const WORDS12K=[["the","ðә","art. 那",["I can only wonder if this is the same for everyone else.","I suppose it's different when you think about it over the long term."],["我只能问自己这对其他所有人是不是一回事呢。","我认为你考虑久了就会不一样了。"]],["be","bi:","v. 是, 表示, 在\\n[计] 后端, 总线允许",["It may be that the happiness awaiting us is not at all the sort of happiness we would want.","This will be a good souvenir of my trip around the United States."],["很可能等待着我们的幸福根本不是我们要的那种幸福。","这将是我环绕美国旅行中一个很好的纪念品。"]],["and","ænd","conj. 和, 与\\n[计] 与",["Those selected will have to face extensive medical and psychological tests.","There are 10 types of people in the world: those who understand binary, and those who don't."],["被选上的将会面临大量的医学和精神测试。","世界上有10种人：懂二进制的人和不懂二进制的人。"]],["of","ɒv","prep. 的, 属于",["It may be that the happiness awaiting us is not at all the sort of happiness we would want.","I don't want to lose my ideas, even though some of them are a bit extreme."],["很可能等待着我们的幸福根本不是我们要的那种幸福。","我不想放弃我的想法，虽然一些想法有点极端。"]],["a","ei","第一个字母 A; 一个; 第一的\\r\\nart. [计] 累加器, 加法器, 地址, 振幅, 模拟, 区域, 面积, 汇编, 组件, 异步",["I want a boat that will take me far away from here.","If I wanted to scare you, I would tell you what I dreamt about a few weeks ago."],["我想要一艘船带我远离这里。","如果我是想吓你，我就会告诉你我几周前梦到的事。"]],["in","in","prep. 在...期间, 在...之内, 处于...之中, 从事于, 按照, 穿着\\nadv. 进入, 朝里, 在里面, 在屋里\\na.…",["When you're beginning to look like the photo in your passport, you should go on a holiday.","Excuse me; allow me to point out three errors in the above article."],["当我们开始像自己护照上的照片时，我们该去度假了。","抱歉，请允许我指出上文中的三个错误。"]],["to","tu:","prep. 到, 向, 趋于\\nadv. 向前",["I've always wondered what it'd be like to have siblings.","I don't want to lose my ideas, even though some of them are a bit extreme."],["我总是想有兄弟姐妹会怎么样。","我不想放弃我的想法，虽然一些想法有点极端。"]],["have","hæv","vt. 有, 怀有, 拿, 进行\\naux. 已经",["I've always wondered what it'd be like to have siblings.","Democracy is the worst form of government, except all the others that have been tried."],["我总是想有兄弟姐妹会怎么样。","除了那些我们尝试过的政府形态，民主是最差的那种了。"]],["it","it","pron. 它\\n[计] 信息论, 输入终端, 智能终端, 内捕获",["It is inevitable that I go to France someday, I just don't know when.","I suppose it's different when you think about it over the long term."],["我總有一天是必須去法國的，但不知道是何時。","我认为你考虑久了就会不一样了。"]],["i","ai","pron. 我\\n[计] 电流, 中断, 指令, 指示符",["I may be antisocial, but it doesn't mean I don't talk to people.","I can only wonder if this is the same for everyone else."],["我或许不善于社交,但这并不意味我不和别人交谈。","我只能问自己这对其他所有人是不是一回事呢。"]],["that","ðæt","a. 那, 那个\\nconj. 以致, 因为\\npron. 那\\nadv. 那么, 那样",["It is inevitable that I go to France someday, I just don't know when.","It may be that the happiness awaiting us is not at all the sort of happiness we would want."],["我總有一天是必須去法國的，但不知道是何時。","很可能等待着我们的幸福根本不是我们要的那种幸福。"]],["for","fɒ:","prep. 为, 因为, 至于\\nconj. 因为\\n[计] DOS批处理命令:对一组参数重复执行指定的命令",["I can only wonder if this is the same for everyone else.","It will take five to ten years for the technology to be ready."],["我只能问自己这对其他所有人是不是一回事呢。","在科技准备好之前需要五到十年。"]],["you","ju:","pron. 你, 你们",["If I wanted to scare you, I would tell you what I dreamt about a few weeks ago.","I suppose it's different when you think about it over the long term."],["如果我是想吓你，我就会告诉你我几周前梦到的事。","我认为你考虑久了就会不一样了。"]],["he","hi:","pron. 他\\nn. 男孩, 男人, 雄性动物",["The king was tired of his sycophants always praising him, so he sent them away.","A miser hoards money not because he is prudent but because he is greedy."],["国王受够了他的大臣们总是对他阿谀奉承，于是把他们遣散了。","守财奴积聚钱财不是因为他谨慎，而是因为他贪婪。"]],["with","wið","prep. 和...在一起, 以, 由于",["I think my living with you has influenced your way of living.","When both girls told John they had feelings for him, he was in a quandary as to which girl he should be with."],["我觉得我和你一起住影响了你生活的方式。","当两个女生都跟约翰宣称她们对他有感觉时，他不知道该跟哪个谈恋爱了。"]],["on","ɒn","prep. 在...之上\\nadv. ...上去\\na. 正起作用的\\n[计] 打开",["I was planning on going to the beach today, but then it started to rain.","It's a complete mess, and it's getting on my nerves."],["我本来预备今天去海滩的，但接着天就开始下雨了。","這完全一團亂，讓我心煩意亂。"]],["do","du:","v. 做, 进行, 完成",["If you don't have anything to do, look at the ceiling of your room.","It's presumptuous for humans to assume that our task is to do what only God can do."],["如果你没事做，那就看你房间的天花板。","人类假设我们的任务是完成只有上帝能做的事，这太自以为是了。"]],["say","sei","vt. 说, 讲, 念, 说明, 指明\\nvi. 说, 讲\\nn. 意见, 发言权",["My friends always say I'm too calm, but my family always says I'm too annoying.","Even if I grant that what you say is true, it is no excuse."],["我的朋友们总是说我太安静了，而我的家人总是说我太让人烦了。","即使我承认你说的是真的，但这并不是借口。"]],["this","θis","pron. 这, 本\\na. 这, 本\\nadv. 这么",["It might sound far-fetched, but this is a real problem.","I can only wonder if this is the same for everyone else."],["这可能听起来牵强，但却是个真实的问题。","我只能问自己这对其他所有人是不是一回事呢。"]],["they","ðei","pron. 他们, 它们",["The principal severely reproved the students whenever they made a mess in the hallway.","That's the thing about people who think they hate computers. What they really hate is lousy programmers."],["每次学生把走廊弄得一团糟的时候，校长都会严厉地训斥他们。","那些自认为讨厌电脑的人就是这么回事。他们真正讨厌的是差劲的程序员。"]],["at","æt","prep. 在, 向, 对\\n[计] 地址转换器, 异常传输, 自动订票",["At the age of six he had learned to use the typewriter and told the teacher that he did not need to learn to write by hand.","Back in high school, I got up at 6 a.m. every morning."],["他六歲的時候學會了用打字機，便和老師說他不用學執筆寫字了。","以前讀高中的時候﹐我每天早上六點起床。"]],["but","bʌt","prep. 除了\\nconj. 但是\\nadv. 仅仅",["I may be antisocial, but it doesn't mean I don't talk to people.","In theory, there is no difference between theory and practice. But, in practice, there is."],["我或许不善于社交,但这并不意味我不和别人交谈。","理论上说，理论和实践没有区别。但实践上说，是有的。"]],["we","wi:","pron. 我们",["You know the phrase, we reap what we sow. I have sown the wind and this is my storm.","We must learn to live together as brothers, or we will perish together as fools."],["你也知道那句話，「善有善報，惡有惡報」。我搧的風，現在火就來了。","我们必须学会像兄弟一样共同生活，要么就像傻子一样同归于尽。"]],["his","hiz","pron. 他的\\n[化] 组氨酸",["There was always too much superfluous writing in his essays.","You can get in touch with him at his home tonight."],["在他的文章中总是有太多肤浅的桥段。","今晚你可以在他家联络到他。"]],["from","frɒm","prep. 从, 来自, 根据",["You should look after the children from time to time.","To win his audience, the speaker resorted to using rhetorical techniques he learned from his communication courses."],["你應該偶爾照顧孩子。","演说家为了征服他的听众，不惜使用他在交流课上学到的修辞技巧。"]],["not","nɒt","adv. 不, 非, 未\\n[计] 非",["Better to be hated for who you are than loved for who you're not.","The past can only be known, not changed. The future can only be changed, not known."],["宁愿做自己而被人讨厌，也不要因为虚假而被人喜欢。","我們可以回顧過去，但不能改變過去；我們可以改變未來，但不能預知未來。"]],["by","bai","prep. 被, 经, 由, 在...之旁\\nadv. 经过, 在近处",["You must get this homework finished by the day after tomorrow.","At the age of six he had learned to use the typewriter and told the teacher that he did not need to learn to write by hand."],["你必須在後天以前完成回家作業。","他六歲的時候學會了用打字機，便和老師說他不用學執筆寫字了。"]],["she","ʃi:","pron. 她",["She can express her feelings when she feels happy or sad.","You say Nessie is an imaginary being, but I think she exists."],["当感到高兴或悲伤时，她能表达感情。","你说尼斯湖水怪是虚构的，但我觉得它真实存在。"]],["or","ɒ:","conj. 或, 或者\\n[计] 或",["We must learn to live together as brothers, or we will perish together as fools.","It is up to you to decide whether we will go there or not."],["我们必须学会像兄弟一样共同生活，要么就像傻子一样同归于尽。","我们去不去那儿由你来决定。"]],["as","æz","adv. 同样地, 例如\\nprep. 做为, 当作\\nconj. 当...之时, 以...的方式, 像...一样, 因为\\n[计] 高级…",["Even people who don't believe in the Catholic church venerate the Pope as a symbolic leader.","We must learn to live together as brothers, or we will perish together as fools."],["甚至是不相信天主教的人也把教皇敬为一个象征性的领导者。","我们必须学会像兄弟一样共同生活，要么就像傻子一样同归于尽。"]],["what","hwɒt","pron. 什么\\ninterj. 怎么, 多么\\na. 什么的\\nadv. 到什么程度",["Life is what happens to you while you're busy making other plans.","I've always wondered what it'd be like to have siblings."],["生活就是當你忙著進行你的計劃時總有其他的事情發生。","我总是想有兄弟姐妹会怎么样。"]],["go","gou","vi. 去, 走, 达到, 运转, 查阅, 消失, 结束, 放弃, 花费, 流传, 趋于, 打算, 剩下\\nvt. 以...打赌, 对付,…",["It is inevitable that I go to France someday, I just don't know when.","It is up to you to decide whether we will go there or not."],["我總有一天是必須去法國的，但不知道是何時。","我们去不去那儿由你来决定。"]],["their","ðєә","pron. 他们的",["Some people do not like to deposit their money in banks.","The workers complained when their working hours were extended."],["有些人不喜欢把钱存银行。","当工作时间被延长时，工人们忍不住开口抱怨起来。"]],["can","kæn","vt. 装罐\\nn. 罐头, 容器\\naux. 能, 可以\\n[计] 作废字符",["I can only wonder if this is the same for everyone else.","The past can only be known, not changed. The future can only be changed, not known."],["我只能问自己这对其他所有人是不是一回事呢。","我們可以回顧過去，但不能改變過去；我們可以改變未來，但不能預知未來。"]],["who","hu:","pron. 谁",["There are 10 types of people in the world: those who understand binary, and those who don't.","I don't like it when mathematicians who know much more than I do can't express themselves explicitly."],["世界上有10种人：懂二进制的人和不懂二进制的人。","我不喜欢那些数学家知道的比我多得多，却不知道清楚地表达自己。"]],["get","get","vt. 得到, 获得, 变成, 使得, 收获, 接通, 抓住, 染上\\nvi. 到达, 成为, 变得\\nn. (网球等)救球, 生殖, 幼…",["You can get in touch with him at his home tonight.","Teachers must get tired of rectifying the same mistakes over and over again in their students' papers."],["今晚你可以在他家联络到他。","老师肯定厌倦了一遍又一遍地纠正学生试卷中同样的错误。"]],["if","if","conj. 如果, 是否, 无论何时, 假设, 即使\\nn. 条件\\n[计] DOS批处理命令:根据所测试的条件决定是否执行另一条命令",["I can only wonder if this is the same for everyone else.","If I wanted to scare you, I would tell you what I dreamt about a few weeks ago."],["我只能问自己这对其他所有人是不是一回事呢。","如果我是想吓你，我就会告诉你我几周前梦到的事。"]],["would","wud","aux. 将, 愿意",["It would take forever for me to explain everything.","It's a pity that you can't buy miracles like you would buy potatoes."],["要都解释的话，需要一辈子的时间。","可惜我们不能像买土豆一样买奇迹。"]],["her","hә:","pron. 她的, 她",["You should know better than to ask a lady her age.","She can express her feelings when she feels happy or sad."],["你應該知道不要問小姐的年齡。","当感到高兴或悲伤时，她能表达感情。"]],["all","ɒ:l","a. 所有的, 全部的, 一切的\\nadv. 全部, 全然\\npron. 全部\\nn. 全部",["Teachers should treat all their students impartially.","All of a sudden, large drops of rain began falling from the dark sky."],["老师应该一视同仁地对待他们的学生。","灰暗的天空突然下起了一大滴一大滴的雨來。"]],["my","mai","pron. 我的\\n[医] 迈尔(热容单位)",["This will be a good souvenir of my trip around the United States.","The last person I told my idea to thought I was nuts."],["这将是我环绕美国旅行中一个很好的纪念品。","最后一个听我说我的主意的人认为我疯了。"]],["make","meik","vt. 制造, 安排, 创造, 构成, 使得, 产生, 造成, 整理, 布置, 引起, 到达, 进行\\nvi. 开始, 前进, 增大, 被…",["They helped one another to make the school festival a success.","Make sure to turn off all the lights before going out."],["他们互帮互助，把校庆搞得很成功。","出去之前确认一下所有的灯都关了。"]],["about","ә'baut","prep. 在...周围, 大约, 有关, 关于\\nadv. 大约, 四处, 在附近, 周围",["I suppose it's different when you think about it over the long term.","Sometimes he has difficulty being articulate about his views."],["我认为你考虑久了就会不一样了。","他有时候会难以清楚地表达他的意见。"]],["know","nәu","v. 知道, 了解, 认识, 确信",["If anyone was to ask what the point of the story is, I really don't know.","If you didn't know me that way then you simply didn't know me."],["如果有人问起这个故事的用意是什么，我还真不知道。","你如果不以那種方式了解我，那你根本就不了解我。"]],["will","wil","n. 意志, 决心, 意愿, 意向, 干劲, 遗嘱\\nvt. 用意志的力量驱使, 决意, 愿意, 立遗嘱\\nvi. 下决心, 愿意\\nau…",["I want a boat that will take me far away from here.","This will be a good souvenir of my trip around the United States."],["我想要一艘船带我远离这里。","这将是我环绕美国旅行中一个很好的纪念品。"]],["up","ʌp","a. 向上的, 起床的, 涨的\\nadv. 向上, 上涨\\nprep. 在...上面, 向...的较高处",["Mathematics is the part of science you could continue to do if you woke up tomorrow and discovered the universe was gone.","The second half of a man's life is made up of nothing but the habits he has acquired during the first half."],["就算你明天起床，發現整個宇宙消失了，還有一門科學是可以繼續研究的 ﹣ 那就是數學了。","人的后半生就是由他前半生养成的习惯所构成的，其他什么都没有。"]],["one","wʌn","n. 一(个)\\npron. 一, 任何人\\nnum. 一, 一个\\na. 一致的, 完整的",["Mali is one of the poorest countries in Subsaharan Africa.","Compare your sentence with the one on the blackboard."],["马里是在撒哈拉以南非洲最贫穷的国家之一。","比較一下你寫的句子和黑板上的句子。"]],["time","taim","n. 时间, 时侯, 时机, 时期, 期限, 次数, 节拍, 暂停, 规定时间\\nvt. 测定...的时间, 记录...的时间, 计时, …",["You should look after the children from time to time.","It would take me too much time to explain to you why it's not going to work."],["你應該偶爾照顧孩子。","给你解释这为什么行不通要花很多时间。"]],["there","ðєә","adv. 在那里",["There are a lot of things you don't know about my personality.","There are 10 types of people in the world: those who understand binary, and those who don't."],["我的个性还有很多方面是你不了解的。","世界上有10种人：懂二进制的人和不懂二进制的人。"]],["year","jiә","n. 年, 年度, 年龄\\n[经] 年度",["In Hawaii, one can swim in the ocean all year round.","A foreign language cannot be mastered in a year or so."],["在夏威夷，一个人可以一年到头享受海水浴的乐趣。","一個外國語言無法在一年左右就被掌握。"]],["so","sәu","adv. 如此, 如是, 如...那样\\nconj. 所以, 因此\\npron. 这样",["When I ask people what they regret most about high school, they nearly all say the same thing: that they wasted so much time.","The king was tired of his sycophants always praising him, so he sent them away."],["当我问人家高中时代他们最后悔的是什么时，他们几乎所有人都回答一致：他们浪费了那么多时间。","国王受够了他的大臣们总是对他阿谀奉承，于是把他们遣散了。"]],["think","θiŋk","vt. 想, 考虑, 想起, 想像, 打算, 认为\\nvi. 思考, 料想\\nn. 想法\\na. 思想的",["I suppose it's different when you think about it over the long term.","I think you'll have very little difficulty in getting a driver's license."],["我认为你考虑久了就会不一样了。","我想您要拿到驾照根本不难。"]],["when","hwen","conj. 当...的时候\\nadv. 何时, 什么时候\\npron. 什么时侯\\nn. 时间",["I suppose it's different when you think about it over the long term.","If you don't want to put on sunscreen, that's your problem. Just don't come complaining to me when you get a sunburn."],["我认为你考虑久了就会不一样了。","你不想涂防晒霜是你的问题，但是晒伤了不要来抱怨。"]],["which","hwitʃ","pron. 哪一个, 那一个",["In the English language many words contain letters which are not pronounced.","My eyes are an ocean in which my dreams are reflected."],["英文裡面很多字的字母是不發音的。","我的眼睛是一片反映我梦想的海洋。"]],["them","ðem","pron. 他们, 她们, 它们",["Ray was willing to corroborate Gary's story, but the police were still unconvinced that either of them were telling the truth.","I prefer to look for a solution to problems, not only to report them."],["Ray乐于证实Gary的故事，但警察仍然不相信他们其中一个说的是事实。","我更喜欢寻求问题的解决方法，而不仅仅是揭露它们。"]],["some","sʌm","pron. 一些, 一部分, 若干\\nadv. 大约\\na. 一些的, 少许的, 某一的",["I'm glad we didn't go there because there were some localized heavy rain showers.","I don't want to lose my ideas, even though some of them are a bit extreme."],["我很庆幸我们没有去那儿，因为当时那儿有局部大暴雨。","我不想放弃我的想法，虽然一些想法有点极端。"]],["me","mi:","pron. 我",["It would take me too much time to explain to you why it's not going to work.","I want a boat that will take me far away from here."],["给你解释这为什么行不通要花很多时间。","我想要一艘船带我远离这里。"]],["people","'pi:pl","n. 人, 人民, 民族, 平民\\nvt. 使住满人, 居住于",["I may be antisocial, but it doesn't mean I don't talk to people.","When I ask people what they regret most about high school, they nearly all say the same thing: that they wasted so much time."],["我或许不善于社交,但这并不意味我不和别人交谈。","当我问人家高中时代他们最后悔的是什么时，他们几乎所有人都回答一致：他们浪费了那么多时间。"]],["take","teik","vt. 拿, 取, 抓, 带领, 获得, 就座, 接受, 吃, 吸引, 采取, 乘, 需要, 花费\\nvi. 吃掉对方棋子, 抓住, 起作…",["It would take forever for me to explain everything.","You are working too hard. Take it easy for a while."],["要都解释的话，需要一辈子的时间。","你工作得太辛苦了。放輕鬆一下。"]],["out","aut","a. 外面的, 熄灭的, 结束的\\nadv. 在外, 熄灭, 出现\\nprep. 出自, 离去, 向",["Excuse me; allow me to point out three errors in the above article.","It's just five in the morning, but nevertheless it is light out."],["抱歉，请允许我指出上文中的三个错误。","才早晨5点，但天已经亮了。"]],["into","'intu:","prep. 进入...之内, 朝..., 深入...之中, 成为...状况",["We should have taken the schedule into consideration.","As we went around the corner, the lake came into view."],["我们本该考虑一下行程。","当我们走到转角处，湖就映入了眼帘。"]],["just","dʒʌst","a. 正直的, 合理的, 正确的, 应得的\\nadv. 刚刚, 正好, 仅仅",["It's just five in the morning, but nevertheless it is light out.","He has just published an interesting series of articles."],["才早晨5点，但天已经亮了。","他刚发表一系列有趣的文章。"]],["see","si:","vt. 看见, 查看, 参观, 游览, 理解, 知道, 同意\\nvi. 看, 观看, 注意, 知道, 考虑\\nn. 主教的职位",["It would be better for both of us not to see each other anymore.","If you think education is expensive, wait till you see what ignorance costs you."],["我們還是不要再見面了。","如果你認為教育是昂貴的, 那麼你等著看無知讓你付出的代價。"]],["him","him","pron. 他",["The king was tired of his sycophants always praising him, so he sent them away.","I hope he'll be able to come! I'd like to see him."],["国王受够了他的大臣们总是对他阿谀奉承，于是把他们遣散了。","我希望他能來！我想見他。"]],["your","juә","pron. 你的, 你们的",["I look forward to hearing your thoughts on this matter.","If you don't have anything to do, look at the ceiling of your room."],["我期待听到你在这件事上的想法 。","如果你没事做，那就看你房间的天花板。"]],["come","kʌm","vi. 过来, 来, 到达, 出现, 开始\\ninterj. 喂",["You seem to be prejudiced against ideas that come from foreign countries.","I hope he'll be able to come! I'd like to see him."],["你似乎對來自國外的想法有偏見。","我希望他能來！我想見他。"]],["could","kud","aux. 可以, 能",["If you can't have children, you could always adopt.","The train was delayed, so I could not arrive there on time."],["如果你不能有孩子，你总能领养。","火车晚点了，所以我不能准时赶到那里。"]],["now","nau","adv. 现在, 刚才, 目前\\nn. 现在\\na. 现在的\\nconj. 由于",["If you do not have this program, you can download it now.","You should have done it earlier. It cannot be helped now."],["假如你没有这个程序，你现在就可以去下载。","你本应该早点做的。现在已经没有任何办法了。"]],["than","ðæn","conj. 比, 除...外\\nprep. 比",["I don't like it when mathematicians who know much more than I do can't express themselves explicitly.","Life in prison is worse than the life of an animal."],["我不喜欢那些数学家知道的比我多得多，却不知道清楚地表达自己。","监狱生活比做畜牲还不如。"]],["like","laik","a. 相似的, 同样的\\nvt. 喜欢, 愿意, 想\\nvi. 喜欢, 希望\\nn. 爱好, 同样的人(或物)\\nprep. 象, 如同\\…",["I've always wondered what it'd be like to have siblings.","In a dictionary like this one there should be at least two sentences with \"fridge\"."],["我总是想有兄弟姐妹会怎么样。","這樣的字典最少也應該有兩句「冰箱」的例句吧。"]],["other","'ʌðә","a. 其他的, 另外的, 从前的\\npron. 其他的, 他人, 另外一个",["After they argued, they didn't speak to each other for a week.","Life is what happens to you while you're busy making other plans."],["他们争吵后，一周都没有再说话。","生活就是當你忙著進行你的計劃時總有其他的事情發生。"]],["how","hau","adv. 如何, 怎样, 多少, 多么\\nn. 方式",["It is not until you go abroad that you realize how small Japan is.","There's no point saying \"Hi, how are you?\" to me if you have nothing else to say."],["你出國看看，才會知道日本是多麼的細小。","如果你没有其它可说的，那对我说“嗨，你怎么样？”就毫无意义。"]],["then","ðen","adv. 然后, 当时\\nconj. 然后, 当时\\nn. 那时",["If I could be reborn, I would want to be the child of a rich family, then I'd be set for life.","If you didn't know me that way then you simply didn't know me."],["如果可以投胎轉世的話，我想做有錢人家的兒子，一輩子衣食無憂。","你如果不以那種方式了解我，那你根本就不了解我。"]],["its","its","pron. 它的",["If you don't understand something, it's because you aren't aware of its context.","London, where I live, used to be famous for its fog."],["如果你不明白一件事，那是因为你没有意识到它的背景。","我住的地方－倫敦，從前以霧聞名。"]],["our","'auә","pron. 我们的",["We ought to do our best not to pollute our environment.","On behalf of the company, I would like to express our hearty thanks to you all."],["我們應該盡力不要污染環境。","在此僅代表本公司向各位致上衷心的謝意。"]],["two","tu:","num. 二, 二个",["It took me more than two hours to translate a few pages of English.","You look tired. You ought to rest for an hour or two."],["翻译几页英文花了我2个多小时。","你看起來很累。你應該休息一兩個小時。"]],["more","mɒ:","n. 更多\\na. 多的, 程度较大的, 更大的\\nadv. 多, 更多, 进一步\\n[计] DOS外部命令:显示满屏后自动暂停, 并显示…",["More than 90 percent of visits to a web page are from search engines.","People will accept your idea much more readily if you tell them Benjamin Franklin said it first."],["一个网页超过百分之九十的访问量是来自于搜索引擎的。","如果你告訴他們富蘭克林是第一個這麼說的, 人們會更樂意接受你的想法。"]],["these","ði:z","pron. 这些",["As more time passed, these Creoles became separate languages: Spanish, French, Italian, etc.","I would like to know how these substances are absorbed by the body."],["隨著時間的流逝，這些克里奧爾語成為了獨立的語言：西班牙語，法語，意大利語等等。","我想知道這些物質是怎麼被人體吸收的。"]],["want","wɒnt","n. 需要的东西, 缺乏, 贫困, 需要\\nvt. 要, 希望, 应该, 缺少\\nvi. 生活困苦, 需要, 缺少",["If you don't want to put on sunscreen, that's your problem. Just don't come complaining to me when you get a sunburn.","He doesn't want you to tell him about your sex life."],["你不想涂防晒霜是你的问题，但是晒伤了不要来抱怨。","他不希望你对他谈论你们的性生活。"]],["way","wei","n. 路, 路线, 路途, 方法, 道路, 情形, 规模, 习惯, 行业, 方面\\nadv. 远远地, 非常",["You look the way your father did thirty years ago.","I think my living with you has influenced your way of living."],["你看上去就像是三十年前你父親的樣子。","我觉得我和你一起住影响了你生活的方式。"]],["look","luk","n. 一看, 神色, 样子, 面容\\nvi. 看, 注意, 朝着, 显得\\nvt. 打量, 看上去与...一样, 以眼色(或脸色)显示, …",["You look tired. You ought to rest for an hour or two.","I wouldn't have thought I would someday look up \"Viagra\" in Wikipedia."],["你看起來很累。你應該休息一兩個小時。","我不会想到有一天我会在维基百科查找“伟哥”。"]],["first","fә:st","adv. 首先, 第一, 优先\\na. 第一的\\nnum. 第一\\nn. 开始, 第一",["Canada is a good place to go if it's your first experience living abroad.","To have doubts about oneself is the first sign of intelligence."],["如果你是第一次到外國生活的話，加拿大會很適合你。","自我怀疑是聪明的第一标志。"]],["also","'ɒ:lsәu","adv. 也, 并且, 同样地",["We should try to be philosophical about life; wealth gained could also vanish.","Not only did he refuse to help me, but also he scolded me."],["我們應該努力地豁然看待人生；獲得的財富也會煙消雲散。","他不但没帮我，还骂了我。"]],["new","nju:","a. 新的, 陌生的, 最近的, 不熟悉的\\n[法] 新发现的, 新的, 重新开始的",["In a few minutes we'll be landing at New Tokyo International Airport.","More and more doctors have begun to use the new medicine."],["我们将于几分钟内降落在新东京国际机场。","開始使用新藥的醫生越來越多。"]],["because","bi'kɒ:z","conj. 因为",["When you send a telegram, brevity is essential because you will be charged for every word.","Because of the problem of air pollution, the bicycle may some day replace the automobile."],["当我们发电报的时候，简明扼要是关键，因为是以字计费的。","因為空氣汙染的問題，也許有一天自行車會取代汽車。"]],["day","dei","n. 天, 日子, 白天, 工作日\\n[医] 日(一昼夜), 昼, 白天",["You must get this homework finished by the day after tomorrow.","The conference is to be held in Tokyo the day after tomorrow."],["你必須在後天以前完成回家作業。","会议将在后天于东京举行。"]],["use","ju:s","n. 使用, 习惯, 使用价值, 用法, 使用权\\nvt. 使用, 利用, 运用, 耗费\\nvi. 惯常",["I've got to hang up now. Someone is waiting to use the phone.","More and more doctors have begun to use the new medicine."],["我要掛線了。有人正在等著用電話。","開始使用新藥的醫生越來越多。"]],["no","nәu","n. 不, 拒绝, 否决票\\na. 没有, 不是, 绝非\\nadv. 不",["You are no better at remembering things than I am.","Without air there can be no wind or sound on the moon."],["你记事情的能力并不比我好多少。","月球表面沒有空氣，所以沒有風，也沒有聲音。"]],["man","mæn","n. 男人, 人类, 人\\nvt. 为...配备人手, 操纵, 使振奋\\n[计] 城域网, 手册",["I wonder whether man could live with only two hours' sleep a night.","He does not, in short, write with the candor of a man who is completely confident of his thesis."],["不知道人每晚只睡兩個小時，能不能生存下去呢？","簡單來說，他的文筆並沒有流露出那種對自己的論文充滿信心的人應有的直率和坦誠。"]],["find","faind","vt. 发现, 感到, 找到, 认为, 得到\\nvi. 裁决\\nn. 发现\\n[计] 查找; DOS外部命令:在指定的文件或从键盘输入的文…",["In our society we find men of integrity along with crooks.","My brother was supposed to pick me up at the station, but I couldn't find him."],["我們的社會良莠不齊。","我的弟弟應該會來車站接我的，但是我卻找不到他。"]],["here","hiә","adv. 在这里, 此时, 这里\\nn. 这里",["What have you done with my pen? It was here a minute ago.","If Ted were here, he could help us clean our room."],["你把我的鋼筆怎麼了? 一分鐘前它還在這裡。","如果Ted在这儿，他就能帮我们打扫房间了。"]],["thing","θiŋ","n. 事物, 东西, 物, 用品, 事, 事件, 情况, 行为, 特征",["If I were you, I would have done the same thing in such a difficult situation.","The first thing you have to take into consideration is time."],["如果我是你，我会在这种困难的情况下做同样的事。","你应该考虑的第一件事是时间。"]],["give","giv","n. 弹性, 适应性\\nvt. 给, 授予, 供给, 产生, 发表, 付出, 献出, 让出\\nvi. 捐赠, 支持不住, 让步",["The doctor told Mr Smith to give up smoking if he wanted to live long.","A little walk will give you a good appetite for breakfast."],["医生告诉史密斯先生他要长寿的话就得戒烟。","散散步將會給你很好的食慾吃早餐。"]],["many","'meni","n. 多数, 多数人\\na. 许多的\\npron. 许多",["Many local traditions have fallen into decay in recent years.","Smokers take twice as many days off sick as non-smokers."],["近几年，很多当地的传统都衰败了。","吸煙的人請病假的日數比不吸煙的人多兩倍。"]],["well","wel","n. 井, 泉水, 源泉, 好\\nv. 涌出\\na. 健康的, 良好的, 适宜的, 恰当的\\nadv. 很好地, 适当地, 好意地, 很,…",["I heard the manager's wife is on vacation. And, well, when the cat's away, the mice play. Now he's out partying every night.","Nick can speak Portuguese very well. That's because he's been studying it for 5 years."],["我听说经理的妻子出去度假了。这时就是山中无老虎，猴子称大王了。现在经理他夜夜笙箫。","Nick说葡萄牙语说得很好。那是因为他学了有5年了。"]],["only","'әunli","a. 唯一的, 仅有的, 最佳的\\nadv. 只有, 仅仅, 只能\\nconj. 但是, 不过",["I can only wonder if this is the same for everyone else.","The only useful answers are those that raise new questions."],["我只能问自己这对其他所有人是不是一回事呢。","只有能提出新问题的回答才是有用的回答。"]],["those","ðәuz","pron. 那些",["The world is a book, and those who do not travel read only a page.","The only useful answers are those that raise new questions."],["世界是本书，不旅游的人只看了一页。","只有能提出新问题的回答才是有用的回答。"]],["tell","tel","vt. 告诉, 说, 吩咐, 断定, 知道\\nvi. 讲述, 泄密, 告发, 表明",["Please tell me the closest station to your office.","It's hard to tell Englishmen from Americans just by the way they look."],["请告诉我离您办公室最近的车站。","只凭长相的话很难区分英国人和美国人。"]],["very","'veri","a. 真正的, 恰好的, 十足的, 特有的\\nadv. 非常, 完全",["The cows were moving very slowly through the long green grass.","Generally speaking, Americans are very fond of coffee."],["牛群在鬱鬱蔥蔥的草地上緩緩移動著。","美國人一般都很喜歡喝咖啡。"]],["even","'i:vәn","a. 平坦的, 相等的, 连贯的, 均等的, 公平的, 偶数的, 平均的, 平衡的, 恰好的\\nvt. 使平坦, 使相等\\nvi. 变平,…",["I don't want to lose my ideas, even though some of them are a bit extreme.","The hall was filled with such a large audience that there wasn't even standing room."],["我不想放弃我的想法，虽然一些想法有点极端。","會堂裏擠滿了聽眾，連一點站立的空間也沒有。"]],["back","bæk","a. 后面的\\nvt. 使后退, 支持\\nvi. 倒退, 背靠\\nadv. 向后地\\nn. 背部, 后面",["Let's discuss your love problems on the way back from school.","Back in high school, I got up at 6 a.m. every morning."],["從學校回來的路上讓我們來討論你的愛情問題。","以前讀高中的時候﹐我每天早上六點起床。"]],["any","'eni","a. 任何的\\npron. 任何",["The one resource more precious than any other was land.","She speaks English better than any of her classmates."],["唯一比无论什么资源都珍贵的是土地。","她的英語說得比班上任何人都好。"]],["good","gud","n. 善行, 好处, 利益\\na. 好的, 优良的, 上等的, 愉快的, 有益的, 好心的, 慈善的, 虔诚的",["Your composition was good except for the spelling.","This will be a good souvenir of my trip around the United States."],["你的文章寫得很好，但卻有很多字拼錯了。","这将是我环绕美国旅行中一个很好的纪念品。"]],["woman","'wumәn","n. 女人, 妇女, 女仆\\na. 女用的, 女性的, 妇女的\\nvt. 贬称...为女人, 使成女人腔",["It had the head of a woman, the body of a lion, the wings of a bird, and the tail of a serpent.","The poet expressed his burning passion for the woman he loved."],["它长着女人的头、狮子的身体、一双羽翅以及蛇尾巴。","詩人對他愛的女人表達了他火熱的激情。"]],["through","θru:","adv. 穿越, 从头至尾, 到底, 因为\\nprep. 经过, 穿过\\na. 对穿的, 直达的, 完结的",["The river that flows through London is the Thames.","A small road ran across the bridge, through the fields, and over a hill."],["流经伦敦的河是泰晤士河。","一条小路跨过桥梁，穿过田野，还爬上小丘。"]],["us","ʌs","pron. 我们\\n[经] 美国",["It may be that the happiness awaiting us is not at all the sort of happiness we would want.","In the light of what you told us, I think we should revise our plan."],["很可能等待着我们的幸福根本不是我们要的那种幸福。","根据你所说的话，我认为我们应该重新审视我们的计划。"]],["life","laif","n. 生活, 生命, 人生, 世事, 生物, 寿命, 一生, 生命力, 灵魂, 无期徒刑\\n[医] 生活, 生存, 生命, 寿命",["Life in prison is worse than the life of an animal.","The second half of a man's life is made up of nothing but the habits he has acquired during the first half."],["监狱生活比做畜牲还不如。","人的后半生就是由他前半生养成的习惯所构成的，其他什么都没有。"]],["child","tʃaild","n. 孩子, 产物, 追随者\\n[医] 儿童",["The rescue worker searched the area, looking for the child.","The child had no overcoat on although it was very cold."],["援救人员为了找到孩子，仔细搜索了那个区域。","尽管天气很冷，孩子却没有大衣穿。"]],["work","wә:k","n. 工作, 劳动, 职业, 行为, 功, 作品, 成果, 产品, 工程\\nvi. 工作, 劳动, 做, 运转, 起作用, 被加工\\nvt…",["It would take me too much time to explain to you why it's not going to work.","We will pay you according to the amount of work you do."],["给你解释这为什么行不通要花很多时间。","我們會按照你的工作量付錢給你。"]],["down","daun","a. 向下的\\nadv. 下, 下去, 降下\\nprep. 往下, 沿着\\nn. 丘陵, 软毛, 开阔的高地\\n[计] 向下, 退下命令",["Another step, and you would have fallen down the stairs.","The students noted down every word the teacher said."],["再走一步的话，你就已经跌下楼梯了。","學生們把老師說的話一字不漏地記了下來。"]],["may","mei","n. 五月\\naux. 愿能, 可以, 愿意",["You may think those shoes are in fashion, but they aren't.","I may be antisocial, but it doesn't mean I don't talk to people."],["你可能認為那些鞋子很時髦, 但是他們不是。","我或许不善于社交,但这并不意味我不和别人交谈。"]],["after","'ɑ:ftә","prep. 在...之后, 由于\\nconj. 在...之后\\nadv. 后来",["I make it a rule not to watch television after nine o'clock.","After running up the hill, I was completely out of breath."],["我规定自己在九点之后不看电视。","跑上山後，我完全喘不過氣來。"]],["should","ʃud","aux. 应该, 将要",["When you're beginning to look like the photo in your passport, you should go on a holiday.","You should know better than to ask a lady her age."],["当我们开始像自己护照上的照片时，我们该去度假了。","你應該知道不要問小姐的年齡。"]],["call","kɒ:l","n. 呼叫, 访问, 打电话, 号召, 召集, 要求\\nvt. 呼叫, 召集, 打电话\\nvi. 叫喊, 访问, 叫牌\\n[计] 调用; …",["Bob thinks it is a silly idea to call his mother who is so far away, to spend so much, and to say so little.","Should anyone call on me in my absence, tell him that I will be back soon."],["鲍勃认为，给他那住得老远的母亲花高昂的话费，只为说上那么一两句是一个愚蠢的主意。","如果我不在的時候有人來找我，麻煩你告訴他我很快回來。"]],["world","wә:ld","n. 世界, 地球, 宇宙, 万物, 世人, 人间, 领域, 世事, 世故, 社会生活, 大量\\n[法] 世界, 地球, 世人",["Modern travel enables us to go around the world in a few days.","Oceans do not so much divide the world as unite it."],["现代交通使我们能在几天内环绕地球。","海洋不是将世界分隔开来，而是将世界连接起来"]],["over","'әuvә","adv. 结束, 越过, 从头到尾\\nprep. 在...之上, 遍于...之上, 越过\\na. 上面的\\nvt. 越过",["I suppose it's different when you think about it over the long term.","I'm going to sit on the bench over there next to the street lamp."],["我认为你考虑久了就会不一样了。","我會在那盞街燈旁邊的長凳上坐下來。"]],["school","sku:l","n. 学校, 鱼群, 门派, 学派\\nvt. 教育, 训练, 培养\\nvi. 成群地游",["Back in high school, I got up at 6 a.m. every morning.","It was an advantage having learned Chinese while I was in school."],["以前讀高中的時候﹐我每天早上六點起床。","在学校时我学了中文是个优势。"]],["still","stil","n. 蒸馏室, 寂静, 剧照\\nv. 蒸馏, (使)平静, (使)静止\\na. 静止的, 不动的, 静寂的, 不起泡的, 静物摄影的\\na…",["Admitting what you say, I still think you are in the wrong.","Hey, I may have no money, but I still have my pride."],["虽然我承认你说的,但是我仍然认为你是错的。","嗨，我可能没钱，但我一直有我的骄傲。"]],["try","trai","n. 尝试, 试验, 审理, 审判\\nvt. 试, 尝试, 试验, 考验, 审问, 提炼\\nvi. 尝试, 试图",["However hard I try, I can't do it any better than she can.","However hard you try, you can't finish it in a week or so."],["无论我多么努力尝试，我都无法做到比她更好。","你就算多努力，也不可能在一兩個星期內做完。"]],["last","lɑ:st","a. 最后的, 末尾的, 最近的\\nvi. 持续, 支持, 维持\\nvt. 使维持, 够...用\\nadv. 最后, 后来\\nn. 最后,…",["The last person I told my idea to thought I was nuts.","Thanks for having explained to me at last why people take me for an idiot."],["最后一个听我说我的主意的人认为我疯了。","感謝您終於爲我說明了爲甚麼人們通通把我當傻瓜。"]],["ask","ɑ:sk","vi. 问, 要求\\nvt. 问, 要求, 邀请, 需要",["If anyone was to ask what the point of the story is, I really don't know.","You should know better than to ask a lady her age."],["如果有人问起这个故事的用意是什么，我还真不知道。","你應該知道不要問小姐的年齡。"]],["need","ni:d","n. 需要, 必须, 缺乏\\nvt. 需要, 必需\\nvi. 贫困, 有必要\\naux. 需要",["If you want to study in the United States, you need to get a student visa.","You need to reverse your vest, it's back to front."],["你想去美國讀書的話，一定要先申請一張學生簽證。","你的背心前后反了，得翻过来。"]],["too","tu:","adv. 也, 非常, 太",["There was always too much superfluous writing in his essays.","You are working too hard. Take it easy for a while."],["在他的文章中总是有太多肤浅的桥段。","你工作得太辛苦了。放輕鬆一下。"]],["feel","fi:l","vt. 感觉, 觉得, 触摸, 以为\\nvi. 有知觉, 摸索, 同情\\nn. 感觉, 觉得, 触摸",["If you sleep for a while, you will feel much better.","Kate glanced at Chris and then ignored him, making him feel miserable."],["小睡一会儿，你会好一些。","凱特看了克里斯一眼，然後不理睬他，使他感到痛苦。"]],["three","θri:","num. 三, 三个",["Excuse me; allow me to point out three errors in the above article.","Due to bad weather, the plane arrived three hours late."],["抱歉，请允许我指出上文中的三个错误。","由于天气不好，飞机迟到了3小时。"]],["state","steit","n. 州, 状态, 情形, 国家, 政府, 领土, 国务, 社会地位\\na. 国家的, 正式的, 礼仪用的, 州的\\nvt. 说明, 陈述…",["It is well known that up to the middle of the last century Japan was a feudal state.","In the late 20th century, Yugoslavia was considered a rogue state by the United States."],["眾所周知，直到上個世紀中葉日本是一個封建國家。","在二十世紀末期，南斯拉夫被美國認為是一個流氓國家。"]],["never","'nevә","adv. 从不, 决不, 不曾\\n[法] 永不, 决不, 从来没有",["Having failed many times, he never gave up the plan.","You'll never achieve anything if you don't study harder."],["雖然失敗了很多次，但是他仍從不放棄。","如果你不更加努力地學習, 你將永遠不會有所成就。"]],["become","bi'kʌm","vi. 变成, 变得\\nvt. 适合",["When we are told not to come, we become all the more eager to go.","Men's wants become greater in proportion to the increase in their income."],["让我们别来，我们就更想来了。","人收入愈高，慾望就愈大。"]],["between","bi'twi:n","prep. 在...之间",["In theory, there is no difference between theory and practice. But, in practice, there is.","There are subtle differences between the two pictures."],["理论上说，理论和实践没有区别。但实践上说，是有的。","这两张图片之间有细致的差异。"]],["high","hai","n. 高度, 高处\\na. 高的, 高级的, 主要的, 高尚的, 高原的, 高音的, 昂贵的, 傲慢的\\nadv. 高度地, 奢侈地",["Back in high school, I got up at 6 a.m. every morning.","This is my friend Rachel. We went to high school together."],["以前讀高中的時候﹐我每天早上六點起床。","这是我朋友Rachel，我们当时在同一所高中。"]],["something","'sʌmθiŋ","pron. 某事, 某物",["A passport is something you cannot do without when you go to a foreign country.","Sometimes I smoke just to give my hands something to do."],["去外國旅行不能不帶護照。","有时我吸烟只是因为要给我手头点事做。"]],["really","'riәli","adv. 实际上, 真实地, 实在",["If anyone was to ask what the point of the story is, I really don't know.","Visiting all the tourist sights really wore me out."],["如果有人问起这个故事的用意是什么，我还真不知道。","參觀所有觀光勝地累壞了我。"]],["most","mәust","n. 最多, 最大\\na. 大多数的, 几乎全部的, 最多的\\nadv. 最, 最多, 极其",["English is by far the most widely-spoken language in the world.","It is said that \"Hamlet\" is the most interesting play ever written."],["英語是目前在世界上使用最廣泛的語言。","据说《哈姆雷特》是写出来的最有意思的剧本。"]],["another","ә'nʌðә","a. 另外的, 再一的, 不同的\\npron. 又一个, 另一个, 类似的另一个",["I think we had better wait another thirty minutes.","Another step, and you would have fallen down the stairs."],["我想我們還是再多等三十分鐘吧。","再走一步的话，你就已经跌下楼梯了。"]],["much","mʌtʃ","n. 大量, 许多, 重要的事\\na. 很多的, 重要的\\nadv. 多, 甚, 几乎",["The number of students who were late for school was much smaller than I had expected.","I don't like it when mathematicians who know much more than I do can't express themselves explicitly."],["上學遲到的學生人數比我想像中少很多。","我不喜欢那些数学家知道的比我多得多，却不知道清楚地表达自己。"]],["family","'fæmәli","n. 家庭, 家人, 族\\na. 家庭的",["We are all looking forward to seeing you and your family.","My friends always say I'm too calm, but my family always says I'm too annoying."],["我们都期待看到你和你的家人。","我的朋友们总是说我太安静了，而我的家人总是说我太让人烦了。"]],["own","әun","n. 自己的\\na. 自己的, 嫡亲的, 同胞的\\nvt. 拥有, 支配, 自认, 承认, 顺从于\\nvi. 承认, 供认",["All happy families resemble each other, each unhappy family is unhappy in its own way.","John turned his back on the company and started on his own."],["幸福家庭的幸福原因全都大同小異，但悲慘的家庭卻往往各自有各自的慘法。","约翰离开了公司，另起炉灶。"]],["leave","li:v","n. 许可, 告别, 请假, 休假\\nvt. 离开, 剩下, 遗忘, 委托, 丢弃\\nvi. 出发, 离开, 生叶",["I will leave everything about the party up to you.","Tom expected to leave early in the morning, but he overslept."],["派對的準備工作就全交給你了。","汤姆本想早上早点出发，结果却睡过头了。"]],["put","put","vt. 放, 摆, 安置, 移动, 发射, 投掷, 写上, 表达, 使从事, 使受到, 驱使, 赋予\\nvi. 出发, 航行, 发芽\\nn…",["If you don't want to put on sunscreen, that's your problem. Just don't come complaining to me when you get a sunburn.","The house did not suffer much damage because the fire was quickly put out."],["你不想涂防晒霜是你的问题，但是晒伤了不要来抱怨。","火很快便被撲熄了，房子只受到輕微損壞。"]],["old","әuld","n. 以前, 往昔\\na. 老的, 旧的, 古老的, 年长的, 老练的",["Some babies learn to swim even before they are one year old.","Quite by chance, I met my old friend at the airport."],["有些宝宝甚至在一岁之前就学习游泳了。","很幸运地，我在机场遇到了我的老朋友。"]],["while","hwail","n. 一会儿, (一段)时间\\nconj. 当...的时候, 虽然\\nvt. 消磨",["Seriously though, episode 21 made me almost cry while laughing.","Life is what happens to you while you're busy making other plans."],["但是说真的，第21集让我笑得眼泪都要出来了。","生活就是當你忙著進行你的計劃時總有其他的事情發生。"]],["mean","mi:n","a. 低劣的, 卑贱的, 简陋的, 吝啬的, 惭愧的, 平均的, 中间的, 普通的\\nvt. 意谓, 想要, 意欲, 预定\\nvi. 用意…",["I may be antisocial, but it doesn't mean I don't talk to people.","I usually ride my bike to school. I mean to the office."],["我或许不善于社交,但这并不意味我不和别人交谈。","我通常踏單車上學⋯⋯啊，說錯了，應該是上班才對。"]],["keep","ki:p","n. 生计, 维持, 保持\\nvt. 保持, 保存, 遵守, 看守, 整理, 维持, 履行, 经营, 拘留, 记帐\\nvi. 保持, 继续…",["Keep your eyes closed until I tell you to open them.","It is difficult to keep up a conversation with someone who only says \"yes\" and \"no\"."],["闭着你的眼睛直到我告诉你睁开为止。","跟一个只说“是”和“不是”的人很难继续谈话。"]],["student","'stju:dnt","n. 学生, 研究者, 学者",["\"Haven't we met somewhere before?\" asked the student.","A student should not lose sight of his own identity."],["“以前我们没在哪儿见过吗？”学生问道。","学生不该忽略自己的身份。"]],["why","hwai","adv. 为什么\\nn. 原因, 理由",["Thanks for having explained to me at last why people take me for an idiot.","The reason why you failed is you did not try hard enough."],["感謝您終於爲我說明了爲甚麼人們通通把我當傻瓜。","因為你不夠努力，所以才會失敗。"]],["let","let","vt. 让, 假设, 出租, 排放, 妨碍\\nvi. 出租, 被承包\\nn. 出租屋, 障碍",["This is a secret just between you and me, so don't let it slip out.","It's very important to know how to let off steam, living in this world."],["这只是你和我之间的秘密，所以不要让它流出去。","生活在這個世界裏，懂得發泄是十分重要的。"]],["great","greit","a. 大的, 非常的, 主要的, 重大的, 崇高的, 伟大的\\nadv. 顺利地, 得意地\\nn. 全部, 大人物, 大师",["On the one hand we suffered a heavy loss, but on the other hand we learned a great deal from the experience.","Every great writer seems to have been interested in English."],["一方面我们虽然蒙受了损失，但另一方面我们从这次经验中学到了很多。","每一個偉大的作家似乎已經對英語感興趣。"]],["same","seim","a. 相同的, 同样的\\npron. 相同的人(或事物)\\nadv. 同样地",["I can only wonder if this is the same for everyone else.","In culture, they are on the same plane as savages."],["我只能问自己这对其他所有人是不是一回事呢。","在教養上，他們可以說是和野蠻人差不多。"]],["big","big","a. 大的, 重要的\\nadv. 大量地",["This is just between you and me, he is a big eater.","According to the newspaper, there was a big fire last night."],["我就只告诉你，他是个大胃王。","根據報導，昨晚有一場很大的火災。"]],["group","gru:p","n. 团体, 组, 团, 群\\nv. 聚合, 成群\\n[计] 创建组; 组, 用户组",["The first group studies in the morning, the second in the evening.","You yourself belong to this group of people that you're talking about - the one that doesn't speak standard Mandarin well."],["第一组早上学习，第二组晚上学习。","你像你说的那些人一样都属于说不好普通话的人。"]],["begin","bi'gin","v. 开始\\n[计] 开始",["If you want security in your old age, begin saving now.","To be surprised, to wonder, is to begin to understand."],["如果你想安享晚年，現在就要開始儲蓄了。","感到惊讶、感到惊奇就是明白的开始。"]],["seem","si:m","vi. 象是, 似乎",["You seem to be prejudiced against ideas that come from foreign countries.","They went along and along, but they couldn't seem to find just the right place."],["你似乎對來自國外的想法有偏見。","他們四處找來找去，但就是找不到合適的地方。"]],["country","'kʌntri","n. 国家, 乡村, 地区, 故乡\\na. 乡下的, 农村的\\n[计] DOS外部命令:用于设定国家代码, 包括日期时间及货币格式",["A passport is something you cannot do without when you go to a foreign country.","An ambassador is an honest man sent to lie abroad for the good of his country."],["去外國旅行不能不帶護照。","大使是为了本国的利益被派去外国撒谎的正直的人。"]],["help","help","n. 帮忙, 帮助者, 补救办法, 有益的东西\\nvt. 帮助, 帮忙, 接济, 治疗, 款待\\nvi. 有用, 救命, 招待\\n[计] …",["If it had not been for his help, I would have failed.","If it had not been for your help, I couldn't have completed the work."],["他没帮助我的话，我就失败了。","如果不是因为有你的帮助，我不可能完成了这个工作。"]],["talk","tɒ:k","n. 谈话, 交谈, 会谈, 讲话, 演讲, 空谈, 谣言, 方言, 语言\\nvi. 讲话, 演讲, 说话, 谈话, 交流, 闲聊, 说闲…",["I may be antisocial, but it doesn't mean I don't talk to people.","First of all, you should talk it over with your parents."],["我或许不善于社交,但这并不意味我不和别人交谈。","你應該先和你的父母談談。"]],["where","hwєә","adv. 在哪里\\npron. 哪里\\nn. 地点",["Michael, this is the restaurant where your father and I had our first date.","Not knowing where to get off the bus, I asked the driver."],["麥可, 這家餐廳就是你爸爸和我第一次約會的地方。","因为我不知道应该在哪里下巴士，我问了司机。"]],["turn","tә:n","n. 转弯, 转动, 旋转, 翻转, 一圈, 顺次, 改动, 变化, 性格, 特色, 形状, 转折\\nvt. 使旋转, 转弯, 转动, 使…",["I am sure the situation will take a turn for the better.","George, if you are not listening to the radio, turn it off."],["我肯定事情会往好的方向发展。","乔治，如果你不听广播，就把它关掉。"]],["problem","'prɒblәm","n. 问题, 难题\\na. 成问题的, 难处理的",["We should approach this problem from different angles.","If you don't want to put on sunscreen, that's your problem. Just don't come complaining to me when you get a sunburn."],["我們應該用各種不同的角度看待此問題","你不想涂防晒霜是你的问题，但是晒伤了不要来抱怨。"]],["every","'evri","a. 每一, 所有的",["Back in high school, I got up at 6 a.m. every morning.","To the man who only has a hammer in the toolkit, every problem looks like a nail."],["以前讀高中的時候﹐我每天早上六點起床。","对工具箱里只有一把榔头的人来说，所有的问题都像钉子。"]],["start","stɑ:t","n. 惊起, 出发, 开端, 起点, 吃惊, 有利条件\\nvi. 开始, 出发, 启动, 跳起, 吃惊, 出现, 松动, 脱落, 起价, …",["As soon as it gets dark, the fireworks will start.","If you are to succeed, you must start studying now."],["天一黑，就会开始放焰火了。","如果你要成功, 你必須現在開始學習。"]],["hand","hænd","n. 手, 爪, 指针, 掌握, 协助, 人手, 手艺, 手迹, 支配, 插手\\nvt. 交给, 支持, 搀扶",["At the age of six he had learned to use the typewriter and told the teacher that he did not need to learn to write by hand.","All students of English should have a good English-English dictionary at hand."],["他六歲的時候學會了用打字機，便和老師說他不用學執筆寫字了。","所有學英語的學生應該隨手有一本好的英英詞典。"]],["might","mait","n. 力量, 权力\\naux. 可能, 也许",["It might sound far-fetched, but this is a real problem.","I'd send my kid out on his own for a while if I were you. A few hard knocks at this point might do him some good."],["这可能听起来牵强，但却是个真实的问题。","換了是我，就會要孩子自己一個人去遊歷一下。他現在這個年紀，吃一點苦是好的。"]],["american","ә'merikәn","n. 美国人\\na. 美国的, 美洲的",["Mariko's parents are strongly opposed to her marrying an American.","This book will give you a clear idea of the American way of life."],["麻理子的父母强烈反对她和美国人结婚。","这书会教给你一个明了的美式人生观。"]],["show","ʃәu","n. 显示, 表现, 展览, 卖弄, 炫耀, 外观, 演出, 洋相\\nvt. 表示, 显示, 展现, 陈列, 演出, 表明, 指出, 带领…",["I was wondering if you were going to show up today.","The show was wonderful, but the tickets were too expensive."],["我在想你今天会不会来。","这场秀棒极了，但是门票太贵了。"]],["part","pɑ:t","n. 部分, 局部, 零件, 要素, 等分, 职责, 角色, 部位\\nvt. 分开, 分离, 断绝, 区别, 分配\\nvi. 分开, 断裂…",["Mathematics is the part of science you could continue to do if you woke up tomorrow and discovered the universe was gone.","A new team was formed in order to take part in the boat race."],["就算你明天起床，發現整個宇宙消失了，還有一門科學是可以繼續研究的 ﹣ 那就是數學了。","为了参加划船比赛，一支新的队伍组成了。"]],["against","ә'geinst","prep. 反对, 对着, 倚靠",["Four-fifths of all the members were against the plan.","The police assembled a lot of evidence against him."],["有五分之四的會員反對這個計劃。","警察收集了很多对他不利的证据。"]],["place","pleis","n. 地方, 地点, 位置, 住所, 座位, 地位, 处境, 特权, 空间, 余地, 职务, 位\\nvt. 放置, 寄予, 认出, 评定,…",["Scientific discoveries don't always make the world a better place.","Were it not for music, the world would be a dull place."],["科学发明并不总是使世界变得更美好。","如果沒有了音樂，這個世界就會變得十分沉悶。"]],["such","sʌtʃ","a. 如此的, 这样的",["Recession is a temporary falling off of business activity during a period when such activity is generally increasing.","When the body is touched, receptors in the skin send messages to the brain causing the release of chemicals such as endorphins."],["经济萧条是一段时间内，当这样的经济活动普遍增长而造成的一种临时性的经济活动衰退。","當身體受到外界觸碰的時候，皮膚的感受器就會向大腦發出信息，令大腦釋放安多芬等的化學物質。"]],["again","ә'gein","adv. 再一次, 又, 到原处",["I will have read Hamlet three times if I read it again.","Teachers must get tired of rectifying the same mistakes over and over again in their students' papers."],["我再看一次《王子復仇記》，加起來一共就看過三次了。","老师肯定厌倦了一遍又一遍地纠正学生试卷中同样的错误。"]],["few","fju:","a. 很少的, 不多的, 少数的\\nn. 少数",["If I wanted to scare you, I would tell you what I dreamt about a few weeks ago.","It took me more than two hours to translate a few pages of English."],["如果我是想吓你，我就会告诉你我几周前梦到的事。","翻译几页英文花了我2个多小时。"]],["case","keis","n. 情形, 情况, 箱, 容器, 事实, 病例, 案例, 框子\\nvt. 装箱, 包盖",["In case of an emergency, get in touch with my agent.","A more experienced lawyer would have dealt with the case in a different way."],["万一有紧急情况，联系我的代理人。","一个经验丰富的律师会以其它方法来处理这个情形的。"]],["week","wi:k","n. 星期, 周",["Peter talks with his parents in the United States on the phone at least once a week.","However hard you try, you can't finish it in a week or so."],["彼得每星期都至少會和身在美國的父母談一次電話。","你就算多努力，也不可能在一兩個星期內做完。"]],["company","'kʌmpәni","n. 公司, 友伴, 交往, 连队, 朋友, 一群\\nvt. 陪伴\\nvi. 交往",["If you don't want to stay alone, I can keep you company.","On behalf of the company, I would like to express our hearty thanks to you all."],["如果你不想一个人呆着，我可以陪着你。","在此僅代表本公司向各位致上衷心的謝意。"]],["mr","'mistә(r)","先生\\n[计] 存储器回收程序, 多重请求",["The doctor told Mr Smith to give up smoking if he wanted to live long.","On the way to London Mr Higgins told Tom and Susie many interesting things."],["医生告诉史密斯先生他要长寿的话就得戒烟。","在去倫敦的路上，Higgins先生和Tom和Susie說了許多有趣的事。"]],["system","'sistәm","n. 系统, 体系, 制度, 方式, 秩序, 分类原则\\n[计] 系统; 体制; 体系",["Every person in this community is like a cell in the immune system of a healthy human body.","Communism is the system practiced in the Soviet Union."],["这个团体内的每个人，像是一个健康的人体内免疫系统里的细胞。","共產主義是在蘇聯被實行的制度。"]],["each","i:tʃ","a. 每个, 每一\\nadv. 每个\\npron. 每个, 个人, 各自",["After they argued, they didn't speak to each other for a week.","Round-trip fares to each destination are as follows."],["他们争吵后，一周都没有再说话。","往返各地的收费如下。"]],["right","rait","n. 权利, 右边, 正义, 右派, 公正\\na. 正确的, 对的, 恰当的, 正常的, 正直的, 正面的, 右方的\\nadv. 正确地,…",["In case of an emergency, get in touch with my agent right away.","The house looked good; moreover, the price was right."],["如遇情况紧急，请立即联系我的代理。","屋子物美价廉。"]],["program","'prәugræm","n. 节目, 节目单, 程序, 纲要, 大纲, 计划\\nvt. 规划, 拟...计划\\nvi. 安排节目, 编程序\\n[计] 程序",["My mother is currently watching French Television program.","If you do not have this program, you can download it now."],["我媽媽現在在看法語電視節目。","假如你没有这个程序，你现在就可以去下载。"]],["hear","hiә","vt. 听到, 倾听, 听说, 审理\\nvi. 听见, 听",["She said that John must be very glad to hear the news.","I don't want to hear any more of your complaining."],["她说约翰一定非常愿意听到这个消息。","我不想再听你抱怨了。"]],["question","'kwestʃәn","n. 问题, 询问\\nv. 询问, 审问, 怀疑\\n[计] 询问",["This question must be discussed separately from that one.","I'm sure people ask you this question all the time, but it's all that comes to mind right now."],["这两个问题必须分开讨论。","這條問題你大概已經聽過很多次了，但我暫時還想不到別的來問你。"]],["during","'djuәriŋ","prep. 在...的时候",["I slept a little during lunch break because I was so tired.","There ought to be more buses during the rush hours."],["我在午休时间睡了一会儿，因为我太累了。","交通高峰期该有更多公交车。"]],["play","plei","n. 游戏, 游玩, 玩笑, 运动, 比赛, 赌博, 跳动, 表演, 剧本\\nv. 玩, 游戏, 假装, 开玩笑, 比赛, 扮演, 演奏,…",["I will play Sudoku then instead of continuing to bother you.","It is said that \"Hamlet\" is the most interesting play ever written."],["那我就不继续打扰你，玩数独游戏去了。","据说《哈姆雷特》是写出来的最有意思的剧本。"]],["government","'gʌvәnmәnt","n. 政府, 内阁\\n[经] 政府, 政治, 政体",["Democracy is the worst form of government, except all the others that have been tried.","The French government has launched an online game that challenges taxpayers to balance the national budget."],["除了那些我们尝试过的政府形态，民主是最差的那种了。","法國政府發布了一款線上遊戲，讓納稅人挑戰平衡國家預算。"]],["run","rʌn","n. 跑, 赛跑, 奔跑, 奔跑的路程, 趋向, 流出, 运转时间, 连续\\nvi. 跑, 奔跑, 跑步, 赛跑, 竞赛, 行驶, 运转,…",["All I did was run a little and now my knees are wobbly.","Generally speaking, boys can run faster than girls."],["只跑了一點點，膝蓋就開始發抖。","一般来说，男生跑得比女生快。"]],["small","smɒ:l","a. 小的, 少的, 小型的, 低微的, 小气的, 细微的\\nadv. 些微地\\nn. 狭小部分",["The village which I visited last summer was a small one in Nagano Prefecture.","You don't have to go getting so hairy about such a small thing."],["我去年夏天到訪的是一個位於長野縣的小村落。","不要這麼吹毛求疵。"]],["number","'nʌmbә","n. 数, 数字, 数目, 号码\\nvt. 数, 计算, 共计\\nvi. 计算, 报数\\n[计] 数字",["The number of students who were late for school was much smaller than I had expected.","The number of people who go abroad has been increasing."],["上學遲到的學生人數比我想像中少很多。","出国的人数一直在增加。"]],["off","ɒf","a. 关着的, 不再生效的, 处于...境况的, 休假的, 空闲的\\nadv. 走开, ...掉, ...下, 休息, 出发, 隔断\\np…",["Owing to the rain, the athletic meeting was put off.","The thieves knocked off another bank today in a daytime robbery."],["運動會因為下雨延後了。","今天强盗大白天的就抢了另一家银行。"]],["always","'ɒ:lweiz","adv. 总是, 始终",["To him, hunger was an abstract concept; he always had enough to eat.","I've always wondered what it'd be like to have siblings."],["對他來說，「肚子餓」是個抽象的概念，因為他從來就沒有餓過。","我总是想有兄弟姐妹会怎么样。"]],["move","mu:v","n. 移动, 迁居, 步骤\\nvt. 移动, 开动, 感动, 搬(家)\\nvi. 移动, 离开, 运行, 迁移, 摇动, 搬家, 交往, …",["She wants to move out and find a place of her own.","You'll have to get a move on if you want to catch the train."],["她想搬出去，找個屬於自己的地方。","要想赶上火车就动作快点。"]],["night","nait","n. 夜, 夜晚, 晚上, 黑暗, 夜晚的工作\\n[法] 夜, 黑夜, 黑暗",["Put on your thinking cap and try to remember whose house you slept at last night.","Last night my house was robbed while I was still awake."],["好好的想一想，看看能不能想起你昨晚是在誰家過夜的。","昨晚睡觉之前家里进了小偷。"]],["live","liv.laiv","a. 活的, 生动的, 精力充沛的, 实况转播的\\nvi. 活, 生存, 居住\\nvt. 过着, 度过, 经历\\nadv. 实况地",["London, where I live, used to be famous for its fog.","We must learn to live together as brothers, or we will perish together as fools."],["我住的地方－倫敦，從前以霧聞名。","我们必须学会像兄弟一样共同生活，要么就像傻子一样同归于尽。"]],["point","pɒint","n. 点, 小数点, 标点, 地点, 要点, 特点, 尖端, 分数, 得分, 穴位\\nvt. 弄尖, 强调, 指出, 加标点于, 瞄准\\n…",["If anyone was to ask what the point of the story is, I really don't know.","The point we must clarify here is that the lines between amateur and professional in sport are beginning to disappear."],["如果有人问起这个故事的用意是什么，我还真不知道。","我们必须阐明这个观点，在运动项目上，业余选手和专业选手的界限开始消失了。"]],["believe","bi'li:v","v. 相信",["That's nonsense. Nobody but a fool would believe it.","Jane could not believe it when her date polished off an entire chocolate cake."],["那是無稽之談。只有傻瓜才會相信。","珍的男朋友一口氣把整個巧克力蛋糕吃得一乾二淨，把珍看得目瞪口呆。"]],["hold","hәuld","n. 把握, 把持力, 柄, 控制, 掌握, 监禁\\nvt. 保存, 握住, 拿住, 占据, 持有, 拥有\\nvi. 支持, 持续, 有效…",["The telephone operator asked the caller to hold on until a connection was made.","Some Shanghainese hold large banquets when they get married."],["电话运营商提示来电人等候接通。","上海人结婚，有的人家办酒宴场面很大。"]],["today","tә'dei","n. 今天, 当今, 现在\\nadv. 今天, 当今",["The thieves knocked off another bank today in a daytime robbery.","English is taught almost all over the world today."],["今天强盗大白天的就抢了另一家银行。","今天幾乎全世界都在教授英語。"]],["bring","briŋ","vt. 带来, 产生, 促使, 提出\\nvi. 生产",["Bring me a clean plate and take the dirty one away.","A nuclear war will bring about the destruction of mankind."],["请拿一个新的盘子给我并把这个脏的拿走.","核戰爭將會為人類帶來滅亡。"]],["happen","'hæpәn","vi. 发生, 发生, 恰巧",["There is no telling what will happen in the future.","He was so healthy up to the minute of his sudden death. You really never know what might happen next."],["誰也不知道將來會發生甚麼事。","他一直好好的，卻突然死去了。未來的事情，實在是無法預知的。"]],["next","'nekst","n. 下一个\\na. 下一个的, 其次的, 贴近的\\nadv. 然后, 下次, 次于\\n[计] 近邻干扰",["Tom and Jane quarreled, but they made up the next morning.","Possibly the factory will be closed down next week."],["湯姆和珍吵了架，但是第二天早上就和好如初了。","下周工厂可能会关。"]],["without","wi'ðaut","prep. 没有, 不, 在...之外\\nadv. 在外面, 户外\\nn. 外面, 外部",["It goes without saying that money cannot buy happiness.","Bob seldom talks with Maria without making her angry."],["不言自明，金钱买不到幸福。","鮑伯和瑪麗亞說話時很少不惹她生氣。"]],["before","bi'fɒ:","prep. 在...之前\\nconj. 在...之前\\nadv. 在前",["It'd be great if you could pick up some bread before you come home.","\"Haven't we met somewhere before?\" asked the student."],["这将会是巨大的，如果你可以挑选一些面包，然后再回家。","“以前我们没在哪儿见过吗？”学生问道。"]],["large","lɑ:dʒ","a. 大的, 大量的, 宽大的, 广博的\\nadv. 大大地, 夸大地",["The hall was filled with such a large audience that there wasn't even standing room.","The old man contributed a large sum of money to the poor."],["會堂裏擠滿了聽眾，連一點站立的空間也沒有。","那位老者捐了一大筆錢去幫助窮人。"]],["million","'miljәn","n. 百万, 无数\\nnum. 百万",["At present there are about 31 million Americans over the age of sixty-five.","Half a million children still face malnutrition in Niger."],["现在美国有三千一百万年龄在六十五岁以上的老人。","尼日尔仍然有50万孩子面临着营养不良。"]],["must","mʌst","n. 必须, 未发酵葡萄汁, 绝对必要的事物\\naux. 必须",["We must learn to live together as brothers, or we will perish together as fools.","You must consider what kind of work you want to do."],["我们必须学会像兄弟一样共同生活，要么就像傻子一样同归于尽。","你一定要考慮清楚你想做怎麼樣的工作。"]],["home","hәum","n. 家, 避难所, 故乡\\na. 家庭的, 国内的, 打中目标的\\nadv. 在家, 在本国, 打中目标地\\n[计] 返回始位",["It'd be great if you could pick up some bread before you come home.","I called at Nancy's house on my way home from school."],["这将会是巨大的，如果你可以挑选一些面包，然后再回家。","在放学回家的路上，我拜访了Nancy家。"]],["under","'ʌndә","prep. 在...之下, 低于\\na. 下面的, 从属的\\nadv. 在下面",["Of course you'll catch a cold if you fall asleep under the kotatsu. You have to learn to take care of yourself.","There is no admission fee for children under five."],["如果你睡在kotatsu下当然会感冒。你要学会照顾好自己。","五岁以下的小孩票价全免。"]],["water","'wɒ:tә","n. 水, 雨水, 海水, 水位, 水面, 流水\\nvt. 给...浇水, 供以水, 注入水, 使湿\\nvi. 流泪, 流口水, 加水\\n…",["If it were not for water, no one could live on earth.","The substance is light enough to float on the water."],["如果沒有了水，沒有人能夠在地球上生存。","這種物質很輕，可以浮在水面上。"]],["room","ru:m","n. 房间, 空位, 场所\\nvi. 住宿, 居住\\nvt. 留宿",["If you don't have anything to do, look at the ceiling of your room.","The hall was filled with such a large audience that there wasn't even standing room."],["如果你没事做，那就看你房间的天花板。","會堂裏擠滿了聽眾，連一點站立的空間也沒有。"]],["write","rait","vt. 书写, 著述, 写, 写满, 写信给\\nvi. 写, 写字, 写信, 写作, 作曲\\n[计] 书写器",["Please write to me about conditions at your school.","At the age of six he had learned to use the typewriter and told the teacher that he did not need to learn to write by hand."],["请写信告诉我你们学校的情况。","他六歲的時候學會了用打字機，便和老師說他不用學執筆寫字了。"]],["mother","'mʌðә","n. 母亲, 修女院长\\nvt. 产生, 照看, 收养",["My mother prefers the arbitrary selection of the lottery machines over my lucky numbers.","My mother happened to be there when the fire broke out."],["我母亲宁愿选彩票机上的任意数字，也不选我的幸运数字。","着火的时候我妈妈恰好在那。"]],["area","'єәriә","n. 区域, 面积, 范围, 空地\\n[计] 区域",["The area around the melting ice cream was crawling with ants.","The rescue worker searched the area, looking for the child."],["在那灘冰淇淋的周圍，有一群螞蟻在爬來爬去。","援救人员为了找到孩子，仔细搜索了那个区域。"]],["national","'næʃәnәl","a. 国家的, 国立的, 全国性的, 民族的\\n[经] 全国性的, 国家的, 国民的",["The French government has launched an online game that challenges taxpayers to balance the national budget.","Some national parks offer showers and even baby-sitting services."],["法國政府發布了一款線上遊戲，讓納稅人挑戰平衡國家預算。","有些國家公園設有淋浴間，甚至還會提供託兒服務。"]],["money","'mʌni","n. 金钱, 一笔款, 财富, 货币, 金额\\n[经] 货币, 金钱, 财产",["No money, no job, no friends. He was truly at loose ends.","It goes without saying that money cannot buy happiness."],["没钱，没工作，没朋友，他真是无所适从。","不言自明，金钱买不到幸福。"]],["story","'stɒ:ri","n. 故事, 小说, 传奇, 描述, 阅历, 经历, 层",["If anyone was to ask what the point of the story is, I really don't know.","Ray was willing to corroborate Gary's story, but the police were still unconvinced that either of them were telling the truth."],["如果有人问起这个故事的用意是什么，我还真不知道。","Ray乐于证实Gary的故事，但警察仍然不相信他们其中一个说的是事实。"]],["young","jʌŋ","a. 年轻的, 无经验的, 朝气蓬勃的\\nn. 青年们, 幼小动物, 崽",["Indeed she is young and beautiful, but she is in delicate health.","The proliferation of Internet usage has given birth to a new generation of young people."],["她确实年轻貌美，但她体质娇弱。","互联网的广泛应用使新一代的年轻人诞生了。"]],["fact","fækt","n. 事实, 真实性, 真相, 细节, 论据",["In point of fact, she had nothing to do with the scandal.","Tom is not a lazy boy. As a matter of fact, he works hard."],["事实上，她和这个丑闻没有任何关系。","汤姆其实并不懒，相反他很勤奋。"]],["month","mʌnθ","n. 月\\n[经] 月",["After a six month period, his leg was healed and is normal again.","I don't mind lending you the money provided you pay it back within a month."],["過了六個月，他的腿便治好，回復正常了。","假如能一个月之内还上的话，我可以把钱借给你。"]],["different","'difәrәnt","a. 不同的\\n[机] 差动, 微分的, 差速器",["I suppose it's different when you think about it over the long term.","A more experienced lawyer would have dealt with the case in a different way."],["我认为你考虑久了就会不一样了。","一个经验丰富的律师会以其它方法来处理这个情形的。"]],["lot","lɒt","n. 运气, 签, 抽签, 份额, 许多, 一堆\\nvt. 划分\\nvi. 抽签, 抓阄",["Mastering a foreign language involves a lot of patience.","The British have a lot of respect for law and order."],["学好一门外语需要坚韧不拔的毅力。","英國人很尊重法序和秩序。"]],["study","'stʌdi","n. 学习, 研究, 学科, 论文, 求学, 书房, 试作\\nvt. 学习, 读书, 研究, 考虑, 计划\\nvi. 学习, 思索",["You'll never achieve anything if you don't study harder.","If you want to study in the United States, you need to get a student visa."],["如果你不更加努力地學習, 你將永遠不會有所成就。","你想去美國讀書的話，一定要先申請一張學生簽證。"]],["book","buk","n. 书, 书籍, 帐簿, 名册, 工作簿\\nv. 登记, 预订\\n[计] 工作簿",["You may take this book as long as you keep it clean.","The world is a book, and those who do not travel read only a page."],["你可以拿走這本書，但可別把它弄髒了。","世界是本书，不旅游的人只看了一页。"]],["eye","ai","n. 眼睛, 视力, 看\\nvt. 看, 注视",["It is easier for a camel to pass through the eye of a needle than for a rich man to enter the kingdom of God.","The firefighters put out the fire in the blink of an eye."],["富人要進天國，比駱駝穿過針孔還要難。","消防员一眨眼的功夫就把火给灭了。"]],["job","dʒɒb","n. 工作, 零活, 职业, 事情\\nvi. 做零工, 打杂, 做股票经纪, 假公济私\\nvt. 代客买卖, 批发, 承包, 欺骗\\n[计…",["If you want this job, you must apply for it by tomorrow.","Tom is thinking about applying for a better-paying job."],["如果你想要這份工作的話，就一定要在明天之前申請。","汤姆正考虑应聘薪酬更高的工作。"]],["word","wә:d","n. 话, 消息, 词, 诺言, 命令\\nvt. 用言辞表达\\n[计] 字",["If you don't know what the word means, look it up in the dictionary.","When you send a telegram, brevity is essential because you will be charged for every word."],["若你不懂词义，就在辞典上查阅一下吧。","当我们发电报的时候，简明扼要是关键，因为是以字计费的。"]],["though","ðәu","adv. 然而, 可是\\nconj. 虽然, 纵然",["I don't want to lose my ideas, even though some of them are a bit extreme.","Though Jim works very hard, his job does not pay very much."],["我不想放弃我的想法，虽然一些想法有点极端。","吉姆很努力工作，但薪水卻不高。"]],["business","'biznis","n. 生意, 事情, 业务, 商业, 商行, 职责\\n[经] 企业, 商业, 营业",["Recession is a temporary falling off of business activity during a period when such activity is generally increasing.","He put up a brave and lone struggle, but up against such heavy odds he couldn't get his business plan accepted."],["经济萧条是一段时间内，当这样的经济活动普遍增长而造成的一种临时性的经济活动衰退。","他英勇地孤军奋战，但面对如此强弱悬殊的局面，他的商业计划无法得到接受。"]],["four","fɒ:","num. 四, 四个\\n[机] 四冲程循环",["The Olympic Games take place at intervals of four years.","I will help you if I have finished my work by four."],["每隔四年，奥运会举行一次。","如果我在4点之前能完成工作，我会来帮助你。"]],["issue","'isju","n. 发行, 问题, 后果, 流出, 出口, 争端\\nvi. 发行, 流出, 造成...结果, 传下\\nvt. 使流出, 放出, 发行, …",["Kids these days think that any issue in life can be resolved as easily as restarting a computer game.","Don't dodge the issue, I want you to answer my question."],["现在的孩子认为解决任何生活问题都像重新开始一个电脑游戏那么简单。","不要逃避，我要你回答我的問題。"]],["side","said","n. 旁边, 侧, 方面, 胁, 侧边, 血统\\na. 旁的, 侧的, 次要的\\nvt. 同意, 支持\\nvi. 支持, 赞助",["That man knows how to get on the president's good side.","We heard the echo of our voices from the other side of the valley."],["那人很會討好老闆。","我們聽見自己說話的回音從山谷的另一邊傳了回來。"]],["kind","kaind","n. 种类, 性质, 方式\\na. 亲切的, 仁慈的, 和蔼的",["This kind of magazine can do harm to young people.","You must consider what kind of work you want to do."],["这种杂志对年轻人有害。","你一定要考慮清楚你想做怎麼樣的工作。"]],["head","hed","n. 头, 头脑, 领袖, 脑袋, 最前的部分\\nvt. 为首, 朝向, 前进, 用头顶\\nvi. 朝特定方向行进, (作物)结穗\\na.…",["I was called into the office first, my name being at the head of the list.","Better be the head of a cat than the tail of a lion."],["我的名字在名單中排得最前，所以我第一個被叫進了辦工室。","寧為貓頭不為獅尾。"]],["far","fɑ:","a. 远的, 久远的, 遥远的\\nadv. 甚远地, 很, 到很深的程度, 到很远的距离",["I want a boat that will take me far away from here.","It might sound far-fetched, but this is a real problem."],["我想要一艘船带我远离这里。","这可能听起来牵强，但却是个真实的问题。"]],["black","blæk","n. 黑色, 黑颜料\\na. 黑色的",["After a while, the little black rabbit sat down, and looked very sad.","I have a cat and a dog. The cat is black and the dog is white."],["過了一會兒，小黑兔就坐了下來，臉上的神情十分哀傷。","我養了一隻貓和一隻狗。貓是黑色的，狗是白色的。"]],["long","lɒŋ","a. 长的, 长久的, 冗长的, 做多头的\\nvi. 渴望, 热望, 极想\\nadv. 长久, 始终\\nn. 长时间, 长信号, 长整型\\…",["I suppose it's different when you think about it over the long term.","The cows were moving very slowly through the long green grass."],["我认为你考虑久了就会不一样了。","牛群在鬱鬱蔥蔥的草地上緩緩移動著。"]],["both","bәuθ","a. 两者的\\nadv. 两者都\\npron. 两者",["When both girls told John they had feelings for him, he was in a quandary as to which girl he should be with.","He that hears much and speaks not at all shall be welcome both in bower and hall."],["当两个女生都跟约翰宣称她们对他有感觉时，他不知道该跟哪个谈恋爱了。","他聽得多說得少, 在閨房和大廳都很受歡迎。"]],["little","'litl","n. 一点点, 少许, 一会儿, 短时间\\na. 小的, 很少的, 幼小的, 琐碎的, 短暂的, 矮小的\\nadv. 很少, 稍微, 完全不",["My wife's part-time job brings in a little extra money.","Poor is not the one who has too little, but the one who wants too much."],["我太太兼職的工作賺進了一些額外的錢。","贫穷的不是拥有太少的人，而是想要太多的人。"]],["house","haus","n. 房子, 住宅, 机构, 议院, 家族, 家庭\\nvt. 给...房子住, 收藏\\nvi. 住, 躲藏",["The house looked good; moreover, the price was right.","His low salary prevents him from buying the house."],["屋子物美价廉。","因為他的薪水太低，他買不起那棟房子。"]],["yes","jes","adv. 是\\nn. 是, 同意\\nv. 同意",["It is difficult to keep up a conversation with someone who only says \"yes\" and \"no\".","For example in Bulgaria, shaking one's head means yes while nodding one's head means no."],["跟一个只说“是”和“不是”的人很难继续谈话。","例如，在保加利亚摇头表示同意而点头表示不同意。"]],["since","sins","prep. 自...以后, 自...以来\\nadv. 自那时以后\\nconj. 既然, 自...以后, 自...以来",["The office has been topsy-turvy since the merger upset everything.","There is nothing new transpired since I wrote you last."],["自從公司合併了以後，一切都變得十分混亂。","上次写信以来没有什么新鲜事发生。"]],["provide","prә'vaid","vt. 提供, 供应, 规定, 预备\\nvi. 作准备, 抚养, 规定",["The government will provide interest-free loans to firms that participate in the program.","We should all help provide starving people with food."],["政府将会对参与该项计划的企业提供无息贷款。","我们应该尽量的提供一些食物给那些饥肠辘辘的人们."]],["service","'sә:vis","n. 服务, 贡献, 雇佣, 公职, 服役, 功劳, 仪式, 送达, 行政部门\\nvt. 保养, 维修\\na. 武装部队的, 服务性的, …",["The difference between Facebook and Twitter is that Twitter is a microblogging service.","Our on-line Customer Service Desk and trained support agents enable problems to be quickly identified and addressed."],["Facebook 和 Twitter 的不同在于，Twitter 是微博服务。","我們的線上客服台和訓練有素的支援代理能夠快速識別和解決問題。"]],["around","ә'raund","prep. 包围, 在...周围, 四处\\nadv. 兜着圈子, 在附近, 到处",["With so many people around he naturally became a bit nervous.","This will be a good souvenir of my trip around the United States."],["他被很多人围着，自然变得有点紧张。","这将是我环绕美国旅行中一个很好的纪念品。"]],["friend","frend","n. 朋友, 支持者, 赞助者\\n[法] 朋友, 友人, 赞助者",["This is my friend Rachel. We went to high school together.","I will never sell my friend down the river for anything in the world."],["这是我朋友Rachel，我们当时在同一所高中。","無論發生甚麼事，我也絕對不會出賣我的朋友。"]],["important","im'pɒ:tәnt","a. 重要的, 有地位的, 大量的, 显要的, 自负的\\n[计] 要点",["The rules must be few, and what is more important, simple.","This is a very important meeting. You ought not to miss it."],["规则要少，并且最重要的是要简单。","這個會議很重要的，你不要不來。"]],["father","'fɑ:ðә","n. 父亲, 祖先, 长辈, 神父, 创始者\\nvt. 当...的父亲, 保护, 创作, 发明, 培养",["The university was founded by his father twenty years ago.","George did business in the same manner as his father."],["大学在20年前由他的父亲建立。","乔治和他爸爸做生意的方式一样。"]],["sit","sit","vi. 坐, 就座, 坐落\\nvt. 使就座, 骑\\nn. 坐, 衣服合身",["I'm going to sit on the bench over there next to the street lamp.","Mother always tells me not to sit up late at night."],["我會在那盞街燈旁邊的長凳上坐下來。","媽媽總是告訴我晚上不要熬夜太晚。"]],["away","ә'wei","adv. 离去",["In case of an emergency, get in touch with my agent right away.","I want a boat that will take me far away from here."],["如遇情况紧急，请立即联系我的代理。","我想要一艘船带我远离这里。"]],["until","әn'til","prep. 直到, 在...以前\\nconj. 直到...时, 在...以前",["It was not until Lucy left me that I realized how much I loved her.","It is not until you go abroad that you realize how small Japan is."],["直到露西離開了我，我才意識到我是多麼愛她。","你出國看看，才會知道日本是多麼的細小。"]],["power","'pauә","n. 力, 体力, 力量, 势力, 动力, 权力, 强国, 乘方, 强度, 幂, 功率\\nvt. 使...有力量, 供以动力, 激励\\n[…",["Worrying doesn't take away tomorrow's concerns, but it does take away today's power.","Accepting the other's norms is submitting to the other's power."],["煩惱帶不走明天的憂慮, 但卻拿走了今天的力量。","接受对方的准则就是给予他权力。"]],["hour","auә","n. 小时, 钟头, 时间, ...点钟, 课时",["As I missed the train, I had to wait for the next one for about an hour.","Scarcely an hour goes by that I don't I think of you with love."],["由于错过了火车，我不得不等下一班等一小时。","我幾乎沒有一個小時不滿懷愛意地想著你。"]],["game","geim","n. 比赛, 玩耍, 比分, 得胜, 比赛规则, 策略, 游戏, 野味\\nvi. 赌博\\na. 勇敢的, 有胆量的, 关于野味的, 跛的\\…",["The French government has launched an online game that challenges taxpayers to balance the national budget.","The Tigers lost the game, which was a surprise to us."],["法國政府發布了一款線上遊戲，讓納稅人挑戰平衡國家預算。","我們覺得很驚訝老虎隊竟然輸掉了比賽。"]],["often","'ɒ:fn","adv. 时常, 常常",["I would often take part in an English speech contest in my school days.","You do such a thing once too often and get punished."],["当年我在学校的时候经常参加英语演讲比赛。","你一錯再錯，當然會被處罰。"]],["yet","jet","adv. 还, 尚, 仍然, 已经, 然而\\nconj. 然而",["At that time, Mexico was not yet independent of Spain.","Don't throw away this magazine. I haven't read it yet."],["那个时候，墨西哥还没有独立于西班牙。","这本杂志不要扔。我还没看呢。"]],["line","lain","n. 列, 线, 绳, 电线, 线路, 路线, 航线, 作业线, 界线, 战线, 外形, 排, 家系\\nvt. 排成一行, 顺...排列,…",["The two runners reached the finish line at the same time.","Be sure to drop us a line as soon as you get to London."],["兩位跑手同時到達了終點線。","别忘了一到伦敦就给我们留言啊。"]],["political","pә'litikl","a. 政治的, 政治上的, 政党的, 从事政治的\\n[法] 政治的, 政治上的, 党派政治的",["Today our numbers are few, but with the right political strategy, in a couple years we may number in the tens of thousands.","The abbreviation of \"Chinese People's Political Consultative Conference\" is \"CPPCC\"."],["我們目前人數不多，但只要政治策略得當，幾年後或許能達到數萬人。","“中国人民政治协商会议”的简称是“人民政协”。"]],["end","end","n. 结束, 终点, 目标, 末端, 梢, 死亡, 残余\\nv. 结束, 终结, 终止\\n[计] 端; 结束",["You should turn in your term papers by the end of April.","At this rate, we're not likely to be done before the end of the week."],["請在四月底之前交上你的學期報告。","按照这个速度，我们不会在这周结束前完成。"]],["among","ә'mʌŋ","prep. 在...之中",["Wearing second-hand clothes is now popular among young people.","Tom became popular among teenagers as soon as he made his debut on the screen."],["二手服飾在時下年輕人之間蔚為風潮。","汤姆第一次上电视后就广受青少年的欢迎。"]],["ever","'evә","adv. 曾经, 究竟, 永远",["This was the most interesting book that she had ever read.","It is said that \"Hamlet\" is the most interesting play ever written."],["這是她讀過最有趣的書。","据说《哈姆雷特》是写出来的最有意思的剧本。"]],["stand","stænd","n. 站立, 站住, 停顿, 讲台, 看台, 立场, 法院证人席\\nvi. 站, 立, 坐落, 停滞, 位于, 坚持, 维持原状\\nvt.…",["The train was so crowded that we were obliged to stand all the way to Osaka.","Let go of my arm! I can't stand people touching me."],["火車很擠迫，一直駛到了大阪我們都要站著。","放開我的手臂！我不能忍受有人碰我。"]],["bad","bæd","a. 坏的\\nn. 坏\\nadv. 坏地",["The image quality is really bad - the resolution is so low.","Due to bad weather, the plane arrived three hours late."],["画质真的很差 - 分辨率那么低。","由于天气不好，飞机迟到了3小时。"]],["lose","lu:z","vt. 遗失, 损失, 丢失, 使失去, 错过, 浪费, 迷失, 使迷路, 输去, 使沉溺于\\nvi. 受损失, 失败",["I don't want to lose my ideas, even though some of them are a bit extreme.","Out of sight out of mind. When you're separated you lose touch."],["我不想放弃我的想法，虽然一些想法有点极端。","久了不見，便會逐漸淡忘。分開以後，也就自然不會再聯絡了。"]],["however","hau'evә","adv. 然而, 无论如何, 究竟怎样\\nconj. 然而, 可是",["However hard I try, I can't do it any better than she can.","However hard you try, you can't finish it in a week or so."],["无论我多么努力尝试，我都无法做到比她更好。","你就算多努力，也不可能在一兩個星期內做完。"]],["member","'membә","n. 成员, 会员\\n[医] │肢, 肢体",["Before anything else, let's welcome a new member to our company.","Each family member is at home on Saturday morning."],["首先，让我们欢迎公司的一个新成员。","家庭的每个人都在周六的早上在家里。"]],["pay","pei","n. 薪资, 付款, 补偿\\nvt. 支付, 付清, 补偿, 偿还, 对...有利, 为...涂防水物\\nvi. 付款, 付出代价, 偿还…",["Though Jim works very hard, his job does not pay very much.","It makes sense to pay off your credit card balance every month."],["吉姆很努力工作，但薪水卻不高。","每个月还清信用卡负债很重要。"]],["law","lɒ:","n. 法律, 法则, 定律, 法律的制约, 法学, 司法界, 诉讼\\nv. 起诉",["He pointed out how important it is to observe the law.","In many countries, buying or smoking cannabis is forbidden by law."],["他指出了遵守法律的重要性。","在很多国家，购买和吸食大麻是违法的。"]],["meet","mi:t","n. 会, 集会\\na. 适宜的, 合适的\\nvt. 遇见, 引见, 认识, 满足, 对付\\nvi. 相遇, 接触",["The English ambassador demanded to meet with the President directly.","Meet me at the lobby of the Imperial Hotel at 6:30 p.m."],["英国大使要求直接会见总统。","下午六点半到帝国酒店的大堂找我。"]],["car","kɑ:","n. 汽车, 客车\\n[机] 车",["Mike is always nagging his father to buy him a car.","Buying such an expensive car is out of the question."],["米克整天都在求爸爸買車給他。","根本不可能買到這麼貴的車子。"]],["city","'siti","n. 城市, 市\\n[法] 都市, 城市, 市",["London is such a large city that visitors must use buses and the underground railway to get about.","The population of London is much greater than that of any other British city."],["伦敦是个大城市，游客必须乘公交或地铁才能出行。","倫敦的人口遠遠多於其他英國城市的人口。"]],["almost","'ɒ:lmәust","adv. 几乎, 差不多",["The police have been searching for the stolen goods for almost a month.","Seriously though, episode 21 made me almost cry while laughing."],["警察大概从一个月前就开始找被偷物品了。","但是说真的，第21集让我笑得眼泪都要出来了。"]],["include","in'klu:d","vt. 包括, 把...算入, 包住\\n[计] DOS内部命令:在CONFIG.SYS文件的一个配置块中包含另一配置块的内容",["Possible side effects include blurred vision and shortness of breath.","Don't include multiple alternative words inside the same sentence."],["可能會引起視力模糊、呼吸急促等副作用。","在同一句中不要包含多个可选单词。"]],["continue","kәn'tinju:","vi. 继续, 延续, 延长\\nvt. 使继续, 使延长",["Mathematics is the part of science you could continue to do if you woke up tomorrow and discovered the universe was gone.","You continue making the same mistakes time after time."],["就算你明天起床，發現整個宇宙消失了，還有一門科學是可以繼續研究的 ﹣ 那就是數學了。","你每次都继续犯同样的错误。"]],["set","set","n. 日落, 同伙, 组合, 集合, 装置\\nvt. 放, 安置, 放置, 设定, 使凝结, 点燃, 确定, 点缀, 使就位, 树立, 分…",["If I could be reborn, I would want to be the child of a rich family, then I'd be set for life.","I had words with the manager of that store, because he refused to refund my money for the TV set that wasn't operating properly."],["如果可以投胎轉世的話，我想做有錢人家的兒子，一輩子衣食無憂。","我找商店经理谈了话，因为他拒绝为那不能用的电视退钱。"]],["later","'leitә","adv. 以后, 随后",["It was only much later that I came to understand the importance of child education.","He obtained a picture which Picasso had painted in his later years."],["很久以後我才明白到教育兒童有多重要。","他獲得了一幅畢卡索晚年的畫作。"]],["community","kә'mju:niti","n. 社区, 公众, 共有, 共同体\\n[经] 公众, 共有, 社会",["I applied for a job as a lifeguard at the community pool.","Every month at our company, they run a community activity."],["我去了公共游泳池應徵當救生員。","在我们公司每月都会举办社团活动。"]],["name","neim","n. 名字, 名称, 姓名, 名义, 名誉, 文件名\\nvt. 命名, 称呼, 任命, 提名, 列举\\na. 姓名的, 据以取名的\\n[计…",["I heard someone in the crowd outside the station call my name.","While getting off the bus, she heard her name called."],["我聽到車站外的人群中有人在叫我的名字。","她一下車，就聽到有人叫她的名字。"]],["five","faiv","num. 五, 五个",["It will take five to ten years for the technology to be ready.","It's just five in the morning, but nevertheless it is light out."],["在科技准备好之前需要五到十年。","才早晨5点，但天已经亮了。"]],["once","wʌns","adv. 一次, 曾经, 一旦\\nconj. 一旦, 一经\\nn. 一次\\na. 从前的",["A bad habit, once formed, is difficult to get rid of.","Peter talks with his parents in the United States on the phone at least once a week."],["一旦養成了壞習慣，就很難改回來了。","彼得每星期都至少會和身在美國的父母談一次電話。"]],["white","hwait","n. 白色, 洁白, 眼白, 白种人, 蛋白\\na. 白色的, 纯洁的, 白种的, 苍白的, 空白的, 幸运的",["Some people like red wine and some people like white wine.","Some of the roses in my garden are white, and the others are red."],["有人喜歡紅酒，有人喜歡白酒。","我花园里的一部分玫瑰是白色的，其他的是红色的。"]],["least","li:st","n. 最少, 最小, 最小限度\\na. 最少的, 最小的\\nadv. 最小, 最少",["In a dictionary like this one there should be at least two sentences with \"fridge\".","Even if your sentences were actually senseless, you at least have the luck to be able to form beautiful sentences."],["這樣的字典最少也應該有兩句「冰箱」的例句吧。","即使你的句子实际上是毫无意义的，至少你有幸能造出好句子。"]],["president","'prezidәnt","n. 总统, 总裁, 董事长, (学院)院长, (大学)校长, 主管人, 主持人\\n[经] 总经理, 董事长, 总裁",["The English ambassador demanded to meet with the President directly.","President Lincoln was what we call a self-made man."],["英国大使要求直接会见总统。","林肯總統就是我們所謂白手起家的男人。"]],["learn","lә:n","vt. 学习；认识到；得知",["Some babies learn to swim even before they are one year old.","Any student of this school must learn one more foreign language besides English."],["有些宝宝甚至在一岁之前就学习游泳了。","除了英语，这个学校的所有学生必须多学一门外语。"]],["real","'riәl","a. 真的, 真实的, 实际的, 实在的, 不动(产)的, 实数的\\nn. 实数, 现实\\nadv. 真正地",["Artificial leather can't compare with the real thing.","In real combat, you must not forget that hesitation is a very dangerous thing."],["人造皮革是比不上真皮的。","在实战中，你要知道三心二意是很危险的。"]],["change","tʃeindʒ","n. 变化, 找回的零钱, 找头, 更换\\nvt. 改变, 更换, 兑换",["The progress of science has brought about great change in our lives.","No matter what you may say, I will not change my mind."],["科技的進步為我們的生活帶來了巨大的轉變。","你說甚麼我也不會改變主意的。"]],["team","ti:m","n. 队, 组\\nvt. 把马(牛)套在同一辆车上, 把...编成一组\\nvi. 驾驶卡车, 协作",["A new team was formed in order to take part in the boat race.","Between you and me, I don't like our new team captain."],["为了参加划船比赛，一支新的队伍组成了。","我就只告诉你，我不喜欢我们的新队长。"]],["minute","'minit. mai'nju:t","n. 分, 分钟, 片刻, 备忘录, 笔记\\nvt. 记录, 摘录, 测定时间\\na. 微小的, 详细的",["The statue of the Minute Man commemorates the valiant soldiers who fought in the Revolutionary War.","He was so healthy up to the minute of his sudden death. You really never know what might happen next."],["民兵雕像是为了纪念独立战争中英勇作战的士兵。","他一直好好的，卻突然死去了。未來的事情，實在是無法預知的。"]],["best","best","a. 最好的\\nadv. 最好地\\nn. 最好的人",["Should he be given another chance, he would do his best.","The girl did not like to wash dishes, but she made the best of it."],["再給他一次機會的話，他會盡力做到最好的。","女孩不太喜歡洗碗，但也盡力而為。"]],["several","'sevәrәl","a. 几个的, 一些的, 各自的\\npron. 几个",["Several cottages have been isolated by the flood water.","English has now become the common language of several nations in the world."],["好几间小屋被洪水孤立起来了。","英语现已成为世界上许多国家的通用语言了。"]],["idea","ai'diә","n. 主意, 办法, 理想, 思想, 概念, 意见\\n[医] 观念, 思想",["The last person I told my idea to thought I was nuts.","While we were discussing the problem, I hit upon a good idea."],["最后一个听我说我的主意的人认为我疯了。","在我们讨论问题的过程中，我想到了一个好主意。"]],["kid","kid","n. 小山羊, 小山羊肉, 小孩, 欺骗\\na. 小山羊皮制的\\nv. 哄骗, 嘲弄",["I'd send my kid out on his own for a while if I were you. A few hard knocks at this point might do him some good.","I can't believe you were the smartest kid in your class."],["換了是我，就會要孩子自己一個人去遊歷一下。他現在這個年紀，吃一點苦是好的。","我不敢相信你是你们班里面最聪明的孩子。"]],["body","'bɒdi","n. 身体, 人, 尸体, 主要部分, 团体\\nvt. 赋以形体\\n[计] 体",["When the body is touched, receptors in the skin send messages to the brain causing the release of chemicals such as endorphins.","Just as food feeds the body, so reading feeds the mind."],["當身體受到外界觸碰的時候，皮膚的感受器就會向大腦發出信息，令大腦釋放安多芬等的化學物質。","就像食物餵養身體，所以閱讀餵養心靈。"]],["information",".infә'meiʃәn","n. 消息, 知识, 通知, 情报, 信息, 问讯处, 起诉\\n[计] 信息",["The Internet is an invaluable source of information.","Eighty percent of all information on computers around the world is in English."],["互联网是一种无法估量的信息资源。","全世界百分之八十電腦上的資訊都是用英語寫的。"]],["nothing","'nʌθiŋ","n. 无, 不关紧要之事, 零\\nadv. 毫不, 决不\\ninterj. 什么也没有, 无",["Except for carrots, there is nothing he won't eat.","I have nothing to say with regard to that problem."],["除了胡萝卜，他没有什么是不吃的。","对于这个问题我无可奉告。"]],["ago","ә'gәu","adv. 以前",["If I wanted to scare you, I would tell you what I dreamt about a few weeks ago.","The university was founded by his father twenty years ago."],["如果我是想吓你，我就会告诉你我几周前梦到的事。","大学在20年前由他的父亲建立。"]],["lead","li:d. led","n. 铅, 铅条, 领导, 超前量, 领引, 榜样, 主角, 导线\\nvt. 引导, 带领, 领导, 指挥, 致使, 加铅于, 用铅包\\n…",["There's a chance that tap water may contain harmful substances like chlorine and lead.","I got a piece of lead for my mechanical pencil from her."],["自來水有可能含有氯、鉛等有害物質。","我从她那里拿了一根自动铅笔芯。"]],["social","'sәuʃәl","a. 社会的, 群居的, 社交的\\nn. 联欢会",["As soon as we are born, the world gets to work on us and transforms us from merely biological into social units.","Citizens of higher social status were permitted to live closer to the center."],["我們一出生在這個世界上，就會開始受到周遭環境的影響，從生物單位慢慢進化成社會單位。","社會地位較高的公民被允許住在較靠近市中心的地方。"]],["understand",".ʌndә'stænd","vt. 理解, 了解, 领会, 听说, 懂\\nvi. 懂得, 认为",["Because it is written in simple English even a child can understand it.","I'm so dumb... I'm trying to explain things to you that I don't understand myself."],["因為這是用簡單的英語寫的，所以甚至連孩子都能理解。","我太愚蠢了...我竟然试着给你解释我自己都不懂的东西。"]],["whether","'hweðә","conj. 是否, 不论\\npron. 两个中的哪一个",["It is up to you to decide whether we will go there or not.","I wonder whether man could live with only two hours' sleep a night."],["我们去不去那儿由你来决定。","不知道人每晚只睡兩個小時，能不能生存下去呢？"]],["watch","wɒtʃ","n. 观察, 手表, 看守, 守护, 监视, 值班人\\nvt. 看, 注视, 照顾, 看守, 守护, 监视\\nvi. 观看, 注视, 守侯",["American politics are interesting to watch, especially during a presidential election.","Every morning I make it a rule to watch the English course on TV."],["美国的政治看起来很有趣，特别是在选举总统期间。","每天早上我養成看電視英語課程的習慣。"]],["together","tә'geðә","adv. 一起, 共同, 彼此",["We must learn to live together as brothers, or we will perish together as fools.","This is my friend Rachel. We went to high school together."],["我们必须学会像兄弟一样共同生活，要么就像傻子一样同归于尽。","这是我朋友Rachel，我们当时在同一所高中。"]],["follow","'fɒlәu","vt. 跟随, 沿行, 遵循, 追求\\nvi. 跟随, 接着\\nn. 跟随, 追随",["I could hardly follow what Jane said in her speech.","To be a good batter, you've got to hang loose and follow your instincts."],["我幾乎完全跟不上 Jane 的演講內容。","想成為一個好的擊球手的話，你要在球場上時刻保持鎮定，還要學會相信自己的直覺。"]],["parent","'perәnt","n. 父母, 父母亲, 根源\\n[法] 父亲, 母亲, 根源",["Due to a number of unfortunate causes, one-parent families are on the increase.","She's what you call a \"delinquent mom,\" but she's good at cooking, and most importantly, she's a really caring parent."],["由于诸多不幸因素，单亲家庭的数量在增长中。","她就是你所謂的「年輕媽媽」，但是她的廚藝不錯，最重要的是，她非常關心孩子。"]],["stop","stɒp","n. 停止, 车站, 逗留, 填塞, 障碍, (风琴的)音栓\\nvi. 停止, 被塞住\\nvt. 塞住, 堵塞, 阻止, 击落, 停止, …",["The bus had already left when we got to the bus stop.","He raised his hand in order that the taxi might stop."],["我們到公車站的時候，公車已經開走了。","他舉高了手來截的士。"]],["face","feis","n. 脸, 面容, 正面, 外观\\nvt. 面对, 朝, 正视, 面临\\nvi. 朝, 向\\n[计] 现场可改变的控制元件",["Those selected will have to face extensive medical and psychological tests.","Half a million children still face malnutrition in Niger."],["被选上的将会面临大量的医学和精神测试。","尼日尔仍然有50万孩子面临着营养不良。"]],["anything","'eniθiŋ","pron. 任何事",["If there's anything urgent, you can get in touch with me.","I will never sell my friend down the river for anything in the world."],["紧急情况下，您可以联系我。","無論發生甚麼事，我也絕對不會出賣我的朋友。"]],["create","kri:'eit","vt. 创造, 建造, 引起, 任命",["Be not afraid of life. Believe that life is worth living, and your belief will help create the fact.","Thousands of workers and artisans toiled for 22 years to create this breathtaking white marble structure."],["不要害怕活著。要相信生命是有價值的，你的信念會使之成真。","數千名工人和工匠辛勤工作了 22 年，才打造出這座令人驚嘆的白色大理石建築。"]],["public","'pʌblik","n. 公众, 民众\\na. 公众的, 公共的, 公立的, 公用的",["The plan was given up under the pressure of public opinion.","It is sometimes difficult to make yourself understood in public."],["計劃受到輿論的壓力而被取消了。","有時很難在公眾場合表達你自己的意思。"]],["already","ɒ:l'redi","adv. 已经, 早已",["It's already eleven o'clock. I must be leaving now.","The fact that television frequently limits communication within families is already well known."],["現在已經十一時了。我一定要走了。","电视限制家庭成员的沟通的事实已经广为人知。"]],["speak","spi:k","vi. 说, 说话, 演说, 发言\\nvt. 说, 讲, 说出",["It seems that the purpose of his study abroad was to improve his ability to speak English.","After they argued, they didn't speak to each other for a week."],["看来他出国学习的目的是要提高他说英语的能力。","他们争吵后，一周都没有再说话。"]],["others","","pron. 其他人",["Some of my classmates like volleyball and others enjoy tennis.","Some students like English, and others like physics."],["我有些同學喜歡排球，也有些喜歡網球。","有些学生喜欢英语，有些喜欢物理。"]],["read","ri:d","v. 读, 阅读, 理解\\na. 有学问的\\nn. 读取, 阅读\\n[计] 读取",["As it is written in simple English, this book is easy to read.","We should read the newspaper so as not to lag behind the times."],["由於是用簡單的英語所寫的，這本書很容易閱讀。","我們應該讀报紙，不落後於時代。"]],["level","'levl","n. 水平, 水准, 平地\\na. 同高的, 平坦的, 齐平的, 水平的\\nvt. 弄平, 夷平, 使同等, 瞄准, 对准\\nvi. 变平…",["On a fundamental level, the 12 forms of the Chinese zodiac are related to animal worship.","I'd like to study in China to improve the level of my Chinese."],["從根本上說，十二生肖的形成，與動物崇拜有關。","为了提高我的汉语水平，我想去中国学习。"]],["allow","ә'lau","vt. 允许, 同意给予, 承认\\nvi. 容许, 猜想\\n[计] 允许命令",["Excuse me; allow me to point out three errors in the above article.","I hope that your parents will allow us to get married."],["抱歉，请允许我指出上文中的三个错误。","希望你父母會讓我們結婚吧。"]],["add","æd","vt. 增加, 添加, 附带说明, 计算...总和\\nvi. 做加法, 积累而成, 增添\\n[计] 加法",["Use interrogative pronouns to rewrite the sentences below; if you need to, you can add or remove a few words.","Let's find sentences with new vocabulary on this topic, add them to the following list: _____; and translate them."],["用疑问代词表任指格式改写下面的句子，根据需要可以增加或者减少一些词语。","讓我們找關於這一主題有新單字的句子，將其添加到下面的列表：_____;並翻譯它們。"]],["office","'ɒfis","n. 办公室, 部, 公职, 职责\\n[化] 办公室",["The office has been topsy-turvy since the merger upset everything.","Every now and then he drops in at this bookstore on his way home from the office."],["自從公司合併了以後，一切都變得十分混亂。","有時從辦公室回家的路上他會到這家書店看一看。"]],["spend","spend","vt. 花费, 浪费, 度过, 消耗, 消磨\\nvi. 花费, 用尽",["Bob thinks it is a silly idea to call his mother who is so far away, to spend so much, and to say so little.","He likes to spend some time in solitude every day."],["鲍勃认为，给他那住得老远的母亲花高昂的话费，只为说上那么一两句是一个愚蠢的主意。","他喜歡每天都享受一下一個人的時間。"]],["door","dɒ:","n. 门",["We couldn't open the door because it was locked from within.","If I lost my key, I wouldn't be able to lock the door."],["我們無法打開這扇門，因為它從裡面被反鎖了。","如果我弄丟了我的鑰匙，我就無法鎖門了。"]],["health","'helθ","n. 健康, 卫生, 蓬勃, 健康状态\\n[医] 健康",["Good health is inseparable from exercise and moderation.","Indeed she is young and beautiful, but she is in delicate health."],["健康与运动及节制密不可分。","她确实年轻貌美，但她体质娇弱。"]],["person","'pә:sn","n. 人, 人身, 人称\\n[法] 人, 法人, 人身",["The last person I told my idea to thought I was nuts.","Bob is such a nice person that everybody likes him."],["最后一个听我说我的主意的人认为我疯了。","鲍勃是个很好的人，大家都很喜欢他。"]],["art","ɑ:t","n. 艺术, 人文科学, 技术, 巧妙, 诡计, 美术\\n[计] 实际保持时间, 特许权和资源表, 平均检索时间, 平均运行时间",["That painting is a masterpiece of impressionist art.","I went to every modern art show that took place in Tokyo last year."],["那幅畫是印象派的大師級作品。","東京去年舉行的現代藝術展，我全都去過了。"]],["sure","ʃuә","a. 确信, 必然的, 必定的\\nadv. 当然, 确实地, 无疑地",["Make sure to turn off all the lights before going out.","I am sure the situation will take a turn for the better."],["出去之前确认一下所有的灯都关了。","我肯定事情会往好的方向发展。"]],["war","wɒ:","n. 战争, 战争状态, 战术, 军事, 冲突, 斗争, 竞争\\nvi. 进行战争, 作战, 打仗, 战斗\\na. 战争的, 战时用的",["I had been in the army for a month when the war ended.","All humanity will suffer if a nuclear war breaks out."],["戰爭結束的時候，我已經在軍隊裡待了一箇月。","一旦爆發核戰爭，受苦的將會是全人類。"]],["history","'histәri","n. 历史, 过去, 经历, 发展过程, 历史学, 过去的事, 历史记录\\n[计] 历史记录",["Beth was asked by her lazy boyfriend to do his history homework.","He is very much interested in Japanese history. We are surprised at his vast knowledge of the subject."],["Beth被她懒惰的男朋友要求帮他做历史作业。","他对日本的历史非常感兴趣。我们很惊讶他在这方面的丰富知识。"]],["party","'pɑ:ti","n. 宴会, 党, 政党, 团体, 当事人, 聚会\\nv. 举办聚会",["I will leave everything about the party up to you.","I am grateful to you for inviting me to the party."],["派對的準備工作就全交給你了。","謝謝你邀我參加派對。"]],["within","wi'ðin","n. 内部, 里头\\nadv. 在内部, 在内心里\\nprep. 在...之内",["I don't mind lending you the money provided you pay it back within a month.","We couldn't open the door because it was locked from within."],["假如能一个月之内还上的话，我可以把钱借给你。","我們無法打開這扇門，因為它從裡面被反鎖了。"]],["grow","grәu","vt. 种植, 使长满\\nvi. 生长, 变成, 发展",["These plants are too small. I don't think that they'll grow.","Fingernails grow nearly four times faster than toenails."],["这些植物太小了，我觉得它们长不大。","手甲的生長速度比腳甲快四倍。"]],["result","ri'zʌlt","n. 结果, 成绩, 答案\\nvi. 产生, 结果, 致使\\n[计] 结果",["This book is a result of his enthusiastic research.","This invention was the result of years of patient experiment."],["這本書是他熱心研究的成果。","這發明是多年來耐心實驗的成果。"]],["open","'әupәn","n. 公开, 户外, 空旷\\na. 开着的, 开放的, 开阔的, 营业着的, 公开的, 悬而未决的\\nvt. 打开, 公开, 开放\\nvi…",["Open the cupboard to the left, the bottles are in there.","Keep your eyes closed until I tell you to open them."],["打开左边的橱，瓶子在那儿。","闭着你的眼睛直到我告诉你睁开为止。"]],["morning","'mɒ:niŋ","n. 早晨, 早上, 初期",["Back in high school, I got up at 6 a.m. every morning.","Tom expected to leave early in the morning, but he overslept."],["以前讀高中的時候﹐我每天早上六點起床。","汤姆本想早上早点出发，结果却睡过头了。"]],["walk","wɒ:k","n. 走, 散步, 步行, 行走的路程, 竞走, 散步场所\\nvi. 走路, 步行, 处世\\nvt. 走过, 遛, 使走, 护送...走",["In the end, because of the disease, he became unable to walk and had to use a motorized wheelchair to get around.","A little walk will give you a good appetite for breakfast."],["最後，他的病奪去了他走路的能力，想去哪兒也要用電動輪椅來代步。","散散步將會給你很好的食慾吃早餐。"]],["reason","'ri:zn","n. 理由, 原因, 理智, 道理, 前提, 理性\\nvt. 说服, 推论, 辩论\\nvi. 推论, 劝说, 思考",["There is no reason for you to feel inferior to anyone.","For one reason or another their holiday in France didn't come up to expectations."],["你没理由觉得自己比别人差的。","由于种种原因，他们在法国的假期没让他们感到满意。"]],["low","lәu","n. 低点, 低价, 低, 牛叫声\\na. 低的, 消沉的, 低等的, 浅的, 卑贱的\\nadv. 低下地, 谦卑地, 低\\nvi. 牛叫",["His low salary prevents him from buying the house.","The image quality is really bad - the resolution is so low."],["因為他的薪水太低，他買不起那棟房子。","画质真的很差 - 分辨率那么低。"]],["win","win","vt. 赢得, 打胜, 成功\\nvi. 获胜, 达到, 影响\\nn. 胜利, 赢, 收益",["To win his audience, the speaker resorted to using rhetorical techniques he learned from his communication courses.","Everyone held their breath to see who would win the presidential election."],["演说家为了征服他的听众，不惜使用他在交流课上学到的修辞技巧。","所有人都屏住呼吸关注着谁会赢得总统竞选。"]],["research","ri'sә:tʃ","n. 研究, 调查, 考察\\nvi. 研究, 调查",["I'm an anthropology research student, and my topic is 'Chinese medicine in Britain'.","The results of the research were quite satisfactory."],["我是人类学的研究学生，课题是“中医在英国”。","調查的結果十分令人滿意。"]],["girl","gә:l","n. 女孩, 少女, 女佣",["When both girls told John they had feelings for him, he was in a quandary as to which girl he should be with.","The old man bribed a young girl with money and jewelry."],["当两个女生都跟约翰宣称她们对他有感觉时，他不知道该跟哪个谈恋爱了。","老人用金錢和珠寶取得了少女的歡心。"]],["guy","gai","n. 家伙, 支索\\nvt. 用支索撑住, 取笑, 嘲弄\\nvi. 逃跑",["I don't know what to do with that guy. No matter how mad I get at him he just takes it in stride and pays no attention.","He won't be easily discouraged, because he's a tough guy."],["我不知道對那個傢伙該怎麼辦。不論我對他生多大的氣, 他就是蠻不在乎而且置之不理。","他很坚强，不会那么容易灰心。"]],["early","'ә:li","a. 早的, 早熟的\\nadv. 很早, 初",["Please excuse me for calling you so early in the morning.","On a rainy morning, he left his house early so as to be in time for school."],["原谅我早上这么早给你打电话。","在一个下雨的早晨，他很早出门为的是及时到学校。"]],["food","fu:d","n. 食物, 养料\\n[医] 食物, 食品",["Every now and then I like to have hot and spicy food.","Just as food feeds the body, so reading feeds the mind."],["有时候我会想吃辣的东西。","就像食物餵養身體，所以閱讀餵養心靈。"]],["himself","him'self","pron. 他自己, 他亲自",["My grandfather sometimes talks to himself when he's alone.","Bob gave Tina almost all the stamps he had collected, and kept only a few for himself."],["我祖父一个人的时候，有时会自言自语。","Bob将自己收集的邮票大部分都给了Tina，只留了一小部分给自己。"]],["moment","'mәumәnt","n. 片刻, 瞬间, 重要, 阶段, 力矩\\n[医] 片刻, 瞬间, 时机, 因素, 矩",["So, we finally meet! I've waited so long for this moment.","Could you lend me some money? I'm short of cash at the moment."],["我們終於見面了！我等這一刻等了好久了。","可以借點錢給我嗎？我現在有點缺錢。"]],["air","єә","n. 空气, 旋律, 态度\\nvt. 晾, 使通风, 夸耀",["Without air there can be no wind or sound on the moon.","Air quality has deteriorated these past few years."],["月球表面沒有空氣，所以沒有風，也沒有聲音。","这些年空气质量恶化了。"]],["teacher","'ti:tʃә","n. 教师, 老师, 导师",["My physics teacher doesn't care if I skip classes.","At the age of six he had learned to use the typewriter and told the teacher that he did not need to learn to write by hand."],["我的物理老师不在乎我是否逃课。","他六歲的時候學會了用打字機，便和老師說他不用學執筆寫字了。"]],["force","fɒ:s","n. 力量, 武力, 势力, 影响力, 军队, 力, 效力\\nvt. 强迫, 强夺, 推动, 提高\\n[计] 人工转移; 强制",["Don't force yourself to do things that you don't like.","As long as you have someone you love from the heart, you have a motivating force and you can face the entire world."],["不要强迫自己做不喜欢的事情。","只要你有一個心愛的人,你就有了原動力,你就能面對全世界。"]],["offer","'ɒfә","n. 给予(物), 出价, 提议, 意图, 报价\\nvt. 提供, 出价, 奉献, 试图, 使出现, 演出\\nvi. 出现, 献祭, 提议…",["When real life friends desert us, books are always ready to offer friendship, sympathy and motivation.","Condoms offer protection against sexually transmitted diseases."],["生活中的朋友弃我们不顾之时，书随时给我们送来友谊、同情和鼓励。","避孕套可以預防性傳播疾病。"]],["enough","i'nʌf","n. 充足, 够, 很多\\na. 充足的, 足够\\nadv. 足够\\ninterj. 够了",["Any universe simple enough to be understood is too simple to produce a mind able to understand it.","The reason why you failed is you did not try hard enough."],["任何簡單到可以被了解的宇宙便太過簡單而無法產生可以了解它的心靈。","因為你不夠努力，所以才會失敗。"]],["education",".edju'keiʃәn","n. 教育, 训练, 教育学\\n[医] 教育, 训练",["Parents are responsible for their children's education.","One of the great superstitions about education is that learning is the result of teaching."],["父母承担教育子女的责任。","很多人覺得有教才有學，但其實這個觀念是錯的。"]],["across","ә'krɒs","prep. 越过, 穿过, 与...相交叉, 在...的对面\\nadv. 交叉, 到另一边, 在对面, 成十字",["These two lines cut across each other at right angles.","Crossing guards are posted during school hours to guide children safely across busy streets."],["这两条线成直角相交。","在学校上课期间会设置过马路警察以引导小孩安全地穿过繁忙的街道。"]],["although","ɒ:l'ðou","conj. 虽然, 尽管",["Although Hiroko dislikes cigarette smoke, she readily goes out drinking with friends.","Although he did well in the exam, his spoken Chinese is not necessarily as good as yours."],["虽然弘子不喜欢香烟的烟雾，她却乐意和朋友出去喝酒。","虽然他考得很好，他口语的汉语不见得比你的好。"]],["remember","ri'membә","vt. 记得, 回忆起, 记住, 铭记, 纪念\\nvi. 记得",["I find words with concise definitions to be the easiest to remember.","I may have seen that film before, but I can hardly remember it."],["我发现有明确定义的词最容易记住。","我以前可能看過這部電影，但是我卻不怎麼記得了。"]],["foot","fut","n. 脚, 步调, 英尺, 底部, 末尾, 步兵\\nvt. 走在...上, 给...换底, 支付\\nvi. 跳舞, 步行, 总计",["Maybe my grandchild will be the first person to set foot on Mars.","It will make little difference whether you go there by taxi or on foot."],["可能我的孙子会是登陆火星的第一人。","你乘出租車去和走路去也沒有甚麼分別。"]],["second","'sekәnd","n. 秒, 瞬间, 第二名, 支持者, 助手\\na. 第二的, 其次的, 次要的, 附加的, 辅助的\\nnum. 第二\\nvt. 当...…",["The second half of a man's life is made up of nothing but the habits he has acquired during the first half.","In Olympic competitions, a gold medal is for first place, a silver medal for second, and a bronze medal is for third place."],["人的后半生就是由他前半生养成的习惯所构成的，其他什么都没有。","在奥运会的竞赛中，金牌代表第一名，银牌代表第二名，铜牌是第三名。"]],["boy","bɒi","n. 男孩\\n[法] 男孩, 少年, 儿子",["Tom is not a lazy boy. As a matter of fact, he works hard.","The boy put on his athletic shoes and ran outside."],["汤姆其实并不懒，相反他很勤奋。","那个男孩穿上了他的运动鞋，跑向外面。"]],["maybe","'meibi:","adv. 也许, 大概\\nn. 可能性",["Maybe it's the low air pressure that means you get drunk more easily on planes.","Maybe I'll just give up soon and take a nap instead."],["也許這是低氣壓，這意味著你在飛機上更容易喝醉。","也许我会马上放弃然后去打盹。"]],["toward","tә'wɒ:d","prep. 向, 对于, 为了\\na. 即将来临的, 进行中的",["A little knowledge of Spanish will go a long way toward making your trip to Mexico enjoyable.","Everybody showed sympathy toward the prisoner."],["懂一點西班牙語的話，你去墨西哥一定會玩得更愉快。","每个人都对囚犯表示同情。"]],["able","'eibl","a. 能干的, 能够的",["Any universe simple enough to be understood is too simple to produce a mind able to understand it.","Liberty consists of being able to make everything as harmless as possible."],["任何簡單到可以被了解的宇宙便太過簡單而無法產生可以了解它的心靈。","自由旨在能够做所有不伤害其他人的事。"]],["age","eidʒ","n. 年龄, 老年, 成年, 寿命, 时代, 时期\\nv. 变老, 成熟",["At the age of six he had learned to use the typewriter and told the teacher that he did not need to learn to write by hand.","If you dress like that at your age, you'll make a fool of yourself."],["他六歲的時候學會了用打字機，便和老師說他不用學執筆寫字了。","你現在這個年紀，穿成這個樣子，會給人取笑的。"]],["policy","'pɒlisi","n. 政策, 方针, 策略, 保险单\\n[医] 凭单, 保险单",["The aim of this policy is to improve the environment in the poorest cities.","Although the government refuses to admit it, its economic policy is in ruins."],["這個政策的目的是改善最貧困城市的環境。","尽管政府拒绝承认，它的经济政策还是失败了。"]],["everything","'evriθiŋ","pron. 每件事物, 所有事物",["It would take forever for me to explain everything.","I simply haven't the time to do everything I want to do."],["要都解释的话，需要一辈子的时间。","我有很多事想做，但就是沒時間做。"]],["love","lʌv","n. 爱, 恋爱, 爱情, 爱好, 性爱\\nvt. 爱, 爱好, 爱慕\\nvi. 爱",["Math is like love: a simple idea, but it can get complicated.","Scarcely an hour goes by that I don't I think of you with love."],["数学就像爱情，一个简单的意思，但可以变得很复杂。","我幾乎沒有一個小時不滿懷愛意地想著你。"]],["process","'prɒses","n. 程序, 进行, 过程\\nvt. 加工, 使...接受处理, 对...处置, 对...起诉\\na. 经加工的, 有特殊光效的\\n[计]…",["You can skip stage three of the certification process and advance immediately to stage six.","Love is the process of breaking and mending the heart of another."],["您可以跳過認證過程的第三階段，直接進入第六階段。","爱，就是一个人把另一个人的心揉碎的过程。"]],["music","'mju:zik","n. 音乐, 乐曲",["It requires wisdom to understand wisdom: the music is nothing if the audience is deaf.","Were it not for music, the world would be a dull place."],["要用智慧来理解智慧：如果听众是聋的话，那音乐什么都不是。","如果沒有了音樂，這個世界就會變得十分沉悶。"]],["including","","prep. 包含, 包括\\n[经] 包括, 算入",["At this language centre, about 15 international languages are taught, including English.","In Germany today, anti-violence rallies took place in several cities, including one near Hamburg where three Turks were killed in an arson attack on Monday."],["在這個語言中心，教授約15種國際語言，包括英語。","今日在德国，反暴力集会着落到了德国的很多城市，包括周一在汉堡附近一场纵火袭击中3名突厥人被杀害的地方。"]],["consider","kәn'sidŋ","v. 考虑, 思考, 认为",["Many people consider a high salary to be a condition for success.","We must consider the financial aspects of this project."],["不少人以高薪为成功的条件。","我們必須從財政方面考慮一下這個計劃。"]],["appear","ә'piә","vi. 出现, 显得, 来到\\n[法] 出庭, 到案, 出现",["The politician didn't appear in public after the incident.","I often wonder if he'll suddenly appear at that coffee shop on the corner."],["發生了那件事以後，那位政治家一直沒有公開露面。","我常常想他会不会突然地出现在街角的咖啡店呢？"]],["actually","'æktʃuәli","adv. 事实上, 竟然, 如今, 现在",["Even if your sentences were actually senseless, you at least have the luck to be able to form beautiful sentences.","After the assistant returned $1 to each one, each man had actually paid only $9."],["即使你的句子实际上是毫无意义的，至少你有幸能造出好句子。","然后助手还给每人1美金，每个人实际上只付了9美金。"]],["buy","bai","vt. 买, 获得\\nvi. 买\\nn. 购买, 买得的东西",["It's a pity that you can't buy miracles like you would buy potatoes.","What a waste to buy such an expensive machine even though he doesn't even know how to use computers."],["可惜我们不能像买土豆一样买奇迹。","買這麼貴的機器真是浪費, 而他甚至不知道怎麼用電腦。"]],["probably","'prɒbәbli","adv. 大概, 或许",["Whether Shakespeare wrote this poem or not will probably remain a mystery.","When the cow flies high and the ox flies low, there probably is a twister."],["這首詩是不是莎士比亞寫的，恐怕是無從考究的了。","當母牛飛得高, 公牛飛得低, 就有可能是一個龍捲風。"]],["human","'hju:mәn","n. 人, 人类\\na. 人类的, 似人类的, 人性的, 有同情心的",["Seen at a distance, the rock looks like a human face.","Pigs share certain characteristics with human beings."],["从远处看，岩石像一张人的脸。","豬與人類的一些特性相同。"]],["wait","weit","n. 等待, 等候\\nvt. 等候, 期待, 延缓, 伺候, 推迟\\nvi. 等, 等候, 耽搁, 伺候用餐\\n[计] 等待",["If you think education is expensive, wait till you see what ignorance costs you.","I think we had better wait another thirty minutes."],["如果你認為教育是昂貴的, 那麼你等著看無知讓你付出的代價。","我想我們還是再多等三十分鐘吧。"]],["serve","sә:v","vt. 可作...用, 服务, 经历, 招待, 供应, 送交, 对待\\nvi. 服务, 服役, 侍应, 适合, 有用, 开球\\nn. 发球…",["It's better to chill white wine before you serve it.","Brahe had a brother who grew up to serve in the government. He also had a sister that became a scientist."],["在你侍酒前最好先將白葡萄酒冷卻一下。","布拉赫有一個兄弟，長大後在政府任職。他還有一個姊妹，後來成為了科學家。"]],["market","'mɑ:kit","n. 市场, 交易, 集市, 推销地区, 行情, 市面, 销路\\nvt. 在市场上交易, 使上市, 销售\\nvi. 在市场上买卖",["Our sister bought some eggplants, potatoes, zucchinis and Chinese cabbage at the market.","Tom thought he had a chance to make a lot of money on the stock market."],["姐姐在市场买了一点茄子、土豆、西葫芦和大白菜。","汤姆觉得他有机会在股市赚一大笔钱。"]],["die","dai","vi. 死亡, 消逝, 平息, 熄灭, 漠然, 渴望\\nvt. 死\\nn. 骰子, 冲模",["\"The good die young\" is an old saying which may or may not be true.","Tom told me he thought he was going to die in prison."],["“好人不长命”是句或真或假的老话。","汤姆告诉我他以为他会死在监狱里。"]],["send","send","vt. 发送, 使进入, 寄, 派遣, 发射, 使陷于\\nvi. 寄信, 派人, 播送\\nn. (船的)上升运动\\n[计] 发送",["Please send me a reply as soon as you receive this mail.","If I could send you a marshmallow, Trang, I would."],["收到此邮件后请尽快给我答复。","Trang，如果我能寄给你一个棉花糖，我会这么做的。"]],["expect","iks'pekt","vt. 预期, 盼望, 期待",["We did not expect him to finish the task in so short a time.","Thank you for all your contributions. We expect to see you again soon."],["我们没指望过他在那么短的时间里完成工作。","谢谢您的贡献。预计我们很快会再见面。"]],["sense","sens","n. 感应, 感觉, 感官, 意识, 观念, 情理, 知觉, 理智\\nvt. 感觉, 觉察, 检测\\n[计] 阅读; 检测",["Blind people sometimes develop a compensatory ability to sense the proximity of objects around them.","She gets lost really easily. She's got no sense of direction."],["某些失明者会产生一个弥补性的能力，这个能力让他们察觉到他们与离他们很近的物体的距离。","她完全沒有方向感，很容易便會迷路。"]],["build","bild","v. 建立, 建筑\\nn. 构造, 体格",["The state will build specially made bridges so that koalas and other wildlife can cross roads while avoiding cars and trucks.","Plans are being drawn up to build a power station here."],["该州将修建特制的桥梁以便考拉和其他野生动物可以在避开汽车和卡车的情况下过马路。","这里正在筹划建设一座发电站。"]],["stay","stei","n. 停留, 逗留, 制止, 延缓, 停止, 支柱, 支撑物, 支索\\nvt. 制止, 延缓, 坚持, 支持, 支撑, 用支索固定\\nvi…",["I would rather stay at home than go out in this hot weather.","The coffee enabled me to stay awake during the dull concert."],["在这种暑天里我宁愿呆在家也不出去。","咖啡讓我在沉悶的音樂會中保持清醒。"]],["fall","fɒ:l","n. 落下, 瀑布, 采伐量, 下降, 落差, 降低, 堕落, 秋天\\nvi. 倒下, 落下, 来临, 失守, 阵亡, 下跌, 减弱, 倾…",["Despite Trang's constant affirmations of love, Spenser is still afraid someday she will fall out of love with him.","In the winter, many older people slip on ice and fall down."],["儘管莊不斷發誓她不變的愛情，斯賓塞仍然害怕有一天她會不愛他了。","冬天有很多老人在冰上滑倒。"]],["oh","әu","interj. (表示惊讶、恐怖、赞叹)哦",["\"Novels? I hate novels.\" Oh muse, forgive her blasphemy.","Oh, I just remembered, do not forget to bring your ID."],["「小说啊？我就讨厌看小说。」缪斯，请原谅她的亵渎行为。","哦，我才想起来，身份证不要忘了带。"]],["nation","'neiʃәn","n. 国家, 民族\\n[法] 民族, 国家",["If you are to know a nation, you must learn its history.","In order to alleviate employment pressures, the nation has established a series of relevant policies."],["如果想了解一个国家，就必须学习这个国家的历史。","为了缓解就业压力，国家已经制定了一系列相关政策。"]],["plan","plæn","n. 计划, 方案, 策略, 方法, 进度表, 程序表, 平面图, 设计图, 轮廓, 示意图\\nvt. 计划, 设计, 意欲\\nvi. 订…",["The plan was given up under the pressure of public opinion.","Having failed many times, he never gave up the plan."],["計劃受到輿論的壓力而被取消了。","雖然失敗了很多次，但是他仍從不放棄。"]],["cut","kʌt","n. 切口, 割伤, 降低, 切, 割, 砍, 削, 伤口, 削减, 缩短, 删节, 通路\\na. 经切割的, 缩减的\\nvt. 切, 割…",["At last, John and Sue decided to cut the apple into halves.","If you want to become thin, you should cut back on the between-meal snacks."],["約翰和蘇最後決定把蘋果切成兩半。","如果你想變瘦，就應該少點在正餐以外吃零食。"]],["college","'kɒlidʒ","n. 学院, 大学, 学会",["Now that you're a college student, you should study harder.","It was five years ago that I graduated from college."],["你現在是大學生了，應該努力點讀書。","我大学毕业是五年前的事。"]],["interest","'intrist","n. 兴趣, 嗜好, 利息, 利益, 爱好, 趣味, 势力\\nvt. 使感兴趣, 与...有关系",["The article on Buddhism revived my interest in oriental religions.","Just because a certain book does not interest readers does not mean that the fault lies in the book."],["那篇關於佛教的文章再次勾起了我對東方宗教的興趣。","不是因为读者对某本书不感兴趣，这本书就肯定是有问题的了。"]],["death","deθ","n. 死亡\\n[医] 死亡",["City dwellers have a higher death rate than country people do.","He was so healthy up to the minute of his sudden death. You really never know what might happen next."],["城市居民的死亡率高于农村里的人。","他一直好好的，卻突然死去了。未來的事情，實在是無法預知的。"]],["course","kɒ:s","n. 课程, 路线, 过程, 一道菜, 道路\\nv. 追, (使)跑",["It would of course be cheaper for you to sleep at our place.","Every morning I make it a rule to watch the English course on TV."],["你在我们家睡觉当然能让你少花点钱。","每天早上我養成看電視英語課程的習慣。"]],["someone","'sʌmwʌn","pron. 有人, 某人",["It is difficult to keep up a conversation with someone who only says \"yes\" and \"no\".","I heard someone in the crowd outside the station call my name."],["跟一个只说“是”和“不是”的人很难继续谈话。","我聽到車站外的人群中有人在叫我的名字。"]],["experience","ik'spiәriәns","n. 经历, 经验, 体验\\nvt. 经历, 经验, 体验",["On the one hand we suffered a heavy loss, but on the other hand we learned a great deal from the experience.","His intelligence and experience enabled him to deal with the trouble."],["一方面我们虽然蒙受了损失，但另一方面我们从这次经验中学到了很多。","他的智慧和經驗使他能處理這個麻煩。"]],["behind","bi'haind","adv. 在后地\\nprep. 在...背后",["We must not speak ill of others behind their backs.","I can't find my glasses. I may have left them behind on the train."],["我們不應該在背後說別人的壞話。","我的眼鏡不見了。我大概是把它留在電車上了。"]],["reach","ri:tʃ","n. 伸出, 延伸, 区域, 范围, 流域, 岬\\nvt. 到达, 达到, 伸出, 延伸, 影响\\nvi. 达到, 延伸, 伸出手, 传到",["I tried to reach you on the phone, but I was unable to get through.","We calculated that we could reach the place within two weeks."],["我打了電話給你，但卻接不通。","我们估计能在两周内到那个地方。"]],["local","'lәukәl","a. 地方性的, 当地的, 局部的, 乡土的, 本地的\\nn. 当地居民, 本地新闻, 局部\\n[计] 本地的; 局部",["Many local traditions have fallen into decay in recent years.","When you go abroad, it is useful to learn at least some polite phrases in the local language."],["近几年，很多当地的传统都衰败了。","你出国的时候学一些当地的礼貌用语还是很有用的。"]],["six","siks","num. 六, 六个",["At the age of six he had learned to use the typewriter and told the teacher that he did not need to learn to write by hand.","After a six month period, his leg was healed and is normal again."],["他六歲的時候學會了用打字機，便和老師說他不用學執筆寫字了。","過了六個月，他的腿便治好，回復正常了。"]],["kill","kil","n. 杀, 杀戮, 小河\\nvt. 杀, 破坏, 消灭, 使终止, 抵消, 否决\\nvi. 杀死\\n[计] 删除",["After all, this is a guy that tried to kill my dad at one time.","Monkeys kill people too, but only if they have guns."],["毕竟，这家伙有一次想杀我爸。","猴子也會殺人 ﹣ 如果牠們有槍的話。"]],["remain","ri'mein","vi. 保持, 逗留, 剩余\\n[法] 停留, 居住, 继续",["The man on whom you see the Spirit come down and remain is he who will baptize with the Holy Spirit.","Wood may remain ten years in the water, but it will never become a crocodile."],["你如果看見聖靈降下，落在誰身上，誰就是用聖靈替人施洗的了。","木头或许能在水里呆上十年，但它终究不可能变成一条鳄鱼。"]],["effect","i'fekt","n. 结果, 影响, 效果, 印象\\nvt. 实行, 引起, 完成\\n[计] 效果",["Making this matter public would have an effect on our sales, so we're going to overlook it this once.","Don't worry! Even if I drink, it doesn't have an effect on my driving."],["公开此事会影响我们的销售，所以我们将忽略它一次。","別擔心! 即使我喝酒了, 它對我的駕駛沒有影響。"]],["yeah","jɑ:","adv. (非正式)是, 是的",["Tatoeba: Ever heard of sentence fights? Yeah, that's what we do for fun.","\"Can you move over a bit?\" \"Yeah, sorry, I didn't realize I took up that much space.\""],["Tatoeba:聽過句子打架嗎？是啊，那是我們為好玩做的。","“你能动一下吗？”“哦，对不起，我不知道自己占了那么多空间。”"]],["suggest","sәg'dʒest","vt. 提议, 建议, 促成, 暗示, 启发, 使人想起\\n[法] 建议, 提出, 提议",["I suggest that, out of politeness, we drink as little as possible.","I suggest we drink as little as possible to be polite."],["我建议，为了礼貌起见，我们尽可能少喝。","我建议，为了礼貌起见，我们尽可能少喝。"]],["class","klɑ:s","n. 班级, 阶级, 种类, 课\\nvt. 分类\\n[计] 类别; 类; 种类; 类程",["No other boy in our class is more studious than Jack.","Bob is the only student that can speak Spanish in our class."],["我们班级里没有比杰克更勤奋的男孩了。","鮑勃是我們班上唯一會講西班牙語的學生。"]],["control","kәn'trәul","n. 控制, 管理, 克制, 控制器, 操纵装置\\nvt. 控制, 操纵, 抑制\\n[计] 控制; 控制器",["To control a class calls for all your skills as a teacher.","The doctors did all they could to control Tom's disease but, sadly, to no avail."],["控制一个班级需要你做老师的所有技能。","医生们尽力控制汤姆的病情了但可惜无法奏效。"]],["raise","reiz","n. 上升, 高地, 增高\\nvt. 升起, 举起, 唤起, 提高, 使出现, 使复活, 提出, 筹集, 饲养",["The only useful answers are those that raise new questions.","I'll see to it that you have a raise after the first year."],["只有能提出新问题的回答才是有用的回答。","我将确保你们在第一年后有一个增长。"]],["care","kєә","n. 小心, 照料, 忧虑\\nvi. 关心, 介意\\nvt. 在意, 喜欢",["Of course you'll catch a cold if you fall asleep under the kotatsu. You have to learn to take care of yourself.","My physics teacher doesn't care if I skip classes."],["如果你睡在kotatsu下当然会感冒。你要学会照顾好自己。","我的物理老师不在乎我是否逃课。"]],["perhaps","pә'hæps","adv. 也许, 大概",["Perhaps he would not celebrate Chinese New Year again.","A growing child who doesn't seem to have much energy perhaps needs medical attention."],["他或许不会再庆祝春节了。","一个成长中的孩子如果没有充足的能量，可能需要药物治疗。"]],["late","leit","a. 迟的, 晚的, 已故的\\nadv. 很晚, 很迟, 晚",["Due to bad weather, the plane arrived three hours late.","Bob forgot to bring the pass, which made him late for school."],["由于天气不好，飞机迟到了3小时。","鲍勃忘记带通行证，这使得他上学迟到了。"]],["hard","hɑ:d","a. 坚硬的, 硬的, 难的, 艰苦的, 困难的, 坚固的, 猛烈的, 艰难的, 结实的, 确实的\\nadv. 坚硬地, 努力地, 辛苦地…",["It's hard to tell Englishmen from Americans just by the way they look.","You have to study hard to catch up with your class."],["只凭长相的话很难区分英国人和美国人。","你必須用功讀書趕上同學。"]],["field","fi:ld","n. 领域, 田地, 场地, 战场, 场, 域\\nvt. 使...晒在场上, 使上场\\na. 田间的, 野生的, 野外的, 田赛的\\n[计…",["She has a lot of experience in this field of work.","He did pioneering work in the field of physical geography."],["她对这项工作有着多年的工作经验。","他在自然地理科學界取得了突破性的成果。"]],["else","els","a. 别的, 其他的\\nadv. 另外, 否则, 不然",["I can only wonder if this is the same for everyone else.","Tom is better at science than anyone else in his class."],["我只能问自己这对其他所有人是不是一回事呢。","汤姆的科学成绩比班上的任何一个人都要好。"]],["pass","pæs","n. 经过, 要隘, 途径, 通行, 护照, 及格\\nvt. 经过, 越过, 通过, 批准, 度过, 传递, 忽略\\nvi. 经过, 变化…",["The friend who I thought would pass the exam failed it.","He managed to pass his driving test even though he was a poor driver."],["那个我认为会通过考试的朋友失败了。","他的駕駛技術很差，但也勉強通過了駕駛考試。"]],["former","'fɒ:mә","a. 从前的, 前者的\\nn. 起形成作用的人(或物), 模型, 样板",["I prefer Noh to Kabuki because I find the former to be more elegant than the latter.","Everyone is anxious to know what has become of the former champion."],["比起歌舞伎，我更喜欢能乐表演，因为我觉得后者比前者优雅。","大家都渴望知道前冠军得主发生了什么。"]],["sell","sel","vt. 卖, 背叛, 销售, 出卖\\nvi. 卖, 销售\\nn. 卖, 推销术, 失望",["He is badly off, because his book doesn't sell well.","I will never sell my friend down the river for anything in the world."],["他的書銷路不好，所以現在手頭十分拮据。","無論發生甚麼事，我也絕對不會出賣我的朋友。"]],["major","'meidʒә","n. 主修课, 成年人, 陆军少校\\na. 主要的, 较多的, 大部分的, 成年的, 严重的\\nvi. 主修\\n[计] 主要, 主要刻度",["Tax cuts are often used as a major fiscal tool to stimulate the economy.","We are informed by newspapers of the major events that take place every day."],["减税常被用作刺激经济的主要财政手段。","我们从报纸中获知每天发生的重大事件。"]],["sometimes","'sʌmtaimz","adv. 有时, 时常, 往往",["Sometimes being overcautious in planning could upset the apple cart.","Blind people sometimes develop a compensatory ability to sense the proximity of objects around them."],["計劃時如果過於謹慎的話，可能會反把計劃搞亂。","某些失明者会产生一个弥补性的能力，这个能力让他们察觉到他们与离他们很近的物体的距离。"]],["require","ri'kwaiә","vt. 需要, 命令, 要求\\n[法] 需要, 要求, 命令",["The art of modern warfare does not necessarily require soldiers to be armed to the teeth to be effective as combatants.","An aging population will require more spending on health care."],["現代戰術並無指明士兵必須全副武裝上陣才能發揮其最大的戰鬥力。","老龄化的人口需要更多医疗保健支出。"]],["along","ә'lɒŋ","adv. 平行地, 向前\\nprep. 沿着",["I was walking along the crowded street when all at once I heard a shrill cry.","In our society we find men of integrity along with crooks."],["我在人來人往的街道上走著，突然聽見一下尖銳的叫聲。","我們的社會良莠不齊。"]],["development","di'velәpmәnt","n. 发展\\n[化] 展开",["The development of the computer industry has been very rapid.","Since all tasks have been completed without delay, we are ready to start the next phase of development."],["電腦產業的發展一日千里。","既然所有的任务都按时完成了，我们已经准备好开始下一阶段的开发了。"]],["themselves","ðәm'selvz","pron. 他们自己, 她们自己, 它们自己",["I don't like it when mathematicians who know much more than I do can't express themselves explicitly.","The Japanese at large consider themselves better off than they used to be."],["我不喜欢那些数学家知道的比我多得多，却不知道清楚地表达自己。","日本人一般都覺得自己的生活比以前過得好。"]],["report","ri'pɒ:t","n. 报告, 报道, 传说, 案情报告, 爆炸声, 成绩单\\nvt. 报告, 汇报, 转述, 报道, 揭发, 使报到\\nvi. 报告, 写…",["I prefer to look for a solution to problems, not only to report them.","Concerning this issue, I feel that the trash media only report biased information."],["我更喜欢寻求问题的解决方法，而不仅仅是揭露它们。","关于这个问题，我觉得垃圾媒体只报道了很片面的信息。"]],["role","rәul","n. 角色, 职责, 任务\\n[医] 作用, 功用",["Computers are certainly playing an important role in our life, whether we like it or not.","He will play the leading role for the first time in the next school festival."],["无论我们是否喜欢电脑，它在我们的生活中始终起着重要的作用。","这次校庆时，他将第一次做主角。"]],["better","'betә","a. 较好的\\nadv. 比较好",["You should have known better than to take an examination without preparing for it.","Better to be hated for who you are than loved for who you're not."],["你應該知道要為考試作準備。","宁愿做自己而被人讨厌，也不要因为虚假而被人喜欢。"]],["economic",".i:kә'nɒmik","a. 经济上的, 实用的, 节省的\\n[经] 经济的",["More money for education will spur economic growth.","Although the government refuses to admit it, its economic policy is in ruins."],["更多投資在教育的錢將會刺激經濟成長。","尽管政府拒绝承认，它的经济政策还是失败了。"]],["effort","'efәt","n. 努力, 成就",["No matter how much you hurry your effort is just a drop in the bucket.","Because people in the world don't speak the same language, much effort is now devoted to translation."],["就算你多焦急，也不能幫上甚麼忙。","因為世界上的人不是講同一種語言, 所以現在很多人努力致力於翻譯。"]],["decide","di'said","v. 决定, 判决",["It is up to you to decide whether we will go there or not.","Tom can't decide whether to buy a Toyota or a Ford."],["我们去不去那儿由你来决定。","汤姆不能决定买丰田还是福特。"]],["rate","reit","n. 比率, 率, 速度, 价格, 费用, 等级\\nvt. 估价, 认为, 鉴定等级, 责骂\\nvi. 被评价, 责骂",["At this rate, we're not likely to be done before the end of the week.","The train is traveling at the rate of 50 miles an hour."],["按照这个速度，我们不会在这周结束前完成。","火车以每小时50英里的速度前行。"]],["strong","strɒŋ","a. 强壮的, 坚固的, 坚强的, 强烈的, 有力的, 优良的\\nadv. 强劲地, 有力地, 猛烈地",["We've been matched up with some strong teams this year.","He has a strong influence over the business world."],["我們今年和不少強隊交過手。","他在商界有很大的影響力。"]],["possible","'pɒsәbl","a. 可能的, 潜在的, 合适的\\nn. 可能性, 可能的事物",["Liberty consists of being able to make everything as harmless as possible.","It's possible to branch out from computing to jobs in banking, accountancy and so on."],["自由旨在能够做所有不伤害其他人的事。","有可能將電腦工作擴展到銀行業務, 會計業務等等。"]],["heart","hɑ:t","n. 心, 心脏, 中心, 内心, 感情, 精神, 心情, 宝贝儿\\nvt. 鼓励",["The number of people suffering from heart disease has increased.","Mary looks unfriendly, but she is really very kind at heart."],["遭受心脏病困扰的人数增加了。","瑪麗雖然看起來好像不是很友好，其實她有顆很善良的心。"]],["drug","drʌg","n. 药, 麻药, 麻醉药\\nvi. 吸毒\\nvt. 使服麻醉药, 使麻木",["Optimism is like the lamp of hope. Pessimism [or negativity] is like a drug of sorrow.","In the USA, there have never been as many drug addicts as there are today."],["樂觀如明燈,照亮希望的前程. 消極如毒品,腐蝕健康的心靈.","在美國，吸毒成癮者的數量從未像今天這樣多。"]],["leader","'li:dә","n. 领导者, 社论, 指挥, 领袖, 领唱者, 前导字符\\n[计] 前导字符",["Even people who don't believe in the Catholic church venerate the Pope as a symbolic leader.","Japan is a leader in the world's high-tech industry."],["甚至是不相信天主教的人也把教皇敬为一个象征性的领导者。","日本是世界高科技产业的领头人。"]],["light","lait","n. 光, 光亮, 灯, 日光, 发光体, 光源, 杰出人物, 火花, 眼光\\na. 轻的, 少量的, 轻微的, 轻快的, 轻浮的, 明亮…",["It's just five in the morning, but nevertheless it is light out.","We felt relieved when we saw a light in the distance."],["才早晨5点，但天已经亮了。","我們看見遠處傳來了一點光，不禁都鬆了一口氣。"]],["voice","vɒis","n. 声音, 嗓音, 嗓子, 愿望, 发言权, 表达, 喉舌, 语态\\nvt. 表达, 吐露, 调音",["The sound of your voice is like a siren's song to me.","Tom always speaks in such a low voice that I can barely understand what he says."],["你的嗓音对我来说就像是美人鱼的歌。","汤姆总是说话声音太小，我几乎听不懂他在说什么。"]],["wife","waif","n. 妻子, 太太, 夫人\\n[法] 妻子, 已婚妇女",["No, I think he just does those things because he wants to please his wife.","I can't understand why James always finds fault with his wife."],["才不呢，我想他那樣做只不過是想哄老婆高興。","我不懂得詹姆斯为什么一直给他的妻子吹毛求疵。"]],["whole","hәul","n. 全部, 全体, 整体, 完全之体系\\na. 所有的, 完整的, 完全的, 纯粹的",["Finally she gave in to temptation and ate the whole cake.","The whole place was simply blotted out with the snow."],["她終於受不了誘惑，吃掉了整件蛋糕。","整個地方完全地被雪遮蓋住了。"]],["police","pә'li:s","n. 警察, 警察当局, 治安\\nvt. 维持治安, 管辖",["One day, the police raided a whole group of prostitutes, and the girl was among them.","Ray was willing to corroborate Gary's story, but the police were still unconvinced that either of them were telling the truth."],["有一天，警方突擊搜捕了一個娼妓集團，而她正是被捕的人的其中一個。","Ray乐于证实Gary的故事，但警察仍然不相信他们其中一个说的是事实。"]],["mind","maind","n. 思想, 愿望, 智力, 记忆, 心理, 情绪, 理智, 主意, 心意\\nvi. 介意, 注意, 留心\\nvt. 注意, 留意, 专心…",["Just as food feeds the body, so reading feeds the mind.","Any universe simple enough to be understood is too simple to produce a mind able to understand it."],["就像食物餵養身體，所以閱讀餵養心靈。","任何簡單到可以被了解的宇宙便太過簡單而無法產生可以了解它的心靈。"]],["finally","'fainәli","adv. 最后, 终于",["With the heirless king going crazy and royal family poisoned, the general of the army finally had his chance to usurp the throne.","The soldiers fought valiantly, but finally they had to give in."],["随着无继承人的国王的发疯和王室家族的中毒，将军终于有机会篡夺王位。","士兵作戰時毫無畏縮，但到了最後還是不得不投降。"]],["pull","pul","vt. 拉, 拖, 拔, 牵, 撕开, 吸引\\nvi. 拉, 拖, 拔, 有吸引力\\nn. 拉, 拖, 拔, 拉力, 牵引力, 划船, 吸引",["A whistle blew, and the boat slowly began to pull out of port.","Just pull the door shut. It'll lock by itself."],["汽笛声响起，船开始慢慢地驶离港口。","只要推门就好了。它自己会锁上的。"]],["return","ri'tә:n","n. 回来, 返回, 来回票, 归还, 报答, 利润率, 报告书\\na. 返回的, 回程的, 报答的, 反向的, 重现的, 复原的\\nvi…",["I'll lend you the book, provided you return it next week.","A few months later they return to their breeding grounds in the Arctic."],["如果你可以在下個星期還給我的話，這本書就借給你吧。","數月後，牠們回到了北極的繁殖地。"]],["free","fri:","a. 自由的, 享受政治权力的, 允许的, 免费的, 丰富的\\nvt. 释放, 解放, 使自由\\nadv. 自由地, 免费",["A democrat is a free citizen who yields to the will of the majority.","I always enjoy listening to classical music when I have some free time."],["民主主义者是屈服于大部分人的自由公民。","有空的时候，我总喜欢听古典音乐。"]],["military","'militәri","n. 军队\\na. 军事的, 军人的, 适于战争的",["The Japanese military forces seemed too strong to stop.","Operation Yoav was a military operation carried out by Israel in its war for independence."],["日本军队看来强大得不可阻挡。","约阿夫行动是以色列独立战争中的一次作战行动。"]],["price","prais","n. 价格, 代价, 价值\\nvt. 定...的价格",["The house looked good; moreover, the price was right.","It is said that the price of wine may go up at any time now."],["屋子物美价廉。","据说葡萄酒的价格可以随时增长。"]],["less","les","n. 较少, 较小\\na. 少的, 小的\\nadv. 较少, 较小, 较差\\n[计] 最低成本估算与调度法",["The lecture was very long, but I enjoyed it none the less.","This car is running less smoothly than it used to."],["那場演講很長，但我卻聽得津津有味。","這輛車沒有以前跑得那麼順暢了。"]],["according","ә'kɒ:diŋ","a. 相符的, 根据...而定的\\nadv. 相应地",["It is a prevalent belief, according to a nationwide poll in the United States, that Muslims are linked with terrorism.","According to my experience, it takes one year to master French grammar."],["根据美国国民的一个投票，人们普遍认为穆斯林人和恐怖主义有关。","根據我的經驗，掌握法語語法需要一年的時間。"]],["decision","di'siʒәn","n. 决定, 决心, 决断\\n[计] 判定",["They needed to make a decision - an immediate decision.","Although the decision to implement this plan has already been made, the finer points still need to be planned out."],["他们需要做决定——即刻作出决定。","这个计划虽然已经决定实施了，但是具体细节还需要从长计议。"]],["explain","ik'splein","v. 解释, 说明",["It would take forever for me to explain everything.","It would take me too much time to explain to you why it's not going to work."],["要都解释的话，需要一辈子的时间。","给你解释这为什么行不通要花很多时间。"]],["son","sʌn","n. 儿子, 女婿, 子孙\\n[法] 儿子, 女婿, 养子",["She was very pleased when her son returned home safe and sound.","Your son took part in the student movement, I hear."],["儿子平安无事回家时,她高兴极了.","聽說你兒子參與了學生運動。"]],["hope","hәup","n. 希望, 信心, 期待\\nv. 希望, 期望, 信赖",["I hope he'll be able to come! I'd like to see him.","We're going to eat a lot tonight so I hope you're not on a diet."],["我希望他能來！我想見他。","我们今晚会吃很多，所以我希望你没有在节食。"]],["develop","di'velәp","vt. 发展, 使发达, 进步, 洗印, 显影\\nvi. 发展, 生长",["Blind people sometimes develop a compensatory ability to sense the proximity of objects around them.","A man can no more become a woman than a monkey can develop into a man."],["某些失明者会产生一个弥补性的能力，这个能力让他们察觉到他们与离他们很近的物体的距离。","男人不能变成女人，就像猴子不能进化成人类一样。"]],["view","vju:","n. 视野, 风景, 见解, 视力, 观看, 视图, 指望, 意图, 印象\\nvt. 看, 考虑, 视察, 查看, 估量\\n[计] 视图",["As we went around the corner, the lake came into view.","My view was different from his as to what should be done."],["当我们走到转角处，湖就映入了眼帘。","至於应该做什么，我和他的见解不同。"]],["relationship","ri'leiʃәnʃip","n. 关系, 关联\\n[医] 关系",["There is close relationship between supply and demand.","When they were in Leicester, it was obvious that they had a very warm relationship."],["供應和需求之間的關係十分密切。","在莱斯特的时候很明显她们有很热烈的关系。"]],["carry","'kæri","n. 进位, 射程, 运载\\nvt. 携带, 运送, 支持, 传送, 包含\\nvi. 被携带, 能达到\\n[计] 进位; 进位数",["Bob, help me carry his suitcase to the living room.","Whatever results may follow, I will carry out my plan."],["Bob，帮我把他的行李搬到客厅。","無論結果會是怎樣，我也不會改變我的計劃。"]],["town","taun","n. 城镇, 市, 镇\\n[法] 城镇, 城市, 闹市",["The town developed into the center of the economy.","There on the top of a high mountain they built a small town of their own and lived in peace."],["這座城鎮發展成為了一個經濟中心。","他们在高山顶上建了自己的小城镇在那里过着宁静的生活。"]],["road","rәud","n. 路, 道路, 公路, 途径, 方法\\n[法] 公路, 道路, 行车道",["A small road ran across the bridge, through the fields, and over a hill.","If we don't hit the road soon, we'll get caught in the morning rush hour traffic."],["一条小路跨过桥梁，穿过田野，还爬上小丘。","快要到早上的繁忙時段了，我們還不出發就要堵車了。"]],["drive","draiv","n. 驾车, 快车道, 推进力, 驱动, 动力, 击球, 驱动器\\nvt. 开车, 驱使, 推动, 驾驶\\nvi. 开车, 猛击, 飞跑\\…",["You must have a driver's license before you can drive a car.","They are trying to drive Japanese goods out of the market."],["沒有駕駛執照不能開車。","他们试图把日本产品赶出市场。"]],["arm","ɑ:m","n. 手臂, 袖子, 狭长港湾, 武器\\nvt. 武装, 装备\\nvi. 武装起来\\n[计] 异步应答方式; 自动货品销路管理",["Whenever he moved, the wound sent pains all along his arm.","Tom hooked his arm under John's shoulder and flipped him over."],["他只要一动, 伤口就连带整个胳膊都疼。","湯姆把手臂勾進約翰的腋下，把他翻了過去。"]],["true","tru:","a. 真实的, 正确的, 忠诚的, 可靠的, 纯粹的, 正式的\\nn. 真实, 准确\\nadv. 真实地, 准确地",["It is true that she is pretty, but she is selfish.","It is true Wendy grew up at the seaside, but she isn't a good swimmer."],["她确实很漂亮，但她很自私。","溫迪的確是在海邊長大的，但是她卻不太會游泳。"]],["federal","'fedәrәl","a. 联邦的, 联合的, 同盟的\\n[法] 联邦的, 联邦制的, 联盟的",["Federal, state, and community officials immediately pledged to rebuild it.","The state court effected unconstitutional legislation without the federal government noticing."],["聯邦、州及地方官員立即承諾將其重建。",""]],["break","breik","n. 休息, 中断, 破裂处, 绝交, 破晓, 突变\\nvt. 打破, 弄破, 弄坏, 破坏, 违反, 打断, 削弱, 放弃\\nvi. 破…",["I slept a little during lunch break because I was so tired.","Sometimes hockey players get so competitive that fights break out."],["我在午休时间睡了一会儿，因为我太累了。","有时候冰球运动员相互挑衅得太厉害以至于会引发斗殴。"]],["difference","'difәrәns","n. 不同, 差异\\n[计] 差分",["In theory, there is no difference between theory and practice. But, in practice, there is.","It will make little difference whether you go there by taxi or on foot."],["理论上说，理论和实践没有区别。但实践上说，是有的。","你乘出租車去和走路去也沒有甚麼分別。"]],["receive","ri'si:v","vt. 收到, 接到, 得到, 接待, 迎接, 承受\\nvi. 收到, 会客\\n[计] 接收",["He came to that which was his own, but his own did not receive him.","If there is already an account, there is a system by which you are able to send and receive email."],["祂到自己的地方來，自己的人卻不接受祂。","如果有帐户，你就能通过一个系统发送和接收邮件了。"]],["thank","θæŋk","n. 谢意, 感谢\\nvt. 谢谢, 感谢",["I suggest that you should write him a thank-you letter.","Thank you very much for the wonderful dinner last night."],["我覺得你應該給他寫一封感謝信。","非常感謝您昨晚美妙的晚餐。"]],["value","'vælju:","n. 价值, 价格, 购买力, 评价, 估价, 计算结果\\nvt. 评价, 估价, 重视\\n[计] 计算结果",["The value of the painting was estimated at several million dollars.","The value of the dollar declines as the rate of inflation rises."],["这幅画被估价数百万元。","随着通货膨胀的发展美元贬值了。"]],["international",".intә'næʃәnәl","a. 国际的\\nn. 国别设定\\n[计] 国别设定",["A population policy should be considered on the international viewpoint so as to balance the interests of both sides.","His victory at this age in an international competition is a good indication of a bright future."],["從國際的觀點看，應該考慮推行人口政策來平衡兩方的利益。","他現在這個年紀，就已經在國際比賽中取勝，前途實在無可限量。"]],["building","'bildiŋ","n. 建筑物, 建筑\\n[法] 营造, 建筑, 建筑物",["They shone like stars in the dark, dirty building.","It is necessary to obtain the sanction of the authorities to enter this building."],["在又黑又髒的大廈裏，它們就像星星一樣地閃耀著。","必須獲得有關當局的批准才能進入這座建築物。"]],["action","'ækʃәn","n. 行动, 活动, 动作, 作用, 战斗, 行为, 诉讼\\nvt. 对...起诉\\n[计] 方式",["A man who asks his wife's permission before taking any action except breathing is a henpecked husband.","Lawyers will urge the parents to take further legal action."],["一個除了呼吸之外做任何事之前都要經過老婆同意的男人是一個怕老婆的男人。","律师们会力劝家长们采取进一步的法律行动。"]],["full","ful","n. 全部, 完整\\na. 充满的, 完全的, 丰富的, 完美的, 丰满的, 详尽的\\nadv. 完全地, 整整, 十分\\nvt. 把(衣…",["Black people had to sit in the back of the bus, or stand if the back was full.","Almost no students get full marks in Chinese classics."],["黑人不得不坐在公交车的后面，如果后面的座位满了则只能站在那里。","很少有学生能在古汉语考试上拿满分。"]],["model","'mɒdәl","n. 模型, 模范, 模特儿\\na. 模范的, 作模型用的\\nvi. 做模型, 做模特儿\\nvt. 使模仿, 塑造\\n[计] 模型",["Comrades! Let's transform Moscow into a model communist city.","Mike has been making a model plane since breakfast."],["同志们，让我们转换莫斯科为理想的共产主义城市。","迈克吃完早饭以后一直在做一个模型飞机。"]],["join","dʒɒin","vi. 参加, 结合, 加入\\nvt. 连接, 结合, 参加, 加入\\nn. 连接, 结合, 接合点\\n[计] 连接; 汇合指令",["Russia has no right to decide whether Ukraine should join NATO.","Several classic, family-friendly games will also join the service next month."],["俄羅斯無權決定烏克蘭是否加入北約。","多款經典家庭遊戲也將於下個月同步上架。"]],["season","'si:zn","n. 季节, 时节, 当令期, 时期\\nvt. 给...调味, 使成熟, 使老练, 缓和\\nvi. 变干燥",["According to the weather report, the rainy season will start next week.","During mating season many animals exude strong fragrances."],["根据天气预报，雨季下周会开始。","很多動物會在交配季節釋放出很強的氣味。"]],["society","sә'saiәti","n. 社会；社交界；交往；社团",["America likes to claim that it is a \"classless\" society.","But I dare to say that it is better to face those few but powerful interests, rather than eventually facing the fury of society."],["美国是一个自称没有社会阶层的国家。","但我敢说解决这些少数群体的利益问题—虽然这些利益很大，但总比以后面对社会的愤怒好。"]],["tax","tæks","n. 税, 税款, 重负, 会费\\nvt. 课以税, 使负重荷, 斥责",["Tax cuts are often used as a major fiscal tool to stimulate the economy.","The accusations are shocking: money laundering, tax evasion and obstruction of justice."],["减税常被用作刺激经济的主要财政手段。","这些指控令人震惊:洗钱、逃税和妨碍司法公正。"]],["director","di'rektә","n. 主管, 导演, 董事\\n[计] 寻向偶极子; 指挥仪",["This is Professor Oak, the director of this experiment.","In the film, the director makes Hamlet an active person."],["這位是奧克教授，他是這項實驗的負責人。",""]],["position","pә'ziʃәn","n. 位置, 地位, 身分, 形势, 姿势, 立场, 职位, 状态, 阵地\\nvt. 安置, 决定...的位置\\n[计] 位置",["You will lose your position if you don't keep your temper.","We'll need a head hunting agency to find the right man for this executive position."],["如果你不管好你的性子，你的工作可能就不保了。","我們需要人力仲介公司幫我們找到合適的人來擔任這個管理職位。"]],["player","'pleiә","n. 竞赛者, 上场队员, 游戏者, 演员\\n[经] 交易者",["My dream is to become a very strong mahjong player.","When I try to listen to music with media player there's an error and I can't play the file."],["我的夢想是要成為一個頂級的麻將高手。","我想用媒體播放器聽音樂，卻出現了錯誤訊息，不能播放。"]],["agree","ә'gri:","vi. 同意, 赞成, 应允, 适合\\nvt. 承认, 认定, 同意",["They say she and her husband can't agree on anything.","The problem is whether my parents will agree or not."],["他們說她和她的丈夫不可能對任何事達成協議。","問題是我爸爸媽媽會不會同意。"]],["especially","i'speʃәli","adv. 尤其, 特别, 格外",["It can make some people, especially the elderly and infants, very ill.","American politics are interesting to watch, especially during a presidential election."],["它可以使一些人，尤其是老人和婴幼儿，病得很重。","美国的政治看起来很有趣，特别是在选举总统期间。"]],["record","ri'kɒ:d","n. 记录, 履历, 档案, 审判记录, 最高纪录, 唱片\\nvt. 记录, 记载, 标明, 将...录音\\nvi. 记录, 录音, 可被…",["I also run my own website, to try and record my progress and to help other people a little bit.","Tom was exposed to a wide variety of music as a child through his mother's vast record collection."],["我也管理自己的网站，试试记录我的进步而且给别人帮助。","由於母親收藏了一整屋的唱片，湯姆小時候便有機會接觸各種類型的音樂。"]],["pick","pik","n. 精选, 选择, 掘, 精华, 牙签, 鹤嘴锄\\nv. 摘, 掘, 凿, 挖, 挑选\\n[计] 拾取",["I bent over to pick up my pen which had fallen on the floor.","It'd be great if you could pick up some bread before you come home."],["我俯身撿起了掉在地上的筆。","这将会是巨大的，如果你可以挑选一些面包，然后再回家。"]],["wear","wєә","n. 穿着, 戴, 使用, 耗损, 服装, 耐久性\\nvt. 穿着, 戴, 留(须、发等), 呈现, 磨损, 磨成, 耗损, 使疲乏, 消…",["I have to wear earplugs to drown out all the noise from the construction site next door.","I found that she wore the same dress that I had seen her wear last time."],["我不得不戴耳塞来阻隔旁边建筑工地的所有噪音。","我記起上次見到她時，她也是穿著這條裙子的。"]],["paper","'peipә","n. 纸, 文件, 文章, 报纸, 证券, 证件\\nvt. 用纸糊, 贴壁纸于, 用纸包装\\nvi. 贴壁纸\\na. 纸做的, 纸上的",["She drew a circle on a piece of paper with a pencil.","Let me read the paper when you have finished with it."],["她用铅笔在纸上画了一个圈。","报纸看完后借我看下。"]],["special","'speʃәl","n. 专辑, 专车, 号外, 特别的东西, 负有特别任务的人员\\na. 特别的, 专门的, 特殊的, 额外的, 附加的, 特别亲密的",["If necessary, I have no objection to paying a special fee.","In case the shipment is delayed, we have special delay insurance."],["如果必要的话，我不反对付特别费用。","万一船运迟了，我们有特别的迟到保险。"]],["space","speis","n. 位置, 空间, 距离, 太空, 空白, 间隔, (期刊等的)篇幅\\nvt. 隔开, 分隔\\nvi. 留间隔\\n[计] 空白, 空格校验",["Space travel will be commonplace some time in the future.","Vikings 1 and 2 became the first space probes to successfully land on the surface of Mars."],["太空旅行終有一天會成為平常事。","維京1號和2號成爲了最先在火星表面成功著陸的空間探測器。"]],["ground","graund","n. 土地, 战场, 场地, 地面, 范围\\na. 土地的, 地面上的\\nvt. 放在地上, 使搁浅, 打基础, 给...以训练\\nvi.…",["In Singapore, it is a crime to spit on the ground.","The shards of thought were scattered on the ground."],["隨地吐痰在新加坡算是犯罪行為。","思想的碎片散落一地。"]],["form","fɒ:m","n. 形状, 形体, 类型, 方式, 表格, 形式\\nv. 形成, 排列, (使)组成\\nn. 表单\\n[计] 表单",["Democracy is the worst form of government, except all the others that have been tried.","This form looks kind of complicated. Help me fill it out."],["除了那些我们尝试过的政府形态，民主是最差的那种了。","這個表格好像有點複雜，你可以幫我填嗎？"]],["support","sә'pɒ:t","n. 支持, 支撑, 援助, 供养, 支撑物\\nvt. 支援, 支撑, 帮助, 支持, 忍受, 供养, 证实\\n[计] 后援; 支持",["Whether you know him or not, you have to support his opinion.","Our on-line Customer Service Desk and trained support agents enable problems to be quickly identified and addressed."],["不管你认不认识他，你都应该支持他的想法。","我們的線上客服台和訓練有素的支援代理能夠快速識別和解決問題。"]],["event","i'vent","n. 事件, 结果, 事情的进程, 竞赛项目\\n[计] 事件",["Anyway the event has already passed, there is no point in mentioning it again.","I never drink unless there's a big event of some kind."],["反正事情已过去了，那不用再提了。","除非是大活動，否則我是從不喝酒的。"]],["official","ә'fiʃәl","n. 官员, 公务员, 职员\\na. 公务的, 官方的, 正式的",["He made an official visit to the French president the day before yesterday.","The official languages of the United Nations are Arabic, Chinese, English, French, Russian and Spanish."],["他前天拜会了法国总统。","联合国的正式语文是阿拉伯文，中文，英文，法文，俄文，和西班牙文。"]],["whose","hu:z","pron. 谁的",["This book is for students whose native language is not Japanese.","I have a friend whose father is a famous novelist."],["這本書是給母語不是日語的學生的。","我有一位朋友，他的父親是著名小說家。"]],["matter","'mætә","n. 事件, 物质, 原因, 素材, 实体, 重要\\nvi. 有关系",["No matter how cold it is outside, the rooms are comfortably heated.","I look forward to hearing your thoughts on this matter."],["無論外面多麼寒冷，房間始終既舒適又溫暖。","我期待听到你在这件事上的想法 。"]],["everyone","'evriwʌn","pron. 每个人, 人人\\n[计] 系统中的一个组名",["I can only wonder if this is the same for everyone else.","Everyone is anxious to know what has become of the former champion."],["我只能问自己这对其他所有人是不是一回事呢。","大家都渴望知道前冠军得主发生了什么。"]],["center","'sentә","n. 中心, 中心点, 中锋\\na. 中央的, 位在正中的\\nvt. 集中, 定中心\\nvi. 居中\\n[计] 居中; 中央",["Citizens of higher social status were permitted to live closer to the center.","When I left the shopping center, the car wasn't where I had left it."],["社會地位較高的公民被允許住在較靠近市中心的地方。","当我离开购物中心，车子不在我停的地方。"]],["couple","'kʌpl","n. 对, 夫妇, 数个\\nvt. 使成双, 连接, 使成婚, 把...联系起来\\nvi. 结合, 成婚",["Mr. and Mrs. Smith are the sort of couple who don't go out much in the evenings.","I went to Hawaii on vacation for a couple of weeks."],["Smith夫婦是晚上不出門的夫婦類型。","我去夏威夷休假了两周。"]],["site","sait","n. 位置, 场所, 地点\\nvt. 给...择址",["Gambling site lets users bet on which species will go extinct because of the oil spill in the Gulf of Mexico.","I have to wear earplugs to drown out all the noise from the construction site next door."],["賭博網站讓用戶投注於哪些物種將因為墨西哥灣漏油而滅絕。","我不得不戴耳塞来阻隔旁边建筑工地的所有噪音。"]],["project","'prɒdʒekt","n. 计划, 设计, 事业\\nvt. 计划, 设计, 投掷, 发射, 使凸出, 放映\\nvi. 凸出",["I tried to talk him out of the project, but in vain.","The total expense for the project amounts to one hundred million yen."],["我努力劝他远离那个计划，但是他不听。","計劃的總開支為一億円。"]],["hit","hit","n. 打击, 打, 冲撞, 讽刺\\nvt. 打, 打击, 碰撞, 打中, 袭击, 偶然碰上\\nvi. 打, 打中, 打击, 碰撞, 偶然碰…",["It is easier to hit on people on the Internet than in the street.","She was hit by a car while she was crossing the street."],["在网上勾人比在街上容易。","她过马路的时候被车撞了。"]],["base","beis","n. 底部, 垒, 基础, 基地\\nvt. 以...作基础\\na. 卑鄙的, 低劣的\\n[计] 基准",["We found it very hard going back to our base camp in the blizzard.","His remuneration consists of a base salary plus commissions."],["暴风雪使得我们难以返回营地。","他的薪水包括基本工資和提成。"]],["activity","æk'tiviti","n. 活动, 行动, 活跃, 活力\\n[计] 活动",["The activity of foreign trade has been declining of late.","The movie called \"Paranormal Activity\" was not that much good."],["最近对外贸易活动减少了。","那部叫“鬼影实录”的电影并没那么好。"]],["star","stɑ:","n. 星, 恒星, 星形物, 运气, 明星\\nvt. 以星状物装饰, 用星号标, 使成为明星\\nvi. 变成明星",["SpongeBob and Squidward went to visit Patrick Star.","This is a three-star hotel; three hundred dollars a night."],["海綿寶寶和章魚哥去看望派大星。","这里是三星级宾馆，三百元住一晚。"]],["table","'teibl","n. 桌子, 餐桌, 工作台, 铭文, 表格, 表, 高原, 平地层\\nvt. 搁置, 嵌合, 制表, 把...列入议事日程\\n[计] 表…",["This table is fine except in one respect - it will not fit into my room.","On leaving school, we presented him with a table clock as a token of our thanks."],["這張桌子不錯，不過有一個美中不足的地方 ﹣ 我的房間放不下它。","我們畢業的時候送了一個桌上時鐘給他作為謝禮。"]],["court","kɒ:t","n. 法院, 庭院, 奉承\\nvt. 献殷勤, 追求, 招致\\nvi. 求爱",["Anything you say can be used against you in court.","The accused is to appear before the court on Friday."],["你所说的一切都将成为呈堂证供。","被告周五将会出现在法庭上。"]],["produce","prә'dju:s","n. 生产品, 物产, 后代\\nvt. 产生, 生产, 提出, 出示\\nvi. 生产, 制造",["Any universe simple enough to be understood is too simple to produce a mind able to understand it.","This region's beekeepers produce honey particularly well."],["任何簡單到可以被了解的宇宙便太過簡單而無法產生可以了解它的心靈。","这个区域的养蜂人产得蜂蜜特别好。"]],["eat","i:t","v. 吃, 腐蚀",["To him, hunger was an abstract concept; he always had enough to eat.","Except for carrots, there is nothing he won't eat."],["對他來說，「肚子餓」是個抽象的概念，因為他從來就沒有餓過。","除了胡萝卜，他没有什么是不吃的。"]],["teach","ti:tʃ","vt. 教, 讲授, 教导, 教育\\nvi. 教书, 教学, 可以教",["I'd like to teach you Chinese in exchange for your teaching me another language.","Children learn more from what you are than what you teach."],["我想用汉语交换另一种语言.","比起父母的说教，小孩子会从父母的品格中习得更多知识。"]],["oil","ɒil","n. 油, 石油, 油画颜料\\nvt. 涂油于, 使融化成油状, 加油于\\nvi. 加燃油, 融化",["Gambling site lets users bet on which species will go extinct because of the oil spill in the Gulf of Mexico.","Carbon dioxide is a gas that is produced every time a fuel such as coal, oil, or natural gas is burned."],["賭博網站讓用戶投注於哪些物種將因為墨西哥灣漏油而滅絕。","二氧化碳是燃燒煤、石油或天然氣這樣的燃料時會產生的氣體。"]],["half","hɑ:f","n. 一半, 半场, 不完全\\na. 一半的, 不完全的, 部分的, 半场的\\nadv. 一半地, 部分地, 在某种程度上地, 几乎",["Half a million children still face malnutrition in Niger.","The second half of a man's life is made up of nothing but the habits he has acquired during the first half."],["尼日尔仍然有50万孩子面临着营养不良。","人的后半生就是由他前半生养成的习惯所构成的，其他什么都没有。"]],["situation",".sitju'eiʃәn","n. 情形, 境遇, 位置\\n[医] 情境, 处境",["The situation is getting worse and worse day by day.","If I were you, I would have done the same thing in such a difficult situation."],["情况一天比一天差。","如果我是你，我会在这种困难的情况下做同样的事。"]],["easy","'i:zi","a. 容易的, 缓缓的, 舒适的, 从容的, 宽容的, 流畅的, 随便的, 自在的, 疲软的\\nadv. 容易地, 慢慢地",["You are working too hard. Take it easy for a while.","As it is written in simple English, this book is easy to read."],["你工作得太辛苦了。放輕鬆一下。","由於是用簡單的英語所寫的，這本書很容易閱讀。"]],["cost","kɒst","n. 代价, 价值, 费用\\nvi. 花费\\nvt. 使失去, 值, 使花费",["It cost me ten thousand yen to have my television set repaired.","He saved the boy from drowning, but only at the cost of his own life."],["把我的電視機修好花了我一萬日元。","他救了那個遇溺的男孩，但卻犠牲了自己的生命。"]],["industry","'indәstri","n. 勤劳, 工业, 企业, 产业, 有组织的劳动\\n[经] 工业, 实业",["Housing prices in Hsinchu City have risen sharply due to the concentration of the tech industry.","The economy of the island is dependent on the fishing industry."],["新竹市區的房價因為科技產業聚集而水漲船高。","这个岛的经济依靠的是渔业。"]],["figure","'figә","n. 数字, 价格, 图形, 形状\\nvt. 描绘, 表示, 演算, 认为\\nvi. 计算, 出现, 估计",["As you look at your face, you try to figure out what is happening behind it, in your mind.","The basic job of an advertising agency is to figure out how to turn a desire into a need."],["当你看着自己的脸时，你会试图去发现这张脸后面的心灵里在发生着什么。","廣告商最基本的工作就是把人的慾望轉化成需要。"]],["street","stri:t","n. 街道, 马路, 街区\\na. 街道的",["It is easier to hit on people on the Internet than in the street.","I'm going to sit on the bench over there next to the street lamp."],["在网上勾人比在街上容易。","我會在那盞街燈旁邊的長凳上坐下來。"]],["image","'imidʒ","n. 影像, 肖像, 想象, 图像, 形象, 翻版\\nvt. 作...的像, 反映, 想象, 象征\\nn. 图像\\n[计] 图象",["The Shanghainese people must build up Shanghai's new image.","They completely destroyed the image of the country."],["上海人要树立上海新形象。","他們完全損壞了國家的形象。"]],["itself","it'self","pron. 它本身, 它自己",["Creating creativity itself is improving creativity.","I never consider ease and joyfulness as the purpose of life itself."],["創新創新本身就提升了創新。","我从来不认为安逸和享乐是人生本来的目的。"]],["phone","fәun","n. 电话, 受话器, 耳机\\nvt. 打电话给\\nvi. 打电话",["I want a cellular phone, but I don't have enough money to pay for one.","The mayor's family was harassed with threatening phone calls all day."],["我想要一支手機, 但是我沒有足夠的錢買一支。","市長一家人一整天不斷遭到了恐嚇電話的騷擾。"]],["either","'i:ðә","a. (两者之中)任一的, (两者之中)各一的\\npron. (两者之中)任一\\nconj. 或, 要么",["Ray was willing to corroborate Gary's story, but the police were still unconvinced that either of them were telling the truth.","I've never been to New York, and my sister hasn't, either."],["Ray乐于证实Gary的故事，但警察仍然不相信他们其中一个说的是事实。","我从没去过纽约，我妹妹也没有。"]],["data","'deitә","pl. 资料, 数据\\n[计] 数据; DOS内部命令:用于显示或设定系统的日期",["It is questionable whether this data can be relied on.","My data-burning software is showing an error message."],["這些資料未必可靠。","我的刻录软件显示了一个错误信息。"]],["cover","'kʌvә","n. 盖子, 封面, 藉口\\nvt. 覆盖, 掩饰, 保护, 掩护, 包括\\nvi. 覆盖",["The piston does not come into contact with the cylinder cover.","Cover the pan and cook until tender, then remove the cover and continue the cooking until the onions are a light brown."],["这个活塞不接触汽缸盖。","蓋上鍋蓋煮至洋蔥變軟，然後揭開鍋蓋繼續煮至洋蔥呈現淺棕色。"]],["quite","kwait","adv. 相当, 完全, 十分",["The two brothers are quite unlike in their appearance.","It's quite difficult to master French in 2 or 3 years."],["哥哥和弟弟的樣子一點也不像。","两三年就想掌握法语是很困难的。"]],["picture","'piktʃә","n. 图画, 照片, 景色, 美丽如画的人(或物), 化身, 生动的描述, 想像, 形象思维\\nvt. 画, 拍摄, 用图说明, 描写, …",["The picture is colorful in contrast with this one.","There is a castle in the background of the picture."],["和這幅比起上來，那幅畫的色彩鮮艷多了。","图片的背景是一座城堡。"]],["clear","kliә","a. 清楚的, 明确的, 澄清的\\nadv. 清晰地\\nvt. 澄清, 清除障碍\\nvi. 放晴, 变清澈\\nn. 空隙\\n[计] 清除",["In clear weather one can see Mount Fuji from here.","It's clear that there's a rather strong disagreement between the two."],["在晴朗的日子裡，可以從這看見富士山。","兩人之間明顯存在相當大的分歧。"]],["practice","'præktis","n. 实践, 练习, 实行, 惯例, 习惯, 开业\\nv. 实践, 实行, 练习, 实习, 业务",["In theory, there is no difference between theory and practice. But, in practice, there is.","I realized that putting this thing into practice was hard."],["理论上说，理论和实践没有区别。但实践上说，是有的。","我意识到要实行这件事是很困难的。"]],["piece","pi:s","n. 块, 片, 篇, 碎片, 部分, 部件, 标准量\\nvt. 修补, 修理, 拼合, 接线头\\nvi. 吃零食",["I got a piece of lead for my mechanical pencil from her.","I can't find the waistcoat of my three piece suit."],["我从她那里拿了一根自动铅笔芯。","我找不到我三件套的背心。"]],["land","lænd","n. 陆地, 地面, 地界, 地产, 国土, 土地\\nvi. 登陆, 登岸, 到达\\nvt. 使上岸, 使登陆, 使到达\\n[计] 连接盘…",["He bought the land for the purpose of building a house on it.","Elephants are the largest land animals alive today."],["他買土地的目的是要造房子。","大象是如今现存的陆生动物里最大的。"]],["recent","'ri:snt","a. 最近的, 近代的, 最新的\\n[经] 最近的, 新进的",["Demand for occupational therapy has surged in recent years.","A recent survey shows that the number of smokers is decreasing."],["这几年对作业疗法的需求在迅速增长。","最近的一项调查显示吸烟的人数减少了。"]],["describe","di'skraib","vt. 描述, 描绘, 画",["It is a term used to describe the warming of the earth due to increasing amounts of carbon dioxide in the atmosphere.","I can only describe the terrible smell as vomit mixed with rotting flesh."],["这个词指的是由于大气层里二氧化碳含量增多而导致全球变暖。","我只能描述这可怕的味道像呕吐物混合着烂肉。"]],["product","'prɒdʌkt","n. 产品, 结果, 乘积\\n[化] 生产物",["My uncle's company launched a new product last month.","The end product is worth ten times the value of the materials used."],["舅舅的公司上个月推出了一款新产品。","最终产品值所用原材料的10倍价格。"]],["doctor","'dɒktә","n. 医生, 博士\\nvt. 授以博士学位, 诊断, 修改\\nvi. 行医",["The doctor insisted that the patient get plenty of rest.","The doctor thought the patient's pulse was rather rapid."],["医生坚持病人获得充分的休息。","医生认为病人的脉搏有点快。"]],["wall","wɒ:l","n. 墙, 墙壁, 垣, 内壁, 分界物, 屏障\\na. 墙的\\nvt. 给...建墙, 禁闭, 用墙围住\\n[计] 背景墙",["She hung a little Picasso on the wall of the drawing room.","A man touched down on the moon. A wall came down in Berlin. A world was connected by our own science and imagination."],["她把一幅小尺寸的毕卡索画作挂在会客厅的墙上。","人类登上月球、柏林墙倒下，世界被我们的科学和想像被连接在一起。"]],["patient","'peiʃәnt","n. 病人, 承受者\\na. 忍耐的, 容忍的, 有耐性的, 坚忍的",["The physician prescribed his patient some medicine.","My driving instructor says I should be more patient."],["医生给他的病人开了一些药。","我的駕駛教練說我應該更有耐心一點。"]],["worker","'wә:kә","n. 工人, 劳动者\\n[经] 工人, 劳工, 劳动者",["The rescue worker searched the area, looking for the child.","The washing-up machine at home was regarded as a rival to the worker at the kitchen sink."],["援救人员为了找到孩子，仔细搜索了那个区域。","在厨房，家用洗碗机可以算得上是手洗刷碗工的大敌。"]],["news","nju:z","n. 新闻, 消息, 报导\\n[法] 新闻, 消息, 新闻报导",["The communication of news by TV and radio is very common now.","The news article painted the defendant as a guilty man, even though he had been proven innocent."],["這個年代用電視和收音機報道新聞已是十分平常的事了。","该报文章中将被告人描述成一个罪魁祸首，尽管他已经被证明是无辜的了。"]],["test","test","n. 测试, 试验, 化验, 检验, 考验, 甲壳\\nvt. 测试, 试验, 化验\\nvi. 接受测验, 进行测试",["Tom looked worried about the result of an English test.","She is not in the least worried about her test scores."],["Tom看上去对英语测试的结果很担心。","她完全不擔心測驗的分數。"]],["movie","'mu:vi","n. 电影",["I think a movie is more entertaining than any book.","I would rather go to the art museum than to the movie theater."],["我觉得一部电影比任何书都有趣。","我想去美術館勝過去電影院。"]],["certain","'sә:tәn","a. 确定的, 某一个的, 必然的\\n[法] 确凿的, 无疑的, 可靠的",["It's still not certain who's going to win this match.","Pigs share certain characteristics with human beings."],["谁能赢这场比赛还说不定。","豬與人類的一些特性相同。"]],["north","nɒ:θ","n. 北方, 北\\na. 北的, 北方的\\nadv. 向北方, 在北方",["Farther from the palace and to its north and south were the commoners, merchants, artisans, and laborers.","As North Korea displays aggression, South Korea concentrates its forces near the border."],["遠離宫殿的北方及南方是平民、商人、工藝師傅和工人。","韩国随着朝鲜的外患而在边界附近集结军队。"]],["personal","'pә:snl","a. 私人的, 涉及隐私的, 有人性的, 人称的, 亲自的, 身体的\\n[医] 人的; 个人的, 自身的",["Our company and its affiliates may share your personal information with each other.","We may combine your personal information with other information."],["我们公司与其分公司会共享你的个人信息。","我们可能会将你的私人信息和其他信息结合在一起。"]],["simply","'simpli","adv. 简单地, 只是, 简直, 简朴地, 坦白地",["If you didn't know me that way then you simply didn't know me.","There are things in this world which simply cannot be expressed in the form of words."],["你如果不以那種方式了解我，那你根本就不了解我。","這個世界上有些事物根本不能用言語形容。"]],["third","θә:d","num. 第三, 三分之一\\n[机] 第三; 第三的",["One third of the population of that country cannot read.","If you go by bus, you can get there in about one-third of the time."],["那個國家三分之一的人口是文盲。","你乘公車去的話，可以省掉三分之二的時間。"]],["technology","tek'nɒlәdʒi","n. 技术, 工业技术, 术语\\n[医] 技术学, 工艺学",["It will take five to ten years for the technology to be ready.","More than 75% of them fear that technology impoverishes the traditional French language."],["在科技准备好之前需要五到十年。","他們其中的 75 ％ 以上都擔心技術導致傳統法語的衰落。"]],["catch","kætʃ","n. 捕捉, 陷阱, 捕捉之物, 抓, 拉手\\nvt. 捕捉, 赶上, 感染, 听清楚\\nvi. 抓住, 燃着",["Bill got up early in order that he might catch the first train.","You have to study hard to catch up with your class."],["為了能夠趕上第一班火車, 比爾很早就起床了。","你必須用功讀書趕上同學。"]],["step","step","n. 步骤, 步, 步幅, 脚步声, 踏级, 步伐, 短距离, 步态, 手段, 等级\\nvt. 踏, 以步测量, 跨步, 使成阶梯状\\nv…",["A journey of a thousand miles begins with a single step.","Another step, and you would have fallen down the stairs."],["千里之行，始於足下。","再走一步的话，你就已经跌下楼梯了。"]],["baby","'beibi","n. 婴孩\\n[医] 婴儿",["Some national parks offer showers and even baby-sitting services.","The moment I held the baby in my arms, it began to cry."],["有些國家公園設有淋浴間，甚至還會提供託兒服務。","我一把孩子抱在手里，他就开始哭了。"]],["computer","kәm'pju:tә","n. 电脑, 电子计算机\\n[计] 计算机",["Compared to a computer, a word processor has a single purpose.","Had I had enough money, I would have bought that computer."],["文字處理軟件和電腦不同的是，它只有一個用途。","如果有了足够的钱，我会把这台电脑买上了。"]],["type","taip","n. 类型, 样式, 典型, 榜样, 标志, 符号, 型, 式\\nvi. 打字\\nvt. 作为代表, 测定类型, 用打字机打\\n[计] 类…",["I'm the type who gets nervous in front of people, so I'm bad at speech making.","Hutongs are a type of narrow street, most commonly associated with Beijing, China."],["我是那种面对人群很紧张的人，所以我的演讲能力很差。","胡同是一种跟中国北京有关的窄街路。"]],["attention","ә'tenʃәn","n. 注意, 注意力\\n[计] 引起注意信号",["I don't know what to do with that guy. No matter how mad I get at him he just takes it in stride and pays no attention.","She doesn't pay attention to others; in other words, she is selfish."],["我不知道對那個傢伙該怎麼辦。不論我對他生多大的氣, 他就是蠻不在乎而且置之不理。","她不關心別人；也就是說，她很自私。"]],["draw","drɒ:","vi. 拉, 拖, 拔剑\\nvt. 拖拉, 挨近, 领取, 打成平局, 引导, 抽签决定, 画, 描写, 制订, 草拟, 吸引\\nn. 拉…",["The journalist wanted to write an article that would draw public attention to the issue.","The game ended in a draw, and the final score was 2-2."],["記者想寫一篇文章，以便引起公眾對那件事情的注意。","比赛以平局结束，最后比分是二比二。"]],["film","film","n. 软片, 薄膜, 胶卷, 电影\\nvt. 覆以薄膜, 拍摄\\nvi. 生薄膜, 拍电影",["This film is really boring - the best bit is when it finishes.","I am either going to see a film, or going to see an opera."],["这部电影很无聊，最好的部分是结局。","我或者去看电影，或者去看歌剧。"]],["republican","ri'pʌblikәn","n. 共和主义者, 共和党员\\na. 共和政体的, 共和国的, 共和主义的",["There are two major political parties in the United States: the conservative Republican Party, and the liberal Democratic Party.","In the past I used to vote for the Democratic ticket, but from now on I'll climb on the Republican bandwagon."],["美国有两大政党，一是较为保守的共和党，一是较为自由的民主党。",""]],["organization",".ɒ:gәnai'zeiʃәn","n. 组织, 结构, 团体, 体制\\n[医] 组织, 机构, 机化(血栓或坏死组织)",["Even though it costs his life, he still chooses to betray his organization.","He wastes his life, forgetting to betray his organization."],["他即使犧牲生命，也要出賣組織。","他白白犧牲生命，忘了出賣組織。"]],["tree","tri:","n. 树, 木料, 树状物\\nvt. 把...赶上树\\n[计] 树; DOS外部命令:显示指定磁盘驱动器的目录结构",["I saw a young man lying on the bench under the cherry tree in the park.","There used to be a big pine tree in front of my house."],["在公园里，我看到一个年轻人躺在一棵樱桃树下的长椅上。","以前我家前面有棵大松树。"]],["source","sɒ:s","n. 来源, 水源, 根源, 原始资料, 源\\n[计] 来源, 源程序",["The Internet is an invaluable source of information.","Purple clover is a type of plant that bees use as a source of food."],["互联网是一种无法估量的信息资源。","紫三葉草是一種被蜜蜂用來當作食物來源的植物。"]],["red","red","a. 红的, 红色的, 红肿的, 流血的\\nn. 红色, 红颜料, 赤字\\n[计] 简化, 减少",["In hard times like this, no ordinary effort can get our company out of the red.","The minute I have something to drink, I turn bright red."],["在这种困难的时候，任何寻常的努力都无法使我们的公司摆脱赤字。","我一喝了酒就立刻变得通红。"]],["nearly","'niәli","adv. 几乎, 密切地",["When I ask people what they regret most about high school, they nearly all say the same thing: that they wasted so much time.","He was nearly hit by the car while crossing the street."],["当我问人家高中时代他们最后悔的是什么时，他们几乎所有人都回答一致：他们浪费了那么多时间。","他過馬路時差點被車撞。"]],["choose","tʃu:z","vt. 选择, 宁愿, 欲\\nvi. 作出选择, 愿意\\n[计] 选取",["We can't choose where we come from, but we can choose where we go from there.","It is sometimes hard to choose between dreams and reality."],["我们不能选择从哪里来，却能选择往哪里去。","梦想和现实有时真的很难取舍。"]],["cause","kɒ:z","n. 原因, 目标\\nvt. 引起, 使产生, 使遭受",["The committee inquired into the cause of the accident.","The machine was too complicated for us to find out the cause of the trouble."],["委员会调查了事故的原因。","機器結構很複雜，我們找來找去也找不到故障的原因。"]],["hair","hєә","n. 头发, 毛发, 些微\\n[医] 毛, 发",["She stood on the deck with her long hair waving in the wind.","She was a tall, thin girl with long, soft brown hair."],["她站在甲板上，长头发随风飞舞。","她是個又高又瘦, 留著一頭又長又軟的褐色頭髮的女孩。"]],["century","'sentʃuri","n. 世纪, 百年",["The wedding will be held in a 17th century church.","The old church on the hill dates back to the twelfth century."],["婚禮會在一座十七世紀的教堂裏舉行。","山上的老教堂的歷史可以追溯到12世紀。"]],["evidence","'evidәns","n. 根据, 证据, 迹象\\n[经] 证据, 凭证",["The police assembled a lot of evidence against him.","Unless there is reliable evidence for it, we should not believe anything."],["警察收集了很多对他不利的证据。","除非有可靠的证据，不然我们不应该相信任何事。"]],["window","'windәu","n. 窗户, 窗子, 窗口\\nvt. 给...开窗\\n[计] 窗口",["When poverty comes in at the door, love flies out the window.","After I cleaned the window, I could see through it clearly."],["当贫穷降临在门口，爱从窗外飞走。","清潔窗戶後，我能很清楚的從窗戶看出去。"]],["difficult","'difikәlt","a. 困难的",["It is difficult to keep up a conversation with someone who only says \"yes\" and \"no\".","It's quite difficult to master French in 2 or 3 years."],["跟一个只说“是”和“不是”的人很难继续谈话。","两三年就想掌握法语是很困难的。"]],["listen","'lisn","vi. 听, 倾听, 听从\\nn. 听, 倾听",["There's no one more deaf than he who does not want to listen.","In Tatoeba, you gotta always listen to veteran members. They'll tell you what can't be done and why. Then do it."],["不願意聆聽的人，才是真正的聾子。","在Tatoeba，你必須總是傾聽資深成員。他們會告訴你什麼不能做，以及為什麼。然後你去做。"]],["soon","su:n","adv. 不久, 早, 快, 宁可",["All the doctor's efforts were in vain and the man soon died.","As soon as it gets dark, the fireworks will start."],["醫生雖然已經竭盡全力，但不久病人還是死了。","天一黑，就会开始放焰火了。"]],["culture","'kʌltʃә","n. 文化, 修养, 耕种\\nvt. 耕种, 培养",["In culture, they are on the same plane as savages.","The manners and customs of a country reflect its culture."],["在教養上，他們可以說是和野蠻人差不多。","一个国家的风俗习惯反映了它的文化。"]],["billion","'biljәn","num. 十亿, 十亿个",["The population of China has already exceeded 1.3 billion.","The company suffered a loss of one billion yen last year."],["中国的人口已经超过了十三亿。","那家公司去年亏损了10亿日元。"]],["chance","tʃæns. tʃɑ:ns","n. 机会, 意外, 可能性\\nvi. 偶然发生\\nvt. 冒险",["With the heirless king going crazy and royal family poisoned, the general of the army finally had his chance to usurp the throne.","I hope I will have a chance to see you next time I'm in New York."],["随着无继承人的国王的发疯和王室家族的中毒，将军终于有机会篡夺王位。","希望下次我在纽约还可以有机会见到你。"]],["brother","'brʌðә","n. 兄弟",["You seem to have mistaken me for my elder brother.","My brother is very important. At least he thinks he is."],["你似乎把我当成我哥哥了。","我弟弟非常重要。至少他认为他是。"]],["energy","'enәdʒi","n. 精力, 精神, 活力, 能量\\n[化] 能; 能量",["A growing child who doesn't seem to have much energy perhaps needs medical attention.","We have used earth's energy resources as if they were limitless."],["一个成长中的孩子如果没有充足的能量，可能需要药物治疗。","我们如同无限般的使用地球的能源资源。"]],["realize","'riәlaiz","vt. 了解, 实现, 使显得逼真, 变卖\\nvi. 变卖",["Some day you will come to realize the importance of saving.","I have come to realize that China is developing quickly but the Chinese people live a relatively leisurely life."],["有朝一日你會懂得存錢的重要性的。","我意識到了中國正在快速地發展，但是相對而言中國人卻過著悠閒的生活。"]],["period","'piәriәd","n. 时期, 节段, 节, 句点, 学时, 周期\\na. 当时特有的, 过去某段时期的\\ninterj. 就是这话, 就是这么回事",["There is a large temperature difference between day and night during this period of time.","After a six month period, his leg was healed and is normal again."],["这段时间昼夜温差很大。","過了六個月，他的腿便治好，回復正常了。"]],["summer","'sʌmә","n. 夏季, 全盛时期\\nvi. 避暑, 过夏天\\n[计] 加法器",["I worked in a post office during the summer vacation.","St Mark's Square in Venice is always swarming with tourists in the summer."],["暑假期间，我在邮局工作。","威尼斯的圣马可广场在夏季总是挤满了游客。"]],["hundred","'hʌndrәd","n. 百, 百个东西\\nnum. 百, 百个\\na. 一百的, 许多的",["The total expense for the project amounts to one hundred million yen.","No less than three hundred dollars was needed for the work."],["計劃的總開支為一億円。","这个工作需要不低于300美金。"]],["available","ә'veilәbl","a. 可利用的, 可获得的, 有效的\\n[医] 有效的, 可得的",["We are sorry, the person you are trying to contact is not available.","There are many jobs available in the computer industry."],["對不起, 你要聯絡的人沒空。","计算机产业能够提供相当多的就业岗位。"]],["plant","plænt. plɑ:nt","n. 植物, 作物, 工厂, 树枝, 生长, 设施, 成套设备\\nvt. 种植, 栽培, 播种, 培养, 安置, 殖民于, 使位于\\nvi…",["The best time to plant a tree is 20 years ago. The second best time is now.","This kind of plant grows only in the tropical regions."],["种一棵树，最好的时间是20年前，其次是现在。","這類植物只生長在熱帶地區。"]],["likely","'laikli","a. 有可能的, 合适的, 前途有望的\\nadv. 或许, 可能",["At this rate, we're not likely to be done before the end of the week.","The more difficult the questions are, the less likely I'll be able to answer them."],["按照这个速度，我们不会在这周结束前完成。","問題愈難，我懂得回答的機會就愈低。"]],["opportunity",".ɒpә'tju:niti","n. 机会, 时机",["He made use of every opportunity to become famous.","It's not that I don't like your English, but for me it's important to use every opportunity to practise Russian."],["他為了成名，沒有錯失過半個機會。","并不是我不喜欢你的英语，只是对我而言，利用每一个可能的机会来练习俄语很重要。"]],["term","tә:m","n. 术语, 专有名词, 期限, 学期, 任期, 条件, 价钱, 关系, 地位, 项, 界石\\nvt. 称, 呼\\n[计] 检索词; 项",["I suppose it's different when you think about it over the long term.","You should turn in your term papers by the end of April."],["我认为你考虑久了就会不一样了。","請在四月底之前交上你的學期報告。"]],["short","ʃɒ:t","a. 短的, 近的, 矮的, 短期的, 简短的, 少量的\\nadv. 简短地, 突然\\nn. 扼要, 短片, 缺乏\\nvt. 故意少给, …",["Jane had her hair cut short before the athletic meet.","Three months is too short a time to finish the experiment."],["Jane在运动会之前把头发剃短了。","要完成实验，三个月太短了。"]],["letter","'letә","n. 信, 字母, 证书, 字面意义, 铅字, 学问, 出租人\\nvt. 写字母于, 在...上刻字母, 用字母标明\\nvi. 写印刷体字…",["Please don't forget to put a stamp on the letter before mailing it.","I do not remember seeing the letter, but perhaps I read it."],["请不要忘记寄信前要在上面贴邮票。","我不記得我看過這封信，但或許我讀過它。"]],["condition","kәn'diʃәn","n. 情况, 条件\\nvt. 使健康, 以...为条件, 决定, 使适应\\n[计] 条件",["My father's condition seems to improve one moment, but the next moment he sinks again.","Many people consider a high salary to be a condition for success."],["我父亲的状况时好时坏。","不少人以高薪为成功的条件。"]],["choice","tʃɒis","n. 选择, 精选品, 选择权\\na. 精选的, 挑三拣四的, 上等的\\n[计] DOS内部命令:在批处理文件中\\n该命令用于提示用户作出…",["People can begin to love when they choose, but they have no choice when it comes to ending love.","Because of the storm, we had no choice but to stay at home."],["人們或可選擇何時開始戀愛，但它的終結卻不由人。","因為暴風雨的關係，所以我們必須待在家裡。"]],["single","'siŋgl","a. 单身的, 单程的, 单一的, 个别的, 孤独的, 专一的\\nn. 一个, 单打, 单程票\\nvt. 选出\\nvi. 击出一垒打\\n[…",["I cannot do without this dictionary even for a single day.","Compared to a computer, a word processor has a single purpose."],["我一天也离不开这本字典。","文字處理軟件和電腦不同的是，它只有一個用途。"]],["rule","ru:l","n. 规则, 统治, 控制, 支配, 规律, 标准, 章程, 破折号, 铅线\\nvt. 规定, 统治, 管理, 控制, 支配, 裁决\\nv…",["I make it a rule not to watch television after nine o'clock.","As a rule of thumb, you should plan on one pound of beef for every two guests."],["我规定自己在九点之后不看电视。","一般來說，你應該為每兩個客人準備一磅牛肉。"]],["daughter","'dɒ:tә","n. 女儿\\na. 女儿的",["The mother missed her daughter who was away at college.","Last night my daughter didn't come home until half past one."],["妈妈想念她在读大学的女儿。","昨天晚上我的女儿一点半才回家。"]],["administration","әd.mini'streiʃәn","n. 行政, 管理, 政府机关\\n[化] 给药",["The appropriation is pin-money; it wouldn't be enough even to build a gym, much less build the administration building.","Our school administration decided to do away with that school rule."],["",""]],["south","sauθ","n. 南方, 南\\na. 南的, 向南的\\nadv. 在南方\\nvi. 转向南方",["This is how Scott and his men arrived at the South Pole.","Afrikaners are the people originated in South Africa."],["這是史考特和他的夥伴到達南極的方法。","阿非利康族是源在南非形成的民族。"]],["husband","'hʌzbәnd","n. 丈夫, 管理人, 节俭的人\\nvt. 节俭, 使成丈夫, 持有",["A woman brought an old picture of her dead husband, wearing a hat, to the photographer.","She employed a private detective to keep a watch on her husband."],["一個女人帶了一張她去世的丈夫的舊照片給攝影師，照片中她的丈夫戴著一頂帽子。","她僱了一個私人偵探看守她的丈夫。"]],["congress","'kɒŋgres","n. 国会, 会议, 讨论会\\n[医] 会议, 会合",["The President reiterated his call for Congress to pass the Paycheck Fairness Act that would strengthen the Equal Pay Act and give women more tools to fight pay discrimination.","The President vetoed the bill, but Congress overrode his veto."],["總統再次呼籲國會通過《薪酬公平法案》，該法案將加強《同工同酬法案》，並為女性提供更多對抗薪資歧視的工具。",""]],["floor","flɒ:","n. 地板, 楼层, 底部, 底价\\nvt. 铺地板, 打倒\\nn. 地面, 地板, 基底\\n[计] 基底",["I can place the palms of my hands on the floor without bending my knees.","I sucked up the dust on the floor with a vacuum cleaner."],["我不用曲膝就能把我的手掌放到地上。","我用吸塵機把地上的灰塵吸掉了。"]],["campaign","kæm'pein","n. 战役, 运动, 竞选运动\\nvi. 参加运动, 作战",["Lobbyists for the bill funneled bribes into a campaign fund.","We started a campaign against smoking."],["該法案的說客把遊說賄款匯入了競選基金。","我們開始了一個反對吸煙運動。"]],["material","mә'tiәriәl","n. 材料, 物资, 素材, 布料, 资料\\na. 物质的, 肉体的, 重要的",["Not material, but spiritual things determine our life.","The king, convinced, told the tailors to prepare the outfit, but he also couldn't see this material."],["我们的生活不是由物质，而是由精神来决定的。","國王聽信了騙子的話，吩咐裁縫師準備這套服裝，但其實裁縫師也看不見這塊布料。"]],["population",".pɒpju'leiʃәn","n. 人口, 人口数\\n[化] 群体; 总体",["One third of the population of that country cannot read.","The population of Shanghai is as large as that of Tokyo."],["那個國家三分之一的人口是文盲。","上海的人口数量和东京相当。"]],["economy","i'kɒnәmi","n. 经济, 理财, 节约\\n[医] 经济, 整体",["The town developed into the center of the economy.","The economy of the island is dependent on the fishing industry."],["這座城鎮發展成為了一個經濟中心。","这个岛的经济依靠的是渔业。"]],["medical","'medikl","n. 医生, 体格检查\\na. 医学的, 内科的, 药的",["Those selected will have to face extensive medical and psychological tests.","It's best to keep a household medical manual by your pillow and read it from time to time."],["被选上的将会面临大量的医学和精神测试。","最好备一本家用医卫手册在枕头边，常常翻翻看看。"]],["hospital","'hɒspitәl","n. 医院\\n[医] 医院",["In another two weeks you will be able to get out of the hospital.","I had to abstain from smoking while I was in the hospital."],["再过两周你就可以出院了。","在医院的时候，我不得不戒烟。"]],["church","tʃә:tʃ","n. 教堂, 礼拜, 教会\\nvt. 使人接受宗教仪式\\na. 教堂的",["Even people who don't believe in the Catholic church venerate the Pope as a symbolic leader.","The wedding will be held in a 17th century church."],["甚至是不相信天主教的人也把教皇敬为一个象征性的领导者。","婚禮會在一座十七世紀的教堂裏舉行。"]],["close","klәuz","n. 结束, 完结\\na. 靠近的, 亲近的, 亲密的, 严密的, 关闭的, 狭窄的, 秘密的\\nvt. 关, 结束, 使靠近, 封闭, …",["There is close relationship between supply and demand.","It's close to ten o'clock. It's about time we went to bed."],["供應和需求之間的關係十分密切。","已将近十点了。该是睡觉的时候了。"]],["risk","risk","n. 冒险, 危险, 保险额\\nvt. 冒...的危险, 冒险干",["He saved the drowning boy at the risk of his own life.","It's a risk that Tom and I aren't willing to take."],["他奮不顧身地把遇溺的男孩救了起來。","我和汤姆都不愿意冒这个险。"]],["thousand","'θauznd","num. 千\\na. 成千的, 许多的\\nn. 许许多多",["Mother gives my sister two thousand yen every month.","It cost me ten thousand yen to have my television set repaired."],["母親每個月給妹妹兩千日元。","把我的電視機修好花了我一萬日元。"]],["current","'kʌrәnt","n. 涌流, 趋势, 流\\na. 流通的, 现在的, 当前的, 流行的\\n[计] 当前的",["Judging from the current situation, this project is sure to succeed.","Judging from current situations, this task will not be finished until next week."],["根据当前的状况，这个项目绝对会成功。","根据现在的情况，这个任务在下周之前无法结束。"]],["fire","'faiә","n. 火, 炉火, 电炉, 火灾, 闪光体, 炮火, 热情\\nvt. 点燃, 烧制, 使发光, 激动, 放枪, 解雇\\nvi. 着火, 烧…",["The house did not suffer much damage because the fire was quickly put out.","As he had no way of making fire, he ate the fish raw."],["火很快便被撲熄了，房子只受到輕微損壞。","他沒法生火，只好把魚生吃。"]],["future","'fju:tʃә","n. 未来, 将来\\na. 将来的, 未来的",["The past can only be known, not changed. The future can only be changed, not known.","We wish to invite Peter to Japan in the near future."],["我們可以回顧過去，但不能改變過去；我們可以改變未來，但不能預知未來。","我们希望在不久的将来邀请彼得去日本。"]],["wrong","rɒŋ","a. 错误的, 不正当的, 失常的\\nadv. 错误地",["Admitting what you say, I still think you are in the wrong.","Two men are trying to get a handle on what's wrong with the car."],["虽然我承认你说的,但是我仍然认为你是错的。","两个男人在检查汽车出了什么故障。"]],["involve","in'vɒlv","vt. 包括, 使陷于, 潜心于, 包围\\n[医] 累及, 牵涉, 包含",["All social interactions, naturally, will involve some degree of insincerity, which I believe is necessary.","Whichever way we choose will involve danger."],["所有的社交，自然而然地，都会掺入一些虚伪的成分，我想这是有其必要的。","不管我们选哪条路，都会有危险。"]],["defense","di'fens","n. 防卫, 防卫物\\n[医] 防御",["She took night classes in the art of self-defense.","The defense of the master thesis is just happening next month."],["她在夜校上自卫术课程。","下个月就要进行硕士论文答辩了。"]],["behavior","bi'heivjә","n. 行为, 举止\\n[医] 行为",["The doctor continued to observe the patient's behavior.","His daily behavior is not consistent with his principles."],["醫生繼續觀察病人的一舉一動。","他的日常行为并不和他的原则相一致。"]],["anyone","'eniwʌn","pron. 任何人",["Should anyone call on me in my absence, tell him that I will be back soon.","If anyone was to ask what the point of the story is, I really don't know."],["如果我不在的時候有人來找我，麻煩你告訴他我很快回來。","如果有人问起这个故事的用意是什么，我还真不知道。"]],["increase","in'kri:s","n. 增加, 增进, 利益\\nvt. 增加, 加大\\nvi. 增加, 繁殖",["Due to a number of unfortunate causes, one-parent families are on the increase.","An increase in customer complaints could signal a decline in business."],["由于诸多不幸因素，单亲家庭的数量在增长中。","顧客投訴量增加，可能代表生意正在走下坡。"]],["security","si'kjuriti","n. 安全, 安全性, 防护物, 保安, 可靠性, 担保人, 抵押品, 保证金\\n[计] 安全性, 保密性, 安全检查程序",["If you want security in your old age, begin saving now.","The security level, as established by the Department of Homeland Security, is orange."],["如果你想安享晚年，現在就要開始儲蓄了。","根据国土安全部的规定，目前的安全水准是橙色等级。"]],["myself","mai'self","pron. 我自己, 我亲自, 我独自",["At the time, I managed to make myself understood in English.","I'm so dumb... I'm trying to explain things to you that I don't understand myself."],["當時我設法讓別人聽得懂我說的英語。","我太愚蠢了...我竟然试着给你解释我自己都不懂的东西。"]],["bank","bæŋk","n. 银行, 堤, 岸\\n[医] 库",["The Mitsubishi Bank merged with the Bank of Tokyo.","The thieves knocked off another bank today in a daytime robbery."],["三菱銀行和東京銀行合併了。","今天强盗大白天的就抢了另一家银行。"]],["certainly","'sә:tәnli","adv. 确定地",["You've worked hard for months and have certainly earned a holiday.","Computers are certainly playing an important role in our life, whether we like it or not."],["你已經辛苦地工作好幾個月了, 當然可以休假。","无论我们是否喜欢电脑，它在我们的生活中始终起着重要的作用。"]],["west","west","n. 西方, 西部\\na. 西方的, 向西的\\nadv. 向西, 自西方, 在西方",["Even if the sun were to rise in the west, I would not change my mind.","The students were for the most part from the West Coast."],["即使太阳从西边出来，我也不会改变主意。","大部分的學生來自西海岸。"]],["sport","spɒ:t","n. 运动, 游戏, 娱乐, 消遣, 玩笑\\na. 运动的, 户外穿戴的\\nvi. 游戏, 参加体育运动, 戏弄, 产生变种\\nvt. 炫…",["Take this as friendly advice: I think you should do sport more often to keep yourself fit.","A winter sport that many people enjoy is ice skating."],["把它当成友好的建议，但我认为你应该多运动来保持你自己的体型和健康。","许多人爱好的一个冬季运动是溜冰。"]],["board","bɒ:d","n. 木板, 甲板, 膳食, 会议桌\\nvt. 乘船, 供膳食, 用板覆盖\\nvi. 搭伙\\n[计] 板",["She waved at me before she got on board the plane.","When children play Go, they use a 5-by-5 or 7-by-7 board."],["她上飞机前，给我招了招手。","孩子们下围棋，会使用5x5或者7x7的棋盘。"]],["seek","si:k","vt. 寻求, 寻找, 探索, 追求, 搜索, 请求\\nvi. 寻找, 搜索\\n[计] 查找",["Some people prefer conformity, while others seek novelty.","Shh! Don't make a sound. We are playing hide-and-seek now. If you want to talk, go find somewhere else to hide."],["有些人喜欢循规蹈矩，而有些人总喜欢寻求刺激。","Shh！不要出聲……我們現在捉迷藏，要搞的話快點找一個地方躲藏一邊了。"]],["per","pә:","prep. 每一, 通过, 经, 按照\\n[经] 每, 按照",["The new secretary types about 70 words per minute.","Fifty-two per cent of British women prefer chocolate to sex."],["新來的秘書一分鐘可以打七十幾個字。","有百分之五十二的英國女性喜歡巧克力勝於性。"]],["subject","'sʌbdʒekt","n. 科目, 主题, 臣民, 主语, 题目, (事物的)经受者, 学科, 受治疗者, 原因, 理由\\na. 服从的, 易患...的, 隶属…",["The first subject that attracted my attention was philosophy.","He is very much interested in Japanese history. We are surprised at his vast knowledge of the subject."],["第一個吸引我注意的科目是哲學。","他对日本的历史非常感兴趣。我们很惊讶他在这方面的丰富知识。"]],["officer","'ɒfisә","n. 军官, 主管, 官员, 公务员\\nvt. 指挥",["FSI officer: \"Sir, there is a website where ANYONE can add a sentence in a foreign language!\". FSI president: \"What?! Bomb them!\".","As everyone stood guard silently, someone ran to the corner of the street and called over a police officer."],["FSI人員:\"長官，有一個網站，任何人都可以加上一個外國語言的句子!\"。FSI主席:\"什麼? 炸掉他們!\"。","默默守护中，有人跑到街头，叫来了协警。"]],["private","'praivit","a. 私人的, 秘密的, 私立的, 隐蔽的\\nn. 士兵, 隐士, 阴部\\n[计] 私人的",["While some private and church schools in America have uniforms, they are not common.","My father is always poking his nose into my private life."],["雖然美國有些私立或教會學校有校服，但校服並不常見。","我的父亲总是干涉我的私生活。"]],["rest","rest","n. 休息, 睡眠, 安息, 稍息, 静止, 支架, 休息处, 其余者, 剩余部分\\nvi. 休息, 睡, 长眠, 安心, 静止, 停止,…",["When the sign on the door of a rest room says OCCUPIED, it means someone is using it.","The doctor insisted that the patient get plenty of rest."],["廁所門上的標示顯示「使用中」的時候，代表有人正在使用。","医生坚持病人获得充分的休息。"]],["deal","di:l","n. 交易, 协定, 数量, 买卖, 松木板\\nvi. 处理, 应付, 做生意\\nvt. 分配, 发牌, 给予\\n[计] 发牌",["On the one hand we suffered a heavy loss, but on the other hand we learned a great deal from the experience.","Japanese management must learn how to deal with American workers, he said."],["一方面我们虽然蒙受了损失，但另一方面我们从这次经验中学到了很多。","他说：“日本管理层必须学会如何处理美国员工。”"]],["performance","pә'fɒ:mәns","n. 施行, 工作情况, 成绩, 行为, 表现, 演出\\n[电] 绩效, 性能",["The infrastructure of an application is directly related to its overall performance.","This behavior shows a lack of respect for the performance."],["一个应用的架构直接关系到它的整体性能。","這種行為是對演出的不尊重。"]],["fight","fait","n. 打架, 争吵, 斗志\\nv. 对抗, 打架",["Jonathan was booked because he got into a fight with a player on the other team.","First they laugh at you, then they fight you, and then you win."],["乔纳森吃牌了，因为与对方球员打架。","首先他们嘲笑你，其次他们和你作战，然后你赢了。"]],["throw","θrәu","vt. 投, 掷, 抛, 发射, 摔下, 匆匆穿上(或脱下), 抛弃, 摆脱\\nvi. 丢, 掷, 抛\\nn. 投掷, 掷骰子, 冒险",["Don't throw away this magazine. I haven't read it yet.","Don't throw cigarette butts on the ground. Cockroaches might get cancer."],["这本杂志不要扔。我还没看呢。","別把菸頭往地上扔，要不然蟑螂會得癌症的。"]],["top","tɒp","n. 顶部, 顶端, 极点, 上面, 上部, 顶篷, 最高地位, 首位, 陀螺\\na. 最高的, 顶上的, 头等的\\nvt. 盖, 加以顶…",["Makoto found his true love on top of Ayers Rock. She's from Osaka.","She lost her way and on top of that it began to rain."],["誠在艾爾斯岩上找到了自己真正的愛情。她來自大阪。","她迷路了，紧接着天开始下雨了。"]],["quickly","'kwikli","adv. 很快地",["The body quickly adjusts itself to changes in temperature.","He quickly made friends with the new boy on the block."],["人體能夠快速地適應氣溫的轉變。","他很快便与小区里新来的男孩交上了朋友。"]],["past","pɑ:st","n. 过去, 昔时, 往事, 早年经历, 过去时\\na. 过去的, 结束的, 卸任的, 过去时的\\nprep. 越过, 晚于, 超越, 超…",["The past can only be known, not changed. The future can only be changed, not known.","Air quality has deteriorated these past few years."],["我們可以回顧過去，但不能改變過去；我們可以改變未來，但不能預知未來。","这些年空气质量恶化了。"]],["goal","gәul","n. 目标, 终点, 得分, 球门, 守门员\\nvi. 攻门, 射门得分",["Messi was very close to scoring a goal, but the referee blew his whistle to say that he was offside.","If you don't know what your goal is, you'll never be able to achieve it."],["梅西差一点就进球了，但裁判吹哨说他越位。","如果你不知道你的目标是什么，那么你永远不能完成它。"]],["bed","bed","n. 床, 睡眠处, 河床, 底座, 路基, 一层\\nvt. 提供宿处, 栽种, 安装\\nvi. 睡, 形成坚实的一层",["John stayed in bed all day instead of going to work.","It's close to ten o'clock. It's about time we went to bed."],["约翰一整天待在床上而没去工作。","已将近十点了。该是睡觉的时候了。"]],["order","'ɒ:dә","n. 次序, 规则, 命令\\nvi. 命令, 定货\\nvt. 整理, 命令, 定购\\nn. 顺序, 阶数\\n[计] 顺序, 阶数",["In order to avoid misunderstandings, they went through the contract again.","The British have a lot of respect for law and order."],["為了避免誤解，他們又過了一遍合同。","英國人很尊重法序和秩序。"]],["author","'ɒ:θә","n. 作家, 作家的著作, 创始人\\n[法] 作者, 著作人, 本人",["This author doesn't understand at all why a man and a woman who can't become lovers would become friends.","Don't write extra information, such as the name of the author, within the sentence."],["这个作者完全不懂为什么一对不能够成为恋人的男女会成为朋友。","在句子中不要写入额外信息，比如作者姓名。"]],["fill","fil","vt. 装满, 填充, 弥漫, 供给, 满足, 供应\\nvi. 充满, 变得沉重\\nn. 满足, 装满, 充分, 填方\\nvt. 填充\\n…",["Be sure to fill out the registration form in person.","Please fill out this form and wait for us to notify you."],["确保亲自填写注册表格。","请你把这张表填一下，等我们的通知。"]],["represent",".repri'zent","vt. 表现, 表示, 描绘, 讲述, 代表, 象征, 回忆, 再赠送, 再上演\\nvi. 提出异议",["I represent all of the students in the class when I thank you for the help that you've given us.","He was accredited to the United States to represent Japan."],["我代表全班同学谢谢你给我们的帮助。","他被任命为驻美日本大使。"]],["focus","'fәukәs","n. 焦点, 焦距\\nvi. 聚焦, 注视\\nvt. 使聚焦, 调焦, 集中\\n[计] 焦点",["Although people like to focus on the differences, I think that on the whole it's the same.","These days many young people work without much focus; my friend's son hadn't gone two years after graduating before he'd changed jobs five times."],["虽然人们喜欢集中于不同的方面，但是我认为大部分的差不多。","现在许多年轻人工作都不太安分，朋友的儿子大学毕业不到两年，已经换了五个工作了。"]],["foreign","'fɒ:rin","a. 外国的, 外交的, 外省的, 外来的, 不相关的\\n[机] 外来的",["The Foreign Minister said that war was inevitable.","You seem to be prejudiced against ideas that come from foreign countries."],["外交部长称战争在所难免。","你似乎對來自國外的想法有偏見。"]],["drop","drɒp","n. 滴, 微量, 落下, 空投\\nvi. 放下, 掉下, 下降\\nvt. 使滴下, 放下, 丢失, 遗漏\\n[计] 投入, 投入点, 接…",["Be sure to drop us a line as soon as you get to London.","Put this stamp on the postcard and drop it in the mailbox."],["别忘了一到伦敦就给我们留言啊。","把这张邮票贴在明信片上，然后投到邮箱里。"]],["blood","blʌd","n. 血, 血统, 流血, 气质, 生命\\nvt. 使出血, 用血涂",["A relationship between blood group and personality has not been scientifically proven.","At first the forensics team thought that they'd discovered human blood, only to find out later, at the lab, that it was bovine."],["科学上，血型和性格的关联性没有被证明。","一开始法医团队以为他们发现了人血，但后来才在实验室里发现这原来是牛血。"]],["upon","ә'pɒn","prep. 在...之上, 迫近, 紧接着",["The taste of wine is largely dependent upon the weather.","While we were discussing the problem, I hit upon a good idea."],["葡萄酒的味道很受天氣影響。","在我们讨论问题的过程中，我想到了一个好主意。"]],["agency","'eidʒәnsi","n. 代理机构, 经销商, 中介\\n[化] 办事处",["The basic job of an advertising agency is to figure out how to turn a desire into a need.","The car rental agency provided excellent customer service."],["廣告商最基本的工作就是把人的慾望轉化成需要。","這家汽車租賃公司提供了優質的客服業務。"]],["push","puʃ","n. 推, 推动, 奋斗, 攻击, 进取心\\nvt. 推, 推动, 使伸出, 推行, 逼迫, 增加\\nvi. 推, 推进, 增加, 努力争取",["There are too many push notifications, so I turned them off in the settings.","All you have to do is push this button to take a picture."],["推送通知太多了，我在設定裡關掉了。","你要做的就是按这个按钮拍照。"]],["nature","'neitʃә","n. 自然, 大自然, 本性, 性格, 性质\\n[医] 自然, 大自然; 本性, 性能",["The truth and simplicity of nature is always the most important foundation of noteworthy art.","We'll be going outside to observe nature for this. Thus, a good pencil, eraser, and possibly a paint brush are required."],["大自然的真实和质朴往往是值得注意的艺术中最重要的基石。","我们将要到室外去观察大自然。因此，一支好的笔，橡皮和大概一支画笔是必需的。"]],["color","'kʌlә","n. 颜色, 面色, 颜料, 外貌\\nvt. 把...涂上颜色, 粉饰, 使脸红, 歪曲\\nvi. 变色",["Tom and Mary even always wear the same color clothes.","This tie has a more vibrant color and goes better with this suit."],["汤姆和玛丽甚至经常穿同样颜色的衣服。","这条领带颜色亮一点，跟这件西装比较配。"]],["recently","'ri:sntli","adv. 最近",["The room hasn't been cleaned recently, so it now has a foul aroma.","Recently, there's been a lot of talk about distance education."],["这个房间最近都没打扫过，有一股臭味。","近來有許多關於遠距教學的討論。"]],["store","stɒ:","n. 商店, 贮藏, 仓库, 备用品, 存储器\\nvt. 储存, 贮藏, 供给\\nvi. 贮藏\\na. 贮藏的, 现成的\\n[计] 存储器…",["The store sells foodstuffs, such as butter, cheese, and sugar.","Bob worked as a clerk in the grocery store on Saturday."],["這家店賣黃油、奶酪、砂糖之類的食品。","每周六鲍勃在杂货店做店员。"]],["reduce","ri'dju:s","vt. 减少, 分解, 降低, 使衰退, 把...分解, 把...归纳\\nvi. 减少, 减肥, 缩小\\n[计] 缩小",["We must make the utmost effort to reduce the use of plastic packaging, and also to recycle all waste plastic.","By switching your lover from 3D to 2D, you may successfully reduce all social-interaction-related costs."],["我们应该尽我们最大的努力减少塑料包装的使用，并回收所有的塑料废物。","把恋人从3D换成2D可以有效地降低交际所需的费用。"]],["sound","saund","n. 声音, 语音, 吵闹, 声调, 听力范围, 探条, 海峡\\na. 健全的, 可靠的, 合理的, 健康的, 彻底的, 资金充实的\\na…",["It might sound far-fetched, but this is a real problem.","Without air there can be no wind or sound on the moon."],["这可能听起来牵强，但却是个真实的问题。","月球表面沒有空氣，所以沒有風，也沒有聲音。"]],["note","nәut","n. 笔记, 记录, 注解, 票据, 符号, 显要, 注重, 便笺, 照会\\nvt. 记录, 注解, 注意",["I noticed a note on my desk, but I do not know who wrote it.","I noticed a note on my desk, but I don't know who wrote it."],["我發現了我辦公桌上有張字條, 但是我不知道是誰寫的。","我發現了我辦公桌上有張字條, 但是我不知道是誰寫的。"]],["fine","fain","n. 罚款, 罚金, 晴天, 精细\\na. 好的, 晴朗的, 健康的, 细小的, 精细的\\nvt. 罚款, 精炼, 澄清\\nvi. 变清,…",["They say fine words are no virtue if they're insincere and that's him in a nutshell. He's all talk but doesn't mean a word of it.","You can get a fine view of the sea from the mountaintop."],["「巧言令色，鮮矣仁」這句說話，用來形容他最適合不過了。他說的話，沒有一句是有誠意的。","從山頂上可以欣賞到秀麗的海景。"]],["near","niә","a. 近的, 近亲的, 近似的\\nadv. 接近, 亲近\\nprep. 靠近, 近似于\\nv. 接近, 走近",["I really look forward to your visit in the near future.","In the near future, we may have a big earthquake in Japan."],["我很期待在不久的將來您的光臨。","在不久的将来，可能有一场大地震将在日本发生。"]],["movement","'mu:vmәnt","n. 运动, 动作, 运转, 移动, 倾向, 变化, 活动, 乐章\\n[医] 运动",["This movement from rural to urban areas has been going on for over two hundred years.","Your son took part in the student movement, I hear."],["在這二百年來，有很多人從農村搬到了市區居住。","聽說你兒子參與了學生運動。"]],["page","peidʒ","n. 页, 记录, 事件, 专栏, 男侍\\nvt. 标明...的页数, 翻...的书页, 分页排版, 呼叫, 侍候\\nvi. 翻书页, 侍…",["More than 90 percent of visits to a web page are from search engines.","The world is a book, and those who do not travel read only a page."],["一个网页超过百分之九十的访问量是来自于搜索引擎的。","世界是本书，不旅游的人只看了一页。"]],["enter","'entә","vt. 进入, 参加, 开始, 输入, 回车\\nvi. 进去, 参加\\n[计] 输入, 回车",["He walked back and forth in front of the door, hesitating to enter.","To purchase a ticket, you need to enter your personal details."],["他在門前走來走去，不知道該不該進去。","你要先輸入好個人資料，然後才能買票。"]],["common","'kɒmәn","a. 通常的, 共同的, 通俗的, 公共的\\n[计] 公用块",["The swimming pool is used in common by all the children in the neighborhood.","Religion is regarded by the common people as true, by the wise as false, and by the rulers as useful."],["游泳池由住在附近的孩子们共同使用。","宗教在一般人的眼中是真理，在智者的眼中是謊言，而在統治者的眼中則是一種工具。"]],["share","ʃєә","n. 部分, 参与, 一份, 参股, 份额\\nvt. 均分, 分担, 分享, 分配, 共有\\nvi. 分享\\n[计] 共享; DOS外部命…",["I don't want to share the hotel room with a stranger.","Canada and Mexico both share a border with the USA."],["我不想和一个陌生人分享旅馆房间。","加拿大和墨西哥跟美国分享一个国境。"]],["poor","puә. pɒ:","a. 贫穷的, 贫乏的, 不幸的, 可怜的, 拙劣的, 卑鄙的\\n[经] 低劣的, 不良的",["Poor is not the one who has too little, but the one who wants too much.","He managed to pass his driving test even though he was a poor driver."],["贫穷的不是拥有太少的人，而是想要太多的人。","他的駕駛技術很差，但也勉強通過了駕駛考試。"]],["natural","'nætʃәrәl","n. 白痴\\na. 自然的, 自然界的, 本能的, 天然的, 物质的, 正常的, 原始的, 自然数的",["The United States is abundant in natural resources.","The natural sciences are harder than the social sciences."],["美国的自然资源很丰富。","理科比文科难。"]],["race","reis","n. 种族, 人种, 赛跑, 比赛, 急流, 人类, 同道, 姜根\\nvi. 赛跑, 竞赛, 疾走\\nvt. 与...赛跑, 使疾走, 使…",["Discriminating against people because of their race is a mistake.","One hundred and fifty people entered the marathon race."],["因为人的种族而歧视他们是一种错误。","150个人参加了马拉松比赛。"]],["concern","kәn'sә:n","n. 关心, 忧虑\\nvt. 与...有关, 使担心, 使挂念",["This new project in Java doesn't concern me at all, because I'm a PHP developer.","Tom always meddles in affairs that do not concern him."],["这个新的Java项目完全与我无关，因为我是一个PHP程序员。","汤姆总是多管闲事。"]],["series","'siәri:z","n. 串联, 序列, 连续, 系列, 丛书, 套, 级数, 组\\n[计] 系列",["He has just published an interesting series of articles.","A series of blasts reduced the laboratory to ruins."],["他刚发表一系列有趣的文章。","一连串的爆炸使实验室成为废墟。"]],["significant","sig'nifikәnt","a. 重要的, 有效的, 有含义的, 暗示的, 值得注意的",["As everyone knows, today is a very significant day for us.","Life is like a marathon, where short-term gains and losses are not significant in and of themselves."],["大家知道，今天对我们来说是一个很有意义的日子。","人生是一次长跑，暂时的落后和领先都不算什么。"]],["similar","'similә","a. 相似的, 类似的\\nn. 相似的东西",["The climate of England is similar to that of Hokkaido.","We can find similar situations in these next few cases."],["英國的氣候和北海道很相似。","同樣的情況我們還能在下面這幾個例子中找到。"]],["hot","hɒt","a. 热的, 热心的, 辣的, 热情的, 激动的, 猛烈的, 紧迫的\\nadv. 热, 紧迫地",["It is extremely hot and humid in Bali in December.","It was so hot that I got into the shade and took a rest."],["12月份巴厘岛极其炎热和潮湿。","因為天氣很熱，所以我就走到陰涼的地方歇了一會兒。"]],["language","'læŋgwidʒ","n. 语言, 文字, 措辞\\n[计] 语言",["Mastering a foreign language involves a lot of patience.","English is spoken by more people than any other language."],["学好一门外语需要坚韧不拔的毅力。","說英語的人比說任何其他語言的人多。"]],["usually","'ju:ʒuәli","adv. 通常, 大抵",["The President is usually accompanied by his wife when he goes abroad.","Visitors are usually asked to remove their shoes before they enter a Japanese house."],["總統出國通常有妻子陪伴。","访客通常在进入一户日本人家之前会被要求脱鞋。"]],["response","ri'spɒns","n. 反应, 回答, 响应\\n[计] 应答",["Too bad I didn't wait for your response before I added the sentences.","She made no response to my question."],["我没在等到你的回应之前添加了句子，真是糟糕。","她沒有回答我的問題。"]],["dead","ded","a. 死的, 不活泼的, 麻木的, 熄灭的\\nn. 死者\\nadv. 完全地, 直接地",["A woman brought an old picture of her dead husband, wearing a hat, to the photographer.","To fear love is to fear life, and those who fear life are already three parts dead."],["一個女人帶了一張她去世的丈夫的舊照片給攝影師，照片中她的丈夫戴著一頂帽子。","惧怕爱就是惧怕生活，那些惧怕生活的人已经有四分之三部分死了。"]],["rise","raiz","n. 上升, 增加, 上涨, 高地, 升高, 出现\\nvi. 升起, 起身, 起立, 上升, 上涨, 增长, 高耸, 起义, 浮现\\nvt…",["Even if the sun were to rise in the west, I would not change my mind.","First of all, the level of the ocean could rise, because ocean water expands as it grows warmer."],["即使太阳从西边出来，我也不会改变主意。","首先，因为海水变热时膨胀，海平面可能提高。"]],["animal","'ænimәl","n. 动物\\n[医] 动物",["Life in prison is worse than the life of an animal.","On a fundamental level, the 12 forms of the Chinese zodiac are related to animal worship."],["监狱生活比做畜牲还不如。","從根本上說，十二生肖的形成，與動物崇拜有關。"]],["factor","'fæktә","n. 因素, 因数, 系数, 基因, 代理人\\n[计] 因式",["Another factor to be taken into consideration is that the present situation is favourable to us.","When applying to American universities, your TOEFL score is only one factor."],["将要考虑的另一个重要因素是，目前的情况对我们有利。","当您登记美国大学时，您考TOEFL获得的分数只是所选因素的其中一个。"]],["tv","'ti:'vi:","电视\\n[计] 电视, 转移向量",["This TV was made ten years ago and there are no parts available, so it is impossible to repair it.","I had words with the manager of that store, because he refused to refund my money for the TV set that wasn't operating properly."],["這台電視機是十年前製造的, 現在已經沒有零件可換, 所以要修理它是不可能的事了。","我找商店经理谈了话，因为他拒绝为那不能用的电视退钱。"]],["decade","'dekeid","n. 十年, 十",["We have experienced many changes over the last decade.","China has had the fastest economic growth rate in the world in the last decade."],["我们最近十年经历了很多变化。",""]],["article","'ɑ:tikl","n. 文章, 冠词, 物品, 物件, 条款, 契约\\n[计] 信件",["Excuse me; allow me to point out three errors in the above article.","The news article painted the defendant as a guilty man, even though he had been proven innocent."],["抱歉，请允许我指出上文中的三个错误。","该报文章中将被告人描述成一个罪魁祸首，尽管他已经被证明是无辜的了。"]],["shoot","ʃu:t","n. 射击, 狩猎, 芽, 射伤, 发射, 发芽, 急流, 推力, 摄影, 急送, 滑运道, 浪费\\nvt. 射击, 射中, 损毁, 拍摄…",["The players made a wall as Lionel Messi went to shoot.","Don't shoot the devil in the back. You might miss."],["当里奥梅西射门时，球员们筑起一道人墙。","别射撒旦的背部。你可能会射不中。"]],["east","i:st","n. 东方, 东\\na. 东方的, 向东的\\nadv. 向东方, 朝东方",["The fire burnt down four houses in the east of the city.","Aristocrats lived to the east and west of the imperial palace."],["火灾把位于市区东部的四栋房屋全烧光了。","贵族住在故宫的东边和西边。"]],["seven","'sevn","num. 七, 七个",["Light travels around the earth seven and a half times a second.","My train started at seven, arrived in New York at 10."],["光一秒鐘能夠環繞地球七圈半。","我乘的火车7点出发，10点到了纽约。"]],["save","seiv","n. 救球\\nvt. 解救, 挽救, 储蓄, 保存, 节省, 保留\\nvi. 挽救, 节省, 救球\\nprep. 除...之外\\n[计] …",["In the long run, we can save a lot of money by buying this machine.","He pinched and scraped for many years to save money."],["長遠來說，我們買了這台機器可以省回很多錢。","為了存錢，他省吃儉用了許多年。"]],["artist","'ɑ:tist","n. 艺术家, 画家",["A friend of mine commissioned a well-known artist to paint a portrait of his wife.","Making a living as a manga artist is almost impossible."],["我的一箇朋友請了箇著名畫家給妻子畫肖像。","以漫画家谋生几乎不可能。"]],["scene","si:n","n. 场, 情景, 镜头, 发生地点, 道具, 布景, 景色\\n[化] 现场",["The burglar was traced by one of the things she had left on the scene.","The burglar was traced by one of the things he had left on the scene."],["警方根據現場遺下的證物把賊子找了出來。","警方根據現場遺下的證物把賊子找了出來。"]],["eight","eit","num. 八, 八个",["Her grandmother lived to be eighty-eight years old.","Let's meet at the station at eight tomorrow morning."],["她的祖母活到了八十八歲。","明早八点车站见。"]],["stock","stɒk","n. 树干, 祖先, 血统, 原料, 备料, 库存, 牲畜, 股票, 股份, 保留剧目\\na. 存货的, 常备的, 平凡的, 普通的, 股…",["My father is very much involved in the stock market now.","The NYSE is one of the largest stock exchanges in the world."],["我爸爸现在非常专注于股市。","纽约证券交易所是世界上最大的证券交易所之一。"]],["career","kә'riә","n. 事业, 生涯, 成功\\n[法] 职业, 专业, 履历",["She seems to devote all her effects to her career.","He always kept an open mind about his future career."],["她似乎把自己所有的精力都投入到了事业上。","他一直都对他的未来事业保持着开明的心态。"]],["despite","di'spait","n. 轻视, 憎恨\\nprep. 虽然, 尽管",["The patient, despite having taken the new medication, didn't feel any better.","Despite Trang's constant affirmations of love, Spenser is still afraid someday she will fall out of love with him."],["病人吃了新药后没觉得好些了。","儘管莊不斷發誓她不變的愛情，斯賓塞仍然害怕有一天她會不愛他了。"]],["central","'sentrәl","a. 中央的, 重要的\\n[医] 中央的, 中心的, 中枢的",["Kazakhstan is the largest country in Central Asia.","Most large galaxies have a central supermassive black hole."],["哈薩克是中亞最大的國家。","大多数大星系的中心都有一个超大质量黑洞。"]],["thus","ðʌs","adv. 如此, 因此, 到如此程度\\n[医] 乳香",["The more cheese, the more holes. The more holes, the less cheese. Thus: The more cheese, the less cheese.","We'll be going outside to observe nature for this. Thus, a good pencil, eraser, and possibly a paint brush are required."],["越多奶酪越多洞。洞越多則奶酪越少。因此: 奶酪越多就越少奶酪。","我们将要到室外去观察大自然。因此，一支好的笔，橡皮和大概一支画笔是必需的。"]],["treatment","'tri:tmәnt","n. 治疗, 待遇, 处理\\n[医] 疗法, 治疗; 处理",["Preventive measures are much more effective than the actual treatment.","The company medical treatment insurance covered all the medical treatment costs."],["预防措施比真正的治疗更有效。","公司的医疗保险覆盖了全部的医疗费用。"]],["beyond","bi'jɒnd","prep. 超过, 在那一边, 迟于\\nadv. 在远处\\nn. 更远处",["Have you ever seen Mt. Fuji? It is beautiful beyond description.","Russell was a brilliant philosopher, but even the simplest practical task was quite beyond him."],["你看過富士山嗎? 它美得無法形容。","羅素是一個極出色的哲學家，可是他對日常生活中的事務卻是一竅不通。"]],["happy","'hæpi","a. 快乐的, 幸福的, 愉快的, 恰当的",["All happy families resemble each other, each unhappy family is unhappy in its own way.","He endeavored to make his wife happy, but in vain."],["幸福家庭的幸福原因全都大同小異，但悲慘的家庭卻往往各自有各自的慘法。","他試著想讓他妻子開心，但是沒有成功。"]],["exactly","i^'zæktli","adv. 确切地, 精确地, 恰好, 完全地, 确实, 恰恰正是, 确实如此",["However much advice we give him, he still does exactly what he wants.","You can search words, and get translations. But it's not exactly a typical dictionary."],["即使我們給他提了很多建議，他還是做了他想做的。","你们可以搜索词并得到翻译。但这真不是一本寻常的字典。"]],["protect","prә'tekt","vt. 防卫, 保护, 警戒\\n[法] 庇护, 保护, 警戒",["We should tell children how to protect themselves.","It is the duty of every patriot to protect his country from its government."],["我们应该告诉孩子怎么保护自己。","爱国者的责任就是保护国家不受政府侵犯。"]],["approach","ә'prәutʃ","n. 接近, 入门\\nvt. 接近, 近似, 找...商量\\nvi. 靠近",["With the approach of Christmas, business improved somewhat.","He's turning red, because he doesn't know how to approach her."],["聖誕節快到了，生意也好了點。","他脸红了，不知该怎么接近她。"]],["lie","lai","n. 谎言, 假象, 位置\\nvi. 躺着, 说谎, 位于, 展现, 存在, 停泊\\nvt. 谎骗",["The lie got him in trouble when his boss found out the truth.","You look pale. You had better lie down in bed at once."],["当他的上司察觉他的谎言，麻烦来了。","你看上去很苍白。你最好立刻去床上躺会儿。"]],["size","saiz","n. 大小, 尺寸, 规模, 尺码, 能力, 浆料\\nvt. 上浆, 依大小排列\\nvi. 可比拟\\na. 一定大小的, 一定尺寸的",["To date nobody knows the actual size of the cosmos.","We've got it in your size, but not in that colour."],["宇宙的實際大小至今無人知道。","我们有你的尺寸，但是没有那个颜色。"]],["dog","dɒg","n. 狗, 坏蛋\\nvt. 跟踪, 尾随",["Don't worry about my dog. He won't do you any harm.","I have a cat and a dog. The cat is black and the dog is white."],["不要担心我的狗，它不会伤害你。","我養了一隻貓和一隻狗。貓是黑色的，狗是白色的。"]],["fund","fʌnd","n. 基金, 资金, 存款, 财源, 贮藏\\nvt. 提供资金, 积累",["Lobbyists for the bill funneled bribes into a campaign fund.","The money was put into a special fund to buy books for the school library."],["該法案的說客把遊說賄款匯入了競選基金。",""]],["serious","'siәriәs","a. 严肃的, 认真的, 重要的, 严重的\\n[电] 严重的",["You have only to read this article to see how serious the accident was.","The factory waste gave rise to serious environmental pollution."],["你只要讀讀這篇文章，就能知道那意外有多嚴重。","工厂的废料导致了严重的环境污染。"]],["occur","ә'kә:","vi. 发生, 被想到, 存在",["Traffic accidents are likely to occur on rainy days.","According to some scholars, a major earthquake could occur at any moment now."],["下雨天容易發生交通事故。","据一些学者称，现在可能随时发生一场特大地震。"]],["media","'mi:diә","n. 媒体\\n[计] 媒质",["When I try to listen to music with media player there's an error and I can't play the file.","Concerning this issue, I feel that the trash media only report biased information."],["我想用媒體播放器聽音樂，卻出現了錯誤訊息，不能播放。","关于这个问题，我觉得垃圾媒体只报道了很片面的信息。"]],["ready","'redi","n. 预备好的状态, 现款\\na. 准备好的, 备用的, 可以使用的\\nadv. 预先, 迅速\\nvt. 使准备好",["It will take five to ten years for the technology to be ready.","Dinner is probably ready, so we had better hurry home."],["在科技准备好之前需要五到十年。","晚飯大概已經準備好了，我們還是快點回家吧。"]],["sign","sain","n. 符号, 招牌, 征兆, 正负号, 手势\\nvt. 签名, 打手势表达\\nvi. 签名\\n[计] 正负号; 符号; 符号字符",["To have doubts about oneself is the first sign of intelligence.","He put a Closed sign on the front door of the store."],["自我怀疑是聪明的第一标志。","他在店子的正門上掛上了一個「休息」的牌子。"]],["thought","θɒ:t","n. 想法, 思想, 思维, 关心, 挂念\\nthink的过去式和过去分词",["The last person I told my idea to thought I was nuts.","I never thought he was capable of doing something so cruel."],["最后一个听我说我的主意的人认为我疯了。","我从来没想到他能做到那么残忍的事。"]],["list","list","n. 目录, 名单, 明细表, 布条, 条纹, 列表, 序列, 数据清单\\nvt. 列出, 列于表上, 记入名单内, 装布条\\nvi. 列…",["Read the list we sent you and check that all the sentences sound natural to you.","Let's find sentences with new vocabulary on this topic, add them to the following list: _____; and translate them."],["请把发给你的那张单子看一下，再确认一下所有的句子都很通顺。","讓我們找關於這一主題有新單字的句子，將其添加到下面的列表：_____;並翻譯它們。"]],["individual",".indi'vidʒuәl","n. 人, 个人, 个体\\na. 个别的, 个人的, 独特的",["Don't generalize individual behavior to an entire group.","She had an individual style of speaking."],["不要把个人行为上升到集体。","她说话有自己的风格。"]],["simple","'simpl","a. 简单的, 普通的, 朴素的, 单纯的, 绝对的, 初级的, 原始的, 迟钝的\\nn. 出身低微者, 傻子",["Because it is written in simple English even a child can understand it.","The job looked quite simple, but it took me a week."],["因為這是用簡單的英語寫的，所以甚至連孩子都能理解。","這份工作看起來很簡單，但它花了我一個星期。"]],["quality","'kwɒlәti","n. 品质, 特性, 才能, 质量\\na. 优质的\\n[计] 品质",["I'd gladly pay more for something if it's of high quality.","Air quality has deteriorated these past few years."],["如果它是高品質的東西我會很樂意多付一點錢。","这些年空气质量恶化了。"]],["pressure","'preʃә","n. 压, 榨, 按, 强制, 压力, 压迫, 压强\\nvt. 迫使, 使增压, 密封",["When the pressure is lower, the boiling point is lower.","Maybe it's the low air pressure that means you get drunk more easily on planes."],["压力低了，沸点就低。","也許這是低氣壓，這意味著你在飛機上更容易喝醉。"]],["accept","әk'sept","vt. 接受, 承认, 同意, 相信, 赞成, 承担, 承兑, 采纳, 接纳, 容忍\\nvi. 同意",["Tom says that Mary definitely won't accept the job.","People will accept your idea much more readily if you tell them Benjamin Franklin said it first."],["湯姆說瑪麗絕不會接受這工作。","如果你告訴他們富蘭克林是第一個這麼說的, 人們會更樂意接受你的想法。"]],["answer","'ɑ:nsә","n. 答案, 回答, 回报, 答辩\\nvt. 回答, 反驳, 适应, 响应, 符合\\nvi. 回答, 答应, 负责, 符合, 成功\\n[计…",["The more difficult the questions are, the less likely I'll be able to answer them.","You mustn't answer your mother back when she scolds you."],["問題愈難，我懂得回答的機會就愈低。","給母親責罵的時候不要回嘴。"]],["resource","ri'sɒ:s","n. 资源, 财力, 办法, 策略, 急智, 消遣\\n[计] 资源",["The one resource more precious than any other was land.","The only thing that is more precious than any resource is land."],["唯一比无论什么资源都珍贵的是土地。","唯一比什么资源都珍贵的是土地。"]],["identify","ai'dentifai","vt. 识别, 认为...等同于, 确定, 使参与\\nvi. 一致, 认同",["You can identify children's voices without any problem.","Some people identify success with having much money."],["你可以毫无问题地辨别孩子们的声音。",""]],["left","left","a. 左边的, 左倾的, 左侧的, 左派的\\nadv. 在左面\\nn. 左, 左面, 左派\\nleave的过去式和过去分词",["The burglar was traced by one of the things he had left on the scene.","I had hardly left home when it began to rain heavily."],["警方根據現場遺下的證物把賊子找了出來。","當雨開始下得很大的時候, 我幾乎不能出門了。"]],["meeting","'mi:tiŋ","n. 会议, 会面\\n[法] 会议, 会谈, 集会",["Her absence went unnoticed until the end of the meeting.","Owing to the rain, the athletic meeting was put off."],["直到会议结束之前都没人注意到她不在。","運動會因為下雨延後了。"]],["determine","di'tә:min","v. 决定, 决心",["Not material, but spiritual things determine our life.","When people meet, first impressions determine more than 50 percent of whatever happens next."],["我们的生活不是由物质，而是由精神来决定的。","在人际交往中，第一印象决定着将要发生的事情内容的百分之五十以上。"]],["prepare","pri'pєә","vt. 准备, 筹备, 使在思想上有准备, 制造, 调制\\nvi. 预备",["Tom said that school did little to prepare him for life.","Every morning she helps her mother to prepare breakfast in the kitchen."],["湯姆說學校並沒有讓他為人生做好準備。","她每天早上都帮母亲在厨房准备早餐。"]],["disease","di'zi:z","n. 疾病, 弊病\\n[医] [疾]病",["Several thousand people became victims of this disease.","They watched her gradually weaken as the disease progressed."],["数千人受此疾病所害。","他们观察到她随著病情变化身体也渐渐衰弱下去。"]],["whatever","hwɒt'evә","pron. 无论什么",["When people meet, first impressions determine more than 50 percent of whatever happens next.","That's not what I mean. Sex discrimination, female discrimination, whatever, men and women are just different."],["在人际交往中，第一印象决定着将要发生的事情内容的百分之五十以上。","我不是这个意思。性别歧视，女性歧视，不管怎样，男人和女人都是不同的。"]],["success","sәk'ses","n. 成功, 成就, 胜利",["It was difficult for him to hide his pride in his success.","He owes his success both to working hard and to good luck."],["他很难掩饰对自己成功的骄傲。","他的成功要归结于他的辛勤工作和好运气。"]],["argue","'ɑ:gju","vi. 提出理由, 争论, 辩论\\nvt. 主张, 辩论, 证明, 说服",["Don't argue with an idiot, or else people might not be sure which of you is really the idiot.","No need to argue, there is nothing that only has bad effects and no benefits."],["不要同一個傻瓜爭辯、否則別人會搞不清到底誰是傻瓜。","不必爭,沒有事情是只有壞處而沒有好處的."]],["recognize","'rekәgnaiz","vt. 认出, 认可, 承认, 公认, 识别, 赏识\\nvi. 承认, 具结",["He wore a mask so that no one could recognize him.","Tom was so drunk that he didn't even recognize me."],["他戴著面具以至於沒有人認出他。","汤姆醉得连我都认不出来了。"]],["cup","kʌp","n. 杯子, 茶杯, 优胜杯\\nvt. 使成杯状, 为...拔火罐",["Let's go drink a cup of coffee at that coffee shop over there.","No one is working. Everyone's watching the World Cup."],["我們去那間咖啡店喝杯咖啡吧。","谁也不工作。大家在看世界杯。"]],["particularly","pә'tikjjlәli","adv. 特别, 格外, 尤其, 详细地, 细致地",["The clothes at this boutique are particularly expensive.","His painting wasn't particularly good, so no one praised him for it."],["这家精品店的服装卖得很贵.","他的畫畫得並不是很好，所以沒有獲得人們的讚賞。"]],["amount","ә'maunt","n. 总数, 总额\\nvi. 总计, 等同",["A considerable amount of time and effort have been spent already.","The amount of time someone is willing to spend on something may communicate how important it is to him."],["已經花費了很多的時間和精力。","從一個人在某件事上肯花多少時間，就能看出這件事對這個人有多重要。"]],["ability","ә'biliti","n. 能力, 才干\\n[经] 能力, 才能",["The average man fails not because he lacks ability, but because he lacks ability to concentrate.","Blind people sometimes develop a compensatory ability to sense the proximity of objects around them."],["通常人们失败并非能力不足，而是不够专注。","某些失明者会产生一个弥补性的能力，这个能力让他们察觉到他们与离他们很近的物体的距离。"]],["staff","stɑ:f","n. 全体人员, 工作班子, 棍棒, 杆, 拐杖, 支柱, 权杖\\na. 职员的, 雇员的, 参谋的\\nvt. 为...配备人员",["The entire sales staff has worked around the clock for a week.","The staff in this shop are really friendly. It's no wonder they've got so much custom."],["全体销售人员通宵达旦地工作了一周。","这家商店人员的态度特好，怪不得顾客也好多。"]],["indicate","'indikeit","vt. 显示, 象征, 指示, 指出\\n[医] 指示",["They express disagreement by shaking their heads, which may indicate agreement in other countries.","I took his not coming to indicate that he wasn't interested."],["他们以摇头表示不同意，而其他国家的人可能以摇头表示同意。","我將他的缺席視為沒有興趣。"]],["character","'kærәktә","n. 个性, 字符, 人物, 性质, 品格, 资格\\n[计] 字符",["If you have no character to lose, people will have no faith in you.","His failure seems to have something to do with his character."],["如果你没有尝试过失败的角色，那么人们也就不会相信你。","他的失败好似和他的性格有什么关系。"]],["growth","grәuθ","n. 生长, 栽培, 增长\\n[计] 等比级数",["The third quarter GNP growth was 1% over the preceding quarter.","More money for education will spur economic growth."],["第三季國民生產總值較上一季成長了1％。","更多投資在教育的錢將會刺激經濟成長。"]],["loss","lɒs","n. 损失, 遗失, 失败, 输, 错过, 伤亡\\n[化] 损失; 损耗",["She was at a loss for words to express her feeling.","The company suffered a loss of one billion yen last year."],["她已经无法用语言表达她的感觉了。","那家公司去年亏损了10亿日元。"]],["degree","di'gri:","n. 程度, 度数, 学位, 度\\n[医] 度, 程度",["The degree to which it had been modernised far exceeded my expectations.","All social interactions, naturally, will involve some degree of insincerity, which I believe is necessary."],["它現代化的程度遠遠超乎我的預料。","所有的社交，自然而然地，都会掺入一些虚伪的成分，我想这是有其必要的。"]],["wonder","'wʌndә","n. 奇迹, 惊奇, 惊愕\\nvt. 惊奇, 想知道\\nvi. 惊讶, 怀疑",["I can only wonder if this is the same for everyone else.","I wonder whether man could live with only two hours' sleep a night."],["我只能问自己这对其他所有人是不是一回事呢。","不知道人每晚只睡兩個小時，能不能生存下去呢？"]],["attack","ә'tæk","n. 攻击, 抨击\\nvt. 攻击, 抨击, 动手干\\nvi. 攻击",["Wolves won't usually attack people.","The enemy made a strong attack on that building."],["一般來說，狼不會攻擊人。","敵人對那棟建築物使出了強力攻擊。"]],["herself","hә:'self","pron. 她自己, 她亲自",["Though she wished to travel abroad by herself, she thought better of it.","After retirement, Teresa devoted herself to caring for orphans."],["儘管她想過一個人去國外旅行，她改變了主意。","退休後，德蕾莎投身照顧孤兒的工作。"]],["region","'ri:dʒәn","n. 区域, 地带, 地区, 领域, 范围, 区\\n[计] 区, 区域",["Pollution has a disastrous effect on the ecology of a region.","There still aren't any highways in this mountain region. All goods are transported on the backs of people and horses."],["環境污染可以對一個區域的生態造成極大的影響。","那多山地区还没有高速路。所有货运被驮在人的背上或在马的背上。"]],["television","'teli.viʒәn","n. 电视\\n[电] 电视",["It cost me ten thousand yen to have my television set repaired.","Thanks to television, boys and girls are apt to neglect reading books."],["把我的電視機修好花了我一萬日元。","拜電視所賜，現在的小孩都不喜歡看書了。"]],["box","bɒks","n. 盒子, 箱, 方框, 一巴掌\\nvt. 装...入盒中, 装箱, 打耳光\\nvi. 拳击\\n[计] 方框",["The boy gathered a handful of peanuts and put them in a small box.","He shared his box of biscuits with all his friends."],["男孩收集了一把花生，然後把它們放到了一個小箱子裏。","他和他所有的朋友分享了他的那盒饼干。"]],["training","'treiniŋ","n. 训练, 培养\\n[医] 训练",["The Fuzhou Zoo in China's Fujian Province has done more than its counterparts in training pandas.","No matter how hard the training was, she never cried."],["中国福建省福州市动物园在训练大熊猫方面做得比它的同行多。","不管训练多么艰苦，她都没有哭过。"]],["pretty","'priti","a. 漂亮的, 优美的, 机灵的, 狡猾的, 恰当的\\nadv. 相当, 颇",["If her nose were a little shorter, she would be quite pretty.","She's smarter than Mary, but she's not as pretty as Mary."],["若她的姿態能再低一點就更完美了。","她比玛丽聪明，但她却没玛丽漂亮。"]],["everybody","'evribɒdi","pron. 每个人, 人人",["Bob is such a nice person that everybody likes him.","Everybody knows for a fact that he is still alive."],["鲍勃是个很好的人，大家都很喜欢他。","誰都知道他現在還在人世。"]],["trade","treid","n. 贸易, 商业, 交易, 生意, 职业, 顾客, 信风\\nvi. 进行交易, 做买卖, 经商, 对换, 购物\\nvt. 用...进行交换",["A free-trade agreement between Europe and the United States is currently under negotiation.","My father has been engaged in foreign trade for many years."],["歐洲和美國的一份自由貿易協定正在商議中。","我父亲经营外贸多年。"]],["election","i'lekʃәn","n. 选举, 当选, 选择权\\n[法] 选举, 当选",["American politics are interesting to watch, especially during a presidential election.","Mr. Sato asked me many questions about the election."],["美国的政治看起来很有趣，特别是在选举总统期间。","佐藤先生問了我很多有關競選的問題。"]],["physical","'fizikl","a. 身体的, 物质的, 自然的, 物理学的, 好色的\\nn. 体格检查",["He did pioneering work in the field of physical geography.","The emigrants have endured physical and mental pain."],["他在自然地理科學界取得了突破性的成果。","移民们忍受着肉体和精神的痛苦。"]],["lay","lei","vt. 放置, 产, 铺设, 布置, 提出, 平息\\nvi. 下蛋, 打赌\\nn. 位置, 层, 隐藏处\\na. 世俗的, 外行的\\nli…",["When I was little, I often lay on the grass and watched the white clouds in the sky.","The moment she'd finished, she lay down for a nap."],["我小時候常常躺在草地上看天上的白雲。","她刚结束，就躺下打了个盹儿。"]],["general","'dʒenәrәl","n. 一般, 将军, 大体\\na. 全面的, 大体的, 总的, 一般的, 普遍的\\nn. 常规\\n[计] 常规",["With the heirless king going crazy and royal family poisoned, the general of the army finally had his chance to usurp the throne.","Hi, I have an appointment with the general manager. This is my interview notice."],["随着无继承人的国王的发疯和王室家族的中毒，将军终于有机会篡夺王位。","您好，我跟總經理有約十點見面，這是我的面試通知。"]],["feeling","'fi:liŋ","n. 摸, 触觉, 知觉, 感觉, 情绪, 同情\\na. 有同情心的, 有感觉的, 仁慈的, 动人的",["Hmm. I have a feeling I'm going to get lost whichever road I take.","I've been feeling poorly for the last couple of days."],["唔。我有預感我走哪邊都會迷路。","过去两天我觉得不太舒服。"]],["standard","'stændәd","n. 标准, 规格, 旗, 军旗, 本位\\na. 标准的, 合规格的\\n[计] 标准",["While you drone on about preserving the standard of living for the middle class, our parents are dying of hypothermia.","Standard Chinese, commonly referred to as Mandarin, is based on Pekinese."],["當您滔滔不絕地談論著維護中產階級的生活水準時，我們的父母正死於體溫過低。","中文的标准语，也就是人们常说的普通话，以北京口音为基础。"]],["message","'mesidʒ","n. 消息, 通讯, 讯息, 教训, 预言, 广告词\\nvt. 通知\\nvi. 通报, 报告, 报信\\n[计] 报文; 消息; 信息",["You can write a sentence in a lot of ways and still keep the general message intact.","When the counter value reaches the assigned 'lucky-number' it displays a congratulatory message."],["同一个含义可以用很多不同方式写的句子来表示。","當計數器的數值達到預設的「幸運號碼」時，就會顯示一則恭喜訊息。"]],["fail","feil","vi. 失败, 缺乏, 中断, 衰退, 失灵\\nvt. 忘记, 使...失望, 缺乏, 不及格\\nn. 不及格",["I thought he was going to fail the exam, but he passed after all.","Tom has to do better on the next test or he'll fail my class."],["本以为他不会及格，但最终还是及格了。","汤姆在下次考试需要考好，或者他将失败我的课。"]],["outside","'aut'said","n. 外面, 外表, 外界\\na. 外面的, 外表的, 外界的\\nadv. 外面, 外表, 外界",["I heard someone in the crowd outside the station call my name.","Outside the school, she saw people with no homes living in cardboard boxes."],["我聽到車站外的人群中有人在叫我的名字。","她在校外見到沒家的人住紙板箱。"]],["arrive","ә'raiv","vi. 到达, 抵达",["If you start at once you'll arrive by six o'clock.","It will be snowing when we arrive at Shiga Heights."],["如果你現在馬上出發，六時之前就可以到達。","我們到達志賀高原時會下雪。"]],["analysis","ә'nælәsis","n. 分析\\n[计] 分析机; 分析员; 分析; 分析程序",["She persists in saying that her analysis is correct.","Listening to the personal analysis about global economy made by people who watch only CCAV has always been kinda funny."],["她坚持认为自己的分析是正确的。","听那些只看CCAV的老百姓进行全球经济的个人分析一直是很有趣的。"]],["benefit","'benifit","n. 利益\\nvt. 有益于\\nvi. 受益",["A portion of the proceeds will go to benefit children with disabilities.","Doing things in this way has no benefit."],["我們會把一部分籌得的款項用來幫助殘疾兒童。","这么做没什么好处。"]],["sex","seks","n. 性别, 性欲\\nvt. 区别...的性别, 引起...的性欲",["He doesn't want you to tell him about your sex life.","The most important thing about relations with the opposite sex is not how good the other person is, but that they treat you well."],["他不希望你对他谈论你们的性生活。","跟異性交往最重要的不是他有多好,而是他對你有多好。"]],["forward","'fɒ:wәd","a. 向前的, 早的, 迅速的, 在前的, 进步的\\nvt. 促进...的生长, 转寄, 运送\\nadv. 向前地\\n[计] 前推, 转信",["I look forward to hearing your thoughts on this matter.","The only person who's looking forward to Miss Cobb's return."],["我期待听到你在这件事上的想法 。","期望 Cobb 小姐回來的唯一一人。"]],["lawyer","'lɒ:jә","n. 律师\\n[经] 律师",["My cousin, who is a lawyer, is in France at present.","A lawyer is a person who prevents someone else from getting your money."],["我的律师表哥现在在法国。","律师是防止别人拿你的钱的人。"]],["present","'preznt","n. 现在, 礼品, 瞄准\\na. 现在的, 出席的\\nvt. 介绍, 引见, 赠送, 提出, 呈现, 上演\\nvi. 举枪瞄准",["This is the most wonderful present I have ever received.","At present there are about 31 million Americans over the age of sixty-five."],["這是我收過最好的禮物了。","现在美国有三千一百万年龄在六十五岁以上的老人。"]],["section","'sekʃәn","n. 区段, 部分, 区域, 节, 截面, 处, 科, 区, 扇区\\nvt. 把...分段, 把...切片\\nvi. 被切成片\\n[计] …",["Dad said he'd be promoted to section manager next year.","The woodwind section includes both pipes and reeds."],["爸爸说他明年就要被升为部门主管了。","木管乐器组中包含无簧片管乐器与簧片管乐器。"]],["environmental","in.vaiәrәn'mentәl","a. 周围的, 环境的\\n[经] 环境的, 环保的",["Man has a great capacity to adapt to environmental changes.","Environmental pollution is causing abnormal weather conditions."],["人類適應環境變化的能力很強。","環境污染正造成異常的天氣情況。"]],["glass","glɑ:s","n. 玻璃, 玻璃杯, 透镜\\nvt. 装玻璃于, 反射, 反映\\nvi. 成玻璃状",["When I tried to set the glass down in the sink my hand slipped and it shattered to pieces.","A glass of cold water is very refreshing in hot weather."],["当我试着把玻璃杯放进水槽时，我的手打了滑，玻璃杯打碎了。","一杯冷水在暑热的天气里十分提神。"]],["skill","'skil","n. 技术, 技巧, 技能, 熟练, 熟练工人\\n[化] 技能",["Fluency in English is a very marketable skill today.","He has an interesting job but it requires a lot of skill."],["流利的英語在今天是一種十分搶手的技能。","他有个很有意思但很费功夫的工作。"]],["sister","'sistә","n. 姐妹, 姐, 妹, 护士, 修女\\nvt. 姐妹般对待",["Mary has as attractive a personality as her sister.","Compared with her sister, she isn't very punctual."],["玛丽性格很好，就像她姐姐一样。","與她的妹妹相比，她不是很準時。"]],["pm","","出纳员, 军需官\\n[计] 调相, 性能管理, 处理模块, 程序存储器",["I usually work from 9 AM to 5 PM, but today I worked until 10 PM.","At around 12pm, we go to the dining area of our unit for lunch."],["我通常从上午九点工作到下午五点，但是今天晚上我十点才下班。","中午十二点左右，到我们单位的饭厅去吃午饭。"]],["professor","prә'fesә","n. 教授",["The professor spoke too fast for anyone to understand.","The professor was unable to comprehend what I meant."],["那个教授讲得太快了，没有一个人听得懂。","教授不明白我說了甚麼。"]],["operation",".ɒpә'reiʃәn","n. 操作, 动作, 手术, 运算, 作用, 业务\\n[计] 运算",["My father has been in good shape since his operation.","The only thing that will redeem mankind is co-operation."],["自从手术后，我父亲一直处于良好的状态。","合作是人類唯一的救贖。"]],["financial","fai'nænʃәl","a. 财政的, 金融的\\n[经] 财政的, 金融的, 财务的",["Tokyo, as you know, is one of the financial centers of the world.","We must consider the financial aspects of this project."],["如你所知，東京是全球金融中心之一。","我們必須從財政方面考慮一下這個計劃。"]],["crime","kraim","n. 犯罪, 罪行, 罪恶\\n[法] 犯罪, 罪, 罪恶",["In Singapore, it is a crime to spit on the ground.","There were three uniformed police officers at the crime scene."],["隨地吐痰在新加坡算是犯罪行為。","犯罪现场有三名穿制服的警察。"]],["stage","steidʒ","n. 阶段, 舞台, 场所, 戏剧, 站, 驿站, 级, 层, 脚手架\\nvt. 上演, 表演, 筹划\\nvi. 适于上演, 乘驿车旅行",["Putin will be a pariah on the international stage.","My goal is to help him navigate this stage of life."],["普丁將成為國際舞台上的棄兒。","我的目的是幫助他審視這段人生。"]],["ok","'әu'kei","a. 好, 不错, 可以\\nadv. 好, 不错, 可以\\nn. 批准, 认可\\n[计] 确定",["As long as it's not a fatal mistake, it is ok to fail.","Either as a waiter at a restaurant or a bartender, both are OK."],["只要不是致命性的错误，失败也没关系。","做餐馆服务员啊、酒吧招待员啊，都可以。"]],["compare","kәm'pєә","vt. 比较, 比喻, 对照\\nvi. 相比\\nn. 比较\\n[计] 比较",["The speed at which native speakers of other languages are adding sentences doesn't even compare to theirs.","Compare the two carefully, and you will see the difference."],["其它母语的使用者添加句子的速度也比不过他们的。","仔細的比較一下，就會發現兩者之間的分別了。"]],["authority","ɒ:'θɒriti","n. 权力, 当权者, 当局, 权威, 专家\\n[经] 代理权, 授权, 权威",["It seems that the policeman in this TV series is a dirty cop who abuses his authority.","The doctor is a great authority on children's diseases."],["這套電視劇裏的驚察似乎是個濫用職權的壞蛋。","那位醫生是兒童疾病的專家。"]],["miss","mis","n. 失误, 避免, 失败, 小姐\\nvt. 未得到, 未达到, 未听到, 未觉察, 逃脱, 遗漏, 错过, 思念\\nvi. 失败, 击不中",["This is a very important meeting. You ought not to miss it.","The only person who's looking forward to Miss Cobb's return."],["這個會議很重要的，你不要不來。","期望 Cobb 小姐回來的唯一一人。"]],["design","di'zain","n. 设计, 图样, 方案, 企图\\nv. 设计, 计划",["Their siheyuans were far smaller in scale and simpler in design and decoration, and the hutongs were narrower.","The natural world is always much more complex than formulations in the lab or blueprints in the design office."],["他们的四合院要小得多，设计和装饰也比较简单，胡同也比较窄。","自然界从来都比试验室的配方或设计院的图纸里所反映的要复杂得多。"]],["sort","sɒ:t","n. 种类, 方式, 品质, 态度, 举止\\nvt. 分类, 排序, 挑选\\nvi. 交往, 协调\\n[计] 排序; DOS外部命令:从标…",["It may be that the happiness awaiting us is not at all the sort of happiness we would want.","Mr. and Mrs. Smith are the sort of couple who don't go out much in the evenings."],["很可能等待着我们的幸福根本不是我们要的那种幸福。","Smith夫婦是晚上不出門的夫婦類型。"]],["act","ækt","n. 行动, 行为, 幕, 法案\\nvi. 行动, 表演, 假装, 见效, 表现, 担当\\nvt. 扮演, 装作\\n[计] 先进通信技术,…",["To forgive others is an act of kindness to yourself.","You are old enough to know better than to act like that."],["原諒別人就是善待自己。","你夠大了知道不要那樣做。"]],["ten","ten","num. 十, 十个",["It's been almost ten years, but you're as beautiful as ever.","It will take five to ten years for the technology to be ready."],["過了差不多十年，你還是和以前一樣漂亮。","在科技准备好之前需要五到十年。"]],["knowledge","'nɒlidʒ","n. 知识, 学问, 认识, 知道",["A little knowledge of Spanish will go a long way toward making your trip to Mexico enjoyable.","Knowledge is power, but it is power for evil just as much as for good."],["懂一點西班牙語的話，你去墨西哥一定會玩得更愉快。","知識就是力量，但這力量可以用來做好事，也可以用來做壞事。"]],["gun","gʌn","n. 枪\\n[医] 枪",["To my horror, the man took a gun out of his pocket.","The man with the gun threatened to kill Tom's dog."],["男子从口袋中掏出枪，吓了我一跳。","持槍男子揚言要殺死湯姆的狗。"]],["station","'steiʃәn","n. 车站, 站, 局, 驻地, 位置, 身分, 地位\\nvt. 安置, 配置, 驻扎\\n[计] 站",["Please tell me the closest station to your office.","The school is located within five minutes' walk of the station."],["请告诉我离您办公室最近的车站。","學校坐落於距離車站步行五分鐘的地方。"]],["blue","blu:","n. 蓝色\\na. 蓝色的, 下流的, 忧郁的\\nvt. 染成蓝色\\nvi. 变蓝",["A green carpet will not go with this blue curtain.","This flower is yellow, but all the others are blue."],["绿色的毯子和这条蓝色的帘子不配。","這朵花是黃色的，但是其他全都是藍色的。"]],["strategy","'strætidʒi","n. 战略, 策略\\n[经] 战略, 策略",["China is incorporating Algeria into its Belt and Road strategy.","Real-time strategy games usually include arcade elements."],["中國正將阿爾及利亞納入「一帶一路」戰略。","即時策略遊戲通常會融入街機元素。"]],["clearly","'kliәli","adv. 清楚地",["Kate's voice is clearly different from the other girls'.","I sat at the front in order to hear the lecture clearly."],["Kate 的聲音明顯和其它女孩不同。","我想聽清楚演講內容，便坐在了前面。"]],["discuss","dis'kʌs","vt. 讨论, 论述\\n[医] 讨论, 辩论",["Let's discuss your love problems on the way back from school.","There's something I've been meaning to discuss with you."],["從學校回來的路上讓我們來討論你的愛情問題。","有件事我一直想跟你商量。"]],["indeed","in'di:d","adv. 的确, 实在, 真正地, 甚至",["The design of these clothes is indeed rather nice, but they are a little expensive.","Turpan is indeed very hot. Even the government is unable to control the temperature."],["这件衣服样式倒是挺好，就是贵了点儿。","吐鲁番实在太热了，连政府也控制不了这里的温度。"]],["truth","tru:θ","n. 事实, 实情\\n[法] 真实, 真相, 事实",["It will not be long before we can know the truth of the matter.","If he told me the truth, I would have forgiven him."],["我們很快就可以知道事情的真相了。","如果他跟我说实话，我就原谅他。"]],["song","sɒŋ","n. 歌, 曲, 鸣声, 歌唱, 歌曲, 诗歌",["This song is so moving that it brings tears to my eyes.","When I hear that song, I remember my younger days."],["這首歌太感人了，使我不禁流下了眼淚。","每次听到这首歌，都会让我回忆起自己年轻的时候。"]],["example","ig'zæmpl","n. 例子, 样本, 实例\\n[化] 实例",["Tatoeba is created for adding and collecting example sentences.","For example in Bulgaria, shaking one's head means yes while nodding one's head means no."],["Tatoeba是為了添加和收集例句而被創建。","例如，在保加利亚摇头表示同意而点头表示不同意。"]],["democratic",".demә'krætik","a. 民主的\\n[法] 民主的, 民主政体的, 平民的",["The United States of America is a democratic country.","There are two major political parties in the United States: the conservative Republican Party, and the liberal Democratic Party."],["美國是一個民主國家。","美国有两大政党，一是较为保守的共和党，一是较为自由的民主党。"]],["check","tʃek","n. 检查, 支票, 阻止物, 寄物牌, 象棋中将军\\nvt. 检查, 阻止, 核对, 寄存, 托运\\nvi. 逐项相符, 开支票\\n[计…",["Read the list we sent you and check that all the sentences sound natural to you.","Check that your username and password are written correctly."],["请把发给你的那张单子看一下，再确认一下所有的句子都很通顺。","檢查一下用戶名和密碼有沒有填錯。"]],["environment","in'vairәnmәnt","n. 环境, 外界, 围绕\\n[计] 环境",["If mankind doesn't take care of the environment, the environment may eliminate mankind.","Noise pollution could be avoided if only people were more sensitive to the environment."],["如果人類不好好保護大自然，大自然說不定會反過來把人類毀滅。","如果大家都懂得關心環境的話，就不會有噪音污染了。"]],["leg","leg","n. 腿, 假腿, 路程\\nvi. 走, 跑",["After a six month period, his leg was healed and is normal again.","An elderly person in the street fell and broke a leg."],["過了六個月，他的腿便治好，回復正常了。","一位老人在街上摔斷了腿。"]],["dark","dɑ:k","n. 黑暗, 夜, 黄昏, 模糊\\na. 黑暗的, 暗的, 深色的, 隐密的, 模糊的, 无知的",["It's getting dark. Please turn the light on for me.","As soon as it gets dark, the fireworks will start."],["天色開始暗了。麻煩你幫我開燈。","天一黑，就会开始放焰火了。"]],["various","'vєәriәs","a. 不同的, 各种的, 多方面的, 许多的, 个别的, 杂色的\\n[法] 不同的, 种种的, 各式各样的",["In various Turkish restaurants, shishkabob is the main food.","The various dialects of China are what 'Chinese' really is."],["在各大土耳其餐馆，烤羊肉串是主食。","我们中国的各地方言才是真正的中国话。"]],["rather","'ræðә","adv. 宁可, 稍微, 相当",["I would rather work for any company than waste another year.","I would rather kill myself than reconcile myself to my fate."],["我寧願到不喜歡的公司工作，也不想渾渾噩噩的又過一年。","与其向命运妥协，我宁可自杀。"]],["laugh","lɑ:f","n. 笑, 笑声\\nvi. 笑, 大笑\\nvt. 以笑表示",["I try not to laugh at my own jokes, but we all know I'm hilarious.","First they laugh at you, then they fight you, and then you win."],["我尽量不对我自己的笑话发笑，但是我们都知道我很搞笑。","首先他们嘲笑你，其次他们和你作战，然后你赢了。"]],["guess","ges","n. 猜测, 臆测\\nv. 猜测, 臆测",["I guess what I've said isn't all that clear, but that's the only way I can explain it.","I guess you heard about what happened this morning."],["总觉得解释的不是很清楚...但我只知道这样...","我想你听说今天早上发生什么了。"]],["executive","ig'zekjutiv","n. 执行部门, 执行委员会, 执行者, 经理主管人员\\na. 执行的, 善于执行的, 善于经营的\\n[计] 执行程序",["We'll need a head hunting agency to find the right man for this executive position.","On March 1, President Donald Trump has signed an executive order making English the official language of the United States."],["我們需要人力仲介公司幫我們找到合適的人來擔任這個管理職位。","3 月 1 日，唐纳德・特朗普总统签署了一项行政命令，将英语定为美国的官方语言。"]],["prove","pru:v","vt. 证明, 查验, 检验, 勘探, 显示\\nvi. 证明是",["I just wanted to prove to myself that I could do this.","When you're trying to prove something, it helps to know it's true."],["我只想向自己证明我可以做到。","當你試圖去證明某件事，先知道它是真的會有所幫助。"]],["hang","hæŋ","n. 悬挂, 诀窍, 意义\\nvt. 悬挂, 附着, 装饰, 垂下, 踌躇, 绞死, 使悬而未决\\nvi. 悬着, 垂下, 被绞死, 悬而…",["Hang on a minute. There's quite a few black chess pieces over there.","There is a tendency for people to think that hang gliding is dangerous."],["等等！那邊有很多黑棋。","人们普遍认为悬挂式滑翔运动是危险的。"]],["entire","in'taiә","n. 整个, 全部\\na. 全体的, 完全的, 全部的",["The rain didn't stop, and went on for the entire day.","Grandmother's passing away came as a great blow to the entire family."],["雨没有停，连着下了整天。","奶奶去世让全家都受了打击。"]],["rock","rɒk","n. 岩石, 岩礁, 石头, 基石, 暗礁, 摇动, 摇滚乐\\nvt. 摇摆, 摇动, 使摇晃, 使动摇\\nvi. 摇, 摇动",["Passing through the strong wind, the planes rock like this, but don't worry.","Makoto found his true love on top of Ayers Rock. She's from Osaka."],["当飞机穿越强风时，它们会像这样摇晃，但是别担心。","誠在艾爾斯岩上找到了自己真正的愛情。她來自大阪。"]],["forget","fә'get","vt. 忘记, 忽略, 忘\\nvi. 忘记",["I will never forget your kindness as long as I live.","Don't forget to take your umbrella when you leave."],["我一輩子也不會忘記你的大恩大德。","你出門的時候別忘了帶傘。"]],["claim","kleim","n. 要求, 要求权, 断言, 权利\\nvt. 要求, 认领, 主张\\nvi. 提出要求, 主张, 断言",["To claim sex is binary requires ignoring intersex people, which is unscientific and purely ideological.","America likes to claim that it is a \"classless\" society."],["若要聲稱性別是二元的，就需要忽視陰陽人，這是不科學的，且純粹屬於意識形態問題。","美国是一个自称没有社会阶层的国家。"]],["remove","ri'mu:v","vt. 移动, 调动, 除去, 迁移, 开除, 移交\\nvi. 迁移, 移动, 搬家\\nn. 班级, 升级, 移动, 搬家, 间距\\n[计…",["Use interrogative pronouns to rewrite the sentences below; if you need to, you can add or remove a few words.","Cover the pan and cook until tender, then remove the cover and continue the cooking until the onions are a light brown."],["用疑问代词表任指格式改写下面的句子，根据需要可以增加或者减少一些词语。","蓋上鍋蓋煮至洋蔥變軟，然後揭開鍋蓋繼續煮至洋蔥呈現淺棕色。"]],["manager","'mænidʒә","n. 经理, 管理员, 管理器\\n[计] 管理器",["The manager ordered all the rooms to be swept clean as soon as possible.","I had words with the manager of that store, because he refused to refund my money for the TV set that wasn't operating properly."],["經理命令要把所有房間儘快打掃乾淨。","我找商店经理谈了话，因为他拒绝为那不能用的电视退钱。"]],["enjoy","in'dʒɒi","vt. 享受, 喜欢, 欣赏\\n[法] 享受, 享有, 获得某种利益",["Some of my classmates like volleyball and others enjoy tennis.","She turned off the lights so she could enjoy the moonlight."],["我有些同學喜歡排球，也有些喜歡網球。","她關了燈，好享受月光。"]],["network","'netwә:k","n. 网络, 广播网, 网状物\\n[计] 网络",["The UK must improve the problems with its rail network.","I hear that the network is very popular now."],["英國必須改善它在鐵路網的問題。","听说大数据技术现在很热门。"]],["legal","'li:gәl","a. 法律的, 法定的, 合法的\\n[经] 法定权利; 法律(上)的, 合法的",["It's not legal for people under 20 to drink in Canada.","Lawyers will urge the parents to take further legal action."],["在加拿大不满20岁饮酒不合法。","律师们会力劝家长们采取进一步的法律行动。"]],["religious","ri'lidʒәs","a. 宗教性的, 虔诚的, 宗教上的, 严谨的\\nn. 修道士, 出家人",["People who want to share their religious views with you almost never want you to share yours with them.","I'm a deeply religious man and believe in life after death."],["想要跟你分享他们宗教信仰的人几乎从不愿你跟他们分享你的。","我是一個虔誠的教徒，我相信死後的生命。"]],["cold","kәuld","n. 感冒, 寒冷\\na. 寒冷的, 冷淡的, 冷静的\\nadv. 完全地",["The child had no overcoat on although it was very cold.","No matter how cold it is outside, the rooms are comfortably heated."],["尽管天气很冷，孩子却没有大衣穿。","無論外面多麼寒冷，房間始終既舒適又溫暖。"]],["final","'fainl","n. 期末考试, 结局, 决赛\\na. 最后的, 终极的, 决定性的",["The final exams will probably carry over into next month.","My final destination in China is the city of Harbin in the north-east, about one thousand kilometres from Beijing."],["期末考试也许要持续到下个月吧。","我在中国最后的目的地是东北的哈尔滨，离北京大概一千公里左右。"]],["main","mein","n. 主要部分, 干线, 体力, 力量, 主群组\\na. 主要的, 重要的, 全力的\\n[计] 主群组",["One of the main products of this country is coffee.","No matter what your main purpose is in reading, books should never fail to provide contentment and satisfaction."],["这个国家的主要产品之一是咖啡。","无论读书的目的是什么，书总会带给我们乐趣和满足。"]],["science","'saiәns","n. 科学, 学科, 学问, 自然科学\\n[医] 科学",["Mathematics is the part of science you could continue to do if you woke up tomorrow and discovered the universe was gone.","The progress of science has brought about great change in our lives."],["就算你明天起床，發現整個宇宙消失了，還有一門科學是可以繼續研究的 ﹣ 那就是數學了。","科技的進步為我們的生活帶來了巨大的轉變。"]],["green","gri:n","n. 绿色, 绿色颜料\\na. 绿色的, 未成熟的, 新鲜的, 青春的, 无经验的, 脸色发青的",["The cows were moving very slowly through the long green grass.","A green carpet will not go with this blue curtain."],["牛群在鬱鬱蔥蔥的草地上緩緩移動著。","绿色的毯子和这条蓝色的帘子不配。"]],["memory","'memәri","n. 记忆, 记忆力, 回忆, 纪念, 存储\\nn. 内存\\n[计] 存储器, 内存, 查看内存实用程序",["My memory failed me. I just could not remember his name.","You can upgrade your computer with more random access memory to make the PC faster."],["我的記性不好。我簡直不記得他的名字了。","您可以使用更多任何存取記憶體來升級您的電腦，以提高 PC 的運行速度。"]],["card","kɑ:d","n. 卡片, 纸牌, 节目单, 明信片, 梳棉机\\nvt. 备置卡片, 记于卡片上, 梳理\\n[计] 卡片, 卡",["It makes sense to pay off your credit card balance every month.","Any student with an I.D. card has access to the library."],["每个月还清信用卡负债很重要。","所有持有學生證的學生均可進入圖書館。"]],["above","ә'bʌv","prep. 在上方, 超出\\nadv. 在上面\\na. 上述的, 上面的",["Excuse me; allow me to point out three errors in the above article.","John is head and shoulders above any of his classmates in French."],["抱歉，请允许我指出上文中的三个错误。","約翰的法文比他的同學都來得好。"]],["seat","si:t","n. 座, 座位, 位子, 席位, 所在地\\nvt. 使坐下, 使就座, 为...设座于, 使就职\\nvi. 安装在底座上",["The boy gave up his seat to the old man on the bus.","The back seat of the car will hold three passengers."],["男孩在巴士上把座位讓給了老人。","车后座可以坐三个人。"]],["cell","sel","n. 单元, 细胞, 电池\\n[计] 单元",["Recently T Mall has had a sales promotion on cell phones.","A cell phone is as contaminated with bacteria as a toilet is."],["最近天猫上有手机促销活动。","手机如同马桶一样被细菌污染。"]],["establish","i'stæbliʃ","vt. 建立, 确立, 制定\\nvi. 移植生长",["Our ultimate goal is to establish world peace.","The question of how to establish the optimal formula is still open."],["我们的究极目标是树立世界和平。",""]],["nice","nais","a. 美好的, 和蔼的, 正派的, 做得好的, 精密的, 细微的, 挑剔的, 谨慎的",["If the weather is nice tomorrow, we will have a picnic.","Bob is such a nice person that everybody likes him."],["如果明天天氣好，我們就去野餐。","鲍勃是个很好的人，大家都很喜欢他。"]],["trial","'traiәl","n. 审判, 试验, 艰苦, 麻烦事, 考验\\na. 审讯的, 试验性的",["The subscription service is available for a fixed monthly fee with a one-month free trial.","Customers who purchase a new device can enjoy additional trial period as a promotional offer."],["此訂閱服務的月費為固定金額，並提供免費試用一個月。","購買新裝置的用戶可享有額外試用優惠。"]],["expert","'ekspә:t","n. 专家, 行家\\na. 老练的, 内行的, 专门的\\n[计] 高级",["Concerning this word, each expert has a different point of view.","It is for certain, he is the expert in this field."],["對這個詞，專家們各有不同的看法。","他是这方面的专家，这是肯定的。"]],["spring","spriŋ","n. 春天, 弹簧, 跳跃, 弹性, 活力, 泉, 源泉\\na. 春天的\\nvi. 跳, 弹跳, 涌出, 生长, 裂开, 高耸\\nvt. …",["Spring Festival is also known as Chinese New Year.","Celebrating Spring Festival is commonly referred to as 'passing the year'."],["春节，即农历新年。","庆祝春节俗称过年。"]],["firm","fә:m","n. 公司, 商号\\na. 坚定的, 坚强的, 牢固的, 结实的, 坚硬的, 坚挺的, 严格的, 确定的\\nvt. 使牢固, 使坚定\\nv…",["Though I may be in the jaws of death, I am as a firm as a rock.","The firm went under due to lack of capital."],["我虽然在虎口里，却是安如泰山。","公司由于缺乏资本倒闭了。"]],["democrat","'demәkræt","n. 民主人士, 民主主义者, 民主党党员\\n[经] 民主党",["A democrat is a free citizen who yields to the will of the majority.","Mary quickly noticed that Putin was not a democrat."],["民主主义者是屈服于大部分人的自由公民。","瑪麗很快就注意到普丁並不是民主人士。"]],["radio","'reidiәu","n. 无线电, 收音机, 无线电报, 无线电广播, 无线电台\\nv. 用无线电发送",["The communication of news by TV and radio is very common now.","I'm fixing the radio which I found on my way home."],["這個年代用電視和收音機報道新聞已是十分平常的事了。","我在修理回家路上捡到的收音机。"]],["visit","'vizit","n. 拜访, 访问, 游览, 视察\\nvt. 拜访, 访问, 参观, 视察, 降临\\nvi. 访问, 参观, 闲谈",["Los Angeles is one of the places that I'd like to visit.","I really look forward to your visit in the near future."],["洛杉磯是我想去的其中一個地方。","我很期待在不久的將來您的光臨。"]],["management","'mænidʒmәnt","n. 经营, 支配, 管理\\n[化] 管理处",["Management of a company is different from ownership of a company.","The company is starting to implement the new management system from next month."],["管理一家公司和擁有一家公司是捷然不同的。","公司从下个月开始推行新的管理制度。"]],["avoid","ә'vɒid","vt. 避免, 防止, 撤消\\n[法] 避免, 回避, 躲开",["Jim was able to hold back his anger and avoid a fight.","You'd better avoid discussion of religion and politics."],["Jim抑制住了怒火，避免了一场斗争。","你最好別提到宗教和政治這些話題。"]],["imagine","i'mædʒin","vt. 想像, 设想, 猜测\\nvi. 想像起来",["Today no one can imagine a life without television.","We can hardly imagine our daily life without television."],["今天沒有人能想像一個沒有電視的生活。","如果沒有了電視，實在很難想像我們的日常生活會變成怎樣。"]],["tonight","tә'nait","n. 今晚, 今夜\\nadv. 今晚, 今夜",["We're going to eat a lot tonight so I hope you're not on a diet.","You can get in touch with him at his home tonight."],["我们今晚会吃很多，所以我希望你没有在节食。","今晚你可以在他家联络到他。"]],["huge","hju:dʒ","a. 极大的, 巨大的, 无限的",["Furthermore, I still don't think this a huge cultural difference.","Seen from the sky, the river looked like a huge snake."],["而且，我还是认为这准不是个巨大的文化区别。","从天上看下来，这条河像一条巨蛇。"]],["ball","bɒ:l","n. 球, 舞会, 球状物\\nv. 捏成球形",["Truth is like a disco ball, and only one of the tiny little mirrors it is made up of is actually yours.","The assistant referee held up his flag to show the referee that the ball was still in play."],["真相就像一顆迪斯可球，組成球面的無數小鏡子中，只有一面是真正屬於你的。","助理裁判向主裁判举旗示意比赛继续。"]],["yourself","juә'self","pron. 你自己",["You may injure yourself if you don't follow safety procedures.","Of course you'll catch a cold if you fall asleep under the kotatsu. You have to learn to take care of yourself."],["如果你不按照安全手续来的话，你可能会受伤的。","如果你睡在kotatsu下当然会感冒。你要学会照顾好自己。"]],["finish","'finiʃ","n. 完成, 结束, 末道漆, 磨光, 完美\\nvt. 完成, 结束, 用完, 毁掉\\nvi. 结束\\n[计] 完成",["It is utterly impossible to finish the work within a month.","However hard you try, you can't finish it in a week or so."],["這份工作絕對沒有可能在一個月之內完成。","你就算多努力，也不可能在一兩個星期內做完。"]],["theory","'θiәri","n. 理论, 学说, 原理, 意见, 推测\\n[化] 理论",["Practice is as important as theory, but we are apt to value the latter and despise the former.","In theory, there is no difference between theory and practice. But, in practice, there is."],["实践和理论同样重要，但我们倾向于重视后者而忽略前者。","理论上说，理论和实践没有区别。但实践上说，是有的。"]],["impact","'impækt","n. 冲击, 冲突, 影响, 效果\\nvt. 挤入, 撞击, 压紧, 对...发生影响",["This incident has made a great impact on the progress of the project.","With this upgrade, one obvious impact is that users will be obliged to reset their passwords."],["这个事件极大影响了项目进度。","这次升级的一个明显影响是用户会被强制重置密码。"]],["respond","ri'spɒnd","vt. 以...回答\\nvi. 回答, 响应, 回报, 有反应, 承担责任",["The president refused to respond to that question.","Our bodies respond to our feelings."],["总统拒绝回答那个问题。","我们的身体会对我们的感情做出反应。"]],["statement","'steitmәnt","n. 陈述, 指令, 声明\\n[计] 程序语句; 语句",["The family was highly doubtful of the statement from the military.","I would like to retract my previous statement."],["家屬對軍方的說法高度置疑。","我想撤回我之前的陈述。"]],["maintain","mein'tein","vt. 维持, 维修, 保持, 坚持, 供养, 主张\\n[化] 维修",["Each of you must work hard for a lifetime, and only then will you be able to maintain a relationship.","When chickens pancake-shape maintain, the tractor must have won again."],["彼此必須一輩子努力,才能把感情维系好。","當雞像煎餅一樣平的時候, 那麼一定是拖拉機跑得比它們快。"]],["charge","tʃɑ:dʒ","n. 指控, 费用, 冲锋, 电荷, 炸药, 主管, 被托管人, 命令\\nvt. 控诉, 加罪于, 使充满, 使充电, 使承担\\nvi. …",["Banks charge higher interest on loans to risky customers.","Miss Yamada is in charge of the 2nd year class this year."],["银行对风险客户收取较高的贷款利息。","今年，山田先生教二年班。"]],["popular","'pɒpjulә","a. 通俗的, 流行的, 受欢迎的, 大众的, 人民的, 普及的\\n[经] 大众的, 通俗的, 普及的",["No pro golfer in Japan is as popular as Jumbo Ozaki.","Tom became popular among teenagers as soon as he made his debut on the screen."],["尾崎將司是日本最受歡迎的專業高爾夫球手。","汤姆第一次上电视后就广受青少年的欢迎。"]],["traditional","trә'diʃәnl","a. 传统的, 惯例的\\n[经] 传统的, 惯例的",["He is a painter, but he can't paint in the traditional Chinese style.","He's a painter, but he doesn't do traditional Chinese painting."],["他是个画家，但他不会画国画。","他是个画家，但他不会画国画。"]],["onto","'ɒntu:","prep. 在...之上",["Country girls like to cut red paper into peach and plum blossoms and paste them onto doors and windows.","If we'd arrived ten minutes earlier, we would've made it onto the plane."],["农村的女孩喜欢把红色的纸裁减成桃和李的花及贴在门窗上。","要是我们早十分钟到的话，我们就能赶上飞机了。"]],["reveal","ri'vi:l","vt. 露出, 显示, 透露, 揭露, 泄露, (神)启示\\nn. 窗侧, 门侧",["Adversity and prosperity reveal one's breadth of mind; joy and anger test one's self-restraint.","If he doesn't get a letter from me once a month, he will reveal the Pope's secret to the world."],["逆境顺境看襟度，临喜临怒看涵养。",""]],["direction","di'rekʃәn","n. 方向, 指导, 趋势\\n[计] 方向; 流向",["She gets lost really easily. She's got no sense of direction.","No sooner had she caught sight of me than she started running in my direction."],["她完全沒有方向感，很容易便會迷路。","她一見到我就馬上跑了過來。"]],["weapon","'wepәn","n. 武器, 兵器\\nvt. 武装",["Skilled soldiers know how to use their environment as a weapon.","Sami dropped the murder weapon in a lake."],["熟练的士兵知道怎么以他们的环境为武器。","薩米把凶器丟進湖裡了。"]],["employee",".emplɒi'i:","n. 职员, 员工, 受雇人员\\n[化] 职工; 雇员",["It is difficult to replace an employee that is as qualified as he is.","It is a basic quality of an employee to complete his tasks within a fixed time."],["要找人代替像他这么有资历的员工很难。","在限定时间内完成任务是一个职员的基本素质。"]],["contain","kәn'tein","vt. 包含, 容纳, 控制\\nvi. 自制",["In the English language many words contain letters which are not pronounced.","Cookies may contain nuts or peanuts, even if not included in the ingredient list."],["英文裡面很多字的字母是不發音的。","雖然配料表中未列出堅果和花生，但餅乾中仍可能含有這些成分。。"]],["mrs","'misiz","太太",["Mrs. White broke into tears when I told her the news.","Mrs. Bruce was the first female pilot to fly between England and Japan."],["當我告知她那件消息時，懷特小姐哭了出來。","布魯斯夫人是英國和日本之間航線的第一位女性飛行員。"]],["cultural","'kʌltʃәrәl","a. 文化的, 教养的, 修养的\\n[医] 培养的",["The amount of paper produced by a country is closely related to its cultural standards.","In its home country, France, Tatoeba became a social and cultural phenomenon."],["一个国家纸的产量和它的文明程度密切相关。","在其本國，法國，Tatoeba成為一種社會文化現象。"]],["peace","pi:s","n. 和平, 和约, 治安, 和睦, 安宁, 静寂\\nvi. 安静下来, 不作声",["Education is the path to happiness, peace, righteousness, and success.","There on the top of a high mountain they built a small town of their own and lived in peace."],["教育是通往幸福、和平、正义与成功的道路。","他们在高山顶上建了自己的小城镇在那里过着宁静的生活。"]],["pain","pein","n. 痛苦, 疼痛, 辛苦\\nvt. 使痛苦, 痛苦\\nvi. 作痛, 疼",["If the pain continues you have to go to the doctor.","Tom had a pain in his chest, so he went to the hospital."],["如果持續疼痛, 你必須去看醫生。","汤姆胸痛，所以去了医院。"]],["apply","ә'plai","vt. 涂, 应用\\nvi. 申请, 适用",["I went to the public swimming pool to apply for a lifeguard position.","We could apply the theory of punctuated equilibrium to languages."],["我去了公共游泳池應徵當救生員。","我们可以把间断平衡理论应用到语言上。"]],["wide","waid","a. 宽的, 广阔的, 普遍的, 宽阔的, 广泛的, 一般的\\nadv. 广阔地, 遍及各处地, 广泛地\\nn. 大千世界",["The trigonometric functions satisfy a wide array of notable algebraic identities.","Keep your eyes wide open before marriage, half shut afterwards."],["三角函數滿足各種代數恆等式。","婚前張開眼，婚後半閉眼。"]],["measure","'meʒә","n. 尺寸, 量度器, 量度标准, 测量, 量具, 程度, 范围, 限度, 分寸, 措施, 方法\\nvt. 测量, 测度, 估量, 权衡,…",["You can't judge a person by appearance, just as you can't measure the sea with a pint pot.","Condoms are an effective measure to prevent HIV and many other diseases."],["人不可貌相，海水不可斗量。","避孕套是預防艾滋病和許多其他疾病的有效手段。"]],["shake","ʃeik","n. 摇动, 震动\\nvt. 摇动, 动摇, 使震动, 挥舞\\nvi. 震动, 发抖, 动摇",["When you shake hands with somebody, you must look him in the eye.","She stepped forward to shake his hand."],["和別人握手的時候，一定要有眼神接觸。","為了握住他的手，她往前跨了一步。"]],["fly","flai","n. 苍蝇, 两翼昆虫, 飞行\\nvi. 飞, 飞翔, 飘扬, 逃走\\nvt. 飞, 飞越, 使飘扬, 逃出\\na. 敏捷的",["National rescue teams are on standby ready to fly to Japan.","International rescue teams are at the ready to fly to Japan."],["國際救難隊伍隨時待命準備前往日本。","國際救難隊伍隨時待命準備前往日本。"]],["interview","'intәvju:","n. 面谈, 访问, 接见, 面试\\nvt. 接见, 对...进行面谈(试)",["I reminded him of his interview with the president.","The purpose of this interview is to assess whether or not you are suitable for the company."],["我提醒他要去會見總裁。","这次面试的意义是评断你适不适合这家公司。"]],["manage","'mænidʒ","vi. 处理\\nvt. 管理, 控制, 维持, 达成, 经营, 运用",["Few governments can manage the economy successfully.","In the end, I did manage to become friends with benefits with that girl."],["能把經濟管好的政府不多。","最後我成功和那個女孩成為了炮友關係。"]],["chair","tʃєә","n. 椅子, 显要的席位, 主席\\nvt. 使入座, 使就任要职",["The cat likes sitting in the chair more than I do.","It is easier to study when you are sitting in a comfortable chair."],["这只猫比我更喜欢坐在椅子上。","当你坐在一把舒适的椅子上的时候，更容易学习。"]],["fish","fiʃ","n. 鱼, 鱼肉, 鱼类, 接合板\\nvt. 钓, 钓鱼, 查出, 用接合板连接\\nvi. 捕鱼, 钓鱼, 用钩捞取, 摸索寻找",["The skin of a shark is much rougher than that of a tuna fish.","For years he has been at the market every Tuesday morning with his fish stall."],["鯊魚皮比金槍魚皮粗糙多了。","他在街市賣魚賣了許多年了，這些年來每逢星期二都會在街市見到他。"]],["particular","pә'tikjulә","n. 一项(或条、点), 个别项目, 详细说明\\na. 特别的, 独有的, 挑剔的, 详尽的",["I would like to place particular emphasis on this point.","At school I had enjoyed reading Japanese literature in English translation, in particular Soseki's I am a Cat and Kokoro, and Akutagawa's The Nose and Kappa."],["我想特别强调这一点。","在學校我喜歡閱讀日本文學的英文翻譯，特別是夏目漱石的我是一隻貓和心，和芥川龍之介的鼻子和河童。"]],["camera","'kæmәrә","n. 照相机, 摄影机, 密谈室, 暗箱\\n[计] 摄影",["I'm going to buy myself a new camera, digital this time.","People show up bright on an infrared camera because of their body heat."],["我要给我自己买一个新照相机，这次要数码的。","人會因為體溫而在紅外線攝影機上顯現。"]],["structure","'strʌktʃә","n. 结构, 构造, 建筑物\\nvt. 构成, 组织",["Mangroves sequester more carbon than any other trees on Earth because they have quite a large underground root structure.","The school's tallest structure is that water tower."],["红树林吸取二氧化碳比地球上其他树木都要多，因为它们具有很大的地下根部结构。","学校最高的建筑就是那个水塔。"]],["politics","'pɒlitiks","n. 政治, 政治学, 政见, 政治活动\\n[法] 政治, 政治学, 政纲",["American politics are interesting to watch, especially during a presidential election.","You'd better avoid discussion of religion and politics."],["美国的政治看起来很有趣，特别是在选举总统期间。","你最好別提到宗教和政治這些話題。"]],["bit","bit","n. 少量, 马嚼子, 辅币\\nvt. 给马上嚼子, 控制\\nbite的过去式和过去分词\\n[计] 比特, 二进制数位, 机内测试",["I don't want to lose my ideas, even though some of them are a bit extreme.","With so many people around he naturally became a bit nervous."],["我不想放弃我的想法，虽然一些想法有点极端。","他被很多人围着，自然变得有点紧张。"]],["perform","pә'fɒ:m","vt. 进行, 履行, 完成, 执行, 表演\\nvi. 行动, 工作, 执行, 演出",["It's Friday, and so we have to perform our prayers.","There, pandas have been trained to perform dozens of items."],["今天是星期五，所以我們需要禱告。","在那里，人们把熊猫训练得能表演许多节目。"]],["weight","weit","n. 重, 重量, 体重, 砝码, 重大, 影响, 力量\\nvt. 加重量于, 压迫, 使加权, 称重量\\n[计] 粗细",["The ice on the lake is too thin to bear your weight.","She is on a diet for fear that she will put on weight."],["湖上的冰太薄了，承受不了你的重量。","她因为担心发胖而节食。"]],["suddenly","'sʌdәnli","adv. 突然, 意外, 忽然, 迅速, 即席作成, 即刻, 急速",["The bus stopped suddenly in the middle of the street.","I haven't got a clue as to why he quit so suddenly."],["公車突然在路中央停下來。","我完全不明白他為甚麼會突然辭職。"]],["discover","dis'kʌvә","vt. 发现, 找到, 暴露\\nvi. 发现",["I hope that some scientist will soon discover a cure for AIDS.","If you discover any problems on Tatoeba, you should go ahead and blame Sysko."],["真希望科学家们能早点找到艾滋病的治疗方法。","你要是在Tatoeba上发现什么问题，你应该责备Sysko才对。"]],["candidate","'kændideit","n. 候选人, 投考者\\n[法] 候选, 候补者",["Ideally, a candidate for this job should have four years' work experience.","He's taken off his mask, torn off his costume. There's no doubt now about what the far-right candidate intends."],["我们希望应聘者能有4年工作经验。","他摘下了面具，卸下了偽裝。極右翼候選人的意圖已昭然若揭。"]],["production","prә'dʌkʃәn","n. 制造, 生产, 产物\\n[医] 产生, 生成",["Palm oil production is the leading cause of deforestation in Indonesia.","Steel production will increase 2% this month from last month."],["棕榈油制造是导致印度尼西亚森林砍伐的主要原因。","今個月的鋼鐵產量和上個月比起來，估計會上升兩個巴仙。"]],["treat","tri:t","n. 宴请, 款待\\nvt. 视为, 对待, 论述, 治疗, 款待\\nvi. 讨论, 谈判, 作东",["Teachers should treat all their students impartially.","The most important thing about relations with the opposite sex is not how good the other person is, but that they treat you well."],["老师应该一视同仁地对待他们的学生。","跟異性交往最重要的不是他有多好,而是他對你有多好。"]],["evening","'i:vniŋ","n. 傍晚, 晚间, 末期",["The President is to speak on television this evening.","I enjoyed talking with you this evening very much."],["總統今晚將會在電視上發表演說。","今晚我非常享受和你的聊天。"]],["trip","trip","n. 旅行, 绊倒, 摔倒, 失足, 差错, 旅程\\nvt. 使跌倒, 使犯错, 使失败\\nvi. 轻快地走, 绊倒, 失误, 犯错, 结…",["This will be a good souvenir of my trip around the United States.","I crossed the equator for the first time on my trip to Australia."],["这将是我环绕美国旅行中一个很好的纪念品。","我去澳大利亚旅游的时候第一次穿越了赤道。"]],["affect","ә'fekt","vt. 影响, 感动, 假装, 模仿, 爱好, 倾向于\\nn. 自觉感情",["An increase in the number of cars will affect the urban environment.","The service plan you choose will affect your user experience. Please be sure to compare the details carefully."],["车辆增多会影响到城市的环境。","您選擇的服務方案將影響您的使用體驗，請務必仔細比較細節。"]],["inside","'in'said","n. 内部, 内脏, 内幕\\na. 内部的, 秘密的, 户内的\\nadv. 在里面\\nprep. 在...之内",["Iron the inside of collars first, and then the outside.","Inside my backpack there are many colored pens, red ones, blue ones, green ones, etc."],["先熨烫领子的里面，然后是外面。","我的書包裡有很多彩色筆，紅的，藍的，綠的，等等。"]],["conference","'kɒnfәrәns","n. 会议\\n[经] 会议, 讨论会, 协商会",["Delegates from many countries participated in the conference.","Please attend the meeting in the second floor conference room at 2:30 p.m."],["许多国家的代表出席了会议。","请在两点半参加在二楼会议室的会议。"]],["unit","'ju:nit","n. 单位, 分队, 部队, 单元, 部件, 装置\\na. 单位的, 单元的\\n[计] 单元常数; 部件",["At that moment, the telephone in the unit office rang.","At around 12pm, we go to the dining area of our unit for lunch."],["那时，分队办公室里电话响了。","中午十二点左右，到我们单位的饭厅去吃午饭。"]],["style","stail","n. 风格, 时尚, 文体, 风度, 字体, 类型\\nvt. 称呼, (根据新款式)设计, 使合潮流\\nn. 风格, 样式\\n[计] 风格…",["Rocks are beautifully arranged in the Japanese-style garden.","There are a lot of people so today we've gone for buffet style."],["石頭被美麗得放置在日式庭園裡。","因为人很多，今天我们会采取自助餐的形式。"]],["adult","'ædʌlt","n. 成人, 成虫\\na. 成年的, 成熟的",["And yet, in the \"real adult world\" there are a lot of competitions.","Two adult tickets and three children's tickets to London, please."],["但是，在「真實的大人世界」裏是有很多競爭的。","请给我两张到伦敦的成人票，三张儿童票。"]],["worry","'wʌri","n. 担心, 烦恼, 忧虑, 苦恼, 撕咬\\nvt. 使烦恼, 使焦虑, 使苦恼, 困扰, 折磨, 撕咬\\nvi. 烦恼, 担心, 撕咬",["Don't worry! Even if I drink, it doesn't have an effect on my driving.","Life is too short to worry about things like that."],["別擔心! 即使我喝酒了, 它對我的駕駛沒有影響。","人生短暫，用來擔心這種事情，實在太浪費了。"]],["mention","'menʃәn","n. 提到, 言及, 陈述\\nvt. 提到, 提及",["Nuclear power plants are dangerous, not to mention nuclear weapons.","He knows German and French, not to mention English."],["核电厂具危险性，更不用说核武器了。","不提英语，他还会说德语和法语。"]],["range","'reindʒ","n. 排, 行, 山脉, 范围, 行列, 射程\\nvt. 排列, 归类于, 使并列, 放牧\\nvi. 平行, 延伸, 漫游\\n[计] 量程…",["We do have something which is more in your price range.","I knew it was out of our price range, but I wanted to buy it anyway."],["我们确实有一些更符合您预算价位的产品。","我知道超出我們的預算了，但是我就想買下來。"]],["deep","di:p","a. 深的\\nadv. 深入地\\nn. 深渊, 深处",["He'll never show it, but I think that deep down, he's seriously worried.","Today's Beijing has given me a very deep impression and aroused my curiosity."],["他雖然擺着一副若無其事的樣子，但是我想他心裏一定擔心得不得了。","現代的北京给了我深刻的印象，也激起了我的好奇心。"]],["edge","edʒ","n. 边缘, 尖锐, 刀刃, 优势\\nvt. 使锐利, 挤进, 镶边\\nvi. 缓缓移动",["The company's competitive edge will be eroded if system engineers continue to leave.","The laptop provides cutting-edge technology at an affordable price."],["如果系统工程师继续离开，公司的竞争优势将会被削弱。","這款筆記型電腦價格親民，技術領先。"]],["specific","spi'sifik","n. 特效药, 特性\\na. 特殊的, 明确的, 具有特效的, 特定地, 具体地",["Could you tell me what your specific requirements are?","By using four types of metal, specific frequency resonance is suppressed."],["可以说说您的具体要求吗？",""]],["writer","'raitә","n. 作家, 撰稿者, 抄写员\\n[化] 记录器",["A writer is somebody for whom writing is more difficult than it is for other people.","He's not such a great writer and I think he knows it."],["作家是一個寫作對他來說比對其他人更困難的人。","他不是那么出色的作家我想他知道这一点。"]],["trouble","'trʌbl","n. 烦恼, 麻烦, 困难, 动乱, 故障\\nvt. 困扰, 麻烦, 使烦恼, 折磨\\nvi. 烦恼, 费心",["I had no idea it would put you to so much trouble.","Between you and me, he's in trouble with the boss."],["我一点都不知道这会给你带来那么多问题。","他和老板有矛盾，这个我们知道就好。"]],["necessary","'nesisәri","a. 必要的；必然的；必需的",["It is necessary to obtain the sanction of the authorities to enter this building.","You'd better remember that tipping is necessary in the USA."],["必須獲得有關當局的批准才能進入這座建築物。","你最好記住，在美國給小費是必須的。"]],["throughout","θru:'aut","adv. 到处, 贯穿全部地, 自始至终\\nprep. 遍及, 在各处\\n[计] 吞吐量",["There are beautiful flowers scattered throughout the garden.","Throughout Heaven and Earth, I alone am the honored one."],["花園裡散落著美麗的花朵。","天上天下，唯我獨尊。"]],["challenge","'tʃælindʒ","n. 挑战, 盘问\\nvt. 向...挑战, 要求, 怀疑\\nvi. 挑战, 对(证据等)表示异议",["The challenge we are going to face is how to increase work efficiency.","Crafting a perfect Mojito can be a challenge. Achieving the right balance of sweetness, mintiness, and lime is an art."],["如何提高工作效率是我们现在要面临的难题。","調製一杯完美的 Mojito 並非易事。要達到甜味、薄荷味和青檸味之間的完美平衡，是一門藝術。"]],["fear","fiә","n. 恐怖, 害怕, 担心\\nv. 害怕, 恐惧, 为...担心, 敬畏",["To fear love is to fear life, and those who fear life are already three parts dead.","James had a great fear of making mistakes in class and being reprimanded."],["惧怕爱就是惧怕生活，那些惧怕生活的人已经有四分之三部分死了。","詹姆斯怕极了在课堂上犯错并被训斥。"]],["shoulder","'ʃәuldә","n. 肩, 肩膀, 衣肩\\nvt. 肩负, 负担, 担任\\nvi. 用肩推挤",["My shoulder hurts so much, I don't know what to do.","Tom hooked his arm under John's shoulder and flipped him over."],["我的肩膀很痛，我不知道怎么办。","湯姆把手臂勾進約翰的腋下，把他翻了過去。"]],["institution",".insti'tju:ʃәn","n. 机构, 惯例, 制度\\n[医] 机关, 机构, 设施",["In the heart of the city, there is an institution with a golden history.","A serious linguistic institution won't ever censure a translation, it does not matter how dirty or rude it feels when reading it."],["",""]],["middle","'midl","n. 中央, 中间, 腰部\\na. 中央的, 中庸的, 中间的",["The graduation from elementary school to middle school is regarded by some as the first step towards adulthood.","The bus stopped suddenly in the middle of the street."],["有些人認為從小學升到中學是踏入成年的第一步。","公車突然在路中央停下來。"]],["sea","si:","n. 海, 海洋, 海浪, 大量\\n[法] 海, 海洋",["A camel is to the desert what a ship is to the sea.","I would often go swimming in the sea when a child."],["駱駝是沙漠之舟。","我小时候经常在海里游泳。"]],["dream","dri:m","n. 梦, 空想, 愿望\\nv. 做梦, 想象, 梦想",["It is no longer a dream for man to live on the moon.","You can make your dream come true by working hard."],["人类在月球上居住已不再是梦想。","你努力工作的話，就可以實現你的夢想。"]],["bar","bɑ:","n. 条, 棒, 酒吧, 栅, 障碍物\\nvt. 禁止, 阻挡, 妨碍\\n[计] 棒形图",["Whether you pass the Chinese exam or not, let's go to the bar to drink beer.","The bar-tailed godwit migrates from Alaska to New Zealand."],["不管你有沒有通過中文考試，我們一起去酒吧喝啤酒。","斑尾塍鷸從阿拉斯加遷徙至紐西蘭。"]],["beautiful","'bju:tiful","a. 美丽的",["Your mother must have been beautiful when she was young.","Indeed she is young and beautiful, but she is in delicate health."],["你母親年輕的時候一定很美。","她确实年轻貌美，但她体质娇弱。"]],["property","'prɒpәti","n. 财产, 所有权, 性质, 属性\\n[计] 属性",["All humans are equal and independent. No one can damage another's life, health, freedom, and property.","He left all his property to his wife in his will."],["一切人都是平等和独立的，没有人有权损害另一个人的生命、健康、自由和财产。","他在遺囑裏說要把他的財產全部留給他的妻子。"]],["instead","in'sted","adv. 作为替代, 反而",["Instead, they live alone as long as they are able to take care of themselves.","I will play Sudoku then instead of continuing to bother you."],["恰恰相反，在有能力自己照顾自己的时候，他们独自生活。","那我就不继续打扰你，玩数独游戏去了。"]],["improve","im'pru:v","vt. 改良, 提高...的价值, 改善, 利用\\nvi. 变得更好, 增加",["I'd like to study in China to improve the level of my Chinese.","It seems that the purpose of his study abroad was to improve his ability to speak English."],["为了提高我的汉语水平，我想去中国学习。","看来他出国学习的目的是要提高他说英语的能力。"]],["stuff","stʌf","n. 原料, 要素, 东西, 材料, 素质, 织品, 废物, 废话\\nvt. 装填\\nvi. 狼吞虎咽",["We ought to buy some new office equipment: the stuff we've got is out of date.","Old stuff that doesn't fit any more can be used as cloths."],["我們現在的辦公室用品都過時了，得去買點新的了。","不合适的旧衣物可以当抹布用。"]],["detail","'di:teil","n. 细节, 详情\\nvt. 详述, 选派\\nvi. 画详图\\n[计] 详细数据",["He researched British tea culture in great detail.","Please tell me in complete detail what occurred, when and where."],["他对英国茶文化很有研究。","请给我统统说清楚什么时候在哪里发生了什么事。"]],["method","'meθәd","n. 方法, 办法, 条理, 秩序\\n[医] [方]法",["He's proposing a suggestion for altering the research method.","Actually, the present method has plenty of room for improvement."],["他提出改革研究方法的意见。","其實現時的方法還有很大的改善空間。"]],["somebody","'sʌmbɒdi","n. 了不起的人, 大人物\\npron. 有人, 某人",["A writer is somebody for whom writing is more difficult than it is for other people.","Sami looked at himself as somebody smarter than anybody else."],["作家是一個寫作對他來說比對其他人更困難的人。","萨米自认为他比他身边的其他人都聪明。"]],["magazine",".mægә'zi:n","n. 杂志, 仓库, 弹盒, 胶卷盒\\n[计] 卡片箱, 介质装卸程序",["This kind of magazine can do harm to young people.","Mick killed time by reading a magazine while waiting for his date."],["这种杂志对年轻人有害。","Mick等待约会的时候靠读杂志打发时间。"]],["hotel","hәu'tel","n. 旅馆, 客栈",["This building is a capsule hotel lodging men and women.","We could see the full extent of the park from the hotel."],["那个建筑物是男女都可以住宿的胶囊酒店。","我們從酒店裏可以把整個公園看得清清楚楚。"]],["soldier","'sәuldʒә","n. 军人, 士兵, 兵蚁\\nvi. 从军, 尽职, 偷懒, 磨洋工",["Both victory and defeat are but an everyday occurrence to a soldier.","\"I hope we'll be home for Christmas\", said the soldier."],["胜败是兵家常事。","士兵说道：“我希望圣诞节时我们能在家里。”"]],["reflect","ri'flekt","vt. 反射, 反映, 招致, 深思\\nvi. 被反射, 映出, 深思, 考虑, 指责",["The manners and customs of a country reflect its culture.","While most of us are significantly better off financially than our parents and grandparents, happiness levels haven't changed to reflect that."],["一个国家的风俗习惯反映了它的文化。","虽然我们大多数人比我们的父母、祖父母还要富裕得多，但是与之相应的快乐程度却没有多大的改变。"]],["heavy","'hevi","a. 重的, 巨大的, 沉重的, 笨重的, 过度的\\nadv. 沉重地\\nn. 重物, 严肃角色",["I'm glad we didn't go there because there were some localized heavy rain showers.","The track meet was called off on account of the heavy rain."],["我很庆幸我们没有去那儿，因为当时那儿有局部大暴雨。","田徑運動會因天雨關係取消了。"]],["sexual","'sekʃuәl","a. 性的, 性别的\\n[医] 性的; 性欲的",["Do transgender people need to continuously use hormones to maintain their sexual characteristics?","Recent comics have too many violent and sexual scenes."],["变性者需要不断服用激素来维持性别特征吗？",""]],["bag","bæg","n. 袋子, 袋状物\\nvt. 使膨大, 装袋, 猎获",["I shouldn't have eaten the whole bag of potato chips.","For the new year, Liu's company gives every employee a bag of flour."],["我不该把一整包薯片都吃完的。","過年時，小劉的單位给每位員工發一袋麵粉。"]],["heat","hi:t","n. 热, 热度, 体温, 高潮\\nvi. 加热, 激昂, 加剧\\nvt. 把...加热, 使激动",["People show up bright on an infrared camera because of their body heat.","They went to Edinburgh to escape from the summer heat."],["人會因為體溫而在紅外線攝影機上顯現。","他们去了爱丁堡避暑。"]],["marriage","'mæridʒ","n. 婚姻, 结婚, 婚礼, 合并\\n[医] 婚姻, 结婚",["Marriage has many pains, but celibacy has no pleasures.","Keep your eyes wide open before marriage, half shut afterwards."],["婚姻生活固然有許多痛苦的地方，但單身也絕不是一件樂事。","婚前張開眼，婚後半閉眼。"]],["tough","tʌf","n. 恶棍\\na. 强硬的, 艰苦的, 坚固的, 坚韧的, 粗暴的, 咬不动的",["He won't be easily discouraged, because he's a tough guy.","I think that, in tough times, you can cry as much as you want."],["他很坚强，不会那么容易灰心。","我想, 在艰难的时候, 你想哭就使劲哭吧。"]],["sing","siŋ","vi. 唱, 唱歌, 演唱, 鸣, 啼\\nvt. 唱, 歌颂\\nn. 嗖嗖声",["She can sing better than anybody else in her class.","It would be wonderful if you could sing at our wedding."],["她唱歌唱得比班上任何一個人好。","你能在我们的婚礼上唱歌就太好了。"]],["purpose","'pә:pәs","n. 目的, 意向, 决心, 用途, 效果, 论题\\nvt. 意欲, 企图, 计划",["She went to Italy for the purpose of studying music.","Compared to a computer, a word processor has a single purpose."],["她去意大利是为了学习音乐。","文字處理軟件和電腦不同的是，它只有一個用途。"]],["surface","'sә:fis","n. 面, 表面, 水面, 外表, 平面\\na. 表面的, 外观的, 肤浅的, 水面上的\\nvt. 使成平面, 使浮出水面\\nvi. 浮出…",["Three fourths of the earth's surface is covered with water.","A fallen leaf floated on the surface of the water."],["地表的四分之三被水覆蓋。","水面浮着一片落葉。"]],["exist","ig'zist","vi. 存在, 生存, 发生",["Industry as we know it today didn't exist in those days.","You will exist but you will never know what it is to live."],["我们今天所认识的工业在那个时代不存在。","你活着，但是却不知道为什么活着。"]],["pattern","'pætәn","n. 模范, 典型, 式样, 样品, 图案, 格调, 模式\\nvt. 模仿, 仿造, 以图案装饰\\nvi. 形成图案\\n[计] 模式, 图案",["India ink produces an interesting pattern when used as a dye.","There's a fear that the snow will strengthen amid the strong winter pressure pattern."],["墨汁用作染料时会产生有趣的图案。","人們擔心在強勁的冬季氣壓模式下，降雪量會增加。"]],["whom","hu:m","pron. 谁",["The man whom she is going to marry is an astronaut.","A writer is somebody for whom writing is more difficult than it is for other people."],["她的未婚夫是一個太空人。","作家是一個寫作對他來說比對其他人更困難的人。"]],["skin","skin","n. 皮肤, 皮\\nvt. 剥皮, 在...植皮\\nvi. 长皮, 愈合, 蜕皮",["When the body is touched, receptors in the skin send messages to the brain causing the release of chemicals such as endorphins.","Staying up late at night is very bad for your skin."],["當身體受到外界觸碰的時候，皮膚的感受器就會向大腦發出信息，令大腦釋放安多芬等的化學物質。","熬夜是皮肤的大敌。"]],["agent","'eidʒәnt","n. 代理商, 政府代表, 动原, 媒介\\n[计] 代理程序",["In case of an emergency, get in touch with my agent.","In case of an emergency, get in touch with my agent right away."],["万一有紧急情况，联系我的代理人。","如遇情况紧急，请立即联系我的代理。"]],["owner","'әunә","n. 拥有者, 物主, 所有人\\n[经] 所有者, 物主, 业主",["Nobody understood why the elephant suddenly turned on its owner.","The moment Pip saw its owner come home, it excitedly wagged its tail."],["没有人明白为什么大象突然攻击了它的主人。","皮皮一看到主人回家，就興奮地搖尾巴。"]],["machine","mә'ʃi:n","n. 机器, 机械装置, 机构, 自动售货机, 机械般工作的人\\nvt. 以机器制造",["What a waste to buy such an expensive machine even though he doesn't even know how to use computers.","In the long run, we can save a lot of money by buying this machine."],["買這麼貴的機器真是浪費, 而他甚至不知道怎麼用電腦。","長遠來說，我們買了這台機器可以省回很多錢。"]],["gas","gæs","n. 气体, 汽油, 瓦斯\\n[化] 气体; 煤气; 瓦斯; 毒气",["So it seems that cloud of odorless deadly gas had a silver lining after all.","Remember to check to make sure the gas has been turned off before you go out."],["只能说，那团无味的致命气体，也不是没有好处。","出门前记得检查一下煤气是否关好了。"]],["ahead","ә'hed","a. 领先的, 预先的, 向前的\\nadv. 领先, 预先, 向前, 胜于, 在前面, 在将来",["If you discover any problems on Tatoeba, you should go ahead and blame Sysko.","If you can't come, you should let me know ahead of time."],["你要是在Tatoeba上发现什么问题，你应该责备Sysko才对。","如果你不能來，你該讓我提前知道。"]],["generation",".dʒenә'reiʃәn","n. 一代, 一世, 产生\\n[医] 生殖, 世代",["The proliferation of Internet usage has given birth to a new generation of young people.","These old customs have been handed down from generation to generation."],["互联网的广泛应用使新一代的年轻人诞生了。","這些古老習俗都是一代一代相傳下來的。"]],["commercial","kә'mә:ʃәl","a. 商业的, 商用的, 商品化的\\nn. 商业广告节目",["The economist and statistician based in Ivory Coast says commercial trade in the region is primarily conducted with France.","As commercial and cultural contacts between East and West developed, Arab and Persian traders began calling on China along the Silk Road in increasing numbers."],["這位常駐科特迪瓦的經濟學家兼統計學家表示，該地區的商業貿易主要與法國進行。","隨著東西方之間的貿易及文化往來日漸發展，越來越多的阿拉伯和波斯商人開始沿著絲路拜訪中國。"]],["address","ә'dres","n. 住址, 演说, 举止, 灵巧, 求爱\\nvt. 发表(演说或讲话), 对付, 写地址\\n[计] 地址, 寻址",["He asked me my age, my name, my address, and so forth.","He said that if he knew her address, he would write to her."],["他問了我的年齡、姓名、地址等等。","他说如果他知道她的地址，他会写信给她。"]],["cancer","'kænsә","n. 癌, 恶性肿瘤\\n[医] 癌",["Research on the causes of cancer is very expensive.","Smokers are far more likely to develop lung cancer than non-smokers are."],["有關癌症成因的研究耗費頗巨。","吸煙的人患上肺癌的風險比不吸煙的人高得多。"]],["item","'aitәm","n. 项目, 条款, 一则, 项\\n[计] 项",["The style of this item of clothing is good; it's just a bit expensive.","If I do not get the item this week, I will make a complaint to PayPal."],["这件衣服样式倒是挺好，就是贵了点儿。","如果本周我收不到货，我就向paypal投诉。"]],["reality","ri'æliti","n. 实在, 事实, 实体, 逼真\\n[法] 现实, 实在存在的事物, 实在性",["In reality black is not a color; it is the absence of color.","The third point to make is that Emmet attempted to harmonize his theory with the reality of designing."],["黑色其實不是一種顏色，而是一種沒有顏色的狀態。","他的第三点说明的是，埃米特试图协调现实与他的理论设计。"]],["coach","kәutʃ","n. 四轮大马车, 教练\\nvt. 训练, 指导\\nvi. 坐马车旅行, 作指导",["The players sat in the locker room while they listened to their coach speak.","The manager and coach stood on the touchline shouting out instructions to their team."],["球员们坐在更衣室里听教练讲话。","足球教练站在边线上对自己的队伍喊出指令。"]],["yard","jɑ:d","n. 码, 庭院, 工场\\n[化] 堆置场",["There is a fence marking the boundary between our yard and the neighbor's.","It's raining, so the kids aren't playing in the yard."],["我家院子和邻居家院子之间有一道篱笆做为分界线。.","正在下雨，孩子们没有在院子里玩儿。"]],["beat","bi:t","n. 心跳(声), 打, 敲打声, 拍子\\nv. 打, 拍打, 打败\\na. 疲乏的, 颓废的\\nbeat的过去式\\n[计] 拍; 节拍",["As far as English is concerned, nobody can beat me.","Let's not beat around the bush here! I'm pregnant, and you're the kid's father."],["在英語能力方面，沒有人能比我好。","我們就開門見山吧！我懷孕了，而你就是孩子他爸。"]],["violence","'vaiәlәns","n. 猛烈, 暴力, 暴虐, 暴行\\n[法] 暴行, 暴力, 暴乱",["Victory attained by violence is tantamount to a defeat, for it is momentary.","A revolution is an insurrection, an act of violence by which one class overthrows another."],["靠武力取勝，猶如落敗，因為這樣的勝利不會長久。","革命就是一场暴动，一场由一个阶级推翻另一个阶级的暴力行动。"]],["total","'tәutl","a. 全体的, 总的, 全然的\\nvt. 计算...的总和, 共计为\\nvi. 合计\\nn. 总数, 全体, 合计\\nadv. 统统",["The total solar eclipse can be observed next year on June 22nd.","Due to total Russification in Belarus, the Belarusian language is on the brink of extinction."],["明年 6 月 22 日可以觀測到日全食。","由于白俄罗斯完全地俄罗斯化，白俄罗斯语在绝灭的边缘。"]],["tend","tend","vi. 走向, 有某种的倾向, 易于, 照顾, 注意\\nvt. 照料, 护理",["I'm lazy about my hair, so I tend to look like a slob.","The capitalists tend to exploit the working people."],["我懒得整理我的头发，所以我看起来就像个懒汉。","资本家倾向于压榨工人。"]],["investment","in'vestmәnt","n. 投资\\n[医] 包埋料, 围模料, 包埋法, 围模法",["In our opinion, solar panels are a good investment.","They obtained a yield of 8 percent on their investment."],["在我们看来，太阳能电池是一项很好的投资。","他們在這次的投資中得到百分之八的收益。"]],["discussion","dis'kʌʃәn","n. 讨论",["Godwin's law teaches us that any infinite discussion about an arbitrary subject converges to a Nazi comparison.","It goes without saying that he will come to the discussion."],["高德温法则告诉我们对任何主题的所有无休止的讨论会趋于和纳粹主义的类比。","毫无疑问，他会来参加讨论。"]],["finger","'fiŋgә","n. 手指, 指状物, (手套的)手指部分, 指针\\nv. 用手指拨弄, 伸出\\n[计] 网络命令",["The hand has five fingers: the thumb, the index finger, the middle finger, the ring finger, and the pinky.","The teacher pointed her finger at me and asked me to come with her."],["人的手有五个手指: 拇指、食指、中指、无名指和小指。","教师用手指指着我，要我跟她走。"]],["garden","'gɑ:dn","n. 花园, 果园, 菜园\\nvi. 栽培花木\\nvt. 造园\\na. 花园的, 普通的",["We found many strange plants in a botanical garden.","Rocks are beautifully arranged in the Japanese-style garden."],["我們在一家植物園裏找到了許多稀奇古怪的植物。","石頭被美麗得放置在日式庭園裡。"]],["notice","'nәutis","n. 注意, 布告, 通知, 预告, 短评\\nvt. 注意, 通知, 评论, 提及, 关注\\nvi. 注意",["Only when the poor enter the halls of the rich, do the rich notice that the poor exist.","He never takes any notice of what his father says."],["只有當窮人進入富人的大廳之時，富人才會注意到窮人的存在。","他總是把父親的話當作耳邊風。"]],["collection","kә'lekʃәn","n. 收集, 采集, (一批)收藏品, 募捐\\n[医] 收集; 收集品, 标本",["I would like to have a look at your collection of stamps.","I don't have a stamp collection, but I have a Japanese postcard collection that I could use as an excuse to invite him."],["我想看看您的邮票收藏。","我沒有集郵，但是卻收藏了一堆日本的明信片，我想我可以用這來做藉口，邀請他來我家。"]],["modern","'mɒdәn","n. 现代人, 有思想的人\\na. 现代的, 时髦的",["Modern travel enables us to go around the world in a few days.","Modern technology has made our lives more comfortable."],["现代交通使我们能在几天内环绕地球。","现代科学技术让我们的生活更加舒适。"]],["task","tɑ:sk","n. 工作, 任务, 作业, 困难的工作\\nvt. 派给...工作, 使辛劳\\n[计] 任务",["It's presumptuous for humans to assume that our task is to do what only God can do.","Our task has been easy so far, but it will be difficult from now on."],["人类假设我们的任务是完成只有上帝能做的事，这太自以为是了。","我们的任务到目前为止很轻松，但从现在开始将会变得很难。"]],["partner","'pɑ:tnә","n. 合伙人, 股东, 伙伴, 伴侣\\nvt. 与...合伙, 组成一对\\nvi. 做伙伴, 当助手",["The teacher and her partner took the people attending the wedding to a park.","Almost half the men in Great Britain regularly give chocolate to their partner, especially for their birthday."],["老师和她爱人带着参加婚礼的人来到一个公园。","大部分大不列颠的男人定期送巧克力作礼物给他们的配偶，尤其是在他们生日的时候。"]],["positive","'pɒzitiv","a. 肯定的, 积极的, 有把握的\\n[医] 正的, 阳性的",["His speech has had a positive effect on all of his coworkers.","With Renaissance, scholastic ideas gave place to positive ideas."],["他的讲话对所有同事产生了积极影响。","隨著文藝復興，學院派的想法被積極的想法取而代之了。"]],["civil","'sivәl","a. 市民的, 公民的, 有礼貌的\\n[法] 公民的, 国民的, 民用的",["If it had not been for civil war, they would be wealthy now.","Chun-chieh took the day off. I think he's taking the civil service exam."],["要不是当初有内战，他们现在应该挺富裕了。","俊傑今天請假，好像去考公職。"]],["kitchen","'kitʃin","n. 厨房, 全套炊具\\n[医] 厨房",["There is milk all over the kitchen floor because my wife broke the bottle.","Ever since she fell in the kitchen, she hasn't been all there."],["我老婆把瓶子打破了，把廚房弄得滿地都是牛奶。","自從她在廚房裡摔倒後，她不曾再到那裡。"]],["consumer","kәn'sju:mә","n. 消费者\\n[经] 消费者, 用户",["Not being able to carry out payments on time can cause very large losses for the consumer.","The consumer price index has been fluctuating wildly."],["不能按时交付货款的话会给客户带来很大损失。",""]],["shot","ʃɒt","n. 发射, 炮弹, 射击, 射手, 投篮, 射门, 子弹, 射程, 拍摄, 注射\\nvt. 装弹, 使成颗粒状\\na. 杂色的, 交织着…",["His only hope of winning the pool game at that point was to successfully execute a complex trick shot.","We know that Tom has been shot. That's all we know."],["那時他贏得撞球比賽的唯一希望，就是成功打出一記複雜的花式擊球。","我们知道，汤姆被枪杀。这就是我们所知道的一切。"]],["budget","'bʌdʒit","n. 预算\\nvi. 编预算\\nvt. 编入预算, 安排\\na. 廉价的",["The French government has launched an online game that challenges taxpayers to balance the national budget.","The calculation of the budget for next year is based on the costs this year."],["法國政府發布了一款線上遊戲，讓納稅人挑戰平衡國家預算。","明年预算的计算是基于今年的成本的。"]],["wish","wiʃ","n. 希望, 愿望, 祝愿, 命令, 请求\\nvt. 愿, 想要, 希望, 祝愿\\nvi. 希望",["If a sick person folds one thousand paper cranes, her wish will come true.","You speak French very well. I wish I could speak it as well as you."],["如果一個病人折一千隻紙鶴, 她的願望就會成真。","你的法语讲的很好。我希望可以讲的像你一样好。"]],["painting","'peintiŋ","n. 画, 绘画, 油漆\\n[化] 涂漆",["The value of the painting was estimated at several million dollars.","I like to do oil painting, but I don't intend to make that my lifelong occupation."],["这幅画被估价数百万元。","我喜欢画油画，但是我不想拿它做我的终身职业。"]],["scientist","'saiәntist","n. 科学家\\n[医] 科学家",["I hope that some scientist will soon discover a cure for AIDS.","A true scientist would not approach the question this way."],["真希望科学家们能早点找到艾滋病的治疗方法。","真正的科学家不会这样去思考。"]],["safe","seif","n. 保险箱, 冷藏室\\na. 安全的, 可靠的, 平安的, 稳健的, 有把握的",["Rio de Janeiro is perfectly safe as long as you stay out of the dangerous areas.","The next morning, to our great relief, he returned home safe and sound."],["只要你遠離危險區域，里約熱內盧就是完全安全的。","第二天早上，他就平安無事的回來了，我們都大大的鬆了一口氣。"]],["agreement","ә'gri:mәnt","n. 同意, 合约, 协议\\n[经] 契约, 协议, 协定",["There is not one person who is in agreement with the plan.","They express disagreement by shaking their heads, which may indicate agreement in other countries."],["贊成計劃的人一個也沒有。","他们以摇头表示不同意，而其他国家的人可能以摇头表示同意。"]],["mouth","mauθ","n. 嘴, 口, 口腔, 口状物\\nvi. 装腔作势说话, 做鬼脸\\nvt. 说出, 做作地说",["I saw a dog. The dog held a piece of meat in its mouth.","She laughed the way schoolgirls do, with her hand over her mouth."],["我看到了一条狗。狗嘴里叼着一块肉。","她捂着嘴，笑得跟个小女生似的。"]],["capital","'kæpitәl","n. 首都, 大写字母, 资本\\na. 首都的, 重要的",["A capital letter is used at the beginning of a sentence.","The Waterfront project will help to keep Edinburgh up-to-date and bring more people to Scotland's capital city."],["一個大寫字母被使用在一個句子的開頭。","水边地工程会帮助爱丁堡城市紧随形势并使更多人来苏格兰的首都。"]],["nor","nɒ:","conj. 也不, 也没有\\n[计] 或非",["She is neither in the kitchen nor in the living room.","A complete intransitive verb takes neither complement nor object."],["她不在廚房裏，也不在客廳裏。","一个完完全全的不及物动词既没有补语，又没有宾语。"]],["victim","'viktim","n. 受害人, 牺牲者, 牺牲品\\n[法] 受害人, 被害人, 遭难者",["The victim of blackmail has been paying hush money for years, but now he realizes it is foolish, and has decided not to pay a red cent more.","The shooting victim is alive, but just barely."],["被害人被勒索支付封口費已經很多年, 但現在他意識到這樣做是愚蠢的, 而且他已經決定再也不付一毛錢了。","那個中了槍的人還沒有死，但卻已經奄奄一息了。"]],["newspaper","'nju:z.peipә","n. 报纸",["The man answers to the description in the newspaper.","I always have a look at the newspaper before breakfast."],["那个男人和报纸上描述的一模一样。","我经常在早饭前看一眼报纸。"]],["threat","θret","n. 恐吓, 恶兆, 威胁\\n[经] 威胁",["But with the threat of a coronavirus epidemic, things might not look so sunny for Florida tourism.","This country considers every neighboring country as a threat."],["但隨著新冠病毒疫情的威脅，佛羅裡達州的旅遊業前景可能並不樂觀。","此國將周邊諸國都視作威脅。"]],["responsibility","ri.spɒnsә'biliti","n. 责任, 职责, 负担, 可靠性\\n[化] 职责",["It is time not only to equalize men's and women's wages, but also to equalize responsibility for housework.","He resigned from the job to take the responsibility for the loss."],["現在不止要男女薪金平等，而且還要平均分配家務。","为了这次的损失，他扛起责任，辞职了。"]],["smile","smail","n. 微笑, 喜色, 笑容\\nvi. 微笑, 觉得好笑\\nvt. 微笑着表示",["I can't remember when was the last time I've seen him smile.","She said good-bye with a smile, but there was a good deal of bitterness in her heart."],["我想不起來我甚麼時候最後一次看見他笑。","她說再見的時候，臉上掛著笑容，但其實心中是十分難受的。"]],["attorney","ә'tә:ni","n. 代理人, 律师\\n[经] 律师, 代理人",["It's totally without precedent for the suspect's attorney to be the true culprit.","You should confer with your attorney on this matter."],["這前所未聞, 犯罪嫌疑人的律師竟然是真正的罪魁禍首。",""]],["score","skɒ:","n. 得分, 抓痕, 二十个, 刻痕, 帐目, 乐谱, 起跑线, 终点线, 大量\\nvt. 刻划, 划线, 获得, 评价, 把...记下\\…",["The game ended in a draw, and the final score was 2-2.","Ronaldo shot the ball right into the back of the net to score the winning goal."],["比赛以平局结束，最后比分是二比二。","罗纳尔多一脚射门，打进制胜一球。"]],["account","ә'kaunt","n. 报告, 解释, 估价, 理由, 利润, 算账, 帐目\\nvi. 报帐, 解释, 导致, 报偿, 占, 杀死\\nvt. 认为\\n[计]…",["A couple of flights were delayed on account of the earthquake.","We must take into account the fact that he is young."],["一些航班由於地震被延誤了。","我们必须考虑到他很年轻。"]],["interesting","'intristiŋ","a. 有趣的",["This was the most interesting book that she had ever read.","It is said that \"Hamlet\" is the most interesting play ever written."],["這是她讀過最有趣的書。","据说《哈姆雷特》是写出来的最有意思的剧本。"]],["audience","'ɒ:diәns","n. 听众, 观众, 读者\\n[法] 听讼, 观众, 听众",["It requires wisdom to understand wisdom: the music is nothing if the audience is deaf.","However, some people in the audience were not pleased with the results."],["要用智慧来理解智慧：如果听众是聋的话，那音乐什么都不是。","尽管如此，观众中仍有些人不满意这个结果。"]],["rich","ri:tʃ","a. 富裕的, 富饶的, 浓厚的, 贵重的",["She became rich by virtue of hard work and good business sense.","Judging from her appearance, I think that she's rich."],["她憑著努力和生意頭腦成了富翁。","從她的外表上看，我想她大半是個有錢人。"]],["dinner","'dinә","n. 晚餐, 正餐, 宴会",["Thank you very much for the wonderful dinner last night.","Dinner is probably ready, so we had better hurry home."],["非常感謝您昨晚美妙的晚餐。","晚飯大概已經準備好了，我們還是快點回家吧。"]],["vote","vәut","n. 投票, 选举, 选票, 表决, 选举权, 得票数\\nvi. 投票, 选举\\nvt. 投票选举, 投票决定, 公认, 使投票",["In the U.S., most people can vote when they reach eighteen years of age.","And to those Americans whose support I have yet to earn, I may not have won your vote tonight, but I hear your voices. I need your help. And I will be your president, too."],["在美國，大多數人能在十八歲以後投票。","对于那些现在没有投票给我的美国人，我想说，我可能没有赢得你们的选票，但是我听到了你们的声音，我需要你们的帮助，而且我也将是你们的总统"]],["western","'westәn","n. 西方人, 西部片, 西部小说\\na. 向西方的, 来自西方的, 西方的, 西洋的, 西部的",["The novel \"All Quiet on the Western Front\" by Erich Maria Remarque has been translated into more than fifty languages.","Because it's a developing country, some aspects of China aren't as good as those in Western countries."],["埃里希馬里亞雷馬克所寫的小說\"西線無戰事\"已被翻譯成超過五十種語言。","因为中国是个发展中的国家，所以有的方面没有西方国家那么好。"]],["relate","ri'leit","vt. 讲, 叙述, 使互相关联\\nvi. 有关, 符合, 相处得好",["It is difficult to relate to someone who has different values from you.","Being active at night may relate to the behavior of seals, which feed at night on various fish that come up closer to the surface."],["",""]],["travel","'trævl","n. 旅行, 游历, 行进\\nvi. 旅行, 行进, 移动, 被传播\\nvt. 旅行, 通过, 使移动",["His large income enables him to travel abroad every year.","Space travel will be commonplace some time in the future."],["他的收入很高，所以每年都能出國旅行。","太空旅行終有一天會成為平常事。"]],["debate","di'beit","n. 辩论, 讨论\\nv. 争论, 辩论",["He organized a classroom debate on current events.","The jury's guilty verdict gave rise to widespread debate."],["他組織了一場關於時事的課堂辯論。","陪审团作出的犯罪判决激起了很大的争论。"]],["prevent","pri'vent","v. 预防, 防止, 阻止, 妨碍",["Condoms are an effective measure to prevent HIV and many other diseases.","To prevent them from being pirated, some of his films were never shown at the cinema."],["避孕套是預防艾滋病和許多其他疾病的有效手段。","为了防止盗版，他有些电影从未在影院上映。"]],["citizen","'sitizn","n. 市民, 公民\\n[法] 公民, 国民, 市民",["A democrat is a free citizen who yields to the will of the majority.","Every male Algerian citizen must do military service."],["民主主义者是屈服于大部分人的自由公民。","每个阿尔及利亚的男性国民都需要服兵役。"]],["majority","mә'dʒɒriti","n. 多数, 大半\\n[计] 多数逻辑",["A democrat is a free citizen who yields to the will of the majority.","Where programmers use semi-colons every day, the majority of people only use them in emoticons."],["民主主义者是屈服于大部分人的自由公民。","尽管程序设计师天天都会用到分号，大多数人只把分号用在表情中。"]],["none","nʌn","adv. 一点也不, 毫不\\npron. 没有人, 无一物, 并无一个\\na. 没有的",["None of us thought he was to blame for the accident.","Six people applied for the job, but none of them were employed."],["我們都不認為他是事故的罪魁禍首。","六个人投了这份工作，但他们中没有一个被录用。"]],["front","frʌnt","n. 前面, 开头, 前线, 阵线, 态度\\nvt. 面对, 朝向, 对抗\\nvi. 朝向",["There is a bookstore in front of the department store.","Turning to the right, you will find the city hall in front of you."],["百货商店前有个书店。","向右转，你就可以看到市政厅位于正前方。"]],["born","bɒ:n","a. 天生的\\nbear的过去分词",["As soon as we are born, the world gets to work on us and transforms us from merely biological into social units.","I visited the house in which Shakespeare was born."],["我們一出生在這個世界上，就會開始受到周遭環境的影響，從生物單位慢慢進化成社會單位。","我去参观了莎士比亚的故居。"]],["admit","әd'mit","vt. 承认, 接受, 允许进入, 容许\\nvi. 开向, 容许, 承认",["I admit that if it weren't for him, the next ten years of my life would have been empty and devoid of purpose.","Although the government refuses to admit it, its economic policy is in ruins."],["我承认，没有他，我未来十年的生活将会是空虚的、没有目标的。","尽管政府拒绝承认，它的经济政策还是失败了。"]],["senior","'si:njә","n. 年长者, 资深者, 毕业班学生\\na. 年长的, 高级的, 资深的",["I'm not sure if you remember me, but I'm an alumnus who took a couple of your classes during my senior year.","She gave her seat to a senior citizen."],["不知道您是否還記得我，我是曾在大四修過您幾門課的校友。","她把她的座位让给了一个老人。"]],["assume","ә'sju:m","vt. 假定, 承担, 呈现\\nvi. 装腔作势, 僭越",["It's presumptuous for humans to assume that our task is to do what only God can do.","I assume that you wouldn't want to do that."],["人类假设我们的任务是完成只有上帝能做的事，这太自以为是了。","我想你不会那么做的吧。"]],["wind","wind","n. 风, 气息, 气味, 呼吸, 风声, 趋势, 空谈, 卷绕, 弯曲\\nvt. 使通风, 嗅出, 使喘气, 吹号角, 上发条, 缠绕,…",["You know the phrase, we reap what we sow. I have sown the wind and this is my storm.","Without air there can be no wind or sound on the moon."],["你也知道那句話，「善有善報，惡有惡報」。我搧的風，現在火就來了。","月球表面沒有空氣，所以沒有風，也沒有聲音。"]],["key","ki:","n. 钥匙, 键, 解答, 关键, 要害, 基调, 线索, 答案, 暗礁\\nvt. 调音, 锁上, 提供线索\\nvi. 使用钥匙\\n[计]…",["Could you please find the missing key. I can't open the pantry.","If I lost my key, I wouldn't be able to lock the door."],["你能帮忙寻找丢失的钥匙吗? 我打不开食品柜。","如果我弄丟了我的鑰匙，我就無法鎖門了。"]],["professional","prә'feʃәnl","n. 专业人才\\na. 专业的, 职业的",["The point we must clarify here is that the lines between amateur and professional in sport are beginning to disappear.","My son wants to become a professional golf player."],["我们必须阐明这个观点，在运动项目上，业余选手和专业选手的界限开始消失了。","我的兒子想成為一個專業高爾夫球手。"]],["mission","'miʃәn","n. 任务, 代表团, 使命, 传教团\\nvt. 派遣, 向...传教",["The American mission is to eliminate communism from the world.","With their cooperation, the mission had been successfully finished."],["美国的任务是将共产主义从世界上消除。","在他們的默契合作下，任務完美地完成了。"]],["fast","fɑ:st","a. 快速的, 紧的\\nadv. 很快地, 紧紧地, 彻底地\\nn. 绝食, 斋戒\\nvi. 绝食, 斋戒",["He walked as fast as he could to catch up with her.","Please don't walk so fast. I can't keep pace with you."],["為了趕上她，他儘快的走。","請別走得那麼快，我跟不上你。"]],["alone","ә'lәun","a. 孤独的, 单独的, 独自的\\nadv. 独自地",["Instead, they live alone as long as they are able to take care of themselves.","My grandfather sometimes talks to himself when he's alone."],["恰恰相反，在有能力自己照顾自己的时候，他们独自生活。","我祖父一个人的时候，有时会自言自语。"]],["customer","'kʌstәmә","n. 消费者\\n[化] 顾客",["An increase in customer complaints could signal a decline in business.","Our on-line Customer Service Desk and trained support agents enable problems to be quickly identified and addressed."],["顧客投訴量增加，可能代表生意正在走下坡。","我們的線上客服台和訓練有素的支援代理能夠快速識別和解決問題。"]],["suffer","'sʌfә","vt. 遭受, 经历, 忍受\\nvi. 受痛苦, 受损害",["Worries are like ghosts - those who aren't afraid of them can't suffer at their hands.","Music is inner life, and he will never suffer loneliness who has inner life."],["忧愁就像魔鬼一样，它伤害不了不害怕它的人。","音乐是内心世界，拥有了内心世界的他永远不会觉得孤独。"]],["speech","spi:tʃ","n. 演讲, 说话, 谈话, 言语, 引语, 民族语言\\n[医] 言语, 语言",["The following is a summary of the President's speech.","I could hardly follow what Jane said in her speech."],["下面是总统讲话的概要。","我幾乎完全跟不上 Jane 的演講內容。"]],["successful","sәk'sesful","a. 成功的, 一帆风顺的, 顺利的\\n[经] 成功的",["Silvio Berlusconi is an Italian politician, the current Prime Minister of Italy, as well as a successful entrepreneur.","If there is somebody to back me up, the business will be successful."],["西爾維奧·貝盧斯科尼除了是一位意大利政治家和現任的意大利總理，也是一個成功的商人。","如果有人支持的話，生意是會成功的。"]],["option","'ɒpʃәn","n. 选择权, 挑选, 选项\\n[计] 选项",["In the U.S., you have the option, when you enter a restaurant, to sit in the smoking or non-smoking section.","Veggie burgers are a plant-based option."],["在美国，当你进入餐厅时，你可选择坐在吸烟区或是禁烟区。","素食漢堡是一種蔬食選擇。"]],["participant","pɑ:'tisipәnt","n. 参加者, 参与者\\na. 有份的, 参加的, 参与的",["So far there has been only one participant who won one million Israeli Shekels in \"Who Wants to Be a Millionaire\" in Israel.","Anthropologists use interviews and participant observation to gain an emic."],["",""]],["southern","'sʌðәn","n. 南方人, 男风\\na. 向南方的, 来自南方的",["In Southern China, the qipao is also known as \"changshan\".","In China, southern people eat rice as staple food; northern people eat wheaten food as staple food."],["在中国南方，旗袍又称“长衫”。","在中国，南方人以米饭为主食，北方人以面食为主食。"]],["university",".ju:ni'vә:siti","n. 大学",["The university was founded by his father twenty years ago.","More than 40 percent of the students go to university."],["大学在20年前由他的父亲建立。","40%以上的学生去读大学。"]],["eventually","i'ventʃuәli","adv. 最后, 终于",["Eventually I'd like to settle down and have a family, but not yet.","But I dare to say that it is better to face those few but powerful interests, rather than eventually facing the fury of society."],["我會找個地方安頓下來，然後結婚生子的，但這是以後的事。","但我敢说解决这些少数群体的利益问题—虽然这些利益很大，但总比以后面对社会的愤怒好。"]],["fresh","freʃ","a. 新鲜的, 新奇的, 另外的, 淡的, 精神饱满的, 冒失的\\nadv. 最新地, 刚刚\\nn. 开始, 泛滥",["This device made it possible to turn sea-water into fresh water easily.","He is fresh from college, so he has no experience."],["有了這個裝置，把海水淨化成淡水就不是難事了。","他刚刚大学毕业，所以没什么经验。"]],["forest","'fɒrist","n. 森林, 林区\\nvt. 植树于",["The prevention of forest fires is everyone's responsibility.","Once upon a time there was a dwarf that lived in the forest."],["防止山火，人人有責。","從前有個侏儒住在森林裡。"]],["video","'vidiәu","n. 影像, 电视\\na. 图像的, 电视的",["I think you haven't watched the video till the end.","The number of people who play video games on PC is increasing."],["我感觉你还没把视频看完。","在電腦上玩電玩遊戲的人數正在增加。"]],["global","'glәubl","a. 通用的, 全球的, 球形的, 综合的, 普遍的\\n[计] 共用",["The term 'greenhouse effect' is often used when people talk about global changes of climate nowadays.","As global warming increases, sea levels get higher and higher."],["人们谈到全球气候变化的时候，常常用到“温室效应”这个词。","海面随着全球变暖的加剧而越来越高。"]],["senate","'senit","n. 参议院, 立法机构, 评议会",["He was elected to the Senate in the last election.","SOPA and PIPA are two bills in the United States House of Representatives and the United States Senate respectively."],["",""]],["reform","ri'fɒ:m","n. 改革, 改正, 改造\\nvt. 改革, 改过, 革新, 重整\\nvi. 革新, 改过",["The politician pushed for reform by denouncing the corruption of the government officials.","The raising of children is something that concerns the entire community. There will be an education reform."],["政治家以揭露政府官员的腐败来推动改革。","子女培养全社会都很关心，教育要进行改革。"]],["access","'ækses","n. 通路, 入口, 接近, 进入, 使用权, 发作\\nvt. 访问, 存取, 接近, 使用\\n[计] 访问, 存取",["Any student with an I.D. card has access to the library.","The burglar gained access to the house through this door."],["所有持有學生證的學生均可進入圖書館。","竊賊是從這扇門進到屋子裡的。"]],["restaurant","'restәrɒŋ","n. 餐馆, 饭店",["In the U.S., you have the option, when you enter a restaurant, to sit in the smoking or non-smoking section.","I don't recommend eating in that restaurant. The food is awful."],["在美国，当你进入餐厅时，你可选择坐在吸烟区或是禁烟区。","我不推荐在那家餐馆吃饭。食物糟糕透了。"]],["judge","dʒʌdʒ","n. 法官, 裁判员, 审判官, 鉴定人\\nvt. 审理, 鉴定, 判断, 判决, 裁定\\nvi. 下判断, 作评价",["You should be able to judge when you've had too much to drink.","The judge sentenced him to one year's imprisonment."],["你应该自己判断什么时候喝了太多酒。","法官判了他一年有期徒刑。"]],["publish","'pʌbliʃ","vt. 出版, 发行, 公开, 发表, 宣传, 公布\\nvi. 出版, 发行",["He has written a book, however, he has no money to publish it.","Taishukan advertised it would publish a new dictionary."],["他寫了一本書，但是沒有錢出版。",""]],["relation","ri'leiʃәn","n. 关系, 联系, 叙述, 故事, 家属, 亲戚\\n[计] 关系",["His claim is that there is a close relation between birth order and personality.","I can describe China, especially in relation to big cities like Beijing, in one sentence - China is a country whose pace of life is both fast and leisurely."],["他主張的是出生的先後次序和個性有很密切的關係。","我能用一句话描述中国，尤其是关于北京那样的大城市：中国是一个有悠闲生活并有快速生活的国家。"]],["release","ri'li:s","n. 释放, 发泄, 豁免, 发行, 释放证书\\nvt. 释放, 解除, 放松, 豁免, 免除, 发布, 放弃, 让与\\nn. 发布\\n[…",["When the body is touched, receptors in the skin send messages to the brain causing the release of chemicals such as endorphins.","With the release of Skype, studying languages has become easier."],["當身體受到外界觸碰的時候，皮膚的感受器就會向大腦發出信息，令大腦釋放安多芬等的化學物質。","学习语言随着Skype的发行而变得更容易。"]],["bird","bә:d","n. 鸟, 羽毛球\\nvi. 打鸟",["A prudent bird chooses its tree. A wise servant chooses his master.","A bird in the hand is better than two in the bush."],["良禽择木而栖，贤臣择主而事。","一鳥在手勝過二鳥在林。"]],["labor","'leibә","n. 劳动, 努力, 工作, 劳工, 分娩\\nvi. 劳动, 努力, 苦干\\nvt. 详细分析, 使厌烦",["Capital, land and labor are the three key factors of production.","Labor is not merely a necessity but a pleasure."],["资本、土地和劳动是生产的三大要素。","劳动不仅是一种需要，而还是一种愉快。"]],["opinion","ә'pinjәn","n. 意见, 评价, 主张\\n[经] 意见",["You may be right, but we have a slightly different opinion.","After the incident I came to have a higher opinion of him."],["也许你是对的，但我们的意见稍微有所不同。","這個事件過後我對他的評價很高。"]],["credit","'kredit","n. 信用, 信任, 荣誉, 贷款, 学分\\nvt. 归功于, 赞颂, 信任, 相信\\n[计] 信用量",["It makes sense to pay off your credit card balance every month.","I use a credit card to pay for things more often than cash."],["每个月还清信用卡负债很重要。","通常我用信用卡支付多过用现金。"]],["critical","'kritikәl","a. 批评的, 决定性的, 危险的, 临界的\\n[医] 危象的; 临界的, 极期的",["Now is the critical moment. Please stop being so stubborn and inflexible, completely unable to adapt flexibility.","I can't understand why you are so critical of him."],["現在正是關鍵的時候了，請不要還那麼死腦筋，絲毫不知權變。","我不明白为什么你这么批评他。"]],["corner","'kɒ:nә","n. 角落, 转角, 窘境\\nvt. 迫至一隅, 垄断, 使陷入绝境\\nvi. 相交成角, 垄断\\n[计] 边角",["I often wonder if he'll suddenly appear at that coffee shop on the corner.","As everyone stood guard silently, someone ran to the corner of the street and called over a police officer."],["我常常想他会不会突然地出现在街角的咖啡店呢？","默默守护中，有人跑到街头，叫来了协警。"]],["concerned","kәn'sә:nd","a. 关心的, 有关的, 参与的, 担心的",["So far as this matter is concerned, I am completely satisfied.","People are getting more concerned about the matter."],["我對這件事感到十分滿意。","公眾對這件事越來越關心了。"]],["recall","ri'kɒ:l","n. 回忆, 召回, 撤消\\nvt. 回想, 回忆, 召回, 撤消, 使恢复\\n[计] 检索",["I can't recall the last time we met.","I can't recall her name at the moment."],["我想不起來我們上次見面的情况了。","我突然想不起她的名字。"]],["version","'vә:ʒәn","n. 一种描述, 版本, 译文\\n[计] 版本",["I'm very impatient to see the new version of Tatoeba.","The modernized version of the qipao is noted for accentuating the female figure."],["我迫不及待地想要看到Tatoeba的新版本。","现代版旗袍因能突显女人的身材而闻名。"]],["stare","stєә","vi. 注视, 凝视, 瞪视, 显眼\\nvt. 盯\\nn. 凝视",["It's embarrassing to be seen without make-up so please don't stare.","It isn't polite to stare at people."],["素颜太害羞了，请不要盯着我看。","盯著人看是不禮貌的。"]],["safety","'seifti","n. 安全, 保险, 平安, 保安设备\\nvt. 保护, 防护",["We conduct safety inspections here on a regular basis.","It's the law: always buckle your safety belt in cars and airplanes."],["我們定期在這裡施行安全檢查。","法律規定，在車輛和飛機上，一定要扣上安全帶。"]],["effective","i'fektiv","a. 有效的, 有力的, 实际的\\nn. 有生力量",["The art of modern warfare does not necessarily require soldiers to be armed to the teeth to be effective as combatants.","Condoms are an effective measure to prevent HIV and many other diseases."],["現代戰術並無指明士兵必須全副武裝上陣才能發揮其最大的戰鬥力。","避孕套是預防艾滋病和許多其他疾病的有效手段。"]],["neighborhood","'neibәhud","n. 附近, 邻近",["He is by nature a kind person and is popular with the children in his neighborhood.","She was different from most women in the neighborhood, for she was able to read and write."],["他天生就是一個和藹可親的人，所以很受住在附近的孩子歡迎。","她和小区里大部分妇女不同，因为她会读书写字。"]],["original","ә'ridʒәnl","a. 最初的, 原始的, 有创意的\\nn. 原物, 原作",["Tom wanted to be able to read the original Quran and solely for that reason he started learning Arabic.","Everyone listened and was very happy, thinking this wedding was both original and meaningful."],["汤姆是为了能够看懂古兰经的原文才去开始学习阿拉伯语的。","大家听了，都很高兴，觉得这个婚礼又新颖又有意义。"]],["troop","tru:p","n. 军队, 一群, 一队\\nvi. 群集, 结队, 成群而行",["At twelve o'clock sharp we all troop into the staff canteen for lunch.","We saw a troop of monkeys moving from tree to tree."],["",""]],["income","'inkʌm","n. 收入, 收益, 流入\\n[经] 收益",["Professional writers do not have a regular income.","Experts say only about 15 percent of happiness comes from income, assets and other financial factors."],["專職作家沒有固定的收入。","专家说只有百分之十五左右的快乐来自收入、资产等财政的因素。"]],["directly","di'rektli, dai'rektli","adv. 径直地, 直接地, 直率地, 正好地, 直截了当地, (非正式)立即, 马上\\nconj. 一...(就...), 一当...就…",["The English ambassador demanded to meet with the President directly.","Some believe that the British Royal Family is directly descended from the line of King David."],["英国大使要求直接会见总统。","有些人相信英國皇室是大衛王的後裔。"]],["hurt","hә:t","n. 伤害, 创伤, 损害\\nv. 伤害, (使)伤心, 危害, 刺痛",["Fighting with your friends can really hurt your feelings.","I got hurt during an experiment, and the injury was pretty serious."],["与朋友吵架是件很伤感情的事。","我做實驗的時候弄傷了，而且還傷得十分嚴重。"]],["species","'spi:ʃiz","n. 种, 类, 外形\\n[医] 茶剂; 种",["Gambling site lets users bet on which species will go extinct because of the oil spill in the Gulf of Mexico.","If we don't make the utmost effort to protect the rainforests, many of the rare species in them will become extinct."],["賭博網站讓用戶投注於哪些物種將因為墨西哥灣漏油而滅絕。","如果我们不做更多的努力去保护雨林，很多其中的稀有物种将会灭绝。"]],["immediately","i'mi:diәtli","adv. 直接地, 立刻, 立即",["If I had the money, I would immediately acquire this computer.","If I had the money, I would immediately buy this computer."],["我要是有钱，立马就买这台电脑。","我要是有钱，立马就买这台电脑。"]],["track","træk","n. 轨迹, 足迹, 径迹, 小道, 轨道, 磁轨, 途径\\nvt. 循路而行, 追踪, 通过, 用纤拉\\nvi. 追踪, 留下足迹, 沿…",["My business has at last gotten on the right track.","The track and field meet was canceled due to rain."],["我的生意終於上了軌道。","田徑運動會因天雨關係取消了。"]],["basic","'beisik","n. 基本原理, 要素, 基本规律\\na. 基本的, 碱性的\\n(计算机)BASIC语言",["I never know what to say to people who have absolutely no grasp of the basic facts and are too ignorant to realise it.","It is a basic quality of an employee to complete his tasks within a fixed time."],["对于那些连基本事实都搞不清楚而且又盲目得无法了解到这一点的人，我从来都不知道对他们说些什么。","在限定时间内完成任务是一个职员的基本素质。"]],["strike","straik","n. 罢工, 打击, 殴打\\nvt. 打, 撞击, 冲击, 侵袭, 取消, 结算, 打掉, 罢工, 刺透, 使生根, 遇见\\nvi. 打,…",["He had gone there to help garbage workers strike peacefully for better pay and working conditions.","If you swear reckless oaths, lightning will strike you."],["他去了那裏幫助清潔工人和平地爭取更高的薪金和更好的工作環境。","乱发誓会遭雷劈的。"]],["ms","miz","美国微软公司\\n[计] 主存储器, 制造系统, 毫秒, 微软公司",["Ms. Eichler had a notorious reputation for being austere to her students.","I'm getting sick and tired of Ms Maruta and her noisy friends."],["艾希勒女士对学生严厉是出了名的。",""]],["sky","skai","n. 天空, 天色, 天堂\\nvt. 击向空中, 挂在高处\\nvi. 高涨",["Seen from the sky, the river looked like a huge snake.","All of a sudden, large drops of rain began falling from the dark sky."],["从天上看下来，这条河像一条巨蛇。","灰暗的天空突然下起了一大滴一大滴的雨來。"]],["freedom","'fri:dәm","n. 自由, 坦率, 特权\\n[法] 自由, 自主, 免除",["Freedom of thought is guaranteed by the constitution.","War is peace. Freedom is slavery. Ignorance is strength."],["思想自由為憲法所保障。","战争即和平，自由即奴役，无知即力量。"]],["absolutely","'æbsәlu:tli","adv. 完全地, 绝对地, 确确实实地",["This story may sound strange, but it's absolutely true.","These young people are talking loudly amongst themselves and have absolutely no regard for those around them."],["這個故事聽起來可能很奇怪，但卻是千真萬確的。","這些年輕人彼此之間大聲說話, 絲毫不在意周圍的人。"]],["plane","plein","n. 平面, 扁平物, 机翼, 飞机, 水准, 地位\\na. 平的, 平面的\\nvt. 将...刨平, 刨平, 掠过水面\\nvi. 翱翔,…",["Today we can go to distant countries easily by plane.","Passengers became nervous when the plane began to vibrate."],["现在我们很容易就能乘飞机去遥远的国度。","飛機開始震動的時候，乘客們都緊張了起來。"]],["nobody","'nәubɒdi","n. 小人物, 无名小卒\\npron. 无人, 没有人",["There were cars burning, people dying, and nobody could help them.","It exists, but seeing as it is taboo and that nobody talks about it, there's no need to have words for it."],["有着火的汽车和垂死的人，而且没有人能帮得上忙。","它的確存在, 但是因為人們將它視為禁忌而不去談論它, 也就不需要多說什麼了。"]],["achieve","ә'tʃi:v","vt. 完成, 达到\\nvi. 如愿以偿",["You'll never achieve anything if you don't study harder.","If you don't know what your goal is, you'll never be able to achieve it."],["如果你不更加努力地學習, 你將永遠不會有所成就。","如果你不知道你的目标是什么，那么你永远不能完成它。"]],["object","'ɒbdʒekt","n. 物体, 目标, 目的, 对象, 宾语, 客体\\nvi. 反对, 抱反感\\nvt. 提出...来反对\\n[计] 对象",["Most Americans do not object to my calling them by their first names.","A complete intransitive verb takes neither complement nor object."],["大多数美国人似乎不反对我直呼其名。","一个完完全全的不及物动词既没有补语，又没有宾语。"]],["nine","nain","num. 九, 九个",["We learned at school that the square root of nine is three.","One, two, three, four, five, six, seven, eight, nine, ten."],["我们上课时学了九的根是三。","一、二、三、四、五、六、七、八、九、十。"]],["attitude","'ætitju:d","n. 态度, 看法, 姿势\\n[医] 体态, 姿势, 态度",["This shows that happiness and sadness are only separated by attitude.","As much as 90 percent of happiness comes from elements such as attitude, control over one's life and relationships."],["这表明幸福和悲痛之间只隔着看法。","高达百分之九十的快乐来自看法、生活控制、关系等因素。"]],["refer","ri'fә:","vt. 提交, 归诸于, 把...提交, 使求助于\\nvi. 提到, 涉及, 查阅, 查询, 咨询",["Refer to the dictionary as often as possible.","I am using this term in Emmet's sense to refer to the psychological rules of language use."],["儘可能多點查字典。",""]],["client","'klaiәnt","n. 客户, 顾客, 委托人\\n[计] 客户, 客户机, 客户机程序",["The lawyer warned his client against testifying, but he did it anyway.","The investor stole the capital of his client."],["律師警告過他的當事人反對作證, 但是他還是這麼做了。","投资者把他客户的资金窃取了."]],["concept","'kɒnsept","n. 观念, 概念\\n[医] 概念",["To him, hunger was an abstract concept; he always had enough to eat.","They implemented a communication policy so as to promote their new concept."],["對他來說，「肚子餓」是個抽象的概念，因為他從來就沒有餓過。","他们到位了实行新概念的广告策略。"]],["powerful","'pauәful","a. 有力的, 有权力的, 强大的\\n[机] 强力的",["But I dare to say that it is better to face those few but powerful interests, rather than eventually facing the fury of society.","When two powerful forces with opposite ideals come face to face, it's time for a showdown."],["但我敢说解决这些少数群体的利益问题—虽然这些利益很大，但总比以后面对社会的愤怒好。",""]],["perfect","'pә:fikt","n. 完成时\\na. 完美的, 完好的, 理想的, 熟练的, 精确的, 完成式的\\nvt. 使完美, 修改, 使精通, 改善, 使熟练",["During the holidays, some university students go to Africa as volunteers and help to perfect local wildlife conservation.","Gentleness and cheerfulness, these come before all morality; they are the perfect duties."],["一些大学生在假期去非洲做志愿者 ，帮助当地完善野生生物管理。","良善和喜樂比道德更加重要，是我們所應盡的絕對義務。"]],["therefore","'ðєәfɒ:","adv. 因此, 所以",["They have a growing population; therefore they need more and more food.","Therefore, other people's ways of thinking might not be suited to you."],["那國家的人口正在增長，所以他們需要的食物量也愈來愈大。","所以别人的思想方法用在你身上不一定有效。"]],["conduct","'kɔndʌkt, -dәkt","n. 行为, 举动, 指导\\nvt. 为人, 指挥, 管理, 实施\\nvi. 领导, 传导, 指挥",["We conduct safety inspections here on a regular basis.","One must be responsible for one's conduct."],["我們定期在這裡施行安全檢查。","人要为自己的行为负责。"]],["announce","ә'nauns","vt. 宣布, 声称, 显示, 预告\\nvi. 当报幕员, 宣布参加竞选",["In the first place, I would like to announce several new regulations.","Tom ran as fast as he could to announce the good news to Mary."],["首先，我想宣布几条新制度。","汤姆以最快的速度跑着，好向玛丽宣布好消息。"]],["conversation",".kɒnvә'seiʃәn","n. 会话, 说话, 交谈\\n[法] 交谈, 社交, 性交",["It is difficult to keep up a conversation with someone who only says \"yes\" and \"no\".","As their conversation was in French, I could not understand a word."],["跟一个只说“是”和“不是”的人很难继续谈话。","因為他們是用法語談話的，所以我一句也聽不懂。"]],["examine","ig'zæmin","v. 检查, 调查, 考试",["It's hard for people to examine and correct their own flaws.","Dentists take X-rays to examine your teeth."],["人们难以审视和纠正自身的问题。","牙医用X光检查你的牙齿。"]],["touch","tʌtʃ","n. 触觉, 碰, 触, 机灵, 轻触, 格调, 少许, 缺点, 弹力\\nvt. 接触, 触摸, 触及, 使接触, 达到, 涉及, 影响到…",["You can get in touch with him at his home tonight.","In case of an emergency, get in touch with my agent."],["今晚你可以在他家联络到他。","万一有紧急情况，联系我的代理人。"]],["please","pli:z","adv. 请\\nvt. 使高兴, 合...的心意, 取悦\\nvi. 使人满意, 讨好, 愿意, 敬请",["Please tell me the closest station to your office.","Please telephone me when you have made up your mind what you want to do."],["请告诉我离您办公室最近的车站。","你決定好要怎麼做的時候就打個電話給我吧。"]],["attend","ә'tend","vt. 参加, 照料, 伴随\\nvi. 专心于, 照顾, 服侍, 出席",["He called in to say he could not attend the meeting.","When they heard that their teacher was going to get married, everyone wanted to attend her wedding."],["他打電話來說不能參加會議。","听说老师要结婚，大家都想参加她的婚礼。"]],["completely","kәm'pli:tli","adv. 完全地, 十分地, 圆满地",["The leaves of the trees in the garden have turned completely red.","It was raining, and Joe's long hair was completely wet by the time he got home."],["花园里树上的叶子已经完全变红了。","那時正在下雨，而 Joe 回到家時長髮已濕透了。"]],["variety","vә'raiәti","n. 多样, 种类, 变种, 杂耍\\n[化] 变种",["The explanation below was achieved by comparing and contrasting a variety of different theories.","Tom was exposed to a wide variety of music as a child through his mother's vast record collection."],["下面的解釋是通過比較和對比各種不同的理論。","由於母親收藏了一整屋的唱片，湯姆小時候便有機會接觸各種類型的音樂。"]],["sleep","sli:p","n. 睡眠, 静止, 昏迷, 麻木, 长眠, 冬眠\\nvi. 睡觉, 睡眠, 静止\\nvt. 睡",["If you sleep for a while, you will feel much better.","Now that I have finished this assignment I want to go to sleep, but I have to go to school."],["小睡一会儿，你会好一些。","我做完功課，想去睡覺，可是又要上學⋯⋯"]],["involved","in'vɔlvd","a. 难懂的, 复杂的, 不易懂的, 卷入...之中的, 累及..., 与...有关, 被纠缠的\\n[计] 包含, 涉及",["I'd rather not get involved at the moment, thanks.","Unfortunately, my neighbor was involved in a traffic accident, and is currently in a coma."],["我现在还不想掺和进来，谢了。","很不幸地，我的鄰居被捲入交通事故，呈現昏迷狀態。"]],["investigation","in.vesti'geiʃәn","n. 调查, 审查\\n[医] 调查, 调查研究",["The report proved true as a result of their investigation.","It is clearly shown in Johnson's investigation that passive smoking is very harmful."],["他們的調查結果顯示這篇報導是真實的。","在Johnson的调查里，明确地证明了二手烟是很有害的。"]],["nuclear","'nju:kliә","a. 核子的, 原子能的, 核的, 中心的\\n[医] 核的",["We can not be too careful in operating a nuclear power plant.","A nuclear war will bring about the destruction of mankind."],["我们再怎么认真管理核电站也不为过。","核戰爭將會為人類帶來滅亡。"]],["researcher","ri:'sә:tʃә","n. 研究人员",["American researcher Ellie Cutright works with African giant pouched rats that are trained to detect landmines.","The researcher suggested promising directions for treating the cancer."],["",""]],["press","pres","n. 压, 揿, 按, 人群, 印刷机, 压力, 出版社, 记者, 报刊, 新闻舆论, 紧迫\\nvt. 压, 压榨, 紧抱, 逼迫, 推进…",["The room was jam-packed with reporters waiting for the press conference to begin.","In a democracy, it's important for the press to be independent."],["房间挤满了等待发布会开始的记者。","在民主国家，报刊的独立性是很重要的。"]],["conflict","'kɒnflikt","n. 战斗, 冲突, 矛盾, 争执\\nvi. 争执, 战斗, 冲突, 抵触\\n[计] 冲突",["He seems not to be aware of the conflict between my father and me.","Diplomatic dialogue helped put an end to the conflict."],["他似乎不知道我父亲和我之间的纠葛。","外交谈判帮助结束了冲突。"]],["spirit","'spirit","n. 精神, 心灵, 灵魂, 态度, 志气, 人格, 情绪, 心情, 烈酒\\nvt. 诱拐, 鼓励, 鼓舞",["The man on whom you see the Spirit come down and remain is he who will baptize with the Holy Spirit.","The spirit is willing, but the flesh is weak."],["你如果看見聖靈降下，落在誰身上，誰就是用聖靈替人施洗的了。","心有餘而力不足。"]],["replace","ri'pleis","vt. 代替, 替换, 放回, 归还\\n[计] 替换; DOS外部命令:取代或更新文件",["Please replace the empty ink cartridge in the printer.","Because of the problem of air pollution, the bicycle may some day replace the automobile."],["请把打印机里面的空的墨粉鼓换掉。","因為空氣汙染的問題，也許有一天自行車會取代汽車。"]],["british","'britiʃ","a. 英国的\\nn. 英国人, 英国英语",["Fifty-two per cent of British women prefer chocolate to sex.","Because of its origins, Canadian English has features of both American and British English."],["有百分之五十二的英國女性喜歡巧克力勝於性。","由於它的起源，加拿大英語具有美國英語和​​英國英語兩者的特色。"]],["encourage","in'kʌridʒ","vt. 鼓励, 支持, 激励\\n[法] 怂恿, 煽动, 助长",["When I'm sad, my friends encourage me.","It is necessary for you to go and encourage the girl."],["我傷心的時候，我的朋友會鼓勵我。",""]],["argument","'ɑ:gjumәnt","n. 争论, 论证, 论据, 自变量\\n[计] 参数",["I tried very hard to put an end to their heated argument.","After a long argument, I finally persuaded her to go camping."],["我努力地平息他們不斷加溫的爭執。","經過長久的爭論，我終於說服了她去露營。"]],["camp","kæmp","n. 露营, 帐篷\\nvi. 露营, 扎营\\nvt. 使扎营",["We found it very hard going back to our base camp in the blizzard.","Most of the traffic coming into this seaside town is heading for the beachside holiday camp."],["暴风雪使得我们难以返回营地。","進入這座海濱小鎮的車輛大多是前往海邊度假營地的。"]],["brain","brein","n. 脑\\nvt. 打碎脑部",["When the body is touched, receptors in the skin send messages to the brain causing the release of chemicals such as endorphins.","Computers seem to play the role of the human brain, so they're often called \"electric brains\"."],["當身體受到外界觸碰的時候，皮膚的感受器就會向大腦發出信息，令大腦釋放安多芬等的化學物質。","計算機似乎有著人類大腦一樣的作用，所以常常被稱為”電腦 ”。"]],["feature","'fi:tʃә","n. 面孔的一部分(如眼、口等), 特征, 容貌, 特色, 特写\\nvt. 是...的特色, 特写, 放映\\nvi. 起重要作用\\n[计]…",["A special feature of verbs in the Russian language is the presence of the category of aspect.","The most important feature of all games is that they are governed by rules."],["俄語動詞的一個特徵是存在體的範疇。","所有的游戏都有一个最重要的共同点：它们都有规则。"]],["afternoon","'ɑ:ftә'nu:n","n. 午后, 下午",["John asked Mary whether she would like to go shopping in the afternoon.","Judging from the look of the sky, it may rain this afternoon."],["約翰問瑪莉下午想不想一起去買東西。","從天色上判斷，今天下午可能會下雨。"]],["am","æm","be的单数第一人称\\n[计] 存取管理程序, 寻址方式, 地址标记, 变址数, 调幅, 辅助存储器",["I am grateful to you for inviting me to the party.","You are no better at remembering things than I am."],["謝謝你邀我參加派對。","你记事情的能力并不比我好多少。"]],["weekend","'wi:kend","n. 周末, 周末休假",["It is out of the question for you to go to New York this weekend.","Tom said Mary thought John might be permitted to do that next weekend."],["這個週末去紐約對你來說是不可能的事。","汤姆说玛丽觉得约翰下周末可能被允许那么做。"]],["dozen","'dʌzn","n. 打, 十二个\\na. 一打的",["Tom has been to this park with Mary at least a dozen times.","In U.S. bakeries, a \"baker's dozen\" is 13, not 12."],["湯姆跟瑪麗來這公園至少十二次。","在美國的麵包店，「麵包師傅的一打」是13，不是12。"]],["possibility",".pɒsә'biliti","n. 可能性, 可能的事\\n[法] 可能性, 可能发生的事, 不确定权",["There is not much possibility of his coming on time.","There's a possibility that you'll have to do that."],["他十有八九不會準時來。","你有可能不得不那么做。"]],["insurance","in'ʃurәns","n. 保险, 保险业, 保险费\\n[医] 保险",["In case the shipment is delayed, we have special delay insurance.","There are many kinds of insurance such as: health insurance, fire insurance, life insurance, etc."],["万一船运迟了，我们有特别的迟到保险。","保險有很多種，例如健康保險、火災保險、人壽保險等等。"]],["department","di'pɑ:tmәnt","n. 部门, 系, 机关\\n[医] 部, 科",["There is a bookstore in front of the department store.","The objectives of the marketing department and the sales department are not necessarily the same."],["百货商店前有个书店。","销售部门和营销部门的目标不见得一样。"]],["battle","'bætl","n. 战役\\nv. 战斗",["The French were defeated at the Battle of Waterloo.","Many soldiers suffered terrible wounds in the battle."],["法國人在滑鐵盧之役吃了敗仗。","很多士兵在这场战役中严重受伤。"]],["beginning","bi'giniŋ","n. 开始",["When you're beginning to look like the photo in your passport, you should go on a holiday.","The point we must clarify here is that the lines between amateur and professional in sport are beginning to disappear."],["当我们开始像自己护照上的照片时，我们该去度假了。","我们必须阐明这个观点，在运动项目上，业余选手和专业选手的界限开始消失了。"]],["date","deit","n. 日期, 约会, 枣椰树\\nvt. 约会, 定日期\\nvi. 注明日期, 过时",["Jane could not believe it when her date polished off an entire chocolate cake.","The date of the festival coincides with that of the exam."],["珍的男朋友一口氣把整個巧克力蛋糕吃得一乾二淨，把珍看得目瞪口呆。","节日和考试碰巧在同一天。"]],["generally","'dʒenәrәli","adv. 通常, 逐渐地, 普遍地",["Generally speaking, men can run faster than women can.","Generally speaking, men are physically stronger than women."],["一般來說, 男人比女人跑得快。","一般说来，男生的肌肉比女生发达。"]],["african","'æfrikәn","n. 非洲人\\na. 非洲的, 非洲人的",["The African ground squirrels collaborate and are not aggressive to other mammals.","It's an African country, so you may think the climate is very hot."],["非洲地松鼠互帮互助，对其他哺乳动物没有攻击性。",""]],["sorry","'sɒri","a. 难过的, 悲哀的, 遗憾的",["We are sorry we are unable to accept your request.","As such is the case, I am sorry I can't accept your kind invitation."],["很抱歉，我们不能接受你的要求。","照这样的情况，很抱歉，我不能接受你的盛情邀请。"]],["crisis","'kraisis","n. 危机, 危险期, 紧要关头\\n[医] 危象; 骤退, 临界, 极期",["That documentary about the environmental crisis was a real eye-opener.","In a crisis, you must get in touch with your teacher."],["這部有關環境危機的紀錄片真是令人大開眼界。","在危險的時候你必須跟你的老師聯繫。"]],["complete","kәm'pli:t","a. 完全的, 十足的, 完成的\\nvt. 完成, 完工, 使圆满",["It's a complete mess, and it's getting on my nerves.","This book contains the complete works of Shakespeare."],["這完全一團亂，讓我心煩意亂。","這本書是莎士比亞的作品全集。"]],["fan","fæn","n. 风扇, 迷, 狂热者, 爱好者\\nvt. 煽动, 刺激, 吹拂\\nvi. 飘动, 成扇形散开",["My older brother is a very enthusiastic soccer fan.","Just what time period is \"Hong Fan\" a product of? Although people have debated this issue for ages, there is still no clear consensus to this day."],["我的哥哥是很狂热的足球迷。","《洪范》到底是什么时代的作品, 千百年来人们见仁见智, 至今仍无定论。"]],["stick","stik","n. 棍, 棒, 刺, 枯枝, 茎, 条状物\\nvt. 插进, 刺入, 钉住, 伸出, 粘贴, 停止\\nvi. 粘住, 停留, 坚持, 陷…",["I think you had better stick to your present job.","My grandfather cannot walk without a stick."],["我覺得你應該繼續做這份工作。","我的祖父要用拐杖才能走路。"]],["define","di'fain","vt. 定义, 规定, 使明确\\n[计] 定义",["If I had to define life in a word, it would be: Life is creation.","\"Define your terms,\" requested the businessman at the contract hearings."],["",""]],["easily","'i:zili","adv. 容易地, 轻易地, 流利地",["Cancer can be cured easily if it is found in its first phase.","Once you have formed a bad habit, you can't get rid of it easily."],["癌症如果在第一阶段被发现的话是很容易治愈的。","坏习惯一旦被养成，便不能简单地改正。"]],["hole","hәul","n. 孔, 洞, 穴, 漏洞\\nvt. 挖洞, 掘坑\\nvi. 进洞, 凿洞",["I'm so embarrassed I could dig a hole and crawl into it.","Manholes are round because that way they won't accidentally fall through the hole."],["我窘得想找個洞鑽進去。","人孔是圓的，因為這樣人孔蓋就不會意外地掉進洞裡。"]],["element","'elimәnt","n. 元件, 元素, 要素\\n[计] 部分; 成分; 单元; 码元; 元件; 元素; 单元",["It is highly probable that the deletion of element C will still yield the same result.","Self-confidence is the principal element of any great endeavor."],["很有可能去掉C元素会得出同样的结果。","自信是伟大事业的第一要素。"]],["status","'steitәs","n. 状态, 情形, 地位, 要人身份\\n[计] 状态",["Citizens of higher social status were permitted to live closer to the center.","I believe that a fine education can change one's social status."],["社會地位較高的公民被允許住在較靠近市中心的地方。","我相信良好的教育能改变人的社会地位。"]],["vision","'viʒәn","n. 视觉, 眼光, 视力, 幻想\\nvt. 梦见, 想象, 显示",["Possible side effects include blurred vision and shortness of breath.","Wearing glasses should correct your vision."],["可能會引起視力模糊、呼吸急促等副作用。","戴眼鏡應該能糾正你的視力。"]],["normal","'nɒ:ml","n. 常态, 标准, 正常, 普通\\na. 正常的, 正规的, 标准的, 师范的, 正态的\\n[计] 标准, 普通",["He's just a normal junior high school student, not particularly intelligent.","I don't know if he has any special powers or not, but he's probably stronger than a normal human."],["他只不過是個普普通通的中學生，不算特別聰明。","我不知道他有没有超能力，但是我猜他可能比一般人要强吧。"]],["chinese","tʃai'ni:z","n. 中文, 中国话, 中国人\\na. 中国的, 中国话的",["It is not always easy to distinguish the Japanese from the Chinese.","Three Chinese students were admitted to the college."],["日本人和中國人有時很難分辨。","大学被招收了三个中国学生。"]],["ship","ʃip","n. 船, 舰\\nvt. 以船运送, 装船, 运送\\nvi. 上船, 乘船",["The wreckage of the ship was salvaged after it had gone to Davy Jones's locker.","The ship was on the point of arriving at her destination."],["船的残骸从海底被打捞上来。","这艘船即将到达她的目的地"]],["stone","stәun","n. 石头, 宝石, 果核, 纪念碑, 结石\\nvt. 投扔石子, 铺石头\\na. 石的, 石制的, 完全的",["A water drop hollows a stone not by force but by falling often.","From a distance, this stone looks like a human face."],["滴水穿石，不是靠力量，而是靠時間。","从远看得话，这个石头看起来像人的脸。"]],["solution","sә'lu:ʃәn","n. 解决, 解答, 溶液\\n[化] 溶液",["There must be a way to arrive at a diplomatic solution.","I prefer to look for a solution to problems, not only to report them."],["必须有外交解决的途径。","我更喜欢寻求问题的解决方法，而不仅仅是揭露它们。"]],["slowly","'slәuli","adv. 慢慢地, 迟缓地",["The cows were moving very slowly through the long green grass.","A whistle blew, and the boat slowly began to pull out of port."],["牛群在鬱鬱蔥蔥的草地上緩緩移動著。","汽笛声响起，船开始慢慢地驶离港口。"]],["scale","skeil","n. 刻度, 衡量, 比例, 比例尺, 数值范围, 等级, 规模, 天平, 秤, 鳞, 积垢\\nvt. 依比例决定, 攀登, 测量, 绘制…",["It seems the rural area will be developed on a large scale.","Their siheyuans were far smaller in scale and simpler in design and decoration, and the hutongs were narrower."],["农村好像要大规模发展了。","他们的四合院要小得多，设计和装饰也比较简单，胡同也比较窄。"]],["introduce",".intrә'dju:s","vt. 介绍, 引入, 采用, 输入\\n[法] 引进, 输入, 介绍",["I think the time is right to introduce this product.","I wonder if it would be possible for you to introduce me to Mr. Harrison of PC Interactive Co. Ltd."],["我覺得現在是發表這個產品的好時機。","我想知道您能否把我介紹給 PC Interactive 有限公司的哈里森先生。"]],["driver","'draivә","n. 驾驶员, 驱动器, 驱动程序\\n[化] 驱动器",["A bus driver is responsible for the safety of the passengers.","Not knowing where to get off the bus, I asked the driver."],["巴士司機有責任保護乘客的安全。","因为我不知道应该在哪里下巴士，我问了司机。"]],["attempt","ә'tempt","n. 尝试, 企图\\nvt. 尝试, 企图",["They explored every avenue in an attempt to avoid war.","It's just an attempt on his part to maximize profits, as much as possible, in the last moments of negotiations."],["他们尽一切手段避免战争。","这不过是他在谈判最后时刻尽可能最大化利润的尝试。"]],["spot","spɒt","n. 污点, 地点, 斑点, 点, 娱乐场所, 处境, 少量\\na. 当场的, 现场的, 现货买卖的, 现金交易的, 抽样的\\nvt. 点…",["Algeria should become China's main investment hot spot in the Mediterranean region.","The place you moved to is in such a good spot. Nowadays, everyone's looking for a good location and architecture for their house."],["阿爾及利亞應該成為中國在地中海地區的主要投資熱點。","你搬的地方真是好地段，现在大家是看上地段和房型。"]],["lack","læk","n. 缺乏, 无, 不足\\nvt. 缺乏, 短少, 不足, 需要\\nvi. 缺乏",["What with fatigue and lack of sleep, he has fallen ill at last.","By lack of attention, she hit the post with her car."],["他疲勞過度，又睡眠不足，最後便病倒了。","她心不在焉的把車子撞在了柱子上。"]],["ice","ais","n. 冰, 冰淇淋, 糖衣, 冷若冰霜, 矜持, 贿赂\\nvt. 使结冰, 冰镇, 覆以糖衣\\nvi. 结冰",["The area around the melting ice cream was crawling with ants.","Water and ice are the same substance in different forms."],["在那灘冰淇淋的周圍，有一群螞蟻在爬來爬去。","水和冰雖然形態不同，但其實是同一種物質。"]],["boat","bәut","n. 船\\nvi. 乘船\\nvt. 以船运",["I want a boat that will take me far away from here.","A new team was formed in order to take part in the boat race."],["我想要一艘船带我远离这里。","为了参加划船比赛，一支新的队伍组成了。"]],["christmas","'krismәs","n. 圣诞节",["I was nine years old when I asked my mother whether Father Christmas really existed.","\"I hope we'll be home for Christmas\", said the soldier."],["我九岁的时候问我妈妈圣诞老人是否真的存在。","士兵说道：“我希望圣诞节时我们能在家里。”"]],["drink","driŋk","n. 饮料, 酒\\nv. 喝, 喝酒",["I prefer cakes or candies to alcohol, but I do drink.","I do not like tea, so I generally drink coffee for breakfast."],["比起酒來，我比較喜歡蛋糕、糖果，可是酒我也不是完全不喝的。","我不喜欢茶，所以我早餐大致上都喝咖啡。"]],["sun","sʌn","n. 太阳, 日, 日光, 阳光\\nvt. 晒\\nvi. 晒太阳",["Nicolas means that romanization of the Cyrillic alphabet is as beautiful as the sun, which burns your eyes when you look at it.","Even if the sun were to rise in the west, I would not change my mind."],["尼古拉斯的用意是羅馬化西里爾字母就猶如太陽般美麗，若是直視會灼燒人的眼睛。","即使太阳从西边出来，我也不会改变主意。"]],["distance","'distәns","n. 距离, 远方, 遥远\\n[计] 位距",["Viewed from a distance, the island looked like a cloud.","Seen from a distance, the stone looks like a human face."],["這個島從遠方看起來像一片雲。","从远看得话，这个石头看起来像人的脸。"]],["wood","wud","n. 木材, 木制品\\nvt. 植林于, 给...添加木柴\\nvi. 收集木材",["This wood wallet is crafted from a single piece of walnut.","Houses made of wood are the easiest to catch on fire."],["這款木質皮夾由一整塊胡桃木製成。","木造的房子最容易失火。"]],["truck","trʌk","n. 卡车, 货车, 对...进行交易, 来往, 实物工资, (供应市场的)蔬菜, 废物, 废话\\nvt. 对...进行交易, 交往, 以…",["The load of the truck was in excess of three tons.","This truck transports fresh food from Aomori to Tokyo."],["貨車的載貨量超過了三噸。","這輛卡車從青森運輸新鮮食品到東京。"]],["handle","hændl","n. 柄, 把手, 把柄, 柄状物, 手感\\nvt. 触摸, 运用, 买卖, 处理, 操作\\nvi. 搬运, 易于操纵\\nn. 句柄\\n[…",["My PC with 16 gigs of RAM can't handle my next-level multitasking.","Two men are trying to get a handle on what's wrong with the car."],["我的電腦有 16GB 的 RAM，無法滿足我的高階多工需求。","两个男人在检查汽车出了什么故障。"]],["mountain","'mauntin","n. 山, 山脉, 大堆",["There on the top of a high mountain they built a small town of their own and lived in peace.","There is an old castle at the foot of the mountain."],["他们在高山顶上建了自己的小城镇在那里过着宁静的生活。","山腳下有一座古老的城堡。"]],["survey","sә'vei","n. 纵览, 视察, 测量, 俯瞰, 调查\\nvt. 审视, 视察, 俯瞰, 通盘考虑\\nvi. 测量土地",["According to the latest survey, 99% of employees want a free iPad.","The results of the Chinese Academy of Sciences' survey are like this."],["根据最新的调查，99%的员工想要一个免费的iPad。","中国科学院的调查结果是这样的。"]],["supposed","sә'pәuzd","a. 想象上的, 假定的, 被信以为真的\\n[法] 推测的, 想像的, 被信以为真的",["The handyman was supposed to arrive at twelve noon, but got stuck in a traffic jam for a few hours.","Kyouichi Saionji, who he supposed would win the duel, has lost."],["這個工人本來應該在中午十二點到達, 但他被交通堵塞困住了幾個小時。","大家都以為西園寺會勝出那場決鬥的，但他卻輸了。"]],["tradition","trә'diʃәn","n. 传说, 传统, 交付\\n[法] 传统, 惯例, 移交",["It is a Chinese tradition to welcome spring with flowers.","At nightfall I like following the tradition of taking a walk along the lakeside."],["用花迎春是中国的传统。","傍晚我喜歡沿著湖邊散步。"]],["winter","'wintә","n. 冬季, 萧条期, 衰退期\\na. 冬天的\\nvt. 使度过冬天\\nvi. 过冬",["A winter sport that many people enjoy is ice skating.","In autumn, some animals store food away for the winter."],["许多人爱好的一个冬季运动是溜冰。","有些動物會在秋天為冬季儲藏食物。"]],["village","'vilidʒ","n. 村庄\\na. 乡村的, 村庄的",["The things in this village are cheaper than those in ours.","Long, long ago, there lived an old man in a village."],["這條村的東西比我們村的便宜多了。","很久、很久以前，有一個村子，裏面住了一個老人。"]],["soviet","'sәuviәt","n. 代表会议, 苏维埃, 苏联\\na. 苏维埃的, 苏联的",["Communism is the system practiced in the Soviet Union.","The Soviet troops started to withdraw from Afghanistan."],["共產主義是在蘇聯被實行的制度。","苏联军队开始从阿富汗撤军了。"]],["refuse","ri'fju:z","vt. 拒绝, 谢绝\\nvi. 拒绝\\nn. 废物\\na. 扔掉的, 无用的",["You refuse a toast, only to be forced to drink a forfeit.","Not only did he refuse to help me, but also he scolded me."],["敬酒不吃吃罰酒。","他不但没帮我，还骂了我。"]],["sales","","a. 销售的\\n[计] 销售",["Making this matter public would have an effect on our sales, so we're going to overlook it this once.","When one of my coworkers starts racking up good sales figures I can't let down my guard."],["公开此事会影响我们的销售，所以我们将忽略它一次。","若同期的人先一步完成銷售目標，我也不能再吊兒郎當了。"]],["roll","rәul","n. 卷, 滚动, 名单, 案卷, 压路机\\nvi. 滚, 滚动, 飘流, 起伏, 卷, 绕\\nvt. 使滚动, 卷, 绕",["I put roll-on antiperspirant all over my body. If sweat starts squirting out the top of my head, you know why.","The Easter Egg Roll is an annual event that is held on the lawn of the White House each Easter Monday."],["我把整个止汗剂抹遍全身。如果汗从我脑顶喷出来，你就知道原因了。","复活节滚彩蛋活动每年复活节周一都会在白宫的草地上举行。"]],["communication","kә.mju:ni'keiʃәn","n. 交流, 交通, 通讯\\n[计] 通信",["The communication of news by TV and radio is very common now.","This is a fast and effective way of communication."],["這個年代用電視和收音機報道新聞已是十分平常的事了。","这是快速且有效的交流方式。"]],["screen","skri:n","n. 幕, 银幕, 屏风, 掩蔽物, 屏蔽, 筛子\\nvt. 掩蔽, 放映, 拍摄, 掩护, 筛, 甄别\\nvi. 拍电影\\n[计] 筛选…",["The aim of this game is to explode all the bombs on the screen.","A scary horror movie is only a movie. Once you turn off the screen it's all over, but life...you're stuck in it."],["這個遊戲的目的是引爆螢幕上所有的炸彈。","多恐怖的恐怖電影，也只不過是一部電影；你把熒幕關掉，就甚麼事也沒有了。可是人生……你想躲也躲不掉。"]],["gain","gein","n. 增益, 获得, 利润, 收获, 增加\\nvt. 得到, 增进, 赚到\\nvi. 获利, 增加\\n[计] 增益",["They tried very hard to gain an advantage over one another.","By reading books and discussing concepts, a person can gain wisdom and tolerance of differing ideas."],["他們很努力地超過對方獲得優勢。","藉由讀書和討論概念, 一個人能獲得智慧並包容不同的想法。"]],["resident","'rezidәnt","n. 居民, 常驻程序, 居住者, 留鸟\\na. 居留的, 定居的",["Resident Evil 4 is one of the best games I have ever played.","Sami was the graduate resident mentor of Layla's dorm."],["",""]],["hide","haid","n. 兽皮, 迹象, 躲藏处\\nvt. 藏, 隐瞒, 遮避, 剥...的皮, 隐藏\\nvi. 躲藏\\n[计] 隐藏",["To hide the fact that she's a princess, she disguised herself as a boy and escaped the palace.","The longer you hide your feelings for someone, the more you fall for them."],["她為了掩飾自己公主的身份，女扮男裝，逃出了皇宮。","对爱掩饰得越多，愈是证明你喜欢他。"]],["gold","gәuld","n. 黄金, 钱财, 金块, 金色, 宝贵\\na. 金的, 似金的, 金色的, 金制的",["Idiot! She's not being honest when she says she loves you. Haven't you figured it out yet? She's just a gold digger.","The girl in the picture is wearing a crown not of gold but of flowers."],["笨蛋！她说她爱你不是真心的。还没有发现吗？她只是钓凯子的。","畫中的女孩頭上戴著的是花冠，不是金皇冠。"]],["club","klʌb","n. 俱乐部, 木棍, 球棒\\nvt. 用棍棒打, 缴纳\\nvi. 联合起来\\na. 俱乐部的",["You may as well withdraw from the club right away.","He was excluded from the club for infractions of the rules."],["你還不如立刻退出這個俱樂部。","他觸犯會規，被踢出了俱樂部。"]],["farm","fɑ:m","n. 农场, 农田\\nvt. 耕种\\nvi. 种田",["The free-range eggs from this farm are darker in color, and the yolks are extraordinarily delicious.","The turkeys in my grandfather's farm are very noisy, I can't wait for them to get eaten."],["這家農場的草雞蛋顏色偏深，蛋黃特別鮮美。","我爺爺農場養的火雞吵得要命，真想牠們快點被人吃掉。"]],["potential","pә'tenʃәl","n. 潜在性, 可能性, 潜力, 潜能, 势, 位\\na. 有潜力的, 可能的, 潜在的",["If you are a potential employee then you should be aware of what the company stands for and how it treats its employees before attending an interview.","A potential third party would not be able to crack the code."],["如果你有意應徵，應該在面試前明白公司的主張以及公司如何對待員工。",""]],["european",".juәrә'pi:әn","n. 欧洲人\\na. 欧洲的, 欧洲人的",["There needs to be agreement between European countries.","I want to find a blonde, blue-eyed European woman."],["歐洲各國之間需要達成協議。","他想找一位金发碧眼的欧洲女人。"]],["presence","'prezns","n. 出席, 面前, 存在, 仪态, 风度\\n[电] 出现",["John felt the presence of a ghost in the dark room.","I told you not to talk about the matter in her presence."],["約翰感覺到那黑漆漆的房間裏有鬼。","我跟你说过她在的时候不要说这件事。"]],["independent",".indi'pendәnt","n. 独立自主者, 无党派者\\na. 独立的, 有主见的, 不须依赖的, 不受约束的",["All humans are equal and independent. No one can damage another's life, health, freedom, and property.","More and more women have their own careers and are economically independent of their husbands."],["一切人都是平等和独立的，没有人有权损害另一个人的生命、健康、自由和财产。","越来越多的女人拥有自己的事业并实现和丈夫的经济独立。"]],["district","'distrikt","n. 区域, 地方\\n[医] 地区, 地段",["There are many hotels in the city's business district.","The typhoon struck the Kanto district."],["城裡的商業區有很多旅館。","台风袭击了关东地区。"]],["shape","ʃeip","n. 形状, 形态, 外形, 形式, 身材\\nvt. 定形, 使成形, 塑造, 计划, 使符合\\nvi. 成形, 形成, 成长\\n[计] …",["When chickens pancake-shape maintain, the tractor must have won again.","My father has been in good shape since his operation."],["當雞像煎餅一樣平的時候, 那麼一定是拖拉機跑得比它們快。","自从手术后，我父亲一直处于良好的状态。"]],["reader","'ri:dә","n. 读者, 读物, 文选, 校对人, 讲师\\n[计] 阅读程序; 阅读器",["An astute reader should be willing to weigh everything they read, including anonymous sources.","Reader, suppose you were an idiot. And suppose you were a member of Congress. But I repeat myself."],["",""]],["contract","'kɒntrækt","n. 合约, 婚约, 契约\\nvt. 使皱缩, 使缩短, 感染, 订约, 缔结\\nvi. 皱缩, 订约, 收缩",["The contract is in the bag, so let's go out and celebrate.","In order to avoid misunderstandings, they went through the contract again."],["合同已经到手了，那就出去庆祝一下吧。","為了避免誤解，他們又過了一遍合同。"]],["crowd","kraud","n. 群众, 一伙人\\nvt. 拥挤, 挤满, 挤进",["He was too embarrassed to utter a word in front of the crowd.","The large crowd roared in approval as Mark Knopfler played the first few bars of \"Money for Nothing\"."],["他太难为情，在大众人前一句话也说不出来。","就像马克·诺弗勒早期演唱的歌曲《金钱无用》一样，绝大多数的人依然高呼赞成“金钱无用论”。"]],["christian","'kristʃәn","n. 基督徒, 正派人\\na. 基督的, 基督教的",["Going to church doesn't make you a Christian any more than standing in a garage makes you a car.","Tom is a Christian in name only. He never goes to church."],["去教堂參加禮拜，不會馬上就變成一個基督徒，就好像站在車房裏，不會變成一輛車一樣。","汤姆名义上是基督徒。他从来不去做礼拜。"]],["express","ik'spres","n. 快车, 快递, 专使\\na. 明确的, 丝毫不差的, 专门的, 快的\\nvt. 表达, 表示, 表露",["I don't like it when mathematicians who know much more than I do can't express themselves explicitly.","She can express her feelings when she feels happy or sad."],["我不喜欢那些数学家知道的比我多得多，却不知道清楚地表达自己。","当感到高兴或悲伤时，她能表达感情。"]],["apartment","ә'pɑ:tmәnt","n. 房间, 公寓",["During the blizzard, I have to ride my bicycle back to the apartment.","My apartment is located within five minutes' walk of the station."],["暴风雪的时候，我要骑自行车回公寓。","我住的公寓距離車站步行不到五分鐘。"]],["willing","'wiliŋ","a. 乐意的, 自愿的, 甘愿的",["Even if I don't get a high salary, I'm not willing to quit this way of making a living.","I don't think my father is willing to lend us the car."],["即使我拿不到高工资，我也不肯放弃这个饭碗。","我觉得我的父亲不情愿借给我他的车。"]],["strength","streŋθ","n. 力量, 实力, 强度, 浓度, 人数, 抵抗力\\n[化] 强度",["You cannot compare the strength of a man to that of a tiger, but nevertheless, the tiger is still the inferior creature.","War is peace. Freedom is slavery. Ignorance is strength."],["虎与人是无法比拼力量的，但是，老虎还是比人类低等。","战争即和平，自由即奴役，无知即力量。"]],["previous","'pri:viәs","a. 早先的, 前面的, 过急的\\n[法] 以前的, 生前的, 前述的",["In short, it is because the 'plan.doc' file I attached in the previous email was infected with a virus.","Our conclusion is based on previous studies of the problem."],["簡單來說，就是因為我附在上一封電郵的「plan.doc」檔案被電腦病毒感染了。","我们的结论基于之前对这个问题的研究。"]],["band","bænd","n. 带子, 队, 乐队\\nv. 联合, 结合\\n[计] 频带; 波段; 区",["They're considered the greatest rock band in history.","Some people consider Led Zeppelin to be the greatest band there has ever been."],["有人认为他们是历史上最伟大的乐队。","有些人將齊柏林飛船視為有史以來最偉大的樂團。"]],["obviously","'ɔbviәsli","adv. 显而易见地, 明显地",["Obviously, this cannot be the work of one person. This is why Tatoeba is collaborative.","Obviously, we don't know if those thermos flasks are their own."],["很明显，这不可能是一个人的工作。这就是为什么Tatoeba是一个合作项目。","当然，那些热水瓶是不是他们自己的就不得而知了。"]],["horse","hɒ:s","n. 马, 骑兵, 脚架\\nvi. 骑马, 取笑\\nvt. 使骑马, 系马于",["As well as this, the horse is also representative of human talent.","I shot the horse because it had trouble breathing."],["除此之外，馬還是人才的代名詞。","我枪杀了那匹马，因为他已呼吸困难。"]],["interested","'intristid","a. 感兴趣的\\n[法] 有利害关系的, 有股份的, 偏私的",["I met an American who was interested in Noh plays.","He is very much interested in Japanese history. We are surprised at his vast knowledge of the subject."],["我碰到一个对能剧感兴趣的美国人。","他对日本的历史非常感兴趣。我们很惊讶他在这方面的丰富知识。"]],["target","'tɑ:git","n. 目标, 靶子, 指标\\nvt. 对准, 订指标",["Appreciate the little things in life - they will bring you to a bigger end target.","The Three Forks is a bar serving beer, and its target audience are travellers."],["欣賞生活中的小事，它們的總合很是宏大。","三把叉子是一家供應啤酒的酒吧，其目標客戶是旅行者。"]],["prison","'prizn","n. 监狱, 监禁, 拘留所\\nvt. 监禁",["Tom told me that he thought that he was going to die in prison.","Tom told me he thought that he was going to die in prison."],["汤姆告诉我他以为他会死在监狱里。","汤姆告诉我他以为他会死在监狱里。"]],["ride","raid","n. 骑马, 乘坐, 乘车, 搭便车\\nvt. 骑, 乘坐, 压迫, 控制\\nvi. 骑马, 乘车, 漂游",["It's only a fifteen minute bus ride from here to the airport.","It took him three months to learn to ride a bicycle."],["坐公車從這裏到機場只不過是十五分鐘的路程。","他學了三個月才學會了騎自行車。"]],["guard","gɑ:d","n. 守卫者, 警戒, 护卫队, 防护装置\\nvt. 保卫, 看守, 当心\\nvi. 防止, 警惕, 警卫, 看守",["When one of my coworkers starts racking up good sales figures I can't let down my guard.","As everyone stood guard silently, someone ran to the corner of the street and called over a police officer."],["若同期的人先一步完成銷售目標，我也不能再吊兒郎當了。","默默守护中，有人跑到街头，叫来了协警。"]],["terms","","n. 条件, 条款, 费用, 价钱, 关系, 地位, 交谊\\n[经] 条件",["Man is the only animal that can remain on friendly terms with the victims he intends to eat until he eats them.","This hotel is conveniently located in terms of public transportation."],["人类是在没吃掉对方前能够与对方和睦相处的唯一动物。","這間酒店的交通位置很方便。"]],["reporter","ri'pɒ:tә","n. 记者, 报告者\\n[化] 指示器",["The reporter elaborated on the method of his investigation.","The reporter rented an expensive room."],["报告者详尽地说明了他的研究方法。","记者租了间很贵的房。"]],["demand","di'mɑ:nd","n. 要求, 需求, 需要\\nv. 要求, 查询",["There is close relationship between supply and demand.","Demand for occupational therapy has surged in recent years."],["供應和需求之間的關係十分密切。","这几年对作业疗法的需求在迅速增长。"]],["deliver","di'livә","vt. 递送, 陈述, 释放, 发表, 引渡, 投递, 交付\\n[经] 交运",["We will deliver up to the airport of the island.","Please inform us as to what quantity you can deliver at regular intervals."],["我們將移交至島上的機場。",""]],["text","tekst","n. 文本, 正文, 课文, 主题, 圣经文句, 乐谱\\n[计] 电文; 文本; 正文",["The text of the national anthem of Canada was first written in French.","Please translate this text from Japanese to French."],["加拿大國歌的歌詞最初是用法文寫的。","请把这段日文翻译为法文。"]],["tool","tu:l","n. 工具, 机床, 傀儡\\nvt. 用工具加工\\nvi. 使用工具",["Tax cuts are often used as a major fiscal tool to stimulate the economy.","Coldness sometimes don't mean apathy. It's just a tool to avoid being hurt."],["减税常被用作刺激经济的主要财政手段。","冷漠，有時候並不是無情，只是一種逃避被傷害的工具！"]],["wild","waild","n. 荒野, 荒地\\na. 野性的, 野蛮的, 野生的, 失控的, 任性的, 杂乱的, 轻率的, 狂热的, 疯狂的\\nadv. 狂暴地, …",["The importation of rare wild animals to this country is strictly prohibited.","The most effective way to kill time, of course, is chatting, bragging, and having wild conversations."],["该国严禁进口稀有野生动物。","消磨时间的最有效办法当然还是聊天吹牛侃大山。"]],["vehicle","'vi:ikl","n. 交通工具, 车辆, 传播媒介\\n[化] 载体; 运载体; 漆料",["Edmundo threw Rima off the vehicle.","Rigid wheels give sufficient stability to a low-speed vehicle steered by outside forces."],["埃德蒙多把里瑪從車上推下去了。",""]],["observe","әb'zә:v","vt. 觉察到, 遵守, 注意到, 庆祝\\nvi. 注意, 评论",["He pointed out how important it is to observe the law.","His failure to observe traffic regulations resulted in a serious accident."],["他指出了遵守法律的重要性。","他未能遵守交通規則，結果發生了嚴重的事故。"]],["flight","flait","n. 飞行, 射程, 逃走, 飞跃, 飞机航程, 班机, 迁徙, 飞逝\\nvi. 迁徙\\nvt. 射击(飞禽), 为(箭)装上羽毛, 使惊飞",["We arrived at the airport three hours before our flight.","Mary placed her baby in a car seat for the flight."],["我們在飛機起飛前三個小時就到達了機場。","航程中瑪麗把她的寶寶放在嬰兒汽車座椅上。"]],["facility","fә'siliti","n. 容易, 灵巧, 设备\\n[计] 设施; 设备; 装备",["Dan ordered the security guards to close all the exit doors of the facility.","He can speak both Japanese and English with facility."],["",""]],["understanding",".ʌndә'stændiŋ","n. 理解, 谅解\\n[法] 协商, 协议, 谅解",["Before understanding the situation clearly, he hastily gave his opinion.","It's good for our understanding of other cultures."],["他还没有把情况了解清楚就急忙发表意见。","它有利於我們理解其他文化。"]],["average","'ævәridʒ","n. 平均, 平均数, 一般水平, 海损\\na. 平均的, 中等的, 平常的\\nvt. 算出...平均数, 平均做, 均分, 使平衡\\nv…",["Each year the world's population increases on average by two percent.","The average man fails not because he lacks ability, but because he lacks ability to concentrate."],["每年世界人口都有 2% 的平均增長。","通常人们失败并非能力不足，而是不够专注。"]],["emerge","i'mә:dʒ","vi. 浮现, 形成, 出现, (事实)显露",["One finding to emerge was that critical features differ between species.","Japan is still struggling to emerge from recession."],["",""]],["advantage","әd'vɑ:ntidʒ","n. 优点, 便利, 好处, 优势\\nvt. 有助于",["Having a driver's license is an advantage for this job.","All you have to do is take advantage of this rare opportunity."],["有駕照者優先得到這個職位。","你所要做的便是好好把握這千載難逢的機會。"]],["quick","kwik","a. 快的, 迅速的, 敏捷的, 灵敏的, 急速的\\nadv. 快\\nn. 新长出的肉, 要害, 核心, 感觉敏锐部位",["The quick brown fox did not jump over the lazy dog.","The quick brown fox didn't jump over the lazy dog."],["身手矯健的棕狐狸沒有躍過懶洋洋的狗。","身手矯健的棕狐狸沒有躍過懶洋洋的狗。"]],["leadership","'li:dәʃip","n. 领导能力, 领导阶层",["Tom has natural leadership ability.","Students admire her leadership skills."],["湯姆天生具有領導能力。","學生們佩服她的領導能力。"]],["earn","ә:n","vt. 赚得, 获得, 博得\\n[计] 欧州科学研究网",["In my opinion this kind of work is both uninteresting and difficult, but I don't have any other way to earn money.","Money takes a long time to earn, but you can spend it in no time."],["我認為這種工作既不有趣又困難, 可是我没有别的方法賺錢。","錢要花很長的時間來賺, 但你可以一下子就花掉它了。"]],["pound","paund","n. 磅, 英镑, 重击, 鱼塘, 拘留所, 兽栏\\nvt. 强烈打击, 捣烂, 监禁, 关入栏内\\nvi. 连续重击, 苦干",["An ounce of wit that is bought is worse a pound that is taught.","As a rule of thumb, you should plan on one pound of beef for every two guests."],["花代价所换来的一点才智，抵过别人传授的数倍不止。","一般來說，你應該為每兩個客人準備一磅牛肉。"]],["basis","'beisis","n. 基础, 主要成分\\n[化] 基底",["She visits the dentist on a regular basis, so she seldom gets toothaches.","The book is full of far-flung theories without any basis in scientific fact."],["她定期去看牙医，因此很少牙疼。","書中滿是遙不可及、沒有科學根據的理論。"]],["bright","brait","a. 明亮的, 聪明的, 鲜明的, 欢快的\\nadv. 明亮地, 欢快地",["Tom rolled up his trouser legs, making his bright red socks visible.","People show up bright on an infrared camera because of their body heat."],["湯姆捲起褲管，露出鮮紅的襪子。","人會因為體溫而在紅外線攝影機上顯現。"]],["operate","'ɒpәreit","v. 操作, 运转, 动手术, 活动",["Contact the appropriate customer service helpline if the device does not operate properly.","The doctor decided to operate at once."],["如果裝置無法正常運作，請聯絡對應的客服專線。","医生决定立刻动手术。"]],["guest","gest","n. 客人, 来宾, 旅客\\n[化] 客体",["A guest should not try to make himself superior to the host.","However, I've never been a guest in an English household that wasn't generous."],["强宾不压主。","不过，我从来没有在一个小气的英国家庭做过客。"]],["sample","'sæmpl","n. 样品, 范例, 样本\\nvt. 抽样, 尝试\\n[计] 示例, 字样",["The greater the difference between the null hypothesis and an outcome, and the larger the sample size, the more confident one can be that the outcome is meaningful.","We would now like to have some sample flashlights."],["零假设和结果之间的差异越大，样本规模越大，对结果是有意义的就越有信心。",""]],["contribute","kәn'tribju:t","vt. 有助于, 捐助, 投稿\\nvi. 出力, 捐献, 投稿",["Melting polar icecaps could also contribute to an increase in sea levels.","And everyone has the ability to contribute."],["融化中的极地冰盖也可以使海平面上涨的势态更加严重。","每个人都有能力作贡献。"]],["tiny","'taini","a. 很少的, 微小的",["Truth is like a disco ball, and only one of the tiny little mirrors it is made up of is actually yours.","That tiny star there is the brightest out of all the stars."],["真相就像一顆迪斯可球，組成球面的無數小鏡子中，只有一面是真正屬於你的。","那儿的小星星是所有星星里最亮的。"]],["block","blɒk","n. 街区, 木块, 石块, 块\\nvt. 阻塞, 封锁, 使成块状\\n[计] 块, 数据块",["Both of these are Song Dynasty block-printed editions.","The opposition formed a line in the box to try and block Messi from scoring."],["這兩本都是宋本。","对方球员在禁区内组成一道防线，试图阻截梅西的射门。"]],["protection","prә'tekʃәn","n. 保护, 防卫, 贸易保护制度\\n[计] 保护",["We are responsible for your protection from now on.","Condoms offer protection against sexually transmitted diseases."],["從此起我們為您的安全負責。","避孕套可以預防性傳播疾病。"]],["settle","'setl","n. 有背长椅\\nvt. 决定, 整理, 安放, 使定居, 使平静, 支付, 安排, 解决, 结算\\nvi. 停留, 下陷, 沉淀, 澄清…",["This deal is mine, so you need to just settle down and agree with me.","Eventually I'd like to settle down and have a family, but not yet."],["这笔交易是我的，所以你需要去冷静并且同意我","我會找個地方安頓下來，然後結婚生子的，但這是以後的事。"]],["feed","fi:d","n. 饲料, 一餐, 饲养\\nvt. 喂, 饲养, 放牧, 靠...为生\\nvi. 吃东西, 用餐, 流入\\n[计] 送纸",["You want the horse to run fast, but you don't want to feed it grass.","If you feed your dog properly, you can increase his lifespan."],["又要馬兒好，又要馬兒不吃草。","合理地喂狗可以延长宠物寿命。"]],["collect","kә'lekt","v. 收集, 聚集, 集中, 搜集\\na. 由收到者付款的\\nadv. 由收到者付款地",["In our city, we carefully separate and collect garbage.","Tom and Mary went into the forest to collect mushrooms."],["在我们的城市那，我们非常谨慎地分类收集垃圾。","湯姆和瑪麗亞到樹林裡採集蘑菇去了。"]],["additional","ә'diʃәnәl","a. 附加的, 另外的, 额外的\\n[机] 加添的, 附加的",["As a consequence, additional tests must be carried out to ensure complete security.","Studies show that once the basic needs of shelter and food are met, additional wealth adds very little to happiness."],["因此，必须进行额外的测试以确保完整的安全性。","研究表明人们一有住处、食物这些基本的需要，附加的财富就不能大量地提高他们的快乐。"]],["highly","'haili","adv. 非常, 非常赞许地\\n[电] 大大地",["The programming language Java is highly versatile.","Japan is highly competitive in high technology industries."],["编程语言JAVA非常多用途的。","日本在高科技產業方面的競爭力很強。"]],["identity","ai'dentiti","n. 身份, 相同, 一致, 特性, 恒等式\\n[计] (打)标记, 标识",["A student should not lose sight of his own identity.","We need six tickets, two of them are student tickets, here is our student identity card."],["学生不该忽略自己的身份。","我們要六張門票，兩張是學生票，這是我們的學生證。"]],["title","'taitl","n. 头衔, 名称, 标题, 书名, 扉页, 权利, 资格, 冠军, 字幕\\nvt. 授予头衔, 加标题于\\n[计] 标题",["This function takes two parameters, the first one is the title of the window, the second one will be the title of the icon.","This title allows players to live the life of a football manager."],["这个函数有两个参数，第一个是窗体的标题，另一个是图标的标题。","這款遊戲讓玩家能親身體驗球隊經理的生活。"]],["mostly","'mәustli","adv. 大概, 大部分, 主要\\n[经] 大部份",["A motel is like a hotel only much smaller and is used mostly by people traveling by automobile.","He enjoys wine sometimes, but mostly he drinks whisky."],["",""]],["lesson","'lesn","n. 课, 课业, 教训",["The lesson has ended and the children have gone out to play.","Use your own words to retell the content of the lesson."],["下了課，孩子都跑出去玩兒了。","用自己的语言把课文内容复述。"]],["faith","feiθ","n. 信心, 信任, 忠实, 保证\\n[法] 信任, 信仰, 信念",["My God and my faith are the only true ones, and the others are just fiction.","If you have no character to lose, people will have no faith in you."],["我的神与我的信仰是唯一的真理，其余都是虚构。","如果你没有尝试过失败的角色，那么人们也就不会相信你。"]],["river","'rivә","n. 河, 江\\n[法] 河流, 江河, 内河",["The river that flows through London is the Thames.","The Amazon is the second longest river in the world after the Nile."],["流经伦敦的河是泰晤士河。","亞馬遜河的長度僅次於尼羅河，是世界第二長的河。"]],["promote","prәu'mәut","vt. 促进, 晋升, 创办, 推销\\n[经] 促进, 推广, 推销",["They implemented a communication policy so as to promote their new concept.","We must promote commerce with neighboring countries."],["他们到位了实行新概念的广告策略。",""]],["photo","'fәutәu","n. 相片, 照片, 逼真的描绘\\nv. 照相\\na. 照相的, 摄影用的, 详细记录的, 逼真的, 酷似的",["When you're beginning to look like the photo in your passport, you should go on a holiday.","You need to attach your photo to the application form."],["当我们开始像自己护照上的照片时，我们该去度假了。","你必须把你的照片贴在申请书上。"]],["living","'liviŋ","n. 生活, 生计, 生存\\na. 活的, 逼真的, 现存的",["I think my living with you has influenced your way of living.","You will soon get accustomed to living in this country."],["我觉得我和你一起住影响了你生活的方式。","你很快就會習慣這個國家的生活模式了。"]],["count","kaunt","vt. 计算, 视为\\nvi. 计数\\nn. 计算, 合计, 计数, 伯爵\\n[计] 计数",["The cedar count today is really high, so I might have to call work and tell them I'm too sick to go in.","Those who count their blessings experience more joy."],["今天的雪松數量非常高，所以我可能得打電話給單位，說我病得太厲害不能去上班了。","知足者常乐。"]],["unless",".ʌn'les","conj. 除非\\nprep. 除...之外",["I'll expect you tomorrow unless you let me know otherwise.","Don't speak unless you have something worth saying."],["你不改口的话，我明天就来等你了。","除非你有什么值得说的话要说，否则就别吭声。"]],["marry","'mæri","vt. 与...结婚, 娶, 嫁\\nvi. 结婚",["I cannot forbid a person to marry several wives, for it does not contradict Scripture.","Tom asked Mary to marry him, but she turned down his proposal."],["我不能禁止一个人娶好几个妻子，因为这与圣经不矛盾。","汤姆向玛丽求婚，但是她拒绝了。"]],["tomorrow","tә'mɒ:rәu","n. 明天, 未来\\nadv. 明天, 未来地",["If you want this job, you must apply for it by tomorrow.","If you do not go fishing tomorrow, I will not either."],["如果你想要這份工作的話，就一定要在明天之前申請。","你明天不去釣魚的話，我也不去了。"]],["technique","tek'ni:k","n. 技巧, 技术, 方法\\n[化] 工艺方法; 技巧",["Shougongsha is an old Chinese technique to test a woman's virginity.","A good diplomat is a person who practices the technique of letting someone else let the cat out of the bag."],["守宫砂是中国古代用来验证女人贞操的方法.",""]],["path","pɑ:θ","n. 路径, 小路, 道路, 途径, 路线, 轨道\\n[计] 路径; DOS内部命令:设定DOS读取程序的路径",["Two persons were killed when an elevated bike path collapsed in Rio.","On the country path, a gentle breeze blows, and the scent of night-blooming jasmine reminds one of childhood nights."],["当里约热内卢的一条高架自行车道倒塌时，有2人被砸死了。","鄉間小路上，微風拂過，夜來香的香味讓人想起童年的夜晚。"]],["ear","iә","n. 耳朵, 倾听, 听觉, 穗\\nvi. 抽穗",["She stood on tip-toe and whispered something in his ear, and then went away.","If we were supposed to talk more than listen, we would have been given two mouths and one ear."],["她踮起腳向他耳語，然後走了","如果我們應該少聽多說話, 那麼我們應該得到兩個嘴巴一隻耳朵才是。"]],["shop","ʃɒp","n. 商店, 工厂, 车间\\nvi. 购物, 到处寻找\\nvt. 选购",["I got a video cassette recorder cheap at that shop.","Let's go drink a cup of coffee at that coffee shop over there."],["我在那商店花低價買了臺錄像機。","我們去那間咖啡店喝杯咖啡吧。"]],["folk","fәuk","n. 人们, 家人, 亲属, 民族\\na. 民间的",["That folk singer is very popular with people in general.","Tom played a Spanish folk tune on his English horn at a Chinese restaurant in France."],["",""]],["principle","'prinsipl","n. 原则, 原理, 主义\\n[化] 原理",["Then I'll work on the principle that deference is no substitute for obedience.","However, apart from Buddhists, hardly anyone can consistently follow this principle."],["那我就恭敬不如从命啦。","不过，除了佛教者以外，没有任何人可以一直遵循这个原则。"]],["survive","sә'vaiv","vt. 比...活得长, 生存, 生还, 幸免于\\nvi. 活下来, 幸存",["It's really difficult to survive in a big city like Tokyo without going into debt.","I can't survive without air conditioning in the summer."],["要在一個像東京一樣的大都市裡過活，不借錢是很困難的。","我夏天没有空调会死。"]],["lift","lift","n. 举起, 帮助, 昂扬, 电梯\\nvt. 升高, 提高, 鼓舞, 清偿, 空运, 举起, 剽窃\\nvi. 升起, 消散, 耸立",["She tried to lift the box, but found it impossible.","She tried to lift the box, but found it impossible to do."],["她嘗試將箱子舉起，但發現舉不動。","她嘗試將箱子舉起，但發現舉不動。"]],["border","'bɒ:dә","n. 边缘, 边境, 边界, 花坛\\nvt. 在...上镶边, 接近\\nvi. 接界, 近似\\n[计] 边框",["Sebatik Island is one of the regions where Indonesia and Malaysia share a border.","As North Korea displays aggression, South Korea concentrates its forces near the border."],["石峇迪島是印度尼西亞和馬來西亞的邊境地區之一。","韩国随着朝鲜的外患而在边界附近集结军队。"]],["competition",".kɒmpi'tiʃәn","n. 竞争, 竞赛\\n[经] 竞争, 竞销, 比赛",["He was able to put up remarkable performances at the sports competition.","In the last World Cup, New Zealand was knocked out of the competition by Mexico."],["他在運動會上的表現十分出色。","在上一届世界杯上，新西兰在比赛中被墨西哥淘汰。"]],["jump","dʒʌmp","n. 跳跃, 跳动, 暴涨, 惊跳\\nvt. 跳跃, 跃过, 突升, 使跳跃\\nvi. 跳跃, 跳, 跳动, 暴涨\\n[计] 转移, 跳转",["It was proven that fleas living on dogs jump higher than fleas living on cats.","It is very dangerous to jump aboard the train when it is moving."],["寄生在狗身上的跳蚤已被證明跳得比寄生在貓身上的高。","跳上一列正在开的火车是很危险的。"]],["gather","'gæðә","n. 集合, 聚集\\nvi. 聚集, 集合, 渐增\\nvt. 使聚集, 搜集, 积聚",["On Mid-Autumn Day, families gather, eat moon cake together, and watch the moon.","You must gather further information."],["在中秋节，家人团聚，一起吃月饼、赏月。","你们应该收集进一步的信息。"]],["limit","'limit","n. 界限, 边界, 限度, 极限, 限制\\nvt. 限制, 限定",["We're sorry, Ami, but you can't be part of our group because it would... you know... exceed the 5-people-per-group limit.","Limit the consumption of white sugar and salt."],["我们很抱歉，Ami，但是你不能加入我们的小组因为..你知道的...小组成员不能超过五个人。","限制白糖和盐的摄取量。"]],["fit","fit","n. 适宜, 合身, 发作, 痉挛\\na. 适宜的, 对的, 准备好的\\nvt. 适合, 安装, 使合身, 使适应, 使合格\\nvi. 适…",["Sami was the only one who could fit into the costume.","Old stuff that doesn't fit any more can be used as cloths."],["萨米是唯一一个能穿上这件衣服的人。","不合适的旧衣物可以当抹布用。"]],["cry","krai","n. 叫声, 哭声, 大叫\\nvi. 哭, 叫, 喊\\nvt. 叫喊, 大声说, 哭出",["Seriously though, episode 21 made me almost cry while laughing.","She pressed her lips together and willed herself not to cry."],["但是说真的，第21集让我笑得眼泪都要出来了。","她合上雙唇，並告訴自己不要哭。"]],["equipment","i'kwipmәnt","n. 装备, 设备, 才能\\n[化] 设备; 装备; 装置",["We ought to buy some new office equipment: the stuff we've got is out of date.","If you use this modern equipment, it will save a lot of manpower."],["我們現在的辦公室用品都過時了，得去買點新的了。","如果人們使用這些現代化的機器, 那將節省很多人力。"]],["worth","wә:θ","n. 价值, 财产\\na. 值...的, 值得的",["Don't speak unless you have something worth saying.","The movie is worth seeing at least two or three times."],["除非你有什么值得说的话要说，否则就别吭声。","这部电影至少值得看两三遍。"]],["associate","ә'sәuʃieit","n. 同伴, 伙伴, 关联的事物\\nvt. 使联合, 使发生联系\\nvi. 交往\\n[计] 关联",["We associate the name of Einstein with the theory of relativity.","Don't associate yourself with people that give up easily."],["一提到愛因斯坦，我們就會想起相對論。","別跟輕易放棄的人交往。"]],["critic","'kritik","n. 批评家, 鉴定家",["This famous mountain climber is a critic of mass tourism.","The great critic and the poet are traveling together."],["這位著名的登山家批評大眾旅遊。",""]],["warm","wɒ:m","a. 暖和的, 暖的, 温暖的, 热烈的, 兴奋的, 激烈的, 多情的, 色情的\\nvt. 使温暖, 弄热, 使兴奋, 使充满仇恨\\nvi…",["When they were in Leicester, it was obvious that they had a very warm relationship.","While not experiencing high fevers, she said, her body gets uncomfortably warm."],["在莱斯特的时候很明显她们有很热烈的关系。","她说，虽然没发高烧，但身体暖得难受。"]],["aspect","'æspekt","n. 外观, 方面, 面貌, 方向\\n[医] 方面, 局面; 外观",["A special feature of verbs in the Russian language is the presence of the category of aspect.","Imagination affects every aspect of our lives."],["俄語動詞的一個特徵是存在體的範疇。","想像力影响着我们生活的各个方面。"]],["insist","in'sist","v. 坚持, 坚决主张, 强调",["They insist that daily exercise is an action that must be done.","They will insist on her staying there longer."],["他们坚持认为日常锻练是必得表出的行为。","他们会坚持要她逗留久一点。"]],["failure","'feiljә","n. 失败, 失败者, 不足, 缺乏, 破产\\n[计] 故障; 失效",["His failure to observe traffic regulations resulted in a serious accident.","Even the most carefully made plans frequently result in failure."],["他未能遵守交通規則，結果發生了嚴重的事故。","即使最小心做的计划也经常失败了。"]],["annual","'ænjuәl","n. 年刊, 年报\\na. 每年的, 一年一次的, 全年的, 一年生的",["The Easter Egg Roll is an annual event that is held on the lawn of the White House each Easter Monday.","I counted. A pine tree like this has over three hundred annual rings, yet it took only 15 minutes to cut it down."],["复活节滚彩蛋活动每年复活节周一都会在白宫的草地上举行。","我数了一下，这样一棵松树有三百多圈年轮。而砍倒它只需要15分钟。"]],["french","frentʃ","n. 法国人, 法文, 法式\\na. 法国的, 法国人的, 法语的",["It's quite difficult to master French in 2 or 3 years.","The French government has launched an online game that challenges taxpayers to balance the national budget."],["两三年就想掌握法语是很困难的。","法國政府發布了一款線上遊戲，讓納稅人挑戰平衡國家預算。"]],["comment","'kɒment","n. 注解, 批评, 评论, 备注\\nvi. 评论, 注解\\n[计] 备注",["They said humanity needs to rebuild the Tower of Babel, I have no comment on this.","His comment was concise and to the point."],["他们说人类要重建巴别塔，我对此不予评价。","他的评论简洁且击中要害。"]],["affair","ә'fєә","n. 事件, 事务, 恋爱事件",["Sami was having an affair with a girl named Layla.","Our love affair was as short-lived as a soap bubble."],["萨米和一个叫莱拉的女生有染。","我们的爱情就像肥皂泡一样脆弱。"]],["responsible","ri'spɒnsәbl","a. 有责任的, 负责的, 责任重大的\\n[法] 应负责任的, 有责任的, 能履行责任的",["A bus driver is responsible for the safety of the passengers.","The captain is responsible for the safety of passengers."],["巴士司機有責任保護乘客的安全。","船长要为乘客安全负责。"]],["procedure","prә'si:dʒә","n. 程序, 过程, 手续\\n[计] 规程; 过程",["You don't understand the procedure.","You will save time if you adopt this new procedure."],["你不明白流程。",""]],["regular","'regjulә","a. 规则的, 常例的, 有秩序的, 整齐的, 等边的, 定期的, 经常的, 合格的, 常备军的\\nn. 正规军, 正式队员\\nadv. …",["Everything at that store is 10 percent off the regular price.","It's best to go to the dentist at regular intervals."],["那商店里的商品全都打九折呢。","最好定期去看牙医。"]],["spread","spred","n. 传播, 散布, 伸展\\na. 双唇展开的, 伸展的\\nvt. 展开, 铺开, 传播, 推广, 伸出, 涂, 敷, 延伸\\nvi. 展…",["In the scorching heat, the cat is spread out lethargically on the ground.","We spread out and began to search through the woods."],["在炎热的天气里，猫咪没精神地摊在地上。","我们分散开来并在树林中展开搜索。"]],["chairman","'tʃєәmәn","n. 主席, 会长\\n[经] 主席",["I'll recommend him as chairman, whether you are in favour of it or not.","I'll recommend him as chairman, whether you are in favor of it or not."],["你贊成也好，不贊成也好，我也會推薦他當主席的。","你贊成也好，不贊成也好，我也會推薦他當主席的。"]],["baseball","'beisbɒ:l","n. 棒球\\n[计] 棒球系统",["Interest in baseball cuts across classes and ages in this country.","Playing baseball is a sport, and climbing mountains is a sport, too."],["這個國家裡不同年齡階級的人都減少了對棒球的興趣。","打棒球是一种运动，登山也是一种运动。"]],["soft","sɒft","a. 软的, 温和的, 柔和的, 柔滑的, 温柔的, 软弱的, 坡度小的, 笨的, 纸币的\\nn. 柔软的东西, 笨人, 纸币\\nadv.…",["She was a tall, thin girl with long, soft brown hair.","The mountain path was under a blanket of leaves, soft and easy to walk on."],["她是個又高又瘦, 留著一頭又長又軟的褐色頭髮的女孩。","山中的小徑舖滿了柔軟的落葉，十分好走。"]],["ignore","ig'nɒ:","vt. 不理睬, 忽视, 驳回, 忽略\\n[计] 忽略",["We must not ignore populations suffering under misgovernment.","It wouldn't be wise to ignore Tom completely."],["我们不能忽视暴政之下饱受苦难的人民。","完全忽视汤姆不会是明智的。"]],["egg","eg","n. 蛋, 卵\\nvt. 挑唆, 煽动, 调蛋黄",["Put them on the baking pan and smear them with egg whites.","Egg tarts, when freshly baked, are a real delicacy."],["將它們放在烤盤上並且塗抹蛋白。","新鮮出爐的蛋撻味道一流。"]],["belief","bi'li:f","n. 信念, 相信, 信仰",["It is a prevalent belief, according to a nationwide poll in the United States, that Muslims are linked with terrorism.","Be not afraid of life. Believe that life is worth living, and your belief will help create the fact."],["根据美国国民的一个投票，人们普遍认为穆斯林人和恐怖主义有关。","不要害怕活著。要相信生命是有價值的，你的信念會使之成真。"]],["demonstrate","'demәnstreit","vt. 示范, 证明\\nvi. 示威",["I'd like Tom to demonstrate how to do the butterfly.","These diagrams demonstrate different possible approaches to job seeking."],["",""]],["anybody","'enibɒdi","pron. 任何人\\nn. 重要人物",["Tom asked me if I knew anybody who could translate from French into English.","The world tolerates conceit from those who are successful, but not from anybody else."],["湯姆問我是否認識可以做法英翻譯的人。","世界只能容忍有成就的人的自傲。"]],["murder","'mә:dә","n. 谋杀\\nvt. 谋杀, 损毁, 破坏\\nvi. 犯杀人罪",["The court declared him innocent on the charge of murder.","The police are investigating the murder."],["法庭对他的谋杀罪名作出了无罪判决。","警方正在调查那起谋杀案。"]],["gift","gift","n. 礼物, 赠予, 天才\\nvt. 赋予",["On gift-giving occasions, people generally avoid giving money, but there are exceptions.","You can come to my party, but you have to bring me a gift."],["人們送禮通常都不會送錢，但是也會有例外的情況。","你可以来我的派对,不过,你得带来一件礼物."]],["religion","ri'lidʒәn","n. 宗教, 信仰\\n[法] 宗教, 宗教信仰, 信仰",["You'd better avoid discussion of religion and politics.","I study comparative religion in the arts faculty of the University of Turku."],["你最好別提到宗教和政治這些話題。","我在图尔库大学文化系学习宗教比较学。"]],["review","ri'vju:","n. 检讨, 复习, 回顾, 检阅, 评论\\nvt. 温习, 检讨, 评论, 再检察, 复审\\nvi. 复习功课, 写评论",["I'll keep the meeting notes to review them before the next session.","It is best to review the material before the presentation."],["我會記會議筆記，下次會議前可以回顧一下。",""]],["editor","'editә","n. 编者, 编辑, 主笔, 编辑器, 编辑装置\\n[计] 编辑器",["I know that you're the editor of a popular scientific magazine.","Tom often writes to the editor of the local newspaper about issues of concern to his community."],["",""]],["engage","in'geidʒ","vi. 答应, 从事, 交战\\nvt. 使忙碌, 雇佣, 预定, 使从事于, 使参加",["If you engage in espionage for a foreign power, you are selling your country down the river.","His father was a mayor, but he didn't want to engage in politics."],["",""]],["coffee","'kɒfi","n. 咖啡, 咖啡色\\n[医] 咖啡, 咖啡豆",["The coffee enabled me to stay awake during the dull concert.","One of the main products of this country is coffee."],["咖啡讓我在沉悶的音樂會中保持清醒。","这个国家的主要产品之一是咖啡。"]],["document","'dɒkjumәnt","n. 文件, 公文, 文档\\nvt. 证明, 为...引证\\n[计] 文档",["I hadn't recognized the importance of this document until you told me about it.","Father translated the French document into Japanese."],["你告訴了我以後，我才知道這份文件有多重要。","爸爸把那份法文的文件翻譯成了日文。"]],["speed","spi:d","n. 速率, 速度, 迅速\\nvi. 加速, 超速, 快进\\nvt. 快速传送, 促进, 使加速\\n[计] 中央处理机速度设置程序",["The train is going at a speed of 50 miles per hour.","This year, the speed of development in our company far exceeds that of last year."],["火车以每小时50英里的速度前行。","今年我们公司的发展速度大大超过去年。"]],["cross","krɒs","n. 十字架, 十字架形物件, 交叉, 十字标, 交叉路, 磨难, 杂交\\na. 生气的, 交叉的, 相反的\\nv. 交叉, 横过, 越过…",["He anonymously donated a large sum of money to the Red Cross.","You must be careful of the traffic when you cross the street."],["他匿名向红十字捐了大笔钱。","你橫穿馬路要小心。"]],["influence","'influәns","n. 影响力, 权力, 势力\\nvt. 影响, 改变",["It was through his influence that she became interested in ecology.","Such magazines have a great influence on children."],["她开始对生态学感兴趣，是受到他的影响。","這些雜誌對小孩的影響很大。"]],["anyway","'eniwei","adv. 无论如何, 至少",["I don't have a CD player, but I bought the CD anyway.","You can't get in without your key anyway, so you may as well come to have supper with us."],["我沒有 CD 播放機，但還是把唱片買下來了。","没有你的钥匙的话，你还是进不去，所以你不放来跟我们一起吃晚饭。"]],["commit","kә'mit","vt. 委托(托付), 犯罪, 指派...作战, 使承担义务\\n[法] 犯, 做, 把...交托给",["Out of all the attributes of the gods, the one I find most pitiable is their inability to commit suicide.","How frustrated must a person be to commit suicide?"],["在神的所有特性中，我觉得最让人同情的是他们没办法自杀这一点。","一个人得遇到多大的挫折才会自杀？"]],["threaten","'θretn","vt. 恐吓, 威胁, 预示...的凶兆\\nvi. 威胁, 恫吓, 可能来临",["Don't threaten me with a good time.","There are dangers that threaten both men and women."],["用這種好事來威脅我？我巴不得呢。",""]],["female","'fi:meil","n. 女性, 女人, 雌性动物\\na. 女性的, 女子的",["I have three dogs. One is male and the other two are female.","That's not what I mean. Sex discrimination, female discrimination, whatever, men and women are just different."],["我有三只狗，其中一只是公的，另外两只是母的。","我不是这个意思。性别歧视，女性歧视，不管怎样，男人和女人都是不同的。"]],["youth","ju:θ","n. 年轻, 青年时代, 青年们, 青春\\n[法] 青年, 青年时期, 青春时期",["A lot of people ask me whether bidding goodbye to youth means old age is near.","\"What craft do you know?\" the wizard asked the youth."],["很多人问我，青春的诀别是否意味着年迈的将近。","巫師問年輕人：「你懂什麼技藝？」"]],["wave","weiv","n. 波, 波浪, 波动, 起伏, 高潮, 潮涌, 挥手致意, (气压)突变\\nvi. 波动, 飘动, 挥手示意, 起伏\\nvt. 使波动…",["Following a wave of other recent sports simulations, this release offers ball game fans a more authentic management experience.","A cold wave of fear hit me like a brick."],["在多款體育類模擬遊戲陸續登場後，這款作品為熱愛球類運動的玩家帶來更真實的管理體驗。","一陣寒意像磚頭一樣擊中了我。"]],["afraid","ә'freid","a. 害怕的, 恐怕的, 遗憾的",["Don't be afraid to make mistakes when speaking English.","Despite Trang's constant affirmations of love, Spenser is still afraid someday she will fall out of love with him."],["當你說英語的時候不要怕犯錯。","儘管莊不斷發誓她不變的愛情，斯賓塞仍然害怕有一天她會不愛他了。"]],["quarter","'kwɒ:tә","n. 四分之一, 一刻钟, 季度, 地区\\nvt. 四等分, 肢解\\nvi. 驻扎, 住宿",["Corporate earnings in the first quarter improved sharply.","The third quarter GNP growth was 1% over the preceding quarter."],["企业第一季度收益大幅增长。","第三季國民生產總值較上一季成長了1％。"]],["background","'bækgraund","n. 背景, 背景资料\\n[计] 背景, 后台",["You will need to bring two passport-sized photos of yourself taken with a white background.","There is a castle in the background of the picture."],["你需要攜帶兩張白底的個人證件照。","图片的背景是一座城堡。"]],["native","'neitiv","n. 本地人, 土产, 当地人\\na. 本国的, 与生俱来的, 自然的",["At the time there were no native English speakers teaching in any public school.","Of these, Taoism is a native religion, the others having been introduced from foreign lands."],["當時沒有任何以英語為母語的人在公立學校任教。","其中，道教是本国的，其他是从国外引进的。"]],["broad","brɒ:d","a. 宽广的, 辽阔的, 广大的, 显著的\\nadv. 宽阔地\\nn. 宽阔部分",["Today, robbers robbed another bank in broad daylight.","He had his car stolen in broad daylight."],["今天强盗大白天的就抢了另一家银行。","他的车子光天化日被偷走了。"]],["wonderful","'wʌndәful","a. 令人惊奇的, 奇妙的, 极好的",["The show was wonderful, but the tickets were too expensive.","It would be wonderful if you could sing at our wedding."],["这场秀棒极了，但是门票太贵了。","你能在我们的婚礼上唱歌就太好了。"]],["deny","di'nai","v. 否认, 拒绝",["You shouldn't deny the validity of everything she did just because of a single mistake.","You can't deny the validity of everything she did just because of a single mistake."],["你不能因为她所犯下的一个错误就否定她所做的一切。","你不能因为她所犯下的一个错误就否定她所做的一切。"]],["apparently","ә'pærәntli","adv. 表面上, 清楚地, 显然地",["Apparently, there is nothing that cannot happen today.","Apparently, they nest in a tree in front of the house."],["显然，今天什么事都有可能发生。","很明顯的，牠們在房前的樹上築巢。"]],["slightly","'slaitli","adv. 些微地, 苗条地",["You may be right, but we have a slightly different opinion.","Generally speaking, nobles were only very slightly affected by taxes."],["也许你是对的，但我们的意见稍微有所不同。","总体来说，贵族受到税收的影响微乎其微。"]],["reaction","ri'ækʃәn","n. 反应, 反作用, 反动\\n[医] 反应",["What kind of reaction did you have when he came looking for you?","I find myself being enthralled by her reaction each time I replay it."],["他来找你的时候，当时你是什么反应？",""]],["twice","twais","adv. 两次, 两倍",["She writes to her pen pal in London twice a month.","The referee blew his whistle twice to tell everyone it was full-time."],["她每两个月给在伦敦的笔友写一封信。","裁判吹哨两次，向大家宣布已经终场。"]],["suit","sju:t. su:t","n. 套装, 诉讼, 请求, 起诉, 套, 组\\nvt. 适合, 使适应\\nvi. 合适, 相称",["People eagerly sought a more modernised style of dress and transformed the old qipao to suit their tastes.","I can't find the waistcoat of my three piece suit."],["人们热切地寻求更有现代风格的衣服，所以把以前的旗袍改成了适合他们品位的东西。","我找不到我三件套的背心。"]],["perspective","pә'spektiv","n. 远景, 透视感, (观察问题的)视角, 透视法, 看法, 透视图\\na. 透视的, 透视法的\\n[计] 透视",["We need at least one policymaker on the committee to provide the perspective of someone who can help make decisions about the research.","You should always keep a broad perspective on the work you do."],["我們需要至少一個關於委員會的政策制定者，提供有助於做出關於該研究的決策者觀點。",""]],["growing","'grәuiŋ","a. 成长的",["They have a growing population; therefore they need more and more food.","They want to increase food production by growing new kinds of rice."],["那國家的人口正在增長，所以他們需要的食物量也愈來愈大。","他們想栽培新品種的米來增加糧食生產。"]],["blow","blәu","n. 吹, 打击, 殴打, 花开\\nv. 吹, 风吹, 吹响, 开花",["No matter how fierce the winds blow or the waves crash, it feels as effortless as strolling leisurely in a quiet courtyard.","He had his girlfriend blow on the dice for luck before he threw them."],["不管风吹浪打，胜似闲庭信步。","他掷骰子之前让他的女友在上面吹气来给他带来好运。"]],["construction","kәn'strʌkʃәn","n. 建筑, 构造, 建筑物\\n[化] 施工",["The first phase of construction has been completed.","There is a shortage of good construction timber right now."],["工程的第一階段已經完成了。","现在正缺良好的建筑木材。"]],["intelligence","in'telidʒәns","n. 智力, 情报, 信息\\n[医] 智力",["To have doubts about oneself is the first sign of intelligence.","If you sign up to Facebook, your information will be sent to intelligence agencies."],["自我怀疑是聪明的第一标志。","如果你在 Facebook 註冊，你的個人資料就會被送到情報機關的手裏。"]],["destroy","di'strɒi","vt. 破坏, 毁坏, 消灭",["Destroy one's bridges after one has crossed the river.","China has the means to destroy your aircraft carriers."],["过河拆桥。","中國有能力摧毀你們的航空母艦。"]],["cook","kuk","n. 厨子, 厨师\\nvt. 烹调, 煮饭, 加热\\nvi. 在煮着",["Because my mother is sick, my father will cook today.","I'll do your shopping, clean up the house, and cook your dinner for you."],["母親病了，所以今天由父親下廚。","我會幫你買菜，打掃，以及做晚餐。"]],["connection","kә'nekʃәn","n. 连接, 关系, 前后关系\\n[计] 连接",["The telephone operator asked the caller to hold on until a connection was made.","The possibility of a lack of connection between the events can be dismissed immediately."],["电话运营商提示来电人等候接通。","可以立即排除事件之间缺乏关联的可能性"]],["burn","bә:n","vt. 烧, 烧毁, 烧伤\\nvi. 燃烧, 发热, 烧毁\\nn. 烧伤, 烙印",["When you have finished reading this letter, burn it.","He lost his reason when he saw his house burn down."],["看完这封信请把它烧掉。","看着自己的房子被烧得精光，他顿时丧失了理智。"]],["shoe","ʃu:","n. 鞋, 靴, 外胎\\nvt. 给...穿鞋, 为马钉蹄铁",["There was some chewing gum on the sole of Tom's shoe.","There was some chewing gum stuck to the sole of Tom's shoe."],["汤姆的鞋底粘了口香糖。","汤姆的鞋底粘了口香糖。"]],["neighbor","'neibә","n. 邻居\\nvt. 邻接\\nvi. 毗邻而居, 友好\\na. 邻近的",["A close neighbor is better than a distant relative.","Unfortunately, my neighbor was involved in a traffic accident, and is currently in a coma."],["远亲不如近邻。","很不幸地，我的鄰居被捲入交通事故，呈現昏迷狀態。"]],["grade","greid","n. 等级, 年级, 阶段, 成绩, 程度, 坡度, 斜坡\\nvt. 分等, 分级, 评分\\nvi. 属于某等级, 逐渐变化",["Tom did the best he could, but he wasn't able to get a higher grade than Mary.","Mary and Tom have been in love since the eighth grade."],["汤姆尽了全力，但他还是不能获得比玛丽更高的等级。","玛丽和汤姆从8年级开始就相爱了。"]],["context","'kɒntekst","n. 上下文, 背景, 来龙去脉\\nn. 上下文\\n[计] 上下文",["If you don't understand something, it's because you aren't aware of its context.","The difference between a standalone sentence and a sentence in the middle of an essay is that the latter has context."],["如果你不明白一件事，那是因为你没有意识到它的背景。","独立的句子和文章中的句子的区别在于后者具备上下文。"]],["committee","kә'miti","n. 委员会\\n[经] 委员会",["A committee was constituted to investigate prices.","The committee consists of scientists and engineers."],["为了调查物价，成立了一个委员会。","委員會是由科學家和工程師組成的。"]],["hey","hei","interj. 嗨",["Hey, I may have no money, but I still have my pride.","Hey, sir, the function on the blackboard is not exponential, but trigonometric."],["嗨，我可能没钱，但我一直有我的骄傲。","老師，黑板上的函數不是指數函數，是三角函數。"]],["mistake","mis'teik","n. 错误, 误会\\nvi. 犯错, 误认\\nvt. 误解, 弄错\\n[计] 错误",["No matter how often I tell her, she keeps making the same mistake.","If that man makes one more mistake, I'll fire him."],["不管我跟她说了多少次，她还是继续犯同样的错误。","如果那个男人再犯一个错误，我就开除他。"]],["location","lәu'keiʃәn","n. 位置, 场所, 特定区域\\n[计] 位置",["A GPS device can pinpoint your location anywhere in the world.","That place's food is delicious and their prices are low. However, their location isn't good."],["無論你在世界的哪一個角落，你都可以使用全球定位儀來找出你的所在。","那家馆子物美价廉，美中不足的是他们糟糕的位置。"]],["clothes","klәuðz","n. 衣服",["Wearing second-hand clothes is now popular among young people.","She finished ironing the clothes a few minutes ago."],["二手服飾在時下年輕人之間蔚為風潮。","她几分钟前熨完了衣服。"]],["quiet","'kwaiәt","n. 安静, 闲适, 平静\\na. 安静的, 静止的, 寂静的, 朴素的, 从容的, 暗中的\\nvi. 平静下来\\nvt. 使平静, 使平…",["To be quiet in class is to respect other people's sleep.","The novel \"All Quiet on the Western Front\" by Erich Maria Remarque has been translated into more than fifty languages."],["人上课時安静意味着他尊重他人的睡眠。","埃里希馬里亞雷馬克所寫的小說\"西線無戰事\"已被翻譯成超過五十種語言。"]],["indian","'indiәn","n. 印度人, 印第安人, 印第安语\\na. 印度的, 印度群岛的, 印第安语的",["Taiwanese food is milder than Indian food.","At long last, the two chiefs of the Indian tribes have decided to make peace."],["台灣菜比印度菜口味淡。",""]],["dress","dres","n. 服装, 覆盖物\\nvi. 穿着\\nvt. 给...穿衣, 整理",["His dress is that of a gentleman, but his speech and behavior are those of a clown.","The color of her dress and that of her shoes go well together."],["他衣着像个绅士，言行举止却像个小丑。","她裙子和鞋子的顏色很配。"]],["promise","'prɒmis","n. 诺言, 约定的事情, 有指望\\nvt. 允诺, 约定, 预示\\nvi. 允诺, 有前途, 有指望",["When you want to say \"I promise\", if you say \"koko ni chikaimasu\" you'll sound more like a native.","If you don't make the promise, then I'll just stand by and watch."],["當你想說\"我保證\", 如果你說\"koko ni chikaimasu\", 你聽起來會更象一個本地人。","你要是不答应的话，我就袖手旁观。"]],["aware","ә'wєә","a. 知道的, 有觉悟的",["If you don't understand something, it's because you aren't aware of its context.","He was aware that I was around, but didn't come to greet me."],["如果你不明白一件事，那是因为你没有意识到它的背景。","他注意到我在場，但是沒向我打招呼。"]],["function","'fʌŋkʃәn","n. 官能, 职务, 功能, 函数\\nvi. 活动, 运行, 行使职责\\n[计] 功能, 函数",["The dot product of two vectors can be expressed as a function of their lengths and the angle between them.","This function takes two parameters, the first one is the title of the window, the second one will be the title of the icon."],["兩個向量的點積可以表示為其長度與兩者夾角的函數。","这个函数有两个参数，第一个是窗体的标题，另一个是图标的标题。"]],["bone","bәun","n. 骨头, 骨, 骨制品\\nvt. 剔骨\\nvi. 专心致志",["If you have a bone to pick with a person, tell it to his face instead of saying things behind his back.","I got a fish bone stuck in my throat."],["如果你们之间有问题，应该当面告诉他，不要在背后说他。","我被鱼骨刺到了喉咙。"]],["active","'æktiv","a. 活跃的, 起作用的, 积极的, 有效的, 主动的, 活性的, 现行的, 现役的\\nn. 主动语态, 积极分子",["According to my grandmother, being active is the key to her good health.","There are many active volcanoes in Japan."],["我奶奶说，良好健康的关键是保持积极。","日本有很多活火山。"]],["extend","ik'stend","v. 扩充, 延伸, 伸展, 扩大\\n[计] 扩展",["I want to extend my stay here for a few more days.","The Alps extend across eight European countries."],["我想延长这里的住宿多几天。","阿爾卑斯山脈橫跨八個歐洲國家。"]],["chief","tʃi:f","n. 领袖, 酋长, 长官, 主要部分\\na. 主要的, 首位的",["I got acquainted with the chief executive.","You don't have proper dignity as chief of the section."],["我認識了這位行政長官。",""]],["combine","kәm'bain","v. (使)联合, (使)结合\\nn. (企业的)联合, 联合收割机",["I know a lot of French words, but it's difficult for me to combine them into sentences.","We may combine your personal information with other information."],["我知道很多法语词汇但我很难将它们组成句子","我们可能会将你的私人信息和其他信息结合在一起。"]],["wine","wain","n. 葡萄酒, 果酒, 暗红色\\nv. (请)喝酒",["It's better to chill white wine before you serve it.","Even if they have a good wine menu, I will not want to dine here."],["在你侍酒前最好先將白葡萄酒冷卻一下。","即使他们有很好的酒单，我也不想在这里用餐。"]],["below","bi'lәu","prep. 在下面\\nadv. 在下面",["The reason why we cannot support his view will be given below.","The temperature has been below freezing for several days."],["以下是我們不支持他的看法的理由。","零度以下的氣溫持續了好幾天。"]],["cool","ku:l","n. 凉爽, 凉爽的空气\\na. 凉爽的, 冷淡的, 冷静的\\nvi. 冷却, 平息\\nvt. 使冷却, 使平静",["On a hot summer day, the air conditioner works all day to keep us cool.","I was quite thirsty and wanted to drink something cool."],["炎炎夏日，空调全天开放让我们保持凉爽。","我很渴，想喝点冷饮。"]],["voter","'vәutә","n. 选民, 投票人\\n[法] 选民, 选举人, 投票人",["That voter, Mary Johnson, turned out to be a Democrat.","They claimed that my name had been inadvertently eliminated from the voter registration list."],["",""]],["bus","bʌs","n. 公共汽车\\n[计] 总线; 汇流条; 母线",["A bus driver is responsible for the safety of the passengers.","If you go by bus, you can get there in about one-third of the time."],["巴士司機有責任保護乘客的安全。","你乘公車去的話，可以省掉三分之二的時間。"]],["learning","'lә:niŋ","n. 学问, 学识, 学习\\n[计] 学习",["She had no difficulty in learning the poem by heart.","I greatly recommend reading it to anybody thinking of learning a craft."],["她輕而易舉的就把詩背熟了。","我強烈推薦任何想學習一門手藝的人都去讀這本書。"]],["hell","hel","n. 地狱, 邪恶势力, 苦境, 阴间, 毁坏, 训斥\\nvi. 狂饮, 飞驰",["A person who hates creates his own hell, but a person who loves has heaven within.","I just got another leg cramp and it hurts like hell."],["一个充满了恨的人为自己创造了地狱，而一个拥有爱的人心中存在着天堂。","我刚刚腿又抽筋了，痛死我了。"]],["dangerous","'deindʒәrәs","a. 危险的\\n[法] 危险的, 危害的",["It must be dangerous to swim in this rapid stream.","It is dangerous for children to play near this pond."],["在這麼急的急流裏游泳，一定會很危險的。","小孩在這個水池旁邊玩會很容易發生意外的。"]],["remind","ri'maind","vt. 提醒, 使想起",["He would remind people again that it was decided not only by him but by many others.","Let me remind you again that March 31st is the due date."],["他会再一次提醒人们，这不仅是他一个人的决定，也是很多其他人的决定。","讓我再次提醒你3月31日是到期日。"]],["moral","'mɒrәl","n. 道德, 品行, 寓意\\na. 道德的, 品性端正的, 精神上的",["Moral evil is the result of ignorance.","Everyone has the right to the protection of the moral and material interests resulting from any scientific, literary or artistic production of which he is the author."],["道德上的恶乃是无知的后果。","人人对由于他所创作的任何科学、文学或美术作品而产生的精神的和物质的利益，有享受保护的权利。"]],["united","ju:'naitid","a. 联合的, 团结的, 一致的, 和睦的\\n[法] 联合的, 统一的, 一致的",["This will be a good souvenir of my trip around the United States.","If you want to study in the United States, you need to get a student visa."],["这将是我环绕美国旅行中一个很好的纪念品。","你想去美國讀書的話，一定要先申請一張學生簽證。"]],["category","'kætigәri","n. 种类, 类项\\n[计] 分类",["A special feature of verbs in the Russian language is the presence of the category of aspect.","In a different category was the prediction of a new age."],["俄語動詞的一個特徵是存在體的範疇。",""]],["relatively","'relәtivli","adv. 相对地, 比较地, 相当地, 相关地\\n[计] 相对地",["I have come to realize that China is developing quickly but the Chinese people live a relatively leisurely life.","I'm actually relatively good at written language, but with spoken language I often can't remember the tone on some word."],["我意識到了中國正在快速地發展，但是相對而言中國人卻過著悠閒的生活。","其实，书面语我搞得相当好，但是口语中，我经常会记不起来某个字的音调。"]],["victory","'viktәri","n. 胜利, 战胜, 克服",["Both victory and defeat are but an everyday occurrence to a soldier.","But above all, I will never forget who this victory truly belongs to. It belongs to you. It belongs to you."],["胜败是兵家常事。","但最重要的是，我永远不会忘记这场胜利真正属于谁，它属于你们，它属于你们。"]],["academic",".ækә'demik","a. 学院的, 学术的, 不切实际的\\nn. 大学生, 大学教师, 学者, 学会会员",["Academic fraud is more common than you might think.","Schoolwork, cultural work and academic work should all be promoted together."],["学术造假比你想象的普遍。","學生工作、文化工作和學術工作應該同時推進。"]],["internet","'intәnet","[计] 因特网, 国际互连网, 网际网络, 互连网络, 广域网",["It is easier to hit on people on the Internet than in the street.","The proliferation of Internet usage has given birth to a new generation of young people."],["在网上勾人比在街上容易。","互联网的广泛应用使新一代的年轻人诞生了。"]],["healthy","'helθi","a. 健康的, 有益健康的, 卫生的\\n[医] 健康的",["Every person in this community is like a cell in the immune system of a healthy human body.","If you want to keep healthy, you should do more exercises."],["这个团体内的每个人，像是一个健康的人体内免疫系统里的细胞。","要想身体健康, 就应该多锻练身体."]],["negative","'negәtiv","n. 否定, 否定语, 负数, 底片\\na. 否定的, 消极的, 负的, 阴性的\\nn. 负数, 负值\\n[计] 负数, 负值",["It's stable because all the roots of this equation are negative.","My teacher taught me that you can take the square root of a negative number."],["它是可靠的, 因為這個方程式所有的根都是負的。","我的老师教我负数也可以开平方根。"]],["following","'fɒlәuiŋ","n. 下列各项, 部下, 追随者\\na. 下列的, 其次的",["The workflow is illustrated in the following chart.","At nightfall I like following the tradition of taking a walk along the lakeside."],["下面的图标显示了这个流程图","傍晚我喜歡沿著湖邊散步。"]],["historical","hi'stɒrikәl","a. 历史的, 史实的, 历史上的\\n[法] 历史性的",["A historical landmark has been restored and will reopen.","This is a city of real historical value."],["一座歷史地標已經修復並將重新開放。","这是一个具有历史价值的城市。"]],["medicine","'medisin","n. 药, 医学, 内科\\nvt. 给...用药",["Mother applied the medicine to the sore on my knee.","The physician prescribed his patient some medicine."],["母親把藥膏塗在了我膝蓋的傷口上。","医生给他的病人开了一些药。"]],["tour","tuә","n. 旅游, 观光旅行, 任期\\nvi. 旅行, 周游, 巡回\\nvt. 周游, 观光, 游历, 使巡回演出",["The old couple embarked on a tour around the world.","During the tour he broke apart from the group and found his own way."],["老夫妇出发去环游世界了。",""]],["depend","di'pend","vi. 靠, 视...而定, 信赖",["Children depend on their parents for food, clothing and shelter.","A man's happiness doesn't depend on what he has, but on what he is."],["孩子们的衣食住行靠的是他们的父母。","人的幸福不在于他拥有什么，而在于他是什么样的人。"]],["finding","'faindiŋ","n. 发现, 发现物, 决定, 裁决\\n[法] 调查结果, 对事实的认定, 判定的要素",["The rescuers searched the surroundings in hopes of finding the child.","Finding a decent man is more difficult than winning a lottery."],["援救人员为了找到孩子，仔细搜索了那个区域。","找一个好男人比中彩票还要难。"]],["grab","græb","n. 抓握, 掠夺, 强占, 东方沿岸帆船\\nvi. 抓取, 抢去\\nvt. 攫取, 捕获, 霸占",["Ziri went to his fridge to grab some milk.","Let's grab a quick lunch at that small coffeeshop near the park."],["齊里走到冰箱前去拿牛奶。",""]],["direct","di'rekt","a. 直接的, 坦白的\\nvt. 指示, 指挥, 命令, 导演\\nvi. 指导, 指挥\\nadv. 直接地",["We want natural-sounding translations, not word-for-word direct translations.","Are there any direct flights between Boston and Sydney?"],["我们想要听起来自然的翻译，而不需要逐字的翻译。","请问波士顿和悉尼之间有直飞航班吗？"]],["classroom","'klɑ:sru:m","n. 教室",["This classroom can accommodate only thirty students.","There were few students remaining in the classroom."],["這間班房只能容納三十個學生。","教室里没剩下几个学生了。"]],["contact","'kɒntækt","n. 联系, 交际, 熟人, 接触\\nvi. 接触, 联系\\nvt. 使接触",["We are sorry, the person you are trying to contact is not available.","Sally lost the contact lenses she had bought the day before."],["對不起, 你要聯絡的人沒空。","Sally 把前一天買的隱形眼鏡弄不見了。"]],["justice","'dʒʌstis","n. 正义, 公平, 公正, 正确, 司法, 审判",["He believed that the war was fought in the cause of justice.","It is justice, not charity, that is wanting in the world."],["他相信，戰爭是為了正義而戰。","世界需要的是公正，不是施舍。"]],["photograph","'fәutәgrɑ:f","n. 相片, 照片, 逼真的描绘\\nv. 照相, 摄影",["This photograph reminds me of enjoyable times when I was a child.","That's my younger sister's photograph."],["这张照片让我想起童年的快乐时光。","那是我妹妹的照片。"]],["participate","pɑ:'tisipeit","vi. 参加, 分享, 参与, 带有\\nvt. 分享, 分担",["The government will provide interest-free loans to firms that participate in the program.","I can translate between Chinese and English, and can participate in negotiations with foreigners."],["政府将会对参与该项计划的企业提供无息贷款。","我可以做中英双向翻译，参加跟外国人交际谈判。"]],["daily","'deili","a. 每日的, 日常的\\nadv. 每日地, 日常地\\nn. 日报",["Other requirements come from your relationships with other people and your daily activities.","Putting in effort daily is essential to language learning."],["其它的要素来自你跟别人的关系和你平日的活动。","语言的学习在于日积月累。"]],["fair","fєә","n. 展览会, 市集, 美好的事物\\na. 公平的, 按规则进行的, 不好不坏的, 晴朗的, 美丽的\\nadv. 公平地, 正面地, 有教…",["It's not fair to attribute your failure to your parents.","It doesn't seem very fair to treat him like this."],["把你的失败归咎于你的父母是不对的。","这样对待他似乎不太公平。"]],["pair","pєә","n. 一双, 一对, 一副\\nv. (使)成对",["There is a pair of worn red stockings in the drawer.","I don't need anything... just a new pair of pants."],["抽屜裏有一雙穿過的紅色絲襪。","我什么都不需要……只要一条新裤子。"]],["famous","'feimәs","a. 出名的, 极好的",["The man who lives next door to us is a famous actor.","London, where I live, used to be famous for its fog."],["住在我們隔壁的男人是位知名演員。","我住的地方－倫敦，從前以霧聞名。"]],["exercise","'eksәsaiz","n. 行使, 执行, 运动, 练习, 作业\\nvt. 运用, 练习, 运动\\nvi. 练习, 锻炼",["Moderate exercise will refresh both mind and body.","Good health is inseparable from exercise and moderation."],["适度的运动让身心焕然一新。","健康与运动及节制密不可分。"]],["knee","ni:","n. 膝, 膝盖\\nvt. 膝行, 用膝盖碰",["Mother applied the medicine to the sore on my knee.","Tom hurt his left knee during practice, so John had to play the game in his place."],["母親把藥膏塗在了我膝蓋的傷口上。",""]],["flower","'flauә","n. 花, 开花植物, 精华, 盛时\\nvi. 开花, 发育, 旺盛, 成熟\\nvt. 用花装饰, 使开花",["The girl in the picture has a flower wreath on her head, and not a golden crown.","From then on, flower fairs were held in Guangzhou during the Spring Festival every year."],["畫中的女孩頭上戴著的是花冠，不是金皇冠。","从那时起，在广州每年春节的时候都有花节。"]],["tape","teip","n. 带子, 录音带, 磁带, 窄带, 卷尺\\nvt. 以带子绑起, 测量, 录音\\n[计] 带",["My cassette tape recorder needs fixing.","That tape recorder recorded his voice."],["我的磁带录音机需要维修。","那台錄音機錄下了他的聲音。"]],["hire","haiә","n. 租金, 租用, 雇用\\nvt. 雇请, 出租\\nvi. 受雇",["When we started out, our band could only find small clubs in small cities that would hire us.","We're going to hire the most famous makeup artist for our cast's makeup."],["我們的樂隊剛起步時，只有小城市里的小俱樂部僱我們。","我們將邀請最有名的化妝師為我們的演員化妝。"]],["familiar","fә'miljә","a. 熟悉的, 常见的, 亲密的\\nn. 熟友, 常客",["All of you are familiar with the truth of the story.","The map on page 11 looks very strange. Turn it upside down. Then it becomes a familiar map to you."],["你們所有的人都熟悉這個故事的真相。","第十一頁的地圖看起來十分奇怪。可是，把它上下倒轉來看的話，就會變回你所熟悉的地圖了。"]],["appropriate","ә'prәupriәt","a. 适当的\\n[经] 适当的, 拨出, 占用",["I need to configure this server with an appropriate firewall system.","Contact the appropriate customer service helpline if the device does not operate properly."],["我该在这个服务器上设置一个防火墙。","如果裝置無法正常運作，請聯絡對應的客服專線。"]],["supply","sә'plai","n. 补给, 供给, 供应品\\nvt. 补给, 供给, 提供, 补充\\nvi. 替代",["There is close relationship between supply and demand.","They monopolized the supply market and drastically raised prices."],["供應和需求之間的關係十分密切。","他們壟斷了原物料供應，並開天價。"]],["fully","'fuli","adv. 十分地, 完全地, 充分地",["Every time I leave, I'm of full the regret that I haven't fully said goodbye.","I will follow your advice fully from here onwards."],["我很遗憾每次离开的时候，都没有好好地道别。","接下来该怎么做，我完全听从您的吩咐。"]],["actor","'æktә","n. 男演员, 行动者\\n[医] 作用物, 反应物",["That 'Ayumi' kid, only 13 but has performed in movies and theatres as a child actor since she was five.","The man who lives next door to us is a famous actor."],["那個叫做亜弓的孩子，你別看她才十三歲，她五歲的時候就成了童星，在電影和舞台劇中演出了。","住在我們隔壁的男人是位知名演員。"]],["birth","bә:θ","n. 出生, 起源\\n[医] 生产, 分娩",["The proliferation of Internet usage has given birth to a new generation of young people.","She gave birth to her first child at twenty years old."],["互联网的广泛应用使新一代的年轻人诞生了。","她在二十歲的時候生下第一個孩子。"]],["search","sә:tʃ","n. 搜寻, 查究\\nv. 搜寻, 搜查, 探求, 调查, 搜索\\n[计] 搜索, 路径检索程序",["More than 90 percent of visits to a web page are from search engines.","We spread out and began to search through the woods."],["一个网页超过百分之九十的访问量是来自于搜索引擎的。","我们分散开来并在树林中展开搜索。"]],["tie","tai","n. 带子, 线, 鞋带, 领带, 领结, 关系, 束缚, 平局, 不分胜负\\nvt. 系, 打结, 扎, 约束, 与...成平局\\nvi…",["This tie has a more vibrant color and goes better with this suit.","A drop of mustard fell and stained my tie during lunch."],["这条领带颜色亮一点，跟这件西装比较配。","吃午饭的时候，一坨芥末酱滴下来弄脏了我的领带。"]],["democracy","di'mɒkrәsi","n. 民主政治, 民主主义\\n[法] 民主, 民主政治, 民主政体",["Democracy is the worst form of government, except all the others that have been tried.","In a democracy, it's important for the press to be independent."],["除了那些我们尝试过的政府形态，民主是最差的那种了。","在民主国家，报刊的独立性是很重要的。"]],["eastern","'i:stәn","n. 东方人, 东正教徒\\na. 东方的, 向东的, 自东的",["It is generally believed that Buddhism first came to China in 67 A.D. during the reign of Emperor Mingdi of the Eastern Han Dynasty.","Gorelick said that the outcomes of his work in Jordan may be used to evaluate water scarcity in other Middle Eastern countries, such as Syria."],["普遍认为佛教公元六七年在东汉明帝的统治时先来中国。","戈雷利克表示，他在約旦的研究成果可用於評估敘利亞等其他中東國家的水資源短缺。"]],["primary","'praimәri","n. 最主要者, 原色\\na. 主要的, 初期的, 根本的, 原始的, 首要的, 基本的\\n[计] 初等量; 主要的; 一次的",["My mother used to pick me up every day when I was at primary school.","Saxophonists often double on flutes, which have similar fingerings to their primary instruments."],["我读小学的时候，我母亲每天来接我。","薩克斯管吹奏者常常兼演奏長笛，因為長笛的指法和薩克斯管類似。"]],["yesterday","'jestәdi","n. 昨天\\nadv. 昨天",["This racket of Jane's is a little heavier than the one which I bought yesterday.","I had to attend two meetings yesterday, and there was no time to have lunch between."],["珍的這個球拍比我昨天買的那個重了一點點。","我昨天要開兩個會，連吃午飯的時間也沒有。"]],["circle","'sә:kl","n. 圆周, 社交圈, 循环, 范围\\nvt. 围着, 环绕\\nvi. 盘旋, 循环",["She drew a circle on a piece of paper with a pencil.","The red circle on the calendar marking the deadline causes me to fall into anxiety."],["她用铅笔在纸上画了一个圈。","日历上画着红圈的截稿日期使我陷入了焦虑。"]],["device","di'vais","n. 装置, 设计, 策略, 发明物, 设备\\n[计] 设备; DOS内部命令:该命令要求DOS安装一个设备驱动程序",["A GPS device can pinpoint your location anywhere in the world.","Customers who purchase a new device can enjoy additional trial period as a promotional offer."],["無論你在世界的哪一個角落，你都可以使用全球定位儀來找出你的所在。","購買新裝置的用戶可享有額外試用優惠。"]],["progress","'prәugres","n. 进步, 发展, 前进\\nvi. 进步, 进行",["The ship made slow progress against the strong wind.","Together, you represent the harmony between tradition and progress."],["這艘船逆風而行緩慢前進。","你們共同代表著傳統與進步之間的和諧。"]],["bottom","'bɒtәm","n. 底部\\na. 底部的\\nvt. 给...装底, 查明真相\\nvi. 到达底部, 建立基础",["I'm beginning to stop seeing people wearing bulky glasses like that of the bottom of a milk bottle.","Truth is difficult to find at the bottom of a well."],["鏡片像牛奶瓶底一樣厚的那種眼鏡，我不太看到有人戴了。","在井底很難找到真理。"]],["island","'ailәnd","n. 岛, 岛屿, 孤立地区, 安全岛\\nvt. 使成岛状, 孤立",["Viewed from a distance, the island looked like a cloud.","The economy of the island is dependent on the fishing industry."],["這個島從遠方看起來像一片雲。","这个岛的经济依靠的是渔业。"]],["exchange","iks'tʃeindʒ","n. 交换, (电话)交换局, 交换机, 汇兑, 交易所\\nv. 交换, 交易, 兑换\\n[计] 交换; 电话局",["The exchange rates for foreign currency change daily.","I would like to exchange this watch for a cheaper one."],["外幣的匯率天天都變。","我想用这块手表换一块便宜一点的。"]],["clean","kli:n","a. 干净的, 清白的, 简洁的\\nadv. 清洁地, 完全地\\nvt. 清理, 使干净, 出空\\nvi. 被搞干净\\nn. 打扫",["Bring me a clean plate and take the dirty one away.","I'll do your shopping, clean up the house, and cook your dinner for you."],["请拿一个新的盘子给我并把这个脏的拿走.","我會幫你買菜，打掃，以及做晚餐。"]],["studio","'stju:diәu","n. 工作室, 画室, 演播室, 电影制片厂",["There was a single oil painting left unfinished in the studio. No other pictures were there.","My sister is old enough to go to a workout studio by herself."],["",""]],["county","'kaunti","n. 县, 郡",["These smaller parts are called counties, and each county has a county council, like Westhamptonshire County Council.","And now, think about a county, any county, and imagine this county divided into five or six different areas."],["",""]],["train","trein","n. 火车, 列车, 行列, 长队, 一连串的后果, 顺序\\nvt. 训练, 教育, 对准\\nvi. 受训练, 锻炼",["The train was delayed, so I could not arrive there on time.","They waved good-bye to their parents as the train pulled out."],["火车晚点了，所以我不能准时赶到那里。","火車開出的時候，他們都揮手向父母道別。"]],["lady","'leidi","n. 淑女, 夫人, 女士, 贵妇",["You should know better than to ask a lady her age.","The lady really flipped out when she learned she had won a million dollars."],["你應該知道不要問小姐的年齡。","當這位女士得知她已經贏得了百萬美元, 她真的樂瘋了。"]],["colleague","'kɒli:g","n. 同事, 同僚",["My colleague and I do the same job, but he was promised a promotion in a very short while.","My colleague and I do the same job, but she was promised a promotion very soon."],["我和我別的同事做同樣的事情，但是得到了能在很短時間內得到晉升的承諾。","我和我別的同事做同樣的事情，但是得到了能在很短時間內得到晉升的承諾。"]],["application",".æpli'keiʃәn","n. 应用, 申请, 志愿书, 应用程序\\n[计] 应用, 应用程序",["The due date for submitting the application is this Friday.","You need to attach your photo to the application form."],["提交申请的最后期限是星期五。","你必须把你的照片贴在申请书上。"]],["lean","li:n","n. 瘦肉, 倾斜, 倾斜度\\na. 瘦的, 贫乏的, 歉收的\\nvi. 倚靠, 倾斜, 依赖\\nvt. 使倾斜",["Lend me your shoulder for me to lean on.","Tom resisted the temptation to lean over and kiss Mary."],["把你的肩膀借给我让我依靠。",""]],["neck","nek","n. 脖子, 衣领, 颈\\nvi. 拥抱, 拥吻, 收缩\\nvt. 割颈",["When he shouted, the veins in his neck stood out clearly.","He craned his neck a bit in hopes of hearing what they were whispering."],["他大喊的時候，脖子上青筋暴起。","他伸长了脖子，希望能听到他们低声说的话。"]],["damage","'dæmidʒ","n. 损害, 伤害\\nv. 损害",["The house did not suffer much damage because the fire was quickly put out.","Our employees are working around the clock to fix the damage caused by the ice storm."],["火很快便被撲熄了，房子只受到輕微損壞。","我们的员工正在争分夺秒地修理冰暴带来的损坏。"]],["plastic","'plæstik","n. 塑料, 可塑体, 可塑性物质\\na. 塑料的, 塑造的, 有可塑性的, 造型的, 易受影响的, 有创造力的",["We must make the utmost effort to reduce the use of plastic packaging, and also to recycle all waste plastic.","Paper, glass and plastic are recyclable materials."],["我们应该尽我们最大的努力减少塑料包装的使用，并回收所有的塑料废物。","紙張、玻璃和塑膠都是可回收的材質。"]],["tall","tɒ:l","a. 高的, 长的, 夸大的\\nadv. 夸大地",["No other mountain in the world is as tall as Mt. Everest.","At the city center, there are many tall buildings."],["世界上任何山峰都达不到珠穆朗瑪峰的高度。","城市中心有很多高高的建筑。"]],["plate","pleit","n. 碟, 盘子, 盆中物, 金属板, 图版, 金银餐具, 印版, 金属牌(照)\\nvt. 镀金, 电镀, 用金属板固定, 给...装钢板…",["A plate of pilaf with some kebabs is heaven on earth.","A plate of pulao with some kebabs is heaven on earth."],["一盘抓饭配一些烤肉串就是人间天堂。","一盘抓饭配一些烤肉串就是人间天堂。"]],["hate","heit","n. 憎恨, 恨, 厌恶\\nvt. 憎恨, 憎恶\\nvi. 仇恨",["I hate when other people make me wait a long time.","To be in love is not the same as loving. You can be in love with a woman and still hate her."],["我讨厌别人让我等很久。","被爱和爱一个人不同。你可以被一个人爱着的同时，却恨着这个人。"]],["otherwise","'ʌðәwaiz","adv. 否则, 不同地, 别的方式",["I'll expect you tomorrow unless you let me know otherwise.","They lost their way; otherwise, they would have arrived long ago."],["你不改口的话，我明天就来等你了。","他們肯定是迷路了，不然他們應該已經到了很久了。"]],["writing","'raitiŋ","n. 书写, 著作, 笔迹, 作品\\n[医] 书写",["There was always too much superfluous writing in his essays.","I have been writing since two o'clock without a break."],["在他的文章中总是有太多肤浅的桥段。","我從兩點開始寫呀寫呀，一分鐘也沒休息過。"]],["male","meil","n. 男人, 雄性动物\\na. 男性的, 雄性的, 有力的",["Some people say Japan is a male-dominated society.","I have three dogs. One of them is male and the other two are female."],["有些人说日本是个男性统治的社会。","我有三只狗，其中一只是公的，另外两只是母的。"]],["alive","ә'laiv","a. 活着的, 活泼的, 敏感的, 热闹的",["Many of our pioneers are still alive... but, alas, many of them aren't alive any more.","Everybody knows for a fact that he is still alive."],["我們的先驅者中許多還活著...但是，唉，其中有許多已經死了。","誰都知道他現在還在人世。"]],["expression","ik'spreʃәn","n. 表达, 表现, 词语, 措辞\\n[计] 表达式",["He said with a perplexed expression, \"I've heard nothing, so I can't say anything.\"","Whether by a Hitler salute or a hand on your heart, I consider the expression of patriotism to be the symptoms of a disease, whose cause and cure should be more closely studied."],["他的目光十分困惑：「我甚麼也沒聽過，所以甚麼也說不出來。」","無論通過行納粹禮還是將手放在胸前，我認為這種愛國主義的表現是一種病的症狀，而病因和治療方法有待進一步研究。"]],["football","'futbɒ:l","n. 足球, 橄榄球",["Our football team defeated all the other teams in the city.","I have never been able to understand the joy of watching football, haha."],["我们的足球队打败了市里所有其他队。","我始终不能理解看足球的乐趣，呵呵。"]],["theater","'θiәtә","n. 戏院, 电影院, 剧场, 全体观众, 戏剧, 戏剧效果, 阶梯式讲堂, 场所",["Go along this street, and you'll find the movie theater.","The movie theater has discounts every Monday and Wednesday."],["沿着这条大道走，你就会找到电影院了。","電影院每個星期一和星期三都有折扣。"]],["intend","in'tend","vt. 计划, 打算, 意思是\\n[法] 想要, 打算, 意旨",["I intend to devote a few hours a day to the study of English.","Tom and Mary say they intend to play golf with us this afternoon."],["我打算每天花幾個小時來學英文。","汤姆和玛丽说他们今天下午打算和我们一起来打高尔夫。"]],["chicken","'tʃikin","n. 小鸡, 鸡肉",["\"I'm going to try to make chicken parmesan for my family tonight,\" said Matthew's sister after trying his recipe.","Tom eats rice every day either with fish or with chicken breast."],["馬修的姊姊在試過他的食譜後說道：「我今晚要試著為家人做帕瑪森雞排。」","湯姆每天吃飯要嘛配魚，要嘛配雞胸肉。"]],["army","'ɑ:mi","n. 军队, 陆军",["With the heirless king going crazy and royal family poisoned, the general of the army finally had his chance to usurp the throne.","I had been in the army for a month when the war ended."],["随着无继承人的国王的发疯和王室家族的中毒，将军终于有机会篡夺王位。","戰爭結束的時候，我已經在軍隊裡待了一箇月。"]],["abuse","ә'bju:s.ә'bju:z","n. 滥用, 虐待, 恶习, 辱骂\\nvt. 滥用, 辱骂, 虐待",["When it comes to drugs, there's a very fine line between use and abuse.","I wrote a post to my blog encouraging men to report experiences with domestic abuse."],["用藥和濫藥只差一線。","我在部落格上發表了一篇文章，鼓勵男性舉報自己遭受家庭虐待的經歷。"]],["shut","ʃʌʃ","n. 关闭\\nvt. 关上, 闭起, 幽禁, 合拢, 轧住\\nvi. 关上, 停止营业",["Keep your eyes wide open before marriage, half shut afterwards.","It looks like rain. We had better shut the windows."],["婚前張開眼，婚後半閉眼。","好像快要下雨了。我們把窗關上吧。"]],["map","mæp","n. 地图, 天体图, 映像\\nvt. 映射, 绘制...地图, 计划\\n[计] 实用程序, 映射, 制造自动化协议",["The map on page 11 looks very strange. Turn it upside down. Then it becomes a familiar map to you.","My schoolmate is holding a map of Beijing in his hand."],["第十一頁的地圖看起來十分奇怪。可是，把它上下倒轉來看的話，就會變回你所熟悉的地圖了。","学友的手里正拿着北京地图呢。"]],["extra","'ekstrә","n. 额外的事物, 另外的收费\\na. 额外的, 特别的\\nadv. 额外地, 特别地, 非常地",["The child next door has to attend three different extra classes every month.","They were lucky the game went into extra time because they ended up winning."],["隔壁家的孩子每个月要参加3种补习班。","他们很幸运比赛进入加时赛，因为他们最终获胜。"]],["session","'seʃәn","n. 期间, 开庭期, 会议, 学期\\n[计] 会话, 对话, 会晤, 通用任务程序",["I'll keep the meeting notes to review them before the next session.","The bill is expected to be enacted during the present session."],["我會記會議筆記，下次會議前可以回顧一下。",""]],["welcome","'welkәm","n. 欢迎, 欢迎词\\na. 受欢迎的, 可随意的, 可喜的\\nvt. 欢迎, 接待\\ninterj. 欢迎",["Welcome. Now that many people have arrived, please take a seat and wait for a while.","He that hears much and speaks not at all shall be welcome both in bower and hall."],["欢迎光临，现在人很多，请坐下来等一等。","他聽得多說得少, 在閨房和大廳都很受歡迎。"]],["danger","'deindʒә","n. 危险, 威胁\\n[法] 危险, 危险物, 危机",["An octopus can release ink when it gets into danger.","Doctors warn us of possible danger."],["章魚遇到危險時會噴出墨汁。","医生们警告我们可能的危险。"]],["earth","ә:θ","n. 地球, 泥土, 世界, 尘世\\nvt. 埋入土中, 赶入洞内\\nvi. 躲入洞内",["Today our artificial satellites are revolving around the earth.","If it were not for water, no one could live on earth."],["今天我们的人造卫星正在环绕地球运转。","如果沒有了水，沒有人能夠在地球上生存。"]],["domestic","dәu'mestik","a. 家庭的, 国内的, 驯养的\\n[医] 家庭的, 家用的",["I wrote a post to my blog encouraging men to report experiences with domestic abuse.","The company is turning to export markets to make up for a decline in domestic sales."],["我在部落格上發表了一篇文章，鼓勵男性舉報自己遭受家庭虐待的經歷。",""]],["lots","lɔts","n. 大量, 许多；一堆；命运（lot的复数）",["I couldn't sleep well last night because there were lots of things on my mind.","When I was a teenager I had lots of hair on my head and none on my chest. Now it's just the opposite."],["我昨晚一整夜沒睡好，因為有許多事情縈繞在我的心頭。","当我还是年轻人的时候，我脑袋上有很多头发，胸上无毛。现在，恰恰相反。"]],["literature","'litәrәtʃә","n. 文学, 文艺, 著作\\n[经] 广告, 商品介绍等文学",["The culture of the Chinese zodiac is deeply rooted in people's lives, language and literature.","He is already skilled in both math and literature."],["生肖文化深深植根於人們的日常生活和語言文化中。","他既精于数学又精于文学。"]],["rain","rein","n. 雨, 下雨, 雨天\\nvi. 下雨\\nvt. 使大量落下",["I was planning on going to the beach today, but then it started to rain.","All of a sudden, large drops of rain began falling from the dark sky."],["我本来预备今天去海滩的，但接着天就开始下雨了。","灰暗的天空突然下起了一大滴一大滴的雨來。"]],["desire","di'zaiә","n. 欲望, 要求\\nvt. 想要, 请求\\nvi. 渴望",["The basic job of an advertising agency is to figure out how to turn a desire into a need.","So wine and venison, to their hearts' desire, / refreshed their strength."],["廣告商最基本的工作就是把人的慾望轉化成需要。","於是，他們心滿意足地享用了美酒和野味，/ 恢復了體力。"]],["assessment","ә'sesmәnt","n. 评估, 估定, 评定的款额\\n[化] 评估",["The assessment of communist countries is positive overall.","The report gives a sober assessment of the current state of science education in the US."],["",""]],["injury","'indʒәri","n. 伤害, 侮辱\\n[医] 伤, 损伤",["I got hurt during an experiment, and the injury was pretty serious.","Not all of the passengers escaped injury."],["我做實驗的時候弄傷了，而且還傷得十分嚴重。","並非所有的乘客都免於受傷。"]],["respect","ri'spekt","n. 尊敬, 尊重, 问候\\nvt. 尊敬, 注意, 遵守",["To be quiet in class is to respect other people's sleep.","This table is fine except in one respect - it will not fit into my room."],["人上课時安静意味着他尊重他人的睡眠。","這張桌子不錯，不過有一個美中不足的地方 ﹣ 我的房間放不下它。"]],["paint","peint","n. 油漆, 颜料, 绘画作品, 涂漆\\nvt. 油漆, 绘, 画, 描绘, 装饰, 点缀\\nvi. 绘画, 涂漆",["It was not until he was thirty that he started to paint.","He had his sister help him paint the wall of his room."],["他到了三十歲才開始畫畫。","他让妹妹帮他涂他房间的墙。"]],["northern","'nɒ:ðәn","n. 北方人\\na. 北方的, 向北的, 自北方来的",["The term \"qipao\" is widely used in Northern China.","Norway, located in Northern Europe, is a highly developed country."],["“旗袍”这个词语在中国北方广为使用。","挪威位於北歐，是個高度發展的國家。"]],["nod","nɒd","n. 点头, 打盹, 晃动\\nvi. 点头, 打盹\\nvt. 点头表示, 点(头)",["Nancy greeted me with a nod from across the street.","I don't need a friend who changes when I change and who nods when I nod; my shadow does that much better."],["",""]],["fuel","'fjuәl","n. 燃料, 木炭\\nvt. 加燃料, 供燃料\\nvi. 得到燃料",["Carbon dioxide is a gas that is produced every time a fuel such as coal, oil, or natural gas is burned.","This heating equipment uses diesel as fuel."],["二氧化碳是燃燒煤、石油或天然氣這樣的燃料時會產生的氣體。","这个取暖装置用柴油作为燃料。"]],["leaf","li:f","n. 叶, 树叶, 花瓣, 页\\nvi. 生叶, 翻书页\\nvt. 在...上长叶, 翻...的页",["A fallen leaf floated on the surface of the water.","I'll turn over a new leaf and study English very hard."],["水面浮着一片落葉。","我会重新开始，努力学习英语。"]],["dry","drai","a. 干的, 无酒的, 枯燥无味的, 干燥的\\nvt. 把...弄干\\nvi. 变干\\nn. 干, 干涸",["It gets very humid here in the summer. In the winter, on the other hand, it gets very dry.","Cold and dry, splendid sunshine, what beautiful winter weather!"],["这里的夏天很潮湿，另外，冬天很干燥。","寒冷乾燥，燦爛的陽光，多麼美麗的冬日天氣!"]],["russian","'rʌʃәn","n. 俄国人, 俄语\\na. 俄国的, 俄语的",["The official languages of the United Nations are Arabic, Chinese, English, French, Russian and Spanish.","The official languages of the UN are Arabic, Chinese, English, French, Russian, and Spanish."],["联合国的正式语文是阿拉伯文，中文，英文，法文，俄文，和西班牙文。","联合国的正式语文是阿拉伯文，中文，英文，法文，俄文，和西班牙文。"]],["instruction","in'strʌkʃәn","n. 指令, 教导, 命令\\n[计] 指令",["From reading good books we can derive pleasure, friendship, experience and instruction.","Refer to the instruction manual if you need to fix the refrigerator."],["读书，可以获得乐趣、友谊、经验和指导。",""]],["pool","pu:l","n. 池, 水塘, 石油层, 联营\\nvt. 合伙经营, 共享, 采掘, 汇聚成\\nvi. 汇合成塘, 淤积, 联营",["You have to stretch your muscles after swimming in the pool.","His only hope of winning the pool game at that point was to successfully execute a complex trick shot."],["在泳池游完泳後要拉伸肌肉。","那時他贏得撞球比賽的唯一希望，就是成功打出一記複雜的花式擊球。"]],["climb","klaim","v. 攀登, 上升, 爬\\nn. 攀登, 爬升",["He was the first man to climb Mt. Fuji in the winter.","A lot of people climb the railing, and even litter."],["他是第一個在冬季攀登富士山的人。","很多人跳過欄杆，還丟垃圾。"]],["sweet","swi:t","n. 甜蜜, 糖果, 情人\\na. 甜的, 芳香的, 悦耳的, 漂亮的, 和蔼的, 不咸的, 灵活的, 轻快的",["Then let me to the valley go, This pretty flower to see; That I may also learn to grow In sweet humility.","Those grapes look sweet, but in fact they're sour."],["然後讓我去山谷，看看這朵美麗的花；這樣我也可以在甜蜜的謙卑中，學會成長。","那些葡萄看起來很甜，但其實是酸的。"]],["engine","'endʒin","n. 引擎, 发动机, 机车\\nvt. 安装发动机于",["Before the fire engine arrived, the whole house had burnt down.","The result of the invention of the steam engine was that human power was replaced by mechanical power."],["消防车到达之前，房子就全烧了。","机械力代替人力, 这是蒸汽机发明的结果。"]],["fourth","fɒ:θ","num. 第四, 四分之一",["My office is on the fourth floor of that gray six-story building.","I took the elevator to the fourth floor."],["我的办公室在那幢灰色的六层楼的四楼。","我搭电梯去了四楼。"]],["salt","sɒ:lt","n. 盐, 风趣, 刺激\\na. 含盐的, 咸的, 风趣的, 辛辣的\\nvt. 加盐于, 用盐腌",["Choose food low in fat, sugar and salt, and high in fibre.","Slice the kale, and add it to a pan, with olive oil, garlic, salt and pepper, and wait until it is soft and tasty."],["挑選少油、少糖、少鹽和高纖的食物。","將羽衣甘藍切片，放入鍋中，加入橄欖油、大蒜、鹽和胡椒，煮至軟嫩可口。"]],["expand","ik'spænd","vt. 使膨胀, 详述, 扩张\\nvi. 张开, 发展\\nvt. 展开\\nvi. 展开\\n[计] 展开; DOS外部命令:将原始DOS磁盘…",["He really needs to expand his Berber vocabulary.","The blossoms expand under the influence of the weather."],["他真的很需要擴大自己的柏柏語詞彙量。",""]],["importance","im'pɒ:tәns","n. 重要, 重要性, 重要地位, 自大\\n[机] 重要, 重要性",["It was only much later that I came to understand the importance of child education.","This is considered to be a matter of great importance."],["很久以後我才明白到教育兒童有多重要。","这被认为是一件大事。"]],["metal","'metәl","n. 金属, 金属制品, 合金, 本质, 质料\\na. 金属制的\\nvt. 以金属覆盖",["The value of a coin depends on the weight of the metal used.","On the mahogany desk, there is a metal cup and a blue coaster."],["钱币的价值取决于所使用的金属的重量。","紅木書桌上有一個金屬杯子和一個藍色杯墊。"]],["fat","fæt","n. 脂肪, 脂油, 肥肉\\na. 肥的, 胖的, 油腻的\\nn. 文件分配表\\n[计] 文件分配表",["Between you and me, the fat ugly man is on a diet.","She once proudly stated that she was going to lose 5 kilos of fat in a single month."],["那个丑男人在节食，这个我们知道就好。","她曾经夸口说一个月之内要减掉5公斤赘肉。"]],["ticket","'tikit","n. 票, 券, 车票, 标签, 入场券, 证明书\\nvt. 加标签于, 为...购票",["The concert ticket costs more than the cinema ticket.","It was Sir Anthony's eightieth birthday concert and everybody wanted a ticket."],["演唱会门票比电影票贵。","这是安东尼爵士的八十岁生日音乐会，大家都想要一张入场券。"]],["software","'sɒftwєә","n. 软件\\n[计] 软设备",["A user should have freedom with respect to both hardware and software. An operating system should be open, not closed.","Pierre has a lot of pirated software on his computer."],["用户应该拥有硬件和软件的使用自由，操作系统应该是开放的，而不是封闭的。","Pierre电脑里有很多盗版软件。"]],["disappear",".disә'piә","vi. 消失, 不见",["He put up his hoodie and tried to disappear into the crowd.","The point we must clarify here is that the lines between amateur and professional in sport are beginning to disappear."],["他拉起帽兜，試圖隱沒在人群中。","我们必须阐明这个观点，在运动项目上，业余选手和专业选手的界限开始消失了。"]],["corporate","'kɒ:pәrit","a. 社团的, 合伙的, 公司的\\n[经] 团体的, 法人的, 社团的",["Corporate earnings in the first quarter improved sharply.","Corporate bankruptcies continued at a high level last month."],["企业第一季度收益大幅增长。",""]],["strange","streindʒ","a. 奇怪的, 陌生的, 生疏的, 不熟悉的, 不可思议的, 外行的, 外地的, 异乡的",["This story may sound strange, but it's absolutely true.","We've been having strange weather the past few years."],["這個故事聽起來可能很奇怪，但卻是千真萬確的。","這幾年的天氣很反常。"]],["reading","'ri:diŋ","n. 阅读, 知识, 读物\\na. 阅读的",["Please return the book when you have finished reading it.","While I was reading in bed last night, I fell asleep with the light on."],["请你在阅读完毕后归还此书。","我昨晚在床上看书的时候点着灯就睡了。"]],["lip","lip","n. 唇, 口缘, 唇状构造\\nvt. 以嘴唇碰, 轻轻说出\\na. 口头上的\\n[计] 大型互连网信息包",["In a horrifying chain of events, Christopher Columbus once bit his own lip.","Throughout the five years of painful cancer treatments, he managed to keep a stiff upper lip."],["在一連串可怕的事件中, 哥倫布曾經咬緊牙關撐過去。","这五年痛苦的癌症治疗他终于坚持下来了。"]],["urban","'ә:bәn","a. 都市的, 住在都市的, 习惯于都市的\\n[法] 城市的, 都市的, 市区的",["An increase in the number of cars will affect the urban environment.","This movement from rural to urban areas has been going on for over two hundred years."],["车辆增多会影响到城市的环境。","在這二百年來，有很多人從農村搬到了市區居住。"]],["mental","'mentl","a. 心智的, 精神病的, 心理的, 颏的\\nn. 精神病患者",["The emigrants have endured physical and mental pain.","He got where he wanted to be in life by just using his raw mental strength and willpower."],["移民们忍受着肉体和精神的痛苦。","他仅凭借精神力量和意志力就达到了他所想要的生活。"]],["increasingly","in'kri:siŋli","adv. 逐渐地, 渐增地",["Over the past ten years, people have become increasingly aware that they need to change their eating habits.","In England, parks taking rare breeds of animals as their theme are becoming increasingly popular with people."],["十年来，人们越来越强烈地意识到需要改变自己的饮食习惯。","在英国，以珍稀物种为主题的公园变得越来越受人们的欢迎。"]],["lunch","lʌntʃ","n. 午餐",["I slept a little during lunch break because I was so tired.","A drop of mustard fell and stained my tie during lunch."],["我在午休时间睡了一会儿，因为我太累了。","吃午饭的时候，一坨芥末酱滴下来弄脏了我的领带。"]],["educational",".edju'keiʃәnl","a. 教育的, 教育性的",["It is essential that every child have the same educational opportunities.","Some people say that cartoons on television are educational in themselves."],["每一個孩子都應該享有平等的學習機會。","有人說電視上的卡通本身是有教育意義的。"]],["somewhere","'sʌmhwєә","adv. 到某处, 在某处",["\"Haven't we met somewhere before?\" asked the student.","Books are for people who wish they were somewhere else."],["“以前我们没在哪儿见过吗？”学生问道。","書是為了那些希望自己在另一個地方的人。"]],["farmer","'fɑ:mә","n. 农夫, 农场主\\n[法] 农民, 农场主, 承包者",["The farmer warned the children not to stomp on the freshly planted crops.","\"Get rid of it, of course!\" answered the farmer."],["農夫警告孩子們不要踐踏新栽種的作物。","\"擺脫它, 當然!\" 這個農夫回答。"]],["sugar","'ʃugә","n. 糖, 糖块, 甜言蜜语\\nvt. 加糖于, 使甜蜜, 粉饰, 美化\\nvi. 制成糖",["The store sells foodstuffs, such as butter, cheese, and sugar.","The only way I can eat porridge is with lots of sugar."],["這家店賣黃油、奶酪、砂糖之類的食品。","唯有加很多糖才能讓我喝得下粥。"]],["planet","'plænit","n. 行星, 命运星辰, 杰出的人, 重大影响的事",["Mercury is the smallest planet in our solar system.","The Moon isn't a planet, but a satellite of the Earth."],["水星是我們的太陽系中最小的行星。","月球不是一颗行星，而是地球的一颗卫星。"]],["favorite","'feivәrit","n. 喜欢的事物, 幸运儿\\na. 特别受喜爱的, 喜爱的, 宠爱的, 中意的",["My favorite word in German is the word for \"glove\".","Tom donates half his salary to his favorite charity."],["我最喜歡的德文字是「手套」。","汤姆捐一半他的薪水给他最喜欢的慈善机构。"]],["explore","ik'splɒ:","v. 探险, 探测, 探究",["A cost-effective way to explore the Solar System was to send thousands of robotic probes to scour celestial bodies for data.","We will explore every planet that goes around the sun."],["",""]],["obtain","әb'tein","vt. 获得, 达到\\nvi. 流行, 得到公认",["It is necessary to obtain the sanction of the authorities to enter this building.","I am able to obtain a registration form for free."],["必須獲得有關當局的批准才能進入這座建築物。","我可以免费获取一份注册表格。"]],["enemy","'enimi","n. 敌人, 仇敌, 敌军\\na. 敌人的",["Investigate thoroughly the bushes where the enemy may be hiding.","We've just received intelligence that the enemy is waiting in ambush two miles down the road."],["仔細搜尋敵人可能藏身的灌木叢。","我們剛剛收到情報，敵方正在前方兩英里處埋伏。"]],["greatest","'^reitist","[计] 最大的",["Sleep is the greatest thief, for it steals half one's life.","Although you can't make it as \"the greatest person\", you can still be the best person to your partner."],["睡眠是最大的小偷，它偷了我们一半的生命。","你雖然做 不到一個『最好的人』,可是你卻做得到一個『對對方最好的人』。"]],["complex","kәm'pleks","n. 综合体, 情结, 络合物\\na. 复杂的, 组合的",["The natural world is always much more complex than formulations in the lab or blueprints in the design office.","The situation was much more complex than he had thought."],["自然界从来都比试验室的配方或设计院的图纸里所反映的要复杂得多。","事情可比他所想的要复杂得多。"]],["surround","sә'raund","vt. 包围, 环绕, 围绕\\nn. 围绕物",["Sometimes because of their atmospheres and sometimes because of the gases which surround them.","Surround yourself only with people who are going to lift you higher."],["",""]],["athlete","'æθli:t","n. 运动员, 运动选手\\n[医] 运动员",["That athlete won three times in a row in this tournament.","You must be a good athlete to have run a mile in such a short time."],["那位選手在這次比賽中取得了三連勝。",""]],["invite","in'vait","vt. 邀请, 请求, 引起, 招致\\nn. 邀请",["Losing your temper for no reason would invite the resentment of others.","I feel a little guilty that I didn't invite him to join the celebration."],["无理由乱发脾气会让别人反感。","我没请他来参加庆祝会，感到有点内疚。"]],["repeat","ri'pi:t","n. 重复, 反复\\nvt. 重做, 重复, 复述, 使再现, 复制\\nvi. 重复\\n[计] 重复",["Let us repeat: cup, plate, knife, fork, spoon, teaspoon.","The teacher made me repeat the sentence."],["再念一次：杯子、盤子、刀、叉、湯匙、茶匙。","老師讓我重複了這句話。"]],["carefully","'kєәfuli","adv. 小心地, 谨慎地",["When taking drugs, follow the directions on the bottle carefully.","Compare the two carefully, and you will see the difference."],["吃药之前一定要仔细看说明书。","仔細的比較一下，就會發現兩者之間的分別了。"]],["soul","sәul","n. 灵魂, 心灵, 精神, 精髓, 人, 化身, 典型, 鬼魂\\na. 黑人的",["Sun lights the landscape, pain illuminates the soul.","The soul is made up of reason, determination, and passion."],["阳光照亮田野，痛苦点亮心灵。","灵魂是由理性、意志和情欲构成的。"]],["scientific",".saiәn'tifik","a. 科学的, 系统的, 符合科学规律的\\n[计] 科学记数法",["Most scientific breakthroughs are nothing else than the discovery of the obvious.","The book is full of far-flung theories without any basis in scientific fact."],["多數科學突破只不過是發現了顯而易見的事。","書中滿是遙不可及、沒有科學根據的理論。"]],["impossible","im'pɒsәbl","a. 不可能的, 难以置信的, 令人无法忍受的",["It's absolutely impossible for me to go on like this.","This TV was made ten years ago and there are no parts available, so it is impossible to repair it."],["让我像这样继续下去是绝对不可能的。","這台電視機是十年前製造的, 現在已經沒有零件可換, 所以要修理它是不可能的事了。"]],["panel","'pænl","n. 嵌板, 仪表板, 专题讨论小组, 全体陪审员\\nvt. 嵌镶板",["A panel of experts discussed the plan.","We understand that the Woody Panel retails for $80."],["一個專家小組討論這個計劃。",""]],["meaning","'mi:niŋ","n. 意义, 含义, 目的, 意图\\na. 意味深长的",["He explained the literal meaning of the sentences.","Even though he explained to me over and over again the meaning of this poem, I still don't get it."],["他解释了句子的字面意思。","虽然他对我反复解释这首诗的意思，我还是不懂。"]],["mom","mʌm","n. 妈妈",["To tell you the truth, I've been scolded by my mom.","We will tidy up our room so that Mom is satisfied."],["老实说，我被我妈妈骂了。","我们将要整理房间，这样妈妈就会满意了。"]],["married","'mærid","a. 已婚的, 婚姻的\\n[法] 结了婚的, 有配偶的, 夫妇的",["After I got married, my Japanese got better and I could understand more.","Everyone opposed it, but they got married all the same."],["在我结婚之后，我的日语水平提高了，能理解更多日语了。","他們不理眾人的反對結了婚。"]],["instrument","'instrumәnt","n. 工具, 手段, 仪器\\n[化] 仪器",["My favourite musical instrument is the electric guitar.","The barometer is an instrument that measures atmospheric pressure, especially used to study climate and to determine altitudes."],["我最喜欢的乐器是电吉他。","氣壓表是一種用來測量大氣壓力的儀器，主要用於研究氣候和測量高度。"]],["predict","pri'dikt","v. 预知, 预言, 预报",["The best way to predict the future is to create it yourself.","No one could predict the outcome of this cooperation."],["預知未來的最好方法就是自己創造未來。","没人能够预言这次合作的结果。"]],["weather","'weðә","n. 天气, 气象, 处境\\na. 迎风的\\nvt. 使受风吹雨打, 侵蚀, 使风化, 经受住\\nvi. 风化, 受侵蚀, 经受风雨",["I would rather stay at home than go out in this hot weather.","We've been having strange weather the past few years."],["在这种暑天里我宁愿呆在家也不出去。","這幾年的天氣很反常。"]],["presidential",".prezi'denʃәl","a. 总统制的, 总统的, 首长的, 统辖的\\n[法] 总统的, 议长的, 总经理的",["American politics are interesting to watch, especially during a presidential election.","Everyone held their breath to see who would win the presidential election."],["美国的政治看起来很有趣，特别是在选举总统期间。","所有人都屏住呼吸关注着谁会赢得总统竞选。"]],["commitment","kә'mitmәnt","n. 委托, 交押, 承担义务, 赞助\\n[医] 院禁",["Strong commitment to the environment is not compatible with large investments in oil and gas.","Adopting a sentence on Tatoeba is a lot less of a commitment than adopting a child."],["",""]],["emotional","i'mәuʃәnәl","a. 情绪的, 情感的\\n[医] 情绪的",["I agree on an emotional level, but on the pragmatic level I disagree.","People's emotional lives are becoming more and more unstable."],["我感情上支持，但是理性上反对。","人們的感情生活越來越不穩定。"]],["supreme","sju'pri:m","n. 至高, 霸权\\na. 至高的, 终极的, 极端的, 最大的",["Cyber activists want to meet with the Supreme Leader.","The embassy is located next to the Supreme Court."],["网络积极分子想跟最高领袖见面。","大使馆就在最高法院旁边。"]],["bear","bєә","n. 熊\\nvt. 忍受, 支承, 产生, 怀有, 通过卖空使跌价\\nvi. 忍受, 结果实, 压挤, 行进, 转向",["I've got a toothache. I just can't bear this pain anymore.","If the bees do not work, the flowers will not bear fruit."],["牙疼。我无法忍受这种疼痛。","如果蜜蜂都偷懒的话，盛开的花便不会结果了。"]],["pocket","'pɒkit","n. 口袋, 钱袋, 钱, 容器\\nvt. 装...在口袋里, 隐藏, 抑制, 私吞, 搁置, 击...入袋\\na. 袖珍的, 小型的, …",["The knife was so blunt that I could not cut the meat with it and I resorted to my pocket knife.","The kitchen knife wasn't sharp enough to cut the meat, so I used my pocket knife."],["那把刀太鈍了，根本切不動肉，我只好拿出我的小刀。","这把菜刀不够锋利，所以我用了我的折叠刀来切肉。"]],["thin","θin","a. 薄的, 细的, 瘦的, 稀疏的, 稀薄的, 淡的, 弱的, 空洞的\\nvt. 使变薄, 使变细, 使稀少, 使淡\\nvi. 变薄, …",["If you want to become thin, you should cut back on the between-meal snacks.","She was a tall, thin girl with long, soft brown hair."],["如果你想變瘦，就應該少點在正餐以外吃零食。","她是個又高又瘦, 留著一頭又長又軟的褐色頭髮的女孩。"]],["temperature","'temprәtʃә","n. 温度, 发烧, 热度\\n[化] 温度",["In addition to a blocked nose, I'm also suffering from a high temperature.","The temperature has been below freezing for several days."],["除了鼻子不通以外，我还发着高烧。","零度以下的氣溫持續了好幾天。"]],["poll","pәul","n. 投票, 民意测验, 选举投票, 投票数, 一组人中的一个, 头颈和后脑部, 鹦鹉\\nvt. 对...进行民意测验, 获得...票, …",["It is a prevalent belief, according to a nationwide poll in the United States, that Muslims are linked with terrorism.","The opinion poll was based on a random sample of adults."],["根据美国国民的一个投票，人们普遍认为穆斯林人和恐怖主义有关。",""]],["surprise","sә'praiz","n. 惊奇, 奇袭, 诧异\\nvt. 使惊奇, 撞见, 奇袭",["To my surprise, there were no people in the village.","Her surprise was so great that she could not speak."],["奇怪的是，村子裏竟然一個人也沒有。","她驚訝得說不出話來。"]],["proposal","prә'pәuzl","n. 提议, 计划, 求婚\\n[经] 提案, 申请, 投标",["Most students agree with the proposal and have made a list of arguments in favour of it.","Tom asked Mary to marry him, but she turned down his proposal."],["大多数学生同意这个建议，并列出了他们同意的理由。","汤姆向玛丽求婚，但是她拒绝了。"]],["consequence","'kɒnsikwәns","n. 结果, 重要性\\n[法] 结果, 后果, 推断",["In consequence of some badly coded functions, the system is unstable most of the time.","In consequence of a new agreement between two competitors, we need to readjust our strategies."],["由于一些写得糟糕的函数，系统大多数情况下不稳定。","由于两个竞争对手的一项新协议，我们需要重新调整战略。"]],["breath","breθ","n. 呼吸, 气息, 瞬间\\n[医] 呼气, 呵气, 口气, 呼吸",["Everyone held their breath to see who would win the presidential election.","He took a deep breath before entering his boss's office."],["所有人都屏住呼吸关注着谁会赢得总统竞选。","他在进老板办公室前深吸了一口气。"]],["sight","sait","n. 景观, 视力, 眼界, 阅读, 见解, 意见\\nvt. 看见, 瞄准\\nvi. 瞄准, 观看\\na. 即席的, 见票即付的",["The baby caught sight of my ballpoint pen and reached out for it.","She waved her hand until the train was out of sight."],["這個嬰兒盯著我的原子筆看, 並且伸手要拿它。","她挥着她的手，直到火车消失在视线之外。"]],["balance","'bælәns","n. 平衡, 差额\\nvi. 平衡, 相等\\nvt. 称, 权衡, 比较, 使平衡, 结算, 抵消",["The French government has launched an online game that challenges taxpayers to balance the national budget.","The balance of public opinion remains in his favor."],["法國政府發布了一款線上遊戲，讓納稅人挑戰平衡國家預算。","公众意见的平衡仍是他的关切。"]],["adopt","ә'dɒpt","vt. 采用, 正式通过, 收养, 接受\\n[医] 采取",["If you can't have children, you could always adopt.","Tom was hoping the committee would adopt his proposal."],["如果你不能有孩子，你总能领养。","湯姆希望委員會採納他的提案。"]],["minority","mai'nɒriti","n. 少数, 未成年, 少数民族\\na. 少数的, 属于少数派的",["Han, Manchu, Mongol, Hui and Tibetan people (as well as other minority groups in China) are kins in one family.","April is the national minority health month."],["漢滿蒙回藏（以及中國的其他少數族裔們）一家親。","四月是全國弱勢團體醫療月。"]],["straight","streit","n. 直线, 直\\na. 直的, 笔直的, 正直的, 直接的, 连续的, 整齐的\\nadv. 直接地, 立即, 不断地",["I recognised her straight away; she hasn't changed a bit.","Go straight down this street and turn right at the third light."],["我一下子就認出她了，她一點兒都沒變。","沿着这条路直走，到第三个红绿灯的地方右转。"]],["connect","kә'nekt","v. 连接, 联合, 联系",["I often use SSH to remotely connect to my computer.","If you connect your phone to your PC via USB, you can even transfer files and photos."],["我经常使用SSH来远程连接到我的电脑。","您如果透過 USB 將手機連接到電腦，則甚至可以傳輸檔案和照片。"]],["works","","n. 工程, 工厂, 工事, 活动部件, 机件, 著作, 作品, 善行, 德行\\n[机] 工厂, 工场",["The groom works for a company now, and the bride is our teacher.","He works really hard, and his co-workers respect him for it."],["新郎现在在一家公司工作，新娘是我们的老师。","他很努力工作，所以他的同事们都尊敬他。"]],["teaching","'ti:tʃiŋ","n. 教学, 学说, 教导",["At the time there were no native English speakers teaching in any public school.","Teaching ESL is usually a gig for losers and boozers."],["當時沒有任何以英語為母語的人在公立學校任教。","教英語通常是失敗者和酒鬼的工作。"]],["belong","bi'lɒŋ","vi. 属于, 合适",["No one may be compelled to belong to an association.","You yourself belong to this group of people that you're talking about - the one that doesn't speak standard Mandarin well."],["不可以强迫任何人加入某个协会。","你像你说的那些人一样都属于说不好普通话的人。"]],["aid","eid","n. 帮助, 外援, 助手\\nvt. 援助, 帮助, 有助于\\nvi. 帮助\\n[计] 自动内部诊断",["Don't forget to take the first-aid kit.","Doctor, please give this child first aid."],["别忘了带上急救箱。","医生，请给这孩子急救。"]],["advice","әd'vais","n. 忠告, 劝告, 意见, 报道, 通知\\n[经] 通知书, 通知, 建议",["Not knowing what to do, I asked the teacher for advice.","My uncle kept on drinking in spite of his doctor's advice."],["因为不知道做什么，所以我向老师寻求建议。","我叔叔不顧醫生勸阻，還是繼續喝酒。"]],["okay","әj'kei","a. 好, 可以, 行, 对, 好吗, 很好\\nadv. 好, 可以, 行, 对, 好吗, 很好\\nn. 同意, 签认, 批准, 认可\\n…",["\"Okay, okay,\" said the doctor. \"I'll definitely take a look at her.\"","I've written an article. Could you take a look and tell me if it's okay?"],["\"好的, 好的\" 醫生說。\"我一定檢查她。\"","我写了一篇文章，麻烦您看一下它行不行。"]],["organize","'ɒ:gәnaiz","vt. 组织, 有机化, 给予生机\\nvi. 组织起来",["I keep meaning to organize my desk.","He is in a wheelchair but he can organize his own day-to-day life."],["我一直想整理書桌。",""]],["empty","'empti","a. 空的, 空虚的, 空腹的, 空洞的\\nn. 空的东西, 空车\\nvt. 倒空, 使变空, 使排出\\nvi. 流空\\n[计] 空",["There are three empty rooms. However, we can't use any of them.","How many doughnuts can you eat on an empty stomach? Just one. After the first one your stomach isn't empty."],["虽然有三间空屋，但哪间都用不了。","空腹能吃幾個甜甜圈？只能吃一個。吃了第一個之後，肚子就不空了。"]],["regional","'ri:dʒәnәl","a. 地方的, 地域性的\\n[医] 区的, 部位的",["Drents is a group of variants of the Low Saxon regional language.","So-called regional specialities are things prized by out-of-towners but spurned by locals."],["德伦特方言是低地撒克逊地区的一个方言群。","所谓特产，就是外地人奉之为宝，本地人嗤之以鼻的东西。"]],["trail","treil","n. 踪迹, 痕迹, 一串, 尾部, 小径, 持枪姿势\\nvt. 拖, 尾随, 追踪, 落后于, 开出路\\nvi. 拖曳, 垂下, 落后,…",["The frustrated artist stomped on his failed painting, leaving a trail of shattered colors.","Hikers were warned to be careful because the trail was uneven underfoot and had tree roots growing on it."],["畫家失望地踐踏失敗之作，留下一片混亂的色彩。",""]],["novel","'nɒvl","n. 小说, 长篇故事\\na. 新奇的, 异常的",["This novel is more interesting than the one I read last week.","That was the most interesting novel that I had ever read."],["這本小說比我上週看的那本有意思。","这是我所读过的最有趣的小说。"]],["code","kәud","n. 代码, 密码, 法规, 法典\\nvt. 把...编码\\n[计] 代码",["You need to consider the consequences before making any modifications to existing code.","In this secret code, each number stands for a letter of the alphabet."],["对现有代码做出任何修改前，你需要考虑后果。","在这个密码里，每个数字取代了一个字母。"]],["somehow","'sʌmhau","adv. 不知何故",["I feel like somehow I've stopped thinking of translation as something enjoyable.","The plush fur of the toy felt so soft and somehow soothing."],["不知怎麼的，我覺得翻譯好像已經不再是一件樂事了。","那個玩具絨毛摸起來很柔軟，讓人感到舒適。"]],["jury","'dʒuәri","n. 陪审团, 评判委员会\\na. 应急的",["In the justice system of the United States, there are twelve people on a jury.","I was called in for jury this morning, and I actually have to serve on a case."],["",""]],["iraqi","i'rɑ:ki","n. 伊拉克人, 伊拉克阿拉伯语\\na. 伊拉克的, 伊拉克人的",["Polish Jews are more closely related to Iraqi Jews than to non-Jewish Poles.","I searched for Swedish rap, but found nothing other than Iraqi guys rapping in Swedish."],["",""]],["breast","brest","n. 胸部, 乳房, 胸怀\\nvt. 以胸对着, 面对",["Tom eats rice every day either with fish or with chicken breast.","He doesn't drink enough breast milk."],["湯姆每天吃飯要嘛配魚，要嘛配雞胸肉。","他母乳喝得不够。"]],["acknowledge","әk'nɒlidʒ","vt. 承认, 告知收悉, 答谢, 报偿\\n[经] 承认, 答谢, 收到的通知",["Acknowledge your own faults before criticizing others.","Superstitions derive from the inability of men to acknowledge that coincidences are merely coincidences."],["要批評別人時，先想想自己是否完美無缺。","迷信之所以存在，是因為人無法接受巧合只是巧合而已。"]],["theme","θi:m","n. 主题, 话题, 题目",["The principal theme of the book is the American Revolution.","In England, parks taking rare breeds of animals as their theme are becoming increasingly popular with people."],["这本书的主题是美国革命。","在英国，以珍稀物种为主题的公园变得越来越受人们的欢迎。"]],["storm","stɒ:m","n. 暴风雨, 骚动, 风波, 风暴, 猛攻\\nvi. 起风, 猛冲, 怒吼\\nvt. 猛攻",["You know the phrase, we reap what we sow. I have sown the wind and this is my storm.","We were compelled to stay at home on account of the storm."],["你也知道那句話，「善有善報，惡有惡報」。我搧的風，現在火就來了。","因為暴風雨的關係，所以我們必須待在家裡。"]],["union","'ju:njәn","n. 联盟, 联合, 结合, 工会\\n[化] 联合; 联管节; 活接头",["The union and the company have agreed upon a new contract.","Communism is the system practiced in the Soviet Union."],["工會和企業一致同意了一份新的合同。","共產主義是在蘇聯被實行的制度。"]],["desk","desk","n. 书桌, 办公桌, 工作台",["The vase on my desk overturned when I jumped up in surprise.","After some hesitation, he laid the book on the desk."],["我突然跳起来的时候把花瓶桌子上的打翻了。","犹豫了片刻之后，他把书放在了桌子上。"]],["thanks","","n. 感谢, 谢意, 谢忱\\ninterj. 谢谢, 谢谢你",["Thanks for having explained to me at last why people take me for an idiot.","Thanks to the favorable wind, we soon reached the island."],["感謝您終於爲我說明了爲甚麼人們通通把我當傻瓜。","多虧了順風，我們很快就到了那個小島。"]],["fruit","fru:t","n. 水果, 果类, 结果\\n[医] 果实, 种实",["Strictly speaking, the tomato is not a vegetable. It's a fruit.","I found a good place to buy fruit a couple of days ago."],["嚴格來說，蕃茄不是蔬菜，是水果。","前几天我发现了一个买水果的好地方。"]],["expensive","ik'spensiv","a. 贵的, 奢华的, 费用浩大的, 乱化钱的\\n[经] 高价的, 昂贵的, 浪费的",["Tim's motorbike is far more expensive than mine is.","If you think education is expensive, wait till you see what ignorance costs you."],["提姆的摩托車比我的貴多了。","如果你認為教育是昂貴的, 那麼你等著看無知讓你付出的代價。"]],["yellow","'jelәu","n. 黄色\\na. 黄色的",["At the end of April, the water of the Yellow River had darkened.","When Mike tried to tackle the other player, he pushed him and he was given a yellow card and a warning."],["四月底，黄河的水发黑了。","当迈克试图铲球的时候，他用手推了对方球员一把，结果得到了黄牌警告。"]],["conclusion","kәn'klu:ʒәn","n. 结论, 结尾, 推论\\n[法] 缔结, 结论, 推论",["I came to the conclusion that I had been deceived.","Tom came to the conclusion that no matter what he did, Mary wouldn't like it."],["我得到一個結論——我被騙了。","汤姆得出无论他做什么，玛丽都不会喜欢的结论。"]],["prime","praim","n. 最佳部分, 初期, 全盛期\\na. 主要的, 最初的, 根本的\\nv. 加油启动, 灌注, 填装",["It is rumoured that the Prime Minister will resign next month.","The sixth prime minister of Malaysia is Dato' Sri Najib Abdul Razak."],["据传总统下个月要辞职了。","马来西亚第六任首相是拿督斯利纳吉·阿都拉萨。"]],["shadow","'ʃædәu","n. 阴影, 荫, 影子, 影像, 阴暗, 幽灵, 少许, 隐蔽处, 庇护\\nvt. 遮蔽, 使朦胧, 预示, 尾随\\nvi. 渐变, 变…",["When the mind is pure, joy follows like a shadow that never leaves.","The shadow of the stick is visible."],["心靈純淨時，喜悅便如影隨形。","立竿见影。"]],["struggle","'strʌgl","n. 斗争, 努力, 奋斗\\nvi. 努力, 奋斗, 挣扎",["In a struggle of power, if you aren't with us, you're against us.","Tourists struggle for breath as they climb for two hours to reach the top of a mountain in the Peruvian Andes."],["在权利斗争中，非友即敌。","遊客攀登秘魯安地斯山脈的一座山峰，歷經兩個小時才到達山頂，他們氣喘吁吁。"]],["conclude","kәn'klu:d","vt. 结束, 作结论, 推断\\nvi. 结束, 推断",["As he has done a lot of bad things, we can conclude that he is a bad person.","After looking at the research, most of us conclude that vaccines are a good thing."],["因為他做了不少壞事，我們可以斷定他不是個好人。","看完研究以后，我们其中大部分人论定疫苗是件好事。"]],["dance","dæns. dɑ:ns","n. 跳舞, 舞蹈, 舞会\\nv. 跳舞",["While I'm at the dance, my mother will take care of the baby.","I am learning how to dance; I have class once a week."],["我去參加舞會，母親就幫忙照顧嬰兒。","我在學跳舞，每個星期一次課。"]],["analyst","'ænәlist","n. 分析者, 精神分析学家\\n[化] 分析员; 化验员",["He's a financial analyst with a pretty good reputation for his analysis of economic trends.","The Maryland-based product testing analyst says she always dreamed of finding the right person rather than her actual wedding day."],["",""]],["regulation",".regju'leiʃәn","n. 规则, 管理, 调整\\n[计] 调整; 规章; 规则; 调节",["From today on this regulation is history.","The government manages the country's petroleum resources through extensive regulation."],["從今天開始，這項規定成為了歷史。",""]],["being","'bi:iŋ","n. 存在, 性质, 生命, 人, 生物, be的现在分词",["Sometimes he has difficulty being articulate about his views.","Liberty consists of being able to make everything as harmless as possible."],["他有时候会难以清楚地表达他的意见。","自由旨在能够做所有不伤害其他人的事。"]],["ring","riŋ","n. 环, 环形物, 拳击场, 戒指, 角逐, 小集团, 铃声, 钟声, 声调\\nvt. 包围, 套住, 按铃, 敲钟\\nvi. 成环形,…",["Suddenly, he took out a ring, kneeled on the ground, and asked me to marry him.","I watched a ring of smoke that floated from his cigar into the air."],["突然，他拿出了一个戒指，跪在地上，向我求婚。","我看著一輪煙圈從他的雪茄裏冒出來，飄到了空氣中。"]],["largely","'lɑ:dʒli","adv. 大量地, 很多地, 大半地",["The taste of wine is largely dependent upon the weather.","The audience was largely made up of very young children."],["葡萄酒的味道很受天氣影響。","大部分观众是年幼的儿童。"]],["shift","ʃift","n. 变化, 移动, 轮班, 手段, 应急办法, 移位\\nvt. 替换, 转移, 改变, 推卸, 变速\\nvi. 转换, 移动, 转变, …",["Freddy's been working the graveyard shift the past month, so he hasn't been able to see any of his friends who work normal hours.","When I speak to a Westerner, I have to shift mental gears, so to speak."],["",""]],["revenue","'revinju:","n. 收入, 岁入, 税收, 税务局\\n[经] 岁入, 税收, 税务局",["Many websites are supported by revenue from advertising.","He argues that the administration must look for alternative sources of revenue."],["許多網站都是靠廣告收入來維持的。",""]],["locate","'lәukeit","vt. 找出, 设于, 位于\\nvi. 定居",["The bats use ultrasound to locate obstacles.","Bats use ultrasound to locate obstacles."],["蝙蝠使用超音波來定位障礙物。","蝙蝠使用超音波來定位障礙物。"]],["mark","mɑ:k","n. 标志, 分数, 马克, 痕迹, 斑点, 靶子, 刻度, 记号, 符号, 戳记, 标准, 起跑线\\nvt. 做标记于, 留意, 打分数…",["The manager shouted out to his players to mark the opposition.","The large crowd roared in approval as Mark Knopfler played the first few bars of \"Money for Nothing\"."],["教练对自己的球员大喊，让他盯守对方球员。","就像马克·诺弗勒早期演唱的歌曲《金钱无用》一样，绝大多数的人依然高呼赞成“金钱无用论”。"]],["appearance","ә'piәrәns","n. 出现, 露面, 外观, 外表, 出版\\n[计] 外观, 版面",["Judging from his appearance, he must be a rich man.","The two brothers are quite unlike in their appearance."],["从他的外表来看，他应该是个有钱人。","哥哥和弟弟的樣子一點也不像。"]],["package","'pækidʒ","n. 包裹, 套装软件, 包, 包装用物, 程序包\\nvt. 包装, 打包\\na. 一揽子的\\n[计] 包, 软件包, 包装",["He's at the post office sending a package to a friend.","She tied up the package with string."],["他在邮局给朋友寄包裹。","她用繩子把包裹緊緊綁好了。"]],["difficulty","'difikәlti","n. 困难, 难点",["Sometimes he has difficulty being articulate about his views.","I think you'll have very little difficulty in getting a driver's license."],["他有时候会难以清楚地表达他的意见。","我想您要拿到驾照根本不难。"]],["bridge","bridʒ","n. 桥, 舰桥, 桥梁, 桥牌\\nvt. 架桥于, 跨越\\n[计] 桥, 网桥, 桥接器",["We enjoyed watching the fireworks on a bridge last summer.","The people of London are very proud of this bridge."],["去年夏天，我们在桥上看焰火看得很过瘾。","倫敦人對這座橋感到非常自豪。"]],["recommend",".rekә'mend","vt. 推荐, 介绍, 劝告, 使受欢迎, 托付\\n[经] 建议, 推荐",["I'll recommend him as chairman, whether you are in favour of it or not.","I don't recommend eating in that restaurant. The food is awful."],["你贊成也好，不贊成也好，我也會推薦他當主席的。","我不推荐在那家餐馆吃饭。食物糟糕透了。"]],["obvious","'ɒbviәs","a. 明显的, 明白的, 显然的, 平淡无奇的",["Most scientific breakthroughs are nothing else than the discovery of the obvious.","It's obvious that I spend too much time studying Chinese characters, so I ought to study other aspects of the language more."],["多數科學突破只不過是發現了顯而易見的事。","可想而知我在学汉字上花太多时间，所以我应该更好地练习语言的其他方面。"]],["basically","'beisikli","adv. 基本上, 主要地",["From what I understand, those who watch Korean soap operas basically are women with nothing to do.","Sometimes I find that I basically have no time to pay attention to irrelevant trivia."],["我了解的情况是看韩剧者基本上是一些无所事事的女人。","有时候发现自己基本上没有时间顾及一些无关紧要的琐事。"]],["generate","'dʒenәreit","vt. 产生, 发生, 导致\\n[电] 产生",["An electric current can generate magnetism.","Humans generate more than 1 million tons of hazardous waste every day."],["電流可以產生磁性。",""]],["anymore","'eni'mɔ:","adv. 再也不, 不再",["It would be better for both of us not to see each other anymore.","I've got a toothache. I just can't bear this pain anymore."],["我們還是不要再見面了。","牙疼。我无法忍受这种疼痛。"]],["propose","prә'pәuz","vt. 计划, 打算, 建议, 提议, 求(婚)\\nvi. 打算, 求婚",["The young man decided to propose to her.","Propose to me conditions that are better than the ones I have now, and I'll work with you."],["少年決定要向她求婚。",""]],["thinking","'θiŋkiŋ","n. 思考, 思想\\na. 思考的, 有理性的",["Put on your thinking cap and try to remember whose house you slept at last night.","I cannot help thinking that my son is still alive."],["好好的想一想，看看能不能想起你昨晚是在誰家過夜的。","我不禁想我的儿子一直都在生。"]],["possibly","'pɒsәbli","adv. 可能, 也许",["I could not possibly finish the work in a few days.","Possibly because he's got a beard, he looks scary at first glance but he's really a kind man."],["讓我在幾天內完成這些活實在不可能。","或许是因为他有胡子而让他乍看之下很可怕，其实他是个非常好的人。"]],["trend","trend","n. 趋势, 倾向, 走向\\nvi. 倾向, 转向\\n[计] 趋势",["A new art trend in New York City takes the age-old craft of crocheting to the streets, where traditionally walls and fences have been serving as canvases for graffiti artists.","The question here is one of creating the framework with which we can outline the social trend."],["紐約市出現了一種新的藝術潮流，將古老的鉤編工藝帶到了街頭。在那裡，傳統上，牆壁和柵欄一直是塗鴉藝術家的畫布。",""]],["visitor","'vizitә","n. 参观者, 游客, 访客\\n[法] 视察人, 检视人, 检查员",["She's a frequent visitor to this country.","When the visitor entered the room, we stood to greet him."],["她经常来这个国家。",""]],["loan","lәun","n. 贷款, 借出\\nv. 借, 供应货款, 借给",["English has many loan words from French.","I told Tom I'd be willing to loan him some money."],["英语有很多法语外来词。","我告诉汤姆我愿意借给他一些钱。"]],["currently","'kʌrәntli","adv. 现在, 当前, 一般, 普通\\n[计] 当前",["Burj Khalifa is currently the tallest skyscraper in the world.","We have come to the conclusion that this plan is not feasible currently."],["目前哈里發塔是世界上最高的摩天大樓。","我们得出结论，这个计划目前是不可行的。"]],["comfortable","'kʌmfәtәbl","a. 舒服的, 轻松的\\nn. 盖被",["Modern technology has made our lives more comfortable.","Each day our life becomes more comfortable and more automated."],["现代科学技术让我们的生活更加舒适。","我们的生活日益变得更舒适更自动化。"]],["investor","in'vestә","n. 投资者\\n[经] 投资者",["The investor stole the capital of his client.","She is not the founder, she's the investor."],["投资者把他客户的资金窃取了.","她不是創辦人，她是投資人。"]],["profit","'prɒfit","n. 利润, 赢利, 利益\\nvi. 有益, 获利, 赚钱\\nvt. 有益于",["He is making use of the collective's name for his own profit.","Peter was an altruistic video game player; he would give items to people who needed them, rather than selling them for personal profit."],["他在利用集體的名義，為自己謀利。","彼得是一个利他主义的游戏玩家，他会把东西给需要的人，而不是为一己之私利出售。"]],["angry","'æŋgri","a. 生气的, 愤怒的",["When angry, count ten; when very angry, a hundred.","Bob seldom talks with Maria without making her angry."],["生氣的時候，由一數到十；若氣得不得了，就數到一百。","鮑伯和瑪麗亞說話時很少不惹她生氣。"]],["crew","kru:","n. 全体人员, 一群人, 全体队员\\ncrow的过去式",["Captains have responsibility for ship and crew.","Modern ships only need a small crew."],["船長們對他們的船隻和船員負有責任。","現代船隻只需要一小組的船員。"]],["accident","'æksidәnt","n. 意外事件, 机遇, 事故, 次要方面\\n[化] 意外事故; 事故",["A couple of flights were delayed on account of a minor accident.","The accident was brought about by his carelessness."],["因為一些小事故，兩、三班機被延遲了。","因為他不小心，所以才會發生意外。"]],["meal","mi:l","n. 一餐, 膳食, 粗粉\\nvi. 进餐",["We very much enjoyed the meal we had at her home last Sunday.","Admittedly, it wasn't the best meal I've ever eaten."],["我们上个星期天在她家吃得非常开心。","不可否认，那并不是我吃过最好的一顿饭。"]],["hearing","'hiәriŋ","n. 听, 听觉, 听讯\\n[医] 听, 听觉",["I look forward to hearing your thoughts on this matter.","The hearing acuity of dogs is superior by far to that of humans."],["我期待听到你在这件事上的想法 。","狗的聽覺比人類靈敏不知多少倍。"]],["traffic","'træfik","n. 交通, 通行, 运输, 交通量, 贸易, 交易, 交往, 通信量\\nvi. 交易, 做买卖\\nvt. 用...作交换\\n[计] 通信…",["If you leave now, I'm sure you'll be caught in a traffic jam.","Only one little boy survived the traffic accident."],["你現在出門的話，肯定會堵車的。","这次交通事故中只有一个小男孩幸存了下来。"]],["muscle","'mʌsl","n. 肌肉, 臂力\\n[医] 肌",["Courage is very important. Like a muscle, it is strengthened by use.","Hence 50 percent of the muscle can give way to fat."],["勇气是非常重要的。比如肌肉，经常使用才得以加强。",""]],["notion","'nәuʃәn","n. 概念, 观念, 想法, 打算, 别致的小东西\\n[经] 概念, 打算, 想法",["In this paper I would like to examine the notion of \"dyad style\" and its influence on fine arts.","In the same way as Hegel, Panovsky's notion of the dialectic makes history follow a predetermined course."],["",""]],["capture","'kæptʃә","n. 抓取, 战利品, 捕获之物\\nvt. 抓取, 获得, 迷住\\n[计] 截获命令",["To be honest, we came to capture you.","They would capture as many people as possible."],["老实说，我们是来抓你们的。","他們會盡可能地抓更多的人。"]],["prefer","pri'fә:","vt. 宁可, 较喜欢, 提出\\n[法] 给予优先权, 优先偿还, 提出",["I prefer to look for a solution to problems, not only to report them.","Fifty-two per cent of British women prefer chocolate to sex."],["我更喜欢寻求问题的解决方法，而不仅仅是揭露它们。","有百分之五十二的英國女性喜歡巧克力勝於性。"]],["chest","tʃest","n. 胸, 胸部, 衣柜, 箱子\\n[医] 胸, 胸廓",["When I was a teenager I had lots of hair on my head and none on my chest. Now it's just the opposite.","Tom had a pain in his chest, so he went to the hospital."],["当我还是年轻人的时候，我脑袋上有很多头发，胸上无毛。现在，恰恰相反。","汤姆胸痛，所以去了医院。"]],["japanese",".dʒæpә'ni:z","n. 日本人, 日语\\na. 日本的, 日语的",["Don't translate English into Japanese word for word.","Ted was finally able to communicate his thoughts in Japanese."],["不要逐字逐句的把英文翻譯成日文。","Ted最终能用日语交流他的想法了。"]],["truly","'tru:li","adv. 真实地, 不假",["No money, no job, no friends. He was truly at loose ends.","But above all, I will never forget who this victory truly belongs to. It belongs to you. It belongs to you."],["没钱，没工作，没朋友，他真是无所适从。","但最重要的是，我永远不会忘记这场胜利真正属于谁，它属于你们，它属于你们。"]],["thick","θik","a. 厚的, 粗壮的, 浓的, 迟钝的, 浑浊的, 多雾的, 过分的, 口齿不清的\\nadv. 厚地, 密地, 浓浓地\\nn. 最浓处, …",["Kobayashi's eyebrows are thick, his eyes are big, and his eyelashes are long.","Due to the thick fog, the road was difficult to see."],["小林的眉毛长得浓，眼睛又大，睫毛很长。","因为大雾所以看不清道路。"]],["cash","kæʃ","n. 现金\\nvt. 兑现",["Could you lend me some money? I'm short of cash at the moment.","Older couples often appreciate cash more than gifts because they neither need nor have room for them."],["可以借點錢給我嗎？我現在有點缺錢。","年紀大的夫妻往往喜歡禮金勝於禮物, 因為他們既不需要禮物也沒有空間放禮物。"]],["museum","mju:'ziәm","n. 博物馆",["There was a sprinkling of foreigners among the visitors in the museum.","The writer's furniture is all shown in this museum."],["博物馆的参观者中有少数是外国人。","那位作家用過的傢俱全都存放在這間博物館裏。"]],["beauty","'bju:ti","n. 美, 美人",["Maybe I shouldn't tell you this, but I am truly mesmerized by your beauty.","I'm not a poet; I couldn't write a single line to depict its beauty."],["我或許不應該告訴你，但我真的被你的美麗迷倒了。","我不是诗人，无法用一行文字描绘它的美丽。"]],["emergency","i'mә:dʒәnsi","n. 紧急状况, 紧急事件, 紧急需要\\n[化] 紧急情况",["In case of an emergency, get in touch with my agent right away.","In an emergency, use the stairway, not the elevator."],["如遇情况紧急，请立即联系我的代理。","事故發生時，敬勿使用電梯，請使用樓梯。"]],["unique","ju:'ni:k","a. 独一无二的, 独特的, 稀罕的",["The weather here has its own unique characteristics.","A qipao in the traditional style is made entirely by hand and requires labour-intensive manual tailoring techniques to enhance and exhibit every unique female form."],["这里的天气有独一无二的特点。","一件传统式样的旗袍是完全手工制作的，也需要劳动密集的裁缝业技术，为了增加而显示每种独一无二的女性体态。"]],["internal","in'tә:nәl","a. 内在的, 国内的\\n[医] 内的, 内部的",["The button battery in the PC's internal timer has gone flat.","He has a good knowledge of the internal affairs of Japan."],["電腦內部計時器內的紐扣電池沒電了。",""]],["ethnic","'eθnik","a. 人种的, 种族的\\n[医] 人种的",["Hanfu is the traditional clothing used by the ethnic Han of China, before the Qing dynasty.","There are 56 ethnic groups in China."],["漢服是中國漢族于清以前的傳統服飾。","中国有56个民族。"]],["link","liŋk","n. 环, 连结物, 链接, 火把\\nvt. 连结, 联合, 挽住\\nvi. 连接起来\\n[计] 连接, 链路",["If you want to read this page later, just know that you can access it from the \"Help\" link at the very bottom of the website.","Trams will link the area to Edinburgh's city centre (which is only two miles away)."],["如果你之後想要讀這個網頁，記得可以從這個網站最底下的「幫助」連結進入到這個網頁。","电车会把这个地区连接于爱丁堡的城市中心（离那里只有两英里）。"]],["stress","stres","n. 压力, 紧迫, 强调, 重音, 重点, 应力\\nvt. 加压力于, 着重, 重读",["When you're about to have exams, lifting weights really does relieve stress, and it's also good for your mind and body.","They say stress causes high blood pressure."],["快要考试的时候，举重真的消愁解闷，再说对身体和精神都很好。","他们说压力导致高血压。"]],["content","kәn'tent","n. 内容, 满足, 意义, 要旨\\na. 满足的, 满意的\\nvt. 使...满足, 使...安心\\n[计] 内容",["Chocolate's iron content is higher than spinach's.","Concerning the content below, I want to verify two things."],["巧克力含有比菠菜更多的鐵質。","关于下面的内容，我想确认两件事情。"]],["select","si'lekt","a. 挑选出来的, 极好的\\nv. 选择, 挑选\\nn. 被挑选者, 精萃\\n[计] 选定",["Please select a language for the Image Viewer interface.","Take not God's name in vain; select a time when it will have effect."],["请为Image Viewer的界面选择语言。",""]],["root","ru:t","n. 根, 根本, 根源, 基础, 底部\\nvt. 使扎根, 使固定, 根除, 肃清, 搜出, 用鼻拱\\nvi. 生根, 固定, 源于, …",["Mangroves absorb more carbon dioxide than any other trees on Earth because they have large underground root structures.","Root beer is considered a classic American carbonated soft drink."],["红树林吸取二氧化碳比地球上其他树木都要多，因为它们具有很大的地下根部结构。","麥根沙士被視為一種經典的美式碳酸飲品。"]],["nose","nәuz","n. 鼻子, 突出部分, 嗅觉\\nvt. 嗅到, 探出, 用鼻子触\\nvi. 闻, 嗅, 探听, 告密",["It's best if you don't poke your nose into other people's business.","If her nose were a little shorter, she would be quite pretty."],["你最好不要插手别人的事务。","若她的姿態能再低一點就更完美了。"]],["declare","di'klєә","v. 宣布, 声明, 申报, 断言",["I hereby declare the opening of the Olympic Games.","I advised the shy young man to declare his love for the beautiful girl."],["",""]],["appreciate","ә'pri:ʃieit","vt. 赏识, 鉴别, 为...而感激, 领会, 欣赏\\nvi. 增值, 涨价",["Older couples often appreciate cash more than gifts because they neither need nor have room for them.","Appreciate the little things in life - they will bring you to a bigger end target."],["年紀大的夫妻往往喜歡禮金勝於禮物, 因為他們既不需要禮物也沒有空間放禮物。","欣賞生活中的小事，它們的總合很是宏大。"]],["actual","'æktʃuәl","a. 真实的, 实际的, 现行的\\n[医] 实际死亡率",["To date nobody knows the actual size of the cosmos.","The \"anti-woke\" propaganda being imported into your country's media comes straight from actual fascists."],["宇宙的實際大小至今無人知道。","你們國家媒體中輸入的「反覺醒」宣傳，是直接來自真正的法西斯的。"]],["bottle","'bɒtl","n. 瓶子, 酒瓶\\nvt. 装瓶, 抑制, 围困",["There is milk all over the kitchen floor because my wife broke the bottle.","This bottle is able to contain two liters of hot water."],["我老婆把瓶子打破了，把廚房弄得滿地都是牛奶。","这个瓶子可以装两升热水。"]],["hardly","'hɑ:dli","adv. 刚刚, 几乎不, 勉强是",["I could hardly follow what Jane said in her speech.","I've been so busy this past week that I've hardly had time to relax."],["我幾乎完全跟不上 Jane 的演講內容。","我上個星期忙得一點休息的時間也沒有。"]],["setting","'setiŋ","n. 环境, 背景, 布景, 镶嵌, 调整, 沉落, 一副餐具\\n[计] 设置",["The promotion of a piece to a king is indicated by setting on it another piece of the same color.","I was looking at the sun setting in the sea in the west."],["在一顆棋子上放置另一顆相同顏色的棋子，可以表示這顆棋子晉升為王。",""]],["launch","lɒ:ntʃ","n. 下水, 汽艇, 发射\\nvt. 使下水, 发射, 发动\\nvi. 起飞, 下水, 投入, 开始",["The launch was successful. We're now leaving the solar system.","They are going to launch an artificial satellite tomorrow."],["發射成功。我們正在離開太陽系。","明天將要發射一顆人造衛星。"]],["file","fail","n. 档案, 公文箱, 文件夹, 文件, 卷宗, 锉刀\\nvi. 列队行进, 用锉刀做\\nvt. 归档, 申请, 锉, 琢磨\\n[计] 文件",["When I try to listen to music with media player there's an error and I can't play the file.","Correct the mistake and return the file to Mr Luxemburg."],["我想用媒體播放器聽音樂，卻出現了錯誤訊息，不能播放。","請把錯誤改正過來，然後把文件夾還給 Luxemburg 先生。"]],["sick","sik","n. 病人\\na. 不舒服, 有病的, 恶心的, 厌恶的, 渴望的, 病态的\\nvt. 呕吐, 追击, 使(狗)去攻击",["If a sick person folds one thousand paper cranes, her wish will come true.","Because my mother is sick, my father will cook today."],["如果一個病人折一千隻紙鶴, 她的願望就會成真。","母親病了，所以今天由父親下廚。"]],["outcome","'autkʌm","n. 结果, 出口",["The outcome of the test shows that the system has already fulfilled all design requirements.","No one could predict the outcome of this cooperation."],["测试的结果显示，系统已经满足了所有设计要求。","没人能够预言这次合作的结果。"]],["ad","æd","n. 广告\\n[计] 地址, 模拟-数字",["The classified ad wanted female singers to form an a cappella group.","People who resort to ad hominem arguments are all a bunch of backwoods jackasses."],["這則分類廣告招募女歌手組成無伴奏合唱團。",""]],["defend","di'fend","vt. 防护, 辩护, 防卫\\n[法] 作...的辩护律师, 辩护, 为...答辩",["That was the only way we could defend ourselves against all this terrible shooting.","We need to defend Taiwan's sovereignty."],["那是我们在枪林弹雨中自保的唯一方法。","我們需要保衛台灣的主權。"]],["duty","'dju:ti","n. 责任, 关税, 职务, 尊敬\\n[化] 职责",["It is the duty of every patriot to protect his country from its government.","I believe that it's my duty to protect these children."],["爱国者的责任就是保护国家不受政府侵犯。","我認為我有義務保護這些孩子。"]],["sheet","ʃi:t","n. 床单, 张, 纸张, 印刷品, 裹尸布, 薄片\\nvt. 盖上被单, 遍布\\nvi. 大片落下\\na. 片状的, 成薄片的\\n[计]…",["The sea is deep blue, and from afar it looks like a vast sheet of silk spread out.","Sami was writing on that sheet of paper."],["海水藍藍的，遠遠看去像一大片絲綢鋪開。","莎米在那張紙上寫字。"]],["ensure","in'ʃuә","vt. 确定, 保证, 担保, 保护\\n[经] 确保, 确定",["Parents often sacrifice themselves to ensure that their children receive a good education.","When watching TV, please ensure that the room is brightly lit and watch from a distance."],["父母為了確保孩子受到良好的教育常常犧牲自己。","看电视的时候请确保屋子够亮，观看时保持距离。"]],["ought","ɒ:t","aux. 应该, 大概\\nn. 责任",["You look tired. You ought to rest for an hour or two.","There ought to be more buses during the rush hours."],["你看起來很累。你應該休息一兩個小時。","交通高峰期该有更多公交车。"]],["extremely","ik'stri:mli","adv. 极端地, 非常地",["I'm extremely embarrassed that it has taken so long to reply.","Declarations of variables are extremely important in C and C++."],["我過了這麼久才回信，真的十分不好意思。","变量的声明在C和C++中极其重要。"]],["catholic","'kæθәlik","n. 天主教徒\\na. 天主教的, 普遍的, 广泛的, 宽宏大量的",["Even people who don't believe in the Catholic church venerate the Pope as a symbolic leader.","The Catholic Church doesn't condone the use of condoms."],["甚至是不相信天主教的人也把教皇敬为一个象征性的领导者。","天主教廷不同意避孕套的使用。"]],["extent","ik'stent","n. 范围, 程度, 区域\\n[计] 范围",["A good book can completely absorb your attention, to the extent that you forget your surroundings and even your existence.","We could see the full extent of the park from the hotel."],["一本好书会令你全神贯注，甚至忘掉周围和自己。","我們從酒店裏可以把整個公園看得清清楚楚。"]],["mix","miks","n. 混合物, 混乱, 糊涂\\nvt. 使混合, 弄混, 使结合, 混淆\\nvi. 相混合, 交往, 参与",["Don't mix up the Americas with the United States of America, or citizens of the Americas with citizens of the United States.","If you mix blue and red, you'll get purple."],["别混淆美洲和美国，美洲人和美国人。","如果將藍色和紅色混合，就會得到紫色。"]],["component","kәm'pәunәnt","n. 元件, 组件, 成分\\na. 组成的, 构成的\\n[计] 组件",["Many companies have attempted to manufacture this complex component at scale, but so far only ours has succeeded.","The clan system is a key component of traditional Chinese culture."],["許多公司都嘗試過大規模生產這種複雜的零件，但目前只有我們成功了。","宗族制度是中国传统文化的重要组成部分。"]],["slow","slәu","a. 慢的, 缓慢的, 迟缓的, 迟钝的, 冷漠的, 落后的\\nadv. 慢地, 迟缓地\\nv. (使)慢下来",["When you are driving, you should slow down on corners.","As this is a cascade with multiple layers, it shouldn't be surprising that it's slow."],["当您开车的时候，应该在转弯处减速。","因为这是一个有好几层的瀑布，所以速度慢也不会让人惊讶。"]],["contrast","kәn'træst","n. 差别, 对比, 对照物\\nvt. 使对比\\nvi. 成对照\\n[计] 反差; 对比度",["There is a stark contrast between China's order and the chaos of the West.","The picture is colorful in contrast with this one."],["中国之治与西方之乱形成了鲜明的对比。","和這幅比起上來，那幅畫的色彩鮮艷多了。"]],["zone","zәun","n. 地带, 带, 地区\\nvt. 环绕, 使分成地带\\nvi. 分成区\\n[计] 卡片顶部的三行区; 区; 区域",["You need to get out of your comfort zone.","Tom advised Mary not to drive too fast in a school zone."],["你需要离开你的舒适区。",""]],["wake","weik","vt. 叫醒, 激发\\nvi. 醒来, 醒着, 觉醒, 活跃起来\\nn. 守侯, 守夜, 尾迹, 痕迹",["Yesterday the alarm clock didn't go off and Kurt didn't wake up.","Jim entered the room quietly so he wouldn't wake the baby."],["昨天闹钟没响，Kurt也就没醒过来。","吉姆悄悄地走進房間，這樣他就不會吵醒寶寶。"]],["airport","'єәpɒ:t","n. 飞机场\\n[机] 航空站, 机场",["I was searched by the customs officers at the airport.","My parents have gone to the airport to see my uncle off."],["我在機場被海關人員搜查。","我父母去机场送我叔叔了。"]],["ourselves",".auә'selvz","pron. 我们自己",["Nature never deceives us; it is always we who deceive ourselves.","One of the reasons that we love nature is that, unlike ourselves, nature is not envious or deceitful."],["自然从不会欺骗我们，骗我们的永远是我们自己。","我们之所以爱自然——其原由之一，至少是由于它不像我们人那样既嫉妒又欺骗。"]],["brown","braun","n. 褐色\\na. 褐色的\\nv. (使)变褐色",["The quick brown fox jumped over the lazy brown dog.","The quick brown fox did not jump over the lazy dog."],["身手矯健的棕狐狸躍過懶洋洋的棕狗。","身手矯健的棕狐狸沒有躍過懶洋洋的狗。"]],["shirt","ʃә:t","n. 衬衫, 内衣, 汗衫",["I would like to exchange this shirt that I bought yesterday.","I'd like to exchange this shirt I bought yesterday."],["我想去換我昨天買的這件襯衫。","我想去換我昨天買的這件襯衫。"]],["pilot","'pailәt","n. 飞行员, 领航员, 航船者, 导向器, 驾驶仪, 向导, 领导人\\nvt. 领航, 驾驶, 引导, 试用\\na. 引导的, 控制的,…",["Mrs. Bruce was the first female pilot to fly between England and Japan.","The future pilot is trained in a mock cockpit."],["布魯斯夫人是英國和日本之間航線的第一位女性飛行員。","未来飞行员会在虚拟驾驶舱里训练。"]],["warn","wɒ:n","vt. 警告, 提醒, 通知\\nvi. 发出警告",["I tried to warn him about her, but he won't listen to me.","Before turning, put on your blinkers to warn other drivers."],["我警告过他关于她的事，但他不听。","转弯时请打转向灯来提醒其他司机。"]],["ultimately","'ʌltimәtli","adv. 最后, 最终\\n[法] 最后, 终究, 总之",["Her line of reasoning is attractive, but ultimately fallacious.","Ultimately, space flight will be beneficial to all mankind."],["她说理的主线引人注目，但从根本上是靠不住的。",""]],["cat","kæt","n. 猫, 恶妇\\nvi. 呕吐\\n计算机辅助教育, 计算机辅助测试, 计算机辅助翻译, 计算机辅助排版\\n[计] 计算机辅助教学, 计算…",["I have a cat and a dog. The cat is black and the dog is white.","Better be the head of a cat than the tail of a lion."],["我養了一隻貓和一隻狗。貓是黑色的，狗是白色的。","寧為貓頭不為獅尾。"]],["contribution",".kɒntri'bju:ʃәn","n. 捐助, 捐助之物, 贡献\\n[经] 贡献, 捐款, 补助品",["Your contribution to the school is tax-deductible.","The member of the Diet brought in a bill on political contribution, but it didn't pass."],["",""]],["capacity","kә'pæsiti","n. 容量, 能力, 才能, 资格\\n[计] 容量",["Man has a great capacity to adapt to environmental changes.","The cells have the capacity to convert food into energy."],["人類適應環境變化的能力很強。","細胞具有將食物轉化為能量的能力。"]],["estate","i'steit","n. 不动产, (人生的)阶段, 阶层, 财产\\n[经] 房地产, 遗产, 财产",["Apart from earning money, I have no interest in real estate.","Two senior officials are suspected of accepting bribes from real estate companies."],["",""]],["guide","gaid","n. 引导者, 导游, 指南, 路标\\nvt. 指导, 支配, 管理, 带领, 操纵\\nvi. 任向导\\n[计] 辅助线",["Crossing guards are posted during school hours to guide children safely across busy streets.","They set out with a guide just in case they lost their way."],["在学校上课期间会设置过马路警察以引导小孩安全地穿过繁忙的街道。","他们和一个导游一起出发，只是为了以防迷路。"]],["circumstance","'sә:kәmstәns","n. 环境, 状况, 事件",["The new community center was inaugurated yesterday with pomp and circumstance.","He knows full well that she'll never leave him, no matter the circumstance."],["新的社区中心在昨天隆重落成。",""]],["snow","snәu","n. 雪, 积雪, 下雪, 雪花形干扰\\nvi. 下雪, 似雪般落下\\nvt. 使雪白, 用雪覆盖, 使像雪般落下",["The whole place was simply blotted out with the snow.","The accident seemed to have something to do with the heavy snow."],["整個地方完全地被雪遮蓋住了。","事故似乎和厚厚的积雪有关。"]],["english","'iŋgliʃ","n. 英语\\na. 英文的, 英国人的",["I would often take part in an English speech contest in my school days.","It took me more than two hours to translate a few pages of English."],["当年我在学校的时候经常参加英语演讲比赛。","翻译几页英文花了我2个多小时。"]],["politician",".pɒli'tiʃәn","n. 政客, 政治家, 从事党派政治的人\\n[法] 政客, 政治家",["The politician pushed for reform by denouncing the corruption of the government officials.","The politician didn't appear in public after the incident."],["政治家以揭露政府官员的腐败来推动改革。","發生了那件事以後，那位政治家一直沒有公開露面。"]],["steal","sti:l","vt. 剽窃；偷偷地做；偷窃；vi. 窃取；偷偷地行动；[棒球]偷垒；n. [口]偷窃；便宜货；偷垒；[篮球]断球",["Matthew's dog, Rocky, loves to steal cupcakes off the kitchen counter.","Every night, when all was quiet, he would steal into his neighbour's garden to scrump an apple."],["马修的狗洛基喜欢从厨房台面上偷纸杯蛋糕。","每天晚上，当周围安静下来，他就会偷溜进邻居的花园里偷走一颗苹果。"]],["pursue","pә'sju:","vt. 追赶, 追踪, 追随, 追求, 实行, 继续, 从事\\nvi. 追赶, 继续",["She especially likes to pursue questions till the very end.","The police will pursue her for a long time."],["她呢就是喜欢打破沙锅问到底。","警察会追捕她很长时间。"]],["slip","slip","n. 滑, 滑行, 事故, 溜, 差错, 滑台, 下降, 插条, 后裔, 板条, 瘦长的年轻人\\nvi. 滑动, 滑倒, 失足, 溜走, …",["A slip of the tongue is sometimes fatal to a politician.","In the winter, many older people slip on ice and fall down."],["有时候口误对政治家来说是致命的。","冬天有很多老人在冰上滑倒。"]],["percentage","pә'sentidʒ","n. 百分比, 比率, 部分, 可能性\\n[计] 百分比",["What percentage of all taxi drivers make unscrupulous detours, do you think?","The high percentage of oxygen makes humans feel energized and alive."],["你觉得绕路的司机占所有的出租车司机的百分之多少？",""]],["meat","mi:t","n. 肉, 餐, 食物\\n[经] 肉类",["The kitchen knife wasn't sharp enough to cut the meat, so I used my pocket knife.","I saw a dog. The dog held a piece of meat in its mouth."],["这把菜刀不够锋利，所以我用了我的折叠刀来切肉。","我看到了一条狗。狗嘴里叼着一块肉。"]],["funny","'fʌni","a. 好笑的, 有趣的, 滑稽的\\nn. 滑稽人物",["It was a pleasure to spend the evening with a smart, funny and beautiful girl like you.","Coming face to face with a dinosaur was a funny experience."],["和你這樣又聰明、又幽默、又漂亮的女孩共渡一晚，實在是一件賞心樂事。","和一只恐龙面对面是一段有趣的经历。"]],["neither","'naiðә","adv. 皆不, 两个都不\\na. (两者)都不的\\npron. 两者都不\\nconj. 既非, 既不",["He speaks only English and German, neither of which I understand.","She is neither in the kitchen nor in the living room."],["他只會說英語和德語，這兩種語言我都不懂。","她不在廚房裏，也不在客廳裏。"]],["soil","sɒil","n. 土壤, 土地, 国家, 国土, 温床, 污物, 粪便, 水池\\nvt. 弄脏, 污辱\\nvi. 变脏",["It is still raining a lot today, and the soil is being broken up.","The crash was and remains to date the deadliest airplane accident on Canadian soil."],["今天下这么大的雨，土松着呢。","這起空難是迄今為止加拿大境內最嚴重的空難。"]],["surgery","'sә:dʒәri","n. 外科, 手术, 手术室, 换球术",["I developed a tumor in my stomach, which required surgery.","Cosmetic surgery is not covered by most insurance plans."],["我得了胃腫瘤，必須動手術切除。","大部份的保險計劃不包含整容手術。"]],["aids","eidz","n. 爱滋病(获得性免疫缺陷综合征)\\n[计] 高级综合数据系统, 先进交互调试系统, 自动图解文档编制系统\\n美国决策学学会, 信息自动…",["I hope that some scientist will soon discover a cure for AIDS.","Scientists are working hard to put an end to AIDS."],["真希望科学家们能早点找到艾滋病的治疗方法。","科学家们正努力终结艾滋病。"]],["correct","kә'rekt","a. 正确的, 合适的\\nvt. 改正, 订正",["This course will help you master correct pronunciation.","You should have Mr Green correct your English pronunciation."],["這個課程能幫助你掌握正確發音。","你應該請 Green 先生幫你糾正英文發音。"]],["jew","dʒu:","n. 犹太人, 守财奴, 犹太教信徒\\nvt. 欺骗, 杀价",["Then an argument developed between some of John's disciples and a certain Jew about purification.","You're just afraid of Buddhism. That reason is why you call me a \"Jew.\" It's from fear."],["",""]],["jewish","'dʒu:iʃ","a. 犹太人的, 犹太族的",["There are more intersex people in the world than there are Jewish people.","When it was almost time for the Jewish Passover, Jesus went up to Jerusalem."],["世界上陰陽人比猶太人數量還多。",""]],["due","dju:","n. 应得的东西, 应付款\\na. 到期的, 应得的, 应付的, 约定的",["Due to a number of unfortunate causes, one-parent families are on the increase.","I am very sorry that I have to ask you to change the meeting date to March 6 due to personal reasons."],["由于诸多不幸因素，单亲家庭的数量在增长中。","真的很對不起，因為一些私人的理由，我想請你把見面日期改為三月六日。"]],["blame","bleim","n. 过失, 责备\\nvt. 责备, 归咎于",["To err is human. To blame someone else for your mistakes is even more human.","It wasn't just that she didn't blame him - she actually praised the guy."],["是人都會犯錯。為你自己的錯誤指責別人，更是人類會做的事。","她不仅没责怪他，反而称赞他。"]],["estimate","'estimeit","n. 估计, 判断\\nvt. 估计, 评价, 判断\\nvi. 估计",["At a rough estimate, I would say the job will take two weeks.","Try to estimate how much you spent on books."],["我想這工作粗略估計得花上兩個星期的時間。","算一算你花了多少錢買書。"]],["basketball","'bɑ:skitbɒ:l","n. 篮球",["Tom and his friends played basketball all afternoon.","I like rugby, but not as much as I like basketball."],["汤姆和朋友们打了整个下午篮球。","我喜欢橄榄球，但不像我喜欢篮球那么喜欢。"]],["hill","hil","n. 小山, 丘陵, 小土堆\\nvt. 作成土堆, 堆成小丘",["At the foot of the hill you'll see a white building.","A small road ran across the bridge, through the fields, and over a hill."],["你會在山腳下看到一棟白色的建築物。","一条小路跨过桥梁，穿过田野，还爬上小丘。"]],["golf","gɒlf","n. 高尔夫球\\nvi. 打高尔夫球",["My son wants to become a professional golf player.","Tom and Mary say they intend to play golf with us this afternoon."],["我的兒子想成為一個專業高爾夫球手。","汤姆和玛丽说他们今天下午打算和我们一起来打高尔夫。"]],["investigate","in'vestigeit","v. 调查, 审查",["A committee was constituted to investigate prices.","He announced that he would come at once and investigate the matter."],["为了调查物价，成立了一个委员会。","他宣布他將立刻來調查此事。"]],["crazy","'kreizi","a. 发狂的, 狂热的",["He must have been crazy to climb the mountain in winter.","With the heirless king going crazy and royal family poisoned, the general of the army finally had his chance to usurp the throne."],["他一定是瘋了才會在冬天爬山。","随着无继承人的国王的发疯和王室家族的中毒，将军终于有机会篡夺王位。"]],["significantly","","adv. 值得注目地；意味深长地",["Software development as an industry is very adaptable, so it's unclear whether AI will significantly disrupt the programming job market.","While most of us are significantly better off financially than our parents and grandparents, happiness levels haven't changed to reflect that."],["軟體開發業的適應力很強，因此 AI 是否會對程式設計的就業市場造成重大衝擊，目前仍不明朗。","虽然我们大多数人比我们的父母、祖父母还要富裕得多，但是与之相应的快乐程度却没有多大的改变。"]],["chain","tʃein","n. 链, 枷锁, 束缚\\nvt. 用铁练锁住, 束缚, 囚禁",["We want to develop a new supply chain with a supplier from Algeria.","For example, if a chain-smoking teacher cautions a pupil for smoking, that warning is self-contradictory."],["我们想和一个阿尔及利亚的供应商一起打造一条新的供应链。","舉例說，如果一個老師警告學生不要吸煙，但自己卻每天吸個不停，那麼這個警告就是自相矛盾的了。"]],["branch","bræntʃ","n. 树枝, 支店, 支流, 分部\\nvi. 分支, 出枝\\nvt. 分割, 用枝状叶脉刺绣花纹装饰\\n[计] 分支, 目录分支",["A new branch will be opened in Chicago next month.","It's possible to branch out from computing to jobs in banking, accountancy and so on."],["新的分店下箇月在芝加哥開始營業。","有可能將電腦工作擴展到銀行業務, 會計業務等等。"]],["combination",".kɒmbi'neiʃәn","n. 组合, 合并, 联合\\n[计] 组合图",["Cottage cheese and canned peaches are a delicious combination.","Jazz fusion is a combination of rock and jazz."],["乾酪加桃子罐頭是美味的搭配。","融合爵士是搖滾樂與爵士樂的融合。"]],["frequently","'fri:kwәntli","adv. 频繁, 经常地",["As soon as I have a dog, I'll start going for walks frequently.","Even the most carefully made plans frequently result in failure."],["我一有小狗，就会开始常常散步。","即使最小心做的计划也经常失败了。"]],["governor","'gʌvәnә","n. (美)州长, (英)总督, 统治者, 管理者, 理事\\n[医] 节制器, 调节器",["Everybody wished he had been elected governor.","I congratulate him, I congratulate Governor Palin for all that they've achieved. And I look forward to working with them to renew this nation's promise in the months ahead."],["每個人都希望他當選州長。","我向他道賀；也向裴林州長道賀，為他們所成就的一切。我迫不及待想和他們攜手合作，在未來數月更新這個國家的許諾。"]],["relief","ri'li:f","n. 减轻, 解除, 救济, 安慰, 调剂, 浮雕, 换班, (地势的)起伏\\n[医] 缓减, 减轻, 浮雕(绘画中)",["His humor charmingly eased the embarrassing atmosphere at dinner time and made me breathe a sigh of relief.","The next morning, to our great relief, he returned home safe and sound."],["他的幽默巧妙地缓解了晚餐时尴尬的气氛，让我松了一口气。","第二天早上，他就平安無事的回來了，我們都大大的鬆了一口氣。"]],["user","'ju:zә","n. 使用者\\n[计] 用户",["My friend is designing a user interface for the new operating system.","A user should have freedom with respect to both hardware and software. An operating system should be open, not closed."],["我的朋友正在为新的操作系统设计一个用户界面。","用户应该拥有硬件和软件的使用自由，操作系统应该是开放的，而不是封闭的。"]],["dad","dæd","n. 爸爸, 爹爹",["You should apologize to Dad for not coming home in time for supper.","Dad said he'd be promoted to section manager next year."],["你應該為你沒有及時回家吃晚餐向你父親道歉。","爸爸说他明年就要被升为部门主管了。"]],["kick","kik","n. 踢, 反冲, 后座力, 凹底\\nvi. 踢, 反抗, 反冲\\nvt. 踢, 反冲",["When the goalkeeper touched the ball, the referee awarded the other team a corner kick.","Bale was fouled, and his team was awarded a free kick."],["守门员用手碰到了球，裁判给了对方一个角球。","贝尔被犯规了，球队获得了任意球。"]],["ancient","'einʃәnt","a. 古代的, 古老的, 年老的, 旧的",["Astronomy is at the same time the most ancient and the most modern science.","The myth offers insights into the ancient civilization."],["天文學同時是最古老也最現代的科學。","神話讓我們能透悉古文明。"]],["manner","'mænә","n. 样子, 礼貌, 风格\\n[法] 方式, 方法, 样式",["George did business in the same manner as his father.","There is nothing worse than doing something in a half-hearted manner."],["乔治和他爸爸做生意的方式一样。","没有什么比做事缺乏热情更糟。"]],["rating","'reitiŋ","n. 等级, 额定功率, 责骂\\n[经] 等级评定",["Maybe I should add some sentences without translations too. It's a very quick way to improve the rating of your language.","Pedantry is properly the over-rating of any kind of knowledge we pretend to."],["",""]],["silence","'sailәns","n. 沉默, 无声, 静寂, 湮没, 无声息\\nvt. 使缄默\\ninterj. 安静",["In the end, we will remember not the words of our enemies, but the silence of our friends.","Being unfamiliar with foreign languages, you'll never be able to understand the foreigner's silence."],["到頭來，我們記得的不是敵人的話語，而是朋友的沉默。","没有对外语的认识，你永远无法理解外国人的沉默。"]],["golden","'gәuldn","a. 金的, 含金的, 金色的, 贵重的, 繁盛的\\n[法] 金制的, 金色的, 兴隆的",["The girl in the picture has a flower wreath on her head, and not a golden crown.","I watched as my grandmother pulled a golden butter pie from the oven."],["畫中的女孩頭上戴著的是花冠，不是金皇冠。","我看著奶奶從烤箱裡拿出一個金黃色的奶油派。"]],["motion","'mәuʃәn","n. 移动, 手势, 动作, 意向, 请求, 提议\\nv. 打手势",["The idea of perpetual motion is an absurd hypothesis.","They showed the scene in slow motion."],["永动机这个概念是个荒唐的假说。","他們用慢動作把那一幕播了出來。"]],["german","'dʒә:mәn","n. 德国人, 德语\\na. 德国的, 德国人的, 德国语的, 同父母的",["He knows German and French, not to mention English.","He speaks only English and German, neither of which I understand."],["不提英语，他还会说德语和法语。","他只會說英語和德語，這兩種語言我都不懂。"]],["gender","'dʒendә","n. 性\\nvt. 产生",["The lack of gender in English is not due to the English having a more egalitarian culture.","Gender norms should not dictate how individuals cope with and process their emotions."],["英文中沒有陰陽性並不是因為英國人的文化偏向平等。","性別規範不應該規定個人如何面對或處理自己的情緒。"]],["solve","sɒlv","vt. 解决, 付给, 溶解\\nvt. 求解\\nvi. 求解\\n[计] 求解",["In my opinion, it would be difficult to solve this problem.","The government is not doing its best to solve the housing problem."],["在我看来，这个问题很难解决。","政府没有尽他们最大的努力去处理住房问题。"]],["fee","fi:","n. 费用, 小费, 封地, 所有权\\nvt. 付费给",["If necessary, I have no objection to paying a special fee.","He paid the prostitute the fee without being aware of the surveillance camera."],["如果必要的话，我不反对付特别费用。","他在不知有監控錄像的情況下支付了妓女服務費用。"]],["landscape","'lændskeip","n. 风景, 山水, 风景画\\nvi. 从事景观美化\\nvt. 美化...景观\\n[计] 横向",["Sun lights the landscape, pain illuminates the soul.","The natural landscape is characterised by its large amount of mountains, and it looks as truly beautiful as a painting."],["阳光照亮田野，痛苦点亮心灵。","这里的自然景观的特点是山非常多，而且像画一样特别美。"]],["used","'ju:st","a. 使用过的, 二手的, 习惯的",["English is a universal language and is used all over the world.","London, where I live, used to be famous for its fog."],["英語是一種世界性的語言，用於世界各地。","我住的地方－倫敦，從前以霧聞名。"]],["bowl","bәul","n. 碗, 木球, 大酒杯\\nv. 滚木球, 快而稳地行驶",["I ate two green apples and a bowl of green grapes last night.","Mary took an egg and cracked it open on the rim of the bowl."],["昨晚我吃了两个青苹果和一碗青葡萄。","瑪麗婭拿了一個雞蛋，並將它在碗沿上敲開。"]],["equal","'i:kwәl","n. 对手, 匹敌, 同辈\\na. 相等的, 平等的, 胜任的, 合适的, 平静的, 不相上下的\\nvt. 等于, 比得上\\n[计] 等长…",["You may write in any language you want. On Tatoeba, all languages are equal.","All animals are equal, but some animals are more equal than others."],["您可以用任何您想要用的语言写。在Tatoeba，所有语言都是平等的。","所有的動物都是平等的，但是有的動物比別的動物更平等。"]],["frame","freim","n. 框, 结构, 体格\\nvt. 构成, 设计, 制定, 使适合, 陷害\\n[计] 框架, 图文框, 帧",["This picture frame can make the picture rise in value.","The frame itself is worth more than the picture."],["这个画框能让画升值。","画框比画还值钱。"]],["forth","fɒ:θ","adv. 往前, 以后, 向外",["He asked me my age, my name, my address, and so forth.","He walked back and forth in front of the door, hesitating to enter."],["他問了我的年齡、姓名、地址等等。","他在門前走來走去，不知道該不該進去。"]],["typical","'tipikl","a. 典型的, 象征性的\\n[医] 典型的",["You can search words, and get translations. But it's not exactly a typical dictionary.","I find that it's typical for him to come too late."],["你们可以搜索词并得到翻译。但这真不是一本寻常的字典。","我發現他就是會很晚才來這樣的人。"]],["except","ik'sept","vt. 除, 除外\\nvi. 反对\\nprep. 除了...之外, 若不是, 除非\\nconj. 只是",["I go to the office by bicycle except on rainy days.","Democracy is the worst form of government, except all the others that have been tried."],["除了雨天，我都是骑车去上班的。","除了那些我们尝试过的政府形态，民主是最差的那种了。"]],["conservative","kәn'sә:vәtiv","a. 保守的, 守旧的, 有保存力的\\n[化] 防腐剂; 保存剂",["There are two major political parties in the United States: the conservative Republican Party, and the liberal Democratic Party.","Many conservative women still can't accept fishnet stockings."],["美国有两大政党，一是较为保守的共和党，一是较为自由的民主党。","很多保守的女生還是接受不了網襪。"]],["eliminate","i'limineit","vt. 除去, 排除, 剔除, 消除",["The American mission is to eliminate communism from the world.","If mankind doesn't take care of the environment, the environment may eliminate mankind."],["美国的任务是将共产主义从世界上消除。","如果人類不好好保護大自然，大自然說不定會反過來把人類毀滅。"]],["hall","hɒ:l","n. 门厅, 走廊, 会堂",["There is a crowd of people in front of the town hall.","Turning to the right, you will find the city hall in front of you."],["市政大厅前有一群人。","向右转，你就可以看到市政厅位于正前方。"]],["host","hәust","n. 主人, 旅馆老板, 节目主持人\\nvt. 当主人招待, 作...节目主持人\\n[计] 主机, 宿主机",["A guest should not try to make himself superior to the host.","The party host had a Portuguese accent."],["强宾不压主。","派对主席说话时有葡萄牙腔"]],["trust","trʌst","n. 信任, 信赖, 相信, 受托, 职责, 信心, 托拉斯\\na. 信托的, 托拉斯的\\nvt. 信赖, 信任, 相信, 盼望, 赊卖给…",["She has many faults, but I trust her none the less.","If you're not a loser by nature, then people won't trust you."],["她有很多缺點，但我還是這麼信她。","如果你没有尝试过失败的角色，那么人们也就不会相信你。"]],["ocean","'әuʃәn","n. 海洋, 广阔, 许多, 一大片\\n[法] 海洋, 海",["My eyes are an ocean in which my dreams are reflected.","In Hawaii, one can swim in the ocean all year round."],["我的眼睛是一片反映我梦想的海洋。","在夏威夷，一个人可以一年到头享受海水浴的乐趣。"]],["row","rәu. rau","n. 排, 行, 街道, 划船, 吵闹\\nvt. 使成排, 划, 划船, 参加(赛船), 痛骂\\nvi. 划船, 划动, 争吵\\n[计] 行",["There is no difference between this row of clothes and the one next to it.","It's at the third home in the second row of houses."],["旁边一排衣服跟这里的衣服没什么不一样。","在第二排房子的第三家。"]],["producer","prә'dju:sә","n. 生产者, 制作者, 制作人\\n[化] 发生器; (炉煤气)发生炉; 制气炉; 生产者",["Australia is the world's fifth-largest coal producer.","Ivory Coast is the world's biggest cocoa producer."],["澳大利亚是世界第五大煤炭产地。",""]],["afford","ә'fɒ:d","vt. 买得起, 足以, 给予",["This book is too expensive. I can't afford to buy it.","I can't afford eating in such an expensive restaurant."],["这本书太贵了。我买不起。","我吃不起这么贵的餐馆。"]],["meanwhile","'mi:nhwail","n. 其时, 其间\\nadv. 同时, 于此时",["Meanwhile, Jiang Qin distracted Jiang Feng's older brother Yan Daxia.","Meanwhile, the circumstances have changed drastically."],["与此同时江琴分散了江枫的哥哥燕大侠的注意力。","在这期间，情况发生了巨大变化。"]],["regime","rei'ʒi:m","n. 政权, 当权期间, 政体, 社会制度, 体制, 情态\\n[医] 制度, 生活制度",["Korolev eventually fell out of favor with the Stalin regime and was thrown in prison.","Japan has been one of the greatest beneficiaries of the free trade system under the GATT regime."],["",""]],["division","di'viʒәn","n. 分, 分开, 除法, 部门(如部、处、系等), 师\\n[计] 部分",["All the top teams of the UK are in the premier division.","The children haven't studied division yet."],["英国所有的顶尖球队都在超级联赛中。","孩子們還沒上過除法。"]],["fix","fiks","vt. 使固定, 修理, 准备, 安装, 凝视, 牢记, 确定, 整理\\nvi. 固定, 注视, 确定\\nn. 困境, 方位, 维修, 贿赂",["I'll only buy the car if they fix the brakes first.","We shall fix all bugs today before leaving the office."],["除非他们事先修好刹车，我才会买车子。","我们应该在今天下班前解决所有bug。"]],["confirm","kәn'fә:m","vt. 证实, 确定, 批准, 使巩固\\n[计] 确认",["We will confirm your order as follows.","I can neither confirm nor deny that."],["您的订单确认如下。","我既不能確認也不能否定。"]],["appeal","ә'pi:l","n. 恳求, 诉请, 上诉, 吸引力\\nvi. 呼吁, 诉请, 要求, 上诉, 有吸引力\\nvt. 将...上诉",["Between you and me, John's idea doesn't appeal to me very much.","Between you and me, Tom's idea doesn't appeal to me very much."],["约翰的主意我不太喜欢，这个我们知道就好。","汤姆的主意我不太感兴趣，这个我们之间说说就好。"]],["mirror","'mirә","n. 镜子, 写真, 典范\\nvt. 反映, 映出",["A mirror wall in the room creates an illusion of spaciousness.","Tom and Mary practiced their speeches in front of the mirror."],["房間裡的鏡面牆營造出寬敞的錯覺。","湯姆和瑪麗對著鏡子練習演講。"]],["tooth","tu:θ","n. 牙齿, 齿状物, 爱好\\nvt. 装以齿, 将...切成齿状\\nvi. 啮合",["You should go to the dentist and have that tooth pulled out.","According to dentists, tooth decay is not always caused by sweets."],["你應該去看牙醫，把牙拔掉。","根據牙醫，蛀牙並不總是甜食所引起的。"]],["length","leŋθ","n. 长度, 长, 期间, 一段\\n[计] 记录长度; 块长; 字长",["The length of a marriage is inversely proportional to the cost of the wedding.","Her hair grew back to its original length."],["婚姻的長度與婚宴的花費負相關。","她的头发长回原来的长度了。"]],["smart","smɑ:t","a. 聪明的, 漂亮的, 刺痛的, 剧烈的, 敏捷的, 巧妙的, 伶俐的, 潇洒的\\nn. 刺痛, 痛苦\\nvi. 刺痛",["It was a pleasure to spend the evening with a smart, funny and beautiful girl like you.","She's beautiful, smart, and - most importantly - has a good heart."],["和你這樣又聰明、又幽默、又漂亮的女孩共渡一晚，實在是一件賞心樂事。","她很漂亮，聪明，并且最重要的是，她有一颗善良的心。"]],["rely","ri'lai","vi. 信赖, 依赖, 信任",["There has never been a savior nor an immortal emperor to rely on.","You can rely upon his being punctual."],["从来就没有什么救世主， 也不靠神仙皇帝！","你可以放心，他會準時的。"]],["entirely","in'taiәli","adv. 完全, 全然, 一概",["Compact discs have entirely taken the place of phonograph records.","The Latin language is not entirely unknown to me, but I altogether lack the ability to speak it."],["CD已经完全取代了胶木唱片。","拉丁语对我来说不是完全陌生的，但我不懂说这门语言。"]],["association","ә.sәuʃә'eiʃәn","n. 协会\\n[计] 关联",["No one may be compelled to belong to an association.","In Chinese, 'dumpling' and 'first exchange' are homophones, so they have a rich cultural association."],["不可以强迫任何人加入某个协会。","在中文里面，饺子和“交子”谐音，因而具有丰富的文化涵义。"]],["complain","kәm'plein","v. 抱怨, 抗议, 控诉",["He does nothing but complain from morning till night.","Why am I the only one they complain about? They're just making an example out of me and using me as a scapegoat."],["他从早到晚只是在抱怨。","為什麼我是他們唯一抱怨的人? 他們就這樣拿我作例子, 利用我當代罪羔羊。"]],["topic","'tɒpik","n. 主题, 论题, 话题",["I chose this topic because I think it is interesting.","I chose this topic because I think it's interesting."],["我選這個主題是因為我覺得它很有意思。","我選這個主題是因為我覺得它很有意思。"]],["variable","'vєәriәbl","n. 易变的事物, 变数, 可变物, 变量\\na. 可变的, 不定的, 易变的, 变量的\\n[计] 变量",["Even though a parameter's value can change, it is treated as a constant, not as a variable.","Variable names in C are case sensitive."],["尽管参数的值可变，但我们仍把它视为常量，而非变量。","C语言的变量名是区分大小写的。"]],["telephone","'telifәun","n. 电话, 电话机\\nv. 打电话",["Telephone booths are as scarce as hen's teeth around here.","Tom ran and ran, until at last he saw the telephone booth."],["這裏附近的電話亭少得可憐。","湯姆跑啊跑, 直到他終於看到了電話亭。"]],["perception","pә'sepʃәn","n. 知觉, 感觉, 领悟力, 获取\\n[医] 知觉",["If the doors of perception were cleansed everything would appear to man as it is, infinite.","Most of these who are thrust into combat soon find it impossible to maintain the mythic perception of war."],["",""]],["attract","ә'trækt","vt. 吸引, 诱惑\\nvi. 有吸引力",["Black Friday sales attract shoppers.","After business came to a halt, many bathhouses added new facilities, such as saunas and exercise equipment, in an effort to attract customers."],["黑色星期五促銷活動吸引了許多購物者。","生意停頓了以後，許多公共浴堂都添置了桑拿浴室、健身器材等的新設備，希望能吸引多點人來光顧。"]],["secret","'si:krit","n. 秘密, 机密, 秘诀, 秘方\\na. 秘密的, 极机密的, 隐蔽的, 暗中的, 神秘的, 偏僻的",["My mind is at ease believing you'll keep the secret.","At last, she gave in to him and told him the secret."],["我十分安心，因為我知道你會保守秘密。","最後，她對他屈服了，並告訴了他這個秘密。"]],["bedroom","'bedrum","n. 卧室",["Your bedroom doesn't have even a single person in it.","I already said, this is a meeting room, not a bedroom."],["你的卧室里一个人也没有。","我說過了，這是一個會議室，不是臥室。"]],["confidence","'kɒnfidәns","n. 信心\\n[电] 可靠",["All you need is ignorance and confidence and the success is sure.","Self-confidence is the principal element of any great endeavor."],["要想成功只需要无知和自信。","自信是伟大事业的第一要素。"]],["debt","det","n. 债务, 罪过\\n[经] 借款, 欠款, 债务",["It's really difficult to survive in a big city like Tokyo without going into debt.","All you have to do is ask him to pay the debt."],["要在一個像東京一樣的大都市裡過活，不借錢是很困難的。","你只需要喊他还债就行。"]],["rare","rєә","a. 稀罕的, 罕有的, 珍奇的, 稀薄的, 半熟的, 非常好的\\nadv. 非常",["If we don't make the utmost effort to protect the rainforests, many of the rare species in them will become extinct.","I found the rare edition that I've been looking so long for."],["如果我们不做更多的努力去保护雨林，很多其中的稀有物种将会灭绝。","找到了寻找已久的珍本。"]],["tank","tæŋk","n. 槽, 箱, 柜, 罐, 池塘, 储水池, 坦克\\nvt. 储于箱中",["Be careful not to spill gasoline when filling the tank on your lawn mower.","It takes a long time, and a lot of money, to fill that tank with gas."],["",""]],["nurse","nә:s","n. 护士, 保姆, 奶妈\\nvt. 看护, 照顾, 培养\\nvi. 喂奶, 看护病人",["The nurse took his temperature with a thermometer.","She has three sisters: one is a nurse and the other two are teachers."],["護士用溫度計量了量他的體溫。","她有三個姊妹，一個是護士，另外的兩個是教師。"]],["opposition",".ɒpә'ziʃәn","n. 反对, 敌对, 相反, 在野党\\n[医] 对生, 对向, 反抗, 反对症",["In the teeth of their strong opposition, we carried out our plan.","The opposition formed a line in the box to try and block Messi from scoring."],["雖然受到他們的強烈反對，但我們還是實行了我們的計劃。","对方球员在禁区内组成一道防线，试图阻截梅西的射门。"]],["coverage","'kʌvәridʒ","n. 覆盖的范围, 保险总额, 新闻报导\\n[化] 可达范围; 覆盖度",["Algeria needs to ensure health coverage to most of its population.","Your top does not provide enough midriff coverage, young lady."],["",""]],["aside","ә'said","n. 小声说的话, 旁白\\nadv. 在一边, 离开, 另外",["He pulled aside to let a truck pass.","She put aside the sewing and stood up."],["他移开，让卡车通过。","她放下手中的针线活，并站了起来。"]],["anywhere","'enihwєә","adv. 无论何处",["They looked everywhere for him, but couldn't find him anywhere.","A GPS device can pinpoint your location anywhere in the world."],["他們已經到處找過他，可是卻哪裏也找不到他。","無論你在世界的哪一個角落，你都可以使用全球定位儀來找出你的所在。"]],["bond","bɒnd","n. 捆绑物, 结合, 债券, 契约, 粘合剂, 保证人, 键, 关栈保留\\nvt. 存入关栈, 使黏合\\nvi. 结合",["\"I'd look like a real James Bond in that,\" Dima said to himself, then entered the store.","We must complete the bond by the end of this year."],["狄馬自言自語地說：「我穿上它，看起來就會像詹姆士龐德一樣。」然後就走進了店子裏。",""]],["pleasure","'pleʒә","n. 快乐, 愉快, 令人高兴的事, 娱乐, 希望\\nv. (使)高兴",["It was a pleasure to spend the evening with a smart, funny and beautiful girl like you.","Frank was waiting with pleasure for the date in the evening."],["和你這樣又聰明、又幽默、又漂亮的女孩共渡一晚，實在是一件賞心樂事。","法兰克高兴地等待着他晚上的约会。"]],["master","'mɑ:stә. 'mæstә","n. 主人, 硕士, 大师, 母机\\na. 主人的, 主要的\\nvt. 征服, 控制, 精通",["It's quite difficult to master French in 2 or 3 years.","This course will help you master correct pronunciation."],["两三年就想掌握法语是很困难的。","這個課程能幫助你掌握正確發音。"]],["era","'iәrә","n. 时代, 纪元, 时期",["In the era of email, I'm so happy when a friend sends me a real letter.","By reading books we can walk with the great and the good from every place and every era."],["在這個電郵的年代裏，我一收到朋友寄給我的信，就會高興得不得了。","在书中，我们可以跟各个时代、各个地方的智者仁人同行。"]],["requirement","ri'kwaiәmәnt","n. 需求, 必要条件, 要求\\n[化] 要求; 合同要求",["Claiming that money is not a requirement for happiness is foolish.","So friendship is also a requirement for happiness."],["声称钱不是幸福的一个要素是愚蠢的。","所以，友情也是幸福的一个要素。"]],["fun","fʌn","n. 乐趣, 玩笑, 娱乐\\nvi. 开玩笑\\na. 供娱乐用的",["It's fun to learn slang words in foreign languages.","Tatoeba: Ever heard of sentence fights? Yeah, that's what we do for fun."],["学习外语里的俚语很有趣。","Tatoeba:聽過句子打架嗎？是啊，那是我們為好玩做的。"]],["wing","wiŋ","n. 翅膀, 翼, 机翼, 派别\\nvt. 给...装上翼, 飞过, 使飞, 空运, 增加...速度\\nvi. 飞行",["I found a bird whose wing was severely damaged.","Since I don't know what questions I'll be asked, I'll have to wing it at my presentation."],["我發現了一隻翅膀受了重傷的鳥兒。",""]],["expectation",".ekspek'teiʃәn","n. 期待, 指望, 展望\\n[化] 期望值",["He failed to get elected contrary to our expectation.","Expectation caused her to be flushed with excitement."],["",""]],["separate","'sepәreit","n. 独立件, 抽印本\\na. 分开的, 各别的, 单独的, 分隔的\\nvi. 分开, 隔开, 分居\\nvt. 使分离, 使分开, 区分,…",["They sleep in separate bedrooms even though they're married.","In our city, we carefully separate and collect garbage."],["他们分房睡，即使他们已经结婚了。","在我们的城市那，我们非常谨慎地分类收集垃圾。"]],["somewhat","'sʌmhwɒt","n. 某物, 几分\\nadv. 多少, 几分",["While walking, I used to feel somewhat in a hurry.","The rental should be somewhat close to where I work."],["以前，我散步的时候感觉有点匆忙。","租的房屋要离我工作地方近一点。"]],["pour","pɒ:","n. 流出, 倾泻, 骤雨\\nvt. 倒, 灌, 注, 倾泻, 诉说, 倾吐\\nvi. 倾泻, 蜂涌而来, 下大雨",["Pour melted butter over the popcorn.","Don't pour hot water into the glass or it will crack."],["將融化了的奶油倒入爆米花中。",""]],["stir","stә:","n. 骚动, 轰动, 搅动, 监狱\\nvt. 移动, 摇动, 激起, 惹起, 搅拌\\nvi. 走动, 传播, 搅拌",["Two women wielding giant spatulas continuously stir a brimming wok of shredded beef simmering in curry sauce.","I don't want to stir up old memories."],["兩名女子揮舞著巨大的鍋鏟，不停地翻炒著盛滿咖哩醬汁的牛肉絲。","我不愿意勾起久远的回忆。"]],["judgment","'dʒʌdʒmәnt","n. 裁判, 宣告, 判决书\\n[医] 判断",["An idea not properly analyzed is not worth exploiting, just as a life without self-judgment is not worth living.","I'd made up my mind to stop snacking, but against my better judgment, I keep giving in to temptation and eating ice cream."],["没有经过仔细审视的观念是不值得拥有的，正如没有经过仔细审视的生活不值得过一样。","我下定決心要戒掉零食，但違背了自己的意願，我還是不斷屈服於誘惑，吃冰淇淋。"]],["beer","biә","n. 啤酒\\n[化] 啤酒",["Root beer is considered a classic American carbonated soft drink.","The Three Forks is a bar serving beer, and its target audience are travellers."],["麥根沙士被視為一種經典的美式碳酸飲品。","三把叉子是一家供應啤酒的酒吧，其目標客戶是旅行者。"]],["reference","'refәrәns","n. 参考, 索引, 参照\\nvt. 给...加上参考资料\\nvt. 引用\\nvi. 引用\\n[计] 引用",["The source made reference to Kate and the Queen being seen chatting and smiling together last March.","Tom wanted to check the applicant's character reference before extending an offer."],["知情者提到去年三月有人看到女王和凱薩琳笑着聊天。","湯姆想在發出錄取通知前先確認申請人的品行證明。"]],["tear","tiә. tєә","n. 泪滴, 眼泪, 撕, 扯, 裂缝, 激怒, 飞奔\\nvi. 流泪, 撕破, 赶快, 飞奔, 被撕破\\nvt. 撕裂, 戳破, 拉掉,…",["To those who would tear the world down: we will defeat you.","The cops threw tear-gas bombs into the building."],["那些想要颠覆这个世界的人们，我们将击败你们。","警方將催淚彈投擲到了建築中。"]],["doubt","daut","n. 怀疑, 疑惑\\nv. 怀疑, 不信",["People who love doubt nothing, or doubt everything.","Truth is beautiful, without doubt; but so are lies."],["喜欢的人什么都不怀疑，或什么都疑神疑鬼。","诚然，真实是美丽的。但谎言也同样。"]],["grant","grænt","n. 授予, 授予物, 允许\\nvt. 允许, 承认, 授与\\n[计] 授权命令",["Even if I grant that what you say is true, it is no excuse.","He was awarded a grant to study in Germany."],["即使我承认你说的是真的，但这并不是借口。","他獲得了一份去德國留學的獎學金。"]],["seriously","'siәriәsli","adv. 严肃地, 认真地, 严重地",["Seriously though, episode 21 made me almost cry while laughing.","He'll never show it, but I think that deep down, he's seriously worried."],["但是说真的，第21集让我笑得眼泪都要出来了。","他雖然擺着一副若無其事的樣子，但是我想他心裏一定擔心得不得了。"]],["minister","'ministә","n. 部长, 牧师, 公使\\nvi. 服侍, 救助, 主持宗教仪式",["This is the house in which the prime minister lives.","The Foreign Minister said that war was inevitable."],["这是总理住的房子。","外交部长称战争在所难免。"]],["totally","'tәutli","adv. 完全地",["It's totally without precedent for the suspect's attorney to be the true culprit.","He is totally immersed in family life and has no wish to work."],["這前所未聞, 犯罪嫌疑人的律師竟然是真正的罪魁禍首。","他完全沉浸于家庭生活中，不想工作了。"]],["hero","'hiәrәu","n. 英雄, 超越常人者, 男主角",["We had thought that he was a hero, but he turned out to be a traitor.","We called him a \"hero\", but he betrayed us."],["我们以为他是一个英雄，原来是一个叛徒。","我们把他称为“英雄”，但是他却背叛了我们。"]],["industrial","in'dʌstriәl","a. 工业的, 供工业用的, 工业高度发展的, 产业的\\nn. 工业工人, 工业股票",["It occurred to me that he might be an industrial spy.","In China's agricultural and industrial areas, some people are still very poor."],["我突然想到他可能是個商業間諜。","在中国乡村和工业区，有的人还是很穷的。"]],["cloud","klaud","n. 云, 阴暗, 烟雾, 疑团\\nvt. 以云遮敝, 笼罩, 使黯然\\nvi. 乌云密布, 阴沉",["So it seems that cloud of odorless deadly gas had a silver lining after all.","A cloud of dust and debris rose and lingered in the sky for a few minutes afterward."],["只能说，那团无味的致命气体，也不是没有好处。","一團塵土與瓦礫騰空而起，在空中盤旋了數分鐘。"]],["stretch","stretʃ","n. 伸展, 张开, 连绵, 一段路, 一段时间\\na. 可伸缩的, 弹性的\\nvt. 伸展, 张开, 曲解, 使过度伸展\\nvi. 伸展…",["On the border, there is a stretch of agricultural land.","You have to stretch your muscles after swimming in the pool."],["邊境上有一片農業區。","在泳池游完泳後要拉伸肌肉。"]],["winner","'winә","n. 胜利者, 优胜者\\n[法] 取胜者",["The winner of this quarter-final match will advance to the semi-final stage.","We can say that there's not a clear winner in terms of a policy to curtail medical expenses and benefits."],["這場四分之一決賽的勝者將晉級半決賽。",""]],["volume","'vɒljum","n. 册, 卷, 体积, 容量, 大量, 许多, 份量, 音量\\nvi. 成团卷起\\nvt. 把...收集成卷\\na. 大量的\\n[计] 卷",["Turn the volume up so that the students at the back can hear.","Don't turn up the volume of TV anymore."],["声音大声一点，以便让坐在后边的学生能听到。","不要再调大电视的声音了。"]],["seed","si:d","n. 种子, 籽, 萌芽, 子孙, 精液\\nvt. 在...播种, 催...发育, 脱...籽\\nvi. 结实, 播种",["I ordered a sesame seed buns for the veggie burgers.","If you plant an apple seed, it might grow into a tree."],["我點了一份芝麻麵包，用來製作素食漢堡。",""]],["surprised","sә'praizd","a. 感到惊讶的",["I am very much surprised to hear that he got badly injured in a motorcar accident.","He is very much interested in Japanese history. We are surprised at his vast knowledge of the subject."],["他因车祸受了重伤的消息让我震惊万分。","他对日本的历史非常感兴趣。我们很惊讶他在这方面的丰富知识。"]],["fashion","'fæʃәn","n. 流行, 风尚, 时样\\nvt. 形成, 造, 作",["You may think those shoes are in fashion, but they aren't.","With its distinctive Chinese features, the qipao enjoys growing popularity in the international world of high fashion."],["你可能認為那些鞋子很時髦, 但是他們不是。","旗袍因有与众不同的特点而在国际时尚界享有与日俱增的名望。"]],["pepper","'pepә","n. 胡椒粉, 胡椒, 辣椒\\n[化] 胡椒; 辣椒; 花椒",["Slice the kale, and add it to a pan, with olive oil, garlic, salt and pepper, and wait until it is soft and tasty.","I seasoned the fish with salt and pepper."],["將羽衣甘藍切片，放入鍋中，加入橄欖油、大蒜、鹽和胡椒，煮至軟嫩可口。","我在魚上灑鹽和胡椒作調味。"]],["busy","'bizi","a. 忙碌的, 热闹的, 没空的\\nvt. 使忙\\nvi. 忙碌\\n[计] 忙; 忙碌",["I was busy packing, because I was leaving for France in two days.","Life is what happens to you while you're busy making other plans."],["我当时正忙着打包，因为我两天后要去法国。","生活就是當你忙著進行你的計劃時總有其他的事情發生。"]],["intervention",".intә'venʃәn","n. 插入, 介入, 调停\\n[经] 干预",["It has been shown in most studies on this subject that intervention of the legislature had adverse effects.","State intervention should be conducted by generating positive and intense incentives."],["",""]],["copy","'kɒpi","n. 副本, 摹仿, 一册\\nv. 复印, 抄袭, 复制\\n[计] 副本; 复制; DOS内部命令:复制文件\\n将几个文件合并成一个文件,…",["The printer of my company broke down again, so I'm going to the convenience store to copy documents.","He compared the copy with the original."],["因为公司的打印机又坏了，我要去便利店打印文件。","他比较了复印稿和原件。"]],["tip","tip","n. 顶, 尖端, 梢, 末端, 倾斜, 垃圾场, 小费, 轻击, 指点, 秘密消息\\nvt. 装顶端, 使倾斜, 使翻倒, 泄露, 告诫…",["His name was on the tip of my tongue, but I couldn't remember it.","The tip of the spear was dipped in a deadly poison."],["我都快要说出他的名字了，可就是记不起来。","矛尖浸在一種致命的毒藥裡。"]],["cheap","tʃi:p","a. 便宜的, 不值钱的, 可鄙的\\nadv. 便宜地",["I got a video cassette recorder cheap at that shop.","It is strange that he should be put up at such a cheap hotel."],["我在那商店花低價買了臺錄像機。","真奇怪，他竟然被安排入住這種廉價酒店。"]],["aim","eim","n. 目标, 瞄准, 击中目标的能力\\nvi. 对准目标, 致力, 打算\\nvt. 瞄准\\n[计] 医学文摘索引, 存取隔离机构, 高级信…",["The aim of this game is to explode all the bombs on the screen.","The aim of this policy is to improve the environment in the poorest cities."],["這個遊戲的目的是引爆螢幕上所有的炸彈。","這個政策的目的是改善最貧困城市的環境。"]],["cite","sait","vt. 引用, 引证, 表彰\\n[建] 引证, 指引",["To cite usage against rule, in a constructed language, is insane.","Students cite the cost of flights, and worries about renewing visas as the main reasons for not traveling."],["",""]],["welfare","'welfєә","n. 福利, 安宁, 幸福, 福利事业\\na. 福利的",["France is running a welfare state it can no longer afford.","For example, China's public transport is without a doubt better than the UK's, but the UK's public welfare may be better than China's."],["法國是一個福利國家，但它卻不再能夠負擔得起了。","例如，中國的大眾運輸毫無疑問地優於英國，但英國的公共福利可能比中國的好。"]],["vegetable","'vedʒәtәbl","n. 蔬菜, 植物, 无精打采之人\\na. 蔬菜的, 植物的",["Due to the heavy rain, vegetable prices have risen.","Strictly speaking, the tomato is not a vegetable. It's a fruit."],["多亏了这场大雨，蔬菜价格直线上升。","嚴格來說，蕃茄不是蔬菜，是水果。"]],["dish","diʃ","n. 盘子, 碟, 菜肴\\n[医] 皿, 碟",["I'd like to have this meat dish with your best white wine.","Every time he comes here, he orders the same dish."],["我想喝著你最好的白酒吃這肉。","每次他来这里点一样的菜。"]],["improvement","im'pru:vmәnt","n. 进步, 改善, 利用\\n[医] 改善, 好转, 进步",["Actually, the present method has plenty of room for improvement.","Although the life of Chinese people is getting better and better now, there is still room for improvement."],["其實現時的方法還有很大的改善空間。","尽管现在中国人的生活越来越好了，可是还有改进的余地。"]],["beach","bi:tʃ","n. 海滩",["I was planning on going to the beach today, but then it started to rain.","Since my boyfriend is more of an indoors person, I didn't go to the beach, nor to the mountains this summer."],["我本来预备今天去海滩的，但接着天就开始下雨了。","由於男友不喜歡出門，所以今年夏天我既沒去海邊，也沒去山區。"]],["everywhere","'evrihwєә","adv. 各处, 到处",["I've looked everywhere, but I can't find my wallet.","Angrily, he stomped on the puddle, splashing mud everywhere."],["我到处都看了，可还是没找到我的皮夹。","他憤怒地踐踏水坑，弄得泥水四濺。"]],["gray","grei","n. 灰色, 暗淡\\na. 灰色的, 灰白的, 面色苍白的, 年老的, 老练的, 阴沉的\\nv. (使)变灰色",["His actions are neither illegal nor entirely ethical, falling somewhere in a gray area.","My office is on the fourth floor of that gray six-story building."],["他的行為既不違法也不完全合乎道德，介於一種灰色地帶之間。","我的办公室在那幢灰色的六层楼的四楼。"]],["opening","'әupәniŋ","n. 开始, 口子, 穴, 揭幕\\na. 开始的",["The opening ceremony of the Olympics has already begun.","Excuse me for interrupting you, but would you mind opening the window?"],["奥运会已经开幕了。","对不起，打扰一下，能帮忙开下窗子吗？"]],["overall","'әuvәrɒ:l","a. 全部的, 全体的, 从头至尾的, 一切在内的\\nadv. 从头到尾, 总的说来\\nn. 罩衫, 工作服",["Overall, the movie was a success from script to screen.","The infrastructure of an application is directly related to its overall performance."],["总的来说，这部电影从剧本到银幕是成功的。","一个应用的架构直接关系到它的整体性能。"]],["divide","di'vaid","vi. 分开, 分配, 分裂\\nvt. 分, 分开, 分裂, 除\\nn. 分配, 分水岭\\n[计] 除",["Oceans do not so much divide the world as unite it.","Please divide the pizza into three parts."],["海洋不是将世界分隔开来，而是将世界连接起来","請把披薩分成三份。"]],["initial","i'niʃәl","n. 字首, 首字母\\na. 开始的, 最初的, 字首的\\nvt. 用姓名的首字母签名",["Your initial order is subject to a special discount of 5%.","The initial symptoms of the disease are fever and sore throat."],["首次訂購可獲九五折的特別優惠。",""]],["terrible","'terәbl","a. 可怕的, 令人恐惧的, 极坏的",["That was the only way we could defend ourselves against all this terrible shooting.","That place's food is great, and their prices are good, but the fly in the ointment is their terrible location."],["那是我们在枪林弹雨中自保的唯一方法。","那家馆子物美价廉，美中不足的是他们糟糕的位置。"]],["oppose","ә'pәuz","vt. 反对, 以...对抗, 抗争\\nvi. 反对",["The city government wants to set up special cycle lanes. However, a lot of drivers oppose the idea.","Were I in your position, I would oppose that plan."],["市政府想建设专门的自行车道。但是，很多司机反对这个主意。",""]],["route","ru:t","n. 路径, 途径, 路线\\nvt. 确定路线, 按规定路线发送\\n[计] 传递, 路由设定程序",["Whichever route you take, you will get there in time.","He might have returned home from another route."],["不管你选哪条路，你都能按时到那里。","他可能是从另一条路回到了家。"]],["contemporary","kәn'tempәrәri","n. 同时代的人\\na. 同时代的, 属于同一时期的",["The level of education of contemporary people is far higher than it has been in the past.","Contemporary Chinese youth culture is very shallow."],["现在的人教育程度比以前高得多。","中國的當代青年文化很空洞。"]],["multiple","'mʌltipl","n. 倍数, 并联\\na. 多样的, 许多的, 多功能的",["Don't include multiple alternative words inside the same sentence.","Completing this project would require the cooperation of multiple parties."],["在同一句中不要包含多个可选单词。","這個項目要多方合作才能完成。"]],["essential","i'senʃәl","n. 要素, 要点, 本质\\na. 必要的, 重要的, 本质的\\n[计] 本质冒险",["When you send a telegram, brevity is essential because you will be charged for every word.","Fruits and vegetables are essential to a balanced diet."],["当我们发电报的时候，简明扼要是关键，因为是以字计费的。","蔬果对平衡饮食必不可少。"]],["lake","leik","n. 湖, 池, 色淀\\nv. (使)血球溶解",["The ice on the lake is too thin to bear your weight.","Drop by drop, the water can conglomerate into a lake."],["湖上的冰太薄了，承受不了你的重量。","一滴滴水能聚成湖泊。"]],["league","li:g","n. 同盟, 联盟, 盟约\\nv. 组联盟, (使)加盟",["Because all of the teams in the Premier League are really strong, the goal difference is usually small.","All the top teams in England are in the Premier League."],["因为在甲级联赛中，所有队伍都很有实力，净胜球差异很小。","英格蘭所有頂級球隊都在英超聯賽。"]],["careful","'kєәful","a. 小心的, 谨慎的",["You must be more careful about spelling and punctuation.","You must be careful of the traffic when you cross the street."],["你得要更注意拼字和標點符號。","你橫穿馬路要小心。"]],["criminal","'kriminәl","n. 罪犯, 犯人, 刑事\\na. 犯了罪的, 刑事的, 有罪的",["In Singapore, one way to punish a criminal is to whip him or her.","His son's criminal activities caused him great pain."],["在新加坡，鞭刑是处置犯人的方法之一。","他儿子的犯罪行为给他带来了很大的痛苦。"]],["core","kɒ:","n. 核心, 果心, 要点\\nvt. 挖...的核\\n[计] 内核, 核心网",["In my soul there are many places that are cynical and arrogant, but at its core, it fears the darkness and is as weak as a sheep.","My mum helps me remove the core of the plum."],["我的灵魂里有很多地方玩世不恭，对人傲慢无礼，但是它有一个核心，这个核心害怕黑暗，柔弱得像绵羊一样。","妈妈帮我把李子去了核。"]],["upper","'ʌpә","a. 上面的, 较高的, 上级的, 上院的, 穿在外面的, 北部的, 地表的, 后期的\\nn. 鞋帮, 上齿",["The upper reaches of the river are very beautiful.","He thought he had the upper hand, but I turned the tables on him."],["河的上游很美。","他觉得自己占了上风，但我反过来扭转了局面。"]],["rush","rʌʃ","n. 匆促, 冲进, 急流, 灯心草\\nvi. 冲, 奔, 闯, 赶紧, 匆促行事, 涌现\\nvt. 使冲, 匆忙地做, 突袭, 飞跃, …",["If we don't hit the road soon, we'll get caught in the morning rush hour traffic.","There ought to be more buses during the rush hours."],["快要到早上的繁忙時段了，我們還不出發就要堵車了。","交通高峰期该有更多公交车。"]],["necessarily","'nesisәrili","adv. 必然地, 必须地, 必要地",["Large houses are not necessarily comfortable to live in.","Although he did well in the exam, his spoken Chinese is not necessarily as good as yours."],["大房子不一定适合住。","虽然他考得很好，他口语的汉语不见得比你的好。"]],["specifically","spi'sifikli","adv. 特定地, 明确地, 按特性",["The first time he came to Taipei, he specifically wanted to go shopping in Ximending.","You know, Tom, I didn't appreciate you hitting on her after I specifically told you I was interested in her."],["他第一次來台北，就指名要去西門町逛街。",""]],["tired","taiәd","a. 疲累的, 疲乏的, 厌倦的",["You look very tired. You must have been working too hard.","I slept a little during lunch break because I was so tired."],["你看起来很累。你一定是工作过头了。","我在午休时间睡了一会儿，因为我太累了。"]],["employ","im'plɒi","n. 雇用\\nvt. 雇用, 使用, 使从事于",["His age didn't enter into our decision not to employ him.","If he could speak English, I would employ him right away."],["我们决定不录用他时，并没有考虑他的年龄问题。",""]],["holiday","'hɒlәdi","n. 假日, 假期, 节日\\nvi. 度假",["When you're beginning to look like the photo in your passport, you should go on a holiday.","You've worked hard for months and have certainly earned a holiday."],["当我们开始像自己护照上的照片时，我们该去度假了。","你已經辛苦地工作好幾個月了, 當然可以休假。"]],["vast","vɑ:st","a. 巨大的, 广大的, 非常的, 大量的",["He is very much interested in Japanese history. We are surprised at his vast knowledge of the subject.","Tom was exposed to a wide variety of music as a child through his mother's vast record collection."],["他对日本的历史非常感兴趣。我们很惊讶他在这方面的丰富知识。","由於母親收藏了一整屋的唱片，湯姆小時候便有機會接觸各種類型的音樂。"]],["fewer","'fju:ә","a. 较少的",["Not every addict is traumatized, but there would be a lot fewer addicts if a lot fewer people were traumatized.","No fewer than 50 passengers were killed."],["不是每個癮君子都有創傷；不過有創傷的人變少，癮君子也會變少。","不下50个乘客死了。"]],["household","'haushәuld","n. 一家人, 家庭, 家族, 王室\\na. 家庭的, 家常的, 王室的",["More and more married couples share household chores.","Nowadays, equal pay is not enough. Household responsibilities must also be distributed evenly."],["夫妻分擔家務的情況愈來愈普遍。","現在不止要男女薪金平等，而且還要平均分配家務。"]],["resolution",".rezә'lu:ʃәn","n. 解析, 决心, 坚定, 决定, 决议, 消除, 解答, 分解\\nn. 图形分辨率\\n[计] 图形分辨率",["I have made a resolution to keep a diary this year.","My New Year's resolution is to learn how to play the ocarina."],["这一年我下了决心写日记。","我新年的願望是學會吹奧卡利納塤。"]],["abortion","ә'bɒ:ʃәn","n. 流产, 堕胎, 失败, 夭折, 中止\\n[医] 流产, 小产; 顿挫",["The independent candidate took the abortion issue off his platform.","I've noticed that everyone who is for abortion has already been born."],["",""]],["witness","'witnis","n. 证人, 目击者, 证据, 证词\\nvt. 目击, 作证, 证明, 表明\\nvi. 作证人, 作为证据",["We speak that we do know, and testify that we have seen; and ye receive not our witness.","Have you ever served as a witness in a court case?"],["我們說我們所知道的，為我們所看到的作證；你們卻不接受我們的見證。","你曾是一宗司法案件的证人？"]],["apart","ә'pɑ:t","adv. 成零碎, 成距离, 分别地, 分离着\\na. 分离的",["However, apart from Buddhists, hardly anyone can consistently follow this principle.","Apart from the cost, it will take long to build the bridge."],["不过，除了佛教者以外，没有任何人可以一直遵循这个原则。","撇開費用不說，建這座橋也會耗費不少的時間。"]],["match","mætʃ","n. 比赛, 火柴, 对手\\nvt. 使相配, 使比赛, 与...竞争\\nvi. 结婚, 相配\\n[计] 比较",["Let's go to the stadium, because today's match will not be televised.","I do really want to watch this match, but I'm not sure if I have the time."],["一起去體育館吧，因爲今天的比賽沒有電視轉播。","我倒是很想去看这场比赛，可是不知道有没有时间。"]],["barely","'bєәli","adv. 几乎不",["The train is about to leave, we can barely catch it.","During droughts, farmers are barely able to eke out a living."],["火车马上就要开，我们勉强可以赶到。","發生旱災的時候，農民很難維持生計。"]],["sector","'sektә","n. 扇形, 部门, 部分, 函数尺, 象限仪, 段, 区段\\nvt. 把...分成扇形\\n[计] 扇面; 扇区; 段; 区段",["Algeria needs to train its public sector employees on new technologies, communication skills, and customer service.","In the United States, 20 million new jobs have been created during the past two decades, most of them in the service sector."],["阿爾及利亞需要對其公共部門員工進行新技術、溝通技巧和客服方面的培訓。",""]],["emphasize","'emfәsaiz","vt. 强调, 加强语气, 着重",["I want to emphasize this point in particular.","It is most important to emphasize that none of these processes are conscious."],["我想特别强调这一点。",""]],["representative",".repri'zentәtiv","n. 代表, 众议员, 典型\\na. 描写的, 表现的, 代理的, 代表的, 代议制的, 典型的",["As well as this, the horse is also representative of human talent.","If you would like to speak to a customer service representative, please press three."],["除此之外，馬還是人才的代名詞。","如果想與客服代表通話，請按三。"]],["beneath","bi'ni:θ","prep. 在...下方\\nadv. 在...下方",["She was closely related to the mighty Queen Zurline, and her home was beneath the shade of a widespreading oak.","To broaden your view, go see the underground shopping mall beneath People's Square."],["她與強大的祖琳女王有著密切的血緣關係，她的家在一棵枝繁葉茂的橡樹蔭下。","再要开眼界，去看人民广场下面的地下商场。"]],["incident","'insidәnt","n. 事件, 事变, 小事\\na. 附带的, 易于发生的, 外来的, 入射的",["This incident has made a great impact on the progress of the project.","After the incident I came to have a higher opinion of him."],["这个事件极大影响了项目进度。","這個事件過後我對他的評價很高。"]],["beside","bi'said","prep. 在旁边",["Worried, the shopkeeper ran over and kneeled beside Dima, who was breathing heavily - his forehead covered in sweat.","He looked young beside his brother."],["店主擔心地跑過去跪在迪馬身旁, 迪馬沉重地喘著氣, 他的額頭覆著一層汗。","他在他弟弟旁边显得很年轻。"]],["limited","'limitid","a. 有限制的, 有限的, 有限责任的\\nn. 特别快车",["The ambitions of some Americans are limited by failing schools and hidden prejudice and the circumstances of their birth.","Recently, this brand launched a series of limited edition underwear."],["一些美國人的抱負因學校教育不完美、隱性的偏見和出生環境而受到限制。","最近這個品牌推出了一系列限量版內衣。"]],["proud","praud","a. 骄傲的, 自大的, 自豪的, 辉煌的, 壮丽的",["You've both been very impressive today. I'm proud of you.","The people of London are very proud of this bridge."],["今天你们俩很让人印象深刻。我为你们感到骄傲。","倫敦人對這座橋感到非常自豪。"]],["flow","flәu","n. 流程, 流动, 流量, 洋溢, 泛滥, 涨潮\\nvi. 流动, 流泄, 畅流, 川流不息, 飘扬, 涌出\\nvt. 使流动, 淹没,…",["The immigrants entered the country in a steady flow.","Though tears may flow down your face, I won't look back."],["移民川流不息地进入这个国家。","任凭眼泪在你脸上滑过，我头也不回。"]],["faculty","'fækәlti","n. 才能, 能力, 全体教员, (大学的)系\\n[医] 能力, [大学]院系",["I study comparative religion in the arts faculty of the University of Turku.","I am Du Yu, a student at the Faculty of Computer Science and Technology, Qilu University of Technology (Shandong Academy of Sciences)."],["我在图尔库大学文化系学习宗教比较学。","我是杜宇，是一名来自齐鲁工业大学（山东省科学院）计算机科学与技术学部的学生。"]],["waste","weist","n. 浪费, 废物, 损耗, 消耗, 荒地, 垃圾, 地面风化物\\na. 废弃的, 荒芜的, 多余的\\nvt. 浪费, 消耗, 使荒芜\\n…",["Life being very short, we ought not to waste time.","What a waste to buy such an expensive machine even though he doesn't even know how to use computers."],["人生十分短暫，我們不應該浪費時間。","買這麼貴的機器真是浪費, 而他甚至不知道怎麼用電腦。"]],["increased","in'kri:st","a. 增强的（increase的过去分词）",["The number of cars driven in the city has increased.","The number of people suffering from heart disease has increased."],["在城市里行驶的车辆数量增加了。","遭受心脏病困扰的人数增加了。"]],["merely","'miәli","adv. 只",["Superstitions derive from the inability of men to acknowledge that coincidences are merely coincidences.","Even if an intelligent man loves a woman deeply, he will never show his love to her, but merely keep it in his heart."],["迷信之所以存在，是因為人無法接受巧合只是巧合而已。","聪明的男人就算爱极了一个女人，也只是藏在心里，绝不会将他的爱在她面前表现出来。"]],["mass","mæs","n. 块, 大多数, 质量, 大量, 群众, 弥撒\\na. 群众的, 大规模的, 整个的\\nvt. 使集合, 集中\\nvi. 聚集",["The application allows you to quickly calculate the ratio of body mass index - BMI.","Nowadays it's not possible to protect oneself against weapons of mass destruction."],["這項應用程序能讓你快速計算身高體重指數（BMI）。","如今已經没甚麼能防範大規模殺傷性武器了。"]],["experiment","ik'sperimәnt","n. 实验, 试验, 实验仪器\\nvi. 实验, 尝试",["This country successfully conducted a nuclear experiment.","This invention was the result of years of patient experiment."],["這個國家成功進行了一次核試驗。","這發明是多年來耐心實驗的成果。"]],["definitely","'definitli","adv. 明确无疑地, 清楚地",["If you go to Beijing, definitely have a look at Tiananmen Square.","If I tell him, then it's as good as done. He'll definitely take care of it."],["要是去北京的话，一定要看一下天安门广场。","我只要告诉他就好了，他肯定会干得到。"]],["bomb","bɒm","n. 炸弹\\nvt. 轰炸, 投弹于\\nvi. 失败",["FSI officer: \"Sir, there is a website where ANYONE can add a sentence in a foreign language!\". FSI president: \"What?! Bomb them!\".","A big bomb fell, and a great many people lost their lives."],["FSI人員:\"長官，有一個網站，任何人都可以加上一個外國語言的句子!\"。FSI主席:\"什麼? 炸掉他們!\"。","大炸彈從天而降，奪走了許多人的生命。"]],["liberal","'libәrәl","n. 自由主义者\\na. 慷慨的, 不拘泥的, 宽大的, 自由主义的",["There are two major political parties in the United States: the conservative Republican Party, and the liberal Democratic Party.","God destroyed the liberal cities of Sodom and Gomorra."],["美国有两大政党，一是较为保守的共和党，一是较为自由的民主党。",""]],["enormous","i'nɒ:mәs","a. 巨大的, 庞大的",["The atomic reactor generates enormous amounts of thermal energy.","Compiling a dictionary demands an enormous amount of time."],["原子反应堆发出大量的热能。","編字典是一項極花時間的工作。"]],["tone","tәun","n. 音调, 音质, 语调, 语气, 色调, 气氛, 状况, 思想状态\\nvt. 给...定色调, 增强, 使...的声调和谐, 定音调\\…",["I'm actually relatively good at written language, but with spoken language I often can't remember the tone on some word.","There was a sudden change in her tone."],["其实，书面语我搞得相当好，但是口语中，我经常会记不起来某个字的音调。","她声调突然变了。"]],["massive","'mæsiv","a. 大而重的, 宽大的, 宏伟的\\n[医] 大块的, 整块的, 大量的",["A massive earthquake of magnitude 8.8 hit the Japanese islands today.","This is the most massive structure I have ever seen."],["今天，8.8级的强大地震袭击了日本的岛屿。","这是我所见过的最大型的构造了。"]],["engineer",".endʒi'niә","n. 工程师, 工兵\\nvt. 设计, 监造, 精明地处理, 策划",["I cannot calculate this. I am not an engineer.","His dream is to become an aerospace engineer."],["我不是工程师，不会算这个。","他的梦想是成为航天航空工程师。"]],["wheel","hwi:l","n. 轮子, 车轮, 轮, 方向盘, 旋转, 机构, 重要人物\\nvt. 使旋转, 转动, 使转向\\nvi. 旋转, 转弯, 盘旋",["People from the so-called first world look at us Latinos as if we hadn't invented the wheel yet.","Seems like I'm the third wheel here. I should go."],["所谓的先进国家经常把拉丁美洲人看成石器时代的原始人。","好像我成电灯泡了。我该走了。"]],["decline","di'klain","n. 衰退, 跌落, 下降\\nvt. 使降低, 婉谢\\nvi. 下降, 衰落, 偏斜",["An increase in customer complaints could signal a decline in business.","It is very impolite of her to decline our invitation."],["顧客投訴量增加，可能代表生意正在走下坡。","她拒绝我们的邀请很不礼貌。"]],["invest","in'vest","vt. 投资, 花费, 笼罩, 授予\\nvi. 投资, 利用",["The government should invest more money in agriculture.","Don't be afraid to invest time and energy."],["政府应该加大对农业的投资。","不要害怕付出。"]],["cable","'keibl","n. 电缆, 海底电报, 缆, 索\\nvi. 打海底电报\\nvt. 发海底电报, 缚住\\n[计] 电缆",["The profane language used on network television makes many parents with young children not want to subscribe to cable.","A submarine cable was laid between the two countries."],["",""]],["towards","tә'wɔ:dz","prep. 向, 对于, 为了",["Many conservationists fear the continuing slaughter of whales is pushing these animals towards extinction.","The graduation from elementary school to middle school is regarded by some as the first step towards adulthood."],["许多自然环境保护主义者担心持续屠杀鲸鱼正推动这些动物走向灭绝。","有些人認為從小學升到中學是踏入成年的第一步。"]],["expose","ik'spәuz","vt. 使暴露, 使曝光, 揭穿, 陈列\\n[医] 暴露, 露置",["We should sometimes expose our bodies to the sun.","Do not throw or drop the console or accessories, or expose them to strong physical shock."],["我們閒時應該出外曬曬太陽。",""]],["rural","'ruәrәl","a. 乡下的, 田园的, 乡村风味的\\n[法] 农村的, 乡村的, 有关农业的",["Many Chinese people make good guests, especially those from rural areas.","It seems the rural area will be developed on a large scale."],["大多数中国人是非常好客的，尤其是住在农村的人。","农村好像要大规模发展了。"]],["narrow","'nærәu","n. 狭窄部分, 隘路\\na. 狭窄的, 仔细的, 有限的, 勉强的, 狭隘的, 手紧的\\nvi. 变窄\\nvt. 使变狭窄",["The gate is so narrow that the car can't pass through it.","Hutongs are a type of narrow street, most commonly associated with Beijing, China."],["门太窄了，这辆车通不过。","胡同是一种跟中国北京有关的窄街路。"]],["cream","kri:m","n. 乳酪, 奶油, 面霜\\n[医] 乳油, 乳皮; 乳膏, 霜",["If and only if the ice-cream is vanilla flavour will Xiao Wang eat it.","The area around the melting ice cream was crawling with ants."],["当且仅当冰淇淋是香草口味，小王会吃这个冰淇淋。","在那灘冰淇淋的周圍，有一群螞蟻在爬來爬去。"]],["secretary","'sekrәtәri","n. 秘书, 书记, 大臣\\n[经] 秘书",["The new secretary types about 70 words per minute.","My sister worked as a secretary before she got married."],["新來的秘書一分鐘可以打七十幾個字。","我的姐姐结婚前是个秘书."]],["gate","geit","n. 门, 牌楼, 大门, 通道, 闸\\nvt. 装门于\\n[计] 门; 栅",["The gate is so narrow that the car can't pass through it.","Let's see if we can get the gate closed."],["门太窄了，这辆车通不过。","让我们看看能不能把大门关上。"]],["solid","'sɒlid","n. 固体\\na. 坚硬的, 稳固的, 固体的, 实心的, 纯质的, 立体的, 立方的\\n[计] 原色",["Cheese is a solid food made from the milk of cows, goats, sheep, and other mammals.","Water is liquid. When it freezes, it becomes solid."],["奶酪是由母牛、山羊、绵羊或其它哺乳动物的奶加工制成的固体食物。","水是液体。冻起来就成了固体。"]],["noise","nɒiz","n. 噪音, 杂音, 响声, 喧闹\\nvt. 谣传\\nvi. 喧闹\\n[计] 噪声",["I can't concentrate on my work because of the noise.","Noise pollution could be avoided if only people were more sensitive to the environment."],["由于噪音，我无法集中精力工作了。","如果大家都懂得關心環境的話，就不會有噪音污染了。"]],["typically","'tipikәli","adv. 代表性地；作为特色地",["Whereas birds of prey typically do not, many birds have very large fields of vision.","Typically, a space station serviced a locale at least several light-years radially."],["",""]],["grass","græs","n. 草, 草原, 牧场\\n[医] 草, 禾本",["The cows were moving very slowly through the long green grass.","The blackbird found a little red worm in the green grass."],["牛群在鬱鬱蔥蔥的草地上緩緩移動著。","乌鸫在绿草中发现了一条小红虫。"]],["hat","hæt","n. 帽子\\nvt. 给...戴帽子",["My wife wants me to do away with this nice old hat.","Take your hat off when you enter a house of worship."],["我老婆想讓我把那頂頂好的老帽子給扔掉。","當你進入禮拜堂時，把你的帽子脫下來。"]],["unfortunately","ʌn'fɔ:tjjnәtli","adv. 恐怕, 不幸的是",["Everything has two sides: the good side and the bad side. Unfortunately, we usually see only one of them.","Unfortunately, by the time we got there the train had been gone for fifteen minutes."],["事物皆有兩面：好的一面和壞的一面。不幸的是，我們往往只能看見其中的一面。","可惜，我们来到的时候，火车已经十五分钟以前走了。"]],["legislation",".ledʒis'leiʃәn","n. 立法, 法律\\n[医] 立法, 法规",["The President of the United States has the power to veto and send back legislation.","A poll shows that an overwhelming majority is in favor of the legislation."],["美國總統有權否決與退回法案。",""]],["succeed","sәk'si:d","vi. 成功, 继承, 继续\\nvt. 继承, 接替",["We take it for granted that he will succeed in his business.","Whether you succeed or not depends on your own efforts."],["我们认为他的生意理所当然会获得成功。","你成功与否取决于你自身的努力。"]],["celebrate","'selibreit","v. 庆祝, 祝贺, 举行",["We celebrate November 28 as Tatoeba day because it is the day when Turkish, Esperanto and Greek were added.","In China, they celebrate New Year by the lunar calendar."],["我们将11月28日作为Tatoeba日来庆祝，因为土耳其语、世界语和希腊语是在那天被加上去的。","中国按阴历过新年。"]],["achievement","ә'tʃi:vmәnt","n. 完成, 成就, 功业",["\"Literary composition is a great achievement that concerns the ruling of a state, a splendid affair of eternal standing\".","The moon landing was a monumental achievement."],["\"文學作品是關係到一個國家統治的偉大成就，以及永恆地位的輝煌事跡\"。","登月是一項里程碑式的成就。"]],["fishing","'fiʃiŋ","n. 钓鱼, 鱼业\\na. 钓鱼的",["We were granted the privilege of fishing in this bay.","The other day I went fishing for the first time in my life."],["我们得到了在这个海湾内捕鱼的特权。","前几天人生第一次去钓鱼了。"]],["accuse","ә'kju:z","vt. 指责, 控告, 归咎于\\nvi. 指责, 控告",["How can you accuse me of such a thing? I would never lay a hand on my child.","You can't accuse him of theft without having proof."],["你怎么敢指责我做这种事？我决不会动手打我的儿子。","没有证据你们不能指责他偷东西。"]],["useful","'ju:sful","a. 有用的, 有益的\\n[机] 有用的, 有效的",["This is a useful book and, what is more, it is not expensive.","The only useful answers are those that raise new questions."],["這本書很實用，而且價錢也很相宜。","只有能提出新问题的回答才是有用的回答。"]],["reject","ri'dʒekt","n. 被拒之人, 被弃之物, 不合格品, 次品\\nvt. 拒绝, 抵制, 否决, 驳回, 丢弃, 呕出",["We need to decide whether to accept or reject your request.","It would be reasonable for him to reject that proposal."],["",""]],["talent","'tælәnt","n. 天才, 才能, 有才干的人, 天资",["With all the talent he has, he never makes any effort.","As well as this, the horse is also representative of human talent."],["他雖然很有才能，但卻不肯努力上進。","除此之外，馬還是人才的代名詞。"]],["taste","teist","n. 味道, 品味, 味觉, 感受, 体验, 爱好, 审美, 少量\\nvt. 尝, 察觉...的味道, 体会\\nvi. 品尝, 察觉味道,…",["This wine has a fruitier taste than the one we tasted before.","Hsinchu's meatballs and rice noodles are very famous, attracting many tourists to taste them."],["这种葡萄酒比我们之前尝过的那种有更多果香。","新竹的貢丸和米粉非常有名，吸引不少遊客品嚐。"]],["characteristic",".kærәktә'ristik","n. 特性, 特征, 特色\\na. 特性的, 特有的, 有特色的\\n[计] 阶; 指数",["The aurora is a phenomenon characteristic of the polar regions.","I got over the difficulty with my characteristic tenacity."],["極光是極地特有的自然現象。","我凭韧性克服了困难。"]],["milk","milk","n. 奶, 乳状物\\nvt. 挤乳, 榨取\\nvi. 产乳",["Cheese is a solid food made from the milk of cows, goats, sheep, and other mammals.","You cannot separate the milk from the coffee once you put it in."],["奶酪是由母牛、山羊、绵羊或其它哺乳动物的奶加工制成的固体食物。","你一把它放進去，就不能把牛奶和咖啡分開了。"]],["escape","i'skeip","n. 逃亡, 避难设备, 逃跑\\nvi. 逃脱, 避开, 溜走\\nvt. 逃避, 避免, 被...忘掉",["They went to Edinburgh to escape from the summer heat.","If you are patient in one moment of anger, you will escape a hundred days of sorrow."],["他们去了爱丁堡避暑。","忍一時,風平浪靜. 讓一步, 海闊天空."]],["cast","kɑ:st. kæst","n. 演员阵容, 投掷, 铸件, 预测, 特性\\nvt. 投, 掷, 抛, 脱落, 铸, 使弯曲, 计算\\nvi. 投, 计算, 浇铸成型",["The demon grabbed my sister and, with howling laughter, cast her into a bottomless pit.","The wicked witch cast a spell on the man and turned him into a bug."],["惡魔一把抓住了我的妹妹，一邊猙獰地狂笑着，一邊把她丟進了一個無底洞裏。","惡毒的巫婆在男人身上施了咒語，把他變成了一隻蟲子。"]],["sentence","'sentәns","n. 句子, 命题, 宣判\\nvt. 宣判, 判决\\n[计] 句子",["Strictly speaking, this sentence is grammatically incorrect.","A capital letter is used at the beginning of a sentence."],["严格地讲,这句话语法上有错误。","一個大寫字母被使用在一個句子的開頭。"]],["unusual",".ʌn'ju:ʒu:l","a. 不寻常的, 罕见的, 与众不同的",["He is endowed with unusual ability in mathematics.","We were faced with an unusual situation because of the accident."],["他天生具有不尋常的數學能力。","那场事故让我们陷入了不寻常的局势。"]],["closely","'klәusli","adv. 接近地",["She was closely related to the mighty Queen Zurline, and her home was beneath the shade of a widespreading oak.","The amount of paper produced by a country is closely related to its cultural standards."],["她與強大的祖琳女王有著密切的血緣關係，她的家在一棵枝繁葉茂的橡樹蔭下。","一个国家纸的产量和它的文明程度密切相关。"]],["convince","kәn'vins","vt. 说服, 使相信\\n[法] 使确信, 使信服, 使人认识错误",["She couldn't convince him to write a song for her.","She was asked to convince him to get his son or someone else to paint the house."],["她没能說服他爲她寫首歌。","她被要求去说服他以让他或者他的儿子或者是别的人来粉刷屋子。"]],["height","hait","n. 高度, 海拔, 高地, 顶点\\n[化] 高度",["She's a professor whose works you could stack up to head height.","The teacher lined the children up in order of height."],["那位是一个著作等身的教授。","老师按照身高给孩子们排队。"]],["physician","fi'ziʃәn","n. 医师, 内科医师, 解除痛苦者\\n[医] 主治医师",["The physician prescribed his patient some medicine.","My physician advised me to refrain from alcohol for the time being."],["医生给他的病人开了一些药。",""]],["assess","ә'ses","vt. 估定, 对...征税, 评定\\n[经] 估计, 估价, 确定(税款罚款等)的金额",["The purpose of this interview is to assess whether or not you are suitable for the company.","She can assess investments very accurately."],["这次面试的意义是评断你适不适合这家公司。","她能很准确地评估投资。"]],["plenty","'plenti","n. 充分, 很多, 丰富\\na. 很多的, 足够的, 丰富的",["Actually, the present method has plenty of room for improvement.","The doctor insisted that the patient get plenty of rest."],["其實現時的方法還有很大的改善空間。","医生坚持病人获得充分的休息。"]],["virtually","'vә:tʃuәli","adv. 事实上",["Unemployment in this part of the country is virtually nonexistent.","Learning probably takes place in virtually every activity in which we take part."],["",""]],["addition","ә'diʃәn","n. 加法, 增加的人(或物)\\n[计] 加法",["In addition, we will issue the 'employee of the month' award afterwards.","In addition to being a great statesman, Churchill was a great writer."],["另外，之后我们会颁发“每月最佳员工”奖。","邱吉爾不僅是一位偉大的政治家，還是一位偉大的作家。"]],["sharp","ʃɑ:p","n. 半升音调, 利刃, 骗子\\na. 锋利的, 明显的, 敏锐的, 急剧的, 尖刻的, 严厉的, 刺耳的, 精明的\\nadv. 锐利地,…",["All of a sudden, I felt a sharp pain in my stomach.","His observations are sharp, but he doesn't say much."],["我突然肚痛得要命。","他的觀察是敏銳的，但他沒有說太多。"]],["creative","kri:'eitiv","a. 有创造力的, 创作的, 产生的",["I don't know how long I'll have to wait before my creative ability improves.","I don't know how long I'll have to wait before I become more creative."],["不知道要等多长时间，我的创作能力才能进步。","不知道要等多长时间，我的创作能力才能进步。"]],["lower","'lәuә","a. 低的, 下级的, 下层的\\nvi. 降低, 跌落, 减弱\\nvt. 放下, 降下, 减弱, 贬低",["When the pressure is lower, the boiling point is lower.","The government clearly stated its intention to lower taxes."],["压力低了，沸点就低。","政府明确宣布了降税的意图。"]],["approve","ә'pru:v","vt. 赞同, 核准, 为...提供证据\\nvi. 赞许",["Father will never approve of my marriage.","That's why I don't approve of your plan."],["父亲绝不会赞成我结婚。","那就是我不赞同你的计划的原因。"]],["explanation",".eksplә'neiʃәn","n. 解释, 说明, 辩解, 表明\\n[经] 解释, 注释, 说明",["The students didn't understand the teacher's explanation.","The scientists have not found any explanation for the mysterious phenomenon."],["学生们别明白了老师的解释。","科學家們尚未找到對這神秘現象的解釋。"]],["gay","gei","a. 欢快的, 艳丽的, 快乐的, 放荡的",["A female friend of mine loves to go to gay bars with me.","Gay marriage is permitted in less than 20% of countries."],["我的一个女性朋友喜欢跟我一起去同志酒吧。","世界上允许同性婚姻的国家不超过20%。"]],["honor","'ɒnә","n. 荣誉, 头衔, 信用, 尊敬, 名誉, 阁下, 勋章\\nvt. 尊敬, 授予荣誉, 承兑, 实践",["A farewell meeting was held in honor of Mr Jones.","In honor of all the hard work we raised a toast to our first day in our new home!"],["舉行了一場歡送會以紀念瓊斯先生。","感謝大家的辛苦付出，我們為第一天入住新家舉杯同慶！"]],["proper","'prɒpә","a. 适当的, 固有的, 高尚的, 专属的\\nadv. 完全地, 彻底地",["Bicycles wear out, of course, but with proper care they may be made to last a long time.","A proper test does not allow the use of correction fluid."],["自行车当然会磨损，但只要你保养得好，就能骑很长一段时间。","正規的考試不允許使用塗改液。"]],["campus","'kæmpәs","n. 校园, 大学生活",["I took him to the most expensive restaurant on campus.","In the center of the university campus stands the statue of the founder."],["我把他带到校区里最贵的餐馆去了。","創校人的雕像在大學校園的中心矗立著。"]],["guilty","'gilti","a. 犯罪的, 有过失的, 自觉有错的, 心虚的\\n[法] 有罪的, 犯罪的, 自觉有罪的",["The news article painted the defendant as a guilty man, even though he had been proven innocent.","If he is innocent, it follows that his wife is guilty."],["该报文章中将被告人描述成一个罪魁祸首，尽管他已经被证明是无辜的了。","如果他是清白的，那他妻子就有罪。"]],["acquire","ә'kwaiә","vt. 获得, 学到\\n[电] 目标锁定",["You have to acquire real skills, not just superficial knowledge.","If I had the money, I would immediately acquire this computer."],["你要學的是實實在在的技能，而不單是表面的知識。","我要是有钱，立马就买这台电脑。"]],["technical","'teknikl","a. 技术上的, 专门的, 工业的, 严格根据法律的\\n[化] 技巧",["We provide broad services to the computer end users, based on our experience and technical expertise.","Because of some technical problem, a movie was shown in place of the announced program."],["",""]],["compete","kәm'pi:t","vi. 竞争, 对抗",["He did his best but soon saw that he could not compete with such a fast runner.","Family members should not compete against each other."],["",""]],["plus","plʌs","prep. 加上, 加, 外加\\na. 正的, 附加的\\nn. 正号, 加号, 附加额, 正数, 增益\\n[计] 正差",["I'd like to know if I can write \"One plus one equals three.\" on Tatoeba.","His remuneration consists of a base salary plus commissions."],["請問我在Tatoeba上能不能寫「一加一等於三。」？","他的薪水包括基本工資和提成。"]],["immigrant","'imigrәnt","n. 移民\\na. 移入的, 移民的",["Layla was the first immigrant woman sentenced to death.","I'm only an immigrant trying to protect the English language from its native speakers."],["",""]],["weak","wi:k","a. 不牢固的, 弱的, 虚弱的, 软弱的, 无力的, 无权力的, (论据等)不充分的\\n[经] 疲软的",["She has been ill for a long time and she is still too weak to get about.","The weak point of this book is that it's less than persuasive when the married author recommends not being married."],["她病了很久，现在还很虚弱，无法随意走动。","這本書有一個弱點 ﹣ 作者自己結了婚，但卻建議別人不要結婚，沒有甚麼說服力。"]],["illegal","i'li:gәl","a. 违法的, 不合规定的\\n[经] 非法的, 犯规的",["Bicycles traveling to the right of automobiles is illegal.","Russia started its illegal and unjustifiable war of aggression against Ukraine, and Russia can end it."],["自行车在汽车的右侧行驶是不合法的。","俄羅斯對烏克蘭發動了非法、不公義的侵略戰爭，而俄羅斯應該終止這一切。"]],["hi","hai","interj. 喂",["There's no point saying \"Hi, how are you?\" to me if you have nothing else to say.","Hi, I have an appointment with the general manager. This is my interview notice."],["如果你没有其它可说的，那对我说“嗨，你怎么样？”就毫无意义。","您好，我跟總經理有約十點見面，這是我的面試通知。"]],["alternative","ɒ:l'tә:nәtiv","n. 两者择一, 供替代的选择\\na. 两者择一的, 供选择的\\n[计] 选择对象",["Don't change sentences that are correct. You can, instead, submit natural-sounding alternative translations.","Don't include multiple alternative words inside the same sentence."],["请勿更改没有错误的句子。请添加一个新的更自然的翻译。","在同一句中不要包含多个可选单词。"]],["column","'kɒlәm","n. 专栏, 圆柱, 纵队, 列, 柱形物\\n[计] 列, 柱形图",["The opinion column discusses the importance of voting.","Moscow residents witnessed a large column of military equipment moving on Tverskaya Street."],["意見欄討論了投票的重要性，",""]],["interaction",".intәr'ækʃәn","n. 交互作用, 交感\\n[计] 交互作用",["By switching your lover from 3D to 2D, you may successfully reduce all social-interaction-related costs.","Whether written or spoken, formally monologic or dialogic, discourse is studied as interaction."],["把恋人从3D换成2D可以有效地降低交际所需的费用。",""]],["personality",".pә:sә'næliti","n. 个性, 人格, (团体、地方、国家)特有特性, 名人\\n[医] 人格; 个性",["There are a lot of things you don't know about my personality.","His claim is that there is a close relation between birth order and personality."],["我的个性还有很多方面是你不了解的。","他主張的是出生的先後次序和個性有很密切的關係。"]],["curriculum","kә'rikjulәm","n. 课程\\n[医] 课程, 学程",["It should be clear that the curriculum reform is mandatory in order to enhance interdisciplinary research.","That university's curriculum covers natural science and social science."],["",""]],["signal","'signl","n. 信号, 暗号, 近因, 导火线\\nvt. 向...作信号, 标志, 用信号通知\\nvi. 发信号\\na. 作为信号的, 显著的\\n[…",["What are you saying? I cannot hear, the signal here is too bad.","An increase in customer complaints could signal a decline in business."],["你说什么？我听不见，这里信号太差了。","顧客投訴量增加，可能代表生意正在走下坡。"]],["king","kiŋ","n. 国王, 君主\\nvt. 使...成为君主\\nvi. 君临, 统治",["We are here in the name of Jesus Christ and King Charles.","With the heirless king going crazy and royal family poisoned, the general of the army finally had his chance to usurp the throne."],["我們以耶穌基督和查理斯國王之名來到這裡。","随着无继承人的国王的发疯和王室家族的中毒，将军终于有机会篡夺王位。"]],["passenger","'pæsindʒә","n. 乘客, 旅客\\n[经] 乘客, 旅客",["Tom put the large picnic basket on the passenger seat next to him.","A passenger fainted, but the stewardess brought him round."],["汤姆把那个大野餐篮子放在他旁边的乘客座位上。",""]],["assistance","ә'sistәns","n. 协助, 援助\\n[经] 援助, 帮助",["Your assistance is indispensable for us.","The governor decided to provide assistance for the victims."],["您的帮助对我们来说是必不可少的。",""]],["forever","fә'revә","adv. 永远",["It would take forever for me to explain everything.","Nothing lasts forever, not for a long time, anyone can find an excuse to go ahead."],["要都解释的话，需要一辈子的时间。","没有什么永远，没有什么很久，找个借口谁都可以先走。"]],["regard","ri'gɑ:d","n. 关心, 注意, 尊敬, 关系, 问候\\nvt. 视为, 注意, 考虑, 和...有关, 看待\\nvi. 注视, 注意",["That company hires people without regard to race, religion, or nationality.","Apple is still very secretive with regard to the release date and the price."],["这家公司不分种族、宗教或国籍雇用人。","苹果在发售日期和价格上口风仍然很紧。"]],["israeli","iz'reili","a. 以色列的, 以色列人(语)的\\nn. 以色列人",["This United Nations resolution calls for the withdrawal of Israeli armed forces from territories occupied in the recent conflict.","So far there has been only one participant who won one million Israeli Shekels in \"Who Wants to Be a Millionaire\" in Israel."],["",""]],["twenty","'twenti","num. 二十, 二十个",["Where is your twenty? I'll give you five bucks for it.","China is about twenty-five times as large as Japan."],["你的二十塊在哪裡? 我給你五塊錢找到它。","中国的版图大概是日本的二十五倍。"]],["knock","nɒk","n. 敲, 敲打, 敲门\\nv. 敲击, 互撞, 攻击",["You are always to knock before you come into my room.","I don't really like Xiaomi phones, and I think that they're for losers. They're like knock-offs."],["你進入我的房間之前都要敲門。","我似乎不太喜欢小米，我觉得小米是屌丝用的手机，就是个山寨机。"]],["lab","læb","n. 实验室, 研究室\\n[医] 凝乳酶",["At first the forensics team thought that they'd discovered human blood, only to find out later, at the lab, that it was bovine.","The natural world is always much more complex than formulations in the lab or blueprints in the design office."],["一开始法医团队以为他们发现了人血，但后来才在实验室里发现这原来是牛血。","自然界从来都比试验室的配方或设计院的图纸里所反映的要复杂得多。"]],["wrap","ræp","n. 外套, 围巾, 包裹物, 限制, 约束, 秘密, 换行\\nvt. 包装, 卷, 缠绕, 包, 裹, 覆盖, 遮蔽, 隐藏, 掩护\\n…",["Can you wrap it up for me? It's a gift.","Are you going to eat here or do you want us to wrap it?"],["可以帮我包起来吗？我拿来送人的。","您是在这儿用餐，还是给您打包带走？"]],["display","dis'plei","n. 显示, 陈列, 炫耀, 显示器\\nvt. 陈列, 显示, 表现, 夸示\\n[计] 显示器; 显示",["Sociopaths rarely display remorse or feelings of guilt for their crimes.","What's wrong with this projector? It won't display anything."],["反社会者极少为他们的罪行显露懊悔或有罪恶的感觉。","這個投影儀怎麼了？什麼都放不出來。"]],["criticism","'kritisizm","n. 批评, 评论, 非难\\n[法] 批判, 批评, 评论",["The more public the work, the more criticism you receive.","Tom found Mary's constant criticism of him hard to cope with."],["工作越公开，批评就越多。","汤姆认为和经常批评他的玛丽很难相处。"]],["asset","'æset","n. 资产, 有益的东西",["She will be an asset to the Purchasing Department.","I'm sure you'll be a valuable asset to our company."],["",""]],["depression","di'preʃәn","n. 不景气, 消沉, 沮丧, 洼地\\n[医] 抑郁[症], 阻抑, 压低, 凹, 窝, 衰退, 俯角",["After Tom lost his job, he started to gamble to cope with his depression.","She sometimes goes into a mood of depression."],["湯姆失業後，為了排遣鬱悶的心情而開始了賭博。","她有時變得心情抑鬱。"]],["spiritual","'spiritʃuәl","a. 精神上的, 神圣的, 崇高的, 高尚的, 鬼的, 招魂术的\\nn. 有关教会的事",["Not material, but spiritual things determine our life.","He taught contemplation as a means of spiritual purification and the attainment of the Dao, a principle that signifies the highest spiritual ideals of mankind."],["我们的生活不是由物质，而是由精神来决定的。","他为精神的洁净和获得道的方法教深思，道是表示人类最高的精神理想的一个原则。"]],["musical","'mju:zikl","n. 音乐片, 音乐舞台剧\\na. 音乐的, 声音美妙的, 喜爱音乐的",["Mozart: one of the great musical prodigies of all time.","He seems very interested in musical theatre and the like, and he also seems quite adept."],["莫札特: 一個永遠的音樂奇才","他好像对音乐剧什么的很感兴趣，而且还非常内行。"]],["prayer","prєә. 'preiә","n. 祈祷, 恳求, 祷辞, 祈祷者",["Your team doesn't have a prayer to win the championship game.","They offer an earnest prayer on the evening of December 24."],["",""]],["journalist","'dʒә:nәlist","n. 新闻记者, 从事新闻杂志业的人",["The journalist wanted to write an article that would draw public attention to the issue.","Mr Tani is not so much a scholar as a journalist."],["記者想寫一篇文章，以便引起公眾對那件事情的注意。","Tani 先生與其說是學者，倒不如說是新聞工作者。"]],["suspect","sә'spekt","n. 被怀疑者, 嫌疑犯\\na. 令人怀疑的, 不可信的, 可疑的\\nv. 怀疑, 猜想",["I suspect Koreans must have trained their wrist strength to use those iron chopsticks so well.","I suspect that they water down the beer in that pub."],["我懷疑韓國人是練過腕力才用得好那種鐵筷。","我怀疑那家酒馆的啤酒兑水了。"]],["scholar","'skɒlә","n. 学者, 奖学金获得者, 有文化者, 学习者",["He is a great statesman, and what is more a great scholar.","People thought him to be a great scholar."],["他是一個偉大的政治家，更重要的是，他也是一個偉大的學者。","人们认为他是一名伟大的学者。"]],["warning","'wɒ:niŋ","n. 警告, 预告, 预兆, 通知\\n[法] 警告, 警戒, 预告; 警告的, 注意的",["For example, if a chain-smoking teacher cautions a pupil for smoking, that warning is self-contradictory.","In the London underground there is a warning to \"mind the gap\" when boarding the train."],["舉例說，如果一個老師警告學生不要吸煙，但自己卻每天吸個不停，那麼這個警告就是自相矛盾的了。","在倫敦地鐵，上車時會有「注意間隙」提醒。"]],["climate","'klaimit","n. 气候, 社会趋势, 气候区\\n[医] 气候",["The climate here is very similar to that of England.","The climate of New Zealand is similar to that of Japan."],["這裏的氣候和英國十分相似。","新西兰和日本的气候差不多一样。"]],["cheese","tʃi:z","n. 乳酪\\n[化] 干酪",["Cheese is a solid food made from the milk of cows, goats, sheep, and other mammals.","If cheese is good, but the cake is a lie, what is a cheesecake? A good lie."],["奶酪是由母牛、山羊、绵羊或其它哺乳动物的奶加工制成的固体食物。","如果乳酪是好的, 但是蛋糕是個謊言, 什麼是乳酪蛋糕? 一個好的謊言。"]],["observation",".ɒbzә:'veiʃәn","n. 观察, 注意, 观测, 观察力\\n[化] 观察",["Her acute observation skills make her a very suitable photographer.","What is especially important is the observation of the traditional values."],["她因为敏锐的观察力，很适合当一名摄影师。",""]],["payment","'peimәnt","n. 付款, 支付的款项(或实物), 偿还, 报应, 惩罚\\n[经] 支付, 缴纳, 支付款额",["We will make the payment by bank transfer.","Hanako made the final payment on her car, and felt very satisfied."],["我们会用银行转帐付款。",""]],["childhood","'tʃaildhud","n. 孩童时期\\n[医] 儿童期",["In nostalgic moments we may tend to think of childhood as a time of almost unbroken happiness.","From childhood I was fond of reading, and all the little money that ever came into my hands was laid out in books."],["在懷念舊日時光的時刻，我們可能往往想起童年像是有著幾乎完整幸福的一段時期。","從小開始我就很喜歡讀書，那時有的錢雖然不多，但也都全花在書本上。"]],["sir","sә:","n. 先生, 阁下",["When Sir Alex Ferguson saw that his players were getting tired, he always substituted them.","FSI officer: \"Sir, there is a website where ANYONE can add a sentence in a foreign language!\". FSI president: \"What?! Bomb them!\"."],["当亚历克斯·弗格森看到自己的球员劳累时，他总是叫替补上场。","FSI人員:\"長官，有一個網站，任何人都可以加上一個外國語言的句子!\"。FSI主席:\"什麼? 炸掉他們!\"。"]],["permit","pә'mit","n. 许可证, 许可, 执照, 通行证\\nvt. 允许, 容许, 可能, 使放手做\\nvi. 容许, 给以机会, 提供可能",["The two birds built a nest without a building permit.","The landlord won't permit him to paint the door red."],["這兩隻鳥在沒有建築許可的情況下築了巢。",""]],["definition",".defi'niʃәn","n. 定义, 精确度, 清晰度\\n[计] 清晰度; 清晰度",["To give a definition of a word is more difficult than to give an illustration of its usage.","My camera can shoot high-definition video."],["要為一個字下定義比為字的用法舉例更困難。","我的录像机可以拍高清视频。"]],["cigarette",".sigә'ret","n. 香烟, 纸烟",["Someone told me that every cigarette you smoke takes seven minutes away from your life.","At one time, people would not have hesitated to light up a cigarette in stations, restaurants, or hospital waiting rooms."],["有人告訴過我，我們每抽一根煙，壽命就會縮短七分鐘。","在以前的人的眼中，在車站、餐廳、醫院的等候室裏抽煙並沒有甚麼問題。"]],["priority","prai'ɒriti","n. 优先权, 优先\\n[计] 优先级",["Camera quality is a top priority for me.","Our top priority is to settle this dispute once and for all, so we are ready to meet them halfway."],["相機品質是我的優先考量。",""]],["bread","bred","n. 面包, 生计, 食物\\nvt. 裹以面包屑",["Modern healthy eating experts put emphasis on eating wholemeal bread and eating more vegetables.","I just remembered that I was supposed to buy a loaf of bread."],["现代的健康饮食专家强调要吃全麦面包，多吃蔬菜。","我才想起来我之前该买个面包。"]],["creation","kri:'eiʃәn","n. 创造, 创作物, 发明\\n[化] 产生",["The creation of most schools was not to transform society, but to reconstruct society.","Love is what gives joy to all creation."],["大部分学校的创建不是用来转变社会，而是用来重建社会的。","爱把喜悦带给所有的生命。"]],["graduate","'grædʒueit","n. 毕业生, 量杯\\na. 已得学位的, 研究生的, 毕业的\\nvi. 毕业, 得学位, 逐渐变为\\nvt. 准予...毕业, 授予..…",["I've got a feeling that Tom won't graduate this year.","If you pass this test, you could graduate next month."],["我觉得汤姆今年不会毕业。","如果你通過這個考試，你下個月就可以畢業了。"]],["request","ri'kwest","n. 请求, 需要, 申请书\\nvt. 请求, 要求, 邀请\\n[计] 请求",["Under the circumstances I cannot allow the request.","They refused to talk to me in spite of my earnest request."],["在這種情況之下,我不能允許這個要求。","尽管我恳切地要求，他们还是拒绝跟我说话。"]],["emotion","i'mәuʃәn","n. 情绪, 激动, 强烈的情感\\n[医] 情绪, 情感",["Any emotion, if it is sincere, is involuntary.","So great was his emotion that he could not utter a word."],["任何情绪，只要它是真诚的，就说明它是发自内心的自然流露。",""]],["scream","skri:m","n. 尖叫声\\nvi. 尖叫, 大笑, 尖啸, 令人震惊\\nvt. 尖叫着说, 大叫大嚷着要求",["I would scream very loudly if I saw a scorpion in my room.","She heard him scream, so she ran into his bedroom."],["",""]],["dramatic","drә'mætik","a. 戏剧性的, 生动的",["Don't take that dramatic attitude all of a sudden.","In music or speaking, a pause is frequently used for dramatic effect."],["",""]],["universe","'ju:nivә:s","n. 宇宙, 星系, (思想等)范围",["Mathematics is the part of science you could continue to do if you woke up tomorrow and discovered the universe was gone.","Any universe simple enough to be understood is too simple to produce a mind able to understand it."],["就算你明天起床，發現整個宇宙消失了，還有一門科學是可以繼續研究的 ﹣ 那就是數學了。","任何簡單到可以被了解的宇宙便太過簡單而無法產生可以了解它的心靈。"]],["gap","gæp","n. 缝隙, 缺口, 间断, 间距, 通用汇编程序\\nvt. 打开缺口, 造成缝隙\\nvi. 豁开\\n[计] 通用汇编程序, 图形应用程序…",["In the London underground there is a warning to \"mind the gap\" when boarding the train.","Please mind the gap between the train and the platform."],["在倫敦地鐵，上車時會有「注意間隙」提醒。","請小心月台與車廂之間的空隙。"]],["deeply","'di:pli","adv. 深刻地, 在深处, 深沉地",["I'm a deeply religious man and believe in life after death.","We were deeply impressed by the lecturer's eloquent speech."],["我是一個虔誠的教徒，我相信死後的生命。","演讲者精彩的演说给我们留下了深刻的印象。"]],["excellent","'ekslәnt","a. 优良的, 杰出的, 出色的",["He was an excellent scientist, and what is more, was a great poet.","He is an excellent fixer, and has always been regarded as such."],["他是一位優秀的科學家，更是一位偉大的詩人。","他是一個出色的調停者，並一直被人認為如此。"]],["prosecutor","'prɒsikju:tә","n. 实行者, 告发者, 公诉人\\n[法] 原告, 起诉人, 检举人",["The prosecutor asked me a leading question.","It's a love story that unfolds between an unlikely pair, a public prosecutor from a good family and a modern high school girl."],["检察官问了我一个引导性的问题。",""]],["lucky","'lʌki","a. 幸运的, 吉祥的, 好运的, 侥幸的",["It was lucky I was able to speak to Tom before he left for Boston.","My mother prefers the arbitrary selection of the lottery machines over my lucky numbers."],["在汤姆前往波士顿之前，我能和他说话可真算是走了运。","我母亲宁愿选彩票机上的任意数字，也不选我的幸运数字。"]],["drag","dræg","n. 拖, 拖累\\nv. 拖累, 拖拉, 沉重缓慢地走, 拖动\\n[计] 拖动",["The stage charisma of drag performers compels audiences to reconsider their own stereotypes.","The Fates lead the willing, and drag the unwilling."],["反串秀者的舞台魅力使觀眾不禁重新審視自己的刻板印象。",""]],["airline","'єәlain","n. 航线, 航线的设备, 航空公司",["The airline provided free accommodation to stranded passengers as a goodwill gesture.","This morning, my friend and I went to buy airline tickets."],["",""]],["library","'laibrәri","n. 图书馆, 藏书, 库\\n[计] 库",["Any student with an I.D. card has access to the library.","Taking the group of children to the library was no problem."],["所有持有學生證的學生均可進入圖書館。","带孩子团体去图书馆一点问题都没有。"]],["agenda","ә'dʒendә","pl. 议程, 日常工作事项\\n[计] 待议事件",["Let's proceed with the items on the agenda.","We'll release the final agenda on the morning of Monday, January 20, so please reply quickly."],["讓我們繼續進行議程上的項目。",""]],["recover","ri'kʌvә","vt. 重新获得, 恢复, 复原, 拯救\\nvi. 痊愈, 复原, 胜诉\\n[计] 恢复",["Anyone who can recover the money he lost will receive a reward.","There's no chance that he'll recover."],["凡能将他遗失的钱寻回者可得到酬金。","对于他的康复没有任何希望。"]],["factory","'fæktәri","n. 工厂, 产生地, 代理店\\n[经] 工厂, 代理店, 商行在国外的代理处",["Possibly the factory will be closed down next week.","The factory waste gave rise to serious environmental pollution."],["下周工厂可能会关。","工厂的废料导致了严重的环境污染。"]],["selection","si'lekʃәn","n. 选择, 选文, 精选品\\n[医] 选择, 淘汰",["My mother prefers the arbitrary selection of the lottery machines over my lucky numbers.","The task of philosophy is to recover the totality obscured by the selection."],["我母亲宁愿选彩票机上的任意数字，也不选我的幸运数字。",""]],["primarily","'praimәrili","adv. 主要地, 首先地",["The economist and statistician based in Ivory Coast says commercial trade in the region is primarily conducted with France.","If economic globalization is inevitable, it should primarily serve humanity rather than the interests of trans-national corporations."],["這位常駐科特迪瓦的經濟學家兼統計學家表示，該地區的商業貿易主要與法國進行。","如果全球化无法避免，应该首先为人服务而不是为跨国公司的利益服务。"]],["roof","ru:f","n. 屋顶, 室顶\\nvt. 给...盖屋顶, 遮蔽",["Tom is going to shovel the snow off the roof for us.","Tom is clambering about on the roof, repairing the chimney stack."],["汤姆正要为我们铲掉屋顶上的雪。","汤姆在屋顶一边爬一边修理烟囱。"]],["unable","ʌn'eibl","a. 不能的, 不会的\\n[法] 无能力的, 无资格的, 没有办法的",["I tried to reach you on the phone, but I was unable to get through.","In the end, because of the disease, he became unable to walk and had to use a motorized wheelchair to get around."],["我打了電話給你，但卻接不通。","最後，他的病奪去了他走路的能力，想去哪兒也要用電動輪椅來代步。"]],["expense","ik'spens","n. 费用, 代价, 开支, 损失\\n[经] 费用, 开支, 将支出转为费用",["John finished the work at the expense of his health.","The total expense for the project amounts to one hundred million yen."],["約翰犧牲自己的健康，完成工作。","計劃的總開支為一億円。"]],["initiative","i'niʃiәtiv","n. 主动行动, 首创精神, 主动权\\na. 自发的, 起始的",["He takes the initiative in helping his mother do the housework.","The initiative measurably improved quality of life for the villagers."],["他主动帮他妈妈做家务。","計劃使村民的生活改善了不少。"]],["diet","'daiәt","n. 日常饮食, 议会\\nvt. 照规定饮食\\nvi. 忌食",["Fruits and vegetables are essential to a balanced diet.","We're going to eat a lot tonight so I hope you're not on a diet."],["蔬果对平衡饮食必不可少。","我们今晚会吃很多，所以我希望你没有在节食。"]],["arrest","ә'rest","n. 逮捕, 监禁\\nvt. 拘捕, 抑制, 吸引, 阻止",["We used emergency measures to revive the cardiac arrest patient.","No one shall be subjected to arbitrary arrest, detention or exile."],["",""]],["funding","'fʌndiŋ","[经] 债务转期",["The industry is heavily dependent on government funding.","A meteor exploded over Russia, yet no one cares enough to provide funding for meteor deflection technology."],["",""]],["therapy","'θerәpi","n. 治疗\\n[医] 疗法, 治疗",["Demand for occupational therapy has surged in recent years.","A great many people were opposed to gene therapy in terms of ethics."],["这几年对作业疗法的需求在迅速增长。",""]],["wash","wɒʃ","n. 洗, 洗涤, 冲洗, 洗的衣服, 冲积物, 洼地\\nvt. 洗, 洗涤, 洗清, 用水冲洗, 流过, 弄湿, 粉刷, 镀金属薄层于\\…",["When you leave the bathroom, you should wash your hands.","The girl did not like to wash dishes, but she made the best of it."],["离开厕所前应该洗手。","女孩不太喜歡洗碗，但也盡力而為。"]],["schedule","'skedʒuәl","n. 时间表, 一览表, 计划表, 议事日程\\nvt. 预定, 编制目录, 制...表, 安排",["Although the accident has delayed progress by one month, we have managed to catch up with the schedule.","The schedule is only slightly affected by this delay."],["尽管事故使进度延迟了一个月，我们还是设法赶上了日程表。","日程表只受到了这次延误的轻微影响。"]],["sad","sæd","a. 忧愁的, 悲哀的",["When you are cheerful, books can increase your happiness; when you are sad, books can lessen your sorrow.","Ever since his father died, David has been very sad."],["开心时，书可以给你增加快乐；忧伤时，书可以给你减少哀愁。","自从得到他爸爸去了以来，戴夫就心酸。"]],["brief","bri:f","n. 摘要, 简报\\na. 简短的, 短暂的\\nvt. 对...作简报, 摘要, 节录",["Could you give us a brief introduction of yourself?","Let's take a brief look at this topic."],["你能簡短地介紹一下你自己嗎？","讓我們來簡單地瞭解一下這個課題。"]],["housing","'hausiŋ","n. 遮盖, 住房供给, 居留(处), 房屋, 装饰\\n[化] 外壳",["Fifteen per cent of the housing will be affordable, so that low-income families will be able to buy or rent homes in the area.","Housing prices in Hsinchu City have risen sharply due to the concentration of the tech industry."],["百分之十五的房屋将是经济适用，所以低收入家庭会在这个地区买或者租房子。","新竹市區的房價因為科技產業聚集而水漲船高。"]],["post","pәust","n. 柱, 杆, 准星, 邮件, 邮政, 标竿, 职位, 岗位, 哨所, 兵营\\nvt. 张帖, 邮递, 公布, 登入帐, 使熟悉, 布置…",["I worked in a post office during the summer vacation.","It was less than one kilometer to the village post office."],["暑假期间，我在邮局工作。","距離村內的郵政局不到一公里。"]],["purchase","'pә:tʃәs","n. 购买, 购买品, 紧握, 绞辘\\nvt. 购买, 赢得, 努力取得, 用滑轮起(锚等)",["Your plan to purchase another PC will not be a problem at all.","They are saving their money for the purchase of a house."],["您購買另一台電腦的計劃完全不會有問題。","他們在儲錢買房子。"]],["existing","i^'zistiŋ","a. 存在的, 目前的, 现存的, 现有的\\n[计] 现成的, 已有的, 现存的",["I wish all those an unhurried night who want a revision of the existing copyright laws, but actually all the others too.","You need to consider the consequences before making any modifications to existing code."],["对于那些想要修订现行著作权法的人，我希望他们这一晚是轻松的一晚，但实际上我希望其他人的夜晚也是轻松的。","对现有代码做出任何修改前，你需要考虑后果。"]],["steel","sti:l","n. 钢, 钢制品, 钢铁, 坚硬, 坚固\\na. 钢的, 钢制的, 钢铁业的, 坚强的\\nvt. 使坚强, 钢化, 使冷酷",["Steel production will increase 2% this month from last month.","There are daisies next to the steel building."],["今個月的鋼鐵產量和上個月比起來，估計會上升兩個巴仙。","在钢铁大厦的旁边有许多的雏菊。"]],["regarding","ri'gɑ:diŋ","prep. 关于",["We are open to all suggestions regarding the new design of the website.","Our company will implement new price standards regarding this product."],["关于网站的新设计，我们乐于接受任何建议。","关于这个产品，我公司将执行新的价格标准。"]],["shout","ʃaut","n. 呼喊, 喊声\\nvi. 呼喊, 喊叫, 嚷\\nvt. 高喊",["I heard someone shout outside the window.","All at once she began to shout in a shrill voice."],["我听到窗外有人大叫。","突然間她開始用尖銳的聲音大喊。"]],["remaining","","[电] 剩余的",["There were few students remaining in the classroom.","The door remaining locked up from inside, he could not enter the house."],["教室里没剩下几个学生了。",""]],["visual","'viʒuәl","a. 视觉的\\n[医] 视觉的, 视力的, 视觉性记忆优势者",["Some say the new film is not a visual tour de force like others in its genre, but it is worth seeing for other reasons.","Visual learners are often helped by visual representations in their own notes."],["",""]],["fairly","'fєәli","adv. 美观地, 公平地, 相当地, 清楚地",["Tanabata comes up in manga a lot so I also know it fairly well.","Mary is fairly plain, but Tom thinks she's the bee's knees."],["七夕在漫畫裡常常出現所以我也了解它的意思。","玛丽是个平淡无奇的人，但是汤姆却认为她出类拔萃。"]],["violent","'vaiәlәnt","a. 暴力的, 猛烈的, 激烈的, 极端的, 凶暴的",["She's violent right now. It'd be better to avoid her.","Another step forward revealed that the skull had received violent impact and disintegrated."],["她现在很暴力。最好避着点。","进一步的检查发现头骨受到剧烈的撞击而碎裂。"]],["chip","tʃip","n. 屑片, 薄片, 碎片\\nvt. 削, 切, 削成碎片, 使摔倒, 凿\\nvi. 削下屑片\\n[计] 孔屑; 组件; 晶片; 芯片",["The chip in Yanni's windshield became a huge crack.","Tom baked some chocolate chip cookies."],["雅尼的擋風玻璃上的碎片變成了一條巨大的裂縫。","汤姆烤了些巧克力脆饼。"]],["silent","'sailәnt","a. 沉默的, 安静的, 无声的, 静止的\\n[医] 静止的, 无症状的",["The fans went silent as they nervously watched the penalty shootout between the two teams.","Since I didn't know what to say, I remained silent."],["球迷们安静下来，绷紧神经，观看两支球队的点球大战。","因为不知道说什么，所以我保持沉默。"]],["suppose","sә'pәuz","vt. 推想, 假设, 以为, 想像, 假定\\nvi. 料想",["I suppose it's different when you think about it over the long term.","Suppose you had a thousand dollars, what would you do with it?"],["我认为你考虑久了就会不一样了。","假如你有1000美元，你会用它做什么呢？"]],["self","self","n. 自己, 自我, 本性, 本质, 私心, 本人\\nvt. 使近亲繁殖, 使自花授精\\nvi. 自花授精\\na. 同一的",["I have self-studied half a semester's worth of German.","She took night classes in the art of self-defense."],["我自學了半個學期的德文。","她在夜校上自卫术课程。"]],["bike","baik","n. 自行车, 脚踏车",["Every day I either ride a bike or get the bus to work.","Apart from on rainy days, I always ride my bike to work."],["我每天要么骑自行车，要么坐公车上班。","除了雨天，我都是骑车去上班的。"]],["tea","ti:","n. 茶, 茶叶\\n[医] 茶, 茶剂, 浸剂",["I do not like tea, so I generally drink coffee for breakfast.","Please bring us two cups of tea and one cup of coffee."],["我不喜欢茶，所以我早餐大致上都喝咖啡。","请来两杯茶和一杯咖啡。"]],["perceive","pә'si:v","vt. 感觉, 认知, 理解, 意识到",["I perceive by your face that you have good news.","He could not perceive any difference between the twins."],["我从你的表情猜到你有好消息。",""]],["comparison","kәm'pærisn","n. 比较, 对照, 比喻\\n[经] 比较, 对比",["Godwin's law teaches us that any infinite discussion about an arbitrary subject converges to a Nazi comparison.","Country life is very peaceful in comparison with city life."],["高德温法则告诉我们对任何主题的所有无休止的讨论会趋于和纳粹主义的类比。","和都市生活相比，鄉村生活和諧多了。"]],["settlement","'setlmәnt","n. 安顿, 解决, 处理, 结算, 殖民, 殖民地, 沉降\\n[医] 居住区; 沉渣",["Some scholars ascribe the settlement of America to social unrest in Western Europe.","The two countries will negotiate a settlement to the crisis."],["",""]],["layer","'leiә","n. 层, 产卵鸡, 放置者\\nvt. 分层堆积, 压植\\n[计] 层",["I have a dull pain in my temples and my mind feels like its covered with a thin layer of fog.","Gently layer gold eyeshadow on the eyelids."],["太阳穴钝钝地痛，意识似乎被笼罩上了一层薄薄的雾霭。","在眼皮上輕輕疊加金色眼影。"]],["planning","","n. 计划的制订, 策划, 设计, 规划\\n[计] 计划, 规划",["I was planning on going to the beach today, but then it started to rain.","Sometimes being overcautious in planning could upset the apple cart."],["我本来预备今天去海滩的，但接着天就开始下雨了。","計劃時如果過於謹慎的話，可能會反把計劃搞亂。"]],["description","di'skripʃәn","n. 描述, 说明, 种类\\n[经] 说明书(物品), 品名种类, 货物名称",["Have you ever seen Mt. Fuji? It is beautiful beyond description.","I don't know anyone who corresponds to that description."],["你看過富士山嗎? 它美得無法形容。","我不认识符合条件的人。"]],["slide","slaid","n. 滑, 滑道, 山崩, 雪崩, 幻灯片\\nvt. 使滑动, 偷偷放入\\nvi. 滑动, 滑落, 不知不觉陷入, 偷偷地走",["Now, just let the clay slide between your fingers.","In our park, we have a nice slide for children to play on."],["",""]],["widely","'waidli","adv. 广泛地",["English is by far the most widely-spoken language in the world.","The term \"qipao\" is widely used in Northern China."],["英語是目前在世界上使用最廣泛的語言。","“旗袍”这个词语在中国北方广为使用。"]],["wedding","'wediŋ","n. 婚礼, 结婚, 结婚周年纪念日, 结合\\n[法] 结婚, 婚礼, 结婚纪念日",["On the day of the wedding, we arrived at our teacher's house.","The teacher and her partner took the people attending the wedding to a park."],["婚礼那天，我们来到老师家。","老师和她爱人带着参加婚礼的人来到一个公园。"]],["inform","in'fɒ:m","vt. 通知, 使了解, 使充满\\nvi. 提供资料, 告发",["Please inform me of the plan ahead of time.","Please inform me of any changes in the situation."],["請你事先把計劃告訴我。","如果情况有任何变化，请务必通知我。"]],["portion","'pɒ:ʃәn","n. 部分, 一份, 命运, 嫁妆\\nvt. 分配, 给...嫁妆",["He finished the steak, then ordered another portion.","Mike waited outside the chippy for Dani while she ordered a large portion of chips."],["他吃完排骨又點了一份。","丹妮點了一大份薯條，麥克在炸魚薯條店外等她。"]],["territory","'teritәri","n. 领土, 领地, 版图, 地区, 活动范围\\n[经] (推销员等的)推销区域",["On the 25th, the Chinese government issued a white paper entitled \"The Diaoyu Islands are China's Inherent Territory\".","A perfect map would have to be as big as the territory it represents."],["中国政府25日发布了《钓鱼岛是中国的固有领土》白皮书。","一個完美的地圖必須要像它所代表的領土一樣大。"]],["immediate","i'mi:diәt","a. 立即的, 直接的, 接近的\\n[医] 直接的, 立即的",["They needed to make a decision - an immediate decision.","His speech won the immediate applause of the audience."],["他们需要做决定——即刻作出决定。","他的演說贏得了觀眾熱烈的掌聲。"]],["opponent","ә'pәunәnt","n. 对手, 敌手, 反对者\\na. 敌对的, 反对的, 对面的",["Our team defeated our opponent 5-4.","The manager balanced the strength of his team against that of their opponent and sighed."],["我們這隊5-4擊敗對手。",""]],["abandon","ә'bændәn","vt. 放弃, 抛弃, 遗弃, 使屈从, 沉溺, 放纵\\nn. 放任, 无拘束, 狂热",["There are days where I feel like my brain wants to abandon me.","We made a pact that we wouldn't abandon one another."],["",""]],["transform","træns'fɒ:m","vt. 使转换, 改变, 改造, 使...变形\\nvi. 改变, 转化, 变换\\n[计] 变换",["Comrades! Let's transform Moscow into a model communist city.","The creation of most schools was not to transform society, but to reconstruct society."],["同志们，让我们转换莫斯科为理想的共产主义城市。","大部分学校的创建不是用来转变社会，而是用来重建社会的。"]],["tension","'tenʃәn","n. 紧张, 不安, 拉紧, 张力, 压力, 电压\\nvt. 拉紧, 使紧张",["Every transfer window is a test of judgment and patience, and every match brings its own surprises and tension.","If you stop and relax, this will relieve the tension and stress in your shoulders."],["每一次轉會談判都是對眼光與耐性的考驗，每一個比賽日都充滿未知的挑戰與壓力。",""]],["leading","'li:diŋ","n. 领导, 指挥, 神示, 铅板\\na. 领导的, 主要的, 在前的",["He will play the leading role for the first time in the next school festival.","Car accidents are the leading cause of death for teenagers in the United States."],["这次校庆时，他将第一次做主角。","交通事故是美国青少年死亡的主要原因。"]],["bother","'bɒðә","vt. 烦扰, 迷惑\\nvi. 烦恼, 操心\\nn. 麻烦, 纠纷, 讨厌的人",["I will play Sudoku then instead of continuing to bother you.","He didn't pass the exam, but it doesn't bother him."],["那我就不继续打扰你，玩数独游戏去了。","他考試沒過，但他不是特別在意。"]],["consist","kәn'sist","vi. 组成, 存在于, 一致",["Education does not consist simply in learning a lot of facts.","Education doesn't consist of learning a lot of facts."],["",""]],["alcohol","'ælkәhɒl","n. 酒精, 酒\\n[化] 醇; 乙醇; 酒精",["Europeans are the world's largest consumers of alcohol.","I prefer cakes or candies to alcohol, but I do drink."],["歐洲人是世界上最大的酒精消費者。","比起酒來，我比較喜歡蛋糕、糖果，可是酒我也不是完全不喝的。"]],["enable","i'neibl","vt. 使能够\\n[计] 允许, 使能, 打开",["Our on-line Customer Service Desk and trained support agents enable problems to be quickly identified and addressed.","This would enable us to compete more effectively with other agencies."],["我們的線上客服台和訓練有素的支援代理能夠快速識別和解決問題。",""]],["saving","'seiviŋ","n. 存款, 挽救, 节约\\na. 搭救的, 节约的, 保留的, 补偿的\\nprep. 除...之外",["They are saving their money for the purchase of a house.","If you want security in your old age, begin saving now."],["他們在儲錢買房子。","如果你想安享晚年，現在就要開始儲蓄了。"]],["bend","bend","vi. 变弯曲, 屈服\\nvt. 使弯曲, 使屈服\\nn. 弯曲",["Einstein predicted that the Sun's gravity would bend light.","Tom was driving too fast on the bend and ended up in the ditch."],["爱因斯坦预测太阳的引力会弯曲光线。","湯姆拐彎兒拐得太快了，把車开到了水溝裏。"]],["desert","'dezәt. di'sә:t","n. 沙漠, 应得的赏罚, 功劳\\na. 沙漠的, 不毛的\\nvt. 放弃, 遗弃, 擅离\\nvi. 逃掉",["She weaves her baskets in the same style as her ancestors who lived in the desert and harvested fruit and vegetables.","A camel is to the desert what a ship is to the sea."],["她編織的籃子的樣式，與她生活在沙漠中收穫水果和蔬​​菜的祖先相同。","駱駝是沙漠之舟。"]],["shall","ʃæl","aux. 将",["He that hears much and speaks not at all shall be welcome both in bower and hall.","Don't worry, you shall get the answer this afternoon."],["他聽得多說得少, 在閨房和大廳都很受歡迎。","别着急，今天下午你就可得到答复了."]],["error","'erә","n. 错误, 过失, 失误, 误差\\n[计] 错误",["When I try to listen to music with media player there's an error and I can't play the file.","My data-burning software is showing an error message."],["我想用媒體播放器聽音樂，卻出現了錯誤訊息，不能播放。","我的刻录软件显示了一个错误信息。"]],["cop","kɒp","n. 警官\\nvt. 抓住",["It seems that the policeman in this TV series is a dirty cop who abuses his authority.","My boss tried to cop a feel but I slapped his hand before he got any further."],["這套電視劇裏的驚察似乎是個濫用職權的壞蛋。","我老闆想佔我便宜，我便一掌拍了在他的手上，讓他不能再毛手毛腳。"]],["arab","'ærәb","n. 阿拉伯人, 阿拉伯马\\na. 阿拉伯人的, 阿拉伯的",["Japan relies on Arab countries for oil.","As commercial and cultural contacts between East and West developed, Arab and Persian traders began calling on China along the Silk Road in increasing numbers."],["日本靠阿拉伯国家提供石油。","隨著東西方之間的貿易及文化往來日漸發展，越來越多的阿拉伯和波斯商人開始沿著絲路拜訪中國。"]],["double","'dʌbl","n. 两倍\\na. 两倍的, 双重的\\nvt. 使加倍\\nvi. 加倍, 代替, 快步走\\n[计] 双精度型",["The population of the world will double before long.","How come this fucking apartment has no double-glazing? I'm freezing."],["世界人口将在不久的将来增加两倍。","为什么这个他妈的房子没有双层玻璃，我快要冷死了。"]],["spanish","'spæniʃ","n. 西班牙人, 西班牙语\\na. 西班牙的",["I've heard it said that English is for making money, French for making love, and Spanish for praying to God.","My Spanish dictionary says not to use the word \"desgraciado\" in Ecuador."],["我听说英语是用来赚钱的，法语是用来做爱的，西班牙语是用来祈求上帝的。","我的西班牙语词典说不要在厄瓜多尔用“desgraciado”这个词。"]],["sand","sænd","n. 沙, 沙子, 沙滩, 光阴, 生涯\\nvt. 撒沙, 以沙掩盖",["The old man loaded his mule with bags full of sand.","There is sand at the bottom of the ocean."],["老人在骡子的背上放上了一个个装满了沙的袋子。","海洋底部有沙子。"]],["print","print","n. 打印, 版, 印刷物, 痕迹, 印刷业, 印刷字体, 图片, 印花布, 印章\\nv. 打印, 印刷, 铭记, 留印记于, 用印刷体写…",["It will be able to edit the pictures you don't like, then print them out.","A businesswoman by day, Natasja leads a nightlife unfit for print."],["它可以將你不喜歡的照片修好，然後在印出來。",""]],["preserve","pri'zә:v","vt. 保护, 保持, 保存, 维持, 腌, 禁猎\\nvi. 加工食品, 禁猎\\nn. 加工成的食品, 禁猎地, 保护区, 防护物",["More recently, some hutongs have been designated as protected areas in an attempt to preserve this aspect of Chinese cultural history.","Preserve life; please don't waste water."],["最近，有些胡同被指定为保护区，以试图保存这方面的中国文化历史。","关爱生命，请勿嬉水。"]],["passage","'pæsidʒ","n. 通道, 通过, 移居, 航行, 一段, 走廊\\nvi. 通过, 经过, 航行, 横渡, 争吵\\nvt. (使)马以斜横步前进, 使传代",["Don't put your things in the passage.","There's a secret passage on the left."],["別在通道上放東西。","在左边有一条秘密通道。"]],["ceo","","abbr. 首席执行官；执行总裁（chief executive officer）",["He's the new CEO from the parent company in France.","Ever since the CEO was caught saying racial slurs on a hot mic, the whole PR team has been doing damage control."],["他是來自法國母公司的新任執行長。","自從執行長無意被麥克風錄到說出種族歧視言論，整個公關團隊就一直在忙著善後。"]],["formal","'fɒ:mәl","a. 正式的, 形式的, 礼仪的, 拘于礼节的, 拘谨的\\nn. 正式的社交活动",["There's no need for you to prepare a formal speech.","You don't need to prepare a formal speech."],["您没必要准备一个正式的演讲。","您没必要准备一个正式的演讲。"]],["transition","træn'ziʃәn","n. 转变, 转换, 变迁, 过渡时期, 临时转调\\n[化] 跃迁",["The transition from hardware to software happened gradually.","A thermocline is the transition layer between warmer mixed water at the ocean's surface and cooler deep water below."],["由硬體到軟體的轉變是緩慢的。",""]],["existence","ig'zistәns","n. 存在, 生存\\n[法] 存在, 存在状态, 实体",["A good book can completely absorb your attention, to the extent that you forget your surroundings and even your existence.","Three out of four Americans believe in the existence of paranormal phenomena."],["一本好书会令你全神贯注，甚至忘掉周围和自己。","四分之三的美国人相信存在超自然现象。"]],["participation",".pɑ:tisi'peiʃәn","n. 参与, 分享\\n[经] 参与, 参股",["Watching television changes the role of the fans by making their participation more passive and distant.","The company is open for equity participation by anybody."],["",""]],["album","'ælbәm","n. 粘贴簿, 唱片套\\n[医] 白色物",["In this album all the sounds that you hear are really elaborate computer voices.","He sat quietly at his desk, flipping through the yellowed photo album."],["在這張專輯裡, 所有你聽到的聲音都是用電腦精密製作出的聲音。","他靜靜地坐在書桌前，翻閱著那本泛黃的相簿。"]],["arrange","ә'reindʒ","v. 安排, 排列, 达成协议\\n[计] 重排",["I'll arrange for someone to pick you up at your home.","A travel agent will arrange an excursion to Andalusia for you."],["我会安排一下，叫个人去你家接你。","旅行社會爲你安排去安達盧西亞的旅行。"]],["atmosphere","'ætmәsfiә","n. 大气, 空气, 气氛\\n[医] 大气; 大气压",["Saving energy can reduce the emission of greenhouse gases into the atmosphere.","The asteroid broke up into small pieces as it entered Earth's atmosphere."],["節約能源可減少溫室氣體排出到大氣層。","进入地球大气层后，小行星分裂成了无数的小块。"]],["joint","dʒɒint","n. 连接处, 接合, 关节\\na. 共同的, 联合的, 连接的, 合办的\\nvt. 连接, 接合, 使有接头\\nvi. 贴合, 长节",["We can lift the restrictions on imports once the joint agreement is signed.","They came to terms with each other on how to start a joint venture."],["",""]],["reply","ri'plai","n. 答复, 回答, 答辩\\nvi. 答复, 回答, 回击, 反响, 答辩\\nvt. 回答\\n[计] 答复",["He doesn't even dare to reply to a harsh word. He's such a coward.","Please send me a reply as soon as you receive this mail."],["他連一句重話都不敢回，真是個窩囊廢。","收到此邮件后请尽快给我答复。"]],["cycle","'saikl","n. 周期, 循环, 自行车, 一段时间, 整套\\nvi. 循环, 轮转, 骑自行车\\nvt. 使循环, 使轮转\\n[计] 环路; 周期;…",["The city government wants to set up special cycle lanes. However, a lot of drivers oppose the idea.","Usually I cycle or get the bus to work."],["市政府想建设专门的自行车道。但是，很多司机反对这个主意。","我通常骑自行车或乘公交车去上班。"]],["lock","lɒk","n. 锁, 刹车, 水闸, 一缕头发\\nvt. 锁, 锁上, 拘禁, 隐藏, (用锁等)拴住, 刹住\\nvi. 锁住, (齿轮等)啮合, …",["They tried to use an iron bar to pry open the lock.","If I lost my key, I wouldn't be able to lock the door."],["他们试图用一根铁棒撬开锁。","如果我弄丟了我的鑰匙，我就無法鎖門了。"]],["opposite","'ɒpәzit","a. 相对的, 相反的, 对面的\\nprep. 对面\\nn. 对立面",["The opposite sides of a parallelogram are parallel.","What they told you is the opposite of what they told me yesterday."],["平行四边形的对边平行。","她們跟你說的可和她們昨天跟我説的完全相反。"]],["deserve","di'zә:v","vt. 该得到, 值得\\nvi. 应得报答",["You don't deserve the salary they're paying you.","Those who would give up Essential Liberty to purchase a little Temporary Safety, deserve neither Liberty nor Safety."],["你不应该得到他们给你的薪水。",""]],["consistent","kәn'sistәnt","a. 一致的, 坚持的, 并立的, 坚固的",["His daily behavior is not consistent with his principles.","Her behavior is consistent with her words."],["他的日常行为并不和他的原则相一致。","她言行一致。"]],["resistance","ri'zistәns","n. 抵抗力, 反抗, 耐力, 阻力, 电阻\\n[化] 抵抗; 抗性; 阻力; 抗药性; 电阻",["Years of resistance to misfortune ended when the settlers' village was overcome by the savages and their hopes and lives came to the bitter end.","We are faced with the alternative of resistance or slavery."],["当移居者的村庄被野蛮人征服后，他们的希望和生活到了痛苦的尽头，数年对灾祸的抵抗结束了。",""]],["discovery","dis'kʌvәri","n. 发现, 被发现的事物\\n[法] 要求告知, 发现, 发觉",["Most scientific breakthroughs are nothing else than the discovery of the obvious.","The discovery that electric currents can be produced by magnetism is extremely important in the field of electricity."],["多數科學突破只不過是發現了顯而易見的事。","磁能生产电流的发明，在电力领域非常重要。"]],["exposure","ik'spәuʒә","n. 暴露, 揭发, 揭露\\n[化] 曝光量; 照射; 照射量",["People who develop freckles should avoid direct exposure to sunlight.","Exposure to radiation causes susceptibility to mutations."],["",""]],["pose","pәuz","n. 姿势, 姿态, 装模作样, 伪装\\nvi. 摆姿势, 装模作样, 假装\\nvt. 使摆好姿势, 提出, 造成",["When you pose a question, you expect an answer.","You pose thought-provoking and important questions."],["當你提出一個問題，你期望得到答案。",""]],["stream","stri:m","n. 水流, 小河, 流出, 趋势, 人潮\\nvt. 流出, 流动, 展开\\nvi. 流, 涌, 飘扬\\n[计] 流",["It must be dangerous to swim in this rapid stream.","Behind his house is a stream so clear that you can see the bottom of it."],["在這麼急的急流裏游泳，一定會很危險的。","他家后面有小溪，清可见底。"]],["sale","seil","n. 出售, 卖, 拍卖, 销售额, 廉价出售\\n[经] 卖, 出售; 销售(货)",["First off, I'd like you to come with me to a department store sale.","The bargain sale will run for three days, beginning today."],["首先，我要你跟我一起去百貨公司的特價活動。","这场减价活动会持续三天，从今天开始。"]],["pot","pɒt","n. 盆, 罐, 壶, 坩埚, 奖杯\\nvt. 装入盆中, 在锅中煮, 随手射击\\nvi. 随手射击",["The others have already licked the bottom of the pot.","The food at this hot pot restaurant really tastes pretty good. Let's come here again next time."],["其他人已經舔乾淨鍋底了。","这家火锅店的味道还挺不错的嘛，下次我们再来吃吧。"]],["mine","main","n. 矿, 矿藏, 地雷\\nvt. 挖掘, 开采, 在...布雷, 破坏\\nvi. 开矿, 埋设地雷\\npron. 我的",["\"I wish you were all mine!\" said the little black rabbit.","Yesterday I met an old friend of mine whom I had not seen for a long time."],["\"我希望你全都是我的!\" 小黑兔說。","我昨天遇到了一个许久不见的老朋友。"]],["grand","grænd","a. 庄重的, 壮观的, 显赫的, 重大的, 最高的, 雄伟的, 宏大的, 豪华的, 傲慢的\\n[法] 重大的, 主要的, 伟大的",["No matter what grand and lofty reason you have, it's not right to do this.","The scenery of Basutoland is rugged and grand, with a beauty quite its own, and unlike any other part of South Africa I have seen."],["不管你有什么冠冕堂皇的理由，这样做是不对的。","巴蘇陀蘭的景色崎嶇壯麗，別具一格，與我見過的南非其他地方都截然不同。"]],["hello","hә'lәu","interj. 喂, 嘿",["Why didn't the half-cooked steak say hello to the nearly-cooked steak when the two saw each other? They both weren't ready.","Please say hello to your family on my behalf."],["五成熟牛排见了七成熟牛排为什么不打招呼？两个都不熟。","请代我向你的家人问好。"]],["tale","teil","n. 故事, 谎言, 谣言, 陈述, 叙述\\n[法] 虚语, 诽语, 谣言",["The author translated the fairy tale into our mother tongue.","He-heh... there's a tale behind that, for that place."],["作者將童話翻譯成了我們的母語。","嘿-嘿... 那個地方的背後有一個故事。"]],["knife","naif","n. 小刀, 匕首\\nvt. 切割, 伤害, 切, 戳\\nvi. 劈开, 穿过",["Tom carefully wiped his fingerprints off the knife.","He cut it with the knife that he received as a present from his brother."],["汤姆小心翼翼地把刀子上的指纹擦掉。","他用哥哥送給他的刀子切開了。"]],["coalition",".kәuә'liʃәn","n. 结合体, 结合, 联合\\n[经] 联合, 联盟",["According to the news report, the ruling coalition has secured 72 seats as of 5 p.m.","The new coalition government is trying to ride out the storm."],["",""]],["resolve","ri'zɒlv","vi. 决定, 分解, 决心\\nvt. 使分解, 解析, 解决, 消除, 决心\\nn. 决定之事, 决心, 坚决",["Only when the Party Committee Secretary came in person to resolve it was this point of view dispelled entirely.","If you don't resolve to become a good man, then you just won't get a good woman."],["直到党委书记出面加以解释，才算打消了这种想法。","如果你沒決心做好男人,那你就得不到好女人。"]],["racial","'reiʃәl","a. 人种的, 种族的\\n[医] 种族的",["Ever since the CEO was caught saying racial slurs on a hot mic, the whole PR team has been doing damage control.","People are concerned about racial problems."],["自從執行長無意被麥克風錄到說出種族歧視言論，整個公關團隊就一直在忙著善後。","人们有关心种族问题。"]],["phase","feiz","n. 时期, 局面, 方面, 位相, 相, 阶段\\nvt. 使调整相位, 使定相, 使一致, 逐步执行, 实行\\n[计] 阶段",["Cancer can be cured easily if it is found in its first phase.","The first phase of construction has been completed."],["癌症如果在第一阶段被发现的话是很容易治愈的。","工程的第一階段已經完成了。"]],["joke","dʒәuk","n. 笑话, 玩笑, 笑柄\\nv. 开玩笑, 取笑, 作弄",["The joke loses everything when the joker laughs himself.","Mr Smith always begins his lectures with a joke."],["當講笑話的人自己先笑時，這個笑話就失去了一切意義。","史密斯先生永远用玩笑开始课。"]],["coat","kәut","n. 外套\\nvt. 外面覆盖, 给...穿外套",["Mary asked whose coat it was and I told her it was mine.","I bought a coat and a jacket at the department store."],["玛丽问我这是谁的外套，我告诉她这是我的。","我在百貨公司買了大衣和夾克"]],["mexican","'meksikәn","n. 墨西哥人, 墨西哥语\\na. 墨西哥的",["\"El Chavo del 8\" is a Mexican series transmitted in Brazil by the Brazilian Television System (BTS).","I learn Nahuatl at my school. I'm Mexican."],["《查沃德爾奧喬》是一部墨西哥電視劇，由巴西電視系統 (BTS) 在巴西播出。","我在學校學納瓦特爾語。我是墨西哥人。"]],["symptom","'simptәm","n. 症状, 征候, 征兆\\n[医] 症状",["The civil war in the Azawad region is a symptom of Mali's collapse.","Losing your sense of smell can be a symptom of COVID-19."],["",""]],["manufacturer",".mænju'fæktʃәrә","n. 制造业者, 厂商\\n[经] 制造人, 制造商, 制造厂",["Write to the manufacturer if the machine develops the same fault again.","If that washing machine goes wrong again, I shall complain to the manufacturer."],["",""]],["philosophy","fi'lɒsәfi","n. 哲学, 人生观, 哲学思想, 哲理, 基本原理, 见解, 达观, 沉着",["He not only graduated from studying sociology, but also philosophy.","Philosophy is not a written subject, but a way of life."],["他不仅社会学毕业，还有哲学。","哲学不是书面上的学问，而是一种生活的方式。"]],["potato","pә'teitәu","n. 马铃薯",["I shouldn't have eaten the whole bag of potato chips.","On the plate was a piece of chicken, a potato and some green peas."],["我不该把一整包薯片都吃完的。","盤子上盛着一塊雞肉、一塊馬鈴薯和一些青豆。"]],["quote","kwәut","n. 引用\\nvt. 引述, 举证, 报(价)\\nvi. 引用",["Your Chinese is so good, you can quote proverbs.","We are looking forward to receiving your quote as soon as possible."],["你中文真好，都能引用俗语了。",""]],["foundation","faun'deiʃәn","n. 基础, 根据, 建立\\n[化] 地基",["The truth and simplicity of nature is always the most important foundation of noteworthy art.","Mathematics are the foundation of all sciences."],["大自然的真实和质朴往往是值得注意的艺术中最重要的基石。","数学是所有科学的基础。"]],["online","","[计] 联机",["Tom doesn't care about protecting his personal information online.","The French government has launched an online game that challenges taxpayers to balance the national budget."],["湯姆上網時並不在乎個人資訊的保護。","法國政府發布了一款線上遊戲，讓納稅人挑戰平衡國家預算。"]],["negotiation","ni.gәuʃi'eiʃәn","n. 谈判, 磋商, 交涉\\n[经] 谈判, 协商",["A free-trade agreement between Europe and the United States is currently under negotiation.","The fate of the hostages depends on the result of the negotiation."],["歐洲和美國的一份自由貿易協定正在商議中。",""]],["urge","ә:dʒ","n. 冲动, 推动力, 迫切的要求\\nvt. 驱策, 力劝, 竭力主张, 推动\\nvi. 强烈要求",["Lawyers will urge the parents to take further legal action.","Advertisements urge us to buy luxuries."],["律师们会力劝家长们采取进一步的法律行动。","廣告慫恿我們買奢侈品。"]],["occasion","ә'keiʒәn","n. 场合, 时机, 机会, 诱因, 理由\\nvt. 惹起, 引起",["Please allow me to say a few words on this occasion.","You should change your job if the occasion arises."],["",""]],["dust","dʌst","n. 灰尘, 尘埃, 粉末, 花粉, 土, 骚乱\\nvt. 拂去灰尘, 撒, 弄成粉末\\nvi. 拂去灰尘, 化为粉末",["Spacesuits protect astronauts from being injured from impacts of small bits of space dust.","A cloud of dust and debris rose and lingered in the sky for a few minutes afterward."],["宇航服保护宇航员们不会因和微小宇宙尘埃碰撞而受伤。","一團塵土與瓦礫騰空而起，在空中盤旋了數分鐘。"]],["breathe","bri:ð","vi. 呼吸, 生存, 低语\\nvt. 呼吸, 使喘息, 发散, 低声说",["The book tells the story of a dragon that can't breathe fire.","His humor charmingly eased the embarrassing atmosphere at dinner time and made me breathe a sigh of relief."],["書裡講的是一條不會噴火的龍的故事。","他的幽默巧妙地缓解了晚餐时尴尬的气氛，让我松了一口气。"]],["elect","i'lekt","n. 当选人, 被选的人\\na. 被选的, 选出的\\nvt. 选举, 选择\\nvi. 作选择",["Someday, the USA will elect its first woman president, and it will rejoice in the long overdue occasion.","The US will one day elect its first woman president, and there will be rejoicing in the long overdue occasion."],["",""]],["investigator","in'vestigeitә","n. 调查者, 审查者\\n[法] 审查员, 侦查员, 调查员",["The suspect's apparent knowledge of details of the murder can't be used against him in this case since it was elicited by a leading question from the investigator.","Tom hired a private investigator to dig up dirt on his wife and her lover."],["嫌疑人對謀殺案細節顯然知情一事，在本案中不得作為不利於他的證據，因為這是調查人員以誘導性提問所套出的。",""]],["jacket","'dʒækit","n. 夹克, 外套, 护套\\nvt. 给...穿夹克, 给...装护套",["He took out the wallet from his inside jacket pocket.","The jacket, which I wanted, cost three hundred dollars."],["他從他外套內袋裡拿出皮夾。","這件我想要的夾克花費三百美元。"]],["ordinary","'ɒ:dinәri","a. 平常的, 普通的, 平凡的\\nn. 平常的人(或事)",["Wise men talk about ideas, intellectuals about facts, and the ordinary man talks about what he eats.","True art of life is to see the extraordinary amongst the ordinary."],["智者談論想法, 知識分子談論事實, 普通人談論他吃什麼。","生活真正的艺术是在平凡中看到不平凡。"]],["glad","glæd","a. 高兴的, 喜欢的, 情愿的",["He was glad to avail himself of any means to succeed in life.","She said that John must be very glad to hear the news."],["他很高兴能通过各种方法在人生中取得成功。","她说约翰一定非常愿意听到这个消息。"]],["reduction","ri'dʌkʃәn","n. 减少, 缩影, 变化\\n[化] 还原",["He advocated the reduction of taxes.","Survival analysis showed a significant reduction."],["他提倡減稅。","存活分析顯示，機率顯著減少。"]],["rarely","'rєәli","adv. 很少地, 罕有地",["It's not wrong, but it's rarely written like that.","English people rarely talk to strangers in the train."],["写的没错，不过很少那么说。","英國人很少在火車上和陌生人搭訕。"]],["pack","pæk","n. 包裹, 一伙, 一副, 背包, 包装\\nvt. 包装, 捆扎, 塞满, 压紧, 挑选\\nvi. 包装货物, 挤, 群集, 被包装\\n…",["My father smokes a pack of cigarettes a day.","As a last precaution, I put a flashlight into my pack."],["我爸爸每天抽一包烟。",""]],["suicide","'sjuisaid","n. 自杀, 自杀者\\nv. 自杀\\na. 自杀的",["Out of all the attributes of the gods, the one I find most pitiable is their inability to commit suicide.","He committed suicide by hanging himself."],["在神的所有特性中，我觉得最让人同情的是他们没办法自杀这一点。","他上吊自殺了。"]],["numerous","'nju:mәrәs","a. 很多的, 数目众多的, 多数的\\n[机] 多数的, 甚多的",["The victims of the earthquake disaster are numerous.","I have numerous books on my bookshelf."],["地震災難的受害者非常多。","我有大量的书在我的书架上。"]],["substance","'sʌbstәns","n. 物质, 实质, 主旨, 资产, 本质, 牢固\\n[化] 物质",["The substance is light enough to float on the water.","Water and ice are the same substance in different forms."],["這種物質很輕，可以浮在水面上。","水和冰雖然形態不同，但其實是同一種物質。"]],["discipline","'disiplin","n. 训练, 纪律\\nvt. 训练, 惩罚",["Translation is a scholarly discipline.","The pupils are supposed to observe rigid discipline."],["翻译是一门学问。",""]],["elsewhere","'elshwєә","adv. 在别处",["And not only that, the goods in the company shop were usually more expensive than elsewhere.","I can't find my notebook here; I must have put it elsewhere."],["",""]],["iron","'aiәn","n. 铁, 熨斗, 铁器, 坚强, 烙铁, 镣铐\\nvt. 烫平, 熨, 用铁包\\nvi. 烫平",["They tried to use an iron bar to pry open the lock.","I suspect Koreans must have trained their wrist strength to use those iron chopsticks so well."],["他们试图用一根铁棒撬开锁。","我懷疑韓國人是練過腕力才用得好那種鐵筷。"]],["practical","'præktikl","a. 实际的, 现实的, 实用性的\\n[法] 事实上的, 实际上的, 接近...的",["As she's a very practical person, she often fixes her friends' cars.","From the practical point of view, there are many shortcomings in his plan."],["她作为一个喜欢动手实践的人常常把朋友的汽车修好。","從現實的角度看，他的計劃有很多缺點。"]],["moreover","mɒ:'әuvә","adv. 而且, 此外",["The house looked good; moreover, the price was right.","It's a cat, and moreover an orange one."],["屋子物美价廉。","這是一隻貓，而且是一隻橘色的貓。"]],["passion","'pæʃәn","n. 激情, 酷爱, 热爱, 强烈感情, 耶稣受难(故事)",["Though passion may have strained, it must not break our bonds of affection.","The soul is made up of reason, determination, and passion."],["雖然激情可能會褪去，但我們不能切斷感情上的聯繫。","灵魂是由理性、意志和情欲构成的。"]],["volunteer",".vɒlәn'tiә","n. 志愿者\\na. 志愿的\\nv. 自愿",["Tom was the first person to volunteer.","The volunteer group provided the villagers with water."],["汤姆是第一个志愿参与的人。",""]],["implement","'implimәnt","n. 工具, 器具, 手段\\nvt. 实现, 使生效, 执行",["Our company will implement new price standards regarding this product.","The company is starting to implement the new management system from next month."],["关于这个产品，我公司将执行新的价格标准。","公司从下个月开始推行新的管理制度。"]],["essentially","i'senʃәli","adv. 本质上, 本来",["It is essentially a question of time.","In general, the relationship between parents and children is essentially based on teaching."],["它本質上是一個時間的問題。",""]],["gene","dʒi:n","n. 基因\\n[化] 基因(遗传因子)",["Some diseases are caused by a defective gene.","A gene is a chemical substance, or a molecule, that can encode, store, and transfer information between organisms."],["一些疾病的产生原因是基因缺陷。",""]],["enforcement","in'fɒ:smәnt","n. 执行, 强制\\n[法] 实施, 加强, 厉行",["The government will adopt enforcement measures to solve this problem.","They say everything's bigger in Texas, and that includes absurdity in law enforcement."],["政府将采取强制措施来解决这一问题。",""]],["sauce","sɒ:s","n. 酱油, 调味汁, 酱\\nvt. 给...调味, 使增加趣味",["Two women wielding giant spatulas continuously stir a brimming wok of shredded beef simmering in curry sauce.","The herb used in that pasta sauce might be parsley."],["兩名女子揮舞著巨大的鍋鏟，不停地翻炒著盛滿咖哩醬汁的牛肉絲。","用於那個義大利醬的香草可能是荷蘭芹。"]],["vs","","prep. 对\\n[经] 对",["Please don't worry about the finer details of free vs mis-translation.","Researchers study identical twins to solve the \"Nature vs. Nurture\" debate."],["",""]],["independence",".indi'pendәns","n. 独立, 自立, 自主\\n[医] 自主性, 独立性",["Operation Yoav was a military operation carried out by Israel in its war for independence.","Our people thirst for independence."],["约阿夫行动是以色列独立战争中的一次作战行动。","我们的人民渴望独立。"]],["marketing","'mɑ:kitiŋ","n. 行销, 买卖\\n[经] 推销, 在市场买卖, 销售",["I plan to accept the offer from that company to become their marketing department's manager.","The objectives of the marketing department and the sales department are not necessarily the same."],["我打算去应聘那个公司的营销部经理职位.","销售部门和营销部门的目标不见得一样。"]],["priest","pri:st","n. 祭司, 牧师, 神父, 神质人员, 僧侣, 泰斗",["Sorry, I'm not used to seeing a priest with a sense of humor.","\"God is our salvation,\" said the priest."],["不好意思，有幽默感的牧師我是真的不太習慣。","“天主是我们的救援。”，牧师说。"]],["amazing","ә'meiziŋ","a. 令人惊异的",["This teacher always drags his class time, taking up the students' rest time, later he got reported, it felt amazing.","This week has been an amazing experience."],["这个老师总是拖堂，占用同学们课间休息的时间，后来他被举报了，真过瘾啊。","這週的經歷真是太棒了。"]],["intense","in'tens","a. 非常的, 强烈的, 紧张的, 热情的\\n[医] 强的",["Due to the intense sunlight, his back was sunburnt.","We couldn't play outdoors because of the intense heat."],["",""]],["advance","әd'vɑ:ns","n. 前进, 进展, 行过的路程\\nvi. 前进, 进展, 提高, 上涨\\nvt. 使前进, 促进, 提出, 提高, 使提前, 预付\\na…",["What's more, you can only buy train tickets one week in advance.","The referee, according to principle of advantage, raised his hand and motioned for the advance to continue."],["再说，只能提前一周买火车票 。","裁判根据有利原则，举起手示意继续进攻。"]],["employer","im'plɒiә","n. 雇主, 老板\\n[经] 雇主, 业主",["His employer was sincerely grateful for his cooperation.","Tim's employer promised him pie-in-the-sky benefits."],["",""]],["shock","ʃɒk","n. 震动, 冲突, 震惊, 冲击, 突击, 禾束堆, 休克, 长毛狗\\nvt. 使震动, 使休克, 使受电击, 震惊得\\nvi. 震动,…",["The shock of her father's death lingered on and she didn't feel like going out at all.","China is a sleeping tiger, but once it wakes up, it will shock the world."],["她完全沒有出外的心情，因為那種突然失去父親的痛苦，一直在她的心頭揮之不去。","中国是一只沉睡的狮子，一旦觉醒，将会震惊世界。"]],["inspire","in'spaiә","vt. 使感动, 激发, 启示, 吸入, 鼓舞, 产生, 使生灵感\\nvi. 吸入, 赋予灵感",["Asian religions inspire him to create splendid sculptures.","We may give advice, but we do not inspire conduct."],["",""]],["adjust","ә'dʒʌst","vt. 调整, 使适应于, 校准\\nvi. 适应于, 被调节, 相互熟悉而适应",["Our eyes take time to adjust to the dark.","I can't adjust myself to the climate here."],["我们的眼睛需要时间来适应黑暗。","我不能適應這裡的氣候。"]],["retire","ri'taiә","n. 隐居\\nvi. 引退, 退役, 退休, 退去, 撤退, 退却\\nvt. 使...撤退, 辞退",["My father will retire at the age of sixty.","Tom said that he doesn't want to retire."],["我父亲六十岁就要退休了。","汤姆说他不想退休。"]],["kiss","kis","n. 吻\\nvt. 吻\\nvi. 接吻",["What must one keep in mind during a kiss, above all else? The singer Max Raabe answers this important question.","He chose to kiss up to someone, but stepped on a landmine instead."],["接吻時最該注意的是什麼？歌手馬克斯拉貝回答了這個重要的問題。","马屁拍在马脚上。"]],["illness","'ilnis","n. 疾病, 恶意\\n[医] 病",["It took John about two weeks to get over his illness.","If I had known about your illness, I could have visited you in the hospital."],["差不多两周John的病才好了。","如果我知道你病了，怎麼也會趕來看你的。"]],["visible","'vizәbl","a. 看得见的, 明显的, 显然的\\nn. 可见物",["Tom rolled up his trouser legs, making his bright red socks visible.","The shadow of the stick is visible."],["湯姆捲起褲管，露出鮮紅的襪子。","立竿见影。"]],["cap","kæp","n. 盖子, 帽子\\nvt. 戴帽子, 覆盖, 胜过\\nvi. 脱帽致意\\n[计] 调用程序分析, 容量, 代码分析程序, 计算机辅助生产…",["Put on your thinking cap and try to remember whose house you slept at last night.","Winning the Grand Prix was a feather in the cap of the famous drivers."],["好好的想一想，看看能不能想起你昨晚是在誰家過夜的。",""]],["competitive","kәm'petitiv","a. 竞争的\\n[经] 竞争的",["Sometimes hockey players get so competitive that fights break out.","Japan is highly competitive in high technology industries."],["有时候冰球运动员相互挑衅得太厉害以至于会引发斗殴。","日本在高科技產業方面的競爭力很強。"]],["habit","'hæbit","n. 习惯, 嗜好, 习性\\nvt. 使穿衣",["You should try to form the habit of using your dictionaries.","I am in the habit of taking some exercise before breakfast."],["你们该养成使用字典的习惯。","我在吃早餐前有運動的習慣。"]],["congressional","kәn'greʃәnl","a. 会议的, 议会的, 国会的\\n[法] 代表大会的, 大会的, 议会的",["The senator was censured by the congressional ethics committee.","The Congressional Medal of Honor is the highest award that any soldier can aspire to."],["议员受到了议会道德委员会的谴责。",""]],["juice","dʒu:s","n. 汁, 活力, 体液\\nvt. 挤出汁来, 加汁",["Add the honey, lemon juice, chopped almonds and the chopped apples.","The Tequila Sunrise is made with orange juice, tequila, and grenadine."],["加入蜂蜜、檸檬汁、切碎的杏仁和切碎的蘋果。","龍舌蘭日出由柳橙汁、龍舌蘭酒和石榴糖漿調製而成。"]],["involvement","in'vɔlvmәnt","n. 卷入, 牵连, 包含, 困窘\\n[经] 财政困难, 经济上的困窘",["The use of space must be limited to non-military purposes, as far as Japan's involvement is concerned.","The newspaper alleged his involvement in the crime."],["",""]],["dominate","'dɒmineit","v. 支配, 占优势",["Two bishops working together control so many squares that they can dominate the board.","No matter how often I put on my thinking cap, I am afraid my unpreparedness will dominate."],["",""]],["previously","'pri:vju:sli","adv. 先, 先前, 以前, 前, (非正式)过早, 过急, 在前, 在...以前, 在先\\n[计] 先前地",["Mr. Johnson previously advocated banning alcohol on public transport in the capital, and some believe this initiative effectively reduced crime on trains and buses.","Previously people believed the earth was flat."],["约翰逊先生以前还倡议禁止在首都公交上饮酒，有人认为这个倡议有效减少了火车和公车上的犯罪率。","以前的人以為地球是平的。"]],["whenever","hwen'evә","conj. 每当\\nadv. 不论何时, 每逢",["The little child drools whenever he hears of something delicious.","Whenever he moved, the wound sent pains all along his arm."],["小家伙一听到有好吃的，口涎就流出来好长！","他只要一动, 伤口就连带整个胳膊都疼。"]],["transfer","træns'fә:","n. 迁移, 移动, 传递, 转让, 转移, 过户, 汇兑, 换车\\nvt. 使转移, 调转, 调任, 改变, 传递, 转让\\nvi. 转…",["If you connect your phone to your PC via USB, you can even transfer files and photos.","It's time for the Tuaregs to transfer their herds to the valley."],["您如果透過 USB 將手機連接到電腦，則甚至可以傳輸檔案和照片。","圖阿雷格人該把他們的牲畜轉移到山谷去了。"]],["analyze","'ænәlaiz","vt. 分析, 细察, 分解\\n[机] 分析",["It is difficult to objectively analyze one's own beliefs.","I can't understand why you said that. You don't know how to analyze numbers and charts."],["",""]],["attach","ә'tætʃ","vt. 附上, 使依附, 使附属, 使喜爱, 系, 缚\\nvi. 附属, 归属, 联系在一起\\n[计] 挂接服务器命令, 关联, 挂接, …",["You need to attach your photo to the application form.","I forgot to attach a stamp to the envelope."],["你必须把你的照片贴在申请书上。","我忘记在信封上贴邮票了。"]],["disaster","di'zɑ:stә","n. 灾祸, 不幸, 彻底失败",["The victims of the earthquake disaster are numerous.","What was at first a natural disaster rapidly became a man-made debacle."],["地震災難的受害者非常多。","起初的天灾迅速演变为了人祸。"]],["parking","'pɑ:kiŋ","n. 停车\\na. 停车的",["Before now, when you thought of a city, you thought of crowded streets, parking problems, traffic jams, queues, noise and fumes.","We spent a lot of time looking for a parking lot."],["以前，想到城市，人们就会想到拥挤的街道、紧缺的车位、拥挤的交通、排得老长的队伍以及噪音和烟雾。","我们花了很长时间找停车场。"]],["prospect","'prɒspekt","n. 景色, 展望\\nvt. 勘探, 勘察\\nvi. 勘探, 有前途",["The prospect of famine hangs over many areas of the world.","The idea that this country might become linguistically homogeneous is a depressing prospect."],["",""]],["boss","bɒs","n. 老板, 上司, 岩瘤, 浮雕, 母牛\\nvt. 指挥, 控制, 浮雕",["Between you and me, he's in trouble with the boss.","He pretends to be enthusiastic when his boss is around."],["他和老板有矛盾，这个我们知道就好。","老闆在的時候他就裝成一副很熱心的樣子。"]],["complaint","kәm'pleint","n. 诉苦, 抱怨, 控诉\\n[医] 陈诉; 病",["If I do not get the item this week, I will make a complaint to PayPal.","The company went after its no. 1 customer complaint: power outages."],["如果本周我收不到货，我就向paypal投诉。",""]],["championship","'tʃæmpiәnʃip","n. 冠军身份, 冠军称号, 捍卫",["Build your own championship team in a new football management simulation game, launching in early November.","After many years of grueling training, she finally made a breakthrough and won the championship."],["全新足球經理模擬遊戲將於 11 月初推出，邀你打造屬於自己的冠軍球隊。","经过多年的刻苦训练，她终于破茧成蝶，赢得了冠军。"]],["fundamental",".fʌndә'mentәl","n. 基本原理, 原则, 基波\\na. 基本的, 重要的, 原音的",["Needless to say, fundamental human rights should be respected.","The fundamental cause of the trouble is that in the modern world the stupid are cocksure while the intelligent are full of doubt."],["無須多言，基本人權應當被尊重。","问题的根源是，在当今世界，愚人充满了自信，而智者充满了怀疑。"]],["severe","si'viә","a. 严格的, 尖锐的, 严肃的, 严重的, 严厉的, 朴素的\\n[法] 严厉的, 苛刻的, 严重的",["Japan is confronted with severe economic problems.","No one knows when a severe earthquake will strike Tokyo."],["日本正面臨著嚴重的經濟問題。","沒有人知道東京甚麼時候會發生大地震。"]],["enhance","in'hæns","vt. 提高, 加强, 增加",["A qipao in the traditional style is made entirely by hand and requires labour-intensive manual tailoring techniques to enhance and exhibit every unique female form.","It should be clear that the curriculum reform is mandatory in order to enhance interdisciplinary research."],["一件传统式样的旗袍是完全手工制作的，也需要劳动密集的裁缝业技术，为了增加而显示每种独一无二的女性体态。",""]],["mystery","'mistәri","n. 秘密, 神秘, 奥秘",["Anna's striking almond-shaped eyes, inherited from her Asian lineage, exude a captivating depth and a hint of mystery.","Whether Shakespeare wrote this poem or not will probably remain a mystery."],["安娜引人注目的杏仁狀眼睛繼承了她的亞洲血統，散發著迷人的深度和一絲神秘感。","這首詩是不是莎士比亞寫的，恐怕是無從考究的了。"]],["poverty","'pɒvәti","n. 贫穷, 贫困, 缺乏\\n[医] 贫乏, 缺乏",["The president called on the people to unite in fighting poverty and disease.","There is nowhere in the whole world without poverty."],["總統呼籲全國民眾在對抗貧窮或疾病的時候，一定要團結一致。","全世界沒有一個地方沒有貧窮。"]],["impose","im'pәuz","vt. 征(税), 把...强加于, 以...欺骗\\nvi. 利用, 欺骗, 施加影响",["Unless Japan eliminates its unfair tariffs, the U.S. will impose sanctions.","The U.S. government is to impose two of the sanctions against those countries."],["",""]],["spending","'spendiŋ","n. 经费, 开销\\n[经] 开支, 开销, 经费",["An aging population will require more spending on health care.","I prefer going outside to spending time on Facebook."],["老龄化的人口需要更多医疗保健支出。","比起上Facebook，我更喜欢去外面。"]],["entry","'entri","n. 登录, 条目, 进入, 入口, 报关\\n[计] 登录项, 输入项, 条目",["Her smooth entry into the ranks of the royal family will help to dispel these fears.","I gave my daughter an entry ticket to the concert for her birthday."],["证实她顺利地过渡入皇室组织，有帮于消除这些焦虑。","我送了我女兒一張音樂會門票作為生日禮物。"]],["evaluate","i'væljueit","vt. 评估, 评价, 赋值",["Gorelick said that the outcomes of his work in Jordan may be used to evaluate water scarcity in other Middle Eastern countries, such as Syria.","The coach had a one-on-one discussion with each player to evaluate his performance on the field."],["戈雷利克表示，他在約旦的研究成果可用於評估敘利亞等其他中東國家的水資源短缺。",""]],["symbol","'simbl","n. 符号, 象征, 代号, 信条\\n[计] 符号; 码元",["This means that eating dumplings on New Year's eve is a symbol of family reunion.","Translated into many languages, The International has been and is still singing symbol of social struggles around the world."],["说明年夜饭的饺子是亲人团聚的象征。","被翻譯成多種語言的國際歌，在世界各地仍然是社會鬥爭的象徵。"]],["maker","'meikә","n. 制造者, 上帝\\n[经] 制造者, 出票人",["In the U.S., it is common to give a present, such as glasses or a coffee-maker, to the bride at weddings.","This new and improved coffee maker will revolutionize the way you start your morning."],["",""]],["mood","mu:d","n. 心情, 气氛, 生气, 基调\\n[医] 心境",["Don't bother Mary; she's in a rotten mood at the moment.","I haven't been in the mood lately to watch any films."],["别打扰玛丽，她现在脾气不好。","我最近一直沒心情看電影。"]],["accomplish","ә'kʌmpliʃ","vt. 完成, 达到, 实现, 使完美",["He is sure to accomplish his purpose.","Without me, you wouldn't accomplish anything."],["他很肯定可以达到目标。","如果没有我，你什么也做不到。"]],["emphasis","'emfәsis","n. 强调, 加强, 重点, 强语气",["He placed emphasis on the importance of education.","Modern healthy eating experts put emphasis on eating wholemeal bread and eating more vegetables."],["他强调了教育的重要性。","现代的健康饮食专家强调要吃全麦面包，多吃蔬菜。"]],["boot","bu:t","n. 长靴, 踢, 解雇, 效用\\nvt. 使穿靴, 踢, 解雇, 有用\\n[计] 引导, 自举",["Do you need as many licenses as you have operating systems installed in a multi-boot PC?","The doors wouldn't open, so I had to get into the car through the boot."],["在多重引導電腦上安裝多少作業系統，就需要多少授權嗎？",""]],["illustrate","'ilәstreit","vt. 举例说明, 作图解, 阐明\\nvi. 举例说明",["This dictionary has sentences that illustrate how to use each word.","I would like to illustrate children's books for a living."],["",""]],["monitor","'mɒnitә","n. 监督器, 级长, 监听员, 班长, 监视器, 告诫物\\nv. 监视, 监听, 监督\\n[计] 监视器, 监视程序; 监视",["Whilst at university, Xiaowang held the post of class monitor.","I'll monitor your progress from my computer."],["上大學的时候，小王擔任過班長。","我會用我的電腦監察你的進度。"]],["entertainment",".entә'teinmәnt","n. 娱乐, 款待, 娱乐表演",["The latest entertainment magazine has many Korean influences.","Korean entertainment culture is popular worldwide."],["最近的娛樂雜誌上很多有關韓流的內容。","韓國的娛樂文化在全球都很受歡迎。"]],["asian","'eiʃәn","n. 亚洲人\\na. 亚洲的, 亚洲人的",["In Asian culture it's customary to take one's shoes off before entering a house or temple.","The imports from Asian countries have expanded recently."],["在亚洲文化里，习惯在进一个房子或一座寺庙前先脱鞋子。","最近，来自亚洲各国的进口额不断扩大。"]],["bean","bi:n","n. 豆子\\n[化] 油嘴; 豆",["Acaraje, a Brazilian food from Africa, is a ball of caupi bean dough, onions, and salt, fried in palm oil and served with shrimp and a spicy sauce.","After eating the bean salad, he had a six and seven-eighths pack."],["阿嗄拉咭是源自非洲的巴西食品，是豇豆面团、洋葱和盐，经棕榈油炸，与虾和辣酱一起食用的食品。",""]],["creature","'kri:tʃә","n. 人, 动物, 创造物, 生物",["You cannot compare the strength of a man to that of a tiger, but nevertheless, the tiger is still the inferior creature.","The octopus is an extremely intelligent sea creature."],["虎与人是无法比拼力量的，但是，老虎还是比人类低等。","章魚是一種非常聰明的海洋生物。"]],["evaluation","i.vælju'eiʃәn","n. 评估, 估价, 求值\\n[计] 鉴定; 评价; 求值",["He has not taken the highest level evaluation, but he is good at mathematics.","This financial audit also includes an evaluation of the company's assets."],["",""]],["commander","kә'mɑ:ndә","n. 司令官, 指挥官",["The launch, which had been scheduled for this morning, was postponed because of the illness of shuttle Commander John Creighton.","The commander gave orders that his men fire at once."],["",""]],["digital","'didʒitәl","a. 数字显示的, 数字的\\nn. 数字仪表, 数字式电子表(或时钟)\\n[计] 数字, 数字式",["I'm going to buy myself a new camera, digital this time.","That year's buzzword was digital: digital clocks, digital microwave ovens, even digital pens."],["我要给我自己买一个新照相机，这次要数码的。","那一年的流行語是「數位」：數位鐘、數位微波爐，甚至還有數位筆。"]],["arrangement","ә'reindʒmәnt","n. 排列, 整齐, 安排\\n[计] 排列",["Flower arrangement is a part of Japanese culture.","A delivery man is dropping off an arrangement of artificial flowers."],["花道是日本文化的一部分。",""]],["concentrate","'kɒnsәntreit","n. 浓缩, 精选\\nv. 集中, 专心",["If you concentrate all your energies on the study of English, you will master the language.","I can't concentrate on my work because of the noise."],["你如果能把全副精力放進去，要學會英文並不是難事。","由于噪音，我无法集中精力工作了。"]],["usual","'ju:ʒuәl","a. 平常的, 通常的",["As usual the peasants are busy scattering grain seeds.","We give here a list of the usual Esperanto-related questions."],["農民們如常在忙著播種。","我們在這裡羅列了常見的有關世界語的問題。"]],["psychological",".saikә'lɒdʒikәl","a. 心理学的, 精神上的, 心灵的\\n[法] 心理上的, 心理学的",["Those selected will have to face extensive medical and psychological tests.","Benson and Holmes analyzed the psychological effect of artificial insemination on parents."],["被选上的将会面临大量的医学和精神测试。",""]],["anger","'æŋgә","n. 忿怒\\nvt. 激怒, 使发怒\\nvi. 发怒",["Anger is punishing yourself for other people's mistakes.","I am really extremely angry, so I plan to smash things to vent my anger."],["生氣，就是拿別人的過錯來懲罰自己。","我實在氣得不得了，所以打算砸東西發洩。"]],["heavily","'hevili","adv. 很重地, 严重地, 难以忍受地",["It was raining heavily when I got up this morning.","I had hardly left home when it began to rain heavily."],["我今天早上起来的时候雨下得很大。","當雨開始下得很大的時候, 我幾乎不能出門了。"]],["peak","pi:k","n. 山峰, 巅, 山顶, 顶点, 尖峰, 帽舌\\na. 最高的, 最大值的\\nvi. 到达最高点, 消瘦, 变憔悴, 逐渐缩小\\nvt.…",["The peak of Fujiyama was covered with snow.","There are no shortcuts to the peak, only to the abyss."],["富士山顶盖满了雪。",""]],["approximately","ә'prɒksimәtli","adv. 大约, 大致, 近于\\n[经] 大约, 近似",["Approximately thirty young people attended.","Approximately 30 people were arrested."],["約有三十箇年輕人到了。","大约 30 个人被逮捕。"]],["increasing","in'kri:siŋ","[经] 递增",["Recession is a temporary falling off of business activity during a period when such activity is generally increasing.","I hear that the number of the unemployed has been increasing recently."],["经济萧条是一段时间内，当这样的经济活动普遍增长而造成的一种临时性的经济活动衰退。","听说最近失业者人数正在增加。"]],["missile","'misail","n. 发射物, 导弹, 飞弹, 火箭\\na. 可发射的",["Algeria needs to build up its missile capabilities.","The Cuban Missile Crisis brought the world to the brink of nuclear war."],["",""]],["disorder","dis'ɒ:dә","n. 杂乱, 混乱\\nvt. 扰乱, 使失调",["Tom thinks that Mary may have an eating disorder.","Tom thinks Mary may have an eating disorder."],["汤姆认为玛丽可能有进食障碍。","汤姆认为玛丽可能有进食障碍。"]],["equally","'i:kwәli","adv. 相等地, 同样地, 平等地",["They are equally matched in their knowledge of French.","Whether you pick the Lions or Tigers to win, the result will be a toss-up because both teams are equally strong."],["",""]],["wire","'waiә","n. 电线, 电报, 电信, 铁丝网, 金属丝\\nvt. 用金属丝捆扎, 拍电报\\nvi. 打电报",["Having forgotten his key, he was able to open the door by inserting a wire in the keyhole.","Is the wire live? I can tell just by touching it."],["他没带钥匙，用铁丝拨动了两下，门居然开了。","电线有没有电？我一摸就知道。"]],["vary","'vєәri","vt. 改变, 使多样化\\nvi. 变化, 有不同, 违反",["The amount of time spent asleep can vary from person to person.","China's territory is vast, thus the types of tea vary."],["睡眠时间的长短可因人而异。","中国幅员辽阔,因而茶的品种繁多。"]],["round","raund","n. 圆, 圆形物, 巡回, 循环, 一轮, 一回合, 一局, 范围, 轮唱\\na. 圆的, 球形的, 丰满的, 肥胖的, 完全的, 大概…",["There is no one but knows that the earth is round.","Round-trip fares to each destination are as follows."],["誰都知道地球是圓的。","往返各地的收费如下。"]],["distribution",".distrә'bju:ʃәn","n. 分配\\n[计] 分布",["Ubuntu is a popular Linux distribution.","In its graphical representation, the normal distribution is a bell-shaped curve, with the value growing as one moves closer to the middle and decreasing as one moves away."],["Ubuntu是一个流行的Linux发行版。","在图形上，正态分布是一种钟形曲线，越接近中心，取值越大，越远离中心，取值越小。"]],["transportation",".trænspә'teiʃәn","n. 运输, 输送, 交通车辆\\n[经] 运转, 运输, 运输费",["The transportation in this city is very convenient.","This hotel is conveniently located in terms of public transportation."],["这个城市的交通方便得很。","這間酒店的交通位置很方便。"]],["holy","'hәuli","a. 神圣的, 圣洁的, 至善的\\nn. 神圣的东西",["The man on whom you see the Spirit come down and remain is he who will baptize with the Holy Spirit.","Jerusalem is the Holy City of the Jews."],["你如果看見聖靈降下，落在誰身上，誰就是用聖靈替人施洗的了。","耶路撒冷是犹太人的圣城。"]],["twin","twin","n. 双胞胎中一人, 一对非常相像的人(或物)中的一个\\na. 双胞胎的, 成对的, 孪生的\\nvi. 生双胞胎, 成对\\nvt. 怀(双…",["These twin brothers are as alike as two peas in a pod.","Ally loves playing with her twin sister Anne."],["这两个双胞胎兄弟长得一模一样。","Ally喜欢和她的双胞胎妹妹Anne一起玩。"]],["command","kә'mɑ:nd","n. 命令, 指挥, 控制, 部队, 司令部\\nv. 命令, 指挥, 控制\\n[计] 命令; 指令; DOS外部命令:启动新的命令处理器",["She has a good command of English though she was brought up in Japan.","Linux experts are able to use the command line."],["雖然她在日本被撫養長大，但是她精通英語。","Linux系统的高手都会用命令行。"]],["commission","kә'miʃәn","n. 委任状, 任官令, 所委职责, 佣金, 犯, 委托, 所托之事\\nvt. 委任, 委托制作, 使服役",["I get a three percent commission on anything I sell.","Mary proposed a different project to the commission."],["",""]],["interpretation","in.tә:pri'teiʃәn","n. 解释, 演出, 翻译\\n[计] 插值; 插值法; 解释",["Your interpretation is based merely on the surface meaning.","Your interpretation is a bit too literal."],["你的理解有点望文生义了。","你的理解有点望文生义了。"]],["breakfast","'brekfәst","n. 早餐",["I always have a look at the newspaper before breakfast.","A little walk will give you a good appetite for breakfast."],["我经常在早饭前看一眼报纸。","散散步將會給你很好的食慾吃早餐。"]],["strongly","'strɒŋli","adv. 强有力地, 坚强地, 激烈地",["I also think 'living hell' is putting it too strongly.","Mariko's parents are strongly opposed to her marrying an American."],["我也覺得說成「人間地獄」是誇張了點。","麻理子的父母强烈反对她和美国人结婚。"]],["luck","lʌk","n. 运气, 幸运, 好运, 侥幸\\nvi. 靠好运成功",["Even if your sentences were actually senseless, you at least have the luck to be able to form beautiful sentences.","A little bit of luck sometimes leads to an unexpected success."],["即使你的句子实际上是毫无意义的，至少你有幸能造出好句子。","一點點的運氣有時會導致意想不到的成功。"]],["engineering",".endʒi'niәriŋ","n. 工程学, 工程, 操纵\\n[化] 机器; 机器学",["Engineering service will be taken up by the Japanese company.","I am studying electrical engineering at the University of Plymouth."],["",""]],["constant","'kɒnstәnt","n. 常数, 恒量\\na. 不变的, 一定的, 时常的\\n[计] 常量; 常数; 恒值",["Despite Trang's constant affirmations of love, Spenser is still afraid someday she will fall out of love with him.","Tom found Mary's constant criticism of him hard to cope with."],["儘管莊不斷發誓她不變的愛情，斯賓塞仍然害怕有一天她會不愛他了。","汤姆认为和经常批评他的玛丽很难相处。"]],["clinic","'klinik","n. 诊所, 临床教学\\n[医] 诊所(门诊部); 临床(讲解); 临床(学)科",["This clinic is doing laser surgery.","Tom works at a harm reduction clinic."],["这个诊所正在做激光手术。","湯姆在一家減害診所工作。"]],["veteran","'vetәrәn","n. 老手, 退伍军人, 老兵, 老树\\na. 老兵的, 老练的, 经验丰富的",["In Tatoeba, you gotta always listen to veteran members. They'll tell you what can't be done and why. Then do it.","She's a veteran: she's been doing this for decades."],["在Tatoeba，你必須總是傾聽資深成員。他們會告訴你什麼不能做，以及為什麼。然後你去做。",""]],["smell","smel","n. 味道, 气味, 嗅觉, 嗅, 臭味, 气息\\nvt. 闻, 探出, 察觉, 发出...的气味\\nvi. 嗅, 散发气味, 发臭",["A dog's sense of smell is much keener than a human's.","I can only describe the terrible smell as vomit mixed with rotting flesh."],["狗的嗅覺比人類敏銳得多。","我只能描述这可怕的味道像呕吐物混合着烂肉。"]],["tablespoon","'teiblspu:n","n. 大汤匙\\n[医] 汤匙, 大匙(15毫升)",["In the United States, a tablespoon is equivalent to three teaspoons.","Tom adds a tablespoon of ground flaxseeds to his oatmeal every morning."],["",""]],["capable","'keipәbl","a. 有能力的, 能的, 能干的",["This airplane is capable of carrying 40 passengers at a time.","I never thought he was capable of doing something so cruel."],["这架飞机一次可以携带40名乘客。","我从来没想到他能做到那么残忍的事。"]],["nervous","'nә:vәs","a. 神经紧张的, 不安的, 神经的\\n[医] 神经的; 神经质的, 神经过敏的",["With so many people around he naturally became a bit nervous.","The student became very nervous with the teacher watching him."],["他被很多人围着，自然变得有点紧张。","那個學生被老師盯著看，覺得渾身不自在。"]],["tourist","'tuәrist","n. 观光客, 旅行者\\na. 旅游的",["Visiting all the tourist sights really wore me out.","Edinburgh already offers a busy and traditional city experience, with many historic buildings and tourist attractions."],["參觀所有觀光勝地累壞了我。","爱丁堡已经供应一个繁忙而传统的城市，有许多历史性的建筑物和名胜。"]],["toss","tɒs","n. 投掷, 抛, 摇摆, 震荡, 掷钱币决定\\nvt. 投掷, 猛抬, 摇荡, 使不安, 掷钱币决定\\nvi. 被到处扔, 摇摆, 颠簸…",["The coin toss decides who will kick off the match.","I don't give a toss that you are tired."],["裁判抛硬币来决定谁来开球。","我才不管你累不累呢。"]],["crucial","'kru:ʃәl","a. 决定性的, 重要的, 严厉的\\n[医] 十字形的; 决断的, 定局的",["The next four to six weeks are crucial in controlling the massive Ebola outbreak.","Mental strength is crucial for success in any sports."],["接下來的四到六週將對於控制伊波拉病毒的大爆發至關重要。",""]],["bury","'beri","vt. 埋葬, 埋藏",["You can only bury these deeply in your heart.","They're fighting fiercely now but I assure you they'll bury the hatchet before long."],["只能把這些深深地埋在心裏。",""]],["pray","prei","v. 祈祷, 恳求, 请",["There's nothing we can do to save Tom at this point. All we can do is pray.","In Tbilisi, you can find the only mosque in the world where shia and sunni Muslims pray together."],["現在我們什麼也做不了，救不了湯姆。我們唯一能做的就是祈禱。","在第比利斯，你可以看到世界上唯一一座什葉派和遜尼派穆斯林一起祈禱的清真寺。"]],["tomato","tә'mɑ:tәu","n. 番茄, 西红柿",["Strictly speaking, the tomato is not a vegetable. It's a fruit.","One kilogram of tomato sauce is equivalent to two kilograms of tomatoes."],["嚴格來說，蕃茄不是蔬菜，是水果。","一公斤的番茄酱等于两公斤的西红柿。"]],["exception","ik'sepʃәn","n. 例外, 除外, 异议\\n[计] 例外; 异常",["I'm not a woman hater; and if I were, I would make an exception for you.","It's been hot this month, but today's an exception."],["我不是一個厭惡女性的人; 但如果我是, 我會為你而破例。","这个月一直都很热，但今天是个例外。"]],["butter","'bʌtә","n. 奶油, 黄油\\nvt. 涂黄油于",["I watched as my grandmother pulled a golden butter pie from the oven.","The store sells foodstuffs, such as butter, cheese, and sugar."],["我看著奶奶從烤箱裡拿出一個金黃色的奶油派。","這家店賣黃油、奶酪、砂糖之類的食品。"]],["deficit","'defisit","n. 赤字, 不足额\\n[医] 短缺",["A huge federal budget deficit has been plaguing the American economy for many years.","A budget deficit will occur because of a revenue shortfall."],["",""]],["bathroom","'bɑ:θru:m","n. 浴室, 厕所",["When you leave the bathroom, you should wash your hands.","Tom dreams of the toilet when he has to go to the bathroom."],["离开厕所前应该洗手。","湯姆在需要上廁所的時候會夢見廁所。"]],["objective","әb'dʒektiv","n. 目的, 目标, 宗旨, 宾格, 实物\\na. 客观的, 如实的, 无偏见的, 宾格的",["It's hard to stay objective and calm when it happens to you.","He explained the plan's main objective."],["当事情发生在自己身上时，就无法客观冷静地处理。","他解释了这个计划的主要目标。"]],["electronic",".ilek'trɒnik","a. 电子的\\n[计] 电子工业协会接口",["This man is like a filthy electronic without a battery.","The good thing about this electronic dictionary is that it's easy to carry."],["这个男人简直像一台被扯掉了电源的肮脏电器。","这电子辞典的好处就是便于携带。"]],["ally","'ælai. ә'lai","n. 同盟者, 同盟国, 助手\\nvt. 使联盟, 使联合, 使有关系\\nvi. 结盟",["Algeria is a close ally of both Russia and China.","Ally loves playing with her twin sister Anne."],["阿尔及利亚是俄罗斯和中国的亲密盟友。","Ally喜欢和她的双胞胎妹妹Anne一起玩。"]],["journey","'dʒә:ni","n. 旅程, 旅行, 行程\\nvi. 旅行\\nvt. 游历",["A journey of a thousand miles begins with a single step.","When booking flights, I decided the easiest way would be to fly to Beijing first, then get the train to complete my journey."],["千里之行，始於足下。","预定机票时我决定最容易的办法就是先坐飞机到北京，然后坐火车完成我的旅程。"]],["surely","'ʃuәli","adv. 的确地, 安全地\\n[经] 保证, 保证人, 保证金",["An English-Japanese dictionary is surely a must have book, not just for those taking TOEIC, but for all studying English.","Among the five of us, he's surely the one who can speak the most languages."],["一本英日字典無疑地是一本必備的書，不僅是對那些參加多益考試的人，而且是對所有學習英語的人。","我們五個人當中，他一定是那個會說最多種語言的人。"]],["reputation",".repju'teiʃәn","n. 名誉, 名声, 声望\\n[法] 名声, 名誉, 公认证据",["Ms. Eichler had a notorious reputation for being austere to her students.","Japanese companies have built up a reputation for quality."],["艾希勒女士对学生严厉是出了名的。","日本公司已經建立了品質的信譽。"]],["tower","'tauә","n. 塔, 高楼, 堡垒\\nvi. 高耸, 翱翔",["They said humanity needs to rebuild the Tower of Babel, I have no comment on this.","The Eiffel Tower is in the same city as the Louvre Museum."],["他们说人类要重建巴别塔，我对此不予评价。","埃菲尔铁塔和卢浮宫在同一座城市。"]],["mixture","'mikstʃә","n. 混合, 混淆, 混合物\\n[化] 混合物",["The London to Amsterdam flight was partially powered with a mixture of coconut and babassu nut oil.","Every opinion is a mixture of truth and mistakes."],["倫敦飛往阿姆斯特丹的航班部分動力來自椰子油和巴巴蘇堅果油的混合物。","任何意見都是事實與謬誤的混合體。"]],["smoke","smәuk","n. 烟, 雾气, 烟熏剂, 抽烟, 烟色\\nvi. 吸烟, 冒烟, 弥漫\\nvt. 以烟熏, 抽烟而导致...",["Look at that smoke. That building must be on fire.","I watched a ring of smoke that floated from his cigar into the air."],["你看，那邊正在冒煙，那棟大廈一定是失火了。","我看著一輪煙圈從他的雪茄裏冒出來，飄到了空氣中。"]],["confront","kәn'frʌnt","vt. 使面对, 对抗, 遭遇, 使对质, 比较\\n[法] 对证, 使对质, 比较",["Let's cooperate where we can, let's confront where we must.","Sami was determined to confront the problem head on."],["",""]],["pure","pjuә","a. 纯的, 纯净的, 纯洁的, 清白的, 完美的, 无瑕的, 抽象的\\n[医] 的, 纯净的",["Some of my classmates are pure noobs; they know nothing about computing sciences.","Europeans drink, on average, 12.5 liters of pure alcohol per year."],["我的一些同学真是菜鸟，他们一点都不懂计算机。","歐洲人每年平均飲用十二點五公升的純酒精。"]],["glance","'glɑ:ns","n. 一瞥, 闪光, 掠过, 辉矿类\\nvi. 扫视, 闪光, 掠过, 提到, 略说\\nvt. 扫视, 反射, 使掠过",["Possibly because he's got a beard, he looks scary at first glance but he's really a kind man.","With a glance of her, he left swiftly."],["或许是因为他有胡子而让他乍看之下很可怕，其实他是个非常好的人。","他看了她一眼就马上离开了。"]],["toy","tɒi","n. 玩具, 小玩艺儿, 小型的东西, 消遣\\na. 供玩耍的, 作为玩具的\\nvi. 玩弄, 戏弄, 调情",["The plush fur of the toy felt so soft and somehow soothing.","Tom appealed to his mother to buy a new toy for him."],["那個玩具絨毛摸起來很柔軟，讓人感到舒適。","汤姆请求妈妈给他买新玩具。"]],["prisoner","'priznә","n. 囚犯, 犯人, 战俘\\n[法] 犯人, 囚犯, 扣押犯",["The king ordered that the prisoner should be set free.","Everybody showed sympathy toward the prisoner."],["國王下令把囚犯釋放。","每个人都对囚犯表示同情。"]],["dimension","dai'menʃәn","n. 尺寸, 次元, 面积, 维数\\nvt. 标出尺寸",["In the third dimension you see yourself as a separate entity in comparison to other people and the universe.","This adds a new dimension of complexity to the problem."],["",""]],["fellow","'felәu","n. 男人, 朋友, 同事\\na. 同伴的, 同事的, 同道的",["He is hardly friendly with his fellow workers.","He's your senior fellow apprentice."],["他几乎不和他的同僚友好相处。","他是你的师兄。"]],["smooth","smu:ð","a. 平滑的, 平稳的, 流畅的, 和蔼的, 安祥的, 圆滑的, 调匀的, 无毛的\\nvt. 使光滑, 烫平, 使平和, 消除\\nvi. …",["Her smooth entry into the ranks of the royal family will help to dispel these fears.","Blend the mixture together until it is smooth."],["证实她顺利地过渡入皇室组织，有帮于消除这些焦虑。","將混合物攪拌均勻。"]],["nearby","'niәbai","a. 附近的, 近旁的\\nadv. 在附近, 近旁地\\nprep. 在...附近",["The rent can be a bit expensive, but something nearby would be best.","My wife buys vegetables from a supermarket nearby."],["租金贵一点儿没关系，近一些最好。","我老婆在附近的超市买蔬菜。"]],["peer","piә","n. 同等的人, 匹敌, 贵族\\nvi. 凝视, 窥视, 费力地看, 隐现\\nvt. 与...同等, 封为贵族",["Peer helpers made the teacher's job a lot easier, but established a cruel hierarchy among the students.","Every scientific article needs to pass peer review before it is published in a scientific journal."],["",""]],["personnel",".pә:sә'nel","n. 人员, 人事部门, 人事科(处)\\n[经] 人事, 全体人员, 职工",["I will not be dictated to by some idiot in the personnel department.","To avoid electrical shock, do not open the cabinet. Refer servicing to qualified personnel only."],["",""]],["designer","di'zainә","n. 设计者, 谋划者, 制图者\\n[计] 设计员",["In the hands of a skilled designer, any two colors can go well together.","These dresses were designed by the same designer."],["無論是多麼不協和的兩種顏色，在技術高超的設計師手裏，也能化成悅目的配搭。","这几套衣服是同一位服装师设计的."]],["relative","'relәtiv","n. 亲戚, 关系词\\na. 有关系的, 相对的, 比较的",["A close neighbor is better than a distant relative.","The relative pronoun 'that' has two states, a nominative case and objective case, but there is no possessive case."],["远亲不如近邻。",""]],["educator","'edjukeitә","n. 教育家",["He was a great educator so his children really listened to him.","Ziri is an Algerian canine educator."],["他很会教育人，所以他的孩子都很听话。",""]],["belt","belt","n. 带子, 地带\\n[医] 带, 腰带, 束带, 地带, 区",["It's the law: always buckle your safety belt in cars and airplanes.","Tom would still be alive if he had been wearing his seat belt."],["法律規定，在車輛和飛機上，一定要扣上安全帶。","要是汤姆系上安全带的话，他就不会死的。"]],["immigration",".imi'greiʃәn","n. 移民, 移居\\n[医] 移民",["Please let me see your passport, also did you complete the immigration form?","This is the central problem of postwar immigration."],["请你把护照出示给我看看，还有入境表格填好了吗？",""]],["teaspoon","'ti:spu:n","n. 茶匙\\n[医] 茶匙(4毫升)",["Let us repeat: cup, plate, knife, fork, spoon, teaspoon.","She stirred her coffee with a teaspoon."],["再念一次：杯子、盤子、刀、叉、湯匙、茶匙。","她用茶匙搅她的咖啡。"]],["birthday","'bә:θdei","n. 生日",["It was Sir Anthony's eightieth birthday concert and everybody wanted a ticket.","Publication of the article was timed to coincide with the professor's birthday."],["这是安东尼爵士的八十岁生日音乐会，大家都想要一张入场券。","文章的发表被预定在教授生日那天。"]],["implication",".impli'keiʃәn","n. 牵连, 含义, 暗示\\n[法] 推断, 含蓄之意, 暗示",["The implication was that where there was a well, there were residents.","I resent your implication that I am engaged to you only because of your money."],["含義是哪裡有水井，哪裡就有居民。",""]],["perfectly","'pә:fiktli","adv. 完全地, 无瑕疵地, 完整地",["Rio de Janeiro is perfectly safe as long as you stay out of the dangerous areas.","Tatoeba is back, but not everything will be working perfectly."],["只要你遠離危險區域，里約熱內盧就是完全安全的。","Tatoeba 恢復開放，但有些部分可能會出現異常。"]],["coast","kәust","n. 海岸, 滑坡\\nv. 沿海岸而行",["More than a third of the world population lives near a coast.","China, otherwise known as the People's Republic of China, is located in east Asia, on the western coast of the Pacific ocean."],["全世界有超過三分之一的人在沿岸地區居住。","中国，全名中华人民共和国，位于亚洲东部，太平洋西岸。"]],["supporter","sә'pɒ:tә","n. 支持者, 后盾, 迫随者, 护身织物\\n[法] 支持者, 赡养者, 抚养者",["Algeria is a strong supporter of the Sahrawi independence movement.","She's no longer a supporter of the communist regime."],["",""]],["accompany","ә'kʌmpәni","vt. 陪伴, 伴随, 补充, 为...伴奏\\nvi. 伴奏, 伴唱",["Unfortunately, you will return to China soon, so I will have nobody to accompany me.","Tomorrow is the first time I will accompany the Chinese delegation, and I'm extremely nervous."],["可惜你很快又会回中国，没人陪我了呢。","明天第一次陪中国代表团， 我紧张得不得了。"]],["silver","'silvә","n. 银, 银币, 银器\\na. 银的, 银制的, 银器的\\nvt. 镀银\\nvi. 变银白色",["So it seems that cloud of odorless deadly gas had a silver lining after all.","As the saying goes: Speech is silver, silence is gold."],["只能说，那团无味的致命气体，也不是没有好处。","常言道：言语是银，沉默是金。"]],["teenager","'ti:nidʒә","n. 十三岁到十九岁的少年",["When I was a teenager I had lots of hair on my head and none on my chest. Now it's just the opposite.","Dan dated Linda when she was a teenager."],["当我还是年轻人的时候，我脑袋上有很多头发，胸上无毛。现在，恰恰相反。","丹在琳達十幾歲的時候就與她交往過。"]],["recognition",".rekәg'niʃәn","n. 赞誉, 认得, 识别, 承认, 认可, 认识\\n[电] 认识",["She gave me a smile of recognition.","When you speak of a pay-raise before recognition, I am inclined to think you are putting the cart before the horse."],["她給了我一個認可的微笑。",""]],["retirement","ri'taiәmәnt","n. 退休, 隐居, 撤退\\n[经] 退休, 退股, (固定资产)报废",["His income was diminished by half after retirement.","From graduation to retirement, Laowang worked as a teacher without intermission."],["退休后他的收入少了一半。","從大學畢業到退休，老王一直擔任教學工作。"]],["recovery","ri'kʌvәri","n. 恢复, 复原, 痊愈, 重获\\n[计] 恢复",["You have to be patient about your recovery.","My wishes for your father's rapid recovery."],["你必須對你的康復有耐心。","祝令尊早日康復。"]],["flag","flæg","n. 标志, 旗标, 旗子, 信号旗, 菖蒲\\nvt. 悬旗, 打旗号, 铺石板\\nvi. 无力地下垂\\n[计] 标志; 属性标记命令",["The assistant referee held up his flag to show the referee that the ball was still in play.","If someone in the class has a birthday, the teacher always draws a flag on the blackboard."],["助理裁判向主裁判举旗示意比赛继续。","如果班上有人過生日, 老師總是會在黑板上畫一面旗子。"]],["whisper","'hwispә","n. 耳语, 密谈, 谣传, 沙沙声\\nvi. 耳语, 密谈, 沙沙地响\\nvt. 低声说",["She laid her hand on my arm, and sank her voice to a whisper.","To him, in his present fractious mood, she dared whisper no observations, nor ask of him any information."],["",""]],["gentleman","'dʒentlmәn","n. 绅士, 先生",["His dress is that of a gentleman, but his speech and behavior are those of a clown.","He must be a gentleman to act that way."],["他衣着像个绅士，言行举止却像个小丑。","这样的举止只可能是个绅士。"]],["corn","kɒ:n","n. 玉蜀黍, 谷类, 谷粒, 鸡眼\\nvt. 使成颗粒, 腌",["What country has the absolute advantage in the production of corn?","Our breakfast has oats and corn in it."],["哪一個國家擁有生產玉米的絕對優勢？","我們早餐有燕麥和玉米。"]],["inner","'inә","a. 内部的, 内心的\\nn. 内部",["Music is inner life, and he will never suffer loneliness who has inner life.","This inner conflict tends to diminish as the years go by."],["音乐是内心世界，拥有了内心世界的他永远不会觉得孤独。","這種內心的衝突往往會隨著歲月流逝而平息。"]],["moon","mu:n","n. 月亮, 月球, 月光\\nvi. 闲荡\\nvt. 虚度",["It will not be long before we can take a trip to the moon.","It is no longer a dream for man to live on the moon."],["我們不久就能到月球旅行了。","人类在月球上居住已不再是梦想。"]],["junior","'dʒu:njә","n. 年少者, 地位较低者, 大学三年级学生\\na. 年少的, 下级的, 后进的",["He's just a normal junior high school student, not particularly intelligent.","He eventually married an Italian woman ten years his junior."],["他只不過是個普普通通的中學生，不算特別聰明。","他最终和一个比他小十岁的意大利女人结了婚。"]],["swing","swiŋ","n. 摇摆, 振幅, 音律, 节奏, 涨落, 秋千, 旋转, 行动自由\\nvi. 摇摆, 悬挂, 旋转, 大摇大摆地走, 转向\\nvt. …",["If you wind up the doll with the key on the side of its torso it will swing its arms round and go forward doing somersaults.","\"I am too old to swing on branches,\" said the boy."],["如果你在洋娃娃腹部的側面上鏈的話，它就會扭動手臂，翻著筋斗向前前進。",""]],["throat","θrәut","n. 咽喉, 喉咙, 嗓音\\nvt. 用喉音说, 开沟于",["I've had a scratchy throat since this morning. I wonder if I've caught a cold.","I got a fish bone stuck in my throat."],["早上起来，嗓子变得很沙哑，我想是不是感冒了。","我被鱼骨刺到了喉咙。"]],["salary","'sælәri","n. 薪水\\nvt. 给...加薪",["Many people consider a high salary to be a condition for success.","His remuneration consists of a base salary plus commissions."],["不少人以高薪为成功的条件。","他的薪水包括基本工資和提成。"]],["observer","әb'zә:vә","n. 观察者, 遵守者, 观察员\\n[法] 观察者, 观察员, 监场员",["I'm proactive in shaping my reality, rather than being a passive observer.","Opaque? Not at all. Intuitively obvious to the most casual observer."],["",""]],["publication",".pʌbli'keiʃәn","n. 出版物, 出版, 公布\\n[经] 发布",["Publication of the article was timed to coincide with the professor's birthday.","Publication of the book was timed to coincide with the author's birthday."],["文章的发表被预定在教授生日那天。",""]],["dig","dig","vt. 挖, 翻土, 发掘\\nvi. 挖掘\\nn. 挖掘\\n[计] 数字, 数位",["I'm so embarrassed I could dig a hole and crawl into it.","Some people tried to dig the treasure out, but they couldn't."],["我窘得想找個洞鑽進去。",""]],["crop","krɒp","n. 农作物, 产量, 平头\\nvt. 收割, 修剪, 种植\\nvi. 收获\\n[计] 裁剪",["Without bee pollination, California's almond crop, for example, would be non-existent.","The flood caused a great deal of damage to the crop."],["例如，如果沒有蜜蜂授粉，加州的杏仁作物就不會存在。",""]],["permanent","'pә:mәnәnt","a. 永久的, 不变的, 固定的, 持久的\\nn. 烫发\\n[计] 永久的",["Please give me your permanent address.","Absolutely nothing is permanent in life."],["請給我你的永久地址。","生活中绝对没有什么是持久的。"]],["phenomenon","fi'nɒminәn","n. 现象, 迹象, 表现, 奇迹, 奇才\\n[化] 现象",["The aurora is a phenomenon characteristic of the polar regions.","Many of Europe's metropolises are plagued by the doughnut phenomenon."],["極光是極地特有的自然現象。","许多欧洲的大都市饱受“甜甜圈现象”困扰。"]],["anxiety","æŋ'zaiәti","n. 焦虑, 忧虑, 令人焦虑的事\\n[医] 焦虑",["The red circle on the calendar marking the deadline causes me to fall into anxiety.","The way to solve pre-exam anxiety is to start learning now."],["日历上画着红圈的截稿日期使我陷入了焦虑。","解决考前焦虑的办法是立刻开始学习。"]],["unlike",".ʌn'laik","a. 不像的, 不同的\\nprep. 不像, 和...不同",["The crane, unlike the dog, has never dreamed of flying.","One of the reasons that we love nature is that, unlike ourselves, nature is not envious or deceitful."],["不像狗, 這隻鶴從來沒有夢想過飛翔。","我们之所以爱自然——其原由之一，至少是由于它不像我们人那样既嫉妒又欺骗。"]],["literally","'litәrәli","adv. 逐字地, 按照字面上地, 不夸张地",["We know it's difficult, but please don't translate literally.","I didn't literally translate from English into Japanese."],["我们知道这很困难，但请不要直译。","我没有把英语直译成日语。"]],["resist","ri'zist","v. 抵抗, 耐得住, 抵制, 反抗\\nn. 防染材料",["It's hard to resist the wish to make the sentence rhyme.","We, ACME Ltd., hereby announce that we will resist with all our strength this hostile takeover."],["难以抵抗给句子押韵的愿望。","我們ACME有限公司，特此宣布，我們將盡我們的力量抵制這種惡意收購。"]],["wet","wet","n. 湿气, 潮湿, 水分, 雨天\\na. 湿的, 潮的, 搞错的, 下雨的, 反对禁酒的\\nvi. 变湿\\nvt. 使...湿",["With a warm and wet climate, Guangzhou has fresh flowers all year round.","The ground is still wet. As likely as not, the game will be canceled."],["因为气候又暖和又湿润，所以广州一年到头都有花。","地面仍然很濕滑，看來比賽要被取消了。"]],["convention","kәn'venʃәn","n. 大会, 协定, 惯例, 约定\\n[计] 约定",["Progress in science was often barred by convention.","Please let me know if you need help in reserving a room closer to the Convention Center."],["",""]],["embrace","im'breis","n. 拥抱\\nvt. 拥抱, 互相拥抱, 包含, 收买\\nvi. 拥抱",["He spread his arms as though he wanted to embrace the world.","He spread his arms as though wanting to embrace the world."],["他张开双臂, 似乎要拥抱这个世界。","他张开双臂, 似乎要拥抱这个世界。"]],["assist","ә'sist","n. 帮助, 协助\\nvt. 帮助, 促进\\nvi. 协助, 参加",["I would like you to assist me with my gardening.","The airplane used a rocket motor to assist with takeoff."],["我想請你帮我整理花園。",""]],["exhibition",".eksi'biʃәn","n. 表现, 展览会, 展览品\\n[医] 投药, 展览, 展出",["The exhibition has drawn much attention from the public.","They awarded her first prize at the art exhibition."],["展览大大地吸引了公众的注意。","他们在画展上授予了她一等奖。"]],["construct","kәn'strʌkt","vt. 构造, 建造, 对...进行构思, 作图\\nn. 构成物",["The purpose of criticism is to construct, not to destroy.","After reading his books I feel I can construct a house."],["批评的目的是建设而不是破坏。","讀完他的書後，我覺得我可以構建一棟房子。"]],["viewer","'vju:ә","n. 观察者, 看电视者, 视察员, 观察器\\n[化] 指示器",["Please select a language for the Image Viewer interface.","Image Viewer is an image viewing software. This software is a very small program. This software has basic functions only. This is translatable by Tatoeba Project users."],["请为Image Viewer的界面选择语言。","Image Viewer是一款图片查看软件。该软件是一个非常小的程序。只有基础功能。可以被Tatoeba项目的用户翻译。"]],["pan","pæn","n. 平锅, 浅盘, 盆地, 硬土层, 拍摄全景\\nv. 上下左右移动, 摇镜头, 淘洗, 淘金",["Put them on the baking pan and smear them with egg whites.","You scorned both the Nymphs, who beheld your deeds, and me the mighty Pan."],["將它們放在烤盤上並且塗抹蛋白。","你蔑視了目睹你罪行的仙女們，也蔑視了我を這位強大的潘神。"]],["consultant","kәn'sʌltәnt","n. 顾问, 征询意见者\\n[医] 顾问医师",["The debate over which consultant to use went on for hours.","The consultant, who is under the authority of the Chancellor, gives the committee advice on important questions."],["",""]],["administrator","әd'ministreitә","n. 管理人, 行政官\\n[经] 遗产管理人员",["You will receive a confirmation email after your account has been activated by an administrator.","Administrator and moderators are working for the best language tool, Tatoeba Project."],["",""]],["occasionally","ә'keiʒәnli","adv. 有时候, 偶而",["Even now, I occasionally think I'd like to see you. Not the you that you are today, but the you I remember from the past.","The mother occasionally reread her son's letter."],["即使是现在，我偶尔还是想见到你。不是今天的你，而是我记忆中曾经的你。","这位母亲偶尔会重温她的儿子的信件。"]],["mayor","'mєә","n. 市长\\n[法] 市长",["The mayor denied having taken a bribe.","He is one of the candidates running for mayor."],["市长否认收受了贿赂。","他是市長的候選人之一。"]],["consideration","kәn.sidә'reiʃәn","n. 考虑, 原因\\n[法] 考虑, 思考, 报酬",["Another factor to be taken into consideration is that the present situation is favourable to us.","We should've taken the schedule into consideration."],["将要考虑的另一个重要因素是，目前的情况对我们有利。","我们本该考虑一下行程。"]],["pink","piŋk","n. 粉红色, 石竹花, 化身, 典范, 头面人物, 极度\\na. 粉红的, 石竹科的, 比较激进的, 脸色发红的, 精致的, 有点下流的…",["Honeycake is a white kitten with purple eyes and a pink nose.","She was wearing pink panties under the skirt."],["蜂蜜蛋糕是一隻白色的小貓，有著紫色的眼睛和粉紅色的鼻子。","裙子下她穿著一條粉紅色的內褲。"]],["secure","si'kjuә","a. 无虑的, 安心的, 安全的, 可靠的, 保险的\\nvt. 固定, 获得, 保证, 使安全, 掩护, 招致\\nvi. 停止操作, 船抛锚",["They believe their country is secure against foreign enemies.","Please secure your seat belt during takeoff and landing."],["",""]],["historic","hi'stɒrik","a. 历史上著名的, 有历史性的",["Edinburgh already offers a busy and traditional city experience, with many historic buildings and tourist attractions.","There are many famous historic buildings in Kyoto."],["爱丁堡已经供应一个繁忙而传统的城市，有许多历史性的建筑物和名胜。","京都有很多有名的古建筑。"]],["buck","bʌk","n. 元, 雄鹿, 纨绔子弟, 鞍马, 培克(赌博时的庄家标志), 碱水, 自夸, 谈话\\nvi. 马背突然拱起, 反对, 吹牛, 闲聊\\…",["They're a dollar. They're a buck. They're a pound. They're a euro.","It is inexcusable to prey on people in a vulnerable time to make a quick buck."],["",""]],["poem","'pәuim","n. 诗, 诗般美的事物",["After climbing Mt Fuji I got the inspiration for a poem.","Whether Shakespeare wrote this poem or not will probably remain a mystery."],["攀登富士山後，我得到了一首詩的靈感。","這首詩是不是莎士比亞寫的，恐怕是無從考究的了。"]],["grandmother","'grændmʌðә","n. 祖母, 女祖先",["Her grandmother lived to be eighty-eight years old.","Grandmother takes great delight in watching television."],["她的祖母活到了八十八歲。","祖母非常喜欢看电视。"]],["bind","baind","vt. 绑, 约束, 装订, 包扎, 使结合\\nvi. 凝固, 有约束力\\n[计] 赋值, 绑定",["When you put a Christmas tree on the top of your car, you need to bind it with twine to make sure it stays there while you drive.","With the help of Carlitos, we were able to get out of that bind."],["",""]],["fifth","fifθ","num. 第五, 五分之一",["One fifth of the earth's surface is covered by permafrost.","I'd like to do shopping on Fifth Avenue in New York."],["地球表面的五分之一被冻土覆盖了。","我想在紐約的第五大道購物。"]],["constantly","'kɒnstәntli","adv. 不变地, 不断地, 时常地",["Our troops were constantly attacked by the guerrillas.","When I was talking with him, he was constantly looking to his side."],["我們軍隊總是被遊擊隊騷擾。","我跟他说话的时候，他一直往旁边看。"]],["enterprise","'entәpraiz","n. 企业, 事业心, 进取心, 干事业\\n[计] 企业",["The school-enterprise networking event was held as scheduled on December 26th.","The school-enterprise networking event will be held as scheduled on December 26th."],["学校与企业见面会于12月26日按期举行。","学校与企业见面会于12月26日按期举行。"]],["favor","'feivә","n. 好意, 喜爱\\nvt. 赐予, 支持, 喜欢, 证实",["The balance of public opinion remains in his favor.","I'll recommend him as chairman, whether you are in favor of it or not."],["公众意见的平衡仍是他的关切。","你贊成也好，不贊成也好，我也會推薦他當主席的。"]],["testing","'testiŋ","n. 测试\\na. 吃力的, 试验的",["Teachers nowadays are super into testing. It seems that there's another test today.","Testing has been delayed by two days. As a consequence, we need to reschedule the release date."],["现在的老师么，非常迷信考试，据说今天又要考试啦。","测试延迟了两天，因此，我们需要重新安排发布日期。"]],["apparent","ә'pærәnt","a. 清晰可见的, 显然的, 表面上的\\n[电] 外在的",["It's in times like these that the character of a person becomes apparent.","The suspect's apparent knowledge of details of the murder can't be used against him in this case since it was elicited by a leading question from the investigator."],["路遙知馬力，日久見人心。","嫌疑人對謀殺案細節顯然知情一事，在本案中不得作為不利於他的證據，因為這是調查人員以誘導性提問所套出的。"]],["stomach","'stʌmәk","n. 胃, 食欲, 欲望, 肚子\\nvt. 吃下, 忍受",["I got a stomach tumor and had to have it operated on.","How many doughnuts can you eat on an empty stomach? Just one. After the first one your stomach isn't empty."],["我得了胃腫瘤，必須動手術切除。","空腹能吃幾個甜甜圈？只能吃一個。吃了第一個之後，肚子就不空了。"]],["weigh","wei","vt. 称...重量, 衡量, 把...压弯, 考虑, 权衡, 起锚\\nvi. 称分量, 有意义, 重压, 起锚\\nn. 过秤, 称分量",["Let us weigh one catty of cuttlefish.","We should weigh the options carefully before making a decision."],["我們稱一斤花枝吧。",""]],["install","in'stɒ:l","vt. 安装, 安置, 使就职\\n[计] 安装, 安装程序; DOS内部命令:安装常驻程序",["The man tried to install his own antenna.","We can download and install Klavaro to learn touch typing."],["这男人试着安装他自己的天线。",""]],["sensitive","'sensitiv","a. 敏感的, 易感的, 灵敏的, 感光的\\n[机] 敏感的, 灵敏的, 感度高的",["We all know that blue-eyed red-heads are sensitive to sunshine, burning more readily than dark-skinned people.","Noise pollution could be avoided if only people were more sensitive to the environment."],["我們都知道，藍眼睛紅頭髮的人對陽光敏感，比深色皮膚的人更容易曬傷。","如果大家都懂得關心環境的話，就不會有噪音污染了。"]],["suggestion","sә'dʒestʃәn","n. 提议, 意见\\n[医] 暗示",["He's proposing a suggestion for altering the research method.","He thought she spoke reasonably, so he accepted her suggestion."],["他提出改革研究方法的意见。","他觉得她说得很有道理，于是接受了她的建议。"]],["mail","meil","n. 邮件, 邮政, 邮递, 盔甲\\nvt. 邮寄, 给...穿盔甲\\n[计] 邮件",["Please do not answer this fraudulent e-mail and certainly do not click on the links in the e-mail.","Please send me a reply as soon as you receive this mail."],["請不要回覆這封詐騙電郵，當然也不要點擊電郵裏的超連結。","收到此邮件后请尽快给我答复。"]],["recipe","'resipi","n. 食谱, 处方, 秘诀\\n[医] 取(处方头语), 处方",["\"I'm going to try to make chicken parmesan for my family tonight,\" said Matthew's sister after trying his recipe.","The frog and I took turns guessing what the secret recipe was."],["馬修的姊姊在試過他的食譜後說道：「我今晚要試著為家人做帕瑪森雞排。」","青蛙和我轮流猜了秘方是什么。"]],["reasonable","'ri:znәbl","a. 合理的, 明理的, 适当的\\n[法] 合理的, 公道的, 正当的",["Tom bought this camera for a reasonable price.","It's reasonable that you should do that."],["Tom用合理的價格買了相機。","你那樣做是合理的。"]],["elementary",".eli'mentәri","a. 初步的, 基本的\\n[医] 元素的, 基础的, 初级的",["The graduation from elementary school to middle school is regarded by some as the first step towards adulthood.","When I was in elementary school, my mother always fetched me from school."],["有些人認為從小學升到中學是踏入成年的第一步。","我读小学的时候，我母亲常常来接我。"]],["wooden","'wudn","a. 木制的, 呆笨的, 木然的",["Her footsteps fell ponderously on the wooden floor.","He took his wooden spoons to a nearby village to sell them."],["她的脚步沉重地落在木地板上。","他帶著木湯匙到附近的村莊去賣。"]],["preparation",".prepә'reiʃәn","n. 准备, 预备, 预习\\n[化] 制剂",["They've sold their house and car in preparation for leaving the country.","I bought a house on a small hill in southern France in preparation of building a retirement home."],["他们卖掉了房子和汽车准备出国.","我在法国南边的一座小山买了一所房子，准备在那里建设老人院。"]],["aggressive","ә'gresiv","a. 侵略的, 挑畔的, 进取的\\n[法] 侵略的, 爱挑衅的, 行为过火的",["The African ground squirrels collaborate and are not aggressive to other mammals.","Sami became more aggressive with customers."],["非洲地松鼠互帮互助，对其他哺乳动物没有攻击性。","萨米对顾客变得更加挑衅了。"]],["concert","'kɒnsәt","n. 音乐会, 和声, 一致\\nvt. 协力, 协调\\nvi. 协力\\n[计] 美国北卡罗来纳州Internet网",["The coffee enabled me to stay awake during the dull concert.","If you are not going to the concert, then neither am I."],["咖啡讓我在沉悶的音樂會中保持清醒。","如果你不去音樂會, 我也不去。"]],["false","fɒ:ls","a. 错误的, 虚伪的, 假的, 不老实的\\nadv. 不准确地, 欺诈地",["Religion is regarded by the common people as true, by the wise as false, and by the rulers as useful.","The truth is that nothing is totally true or false."],["宗教在一般人的眼中是真理，在智者的眼中是謊言，而在統治者的眼中則是一種工具。","真相是沒有甚麼完全正確或錯誤。"]],["intention","in'tenʃәn","n. 意图, 目的, 含义\\n[医] 愈合, 意向",["Tom has no intention of asking Mary to the upcoming dance.","The only difference between an awful cook and a poisoner is the intention."],["Tom没有意图去邀请Mary去即将来临的舞会。","一個差勁的廚師和下毒者唯一的不同在於他們的意圖。"]],["channel","'tʃænәl","n. 海峡, 航道, 频道\\nvt. 引导, 在...上挖沟, 形成河道\\n[计] 信道, 通道",["He is the only American who has swum the English Channel.","The first man that succeed in swimming the Channel was Captain Webb."],["他是唯一一個游泳橫渡英吉利海峽的美國人。",""]],["extreme","ik'stri:m","n. 极端, 末端\\na. 极端的, 尽头的, 极度的, 偏激的",["I don't want to lose my ideas, even though some of them are a bit extreme.","In its more extreme variants, cis ideology can include denial of the empirical reality of intersex and transgender people."],["我不想放弃我的想法，虽然一些想法有点极端。","在更極端的變體中，順性別意識形態可能包括否認陰陽人和跨性別者的現實經歷。"]],["tube","tju:b","n. 管, 软管, 隧道\\nvt. 把...装管, 使通过管子\\n[计] 管子",["We still have an old tube television.","You can't put toothpaste back in the tube."],["我们还有个老式电视机。","不能把牙膏塞回管里。"]],["drawing","'drɒ:iŋ","n. 图画, 制图, 拉\\n[计] 绘图",["She hung a little Picasso on the wall of the drawing room.","\"Drawing dragons and dotting in the eyes\" is a fable."],["她把一幅小尺寸的毕卡索画作挂在会客厅的墙上。","画龙点睛是一则寓言故事。"]],["quit","kwit","vi. 离开, 辞职, 停止\\nvt. 离开, 放弃, 使解除, 停止\\nn. 离开\\n[计] 结束, 退出",["I haven't got a clue as to why he quit so suddenly.","John did not know how to explain to his wife that he had quit his job."],["我完全不明白他為甚麼會突然辭職。","John不知道怎么跟他老婆解释他辞了职。"]],["protein","'prәuti:in","n. 蛋白质\\na. 蛋白质的",["A liter of milk contains about thirty grams of protein.","After the gym, I drink a glass of milk mixed with powdered protein."],["",""]],["absence","'æbsәns","n. 缺席, 缺乏, 没有\\n[医] 失神",["No one noticed her absence until the end of the meeting.","In reality black is not a color; it is the absence of color."],["直到会议结束之前都没人注意到她不在。","黑色其實不是一種顏色，而是一種沒有顏色的狀態。"]],["latin","'lætin","n. 拉丁人, 拉丁语\\na. 拉丁人的, 拉丁语的",["I don't agree with the theory that one should learn Latin in order to better understand English.","The Romans would never have had enough time for conquering the world if they had first been required to study Latin."],["有人說，要深入理解英語，就必須先學好拉丁語。我不同意這種說法。","如果他们必须先学拉丁文的话，是没有时间让罗马人征服世界的对吧。"]],["rapidly","'ræpidli","adv. 飞快地, 迅速地, 赶紧地",["As figures from the National Development and Reform Committee show, the Internet has developed rapidly in rural China.","What was at first a natural disaster rapidly became a man-made debacle."],["来自国家发展和改革委员会的数据显示，互联网在中国农村地区发展迅猛。","起初的天灾迅速演变为了人祸。"]],["jail","dʒeil","n. 监牢, 监狱, 拘留所\\nvt. 监禁, 下狱",["I can't do that, because I don't want to go to jail.","He has spent ten years in jail for murder."],["我不會那樣做的，因為我不想進監獄。","他因為謀殺案在牢裡待了十年。"]],["honest","'ɒnist","a. 诚实的, 坦直的, 可靠的",["To be honest, I've gradually come to dislike the life here.","Mark is so honest that everybody commends him for it."],["老實說, 我已經漸漸地不喜歡這裡的生活。","馬克是如此的誠實所以每個人都讚揚他。"]],["diversity","dai'vә:siti","n. 差异, 多样性\\n[化] 多样性",["Recently, the increasing diversity of computer use has extended far beyond the realms of the office.","Existing legislation does not take diversity of races into account."],["",""]],["palestinian",",pælis'tiniәn","[经] 巴勒斯坦的",["What can we do to strengthen the movement of solidarity with the Palestinian people?","Putin is plucking Palestinian refugees from Lebanese camps to go fight for him in Ukraine; apparently his own soldiers aren't tough enough."],["我們能做些什麼來加強聲援巴勒斯坦人民的運動？","普丁正在從黎巴嫩難民營中招募巴勒斯坦難民前往烏克蘭為他作戰；顯然他自己的士兵不夠強悍。"]],["pace","peis","n. 速度, 步调, 步法\\nvi. 踱步, 缓慢走\\nvt. 用步测, 踱步于",["Please don't walk so fast. I can't keep pace with you.","He was walking up the hill at a steady pace."],["請別走得那麼快，我跟不上你。","他迈着稳健的步伐登上了山丘。"]],["employment","im'plɒimәnt","n. 雇用, 职业, 工作\\n[经] 职业, 雇用, 职工招请",["In order to alleviate employment pressures, the nation has established a series of relevant policies.","They guaranteed regular employment to their workers."],["为了缓解就业压力，国家已经制定了一系列相关政策。","他們對他們的員工保證就業。"]],["speaker","'spi:kә","n. 说话人, 讲演者, 发言人, 喇叭, 扬声器\\n[计] 扬声器",["To win his audience, the speaker resorted to using rhetorical techniques he learned from his communication courses.","I'm looking for a native speaker who could help me correct this essay."],["演说家为了征服他的听众，不惜使用他在交流课上学到的修辞技巧。","我正在尋找可以幫我修改這篇論文的母語人士。"]],["essay","'esei. e'sei","n. 随笔, 短文, 评论, 企图\\nvt. 试图",["I'm looking for a native speaker who could help me correct this essay.","The difference between a standalone sentence and a sentence in the middle of an essay is that the latter has context."],["我正在尋找可以幫我修改這篇論文的母語人士。","独立的句子和文章中的句子的区别在于后者具备上下文。"]],["impression","im'preʃәn","n. 印象, 意念, 盖印, 印记, 印数, 底色, 效果\\n[医] 压迹, 印模, 印象, 影响",["You never get a second chance to make a first impression.","Firstly, I think that the first time each foreigner is in China, the earliest impression is certainly the size of the country."],["你永遠沒有第二次機會去打造第一印象。","首先，我认为每个外国人第一次在中国的时候，最初的印象一定是国家的大小。"]],["respondent","ri'spɒndәnt","a. 回答的, 应答的, 反射的\\nn. 应答者, 被告",["The first respondent failed to fill out the entire questionnaire."],[""]],["giant","'dʒaiәnt","n. 巨人, 大力士, 巨大怪物\\na. 庞大的, 巨大的",["Two women wielding giant spatulas continuously stir a brimming wok of shredded beef simmering in curry sauce.","The giant panda is a surviving ancient animal species."],["兩名女子揮舞著巨大的鍋鏟，不停地翻炒著盛滿咖哩醬汁的牛肉絲。","大熊猫是一种残存的古动物。"]],["cake","keik","n. 蛋糕, 块, 饼\\nvt. 使结块, 加块状物于\\nvi. 结块",["It is no use looking for the cake; I already ate it.","A girl gave me an orange in exchange for a piece of cake."],["找蛋糕也没用，我已经吃完了。","有个女生用一个橙子跟我换了一块蛋糕。"]],["negotiate","ni'gәuʃieit","vi. 商议, 谈判, 交涉\\nvt. 谈妥, 转让, 处理",["The next step was to negotiate terms of a peace treaty.","The problem is Tom's complete unwillingness to negotiate."],["",""]],["historian","hi'stɒ:riәn","n. 历史学家, 记事者",["Israeli historian Ilan Pappe wrote many scholarly works.","The role of the historian is less to discover and catalog documents than to interpret and explain them."],["",""]],["restore","ri'stɒ:","vt. 回复, 恢复, 归还, 修补, 修复\\nvt. 还原\\nvi. 还原\\n[计] 还原; DOS外部命令:从备份盘中取回文件",["The pilot is trying to restore communication with the control tower.","The judge was forced to slam her gavel down multiple times in order to restore order to the court."],["",""]],["substantial","sәb'stænʃәl","n. 重要材料(或事物), 有实际价值的东西\\na. 实质上的, 物质的, 有内容的, 结实的",["Thanks to the opportunity, we were able to avoid substantial effort.","He woke up starving; but after getting outside a substantial breakfast, he felt splendid."],["",""]],["pop","pɒp","n. 砰然声, 枪击, 含气饮料, 流行音乐, 通俗艺术\\na. 流行的, 热门的, 通俗的\\nvt. 使发出爆裂声, 开枪打, 突然伸出…",["Recent J-POP doesn't really have many signature songs, you know.","Last year's pop hit was set off by a serial TV drama."],["你也知道，最近的 J-POP 實際上並沒有很多招牌歌曲。",""]],["specialist","'speiʃәlist","n. 专门医师, 专家\\na. 专业的, 专家的",["The specialist predicts international tension will build up.","We regard Dr. Brown as the best heart specialist in the United States."],["",""]],["origin","'ɒridʒin","n. 起源, 起因, 出身, 开端\\n[计] 原点; 起始地址; 信件来源的相关数据",["This word is also French in origin.","What is the origin of the universe?"],["這個字也是由法語衍生出來的。","宇宙何以開端？"]],["approval","ә'pru:vl","n. 赞成, 批准\\n[化] 核准",["With your approval, I would like to offer him the job.","The large crowd roared in approval as Mark Knopfler played the first few bars of \"Money for Nothing\"."],["如果您同意, 我想給他這份工作。","就像马克·诺弗勒早期演唱的歌曲《金钱无用》一样，绝大多数的人依然高呼赞成“金钱无用论”。"]],["criticize","'kritisaiz","v. 批评, 吹毛求疵, 非难",["You ought to walk a mile in his shoes before you criticize him.","Far be it from me to criticize, but your dress is rather loud."],["",""]],["advise","әd'vaiz","vt. 劝告, 给...出主意, 通知, 建议\\nvi. 提意见, 商量",["I advise you never to live beyond your income.","I advise you to be careful in making notes for the lecture."],["我建议你永远不要入不敷出。",""]],["quietly","'kwaiәtli","adv. 安静地, 沉着地, 秘密地",["He read a book quietly, as though nothing had happened.","Jim entered the room quietly so he wouldn't wake the baby."],["他安靜地讀著書，彷彿什麼事都沒發生過。","吉姆悄悄地走進房間，這樣他就不會吵醒寶寶。"]],["conventional","kәn'venʃәnl","a. 传统的, 习惯的, 约定的\\n[经] 惯例的, 常规的, 传统的",["Plastics have taken the place of many conventional materials.","The new product will not be distributed through conventional channels."],["塑料代替了许多传统的原料。",""]],["depth","depθ","n. 深度, 深处, 深奥\\n[计] 深度",["I am always freed of all of my worries and concerns in the depth of the night.","Anna's striking almond-shaped eyes, inherited from her Asian lineage, exude a captivating depth and a hint of mystery."],["在深夜，我总是如释重负。","安娜引人注目的杏仁狀眼睛繼承了她的亞洲血統，散發著迷人的深度和一絲神秘感。"]],["disability","disә'biliti","n. 无力, 无能, 残疾\\n[医] 劳动能力丧失, 病废",["Having a disability does not mean that you can be ableist towards other people or maintain ableist frameworks.","The World Health Organization says alcohol abuse is the third leading cause of death and disability in the world."],["身有残疾，并不代表你就可以对他人抱有残障歧视，或者继续固守那些歧视残障者的固有观念。",""]],["wealth","welθ","n. 财富, 资源, 财产, 丰富, 富裕, 大量\\n[经] 财富",["Studies show that once the basic needs of shelter and food are met, additional wealth adds very little to happiness.","It goes without saying that health is above wealth."],["研究表明人们一有住处、食物这些基本的需要，附加的财富就不能大量地提高他们的快乐。","健康胜过财富，这件事谁都知道。"]],["shell","ʃel","n. 贝壳, 壳, 外形, 炮弹\\nvt. 去壳, 脱落, 炮轰\\nvi. 剥落, 脱壳\\n[计] 外壳; DOS内部命令:指定命令行处理…",["This farm's free-range eggs have a deeper shell color, and the yolks are especially rich and delicious.","Great! Is the apartment bought as a concrete shell, or is it ready to move into?"],["這家農場的草雞蛋顏色偏深，蛋黃特別鮮美。","太棒了！是毛坯房还是装修房？"]],["biological",".baiәu'lɒdʒikәl","a. 生物学的\\n[医] 生物学的",["As soon as we are born, the world gets to work on us and transforms us from merely biological into social units.","How long adolescence continues is determined by biological factors."],["我們一出生在這個世界上，就會開始受到周遭環境的影響，從生物單位慢慢進化成社會單位。",""]],["effectively","i'fektivli","adv. 有效地, 有力地, 实际上",["Mr. Johnson previously advocated banning alcohol on public transport in the capital, and some believe this initiative effectively reduced crime on trains and buses.","Knowing their languages is not enough to communicate effectively, because the methods of communication are determined by their cultures."],["约翰逊先生以前还倡议禁止在首都公交上饮酒，有人认为这个倡议有效减少了火车和公车上的犯罪率。","要和他們有效地溝通，只懂得說他們的語言是不夠的，因為溝通的方式是由他們的文化來決定的。"]],["onion","'ʌnjәn","n. 洋葱\\nvt. 因洋葱使掉泪",["Tom grabbed a knife, an onion and a chopping board.","Our neighbor has bought cheese, onion sausage and rolls for us."],["",""]],["deputy","'depjuti","n. 副手，代理人",["He will be my deputy while I am away.","The deputy was a rude person treating people like his servants."],["我不在的时候，他将是我的代理人。",""]],["flat","flæt","a. 平坦的, 单调的, 无力的, 浅的, 萧条的, 干脆的, 无聊的\\nadv. 平直地, 断然地\\nn. 扁平物, 平面, 平地, 平…",["When the chickens are flat as pancakes, then again the tractor must have been faster than them.","I have to push my bike because one of the tyres is flat."],["當雞像煎餅一樣平的時候, 那麼一定是拖拉機跑得比它們快。","我得推我的自行车，因为有个轮胎漏气了。"]],["brand","brænd","n. 商标, 牌子, 烙印\\nvt. 打烙印于",["Recently, this brand launched a series of limited edition underwear.","The bags from this brand are too expensive."],["最近這個品牌推出了一系列限量版內衣。","這個牌子的包包太貴了。"]],["assure","ә'ʃuә","vt. 保证, 使确信, 弄清楚, 担保\\n[法] 确信, 保证, 保障",["Take it easy. I can assure you that chances are in your favor.","Take it easy. I can assure you that everything will turn out fine."],["",""]],["mad","mæd","a. 疯狂的, 发疯的, 生气的, 愚蠢的, 狂欢的\\nn. 狂怒",["I don't know what to do with that guy. No matter how mad I get at him he just takes it in stride and pays no attention.","I know you're probably mad about what I said yesterday."],["我不知道對那個傢伙該怎麼辦。不論我對他生多大的氣, 他就是蠻不在乎而且置之不理。","我知道我昨天說的那番話把你弄得很生氣。"]],["award","ә'wɒ:d","n. 奖品, 裁定, 判决\\nvt. 授予, 给予",["In addition, we will issue the 'employee of the month' award afterwards.","The architect boasted that he had received a prestigious award."],["另外，之后我们会颁发“每月最佳员工”奖。",""]],["criteria","krai'tiәriә","pl. 标准\\n[计] 条件",["The precision ratio is an index that indicates how many articles meet the search criteria out of all of the articles retrieved.","Beauty cannot be determined objectively but depends on personal aesthetic criteria."],["",""]],["dealer","'di:lә","n. 经销商, 商人\\n[经] 交易员, 贩卖商",["My decision was based on a dealer recommendation.","We have come to an arrangement with the dealer about the price."],["我是聽從經銷商的建議做的決定。",""]],["via","vaiә","prep. 经由, 经过, 通过\\n[医] 病毒灭活剂",["Any further queries should be made via the customer service number below.","If you connect your phone to your PC via USB, you can even transfer files and photos."],["如有任何其他疑問，請撥打下方的客服電話。","您如果透過 USB 將手機連接到電腦，則甚至可以傳輸檔案和照片。"]],["utility","ju:'tiliti","n. 功用, 有用之物, 实用, 公用事业, 实用程序\\na. 实用的, 有多种用途的\\n[计] 实用程序, 工具",["This antique brazier no longer has any real utility.","There are no cookies in the pantry. Look in the utility room."],["",""]],["precisely","pri'saisli","adv. 精确地, 明确地, 刻板地, 拘泥地, 正好, 恰恰, 对, 正是如此, 确实如此, 不错",["Tashkil helps in understanding texts more precisely.","But the person in charge is there precisely to take responsibility."],["變音符號有助於更準確地理解文字。",""]],["armed","ɑ:md","a. 有扶手的, 武装的, 有防卫器官的\\n[法] 武装的, 持械的, \"F带武器的",["The art of modern warfare does not necessarily require soldiers to be armed to the teeth to be effective as combatants.","The armed forces occupied the entire territory."],["現代戰術並無指明士兵必須全副武裝上陣才能發揮其最大的戰鬥力。","军队占领了整片领土。"]],["arise","ә'raiz","vi. 站立, 出现, 起来",["I'm not afraid of facing pressure. When problems arise, I will quickly think of ways to find the solutions.","Even after being approved, difficulties might arise in the actual construction of the line."],["我不怕面對壓力,有問題的時候,我就會很快地想辦法去解決",""]],["nevertheless",".nevәðә'les","adv. 然而, 虽然如此\\nconj. 然而",["It's just five in the morning, but nevertheless it is light out.","You cannot compare the strength of a man to that of a tiger, but nevertheless, the tiger is still the inferior creature."],["才早晨5点，但天已经亮了。","虎与人是无法比拼力量的，但是，老虎还是比人类低等。"]],["highway","'haiwei","n. 公路, 大道, 捷径\\n[法] 公路, 大路",["Traffic conditions on the highway are normal this morning.","In Austria, you have to pay to use the highway."],["今天早上高速公路上的交通状况正常。","奥地利的高速公路是收费的。"]],["clinical","'klinikәl","a. 临床的, 门诊部的\\n[医] 临床的, 临证的",["Not all clinical studies are hypothesis-driven.","The clinical records in most hospitals are kept in alphabetical order."],["不是所有的临床研究都是假设驱动的。",""]],["routine","ru:'ti:n","n. 常规, 日常工作, 惯例, 例行公事\\na. 日常的, 常规的\\n[计] 例程",["Ten years after the wedding, everything is just routine.","Such questioning is routine police business."],["婚姻走过十个年头一切只是例行公事。","这样讯问只是警察例行公事。"]],["wage","weidʒ","n. 工资, 报应, 报偿\\nvt. 开展, 进行\\nvi. 进行",["The workers didn't get their basic wage.","The recession has put the crunch on wage laborers."],["工人拿不到基本工资。",""]],["normally","'nɒ:mәli","adv. 正规地, 合规则, 正常地",["Normally I might study Chinese characters for an hour a day.","This verb is normally used only in the third person."],["我平时每天可能练习一个小时汉字。","這個動詞通常只用在第三人稱。"]],["phrase","freiz","n. 惯用语, 词组, 成语, 措词, 乐句\\nvt. 用短语表达, 把(乐曲)分成短句\\n[计] 短语",["You know the phrase, we reap what we sow. I have sown the wind and this is my storm.","The two scholars wrangled over the meaning of an obscure Tibetan phrase."],["你也知道那句話，「善有善報，惡有惡報」。我搧的風，現在火就來了。","兩位學者為一句意思含糊的藏文句子爭論了一番。"]],["ingredient","in'gri:diәnt","n. 成分, 因素\\n[化] 配合剂; 拼料; 成分; 组分",["Cookies may contain nuts or peanuts, even if not included in the ingredient list.","He added another ingredient to the pot."],["雖然配料表中未列出堅果和花生，但餅乾中仍可能含有這些成分。。","他又往鍋裡加了一種食材。"]],["stake","steik","n. 桩, 炮烙刑, 木柱, 赌注, 奖金\\nvt. 打桩, 用桩撑, 下赌注, 资助\\nvi. 打赌",["Commoners had no stake or interest in the constant fighting between nobles.","The future of our company is at stake. We have been heavily in the red for the last couple of years."],["",""]],["muslim","'mjzlim; (?@) 'mʌzlem","n. 伊斯兰教, 伊斯兰教教徒",["Sami is Muslim and he doesn't believe this.","He's born from a Jewish mother and a Muslim father; this helped him much to develop a kind of open-mindedness."],["薩米是穆斯林，他不相信這種說法。",""]],["fiber","'faibә","n. 纤维, 构造, 纤维制品\\n[化] 纤维",["I love my country with every fiber of my being.","Ahhh! Feel that beer seep into every fiber of my being. Yep, nothing beats a cold one after work."],["我深爱我的祖国。",""]],["activist","'æktivist","n. 激进主义分子",["Tom is an activist in his community.","Matoub Lounes was an Algerian singer and activist."],["湯姆是社群中的積極分子。",""]],["islamic","iz'læmik","a. 伊斯兰教的, 穆斯林的",["She started wearing an Islamic headscarf during Ramadan.","Sami's Islamic school was an hour away from his home."],["她在齋戒月期間開始佩戴伊斯蘭頭巾。",""]],["snap","snæp","vt. 使突然中断, 猛咬, 争夺, 拉断, 使有啪啪声, 厉声说, 突然射击, 用快照拍摄\\nvi. 咬, 扑, 抓, 折断, 劈啪地响…",["Sorry, I didn't mean to snap at you.","A home is a once-in-a-lifetime purchase so you don't want to make any snap decisions."],["对不起，我并不想对你发火。",""]],["terrorism","'terәrizm","n. 恐怖主义, 恐怖统治, 恐怖状态\\n[法] 胁迫, 暴政, 恐怖政治",["It is a prevalent belief, according to a nationwide poll in the United States, that Muslims are linked with terrorism.","Algeria finances Islamists and terrorism."],["根据美国国民的一个投票，人们普遍认为穆斯林人和恐怖主义有关。","阿爾及利亞有資助伊斯蘭主義者和恐怖主義。"]],["refugee",".refju'dʒi:","n. 难民, 流亡者\\n[法] 避难者, 流亡者, 难民",["My wife can't visit Jerusalem because she is a Palestinian refugee.","The principal cause of death in refugee camps is the lack of nourishment."],["",""]],["incorporate","in'kɒ:pәreit","a. 合并的, 组成公司的, 一体化的\\nvt. 吸收, 合并, 使组成公司, 体现\\nvi. 合并, 混合, 组成公司",["Incorporate yoga or Pilates for flexibility and core strength.","To get fluent in Berber, you need to incorporate it into your life."],["",""]],["ultimate","'ʌltimit","n. 终极, 根本, 顶点, 基本原则\\na. 终极的, 根本的, 极限的, 最远的, 最后的, 最大的",["Our ultimate goal is to establish world peace.","What is the ultimate purpose of education?"],["我们的究极目标是树立世界和平。","教育的最终目的是什么？"]],["corporation",".kɒ:pә'reiʃәn","n. 公司, 合作, 法人团体\\n[法] 法人团体, 社团, 法人",["The multinational corporation has forecast the implementation of economies of scale.","The poor sales during that Holiday season served as the final nail in the coffin for Boar Corporation."],["跨国公司预料到了规模经济的实行。","那個假期銷售業績不佳，為博爾公司敲下了最後一根棺材釘。"]],["hip","hip","n. 臀部, 蔷薇果, 忧郁\\na. 熟悉内情的\\nvt. 使忧郁, 给(屋顶)造屋脊\\ninterj. 喝彩声",["Like it or not, we're in this together. All we can do is work as closely as if we were joined at the hip.","Judges don't have to shoot from the hip. They have the leisure to think, to decide."],["",""]],["switch","switʃ","n. 开关, 电闸, 转换, 软枝, 鞭子, 道岔\\nvt. 转变, 切换, 摆动, 转换, 使转轨\\nvi. 转换, 变换, 摆动\\n[…",["Friendly Reminder: Please keep in mind the closing time of the line you need to switch to, so as to avoid delays in your trip.","Tom's game is in development for PC, PS4 and Switch."],["友情提示：请留意您需要换乘线路的首末班时间，以免耽误您的出行。","湯姆的遊戲正在為 PC、PS4 和 Switch 開發。"]],["valuable","'væljuәbl","a. 有价值的, 贵重的, 宝贵的, 可估价的\\n[经] 有价值的, 可估价的, 贵重的",["Nothing is more valuable than good health.","Real friendship is more valuable than money."],["没有什么比健康更重要。","真正的友谊比金钱更有价值。"]],["assumption","ә'sʌmpʃәn","n. 假定, 自负, 担任, 假装\\n[经] 假定, 承担",["Basic to the argument is the assumption that the rules in question are present in the language.","First of all, you have no right to make conclusions. Second of all, your argument was based on an invalid assumption."],["",""]],["gear","giә","n. 齿轮, 工具\\nvt. 以齿轮连起, 开动, 使适应, 安排\\nvi. 连接上, 适合",["Tom put the car into gear and slowly pulled out of the parking lot.","Most landing gear can be folded into the fuselage during the flight and opened for landing."],["",""]],["barrier","'bæriә","n. 障碍, 栅栏\\n[化] 势垒; 阻片; 阻挡层",["Some birds can break the sound barrier.","High tariffs have become a barrier to international trade."],["有的鳥可以穿越音障。",""]],["minor","'mainә","n. 未成年人, 副修科目\\na. 较小的, 二流的, 未成年的\\nvi. 副修\\n[计] 次要",["A couple of flights were delayed on account of a minor accident.","He played a minor part in the play."],["因為一些小事故，兩、三班機被延遲了。","他在劇中演了一個小角色。"]],["assign","ә'sain","vt. 分配, 指派, 赋值\\n[计] 赋值",["You can't assign a string to a variable of type integer.","I don't know if the teacher plans to assign homework."],["",""]],["council","'kaunsәl","n. 会议, 委员会\\n[经] 委员会",["The environment was the focus of student council activities.","The municipal council all but ignored the gravity of the pollution."],["",""]],["provision","prә'viʒәn","n. (政府提供的)钱和设备, 准备, 供应品, 规定, 条款\\nvt. 供给...食物及必需品",["Fortunately, the law had anticipated and made a provision for that case.","The new agreement included a provision that dealt with the ramifications of the outbreak of a war."],["",""]],["killer","'kilә","n. (非正式)杀人者, 屠杀者, 猛兽, 致死(疾病), 杀手, 止痛药, 限制器, 瞄准器\\n[计] 删除程序; 断路器",["We know the identity of Tom's killer.","Sami was speaking to Layla's killer."],["我們知道湯姆的殺手是誰。","萨米在与莱拉的杀手说话。"]],["gang","gæŋ","n. 队, 群, 帮\\nvi. 成群结队, 结成一伙\\nvt. 使成群结队",["Lander assumes that rioting and gang behavior are a result of poverty and poor economic conditions.","The gangsters let him in on their plan to knock off a rival gang leader."],["",""]],["developing","di'velәpiŋ","a. 发展中的\\n[计] 显影",["I have come to realize that China is developing quickly but the Chinese people live a relatively leisurely life.","Because it's a developing country, some aspects of China aren't as good as those in Western countries."],["我意識到了中國正在快速地發展，但是相對而言中國人卻過著悠閒的生活。","因为中国是个发展中的国家，所以有的方面没有西方国家那么好。"]],["classic","'klæsik","n. 古典作品, 杰作, 大艺术家\\na. 第一流的, 最优秀的, 古典的",["Root beer is considered a classic American carbonated soft drink.","Several classic, family-friendly games will also join the service next month."],["麥根沙士被視為一種經典的美式碳酸飲品。","多款經典家庭遊戲也將於下個月同步上架。"]],["chemical","'kemikl","n. 化学药品\\na. 化学的, 化学上用的",["Immediately after it caught fire, the chemical factory blew up.","As a result of some factories using fossil fuels, chemical emissions have already caused serious environmental problems."],["化学工厂一着火就爆炸了。","由于一些工厂使用矿物燃料，化学品的排放已经产生严重的环境问题。"]],["label","'leibl","n. 标签, 称号, 商标, 标志\\nvt. 贴标签于, 标注\\n[计] 标志; 标注; DOS外部命令:用于建立改变或删除磁盘卷标号",["The contents of the box are indicated on the label.","The contents of the box are listed on the label."],["箱子的内容在标签上面写着。","箱子的内容在标签上面写着。"]],["teen","ti:n","n. 愤怒, 悲哀",["Smoking as a teen can stunt your lungs, keeping them little forever.","Ziri wanted to cast Rima in an upcoming teen movie."],["",""]],["index","'indeks","n. 索引, 指针, 指数, 指标\\nvt. 编入索引中, 指出\\nvi. 做索引\\n[计] 下标; 附标; 变址; 索引; 编索引",["The hand has five fingers: the thumb, the index finger, the middle finger, the ring finger, and the pinky.","The application allows you to quickly calculate the ratio of body mass index - BMI."],["人的手有五个手指: 拇指、食指、中指、无名指和小指。","這項應用程序能讓你快速計算身高體重指數（BMI）。"]],["vacation","vei'keiʃәn","n. 假期, 休假\\n[法] 假期, 停审期, 休庭期",["I worked in a post office during the summer vacation.","I studied in the morning during the summer vacation."],["暑假期间，我在邮局工作。","我在暑假裡早晨學習。"]],["advocate","'ædvәkeit","n. 提倡者, 拥护者\\nvt. 主张, 提倡",["More and more environmentalists advocate and use environmentally friendly unleaded petrol in cars.","China is an advocate for the Diaoyu Islands' sovereignty."],["越来越多的环保者开始宣传和使用以环保的无铅汽油为燃料的汽车。","中国主张钓鱼岛的主权。"]],["draft","dræft. drɑ:ft","n. 气流, 草稿, 汇票, 草案\\nvt. 起草, 征兵\\n[计] 草稿",["Draft beer tastes especially good on a hot day.","I am writing a draft of the speech."],["生啤酒在大熱天時特別好喝。","我在寫演講的草稿。"]],["extraordinary","ik'strɒ:dәnәri","a. 非常的, 特别的, 非凡的\\n[经] 非常的, 特别的, 临时的",["Do not think that love, in order to be genuine, has to be extraordinary. What we need is to love without getting tired.","True art of life is to see the extraordinary amongst the ordinary."],["不要覺得真誠的愛必需驚天動地。我們需要的，是不會倦怠的愛。","生活真正的艺术是在平凡中看到不平凡。"]],["heaven","'hevn","n. 天堂, 上帝, 天空",["God is the creator. Heaven and Earth and people and everything apart from God are created.","A plate of pilaf with some kebabs is heaven on earth."],["上帝就是造物主。天空，土地以及人类，一切都出自上帝之手，除了上帝自身以外。","一盘抓饭配一些烤肉串就是人间天堂。"]],["rough","rʌf","n. 粗糙的东西, 毛坯, 未加工品, 梗概, 草图, 暴徒, 艰难\\na. 粗糙的, 粗暴的, 蓬乱的, 草率的, 大致的, 简陋的, …",["At a rough estimate, I would say the job will take two weeks.","Boxing is not always a rough sport."],["我想這工作粗略估計得花上兩個星期的時間。","拳擊並不總是一種粗暴的運動。"]],["yell","jel","vi. 叫喊, 大叫, (齐声)呐喊欢呼\\nvt. 喊叫着说\\nn. 叫声, 喊声, 呐喊",["If you got anything to say, say it properly, don't yell.","Tom turned around when he heard someone yell his name."],["有事好好说，不要大喊大叫！",""]],["pregnant","'pregnәnt","a. 怀孕的, 充满的, 思想丰富的, 成果丰硕的\\n[医] 妊娠的, 有孕的",["Let's not beat around the bush! I'm pregnant, and you're the baby's father.","Dad, I am pregnant. Here is the list of the suspects..."],["我們就開門見山吧！我懷孕了，而你就是孩子他爸。","爸爸，我怀孕了。这是我男朋友们的名单……"]],["distant","'distәnt","a. 远的, 疏远的\\n[经] 远期的",["Today we can go to distant countries easily by plane.","A close neighbor is better than a distant relative."],["现在我们很容易就能乘飞机去遥远的国度。","远亲不如近邻。"]],["drama","'drɑ:mә","n. 戏剧, 戏剧艺术",["The new TV drama is quite interesting.","Last year's pop hit was set off by a serial TV drama."],["這部新電視劇挺有意思的。",""]],["satellite","'sætlait","n. 人造卫星\\n[医] 伴行静脉, 陪静脉, 陪病部, 随体, 卫星",["They are going to launch an artificial satellite tomorrow.","The Moon isn't a planet, but a satellite of the Earth."],["明天將要發射一顆人造衛星。","月球不是一颗行星，而是地球的一颗卫星。"]],["personally","'pә:sәnli","adv. 亲自地, 个别地, 当面, 就本人而言, 针对个人地",["James Cameron personally did the official promotion!","Personally, I don't think it makes any difference who wins the election."],["卡神親自官宣！",""]],["clock","klɒk","n. 时钟, 计时器, (袜子上的)绣花边花\\nvt. 绣花样, 记时, 记录\\nvi. 记录时间\\n[计] 时钟",["The only sound to be heard was the ticking of the clock.","It's five o' clock. If you quickly post your letter, it still might make it in time."],["唯一能听到的声音是钟的滴答声。","五点钟，你的信赶快投进去还来得及。"]],["chocolate","'tʃɒkәlit","n. 巧克力\\na. 巧克力制的",["The more chocolate you eat, the fatter you'll get.","Fifty-two per cent of British women prefer chocolate to sex."],["您越是多吃巧克力，您就會變得越胖。","有百分之五十二的英國女性喜歡巧克力勝於性。"]],["italian","i'tæljәn","n. 意大利人, 意大利语\\na. 意大利的, 意大利语的",["He eventually married an Italian woman ten years his junior.","Her mom is from Spain and her dad is from Italy. That's why she can speak both Spanish and Italian."],["他最终和一个比他小十岁的意大利女人结了婚。","她妈妈来自西班牙，她爸爸来自意大利，所以她会讲西班牙语和意大利语。"]],["canadian","kә'neidiәn","a. 加拿大的",["Because of its origins, Canadian English has features of both American and British English.","The crash was and remains to date the deadliest airplane accident on Canadian soil."],["由於它的起源，加拿大英語具有美國英語和​​英國英語兩者的特色。","這起空難是迄今為止加拿大境內最嚴重的空難。"]],["sweep","swi:p","n. 扫除, 打扫, 肃清, 视野, 范围, 全胜\\nvt. 扫除, 掸去, 猛拉, 扫荡, 肃清, 冲走, 刮起, 环视, 掠过, 扫射…",["Spring in the north sends gales to sweep the roads.","Don't forget to sweep the kitchen clean."],["北方的春天送来狂风扫路。","記住把廚房打掃乾淨。"]],["advertising","'ædvәtaiziŋ","n. 广告业, 广告\\na. 广告的\\n[计] 发广告",["The basic job of an advertising agency is to figure out how to turn a desire into a need.","Many websites are supported by revenue from advertising."],["廣告商最基本的工作就是把人的慾望轉化成需要。","許多網站都是靠廣告收入來維持的。"]],["ceiling","'si:liŋ","n. 天花板\\n[经] 顶点, 顶线, 上限",["If you don't have anything to do, look at the ceiling of your room.","You might as well read a novel instead of staring at the ceiling."],["如果你没事做，那就看你房间的天花板。","望着天花板发呆,还不如读一读小说。"]],["universal",".ju:ni'vә:sl","a. 全世界的, 普遍的, 宇宙的, 通用的\\nn. 一般概念",["English is a universal language and is used all over the world.","English is a kind of universal language."],["英語是一種世界性的語言，用於世界各地。","英語是一種世界語言。"]],["spin","spin","n. 旋转, 自旋, 疾驰, 情绪低落\\nvt. 纺织, 纺, 使旋转, 编造\\nvi. 纺纱, 吐丝, 作茧, 结网, 旋转, 自旋, …",["Improved medical technology has been one of the spin-offs of the space program.","I cannot spin wool. Only my grandmother knows how to do it."],["",""]],["button","'bʌtәn","n. 钮扣, 按钮\\nvi. 扣住\\nvt. 钉钮扣于, 扣紧\\n[计] 按钮",["If you press this button the window opens automatically.","All you have to do is push this button to take a picture."],["按下這個按鈕, 窗口會自動打開。","你要做的就是按这个按钮拍照。"]],["bell","bel","n. 铃, 钟\\n[计] 响铃命令",["I ate a bunch of Taco Bell and now I have a serious case of the shits.","As soon as the bell rang, the teacher came into the classroom."],["我吃了一堆塔可鐘，現在肚子拉得很慘。","鐘聲一響起，老師就走進了教室。"]],["rank","ræŋk","n. 等级, 排, 横列, 队伍, 阶级\\na. 茂密丛生的, 恶臭的, 十足的, 粗俗的\\nvt. 排列, 归类于, 把...分等\\nv…",["He is immediately above me in rank.","I heard that a gay priest had been promoted to the rank of bishop, but it turned out to be a fabrication."],["他的軍階比我高一級。",""]],["darkness","'dɑ:knis","n. 黑暗, 暗, 深色, 隐密, 模糊, 无知",["In the darkness, she could hear him and his guests chatting and laughing.","In my soul there are many places that are cynical and arrogant, but at its core, it fears the darkness and is as weak as a sheep."],["在黑暗中，她能听到他和客人说笑。","我的灵魂里有很多地方玩世不恭，对人傲慢无礼，但是它有一个核心，这个核心害怕黑暗，柔弱得像绵羊一样。"]],["clothing","'klәuðiŋ","n. 衣服",["Children depend on their parents for food, clothing and shelter.","Food, clothing and shelter are the foundations of survival."],["孩子们的衣食住行靠的是他们的父母。","衣食住是生存的基础。"]],["super","'sju:pә","n. 跑龙套角色, 冗员, 特级品, 特大号, 管理人\\na. 上等的, 特大的, 超级的, 极好的, 十分的, 过分的\\nadv. 非常",["Teachers nowadays are super into testing. It seems that there's another test today.","Po-lin ran into his ex at the night market yesterday. It was super awkward."],["现在的老师么，非常迷信考试，据说今天又要考试啦。","柏霖昨天在夜市遇到前女友，尷尬到不行。"]],["yield","ji:ld","n. 生产量, 投资收益\\nvt. 出产, 给予, 让出, 放弃, 使屈服\\nvi. 出产, 屈服, 投降, 倒塌",["When the light is green, cars turning must yield to pedestrians.","They obtained a yield of 8 percent on their investment."],["绿灯时，拐弯车要让人。","他們在這次的投資中得到百分之八的收益。"]],["fence","fens","n. 围墙, 栅栏, 买卖赃物的人, 剑术\\nvt. 用篱笆围住, 练习剑术, 防护\\nvi. 击剑, 搪塞",["Tom painted the part of the fence where the paint had flaked off.","Our ball went over the fence and landed on the building site."],["湯姆在院子柵欄上油漆脫落的地方又刷上了油漆。","我們的球越過了柵欄，掉到了工地裡。"]],["portrait","'pɒ:treit","n. 肖像, 人像, 半身像, 描写, 竖排格式\\n[计] 纵向",["A friend of mine commissioned a well-known artist to paint a portrait of his wife.","The portrait of the king was unveiled and received enthusiastic applause."],["我的一箇朋友請了箇著名畫家給妻子畫肖像。","國王的肖像揭曉，收穫了熱烈的掌聲。"]],["survival","sә'vaivәl","n. 生存, 残存, 幸存者\\na. 赖以生存的",["Food, clothing and shelter are the foundations of survival.","This medicine will increase the survival rate of the patients."],["衣食住是生存的基础。","这个药品会提高病人的存活率。"]],["roughly","'rʌfli","adv. 概略地, 粗糙地, 粗暴地",["My Chinese is far from perfect, but I can roughly understand everything he is saying.","Taiwan is an island nation in the western Pacific Ocean with a population of roughly 23 million people."],["我的漢語並不完美，但能大致聽懂他所說的。","台灣是個位於太平洋西岸的島國，人口約兩千三百萬。"]],["bunch","bʌntʃ","n. 串, 束\\n[医] 骨肿块(马)",["The young man saved the girl from a bunch of hoodlums.","I ate a bunch of Taco Bell and now I have a serious case of the shits."],["该名青年将少女从流氓团伙中救了出来。","我吃了一堆塔可鐘，現在肚子拉得很慘。"]],["lawsuit","'lɒ:sju:t","n. 诉讼\\n[法] 诉讼, 诉讼案件",["Despite my lawyer's doubts, I chose to press forward with the lawsuit.","The lawsuit was dismissed as vexatious and meritless."],["",""]],["testimony","'testimәni","n. 证言, 证据, 声明\\n[医] 证据",["In Islam, the shahada is the testimony of faith.","Now, this is John's testimony: Jews of Jerusalem sent priests and Levites to ask him who he was."],["萨哈达在伊斯兰教是信仰的证明。",""]],["found","faund","vt. 建立, 创立, 铸造\\nfind的过去式和过去分词",["We found it very hard going back to our base camp in the blizzard.","Makoto found his true love on top of Ayers Rock. She's from Osaka."],["暴风雪使得我们难以返回营地。","誠在艾爾斯岩上找到了自己真正的愛情。她來自大阪。"]],["burden","'bә:dn","n. 负担, 重载, 担子, 责任\\nvt. 装货于, 烦扰, 使负担",["I feel that I am a burden to everyone, that no one will ever love me.","I know I'm a burden; you don't have to repeat it."],["感觉自己对别人而言就是个累赘，不会有人爱上我的。","我知道自己是个累赘，你没必要反复提。"]],["react","ri'ækt","vi. 起反应, 起作用, 反攻\\n[医] 应答, 发生反应",["If someone irritates you, it is best not to react immediately.","Acids react chemically with metals."],["如果有人激怒你，你最好不要立刻做出反应。","酸会和金属物质起化学反应。"]],["chamber","'tʃeimbә","n. 室, 房间, 枪膛\\nvt. 装(弹药), 把...关在室内\\na. 室内的",["A furnace is an enclosed chamber in which heat is produced to heat buildings, destroy refuse, smelt or refine ores, etc.","Under the Constitution, the lower chamber's resolutions override those of the upper chamber."],["",""]],["cooperation","kәu.ɒpә'reiʃәn","n. 合作, 协力, 配合\\n[化] 合作",["No one could predict the outcome of this cooperation.","With their cooperation, the mission had been successfully finished."],["没人能够预言这次合作的结果。","在他們的默契合作下，任務完美地完成了。"]],["furniture","'fәnitʃә","n. 家具, 帆具",["I sold my house and furniture, together with my jewelry, in order to scrape together a half a million.","That piece of furniture is not fitting for the living room."],["我卖了房子和家具，连同我的手饰一起才凑了五十万。","那件家具不适合摆在客厅。"]],["ceremony","'serimәni","n. 典礼, 仪式, 礼节\\n[法] 典礼, 仪式",["Thousands of candles illuminated the church during the ceremony.","At the end of the ceremony, the new couple kissed."],["数以千计的蜡烛点亮了仪式中的教堂。","典礼结束时，新人接了吻。"]],["string","striŋ","n. 线, 细绳, 一串, 字符串\\nvt. 串起, 成串, 收紧, 缚, 扎\\nvi. 成一串\\n[计] 字符串, 串",["If a piece of knotted string can unleash the wind, and if a drowned man can awaken, then I believe a broken man can heal.","Specialists are people who have only one string on their violin."],["如果一段打结的绳子能换来风，如果淹死的人能再醒来，那么我相信伤了心的人会痊愈。","專家就好像一台只有一根弦的小提琴一樣。"]],["communicate","kә'mju:nikeit","vt. 显露, 传达, 感染\\nvi. 通讯",["The amount of time someone is willing to spend on something may communicate how important it is to him.","If you want to learn Chinese well, you should communicate with Chinese people more often."],["從一個人在某件事上肯花多少時間，就能看出這件事對這個人有多重要。","要想学好中文，就应该多跟中国人交流。"]],["cheek","tʃi:k","n. 颊, 厚颜, 脸蛋\\n[医] 颊",["After slapping Tom's right cheek, Mary stomped on his left foot.","The boy caressed the girl's chin and kissed her cheek."],["玛丽给了汤姆的右脸一巴掌，然后踩了他的左脚。",""]],["lost","lɒst","a. 失去的, 遗失的, 迷惑的\\nlose的过去式和过去分词",["The Tigers lost the game, which was a surprise to us.","Sally lost the contact lenses she had bought the day before."],["我們覺得很驚訝老虎隊竟然輸掉了比賽。","Sally 把前一天買的隱形眼鏡弄不見了。"]],["profile","'prәufail","n. 侧面, 轮廓, 传略\\nvt. 描绘...轮廓, 写...的传略\\n[计] 提问档; 剖面图法; 剖面法",["Tom always has the cutest profile pictures.","The portrait shows the profile of a beautiful woman."],["汤姆永远有最可爱的头像。",""]],["mechanism","'mekәnizm","n. 机械, 机构, 结构, 机理, 技巧\\n[化] 机理; 历程; 机构",["In order to bring about order in this chaos, we need a reliably functioning control mechanism.","I think Tom's anger is just a defense mechanism; I wouldn't take it personally if I were you."],["",""]],["disagree",".disә'gri:","vi. 不一致, 不适宜\\n[法] 抵触, 不同意, 争执",["I have no difficulty finding people who disagree with you.","They consider it impolite to disagree with someone they don't know very well."],["我找跟您意見相左的人毫無困難。","他们认为，去反驳一个不认识的人有些不礼貌。"]],["penalty","'penәlti","n. 处罚, 刑罚, 罚款, 罚球, 报应, 不利结果, 妨碍\\n[经] 罚金(款), 违约金",["The fans went silent as they nervously watched the penalty shootout between the two teams.","The death penalty had been done away with in many states in the USA."],["球迷们安静下来，绷紧神经，观看两支球队的点球大战。","死刑在美国的很多州都被废除了。"]],["ie","'i:ei","[计] 中断启动",["This book sells very well, ie it is sold to many people.","My father studies astronomy, ie the science of stars."],["",""]],["resort","ri'zɒ:t","n. 度假胜地, 手段, 凭借, 常去之地\\nvi. 诉诸, 常去",["When only death remains, the last resort is to beg for food.","He was affable and smiling, and he told staff he was visiting friends in a seaside resort popular with day-trippers and, in recent years, associated with gay chic."],["除死无大事，讨饭到了家。","他和藹可親，面帶微笑。他告訴工作人員，他正在拜訪朋友，他們住在一個受一日遊遊客歡迎的海濱度假勝地。近年來，這裡與同性戀時尚聯繫在一起。"]],["destruction","di'strʌkʃәn","n. 破坏, 毁灭\\n[医] 破坏",["First Contact became humanity's salvation as it was at the brink of self-destruction.","A nuclear war will bring about the destruction of mankind."],["在人類自我毀滅的邊緣，第一次接觸成了福音。","核戰爭將會為人類帶來滅亡。"]],["unlikely",".ʌn'laikli","a. 不太可能的",["I know that it is highly unlikely that anyone would be willing to help me.","I think that it's unlikely that Tom will get elected."],["我知道不太可能有人願意幫助我。","我觉得汤姆不太可能会当选。"]],["tissue","'tiʃu:","n. 薄的织物, 薄纱, 棉纸, 组织, 一套\\n[化] 组织",["I think I'm gonna sneeze. Give me a tissue.","I'm buying letter paper, some stamps, and some tissue paper."],["我想我要打喷嚏了。。。给我张纸巾。",""]],["constitutional",".kɒnsti'tju:ʃәnl","a. 宪法的, 立宪的, 体质的\\n[医] 全身的; 体质的",["America has an elaborate system of constitutional checks and balances.","It was under these circumstances that the constitutional crisis began."],["",""]],["pant","pænt","n. 喘息, 悸动\\nvi. 喘息, 渴望\\nvt. 气喘吁吁地说",["Tom rolled up his pant legs so people could see his bright red socks.","Tom's gone down two pant sizes since he went vegan."],["湯姆捲起了他的褲腿，好讓人看到他鮮紅色的襪子。",""]],["stranger","'streindʒә","n. 陌生人, 门外汉\\n[法] 局外人, 非当事人, 第三者",["When Mary was spoken to by a stranger, she was at a loss for words.","A stranger tapped me on the shoulder from behind. He must have mistaken me for someone else."],["当一个陌生人来和玛丽说话时，她不知道该说什么了。","有個陌生人從後面拍了拍我的肩。我肯定他是認錯人了。"]],["infection","in'fekʃәn","n. 传染, 影响, 传染病\\n[医] 传染, 感染",["He had an infection in his belly button.","The government didn't take appropriate measures to prevent the infection from spreading."],["他的肚脐发炎了。",""]],["cabinet","'kæbinit","n. 橱柜, 内阁\\na. 内阁的, 细木工做的\\n[计] 机柜",["The prime minister appoints the members of his cabinet.","The Prime Minister was obliged to resign from the Cabinet."],["",""]],["broken","'brәukәn","a. 坏掉的, 打破的, 断掉的\\nbreak的过去分词",["Harry had to back out of the competition because of a broken arm.","The meeting will have broken up by the time you arrive there."],["亨利因为伤了手臂而被撤销了比赛资格。","等你到的时候应该已经散会了。"]],["apple","'æpl","n. 苹果, 家伙\\n[医] 苹果",["At last, John and Sue decided to cut the apple into halves.","I delight in going to the apple orchard each fall."],["約翰和蘇最後決定把蘋果切成兩半。","我樂意每年秋季去蘋果園。"]],["electric","i'lektik","a. 电的, 导电的, 电动的\\n[医] 电的",["My favourite musical instrument is the electric guitar.","An electric guitar doesn't sound the same as an acoustic one."],["我最喜欢的乐器是电吉他。","電結他的聲音和木結他不同。"]],["proceed","prәu'si:d","vi. 继续进行, 进行, 开始, 发出, 起诉\\n[法] 所得, 收入, 收益",["Let's proceed with the items on the agenda.","Follow my instructions and proceed carefully."],["讓我們繼續進行議程上的項目。","按照我的指示小心謹慎地前進。"]],["bet","bet","n. 打赌, 赌注\\nv. 打赌",["I bet Tom and Mary have never even been to Boston.","I bet I can sit here longer without saying a thing than you can."],["我很肯定湯姆和瑪麗從來沒去過波士頓。","我猜我能老实地坐在这更久，不发一句牢骚，而不像你。"]],["literary","'litәrәri","a. 文学的, 文艺的, 精通文学的\\n[法] 文学的, 从事文学的, 从事写作的",["\"Literary composition is a great achievement that concerns the ruling of a state, a splendid affair of eternal standing\".","Noted literary personalities gathered together last evening."],["\"文學作品是關係到一個國家統治的偉大成就，以及永恆地位的輝煌事跡\"。","知名文学界人士昨晚齐聚一堂。"]],["virus","'vaiәrәs","n. 病毒, 滤过性病毒, 毒害\\n[化] 病毒",["Tom got a computer virus while he was watching videos on dubious Internet sites.","In short, it is because the 'plan.doc' file I attached in the previous email was infected with a virus."],["汤姆在可疑的网站上看视频的时候中了电脑病毒。","簡單來說，就是因為我附在上一封電郵的「plan.doc」檔案被電腦病毒感染了。"]],["strategic","strә'ti:dʒik","a. 战略的, 战略上的\\n[经] 战略的",["This project offers strategic advantages for Algeria.","At Juancheng, Dong'e, and Fan counties, thanks to the strategic planning of Xun Yu and Cheng Yu, the locations were connected, and the cities were defended to the death."],["這項專案給阿爾及利亞帶來策略性優勢。","其鄄城、東阿、范縣三處，賴荀彧、程昱二人設計相連，死守城郭。"]],["fortune","'fɒ:tʃәn","n. 财富, 运气, 兴隆, 大量财产, 好运, 命运\\n[法] 命运, 财产, 大量财产",["I had my fortune read by an old lady with an eery-looking glass eye.","All of the longing and wishes for good fortune are wrapped up in the fragile skin of the dumplings."],["我让一个有着奇怪玻璃眼珠的老太太帮我算了命。","所有的思念与祝福都包进了那薄薄的饺子皮里。"]],["stupid","'stju:pid","a. 愚蠢的, 麻木的",["I don't think Tom and Mary know that John thinks they're stupid.","I didn't think Tom would be stupid enough to do that."],["我不觉得汤姆和玛丽知道约翰认为他们愚蠢。","我覺得，湯姆不會傻到那樣做。"]],["dispute","dis'pju:t","n. 争论\\nv. 争论",["Two different parties with common interests were on the warpath when he cut in to settle the dispute.","The countries concerned settled the dispute by peaceful means."],["",""]],["assistant","ә'sistәnt","n. 助手, 助理, 助教\\na. 有帮助的, 辅助的, 助理的",["The assistant referee held up his flag to show the referee that the ball was still in play.","After the assistant returned $1 to each one, each man had actually paid only $9."],["助理裁判向主裁判举旗示意比赛继续。","然后助手还给每人1美金，每个人实际上只付了9美金。"]],["overcome",".әuvә'kʌm","vt. 战胜, 克服, 胜过\\nvi. 得胜",["How to overcome the high value of the yen is a big problem.","I've found a way to overcome my habit of always picking fault with others."],["如何克服日元升高是个大问题。","我想办法克服了对别人吹毛求疵的毛病。"]],["remarkable","ri'mɑ:kәbl","a. 不平常的, 值得注意的, 显著的",["In recent years, science has made remarkable progress.","He was able to put up remarkable performances at the sports competition."],["这几年，科学取得了显著的进步。","他在運動會上的表現十分出色。"]],["statistics","stә'tistiks","n. 统计学, 统计资料\\n[计] 统计信息",["The aviation expert analyzed the statistics in detail.","Facts are stubborn things, but statistics are pliable."],["航空专家详细分析了统计数据。","事实是倔强的，但统计是柔顺的。"]],["occupy","'ɒkjupai","vt. 占领, 占(时间、空间等), 住进, 担任, 使从事, 使全神贯注\\n[法] 占领, 占据, 占有",["Sami wanted to occupy himself with something else to stop smoking weed.","I think I will occupy myself in my father's business."],["",""]],["wipe","waip","n. 擦拭, 用力打, 凸轮\\nvt. 擦, 揩, 消灭, 涂上, 拭去\\nvi. 擦, 打",["Wipe the pan dry with a paper towel.","The young wives of old husbands have the habit of thinking early on about choosing the one who will wipe their widow tears."],["用纸巾把平底锅擦干。",""]],["encounter","in'kauntә","n. 相会, 相遇, 遭遇\\nvt. 遇见, 邂逅, 会战\\nvi. 偶然相遇",["When you encounter difficulties, friends can help you deal with them.","His encounter with her is enriching his inner life."],["你遇到苦难的时候，朋友们可以帮助你经受住。","与她的相遇丰富了他的精神生活。"]],["shopping","'ʃɒpiŋ","n. 买东西, 购物\\n[经] 购物, 买东西",["I had neither the time to go shopping, nor to say goodbye to my mother.","John asked Mary whether she would like to go shopping in the afternoon."],["我既没时间购物，又没时间跟我妈妈说再见。","約翰問瑪莉下午想不想一起去買東西。"]],["cousin","'kʌzәn","n. 堂兄弟姊妹, 表兄弟姊妹\\n[法] 同辈表亲或堂亲",["My cousin is so steeped in schoolwork that his friends call him bookworm.","Even if your friend is a doctor and your cousin is a pharmacist, you will still have to die."],["我的表兄弟太过沉浸于学业，以致于他的朋友们唤他作书虫。","就算你朋友是醫生、堂表親是藥劑師，該死的時候還是得死。"]],["initially","i'niʃәli","adv. 最初, 开头",["Initially we had some problems with our computer system, but they've been sorted out now.","It was much worse than we initially thought."],["我們的電腦系統起初出了點問題，不過現在已經修理好了。","事情比我们最初想象的更严重。"]],["blind","blaind","n. 蒙蔽物, 窗帘\\na. 盲目的, 瞎的, 不加思考的\\nvt. 使失明, 蒙蔽, 遮暗\\nadv. 盲目地",["Blind people sometimes develop a compensatory ability to sense the proximity of objects around them.","My mother told me that if I masturbated, I'd go blind."],["某些失明者会产生一个弥补性的能力，这个能力让他们察觉到他们与离他们很近的物体的距离。","我妈告诉我要是自慰我就会瞎。"]],["port","pɒ:t","n. 港口, 埠, 舱门, 避风港, 左舷, 炮眼, 姿势, 意义\\nvt. 左转舵, 持(枪)\\nvi. 左转舵\\n[计] 端口, 移植",["A whistle blew, and the boat slowly began to pull out of port.","The fishing boat that had been missing returned to its port safely."],["汽笛声响起，船开始慢慢地驶离港口。","消失了的漁船安全地回了港。"]],["electricity",".ilek'trisiti","n. 电, 电流, 电学, 热情, 电力供应\\n[化] 电学; 电",["The discovery that electric currents can be produced by magnetism is extremely important in the field of electricity.","The machine generated large amounts of electricity."],["磁能生产电流的发明，在电力领域非常重要。","机器发了很多电。"]],["adviser","әd'vaizә","n. 顾问, 劝告者, 指导教师\\n[法] 顾问, 劝告者",["My father achieved that and more in four words, which made quoting Shakespeare as effective as any business adviser could wish.","The scientific adviser doesn't share his student's optimism."],["",""]],["genetic","dʒi'netik","a. 创始的, 遗传的, 起源的, 遗传学的\\n[医] 生殖的, 遗传的",["Through genetic modification, we can improve crops.","Is it true that our genetic heritage is almost the same as that of chimpanzees?"],["通过遗传修饰，我们可以改良农作物。","我们的遗传基因真的和黑猩猩几乎一样吗？"]],["spokesman","'spәuksmәn","n. 发言人, 代言者",["A spokesman has confirmed that the secretary's recommendation was sent to the president early Friday.","The spokesman explained the blueprint of the scheme to the press."],["",""]],["retain","ri'tein","vt. 保持, 保有, 留住, 记得, 付定金聘请\\n[经] 保留, 留存",["If you use a computer, you can retain information.","Whoever wants to retain everything lets everything escape."],["",""]],["latter","'lætә","a. 后者的, 较后的, 近来的",["Practice is as important as theory, but we are apt to value the latter and despise the former.","The difference between a standalone sentence and a sentence in the middle of an essay is that the latter has context."],["实践和理论同样重要，但我们倾向于重视后者而忽略前者。","独立的句子和文章中的句子的区别在于后者具备上下文。"]],["incentive","in'sentiv","n. 动机\\na. 激励的",["We lack an incentive for pursuing the eastern market.","The cold winter wind wasn't really an incentive to cycling."],["",""]],["slave","sleiv","n. 奴隶, 从动装置, 卑鄙的人\\nvi. 拼命工作\\n[计] 从设备",["I refuse to be treated like a slave by you.","No one shall be held in slavery or servitude; slavery and the slave trade shall be prohibited in all their forms."],["我拒绝被你像奴隶一样对待。",""]],["accurate","'ækjurәt","a. 正确的, 精确的\\n[经] 准确的, 精确的",["It's not your mother tongue, so your pronunciation will never be accurate.","What you've said is totally accurate."],["因为它不是你的母语，你的发音会永远不准。","你说的完全正确！"]],["translate","træns'leit","vt. 翻译, 解释, 转化, 转变为, 调动\\nvi. 翻译, 被译\\n[计] 转换",["It took me more than two hours to translate a few pages of English.","I didn't literally translate from English into Japanese."],["翻译几页英文花了我2个多小时。","我没有把英语直译成日语。"]],["whereas","hwєәr'æz","conj. 然而, 鉴于\\n[法] 考虑到, 鉴于, 就...而论",["Mary is a very promising student, whereas Tom promises much but achieves little.","Working part-time at a supermarket, I found that some customers were polite whereas others weren't."],["瑪麗是個很有前途的學生，而湯姆則是光說不練。",""]],["terror","'terә","n. 恐怖, 可怕的人\\n[医] 惊吓, 惊悸",["One student says the purge is still going on in China and terror is widespread.","When we saw the animal so near us, we ran away in terror."],["",""]],["expansion","ik'spænʃәn","n. 扩充, 开展, 膨胀\\n[计] 扩展",["The expansion of the building's west end is being studied.","Shareholders were concerned about the company's swift expansion overseas."],["西面大楼的扩建在研究中。",""]],["elite","ei'li:t","n. 精华, 精锐, 中坚分子",["On the whole, the elite are not sensitive to criticism.","Though he is no longer president, he still holds considerable sway among the political elite."],["",""]],["olympic","әu'limpik","a. 奥林匹亚的, 奥林匹斯山的, 强有力的, 巨大的",["The most important thing in the Olympic Games is not winning but taking part.","The important thing about the Olympic Games is not to win, but to take part in them."],["奥运会最重要的不是获胜，而是参与。","奥运会重要的是参与，不是获胜。"]],["dirt","dә:t","n. 污垢, 泥土\\n[化] 污垢",["They not only washed off the sweat, dirt and cares of the day in the hot water, but also enjoyed gossiping about everyday affairs.","Tom is washing the dirt off the plates."],["他們不只是洗去汗水、汙垢和鎮日的操勞，同時也沉浸在閒話家常日常生活當中。","Tom洗去盘子上的污垢。"]],["odd","ɒd","a. 奇数的, 古怪的, 剩余的, 零散的, 各种各样的, 少量的\\nn. 奇特的事物, 怪人\\n[计] 奇数, 奇校验, 光数据数字转换器",["The vast majority of Chinese people have never met foreigners before, so it feels odd for them, like meeting space aliens.","Even times odd is even, odd times odd is odd."],["大多数中国人没见过几个外国人，觉得特新奇，看见外星人的感觉。","偶数乘以奇数是偶数，奇数乘以奇数是奇数。"]],["bullet","'bulit","n. 子弹\\n[医] 弹, 子弹, 距节(马)",["Tom was wearing a bulletproof vest, so the bullet didn't kill him.","He had three bullet wounds in his chest."],["湯姆穿著一件防彈衣，所以子彈沒把他殺死。","他胸口中了三槍。"]],["rice","rais","n. 米, 米饭, 稻\\nvt. 将...压成米粒状",["I could eat some beef noodle soup, or some reheated rice with soybean paste like that, no problem.","In China, southern people eat rice as staple food; northern people eat wheaten food as staple food."],["我可以不慌不忙吃牛奶面包鸡蛋，或者泡饭酱菜。","在中国，南方人以米饭为主食，北方人以面食为主食。"]],["tight","tait","a. 紧的, 密封的, 吝啬的, 严厉的\\nadv. 紧紧地",["We are traveling on a tight budget.","These shoes are too tight. They hurt."],["我們用少的預算旅行。","这些鞋子太紧了，伤脚。"]],["bible","'baibl","n. 圣经",["According to the Bible, God made the world in six days.","According to the Bible, God created the world in six days."],["根据圣经记载，上帝用6天创造了世界。","根据圣经记载，上帝用6天创造了世界。"]],["chart","tʃɑ:t","n. 图表, 海图\\nvt. 制成图表\\n[计] 图表",["The workflow is illustrated in the following chart.","Pizza is a pie chart showing how much of it is left."],["下面的图标显示了这个流程图",""]],["solar","'sәulә","a. 太阳的, 日光的, 源自太阳的\\n[医] 太阳的; 腹腔丛的",["Saturn is the second largest planet in the Solar System.","Mercury is the smallest planet in our solar system."],["土星是太陽系中第二大的行星。","水星是我們的太陽系中最小的行星。"]],["square","skwєә","n. 正方形, 街区, 广场, 平方, 直角尺\\na. 正方形的, 正直的, 公正的, 平方的, 方正的, 结清的\\nadv. 成直角地,…",["St Mark's Square in Venice is always swarming with tourists in the summer.","We learned at school that the square root of nine is three."],["威尼斯的圣马可广场在夏季总是挤满了游客。","我们上课时学了九的根是三。"]],["complicated","'kɒmplikeitid","a. 复杂的\\n[医] 并发的",["Math is like love: a simple idea, but it can get complicated.","Computers are capable of doing extremely complicated work."],["数学就像爱情，一个简单的意思，但可以变得很复杂。","电脑可以做极为复杂的工作。"]],["gently","'dʒentli","adv. 温和地, 温柔地, 轻轻地, 逐渐地",["Down in the valley a mist like a white feather rose gently into a white cloud, and obscured everything.","The leaves on the trees rustle gently in the wind."],["山谷中，薄霧如白色羽毛般緩緩升騰，化作一團白雲，遮蔽了一切。","树叶在风中簌簌作响。"]],["concentration",".kɒnsәn'treiʃәn","n. 集中, 专心\\n[化] 浓度; 浓缩",["Housing prices in Hsinchu City have risen sharply due to the concentration of the tech industry.","It's the sort of work that calls for a high level of concentration."],["新竹市區的房價因為科技產業聚集而水漲船高。",""]],["revolution",".revә'lu:ʃәn","n. 革命, 大变革, 旋转, 转数, 循环\\n[化] 回转",["This book's main topic is the American revolution.","The proletarians lose nothing in this revolution but their chains."],["这本书的主题是美国革命。","无产者在这个革命中失去的只是锁链。"]],["strip","strip","n. 长条, 条状, 带, 脱衣舞\\nvt. 脱衣, 被剥去, 剥夺, 拆卸\\nvi. 脱衣服",["Disney strip-mines the world's fairy tales for ideas and then sues people for intellectual property infringement.","The strong, gusty wind strived to strip the leaves off the trees."],["",""]],["interpret","in'tә:prit","vt. 解释, 演出, 翻译, 理解\\nvi. 翻译, 解释",["This moment will nap, you will have a dream; But this moment study,you will interpret a dream.","As for the criminal, I also currently have no idea how to interpret his actions."],["此刻打盹，你将做梦；而此刻学习，你将圆梦。",""]],["scenario","si'nɑ:riәu","n. 剧本提纲, 情节, 剧本, 方案, 事态\\n[计] 方案",["Best case scenario, you get kicked out of the house.","That's something like a movie scenario."],["即使最乐观而言，你也会被赶出这间房子。","這件事情像是電影情節。"]],["reflection","ri'flekʃәn","n. 反映, 沉思, 映像, 想法, 责难\\n[计] 反射",["My cat peers bemusedly at her reflection in the water.","A little reflection will show you that you are wrong."],["我的貓兒一臉迷惘地盯著自己在水中的倒影。","只要你細心想一想，就會明白自己的錯處了。"]],["champion","'tʃæmpiәn","n. 冠军, 拥护者, 战士\\nvt. 保卫, 拥护\\na. 优胜的",["Everyone is anxious to know what has become of the former champion.","There can only be one world champion. The question is: Who will it be?"],["大家都渴望知道前冠军得主发生了什么。","只有一个人能成为世界冠军。问题是：会是谁呢？"]],["telescope","'teliskәup","n. 望远镜\\nvi. 叠缩, 嵌进, 缩短\\nvt. 使叠缩, 使缩短",["You can see the stars with your naked eye, and even better through a telescope.","The telescope has opened a new eye onto the cosmos that has been transformative for our civilization."],["你可以用肉眼觀星，用望遠鏡的話，還能看得更清楚。","望远镜为我们的文明开启了一种全新的视角来观察宇宙。"]],["friendly","'frendli","a. 友好的, 亲切的, 互助的\\nadv. 友善地, 温和地",["Most of the Finnish people are very friendly to Chinese people.","Friendly Reminder: Please keep in mind the closing time of the line you need to switch to, so as to avoid delays in your trip."],["绝大多数芬兰人对中国人非常友好。","友情提示：请留意您需要换乘线路的首末班时间，以免耽误您的出行。"]],["tournament","'tә:nәmәnt","n. 比赛, 竞赛, 锦标赛, 联赛",["He carried off the first prize at the chess tournament.","That athlete won three times in a row in this tournament."],["他在國際象棋比賽中取得了冠軍。","那位選手在這次比賽中取得了三連勝。"]],["fiction","'fikʃәn","n. 小说, 虚构故事\\n[法] 虚构的事实, 捏造, 拟制",["My God and my faith are the only true ones, and the others are just fiction.","This is the best science fiction film in the past few years."],["我的神与我的信仰是唯一的真理，其余都是虚构。","這部科幻電影是這幾年最好看的了。"]],["detect","di'tekt","vt. 发现, 察觉, 探测\\n[法] 发现, 查明, 探测",["Instead, they detect sounds through their tongues and feel vibrations through sense organs in the skull.","Scientists have discovered that an ancient pigment, called Egyptian blue, can be used as dusting powder to detect fingerprints."],["相反，他们通过舌头来侦测声音，并通过头骨内的感觉器官来感受震动。",""]],["recommendation",".rekәmen'deiʃәn","n. 推荐, 介绍, 推荐信, 劝告\\n[经] 建议书",["Tom got the job on the strength of your recommendation.","It was all thanks to his recommendation that I was able to become a teacher at a college in Tokyo."],["多亏了你的推荐，汤姆得到了那份工作。","多亏了他的推荐，我得以在东京的一所大学里担任老师。"]],["lifetime","'laiftaim","n. 一生, 终生\\na. 一生的, 终生的",["Tatoeba: We've got more sentences than your mom could ever say in her lifetime.","Each of you must work hard for a lifetime, and only then will you be able to maintain a relationship."],["Tatoeba:我们有的句子比你妈这辈子说的都多。","彼此必須一輩子努力,才能把感情维系好。"]],["tremendous","tri'mendәs","a. 巨大的, 非常的, 可怕的",["Coming out of the closet requires tremendous courage.","The rocket travels at a tremendous speed."],["出柜需要莫大的勇气。","火箭飞得极快。"]],["senator","'senәtә","n. 参议员, (某些大学的)理事\\n[法] 参议员, 上议员",["The senator was censured by the congressional ethics committee.","The senator remained neutral in the furious controversy."],["议员受到了议会道德委员会的谴责。",""]],["hunting","'hʌntiŋ","n. 狩猎, 猎狐, 探求\\n[计] 寻找平衡; 寻找",["I am in Lyon, but maybe I'll go to Paris for hunting a job.","We'll need a head hunting agency to find the right man for this executive position."],["我在里昂，不过没准去巴黎找工作。","我們需要人力仲介公司幫我們找到合適的人來擔任這個管理職位。"]],["salad","'sælәd","n. 色拉",["Put the tomato salad in the refrigerator.","A horse doesn't eat cucumber salad."],["把蕃茄沙拉放進冰箱裏。","馬不吃黃瓜沙拉。"]],["guarantee",".gærәn'ti:","n. 担保, 抵押品, 保证书\\nvt. 保证, 担保",["Relying on strength alone cannot guarantee victory.","We guarantee our products for one year."],["单凭力量不能保证取胜。","我們保證我們的產品一年。"]],["innocent","'inәsәnt","a. 无罪的, 不懂事的, 无知的\\nn. 天真的人, 笨蛋",["The news article painted the defendant as a guilty man, even though he had been proven innocent.","Then, when he asked who had broken the window, all the boys acted innocent."],["该报文章中将被告人描述成一个罪魁祸首，尽管他已经被证明是无辜的了。","当他问起是谁打破了窗户时，所有的男生都显得很无辜。"]],["boundary","'baundri","n. 边界, 分界线\\n[计] 边界",["Sebatik Island is one of the boundary regions between Indonesia and Malaysia.","There is a fence marking the boundary between our yard and the neighbor's."],["石峇迪島是印度尼西亞和馬來西亞的邊境地區之一。","我家院子和邻居家院子之间有一道篱笆做为分界线。."]],["pause","pɒ:z","n. 暂停, 中止, 停顿, 间歇, 踌躇, 休止符\\nvi. 暂停, 中止, 停顿, 踌躇\\n[计] DOS内部命令:暂时停止批处理文件…",["He spoke for ten minutes without a pause.","After an awkward pause, Bill took her by the hand and dragged her upstairs."],["他不停顿地说了十分钟。",""]],["remote","ri'mәut","a. 遥远的, 偏僻的, 疏远的, 微少的\\n[计] 远程, 远程访问实用程序",["The TV remote control is under the couch.","We sat talking about the remote past."],["电视遥控器在沙发下面。","我们坐着谈很久以前的事。"]],["satisfaction",".sætis'fækʃәn","n. 满足, 满意, 快事, 赔偿, 赎罪, 报仇的机会\\n[经] 偿还, 赎回",["No matter what your main purpose is in reading, books should never fail to provide contentment and satisfaction.","I won't give them the satisfaction."],["无论读书的目的是什么，书总会带给我们乐趣和满足。","我不會讓他們得逞的。"]],["journal","'dʒә:nәl","n. 日记, 杂志, 日报\\n[化] 轴颈",["Thank you for submitting your work to this journal.","He writes a daily journal, and that inspired me to try doing the same thing, but in English."],["",""]],["lover","'lʌvә","n. 爱人, 爱好者",["By switching your lover from 3D to 2D, you may successfully reduce all social-interaction-related costs.","She was seen at a restaurant with her lover."],["把恋人从3D换成2D可以有效地降低交际所需的费用。","有人看見他和情人在飯店吃飯。"]],["bench","bentʃ","n. 长椅子\\n[机] 台",["I'm going to sit on the bench over there next to the street lamp.","Tom and I sat on a bench in the park and talked while we fed pigeons."],["我會在那盞街燈旁邊的長凳上坐下來。","我和汤姆在公园的长椅上坐着，一边聊天一边喂着鸽子。"]],["raw","rɒ:","n. 擦伤处, 半成品\\na. 生的, 未加工的, 生疏的, 不成熟的, 阴冷的, 刺痛的, 擦掉皮的\\nvt. 擦伤\\n[计] 写后读",["He got where he wanted to be in life by just using his raw mental strength and willpower.","This chocolate factory consumes twenty metric tons of raw cocoa per day."],["他仅凭借精神力量和意志力就达到了他所想要的生活。","這座巧克力工廠每一天消耗二十公噸可可原料。"]],["awareness","ә'weәnis","n. 意识, 认识\\n[计] 识别, 议定, 明白",["Developing political awareness takes time.","April 2nd is World Autism Awareness Day."],["培养政治意识要花费时间。","4月2日是世界提高自闭症意识日。"]],["surprising","sә'praiziŋ","a. 令人惊讶的",["As this is a cascade with multiple layers, it shouldn't be surprising that it's slow.","I've something interesting to tell you that you might find surprising."],["因为这是一个有好几层的瀑布，所以速度慢也不会让人惊讶。","告訴你箇好玩的事，能驚你一下。"]],["withdraw","wið'drɒ:","vt. 撤回, 取回, 撤消, 使撤退, 拉开, 移开\\nvi. 撤退, 离开",["You may as well withdraw from the club right away.","The Soviet troops started to withdraw from Afghanistan."],["你還不如立刻退出這個俱樂部。","苏联军队开始从阿富汗撤军了。"]],["deck","dek","n. 甲板, (汽车后部的)行李仓\\nvt. 装饰, 打扮, 装甲板\\n[计] 纸牌背面图案",["Memorizing the order of a deck of playing cards is definitely not easy, but it's not impossible.","She stood on the deck with her long hair waving in the wind."],["把一疊撲克牌的排列次序背熟，雖然絕不是一件易事，卻也不是沒有可能的。","她站在甲板上，长头发随风飞舞。"]],["pole","pәul","n. 波兰人, 极点, 磁极, 电极, 杆, 竿, 相反的极端\\nvt. 用竿支撑\\nvi. 撑篙",["The temperature at the North Pole is different from at the South Pole.","I wonder if the sea levels will rise when the North Pole melts."],["北極與南極的溫度不一樣。","我在想是否北極的冰融化的時候, 海平面就會上升。"]],["testify","'testifai","v. 证明, 作证, 声明, 表明",["We speak that we do know, and testify that we have seen; and ye receive not our witness.","He is not willing to testify for his compatriot."],["我們說我們所知道的，為我們所看到的作證；你們卻不接受我們的見證。","他不願意為同胞作證。"]],["newly","'nju:li","adv. 重新, 最近",["It only takes 20 minutes to get to school by the newly opened subway.","Going to the newly built Greenland in Shanghai is really fun!"],["坐新開的地鐵上學只需要 20 分鐘。","去上海新建的绿地玩也特有劲！"]],["similarly","'similәli","adv. 相像地, 类似于",["There isn't a bad man in the world who has been able to get a good woman; similarly, there isn't a bad woman in the world who has been able to get a good man.","In an essay similarly devoted to allegorical procedures in contemporary art, Buchloh discusses 6 women artists."],["世界上沒有一個壞男人會有一個好女人;同樣的,也沒有一個壞女人會有一個好男 人。",""]],["valley","'væli","n. 山谷, 溪谷, 流域, 凹地\\n[医] 谷",["It's time for the Tuaregs to transfer their herds to the valley.","Down in the valley a mist like a white feather rose gently into a white cloud, and obscured everything."],["圖阿雷格人該把他們的牲畜轉移到山谷去了。","山谷中，薄霧如白色羽毛般緩緩升騰，化作一團白雲，遮蔽了一切。"]],["mode","mәud","n. 模态, 调式, 样式, 文体, 状态, 方式, 风尚\\n[计] 方式; DOS外部命令:设定各种设备命令",["There is a widespread opinion that all study of the mode of oratory is unmanly, and leads to the substitution of artifice and adornment for simplicity and power.","This program cannot be run in DOS mode."],["有一種普遍的看法認為，一切對演說方式的研究都是有損男子氣概的，都會以雕飾與浮華取代質樸與力量。","這個程式無法在DOS模式下執行。"]],["dialogue","'daiәlɒg","n. 对话\\nvi. 对话\\nvt. 用对话表达",["Diplomatic dialogue helped put an end to the conflict.","The mystery contains more dialogue than narrative."],["外交谈判帮助结束了冲突。",""]],["naturally","'nætʃәrәli","adv. 自然地, 以自然力, 天生地",["With so many people around he naturally became a bit nervous.","A promise between friends naturally will be carried out to the end."],["他被很多人围着，自然变得有点紧张。","朋友之间的承诺自然会奉行到底。"]],["imply","im'plai","vt. 暗示, 意味\\n[计] 隐含",["Correlation does not imply causation.","A good education doesn't imply a good upbringing."],["相关关系不导致因果关系。","虽说是高学历，也未必就有教养。"]],["advanced","әd'vɑ:nst","a. 在前的, 高级的, 先进的, 年老的\\n[法] 预付的, 预支的, 垫付的",["The military power of this country is very advanced.","The squirrel advanced against the strong wind."],["这个国家的军事力量很先进。","松鼠在前面頂著強風。"]],["mutual","'mju:tʃuәl","a. 相互的, 共有的\\n[经] 相互的",["They want to talk to you about areas of mutual interest.","True friendship is based on mutual trust."],["他们想和你互相谈谈共同的兴趣领域。","真正的友谊建立在彼此信任的基础上。"]],["founder","'faundә","n. 创立者, 建立者\\nvt. 使沉没, 使摔倒, 弄跛, 浸水, 破坏\\nvi. 沉没, 摔到, 变跛, 倒塌, 失败",["In the center of the university campus stands the statue of the founder.","She is not the founder, she's the investor."],["創校人的雕像在大學校園的中心矗立著。","她不是創辦人，她是投資人。"]],["pride","praid","n. 骄傲, 自尊心, 自豪, 精华, 勇气\\nvt. 以...自豪",["Hey, I may have no money, but I still have my pride.","It was difficult for him to hide his pride in his success."],["嗨，我可能没钱，但我一直有我的骄傲。","他很难掩饰对自己成功的骄傲。"]],["dismiss","dis'mis","vt. 解散, 开除, 解职\\nvi. 解散\\n[计] 解散",["By turning the page, we can dismiss the characters in a book without fear of hurting their feelings.","My parents want to dismiss our nurse because they don't have enough money to pay her."],["书页翻动之间，我们可以对书中的人物不予理会而不伤及他们的情感。",""]],["aircraft","'єәkræft","n. 航空器, 飞机\\n[机] 航空器",["China has the means to destroy your aircraft carriers.","Washington's neocons should not push their aircraft carriers too close to Russia and China. These two countries have the weapons they need to pulverize them."],["中國有能力摧毀你們的航空母艦。","华盛顿的新保守主义者不该把航空母舰放到离俄罗斯和中国太近的地方。这两个国家有能粉碎它们的武器。"]],["delivery","di'livәri","n. 递送, 交付, 分娩, 交货, 引渡\\n[化] 交货额",["If you'd sent the letter by special delivery on Friday, it would've arrived by now.","This electrical device must have been damaged during delivery."],["如果你週五用特快專遞寄出這封信，現在應該已經到了。","这个电子仪器肯定在运输途中损坏了。"]],["mainly","'meinli","adv. 主要地, 大抵",["The bat's diet consists mainly of insects and fruit.","Scientists deal mainly with physical matters."],["蝙蝠的食物主要包括昆蟲和水果。","科学家處理大多数物理的事物。"]],["platform","'plætfɒ:m","n. 站台, 月台, 讲台, 论坛, 平台\\n[计] 平台",["Anne, go and stand on the platform in front of the blackboard for the rest of the afternoon.","He walked back and forth on the platform while waiting for the train."],["安妮，妳下午剩下的時間就站在黑板前的平台上。","他一邊等火車，一邊在月台上走來走去。"]],["freeze","fri:z","vi. 冻结, 冷冻, 僵硬, 楞住\\nvt. 使结冰, 使冻住, 使呆住\\nn. 结冰, 凝固\\n[计] 冻结",["Have you ever wondered how fish survive in cold winter weather, or where they go when lakes and ponds freeze over?","Have you ever wondered how fish survive in the cold winter, or where they go when lakes and ponds freeze over?"],["你有沒有想過，魚類是如何在寒冷的冬季生存的，或者當湖泊和池塘結冰時牠們會去哪裡？","你有沒有想過，魚類是如何在寒冷的冬季生存的，或者當湖泊和池塘結冰時牠們會去哪裡？"]],["finance","fai'næns","n. 财政, 财务\\nvt. 供给...经费, 负担经费\\nvi. 筹措资金",["He claimed to be an expert in finance.","Finance Ministry officials tried to boost confidence in recovery."],["他自稱為金融專家。",""]],["god","^ɔd","n. 上帝, 神像, 偶像\\nvt. 使神化",["God is the creator. Heaven and Earth and people and everything apart from God are created.","It's presumptuous for humans to assume that our task is to do what only God can do."],["上帝就是造物主。天空，土地以及人类，一切都出自上帝之手，除了上帝自身以外。","人类假设我们的任务是完成只有上帝能做的事，这太自以为是了。"]],["sink","siŋk","n. 藏垢的场所, 沟渠, 污水槽\\nvi. 下沉, 沉没, 下陷, 减弱, 衰退, 消沉, 堕落, 渗透\\nvt. 使低落, 使下沉, …",["Tom seems to have packed everything but the kitchen sink.","The washing-up machine at home was regarded as a rival to the worker at the kitchen sink."],["Tom把除了厨房水槽之外的所有东西都打包了。","在厨房，家用洗碗机可以算得上是手洗刷碗工的大敌。"]],["bake","beik","vt. 烘焙, 烤\\nvi. 烤面包\\nn. 烘焙, 烤",["There is an oven to bake bread in the kitchen.","I haven't baked bread in a long time. How about we bake a little today?"],["廚房有烤箱，可以用來烤麵包。","我有好久都没烤面包了。要不今天烤点儿？"]],["attractive","ә'træktiv","a. 吸引人的, 有魅力的\\n[法] 有吸引力的, 有迷惑力的",["Mary has as attractive a personality as her sister.","Mountaineering is attractive especially to young people because it is accompanied with hardships and adventures."],["玛丽性格很好，就像她姐姐一样。","攀山是種既緊張刺激，又具挑戰性的運動，因此特別受年青人歡迎。"]],["diverse","dai'vә:s","a. 不同的, 变化多的",["It's fertile land inhabited by diverse nations.","We find diverse ethnic and economic interests here."],["這是一片肥沃的土地，居住著不同的民族。",""]],["relevant","'relivәnt","a. 有关联的, 有关系的, 适当的, 相应的\\n[法] 有关的, 相关的",["In order to alleviate employment pressures, the nation has established a series of relevant policies.","Comments must be relevant to the topic."],["为了缓解就业压力，国家已经制定了一系列相关政策。","评论要与主题相关。"]],["ideal","ai'diәl","n. 理想, 典范, 观念, 思想, 最后目标\\na. 理想的, 完美的, 空想的, 观念的, 唯心论的",["The beach is an ideal place for children to play.","He's making it clear that he's an ideal husband."],["海滩是一个供孩子们玩乐的理想场所。","他表明自己是一個理想的丈夫。"]],["joy","dʒɒi","n. 欢喜, 乐事, 高兴\\nvt. 使快乐, 令人高兴\\nvi. 欢喜",["He could not help jumping for joy at the good news.","Those who count their blessings experience more joy."],["他聽到那個好消息，高興得跳了起來。","知足者常乐。"]],["regularly","'regjulәli","adv. 有规则地, 一丝不苟地, 正式地",["Almost half the men in Great Britain regularly give chocolate to their partner, especially for their birthday.","She goes to the dentist regularly, so she seldom gets toothache."],["大部分大不列颠的男人定期送巧克力作礼物给他们的配偶，尤其是在他们生日的时候。","她定期去看牙医，所以她很少牙痛。"]],["working","'wә:kiŋ","n. 工作, 运转, 劳动\\na. 工作的, 劳动的, 经营的, 抽搐的, 运转的",["You can make your dream come true by working hard.","You are working too hard. Take it easy for a while."],["你努力工作的話，就可以實現你的夢想。","你工作得太辛苦了。放輕鬆一下。"]],["conservation",".kɒnsә'veiʃәn","n. 保护, 保存\\n[医] 保存",["The giant panda is recognised as a national treasure of China, but in some conservation areas it is still killed by poachers.","During the holidays, some university students go to Africa as volunteers and help to perfect local wildlife conservation."],["大熊猫被认为是中国的国宝，但在一些保护区，它仍被偷猎。","一些大学生在假期去非洲做志愿者 ，帮助当地完善野生生物管理。"]],["evolve","i'vɒlv","vi. 进展, 进化, 展开\\nvt. 使发展, 使推断出, 使进化",["The threat increases; a defence that doesn't evolve is meaningless.","The rules of grammar and spelling have to be broken in order for a language to evolve."],["",""]],["shooting","'ʃu:tiŋ","n. 发射, 猎场, 射击",["Speaking without thinking is like shooting without looking.","The sun shines through the tri-color clouds, shooting towards the earth."],["不思就說等於無的放矢。","陽光穿過三色雲，射向大地。"]],["singer","'siŋә","n. 歌手",["What must one keep in mind during a kiss, above all else? The singer Max Raabe answers this important question.","Mary discovered that Tom was secretly a talented singer."],["接吻時最該注意的是什麼？歌手馬克斯拉貝回答了這個重要的問題。","瑪莉發現湯姆其實是一位很有才華的歌手。"]],["partly","'pɑ:tli","adv. 部分地, 在一定程度上",["The wall is partly covered with ivy.","This means that our perception of any situation depends only partly on sensory signals being received at that time."],["墙被常青藤覆盖了一部分。",""]],["unknown",".ʌn'nәun","a. 不知道的, 未知的, 陌生的\\nn. 未知物, 未知数",["The Latin language is not entirely unknown to me, but I altogether lack the ability to speak it.","Flowers and wreaths were laid in front of the Tomb of the Unknown Soldier."],["拉丁语对我来说不是完全陌生的，但我不懂说这门语言。","在无名战士的墓前献上了鲜花和花圈。"]],["offense","ә'fens","n. 犯罪, 伤感情, 攻击",["That is a criminal offense, and you will surely be punished!","He took offense at what I said and turned on his heels."],["那是犯罪行为，你肯定会受到惩罚的!",""]],["dna","","脱氧核糖核酸\\n[计] 无效数据, 数字网络体系结构, 分布式网络体系结构",["The police found foreign DNA at the scene of the crime.","Neil Gemmell, a geneticist from the University of Otago in New Zealand, led the study that tried to catalog all living species in the lake by extracting DNA from water samples."],["警方在犯罪現場發現了陌生人的 DNA。","紐西蘭奧塔哥大學的遺傳學家尼爾杰梅爾領導了這項研究，試圖透過從水樣本中提取 DNA 來對湖泊中所有生物物種進行編目。"]],["counter","'kauntә","n. 计算器, 计算者, 柜台, 筹码\\na. 反方向的, 相反的\\nadv. 反方向地, 相反地\\n[计] 计数器; 计数字",["Matthew's dog, Rocky, loves to steal cupcakes off the kitchen counter.","Tom is filling his sentence counter on Tatoeba by adding translations from an English-Russian phrasebook."],["马修的狗洛基喜欢从厨房台面上偷纸杯蛋糕。","湯姆在 Tatoeba 上添加英俄短語手冊中的翻譯，來增加他的句子數。"]],["potentially","pә'tenʃәli","adv. 可能地, 潜在地",["The purpose of the meeting was to encourage employees to share any potentially innovating ideas.","Layla understood that her boyfriend was potentially dangerous."],["",""]],["thirty","'θә:ti","num. 三十, 三十个",["Fashions of thirty years ago have come back in style.","\"Thirty dollars is a lot for that small room,\" he thought."],["三十年前的時裝款式又流行起來了。","「這麼狹小的房間要三十元實在是太貴了。」他想。"]],["justify","'dʒʌstifai","vt. 替...辩护, 证明\\nvi. 证明合法\\n[计] 段落重排, 两端对齐",["The end does not always justify the means.","Often, the less there is to justify a traditional custom the harder it is to get rid of it."],["為了正當目的並非總是可以不擇手段.",""]],["protest","prә'test","n. 抗议, 反对, 抗议书, 断言\\nv. 反对, 抗议, 断言",["Their small protest triggered a mass demonstration.","The school won't turn on the air conditioning, so the students are going to throw their hot water flasks off of the balcony in protest."],["他們小型的示威引發了一場大規模的遊行。","学校不给开空调，学生们就会从阳台上扔热水瓶抗议。"]],["treaty","'tri:ti","n. 条约, 谈判\\n[经] 协议, 协定, 协商",["The treaty has been concluded after many twists and turns.","The spokesman explained the contents of the treaty to the press."],["",""]],["crash","kræʃ","n. 哗啦声, 猛撞, 崩溃, 粗布\\nv. 撞碎, 破碎, (使)...坠毁\\na. 速成的\\n[计] 崩溃",["His wife is in the hospital because she was injured in a car crash.","Why does the computer crash every time I run a program? Simply because I can't afford a good computer."],["他的妻子在醫院裡因為她在一場車禍中受傷了。","为什么电脑一跑程序，就崩溃？还不是因为我没钱买好电脑。"]],["politically","","adv. 政治上",["The country is isolated economically and politically.","Anybody with at least a two-digit IQ knows this was a politically biased choice."],["",""]],["craft","kræft","n. 技艺, 手艺, 诡计\\nvt. 精心制作",["\"What craft do you know?\" the wizard asked the youth.","Thousands of laborers and craftsmen toiled for 22 years to craft the stunning white marble edifice."],["巫師問年輕人：「你懂什麼技藝？」","數千名工人和工匠辛勤工作了 22 年，才打造出這座令人驚嘆的白色大理石建築。"]],["insight","'insait","n. 察看, 洞察力, 见识\\n[医] 自知力, 洞察, 顿悟",["This poem calls for great insight from the reader.","Your insight is poor and your judgment is impaired."],["",""]],["terrorist","'terәrist","n. 恐怖分子\\n[法] 恐怖份子, 恐怖主义",["The USA is acting like a terrorist force in the Middle East.","One man's terrorist is another man's freedom fighter."],["美國在中東的行為如同恐怖主義勢力。","一个人的恐怖分子为另人的自由战士。"]],["possess","pә'zes","vt. 持有, 占有, 拥有, 克制, 支配, 迷住\\n[法] 持有, 占有, 具有",["I believe you already possess all the qualities needed to go undercover.","It is the things that we do not possess which seem to us most desirable."],["我认为，你已经完全具备了潜伏的资质。","得不到的东西就最想得到。"]],["tap","'tæp","n. 轻打, 水龙头\\nvt. 轻打, 轻敲, 敲打出, 选择, 装上嘴子, 使流出, 开发, 分接, 向...乞讨\\nvi. 轻叩, 轻…",["There's a chance that tap water may contain harmful substances like chlorine and lead.","The tap in the kitchen is dripping."],["自來水有可能含有氯、鉛等有害物質。","廚房裡的水龍頭在漏水。"]],["extensive","ik'stensiv","a. 广的, 广泛的, 多方面的\\n[经] 广大的, 扩大的",["Those selected will have to face extensive medical and psychological tests.","She has extensive knowledge of birds, flowers, and plants."],["被选上的将会面临大量的医学和精神测试。","她对鸟类和花草很有研究。"]],["episode","'episәud","n. 插曲, 插话, 有趣的事件, 一段情节\\n[医] 插话, 插曲, 发作",["Seriously though, episode 21 made me almost cry while laughing.","That reminds me of a Spongebob episode."],["但是说真的，第21集让我笑得眼泪都要出来了。","這讓我想起一集《海綿寶寶》。"]],["swim","swim","n. 游泳, 漂浮, 潮流, 眩晕\\nvi. 游泳, 游, 漂浮, 浸, 覆盖, 充溢, 大量拥有, 旋转, 眩晕\\nvt. 游过, 使浮起",["It must be dangerous to swim in this rapid stream.","He failed in his attempt to swim across the river."],["在這麼急的急流裏游泳，一定會很危險的。","他试图游过河，但是失败了。"]],["fault","fɒ:lt","n. 过错, 故障, 毛病\\nvt. 挑剔\\nvi. 产生断层, 弄错\\n[计] 故障",["I'm really sorry, it's all my fault - I didn't notice you.","I've found a way to overcome my habit of always picking fault with others."],["真对不起，刚才都怪我，没注意到您。","我想办法克服了对别人吹毛求疵的毛病。"]],["tire","taiә","n. 轮胎, 头饰\\nvt. 使疲倦, 使厌烦, 打扮\\nvi. 疲劳, 厌倦",["I had to push my bicycle because I had a flat tire.","The rear tire of my bicycle is flat."],["我得推我的自行车，因为有个轮胎漏气了。","我的自行車的後輪爆胎了。"]],["loose","lu:s","n. 发射, 放任, 放纵\\na. 宽松的, 松的, 宽的, 不牢固的, 散漫的, 自由的, 不精确的\\nvt. 释放, 放枪, 开船\\n…",["No money, no job, no friends. He was truly at loose ends.","This is because you approach everything as a total person, with no loose ends hanging out to signify divided intentions."],["没钱，没工作，没朋友，他真是无所适从。","这是因为你总是全身心处理每一件事情，没有让鸡毛蒜皮的问题分散了你的目标。"]],["shortly","'ʃɒ:tli","adv. 不久, 简短, 唐突地",["Shortly before his wedding, he decided not to get married.","Shortly after the war my father bought a new house, in which I was born."],["他在要結婚之際決定還是不結婚了。","戰後不久，我的父親就買了一棟房子，而我就是在那棟房子裏出生的。"]],["originally","ә'ridʒәnli","adv. 本来, 原来, 最初, 就起源而论, 独创地",["I find the problem easier than I originally believed it to be.","I find this problem easier than I originally thought."],["我发现问题比我原以为的容易。","我发现问题比我原以为的容易。"]],["considerable","kәn'sidәrәbl","a. 相当的, 可观的, 重要的",["A considerable amount of time and effort have been spent already.","To Brian's surprise, his debt amounted to a considerable sum."],["已經花費了很多的時間和精力。",""]],["prior","'praiә","a. 更重要的, 较早的, 在先的\\nn. 小隐修院院长, 大隐修院副院长",["All the arrangements should be made prior to our departure.","Be sure to check in at least 45 minutes prior to departure time."],["",""]],["intellectual",".intә'lektʃuәl","n. 有知识者, 知识分子, 凭理智做事者\\na. 智力的, 用脑力的, 聪明的",["In terms of intellectual hobbies, I really like learning Chinese characters.","An intellectual is a person who has discovered something more interesting than sex."],["对知识的爱好而言，我真的喜欢学汉字。","一个知识分子是发现到一种比性行为更有意思的活动的人。"]],["characterize","'kærәktәraiz","vt. 描绘...的特性, 刻划...的性格",["To one of the head psychologists, the depression criteria didn't quite characterize this group of girls.","Is this kid autistic or does he have ADHD? His behavior is hard to characterize either way."],["",""]],["assault","ә'sɒ:t","n. 攻击, 袭击\\nvt. 袭击, 攻击\\nvi. 发动攻击",["You can be charged with criminal assault without actually touching the victim.","Incidents of sexual assault in the military are heavily under-reported."],["",""]],["relax","ri'læks","vi. 放松, 松懈, 松弛, 变从容, 休息, 休养\\nvt. 使松弛, 缓和, 使松懈, 使休息",["Tom wanted to stay home and relax instead of hiking with his children.","Work is so busy that I don't even have any time to relax."],["汤姆想待在家休息而不是和他的孩子们出去远足。","工作很忙， 连休息的时间都没有。"]],["adventure","әd'ventʃә","n. 冒险, 冒险经历\\nv. 冒险",["I remember last summer's adventure.","He has an innate love of adventure."],["我记得去年夏天的历险。","他天生热爱冒险。"]],["stair","stєә","n. 梯级, 楼梯, 阶梯",["As I was going up the stair // I met a man who wasn't there // He wasn't there again today // I wish that man would go away.","After the accident, he was physically challenged by even a single stair."],["",""]],["external","ik'stә:nl","n. 外部, 外面\\na. 外部的, 客观的, 表面的",["No external evidence can, at this long distance of time, be produced to prove whether the church fabricated the doctrine called redemption or not.","Save it on the external hard drive."],["經過如此漫長的時間，已不可能提出任何外部證據，來證明教會是否捏造了所謂的「救贖」教義。","把它保存在外接式硬碟。"]],["proof","pru:f","n. 证据, 证明, 试验, 检验, 考验\\na. 不能透入的, 证明用的, 防...的, 耐...的\\nvt. 检验, 试验, 校对, …",["Just as if that was proof that that was correct English.","The sentences \"Let's eat grandpa.\" and \"Let's eat, grandpa.\" are only one proof that punctuation can change a lot."],["就好像那證明了英語是正確的。","\"我們吃爺爺吧。\" 和\"我們吃了吧, 爺爺。\" 這兩個句子可以證明標點符號能讓句子有很大的不同。"]],["confident","'kɒnfidәnt","a. 有信心的, 有把握的",["He does not, in short, write with the candor of a man who is completely confident of his thesis.","People are most angry when they feel they are being mocked. That's why those who are confident in themselves seldom become angry."],["簡單來說，他的文筆並沒有流露出那種對自己的論文充滿信心的人應有的直率和坦誠。","人覺得自己被嘲笑時最易生氣，因此有自信的人往往不易動怒。"]],["headquarters","hed'kwɒ:tәz","n. 总部, 司令部, 总部人员\\n[经] 本部, 总部, 总署",["There was a different kind of atmosphere in the headquarters.","In this next slide we see an aerial shot of the company headquarters."],["总部里有另外一种气氛。",""]],["sudden","'sʌdn","n. 突然, 忽然\\na. 突然的, 意外的, 快速的",["All of a sudden, three dogs appeared in front of us.","Jack stopped talking all of a sudden when Mary went into the room."],["突然之間，三隻狗出現在我們面前。","瑪麗進入了房間，傑克就突然不講話了。"]],["dirty","'dә:ti","a. 肮脏的, 卑鄙的\\nvt. 弄脏\\nvi. 变脏",["They shone like stars in the dark, dirty building.","It seems that the policeman in this TV series is a dirty cop who abuses his authority."],["在又黑又髒的大廈裏，它們就像星星一樣地閃耀著。","這套電視劇裏的驚察似乎是個濫用職權的壞蛋。"]],["violation",".vaiә'leiʃәn","n. 违反, 违背, 妨碍\\n[法] 违犯, 违背, 违反",["Fadil was arrested and convicted of a weapon-related violation.","I was fined six thousand yen for a parking violation."],["",""]],["tongue","tʌŋ","n. 舌, 语言能力, 讲话方式, 语言\\nvt. 舔, 斥责, 发...的音\\nvi. 使用舌头, 吹管乐器",["Translating helps us to know our mother tongue better.","A slip of the tongue often brings about unexpected results."],["翻译帮助我们更好地了解自己的母语。","一時失言常常會帶來意想不到的結果。"]],["license","'laisns","n. 执照, 许可证, 特许\\nvt. 许可, 特许",["I think you'll have very little difficulty in getting a driver's license.","I learned to drive a car when I was eighteen and got a driver's license."],["我想您要拿到驾照根本不难。","我十八歲時，學了開車、考到了駕照。"]],["shelter","'ʃeltә","n. 庇护所, 避难所, 庇护, 隐蔽处, 掩蔽\\nvt. 庇护, 保护, 隐匿\\nvi. 躲避",["To escape the storm, we took shelter in a nearby barn.","Studies show that once the basic needs of shelter and food are met, additional wealth adds very little to happiness."],["为躲避风暴，我们躲到了附近的一个谷仓内。","研究表明人们一有住处、食物这些基本的需要，附加的财富就不能大量地提高他们的快乐。"]],["rub","rʌb","n. 摩擦, 困难, 障碍, 磨损处\\nvt. 擦, 搓, 摩擦, 惹怒\\nvi. 摩擦, 擦破",["Never rub your eyes when your hands are dirty.","Never rub your eyes with dirty hands."],["手髒的時候千萬不要揉眼睛。","手髒的時候千萬不要揉眼睛。"]],["controversy","'kɒntrәvә:si","n. 论争, 辩论, 论战, 争论\\n[法] 论战, 争论, 争吵",["Let's take advantage of the 'exemption' controversy to reconsider the way we work.","In spite of the controversy it aroused, the question still remains open."],["",""]],["entrance","'entrәns","n. 入口, 进入点, 入场, 入学, 进入, 开始(阶段), 就任\\nvt. 使出神, 使入迷\\n[计] 入口",["Please wait for me at the entrance of the building.","Because the entrance was locked, we couldn't enter the house."],["请在建筑的入口处等我。","由于大门锁着，我们无法入屋。"]],["properly","'prɒpәli","adv. 适当地, 相当地",["An idea not properly analyzed is not worth exploiting, just as a life without self-judgment is not worth living.","Musical talent can be developed if it's properly trained."],["没有经过仔细审视的观念是不值得拥有的，正如没有经过仔细审视的生活不值得过一样。","如果训练得当的话，音乐才能是可以培养出来的。"]],["defensive","di'fensiv","a. 防卫的, 防备用的, 自卫的\\nn. 守势, 防卫姿势, 防卫物",["Tom practices defensive programming to prevent bugs.","You don't need to be so defensive. We know you're not involved in the murder."],["",""]],["fade","feid","vi. 褪色, 消失, 凋谢\\nvt. 使褪色\\nn. 淡入, 淡出\\na. 平淡的",["The colour of the bedlinen is a bit loud, but it'll fade in the wash.","The tans will fade, but the memories will last forever."],["",""]],["tragedy","'trædʒidi","n. 悲剧, 惨案, 悲剧作品\\n[法] 惨事, 灾难, 不辛",["A single death is a tragedy, a million deaths is a statistic.","As the saying goes: As long as you don't offend me, I won't offend you. But there's another saying: To strike first means victory, to strike second means tragedy."],["死一个人是悲剧；死上万人是数据。","俗話說：人不犯我，我不犯人；可俗話又說：先下手為強，後下手遭殃!"]],["net","net","n. 网, 网状物, 罗网, 净利, 净价\\na. 净的, 最终的\\nvt. 用网捕, 撒网, 净赚, 得到\\nvi. 编网\\n[计] 网…",["The hunters captured the wild animal with a strong rope net.","Ronaldo shot the ball right into the back of the net to score the winning goal."],["獵人們用堅韌的繩網把野生動物捉住了。","罗纳尔多一脚射门，打进制胜一球。"]],["funeral","'fju:nәrәl","n. 葬礼, 出殡",["At lunchtime today, our usual restaurant was closed because of a funeral in the family.","Tom's funeral will be this weekend."],["今天午餐時間，我們常去的飯館關門了，因為他們家在辦喪事。","湯姆的葬禮訂在這週末。"]],["profession","prә'feʃәn","n. 职业, 表白, 声明\\n[化] 工种; 职业",["The \"family manager\" is a profession, occupation, vocation.","Teaching is a profession of my own choosing."],["“一家之主”是一份专业工作、事业和使命。","教书是我自己选择的职业。"]],["constitute","kәn'stitjut","vt. 构成, 组成, 任命\\n[建] 构造, 组成",["These things constitute a balanced meal.","Thou shalt respect all weaknesses, and shalt constitute thyself the defender of them."],["这些东西构成了一顿营养均衡的饭。",""]],["alter","'ɒ:ltә","v. 改变",["It is not clear whether Lander intended to alter Emmet's style from the beginning.","If you alter the plan, you must inform the team members of the changes."],["",""]],["establishment","i'stæbliʃmәnt","n. 确立, 制定, 设施\\n[经] 企业, 公司, 商店",["The reformers were subject to every attack from the Establishment.","Commercial relations between the two nations had started prior to the establishment of diplomatic relations."],["",""]],["squeeze","skwi:z","n. 紧握, 挤, 榨, 榨取, 佣金\\nvt. 紧握, 挤, 榨取\\nvi. 压榨, 榨",["The bank rate cut is expected to relieve the severe financial squeeze that has hit industry.","I'll squeeze lemons all afternoon if it's necessary."],["",""]],["imagination","i.mædʒi'neiʃәn","n. 想像, 听觉, 想像力\\n[医] 想像",["No man has the imagination required to grasp female reason, which is why it is called unreasonable.","A man touched down on the moon. A wall came down in Berlin. A world was connected by our own science and imagination."],["没有男人有能把控住女性理性的想象力，这就是为什么它被说无理。","人类登上月球、柏林墙倒下，世界被我们的科学和想像被连接在一起。"]],["mask","mæsk","n. 面具, 假面具, 掩饰, 石膏面模\\nvt. 戴面具, 掩饰, 使模糊\\nvi. 化装, 戴面具, 掩饰, 参加化装舞会\\n[计] …",["He wore a mask so that no one could recognize him.","He's taken off his mask, torn off his costume. There's no doubt now about what the far-right candidate intends."],["他戴著面具以至於沒有人認出他。","他摘下了面具，卸下了偽裝。極右翼候選人的意圖已昭然若揭。"]],["convert","kәn'vә:t","n. 皈依者, 改变宗教信仰者\\nvt. 使改变信仰, 转换, 兑换, 倒置\\nvi. 皈依\\n[计] 转换",["The cells have the capacity to convert food into energy.","He is a recent convert to Catholicism."],["細胞具有將食物轉化為能量的能力。","他新近皈依的天主教徒。"]],["comprehensive",".kɒmpri'hensiv","a. 广泛的, 有理解力的, 综合的\\n[经] 广泛的, 综合的, 全面的",["The service is also part of a comprehensive subscription plan, allowing users to choose the pricing and features that best fit individual and family needs.","This is a representative, not a comprehensive, list of various types of vaccines."],["此服務亦包含於綜合訂閱方案中，使用者可依個人或家庭方案選擇適合的價格與內容。",""]],["prominent","'prɒminәnt","a. 卓越的, 显著的, 突出的, 凸出的",["Prominent figures in the literary world gathered together last night.","The prominent psychologist resembles my uncle in appearance."],["知名文学界人士昨晚齐聚一堂。",""]],["presentation",".prezәn'teiʃәn","n. 赠与, 描述, 介绍\\n[计] 简报",["I'll keep the tips you shared for improving my presentation skills.","Please give us a 20-30 min. time slot for our presentation."],["你對提升我演講能力的建議，我會記下來。",""]],["regardless","ri'gɑ:dlis","a. 不管, 不注意, 不顾",["He says what he thinks regardless of other people's feelings.","Those fated to meet will do so regardless of distance. Those not fated will not, even if they are across from one another."],["他說話從來不理別人的感受。","有缘千里来相会，无缘对面不相逢。"]],["load","lәud","n. 负荷, 担子, 重担, 装载量, 负载, 工作量, 加载\\nvt. 装载, 装填, 使担负\\nvi. 装货, 上客, 装料\\n[计]…",["The load of the truck was in excess of three tons.","This truck has a maximum load of 5 tons."],["貨車的載貨量超過了三噸。","这辆卡车最大的载重量是5吨。"]],["stable","'steibl","n. 马房, 牛棚\\na. 稳定的, 安定的, 坚固的, 坚定的\\nvt. 赶入马房\\nvi. 被关在马厩",["According to the latest census, the language's number of speakers appears to be stable, or even increasing.","He is a man of strong, stable and trustworthy character."],["根据最新的人口普查，语言的发言人人数好像稳定，或者是甚至在上升。","他是個性格強、穩定且可靠的男人。"]],["introduction",".intrә'dʌkʃәn","n. 介绍, 传入, 采用, 初步",["Mr Gilmore is so well known as to need no introduction.","I came to work here though his introduction."],["Gilmore先生如此有名，就不必介绍了。","通过他的介绍，我来到这里工作。"]],["pretend","pri'tend","v. 假装, 伪称, 自命, 自称",["There's no need to pretend you don't speak French.","There's no need to pretend anymore."],["你沒必要假裝你不會講法語。","已经不需要再伪装了。"]],["elderly","'eldәli","a. 过了中年的, 稍老的",["It can make some people, especially the elderly and infants, very ill.","An elderly person in the street fell and broke a leg."],["它可以使一些人，尤其是老人和婴幼儿，病得很重。","一位老人在街上摔斷了腿。"]],["representation",".reprizen'teiʃәn","n. 表示法, 表现, 陈述, 代表\\n[计] 表示法指定",["In its graphical representation, the normal distribution is a bell-shaped curve, with the value growing as one moves closer to the middle and decreasing as one moves away.","This painting is a representation of a storm at sea."],["在图形上，正态分布是一种钟形曲线，越接近中心，取值越大，越远离中心，取值越小。",""]],["violate","'vaiәleit","vt. 违犯, 亵渎, 违反, 侵犯, 妨碍\\n[经] 违犯, 违反",["These factories violate multiple health regulations.","Algerian Arabs veil their sisters but violate and beat women who are not veiled."],["",""]],["split","split","n. 劈开, 裂片, 裂缝, 分裂, 派系, 派别, 柳条\\na. 劈开的\\nvi. 分离, 分开, 裂开, 被劈开\\nvt. 劈开, 切…",["Alrighty kids! So for this art project, all of you guys will split into groups of 3 - 5 people.","\"Didn't you get married!?\" \"Oh, we split up. We broke our engagement.\""],["好了孩子们！所以为了这个美术计划，你们所有人都将被分离并加入3-5人的小组","\"你沒結婚吧!?\" \"哦，我們分手了。我們解除婚約了。\""]],["deer","diә","n. 鹿",["It's been said that one should not smell deer musk when pregnant.","The deer is three times as heavy as Jane."],["據說懷孕的時候不能聞麝香。","鹿是简的三倍重。"]],["partnership","'pɑ:tnәʃip","n. 合伙, 合股, 合作关系\\n[经] 合伙(合作)关系, 全体合伙人",["This opportunity for success in forming a partnership is a big one; the key lies in whether you are willing to work hard and invest in it, and that is all.","We have reached a partnership agreement."],["這個合夥事業成功的機會是很大的,關鍵就在於妳是否願意努力、付出而已。","我们达成了合伙协议。"]],["pollution","pә'lu:ʃәn","n. 污染, 玷污\\n[化] 污染",["Because of the problem of air pollution, the bicycle may some day replace the automobile.","Environmental pollution is causing abnormal weather conditions."],["因為空氣汙染的問題，也許有一天自行車會取代汽車。","環境污染正造成異常的天氣情況。"]],["steady","'stedi","a. 稳定的, 不动摇的, 沉着的, 稳固的, 坚定的, 经常的\\nvt. 使稳定, 使坚定\\nvi. 变为沉着, 稳固",["The immigrants entered the country in a steady flow.","There was a steady increase in population."],["移民川流不息地进入这个国家。","人口穩定地增加。"]],["emission","i'miʃәn","n. 发射, 射出, 发行\\n[医] 发射, 遗精",["Saving energy can reduce the emission of greenhouse gases into the atmosphere.","Positron Emission Tomography uses a radioactive tracer to visualize metabolic activity within the human body."],["節約能源可減少溫室氣體排出到大氣層。",""]],["vital","'vaitl","a. 生命的, 重要的, 充满活力的, 生死攸关的, 致命的\\n[医] 生命的, 生活的, 生活上必需的, 紧要的",["The elevators in a skyscraper are vital systems.","Products made from petroleum are vital to modern societies."],["摩天大厦里的电梯是至关重要的。",""]],["earnings","'ә:niŋ","n. 所赚的钱, 工资, 收入\\n[经] 工资, 收入, 收益, 盈余",["Corporate earnings in the first quarter improved sharply.","His parents' view was that he was wasting his earnings on a silly girl."],["企业第一季度收益大幅增长。",""]],["fate","feit","n. 命运, 运气\\nvt. 注定",["I would rather kill myself than reconcile myself to my fate.","I walked without hope, already resigned to the certain fate of being abandoned forever."],["与其向命运妥协，我宁可自杀。","我毫无希望地走着，已经屈服在永远被抛弃的命运之下。"]],["oven","'ʌvәn","n. 烤箱, 灶, 子宫\\n[化] 烘箱",["Mary tied an apron around her waist and then took the turkey out of the oven.","I forgot to tell Tom to take the cookies out of the oven."],["玛丽把围裙系在她的腰上，然后把火鸡从烤箱里拿出来了。","我忘了告訴湯姆把餅乾從烤箱拿出來。"]],["distinction","dis'tiŋkʃәn","n. 区别",["He makes no distinction between right and wrong.","There is an obvious distinction between the good and the best."],["他是非不分。",""]],["segment","'segmәnt","n. 片段, 部分, 分节, 段\\nv. 分割, 分裂\\n[计] 段",["Many firms are competing for the wealthier segment of the market.","Last summer, cigarettes from the middle price segment appeared on the market."],["",""]],["poet","'pәuit","n. 诗人",["The poet expressed his burning passion for the woman he loved.","He was an excellent scientist, and what is more, was a great poet."],["詩人對他愛的女人表達了他火熱的激情。","他是一位優秀的科學家，更是一位偉大的詩人。"]],["nowhere","'nәuhwєә","adv. 无处, 到处都无",["At my house, I have nowhere to study - it's too noisy there.","There is nowhere in the whole world without poverty."],["我在自己家中哪裡都不能讀書，那裏太吵了。","全世界沒有一個地方沒有貧窮。"]],["mere","miә","n. 小湖, 池塘\\na. 仅仅的, 只不过的",["I'm not a real fish, I'm just a mere plushy.","Our current crisis is no mere economic crisis."],["我不是一条真的鱼，我只是一个长毛绒玩具。","我們當前的危機絕非單純的經濟危機。"]],["exciting","ik'saitiŋ","a. 令人兴奋的, 刺激的\\n[电] 激磁",["The space race was an exciting time in history.","Cities are exciting places, but also stressful."],["太空竞赛是历史上激动人心的时期。","城市是令人興奮的地方，但也會讓人產生壓力。"]],["variation",".vєәri'eiʃәn","n. 变更, 变化, 变种, 变奏\\n[医] 变异, 变易; 变度",["In our interpretation, the output data in Table 2 is an acceptable variation of that in Table 1.","The reason for this is that we found no variation of those morphemes."],["",""]],["comfort","'kʌmfәt","n. 舒适, 安慰, 安慰者\\nvt. 安慰",["He worked hard in order that his family might live in comfort.","People could not see any hopes of obtaining happiness in this life, thus they instinctively sought comfort in the afterlife."],["他努力工作為了讓他的家人可以過舒適的生活。","人们在此世中看不到任何获得幸福的希望，便很本能地想在彼世中寻求慰藉。"]],["radical","'rædikl","n. 激进分子, 词根, 基础, 根式, 根\\na. 激进的, 根本的, 基本的, 根的",["The radical in the Chinese character for \"good\" is the character for \"woman\".","She has a very radical opinion about the problem."],["“好”的部首是女。","她對於這個問題有很激進的意見。"]],["irish","'airiʃ","n. 爱尔兰人, 爱尔兰语\\na. 爱尔兰的",["Celtic is still present in Irish, Welsh and Scottish Gaelic.","Tom played an old Irish song on his new French horn."],["",""]],["honey","'hʌni","n. 蜂蜜, 甜蜜, 爱人\\na. 蜂蜜似的, 甜蜜的, 甘美的\\nvt. 加蜜使甜, 对...说甜言蜜语\\nvi. 说甜言蜜语, 奉承",["This region's beekeepers produce honey particularly well.","Add the honey, lemon juice, chopped almonds and the chopped apples."],["这个区域的养蜂人产得蜂蜜特别好。","加入蜂蜜、檸檬汁、切碎的杏仁和切碎的蘋果。"]],["adapt","ә'dæpt","vt. 使适应, 改编\\nvi. 适应",["Now is the critical moment. Please stop being so stubborn and inflexible, completely unable to adapt flexibility.","Man has a great capacity to adapt to environmental changes."],["現在正是關鍵的時候了，請不要還那麼死腦筋，絲毫不知權變。","人類適應環境變化的能力很強。"]],["correspondent",".kɒri'spɒndәnt","n. 通讯记者, 通信者\\n[经] 客户, 代理商行, 代理银行",["Martha feels she has married a war correspondent, not a journalist.","The newspaper recalled the special correspondent to the main office in Tokyo."],["",""]],["pale","peil","n. 栅栏, 界线, 范围\\na. 苍白的, 暗淡的, 无力的\\nvi. 变苍白, 变暗, 失色\\nvt. 使变苍白, 使失色, 用栅栏围",["You look pale. You had better lie down in bed at once.","A gleam of real pride quickened most ingenuously in the Older Man's pale blue eyes."],["你看上去很苍白。你最好立刻去床上躺会儿。","老人淡藍色的眼睛閃過一絲真誠的驕傲。"]],["musician","mju:'ziʃәn","n. 音乐家, 乐师, 作曲家",["In her opinion, he is the best musician she has ever seen.","He was destined to become a great musician."],["她認為他是她所見過最好的音樂家。","他命中注定要成為偉大的音樂家。"]],["significance","sig'nifikәns","n. 重要性, 意义, 意味\\n[计] 有效; 有效性",["I don't understand its significance.","It is that Emmet's theory is compatible with previous theories in physics that is of most significance."],["我没有领会这个意义。",""]],["vessel","'vesl","n. 船, 容器, 脉管\\n[医] 管, 脉管, (容)器",["A child is not a vessel for filling, but a fire to light.","The vessel was loaded with coal, lumber, and so on."],["",""]],["storage","'stɒ:ridʒ","n. 存储器, 储藏, 保管, 库存, 仓库\\n[计] 存放处; 存储",["My phone needs to have enough storage for my apps.","The apartment has both a storage room and a balcony."],["我的手機需要足夠存儲空間來下載 App。",""]],["flee","fli:","vt. 逃避, 逃跑, 逃走\\nvi. 逃, 消失",["Never flee from injustice, intolerance, or insanity. Reason must prevail.","We're happy that we're able to flee to the large awning, shielding ourselves from the rays of the harsh sun."],["",""]],["leather","'leðә","n. 皮革, 皮制品, 马镫的皮带\\nvt. 覆以皮革, 鞭苔, 抽打\\na. 皮革的, 皮制的",["Artificial leather can't compare with the real thing.","Tom bought a pair of black leather shoes."],["人造皮革是比不上真皮的。","汤姆买了一双黑色皮鞋。"]],["distribute","di'stribju:t","vt. 分配, 散布, 分发\\n[经] 分配, 分发",["We would like to distribute your product in Japan.","Maybe you should make brochures for Interlingua and distribute them."],["",""]],["ill","il","n. 疾病, 坏事, 罪恶, 灾难\\na. 生病的, 邪恶的, 不吉利的, 敌意的, 不良的, 不顺利的\\nadv. 有害地, 不幸地, …",["I was unable to leave home last Saturday, with my mother being ill.","It is not manly to speak ill of others behind their backs."],["上周六，因为我母亲病了，我无法离开家。","在背后说别人坏话不是大丈夫所为。"]],["evolution",".i:vә'lu:ʃәn","n. 进化, 发展, 进展, (气体)放出, 开方\\n[医] 进化, 演化, 旋出",["We associate Darwin with the theory of evolution.","They opposed Darwin's theory of evolution."],["一提到進化論，我們就會想起達爾文。","他們反對達爾文的進化論。"]],["shelf","ʃelf","n. 架子, 搁板\\n[化] 架子",["Tom reached for a dictionary that was on the very top of the shelf.","He got the book down from the shelf."],["汤姆把手伸向了书架上最高的一本词典。","他從架子上拿下書。"]],["tribe","traib","n. 宗族, 部落, 一群人\\n[医] 族(生物分类)",["Ewondo is the language spoken by the Ewondo tribe of Cameroon.","The Zulu tribe in South Africa has its own language."],["埃翁多语是客麦隆埃翁多部落所说的语言。","南非的祖魯族人有著自己獨特的語言。"]],["grandfather","'grændfɑ:ðә","n. 祖父, 始祖\\n[电] 原始资料组",["My grandfather sometimes talks to himself when he's alone.","My grandfather wants to live quietly for the rest of his life."],["我祖父一个人的时候，有时会自言自语。","我的外公想安静地度过晚年。"]],["lawn","lɒ:n","n. 草地, 草坪, 上等细麻布\\n[机] 细筛",["The Easter Egg Roll is an annual event that is held on the lawn of the White House each Easter Monday.","I'm going to mow the lawn tomorrow, weather permitting."],["复活节滚彩蛋活动每年复活节周一都会在白宫的草地上举行。","如果天氣情況允許的話，我明天就去割草坪。"]],["dining","'dainiŋ","n. 正餐, 宴会",["At around 12pm, we go to the dining area of our unit for lunch.","It's too bad the college dining hall doesn't have fig cookies."],["中午十二点左右，到我们单位的饭厅去吃午饭。","可惜大学食堂没有无花果饼干。"]],["buyer","'baiә","n. 买主, 买方\\n[经] 买主, 买方, 买手",["I will sell it as soon as I find a buyer.","Bear in mind that, under such circumstances, we have no alternative but to find another buyer."],["我一找到買家就會把它賣掉。",""]],["wisdom","'wizdәm","n. 智慧, 明智行为, 学识, 名言, 贤人",["It requires wisdom to understand wisdom: the music is nothing if the audience is deaf.","Only with wisdom can one distinguish between good and evil; only with humility can one build a happy life."],["要用智慧来理解智慧：如果听众是聋的话，那音乐什么都不是。","有智慧才能分辨善惡邪正；有謙虛才能建立美滿人生。"]],["vulnerable","'vʌlnәrәbl","a. 易受伤害的, 有弱点的, 易受影响的, 脆弱的, 成局的\\n[医] 易损的",["Because of a flaw in the original design, our website is vulnerable to SQL injection attacks.","There is an whole industry based entirely on preying upon financially vulnerable individuals."],["由于最初设计中的一个缺陷，我们的网站易受到SQL注入攻击。",""]],["garlic","'gɑ:lik","n. 大蒜\\n[化] 大蒜",["Slice the kale, and add it to a pan, with olive oil, garlic, salt and pepper, and wait until it is soft and tasty.","I like garlic but, because of the smell, I rarely eat it."],["將羽衣甘藍切片，放入鍋中，加入橄欖油、大蒜、鹽和胡椒，煮至軟嫩可口。","雖然我喜歡大蒜，但因為很臭，所以很少吃。"]],["instance","'instәns","n. 建议, 情况, 例子, 场合\\nvt. 引以为例, 举例说明",["Japan is full of beautiful cities. Kyoto and Nara, for instance.","For instance, bowing is peculiar to us, the Japanese."],["",""]],["capability",".keipә'biliti","n. 能力, 性能, 约束力\\n[化] 能力",["My classmate, Xiao Ming, has strong managerial capability.","Tom lacks the capability of imagining himself in someone else's situation."],["小明同学管理能力很强。",""]],["poetry","'pәuitri","n. 诗, 韵文, 诗歌艺术",["They referred to Chaucer as the father of English poetry.","Li Bai's work is the most famous of Chinese poetry."],["他們視喬叟為英詩之父。","中国诗歌以李白的诗最为有名。"]],["celebrity","si'lebrti","n. 名声, 名人",["On encountering the celebrity, the fans asked for his autograph.","On encountering the celebrity, they asked for his autograph."],["",""]],["gradually","'grædʒuәli","adv. 逐渐地",["To be honest, I've gradually come to dislike the life here.","The transition from hardware to software happened gradually."],["老實說, 我已經漸漸地不喜歡這裡的生活。","由硬體到軟體的轉變是緩慢的。"]],["stability","stә'biliti","n. 安定, 稳定性, 坚实, 巩固\\n[化] 稳定性",["Rigid wheels give sufficient stability to a low-speed vehicle steered by outside forces.","We need peace and stability first and foremost - these are the most important things."],["",""]],["fantasy","'fæntәsi","n. 幻想, 想象的产物\\n[医] 幻想",["Mathematicians are poets, except that they have to prove what their fantasy creates.","Reality and fantasy are hard to distinguish."],["數學家是詩人，不過他們必須也能證明他們想像力的果實。","現實和幻想是很難區分的。"]],["scared","skeәd","a. 害怕的, 担惊受怕的, 惊慌的, 吓坏了的",["If a tiger suddenly appeared in front of me, I'd be scared to death.","At first there will be many unrecognized words and grammatical forms, but don't be scared."],["如果一只老虎突然出现在我面前，我肯定吓死了。","一开始会有很多不认识的单词和语法形式，但是不要害怕。"]],["plot","plɒt","n. 小块土地, 地区图, 图, 阴谋, 情节\\nvt. 划分, 绘图, 密谋\\nvi. 密谋, 策划\\n[计] 绘制",["They accused him of being part of the plot.","The plot to assassinate the president was discovered just in time."],["人們指控他參與了這場陰謀。",""]],["framework","'freimwә:k","n. 结构, 骨架, 参照标准, 准则, 观点\\n[医] 构架组织",["We need to keep Algeria within the socialist framework.","The whole framework was made of iron."],["我們需要讓阿爾及利亞保持在社會主義框架內。","整個框架由鐵金屬製成。"]],["gesture","'dʒestʃә","n. 手势, 姿态\\nvi. 作手势, 作姿态",["They communicate with each other by gesture.","She gave me a hand gesture I didn't understand."],["她們用手勢溝通。","她给我打了一个看不懂的手势。"]],["ongoing","'ɒngәuiŋ","a. 前进的, 进行的, 不间断的\\nn. 前进, 发展",["United States shale gas production is one of the worst ongoing ecological disasters.","Two global studies in children with hemophilia A are ongoing."],["",""]],["depending","","[计] 依赖",["Some foreign words and names are not declined in Russian, usually depending on the ending and gender.","People look at things differently depending on whether they are rich or poor."],["有些外來語和人名在俄語中沒有變格，通常取決於詞尾和性別。","人們看待事情的角度不同取決於他們是富裕或貧窮。"]],["psychology","sai'kɒlәdʒi","n. 心理学, 心理状态\\n[医] 心理学",["At that time, the two main schools of thought in psychology were behaviourism and psychoanalysis.","Psycho-horror films dealing with the mysteries of human psychology are popular these days."],["在那个年代，心理学的两个主要学派是行为主义学派与精神分析学派。","這幾年有關心理之謎的心理恐怖片很熱門。"]],["counselor","'kaunsәlә","n. 顾问, 参事, 法律顾问",["Sami and Layla decided to see a couples counselor.","Tom and Mary have decided to go to a marriage counselor."],["",""]],["chapter","'tʃæptә","n. 章, 篇, 重要章节\\n[计] 章; 段",["Let's begin with the first chapter.","This chapter is the heart of the novel."],["從第一章開始吧。","這個章節是這部小說的核心。"]],["divorce","di'vɒ:s","n. 离婚\\nvt. 与...离婚",["I've heard that Mary wants a divorce.","I can't imagine ever getting a divorce."],["我聽說瑪麗想離婚。","我完全无法想象自己会离婚。"]],["owe","әu","vt. 亏欠, 负...债, 归功于, 怀有, 应给予, 感恩\\nvi. 欠钱",["I still owe my brother the ten dollars that he lent me last week.","I owe it you that I am still alive."],["上個星期弟弟借了十元給我，我現在還沒還給他。","多亏了你，我还活着。"]],["pipe","paip","n. 管, 导管, 输送管, 管状器官, 声带, 尖细的声音, 烟斗, 笛, 管乐器\\nvt. 以管输送, 吹哨子, 吹奏, 尖声唱\\nv…",["A guy I met in my physics class made a didgeridoo out of PVC pipe.","Grandfather talked to me with a pipe in his mouth."],["我在物理課遇到一個傢伙用PVC管做了迪吉里杜管。","爷爷叼着烟管跟我说话。"]],["athletic","æθ'letik","a. 运动的",["The boy put on his athletic shoes and ran outside.","Jane had her hair cut short before the athletic meet."],["那个男孩穿上了他的运动鞋，跑向外面。","Jane在运动会之前把头发剃短了。"]],["slight","slait","n. 轻蔑, 怠慢\\na. 轻微的, 纤细的, 脆弱的, 苗条的\\nvt. 轻视, 忽略, 怠慢",["A slight cold prevented me from going to Ibusuki with my family.","Would you mind if I shut the window? I have a slight cold."],["我有点感冒，没能和家人一起去指宿。","你不介意我关窗吧？我有点着凉了。"]],["math","mæθ","n. 数学",["Math is like love: a simple idea, but it can get complicated.","He is already skilled in both math and literature."],["数学就像爱情，一个简单的意思，但可以变得很复杂。","他既精于数学又精于文学。"]],["shade","ʃeid","n. 荫, 阴暗, 遮光物, 灯罩, 帘, 浓淡, 微量, 底纹\\nvi. 渐变\\nvt. 使阴暗, 使渐变, 遮蔽, 微减\\n[计] 底纹",["She was closely related to the mighty Queen Zurline, and her home was beneath the shade of a widespreading oak.","There's no light without shade, and no shade without light."],["她與強大的祖琳女王有著密切的血緣關係，她的家在一棵枝繁葉茂的橡樹蔭下。","不存在没有阴影的光明，也不存在没有光明的阴影。"]],["tail","teil","n. 尾部, 后部, 辫子, 随员, 特务, 燕尾服, 踪迹, 限定继承(权)\\na. 在后面的, 从后面而来的, 限定继承的, 尾部的,…",["The moment Pip saw its owner come home, it excitedly wagged its tail.","Better be the head of a cat than the tail of a lion."],["皮皮一看到主人回家，就興奮地搖尾巴。","寧為貓頭不為獅尾。"]],["sustain","sә'stein","vt. 承受, 支持, 供养, 继续, 忍受, 蒙受, 证实, 准许\\n[电] 持续",["The bridge couldn't sustain the force of the strong current and collapsed.","Algeria needs to sustain a better level of growth."],["",""]],["mount","maunt","n. 乘骑用马, 框, 衬纸, 山\\nvi. 乘马, 爬上, 增长\\nvt. 爬上, 使上马, 装上, 装裱, 安放, 制作...的标本,…",["Though I am in the tiger's mouth, I am as calm as Mount Tai.","In clear weather one can see Mount Fuji from here."],["我虽然在虎口里，却是安如泰山。","在晴朗的日子裡，可以從這看見富士山。"]],["obligation",".ɒbli'geiʃәn","n. 义务, 责任, 约束, 契约, 恩惠, 债务\\n[经] 待付款, 债务, 义务",["Every player is under obligation to keep the rules.","I actually don't have an obligation to help you."],["每一位選手都有義務遵守規則。","我并没有义务帮助你。"]],["angle","'æŋgl","n. 角, 角度, 角落\\nvi. 钓鱼, 谋取, 博取, 斜向移动, 转变角度\\nvt. 使转动角度, 在...钓鱼, 获取",["The dot product of two vectors can be expressed as a function of their lengths and the angle between them.","An angle of 90 degrees is called a right angle."],["兩個向量的點積可以表示為其長度與兩者夾角的函數。","90度的角叫直角。"]],["differ","'difә","vi. 不一致, 不同\\n[机] 差异, 不同",["Different variants of Shanghainese differ greatly with each other.","The north and south differ greatly from each other."],["吴语的方言差异很大。","南方和北方的差异很大。"]],["palm","pɑ:m","n. 手掌, 棕榈, 胜利\\nvt. 与...握手, 藏...于掌中",["Palm oil production is the leading cause of deforestation in Indonesia.","Ziri showed Rima how to properly prune her palm trees."],["棕榈油制造是导致印度尼西亚森林砍伐的主要原因。","齊里向里瑪示範如何正確修剪棕櫚樹。"]],["custom","'kʌstәm","n. 习惯, 风俗, 海关, 自定义\\na. 定制的\\n[计] 定制; 自定义",["As was the custom in those days, he married young.","According to custom, the bride should be compliant."],["如當時的習慣，他很年輕便成婚了。","根据习俗，新娘应该循规蹈矩。"]],["economist","i:'kɒnәmist","n. 经济学者, 经济家\\n[经] 经济学家",["The economist and statistician based in Ivory Coast says commercial trade in the region is primarily conducted with France.","Karl Marx, a German philosopher and economist, said: Religion is the opium of the people."],["這位常駐科特迪瓦的經濟學家兼統計學家表示，該地區的商業貿易主要與法國進行。",""]],["fifteen","'fif'ti:n","num. 十五, 十五个",["Chestnuts have to be boiled for at least fifteen minutes.","Unfortunately, by the time we got there the train had been gone for fifteen minutes."],["栗子至少要煮15分钟。","可惜，我们来到的时候，火车已经十五分钟以前走了。"]],["celebration",".seli'breiʃәn","n. 庆祝, 庆典",["I feel a little guilty that I didn't invite him to join the celebration.","Mr Philips, along with some friends and neighbors, is planning a celebration."],["我没请他来参加庆祝会，感到有点内疚。",""]],["soup","su:p","n. 汤, 马力\\nvt. 加速, 增加马力",["I could eat some beef noodle soup, or some reheated rice with soybean paste like that, no problem.","In this soup there are carrots, onions, parsley, celery and potatoes."],["我可以不慌不忙吃牛奶面包鸡蛋，或者泡饭酱菜。","這個湯裏有胡蘿蔔、洋蔥、歐芹、芹菜和土豆。"]],["efficient","i'fiʃәnt","a. 有效率的, 能干的",["As people get older, their brain cells become less efficient.","These students work hard, but it's not that much efficient."],["隨著人們年齡的增長，其腦細胞就變得比較沒有效率。","这些学生很努力，但效率不太高。"]],["composition","kɒmpә'ziʃәn","n. 作文, 创作, 组成\\n[化] 成分; 组成",["I wish someone would help me with English composition.","Errors are few, if any, in his English composition."],["我希望有人能教我英语作文。","他的英文作文沒有甚麼錯處。"]],["satisfy","'sætisfai","vt. 使满意, 满足, 符合, 使确信, 赔偿\\nvi. 令人满意, 替人赎罪",["The trigonometric functions satisfy a wide array of notable algebraic identities.","I am sorry, we are unable to satisfy your demand."],["三角函數滿足各種代數恆等式。","对不起，我们无法满足您的要求。"]],["briefly","'brifli","adv. 简短地, 扼要地, 简明地, 简单地",["She glanced briefly at the newspaper.","Briefly stated, Hobsbawm's thesis is that the history of the twentieth century is that of the decline of civilization."],["她很快地瞟了一眼報紙。",""]],["pile","pail","n. 堆, 大堆, 大厦, 建筑群, 电池, 大量, 桥桩, 软毛, 痔疮\\nvi. 堆起, 堆积, 积累, 挤, 猛烈攻击\\nvt. 堆…",["There were some graphic novels mixed into the pile of specialty books on the desk.","I haven't had time to do the dishes for two days; they are in a pile in the kitchen sink."],["书桌上一叠专业书里有几本卡通书混在里面。","這兩天我沒時間洗碗，現在廚房的洗碗槽裏已經堆滿了碗碗碟碟。"]],["carbon","'kɑ:bәn","n. 碳, 副本, 复写纸\\n[化] 碳",["It is a term used to describe the warming of the earth due to increasing amounts of carbon dioxide in the atmosphere.","Carbon dioxide is a gas that is produced every time a fuel such as coal, oil, or natural gas is burned."],["这个词指的是由于大气层里二氧化碳含量增多而导致全球变暖。","二氧化碳是燃燒煤、石油或天然氣這樣的燃料時會產生的氣體。"]],["closer","'klәuzә","n. 关闭者, 闭合器, 关闭器",["Citizens of higher social status were permitted to live closer to the center.","Spoken language is closer to life than written language."],["社會地位較高的公民被允許住在較靠近市中心的地方。","口语比书面语更贴近生活。"]],["consume","kәn'sju:m","vt. 消耗, 消费, 消灭\\nvi. 耗尽, 毁灭",["Zeal for your house will consume me.","The Swiss consume a large amount of beer."],["我為你的殿，心裡焦急，如同火燒。","瑞士人消耗不少啤酒。"]],["scheme","ski:m","n. 方案, 计划, 组合, 系统, 图解, 诡计, 阴谋\\nv. 计划, 设计, 图谋, 策划",["Your help is indispensable for the success of the scheme.","He carried out the scheme faithfully."],["沒有你幫忙，計劃就不能成功了。","他忠实地实行了该计划。"]],["crack","kræk","n. 裂缝, 爆裂声\\nv. (使)爆裂, (使)裂开, (使)发出爆裂声\\na. 第一流的\\nadv. 啪地一声",["There was a crack in my tennis racket, so I sent it out to be repaired.","The chip in Yanni's windshield became a huge crack."],["我的网球拍裂了，所以我把它拿去修了。","雅尼的擋風玻璃上的碎片變成了一條巨大的裂縫。"]],["frequency","'fri:kwәnsi","n. 频率, 频数\\n[计] 频率",["The recent frequency of earthquakes makes us nervous.","Increases in the frequency and intensity of extreme precipitation events are projected for all U.S. regions."],["最近频繁的地震让我们很焦虑。",""]],["tobacco","tә'bækәu","n. 烟草, 香烟\\n[医] 烟草",["For thy sake, tobacco, I would do anything but die.","We carry out treatments like whitening. We also do tobacco stain removal and other cleaning procedures."],["",""]],["survivor","sә'vaivә","n. 生还者, 幸存者\\n[法] 生还者, 生存者, 辛存者",["He's the only survivor in the village.","The accident's only survivor was a baby."],["他是村子里面唯一在世的人。","这场灾难的唯一幸存者是一个婴儿。"]],["besides","bi'saidz","prep. 除...之外\\nadv. 而且, 此外",["Besides being an actress, she was a famous painter.","There was no one in the room besides Tom and Mary."],["她不但是一个演员，她还曾是一个著名的画家。","除了汤姆和玛丽，房间里没有人。"]],["psychologist","sai'kɒlәdʒist","n. 心理学家\\n[医] 心理学家",["To my surprise, the noted psychologist was accused of a kidnapping.","The prominent psychologist resembles my uncle in appearance."],["",""]],["wealthy","'welθi","a. 富有的, 丰裕的, 充分的",["He can't be very wealthy, judging from his salary.","If it had not been for civil war, they would be wealthy now."],["以他的薪水不会很富裕。","要不是当初有内战，他们现在应该挺富裕了。"]],["galaxy","'gælәksi","n. 银河, 星系, 一群(显赫的人物)\\n[电] 银河系",["Astronomers have discovered a galaxy that has almost no dark matter.","Out in the furthest reaches of the galaxy there are a bunch of stars named after dead actors."],["天文學家們發現了一個幾乎沒有暗物質的星系。",""]],["given","'givәn","a. 赠予的, 沉溺的, 约定的\\ngive的过去分词",["The proliferation of Internet usage has given birth to a new generation of young people.","My father has already given up smoking and drinking."],["互联网的广泛应用使新一代的年轻人诞生了。","我爸爸已经戒烟戒酒了。"]],["limitation",".limi'teiʃәn","n. 限制, 缺陷, 限额\\n[医] 限界, 限制, 限度",["Everyone has the right to rest and leisure, including reasonable limitation of working hours and periodic holidays with pay.","Religion is the outcome of human weakness or the limitation of human knowledge."],["",""]],["trace","treis","n. 痕迹, 踪迹, 微量, 迹线, 缰绳\\nvt. 追踪, 回溯, 描绘\\nvi. 追溯, 沿路走",["Miss Wang has a trace of obstinacy in her, but she is still a good student.","Sometimes I will lose the context of my speech in an instant, as if a sudden gust of wind blows away the music score being played without leaving a trace."],["王小姐有一点固执，但是她还算是一个好学生。","有时我会在一瞬间忽然迷失说话的脉络，像是忽然刮来一阵狂风，将正在演奏的乐谱吹得无影无踪。"]],["appointment","ә'pɒintmәnt","n. 约会, 委任的职位, 委派\\n[经] 任命, 派, 指定",["Sorry, but I have to go now. I have an appointment in one hour. Please don't forget to call me back when I get home.","Hi, I have an appointment with the general manager. This is my interview notice."],["不好意思，我先走了。我一个小时后有约会。我回家后，请别忘了打回给我。","您好，我跟總經理有約十點見面，這是我的面試通知。"]],["preference","'prefәrәns","n. 偏爱, 优先, 喜爱物\\n[计] 首选项",["Fascists are enabled by liberals' preference for abstractions over people.","Despite my parents' preference, I have decided to attend an out-of-state college on my own volition."],["",""]],["explosion","ik'splәuʒәn","n. 爆发, 激增, 爆炸(声)\\n[化] 爆炸",["Yesterday, an explosion occurred at the fireworks factory.","The explosion may have been caused by a gas leak."],["昨晚，烟花厂发生了爆炸。","這場爆炸有可能是瓦斯外洩引起的。"]],["meter","'mi:tә","n. 米, 公尺, 仪表, 计量器\\nvt. 以仪表计量",["Rhyme and meter form the essential rules of Chinese poetry.","The penis of a dwarf elephant can reach the half meter in length."],["",""]],["incredible","in'kredәbl","a. 难以置信的",["My writing desk, a place of dread: an incredible number of incredibly useful drawers - combined with incredibly little legspace.","It's incredible that your mother speaks six languages!"],["我的書桌很嚇人：那麼多那麼有用抽屜，放在那麼小、剛夠伸腿的地方。","你母亲说六种语言真是让人难以置信！"]],["publicly","'pʌblikli","adv. 公然地, 以公众名义",["Then they displayed all the book titles publicly and banned their sale forever.","Publicly express your love for someone."],["然後又把各書名揭示通衢，永遠禁止販賣。","公开表示你对某人的爱。"]],["fighter","'faitә","n. 斗士, 战士, 好战者, 战斗机",["One man's terrorist is another man's freedom fighter.","With only a single drop of poison, the well-known fighter was defeated."],["一个人的恐怖分子为另人的自由战士。",""]],["rapid","'ræpid","a. 迅速的, 飞快的, 急促的, 陡的\\nn. 急流",["The development of the computer industry has been very rapid.","It must be dangerous to swim in this rapid stream."],["電腦產業的發展一日千里。","在這麼急的急流裏游泳，一定會很危險的。"]],["hunter","'hʌntә","n. 猎人, 猎犬, 追求者",["In his lectures, Professor Hunter prefers to study the blackboard rather than look at his students.","The hunter followed the bear tracks."],["亨特教授在講課時更喜歡盯著黑板看，而不是看學生。","獵人跟著熊的蹤跡。"]],["admission","әd'miʃәn","n. 准许进入, 入场费, 录用, 承认\\n[经] 加入, 入股",["There is no admission fee for children under five.","He made an admission that he had lied."],["五岁以下的小孩票价全免。","他承认他撒谎了。"]],["ski","ski:","n. 滑雪橇\\nvi. 滑雪",["Roy practiced very hard to get his ski instructor's license.","He was able to ski down the slope in three minutes."],["",""]],["educate","'edjukeit","vt. 教育, 培养, 训练",["In the last analysis, methods don't educate children; people do.","You must educate your tongue to distinguish good coffee from bad."],["",""]],["painful","'peinful","a. 痛苦的, 困难的, 令人烦恼的\\n[医] 疼痛的",["Not being able to eat sweets is an extremely painful thing.","There's nothing more painful than losing one's child."],["不能吃甜食是极其痛苦的事情。","沒有比失去孩子更傷心的事。"]],["aide","eid","n. 助手, 副官\\n[计] 数据输入的可说明性",["An aide told reporters, off the record, that the senator had been lying.","The aide suggested a change in tactics to him."],["",""]],["friendship","'frendʃip","n. 友谊, 友爱, 友善",["As human beings are social animals, friendship is an essential part of life.","So friendship is also a requirement for happiness."],["因为人类是一种群居动物，所以友情是生活里面一个必要的方面。","所以，友情也是幸福的一个要素。"]],["infant","'infәnt","n. 婴儿, 儿童, 初学者\\na. 婴儿的, 幼稚的",["Not far away, screened by the forest, crouched Shiegra, the lioness, intent upon devouring the infant for her evening meal.","The young woman was carrying an infant in her arms."],["不遠處，母獅謝格拉匍匐著，隱匿於林間，正伺機將嬰兒吞食，作為她的晚餐。","那個年輕女人手抱著嬰兒。"]],["fifty","'fifti","num. 五十, 五十个",["Fifty-two per cent of British women prefer chocolate to sex.","This is the hottest summer we have had in fifty years."],["有百分之五十二的英國女性喜歡巧克力勝於性。","這是 50 年來最熱的夏天。"]],["calculate","'kælkjuleit","v. 计算, 预测, 计划, 打算",["I can't calculate the final cost without first discussing it with our contractors.","The application allows you to quickly calculate the ratio of body mass index - BMI."],["不先與我們的承包商討論的話我無法計算出最後的費用。","這項應用程序能讓你快速計算身高體重指數（BMI）。"]],["tendency","'tendәnsi","n. 趋向, 倾向\\n[医] 趋向, 趋势",["It seems to me that she has a tendency to exaggerate.","There is a tendency for people to think that hang gliding is dangerous."],["在我看來，她有一種誇張的傾向。","人们普遍认为悬挂式滑翔运动是危险的。"]],["rid","rid","vt. 免除, 以...清除, 使获自由, 使摆脱\\n[法] 免除, 清除, 摆脱",["It's easy to make friends, but hard to get rid of them.","Once you've formed a bad habit, you can't get rid of it easily."],["交朋友很容易, 但擺脫他們很難。","坏习惯一旦被养成，便不能简单地改正。"]],["porch","pɒ:tʃ","n. 门廊, 走廊",["Three men are waiting for you on the porch.","Yanni left the flowers on Skura's porch."],["三个男人在门廊上在等你。","雅尼把花放在了斯庫拉家的門廊上。"]],["uniform","'ju:nifɒ:m","n. 制服\\na. 统一的, 一律的, 始终如一的",["The New York City police wear a dark blue uniform.","Some spaghetti fell on the badge of the uniform, dirtying it."],["紐約警察穿深藍色制服。","有一些意面掉到了制服上的徽章那儿，把那边弄脏了。"]],["scholarship","'skɒlәʃip","n. 学问, 学术成就, 奖学金",["Tom was able to go to college thanks to a scholarship.","Thirty-two Madagascan students who receive scholarship are flying to China."],["因為一份獎學金，Tom得以上大學。","三十二名领奖学金的马达加斯加学生飞往中国。"]],["formation","fɒ:'meiʃәn","n. 形成, 构造, 编队\\n[医] 形成, 结构",["Fundamentally, the formation of the twelve zodiac signs is related to animal worship.","A possible explanation would be the formation of pore-like structures."],["從根本上說，十二生肖的形成，與動物崇拜有關。",""]],["reservation",".rezә'veiʃәn","n. 保留, 预定, 保留品, 保留地\\n[经] 预定, 预约, 权益保留",["Tom canceled his hotel reservation.","Please reconfirm the reservation by March 10."],["湯姆把酒店訂單取消了。","請在3月10日前再次確認預訂。"]],["efficiency","i'fiʃәnsi","n. 效率, 效能, 功效\\n[医] 效率, 效力",["The challenge we are going to face is how to increase work efficiency.","We have optimized the database indexing, and as a result, system efficiency has improved by 50%."],["如何提高工作效率是我们现在要面临的难题。","我们优化了数据库索引，结果系统效率提高了50%。"]],["qualify","'kwɒlifai","vi. 取得资格, 有资格\\nvt. 使有资格, 使合格, 限定, 限制, 准予",["Looks like I qualify to apply to be an advanced contributor now.","In order to qualify for the homestay you must have an interview with the sponsors."],["",""]],["mall","mɔ:l","n. 林荫路",["Recently T Mall has had a sales promotion on cell phones.","To broaden your view, go see the underground shopping mall beneath People's Square."],["最近天猫上有手机促销活动。","再要开眼界，去看人民广场下面的地下商场。"]],["derive","di'raiv","vt. 得自\\nvi. 起源",["Superstitions derive from the inability of men to acknowledge that coincidences are merely coincidences.","From reading good books we can derive pleasure, friendship, experience and instruction."],["迷信之所以存在，是因為人無法接受巧合只是巧合而已。","读书，可以获得乐趣、友谊、经验和指导。"]],["scandal","'skændәl","n. 丑闻, 中伤, 耻辱, 反感, 流言蜚语\\n[法] 丑事, 丑闻, 干丑事的人",["In point of fact, she had nothing to do with the scandal.","This scandal will likely ruin your chances of being elected."],["事实上，她和这个丑闻没有任何关系。","这则丑闻很有可能会断送您的选举。"]],["pc","","个人计算机\\n[计] 外部控制, 个人计算机, 光电导体, 伪码",["I'm too cheap to play anything but homebrew PC games.","I imagine that you are wondering when your new PC will arrive."],["我太小氣了，除了 Homebrew 電腦遊戲，什麼遊戲都不玩。","我猜您一定想知道您的新電腦什麼時候到貨。"]],["helpful","'helpful","a. 有帮助的, 有益的, 有用的",["Carlos's work as a customer service representative requires him to be friendly and helpful to customers.","When learning Chinese, pinyin is very helpful for beginners."],["卡洛斯的客服代表工作要求他對客戶友好且樂於幫助客戶。","學習漢語的時候，拼音對初學者很有幫助。"]],["impress","im'pres","n. 印象, 特征, 印记\\nvt. 使有印象, 印, 铭刻, 传送, 影响, 强征\\nvi. 给人印象",["Parents try to impress upon their children the importance of honesty and hard work.","Tom's designs didn't impress me much."],["父母试图将诚实和工作的重要性灌输给孩子。","湯姆的設計沒有給我留下多少印象。"]],["heel","hi:l","n. 脚后跟, 踵, 后部, 倾侧\\nvt. 尾随, 装以鞋跟, 倾侧, 追赶\\nvi. 紧随, 用脚后跟传球",["The first baseman is the Achilles heel of our team.","She got a run in her stocking when she broke the heel of her shoe."],["",""]],["humor","'hju:mә","n. 幽默, 诙谐, 心情\\nvt. 迎合, 牵就, 顺应",["She looks down on me for not having a sense of humor.","His humor charmingly eased the embarrassing atmosphere at dinner time and made me breathe a sigh of relief."],["她很瞧不起我，认为我没有幽默细胞。","他的幽默巧妙地缓解了晚餐时尴尬的气氛，让我松了一口气。"]],["resemble","ri'zembl","vt. 相似, 类似",["All happy families resemble each other, each unhappy family is unhappy in its own way.","Much as we resemble one another, none of us are exactly alike."],["幸福家庭的幸福原因全都大同小異，但悲慘的家庭卻往往各自有各自的慘法。",""]],["fabric","'fæbrik","n. 织物, 布, 结构, 构造, 建筑物\\n[经] 组织, 建筑物, 工厂",["The suits in this row are all made of imported European fabric.","The dress is made of a thin fabric."],["这里一排都是进口面料欧版的西装。","這件衣服是由薄織物製成的。"]],["privacy","'praivәsi","n. 隐私, 隐居, 秘密\\n[计] 个人保密权",["Reporters do not hesitate to intrude into people's privacy.","More than 28 million Canadians were affected by privacy breaches last year."],["记者没有犹豫地去干涉了人们的私生活。","去年，超过2800万加拿大人被隐私泄露受到影响了。"]],["contest","'kɒntest","n. 竞赛, 争论\\nvt. 竞争, 争取, 争辩\\nvi. 竞争",["I would often take part in an English speech contest in my school days.","My father participated in a cooking contest and came in first."],["当年我在学校的时候经常参加英语演讲比赛。","我爸爸参加了料理竞赛并得了第一名。"]],["proportion","prә'pɒ:ʃәn","n. 比例, 比率, 均衡, 部分, 面积\\nvt. 使成比例, 使均衡",["Men's wants become greater in proportion to the increase in their income.","The wages will be paid in proportion to the work done."],["人收入愈高，慾望就愈大。",""]],["guideline","'gaidlain","n. 指导路线, 方针, 指标\\n[经] 指导路线, 方针, 准则",["Rules are made for fools to follow and for wise men to use as a guideline.","Actually, it's really more of a guideline than a rule."],["",""]],["rifle","'raifl","n. 来复枪, 步枪\\nvt. 用步枪射击, 抢夺\\nvi. (抱有不良意图)迅速翻查",["When arguing, the difference between a man and a woman is like between a rifle and a machine gun.","He carried a rifle on his shoulder."],["爭吵的時候，男人和女人的區別就像步槍和機關槍的區別。","他把步槍背在他的肩上。"]],["conviction","kәn'vikʃәn","n. 定罪, 信服, 坚信\\n[法] 定罪, 证明有罪, 判罪",["One must have conviction in law, or its existence will be superficial only.","Betty has a previous conviction for theft."],["法律必须被信仰，否则形同虚设。","贝蒂有盗窃前科。"]],["maintenance","'meintәnәns","n. 维护, 保持, 维修, 生活费用, 坚持, 扶养\\n[计] 维护; 维修",["Getting a sports car is easy, compared to the maintenance one must do on it.","The server is temporarily unable to service your request due to maintenance downtime or capacity problems. Please try again later."],["",""]],["trick","trik","n. 诡计, 欺诈, 谋略, 恶作剧, 习惯, 决窍\\nvt. 愚弄, 欺骗, 装饰\\nvi. 哄骗, 戏弄\\na. 有决窍的, 特技的,…",["The phone call was a trick to get him out of the house.","Felix was trying to trick Amelia to open the door."],["那通電話是引他離開房子的一個小把戲。","菲力克斯当时试图哄骗阿米莉娅开门。"]],["examination","ig.zæmi'neiʃәn","n. 考试, 测验, 审查\\n[医] 检查, 诊察",["Allan was lucky and passed the tax accountant examination.","You should have known better than to take an examination without preparing for it."],["艾伦很幸运地考过了税务师考试。","你應該知道要為考試作準備。"]],["organic","ɒ:'gænik","a. 器官的, 有机的, 组织的, 根本的\\n[医] 器官的, 有生命的, 有机的, 器质的",["Organic kale is hand picked, washed and packed on site at Sprouting Farms, West Virginia, for retail and wholesale.","Some people only buy organic food; they think that in this way their body will not be damaged by pollutants."],["有機羽衣甘藍在西維吉尼亞州的 Sprouting Farms 現場手工採摘、清洗和包裝，提供零售和批發。","一些人只买有机的食物，他们认为这样可以使他们的健康不受污染的损害。"]],["tent","tent","n. 帐篷, 帷幕, 住处, 塞条, 塞子\\nvi. 住帐蓬, 宿营, 暂时居住\\nvt. 用帐篷遮盖, 使住帐篷, 用塞条嵌入",["They were looking for a place at which they could pitch the tent.","This is a good place to pitch a tent."],["他们在找一个可以搭帐篷的地方。","这是搭帐篷的好地方。"]],["publisher","'pʌbliʃә","n. 出版者, 发行人\\n[法] 发行人, 出版者, 报刊发行者",["This publisher specializes in children's literature.","The editor and the publisher were present at the party."],["這家出版社專門出版兒童文學。",""]],["strengthen","'streŋθәn","vt. 加强, 变坚固\\nvi. 变强, 股票上涨",["Cultural exchange programs can strengthen friendly relations between neighboring countries.","Algeria continues to strengthen ties with China and Russia."],["文化交流計畫可以加強鄰國之間的友好關係。","阿爾及利亞繼續加強與中國和俄羅斯的關係。"]],["proposed","","a. 被提议的；所推荐的",["She had been proposed to five times by the time she was twenty.","He proposed a reform in the educational system."],["她二十歲的時候，就已經有五個人向她求過婚了。","他提议对教育系统进行改革。"]],["myth","miθ","n. 神话, 虚构的事, 虚构的人",["The myth offers insights into the ancient civilization.","It drew strength from the young people who rejected the myth of their generation's apathy, who left their homes and their families for jobs that offered little pay and less sleep."],["神話讓我們能透悉古文明。","竞选活动因为年轻人的支持而越来越有声势，他们拒绝了他们那一代对政治不感兴趣的神话，他们离开家，从事那些薪水少而且辛苦的工作。"]],["sophisticated","sә'fistikeitid","a. 复杂的, 久经世故的\\n[法] 尖端的, 高级的, 非常有经验的",["A vast and sophisticated system is usually based on a few simple rules.","The readers of that book think themselves sophisticated."],["庞大而精妙的体系往往建立在几个简单的规则之上。",""]],["cow","kau","n. 母牛, 母兽\\nvt. 威胁",["I don't like being the one who always has to milk the cow.","When the cow flies high and the ox flies low, there probably is a twister."],["我不喜欢做那个总是挤牛奶的人。","當母牛飛得高, 公牛飛得低, 就有可能是一個龍捲風。"]],["etc","","及其他, 等等",["Compare it to other enjoyable activities: going to the cinema, reading books, going for walks, chatting to friends etc.","Inside my backpack there are many colored pens, red ones, blue ones, green ones, etc."],["把它相较于其他有意思的活动：去电影院，看书，散步，跟朋友聊天等等。","我的書包裡有很多彩色筆，紅的，藍的，綠的，等等。"]],["standing","'stændiŋ","n. 起立, 持续, 身分\\na. 立着的, 不动的, 经常的, 持续的",["The train was so crowded that I had to keep standing all the way.","Going to church doesn't make you a Christian any more than standing in a garage makes you a car."],["火車擁擠極了，我整趟車程都沒有位子坐。","去教堂參加禮拜，不會馬上就變成一個基督徒，就好像站在車房裏，不會變成一輛車一樣。"]],["asleep","ә'sli:p","a. 睡着的, 长眠的, 麻木的\\nadv. 熟睡地",["He was about to fall asleep, when he heard his name called.","Last night I was dead drunk and fell asleep without having a bath."],["他快要睡著的時候，聽到有人在叫他的名字。","昨夜，我烂醉了，我没洗澡就睡觉了。"]],["tennis","'tenis","n. 网球",["Because of the rain, we weren't able to play tennis outside.","Some of my classmates like volleyball and others enjoy tennis."],["由于下雨，我们没能上外头打网球。","我有些同學喜歡排球，也有些喜歡網球。"]],["nerve","nә:v","n. 精神, 勇气, 叶脉, 神经\\nvt. 鼓起勇气",["She must have some nerve to go and meet him by herself.","The sciatic nerve is the longest nerve in the human body."],["",""]],["barrel","'bærәl","n. 桶\\nvt. 装入桶内",["Political power grows out of the barrel of a gun.","Middle Eastern oil prices jumped by five dollars per barrel."],["枪杆子里面出政权。",""]],["membership","'membәʃip","n. 会员的资格, 全体会员, 会员数目\\n[法] 会员资格, 成员资格, 会籍",["I applied for membership in the association.","There's no membership fee for joining."],["我申請成為協會會員。","參加不用會員費。"]],["menu","'menju:","n. 菜单, (功能)选择单\\n[计] 菜单",["Even if they have a good wine menu, I will not want to dine here.","I'm sure you'll love what we have on the menu tonight."],["即使他们有很好的酒单，我也不想在这里用餐。","我肯定你会喜欢我们今晚的菜肴。"]],["bombing","'bɔmiŋ","n. 轰炸, 投弹",["The phrase \"humanitarian bombing\" is an oxymoron.","George H. W. Bush was a war criminal responsible for bombing retreating soldiers, many of whom were conscripts."],["「人道主義轟炸」一詞是自相矛盾的。",""]],["ratio","'reiʃәu","n. 比, 比率\\n[医] 比, 比率, 比例",["The application allows you to quickly calculate the ratio of body mass index - BMI.","Vietnam's public debt to GDP ratio is nearing the government-mandated ceiling of 65%."],["這項應用程序能讓你快速計算身高體重指數（BMI）。",""]],["controversial",".kɒntrә'vә:ʃәl","a. 争论的, 论争的, 被议论的",["He sows discord by raising controversial subjects.","This movie is highly controversial."],["他挑起爭議性高的話題，製造紛爭。","这个电影很有争议。"]],["desperate","'despәrәt","a. 不顾一切的, 危急的, 令人绝望的, 极渴望的",["Desperate times call for desperate measures.","After all, even salesmen are desperate to avoid being targeted for downsizing."],["非常时期需要非常措施。",""]],["lifestyle","'laifstail","n. 生活方式",["He has problems with adapting to lifestyle changes.","An orderly lifestyle and a regular diet are the keys to health."],["他在適應新的生活方式上有問題。",""]],["loud","laud","a. 大声的, 不断的, 喧吵的\\nadv. 高声地, 大声地",["Playing WHAT THE CAR? with friends is a guaranteed laugh-out-loud experience.","He was roused by a loud knocking at the door."],["與朋友玩《WHAT THE CAR?》，保證能得到讓你開懷大笑的遊戲體驗。","他被啪啪的敲門聲吵醒了。"]],["glove","glʌv","n. 手套\\nvt. 给...戴手套",["My favorite word in German is the word for \"glove\".","Tom opened the glove compartment and took out a pair of sunglasses."],["我最喜歡的德文字是「手套」。",""]],["narrative","'nærәtiv","n. 叙述, 故事\\na. 叙述的, 叙事的, 故事体的",["The narrative provided some eye-opening social commentary on the state of the country.","The mystery contains more dialogue than narrative."],["",""]],["islam","'izlɑ:m","n. 伊斯兰教",["In this country, the majority of the population espouses Sunni Islam.","Sami's conversion to Islam was a life-changing thing."],["在這個國家，大多數人口信奉遜尼派伊斯蘭教。","薩米皈依伊斯蘭教對他的人生產生了深遠的影響。"]],["photographer","fә'tɔ^rәfә","n. 摄影师, 摄影者",["A woman brought an old picture of her dead husband, wearing a hat, to the photographer.","Every dumbass with a camera thinks he is a photographer."],["一個女人帶了一張她去世的丈夫的舊照片給攝影師，照片中她的丈夫戴著一頂帽子。","每个有照相机的傻瓜都觉得自己是摄影家。"]],["sufficient","sә'fiʃәnt","a. 充分的, 足够的\\n[法] 充分的, 足够的",["I have not yet collected sufficient materials to write a book.","We have sufficient evidence to prove this hypothesis."],["我還沒有收集到足夠的材料來寫一本書。","我們有充分的理由論證這個假設。"]],["helicopter","'helikɒptә","n. 直升机\\nvt. 由直升机运送\\nvi. 乘直升机",["Tell those people to back off so that the helicopter can land.","The government transported goods to the island by helicopter."],["叫那些人後退，直升機要著陸了。","政府用直升機把物資送到了那個小島。"]],["modest","'mɒdist","a. 谦逊的, 羞怯的, 端庄的, 适度的\\n[经] 适当的",["The films shown in this modest cinema had an intermission during which the projectionist changed the reel.","After winning the Nobel prize, she remained as modest as ever."],["這座規模不大的電影院在放映影片時會有一段中場休息，期間放映師負責換片。","獲得諾貝爾獎後，她仍謙虛如昔。"]],["provider","prә'vaidә","n. 供应者, 供养人, 伙食承办人\\n[计] 提供器",["Every Internet access provider must understand these regulations.","In the Internet age, the once noble title of publisher has been demoted to the insipid \"content provider\"."],["",""]],["agricultural",".ægri'kʌltʃәrәl","a. 农业的\\n[法] 农业的, 耕作的",["On the border, there is a stretch of agricultural land.","In China's agricultural and industrial areas, some people are still very poor."],["邊境上有一片農業區。","在中国乡村和工业区，有的人还是很穷的。"]],["delay","di'lei","n. 耽搁, 迟滞\\nv. 耽搁, 延迟\\n[计] 延迟, 延时",["In case the shipment is delayed, we have special delay insurance.","We apologize for the delay and regret any inconvenience it may have caused."],["万一船运迟了，我们有特别的迟到保险。","我们对这次的延迟表示抱歉，并对可能造成的不便表示遗憾。"]],["explode","ik'splәud","vi. 爆炸, 爆发, 激增\\nvt. 使爆炸",["The aim of this game is to explode all the bombs on the screen.","A spark caused the gunpowder to explode."],["這個遊戲的目的是引爆螢幕上所有的炸彈。","一点火花让火药爆炸。"]],["scope","skәup","n. 范围, 机会, 广度, 眼界, 观察仪器, 导弹射程\\n[计] 作用域",["This is beyond the scope of my imagination.","The problem is beyond the scope of my understanding."],["這超出了我的想像範圍。",""]],["stroke","strәuk","n. 笔划, 打, 中风, 抚, 摩, 冲程\\nvt. 划尾桨, 抚, 摩, 划去\\n[计] 笔划",["An elderly person in my family suddenly fell to the ground; he likely suffered a stroke.","In tennis and ping-pong backhand the hand is turned backwards in making the stroke."],["我家里有个老年人突然倒在地上，大概是中风了。",""]],["handful","'hændful","n. 少数, 一把, 棘手事",["The boy gathered a handful of peanuts and put them in a small box.","Tom bent down and picked up a handful of sand."],["男孩收集了一把花生，然後把它們放到了一個小箱子裏。","汤姆弯下腰，捧起了一把沙子。"]],["punishment","'pʌniʃmәnt","n. 处罚, 刑罚, 惩罚\\n[法] 罚, 处罚, 刑罚",["In some countries, the punishment for treason can be life in prison.","Many countries have abolished capital punishment."],["在一些國家，叛國罪的懲罰可以是終身監禁。","許多國家已經廢除了死刑。"]],["badly","'bædli","adv. 严重地, 恶劣地, 极度地",["She was very embarrassed when her child behaved badly in public.","The last three coaches of the train were badly damaged."],["當她的孩子在公共場合行為表現不好的時候，她覺得很尷尬。","火車的尾三節車廂損壞得很嚴重。"]],["curious","'kjuәriәs","a. 好奇的, 求知的, 古怪的",["\"What's going on in the cave? I'm curious.\" \"I have no idea.\"","She is curious to find who sent the flowers."],["\"山洞裡發生了什麼事?\" 我很好奇。\"我不知道。\"","她很想知道那束花是誰寄來的。"]],["horizon","hә'raizәn","n. 地平线, 眼界, (天)视地平",["The sun has just sunk below the horizon.","Death is only a horizon, and a horizon is nothing save the limit of our sight."],["太阳刚下山。",""]],["prompt","prɒmpt","n. 激励, 提示, 提醒物, 提词, 付款期限\\na. 迅速的, 敏捷的, 立刻的, 提词员的\\nvt. 激励, 鼓动, 提示\\nadv…",["Your prompt attention to this matter will be greatly appreciated.","Following the text is an exercise which teachers can use to prompt pupils to speak."],["",""]],["van","væn","n. 货车, 篷车, 先锋, 前驱, 前卫\\nvt. 用货车搬运\\n[计] 增值网",["A big van appeared on the street corner.","Tom was the last one to get in the van."],["街角出現了一輛大麵包車。","汤姆是最后一个上面包车的。"]],["girlfriend","","n. 女朋友",["After having anal sex with my girlfriend, we usually need to have a good wash.","You'll get into trouble if your girlfriend finds out the truth."],["跟我女友肛交後，我們一般需要把自己洗乾淨。","如果你女朋友发现真相的话，你会有麻烦的。"]],["downtown","'daun'taun","n. 市中心区\\na. 市中心的\\nadv. 往闹市区",["For example, if I want to get downtown what bus should I take?","The house I bought is pretty far from downtown."],["比如说，我要到市中心，有什么车子可以坐吗？","我買的房子離市中心比較遠。"]],["flavor","'fleivә","n. 滋味, 调味品\\nvt. 加味于",["This braised pork is still too watery. Cook it for another ten minutes to thicken the sauce, so the flavor sticks to the meat.","The peppermint flavor in this mouthwash is too strong."],["這滷肉還是太稀了，再煮十分鐘，讓湯汁濃稠一些，這樣味道才能更好地留在肉上。","這個漱口水的薄荷味太重了。"]],["cholesterol","kә'lestәrɒl","n. 胆固醇\\n[化] 胆固醇; 胆固醇",["If you want to avoid cholesterol, eat lean meat with no fat.","It is best to avoid eating high cholesterol foods."],["",""]],["absorb","әb'sɒ:b","vt. 吸收, 使全神贯注, 同化, 买进, 理解, 承受, 忍受, 承担\\n[医] 吸收",["Mangroves absorb more carbon dioxide than any other trees on Earth because they have large underground root structures.","A good book can completely absorb your attention, to the extent that you forget your surroundings and even your existence."],["红树林吸取二氧化碳比地球上其他树木都要多，因为它们具有很大的地下根部结构。","一本好书会令你全神贯注，甚至忘掉周围和自己。"]],["adjustment","ә'dʒʌstmәnt","n. 调整, 调节, 校正\\n[化] 调节",["The decline isn't so sharp after seasonal adjustment.","You can adjust the seat height by moving the adjustment lever up."],["",""]],["taxpayer","'tækspeiә","n. 纳税人\\n[法] 纳税人, 纳税义务人",["Each taxpayer has the right to know where his money goes.","The President has made clear that it is time to turn the page on an era of reckless lending and taxpayer bailouts."],["",""]],["eager","'i:gә","a. 热心的, 渴望的, 热望的",["When we are told not to come, we become all the more eager to go.","He thinks that they are eager for glory."],["让我们别来，我们就更想来了。","他以为他们渴望荣耀。"]],["principal","'prinsipәl","n. 校长, 首长, 本金, 主犯, 资本, 委托人\\na. 主要的, 最重要的, 首要的",["The principal severely reproved the students whenever they made a mess in the hallway.","The principal presented each of the graduates with diploma."],["每次学生把走廊弄得一团糟的时候，校长都会严厉地训斥他们。","校长向每个毕业生颁发了毕业证书。"]],["detailed","'di:teild","a. 详细的, 复杂的\\n[法] 详细的, 详尽的",["He gave us a detailed account of his experiences in Africa.","When using this information, I will follow any conditions you specify, whether that's anonymity or giving detailed reference."],["他把他在非洲的所見所聞一五一十地告訴了我們。","在使用这份问卷的信息时，我会遵照您提出的条件，不留您的姓名或者关于您的任何详细信息。"]],["motivation",".mәuti'veiʃәn","n. 动机, 刺激, 推动\\n[医] 促动, 推动, 诱导",["When real life friends desert us, books are always ready to offer friendship, sympathy and motivation.","Failure gives me strength: my pain is my motivation."],["生活中的朋友弃我们不顾之时，书随时给我们送来友谊、同情和鼓励。",""]],["restriction","ri'strikʃәn","n. 限制, 限定, 约束\\n[计] 限定",["It has recently been suggested that calorie restriction alone has anticonvulsant effects in an animal model of epilepsy.","You didn't mention that restriction when we were writing up the contract."],["",""]],["assignment","ә'sainmәnt","n. 分配, 功课, 任务, 转让, 归因, 陈述\\n[计] 赋值",["Now that I have finished this assignment I want to go to sleep, but I have to go to school.","It's necessary that we all work together to complete this assignment."],["我做完功課，想去睡覺，可是又要上學⋯⋯","我们必须一起完成这个任务。"]],["workshop","'wә:kʃɒp","n. 工场, 车间, 研讨会\\n[计] 讨论会; 专题研究组",["An old worker was found repairing machinery in the workshop.","I adapted the garage for use as a workshop."],["有人发现一个老工人在车间修机器。","我把车库改造成工作室使用。"]],["laboratory","'læbrәtәri","n. 实验室, 研究室, 化工厂\\n[医] 实验室, 检验室, 化验室",["A series of blasts reduced the laboratory to ruins.","This laboratory is equipped with the latest computers."],["一连串的爆炸使实验室成为废墟。","这个实验室配备了最新的计算机。"]],["differently","'difrentli","adv. 差异, 不同, 各别, 各种",["One views things differently according to whether one is rich or poor.","People look at things differently depending on whether they are rich or poor."],["每個人對事情有不同的觀點是根據他是富裕的還是貧窮的。","人們看待事情的角度不同取決於他們是富裕或貧窮。"]],["auto","'ɒ:tәu","n. 汽车\\npref. 表示\"自己\"、\"本身\", 表示\"自己的\", 表示\"自动的\"",["It's a comparison of setting the white balance to \"auto\" versus presetting it with white copy paper.","The building you see over there is an auto factory."],["",""]],["romantic","rәu'mæntik","a. 浪漫的, 风流的, 传奇性的, 夸大的, 空想的, 浪漫派的",["Mary is always saying that Tom isn't romantic enough.","For his first date, he chose an Italian restaurant and ordered seafood pasta, hoping to leave a romantic impression."],["玛丽总是说汤姆不够浪漫。","他第一次約會就選了義大利餐廳，點了海鮮義大利麵，希望留下浪漫印象。"]],["cotton","'kɒtn","n. 棉花\\nvi. 和谐, 有好感, 理解",["Their main exports are textiles, especially silk and cotton.","Someday I will buy a cotton candy machine."],["他们主要输出的产品是纺织品，尤其以丝绸和绵为主。","有一天我买了一台棉花糖机。"]],["sue","su:","vt. 控告, 起诉, 请求\\nvi. 提出诉讼, 提出请求",["At last, John and Sue decided to cut the apple into halves.","Sue and John decided to get married."],["約翰和蘇最後決定把蘋果切成兩半。","Sue 和 John 决定结婚。"]],["motor","'mәutә","n. 马达, 发动机, 原动力, 汽车\\na. 马达的, 发动机的, 汽车的, 发动的\\nvt. 推动, 以汽车载运\\nvi. 乘汽车, …",["The number of motor vehicles in the city has increased.","The insurer will indemnify the policyholder against loss of or damage to the motor car."],["城市裏的機動車數量增加了。",""]],["overlook",".әuvә'luk","vt. 俯瞰, 远眺, 没注意到\\nn. 眺望, 俯瞰到的景色",["Making this matter public would have an effect on our sales, so we're going to overlook it this once.","This kind of mistake is easy to overlook."],["公开此事会影响我们的销售，所以我们将忽略它一次。","这种错误很容易被人忽视。"]],["float","flәut","n. 漂流物, 浮舟, 漂浮, 浮萍, 彩车\\nvi. 浮动, 飘动, 散播, 摇摆, 动摇, 浮动\\nvt. 使漂浮, 容纳, 淹没, …",["The substance is light enough to float on the water.","Bill, if you'll come with me, you'll float, too."],["這種物質很輕，可以浮在水面上。","比爾，如果你跟我來，你也會飄。"]],["undergo",".ʌndә'gәu","vt. 遭受, 经历, 忍受\\n[法] 经受, 经历, 忍受",["Father is going to undergo an operation.","The surgeon persuaded me to undergo an organ transplant operation."],["父亲将会接受手术。",""]],["demonstration",".demәn'streiʃәn","n. 示范, 实证\\n[医] 示教, 实物教授",["Dozens of young people attended the demonstration.","Several dozen young people participated in the demonstration."],["几十个年轻人参加了示威游行。","几十个年轻人参加了示威游行。"]],["sequence","'si:kwәns","n. 序列, 续发事件, 顺序, 连续\\nvt. 按顺序排好\\n[计] 顺序",["There are many examples of the Fibonacci sequence in nature.","The fibonacci sequence makes numerous appearances throughout the natural world."],["",""]],["jet","dʒet","n. 喷射流, 喷嘴, 煤玉\\nv. 射出, 迸出, 喷射\\na. 黑而发亮的, 墨黑的",["I feel exhausted because of jet lag.","Actually, I still haven't gotten over my jet lag."],["我因為時差而感到疲憊。","我时差还没倒过来呢。"]],["orange","'ɒ:rindʒ","n. 柑橘, 桔子, 橘色\\na. 橘色的",["The Tequila Sunrise is made with orange juice, tequila, and grenadine.","The heater is aglow with a beautiful orange color."],["龍舌蘭日出由柳橙汁、龍舌蘭酒和石榴糖漿調製而成。","加熱器發出美麗的橙色光芒。"]],["consumption","kәn'sʌmpʃәn","n. 消费, 消费量, 痨病\\n[化] 消耗量; 耗量",["Previously, Mr Johnson also proposed banning the consumption of alcohol on public transport in the capital, which is believed to have reduced the crime rate on trains and buses.","Limit the consumption of white sugar and salt."],["约翰逊先生以前还倡议禁止在首都公交上饮酒，有人认为这个倡议有效减少了火车和公车上的犯罪率。","限制白糖和盐的摄取量。"]],["assert","ә'sә:t","vt. 主张, 坚称, 断言\\n[法] 宣称, 断言, 维护",["Algeria needs to emphatically assert its status as a big and modern nation.","If America were the best country in the world, it wouldn't need to constantly assert this."],["",""]],["blade","bleid","n. 叶片, 刀锋, 刀口, 剑\\n[医] 页[片], 叶片, 刀片, 刀刃, 刀口",["It doesn't matter whether your beard has grown for four years or seven. When the barber shaves it he'll use that same blade.","A mind all logic is like a knife all blade. It makes the hand bleed that uses it."],["不論你的鬍子長了四年還是七年, 理髮師用刀子剔的時間都是一樣的。",""]],["medication",".medi'keiʃәn","n. 药物治疗, 药物处理, 医药\\n[医] 药疗法, 投药法",["The patient, despite having taken the new medication, didn't feel any better.","I have been taking this medication for many years."],["病人吃了新药后没觉得好些了。","这种药我吃了好多年了。"]],["temporary","'tempәrәri","a. 暂时的, 临时的\\nn. 临时工, 临时雇员\\n[计] 临时",["Recession is a temporary falling off of business activity during a period when such activity is generally increasing.","They said the situation was only temporary."],["经济萧条是一段时间内，当这样的经济活动普遍增长而造成的一种临时性的经济活动衰退。","他们说情况只是暂时的。"]],["cabin","'kæbin","n. 小屋, 客舱\\nvt. 关在小屋",["Abraham Lincoln, the 16th president of the United States, was born in a log cabin in Kentucky.","The writer is living in a log cabin."],["伯拉罕·林肯，美国第16任总统，生于肯塔基州的一个简陋的小屋里。","那个作家生活在小木屋中。"]],["bite","bait","n. 咬, 一口\\nv. 咬, 刺痛, 穿透",["You're lucky because he didn't bite you.","We suspect it's about a poisoning by snake bite."],["你真走运，因为他没咬你。","我们猜这是一种被蛇咬伤的毒。"]],["edition","i'diʃәn","n. 版本, 版, 翻版",["There are so many mistakes in this book that the teacher has dubbed it \"The Drunkard's Edition\".","I found the rare edition that I've been looking so long for."],["这本书里错误多得以至于老师把它叫作“醉鬼版”。","找到了寻找已久的珍本。"]],["yours","juәz","pron. 你的(东西), 你们的(东西)",["Although he did well in the exam, his spoken Chinese is not necessarily as good as yours.","People who want to share their religious views with you almost never want you to share yours with them."],["虽然他考得很好，他口语的汉语不见得比你的好。","想要跟你分享他们宗教信仰的人几乎从不愿你跟他们分享你的。"]],["pitch","pitʃ","n. 程度, 坡度, 顶点, 前倾, 倾斜, 投掷, 音高, 螺距, 节距, 摊位, 树脂, 沥青\\nvt. 投, 掷, 向前倾跌, 扎营…",["The players ran off the pitch and had a meeting during half-time.","Because it had been raining for a couple of days, the pitch was muddy and difficult to play on."],["球员们跑下场，在中场休息时开了一个会。","连续下了好几天雨，所以这个足球场有些泥泞，不太好用了。"]],["pine","pain","n. 松树, 松木\\nvi. 消瘦, 憔悴, 痛苦, 怀念, 渴望\\n[计] 邮件程序",["There used to be a big pine tree in front of my house.","The wood of trees in the pine family is much prized for construction and furniture making."],["以前我家前面有棵大松树。","松科樹木的木材因其優良的品質，在建築和家具製造領域備受推崇。"]],["brilliant","'briljәnt","a. 光辉的, 灿烂的, 有才气的\\n[机] 亮的",["Russell was a brilliant philosopher, but even the simplest practical task was quite beyond him.","It is because light travels faster than sound that some people look brilliant before sounding stupid."],["羅素是一個極出色的哲學家，可是他對日常生活中的事務卻是一竅不通。","光速比音速快，所以某些人在開口前，看起來還挺聰明的。"]],["versus","'vә:sәs","prep. 对...\\n[法] 诉, 对, 相形",["It's a comparison of setting the white balance to \"auto\" versus presetting it with white copy paper.","The exchange rate of the dollar versus the euro has declined."],["",""]],["manufacturing",".mænju'fæktʃәriŋ","n. 制造业\\na. 制造业的",["We are planning changes to the manufacturing process.","The company has already established its fame as a robot manufacturing company."],["我们算计着改革生产流程。",""]],["chef","ʃef","n. 厨师",["She used to be a part time chef, then she became full time.","A brilliant, seductive chef turns to espionage in Napoleon-era France."],["她以前是兼职厨师，后来做了全职。","拿破崙時代的法國，魅力誘人的天才廚師搖身一變成為間諜。"]],["absolute","'æbsәlu:t","a. 绝对的, 专制的, 完全的, 独立的\\nn. 绝对事物",["What country has the absolute advantage in the production of corn?","The lord held absolute power over his subjects."],["哪一個國家擁有生產玉米的絕對優勢？","领主对他的臣民有绝对权力。"]],["discrimination","dis.krimi'neiʃәn","n. 差别, 岐视, 辨别力\\n[化] 鉴别",["Androgynous-looking people are often the subject of discussion and discrimination.","That's not what I mean. Sex discrimination, female discrimination, whatever, men and women are just different."],["看起来不男不女的人常常受到议论和歧视。","我不是这个意思。性别歧视，女性歧视，不管怎样，男人和女人都是不同的。"]],["offensive","ә'fensiv","a. 令人不快的, 侮辱的, 攻击性的\\n[法] 攻击的, 进攻的, 冒犯的",["The speaker's comments were highly offensive.","The instant I open the lid an offensive smell greets my nose."],["发言人的评论极有攻击性。",""]],["boom","bu:m","n. 繁荣, 隆隆声\\nvi. 急速发展, 发隆隆声\\nvt. 使兴旺, 发隆隆声",["He amassed a fortune in stock trading during the last boom.","Tom usually remembers to duck his head to avoid the swinging boom when tacking in his sailboat."],["他在上个景气时期炒股攒下了一笔钱。",""]],["appoint","ә'pɒint","vt. 任命, 指定, 下令\\n[法] 派, 派任, 任命",["The board unanimously decided to appoint her as CEO.","The committee met and discussed whom to appoint to the post."],["董事会一致决定任命她为执行总裁。",""]],["register","'redʒistә","n. 寄存器, 记录, 登记簿, 注册\\nvt. 记录, 注册, 提示, 表达, 把...挂号\\nvi. 登记, 注册, 挂号\\n[计] …",["Sir, please present your passport or identity card, so I can register it.","No person by that name is listed in the register of the school."],["先生，请出示护照或者身份证，让我登记一下。","学校的名册里没有这个名字的人。"]],["dominant","'dɒminәnt","a. 占优势的, 支配的\\n[医] 优性的, 显性的",["Monetary value is the dominant value in American society.","The union exerts a dominant influence on the conservative party."],["",""]],["heritage","'heritidʒ","n. 遗产, 祖先遗留物, 继承物\\n[医] 遗传性",["Is it true that our genetic heritage is almost the same as that of chimpanzees?","Ironbridge Gorge is a Unesco world heritage site."],["我们的遗传基因真的和黑猩猩几乎一样吗？","鐵橋峽谷是聯合國教科文組織世界遺產。"]],["successfully","sәk'sesfjli","adv. 成功, 结果良好, 有成就",["His only hope of winning the pool game at that point was to successfully execute a complex trick shot.","He was extremely happy at having successfully solved the problem."],["那時他贏得撞球比賽的唯一希望，就是成功打出一記複雜的花式擊球。","成功地解决了这个问题，对此他感到十分高兴。"]],["shit","ʃit","vi. 拉屎\\nvt. 欺骗, 在...拉屎\\nn. 粪, 屎\\ninterj. 狗屁",["The saying goes: to turn a new leaf is priceless. The saying also goes: a dog can't change their habits of eating shit!","I completely forgot there was a test today. The teacher told us to put our phones away and started handing out test booklets, and I'm like \"oh, shit\"."],["俗話說：浪子回頭金不換；可俗話又說：狗改不了吃屎！","我完全忘了今天有考試。老師叫我們把手機收起來，然後開始發考卷，我只想說：「靠，完了。」"]],["lemon","'lemәn","n. 柠檬, 柠檬树, 柠檬色\\n[医] 柠檬",["Add the honey, lemon juice, chopped almonds and the chopped apples.","Use lemon juice instead of vinegar."],["加入蜂蜜、檸檬汁、切碎的杏仁和切碎的蘋果。","用擰檬汁代替醋。"]],["hungry","'hʌŋgi","a. 饥饿的, 荒年的, 渴望的, 不毛的\\n[化] 欠鞣皮",["If I had eaten breakfast this morning, I would not be hungry now.","Tom always feels hungry at least one hour before lunch."],["如果我今早吃了早餐，現在肚子就不會這麼餓了。","湯姆總是在離午餐至少還要一個小時之前就餓了。"]],["wander","'wɒndә","vi. 游荡, 漫步, 徘徊, 迷路, 离题, 蜿蜒\\nvt. 在...漫游",["But meanwhile it flees: time flees irretrievably, while we wander around, prisoners of our love of detail.","Sometimes it's fun to just wander about aimlessly."],["但与此同时，它却在消逝：时间无可挽回地流逝， 而我们却四处游荡，成为我们对细节的热爱的囚徒。","偶爾漫無目的地走一走是很有樂趣的。"]],["submit","sәb'mit","vt. 使服从, 使受到, 委托, 提交, 认为\\nvi. 屈服, 服从",["Don't change sentences that are correct. You can, instead, submit natural-sounding alternative translations.","Edit your work better before you submit it, it's sloppy."],["请勿更改没有错误的句子。请添加一个新的更自然的翻译。","提交工作内容之前请仔细检查，这里有疏忽的地方。"]],["naked","'neikid","a. 裸体的, 无装饰的, 无保护的, 赤贫的\\n[医] 裸露的",["My little brother ran through the living room stark naked.","You can see the stars with your naked eye, and even better through a telescope."],["我弟弟全身光溜溜地跑過客廳。","你可以用肉眼觀星，用望遠鏡的話，還能看得更清楚。"]],["economics",".i:kә'nɒmiks","n. 经济学\\n[经] 经济学",["Excuse me, do you know where the economics department library is?","He studies economics at university."],["不好意思，请问你知道经济学部图书馆在哪里吗？","他在大學讀經濟學。"]],["anticipate","æn'tisipeit","vt. 预期, 占先, 加速, 提前使用\\n[医] 提前出现, 先期发生",["I anticipate that there will be trouble.","We do not anticipate their buying a new car."],["我預料會有麻煩。","我們認為他們不會買新車。"]],["nut","nʌt","n. 坚果, 核心, 螺帽\\n[计] Novell NetWare服务器实用程序",["The London to Amsterdam flight was partially powered with a mixture of coconut and babassu nut oil.","Nuts are round, but not everything that's round is a nut."],["倫敦飛往阿姆斯特丹的航班部分動力來自椰子油和巴巴蘇堅果油的混合物。","堅果是圓的，但不是光是圓的就是堅果。"]],["legacy","'legәsi","n. 祖先传下来之物, 遗赠物\\n[经] 遗产, 遗赠物",["The 19th-century European colonization of Africa has left a lasting legacy all over the continent.","In a conversation with my professor, it became clear to me that the legacy of this poet deserves greater regard."],["",""]],["extension","ik'stenʃәn","n. 延长, 扩充, 范围, 扩展名\\na. 伸缩的\\n[计] 扩展名, 扩充名",["Grace goes upstairs to the extension telephone.","The extension of summer vacation delighted the children."],["格雷斯去樓上的分機電話。",""]],["shrug","ʃrʌg","n. 耸肩\\nv. 耸肩",["With a shrug and some sorrow, Europeans bid 'Adieu' to EU member Britain."],[""]],["battery","'bætәri","n. 电池, 殴打\\n[化] 蓄电池",["The car won't start because the battery has run down.","This man is like a filthy electronic without a battery."],["车发动不了因为电池没电了。","这个男人简直像一台被扯掉了电源的肮脏电器。"]],["arrival","ә'raivl","n. 到达, 抵达, 到达者\\n[经] 到达, 到达物",["Ladies and gentlemen, due to an accident at the airport, our arrival will be delayed.","With the arrival of winter, leaves fall from the trees."],["女士們，先生們，由於機場的意外情況，我們的著陸將被推遲。","树上的叶子随着冬天的到来而掉落。"]],["legitimate","li'dʒitimәt","a. 合法的, 正当的, 婚生的\\nvt. 认为正当, 立为嫡嗣, 使合法",["We consider it the citizens' legitimate right to have public libraries.","The Mafia uses legitimate business operations as a front."],["",""]],["orientation",".ɒ:rien'teiʃәn","n. 定方位, 适应, 向东方\\nn. 方向\\n[计] 方向",["Children are quick to gain orientation to new circumstances.","We will have a period of orientation for freshmen."],["",""]],["inflation","in'fleiʃәn","n. 胀大, 夸张, 通货膨胀\\n[化] 充气吹胀; 膨胀",["The value of the dollar declines as the rate of inflation rises.","Interest rates and inflation were high."],["随着通货膨胀的发展美元贬值了。","利率和通货膨胀很高。"]],["cope","kәup","vi. 竞争, 应付\\nn. 长袍",["The Japanese government can't cope with the problem.","The problem is how we cope with the present difficulties."],["日本政府无法管理问题。","问题是我们如何应付目前的困难。"]],["flame","fleim","n. 火焰, 火舌, 热情, 光辉\\nvt. 焚烧, 用火焰给...灭菌, 用火焰传送(信号), 点燃, 激动\\nvi. 燃烧, 爆发, …",["After, cook it on a low flame for 30 minutes and you're done.","Potassium, heated with a Bunsen burner, gives the flame a lilac color."],["然後用慢火煮約三十分鐘即成。","用本生燈加熱鉀，火焰就會呈現淡紫色。"]],["cluster","'klʌstә","n. 串, 丛, 群, 簇\\nvi. 成串, 丛生\\nvt. 使聚集\\n[计] 簇",["The farmland was open and flat, except for the solitary house in a cluster of trees.","The cluster of cells continued to grow in the laboratory."],["",""]],["dependent","di'pendәnt","n. 依赖他人者\\na. 依赖的, 从属的",["She is dependent on her parents even after her marriage.","This is obviously dependent on the relationship..."],["她婚后仍然依赖父母。","这明显就是靠关系..."]],["wound","wu:nd","n. 创伤, 伤口, 伤疤, 伤害, 痛苦\\nvt. 伤害, 损害, 使受伤\\nvi. 打伤, 伤害\\nwind的过去式和过去分词",["He cleansed the wound before putting on a bandage.","Whenever he moved, the wound sent pains all along his arm."],["他先清洗了伤口，再绑上绷带。","他只要一动, 伤口就连带整个胳膊都疼。"]],["shower","'ʃauә","n. 阵雨, 淋浴, 一阵, 展出者, 显示者\\nvi. 淋浴, 下阵雨\\nvt. 淋湿, 倾注",["By the shower of time, people have forgotten this event.","As I returned from school yesterday, I was caught in a sudden shower."],["在時間的洗禮下，這事件已經被人們遺忘。","昨天我在放学回家的路上突然遇上了一阵大雨。"]],["depict","di'pikt","vt. 描述, 描写",["I'm not a poet; I couldn't write a single line to depict its beauty.","Meanwhile, we depict aliens doing really weird stuff."],["我不是诗人，无法用一行文字描绘它的美丽。",""]],["institutional",".insti'tju:ʃәnәl","a. 制度的, 公共机构的, 学会的\\n[法] 组织机构的, 制度的, 公共机构的",["I still need to pay the institutional membership dues or we won't get free registration to the conference.","The Bangladesh Armed Forces have inherited the institutional framework of the British military and the British Indian Army."],["",""]],["operating","'ɔpәreitiŋ","a. 操作的, 工作的, 营业上的, 业务的, 关于收支的, 关于损益的, 外科手术的\\n[机] 运转费用",["Linux is a free operating system; you should try it.","I didn't like the interface of that operating system."],["Linux是一个免费的操作系统。你应该去试用一下。","我不喜欢这个操作系统的页面。"]],["garage","gә'rɑ:ʒ. 'gærɑ:ʒ","n. 车库, 汽车修理厂, 机库\\nvt. 把车送入修车场",["Going to church doesn't make you a Christian any more than standing in a garage makes you a car.","Tom has no idea what to do with all the junk in his garage."],["去教堂參加禮拜，不會馬上就變成一個基督徒，就好像站在車房裏，不會變成一輛車一樣。","汤姆不知道拿他车库的那些废物怎么办。"]],["flesh","'fleʃ","n. 肉, 肉体, 肉欲, 人性, 亲属, 人类, 众生, 人体\\nvt. 以肉喂, 激起...的杀戳情绪, 使肥, 赋以血肉\\nvi. …",["I can only describe the terrible smell as vomit mixed with rotting flesh.","The spirit is willing, but the flesh is weak."],["我只能描述这可怕的味道像呕吐物混合着烂肉。","心有餘而力不足。"]],["operator","'ɒpәreitә","n. 操作员, 行家, 经纪人, 算子, 运算符\\n[计] 运算符",["Mary was a switchboard operator when she was younger.","The telephone operator asked the caller to hold on until a connection was made."],["瑪麗年輕時是電話接線生。","电话运营商提示来电人等候接通。"]],["instructor","in'strʌktә","n. 教员, 讲师\\n[法] 指导者, 教员, 讲师",["My driving instructor says I should be more patient.","I know an English language instructor who comes from Canada."],["我的駕駛教練說我應該更有耐心一點。","我认识一个加拿大来的英语教师。"]],["collapse","kә'læps","n. 崩溃, 倒塌, 虚脱\\nvi. 倒塌, 崩溃, 瓦解\\nvt. 使倒塌, 折叠\\n[计] 折叠",["The woman has suffered from a collapse, because she ate meat from a water buffalo.","If there's a big earthquake, the house could really collapse!"],["女人食用水牛肉導致暈厥。","若有大地震，房屋会倒塌呀！"]],["furthermore","'fә:ðә'mɒ:","adv. 此外, 而且",["Furthermore, I still don't think this a huge cultural difference.","She is not only beautiful, but also gentle and, furthermore, intelligent."],["而且，我还是认为这准不是个巨大的文化区别。",""]],["borrow","'bɒrәu","vt. 借, 借入, 借用\\nvi. 借\\n[计] 借位; 借位数",["Yesterday a friend of mine that I hadn't seen in years gave me a call out of the blue asking to borrow money.","Borrow and return, then you can borrow again. Borrow and don't return, and then the borrowing gets difficult."],["昨天一个很多年没联系的朋友突然打电话给我，问我借钱。","有借有还，再借不难。有借不还，再借就难。"]],["mortgage","'mɒ:gidʒ","n. 抵押, 约束性义务, 抵押借款\\nvt. 抵押, 以...作担保, 把...许给",["In some larger cities, people must stint on food and clothing in order to make rent or mortgage payments.","A mortgage is a kind of loan that people can use to buy a house."],["",""]],["comedy","'kɒmidi","n. 喜剧, 有趣的事情",["We were all amused with the comedy.","Love is a comedy in France, a tragedy in England, an opera in Italy, and a melodrama in Germany."],["我们都被这出喜剧逗乐了。",""]],["sanction","'sæŋkʃәn","n. 核准, 制裁, 处罚, 约束力\\nvt. 制定制裁规则, 认可, 核准, 同意",["It is necessary to obtain the sanction of the authorities to enter this building.","His father would never sanction his engagement to a girl who did not share the same religious beliefs as their family."],["必須獲得有關當局的批准才能進入這座建築物。",""]],["twelve","twelv","num. 十二, 十二个",["The handyman was supposed to arrive at twelve noon, but got stuck in a traffic jam for a few hours.","He came to Tokyo five years ago, that is to say, when he was twelve years old."],["這個工人本來應該在中午十二點到達, 但他被交通堵塞困住了幾個小時。","他在五年前，也就是十二歲的時候來了東京。"]],["civilian","si'viljәn","n. 平民, 民法专家\\na. 平民的, 百姓的, 民用的",["All oil-rich countries should be invaded and annihilated by US forces to protect their civilian populations and teach them democracy.","The war has taken a terrible toll on the civilian population."],["所有石油資源豐富的國家都應該被美國軍隊入侵並摧毀，以保護那裡的平民並向他們傳授民主。",""]],["weekly","'wi:kli","n. 周刊, 周报\\na. 每周的, 一周一次的, 周刊的\\nadv. 每周, 一周一次",["My dad gives me a weekly allowance that I use to buy comics and ice cream.","My youngest sister has piano lessons twice weekly."],["我爸爸每周给我零用钱，我会用来买漫画书和冰激凌。",""]],["habitat","'hæbitæt","n. 栖息地, 居留地, 自生地, 聚集处\\n[医] 习生地, 产地, 生境, 栖所",["Wetlands play important roles in the ecosystem in purifying water, protecting against flood and erosion, and as both a source of food and habitat for wild animals.","Koalas face several threats, including loss of habitat due to land-clearing, dog attacks and heatwaves."],["湿地在生态系统中扮演着净化水源、防止洪水和侵蚀、为野生动物提供食物和栖息地的重要角色。",""]],["grain","grein","n. 谷粒, 颗粒, 谷类, 纹理, 本质\\nv. (使)成谷粒",["As usual the peasants are busy scattering grain seeds.","Rye was called the grain of poverty."],["農民們如常在忙著播種。","黑麦被称为贫穷的谷物。"]],["brush","brʌʃ","n. 刷子, 毛笔, 争吵\\nvt. 刷\\nvi. 擦过, 掠过\\n[计] 电刷",["She studied abroad in order to brush up her English.","Most people brush their teeth at least two times a day."],["她在國外學習以便提升她的英語。","多数人每天至少刷两次牙。"]],["consciousness","'kɒnʃәsnis","n. 意识, 知觉, 自觉\\n[医] (有)意识, 清醒",["He lost consciousness under the influence of the anesthetic.","It was I who found her. She'd lost consciousness, so I carried her to the infirmary."],["在麻醉剂的作用下，他昏了过去。","是我发现她的。她当时已经失去了意识，所以我把她送到了疗养院。"]],["devote","di'vәut","vt. 投入于, 献身",["I intend to devote a few hours a day to the study of English.","She seems to devote all her effects to her career."],["我打算每天花幾個小時來學英文。","她似乎把自己所有的精力都投入到了事业上。"]],["measurement","'meʒәdmәnt","n. 尺寸, 度量, 度量单位\\n[计] 度量, 度量单位",["In the imperial measurement system, four quarts equals one gallon.","That can't be. It must be an error in measurement."],["",""]],["province","'prɒvins","n. 省, 地方, 职权, 领域\\n[法] 省, 地方, 领域",["Zhejiang Province is located on the southeastern coast of China and belongs to the East China region.","Hangzhou is the provincial capital of Zhejiang Province."],["浙江省地处中国东南沿海，隶属于华东地区。","杭州是浙江省的省会。"]],["ease","i:z","n. 安乐, 安逸, 悠闲\\nvt. 使安乐, 使安心, 减轻, 放松\\nvi. 减轻, 放松, 灵活地移动",["If symptoms do not ease after taking Suxiao Jiuxin Pills, take nitroglycerin immediately.","My mind is at ease believing you'll keep the secret."],["如果服用速效救心丸后症状并未缓解，请立即服用硝酸甘油。","我十分安心，因為我知道你會保守秘密。"]],["seize","si:z","vt. 抓住, 逮捕, 俘获, 没收, 扣押, 掌握\\nvi. 突然抓住, 利用",["We never know when adventure will step into our lives, but when it does, we must seize it.","She will seize us, and, instead of finding happiness, we shall perish, and all for nothing."],["",""]],["ethics","'eθiks","n. 道德规范\\n[医] 伦理学",["The senator was censured by the congressional ethics committee.","A great many people were opposed to gene therapy in terms of ethics."],["议员受到了议会道德委员会的谴责。",""]],["nomination",".nɒmi'neiʃәn","n. 提名, 任命, 提名权",["She won an Oscar nomination for best supporting actress.","Ziri's performance earned him a Golden Globe nomination."],["",""]],["permission","pә'miʃәn","n. 许可, 允许\\n[计] 许可, 认可",["The teacher granted me permission to go home early.","A man who asks his wife's permission before taking any action except breathing is a henpecked husband."],["老師允許我提前回家。","一個除了呼吸之外做任何事之前都要經過老婆同意的男人是一個怕老婆的男人。"]],["wise","waiz","a. 明智的, 慎虑的, 聪明的, 博学的, 狡猾的, 机灵的\\nvi. 知道\\nvt. 教导, 告诉, 劝导\\nn. 方法, 方式\\n[…",["Religion is regarded by the common people as true, by the wise as false, and by the rulers as useful.","One idiot can ask more questions than ten wise men can answer."],["宗教在一般人的眼中是真理，在智者的眼中是謊言，而在統治者的眼中則是一種工具。","一個傻瓜問出的問題，能多到連十個智者都顧不及回答。"]],["summit","'sʌmit","n. 顶点, 最高阶层, 最高级会议\\na. 政府首脑的, 最高级的",["The summit of Mt. Fuji was covered in snow.","When I reached the summit, I was thoroughly worn out."],["富士山顶盖满了雪。",""]],["actress","'æktris","n. 女演员",["Her mind is filled with dreams of becoming an actress.","Besides being an actress, she was a famous painter."],["她心中充滿了成為女演員的夢想。","她不但是一个演员，她还曾是一个著名的画家。"]],["gifted","'giftid","a. 有天才的",["Some people are gifted with the ability to iron out difficulties while others are born trouble makers.","Blind be he whoever portrayed you yet did not paint that birthmark of yours gifted by Venus herself."],["",""]],["acid","'æsid","n. 酸, 酸类物质, 尖刻, 迷幻药\\na. 酸的, 酸性的, 尖刻的, 敏锐的\\n[计] 自动文档互参与索引生成程序",["The decay of the shrine is due, in part, to acid rain.","Acid rain in drinking water affects human health."],["廟宇的毀壞有一部分要歸因於酸雨。","飲用水中的酸雨影響人類的健康。"]],["odds","ɒdz","n. 可能性, 几率, 机会, 胜算, 不平等",["Those two departments are sometimes at odds with each other.","He put up a brave and lone struggle, but up against such heavy odds he couldn't get his business plan accepted."],["那两个部门有时候意见相左。","他英勇地孤军奋战，但面对如此强弱悬殊的局面，他的商业计划无法得到接受。"]],["frustration","frʌs'treiʃәn","n. 挫折, 顿挫\\n[医] 挫折",["People react to the frustration in much the same way.","His Borgesian short stories reflected the frustration of the younger generation."],["",""]],["medium","'mi:diәm","n. 媒体, 方法, 媒介\\na. 半生熟的, 中间的\\n[计] 媒体, 中",["One of my suitcases is large, and the other one is medium.","And even outside these nations, English is perhaps more widely used as a medium of international communication than any other language."],["我的手提包，一只是大的，另一只是中号的。","甚至在這些國家以外，英語也許比其他任何語言更廣泛地被使用來當作國際交流的媒介。"]],["physically","'fizikli","adv. 按自然规律, 完全地, 实际上, 真正地, 身体上地",["Generally speaking, men are physically stronger than women.","Tom was there physically, but not mentally."],["一般说来，男生的肌肉比女生发达。","汤姆人在心不在。"]],["shore","ʃɒ:","n. 海岸, 海滨, 斜撑柱\\nvt. 把...送上岸, 支撑, 支持",["Now, get off the boat and swim to shore.","Three soldiers who came back from the war are renting a house at the edge of a small town on the shore of the Inland Sea and live together."],["现在下船，游到岸边。","三个退伍军人在内海一个小镇边上租了一套房子，并生活在一起。"]],["repeatedly","ri'pi:tidli","adv. 重复地, 再三地",["I can't believe you are eating something the doctor has told you repeatedly you shouldn't eat.","I'm tossing and turning, repeatedly thinking about what happened today, deeply remorseful."],["真的不敢相信你在吃医生叮嘱不要食用的东西。","我辗转反侧，反复思考着白天发生的事，后悔不已。"]],["distinguish","dis'tiŋgwiʃ","v. 区别, 辨别",["Only with wisdom can one distinguish between good and evil; only with humility can one build a happy life.","It is impossible to distinguish one from the other."],["有智慧才能分辨善惡邪正；有謙虛才能建立美滿人生。","無法把兩者區分開來。"]],["lung","lʌŋ","n. 肺, 肺脏, 空地\\n[医] 肺",["Smokers are far more likely to develop lung cancer than non-smokers are.","On the weekend, our whole family went to eat Sichuan food and ordered mapo tofu and husband-and-wife lung slices."],["吸煙的人患上肺癌的風險比不吸煙的人高得多。","週末我們全家去吃四川菜，點了麻婆豆腐和夫妻肺片。"]],["artistic","ɑ:'tistik","a. 艺术的, 艺术家的, 富有艺术性的",["In addition, she has an artistic flair.","He was raised in an artistic family."],["此外，她有艺术家天赋。","他在艺术世家长大。"]],["running","'rʌniŋ","n. 赛跑, 流出, 运转\\na. 流动的, 跑着的, 连续的",["He came back not because he was homesick, but because he was running short of money.","This car is running less smoothly than it used to."],["他不是因為想家，而是因為沒錢才回來的。","這輛車沒有以前跑得那麼順暢了。"]],["discourse","'diskɒ:s","n. 谈话, 演讲\\nvi. 谈话, 讲述",["In their discourse after dinner, they talked about politics.","The discourse of the Likud is becoming much more racist."],["",""]],["distinct","dis'tiŋkt","a. 清楚的, 显著的, 不同的",["Europe, with its four distinct seasons, is the most suitable environment for the human race to live in.","Those two ideas are quite distinct."],["歐洲四季分明，是最適合人類居住的地區。","这完全是两个不同的观点。"]],["basket","'bɑ:skit","n. 篮, 篮子\\nvt. 装入篮",["Tom put the large picnic basket on the passenger seat next to him.","There are some apples in the basket."],["汤姆把那个大野餐篮子放在他旁边的乘客座位上。","籃子裡有一些蘋果。"]],["ah","ɑ:","interj. 啊, 哈",["Ah, I forgot to ask. Before you said you hadn't seen the umbrella. Have you found it since?","Ah no. It's not as though I always have everything."],["对了，前些时间你说伞不见了，现在找到了吗？",""]],["fighting","'faitiŋ","a. 战斗的, 容易引起争斗的, 适于格斗的, 好斗的, 好战的, 斗争的, 搏斗的\\nn. 战斗, 斗争, 搏斗",["The president called on the people to unite in fighting poverty and disease.","Fighting with your friends can really hurt your feelings."],["總統呼籲全國民眾在對抗貧窮或疾病的時候，一定要團結一致。","与朋友吵架是件很伤感情的事。"]],["impressive","im'presiv","a. 给人深刻印象的, 威严的",["You've both been very impressive today. I'm proud of you.","Unless it's something fairly impressive, I won't remember it."],["今天你们俩很让人印象深刻。我为你们感到骄傲。",""]],["competitor","kәm'petitә","n. 竞争者\\n[经] 竞争者, 竞争对手",["The circulation of the newspaper is only one-third that of its competitor.","Several years ago, in the course of being interviewed for a job, I was introduced to a competitor for the position."],["",""]],["powder","'paudә","n. 粉, 粉末, 火药\\nvt. 搽粉于, 搽粉, 撒粉, 使成粉末\\nvi. 搽粉, 变成粉末",["I mixed milk and chocolate powder together and then added water.","Add the flour, salt, baking powder and mashed bananas, and work into a dough."],["",""]],["worried","'wʌrid","a. 担心的, 闷闷不乐的",["He'll never show it, but I think that deep down, he's seriously worried.","She was worried that she might be late for the train."],["他雖然擺着一副若無其事的樣子，但是我想他心裏一定擔心得不得了。","她擔心她趕不上火車。"]],["ugly","'ʌgli","a. 丑陋的, 邪恶的, 险恶的, 不祥的\\nn. 丑陋的人(或物)",["Do not wait until everyone says that you are ugly before realising that you really are ugly.","Beautiful, ugly, rich, poor, strong, and weak are examples of adjectives."],["不要等到人人都說你醜時才發現自己真的醜。","美丽、丑陋、富有、贫穷、强壮和虚弱都是形容词。"]],["portray","pɒ:'trei","vt. 描绘, 描写, 描绘...的肖像",["In this film they both portray notorious gang leaders.","I still can't work out what the artist intended to portray."],["",""]],["moderate","'mɒdәrәt","a. 适度的, 稳健的, 中等的, 节制的\\nvt. 节制, 减轻, 使缓和\\nvi. 变缓和, 主持会议",["Moderate exercise will refresh both mind and body.","Moderate exercise is necessary for good health."],["适度的运动让身心焕然一新。","適度運動對身體健康是必要的。"]],["persuade","pә'sweid","vt. 劝, 使相信, 恳求, 敦促, 说服\\nvi. 劝服, 被说服",["I had a hard time trying to persuade him to cancel the trip.","It's no use trying to persuade her."],["说服他中止旅行真是件苦差事。","試圖勸她是沒有用的。"]],["ghost","gәust","n. 鬼, 灵魂, 幻影, 一丝, 一点\\nv. 鬼似地游荡",["We reached our destination just as I thought the car was going to give up the ghost.","When I saw the ghost, I was so frightened that my hair stood on end."],["我們抵達目的地的時候，我還以為那輛車快要報廢了。","看到鬼的時候，我嚇得汗毛直豎。"]],["subsequent","'sʌbsikwәnt","a. 后来的, 接下去的\\n[经] 后来的",["Subsequent constitutional reforms restored relative political stability.","Knowledge has been passed down to subsequent generation."],["",""]],["continued","kәn'tinju:d","a. 继续的, 延续的\\n[医] 连续的",["The doctor continued to observe the patient's behavior.","Tom cleared his throat and continued to speak."],["醫生繼續觀察病人的一舉一動。","汤姆咳嗽了一下然后接着讲。"]],["cookie","'kuki","n. 饼干, 小甜点\\n[建] 糕点",["I think Cookie got into something he wasn't supposed to.","Tom thought Cookie would be a good name for his dog."],["我覺得曲奇捲入了不該捲入的事。","汤姆认为“小饼干”这个名字很适合他的狗。"]],["cooking","'kukiŋ","n. 烹饪\\n[化] 熬炼; 热炼; 蒸煮",["My father participated in a cooking contest and came in first.","She's what you call a \"delinquent mom,\" but she's good at cooking, and most importantly, she's a really caring parent."],["我爸爸参加了料理竞赛并得了第一名。","她就是你所謂的「年輕媽媽」，但是她的廚藝不錯，最重要的是，她非常關心孩子。"]],["carrier","'kæriә","n. 运送者, 邮递员, 带菌者\\n[计] 载波",["Impure drinking water can be a carrier of diseases.","Written words, carrier pigeons, the telegraph, and many other devices carried ideas faster and faster from man to man."],["",""]],["frequent","'fri:kwәnt","a. 时常发生的, 频繁的, 快速的\\nvt. 时常来访, 常常聚集, 常与...交往",["Fiona's letters were becoming less and less frequent.","The use of trust-region algorithms is becoming more and more frequent."],["Fiona的信件越來越少。","信赖域的算法越来越常用。"]],["ban","bæn","n. 禁令\\nvt. 禁止, 取缔",["Germany is to ban employers from snooping on Facebook.","While video platforms do not explicitly ban such content, works of this type will have their traffic restricted."],["德国将禁止雇主在脸书上偷窥。","虽然视频平台没有明确禁止此类内容，但这种类型的作品的流量会被限制。"]],["awful","'ɒ:ful","a. 可怕的, 庄严的, 虔敬的",["I don't recommend eating in that restaurant. The food is awful.","I had an awful experience today, so I'm going to have a beer and go straight to bed."],["我不推荐在那家餐馆吃饭。食物糟糕透了。","今天糟糕透了，所以我准备去喝一杯就直接上床。"]],["admire","әd'maiә","vt. 赞美, 钦佩, 爱慕\\nvi. 称赞, 惊奇",["I wholeheartedly admire your understanding of Chinese.","The school's lovely cherry blossoms drew a lot of residents to come and admire it."],["我真的很佩服你的汉语水平。","学校的樱花开的烂漫，吸引了大量市民前来观赏。"]],["pet","pet","n. 宠物, 受宠爱的人, 宠坏的孩子, 不悦, 生气\\na. 宠爱的, 表示亲昵的, 养着观赏的, 特别珍爱的, 格外的\\nvt. 宠爱…",["The American government has always regarded England as America's house pet.","Bigfoot is not a pet. For one thing, they don't like being called 'bigfoot'."],["美国政府一直视英国为美国的宠物。","大腳怪並非寵物。首先，他們並不喜歡被人叫做「大腳怪」。"]],["miracle","'mirәkl","n. 奇迹, 奇事",["All Sadako could do now was to make paper cranes and hope for a miracle.","Love is the miracle of civilization."],["今祯子当时能做的就是折纸鹤并期盼奇迹。","愛是文明的奇蹟。"]],["rhythm","'riðәm","n. 旋律, 节奏, 韵律, 匀称, 张弛节律\\n[医] 节律",["I like this song. It has a nice rhythm and is danceable.","The rhythm is light, and the tempo fast - that song is liked by young people."],["",""]],["exceed","ik'si:d","vt. 超过, 超越, 胜过\\nvi. 超过其他",["We're sorry, Ami, but you can't be part of our group because it would... you know... exceed the 5-people-per-group limit.","This year, the number of conference participants from China will exceed the number from the United States."],["我们很抱歉，Ami，但是你不能加入我们的小组因为..你知道的...小组成员不能超过五个人。",""]],["widespread","'waidspred","a. 充分伸展的, 广布的, 普及的, 流传广的",["The jury's guilty verdict gave rise to widespread debate.","There is a widespread opinion that all study of the mode of oratory is unmanly, and leads to the substitution of artifice and adornment for simplicity and power."],["陪审团作出的犯罪判决激起了很大的争论。","有一種普遍的看法認為，一切對演說方式的研究都是有損男子氣概的，都會以雕飾與浮華取代質樸與力量。"]],["killing","'kiliŋ","n. 谋杀, 杀戮\\na. 杀害的, 疲惫的, 迷人的",["When her husband died, she felt like killing herself.","The volcano erupted suddenly, killing many people."],["她丈夫去世時，她想自殺。","火山突然喷发，造成了多人死亡。"]],["lovely","'lʌvli","a. 可爱的, 有趣的",["The school's lovely cherry blossoms drew a lot of residents to come and admire it.","Jane is fat and rude, and smokes too much. However, Ken thinks she's lovely and charming. That's why they say love is blind."],["学校的樱花开的烂漫，吸引了大量市民前来观赏。","Jane 又胖、又沒禮貌、又煙不離手，可是 Ken 卻覺得她可愛、動人，所謂「愛情是盲目的」，大概就是這個意思了吧。"]],["sin","sin","n. 罪, 犯罪, 过失, 失礼\\nv. 犯",["As with everything else, there's something beautiful in sin.","And the Devil did grin, for his darling sin is pride that apes humility."],["",""]],["script","skript","n. 手迹, 手稿, 正本, 手写体\\nvt. 改编为演出本\\n[计] 手写体, 小型程序",["Overall, the movie was a success from script to screen.","Today I watched a play of a script written by a friend."],["总的来说，这部电影从剧本到银幕是成功的。",""]],["charity","'tʃæriti","n. 慈悲, 博爱, 慈善团体, 施舍\\n[法] 宽大, 宽恕, 慈善机关",["Tom donates half his salary to his favorite charity.","Whenever I get a large sum of money, I donate some of it to charity."],["汤姆捐一半他的薪水给他最喜欢的慈善机构。","我一得到一大笔钱就捐一部分给慈善机构。"]],["tactic","'tæktik","n. 一项战术, 一条策略\\na. 战术的, 顺序的, 排列的",["Elon Musk embodies the conservative propaganda tactic of calling everyone who crosses you a pedophile.","Racial profiling is a controversial police tactic."],["伊隆馬斯克將「凡是與你作對的人都是戀童癖」這一保守派慣用的抹黑手法發揮得淋漓盡致。",""]],["identification","ai.dentifi'keiʃәn","n. 识别, 身份证明, 认同\\n[化] 鉴定; 鉴别; 鉴别法; 认证",["In the U.S., you usually have to show identification in order to buy alcohol.","\"May I please see your driver's license for identification?\" said the clerk."],["",""]],["transformation",".trænsfә'meiʃәn","n. 变形, 变质, 变化, 改革, 变换\\n[化] 转化; 变换",["Transformation is birth and death at the same time.","Neglecting the transformation would mean dropping all the assumptions on which this technique is founded."],["改变同时蕴含着新生与毁灭。",""]],["everyday","'evri'dei","a. 每天的, 日常的, 平常的",["Both victory and defeat are but an everyday occurrence to a soldier.","In order to make life happy, you must love the everyday trifles."],["胜败是兵家常事。","熱愛生活中的日常瑣事，人生才會快樂。"]],["turkey","'tә:ki","n. 火鸡, 无用的家伙, 土耳其",["She's vegetarian, so she ate tofu instead of turkey.","Mary tied an apron around her waist and then took the turkey out of the oven."],["她是素食者，所以她沒吃火雞，而是吃了豆腐。","玛丽把围裙系在她的腰上，然后把火鸡从烤箱里拿出来了。"]],["headline","'hedlain","n. 大标题, 新闻摘要\\nvt. 为...做标题, 写标题",["The headline caught my eye this morning.","The headline in the newspaper today shocked everyone in the city."],["大标题今天早上吸引了我的注意。",""]],["venture","'ventʃә","n. 冒险, 风险\\nvt. 敢于, 冒...的危险\\nvi. 冒险",["They came to terms with each other on how to start a joint venture.","My uncle says he's about to embark on a new business venture."],["",""]],["invasion","in'veiʒәn","n. 侵犯, 侵入, 侵害\\n[医] 侵袭, 侵入, 发病",["Tatoeba: As if the geek invasion wasn't enough.","Christopher Columbus was the spearhead of the biggest invasion and genocide ever seen in the history of humanity."],["Tatoeba:好像怪客入侵還不夠似的。",""]],["adequate","'ædikwәt","a. 适当的, 足够的\\n[法] 胜任的, 适当的, 充分的",["With adequate lighting, one can easily discern Nosferatu, with his pointed incisors and extremely long-limbed fingers, known as arachnodactyly, from common vampires.","We need not only adequate water but clean water."],["在光線充足的情況下，諾斯費拉圖與普通吸血鬼很容易區分。諾斯費拉圖有著尖銳的門牙，以及極為修長的手指，即所謂的蜘蛛指。","我們不僅需要充足的水，還需要乾淨的水。"]],["nonetheless",",nʌnðә'les","conj. 然而, 尽管, 不过\\nadv. 不过, 仍然, 尽管如此, 然而",["Carrefour's Ham offcuts are not expensive at all, but are nonetheless delicious.","Whoever may oppose my plan, I will carry it out nonetheless."],["家乐福的火腿剩料一点都不贵，然而却很好吃。",""]],["piano","pi'ɑ:nәu","n. 钢琴",["My fingers are so numb with cold that I can't play the piano.","She gives most of her spare time to playing the piano."],["我的手指冻僵了，以至于无法弹钢琴了。","她把大部分的空餘時間都花在彈鋼琴上。"]],["intensity","in'tensәti","n. 强烈, 紧张, 强度\\n[计] 强度; 亮度",["Being without the intensity of density is a nonsensity.","We were shocked by the intensity of our mother's anger."],["",""]],["grocery","'grәusәri","n. 食品杂货店, 食品杂货业",["Please buy some blood oranges at the grocery store.","Bob worked as a clerk in the grocery store on Saturday."],["請在雜貨店買一些血橙。","每周六鲍勃在杂货店做店员。"]],["quarterback","'kwɒ:tәbæk","n. 四分卫\\nvi. 担任四分卫",["Tom plays quarterback on our high school's football team.","The star quarterback congratulated Adriano on his performance."],["",""]],["exhibit","ig'zibit","n. 显示, 显现, 展览品, 陈列品, 展览\\nvt. 展现, 陈列, 展览\\nvi. 开展览会",["I'm going to exhibit my roses at the flower show.","A qipao in the traditional style is made entirely by hand and requires labour-intensive manual tailoring techniques to enhance and exhibit every unique female form."],["我要把我的玫瑰拿到花展上展示。","一件传统式样的旗袍是完全手工制作的，也需要劳动密集的裁缝业技术，为了增加而显示每种独一无二的女性体态。"]],["mouse","maus","n. 老鼠, 胆小羞怯的人, 鼠标\\nvi. 捕鼠, 窥探\\nvt. 探出\\n[计] 鼠标",["A dog runs after a cat, and the cat after a mouse.","That person's so stingy that he won't even let the mouse have the chaff."],["狗追猫，猫追鼠。","那个人那么小气，连谷壳都不让老鼠吃。"]],["blanket","'blæŋkit","n. 毛毯, 毯子\\nvt. 掩盖, 覆盖\\na. 总共的",["Please take the pillow and blanket and give them to me.","Mom took the blanket along with the bedsheet to wash."],["請把枕頭和毯子拿給我。","媽媽把被單連同床單一起拿去洗了。"]],["margin","'mɑ:dʒin","n. 页边的空白, 边缘, 界限, 余裕, 差数, 差额, 保证金\\nvt. 加边于, 加旁注于\\n[计] 页边距",["The distributors are asking for an exceptional margin.","The company decided to skimp on the quality of its products to boost the profit margin."],["",""]],["rope","rәup","n. 绳, 索, 粗绳, 绞索, 决窍\\nvt. 捆, 缚, 绑, 圈起, 以绳将...系住\\nvi. 拧成绳状",["I told her not to let go of the rope, but she did.","The rope broke when we were climbing the mountain."],["我叫她不要松开绳子，但是她做了。","我們爬山的時候繩子斷了。"]],["concrete","'kɒnkri:t","n. 凝结物, 混凝土\\na. 具体的, 实在的, 混凝土的\\nv. (使)凝结, 用混凝土浇筑",["He was only bothered about concrete questions.","Great! Is the apartment bought as a concrete shell, or is it ready to move into?"],["他一向只关心具体问题。","太棒了！是毛坯房还是装修房？"]],["prescription","pri'skripʃәn","n. 处方, 命令, 指定\\n[医] 处方, 药方",["You can't buy this medicine without a prescription.","You cannot purchase this medicine without a prescription."],["那个药的话没有处方是买不到的。","那个药的话没有处方是买不到的。"]],["chase","tʃeis","n. 追求, 狩猎, 追逐\\nvt. 追捕, 追逐, 雕刻, 在...上镶嵌宝石\\nvi. 追赶, 奔跑",["We all knew that Bob was on a wild-goose chase after Marge, because she was already happily engaged.","The patrol car pursued a speeding sports car, but it all ended in a wild-goose chase."],["",""]],["recruit","ri'kru:t","n. 新兵, 新手, 新会员, 补给品\\nvt. 恢复, 补充, 充实, 征募\\nvi. 征募新兵, 复原, 得到补充",["The plan is to recruit 5 Java engineers before the end of next month.","The papers found lots of monkey business when they investigated the Recruit scandal."],["计划是在下月底之前招聘5名Java工程师。",""]],["brick","brik","n. 砖块, 积木\\na. 用砖做的\\nvt. 用砖造, 用砖砌",["Put your hard hat on. You might well get a brick fall on your head here.","A cold wave of fear hit me like a brick."],["把安全帽戴上。這裡很可能會有磚塊砸到你頭上。","一陣寒意像磚頭一樣擊中了我。"]],["patch","pætʃ","n. 片, 补缀, 碎片, 斑, 傻瓜\\nvt. 补缀, 掩饰, 拼凑, 平息\\n[计] 修补; 拼凑",["The Sargasso Sea is a vast patch of ocean named for a genus of free-floating seaweed called Sargassum.","Apparently, they're trying to patch up their marriage."],["馬尾藻海是一片廣闊的海域，因一種名為「馬尾藻」的自由漂浮海藻而得名。",""]],["consensus","kәn'sensәs","n. 合意, 一致, 同感\\n[计] 合意",["Just what time period is \"Hong Fan\" a product of? Although people have debated this issue for ages, there is still no clear consensus to this day.","The consensus indicates that we are opposed to the proposed idea."],["《洪范》到底是什么时代的作品, 千百年来人们见仁见智, 至今仍无定论。",""]],["horror","'hɒrә","n. 惊骇, 恐怖, 惨状\\n[医] 恐怖, 恐惧",["Psycho-horror films dealing with the mysteries of human psychology are popular these days.","A scary horror movie is only a movie. Once you turn off the screen it's all over, but life...you're stuck in it."],["這幾年有關心理之謎的心理恐怖片很熱門。","多恐怖的恐怖電影，也只不過是一部電影；你把熒幕關掉，就甚麼事也沒有了。可是人生……你想躲也躲不掉。"]],["recording","ri'kɒ:diŋ","a. 记录的, 记录用的\\nn. 录音",["A telephone recording tells you what time the concert starts.","Please play it back for me after you've finished the recording."],["",""]],["changing","'tʃeindʒiŋ","v. 交换；兑换；改变（change的ing形式）",["People should understand that the world is changing.","I considered changing my job, but in the end I decided not to."],["人应该明白世界在变。","我考慮過要不要換工作，但是我最終還是決定不要那樣做。"]],["colonial","kә'lәunjәl","a. 殖民的, 殖民地的\\n[法] 殖民地居民",["Gandhi's strategy of civil disobedience only worked because of colonial India's racial homogeneity versus its British overlords.","Besides Arabic, Turkish, and Persian, the colonial languages of English and French remain in use."],["",""]],["painter","'peintә","n. 画家, 油漆匠\\n[机] 油漆匠, 喷漆匠",["He is a painter, but he can't paint in the traditional Chinese style.","He's a painter, but he doesn't do traditional Chinese painting."],["他是个画家，但他不会画国画。","他是个画家，但他不会画国画。"]],["pie","pai","n. 馅饼, 财富, 总额, 贪污受贿, 杂乱, 喜鹊\\n[计] 饼图",["I watched as my grandmother pulled a golden butter pie from the oven.","Luciano, the underdog in the match, will be trying to make the champ eat humble pie."],["我看著奶奶從烤箱裡拿出一個金黃色的奶油派。",""]],["courage","'kʌridʒ","n. 勇气, 胆量",["She had the courage to go and inquire about the results of the exam.","His courage will carry him through this difficult job."],["她有勇气去查询考试的结果。","他的勇气将帮助他度过这艰难的任务。"]],["sake","seik","n. 目的, 缘故, 理由",["The Party seeks power entirely for its own sake. We are not interested in the good of others; we are interested solely in power.","For the sake of living things, please do not play around with the water."],["党为自己的利益追求势力。我们对别人不体贴；我们只追求势力。","关爱生命，请勿嬉水。"]],["defeat","di'fi:t","n. 败北, 失败\\nvt. 击败, 使落空",["Victory and defeat aren't solely decided by the size of your army.","Both victory and defeat are but an everyday occurrence to a soldier."],["胜败不能单靠兵力多少。","胜败是兵家常事。"]],["gaze","geiz","n. 注视, 凝视\\nvi. 注视, 凝视",["I kept gazing at her until she, totally confused, dropped her gaze.","Don't look into the abyss. Otherwise, the abyss will gaze into you."],["",""]],["pregnancy","'preɡnәnsi","n. 怀孕；丰富, 多产；意义深长",["Drinking alcohol during pregnancy can cause birth defects.","She stopped smoking on account of health concerns for her pregnancy."],["",""]],["reinforce",".ri:in'fɒ:s","vt. 加强, 增援, 补充\\nvi. 求援, 得到增援\\nn. 加固材料",["Billy's remarks reinforce the notion that non-native speakers of English will never be as proficient as native speakers.","The lack of objection will only serve to reinforce their prejudices."],["",""]],["swear","swєә","vt. 发誓, 咒骂, 使宣誓\\nvi. 发誓, 诅咒\\nn. 诅咒, 誓言",["If you swear reckless oaths, lightning will strike you.","I could swear there's something inside this box."],["乱发誓会遭雷劈的。","我能发誓这箱子里有东西。"]],["clue","klu:","n. 线索, 暗示\\nvt. 暗示, 提供线索",["The authorities have no clue, but everyone else knows.","I haven't got a clue as to why he quit so suddenly."],["旁观者清，当局者迷。","我完全不明白他為甚麼會突然辭職。"]],["slice","slais","n. 薄的切片, 一部分, 菜刀\\nvt. 切成薄片, 切下\\nvi. 切\\n[计] 片",["Slice the kale, and add it to a pan, with olive oil, garlic, salt and pepper, and wait until it is soft and tasty.","I want to slice these potatoes into strips."],["將羽衣甘藍切片，放入鍋中，加入橄欖油、大蒜、鹽和胡椒，煮至軟嫩可口。","我想把這些土豆切成絲。"]],["occupation",".ɒkju'peiʃәn","n. 职业, 占有, 占有期, 占领, 占领军\\n[经] 占有, 占用, 职业",["The \"family manager\" is a profession, occupation, vocation.","I like to do oil painting, but I don't intend to make that my lifelong occupation."],["“一家之主”是一份专业工作、事业和使命。","我喜欢画油画，但是我不想拿它做我的终身职业。"]],["confusion","kәn'fju:ʒәn","n. 混乱, 混淆, 无秩序\\n[计] 含混",["Every function should have comments describing its purpose in order to avoid confusion.","The accident caused traffic confusion."],["每一个函数都应该有描述其目的的注释以避免误解。","那場意外使交通大亂。"]],["coal","kәul","n. 煤, 木炭\\nv. 加煤",["Carbon dioxide is a gas that is produced every time a fuel such as coal, oil, or natural gas is burned.","The prices of raw materials such as oil or coal continue to rise."],["二氧化碳是燃燒煤、石油或天然氣這樣的燃料時會產生的氣體。","原材料的价格如石油或者煤的不停地上升。"]],["dear","'diә","n. 亲爱的人\\na. 亲爱的, 昂贵的, 严重的, 急迫的\\ninterj. 啊\\nadv. 深爱地, 高价地",["Please serve the guests some coffee, dear.","Dear Santa, I want a girlfriend for Christmas."],["亲爱的，给客人端点咖啡吧。","圣诞老人，我想要一个女朋友当圣诞礼物。"]],["sacred","'seikrid","a. 神圣的, 献给上帝的, 庄严的, 祭祀的\\n[法] 神圣的, 不可侵犯的",["If anything is to be called sacred, it's the human body.","A sacred ritual took place in the magnificent temple."],["如果有任何東西可以稱作神聖的，那就是人體。","一个神圣的仪式在庄严的庙宇中举行。"]],["formula","'fɒ:mjulә","n. 客套语, 公式, 准则\\n[计] 公式",["Heron's Formula shows how the area of a triangle can be expressed as a function of its side lengths.","This formula is valid for all complex numbers z with a real part greater than zero."],["海龍公式說明了三角形的面積如何表示為其邊長的函數。","此公式對所有實部大於零的複數 z 均成立。"]],["exact","ig'zækt","a. 精确的, 准确的, 精密的\\nvt. 强求, 急需",["He is honest and hard-working, but his brother is the exact opposite.","I do not understand the exact meaning of this sentence."],["他既誠實又勤勞，而他的弟弟正好相反。","我不是很清楚这个句子的意思。"]],["collective","kә'leiktiv","a. 集体的, 聚集的, 共同的\\n[医] 集体的, 集合的",["The best refutation of the imaginary Malthusian laws of \"land depletion\" is the practice of Soviet collective farming.","Collective responsibility means irresponsibility."],["對馬爾薩斯虛構的「土地耗盡」定律最有力的反駁，是蘇聯集體農場的時間。","法不责众。"]],["cognitive","'kɒgnitiv","a. 认知的, 认识的",["This psychological study investigates the cognitive factors of memory.","Her conflicting desires to consume chocolate and to lose weight resulted in her experiencing cognitive dissonance."],["",""]],["uncle","ʌŋkl","n. 叔父, 伯父, 姨丈",["My uncle kept on drinking in spite of his doctor's advice.","My parents have gone to the airport to see my uncle off."],["我叔叔不顧醫生勸阻，還是繼續喝酒。","我父母去机场送我叔叔了。"]],["attribute","ә'tribju:t","n. 属性, 标志, 定语\\nvt. 把...归于, 认为...属于\\n[计] 属性",["It's not fair to attribute your failure to your parents.","Never attribute to malice that which is adequately explained by stupidity."],["把你的失败归咎于你的父母是不对的。","能解釋為愚蠢的，就不要解釋為惡意。"]],["captain","'kæptin","n. 船长, 指挥官, 海军上校, 首领\\nvt. 率领, 指挥",["Between you and me, I don't like our new team captain.","The captain is responsible for the safety of passengers."],["我就只告诉你，我不喜欢我们的新队长。","船长要为乘客安全负责。"]],["dare","dєә","n. 挑战, 挑动, 大胆\\nv. 敢, 胆敢",["Tom wouldn't dare show his face around here again.","Because of his score of zero, he didn't dare to return."],["汤姆不敢再到这里露面。","因為考了零分，所有不敢回去。"]],["sigh","sai","n. 叹息\\nvi. 叹息, 渴望\\nvt. 叹息着说",["His humor charmingly eased the embarrassing atmosphere at dinner time and made me breathe a sigh of relief.","We all breathed a big sigh of relief."],["他的幽默巧妙地缓解了晚餐时尴尬的气氛，让我松了一口气。","我們都舒了一口長氣。"]],["homeless","'hәumlis","a. 无家的, 无养主的",["During the holiday season, the center's volunteers serve up meals-on-wheels, feeding homebound seniors and the homeless.","I often slept on that bench when I was homeless."],["假期期間，中心的志工提供「送餐到府」服務，為行動不便的長者和無家可歸者提供餐食。","当我无家可归的时候，我常在那张长椅上睡觉。"]],["soccer","'sɒkә","n. 英式足球",["My older brother is a very enthusiastic soccer fan.","This soccer match is full of energetic and splendid competition."],["我的哥哥是很狂热的足球迷。","这场足球赛充满着激情和精彩的竞争。"]],["gallery","'gælәri","n. 走廊, 最高楼座, 画廊, 收集, 图库\\n[计] 图库",["The New York Times reviews her gallery all the time.","They are going to exhibit many famous old paintings at the gallery."],["",""]],["tunnel","'tʌnl","n. 隧道, 地下道\\nvi. 挖隧道\\nvt. 掘隧道于",["At times, I felt like I was living in a fog, unable to see the light at the end of the tunnel.","The sightseeing bus ran through a long tunnel."],["有时候，我感觉自己身处迷雾之中，不知该去往何方。","觀光巴士穿過了一條長長的隧道。"]],["defendant","di'fendәnt","n. 被告\\n[经] 被告方",["The news article painted the defendant as a guilty man, even though he had been proven innocent.","The court declared the defendant innocent."],["该报文章中将被告人描述成一个罪魁祸首，尽管他已经被证明是无辜的了。","法庭宣判被告无罪。"]],["fitness","'fitnis","n. 适合, 合宜, 合理, 恰当, 健康\\n[医] 适合性, 适应性",["You can apply for a physical fitness test regardless of your age.","The physical fitness courses are required for everyone."],["",""]],["grave","greiv","n. 墓穴, 坟墓, 终结, 死亡\\na. 庄重的, 严肃的, 重大的, 低沉的\\nvt. 雕刻",["Mary had become so frail and gaunt that it seemed she already had one foot in the grave.","She carried that habit to her grave."],["玛丽早已变得太虚弱憔悴，似乎已经半截入土。","她到死都改不了那個習慣。"]],["lap","læp","n. 膝盖, 舔, 一圈, 下摆, 衣兜, 山坳\\nvi. 重叠, 围住, 轻拍, 舔\\nvt. 包围, 抱...在膝上, 使重叠, 舔,…",["Ben acted out the scene of the waitress spilling soup in his lap.","You have only to sit quietly with your hands folded in your lap."],["",""]],["toe","tәu","n. 足趾, 趾部, 脚趾\\nvt. 以趾踏触, 用脚尖走\\nvi. 动脚尖",["She stood on tip-toe and whispered something in his ear, and then went away.","He was soaking wet from head to toe."],["她踮起腳向他耳語，然後走了","他从头到脚都湿透了。"]],["container","kәn'teinә","n. 容器, 集装箱\\n[化] 集装箱; 贮存箱; 容器(任何一种)",["This food will keep for a week in an airtight container.","The container ship kept station outside the harbor until the pilot boat arrived."],["",""]],["virtue","'vә:tju:","n. 德行, 美德, 优点, 功效, 效力\\n[法] 美德, 贞操, 优点",["She became rich by virtue of hard work and good business sense.","They say fine words are no virtue if they're insincere and that's him in a nutshell. He's all talk but doesn't mean a word of it."],["她憑著努力和生意頭腦成了富翁。","「巧言令色，鮮矣仁」這句說話，用來形容他最適合不過了。他說的話，沒有一句是有誠意的。"]],["abroad","ә'brɒ:d","adv. 往国外, 到室外, 到处\\na. 往国外的, 在室外的, 广泛四散的",["It is not until you go abroad that you realize how small Japan is.","The number of people who go abroad has been increasing."],["你出國看看，才會知道日本是多麼的細小。","出国的人数一直在增加。"]],["dramatically","drә'mætikli","adv. 戏剧地, 引人注目地, 突然地",["Since the mid-20th century, the number of hutongs in Beijing has dropped dramatically as they are demolished to make way for new roads and buildings.","LED streetlights are more energy-efficient, but they dramatically increase light pollution."],["二十世纪中以后，北京胡同的数量显著地下降，因为人们把它们拆毁以便给新的楼房和街路让路。",""]],["architect","'ɑ:kitekt","n. 建筑师, 设计者, 缔造者",["Despite adversity, the architect achieved worldwide fame.","You can see that the architect paid scrupulous attention to detail."],["尽管有逆境，建筑师还是获得了享誉全球的荣誉。","這位建築師顯然是一位無微不至的建築師。"]],["makeup","'meikʌp","n. 组成, 性格, 化妆品, 化装(术), 虚构, 补考",["We're going to hire the most famous makeup artist for our cast's makeup.","You are so beautiful, you do not need to use makeup."],["我們將邀請最有名的化妝師為我們的演員化妝。","你很美, 甚至不必使用化妝品。"]],["inquiry","in'kwaiәri","n. 质询, 探索, 调查, 询盘\\n[计] 询问; 查询",["We have just received an inquiry from Kansas concerning your brother.","Every art and every inquiry seem to aim at some good."],["",""]],["surprisingly","","adv. 使人惊奇, 出人意外, 惊人, 令人惊讶",["The key is that Asuka abuses Shinji. So, rarely, Shinji flips and assaults Asuka. Then Asuka is surprisingly meek.","Surprisingly, he did his last job in one-third the time it would take me."],["",""]],["highlight","'hailait","n. 加亮区, 精彩场面\\nvt. 加亮, 使显著, 以强光照射, 突出\\n[计] 突出",["They will highlight various aspects of mobile services in Bangladesh.","The bioluminescent bay was the highlight of our trip."],["",""]],["decrease","'di:kri:s","n. 减少, 减少量\\nv. 减少",["This medicine will decrease your pain.","This figure is a mirror of the decrease in imports of crude oil."],["这种药会减轻你的疼痛。",""]],["indication",".indi'keiʃәn","n. 指示, 象征, 暗示\\n[医] 指示, 指征, 适应征",["His victory at this age in an international competition is a good indication of a bright future.","Her slurred speech was an indication that she was drunk."],["他現在這個年紀，就已經在國際比賽中取勝，前途實在無可限量。",""]],["rail","reil","n. 横杆, 围栏, 栏杆, 铁轨, 扶手, 秧鸡\\nvt. 以横木围栏, 给...铺铁轨\\nvi. 责骂, 抱怨",["The UK must improve the problems with its rail network.","Is it convenient to transfer between the subway and the light rail here?"],["英國必須改善它在鐵路網的問題。","在這裡換乘地鐵與輕軌方便嗎？"]],["anniversary","æni'vә:sәri","n. 周年纪念",["Tom never forgets to give his wife flowers on their wedding anniversary.","Next month is their 50th anniversary, and they're planning on renewing their vows."],["湯姆從沒忘記在婚禮周年紀念日送給他妻子花。","下個月是他們的五十周年紀念，他們打算重新宣誓。"]],["couch","kautʃ","n. 长沙发, 睡椅, 卧榻\\nvt. 横躺, 表达\\nvi. 躺下, 蹲伏",["A couch potato is something that I don't want to be.","My wife and I sat on the couch to watch one of our favorite shows."],["我不想成為整天泡在沙發上看電視的人。","我和老婆坐在沙发上看我俩特别喜欢看的一个节目。"]],["alliance","ә'laiәns","n. 联盟, 联合\\n[法] 同盟, 联盟, 联姻",["Japan entered into an alliance with France just before the war.","The students managed to indict the country's establishment and forged an alliance with the unions."],["",""]],["hypothesis","hai'pɒθәsis","n. 假设\\n[化] 假设",["We can now say definitely that this hypothesis holds water.","We have sufficient evidence to prove this hypothesis."],["我們現在能肯定地說，這個假設是成立的。","我們有充分的理由論證這個假設。"]],["boyfriend","'bɔifrend","n. 男朋友",["He's a very romantic boyfriend who brings me flowers each night.","I think that you should break up with your boyfriend."],["他是箇非常浪漫的男朋友，每晚都給我送花。","我觉得你应该跟男友分手。"]],["compose","kәm'pәuz","vt. 组成, 写作, 作曲, 使平静\\nvi. 创作, 排字\\n[计] 编写",["One can no more write good English than one can compose good music, merely by keeping the rules.","Rossini covered himself with several blankets while he compose his operas."],["",""]],["mess","mes","n. 食堂, 伙食, 用膳, 一份食品, 混乱, 乱七八糟, 困境\\nvt. 将...弄糟, 妨碍, 使紊乱, 使就餐\\nvi. 陷入困境…",["It's a complete mess, and it's getting on my nerves.","The principal severely reproved the students whenever they made a mess in the hallway."],["這完全一團亂，讓我心煩意亂。","每次学生把走廊弄得一团糟的时候，校长都会严厉地训斥他们。"]],["legend","'ledʒәnd","n. 传说, 传奇文学, 图例\\n[计] 图例",["President Kennedy was killed, but his legend will live on forever.","According to legend, the wood used to be haunted, so people would avoid it."],["肯尼迪总统被刺杀了，但是他的传奇会永久长存。",""]],["regulate","'regjuleit","vt. 管理, 控制, 调节, 调整, 校准\\n[经] 控制, 管理",["Traffic lights are used to regulate traffic.","During warm weather, sweating helps man regulate his body temperature."],["交通燈是用來控制交通的。",""]],["shine","ʃain","n. 光泽, 阳光\\nvt. 使发光\\nvi. 照耀, 发光, 发亮",["Whether rain or shine, I go to the park every day to run.","I make it a point to shine my shoes before I go to bed."],["不管下不下雨，我都每天去公园跑步。","我习惯在睡觉前把鞋擦亮。"]],["adolescent",".ædәu'lesәnt","a. 青春期的, 青少年的\\nn. 青少年",["Education about birth control might help cut down on adolescent pregnancies.","It is said that adolescent friendships do not often last."],["",""]],["norm","nɒ:m","n. 基准, 模范, 标准, 准则, 平均数\\n[化] 定额",["A vector is a unit vector if its norm is 1.","Her behaviour towards me was a departure from the norm."],["模为1的向量是单位向量。",""]],["upset","ʌp'set","a. 弄翻的, 混乱的, 心烦的\\nvt. 弄翻, 颠覆, 推翻, 打乱, 使不适, 使心烦\\nvi. 翻倒",["Sometimes being overcautious in planning could upset the apple cart.","Because my stomach was upset, I took a day off school."],["計劃時如果過於謹慎的話，可能會反把計劃搞亂。","因为肚子不舒服， 我请了一天假不去学校。"]],["remark","ri'mɑ:k","n. 评论, 注意\\nvt. 评论, 注意\\nvi. 评论, 谈论\\n[计] 注释",["The beginning of the trouble was his careless remark.","The remark you made at the party about Lisa's weight was totally uncalled for."],["麻煩的開頭是他草率的評論。","你在聚会中针对Lisa体重作出的评论是完全不适当的。"]],["resign","ri'zain","vt. 辞职, 放弃, 使顺从\\nvi. 辞职, 屈从",["It is rumoured that the Prime Minister will resign next month.","You should do the honorable thing and resign."],["据传总统下个月要辞职了。","你應該光榮地辭職。"]],["related","ri'leitid","a. 讲述的, 叙述的；有关系的, 有关联的",["By switching your lover from 3D to 2D, you may successfully reduce all social-interaction-related costs.","The amount of paper produced by a country is closely related to its cultural standards."],["把恋人从3D换成2D可以有效地降低交际所需的费用。","一个国家纸的产量和它的文明程度密切相关。"]],["reward","ri'wɒ:d","n. 报酬, 酬谢, 赏金\\nvt. 奖赏, 酬谢, 给...应有报应",["A reward will be paid to anyone who brings back the money that he lost.","Anyone who can recover the money he lost will receive a reward."],["凡能将他遗失的钱寻回者可得到酬金。","凡能将他遗失的钱寻回者可得到酬金。"]],["gentle","'dʒentl","a. 温和的, 文雅的",["On the country path, a gentle breeze blows, and the scent of night-blooming jasmine reminds one of childhood nights.","A gentle wind made ripples on the surface of the pond."],["鄉間小路上，微風拂過，夜來香的香味讓人想起童年的夜晚。","微風在湖面上掀起了一絲絲漣漪。"]],["organ","'ɒ:gәn","n. 风琴, 器官, 元件, 机构, 机关\\n[电] 风琴",["The lowest-tuned pipe on the organ set off barometers all over the state.","The surgeon persuaded me to undergo an organ transplant operation."],["",""]],["concerning","kәn'sә:niŋ","prep. 关于\\n[法] 关于",["Concerning this issue, I feel that the trash media only report biased information.","He is going to take charge of a project concerning the future of the company."],["关于这个问题，我觉得垃圾媒体只报道了很片面的信息。","他将要负责一个关系公司前途的项目。"]],["lightly","'laitli","adv. 轻轻地, 少许, 不费力地",["War isn't something to be done lightly, also changing the constitution isn't something that should be done because \"I just really want to go to war\".","The girls were dancing lightly like so many butterflies."],["战争不是轻易就应该开始的，所以也不能够因为像打仗就改变宪法。",""]],["laughter","'lɑ:ftә","n. 笑, 笑声\\n[医] 笑, 大笑",["The boy was not humiliated by the laughter of his classmates.","The demon grabbed my sister and, with howling laughter, cast her into a bottomless pit."],["那个男孩没有因为他同学的笑而谦卑。","惡魔一把抓住了我的妹妹，一邊猙獰地狂笑着，一邊把她丟進了一個無底洞裏。"]],["invent","in'vent","vt. 发明, 创作, 虚构\\n[机] 发明",["Don't use \"discover\" when you mean \"invent\".","Children were apt to invent their own games."],["當你在指「發明」的時候，不要用「發現」這個字。","孩子們總愛創作自己的遊戲。"]],["counseling","'kaunsәliŋ","n. 咨询服务",["Tom and Mary have decided to go to marriage counseling.","Once the children are rescued, they receive psychosocial counseling to help them overcome their trauma."],["",""]],["receiver","ri'si:vә","n. 接收器；接受者；收信机；收款员, 接待者",["I forgot to lift the receiver before dialing the number.","The worried housewife heard the telephone ring and quickly picked up the receiver."],["",""]],["northwest",".nɒ:θ'west","n. 西北, 西北方\\na. 西北的, 在西北的, 来自西北的\\nadv. 向西北",["They marched northwest into the Shenandoah Valley.","Russian Protestantism was born in the northwest of Russia."],["他們向西北方向進軍，進入了謝南多厄河谷。",""]],["ritual","'ritʃuәl","n. 仪式, 典礼, 宗教仪式\\na. 仪式的, 依仪式进行的",["A sacred ritual took place in the magnificent temple.","The Heavenly Timber Immolation is a kind of ancient ritual."],["一个神圣的仪式在庄严的庙宇中举行。","燔柴祭天是一種古老的儀式。"]],["insect","'insekt","n. 昆虫, 卑鄙的人\\n[医] 昆虫",["The insect grew out of a pupa into an imago.","What do you call this insect in English?"],["昆蟲破蛹而出變成成蟲。","这种昆虫在英语中叫什么？"]],["salmon","'sæmәn","n. 鲑鱼, 大麻哈鱼\\n[医] 鲑",["The quality of salmon being sold here is the best.","Salmon lay their eggs in fresh water."],["這裡賣的三文魚是品質最好的。","鮭魚在淡水中產卵。"]],["interrupt",".intә'rʌpt","vt. 中断, 妨碍, 插嘴\\nvi. 打断\\nn. 中断\\n[计] 中断",["I will try not to interrupt you while you are studying.","Tom didn't want to interrupt Mary while she was studying."],["我会尽量不打扰你复习。","Tom不想在Mary讀書時騷擾她。"]],["trading","'treidiŋ","[经] 交易",["He amassed a fortune in stock trading during the last boom.","A record number of shares changed hands in busy trading as prices soared to a historic high."],["他在上个景气时期炒股攒下了一笔钱。",""]],["superior","sju:'piәriә","n. 长者, 占优势的人, 上级\\na. 上级的, 出众的, 高傲的",["Not a few people think that all foreign-made articles are superior to ones made in this country.","The hearing acuity of dogs is superior by far to that of humans."],["不少人認為，所有外國製造的物品均優於那些在本國所製造的。","狗的聽覺比人類靈敏不知多少倍。"]],["magic","'mædʒik","n. 魔术, 魔法\\na. 魔术的, 有魔力的, 不可思议的",["My parents say that YouTube and streaming services cheapen the magic of film.","Magic plays an important part in primitive society."],["我父母說，YouTube 和串流平台讓電影的魔力大打折扣。","巫術在原始社會扮演重要角色。"]],["combat","'kɒmbæt","n. 争斗, 战斗\\nvi. 战斗, 争斗\\nvt. 与...战斗, 与...斗争",["In real combat, you must not forget that hesitation is a very dangerous thing.","Combat soldiers during peaceful moments like to reminisce of their halcyon days."],["在实战中，你要知道三心二意是很危险的。",""]],["surgeon","'sә:dʒәn","n. 外科医生, 军医, 船医\\n[医] 外科医师",["There are two doctors in his circle of friends, a surgeon and an ophthalmologist.","The surgeon persuaded me to undergo an organ transplant operation."],["他的圈子裏有兩人是醫生，一個是外科醫生，另一個是眼科醫生。",""]],["stem","stem","n. 茎, 干, 柄, 船首, 血统, 堵塞物\\nvt. 摘掉茎, 装柄于, 阻止, 堵住, 逆行\\nvi. 堵住, 逆行",["Scientists are fighting to stem the spread of the AIDS virus.","One of the key missions at the school, he said, is to encourage more women to enter STEM-related fields."],["",""]],["acceptable","әk'septәbl","a. 可接受的, 合意的, 可忍受的",["Doing math is the only socially acceptable way to masturbate in public.","In our interpretation, the output data in Table 2 is an acceptable variation of that in Table 1."],["",""]],["rape","reip","n. 抢夺, 掠夺, 强奸, 葡萄渣, 芸苔\\nvt. 掠夺, 抢夺, 强奸",["Within the rape crisis movement, Greensite's dissent is significant.","A severed penis constitutes a solid piece of evidence for rape."],["",""]],["physics","'fiziks","n. 物理学, 物理过程, 物理现象\\n[化] 物理; 物理学",["My physics teacher doesn't care if I skip classes.","Even our brains are subject to the laws of physics."],["我的物理老师不在乎我是否逃课。","就连我们的头脑也遵守物理法则。"]],["counsel","'kaunsәl","n. 商议, 忠告, 法律顾问\\nv. 商议, 劝告",["I counsel you by way of caution to forbear from crossing the moor in those dark hours when the powers of evil are exalted.","He makes himself accessible to all who seek his counsel."],["",""]],["hunt","hʌnt","n. 狩猎, 追捕, 搜寻, 猎区\\nvt. 狩猎, 打猎, 搜索\\nvi. 打猎, 猎食, 搜寻",["Sturgeons can sometimes live for over 50 years, growing so large that few predators hunt them.","Have you ever seen a snow leopard hunt in the mountains?"],["鲟鱼的寿命有时能超过50年，长得大到少数的捕食者才会去猎。","你見過雪豹在山上狩獵嗎？"]],["jeans","dʒi:nz","n. 工装裤, 牛仔裤",["Karl wore a blue t-shirt and jeans.","Meg was the only girl that was wearing jeans."],["卡爾穿著藍色 T 恤和牛仔褲。","Meg是唯一一个穿牛仔裤的女生。"]],["continuous","kәn'tinjuәs","a. 连续的, 继续的, 连续不断的\\n[计] 连续的",["The cerebellum requires continuous blood supply.","The consumerist society contributes to a continuous increase in the amount of household waste."],["小脑需要连续不断的血液供给。",""]],["log","lɒg","n. 记录, 圆木, 日志, 计程仪\\nvt. 伐木, 切, 航行\\nvi. 伐木\\n[计] 日志",["You need a password to log in again after logging out.","In Canada, there are many areas where it is illegal to log trees."],["登出後重新登入需要密碼。","在加拿大有很多區域砍伐樹木是非法的。"]],["echo","'ekәu","n. 回声, 回音, 回波\\nvi. 发回声, 随声附和\\nvt. 摹仿, 重复, 反射\\n[计] 回显; DOS批处理命令:控制MS-D…",["We heard the echo of our voices from the other side of the valley.","If you shout from the top of a cliff, you can hear the echo of your voice."],["我們聽見自己說話的回音從山谷的另一邊傳了回來。",""]],["pill","pil","n. 药丸, 弹丸, 屈辱, 胡说\\nv. 做成药丸, 形成丸状, 服药丸, 挫败, 抢劫",["The researcher said that taking the red pill would send him to another universe.","He takes the purple pill so he doesn't feel bored."],["",""]],["excited","ik'saitid","a. 兴奋的, 已励磁的, 已激发的, 激昂的, 激动的",["There were a lot of excited fans in the stadium.","As he talked, he got more and more excited."],["体育场里有很多兴奋的球迷。","他越说越兴奋。"]],["sculpture","'skʌlptʃә","n. 雕刻, 雕塑\\nvt. 雕刻, 雕塑\\nvi. 当雕刻师",["The sculpture they bought to install in the plaza was out of scale for the site; it was much too small.","He went to art school to study painting and sculpture."],["",""]],["compound","kәm'paund","n. 混合物, 复合词, 化合物, 院子\\na. 复合的, 混合的, 化合的\\nvi. 化合, 和解, 妥协\\nvt. 使复合, 使化合",["The pain from the compound fracture was almost intolerable.","The hostage-takers planted explosives all around the compound."],["",""]],["flour","'flauә","n. 面粉, 粉沫, 碎粉\\n[医] 面粉, 麦粉",["For the new year, Liu's company gives every employee a bag of flour.","Flour is one of those products you should always have in your kitchen."],["過年時，小劉的單位给每位員工發一袋麵粉。","面粉是那些你始终应该储备在厨房里的产品之一。"]],["bare","bєә","a. 赤裸的, 缺少的, 无遮蔽的, 坦率的\\nvt. 使赤裸, 露出",["It's difficult to catch a rabbit with your bare hands.","It is not easy to catch a hare with your bare hands."],["徒手逮兔挺难。","空手赤拳抓野兔並不容易。"]],["integrate","'intigreit","vt. 综合, 使完整, 使成整体\\nvi. 成一体\\na. 完整的, 完全的",["When the Algerian wants to build mosques all over the world, the Kabyle seeks to integrate.","Algeria needs to integrate its outlying regions with the more developed north."],["",""]],["presidency","'prezidәnsi","n. 总统职权, 总裁职位",["Lyndon Johnson took over presidency when John Kennedy was assassinated.","He finally resigned the presidency of the college."],["",""]],["rent","rent","n. 租金, 房租, 出租物, 裂缝, 破裂处, 分裂\\nvt. 租用, 租出\\nvi. 出租\\na. 分裂的, 破裂的\\nrend的过去…",["The rent can be a bit expensive, but something nearby would be best.","Fifteen per cent of the housing will be affordable, so that low-income families will be able to buy or rent homes in the area."],["租金贵一点儿没关系，近一些最好。","百分之十五的房屋将是经济适用，所以低收入家庭会在这个地区买或者租房子。"]],["slope","slәup","n. 倾斜, 斜坡, 斜率, 扛枪姿势\\nvt. 使倾斜, 弄斜, 扛\\nvi. 倾斜, 走, 逃走",["The path zigzagged up the steep slope.","One night a merchant was walking up the slope on his way home."],["蜿蜒的小路爬上了陡坡。",""]],["subtle","'sʌtl","a. 敏锐的, 精细的, 狡猾的, 稀薄的, 灵巧的, 微妙的\\n[医] 锐敏的; 精细的",["There are subtle differences between the two pictures.","There are subtle differences between the two things."],["这两张图片之间有细致的差异。",""]],["greatly","'greitli","adv. 很, 非常",["The number of tourists has increased greatly in recent years.","It has greatly improved compared with what it was."],["近年的遊客數量大幅增加。","和以前相比，已經進步了很多。"]],["bishop","'biʃәp","n. 主教, (国际象棋中的)象, 热果子酒",["The bishop felt pity for the immigrants who were abandoned, and gave them help.","The chess pieces are: king, queen, bishop, knight, rook and pawn."],["",""]],["serving","'sә:viŋ","n. 服务, 招待, 上菜, 一份食物",["The Three Forks is a bar serving beer, and its target audience are travellers.","A new art trend in New York City takes the age-old craft of crocheting to the streets, where traditionally walls and fences have been serving as canvases for graffiti artists."],["三把叉子是一家供應啤酒的酒吧，其目標客戶是旅行者。","紐約市出現了一種新的藝術潮流，將古老的鉤編工藝帶到了街頭。在那裡，傳統上，牆壁和柵欄一直是塗鴉藝術家的畫布。"]],["drinking","'driŋkiŋ","n. 喝, 喝酒",["Although Hiroko dislikes cigarette smoke, she readily goes out drinking with friends.","Excessive drinking is one of the causes of impotence."],["虽然弘子不喜欢香烟的烟雾，她却乐意和朋友出去喝酒。","酗酒是导致阳痿的一个因素。"]],["acceptance","әk'septәns","n. 接受, 接纳, 承认, 同意, 赞同, 容忍, 相信\\n[经] 承兑, 认付, (工程)验收",["Formal acceptance of the article was sent to MLJ on March 24th.","In an ever diversifying society, acceptance of the ideas and values of other people should be elevated as one of our main goals."],["",""]],["pump","pʌmp","n. 抽水机, 打气筒, 泵, 抽吸\\nvt. 用唧筒抽水, 打气, 盘问, 倾注, 使疲惫\\nvi. 抽水, 上下(或往复)运动",["You don't have to go inside. You can pay at the pump.","Real men go to the gym to pump iron, not to do aerobics."],["",""]],["candy","'kændi","n. 糖果, 冰糖\\nvt. 用糖煮, 使结晶为砂糖\\nvi. 结晶为砂糖",["Someday I will buy a cotton candy machine.","I never should've let Tom eat so much candy."],["有一天我买了一台棉花糖机。","我不論甚麼時候都不該讓湯姆吃那麼多糖。"]],["evil","'i:vl","n. 邪恶, 不幸, 罪恶\\na. 邪恶的, 不幸的, 有害的, 讨厌的",["As long as good people do nothing, evil will triumph.","She doesn't know how to tell the difference between good and evil."],["只要好人袖手旁观，恶人就会得胜。","她不知道如何辨别善与恶。"]],["pleased","pli:zd","a. 高兴的, 喜欢的, 满足的",["She was very pleased when her son returned home safe and sound.","They were pleased at the birth of their first child."],["儿子平安无事回家时,她高兴极了.","他們第一箇孩子出生了，很高興。"]],["medal","'medl","n. 奖牌, 勋章\\nvt. 授勋予",["Four brave military dogs were awarded the K-9 Medal of Courage for their bravery and service.","In Olympic competitions, a gold medal is for first place, a silver medal for second, and a bronze medal is for third place."],["四隻英勇的軍犬因其勇氣與貢獻獲頒 K-9 勇氣勳章。","在奥运会的竞赛中，金牌代表第一名，银牌代表第二名，铜牌是第三名。"]],["beg","beg","v. 乞求, 乞讨, 请求",["I beg your pardon; I didn't quite catch your name.","When only death remains, the last resort is to beg for food."],["能再說一次嗎？我沒聽清楚你的名字。","除死无大事，讨饭到了家。"]],["sponsor","'spɒnsә","n. 保证人, 赞助者, 发起者, 倡议者, 教父\\nvt. 发起, 赞助, 倡议",["Prospectuses must be signed by two sponsor representatives.","I don't think this sponsor is very suitable."],["招股说明书必须由两名保荐代表人签字。","我覺得這個贊助不太合適。"]],["ethical","'eθikәl","a. 伦理的, 民族的, 民族特有的\\n[医] 伦理的, 道德的",["It needs to be judged on whether it meets the ethical standards.","His actions are neither illegal nor entirely ethical, falling somewhere in a gray area."],["必須判斷一個行為是否符合道德標準。","他的行為既不違法也不完全合乎道德，介於一種灰色地帶之間。"]],["secondary","'sekәndәri","a. 中级的, 中等的, 次要的, 第二的, 从属的, 辅助的\\n[化] 仲(指CH-3...CH(CH-3)-型支链烃基或指二元胺及R-…",["When I was at secondary school, I got up at six o'clock every morning.","Tom told me he didn't take French at secondary school."],["我上中學的時候天天六點起床。","湯姆告訴我說他在中學沒修法語。"]],["export","ik'spɒ:t","n. 输出品, 输出\\nvt. 输出, 出口\\nvi. 输出物资\\n[计] 导出",["Taiwan is an export-oriented economy.","We import raw materials and export the finished products."],["台灣是出口導向的經濟體。",""]],["experimental","ik.speri'mentәl","a. 实验的, 根据实验的\\n[医] 实验的",["What did the experimental set-up look like? What was connected to what and how?","We deal here with Emmet's 'dyad' style first presented in his experimental works in the late sixties."],["实验构造是怎样的？它们是如何相连接的？",""]],["slam","slæm","n. 砰然声, 猛然, 猛烈的抨击\\nvt. 猛然关上, 砰地关上, 猛烈抨击\\nvi. 砰地关上, 猛攻",["Matsui pulled the Giants back from the brink with a grand slam that gave them a come-from-behind victory.","That's pitiful ... don't put on such a death-bed voice from just a body slam."],["",""]],["civilization","si.vilai'zeiʃәn","n. 文明, 教化\\n[法] 文明, 文化, 文明国家的总称",["One step forward is a step forward for civilization.","The telescope has opened a new eye onto the cosmos that has been transformative for our civilization."],["向前一步，走向文明。","望远镜为我们的文明开启了一种全新的视角来观察宇宙。"]],["melt","melt","n. 熔化, 熔化物, 溶解\\nv. (使)熔化, (使)溶解, (使)消散, (使)变软",["The ice-cream will melt, so I put it in the fridge.","The chocolate is going to melt if you keep it out of the fridge."],["冰淇淋会融化所以我把它放在冰箱里。","巧克力不放在冰箱里的话会融化的。"]],["midnight","'midnait","n. 午夜, 子夜, 半夜\\na. 午夜的, 半夜的",["During summer breaks, I ate dinner at midnight.","I had instant noodles as a midnight snack."],["暑假里，我半夜十二点才吃晚饭。","我消夜吃了速食面。"]],["curve","kә:v","n. 曲线, 弯曲, 曲线球\\nvt. 弯, 使弯曲\\nvi. 成曲形",["In its graphical representation, the normal distribution is a bell-shaped curve, with the value growing as one moves closer to the middle and decreasing as one moves away.","A smile is the most beautiful curve on a woman's body."],["在图形上，正态分布是一种钟形曲线，越接近中心，取值越大，越远离中心，取值越小。",""]],["integrity","in'tegriti","n. 正直, 廉正, 完整\\n[计] 完整性",["In our society we find men of integrity along with crooks.","Wealth could not muddle his thoughts, poverty could not change his integrity, force could not oppress his will, this is what it means to be a man."],["我們的社會良莠不齊。","富贵不能迷乱他的思想，贫贱不能改变他的操守，威武不能压服他的意志，这就是大丈夫的本分。"]],["entitle","in'taitl","vt. 给...权利, 取名为, 给予名称, 叫做\\n[法] 给...权利, 使有资格, 称呼",["Your passport does not, in itself, entitle you to enter this country.","Participation in a strike does not entitle the employer to terminate the employee's contract of employment."],["",""]],["evident","'evidәnt","a. 显然的, 明显的",["It was evident that everyone was upset when Atletico Madrid suffered defeat.","As is evident from the data, smoking is not decreasing among the young."],["马德里竞技遭遇失败后，很明显大家都很生气。","数据表明年轻人抽烟的现象没有减少。"]],["park","pɑ:k","n. 公园, 停车处\\nvt. 停车, 置于\\nvi. 停车",["I saw a young man lying on the bench under the cherry tree in the park.","We could see the full extent of the park from the hotel."],["在公园里，我看到一个年轻人躺在一棵樱桃树下的长椅上。","我們從酒店裏可以把整個公園看得清清楚楚。"]],["essence","'esns","n. 实质, 本质, 香精\\n[化] 香精",["Time is of the essence, Paul. If you don't tell her how you feel now, you'll never have another chance.","Departure is a partial death but death in essence is not only departure."],["時間就是生命，保羅。如果你不告訴她你現在的感覺，你永遠不會有第二次機會。","离开是部分的死亡，而死亡不仅仅是离开。"]],["logic","'lɒdʒik","n. 逻辑, 逻辑学, 推理的方法, 推理, 逻辑性\\n[计] 逻辑",["Mathematics is like the logic of physics.","Logic is a systematic method of coming to the wrong conclusion with confidence."],["数学就像物理的逻辑一样。",""]],["exclude","iks'klu:d","vt. 除外, 排除, 排斥\\n[医] 除外(诊断)",["I don't believe that you will be able to defeat me, but I don't exclude the possibility that you'll make a brave attempt to do so.","You can be ambitious and kind; one doesn't exclude the other."],["",""]],["harsh","hɑ:ʃ","a. 粗糙的, 刺耳的, 严厉的\\n[法] 粗糙的, 严厉的, 苛刻的",["He doesn't even dare to reply to a harsh word. He's such a coward.","I am slowly adjusting to the harsh climate here."],["他連一句重話都不敢回，真是個窩囊廢。","我在慢慢习惯这苛刻的气候。"]],["suburban","sә'bә:bәn","a. 郊外的, 郊区的, (贬)偏狭的, 土气的, 见识不广的\\nn. 郊区居民",["Yanni lived in a normal suburban house in Algiers.","Yanni lives in a suburban neighborhood of Algiers."],["",""]],["closet","'klɒzit","n. 壁橱, 小室\\na. 秘密的, 空谈的\\nvt. 把...关入小室",["Coming out of the closet requires tremendous courage.","If you stand on this stool, you can reach the top of the closet."],["出柜需要莫大的勇气。","站在这个凳子上的话，你可以摸到衣柜顶。"]],["corridor","'kɒridɒ:","n. 走廊, 回廊, 人口密集地带",["Every morning, the corridor was swept clean.","I happened to witness the bullying in the corridor."],["走廊每天早上都清掃得乾乾淨淨。",""]],["greet","gri:t","vt. 问候, 致敬, 欢迎, 映入眼帘",["People, old and young, all came out to greet the guests.","He was aware that I was around, but didn't come to greet me."],["无论老幼，人们都出来迎接贵客。","他注意到我在場，但是沒向我打招呼。"]],["interior","in'tiәriә","n. 内部, 内政\\na. 内部的, 心灵的, 内地的, 内政的",["He made over the interior of his house.","Dan remembers the red interior of his grandfather's car."],["他把屋子重新装修了。",""]],["pitcher","'pitʃә","n. 有把的大罐, 瓶状体, 投手, 摊贩",["There's no denying his ability as a pitcher, but he is rather injury-prone.","Whoever the pitcher may be, he will not be able to strike out our best hitter."],["",""]],["retail","'ri:teil","n. 零售\\na. 零售的\\nvt. 零售, 详述, 传播\\nvi. 零售",["Currently, I'm looking for a job in customer service, preferably retail.","Organic kale is hand picked, washed and packed on site at Sprouting Farms, West Virginia, for retail and wholesale."],["目前，我正在尋找客服工作，最好是零售業。","有機羽衣甘藍在西維吉尼亞州的 Sprouting Farms 現場手工採摘、清洗和包裝，提供零售和批發。"]],["snake","sneik","n. 蛇, 阴险的人\\nvi. 曲折行进\\nvt. 迂回, 拉, 急抽",["Seen from the sky, the river looked like a huge snake.","The slippery snake slithered right out of his hand."],["从天上看下来，这条河像一条巨蛇。","那條蛇滑溜溜的，一下子就從他的手中掉了出來。"]],["march","mɑ:tʃ","n. 三月, 进行, 行军, 步伐, 长途跋涉, 进行曲, 边界\\nvi. 进军, 前进, 交界\\nvt. 使行军, 使行进",["In March next year, I will take a plane to the USA.","On March 1, President Donald Trump has signed an executive order making English the official language of the United States."],["明年三月我坐飛機去美國。","3 月 1 日，唐纳德・特朗普总统签署了一项行政命令，将英语定为美国的官方语言。"]],["excuse","ik'skju:z","vt. 原谅, 申辩, 做为...的托辞\\nn. 致歉, 理由, 饶恕, 借口",["Excuse me; allow me to point out three errors in the above article.","Please excuse me for calling you so early in the morning."],["抱歉，请允许我指出上文中的三个错误。","原谅我早上这么早给你打电话。"]],["weakness","'wi:knis","n. 虚弱, 薄弱, 弱点\\n[经] 欲振乏力",["The warrior is conscious of both his strength and his weakness.","The ability to show weakness is a strength."],["戰士知道自己的力量和弱點。","示弱是一种力量。"]],["pig","pig","n. 猪, 猪肉, 贪婪的人, 猪一样的人\\nv. 生小猪, 象猪般地生活",["The wool comes off the pig, and the dog pays the bill.","I may not have eaten pork, but I've seen a pig run."],["羊毛出在豬身上，狗來買單。","没吃过猪肉还没见过猪走吗？"]],["classical","'klæsikl","a. 古典的, 正统派的, 经典的\\n[医] 古典的; 标准的, 典型的",["Tom started playing jazz after studying classical music for many years.","You should memorize a piece of classical literature every day."],["在学习古典音乐多年后，汤姆开始演奏爵士了。","你必须每天背一篇古典文献。"]],["estimated","","a. 估算的；估计的；预计的",["It is estimated that only a few hundred pandas remain, with a small number of them being raised in zoos in China and abroad.","The value of the painting was estimated at several million dollars."],["据估计只有几百只遗留的熊猫，其中的少数圈养在中国和国外的动物园。","这幅画被估价数百万元。"]],["unemployment",".ʌnim'plɒimәnt","n. 失业, 失业人数\\n[经] 失业",["The unemployment rate went up to 5% because of the recession.","The best way to solve unemployment is to work."],["經濟不景氣失業率上升到了5％。","解決失業最好的辦法是去工作"]],["fold","fәuld","n. 折层, 折, 羊栏, 折痕, 信徒\\nvt. 折叠, 包, 合拢, 交迭\\nvi. 折叠起来, 彻底失败\\n[计] 折叠; 合并",["If you don't fold your clothes or hang them, they will be wrinkled.","Teach me how to fold a paper crane. I forgot how to fold it."],["若沒有將衣服摺起來或是掛在衣架上，會起皺紋。","教我怎么折纸鹤吧。我忘记怎么折了。"]],["reverse","ri'vә:s","n. 相反, 背面, 倒退, 挫折, 失败\\na. 反面的, 相反的, 反向的, 颠倒的\\nvt. 使颠倒, 使逆转, 使倒退, 使反向\\…",["You need to reverse your vest, it's back to front.","He did the reverse of what I asked."],["你的背心前后反了，得翻过来。","他做的和我要求的相反。"]],["rumor","'ru:mә","n. 谣言, 传闻\\nvt. 谣传",["To the best of my knowledge, the rumor is not true.","Among the students there's a rumor that this teacher fails everyone on their exams."],["据我所知，这个谣言不是真的。","學生中流傳著一個傳言，說這位老師會讓所有學生考試不及格。"]],["missing","'misiŋ","a. 不见的, 缺少的\\n[法] 行踪不明的, 失踪的, 遗失的",["The fishing boat that had been missing returned to its port safely.","We listened with great care, not missing a single word."],["消失了的漁船安全地回了港。","我们一字不落的，专心致志的听着。"]],["flash","flæʃ","n. 闪光, 闪现, 一瞬间\\nvi. 闪光, 闪现, 反射\\nvt. 使闪光, 反射",["The flash wasn't working, so he couldn't take a picture in the dark.","You can't view Flash content on an iPad. However, you can easily email yourself the URLs of these web pages and view that content on your regular computer when you get home."],["因为闪光灯坏了，他不能在黑暗中拍照。","雖然Flash的內容不能在iPad顯示，只要把網頁的URL發到自己的郵箱，回家便可以在普通電腦裡觀看。"]],["humanity","hju:'mæniti","n. 人性, 人类, 博爱",["All humanity will suffer if a nuclear war breaks out.","They said humanity needs to rebuild the Tower of Babel, I have no comment on this."],["一旦爆發核戰爭，受苦的將會是全人類。","他们说人类要重建巴别塔，我对此不予评价。"]],["correlation",".kɒrә'leiʃәn","n. 相互关系, 相关, 关联\\n[医] 相关, 联系",["Correlation does not imply causation.","The more I study for an exam, the worse I do! I guess correlation does not imply causation."],["相关关系不导致因果关系。",""]],["developer","di'velәpә","n. 开发者\\n[计] 显影器",["This new project in Java doesn't concern me at all, because I'm a PHP developer.","You are a mechanical engineer and I am a software developer."],["这个新的Java项目完全与我无关，因为我是一个PHP程序员。",""]],["reliable","ri'laiәbl","a. 可靠的, 可信赖的\\n[法] 可靠的, 可信赖的, 确实的",["Unless there is reliable evidence for it, we should not believe anything.","It is true that he is young, but he is very reliable."],["除非有可靠的证据，不然我们不应该相信任何事。","确实，他还年轻，但是很靠得住。"]],["beef","bi:f","n. 牛肉, 肌肉\\nvt. 养(牛), 宰(牛)\\nvi. 抱怨, 告发",["As a rule of thumb, you should plan on one pound of beef for every two guests.","I could eat some beef noodle soup, or some reheated rice with soybean paste like that, no problem."],["一般來說，你應該為每兩個客人準備一磅牛肉。","我可以不慌不忙吃牛奶面包鸡蛋，或者泡饭酱菜。"]],["excitement","ik'saitmәnt","n. 刺激, 兴奋\\n[医] 兴奋, 激动",["Hearing that a transfer student was coming, the class buzzed with excitement.","There was a lot of excitement in the stands as the fans cheered for their teams."],["听说要来一个转校生之后，全班都乱哄哄地活跃起来。","球迷们在为自己喜欢的球队欢呼，看台上总是一片热闹的景象。"]],["roman","'rәumәn","n. 罗马人\\na. 罗马人的, 罗马的",["I'm looking for books on Roman history.","An important reason for the fall of the Roman Empire was that they had no zero. So they had no way of demonstrating a successful exit of their C programs."],["我在找关于古罗马历史的书。","罗马帝国灭亡的其中一个主要原因是他们没有0 —— 这样他们就没法给自己的C程序指明成功退出的路。"]],["architecture","'ɑ:kitektʃә","n. 建筑学, 建筑式样\\n[计] 体系结构",["Sixty-four-bit software will not run on 32-bit architecture.","The place you moved to is in such a good spot. Nowadays, everyone's looking for a good location and architecture for their house."],["64位的软件在32位架构的系统上跑不起来。","你搬的地方真是好地段，现在大家是看上地段和房型。"]],["administrative","әd'ministrәtiv","a. 管理的, 行政的\\n[法] 行政的, 管理的, 遗产管理的",["The emergence of a third gender has added legal and administrative complications, creating unnecessary burdens.","The Prime Minister proposed administrative reforms."],["第三性別的出現增加了法律和行政上的麻煩，徒增無謂的負擔。",""]],["occasional","ә'keiʒәnl","a. 偶然的, 临时的\\n[法] 偶然的, 特殊场合的",["Tomorrow's weather should be sunny with occasional rain.","I have occasional pains in the stomach."],["明天天气晴转阵雨。","我的胃偶尔会阵痛。"]],["elbow","'elbәu","n. 手肘, 弯头, 扶手\\nv. 用手肘推开, 推挤",["You have tennis elbow. Soak your arm in warm water.","A very common type of elbow pain is known as \"tennis elbow\" in English."],["",""]],["deadly","'dedli","a. 致命的, 致死的\\nadv. 非常, 如死一般地",["So it seems that cloud of odorless deadly gas had a silver lining after all.","The tip of the spear was dipped in a deadly poison."],["只能说，那团无味的致命气体，也不是没有好处。","矛尖浸在一種致命的毒藥裡。"]],["hispanic","his'pænik","a. 西班牙的",["Mexicans are the largest group of Hispanic origin in the United States of America.","At times he thought you were a native from some Hispanic country."],["",""]],["allegation",".æli'geiʃәn","n. 断言, 主张, 申辩\\n[法] 声明, 事实陈述, 断言",["Tom was fired over a sexual harassment allegation.","Tom wouldn't discuss the allegation."],["",""]],["confuse","kәn'fju:z","vt. 使混乱, 使狼狈, 使困惑\\n[法] 混淆",["Don't confuse Austria with Australia.","When it comes to my turn to speak, I confuse the words 'standard' and 'common', and end up saying that the north-eastern accent is 'the most common'."],["不要把奥地利和澳大利亚混淆。","轮到我说话时，我不觉地把“标准”和“普通”这两个词混为一谈，后来又说东北的口音是最普通的。"]],["airplane","'єәplein","n. 飞机\\n[机] 飞机",["This airplane is capable of carrying 40 passengers at a time.","According to newspaper reports, there was an airplane accident last evening."],["这架飞机一次可以携带40名乘客。","根據報載，有一架飛機昨天晚上發生了意外。"]],["monthly","'mʌnθli","n. 月刊\\na. 每月的, 每月一次的",["Her husband intends to bring out a new monthly magazine.","The subscription service is available for a fixed monthly fee with a one-month free trial."],["他丈夫打算辦月刊。","此訂閱服務的月費為固定金額，並提供免費試用一個月。"]],["duck","dʌk","n. 鸭子\\nvi. 没入水中, 闪避\\nvt. 猛按...入水, 躲避",["We ate Peking duck in the Chinese restaurant.","It's duck soup for a girl of easy virtue to find a new man."],["我们在中餐厅吃了北京烤鸭。",""]],["korean","kә'riәn","n. 朝鲜人, 朝鲜语\\na. 朝鲜人的, 朝鲜语的",["Korean is difficult to learn, but Hangul can be learned quickly.","Korean entertainment culture is popular worldwide."],["韓語很難學，但韓文學起來很快。","韓國的娛樂文化在全球都很受歡迎。"]],["dose","dәus","n. 剂量, 服用量\\nvt. 给药, (用药)医治\\nvi. 服药",["Sami takes a dose of antibiotics every eight hours.","Please give him a dose of medicine every six hours."],["",""]],["initiate","i'niʃieit","n. 入会, 开始\\na. 新加入的\\nvt. 开始, 传授基本知识给",["\"I'll do my best\" often means \"I'll initiate nothing\".","\"I'll do my best\" often means \"I won't initiate anything\"."],["",""]],["plead","pli:d","vi. 辩护, 恳求\\nvt. 为...辩护, 提出...借口, 托称, 恳求",["The man who was arrested for murder asked to plead the fifth.","Miroslav would rather plead guilty than destroy more lives."],["",""]],["lecture","'lektʃә","n. 演讲, 谴责, 讲稿\\nvt. 演讲, 训诫, 说教\\nvi. 讲演",["I sat at the front in order to hear the lecture clearly.","It is not necessary for us to attend this lecture."],["我想聽清楚演講內容，便坐在了前面。","我們沒有必要出席這個講座。"]],["sixth","siksθ","num. 第六, 六分之一",["The sixth prime minister of Malaysia is Dato' Sri Najib Abdul Razak.","The sixth Prime Minister of Malaysia is Dato' Seri Najib Abdul Razak."],["马来西亚第六任首相是拿督斯利纳吉·阿都拉萨。","马来西亚第六任首相是拿督斯利纳吉·阿都拉萨。"]],["mainstream","'meinstri:m","n. 主流",["Outside the mainstream of orthodox Judaism, the apocalyptic books were more successful with certain movements.","I think that furries will be more widely accepted in the mainstream as time goes on."],["",""]],["sandwich","'sændwitʃ","n. 三明治, 夹心面包, 夹层板\\nvt. 插入, 夹入, 把...制成三明治",["As I didn't have time to go shopping today, I had to make do with a sandwich for dinner.","Tom said he saw Mary eating a sandwich in the park."],["因為今天我沒法上街購物，只好做點三明治將就將就。","汤姆说他看到玛丽在公园吃三文治。"]],["implementation",".implimen'teiʃәn","n. 安装启用, 实行, 履行\\n[计] 实施; 实现",["The multinational corporation has forecast the implementation of economies of scale.","The implementation of the new strategy will take a few weeks."],["跨国公司预料到了规模经济的实行。",""]],["suburb","'sʌbә:b","n. 市郊住宅区, 郊区, 边缘",["Helen and Kathy rented an apartment in a suburb of Tokyo.","The other day something horrible happened in a Tokyo suburb."],["海伦和凯蒂在东京郊区租了个套间。","前幾天，東京郊外發生了件可怕的事情。"]],["trunk","trʌŋk","n. 树干, 干线, 躯干, 主干, 象鼻, 箱子\\nvt. 把...放入旅行箱内\\na. 树干的, 躯干的, 干线的, 箱形的\\n[计]…",["Tom found Mary's umbrella in the trunk of his car.","The woodpecker is pecking the tree trunk vigorously."],["汤姆在车厢里找到玛丽的雨伞。","啄木鸟正在使劲地啄树干。"]],["motivate","'mәutiveit","vt. 给与动机, 刺激, 提高...的学习欲望, 促动\\n[经] 促动, 激发, 激励",["The teachers are trying to motivate their students.","Yanni tried to motivate the people who worked for him to be successful as well."],["",""]],["swallow","'swɒlәu","n. 燕子, 吞咽, 喉\\nvt. 咽, 淹没, 吞没, 耗尽, 轻信, 忍受, 抑制\\nvi. 吞下, 咽下",["If I don't drink a swig of water, I can't swallow these tablets.","I can't swallow these tablets without a drink of water."],["不喝水我咽不下这些药片。","不喝水我咽不下这些药片。"]],["longtime","'lɔŋtaim;'lɔ:ŋ-","a. (已持续)长时间的,为时甚久的\\nadv. 长久",["When our eyes met, I felt like I knew her for longtime.","In their younger years, longtime friends Aidan Reilly and James Kanoff volunteered together at a Los Angeles food bank."],["",""]],["render","'rendә","vt. 回报, 给于, 付给, 汇报, 提出, 舍弃, 反映, 表示, 表演, 致使, 执行, 实施\\nvi. 给予补偿\\nn. 交纳, …",["Japanese food terms are difficult to render into other languages.","Render that which is Caesar's to Caesar, and that which is God's to God."],["",""]],["trap","træp","n. 圈套, 陷阱, 诡计, 存水弯\\nvi. 设圈套, 设陷阱\\nvt. 诱捕, 诱骗, 抓住, 使受限制\\n[计] 俘获; 陷井",["Be sure to clear the lint trap before you run the dryer. Otherwise, you might start a fire.","It's impossible to release his foot from the trap."],["",""]],["restrict","ri'strikt","vt. 限制, 限定, 约束\\n[医] 限制",["There is a plan to restrict the use of cars in the city center.","I know I could easily get by with just English nowadays, but I don't want to restrict myself by only knowing one language."],["",""]],["cloth","klɒ:θ. klɒθ","n. 布料, 织品, 布\\n[建] 布",["She has bought some cloth; she is going to make herself a dress.","This kind of cloth is both cheap and sturdy."],["她買了一些布料，打算為自己做一條裙子。","这种布既便宜又结实。"]],["seemingly","'si:miŋli","adv. 看来似乎, 表面上看来",["I think that against somebody like that, my seemingly clever techniques would be seen through and then I would be defeated.","The odds were seemingly insurmountable but he overcame them to win the presidency."],["",""]],["legislative","'ledʒislәtiv","n. 立法机构\\na. 立法的, 有立法权的",["The U.S. government has three branches: the executive, the legislative, and the judicial.","The reconciliation report was issued in violation of the legislative requirements."],["",""]],["effectiveness","i'fektivnis","n. 效力\\n[经] 有效性, 能行性",["As yardsticks to measure the effectiveness of information retrieval there exist those called 'recall ratio' and 'precision ratio'.","The creatures were struck dead, one after the other, with amazing precision and effectiveness."],["",""]],["lens","lenz","n. 透镜, 镜头, 镜片, 晶状体\\nvt. 给...摄影",["Through the lens the image was inverted.","Tom started a fire by turning a condom filled with water into a magnifying lens."],["图像在镜片中呈反向。",""]],["enforce","in'fɒ:s","vt. 强迫, 执行, 坚持\\n[经] 予以强制执行",["The absentee landlord requires a state to enforce his claims to the property.","The Sioux tribe asked the government to enforce the treaty."],["",""]],["companion","kәm'pænjәn","n. 朋友, 陪伴, 指南, 升降口围罩\\nvt. 陪伴",["He and his companion asked me to come along with them.","My companion said that she was too tired to walk, let alone run."],["他和他的伙伴让我跟他们一起去。",""]],["lend","lend","vt. 借, 贷款给, 增添, 提供, 出租\\nvi. 贷款",["I'll lend you the book, provided you return it next week.","I will lend you any book that I have, so long as you keep it clean."],["如果你可以在下個星期還給我的話，這本書就借給你吧。","我的書每一本都可以借給你，只要你不把它們弄髒就行了。"]],["plain","plein","n. 平原, 草原, 朴实无华的东西, 无格式\\na. 简单的, 明白的, 平常的, 不好看的, 朴素的, 清晰的, 普通的, 平坦的, …",["Stracciatella ice-cream is nothing but a plain ice-cream with chocolate chips.","Mary is fairly plain, but Tom thinks she's the bee's knees."],["斯特拉恰泰拉冰淇淋只不過是一種添加了巧克力碎的普通冰淇淋。","玛丽是个平淡无奇的人，但是汤姆却认为她出类拔萃。"]],["inspector","in'spektә","n. 检查员, 巡视员\\n[化] 检查员",["The suspect told a lie to the inspector.","Inspector, try to keep a lid on the situation until we can get more police down there."],["那嫌疑犯對偵察官撒了個謊。",""]],["fraud","frɒ:d","n. 欺骗, 欺诈, 诡计, 骗子\\n[经] 欺诈, 舞弊, 骗子",["Academic fraud is more common than you might think.","Fraud and deceit abound in these days more than in former times."],["学术造假比你想象的普遍。",""]],["contend","kәn'tend","vi. 奋斗, 斗争, 竞争\\nvt. 为...斗争",["Besides those serious problems, he had to contend with all sorts of people.","Against stupidity, the gods themselves contend in vain."],["",""]],["strict","strikt","a. 严厉的, 绝对的, 详尽的, 严格的, 精确的\\n[法] 严格的, 精确的, 绝对的",["The contest has very strict eligibility requirements.","It's important to follow a strict diet."],["參賽條件非常嚴格。","重要的是要遵循嚴格的飲食控制。"]],["array","ә'rei","n. 排列, 衣服, 大批, 军队\\nvt. 布署, 打扮, 排列\\n[计] 数组; 阵列",["Behind every animal on the Chinese zodiac lies an array of proverbs, sayings and stories.","The trigonometric functions satisfy a wide array of notable algebraic identities."],["每一個生肖的背後都有著數不盡的成語、諺語和故事。","三角函數滿足各種代數恆等式。"]],["frankly","'fræŋkli","adv. 坦白地",["Frankly speaking, I actually wanted to stay at home, instead of going out.","Frankly speaking, I don't like your haircut."],["老實說，我其實想留在家中，不想出外的。","坦白地说，我不喜欢你的发型。"]],["nail","neil","n. 钉子, 指甲\\nvt. 用钉钉牢, 使固定, 截住, 揭露",["To the man who only has a hammer in the toolkit, every problem looks like a nail.","The poor sales during that Holiday season served as the final nail in the coffin for Boar Corporation."],["对工具箱里只有一把榔头的人来说，所有的问题都像钉子。","那個假期銷售業績不佳，為博爾公司敲下了最後一根棺材釘。"]],["assemble","ә'sembl","vt. 集合, 收集, 装配\\nvi. 集合\\n[计] 汇编",["Stop playing your video game for a minute and help me assemble this desk.","At Kuroda Primary School we assemble at a prearranged time and go to school as a group."],["",""]],["rat","ræt","n. 鼠, 卑鄙的人, 破坏者, 变节者\\nvi. 捕鼠, 变节\\nvt. 弄蓬松",["If you have rat or mouse problems, you can scare them off with ultrasound.","The rat was killed by him with a stick."],["你如果遭受老鼠困擾，可以使用超音波來嚇跑牠們。","他用一根棍子把老鼠打死了。"]],["hallway","'hɔ:lwei","n. 门厅；玄关；走廊",["The principal severely reproved the students whenever they made a mess in the hallway.","The hallway needs to be wide enough for a wheelchair."],["每次学生把走廊弄得一团糟的时候，校长都会严厉地训斥他们。","走廊要夠輪椅寬。"]],["burst","bә:st","n. 破裂, 突发, 爆发\\nv. 爆裂, 突发, 充满\\n[计] 二进制位组; 字符组; 脉冲串",["No sooner had the child seen his mother than he burst into tears.","Hardly had he entered the room, when she burst into tears."],["孩子一見到母親就哭了起來。","他刚进房间，她就泣不成声了。"]],["inevitable","in'evitәbl","a. 不可避免的, 必然的\\n[法] 不可避免的, 无法规避的, 必然的",["It is inevitable that I go to France someday, I just don't know when.","Being challenged in life is inevitable, being defeated is optional."],["我總有一天是必須去法國的，但不知道是何時。","生命中你无法选择接踵而至的挑战，但是你可以选择不成为一个失败者。"]],["cave","keiv","n. 洞, 穴\\nvi. 凹陷, 塌落\\nvt. 挖洞, 使凹陷, 损坏...的基础",["A goatherd drove his goats, all white with snow, into a deserted cave for shelter.","A shepherd drove his snow-covered goat into an abandoned cave to take shelter from the blizzard."],["一个牧羊人把他一身白雪的山羊赶进被遗弃的山洞躲避暴风雪。","一个牧羊人把他一身白雪的山羊赶进被遗弃的山洞躲避暴风雪。"]],["southwest","sauθ'west","n. 西南, 西南方, 西南地区\\na. 西南的, 来自西南方的\\nadv. 往西南, 来自西南",["It is bounded to the north by Lebanon, the northest by Syria, the east by Jordan and the West Bank, and to the southwest by Egypt.","The river has its source to the southwest of Sussex, New Brunswick."],["",""]],["monster","'mɒnstә","n. 怪物, 恶人, 巨物\\n[医] 畸胎",["The monster in the movie would stomp on anything that got in its way.","A huge monster is coming down the mountain."],["電影中的怪獸會踐踏阻礙牠的一切事物。","从山上走来一只巨大的怪物。"]],["unexpected",".ʌnik'spektid","a. 料想不到的, 突然的, 意外的\\n[法] 不能预料的, 意外的",["A little bit of luck sometimes leads to an unexpected success.","I regret that I will be unable to meet you on February 27 owing to an unexpected matter."],["一點點的運氣有時會導致意想不到的成功。","因为临时有事，我很抱歉在2月27日那天不能跟你们碰面了。"]],["facilitate","fә'siliteit","vt. 使容易, 促进, 帮助\\n[法] 使容易, 使便利, 推进",["It is certain that Emmet contrived his 'dyad' style to facilitate the process of architectural design.","The determining factor in question is whether this social welfare plan can facilitate the influx of immigrants."],["",""]],["obstacle","'ɒbstәkl","n. 障碍, 妨害物, 阻碍",["Tom was the biggest obstacle for them.","Don't waste your time looking for an obstacle - maybe there is none."],["湯姆是他們最大的障礙。",""]],["overwhelming",".әuvә'hwelmiŋ","a. 压倒性的, 无法抵抗的",["Narcissists are often snobbish, disdainful and patronising of others' opinions, while, at the same time, having an overwhelming need for admiration and reassurance.","Parents' love can sometimes be so overwhelming that you can't breathe."],["自恋的人往往自命不凡，轻蔑和屈尊俯就于他人的意见，与此同时，对赞美和肯定有着迫切的需求。",""]],["rip","rip","n. 裂痕, 破绽, 拉裂, 浪子, 巨浪\\nvi. 被拉开, 裂开, 猛冲\\nvt. 撕, 扯, 劈",["Oi you, that's too much of a rip off by anyone's count! 6:4 is more than enough. Of course I'm the '6'.","A foreign tourist was caught in a strong rip and swept out to sea."],["",""]],["herb","hә:b","n. 药草, 香草\\n[医] 草, 草本, 草药",["The herb used in that pasta sauce might be parsley.","The monk prays for an hour, while the nun boils the herb in the kitchen."],["用於那個義大利醬的香草可能是荷蘭芹。",""]],["crystal","'kristl","n. 水晶, 水晶装饰品, 结晶\\na. 水晶的, 水晶一样的, 透明的",["Whenever Mary gets drunk, she ends up doing crystal meth for the next three days.","He looked deeply into his crystal ball and predicted my future."],["",""]],["integration",".inti'greiʃәn","n. 综合, 与环境协调的行为, 集成\\n[化] 集成; 整合",["Discussion continued in the Foreign Ministry over social integration and the policy of accepting foreigners in Japan.","In Russian, nouns of foreign origin generally don't succumb to integration."],["",""]],["recession","ri'seʃәn","n. 后退, 凹处, 衰退, 归还\\n[医] 退缩",["Recession is a temporary falling off of business activity during a period when such activity is generally increasing.","The unemployment rate went up to 5% because of the recession."],["经济萧条是一段时间内，当这样的经济活动普遍增长而造成的一种临时性的经济活动衰退。","經濟不景氣失業率上升到了5％。"]],["motive","'mәutiv","n. 动机, 目的, 主题, 基调\\na. 运动的, 成为动机的",["Jealousy was the motive for the murder.","You may rest assured; I have no ulterior motive in making this donation."],["嫉妒是謀殺的動機。",""]],["bitter","'bitә","a. 苦的, 痛苦的, 怀恨的\\nadv. 刺骨\\nv. (使)变苦",["His bitter words still rankle in my mind.","Good medicine is bitter to the mouth."],["他尖刻的话语仍然在我心中挥之不去。","良藥苦口。"]],["written","'ritn","a. 书面的, 写成文字的\\nwrite的过去分词",["It is said that \"Hamlet\" is the most interesting play ever written.","As it is written in simple English, this book is easy to read."],["据说《哈姆雷特》是写出来的最有意思的剧本。","由於是用簡單的英語所寫的，這本書很容易閱讀。"]],["flood","flʌd","n. 洪水, 大量之水, 涨潮\\nvt. 淹没, 使泛滥, 注满\\nvi. 被淹, 溢出, 涌进",["The town was destroyed by the flood after the storm.","Several cottages have been isolated by the flood water."],["小镇被暴风雨后的洪水摧毁了。","好几间小屋被洪水孤立起来了。"]],["pen","pen","n. 钢笔, 笔, 笔调, 笔杆子, 作家, 围栏, 栅栏, 禽畜\\nvt. 写, 关入栏中, 囚禁\\nvi. 动笔, 写作",["I bent over to pick up my pen which had fallen on the floor.","The baby caught sight of my ballpoint pen and reached out for it."],["我俯身撿起了掉在地上的筆。","這個嬰兒盯著我的原子筆看, 並且伸手要拿它。"]],["ownership","'әunәʃip","n. 所有权, 物主身份\\n[经] 所有权, 所有制",["Management of a company is different from ownership of a company.","Catalogue companies like Sears sold mail order house kits, making home ownership achievable even during the Depression."],["管理一家公司和擁有一家公司是捷然不同的。",""]],["nightmare","'naitmєә","n. 梦魇, 恶梦, 可怕的事物(或情景、人物)\\n[医] 梦魇, 恶梦",["Eating lots at night can easily give you a nightmare.","I feel as if I've woken up from a nightmare."],["晚上吃多了容易做噩梦。","我覺得我好像從惡夢中驚醒。"]],["inspection","in'spekʃәn","n. 检验, 检查, 视察\\n[医] 检查, 视察, 监督, 望诊",["Korea allowed an inspection by the IAEA.","This is because there is nothing so beautiful that, even on close inspection, no defects will be found."],["韓國允許了國際原子能總署的視察。",""]],["supervisor",".sju:pә'vaizә","n. 管理者, 监督者, 指导者, 视导员\\n[计] 管理程序",["The supervisor enforced the rules here in this factory.","You must act under the leadership of your supervisor."],["",""]],["arena","ә'ri:nә","n. 角斗场, 舞台, 场地\\n[医] 尿沉渣, 尿沙; 脑沙",["Tomorrow the Chinese national team play against the Korean national team in their home arena.","The Coliseum was the former arena in ancient Rome."],["明天中國國家隊主場對陣韓國國家隊。",""]],["consult","kәn'sʌlt","vi. 商讨, 商量, 协商, 会诊\\nvt. 向...请教, 查阅, 考虑",["You should consult with a pharmacist before buying that medicine.","He's already retired but is often asked by them to consult."],["你在买这药之前应该问一下药剂师的建议。","已经退休了，但还常常被他们请去做顾问。"]],["possession","pә'zeʃәn","n. 拥有, 占有, 所有, 财产, 领土, 领地, 自制, 着迷\\n[经] 占有, 持有",["The Spanish team is great at keeping possession of the ball.","The ball is that boy's prized possession."],["西班牙队很擅长控球。","这个球是那个男孩的宝贝。"]],["diagnosis",".daiәg'nәusis","n. 诊断\\n[计] 诊断",["A lot of girls hide their autism, sometimes evading diagnosis well into adulthood.","Avian medicine - diagnosis and treatment of illnesses."],["",""]],["forgive","fә'giv","vt. 原谅, 宽恕, 免除\\n[法] 免除, 宽恕, 原谅",["Please forgive my asking such a personal question.","\"Novels? I hate novels.\" Oh muse, forgive her blasphemy."],["請原諒我問了這樣一個私人的問題。","「小说啊？我就讨厌看小说。」缪斯，请原谅她的亵渎行为。"]],["consistently","","adv. 坚固, 坚实, 一致, 始终如一, 连贯\\n[计] 相容地",["However, apart from Buddhists, hardly anyone can consistently follow this principle.","He has consistently been an advocate for the poor and downtrodden."],["不过，除了佛教者以外，没有任何人可以一直遵循这个原则。",""]],["basement","'beismәnt","n. 地下室, 墙脚\\n[化] 地下室",["The police think the burglar entered through a basement window.","They cleaned everything, from the basement to the attic."],["警察認爲竊賊從地下室窗口進入。","他们从地下室到阁楼都打扫了。"]],["drift","drift","n. 漂流物, 漂流, 动向\\nv. (使)漂流",["Fluffy white clouds drift across the sky one by one.","Many people drift through life without a purpose."],["一片一片的白雲在上空飄過。","许多人毫无目的地随波逐流。"]],["drain","drein","n. 排水沟, 消耗, 排水\\nvt. 排出, 喝光, 耗尽\\nvi. 排水, 流干",["Taking care of the boy is a great drain on her energies.","When I unplugged the bathroom sink, the water gushed down the drain."],["",""]],["maximum","'mæksimәn","n. 极点, 最大量, 极大\\na. 最高的, 最大的, 最大极限的\\n[计] 最大值",["Please consider that the maximum doesn't exist in some circumstances.","This truck has a maximum load of 5 tons."],["请考虑一下，最大值在有些情况下是不存在的。","这辆卡车最大的载重量是5吨。"]],["announcement","ә'naunsmәnt","n. 公告, 发表, 告知\\n[经] 通告, 布告, 公告",["The timing of the announcement hurts the public relations of the police.","We will post the announcement in all the staff lounges."],["聲明的時機對警察的公衆關係不利。",""]],["prosecution",".prɒsi'kju:ʃәn","n. 执行, 经营, 起诉",["The prosecution condemned the defendant for kidnapping a child.","A loophole in the law allowed him to escape prosecution."],["",""]],["questionnaire","kwestʃә'nєә","n. 调查表, 问卷\\n[经] 调查表",["Please fill out this questionnaire and send it to us.","I don't feel like filling out this questionnaire. There are too many items."],["",""]],["warrior","'wɒ:riә","n. 战士, 勇士, 武士, 鼓吹战争的人, 战斗, 尚武",["The warrior is conscious of both his strength and his weakness.","A great warrior radiates strength. He doesn't have to fight to the death."],["戰士知道自己的力量和弱點。","一名伟大的战士威力显著，无需抵死奋战。"]],["prediction","pri'dikʃәn","n. 预言, 预报\\n[化] 预测",["The prediction was falsified by the result.","Strange to say, his prediction has come true."],["預言被實驗結果推翻了。","說來奇怪，他的預言竟然真的靈驗了。"]],["hurry","'hʌri","n. 匆忙, 急忙, 急促\\nvt. 急派, 催促\\nvi. 匆忙, 赶快",["People who are not in a hurry stand on the right side of the escalator.","No matter how much you hurry your effort is just a drop in the bucket."],["不赶时间的人们站在自动扶梯的右边。","就算你多焦急，也不能幫上甚麼忙。"]],["mud","mʌd","n. 泥, 诽谤\\nvt. 弄脏",["People who play with mud will get their hands dirty.","Angrily, he stomped on the puddle, splashing mud everywhere."],["玩泥的人会弄脏自己的双手。","他憤怒地踐踏水坑，弄得泥水四濺。"]],["bacteria","bæk'tiәriә","pl. 细菌\\n[医] 细菌, [无芽胞]杆菌",["A cell phone is as contaminated with bacteria as a toilet is.","Bacteria are so small that they cannot be seen with the naked eye."],["手机如同马桶一样被细菌污染。","细菌微小到无法用肉眼看到。"]],["privilege","'privilidʒ","n. 特权, 特别恩典, 基本权利, 特免\\nvt. 给与...特权, 特免",["We were granted the privilege of fishing in this bay.","It is a great privilege to be with you in Tatoeba."],["我们得到了在这个海湾内捕鱼的特权。","在Tatoeba与你相会是我的幸运。"]],["infrastructure","'infrәstrʌktʃә","n. 基础结构, 基础设施\\n[经] 基础设施",["The infrastructure of an application is directly related to its overall performance.","This blog covers topics that centre on information infrastructure."],["一个应用的架构直接关系到它的整体性能。",""]],["outdoor","'autdɒ:","a. 户外的, 屋外的, 露天的",["I wish I could return to Paris and order a dozen oysters at an outdoor cafe while soaking in the sun.","Thank you Congresswoman Smith for supporting outdoor recreation businesses."],["",""]],["temple","templ","n. 圣堂, 庙宇, 教堂, 礼拜堂, 太阳穴, 鬓角\\n[医] 颞颥, 颞部",["In Asian culture it's customary to take one's shoes off before entering a house or temple.","A sacred ritual took place in the magnificent temple."],["在亚洲文化里，习惯在进一个房子或一座寺庙前先脱鞋子。","一个神圣的仪式在庄严的庙宇中举行。"]],["broadcast","'brɒ:dkæst","n. 广播, 传播\\na. 广播的\\nv. 广播\\nadv. 经广播, 四散地\\n[计] 广播命令, 广播",["His death was broadcast all over the world.","That program is now being broadcast."],["他去世的消息在世界各地播出。","那個節目現在正在播出。"]],["suck","sʌk","vt. 吸, 吮, 吸入, 吮吸, 吸收\\nvi. 吸, 吸奶\\nn. 吸, 吸入, 吮吸",["You suck dude! I have to tell you everything!","Children suck the mother when they are young, and the father when they are old."],["你好烂哦！ 我什么事都需要跟你讲！",""]],["random","'rændәm","n. 随意, 随机\\na. 任意的, 随便的, 胡乱的, 随机的\\nadv. 胡乱地",["You can upgrade your computer with more random access memory to make the PC faster.","Your random firing will scare away the prey."],["您可以使用更多任何存取記憶體來升級您的電腦，以提高 PC 的運行速度。","你胡乱打枪，会吓跑猎物的。"]],["leap","li:p","n. 跳跃, 剧增, 急变, 被越过之物\\nvi. 跳跃, 突然经过\\nvt. 跃过, 使跃过",["I am about to take my last voyage, a great leap in the dark.","The fastest way to heaven is a leap into a deep abyss."],["",""]],["curtain","'kә:tәn","n. 帐, 幕, 窗帘\\nvt. 装帘子于, 遮蔽",["A green carpet will not go with this blue curtain.","She hung a curtain over the window."],["绿色的毯子和这条蓝色的帘子不配。","她把窗簾掛在窗戶上。"]],["wrist","rist","n. 手腕, 腕关节\\n[医] 腕",["I suspect Koreans must have trained their wrist strength to use those iron chopsticks so well.","That man grabbed the young girl's wrist."],["我懷疑韓國人是練過腕力才用得好那種鐵筷。","那個男人抓住了這個年輕女孩的手腕。"]],["re","ri:","prep. 关于\\nn. 不动产, 房地产\\n[计] 赖斯编码",["He likes re-watching the old videotapes.","I should point out that it is necessary to re-examine the validity of Emmet's theory."],["他喜欢回顾老录像带。",""]],["pond","pɒnd","n. 池塘\\nv. 筑成池塘",["A few fragments of dead leaves floated on the pond.","A gentle wind made ripples on the surface of the pond."],["池塘里漂浮着零星的几片落叶。","微風在湖面上掀起了一絲絲漣漪。"]],["domain","dәu'mein","n. 领域, 领土, 产业, 范围\\n[计] 域, 区域, 支配命令",["A holomorphic function can be expressed as a convergent power series in a neighborhood of any point in its domain.","I guess that there are fundamentalists and radicals even in the relatively peaceful domain of language..."],["全純函數在其定義域內任意一點的鄰域中都可以表示為收斂的冪級數。",""]],["guilt","gilt","n. 罪行, 内疚\\n[法] 罪, 犯罪, 罪行",["Sociopaths rarely display remorse or feelings of guilt for their crimes.","It doesn't matter whether she admits her guilt or not."],["反社会者极少为他们的罪行显露懊悔或有罪恶的感觉。","她認罪不認罪都沒關係。"]],["cattle","kætl","n. 牛, 家畜\\n[法] 家畜",["The horses and cattle in heat never meet.","Because of the famine, the cattle starved to death."],["風馬牛不相及。",""]],["playoff","'pleiɔ:f","n. 双方得分相等时的最后决赛；复赛；季后赛",["Veteran Spanish golfer Sergio Garcia finally captured his first major title in a sudden death playoff over Britain's Justin Rose.","He loves to watch playoff basketball."],["",""]],["weird","wiәd","a. 怪异的, 超自然的, 不可思议的\\nn. 命运, 预言, 符咒",["How do you know they're not just giving you a weird look because you have a funny face?","I had a really weird dream yesterday."],["你怎麼知道他們奇怪的看著你不只是因為你有一張有趣的臉呢?","我昨晚做了一个很奇怪的梦。"]],["minimum","'minimәm","a. 最小的, 最低的\\nn. 最小值\\n[计] 最小值",["What's the minimum wage in your country?","For years I have been struggling to reduce the sloppiness in our office to a tolerable minimum."],["你的国家的最低工资是多少？",""]],["walking","'wɒ:kiŋ","n. 步行, 步态\\na. 步行的, 步行用的",["A sprained ankle disabled him from walking for a month.","After walking for an hour, we stopped to take a rest."],["他把足踝扭傷了，整整一個月不能走路。","走了一個小時後，我們停下來休息。"]],["fiscal","'fiskәl","a. 财政的, 国库的\\n[经] 财政上的, 会计的, 国库的",["Tax cuts are often used as a major fiscal tool to stimulate the economy.","Multinationals and extremely rich people manage, sometimes legally, sometimes illegally, to pay little to no taxes by using services offered in fiscal paradises."],["减税常被用作刺激经济的主要财政手段。","跨國公司和極富有的人透過利用避稅天堂所提供的服務，時而合法、時而非法地少繳甚至不繳稅。"]],["dump","dʌmp","n. 垃圾场\\nvt. 倾倒, 倾销\\nvi. 倒垃圾, 倾销商品\\n[计] 转出; 转储; 倾卸; 切断电源",["Today I hooked my trailer up to my car, filled it with rubbish and took a very full load to the local rubbish dump.","The taxi collided head-on with a dump truck and was badly crushed."],["",""]],["skirt","skә:t","n. 裙子, 下摆, 边缘, 郊区\\nvt. 位于...边缘, 绕过, 回避\\nvi. 位于边缘",["I'm looking for a warm, woolen skirt.","I would like to try the blue striped skirt."],["我想找一件溫暖的羊毛裙。","我想试一下那条蓝色条纹裙。"]],["database","'deitәbeis","n. 数据库\\n[计] 数据库",["We have optimized the database indexing, and as a result, system efficiency has improved by 50%.","Just because it's in Tatoeba.org's database, doesn't mean it's a sentence."],["我们优化了数据库索引，结果系统效率提高了50%。","在Tatoeba.org的数据库里并不意味着它是一个句子。"]],["hence","hens","adv. 因此, 从此",["He did everything to be able to survive, hence he never wants to talk about it.","Hence, we have to take care of ourselves."],["他為了活下去竭盡全力，所以他從來不想談起這件事。","因此，我们必须自己照顾自己。"]],["uncomfortable",".ʌn'kʌmfәtәbl","a. 不舒服的, 不自在的, 不安的",["I am ready to die. I hope it's not too uncomfortable.","I'm very uncomfortable around children."],["我准备好迎接死亡了。我希望别太难受。","我被小孩围着非常不舒服。"]],["execute","'eksikju:t","vt. 执行, 实行, 完成, 处死, 制成\\n[计] 执行",["His only hope of winning the pool game at that point was to successfully execute a complex trick shot.","This investment plan requires approval from the director of operations or someone of equally high status in order to execute."],["那時他贏得撞球比賽的唯一希望，就是成功打出一記複雜的花式擊球。",""]],["limb","lim","n. 四肢, 枝干, 翼, 边缘\\nvt. 切断...之手足",["I'm not going out on a limb for you because you never helped me before.","Tom Skeleton was shaking and trembling in every limb."],["",""]],["ideology",".aidi'ɒlәdʒi","n. 思想体系, 意识形态, 观念学, 空论\\n[医] 观念学, 观念形态",["This is the ideology to which my speech is written.","The heart of Esperanto ideology is the equality of all languages and cultures."],["我的演讲稿就是依据这个理论写的。","世界语的思想核心在于一切语言文化的平等。"]],["tune","tju:n","n. 歌曲, 主旋律, 心情, 声调, 和谐, 一致, 语调, 程度\\nvt. 为...调音, 调整, 调谐, 使一致\\nvi. 协调, …",["Tom went to school to learn how to tune pianos.","If you listen to foreign language songs, feel tunes nice, but do not understand the lyrics, then you can not say you like this song, can only say that like the tune."],["汤姆去学校学习调琴手艺。","如果你听外语歌，觉得曲调好听，但不懂歌词，那你不能说你喜欢这首歌，只能说喜欢它的曲调。"]],["continuing","kәn'tinjuiŋ","a. 继续的, 持续的, 连续的\\n[法] 继续的, 连续的, 持续的",["I will play Sudoku then instead of continuing to bother you.","Many conservationists fear the continuing slaughter of whales is pushing these animals towards extinction."],["那我就不继续打扰你，玩数独游戏去了。","许多自然环境保护主义者担心持续屠杀鲸鱼正推动这些动物走向灭绝。"]],["railroad","'reilrәud","n. 铁路, 铁路公司\\nvt. 铺设铁路, 用铁路运输\\nvi. 在铁路工作",["The railroad workers are going on walkout tomorrow.","The railroad is parallel to the road."],["鐵路工人明天將繼續進行罷工。","铁路与公路平行。"]],["endure","in'djuә","vt. 忍受, 忍耐, 容忍, 耐\\nvi. (正式)持久, 持续\\n[计] 仍能工作, 继续工作",["I cannot endure being disturbed in my work.","It's hard to endure the boastings of the French."],["我无法容忍别人打扰我的工作。","法国人的自以为是真是让人难以忍受。"]],["harm","hɑ:m","n. 伤害, 害处\\nvt. 伤害, 损害",["From my point of view, cars do more harm than good.","Don't worry about my dog. He won't do you any harm."],["在我看来，汽车是弊大于利。","不要担心我的狗，它不会伤害你。"]],["radiation",".reidi'eiʃәn","n. 辐射\\n[化] 放射",["Yesterday my big brother went to Fukushima to help the locals. I'm very afraid of the rise in radiation levels.","The ozone in the stratosphere absorbs ultraviolet radiation."],["昨天哥哥去福岛给当地居民帮忙了。我对放射量的增加很害怕。","平流層的臭氧會吸收紫外線。"]],["horn","hɒ:n","n. 角, 角质, 喇叭, 号角\\na. 角制的\\nvt. 用角触, 长角于",["The train slowed and blared its horn as it approached the railway crossing.","This may sound like blowing my own horn, but ..."],["火车在快到交叉路口的时候减速、按喇叭。","這聽起來可能像是我在自吹自擂, 但是..."]],["chronic","'krɒnik","a. 慢性的, 习惯性的\\nn. 慢性病患者",["Rising seas linked to climate change are triggering chronic inland flooding in many parts of the world.","Chronic problems include a shortage of skilled labor and a deficient infrastructure."],["",""]],["peaceful","'pi:sful","a. 平静的, 和平的, 和平时期的, 爱好和平的, 喜爱安静的\\n[法] 和平的, 爱好和平的, 和平时期的",["Country life is very peaceful in comparison with city life.","The world which I saw in my dream was a peaceful world devoid of war."],["和都市生活相比，鄉村生活和諧多了。","我夢見的是一個沒有戰爭的、和平的世界。"]],["replacement","ri'pleismәnt","n. 归还, 更换, 代替者\\n[医] 复位, 置换",["History develops through the replacement of the old by the new.","I hadn't thought about something: about the replacement glasses."],["新事物取代旧事物推动历史发展。",""]],["innovation",".inәu'veiʃәn","n. 改革, 创新\\n[法] 创新, 改革, 刷新",["Technological innovation brought about the rapid progress of the information industry.","Thanks to the technological innovation, the maximum output of the factory has doubled."],["",""]],["guitar","gi'tɑ:","n. 吉他",["An electric guitar doesn't sound the same as an acoustic one.","I would like to learn to play the piano, guitar or flute."],["電結他的聲音和木結他不同。","我想学钢琴，吉它或长笛。"]],["strain","strein","n. 紧张, 拉紧, 张力, 过劳, 扭伤, 血缘, 种, 族, 气质, 曲调, 旋律, 口吻\\nvt. 使劳累, 拉紧, 过分使用, 扭…",["Tom has been under a great deal of strain lately.","You'll strain your eyes trying to read in this light."],["汤姆最近压力特别大。",""]],["behave","bi'heiv","vi. 举止端正, 行为规矩\\nvt. 检点(自己的)行为, 使表现好",["Many people cannot understand the way hackers behave.","Other people's expectations affect how we behave."],["很多人无法理解黑客们的行为。","其他人的期望會影響我們的行為。"]],["administer","әd'ministә","vt. 管理, 料理, 执行\\nvi. 执行遗产管理人的职责, 给予帮助",["The syringe is the instrument most commonly used to administer insulin.","There is a dearth of available medical personnel to administer vaccines."],["",""]],["simultaneously","simәl'teiniәsly; (?@) saim-","adv. 同时发生, 一齐, 同时, 同时存在",["The summit talks are to be broadcast simultaneously throughout the world.","Preparations for the new project are under way in both companies simultaneously."],["",""]],["dancer","'dɑ:nsә","n. 舞蹈演员, 跳舞者",["Each movement of the dancer was perfect.","I know that Tom is a terrible dancer."],["這舞者的每一個動作都是完美的。","我知道汤姆是个差劲的舞蹈员。"]],["pad","pæd","n. 填补, 衬垫, 印色盒, 路\\nvt. 填补, 走, 夸大\\nvi. 步行\\n[计] 焊接点; 包装配/拆卸",["\"Pad See Ew\" is a Thai dish made with flat, broad rice noodles.","If your essay is on the short side, you can always pad it out with a few quotations."],["",""]],["transmission","træns'miʃәn","n. 传输, 传送, 变速器\\n[计] 传输",["Er, I can only drive cars with an automatic transmission.","Algeria needs to enforce social distancing measures to reduce person-to-person transmission of the coronavirus."],["",""]],["trigger","'trigә","n. 触发器, 扳机\\nvt. 触发, 发射, 引起\\nvi. 松开扳柄\\n[计] 切换开关",["Tom put the gun to his own head and pulled the trigger.","Certain smells can easily trigger childhood memories."],["汤姆把枪顶到了自己头上，扣动了扳机。",""]],["amendment","ә'mendmәnt","n. 修订, 改善, 改良, 改正\\n[化] 调理剂; 修正",["Some claim that full-body scanners violate the Fourth Amendment.","It's not every day that Congress ratifies a new amendment."],["",""]],["await","ә'weit","vt. 等候\\nvi. 等待着",["With the President dead now, the new policies will have to await government approval.","Tatoeba is just Twitter for language nerds. I eagerly await tempestuous floods of snarky hashtags in every sentence."],["",""]],["retired","ri'taiәd","a. 隐退的, 退休的, 退役的\\n[经] 退休的, 已收回的",["With the money Mr Johnson had saved, he would be able to live high on the hog when he retired.","He's already retired but is often asked by them to consult."],["用這些傑森先生存下來的錢, 在他退休後他可以生活的很寬裕。","已经退休了，但还常常被他们请去做顾问。"]],["spill","spil","n. 溢出, 溅出, 摔下, 溢出量, 木片, 小塞子\\nvt. 使溢出, 使散落, 洒, 使流出, 倒出, 使摔下\\nvi. 溢出, 涌…",["Gambling site lets users bet on which species will go extinct because of the oil spill in the Gulf of Mexico.","You can wear my scarf as long as you don't spill anything on it."],["賭博網站讓用戶投注於哪些物種將因為墨西哥灣漏油而滅絕。",""]],["grateful","'greitful","a. 感谢的, 感激的, 令人快意的, 受欢迎的",["The repairs cost a lot more than 15 dollars, of course, but I am grateful to them for finding a solution.","I am grateful to you for inviting me to the party."],["理所當然，修理費用比15元還要多更多，但是我非常感激他們找到了解決的辦法。","謝謝你邀我參加派對。"]],["colony","'kɒlәni","n. 殖民地, 移民队\\n[医] 菌(集)落, 菌丛; 移民区",["At one time Nigeria was a British colony.","Zimbabwe was once a colony of Britain."],["尼日利亞曾經是英國的殖民地。","津巴布韋曾經是英國的殖民地。"]],["adoption","ә'dɒpʃәn","n. 采用, 采纳, 收养\\n[法] 收养, 采纳, 采用",["Adoption for gay and lesbian parents remains a hotly contested issue in the United States.","Tom was born in China and sent to the US for adoption at the age of three."],["",""]],["virtual","'vә:tʃuәl","a. 实际上起作用的, 虚的, 实质的, 有效的, 事实上生效的\\n[计] 虚拟",["I couldn't find my non-virtual address book until only a few minutes ago.","The world of dreams is a set of stages where virtual realities permeate one another."],["",""]],["convict","kәn'vikt","n. 囚犯, 罪犯\\nvt. 宣告有罪, 使知罪",["The convict was pardoned after serving his sentence.","The police are hunting an escaped convict in this area."],["",""]],["indigenous","in'didʒinәs","a. 本土的, 国产的, 固有的\\n[医] 原产的, 本土的",["The panda is indigenous to Sichuan Province and does not live in the wild in any other places.","Indigenous Australians have eaten kangaroos for millennia."],["熊猫在四川省土生土长，不在任何其他省份的野外生活。","澳大利亚土著已经吃了上千年袋鼠。"]],["closed","klәuzd","a. 关闭的, 限于少数人的\\n[计] 关闭指令",["The supermarkets are now closed, so we'll have to make do with what is left in the refrigerator.","He put a Closed sign on the front door of the store."],["超市現在已經關了，我們只能加減用一下冰箱裡剩的食物。","他在店子的正門上掛上了一個「休息」的牌子。"]],["towel","'tauәl","n. 手巾, 毛巾\\nv. 擦干身子",["She came out of the bathroom with a towel wrapped around her.","Tom wrung out the towel and hung it up to dry."],["她圍著一條浴巾從浴室走了出來。","汤姆拧干毛巾挂起来晾干。"]],["particle","'pɑ:tikl","n. 颗粒, 粒子, 质点, 极小量\\n[化] 粒子; 质点",["It is of great significance in this experiment to accelerate the particle M in the horizontal direction.","He doesn't have a particle of kindness in his heart."],["",""]],["modify","'mɒdifai","vt. 修正, 变更, 修饰, 缓和, 减轻\\nvi. 被修改\\n[计] 修改",["Things that modify nouns (adjective, or adjectival equivalent).","We want to modify the regulations of our school."],["修飾名詞的東西（形容詞，或形容詞相等語）。","我们想修改学校的规章制度。"]],["prize","praiz","n. 奖赏, 奖金, 奖品, 战利品, 捕获\\na. 得奖的\\nvt. 珍视, 估价, 捕获, 撬, 撬动",["They awarded her first prize at the art exhibition.","The Nobel Prize is awarded annually on December 10, the day of Alfred Nobel's death."],["他们在画展上授予了她一等奖。","諾貝爾獎在每年的十二月十日頒發，是Alfred Nobel去世的那天。"]],["landing","'lændiŋ","n. 登陆, 码头, 降落\\n[经] 上岸, 登陆, 降落",["My grandpa believes that the moon landing was a hoax.","In a few minutes we'll be landing at New Tokyo International Airport."],["我的祖父相信登月是一個騙局。","我们将于几分钟内降落在新东京国际机场。"]],["boost","bu:st","n. 推进, 吹捧\\nvt. 推进, 提高, 宣扬, 促进",["I think I can reach the branch if you'll give me a boost.","Finance Ministry officials tried to boost confidence in recovery."],["",""]],["bat","bæt","n. 蝙蝠, 球棒\\nv. 用球棒打, 眨眼\\n[计] 成批",["I often stumble over something as I am blind as a bat in the dark.","A bat hunts food and eats at night, but sleeps during the day."],["",""]],["alarm","ә'lɑ:m","n. 惊恐, 警报, 警钟\\nvt. 使惊恐, 警告\\n[计] 报警信号",["Kurt didn't wake up yesterday because the alarm didn't ring.","You've got to set the alarm clock before you go to bed."],["昨天闹钟没响，Kurt也就没醒过来。","在你上床睡覺之前，你必須把鬧鐘設定好。"]],["grip","grip","n. 紧握, 柄, 握力, 握手方式, 手提包, 掌握, 支配, 控制\\nvt. 抓紧, 抱住, 吸住, 掌握\\nvi. 握牢, 有吸引力",["It was not until the end of April that winter began to release the land from its icy grip. The days became warmer; snow and ice turned into streams of meltwater.","The rioters were like animals in the grip of a primitive frenzy."],["大地直到四月底才得以從冬季冰冷的握持中掙脫出來。天漸暖了，雪和冰也都融化成溪了。",""]],["festival","'festәvәl","a. 节日的, 喜庆的, 快乐的\\nn. 节日, 庆祝, 欢宴",["Spring Festival is also known as Chinese New Year.","They helped one another to make the school festival a success."],["春节，即农历新年。","他们互帮互助，把校庆搞得很成功。"]],["sweat","swet","n. 汗, 汗水, 水珠, 焦急\\nvi. 出汗, 渗出, 冒出水气, 结水珠, 烦恼, 懊恼\\nvt. 使出汗, 流出, 榨出, 使汗流…",["Worried, the shopkeeper ran over and kneeled beside Dima, who was breathing heavily - his forehead covered in sweat.","I put roll-on antiperspirant all over my body. If sweat starts squirting out the top of my head, you know why."],["店主擔心地跑過去跪在迪馬身旁, 迪馬沉重地喘著氣, 他的額頭覆著一層汗。","我把整个止汗剂抹遍全身。如果汗从我脑顶喷出来，你就知道原因了。"]],["undermine",".ʌndә'main","vt. 在...下面挖, 渐渐破坏, 暗地里破坏\\n[法] 暗中破坏, 以阴谋中伤伤害",["Many fear that cuts in the defense budget will undermine the military's effectiveness.","The market tends to undermine the very values that gave rise to it."],["",""]],["outer","'autә","a. 外部的, 外面的, 在外的, 远离中心的\\n[机] 外部的, 外面的, 外侧的",["How do you find food in outer space?","Centuries later, there were more humans in outer space than there were on Earth."],["你怎么在太空里找到食物？",""]],["freshman","","n. 新手, 生手, 大学一年级学生, (美)中学一年级学生",["Felix constantly worries that he isn't amounting to anything, even though he's only a freshman in high school.","Carla is the one freshman who aced every course in which she enrolled."],["",""]],["drunk","drʌŋk","a. 喝醉了的\\ndrink的过去式",["Tom was so drunk that he didn't even recognize me.","Maybe it's the low air pressure that means you get drunk more easily on planes."],["汤姆醉得连我都认不出来了。","也許這是低氣壓，這意味著你在飛機上更容易喝醉。"]],["separation",".sepә'reiʃәn","n. 分离, 分居, 缺口, 退职\\n[化] 分离",["One day apart seems like a separation of three years.","My sweetheart said it was only a temporary separation."],["一日不见如隔三秋。",""]],["traditionally","","adv. 传统上；传说上；习惯上",["A new art trend in New York City takes the age-old craft of crocheting to the streets, where traditionally walls and fences have been serving as canvases for graffiti artists.","Many ethnic groups traditionally give money as a wedding gift."],["紐約市出現了一種新的藝術潮流，將古老的鉤編工藝帶到了街頭。在那裡，傳統上，牆壁和柵欄一直是塗鴉藝術家的畫布。",""]],["ballot","'bælәt","n. 投票, 投票用纸, 抽签\\nvi. 投票, 抽签\\nvt. 投票选出, 拉选票",["The required majority was not achieved by any of the candidates at the first ballot.","Tom had already reached the required majority by the first ballot."],["",""]],["web","web","n. 网, 蛛丝, 蹼, 织物, 圈套, 卷筒纸\\nvi. 结网, 形成网\\nvt. 织蜘蛛网于, 使落入圈套",["More than 90 percent of visits to a web page are from search engines.","She spends way too much time surfing the web."],["一个网页超过百分之九十的访问量是来自于搜索引擎的。","她花实在太多的时间在网上冲浪。"]],["southeast","sauθ'i:st","n. 东南, 东南地区\\na. 东南的, 向东南的, 来自东南的\\nadv. 往东南, 来自东南",["Languages in the Hmong-Mien language family, also referred to as the Miao-Yao language family, are spoken across Southeast Asia and mountainous areas of southern China.","The letters ASEAN stand for the Association of Southeast Asian Nations."],["苗瑤語系的語言分佈於東南亞和中國南方山區。",""]],["republic","ri'pʌblik","n. 共和国, 共和政体, 团体, 界",["Guatemala was once qualified as a banana republic.","China, otherwise known as the People's Republic of China, is located in east Asia, on the western coast of the Pacific ocean."],["瓜地馬拉曾經被稱作香蕉共和國。","中国，全名中华人民共和国，位于亚洲东部，太平洋西岸。"]],["intelligent","in'telidʒәnt","a. 聪明的, 智能的, 了解的",["It was once thought that there was intelligent life on Mars.","She is beautiful, intelligent and, what is best of all, very kind-hearted."],["以前有人以为火星上有智能生物。","她又漂亮，又聰明，而最棒的是，她還是一個十分善良的人。"]],["wherever","hwєәr'evә","adv. 无论哪里",["Tom always carries a camera with him wherever he goes.","I think we should be able to go wherever we want to."],["汤姆无论到哪里都带着照相机。","我認為我們應該能去我們想去的地方。"]],["govern","'gʌvәn","v. 统治, 支配, 管理",["To govern a country is no easy job.","To govern a country is not an easy job."],["统治一个国家并不简单。","统治一个国家不是一个简单活。"]],["driving","'draiviŋ","n. 赶, 操纵, 驾驶\\na. 推进的, 强劲的, 精力旺盛的",["When you are driving, you should slow down on corners.","My driving instructor says I should be more patient."],["当您开车的时候，应该在转弯处减速。","我的駕駛教練說我應該更有耐心一點。"]],["rhetoric","'retәrik","n. 修辞, 修辞学, 雄辩(术)",["Beauty is that marvelous mystery that neither psychology nor rhetoric deciphers.","Their pseudo-scientific rhetoric serves as justification for America's imperialist foreign policy."],["",""]],["convinced","kәn'vinst","a. 确信的, 深信的",["Tom was convinced that the food he had just eaten had been poisoned.","I am convinced that things will change for the better."],["湯姆相信有人在他剛剛吃的食物裡下了毒。","我深信事情会往更好的方向转变。"]],["vitamin","'vaitәmin","n. 维生素\\n[化] 维生素",["Oranges contain a large amount of vitamin C.","Oranges contain a lot of vitamin C."],["柳丁含有大量的維生素 C。","柳橙富含維他命 C。"]],["enthusiasm","in'θju:ziæzәm","n. 巨大的热情, 热心",["Tom doesn't share Mary's enthusiasm.","The air in that room was thick with the enthusiasm of the participants."],["汤姆没有感受到玛丽的热情。",""]],["accommodate","ә'kɒmәdeit","vt. 使适应, 调和, 通融, 容纳, 向...提供\\nvi. 适应",["This classroom can accommodate only thirty students.","His cottage is neat and comfortable; moreover, it can accommodate as many as ten people."],["這間班房只能容納三十個學生。",""]],["wilderness","'wildәnis","n. 荒野, 荒地, 大量",["My heart, the bird of the wilderness, has found its sky in your eyes.","Just three kilometers past my house is complete wilderness."],["",""]],["praise","preiz","n. 赞美, 称赞, 崇拜\\nvt. 称赞, 赞美\\nvi. 赞扬, 表扬",["People can accept praise more easily than criticism.","It's not immoral for a novelist to tell lies. In fact, the bigger the lies, the better lies, and the more the common folks and critics will praise you."],["赞扬比批评更容易让人接受。","小說家說謊並不是不道德的事。其實，謊話說得愈離譜、愈有技巧，就愈會受到公眾和批評家的表揚。"]],["injure","'indʒә","vt. 伤害, 损害, 使受冤屈\\n[医] 损伤",["You may injure yourself if you don't follow safety procedures.","For he would not injure me at all; for he would not even be able to."],["如果你不按照安全手续来的话，你可能会受伤的。",""]],["endless","'endlis","a. 不停的, 无穷尽的, 无尽的\\n[机] 无端的, 环状的",["It was a fabulous show which brought us an endless delight.","Social unrest may come about as a result of the endless rising of prices."],["那是一个给我们带来无穷乐趣的传奇性的演出。",""]],["mandate","'mændeit","n. 命令, 指令, 要求\\nvt. 委任统治",["The church does not have the mandate to change the world. But if it fulfills its mission, it will change the world.","You are entitled to hold your beliefs, but you are not entitled to mandate those beliefs for others."],["",""]],["respectively","ri'spektivli","adv. 各自地, 独自地, 个别地, 分别地",["The two boys, aged respectively fourteen and sixteen, were dressed in the army uniform, and wore gold-lace sergeant's chevrons upon their sleeves.","SOPA and PIPA are two bills in the United States House of Representatives and the United States Senate respectively."],["这两个男孩，一个14岁、一个16岁，都穿着军队制服，衣袖上佩戴着镶金色蕾丝边的中士袖章。",""]],["chaos","'keiɒs","n. 大混乱, 混沌\\n[化] 混沌; 浑沌",["Today, the greatest source of chaos in the world is the United States.","There is a stark contrast between China's order and the chaos of the West."],["当今世界最大的乱源在美国。","中国之治与西方之乱形成了鲜明的对比。"]],["uncertainty",".ʌn'sә:tnti","n. 不确定, 不可靠, 不确定的事物\\n[化] 不确定度",["All forecasts have a certain degree of uncertainty.","The uncertainty about the weather has had a definite effect upon the Englishman's character."],["",""]],["mechanical","mi'kænikәl","a. 机械的, 机械性的, 力学的\\n[医] 机械的, 力学的",["The result of the invention of the steam engine was that human power was replaced by mechanical power.","I got a piece of lead for my mechanical pencil from her."],["机械力代替人力, 这是蒸汽机发明的结果。","我从她那里拿了一根自动铅笔芯。"]],["format","'fɒ:mæt","n. 开本, 版式, 形式, 格式\\nvt. 格式化\\n[计] 格式; DOS外部命令:对磁盘进行格式化",["I have installed Microsoft Office on my personal computer, so please use its file format when you send me the attachment.","You can format and customize a worksheet, and insert and use tables, charts, formulas and functions."],["",""]],["canvas","'kænvәs","n. 帆布, 画布, 油画\\n[化] 帆布",["The South-wind fills the canvas; on we fly / where breeze and pilot drive us through the deep.","Oil on canvas can never paint a petal so delicate."],["",""]],["forty","'fɒ:ti","num. 四十, 四十个",["Ten, twenty, thirty, forty, fifty, sixty, seventy, eighty, ninety, hundred.","Ten, twenty, thirty, forty, fifty, sixty, seventy, eighty, ninety, one hundred."],["十、二十、三十、四十、五十、六十、七十、八十、九十、一百。","十、二十、三十、四十、五十、六十、七十、八十、九十、一百。"]],["profound","prә'faund","a. 极深的, 深厚的, 深刻的, 渊博的",["If a person doesn't have a strong will, he will be unable to embrace profound wisdom.","His teachings are incorporated in a profound book Daode Jing which Taoists regard as the final authority and doctrines of the religion."],["如果一个人没有坚强的意志，那么他也不会拥有高深的智慧。","他的教导都包含在道教者看作关于宗教最后的权威的道德经那本深刻的书。"]],["lobby","'lɒbi","n. 大厅, 休息室, 游说议员者\\nvi. 游说议员, 游说\\nvt. 游说",["Meet me at the lobby of the Imperial Hotel at 6:30 p.m.","I have a friend waiting for me in the lobby."],["下午六点半到帝国酒店的大堂找我。","有個朋友正在大堂等我。"]],["trait","treit","n. 特征, 特性, 一笔, 少许",["Her character trait that I love the most is sweetness.","Neurosis is a trait often stereotypically assigned to Ashkenazi Jews."],["",""]],["currency","'kʌrәnsi","n. 货币, 通货, 流通, 通用\\n[计] 货币, 货币型",["The exchange rates for foreign currency change daily.","Britain's currency crisis has turned into a political one over government failure to stop the pound from going into free-fall."],["外幣的匯率天天都變。",""]],["apologize","ә'pɒlәdʒaiz","vi. 道歉, 辩解",["You should apologize to your father for not getting home in time for dinner.","We apologize for the delay and regret any inconvenience it may have caused."],["你應該為你沒有及時回家吃晚餐向你父親道歉。","我们对这次的延迟表示抱歉，并对可能造成的不便表示遗憾。"]],["reserve","ri'zә:v","n. 储备品, 贮量, 后备军, 自然保护区, 保留, 拘谨, 节制, 储备金\\nvt. 保留, 保存, 预订, 延期, 推迟",["I'd like to reserve a room in a hotel.","I want to reserve a first-class stateroom."],["我想要订房。","我要订官舱。"]],["beam","bi:m","n. 横梁, 杆, 光线, 容光焕发\\nvi. 用梁支承, 微笑, 射出光线\\nvt. 照耀, 感到欣喜\\n[计] 束",["I'm checking for laser beam alarm triggers.","The witch cast a spell and a beam of light shot out of her wand."],["我在检查这里有没有激光警报装置。",""]],["corruption","kә'rʌpʃәn","n. 腐败, 堕落, 贪污\\n[计] 论误",["The politician pushed for reform by denouncing the corruption of the government officials.","What is most troublesome is the corruption of the best."],["政治家以揭露政府官员的腐败来推动改革。",""]],["astronomer","ә'strɒnәmә","n. 天文学家",["J. Kepler, astronomer and mathematician, made a study of planets and their movements.","Tycho Brahe was the last major astronomer to work without the aid of a telescope."],["",""]],["contractor","'kɒntræktә","n. 立契约的人, 承包商\\n[化] 承包者; 承包工厂",["Just like I thought, the contractor came back today, begging for more time.","Right on schedule, that contractor came around today, begging for more time."],["",""]],["doctrine","'dɒktrin","n. 教条, 学说\\n[医] 学说",["No external evidence can, at this long distance of time, be produced to prove whether the church fabricated the doctrine called redemption or not.","That doctrine will no doubt lead to dismal consequences."],["經過如此漫長的時間，已不可能提出任何外部證據，來證明教會是否捏造了所謂的「救贖」教義。",""]],["genuine","'dʒenjuin","a. 真正的, 真实的, 诚恳的\\n[医] 真性的",["Do not think that love, in order to be genuine, has to be extraordinary. What we need is to love without getting tired.","If there are genuine differences between these two cultures, I think that the largest are certainly in what you think about foreigners studying your native language."],["不要覺得真誠的愛必需驚天動地。我們需要的，是不會倦怠的愛。","如果这两个文化有真实的不同，我认为最大的准是在关于外国人学习自己的母语的意见。"]],["thumb","θʌm","n. 拇指\\nvt. 以拇指拨弄, 笨拙地摆弄, 用拇指翻旧, 迅速翻阅, 作搭车手势",["As a rule of thumb, you should plan on one pound of beef for every two guests.","The hand has five fingers: the thumb, the index finger, the middle finger, the ring finger, and the pinky."],["一般來說，你應該為每兩個客人準備一磅牛肉。","人的手有五个手指: 拇指、食指、中指、无名指和小指。"]],["unity","'ju:niti","n. 一致, 联合, 单一(性), 个体\\n[经] 统一",["Unity, justice and freedom are the pledge of fortune.","\"Who sees variety and not the unity wanders on from death to death\", state the Upanishads."],["团结、公正和自由是幸福的保证。",""]],["horrible","'hɒrәbl","a. 可怕的, 遭透的, 极讨厌的",["The other day something horrible happened in a Tokyo suburb.","The weather yesterday was horrible."],["前幾天，東京郊外發生了件可怕的事情。","昨天的天氣壞透了。"]],["compromise","'kɒmprәmaiz","n. 妥协, 折中, 折中方案, 和解\\nvi. 妥协处理\\nvt. 危害",["In our view, we have already made the biggest possible compromise.","We tried to come to a compromise with them."],["对于我们来说，这已经是做出了最大限度的让步了。","我們試著和他們妥協。"]],["behavioral","bi'heivjәrәl","a. 行为的",["I suggest that you start a behavioral therapy in order to cure yourself of your obsession with comas.","Sami spent six years in the FBI's behavioral analysis unit."],["",""]],["exclusive","ik'sklu:siv","a. 排外的, 独占的, 唯一的\\n[计] 独占的",["This contract shall be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts in Mumbai alone.","That is not to say the two are mutually exclusive."],["",""]],["bureau","'bjuәrәu","n. 局, 办公处\\n[经] 局, 司, 处",["Leave the bike here, and tomorrow bring your ID and 20 dollars to the Bureau of Communications to get the bike back.","The meteorological bureau has issued a red rainstorm alert."],["你们把自行车留下，明天带着身份证和20块钱到交通局领自行车。","气象局发布了暴雨红色预警。"]],["scatter","'skætә","n. 消散, 分散, 散播, 散射, 散布, 酒馆\\nvi. 散布, 散播, 消散\\nvt. 使消散, 使分散, 撒, 散布, 散播, 散…",["For an idea to germinate and to be fruitful, it is necessary to scatter its seeds in the appropriate season.","Enrage your winds, sink those ships, or smash them to pieces, and scatter the bodies of the Trojans across the sea."],["",""]],["commonly","'kɒmәnli","adv. 一般, 普通, 通常",["Sodium bicarbonate is commonly known as baking soda.","Hutongs are a type of narrow street, most commonly associated with Beijing, China."],["碳酸氫鈉通常被稱為小蘇打。","胡同是一种跟中国北京有关的窄街路。"]],["convey","kәn'vei","vt. 传达, 运输, 转让\\n[经] 转让(财产等), 搬运",["While dreams cannot tell you what will happen to you in reality, they are able to convey your innermost thoughts.","Wires are used to convey electricity."],["梦虽然不会告诉你现实中将要发生什么，却能告诉你内心的真实想法。","電線被用來運送電力。"]],["complexity","kәm'pleksiti","n. 复杂, 复杂性, 复杂的事物",["He's contemplating the complexity of contemporary life.","However, I recommend that you take the JR Narita Express (a train leaves every 30-60 minutes from the airport), to avoid the complexity of changing trains."],["他思考着现代生活的复杂性。","但是，我建議你乘 JR 的成田特急（每三十分鐘至一個小時就有一班列車從機場開出），不用轉車這麼麻煩。"]],["fork","fɒ:k","n. 叉子, 叉状物, 分岔\\nvi. 分支, 分歧\\nvt. 做成叉形, 叉起\\n[计] 派生指令",["This boy is very good at using the knife and fork.","Let us repeat: cup, plate, knife, fork, spoon, teaspoon."],["这个男孩刀叉用得很好。","再念一次：杯子、盤子、刀、叉、湯匙、茶匙。"]],["twist","twist","n. 一扭, 扭曲, 曲折, 歪曲, 螺旋状, 新手法\\nvt. 拧, 扭, 捻, 编织, 使扭转, 缠绕, 盘绕, 歪曲, 使转动, 使…",["Twist that knob to the right and the box will open.","This mystery has a plot twist that's completely novel."],["",""]],["disk","disk","n. 圆盘, 磁盘\\n[计] 磁盘",["I've formatted your hard disk by mistake.","Tom asked Mary to help him reformat the hard disk."],["我不小心格式化了你的硬盤。",""]],["christianity",".kristʃi'æniti","n. 基督教, 基督教精神",["In Christianity, Jesus is believed to be the son of God.","The major religions in China are Taoism, Buddhism, Islam and Christianity."],["基督徒认为耶稣是上帝的儿子。","中国重要的宗教是道教、佛教、伊斯兰教和基督教。"]],["suspicion","sә'spiʃәn","n. 怀疑, 觉察, 嫌疑\\n[法] 怀疑, 疑心, 嫌疑",["Suspicion is destructive of friendship.","I have a suspicion about his death."],["怀疑会毁掉友情。","我覺得他的死有點可疑。"]],["relieve","ri'li:v","vt. 减轻, 救济, 解除, 使免除, 换...的班, 使得到调剂, 使不单调, 衬托, 使显著\\nvi. 救济, 当替补投手, 呈鲜明…",["When you're about to have exams, lifting weights really does relieve stress, and it's also good for your mind and body.","No words can relieve her deep sorrow."],["快要考试的时候，举重真的消愁解闷，再说对身体和精神都很好。","語言不能減輕她的悲痛。"]],["residence","'rezidәns","n. 住宅, 居留, 驻扎, 居住期间\\n[医] 住房",["Everyone has the right to freedom of movement and residence within the borders of each State.","Tom's residence is a little too big for just one person."],["每個人在各國境內均享有遷徙自由與居住自由的權利。",""]],["shame","ʃeim","n. 羞耻, 羞愧, 耻辱\\nvt. 使羞愧, 侮辱",["It's a crying shame that they weren't insured against fire.","I think death is preferable to shame."],["这简直是太可惜了，他们没有买火险。","我覺得士可殺不可辱。"]],["olympics","әu'limpiks","n. 奥林匹克运动会",["The opening ceremony of the Olympics has already begun.","The Olympics are starting today. What are you feeling?"],["奥运会已经开幕了。","奥运会今天就要开幕了。你有什么感觉？"]],["meaningful","'mi:niŋful","a. 意味深长的",["Everyone listened and was very happy, thinking this wedding was both original and meaningful.","The greater the difference between the null hypothesis and an outcome, and the larger the sample size, the more confident one can be that the outcome is meaningful."],["大家听了，都很高兴，觉得这个婚礼又新颖又有意义。","零假设和结果之间的差异越大，样本规模越大，对结果是有意义的就越有信心。"]],["sidewalk","'saidwɒ:k","n. 人行道",["I saw Tom pushing a stroller down the sidewalk.","The tree roots have burst through the cement at several points along the sidewalk."],["我看到湯姆推著嬰兒車走在人行道上。",""]],["technological",".teknә'lɒdʒikl","a. 技术的\\n[经] 工艺的, 技术的",["Technological innovation brought about the rapid progress of the information industry.","Thanks to the technological innovation, the maximum output of the factory has doubled."],["",""]],["pleasant","'pleznt","a. 愉快的, 可爱的, 活泼的, 亲切的",["It was a pleasant day, but there were few people in the park.","It is very pleasant to cross the ocean by ship."],["那天天氣很好，但公園裏人並不多。","乘船过海非常舒服。"]],["signature","'signәtʃә","n. 签字, 识别标志, 调号\\n[计] 签名附件",["Recent J-POP doesn't really have many signature songs, you know.","I attached my signature to the document."],["你也知道，最近的 J-POP 實際上並沒有很多招牌歌曲。","我簽署了文件。"]],["wow","wau","interj. (非正式)哇\\nn. 巨大的成功, 轰动一时的成功, 十分有趣的事物\\n[计] WIn32上的Windows",["Wow, I can't believe they actually met the deadline for once.","\"How much did you pay for this?\" \"About 20 euros.\" \"Wow! That's incredibly cheap.\""],["哇，真不敢相信他們這次居然真的趕上截止日期了。","“你付了多少钱？” “大概二十欧元。” “哇！好便宜。”"]],["suspend","sә'spend","vt. 悬, 吊, 使悬浮, 暂停, 中止, 推迟\\nvi. 暂停, 中止, 悬浮, 停止偿付债务\\n[计] 暂停",["We reserve the right to suspend any account that violates our terms of use.","During the movie, I tried to suspend my disbelief, but failed."],["",""]],["rebel","'rebl","n. 叛徒, 反叛者\\nvi. 造反, 反抗, 抵抗, 反感\\na. 造反的, 反抗的",["The notorious rebel was ultimately captured and confined to jail.","The rebel was ultimately captured and confined to jail."],["",""]],["spouse","spauz","n. 配偶",["Tom found a wonderful spouse in Mary.","Mr. Pierre and his spouse really like my children; I really like their children too."],["湯姆認識了瑪莉這麼個好老婆。",""]],["frozen","'frәuzn","a. 冻结的, 冰冷的, 严寒的, 冻伤的, 冷酷的\\nfreeze的过去分词",["The snow lay on the ground, frozen into a thick, hard crust.","I hung the laundry out to dry last night and by morning it had frozen hard as a rock."],["地上覆盖着积雪，冻成了又硬又厚的壳。",""]],["fluid","'flu:id","n. 液体, 分泌液, 流体\\na. 流动的, 可改变的",["My correction fluid has run out, so now I only write in pencil.","A proper test does not allow the use of correction fluid."],["我的涂改液用完了，现在写字只用铅笔。","正規的考試不允許使用塗改液。"]],["resume","ri'zju:m","vt. 重新开始, 取回, 恢复\\nvi. 再开始\\nn. 摘要, 个人简历\\n[计] 继续执行",["I asked the company for his resume.","I don't worry so much about my resume."],["我向他公司询问了他的经历。","我對自己的履歷不那麼在意。"]],["theoretical","θiә'retikәl","a. 理论的, 理论上的, 假设的, 推理的\\n[计] 理论的",["The Greeks invented a theoretical model of geometry.","The lecture is composed by two parts, one theoretical, the other practical."],["希臘人建立了幾何學的理論模型。",""]],["sodium","'sәudiәm","n. 钠\\n[化] 钠Na",["Sodium bicarbonate is commonly known as baking soda.","Lithium, sodium, potassium, rubidium, caesium and francium are alkali metals."],["碳酸氫鈉通常被稱為小蘇打。",""]],["pension","'penʃәn","n. 养老金, 退休金, 津贴, 年金, 抚恤金, 膳宿学校, 膳宿费\\nvt. 发给退休金, 用津贴拉拢",["People over 65 can receive a pension from the government.","Instead of relying on a pension, he resolved to apply for the job."],["过65岁的人就可以从政府那里领退休金了。",""]],["promotion","prәu'mәuʃәn","n. 晋级, 创建, 增进\\n[经] 推广, 推销, 促进",["Recently T Mall has had a sales promotion on cell phones.","My colleague and I do the same job, but he was promised a promotion in a very short while."],["最近天猫上有手机促销活动。","我和我別的同事做同樣的事情，但是得到了能在很短時間內得到晉升的承諾。"]],["delicate","'delikәt","a. 细致优雅的, 微妙的, 美味的\\n[医] 柔弱的",["Indeed she is young and beautiful, but she is in delicate health.","Those who are delicate in health are apt to catch a cold when the cold season sets in."],["她确实年轻貌美，但她体质娇弱。",""]],["forehead","'fɒ:rid","n. 额, 前额, 前部\\n[医] 额",["Worried, the shopkeeper ran over and kneeled beside Dima, who was breathing heavily - his forehead covered in sweat.","The scar on his forehead really stands out."],["店主擔心地跑過去跪在迪馬身旁, 迪馬沉重地喘著氣, 他的額頭覆著一層汗。","他額頭上的疤痕很醒目。"]],["electrical","i'lektrikәl","a. 电的, 有关电的\\n[医] 电的",["This electrical device must have been damaged during delivery.","Sharks are sensitive to electrical impulses as well as sound."],["这个电子仪器肯定在运输途中损坏了。","鯊魚對電子信號和噪音很敏感。"]],["rebuild","ri'bild","vt. 改建, 重建, 改造\\nvi. 重建",["Federal, state, and community officials immediately pledged to rebuild it.","They said humanity needs to rebuild the Tower of Babel, I have no comment on this."],["聯邦、州及地方官員立即承諾將其重建。","他们说人类要重建巴别塔，我对此不予评价。"]],["hook","huk","n. 钩, 钩状, 镰刀, 陷阱\\nvt. 挂...于钩上, 钩住, 引上钩, 偷窃\\nvi. 弯成钩状, 钩紧\\n[计] 钩",["He asked me to do what I can to hook them up.","Since my nephew was still young, he was let off the hook."],["他求我尽力去帮他搭桥拉线。",""]],["bounce","bauns","n. 跳, 跳跃, 弹力, 撞击\\nvi. 反跳, 弹跳\\nvt. 使跳回, 撞击\\n[计] 打回",["Tom had to borrow money to put into his savings account so that his cheque wouldn't bounce.","Ultraviolet light comes from the sun, but it can also bounce off of other surfaces like water, snow, and concrete."],["",""]],["detective","di'tektiv","n. 侦探\\na. 侦探的",["He would often read detective stories after supper.","She employed a private detective to keep a watch on her husband."],["他常常在吃過晚飯後看偵探小說。","她僱了一個私人偵探看守她的丈夫。"]],["click","klik","n. 咔哒声, 啪嗒声\\nvi. 作咔哒声\\nvt. 使发咔哒声\\n[计] 单击",["Please do not answer this fraudulent e-mail and certainly do not click on the links in the e-mail.","Click: Quickly pushing the mouse's left hand side button once."],["請不要回覆這封詐騙電郵，當然也不要點擊電郵裏的超連結。",""]],["traveler","'trævlә","n. 旅行者, 游客, 旅客, 旅行推销员, 活动起重架, 行车, 临时记帐单",["The traveler was delighted at the sight of a light in the distance.","Our travel advice center caters to the independent traveler."],["发现了远处的灯光的旅行者欢喜不已。",""]],["compensation",".kɒmpen'seiʃәn","n. 补偿, 赔偿金, 工资\\n[医] 代偿(机能), 补偿",["Workers' compensation due to strain injuries was undervalued.","He received a large sum of money in compensation for his injury."],["",""]],["exit","'eksit","n. 出口, 退场, 离去, 去世\\nvi. 退出, 脱离, 去世\\n[计] 退出; DOS内部命令:本命令用于退出当前的命令处理器(CO…",["If there's an emergency, you must run out of the house through this exit.","An important reason for the fall of the Roman Empire was that they had no zero. So they had no way of demonstrating a successful exit of their C programs."],["有紧急情况时，必须通过这个出口跑出房子。","罗马帝国灭亡的其中一个主要原因是他们没有0 —— 这样他们就没法给自己的C程序指明成功退出的路。"]],["dedicate","'dedikeit","vt. 献出, 贡献",["Once I retire, I will dedicate all my time to Tatoeba.","Having climbed all the way to the shrine, I decided to dedicate a votive horse tablet."],["",""]],["attraction","ә'trækʃәn","n. 吸引, 吸引人的事物, 吸引力\\n[医] 吸引",["The tickets for this attraction can only be bought online.","The coral reef is the region's prime attraction."],["這個景點只能網上購票。","珊瑚礁是这个地区的主要景点。"]],["altogether",".ɒ:ltә'geðә","adv. 完全地, 总而言之",["The Latin language is not entirely unknown to me, but I altogether lack the ability to speak it.","Only by prohibiting nuclear weapons altogether can we stop the arms race."],["拉丁语对我来说不是完全陌生的，但我不懂说这门语言。",""]],["pickup","'pikʌp","n. 拾起, 加速, 刺激, 猎物的收集, 好转, 恢复健康, 搭车者, 兴奋剂, 电视摄像\\n[电] 拾音器",["I remember riding home on a pickup truck last Sunday.","I remembered riding home in a pickup truck last Sunday."],["",""]],["carve","kɑ:v","v. 雕刻, 切开",["Most bans on gender-affirming care explicitly carve out exceptions for the only actual child genital mutilation going on, that against intersex babies.","It takes a skilled craftsman to carve a handle that ornate."],["大多數針對性別肯定照護的禁令都針對陰陽人嬰兒明確規定了唯一豁免，允許他們接受真正的兒童生殖器切割。",""]],["needle","'ni:dl","n. 针, 尖\\nvt. 用针缝\\nvi. 缝纫\\n[计] 探针",["My hands were shaking too much to thread the needle.","It is easier for a camel to pass through the eye of a needle than for a rich man to enter the kingdom of God."],["我的手抖得太厉害，没法穿针了。","富人要進天國，比駱駝穿過針孔還要難。"]],["belly","'beli","n. 腹部, 食欲\\nvt. 使鼓起\\nvi. 鼓起, 匍匐前进",["His body type is born balanced! Wide shoulders, slim waist, belly not popping outwards.","Koala bears do not have belly buttons."],["他的体形生得很匀称！肩膀宽，腰身窄，肚子又没凸出来。","无尾熊没有肚脐。"]],["scare","skєә","n. 惊吓, 恐慌\\nvt. 惊吓, 使恐慌\\nvi. 受惊",["If I wanted to scare you, I would tell you what I dreamt about a few weeks ago.","If you have rat or mouse problems, you can scare them off with ultrasound."],["如果我是想吓你，我就会告诉你我几周前梦到的事。","你如果遭受老鼠困擾，可以使用超音波來嚇跑牠們。"]],["timing","'taimiŋ","n. 时间选择, 时间测定, 定时, 调速\\n[计] 定时器时钟",["I feel awful about the timing, but there's never a good time.","The timing of the announcement hurts the public relations of the police."],["这个时机很糟糕，但这种事永远没有好时候。","聲明的時機對警察的公衆關係不利。"]],["portfolio","pɒ:t'fәuliәu","n. 皮包, 公文包, 部长职务, 有价证券财产目录, 艺术代表作选辑\\n[法] 公文包, 文件夹, 阁员职务",["As part of my application to art school, here is my portfolio.","Sami took a picture of Layla's hair for his portfolio."],["",""]],["shuttle","'ʃʌtl","n. 穿梭, 梭子, 往返移动之物\\nv. (使)穿梭移动, 往返运送",["How long does it take for the airport shuttle to get to the airport?","The airport shuttle will take you to Tokyo International Airport."],["穿梭班车到机场需要多长时间？",""]],["invisible","in'vizәbl","a. 看不见的, 无形的\\n[经] 无形的, 表面上看不见的, 未列在公开帐目的",["If I were invisible, I wouldn't have to wear anything.","If I were invisible I wouldn't have to dress myself."],["若我是隱形的，就不用穿衣服了。","若我是隱形的，就不用穿衣服了。"]],["engagement","in'geidʒdmәnt","n. 诺言, 约会, 婚约, 交战\\n[医] 衔接",["The engagement of Mr Rogers and Miss Smith was announced yesterday.","He announced his engagement to her."],["罗杰斯先生和史密斯小姐昨天宣布订婚。","他宣布与她订婚。"]],["transaction","træn'sækʃәn","n. 交易, 办理, 学报, 和解协议\\n[计] 事务处理",["Tony went to Boston for the purpose of carrying out an important business transaction.","The businessman didn't dare withdraw from the transaction."],["",""]],["ankle","'æŋkl","n. 踝\\n[医] 踝, 踝关节",["A sprained ankle disabled him from walking for a month.","She twisted her ankle while she was doing exercise."],["他把足踝扭傷了，整整一個月不能走路。","她锻炼时扭伤了脚踝。"]],["rescue","'reskju:","n. 援救, 解救, 营救\\nvt. 援救, 救出, 营救",["National rescue teams are on standby ready to fly to Japan.","The rescue workers are going to hand out supplies to the victims of the earthquake."],["國際救難隊伍隨時待命準備前往日本。","救助人员将为地震受灾者发放物资。"]],["counterpart","'kauntәpɑ:t","n. 副本, 复本, 配对物, 相应物\\n[经] 副本, 正副二份中之一",["The pro-Kurdish movement in Turkey is less Islamophobic and pro-Zionist than its counterpart in Algeria.","I tried to close the discussions at noon, but my counterpart would not stop talking."],["",""]],["historically","his'tɔrikәli","adv. 历史上地；从历史观点上说",["Fork-users have historically been in the minority.","Algeria is named after Algiers, its historically largest and most important city and present-day capital."],["",""]],["firmly","'fә:mli","adv. 坚固, 坚定, 断然",["She is firmly determined to own a store of her own.","I have my feet firmly planted on the ground."],["她下定決心要擁有自己的店。","我是个脚踏实地的人。"]],["mild","maild","a. 温和的, 温柔的, 淡味的, 适度的, 轻微的, (肥皂等)软性的\\n[医] 轻的, 缓和的",["The climate of this town is so mild that the thermometer seldom rises to thirty degrees, even in midsummer.","It's fairly mild for this time of year."],["這小鎮的天氣十分暖和，即使是在盛夏，溫度計也很少會升到三十度。","就现在这个节气来说天气是相当温和了。"]],["noon","nu:n","n. 正午, 中午, 全盛期",["The train will probably arrive at the station before noon.","The handyman was supposed to arrive at twelve noon, but got stuck in a traffic jam for a few hours."],["火车大概会在中午前到站。","這個工人本來應該在中午十二點到達, 但他被交通堵塞困住了幾個小時。"]],["identical","ai'dentikәl","a. 同一的, 恒等的, 完全相同的\\n[医] 同一的, 同等的",["No two words are identical in meaning.","He is identical to his older brother."],["每一個字的意思都是獨特的。","他跟哥哥一模一样。"]],["doll","dɒl","n. 洋娃娃, 无头脑的美丽女人",["If you wind up the doll with the key on the side of its torso it will swing its arms round and go forward doing somersaults.","I'd like a doll, a new bicycle..... and peace on earth!"],["如果你在洋娃娃腹部的側面上鏈的話，它就會扭動手臂，翻著筋斗向前前進。","我想要一个洋娃娃，一辆新自行车……以及世界和平。"]],["rider","'raidә","n. 骑手, (文件后的)附件, 扶手\\n[化] 游码",["Let Dan be a snake in the way, a serpent in the path, that biteth the horse's heels, that his rider may fall backward.","Only a bareback rider at the circus shaves her legs above the knees."],["",""]],["amid","ә'mid","prep. 在其间, 在其中\\n[经] 在...中",["There's a fear that the snow will strengthen amid the strong winter pressure pattern.","The curtain fell amid the wild applause of the audience."],["人們擔心在強勁的冬季氣壓模式下，降雪量會增加。",""]],["precise","pri'sais","a. 精确的, 严谨的, 明确的\\n[机] 精密的, 正确的",["Our teacher is someone who likes precision, and always demands precise answers of her students.","The more precise the calculations, the stronger the friendship."],["老師性喜精準——她總是要求精確的答案。","算帳愈是精確, 友誼愈是堅定。"]],["anxious","'æŋʃәs","a. 忧虑的, 发愁的, 渴望的",["Everyone is anxious to know what has become of the former champion.","We are anxious about our daughter's health."],["大家都渴望知道前冠军得主发生了什么。","我们对女儿的健康问题很担忧。"]],["residential",".rezi'denʃәl","a. 住宅的, 与居住有关的\\n[法] 有关居住的, 房产的:居所的, 适于居住的",["Please write down your residential address and home number.","That's the only residential building in Boston that's been torn down recently."],["请写下住址和家庭电话。",""]],["structural","'strʌktʃәrәl","a. 结构的, 建筑的\\n[医] 结构的",["No one can question the profound structural unity of the Berber language.","The structural integrity of the building is compromised."],["",""]],["carbohydrate",".kɑ:bәu'haidreit","n. 碳水化合物, 糖类\\n[化] 糖类; 碳水化合物",["Only manual laborers need a high carbohydrate diet.","This chow contains not less than 23 per cent protein and 4.5 per cent fat, and about 57 per cent carbohydrate."],["",""]],["diagnose","'daiәgnәuz","v. 诊断",["That can diagnose anything, quicker and cheaper than a doctor.","Simply put in a sample of your urine and the computer will diagnose your problem and tell you what you can do about it."],["",""]],["theology","θi'ɒlәdʒi","n. 神学",["Fadil studied theology as an undergraduate degree.","You don't have to study theology to be a believer."],["",""]],["poster","'pәustә","n. 海报, 招贴, 驿马",["Sami's innocent face appeared on a missing poster.","Cartoonist Walt Kelly created a special Earth Day poster."],["",""]],["liberty","'libәli","n. 自由, 特权, 许可, 冒失\\n[法] 自由, 自由权, 自由区域",["Liberty consists of being able to make everything as harmless as possible.","The essence of liberty is mathematics."],["自由旨在能够做所有不伤害其他人的事。","自由的本质就是数学。"]],["crawl","krɒ:l","n. 爬行, 匍匐而行, 养鱼池\\nv. 爬行",["I'm so embarrassed I could dig a hole and crawl into it.","I'm so sorry about what I did. I wish I could just crawl into a hole and die."],["我窘得想找個洞鑽進去。",""]],["nonprofit","nɒn'prɒfit","a. 非赢利的, 无利可图的\\n[法] 非营利的, 无利可图的",["My nonprofit has a hands on approach to problem solving.","There aren't that many nonprofit organizations in my country."],["",""]],["handsome","'hænsәm","a. 英俊的, 大方的, 慷慨的, 相当可观的, 美观的, 灵敏的",["He's very smart, and he's handsome too.","Tom wasn't as handsome as Mary said he was."],["他很聪明，而且他很帅。","汤姆并不是玛丽说得那样英俊。"]],["oxygen","'ɒksәdʒәn","n. 氧\\n[化] 氧O-2",["It is impossible to live without water and without oxygen.","A water molecule has two hydrogen atoms and one oxygen atom."],["在沒有水和氧氣的狀態下是不可能存活的。","一個水分子是由兩個氫原子和一個氧原子組成的。"]],["businessman","'biznismæn","n. 商人, 实业家, 工商业家",["He is a Japanese businessman, but he lives in Finland.","Tom seems to be a fairly successful businessman."],["他是一名日本商人，但他住在芬兰。","湯姆看來是箇很成功的商人。"]],["provided","prә'vaidid","conj. 倘若, 以...为条件",["I'll lend you the book, provided you return it next week.","I don't mind lending you the money provided you pay it back within a month."],["如果你可以在下個星期還給我的話，這本書就借給你吧。","假如能一个月之内还上的话，我可以把钱借给你。"]],["sum","sʌm","n. 总数, 总和, 金额, 概要, 顶点\\nvt. 总计, 概括\\nvi. 合计\\n[计] 系统实用程序和维护",["He anonymously donated a large sum of money to the Red Cross.","Tatoeba: Because a language is more than the sum of its words."],["他匿名向红十字捐了大笔钱。","Tatoeba: 因為語言意義不只是單字的總合。"]],["promising","'prɒmisiŋ","a. 有希望的, 前途有望的\\n[经] 有希望的",["Mary is a very promising student, whereas Tom promises much but achieves little.","Mars is a promising place where we may be able to live."],["瑪麗是個很有前途的學生，而湯姆則是光說不練。",""]],["conscious","'kɒnʃәs","a. 有意识的, 知觉的, 觉察的\\n[医] 有意识的, 清醒的",["The warrior is conscious of both his strength and his weakness.","To make matters worse, he isn't even conscious of annoying his neighbors."],["戰士知道自己的力量和弱點。","让事情更糟糕的是，他没有注意到他打扰到了邻居。"]],["determination","di.tә:mi'neiʃәn","n. 决心, 果断\\n[化] 判定; 测定",["The soul is made up of reason, determination, and passion.","If confidence, determination and courage are together in one place, there is nothing that cannot be done."],["灵魂是由理性、意志和情欲构成的。","信心、毅力、勇氣三者具備，則天下沒有做不成的事。"]],["donor","'dәunә","n. 捐赠人\\n[化] 给体; 供体",["Mary was donor-conceived and is trying to track down her biological father.","The treatment was made possible by a benevolent donor."],["",""]],["jazz","dʒæz","n. 爵士乐, 喧闹\\na. 爵士乐的, 喧吵的\\nvi. 演奏爵士乐, 跳爵士舞, 游荡\\nvt. 奏爵士乐, 使活泼",["Tom started playing jazz after studying classical music for many years.","Jazz fusion is a combination of rock and jazz."],["在学习古典音乐多年后，汤姆开始演奏爵士了。","融合爵士是搖滾樂與爵士樂的融合。"]],["hers","hә:z","pron. 她的",["As far as she goes, yea, she does have those few faults, but it's just those faults of hers that make me like her even more.","Nancy ran across an old friend of hers yesterday."],["她的话是有那么几个缺点，但就是因为这些缺点，我更喜欢她了。","Nancy昨天巧遇了她的一个老朋友。"]],["pastor","'pæstә","n. 牧师",["The girl closed her eyes and listened to the pastor.","The girl, closing her eyes, listened to the pastor."],["小女孩闭上了眼睛听了牧师。",""]],["opera","'ɒpәrә","n. 歌剧",["The singer has a good opera voice, but I don't think he'll catch on with young people.","I am either going to see a film, or going to see an opera."],["這位歌手擁有一副好嗓子，但我認為他不會受到年輕人的喜愛。","我或者去看电影，或者去看歌剧。"]],["acquisition",".ækwi'ziʃәn","n. 获得, 获得物\\n[经] 收购, 招揽, 取得",["Education is the acquisition of the art of the utilisation of knowledge.","Second-language acquisition requires a lot of hard work and dedication to reach fluency."],["",""]],["pit","pit","n. 深坑, 矿井, 果核, 地窖, 深渊, 绝境, 陷阱\\nvt. 窖藏, 使凹下, 使有麻点, 去...之核, 使留疤痕, 使相斗, …",["The demon grabbed my sister and, with howling laughter, cast her into a bottomless pit.","A fall into a pit, a gain in your wit."],["惡魔一把抓住了我的妹妹，一邊猙獰地狂笑着，一邊把她丟進了一個無底洞裏。","吃一堑长一智。"]],["hug","hʌg","n. 紧抱, 拥抱\\nvt. 紧抱, 坚持, 使沾沾自喜",["Give a hug to your parents before you get far away from your hometown.","Someone among them wants to hug you."],["在你们远离家乡之前请给父母一个拥抱。","他们中有一个人想要拥抱你。"]],["wildlife","'waildlaif","n. 野生动植物",["The state will build specially made bridges so that koalas and other wildlife can cross roads while avoiding cars and trucks.","During the holidays, some university students go to Africa as volunteers and help to perfect local wildlife conservation."],["该州将修建特制的桥梁以便考拉和其他野生动物可以在避开汽车和卡车的情况下过马路。","一些大学生在假期去非洲做志愿者 ，帮助当地完善野生生物管理。"]],["punish","'pʌniʃ","vt. 处罚, 惩罚, 严厉对待\\nvi. 惩罚",["In Singapore, one way to punish a criminal is to whip him or her.","\"Teacher, would you punish me for something I didn't do?\" \"No.\" \"I didn't do my homework.\""],["在新加坡，鞭刑是处置犯人的方法之一。","\"老师，你会为了我没做的事情而罚我吗？“”不会。“”我没做作业。“"]],["equity","'ekwiti","n. 公平, 公正\\n[经] 权益, 产权",["The company is open for equity participation by anybody.","He was the oldest man present, and was celebrated among the villagers for the equity of his decisions."],["",""]],["doorway","'dɒ:wei","n. 门口, 途径",["A strange woman was standing in the doorway.","A man suddenly appeared in the doorway."],["門口站著一個奇怪的女人。","一个男的突然出现在门口。"]],["departure","di'pɑ:tʃә","n. 离开, 出发, 违背, 偏离\\n[经] 启运",["With the weather getting worse, the departure was put off.","Departure is a partial death but death in essence is not only departure."],["由于天气变差，出发延迟了。","离开是部分的死亡，而死亡不仅仅是离开。"]],["teenage","'ti:nidʒ","a. 十三岁到十九岁的",["This teenage pop star has been described as androgynous.","The family of the teenage bashing victim took the agonising decision to switch off his life support."],["",""]],["guidance","'gaidns","n. 指导, 领导\\n[医] 导",["Under the teacher's guidance, I took big strides with my studies.","The camp counselors are supposed to provide guidance and mentorship to the students."],["在老师的指导下，我的学习有了很大的进步。","營輔員應負責為學生提供指引和輔導。"]],["happiness","'hæpinis","n. 快乐, 幸运, 适当",["It may be that the happiness awaiting us is not at all the sort of happiness we would want.","A man's happiness doesn't depend on what he has, but on what he is."],["很可能等待着我们的幸福根本不是我们要的那种幸福。","人的幸福不在于他拥有什么，而在于他是什么样的人。"]],["elevator","'eliveitә","n. 电梯, 升降机\\n[化] 提升机",["After asking for my key at the front desk, I took the elevator to my floor.","In an emergency, use the stairway, not the elevator."],["我到櫃檯拿了鑰匙，然後就乘電梯去了我房間的樓層。","事故發生時，敬勿使用電梯，請使用樓梯。"]],["statue","'stætju","vt. 以雕像装饰\\nn. 雕像",["The statue of the Minute Man commemorates the valiant soldiers who fought in the Revolutionary War.","The statue of Hachiko, the faithful dog, stands in front of Shibuya Station."],["民兵雕像是为了纪念独立战争中英勇作战的士兵。","忠犬八公的雕像伫立在涩谷站前。"]],["pursuit","pә'sju:t","n. 追踪, 追求, 追赶, 娱乐, 职业\\n[法] 追捕, 追求",["In fact, love is the only genuinely precious thing in life; it's also the only thing worthy of pursuit.","Bleeding from her little finger, the nymphomaniac started a hot pursuit with the cops on a stolen raft."],["其實愛情是人生唯一的、真正珍貴的；也是唯一的、真正值得追求的東西。",""]],["repair","ri'pєә","n. 修理, 补救, 修复\\nvt. 修理, 修补, 补救, 恢复, 补偿\\nvi. 修理, 修补, 补救, 恢复, 去, 常去, 集合",["There's new energy to harness, new jobs to be created, new schools to build, and threats to meet, alliances to repair.","I will only buy the car if they repair the brakes first."],["我们需要开发新的能源、创造新的工作岗位，我们需要修建新学校，应对众多威胁、修复与许多国家的盟友关系。","除非他们事先修好刹车，我才会买车子。"]],["oral","'ɒ:rәl","n. 口试\\na. 口头的, 口述的, 口部的",["Sami had Layla perform oral sex on him.","I still don't like Cavalieri, Tonelli, or Fubini... and my oral calculus exam is already tomorrow."],["薩米讓萊拉幫他口交。",""]],["gym","dʒim","n. +体育馆, 体育训练, 体育课, 体操",["As for physical exercise, although I loathe most sports (I think they're really boring), I do like going to the gym to lift weights.","Because there's the chance to help each other, as well as some healthy competition, I think going to the gym with friends is the best way."],["要说锻炼身体，虽然我痛恨大部分的运动，觉得它们真的无聊，但是我喜欢去健身房举重。","因为有互相帮助的机会也有正常竞争，所以我觉得跟朋友去健身房是最好的办法。"]],["clerk","klә:k","n. 办事员, 职员, 文书\\nvi. 当店员",["Tom tried to return the swimsuit for a larger size, but the clerk told him that wasn't allowed.","Bob worked as a clerk in the grocery store on Saturday."],["汤姆试过还回泳衣来换成更大一号的，但是员工告诉他那是不被允许的。","每周六鲍勃在杂货店做店员。"]],["decent","'di:sәnt","a. 有分寸的, 得体的, 大方的",["Please keep your language decent while my parents are here.","Finding a decent man is more difficult than winning a lottery."],["我父母在的时候，请你言语注意分寸。","找一个好男人比中彩票还要难。"]],["envelope","'envәlәup","n. 信封, 封套, 封袋\\n[医] 膜, 包袋",["Tom told me not to open the envelope until my birthday.","The secretary stuffed the letter into an envelope."],["汤姆告诉我，到我生日那天我才能打开信封。","秘書把信塞到了信封裡。"]],["fist","fist","n. 拳头, 手\\nvt. 拳打, 握成拳, 紧握",["She banged the table with her fist.","\"Short tempered as ever.\" He said while dodging Reika's fist."],["她用拳頭拍了桌子。",""]],["reporting","ri'pɒ:tiŋ","n. 报道\\n[经] 报告, 汇报",["All the newspapers were reporting on it.","The Defense Enrollment Eligibility Reporting System is also called DEERS."],["所有報紙都在報導這件事。",""]],["destination",".desti'neiʃәn","n. 目的地, 目标, 目的\\n[计] 目的文件, 目的单元",["Round-trip fares to each destination are as follows.","We reached our destination just as I thought the car was going to give up the ghost."],["往返各地的收费如下。","我們抵達目的地的時候，我還以為那輛車快要報廢了。"]],["endorse","in'dɒ:s","vt. 支持, 赞同, 背书于, 签署\\n[经] 赞成, 背书",["Although Imam Ziri advocates tolerance, he doesn't endorse same-sex marriage.","Muslims don't endorse violence in the name of religion."],["",""]],["exploration",".eksplә'reiʃәn","n. 探险, 踏勘, 探测\\n[医] 探察",["I like how WHAT THE CAR? combines racing with fun puzzle gameplay and exploration.","From the standpoint of ecology, Antarctica should be reserved solely for research, not for tourism or for commercial exploration."],["我喜歡《WHAT THE CAR?》將賽車與有趣的益智遊戲和探索相結合。",""]],["generous","'dʒenәrәs","a. 慷慨的, 有雅量的, 大量的, 丰富的",["However, I've never been a guest in an English household that wasn't generous.","It seems that everyone likes to be generous in welcoming guests to their home."],["不过，我从来没有在一个小气的英国家庭做过客。","好像所有的人喜欢大方地欢迎客人来他们家。"]],["feedback","'fi:dbæk","n. 反馈, 反应\\n[计] 反馈",["The company welcomes feedback from consumers who use their products.","Please review the contents and provide any appropriate feedback."],["公司欢迎消费者对他们产品的反馈",""]],["bath","bæθ.bɑ:θ","n. 沐浴, 浴室\\n[医] 浴",["Last night I was dead drunk and fell asleep without having a bath.","On the winter solstice we have a hot bath with yuzu citrus fruits in it."],["昨夜，我烂醉了，我没洗澡就睡觉了。","冬至時，我們泡熱水澡，池中會加柚子。"]],["thereby","'ðєәbai","adv. 因此",["The failure was detected in time, thereby preventing a disaster.","The secret of the agitator is to make himself as stupid as his audience; thereby they believe they are as clever as he is."],["",""]],["indicator","'indikeitә","n. 指示器, 指示剂, 指标\\n[计] 指示器",["Rank smells are a clear indicator that food should be thrown away.","You forgot to drop the indicator, that's why it never changes its color."],["",""]],["spectrum","'spektrәm","n. 光谱, 范围, 系列\\n[化] 光谱",["You can see the colors of the spectrum in a rainbow.","The upcoming fifth edition of the DSM proposes a new spectrum-based classification of autistic disorders."],["",""]],["purple","'pә:pl","n. 紫色, 帝位\\na. 紫色的, 帝王的, 华而不实的\\nv. (使)成紫色",["The fisherman caught a purple jellyfish in his net.","Thoreau coveted the plant's strong purple stalk for a cane, and the robins eat its dark crimson-juiced berries."],["渔民用他的网捕到了一只紫色的水母。","梭羅垂涎於這種植物強壯的紫色莖稈，將其製成藤條，而知更鳥則以深紅色汁液的漿果為食。"]],["sunlight","'sʌnlait","n. 日光\\n[医] 日光, 太阳光",["Skin shouldn't be exposed to sunlight for too long.","The icy road sparkled in the sunlight."],["不要把皮肤长时间暴露在阳光里。","結冰的道路在陽光下閃閃發亮。"]],["laser","'leizә","n. 激光\\n[计] 激光器",["Laser printers are generally cheaper to maintain than inkjet printers.","I'm checking for laser beam alarm triggers."],["激光打印机一般比喷墨打印机用起来更省钱。","我在检查这里有没有激光警报装置。"]],["bold","bәuld","a. 大胆的\\nn. 粗体\\n[计] 粗体",["Though timid in some respects, he was very bold in others.","The bold man glanced at the gangster with hatred and contempt."],["",""]],["expertise",".ekspә:'ti:z","n. 专家意见, 专门技术\\n[法] 专门知识, 专家意见",["We provide broad services to the computer end users, based on our experience and technical expertise.","His lack of expertise has never stopped him from talking about the subject for several hours straight."],["",""]],["starting","'stɑ:tiŋ","n. 开端, 开始, 出发, 起动, 开动\\n[机] 开动, 起动",["Starting from today, I am going to learn a little Japanese.","This young man doesn't have work experience because he's just starting out."],["从今天开始，我要学一点日语。","那个年轻人没有经验，因为他才开始工作。"]],["reluctant","ri'lʌktәnt","a. 不情愿的, 勉强的\\n[法] 不愿的, 勉强的, 难以处理的",["Too long a holiday makes one reluctant to start work again.","Some soldiers were reluctant to obey the commands."],["",""]],["practically","'præktikli","adv. 几乎, 差不多, 事实上",["The famous hotel was practically destroyed by a large fire.","Tom would do practically anything to keep Mary happy."],["著名的酒店几乎被大火烧毁了。","為了哄瑪莉開心，湯姆幾乎會做任何事。"]],["eating","'i:tiŋ","n. 吃, 食物\\na. 侵蚀的, 腐蚀性的",["New Year is the time for a lot of eating and drinking.","I don't recommend eating in that restaurant. The food is awful."],["新年是大吃大喝的好時節。","我不推荐在那家餐馆吃饭。食物糟糕透了。"]],["parade","pә'reid","n. 游行, 炫耀, 阅兵\\nv. 游行, 炫耀, (使)列队行进",["A crowd of people gathered to see the parade.","I caught sight of a parade on my way home."],["一大群人聚在一起看巡游。","在回家的路上，我看到一场阅兵式。"]],["sharply","'ʃɑ:pli","adv. 锐利地, 严厉地, 厉害地\\n[经] 剧烈地",["Slender and form-fitting with a high cut, the new qipao contrasted sharply with the traditional one.","Corporate earnings in the first quarter improved sharply."],["新的旗袍又修长又紧身，也有短裙摆，与传统式样构成了鲜明的对比。","企业第一季度收益大幅增长。"]],["hint","hint","n. 暗示, 提示\\nv. 暗示, 示意",["Anna's striking almond-shaped eyes, inherited from her Asian lineage, exude a captivating depth and a hint of mystery.","The girl, her eyes shining brightly from that single hint, makes her cute cat-motif automatic pencil run across her notebook."],["安娜引人注目的杏仁狀眼睛繼承了她的亞洲血統，散發著迷人的深度和一絲神秘感。","這女孩的眼睛閃爍著光亮, 這個暗示讓她可愛的貓圖案自動鉛筆越過了她的筆記本。"]],["realm","relm","n. 王国, 领土, 领域\\n[计] 领域",["What these acts said was that it was illegal to pay someone in anything other than coin of the realm.","One is never as happy in the realm of reality as in the realm of thought."],["",""]],["blend","blend","vt. 混合\\nn. 混合",["Oil and water won't blend with each other.","Blend the mixture together until it is smooth."],["油和水不能混合。","將混合物攪拌均勻。"]],["cancel","'kænsәl","n. 取消, 撤消, 盖销(邮票)\\nvt. 取消, 删去, 抵销, 盖销\\nvi. 相互抵销\\n[计] 作废",["I had a hard time trying to persuade him to cancel the trip.","I had to cancel that order because we didn't have enough money to pay for it."],["说服他中止旅行真是件苦差事。","我们的钱不够，所以我只好把订单取消了。"]],["therapist","'θerәpist","n. 治疗学家\\n[医] 治疗学家",["The therapist finally got him to open up about what he went through during the war.","My therapist told me to go to a bar and strike up a conversation with a complete stranger."],["",""]],["constitution",".kɒnsti'tju:ʃәn","n. 构成, 宪法, 体格\\n[医] 体质; 结构, 组织",["Freedom of thought is guaranteed by the constitution.","Equality is guaranteed by the Constitution."],["思想自由為憲法所保障。","平等是由宪法保障的。"]],["pizza","'pi:tsә","n. 比萨饼",["I am so thirsty, probably because I ate pizza yesterday night.","Pizza is the kind of food that fits into today's life style."],["我渴死了，可能是因為我昨天晚上吃了比薩。","比萨是种适合现在的生活方式的食物。"]],["recipient","ri'sipiәnt","a. 领受的, 容易接受的, 感受性强的\\nn. 领受者, 容纳者, 容器",["Don't flip-flop the addresses of the sender and recipient!","The largest recipient of Japan's ODA that year was China."],["不要把寄件人、收件人地址的姓名填反了！",""]],["peel","pi:l","n. 皮, 外壳\\nvt. 削...皮, 剥去...的壳\\nvi. 蜕皮, 剥落, 脱皮, 脱去衣服",["I observe a chimpanzee peel a banana and eat it.","Anger me again, I might just peel your skin off."],["我观察到一只黑猩猩剥了一根香蕉并吃了它。","再惹我生气，小心我扒了你的皮！"]],["accounting","ә'kauntiŋ","n. 会计学, 帐单, 清帐\\n[计] 帐户处理, 记帐",["The first principle of accounting is the principle of going concern.","All you need is a little sleight of hand in your accounting to make people think your company is profitable."],["",""]],["flip","flip","vt. 掷, 弹, 轻击, 空翻\\nvi. 用指轻弹, 抽打, 蹦跳\\nn. 抛, 弹, 筋斗\\na. 无礼的\\n[计] 翻转",["Unable to find a spatula, Tom used tongs to flip the pancakes.","Don't flip-flop the addresses of the sender and recipient!"],["湯姆找不到鍋鏟了，只好用夾子為煎餅翻面。","不要把寄件人、收件人地址的姓名填反了！"]],["hesitate","'heziteit","vi. 犹豫, 迟疑, 踌躇, 支吾, 停顿",["Reporters do not hesitate to intrude into people's privacy.","When facing this opportunity, you can't hesitate to take advantage of it."],["记者没有犹豫地去干涉了人们的私生活。","面对这个机会不能犹豫，要赶快行动。"]],["bias","'baiәs","n. 偏见, 斜纹\\na. 偏斜的\\nadv. 偏斜\\nvt. 使有偏见\\n[计] 偏流; 偏压; 偏磁; 偏离",["People tend to look at others with bias.","Random assignment to a study group eliminates selection bias."],["人们趋向于带着偏见看待他人。",""]],["huh","hʌ","interj. 哼, 哈",["This robot does whatever I say. That's a big help when I'm too tired to do anything. Not too likely, huh?","You just can't stand still, huh? What are you, looking for a fight?"],["我叫這個機器人做甚麼，它就做甚麼。我累得不想動的時候，它就很幫得上忙。- 這種事不太可能吧？","你又皮发痒了，找抽，是吧？"]],["metaphor","'metәfә","n. 隐喻",["\"He's a tiger when he's angry\" is an example of metaphor.","It's apparently a metaphor for something uncatchable, light of body and fleet of foot."],["",""]],["candle","'kændl","n. 蜡烛\\nvt. 对着光检查",["The candle went out instead of having been put out.","A candle without a wick is no candle at all."],["蜡烛是自己熄灭的，而不是被扑灭的。","蠟燭沒有了芯，就不能算是蠟燭了。"]],["judicial","dʒu:'diʃәl","a. 法庭的, 公正的, 审判上的, 司法的\\n[法] 司法的, 审判上的, 法官的",["The dictator arrogated judicial powers to himself.","The U.S. government has three branches: the executive, the legislative, and the judicial."],["",""]],["entity","'entiti","n. 实体, 实存物, 存在\\n[计] 实体",["The small retail outlet is only a front for a much larger entity.","Sami and his identical twin, Farid, grew up thinking themselves as one entity."],["",""]],["suffering","'sʌfәriŋ","n. 苦难, 受苦",["The number of people suffering from heart disease has increased.","In addition to a blocked nose, I'm also suffering from a high temperature."],["遭受心脏病困扰的人数增加了。","除了鼻子不通以外，我还发着高烧。"]],["garbage","'gɑ:bidʒ","n. 垃圾, 废物\\n[计] 无用信息",["The next morning, Dima got out of the dumpster, but only to realize that all of his clothes now smelled like garbage.","In our city, we carefully separate and collect garbage."],["第二天早上，狄馬從垃圾箱裏走了出來，但卻發現自己全身的衣服都沾上了垃圾的臭味。","在我们的城市那，我们非常谨慎地分类收集垃圾。"]],["lamp","læmp","n. 灯\\nvt. 照亮\\n[计] 逻辑模拟分析系统",["I'm going to sit on the bench over there next to the street lamp.","I think this lamp has a short because the light comes on only if I jiggle the cord."],["我會在那盞街燈旁邊的長凳上坐下來。","我觉得这盏灯短路了，因为只有我摇线的时候灯才会亮。"]],["servant","'sә:vәnt","n. 仆人, 有用物, 公务员, 雇员\\n[法] 受雇人, 服务者, 公务员",["Jiang Feng's servant hired the \"Twelve Zodiacs\" to kill him. They ambushed him and his wife Yuenu.","Jiang Feng's servant hired the twelve zodiac animals to kill Jiang Feng. They ambushed Jiang Feng and his wife, Yue Nu."],["江枫的仆人雇了十二生肖杀江枫，他们伏击了江枫和江枫的妻子月奴。","江枫的仆人雇了十二生肖杀江枫，他们伏击了江枫和江枫的妻子月奴。"]],["regulatory","'regjulәtәri","a. 受控制的, 统制的, 调整的\\n[经] 规则的",["I prefer market-based solutions, such as carbon taxation, to a micromanaging regulatory approach.","Both vaccines, according to the WHO, are pending regulatory and ethics approvals from the Ugandan government."],["",""]],["diplomatic",".diplә'mætik","a. 外交的, 老练的\\n[法] 外交的, 外交上的, 文献上的",["Diplomatic dialogue helped put an end to the conflict.","South Korea established diplomatic relations with Syria."],["外交谈判帮助结束了冲突。","韓國與敘利亞建立外交關係。"]],["minimize","'minimaiz","vt. 将...减到最少\\nvt. 最小化\\nvi. 最小化\\n[计] 最小化",["A new initiative strives to minimize the number of accidents.","I want to minimize the chances of another accident."],["",""]],["elegant","'eligәnt","a. 优雅的, 端庄的, 高雅的",["I prefer Noh to Kabuki because I find the former to be more elegant than the latter.","I prefer Noh to Kabuki, because the former looks more elegant to me than the latter."],["比起歌舞伎，我更喜欢能乐表演，因为我觉得后者比前者优雅。",""]],["reception","ri'sepʃәn","n. 接待, 接受, 招待会\\n[医] 接受, 感受",["Reception in the cellar is very poor.","The reception in the cellar is really bad."],["地下室裏的信號很差。","地下室裏的信號很差。"]],["automatically",".ɒ:tә'mætikli","adv. 自动地, 机械地",["If you press this button the window opens automatically.","Tom was automatically logged out of Tatoeba."],["按下這個按鈕, 窗口會自動打開。","汤姆自动退出了Tatoeba。"]],["chin","tʃin","n. 下巴, 颏\\n[医] 颏",["Be patient and keep your chin up. Some things just take time.","He was listening with his chin resting on his hand."],["耐心地坚持下去，有些事急不来。","他用手撑着下巴，听着。"]],["racism","'reisizm","n. 种族主义, 种族偏见\\n[法] 种族主义, 种族歧视, 种族歧视主张",["It is important to condemn racism, but that alone is not enough.","Heart of Darkness raises important questions about imperialism, as well as racism."],["譴責種族主義很重要，但光是譴責種族主義是不夠的。",""]],["vanish","'væniʃ","vi. 消失, 不见, 成为零",["We should try to be philosophical about life; wealth gained could also vanish.","It's a unique device able to make stress and melancholy vanish."],["我們應該努力地豁然看待人生；獲得的財富也會煙消雲散。",""]],["confess","kәn'fes","v. 承认, 坦白, 忏悔, 供认",["There's no point in torturing him, he isn't going to confess.","There's no point torturing him anymore, he won't confess."],["再折磨他也没用，他不会招供的。","再折磨他也没用，他不会招供的。"]],["necessity","ni'sesәti","n. 需要, 必需品, 必然\\n[法] 必要性, 必然性, 必要",["In the United States the automobile is a necessity and not a luxury.","Labor is not merely a necessity but a pleasure."],["在美國，汽車並不是奢華的象徵，而是生活的必需品。","劳动不仅是一种需要，而还是一种愉快。"]],["starter","'stɑ:tә","n. 开端者, 在起跑线上的人, 参加赛跑的人, 调度员, 起动机, 酵母\\n[计] 启动程序, 启动器",["Tomatoes may be served hot or cold, as a starter or as a side dish.","If something strange happens, press the red starter-button."],["",""]],["banking","'bæŋkiŋ","n. 银行业务\\n[经] 银行业, 银行事务",["It's possible to branch out from computing to jobs in banking, accountancy and so on.","However, compared to that in cities, rural use of online news, search engines, online shopping, online banking, online stocks and so on is much lower."],["有可能將電腦工作擴展到銀行業務, 會計業務等等。","但是，相对于城镇网民，农村网民对网络新闻、搜索引擎、网络购物、网上银行和网上炒股等应用程度要低很多。"]],["casual","'kæʒjuәl","a. 偶然的, 不经意的, 便装的\\nn. 临时工, 待命士兵",["They are collecting information by casual methods.","That topic is too intimate to share with casual acquaintances."],["",""]],["gravity","'græviti","n. 地心引力, 重力\\n[化] 重力",["It's gravity that makes satellites move around the Earth.","They conducted a series of experiments under zero gravity."],["让卫星环绕地球的是重力。","他們在無重力狀態下進行了一連串的實驗。"]],["diminish","di'miniʃ","v. (使)减少, (使)变小",["This inner conflict tends to diminish as the years go by.","With no supply of water from trees, rainfalls diminish in time and the area keeps drying up."],["這種內心的衝突往往會隨著歲月流逝而平息。",""]],["prevention","pri'venʃәn","n. 阻止, 妨碍, 预防\\n[医] 预防",["The prevention of forest fires is everyone's responsibility.","An ounce of prevention is worth a pound of cure."],["防止山火，人人有責。","預防勝於治療。"]],["intent","in'tent","n. 意图, 含义, 故意\\na. 专心的, 决心的, 热心的",["The only difference between a bad cook and a poisoner is the intent.","Not far away, screened by the forest, crouched Shiegra, the lioness, intent upon devouring the infant for her evening meal."],["一個差勁的廚師和下毒者唯一的不同在於他們的意圖。","不遠處，母獅謝格拉匍匐著，隱匿於林間，正伺機將嬰兒吞食，作為她的晚餐。"]],["performer","pә'fɒ:mә","n. 表演者, 执行者, 完成者\\n[法] 执行者, 履行者, 实行者",["We gave the performer a round of applause.","The 21st century composition was so discordant that it felt as though the performer was murdering the Steinway grand piano."],["我们为表演者鼓掌。",""]],["isolate","'aisәleit","vt. 使隔离, 使孤立, 使绝缘\\nn. 隔离种群",["Johnson is a recluse; he prefers to isolate himself from the rest of the students in our class.","In medical research, one of the first problems is to isolate the cause of the disease."],["",""]],["chop","tʃɒp","n. 肋条肉, 排骨, 砍, 戳记, 商标\\nvt. 剁碎, 砍, 切击, 割断\\nvi. 砍, 突然转向",["Mary, you shouldn't chop food without using a chopping board, no matter how short a time it is for.","Actually I wanted to be a damsel in a tower guarded by seven dragons, and then a prince on a white horse would chop off the dragons' heads and liberate me."],["瑪麗，不管是多快的活兒，妳都不應該不用菜板切菜。","其實我想做一個被關在高塔裏的少女，然後有一天，就會有一個白馬王子出現，把守衛著高塔的七條龍通通殺掉，救我出來。"]],["assembly","ә'sembli","n. 与会者, 集会, 装配, 组件\\n[化] 装配",["Tessa shared her experience in a chapel assembly this April.","The assembly voted to protest against any nuclear armament."],["今年四月，苔絲在教會集會上分享了她的經驗。",""]],["productive","prә'dʌktiv","a. 能生产的, 有生产价值的, 多产的\\n[医] 产出性的, 产生性的",["You are really very productive today.","The author is seventy, but he's no less productive than he was twenty years ago."],["你今天真的很有生產力。",""]],["inventory","'invәntәri","n. 详细目录, 存货清单\\nvt. 列入详细目录, 清点存货\\n[计] 存货清单",["After inventory, there was a net balance of three hundred pesos.","The MMPI is the Minnesota Multiphasic Personality Inventory, and is just another questionnaire used in the hiring process."],["",""]],["silk","silk","n. 丝, 绸, 绸锻类, 丝织品\\na. 丝的, 丝织的",["Their main exports are textiles, especially silk and cotton.","The original purpose of the Silk Road was not for trade."],["他们主要输出的产品是纺织品，尤其以丝绸和绵为主。","絲綢之路形成的初衷並非是貿易。"]],["civic","'sivik","a. 市的, 市民的, 公民的\\n[法] 公民的, 市民的, 公民资格的",["Because of coronavirus, civic life is shutting down in Algeria.","Unlike its European neighbors and much of the rest of the world, Sweden relied on its citizens' sense of civic duty."],["",""]],["magnitude","'mægnitju:d","n. 巨大, 重大, 重要, 大小, 数量, 星等(指星的亮度)\\n[计] 大小; 值",["A massive earthquake of magnitude 8.8 hit the Japanese islands today.","You need to understand the magnitude of the problem."],["今天，8.8级的强大地震袭击了日本的岛屿。",""]],["hostage","'hɒstidʒ","n. 人质, 抵押品\\n[经] 人质, 抵押品",["Russia expresses regret for those lost in the hostage incident.","Tom brutally killed a hostage who tried to sound the alarm system."],["俄罗斯对在人质事件中牺牲的人们表示哀悼。",""]],["steep","sti:p","n. 浸渍, 悬崖\\na. 险峻的, 陡峭的, 急剧升降的, 夸大的\\nv. 浸, 泡",["The path zigzagged up the steep slope.","The staircase leading to the rooftop is narrow, steep, and dark."],["蜿蜒的小路爬上了陡坡。",""]],["popularity",".pɒpju'læriti","n. 名声, 受大众欢迎, 流行",["His first work gained great popularity among people.","With its distinctive Chinese features, the qipao enjoys growing popularity in the international world of high fashion."],["他的处女作受到了大家的极大欢迎。","旗袍因有与众不同的特点而在国际时尚界享有与日俱增的名望。"]],["collector","kә'lektә","n. 收集家, 收取款项的人\\n[化] 集电极; 捕收剂",["I've been a stamp collector ever since I was a kid.","The collector donated his whole collection to the city museum."],["",""]],["alien","'eiljәn","n. 外国人, 外侨\\na. 外国的, 相异的",["If we ever came in contact with an alien race, how would we communicate with it?","I believe that an alien intelligence is watching the Earth."],["如果有天我們真的和外星人有了接觸，我們應該怎樣和他們溝通呢？",""]],["dynamic","dai'næmik","a. 动态的, 有活力的, 有力的, 动力的, 不断变化的\\nn. 动力, 动态\\n[计] 动态的",["It's the dynamic interaction between the characters that makes this novel so great.","Renting proves to be a more flexible option for those enjoying a dynamic and rich lifestyle."],["",""]],["scary","'skєәri","a. 容易受惊的, 胆小的, 提心吊胆的",["This horror movie is really scary. I couldn't sleep after I watched it.","Possibly because he's got a beard, he looks scary at first glance but he's really a kind man."],["这部恐怖片很吓人，我一看就睡不着觉了。","或许是因为他有胡子而让他乍看之下很可怕，其实他是个非常好的人。"]],["angel","'eindʒәl","n. 天使, 守护神, 善人",["I met your mother through Facebook. So, if Facebook didn't exist, neither would you, my little angel.","My mother was an angel and an inspiration to me."],["我是在 Facebook 認識你媽媽的。所以，如果沒有 Facebook，你也不會在這個世界上了，我的小寶寶。","我的母亲是一位天使，也是我的灵感来源。"]],["equation","i'kweiʃәn","n. 相等, 等式, 平衡\\n[化] 方程式; 等式; 反应式; 公式",["It's stable because all the roots of this equation are negative.","The boy solved the simultaneous equation with ease."],["它是可靠的, 因為這個方程式所有的根都是負的。",""]],["toilet","'tɒilit","n. 厕所, 梳妆\\nvi. 梳妆, 打扮, 上厕所\\nvt. 给...梳妆打扮",["A cell phone is as contaminated with bacteria as a toilet is.","Tom dreams of the toilet when he has to go to the bathroom."],["手机如同马桶一样被细菌污染。","湯姆在需要上廁所的時候會夢見廁所。"]],["rage","reidʒ","n. 愤怒, 情绪激动, 狂暴\\nvi. 大怒, 狂吹, 流行",["\"Put this stuff away at once!\" she yelled in a rage.","I don't want to remember. I feel I'll go mad through rage."],["",""]],["photography","fә'tɒgrәfi","n. 摄影, 摄影术\\n[化] 照相术",["I participated in a photography competition.","Res96 was a popular photography reference, as well as his username."],["我參加了一個攝影比賽。",""]],["disappointed",".disә'pɒintid","a. 失望的",["We were more or less disappointed about the election.","I'm disappointed that I wasn't able to go with her."],["我們或多或少對這次的選舉感到失望。","我很失望我沒能和她一起去。"]],["offering","'ɒfәriŋ","n. 提供, 奉献物, 牲礼, 上市的股票(或证券等)\\n[经] 出售物",["Management tried to appease labor by offering them a bonus.","We lured him away from the company by offering him a much larger salary."],["",""]],["precious","'preʃәs","a. 宝贵的, 珍贵的, 过于精致的, 珍爱的",["The one resource more precious than any other was land.","It is often said that nothing is more precious than time."],["唯一比无论什么资源都珍贵的是土地。","人們常說沒有甚麼比時間更重要。"]],["prohibit","prә'hibit","vt. 禁止, 阻止\\n[经] 禁止",["Many countries have passed laws to prohibit people from smoking in public places.","What the church can't prohibit it blesses."],["",""]],["realistic","riә'listik","a. 现实的, 逼真的, 现实主义的, 实在论的",["Maybe it was an alarming situation, but in the end it was a realistic thing to say.","A long discussion boiled down to a realistic conclusion."],["",""]],["enroll","in'rәul","vt. 登记, 使加入\\nvi. 参军, 注册",["I want to enroll at graduate school.","My aspiration has always been to enroll in university."],["我想在研究生院註冊。",""]],["hidden","'hidn","a. 隐藏的\\nhide的过去分词\\n[计] 隐藏的",["I'll never tell anyone where I've hidden the treasure.","Exploring hidden treasures behind waterfalls is one of my favorite parts of WHAT THE CAR?."],["我不會把藏寶的地方告訴任何人。","《WHAT THE CAR?》中我最喜歡的部分是探索瀑布之後的隱藏寶藏。"]],["gathering","'gæðәriŋ","n. 聚集, 集中, 采集\\n[化] 富集",["The way some people see it, associating with the opposite sex is just like going to the seaside and gathering stones; everyone can pick up the ones they like.","The American Ambassador was invited to the gathering."],["有人形容，跟異性交往就好像在海邊撿石頭，大家都能撿喜歡的那一個。",""]],["outstanding",".aut'stændiŋ","a. 杰出的, 突出的, 未偿付的, 未决定的\\n[经] 未解决的, 未偿付",["We express our gratitude for Mr Smith's outstanding, challenging speech.","He came across an outstanding young person."],["我们对史密斯先生杰出的，给人启发的讲话表示感激。","他遇到了一个优秀的年轻人。"]],["stumble","'stʌmbl","n. 绊倒, 蹒跚而行, 失足\\nvt. 使绊倒, 使困惑\\nvi. 绊倒, 失足, 失策, 犯错, 蹒跚, 踌躇",["I often stumble over something as I am blind as a bat in the dark.","She walked carefully so as not to stumble over a rock."],["",""]],["lonely","'lәunli","a. 孤单的, 孤寂的, 荒凉的",["When I first came back to Boston, I was really lonely.","Lonely people perpetuate their own loneliness through their fear of others."],["当我第一次回波士顿时，我真是孤独。","孤獨的人會孤獨，是因為他畏懼他人。"]],["artificial",".ɑ:ti'fiʃәl","a. 人造的, 假的, 非原地产的\\n[医] 人工的, 人造的, 伟牟",["His thesis summed up the new achievements made in computers, artificial satellites and rockets.","They are going to launch an artificial satellite tomorrow."],["他的论文总结了电脑，人造卫星和火箭三个的新成就。","明天將要發射一顆人造衛星。"]],["dawn","dɒ:n","n. 破晓, 黎明\\nvi. 破晓",["One of his brothers is the wind, the other is the rain. One of his sisters is the sunshine, the other is the dawn.","It was before dawn that they got the fire under control."],["祂的兄弟之一是風，另一個是雨。祂的姊妹之一是陽光，另一個是拂曉。","他们在黎明前控制住了火势。"]],["automobile","'ɒ:tәmәbi:l","n. 汽车\\n[机] 汽车",["Because of the problem of air pollution, the bicycle may some day replace the automobile.","It is incomprehensible to us that a country with that level of technology would even think of making an automobile."],["因為空氣汙染的問題，也許有一天自行車會取代汽車。","只有那样技术的国家，还想要做汽车，我们十分无法理解。"]],["descend","di'send","vi. 下降, 世代相传, 屈尊, 袭击\\nvt. 下降",["I didn't expect his behavior to descend to such a disagreeable level.","Americans descend from immigrants, and they are very patriotic."],["",""]],["abstract","'æbstrækt","a. 抽象的, 深奥的\\nn. 摘要, 抽象概念\\nvt. 摘要, 提炼, 使抽象化\\n[计] 摘录; 摘要; 抽象",["To him, hunger was an abstract concept; he always had enough to eat.","Nietzsche believes philosophers should stop riding their high horse and focus more on people's differences in values, instead of abstract systems."],["對他來說，「肚子餓」是個抽象的概念，因為他從來就沒有餓過。","尼采认为，哲学家应该少一点自命不凡，多关注人的价值问题，而不是抽象的体系。"]],["silly","'sili","a. 愚蠢的, 糊涂的",["If you do silly things, you must accept the consequences without complaining.","Bob thinks it is a silly idea to call his mother who is so far away, to spend so much, and to say so little."],["如果你做了愚蠢的事，你就必須無怨尤接受痛苦懲罰。","鲍勃认为，给他那住得老远的母亲花高昂的话费，只为说上那么一两句是一个愚蠢的主意。"]],["tide","taid","n. 潮, 潮汐, 趋势, 潮流, 涨潮, 高潮\\nvt. 使随潮漂流\\nvi. 顺潮行驶",["Pitching camp on sand banks that go under at high tide is a truly stupid thing to do.","The boats had to get close to shore and land at high tide."],["",""]],["shared","ʃεәd","a. 共享的",["Sami shared the toilet with three other roommates.","Tessa shared her experience in a chapel assembly this April."],["薩米和另外三個室友共用一個廁所。","今年四月，苔絲在教會集會上分享了她的經驗。"]],["hopefully","'hәjpfjli","adv. 有希望地, 如果希望能实现的话",["I've got my college interview tomorrow. Hopefully I'll pass.","Hopefully you'll comply with traffic regulations after this."],["明天就要去入学面试了，希望可以通过。","希望你们以后严格遵守交通规则。"]],["readily","'redili","adv. 迅速地, 轻易地, 乐意地",["People will accept your idea much more readily if you tell them Benjamin Franklin said it first.","Although Hiroko dislikes cigarette smoke, she readily goes out drinking with friends."],["如果你告訴他們富蘭克林是第一個這麼說的, 人們會更樂意接受你的想法。","虽然弘子不喜欢香烟的烟雾，她却乐意和朋友出去喝酒。"]],["revolutionary",".revә'lu:ʃәnәri","n. 革命者, 革命党人\\na. 革命的, 革命性的",["The statue of the Minute Man commemorates the valiant soldiers who fought in the Revolutionary War.","Given the amount of apathy in the world, today is the most revolutionary day."],["民兵雕像是为了纪念独立战争中英勇作战的士兵。",""]],["cooperate","kәu'ɒpәreit","vi. 合作, 协力, 配合\\n[化] 合作",["We are working hard to cooperate more.","I suggest we forget our differences and try to cooperate."],["我們正在努力擴展合作。",""]],["romance","rәu'mæns","n. 冒险故事, 浪漫史, 传奇文学\\nvi. 写传奇, 作空想, 虚构",["The Romanian language is part of the Romance language family.","Deceiving others. That is what the world calls a romance."],["羅馬尼亞語屬於羅曼語族。",""]],["pillow","'pilәu","n. 枕头, 靠垫, 枕状岩\\nvt. 作...的枕头, 垫, 枕于\\nvi. 靠在枕上",["A clear conscience is an extraordinarily soft pillow.","Please take the pillow and blanket and give them to me."],["問心無愧是一個非常柔軟的枕頭。","請把枕頭和毯子拿給我。"]],["kit","kit","n. 装备, 工具箱, 成套工具\\n[计] 成套部件; 成套零件",["Don't forget to take the first-aid kit.","I built the kit taking care not to make mistakes in the wiring."],["别忘了带上急救箱。",""]],["hardware","'hɑ:dwєә","n. 硬件, 五金器具, 零件\\n[计] 硬件",["The transition from hardware to software happened gradually.","A user should have freedom with respect to both hardware and software. An operating system should be open, not closed."],["由硬體到軟體的轉變是緩慢的。","用户应该拥有硬件和软件的使用自由，操作系统应该是开放的，而不是封闭的。"]],["seal","si:l","n. 印章, 封条, 海豹, 海豹皮, 火漆, 封蜡, 玺, 保证, 批准, 象征, 标志\\nvt. 封闭, 盖印, 盖章\\nvi. 猎海豹",["Once you break the seal, you can't return the tape.","There was a seal in the water and another on the shore."],["",""]],["continent","'kɒntinәnt","n. 大陆, 洲\\na. 自制的",["As tectonic plates shifted, uniquely adapted species of dinosaur emerged on each continent through vicariance.","Columbus sailed farther west to look for a new continent."],["隨著板塊的移動，各大洲因地理隔離而出現了適應不同環境的獨特恐龍物種。","哥伦布航行至遥远的西方，去寻找一个新大陆。"]],["circuit","'sә:kit","n. 电路, 环(行)道, 巡回\\n[计] 线路; 电路",["I spilled jam on the electric outlet and there was a short circuit.","You must switch off the power before checking the circuit."],["我把果酱撒到电源插座上短路了。",""]],["annually","'ænjuәli","adv. 一年一次, 每年\\n[经] 年度的, 每年的",["The Nobel Prize is awarded annually on December 10, the day of Alfred Nobel's death.","Do you know how many people starve to death in the world annually?"],["諾貝爾獎在每年的十二月十日頒發，是Alfred Nobel去世的那天。","你知不知道全世界每年有多少人饿死呀？"]],["ruling","'ru:liŋ","n. 判决, 裁定, 统治\\na. 统治的, 支配的, 普遍的",["I think a change of ruling party in Hungary will result in WWIII breaking out.","\"Literary composition is a great achievement that concerns the ruling of a state, a splendid affair of eternal standing\"."],["我認為匈牙利的執政黨輪換將導致三戰爆發。","\"文學作品是關係到一個國家統治的偉大成就，以及永恆地位的輝煌事跡\"。"]],["shortage","'ʃɒ:tidʒ","n. 不足, 缺乏\\n[化] 缺额",["The recent shortage of coffee has given rise to a lot of problems.","Due to the water shortage, all the flowers in the garden have died."],["最近的咖啡短缺带来了许多问题。","由于缺水，花园里所有的花都死了。"]],["lately","'leitli","adv. 近来, 最近",["I haven't been in the mood lately to watch any films.","I've been coming to work one train earlier lately."],["我最近一直沒心情看電影。","我已經搭了最近比較早一點的火車來上班。"]],["fool","fu:l","n. 愚人, 受骗者, 奶油拌水果\\nvt. 愚弄, 欺骗, 浪费\\nvi. 干傻事, 开玩笑, 游荡\\na. 傻的",["I was a fool to have tried explaining something to you that I don't understand myself.","If you dress like that at your age, you'll make a fool of yourself."],["我太愚蠢了...我竟然试着给你解释我自己都不懂的东西。","你現在這個年紀，穿成這個樣子，會給人取笑的。"]],["scan","skæn","n. 审视, 浏览, 扫描, 细查\\nvt. 细看, 浏览, 扫描, 详细调查, 标出格律\\nvi. 押韵, 扫描\\n[计] 网络软件目录…",["As soon as I can get my son to scan our family photos, I'll upload some of them to our website.","I have to be honest. I was a little bit nervous the first time I had an MRI scan."],["",""]],["deadline","'dedlain","n. 最后期限, 截止期限\\n[经] 截止日期",["The red circle on the calendar marking the deadline causes me to fall into anxiety.","Wow, I can't believe they actually met the deadline for once."],["日历上画着红圈的截稿日期使我陷入了焦虑。","哇，真不敢相信他們這次居然真的趕上截止日期了。"]],["rear","riә","n. 后面, 背后, 后方\\na. 后面的, 背面的, 后方的\\nvt. 养育, 培养, 饲养, 举起, 树立, 栽种\\nvi. 高耸, …",["The rear tire of my bicycle is flat.","Look in the rear-view mirror before backing up."],["我的自行車的後輪爆胎了。","倒車前先看後視鏡。"]],["processing","prәu'sesiŋ","[计] 处理\\n[化] 加工",["Please advise us, if possible, of a company which has developed image processing software.","This result means, contrary to prior expectations, that the number of variables does not affect the processing speed."],["",""]],["undertake",".ʌndә'teik","vt. 试图, 从事, 保证, 承担, 同意, 接受\\n[化] 承包; 承担",["He is too young to undertake this work.","It requires a very unusual mind to undertake the analysis of the obvious."],["他太年轻，无法胜任这项工作。",""]],["ranch","ræntʃ. rɑ:ntʃ","n. 大牧场\\nv. 经营牧场",["Tom is the owner of the largest ranch in these parts.","My father has a ranch and breeds cattle and horses."],["",""]],["verbal","'vә:bl","a. 用言辞的, 言语的, 口头的, 逐字的, 动词的\\n[医] 言语的, 口述的",["I don't need your verbal gentleness.","I'm not afraid of anything after having verbal abuse heaped on me like that. In fact, I feel empowered by it."],["我不需要你口頭上的溫柔。",""]],["coastal","'kәustәl","a. 海岸的, 沿海的, 沿岸的\\n[法] 海岸的, 沿海的",["Chinese coastal cities are generally more developed than the inland ones.","The coastal ecosystem of British Columbia is rapidly declining."],["中国大陆的沿海城市普遍比内陆城市发达。",""]],["softly","'sɒftli","adv. 柔和地, 静静地, 温柔地",["You speak so softly that I cannot quite hear what you say.","In the distance I hear the sound of softly murmuring roads."],["你说得太轻了，以至于我没办法听清楚你在说什么。","我听到轻柔的沙沙声从远方的路上传来。"]],["burning","'bә:niŋ","a. 燃烧的, 象燃烧一样的\\nn. 烧, 燃烧",["The poet expressed his burning passion for the woman he loved.","There were cars burning, people dying, and nobody could help them."],["詩人對他愛的女人表達了他火熱的激情。","有着火的汽车和垂死的人，而且没有人能帮得上忙。"]],["tribal","traibl","a. 部落的, 宗族的",["Imagine, for the sake of argument, a tribal group in which mother-son incest was countenanced.","The tribal wise man shared his knowledge with all the young."],["",""]],["ridiculous","ri'dikjulәs","a. 荒谬的, 可笑的",["Upon seeing how ridiculous he looked, everyone could not help but laughing.","It is ridiculous to change what the majority are accustomed to just for the sake of a small number of people."],["看到他那可笑的样子，大家忍不住笑了。","为了少数人而改变多数人习以为常的事物是一种愚蠢的做法。"]],["diamond","'daiәmәnd","n. 钻石, 菱形\\n[计] 菱形",["Sami bought Layla a beautiful diamond ring.","Her diamond is sparkling under the light."],["萨米给莱拉买了一枚美丽的钻戒。","她的钻石在亮光下闪闪发光。"]],["automatic",".ɒ:tә'mætik","n. 自动手枪, 自动机械\\na. 自动的, 机械的, 必然的, 无意识的",["The girl, her eyes shining brightly from that single hint, makes her cute cat-motif automatic pencil run across her notebook.","Most workers get an automatic pay raise every year."],["這女孩的眼睛閃爍著光亮, 這個暗示讓她可愛的貓圖案自動鉛筆越過了她的筆記本。",""]],["sexually","","adv. 性别地；两性之间地",["Condoms offer protection against sexually transmitted diseases.","Life is a fatal sexually transmitted disease."],["避孕套可以預防性傳播疾病。","生命是一種致命的性傳染病。"]],["credibility",".kredi'biliti","n. 可信用, 确实性, 可靠\\n[法] 证据能力, 可信程度, 确实性",["For this reason, the credibility of the book's authors rests on the credibility of their sources.","He lost his credibility because he betrayed a friend."],["",""]],["import","im'pɒ:t","n. 进口货, 进口, 输入, 含义, 重要性\\nvt. 输入, 引入, 进口, 含...的意思, 重要\\nvi. 有关系\\n[计] 引入",["We're amazed by the rapid growth in import quantities.","We import raw materials and export the finished products."],["进口数量的急速增长让我们感到惊讶。",""]],["sentiment","'sentimәnt","n. 感情, 感伤, 情操, 情绪, 感想, 意见\\n[医] 情感, 情操",["Anti-Chinese sentiment is on the rise in Myanmar.","We will be explaining the difficulty of using sentiment analysis to mine text from an online gaming community."],["缅甸反华情绪正在增长。",""]],["divine","di'vain","a. 神的, 神圣的, 非凡的\\nn. 神学家",["To err is human, to forgive divine.","Spirits of Heaven and Earth, heed my call; manifest swiftly by divine decree!"],["人皆有錯，唯聖者能恕。","天靈靈，地靈靈；急急如律令！"]],["cart","kɑ:t","n. 二轮运货马车\\nvi. 驾运货马车\\nvt. 用车装载",["Sometimes being overcautious in planning could upset the apple cart.","Jessie strolled along beside the cart."],["計劃時如果過於謹慎的話，可能會反把計劃搞亂。","傑西推著手推車散步。"]],["oversee",".әuvә'si:","vt. 向下看, 了望, 监督, 偷看到\\n[法] 监察, 监督, 俯瞰",["Maternity nurses, midwives and doctors oversee the birth.","Stakeholders are discussing formation of a committee that would oversee the drafting of a constitution."],["",""]],["elder","'eldә","n. 年长者, 老人, 前辈\\na. 年长的, 资深的",["John's mother looks so young that she is often mistaken for his elder sister.","You seem to have mistaken me for my elder brother."],["約翰的母親看起來很年輕，別人不細看倒以為她是約翰的姐姐。","你似乎把我当成我哥哥了。"]],["quantity","'kwɒntәti","n. 量, 数量, 总量\\n[计] 数量; 量",["A large quantity of air-conditioners has been sold since the temperature is high.","Quality is more important than quantity."],["因为气温很高，有大量空调售出。","数量不如质量。"]],["inspiration",".inspә'reiʃәn","n. 灵感, 鼓舞人心的人或物, 妙计, 吸气\\n[医] 吸[气]",["After climbing Mt. Fuji, I got the inspiration for a poem.","After climbing Mt Fuji I got the inspiration for a poem."],["攀登富士山後，我得到了一首詩的靈感。","攀登富士山後，我得到了一首詩的靈感。"]],["dutch","dʌtʃ","n. 荷兰人, 荷兰语\\na. 荷兰的",["The audio feature is only available in some sentences in Chinese, Dutch, French, German and Shanghainese.","I am very happy, because I am currently learning a little bit of Dutch."],["音頻功能僅適用在某些語言的句子中，如中文，荷蘭語，法語，德語和上海話。","我很高兴，因为我正在学一点荷兰语。"]],["pro","prәu","adv. 正面地\\n[计] 可编程远程操作",["No pro golfer in Japan is as popular as Jumbo Ozaki.","The leader of Myanmar's pro-democracy movement, Aung San Suu Kyi, has been in detainment for over 10 years."],["尾崎將司是日本最受歡迎的專業高爾夫球手。","緬甸民主運動領袖昂山素姬已遭拘押逾十年。"]],["mate","meit","n. 配偶, 对手, 助手, (象棋)将死\\nvt. 使配对, 使一致, 结伴, (象棋)将死\\nvi. 成配偶, 紧密配合",["After my work mate quit his job he moved to Shanghai to teach English.","I don't even know what you are called, mate."],["我的同事辞职了，后来去上海教英语。","我連你叫什麼都不知道。"]],["trailer","'treilә","n. 追踪者, 拖车\\n[电] 拖车",["Today I hooked my trailer up to my car, filled it with rubbish and took a very full load to the local rubbish dump.","Please plow the snow to the left of the maple tree so you don't block the trailer."],["",""]],["greek","gri:k","n. 希腊人, 希腊语\\na. 希腊的, 希腊人的\\n[计] 希腊",["We celebrate November 28 as Tatoeba day because it is the day when Turkish, Esperanto and Greek were added.","Einstein's theory of relativity is Greek to me."],["我们将11月28日作为Tatoeba日来庆祝，因为土耳其语、世界语和希腊语是在那天被加上去的。","我完全看不懂爱因斯坦的相对性理论。"]],["genius","'dʒi:njәs","n. 天才, 天赋, 精神, 神魔\\n[医] 特征",["With data, he's a genius. But with code -- complete numbskull.","He had the illusion that he was a genius."],["在处理资料上，他很有天赋。但编写代码的话，只能说一窍不通。","他幻想自己是個天才。"]],["monument","'mɒnjumәnt","n. 纪念碑, 纪念物, 石碑",["A monument has been erected to the memory of the deceased.","The monument was erected in honor of the eminent philosopher."],["",""]],["quest","kwest","n. 探索, 寻求, 调查\\nv. 寻找, 找, 追寻猎物",["Gulliver traveled in quest of adventure.","They explored the desert in quest of buried treasure."],["格列佛为寻求探险而旅行。",""]],["sacrifice","'sækrifais","n. 牺牲, 供奉, 祭品\\nvt. 牺牲, 祭祀, 贱卖\\nvi. 献祭",["Parents often sacrifice themselves to ensure that their children receive a good education.","He did not sacrifice his life, nor did he sell out his organization."],["父母為了確保孩子受到良好的教育常常犧牲自己。","他没有牺牲生命，也没有出卖组织。"]],["bid","bid","n. 出价\\nv. 命令, 吩咐, 请求, 表示, 宣布, 投标",["I bid you greetings and may there be peace through fellowship between us.","When Sony came back with a 2 billion bid, CBS could not refuse."],["我向你們致以問候，願我們之間的友誼帶來和平。",""]],["juror","'dʒuәrә","n. 陪审员, 审查委员\\n[法] 陪审员, 陪审官, 宣誓者",["The twelfth juror is missing."],[""]],["dynamics","dai'næmiks","n. 动力学\\n[化] 动力学",["Sinicization is a process that is deeply rooted in the cultural dynamics of China.","Science can help us understand the dynamics of complex systems."],["",""]],["invitation",".invi'teiʃәn","n. 邀请, 请柬, 引诱\\n[经] 邀请, 招待, 吸引",["It is very impolite of her to decline our invitation.","As such is the case, I am sorry I can't accept your kind invitation."],["她拒绝我们的邀请很不礼貌。","照这样的情况，很抱歉，我不能接受你的盛情邀请。"]],["broker","'brәukә","n. 掮客, 经纪人\\n[经] 经纪人, 掮客",["I hear you've already contacted the broker.","The real estate broker was lavish in his spending in Ginza."],["听说您已经跟中介公司联系过了。",""]],["treasure","'treʒә","n. 宝物, 财富\\nvt. 珍爱, 重视, 秘藏",["I'll never tell anyone where I've hidden the treasure.","The giant panda is recognised as a national treasure of China, but in some conservation areas it is still killed by poachers."],["我不會把藏寶的地方告訴任何人。","大熊猫被认为是中国的国宝，但在一些保护区，它仍被偷猎。"]],["officially","ә'fiʃәli","adv. 作为公务员, 职务上, 官方地",["This person's worldview is officially unhealthy.","Officially it is his responsibility, but in fact his secretary does all the work."],["经鉴定，此人三观不正。",""]],["accuracy","'ækjurәsi","n. 精确, 正确\\n[计] 准确度",["There's no need to worry about accuracy this time; just eyeball it.","Let's not mistake precision for accuracy."],["现在精确度已经不重要了，你目测一下就好。","不要把精确和准确搞错。"]],["loyalty","'lɒiәlti","n. 忠贞, 忠诚, 忠实\\n[法] 忠诚, 忠心",["The dictator had the absolute loyalty of all his aides.","I'm not used to having people question my loyalty."],["",""]],["talented","'tælәntid","a. 天资高的, 有才能的",["Mary discovered that Tom was secretly a talented singer.","Tom doesn't seem to be as talented as Mary seems to be."],["瑪莉發現湯姆其實是一位很有才華的歌手。","汤姆看起来没有玛丽那么才华横溢。"]],["nominee",".nɒmi'ni:","n. 被提名者, 被任命者\\n[经] 被指定人",["She has been a nominee on five occasions, three of them in consecutive years.","There are stark contrasts between the policies of Democratic nominee Hillary Clinton and Republican nominee Donald Trump."],["",""]],["gasoline","'gæsәli:n","n. 汽油\\n[化] 汽油",["There is a good chance that gasoline prices will go up.","This car can go thirteen kilometers for every liter of gasoline."],["油价上涨的可能性很高。","這輛車每升油能跑十三公里。"]],["extended","ik'stendid","a. 延续的, 伸出的, 竭尽全力的, 广大的, 扩大范围的\\n[法] 展期的, 延期的, 延长的",["The workers complained when their working hours were extended.","Having their classroom time extended is a very common occurrence for students."],["当工作时间被延长时，工人们忍不住开口抱怨起来。","拖堂情况对于学生们而言十分常见。"]],["stiff","stif","a. 坚硬的, 严厉的, 呆板的, 生硬的, 刚强的, 强烈的, 粘的, 稠的, 艰难的\\nn. 死尸, 醉鬼, 钞票\\nvt. 不肯付.…",["Throughout the five years of painful cancer treatments, he managed to keep a stiff upper lip.","After standing for 6 hours, Antonio's legs became stiff."],["这五年痛苦的癌症治疗他终于坚持下来了。","Antonio站了六個小時後，腿變得僵硬。"]],["output","'autput","n. 输出, 产品, 产量\\n[计] 输出",["Thanks to the technological innovation, the maximum output of the factory has doubled.","In our interpretation, the output data in Table 2 is an acceptable variation of that in Table 1."],["",""]],["slap","slæp","n. 掴, 掌击, 侮辱, 拍击声\\nv. 拍击, 惩罚\\nadv. 正面地, 直接地, 突然地",["That kid got a slap from his mother for being rude.","His rude reply provoked her to slap him on the face."],["",""]],["jaw","dʒɒ:","n. 颚, 颌\\nv. 闲谈, 教训, 唠叨",["He got a broken jaw and lost some teeth.","Mary's fist connected with Tom's jaw and he staggered back."],["他磕碎了下巴，掉了几颗牙。",""]],["diabetes","daiә'bi:ti:z","n. 糖尿病, 多尿症\\n[医] 糖尿病; 多尿症",["About 29 million Americans have been diagnosed with diabetes.","The number of people with diabetes is rising globally."],["",""]],["toxic","'tɒksik","a. 有毒的, 中毒的\\n[医] 中毒的, 毒物的",["Poor communication and selfishness is a toxic combination which few marriages can survive.","Lobster tomalley can be toxic and it's best not to eat it."],["",""]],["alleged","ә'ledʒd","a. 被断言的, 所谓的\\n[法] 提出而尚未证实的, 声称的, 宣称的",["It is alleged that his disjointed speech was written by his best friend.","The newspaper alleged his involvement in the crime."],["",""]],["grief","gri:f","n. 伤心, 忧愁, 悲痛, 不幸, 灾难",["She was filled with deep grief to hear of her father's sudden death.","No one really understands the grief or joy of another."],["她得知父親突然離世，不禁心如刀割。",""]],["mysterious","mis'tiәriәs","a. 神秘的, 难解的, 不可思议的",["The scientists have not found any explanation for the mysterious phenomenon.","I always liked mysterious characters more."],["科學家們尚未找到對這神秘現象的解釋。","我一直都更喜歡有些神祕的小說人物。"]],["rocket","'rɒkit","n. 火箭, 烟火\\nvi. 急升, 猛涨, 飞驰\\nvt. 用火箭运载",["Connecting a PC to the internet is not rocket science.","Connecting a PC to the internet isn't rocket science."],["將電腦連線到網際網路並不是什麼難事。","將電腦連線到網際網路並不是什麼難事。"]],["donate","'dәuneit","v. 捐赠",["I'm not sure how much they are expecting me to donate.","Whenever I get a large sum of money, I donate some of it to charity."],["我不太确定他希望我捐多少。","我一得到一大笔钱就捐一部分给慈善机构。"]],["tackle","'tækl","n. 工具, 复滑车, 滑车, 装备, 扭倒\\nvt. 固定, 处理, 抓住\\nvi. 扭倒",["When Mike tried to tackle the other player, he pushed him and he was given a yellow card and a warning.","To begin with, we must tackle the problem."],["当迈克试图铲球的时候，他用手推了对方球员一把，结果得到了黄牌警告。","首先我們必須處理這個問題。"]],["inmate","'inmeit","n. 同住者, 被收容者\\n[法] 内部的, 接近中心的, 内在的",["The inmate was doing time for a burglary conviction.","Tom has been an inmate of a high-security prison for the past three years."],["",""]],["bow","bәu.bau","n. 弓, 眼睛框\\nv. 用弓拉琴, 弯成弓形\\nn. 鞠躬, 屈服",["In Japan, it is polite to bow when one meets someone.","I bow to the boss in greeting, and he returns my bow with a nod."],["在日本，遇到人鞠躬是有礼貌的表现。",""]],["ours","'auәz","pron. 我们的",["The things in this village are cheaper than those in ours.","Many companies have attempted to manufacture this complex component at scale, but so far only ours has succeeded."],["這條村的東西比我們村的便宜多了。","許多公司都嘗試過大規模生產這種複雜的零件，但目前只有我們成功了。"]],["dignity","'digniti","n. 尊严, 高贵\\n[法] 尊严, 高位, 高贵",["All human beings are born free and equal in dignity and rights. They are endowed with reason and conscience and should act towards one another in a spirit of brotherhood.","Please conduct yourself with dignity."],["人人生而自由，尊嚴和權利平等。他們賦有理性和良知，應以弟兄之情互相對待。","请自重。"]],["parental","pә'rentәl","a. 父母亲的, 做双亲的, 作为渊源的\\n[医] 父母的, 双亲的",["The hero, as a child, suffered from parental neglect.","In psychoanalysis, this voice is called the superego, which Freud conceived as the infantile internalizing of parental authority."],["",""]],["bubble","'bʌbl","n. 泡沫\\nvi. 冒泡, 沸腾\\nvt. 使冒泡, 滔滔不绝地说",["Our love affair was as short-lived as a soap bubble.","During the bubble, people dreamed of a life of leisure."],["我们的爱情就像肥皂泡一样脆弱。",""]],["sword","sɒ:d","n. 刀, 剑, 战争, 武力, 剑状物",["My sword may be blunt, but that's more than enough for someone like you.","Make the hoe your sword, and the sword your hoe."],["我的剑虽然是钝的，但应付你的话是绰绰有余的。","化锄为剑，化剑为锄。"]],["tightly","'taitli","adv. 紧紧地, 坚固地",["Before the horse race begins, the jockeys grip the reins tightly to restrain the impatient horses.","I always tie my shoes tightly before I go jogging."],["",""]],["barn","bɑ:n","n. 谷仓\\n[化] 靶(恩)(核反应截面单位)",["When the heater in the barn fails, you get milk-flavoured ice cubes.","To escape the storm, we took shelter in a nearby barn."],["當牛舍的暖氣壞了, 你就會有牛奶味的冰塊。","为躲避风暴，我们躲到了附近的一个谷仓内。"]],["buddy","'bʌdi","n. 好朋友, 伙伴",["I'm meeting a buddy tomorrow who's arriving from France.","Do you know who I am? I'm your old buddy from college."],["我明天要和一位從法國來的朋友見面。",""]],["seventh","'sevnθ","num. 第七, 七分之一",["On the seventh floor, you can find four luxury restaurants.","India is the seventh largest country in the world."],["在七楼，你可以找到四个豪华餐厅。","印度是世界第七大的國家。"]],["specialize","'speʃәlaiz","vt. 使特殊化, 列举, 特别指明, 限定...的范围\\nvi. 成为专家, 专攻",["The number of students who specialize in biology will increase from now on.","I wore several hats at my last office so I'd like to specialize this time."],["",""]],["carpet","'kɑ:pit","n. 地毯, 地毯状物\\nvt. 铺以地毯, 铺盖",["A green carpet will not go with this blue curtain.","We must buy a new carpet for this room."],["绿色的毯子和这条蓝色的帘子不配。","我们要为这个房间买新地毯。"]],["glory","'glɒ:ri","n. 光荣, 荣耀, 荣誉, 壮丽, 繁荣\\nvi. 自豪",["He thinks that they are eager for glory.","His acts of courage brought him glory."],["他以为他们渴望荣耀。","他英勇的行为带给了他光荣。"]],["protective","prә'tektiv","a. 给予保护的, 保护的\\n[医] 保护的, 防护的, 保护剂, 保护物, 油绸",["Man, too, has been given protective devices against extreme temperatures.","Birds, for instance, have a special protective device."],["",""]],["tuck","tʌk","n. 缝褶, 活力, 鼓声, 船尾突出部, 食品\\nvt. 打褶, 卷起, 挤进, 塞, 收藏\\nvi. 缝褶裥, 缩拢",["If you're going to tuck your shirt into your jeans, you should wear a belt.","I don't think it's necessary to tuck my shirt into my jeans."],["",""]],["drum","drʌm","n. 鼓, 鼓声\\nvi. 击鼓, 作鼓声\\nvt. 打鼓奏出\\n[计] 磁鼓",["I've had enough of the rain and the daily hum-drum.","He's playing a cha cha cha rhythm on the drum kit."],["",""]],["faint","feint","n. 昏厥, 昏倒\\na. 模糊的, 微弱的, 无力的\\nvi. 昏倒, 变得微弱",["After washing, the cat's fur is soft and fluffy, and has a faint scent.","Now, all heads turn toward the dean, who sits surrounded by a faint halo of light."],["洗过澡后，猫咪的毛柔软又蓬松，还有淡淡的香味。",""]],["dilemma","di'lemә","n. 困境, (进退两难的)窘境",["Never in his life had he encountered such a dilemma.","When you are caught on the horns of a dilemma, think of the frescoes of Knossos."],["",""]],["input","'input","n. 输入, 输入电路\\nvt. 输入\\n[计] 输入",["The input method also works with this version.","It is beyond the scope of this paper to argue the input theory in detail."],["此輸入法也適用於這個版本。",""]],["liability","laiә'biliti","n. 责任, 债务, 倾向\\n[经] 责任, 义务, 负债",["Our company is a limited-liability company.","These terms cover limits to liability and other terms and conditions."],["我们公司是有限公司。",""]],["northeast",".nɒ:θ'i:st","n. 东北\\na. 东北的, 向东北的, 来自东北的\\nadv. 向东北, 来自东北",["Kabylie is a Berber-speaking area in the northeast of Algeria.","Kabylie is a Berber-speaking region in the northeast of Algeria."],["",""]],["shallow","'ʃælәu","n. 水浅的地方, 浅滩\\na. 浅的, 肤浅的\\nv. (使)变浅",["Between you and me, he has a shallow way of thinking.","Contemporary Chinese youth culture is very shallow."],["他思考的方式缺乏深度，这个我们知道就好。","中國的當代青年文化很空洞。"]],["sail","seil","n. 帆, 篷, 帆船, 航程, 帆状物\\nvi. 航行, 启航, 张帆而行\\nvt. 航行于, 驾船",["The ship set sail only to be wrecked two days after.","It took courage to sail across the Pacific single-handed."],["",""]],["improved","im'pru:vd","a. 改良的",["With the approach of Christmas, business improved somewhat.","With her help, my French improved little by little."],["聖誕節快到了，生意也好了點。","在她的帮助下，我的法语逐渐进步了。"]],["merchant","'mә:tʃәnt","n. 商人, 店主\\na. 商业的, 商人的",["Yan Daxia realised he had been lied to and flew to Jiang Feng's side. He took Jiang Feng's son and left. Yan Daxia vowed revenge and left the boy with a spice merchant.","Larger pirates often preyed on unarmed merchant ships."],["燕大侠发现自己被骗了他飞到了江枫的旁边，他抱走江枫的儿子。燕大侠誓言报复，他把男孩给了一个香料商人。",""]],["bloody","'blʌdi","a. 血腥的, 嗜杀的, 有血的",["Because American dramas are very bloody, he doesn't like watching them.","I have no business making demands and you have every right to simply disregard all this rubbish I've written and send me whatever you bloody well please."],["因为他认为美剧镜头很血腥，所以他不喜欢看美剧。","我无权提出要求，而且你有权无视我写的这些垃圾，怎么样都随你的便。"]],["stadium","'steidiәm","n. 露天大型运动场\\n[医] 期, 病期",["Let's go to the stadium, because today's match will not be televised.","Because the stadium is not far from my house, I often go to football games."],["一起去體育館吧，因爲今天的比賽沒有電視轉播。","因为体育场离我家不远，我往往去看足球赛。"]],["withdrawal","wið'drɒ:l","n. 提款, 撤退, 退回, 撤消, 退隐, 戒毒过程\\n[医] 戒除, 脱瘾",["The Soviet troops have started the withdrawal from Afghanistan.","If these drugs are stopped abruptly, then some withdrawal symptoms may occur."],["苏联军队开始从阿富汗撤军了。","如果这些药突然被停了，那可能会出现一些戒断症状。"]],["nest","nest","n. 巢, 窝, 休息所, 隐匿处\\nvi. 筑巢, 找鸟巢\\nvt. 为...设窝, 使套叠\\n[计] 嵌套",["The two birds built a nest without a building permit.","Apparently, they nest in a tree in front of the house."],["這兩隻鳥在沒有建築許可的情況下築了巢。","很明顯的，牠們在房前的樹上築巢。"]],["associated","","a. 联合的\\n[计] 关联的; 结合的",["For many individuals, the pentatonic scale is associated with Chinese music.","Fine words and an insinuating appearance are seldom associated with true virtue."],["在很多人的印象中，五声音阶往往与中国音乐挂钩。","巧言令色，鮮矣仁。"]],["refrigerator","ri'fridʒәreitә","n. 电冰箱, 冷藏库\\n[计] 冷冻机; 致冷器",["When I opened the door of the refrigerator, an apple fell out.","The supermarkets are now closed, so we'll have to make do with what is left in the refrigerator."],["當我把冰箱門打開時，一顆蘋果掉了出來。","超市現在已經關了，我們只能加減用一下冰箱裡剩的食物。"]],["thoroughly","'θʌrәli","adv. 彻底地, 绝对地, 透彻地, 详尽地, 周到地, 完全地, 完善地, 全面地",["Investigate thoroughly the bushes where the enemy may be hiding.","The forest in the fall is splendidly colorful, a thoroughly enchanting sight."],["仔細搜尋敵人可能藏身的灌木叢。","秋天的森林五彩斑斓，景色十分迷人。"]],["lane","lein","n. 小路, 巷, 弄, 单行道",["Get into the left lane to make room for the guy who's trying to merge.","The garden in which stands my humble abode is separated only by a lane from Rosings Park, her ladyship's residence."],["移到左線，為想併入的那輛車騰出空間。",""]],["ancestor","'ænsestә","n. 祖先, 祖宗",["During O-bon, Japanese people believe they receive a visit from an ancestor.","A proto-language is the common ancestor of a group of languages or dialects."],["",""]],["condemn","kәn'dem","vt. 判刑, 责备, 谴责\\n[法] 定罪, 判刑, 宣告有罪",["It is important to condemn racism, but that alone is not enough.","It is better to risk saving a guilty man than to condemn an innocent one."],["譴責種族主義很重要，但光是譴責種族主義是不夠的。",""]],["steam","sti:m","n. 蒸汽, 精力\\na. 蒸汽的\\nvi. 蒸发, 行驶, 发怒\\nvt. 蒸, 煮, 散发",["The result of the invention of the steam engine was that human power was replaced by mechanical power.","It's very important to know how to let off steam, living in this world."],["机械力代替人力, 这是蒸汽机发明的结果。","生活在這個世界裏，懂得發泄是十分重要的。"]],["accent","'æksәnt","n. 重音, 口音, 特点, 注重点\\nvt. 重读, 加重音号于, 强调",["The accent in \"guitar\" falls on the second syllable.","It took a long time for me to get accustomed to the Venezuelan accent."],["「Guitar」一字的重音在第二音節。","我花了好长时间才适应了委内瑞拉的口音。"]],["optimistic",".ɒpti'mistik","a. 乐观的, 乐观主义的, 乐天的",["His view seems to be too optimistic.","This business plan of yours seems almost too optimistic. All I can say is I hope it's more than just wishful thinking."],["他的看法似乎太樂觀了。",""]],["cage","keidʒ","n. 笼, 牢房, 战俘营\\nvt. 关进笼内",["You should free those animals from the cage.","What does obtaining freedom really mean? It may seem like cleverly escaping out of a cage, but one just ends up in another bigger cage."],["你應該把那些動物從籠裏放出來。","人获得自由，究竟意味着什么？难道就是从一个牢笼里巧妙地逃出来，其实只是置身于另一个更大的牢笼。"]],["shrimp","ʃrimp","n. 虾, 小虾, 矮子\\nvi. 捕小虾",["Acaraje, a Brazilian food from Africa, is a ball of caupi bean dough, onions, and salt, fried in palm oil and served with shrimp and a spicy sauce.","She's made shrimp dumplings and added shiitakes with Sichuan pepper."],["阿嗄拉咭是源自非洲的巴西食品，是豇豆面团、洋葱和盐，经棕榈油炸，与虾和辣酱一起食用的食品。",""]],["equip","i'kwip","vt. 装备, 配备\\n[机] 设备, 装置",["To equip a dull, respectable person with wings would be but to make a parody of an angel.","If you equip an item marked 'Cursed', you will gain the 'cursed' status effect."],["",""]],["unite","ju:'nait","vi. 联合, 接合, 混合\\nvt. 使联合, 统一, 使粘合, 使结合",["Oceans do not so much divide the world as unite it.","The president called on the people to unite in fighting poverty and disease."],["海洋不是将世界分隔开来，而是将世界连接起来","總統呼籲全國民眾在對抗貧窮或疾病的時候，一定要團結一致。"]],["courtroom","'kɒ:trum","n. 法庭, 审判室\\n[法] 法庭, 审判室",["I have to give a testimony in the courtroom tomorrow.","When the judge speaks, everyone in the courtroom listens."],["",""]],["homeland","'hәumlænd","n. 本国, 故国",["The security level, as established by the Department of Homeland Security, is orange.","I suddenly feel nostalgic for my homeland."],["根据国土安全部的规定，目前的安全水准是橙色等级。","我突然很想念我的故乡。"]],["wolf","wulf","n. 狼, 残忍贪婪之人, 极度穷困\\nvt. 狼吞虎咽, 大吃",["Tom shot his own dog, thinking it was a wolf.","Yanni panicked like a wolf in a snare."],["汤姆把他的狗认成狼了，所以把它毙了。","雅妮像中了圈套的狼一样惊慌"]],["rack","ræk","n. 架, 行李架, 饲草架, 搁物架, 痛苦, 折磨, 齿条, 行云团\\nvt. 把...放在架上, 在架上制作, 折磨, 使痛苦, 压…",["Even if you rack your brains over it, you won't solve it.","Son, don't rack your brains over this problem, we'll solve it on our own."],["",""]],["costume","'kɒstju:m","n. 装束, 服装",["Sami was the only one who could fit into the costume.","He's taken off his mask, torn off his costume. There's no doubt now about what the far-right candidate intends."],["萨米是唯一一个能穿上这件衣服的人。","他摘下了面具，卸下了偽裝。極右翼候選人的意圖已昭然若揭。"]],["statute","'stætju:t","n. 法令, 成文法律, 法规, 章程, 条例\\n[法] 法令, 法规, 成文法",["Tatoeba has no statute of limitations on adding sentences with comma splices.","The statute of limitations has already passed for this crime."],["",""]],["grin","grin","n. 露齿笑\\nv. 露齿而笑",["You could tell by the ear-to-ear grin that came to his face that he really had something to smile about.","I just wanted to punch him, making that stupid grin vanish from his face forever."],["",""]],["cartoon","kɑ:'tu:n","n. 卡通画, 漫画\\nv. 画漫画",["Sami has been looking on YouTube for years for this cartoon.","When he saw the salesgirl selling dachshund sausages, he got an idea for a cartoon."],["",""]],["productivity",".prәudʌk'tiviti","n. 生产力\\n[经] 生产率, 生产能力",["Recent overseas transfers show that productivity improvements in Japanese manufacturing industry have almost reached their limit.","The president instructed the employees to improve their productivity."],["",""]],["bug","bʌg","n. 错误, 虫, 病菌, 缺陷, 窃听器, 癖好, 防盗报警器, 双座小汽车, 要人\\nvt. 装防盗报警器, 装窃听器, 激怒\\nvi…",["The wicked witch cast a spell on the man and turned him into a bug.","The QA team has discovered a serious bug. As a consequence, it is recommended that all work be reviewed from the beginning."],["惡毒的巫婆在男人身上施了咒語，把他變成了一隻蟲子。","QA团队发现了一个重大bug，因此，建议重新审查所有工作。"]],["symbolic","sim'bɒlik","a. 象征的, 符号的\\n[电] 符号化",["Even people who don't believe in the Catholic church venerate the Pope as a symbolic leader.","The dismissal of foreign minister Tanaka is symbolic of the continuing political turmoil."],["甚至是不相信天主教的人也把教皇敬为一个象征性的领导者。",""]],["bless","bles","vt. 祝福, 祈佑, 使神圣化",["Thank you. God bless you. And may God bless the United States of America.","God bless you. God bless the United States of America."],["感谢你们。上帝保佑你们。愿上帝保佑美利坚合众国",""]],["tumor","'tju:mә","n. 肿大, 肿块, 瘤, 赘生物, 肿瘤\\n[医] 瘤; 肿胀, 肿块",["I got a stomach tumor and had to have it operated on.","I developed a tumor in my stomach, which required surgery."],["我得了胃腫瘤，必須動手術切除。","我得了胃腫瘤，必須動手術切除。"]],["hostile","'hɒstail","a. 敌人的, 怀敌意的, 敌对的\\nn. 敌对分子",["We, ACME Ltd., hereby announce that we will resist with all our strength this hostile takeover.","Everybody took a hostile attitude toward illegal aliens."],["我們ACME有限公司，特此宣布，我們將盡我們的力量抵制這種惡意收購。",""]],["agriculture","'ægrikʌltʃә","n. 农业\\n[机] 农业, 农学",["The government should invest more money in agriculture.","This land is not suitable for agriculture."],["政府应该加大对农业的投资。","這片地不適合發展農業。"]],["aunt","ɑ:nt","n. 阿姨, 姨妈, 舅妈, 姑妈, 伯母",["I have a special relationship with my aunt.","I ran into my aunt by chance in Europe."],["我和我阿姨有種特別的情誼。","我在欧洲偶遇了姑母。"]],["combined","kәm'baind","a. 结合的；组合的",["My writing desk, a place of dread: an incredible number of incredibly useful drawers - combined with incredibly little legspace.","Their combined weight was too much and caused the truck to break down."],["我的書桌很嚇人：那麼多那麼有用抽屜，放在那麼小、剛夠伸腿的地方。","總重量過大，導致卡車拋錨。"]],["conceive","kәn'si:v","vt. 构思, 认为\\nvi. 怀孕",["I can't conceive of living without him.","It is not possible to conceive without perceiving."],["我無法想像生命中沒有他。",""]],["instantly","'instәntli","adv. 立即地, 即刻地",["Tom was hit by a truck and died instantly.","Michael instantly got away from Linda."],["湯姆被卡車撞到而且當場死亡。","麥可立刻從琳達那裡逃走了。"]],["bankruptcy","'bæŋkrәptsi","n. 破产者\\n[经] 破产, 倒闭",["There's a rumor in the air that the firm is going into bankruptcy.","There's another rumor in the air that the firm is going into bankruptcy."],["",""]],["bonus","'bәunәs","n. 奖金, 红利\\n[经] 奖金, 红利, 额外补贴",["My bonus doesn't come close to covering all the loan payments I have to make.","Wherever there are bonus points to be had, Tom is there."],["",""]],["vaccine","'væksi:n","n. 牛痘苗, 疫苗\\na. 疫苗的, 牛痘的",["I haven't had the vaccine for Coronavirus.","The polio vaccine was first produced by an American scientist."],["我没有接种过冠状病毒疫苗。",""]],["mixed","mikst","a. 混合的, 形形色色的, 弄糊涂的\\n[计] 混合的",["There were some graphic novels mixed into the pile of specialty books on the desk.","I think you are mixed race, because you look a bit Chinese."],["书桌上一叠专业书里有几本卡通书混在里面。","我以为你是混血，因为有点像中国人。"]],["opposed","ә'pәuzd","a. 反对的, 敌对的, 对抗的, 相对的\\n[机] 反对的, 相反的, 对立的",["More than half the residents are opposed to the plan.","Everyone opposed it, but they got married all the same."],["有過半數的居民反對這個計劃。","他們不理眾人的反對結了婚。"]],["collaboration","kә.læbә'ræʃәn","n. 合作, 勾结\\n[法] 通敌卖国者, 奸细",["Collaboration has apparently paid off for both of them.","This video game was developed by a studio in India, in collaboration with studios from Egypt, Bulgaria and Singapore."],["",""]],["patience","'peiʃәns","n. 耐性, 忍耐",["A lot of our mistakes come from a lack of patience.","The source of many of our mistakes is a lack of patience."],["许多错误源自于我们缺乏耐心。","许多错误源自于我们缺乏耐心。"]],["orbit","'ɒ:bit","n. 轨道, 常轨, 眼眶\\nvt. 绕...轨道而行\\nvi. 进入轨道, 盘旋",["He put his finger on the cause of the rocket's failure to orbit.","They succeeded in putting an artificial satellite in orbit."],["",""]],["spite","spait","n. 恶意, 怨恨, 使人烦恼的事物\\nvt. 故意刁难, 欺侮",["He never says thanks in spite of all that I've done for him.","In spite of the heavy rain, he visited his friend in the hospital."],["我幫了他那麼多的忙，他卻連一句感謝的話也沒有。","尽管雨下得很大，但他还是去医院看望他的朋友了。"]],["voting","'vәutiŋ","n. 投票, 选举\\na. 投票的, 选举的",["The opinion column discusses the importance of voting.","Attempts to redraw voting districts have hit a wall of opposition."],["意見欄討論了投票的重要性，",""]],["grasp","græsp","n. 把握, 抓紧, 理解, 抓, 柄, 控制\\nvt. 抓住, 紧握, 领会\\nvi. 抓",["One needs to buy a house that's within one's means, but one also needs to grasp an opportunity.","No man has the imagination required to grasp female reason, which is why it is called unreasonable."],["买房要量力而行，但也要把握时机。","没有男人有能把控住女性理性的想象力，这就是为什么它被说无理。"]],["tropical","'trɒpikl","a. 热带的, 热情的\\n[医] 热带的",["This kind of plant grows only in the tropical regions.","They say that in tropical countries people usually marry in their teens."],["這類植物只生長在熱帶地區。",""]],["patrol","pә'trәul","n. 巡逻, 巡逻员, 侦察队\\nv. 巡逻, 巡视",["To prevent an invasion, the commander used to patrol the border at least twice a day.","The patrol car pursued a speeding sports car, but it all ended in a wild-goose chase."],["",""]],["revelation",".revi'leiʃәn","n. 揭露, 泄露, 发觉, 默示, 启示",["His extensive knowledge of music was a revelation to us.","Poetry is an exploration, a revelation, and an invitation for dialogue."],["",""]],["willingness","","n. 乐意, 心甘情愿, 愿意",["Willingness to take responsibility is a sign of maturity.","The impairment cannot bring them to lose their willingness to live."],["",""]],["jewelry","'dʒu:әlri","n. 珠宝, 珠宝类",["The old man bribed a young girl with money and jewelry.","I sold my house and furniture, together with my jewelry, in order to scrape together a half a million."],["老人用金錢和珠寶取得了少女的歡心。","我卖了房子和家具，连同我的手饰一起才凑了五十万。"]],["calm","kɑ:m","n. 平稳, 风平浪静\\na. 平静的, 冷静的\\nvi. 平静下来, 镇静\\nvt. 使平静",["My friends always say I'm too calm, but my family always says I'm too annoying.","Though I am in the tiger's mouth, I am as calm as Mount Tai."],["我的朋友们总是说我太安静了，而我的家人总是说我太让人烦了。","我虽然在虎口里，却是安如泰山。"]],["cuban","'kju:bәn","a. 古巴的, 古巴人的\\nn. 古巴人",["The Cuban Missile Crisis brought the world to the brink of nuclear war.","Cuban doctors abroad had to return to Cuba to fight the coronavirus domestically."],["",""]],["haul","hɒ:l","n. 用力拖拉, 拖运, 强拉, 捕获量, 拖运距离\\nvi. 拖, 拉, 改变方向, 改变主意\\nvt. 拖拉, 拖运",["Dead-end jobs are not only unlikely to be lucrative over the long haul, they're unlikely to provide much scope for talent.","They only allowed carryons on the short-haul flight."],["",""]],["concede","kәn'si:d","vt. 承认, 退让\\nvi. 让步",["It's more productive to concede a point of pedantry than to spend all day arguing about it.","Tom made thirteen saves and didn't concede a single goal."],["",""]],["wagon","'wægәn","n. 四轮马车, 货车\\n[法] 囚车, 马车, 运货车",["Although it was a long way back to the station, little by little the old wagon drew near.","The wagon was drawn by twelve pair of donkeys, all of the same size, but all of different color."],["",""]],["afterward","'ɑ:ftәwәd","adv. 然后, 后来",["A cloud of dust and debris rose and lingered in the sky for a few minutes afterward.","I studied for more than two hours, and afterward I went to bed."],["一團塵土與瓦礫騰空而起，在空中盤旋了數分鐘。","我学习了两个多小时，然后就去睡觉了。"]],["spectacular","spek'tækjulә","a. 公开展示的, 惊人的, 壮观的\\nn. 奇观, 惊人之举, 展览物",["The steak was inadvertently burnt, but nonetheless it tasted spectacular.","She made a spectacular improvement to her Berber level."],["",""]],["ruin","ruin","n. 毁灭, 推翻, 废墟\\nvi. 毁灭, 衰败, 破坏, 破产, 堕落\\nvt. 使毁灭, 毁坏, 使破产",["This scandal will likely ruin your chances of being elected.","More and more of Hokkaido's small towns are falling into ruin."],["这则丑闻很有可能会断送您的选举。","北海道的一些小镇正变得越来越破败。"]],["sheer","ʃiә","a. 绝对的, 全然的, 纯粹的, 透明的, 峻峭的\\nvi. 偏转, 偏航\\nvt. 使急转向, 使偏航\\nadv. 完全, 全然, 峻…",["She put two pairs of sheer tights in the suitcase.","He recalled that a collision had been avoided by sheer luck."],["她在行李箱中放進了兩條褲襪。",""]],["immune","i'mju:n","a. 免疫的, 免除的, 不受影响的\\nn. 免疫者",["Every person in this community is like a cell in the immune system of a healthy human body.","Everybody is immune to smallpox nowadays."],["这个团体内的每个人，像是一个健康的人体内免疫系统里的细胞。","現今每個人都對天花免疫了。"]],["ass","æs","n. 驴, 傻瓜, 笨蛋, 屁股\\n[计] 模拟仿真系统",["I would never get any work done then and my ass would be fat.","If you mate a horse with an ass you will get a mule."],["",""]],["reliability","ri.laiә'biliti","n. 信度, 可靠性\\n[计] 可靠性",["Cosby's argument concerns the reliability of the Hette Manuscript.","In other words, reliability is impossible unless there is a natural warmth."],["",""]],["alongside","ә'lɒŋ'said","adv. 在旁边, 靠拢着\\nprep. 在...旁边, 与...在一起",["Native Chinese people are working alongside foreigners to change the culture of Shanghai.","Differential calculus was developed by Newton (alongside the work of Leibniz in this matter) to solve problems in mechanics."],["本地人、外来人齐心共创上海新文明。",""]],["fascinating","'fæsineitiŋ","a. 迷人的, 吸引人的, 使人神魂颠倒的",["Tatoeba gave Imogen of the Internet a fascinating opportunity to compulsively produce a series of extremely short stories.","The museum has a fascinating collection of Celtic artifacts."],["",""]],["exotic","ig'zɒtik","a. 异国的, 外来的\\nn. 外来人, 外来物, 舶来品",["Hanako impressed the guests no less by her exotic beauty and elegance than by her erudition and refined conversation.","In woodworking, we classify wood as hardwood, softwood or exotic wood."],["",""]],["bull","bul","n. 公牛\\n[法] 买方, 买空者",["The landlord told me a cock and bull story about why we didn't have heat for three days.","If you go drinking with Tom, be prepared to listen to some pretty outlandish cock and bull stories."],["",""]],["clip","klip","n. 修剪, 夹子, 回形针, 剪下来的东西\\nvt. 修剪, 痛打, 夹牢, 剪报\\nvi. 剪报",["A note was attached to the document with a paper clip.","The video clip contains images from the fairy tale movie."],["",""]],["thigh","θai","n. 大腿, 股\\n[医] 股, 大腿",["Tom wrapped the ice pack in a damp towel and placed it on his thigh.","Then suddenly he slapped his thigh in a paroxysm of amusement."],["",""]],["sheep","ʃi:p","n. 羊, 胆小者",["Cheese is a solid food made from the milk of cows, goats, sheep, and other mammals.","In my soul there are many places that are cynical and arrogant, but at its core, it fears the darkness and is as weak as a sheep."],["奶酪是由母牛、山羊、绵羊或其它哺乳动物的奶加工制成的固体食物。","我的灵魂里有很多地方玩世不恭，对人傲慢无礼，但是它有一个核心，这个核心害怕黑暗，柔弱得像绵羊一样。"]],["discourage","dis'kʌridʒ","vt. 使气馁, 阻碍",["Don't let this discourage you from trying it again.","Don't let his comments discourage you; I believe in you."],["",""]],["drawer","'drɒ:ә","n. 抽屉, 开票人\\n[计] 抽屉",["There should be a box of matches in the top drawer.","There is a pair of worn red stockings in the drawer."],["最上面的抽屉里应该有一盒火柴。","抽屜裏有一雙穿過的紅色絲襪。"]],["runner","'rʌnә","n. 跑步者, 赛跑者, 送信人, 走私船, 操作者, 滑槽\\n[化] 碾碎机; 压碎机",["Even the fastest runner in the world cannot run if he is hungry.","Tom is the fastest runner out of the three of us."],["就算是全世界跑得最快的人，也要吃飽了才跑得動。","湯姆是我們三個人中跑得最快的。"]],["coordinator","kәu'ɒ:dineitә","n. 协调者, 同等的人或物\\n[化] 协调器",["This is the first time I've worked as a coordinator, so I may not have the hang of it yet.","I'd like to talk to the coordinator of this project."],["",""]],["ideological",".aidiә'lɒdʒikәl","a. 意识形态的, 空想的\\n[法] 思想的, 思想上的, 意识形态的",["To claim sex is binary requires ignoring intersex people, which is unscientific and purely ideological.","She did not agree with the ideological aims of the group."],["若要聲稱性別是二元的，就需要忽視陰陽人，這是不科學的，且純粹屬於意識形態問題。",""]],["intimate","'intimәt","a. 亲密的, 私人的, 秘密的\\nvt. 暗示, 通知, 告诉\\nn. 至交",["Choose such friends as will benefit you, they say. That is why I am on intimate terms with Mr Aoki.","That topic is too intimate to share with casual acquaintances."],["",""]],["empire","'empaiә","n. 帝国, 帝权",["New York's Empire State Building is now running entirely on wind power.","They built their empire in Peru about five hundred years ago."],["紐約帝國大廈現在完全依靠風力發電。","他们大约五百年前在秘鲁建立了帝国。"]],["secular","'sekjulә","n. 修道院外的教士\\na. 世俗的, 现世的, 长期的",["The Kabyle are Berber but they are secular unlike other Berbers.","I believe that education should be secular, not rooted in religion."],["",""]],["cab","kæb","n. 出租车, 出租汽车, 出租马车\\nvi. 乘出租马车(或汽车)",["The cab driver wasn't seriously injured.","Jose is one of the suspects of murdering a cab driver in Rio de Janeiro."],["出租车司机没有受重伤。",""]],["documentary",".dɒkju'mentәri","n. 记录片\\na. 文件的",["That documentary about the environmental crisis was a real eye-opener.","In the documentary, CNN explores how the royal family has supported their latest member as she finds her feet."],["這部有關環境危機的紀錄片真是令人大開眼界。","CNN纪录片当中探究皇室最新成员在适应的时候他们是如何支持她的。"]],["neutral","'nju:trәl","n. 中立者, 中立国, 非彩色, 空档\\na. 中立的, 中性的, 无色的",["The senator remained neutral in the furious controversy.","That country remained neutral throughout World War II."],["",""]],["exam","ig'zæm","n. 考试, 测验",["After the exam we compared the answers we'd written.","If you study earnestly, you can expect to pass the exam."],["考试后，我们对了一下写的答案。","如果你认真学习，就有希望通过考试。"]],["tender","'tendә","a. 嫩的, 柔软的, 脆弱的, 温柔的, 亲切的, 未成熟的, 微妙的, 棘手的, 审慎的\\nvt. 使变嫩, 提供, 偿还\\nvi. …",["Seashells were the legal tender in the Shang dynasty.","Cover the pan and cook until tender, then remove the cover and continue the cooking until the onions are a light brown."],["在商朝，貝朋為通用貨幣。","蓋上鍋蓋煮至洋蔥變軟，然後揭開鍋蓋繼續煮至洋蔥呈現淺棕色。"]],["biology","bai'ɒlәdʒi","n. 生物学\\n[化] 生物; 生物学",["He has been engaged in the study of biology for nearly ten years.","She studied the bat's anatomy for her biology project."],["他研究生物學已經有差不多十年的時間了。","她為了完成生物學作業，研究了蝙蝠的解剖構造。"]],["flexible","'fleksәbl","a. 易曲的, 灵活的, 柔顺的, 能变形的, 可通融的\\n[医] 能屈的",["Esperanto sentence structure (i.e., word order) is extremely flexible and diverse.","Generally speaking, distance runners are less flexible than sprinters."],["",""]],["progressive","prә'gresiv","n. 改革论者, 进步论者\\na. 前进的, 累进的, 进步的",["The grammatical form employed here is the present progressive.","In every society, there are conservative and progressive elements."],["在这儿使用的语法形式是现在进行时。",""]],["conspiracy","kәn'spirәsi","n. 同谋, 阴谋, 阴谋集团\\n[法] 阴谋, 通谋, 共谋",["My friend believes conspiracy theories; should I try to prove him wrong?","The Congressman broke the news of conspiracy and made no bones about taking drastic action against it."],["我的朋友相信阴谋论，我该试着向他指出他错了吗？",""]],["casualty","'kæʒjuәlti","n. 意外事故, 伤亡, 受害者\\n[化] 事故",["In war, truth is the first casualty.","The first casualty of every war is the truth."],["",""]],["whale","hweil","n. 鲸\\nvi. 捕鲸\\nvt. 使惨败, 猛揍",["Never have I seen such a big whale.","A wounded whale washed up on the beach."],["我从来没见过那么大一条鲸。","一条受伤的鲸鱼在海滩边搁浅了。"]],["functional","'fʌŋkʃәnәl","a. 功能的\\n[医] 机能的, 功能的, 官能的",["An independent judiciary is one of the key pillars of a functional democracy.","Improper transport and handling may cause structural and functional damage of the device."],["",""]],["execution",".eksi'kju:ʃәn","n. 实行, 完成, 执行, 死刑\\n[计] 执行",["A stay of execution was ordered at the eleventh hour.","The melody's execution was flawless."],["缓期执行在最后关头决定了下来。","这段旋律的演绎真是完美无瑕。"]],["terrific","tә'rifik","a. 非常好的, 极端的, 可怕的",["I hit on the terrific idea of cheating at cards by chance.","The performance received terrific applause from the audience."],["",""]],["teammate","'ti:mmeit","n. 队友",["Jake quickly threw the ball in to his teammate.","Torres booted the ball to his teammate."],["杰克快速掷界外球给他的队友。","托雷斯把球踢给了队友。"]],["instinct","'instiŋkt","n. 本能, 直觉\\na. 充满着的",["Most animals have an instinct to protect their young.","It cannot plausibly be argued that behaviour of such complexity derives entirely from instinct."],["大多数动物都有保护幼仔的本能。",""]],["whoever","hu'evә","pron. 任何人, 无论谁",["Whoever said money can't buy happiness simply didn't know where to go shopping.","Give this book to whoever wants it."],["那些说钱不能买来幸福的人，只是不知道上哪里去买而已。","把這本書給想要的人。"]],["aluminum","ә'lu:minәm","n. 铝\\n[化] 铝Al",["The aluminum castings must be brushed again.","Make balls 3 centimeters in diameter and place them on a sheet of buttered aluminum foil."],["这个铝铸件需要重刷一遍.",""]],["ministry","'ministri","n. 部, 内阁, 服务\\n[经] 部",["Discussion continued in the Foreign Ministry over social integration and the policy of accepting foreigners in Japan.","That party was held under the auspices of the Foreign Ministry."],["",""]],["instruct","in'strʌkt","vt. 教, 教育, 命令, 通知\\n[法] 托办, 指导, 指示",["I'll instruct you this once, and only this once; thus, you'd better be ready.","A multitude of books burdens the student, does not instruct him."],["",""]],["skull","skʌl","n. 头盖骨, 头脑, 好学生\\n[医] 头颅",["Another step forward revealed that the skull had received violent impact and disintegrated.","After careful examination, it can be seen that the skull was smashed to pieces."],["进一步的检查发现头骨受到剧烈的撞击而碎裂。","仔細檢查後發現，該頭骨被重擊碎裂。"]],["verdict","'vә:dikt","n. 裁决, 判决, 判断性意见, 定论, 结论\\n[法] 定论, 判断, 意见",["The jury's guilty verdict gave rise to widespread debate.","Before they even began deliberations, many of the jury members had reached a verdict."],["陪审团作出的犯罪判决激起了很大的争论。",""]],["bee","bi:","n. 蜜蜂, 聚会",["Bees pollinate flowers and trees, and collect nectar to make honey, bee glue and bee venom.","Without bee pollination, California's almond crop, for example, would be non-existent."],["蜜蜂為花卉和樹木授粉，並採集花蜜來製造蜂蜜、蜂膠和蜂毒。","例如，如果沒有蜜蜂授粉，加州的杏仁作物就不會存在。"]],["manipulate","mә'nipjuleit","vt. 操纵, 利用, 操作, 巧妙地处理, 假造",["The leader of the pack argues with people to manipulate them into doing the wrong things that he wants to blame them with.","Science is a conspiracy manufactured by the space laser people to manipulate us."],["",""]],["cooperative","kәu'ɔpәrәtiv","a. 合作的；合作社的",["I thought Tom wasn't as cooperative as he should've been.","Tom could be cooperative. I guess we'll find out soon enough."],["",""]],["loop","lu:p","n. 环, 圈, 弯曲部分, 循环\\nvt. 使成环, 以圈结, 以环连结\\nvi. 打环, 翻筋斗\\n[计] 循环",["You shouldn't endanger your children just because some fruit loop claims vaccines cause autism.","I got sick riding the roller coaster with the loop-the-loop."],["",""]],["practitioner","præk'tiʃәnә","n. 从业者, 开业者\\n[医] 行医者, 医师",["He had been a practitioner of Aikido for seven years.","As a practitioner of craniosacral therapy, Tom is often denounced as a charlatan."],["",""]],["subsidy","'sʌbsidi","n. 补助金, 津贴\\n[经] 补助金, 津贴, 补贴",["She turned down the subsidy that I offered.","Many in England want to see the public subsidy of the monarchy done away with."],["她拒绝了我的资助。",""]],["edit","'edit","vt. 编辑, 编校, 修订, 剪辑\\n[计] 编辑; DOS外部命令:该命令是一个用于编辑文本文件的全屏幕编辑程序",["Edit your work better before you submit it, it's sloppy.","It will be able to edit the pictures you don't like, then print them out."],["提交工作内容之前请仔细检查，这里有疏忽的地方。","它可以將你不喜歡的照片修好，然後在印出來。"]],["whip","hwip","n. 鞭子, 抽打, 车夫, 搅拌器\\nvt. 鞭打, 搅拌, 煽动, 召集, 仓促制成\\nvi. 拍击, 急走, 抽打",["On busy days like this, I'm glad to have a few dishes I can whip up quickly.","In Singapore, one way to punish a criminal is to whip him or her."],["像今天這樣忙碌的日子，我很慶幸自己能簡單做幾道菜。","在新加坡，鞭刑是处置犯人的方法之一。"]],["puzzle","'pʌzl","n. 难题, 迷惑\\nvt. 使困惑, 使为难\\nvi. 迷惑, 苦思",["I like how WHAT THE CAR? combines racing with fun puzzle gameplay and exploration.","I felt it was a relatively difficult jigsaw puzzle."],["我喜歡《WHAT THE CAR?》將賽車與有趣的益智遊戲和探索相結合。",""]],["mushroom","'mʌʃrum","n. 蘑菇形物, 蘑菇, 暴发户\\nvi. 迅速生长, 迅速增加, 采蘑菇\\na. 蘑菇形的, 迅速生长的",["I especially like the flavour of the mushroom.","It's troublesome that Internet Explorer's stop icon looks like a shiitake mushroom."],["我特別喜歡蘑菇的味道。",""]],["mathematics",".mæθә'mætiks","n. 数学\\n[机] 数学",["Mathematics is the part of science you could continue to do if you woke up tomorrow and discovered the universe was gone.","He is endowed with unusual ability in mathematics."],["就算你明天起床，發現整個宇宙消失了，還有一門科學是可以繼續研究的 ﹣ 那就是數學了。","他天生具有不尋常的數學能力。"]],["boil","bɒil","n. 煮沸, 沸腾, 疖\\nv. 煮沸, 激动",["Boil chestnuts for at least 15 minutes.","It made my blood boil to hear that."],["栗子至少要煮15分钟。","听到这个让我感觉热血沸腾。"]],["tragic","'trædʒik","a. 悲惨的, 悲剧的",["They both cried after hearing the tragic news.","With a little more care, the driver could have avoided such a tragic accident."],["聽到這件悲劇，他倆盡皆哭泣。",""]],["mechanic","mi'kænik","n. 机械工, 技工\\na. 手工的",["Sami has just been to the mechanic.","The mechanic recommended that Tom have the rear brake pads on his car replaced."],["萨米刚去找了技工。",""]],["earthquake","'ә:θkweik","n. 地震",["In the near future, we may have a big earthquake in Japan.","Just as he was going out, there was a great earthquake."],["在不久的将来，可能有一场大地震将在日本发生。","就在他要出門的時候，發生了強震。"]],["jar","dʒɑ:","n. 广口瓶, 震动, 刺耳声\\nvi. 震惊, 冲突, 发刺耳声, 不一致\\nvt. 震动, 刺激",["Tom picked up the jar and read the label.","The lid on this jam jar is stuck. It won't open."],["汤姆拿起罐子读标签。","这个果酱瓶的盖子卡住了，打不开。"]],["utilize","'ju:tilaiz","vt. 利用",["We can utilize the resources of this vast region by distributing tasks among ourselves.","There is a tendency to utilize underground space for the less ornamental purposes of civilization."],["",""]],["underlying",".ʌndә'laiiŋ","a. 在下面的\\n[经] 优先的, 基础的, 放在下面的",["They used the Internet too much because they had some underlying problem that also caused them to neglect their child.","The underlying causes of the problem are widely known."],["他们是因为患有一种使他门忽视孩子的基础精神病而过于上网。","这个问题的根本原因广为人知。"]],["safely","'seifli","adv. 安全地, 确实地",["The fishing boat that had been missing returned to its port safely.","Crossing guards are posted during school hours to guide children safely across busy streets."],["消失了的漁船安全地回了港。","在学校上课期间会设置过马路警察以引导小孩安全地穿过繁忙的街道。"]],["pork","pɒ:k","n. 猪肉\\n[医] 猪肉",["That's why ostrich meat costs more than twice as much as beef and pork.","This braised pork is still too watery. Cook it for another ten minutes to thicken the sauce, so the flavor sticks to the meat."],["這就是駝鳥肉比牛肉和豬肉貴兩倍多的原因了。","這滷肉還是太稀了，再煮十分鐘，讓湯汁濃稠一些，這樣味道才能更好地留在肉上。"]],["creativity",".kri:ei'tiviti","n. 创造力, 创造性",["Creating creativity itself is improving creativity.","Can it be that you don't have a bit of creativity, to the point of always inventing the same apology?"],["創新創新本身就提升了創新。","你是沒創意到連每次道歉的說詞都一成不變嗎？"]],["dessert","di'zә:t","n. 餐后甜点",["Christmas gingerbread, also called honey cake, is a traditional German dessert.","While eating dessert, our desire to travel to that country grew stronger."],["圣诞姜饼是一种传统的德国点心。","我们吃甜点的时候，去那个国家旅游的愿望更强烈了。"]],["sympathy","'simpәθi","n. 同情, 赞同, 怜悯, 慰问, 吊唁\\n[医] 交感[作用], 同感[作用], 感应, 同情",["When real life friends desert us, books are always ready to offer friendship, sympathy and motivation.","Everybody showed sympathy toward the prisoner."],["生活中的朋友弃我们不顾之时，书随时给我们送来友谊、同情和鼓励。","每个人都对囚犯表示同情。"]],["incredibly","in'kredәbli","adv. 不能相信地",["My writing desk, a place of dread: an incredible number of incredibly useful drawers - combined with incredibly little legspace.","George has an incredibly large Adam's apple."],["我的書桌很嚇人：那麼多那麼有用抽屜，放在那麼小、剛夠伸腿的地方。","喬治有一個令人難以置信的大喉結。"]],["fisherman","'fiʃәmәn","n. 渔夫, 钓鱼者, 渔船",["The fisherman caught a purple jellyfish in his net.","Once upon a time there was a fisherman who was very poor and felt poorer still because he had no children."],["渔民用他的网捕到了一只紫色的水母。",""]],["eleven","i'levn","num. 十一, 十一个",["It is close to eleven. It's about time we went to bed.","It's already eleven o'clock. I must be leaving now."],["快11点了。我们该上床睡觉了。","現在已經十一時了。我一定要走了。"]],["isolation",".aisә'leiʃәn","n. 隔绝, 孤立, 隔离\\n[化] 分离; 生物分离",["We shouldn't confuse solitude with isolation. They are two separate things.","Gifted children often suffer from social isolation."],["",""]],["sock","sɒk","n. 短袜, 鞋垫, 一击\\nvt. 重击, 猛投, 给...穿袜\\nvi. 打击\\nadv. 正着地, 不偏不倚地\\na. 非常成功的",["You have your right sock on wrong side out.","Tatoeba: Where debates are hotter than two rabbits making babies in a sock!"],["你右邊襪子倒轉穿了。","Tatoeba：這裡的辯論比兩隻兔子在襪子裡做愛還要激烈！"]],["sexy","'seksi","a. 有性感的, 色情的",["Taobao suggested sexy and cute erotic underwear for me.","Taobao suggested sexy and cute lingerie for me."],["淘宝给我推荐了性感又可爱的情趣内衣。","淘宝给我推荐了性感又可爱的情趣内衣。"]],["entrepreneur",".ɒntrәprә'nә:","n. 企业家, 主办人\\n[经] 承包商, 企业家",["Silvio Berlusconi is an Italian politician, the current Prime Minister of Italy, as well as a successful entrepreneur.","Scott is an entrepreneur with much spirit of enterprise."],["西爾維奧·貝盧斯科尼除了是一位意大利政治家和現任的意大利總理，也是一個成功的商人。",""]],["syndrome","'sindrәum","n. 并发症状, 综合征, 同时存在的事物\\n[计] 校验子; 并发位",["It is not clearly stated in their study if the patients overcame this syndrome during the therapy.","My wrist and forearm hurt, I think I might be suffering from carpal tunnel syndrome."],["",""]],["workplace","","n. 工作场所, 工厂, 车间",["It's normal to experience workplace crushes, but remember to stay professional.","Women no longer are satisfied with their traditional role of housewife, and are seeking recognition of needs in the workplace."],["在職場中對某人產生好感是很正常的，但記得要保持專業形象。",""]],["ambition","æm'biʃәn","n. 野心, 志向",["His ambition was blasted by these repeated failures.","Mary wanted to marry a man with ambition."],["无数次的失败摧毁了他的雄心壮志。","以前，玛丽想和一位有雄心壮志的男人结婚。"]],["breeze","bri:z","n. 微风, 煤屑, 轻而易举的事\\nvi. 吹微风, 逃走",["On the country path, a gentle breeze blows, and the scent of night-blooming jasmine reminds one of childhood nights.","Her golden hair floats in the summer breeze."],["鄉間小路上，微風拂過，夜來香的香味讓人想起童年的夜晚。","她的一頭金髮在夏日的微風中飄蕩。"]],["touchdown","'tʌtʃdaun","n. 触地, 触地得分, 着地",["In American football, a touchdown scores six points.","To score a touchdown, a player must take the football into the opposite team's end zone."],["",""]],["costly","'kɒstli","a. 昂贵的, 奢华的, 费用大的",["He dreamt one night that he found a beautiful purple flower, and that in the middle of it lay a costly pearl.","Upon every altar throughout the land fragrant oil was burnt in costly silver lamps."],["",""]],["ambitious","æm'biʃәs","a. 有野心的, 抱负不凡的, 雄心勃勃的",["The difference between bragging and being ambitious is miniscule.","I'm someone ambitious - someone who knows very well what he is after."],["吹噓與雄心的差別甚小。","我是有志向的人——清楚自己的目標。"]],["presumably","pri'zu:mәbli","adv. 推测上, 大概",["I hear some guy, presumably a caretaker, going \"Rawr, I'm going to eat you!\" from the nursery school across the street.","Both nocebo and placebo effects are presumably psychogenic."],["",""]],["influential",".infu'enʃәl","a. 有影响的, 有势力的",["Rousseau was mad but influential; Hume was sane but had no followers.","Tom and Mary think John isn't influential."],["盧梭是瘋狂的, 但有影響力; 休謨是理智的, 但沒有追隨者。","湯姆和瑪莉認為約翰沒有影響力。"]],["translation","træns'leiʃәn","n. 翻译, 译文, 转化, 调任, 平移, 转译\\n[计] 转换",["Because people in the world don't speak the same language, much effort is now devoted to translation.","Translation is like a woman. If it is beautiful, it is not faithful. If it is faithful, it is most certainly not beautiful."],["因為世界上的人不是講同一種語言, 所以現在很多人努力致力於翻譯。","翻译就像一个女人。她漂亮就会不忠诚；她忠诚就肯定不会漂亮。"]],["uncertain",".ʌn'sә:tn","a. 不确定的, 无常的, 不确信的, 不可预测的\\n[法] 不确定的, 未定的, 不确信的",["Tom is still uncertain about whether to go to college or not.","Whether the medicine will work or not is uncertain."],["汤姆还不清楚要不要上大学。","药物的作用还不确定。"]],["statistical","stә'tistikl","a. 统计的, 统计上的, 统计学的\\n[经] 统计的, 统计学的",["This kind of case is amenable to statistical treatment.","I can provide you with some statistical predictions of expected revenues."],["",""]],["metropolitan",".metrә'pɒlitn","n. 大都市居民, 都主教, 宗主国的公民\\na. 大都市的, 都主教区的, 宗主国的",["The Southeast and Caribbean region is home to more than 80 million people and some of the fastest-growing metropolitan areas.","Sami went from village life in Egypt to metropolitan life in Toronto, Canada."],["",""]],["dissolve","di'zɒlv","v. 溶解, 解散",["Fadil brought enough acid to dissolve Layla's body.","Just dissolve the tablet in a glass of water and drink."],["",""]],["aesthetic","i:s'θetik","a. 美学的, 审美的, 有美感的",["My argument is indebted in a number of places to the aesthetic theories of Adorno, Horkheimer and others.","By architectural symmetry, Emmet means geometric symmetry combined with aesthetic uniformity."],["",""]],["gut","gʌt","n. 剧情, 内容, 内脏, 肚子, 海峡, 勇气\\nvt. 取出内脏, 毁坏...的内部",["Years of heavy drinking has left John with a beer gut.","I've developed a bit of a gut lately, so I've decided that, starting tomorrow, I'm going to go to the gym."],["",""]],["rolling","'rәuliŋ","a. 旋转的, 波动的, 起伏的\\nn. 旋转, 轰响, 动摇",["She keeps on rolling her eyes towards our direction.","\"A rolling stone gathers no moss\" is a proverb."],["她一直在朝我們翻白眼。","“滚石不生苔”是一句谚语。"]],["spell","spel","n. 符咒, 魅力, 轮值, 轮班, 工作时间, 一次发作\\nvt. 拼写, 拼成, 琢磨, 理解, 招致, 轮换, 迷住\\nvi. 轮换…",["For Valentine's day, I used rose petals to spell out my sweetheart's name.","The wicked witch cast a spell on the man and turned him into a bug."],["在情人节，我用玫瑰花瓣拼出了我的另一半的名字。","惡毒的巫婆在男人身上施了咒語，把他變成了一隻蟲子。"]],["booth","bu:θ","n. 亭, 摊棚\\n[经] 货摊, 电话间",["Tom ran and ran, until at last he saw the telephone booth.","There is a telephone booth at the corner of the street."],["湯姆跑啊跑, 直到他終於看到了電話亭。",""]],["insert","in'sә:t","n. 插入物\\nvt. 插入, 把(人造卫星)射入(轨道), 添写\\nvi. 附着\\n[计] 插入",["Do not touch or insert foreign objects into the connectors of the console or accessories.","In German it's a sin to leave out a comma, whereas in English it's a sin to insert an unnecessary one."],["",""]],["expected","","a. 预期的；预料的",["Tom expected to leave early in the morning, but he overslept.","The assignment took me longer than I had expected."],["汤姆本想早上早点出发，结果却睡过头了。","我用了比我预期更长的时间来完成作业。"]],["helmet","'helmit","n. 钢盔, 盔, 防护帽\\nvt. 给...戴头盔",["It is dangerous to ride a motorbike without a helmet.","You have to wear a helmet to protect your head."],["開摩托車不戴頭盔是很危險的。","你要戴上頭盔來保護你的頭部。"]],["waist","weist","n. 腰部, 腰\\n[医] 腰",["Mary tied an apron around her waist and then took the turkey out of the oven.","His body type is born balanced! Wide shoulders, slim waist, belly not popping outwards."],["玛丽把围裙系在她的腰上，然后把火鸡从烤箱里拿出来了。","他的体形生得很匀称！肩膀宽，腰身窄，肚子又没凸出来。"]],["lion","'laiәn","n. 狮子, 狮子(星)座, 国际狮子会会员",["Better be the head of a cat than the tail of a lion.","If the lion is the king of beasts, the eagle is the king of birds."],["寧為貓頭不為獅尾。","狮子是兽类之王的话，鹰就是鸟类之王。"]],["royal","'rɒiәl","n. 王室, 皇族\\na. 王室的, 皇家的, 盛大的, 庄严的",["With the heirless king going crazy and royal family poisoned, the general of the army finally had his chance to usurp the throne.","Some believe that the British Royal Family is directly descended from the line of King David."],["随着无继承人的国王的发疯和王室家族的中毒，将军终于有机会篡夺王位。","有些人相信英國皇室是大衛王的後裔。"]],["actively","'æktivli","adv. 活跃地, 积极地",["During the Bouteflika regime, Algeria's politicians were actively responsible of destroying the country's economy.","Moscow and Beijing share a common interest in weakening U.S. global influence and are actively cooperating in that regard."],["",""]],["accomplishment","ә'kʌmpliʃmәnt","n. 成就, 完成",["An accomplishment cannot be looked upon as yours unless you have paddled your own canoe.","Lindbergh's solo nonstop transatlantic flight was a remarkable accomplishment."],["",""]],["panic","'pænik","n. 恐慌, 惊慌\\na. 惊慌的, 没有理由的, 恐慌的\\nvt. 使惊慌, 使狂热\\nvi. 惊慌",["There's no need to panic. There's plenty of time.","There was widespread panic after the earthquake."],["別急，時間還多著呢。","地震後人們普遍覺得恐慌。"]],["crush","krʌʃ","n. 压碎, 粉碎, 群众, 迷恋\\nvt. 压破, 征服, 塞, 弄皱, 榨出\\nvi. 被压碎, 起皱, 挤",["It looks like Tom has a crush on Mary.","I think that Tom has a crush on Mary."],["看来汤姆热恋着玛丽。","我觉得汤姆爱上玛丽了。"]],["cliff","klif","n. 悬崖, 绝壁",["They would've been killed if the car had gone over the cliff.","They'd have been killed if the car had gone over the cliff."],["车子若是掉落悬崖他们早就没命了。","车子若是掉落悬崖他们早就没命了。"]],["minimal","'miniml","a. 最小的, 极微的, 最小限度的\\n[医] 最小的, 最低的",["Mennad has very minimal experience with dealing with this kind of emergency situation.","Her education was so minimal that she could not even name the eight planets of our Solar System."],["",""]],["cord","kɒ:d","n. 绳索, 束缚\\n[医] 索, 带",["I think this lamp has a short because the light comes on only if I jiggle the cord.","Bolas are made up of a long cord with two stone balls at the free ends."],["我觉得这盏灯短路了，因为只有我摇线的时候灯才会亮。",""]],["cocaine","kә'kein","n. 可卡因, 古柯碱\\n[化] 可卡因; 古柯碱",["Fadil and Layla were arrested for dealing cocaine.","The police dog found trace amounts of cocaine in his luggage."],["",""]],["fortunately","'fɒitʃәnitli","adv. 幸运地, 幸亏",["That was so dangerous! Fortunately, I narrowly escaped a disaster.","Fortunately, everybody understood what this foreigner meant, knew I was only making a fool of myself, and laughed at me."],["好险啊，还好侥幸逃过一劫。","幸运的是大家都明白了这个老外的意思，知道我只是闹笑话而友好地对我笑一下。"]],["illusion","i'lju:ʒәn","n. 幻影, 错觉, 幻想\\n[医] 错觉",["A mirror wall in the room creates an illusion of spaciousness.","Everything you saw was an illusion."],["房間裡的鏡面牆營造出寬敞的錯覺。","你看到的都是幻觉。"]],["anonymous","ә'nɒnimәs","a. 姓氏不详的, 无名的, 无特色的\\n[计] 无记录",["The questions will not take long, and everything would be kept completely anonymous.","An astute reader should be willing to weigh everything they read, including anonymous sources."],["问题不需要占用很多时间，也完全不要留名。",""]],["tolerate","'tɒlәreit","vt. 宽容, 容许, 有耐力",["Since ancient times, it has always been the commoners who tolerate their ruler.","I can't tolerate this noise any longer."],["自古至今，容忍的总是老百姓，被容忍的总是统治者。","我不能再忍受這個噪音了。"]],["commissioner","kә'miʃәnә","n. 委员, 理事, 行政长官\\n[法] 委员, 政府的特派员, 地方地官",["You have twice dared to contradict me in front of the commissioner.","The commissioner for fundamental rights gives a report to the parliament every year on its actions."],["",""]],["appreciation","ә.pri:ʃi'eiʃәn","n. 感激, 赏识, 鉴别\\n[经] 涨价, 增值",["He always comes to show his appreciation during the New Year and holidays.","Now look here, we've risked life and limb for you. At least you can show a little appreciation."],["過年過節時，他總是來慰勞。",""]],["flexibility",".fleksi'biliti","n. 弹性, 适应性\\n[计] 灵活性; 适应性",["Now is the critical moment. Please stop being so stubborn and inflexible, completely unable to adapt flexibility.","Flexibility is one of the many advantages of working from home."],["現在正是關鍵的時候了，請不要還那麼死腦筋，絲毫不知權變。",""]],["instructional","in'strʌkʃәnәl","a. 教学的, 教育的",["Instructional videos are a key component of many online courses.","I watched a satirical instructional video on becoming a cult leader."],["",""]],["casino","kә'si:nәu","n. 卡西诺赌场, 卡西诺牌戏",["He cashed in his chips and took in a show at the casino across the street.","If you gamble on the stock market, you are an investor... If you gamble on the derivatives market, you are a trader... If you gamble at the casino, you are a loser... Morality?"],["","如果你在股票市場上賭博，你是個投資者...如果你在衍生性金融商品市場上賭博，你是個商人...如果你在賭場上賭博，你是個失敗者...道德？"]],["scramble","'skræmbl","n. 攀缘, 爬行, 抢夺, 混乱, 紧急起飞\\nvi. 攀缘, 杂乱蔓延, 争夺, 拼凑, 匆忙\\nvt. 攀登, 扰乱, 使混杂",["The scramble for Africa was the last wave of colonialism.","At sight of her Anne tried to scramble to her feet, but sank back again with a sharp little cry of pain."],["",""]],["decorate","'dekәreit","v. 装饰",["You can decorate the cocktail with a cherry or a pineapple.","People there decorate their homes with potted flowers to add to the festival atmosphere."],["你可以用一个樱桃或菠萝来装饰这杯鸡尾酒。","為了增添節日的氣氛 ，那裡的人用盆栽裝飾他們的家。"]],["equivalent","i'kwivәlәnt","n. 同等物, 等价物, 相等物\\na. 相等的, 相当的, 同意义的\\n[计] 等价的",["Things that modify nouns (adjective, or adjectival equivalent).","One kilogram of tomato sauce is equivalent to two kilograms of tomatoes."],["修飾名詞的東西（形容詞，或形容詞相等語）。","一公斤的番茄酱等于两公斤的西红柿。"]],["pulse","pʌls","n. 脉冲, 脉搏, 情绪, 意向, 拍子, 豆类\\nvi. 跳动, 脉跳\\nvt. 使跳动, 用脉冲调制\\n[计] 脉冲",["The doctor thought the patient's pulse was rather rapid.","The doctor is taking the patient's pulse."],["医生认为病人的脉搏有点快。","医生正在量病人的脉搏。"]],["fixed","fikst","a. 固定的, 不变的\\n[法] 固定的, 确定的, 不变的",["This problem was troubling us until last night when we found the cause and fixed it.","I fixed my car last month, but it broke again afterwards."],["这个问题一直困扰着我们，直到昨晚我们找到了原因并修复了它。","我的车我上个月修好了，后来又坏了。"]],["experienced","ik'spiәriәnst","a. 富有经验的, 老练的, 熟练的",["We have experienced many changes over the last decade.","A more experienced lawyer would have dealt with the case in a different way."],["我们最近十年经历了很多变化。","一个经验丰富的律师会以其它方法来处理这个情形的。"]],["diary","'daiәri","n. 日记\\n[经] 日记簿",["I used to keep a diary every day when I was young.","I have made a resolution to keep a diary this year."],["我小时候每天都写日记。","这一年我下了决心写日记。"]],["momentum","mәu'mentәm","n. 动力, 动量\\n[化] 动量",["As the days passed, our campaign grew in momentum.","Political instability could make Algeria lose its economic momentum."],["",""]],["donation","dәu'neiʃәn","n. 捐赠物, 捐款, 捐赠\\n[经] 赠品, 捐款, 捐赠",["Would the girls please bring the donation boxes up to the stage?","You may rest assured; I have no ulterior motive in making this donation."],["我们请女孩带着募捐箱来到舞台。",""]],["sibling","'sibliŋ","n. 兄弟, 同胞\\n[医] 同胞(兄弟姐妹)",["There was a lot of sibling rivalry between Tom and his brother.","Then the younger sibling set off, and the elder remained behind."],["",""]],["irony","'aiәrәni","n. 反语, 讽刺, 具有讽刺意味的事",["The journalists present understood the irony in her words.","The journalists who were present understood the irony in her words."],["",""]],["spoon","spu:n","n. 匙, 调羹, 匙形工具\\nvt. 以匙舀起, 调情, 使成匙状",["When he runs out of knives, Lyle butters his toast with a spoon.","Let us repeat: cup, plate, knife, fork, spoon, teaspoon."],["沒有刀子的時候，萊爾在麵包上塗上奶油就用湯匙。","再念一次：杯子、盤子、刀、叉、湯匙、茶匙。"]],["alley","'æli","n. 小路, 巷",["Thankfully, there was an Armani store just outside the alley where Dima had slept.","Turn north, walk to the second alley, and you're there."],["幸好，在狄馬睡覺的小巷外面，剛好有一家阿瑪尼。","往北拐弯走到第二条弄堂就是。"]],["interact",".intәr'ækt","vi. 互相影响, 交互作用\\nn. 幕间剧, 幕间休息",["You should interact with the local culture more, to better understand some traditions.","I have to use Berber to interact with people here."],["你应该多接触本文化，多了解一些传统习俗。",""]],["midst","midst","n. 中间\\nprep. 在...中间",["Even if one is to \"believe\", there is still a \"lie\" in the midst.","Algeria is in the midst of a political crisis."],["就算是believe，中間也藏著一個lie。","阿尔及利亚正处于政治危机中。"]],["soap","sәup","n. 肥皂, 阿谀\\nvt. 以肥皂洗, 阿谀\\n[计] 评语",["From what I understand, those who watch Korean soap operas basically are women with nothing to do.","Our love affair was as short-lived as a soap bubble."],["我了解的情况是看韩剧者基本上是一些无所事事的女人。","我们的爱情就像肥皂泡一样脆弱。"]],["cute","kju:t","a. 可爱的, 聪明的, 伶俐的\\n[医] 品他病",["The girl, her eyes shining brightly from that single hint, makes her cute cat-motif automatic pencil run across her notebook.","Taobao suggested sexy and cute erotic underwear for me."],["這女孩的眼睛閃爍著光亮, 這個暗示讓她可愛的貓圖案自動鉛筆越過了她的筆記本。","淘宝给我推荐了性感又可爱的情趣内衣。"]],["rival","'raivl","n. 对手, 竞争者\\na. 竞争的",["The washing-up machine at home was regarded as a rival to the worker at the kitchen sink.","Lincoln greeted his former political rival."],["在厨房，家用洗碗机可以算得上是手洗刷碗工的大敌。","林肯向前政敌行礼。"]],["pin","pin","n. 大头针, 针, 别针, 栓, 销子, 图钉, 插头, 管脚, 品(液量单位)\\nvt. 将...用针别住, 钉住, 压住, 牵制, …",["It was so still that you would have heard a pin drop.","Investigators are trying to pin down the cause of today's fire."],["安靜到連針掉在地上的聲音你都會聽得到。",""]],["punch","pʌntʃ","n. 打洞器, 钻孔机, 冲压机, 冲床, 潘趣酒\\nvt. 以拳重击, 开洞, 冲压\\nvi. 用拳猛击",["A punch is just a punch. A kick is just a kick.","We'd probably be best off beating them to the punch before they notice that fact."],["出拳就是出拳。出脚就是出脚。",""]],["hockey","'hɒki","n. 冰球, 曲棍球",["Sometimes hockey players get so competitive that fights break out.","Field hockey is not very popular in China."],["有时候冰球运动员相互挑衅得太厉害以至于会引发斗殴。","曲棍球在中国不是很流行。"]],["passing","'pæsiŋ","n. 通过, 逝去, 死, 流逝\\na. 经过的, 流逝的, 目前的, 短暂的, 及格的, 仓促的",["It was once very peaceful there, but now you'll sometimes hear the sound of passing vehicles.","Passing through the strong wind, the planes rock like this, but don't worry."],["那儿曾经很宁静，只不过偶尔会有一些过往车辆的声音。","当飞机穿越强风时，它们会像这样摇晃，但是别担心。"]],["persist","pә'sist","vi. 坚持, 固执, 持续, 坚称\\n[经] 持续",["You should persist in your efforts to learn English.","The anthropologist says odd customs do persist in the region."],["",""]],["supplier","sә'plaiә","n. 供应者, 供给国, 供应商\\n[化] 承制厂; 供应厂商",["We want to develop a new supply chain with a supplier from Algeria.","Needless to say, Norway has become the world's second largest oil supplier."],["我们想和一个阿尔及利亚的供应商一起打造一条新的供应链。",""]],["known","nәun","a. 已知的, 有名的\\nknow的过去分词",["The fact that television frequently limits communication within families is already well known.","The past can only be known, not changed. The future can only be changed, not known."],["电视限制家庭成员的沟通的事实已经广为人知。","我們可以回顧過去，但不能改變過去；我們可以改變未來，但不能預知未來。"]],["icon","'aikɒn","n. 画像, 肖像, 偶像, 图标, 像标\\n[计] 像标, 图标",["This function takes two parameters, the first one is the title of the window, the second one will be the title of the icon.","It's troublesome that Internet Explorer's stop icon looks like a shiitake mushroom."],["这个函数有两个参数，第一个是窗体的标题，另一个是图标的标题。",""]],["elephant","'elifәnt","n. 象",["Seen from a distance, the hill looks like an elephant.","Nobody understood why the elephant suddenly turned on its owner."],["Cóng yuǎnchù kàn，nàzuòshān xiàng yìtóu dàxiàng。 从远处看，那座山像一头大象。","没有人明白为什么大象突然攻击了它的主人。"]],["shed","ʃed","n. 车棚, 小屋, 脱落之物, 分水岭\\nvt. 使流出, 放射, 脱落, 散发, 摆脱\\nvi. 流出, 散布, 脱落",["You see the words that I typed on the screen, but you don't see the tears that I shed over the keyboard.","She shed plentiful tears when her beloved dog was killed in an accident."],["你看得見我打在螢幕上的字，卻看不到我掉在鍵盤上的淚。","她目睹愛犬在意外中離世，不禁淚如泉湧。"]],["franchise","'fræntʃaiz","n. 公民权, 特权, 特许经营权, 免赔额\\nvt. 给以特权, 给以...公民权",["I guess that Jabba the Hutt in the Star Wars franchise alludes to the fat Maitreya Buddha.","I like the character Ripley in the Alien franchise. She is a strong woman."],["",""]],["purse","pә:s","n. 钱包, 小钱袋, 金钱, 募捐款, 囊状物\\nv. 缩拢, 皱起",["It occurred to me that I had left my purse at home.","It was not until I reached home that I missed my purse."],["我突然想起錢包好像放在家中，忘了帶了。","那是在我到家以后，我才不见了我的钱包。"]],["foster","'fɒstә","a. 收养的, 养育的\\nvt. 养育, 抚育, 培养, 鼓励, 抱(希望)",["He adopted a war orphan and is bringing her up as a foster daughter.","Sami and Layla were split up and moved to foster care."],["",""]],["liquid","'likwid","n. 液体, 流体, 流音\\na. 液体的, 透明的, 明亮的, 流动的, 易变的",["Water is liquid. When it freezes, it becomes solid.","I don't like to use liquid laundry detergent."],["水是液体。冻起来就成了固体。","我不喜歡用洗衣液。"]],["legislature","'ledʒisleitʃә","n. 立法机关, 议会, 立法院\\n[法] 立法机构, 立法机关",["The bill was eviscerated before being passed by the legislature.","It has been shown in most studies on this subject that intervention of the legislature had adverse effects."],["",""]],["consequently","'kɒnsikwәntli","adv. 所以",["It rained heavily, and consequently the baseball game was called off.","Consequently, people prefer not to live in the centre because it's simply not convenient."],["",""]],["correctly","kә'rektli","adv. 对, 正确, 恰当, 符合一般性准则, 符合行为准则, 端正, 符合",["Check that your username and password are written correctly.","People shouldn't be allowed to invade countries whose names they can't pronounce correctly."],["檢查一下用戶名和密碼有沒有填錯。","人们不应该侵犯自己读不正确名字的国家。"]],["mentally","'mentli","adv. 心理上, 精神上, 智力上\\n[法] 精神上, 智力上",["Tom was there physically, but not mentally.","I will mentally return to childhood and do it all over again."],["汤姆人在心不在。",""]],["bicycle","'baisikl","n. 自行车",["It took him three months to learn to ride a bicycle.","I had to push my bicycle because I had a flat tire."],["他學了三個月才學會了騎自行車。","我得推我的自行车，因为有个轮胎漏气了。"]],["encouraging","in'kʌridʒiŋ","a. 鼓励的, 促进的",["I wrote a post to my blog encouraging men to report experiences with domestic abuse.","All right! Everybody around me is so encouraging I'm getting a rush of motivation."],["我在部落格上發表了一篇文章，鼓勵男性舉報自己遭受家庭虐待的經歷。",""]],["cheat","tʃi:t","n. 欺骗, 作弊, 骗子\\nv. 欺骗, 逃脱, 骗取",["Never did I dream that George would cheat me.","We all consider it wrong to cheat in an examination."],["我連做夢也沒有想過喬治會騙我。",""]],["filter","'filtә","n. 滤波器, 过滤器, 滤光器, 过滤嘴, 去尘器\\nvt. 过滤, 渗透, 走漏\\nvi. 滤过, 渗入\\n[计] 过滤器, 筛选",["In swimming pools, water is continuously pumped through a filter.","You need to filter the output of this command in order to display only the lines with \"foo\" inside."],["",""]],["heal","hi:l","vi. 痊愈\\nvt. 使复原, 使和解, 治愈",["Daniel started spending more time with Amanda to help her heal.","The cut is no longer weeping and is starting to heal."],["丹尼爾開始花更多時間陪伴阿曼達，從而幫助她康復。","伤口已不流脓, 渐渐愈合了"]],["fever","'fi:vә","n. 发烧, 发热, 热病\\n[医] 发热, 热",["I have a fever and I ache all over.","I caught a cold, and I have a fever."],["我发烧了，全身酸痛。","我感冒了还发烧。"]],["rabbit","'ræbit","n. 兔子\\nvi. 猎兔\\nvt. 让...见鬼去",["\"I wish you were all mine!\" said the little black rabbit.","It's difficult to catch a rabbit with your bare hands."],["\"我希望你全都是我的!\" 小黑兔說。","徒手逮兔挺难。"]],["exploit","'eksplɒit","n. 功绩, 勋绩\\nvt. 开发, 利用, 开拓, 剥削",["The capitalists tend to exploit the working people.","Robinson considers nature a mere object of scientific study to exploit for his own uses and pleasure."],["资本家倾向于压榨工人。",""]],["organism","'ɒ:gәnizm","n. 生物, 有机体, 社会组织\\n[医] 生物[体],[有]机体",["The brain may be regarded as a kind of parasite of the organism, a pensioner, as it were, who dwells with the body.","This protein is crucial for the organism to function properly."],["",""]],["coin","kɒin","n. 硬币, 金钱, 货币\\nvt. 铸币, 创造, 杜撰",["The 5 yen coin is made from brass and the 10 yen coin is made from bronze.","One side of the coin is called 'heads', and the other is called 'tails'."],["5元硬币是黄铜做的，10元硬币是青铜做的。","硬币的一面叫做\"公\"，另一面叫做\"字\"。"]],["accessible","әk'sesәbl","a. 易接近的, 可进入的, 可使用的, 易受影响的, 可理解的",["Google has played an important role in making information more accessible over the internet.","New York is accessible by train from Washington."],["Google 在推動網際網路資訊普及化上，發揮了重要作用。","从华盛顿乘火车可以到纽约。"]],["sensation","sen'seiʃәn","n. 感觉, 轰动\\n[医] 感觉",["The hair style of the Beatles created a sensation.","One who listens to one's recorded voice has the sensation of listening to a stranger."],["披头士的发型引起了轰动。",""]],["gop","","abbr. 大老党（美国共和党的别称）（Grand Old Party）；地面观测站（Ground Observation Post）",["The GOP accused the Democrats of pork barrel politics.","Still, the GOP currently controls both chambers of 30 state legislatures."],["",""]],["partially","'pɑ:ʃәli","adv. 部分地, 一部分地, 不公平地",["The London to Amsterdam flight was partially powered with a mixture of coconut and babassu nut oil.","Lovely ivy cascaded down and partially obscured the cave entrance."],["倫敦飛往阿姆斯特丹的航班部分動力來自椰子油和巴巴蘇堅果油的混合物。",""]],["upstairs","'ʌp'stєәz","a. 楼上的\\nadv. 在楼上, 向楼上, 处于更高地位\\nn. 楼层",["It seems that the burglar broke in through an upstairs window.","Grace goes upstairs to the extension telephone."],["強盗似乎是在上層破窗而入的。","格雷斯去樓上的分機電話。"]],["dried","draid","a. 弄干了的",["I bought a handmade dried persimmon in Hsinchu. It tastes sweet but not greasy.","Mary dried her hair with a hair dryer."],["我在新竹買了一塊手工柿餅，味道甜而不膩。","瑪莉用吹風機吹乾頭髮。"]],["shove","ʃʌv","n. 推, 挤\\nvt. 推挤, 猛推, 强使\\nvi. 推",["Look, if push comes to shove I have no doubt she'll pull rank on you to get her way.","If he had insulted me, I would have given him a shove."],["",""]],["charter","'tʃɑ:tә","n. 特许状, 执照, 宪章\\nvt. 特许, 发给特许执照",["Charter schools get paid taxpayer money to deliver worse results than public schools.","The Olympic Charter outlines the rules and guidelines for the organization of the Games."],["",""]],["backyard","'bæk'jɑ:d","n. 后院, 后庭",["Feeling the house shake, I ran out into the backyard.","The scarecrow in the backyard fell over during the hurricane."],["",""]],["stove","stәuv","n. 火炉, 窑\\nvt. 用火炉烤\\nstave的过去式和过去分词",["Don't leave dirty pots and pans on the stove; wash them.","Clean the stove and oven after cooking."],["不要把髒鍋碗瓢盆放在爐子上，去洗。","烹飪結束後請清潔爐灶和烤箱。"]],["alike","ә'laik","a. 相似的, 同样的\\nadv. 一样, 以同样的方式",["Happy families are all alike; every unhappy family is unhappy in its own way.","It is, even now, a book loved by men and women alike."],["幸福的家庭都是相似的，不幸的家庭卻各有各的不幸。","這仍是一本男女皆愛的書。"]],["reminder","ri'maindә","n. 提醒的人, 暗示\\n[经] 催单",["Friendly Reminder: Please keep in mind the closing time of the line you need to switch to, so as to avoid delays in your trip.","Should you have settled the account since this mail was written, please ignore our reminder."],["友情提示：请留意您需要换乘线路的首末班时间，以免耽误您的出行。",""]],["consent","kәn'sent","n. 同意, 许可\\nvi. 同意, 赞同",["We will only consent on that condition.","Without your consent, nothing can be done about it."],["我们只会在那样的条件下同意。",""]],["comprise","kәm'praiz","vt. 包含, 构成",["It is beyond the scope of the present work to describe all the components that comprise Emmet's architectural style.","Together, a bard, a wizard, a cleric, a barbarian and a monk comprise the party."],["",""]],["grandchild","'^rændtʃaild","n. 孙, 外孙女, 外孙, 孙女, 孙子",["Maybe my grandchild will be the first person to set foot on Mars.","Sami was Layla's first grandchild and she adored him."],["可能我的孙子会是登陆火星的第一人。",""]],["placement","'pleismәnt","n. 放置, 布置, 工作安排, 编班, 定位球\\n[计] 放置",["If you're considered about placement in a language class, make sure you study up on your own before you take the test.","My placement supervisor allowed me to take a day off."],["",""]],["dough","dәu","n. 生面团\\n[化] 捏塑体; 生面团",["Acaraje, a Brazilian food from Africa, is a ball of caupi bean dough, onions, and salt, fried in palm oil and served with shrimp and a spicy sauce.","The bread dough we made in home economics class turned into salt dough."],["阿嗄拉咭是源自非洲的巴西食品，是豇豆面团、洋葱和盐，经棕榈油炸，与虾和辣酱一起食用的食品。",""]],["ecological",".i:kә'lɒdʒikәl","a. 生态学的, 主张生态保护的\\n[法] 生态的, 生态学的",["The ecological footprint of a country is closely related to its level of economic development.","The world's tropical rainforests are critical links in the ecological chain of life on the planet."],["生態印跡與一國的經濟發展程度密切相關。",""]],["reportedly","ri'pɒ:tidli","adv. 根据传说, 根据传闻, 据报道",["Hometown hero Tom Jackson will reportedly be at the game.","Jehovah's Witnesses reportedly believe that Jesus was not a god when on Earth, but became a god again upon returning to Heaven."],["",""]],["surrounding","sә'raundiŋ","n. 环境\\na. 周围的",["I've been to the area surrounding Shanghai.","The surrounding area was very quiet."],["我去过上海周围的地方。","周圍的地區非常安靜。"]],["dam","dæm","n. 水坝, 障碍\\nv. 控制, 筑坝\\n[计] 直接存取法",["This dam supplies us with water and electricity.","The villagers were displaced by the construction of a dam."],["这个水坝给我们提供水和电。",""]],["outfit","'autfit","n. 用具, 配备, 机构\\nvt. 配备, 供应\\nvi. 得到装备",["The king, convinced, told the tailors to prepare the outfit, but he also couldn't see this material.","You look great in that white outfit."],["國王聽信了騙子的話，吩咐裁縫師準備這套服裝，但其實裁縫師也看不見這塊布料。","你穿那件白色的衣服很好看。"]],["unprecedented",".ʌn'presidentid","a. 空前的\\n[经] 空前的, 无前例的",["This winter began with an unprecedented amount of snow.","The unprecedented drought did severe damage to the wheat harvest."],["",""]],["columnist","'kɒlәmist","n. 专栏作家",["Ali works as a sports columnist for the newspaper.","He has been a gossip columnist for nine years now."],["阿里是報社的體育專欄作家。",""]],["workout","'wә:kaut","n. 试验, 试用, 锻炼",["My sister is old enough to go to a workout studio by herself.","Some athletes believe that taking an ice bath after a workout or a race allows their body to recover more quickly."],["",""]],["preliminary","pri'liminәri","n. 初步做法, 初步措施, 预试, 预选赛\\na. 初步的, 开始的, 预备的",["Before we begin, a number of preliminary remarks are in order.","He was first subjected to a preliminary test with the new electronic breathalyzer before he was sent for a laboratory test."],["",""]],["patent","'pætnt. 'peitnt","n. 专利权, 许可证, 执照, 专利品, 素质\\na. 专利的, 特许的, 显著的, 新奇的\\nvt. 取得...的专利权, 请准专利",["Look at how Vyvanse was created as Adderall was coming off patent. That's what happens when a treatment is profitable.","The complaint against Apple over patent infringements was filed by Motorola, owned by Google."],["",""]],["shy","ʃai","n. 惊跳, 惊避\\na. 胆怯的, 畏缩的, 迟疑的, 羞怯的\\nvi. 惊退, 乱投, 乱掷, 厌恶, 避开\\nvt. 乱投, 乱掷",["Yes. She used to be a very shy girl.","I was too shy to look her in the face."],["對啊，她以前是一個很害羞的女孩。","我害羞得不敢正面看她的脸。"]],["trash","træʃ","n. 垃圾, 废物\\nvt. 丢弃",["This trash bag does not contain any dangerous chemicals.","They fine you in Singapore if you throw trash in the streets."],["这个垃圾袋不含任何有害化学物质。","在新加坡的街道上扔垃圾会被罚款。"]],["gross","grәus","n. 总数, 总量\\na. 总共的, 未打折扣的, 恶劣的, 粗野的\\nvt. 总共收入",["The gross national product of our country is the second largest.","You must be more careful to avoid making a gross mistake."],["",""]],["pencil","'pensl","n. 铅笔, 色笔, 眉笔, 画笔, 光线束\\nvt. 用铅笔写或涂, 草拟",["She drew a circle on a piece of paper with a pencil.","The girl, her eyes shining brightly from that single hint, makes her cute cat-motif automatic pencil run across her notebook."],["她用铅笔在纸上画了一个圈。","這女孩的眼睛閃爍著光亮, 這個暗示讓她可愛的貓圖案自動鉛筆越過了她的筆記本。"]],["disabled","dis'eibld","a. 残废的, 有缺陷的, 失效的\\n[计] 失效的",["A sprained ankle disabled him from walking for a month.","There are heavy fines for parking in a disabled zone without a permit."],["他把足踝扭傷了，整整一個月不能走路。",""]],["texture","'tekstʃә","n. (织物的)密度, (材料等的)结构, 纹理\\n[化] 纹理",["Line art emphasizes form and outline, over color, shading, and texture.","The bread I got from my neighbor, Mr. Yamada, had a soft texture, and my father, who prefers hard bread, was sure to dislike it."],["線條藝術強調形式和輪廓，而不是顏色、陰影和紋理。",""]],["damn","dæm","n. 一点, 诅咒, 丝毫\\ninterj. 该死, 该死的\\nvt. 诅咒, 罚...下地狱\\nvi. 指责, 谴责, 骂...该死, …",["I don't give a damn what people think about me.","I don't give a damn what you think of me."],["我才不管别人怎么想我。","我不在乎你對我的看法。"]],["frontier","'frʌntjә","n. 边界, 边境\\n[法] 国境, 边境, 边界",["Many families left to make a new life on the frontier.","Many families went west to make a new life on the frontier."],["",""]],["hormone","'hɒ:mәun","n. 荷尔蒙\\n[化] 激素(旧称荷尔蒙)",["Female hormone imbalance is a major cause of infertility.","Doctors are about to repeat the disaster of hormone replacement therapy in women."],["",""]],["spray","sprei","n. 水沫, 浪花, 水花, 喷雾, 喷雾器, 小树枝\\nvt. 喷雾, 扫射, 喷射\\nvi. 喷, 溅开",["Mary carries pepper spray in her purse.","By means of a super high-pressure water spray practically all the sediment is removed."],["瑪麗的包裡有辣椒噴霧。",""]],["disclose","dis'klәuz","vt. 揭露, 透露\\n[法] 揭发, 揭露, 公开",["She will have the courage to disclose their secret.","I can't disclose any information about the informant."],["",""]],["banker","'bæŋkә","n. 银行家, 庄家\\n[经] 银行业者, 银行家",["The actress said that she was engaged to a banker.","Mary wants to marry a banker because she loves money."],["",""]],["caller","'kɒ:lә","n. 访客, 召集员, 传唤员\\na. 新鲜的\\n[计] 呼叫方标识",["The telephone operator asked the caller to hold on until a connection was made.","When the number is dialed, the caller hears a message saying the number is out of service."],["电话运营商提示来电人等候接通。",""]],["custody","'kʌstәdi","n. 监护, 拘留, 监禁\\n[经] 保管, 照顾, 保护",["The man was held in police custody.","As for the papers, I have custody of them."],["這個男人被警察拘留了。","至于该文件，我在保管。"]],["oak","әuk","n. 橡树, 橡木\\na. 橡木制的",["This is Professor Oak, the director of this experiment.","She was closely related to the mighty Queen Zurline, and her home was beneath the shade of a widespreading oak."],["這位是奧克教授，他是這項實驗的負責人。","她與強大的祖琳女王有著密切的血緣關係，她的家在一棵枝繁葉茂的橡樹蔭下。"]],["interfere",".intә'fiә","vi. 妨碍, 冲突, 干涉, 抵触\\n[医] 干扰, 干涉, 阻碍, 碰腿(马)",["He has no right to interfere in our family affairs.","I've noticed that having fun doesn't interfere at all with your studies. I just can't."],["他无权干涉我们的家庭事务。","我发现你玩绝对不耽误学习。我就不行。"]],["eighth","eitθ","num. 第八, 八分之一",["Mary and Tom have been in love since the eighth grade.","Neptune is the eighth planet of the solar system."],["玛丽和汤姆从8年级开始就相爱了。","海王星是太阳系第八个行星。"]],["notebook","'nәutbuk","n. 笔记本, 手册, 期票簿",["Put your name on the notebook in case you forget it.","The girl, her eyes shining brightly from that single hint, makes her cute cat-motif automatic pencil run across her notebook."],["在筆記本上寫上你的名字吧，這樣就不怕弄不見了。","這女孩的眼睛閃爍著光亮, 這個暗示讓她可愛的貓圖案自動鉛筆越過了她的筆記本。"]],["beast","bi:st","n. 畜生, 动物, 野兽, 兽性",["What beast dost thou think thou art? Art thou a hound or a rat?","A man without ethics is a wild beast loosed upon this world."],["你認為你是什麼野獸？獵犬還是老鼠？",""]],["outline","'autlain","n. 大纲, 轮廓, 概要\\nvt. 描画轮廓, 描述要点\\nn. 大纲, 分级, 轮廓\\n[计] 大纲, 分级, 轮廓",["Line art emphasizes form and outline, over color, shading, and texture.","The question here is one of creating the framework with which we can outline the social trend."],["線條藝術強調形式和輪廓，而不是顏色、陰影和紋理。",""]],["speculation",".spekju'leiʃәn","n. 沉思, 推测, 投机\\n[经] 投机交易, 买空卖空",["I won't participate in speculation.","No speculation has taken place concerning the motives."],["我不會參與猜忌。",""]],["ray","rei","n. 光线, 射线, 闪烁, 光辉\\nvi. 射出光线, 浮现, 放射光线\\nvt. 放射, 显出",["Ray was willing to corroborate Gary's story, but the police were still unconvinced that either of them were telling the truth.","A number of imaging techniques are employed in radiology, such as X-ray, MRI, and ultrasound."],["Ray乐于证实Gary的故事，但警察仍然不相信他们其中一个说的是事实。","放射學中採用了數種影像技術，比如 X 光、MRI 和超音波。"]],["uncover",".ʌn'kʌvә","vt. 揭露, 揭开, 暴露, 脱帽致敬\\nvi. 脱帽致敬, 揭去盖子",["I dare not probe too deeply, lest I uncover the awful truth!","Sometimes you just need to check the library archives to uncover the hypocrisy of some people."],["我不敢探查得太深, 以免發現可怕的事實。",""]],["attendance","ә'tendәns","n. 出席, 出席的人数, 照料\\n[法] 管理, 照料, 资助",["Attendance is compulsory for all members.","Firstly, let's check the attendance."],["全員均須出席。","首先，我们检查出勤情况。"]],["behalf","bi'hɑ:f","n. 利益, 方面",["On behalf of the company, I would like to express our hearty thanks to you all.","Please say hello to your family on my behalf."],["在此僅代表本公司向各位致上衷心的謝意。","请代我向你的家人问好。"]],["innovative","'inәjveitiv","a. 革新的, 创新的, 富有革新精神的",["Many people would like to be motivated, innovative, thinking beings if they could only get the opportunity.","They will use an innovative technique to perform such a task."],["",""]],["installation",".instә'leiʃәn","n. 安装, 装置, 就职\\n[医] 结构, 装置, 设立",["Your computer will restart several times during installation.","An immersive art installation in New York City has visitors captivated."],["",""]],["shark","ʃɑ:k","n. 鲨鱼, 骗子\\nv. 诈骗",["The skin of a shark is much rougher than that of a tuna fish.","However, I can't help noticing, at this moment, that at first glance it seems inevitable that the shark will devour the man."],["鯊魚皮比金槍魚皮粗糙多了。",""]],["mill","mil","n. 压榨机, 磨坊, 制造厂\\nvt. 碾磨, 磨细, 搅拌, 使乱转\\nvi. 乱转, 被碾磨",["Time passes, and it turns the wheel of life as water does that of a mill.","My life is like water that has passed the mill; it turns no wheel."],["",""]],["stimulate","'stimjuleit","vt. 刺激, 激励, 鼓舞\\nvi. 起刺激作用",["Tax cuts are often used as a major fiscal tool to stimulate the economy.","Teachers stimulate the students' interest, have them think, ask questions, and debate among themselves."],["减税常被用作刺激经济的主要财政手段。",""]],["swimming","'swimiŋ","n. 游泳, 眩晕",["If you stay at a big hotel, you can use their swimming pool.","While swimming in the pool, she lost her locker key."],["若你住到的是大的旅館，就能使用他們的游泳池。","她在游泳池游泳的時候把儲物櫃的鑰匙弄丟了。"]],["tag","tæg","n. 标签, 附属物, 碎片, 结束语, 口头禅, 附加语, 浑名, 标记, 标记符\\nvt. 附以签条, 尾随, 添饰, 起浑名, 连接…",["If anything important comes up, tag me so I can see it right away when I check messages.","I attached my name-tag to my baggage, but it soon came off."],["如果有什么重要的事情，你可以@我，这样我查看消息时就能第一时间看到。","我在我的行李上附上了有我名字的標籤, 但是它很快就剝落了。"]],["catalog","'kætәlɒg","n. 目录, 大学概况手册\\nvt. 编目录\\n[计] 目录; 编目",["Neil Gemmell, a geneticist from the University of Otago in New Zealand, led the study that tried to catalog all living species in the lake by extracting DNA from water samples.","However, the color was different from the sample color in your catalog."],["紐西蘭奧塔哥大學的遺傳學家尼爾杰梅爾領導了這項研究，試圖透過從水樣本中提取 DNA 來對湖泊中所有生物物種進行編目。",""]],["outsider","' aut'saidә","n. 外人, 局外人, 非会员, 外行, 门外汉, 比赛中获胜可能性不大的选手\\n[经] 外船公司",["The easier it is for an outsider to suggest a change, the more volunteers you'll get.","Donald Trump, a political outsider, won the presidency in a stunning upset."],["",""]],["fleet","fli:t","n. 舰队, 港湾, 小河\\na. 快速的, 敏捷的, 浅的, 短暂的\\nadv. 浅\\nvi. 疾驰, 飞逝, 掠过\\nvt. 消磨, …",["Our combined fleet broke through the enemy's defense zone.","It's apparently a metaphor for something uncatchable, light of body and fleet of foot."],["",""]],["stance","stæns","n. 准备击球姿势, 站立的姿势, 位置, 姿态\\n[经] 地位, 形势",["Western countries are jumping on Japan for its stance on the issue.","Their shoulders are strong no matter what stance they are in so they can throw back to the pitcher well."],["",""]],["vertical","'vә:tikl","a. 垂直的, 直立的\\n[医] 垂直的, 顶的, 头顶的",["The giant plane screamed down in an almost vertical dive.","Do not set the console other than in the vertical or horizontal position."],["",""]],["compel","kәm'pel","vt. 强迫, 迫使",["Hunger is a very powerful human instinct which can compel us to extremes of behaviour.","At this the innkeeper waxed very wroth, and threatened if he did not pay to compel him in a way that he would not like."],["",""]],["desperately","'despәrәtli","adv. 拼命地；绝望地；极度地",["The ground is parched and cracked, the tinder-dry grass crackles underfoot, and rain is desperately needed in our region.","Mary still misses Tom desperately nine months after his death."],["",""]],["someday","'sʌmdei","adv. 有一天",["I wouldn't have thought I would someday look up \"Viagra\" in Wikipedia.","It is inevitable that I go to France someday, I just don't know when."],["我不会想到有一天我会在维基百科查找“伟哥”。","我總有一天是必須去法國的，但不知道是何時。"]],["sensitivity",".sensә'tiviti","n. 敏感, 灵敏度\\n[计] 灵敏度",["His stern tone and loud voice belied his inner sensitivity and caring nature.","I recommend earmuffs to help with your noise sensitivity."],["",""]],["instant","'instәnt","n. 立即, 瞬间\\na. 紧急的, 立即的, 即时的",["If you drink instant coffee you do not need a coffee pot.","I had instant noodles as a midnight snack."],["如果你喝速溶咖啡，就不需要咖啡壶了。","我消夜吃了速食面。"]],["proclaim","prә'kleim","vt. 宣布, 公告, 宣言, 表明, 赞扬\\n[法] 宣布, 宣告, 公布",["To save the world requires faith and courage: faith in reason, and courage to proclaim what reason shows to be true.","Taiwan can't possibly proclaim official independence."],["",""]],["debut","'deibju:","n. 初次登台, 开张\\nv. 初次登台",["Tom became popular among teenagers as soon as he made his debut on the screen.","He became popular among teenagers as soon as he made his debut on the screen."],["汤姆第一次上电视后就广受青少年的欢迎。",""]],["hike","haik","n. 徒步旅行, 远足, 涨价, 提高\\nvi. 步行, 徒步旅行, 上升\\nvt. 使高涨, 拉起",["Let's take advantage of the vacation to go on a hike.","The weather has been nice all week; it is high time we went on a hike."],["",""]],["worldwide","'wә:ldwaid","a. 全世界的",["Korean entertainment culture is popular worldwide.","Despite adversity, the architect achieved worldwide fame."],["韓國的娛樂文化在全球都很受歡迎。","尽管有逆境，建筑师还是获得了享誉全球的荣誉。"]],["trainer","'treinә","n. 训练员, 驯马师\\n[电] 列车器",["The dolphin and trainer communicated much better than we expected.","I know that Tom is a horse trainer."],["海豚和驯养员交流得比我们所期望的好得多。","我知道湯姆是位馴馬師。"]],["confrontation",".kɔnfrʌn'teiʃәn","n. 对抗；对质；面对",["Everybody knows that Cold War is the confrontation between two nations.","He deliberately kept on provoking a confrontation."],["是人都知道冷戰是兩國的對峙。",""]],["scent","sent","n. 气味, 香味, 香水, 踪迹, 痕迹, 线索, 嗅觉\\nvt. 闻出, 嗅, 发觉, 使充满气味\\nvi. 嗅猎, 发出气味",["After washing, the cat's fur is soft and fluffy, and has a faint scent.","On the country path, a gentle breeze blows, and the scent of night-blooming jasmine reminds one of childhood nights."],["洗过澡后，猫咪的毛柔软又蓬松，还有淡淡的香味。","鄉間小路上，微風拂過，夜來香的香味讓人想起童年的夜晚。"]],["colorful","'kʌlәful","a. 华美的, 富有色彩的, 有趣的",["The picture is colorful in contrast with this one.","Known for their colorful worlds and open-ended play, these games are scheduled to be available starting November 6."],["和這幅比起上來，那幅畫的色彩鮮艷多了。","這些遊戲以繽紛的世界觀與開放互動的玩法著稱，預定於 11 月 6 日推出。"]],["required","ri'kwaiәd","a. 必需的",["I lost a school key when I was cleaning up after the school festival and I was then required to write an apology letter.","The Romans would never have had enough time for conquering the world if they had first been required to study Latin."],["我在校庆后打扫的时候弄掉了一把学校的钥匙，我被迫写了一份检讨。","如果他们必须先学拉丁文的话，是没有时间让罗马人征服世界的对吧。"]],["thanksgiving","'θæŋks.giviŋ","n. 感谢",["Tom has never participated in Thanksgiving celebrations.","The tramp gobbled down the Thanksgiving dinner served at the church."],["",""]],["eyebrow","'aibrau","n. 眉毛\\n[医] 眉",["Benedito raised an eyebrow as his billy goat sniffed curiously at a clump of rocks.","He did not even raise an eyebrow at the news of his wife's death."],["",""]],["stack","stæk","n. 堆叠, 堆, 大量, 书库, 枪架, 烟囱, 堆积, 存贮栈\\nvt. 堆积, 堆满, 暗中对...做手脚\\nvi. 堆起\\n[计]…",["Tom is clambering about on the roof, repairing the chimney stack.","She's a professor whose works you could stack up to head height."],["汤姆在屋顶一边爬一边修理烟囱。","那位是一个著作等身的教授。"]],["sack","sæk","n. 麻布袋, 洗劫\\nvt. 把...装入袋, 洗劫",["In British English, \"to get the sack\" means to be fired from your job.","I got the sack but I've a little saved up, so for the time being I won't be troubled by living expenses."],["英式英語的「to get the sack」是被解僱的意思。","虽然我被公司解雇了，但是我还有点存款，所以目前不用担心生计问题。"]],["organizational",".ɒ:gәnai'zeiʃәnәl","a. 组织的\\n[法] 组织的, 编制的, 机构的",["In the previous meeting, we already discussed the organizational problem within our company.","Fortunately, the organizational changes did not involve any layoffs."],["在上次會議中我們已經討論了我們集團的組織問題。",""]],["tray","trei","n. 托盘, 公文盘, 满盘, 发射箱\\n[化] 淋盘",["Mr Yamaha filled the big tray in his living room with walnuts.","On the tray are five objects - three of them are keys."],["雅馬哈先生在客廳裡的大托盤裡裝滿了核桃。",""]],["cease","si:s","n. 停止\\nv. 停止, 终了",["Facts do not cease to exist because they are ignored.","As long as war is regarded as wicked, it will always have its fascination. When it is looked upon as vulgar, it will cease to be popular."],["不是因为某人不理事实它们就会不复存在了。","当人们认为战争残酷时，它还是很吸引人的。当人们认为战争粗俗时，它就没那么受欢迎了。"]],["inherit","in'herit","vt. 继承, 遗传\\nvi. 接受遗产",["Blessed are the meek, for they will inherit the earth.","A son who could not learn to paddle his own canoe does not deserve to inherit his father's fortune."],["",""]],["pioneer",".paiә'niә","n. 先锋, 拓荒者, 创始人\\nvt. 提倡, 开辟, 开创, 倡导\\nvi. 作先驱, 开路\\na. 最早的, 开拓的, 先驱的, 有…",["Pioneer men and women had a hard life, and so did their children.","She was a pioneer in the field of computer science."],["",""]],["textbook","'tekstbuk","n. 教科书",["The first day of the course he bought the textbook which he needed to do his homework.","This textbook is written in simple English."],["在學期的第一天，他買了寫作業要用到的教科書。","这本教科书是用简单的英语写的。"]],["shrink","ʃriŋk","n. 收缩, 萎缩, 回避\\nvi. 收缩, 退缩, 萎缩, 缩小, 回避\\nvt. 使收缩, 使缩小",["Fruit that has been left for a long time will shrink.","If you wish to get on in the world, you must not shrink from effort."],["水果放久了，就会萎縮。",""]],["illustration",".ilә'streiʃәn","n. 例证, 插图\\n[化] 插图",["To give a definition of a word is more difficult than to give an illustration of its usage.","I bought the book because of the fantastic illustration on the cover."],["要為一個字下定義比為字的用法舉例更困難。",""]],["nasty","'nɑ:sti","a. 污秽的, 下流的, 险恶的",["Regardless how many times I try to solve this nasty problem, I always end up failing.","She gives me a nasty look every time she sees me."],["对于这个棘手的问题，无论我尝试多少次，结果都会以失败告终。","她每次看見我都給露出厭惡的眼神。"]],["emerging","","[法] 出现的, 发生的, 形成的",["The emerging labor shortage is viewed as a sign of economic overheating.","Government debt is about 79% of GDP and remains among the highest of the emerging markets."],["",""]],["uh","ʌn. әn","int. 嗯啊",["Uh-oh, here comes another lecture. How typical. This guy has something to say about everything.","Uh-oh. He knew I was lying - saw right through me. I didn't know what to say."],["",""]],["wheat","hwi:t","n. 小麦",["At Christmas, one eats roast goose, red cabbage, and wheat buns.","Because of the poor harvest, wheat prices have gone up in the last six months."],["聖誕節時，人們會吃烤鵝、紅甘藍和小麥麵包。",""]],["dot","dɒt","n. 点, 圆点, 小数点, 小东西, 嫁妆\\nvt. 作小点记号, 加小点于\\nvi. 打上点\\n[计] 点",["The dot product of two vectors can be expressed as a function of their lengths and the angle between them.","She bought two pairs of polka dot stockings."],["兩個向量的點積可以表示為其長度與兩者夾角的函數。","她買了兩雙波點絲襪。"]],["rational","'ræʃәnl","a. 理性的, 合理的\\nn. 有理数",["From an objective viewpoint, his argument was far from rational.","Parents aren't rational because love isn't rational."],["",""]],["fierce","fiәs","a. 凶猛的, 猛烈的, 热烈的, 暴躁的",["No matter how fierce the winds blow or the waves crash, it feels as effortless as strolling leisurely in a quiet courtyard.","That really fierce cockroach uglifies the so-called robot."],["不管风吹浪打，胜似闲庭信步。",""]],["envision","in'viʒәn","vt. 想象, 预想",["I didn't envision him as a Klingon speaker; his forehead was too smooth.","I can envision a time when this will be very relevant."],["",""]],["aisle","ail","n. 走廊, 侧廊, 过道\\n[机] 走道",["Morley Andrews was caught driving a pair of trained crickets in the aisle.","As if fleeing, he left the vegetable aisle to go to the meat corner."],["",""]],["protocol","'prәutәkɒl","n. 草案, 礼仪, 协议\\nv. 拟定\\n[计] 协议, 协议列表实用程序",["It should be noted that Dole did not intend to change the configuration of the communication protocol.","Hypertext transfer protocol is abbreviated as http and is the protocol used for web pages."],["",""]],["weaken","'wi:kәn","vt. 削弱, 减弱, 使虚弱\\nvi. 变弱, 变软弱",["They watched her gradually weaken as the disease progressed.","If you want to weaken Samson, cut off his hair when he sleeps. The secret of his strength is in his hair, you see."],["他们观察到她随著病情变化身体也渐渐衰弱下去。",""]],["kingdom","'kiŋdәm","n. 王国, 领域\\n[医] 界(动物,植物,矿物)",["It is easier for a camel to pass through the eye of a needle than for a rich man to enter the kingdom of God.","During the 15th century, the Ryukyu Kingdom was a tributary state of Imperial China."],["富人要進天國，比駱駝穿過針孔還要難。","在15世紀，琉球王國是中國帝國的附庸國。"]],["vocal","'vәukl","a. 嗓音的, 声音的, 有声的, 歌唱的\\nn. 元音, 声乐作品",["Public feeling against air pollution has at last become vocal.","I like vocal music better than instrumental music."],["公众终于对关于空气污染的意见直言不讳了。",""]],["exclusively","ik'sklu:sivli","adv. 排他地, 仅仅, 专门, 只, 仅, 唯一地, 专有地",["Metroid Prime 3: Corruption is a Nintendo video game sold exclusively for the Wii.","The Russian nightingales are even singing this year exclusively for glorification of the Great Victory."],["",""]],["marketplace","'mɑ:kit'pleis","n. 市场",["A moral monopoly is the antithesis of a marketplace of ideas.","A small group of tourists of various nationalities had gathered at the fountain in the marketplace for a city tour."],["",""]],["openly","'әjpәnli","adv. 公开地, 坦率地, 直率地, 公然地",["Those who openly declare themselves to be his enemies do not survive for very long afterwards.","Mary couldn't openly flirt with her girlfriend during the meeting, so she decided to play footsie with her under the table."],["",""]],["terrain","'terein","n. 地带, 地区, 地形, 领域, 范围",["The rugged terrain made the troops' advance difficult.","This is awfully hilly terrain; I hope we don't screw up the transmission."],["地面高低不平，給部隊前進帶來了困難。",""]],["unfair",".ʌn'fєә","a. 不公平的, 不正直的, 不正当的\\n[法] 不正直的, 不公平的, 偏颇的",["It would be unfair if we treated him so badly.","You should've rejected such an unfair proposal."],["我們這樣待他，好像不是太好。","你本该拒绝一个那么不公平的提议。"]],["risky","'riski","a. 危险的",["Banks charge higher interest on loans to risky customers.","Taking slaves from Africa to the United States was very risky."],["银行对风险客户收取较高的贷款利息。",""]],["deploy","di'plɒi","v. 展开, 配置",["During the first week of its journey, the spacecraft will deploy its high-gain antenna and magnetometer boom.","China will need to deploy hundreds of thousands of troops to invade Taiwan."],["",""]],["genre","'ʒɒŋrә","n. 类型, 流派",["Procrastination is very democratic. It does not discriminate by platform, genre, or protocol.","Some say the new film is not a visual tour de force like others in its genre, but it is worth seeing for other reasons."],["",""]],["pasta","'pæstә","n. 意大利面食\\n[医] 糊剂, 泥膏剂",["For his first date, he chose an Italian restaurant and ordered seafood pasta, hoping to leave a romantic impression.","The herb used in that pasta sauce might be parsley."],["他第一次約會就選了義大利餐廳，點了海鮮義大利麵，希望留下浪漫印象。","用於那個義大利醬的香草可能是荷蘭芹。"]],["distract","dis'trækt","vt. 转移, 分心, 使发狂",["Don't distract me while I am studying.","Tom tried to distract the guards so Mary would have a chance to escape."],["当我学习的时候不要打扰我。",""]],["depressed","di'prest","a. 沮丧的, 降低的\\n[医] 抑郁的, 阻抑的, 压低的, 凹[陷]的, 扁平的",["I get depressed by the slightest things.","Rather than getting depressed, I'd probably feel hatred towards her."],["我為小事情覺得沮喪。",""]],["planner","'plænә","n. 计划者, 设计者, 安排者\\n[机] 刨床机",["I used to be a planner, but now I'm a wreckless punk.","Sami looked forward for a career as a wedding planner."],["",""]],["merit","'merit","n. 优点, 功绩, 价值, 功过, 真相\\nvt. 值得\\nvi. 应受",["Investing money in your home has some merit; when it is time to sell it you can get more money.","Charms strike the sight, but merit wins the soul."],["多花點錢在房子上，也有一些好處 ﹣ 例如，賣的時候可以賣個比較好的價錢。","魅力冲击视觉，美德征服心灵。"]],["chunk","tʃʌŋk","n. 大块, 矮胖的人(或物)\\n[经] 定样",["She spends a pretty good chunk of time just sitting there and looking out the window.","All of the students were looking at a little chunk of metal."],["",""]],["closest","","a. 最靠近的（close的最高级）",["Please tell me the closest station to your office.","I know the boy who is sitting closest to the door."],["请告诉我离您办公室最近的车站。","我认识那个坐得最靠近门的男孩。"]],["discount","'diskaunt","n. 折扣, 贴现率\\nvt. 打折扣\\nvi. 贴现",["For quantities of 20 or more, we can allow you a special discount of 10% on the prices quoted.","Your initial order is subject to a special discount of 5%."],["20个以上九折特惠。","首次訂購可獲九五折的特別優惠。"]],["ladder","'lædә","n. 梯, 梯状物, 发迹的途径\\nvi. 袜子抽丝, 成名",["He placed the ladder against the fence.","He lost his balance and fell off the ladder."],["他把梯子倚著柵欄放。","他失去了平衡，从梯子上摔了下来。"]],["jungle","'dʒʌŋgl","n. 丛林, 杂乱的一堆, 弱肉强食的地方",["The children got lost in the jungle.","Looking down, we saw a concrete jungle."],["孩子们在丛林中迷路了。","我們往下看，是一片水泥叢林。"]],["breathing","'bri:ðiŋ","n. 呼吸, 瞬间, 微风\\na. 呼吸的, 逼真的",["I shot the horse because it had trouble breathing.","A man who asks his wife's permission before taking any action except breathing is a henpecked husband."],["我枪杀了那匹马，因为他已呼吸困难。","一個除了呼吸之外做任何事之前都要經過老婆同意的男人是一個怕老婆的男人。"]],["migration","mai'greiʃәn","n. 移民, 移往, 移动\\n[计] 迁移",["Africa is a continent of migration.","This species holds the record for long-distance migration."],["非洲是转移的大洲。",""]],["invade","in'veid","vt. 侵入, 拥入, 侵略, 侵袭\\n[法] 强入, 侵犯, 侵略",["People shouldn't be allowed to invade countries whose names they can't pronounce correctly.","We cannot let these foreign words invade our language."],["人们不应该侵犯自己读不正确名字的国家。",""]],["retailer","'ri:teilә","n. 零售商人, 传播的人\\n[经] 零售商",["Marks & Spencers is a well-known British retailer.","Walmart is a dominant retailer in the United States."],["",""]],["hurricane","'hә:rikәn","n. 飓风, 暴风, 暴风雨",["After the hurricane, their house was a wreck.","The victims of the hurricane have not tasted food for three days."],["暴风雨过后，他们的房子成了废墟。",""]],["density","'densiti","n. 密度\\n[化] 密度",["Japan has a high population density.","A recent survey reveals that the population density in the metropolis is decreasing."],["日本的人口密度很高。",""]],["coup","'ku:","n. 砰然的一击, 妙计, 出乎意料的行动, 政变\\n[医] 发作, 中, 击",["Moussa Dadis Camara led a military coup, seizing power, and suspending the constitution.","The Chinese government backs the military coup in Myanmar."],["",""]],["classify","'klæsifai","vt. 分类, 归类, 分等\\n[建] 分类, 分级, 分粒",["We should classify them before throwing them out.","Since the fossil was discovered, researchers referred to it as the \"thing,\" because they could not classify it."],["我们在扔掉之前得分类。",""]],["curiosity",".kjuәri'ɒsiti","n. 好奇心, 新奇的事物, 珍品",["Today's Beijing has given me a very deep impression and aroused my curiosity.","She has begun to play tennis not so much out of curiosity as out of vanity."],["現代的北京给了我深刻的印象，也激起了我的好奇心。",""]],["skip","skip","n. 跳跃, 跳读\\nvi. 跳越, 跳读, 跳绳, 遗漏, 跳级\\nvt. 跳过, 遗漏\\n[计] 跳过",["My physics teacher doesn't care if I skip classes.","You can skip stage three of the certification process and advance immediately to stage six."],["我的物理老师不在乎我是否逃课。","您可以跳過認證過程的第三階段，直接進入第六階段。"]],["ambassador","æm'bæsәdә","n. 大使\\n[法] 大使, 使节, 代理",["An ambassador is an honest man sent to lie abroad for the good of his country.","The English ambassador demanded to meet with the President directly."],["大使是为了本国的利益被派去外国撒谎的正直的人。","英国大使要求直接会见总统。"]],["aggression","ә'greʃәn","n. 侵犯, 侵略\\n[医] 攻击",["Russia started its illegal and unjustifiable war of aggression against Ukraine, and Russia can end it.","They still attacked us, despite clearly agreeing to sign the non-aggression pact."],["俄羅斯對烏克蘭發動了非法、不公義的侵略戰爭，而俄羅斯應該終止這一切。","明明签订了互不侵犯条约，竟然还来攻击我们。"]],["supportive","sә'pɔ:tiv","a. 支撑, 支承, 资助, 赞助, 支援, 经受, 忍受, 扶养, 证实, 鼓励, 维持, 伴奏",["It is hypocritical to protest the consumption of dogs while being supportive of eating cow meat.","I doubt very seriously that Tom will be supportive."],["",""]],["robot","'rәubәt","n. 机械人, 自动机械, 机械般工作的人\\n[计] 机器人; 自动机",["How could I be a robot? Robots don't dream.","Each robot is equipped with a talking machine."],["我怎么可能是机器人呢？机器人不会做梦。","每個機器人身上都安裝了一台發聲器。"]],["journalism","'dʒә:nәlizm","n. 新闻业, 报章杂志\\n[法] 报刊, 新闻业, 新闻出版",["In a democracy, it is important for journalism to be independent.","The president dismisses damning investigative journalism by calling it fake news."],["在民主国家，报刊的独立性是很重要的。",""]],["stimulus","'stimjulәs","n. 刺激, 激励, 刺激品\\n[医] 刺激特, 刺激",["Light is the stimulus that causes a flower to open.","The building of the railway was an important stimulus to the economic development of the town and its surroundings."],["",""]],["persian","'pә:ʃәn","n. 波斯人, 波斯语",["A Persian cat was sleeping under the table.","As commercial and cultural contacts between East and West developed, Arab and Persian traders began calling on China along the Silk Road in increasing numbers."],["波斯猫在桌子下面睡觉。","隨著東西方之間的貿易及文化往來日漸發展，越來越多的阿拉伯和波斯商人開始沿著絲路拜訪中國。"]],["ecosystem","'i:kәu.sistәm","n. 生态系统\\n[医] 生态系",["Wetlands play important roles in the ecosystem in purifying water, protecting against flood and erosion, and as both a source of food and habitat for wild animals.","The coastal ecosystem of British Columbia is rapidly declining."],["湿地在生态系统中扮演着净化水源、防止洪水和侵蚀、为野生动物提供食物和栖息地的重要角色。",""]],["informal","in'fɒ:mәl","a. 非正式的, 不拘礼的, 通俗的\\n[经] 非正式的, 日常使用的",["The school uniform is convenient because it can be worn for both informal and formal occasions.","Women's Liberation is a broad-based but informal popular movement."],["",""]],["likewise","'laikwaiz","adv. 同样地, 也",["She waited without saying a word until I, likewise silent, set down a steaming hot cup of tea in front of her.","I don't believe a single word he's saying, and suggest you do likewise."],["",""]],["feather","'feðә","n. 羽毛\\nvi. 长羽毛\\nvt. 用羽毛装饰",["Down in the valley a mist like a white feather rose gently into a white cloud, and obscured everything.","\"What's the difference between erotic and kinky?\" \"Erotic is when you use a feather and kinky is when you use a whole chicken.\""],["山谷中，薄霧如白色羽毛般緩緩升騰，化作一團白雲，遮蔽了一切。","「情色和變態之間有什麼不同之處？」「情色是當你使用一根羽毛，變態是當你使用整隻雞。」"]],["dip","dip","v. 浸, 降下, 把(手、勺等)伸入, 舀取\\nn. 浸, 涉猎\\n[计] 双列直插式组件, 分布式输入输出系统, 双排直插封装",["If we have money problems we can always dip into our savings.","We had to dip into our savings in order to pay the unexpected medical expenses."],["",""]],["sphere","sfiә","n. 球, 球面, 球体, 天体, 地球仪, 范围\\nvt. 包围, 使成球体, 放入球内",["Then people knew, that the world is a sphere.","The earth is just a sphere suspended in space."],["当时人们就知道，地球是个球体。","地球只不過是懸浮在太空中的一個球體。"]],["boast","bәust","n. 吹牛\\nvi. 吹牛, 自夸\\nvt. 夸口说, 自恃有",["I don't want to boast, but I've never gotten better than a 3 on my report card for home economics. Out of 10 that is.","The United States boast some of the world's cleanest food."],["",""]],["sole","sәul","n. 脚掌, 鞋底, 底部\\na. 唯一的, 仅有的, 单独的, 独身的\\nvt. 上鞋底, 触底",["There was some chewing gum on the sole of Tom's shoe.","There was some chewing gum stuck to the sole of Tom's shoe."],["汤姆的鞋底粘了口香糖。","汤姆的鞋底粘了口香糖。"]],["tighten","'taitn","vt. 勒紧, 使变紧\\nvi. 变紧, 绷紧",["Small businesses will have to tighten their belts to survive.","Now all you have to do is tighten the screw, and Bob's your uncle."],["中小企业要勒紧裤带才能存活。","現在你只要擰緊螺絲，就大功告成了。"]],["perceived","pə'siːvd","v. 感觉( perceive的过去式和过去分词 ); 视为; 认为; 理解为",["Perceived shyness is often simply an expression of politeness in waiting to be addressed before speaking.","The alert guard perceived a dim shape in the distance."],["",""]],["pat","pæt","n. 轻拍\\nv. 轻拍\\nadv. 适时, 正好, 恰好, 毫不迟疑, 熟记地\\na. 恰好的, 合适的, 熟练的, 坚定的, 人为的",["When we were going through security, I got pulled out of line for a pat-down.","I felt somebody pat me on the shoulder."],["当我们过安检的时候，我从队伍里被拉出来搜身。","我感覺有人拍了拍我的肩。"]],["publicity","pʌb'lisiti","n. 名声, 宣传, 公开场合\\n[经] 宣传, 广告",["You don't have to worry about publicity.","Also, if publicity stunts can be avoided, so much the better."],["你不用担心宣传的事。",""]],["unfold",".ʌn'fәuld","vt. 展开, 打开, 披露, 开展, 挑明\\nvi. 伸展, 开花, 呈现",["They was standing on the side, just watching the drama unfold.","New questions will be asked and new debates will unfold."],["",""]],["validity","vә'liditi","n. 有效性, 正确性\\n[计] 有效性",["You shouldn't deny the validity of everything she did just because of a single mistake.","You can't deny the validity of everything she did just because of a single mistake."],["你不能因为她所犯下的一个错误就否定她所做的一切。","你不能因为她所犯下的一个错误就否定她所做的一切。"]],["strictly","'striktli","adv. 严格地, 确实地",["The importation of rare wild animals to this country is strictly prohibited.","What I'm about to say is strictly between you and me."],["该国严禁进口稀有野生动物。","我要告訴你的只能你我知道。"]],["weed","wi:d","n. 杂草, 野草\\nvi. 除草\\nvt. 除...的草, 剔除",["Tom said he thought he'd be able to help Mary weed the garden today.","Tom said that he thought he'd be able to help Mary weed the garden today."],["汤姆说他以为他今天能够帮玛丽的花园除草","汤姆说他以为他今天能够帮玛丽的花园除草"]],["partial","'pɑ:ʃәl","a. 部分的, 偏袒的, 偏爱的\\nn. 分音",["Departure is a partial death but death in essence is not only departure.","You shouldn't do partial-word searches, since they put a lot of strain on the server."],["离开是部分的死亡，而死亡不仅仅是离开。",""]],["compliance","kәm'plaiәns","n. 遵从, 顺从, 屈从\\n[化] 柔顺; 顺应",["We are building your house in compliance with your wishes.","The article you wrote is not in compliance with our journal's standards."],["",""]],["collar","'kɒlә","n. 衣领, 颈圈\\nvt. 控制, 扭住衣领, 给...装上领子",["With a high, closed collar, figure-hugging cut, and large slits at either side of a straight skirt, the qipao is unique in its ability to communicate both modesty and sensuousness.","The drunken man grasped my collar and swore at me."],["因为有高而闭合的领子、紧身的剪裁和在直身裙两边的大开口，旗袍有着独一无二传达端庄和性感的能力。",""]],["builder","'bildә","n. 建立者\\n[机] 组份",["Mr Brown contracted with the builder for a new house.","You should have your house built by a trustworthy builder."],["",""]],["added","'ædid","a. 额外的；更多的",["As time went on, rules were added to the game to make it safer.","Your sentence was not added because it already exists."],["随着时间的推移，比赛增加了规则以使之更安全。","您无法添加这个句子，因为以下句子已经存在。"]],["supposedly","sә'pәuzidli","adv. 想象上, 看上去像, 被认为是, 恐怕, 按照推测",["Supposedly, his father once betrayed China.","Even though we're supposedly in a recession, people are traveling abroad in record numbers this Golden Week holiday."],["据说他的父亲曾经是汉奸。",""]],["streak","stri:k","n. 条理, 斑纹, 倾向\\nvt. 加条纹\\nvi. 变成条纹, 飞跑",["Having hit a streak of bad luck, my fortune had gone to pot in no time.","After a streak of bad luck, a persistent gambler will be forced to play for high stakes."],["",""]],["specialty","'speʃәlti","n. 专业, 专长, 特产, 特制品, 特性, 特点\\na. 专门的, 独立的",["There were some graphic novels mixed into the pile of specialty books on the desk.","Across the U.S., artisanal and specialty cheesemakers are facing devastating business losses."],["书桌上一叠专业书里有几本卡通书混在里面。",""]],["deem","di:m","v. 认为, 相信",["That person asked me who I was, but I did not deem it necessary to answer him.","The state can take your children away if they deem you an unfit mother."],["",""]],["glimpse","glimps","n. 一瞥, 一闪\\nvi. 投以一瞥, 闪烁不定\\nvt. 瞥见",["I caught a glimpse of Mt. Fuji from the window of the train.","In looking through the mist, I caught a glimpse of my future."],["我從火車車窗瞥見了富士山。","透过薄雾，我隐约看见了我的未来。"]],["premise","'premis","n. 前提, 房屋连地基, 上述各项\\nvt. 预先提出, 引出, 作为...的前提\\nvi. 作出前提",["You ought to think over whether the premise is valid or not.","At least that is the premise of a global gathering of scientists, government representatives and innovators in Senegal this week."],["",""]],["sneak","sni:k","vi. 鬼鬼祟祟做事\\nvt. 偷偷地做\\nn. 鬼鬼祟祟的人, 偷偷摸摸的行为, 帆布胶底运动鞋\\na. 暗中进行的",["David decided to sneak into the kitchen and find something delicious to eat.","Every night, when all was quiet, he would sneak into his neighbour's garden to nick an apple."],["大衛決定偷偷溜進廚房，找點好吃的吃。","每天晚上，当周围安静下来，他就会偷溜进邻居的花园里偷走一颗苹果。"]],["monkey","'mʌŋki","n. 猴子, 猿, 打桩锤\\nvi. 淘气, 胡闹\\nvt. 嘲弄",["I'm not talking to you; I'm talking to the monkey.","A man can no more become a woman than a monkey can develop into a man."],["我不是在跟你說話，我在跟猴子說話。","男人不能变成女人，就像猴子不能进化成人类一样。"]],["oscar","'ɔskә","n. 奥斯卡金像奖, 钱, 现金",["The Oscar ceremonies are Hollywood's biggest extravaganza.","I breed betta fish and cull my unwanted stock by feeding them to my oscar."],["奥斯卡颁奖典礼，是好莱坞最盛大的活动。",""]],["artifact","'ɑ:tifækt","n. 人工制品\\n[医] 人为现象, 人工产物",["The artifact discovered at the archaeological site should be treated with utmost care.","The Artifact on the show \"Picard\" is an abandoned Borg cube."],["",""]],["listener","'lisnә","n. 收听者, 听众",["The secret of influencing people lies not so much in being a good talker as in being a good listener.","When the listener doesn't understand the speaker and the speaker doesn't know what they're talking about: that's philosophy."],["",""]],["mentor","'mentɔ:","n. 指导者, 良师益友",["I mentor junior developers and train them to be confident.","To be always ready for war, said Mentor, is the surest way to avoid it."],["",""]],["lightning","'laitniŋ","n. 闪电\\nvi. 闪电\\na. 闪电的",["It is because light travels faster than sound that we see lightning before we hear thunder.","If you swear reckless oaths, lightning will strike you."],["光傳播得比聲音快，所以我們先看到閃電，然後才會聽見雷聲。","乱发誓会遭雷劈的。"]],["legally","'li:gәli","adv. 法律上, 合法地\\n[法] 法律上, 合法地, 法定地",["Mary and Alice are a legally married same sex couple.","Multinationals and extremely rich people manage, sometimes legally, sometimes illegally, to pay little to no taxes by using services offered in fiscal paradises."],["Mary和Alice是一对合法结婚的同性伴侣。","跨國公司和極富有的人透過利用避稅天堂所提供的服務，時而合法、時而非法地少繳甚至不繳稅。"]],["excessive","ik'sesiv","a. 过度的, 过多的, 极端的\\n[法] 过度的, 过分的, 额外的",["Excessive use of the Internet is not a medical or psychiatric issue.","Excessive choice results in the inability to choose."],["过于上网不是跟医学或精神病有关的事情。","选择太多导致无法选择。"]],["memorial","mi'mɒ:riәl","n. 纪念物, 请愿书\\na. 记念的, 记忆的",["The governor dedicated the memorial to the soldiers who died in the war.","Did you enjoy the memorial service? Oops, that came out wrong. I meant to ask whether you found it meaningful."],["",""]],["disturb","dis'tә:b","vt. 扰乱, 妨碍, 使不安\\n[法] 滋扰, 扰乱",["I will try not to disturb you while you are studying.","I'll try not to disturb you while you're studying."],["我会尽量不打扰你复习。","我会尽量不打扰你复习。"]],["disappointment",".disә'pɒintmәnt","n. 失望",["The new teacher was a disappointment to the class.","Tom couldn't conceal his disappointment."],["新老师辜负了这个班学生的期望。","汤姆不能掩饰他的失望。"]],["sleeve","sli:v","n. 袖子, 套管\\nvt. 缝上袖子",["The men are wearing short sleeve shirts.","My daughter held on to my coat sleeve and would not let me go."],["男人們穿著短袖上衣。",""]],["rib","rib","n. 肋骨, 肋状物, 笑话\\nvt. 装肋状物于, 戏弄",["And the Lord God built the rib which He took from Adam into a woman.","And the Lord God built the rib which he took from Adam into a woman: and brought her to Adam."],["",""]],["logical","'lɒdʒikәl","a. 合乎逻辑的, 合理的\\n[法] 逻辑的, 符合逻辑的",["The most logical place to keep your shoes is near the door.","Prime numbers are like life; they are completely logical, but impossible to find the rules for, even if you spend all your time thinking about it."],["最合逻輯的放鞋處是門口附近。","质数就像生活，它们是完全符合逻辑的，但即使我们花所有时间来思考，也找不到规律。"]],["parish","'pæriʃ","n. 教区, 堂区\\n[法] 救贫区, 教区",["The old parish church was closed due to its disrepair.","This tree is not even close to being the tallest in the parish."],["",""]],["debris","'deibri:","n. 碎片, 残骸\\n[医] 碎屑",["A cloud of dust and debris rose and lingered in the sky for a few minutes afterward.","Ziri cleaned the debris from the roof."],["一團塵土與瓦礫騰空而起，在空中盤旋了數分鐘。","齊李清理了屋頂的瓦礫。"]],["socially","'sәuʃәli","adv. 在社会上, 在社交上, 以社会生活方式",["Doing math is the only socially acceptable way to masturbate in public.","Socially awkward people have a harder time finding romantic partners."],["",""]],["slavery","'sleivәri","n. 奴隶的身分, 奴隶状态, 奴隶制度\\n[法] 奴隶制度, 奴役, 苦役",["War is peace. Freedom is slavery. Ignorance is strength.","Slavery is a crime against humanity."],["战争即和平，自由即奴役，无知即力量。","奴役制是一种危害人类罪。"]],["rod","rɒd","n. 竿, 笞鞭, 小枝\\n[化] 棒",["Even though I walk through the valley of the shadow of death, I will fear no evil, for you are with me; your rod and your staff, they comfort me.","Yea, though I walk through the valley of the shadow of death, I will fear no evil: for thou art with me; thy rod and thy staff they comfort me."],["雖然我行過死蔭的幽谷，也不怕遭害， 因為你與我同在；你的杖，你的竿，都安慰我。","我雖然行過死蔭的幽谷，也不怕遭害，因為你與我同在；你的杖，你的竿，都讓我安心。"]],["ash","æʃ","n. 灰, 灰烬\\n[化] 灰分",["The southern Italian island of Sicily has been covered with a vast plume of smoke and ash.","Think of your opponent as nothing more than a handful of ash."],["",""]],["blank","blæŋk","n. 空格, 空白\\na. 空白的, 空虚的, 完全的, 无色的\\nvi. 消失, 成为空白\\nvt. 使无效, 取消, 封锁\\n[计] …",["I'm in the habit of taking handwritten notes, yet I still often draw a blank when picking up a pen.","There is a blank space in front of the first letter of this sentence that should be removed."],["我有手写笔记的习惯，但依然经常提笔忘字。",""]],["cure","kjuә","n. 治疗, 治愈, 治疗法\\nvt. 治疗, 治愈, 改正, 腌制, 加工处理, 使硫化\\nvi. 受治疗, 被加工处理, 被硫化",["Scientists have not found a method yet to cure cancer.","Many people believe acupuncture can cure diseases."],["科学家们还不知道怎么治疗癌症。","很多人都相信針灸有治癒疾病的功效。"]],["faster","","[计] 加快",["When the chickens are flat as pancakes, then again the tractor must have been faster than them.","Fingernails grow nearly four times faster than toenails."],["當雞像煎餅一樣平的時候, 那麼一定是拖拉機跑得比它們快。","手甲的生長速度比腳甲快四倍。"]],["commodity","kә'mɒditi","n. 农产品, 商品, 有用的物品\\n[经] 商品, 货物, 日用品",["The 12 countries of the European Community are working out a compromise on agricultural commodity prices.","Service economy is a useful labor that does not produce a tangible commodity."],["",""]],["dying","'daiiŋ","a. 垂死的\\n[法] 快要死的, 垂死的, 临终的",["There were cars burning, people dying, and nobody could help them.","The survivors were found on an island, dying of starvation."],["有着火的汽车和垂死的人，而且没有人能帮得上忙。","倖存者在一箇島上被找到了，已經餓得要死了。"]],["saint","seint","n. 圣徒, 圣人\\na. 神圣的\\n[计] 自动积分程序符号",["Many people visited the shrine where the saint lay buried.","The colonnade of the basilica of Saint Peter is truly grand and beautiful."],["",""]],["mineral","'minәrәl","n. 矿物, 无机物, 苏打水\\na. 矿物的, 似矿物的",["That country is rich in mineral resources.","I like to drink natural mineral water."],["那個國家擁有豐富的礦物資源。","我喜歡喝天然的礦泉水。"]],["hunger","'hʌŋgә","n. 饥饿, 渴望, 饥荒\\nvt. 使挨饿\\nvi. 挨饿, 渴望",["To him, hunger was an abstract concept; he always had enough to eat.","During that time, we only heard about thieves, about murders, about men who had died of hunger."],["對他來說，「肚子餓」是個抽象的概念，因為他從來就沒有餓過。","那个时候，我们只能听到关于盗窃、杀人、以及饿死了人的故事。"]],["spare","spєә","n. 剩余, 备用品, 备件, 备用零件, 备用轮胎\\na. 多余的, 备用的, 空闲的, 节约的, 瘦的\\nvi. 节约, 省掉, 宽恕…",["We have three spare rooms, none of which can be used.","Can you spare me a few minutes? I'd like to have a word with you."],["虽然有三间空屋，但哪间都用不了。","你有幾分鐘時間嗎？我想跟你聊一下。"]],["halfway","'hɑ:f'wei","a. 中途的, 不彻底的, 部分的\\nadv. 半路地, 在中途, 在半途",["We still have more than halfway to go to get to the top of the mountain. Are you really already exhausted?","I'm halfway through this detective story."],["我們要走到山上，還沒走到一半的路，你真的已經那麼累了嗎？","這本偵探小說我才看到一半。"]],["developmental","di.velәp'mentәl","a. 发展的, 进化的, 启发的\\n[医] 发育的",["My sister is majoring in developmental psychology.","Saying intersex people have a \"developmental disease\" is a judgment call, not an objective fact."],["",""]],["cemetery","'semitәri","n. 墓地, 公墓\\n[法] 公墓, 墓地",["J.F. Kennedy was buried in Arlington Cemetery.","People are going to the cemetery today to pay respect to their deceased loved ones."],["约翰甘迺迪被安葬在阿靈頓公墓。",""]],["equality","i:'kwɒliti","n. 平等, 均匀, 相等\\n[法] 同等, 平等, 相等",["The heart of Esperanto ideology is the equality of all languages and cultures.","The love of democracy is that of equality."],["世界语的思想核心在于一切语言文化的平等。","爱民主就是爱平等。"]],["harassment","'hærәsmәnt","n. 困扰, 烦扰, 烦恼\\n[法] 折磨, 骚扰, 侵扰",["When I told her I'd never seen such a homely girl, she accused me of sexual harassment.","Women's rights groups are going after sexual harassment."],["",""]],["deliberately","di'libәrәtli","adv. 故意地",["He deliberately exposed her to danger.","The most perfidious way of harming a cause consists of defending it deliberately with faulty arguments."],["他故意令她陷入险境。",""]],["fame","feim","n. 名望, 名声, 传说",["Despite adversity, the architect achieved worldwide fame.","Even with all his wealth and fame, he's unhappy."],["尽管有逆境，建筑师还是获得了享誉全球的荣誉。","尽管有金钱和名誉，他还是不幸福。"]],["striking","'straikiŋ","a. 醒目的, 惊人的, 打击的, 罢工的\\n[法] 罢工的, 罢市的, 罢课的",["Anna's striking almond-shaped eyes, inherited from her Asian lineage, exude a captivating depth and a hint of mystery.","Tall and striking, with a black and gold embroidered shirt and a glittering brown bonnet, she blends in easily with the trendy, after-work crowd."],["安娜引人注目的杏仁狀眼睛繼承了她的亞洲血統，散發著迷人的深度和一絲神秘感。","她身材高挑，外形出眾，身穿黑金刺繡襯衫，頭戴閃亮的棕色軟帽，輕鬆地融入了時髦的下班人潮之中。"]],["regret","ri'gret","n. 遗憾, 后悔, 悔恨, 抱歉, 歉意\\nvt. 为...感到遗憾, 后悔, 惋惜, 懊悔, 抱歉\\nvi. 感到抱歉",["When I ask people what they regret most about high school, they nearly all say the same thing: that they wasted so much time.","However, as soon as I saw the situation at the train station I began to regret this decision."],["当我问人家高中时代他们最后悔的是什么时，他们几乎所有人都回答一致：他们浪费了那么多时间。","但是，我一看到火车站的场面就开始后悔做出这个决定。"]],["likelihood","'laiklihud","n. 可能, 可能性",["In all likelihood, the president will serve a second term.","In all likelihood, you will pass the entrance exam if you use this textbook."],["",""]],["carrot","'kærәt","n. 胡萝卜\\n[医] 胡萝卜",["She has reddish hair, whence comes her nickname \"Carrot\".","At home, because of his reddish hair and freckles, his mother scornfully named him \"carrot\" and had everybody else call him that."],["",""]],["wheelchair","'hwi:l.tʃєә","n. 轮椅",["In the end, because of the disease, he became unable to walk and had to use a motorized wheelchair to get around.","The hallway needs to be wide enough for a wheelchair."],["最後，他的病奪去了他走路的能力，想去哪兒也要用電動輪椅來代步。","走廊要夠輪椅寬。"]],["toll","tәul","n. 通行费, 代价, 钟声\\nvt. 征收, 敲钟, 鸣钟, 勾引, 引诱\\nvi. 征税, 鸣钟",["This mountain was opened by me; this tree was planted by me. If you wish to pass through here, leave behind your toll money.","We must pay a toll to drive on this road."],["此山是我開，此樹是我栽，要想從此過，留下買路財。","我们必得缴通行税才能在这条道路上行驶。"]],["atop","ә'tɒp","adv. 在顶上\\nprep. 在...的顶上",["The flatboat carrying the two silent men went on gliding atop the dark waters as the moonlit night slowly wore on.","I admire the view of the entire city atop the Ferris wheel."],["",""]],["embarrassed","im'bærәst","a. 尴尬的；窘迫的",["Tom and Mary told me that they thought John was embarrassed.","She was very embarrassed when her child behaved badly in public."],["汤姆和玛丽告诉我他们以为约翰感到害羞。","當她的孩子在公共場合行為表現不好的時候，她覺得很尷尬。"]],["rim","rim","n. 边, 轮缘, 框\\nvt. 镶边, 为...装边\\nvi. 形成边缘",["Mary took an egg and cracked it open on the rim of the bowl.","Then I slipped out the card. No water leaks out because no air can come in; the rim is too close to the table for that."],["瑪麗婭拿了一個雞蛋，並將它在碗沿上敲開。",""]],["suspicious","sә'spiʃәs","a. 可疑的, 多疑的, 怀疑的\\n[法] 怀疑的, 令人怀疑的, 可疑的",["Tom is suspicious of Mary even though he declares otherwise.","Tom didn't seem to be as suspicious as Mary seemed to be."],["湯姆雖然說了一套，但依然懷疑瑪麗。","汤姆没有玛丽那么可疑。"]],["isolated","'aisәleitid","a. 孤立的, 孤零零的\\n[计] 隔离的, 绝缘的",["Several cottages have been isolated by the flood water.","The more stubborn you are, the more isolated you become."],["好几间小屋被洪水孤立起来了。",""]],["cling","kliŋ","vi. 粘紧, 附着, 紧贴, 坚持",["The truth you believe and cling to makes you unavailable to hear anything new.","A lot of people still cling to a form of augury, seeing black cats as omens of bad luck."],["",""]],["squad","skwɒd","n. 班, 小队, 小集团\\nvt. 编成班",["The match was postponed because half the squad came down with food poisoning.","He has the most international caps, but there are better players in the squad."],["",""]],["blink","bliŋk","vi. 眨眼, 闪亮\\nvt. 眨眼, 使闪亮\\nn. 眨眼, 瞬间, 闪光, 闪烁\\n[计] 闪烁",["A complicated job like that can't be done in the blink of an eye.","The firefighters put out the fire in the blink of an eye."],["如此复杂的工作决不能毕其功于一役。","消防员一眨眼的功夫就把火给灭了。"]],["eligible","'elidʒәbl","a. 有资格当选的, 合格的\\nn. 有资格者, 合格者, 适任者",["If he were a little younger, he would be eligible for the post.","Fadil accepted a reduced sentence of 25 years and is now eligible for parole."],["如果他年轻一点，他将很适合这个职位。",""]],["plunge","plʌndʒ","n. 钻进, 跳进, 跳水, 跳水池, 猛跌, 落下, 投入, 开始从事, 盲目投资\\nvi. 投入, 投身于, 跳进, 陷入, 下降\\n…",["The robber tried to plunge the knife into the boy.","I'll plunge into the matter without further preamble."],["",""]],["processor","prә'sesә","n. 信息处理机, 加工者, 处理者\\n[计] 处理器",["Compared to a computer, a word processor has a single purpose.","The word processor will save you a lot of trouble."],["文字處理軟件和電腦不同的是，它只有一個用途。",""]],["demographic",".demә'græfik","a. 人口统计的\\n[法] 人口统计的, 人口学的",["Only Japan has an older demographic than Italy among advanced countries.","It is necessary to look more carefully into the demographic configuration of this region."],["",""]],["refuge","'refju:dʒ","n. 避难所, 安全地带, 避难, 庇护\\nvi. 躲避\\nvt. 给予...庇护",["We took refuge from the storm in a nearby barn.","When life is so burdensome death has become a sought after refuge."],["为躲避风暴，我们躲到了附近的一个谷仓内。",""]],["chill","tʃil","n. 寒冷, 寒意, 失意\\na. 寒冷的, 冷漠的\\nvt. 使寒心, 冷冻\\nvi. 变冷",["It's still early. We should all just chill for a bit.","A chill ran down his spine as he crossed the park."],["时间还早着呢，大家坐下来侃一会儿吧。","他穿過公園時，一陣寒意順著脊背蔓延而下。"]],["rally","'ræli","n. 重振旗鼓, 集合, 群众集会, 跌停回升\\nv. 重整旗鼓, 集合, 恢复精神, 团结, 挖苦, 嘲笑",["A group of about 40 counterprotesters showed up to the rally.","This message definitely feels like something to rally around."],["",""]],["legislator","'ledʒisleitә","n. 立法者, 立法官, 立法委员\\n[法] 立法者, 立法机关成员, 立法委员",["The legislator talked at length with his constituents about beach erosion.","For Newton, as for Boyle and Descartes, there were laws of nature only because there had been a (Divine) Legislator."],["",""]],["cheer","tʃiә","n. 愉快, 振奋, 欢呼\\nvi. 欢呼, 喝彩, 快活起来\\nvt. 使振奋, 欢呼",["What are you unhappy about? Let it out and let everyone cheer you up a bit.","He tried to cheer up his wife, but wasn't able to."],["你有什麼不開心的事? 說出來讓大家開心一下。","他试着哄他老婆开心，但他没做到。"]],["programming","'prәugræmiŋ","n. 节目的计划, 编制程序\\n[计] 程序设计; 程序编制",["The programming language Java is highly versatile.","A programming language is actually like a foreign language."],["编程语言JAVA非常多用途的。","编程语言实际上就像一门外语。"]],["steer","stiә","vt. 引导, 驾驶, 航行, 控制\\nvi. 驾驶, 掌舵, 行驶\\nn. 驾驶指示, 劝告",["The butcher was hacking cuts of meat from the steer carcass.","That car dealer gave me a bum steer when he told me this used Toyota was in good condition."],["",""]],["outlet","'autlet","n. 出口, 发泄方法, 市场\\n[医] 出口",["I spilled jam on the electric outlet and there was a short circuit.","Did you know that if you plug a pickle into an electrical outlet, it glows and makes buzzing noises?"],["我把果酱撒到电源插座上短路了。","你知道如果你把泡菜插入電源插座，它會發光並且發出嗡嗡的聲音嗎？"]],["vendor","'vendә","n. 小贩, 卖主, 自动售货机\\n[计] 计算机销售商",["The ice cream vendor is waiting on customers at his outdoor stand.","Before opening his diner, John was a simple hot dog vendor."],["",""]],["intact","in'tækt","a. 尚未被人碰过的, 原封不动的, 完整的\\n[医] 完整的, 无伤的",["You can write a sentence in a lot of ways and still keep the general message intact.","Sami was going to great lengths to keep his relationship with Layla intact."],["同一个含义可以用很多不同方式写的句子来表示。",""]],["peanut","'pi:nʌt","n. 花生, 小人物, 极小的数额\\na. 渺小的, 微不足道的",["Peanut allergy is the most common of food allergies.","The campers made their own bird feeders with pinecones, peanut butter, and seeds. They hung them from trees with fishing line."],["花生過敏是最常見的食物過敏。","露營者們用松果、花生醬和種子自製了餵鳥器，並用釣魚線將它們掛在樹上。"]],["thrive","θraiv","vi. 繁荣, 兴旺, 茁壮成长\\n[经] 兴旺, 繁荣, 旺盛",["He that will thrive must ask leave of his wife.","Pop artists thrive on the adulation of their loyal fans."],["會成功的男人必須請求妻子讓他離開出外打拼。",""]],["fucking","'fʌkiŋ","a. 该死的, 难完成的, 难做的, 低劣的, 讨厌的, 丑恶的, 混乱的, 乱糟糟的",["Even if we don't get lucky on the first try we can just keep fucking till I get pregnant.","How come this fucking apartment has no double-glazing? I'm freezing."],["即使我們第一次不夠幸運, 我們可以就一直做愛直到我懷孕。","为什么这个他妈的房子没有双层玻璃，我快要冷死了。"]],["elaborate","i'læbәreit","a. 精细的, 详尽的, 精心计划(或制作)的\\nvt. 详细地说明, 用心地制作, 发挥\\nvi. 变复杂, 作详细说明",["In this album all the sounds that you hear are really elaborate computer voices.","She made elaborate preparations for the party."],["在這張專輯裡, 所有你聽到的聲音都是用電腦精密製作出的聲音。","她精心籌備了這個派對。"]],["chew","tʃu:","vt. 咀嚼, 嚼碎\\nvi. 咀嚼, 细想\\nn. 咀嚼, 咀嚼物",["I came here to kick ass and chew bubblegum... And I'm all out of bubblegum.","Chew your food well so it can be digested properly."],["",""]],["auction","'ɒ:kʃәn","n. 拍卖\\nvt. 拍卖",["Instead of preparing a dinner by candlelight, she put her boyfriend up for auction on eBay.","The unclaimed items were sold at auction."],["她没有准备烛光晚餐，而是把她的男友放到Ebay上拍卖。","无人领取的物品被拍卖了。"]],["steak","steik","n. 牛排, 鱼排, 肉排",["He finished the steak, then ordered another portion.","Why didn't the half-cooked steak say hello to the nearly-cooked steak when the two saw each other? They both weren't ready."],["他吃完排骨又點了一份。","五成熟牛排见了七成熟牛排为什么不打招呼？两个都不熟。"]],["shareholder","'ʃєә.hәuldә","n. 股东\\n[法] 股东, 股票持有人",["John Locke, the well-known philosopher of freedom, was a shareholder of the Royal African Company, which bought and sold slaves.","Yale said it has supported shareholder proposals that companies report on what they are doing to fight climate change."],["",""]],["conception","kɒn'sepʃәn","n. 观念, 概念\\n[医] 妊娠, 受孕; 概念",["According to Judaism, life begins at birth and not at conception.","We'll talk a little about the conception of the Mother of God."],["",""]],["comply","kәm'plai","vi. 顺从, 依从\\n[法] 遵守, 承诺, 照做",["Hopefully you'll comply with traffic regulations after this.","Some beaches had failed to comply with environmental regulations."],["希望你们以后严格遵守交通规则。","一些海滩没能遵守环保规定。"]],["triumph","'traiәmf","n. 凯旋, 胜利, 欢欣\\nvi. 得胜, 成功",["As long as good people do nothing, evil will triumph.","To my regret, his was nothing but a short-lived triumph."],["只要好人袖手旁观，恶人就会得胜。",""]],["comparable","'kɒmpәrәbl","a. 可比较的, 比得上的",["Women pay more than men for comparable personal care products 56% of the time.","The Caymanians enjoy a standard of living comparable to that of Switzerland."],["",""]],["transport","træns'pɒ:t","n. 运输, 运输工具, 激动, 狂喜, 流放犯\\nvt. 传送, 运输, 流放\\n[计] 传送",["By using this banana case, you can transport bananas without squashing them.","For example, China's public transport is without a doubt better than the UK's, but the UK's public welfare may be better than China's."],["使用這個香蕉盒，可以讓您運送香蕉時不會壓扁它們。","例如，中國的大眾運輸毫無疑問地優於英國，但英國的公共福利可能比中國的好。"]],["conscience","'kɒnʃәns","n. 良心\\n[法] 良心, 道德感, 正义感",["A clear conscience is an extraordinarily soft pillow.","The way a country treats its intellectuals is a sign of its civility. The way a country treats its farmers is a sign of its conscience."],["問心無愧是一個非常柔軟的枕頭。","一个国家对待知识分子的态度标志着一个国家的文明程度，而一个国家对待农民工的态度则代表着一个国家的良心！"]],["calculation",".kælkju'leiʃәn","n. 计算, 考虑, 计算的结果\\n[经] 计算",["According to my calculation, she should be in India by now.","The calculation of the budget for next year is based on the costs this year."],["根據我的估計，她現在應該在印度了。","明年预算的计算是基于今年的成本的。"]],["constraint","kәn'streint","n. 强制, 约束\\n[计] 约束",["There was a feeling of constraint in the room; no one dared to tell the king how foolish his decision was.","I think I've showed considerable constraint under the circumstances."],["",""]],["scratch","skrætʃ","n. 抓痕, 搔, 抓, 擦伤, 刮擦声, 乱写, 零分, 起跑线\\nvt. 搔, 抓, 挖出, 擦, 刮, 乱涂, 勾抹掉\\nvi. 搔…",["Don't scratch your mosquito bite. It'll get inflamed.","Everything around him was blown to pieces, yet he escaped without a scratch."],["",""]],["considerably","kәn'sidәrәbli","adv. 非常地, 很, 颇",["The situation has improved considerably compared with what it was.","The spread of television has considerably deprived us of our time for reading."],["",""]],["interval","'intәvәl","n. 间隔, 距离, 间歇, 间隙\\n[计] 时间间隔",["There was a long interval before he replied.","During the interval, Takashi and Harumi got a drink at the theater bar."],["他间隔了很久才作答。",""]],["commerce","'kɒmә:s","n. 商业, 商务, 贸易\\n[经] 商业, 贸易, 商务",["Osaka is the center of commerce in Japan.","We must promote commerce with neighboring countries."],["大坂是日本的商业中心。",""]],["awake","ә'weik","a. 醒着的\\nvt. 唤醒, 唤起, 使意识到\\nvi. 醒来, 被唤起, 意识到",["Tokyo, which is the largest city in Japan, is awake 24 hours.","Last night my house was robbed while I was still awake."],["東京是日本最大的城市，也是一個每天二十四小時都充滿活力的地方。","昨晚睡觉之前家里进了小偷。"]],["feminist","'feminist","n. 男女平等主义者",["If you sum up feminist counselling in a few words, I suppose it would be counselling done from a woman's standpoint.","You sure ruffled her feathers with that anti-feminist joke."],["",""]],["inevitably","in'evitәbli","adv. 不可避免地",["In addition, coincidences inevitably come in threes.","Due to his high grades, he will inevitably be accepted to the university."],["不但如此，巧合的事还会接二连三地发生。",""]],["emotionally","i'mәuʃәnәli","adv. 在情绪上",["It's not easy to cut ties with a person you are emotionally invested in.","I was emotionally drained after listening to Tom rave on about his marriage problems for two hours."],["",""]],["jurisdiction",".dʒuәris'dikʃәn","n. 司法权, 审判权, 管辖权\\n[经] 法律管辖权, 审判权",["This case raises the question whether admiralty jurisdiction extends to claims arising from agency contracts.","The judge said that the case was outside of his jurisdiction."],["",""]],["expedition",".ekspi'diʃәn","n. 远征, 探险队, 迅速",["We encountered a lot of difficulties on the expedition.","They went on an expedition to the Antarctic."],["我们在探险的时候遇到了很多困难。","他们出发去南极探险。"]],["similarity",".simi'læriti","n. 类似, 类似处\\n[法] 类似, 相似, 类似事例",["In those sentences the similarity between Russian, Slovenian, Serbian and Polish was clear.","I am not writing about myself. Any similarity is purely coincidental."],["",""]],["allegedly","ә'ledʒidli","adv. 依其申述",["A commercial airplane allegedly violated military airspace.","Most airplane accidents allegedly occur at landing or takeoff stages."],["",""]],["butt","bʌt","n. 粗大的一头, 烟头, 靶, 笑柄\\n[医] 对核",["There are two butt-naked children playing on the beach.","Mr. Goat Butt never told me there would be a partner."],["沙灘上有兩個光著屁股的小孩在玩耍。","羊屁股先生可没告诉我还有搭档。"]],["lid","lid","n. 盖子, 限制, 眼睑\\nvt. 给...盖盖子",["I just opened the lid, and a foul smell filled my nose.","This jam jar's lid is stuck and won't open."],["我刚打开锅盖，一股恶臭就扑鼻而来。","这个果酱瓶的盖子卡住了，打不开。"]],["dumb","dʌm","a. 哑的, 不说话的, 无声音的\\n[医] 哑的",["I'm so dumb... I'm trying to explain things to you that I don't understand myself.","Helen Keller was blind, deaf and dumb."],["我太愚蠢了...我竟然试着给你解释我自己都不懂的东西。","海倫凱勒眼盲，耳聾，又啞。"]],["bulk","bʌlk","n. 大小, 体积, 大块, 大多数\\nvt. 显得大, 显得重要",["Tom says he saves a lot of money by buying in bulk.","Tom said he saved a lot of money by buying in bulk."],["",""]],["philosophical",".filә'sɒfikl","a. 哲学的, 冷静的, 达观的, 哲学上的, 哲学家似的",["We should try to be philosophical about life; wealth gained could also vanish.","Everyone seems to have a bone to pick with someone, but only a few people can be philosophical about it."],["我們應該努力地豁然看待人生；獲得的財富也會煙消雲散。",""]],["mortality","mɒ:'tælәti","n. 必死的命运, 死亡数目, 死亡率\\n[医] 必死性, 死亡率",["Above the moon, everything is eternal; below, there is nothing save mortality.","People who were obese between the ages of 5 and 14.9 have three times the risk of mortality of those who have never been obese."],["",""]],["sprinkle","'spriŋkl","vt. 洒, 散置, 撒, 点缀\\nvi. 洒, 撒, 下小雨\\nn. 洒, 撒, 散置, 小雨, 少量",["As a final touch, sprinkle some chocolate chips on top of the cookies.","Sprinkle the slices of goat's cheese with chopped walnuts and pistachios."],["",""]],["conversion","kәn'vә:ʃәn","n. 转变, 转换, 改变宗教信仰, 换位法\\n[计] 转换",["Sami's conversion to Islam was a life-changing thing.","Sami had to be open about his conversion to Islam."],["薩米皈依伊斯蘭教對他的人生產生了深遠的影響。",""]],["patron","'peitrәn","n. 赞助人, 顾客, 保护人\\n[法] 保护人, 庇护人, 赞助人",["Saint Anthony of Padua is the patron saint of lost things.","The parsimonious patron spent aeons haggling with the clerk."],["",""]],["municipal","mju:'nisipl","a. 市政的, 自治区的, 内政的\\n[经] 市政的, 市的",["The municipal council all but ignored the gravity of the pollution.","The municipal council should concentrate more on specific issues."],["",""]],["liver","'livә","n. 肝脏, 生活者, 居民\\n[医] 肝",["I have a corner in my liver just for you, alcohol.","Dr Tom Jackson discovered that the drug could cause liver damage."],["我在肝裡給你留了箇地方，酒精啊。",""]],["harmony","'hɑ:mәni","n. 协调, 和睦, 调和\\n[电] 和声学",["Harmony in the family leads to success in everything.","Together, you represent the harmony between tradition and progress."],["家和万事兴。","你們共同代表著傳統與進步之間的和諧。"]],["tolerance","'tɒlәrәns","n. 宽容, 忍受, 容忍, 容许量, 公差\\n[计] 允许误差",["By reading books and discussing concepts, a person can gain wisdom and tolerance of differing ideas.","Children exhibit a low tolerance for the frustrations of learning."],["藉由讀書和討論概念, 一個人能獲得智慧並包容不同的想法。",""]],["solely","'sәulli","adv. 仅仅, 单独地",["The Party seeks power entirely for its own sake. We are not interested in the good of others; we are interested solely in power.","Victory and defeat aren't solely decided by the size of your army."],["党为自己的利益追求势力。我们对别人不体贴；我们只追求势力。","胜败不能单靠兵力多少。"]],["blessing","'blesiŋ","n. 祝福",["It is not until we lose our health that we recognise its blessing.","From the fullness of his grace we have all received one blessing after another."],["",""]],["goat","gәut","n. 山羊, 替罪羊, 色鬼",["Mr. Goat Butt never told me there would be a partner.","A shepherd drove his snow-covered goat into an abandoned cave to take shelter from the blizzard."],["羊屁股先生可没告诉我还有搭档。","一个牧羊人把他一身白雪的山羊赶进被遗弃的山洞躲避暴风雪。"]],["banana","bә'nɑ:nә","n. 香蕉",["By using this banana case, you can transport bananas without squashing them.","Time flies like an arrow; fruit flies like a banana."],["使用這個香蕉盒，可以讓您運送香蕉時不會壓扁它們。","光陰飛似箭，水果飛似蕉。"]],["palace","'pælis","n. 宫, 宫殿, 华丽大厦",["Farther from the palace and to its north and south were the commoners, merchants, artisans, and laborers.","To hide the fact that she's a princess, she disguised herself as a boy and escaped the palace."],["遠離宫殿的北方及南方是平民、商人、工藝師傅和工人。","她為了掩飾自己公主的身份，女扮男裝，逃出了皇宮。"]],["grandparent","'grændperәnt","n. 祖父母",["A third cousin is the great-granddaughter of the brother or sister of a great-grandparent.","A second cousin is the granddaughter of the brother or sister of a grandparent."],["",""]],["peasant","'peznt","n. 农夫, 乡下人",["Corn pancakes are part of traditional peasant cuisine.","Disguising himself as a peasant, he crept into the castle town."],["",""]],["cruise","kru:z","n. 巡航, 巡弋, 漫游\\nv. 巡航, 巡弋, 漫游",["The straits were too narrow for the cruise ship.","The actions of Coen, directly commanding the cruise at the time of the accident, are of utmost significance."],["这个海峡对游艇来说太窄了。",""]],["supermarket","'sju:pәmɑ:kit","n. 超级市场\\n[经] 超级市场, 自助售货商店",["My wife buys vegetables from a supermarket nearby.","The old houses were torn down to make room for a supermarket."],["我老婆在附近的超市买蔬菜。","這棟老房子被拆除了，以騰出空間給超級市場。"]],["neat","ni:t","a. 整洁的, 巧妙的, 匀称的, 简洁的\\nn. 牛",["There was a neat pile of books in the corner of the room.","Tom isn't as neat as he used to be."],["房間的角落裏整整齊齊地放著一疊書。","汤姆没有以前那么条理。"]],["formerly","'fɒ:mәli","adv. 从前, 以前",["Formerly people did not know that the earth is round and that it moves around the sun.","Formerly this building was a hospital."],["以前的人不知道地球是圓的，也不知道地球是繞著太陽轉的。","这幢楼以前是医院。"]],["lawmaker","lɒ:'meikә","n. 立法者",["Ricks, 54, is now a lawmaker in the Colorado General Assembly, elected in November 2020."],[""]],["mobile","'mәubil","a. 移动的, 易变的, 机动的\\nn. 活动物体",["Most young people have mobile phones.","Nowadays mobile phones are very popular."],["年轻人几乎都有手机。","现今手机非常普及。"]],["calendar","'kælindә","n. 日历, 日程表\\nvt. 列入表中\\n[计] 日历",["In the Spanish calendar, the week begins with Monday.","The red circle on the calendar marking the deadline causes me to fall into anxiety."],["在西班牙日历中，一周的开始是周一。","日历上画着红圈的截稿日期使我陷入了焦虑。"]],["beard","biәd","n. 胡须\\nvt. 抓住胡须, 公开反对",["It doesn't matter whether your beard has grown for four years or seven. When the barber shaves it he'll use that same blade.","Possibly because he's got a beard, he looks scary at first glance but he's really a kind man."],["不論你的鬍子長了四年還是七年, 理髮師用刀子剔的時間都是一樣的。","或许是因为他有胡子而让他乍看之下很可怕，其实他是个非常好的人。"]],["widow","'widәu","n. 寡妇, 孀妇\\nvt. 使成寡妇",["The widow mourned for her husband for a long time.","The widow mourned her husband for a long time."],["寡妇为她的丈夫哀悼了很久。","寡妇为她的丈夫哀悼了很久。"]],["deposit","di'pɒzit","n. 存款, 定金, 堆积物\\nvt. 存放, 堆积\\nvi. 沉淀",["Some people do not like to deposit their money in banks.","Sir, I would like to deposit my money. How do I do that?"],["有些人不喜欢把钱存银行。","先生，我要存钱，怎么存？"]],["brake","breik","n. 刹车, 阻碍, 丛林\\nv. 刹车",["The function of the brake is to stop the car.","The Representative said he will put a brake on spending."],["刹车的功能是使车停下。",""]],["screening","'skri:niŋ","[医] 筛选, 筛分(如普查癌、结核等病), 萤光屏检查",["Callers pass through an intensive screening before they are allowed to speak to the talk show host.","The aim of the mass screening is to identify all those who are carrying COVID-19 but show no symptoms."],["",""]],["impulse","'impʌls","n. 冲动, 驱使, 刺激, 推动, 冲力, 建议, 脉冲\\nvt. 推动",["He told his wife not to buy on impulse.","A foolish impulse made me say what I should have left unsaid."],["他叫自己的妻子不要衝動購物。",""]],["brutal","'bru:tәl","a. 残忍的, 野蛮的, 不讲理的",["\"Tom chopped up the manuscript like it was iceberg lettuce.\" \"Sounds brutal.\" \"It was, but it was also necessary.\"","The city was ruined by the brutal force of nature."],["「湯姆像切捲心萵苣一樣，把手稿切碎了。」「聽起來很殘忍。」「沒錯，而且也沒有那個必要。」",""]],["forbid","fә'bid","vt. 禁止, 不准, 妨碍\\n[法] 不许, 禁止, 阻止",["I cannot forbid a person to marry several wives, for it does not contradict Scripture.","Algerian Muslims impose the construction of mosques in the West but forbid the construction of churches in Algeria."],["我不能禁止一个人娶好几个妻子，因为这与圣经不矛盾。",""]],["predator","'predәtә","n. 食肉动物, 掠夺者\\n[医] 捕食者",["The most visible forms of aggression are often seen between prey and predator.","This invading species of mollusk has no natural predator in America."],["",""]],["fur","fә:","n. 毛皮\\nvt. 以毛皮制作, 使生苔, 使生水垢\\nvi. 生苔, 积水垢",["After washing, the cat's fur is soft and fluffy, and has a faint scent.","The plush fur of the toy felt so soft and somehow soothing."],["洗过澡后，猫咪的毛柔软又蓬松，还有淡淡的香味。","那個玩具絨毛摸起來很柔軟，讓人感到舒適。"]],["voluntary","'vɒlәntәri","a. 自动的, 自愿的, 故意的, 志愿的, 自发的\\nn. 自愿行动, 志愿者, 自由调",["She can only go to the company to do voluntary work on Sundays.","The company appealed for people to take voluntary resignation."],["她星期天也只能去公司做义务劳动了。",""]],["poke","pәuk","n. 刺, 戳, 袋子\\nvt. 戳, 捅, 拨弄, 刺\\nvi. 戳, 刺, 捅, 搜索, 伸出, 行动散慢\\n[计] 存数",["It's best if you don't poke your nose into other people's business.","Tom was afraid Mary might poke her eye out, so he told her to be careful."],["你最好不要插手别人的事务。",""]],["valid","'vælid","a. 有确实根据的, 有法律效力的, 正当的, 正确的\\n[经] 有效的",["This formula is valid for all complex numbers z with a real part greater than zero.","It's valid until March thirty-first, nineteen-ninety-seven."],["此公式對所有實部大於零的複數 z 均成立。","有效期到1997年3月31日为止。"]],["opt","ɒpt","vi. 选择",["Employees currently have the ability to opt in to receive electronic paystubs, but only 64 percent take advantage of this option.","Some parents opt for umbilical nonseverance, where the intact umbilical cord is left to dry and separate of its own accord."],["",""]],["forum","'fɒ:rәm","n. 论坛, 公开讨论的广场, 法庭, 讨论会\\n[法] 讨论会, 专题讨论, 公共论坛",["This movement is like a forum or platform from which feminists speak out on women's issues.","I saw your name and posts in an English forum and took the liberty of reading your profile."],["",""]],["soar","sɒ:","n. 高扬, 翱翔\\nvi. 往上飞舞, 高耸, 翱翔",["Don't flutter about like a hen, when you can soar to the heights of an eagle.","The wind made Adriano's kite soar high in the sky."],["",""]],["happily","'hæpili","adv. 幸福地, 快乐地, 幸好",["He had no friends, no money, no home...but he played happily all the same.","I really hope they can live happily ever after as husband and wife."],["他没有朋友，没有钱，没有房子……他照样玩得很开心。","真的希望他们做夫妻白头偕老。"]],["dancing","'dænsiŋ","n. 舞蹈\\n[建] 跳动的",["The beautiful red leaves of the maple become detached from the branches and are dancing in the wind.","There is a book on dancing on the desk."],["楓樹美麗的紅葉從枝頭飄落，在風中翩翩起舞。","桌子上有一本关于舞蹈的书。"]],["enact","i'nækt","vt. 制定法律, 扮演, 颁布\\n[法] 法令, 法规, 条例",["If it is not absolutely necessary to enact a law, it is absolutely necessary to not adopt a law.","Congress failed to enact any useful legislation during the entire session."],["",""]],["removal","ri'mu:vl","n. 移动, 移居, 迁移, 排除, 切除\\n[医] 切除, 除去",["Early removal of the placenta is very dangerous.","We carry out treatments like whitening. We also do tobacco stain removal and other cleaning procedures."],["胎盘早剥很危险。",""]],["autonomy","ɒ:'tɒnәmi","n. 自治, 自治权\\n[医] 自主性",["If I borrow the money, I feel like I'll lose my autonomy.","Scotland has been agitating for centuries to achieve greater autonomy from the British central government in London."],["",""]],["thread","θred","n. 线, 丝, 纤维, 线索\\nvt. 穿线于, 穿过, 通过, 用线穿成\\nvi. 穿过\\n[计] 线索, 线程",["My hands were shaking too much to thread the needle.","I sewed the dress with silk thread."],["我的手抖得太厉害，没法穿针了。","我用丝线缝了这条裙子。"]],["landmark","'lændmɑ:k","n. 陆标, 划时代的事, 地界标\\n[医] 界标",["A historical landmark has been restored and will reopen.","I wish to know a landmark nearby so I can find my way there."],["一座歷史地標已經修復並將重新開放。",""]],["unhappy",".ʌn'hæpi","a. 不快乐的, 不幸的, 不适当的",["What are you unhappy about? Let it out and let everyone cheer you up a bit.","If you laugh a great deal, you are happy; if you cry a great deal, you are unhappy."],["你有什麼不開心的事? 說出來讓大家開心一下。","如果你笑了很多，你很开心；如果你哭了很多，你不开心。"]],["privately","","adv. 秘密地；私下地",["He contrived a means of speaking to Nancy privately.","I'd like to talk with you privately."],["他用了一些手段来和Nancy私下交谈。","我想跟你私下說話。"]],["fraction","'frækʃәn","n. 小部分, 破片, 分数\\n[医] 部分, 成分, 分散",["The airport tax constitutes a substantial fraction of the price of the ticket.","They winked at each other in a fraction of a second."],["",""]],["coming","'kʌmiŋ","n. 来临\\na. 就要来的, 接着的",["He observed that we should probably have rain coming.","I've been coming to work one train earlier lately."],["他說很可能會下雨。","我已經搭了最近比較早一點的火車來上班。"]],["tourism","'tuәrizm","n. 观光业, 游览\\n[经] 旅游业",["But with the threat of a coronavirus epidemic, things might not look so sunny for Florida tourism.","This famous mountain climber is a critic of mass tourism."],["但隨著新冠病毒疫情的威脅，佛羅裡達州的旅遊業前景可能並不樂觀。","這位著名的登山家批評大眾旅遊。"]],["offender","ә'fendә","n. 罪犯, 无礼的人, 得罪人的人",["Such conduct would subject the offender to a heavy penalty.","As of now, we unfortunately don't know anything about the offender."],["",""]],["distinctive","di'stiŋktiv","a. 有特色的, 出众的",["With its distinctive Chinese features, the qipao enjoys growing popularity in the international world of high fashion.","The tamborim lends a very slightly uneven and highly distinctive 16th note groove to samba music."],["旗袍因有与众不同的特点而在国际时尚界享有与日俱增的名望。",""]],["threshold","'θreʃәuld","n. 门槛, 入口, 开端, 阈\\n[计] 阈; 阈值",["When the input exceeds a certain threshold, an output signal is instantaneously released.","In a few seconds I would have overcome the desperation threshold."],["",""]],["suite","swi:t","n. 随员, 套房, (一)组, (一)套, 组曲, 继之而来的事\\n[电] 程序组",["Tom rented a suite in one of Boston's most expensive hotels.","This suite is three times larger than my condominium."],["",""]],["routinely","","adv. 日常, 乏味, 常规, 例行",["Hospitals routinely sterilize their equipment for safety.","We need to change an Internet where women are routinely harassed and threatened when they go online."],["",""]],["regulator","'regjuleitә","n. 调整者, 校准者, 校准器, 调整器, 标准钟\\n[化] 调节剂; 调节器",["The case was referred to the media regulator.","Britain's fertility regulator has granted its first license for the genetic modification of human embryos for research into the causes of infertility and miscarriages."],["",""]],["straw","strɒ:","n. 稻草, 麦管, 吸管, 一文不值的东西, 草帽\\na. 稻草的, 稻草色的, 琐碎的, 无价值的",["In early days pioneers lived in houses made of mud and straw.","They filled them with straw to make them round and hard."],["",""]],["theological","θiә'lɔdʒikәl","a. 神学上的",["Supersessionism is the theological belief that Christianity has replaced Judaism, rendering it obsolete and taking its place.","The Jewish Theological Seminary in New York City ordains Conservative rabbis."],["",""]],["fragile","'frædʒail","a. 易碎的, 脆的\\n[医] 脆弱的, 脆的",["He stomped on the fragile box, destroying its contents.","All of the longing and wishes for good fortune are wrapped up in the fragile skin of the dumplings."],["他踐踏那箱易碎品，毀壞了裡面的物品。","所有的思念与祝福都包进了那薄薄的饺子皮里。"]],["exhaust","ig'zɒ:st","n. 排气, 排气装置, 废气\\nvt. 抽完, 用尽, 耗尽, 使精疲力尽\\nvi. 排气",["Car exhaust causes serious pollution in towns.","The air was polluted by exhaust gas."],["汽车尾气在城镇里造成了严重的污染。","空氣被廢氣污染了。"]],["globe","glәub","n. 球, 球状物, 地球仪, 天体\\nv. (使)成球状",["In geography class, the teacher showed a globe to the students.","The equator divides the globe into two hemispheres."],["地理課上，老師向同學們展示了地球儀。","赤道把地球分为两个半球。"]],["chemistry","'kemistri","n. 化学, 化学过程\\n[化] 化学",["Sami has to go to his chemistry class and he will see you in Arabic.","This is a chemistry laboratory in an ordinary secondary school."],["萨米得去上他的化学课，他会用阿拉伯语和你会面。","这里是普通中学的化学实验室。"]],["objection","әb'dʒekʃәn","n. 异议, 反对, 不喜欢, 缺点, 缺陷, 妨碍, 拒绝之理由\\n[法] 异议, 反对, 抗议",["I have no objection to paying a special fee if it is necessary.","If necessary, I have no objection to paying a special fee."],["如果必要的话，我不反对付特别费用。","如果必要的话，我不反对付特别费用。"]],["crowded","'kraudid","a. 拥挤的, 塞满的",["The train was so crowded that I had to stand all the way.","The train was so crowded that none of us could get a seat."],["這班火車如此的擁擠以至於我整個車程都必須站著。","火車擠得要命，我們都找不到位子坐。"]],["blast","blæst","n. 一阵风, 爆炸, 枯萎病\\nvt. 炸, 使枯萎\\nvi. 炸, 猛攻, 猛烈抨击, 枯萎",["An icy blast of wind chilled me to the bone.","News of the recent blast is all over the radio."],["冰冷的疾風吹到我骨子裡去了。","收音機廣播充斥著有關最近爆炸的新聞。"]],["prevail","pri'veil","vi. 获胜, 流行, 盛行\\n[医] 流行, 盛行",["In Colombia, Catholic customs prevail.","The anthropologist says old customs still prevail in the province."],["在哥伦比亚，天主教习俗盛行。",""]],["overnight","'әuvәnait","n. 前一天晚上, 一夜的逗留\\na. 通宵的, 晚上的, 前夜的\\nadv. 在前一夜, 整夜, 昨晚一晚上",["Most of today's books seem to have emerged overnight from yesterday's books.","English cannot be mastered overnight."],["如今的大多数书似乎是一夜之间从昨日的书籍中冒出来。","英語不是一朝一夕就能學會的。"]],["denial","di'naiәl","n. 否认\\n[法] 否定, 否认, 拒绝接受",["In its more extreme variants, cis ideology can include denial of the empirical reality of intersex and transgender people.","She's in total denial about her husband's philandering."],["在更極端的變體中，順性別意識形態可能包括否認陰陽人和跨性別者的現實經歷。",""]],["fragment","'frægmәnt","n. 碎片, 破片, 片段\\n[计] 段落; 片段; 分段",["No man is an island, something complete in itself. Every man is a fragment of the continent, one part of the whole.","A real man only goes to the doctor when a spear fragment in his back begins to disturb his sleep."],["",""]],["headache","'hedeik","n. 头痛, 令人头痛之事\\n[医] 头痛",["I've had a headache for three days and I can't get rid of it.","Correct, one has a stomachache, the other has a headache."],["我已经头疼三天了，还没摆脱它。","对，一个人肚子疼，另一个人头疼。"]],["rental","'rentl","n. 租费, 租金收入\\na. 租赁的, 收取租金的",["The car rental agency provided excellent customer service.","The rental should be somewhat close to where I work."],["這家汽車租賃公司提供了優質的客服業務。","租的房屋要离我工作地方近一点。"]],["fantastic","fæn'tæstik","a. 奇妙的, 稀奇的, 空想的",["Although he is not a singer, his singing voice is fantastic.","In order to give him a surprise on his birthday, I prepared a fantastic cake."],["他虽然不是歌手，但他唱的非常优美。","為了給他生日驚喜，我準備了一個非常棒的蛋糕。"]],["warmth","wɒ:mθ","n. 温暖, 温情, 暖和, 激动, 生气",["He was bathed in the warmth of the kind light.","The fire burned brightly, giving forth a comforting warmth."],["亲切的灯光让他的身上充满了温暖的感觉。",""]],["screw","skru:","n. 螺旋, 螺杆, 螺钉, 螺旋桨, 吝啬鬼\\nvt. 调节, 扭紧, 旋, 拧, 加强, 压榨, 勒索\\nvi. 转动, 旋, 拧",["Now all you have to do is tighten the screw, and Bob's your uncle.","He drilled a hole in the wall, pushed a Rawlplug into it, screwed in a screw, and hung on the screw a picture of the Alps."],["現在你只要擰緊螺絲，就大功告成了。","他在牆上鑽了個洞，把膨脹螺栓塞進去，擰上一顆螺絲，然後在螺絲上掛了一幅阿爾卑斯山的畫。"]],["undergraduate",".ʌndә'grædjuit","n. 大学本科生, 大学肄业生\\na. 大学生的",["Undergraduate students should speak out for justice.","Tom teaches an undergraduate course in translation."],["",""]],["policeman","pә'li:smәn","n. 警察\\n[化] 淀帚",["The policeman told me that the last bus leaves at ten.","It seems that the policeman in this TV series is a dirty cop who abuses his authority."],["警察告诉我巴士的末班车在十点出发。","這套電視劇裏的驚察似乎是個濫用職權的壞蛋。"]],["projection","prә'dʒekʃәn","n. 发射, 计划, 突出部分, 设计, 推测\\n[计] 投影",["Astral projection augmented by sophisticated instrumentation became utilized for exploration of distant parts of the universe.","This is just a projection of what I think of myself."],["",""]],["suitable","'sju:tәbl","a. 适当的, 相配的\\n[法] 合适的, 适宜的, 适当的",["Her acute observation skills make her a very suitable photographer.","These scissors are suitable for left and right-handed people."],["她因为敏锐的观察力，很适合当一名摄影师。","這把剪刀左右撇子都適用。"]],["graduation",".grædʒu'eiʃәn","n. 毕业, 得学位, 分划, 刻度, 分等级\\n[医] 刻度, 分度, 毕业",["The graduation from elementary school to middle school is regarded by some as the first step towards adulthood.","In our time, there were many students who passed the graduation exam without studying."],["有些人認為從小學升到中學是踏入成年的第一步。","我那個年代的學生大多不讀書，但考試卻不會不合格。"]],["drill","dril","n. 钻孔机, 钻子, 播种机, 粗斜纹布\\nv. 训练, 钻孔",["Japanese education is sometimes said to employ the drill and kill method.","The singing of the local birds is akin to the sound of a drill."],["",""]],["mansion","'mænʃәn","n. 大厦, 宅邸",["The mansion was so cheap because it was known to be haunted.","Compared to our house, yours is a mansion."],["那別墅因為聽說鬧鬼所以很便宜。","跟我们的房子比，你的就是个豪宅。"]],["cruel","'kru:әl","a. 残酷的, 令人极痛苦的\\n[法] 残忍的, 残酷的",["When it comes to animals, this can't be considered as being something cruel.","I never thought he was capable of doing something so cruel."],["对动物来说这不是什么残酷的事情。","我从来没想到他能做到那么残忍的事。"]],["sexuality",".sekʃu'æliti","n. 性征, 性行为, 性欲\\n[医] 性别, 性欲",["Our talk about the sexuality of flies could offend some people.","The practice of tisese allows Mosuo women to avoid the double standard that regulates women's sexuality in other cultures."],["",""]],["grape","greip","n. 葡萄, 葡萄树\\n[医] 葡萄",["They also use onion skins, apple, grape and mulberry leaves to create different shades of yellow.","\"This is wine from our own grape,\" explained Tom, filling a glass from the wood."],["",""]],["cottage","'kɒtidʒ","n. 小屋, 茅舍",["The old cottage had only one bed, so we all took turns sleeping in it.","Cottage cheese and canned peaches are a delicious combination."],["那間舊屋裏只有一張床，所以我們便輪流睡覺。","乾酪加桃子罐頭是美味的搭配。"]],["authorize","'ɒ:θәraiz","vt. 授权, 批准, 委托\\n[经] 授权, 委任, 认可",["We authorize the workers to take company cars home.","You authorize your workers to smoke in the office."],["",""]],["canyon","'kænjәn","n. 峡谷, 海底悬崖",["The Grand Canyon is one of the most popular places in the USA.","The Grand Canyon at sunrise was the most impressive sight that I had ever seen."],["",""]],["charm","tʃɑ:m","n. 吸引力, 魔力, 符咒\\nvt. 迷住, 使陶醉, 行魔法\\nvi. 用符咒, 有魅力",["The old cottage has a certain charm about it.","The charm of Kyoto consists of the beauty of its old temples."],["舊村屋有它自己一定的魅力。",""]],["driveway","'draivwei","n. 车道",["I was wasting time, wandering around the garage, when an old truck swept into driveway.","She managed to back up through the narrow driveway."],["",""]],["loyal","'lɒiәl","a. 忠诚的, 忠实的, 忠贞的",["Pop artists thrive on the adulation of their loyal fans.","My wife is not only the most beautiful woman I've ever met, she's also the most loyal and hardworking."],["",""]],["clay","klei","n. 泥土, 肉体, 黏土\\n[化] 粘土",["Now, just let the clay slide between your fingers.","Clay is the essential ingredient in making pottery."],["",""]],["invention","in'venʃәn","n. 发明, 创作能力, 虚构的故事\\n[经] 发明",["This invention was the result of years of patient experiment.","The result of the invention of the steam engine was that human power was replaced by mechanical power."],["這發明是多年來耐心實驗的成果。","机械力代替人力, 这是蒸汽机发明的结果。"]],["balloon","bә'lu:n","n. 气球\\nvt. 使成气球状\\nvi. 膨胀如气球, 激增",["The balloon was caught in the tree.","The balloon descended gradually as the air came out."],["這顆氣球被樹絆住了。",""]],["ego","'egәu. 'i:gәu","n. 自我\\n[医] 自我",["It would never occur to Tom to keep a confidence if he thought that revealing it might assuage his soap bubble of an ego.","I regard Vivi as the most amazing person I've met, even though I know that inflates her ego."],["",""]],["fare","fєә","n. 费用, 旅客, 食物\\nvi. 进展, 进步, 经营, 过活",["The railroad fare for children is half of the adult fare.","What is the fare from Osaka to Akita?"],["","从大阪到秋田的车费是多少？"]],["availability","ә.veilә'biliti","n. 有效性, 可利用性, 可利用的人\\n[计] 有效性; 可用性",["Availability may vary by region and device compatibility.","Whether he has the operation depends upon the availability of the organ."],["實際提供內容可能因地區與裝置相容性而異。",""]],["homework","'hәumwә:k","n. 家庭作业, 家里做的工作\\n[经] 家庭作业",["My elder brother finished his homework very quickly.","I am tired; nevertheless, I must finish my homework."],["我哥哥很快就把功課做完了。","我很累, 然而, 我必須完成我的回家作業。"]],["disc","disk","n. 圆盘, 唱片\\nvt. 灌唱片",["To continue, please insert the disc labelled Disc 2.","Don't you want to put in another disc? We've been listening to this one for two hours."],["",""]],["radar","'reidә","n. 雷达, 无线电探测器\\n[计] 雷达图",["If he didn't order this investigation, she could have flown under the radar for years.","The ship is not equipped with radar."],["要是他沒有下令做這個調查她本可以瞞天過海好多年。","这艘船没有雷达装备。"]],["prince","prins","n. 王子, 亲王, 国君, 贵族, 诸侯, 有权势的大人物",["The prince fell in love with a woodcutter's daughter.","Prince William is second in line to the English throne."],["王子愛上了一個樵夫的女兒。","威廉王子是英国王位第二顺位继承人。"]],["sofa","'sәufә","n. 沙发",["Mary, you've come at just the right time! Help me carry this sofa downstairs.","I don't want to buy this kind of sofa."],["瑪麗，你來得正是時候！來幫我把這張沙發搬到樓下！","我不想买这样的沙发。"]],["regain","ri'gein","vt. 取回, 恢复, 重回, 复得\\n[化] 回潮",["Eating properly will help you regain your strength.","Tom never did regain his memory after the accident."],["",""]],["frown","fraun","n. 皱眉\\nvi. 皱眉头\\nvt. 皱眉表示",["He whispered something in her ear which made her frown.","I've wondered for a long time why Tom would always stare at me with a frown on his face."],["",""]],["molecule","'mɒlikju:l","n. 分子, 些微\\n[化] 分子",["A water molecule has two hydrogen atoms and one oxygen atom.","An ion is an atom or molecule with a net electric charge."],["一個水分子是由兩個氫原子和一個氧原子組成的。",""]],["retreat","ri'tri:t","n. 休息寓所, 撤退, 隐居, 退避\\nvi. 撤退, 隐退, 向后倾\\nvt. 退(棋)",["I was uncertain whether to advance or to retreat.","They had no alternative but to retreat."],["我不确定该前进还是后退。","他们不得不后撤。"]],["sweater","'swetә","n. 毛衣, 毛线衫, 运动衫, 出汗者\\n[化] 发汗器",["Take a sweater with you so you don't catch a cold.","You'd better wear a sweater under your jacket."],["为了不感冒，请带上这件毛衣。","您最好在外衣里穿一件套衫。"]],["favorable","'feivәrәbl","a. 有利的, 赞许的, 良好的",["Thanks to the favorable wind, we soon reached the island.","Circumstances are entirely favorable to us."],["多虧了順風，我們很快就到了那個小島。","环境完全对我们有利。"]],["rubber","'rʌbә","n. 橡皮, 橡胶, 做摩擦动作的人, 按摩师, 决胜盘\\nvt. 用橡胶制造, 涂橡胶于",["Sorry, I won't do it without a rubber.","Rubber is not hard: it gives way to pressure."],["對不起，但是如果不用避孕套的話我不做。","橡皮不硬：它在压力下会变形。"]],["freely","'fri:li","adv. 自由地, 随意地, 无拘束地, 直率地, 坦白地, 慷慨地, 免费地, 大量地\\n[计] 浮动地",["The advantage of freelancing is that you can divide your time freely. The disadvantage is that you actually have to work around the clock.","We created a freely available English-Japanese bilingual corpus."],["自由职业的优点是，人们可以自由的分配他们的工作时间。它的缺点是，人们实际上必须24小时不间断的工作。",""]],["rehabilitation","'ri:(h)ә,bili'teiʃәn","n. 复原\\n[医] 复原, 恢复, 康复",["He came to take a walk every morning after rehabilitation.","I think that, as he's using addictive substances like thinner, the chance of rehabilitation is low."],["",""]],["steadily","'stedili","adv. 稳定地, 无变化地, 有规则地",["The badger travels steadily, with its body very low and close to the ground; the marmot, especially when excited, gallops along, with undulatory movements of the body.","The patient is steadily recovering."],["獾行進時步伐穩定，身體壓得很低、貼近地面；旱獺則尤其在興奮時會疾奔，身體呈波浪狀起伏擺動。","该病人正逐步康复。"]],["youngster","'jʌŋstә","n. 小孩, 年轻人, 少年\\n[法] 儿童, 少年, 青年",["The youngster nervously drummed his fingers on the table.","As a youngster, I vaguely remember going to a zoo in Metro Manila."],["",""]],["ha","hɑ:","interj. 嘿, 哈, 哈哈",["Ha - this work's finished! Let's move on to the next stage!","Ha ha, I just dreamt that I won five million RMB."],["这个工作完成了!我们进入下一步吧!","哈哈，我刚才做了一个梦，梦见我中了五百万。"]],["accountability","ә.kauntә'biliti","n. 负有责任, 可说明性\\n[化] 衡算计量",["I take accountability for my mistake.","The accountability of the management of the organization is held in question."],["我来承担失败的责任。",""]],["integrated","'intәgreitid","a. 综合的, 完整的, 互相协调的\\n[法] 成为整体的, 综合的, 统筹的",["Bear in mind that that school is an integrated junior high and high school.","This factory uses an integrated manufacturing system standardized from parts on through to finished products."],["",""]],["premium","'pri:miәm","n. 额外补贴, 奖金, 奖赏, 保险费\\n[医] 保险费",["I want the premium features of this app, but I don't want to pay for them.","Imogen of the Internet is fighting six bored housewives to win an eBay auction for a bag of premium chai tea."],["",""]],["contemplate","'kɒntempleit","vt. 注视, 沉思, 盘算\\nvi. 冥思苦想",["Tom and Mary contemplate the world through the distorting glasses of the media.","Hamlet is a person more prone to contemplate than to act."],["",""]],["update","ʌp'deit","vt. 更新, 使现代化\\nn. 更新\\n[计] 更新",["This update will be released at 10 o'clock this morning.","My PC is in the middle of an update."],["这个更新会在今天上午10点发布。","我的電腦正在更新。"]],["overwhelm",".әuvә'hwelm","vt. 淹没, 受打击, 制服, 压倒, 使不知所措\\n[法] 打翻, 倾覆, 覆盖",["France couldn't overwhelm Algerian independence fighters with its firepower.","Public health experts say they fear the variant could overwhelm Zimbabwe's collapsed health care system."],["",""]],["spark","spɑ:k","n. 火花, 火星, 闪光, 无线电报务员, 瞬间放电, 活力, 朝气, 花花公子, 情郎\\nvi. 闪光, 发火花, 求婚\\nvt. 发…",["The spark plugs aren't the problem.","A spark caused the gunpowder to explode."],["火花塞不是问题所在。","一点火花让火药爆炸。"]],["fatigue","fә'ti:g","n. 疲乏, 疲劳\\nvt. 使疲劳, 使心智衰弱\\nvi. 疲劳\\na. 疲劳的",["What with fatigue and lack of sleep, he has fallen ill at last.","He fainted with hunger and fatigue, but came to after a while."],["他疲勞過度，又睡眠不足，最後便病倒了。",""]],["ironically","","adv. 冷嘲地, 挖苦地, 讽刺地, 令人啼笑皆非地",["Ironically it is war that has brought a great many useful inventions into being.","There are certain expressions which are now only used ironically."],["",""]],["speculate","'spekjuleit","vi. 深思, 推测, 投机\\n[经] 投机",["As to what happened there, one can only speculate.","The filmmakers can only speculate why McQueen, who struggled with drug addiction, took his life."],["",""]],["marker","'mɑ:kә","n. 作记号的人, 记分员, 书签, 纪念碑, 里程碑, 标识物, 标记\\n[计] 标记",["With a thick marker, he drew a yawning little figure.","Marker started working with local farming communities to find ways to protect their livestock from the big cats."],["",""]],["bucket","'bʌkit","n. 桶\\n[计] 存储桶; 桶",["No matter how much you hurry your effort is just a drop in the bucket.","Well, I can cross that off my bucket list."],["就算你多焦急，也不能幫上甚麼忙。","太好了，死前心愿又完成了一样。"]],["meantime","'mi:ntaim","n. 间隔时间, 其时\\nadv. 其间",["He'll be back in two hours. In the meantime, let's prepare dinner.","She was busy knitting. In the meantime, he was taking a nap by the fire."],["",""]],["preach","pri:tʃ","v. 传道, 讲道, 说教, 宣讲, 鼓吹\\nn. 说教, 布道",["The main duty of a priest is to preach in church.","Admirable! Don't preach although you know a lot better."],["牧師的主要職責是在教堂裏講道。",""]],["substantially","sәb'stænʃәli","adv. 实质上, 本质上, 大体上",["The stability of Chinese economy is substantially overestimated.","Laggy systems are, however, not simply annoying but substantially reduce user productivity."],["",""]],["blond","blɒnd","a. 金发的\\nn. 白肤碧眼金发的人",["Sami's mother was bleaching his hair blond to match hers.","Sami followed the blond-haired woman out of the store."],["",""]],["confession","kәn'feʃәn","n. 承认, 坦白, 招供\\n[法] 自白, 招供, 自认有罪",["In the past, people went to church for confession. Nowadays they write on Facebook.","Having heard his love confession, the girl blushed."],["",""]],["marble","'mɑ:bl","n. 大理石, 石弹, 雕刻品\\na. 大理石的, 冷酷无情的, 有大理石花纹的",["Thousands of laborers and craftsmen toiled for 22 years to craft the stunning white marble edifice.","Thousands of workers and artisans toiled for 22 years to create this breathtaking white marble structure."],["數千名工人和工匠辛勤工作了 22 年，才打造出這座令人驚嘆的白色大理石建築。","數千名工人和工匠辛勤工作了 22 年，才打造出這座令人驚嘆的白色大理石建築。"]],["defender","di'fendә","n. 防卫者, 防护者, 辩护者\\n[法] 辩护人, 保护人",["The defender talked about his impressions after the match.","If you don't find an attorney we will order a public defender for you."],["",""]],["provoke","prә'vәuk","vt. 激怒, 惹起, 诱导\\n[法] 刺激, 煽动, 激怒",["A peal of defiant laughter rang out from Tom intending to provoke John, who stood before him.","A facet of genius is the ability to provoke scandals."],["",""]],["trauma","'trɒ:mә","n. 外伤, 损伤\\n[医] 创伤, 外伤",["The trauma was too much for him, and suddenly, he snapped.","Sami's body had no outward sign of visible trauma."],["",""]],["surveillance","sә:'veilәns","n. 监视, 监督\\n[电] 侦测",["He paid the prostitute the fee without being aware of the surveillance camera.","Tom didn't notice the surveillance camera."],["他在不知有監控錄像的情況下支付了妓女服務費用。","汤姆没有注意到监控摄像头。"]],["explicit","ik'splisit","a. 详述的, 清楚的, 直言的",["I gave you explicit instructions not to touch anything.","The following scene contains language of explicit nature."],["",""]],["disturbing","dis'tә:biŋ","a. 引起烦恼的, 令人不安的",["It's really disturbing not to have Wi-Fi in the mountains.","I hope that I'm not disturbing you."],["山中沒有Wi-Fi，真的是很麻煩！","我希望没打扰到你吧？"]],["depart","di'pɑ:t","vi. 离开, 出发, 背离, 违反, 去世",["The next train arriving at platform 2 will depart for Shibuya at 4:35pm.","What time does the train for New York depart?"],["下一班火車將在第二月台, 於下午四點三十五分前往澀谷。","去纽约的火车几点出发？"]],["magnetic","mæg'netik","a. 有磁性的, 有吸引力的, 催眠术的\\n[医] 磁[性]的",["I sit in front of a computer screen all day, so I get pretty heavily bombarded by electro-magnetic waves.","The magnets, of course, have a magnetic field around them."],["",""]],["technician","tek'niʃәn","n. 技师\\n[化] 技师",["Consult the dealer or an experienced radio or television technician for help.","The forensic technician found gunshot residue on the victim's hand."],["",""]],["arrow","'ærәu","n. 箭, 箭状物, 箭头记号",["Time flies like an arrow, and fruit flies like bananas.","Time flies like an arrow; fruit flies like a banana."],["光陰飛似箭，水果飛似蕉。","光陰飛似箭，水果飛似蕉。"]],["neighboring","'neibәriŋ","a. 附近的, 邻近的, 邻接的",["This country considers every neighboring country as a threat.","Cultural exchange programs can strengthen friendly relations between neighboring countries."],["此國將周邊諸國都視作威脅。","文化交流計畫可以加強鄰國之間的友好關係。"]],["devastating","'devәsteitiŋ","a. 毁灭性的, (非正式)很好的, 引人注目的",["A devastating earthquake hit the state capital.","They confirmed the importance of strengthening global precautions in order to prevent devastating losses."],["一場毀滅性的地震襲擊了這個州的首府。",""]],["soak","sәuk","n. 浸, 湿透, 大雨\\nvt. 使上下湿透, 浸, 吸入, 吸收, 浸洗掉\\nvi. 浸泡, 渗透",["You have tennis elbow. Soak your arm in warm water.","Trees soak up and store some of the excess planet-warming carbon dioxide that human activities produce."],["",""]],["transmit","træns'mit","vt. 传输, 传染, 传达, 遗传, 发射, 传播\\nvi. 发射信号, 留传下来\\n[计] 传送",["Flashing lights transmit messages between ships and to motorists along city streets.","We have to transmit our culture to the next generation."],["",""]],["mutter","'mʌtә","n. 喃喃低语\\nvi. 喃喃自语, 作低沉声\\nvt. 出怨言, 抱怨地说",["Don't mutter to yourself under your breath, but speak clearly and distinctly.","For he hath heard your murmuring against the Lord: but as for us, what are we, that you mutter against us?"],["",""]],["ribbon","'ribәn","n. 缎带, 色带, 带状物\\nvt. 用丝带装饰, 把...撕成条状\\nvi. 形成带状\\n[计] 带状条, 格式栏",["The cat had a ribbon around its neck.","The girl wore a yellow ribbon in her hair."],["小貓的脖子上繫著一條絲帶。","那女孩的头发上绑了一根黄丝带。"]],["harvest","'hɑ:vist","n. 收获, 成果, 收获物, 收获期\\nv. 收割, 收获",["This year promises a good harvest of rice.","We're expecting a good harvest this year."],["預期今年稻米會豐收。","我們期望今年豐收。"]],["slot","slɒt","n. 水沟, 细长孔, 硬币投币口, 缝, 狭槽, 狭通道, 位置, 一档(广播节目等)\\nvt. 开槽于, 把...纳入机构\\n[计] …",["Please give us a 20-30 min. time slot for our presentation.","The first thing you hear when arriving in Vegas is the ching ching ching of the slot machines."],["",""]],["consecutive","kәn'sekjutiv","a. 连续的, 联贯的\\n[计] 连续的; 连接的",["It snowed for ten consecutive days.","The coach urged his team not to be complacent following their four consecutive wins."],["一連下了十天雪。",""]],["spy","spai","n. 间谍, 侦探, 侦察\\nvt. 侦察, 找出, 发现\\nvi. 做密探, 侦查",["It occurred to me that he might be an industrial spy.","He believes there is a spy among us."],["我突然想到他可能是個商業間諜。","他相信我们中间有间谍。"]],["coordinate","kәu'ɒ:dineit","n. 同等的人(或物), 坐标\\na. 同等的, 并列的\\nv. (使)协调",["I'll liaise with the marketing team to coordinate the launch.","A polar bear is a rectangular bear after a coordinate transform."],["",""]],["daddy","'dædi","n. 爸爸",["Daddy was in his office, under our flat.","Daddy, let's make faces at each other and see who can keep from laughing the longest."],["爸爸在他的办公室里，在我们公寓楼下。",""]],["riot","'raiәt","n. 暴动, 喧闹, 放纵\\nvi. 发动, 暴动, 纵情, 放荡\\nvt. 浪费, 挥霍",["There was only one warden on duty when the riot started.","Troops were swiftly called in to put down the riot."],["暴動開始時只有一位監獄長值班。",""]],["nutrient","'nju:triәnt","a. 营养的, 滋养的\\nn. 营养物, 滋养物",["The Mississippi River carries millions of tons of nutrient-rich sediment into the Gulf each year.","Eating a large amount of sashimi will demonstrate the satiety effect of nutrient-dense food. The eater will quickly become full."],["",""]],["severely","si'viәli","adv. 严格, 尖锐, 严肃, 严重, 严厉, 朴素",["The principal severely reproved the students whenever they made a mess in the hallway.","The teacher severely reprimanded his pupils."],["每次学生把走廊弄得一团糟的时候，校长都会严厉地训斥他们。","老師把學生狠狠地罵了一頓。"]],["citizenship","'sitizәnʃip","n. 国籍, 市民权, 市民的身份\\n[法] 公民权, 公民资格, 公民身分",["The true purpose of education is to prepare young men and women for effective citizenship in a free form of government.","Under the reign of tyranny, innocent people were deprived of their citizenship."],["",""]],["sovereignty","'sɒvrәnti","n. 主权, 独立国\\n[法] 主权, 主权国家, 统治权",["China is an advocate for the Diaoyu Islands' sovereignty.","We need to defend Taiwan's sovereignty."],["中国主张钓鱼岛的主权。","我們需要保衛台灣的主權。"]],["ridge","ridʒ","n. 脊, 山脊, 山脉\\n[医] 嵴, 脊, 棱线",["A large rock which had been dislodged from the ridge upon our right clattered down and roared into the lake behind us.","In an instant Holmes raced up on to the ridge, and, standing upon a lofty pinnacle, craned his neck in every direction."],["",""]],["brave","breiv","a. 勇敢的, 美好的, 华丽的\\nn. 勇敢者\\nvt. 勇敢地面对",["John is brave in appearance, but is in reality a coward.","Some brave passengers caught the pickpocket and turned him over to the police."],["約翰看起來很勇敢，但其實是個膽小鬼。","幾位見義勇為的乘客把小偷抓住了，還把他送到了警方的手中。"]],["lighting","'laitiŋ","n. 照明, 照明设备, 舞台灯光",["Is this community safe? Are there lighting installations for the night?","Nearly all siheyuans had their main buildings and gates facing south for better lighting, so a majority of hutongs run from east to west."],["小区安全吗？夜晚有照明设施吗？","因为几乎所有的四合院有南面的门和主要楼房，所以大部分的胡同是从东到西建造的。"]],["frustrate","'frʌstreit","vt. 挫败, 击败, 破坏\\na. 无益的, 挫败的, 挫折的",["There's a possibility that the delay will frustrate Tom.","I'm aware that the delay will frustrate some people."],["",""]],["contributor","kәn'tribjutә","n. 贡献者, 捐助者, 赠送者, 投稿者\\n[法] 捐助人, 捐赠人, 投搞人",["A good Tatoeba contributor adopts orphaned sentences so the rest of us can focus on Christopher Columbus and his zany antics.","Urban sprawl is said to be a major contributor to global warming."],["",""]],["importantly","","adv. 重要地；大量地；有名望地；自命不凡地",["The rules must be few and, more importantly, simple.","She's beautiful, smart, and - most importantly - has a good heart."],["规则要少，并且最重要的是要简单。","她很漂亮，聪明，并且最重要的是，她有一颗善良的心。"]],["transit","'trænsit","n. 经过, 通行, 运输, 运输线, 转变\\nvt. 运送, 使通过, 经过\\nvi. 通过",["The electrical appliance must have been damaged in transit.","I'm in transit between flights now. I've spent 8 hours on a plane so far, after changing planes now it's another two hours."],["",""]],["specify","'spesifai","vt. 详列, 指定, 说明\\n[计] 指定",["Please specify any conditions you have for the use of this information.","When using this information, I will follow any conditions you specify, whether that's anonymity or giving detailed reference."],["如果您有关于这份问卷信息的使用条件，请在这里指定。","在使用这份问卷的信息时，我会遵照您提出的条件，不留您的姓名或者关于您的任何详细信息。"]],["unidentified",".ʌnai'dentifaid","a. 未被认出的, 未经确认的",["UFO stands for unidentified flying object.","Unidentified agents of Emperor Trump are going around kidnapping protesters off the street."],["UFO代表不明飛行物體。",""]],["seminar","'seminɑ:","n. 研究班, 专题讨论会\\n[经] 讨论会, 专家讨论会",["Pretty good. Did you go to today's history seminar?","Please forward this message along with the seminar information to the appropriate managers in your firm."],["非常好。你去了今天的歷史研討會嗎？",""]],["electronics",".ilek'trɒniks","n. 电子学\\n[计] 电子学",["Among the manufacturers of so-called consumer electronics, there's ruthless, cut-throat competition.","There have been several new developments in electronics."],["",""]],["dense","dens","a. 密集的, 浓厚的",["The mist was so dense that I could not see even an inch ahead.","Because of the dense haze, the road was hard to see."],["",""]],["articulate","ɑ:'tikjulit","a. 发音清晰的, 口才好的\\nvt. 明白地说, 以关节连接, 使成为系统的整体",["Sometimes he has difficulty being articulate about his views.","Only a handful of activists in our union are articulate."],["他有时候会难以清楚地表达他的意见。",""]],["sunny","'sʌni","a. 阳光充足的, 乐观的, 快乐的, 像太阳的",["It's hard to believe that it has been clear and sunny until now.","It was raining when we left, but by the time we arrived, it was sunny."],["天气到现在竟然依旧很好。","我们走的时候下着雨，到的时候有太阳。"]],["swell","swel","n. 增大, 隆起的部分, 巨浪, 肿胀\\na. 优秀的, 一流的\\nvi. 增大, 膨胀, 肿胀, 增强, 骄傲\\nvt. 使膨胀, 使…",["\"Everything's well, everything's swell,\" he told me with a sing-song voice, and I had no choice but to believe him.","In addition to a thick fog, there was a heavy swell."],["",""]],["shorts","ʃɔ:ts","n. 短裤, (美)男人的短衬裤\\n[经] 空头户, 空头, 短期债券",["Khaki shorts with cargo pockets do not make you an adventurer.","I go to P.E. class just so I can watch sweaty boys running around in shorts."],["單有卡其褲，還成不了冒險家。",""]],["soften","'sɒftn","v. (使)变柔软, (使)变柔和",["What can cheer up, soften, color everything - a big love.","You can soften dialysis tubing by soaking it in water."],["",""]],["accusation","ækju:'zeiʃәn","n. 控告, 指控, 指责\\n[法] 控告, 起诉, 告发",["Recently, not only tabloid journalists have to put up with the accusation of mob journalism.","The accusation was, without a doubt, absolutely ungrounded."],["",""]],["bride","braid","n. 新娘",["According to custom, the bride should be compliant.","There's a photo of the bride and groom together on the invitation sent to friends."],["根据习俗，新娘应该循规蹈矩。","发给好朋友的请帖上有新郎新娘合影的照片。"]],["terribly","'terәbli","adv. 可怕地, 甚为, 非常",["He was terribly poor when he was young.","I was terribly confused by his question."],["他年轻的时候穷困潦倒。","我對他的問題感到非常困惑。"]],["cue","kju:","n. 提示, 线索\\nvt. 给...暗示(或提示)\\n[计] 尾接指令",["Cue cards are used primarily on television to help the actors remember their lines.","Tom's arrival seemed to be the cue for everyone to get up and start talking."],["",""]],["biography","bai'ɒgrәfi","n. 传记",["This means that you will never see a biography about me.","The history of the world is but the biography of great men."],["",""]],["hazard","'hæzәd","n. 冒险, 危险, 机会\\nvt. 冒...的危险, 赌运气, 使冒危险\\n[计] 相关危险; 冒险",["A pot belly is an occupational hazard for office workers.","To prevent fire or shock hazard, do not place a container filled with liquids on top of the console."],["",""]],["straighten","'streitn","vt. 弄直, 整顿, 清理, 使改正\\nvi. 直起来, 改正, 好转",["Put away the bedsheet, I'll straighten the bed.","We will try to correct it in order to straighten out our finances."],["你把床單收起來，我整理一下床。",""]],["seldom","'seldәm","a. 不常的, 稀少的\\nadv. 很少, 不常",["People are most angry when they feel they are being mocked. That's why those who are confident in themselves seldom become angry.","Bob seldom talks with Maria without making her angry."],["人覺得自己被嘲笑時最易生氣，因此有自信的人往往不易動怒。","鮑伯和瑪麗亞說話時很少不惹她生氣。"]],["compelling","kәm'peliŋ","a. 强制的, 强迫性的, 激发兴趣的",["I have never seen a compelling argument for religion. If I ever saw one I'd convert.","Fashion is a compelling subject for documentaries."],["",""]],["tile","tail","n. 砖瓦, 瓷砖, 瓦片\\nvt. 铺以瓦, 铺以瓷砖\\n[计] 平铺",["The tile that fell from the roof broke into pieces.","We want to re-tile our terrace and therefore removed the tiles with a power hammer yesterday."],["",""]],["honestly","'ɒnistli","adv. 真诚地, 公正地",["It is a matter of principle with him to answer your questions honestly.","Honestly, I also want to learn Japanese."],["诚实地回答你的问题对他来说是个原则问题。","其實我也想學日語。"]],["troubled","'trʌbld","a. 烦恼的, 混乱的, 不安的",["I got the sack but I've a little saved up, so for the time being I won't be troubled by living expenses.","I'm very sorry to have troubled you."],["虽然我被公司解雇了，但是我还有点存款，所以目前不用担心生计问题。","给你添麻烦了，真的非常抱歉。"]],["economically","i:kә'nɔmikәli","adv. 节约地, 不浪费地, 节省地, 节俭地, 在经济上, 在经济学上",["More and more women have their own careers and are economically independent of their husbands.","The country is isolated economically and politically."],["越来越多的女人拥有自己的事业并实现和丈夫的经济独立。",""]],["vague","veig","a. 含糊的, 不清楚的, 茫然的",["This meeting is a waste of time. Everybody is just talking in vague theoretical terms.","I have a very vague idea of what you are talking about."],["",""]],["zero","'ziәrәu","n. 零, 零点, 零度, 无, 乌有, 最低点\\na. 零的, 没有的\\nvt. 调零, 对(炮火等)作协调校正\\n[计] 零",["They conducted a series of experiments under zero gravity.","Because of his score of zero, he didn't dare to return."],["他們在無重力狀態下進行了一連串的實驗。","因為考了零分，所有不敢回去。"]],["foreigner","'fɒ:rinә","n. 外国人, 外地人\\n[法] 外国人, 进口货, 外国货",["Fortunately, everybody understood what this foreigner meant, knew I was only making a fool of myself, and laughed at me.","I'm a foreigner and I don't know Czech very well. Please, speak slowly."],["幸运的是大家都明白了这个老外的意思，知道我只是闹笑话而友好地对我笑一下。","我是外国人，我捷克语不好，请说慢一点。"]],["balanced","'bælәnst","a. 公平的, 平衡的\\n[计] 平衡的, 对称的, 均衡的",["Fruits and vegetables are essential to a balanced diet.","His body type is born balanced! Wide shoulders, slim waist, belly not popping outwards."],["蔬果对平衡饮食必不可少。","他的体形生得很匀称！肩膀宽，腰身窄，肚子又没凸出来。"]],["twentieth","'twentiiθ","num. 第二十, 二十分之一",["The next meeting will be on the twentieth of October.","There is no telling how far science may have progressed by the end of the twentieth century."],["下次会议10月20日开。",""]],["delight","di'lait","n. 高兴, 愉快\\nvt. 使高兴, 乐于\\nvi. 感到高兴(或愉快、快乐)",["It was a fabulous show which brought us an endless delight.","I delight in going to the apple orchard each fall."],["那是一个给我们带来无穷乐趣的传奇性的演出。","我樂意每年秋季去蘋果園。"]],["convenience","kә'vi:njәns","n. 方便, 便利的事物, 方便的时候",["There's a convenience store diagonally across the street.","Television has the advantage of providing sports fans with greater convenience."],["有一家便利店在马路斜对面。","电视的优点在于它给体育爱好者提供了更大的方便。"]],["weave","wi:v","n. 编法, 织法, 编织式样\\nvt. 编织, 组合, 编排, 使迂回前进\\nvi. 纺织, 迂回行进",["Spiders always weave their webs in three dimensions.","Yanni uses this bark to weave traditional baskets."],["",""]],["plea","pli:","n. 恳求, 辩解, 抗辩, 诉讼, 请愿, 托词\\n[法] 抗辩, 申诉案件, 答辩",["Please don't do translations if you're crap at it. This is a plea from the English translation clients.","The defence attorney achieved a plea deal of ILS 5 million."],["",""]],["academy","ә'kædәmi","n. 学院, 院校, 学会",["The results of the Chinese Academy of Sciences' survey are like this.","I am Du Yu, a student at the Faculty of Computer Science and Technology, Qilu University of Technology (Shandong Academy of Sciences)."],["中国科学院的调查结果是这样的。","我是杜宇，是一名来自齐鲁工业大学（山东省科学院）计算机科学与技术学部的学生。"]],["sustainable","sә'steinәbl","a. 足可支撑的, 养得起的, 可以忍受的",["New Zealand students have developed sustainable materials made from cabbage tree leaves and flax that could soon be used to make high-performance skis, kayaks and skateboards.","I mainly participated in the working group \"environmental protection and sustainable agriculture\"."],["紐西蘭學生開發出由高麗菜樹葉和亞麻製成的永續材料，很快就能用於製造高性能滑雪板、皮划艇和滑板。",""]],["timber","'timbә","n. 木材, 木料\\nvt. 用木材建造",["The Heavenly Timber Immolation is a kind of ancient ritual.","There is a shortage of good construction timber right now."],["燔柴祭天是一種古老的儀式。","现在正缺良好的建筑木材。"]],["till","til","prep. 直到, 在...以前, 迄\\nconj. 直到...为止\\nvt. 耕种\\nn. 放钱的抽屉, 备用现金, 冰碛",["If you think education is expensive, wait till you see what ignorance costs you.","I am afraid that I shall not be free till the examination is over."],["如果你認為教育是昂貴的, 那麼你等著看無知讓你付出的代價。","恐怕直到考試結束前我都沒空。"]],["accurately","'ækjurәtli","adv. 正确地, 精确地",["I don't remember my grandmother's face accurately.","She can assess investments very accurately."],["我记不清奶奶的脸。","她能很准确地评估投资。"]],["bolt","bәult","n. 门闩, 螺钉, 筛子, 闪电, 意外事件\\nvt. 闩住, 发射, 脱口而出, 筛, 囫囵吞下\\nvi. 囫囵吞枣, 射箭, 脱缰,…",["It was like a bolt out of the blue.","Only if there's a cancellation, and that would be a bolt out of the blue."],["晴天霹雳。",""]],["bulb","bʌlb","n. 球茎, 电灯泡\\n[医] 球, 鳞茎, 球茎",["Thomas Edison invented the light bulb.","Can you change the kitchen light bulb before you leave?"],["愛迪生發明了電燈炮。","您離開前能幫忙換一下廚房的燈泡嗎？"]],["flying","'flaiiŋ","a. 飞的, 飘扬的, 飞速的\\nn. 飞行, 飞花",["I saw an old and hollow pecan tree that had some bees flying around it.","Thirty-two Madagascan students who receive scholarship are flying to China."],["我看到一棵老舊的空心山核桃樹，周圍有一些蜜蜂在飛。","三十二名领奖学金的马达加斯加学生飞往中国。"]],["skilled","'skild","a. 熟练的\\n[经] 熟练的, 有技能的",["The position requires applicants to be skilled in spoken English.","He is already skilled in both math and literature."],["这份职位要求应征者有一定的英语口语表达能力。","他既精于数学又精于文学。"]],["spine","spain","n. 背骨, 脊柱, 尖刺\\n[医] 脊柱; 棘, 刺; 马蹄嵴",["A chill ran down his spine as he crossed the park.","The terrible scene sent shivers down his spine."],["他穿過公園時，一陣寒意順著脊背蔓延而下。","恐怖的场面让了他颤抖。"]],["cargo","'kɑ:gәu","n. 货物\\n[经] 货柜",["Khaki shorts with cargo pockets do not make you an adventurer.","The cargo ship arrived four hours early."],["單有卡其褲，還成不了冒險家。","货船早到了四小时。"]],["managing","'mænidʒiŋ","a. 管理的, 节约的\\n[法] 管理的, 主管的, 善于经营的",["Managing your stocks with Big Wisdom shows that you are serious about investing!","Mimura Yasuyuki (Konichika LTD, Managing Director) died of heart attack on the third, age 45."],["用大智慧做股票，说明您对投资是认真的！",""]],["devil","'devәl","n. 魔鬼\\nvt. 折磨, 戏弄",["Yesterday I became a god, but found that a bit boring, so today I became a devil.","Don't shoot the devil in the back. You might miss."],["昨天我變成了神，但沒意思，所以今天我變成了鬼。","别射撒旦的背部。你可能会射不中。"]],["narrator","","n. 讲述者, 叙述者\\n[法] 陈述者, 叙述者",["Sir David Attenborough is the most well-known narrator in the world.","The intradiegetic narrator lives the event himself."],["",""]],["seller","'selә","n. 销售者\\n[化] 卖方",["The seller weighs the cheese on the copper scales.","This book, which was once a best seller, is now out of print."],["",""]],["organized","'ɔ:^әnaizd","a. 有组织的, 组织起来的",["William is so organized. He's always on top of things.","I'm a determined, organized, and responsible person."],["威廉做事很有条理，他总是能把一切都打点好。","我是个有决心、有条理、有责任的人。"]],["missionary","'miʃәnәri","n. 传教士, 负有任务者, 工作人员\\na. 传教的, 传教士的",["You can give it back whenever you want to as I bought that book for missionary work.","Sami decided to become a missionary to bring Muslims into Christianity."],["",""]],["dock","dɒk","n. 码头, 船坞, 被告席, 尾巴的骨肉部分\\nvt. 使靠码头, 使(船)进港, 剪短\\nvi. 进港",["The huge tanker has just left the dock.","A huge tanker just pulled out from the dock."],["一艘巨大的液货船刚刚启航。","一艘巨大的液货船刚刚启航。"]],["fog","fɒg","n. 雾, 迷惑, (割后的)最生草, 苔藓\\nvi. 被雾笼罩, 变模糊\\nvt. 使困惑, 以雾笼罩",["I have a dull pain in my temples and my mind feels like its covered with a thin layer of fog.","At times, I felt like I was living in a fog, unable to see the light at the end of the tunnel."],["太阳穴钝钝地痛，意识似乎被笼罩上了一层薄薄的雾霭。","有时候，我感觉自己身处迷雾之中，不知该去往何方。"]],["sometime","'sʌmtaim","a. 以前的, 某一时间的\\nadv. 改天, 来日",["Perhaps we could get a drink sometime.","I hope we'll see each other again sometime."],["要不我们找时间喝一顿。","我希望我們有時間還可以見面。"]],["boring","'bɒ:riŋ","a. 烦人的, 无聊的, 无趣的\\n[机] 成孔期, 搪孔",["This film is really boring - the best bit is when it finishes.","Nothing is more boring than traveling long distances by car."],["这部电影很无聊，最好的部分是结局。","没有什么比坐长途汽车更无聊。"]],["marine","mә'ri:n","n. 舰队, 水兵, 海景画\\na. 海的, 海产的, 海底的, 船舶的, 海运的",["The Ordovician-Silurian Extinction Event wiped out nearly 85% of marine species.","Tom is studying to become a marine biologist."],["奧陶紀—志留紀滅絕事件消滅了近 85% 的海洋物種。","湯姆爲了當海洋生物學家學習。"]],["summary","'sʌmәri","n. 摘要, 概要\\na. 摘要的, 简略的\\n[计] 摘要; 概要",["The following is a summary of the President's speech.","His very rough summary does not do justice to the original text and its intellectual sophistication."],["下面是总统讲话的概要。",""]],["diplomat","'diplәmæt","n. 外交官, 有外交手腕的人\\n[法] 外交家, 外交官, 有权谋的人",["He is about to become a diplomat at the Chinese Embassy in France.","He is a diplomat at the American Embassy."],["他将要成为中国驻法国大使馆的外交官。","他是美国大使馆的外交官。"]],["epidemic",".epi'demik","n. 传染病, 流行病\\na. 流行的, 传染性的",["But with the threat of a coronavirus epidemic, things might not look so sunny for Florida tourism.","Thousands upon thousands have died from the epidemic."],["但隨著新冠病毒疫情的威脅，佛羅裡達州的旅遊業前景可能並不樂觀。","成千上万的人死于瘟疫。"]],["trim","trim","n. 整齐, 情形, 修剪\\na. 整齐的\\nvt. 使整齐, 整理, 修剪\\nvi. 调整, 见风使舵\\n[计] 库存管理检查规则程序",["I asked the butcher to trim all the fat off of the meat.","The trim, silver-haired 56-year-old has soaring approval ratings."],["",""]],["fatal","'feitәl","a. 致命的, 重大的, 命运注定的, 粗心的, 不幸的\\n[医] 致命的, 致死的",["As long as it's not a fatal mistake, it is ok to fail.","A slip of the tongue is sometimes fatal to a politician."],["只要不是致命性的错误，失败也没关系。","有时候口误对政治家来说是致命的。"]],["warehouse","'wєәhaus","n. 仓库, 货栈, 大商店\\nvt. 储入仓库",["Then come with me for a moment. Let's check the warehouse. We might just find it there.","Hide it inside the warehouse for now."],["那您随我来一趟，咱们去仓库里找一找，说不定那里会有。","暫時藏在倉庫裡好了。"]],["butterfly","'bʌtәflai","n. 蝴蝶\\n[医] 蝶式棉块, 翼形皮癣, 纸蝶",["This species of butterfly has already gone extinct.","The life span of a butterfly is short."],["這種種類的蝴蝶已經絕種了。","蝴蝶的寿命短。"]],["inherent","in'hiәrәnt","a. 固有的, 与生俱来的\\n[医] 固有的, 生来的",["We must never forget the inherent value of every human being.","On the 25th, the Chinese government issued a white paper entitled \"The Diaoyu Islands are China's Inherent Territory\"."],["我们一定不能忘记每个人的内在价值。","中国政府25日发布了《钓鱼岛是中国的固有领土》白皮书。"]],["accelerate","әk'selәreit","v. 加速, 促进",["Global warming could accelerate the expansion of the Sahara desert in Algeria.","It is of great significance in this experiment to accelerate the particle M in the horizontal direction."],["",""]],["bronze","brɒnz","n. 青铜, 铜像\\na. 青铜色的",["The five yuan coins are brass, and the ten yuan coins are made out of bronze.","In Olympic competitions, a gold medal is for first place, a silver medal for second, and a bronze medal is for third place."],["5元硬币是黄铜做的，10元硬币是青铜做的。","在奥运会的竞赛中，金牌代表第一名，银牌代表第二名，铜牌是第三名。"]],["drown","draun","vi. 淹死\\nvt. 把...淹死, 淹没",["I have to wear earplugs to drown out all the noise from the construction site next door.","The child knows how to swim, so she won't drown in the water."],["我不得不戴耳塞来阻隔旁边建筑工地的所有噪音。","這個孩子知道如何游泳，所以她不會在水裡溺死。"]],["nationwide","'neiʃәnwaid","a. 全国性的\\n[法] 全国的, 全国范围的",["It is a prevalent belief, according to a nationwide poll in the United States, that Muslims are linked with terrorism.","The police have started a nationwide hunt for the criminal."],["根据美国国民的一个投票，人们普遍认为穆斯林人和恐怖主义有关。",""]],["vacuum","''vækjuәm","n. 真空, 空间, 真空吸尘器\\na. 真空的, 产生真空的, 利用真空的\\nvt. 用吸尘器打扫",["I sucked up the dust on the floor with a vacuum cleaner.","I got this vacuum cleaner for nothing."],["我用吸塵機把地上的灰塵吸掉了。","我免費得到了這個吸塵器。"]],["selected","si'lektid","a. 挑选出来的, 精选的\\n[计] 被选的",["Those selected will have to face extensive medical and psychological tests.","The conference will be held in a specially selected church."],["被选上的将会面临大量的医学和精神测试。","会议将会在特意安排的礼堂里举行。"]],["creek","kri:k","n. 小溪, 小河, 小湾",["There used to be a lot of small creeks in old time Shanghai, which included Zhaojia Creek and Yangjing Creek, but they're all covered up nowadays.","His wife caught him out with that blonde and then he was really up shit creek without a paddle."],["上海以前有许多小河浜，其中有肇家浜、洋泾浜，现在都被填了。",""]],["spit","spit","n. 唾液, 唾吐, 小雨, 炙叉, 一铲的深度\\nvt. 唾吐, 吐出, 降小雨, 用炙叉穿过\\nvi. 吐唾沫, 吐痰, 唾弃, 飘霏…",["In Singapore, it is a crime to spit on the ground.","It's poor form to spit from the window into the street, or into the fire, or anywhere people might step on what you have spit."],["隨地吐痰在新加坡算是犯罪行為。",""]],["dictate","'dikteit","vi. 听写, 口述, 口授\\nvt. 口述, 使听写, 命令\\nn. 命令, 指挥, 指令",["Gender norms should not dictate how individuals cope with and process their emotions.","Martha doesn't want her parents to dictate who she was going to spend the rest of her life with."],["性別規範不應該規定個人如何面對或處理自己的情緒。",""]],["sensor","'sensә","n. 传感器\\n[计] 检测器",["As soon as Lorenzo stepped in, the motion-sensor lights turned on.","The pulse ox sensor couldn't get a good oxygen saturation reading because Tom's hands were so cold."],["",""]],["stereotype","'stiәriәtaip","n. 铅版, 陈规, 老套\\nvt. 使用铅版, 把...印制成盲文, 套用老套, 使一成不变",["It is a stereotype that police officers always eat doughnuts.","The stereotype that women are more sensitive than males isn't always true."],["警察總吃甜甜圈是一種刻板印象。",""]],["manual","'mænjuәl","n. 手册, 指南\\na. 手的, 手动的, 手工的, 体力的\\n[计] 人工的, 手动的",["It's best to keep a household medical manual by your pillow and read it from time to time.","A qipao in the traditional style is made entirely by hand and requires labour-intensive manual tailoring techniques to enhance and exhibit every unique female form."],["最好备一本家用医卫手册在枕头边，常常翻翻看看。","一件传统式样的旗袍是完全手工制作的，也需要劳动密集的裁缝业技术，为了增加而显示每种独一无二的女性体态。"]],["kneel","ni:l","vi. 跪下",["I encourage you to come and kneel with me at the foot of Calvary's Cross and be washed in the blood of Our Savior Jesus Christ.","You must kneel at my feet, kiss my hand and swear that I am an angel."],["",""]],["plaintiff","'pleintif","n. 原告, 起诉人\\n[经] 原告, 原起诉人",["We the jury find for the plaintiff and award actual damages in the amount of one million dollars.","The judge decided against the plaintiff."],["",""]],["laundry","'lɒ:ndri","n. 洗衣店, 洗好的衣服, 洗涤\\n[机] 洗衣作, 洗衣店, 洗衣房",["I don't have a washing machine at home, and so I have to go to the washing room in order to do the laundry.","I have to do laundry while it's still sunny."],["因为我家没有洗衣机，我必须去洗衣房洗衣服。","趁还有太阳的时候，我该洗衣服。"]],["naval","'neivl","a. 海军的, 军舰的, 有舰队的\\n[法] 海军的, 军舰的, 船的",["The Iranian Navy accidentally destroyed one of its ships in friendly fire during a naval exercise, killing at least 19.","The gentlemen at this table were naval commanders during the first Gulf War."],["",""]],["pistol","'pistl","n. 手枪, 信号枪\\nvt. 以手枪杀死(或伤害)",["If you want that water pistol you'll just have to save money and buy it yourself. I can't constantly buy toys for you. I'm not made of money.","Never trust a woman with a pistol in hand."],["如果你想要那把水槍，你必須自己存錢買。我沒有辦法一直買玩具給你。錢不會從我背上長出來。","千万别相信一个手里拿手枪的女人。"]],["apology","ә'pɒlәdʒi","n. 道歉, 辩护\\n[法] 道歉, 谢罪, 辩解者",["I lost a school key when I was cleaning up after the school festival and I was then required to write an apology letter.","Can it be that you don't have a bit of creativity, to the point of always inventing the same apology?"],["我在校庆后打扫的时候弄掉了一把学校的钥匙，我被迫写了一份检讨。","你是沒創意到連每次道歉的說詞都一成不變嗎？"]],["dean","di:n","n. 院长, 主持牧师\\n[法] 外交团长, 学院院长, 教务长",["He used to be a professor, but now he is the dean.","Without hesitating, the dean selects infinite wisdom."],["他以前是教授，后来当了系主任。",""]],["bore","bɒ:","n. 令人讨厌的人, 激浪, 枪膛, 孔\\nvt. 使烦扰, 钻孔\\nvi. 钻孔\\nbear的过去式\\n[计] 内径; 孔径",["Our real life friends may sometimes bore us, but the friends we find in books would never do that.","Even small drops striking constantly will bore through a granite mountain."],["我们生活中的朋友有时会让我们觉得无聊，而我们书中的朋友永远不会这样。",""]],["beloved","bi'lʌvd","a. 心爱的\\nn. 心爱的人",["My beloved is white and ruddy, chosen out of thousands.","Our beloved father would read us some prose every week to better our understanding of the world's beauty."],["我所爱的是白皙红润，千里挑一的。","我們親愛的父親每週都會給我們閱讀散文，好讓我們認識到世界的美好之處。"]],["entertain",".entә'tein","vt. 娱乐, 招待, 怀抱\\nvi. 款待",["If the students are bored, they will find ways to entertain themselves.","It is the mark of an educated mind to be able to entertain a thought without accepting it as fact."],["",""]],["website","","n. 网站（全球资讯网的主机站）",["I also run my own website, to try and record my progress and to help other people a little bit.","Because of a flaw in the original design, our website is vulnerable to SQL injection attacks."],["我也管理自己的网站，试试记录我的进步而且给别人帮助。","由于最初设计中的一个缺陷，我们的网站易受到SQL注入攻击。"]],["chopped","tʃɔpt","v. 砍；斩碎；大量削减（chop的过去分词）",["Cook the peeled and chopped potatoes for 20 minutes in boiling water.","Add the honey, lemon juice, chopped almonds and the chopped apples."],["把去皮切成小块的土豆放在滚水里煮20分钟。","加入蜂蜜、檸檬汁、切碎的杏仁和切碎的蘋果。"]],["retrieve","ri'tri:v","vt. 取回, 挽回, 弥补, 恢复, 补偿, 回忆, 检索\\nvi. 找回猎物\\nn. 取回, 恢复, 救险球\\n[计] 检索",["The secretary went to the storage room to retrieve the file.","Your attempt to retrieve your password was not successful. Please try again."],["",""]],["tribute","'tribju:t","n. 贡物, 礼物, 颂辞",["The whole company stood in silence for a few moments, as a tribute to the dead.","This memorial is built as a tribute to the Algerians who fought and died in the war of independence against the French."],["",""]],["bomber","'bɒmә","n. 轰炸机, 投弹手",["The suicide bomber fired towards former Prime Minister Benazir Bhutto, but missed.","Tom and Mary adopted two children whose parents had been killed by a suicide bomber."],["",""]],["overseas","'әuvә'si:z","a. 海外的, 国外的\\nadv. 在海外, 在国外",["A passport is usually necessary when you travel overseas.","His music has attained great popularity overseas."],["海外旅行通常都要用到護照。","他的音樂在國外很受歡迎。"]],["smoking","'smәukiŋ","n. 抽烟, 冒烟\\n[医] 烟熏; 吸烟",["The doctor told Mr Smith to give up smoking if he wanted to live long.","As is evident from the data, smoking is not decreasing among the young."],["医生告诉史密斯先生他要长寿的话就得戒烟。","数据表明年轻人抽烟的现象没有减少。"]],["bizarre","bi'zɑ:","a. 奇异的",["That building's facade is bizarre. No idea what the architect was thinking.","The evil spirit lived in a terrifying world full of bizarre and monstrous creatures."],["這座大樓的外觀很奇怪，不知道設計師是怎麼想的。",""]],["nominate","'nɒmineit","vt. 提名, 任命, 命名\\n[法] 提名...为候选人, 指定, 推荐",["Nominate now the champion of gender-balanced business.","The director has asked the board to nominate him for a second term."],["",""]],["devise","di'vaiz","vt. 设计, 发明, 图谋, 遗赠给\\nn. 遗赠",["He tried to devise a plan for getting rid of termites.","We must devise some means of escape."],["",""]],["anchor","'æŋkә","n. 锚\\nvt. 抛锚停泊, 使固定\\n[计] 锚",["They usually use an anchor to hold a yacht in place.","Tired out we seek the little town, and run / the sterns ashore and anchor in the bay."],["",""]],["bargain","'bɑ:gin","n. 交易, 买卖协定, 特价商品\\nv. 讲价, 交易",["The bargain sale will run for three days, beginning today.","The media sells a trace of hatred at bargain prices."],["这场减价活动会持续三天，从今天开始。",""]],["skeptical","'skeptikәl","a. 怀疑论的, 怀疑的, 不可知论的\\n[法] 怀疑的, 不信的, 怀疑论者的",["Many people are skeptical about the actual effects of traditional Chinese medicine.","I'm skeptical when I hear someone claim to speak more than five languages fluently."],["很多人对中药的真实效果持怀疑态度。",""]],["scrutiny","'skru:tini","n. 细看, 仔细检查, 监视, 选票检查\\n[经] 复查, 评核, 仔细检查",["Corporate political donations are coming under heavy scrutiny.","The statement seems to make sense, but under further scrutiny, it falls apart."],["",""]],["suppress","sә'pres","vt. 镇压, 使止住, 禁止, 抑制, 查禁\\n[法] 镇压, 平定, 禁止出版",["Is France trying to suppress Algeria's development?","Heathers help to suppress weeds in your garden."],["法国是在试图压制阿尔及利亚的发展吗？","石楠花有助於抑制花園裡的雜草。"]],["considering","kәn'sidәriŋ","prep. 就...而论\\nconj. 考虑到",["I'm considering studying in the United States next year.","He is doing very well considering he lacks experience."],["我在考虑明年去美国学习。","考虑到他缺乏经验，他做得[已经]非常好了。"]],["brass","bræs.brɑ:s","n. 黄铜, 黄铜制品\\na. 黄铜的, 铜管乐器的\\nv. 镀以黄铜, 支付",["We've been horsing around too much; it's high time we got down to brass tacks.","The 5 yen coin is made from brass and the 10 yen coin is made from bronze."],["我們胡鬧太久了, 現在該是我們考慮基本事實的時候了。","5元硬币是黄铜做的，10元硬币是青铜做的。"]],["unfortunate",".ʌn'fɒ:tʃәnit","a. 不幸的, 不合适的, 不吉利的",["Due to a number of unfortunate causes, one-parent families are on the increase.","It's really unfortunate. You don't understand at all its essence."],["由于诸多不幸因素，单亲家庭的数量在增长中。","太可惜了，你一点也不懂它的精髓。"]],["extract","ik'strækt","n. 榨出物, 精汁, 摘录, 选段\\nvt. (费力地)取出, 采掘, 榨取, 摘录, 吸取\\n[计] 提取",["No indeed, it would be easier extract a tooth from him than a coin in a honest matter.","It's the reader that determines whether they extract pleasure from reading."],["",""]],["intensive","in'tensiv","a. 加强的, 内涵的, 集中的\\nn. 加强器",["A qipao in the traditional style is made entirely by hand and requires labour-intensive manual tailoring techniques to enhance and exhibit every unique female form.","As economy develops, labor-intensive industries give way to capital-intensive industries."],["一件传统式样的旗袍是完全手工制作的，也需要劳动密集的裁缝业技术，为了增加而显示每种独一无二的女性体态。",""]],["tech","tek","n. 技术学院或学校",["Housing prices in Hsinchu City have risen sharply due to the concentration of the tech industry.","I went to the Hsinchu Science Park during summer vacation and saw many high-tech companies."],["新竹市區的房價因為科技產業聚集而水漲船高。","我暑假去了新竹科技園區，見識了許多高科技公司。"]],["betray","bi'trei","vt. 出卖, 背叛, 辜负, 暴露\\n[法] 出卖, 背叛, 泄漏",["He would rather lose his life than betray his organization.","Afraid of losing his life, he has to betray his organization."],["他寧可犧牲生命，也不出賣組織。","他害怕犧牲生命，不得不出賣組織。"]],["consistency","kәn'sistәnsi","n. 坚硬性, 黏稠度, 一致性\\n[化] 稠度; 一致性",["I'm so busy running about year in, year out. My life has no consistency.","This statement-of-purpose essay has no consistency in how the points are laid out and gives a distracted impression."],["长年累月东奔西走忙死了，生活太没有规律了。",""]],["bureaucracy","bjuә'rɒkrәsi","n. 官僚, 官吏\\n[法] 官僚主义, 官僚政治, 官僚机构",["Algeria needs to get rid of its bureaucracy.","The bureaucracy is expanding to meet the needs of the expanding bureaucracy."],["阿尔及利亚需要摆脱官僚主义。",""]],["interactive",",intәr'æktiv","a. 相互作用的, 相互影响的\\n[计] 交互, 人机对话的",["I wonder if it would be possible for you to introduce me to Mr. Harrison of PC Interactive Co. Ltd.","More and more people are rushing to make use of the interactive nature of the medium."],["我想知道您能否把我介紹給 PC Interactive 有限公司的哈里森先生。",""]],["clever","'klevә","a. 聪明的, 精明的",["No matter who it was that wrote this book, he's very clever.","Though he is clever, he isn't wise."],["我不知道這本書的作者是誰，但他肯定是個天才。","即使他有些小聪明，但是他并不智慧。"]],["developed","di'velәpid","a. 发达的（国家或地区）；成熟的",["Even though the United States is a developed country, it still has some very poor people.","Musical talent can be developed if it's properly trained."],["尽管美国是个发达国家，却还有些很贫穷的人。","如果训练得当的话，音乐才能是可以培养出来的。"]],["loser","'lu:zә","n. 失败者, 遗失者\\n[法] 失败者, 失物者, 遗失者",["If you're not a loser by nature, then people won't trust you.","The father was strong all his life, and what he hated most was seeing his son live like a loser."],["如果你没有尝试过失败的角色，那么人们也就不会相信你。","父親一生剛強，最痛恨的就是兒子活成個窩囊廢的樣子。"]],["challenging","'tʃælindʒiŋ","a. 挑战的, 引起争论的",["We express our gratitude for Mr Smith's outstanding, challenging speech.","Mr. Federer is challenging the call on the right sideline. The ball was called out."],["我们对史密斯先生杰出的，给人启发的讲话表示感激。",""]],["critique","kri'ti:k","n. 评论文章, 评论",["You can critique it all you want and it won't change a thing. It's over.","Critique of Pure Reason is German philosopher Immanuel Kant's chief literary work."],["",""]],["skiing","'ski:iŋ","n. 滑雪运动, 滑雪术",["He can't swim at all, but when it comes to skiing, he is the best.","We went skiing in Shiga Kogen for our school trip."],["他完全不會游泳，但卻是一個滑雪高手。","修学旅行，我们去了志贺高原滑雪。"]],["aboard","ә'bɒ:d","adv. 在船上, 在火车上, 在飞机上\\nprep. 在...之上",["It is very dangerous to jump aboard the train when it is moving.","The passengers all went aboard the ship."],["跳上一列正在开的火车是很危险的。","乘客全都登上了船。"]],["delicious","di'liʃәs","a. 美味的",["That place's food is delicious and their prices are low. However, their location isn't good.","Cottage cheese and canned peaches are a delicious combination."],["那家馆子物美价廉，美中不足的是他们糟糕的位置。","乾酪加桃子罐頭是美味的搭配。"]],["compassion","kәm'pæʃәn","n. 同情, 怜悯",["To me, there are but three treasures, compassion, frugality, and not daring to take the lead in the empire.","The fact that you're unable to feel compassion indicates clearly that you're a psychopath."],["",""]],["reproduce",".ri:prә'dju:s","v. 繁殖, 再生, 复制, 生殖\\n[计] 复制",["Most schools were designed not to transform society, but to reproduce it.","One way animals asexually reproduce is via fragmentation."],["",""]],["congregation",".kɒŋgri'geiʃәn","n. 集合, 聚集\\n[法] 集会, 人一, 红衣主教会议",["The church congregation was moved by the fine sermon.","Sami is very well respected and beloved in the congregation."],["",""]],["beneficial",".beni'fiʃәl","a. 有益的, 受益的\\n[经] 有使用权的, 可享利益的",["Regular exercise is beneficial to good health.","Others say it may even be beneficial."],["多運動有益健康。","其他人說它甚至可能是有益的。"]],["awkward","'ɒ:kwәd","a. 笨拙的, 棘手的",["By saying the wrong thing at the wrong time, I kept getting myself and my friends into awkward situations.","Po-lin ran into his ex at the night market yesterday. It was super awkward."],["我在不恰當的時機說錯了話, 不斷的使我自己和我的朋友陷於尷尬的處境。","柏霖昨天在夜市遇到前女友，尷尬到不行。"]],["worm","wә:m","n. 虫, 蠕虫, 小人物, 螺纹, 蜗杆\\nvi. 蠕行, 慢慢前进\\nvt. 使蠕行, 慢慢地走, 除虫\\n[计] 蠕虫病毒",["The blackbird found a little red worm in the green grass.","I ate half the apple before I noticed there was a worm in it."],["乌鸫在绿草中发现了一条小红虫。",""]],["iranian","i'reiniәn","a. 伊朗的, 伊朗语系的\\nn. 伊朗人, 伊朗语",["The Iranian nuclear program has just been attacked by malware.","Two Iranian professors of physics were assassinated."],["",""]],["complication",".kɒmpli'keiʃәn","n. 复杂化, 复杂情况\\n[医] 并发症, 并发病",["A new complication of coronavirus became apparent in the study.","Another common complication of hemorrhoids is inflammation of the rectum."],["",""]],["marijuana",".mæriju'ɑ:nә","n. 大麻\\n[医] 大麻",["I had an argument with Tom about the use of marijuana.","Dan admitted that when he ran Linda over, he was under the influence of marijuana."],["",""]],["legendary","'ledʒәndәri","a. 传说的, 传奇中说的, 传奇般的, 传说中的, 著名的",["Bill is still a legendary figure in this company.","You couldn't tell it by looking, but she has the legendary tale of having eaten two whole cakes when a child."],["Bill 在這間公司仍然是個傳奇人物。",""]],["militia","mi'liʃә","n. 义勇军, 民兵组织, 国民军",["The militia put up posters of Beth's face in an attempt to name and shame her.","The militia was formed to defend citizens in an emergency."],["",""]],["composer","kәm'pәuzә","n. 作曲家, 作家, 调停者",["\"Who's your favourite classical music composer?\" \"Debussy.\"","Tom said Mozart was his favorite composer."],["「你最愛的古典樂作曲家是誰？」「德布西。」","湯姆說莫札特是他最喜歡的作曲家。"]],["authentic","ɒ:'θentik","a. 可靠的, 可信的, 真正的\\n[法] 被认证的, 确认的, 可信的",["Following a wave of other recent sports simulations, this release offers ball game fans a more authentic management experience.","Are there authentic Chinese restaurants in France?"],["在多款體育類模擬遊戲陸續登場後，這款作品為熱愛球類運動的玩家帶來更真實的管理體驗。","法国有正宗的中餐吗？"]],["concession","kәn'seʃәn","n. 特许, 让步, 认可\\n[经] 核准, 许可, 特殊(权)",["We believe that you will be able to make a price concession.","We would appreciate it if you grant us this concession."],["",""]],["restoration",".restә'reiʃәn","n. 恢复, 归还, 复位\\n[医] 恢复, 康复, 复位, 回复, 修复",["The restoration of this historic building went on for five years.","The restoration of this historic building took five years."],["",""]],["rejection","ri'dʒekʃәn","n. 拒绝, 抛弃, 驳回, 被抛弃的东西, 呕出物\\n[化] 报废; 拒收",["Every successful writer has a drawer full of rejection letters.","Yanni wants to avoid the risk of rejection by Skura."],["",""]],["tenure","'tenjuә","n. 享有, 保有期\\n[经] (财产,职位等的)占有, 占有权",["My brother just received tenure at the university where he teaches.","Political power is conferred under a temporary and defeasible tenure."],["",""]],["dome","dәum","n. 圆顶\\nvt. 加圆顶\\nvi. 成圆顶状",["Then, girt with guards, within the temple's gate / beneath the centre of the dome she sate.","What's the number for the Tokyo Dome?"],["","东京巨蛋的电话号码是多少？"]],["inadequate","in'ædikwәt","a. 不充分的, 不适当的\\n[法] 不充分的, 不适当的",["The road is inadequate for the amount of traffic which it carries.","This complex situation arose because signals from the environment itself can be inadequate."],["",""]],["thief","θi:f","n. 小偷, 贼\\n[化] 取样",["The thief ran off as soon as he saw the police car.","The thief entered the house at the back door by the open window."],["小偷一看到警车就跑走了。","小偷從後門爬窗走進了房子裏。"]],["editorial",".edi'tɒ:riәl","n. 社论, 评论\\na. 编辑的, 主笔的, 社论的",["He seldom reads an editorial and is not a book worm.","The journalist was accused of playing fast and loose with the facts in the editorial he wrote."],["",""]],["locker","'lɒkә","n. 抽屉, 小柜, 上锁人\\n[机] 锁柜",["The players sat in the locker room while they listened to their coach speak.","While swimming in the pool, she lost her locker key."],["球员们坐在更衣室里听教练讲话。","她在游泳池游泳的時候把儲物櫃的鑰匙弄丟了。"]],["autumn","'ɒ:tәm","n. 秋天, 成熟期",["In autumn, some animals store food away for the winter.","There are four seasons in a year: spring, summer, autumn and winter."],["有些動物會在秋天為冬季儲藏食物。","一年有四個季節 : 春、夏、秋、冬。"]],["subsequently","'sʌbsikwәntli","adv. 后来, 随后",["Over 20% of the Gairdner Foundation winners have subsequently won a Nobel Prize for their scientific contributions.","Several witnesses subsequently recanted their statements claiming coercion."],["",""]],["merger","'mә:dʒә","n. 合并, 归并\\n[经] 购并",["The office has been topsy-turvy since the merger upset everything.","The news of the merger of the two companies broke yesterday."],["自從公司合併了以後，一切都變得十分混亂。","昨天突然傳出了兩間公司合併的消息。"]],["faithful","'feiθful","a. 忠实的, 详确的, 可靠的\\nn. 信徒",["Translation is like a woman. If it is beautiful, it is not faithful. If it is faithful, it is most certainly not beautiful.","The slowest promise is always the most faithful credit."],["翻译就像一个女人。她漂亮就会不忠诚；她忠诚就肯定不会漂亮。","最慢的承诺永远是最忠实的信用。"]],["haunt","hɒ:nt","n. 常到的地方, 生息地\\nvt. 常到, 出没于, 萦绕于\\nvi. 出没, 作祟",["My past indiscretions are coming back to haunt me.","A favourite haunt of mine during the day was the ruined cellar of the mansion that had burned down."],["",""]],["crude","kru:d","a. 天然的, 未成熟的, 粗糙的, 粗鲁的\\nn. 天然的物质",["It is only recently that crude oil has come to be used to make chemical products.","After reading Tom's forum post, Mary resisted the impulse to post a crude reply."],["",""]],["sheriff","'ʃerif","n. 郡治安官, 县治安官\\n[法] 司法行政官, 郡长, 执行吏",["The sheriff said the victim was carjacked at gunpoint on Park Street.","The sheriff beat the suspect until he was almost dead."],["",""]],["evoke","i'vәuk","vt. 唤起, 引起, 召(魂)\\n[法] 提审, 移送",["This cuisine is seasoned to evoke the esprit of Paris.","Our company's visual identity was designed to evoke a sense of trust and familiarity."],["",""]],["completion","kәm'pli:ʃәn","n. 完成\\n[经] 完井, 结束, 完工",["I intend to take a month's vacation on completion of this work.","The construction work is steadily nearing completion."],["",""]],["pal","pæl","n. 朋友, 伙伴, 同志, 同谋\\nvi. 交友, 结伴",["She writes to her pen pal in London twice a month.","Be a pal and go out for some bread. At the same time, take out the trash."],["她每两个月给在伦敦的笔友写一封信。",""]],["trader","'treidә","n. 商人, 商船\\n[经] 交易者, 商船",["If you gamble on the stock market, you are an investor... If you gamble on the derivatives market, you are a trader... If you gamble at the casino, you are a loser... Morality?","The protesters tore down the statue of a slave trader."],["如果你在股票市場上賭博，你是個投資者...如果你在衍生性金融商品市場上賭博，你是個商人...如果你在賭場上賭博，你是個失敗者...道德？",""]],["affirmative","ә'fә:mәtiv","a. 肯定的, 赞成的, 积极的\\nn. 肯定语",["Debate is an academic game between the affirmative and the negative.","Although many pay lip service to the idea of affirmative action, in reality, very few minorities get hired."],["",""]],["vein","vein","n. 血管, 静脉, 纹理, 气质, 情绪\\nvt. 使有脉络, 像脉络般分布于",["The jugular vein is located on the side of your neck.","A day without a vein of humour is an extremely sad day."],["",""]],["surrender","sә'rendә","vt. 交出, 放弃, 使投降, 让与\\nvi. 投降, 自首\\nn. 交出, 放弃, 投降",["You have three minutes to surrender.","Sami had no choice but to surrender."],["限你三分鐘內投降","薩米只有投降一途"]],["scar","skɑ:","n. 疤痕, 伤痕, 悬崖\\nvi. 结疤, 愈合, 痊愈\\nvt. 使有伤痕",["The scar on his forehead is conspicuous.","The scar on his forehead really stands out."],["他額頭上的疤痕很醒目。","他額頭上的疤痕很醒目。"]],["variance","'vєәriәns","n. 不一致, 变化, 变异, 分歧, 不和\\n[化] 方差; 变种",["A random variable is definitely a constant if the variance is zero.","You can't describe the result of a non-parametric test with a statistical parameter such as variance."],["",""]],["surge","sә:dʒ","n. 巨涌, 汹涌, 澎湃\\nvi. 汹涌, 澎湃, 颠簸, 猛冲, 突然放松\\nvt. 使汹涌奔腾, 急放\\n[计] 电压尖峰",["It is expected that the tsunami surge will be ten meters or less.","An outbreak is a sudden surge in the number of people coming down with a particular disease."],["",""]],["sailor","'seilә","n. 水手, 船员, 海员\\n[法] 水手, 船员, 海员",["A sailor frequently has no time to get his sea legs after leaving port before a battle starts.","I am a poor sailor, so I don't like to travel by boat."],["",""]],["inspect","in'spekt","vt. 检查, 检阅, 检验\\nvi. 检查",["\"I need to inspect the wound,\" said the doctor.","Hey! There's an American who speaks Uyghur here! Hurry up and get over here to inspect his computer!"],["“我必须检查下伤口，”医生说道。","喂！这里有个会说维语的美国人！快来把他的电脑检查一下！"]],["commentary","'kɒmәntәri","n. 注释, 评论, 说明\\n[法] 注释, 评注, 评论",["The narrative provided some eye-opening social commentary on the state of the country.","People sometimes narrate their actions to themselves as a running commentary."],["",""]],["follower","'fɒlәuә","n. 从者, 属下, 追补者\\n[电] 随动机",["A follower of oneness through destructive power is good in only this way: he is dead.","Innovation is the difference between a pathfinder and a path follower."],["",""]],["suspension","sә'spenʃәn","n. 悬挂, 暂停, 中止\\n[化] 悬浮; 悬浮体; 悬浮液",["In Lisbon there is a suspension bridge made of steel.","Damaged overhead cables have led to the suspension of all southbound trains."],["",""]],["imperial","im'piәriәl","a. 帝王的, 宗主国的, 至尊的, 壮丽的\\nn. 特等品",["During the 15th century, the Ryukyu Kingdom was a tributary state of Imperial China.","To change the units from metric to imperial and vice versa, the 'menu' button must be clicked."],["在15世紀，琉球王國是中國帝國的附庸國。","要把公制單位換算成英制或反過來操作，鬚點擊“菜單”按鈕。"]],["compensate","'kɒmpenseit","v. 偿还, 补偿, 付报酬",["You must compensate him for the money he lost.","Sami will for sure be generous and compensate you for your time."],["你需要赔偿他损失的钱。",""]],["ranking","'ræŋkiŋ","n. 等级, 地位\\na. 上级的, 头等的, 超群的",["The large siheyuans of these high-ranking officials and wealthy merchants often featured beautifully carved and painted roof beams and pillars and carefully landscaped gardens.","There are few high-ranking positions left open for you."],["这些高官和富商的大四合院常常有精美雕刻并粉刷的横梁和柱子，并伴有精心修剪的花园。",""]],["fuck","fʌk","vt. 与...性交, 欺骗, 诅咒\\nvi. 性交\\nn. 性交, 些微, 杂种\\ninterj. 他妈的, 混帐",["We've been working on this for five months. Don't fuck it up now.","We were always very good fuck buddies."],["我们已经花了五个月的心血在这上面了。别这时候搞砸了。","我們一直是很好的炮友。"]],["hover","'hʌvә","vi. 盘旋, 翱翔, 徘徊\\nvt. 孵\\nn. 翱翔",["Fair is foul, and foul is fair: hover through the fog and filthy air.","Helicopter parents are parents that hover over their children like helicopters."],["",""]],["making","'meikiŋ","n. 制造, (手工)制造业, 制作, 形成, 发展, 要素, 内在因素, 赚头, 制造物",["Mike has been making a model plane since breakfast.","Life is what happens to you while you're busy making other plans."],["迈克吃完早饭以后一直在做一个模型飞机。","生活就是當你忙著進行你的計劃時總有其他的事情發生。"]],["fossil","'fɒsәl","n. 化石, 古物\\na. 化石的, 陈腐的, 守旧的",["As a result of some factories using fossil fuels, chemical emissions have already caused serious environmental problems.","What I have in my hand is a fossil seashell."],["由于一些工厂使用矿物燃料，化学品的排放已经产生严重的环境问题。","在我手裡的是一個貝殼化石。"]],["stunning","'stʌniŋ","a. 打昏迷的, 弄得人昏头昏脑的, 令人震惊的",["They're creating stunning works of art to force people to stop and appreciate the beauty of the universe.","Thousands of laborers and craftsmen toiled for 22 years to craft the stunning white marble edifice."],["他們創作出令人驚嘆的藝術作品，從而讓人們駐足欣賞宇宙之美。","數千名工人和工匠辛勤工作了 22 年，才打造出這座令人驚嘆的白色大理石建築。"]],["trout","traut","n. 鲑鱼",["Fish such as carp and trout live in fresh water.","Such fishes as carp and trout live in fresh water."],["鲤鱼和鳟鱼等鱼类生活在淡水中。",""]],["inappropriate",".inә'prәupriәt","a. 不适当的, 不相称的",["Some people felt that Tom's behavior was inappropriate.","BMI categories (underweight, overweight or obese) from general reading table are inappropriate for athletes, children, the elderly, and the infirm."],["一部分人感觉Tom的行为举止不太合适。","總讀數表的身高體重指數分類（體重過輕、超重或肥胖）不適用於運動員、兒童、老人和體弱者。"]],["cowboy","'kaubɒi","n. 牛仔, 牛郎, 牧童",["When I saw Tom yesterday, he was wearing a cowboy hat.","Tom usually wears a cowboy hat, but today he's wearing a baseball cap."],["",""]],["latino","læ'ti:nәu, lә-","n. 拉丁美洲人",["Today, things are better for the Latino community in the USA.","The Latino voting bloc in the US is increasingly a force to be reckoned with."],["",""]],["viable","'vaiәbl","a. 能养活的, 能生长发育的\\n[医] 有活力的, 有生机的",["What you're saying is perfectly viable, but I can't shake off my unease.","Tom didn't think that his boss's plan was a viable one."],["",""]],["clarify","'klærifai","vi. 澄清, 阐明\\nvt. 使明晰",["The point we must clarify here is that the lines between amateur and professional in sport are beginning to disappear.","I must point out that we need to clarify the meaning of this over-used concept."],["我们必须阐明这个观点，在运动项目上，业余选手和专业选手的界限开始消失了。",""]],["sketch","sketʃ","n. 素描, 草图, 小品\\nv. 描绘略图, 画素描或速写",["Tom ripped a page out of his sketch book.","Can you sketch it for me on this piece of paper please?"],["汤姆从他的绘画本上撕下了一页。","请你帮我在这张纸上画个草图。"]],["countless","'kauntlis","a. 数不尽的, 无数的",["In fact, there are countless, varied uses for the Internet.","Countless stars were twinkling in the sky."],["实际上，网络的作用有着无数的多种多样的。","无数星星在天上闪烁。"]],["copper","'kɒpә","n. 铜, 警察\\n[化] 铜Cu",["Now I am starting to issue copper medals.","Copper River salmon are the first fresh Alaska salmon to hit the market each year."],["现在我开始发铜牌。",""]],["chat","tʃæt","n. 闲谈\\nvi. 闲谈, 聊天",["You'd rather translate sentences than chat with me.","I am either going to watch a movie, or chat with my friends."],["你寧願翻譯句子也不願意和我說話。","我要么去看电影，要么和朋友聊天。"]],["upcoming","'ʌp.kʌmiŋ","a. 即将来临的, 即将出现的",["I'll keep all the ideas we discussed for the upcoming project proposal.","Tom has no intention of asking Mary to the upcoming dance."],["對於下一個專案提案，我們討論過的所有想法，我都會記下來。","Tom没有意图去邀请Mary去即将来临的舞会。"]],["pupil","'pju:pl","n. 学生, 门生, 未成年人, 瞳孔\\n[医] 瞳孔",["For example, if a chain-smoking teacher cautions a pupil for smoking, that warning is self-contradictory.","He was my pupil. Now he teaches my children."],["舉例說，如果一個老師警告學生不要吸煙，但自己卻每天吸個不停，那麼這個警告就是自相矛盾的了。","他曾是我的學生，現在在教我的孩子們。"]],["ninth","nainθ","num. 第九, 九分之一",["The speech contest took place on the ninth of November.","First, second, third, fourth, fifth, sixth, seventh, eighth, ninth, tenth... penultimate, last."],["",""]],["lyrics","","n. 歌词",["I found the lyrics, but I can't copy-paste them.","If you listen to foreign language songs, feel tunes nice, but do not understand the lyrics, then you can not say you like this song, can only say that like the tune."],["我找到了歌词，但是没法转贴过来。","如果你听外语歌，觉得曲调好听，但不懂歌词，那你不能说你喜欢这首歌，只能说喜欢它的曲调。"]],["strive","straiv","vi. 努力, 奋斗, 斗争",["Confidence and courage are not just masculine traits; they are values anyone can strive for.","No matter how hard I strive, I fail to achieve my parents' requirements."],["自信與勇氣不僅是男性特質，也可以是所有人都能追求的價值。","不管我怎么努力，也达不到父母的要求。"]],["neglect","ni'glekt","n. 疏忽, 忽略, 漏做\\nvt. 疏忽, 忽视, 不顾",["Those people did not neglect their child because they used the Internet too much.","They used the Internet too much because they had some underlying problem that also caused them to neglect their child."],["那两个人不是因为过于上网而忽视他们的孩子。","他们是因为患有一种使他门忽视孩子的基础精神病而过于上网。"]],["gambling","'gæmbliŋ","n. 赌博",["Gambling site lets users bet on which species will go extinct because of the oil spill in the Gulf of Mexico.","Prostitution, gambling, the use of narcotic substances, drunkenness, disorder, and all other illegal activities are STRICTLY FORBIDDEN."],["賭博網站讓用戶投注於哪些物種將因為墨西哥灣漏油而滅絕。","严禁卖淫嫖娼，赌博，吸毒，酗酒滋事等违法犯罪活动！"]],["ward","wɒ:d","n. 病房, 守卫, 保卫, 保护, 监护, 牢房, 行政区, 锁孔内的榫舌\\nvt. 使入病房, 守护, 保卫",["Ten years ago the ward office gave us ballpoint pens on the Coming of Age Day.","In order to buy a car, you must show the ward office proof of parking space."],["",""]],["warfare","'wɒ:fєә","n. 战争, 战斗, 交战, 斗争, 竞争\\n[法] 战事, 作战, 交战",["The art of modern warfare does not necessarily require soldiers to be armed to the teeth to be effective as combatants.","They took to the field with all the panoply of modern warfare."],["現代戰術並無指明士兵必須全副武裝上陣才能發揮其最大的戰鬥力。",""]],["mound","maund","n. 土墩, 堤, 小山\\nvt. 筑堤, 用土堆防卫\\nvi. 积成堆",["Ziri walked around the mound and found a wooden cross on it.","The Takamatsuzuka burial mound is located in Asukamura, Nara prefecture."],["",""]],["bang","bæŋ","n. 重击, 突然巨响, 刘海\\nv. 发巨响, 重击\\nadv. 砰然地, 突然巨响地, 直接地\\n[计] 撞击符",["This is the way the world ends. Not with a bang but a whimper.","Newspaper advertising works well for us because we get the best bang for the buck."],["",""]],["tilt","tilt","n. 倾斜, 倾向, 船篷, 车篷\\nvt. 使倾斜, 使倾侧, 用帆布篷遮盖\\nvi. 倾斜, 翘起, 冲, 评击\\n[计] 倾斜",["In helicopters, the cyclic controls the tilt of the main rotor, producing pitch and roll.","The flaps slide back and down to increase the surface of the wing area. They also tilt down to increase the curve of the wing."],["",""]],["rob","rɒb","v. 抢夺, 抢掠, 剥夺",["Tom and his friends planned to rob a bank.","Toronto mayor Rob Ford admitted to having smoked crack."],["湯姆和好友打算搶銀行。",""]],["reasonably","'ri:znәbli","adv. 适度地, 相当地",["He thought she spoke reasonably, so he accepted her suggestion.","It cannot reasonably be assumed that decreasing the dose would reduce the risk of side-effects."],["他觉得她说得很有道理，于是接受了她的建议。",""]],["medieval",".medi'i:vl","a. 中古的, 中世纪的",["I'm playing a medieval-themed PC game.","You're the only person I know besides me who likes medieval music."],["我正在玩一款中世紀主題的電腦遊戲。",""]],["advocacy","'ædvәkәsi","n. 拥护, 支持, 鼓吹, 辩护, 辩护术\\n[法] 辩护, 拥护, 提倡",["Health advocacy groups that have been warning of possible cell phone-cancer links are praising the WHO pronouncement.","He volunteered at an advocacy group."],["",""]],["biologist","bai'ɒlәdʒist","n. 生物学家\\n[医] 生物学家",["Tom is studying to become a marine biologist.","The biologist concentrated on observing the phenomenon."],["湯姆爲了當海洋生物學家學習。",""]],["monetary","'mʌnitәri","a. 货币的, 金钱的\\n[经] 货币的, 金融的",["Interest rates will rise due to monetary tightening.","It is important for a nation to have an adequate mix of monetary and fiscal policies."],["",""]],["learner","'lә:nә","n. 学习者, 初学者",["Let's pray he turns out to be a fast learner.","Someday, dear language learner, you must stop poring over IPA charts and start listening to people."],["让我们祈祷他学得很快吧。",""]],["knot","nɒt","n. 结, 群, 难题\\nv. 打结, (使)纠缠",["A battle is a method of untying with the teeth a political knot that would not yield to the tongue.","Tom held the knife between his teeth as he untied the knot."],["",""]],["antibiotic",".æntibai'ɒtik","n. 抗生素\\na. 抗生的",["The antibiotic Colistin is known as a medicine of \"last resort,\" used to save people's lives when all other drugs have failed.","Fecal transplant is an effective treatment for antibiotic-associated diarrhoea."],["",""]],["prosperity","prɒs'periti","n. 繁荣, 茂盛, 成功\\n[经] 繁荣",["Adversity and prosperity reveal one's breadth of mind; joy and anger test one's self-restraint.","For we have learned from recent experience that when a financial system weakens in one country, prosperity is hurt everywhere."],["逆境顺境看襟度，临喜临怒看涵养。",""]],["accumulate","ә'kju:mjuleit","v. 积聚, 堆积",["Thick snowflakes melt easily and accumulate slowly.","We studied the Concordance to Shakespeare to accumulate examples of alliteration."],["",""]],["dragon","'drægәn","n. 龙, 凶暴的人\\n[法] 凶恶的人, 凶恶严厉的监护人",["The book tells the story of a dragon that can't breathe fire.","The dragon is one of the cultural emblems of China."],["書裡講的是一條不會噴火的龍的故事。","龍是中國的文化圖騰。"]],["creator","kri:'eitә(r)","n. 上帝, 创造者, 创作者",["God is the creator. Heaven and Earth and people and everything apart from God are created.","Zamenhof, the creator of Esperanto, was an ophthalmologist."],["上帝就是造物主。天空，土地以及人类，一切都出自上帝之手，除了上帝自身以外。","世界语的创始人柴门霍夫是一个眼科医生。"]],["electoral","i'lektәrәl","a. 选举人的, 选举的, (有关)选举的\\n[法] 选举的, 选举人的, 由选举人组成的",["Algeria needs to have a truly transparent electoral system.","The politician was accused of nepotism when he employed his wife in his electoral office, without advertising the position."],["",""]],["prosecute","'prɒsikju:t","vt. 告发, 起诉, 彻底进行, 执行, 从事\\nvi. 告发, 起诉, 作检察官",["There are lots of signs warning that they prosecute shoplifters.","Tom declined to prosecute the person who stole from him, reasoning that the police and prison guards were far bigger criminals."],["",""]],["intervene",".intә'vi:n","vi. 插入, 调停, 干涉\\n[经] 进场干预",["The kids fought with each other, so the parents had to intervene.","There may be other factors that intervene in the relation between these two constants."],["",""]],["glow","glәu","n. 赤热, 光辉, 热情, 热烈, 红光\\nvi. 发红光, 红光焕发, 发热, 洋溢, 激动",["Through the open door shone the hearth fire, sending out its warm red glow athwart the chilly autumn night.","He spake, and nearer through the city came / the roar, the crackle and the fiery glow / of conflagration, rolling floods of flame."],["",""]],["embody","im'bɒdi","vt. 具体表达, 使具体化\\n[经] 合并, 具体化, 具体表现",["I see your confidence and wish to embody the same.","The laws of a land embody the spirit of its people."],["",""]],["dull","dʌl","a. 钝的, 无趣的, 呆滞的, 阴暗的\\nvt. 使迟钝, 使阴暗, 缓和\\nvi. 变迟钝, 减少",["The coffee enabled me to stay awake during the dull concert.","I have a dull pain in my temples and my mind feels like its covered with a thin layer of fog."],["咖啡讓我在沉悶的音樂會中保持清醒。","太阳穴钝钝地痛，意识似乎被笼罩上了一层薄薄的雾霭。"]],["rug","rʌg","n. 小块地毯, 揭露某人",["When I didn't have any money, I only had a rug for a bed.","From between the pleats of her black skirt, the nun brought out scissors and deftly cut coloured paper into long, narrow strips, which we could then braid into a paper rug."],["我没有钱的时候，只能以地毯为床。","修女從黑色裙子的褶皺間掏出剪刀，熟練地將彩色紙剪成長而窄的紙條，讓我們可以把這些紙條編成紙地毯。"]],["raid","reid","n. 袭击, 突袭, 搜捕\\nv. 奇袭, 搜捕\\n[计] 廉价磁盘冗余阵列",["A pre-dawn raid has netted a large stash of illegal steroids and several bags of cash.","Tom's number plates were stolen and used in a ram raid."],["",""]],["crown","kraun","n. 王冠, 王权, 顶点\\nvt. 使成王, 加冕, 居...之顶",["The girl in the picture is wearing a crown not of gold but of flowers.","The crown is adorned with dozens of divinely lustrous gemstones."],["畫中的女孩頭上戴著的是花冠，不是金皇冠。","王冠上鑲嵌著數十顆光彩奪目的寶石。"]],["fake","feik","n. 假货, 欺骗, 诡计\\na. 假的\\nvt. 假造, 仿造\\nvi. 伪装",["I think that Tom is going to be pretty mad when he finds out that the painting he bought is a fake.","The fake king plays golf while the real king consolidates his power."],["我觉得当汤姆发现他买来的画是赝品的时候，他会很生气。","真正的王在巩固他的权利，然而虚假的王却在打高尔夫。"]],["creep","kri:p","n. 爬, 徐行, 蠕动\\nvi. 爬, 蔓延, 潜行",["Sometimes it's fun to creep yourself out thinking about it.","The cat took advantage of the high grass to creep on the bird."],["偶尔偷偷地去想这个问题，还是很有意思的。",""]],["crab","kræb","n. 螃蟹, 偏航, 脾气乖戾的人, 沙果\\nvi. 捕蟹, 偏航, 发牢骚\\nvt. 使偏航, 抱怨, 破坏",["The first person who ate crab must also have tried to eat a spider.","Look, look! On the branch of the orange tree, there is a blue hermit crab!"],["第一个吃螃蟹的人一定也吃过蜘蛛。","快看快看！橙子树的树枝上有一只蓝色的寄居蟹！"]],["satisfied","'sætisfaiәd","a. 感到满意的",["So far as this matter is concerned, I am completely satisfied.","We will tidy up our room so that Mom is satisfied."],["我對這件事感到十分滿意。","我们将要整理房间，这样妈妈就会满意了。"]],["worthy","'wә:ði","n. 杰出人物\\na. 有价值的, 可敬的, 值得的",["In fact, love is the only genuinely precious thing in life; it's also the only thing worthy of pursuit.","He thought, If I don't study hard, how can I be worthy of my countrymen?"],["其實愛情是人生唯一的、真正珍貴的；也是唯一的、真正值得追求的東西。","他想，如果不好好学习，怎么对得起祖国的人民呢？"]],["hydrogen","'haidrәdʒәn","n. 氢\\n[化] 氢H-2",["A water molecule has two hydrogen atoms and one oxygen atom.","The chemical symbol \"H\" stands for hydrogen."],["一個水分子是由兩個氫原子和一個氧原子組成的。","化学符号“H”表示氢。"]],["probability",".prɒbә'biliti","n. 可能性, 或然率, 几率, 概率\\n[化] 概率; 几率",["Tomorrow there's a high probability it will rain.","There's a strong probability of a nuclear tragedy."],["明天很有可能下雨。",""]],["farming","'fɑ:miŋ","n. 农业, 耕作",["The best refutation of the imaginary Malthusian laws of \"land depletion\" is the practice of Soviet collective farming.","Terrace farming is widely practiced in the mountainous regions of China."],["對馬爾薩斯虛構的「土地耗盡」定律最有力的反駁，是蘇聯集體農場的時間。",""]],["vinegar","'vinigә","n. 醋, 尖酸刻薄\\nvt. 加醋于",["Use lemon juice instead of vinegar.","You catch more flies with honey than you do with vinegar."],["用擰檬汁代替醋。",""]],["capitalism","'kæpitәlizәm","n. 资本主义\\n[经] 资本主义",["The Soviet people are not afraid of peaceful competition with capitalism.","They ended capitalism and built a socialist society."],["",""]],["advisory","әd'vaizәri","a. 顾问的, 咨询的, 劝告的\\n[法] 劝告的, 忠告的, 咨询的",["I received an advisory notice about my electricity cutting off this month.","The advisory board had a lot of qualms about her latest album, which she ended up releasing independently."],["",""]],["organizer","'ɒ:gәnaizә","n. 组织者, 编制者, 创立者, 组织导体\\n[医] 组织导体, 机化中心(胚)",["Ever the organizer, Reggie separates his Skittles into groupings of the same flavor before he eats them.","When it got dark, the party organizer said: \"Time to go\"."],["",""]],["remedy","'remidi","n. 药物, 治疗法, 治疗, 补救, 赔偿\\nvt. 治疗, 补救, 矫正, 改善, 修补, 修缮",["Smiling is the best remedy for negative emotions.","Maturity is a bitter disappointment for which no remedy exists, unless laughter could be said to remedy anything."],["笑容是壞心情的最佳藥方。",""]],["inability",".inә'biliti","n. 无能, 无力",["Out of all the attributes of the gods, the one I find most pitiable is their inability to commit suicide.","Superstitions derive from the inability of men to acknowledge that coincidences are merely coincidences."],["在神的所有特性中，我觉得最让人同情的是他们没办法自杀这一点。","迷信之所以存在，是因為人無法接受巧合只是巧合而已。"]],["smash","smæʃ","n. 打碎, 粉碎, 打碎时哗啦声, 猛击, 扣球, 杀球, 经营失败, 破产, 硬币, 假硬币\\na. 非常轰动的, 了不起的\\nvt.…",["I am really extremely angry, so I plan to smash things to vent my anger.","The people are like children: they must smash everything to see what is inside."],["我實在氣得不得了，所以打算砸東西發洩。",""]],["manuscript","'mænjuskript","n. 手稿, 原稿, 底稿\\na. 手写的",["After today, I want to send the manuscript to a publishing house.","He showed me the manuscript of his new play."],["天好以后，我要把稿子送到出版社去。","他给我看了他最新剧的底稿。"]],["morality","mә'ræliti","n. 道德, 教训, 品行\\n[法] 道德, 道义",["Gentleness and cheerfulness, these come before all morality; they are the perfect duties.","Today we are going to discuss this problem in terms of morality."],["良善和喜樂比道德更加重要，是我們所應盡的絕對義務。",""]],["hopeful","'hәupful","n. 有希望之人, 有前途之人\\na. 有希望的, 怀抱希望的, 保持乐观的",["The hopeful man sees success where others see failure, sunshine where others see shadows and storm.","Mary waits for the medical report feeling nervous but hopeful that she does not have cancer."],["",""]],["disagreement",".disә'gri:mәnt","n. 不合, 争论, 不一致\\n[法] 不一致, 不同意, 陪审团的意见不一",["They express disagreement by shaking their heads, which may indicate agreement in other countries.","It's clear that there's a rather strong disagreement between the two."],["他们以摇头表示不同意，而其他国家的人可能以摇头表示同意。","兩人之間明顯存在相當大的分歧。"]],["fancy","'fænsi","n. 想象力, 幻想, 喜好\\na. 想象的, 精美的, 新奇的, 奇特的, 高价的, 特级的\\nvt. 想象, 设想, 相信, 喜爱\\n…",["Tom and Mary stayed at a fancy hotel.","Tom and Mary stayed in a fancy hotel."],["汤姆和玛丽入住了一家高档酒店。","汤姆和玛丽入住了一家高档酒店。"]],["mandatory","'mændәtәri","a. 命令的, 托管的\\n[经] 受托者, 命令者",["The mandatory character of schooling is rarely analyzed in the multitude of works dedicated to the study of the various ways to develop within children the desire to learn.","A cooking course should be mandatory in schools."],["許多著作都致力於研究開發小孩學習慾望的方式，但其中很少會有作品分析學校教育的強制性角色。","烹饪课程应该作为学校的必修课。"]],["purely","'pjuәli","adv. 纯粹地, 清白地, 贞洁地",["To claim sex is binary requires ignoring intersex people, which is unscientific and purely ideological.","I wish to resign from my work for purely personal reasons."],["若要聲稱性別是二元的，就需要忽視陰陽人，這是不科學的，且純粹屬於意識形態問題。",""]],["dive","daiv","n. 潜水, 跳水\\nvi. 跳水, 俯冲, 猛冲\\nvt. 把...突然伸入",["The giant plane screamed down in an almost vertical dive.","Auto imports will take a nose-dive in the first quarter."],["",""]],["advertise","'ædvәtaiz","vt. 做广告, 通知, 公布\\nvi. 做广告",["Perhaps we should advertise in the local newspaper for a reliable house painter.","The company will advertise its new product on television."],["",""]],["soda","'sәudә","n. 苏打, 碳酸水\\n[化] 纯碱; 苏打; 碳酸钠",["Sodium bicarbonate is commonly known as baking soda.","There's a shortage of the soda I drink. None of the stores I've gone to have any."],["碳酸氫鈉通常被稱為小蘇打。","我喝的汽水缺貨了，我去的幾家店都沒貨了。"]],["bass","bæs","n. 低沉的声音, 男低音, 椴树\\na. 低音的",["He can't even tell a treble clef from a bass clef.","I want to do some bass fishing, but I don't know what to use for bait."],["他连高音谱号和低音谱号都分不清。",""]],["lesser","'lesә","a. 较少的, 较小的, 次要的",["The guild leader relegated Vince to a lesser officer because he was abusing his power.","Yanni pleased guilty for a lesser sentence: life in prison without a chance of parole."],["",""]],["shiny","'ʃaini","a. 有光泽的, 发光的, 辉煌的, 磨光的, 磨损的",["The brim of his soft felt hat hid every inch of his face but the shiny tip of his nose.","She decorated her notebook with gum wrappers so the cover was all shiny."],["",""]],["memo","'memәu","n. 备忘录\\n[经] 备忘录",["The company sent out a memo with an apology for the mistake.","Thanks, I'll file this memo away in the circular file."],["",""]],["junk","dʒʌŋk","n. 垃圾, 乌七八糟的东西, 舢板\\n[计] 清除",["Tom has no idea what to do with all the junk in his garage.","The antiques my father left when he died turned out to be nothing but worthless junk."],["汤姆不知道拿他车库的那些废物怎么办。","父親生前留下來的老古董，原來只是一堆不值錢的垃圾。"]],["stun","stʌn","vt. 使昏迷, 使震惊, 打昏\\nn. 昏迷, 猛击",["Israeli police is using stun grenades inside the al-Aqsa Mosque itself.","Israeli troops fired stun grenades at Muslim worshipers at the al-Aqsa Mosque."],["",""]],["devoted","di'vәutid","a. 投入的, 深爱的",["Because people in the world don't speak the same language, much effort is now devoted to translation.","He has been devoted to the study of atomic energy ever since he graduated from the university."],["因為世界上的人不是講同一種語言, 所以現在很多人努力致力於翻譯。","从他大学毕业后，他就一直致力于原子能的研究。"]],["mature","mә'tjuә","a. 成熟的, 到期的, 充分考虑的\\nvt. 使成熟\\nvi. 成熟, 到期",["He grew a beard to look more mature.","After mature reflection, I've decided to accept their offer."],["他留了胡子，为了让自己看起来更成熟。",""]],["manufacture",".mænju'fæktʃә","n. 产品, 制造\\nvt. 制造, 假造\\nvi. 制造",["Many companies have attempted to manufacture this complex component at scale, but so far only ours has succeeded.","You'll have to manufacture some kind of excuse."],["許多公司都嘗試過大規模生產這種複雜的零件，但目前只有我們成功了。","你不得不制造一些借口。"]],["poorly","'puәli","adv. 贫穷地, 不充分地, 贫乏地\\na. 身体不舒服的",["I've been feeling poorly for the last couple of days.","It's better to do nothing than to do something poorly."],["过去两天我觉得不太舒服。","什麼都不要做比做錯了好。"]],["affection","ә'fekʃәn","n. 影响, 病, 喜爱, 情感, 倾向\\n[医] 疾患, 病变, 病; 感情",["Though passion may have strained, it must not break our bonds of affection.","Everyone knows of his affection for that dog."],["雖然激情可能會褪去，但我們不能切斷感情上的聯繫。","人人都知道他對那狗的感情。"]],["warming","'wɔ:miŋ","n. 暖和, 加温, 暖热, 温暖, (非正式)打, 鞭打",["It is a term used to describe the warming of the earth due to increasing amounts of carbon dioxide in the atmosphere.","As global warming increases, sea levels get higher and higher."],["这个词指的是由于大气层里二氧化碳含量增多而导致全球变暖。","海面随着全球变暖的加剧而越来越高。"]],["stamp","stæmp","n. 印, 邮票, 打印器, 戳子, 图章, 印花税票, 标志, 特征, 类型, 跺脚\\nvt. 盖章于, 顿足, 贴上邮票, 铭刻, 捣…",["Put this stamp on the postcard and drop it in the mailbox.","Please don't forget to put a stamp on the letter before mailing it."],["把这张邮票贴在明信片上，然后投到邮箱里。","请不要忘记寄信前要在上面贴邮票。"]],["philosopher","fi'lɒsәfә","n. 哲学家, 哲人, 思想开创人, 达观的人\\n[法] 哲学家, 哲学研究者",["Russell was a brilliant philosopher, but even the simplest practical task was quite beyond him.","The philosopher Socrates discussed death with his friends in prison."],["羅素是一個極出色的哲學家，可是他對日常生活中的事務卻是一竅不通。","哲学家苏格拉底在监狱里和他的朋友们讨论死亡。"]],["colored","'kʌlәd","a. 染色的\\n[建] 有色的",["He saw brightly-colored birds, flowers and leaves.","The different colored strings indicate different fillings."],["他看见色彩鲜艳的鸟、花朵和树叶。","不同颜色的绳子表示不同的馅料。"]],["clutch","klʌtʃ","n. 抓紧, 掌握, 离合器, 一窝小鸡\\nvt. 抓住, 踩汽车离合器踏板\\nvi. 抓\\n[计] 联轴器; 离合器",["Tom pushed the clutch pedal down with his left foot.","The car stalled because you didn't step on the clutch."],["",""]],["silently","'sailәntli","adv. 默默地, 静静地",["As everyone stood guard silently, someone ran to the corner of the street and called over a police officer.","Bender often utters the phrase \"Kill all humans\", even if he always silently adds \"except one\" referring to Fry."],["默默守护中，有人跑到街头，叫来了协警。",""]],["breakdown","'breikdaun","n. 崩溃, 故障\\n[化] 事故; 击穿",["As a result of the server breakdown, total PV of yesterday dropped by 30% compared with normal.","As finals approached, I nearly had a nervous breakdown."],["由于服务器故障，昨天的总PV与正常相比下降了30%。",""]],["conceal","kәn'si:l","vt. 隐藏, 掩盖, 隐瞒\\n[法] 隐瞒, 隐匿, 保守秘密",["We can normally conceal our thoughts from others.","Tom couldn't conceal his disappointment."],["我们通常会对其他人隐瞒自己的想法.","汤姆不能掩饰他的失望。"]],["monitoring","'mɔnitәriŋ","[计] 监控, 监督, 监视\\n[经] 检验, 检查, 控制",["We were asked what our rights are in respect to CCTV monitoring at work.","Oliver thought that his parents, Tom and Mary, weren't setting rules or monitoring his whereabouts."],["",""]],["curl","kә:l","n. 拳曲, 鬈发\\nvt. 弄卷\\nvi. 拳曲, 弯曲",["On colder days, they curl up or dig a hole in the snow.","It's not the mode for young girls to curl their bangs."],["",""]],["kidney","'kidni","n. 肾, 个性\\n[医] 肾",["If he donates a kidney, he can survive with the other one.","I felt like I was dying. I got under the covers and shivered. Kidney stones are nothing to joke about."],["",""]],["nineteenth",".nain'ti:nθ","num. 第十九, 十九分之一",["Not until the end of the nineteenth century, did plant breeding become a scientific discipline.","Death and vulgarity are the only two facts in the nineteenth century that one cannot explain away."],["",""]],["goodness","'gudnis","n. 仁慈, 善良",["She felt something akin to holiness; well, she wasn't sure if it was that, but it felt like something stronger than goodness.","There is no odor so bad as that which arises from goodness tainted."],["",""]],["healing","'hi:liŋ","a. 治愈的, 恢复健康的\\n[计] 修复, 恢复",["These hot springs possess properties for healing wounds.","The faithful believe that this relic is imbued with healing properties."],["",""]],["remarkably","ri'mɑ:kәbli","adv. 显著地, 引人注目地, 非常地",["Her dark, almond-shaped eyes were remarkably beautiful.","My father aged remarkably during his convalescence."],["她那雙深色的杏仁眼非常美麗。",""]],["literacy","'litәrәsi","n. 读写能力, 识字, 精通文学",["Secondly, the literacy rate in Europe of that time was low.","Many new teachers feel ill-prepared to teach basic literacy and numeracy."],["",""]],["taxi","'tæksi","n. 出租车\\nvi. 乘出租车\\nvt. 用出租车送",["If he keeps drinking like that, he'll have to take a taxi home.","You ought to go by taxi, or you might not get there in time."],["如果他继续这样喝酒，他该乘出租车回家。","你最好乘出租車去，不然可能會趕不及。"]],["destiny","'destini","n. 命运, 定数",["Everyone ought to be the master of his own destiny.","You are the master of your own destiny."],["每個人都應該做自己命運的主人。","你才是自己命运的主人。"]],["geography","dʒi'ɒgrәfi","n. 地理学, 地理\\n[医] 地理",["In geography class, the teacher showed a globe to the students.","We expressed the hope that they could go abroad again to study geography."],["地理課上，老師向同學們展示了地球儀。","我们表示希望他们能再次出国学习地理。"]],["solo","'sәulәu","n. 独奏, 独唱, 单独表演\\na. 单独的, 独奏的, 独唱的\\nvi. 放单飞",["He overcame all sorts of hardship and setbacks to succeed in a solo crossing of Antarctica.","Famous vibraphonist Stefon Harris has recorded at least one balafon solo."],["他克服了種種困難和挫折，終於成功一個人越過了南極洲。","著名的鐵琴演奏家Stefon Harris已經錄製了至少一個巴拉風獨奏。"]],["leak","li:k","n. 漏洞, 漏处, 漏出, 泄漏\\nvi. 漏, 泄漏\\nvt. 使渗漏",["Don't let this information leak out.","The explosion may have been caused by a gas leak."],["不要让这些信息泄露出去。","這場爆炸有可能是瓦斯外洩引起的。"]],["greenhouse","'gri:nhaus","n. 温室",["Saving energy can reduce the emission of greenhouse gases into the atmosphere.","Some scientists believe that the greenhouse effect is imaginary."],["節約能源可減少溫室氣體排出到大氣層。","有的科學家認為溫室效應是虛構的。"]],["trillion","'triljәn","n. 大量\\n[经] 兆",["Apple made history Thursday when it became the first publicly listed U.S. company to be valued at $1 trillion.","The definition of trillion has always been the same in the United States, but has changed in the United Kingdom."],["",""]],["loving","'lʌviŋ","a. 亲爱的, 钟情的, 忠诚的",["To be in love is not the same as loving. You can be in love with a woman and still hate her.","Loving and being loved are the most joyful things in the world."],["被爱和爱一个人不同。你可以被一个人爱着的同时，却恨着这个人。","爱和被爱是世上最幸运的事。"]],["parliament","'pɑ:lәmәnt","n. 国会, 议会\\n[法] 会议, 国会, 议院",["The meetings of the parliament are public.","The President cannot disband the Parliament."],["國會的會議是公開的。","總統不得解散國會。"]],["expenditure","ik'spenditʃә","n. 开支, 费用, 用光, 消费额\\n[经] 支出, 费用, 消费",["We should strike a balance between our expenditure and income.","My income falls short of my expenditure by five hundred pounds."],["",""]],["homicide","'hɒmisaid","n. 杀人, 杀人者\\n[医] 杀人, 杀人者",["Make no mistake, we're looking at a homicide case.","Sami Bakir was working on a very complicated homicide."],["毫无疑问，我们正在调查一桩命案。",""]],["australian","ɒ'streiljәn","n. 澳大利亚人\\na. 澳大利亚的, 澳洲的, 澳洲人的",["Rugby, American football, and Australian rules football all come from soccer.","Wonderful was the fighting spirit of the Australian rugby team."],["",""]],["herd","hә:d","n. 兽群, 人群, 牧人\\nvt. 群集, 使成群, 放牧\\nvi. 聚在一起",["The newborn calf couldn't catch up with the herd running from the jaguar.","Tom saw a herd of horses grazing peacefully in the distance."],["新生小牛跟不上逃离美洲虎的牛群。",""]],["passionate","'pæʃәnit","a. 热情的, 热烈的, 易怒的, 热恋的",["He is a young man passionate for good design, games, software, art and people.","So passionate was his letter that she was moved to tears."],["",""]],["biblical","'biblikәl","a. 圣经的",["The biblical Tower of Babel is what architects call a ziggurat.","This refers specifically to the Biblical patriarch, the son of Abraham and father of Jacob."],["",""]],["addiction","ә'dikʃәn","n. 入迷, 瘾\\n[医] 瘾, 癖嗜",["There really is such a thing as Internet addiction.","Stopgap measures won't make a dent in drug addiction."],["确实有网瘾这回事。",""]],["probe","prәub","n. 探索, 调查, 探针, 探测器\\nv. 用探针探测, 调查, 探索",["The probe is equipped with a microphone.","I dare not probe too deeply, lest I uncover the awful truth!"],["探头配有麦克风。","我不敢探查得太深, 以免發現可怕的事實。"]],["psychiatrist","sai'kaiәtrist","n. 精神病医生, 精神病学家\\n[医] 精神病学家",["Dan placed his daughter, Linda, under the care of a psychiatrist.","That psychiatrist specialized in eating disorders."],["",""]],["pipeline","'paiplain","n. 管道, 传递途径\\n[化] 管路; 管线",["The single pipeline serves all the house with water.","This is the pipeline which supplies the town with gas."],["",""]],["hood","hud","n. 头巾, 兜帽, 覆盖, 强盗\\nvt. 罩上, 覆盖",["Currently, having a hood is part of young people's fashion.","The car had two broad stripes painted on the hood and the trunk."],["现代年轻人戴风帽是装一种派头。",""]],["atom","'ætәm","n. 原子, 核能, 微粒, 微量\\n[计] 原子",["A water molecule has two hydrogen atoms and one oxygen atom.","The universe is a gigantic atom and everything is affected by it."],["一個水分子是由兩個氫原子和一個氧原子組成的。",""]],["baking","'beikiŋ","n. 烘焙, 一次烘焙的量\\n[机] 烘, 焙, 烤干",["Sodium bicarbonate is commonly known as baking soda.","Put them on the baking pan and smear them with egg whites."],["碳酸氫鈉通常被稱為小蘇打。","將它們放在烤盤上並且塗抹蛋白。"]],["positively","","adv. 明确地, 肯定地, 无疑地, (非正式)确实地, 真正地",["If you could think positively every day, it would help you to live a lot better.","The good team spirit in the work group is valued positively."],["",""]],["snack","snæk","n. 小吃, 点心, 快餐\\nvi. 吃零食, 吃快餐",["There's enough time for a quick snack.","The mooncake is a kind of Chinese snack."],["有足夠的時間很快地吃一下點心。","月饼是中国点心的一种。"]],["ending","'endiŋ","n. 终止, 终了, 收场\\n[医] 末梢",["Some foreign words and names are not declined in Russian, usually depending on the ending and gender.","People can begin to love when they choose, but they have no choice when it comes to ending love."],["有些外來語和人名在俄語中沒有變格，通常取決於詞尾和性別。","人們或可選擇何時開始戀愛，但它的終結卻不由人。"]],["charming","'tʃɑ:miŋ","a. 迷人的, 有吸引力的",["Jane is fat and rude, and smokes too much. However, Ken thinks she's lovely and charming. That's why they say love is blind.","She never wears makeup, but she always looks very charming."],["Jane 又胖、又沒禮貌、又煙不離手，可是 Ken 卻覺得她可愛、動人，所謂「愛情是盲目的」，大概就是這個意思了吧。","她從不化妝, 但總是看起來很迷人。"]],["migrant","'maigrәnt","n. 候鸟, 移居者\\n[法] 移居者",["There are many migrant farm-worker children at our school.","Migrant birds such as the sandhill crane fly overhead, moving south."],["",""]],["competence","'kɒmpitәns","n. 胜任, 职称, 能力\\n[医] 能力, 活性",["But English competence is not everything when it comes to writing well.","I have always admired his competence in reading and understanding complex texts."],["",""]],["supplement","'sʌplimәnt","n. 补充物, 增刊, 补充, 补遗, 补编, 附录, 补角\\nvt. 补充, 增补",["You had better supplement your diet with vitamins.","Farmers often moonlight to supplement their incomes."],["",""]],["ink","iŋk","n. 墨水, 墨汁\\nvt. 涂墨水于, 签署, 加墨水",["An octopus can release ink when it gets into danger.","Please replace the empty ink cartridge in the printer."],["章魚遇到危險時會噴出墨汁。","请把打印机里面的空的墨粉鼓换掉。"]],["distress","di'stres","n. 苦恼, 贫困, 痛苦\\nvt. 使苦恼\\na. 亏本出售的",["The distress call of a young dolphin has been used to lure a large pod of the animals to safety.","Many people were plunged into distress by the news."],["",""]],["homeowner","'hәum.әunә","n. 私房屋主；自己拥有住房者",["This policy will indemnify the homeowner against flood damage.","The angry homeowner wanted his house repainted."],["",""]],["adaptation",".ædæp'teiʃәn","n. 适应, 改编, 改编本\\n[医] 适应[作用]",["In addition to writing the manga, Katsushiro Otomo also directed its film adaptation.","Fans of the original comic had a field day with the myriad continuity issues of the movie adaptation."],["",""]],["imagery","'imidʒәri","n. 肖像, 比喻, 雕刻\\n[化] 成像",["The careful use of evocative imagery is an important part of building a successful advertising campaign.","Satellite imagery is being used in an effort to narrow down the area in the Indian Ocean where floating debris has been observed."],["",""]],["pledge","pledʒ","n. 诺言, 保证, 誓言, 抵押, 信物, 保人, 祝愿\\nvt. 许诺, 保证, 使发誓, 抵押, 典当, 举杯祝...健康",["Unity, justice and freedom are the pledge of fortune.","This is my solemn pledge: I will work to build a single nation of justice and opportunity."],["团结、公正和自由是幸福的保证。",""]],["infect","in'fekt","vt. 传染, 感染\\n[医] 传染, 感染",["Studies indicate that the world can expect about five new animal-borne pathogens to infect humans each year.","Making matters worse, schools often sent the sickest children home to infect families and communities."],["",""]],["paradigm","'pærәdaim","n. 范例, 式样, 词形变化表, 纵聚合关系语言项",["We need to postulate a completely different paradigm to explain all these phenomena.","The reduction of subsidies to the Cultural Heritage sector requires the adoption of a new paradigm."],["",""]],["backward","'bækwәd","adv. 向后地, 相反地\\na. 向后的, 相反的\\n[计] 倒推",["Social conditions are going backward rather than forward.","He bent over backward to please his wife."],["社會不是在進步，而是在退步。","他竭尽全力地讨好他老婆。"]],["appetite","'æpitait","n. 食欲, 欲望, 爱好\\n[医] 食欲",["After skiing, I find that I have a voracious appetite.","If you want to lose weight, then you need to control your appetite."],["滑完雪后，我发现我食欲大增。","想要减肥就必须控制食欲。"]],["hierarchy","'haiәrɑ:ki","n. 等级制度, 僧侣统治, 等级体系\\n[计] 分级结构; 分层结构; 新闻组, 新闻组分层",["He thinks it's completely clear that you're higher up in the hierarchy.","There's a very rigid hierarchy in the Civil Service."],["",""]],["offend","ә'fend","v. 犯罪, 冒犯, 违反, 进攻",["In conversation among the small grasses, do not offend the big tree.","As the saying goes: As long as you don't offend me, I won't offend you. But there's another saying: To strike first means victory, to strike second means tragedy."],["小草间的对话不要得罪大树。","俗話說：人不犯我，我不犯人；可俗話又說：先下手為強，後下手遭殃!"]],["reconstruction",".ri:kәn'strʌkʃәn","n. 改造, 再建\\n[医] 改建, 改造, 翻造",["Support for post-genocidal war reconciliation and reconstruction is vital.","Benefits accrue to the community from reconstruction."],["",""]],["sympathetic",".simpә'θetik","a. 有同情心的, 合意的, 赞成的\\nn. 交感神经, 容易感受的人",["Layla seemed to be sympathetic to Sami's situation.","Tom told Mary that she should quit pretending to be sympathetic."],["",""]],["hostility","hɒs'tiliti","n. 敌意, 敌对, 反对",["The burning of the Quran fosters an environment of hostility and religious intolerance.","Tolerating hate speech perpetuates division and hostility."],["",""]],["condom","'kɒndәm","n. 避孕套\\n[医] 阴茎套",["Giggling with embarrassment, she held out the condom.","Sorry, but there's no way it's happening without a condom."],["她害羞地笑着拿出了避孕套。","對不起，但是沒有避孕套的話是絕對不行的。"]],["temporarily","'tempәrәrәli","adv. 暂时, 一时, 临时",["This kind of medicine can temporarily alleviate pain. If you need it, just take it.","Because of fighting in the region, the oil supply was temporarily cut off."],["这种药可以暂时缓解身体的疼痛，你需要的话就拿去吧。",""]],["spectator","spek'teitә","n. 观众, 目击者, 旁观者",["The position of being holier than thou is really easy to take when you are a spectator.","Tom has no interest whatsoever in spectator sports."],["",""]],["litigation",".liti'geiʃәn","n. 诉讼, 起诉\\n[经] 诉讼, 纠葛",["Death is not the end. There remains the litigation over the estate.","Tom cynically assumed that the contractor could likely not afford the expense of years of litigation."],["",""]],["comet","'kɒmit","n. 彗星",["Halley's Comet comes round once every eighty years.","Rosetta will try to land on a comet in a few hours."],["",""]],["bleed","bli:d","vi. 流血, 悲痛, 渗出\\nvt. 使出血, 榨取",["His wounded leg began to bleed again.","A mind all logic is like a knife all blade. It makes the hand bleed that uses it."],["他受傷的腳又開始流血了。",""]],["cocktail","'kɒkteil","n. 鸡尾酒, 开味品\\na. 鸡尾酒会的",["You can decorate the cocktail with a cherry or a pineapple.","Tom doesn't like cocktail parties because he finds making small talk difficult."],["你可以用一个樱桃或菠萝来装饰这杯鸡尾酒。",""]],["explicitly","","adv. 明确地；明白地",["I don't like it when mathematicians who know much more than I do can't express themselves explicitly.","While video platforms do not explicitly ban such content, works of this type will have their traffic restricted."],["我不喜欢那些数学家知道的比我多得多，却不知道清楚地表达自己。","虽然视频平台没有明确禁止此类内容，但这种类型的作品的流量会被限制。"]],["choke","tʃәuk","vt. 窒息, 阻塞, 噎, 抑制\\nvi. 窒息, 阻塞, 噎\\nn. 窒息, 噎, 阻气门",["For some reason I choke whenever I drink something.","You have to pace yourself or you'll choke halfway through."],["",""]],["ensemble","ɒn'sɒŋblә","n. 全体, 合唱曲, (女人的)全套服装\\n[化] 总体; 整体; 系综",["No ensemble can convey a composer's intent more forcefully than an orchestra.","Some school uniforms incorporate a white camisole into the ensemble."],["",""]],["pesticide","'pestisaid","n. 杀虫剂\\n[化] 农药",["The pesticide degraded the health of the microbiome within the soil.","She sprayed pesticide on the flowers."],["",""]],["pea","pi:","n. 豌豆, 似豌豆的东西",["In the shadow of the Leaning Tower of Pisa sits the town storyteller, eating a bowl of pea soup. After that he tells some children the fairy tale \"The Princess and the Pea\".","It was Mendel's good fortune that the arrival of the pea weevil postdated the completion of the pea part of his research."],["在比萨斜塔的塔阴下，坐着这城市的童话讲述家，他正在吃一碟豌豆汤。 之后他将给小孩子们讲述童话“豌豆上的公主”。",""]],["delegate","'deligeit","n. 代表\\nvt. 委派...为代表",["She must learn to delegate her responsibilities. She cannot do everything herself.","Micromanagers often find it very hard to delegate work to others."],["",""]],["preservation",".prezә'veiʃәn","n. 保存, 保藏, 保护\\n[医] 保藏, 保存, 防腐",["The third is the preservation of environment. In this case, the conservation of energy and resources is needed.","Jealousy is the undue concern about the preservation of that which can only be lost if not worth keeping."],["",""]],["rotation","rәu'teiʃәn","n. 旋转, 循环, 轮流\\n[计] 旋转",["Growing up, my dad's spinach lasagna was on weekly rotation at our dinner table.","One rotation of the earth around its own axis takes exactly twenty-three hours and fifty-six minutes."],["",""]],["cautious","'kɒ:ʃәs","a. 谨慎的, 小心的",["As far as Bob is concerned, anything goes. By contrast, Jane is very cautious.","After the encouraging preliminary results, the mood at campaign headquarters was one of cautious optimism."],["",""]],["tremble","'trembl","n. 战栗, 颤抖\\nvi. 战栗, 忧虑, 摇晃",["The terrible scene made him tremble in fear.","The mere idea of swimming across the river made me tremble."],["令人震惊的场面让他吓得发抖。",""]],["affordable","","[计] 普及型",["The laptop provides cutting-edge technology at an affordable price.","Fifteen per cent of the housing will be affordable, so that low-income families will be able to buy or rent homes in the area."],["這款筆記型電腦價格親民，技術領先。","百分之十五的房屋将是经济适用，所以低收入家庭会在这个地区买或者租房子。"]],["prejudice","'predʒudis","n. 偏见, 成见, 侵害\\nvt. 使存偏见, 使有成见, 侵害",["The ambitions of some Americans are limited by failing schools and hidden prejudice and the circumstances of their birth.","I don't have a prejudice against foreign workers."],["一些美國人的抱負因學校教育不完美、隱性的偏見和出生環境而受到限制。","我对外籍员工没有偏见。"]],["certificate","sә'tifikeit","n. 证书, 证明书\\nvt. 发给证明书, 用证书批准, 用证书证明",["Please attach a certificate of quality.","If you have a certificate of immunization, please bring it when you come."],["請附上質量證明書。",""]],["designate","'dezigneit","vt. 指定, 指明, 称呼\\na. 已选出而未上任的",["The World Health Organization will decide Thursday whether to designate the coronavirus outbreak a global health emergency.","Work and play are words used to designate the same thing under different conditions."],["",""]],["robe","rәub","n. 宽松长袍, 礼服, 披肩, 覆盖物\\nv. (给)穿长袍",["I use Yan garments as my plain robe, and turn Liqiu into ruins.","I would like to get a robe as a Christmas present."],["以兗衣為褋兮，以黎邱為墟。",""]],["abruptly","ә'brʌptli","adv. 突然地, 唐突地",["His untidy room announced that he had abruptly departed.","If these drugs are stopped abruptly, then some withdrawal symptoms may occur."],["从他凌乱的房间可以看出他离开的时候很着急。","如果这些药突然被停了，那可能会出现一些戒断症状。"]],["mercy","'mә:si","n. 仁慈, 宽恕, 慈悲, 怜悯, 幸运\\n[法] 权宜处置权, 决定权, 宽恕",["The poor people were at the mercy of the cruel dictator.","These poor people were at the mercy of the cruel dictator."],["可憐的人民任憑殘暴的獨裁者處置。",""]],["cult","kʌlt","n. 膜拜, 礼拜式, 祭仪, 一群信徒\\n[医] 迷信, 巫术",["That religious cult has got some pretty off the wall ideas.","In the religious-cult trial, the ambitious lawyer will represent the cult leader."],["",""]],["classmate","'klɑ:smeit","n. 同班同学",["My classmate, Xiao Ming, has strong managerial capability.","Today, my classmate saw you guys shopping at Auchan."],["小明同学管理能力很强。","今天我同学看到你们在欧尚买东西。"]],["nursing","'nә:siŋ","n. 看护, 养育\\n[医] 护理[法], 喂乳[法]",["There is a bus stop near a nursing home in Cologne. No bus ever stops there. It's created for the purpose of finding mental patients on the run more easily.","Be nice to your kids. They'll choose your nursing home, after all."],["在科隆一家疗养院的附近有一个公交车站。这一站没有任何公交车停靠。它是为更加容易地寻找逃跑的精神病患者而设立的。",""]],["motel","mәu'tel","n. 汽车旅馆",["A motel is like a hotel only much smaller and is used mostly by people traveling by automobile.","Layla found Sami at a small motel in Vegas where he was living with his new wife, Salima."],["",""]],["hatred","'heitrid","n. 憎恨, 仇恨, 憎恶\\n[法] 敌意, 憎恨, 憎恶",["The bold man glanced at the gangster with hatred and contempt.","Suddenly, there was a period of terrible violence and hatred between blacks and whites."],["",""]],["diameter","dai'æmitә","n. 直径\\n[医] 直经, 径",["Is it possible to determine the diameter from the circumference?","Atherosclerosis reduces the inner diameter of arteries."],["用圓周能不能求得直徑？",""]],["enlist","in'list","vt. 征募, 参与, 谋取\\nvi. 从军, 应募, 赞助",["Tom's father opposed his decision to enlist in the army.","My father opposed my decision to enlist in the special forces."],["",""]],["acute","ә'kju:t","a. 尖锐的, 敏锐的, 激烈的, 严重的, 急性的\\n[医] 急性的; 尖锐的",["Her acute observation skills make her a very suitable photographer.","He's suffering from acute pain in his life."],["她因为敏锐的观察力，很适合当一名摄影师。","他一生為急性疼痛所苦。"]],["predecessor",".predi'sesә","n. 前任, 先辈, 前身\\n[医] 初牙, 前辈, 祖先",["Floppy disks are the predecessor of hard disks.","The Gospel according to John was probably written about fifty years after its predecessor."],["软盘是硬盘的前身。",""]],["induce","in'dju:s","vt. 引诱, 招致, 归纳出, 感应\\n[医] 诱导, 感应",["Moderate exercise in the evening helps induce sleep.","Because of the increasing risk of complications the doctor decided to induce labor."],["",""]],["rookie","'ruki","n. 新手",["Frankly speaking, in that GP Vettel was driving like a rookie.","After being considered a rookie for most of her career, she came in from the cold after an upset victory against a legend."],["",""]],["disclosure","dis'klәuʒә","n. 揭发, 泄露, 揭发(或暴露)的事实\\n[经] 揭示, 披露",["To get technical information from that company, we first have to sign a non-disclosure agreement.","We had to agree to total confidentiality and sign a non-disclosure agreement."],["",""]],["juvenile","'dʒu:vinail","n. 少年, 少年读物\\na. 少年的, 不成熟的, 适于少年的",["Juvenile crimes have been increasing recently.","Recently juvenile delinquency has been on the rise."],["少年犯罪最近一直在增长。",""]],["gown","gaun","n. 睡衣, 法衣, 大学全体师生\\nvt. 使穿睡衣",["Life is a magnificent gown full of lice.","The ravishing beauty queen wearing a blue velvet gown with a plunging neckline struck a pose on the red carpet."],["生命是一袭华美的袍子，爬满了虱子。",""]],["notably","'nәjtbәli","adv. 显著地, 著名地, 尤其, 特别",["Shanghai is so prosperous; notably it was after the port was opened for trade one hundred and sixty years ago that things started to change.","Several of the original signatories, notably the countries with the largest military forces, declined to consider a new treaty."],["上海那么繁荣，主要是一百六十年前开埠以后发生的变化。",""]],["correlate","'kɒrәleit","n. 有相互关系的东西, 相关物\\nvt. 使有相互关系\\nvi. 相关",["The most merciful thing in the world, I think, is the inability of the human mind to correlate all its contents.","Some of the work in the workbook doesn't correlate with the readings in the textbook."],["",""]],["halt","hɒ:lt","n. 停止, 立定, 休息\\nvt. 使停止, 使立定\\nvi. 立定, 停止, 蹒跚, 踌躇, 有缺点\\n[计] 停止",["As the train came to a halt, all of the passengers wondered what was happening.","After business came to a halt, many bathhouses added new facilities, such as saunas and exercise equipment, in an effort to attract customers."],["当列车停止时，所有的乘客都想知道发生了什么。","生意停頓了以後，許多公共浴堂都添置了桑拿浴室、健身器材等的新設備，希望能吸引多點人來光顧。"]],["persistent","pә'sistәnt","a. 固执的, 坚持的, 持续的, 作用持久的\\n[法] 坚持的, 固执的, 持续的",["Be patient and persistent. These things take time.","His success is due more to his persistent hard work than to his talent."],["耐心地坚持下去，这些事急不来。","他的成功來自他不斷的努力多於來自他的才能。"]],["humanitarian","hju:.mæni'tєәriәn","n. 人道主义者, 博爱者, 基督凡人论者\\na. 人道主义的, 博爱的, 凡人论的",["The phrase \"humanitarian bombing\" is an oxymoron.","This humanitarian group looks for volunteers to distribute meals to the homeless during the month of December."],["「人道主義轟炸」一詞是自相矛盾的。",""]],["torture","'tɒ:tʃә","n. 拷问, 苦闷\\nvt. 拷问, 曲解, 折磨, 使弯曲",["The cruelty of the torture in the police station is beyond description.","The torture made him confess to crimes he had not committed."],["",""]],["exile","'eksail","n. 放逐, 流放, 被放逐者\\nvt. 放逐, 流放, 使背井离乡",["No one shall be subjected to arbitrary arrest, detention or exile.","There, behold, / matrons and men, a miserable band, / gathered for exile."],["",""]],["chorus","'kɒ:rәs","n. 合唱队, 齐声\\nv. 齐声说道, 合唱",["We tried hard to get first prize in the chorus contest.","He threw in the towel in defeat when his favorite chorus girl married another man."],["",""]],["roar","rɒ:","n. 吼, 咆哮, 轰鸣\\nvi. 吼, 大声说出, 叫喊, 喧闹\\nvt. 呼喊, 使轰鸣",["The applause grew to a roar when Pinocchio, the famous donkey, appeared in the circus ring.","His cries for help were drowned by the roar of the surf."],["",""]],["architectural",".ɑ:ki'tektʃәrәl","a. 有关建筑的, 建筑学的",["This is a superb illustration of how Emmet modified the traditional architectural designs.","It is beyond the scope of the present work to describe all the components that comprise Emmet's architectural style."],["",""]],["comic","'kɒmik","n. 连环漫画, 喜剧演员, 滑稽的人\\na. 滑稽的, 有趣的, 喜剧的",["The comic downloader that I wrote will be released this Sunday.","All the characters of this comic are girls."],["我編寫的漫畫下載器將於本週日發布。","这部漫画登场的人物全是少女。"]],["revive","ri'vaiv","vt. 使苏醒, 使复兴, 使振奋, 回想起, 重播\\nvi. 苏醒, 复活, 复兴, 恢复精神",["You'll never be able to revive someone who is only pretending to be dead.","Tom's heart stopped, but the doctors managed to revive him."],["你永远都无法救活一个装死的人。",""]],["fountain","'fauntin","n. 水源, 源, 喷泉, 泉水, 本源\\n[医] 泉",["Water springs out of a fountain, flows downwards in a brook, runs in a beck, stands in a pond, glides in the stream, is whirled about in a whirlpool and causes fens.","The plating on this fountain pen has worn off."],["水從噴泉中湧出，在溪流中向下流，在溪澗中奔走，在池塘中安定，在河流中順勢流，在漩渦中迴旋，並形成沼澤。","这支钢笔的镀层被磨掉了。"]],["revenge","ri'vendʒ","n. 报仇, 复仇, 报复\\nvt. 报仇, 报复",["There is nothing which exacts a higher price than revenge, yet is so futile.","They set fire to their neighbour's house in revenge."],["没有什么东西比复仇更昂贵，更无益。","為了報仇，他們放火燒了鄰居的家。"]],["sour","'sauә","a. 酸的, 酸臭的, 发酵的, 愠怒的, 讨厌的, 拙劣的, 不健全的\\nvi. 变酸, 发酵, 厌烦, 变坏\\nvt. 使变酸, 使失…",["Those grapes look sweet, but in fact they're sour.","I will eat sweet and sour spareribs tonight."],["那些葡萄看起來很甜，但其實是酸的。","今天晚上吃糖醋排骨。"]],["unclear",".ʌn'kliә","a. 不易了解的, 不清楚的, 含混的",["Software development as an industry is very adaptable, so it's unclear whether AI will significantly disrupt the programming job market.","The man I spoke to on the telephone was unclear as to how much firewood we actually needed to bring."],["軟體開發業的適應力很強，因此 AI 是否會對程式設計的就業市場造成重大衝擊，目前仍不明朗。",""]],["endangered","in'deindʒәd","a. 有生命危险的；濒临灭绝的",["I still can't believe they had a snow leopard in that zoo. I thought they were an endangered species.","California condors are endangered by lead poisoning."],["我还不敢想象他们在那个动物园里有一个雪豹，我以为它们是一种濒危物种。",""]],["reside","ri'zaid","vi. 住, 居留, 属于\\n[法] 居住",["Even at night, the street where I reside is too noisy.","It doesn't snow very often in the area where I reside."],["",""]],["empirical","em'pirikәl","a. 完全跟据经验的, 经验主义的\\n[医] 经验主义的",["In its more extreme variants, cis ideology can include denial of the empirical reality of intersex and transgender people.","Grammar is an empirical science, not a theoretical one."],["在更極端的變體中，順性別意識形態可能包括否認陰陽人和跨性別者的現實經歷。",""]],["caution","'kɒ:ʃәn","n. 小心, 慎重, 警示\\nvt. 警告\\n[计] 警告",["Exercise caution in your business affairs, for the world is full of trickery.","If you drive with anything less than extreme caution, you're risking your life."],["",""]],["originate","ә'ridʒineit","vt. 创始, 发明, 发起\\nvi. 发源, 发生, 起航\\n[计] 发自",["The agonies of the machine age do not originate from the machines as such.","The Yautja originate from the distant planet known as Yautja Prime."],["",""]],["lure","luә","n. 饵, 诱惑\\nvt. 引诱, 诱惑",["No man can resist the lure of a woman.","Their commendable social policies lure vulnerable individuals into supporting their harmful economic policies."],["没有男人能够抵挡女人的诱惑。",""]],["compile","kәm'pail","vt. 编译, 编辑, 编纂, 收集\\n[计] 编译",["I have tried to compile the ideas that you proposed prior to the meeting, so that we can use them as the base for the discussion.","Compile an essay on that topic within a fixed number of letters."],["",""]],["nationally","'næʃәnәli","adv. 作为整个民族, 举国一致地, 全国性地",["The result placed him amongst the top one percent nationally.","Heavy downpours are increasing nationally, especially over the last three to five decades."],["",""]],["erupt","i'rʌpt","vi. 爆发\\nvt. 喷出",["I feel like a volcano ready to erupt at any moment.","The mid-ocean ridge consists of thousands of individual volcanoes or volcanic ridge segments which periodically erupt."],["",""]],["loom","lu:m","n. 织布机, 若隐若现的景象\\nvi. 朦胧地出现, 隐约可见, 可怕地出现",["After I tried out my new loom, I made my bed and repaired the coffee grinder.","Few people weave their own fabric on a loom these days."],["",""]],["notable","'nәutәbl","n. 著名人士, 值得注意之事物\\na. 值得注意的, 显著的",["The trigonometric functions satisfy a wide array of notable algebraic identities.","The language by itself doesn't have any notable value unless it is applied practically."],["三角函數滿足各種代數恆等式。",""]],["witch","witʃ","n. 巫婆, 女巫\\nvt. 施巫术, 迷惑",["The wicked witch cast a spell on the man and turned him into a bug.","The wicked witch cast an evil spell on the man and turned him into an insect."],["惡毒的巫婆在男人身上施了咒語，把他變成了一隻蟲子。",""]],["endorsement","in'dɒ:smәnt","n. 支持, 认可, 背书\\n[经] 背书, 担保, 保证",["A translation is not an endorsement.","Actors and sports stars often parlay their celebrity into endorsement deals."],["翻譯不代表認可。",""]],["dusty","'dʌsti","a. 灰尘多的, 无聊的, 含糊的, 粉末状的",["Our mountains have been trying to tell history to dusty towns for a long time, my friend.","The road is dusty. It cannot have rained yesterday."],["",""]],["cane","kein","n. 手杖, 细长的茎, 藤条\\nvt. 以杖击, 以藤编制",["Thoreau coveted the plant's strong purple stalk for a cane, and the robins eat its dark crimson-juiced berries.","A staff is used to help steady yourself when walking, much like a cane."],["梭羅垂涎於這種植物強壯的紫色莖稈，將其製成藤條，而知更鳥則以深紅色汁液的漿果為食。",""]],["fortunate","'fɒ:tʃәnit","a. 幸运的, 幸福的",["You are very fortunate that you have such friends.","I realized how fortunate I was and how many second chances life has given me."],["你们很幸运有这样的朋友们。","我意识到我是多么的幸运，命运给了我这么多重来的机会。"]],["rap","ræp","n. 轻敲, 拍击, 责骂, 无价值的东西\\nvt. 轻敲, 厉声说出, 叱责, 抢走, 使着迷\\nvi. 敲击, 发敲击声, 交谈, 同…",["Yeah, but I'll have to take the rap if they slip up.","Serpents have had a bad rap ever since the Garden of Eden."],["",""]],["forge","fɒ:dʒ","n. 熔炉, 铁工厂\\nvt. 打制, 锻造, 伪造\\nvi. 锻造, 伪造",["If elected president, my pledge is to forge a grand bargain to stop gender-based violence.","Algeria needs to forge a path for others to follow."],["",""]],["surgical","'sә:dʒikl","a. 外科的, 外科医生的, 手术上的\\nn. 外科病例, 外科病房, 外科手术",["For these patients, surgical treatment is far from being satisfactory.","A bilateral salpingectomy, which is the surgical removal of both Fallopian tubes, will result in sterility."],["",""]],["aging","'eidʒiŋ","n. 老化, 变陈\\n[计] 老化, 陈化",["An aging population will require more spending on health care.","My siblings have left it to me to take care of my aging mother."],["老龄化的人口需要更多医疗保健支出。",""]],["disrupt","dis'rʌpt","a. 分裂的, 中断的\\nvt. 使分裂, 使瓦解",["Don't eat too much and disrupt the stomach's normal digestion process.","Software development as an industry is very adaptable, so it's unclear whether AI will significantly disrupt the programming job market."],["不要因为吃得太多而扰乱胃的正常消化。","軟體開發業的適應力很強，因此 AI 是否會對程式設計的就業市場造成重大衝擊，目前仍不明朗。"]],["breakthrough","'breikθru:","n. 突破\\n[经] 突破, 新发现, 新进展",["After many years of grueling training, she finally made a breakthrough and won the championship.","Tom Jackson reprised his role in the sequel to his breakthrough movie."],["经过多年的刻苦训练，她终于破茧成蝶，赢得了冠军。",""]],["established","is'tæbliʃt","a. (被)建立的, 固定的, 既定的, 确定的, 确认的, 确立的, (被)制定的\\n[计] 确定的, 既定的",["The security level, as established by the Department of Homeland Security, is orange.","In order to alleviate employment pressures, the nation has established a series of relevant policies."],["根据国土安全部的规定，目前的安全水准是橙色等级。","为了缓解就业压力，国家已经制定了一系列相关政策。"]],["specialized","","a. 专门的, 特别的, 专科的, 特化的, 专化的\\n[计] 专业化的",["This kind of specialized knowledge has very little to do with daily life.","Tourism from specialized cruise ships is increasing rapidly."],["",""]],["odor","'әudә","n. 气味, 香味, 名声, 意味\\n[医] 气味",["The attic was a long, low-ceilinged room, dark and fragrant with the odor of the cedar.","What a disgusting and stupid vice smoking is! Lighting a cigarette and sucking in the smoke. Breathing a dangerous threat to your health into your lungs. Exhaling a foul odor."],["閣樓是一個狹長的低矮房間，光線昏暗，瀰漫著雪松的香氣。","吸烟真是又恶心又低俗！点根烟然后吸，把这些危害健康的气体吸进肺里，然后呼出肮脏的气味。"]],["slim","slim","a. 瘦的, 苗条的, 微小的, 稀少的, 微薄的\\nvi. 变苗条\\nvt. 使苗条",["When my grandmother was young, her body was very slim. Now in her old age she's grown plump.","His body type is born balanced! Wide shoulders, slim waist, belly not popping outwards."],["我奶奶年轻的时候身材很苗条，现在年纪大了就发福了。","他的体形生得很匀称！肩膀宽，腰身窄，肚子又没凸出来。"]],["desirable","di'zairәbl","a. 令人想望的, 可取的",["It is the things that we do not possess which seem to us most desirable.","It is desirable that you should attend the meeting."],["得不到的东西就最想得到。",""]],["remains","ri'meins","n. 剩余物, 废墟, 残余\\n[法] 遗体, 尸体, 遗骸",["The balance of public opinion remains in his favor.","The crash was and remains to date the deadliest airplane accident on Canadian soil."],["公众意见的平衡仍是他的关切。","這起空難是迄今為止加拿大境內最嚴重的空難。"]],["lobbyist","'lɔbiist","n. 说客\\n[法] 院外活动集团成员",["Tom is a lobbyist."],[""]],["alert","ә'lә:t","a. 警觉的, 灵敏的, 留心的\\nn. 警报\\nvt. 使警觉, 通知, 使意识到",["Alert, in Nunavut, Canada, is the northernmost permanently inhabited place in the world.","The meteorological bureau has issued a red rainstorm alert."],["加拿大努納武特地區的阿勒特是世界上最北端的永久居住地。","气象局发布了暴雨红色预警。"]],["allege","ә'ledʒ","vt. 宣称, 主张, 提出, 断言\\n[法] 断言, 指称, 指证",["To leave poor me you have the strength of laws, since why to love I can allege no cause.","I allege that you are wrong, so I don't want to say a word anymore."],["",""]],["countryside","'kʌntrisaid","n. 乡下地方, 乡下居民",["My parents live a carefree life in the countryside.","I also come from the countryside, so I have a first-hand understanding of poverty."],["我父母在乡村过着无忧无虑的生活。","我也是从农村出来的，对贫困有着切身感受。"]],["avenue","'ævәnju:","n. 大街, 途径, 林荫路",["They explored every avenue in an attempt to avoid war.","I'd like to do shopping on Fifth Avenue in New York."],["他们尽一切手段避免战争。","我想在紐約的第五大道購物。"]],["hut","hʌt","n. 小屋, 茅舍, 临时军营\\nv. (使)住在茅舍",["The roof of the hut groaned under the weight of the snow.","The hut kept the rain and dew out after a fashion."],["",""]],["attain","ә'tein","vt. 达到, 获得\\nvi. 达到",["To attain accreditation, the college had to meet 16 standards.","There is no dream of man which atomic power does not promise a chance to attain."],["",""]],["sixteen","'siks'ti:n","num. 十六, 十六个",["Only sixteen percent of the teachers at the school are female.","Today is the twenty-third of November twenty-sixteen."],["这所学校的老师只有百分之十六是女性。","今天是二零一六年十一月二十三日。"]],["holding","'hәuldiŋ","n. 把持, 支持, 保持\\n[法] 租借地, 占有物, 拥有的财产",["My schoolmate is holding a map of Beijing in his hand.","You're holding the book upside-down. This is upside-down and this is right-side up."],["学友的手里正拿着北京地图呢。","你把书拿反了，这是反面，这才是正面。"]],["dinosaur","'dainәsɒ:","n. 恐龙",["As tectonic plates shifted, uniquely adapted species of dinosaur emerged on each continent through vicariance.","Coming face to face with a dinosaur was a funny experience."],["隨著板塊的移動，各大洲因地理隔離而出現了適應不同環境的獨特恐龍物種。","和一只恐龙面对面是一段有趣的经历。"]],["excite","ik'sait","vt. 刺激, 使兴奋, 激励",["In order to hold on to information, she says the neurons have to excite each other through network connections.","Every day brings new questions and answers that excite his curious mind greatly."],["",""]],["urgent","'ә:dʒәnt","a. 紧急的, 急迫的, 催逼的\\n[经] 紧急的, 急迫的",["If there's anything urgent, you can get in touch with me.","There is an urgent need for medical supplies."],["紧急情况下，您可以联系我。","急需醫療用品。"]],["choir","'kwaiә","n. 唱诗班, 唱诗班的席位\\nv. 合唱",["She has been invited to sing in a choir in a foreign country.","He assigned the kazoo parts to a large four-part men's choir."],["",""]],["pronounce","prә'nauns","v. 发音, 宣告, 断言",["People shouldn't be allowed to invade countries whose names they can't pronounce correctly.","I can't tell you how to pronounce the word."],["人们不应该侵犯自己读不正确名字的国家。","我不知道怎么告诉你这个词的发音。"]],["banner","'bænә","n. 旗帜\\na. 显著的, 特别好的",["Like the banner, the design was based around the colour white.","If you want to put your banner on my site, just send me the code."],["",""]],["insider","'in'saidә","n. 内部的人, 权威人士, 知道内情的人\\n[经] 熟悉内情者",["The insider trading scandal put a lot of people out of business.","The politician tried to cover up the insider trading."],["",""]],["rising","'raiziŋ","n. 上升, 造反, 叛乱\\na. 上升的, 高涨的, 新兴的",["The cost of living in the United States was rising.","Each day is a little life; every waking and rising a little birth; every fresh morning a little youth; every going to rest and sleep a little death."],["美国的生活费用起了。","每一天都是一生；每一次起床醒来都是次微小的新生，每个清新的早晨都带着点青春，每次歇息和睡眠都是次小小的死亡。"]],["confine","kәn'fain","vt. 限制, 使不外出, 禁闭\\nvi. 邻接, 交界\\nn. 边缘, 范围, 区域",["Here, I'll confine this discussion to why many foreigners enjoy sumo.","Confine your remarks to the matter we are discussing."],["",""]],["assertion","ә'sә:ʃәn","n. 断言, 主张\\n[法] 宣称, 断言, 维护",["Tom refuted that assertion with a counterexample.","It is important to note that his assertion is groundless."],["湯姆用一個反例反駁了那個說法。",""]],["orthodox","'ɒ:θәdɒks","a. 正统的, 传统的, 惯常的",["Outside the mainstream of orthodox Judaism, the apocalyptic books were more successful with certain movements.","Outside the mainstream of orthodox Judaism, apocalypticism was more successful with certain movements."],["",""]],["underground","'ʌndәgraund","n. 地下, 地铁, 地道, 秘密活动\\na. 地下的, 秘密的\\nadv. 在地下, 秘密地",["London is such a large city that visitors must use buses and the underground railway to get about.","In the London underground there is a warning to \"mind the gap\" when boarding the train."],["伦敦是个大城市，游客必须乘公交或地铁才能出行。","在倫敦地鐵，上車時會有「注意間隙」提醒。"]],["outbreak","'autbreik","n. 爆发, 暴动\\n[医] 暴发",["The authorities disclosed little useful information about the spread of COVID-19 at the beginning of the outbreak.","The next four to six weeks are crucial in controlling the massive Ebola outbreak."],["当局在疫情之初几乎没有透露关于新型冠状病毒的有用信息。","接下來的四到六週將對於控制伊波拉病毒的大爆發至關重要。"]],["strand","strænd","n. (绳索的)股, 绳, 串, 海滨, 河岸\\nvi. 搁浅\\nvt. 使搁浅, 使落后, 使陷于困境, 弄断, 搓",["You can feel the worm as a painful strand under the skin.","Mary tucked a nonexistent strand of hair behind her ear."],["",""]],["payroll","'peirәul","n. 工资名单, 饷金名单, 发放的工资总额\\n[计] 工资表, 工资单",["I have worked for one company where the payroll was snatched on a dark winter's night.","In Japan, the payroll tax is usually withheld from the monthly salary."],["",""]],["freshly","'freʃli","adv. 新, 新近, 精神饱满",["The farmer warned the children not to stomp on the freshly planted crops.","Egg tarts, when freshly baked, are a real delicacy."],["農夫警告孩子們不要踐踏新栽種的作物。","新鮮出爐的蛋撻味道一流。"]],["orchestra","'ɒ:kistrә","n. 管弦乐队, 乐队演奏处",["I'm going to join the school orchestra.","Do you know the concert schedule of London Symphony Orchestra?"],["我打算加入學校的管弦樂團。","你知道伦敦交响乐团的演奏会行程吗？"]],["grim","grim","a. 冷酷的, 坚强的, 残忍的, 可怕的, 讨厌的",["From the doctor's grim expression, it was clear he had somber news for the patient.","The sky was already looking grim when we set sail. Within an hour, the first squall had hit us."],["",""]],["winning","'winiŋ","n. 胜利, 获得, 成功, 赢得物\\na. 得胜的, 胜利的",["His only hope of winning the pool game at that point was to successfully execute a complex trick shot.","After winning the Nobel prize, she remained as modest as ever."],["那時他贏得撞球比賽的唯一希望，就是成功打出一記複雜的花式擊球。","獲得諾貝爾獎後，她仍謙虛如昔。"]],["bead","bi:d","n. 珠子, 滴\\nvt. 用珠装饰\\nvi. 形成珠\\n[计] 珠",["The artist is especially known for multidimensional bead sculptures of human figures, as well as necklaces and wall hangings.","The old woman fingered each bead of her rosary with deep devotion."],["",""]],["profitable","'prɒfitәbl","a. 有利润的, 有利益的, 赚钱的\\n[经] 有利(可图)的, 合算的",["He looked for a profitable investment for his capital.","Money lending is a profitable business in this country."],["",""]],["drought","draut","n. 干旱, 缺乏",["Last year the region was visited by the worst drought in 60 years.","The spell of drought did severe damage to the harvest."],["去年那个地区遭受了60年来最严重的干旱。",""]],["uphold","ʌp'hәuld","vt. 支撑, 赞成, 鼓励, 举起, 坚持\\n[法] 确认, 赞成, 支持",["He emphasised carrying out promises made to the people, but he failed to uphold many commitments.","As a public official you have sworn an oath to uphold and defend the constitution."],["",""]],["commentator","'kɔmenteitә","n. 评论员, 实况广播员, 注释者, 时事评论员",["Picasso was no clown. He was a sarcastic commentator on a confused age, a great archivist of humanity's foolishness.","The commentator began yelling when the referee gave the defender a second yellow card."],["",""]],["hazardous","'hæzәdәs","a. 危险的, 冒险的, 碰运气的\\n[法] 危险的, 冒险的, 碰运气的",["Too much drinking may be hazardous to your health.","This plastic garbage bag is free of hazardous chemicals."],["",""]],["confirmation",".kɒnfә'meiʃәn","n. 证实, 证明, 批准, 确认\\n[计] 确认",["Hello, I have a reservation, my name is Kaori Yoshikawa. Here is the confirmation card.","The confirmation hearings turned into a free-for-all."],["",""]],["believer","bi'li:vә","n. 信徒",["He is not a believer whose stomach is filled while his neighbor goes hungry.","I'm a great believer in luck, and I find the harder I work, the more I have of it."],["",""]],["wireless","'waiәlis","n. 无线电\\na. 无线的, 无线电的",["I like to use wireless headphones so that I can clean while listening to a podcast. Otherwise, the wires get in my way.","The ship distress signals in Morse code using the relatively new Marconi wireless telegraph."],["我喜歡用無線耳機，這樣我就可以一邊聽 podcast 一邊打掃，不然線會礙事。",""]],["proceedings","","n. 诉讼, 事项, 行径, 事件, 活动, 项目, 会议录, 记录汇编, 活动记录",["One of the visitors cried out to obstruct the proceedings.","She was trying to inject some fun into the grim proceedings."],["",""]],["merge","mә:dʒ","vt. 使合并, 使消失, 吞没\\nvi. 合并, 渐渐消失\\n[计] 合并",["Get into the left lane to make room for the guy who's trying to merge.","He was given a tip three weeks ago that two companies would merge."],["移到左線，為想併入的那輛車騰出空間。",""]],["shaft","ʃæft","n. 轴, 箭杆, 矛, 矿井\\nvt. 装杆于, 利用",["His old company gave him the shaft. But I admire the way he turned bad luck into good and did even better with his own business.","With a slow motion I started to move my hands up and down his shaft."],["",""]],["theft","θeft","n. 盗窃, 失窃, 盗窃罪, 赃物\\n[法] 盗窃行为, 偷窃, 失窃",["You can't accuse him of theft without having proof.","Betty has a previous conviction for theft."],["没有证据你们不能指责他偷东西。","贝蒂有盗窃前科。"]],["convenient","kәn'vi:njәnt","a. 方便的, 合宜的\\n[法] 适当的, 合理而可行的, 方便的",["This place isn't convenient to public transportation.","I think you will find it convenient to put a short-cut on the desktop."],["這地方交通不方便。","我想你迟早会知道在桌面建立一个快捷方式是有多方便。"]],["accommodation","ә.kɒmә'deiʃәn","n. 膳宿, 预订铺位, 适应性调节, 调和, 贷款\\n[医] 调节(眼); 适应",["If you have no way to buy food, clothing, accommodation and other such daily necessities, you definitely won't be able to have peace of mind.","Tom received an overnight accommodation allowance for his trip and was reimbursed his out-of-pocket expenses."],["如果你没办法买饭、衣服、住处这种日常需要等，你并不会得安心。",""]],["frog","frɒg","n. 青蛙\\n[医] 蛙, 马蹄叉",["Eat a live frog every morning, and nothing worse will happen to you the rest of the day.","The frog and I took turns guessing what the secret recipe was."],["每天早上吃一隻活青蛙，那麼你一天中其他的時間就不會發生什麼更糟糕的事了。","青蛙和我轮流猜了秘方是什么。"]],["grind","graind","n. 磨, 碾, 苦差, 摩擦声, 用功的学生\\nvt. 磨擦, 磨碎, 磨光, 折磨, 压榨\\nvi. 磨, 磨碎, 苦干",["I get the feeling you still have an axe to grind. If you've got something to say come on out and say it.","I grind my coffee by hand with a coffee grinder with a crank handle."],["",""]],["elected","i'lektid","vt. 选举, 推选",["This scandal will likely ruin your chances of being elected.","I think that it's unlikely that Tom will get elected."],["这则丑闻很有可能会断送您的选举。","我觉得汤姆不太可能会当选。"]],["vanilla","vә'nilә","n. 香草, 香子兰",["She made a vanilla chocolate cake for four people.","If and only if the ice-cream is vanilla flavour will Xiao Wang eat it."],["她做了一个四人份的巧克力香草蛋糕。","当且仅当冰淇淋是香草口味，小王会吃这个冰淇淋。"]],["prescribe","pris'kraib","v. 规定, 指定, 嘱咐, 开处方",["You should go to specialist, for now I will prescribe you medicine.","Doctors receiving kickbacks from drug companies to prescribe their products is a growing problem."],["",""]],["wounded","","a. 受伤的\\n[法] 受伤者; 受伤的, 受了损害的",["His wounded leg began to bleed again.","Many thousands on both sides had been wounded."],["他受傷的腳又開始流血了。","双方都有几千人受伤。"]],["lone","lәun","a. 孤单的, 孤立的, 单身的, 寂寞的",["He put up a brave and lone struggle, but up against such heavy odds he couldn't get his business plan accepted.","The Lone Ranger got on his horse and rode off into the sunset."],["他英勇地孤军奋战，但面对如此强弱悬殊的局面，他的商业计划无法得到接受。",""]],["registration",".redʒi'streiʃәn","n. 登记, 挂号, 注册\\n[计] 登记; 定位; 对齐; 记录",["Be sure to fill out the registration form in person.","The registration period is already over."],["确保亲自填写注册表格。","報名時間已經過了。"]],["shotgun","'ʃɒtgʌn","n. 散弹猎枪, 媒人\\nv. 用猎枪射击",["Late at night, farmers always answer the door with a loaded shotgun.","Willie accidentally let off his father's shotgun and made a hole in the wall."],["",""]],["courtesy","'kә:tisi","n. 礼貌, 谦恭, 好意\\n[法] 优待, 礼貌, 恩惠",["The President did me the courtesy of replying to my letter.","These pictures are being shown by courtesy of CNN."],["",""]],["graphic","'græfik","a. 生动的, 轮廓分明的, 绘画似的, 图解的\\n[计] 图形的",["There were some graphic novels mixed into the pile of specialty books on the desk.","Note the function of the background layers of these graphic designs."],["书桌上一叠专业书里有几本卡通书混在里面。",""]],["subway","'sʌbwei","n. 地铁, 地道\\nvi. 乘地铁",["It only takes 20 minutes to get to school by the newly opened subway.","In London, the police are always worried about finding a bomb on the train or subway."],["坐新開的地鐵上學只需要 20 分鐘。","在倫敦，警察總是擔心在列車或地鐵上發現炸彈。"]],["circulation",".sә:kju'leiʃәn","n. 流通, 循环, 发行量\\n[化] 环流",["He works for a newspaper with a large circulation.","The circulation of the newspaper is only one-third that of its competitor."],["他为一份印刷量很大的报纸工作。",""]],["transplant","træns'plɑ:nt","vt. 使移居, 移植, 使迁移\\nvi. 移居, 耐移植\\nn. 移居者, 移植",["The surgeon persuaded me to undergo an organ transplant operation.","The surgeon persuaded him to undergo an organ transplant."],["",""]],["explosive","ik'splәusiv","n. 炸药, 爆破音\\na. 易爆发的, 爆炸的, 暴躁的",["There has been an explosive increase in the demand for labor.","The cheetah uses a combination of stealth and explosive acceleration to catch its prey."],["",""]],["illuminate","i'lju:mineit","vt. 照明, 用灯装饰, 阐明, 说明, 使灿烂\\nvi. 照亮, 用灯装饰",["Men of genius are meteors destined to burn in order to illuminate their century.","The sun started to come out and illuminate the sky."],["",""]],["venue","'venju:","n. 犯罪地点, 审判地, 发生地点",["Inside the venue, sounds of clapping, whistling, yelling, laughing blended together.","Our venue wasn't renovated too long ago."],["会场内，掌声、哨声、喊声、笑声乱成了一锅粥。","我们的场地不久前翻新了。"]],["congressman","'kɒŋgresmәn","n. 国会议员, 众议院议员\\n[法] 国会议会",["The Congressman broke the news of conspiracy and made no bones about taking drastic action against it.","The congressman has been in the spotlight ever since his untoward remarks about African Americans."],["",""]],["nazi","'nɑ:tsi","n. 纳粹党人\\na. 纳粹党的",["Godwin's law teaches us that any infinite discussion about an arbitrary subject converges to a Nazi comparison.","The difference between a Nazi and a crypto-Nazi is that one wears a swastika while the other wears a police uniform."],["高德温法则告诉我们对任何主题的所有无休止的讨论会趋于和纳粹主义的类比。",""]],["penetrate","'penitreit","vt. 穿透, 刺穿, 渗透, 看穿, 洞察, 了解, 使充溢\\nvi. 刺入, 看穿, 渗透, 打进",["His eyes seem to penetrate me to the bottom of my soul.","It took a long time for Japanese imports to penetrate the American consumer markets."],["",""]],["evolutionary",",i:vә'lu:ʃәnәri","a. 展开的, 进化论的, 进化的, 发展的\\n[计] 进化的, 改良的, 发展的",["With this as background I turn now to an account of the present state of evolutionary biology.","Evolutionary psychology is largely a pseudoscience, as it cannot be measured or tested and is not based on experimental results."],["",""]],["canal","kә'næl","n. 运河, 水道, 管, 沟渠\\nvt. 开运河",["This ship is too big to pass through the canal.","The ship went through the Panama Canal."],["这艘船太大，没法通过运河。","这艘船穿过巴拿马运河"]],["grill","gril","n. 烤架, 铁格子, 烤肉\\nv. 烧, 烤, 严加盘问, 给...装栅栏",["On Friday evenings, a group of us with spouses working overseas meet at Chuck's Bar and Grill.","My band will perform this week at Chuck's Bar and Grill. Please come and see us."],["",""]],["unnecessary",".ʌn'nesәsәri","a. 不必要的",["If two men always have the same opinion, one of them is unnecessary.","The facts proved that our worries were unnecessary."],["如果两个人总是意见相同，那么他们其中一个就没必要了。","事实证明了我们的担心是多余的。"]],["innocence","'inәsәns","n. 无罪, 无知, 天真无邪\\n[法] 无罪, 无罪的人, 清白无辜者",["When he asked who had broken the window, all the boys put on an air of innocence.","There is no doubt as to her innocence."],["当他问起是谁打破了窗户时，所有的男生都显得很无辜。","她毫無疑問是清白的。"]],["parameter","pә'ræmitә","n. 参变数, 参变量, 参数, 参量\\n[计] 参量; 参数",["You can't describe the result of a non-parametric test with a statistical parameter such as variance.","You need a parameter to capture the stiffness of the metal."],["",""]],["flaw","flɒ:","n. 缺点, 裂纹, 瑕疵, 一阵狂风\\n[化] 划痕; 裂缝; 裂纹",["Because of a flaw in the original design, our website is vulnerable to SQL injection attacks.","I can't find a single flaw in his theory."],["由于最初设计中的一个缺陷，我们的网站易受到SQL注入攻击。","我在他的理論中找不到任何問題。"]],["champagne","ʃæm'pein","n. 香槟酒, 香槟酒色\\n[化] 香槟酒",["Instead of drinking cola, why not drink champagne?","This politician is a typical champagne socialist."],["与其喝可乐，倒不如喝香槟。","這箇政客是典型的香檳社會主義者。"]],["optimism","'ɒptimizm","n. 乐观主义, 乐观, 乐天\\n[医] 乐观主义, 乐观",["Optimism is like the lamp of hope. Pessimism [or negativity] is like a drug of sorrow.","That proved to be no more than an expression of optimism when World War II began."],["樂觀如明燈,照亮希望的前程. 消極如毒品,腐蝕健康的心靈.",""]],["skinny","'skini","a. 似皮的, 极瘦的, 少的, 小气的\\n[医] 皮的; 消瘦的",["It's more polite to say thin than skinny.","Santa Claus is usually drawn as roly-poly. He is almost never skinny."],["说苗条比说瘦更有礼貌。",""]],["regression","ri'greʃәn","n. 退步, 回归\\n[计] 回归",["Support vector machines are supervised learning models used for classification and regression analysis.","The influence of covariates on the primary outcome variable was explored using logistic regression."],["",""]],["posture","'pɒstʃә","n. 姿势, 态度, 情形, 形势\\nvt. 作...的姿势\\nvi. 作姿势",["Cellphone and computer users are encouraged to take frequent breaks and to remain aware of their posture.","The guard's truncheon hit air. Off balance, he regained his posture to see a metal-mesh rubbish bin flying towards him."],["",""]],["demon","'di:mәn","n. 魔鬼",["The demon lord finally lost consciousness and fell to the floor with a thud.","The demon grabbed my sister and, with howling laughter, cast her into a bottomless pit."],["大魔王終於失去知覺，砰的一聲倒在了地上。","惡魔一把抓住了我的妹妹，一邊猙獰地狂笑着，一邊把她丟進了一個無底洞裏。"]],["systematic",".sisti'mætik","a. 有系统的, 分类上的, 体系的\\n[医] 系统的, 系的, 分类的",["Logic is a systematic method of coming to the wrong conclusion with confidence.","Language is one of the most systematic, subtle, and significant vehicles for spreading racist ideology."],["",""]],["inclusion","in'kluʒәn","n. 包含, 内含物\\n[计] 蕴含",["Tom submitted a list of topics for possible inclusion on the agenda for the annual general meeting.","In retrospect, inclusion of that entry in the dictionary was a mistake."],["",""]],["viking","'vaikiŋ","n. 海盗",["Viking 1 and 2 became the first spacecraft to successfully land on the surface of Mars.","Viking helmets with horns aren't in style in Scandinavia anymore."],["維京1號和2號成爲了最先在火星表面成功著陸的空間探測器。","斯堪的纳维亚现在已经不流行戴维京人那种有角的头盔了。"]],["reassure",".ri:ә'ʃuә","vt. 使...安心, 向...再保证\\n[法] 重新保证, 再保险, 使清除疑虑",["Let me reassure you. I myself don't always understand what I've written.","My mother did everything she could to reassure him."],["",""]],["resulting","ri'zʌltiŋ","[计] 结果的, 合成的",["I'm obliged to find a way out of the resulting situation.","Everyone has the right to the protection of the moral and material interests resulting from any scientific, literary or artistic production of which he is the author."],["我应该去找到解决问题的办法。","人人对由于他所创作的任何科学、文学或美术作品而产生的精神的和物质的利益，有享受保护的权利。"]],["pope","pәup","n. 罗马教皇, 主教",["Even people who don't believe in the Catholic church venerate the Pope as a symbolic leader.","I don't care that you're the Pope; you can't touch my feet."],["甚至是不相信天主教的人也把教皇敬为一个象征性的领导者。","我才不管您是不是個甚麼教皇，我的腳您別碰。"]],["rehearsal","ri'hә:sl","n. 预演, 排演, 练习, 叙述, 复述\\n[法] 详述, 列举事实, 复述",["Tomorrow there will be no normal lessons, in view of the athletic meet rehearsal.","After a ten-minute break, we resumed our rehearsal."],["明天是运动会的排练，没有往常的课程。",""]],["invoke","in'vәuk","vt. 祈求, 恳求, 实行, 援引, 引起\\n[计] 调用; 请求",["Once Tom tried to invoke a demon, and he almost succeeded.","In pots I try in vain to invoke the scents of childhood."],["",""]],["correspond",".kɒri'spɒnd","vi. 符合, 通信, 相当\\n[法] 符合, 一致, 相当",["Your words must correspond with your actions.","You should make your ideas correspond with reality."],["你的言行必须一致。",""]],["discard","dis'kɑ:d","vt. 丢弃, 抛弃\\nvi. 垫牌\\nn. 垫牌, 抛弃",["We do not want to discard the article but reshape it.","Remember to check for any expired condiments and discard them."],["",""]],["revival","ri'vaivl","n. 复兴, 复活, 恢复精神, 苏醒\\n[医] 复苏, 回生, 精神重振",["The Old Prussian language revival began in the early 80's.","In recent years, there has been a revival of interest in swing dancing."],["",""]],["tub","tʌb","n. 桶, 浴盆\\nvt. 装入桶, 洗澡\\nvi. 洗盆浴, 被放在桶里洗",["Since it's my day off today, I'm going to treat myself to a family-sized tub of walnut ice cream.","In the hot tub, Mary confessed to wearing adult diapers on long road trips to avoid stopping at rest stops."],["今天是我的休息日，我要買一整桶家庭裝的核桃冰淇淋犒勞自己。",""]],["restraint","ri'streint","n. 抑制, 克制, 束缚\\n[医] 约束, 拘束",["Adversity and prosperity reveal one's breadth of mind; joy and anger test one's self-restraint.","From a Pope to a King, everyone drinks without restraint."],["逆境顺境看襟度，临喜临怒看涵养。",""]],["sunni","'suni:","n. 〈伊斯兰〉逊尼派教徒",["In this country, the majority of the population espouses Sunni Islam.","In Tbilisi, you can find the only mosque in the world where shia and sunni Muslims pray together."],["在這個國家，大多數人口信奉遜尼派伊斯蘭教。","在第比利斯，你可以看到世界上唯一一座什葉派和遜尼派穆斯林一起祈禱的清真寺。"]],["prospective","prәs'pektiv","a. 预期的, 将来的\\n[经] 预期的, 未来的",["The company invited their prospective customers to the party.","Prospective buyers couldn't make heads or tails out of the contract."],["",""]],["theirs","ðєәz","pron. 他们的",["The speed at which native speakers of other languages are adding sentences doesn't even compare to theirs.","Your team is very good, but theirs is the best."],["其它母语的使用者添加句子的速度也比不过他们的。","你有一个非常好的团队，但他们的是最好的。"]],["murderer","'mә:dәrә","n. 凶手, 杀人者, 谋害者\\n[法] 谋杀犯, 凶手",["This is proof that you're the murderer.","The gardener turned out to be the murderer."],["这证明了你是杀人犯。","园丁后来发现就是凶手。"]],["tin","tin","n. 锡, 马口铁, 罐头\\nvt. 在...镀锡于\\na. 锡制的\\n[计] tin阅读程序",["Can you distinguish silver from tin?","Bronze-ware is largely made from alloys of brass and tin."],["你能分辨銀和錫嗎?",""]],["abundance","ә'bʌndәns","n. 丰富, 充足, 大量\\n[经] 丰富, 充裕",["I prefer traditional characters. Due to the abundance of reading materials in simplified characters, I can recognize many of them too.","There were food and drink in abundance at the party."],["我偏愛繁體字。因為有大量的簡體字的閱讀材料，我也認識很多簡體字。",""]],["duration","dju'reiʃәn","n. 持续时间, 持续\\n[计] 持续时间",["Rapidity of rise may be inversely proportional to duration at altitude.","The duration of passion is proportionate with the original resistance of the woman."],["",""]],["despair","di'spєә","n. 绝望, 失望\\nvi. 绝望",["She watched in despair as the thief stomped on her garden plants.","There's no such thing as a perfect sentence. Just as there's no such thing as perfect despair."],["她絕望地看著小偷踐踏她花園裡的植物。","世界上並沒有所謂完美的句子。就好像沒有完美的絕望一樣。"]],["proposition",".prɒpә'ziʃәn","n. 建议, 命题, 主张\\nvt. 向...提议, 向...提出猥亵的要求",["An interesting proposition is raised in your book.","It's no wonder that his proposition was refuted so soon."],["你书中提出了个有意思的命题。",""]],["lime","laim","n. 石灰, 粘鸟胶, 酸橙\\nvt. 以石灰处理, 粘鸟胶于, 撒石灰",["Crafting a perfect Mojito can be a challenge. Achieving the right balance of sweetness, mintiness, and lime is an art.","The woman downed the gin and lime that was served in one swallow."],["調製一杯完美的 Mojito 並非易事。要達到甜味、薄荷味和青檸味之間的完美平衡，是一門藝術。",""]],["attendant","ә'tendәnt","n. 随从, 侍者, 出席者\\na. 侍候的, 伴随的, 出席的, 在场的",["The flight attendant shook Tom awake and told him that the plane had landed.","The petrol pump attendant wasn't very thrilled when we only bought a newspaper from him."],["",""]],["fulfill","ful'fil","vt. 实践, 履行, 实行, 完成, 结束, 满足\\n[法] 履行, 完成, 达到",["I was determined to fulfill my duties at any cost.","Dozens of people encouraged me to fulfill my ambitions."],["",""]],["ethnicity","eθ'nisәti","n. 种族划分",["Hanfu is the traditional clothing of the Han ethnicity.","Rodrigo was denied access to certain features on the website based on his ethnicity."],["",""]],["successor","sәk'sesә","n. 继承者, 接任者\\n[计] 后继",["The matter of his successor is still under debate.","Tom's father died suddenly, and Tom became his successor."],["",""]],["assassination","ә.sæsi'neiʃәn","n. 暗杀\\n[法] 暗杀, 行刺",["The U.S. Government has released thousands of files on the assassination of President John F. Kennedy.","Older people still remember the Kennedy assassination."],["",""]],["handling","'hændliŋ","n. 处理\\na. 操作的",["My work at the TV station is handling letters written in by viewers.","She showed a great deal of wit in handling the delicate question."],["我在电视台的工作就是处理观众们写来的信。",""]],["geographic",",dʒiә'^ræfik","a. 地理(学)的, 地区(性)的",["The first naked woman I saw was in a National Geographic magazine.","Mathematics knows no races or geographic boundaries; for mathematics, the cultural world is one country."],["",""]],["strawberry","'strɒ:bәri","n. 草莓",["The Spanish make a type of brandy with the fruits of the strawberry tree.","The strawberry tree is a commonly used landscape plant in this area."],["西班牙人用草莓樹的果實釀造一種白蘭地。","草莓樹是該地區常見的景觀植物。"]],["atomic","ә'tɒmik","a. 原子的, 原子能的\\n[医] 原子的",["The atomic reactor generates enormous amounts of thermal energy.","He has been devoted to the study of atomic energy ever since he graduated from the university."],["原子反应堆发出大量的热能。","从他大学毕业后，他就一直致力于原子能的研究。"]],["crying","'kraiiŋ","a. 叫喊的, 嚎哭的, 迫切的, 臭名昭著的",["It's a crying shame that they weren't insured against fire.","One day in October, when Sadako awoke, she found her mother crying."],["这简直是太可惜了，他们没有买火险。","在十月的某一天，祯子醒来后发现了正在哭泣的母亲。"]],["holder","'hәuldә","n. 持有人, 所有人, 支持物\\n[化] 夹持器; 夹具; 贮罐",["The former record holder managed to complete this task in thirty seconds and thirteen hundredths of a second.","She uncovers the little plastic tortilla holder so gracefully. It's little things like that that are so cute about people."],["",""]],["portable","'pɒ:tәbl","a. 可携带的, 可搬运的, 可移动的\\n[计] 可移植的",["I learned about your portable copier at the Tokyo-Office '97 Expo.","Tom doesn't want an iPad. He wants a portable device that supports Flash."],["",""]],["guerrilla","gә'rilә","n. 游击队",["In reports in America, guerrilla resistance by the Iraq military is called terrorism.","In reports in the United States, guerrilla resistance by the Iraq military is called terrorism."],["",""]],["clarity","'klærәti","n. 清楚, 明晰\\n[化] 透明度; 透明性; 清晰性",["It seems to me that I haven't explained myself with clarity.","As for phonology, Tagalog has more clarity and rhythm than does English."],["",""]],["environmentalist","in,vaiәrәn'mentlist","n. 环保人士",["The author of \"The Last of the Mohicans\", James Fenimore Cooper, was the first environmentalist.","Environmentalist parties generally use the color green in their symbols and names."],["",""]],["verse","vә:s","n. 诗, 韵文, 诗句\\nvt. 用诗表达\\nvi. 作诗",["He translated the verse into English.","He gave me chapter and verse on how bears pass the winter."],["他把诗翻译成英语。",""]],["moisture","'mɒistʃә","n. 湿气, 水分, 降雨\\n[化] 含水量; 含湿量",["In order to grow well, these plants need soil that does not contain too much moisture.","If your windows are not airtight, moisture will seep in."],["",""]],["trophy","'trәufi","n. 战利品, 奖品\\nvt. 用战利品装饰",["Maybe you should put that trophy in the living room.","Cognitive reframing is a great debate. Like giving a kid a participation trophy. Making negative seem positive. It is what it is."],["",""]],["parenting","'pεәrәntiŋ","n. 父母对子女的养育",["Gay parenting is a no-brainer. It works just as well as straight parenting and it decreases the number of children in foster care.","He learned everything he needed to know about parenting."],["",""]],["ironic","aiә'rɔnik","a. 冷嘲的, 挖苦的, 反话的, 讽刺的, 令人啼笑皆非的, 出乎意料的",["It was pretty ironic how the woman was shouting her head off at her bawling baby.","In a cruelly ironic twist of fate, someday Tatoeba will make an example of us all."],["",""]],["contradiction",".kɒntrә'dikʃәn","n. 反驳, 矛盾\\n[法] 矛盾, 否认, 反驳",["From what stems this contradiction between our hopes and our reality?","Our diplomacy and strategy ran in clear contradiction to each other."],["希望与现实之间的矛盾，因何而起？",""]],["rattle","'rætl","vt. 使嘎嘎响, 喋喋不休地说\\nvi. 格格响, 喋喋不休\\nn. 格格声, 拨浪鼓, 喋喋不休的话",["When you talk of the devil you will hear his bones rattle.","Rattlesnakes have a rattle at the ends of their tails."],["",""]],["shatter","'ʃætә","n. 碎片, 粉碎, 落叶, 喷洒\\nvt. 打碎, 使散开, 粉碎, 破坏\\nvi. 粉碎, 损坏, 脱落",["I call on the living, lament the dead, shatter the lightning.","I stopped by the weed store and got us some more shatter."],["",""]],["descent","di'sent","n. 降落, 家系, 侵袭, 血统\\n[医] 下降, 世代, 血统",["A baby was flung out of its mother's arms when a plane hit severe turbulence while commencing its descent prior to landing.","These children are born not of natural descent, nor of human decision or a husband's will, but born of God."],["",""]],["startle","'stɑ:tl","n. 惊愕, 惊恐\\nvt. 吃惊, 使惊愕\\nvi. 惊起",["Avoid sudden movements around the rabbit, they can startle them.","Slowly and cautiously, Rodrigo approached the beautiful butterfly, trying not to startle it."],["避免在兔子旁邊突然做出動作，以免嚇到牠們。",""]],["widen","'waidn","vt. 弄宽, 加宽, 扩大\\nvi. 变宽, 扩大",["Acts like burning the Quran only serve to widen the gap between different religious communities and hinder progress towards unity.","Television helps us widen our knowledge."],["",""]],["gorgeous","'gɒ:dʒәs","a. 华丽的, 灿烂的",["She is wearing gorgeous silk clothes.","She walked down the aisle in style, wearing her gorgeous mermaid-cut tulle wedding gown."],["她穿著華麗的絲綢服飾。",""]],["tease","ti:z","n. 揶揄, 戏弄, 逗惹\\nvt. 戏弄, 取笑, 强求, 梳理, 使起毛",["My father used to always say that you only tease the ones you love.","Tom used to tease me a lot, but he doesn't anymore."],["",""]],["waiter","'weitә","n. 侍者",["I don't know if you know or not, but here in America you're expected to tip the waiter.","Soon the same waiter came back to pick up the dishes."],["我不知你是否知道，但在美国你要给服务员付小费。","不久，同样的服务员回来拿起菜。"]],["gospel","'gɒspәl","n. 福音, 信仰, 真理",["The Gospel guarantees that Jesus Christ is the key to salvation.","The trumpet of Christ is His gospel. He sounded it, and we heard."],["",""]],["separately","'sepәrәtli","adv. [表]分开, 不相连, 分隔, 分离, 不同, 单独, 独立, 各自, 各别, 脱离肉体, 灵魂\\n[计] 分离地",["This question must be discussed separately from that one.","Fadil and Layla were tried separately for the murder of Rami Hasan."],["这两个问题必须分开讨论。",""]],["vow","vau","n. 誓约, 誓言, 许愿\\nvi. 起誓, 发誓, 郑重宣言\\nvt. 立誓, 起誓要, 郑重地宣布",["With every broken vow, you bring our ideal closer to destruction.","If I wanted to stop speaking to all the people I despise, I would have to take a vow of silence."],["",""]],["semester","si'mestә","n. 学期",["The new school semester has started.","I haven't studied physics much all semester."],["新的學期開始了。","我这学期几乎没学物理。"]],["precision","pri'siʒәn","n. 精密, 精确, 精确度, 精度\\na. 精密的, 精确的\\n[计] 精度",["Our teacher is someone who likes precision, and always demands precise answers of her students.","This cartographer is famous for the precision in his maps."],["老師性喜精準——她總是要求精確的答案。","此製圖員出名於其製圖的精準性。"]],["downstairs","'daun'stєәz","n. 楼下\\na. 楼下的\\nadv. 在楼下",["Mary, you've come at just the right time! Help me carry this sofa downstairs.","I went downstairs and turned off the light."],["瑪麗，你來得正是時候！來幫我把這張沙發搬到樓下！","我下楼把灯关了。"]],["cutting","'kʌtiŋ","n. 切断, 切下, 路堑\\n[化] 切屑",["Cutting a cake into equal pieces is rather difficult.","The hair dresser is cutting the hair with scissors."],["均分蛋糕有些難度。","理发师正在用剪刀剪头发。"]],["rigid","'ridʒid","a. 坚硬的, 刚性的, 严格的, 精密的, 刻板的",["Rigid wheels give sufficient stability to a low-speed vehicle steered by outside forces.","The pupils are supposed to observe rigid discipline."],["",""]],["jam","dʒæm","n. 果酱, 拥塞之物, 堵塞, 困境\\nvt. 挤进, 使塞满, 混杂, 压碎, 使堵塞\\nvi. 堵塞, 轧住, 拥挤",["I spilled jam on the electric outlet and there was a short circuit.","The room was jam-packed with reporters waiting for the press conference to begin."],["我把果酱撒到电源插座上短路了。","房间挤满了等待发布会开始的记者。"]],["hometown","hәum'taun","n. 故乡, 家乡",["Tom returned to his hometown to visit his parents during the summer break.","Give a hug to your parents before you get far away from your hometown."],["汤姆在夏休回乡看望父母。","在你们远离家乡之前请给父母一个拥抱。"]],["tumble","tʌmbl","n. 跌倒, 摔跤, 翻斤斗\\nvi. 翻倒, 摔倒, 倒塌, 滚动, 翻斤斗, 仓促地行动\\nvt. 使摔倒, 使滚翻, 弄乱",["I saw a girl tumble and ran to her in spite of myself.","Benedito watched the water tumble down the waterfall."],["",""]],["financially","","adv. 金融上；财政上",["While most of us are significantly better off financially than our parents and grandparents, happiness levels haven't changed to reflect that.","We were financially troubled, in short, we were bankrupt."],["虽然我们大多数人比我们的父母、祖父母还要富裕得多，但是与之相应的快乐程度却没有多大的改变。",""]],["statistically","","adv. 用统计的方法, 统计学上",["That's statistically unlikely, but not impossible.","Statistically speaking, flying in a plane is much safer than traveling by car."],["",""]],["backup","'bækʌp","n. 倒车, 后退, 后援, 支持, 阻塞\\nvt. 做备份\\na. 候补的, 支持的\\n[计] 备份; DOS外部命令:通常使用于将硬磁…",["Tom is primarily the bass guitarist, but he sometimes sings backup vocals.","I have a backup plan in case something goes wrong."],["",""]],["detector","di'tektә","n. 发现者, 检验器, 检波器\\n[计] 检波器; 检测器",["My neighbor found a cache of ancient Roman coins using his metal detector.","The results of a lie detector test are inadmissible in court."],["",""]],["psychiatric","saiki'ætrik; (?@) si-","a. 精神病学的, 医精神病的\\n[医] 精神病学的",["Sami tried to escape from the psychiatric hospital.","Excessive use of the Internet is not a medical or psychiatric issue."],["薩米試圖從精神病院逃跑。","过于上网不是跟医学或精神病有关的事情。"]],["grid","grid","n. 格子, 栅格\\n[计] 网格",["Solar storms next year could prove disastrous for the electrical grid.","She's off the grid, and European authorities want her arrested."],["",""]],["eighteen","'ei'ti:n","num. 十八, 十八个",["She came to Tokyo when she was eighteen years old.","I learned to drive a car when I was eighteen and got a driver's license."],["她18岁的时候来到东京。","我十八歲時，學了開車、考到了駕照。"]],["rotate","'rәuteit","a. 辐状的\\nvt. 使旋转, 使转动, 使轮流\\nvi. 旋转, 循环\\n[计] 旋转",["Always stir or rotate your food halfway through microwaving for even heating.","Anatomical breast implants, however, can also deform the shape of the breast if they rotate sideways."],["",""]],["recount","ri'kaunt","vt. 详述, 叙述, 重新计算\\nn. 重新计算",["Here he began to recount his misfortune in detail.","Each single-author book is immensely particular, a story told as only one storyteller could recount it."],["",""]],["spotlight","'spɒtlait","n. 照明灯, 反光灯, 聚光灯",["They prefer the shadows rather than the spotlight.","The congressman has been in the spotlight ever since his untoward remarks about African Americans."],["",""]],["settler","'setlә","n. 移民者, 解决者, 结算员\\n[化] 沉淀池; 沉降器; 澄清槽",["You cannot create a settler state without the elimination of the natives.","Ilan Pappe says that the Zionism is a settler colonial project."],["",""]],["polite","pә'lait","a. 有礼貌的, 文雅的, 客气的, 有教养的",["There's no need to be polite with this kind of person.","In Japan, it is polite to bow when one meets someone."],["对这种人，用不着客气。","在日本，遇到人鞠躬是有礼貌的表现。"]],["magnificent","mæg'nifisnt","a. 华丽的, 高尚的, 宏伟的",["Today the weather is magnificent and the children play in the fields.","Tomorrow, I'll fly over the magnificent Himalayas."],["今天天氣晴朗，孩子們在田野裡玩耍。","明天，我將飛越雄偉的喜馬拉雅山脈。"]],["scrape","skreip","n. 刮, 擦, 挖, 擦痕, 刮擦声, 困境\\nvi. 刮掉, 擦掉, 刮出刺耳声\\nvt. 刮, 擦, 擦伤, 挖成, 积蓄",["He uses a spatula to scrape off advertisements that were stuck on the ground.","I sold my house and furniture, together with my jewelry, in order to scrape together a half a million."],["他用鏟子刮掉黏在地上的廣告單。","我卖了房子和家具，连同我的手饰一起才凑了五十万。"]],["contrary","'kɒntrәri","a. 相反的, 矛盾的, 对立的\\nn. 相反, 对立面\\nadv. 相反地",["Mary is not poor. On the contrary, she is quite rich.","And yet, the contrary is always true as well."],["玛丽不穷，相反，她相当富裕。","然而，相反的理论往往也是真的。"]],["superintendent",",sju:pәrin'tendәnt","n. 监督人, 主管人, 主日学校校长\\n[经] 监督人, 主管人(部门)",["The building's superintendent has set up a meeting with the residents.","She's been matron and acting superintendent ever since the hospital was opened, five years ago."],["",""]],["optical","'ɒptikl","a. 眼睛的, 视觉的, 光学的\\n[机] 光学上的, 光学的",["The company faced a major interruption in business when a fire destroyed their archive of computer hard drives and optical discs.","This looks longer than that, but it is an optical illusion."],["",""]],["fourteen","'fɒ:'ti:n","num. 十四, 十四个",["My father died of a subarachnoid hemorrhage when I was fourteen.","I lost my father to a subarachnoid haemorrhage when I was fourteen."],["我十四岁的时候，父亲死于蛛网膜下出血。","我十四岁的时候，父亲死于蛛网膜下出血。"]],["ambulance","'æmbjulәns","n. 救护车\\n[医] 救护车",["Hang on. The ambulance will get here in just a little bit.","Tom bought an old ambulance and converted it into a camper."],["挺住。救护车马上就来了。","湯姆買了一輛舊救護車，並把它改裝成露營車。"]],["prey","prei","n. 被掠食者, 牺牲者\\nvi. 捕食",["Men are hunters, and women are prey.","Cornered prey is the most dangerous kind."],["男人是獵人, 女人是獵物。","最危险的猎物是无路可走的那种。"]],["audit","'ɒ:dit","n. 审计, 查帐\\nvt. 查(帐), 旁听\\nvi. 查账\\n[计] 查帐; 审查; 检查",["This financial audit also includes an evaluation of the company's assets.","You will be in trouble if you become the target of a tax audit."],["",""]],["bump","bʌmp","n. 撞击, 肿块\\nvt. 碰撞\\nvi. 撞, 颠簸而行",["We tried again to bump off the politician, but couldn't do it.","It seems that no matter where we go, we always seem to bump into each other. It's like our fates are intertwined."],["",""]],["peculiar","pi'kju:ljә","a. 奇特的, 罕见的, 特殊的, 特别的\\nn. 特有财产, 特权",["\"So what do you think of Mary?\" \"She has a rather peculiar appearance.\"","For instance, bowing is peculiar to us, the Japanese."],["”那你怎么看玛丽？“ ”她看起来挺古怪的。“",""]],["sadness","'sædnis","n. 悲哀, 悲伤",["This shows that happiness and sadness are only separated by attitude.","She helped him overcome his sadness."],["这表明幸福和悲痛之间只隔着看法。","她幫助他平撫了他的悲傷。"]],["supporting","sә'pɔ:tiŋ","a. 次要的；支持的；辅助性的",["Subscribers can play across phones, tablets, and computers, with certain games supporting multiplayer access and cloud sync.","When we think of the traditional roles of men and women in society, we think of husbands supporting the family, and wives taking care of the house and children."],["訂閱用戶可以在手機、平板與電腦上遊玩，部分遊戲支援多人連線及雲端同步。","当我们想到男女在社会中的传统角色时，我们认为丈夫养家，妻子照顾孩子和家庭。"]],["enthusiastic","in.θju:zi'æstik","a. 狂热的, 热心的, 热烈的",["He hid his emotions and pretended to be enthusiastic.","My older brother is a very enthusiastic soccer fan."],["他把情感藏進了心底，裝出熱心的樣子。","我的哥哥是很狂热的足球迷。"]],["continually","kәn'tinjuәli","adv. 不断地, 频繁地",["Ever since his graduation from university until his retirement, Lao Wang had continually worked as a teacher.","In adolescence, I hated life and was continually on the verge of suicide, from which, however, I was restrained by the desire to know more mathematics."],["從大學畢業到退休，老王一直擔任教學工作。","在青春期，我厌倦生活，并持续陷入自杀的边缘。然而，在那期间，对数学知识的渴望，使我抑制住了那些负面情绪。"]],["firefighter","ˈfaɪəfaɪtə(r)","n. <美>消防队员",["My dream is to become a firefighter.","Tom says that when he grows up he wants to be a firefighter."],["我的夢想是成為一名消防員。",""]],["applicant","'æplikәnt","n. 申请者\\n[经] 申请人, 请求人, 谋事人",["Does the applicant have suitable abilities to carry out the job?","The job requires the applicant to have passed the JLPT N2 exam."],["那位求職者能勝任工作嗎？",""]],["supper","'sʌpә","n. 晚餐",["You should apologize to Dad for not coming home in time for supper.","You can't get in without your key anyway, so you may as well come to have supper with us."],["你應該為你沒有及時回家吃晚餐向你父親道歉。","没有你的钥匙的话，你还是进不去，所以你不放来跟我们一起吃晚饭。"]],["egyptian","i'dʒipʃәn","n. 埃及人\\na. 埃及的, 埃及人的",["Champollion deciphered the Ancient Egyptian language.","Some believe that the Egyptian pyramids were built by ancient aliens."],["商博良破譯了古埃及語。",""]],["absent","'æbsәnt","a. 缺席的, 不在的, 缺乏的, 漫不经心的\\nvt. 使缺席",["He was absent from school yesterday because he was ill.","If anybody is still absent, please send their names to me."],["他昨天没来上学，因为他病了。","如果仍然有人缺席的，请将名单发给我。"]],["injured","'indʒәd","a. 受伤的, 受损害的, 被触怒的\\n[法] 受害的, 被害的",["The people crowded round the injured man, but they made way for the doctor when he reached the scene of the accident.","The ambulances carried the injured to the nearest hospital."],["人群把傷者團團圍住，但醫生來到現場時都讓了路給他。","救护车把伤者送往了最近的医院。"]],["modem","'mәudem","n. 调制解调器\\n[计] 调制解调器",["Disconnect the power cable from the modem, wait for approximately one minute, then reconnect the cable.","It was a daring move at a time when many people's web experience was little more than a dial-up modem."],["",""]],["salvation","sæl'veiʃә","n. 拯救, 救助, 救世",["First Contact became humanity's salvation as it was at the brink of self-destruction.","\"God is our salvation,\" said the priest."],["在人類自我毀滅的邊緣，第一次接觸成了福音。","“天主是我们的救援。”，牧师说。"]],["conceptual","kәn'septʃuәl","a. 概念的\\n[医] 概念的",["The Econ exam was pretty easy, mostly conceptual stuff, supply and demand, and all that.","Perception is based, to a very large extent, on conceptual models - which are always inadequate, often incomplete and sometimes profoundly wrong."],["",""]],["modification",".mɒdifi'keiʃәn","n. 修正, 修饰, 修改\\n[化] 修饰; 修改",["Through genetic modification, we can improve crops.","Open source is a philosophy that encourages openness, sharing, and modification."],["通过遗传修饰，我们可以改良农作物。",""]],["namely","'neimli","adv. 即, 就是, 换句话说",["It's a shame that so many people are sick and dying from eating the products of grass plants, namely grains and sugars.","I know a recipe for cookies which includes only three ingredients, namely butter, sugar and flour."],["",""]],["visa","'vi:zә","n. 签证\\nvt. 签发",["We were disappointed to hear that Tom couldn't get a visa.","If you want to study in the United States, you need to get a student visa."],["我们很遗憾地听说，汤姆没能拿到签证。","你想去美國讀書的話，一定要先申請一張學生簽證。"]],["renew","ri'nju:","vt. 使更新, 使恢复, 复兴, 修补, 补充, 继续, 重订, 重申, 续借\\nvi. 更新, 重新开始",["All plans automatically renew until cancelled.","I congratulate him, I congratulate Governor Palin for all that they've achieved. And I look forward to working with them to renew this nation's promise in the months ahead."],["所有訂閱將自動續訂，除非使用者主動取消。","我向他道賀；也向裴林州長道賀，為他們所成就的一切。我迫不及待想和他們攜手合作，在未來數月更新這個國家的許諾。"]],["overhead","'әuvәhed","n. 经常开支, 普通用费, 天花板\\na. 在头上的, 高架的\\nadv. 在头顶上, 在空中, 在高处, 从头到脚全部没入地\\n[计]…",["I usually stand with one hand on the overhead bar, but if my legs get too tired, sometimes I sit down on the train.","The city should subsidize small businesses in industries with large overhead costs."],["搭車的時候，我通常一隻手抓著頭頂的扶桿站著，但如果腿太痠了，有時候也會坐下來。","市府應補貼經常性開支龐大的產業中的小型企業。"]],["goose","gu:s","n. 鹅, 雌鹅, 鹅肉, 弯把熨斗\\nvt. 与...性交, 突然加大油门, 使生色, 喝倒彩",["Thinking to get at once all the gold the goose could give, he killed it and opened it only to find - nothing.","At Christmas, one eats roast goose, red cabbage, and wheat buns."],["他满脑子想的都是立刻得到鹅体内的金蛋，所以他杀了鹅，然后他发现鹅身体里没有任何东西。","聖誕節時，人們會吃烤鵝、紅甘藍和小麥麵包。"]],["fireplace","'faiәpleis","n. 壁炉",["A chimney carries smoke from a fireplace to the outside.","There used to be a fireplace here but I guess it's been torn down."],["",""]],["peach","pi:tʃ","n. 桃子, 桃树, 桃色, 美人儿, 极好的事物\\nvt. 告发\\nvi. 告密, 检举",["Country girls like to cut red paper into peach and plum blossoms and paste them onto doors and windows.","Have you ever greeted the small peach tree in German?"],["农村的女孩喜欢把红色的纸裁减成桃和李的花及贴在门窗上。","你曾经用德语和那棵小桃树打过招呼吗？"]],["summarize","'sʌmәraiz","v. 概述, 总结",["Summarize the contents in 60 English words.","To summarize, I'm saying that society is becoming better."],["請把內容濃縮至六十個英文字以內。",""]],["nurture","'nә:tʃә","n. 养育, 营养物, 培育\\nvt. 养育, 供给营养物, 教养",["Let's use our experiences to nurture the sense needed to make marital relations go well.","Nurture strength of spirit to shield you in sudden misfortune."],["",""]],["caribbean",".kæri'bi:әn","n. 加勒比海\\na. 加勒比海的, 加勒比人的",["The large number of islands in the Caribbean Sea creates many areas of shallow water that can be treacherous to ship navigation.","I was courted by the most handsome and wealthiest men in the Caribbean."],["",""]],["frighten","'fraitn","vt. 使惊吓\\nvi. 惊恐",["Scary movies will frighten the children.","The steam took the most weird shapes, enough to frighten any one."],["恐怖片會嚇到小孩。",""]],["formally","'fɒ:mәli","adv. 正式地, 形式上",["French is the only foreign language I've ever formally studied.","Mary said that she'd never formally studied French."],["我只系统地学习过法语。",""]],["vivid","'vivid","a. 生动的, 鲜明的, 鲜艳的, 活泼的, 逼真的, 清晰的",["With such a vivid imagination he'll become either a world-famous novelist or a lunatic.","The patient's descriptions of her family are vivid, but very cynical."],["",""]],["frightening","'fraitәniŋ","a. 令人恐惧的；引起突然惊恐的",["A person without faith is frightening.","But earthquakes are still as frightening as ever."],["一个没有信仰的人是可怕的。","但是地震仍然是最可怕的事。"]],["keyboard","'ki:bɒ:d","n. 键盘\\n[计] 键盘",["You see the words that I typed on the screen, but you don't see the tears that I shed over the keyboard.","I'm just a raccoon with a PC and a MIDI keyboard."],["你看得見我打在螢幕上的字，卻看不到我掉在鍵盤上的淚。","我只是一隻擁有電腦和 MIDI 鍵盤的浣熊。"]],["poison","'pɒizn","n. 毒药, 毒, 毒物, 有毒害的事物\\nvt. 毒害, 毒杀, 使中毒\\nvi. 放毒, 下毒",["The tip of the spear was dipped in a deadly poison.","This poison is very effective in getting rid of roaches."],["矛尖浸在一種致命的毒藥裡。","這毒藥用來治蟑螂很有效。"]],["tenant","'tenәnt","n. 承租人, 房客, 居住者\\nvt. 租借\\n[计] 占据者",["The previous tenant took excellent care of her apartment.","The tenant must pay the landlord the rent at the end of each month."],["",""]],["communist","'kɒmjunist","n. 共产主义者, 共产党员\\n[法] 共产主义的, 共产党的",["There would be no New China without the communist party.","Comrades! Let's transform Moscow into a model communist city."],["没有共产党就没有新中国","同志们，让我们转换莫斯科为理想的共产主义城市。"]],["furious","'fjuәriәs","a. 狂怒的, 激烈的, 吵闹的",["Should he hear of your marriage, he will be furious.","Even though he apologized, I'm still furious."],["要是給他知道你要結婚的事，他肯定會大發雷霆。","雖然他道歉了，但我還是很生氣。"]],["undoubtedly","ʌn'dajtidli","adv. 无疑, 必定, 确实地",["All these new blocks will undoubtedly impact the loading speed of the home page.","The computer is undoubtedly a valuable tool."],["这些新模块毫无疑问会影响主页的加载速度。","電腦無疑是一項有價值的工具。"]],["repeated","ri'pi:tid","a. 重复的, 再三的\\n[法] 反复的, 再三的, 屡次的",["His ambition was blasted by these repeated failures.","I repeated the word several times for her."],["无数次的失败摧毁了他的雄心壮志。","我為她重複唸這個字很多遍。"]],["rocky","'rɒki","a. 岩石的, 多石的, 像岩石的, 无情的, 摇动的, 摇晃的",["Matthew's dog, Rocky, loves to steal cupcakes off the kitchen counter.","The first rays of the sun tore the cloudy veil and the outline of a rocky island appeared."],["马修的狗洛基喜欢从厨房台面上偷纸杯蛋糕。",""]],["omit","әu'mit","vt. 省略, 删除, 疏忽, 遗漏\\n[化] 省略",["Omit this word in your sentence because it's not necessary.","You can omit the last chapter of the book."],["把你句子中的这个词去掉，因为它是多余的。","你可以删去书里面的最后一章。"]],["ruler","'ru:lә","n. 统治者, 管理者, 尺, 直尺\\nn. 划线板\\n[计] 标尺",["Since ancient times, it has always been the commoners who tolerate their ruler.","The peasants rose up in rebellion against the ruler."],["自古至今，容忍的总是老百姓，被容忍的总是统治者。",""]],["noble","'nәubl","n. 贵族\\na. 高贵的, 高尚的, 贵族的, 辉煌的",["Your sister looks as noble as if she were a princess.","I want to play a game where a noble female knight with the nickname \"Light-Speed\" freely manipulates gravity."],["你妹妹看上去那么高贵，就像是个公主一样。",""]],["spider","'spaidә","n. 蜘蛛, 设圈套者\\n[化] 星形轮",["The first person who ate crab must also have tried to eat a spider.","Over the last hundred years, there have been twenty-seven recorded deaths from spider bites in Australia."],["第一个吃螃蟹的人一定也吃过蜘蛛。","过去一百多年，澳大利亚共有二十七例蜘蛛咬人致死的记录。"]],["turkish","'tә:kiʃ","n. 土耳其语\\na. 土耳其的, 土耳其人的, 土耳其语的",["We celebrate November 28 as Tatoeba day because it is the day when Turkish, Esperanto and Greek were added.","In various Turkish restaurants, shishkabob is the main food."],["我们将11月28日作为Tatoeba日来庆祝，因为土耳其语、世界语和希腊语是在那天被加上去的。","在各大土耳其餐馆，烤羊肉串是主食。"]],["obsession","әb'seʃәn","n. 困扰, 困扰人的情绪\\n[医] 强迫观念",["I've gotten wary of the gleam in your eye that shows when you've developed a new obsession.","Fadil saw the relationship more as an obsession than a romance."],["",""]],["corpse","kɒ:ps","n. 尸体\\n[医] 尸体",["Seeing all the worms wriggling on the corpse made me squirm all over.","Sami's corpse had been robbed before the police found it."],["",""]],["certainty","'sә:tәnti","n. 确定, 确实的事情\\n[法] 确定, 肯定, 必然的事",["I can say with certainty that he hates me.","The best thing about life is the certainty that it will end."],["我能確定地說他恨我。",""]],["problematic","prɔblә'mætik","a. 成问题的, 未定的, 疑难的, 有疑问的, 盖然性的, 或然性的",["There are many common problematic research practices such as p-hacking.","Marrying someone from a different background or country will always be more problematic than marrying someone from your own."],["",""]],["damp","dæmp","n. 潮湿, 湿气\\na. 潮湿的\\nvt. 使潮湿, 使阻尼, 抑止\\nvi. 变潮湿, 衰减",["Clean the window with a damp cloth.","The weather was not only cold, it was also damp."],["用濕布清潔窗戶。","天气又冷又湿。"]],["nutrition","nju:'triʃәn","n. 营养, 营养学\\n[医] 营养, 营养品",["She is careful about her child's nutrition.","Mosquitoes consider human beings a dangerous but necessary source of nutrition."],["她很关心孩子的营养问题。",""]],["vocabulary","vә'kæbjulәri","n. 词汇(量), 词汇表\\n[计] 词表",["Let's find sentences with new vocabulary on this topic, add them to the following list: _____; and translate them.","I use flash cards to study my German vocabulary."],["讓我們找關於這一主題有新單字的句子，將其添加到下面的列表：_____;並翻譯它們。","我用字卡來學德文生字。"]],["melody","'melәdi","n. 曲子, 美妙音乐, 曲调",["I can't remember the melody of that song.","I've heard that melody somewhere before."],["我想不起那首歌的旋律。","我之前在哪里听过那段旋律。"]],["electron","i'lektrɒn","n. 电子\\n[化] 电子",["An electron is a stable negatively charged subatomic particle.","Cooper pairs are electron pairs formed in superconductors."],["",""]],["distinguished","dis'tiŋgwiʃt","a. 卓著的, 著名的",["The rest of the show was not particularly distinguished.","His career as a journalist was full of distinguished achievements."],["",""]],["physicist","'fizisist","n. 物理学家, 机械唯物论者, 自然科学家\\n[医] 菲西克氏手术(虹膜圆片切除)",["This theory originated with a twenty-eight-year-old physicist.","The physicist was aware of the potential danger of nuclear fusion."],["",""]],["wool","wul","n. 羊毛, 毛织物, 毛线, 绒线\\n[医] 羊毛, 绒毛, 棉[花]",["The wool comes off the pig, and the dog pays the bill.","These fabrics are made of pure wool."],["羊毛出在豬身上，狗來買單。","这些布是全羊毛的。"]],["utterly","'ʌtәli","adv. 完全地, 全然, 绝对",["It is utterly impossible to finish the work within a month.","I was utterly soaked by the downpour."],["這份工作絕對沒有可能在一個月之內完成。","我被雨淋成了落汤鸡。"]],["maple","'meipl","n. 枫, 枫木, 淡棕色\\n[机] 枫木",["The beautiful red leaves of the maple become detached from the branches and are dancing in the wind.","A vase of frost-bleached ferns and ruby-red maple leaves adorned the table."],["楓樹美麗的紅葉從枝頭飄落，在風中翩翩起舞。","桌上擺放著一瓶被霜凍漂白的蕨類植物和紅寶石色的楓葉。"]],["memoir","'memwɑ:","n. 传记, 实录, 追思录, 回忆录, 自传\\n[化] 研究报告",["The memoir breathes the deepest respect for his father.","She penned a tell-all memoir of her affair with the president."],["",""]],["salesman","'seilzmәn","n. 售货员, 推销员\\n[经] 售货员, 店员, 推销员",["The customer and the salesman spoke for two hours on the phone.","Eventually the salesman persuaded me to buy the expensive machine."],["客人和售货员打了2小时电话。",""]],["cultivate","'kʌltiveit","vt. 培养, 耕作",["Picture books will cultivate the minds of children.","We should cultivate our minds by reading good books."],["",""]],["luxury","'lʌkʃәri","n. 奢侈, 豪华\\na. 奢侈的, 豪华的",["On the seventh floor, you can find four luxury restaurants.","In the United States the automobile is a necessity and not a luxury."],["在七楼，你可以找到四个豪华餐厅。","在美國，汽車並不是奢華的象徵，而是生活的必需品。"]],["microphone","'maikrәfәun","n. 扩音器, 麦克风\\n[医] 扩音器, 传声器",["For some reason the microphone didn't work earlier.","Tom put his hand over the microphone."],["剛才我的麥克風沒起作用，不知道為什麼。","湯姆把手放在麥克風上。"]],["goodbye","gud'bai","interj. 再见",["As the train pulled out, they waved goodbye to their parents.","Every time I leave, I'm of full the regret that I haven't fully said goodbye."],["火車開出的時候，他們都揮手向父母道別。","我很遗憾每次离开的时候，都没有好好地道别。"]],["realization",".riәlai'zeiʃәn","n. 实现, 领悟, 实得\\n[医] 现实化, 实现",["I came to the realization too late to make a difference.","None of these plans ever come anywhere near realization."],["",""]],["disposal","dis'pәuzәl","n. 丢掉, 处理, 排列, 销毁, 布置\\n[医] 处理, 处置",["Oh, I almost forgot! Today is garbage disposal day!","The students have an excellent gym at their disposal."],["啊！差点忘了。今天是扔垃圾的日子！",""]],["meadow","'medәu","n. 草地, 牧场",["Your sentences were like a green meadow in winter.","Cows are eating grass in the meadow."],["你的话语就像在冬天的绿色草甸一样。","牛在草地上吃牧草。"]],["cherry","'tʃeri","n. 樱桃, 樱桃树, 樱桃色\\n[医] 樱桃",["The statue was carved from a block of cherry wood.","You can decorate the cocktail with a cherry or a pineapple."],["这座雕像是由樱木雕刻而成。","你可以用一个樱桃或菠萝来装饰这杯鸡尾酒。"]],["defy","di'fai","vt. 藐视, 挑衅, 使落空\\nn. 挑战",["The truth is the truth, even if you defy it and intentionally cover it up, it is still no different from daydreaming.","He promises to enchant every one who dares defy his power."],["真理就是真理， 就算反其道而行故意掩盖它，这样的企图和白日做梦一样，不过是妄想而已。",""]],["magical","'mædʒikәl","a. 魔术的, 有魔力的, 不可思议的",["This paper is magical, it can turn into anything you want.","They were under the magical influence of the night."],["",""]],["plug","plʌg","n. 塞子, 栓, 插头\\nvt. 插入, 塞住, 接插头\\nvi. 被塞住",["Did you know that if you plug a pickle into an electrical outlet, it glows and makes buzzing noises?","Check that there is no dust or lint on the power plug before inserting into an electrical outlet."],["你知道如果你把泡菜插入電源插座，它會發光並且發出嗡嗡的聲音嗎？",""]],["wallet","'wɒlit","n. 皮夹\\n[法] 皮包, 皮夹, 钱袋",["When I was in London last year, someone broke into my room and stole my wallet.","My father took out his wallet and gave me ten dollars."],["當我去年在倫敦的時候，有人闖進了我的房間，偷走了我的錢包。","我爸爸拿出他的钱包，并给了我10美元。"]],["mining","'mainiŋ","n. 采矿\\n[经] 采矿, 采矿业",["Mining is one of the main sources of wealth in Chile.","Simply stated, data mining refers to extracting or \"mining\" knowledge from large amounts of data."],["",""]],["accordingly","ә'kɒ:diŋli","adv. 相应地, 因此, 于是",["Accordingly, besides noun declension patterns, there also existed a greater variety of verb conjugation patterns than in Modern English.","She is an adult, so you should treat her accordingly."],["因此，除了名詞的變格之外，也存在比現代英語多的動詞的各種變型。",""]],["lamb","læm","n. 小羊, 羔羊\\nv. 产羊羔",["I like eating grilled lamb skewers.","\"Let's go together to the forest,\" the wolf said to the lamb. \"OK, Uncle Wolf,\" the lamb replied."],["我喜欢吃烤羊肉串。",""]],["socialist","'sәuʃәlist","n. 社会主义者, 社会党党员\\n[法] 社会主义的",["We need to keep Algeria within the socialist framework.","He claims to be a socialist, and yet he has two houses and a Rolls Royce."],["我們需要讓阿爾及利亞保持在社會主義框架內。","他雖然號稱自己是個社會主義者，但是其實他擁有兩套房子還有一輛勞斯萊斯。"]],["tempt","tempt","vt. 诱惑, 引诱, 引起...的兴趣, 吸引, 冒...风险",["The brochure didn't tempt me to go on holiday there.","Women use perfume because a nose is easier to tempt than an eye."],["",""]],["fundamentally","fʌndә'mentәli","adv. 基础, 首要, 主要, 十分重要, 基本, 根本, 原始, 基频, 基音, 基谐波",["Fundamentally, the formation of the twelve zodiac signs is related to animal worship.","Patriotism is, fundamentally, a conviction that a particular country is the best in the world because you were born in it."],["從根本上說，十二生肖的形成，與動物崇拜有關。",""]],["scrap","skræp","n. 碎片, 残余物, 些微, 片断, 铁屑, 吵架\\nvt. 扔弃, 敲碎, 拆毁\\nvi. 互相殴打\\na. 零碎拼凑成的, 废弃的",["There is not a scrap of truth in his words.","Let's scrap everything and start again with a clean slate."],["他說的話沒有一句是真的。",""]],["declaration",".deklә'reiʃәn","n. 宣告, 说明, 宣布\\n[计] 说明",["Sami hasn't taken the shahada or the declaration of faith.","You can say that the circumstances were thus in the period leading up to the declaration of war."],["",""]],["wildly","","adv. 狂暴地, 激动地, 狂热地, 鲁莽地, 轻率地",["Suddenly the horse began to run about wildly.","Linda was wildly excited to learn that her aunt Nancy was coming to visit her."],["马突然狂暴地乱跑。",""]],["inject","in'dʒekt","vt. 注射, 注入, 使入轨\\n[医] 注射",["We have no other alternative but to swap horses midstream and inject a fresh atmosphere and new ideas into our organization.","She was trying to inject some fun into the grim proceedings."],["",""]],["axis","'æksis","n. 轴\\n[计] 坐标轴",["The earth revolves on its axis once every 24 hours.","The hand on its axis turns at 10 revolutions per hour."],["地球每二十四小時就會繞軸自轉一周。",""]],["applause","ә'plɒ:z","n. 鼓掌, 喝彩, 赞许",["His speech won the immediate applause of the audience.","The portrait of the king was unveiled and received enthusiastic applause."],["他的演說贏得了觀眾熱烈的掌聲。","國王的肖像揭曉，收穫了熱烈的掌聲。"]],["suitcase","'sju:tkeis","n. 手提箱",["Although Jane had one suitcase less than me, she still said she had too much to carry.","You can't get the suitcase closed because you've stuffed too much into it."],["雖然Jane的手提箱比我的少一個, 她還是說她要提的東西太多了。","你無法把這個手提箱關上，因為你已經塞了太多東西進去了。"]],["evenly","'i:vәnli","adv. 平衡地, 平坦地, 平等地",["Nowadays, equal pay is not enough. Household responsibilities must also be distributed evenly.","The money will probably be split evenly between those two."],["現在不止要男女薪金平等，而且還要平均分配家務。",""]],["dual","'dju:әl","a. 双重的, 双的\\nn. 双数",["Microsoft recently unveiled two new dual screen devices.","Arnold is concerned with cases of dual personality."],["Microsoft 近期新推出了兩款雙螢幕裝置。",""]],["supervise","'sju:pәvaiz","v. 监督, 管理, 指导",["Tom was hired to supervise the production of Mary's music video.","The group urges parents to supervise what their children watch on TikTok."],["",""]],["precede",".pri:'si:d","vt. 在...之前, 优于, 较...优先\\nvi. 在前面",["Each number in the Fibonacci sequence is the sum of the two numbers that precede it.","In Asia men usually precede women when walking."],["",""]],["triangle","'traiæŋgl","n. 三角形, 三个一组, 三角关系\\n[医] 三角, 三角形",["A triangle has 3 corners, and a hexagon has 6 corners.","Heron's Formula shows how the area of a triangle can be expressed as a function of its side lengths."],["三角形有三个角，而六边形有六个角","海龍公式說明了三角形的面積如何表示為其邊長的函數。"]],["shield","'ʃi:ld","n. 盾, 防卫物, 保护者, 屏蔽\\nvt. 保护, 遮蔽, 屏蔽, 庇护, 挡开, 避开\\nvi. 起保护作用",["Nurture strength of spirit to shield you in sudden misfortune.","Tom put on his mask, gloves and face shield before leaving the house."],["",""]],["aspiration",".æspә'reiʃәn","n. 热望, 志向, 渴望\\n[医] 吸入; 吸[引], 吸引术",["He studied day and night in aspiration to possibly become a lawyer.","Voiceless plosives in Dutch have almost no aspiration at all."],["",""]],["financing","fai'nænsiŋ","n. 融资, 理财, 筹集的资金\\n[经] 筹措资金, 理财",["The cost of financing of the project was very high.","It is necessary to secure financing for local road maintenance."],["",""]],["inclined","in'klaind","a. 倾向于...的, 想要...的, 可能的, 趋向于...的",["When you speak of a pay-raise before recognition, I am inclined to think you are putting the cart before the horse.","Children used to look up to their parents; now they are inclined to regard them as equals."],["",""]],["newcomer","nju:'kʌmә","n. 新来者",["The detective stared at the newcomer with blank amazement.","A newcomer to acting, Yalitza Aparicio is in the running for Best Actress this Sunday at the Academy Awards."],["",""]],["fried","fraid","a. 油炸的",["On the table, there was a plate with three fried eggs on it.","Hi, I'd like a deep-fried pizza roll."],["桌子上放著一個盤子，上面放著三顆煎蛋。","嗨, 我要一個炸薄餅卷。"]],["substitute","'sʌbstitju:t","n. 代理, 代理人, 代用品, 代替者, 代替物\\nvt. 代替\\nvi. 替代, 取代, 代用\\na. 代替的, 代用的, 代用品的\\…",["Then I'll work on the principle that deference is no substitute for obedience.","We should substitute margarine for butter for our health."],["那我就恭敬不如从命啦。",""]],["supervision",".sju:pә'viʒәn","n. 监督, 管理\\n[经] 监督, 管理",["Under supervision, he looks after his clients much better.","His heart was weak and he needed constant medical supervision."],["",""]],["calcium","'kælsiәm","n. 钙\\n[化] 钙Ca",["Beryllium, magnesium, calcium, strontium, barium and radium are alkaline earth metals.","Calcium is an essential mineral for the human body."],["",""]],["quantum","'kwɒntәm","n. 量, 量子\\n[计] 量子",["At the atomic scale we observe quantum mechanical effects that can not be explained by classical mechanics.","You don't need a PhD in quantum physics to be against nuclear war."],["",""]],["con","kɒn","vt. 精读, 仔细研究, 默记\\nadv. 反面地, 从反面\\na. 欺诈的\\nn. 反对者, 反对票, 肺结核\\n[计] 控制台",["You should open the windows and turn off the air-con!","There were a lot of opinions, pro and con, on this question."],["你把窗门开开，把空调关了！",""]],["picnic","'piknik","n. 野餐, 远足, 愉快的经历\\nvi. 去野餐, 远足",["I can still remember the time when we went on a picnic together.","Tom probably doesn't know why the picnic was canceled."],["我还记得我和你一起去野餐的时候。","湯姆大概不知道為什麼野餐取消了。"]],["gravel","'grævәl","n. 砂砾, 碎石\\n[医] 沙砾, 尿沙",["Gravel flipped up from the car ahead and cracked Tom's windshield.","They are binding the gravel with cement to repair the road."],["",""]],["textile","'tekstail","n. 纺织品, 纺织业\\na. 织的, 纺织的",["Textile News has a large following among those working in the textile industry.","Her father was a tractor driver and her mother worked in a textile plant."],["",""]],["visiting","'vizitiŋ","n. 参观, 拜访, 访问",["It wasn't until after visiting Australia that I realized Japan was so small.","Switzerland is a very beautiful country and well worth visiting."],["直到我游览了澳大利亚之后，我才意识到日本是多么小。","瑞士是一個非常漂亮的國家，值得一遊。"]],["precedent","'presidәnt","n. 先例, 前例\\na. 在先的, 在前的",["It's totally without precedent for the suspect's attorney to be the true culprit.","If Assange is sentenced, this will set a dangerous precedent for press freedom."],["這前所未聞, 犯罪嫌疑人的律師竟然是真正的罪魁禍首。",""]],["nationalism","'næʃәnәlizm","n. 民族主义, 民族特性",["You can't equate nationalism with fascism.","Nationalism is not to be confused with patriotism."],["你不能將民族主義與法西斯混為一談。",""]],["eternal","i'tә:nl","a. 永恒的, 永远的, 不灭的",["\"Literary composition is a great achievement that concerns the ruling of a state, a splendid affair of eternal standing\".","When it comes to love, women are experts and men eternal novices."],["\"文學作品是關係到一個國家統治的偉大成就，以及永恆地位的輝煌事跡\"。","當說到愛情，女人是專家而男人永遠是新手。"]],["indictment","in'daitmәnt","n. 起诉, 控告, 起诉状\\n[经] 起诉书",["It is unlikely that this indictment will lead to his deportation.","The family name fell into disrepute following their son's federal indictment."],["",""]],["interpreter","in'tә:pritә","n. 直译程序, 解释者, 口译者, 注释器\\n[计] 注释器",["The interpreter tries to give the most detail and information possible.","He is an interpreter in an international bank."],["翻译正在试图给尽可能多的细节和消息。","他是个国际银行的翻译。"]],["planned","plænd","a. 计划了的, 预定的, 根据计划的, 有组织的\\n[法] 有计划的, 计划的, 有秩序的",["Although the decision to implement this plan has already been made, the finer points still need to be planned out.","Today I planned to study in the library, but I didn't wake up until around 12 o'clock."],["这个计划虽然已经决定实施了，但是具体细节还需要从长计议。","今天我本打算在圖書館學習，但到12點左右才醒。"]],["calf","kɑ:f","n. 小牛, 小牛皮, 腓肠\\n[医] 腓肠",["The newborn calf couldn't catch up with the herd running from the jaguar.","My calf has been hurting since yesterday."],["新生小牛跟不上逃离美洲虎的牛群。","从昨天起我的小腿就一直痛。"]],["nursery","'nә:sәri","n. 托儿所, 苗圃, 温床\\n[医] 婴儿室, 托儿所",["My son told my wife, \"Mom, pick me up at the door to the nursery school at five forty-five in the afternoon, and don't be late!\"","They send their child to a part-time nursery."],["我儿子对我老婆说：“妈妈，你下午五点四十五分到幼儿园门口接我，别迟到哦。”","他们送孩子去了幼儿园的半托班。"]],["collision","kә'liʒәn","n. 碰撞, 冲突, 抵触\\n[计] 冲突",["In the collision with a Volvo, our car naturally got the worst of it.","A rogue asteroid from the Kuiper Belt is on a collision course with the Earth."],["",""]],["verify","'verifai","vt. 证明, 查证, 证实, 检验, 校验\\n[计] 校验, 检验; DOS内部命令:设定写入磁盘时是否验证写入的正确性",["Concerning the content below, I want to verify two things.","I can verify that that's the truth myself."],["关于下面的内容，我想确认两件事情。","我自己能够证实那是真的。"]],["encompass","in'kʌmpәs","vt. 围绕, 完成, 包括, 包含, 环绕, 包围",["The optimal formula which would encompass all these factors has not been proposed.","The heavens rotate and encompass the earth, which stands in the middle."],["",""]],["clan","klæn","n. 氏族, 宗族, 集团\\n[医] 支",["The clan system is a key component of traditional Chinese culture.","Since I'm a Florida Indian, I don't have a \"tribal town\" per se, but I am bird clan."],["宗族制度是中国传统文化的重要组成部分。",""]],["boxing","'bɒksiŋ","n. 拳击\\n[医] 围模(牙科)",["Tom wants to learn boxing, but his mother thinks it's too dangerous.","Boxing is not always a rough sport."],["汤姆想学拳击，但他妈妈觉得这太危险了。","拳擊並不總是一種粗暴的運動。"]],["diplomacy","di'plәumәsi","n. 外交, 外交手腕, 交际手段\\n[法] 外交, 外交手腕, 权谋",["International problems must be solved by diplomacy, not war.","English is useful in diplomacy and tourism."],["国际问题必须靠外交而非战争解决。","英語在外交和旅遊業方面很有用。"]],["mat","mæt","n. 垫, 丛, 衬边\\na. 粗糙的, 无光泽的\\nvi. 纠缠在一起\\nvt. 铺席于...上, 使无光泽, 使缠结",["Entering the house, I tripped over the mat.","I found the key underneath the mat."],["进家门后，我被垫子绊倒了。","我在擦鞋墊下面發現了這把鑰匙。"]],["spice","spais","n. 香料, 药料, 香气, 调味品, 情趣, 少许\\nvt. 加香料, 使添趣味",["Yan Daxia realised he had been lied to and flew to Jiang Feng's side. He took Jiang Feng's son and left. Yan Daxia vowed revenge and left the boy with a spice merchant.","I often quote myself. It adds spice to my conversation."],["燕大侠发现自己被骗了他飞到了江枫的旁边，他抱走江枫的儿子。燕大侠誓言报复，他把男孩给了一个香料商人。",""]],["faction","'fækʃәn","n. 小派系, 内讧\\n[法] 宗派, 派别, 小集团",["A faction of the Turkish military attempted an anti-Erdogan coup.","The atrocities committed by every participating faction in World War II were shocking."],["",""]],["sixty","'siksti","num. 六十, 六十个",["Sixty minutes make an hour, and a minute is made up of sixty seconds.","Sixty-nine percent of adult Americans are either overweight or obese."],["六十分钟为一小时，一分钟由六十秒组成。","69%的美国成人超重或肥胖。"]],["skillet","'skilit","n. 煮锅, 长柄浅锅",["Blacken the chicken by cooking it on the skillet on high heat for 10 minutes per side.","What Khalid really loved was the sizzle of bacon in the skillet."],["",""]],["immense","i'mens","a. 极广大的, 无边的, 非常好的",["The teachers are all continuing to teach despite the immense pressure.","An immense monument was erected in honor of the eminent philosopher."],["老師們都頂著巨大的壓力在堅持上課。",""]],["confused","kәn'fju:zd","a. 困惑的, 混乱的",["That was the part that Tom and I were most confused about.","I was very confused by his questions."],["这是我和汤姆最困惑的部分。","我對他的問題感到非常困惑。"]],["hop","hɒp","n. 单脚跳, 跳跃, 舞会, 飞行\\nvi. 单脚跳, 跳跃\\nvt. 跃过, 跳上, 加蛇麻子于, 服麻醉药\\n[计] 跳跃式传输",["Let me know beforehand instead of catching me on the hop at the last minute.","I just want to hop into my boat and sally forth into the great blueness."],["事先打个招呼，别叫我临时抓瞎。",""]],["thirteen","'θә:'ti:n","num. 十三, 十三个",["I've been a public school teacher for the past thirteen years.","This car can go thirteen kilometers for every liter of gasoline."],["過去 13 年，我都是公立學校的老師。","這輛車每升油能跑十三公里。"]],["bitch","bitʃ","n. 母狗, 母狼, 母狐",["It's written abazure (bitch). Surely this must mean a slut?","A fucking menopausal old bitch was complaining about me for no reason."],["上面寫的是「abazure (婊子)」。這肯定是指「蕩婦」吧？",""]],["ashamed","ә'ʃeimd","a. 惭愧的, 羞耻的",["He is very much ashamed of having behaved so badly.","This is the first time I've ever lied to my father and I am ashamed of myself."],["他為自己的行為感到非常羞恥。","我很惭愧，这是我第一次对我爸说谎。"]],["afterwards","'ɑ:ftәwәdz","adv. 然后, 后来",["In addition, we will issue the 'employee of the month' award afterwards.","Keep your eyes wide open before marriage, half shut afterwards."],["另外，之后我们会颁发“每月最佳员工”奖。","婚前張開眼，婚後半閉眼。"]],["instrumental",".instru'mentәl","a. 仪器的, 器具的, 可作为手段的\\n[医] 器械的",["He was greatly instrumental in making Japan understood.","I like vocal music better than instrumental music."],["",""]],["independently",".indi'pendәntli","adv. 独立地, 自立地",["Tom and Bill arrived at the conclusion independently of each other.","The truly remarkable feature of sound production by birds is that the two sides of the syrinx can act independently."],["",""]],["aftermath","'ɑ:ftәmæθ","n. 结果, 后果\\n[法] 后果, 结果",["There was no electricity for two days in the aftermath of the typhoon.","Throughout the aftermath of the explosion, Jason's easiness unsettled the survivors."],["",""]],["astronaut","'æstrәnɒ:t","n. 太空旅行者, 宇航员\\n[法] 美国太空人",["The man whom she is going to marry is an astronaut.","She will be the first Japanese woman astronaut."],["她的未婚夫是一個太空人。","她將會成為日本第一個女性太空人。"]],["useless","'ju:slis","a. 无用的, 无效的, 无益的\\n[机] 无用, 无价值, 无效",["For once in my life I'm doing a good deed... And it is useless.","All the wealth in the world is useless when death comes knocking on your door."],["我生平难得做了一件好事...却是没用的。","当死亡来敲你的门时，世界上所有的财富都是无用的。"]],["reproduction",".ri:prә'dʌkʃәn","n. 再现, 复制, 生殖, 繁殖, 复制品\\n[医] 生殖, 复现(心理)",["Reproduction or appropriation of HTML, images and photographs from within this site is prohibited.","Interspecies aggression is oriented towards goals related to reproduction."],["",""]],["crust","krʌst","n. 外壳, 坚硬外皮, 面包皮\\nvt. 盖以硬皮\\nvi. 结硬皮",["The snow lay on the ground, frozen into a thick, hard crust.","Under Europa's icy crust might be an ocean of water."],["地上覆盖着积雪，冻成了又硬又厚的壳。",""]],["gasp","gæsp","n. 喘气\\nvi. 喘气, 喘息, 渴望\\nvt. 气喘吁吁地说",["It was the sob of a woman, the muffled, strangling gasp of one who is torn by an uncontrollable sorrow.","Gasp, laughter and screaming filled the room. Smile, MIC drop, chuckle as he walked off stage."],["",""]],["altar","'ɒ:ltә","n. 圣坛, 祭坛",["The recent scandals involving altar boys and religious leaders have undermined the faith people have in the Church.","This girl I wouldn't take to the altar, at best to the hotel..."],["",""]],["flu","flu:","n. 流感, 流行性感冒",["I've had the flu since Monday. Right now, my temperature has gone down, but I don't feel completely normal yet.","We all caught flu, and so did the teacher."],["我从星期一开始得了流感。现在烧虽然退了，但感觉还不是很舒服。","我們全都染上了流感，連老師也不例外。"]],["embarrassing","im'bærәsiŋ","a. 令人为难的, 麻烦的",["His humor charmingly eased the embarrassing atmosphere at dinner time and made me breathe a sigh of relief.","The cat glided along, very refined, but ended up falling, which was very embarrassing."],["他的幽默巧妙地缓解了晚餐时尴尬的气氛，让我松了一口气。","這隻貓咪氣場全開，走著貓步，相當優雅，然後摔倒了，真是糗大了。"]],["umbrella","ʌm'brelә","n. 伞, 雨伞, 保护伞\\na. 伞的, 包罗万象的\\nvt. 用伞遮掩",["I have lost my umbrella somewhere in the park. I have to buy one.","You had better take an umbrella with you in case it rains."],["我的雨傘遺失在公園裡某個地方。我必須再買一把。","以防下雨你最好带把伞。"]],["millennium","mi'leniәm","n. 千禧年, 一千年",["We've already prepared for the millennium bug.","Islam has molded the culture of the people of Algeria for more than a millennium."],["我們已經準備好應付千年蟲。",""]],["mosquito","mә'ski:tәu","n. 蚊子\\n[医] 蚊",["Minnesota's state bird is the mosquito.","Tom got a lot of mosquito bites the last time he went camping."],["明尼苏达州的官方鸟就是蚊子。",""]],["unconscious",".ʌn'kɒnʃәs","a. 未意识到的, 无意识的, 无知觉的\\n[医] 人事不省的, 神志丧失的; 无意识的",["He was discovered unconscious on the floor of the kitchen.","He was found lying unconscious on the kitchen floor."],["他被人发现倒在厨房的地板上，不省人事。","他被人发现倒在厨房的地板上，不省人事。"]],["listing","'listiŋ","[计] 列表, 清单, 编目\\n[经] 挂牌, 上市, 编表",["This is not a legitimate escort listing, it's a trap by the police.","Listing every tree by its name would be overkill, but allow me to name at least one: the fig tree."],["",""]],["intimacy","'intimәsi","n. 亲密, 熟悉, 亲昵行为(言语)\\n[法] 亲近的行为, 亲密, 隐私",["Yanni and Skura need to build back their emotional intimacy.","He spoke of sex in a rather businesslike manner, which was how he tried to avoid talking about his problems with intimacy."],["",""]],["guardian","'gɑ:diәn","n. 看守者, 监护人, 保护人\\na. 保护的",["Christopher Columbus once fought Cerberus, the three-headed guardian of the underworld, with nothing but his hat.","He considers himself a guardian of moral standards."],["",""]],["obey","ә'bei","vt. 服从, 遵从, 顺从\\nvi. 服从",["To obey the law is everyone's duty.","Children should obey their parents."],["遵守法律是每个人的责任。","孩子應該服從他們的父母。"]],["divert","dai'vә:t","vt. 转移, 使欢娱\\nvi. 转移",["I tried to divert their attention without success.","The producers of Spanish strawberries divert water from natural reserves."],["",""]],["thoughtful","'θɒ:tful","a. 深思的, 体贴的",["She is very thoughtful and patient.","It is thoughtful of you to remind me of my promise."],["她非常周到和耐心。",""]],["vine","vain","n. 藤本植物, 葡萄, 藤, 蔓\\nvi. 形成藤蔓",["She saw beautiful green, vine-clad hills; palaces and country seats peeping through splendid woods.","Vine leaves in the sun take on colours that change from yellow to all shades red, brown and orange, finally reaching violet."],["",""]],["permanently","'p\\\\\\\\:mәntli","adv. 永久, 不变, 持久\\n[计] 永久性的",["Alert, in Nunavut, Canada, is the northernmost permanently inhabited place in the world.","You're still young, but not permanently."],["加拿大努納武特地區的阿勒特是世界上最北端的永久居住地。","你还年轻，可是并非永久。"]],["shocked","ʃɔkt","a. 震撼的；震惊的",["Shocked by the events of September 11th, politicians all over the world condemned the terrorists for their reprehensible deed.","I was shocked by the dog that sprang out of the darkness."],["911事件让世人震惊，全球所有的政治家都一致谴责恐怖分子的这一应受人斥责的行径。","黑暗中突然有一隻狗冒了出來，把我嚇了一跳。"]],["simulation",".simju'leiʃәn","n. 模拟, 假冒物, 模仿\\n[计] 模拟",["Build your own championship team in a new football management simulation game, launching in early November.","The proposed method is applied to three case studies in simulation."],["全新足球經理模擬遊戲將於 11 月初推出，邀你打造屬於自己的冠軍球隊。",""]],["methodology",".meθә'dɒlәdʒi","n. 方法学, 方法论\\n[化] 操作法; 工艺",["The methodology used in his study is also helpful to us in conducting our research.","In order to overcome the data gap, I developed a simple methodology."],["",""]],["passive","'pæsiv","a. 消极的, 被动的, 冷漠的, 顺从的, 无源的\\n[医] 被动的",["Tzu-hsiang's way too honest. He's hopelessly passive in relationships.","It is clearly shown in Johnson's investigation that passive smoking is very harmful."],["子翔那個人太老實了，談戀愛都被動得要命。","在Johnson的调查里，明确地证明了二手烟是很有害的。"]],["awaken","ә'weikәn","vt. 唤醒, 唤起, 使意识到\\nvi. 觉醒, 意识到",["If a piece of knotted string can unleash the wind, and if a drowned man can awaken, then I believe a broken man can heal.","This book will awaken your imagination."],["如果一段打结的绳子能换来风，如果淹死的人能再醒来，那么我相信伤了心的人会痊愈。","這本書會讓你發揮想像力。"]],["outrage","'autreidʒ","n. 暴行, 侮辱, 愤怒\\nvt. 凌辱, 虐待, 触犯",["The U.S. media has always reserved its strongest contempt and moral outrage for the left.","The relationship of two men can still lead to public outrage."],["",""]],["monopoly","mә'nɒpәli","n. 垄断, 专卖权, 独占事业\\n[经] 垄断, 专利品, 垄断(权)独占",["Monopoly is a popular game for families to play.","The company has a monopoly on the nation's tobacco business."],["大富翁是一個家庭玩的熱門遊戲。",""]],["loudly","'laudli","adv. 高声地, 大声地, 吵闹地",["The telephone on my desk rang persistently and loudly.","These young people are talking loudly amongst themselves and have absolutely no regard for those around them."],["我桌上的电话一直大声响铃。","這些年輕人彼此之間大聲說話, 絲毫不在意周圍的人。"]],["nun","nʌn","n. 修女, 尼姑",["From between the pleats of her black skirt, the nun brought out scissors and deftly cut coloured paper into long, narrow strips, which we could then braid into a paper rug.","Mother Teresa was a Catholic nun who lived and worked in Calcutta, India."],["修女從黑色裙子的褶皺間掏出剪刀，熟練地將彩色紙剪成長而窄的紙條，讓我們可以把這些紙條編成紙地毯。",""]],["attachment","ә'tʃætʃmәnt","n. 连接, 附属物, 连接物, 爱慕\\n[计] 附加, 附件",["He sometimes became impatient of the extreme fear which she expressed of their attachment being prematurely discovered.","I have installed Microsoft Office on my personal computer, so please use its file format when you send me the attachment."],["",""]],["broth","brɒθ","n. 原汁清汤, 肉汤\\n[医] 肉汤(培养基)",["You're right. The noodle broth here is a bit expensive.","I do not eat meat, fish, shellfish, poultry or broth."],["您说得对。这里的面汤比较贵。",""]],["summon","'sʌmәn","vt. 召唤, 召集, 号召, 振奋, 唤起, 鼓起\\n[经] 传唤, 传讯",["He gained the power to summon ghost trains.","Ziri performed the bizarre ritual to summon an evil demon."],["他獲得了召喚幽靈列車的能力。",""]],["optional","'ɒpʃәnl","a. 可选择的, 随意的\\n[化] 选购的",["Being challenged in life is inevitable, being defeated is optional.","An air conditioner is available as an optional extra."],["生命中你无法选择接踵而至的挑战，但是你可以选择不成为一个失败者。",""]],["miner","'mainә","n. 矿工, 开矿机, 坑道工兵\\n[经] 矿工",["Isaac Quispe is a 25-year-old former gold miner. He left that work after the murders of six people he worked with.","I thought that you knew that Tom was a coal miner."],["",""]],["aloud","ә'laud","adv. 出声地, 大声地",["I'd like Tom to read what's written on that paper aloud.","He thought to himself, \"No!\" Aloud he said, \"Yes.\""],["請湯姆大聲朗讀紙上的內容。","他心里对自己说“不！”。他大声说出“是。”。"]],["dangle","'dæŋgl","vi. 摇晃地悬挂着, 追求\\nvt. 使摇晃地悬挂\\nn. 悬垂",["If you dangle a shoelace in front of my cat, she'll play with it.","Dangle a string in front of the cat to see whether it's asleep."],["",""]],["cigar","si'gɑ:","n. 雪茄",["I watched a ring of smoke that floated from his cigar into the air.","The tall guy smoking a cigar over there is a famous director."],["我看著一輪煙圈從他的雪茄裏冒出來，飄到了空氣中。",""]],["delegation",".deli'geiʃәn","n. 代表团, 派遣代表团, 代表的地位(或权力)\\n[经] 派遣, 委任, 委托",["Tomorrow is the first time I will accompany the Chinese delegation, and I'm extremely nervous.","It was the first delegation that the new country had ever received."],["明天第一次陪中国代表团， 我紧张得不得了。",""]],["breed","bri:d","n. 种类, 品种\\nv. 养育, 引起, 饲养, 繁殖",["I always have to check my yard for stagnant pools of water so mosquitoes don't breed there.","The crocodile, which produces only male young in hotter weather, might die out too because there will be no females to breed."],["",""]],["haven","'heivn","n. 港, 避难所, 安息所\\nvt. 安置...于港中, 庇护, 入港",["The island was therefore a sure haven for all criminals who had run from the law.","Gustavo's cabin was a haven for birdwatchers, with various species visiting the area."],["",""]],["mobility","mәu'biliti","n. 可动性, 流动性, 机动性\\n[化] 迁移率",["The pain subsided, but the mobility of the arm returned very slowly.","The formal name for the spacesuit used on the International Space Station is the Extravehicular Mobility Unit, or EMU."],["",""]],["assurance","ә'ʃuәrәns","n. 保证, 把握, 信心, 保险\\n[经] 保证, 担保, 保险",["She had something of the assurance of a famous actress.","Now faith is confidence in what we hope for and assurance about what we do not see."],["",""]],["jerk","dʒә:k","n. 性情古怪的人, 急拉, 肌肉抽搐, 牛肉干\\nvi. 痉挛, 急拉, 急推\\nvt. 猛拉",["He's completely convinced of his own greatness but to the people around him he's just a selfish jerk.","Suppose there's some jerk you just can't get on with."],["",""]],["competing","","a. 相互矛盾的；抵触的",["Tom and Mary are competing against each other for the same job.","Algeria and Morocco are competing for influence in North Africa and the Sahel region."],["",""]],["mob","mɒb","n. 暴民, 民众, 暴徒\\nvt. 大举包围, 蜂拥进入, 围攻\\nvi. 聚众生事",["The show's about a New Jersey mob boss who's in psychotherapy.","The mob gathered round the car like so many flies."],["",""]],["weep","wi:p","n. 哭, 哭泣\\nvi. 哭泣, 流泪, 哀悼, 滴落\\nvt. 哭着使..., 悲叹, 滴下",["Rejoice with them that do rejoice, and weep with them that weep.","\"When the dead weep, they are beginning to recover,\" said the Crow solemnly."],["",""]],["consultation",".kɒnsәl'teiʃәn","n. 请教, 咨询, 磋商会\\n[医] 会诊",["I'll call the doctor to reschedule the consultation.","I'd like to have a consultation about getting braces."],["",""]],["liquor","'likә","n. 酒, 液体, 汁, 溶液\\nvt. 浸水\\nvi. 喝酒",["I want to be able to hold my liquor better.","Lips that touch liquor shall not touch mine."],["想酒量大一些。","碰過酒的嘴唇就別想碰我的唇。"]],["dioxide","dai'ɒksaid","n. 二氧化物\\n[医] 二氧化物",["Carbon dioxide is a gas that is produced every time a fuel such as coal, oil, or natural gas is burned.","Mangroves absorb more carbon dioxide than any other trees on Earth because they have large underground root structures."],["二氧化碳是燃燒煤、石油或天然氣這樣的燃料時會產生的氣體。","红树林吸取二氧化碳比地球上其他树木都要多，因为它们具有很大的地下根部结构。"]],["accountable","ә'kauntәbl","a. 负有责任的, 可说明的, 可解释的\\n[经] 负有责任的",["Legal frameworks exist to hold war criminals accountable.","You shouldn't hold people accountable for things they can't control."],["法律架構的存在，使戰爭罪犯的責任可以追究。",""]],["affirm","ә'fә:m","v. 断言, 确认",["It doesn't matter how others see you. What is important is to be sure to affirm your own self.","Many scientists affirm that life on Earth didn't arise by chance."],["别人怎样看自己不重要,重要的是要保证自己得到自己的认同。",""]],["sip","sip","n. 啜饮, 小口喝, 抿\\nvi. 啜饮\\nvt. 啜\\n[计] 单列直插式组件",["Tom picked up one of the cans, opened it, and took a sip.","It's nice to sip and savour drinks other than beer as well from time to time."],["",""]],["sadly","'sædli","adv. 悲痛地, 悲惨地, 悲伤地, 说来遗憾",["The doctors did all they could to control Tom's disease but, sadly, to no avail.","Sadly, most young people speak dialect only rarely."],["医生们尽力控制汤姆的病情了但可惜无法奏效。","不幸的是，大多数年轻人都不常说方言了。"]],["span","spæn","n. 指距, 全长, 跨距, 一段时间, 小范围\\nvt. 以手指测量, 跨越, 架设, 持续",["The life span of a butterfly is short.","Seventy or eighty years is the normal span of a man's life."],["蝴蝶的寿命短。",""]],["emergence","i'mә:dʒәns","n. 出现, 浮现, 发生",["The emergence of a third gender has added legal and administrative complications, creating unnecessary burdens.","Enlightenment is man's emergence from his self-incurred immaturity."],["第三性別的出現增加了法律和行政上的麻煩，徒增無謂的負擔。",""]],["lifelong","'laiflɒŋ","a. 终身的, 毕生的",["I like to do oil painting, but I don't intend to make that my lifelong occupation.","Tom silently looked at the face of his lifelong enemy who was sitting down across the table."],["我喜欢画油画，但是我不想拿它做我的终身职业。",""]],["linger","'liŋgә","vi. 逗留, 消磨, 徘徊\\nvt. 消磨",["There are rumors that some evil spirits linger around here.","Our memories of pain can linger long after the physical sensation has faded."],["传闻这附近有些脏东西。",""]],["applaud","ә'plɒ:d","v. 拍手喝彩, 称赞, 赞同",["The whole audience got up and started to applaud.","As soon as the new teacher entered the classroom, the students began to applaud."],["所有的观众都站起来鼓掌。",""]],["stabilize","'steibilaiz","vt. 使安定, 使稳固\\nvi. 稳定, 安定",["The authorities managed to stabilize the currency.","The authorities are striving in vain to stabilize the currency."],["",""]],["cube","kju:b","n. 立方体, 立方\\n[机] 立方体, 立方",["I like to put an ice cube into my coffee, because it's usually too hot.","Hi Mr Ant, keeping up the good work today as well. Here's a sugar cube."],["",""]],["harbor","'hɑ:bә","n. 港, 避难所\\nv. 庇护, 藏匿, (使)入港停泊",["The boat was piloted safely into harbor.","There are many ships in the harbor."],["船被安全地领入港口。","港口內有許多船。"]],["swiss","swis","n. 瑞士人, 瑞士腔调\\na. 瑞士的, 瑞士风格的",["Most Swiss people can speak three or four languages.","My friend lives near the Swiss German border."],["瑞士人大多能說三、四種語言。","我的朋友住在瑞士与德国边境附近。"]],["fax","fæks","n. 传真\\nvt. 发传真\\n[计] 传真系统; 传真",["I have no idea of how to send a fax.","Here is our answer to your fax message dated April 1st."],["我不知道如何传真。",""]],["underneath",".ʌndә'ni:θ","adv. 在下面\\nprep. 在...的下面",["Underneath we wrote the names of the students in our class.","I found the key underneath the mat."],["下面写上我们班同学的名字。","我在擦鞋墊下面發現了這把鑰匙。"]],["embassy","'embәsi","n. 大使馆, 大使馆全体人员\\n[经] 大使馆",["He is about to become a diplomat at the Chinese Embassy in France.","The embassy is located next to the Supreme Court."],["他将要成为中国驻法国大使馆的外交官。","大使馆就在最高法院旁边。"]],["preacher","'pri:tʃә","n. 传道士, 讲道者, 牧师",["She was there for the buses in Montgomery, the hoses in Birmingham, a bridge in Selma, and a preacher from Atlanta who told a people that \"We Shall Overcome.\" Yes, we can.","Our preacher preaches the same sermon every Christmas."],["她看到蒙哥马利通了公共汽车、伯明翰接上了水管、塞尔马建了桥，一位来自亚特兰大的传教士告诉人们：“我们将克服阻力。”是的，我们能做到。",""]],["dim","dim","a. 暗淡的, 模糊的\\nvt. 使暗淡\\n[计] 数据解释模块",["You shouldn't read a book in a room this dim.","The light is too dim for me to read easily."],["你不應該在這麼暗的房間裏看書。","灯光太暗了，我没法阅读。"]],["injection","in'dʒekʃәn","n. 注射, 注射剂\\n[化] 注入; 注射",["It's alright. This injection won't hurt. It will just prick a little.","Because of a flaw in the original design, our website is vulnerable to SQL injection attacks."],["没关系的，这个针不痛的，就只有一点点刺痛感。","由于最初设计中的一个缺陷，我们的网站易受到SQL注入攻击。"]],["facial","'feiʃәl","n. 美颜, 脸部按摩\\na. 脸的, 表面的, 脸部用的",["Observe his facial reaction when we mention a price.","This is more like a liquid than a facial cream. That makes it easy to use."],["",""]],["plantation","plæn'teiʃәn","n. 种植园, 大农场, 植树造林, 新开垦地\\n[医] 栽植(如牙或其他组织的植入、再植和移植)",["He realized a large sum by the sale of the plantation.","Jefferson was a plantation owner, and he owned slaves which he freed in his will."],["",""]],["predictable","pri'diktәbl","a. 可预言的",["This source is dependable and predictable, but more research is still needed in this area.","The more variables you have, the less predictable the results become."],["",""]],["sunset","'sʌnset","n. 日落, 晚年",["Even after sunset there was little moderation in the temperature.","We could see the sunset from the window."],["甚至在日落之后，气温也不见降低。","我们能从窗户看到日落。"]],["presume","pri'zu:m","vt. 假定, 推测, 擅自, 意味着\\nvi. 擅自行动, 相信",["This I presume is your celebrated friend, Mr. Sherlock Holmes.","Presume not on thy heart when mine is slain; thou gav'st me thine, not to give back again."],["",""]],["excess","ik'ses","n. 过度, 剩于, 超过, 超额\\na. 过量的, 额外的",["The load of the truck was in excess of three tons.","Exercise, if carried to excess, will do you more harm than good."],["貨車的載貨量超過了三噸。",""]],["nearest","","a. 最近的（near的最高级）",["The ambulances carried the injured to the nearest hospital.","The nearest star to our solar system is Proxima Centauri."],["救护车把伤者送往了最近的医院。","離我們太陽系最近的恆星是比鄰星。"]],["proponent","prә'pәunәnt","n. 建议者, 支持者\\n[法] 提议者, 辩护者, 支持者",["Having worked at the cafeteria for ten years, Mary was a big proponent of meatloaf.","Mordecai Noah was a prominent proponent of slavery in the United States."],["",""]],["constituent","kәn'stitjuәnt","n. 成分, 选民, 构成物\\na. 构成的, 组织的, 选举的",["Until we know the constituent elements of human intelligence, we cannot create artificial intelligence."],[""]],["vietnamese","'vjetnә'mi:z","n. 越南人；越南语",["It wasn't in Vietnam that I learnt Vietnamese.","Vietnamese is really hard to learn."],["我的越南语不是在越南学的。","越南语真的难学。"]],["antique","æn'ti:k","n. 古董, 古物\\na. 古老的, 古风的, 旧式的, 过时的",["Can you tell me where the nearest antique shop is?","He came across this old coin in an antique shop."],["你能告诉我最近的古玩店在哪里吗？","他偶然在古董店裏發現了這個舊硬幣。"]],["polish","'pɒliʃ","a. 波兰的\\nn. 波兰人, 上光剂, 光泽, 优雅\\nvt. 擦亮, 擦去, 使完美\\nvi. 擦亮, 变得光亮",["I speak a little Polish, just enough to make myself understood.","I became acquainted with beautiful Polish women at the university in Brazil, and I also met there some very friendly people who could speak Polish."],["我会一点儿波兰语，勉强能让人听懂。","我在巴西的大学认识了美丽的波兰女士，也见了一些会说波兰语的友好的人们。"]],["dairy","'dєәri","n. 牛奶公司, 乳品店, 乳牛场",["Cheese, butter, cream, yogurt and kefir are dairy products.","Cheese and other dairy products do not agree with me."],["",""]],["gardener","'gɑ:dәnә","n. 园丁, 花匠, 园艺家",["The gardener planted a rose tree in the middle of the garden.","The gardener turned out to be the murderer."],["园丁在花园的中央种了一棵玫瑰树。","园丁后来发现就是凶手。"]],["sweeping","'swi:piŋ","n. 扫除, 垃圾\\na. 扫荡的, 彻底的, 广泛的",["When you've finished sweeping, I'll mop.","When you're done sweeping, I'll mop."],["你掃完地後，我來拖地。","你掃完地後，我來拖地。"]],["saudi","'sajdi","a. 沙乌地阿拉伯（人或语）的",["Women are not permitted to drive cars in Saudi Arabia.","I've seen just now that the ambassador of Saudi Arabia has resigned."],["在沙烏地阿拉伯，女性不允許駕駛汽車。",""]],["manipulation","mә.nipju'leiʃәn","n. 操作, 处理\\n[化] (用手)操作; 使用",["Aliens prevented a major war on Earth by hidden manipulation.","The Bouteflika years were characterized by electoral manipulation."],["",""]],["wit","wit","n. 机智, 智力, 头脑, 理智, 妙语, 机智的人",["An ounce of wit that is bought is worse a pound that is taught.","A fall into a pit, a gain in your wit."],["花代价所换来的一点才智，抵过别人传授的数倍不止。","吃一堑长一智。"]],["skate","skeit","n. 溜冰, 冰鞋\\nvi. 滑冰, 滑过",["My parents taught me to skate when I was three years old.","If you want to skate well, you should take it up seriously."],["",""]],["fabulous","'fæbjulәs","a. 传说的, 寓言般的, 难以置信的",["It was a fabulous show which brought us an endless delight.","The laboratory acquired a fabulous reputation for its historic discovery."],["那是一个给我们带来无穷乐趣的传奇性的演出。",""]],["legitimacy","li'dʒitimәsi","n. 合法, 正统, 正当\\n[法] 合法性, 正统性, 婚生",["Domestic foes argue the so-called unity government lacks legitimacy and has been foisted on the country by foreign powers.","Fair trials ensure the legitimacy of holding war criminals accountable."],["",""]],["intersection",".intә'sekʃәn","n. 交集, 十字路口, 交叉点\\n[计] 逻辑乘; 与",["You can get there by crossing the street at the second intersection.","He failed to see the stop sign at the intersection and hit an oncoming car."],["你从这里过去到那里，穿过第二条横马路就是。","他沒有看見十字路口的停止標誌，和一輛迎面而來的汽車撞個正著。"]],["curse","kә:s","n. 咒骂, 诅咒\\nvt. 诅咒, 咒骂",["Yes, people usually curse at someone they are acquainted with.","I found out that all this tragedy is the work of a wicked curse."],["對，人通常會對自己的熟人口出惡言。",""]],["resignation",".rezig'neiʃәn","n. 辞职, 辞呈, 听从\\n[经] 辞职",["What shocked us greatly was his sudden resignation.","\"Exchanging courtesies every day is all we've done,\" Tom answered with resignation."],["让我们非常惊讶的是，他突然辞职了。","“天天寒暄就是我们做的所有事了。”汤姆无奈地回答。"]],["culturally","","adv. 从文化角度, 文化意义上；在人文学方面",["In the development of Lojban, efforts were consistently made since the initial phase to keep the language culturally neutral.","Algeria is culturally close to Morocco and Tunisia."],["",""]],["reconciliation",",rekәnsili'eiʃәn","n. 和解, 和好, 复交, 调解, 调停, 和谐, 一致, 甘愿, 顺从\\n[经] (银行往来)调节, 调和, 一致",["He says racial reconciliation and nation building will be the aims of his government.","They were hostile to any attempt at reconciliation."],["",""]],["deed","di:d","n. 行为, 实行, 契约\\nvt. 立契转让",["Shocked by the events of September 11th, politicians all over the world condemned the terrorists for their reprehensible deed.","For once in my life I'm doing a good deed... And it is useless."],["911事件让世人震惊，全球所有的政治家都一致谴责恐怖分子的这一应受人斥责的行径。","我生平难得做了一件好事...却是没用的。"]],["impairment","im'peәmәnt","n. 削弱, 减少, 损害, 损伤, 危害\\n[计] 减损",["The impairment cannot bring them to lose their willingness to live.","Yanni's visual impairment makes him more vulnerable."],["",""]],["miserable","'mizәrәbl","a. 悲惨的；痛苦的；卑鄙的",["Kate glanced at Chris and then ignored him, making him feel miserable.","I felt ready to give in because of my miserable failure."],["凱特看了克里斯一眼，然後不理睬他，使他感到痛苦。",""]],["closure","'klәuʒә","n. 关闭\\nvt. 使终止",["The school's closure was due to the snow.","It's hard to get a sense of closure when your ex doesn't want to speak to you."],["停课是因为下雪。",""]],["machinery","mә'ʃi:nәri","n. 机器, 机械装置, 机构\\n[化] 机械",["Then arose the question of where we were to get the necessary machinery.","An old worker was found repairing machinery in the workshop."],["于是出现了一个问题，哪里能找我们需要的机器。","有人发现一个老工人在车间修机器。"]],["lively","'laivli","a. 活泼的, 鲜明的, 生动的",["The atmosphere is always extremely lively when eating hot pot.","There isn't a place in this market that isn't lively."],["吃火锅的时候 ,气氛往往是非常热闹的.","市场上到处都很热闹。"]],["erase","i'reis","vt. 抹去, 擦掉\\n[计] 清洗; 擦除; 抹除; DOS内部命令:从磁盘上删除一个或多个文件",["Nature is beginning to erase all evidence of men in the region.","No one can erase the Berber language from North Africa."],["",""]],["terminal","'tә:minәl","n. 终端机, 终点, 末端, 极限, 终点站\\na. 终点的, 定期的, 致死的, 结尾的, 末端的, 晚期的\\n[计] 终端; 终端设备",["Life is a sexually transmitted terminal disease.","The car is parked in Zone E, space 97. That's out the main door, to the right and down at the end of the terminal building."],["生命是一種致命的性傳染病。",""]],["shave","ʃeiv","n. 修面, 刮胡子, 幸免, 剃刀\\nvt. 修面, 剃, 修剪, 掠过\\nvi. 刮脸, 勉强通过",["It is pleasant to shave off my beard.","If the door doesn't fit, you might have to shave off a bit of the wood until it closes properly."],["刮完胡子感觉很舒服。",""]],["coaching","'kәutʃiŋ","n. 辅导；教练技术",["Tom is considering taking a coaching job.","Sami and Layla committed to attend a course of marriage coaching."],["湯姆在考慮擔任教練一職。",""]],["irrelevant","i'relәvәnt","a. 不恰当的, 无关系的, 不相干的\\n[法] 无关的, 不相干的, 离题的",["Sometimes I find that I basically have no time to pay attention to irrelevant trivia.","Your suggestion seems irrelevant to our discussion here."],["有时候发现自己基本上没有时间顾及一些无关紧要的琐事。",""]],["foolish","'fu:liʃ","a. 愚蠢的, 傻的",["Claiming that money is not a requirement for happiness is foolish.","What a pity that there are more foolish people than smart ones."],["声称钱不是幸福的一个要素是愚蠢的。","可惜，世界上的愚人总比聪明人要多。"]],["armor","'ɑ:mә","n. 盔甲, 潜水服, 装甲\\nvt. 为...装甲",["Tom came to my rescue, like a knight in shining armor.","Today, even though he has not put on his armor, he has not forgotten to carry his sword."],["",""]],["frightened","'frait(ә)nd","a. 受惊吓的, 受惊的, (非正式)害怕...的",["There is no need to be frightened. He won't harm you.","When I saw the ghost, I was so frightened that my hair stood on end."],["不用怕，他不會傷害你的。","看到鬼的時候，我嚇得汗毛直豎。"]],["neatly","'ni:tli","adv. 整洁地, 干净地, 匀称地",["Most kids in China start learning Chinese characters with a special notebook which has square grids that help them write neatly.","She folded her handkerchief neatly."],["大多數中國小孩初學漢字，會使用印有方格的特殊冊子，可以輔助工整書寫。","她整齊地把她的手帕折好。"]],["ignorance","'ignәrәns","n. 无知, 愚味\\n[法] 无知, 不知情, 愚昧",["If you think education is expensive, wait till you see what ignorance costs you.","The world's evil almost always comes from ignorance."],["如果你認為教育是昂貴的, 那麼你等著看無知讓你付出的代價。","世上的罪恶差不多总是由愚昧无知造成的。"]],["wetland","'wetlænd","n. 湿地, 沼泽地\\n[经] 湿地",["Many of their wetland habitats are being affected by mining.","A wetland is an area of land that is saturated with water."],["",""]],["skier","'ski:ә","n. 滑雪的人",["He was a very good skier when he was little.","The professional skier liked to \"hot-dog\" down the mountain."],["他年輕時很會滑雪。",""]],["reverend","'revәrәnd","n. 教士, 大人(对教士的尊称)\\na. 应受尊敬的, 教士的",["People called Reverend Dan Anderson for his advice.","By the chalice of Jesus, Reverend hermit, what is this infernal liquor?"],["",""]],["playground","'pleigraund","n. 运动场, 操场, 度假胜地, 活动场所",["A group of young people are playing handball on the playground.","A group of young men are playing handball in the playground."],["一群年輕人在操場上打手球。","一群年輕人在操場上打手球。"]],["embarrassment","im'bærәsmәnt","n. 困难, 阻碍, 困窘\\n[医] 窘迫",["Giggling with embarrassment, she held out the condom.","He went pale with fear and then turned red with embarrassment."],["她害羞地笑着拿出了避孕套。",""]],["amateur","'æmәtә","n. 业余爱好者, 外行, 爱好者\\n[电] 业余家",["The point we must clarify here is that the lines between amateur and professional in sport are beginning to disappear.","I was still an amateur at that time."],["我们必须阐明这个观点，在运动项目上，业余选手和专业选手的界限开始消失了。","我那時還是個外行。"]],["cellular","'seljulә","a. 细胞的\\n[医] 细胞的",["I want a cellular phone, but I don't have enough money to pay for one.","Cellular organization is one of the main characteristics that define a living being."],["我想要一支手機, 但是我沒有足夠的錢買一支。",""]],["competent","'kɒmpitәnt","a. 能干的, 胜任的, 有效的, 足够的\\n[经] 有权的, 授权的, 胜任的",["I've been told that you're a very competent person.","They are both very competent judges."],["有人說你是個很有能力的人。","他们俩都是很称职的法官。"]],["primitive","'primitiv","n. 原始人, 早期艺术家\\na. 原始的, 上古的\\n[计] 图元; 原语; 基元",["Magic plays an important part in primitive society.","He contends that primitive life once existed on Mars."],["巫術在原始社會扮演重要角色。",""]],["balcony","'bælkәni","n. 阳台, 戏院楼厅",["The family is eating breakfast on the balcony.","The school won't turn on the air conditioning, so the students are going to throw their hot water flasks off of the balcony in protest."],["一家人在陽臺上吃早飯。","学校不给开空调，学生们就会从阳台上扔热水瓶抗议。"]],["brow","brau","n. 眉毛, 额\\n[医] 额, 眉, 睫毛",["The sweat was dripping off my brow.","On hearing that, he knitted his brow."],["汗水從我的額頭上落下。","他聽到那個時，皺起了眉頭。"]],["mosque","mɒsk","n. 清真寺",["In Tbilisi, you can find the only mosque in the world where shia and sunni Muslims pray together.","This is a house and that is a mosque."],["在第比利斯，你可以看到世界上唯一一座什葉派和遜尼派穆斯林一起祈禱的清真寺。","这是一座房子，那是一座清真寺。"]],["linear","'liniә","a. 线的, 直线的, 线状的\\n[计] 线性",["\"Actually, I understood everything in linear algebra until we came to vector spaces,\" said Tom. Mary just shook her head.","He's an eccentric man who thought that time was not linear."],["",""]],["closing","'klәuziŋ","n. 结束\\na. 结束的",["Friendly Reminder: Please keep in mind the closing time of the line you need to switch to, so as to avoid delays in your trip.","The commemorative ceremony ended with the closing address."],["友情提示：请留意您需要换乘线路的首末班时间，以免耽误您的出行。",""]],["excellence","'ekslәns","n. 优秀, 卓越, 优点",["Some analysts consider Somalia as the failed state par excellence.","He won the prize for excellence in all subjects."],["一些分析家認為索馬里是非常失敗的國家。","他各科全优。"]],["reasoning","'ri:zniŋ","n. 推论, 推理, 论证\\n[化] 推理",["Women really are quite dangerous. The more I think about this, the more I'm able to understand the reasoning behind face covering.","Her line of reasoning is attractive, but ultimately fallacious."],["女人真是太危险了。越想这一点越能理解蒙脸的道理。","她说理的主线引人注目，但从根本上是靠不住的。"]],["recycle",".ri:'saikl","vt. 使再循环, 重新利用, 再制\\nn. 再循环",["We must make the utmost effort to reduce the use of plastic packaging, and also to recycle all waste plastic.","I wish that more people would take time to properly recycle."],["我们应该尽我们最大的努力减少塑料包装的使用，并回收所有的塑料废物。",""]],["par","pɑ:","n. 标准, 票面价值, 平均数量, 同等水平\\na. 票面的, 平常的, 标准的, 平价的\\n[计] 重新传输的肯定回答",["Some analysts consider Somalia as the failed state par excellence.","I'm not saying that I'm better than him, or that I'm even on par with him."],["一些分析家認為索馬里是非常失敗的國家。",""]],["worship","'wә:ʃip","n. 崇拜, 礼拜, 尊敬\\nvi. 参加礼拜\\nvt. 崇拜, 尊敬",["On New Year's Day many Japanese go to the shrine to worship.","Fundamentally, the formation of the twelve zodiac signs is related to animal worship."],["很多日本人都會在元旦到神社參拜。","從根本上說，十二生肖的形成，與動物崇拜有關。"]],["harmful","'hɑ:mful","a. 有害的, 伤害的",["There's a chance that tap water may contain harmful substances like chlorine and lead.","Be mindful of your actions when in a relationship.What may seem playful to you could really be harmful to your partner."],["自來水有可能含有氯、鉛等有害物質。","请小心地呵护两人之间的感情。也许当你认为只是一个玩笑时，却真真切切地伤了对方的心。"]],["ant","ænt","n. 蚂蚁",["Hi Mr Ant, keeping up the good work today as well. Here's a sugar cube.","The ant dropped her dead sister into the hot tub. True story."],["",""]],["coincidence","kәu'insidәns","n. 巧合, 同时发生\\n[电] 符合计数器",["By coincidence, these two are still being serviced.","Tom doesn't think this is a coincidence."],["真的湊巧，這兩樣現在還在維修。","汤姆不认为这是一个巧合。"]],["resentment","ri'zentmәnt","n. 怨恨, 愤恨",["Losing your temper for no reason would invite the resentment of others.","I feel resentment against your unwarranted criticism."],["无理由乱发脾气会让别人反感。",""]],["dependence","di'pendәns","n. 依赖, 依存, 信赖\\n[医] 依赖(如对药物的依赖,即瘾或癖), 从属, 偏利共生",["Japan's dependence on foreign trade is not necessarily very high as a percentage of GNP.","It's not true that equality is a law of nature; nature makes nothing equal - her sovereign laws are subordination and dependence."],["",""]],["feminine","'feminin","a. 女性的, 阴性的, 柔弱的\\n[医] 女性的, 雌性的",["Masculine qualities in a woman are seen as strength, while feminine qualities in a man are viewed as weakness.","In German, the feminine definite article's genitive singular is \"der\"."],["",""]],["justification",".dʒʌstifi'keiʃәn","n. 辩护, 证明正当, 释罪\\n[计] 调整",["It is without justification that money has been called one of the greatest inventions of man.","You have no justification to say something like that."],["",""]],["tuition","tju:'iʃәn","n. 学费, 讲授",["Today is the last day to pay tuition fees, and my credit card has no money on it.","I am working to save for my college tuition."],["今天是交学费的最后一天，我银行卡里没钱了。","我工作是为了攒大学学费。"]],["destructive","di'strʌktiv","a. 毁灭性的, 破坏的, 有害的\\n[医] 破坏的, 毁坏的",["Suspicion is destructive of friendship.","This destructive world has already experienced two world wars."],["怀疑会毁掉友情。",""]],["governmental",".gʌvәn'mentl","a. 政治的, 统治上的, 政府的\\n[法] 政府的, 统治的, 政治上的",["Prefectures are governmental divisions of France and Japan.","The bank's actions seemed to assure investors about the soundness of the governmental bonds."],["",""]],["repetition",".repi'tiʃәn","n. 重复, 背诵, 循环, 复制品, 副本\\n[机] 重复, 反复",["Repetition is the mother of memory.","The fact that these assertions have consistently proved to be without foundation unfortunately does not prevent their repetition."],["重复是记忆之母。",""]],["niche","nitʃ","n. 壁龛\\nvt. 放入壁龛, 安顿",["U.S. companies are working to find a niche in the Japanese economy.","Joel likes to call himself a niche internet microcelebrity."],["美國公司正在日本經濟中努力尋找利基點。",""]],["inexpensive",".inik'spensiv","a. 便宜的, 不贵重的",["Everyone says the food in this restaurant is both delicious and inexpensive.","Do you know if there's an inexpensive hotel near here?"],["大家说这家饭馆儿的菜又好吃又便宜。","您知道這附近有便宜的旅館嗎？"]],["sleeping","'sli:piŋ","n. 睡眠\\na. 睡着的",["I'm sorry, my boss is sleeping right now. Please come back tomorrow.","The old cottage had only one bed, so we all took turns sleeping in it."],["实在抱歉，老板在睡觉。请您明天再来。","那間舊屋裏只有一張床，所以我們便輪流睡覺。"]],["courtyard","'kɒ:tjɑ:d","n. 庭院, 天井",["In Beijing, hutongs are alleys formed by lines of siheyuans, the traditional courtyard residences.","No matter how fierce the winds blow or the waves crash, it feels as effortless as strolling leisurely in a quiet courtyard."],["在北京，胡同是由四合院的传统居所排形成。","不管风吹浪打，胜似闲庭信步。"]],["dividend","'dividend","n. 被除数, 股利\\n[计] 被除数",["While some countries are in position to reap a 'demographic dividend,' others must prepare to care for a much older population.","The bank has raised its dividend by 20%."],["",""]],["terrify","'terifai","vt. 使恐惧, 恐吓",["A greater yet and ghastlier sign remained / our heedless hearts to terrify anew.","The various atrocities performed still shock and terrify the world today."],["",""]],["revise","ri'vaiz","n. 校订, 修正, 改样\\nvt. 校订, 修正, 校正",["In the light of what you told us, I think we should revise our plan.","In the light of these facts, it may be necessary to revise our theory."],["根据你所说的话，我认为我们应该重新审视我们的计划。",""]],["bark","bɑ:k","n. 树皮, 吠声\\nvi. 吠, 叫骂\\nvt. 喊出, 剥树皮",["If you see the day through with Mr Bark without losing your temper, I'll believe you.","When the thief heard the dog bark, he took to his heels."],["",""]],["fascinate","'fæsineit","vt. 令人入神, 使着迷\\nvi. 入迷",["I can't really explain why palindromes fascinate me so much, even though I'm not a palindromist.","Korean Hangeul glyphs and Inuktitut syllabograms fascinate me in a similar way as Japanese Kana glyphs do."],["",""]],["stab","stæb","n. 刺, 戳, 剧痛, 尝试, 努力\\nvt. 刺, 戳, 刺入, 刺痛, 直入, 使伤心\\nvi. 刺, 刺伤",["I'm a thief, I'll go back when I've taken the stuff. Report me and I'll stab you.","There's no telling when she'll stab you in the back."],["",""]],["generator","'dʒenәreitә","n. 产生器, 发电机, 生产者\\n[计] 发生器",["Every hospital has a back-up electric generator in case of blackout.","All hospitals are equipped with a spare generator in case of a power outage."],["",""]],["cafe","kɑ:'fei","n. 咖啡馆, 酒店",["Tom left the cafe in front of Maria.","The retro feel of this cafe is a hit with young people."],["汤姆离开了玛丽面前的那家咖啡馆。",""]],["propaganda",".prɒpә'gændә","n. 宣传, 宣传活动\\n[医] 宣传",["Elon Musk embodies the conservative propaganda tactic of calling everyone who crosses you a pedophile.","The \"anti-woke\" propaganda being imported into your country's media comes straight from actual fascists."],["伊隆馬斯克將「凡是與你作對的人都是戀童癖」這一保守派慣用的抹黑手法發揮得淋漓盡致。","你們國家媒體中輸入的「反覺醒」宣傳，是直接來自真正的法西斯的。"]],["failed","","a. 已失败的\\n[计] 失败的",["Having failed many times, he never gave up the plan.","If it had not been for your advice, I would have failed."],["雖然失敗了很多次，但是他仍從不放棄。","如果沒有你的忠告，我大概已經失敗了吧。"]],["parallel","'pærәlel","n. 平行, 对比, 相匹敌之物\\na. 平行的, 相似的\\nvt. 与...平行, 与...相似, 相比, 使平行\\n[计] 并联; 并行",["The opposite sides of a parallelogram are parallel.","A parallelogram is a quadrilateral formed from two sets of parallel lines."],["平行四边形的对边平行。","平行四邊形是由兩組平行線組成的四邊形。"]],["underscore",".ʌndә'skɒ:","vt. 划线于...下\\nn. (表强调的)下划线\\n[计] 底线",["Pelosi visited Taiwan to underscore its autonomy. This has led China to threaten the US with grave consequences.","Tom has an underscore in his password."],["",""]],["formulate","'fɒ:mjuleit","vt. 用公式表示, 明确叙述, 制订\\n[机] 公式化, 公式表示",["Studying Turkish gives us the opportunity to formulate sentences about a wide variety of subjects. Turkish culture is very rich.","Readers formulate expectations as to what might be happening at subsequent stages of texts."],["",""]],["castle","'kæsl. 'kɑ:sl","n. 城堡, 象棋中的车\\nvt. 置于城堡中, 盘踞于",["There is an old castle at the foot of the mountain.","When you go to Romania, you will visit Dracula's Castle."],["山腳下有一座古老的城堡。","当你去罗马尼亚的时候，你将会造访吸血鬼之王的城堡。"]],["prop","prɒp","n. 支柱, 支持者, 倚靠人, 道具, 螺旋桨\\nvt. 支撑, 维持",["Even on stage, the prop gun gleamed like a real weapon.","Proppants, such as sand, are added to the water to prop open the newly created cracks."],["",""]],["microwave","'maikrәuweiv","n. 微波\\n[计] 微波",["That year's buzzword was digital: digital clocks, digital microwave ovens, even digital pens.","It is about time we bought a new microwave oven."],["那一年的流行語是「數位」：數位鐘、數位微波爐，甚至還有數位筆。","我们是时候买新的微波炉了。"]],["incidence","'insidәns","n. 发生, 发生率, 影响, 负担者, 入射, 倾角\\n[医] 入射, 发生率, 发生数",["According to this figure, the reflection angle equals the incidence angle.","The incidence of people travelling on fake or stolen passports is not as rare as people would like to think."],["",""]],["technically","'teknikli","adv. 技术上, 学术上, 专门地",["This piece is technically very difficult for the performer.","The cochlea implant is a technically ingenious device."],["",""]],["fulfil","ful'fil","vt. 实践, 履行, 实行, 完成, 结束, 满足\\n[经] 履行(契约), 满期",["Tradesmen who do not fulfil commitments are incredibly annoying.","He couldn't fulfil the promise he'd made his father."],["",""]],["corrupt","kә'rʌpt","a. 腐败的, 贪污的, 讹误充斥的\\nvt. 使腐烂, 腐蚀, 使恶化\\nvi. 腐烂, 堕落",["The party in power is corrupt, but the opposition is little better.","Power tends to corrupt and absolute power corrupts absolutely."],["",""]],["specimen","'spesimәn","n. 样品, 标本, 试料\\n[化] 试样",["A biopsy specimen was obtained and sent to Pathology where it was sectioned and stained with hematoxylin and eosin.","He would pay a million dollars for such a specimen."],["",""]],["thorough","'θʌrә","a. 十分的, 彻底的",["The CIA runs a thorough background check on all new employees.","The hypothesis is based on the thorough experiments."],["",""]],["obscure","әb'skjuә","a. 模糊的, 昏暗的, 难解的, 晦涩的, 偏僻的, 微贱的, 无名的\\nvt. 使变暗, 隐藏, 使变模糊, 使难解",["The two scholars wrangled over the meaning of an obscure Tibetan phrase.","The meaning of this sentence is obscure."],["兩位學者為一句意思含糊的藏文句子爭論了一番。","这句句子意思模糊。"]],["wan","wɒn","a. 苍白的, 无血色的, 病态的, 暗淡的\\nv. (使)变苍白\\n[计] 广域网",["I love the Dim sims from Tim Ho Wan.","The child was pale and wan, but her healthy arms and legs showed that she had suffered less than her companion."],["我爱添好运的点心。",""]],["monk","mʌŋk","n. 修道士, 僧侣, 和尚",["What? A little soup and celery is all I get? I'm not a Zen monk. I can't survive on an austerity diet like this.","Together, a bard, a wizard, a cleric, a barbarian and a monk comprise the party."],["",""]],["spectacle","'spektәkl","n. 引人羡慕的东西, 景象, 眼镜, 场面, 公开展示",["I need to buy new spectacle frames.","The squire observed the whole spectacle with astonishment."],["我需要购买新的镜架。",""]],["thrill","θril","n. 震颤, 激动, 刺激性, 一阵激动\\nvi. 震颤, 颤抖, 激动\\nvt. 使激动, 使颤动",["Racing car drivers aren't just in it for the prize money but also for the thrill of racing.","I felt a thrill of joy at the thought of seeing her soon."],["",""]],["heroin","'herәuin","n. 海洛因, 吗啡\\n[化] 海洛因; 二醋吗啡; 二乙酰吗啡",["The police searched the house and seized 2 kilograms of heroin.","Over the last decade, Estonia has reported that heroin has largely been replaced by fentanyl on the illicit market."],["",""]],["outlook","'autluk","n. 观点, 景色, 前途, 了望\\n[经] 展望",["Let go of your negative outlook on life.","We must be a step ahead of the times in our outlook."],["請拋開你那些負面的人生觀。",""]],["reproductive",".ri:prә'dʌktiv","a. 生殖的, 再生的, 复制的\\n[医] 生殖的, 复现的",["Intersex people have reproductive organs, genitals, and hormones that do not fit the usual female and male characteristics.","Benedito has male reproductive organs and male gametes."],["",""]],["bout","baut","n. 一回, 回合, 较量\\n[医] 发作",["When the wound got infected, he experienced a bout of unbearable pain.","Tom's bout with diarrhea was foreordained due to Mary's refusal to clean any cookware."],["伤口发炎后，他感到难忍无比的剧痛。","瑪麗拒絕洗炊具，湯姆注定會鬧肚子。"]],["laptop","","[计] 膝上型的",["The laptop provides cutting-edge technology at an affordable price.","Tom sat on his bed and opened his laptop."],["這款筆記型電腦價格親民，技術領先。","汤姆坐在床上，打开了笔记本电脑。"]],["recreation",".rekri'eiʃәn","n. 娱乐, 消遣, 休息, 再创造\\n[医] 娱乐, 休养",["People who cannot find time for recreation are obliged sooner or later to find time for illness.","The master plan includes programs to provide employment as well as recreation."],["没工夫休息的人，早晚会有工夫生病的。",""]],["setup","'setʌp","n. 装备, 组织, 计划, 机构, 调整, 设置\\n[计] 设置",["Alternatively you can use the following secret to setup TOTP in your authenticator or password manager manually.","I ran setup and then the whole thing crashed."],["",""]],["spatial","'speiʃәl","a. 空间的, 受空间条件限制的, 占地位的\\n[医] 隙的, 间隙的, 腔的; 空间的, 立体的",["It is used under the condition with spatial gradient field of 72 T/m (value extrapolated) and less.","Touching invisible buttons floating in the air may seem strange, but so-called spatial computing is a new way of interacting with cars, games and even touchscreens."],["",""]],["sniff","snif","n. 以鼻吸气, 嗅, 气息\\nvi. 嗅, 蔑视, 嗤之以鼻\\nvt. 闻, 用力吸, 发觉",["One sniff of that stuff was enough to make me sick.","A quick sniff of the tofu proved it to be well past expiry."],["",""]],["varying","","[计] 改变",["It includes widely varying organizations, people, and ideas.","We pay an income tax at varying rates according to the size of income."],["",""]],["cleanup","'kli:nʌp","n. 清除, 暴利\\n[经] 清扫工作, 扫除",["The cleanup at the Fukushima Daiichi plant could take years, possibly decades.","The EPA official concedes that every village-level cleanup measure is voluntary, making full compliance difficult."],["",""]],["bored","","a. 无聊的；烦人的；无趣的",["Today we went to the shopping mall. I was very bored.","At the beginning, I was bored with radio gymnastics, but now I do not dislike it."],["今天我们去了商城。我很无聊。","我起初覺得廣播體操很無聊，但是現在卻喜歡上了。"]],["matrix","'meitriks","n. 母体, 子宫, 基质, 脉石, 模型, 矩阵\\n[计] 矩阵",["The inverse of a non-square matrix is a dangerous thing.","The problem will be easier to solve if you write the system of equations as a matrix."],["非方矩阵的逆阵是一个危险的东西。",""]],["printer","'printә","n. 印刷工, 打印机\\n[计] 打印机",["The printer stopped in the middle, so I only have part of his CV.","The printer of my company broke down again, so I'm going to the convenience store to copy documents."],["打印機只打了一半兒就停了，我手上只有他簡歷的一部分。","因为公司的打印机又坏了，我要去便利店打印文件。"]],["runway","'rʌnwei","n. 跑道, 河床, 过道\\n[化] 单轨架空道; 吊车道",["The small airport near where I live has only one runway.","The Miss Universe contestant tripped on her gown but got up again gracefully and continued down the runway."],["",""]],["cone","kәun","n. 圆锥体, 球果\\nvt. 使成锥形",["Excuse me, I'd like a double scoop of mint chocolate chip and orange sherbet in a regular-size cone please.","When it's this hot, the only thing I feel like eating is a lemon snow cone or sherbet."],["",""]],["locally","'lәukәli","adv. 地方性地, 局部性地, 在当地",["The practice still prevails locally in parts of Japan.","They only eat fruits and vegetables that are grown locally."],["",""]],["stroll","strәul","n. 闲逛, 漫步\\nv. 闲逛, 漫步",["Spaniards love to stroll around in the evening cool.","When I first came to Beijing, I loved to stroll everywhere, but Beijing was not like what I had imagined."],["西班牙人最愛在晚上外出散散步、乘乘涼。","我先来北京时，就去哪里都爱逛街，可是北京跟我想象的不一样。"]],["nitrogen","'naitrәdʒәn","n. 氮\\n[化] 氮N-2",["The air we breathe consists of oxygen and nitrogen.","There are several irregularities in the nitrogen cycle."],["我们呼吸的空气是由氧气和氮气组成的。",""]],["integral","'intigrәl","n. 整体, 积分, 整数\\na. 固有的, 整体的, 整数的, 积分的\\n[计] 积分",["The integral and the antiderivative are defined in two different ways, and the Fundamental Theorem of Calculus states the relationship between them.","Music was an integral part of almost every aspect of ancient Greek society, from religious, to social to athletic events."],["積分與反導函數是以兩種不同的方式定義的，而微積分基本定理闡述了兩者之間的關係。",""]],["respective","ri'spektiv","a. 分别的, 各自的",["Let's discuss the respective merits of the candidates.","Different nations can only coexist peacefully if they respect each other's respective culture."],["",""]],["transparent","træns'pærәnt","a. 透明的, 显然的, 清晰的\\n[计] 透明",["This transparent liquid contains a kind of poison.","Actually, she's very transparent when it comes to emotions."],["",""]],["rebound","ri'baund","vi. 弹回, 返回, 产生事与愿违的结果\\nvt. 使弹回, 使返回\\nn. 反弹, 返回, 篮板球, 振作\\nrebind的过去式和过…",["Happiness, I have discovered, is nearly always a rebound from hard work.","Alessia missed a sitter but, from the rebound, scored a worldie."],["",""]],["lineup","'lainʌp","n. 阵容, 阵形, 布阵, 一组人",["The witness identified the thief in the police lineup.","There aren't any names in the lineup on the show's website."],["",""]],["saying","'seiiŋ","n. 叙述, 话, 说, 言论",["There is a certain amount of truth in what he's saying.","There's no point saying \"Hi, how are you?\" to me if you have nothing else to say."],["他說的話有一定的道理。","如果你没有其它可说的，那对我说“嗨，你怎么样？”就毫无意义。"]],["circulate","'sә:kjuleit","v. (使)流通, (使)循环, (使)传播",["Rumors started to circulate in town about Yanni having an affair.","Money needs to circulate more efficiently in Algeria."],["",""]],["forecast","'fɒ:kɑ:st","n. 预想, 预测, 预报\\nvt. 预想, 预测, 预报\\n[计] 趋势预测",["The weather forecast says that it's going to snow this evening.","According to the weather forecast, it will snow tomorrow."],["天氣預報說今晚會下雪。","天气预报说明天会下雪。"]],["classification",".klæsifi'keiʃәn","n. 分类, 分级\\n[化] 分级; 分粒; 分类",["The upcoming fifth edition of the DSM proposes a new spectrum-based classification of autistic disorders.","The first biologists worked hard towards the classification of living things."],["",""]],["endeavor","in'devә","n. 努力, 尽力\\nvi. 努力, 尽力",["Self-confidence is the principal element of any great endeavor.","Dieting takes up so much human endeavor with so little to show for it."],["自信是伟大事业的第一要素。",""]],["easter","'i:stә","n. 复活节",["The Easter Egg Roll is an annual event that is held on the lawn of the White House each Easter Monday.","It was the morning of Easter. The bells sounded from the neighboring church, and the sun seemed to rejoice in the sky."],["复活节滚彩蛋活动每年复活节周一都会在白宫的草地上举行。",""]],["intriguing","in'tri:giŋ","a. 吸引人的, 有趣的",["It's an intriguing theory, but I don't see how it can be tested.","The thought of being eaten alive was both frightening and intriguing."],["",""]],["maximize","'mæksimaiz","vt. 取...最大值, 使增加(或扩大)到最大限度\\n[计] 最大化",["It's just an attempt on his part to maximize profits, as much as possible, in the last moments of negotiations.","He should be promoted as soon as possible to maximize his chances."],["这不过是他在谈判最后时刻尽可能最大化利润的尝试。",""]],["advisor","әd'vaizә","n. 顾问, 劝告者, 指导教师",["I know Tom is a financial advisor. Maybe he can help us.","An independent advisor has been brought in to mediate between the unions and the employers."],["",""]],["paragraph","'pærәgrɑ:f","n. 段落, 短评\\nvt. 将...分段, 分段落\\nvi. 写短讯\\n[计] 段落",["This paragraph is well written, but there is a mistake in the last sentence.","Memorize this paragraph until you can say it fluently."],["",""]],["breeding","'bri:diŋ","n. 教养, 生育, 饲养\\n[医] 生育, 繁殖, 育种, 饲养",["The Chinese government has spent a lot of money on research into successful panda breeding in order to increase their birth rate.","A few months later they return to their breeding grounds in the Arctic."],["为了提高出生率，中国政府花了很多钱在大熊猫成功繁殖的研究上。","數月後，牠們回到了北極的繁殖地。"]],["footage","'futidʒ","n. 英尺长度, 英板尺, (影片的)连续镜头",["Uncut footage of the governor's affair has surfaced on the Internet.","Police are scouring security footage following a robbery in the city centre."],["",""]],["preferred","pri'fә:d","a. 首选的\\n[计] 首选的",["Mary's favourite pastime was reading philosophy books, while Tom, he preferred masturbating.","He preferred working to doing nothing."],["瑪麗最喜歡的消遣是讀哲學書；至於湯姆，他比較喜歡自慰。","他更愿意工作而不是无所事事。"]],["absurd","әb'sә:d","a. 荒谬的, 不合理的, 可笑的\\nn. 荒诞",["The idea of perpetual motion is an absurd hypothesis.","I think that this is all quite absurd."],["永动机这个概念是个荒唐的假说。","这一切在我看来都颇为荒唐。"]],["thrust","θrʌst","n. 插, 戳, 刺, 猛推, 口头攻击, 推力\\nvt. 插入, 猛推, 刺, 戳, 强加, 延伸\\nvi. 插, 刺, 戳, 延伸, …",["Before Kate was married last year, some expressed concerns that as she was born a commoner, she would struggle with the pressure of being thrust into the public eye.","He thrust some coins into my pocket."],["凱薩琳去年结婚之前，有人表达了担心说，因为她出生于平民家庭，可能要与被突然置于公众视野来的压力搏斗。","他把數枚硬幣強行塞進了我的口袋中。"]],["allied","ә'laid","a. 联盟的, 联姻的, 联系起来的",["Germany was once allied with Italy.","Germany was allied with Italy in World War II."],["德国曾是意大利的同盟国。","在二战中，德国与意大利结盟。"]],["temptation","temp'teiʃәn","n. 诱惑, 诱惑物\\n[法] 诱惑, 诱惑物",["Finally she gave in to temptation and ate the whole cake.","I'd made up my mind to stop snacking, but against my better judgment, I keep giving in to temptation and eating ice cream."],["她終於受不了誘惑，吃掉了整件蛋糕。","我下定決心要戒掉零食，但違背了自己的意願，我還是不斷屈服於誘惑，吃冰淇淋。"]],["reservoir","'rezәvwɑ:","n. 贮水池, 贮藏处, 贮备, 水库\\nvt. 储藏",["The town is supplied with water from a reservoir in the hills.","As the iron was heating up, Mary poured distilled water into the reservoir to make steam."],["",""]],["tiger","'taigә","n. 老虎, 虎, 凶暴的人",["If a tiger suddenly appeared in front of me, I'd be scared to death.","You cannot compare the strength of a man to that of a tiger, but nevertheless, the tiger is still the inferior creature."],["如果一只老虎突然出现在我面前，我肯定吓死了。","虎与人是无法比拼力量的，但是，老虎还是比人类低等。"]],["strap","stræp","n. 带, 皮带\\nvt. (用皮带)捆扎",["Hold on to the strap. The train will start to move soon.","Benedito scolded his billy goat for chewing on a leather strap that he needed for his work."],["",""]],["feast","fi:st","n. 宴会, 酒席, 享受, 节日\\nvt. 款待, 享乐, 请客\\nvi. 参加宴会, 尽情地吃, 享受",["The first virtue of a painting is to be a feast for the eyes.","Once, if I remember well, my life was a feast where all hearts opened and all wines flowed."],["",""]],["unfamiliar",".ʌnfә'miljә","a. 不熟悉的",["Being unfamiliar with foreign languages, you'll never be able to understand the foreigner's silence.","The cat was scared by an unfamiliar noise."],["没有对外语的认识，你永远无法理解外国人的沉默。","貓被沒聽過的噪音驚嚇到了。"]],["conductor","kәn'dʌktә","n. 领导者, 指挥者, 售票员, 向导\\n[化] 导体",["The band played marvellously under the baton of a new conductor.","Judging from his appearance, he must be the conductor."],["",""]],["analogy","ә'nælәdʒi","n. 相似, 类似\\n[计] 模拟",["Mary tried to explain fractions to Tom by using a pie as an analogy.","The Yiddish term for the Holocaust is Khurbn, a deliberate analogy to the destructions of the First and Second Temple."],["",""]],["inhabitant","in'hæbitәnt","n. 居民, 居住者\\n[医] 居民",["Every spirit makes its house, and we can give a shrewd guess from the house to the inhabitant.","Stay with us! You will learn fresh and interesting news earlier than every other inhabitant of our planet. Tatoeba: Always a good choice."],["",""]],["toddler","'tɔdlә","n. 蹒跚行走的人, 学步的小孩, 学步的幼儿, (非正式)信步走的人",["Again, the toddler says, \"no, I won't\" as he is wont to do.","Crowning toddler beauty pageant queens is Mr. Fredericksen's passion."],["",""]],["determined","di'tә:mind","a. 坚决的, 已下决心的",["I'm a determined, organized, and responsible person.","The meaning of a word is determined by the context where it is used."],["我是个有决心、有条理、有责任的人。","一個字的意思是由上文下理決定的。"]],["logo","'lәugәu","n. 连合活字, 商标, 徽标\\n[计] 徽标",["You can withdraw money from ATMs that have the \"UnionPay\" logo.","The sidebar is displayed on the edge of the page below the site logo."],["你可以到有“银联”标志的ATM机里去取钱。","側邊欄顯示在網站標誌下方的頁面邊緣。"]],["intensify","in'tensifai","vt. 加强\\nvi. 强化",["The feelings of discomfort intensify every time I see you.","It is unavoidable that the fighting will intensify."],["",""]],["arc","ɑ:k","n. 弧, 弧形, 弓形, 弧光\\n[化] 弧",["Joan of Arc refused to renounce her belief that the voice she heard was from God and none other.","Mountains at a distance of three miles formed an arc round the city, shielding it on three sides from the wind."],["",""]],["sway","swei","n. 摇摆, 影响力, 支配\\nvt. 摇动, 支配, 弄歪, 使倾斜, 使动摇, 影响\\nvi. 摇动, 摇摆, 倾斜, 动摇, 统治,…",["From the time he got up, his beliefs began to sway.","France wasn't the first foreign power to hold sway of Algeria."],["从那时起，他的信仰开始摇动了。",""]],["upgrade","'ʌpgreid","n. 上坡, 升级, 上升\\nadv. 往上\\nvt. 使升级, 提升, 改良品种\\nvi. 升级\\n[计] 升级",["With this upgrade, one obvious impact is that users will be obliged to reset their passwords.","You can upgrade your computer with more random access memory to make the PC faster."],["这次升级的一个明显影响是用户会被强制重置密码。","您可以使用更多任何存取記憶體來升級您的電腦，以提高 PC 的運行速度。"]],["postwar","'pәust'wɒ:","a. 战后的",["The merchant accumulated tremendous fortune during the postwar era.","This is the central problem of postwar immigration."],["",""]],["erosion","i'rәuʒәn","n. 腐蚀, 冲蚀, 侵蚀\\n[化] 磨耗; 侵蚀",["Wetlands play important roles in the ecosystem in purifying water, protecting against flood and erosion, and as both a source of food and habitat for wild animals.","Mangrove forests stabilize the coastline, reducing erosion from storm surges, currents, waves, and tides."],["湿地在生态系统中扮演着净化水源、防止洪水和侵蚀、为野生动物提供食物和栖息地的重要角色。",""]],["manifest","'mænifest","n. 载货单, 运货单, 旅客名单\\na. 显然的, 明白的\\nvi. 显示, 出现\\nvt. 表明, 表现, 证明",["Spirits of Heaven and Earth, heed my call; manifest swiftly by divine decree!","It now became manifest that beauty is enhanced by adornment."],["天靈靈，地靈靈；急急如律令！",""]],["sophomore","'sɒfәmɒ:","n. (大学)二年级生\\na. 二年级学生的, 二年级的",["Sami was a sophomore at that high school.","Sami admitted to me that he was dating a sophomore."],["薩米當時是那所高中的二年級學生。",""]],["refusal","ri'fju:zl","n. 拒绝, 推却, 优先决定权\\n[法] 拒绝, 谢绝, 取舍权",["Tom's bout with diarrhea was foreordained due to Mary's refusal to clean any cookware.","I interpreted her silence as a refusal."],["瑪麗拒絕洗炊具，湯姆注定會鬧肚子。","我認為她的沉默就是表示拒絕。"]],["recreational",".rekri'eiʃәnәl","a. 消遣的, 娱乐的",["Algeria should ban recreational hunting in its desert areas.","Recreational drug use inspires many urban legends."],["",""]],["flush","flʌʃ","n. 流溢, 面红, 旺盛, 发烧, 惊飞的鸟, 同花牌\\na. 丰足的, 齐平的, 满盈的, 泛滥的\\nadv. 齐平地, 直接地\\nv…",["If you use the toilet, flush it afterward.","The dam gave way and sent a great flush of water down the valley."],["使用廁所後請沖水。",""]],["lick","lik","n. 舔, 少许, 打\\nvt. 舔, 卷过, 鞭打\\nvi. 轻轻拍打",["Claire Biel looked as if Loren had asked if she could lick their toilet.","\"If you lick between my toes, I'll take you to a movie tonight,\" said Mary."],["",""]],["educated","'edjukeitid","a. 受过教育的, 有教养的",["People are more educated now than they used to be.","He is proud of having been educated in the United States."],["现在的人教育程度比以前高得多。","他对自己在美国读过书这件事感到很骄傲。"]],["align","ә'lain","vi. 排列, 排成一行, 结盟\\nvt. 使结盟, 使成一行, 校正",["I tried to align the pieces of metal perfectly together before soldering them.","The West openly tries to remove leaders that don't align with its way of seeing the world."],["",""]],["unaware",".ʌnә'wєә","a. 未认识到的, 不知道的\\n[法] 不知道的, 不察觉的, 无意的",["He's unaware of who possesses them.","They were carelessly unaware of the danger."],["他不知道这些东西的归属。","他们粗心大意，还没意识到危险。"]],["predominantly","","adv. 主要地, 显著地, 大多数地, 突出地",["Algerian Arabs are predominantly fenient and hypocritical.","The population of North Africa is predominantly Berber."],["",""]],["mighty","'maiti","n. 有势力的人\\na. 有势力的, 强大的, 有力的\\nadv. 很, 极",["You scorned both the Nymphs, who beheld your deeds, and me the mighty Pan.","She was closely related to the mighty Queen Zurline, and her home was beneath the shade of a widespreading oak."],["你蔑視了目睹你罪行的仙女們，也蔑視了我を這位強大的潘神。","她與強大的祖琳女王有著密切的血緣關係，她的家在一棵枝繁葉茂的橡樹蔭下。"]],["idiot","'idiәt","n. 白痴, 极蠢之人\\n[医] 白痴者, 痴子",["Thanks for having explained to me at last why people take me for an idiot.","Idiot! She's not being honest when she says she loves you. Haven't you figured it out yet? She's just a gold digger."],["感謝您終於爲我說明了爲甚麼人們通通把我當傻瓜。","笨蛋！她说她爱你不是真心的。还没有发现吗？她只是钓凯子的。"]],["courthouse","'kɒ:thaus","n. 法院, 郡政府所在地",["\"You can get it at the courthouse,\" the clerk added.","The woman left and went to the courthouse, where she waited in line again."],["",""]],["defect","di'fekt","n. 缺点\\n[医] 缺损, 缺陷",["To be perfect she lacked just one defect.","For nothing is so beautiful but that it betrays some defect on close inspection."],["要变得完美，她就是少了一个缺点。",""]],["subjective","sәb'dʒektiv","a. 主观的, 个人的\\n[医] 主观的, 自觉的",["Subjective reality is whatever the hell I want it to be.","The meaning of this practice was obfuscated by centuries of the practitioners' subjective interpretations."],["",""]],["additionally","","adv. 另外, 此外",["Additionally, there are hungry sharks in the lake.","Additionally, the tale starting with \"Genji's Story\" was also much loved."],["",""]],["accountant","ә'kauntәnt","n. 会计人员, 会计师\\n[经] 会计师, 会计人员",["Allan was lucky and passed the tax accountant examination.","The company took action against its former accountant."],["艾伦很幸运地考过了税务师考试。",""]],["sufficiently","sә'fiʃәntli","adv. 足够, 充分",["The rocket landed sufficiently gently to avoid breaking its instruments.","I haven't made up my mind sufficiently enough to agree with you."],["",""]],["navy","'neivi","n. 海军, 海军人员, 海军军力, 烟蒂",["Mary was wearing a navy blue skirt.","For the first time, the Japanese Navy had been defeated."],["玛丽穿着深蓝色的裙子。",""]],["vulnerability",".vʌlnәrә'biliti","n. 易受伤, 易受责难, 易受伤部位\\n[医] 易损性",["Short-term effects of smoking include unfitness, wheezing, a general vulnerability to illness, bad breath, bad skin and so on.","Despite her hard exterior, she had a certain vulnerability that made her quite endearing."],["",""]],["valve","vælv","n. 活瓣, 阀, 活门\\nv. 装阀, 用阀调节",["The exit flow rate is proportional to the pressure difference around the exit valve.","In an unusual move, this school's big band uses slide trumpets and valve trombones exclusively."],["",""]],["owl","aul","n. 猫头鹰\\n[法] 走私",["You stay up until two in the morning. You're such a night owl!","What's the difference between an eagle-owl and a barn owl?"],["两点怎么还不睡觉，你这个夜猫子！","雕鸮和仓鸮有什么区别？"]],["fairness","'fєәnis","n. 晴朗, 光明正大, 美丽\\n[经] 公正, 适当",["In all fairness, he did do his best.","The President reiterated his call for Congress to pass the Paycheck Fairness Act that would strengthen the Equal Pay Act and give women more tools to fight pay discrimination."],["说句实话，他真的尽力了。","總統再次呼籲國會通過《薪酬公平法案》，該法案將加強《同工同酬法案》，並為女性提供更多對抗薪資歧視的工具。"]],["slash","slæʃ","v. 猛砍, 乱砍\\nn. 猛砍, 乱砍, 删减\\n[计] 斜线",["Use a forward slash in the URL, not a backward slash.","The move has sparked alarm and is intensifying efforts to slash energy consumption and find alternatives."],["",""]],["diner","'dainә","n. 用餐者",["Tom and I went downtown to eat steak at Chuck's Diner.","I have eaten at Chuck's Diner on several occasions."],["",""]],["advertisement",".ædvә'taizmәnt","n. 广告, 启事, 广告宣传\\n[法] 广告, 公告, 告示",["Thousands of people were very disappointed with this advertisement.","Thousands of people are very disappointed with this advertisement."],["成千上万的人对这个广告很失望。","成千上万的人对这个广告很失望。"]],["finely","'fainli","adv. 雅致地, 仔细地, 敏锐地, 微细地",["Melt the butter in the saucepan, and add the finely chopped onion.","The day being fine, I felt amply repaid for my walk through the extensive and finely-wooded grounds, numerously stocked with deer."],["",""]],["petition","pi'tiʃәn","n. 请愿, 诉状, 陈情书, 申请, 祈求, 祷文\\nv. 正式请求, 恳求, 请愿",["Citizens are more and more mobilized today. They are taking different actions like marches, petition, litigation.","I thought it strange that the petition had been turned down."],["",""]],["correspondence",".kɒri'spɒndәns","n. 相符, 通信, 信件\\n[医] 对应, 相对",["She'll be seeing to your correspondence while Miss Cobb's away.","This pair of lovers were carrying on an ardent correspondence."],["",""]],["artery","'ɑ:tәri","n. 动脉, 干道, 要道\\n[医] 动脉",["In biology, bifurcation often describes the splitting of a vein or artery into two smaller branches.","The doctor explained that angina is a common symptom of underlying coronary artery disease."],["",""]],["static","'stætik","n. 静电, 静电干扰\\na. 静态的, 静止的, 固有的, 静电的",["The population of this town has been static for the last ten years.","House prices have remained static for several months."],["",""]],["curator","kjuә'reitә","n. 管理者, 经理, 主管人, 掌管者, 馆长, 大学学监, 监护人, 保护人\\n[经] 临时监护人",["The museum curator wanted the Egyptian painting to be sandwiched between two pieces of thick acrylic glass.","Co-curator Alnoor Merchant says the text is an important encyclopedic body of medical knowledge in the Islamic world."],["",""]],["correction","kә'rekʃәn","n. 订正, 改正, 改正的地方\\n[化] 校正",["A proper test does not allow the use of correction fluid.","My correction fluid has run out, so now I only write in pencil."],["正規的考試不允許使用塗改液。","我的涂改液用完了，现在写字只用铅笔。"]],["mist","mist","n. 雾, 迷蒙, 朦胧不清\\nvt. 使模糊, 使蒙上雾\\nvi. 变模糊, 下雾",["Down in the valley a mist like a white feather rose gently into a white cloud, and obscured everything.","In looking through the mist, I caught a glimpse of my future."],["山谷中，薄霧如白色羽毛般緩緩升騰，化作一團白雲，遮蔽了一切。","透过薄雾，我隐约看见了我的未来。"]],["grower","'grәuә","n. 栽培者, 生长物",["We get our oranges from a grower in the southern part of the country.","Robertson said, since the land on those few large farms has been parceled out into tens of thousands of tobacco farms, the average grower farms about two hectares."],["",""]],["nonsense","'nɒnsәns","n. 无意义的事, 荒谬言行, 荒唐",["That's nonsense. Nobody but a fool would believe it.","Don't listen to him, he's talking nonsense."],["那是無稽之談。只有傻瓜才會相信。","別聽他的, 他在說廢話。"]],["humble","'hʌmbl","a. 低下的, 谦逊的, 粗陋的\\nvt. 使...卑下, 降低...地位, 贬抑",["The humble man is getting along with his neighbors.","Be it ever so humble, there's no place like home."],["那个谦逊的男人跟邻里相处得很好。","金窝银窝不如自己的狗窝。"]],["gum","gʌm","n. 树胶, 橡皮, 橡皮糖, 牙床, 老天\\nvt. 涂以树胶, 用胶粘, 使有粘性\\nvi. 分泌树胶, 发粘",["There was some chewing gum on the sole of Tom's shoe.","There was some chewing gum stuck to the sole of Tom's shoe."],["汤姆的鞋底粘了口香糖。","汤姆的鞋底粘了口香糖。"]],["broadway","'brɒ:dwei","n. 百老汇大街",["Yanni came to New York to make it big on Broadway.","We're booked for the whole month on Broadway."],["",""]],["baseline","'beislain","n. 基线, 基准\\n[计] 基线, 基准",["The players had to throw the ball from one to another to try to get the ball over the other team's baseline.","Miss Williams is challenging the call on the left baseline. The ball was called in."],["",""]],["fishery","'fiʃәri","n. 渔业\\n[法] 捕鱼, 捕鱼权",["The fishery remained empty and devoid of fish for many centuries.","Agriculture, crafts, animal husbandry and fishery are the main traditional sources of income."],["",""]],["thesis","'θi:sis","n. 论题, 论文",["He does not, in short, write with the candor of a man who is completely confident of his thesis.","His thesis summed up the new achievements made in computers, artificial satellites and rockets."],["簡單來說，他的文筆並沒有流露出那種對自己的論文充滿信心的人應有的直率和坦誠。","他的论文总结了电脑，人造卫星和火箭三个的新成就。"]],["audio","'ɒ:diou","a. 音频的, 声音的\\n[电] 声频",["Audio in Tatoeba sentences are provided by Shtooka.","The audio feature is only available in some sentences in Chinese, Dutch, French, German and Shanghainese."],["Tatoeba句子的音頻是由Shtooka所提供。","音頻功能僅適用在某些語言的句子中，如中文，荷蘭語，法語，德語和上海話。"]],["dressing","'dresiŋ","n. 调味品, 穿衣, 化妆\\n[化] 追肥",["She aided her daughter in dressing.","The claim of community involvement is just window dressing; City Hall will do what it wants to anyhow."],["她帮她女儿穿好衣服。",""]],["coefficient","kәui'fiʃәnt","n. 系数\\n[计] 系数",["We assessed reliability using the Cronbach's alpha coefficient and validity using the correlation analysis.","The quadratic coefficient in this term is questionable."],["",""]],["cosmic","'kɒzmik","a. 宇宙的, 宇宙航行的, 无限的, 有秩序的\\n[医] 宇宙的",["The best efforts of the human race, in addition, were necessary to assist the gods in their cosmic task.","Everything from the most human thought or emotion to the most cosmic dimension of existence is an aspect of Being."],["",""]],["qualified","'kwɒlifaid","a. 有资格的\\n[经] 合格的, 有条件的, 有限制的",["It is difficult to replace an employee that is as qualified as he is.","Many people get a job in customer services before they are qualified for other positions."],["要找人代替像他这么有资历的员工很难。","許多人在獲得其他職位的資格之前就從事客服工作。"]],["ponder","'pɒndә","v. 沉思, 考虑",["A gaggle of intoxicated youths stopped to ponder whether there is an Opposite Day in Bizarro World.","Fathers and teachers, I ponder, \"What is hell?\" I maintain that it is the suffering of being unable to love."],["",""]],["complicate","'kɒmplikeit","vt. 弄复杂, 使错综, 使恶化\\nvi. 变复杂",["Don't complicate the problem by raising new issues.","You just complicate the argument when you split hairs that way."],["",""]],["sanctuary","'sæŋktʃuәri","n. 圣所(指教堂、寺院等), 耶路撒冷的神殿, 避难所\\n[法] 庇护所, 避难所, 教堂",["The tiger, having had its wounds treated, was returned by the villagers to the animal sanctuary without incident.","A biodiversity sanctuary in Brazil called The Pantanal is threatened by deforestation."],["",""]],["prepared","pri'pєәd","a. 准备好的, 特制的",["The report was prepared in haste and had several misspellings.","He told me that whatever might happen, he was prepared for it."],["報告是匆匆準備好的，所以含有個把錯別字。","他告訴我不論發生什麼，他都準備好了。"]],["denounce","di'nauns","vt. 告发, 抨击, 谴责\\n[法] 谴责, 斥责, 告发",["The alterglobalists denounce growing inequalities.","We have the right to do non-violent actions to denounce Israel's apartheid policies."],["",""]],["beating","'bi:tiŋ","n. 打, 挫败, 搏动\\n[化] 打浆",["His heart stopped beating and he died immediately.","Stop beating yourself up and start beating up fascists."],["他心脏停止了跳动, 随即死亡。","不要再打擊自己了，給我去打擊法西斯。"]],["stool","stu:l","n. 凳子, 大便, 粪便, 厕所\\nvi. 长新枝\\nvt. 引诱, 诱捕",["If you stand on this stool, you can reach the top of the closet.","The seaman apprentice, sitting on a stool in a bar, ordered a beer while waiting for his basket of fish and chips."],["站在这个凳子上的话，你可以摸到衣柜顶。",""]],["lounge","laundʒ","n. 闲逛, 休闲室, 长沙发\\nvi. 闲混, (懒洋洋地)躺\\nvt. 闲混",["You can't just lounge around like that while everybody else is so busy.","On my days off I do things like go to the movies, lounge around in cafes, and cook."],["",""]],["credible","'kredәbl","a. 可信的, 可靠的\\n[法] 可信的, 可靠的",["If you want to be credible, tell people only what they believe.","The most credible hypothesis is the one that limits the number of elements in the domain T."],["如果你想使他人相信你的话，那就只说他已经相信的东西吧。",""]],["tuna","'tju:nә","n. 金枪鱼, 金枪鱼肉",["The skin of a shark is much rougher than that of a tuna fish.","Tom got mercury poisoning because he ate canned tuna every day."],["鯊魚皮比金槍魚皮粗糙多了。","Tom汞中毒，因為他每天吃罐裝鮪魚。"]],["revision","ri'viʒәn","n. 校订, 修正, 修订本, 修订版\\n[计] 修订版",["Branching and merging are two basic operations of revision control.","I wish all those an unhurried night who want a revision of the existing copyright laws, but actually all the others too."],["分支和合併是版本控制的兩種基本操作。","对于那些想要修订现行著作权法的人，我希望他们这一晚是轻松的一晚，但实际上我希望其他人的夜晚也是轻松的。"]],["recycling","","[电] 再循环",["We've got to start thinking about recycling.","Recycling is the third R. You have to reduce and reuse first."],["我們必須開始考慮回收。",""]],["daylight","'deilait","n. 白昼, 日光\\nvt. 使沐浴于日光\\nvi. 享有日光",["Today, robbers robbed another bank in broad daylight.","He had his car stolen in broad daylight."],["今天强盗大白天的就抢了另一家银行。","他的车子光天化日被偷走了。"]],["simmer","'simә","vt. 煨\\nvi. 炖, 内心充满\\nn. 即将沸腾的状态, 即将发作",["Done! Now I just have to set it to simmer so it doesn't boil before everybody comes.","Please simmer the beans for a while over a low heat."],["",""]],["warrant","'wɒ:rәnt","n. 授权, 正当理由, 根据, 证明, 批准, 凭证, 令状, 委任状\\nvt. 授权给, 保证, 担保, 批准, 使有正当理由",["We have a warrant to search your apartment.","A judge will issue a search warrant only if there is probable cause."],["我们有权搜查你的公寓。",""]],["horizontal",".hɒri'zɒntәl","n. 水平线, 水平面, 水平位置\\na. 水平线的, 平坦的, 横的\\nn. 水平\\n[计] 水平",["It is of great significance in this experiment to accelerate the particle M in the horizontal direction.","Tango is the vertical expression of a horizontal desire."],["",""]],["mattress","'mætris","n. 床垫, 空气垫, 沉床\\n[医] 褥子, 床垫",["My brother hides his porn magazines under his mattress.","Tom hid his money under his mattress."],["我的兄弟把色情雜誌藏在床墊下面。","湯姆把錢藏在床墊底下。"]],["exceptional","ik'sepʃәnәl","a. 例外的, 异常的, 特别的",["Their articles are exceptional, even considering that they have already been very successful.","The color palette you've chosen for this set is exceptional."],["",""]],["battlefield","'bætlfi:ld","n. 战场, 沙场",["He would still be alive had he refused to go to the battlefield then.","The battlefield was full of the dead and the dying."],["",""]],["wary","'wєәri","a. 谨慎的, 小心的, 机警的, 周到的, 唯恐的",["Tom has been saying some strange things recently. I'm even a little wary of him now.","One ought to be wary of \"false friends\" in translation."],["",""]],["bundle","'bʌndl","n. 捆, 束\\nvt. 包扎, 胡乱塞进\\nvi. 匆忙离开",["The drinks at Tom's daughter's wedding cost him a bundle.","\"There is nothing like cleanliness,\" said she, as she scoured the pot with a bundle of snakes."],["",""]],["saturated","'sætʃәreitid","a. 饱和的, 渗透的\\n[医] 饱和的",["Saturated fats may be healthier than poly-unsaturated fats. The latter oxidize easily, while saturated fats remain stable.","I have high cholesterol and I need to avoid saturated fats."],["",""]],["embed","im'bed","vt. 使插入, 使嵌入, 使深留脑中\\n[计] 嵌入",["I wish I could figure out how to embed a YouTube video.","The aliens embed themselves in tinfoil and take over the mind of anyone who wraps it around their head."],["",""]],["staffer","'stɑ:fә","n. (一名)职员(尤指编辑或记者)",["Tom spent much of the year working as a staffer on Mary's Senate campaign.","The congressional staffer who leaked classified documents has been arrested."],["",""]],["linen","'linin","n. 亚麻布, 亚麻线, 亚麻制品\\na. 亚麻布制的, 亚麻的",["In the morning, the witch gave the girl two pieces of linen to weave before night, and the boy a pile of wood to cut into chips.","A maid came in to comb out her long hair, and brought the finest linen for her use."],["",""]],["ozone","'әuzәun","n. 新鲜的空气, 臭氧, 使人愉快的影响\\n[化] 臭氧",["The ozone in the stratosphere absorbs ultraviolet radiation.","Even if we do this, it will be another sixty years before the Antarctic ozone hole is repaired."],["平流層的臭氧會吸收紫外線。",""]],["robbery","'rɒbәri","n. 抢掠, 抢夺\\n[法] 强盗, 抢劫, 劫掠",["The thieves knocked off another bank today in a daytime robbery.","Bank robbery will cost you ten years in prison."],["今天强盗大白天的就抢了另一家银行。","搶劫銀行的後果就是在監獄裏蹲十年。"]],["memorable","'memәrәbl","a. 值得纪念的, 难忘的",["And soon after I procured Xenophon's Memorable Things of Socrates, in which there are many instances of the same method.","The virtual birthday parties entertained the kids and made it a memorable birthday."],["",""]],["recorder","ri'kɒ:dә","n. 记录员, 录音机\\nn. 记录器\\n[计] 宏录制器, 记录器",["I got a video cassette recorder cheap at that shop.","My cassette tape recorder needs fixing."],["我在那商店花低價買了臺錄像機。","我的磁带录音机需要维修。"]],["nicely","'naisli","adv. 漂亮地, 谨慎地, 恰好地",["Hopefully things will pan out nicely.","Tom's creative thinking nicely complemented Mary's organizational talents."],["希望事情能順利解決。",""]],["footstep","'futstep","n. 脚步, 脚步声, 足迹",["Sami could hear each footstep that anybody would make throughout the house.","The fertility Goddess is rising. She will crush all evil with each footstep."],["",""]],["prostitute","'prɒstitju:t","n. 妓女, 男娼\\nvt. 使沦为妓女\\na. 卖淫的, 堕落的",["He paid the prostitute the fee without being aware of the surveillance camera.","Marie admitted that she was a prostitute."],["他在不知有監控錄像的情況下支付了妓女服務費用。","瑪麗婭承認她是一個妓女。"]],["drip","drip","n. 水滴\\nv. (使)滴下",["Remove the cap from the ink refill bottle, fill the dropper with ink, and drip an appropriate amount onto the marker's core.","Consider using a drip tray or liner for messier cooking projects."],["",""]],["clove","klәuv","n. 丁香\\ncleave的过去式",["A clove cigarette miasma made navigating the pub like swimming underwater.","Tom ate a clove of raw garlic in front of everyone."],["",""]],["shocking","'ʃɒkiŋ","a. 令人震惊的, 极坏的, 不正当的",["The accusations are shocking: money laundering, tax evasion and obstruction of justice.","An opinion is shocking only if it is a conviction."],["这些指控令人震惊:洗钱、逃税和妨碍司法公正。",""]],["elevate","'eliveit","vt. 举起, 提拔, 鼓舞",["New truth and knowledge always elevate human life and most usually find practical application.","Wearing sunglasses can elevate your style and add a dash of mystery."],["",""]],["loosen","lu:sn","vt. 放松, 松开, 解除\\nvi. 变松, 松弛",["He kicked off his bonds, which he had somehow contrived to loosen.","I like to do a few exercises to loosen up before I run."],["",""]],["forced","fɒ:st","a. 被迫的, 强迫的, 用力的\\n[法] 强制的, 法定的, 强迫的",["They were forced to kill and eat several of their horses.","Learning should not be forced, but rather encouraged."],["他们被迫杀掉他们的几匹马来吃。","學習不該被強迫，而是該被鼓勵。"]],["intake","'inteik","n. 入口, 吸入, 吸入量\\n[医] 摄取量",["After his heart attack, Jim had to cut down on his sugar intake.","You won't lose weight unless you cut back on your food intake."],["",""]],["predictor","pri'diktә","n. 预言者\\n[计] 预示变量; 预测程序",["Flunking school is not necessarily a predictor of future success.","The greatest predictor of future behaviour is past behaviour."],["",""]],["lottery","'lɒtәri","n. 奖券, 彩票, 运气\\n[经] 抽彩给奖法",["My mother prefers the arbitrary selection of the lottery machines over my lucky numbers.","Finding a decent man is more difficult than winning a lottery."],["我母亲宁愿选彩票机上的任意数字，也不选我的幸运数字。","找一个好男人比中彩票还要难。"]],["chore","tʃɒ:","n. 零工, 家务\\n[经] 零工",["Recently I'm ending up feeling like every single thing is a chore.","Ziri knows the value of being able to finish a chore and move on to the next."],["",""]],["fringe","frindʒ","n. 边缘, 端, 流苏, 穗, 初步\\nvt. 加穗于, 加饰边于\\na. 边缘的, 附加的",["I recommend putting up your hair so your fringe doesn't get on your forehead.","For decades, UBI was dismissed as a fringe economic idea."],["",""]],["shopper","'ʃɒpә","n. 购物者\\n[经] 顾客, 购物的人",["I'm not wealthy enough to afford a personal shopper."],[""]],["lengthy","'leŋθi","a. 冗长的, 漫长的",["It was his lengthy narrative that bored me to death.","In his lengthy career, he had never seen the market so high."],["",""]],["hedge","hedʒ","n. 树篱, 障碍, 套头交易\\nvt. 用树篱围, 套期保值, 妨碍, 两面下注以防...的损失\\nvi. 筑树篱, 躲闪, 两面下注以…",["The top 25 hedge fund managers make more than all of the kindergarten teachers in America combined.","The hedge fund manager was convicted of insider trading."],["",""]],["tattoo","tә'tu:","n. 归营号, 连续有节奏的敲击, 文身, 矮种马\\nvt. 连续有节奏地敲, 刺花纹于\\nvi. 作连续有节奏的敲击",["Tom has a tattoo of a skull on his chest.","Mary explained to her parents that everyone at school had a tattoo, but they remained unconvinced."],["湯姆在胸上有個頭骨文身。",""]],["reduced","ri'dju:st","a. 减少的；简化的；缩减的",["A series of blasts reduced the laboratory to ruins.","Although the production of electric fans was reduced in February, it still beats January."],["一连串的爆炸使实验室成为废墟。","雖然二月電風扇的產量減少了，但還是超過了一月。"]],["lease","li:s","n. 租约, 租期, 租\\nvt. 出租, 租出, 租得",["All land in Tanzania is owned by the government, which can lease land for up to 99 years.","Yanni was all too happy to sign another 12 month lease."],["",""]],["heating","'hi:tiŋ","n. 加热, 供热, 暖气设备, 供暖系统, 暖气装置\\na. 加热的, 供暖的",["Heating water does not change its chemical composition.","I'm glad that they fixed the heating system, but now it's too hot."],["把水加热不改变它的化学成分。","我很高興他們修復了暖氣系統，但現在太熱了。"]],["telecommunications","","n. 电信, 通讯, 电信学\\n[电] 电通信",["The telecommunications market is totally up for grabs.","The laser has since revolutionized the fields of defense, telecommunications, medicine and consumer electronics."],["",""]],["princess","'prinsis","n. 公主, 王妃, 女巨头",["Your sister looks as noble as if she were a princess.","To hide the fact that she's a princess, she disguised herself as a boy and escaped the palace."],["你妹妹看上去那么高贵，就像是个公主一样。","她為了掩飾自己公主的身份，女扮男裝，逃出了皇宮。"]],["murmur","'mә:mә","n. 低语, 低声的怨言\\nvi. 低语, 低声而言\\nvt. 低声说",["The murmur of the brook lulls me to sleep.","From the outside came a murmur of guttural voices, or the occasional sound of moccasined feet passing to and fro."],["溪流潺潺，催我入眠。",""]],["coral","'kɒrәl","n. 珊瑚, 珊瑚色\\n[化] 珊瑚",["The coral reef is the region's prime attraction.","Coral reefs attract a variety of beautiful marine life."],["珊瑚礁是这个地区的主要景点。",""]],["appliance","ә'plaiәns","n. 器械, 用具, 应用\\n[医] 矫正器; 器",["This is an appliance for drying clothes.","The electrical appliance must have been damaged in transit."],["這是一個晾衣服的器具。",""]],["maid","meid","n. 少女, 未婚女子, 女仆",["The maid arranged the knives and forks on the table.","I had a part-time job as a hotel maid, but I didn't like it very much."],["",""]],["circus","'sә:kәs","n. 马戏团, 马戏, 竞技场",["At the age of six, I was taken to a circus for the first time.","Tom works as an elephant trainer in a circus."],["在我六岁的时候，我第一次被带去看马戏。","汤姆在一个马戏团当训象师。"]],["gauge","geidʒ","n. 标准度量, 计量器\\nvt. 精确计量, 估计\\n[计] 线规",["Gauge queens constantly up the ante in order to assert their commitment to a counter cultural look.","According to the gas gauge, we still have half a tank."],["",""]],["census","'sensәs","n. 户口普查\\nvt. 实施统计调查",["According to the latest census, the language's number of speakers appears to be stable, or even increasing.","In the United States, there is a census every ten years."],["根据最新的人口普查，语言的发言人人数好像稳定，或者是甚至在上升。",""]],["rationale",".ræʃә'nɑ:li","n. 基本原理\\n[医] 原理, 理论",["The rationale behind certain New Age treatments can be dangerously wrong.","Be leery of those who claim someone is non compos mentis and let rationale be your judge."],["",""]],["corps","kɒ:","n. 军, 队, 部队, 兵种\\n[医] 对, 团; 体, 物体",["She got her feet wet teaching while she was in the Peace Corps.","He worked as a young person in the aerospace industry; subsequently he joined the spacetime corps."],["",""]],["lieutenant","lef'tenәnt","n. 中尉, 助理人员, 副官",["The camp was under the command of Lieutenant Jackson.","Lieutenant Worf is a Klingon who serves as an officer aboard the Federation starship Enterprise."],["",""]],["inhabit","in'hæbit","vt. 居住于, 占据, 栖息",["Wondji said control efforts, such as eliminating mosquito larvae that inhabit standing pools of water, can also be redoubled.","The spirits can be good or evil and can inhabit inanimate objects."],["",""]],["injustice","in'dʒʌstis","n. 不公平, 非正义的行为\\n[法] 不公正, 不公平, 权利侵害",["Martin Luther King, Jr., had won his first protest against injustice - peacefully.","Woman as I am, I shall stand up against any social injustice."],["",""]],["quota","'kwәutә","n. 配额, 限额\\n[化] 定额",["We almost broke our necks trying to meet the quota.","We will begin by considering the concept of \"quota\"."],["",""]],["stride","straid","n. 大步, 步幅, 步态, 进步\\nv. 迈大步走, 跨过, 跨",["I don't know what to do with that guy. No matter how mad I get at him he just takes it in stride and pays no attention.","It's better to take things in stride than to stress out over every little detail."],["我不知道對那個傢伙該怎麼辦。不論我對他生多大的氣, 他就是蠻不在乎而且置之不理。",""]],["excerpt","'eksә:pt","n. 摘录\\nv. 引用, 摘录",["The students have to analyze an excerpt from the book.","I was planning to include an excerpt from The Chronicles of Narnia."],["",""]],["motorcycle","'mәutәsaikl","n. 摩托车\\n[机] 机动车, 机踏车, 摩托车",["Tom took Mary to the hospital on the back of his motorcycle.","Ziri heard the sound of a motorcycle echoing in the valley."],["汤姆把玛丽放到他的摩托车背上送到医院。","齊里聽到山谷裡傳來摩托車的轟鳴聲。"]],["soy","sɒi","n. 酱油, 大豆\\n[医] 大豆; 酱油",["Mix the rice and eggs with soy sauce.","The company produces soy sauce and other food products."],["把米飯和雞蛋還有醬油拌在了一起。",""]],["miniature","'miniәtʃә","n. 缩图, 小画像\\na. 小规模的, 纤小的",["The scientists are also working to develop artificial blood vessels and miniature models of a human body using 3d bio printing.","He stared at the faithful miniature of the dinosaur."],["",""]],["insurer","in'ʃuәrә","n. 保险公司\\n[法] 保险人, 承保人, 保险公司",["The insurer will indemnify the policyholder against loss of or damage to the motor car."],[""]],["oversight","'әuvәsait","n. 勘漏, 失察, 失败, 照料\\n[经] 监督权",["He reprimanded me for my oversight.","If an oversight is the reason why you have not paid, please send us the amount due, and let us solve the problem immediately."],["他责备了我的疏忽。",""]],["dub","dʌb","vt. 配音, 轻点, 授予称号, 击\\nn. 一下击鼓声, 笨蛋",["Unfortunately, a Japanese dub of the film is not included on this DVD, but at least there are Japanese subtitles.","Dub actors are being sought for the Chinese version of the film."],["",""]],["copyright","'kɒpirait","n. 版权, 著作权\\n[法] 著作权",["I wish all those an unhurried night who want a revision of the existing copyright laws, but actually all the others too.","Tom always violates copyright laws."],["对于那些想要修订现行著作权法的人，我希望他们这一晚是轻松的一晚，但实际上我希望其他人的夜晚也是轻松的。","汤姆一向违反知识产权。"]],["reunion","ri:'ju:njәn","n. 团圆, 重聚\\n[医] 再连合, 复连[合]",["This means that eating dumplings on New Year's eve is a symbol of family reunion.","Tom went to Australia for a family reunion."],["说明年夜饭的饺子是亲人团聚的象征。","湯姆去澳大利亞與家人團聚。"]],["ripe","raip","a. 成熟的, 熟练的, 成年的\\n[医] 成熟的",["There's one surefire way to live to a ripe old age: eat a meatball a day for a hundred years.","Ripe medlars come away easily from the tree."],["想長命百歲有一個萬無一失的方法：每天吃一顆獅子頭，吃一百年。","成熟的枇杷很容易從樹上摘下來。"]],["viewpoint","'vju:pɒint","n. 观点",["A population policy should be considered on the international viewpoint so as to balance the interests of both sides.","You should investigate the fact from a medical viewpoint."],["從國際的觀點看，應該考慮推行人口政策來平衡兩方的利益。",""]],["unbelievable",".ʌnbi'li:vәbl","a. 难以置信的",["This story might sound unbelievable but it is true.","The speed with which we forget is just unbelievable."],["",""]],["snatch","snætʃ","n. 抢夺, 攫取, 片断\\nvt. 夺取, 攫取\\nvi. 想抢走, 攫取",["Love is something that you can neither snatch away nor express.","Boldi finally managed to snatch the toy out of Martha's hands."],["",""]],["coordination","kәu.ɒ:di'neiʃәn","n. 同等, 协调\\n[计] 协调; 进程协调",["The information presented in Kelly's paper on color coordination is seen to be of use in building up an alternative theory.","It has already been explained to you: a battle requires discipline and coordination."],["",""]],["amazed","ә'meizd","a. 吃惊的, 惊奇的",["If I were to tell you all I know, you would be amazed.","We're amazed by the rapid growth in import quantities."],["要是我告诉你我所知的一切，你会被惊呆的。","进口数量的急速增长让我们感到惊讶。"]],["jewel","'dʒu:әl","n. 珠宝, 贵重物, 镶珠宝的饰物\\nvt. 饰以珠宝, 镶以宝石",["He wishes to buy a valuable jewel for his daughter.","The Tassili Mountains of Algeria are a true jewel of nature."],["",""]],["accord","ә'kɒ:d","n. 一致, 调和, 协定\\nvt. 给与, 使一致\\nvi. 相符合",["The story is not in accord with the facts.","I chose this dictionary of my own accord."],["这个故事与事实不符。","這本詞典是我自己選的。"]],["slogan","'slәugәn","n. 呐喊声, 标语, 口号",["We need a campaign slogan that'll really energize the base.","Thus, internationalization has become a fashionable slogan for the Japanese."],["",""]],["outrageous","aut'reidʒәs","a. 暴虐的, 极无礼的, 可恶的",["Politicians are always censured for outrageous or inappropriate behavior.","It is outrageous that you should spend so much money."],["",""]],["waiting","'weitiŋ","n. 等候\\na. 等候的, 服侍的",["I've got to hang up now. Someone is waiting to use the phone.","Failing the examination means waiting for another year."],["我要掛線了。有人正在等著用電話。","考试不及格意味着再等待一年。"]],["overly","'әuvәli","adv. 过度地, 极度地",["It is not fitting for a teacher to overly favor certain pupils over others.","Having realized seven of the eight objectives on her bucket list, Mary was not overly upset by her untimely death."],["",""]],["halloween",".hælәu'i:n","n. (基督教)万圣节前夕",["Some teenagers smashed our pumpkins just before Halloween.","She made pumpkin soup in a black cauldron for Halloween."],["",""]],["perch","pә:tʃ","n. 栖木, 高位, 杆, 河鲈\\nv. (使)栖息, 就位, 位于, (使)暂歇",["Should we order the steamed perch or the beef with oyster sauce?","The eagle likes to perch on the highest branch of the tree."],["叫个清蒸鲈鱼好呢，还是蚝油牛肉好？",""]],["buffalo","'bʌfәlәu","n. 水牛\\n[机] 水牛",["The woman has suffered from a collapse, because she ate meat from a water buffalo.","Me? I can't even begin to draw buffalo, deer and horses so you can tell them apart."],["女人食用水牛肉導致暈厥。",""]],["shrine","ʃrain","n. 圣地, 神龛, 庙\\nvt. 将...置于神龛内",["On New Year's Day many Japanese go to the shrine to worship.","The decay of the shrine is due, in part, to acid rain."],["很多日本人都會在元旦到神社參拜。","廟宇的毀壞有一部分要歸因於酸雨。"]],["individually",".indi'vidʒuәli","adv. 以个人身分, 各个地, 独特地",["The more I detest men individually the more ardent becomes my love for humanity.","Ziri cuts down the flower stems of his heathers individually."],["",""]],["albeit","ɔ:l'bi:it","conj. 尽管, 虽然",["Many software companies offer free versions of their products, albeit with limited functionality.","Tom hopes to make a profit this year, albeit a small one."],["",""]],["mold","mәuld","n. 模子, 模型, 霉\\nv. 形成, 塑造, 发霉",["In other words, people's genetic tendencies actually mold their environments.","Yanni's house is full of trash and smells of mold."],["",""]],["misery","'mizәri","n. 痛苦, 悲惨, 不幸, 穷困",["Money won't make you merry, but it eases your misery.","His illness caused her great misery."],["鈔能力不等於幸福，但可以暫時解決很多麻煩。","他的病使她非常傷心。"]],["adequately","'ædikwәtli","adv. 足够地, 适当地",["Never attribute to malice that which is adequately explained by stupidity.","Tom said that no words could adequately describe his feelings of devastation and grief on losing his best friend."],["能解釋為愚蠢的，就不要解釋為惡意。",""]],["nickname","'nikneim","n. 绰号, 昵称\\nvt. 给...取绰号, 叫错名字\\n[计] 绰号",["She has red hair, so they gave her the nickname \"Carrot\".","She refers to Nostradamus with the rather cloying nickname \"Nosty\"."],["",""]],["addict","ә'dikt","vt. 使沉溺, 使上瘾\\nn. 入迷的人, 上瘾者",["Not every addict is traumatized, but there would be a lot fewer addicts if a lot fewer people were traumatized.","His flawlessly ordered life collapsed when his drug-addict brothers appeared."],["不是每個癮君子都有創傷；不過有創傷的人變少，癮君子也會變少。",""]],["dial","'daiәl","n. 刻度盘, 钟面, 转盘\\nv. 拨",["Can you help me dial? The telephone is put too high.","The boiler can be reset by turning the left hand dial fully anti-clockwise."],["您能帮我拨号吗？电话机放得太高了。",""]],["marginal","'mɑ:dʒinәl","a. 边缘的, 最低限度的, 有旁注的\\n[医] 缘的",["There is only a marginal difference between the two.","Prior to the 20th century, it was the most marginal of ideas to claim Jews were merely a religion and not a people."],["兩者之間只有很小的差別。",""]],["mustard","'mʌstәd","n. 芥末, 芥菜, 强烈的兴趣\\n[医] 芥子; 芥属植物",["A drop of mustard fell and stained my tie during lunch.","He thought he was up to the challenge but in the end he just couldn't cut the mustard."],["吃午饭的时候，一坨芥末酱滴下来弄脏了我的领带。",""]],["berry","'beri","n. 浆果\\nvi. 采集浆果",["\"Vaya\" means \"wow,\" \"baya\" means \"berry,\" and \"valla\" means \"fence.\"","I want to show you the raspberry bushes, put a berry on your soft lips and open them with a gentle kiss."],["\"Vaya\"的意思是\"哇哦\"，\"baya\"的意思是\"浆果\"，\"valla\"的意思是\"栅栏\"。",""]],["ramp","ræmp","n. 斜坡, 坡道, 敲诈\\nvi. 狂跳乱撞, 乱冲, 敲诈, 蔓延\\nvt. 使有斜面, 敲诈",["The building isn't yet up to code because it still needs a wheelchair ramp.","Incidentally a motorway ramp is being constructed in the neighbourhood, a few hundred metres away, of my clinic."],["這棟建築尚未符合法規，因為還缺少輪椅坡道。",""]],["mug","mʌg","n. 有柄大杯, 脸, 苦读者\\nvt. 给...拍照, 攻击, 苦读\\nvi. 拼命用功",["The beer mug is almost bigger than you are.","Tom rinsed out his mug and then refilled it with coffee."],["啤酒杯差一点比你还大。",""]],["controller","kәn'trәulә","n. 控制器, 管理者\\n[计] 控制器",["Air traffic controller is an extremely high pressure job.","This controller has accelerometers in it so it can send a farewell transmission as your child chucks it out the window."],["",""]],["villager","'vilidʒә","n. 村民",["I walked up to the villager to ask for directions, but they looked spaced and unable to speak.","What could Tom know about the life of a villager? He's never had to lift anything heavier than an iPhone."],["",""]],["watercolor","","n. 水彩颜料, 水彩画",["She wanted us to know the different between watercolor and oil painting, the smell of paint and just all the little details.","Watercolor is a more dynamic and versatile painting technique than oil painting."],["",""]],["cleaning","'kli:niŋ","n. 清洁, 扫除, 家畜的胞衣, 扫除出来的垃圾, 大败, 输得精光, 除伐, 巨额利润\\n[计] 清洗, 清除",["I lost a school key when I was cleaning up after the school festival and I was then required to write an apology letter.","Tom said that he had been cleaning the house all day."],["我在校庆后打扫的时候弄掉了一把学校的钥匙，我被迫写了一份检讨。","汤姆说他打扫屋子打扫了一天。"]],["fertility","fә'tiliti","n. 肥沃, 丰饶, 生产力\\n[医] 生育力",["Pachamama is a goddess of earth and fertility revered by the indigenous peoples of the Andes.","Red is the color of love, passion, fertility and power."],["帕查瑪瑪是安地斯山脈土著居民敬仰的大地和生育女神。",""]],["relaxed","ri'lækst","a. 松懈的, 不严密的, 不严格的, 放松的, 得到休息的, 随意的, 不拘束的, 自在的",["After saying everything that I had to, I felt relaxed.","How can I feel relaxed, with you watching me like that?"],["我说完所有需要说的话后，感觉轻松多了。","你那么看着我，我哪里放松得下来啊？"]],["hail","heil","n. 冰雹, 致敬, 欢呼, 招呼\\nvt. 向...欢呼, 致敬, 招呼, 使象下雹样落下\\nvi. 招呼, 下雹\\ninterj. 万…",["We marched under a hail of bullets.","Hail all faithful souls, whose bodies here and everywhere do rest in the dust."],["我們在槍林彈雨之下行進。",""]],["indoor","'indɒ:","a. 户内的, 室内的",["The advent of indoor tanning salons now allows Canadians to sport a sun-kissed look all year round.","If you have an indoor swimming pool, you're probably pretty rich."],["",""]],["secretly","'si:kritli","adv. 秘密地, 背地里",["Mary discovered that Tom was secretly a talented singer.","Sami has been secretly dating Layla's little sister."],["瑪莉發現湯姆其實是一位很有才華的歌手。","薩米一直在偷偷和萊拉的妹妹交往。"]],["whatsoever",".hwɒtsәu'evә","pron. 无论什么",["And whatsoever ye do, do it heartily, as to the Lord, and not unto men.","You are under no obligation whatsoever to share this information."],["",""]],["notify","'nәutifai","vt. 通知, 通告, 报告\\n[计] 通知",["If there's a better solution, then I'll notify you about it as soon as possible.","If you have any other issues, please notify me through the form."],["如果有什么更好的解决方案，我一定第一时间通知您。","如果你有其他问题，请通过表格发给我。"]],["garment","'gɑ:mәnt","n. 衣服, 衣装, 外表",["The qipao is a classic female garment that originated in 17th century China.","It is useless to patch such a big tear in a garment."],["旗袍是一种17世纪起源于中国的传统式样的女性服装。",""]],["activate","'æktiveit","vt. 使活动, 使激活, 正式建成\\nvi. 有活力",["You must activate the software before you can use it again.","To activate the faucet, just wave your hands under the spout and the motion detectors will start the water flowing."],["",""]],["naive","nɑ:'i:v","a. 天真的, 纯真的, 幼稚的",["She's young, naive and inexperienced.","Get rid of those kinds of naive ideas."],["她年轻，天真而又缺乏阅历。","打消这种幼稚的念头吧。"]],["exert","ig'zә:t","vt. 发挥, 运用, 施以影响\\n[法] 施加, 产生, 行使",["Algeria needs to exert its might as a regional power.","Man has always tried to exert control over nature."],["",""]],["arctic","'ɑ:ktik","a. 北极的, 极寒的\\nn. 北极圈, 北极",["Owing to its landmass, the Antarctic has an air temperature lower than that of the Arctic.","A few months later they return to their breeding grounds in the Arctic."],["南極因為有大陸，所以氣溫低於北極。","數月後，牠們回到了北極的繁殖地。"]],["certification",".sә:tifi'keiʃәn","n. 证明\\n[经] 证明",["You can skip stage three of the certification process and advance immediately to stage six.","I've completed all the classes necessary for my certification."],["您可以跳過認證過程的第三階段，直接進入第六階段。",""]],["trustee",".trʌs'ti:","n. 受托人, 理事\\n[计] 委托者",["She is the only trustee of the university who never attended it as a student.","Tom served as a trustee for three years."],["",""]],["caregiver","ˈkeəgɪvə(r)","n. 照料者, 护理者",["My grandaunt needs a caregiver because she as dementia.","Evan needs a caregiver as an adult because his learning disability causes him to struggle with certain tasks."],["",""]],["kindergarten","'kindә.gɑ:tn","n. 幼稚园",["The teacher of the kindergarten told the pupils to respect, and cherish each other.","There is a kindergarten at the other end of the street."],["幼儿园的老师告诉小朋友们要互敬互爱。","横街的那端有一个幼儿园。"]],["cereal","'siәriәl","n. 谷类食品, 谷类植物\\na. 谷类的",["The \"complete breakfasts\" in cereal commercials always include cereal, milk, toast, and orange juice, but even Americans don't usually eat that much in the morning.","Tom won't start his day without a serving of his morning cereal."],["玉米片广告的 “完整早餐” 总有玉米片、牛奶、烤面包和橙汁，但是连美国人的早餐没有那么丰富。",""]],["boulder","'bәuldә","n. 大圆石\\n[机] 圆石, 漂石",["The crevice in the boulder on the ocean floor conceals an octopus.","It's smaller than a boulder and larger than a pebble."],["海底的岩石缝里藏着一只章鱼。",""]],["fracture","'fræktʃә","n. 破碎, 骨折\\nv. (使)破碎, (使)破裂",["The pain from the compound fracture was almost intolerable.","The pain of the compound fracture was almost unbearable."],["",""]],["quilt","kwilt","n. 棉被\\nvt. 加软衬料后缝制, 东拼西凑地编\\nvi. 缝被子",["The newly bought quilt is very warm when covered.","In winter, I cover myself with a quilt."],["新买的被子盖起来非常暖和。","冬天我蓋一條被子。"]],["turnover","'tә:n.әuvә","n. 翻倒, 翻转, 半圆酥饼, 营业额, 流通, 周转\\na. 可翻转的",["This company achieved a remarkable increase in turnover last year.","The turnover at my company is really speeding up lately."],["这家公司去年获得显著的营业额增长。",""]],["sensible","'sensәbl","a. 有感觉的, 敏感的, 明智的\\n[医] 可感觉的",["A sensible man wouldn't say such a thing in public.","Opera in English is, in the main, just about as sensible as baseball in Italian."],["稍有頭腦的人都不會在公眾場合裏說出這種話來。","以英语唱的歌剧，大致上和以意大利语玩的棒球般过得去。"]],["socioeconomic","'sәuʃiәu,i:kә'nɔmik","a. 社会经济学的",["Everybody is a slave to the current socioeconomic system that was invented through the years by unintelligent people.","The current socioeconomic system is made-up."],["",""]],["pyramid","'pirәmid","n. 角锥, 金字塔\\nv. (使)成金字塔状, (使)渐增, (使)上涨",["There's a pyramid in Mexico bigger than any of those in Egypt.","The secret of the pyramid was brought to light by science."],["在墨西哥有一座金字塔比在埃及的任何一座都大。",""]],["bachelor","'bætʃәlә","n. 单身汉, 学士\\n[法] 学士, 单身汉",["A person is a bachelor if and only if that person is a marriageable man who has never married.","Tom remained a bachelor until his death."],["当且仅当一个人是个没有结婚并可以结婚的男人，那个人是个未娶。","汤姆终身未娶。"]],["protestant","'prɒtistәnt","n. 新教徒\\na. 新教的, 新教徒的",["When the early Protestant immigrants came to this country, they brought the idea that work was the way to God and heaven.","This attitude, the Protestant work ethic, still influences Americans today."],["",""]],["moving","'mu:viŋ","a. 动人的, 令人感动的, 鼓动的, 原动的, [无比较级]活动的, 转动的",["This song is so moving that it brings tears to my eyes.","Life is like riding a bicycle. To keep your balance you must keep moving."],["這首歌太感人了，使我不禁流下了眼淚。","人生就像騎單車一樣，要保持平衡就得不停地前進。"]],["tract","trækt","n. 大片土地, 地带, 小册子\\n[医] 束, 道",["Millions of beneficial organisms live in the human digestive tract.","An endoscopy is used to examine a person's digestive tract."],["",""]],["operational",".ɒpә'reiʃәnl","a. 操作的, 运作的\\n[法] 操作上的, 业务上的, 可起作用的",["At present \"consume all consumable resources\" is assigned as the operational meaning of TETRA.","VISUACT supports flexibly the varied environments and needs of our customers and offers a variety of operational procedures."],["",""]],["convincing","kәn'vinsiŋ","a. 使人信服的, 有力的, 令人心悦诚服的",["Your argument is not any more convincing than that of my stubborn father.","I had difficulty convincing her of the dangers of smoking."],["",""]],["decoration",".dekә'reiʃәn","n. 装饰, 装饰品",["Their siheyuans were far smaller in scale and simpler in design and decoration, and the hutongs were narrower.","You've done a wonderful job on the interior decoration."],["他们的四合院要小得多，设计和装饰也比较简单，胡同也比较窄。",""]],["proudly","'praudli","adv. 傲慢地, 自大地, 得意洋洋地",["She once proudly stated that she was going to lose 5 kilos of fat in a single month.","A large army is proudly proceeding."],["她曾经夸口说一个月之内要减掉5公斤赘肉。","一支大军正浩浩荡荡地行进着。"]],["descendant","di'sendәnt","n. 后裔, 子孙\\na. 传下的, 下降的",["According to B'reshit Rabba, Noah's wife Naamah was a righteous descendant of Cain.","I'm not a descendant of slaves. I'm a descendant of human beings who were forced into slavery."],["",""]],["lump","lʌmp","n. 块, 瘤, 很多, 肿块, 笨人\\nvt. 使成块状, 混在一起\\nvi. 结块",["I bumped my head against the door and got a lump.","Every time I see that picture of my late mother, I feel a lump in my throat."],["我头撞到了门，肿了一块。",""]],["scarf","skɑ:f","n. 围巾, 头巾, 领带, 领巾, 嵌接\\nvt. 用围巾围, 嵌接",["I would like to buy a present for my wife. I thought about a scarf.","No matter whether it is cold or hot, when she goes out, she always brings a scarf."],["我想给妻子买一件礼物。我打算买一条围巾。","不論天氣冷還熱，她出門總帶著圍巾。"]],["freeway","'fri:wei","n. 高速公路",["There was a terrible accident on the freeway yesterday.","There are many rest stops along the freeway for the convenience of travelers."],["",""]],["clash","klæʃ","n. 冲突, 撞击声, 抵触\\nvi. 冲突, 抵触\\nvt. 使发出撞击声\\n[计] 对撞",["Every now and then they clash over their differences.","The two strongest teams will clash with each other this weekend."],["他们有时候有矛盾冲突",""]],["upward","'ʌpwәd","a. 向上的\\nadv. 以上",["The smoke went upward through the chimney.","Glancing upward, I saw the aperture, a small blue disc, in which a star was visible."],["烟从烟囱里冒了出来。",""]],["newsletter","'nju:z.letә","n. 时事通讯, 业务通讯, 时事传报\\n[法] 时事通讯, 时事信札",["You want more information about our activities? Subscribe to our newsletter.","Click here if you wish to subscribe to the newsletter."],["",""]],["mammal","mæmәl","n. 哺乳动物\\n[化] 哺乳动物",["The whale is well known to be the largest mammal.","The African elephant is the largest land mammal on earth."],["鲸是被公认为最大的哺乳动物。",""]],["yank","jæŋk","v. 猛拉",["The string is kind of old and worn out, so don't yank it too hard.","\"Septics\" is rhyming slang, meaning \"Americans\": \"septic tank, Yank\"."],["",""]],["multiply","'mʌltiplai","v. 繁殖, 乘, 增加\\n[计] 乘",["The only way on Earth to multiply happiness is to divide it.","Tribbles are animals that multiply quickly, as seen in a popular show."],["",""]],["pumpkin","'pʌmpkin","n. 南瓜",["Tom threw a rotten pumpkin to Mary. It exploded when she tried to catch it.","Tom doesn't know if Mary likes pumpkin pie or not."],["",""]],["imitate","'imiteit","vt. 模仿, 效法, 冒充, 仿造",["Children imitate their peers rather than their parents.","A parrot can imitate the human voice."],["比起父母，儿童更喜欢模仿自己的同龄人。","鸚鵡會模仿人的聲音。"]],["sampling","'sɑ:mpliŋ","[计] 抽样; 采样\\n[化] 取样",["This software carries out Markov Chain Monte Carlo calculations by the use of Gibbs Sampling.","Sampling must be performed in a manner that guarantees random selection."],["",""]],["configuration","kәn.figju'reiʃәn","n. 结构, 表面配置, 外形, 配置\\n[计] 配置",["The point about enclosure is that the configuration of ethnic groups must be clearly described.","It should be noted that Dole did not intend to change the configuration of the communication protocol."],["",""]],["velvet","'velvit","n. 天鹅绒\\na. 天鹅绒的",["Tom ruled Tatoeba with an iron fist in a velvet glove for many years.","The ravishing beauty queen wearing a blue velvet gown with a plunging neckline struck a pose on the red carpet."],["",""]],["notorious","nәu'tɒ:riәs","a. 声名狼藉的, 臭名昭著的, 众人皆知的",["Ms. Eichler had a notorious reputation for being austere to her students.","This junction is notorious for accidents."],["艾希勒女士对学生严厉是出了名的。","這個路口因頻繁的事故而臭名昭著。"]],["compost","'kɒmpәust","n. 混合物, 堆肥\\nvt. 施堆肥于",["Spread compost on the garden beds before planting your seedlings.","It's important to get the carbon-to-nitrogen ratio right in a compost heap."],["",""]],["cough","kɒf","n. 咳嗽\\nvi. 咳嗽\\nvt. 咳出",["Cover your mouth when you cough, sneeze, or yawn.","The cough syrup has a licorice flavoring."],["你咳嗽、打喷嚏或打哈欠的时候要捂住你的嘴。","咳嗽糖浆有股甘草的味道。"]],["stereo","'stiәriәu","n. 铅版, 立体照片\\na. 立体的, 立体感觉的",["John has to do without a stereo for the time being.","The idea of having the chanter in stereo seems very interesting to me."],["",""]],["lethal","'li:θәl","a. 致命的\\nn. 致死因子",["Improper grounding can make a microphone lethal to touch. Several singers have actually died this way.","The court condemned the man to death by lethal injection."],["",""]],["olive","'ɒliv","n. 橄榄, 橄榄树, 橄榄色, 橄榄枝\\na. 黄绿色的, 黄褐色的, 橄榄色的",["Slice the kale, and add it to a pan, with olive oil, garlic, salt and pepper, and wait until it is soft and tasty.","We'd like to order 18 tonnes of olive oil."],["將羽衣甘藍切片，放入鍋中，加入橄欖油、大蒜、鹽和胡椒，煮至軟嫩可口。","我们要订18吨橄榄油。"]],["roller","'rәulә","n. 滚筒, 滚轴, 压路机\\n[化] 滚柱; 托辊",["The shop's roller door is already shut.","I got the roller skates for nothing."],["商店的卷簾門已經關上了。","我免費得到溜冰鞋。"]],["entail","in'teil","vt. 使成为必需, 需要, 使承担, 遗传给\\nn. 限定继承",["The project will entail great expense upon the company.","If the opposition were to win, it would not entail a radical departure from current policies."],["",""]],["toast","tәust","n. 吐司, 烤面包, 干杯\\nvt. 敬酒, 烤, 使暖和\\nvi. 烤, 烘",["When he runs out of knives, Lyle butters his toast with a spoon.","You refuse a toast, only to be forced to drink a forfeit."],["沒有刀子的時候，萊爾在麵包上塗上奶油就用湯匙。","敬酒不吃吃罰酒。"]],["filmmaker","'film,meikә(r)","n. 电影制作人",["Michael Glawogger was an Austrian filmmaker who was well known for his documentary films.","South African filmmaker Carlos Carvalho died after being hit in the head by a giraffe."],["",""]],["credential","kri'denʃәl","n. 国书, 凭据, 证明书\\n[经] 凭证, 证书",["An internship is the most important credential for entering the job market.","Earning a post-secondary degree or credential is a prerequisite for 21st century jobs, and one that everyone should be able to afford."],["",""]],["swirl","swә:l","n. 漩涡, 涡动\\nvt. 使成漩涡\\nvi. 打漩, 盘绕, 眩晕",["The boy drew a swirl of colors. He said it represents the entrance to the world of dreams.","On a moonless summer night in Hawaii, krill, fish and crabs swirl through a beam of light as two researchers peer into the water above a vibrant reef."],["",""]],["broadly","'brɒ:dli","adv. 宽广地, 明白地, 无礼貌地",["Broadly speaking, dogs are more faithful than cats.","The temperatures we had all week were broadly similar."],["",""]],["smoothly","'smu:ðli","adv. 平滑地, 流畅地, 流利地",["This car is running less smoothly than it used to.","In order to move the project along smoothly, we have revised the plan several times."],["這輛車沒有以前跑得那麼順暢了。","为了顺利推进项目，我们已经修订了几次计划。"]],["ham","hæm","n. 火腿, 后腿, 笨拙演员\\na. 过火的, 做作的\\nv. 演得过火",["Carrefour's Ham offcuts are not expensive at all, but are nonetheless delicious.","I think you should eat a ham sandwich."],["家乐福的火腿剩料一点都不贵，然而却很好吃。","我认为你该吃火腿三明治。"]],["distraction","dis'trækʃәn","n. 娱乐, 分心的事物, 分心\\n[医] 注意力分散, 内脱位, 牙弓过宽",["He took advantage of my moment of distraction to run away.","Sports are supposed to be a distraction from more serious things."],["",""]],["fling","fliŋ","n. 投掷, 急冲, 嘲弄\\nvt. 投, 丢下, 抛弃, 使陷入, 挥动, 嘲笑, 扫视\\nvi. 猛冲",["Martha has been David's on-and-off fling for years.","So saying, my neck and shoulders I incline, / and round them fling a lion's tawny hide, / then lift the load."],["",""]],["livestock","'laivstɒk","n. 家畜\\n[经] 牲畜, 家畜",["A trophic cascade led to an increase in livestock attacks as predators sought out alternative sources of food.","Tighter livestock control is leading to excesses: three cattle were shot in Kuopio because of missing EU eartags."],["",""]],["basin","'beisn","n. 盆, 盆地\\n[医] 第三脑室, 骨盆",["A student was run over by a car on Basin Street.","This basin had a secret gate, of which the King alone possessed the key, and which he opened and closed at the necessary times."],["有个学生在贝辛路被车轧了。",""]],["roam","rәum","v. 漫游, 闲逛, 徜徉\\nn. 漫步, 漫游",["Those rogue rebels do not deserve to roam the Earth.","They were encouraged not to let their cattle roam freely."],["",""]],["heroic","hi'rәuik","a. 英勇的, 英雄式的, 壮丽雄伟的\\nn. 英雄诗, 史诗, 英勇行为",["Sami's last heroic act he did in his life was saving Layla.","Tom had a heroic bout of diarrhea last night, but he survived."],["",""]],["heir","єә","n. 继承人, 嗣子, 后嗣\\n[法] 继承人, 后嗣",["The rich merchant adopted the boy and made him his heir.","The queen failed to produce a male heir for the king."],["",""]],["foam","fәum","n. 泡沫, 水沫, 泡沫材料\\nvi. 起泡沫, 吐白沫\\nvt. 使起泡沫",["Poetry must be new as foam, and as old as the rock.","I foam at the mouth whenever someone mentions his name."],["",""]],["offset","'ɒ:fset","n. 抵消, 把...并列, 旁系, 支管, 用胶印法印\\nvt. 弥补, 抵消, 胶印\\nvi. 装支管\\nn. 偏移量\\n[计] 偏移量",["The conservative character of the seating furniture is offset by the brightly coloured accessories.","For the last two months, your profit has offset your expenses."],["",""]],["insure","in'ʃuә","vt. 保险, 确保\\nvi. 投保",["The wearing of agate ornaments was even believed to be a cure for insomnia and was thought to insure pleasant dreams.","I would like to insure this package."],["",""]],["affiliation","ә.fili'eiʃәn","n. 联系, 从属关系\\n[医] 父权(判定私生儿的父亲)",["There is no affiliation between our company and the owners of this logo.","We shouldn't prioritize ethnic affiliation over nationality."],["",""]],["asteroid","'æstәrɒid","n. 小行星, 海盘车\\na. 星状的",["The asteroid broke up into small pieces as it entered Earth's atmosphere.","A rogue asteroid from the Kuiper Belt is on a collision course with the Earth."],["进入地球大气层后，小行星分裂成了无数的小块。",""]],["interface","'intәfeis","n. 分界面, 接触面, 界面\\n[计] 接口, 界面",["Please select a language for the Image Viewer interface.","My friend is designing a user interface for the new operating system."],["请为Image Viewer的界面选择语言。","我的朋友正在为新的操作系统设计一个用户界面。"]],["tomb","tu:m","n. 坟墓, 死亡\\nvt. 埋葬",["What is learned in the cradle is carried to the tomb.","In this tomb from the Han dynasty, a book was found."],["幼年時學的東西，一輩子不會忘記。","這個漢墓中發現了帛書。"]],["abandoned","ә'bændәnd","a. 被抛弃的, 无约束的, 恣意放荡的",["Next to China, Switzerland is an abandoned village.","I walked without hope, already resigned to the certain fate of being abandoned forever."],["在中国的旁边，瑞士像一个荒废的乡村似的。","我毫无希望地走着，已经屈服在永远被抛弃的命运之下。"]],["bald","bɒ:ld","a. 秃头的, 光秃的, 单调的, 赤裸的\\nvi. 变秃",["I don't understand why he goes to the barber's, as he is bald.","Don't worry too much, or you'll go bald."],["我不明白為什麼他全禿還要去理髮店。","別太操心了，不然會掉頭髮的。"]],["bookstore","'bukstɒ:","n. 书店",["There is a bookstore in front of the department store.","I used to run a small bookstore in a shopping centre."],["百货商店前有个书店。","我以前經營一家在商場裡的小書店。"]],["straightforward","streit'fɒ:wәd","a. 笔直的, 率直的, 明确的, 简单的, 直接的",["People who can express their thoughts in a clear-cut way are very straightforward.","You Russians are straightforward and open hearted."],["能够直截了当地表达自己想法的人很直爽。",""]],["anticipation","æn.tisi'peiʃәn","n. 预期, 预料\\n[医] 提前出现(如遗传病)",["An exhibition was given in anticipation of the Queen's visit.","Mother took the clothes off the line in anticipation of rain."],["",""]],["don","dɒn","n. 西班牙贵族(或绅士), 先生, 阁下\\nvt. 穿上",["Rostov and Rostov-on-Don are two different cities located quite far from each other.","I broke the marriage vows that I had sworn to Don Jose, my husband."],["",""]],["frustrating","frʌ'streitiŋ","a. 令人沮丧的",["It's very frustrating to try to find your glasses when you can't see anything without glasses.","I won't be able to stay in such a frustrating job."],["",""]],["glorious","'glɒ:riәs","a. 光荣的",["Therefore, for the glorious God, you must accept each other, and accept Jesus Christ in the same way.","When the glorious sun is set, When the grass with dew is wet, Then you show your little light, Twinkle, twinkle all the night."],["所以，为了荣耀上帝，你们要彼此接纳，就像基督接纳你们一样。",""]],["honesty","'ɒnisti","n. 诚实, 公正, 正直",["Honesty was the most important factor in his success.","Parents try to impress upon their children the importance of honesty and hard work."],["誠實是他成功最重要的因素。","父母试图将诚实和工作的重要性灌输给孩子。"]],["encouragement","in'kʌridʒmәnt","n. 鼓励, 激励, 奖励\\n[法] 怂恿, 煽动, 助长",["Without your encouragement, I would have given up this plan.","Without your encouragement, I should have given up the plan."],["",""]],["crisp","krisp","a. 脆的, 新鲜的, 活泼的\\nv. (使)烘脆, (使)拳曲, (使)起皱\\nn. 松脆物",["The air was fresh and crisp, and little smoke-blue mists curled through the valleys and floated off from the hills.","A crisp wind blew up over the sand dunes from the sea."],["",""]],["selective","si'lektiv","a. 选择的, 选择性的\\n[经] 选择的, 选择性的",["The eyes themselves can become selective, ignoring part of what is there, and the brain sometimes insists on seeing things that don't exist at all.","Natural selection has similarities to selective breeding, but it happens by itself and over a much longer period of time."],["视觉本身具有选择性，既有看不到实际存在一些东西的情况，也有大脑判断看到了实际完全不存在东西这样的情况。",""]],["meditation",".medi'teiʃәn","n. 沉思, 冥想",["Flies and mosquitoes interfered with his meditation.","For some people, meditation is more effective than taking tranquilisers."],["蒼蠅和蚊子干擾了他的冥想。",""]],["protester","","n. 抗议者, 持异议者, 拒付者\\n[经] 反对者",["The police officer beat the protester with her nightstick.","The protester was violently assaulted."],["",""]],["fearful","'fiәful","a. 可怕的, 恐怕的, 担心的",["The fearful noise astonished anyone coming for the first time.","To make matters worse, there were signs of a fearful storm."],["",""]],["sausage","'sɒsidʒ","n. 香肠, 腊肠",["\"Dachshund sausage\" was a good name for the frankfurter.","The next day at the newspaper office he drew a bun which contained a dachshund inside - not a dachshund sausage, but a dachshund."],["",""]],["overturn",".әuvә'tә:n","n. 倾覆, 破灭, 革命\\nvt. 推翻, 颠倒\\nvi. 翻倒",["Sami launched a campaign to overturn his conviction.","The attempts to overturn the ordinance still need to be passed by Congress."],["",""]],["deprive","di'praiv","vt. 剥夺, 使丧失\\n[法] 剥夺, 剥夺, 夺去",["This law will deprive us of our basic rights.","No one can deprive of your human rights."],["这项法律会剥夺我们的基本权利。","沒有人能剝奪你的人權。"]],["compact","kәm'pækt","a. 紧凑的, 紧密的, 简洁的\\nvt. 使紧密结合, 压缩\\nvi. 变坚实",["Compact discs have entirely taken the place of phonograph records.","I want a compact car with an air conditioner."],["CD已经完全取代了胶木唱片。","我想要一輛有空調的小型車。"]],["transcript","'trænskript","n. 抄本, 副本, 成绩单\\n[法] 法院文本, 官方记录, 记录的副本",["A transcript is an official record of the courses you took and grades you received in high school, college or graduate school.","When the call is finished, a senior director in the Situation Room reviews the notes and transcript."],["",""]],["beautifully","'bju:tifuli","adv. 美好地, 漂亮地",["Rocks are beautifully arranged in the Japanese-style garden.","Emi danced the most beautifully of the three girls."],["石頭被美麗得放置在日式庭園裡。","Emi 是三個女孩中跳得最漂亮的。"]],["standpoint","'stændpɒint","n. 立场, 观点",["From this standpoint history can be divided into two main epochs.","From the standpoint of ecology, Antarctica should be reserved solely for research, not for tourism or for commercial exploration."],["",""]],["empower","im'pauә","vt. 授予权力, 允许, 使能够\\n[法] 授权, 准许, 转委",["Fadil started a non-profit organization to empower teen moms.","We should enable children to empower themselves. We can't do it for them."],["",""]],["mainland","'meinlәnd","n. 大陆, 本土\\n[法] 大陆",["Tomorrow, I am coming back from Hong Kong to the mainland.","Per capita income is about two-thirds that of the US mainland."],["明天我要從香港去趟內地。",""]],["flourish","'flʌriʃ","vi. 繁荣, 茂盛, 活跃, 手舞足蹈\\nvt. 挥舞, 夸耀\\nn. 挥舞, 炫耀, 茂盛, 兴旺, 华丽词藻",["There, in the slum's alleys and byways, hundreds of tiny businesses flourish.","For how long did the Maya culture flourish?"],["","玛雅文明繁荣了多久？"]],["tug","tʌg","n. 用力拉, 拖曳, 苦干, 挣扎, 绳索\\nv. 用力拉",["Ziri enjoyed the playful tug of the breeze at his cloak.","Parliamentary activity has become a political tug of war between the ruling and opposition parties over the issue."],["",""]],["shiver","'ʃivә","vi. 颤抖, 哆嗦, 被打碎\\nvt. 使迎风飘动, 粉碎\\nn. 战栗, 碎块",["The mere thought of a snake makes me shiver.","\"The castle is haunted,\" he said with a shiver."],["一想到蛇就發顫。","他邊顫抖邊說：「那座城堡有鬼。」"]],["lobster","'lɒbstә","n. 龙虾",["The sight of fresh lobster gave me an appetite.","Seeing the fresh lobster made me hungry."],["看见新鲜龙虾，我有了食欲。","看见新鲜龙虾，我有了食欲。"]],["solidarity",".sɒli'dæriti","n. 团结, 团结一致, 共同一致\\n[法] 团结, 共同责任",["What can we do to strengthen the movement of solidarity with the Palestinian people?","Make solidarity and equal rights the cornerstone of public policy."],["我們能做些什麼來加強聲援巴勒斯坦人民的運動？",""]],["discharge","dis'tʃɑ:dʒ","vt. 卸下, 放出, 解雇, 拔染, 履行, 放电\\nvi. 卸货, 流出\\nn. 卸货, 流出, 放电",["The crowd obstructed the police in the discharge of their duties.","Dr. Mohammed-Abdi noticed a mild discharge from the umbilicus and ordered further tests."],["群众妨碍了警员执行任务。",""]],["turning","'tә:niŋ","n. 旋转, 转弯处, 车削工作\\n[化] 车削",["River Suzhou is Shanghai's \"mother river\"; twisting and turning, it stretches across and flows through the city center.","By turning the page, we can dismiss the characters in a book without fear of hurting their feelings."],["苏州河是上海的母亲河，弯弯曲曲横跨流过市中心。","书页翻动之间，我们可以对书中的人物不予理会而不伤及他们的情感。"]],["detection","di'tekʃәn","n. 发现, 察觉, 探测\\n[计] 检波; 检测",["I'm testing whether the language detection works again.","Early detection is the key to achieving favourable outcomes in the treatment of disease."],["",""]],["saddle","'sædl","n. 鞍, 马鞍, 车座, 鞍状物\\nvt. 装以马鞍, 使负担\\nvi. 跨上马鞍",["Sami demonstrated to the tourists how to saddle a camel.","Any saddle may be adjusted to be comfortable, but saddles seldom remain comfortable after being adjusted."],["",""]],["artwork","'ɑ:twә:k","n. 插图, 艺术作品\\n[计] 原图",["In many cases, the image that comes to mind when you listen to music is that of the CD's artwork.","This artwork excited much controversy in the world of art."],["聽歌時腦海裏浮起的圖像，許多時候都是唱片的封面。",""]],["lasting","'lɑ:stiŋ","a. 永久的, 永恒的, 持久的\\nn. 厚实斜纹织物",["No hobby is as cheap as reading, nor provides such long lasting enjoyment.","After countless burials of the hatchet, we always dig it up again. There doesn't seem to be any sign of an ever-lasting peace."],["没有任何娱乐像阅读这般廉价，也没有任何愉悦像阅读这般持久。",""]],["occurrence","ә'kʌrәns","n. 发生, 事件, 出现\\n[医] 发生",["Both victory and defeat are but an everyday occurrence to a soldier.","Having their classroom time extended is a very common occurrence for students."],["胜败是兵家常事。","拖堂情况对于学生们而言十分常见。"]],["freeman","'fri:mәn","n. 自由民, 公民, 正会员\\n[法] 自由民, 公民, 有公民权的人",["The right man in the wrong place can make all the difference in the world. So wake up Mister Freeman. Wake up and smell the ashes.","Daniel's guest introduced himself as Morgan Freeman."],["",""]],["partisan","'pɑ:tizn","n. 党羽, 虔诚信徒, 同党, 游击队员\\na. 党派的, 偏袒的, 效忠的, 献身的, 盲目推崇的",["Partisan politics is getting in the way of necessary finance reform.","This kind of partisan skulduggery has no place in a government agency."],["",""]],["abundant","ә'bʌndәnt","a. 丰富的, 充分的, 大量的",["The United States is abundant in natural resources.","There is an abundant supply of foodstuffs."],["美国的自然资源很丰富。","糧食供應十分充足。"]],["prone","prәun","a. 俯伏的, 面向下的, 有...倾向的\\n[医] 旋前的, 伏的, 俯的",["The weak-willed are prone to go to the dogs; the strong-willed turn failure into success.","According to a study, big women are more prone to have twins."],["",""]],["renewed","ri'nju:d","a. 复兴的；更新的；重建的",["She renewed the soil in the flower pot.","When I got my driver's license renewed, I had to decide if I wanted to be an organ donor."],["她更新了花盆裡的土。",""]],["hose","hәuz","n. 水管, 橡皮软管, 长统袜\\nvt. 用水管浇",["After he had watered the garden, he coiled the hose and put it into the shed.","Tom tried drinking from a garden hose while he was out on a run, and then he started feeling sick."],["",""]],["aggressively","","adv. (贬)侵略, 侵犯, 寻衅, (褒)敢作敢为, 有进取心, (武器)攻击性, 过分, 放肆",["One could feel that Mr. Tom Jackson was aggressively anti-American.","She could have resisted more aggressively if she'd wanted to."],["",""]],["formidable","'fɒ:midәbl","a. 巨大的, 优秀的, 可怕的, 艰难的",["The pursuit of European history is a formidable task.","All those tricks he's got up his sleeve make him a formidable client."],["",""]],["liberation",".libә'reiʃәn","n. 释放, 解放\\n[化] 发出; 释放; 放出",["Women's Liberation is a broad-based but informal popular movement.","She is said to be a leader in the women's liberation movement."],["",""]],["hammer","'hæmә","n. 锤, 铁锤, 钉锤\\nvt. 锤打, 敲打, 钉\\nvi. 连续锤打\\n[计] 锤头",["To the man who only has a hammer in the toolkit, every problem looks like a nail.","This is a hammer. It's not mine; I borrowed it from a friend."],["对工具箱里只有一把榔头的人来说，所有的问题都像钉子。","这是锤子。不是我的，是向一个朋友借的。"]],["confusing","","a. 令人困惑的；混淆的；混乱的",["This is an example of confusing two things that have a common cause with one thing that causes another.","You're confusing me with someone else."],["这显然是将属并列关系的两件事误解成为因果关系了。","你認錯人了。"]],["exclusion","ik'sklu:ʒәn","n. 排除, 除外, 逐出\\n[医] 排除, 除外, 分离术",["Demand the exclusion of the country from the U. N.","His work occupies his mind to the exclusion of all else."],["",""]],["burial","'beriәl","n. 埋葬, 葬礼\\n[法] 埋葬, 葬礼",["The Takamatsuzuka burial mound is located in Asukamura, Nara prefecture.","The archaeologists needed to relocate the burial grounds before the pipeline could be built."],["",""]],["mobilize","'mәubilaiz","vt. 动员, 调动, 使流通\\nvi. 动员",["We must mobilize our forces quickly if we wish to succeed.","Sami was working non-stop to mobilize a search team."],["",""]],["vigorous","'vigәrәs","a. 精力充沛的, 元气旺盛的, 茁壮的, 有力的",["No matter how vigorous the lie, you cannot escape the truth.","The vigorous man is engaged in diverse activities."],["",""]],["unwilling",".ʌn'wiliŋ","a. 不愿意的, 勉强的\\n[法] 不愿意的, 勉强的, 不服从的",["I was unwilling to agree to the proposal, but it seemed that I had no choice.","It is not that I am unwilling, but that I have no time."],["",""]],["lazy","'leizi","a. 懒惰的, 怠惰的, 缓慢的\\nvi. 懒散",["The quick brown fox did not jump over the lazy dog.","The quick brown fox didn't jump over the lazy dog."],["身手矯健的棕狐狸沒有躍過懶洋洋的狗。","身手矯健的棕狐狸沒有躍過懶洋洋的狗。"]],["passport","'pæspɒ:t","n. 护照, 手段, 通行证\\n[法] 通行证, 护照",["When you're beginning to look like the photo in your passport, you should go on a holiday.","A passport is something you cannot do without when you go to a foreign country."],["当我们开始像自己护照上的照片时，我们该去度假了。","去外國旅行不能不帶護照。"]],["packet","'pækit","n. 小包, 一批信件, 大量, 信息包\\nvt. 打包, 装进小包\\n[计] 分组, 分组报文, 数据分组",["This book is the literary equivalent of Haribo sweets: you only want to eat one, but end up devouring the whole packet.","He bought a bread, a packet of butter and two canned sardines packed in oil."],["",""]],["fond","fɒnd","a. 喜欢的, 宠爱的, 温柔的",["Generally speaking, Americans are very fond of coffee.","From childhood I was fond of reading, and all the little money that ever came into my hands was laid out in books."],["美國人一般都很喜歡喝咖啡。","從小開始我就很喜歡讀書，那時有的錢雖然不多，但也都全花在書本上。"]],["questionable","'kwestʃәnәbl","a. 可疑的\\n[法] 可疑的, 有问题的, 不可靠的",["It is questionable whether this data can be relied on.","There are many questionable points in this ledger."],["這些資料未必可靠。",""]],["surplus","'sә:plәs","n. 剩余, 过剩, 盈余\\na. 过剩的, 剩余的",["Our surplus has swelled by nearly ten percent in this quarter.","Despite a large surplus in merchandise trade, the current account surplus is not so big due to a deficit in invisible trade."],["我們公司今季的赤字上漲了差不多一成。",""]],["rep","rep","n. 棱纹平布, 浪荡子, 名声\\n[化] 物理伦琴当量",["I had to wait 20 minutes on the phone before reaching the customer service rep."],["我不得不在電話裡等了 20 分鐘才聯繫到客服代表。"]],["poise","pɒiz","n. 平衡, 均衡, 姿势, 镇静, 安静, 砝码\\nvt. 使平衡, 使悬着, 保持...姿势\\nvi. 平衡, 悬着, 准备好",["He always comes through dangerous situations with an unperturbed poise.","The way Caifeng carries themselves with poise and confidence further enhances her Asian beauty."],["",""]],["marital","'mæritәl","a. 丈夫的, 婚姻的, 夫妇间的\\n[医] 婚姻的",["Let's use our experiences to nurture the sense needed to make marital relations go well.","Day after day the tabloids titillated the public with lurid details about the president's marital infidelity."],["",""]],["vicious","'viʃәs","a. 邪恶的, 堕落的, 品性不端的, 恶毒的, 恶性的, 有错误的\\n[医] 缺点的, 恶的",["The answer leads us to a vicious circle.","Tom launched a vicious personal attack against Mary."],["回答把我们带入了一个恶性循环。",""]],["photographic",".fәutә'græfik","a. 照相的, 摄影用的, 详细记录的, 逼真的, 酷似的",["I quietly take out my camera, so as not to be noticed by my photographic subject, and peek through the finder.","The man standing over there next to the bookcase has a photographic memory."],["",""]],["surroundings","sә'rajndiŋz","n. 环境, 周围的事物\\n[化] 环境",["He quickly accustomed himself to his new surroundings.","The rescuers searched the surroundings in hopes of finding the child."],["他很快就适应了新环境。","援救人员为了找到孩子，仔细搜索了那个区域。"]],["victorian","vik'tɔ:riәn","a. 英国维多利亚女王时代的, 笃信宗教的, 讲究体面的\\nn. 维多利亚女王时代的英国人",["The apartment was furnished in the Victorian style.","This house is a fabulous example of Victorian Gothic architecture."],["",""]],["homemade","'hәum'meid","a. 自制的, 国产的",["That old man had been making homemade whiskey for fifty years.","I think Tom's homemade cookies are better than the ones Mary makes."],["",""]],["drape","dreip","n. 布帘, 褶皱\\nvt. 用布帘覆盖, 披上\\nvi. 成褶皱状",["You can always drape your jacket over your chair if you need a place to put it.","The wealthy display their dazzling luxury, the poor drape themselves proudly in their rags."],["",""]],["evangelical",",i:væn'dʒelikәl","a. 福音派教会的\\nn. 福音派信徒",["Sami was an evangelical missionary who converted to Islam.","The evangelical community holds firm beliefs in the authority of Scripture."],["",""]],["spokeswoman","'spәuks,wumәn","n. 女发言人, 女代言人",["State police spokeswoman Janet Welp says the truck wound up crashing into a bridge railing along Interstate 30.","The spokeswoman for the International Organization for Migration says the migrants are living under very flimsy, open structures."],["",""]],["wedge","wedʒ","n. 楔子, 楔形物, 起因, 导致分裂的东西\\nvt. 楔住, 挤进, 楔入\\nvi. 楔入, 挤进",["The screw, the lever, the wedge, the pulley, etc. are called simple machines.","Daniel tried to drive a wedge between Amanda and Walid."],["",""]],["coffin","'kɒfin","n. 棺材, 灵柩\\nvt. 把...装进棺材",["The poor sales during that Holiday season served as the final nail in the coffin for Boar Corporation.","He thought his piano would make a good coffin for him."],["那個假期銷售業績不佳，為博爾公司敲下了最後一根棺材釘。",""]],["server","'sә:vә","n. 服伺者, 上菜用具, 发球员\\nn. 服务器\\n[计] 服务器, 服务器启动程序, 服务台程序",["As a result of the server breakdown, total PV of yesterday dropped by 30% compared with normal.","This process must be stopped immediately, otherwise the server will break down."],["由于服务器故障，昨天的总PV与正常相比下降了30%。","这个进程必须立即停止，否则服务器会故障。"]],["sandy","'sændi","a. 沙的, 沙地的, 多沙的",["Barrier islands are long, sandy islands near the coast.","Lady Gaga gave $1 million to the Red Cross to help the victims of Hurricane Sandy."],["",""]],["tense","tens","a. 紧张的, 拉紧的\\nv. (使)紧张, (使)拉紧\\nn. 时态",["Recently, this area's international relations have become very tense.","The situation seemed very tense and dangerous."],["最近這個區域的國際形勢很緊張。","形势似乎非常紧张严峻。"]],["archaeologist",".ɑ:ki'ɒlәdʒist","n. 考古学家",["Tom is an archaeologist leading the excavations near Rome.","You sound like you don't want to be an archaeologist."],["湯姆是位考古學家，在領導羅馬附近的發掘項目。",""]],["disturbance","dis'tә:bәns","n. 扰乱, 不安, 忧虑\\n[化] 扰动; 干扰; 失调",["As wind blows across the surface of the ocean or a lake, the continual disturbance creates a wave crest.","Sami called the police on Layla for public disturbance."],["",""]],["comparative","kәm'pærәtiv","a. 比较的, 相对的\\nn. 对手",["I study comparative religion in the arts faculty of the University of Turku.","Once divorced from key questions of national culture and identity, comparative literature loses its way."],["我在图尔库大学文化系学习宗教比较学。",""]],["pharmaceutical",",fɑ:mә'sju:tikәl","a. 药学的, 制药的, 药用的, 药物的, 药剂师的, 药师的\\nn. 药品, 成药, 药剂",["The pharmaceutical company is looking for the Elixir of Life to stop the ageing process.","Pharmaceutical companies hide information from the public about the safety of the medications they sell."],["",""]],["leisure","'li:ʒә","n. 空闲, 闲暇, 悠闲\\na. 空闲的, 有闲的",["For one thing, I've no money, and for another, I've no leisure.","I often spend my leisure time listening to the radio."],["我一沒錢，二沒時間。","我常常在我的闲暇时候听广播。"]],["prototype","'prәutәtaip","n. 原型\\n[计] 样机; 原型",["Vling, my prototype of a tonal Oriental-like artificial language, is still indeed just a prototype. Its symbolic colour is orange.","The prototype for the hero of the book was the son of the writer."],["",""]],["vegetation",".vedʒi'teiʃәn","n. 植物\\n[医] 贽生物, 贽疣, 增殖体; 生长, 增殖",["This land is covered by a verdant carpet of lush vegetation.","I propose to investigate the vegetation of the island in great detail."],["",""]],["magnet","'mægnit","n. 磁铁, 有吸引力之人, 有吸引力之物\\n[化] 磁体",["In other words, the field of the magnet is near the pigeon's head.","Tom bought a squirrel magnet and put it on the fridge."],["",""]],["emit","i'mit","vt. 发出, 放射, 发表(意见等), 散发, 发行\\n[化] 放射",["Some cruise ships emit as much particulate matter as 1m cars.","Carbon arc lamps emit a spectrum similar to sunlight."],["",""]],["acquaintance","ә'kweintәns","n. 认识, 相识者",["Yesterday I saw an old acquaintance whom I hadn't seen in ten years.","I have some acquaintance with chemistry."],["我昨天见了一个十年没见的熟人。","我對化學略懂一二。"]],["unusually","ʌn'ju:ʒәli","adv. 不寻常地, 异乎寻常地, (非正式)非常",["Unusually low temperatures account for the poor rice crop this year.","Trang gave an unusually expensive Christmas gift to Sysko."],["",""]],["contempt","kәn'tempt","n. 轻视, 轻蔑\\n[法] 藐视, 侮辱, 轻视",["The bold man glanced at the gangster with hatred and contempt.","I feel nothing but contempt for such dishonest behavior."],["",""]],["lender","'lendә","n. 出借人, 贷方\\n[经] 出借者, 贷方, 贷款人",["Neither a borrower nor a lender be; / For loan oft loses both itself and friend, / And borrowing dulls the edge of husbandry.","Neither a borrower nor a lender be: For loan oft loses both itself and friend; And borrowing dulls the edge of husbandry."],["",""]],["seasonal","'si:znәl","a. 季节的, 依照季节的, 周期性的\\n[经] 季节性的, 季节的",["A geographic understanding of climate requires knowledge of seasonal as well as annual precipitation patterns.","The decline isn't so sharp after seasonal adjustment."],["",""]],["bastard","'bæstәd","n. 私生子, 劣货\\na. 私生的, 杂种的, 不合标准的",["If you think that I'm still going to help a bastard like you, then you couldn't be any further away from the truth.","If I find him, I'll kill the bastard."],["如果你认为我还会帮你这样的混蛋，那你大错特错了。","我如果能找到他，我要殺了那個混蛋。"]],["efficacy","'efikәsi","n. 功效, 效力\\n[医] 效能, 功效, 效验",["Self-efficacy is the measure of the belief in one's own ability to complete tasks and reach goals.","The aim of this study was to evaluate the efficacy of acupuncture in the treatment of SAR through a randomized controlled trail."],["",""]],["anthropologist",".ænθrә'pɒlәdʒist","n. 人类学家",["To my surprise, the anthropologist was accused of murder.","The anthropologist says odd customs do persist in the region."],["",""]],["desired","di'zaiәd","a. 渴望的；想得到的",["Your idea leaves nothing to be desired.","His composition leaves nothing to be desired."],["你的想法简直无可挑剔。","他的文章寫得完美無瑕。"]],["zoo","zu:","n. 动物园",["If the weather had been nice yesterday, we would have gone to the zoo.","My family went to the zoo to see pandas last Sunday."],["昨天要視天氣好的話，我們就會去動物園了。","上星期天我的家庭去了动物园看熊猫。"]],["module","'mɒdju:l","n. 组件, 模数\\n[计] 模块",["A module is said to be semisimple if it is the sum of simple submodules.","With this module you can make the Enter key generate an event."],["",""]],["dominance","'dɔminәns","n. 优势, 显性, 统治, 控制, 支配\\n[计] 控制, 扰势",["The dominance of English kills the European debate.","The dominance of English is killing the European dialogue."],["",""]],["ample","'æmpl","a. 大量的, 充足的, 丰富的",["We have ample time to catch our train.","If a government is to be prudent its taxes must produce ample revenues without discouraging enterprise."],["我们有充裕的时间赶上火车。",""]],["theorist","'θi:әrist","n. 理论家, 理论工作者",["As a conspiracy theorist, Tom is always in a certain amount of danger.","When one conspiracy theorist challenged Buzz Aldrin and called him a liar, Aldrin punched him in the face."],["",""]],["disadvantage",".disәd'vɑ:ntidʒ","n. 缺点, 不利, 坏处",["The comparison between the two was to his disadvantage.","The advantage of freelancing is that you can divide your time freely. The disadvantage is that you actually have to work around the clock."],["两相比较，他那边的形势更不利一些。","自由职业的优点是，人们可以自由的分配他们的工作时间。它的缺点是，人们实际上必须24小时不间断的工作。"]],["stripe","straip","n. 斑纹, 条纹\\n[医] 纹, 条纹",["Life is like a zebra; white stripe, black stripe, and the ass at the end.","Yellow or stripe rust has been in the region for many years but was contained by using certain resistant crops."],["",""]],["potent","'pәutnt","a. 有力的, 有说服力的, 有效的\\n[医] 有力的, 有性交能力的",["It was a cask of our old heather ale which they had broached, and that is potent, if to the unwary it seems harmless enough.","Violent extremists have exploited these tensions in a small but potent minority of Muslims."],["",""]],["foremost","'fәumәust","a. 最初的, 最重要的\\nadv. 在最前",["Let me first and foremost ask you a few questions, and then we'll fix a date for the installation.","Customer service is one of our foremost priorities."],["",""]],["exclaim","iks'kleim","v. 大叫, 呼喊, 大声叫",["Whenever Tom did poorly, his father would exclaim that it was an embarrassment to the family.","But I heard him exclaim, ere he drove out of sight \"Happy Christmas to all, and to all a good-night.\""],["",""]],["tee","ti:","n. T字形, T字形之物, 发球区, 球座, 目标\\nvt. 搁在球座上\\na. T字形的",["That looks like the kind of guy who'd buy me lots of designer goods tee-hee-hee.","He wasn't allowed into the restaurant because his tee shirt had a swear word on it."],["",""]],["reported","ri'pɔ:tid","a. 报告的；据报道的",["This teacher always drags his class time, taking up the students' rest time, later he got reported, it felt amazing.","Europe is now reported to be entirely free of new cases of this disease."],["这个老师总是拖堂，占用同学们课间休息的时间，后来他被举报了，真过瘾啊。",""]],["dentist","'dentist","n. 牙科医生\\n[医] 牙医师",["It's best to go to the dentist at regular intervals.","She goes to the dentist regularly, so she seldom gets toothache."],["最好定期去看牙医。","她定期去看牙医，所以她很少牙痛。"]],["crossing","'krɒsiŋ","n. 横越, 横渡, 交叉点, 渡口\\n[经] 划线",["He was almost hit by a car while crossing the street.","In crossing the street, you must watch out for cars."],["他過馬路時差點被車撞。","過馬路的時候, 你必須小心車輛。"]],["den","den","n. 兽穴, 洞穴\\n[法] 匪巢, 贼窝",["One may only catch the tiger cub by entering the tiger's den.","The IKEA sectional they chose for the den provided seating and extra storage."],["不入虎穴，焉得虎子。",""]],["sorrow","'sɒrәu","n. 悲伤, 哀惜, 不幸\\nvi. 悲伤, 懊悔, 遗憾",["When you are cheerful, books can increase your happiness; when you are sad, books can lessen your sorrow.","If you are patient in one moment of anger, you will escape a hundred days of sorrow."],["开心时，书可以给你增加快乐；忧伤时，书可以给你减少哀愁。","忍一時,風平浪靜. 讓一步, 海闊天空."]],["oyster","'ɒistә","n. 牡蛎, 蚝, 沉默者",["Should we order the steamed perch or the beef with oyster sauce?","Gabor brought Martha an oyster with a pearl as a gift."],["叫个清蒸鲈鱼好呢，还是蚝油牛肉好？",""]],["adverse","'ædvә:s","a. 不利的, 敌对的, 相反的, 逆的\\n[法] 相反的, 敌对的, 逆的",["It has been shown in most studies on this subject that intervention of the legislature had adverse effects.","Some of the adverse effects of testosterone treatment may be popping up now."],["",""]],["provincial","prә'vinʃәl","n. 外地人, 粗野的人\\na. 省的, 外地的, 偏狭的",["Hangzhou is the provincial capital of Zhejiang Province.","Fyodor had his own campsite in the provincial park."],["杭州是浙江省的省会。",""]],["conditioning","kәn'diʃәniŋ","n. 调节, 条件作用, 整修\\n[计] 调节; 调整",["It means a huge increase in the use of air conditioning which uses energy, which costs money and creates pollution.","I can't survive without air conditioning in the summer."],["这意味着对利用能源、耗费资金和制造污染的空调的使用有了大幅增长。","我夏天没有空调会死。"]],["scholarly","'skɔlәli","a. 学者派头的, 学者风度的, 有学问的, 博学的, 好学的",["Translation is a scholarly discipline.","This is likely the first time that these collectives, and the Latinx zines movement, have received scholarly investigation."],["翻译是一门学问。",""]],["improving","im'pru:viŋ","a. 有启发的；有教育意义的",["Creating creativity itself is improving creativity.","I'll keep the tips you shared for improving my presentation skills."],["創新創新本身就提升了創新。","你對提升我演講能力的建議，我會記下來。"]],["exaggerate","ig'zædʒәreit","v. 夸大, 夸张",["It seems to me that she has a tendency to exaggerate.","It is impossible to exaggerate the importance of education."],["在我看來，她有一種誇張的傾向。",""]],["whisk","hwisk","n. 掸, 扫帚, 毛掸子, 搅拌器, 拂\\nvt. 扫, 拂, 挥动, 迅速移动, 搅拌\\nvi. 飞奔",["Crack two eggs into a bowl, then whisk them together with some milk.","If someone could whisk me to another century in time, I'd leap at the chance."],["",""]],["pastry","'peistri","n. 油酥点心, 面粉糕饼",["From childhood I dreamed of being a pastry cook.","Put the cooled, cooked apple mixture into the pastry case."],["我从小就梦想着做一名糕点师。",""]],["decisive","di'saisiv","a. 决定性的, 坚定的, 果断的",["None of these considerations are decisive.","Today's game will be a crucial battle; the result will be decisive."],["这些考虑没有一项是决定性的。",""]],["reactor","ri'æktә","n. 反应者, 反应器, 反应堆, 电抗器\\n[化] 反应釜; 反应锅",["The atomic reactor generates enormous amounts of thermal energy.","Due to the catastrophe caused by the huge tsunami, damage was sustained by the nuclear reactor as well as explosions at the nuclear power plant."],["原子反应堆发出大量的热能。","由于特大海啸的灾害，核能融炉遭受损害，造成了原子能发电站爆炸。"]],["seventeen","sevn'ti:n","num. 十七, 十七个",["A boy of seventeen is often as tall as his father.","She got married at the age of seventeen."],["十七歲的男孩常常長得和他父親一樣高。","她十七岁结婚。"]],["visually","'vizjjәli","adv. 看, 视力, 视觉, 可见, 凭视力, 看到, 看得见, 光学, 形象化, 栩栩如生",["Bangladesh's visually impaired cricketers plays under the captaincy of Hafizur Rahman Bullet.","It was proposed that the term \"blind person\" be replaced with the term \"visually impaired person\"."],["",""]],["volcano","vɒl'keinәu","n. 火山",["The volcano erupted suddenly, killing many people.","The active volcano erupts at regular intervals."],["火山突然喷发，造成了多人死亡。","活火山会定期爆发。"]],["jealous","'dʒelәs","a. 嫉妒的, 羡慕的, 留心的, 戒备的",["Obviously, they are jealous of his wealth and status.","\"I've found a way to make him really jealous.\" \"Oh, do tell!\""],["他们很明显在嫉妒他的财富和地位。","「我已經找到令他嫉妒的方法了。」「喔，說吧！」"]],["molecular","mә'lekjulә","a. 分子的, 由分子组成的\\n[医] 分子的",["We will study the underlying molecular occurrences of fertilization.","Our genetic material is being constantly invaded by small egocentric molecular parasites."],["",""]],["greeting","'gri:tiŋ","n. 祝贺, 问候",["I bow to the boss in greeting, and he returns my bow with a nod.","Gentlemen, allow me to say a few words in greeting."],["",""]],["satisfying","'sætisfaiiŋ","a. 满意的, 充分的, 足可相信的",["Sami has been satisfying his sexual urges with teenagers online.","The food the restaurant offered us was so cold and salty that it was far from satisfying."],["",""]],["arch","ɑ:tʃ","n. 拱门, 拱形, 足弓\\nvt. 使成弓形\\nvi. 拱起, 成弓形\\na. 主要的, 调皮的, 傲慢无礼的, 狡猾的",["There are traces of Romanesque style at the west gate of the cathedral, such as a semi-circular arch.","The strangest thing is that he saved his arch enemy from an unavoidable death."],["",""]],["pasture","'pæstʃә","n. 牧场, 草地, 牧草\\nvt. 放牧\\nvi. 吃草",["The pasture has an area of 10 acres.","The day broke, and Daphnis leaped from his bed with delight, and drove his goats to pasture with boisterous eagerness."],["牧场的面积有10英亩。",""]],["rebellion","ri'beljәn","n. 谋反, 叛乱, 反抗\\n[法] 造反, 反叛, 叛乱",["The ascendancy of monarchs is what keeps their subjects from rebellion.","The speaker tried to incite the people to rebellion."],["",""]],["constituency","kәn'stitjuәnsi","n. 选民, 顾客, 读者\\n[法] 选区, 全体选民, 选区内的选民",["It should be added that his remarks had no direct influence on the constituency.","The strong sentiments the candidate voiced only served to polarize his constituency."],["",""]],["chuckle","'tʃʌkl","n. 咯咯的笑声, 轻笑\\nvi. 咯咯的笑, 咕咕叫",["When she saw the lengths he'd gone to to get all dressed up, she couldn't help letting a brief chuckle escape.","My hovercraft is full of jokes that have been overused to the point where only a small chuckle at best can be elicited from them."],["",""]],["swamp","swɒmp","n. 沼泽, 进退两难的困境\\nvt. 淹没, 击溃, 清除, 使陷于沼泽\\nvi. 陷于沼泽, 淹没",["He lives alone in a little cottage in the swamp.","Founding your life on illusions is like building a house on a swamp."],["他獨自一人住在沼澤地裡的一棟小屋裡。",""]],["dash","dæʃ","n. 冲撞, 破折号, 短跑\\nvi. 猛冲, 冲撞\\nvt. 泼溅, 使猛撞, 搀和, 使破灭, 使沮丧",["Don't dash off a sloppily written report filled with mistakes.","After the rain had let up a bit, we made a dash for the car."],["",""]],["awesome","'ɒ:sәm","a. 引起敬畏的, 可怕的",["We're quite insignificant, but awesome nevertheless.","Whenever I'm sad, I stop being sad and start being awesome instead."],["",""]],["lesbian","'lezbiәn","a. 女同性恋的\\nn. 女同性恋者",["Adoption for gay and lesbian parents remains a hotly contested issue in the United States.","I want you to get this lesbian thing out of your system."],["",""]],["evidently","'evidәntli","adv. 明显地, 根据现有证据来看",["Evidently, it's going to rain tomorrow.","He was evidently surprised when he came across me."],["明天肯定会下雨。",""]],["standardized","'stændә,daizd","a. 标准化的；标准的；定型的",["This factory uses an integrated manufacturing system standardized from parts on through to finished products.","In Algeria, the Kabyle dialect has emerged as a fundamental component in the creation of a standardized Berber language."],["",""]],["steering","'stiәriŋ","n. 掌舵, 操纵, 指导",["Japanese cars' steering wheels are on the right.","British and Japanese cars have steering wheels on the right side."],["日本車的方向盤在右邊。",""]],["deliberate","di'libәrәt","a. 深思熟虑的, 故意的, 从容的\\nv. 仔细考虑",["Every step in the experiment was deliberate.","Nobody ever saw a dog make a fair and deliberate exchange of one bone for another with another dog."],["该实验的每一步都是经过深思熟虑的。",""]],["fictional","'fikʃәnl","a. 虚构的, 编造的, 小说式的\\n[法] 拟制的, 假定的, 虚构的",["That ugly butcher resembles that fictional monster.","The fictional town of Middlemarch in George Eliot's novel of the same name is based on Coventry."],["",""]],["bait","beit","n. 饵\\nvt. 以饵引诱, 欺负\\nvi. 中途休息",["Before he went fishing, he dug up some worms for bait.","If you want to stay a member of this club, you have to fish or cut bait."],["出去釣魚前，他挖出一些蟲子當餌。",""]],["usage","'ju:sidʒ","n. 用法, 使用, 习惯, 惯用法, 习惯法\\n[经] 使用情况, 使用用途, 惯例",["The proliferation of Internet usage has given birth to a new generation of young people.","To give a definition of a word is more difficult than to give an illustration of its usage."],["互联网的广泛应用使新一代的年轻人诞生了。","要為一個字下定義比為字的用法舉例更困難。"]],["novelist","'nɒvәlist","n. 小说家",["I have a friend whose father is a famous novelist.","My goal in life is to be a novelist."],["我有一位朋友，他的父親是著名小說家。","我的终生目标是成为一名作家。"]],["sore","sɒ:","a. 悲伤的, 痛的, 引起痛苦的\\nn. 痛处, 溃疡, 疮",["Mother applied the medicine to the sore on my knee.","I have a very sore arm where you hit me."],["母親把藥膏塗在了我膝蓋的傷口上。","你打在我手臂上的地方超级痛。"]],["subscale","'sʌb,skeil","内部[扩散]氧化物",["Each subscale of the survey measures a different attitude."],["每個分量表衡量一種不同的態度。"]],["reef","ri:f","n. 暗礁, 礁, 缩帆\\nv. 缩(帆)",["The coral reef is the region's prime attraction.","Acidification of the ocean will, in time, threaten the very existence of the Great Barrier Reef."],["珊瑚礁是这个地区的主要景点。",""]],["oath","әuθ","n. 誓约, 誓言, 咒骂\\n[法] 誓言, 誓约, 宣誓",["The knight swore an oath of allegiance to the king.","Euthanasia comes into conflict with the Hippocratic oath."],["騎士宣誓效忠於國王。","安樂死與希波克拉底誓言相衝突。"]],["embargo","im'bɑ:gәu","n. 封港令, 禁运\\nvt. 禁止出入港口, 禁运",["The U.S. is calling for an arms embargo against violators of the treaty.","The United States needed ten years of embargo in order to weaken Iraq."],["",""]],["erect","i'rekt","a. 直立的, 竖立的, 笔直的\\nvt. 使竖立, 使直立, 树立, 建立\\nvi. 勃起",["Sandbags can be used to erect a temporary wall to protect against floods.","It's hard to get used to peace when they only ever erect monuments to wars."],["",""]],["registered","'redʒistәd","a. 注册的, 登记过的, 记名的, 挂号的\\n[法] 已注册的, 已登记的, 挂号的",["All participants must be registered.","Please send this by registered mail."],["所有的參加者都得註冊。","請用掛號寄這個。"]],["efficiently","i'fiʃәntli","adv. 生效, 能胜任, 有能力, 效率高, 有效",["If you make a study plan, you can make progress efficiently.","The office staff worked quickly and efficiently to resolve the problem."],["只要制定學習計劃，就能有效地取得進步。",""]],["implant","im'plɑ:nt","vt. 深植, 灌输, 嵌入\\nn. 植入物, 植入管",["Decision to disallow Medicaid for second cochlea implant withdrawn.","The cochlea implant is a technically ingenious device."],["",""]],["deficiency","di'fiʃәnsi","n. 缺乏, 不足\\n[医] 缺乏, 不足",["Body temperature rising, pulse rising ... he's in a state of oxygen deficiency.","Estrogen deficiency in men causes erectile dysfunction."],["",""]],["nephew","'nefju:","n. 侄子, 外甥",["My nephew is more than twenty years older than me.","She's waiting to pick up her nephew."],["我的姪子比我大了二十來歲。","她等著接外甥。"]],["vintage","'vintidʒ","n. 酒, 葡萄收获(期、量), 酿酒\\nv. 采葡萄\\na. 佳酿的, 古典的, 老式的",["The vintage on Santorini for the \"Assyrtiko\" and \"Athiri\" varieties started 15 days ago.","An East Asian dictionary is like a vintage junk store."],["",""]],["blur","blә:","vt. 使模糊, 弄脏\\nvi. 弄脏, 模糊",["The sports car was going so fast it was just a blur as it passed by.","I can't remember anything. It's just one big blur."],["",""]],["enrollment","in'rәulmәnt","n. 登记, 注册, 入伍\\n[经] 登记, 注册",["The Defense Enrollment Eligibility Reporting System is also called DEERS.","According to the AP, enrollment in journalism programs is up."],["",""]],["dietary","'daiәtәri","a. 饮食的\\nn. 规定食物",["There are many different kinds of dietary supplements.","What, you having bread again? I see you're still leading the same thrilling dietary life as ever."],["",""]],["fertilizer","'fә:tilaizә","n. 肥料, 促进发展者, 受精媒介物\\n[化] 肥料",["Ziri didn't add any fertilizer to the water he used to water his ivy.","Ziri used a liquid fertilizer to supplement the soil."],["",""]],["fairy","'fєәri","n. 仙女, 精灵\\na. 仙女的",["The author translated the fairy tale into our mother tongue.","This fairy tale is easy enough for a seven-year-old child to read."],["作者將童話翻譯成了我們的母語。","這個童話故事很淺白，七歲的小孩也看得懂。"]],["freezing","'fri:ziŋ","a. 冰冻的, 冷冻用的, 严寒的\\n[化] 冻结; 冻结作用; 凝固; 凝固作用",["The temperature has been below freezing for several days.","How come this fucking apartment has no double-glazing? I'm freezing."],["零度以下的氣溫持續了好幾天。","为什么这个他妈的房子没有双层玻璃，我快要冷死了。"]],["altitude","'æltitju:d","n. 高度, 海拔, 高处\\n[电] 高度",["Most satellites, including the Hubble Space Telescope, orbit in a low Earth orbit of just a few hundred kilometers altitude.","The people protested against the low altitude flight training."],["",""]],["glare","glєә","n. 闪耀光, 刺眼\\nvi. 发眩光, 瞪视\\nvt. 瞪眼表示",["There's a huge glare; we should watch it in the other room.","Lorenzo looked at us with the most unwelcoming glare."],["",""]],["squint","skwint","n. 斜视眼, 斜着\\na. 斜视的\\nvt. 使变斜视眼\\nvi. 斜视, 倾向, 斜行",["For the next photo, let's change the way you're facing. The sunlight is making you squint.","Instead of a wagging tail and what looks like a happy smile that dogs project, cats sneer at us haughtily, and sometimes they seem to squint and look inscrutably wise."],["",""]],["flashlight","'flæʃlait","n. 手电筒, 闪光信号灯",["You won't be able to see anything without a flashlight.","Using a flashlight, the policeman signaled the car to stop."],["沒有手電筒的話你什麼都看不到。",""]],["urgency","'ә:dʒәnsi","n. 紧急, 催促\\n[法] 紧急, 迫切, 紧急之事",["No problem demands more urgency than the human conditions of life.","As the effects of climate change intensify, so too does the urgency of our response."],["",""]],["protected","","a. 受保护的",["More recently, some hutongs have been designated as protected areas in an attempt to preserve this aspect of Chinese cultural history.","Fish stocks are declining due to over-protection of whales, so fish that whales can eat should also be protected."],["最近，有些胡同被指定为保护区，以试图保存这方面的中国文化历史。",""]],["recruitment","ri'kru:tmәnt","n. 新兵征召\\n[医] 募集[反应], 募集[现象](生理), 复聪(耳科)",["The war was very unpopular, so recruitment of new soldiers became difficult.","The recruitment team looked for promising employees."],["",""]],["handy","'hændi","a. 便利的, 敏捷的, 容易取得的\\n[化] 便于使用的; 易操作的",["I'll keep this information handy for future reference.","Having a few extra batteries handy is never a bad idea."],["我會將這則資訊記下來，以便未來參考。",""]],["racist","'reisist","n. 种族主义者\\n[法] 种族主义的, 种族歧视",["That politician put his foot in his mouth when he made those racist comments.","Every sentence that starts with \"I'm not racist, but\" is likely to be very racist indeed."],["",""]],["download","","[计] 卸载, 下栽",["If you do not have this program, you can download it now.","If you don't have this software, you can download it now."],["假如你没有这个程序，你现在就可以去下载。","假如你没有这个程序，你现在就可以去下载。"]],["oddly","'ɒdli","adv. 奇怪地",["The wealthy, self-indulgent young man felt oddly drawn to the strict, ascetic life led by members of some monastic orders.","Yanni's restaurant was oddly desolate for lunch time."],["",""]],["varied","'vєәrid","a. 不同的, 杂色的, 各式各样的\\n[法] 不同的, 种种的, 变化的",["In fact, there are countless, varied uses for the Internet.","They all get lumped together as English texts. But in fact these books are extremely varied and wide-ranging."],["实际上，网络的作用有着无数的多种多样的。",""]],["differentiate",".difә'renʃieit","v. 区别, 区分",["We must be able to differentiate between objects and situations.","English doesn't differentiate between the verbs \"ser\" and \"estar\"."],["",""]],["collaborate","kә'læbәreit","vi. 合作, 勾结\\n[法] 合作, 合著, 通敌",["The African ground squirrels collaborate and are not aggressive to other mammals.","We must collaborate to revitalise our relationship."],["非洲地松鼠互帮互助，对其他哺乳动物没有攻击性。",""]],["succession","sәk'seʃәn","n. 连续, 继承权, 继位, 演替, 地层次序\\n[法] 继承, 继承权, 继位",["A business cycle is a recurring succession of periods of prosperity and periods of depression.","Man approaches the unattainable truth through a succession of errors."],["",""]],["waitress","'weitris","n. 女侍者, 女服务员",["Ben acted out the scene of the waitress spilling soup in his lap.","The next night I came and I had the same new waitress."],["",""]],["tricky","'triki","a. 狡猾的, 机敏的",["\"Pecan\" is one of those tricky words that gets pronounced in several different ways.","This is an East Asian concept -- it's a little tricky to explain in Spanish."],["「pecan」是一個發音比較刁鑽的詞，有好幾種不同的發音方式。","這是一個東方的概念，用西班牙語不太好解釋。"]],["elk","elk","n. 麋鹿",["In the winter the elk congregate on the golf course.","During dinner the elk drank a lot of beer, fell down the stairs, and died."],["",""]],["brazilian","brә'ziljәn","n. 巴西人\\na. 巴西的, 巴西人的",["\"El Chavo del 8\" is a Mexican series transmitted in Brazil by the Brazilian Television System (BTS).","Acaraje, a Brazilian food from Africa, is a ball of caupi bean dough, onions, and salt, fried in palm oil and served with shrimp and a spicy sauce."],["《查沃德爾奧喬》是一部墨西哥電視劇，由巴西電視系統 (BTS) 在巴西播出。","阿嗄拉咭是源自非洲的巴西食品，是豇豆面团、洋葱和盐，经棕榈油炸，与虾和辣酱一起食用的食品。"]],["remnant","'remnәnt","n. 剩余, 零料, 遗迹\\na. 剩余的, 残余的",["The pursued remnant of soldiers decided it was high time for a show-down one way or another.","A remnant of the old army is supporting and perhaps leading the current chaos."],["",""]],["cement","si'ment","n. 水泥, 胶结剂\\nvt. 胶合, 用水泥涂\\nvi. 黏牢",["The cement will set in a couple of hours.","A house is built on top of a solid foundation of cement."],["水泥會在數個小時內凝固。",""]],["morally","'mɒrәli","adv. 道德上, 德性上, 有道德地",["The pastor's sermons may bore you, but they are morally edifying.","If something is morally good, it stays that way even if it is not successful."],["",""]],["recite","ri'sait","v. 背诵, 朗读, 叙述",["What I hate most of all is having to recite texts from memory.","His daughter is able to recite a lot of poems."],["我最讨厌背诵课文了。","他的女儿能背诵很多诗。"]],["communal","'kɒmjunәl","a. 公有的, 公社的\\n[法] 公共的, 自治体的, 巴黎公社的",["Evangelical believers find strength in fellowship and communal worship.","The apartment is cheap, but it only has communal bathrooms."],["",""]],["situate","'sitjueit","vt. 使位于, 使处于",["Situate yourself near the door if you need to leave early.","For example, designers can reduce cooling costs depending on how they situate a building to take in sunlight."],["",""]],["guiding","'^aidiŋ","[计] 引导的",["The campfire served as a beacon, guiding Matthew and his friends through the dark forest.","Clearness should be a guiding principle of every technical writer."],["",""]],["unemployed",".ʌnim'plɒid","a. 失业的, 未被利用的\\n[经] 没有被雇用的, 失业的, 没有被利用的",["I hear that the number of the unemployed has been increasing recently.","This increase in the number of unemployed people is a result of the bad economy."],["听说最近失业者人数正在增加。",""]],["cuisine","kwi:'zi:n","n. 烹调风格, 烹调法, 烹饪, 厨房",["Rice and noodles are commonplace in Chinese cuisine.","This restaurant serves French cuisine, but with Japanese tableware."],["中餐常有米饭或面条。","這家餐廳供應法國菜，但使用日式餐具。"]],["thinker","'θiŋkә","n. 思想者, 思想家",["Between you and me, he's a shallow thinker.","Freud's insights into human behavior led to him being honored as a profound thinker."],["他思想肤浅，这个我们知道就好。",""]],["expanding","iks'pændiŋ","[机] 扩张工作",["That market has been rapidly expanding.","The world population is expanding at the rate of nearly 90 million people a year."],["那個市場一直在急速擴展。",""]],["wrestle","'resl","n. 摔跤, 角力, 扭斗\\nvi. 摔跤, 搏斗, 斗争, 斟酌\\nvt. 与(对手)摔跤",["Then I sang a silly song about an ant who tried to wrestle a chewing gum.","I think that all boys should learn how to wrestle."],["",""]],["interference",".intә'fiәrәns","n. 冲突, 干涉\\n[计] 干扰",["I won't allow you to continue your interference in my daughter's life.","There is no guarantee that interference will not occur in a particular installation."],["我不允许你继续干涉我女儿的生活。",""]],["underestimate",".ʌndәr'estimeit","n. 低估\\nvt. 低估, 看轻",["Don't underestimate your own strength.","Never underestimate a man's determination to be free."],["不要低估自己的实力。",""]],["spoil","spɒil","n. 战利品, 赃物, 奖品, 变质, 次品\\nvt. 损坏, 破坏, 溺爱\\nvi. 腐坏, 掠夺",["You should not spoil a kid too much.","I don't want to spoil the ending for you."],["孩子不能太惯了。","我不想把結局提前透露給你。"]],["bacon","'beikәn","n. 熏猪肉\\n[机] 腌肉",["BLT stands for bacon, lettuce and tomato.","After having fought many hard battles, we were able to bring home the bacon and set up a new government."],["BLT 代表培根、生菜和番茄。",""]],["maturity","mә'tjuәriti","n. 成熟, 完备, 到期\\n[医] 成熟, 成熟期, 发育期",["With this type of insurance, most policies don't come with a maturity refund.","Willingness to take responsibility is a sign of maturity."],["",""]],["devastate","'devәsteit","vt. 毁坏\\n[法] 使荒废, 毁灭, 掠夺",["The news will certainly devastate him.","The flood waters will devastate the nearby town."],["",""]],["clause","klɒ:z","n. 子句, 条款\\n[计] 子句",["The clause provides that all decisions shall be made by majority vote.","It's funny how German can take a verb, cut it in half, and spread it over a five-clause sentence."],["",""]],["navigate","'nævigeit","vi. 航行\\nvt. 航行于, 驾驶, 操纵, 使通过",["My goal is to help him navigate this stage of life.","Italians, he argued, are finding it hard to find their bearings to navigate the current coronavirus contagion."],["我的目的是幫助他審視這段人生。",""]],["committed","","a. 献身于某种事业的\\n[计] 委托的",["Carlos is an employee who is committed to providing excellent customer service.","The popular singer committed suicide."],["卡洛斯是一位致力於提供優質客服業務的員工。","那个流行歌手自杀了。"]],["collaborative","kә'læbәreitiv","a. 合作的, 协作的",["Obviously, this cannot be the work of one person. This is why Tatoeba is collaborative.","Tom enjoys the collaborative process of learning with Mary."],["很明显，这不可能是一个人的工作。这就是为什么Tatoeba是一个合作项目。",""]],["robust","rәu'bʌst","a. 健康的, 强健的, 要用力气的, 坚定的, 粗野的\\n[计] 健壮性",["Full oxidation gives black tea its deep, robust flavor and dark amber color.","It is our shared values that form the bedrock of a robust relationship across peoples and governments."],["充分氧化反應賦予紅茶濃鬱醇厚的風味和深琥珀色。",""]],["darling","'dɑ:liŋ","n. 亲爱的, 可爱的人, 可爱的物\\na. 可爱的, 亲爱的",["I'm sorry darling, you are merely a single tree in a forest, I just can't drop everything for you.","\"We shouldn't have to wait too much time with the honeymoon, darling\", said the mayfly."],["不好意思美女，我不会为了你这一颗树，放弃一片森林。",""]],["mama","'mɑ:mә","n. 妈妈",["You think that Mama looks young for someone over 80 years old.","Every evening after bedtime stories Mary asked for a lullaby and Mama of course, could not deny her."],["",""]],["parlor","'pɑ:lә","n. 客厅, 会客室, 小店\\na. 客厅的",["Dan was a part-time student who also worked for a local pizza parlor.","Jiro was all smiles after he made a bundle at the pachinko parlor."],["",""]],["bulletin","'bulitin","n. 公告, 布告, 公报\\n[电] 电子布告栏",["Ziri saw a poster on the bulletin board about the competition.","The names of the students who failed in the examination were posted on the bulletin board."],["",""]],["ecology","i:'kɒlәdʒi","n. 生态学, 社会生态学\\n[化] 生态学",["Pollution has a disastrous effect on the ecology of a region.","It was through his influence that she became interested in ecology."],["環境污染可以對一個區域的生態造成極大的影響。","她开始对生态学感兴趣，是受到他的影响。"]],["northwestern",".nɒ:θ'westәn","a. 在西北部的, 西北方的, 来自西北的",["\"Is this Arabic?\" \"No, it's Uyghur - a language that's spoken in northwestern China.\"","A measles outbreak in the U.S. northwestern state of Washington has state health officials scrambling to contain it."],["「這是阿拉伯文嗎？」「不是，這是維吾爾文，一種中國西北部的語言。」",""]],["deployment","","[计] 展开",["The government asked the SDF for a disaster relief deployment to Okinawa.","The general ordered the deployment of two battalions."],["",""]],["accessory","әk'sesәri","n. 附件, 零件, 附加物, 从犯, 同谋\\na. 附属的, 补充的, 同谋的, 帮凶的, 非主要的, 副的\\n[计] 附件",["Sami was convicted as an accessory to the murder of Layla.","This stolen furniture makes you an accessory. You could go to jail."],["",""]],["resent","ri'zent","vt. 愤恨, 憎恶, 怨恨",["The truth is incontrovertible. Panic may resent it, ignorance may deride it, malice may distort it, but there it is.","If you keep harping on his flaws, he'll grow to resent you."],["",""]],["terrace","'terәs","n. 阶地, 梯田, 房屋之平顶, 阳台, 沿岸防地, 露台\\na. 叠层式的\\nvt. 使成梯田, 使成有平台屋顶",["The festoon lights were draped over the terrace space.","A pair of sparrows is building a nest on the terrace at my house."],["",""]],["continuity",".kɒnti'nju:iti","n. 连续性\\n[化] 连续性",["Fans of the original comic had a field day with the myriad continuity issues of the movie adaptation.","The producers hired a team of writers just to patch up the show's continuity, lest they get letters from...those people."],["",""]],["indirect",".indi'rekt","a. 间接的, 非直截了当的, 不坦率的\\n[医] 间接的",["In Arcaicam Esperantom, the ending -d marks an indirect object.","Consumption and alcohol taxes are indirect and are paid together with the cost."],["",""]],["petty","'peti","a. 琐碎的, 小规模的, 小气的, 委琐的\\n[经] 小额的, 微小的, 小规模的",["In this harsh, petty world where money does the talking, his way of life is like a breath of fresh air.","From now on many petty men will not be able to be cowards anymore."],["",""]],["temper","'tempә","n. (钢等的)硬度, 脾气, 心情, 中和剂, 倾向, 回火\\nvt. 使回火, 锻炼, 调和, 使缓和\\nvi. 回火",["He loses his temper so easily that everybody avoids him.","I don't like him because he loses his temper easily."],["他動不動就發脾氣，所以人人都怕了他。","他動輒就發脾氣，所以我不怎麼喜歡他。"]],["blossom","'blɒsәm","n. 花, 花开的状态, 兴旺期\\nvi. 开花, 兴旺, 发展",["The apple tree has a beautiful blossom.","The cherry blossom is to Japan what the rose is to England."],["苹果树上挂着美丽的花朵。",""]],["smiling","'smailiŋ","a. 微笑的, 欢快的",["The source made reference to Kate and the Queen being seen chatting and smiling together last March.","She waved her hand to me, smiling brightly."],["知情者提到去年三月有人看到女王和凱薩琳笑着聊天。","她笑眯眯的对我招手。"]],["genuinely","","adv. 真诚地；诚实地",["In fact, love is the only genuinely precious thing in life; it's also the only thing worthy of pursuit.","\"My dear little girl, you mustn't cry like this,\" she said, genuinely disturbed by Anne's tragic face."],["其實愛情是人生唯一的、真正珍貴的；也是唯一的、真正值得追求的東西。",""]],["obsessed","","a. 着迷的；无法摆脱的",["I have been obsessed with French recently.","The man was obsessed with fear that the secret might be disclosed."],["我最近着迷于法语。",""]],["spacecraft","'speiskræft","n. 航天飞船",["The Soyuz spacecraft undocked from the International Space Station at 9:53 p.m. EDT, carrying three people back to Earth.","Viking 1 and 2 became the first spacecraft to successfully land on the surface of Mars."],["联盟号宇宙飞船于美国东部时间晚上9点53分脱离国际空间站，携带3人返回地球。","維京1號和2號成爲了最先在火星表面成功著陸的空間探測器。"]],["generic","dʒi'nerik","a. 属类的, 一般的\\n[计] 一般的",["Generic ibuprofen is just as effective as name-brand ibuprofen.","Slimes are a generic RPG monster first featured in Dungeons & Dragons."],["",""]],["bureaucratic","bjuәrәu'krætik","a. 官僚的\\n[经] 机僚化的",["In fact, this is a major means of bureaucratic control.","If I don't take care of all the bureaucratic issues, they'll simply deport me."],["",""]],["marathon","'mærәθәn","n. 马拉松, 耐力的考验",["Life is like a marathon, where short-term gains and losses are not significant in and of themselves.","One hundred and fifty people entered the marathon race."],["人生是一次长跑，暂时的落后和领先都不算什么。","150个人参加了马拉松比赛。"]],["globalization",",^lәjbәlai'zeiʃәn;-li'z-","[计] 全球化, 普及到世界范围",["If economic globalization is inevitable, it should primarily serve humanity rather than the interests of trans-national corporations.","Globalization destroys the diversity of languages."],["如果全球化无法避免，应该首先为人服务而不是为跨国公司的利益服务。",""]],["prestigious","pre'stidʒiәs","a. 享有声望的",["The architect boasted that he had received a prestigious award.","The ingenious man received the prestigious award for the first time."],["",""]],["discomfort","dis'kʌmfәt","n. 困苦, 不适\\n[医] 不舒适, 不舒, 烦闷, 不快活",["I sensed with discomfort that the two of them might ridicule me behind my back as a thoughtless, simple-minded satyr.","To avoid injury or discomfort, be sure that the vagina is lubricated before intercourse."],["",""]],["icy","'aisi","a. 冰的, 冰冷的, 冷淡的, 滑溜的",["An icy wind blew into the room through the open window.","An icy wind was blowing into the room through the open window."],["一股寒風從敞開著的窗口吹入屋內。","一股寒風從敞開著的窗口吹入屋內。"]],["applied","ә'plaid","a. 应用的\\n[机] 应用的; 应用, 申请",["Six people applied for this job, but none of them was accepted.","This kind of medicine can only be applied externally."],["六个人投了这份工作，但他们中没有一个被录用。","这种药物只能外用。"]],["backpack","'bækpæk","n. 远足用的背包；双肩背包, 背包",["Inside my backpack there are many colored pens, red ones, blue ones, green ones, etc.","After that, I left, but then I realized that I forgot my backpack at their house."],["我的書包裡有很多彩色筆，紅的，藍的，綠的，等等。",""]],["massacre","'mæsәkә","n. 大屠杀\\nvt. 大屠杀, 残杀",["The Chinese government controlled the internet to prevent the people from knowing the truth of the Tiananmen Square Massacre.","I watched the film named \"Texas Chainsaw Massacre\" with my girlfriend yesterday. She was very afraid."],["中国政府控制了网络，以免让人民知道六四事件的真相。",""]],["spur","spә:","n. 马刺, 刺激物, 鼓舞\\nvt. 刺激, 激励, 用马刺策(马)前进\\nvi. 用马刺驱马, 疾驰",["More money for education will spur economic growth.","A steep curve of heath-clad land, an outlying spur of the moor, lay in front of us."],["更多投資在教育的錢將會刺激經濟成長。",""]],["trench","trentʃ","n. 渠, 沟渠, 战壕\\nvt. 在...开沟, 挖战壕于, 用战壕围住\\nvi. 挖战壕, 开沟",["After we finish digging the trench, planting the flowers will be easy.","English isn't a language. It's three languages wearing a trench coat pretending to be one."],["",""]],["deviation",".di:vi'eiʃәn","n. 背离\\n[化] 偏差; 误差; 偏斜",["No deviation from the regulations will be tolerated.","Without deviation from the norm, progress is not possible."],["",""]],["spirituality",",spiritju'æliti","n. 精神性, 灵性, 教士, 牧师",["Some believe that spirituality is utterly different from religiosity.","I miss Abraham's spirituality bookshop. It was so cozy with chairs with cushions."],["",""]],["whistle","'hwisl","n. 口哨, 汽笛, 啸啸声, 口哨声\\nvi. 吹口哨, 鸣汽笛, 发嘘嘘声\\nvt. 用口哨或吹哨传意, 用口哨演奏",["A whistle blew, and the boat slowly began to pull out of port.","The referee blew his whistle twice to tell everyone it was full-time."],["汽笛声响起，船开始慢慢地驶离港口。","裁判吹哨两次，向大家宣布已经终场。"]],["cinnamon","'sinәmәn","n. 肉桂, 肉桂树皮, 肉桂色\\na. 肉桂色的, 浅黄褐色的",["During my university days, it was cheap then to buy a snack. I would munch on a curried beef bun or a big cinnamon roll and drink a cup of tea.","Cakes, pies, croissants and cinnamon rolls are all types of pastries."],["大學時期，買零食很便宜。我常常會吃個咖哩牛肉包子或一個大肉桂捲，再喝杯茶。",""]],["devotion","di'vәuʃәn","n. 热爱, 投入",["The senator avowed his devotion to his constituents.","It was your tireless efforts and devotion that made the event successful."],["",""]],["governance","'gʌvәnәns","n. 统治, 统辖, 管理\\n[法] 统治, 管理, 支配",["Corporate governance and accountability are being strengthened.","You've become a thought leader in the whole corporate-governance space."],["",""]],["diesel","'di:zәl","n. 内燃机, 柴油机, 柴油",["When Vin Diesel does pushups, he's not pushing himself up - he's pushing the Earth down.","This heating equipment uses diesel as fuel."],["冯迪索在做俯卧撑时，并不是把自身往上推，而是在把地球向下推。","这个取暖装置用柴油作为燃料。"]],["astronomy","ә'strɒnәmi","n. 天文学",["Astronomy involves the study of stars and planets.","Astronomy is at the same time the most ancient and the most modern science."],["天文學涉及恆星和行星的研究。","天文學同時是最古老也最現代的科學。"]],["appropriately","","adv. 适当的, 恰如其分的, 恰当的, 合适的",["The Vietnam War is known in Vietnam, and quite appropriately, as the American War.","You must appropriately review the outcome of your bargain."],["",""]],["insane","in'sein","a. 患精神病的, 极愚蠢的\\n[医] 神经错乱的",["This world is just an insane asylum.","This numerical analysis coursework is driving me insane."],["世界就是一个疯子的囚笼。",""]],["unpleasant",".ʌn'pleznt","a. 使人不愉快的, 使人厌恶的, 煞风景的",["An unpleasant feeling is always bad.","We had an unpleasant experience there."],["不愉快的感覺永遠不好。","我們在那裡有一個不愉快的經歷。"]],["roster","'rɒstә","n. 花名册",["There's no one on the roster who can play defense.","Jackson is the only one on the roster who can play defense."],["",""]],["skeleton","'skelәtn","n. 骨骼, 骨瘦如柴的人, 梗概, 骨干, 残骸\\na. 骨骼的, 概略的, 基层的, 骨干的\\n[计] 骨架",["The explorers discovered a skeleton in the cave.","I heard they found a skeleton buried in the basement of a house on Park Street."],["探险家们在洞穴里发现了骸骨。",""]],["briefing","'bri:fiŋ","n. 简报\\n[法] 简报, 情况的简要介绍",["The captain will go to the meteorological office to get a weather briefing.","Dan interrupted Linda's briefing saying that the building was on fire."],["",""]],["spawn","spɒ:n","n. (鱼)卵, 产物\\nvt. 产卵, 酿成, 大量生产\\nvi. 产卵, 大量生产",["Salmon return to their original birthplace to spawn.","These fish swim to the shallows to spawn and feed."],["",""]],["entertaining",".entә'teiniŋ","a. 使人愉快的, 有趣的",["I think a movie is more entertaining than any book.","This TV program seems to be very entertaining."],["我觉得一部电影比任何书都有趣。","这个电视节目看起来很好玩。"]],["sew","sәu","vt. 缝纫, 缝合, 缝\\nvi. 缝纫",["She prefers to sew, and wishes neither to walk nor to sit in the garden.","If you'll get a needle and thread, I'll sew your button on."],["",""]],["inflict","in'flikt","vt. 施以, 加害, 使承受\\n[法] 处, 加, 予以",["You should not inflict any injury on others on any account.","Here, unfortunately, Waltz plays a much softer evildoer, but still bad enough to inflict psychological and physical harm on Bond."],["",""]],["marked","mɑ:kt","a. 有记号的, 显著的, 醒目的\\n[化] 有记号的; 显著的",["Tuesday marked the final day of the Diamond Jubilee celebrations, marking the 60th anniversary of Queen Elizabeth II's accession to the throne.","The invention of the transistor marked a new era."],["星期二是女王登基鑽石慶典的最後一天，標誌著伊莉莎白二世女王登基 60 週年。","晶體管的發明標誌著一個新時代的開始。"]],["indict","in'dait","vt. 起诉, 控告, 指控\\n[法] 控告, 揭发, 对...起诉",["In the absence of sufficient proof, the police could not indict him.","The grand jury decided not to indict the police officer."],["",""]],["muddy","'mʌdi","a. 泥泞的, 浑浊的, 模糊的\\nvt. 使污浊, 使沾上泥污",["Because it had been raining for a couple of days, the pitch was muddy and difficult to play on.","The passing car splashed muddy water on me."],["连续下了好几天雨，所以这个足球场有些泥泞，不太好用了。","車子經過的時候把泥水濺到了我的身上。"]],["profoundly","prә'fajndli","adv. 深深地, 深切地",["Becoming Muslim can have a profoundly positive effect on your life.","I'd hoped for better from you, and your actions have left me feeling profoundly disappointed."],["",""]],["occupational",".ɒkju'peiʃәnl","a. 职业的, 军事占领的\\n[医] 职业的",["Demand for occupational therapy has surged in recent years.","A pot belly is an occupational hazard for office workers."],["这几年对作业疗法的需求在迅速增长。",""]],["singing","'siŋiŋ","n. 歌唱, 歌声\\n[计] 振鸣; 蜂鸣",["I sometimes hear my father singing in the bathroom.","She is not only good at running; she is also good at singing."],["我有時會聽到父親在浴室裡唱歌。","她不仅擅长跑步，也擅长唱歌。"]],["turtle","'tә:tl","n. 海龟",["Please buy me a turtle, Mother, please buy me a turtle.","There are three words engraved on the bridge of the plastron of this turtle."],["给我买只乌龟吧，妈妈，求你给我买只乌龟吧！","這塊龜腹甲的甲橋上有三個字的刻辭。"]],["trio","'tri:әu","n. 三重唱",["Some people believe in the trio of science, religion, and magic.","The trio parachuted to Earth in the steppe of Kazakhstan."],["",""]],["ferry","'feri","n. 渡船, 渡口\\n[法] 摆渡营业权, 轮渡",["There were not more than one hundred passengers on board the ferry.","In the morning, I'm taking the first ferry to Greece."],["渡輪上的乘客不多於一百人。",""]],["leverage","'levәridʒ","n. 杠杆作用, 杠杆装置, 杠杆效率\\n[医] 杠杆率",["Narcissists exploit others' weaknesses and vulnerabilities, using them as leverage to control and manipulate.","Many conspiracy theorists leverage unverifiable statements and claim them as facts."],["",""]],["consulting","kәn'sʌltiŋ","a. 商议的, 咨询的, 任专职顾问的",["I think I shouldn't make a decision without consulting Tom.","It was with some surprise, therefore, that I saw him walk into my consulting-room upon the evening of April 24th."],["",""]],["sticky","'stiki","a. 粘的, 有粘性的, 顽固的",["Clerks with sticky fingers won't keep their jobs for long.","The politician had sticky fingers, and 5% of every contract ended in his pocket."],["",""]],["comeback","'kʌmbæk","n. 复原, 复辟, 复位, 尖刻的对答, 抱怨的原因\\n[计] 复原的",["She's quick on her feet, so no matter what you say to her, she'll have a witty comeback.","She's always quick on the comeback to any criticism."],["她的腦筋轉得很快，無論你對她說些什麼，她總能巧妙地作出反駁。",""]],["thereafter",".ðєәr'æftә","adv. 其后, 从那时以后",["Thereafter we heard no more from him.","Thereafter, he was gradually promoted until he became company president."],["从那时以后，我们再也没听到他的任何音讯。",""]],["conflicting","kәn'fliktiŋ","a. 冲突的, 不一致的, 相矛盾的",["Conflicting reports prompted the director to reconsider her position.","There is conflicting information regarding that drug's safety."],["",""]],["clergy","'klә:dʒi","n. 牧师, 僧侣, 神职人员",["Bishops, archbishops and abbots composed the high clergy.","People who work for a given faith are called clergy."],["",""]],["astonishing","ә'stɒniʃiŋ","a. 令人惊讶的",["It's astonishing how in over his head the president is. He seems neither to get the politics nor the policy of this.","It was completely astonishing, as you would expect."],["",""]],["renewal","ri'nju:әl","n. 更新, 革新, 复兴, 恢复, 修补, 补充, 继续, 重订, 重申, 续借\\n[经] 更新, 换新, 重申",["The formation of youth is the renewal of the world.","Urban renewal is another way of saying gentrification."],["",""]],["turmoil","'tә:mɒil","n. 骚动, 混乱",["The dismissal of foreign minister Tanaka is symbolic of the continuing political turmoil.","The carp's longevity is unmolested by the turmoil of the millipede."],["",""]],["painted","'peintid","a. 描画的, 着色的, 刷上油漆的, 涂脂抹粉的, 矫揉造作的",["The news article painted the defendant as a guilty man, even though he had been proven innocent.","He obtained a picture which Picasso had painted in his later years."],["该报文章中将被告人描述成一个罪魁祸首，尽管他已经被证明是无辜的了。","他獲得了一幅畢卡索晚年的畫作。"]],["migrate","'maigreit","vi. 移动, 移往, 随季节而移居\\n[计] 迁移程序",["Algerian Arabs vote for Islamist political parties but migrate to secular and libertarian countries.","Unlike the Serengeti wildebeests, the Masai giraffes don't migrate."],["",""]],["perfection","pә'fekʃәn","n. 完美, 完成, 极端\\n[经] 完整性",["His martial arts prowess has already reached a level of sublime perfection.","Actually his work has reached the acme of perfection."],["他的武功已经达到了出神入化的境界。",""]],["referral","ri'fә:rәl","n. 参照, 介绍, 被介绍人, 转诊病人",["Employee referral programs are gaining in popularity.","No, this is not a referral. I found your name on my own."],["",""]],["randomly","","adv. 偶然, 胡乱, 无目的, 任意, 随便, 任取, 无规则, 机遇, 胡乱地, 任意地, 随便地\\n[计] 随机地",["He had no other choice but to choose the names randomly.","Authorities believe the shooter may have targeted his first victims but then began attacking randomly."],["",""]],["keen","ki:n","a. 锋利的, 敏锐的, 强烈的, 敏捷的, 热心的, 渴望的\\nn. 挽歌, 痛哭\\nv. 唱挽歌, 痛哭",["You have a keen sense of direction.","That young man is very keen on cycling."],["你的方向感很好。","那年轻人很喜欢骑自行车。"]],["sustained","sәs'teind","a. 持续的, 持久不变的, 持久的, 不懈的\\n[计] 持续的",["Tom sustained serious burns and had to go to the hospital.","Due to the catastrophe caused by the huge tsunami, damage was sustained by the nuclear reactor as well as explosions at the nuclear power plant."],["湯姆嚴重燒傷，不得不去醫院治療。","由于特大海啸的灾害，核能融炉遭受损害，造成了原子能发电站爆炸。"]],["rite","rait","n. 仪式, 典礼, 惯例, 礼拜式",["The Italian Jewish rite has elements of both Sephardi and Ashkenazi traditions.","Naming his son after himself felt like a rite of passage."],["",""]],["offspring","'ɒ:fspriŋ","n. 子孙, 后代, 产物\\n[法] 后辈, 子孙, 后裔",["The atomic bomb is the offspring of 20th century physics.","A hinny is a hybrid offspring of two species, a male horse and a female donkey."],["原子弹是二十世纪物理学的产物。",""]],["mathematical",".mæθә'mætikl","a. 数学的, 精确的\\n[机] 数学上的",["Takeo is engrossed in solving mathematical problems.","He is good at solving complicated mathematical problems."],["建夫专心致志地解决数学问题。","他擅长解答数学难题。"]],["imaginary","i'mædʒinәri","a. 想像的, 虚构的, 假想的",["You say Nessie is an imaginary being, but I think she exists.","Whether the characters in a book are real or completely imaginary, they can become your friends and companions."],["你说尼斯湖水怪是虚构的，但我觉得它真实存在。","无论书中的人物是真实的还是完全假想的，他们能成为你的伙伴和朋友。"]],["orient","'ɒ:riәnt","n. 东方, 东方诸国\\na. 东方的\\nvi. 向东\\nvt. 使朝东, 使适应, 确定方向",["The Orient-Express is one of the world's most famous luxury passenger trains.","The Orient is not foreign to me, as it might be to you."],["",""]],["archive","'ɑ:kaiv","vt. 把...存档\\nn. 档案馆, 档案文件\\n[计] 挡案库, 存档",["I'm downloading this internet archive.","The company faced a major interruption in business when a fire destroyed their archive of computer hard drives and optical discs."],["我在下载这份网络档案。",""]],["adhere","әd'hiә","vi. 依附, 粘着, 坚持, 追随, 拥护\\nvt. 使粘附",["There will be chaos unless we all adhere to the rules.","On the contrary, the priests should adhere to a blameless, sober and temperate life."],["",""]],["receipt","ri'si:t","n. 收据, 收入, 收到\\nvt. 开...的收据",["I lost my receipt and had to call customer service at both IKEA and the bank.","Please wait a moment while I write out your receipt."],["我遺失了收據，不得不給 IKEA 和銀行的客服部門打電話。",""]],["radically","'rædikәli","adv. 根本地, 完全地",["He just thinks so radically compared to other people.","The two systems are based on radically different principles."],["",""]],["pillar","'pilә","n. 柱子, 栋梁, 台柱, 重要的支持者\\n[医] 柱, 脚",["A large pillar obstructs the view of the lake.","Her back had stiffened, her arms and hands had stiffened, and her whole body was like a pillar of stone."],["巨大的柱子遮住了视线，让人看不到湖。",""]],["swedish","'swi:diʃ","n. 瑞典人, 瑞典语\\na. 瑞典的, 瑞典人的, 瑞典语的",["I am Finnish, but I speak also Swedish.","With Marika, I found Swedish easier to learn than Finnish."],["我是芬兰人，但我也说瑞典语。",""]],["underwear","'ʌndәwєә","n. 内衣",["My wife's underwear is all old, I want to buy her some new ones online.","Taobao suggested sexy and cute erotic underwear for me."],["我妻子的內褲都舊了，我要給她在網上買點新的。","淘宝给我推荐了性感又可爱的情趣内衣。"]],["contamination","kәn.tæmi'neiʃәn","n. 污染, 污物\\n[化] 污染; 沾污",["You must wear the right PPE, such as gloves and a gown, before entering an isolation room, to protect yourself from contamination.","People are suffering from the contamination of the water supply."],["",""]],["appropriation","әprәupri'eiʃәn","n. 拨用, 挪用, 拨款\\n[经] 拨款, 挪用",["The appropriation is pin-money; it wouldn't be enough even to build a gym, much less build the administration building.","Reproduction or appropriation of HTML, images and photographs from within this site is prohibited."],["",""]],["uneasy",".ʌn'i:zi","a. 心神不安的, 不自在的, 不稳定的, 不舒服的",["Even though someone came, she still remained uneasy.","I understand that you feel uneasy, but don't worry."],["虽然有人来了，但是她还是忐忑不安。","我知道你不自在，但别急。"]],["disappearance",".disә'piәrәns","n. 看不见, 失踪, 消失",["We have to look into the disappearance of the doctor.","The police now believe that Tom had something to do with Mary's disappearance."],["我们必须调查医生的失踪案。","警方現在認為湯姆和瑪麗的失蹤有干系。"]],["unacceptable",".ʌnәk'septәbl","a. 无法接受的, 不受欢迎的\\n[法] 不能接受的, 不受欢迎的, 难以承认的",["It is highly regrettable that your request was considered to be unacceptable.","Acceptable and unacceptable are clearly in opposition to each other."],["",""]],["privileged","'privilidʒd","a. 有特权的, 有特别恩典的\\n[法] 特许的, 有特权的",["This e-mail is confidential and may also contain privileged information.","Their perspective was very eschatological as if they were a very privileged generation."],["",""]],["carriage","'kæridʒ","n. 马车, 客车, 举止, 运输\\n[经] 搬运费, 运费",["The noble lady drove by towards the baron's mansion with her three daughters, in a gilded carriage drawn by six horses.","Around him in the carriage, the other passengers rocked and swayed."],["",""]],["sporting","'spɒ:tiŋ","a. 喜好运动的, 运动用的, 冒险性的",["An Olympic gold medal is probably the most coveted sporting prize.","Many New Yorkers love their professional sporting teams."],["",""]],["fox","fɒks","n. 狐狸, 狡猾的人\\nvi. 奸狡地行动, (书页)生斑, 变酸\\nvt. 欺骗, 使变酸, 为(鞋等)换面, 使生黄斑",["The quick brown fox did not jump over the lazy dog.","The quick brown fox didn't jump over the lazy dog."],["身手矯健的棕狐狸沒有躍過懶洋洋的狗。","身手矯健的棕狐狸沒有躍過懶洋洋的狗。"]],["messenger","'mesindʒә","n. 报信者, 使者\\n[经] 使者, 送信者, 通信员",["A messenger reports that the enemy is approaching.","Native American Indians considered the coyote to be the Creator's Messenger on Earth, teaching people how to live."],["",""]],["artillery","ɑ:'tilәri","n. 火炮, 炮兵, 炮术\\n[机] 火炮, 炮兵",["When Dr. Roylott was in India he married my mother, Mrs. Stoner, the young widow of Major-General Stoner, of the Bengal Artillery.","A volley of artillery fire completely destroyed the buildings."],["",""]],["hitter","'hitә","n. 打手, 打击的人",["Whoever the pitcher may be, he will not be able to strike out our best hitter.","A pinch hitter was brought into action in the last inning."],["",""]],["pavement","'peivmәnt","n. 路面, 人行道, 铺面路, 铺路材料",["Jeff had to pound the pavement for three months before he found a job.","A strange man was walking back and forth on the pavement."],["",""]],["moist","mɒist","a. 潮湿的, 多雨的, 感伤的, 含泪的\\n[医] 湿的",["It's moist and it's the perfect time to root some ivy cuttings.","I like the Japanese custom of offering guests moist towels, called oshibori."],["",""]],["retention","ri'tenʃәn","n. 保持, 留置, 保留, 保持力, 保留物, 记忆, 停滞, 固位\\n[计] 保贸, 保持",["Uncertainty regarding the company's financial situation will interfere with employee retention.","Continuous practice allows for the retention of grammar rules, sentence structures, and idiomatic expressions."],["",""]],["relevance","'relivәns","n. 中肯；关联；相关性",["In her speech, she emphasized the issues that had direct relevance to practice.","Saint Augustine was another Berber of great relevance to world history."],["",""]],["mentality","men'tæliti","n. 精神力, 智力, 头脑作用, 心态\\n[医] 智力",["Having a competitive mentality can give rise to negative emotions.","It is the particular environment that has shaped the Japanese mentality."],["攀比心理会让人产生负面情绪。",""]],["postpone","pәust'pәun","vt. 延迟, 使延期, 缓办, 搁延\\nvi. 延缓, 延缓发作",["For the moment, we want to postpone making a decision.","Tom and Mary agreed to postpone the party for a week."],["",""]],["motif","mәu'ti:f","n. 主题, 基调, 动机, 基本图案\\n[法] 主旨, 主题, 动机",["The girl, her eyes shining brightly from that single hint, makes her cute cat-motif automatic pencil run across her notebook.","The repeated triplets are the most prominent motif in that movement of the symphony."],["這女孩的眼睛閃爍著光亮, 這個暗示讓她可愛的貓圖案自動鉛筆越過了她的筆記本。",""]],["contention","kәn'teinʃәn","n. 争论, 争辩, 所持的论点\\n[计] 争用",["The division of the property was a bone of contention between the brothers.","The choice of place for holiday turned out to be a real bone of contention in their family this year."],["",""]],["tractor","'træktә","n. 牵引器, 拖拉机, 拉纸器\\n[计] 进纸器",["When the chickens are flat as pancakes, then again the tractor must have been faster than them.","When chickens pancake-shape maintain, the tractor must have won again."],["當雞像煎餅一樣平的時候, 那麼一定是拖拉機跑得比它們快。","當雞像煎餅一樣平的時候, 那麼一定是拖拉機跑得比它們快。"]],["beneficiary",".beni'fiʃәri","n. 受惠者, 受益人\\na. 受封的",["Sami rewrote his will, adding Layla as a major beneficiary.","Tyler is a beneficiary of xenoglossia, which has allowed him to know 31 languages without learning."],["",""]],["helpless","'helplis","a. 无助的, 无能为力的, 无依无靠的",["Poor sanitation practices rendered Europe helpless against the Black Death.","Tom told Mary that she should quit pretending to be helpless."],["",""]],["ballet","'bælei","n. 芭蕾舞",["My husband and I are going on Sunday to see the ballet, Carmen, performed by the National Ballet Company at the Four Seasons Centre.","A ballet theater is a place in which I can study motion."],["我和丈夫周日要去四季演艺中心，去看国家芭蕾舞团表演的芭蕾舞剧《卡门》。",""]],["statewide","'steitwaid","a. 全州的, 遍及全州的",["Mary was the first woman to hold a statewide office in any state in the country.","Tom successfully carried the state with nearly sixty percent of the total statewide vote."],["",""]],["hobby","'hɒbi","n. 嗜好, 癖好, 爱好",["No hobby is as cheap as reading, nor provides such long lasting enjoyment.","My hobby is collecting old bottles."],["没有任何娱乐像阅读这般廉价，也没有任何愉悦像阅读这般持久。","我的嗜好是收集舊瓶子。"]],["bosnian","bɔzni:ən","n. 波斯尼亚人\\na. 波斯尼亚的",["At that time, NATO bombed the bases of the Bosnian Serbs.","Bosnia and Herzegovina is called \"Bosna i Hercegovina\" in Bosnian."],["",""]],["velocity","vi'lɒsәti","n. 速度, 迅速\\n[化] 速度",["Application of force to an object changes its velocity: its speed, its direction, or both.","The derivatives of space with respect to time are velocity, acceleration, and jerk."],["",""]],["critically","'kritikәli","adv. 批评性地, 审慎地, 精密地",["A critically wounded elephant went berserk and attacked every living thing in his path.","Up to now we've been taking a casual relaxed attitude toward our relationship but I want to start looking at us more critically."],["",""]],["pathway","'pɑ:θwei","n. 路径, 途径\\n[医] 路径, 道",["No matter what you desire of life, other people's aims, ambitions and activities constitute vital obstructions along your pathway.","He threw the bridle over the fence and strode up the pathway."],["",""]],["reconcile","'rekәnsail","vt. 使和解, 调停, 使和谐, 使一致, 使听从\\n[经] 对帐, 使一致",["I would rather kill myself than reconcile myself to my fate.","The woman of today is exposed to various stresses. She must try to reconcile career and family life."],["与其向命运妥协，我宁可自杀。",""]],["compartment","kәm'pɑ:tmәnt","n. 分隔间, 卧车包房, 防水舱隔\\n[医] 隔室, 隔间",["I found the secret compartment quite by accident.","Tom opened the glove compartment and took out a pair of sunglasses."],["我完全是在偶然的情况下发现了密室。",""]],["policymaker","'pɔlisi.meikә","n. 政策制定者；决策人",["We need at least one policymaker on the committee to provide the perspective of someone who can help make decisions about the research.","The policymaker made sure to carefully consider the pros and cons in his work."],["我們需要至少一個關於委員會的政策制定者，提供有助於做出關於該研究的決策者觀點。",""]],["madness","'mædnis","n. 疯狂, 愚蠢的行为\\n[医] 狂, 疯狂",["Genius and madness are separated only by success.","It is no use trying to separate the sheep from the goats while in a state of madness."],["天才与精神错乱之间只隔着成功。",""]],["hub","hʌb","n. 毂, 木片, 中心\\n[计] 插座; 插孔; 集线器, 集中器, 连接器, 中继站",["If you combine them in this way, you get a 14 port USB hub.","This station is an important hub in the local transport network."],["",""]],["noisy","'nɒizi","a. 嘈杂的, 喧闹的\\n[机] 噪声的, 嘈杂的",["The turkeys in my grandfather's farm are very noisy, I can't wait for them to get eaten.","At my house, I have nowhere to study - it's too noisy there."],["我爺爺農場養的火雞吵得要命，真想牠們快點被人吃掉。","我在自己家中哪裡都不能讀書，那裏太吵了。"]],["opposing","ә'pәuziŋ","a. 对面的, 反对的, 相反的, 相对的",["It would demoralize the opposing team to give it the razz from the spectators' side.","I found out that the opposing counsel is planning on deposing three expert witnesses."],["",""]],["cleaner","'kli:nә","n. 清洁工人, 清洁剂, 干洗商\\n[化] 滤清器; 除垢器; 洗净剂; 清洁剂",["I sucked up the dust on the floor with a vacuum cleaner.","I got this vacuum cleaner for nothing."],["我用吸塵機把地上的灰塵吸掉了。","我免費得到了這個吸塵器。"]],["insult","'insʌlt","n. 侮辱, 无礼, 损害\\nvt. 损害, 侮辱, 攻击",["There is no greater insult to life than premature ejaculation.","I do not know whether to take it as a compliment or an insult."],["没有什么比早泄更糟蹋生活的了","我真是哭笑不得。"]],["asthma","'æsmә","n. 哮喘\\n[医] 气喘",["NO2 pollution triggers an estimated 4 million asthma cases in children each year worldwide.","The shark, being very old and suffering from asthma and heart trouble, was obliged to sleep with his mouth open."],["",""]],["usher","'ʌʃә","n. 引座员, 招待员\\nvt. 引导, 招待\\nvi. 作招待员",["Recent advances in medicine will usher in a new age in medical care.","See if you can find an usher to take this gentleman to his seat."],["",""]],["respected","","a. 受尊敬的",["Needless to say, fundamental human rights should be respected.","Public morals are not respected anymore in this town."],["無須多言，基本人權應當被尊重。","在這座城市裏，公共道德不再受到尊重。"]],["golfer","'gɒlfә","n. 打高尔夫球的人",["No pro golfer in Japan is as popular as Jumbo Ozaki.","Tom became a professional golfer after he graduated from college."],["尾崎將司是日本最受歡迎的專業高爾夫球手。",""]],["misleading","mis'li:diŋ","a. 引入歧途的, 使人误解的, 骗人的\\n[法] 误写姓名的, 误称的, 令人误解的",["It is not that Johnson's claim is groundless, but that it is misleading.","In either case, the division is real and useful; but it can also be misleading."],["",""]],["fury","'fjuri","n. 愤怒, 狂暴, 狂怒的人\\n[医] 狂乱, 狂暴, 狂怒",["But I dare to say that it is better to face those few but powerful interests, rather than eventually facing the fury of society.","Life is a tale, told by an idiot, full of sound and fury, signifying nothing."],["但我敢说解决这些少数群体的利益问题—虽然这些利益很大，但总比以后面对社会的愤怒好。",""]],["embark","im'bɑ:k","vi. 乘船, 着手, 从事, 上飞机\\nvt. 使上船, 使上飞机, 使从事",["My uncle says he's about to embark on a new business venture.","He resolved to embark on a once-in-a-lifetime enterprise."],["",""]],["spontaneous","spɒn'teiniәs","a. 自然的, 自发的, 未经琢磨的\\n[医] 自发的, 特发的, 自生的",["This tall and thin young man had a spontaneous pneumothorax.","Teaching spontaneous thinking is difficult in schools."],["",""]],["slender","'slendә","a. 苗条的, 纤弱的, 微少的, 微薄的\\n[机] 细的, 纤细的",["Slender and form-fitting with a high cut, the new qipao contrasted sharply with the traditional one.","He stood from the wall, his slender figure casting an elongated shadow across the hallway."],["新的旗袍又修长又紧身，也有短裙摆，与传统式样构成了鲜明的对比。",""]],["proliferation",".prәulifә'reiʃәn","n. 增殖, 激增\\n[医] 增生, 增殖",["The proliferation of Internet usage has given birth to a new generation of young people.","Nuclear proliferation is the spread of nuclear weapons."],["互联网的广泛应用使新一代的年轻人诞生了。",""]],["bloom","blu:m","n. 花, 开花, 青春, 钢块\\nvi. 开花, 焕发青春, 茂盛\\nvt. 使茂盛, 把...轧成钢坯",["North China is cold in spring, so flowers don't bloom outdoors.","This week the cherry blossoms in the park are in full bloom."],["春季的时候，中国北边很冷，所以在外边的花不开花。","本周公园樱花盛开。"]],["necklace","'neklis","n. 项链",["I still cherish the necklace you gave me ten years ago.","Tom found Mary's necklace under the sofa."],["我至今还珍惜你十年前给我的项链。","在沙发下，汤姆找到了玛丽的项链。"]],["perimeter","pә'rimitә","n. 周长, 周界, 边缘\\n[医] 周, 周边, 周界线; 周长; 视野计",["Security of the perimeter was also ramped up drastically.","No unauthorised persons will be permitted inside the perimeter."],["",""]],["brochure","'brәuʃә","n. 小册子, 小册",["The brochure hasn't enticed me to go on holiday there.","The brochure didn't tempt me to go on holiday there."],["",""]],["blouse","blauz","n. 宽松的上衣",["I went to the clothing store yesterday and bought a blue blouse and three pairs of pants.","She was clothed in a red blouse and a black skirt."],["昨天我去衣服店买了一件蓝色的衬衫和三件裤子。",""]],["firing","'faiәriŋ","n. 烧毁, 焚烧, 加热, 添煤\\n[计] 点火",["Your random firing will scare away the prey.","In short some guns have excellent security systems to prevent accidental firing (e.g. when dropped), others don't."],["你胡乱打枪，会吓跑猎物的。",""]],["proximity","prɒk'simiti","n. 接近, 亲近",["Blind people sometimes develop a compensatory ability to sense the proximity of objects around them.","Basically, distance is not an obstacle (on the other hand, how often proximity is one) to reach."],["某些失明者会产生一个弥补性的能力，这个能力让他们察觉到他们与离他们很近的物体的距离。",""]],["lettuce","'letis","n. 莴苣, 生菜, 纸币\\n[医] 莴苣",["Tom probably doesn't know where Mary wants him to plant the lettuce.","Tableland vegetables are grown here, such as lettuce, cabbage, and celery."],["湯姆可能不知道瑪莉想讓他把生菜種在哪裡。","這裡種植有生菜、高麗菜和芹菜等高原蔬菜。"]],["manifestation",".mænifes'teiʃәn","n. 显示, 证明, 示威运动\\n[医] 表现, 表示",["I mean it's just another manifestation of internet addiction really.","Transhumance can also be an international manifestation of lucid peasants who resist the dictates of the administration."],["",""]],["inn","in","n. 旅馆, 客栈\\nvi. 住旅馆",["A fire broke out at the inn where they were staying.","At a Japanese-style inn, they take care of your every need, so you don't have to lift a finger."],["火警發生在他們住的旅館。",""]],["brace","breis","n. 支柱, 曲柄, 支撑, 一对\\nvt. 紧缚, 支撑, 激励\\nvi. 打起精神\\n[计] 花括号",["Yanni brought his mother a back brace from the UK.","Yanni wears his back brace when he's working in the garden."],["",""]],["perfume","'pә:fju:m","n. 香水, 香气, (悦人的)气氛, 美名\\nvt. 洒香水于, 薰香, 使充满香气",["The perfume of roses filled the room.","Do you know what it means for a man to give a woman perfume?"],["玫瑰的香氣在房間的每一個角落裏飄蕩著。","你知道男孩子送女孩子香水代表什么吗？"]],["colonel","'kә:nәl","n. 陆军上校, 长官",["He was raised to the rank of colonel two years ago.","The Colonel was very fond of Hughie, but would not hear of any engagement."],["",""]],["matching","'mætʃiŋ","a. 相同的, 协调的\\n[计] 匹配, 对比",["Mary was wearing a pink blouse with matching miniskirt.","The police found a truck matching that description."],["",""]],["symbolize","'simblaiz","vt. 符号化, 用符号表现\\nvi. 采用象征, 使用符号",["In literary works, night-blooming jasmine is often used to symbolize longing and tenderness.","The twelve stars on the flag of the European Union do not symbolize the twelve founding members of the union. They symbolize the Twelve Apostles."],["文學作品中常用夜來香來象徵思念與柔情。","歐盟盟旗的十二顆星代表的不是創立聯盟的十二個會員國，而是十二門徒。"]],["flock","flɒk","n. 兽群, 鸟群, 一群人, 大量, 棉束\\nvi. 成群而行, 聚集\\nvt. 用棉束填满",["There were shepherds keeping watch over their flock.","The shepherd always tries to persuade his flock that its interests and his own are one and the same."],["",""]],["rivalry","'raivlri","n. 竞争, 对抗\\n[医] 拮抗",["The quarrel originated in rivalry between the two countries.","There was a lot of sibling rivalry between Tom and his brother."],["",""]],["firearm","'faiә'ɑ:m","n. 火器, 枪炮",["Gun makers have been able to escape responsibility for firearm violence.","Don't point a firearm at anyone you don't intend to shoot."],["",""]],["sermon","'sә:mәn","n. 说教, 启示, 布道",["The vicar often refers to the Bible in his sermon.","The church congregation was moved by the fine sermon."],["",""]],["refine","ri'fain","vt. 精炼, 净化, 使优雅, 使精炼\\nvi. 被精炼, 被净化",["Good day, lords. In what way can I refine upon my adroitness in aural comprehension?","A furnace is an enclosed chamber in which heat is produced to heat buildings, destroy refuse, smelt or refine ores, etc."],["早安，师傅。我应该怎么样提高听力能力？",""]],["volatile","'vɒlәtail","a. 挥发性的, 可变的, 不稳定的, 飞行的, 轻快的, 爆炸性的\\nn. 有翅动物, 挥发物\\n[计] 易失的",["The war on Iraq is a volatile subject of political debate; any wrong word and a heated argument could spark.","The current geopolitical situation is very volatile."],["",""]],["oval","'әuvәl","n. 椭圆形\\na. 卵形的, 椭圆形的",["On the heavy, polished table stood an oval glass dish decorated with little gilt swags.","One of the most popular sports in the world is certainly the one played with an oval ball."],["",""]],["mule","mju:l","n. 骡, 倔强之人",["The old man loaded his mule with bags full of sand.","I thought our boss was stubborn as a mule but actually he has his cute side."],["老人在骡子的背上放上了一个个装满了沙的袋子。",""]],["rigorous","'rigәrәs","a. 严厉的, 严酷的, 严格的, 苛刻的, 严密的, 精确的",["As I've already mentioned before, after a rigorous investigation, we have found nothing wrong with our company's management.","The top engineer put the car through a series of rigorous tests."],["正如我之前提到的，经过严格的调查后，我们发现公司的管理层没有任何问题。",""]],["linebacker","'lainbækә","n. 中后卫球员",["Tom is built like a linebacker."],[""]],["delighted","di'laitid","a. 高兴的, 快乐的",["The traveler was delighted at the sight of a light in the distance.","We're delighted to bring this game back for the start of a new era for the series."],["发现了远处的灯光的旅行者欢喜不已。","我們很高興能再次推出這款遊戲，並為系列作品開啟全新的階段。"]],["turf","tә:f","n. 草皮, 泥炭, 跑马场\\nvt. 覆草皮于",["We crossed the marshy bottom and passed over a quarter of a mile of dry, hard turf.","He doesn't like playing soccer on an artificial turf field."],["",""]],["hurdle","'hә:dl","n. 障碍, 跳栏, 临时活动篱笆\\nvt. 用篱笆围, 越过, 克服",["The biggest hurdle for pupils writing the exam was question fourteen.","I wish I could run too, but it's too much of a hurdle."],["",""]],["canoe","kә'nu:","n. 独木舟, 轻舟\\nvi. 乘独木舟\\nvt. 用独木舟运",["An accomplishment cannot be looked upon as yours unless you have paddled your own canoe.","A son who could not learn to paddle his own canoe does not deserve to inherit his father's fortune."],["",""]],["sturdy","'stә:di","a. 强健的, 健全的\\n[医] 羊晕倒病, 羊蹒跚病",["This kind of cloth is both cheap and sturdy.","The Indigenous people of North America fashioned sturdy, lightweight canoes from the bark of birch trees."],["这种布既便宜又结实。",""]],["broaden","'brɒ:dn","vi. 变宽, 扩大\\nvt. 放宽, 使扩大",["To broaden your view, go see the underground shopping mall beneath People's Square.","Broaden your horizon so that as you become more and more able to take care of yourself you will move intelligently."],["再要开眼界，去看人民广场下面的地下商场。",""]],["definitive","di'finitiv","n. 限定词\\na. 限定的, 决定性的",["There are no objectively definitive statistics about how many people have savant skills.","The results were not definitive, but I'm sure the DNA's a match."],["",""]],["workforce","","n. 劳动力；工人总数, 职工总数",["Management has threatened to lock out the workforce if they do not accept the proposed changes.","Agriculture continues to employ 80% of the workforce."],["",""]],["propel","prәu'pel","vt. 推进, 驱使\\n[机] 推进",["Going all out like this is going to propel me right into an all-or-nothing struggle.","Economic diversification will propel Algeria into the post-oil era."],["",""]],["voyage","'vɒiidʒ","n. 航行, 航海, 航程, 旅行, 航空\\nvi. 航海, 航行\\nvt. 航行越过, 飞过",["The voyage from England to India used to take 6 months.","The Titanic's maiden voyage didn't go so well."],["從英國乘船到印度，以前需要六個月的時間。","泰塔尼克号的处女航不是很好的。"]],["parsley","'pɑ:sli","n. 皱叶欧芹, 荷兰芹\\n[医] 绉叶石蛇床",["The herb used in that pasta sauce might be parsley.","In this soup there are carrots, onions, parsley, celery and potatoes."],["用於那個義大利醬的香草可能是荷蘭芹。","這個湯裏有胡蘿蔔、洋蔥、歐芹、芹菜和土豆。"]],["replicate","'replikeit","vt. 折叠, 折转, 复制\\nn. 复现试验, 复制品, 高八度音\\na. 复现的, 复制的, 折转的, 弯回的",["Many companies are trying to replicate TikTok's success.","I tried to replicate Adriano's steak recipe, but it wasn't the same."],["",""]],["distort","dis'tɒ:t","vt. 扭曲, 歪曲\\n[法] 歪区, 曲解, 纂改",["Five minutes after I took the pill, the world was beginning to distort.","The truth is incontrovertible. Panic may resent it, ignorance may deride it, malice may distort it, but there it is."],["",""]],["scoop","sku:p","n. 铲子, 勺子, 穴, 口, 独家新闻\\nvt. 汲取, 舀取, 挖空, 抢先报道",["I just use a spoon to scoop out my ice cream instead of using an ice cream scoop.","We enjoyed a slice of cake with a scoop of ice cream."],["",""]],["swift","swift","n. 褐雨燕, 快速爬行的小蜥蜴, 蝙蝠蛾, 大滚筒\\na. 迅速的, 快的, 敏捷的, 立刻的\\nadv. 迅速地, 敏捷地",["Shareholders were concerned about the company's swift expansion overseas.","A common swift can spend its first two or three years on the wing before breeding, and making its first ever landing."],["",""]],["overweight","'әuvә'weit","n. 超过重量, 过重, 优势\\na. 超过重量的, 超重的\\nvt. 使超重, 重于, 过于重视",["I'm not the only one who thinks Tom is overweight.","Sixty-nine percent of adult Americans are either overweight or obese."],["觉得汤姆肥的人不止我一个。","69%的美国成人超重或肥胖。"]],["advancement","әd'vɑ:nsmәnt","n. 前进, 进步, 提升\\n[医] 徙前术",["The advancement of modern medicine was a long process.","His poor educational background was not a bar to his advancement."],["",""]],["basics","","n. 最简单但最重要的部分, 基本, 基础训练",["Vowelizing letters is one of the basics of writing in the Arabic language.","With most of the arts, if you don't get the basics down properly then it is difficult to acquire further skills."],["為字母添加元音是阿拉伯語書寫的基礎之一。",""]],["undo",".ʌn'du:","vt. 解开, 取消, 破坏, 毁灭, 扰乱\\nvi. 松开\\n[计] 撤消",["Undo the wrapper carefully so as not to damage the jelly baby.","Don't undo your bootlaces until you have seen the river."],["",""]],["tab","tæb","n. 制表(键), 搭襻, 标号, 调整片, (易拉罐)拉环, 帐单, 标签, 制表符\\n[计] 标签, 制表符, TAB键",["Put everything on my tab. I'll settle it when I check out.","I can't change this sentence because there is no edit tab."],["",""]],["stalk","stɒ:k","n. 茎, 追踪, 高视阔步\\nvi. 悄悄靠近, 蹑手蹑脚地走近, 蔓延, 高视阔步\\nvt. 追踪, 搜索",["Thoreau coveted the plant's strong purple stalk for a cane, and the robins eat its dark crimson-juiced berries.","The stalk is a little bigger around than your little finger."],["梭羅垂涎於這種植物強壯的紫色莖稈，將其製成藤條，而知更鳥則以深紅色汁液的漿果為食。",""]],["intimidate","in'timideit","vt. 威胁, 恐吓\\n[法] 恐吓, 威胁, 使恐惧",["Rodrigo's online bullies sought to isolate and intimidate him on the website.","Don't let other pets bother or intimidate your tortoise."],["",""]],["goddess","'gɒdis","n. 女神, 美女, 受崇拜的女性",["Pachamama is a goddess of earth and fertility revered by the indigenous peoples of the Andes.","I am the last remaining worshipper of the goddess Demeter."],["帕查瑪瑪是安地斯山脈土著居民敬仰的大地和生育女神。",""]],["verge","vә:dʒ","n. 边缘, 边界, 起始点\\nvi. 处在边缘, 接近, 下沉, 趋向",["In adolescence, I hated life and was continually on the verge of suicide, from which, however, I was restrained by the desire to know more mathematics.","He was just on the verge of going to sleep."],["在青春期，我厌倦生活，并持续陷入自杀的边缘。然而，在那期间，对数学知识的渴望，使我抑制住了那些负面情绪。","他快要睡了。"]],["plague","pleig","n. 瘟疫, 天罚, 麻烦, 灾祸\\nvt. 折磨, 使苦恼, 使得灾祸",["More often than not, famine is accompanied by plague.","Tom has been avoiding me like the plague ever since he borrowed my car."],["",""]],["sergeant","'sɑ:dʒәnt","n. 警察小队长, 军士",["Layla was serving as a sergeant in the US armed forces.","Yanni was never in the military but he acts like a drill sergeant."],["",""]],["batch","bætʃ","n. 一次所烘的面包, 一次所制之量, 一组, 批, 成批, 分批\\nv. 成批, 分批处理\\n[计] 一批",["The third batch of vaccines provided by China to Colombia has arrived in Bogota, the capital of Colombia.","There were nineteen graduates for the batch of Spanish class."],["中国向哥伦比亚提供的第三批疫苗运抵哥伦比亚首都波哥大。",""]],["grandson","'grændsʌn","n. 孙子, 外孙",["Perhaps my grandson will be the first person to land on Mars.","It is said that Peng Zu was the grandson of a celestial emperor."],["可能我的孙子会是登陆火星的第一人。","传说彭祖是天帝的孙子。"]],["lace","leis","n. 饰带, 花边, 缎带, 鞋带\\nvt. 结带子, 饰以花边\\nvi. 系带子\\n[计] 全穿孔",["She has this pretty lace nightgown with straps.","The two boys, aged respectively fourteen and sixteen, were dressed in the army uniform, and wore gold-lace sergeant's chevrons upon their sleeves."],["她的這件吊帶蕾絲睡衣很漂亮。","这两个男孩，一个14岁、一个16岁，都穿着军队制服，衣袖上佩戴着镶金色蕾丝边的中士袖章。"]],["bipartisan","bai,pɑ:ti'zæn","a. 两党连立的",["The bipartisan commission's recommendations were ignored.","Absent sustained and vociferous public outcry, President Barack Obama's call for a bipartisan budget deal may fall on deaf ears."],["",""]],["deter","di'tә:","vt. 制止, 吓住, 威慑",["Ukraine's drones failed to deter Russia's assault.","It couldn't deter my unwavering determination to succeed."],["",""]],["smoker","'smәukә","n. 吸烟者, 吸烟的人, 吸烟车厢, (美)(非正式)蒸汽火车头",["Kissing a smoker is like licking an ashtray.","It transpired that the fire was caused by a careless smoker."],["亲吻一个抽烟的人就像在舔烟灰缸。",""]],["expire","ik'spaiә","vi. 期满, 呼气, 断气\\nvt. 呼出",["This insurance contract will expire at the end of the month.","My driver's license will expire next week."],["",""]],["catastrophe","kә'tæstrәfi","n. 大灾难, 大祸\\n[化] 突变",["Due to the catastrophe caused by the huge tsunami, damage was sustained by the nuclear reactor as well as explosions at the nuclear power plant.","One can't discount a global natural catastrophe like a meteor strike."],["由于特大海啸的灾害，核能融炉遭受损害，造成了原子能发电站爆炸。",""]],["adjacent","ә'dʒeisәnt","a. 毗连的, 邻近的, 连接的\\n[机] 相邻的, 邻位的, 交界的",["The stadium is adjacent to the school.","The living room is adjacent to the dining room."],["體育場毗鄰學校。","客廳緊鄰著餐廳。"]],["withhold","wið'hәuld","vt. 使停止, 扣留, 保留, 拒给\\nvi. 克制, 忍住",["Withhold not good from them to whom it is due, when it is in the power of thine hand to do it.","Do not withhold Your tender mercies from me, O Lord."],["",""]],["messy","'mesi","a. 散乱的, 污秽的, 麻烦的",["The entire family lives there in a messy apartment.","I don't like messy places like this. I'd rather live somewhere clean and peaceful."],["",""]],["privatization","","[计] 私有化",["It was disappointing to hear about the privatization of Chilean copper.","Algeria is making large efforts to move towards privatization."],["",""]],["unpredictable",".ʌnpri'diktәbl","a. 不可预知的",["This week the weather was very unpredictable.","The accident was caused chiefly by the unpredictable weather."],["本週天氣變化無常。",""]],["ivory","'aivәri","n. 象牙, 乳白色\\na. 象牙制的, 乳白色的",["The economist and statistician based in Ivory Coast says commercial trade in the region is primarily conducted with France.","Ivory Coast is the world's biggest cocoa producer."],["這位常駐科特迪瓦的經濟學家兼統計學家表示，該地區的商業貿易主要與法國進行。",""]],["embryo","'embriәu","n. 胚胎, 胎儿, 胚芽\\n[医] 胚, 胚胎",["The point at which an embryo becomes a fetus has apparently been chosen arbitrarily.","A developing embryo connects to the placenta via the umbilical cord."],["",""]],["coincide",".kәuin'said","vi. 一致, 符合\\n[化] 重合",["Publication of the article was timed to coincide with the professor's birthday.","It's clear that our arguments don't coincide at all."],["文章的发表被预定在教授生日那天。",""]],["diagnostic","daiәg'nɒstik","a. 诊断的, 有助于诊断的, 特征的\\nn. 诊断, 病的征候, 诊断法\\n[计] 诊断的",["The sphygmomanometer is an important diagnostic instrument.","We use the latest diagnostic and treatment methods."],["",""]],["decorative","'dekәreitiv","a. 装饰性的",["There was a decorative pilaster to either side of the building's entrance.","Women are a decorative sex. They never have anything to say, but they say it charmingly."],["",""]],["stark","stɑ:k","a. 僵硬的, 完全的, 刻板的, 明显的, 荒凉的, 结实的\\nadv. 突出地, 简直, 全然",["There is a stark contrast between China's order and the chaos of the West.","My little brother ran through the living room stark naked."],["中国之治与西方之乱形成了鲜明的对比。","我弟弟全身光溜溜地跑過客廳。"]],["lucrative","'lu:krәtiv","a. 有利益的, 获利的, 合算的",["Several more companies are moving to enter the lucrative pet food market of the country.","Mexican drug cartels are vying over lucrative drug-trafficking routes to the U.S."],["",""]],["transcend","træn'send","vt. 超越, 胜过",["Love and companionship can transcend traditional mating norms.","Individuals have international duties which transcend the national obligations of obedience."],["",""]],["rag","ræg","n. 碎布, 抹布, 碎片, 碎屑, 少量, 破旧衣服\\nvt. 责骂, 揶揄, 戏弄\\nvi. 喧闹",["After Tom wiped the table with a dirty rag, it looked dirtier than before.","Don't talk to him about politics because it's like a red rag to a bull."],["",""]],["resistant","ri'zistәnt","n. 抵抗者, 反抗者\\na. 抵抗的, 反抗的, 耐...的",["Some persons appear to be resistant to HIV infection.","This is a two-seater sofa using stain-resistant artificial leather."],["",""]],["violin",".vaiә'lin","n. 小提琴",["Specialists are people who have only one string on their violin.","You should practice playing the violin every day."],["專家就好像一台只有一根弦的小提琴一樣。","你應該每天練習拉小提琴。"]],["promptly","'prɒmptli","adv. 敏捷地, 迅速地",["Any orders you place with us will be processed promptly.","Would you please replace the broken one promptly?"],["","请快点把碎了的那个换掉好吗？"]],["expanded","ik'spendid","a. 扩充的；展开的",["The imports from Asian countries have expanded recently.","We thought their shop was a failure, but now they've gotten out from under and even expanded."],["最近，来自亚洲各国的进口额不断扩大。",""]],["escort","'eskɒ:t","n. 护送者, 护卫者, 护航舰\\nvt. 护卫, 护送",["Everyone knows that an escort service offers more than a good massage.","The bus driver didn't stop at any bus stops, but continued until he arrived in Boston with a police escort."],["",""]],["dedicated","'dedikeitid","a. 专注的, 献身的",["The mandatory character of schooling is rarely analyzed in the multitude of works dedicated to the study of the various ways to develop within children the desire to learn.","Do you know which deity this temple is dedicated to?"],["許多著作都致力於研究開發小孩學習慾望的方式，但其中很少會有作品分析學校教育的強制性角色。","您知道这座庙宇供奉的是哪个神吗？"]],["reopen",".ri:'әupәn","v. 重开, 再开始, 再开",["A historical landmark has been restored and will reopen.","Algeria should reopen to welcome international visitors."],["一座歷史地標已經修復並將重新開放。",""]],["homosexuality","-'æliti","n. 同性恋\\n[医] 同性性欲, 同性恋爱",["This TV show tackles issues of teenage pregnancy and homosexuality.","According to Islamic principles, homosexuality is wrong morally speaking."],["",""]],["stall","stɒ:l","n. 厩, 停车处, 牧师职位, 货摊, 托辞, 拖延\\nvt. 关入厩, 停顿, 推托, 支吾, 使陷于泥中\\nvi. 被关在厩内, 陷…",["For years he has been at the market every Tuesday morning with his fish stall.","I bought this old clock at an antique stall in the market."],["他在街市賣魚賣了許多年了，這些年來每逢星期二都會在街市見到他。",""]],["detention","di'tenʃәn","n. 阻止, 监禁, 拘留\\n[医] 隔离, 拘留, 滞留, 停滞",["Tom and John concocted a plan to escape from the detention camp.","No one shall be subjected to arbitrary arrest, detention or exile."],["",""]],["liar","'laiә","n. 说谎者",["You may call him a liar, but you cannot call him a bad man.","That just goes to prove that you are a liar."],["你可以說他是個騙子, 但是你不能稱他為壞人。","这正可以说明您是个骗子。"]],["talking","'tɒ:kiŋ","a. 说话的, 多嘴的, 富有表情的\\nn. 讲话, 谈论",["I enjoyed talking with you this evening very much.","I'm not talking to you; I'm talking to the monkey."],["今晚我非常享受和你的聊天。","我不是在跟你說話，我在跟猴子說話。"]],["southeastern","sauθ'i:stәn","a. 东南方的",["Zhejiang Province is located on the southeastern coast of China and belongs to the East China region.","The Beja live in the southeastern corner of Egypt."],["浙江省地处中国东南沿海，隶属于华东地区。",""]],["elicit","i'lisit","vt. 引出, 推导出, 引起",["It seems like they resorted to a strategy meant to elicit sympathy.","Narcissists often play the victim card to elicit sympathy and manipulate others into feeling sorry for them."],["",""]],["fascination",".fæsi'neiʃәn","n. 令人着迷的事物, 入迷, 魅力",["As long as war is regarded as wicked, it will always have its fascination. When it is looked upon as vulgar, it will cease to be popular.","Rodrigo felt a mix of fascination and slight unease towards spiders."],["当人们认为战争残酷时，它还是很吸引人的。当人们认为战争粗俗时，它就没那么受欢迎了。",""]],["pact","pækt","n. 契约, 协定, 条约\\n[化] 合同",["They still attacked us, despite clearly agreeing to sign the non-aggression pact.","We made a pact that we wouldn't abandon one another."],["明明签订了互不侵犯条约，竟然还来攻击我们。",""]],["hull","hʌl","n. 壳, 皮, 船体\\nvt. 去壳",["The alien shot his ray gun and blasted a hole in the spaceship's hull.","The artist painted a vibrant mural on the ship's hull, making it unique and captivating."],["",""]],["em","em","[计] 媒体用毕符\\n[化] 射气",["Put your hands up here and get' em wet.","Em dashes were named after Dorothy's aunt."],["",""]],["contender","kәn'tendә(r)","n. 参赛者, 争论者, 斗争者, 竞争者",["The Capricorn zodiac sign is a great contender for holding the world's best zodiac sign title.","Capricorn is a great contender for holding the title of the meanest zodiac sign of all time."],["",""]],["oblige","ә'blaidʒ","vt. 强制, 施恩惠于, 使感激\\nvi. 施恩惠, 帮忙",["You would oblige me by bringing with you your very excellent field-glass.","The law does not oblige companies to provide this information."],["",""]],["vest","vest","n. 背心, 汗背心\\nvt. 使穿衣服, 授予\\nvi. 穿衣服, 归属",["You need to reverse your vest, it's back to front.","Tom was wearing a bulletproof vest, so the bullet didn't kill him."],["你的背心前后反了，得翻过来。","湯姆穿著一件防彈衣，所以子彈沒把他殺死。"]],["inquire","in'kwaiә","v. 询问, 问明, 查究",["She had the courage to go and inquire about the results of the exam.","I will inquire about the matter after I return home."],["她有勇气去查询考试的结果。",""]],["bust","bʌst","n. 半身像, 胸部, 失败, 殴打\\nvt. 使爆裂, 使破产\\nvi. 爆裂, 破产\\n[计] 操作错",["A bust of Aristotle stands on a pedestal in the entryway.","Grishkin is nice: her Russian eye is underlined for emphasis; uncorseted, her friendly bust gives promise of pneumatic bliss."],["",""]],["signify","'signifai","vt. 象征, 预示\\nvi. 要紧, 重要",["This is because you approach everything as a total person, with no loose ends hanging out to signify divided intentions.","Religions are like languages. They use different words to signify the same concept."],["这是因为你总是全身心处理每一件事情，没有让鸡毛蒜皮的问题分散了你的目标。",""]],["prestige","pre'sti:ʒ","n. 声望, 威望, 威信\\n[经] 商誉, 声誉",["In Tuareg society, owning a thousand camels commands respect and prestige.","Several universities in this country enjoy great prestige."],["",""]],["bolster","'bәulstә","n. 支持, 长枕\\nvt. 支持, 支撑",["Anti-foreign sentiment is often stoked by the Chinese government in order to bolster cheap nationalism.","It's amazing how a single compliment can bolster one's confidence for so long."],["",""]],["elevation",".eli'veiʃәn","n. 海拔, 提高, 仰角\\n[计] 仰角",["Melanoma's ABCDE stands for: Asymmetry, irregular borders, changing color, great diameter, and elevation above the skin.","Elevation is the process of becoming our best selves."],["",""]],["loved","lʌvd","v. 热爱（love的过去分词）",["Better to be hated for who you are than loved for who you're not.","She married John, not because she loved him, but because he was a rich man."],["宁愿做自己而被人讨厌，也不要因为虚假而被人喜欢。","她嫁了 John，不是因為愛他，而是因為 John 是個有錢人。"]],["linguistic","liŋ'^wistik","a. 语言的, 语言学的\\n[计] 语言的, 语言学的",["The zodiac culture is deeply rooted in people's daily life and linguistic culture.","Using Esperanto with him, I sense that we both are at the same level, at least from a linguistic point of view."],["生肖文化深深植根於人們的日常生活和語言文化中。","我和他用世界語溝通，覺得最少從語言的觀點來看，我和他的程度是差不多的。"]],["splash","splæʃ","n. 飞溅, 污点, 一点儿, 溅泼声, 色斑\\nvi. 溅湿, 溅开, 飞溅\\nvt. 溅, 泼, 使溅起水, 洒, 使成斑驳状",["Children enjoy making a splash in the water as they come off a waterslide.","Kenny, Aaron, and Paul are so rowdy in the kiddie pool that they can never avoid having water splash out."],["",""]],["vibrant","'vaibrәnt","a. 振动的, 战栗的, 响亮的, 活跃的",["This tie has a more vibrant color and goes better with this suit.","While taking a walk, Tom enjoyed the autumn leaves in vibrant red and orange."],["这条领带颜色亮一点，跟这件西装比较配。",""]],["sensibility",".sensi'biliti","n. 感性, 感觉, 情感\\n[医] 感觉性, 感受性; 感觉, 感觉能力",["I don't know how to draw, nor do I have the sensibility of an artist.","I can't compete with the delicate sensibility of Tom."],["",""]],["parole","pә'rәul","n. 假释, 誓言, 释放宣言\\nvt. 宣誓后释放, 使假释出狱",["For the crime of first degree murder, this court hereby sentences you to life in prison without the possibility of parole.","Tom was sentenced to life in prison without parole."],["",""]],["backdrop","'bækdrɒp","n. 背景幕, 背景",["In the leaden backdrop of the dawn, the horseman stands in silence, the long mane of his horse, disheveled by the wind.","Mary's white bridal gown against the backdrop of the white marble wall virtually made her disappear."],["",""]],["reformer","ri'fɒ:mә","n. 改革家, 改革运动者\\n[化] 转化炉; 转化器; 重整器; 重整炉",["Many now remember Giscard as a reformer and a champion of European unity.","The reformer for whom the world is not good enough finds himself shoulder to shoulder with him that is not good enough for the world."],["",""]],["happening","'hæpәniŋ","n. 事件, 意外发生的事",["As the train came to a halt, all of the passengers wondered what was happening.","I cannot believe what's happening in front of my eyes."],["当列车停止时，所有的乘客都想知道发生了什么。","我不敢相信眼前发生的这一切。"]],["poetic","pәu'etik","a. 诗的, 诗意的, 诗人的",["Sami, a rock singer, was more pathetic than poetic.","Mary always greatly enjoyed reading Tom's poetic letters."],["",""]],["modeling","'mɔdliŋ","n. 模特儿职业, 立体感\\n[计] 建模, 模型化, 模拟",["Sami's modeling started conflicting with his classes.","Sami's modeling job started conflicting with his classes."],["",""]],["interrogation","in.terәu'geiʃәn","n. 审问, 疑问句, 问号\\n[电] 询问",["He kept silent all the time during the interrogation.","Sami was caught and brought back to the interrogation room."],["",""]],["shooter","'ʃu:tә","n. 射手, 狩猎者, 手枪",["I'm a straight shooter, and most of the time my ego doesn't interrupt my relationships.","The police don't yet know anything about the shooter."],["",""]],["scoring","'skɔ:riŋ","[化] 擦伤; 划伤",["Messi was very close to scoring a goal, but the referee blew his whistle to say that he was offside.","The opposition formed a line in the box to try and block Messi from scoring."],["梅西差一点就进球了，但裁判吹哨说他越位。","对方球员在禁区内组成一道防线，试图阻截梅西的射门。"]],["stain","stein","n. 污染, 污点, 着色剂\\nvt. 沾染, 染污, 着色\\nvi. 变脏",["My blue dress appeared with a blood stain.","Grief on the face is better than the stain in the heart."],["我的藍色洋裝上出現了血跡。",""]],["sticker","'stikә","n. 屠夫, 尖刀, 刺, 芒, 尖物, 携带尖刀者, 张贴物, 滞销品, (非正式)难题\\n[经] 呆滞商品",["Yanni is using the razor blade very carefully to take the sticker off.","I'll give you an even better deal than the sticker price."],["",""]],["imminent","'iminәnt","a. 即将来临的, 逼近的",["According to the radio, a storm is imminent in the North.","The President's words overshadowed the imminent threat of Global Warming."],["",""]],["foil","fɒil","n. 箔, 烘托, 衬托\\nvt. 贴箔于, 衬托, 阻止, 挡开, 挫败",["Make balls 3 centimeters in diameter and place them on a sheet of buttered aluminum foil.","I finished off one half of the pizza and wrapped the other half in aluminum foil and put it in the fridge."],["",""]],["alpha","'ælfә","n. 希腊字母表的第一个字母, 最初, 开端\\n[医] α(希腊文的第一个字母), 甲种",["Alpha, beta and gamma are Greek letters.","I am the Alpha and the Omega, the first and the last, the beginning and the end."],["阿尔法、贝塔和咖玛是希腊文字。",""]],["flawed","","a. 有缺陷的；有裂纹的；有瑕疵的",["It's when you teach foreigners Chinese that you realize just how flawed your own Chinese is.","I am a flawed person, but these are flaws that can easily be fixed."],["教外国人中文的时候才会发现自己中文有多差。",""]],["geographical","dʒiә'græfikl","a. 地理学的, 地理的",["From above, the Earth looks like a geographical map.","The geographical features here are similar to those of our prefecture."],["",""]],["publishing","'pʌbliʃiŋ","n. 出版, 刊印, 发行",["After today, I want to send the manuscript to a publishing house.","The authenticity of the documents was checked before publishing them."],["天好以后，我要把稿子送到出版社去。",""]],["rude","ru:d","a. 粗鲁无礼的, 粗陋的, 粗暴的, 原始的, 未开化的, 大略的, 崎岖不平的, 狂暴的",["Jane is fat and rude, and smokes too much. However, Ken thinks she's lovely and charming. That's why they say love is blind.","You should not be rude towards beauties and you should not waste good wine. You must keep these two things in mind in the future."],["Jane 又胖、又沒禮貌、又煙不離手，可是 Ken 卻覺得她可愛、動人，所謂「愛情是盲目的」，大概就是這個意思了吧。","佳人不可唐突，好酒不可糟蹋，这两件事你以后一定要牢记在心。"]],["backwards","'bækwәdz","adv. 向后",["Life can only be understood backwards, but it must be lived forwards.","They are going forwards and I am always going backwards."],["只有向后看才能理解生活，但要生活得好，则必须向前看。","他们往前走而我一直都在往后退。"]],["bearing","'bєәriŋ","n. 举止, 轴承, 忍受, 关系, 意义, 方向, 生育\\n[化] 轴承",["It has some bearing on this problem.","Charles Walcot investigated the magnetic compass bearing sense in pigeons."],["它和這個問題有點關係。",""]],["unveil",".ʌn'veil","vt. 揭开, 揭幕, 除去...的面纱\\nvi. 显露, 除去面纱",["The automaker will unveil its new line of sports cars tomorrow.","In order to unveil the international language, each lexical item should be written separately."],["",""]],["frustrated","frʌ'streitid","a. 失意的, 挫败的；泄气的",["The frustrated artist stomped on his failed painting, leaving a trail of shattered colors.","How frustrated must a person be to commit suicide?"],["畫家失望地踐踏失敗之作，留下一片混亂的色彩。","一个人得遇到多大的挫折才会自杀？"]],["clap","klæp","n. 拍手, 拍手声, 霹雳声, 花柳病\\nv. 鼓掌, (使)啪地关上",["Tom tried to start a slow clap, but nobody joined in.","There was the sound of a clap of thunder in my ears."],["",""]],["landlord","'lændlɒ:d","n. 房东, 地主\\n[经] 业主, 地主, 房东",["Why hasn't the landlord come to collect rent this month?","Why did my sixty-year-old landlord buy a trampoline?"],["为什么这个月房东还不来收房租？","我的六十岁的房东为什么买了一个蹦床？"]],["uncommon",".ʌn'kɒmәn","a. 不寻常的, 非凡的, 罕有的\\nadv. 不平常地",["A six-figure income is not uncommon for physicians.","It's not uncommon for a divorced couple to marry each other again some years after their initial divorce."],["",""]],["bunker","'bʌŋkә","n. 煤仓, 沙坑, 暗堡\\nvt. 击入沙坑, 使陷入困境",["Seeing shafts of light piercing the fog, Tom's mother-in-law opened fire from her sofa fort bunker.","Stefan discovered an underground bunker in the woods."],["",""]],["accepted","әk'septid","a. 公认的, 一般承认的\\n[经] 已承兑, 已认付",["He thought she spoke reasonably, so he accepted her suggestion.","Six people applied for this job, but none of them was accepted."],["他觉得她说得很有道理，于是接受了她的建议。","六个人投了这份工作，但他们中没有一个被录用。"]],["animated","'ænimeitid","a. 活生生的, 能活动的, 活泼的, 欢快的",["\"My new animated movie is called 'Stretchie: End of Clays Part II,'\" said Tom.","The students were animated by the agitator's appeal."],["湯姆說：「我推出的全新動畫電影叫做《伸展世界：黏土的末日 (下)》。」",""]],["deepen","'dipәn","vi. 深化\\nvt. 使加深, 使强烈",["The purpose of this text is to deepen the understanding of black culture.","He went to Britain to deepen his knowledge of the culture."],["",""]],["enduring","in'djuәriŋ","a. 持久的, 忍耐的",["I thank You, living and enduring King, Who has returned my spirit to me with compassion. Great is Your trust.","This is so enduring as to make even the most diligent worker give up."],["",""]],["amusement","ә'mju:zmәnt","n. 兴味, 娱乐, 消遣\\n[法] 娱乐, 娱乐活动",["I was thinking of going to the amusement park with my friends, but I was a bit worried that the weather would get worse.","He had time to lose himself in his favorite amusement."],["我原本打算和朋友一起去遊樂園，但有點擔心天氣會變差。",""]],["curb","kә:b","n. 抑制, 勒马绳, 边石\\nvt. 抑制, 束缚, 勒住",["The committee called on all nations to work side-by-side to curb air pollution.","Excessive reliance on monetary policy in an attempt to curb inflation could unnecessarily constrain credit and hence business."],["",""]],["implicit","im'plisit","a. 暗示的, 含蓄的, 固有的, 绝对的\\n[经] 不讲明的, 含蓄的",["We had an implicit agreement that we would support each other.","That's implicit. You don't need to state it explicitly."],["",""]],["anthropology",".ænθrә'pɒlәdʒi","n. 人类学\\n[医] 人类学",["I'm an anthropology research student, and my topic is 'Chinese medicine in Britain'.","He is hailed as the father of modern anthropology."],["我是人类学的研究学生，课题是“中医在英国”。",""]],["conquer","'kɒŋkә","vt. 克服, 征服, 战胜\\nvi. 得胜",["The Romans would never have had the chance to conquer the world if they had first been required to study Latin.","When there was despair in the dust bowl and depression across the land, she saw a nation conquer fear itself with a New Deal, new jobs, a new sense of common purpose. Yes, we can."],["羅馬人如果必須先學拉丁文的話，是沒有機會征服世界的。","当30年代的沙尘暴和大萧条使人们感到绝望时，她看到一个国家用新政、新的就业机会以及对新目标的共同追求战胜恐慌。是的，我们能做到。"]],["crouch","'krautʃ","n. 蹲伏, 蜷缩\\nvi. 蹲下, 蜷着, 缩着\\nvt. 低头",["If you just crouch a little, her crotch can just be seen flicking in and out of sight.","If you just crouch a little, the signal flag can just be seen flicking in and out of sight."],["",""]],["interestingly","'intristiŋli","adv. 有趣地",["Voiceless screaming was interestingly represented through music notation by Alfred Schnittke: \"silence fortissimo\".","Interestingly, the way we understand words is not always that obvious."],["",""]],["dictator","'dikteitә","n. 命令者, 独裁者",["The poor people were at the mercy of the cruel dictator.","The notorious dictator abused his privileges to his heart's content."],["可憐的人民任憑殘暴的獨裁者處置。",""]],["composite","kәm'pɒzit","a. 合成的, 混合成的, 菊科的\\nn. 合成物, 复合材料, 菊科",["This piece is made of a composite material that I cannot identify.","After experimenting in their garage workshops, they created new, natural composite materials."],["",""]],["unlimited",".ʌn'limitid","a. 无限的, 不受限制的, 无条件的\\n[经] 无限的, 不定的",["English is the language of unlimited possibilities.","Hollywood guns have unlimited ammo, so of course all the bad guys can afford to be such bad shots."],["",""]],["therapeutic",".θerә'pju:tik","a. 治疗的, 有益于健康的\\n[医] 治疗的; 治疗学的",["Ziri and Rima have a purely therapeutic relationship.","Ziri, an experience therapist, made a serious therapeutic mistake. He started dating one of his patients."],["",""]],["fetch","fetʃ","n. 取得, 拿, 诡计, 魂\\nvt. 接来, 取来, 售得, 带来, 推出, 引出, 杀死, 吸引, 到达\\nvi. 取物, 前进\\n…",["Martin, this shit just got real. Fetch the chainsaw.","Can you fetch the children from school?"],["","你能去学校接小孩吗？"]],["inhale","in'heil","vt. 吸入\\nvi. 吸气",["I don't like to inhale someone's smoke while I'm working.","The doctor told me to inhale and exhale slowly and deeply."],["",""]],["genetically","","adv. 创始, 遗传学, 生殖, 基因, 遗传, 发生",["Many consumers are concerned about the health risks of genetically modified food.","These genetically modified bananas are loaded with vitamin A."],["",""]],["forthcoming","'fɒ:θ'kʌmɑŋ","a. 即将来临的\\nn. 来临",["Even after several complaints, no response was forthcoming.","The pupils are looking forward to the forthcoming excursion."],["",""]],["circular","'sә:kjulә","a. 圆形的, 循环的, 间接的\\n[医] 环状的, 循环的",["The house looks circular, but it isn't a complete circle.","Only in philosophy can you use a circular argument and get praised for it."],["",""]],["siren","'saiәrin","n. 女海妖, 妖女, 警报器, 汽笛, 迷人的美女\\na. 诱惑的\\nvi. 响着警报器前进",["The bandits ran away when they heard the police siren.","The ambulance is travelling with its siren and blue light on."],["",""]],["vacant","'veikәnt","a. 空的, 空白的, 空虚的, 空闲的, 茫然的, 空缺的\\n[法] 空的, 空虚的, 闲暇的",["Rooms should be left vacant by eleven a.m. on the day of departure.","There were several rooms still vacant."],["走的那天，房间11点要空出来。","还有几间空房。"]],["width","widθ","n. 宽度, 宽广, 广博\\n[医] 宽度",["On some OS's you get gibberish for filenames with full-width characters so when downloading please change to a suitable filename.","The width of the road is insufficient for safe driving."],["一些操作系统上有全角字符的文件名会显示为乱码，所以下载时请改成适当的文件名。",""]],["greed","gri:d","n. 贪欲, 贪婪",["Although he had many toys, his greed made him want more.","The seven deadly sins are: pride, envy, greed, anger, lust, gluttony and sloth."],["",""]],["environmentally","","adv. 有关环境方面",["More and more environmentalists advocate and use environmentally friendly unleaded petrol in cars.","Solar power is environmentally friendly."],["越来越多的环保者开始宣传和使用以环保的无铅汽油为燃料的汽车。","太陽能有益於環保。"]],["deaf","def","a. 聋的\\n[医] 聋的",["It requires wisdom to understand wisdom: the music is nothing if the audience is deaf.","Kindness is the language which the deaf can hear and the blind can see."],["要用智慧来理解智慧：如果听众是聋的话，那音乐什么都不是。","善良是聾子能聽盲人能看的語言。"]],["hillside","'hilsaid","n. 山坡, 山腹",["The hillside had torrential flooding from the west.","The building which stands on the hillside is our school."],["山坡让滔滔的洪水往西流。",""]],["incoming","'inkʌmiŋ","a. 进来的, 刚开始的, 新来的\\nn. 进来",["Incoming mail can be sorted by name, date, or title.","Sami and Layla were incoming freshmen."],["",""]],["referendum",".refә'rendәm","n. （就重大政治或社会问题进行的）全民公决，全民投票",["The government put the question to the people in a referendum.","In any case, you need to vote \"yes\" in the February 18th referendum."],["",""]],["complement","'kɒmplimәnt","n. 补足物, 补语, 补数\\nvt. 补充, 补足\\n[计] 补码; 反相器; 补数",["A complete intransitive verb takes neither complement nor object.","In English, the usual sentence structure is Subject - Verb - Object/Complement."],["一个完完全全的不及物动词既没有补语，又没有宾语。",""]],["weary","'wiәri","a. 疲倦的, 萎靡的, 厌倦的, 厌烦的\\nvt. 使疲倦, 使厌烦\\nvi. 疲乏, 生厌, 不耐烦",["A foolish head makes for weary feet.","I'm astonished, wall, that you haven't collapsed into ruins, since you're holding up the weary verse of so many poets."],["愚笨的頭腦使腿受苦。",""]],["fastest","","a. 最快速的（far 的最高级）",["Even the fastest runner in the world cannot run if he is hungry.","For the UK's fastest growing city after London, this is good news."],["就算是全世界跑得最快的人，也要吃飽了才跑得動。","对于仅次于伦敦、发展第二快的城市，这是个好消息。"]],["allocate","'ælәukeit","vt. 分派, 分配\\n[计] 分配",["A committee of experts determines how to allocate the money.","The Algerian government needs to allocate more funds for local development."],["",""]],["lush","lʌʃ","a. 苍翠繁茂的, 多青草的, 丰富的\\nn. 酒, 酒鬼\\nv. 饮",["A Himalayan country of lush mountains, Bhutan is known as the world's last Shangri-la.","This land is covered by a verdant carpet of lush vegetation."],["",""]],["probable","'prɒbәbl","a. 很可能的, 大概的, 可信的\\nn. 很有希望的候选人, 很可能的事情",["It is highly probable that the deletion of element C will still yield the same result.","When will the most probable hypothetical accident occur?"],["很有可能去掉C元素会得出同样的结果。","最大可能假想事故什么时候会发生？"]],["mourn","mɒ:n","v. 哀悼, 忧伤, 服丧",["The mountain passes are hard to cross; who will mourn for those who have lost their way? Meeting by chance like drifting duckweed, we are all but travelers in a foreign land.","God's inhumanity to man makes countless thousands mourn."],["關山難越，誰悲失路之人。萍水相逢，盡是他鄉之客。",""]],["millionaire",".miljә'nєә","n. 百万富翁, 大富豪\\n[经] 大资本家, 巨富, 百万富翁",["He was a millionaire a long time ago.","The millionaire insisted on acquiring the masterpiece no matter how much it cost."],["很久以前，他是一個百萬富翁。",""]],["arguably","'ɑ:ɡjuәbli","adv. 可论证地；可争辩地；正如可提出证据加以证明的那样地",["This place is arguably the best restaurant in London.","Language was invented to convey meaning. It's arguably the most direct form of human communication."],["",""]],["scarce","skɑ:s","a. 难得的, 稀罕的, 缺乏的",["Telephone booths are as scarce as hen's teeth around here.","In today's world, possessions are plentiful, but time is scarce."],["這裏附近的電話亭少得可憐。",""]],["charitable","'tʃæritәbl","a. 大慈大悲的, 宽厚的, 慈善的\\n[法] 慈善的, 慷慨的, 宽恕的",["All of the money won by our celebrity contestants will go to a charitable cause of their choice.","They managed to get by thanks to the charitable help of their neighbors."],["",""]],["siege","si:dʒ","n. 包围, 围攻, 再三的努力\\nvt. 包围, 围攻",["There is no way out of the siege except to take the bull by the horns and let God judge the outcome.","A trebuchet is a siege weapon similar to a catapult."],["",""]],["paradox","'pærәdɒks","n. 似非而是的论点, 自相矛盾的话, 悖论, 怪人怪事\\n[化] 佯谬",["The paradox of sport is that it bonds as it divides.","What an incredible paradox that a French person is receiving the Nobel Prize in economics."],["",""]],["prevailing","pri'veiliŋ","a. 盛行很广的, 优势的, 主要的, 普遍的\\n[法] 占优势的, 盛行的, 通行的",["On the eve of the conference, the prevailing mood was one of scepticism.","It might be discreet of you to bend a little to the prevailing wind."],["",""]],["barbecue","'bɑ:bikju:","n. 烤肉\\nvt. 烤肉, 烧烤",["We'll have a barbecue at the beach.","The best thing about that place is the barbecue area where they supply you with everything you need."],["我們將在海灘舉行燒烤聚會。",""]],["pervasive","pә'veisiv","a. 普遍的, 流行的, 到处蔓延的, 到处渗透的",["The claim that the word \"Yiddish\" is \"pervasive\" in the corpus is laughable.","Pervasive and pernicious deviations from both fact and logical validity lurked behind a meretricious plausibility."],["",""]],["definite","'definit","a. 明确的, 一定的\\n[法] 明确的, 确切的, 一定的",["It is definite that he will go to America.","I cannot give you a definite answer today."],["他肯定要去美国。","我今天无法给您一个最终的答复。"]],["preside","pri'zaid","vi. 统辖, 当主人, 主持\\n[法] 主持, 负责, 指挥",["Article 6. The president shall preside at all meetings.","The Honorable Mrs Maria Oliveira will preside over the opening session."],["",""]],["discriminate","dis'krimineit","v. 区别, 差别待遇",["We must be able to discriminate between objects and situations.","Subtle differences in tone discriminate the original from the copy."],["",""]],["strangely","'streindʒli","adv. 奇妙地, 奇怪地, 不可思议地",["Strangely, the number of students is decreasing each year.","Politician, it is a shitty job, but strangely enough nobody ever wants to quit. Apparently, it is too much of a turn-on."],["",""]],["disruption","dis'rʌpʃәn","n. 分裂, 崩溃, 瓦解",["I was very upset by the disruption in my normal morning routine.","The strike by the train drivers in Germany caused much disruption to the holiday plans of overseas travellers."],["",""]],["translator","træn'leitә","n. 翻译者\\n[计] 翻译程序; 翻译器",["I don't like to use Google Translator.","My uncle had me act as a translator."],["我不喜歡用谷歌翻譯。","我叔叔讓我擔任翻譯。"]],["strategist","'strætidʒist","n. 战略家",["He was a skilled strategist and canny political operator.","Rosa Parks wasn't simply a tired seamstress who sat down by accident. She was a civil rights leader with the eye of a strategist and the heart of a warrior."],["",""]],["trademark","'treidmɑ:k","n. 商标\\n[法] 商标",["The depiction violated a company's registered trademark.","Trademark protection extends only to national borders."],["",""]],["nowadays","'nauәdeiz","n. 现在, 现时, 当今\\nadv. 时下, 现今",["Nowadays, almost every home has one or two televisions.","Nowadays, some kindergartens are carrying out bilingual teaching, and so all the children can speak a little English."],["現在幾乎每家每戶也有一兩台電視機了。","现在有些幼儿园推行的是双语教学，小朋友们都能滴里嘟噜地说上几句英语。"]],["displace","dis'pleis","vt. 移置, 替换, 转移",["The growing power of the new mercantile aristocracy was beginning to displace the medieval nobility's control.","This technology will undoubtedly displace millions of jobs."],["",""]],["territorial",".teri'tɒ:riәl","a. 领土的, 土地的, 地方的, 区域性的\\nn. 本土自卫队队员",["Bodo is one of the official languages of the Bodoland Territorial Region.","I began to stake out my territorial waters in the sorority house's hot tub."],["",""]],["homosexual",".hɒmәu'sekjuәl","a. 同性恋的\\nn. 同性恋者",["He's afraid of telling his parents that he's homosexual.","Among wild ducks, it seems there are homosexual necrophiliacs."],["",""]],["multicultural",".mʌlti'kʌltʃәrәl","a. 融合或具有多种文化的；多种文化的",["Having been raised in multilingual and multicultural environments, languages are definitely her thing.","Australia is one of the most multicultural places on Earth."],["",""]],["catalogue","'kætәlɒg","n. 目录, 大学情况一览\\nvt. 编入目录",["If they are not free, please let me know how much the catalogue and the postage to Japan are.","I would like to purchase your latest mail order catalogue."],["",""]],["marsh","mɑ:ʃ","n. 沼泽, 湿地\\na. 沼泽的",["The Marsh Woman is related to the elf maidens, who are well-known, for songs are sung and pictures painted about them.","From the marsh at the head of the pond came the clear, mournfully-sweet chorus of the frogs."],["",""]],["polar","'pәulә","a. 两极的, 极地的, 正好相反的, 极性的\\nn. 极线, 极面",["The aurora is a phenomenon characteristic of the polar regions.","Melting polar icecaps could also contribute to an increase in sea levels."],["極光是極地特有的自然現象。","融化中的极地冰盖也可以使海平面上涨的势态更加严重。"]],["gradual","'grædʒuәl","a. 逐渐的, 渐增的\\nn. 弥撒升阶圣歌",["China is now beginning to remove restrictions in Wuhan by allowing a gradual return to economic activity.","A step change in the feed rate of one reactant results in a gradual change in the reaction rate."],["",""]],["solitary","'sɒlitәri","n. 独居者\\na. 孤独的, 独居的",["She lives a solitary life in a remote part of Scotland.","If you are idle, be not solitary, if you are solitary, be not idle."],["",""]],["documentation",".dɒkjumen'teiʃәn","n. (总称)文件\\n[计] 文件编制, 文档",["Some programmers seem to forget that writing good documentation is as important, if not more important, as writing a good program.","See \"/docs\" for the full documentation for this API."],["",""]],["casually","'kæʒjuәli","adv. 偶然地, 临时地, 随便地",["In family photos, Ciham appears carefree. She poses casually for the camera, her hair pulled into a braided ponytail.","He always dresses very casually, and doesn't care about color or style."],["在家庭照片中，西哈姆看起來無憂無慮。她對著鏡頭擺出一副隨興的姿勢，頭髮綁成馬尾。","他穿衣服一向很随便，颜色、样式都无所谓。"]],["puppy","'pʌpi","n. 小狗, 小动物, 自负的年轻人",["Sasha and Malia! I love you both more than you can imagine. And you have earned the new puppy that's coming with us to the White House.","He loves his puppy. His puppy is really adorable."],["萨沙和马莉娅，我爱你们，我对你们的爱超出了你们的想象。你们已赢得了新的宠物狗，它将和我们一起前往新的白宫。","他愛他的狗，那隻小狗真的很可愛。"]],["angler","'æŋ^lә","n. 钓鱼, 攫取, 追逐",["The angler felt a strong tug on the line.","The angler caught a carp weighing ten kilos."],["",""]],["slump","slʌmp","n. 暴跌, 垂头弯腰的姿态\\nvi. 猛然掉落, 陷入, 衰落(经济等)",["The Taiwanese dollar appreciated, causing Taiwanese exports to slump.","The company is caught up in a serious business slump."],["台幣上漲，造成台灣的出口貿易不振。",""]],["remainder","ri'meindә","n. 剩余物, 其他人, 残余, 余数\\nv. 削价出售(图书)\\na. 剩余的, 出售削价剩书的\\n[计] 余数",["Modular division solves for the remainder, not the quotient.","The remainder of his tirade included a number of swear words."],["",""]],["median","'mi:diәn","a. 中央的, 中间的, 正中的\\nn. 正中动脉, 中位数, 中线",["Averages come in three flavors: mean, median, and mode.","It is important to know the difference between mean and median."],["",""]],["prohibition",".prәuhi'biʃәn","n. 禁令, 禁止",["During prohibition days, racketeers used to rub each other out to get control of the rum-running racket.","The first prohibition of slavery was in the mid-nineteenth century."],["",""]],["inaudible","in'ɒ:dәbl","a. 听不见的",["Some high-pitched sounds are inaudible to adults, but can be heard by children and teenagers.","Some multilingual people think that English is somewhat inaudible."],["",""]],["pending","'pendiŋ","a. 未决定的, 待决的, 行将发生的, 向外伸出的\\nprep. 在等待...之际, 直到...时为止, 在...期间, 在...过程中",["We postponed our picnic pending a change in the weather.","Some of the seams of the dress were held together only loosely by basting stitches, pending the final fitting."],["",""]],["dating","'deitiŋ","[计] 记日期的\\n[经] 注明日期",["Sami has been secretly dating Layla's little sister.","Tom started dating Mary three months ago."],["薩米一直在偷偷和萊拉的妹妹交往。","汤姆三个月前开始和玛丽约会。"]],["coconut","'kәukәnәt","n. 椰子\\n[医] 椰子(实)",["The London to Amsterdam flight was partially powered with a mixture of coconut and babassu nut oil.","She does not like to eat coconut-flavored things."],["倫敦飛往阿姆斯特丹的航班部分動力來自椰子油和巴巴蘇堅果油的混合物。","她不喜歡吃椰子味的東西。"]],["dislike","dis'laik","n. 嫌恶\\nvt. 讨厌, 不喜欢",["At the beginning, I was bored with radio gymnastics, but now I do not dislike it.","The only time people dislike gossip is when you gossip about them."],["我起初覺得廣播體操很無聊，但是現在卻喜歡上了。","人们唯一不喜欢流言蜚语的时间，就是当你讨论他们自己的时候。"]],["badge","bædʒ","n. 徽章, 标记\\n[计] 标记",["Some spaghetti fell on the badge of the uniform, dirtying it.","Stefan had to show his student ID badge."],["有一些意面掉到了制服上的徽章那儿，把那边弄脏了。","斯特凡必須出示學生證。"]],["void","vɒid","n. 空虚, 空间, 空白, 空隙, 空虚感\\na. 空的, 无效的, 无人的, 没有的, 无用的\\n[计] 脱墨; 空白点",["Her words were wholly void of meaning.","Deem not life a thing of consequence. For look at the yawning void of the future, and at that other limitless space, the past."],["她的話毫無意義。",""]],["paradise","'pærәdais","n. 天堂, 乐园, 伊甸园",["This park is a little kid's paradise.","The island is a paradise for children."],["這個公園是小孩子的天堂。","这个岛是孩子们的天堂。"]],["seafood","'si:fu:d","n. 海味, 海鲜, 鱼类",["For his first date, he chose an Italian restaurant and ordered seafood pasta, hoping to leave a romantic impression.","The seafood restaurants in Keelung are very famous."],["他第一次約會就選了義大利餐廳，點了海鮮義大利麵，希望留下浪漫印象。","基隆的海鮮餐廳非常有名。"]],["battered","'bætәd","a. 磨损的；弄垮的；破旧的；受到虐待的",["Tom's daughter pretended not to know him when he came to pick her up from school in his battered old car.","Yanni saw Skura many times bruised and battered from domestic abuse."],["当汤姆开着他破旧的雷泽车来接女儿放学时，他的女儿假装不认识他。",""]],["granite","'grænit","n. 花岗岩\\n[化] 花岗岩",["Even small drops striking constantly will bore through a granite mountain.","Archaeologists have unearthed a mysterious black granite sarcophagus in Egypt."],["",""]],["theologian",".θi:ә'lәudʒәn","n. 神学者",["The doctor sees all the weakness of mankind; the lawyer all the wickedness, the theologian all the stupidity.","St. Augustine is a Christian philosopher and theologian of Berber origin."],["",""]],["erode","i'rәud","vt. 腐蚀, 侵蚀\\nvi. 受腐蚀",["Capitalism tends to erode the moral foundations on which it was built.","This will erode his credibility if it is made more widely known."],["",""]],["hum","hʌm","n. 嗡嗡声, 哼声, 杂声\\nvi. 发低哼声\\nvt. 哼, 用哼声表示\\ninterj. 哼, 嗯",["I like this song. When I was a student, I often used to hum it to myself.","I've had enough of the rain and the daily hum-drum."],["",""]],["synthetic","sin'θetik","n. 合成物质\\na. 综合(性)的, 人造的, 合成的",["The field of synthetic biology has the potential to revolutionize the way we live.","In the postbiological era, synthetic bodies became the new home of human minds."],["",""]],["restrain","ri'strein","vt. 抑制, 阻止, 束缚\\n[法] 抑制, 遏制, 制止",["You should learn to restrain yourself.","Before the horse race begins, the jockeys grip the reins tightly to restrain the impatient horses."],["你應該學習控制自己的情緒。",""]],["viewing","'vju:iŋ","[计] 可见的",["In the Edo period, moon-viewing parties were very popular.","Image Viewer is an image viewing software. This software is a very small program. This software has basic functions only. This is translatable by Tatoeba Project users."],["在江戶時代賞月的宴會非常受歡迎。","Image Viewer是一款图片查看软件。该软件是一个非常小的程序。只有基础功能。可以被Tatoeba项目的用户翻译。"]],["syrup","'sirәp","n. 糖浆, 果汁\\n[化] 糖浆剂",["We ate pancakes and maple syrup for breakfast.","The cough syrup has a licorice flavoring."],["我們早餐吃了煎餅和楓糖漿。","咳嗽糖浆有股甘草的味道。"]],["qualification",".kwɒlifi'keiʃәn","n. 资格, 条件, 限制\\n[计] 限定",["We agreed to the plan without qualification."],[""]],["buying","'baiiŋ","[经] 买气; 买进",["In many countries, buying or smoking cannabis is forbidden by law.","His low salary prevents him from buying the house."],["在很多国家，购买和吸食大麻是违法的。","因為他的薪水太低，他買不起那棟房子。"]],["desktop","'desktɔp","n. 桌面\\n[计] 桌面",["I think you will find it convenient to put a short-cut on the desktop.","I created a shortcut on the desktop."],["我想你迟早会知道在桌面建立一个快捷方式是有多方便。","我在桌面上建了一个快捷方式。"]],["beverage","'bevәridʒ","n. 饮料\\n[化] 饮料(如牛奶、茶、咖啡、啤酒等)",["Advertising also played a key role in orange juice becoming a morning beverage.","Some of the ingredients in this beverage are harmful, especially if you are pregnant."],["",""]],["premiere","pri'miә","v. 初次公演, 首次露面\\nn. 初次的演出\\na. 首次的, 首位的",["I guarantee a huge audience for tonight's premiere.","At the premiere, Tom met with fans and signed autographs."],["",""]],["mimic","'mimik","a. 模仿的, 摹拟的\\nn. 效颦者, 模仿者, 小丑, 仿制品\\nvt. 模仿, 摹拟",["A parrot can mimic a person's voice.","People with Borderline Personality Disorder tend to mimic others so as to defend themselves against their own fear of abandonment."],["鸚鵡會模仿人的聲音。",""]],["illegally","","[法] 非法地, 不合法地, 违法地",["Many are able to enter the USA illegally.","Multinationals and extremely rich people manage, sometimes legally, sometimes illegally, to pay little to no taxes by using services offered in fiscal paradises."],["許多人能夠非法進入美國。","跨國公司和極富有的人透過利用避稅天堂所提供的服務，時而合法、時而非法地少繳甚至不繳稅。"]],["wholly","'hәuli","adv. 完全地, 整个, 统统, 全部\\n[法] 完全地, 统统地",["Her words were wholly void of meaning.","I intended to abandon everything to focus wholly on MARDEK, but I was finding it hard to stay interested and motivated."],["她的話毫無意義。",""]],["oppression","ә'preʃәn","n. 压抑, 沉闷, 压迫手段\\n[医] 压迫, 压抑",["Ethnic minorities struggle against prejudice, poverty, and oppression.","Many have suffered oppression and misery for a long period of time under the rule of colonialism."],["",""]],["ammunition",".æmju'niʃәn","n. 军火, 弹药\\n[机] 弹药",["Mexican desperadoes during the early twenties were usually armed to the teeth with stolen firearms and ammunition.","Yanni was arrested with four hundred rounds of ammunition."],["",""]],["paperwork","'peipәwә:k","n. 文书工作",["I knew that Tom was in his office doing paperwork.","However, controls and paperwork should be focused on where they are really needed."],["我知道湯姆正在辦公室處理文件。",""]],["pierce","piәs","vt. 刺穿, 穿透, 打眼于, 洞悉, (声音)响彻, (亮光)照进, 深深地打动\\nvi. 刺入, 穿入, 透入, 进入",["If a high hill stood between A and B, it was important to decide whether the line should climb over it, pierce it with a tunnel, or make a detour to avoid it.","He watched a video on how to pierce his belly button safely."],["假設 A 和 B 之間有一座高山，那就要考慮一下，路線應該越過高山、穿過高山，還是直接從山旁繞過呢？",""]],["hybrid","'haibrid","n. 混血儿, 杂种, 混合物\\na. 混合的, 杂种的, 混合语的\\n[计] NetWare的主机实用程序, 双重用户建立程序",["The orange is a hybrid between a pomelo and a mandarin.","The word \"hybrid\" is derived from the Latin \"hybrida\"."],["",""]],["indulge","in'dʌldʒ","vt. 纵情于, 使高兴, 放任, 迁就\\nvi. 沉溺",["As these days most parents indulge their children, many children don't know what good manners are.","Even during work, I secretly indulge my Internet addiction."],["",""]],["pest","pest","n. 令人讨厌之物, 有害之物, 害虫, 瘟疫\\n[医] 鼠疫, 瘟疫",["He's the pest that, on last month's class-help day, escaped leaving me with all the work.","Dammit, that pest Nagisa, she really went and snitched on me to the teachers."],["",""]],["lodge","lɒdʒ","n. 小屋, 门房, 支部, 旅舍, 分会\\nvi. 临时住宿, 倒伏, 寄宿, 投宿\\nvt. 安顿, 容纳, 提出, 把...射入, …",["They will lodge by twos and threes in lonely farmhouses.","What a surprise! The onsen lodge had turned into a fish breeding farm."],["",""]],["steroids","'stɪərɔɪdz","n. 类固醇( steroid的名词复数 )",["He must have been on steroids to have run that fast.","Sami suffered from all the typical side effects that came with steroids."],["他肯定是吃了兴奋剂才会跑得那么快。",""]],["interim","'intәrim","a. 暂时的, 临时的, 间歇的\\nn. 过渡时期",["In the interim, please send all communications to Tom.","Abdelkader Bensalah is just the interim president of Algeria."],["",""]],["prairie","'prєәri","n. 大草原, 草甸",["Laura Ingalls grew up on the prairie.","In spring brightly green, and spangled with wild flowers, by midsummer this prairie had grown sere and yellow."],["勞拉英戈爾斯是在草原上長大的。",""]],["atmospheric","ætmәs'ferik","a. 大气的\\n[医] 大气的; 大气压的",["The barometer is an instrument that measures atmospheric pressure, especially used to study climate and to determine altitudes.","Venus' atmospheric pressure is very high."],["氣壓表是一種用來測量大氣壓力的儀器，主要用於研究氣候和測量高度。","金星的大氣壓力非常高。"]],["suspected","sә'spektid","a. 有嫌疑的",["Everything has been suspected and been inspected; thoughts have no boundaries.","I suspected that Tom was interested."],["所有的事物都要被怀疑、被验证，思想没有界限。","我怀疑汤姆也感到兴趣。"]],["commuter","kә'mju:tә","n. 乘公共车辆上下班者, 月季票乘客\\n[经] 非(当地)居民",["When you get into a commuter train, you see the briefcases neatly stacked on the racks.","It's a classic commuter town, even during the day there are few people around."],["",""]],["flick","flik","n. 快速的轻打, 轻打声, 弹开\\nv. 轻弹, 轻轻拂去, 忽然摇动",["Notice how the hero in an action flick never seems to run out of ammo?","With a flick of a pen, the war was officially over."],["你有沒有發現動作片主角的子彈好像永遠都不會用完？",""]],["answering","","[计] 应答",["Yoko avoided answering my question.","You are not answering the question correctly."],["洋子回避我提出的问题。","你所答非所问。"]],["serial","'siәriәl","n. 分期连载作品, 连载小说\\na. 连续的, 一连串的, 连载的, 分期偿还的\\n[计] 连续的; 串行的",["Tom had no idea Mary was a serial killer.","Tom had no idea that Mary was a serial killer."],["汤姆不知道玛丽是个连环杀手。","汤姆不知道玛丽是个连环杀手。"]],["investigative","in'vestigeitiv","a. 审查的, 调查的, 好研究的\\n[法] 调查的, 审查的, 受调查研究的",["The crime was one of the worst acts of violence I've ever seen in my 25 years of investigative services.","The president dismisses damning investigative journalism by calling it fake news."],["",""]],["texan","'teksәn","a. 得克萨斯州的\\nn. 得克萨斯州的人, 得克萨斯人",["When the battle ended, not a Texan was left alive.","Yanni's father was a big-spending, big-talking Texan."],["",""]],["dice","dais","n. 骰子\\nvt. 切成方块\\nvi. 掷骰子",["He had his girlfriend blow on the dice for luck before he threw them.","I shall never believe that God plays dice with the world."],["他掷骰子之前让他的女友在上面吹气来给他带来好运。",""]],["dwarf","dwɒ:f","n. 矮子, 侏儒\\nv. (使)变矮小",["The populations of China and India dwarf those of every other nation.","Once upon a time there was a dwarf that lived in the forest."],["中国和印度的人口超过了其他任何国家。","從前有個侏儒住在森林裡。"]],["pear","pєә","n. 梨子, 梨树, 梨木\\n[机] 梨木",["Both peoples lived off deer, small game, rodents, and even insects, but their main food sources were probably plants such as prickly pear cactus, mesquite beans, and pecan.","The island as seen from above resembles a pear in shape."],["這兩個民族都以鹿、小型獵物、囓齒動物甚至昆蟲為生，但他們的主要食物來源可能是仙人掌、牧豆和山核桃等植物。",""]],["boomer","'bu:mә","n. 往来无定的临时工",["\"Back in my day kids were so much tougher.\" \"OK, boomer.\"","I don't have cable because I'm not a boomer."],["",""]],["surpass","sә'pɑ:s","vt. 超越, 凌驾, 胜过",["The reason the Northern and Southern Dynasties had failed in their rule was that they allowed literary splendor to surpass real substance.","If Spenser doesn't keep adding and translating sentences, the other contributors will surely surpass him."],["南北朝在他們的統治之下失敗了的原因是他們讓文學的光輝超越了實質內容。",""]],["infinite","'infinit","n. 无限, 神\\na. 无穷的, 无限的, 极大的",["Godwin's law teaches us that any infinite discussion about an arbitrary subject converges to a Nazi comparison.","The eternal silence of these infinite spaces terrifies me."],["高德温法则告诉我们对任何主题的所有无休止的讨论会趋于和纳粹主义的类比。","這些無限空間的永恆沉默使我恐懼。"]],["gossip","'gɒsip","n. 闲聊, 随笔, 流言, 爱讲闲话的人\\nvi. 说闲话, 闲聊",["The only time people dislike gossip is when you gossip about them.","Initially this gave rise to gossip among petty people, and it gradually provoked criticism from members of our family."],["人们唯一不喜欢流言蜚语的时间，就是当你讨论他们自己的时候。",""]],["reflective","ri'flektiv","a. 反射的, 反映的, 沉思的",["The tyre wall is coated with a reflective material to provide extra visibility in the dark.","Each plastic sheet is about as thin as a human hair and coated with reflective metal, providing protection on the order of more than SPF 1 million."],["",""]],["contradict",".kɒntrә'dikt","vt. 反驳, 与...抵触, 与...矛盾\\nvi. 反驳",["I cannot forbid a person to marry several wives, for it does not contradict Scripture.","I hate it when I dream things that contradict what I feel when awake."],["我不能禁止一个人娶好几个妻子，因为这与圣经不矛盾。",""]],["muscular","'mʌskjulә","a. 强壮的, 肌肉发达的, 有力的\\n[医] 肌的; 肌肉发达的",["Gabor's Rottweiler was massively muscular.","With his muscular constitution he passes for a judoist."],["加博養的羅威納犬肌肉極其發達。",""]],["landfill","'lændfil","n. 垃圾堆；垃圾填埋地",["Many tons of waste go into the landfill each month.","We have made several failed attempts at foresting the local landfill."],["",""]],["finished","'finiʃt","a. 完成的, 完结的, 精巧的, 完美的",["John finished the work at the expense of his health.","You told her that you had finished the work three days before."],["約翰犧牲自己的健康，完成工作。","你告訴她你已經在三天前完成這個工作了。"]],["commute","kә'mju:t","vt. 交换, 折偿, 减轻\\nvi. 代偿, 经常乘车来往",["I have to commute all the way from a distant suburb.","Say that work is 8 hours, it feels like the three hour commute time is also work but you don't get any money for it. What a waste."],["",""]],["temporal","'tempәrәl","a. 时间的, 暂时的, 现世的, 世俗的, 颞的, 太阳穴的\\nn. 世间万物, 教会财产",["Our memories are stored in the temporal-lobe of the brain.","When I swallow I feel an intense pain caused by my elongated temporal styloid process. My condition is called \"Eagle Syndrome\"."],["",""]],["bilateral","bai'lætәrәl","a. 有两边的, 双边的, 双方的\\n[医] 两侧的",["Algeria and Russia have a growing rise in bilateral trade.","Cephalopods are marine animals characterised by tentacles and bilateral body symmetry."],["",""]],["pluck","plʌk","n. 勇气, 猛拉, 动物内脏\\nvt. 摘, 猛拉, 拔, 拉, 扯, 采\\nvi. 拉, 拽",["Tom needs to clip or pluck the hairs on his nose and ears.","Tom says he can pluck a chicken in less than ten minutes."],["",""]],["hmo","","[化] 休克尔分子轨道法",["The clinic accepts most HMO insurance plans."],["診所接受多數 HMO 保險計畫。"]],["lunar","'lu:nә","a. 阴历的, 月的, 微亮的(指光)\\n[医] 月的, 银的",["A lot of people can't go home for Lunar New Year because of the pandemic.","In China, they celebrate New Year by the lunar calendar."],["因疫情许多人不能回家过春节。","中国按阴历过新年。"]],["discrepancy","dis'krepәnsi","n. 不符合, 差异, 不相符之处\\n[化] 不符值; 偏差值",["The discrepancy between the stories of the two parties involved in the accident was so great that the authorities had a hard time deciding which side was telling the truth.","A smart news consumer is always aware of this discrepancy between traditional media and social media."],["事故雙方的說法相差太大，當局難以判斷哪一方說的是實話。",""]],["utter","'ʌtә","a. 全然的, 绝对的, 完全的\\nvt. 发出声音, 做声, 发表, 发射, 流通",["He was too embarrassed to utter a word in front of the crowd.","His utter failure at the last peace conference has taught him to arm himself to the teeth with new tricks and tactics."],["他太难为情，在大众人前一句话也说不出来。",""]],["patio","'pɑ:tiәu","n. 屋子与花园之间的一片供晴天休息用的石砌空地",["Sami and Layla were standing on the patio, talking.","This club is fearfully dull. The dance floor is empty and the smoking patio is packed."],["",""]],["sincere","sin'siә","a. 诚实的, 正直的, 真挚的, 纯净的",["You have helped me so much, I'd like to express my sincere gratitude.","Please accept my sincere congratulations on your success today."],["大家帮我这么大的忙，真心向大家道谢。","請接受我對您今天的成功最誠摯的祝賀。"]],["intermediate",".intә'mi:diәt","n. 中间物, 调停者, 中级\\na. 中间的, 中级的\\nvi. 起媒介作用\\n[计] 中级",["My level in English is intermediate.","When the lights are red all vehicles must stop, and they may not start until they turn to green. Amber is the intermediate colour."],["我英文水平中等。",""]],["roommate","","n. 住在同室的人",["\"Are you friends with Mary?\" \"Yes, she's my roommate.\"","My roommate is prodigal when it comes to spending money on movies; he buys them the day they're released, regardless of price."],["“你和玛丽是朋友吗？”“是的，她是我的室友。”",""]],["demise","di'maiz","n. 崩, 薨, 死亡\\nvt. 让渡, 遗赠, 转让",["He met his demise at the hands of a crowd of jealous husbands.","After the demise of Stalin, Korolev gained the support of the new leader, Nikita Khrushchev."],["",""]],["enrich","in'ritʃ","vt. 使富足, 使肥沃",["You should enrich your mind when young.","There are no good flags, only good people working together to enrich each other and their society."],["年轻的时候你应该开拓你的思想。",""]],["chant","tʃænt. tʃɑ:nt","n. 圣歌, 赞美诗\\nv. 吟唱, 诵扬",["Tom and Mary chant the narrative of mainstream media.","This sounds like a children's chant that is not designed to make sense."],["",""]],["submarine","'sʌbmәri:n","n. 潜水艇, 海底生物\\na. 海中的, 生长在海中的\\nvt. 用潜水艇攻击\\nvi. 在下疾行, 在下滑动",["Russia is sending battleships, marines, and landing craft tanks against Syria, and submarine equiment against Iran.","A submarine cable was laid between the two countries."],["俄羅斯正向敘利亞派遣戰艦、海軍陸戰隊和登陸艇坦克，並向伊朗派遣潛艦裝備。",""]],["overwhelmingly",".әuvә'hwelmiŋli","adv. 压倒性地, 不可抵抗地",["The scientific truth of evolution is so overwhelmingly established, that it is virtually impossible to refute.","British voters overwhelmingly re-elected a racist, antisemitic, and Islamophobic prime minister."],["",""]],["premature",".premә'tjuә","a. 早产的, 过早的, 不成熟的\\nn. 早产儿, 过早发生的事物",["There is no greater insult to life than premature ejaculation.","Are you saying that our plan was accepted? I hope you're not showing me any premature happiness here."],["没有什么比早泄更糟蹋生活的了",""]],["tout","taut","vi. 招徕顾客, 兜售物品\\nvt. 招徕, 刺探...情报\\nn. 兜售者, 侦查者",["He didn't miss the opportunity to tout his bona fides.","Tech bros love to tout their visions for a \"better\" world."],["",""]],["crater","'kreitә","n. 火山口, 环行山, 弹坑\\n[化] 焊口; 火山石; 弧坑; 焰口",["Some of the bluest water in the world is found in Crater Lake.","We have strong evidence that Jezero Crater once had the ingredients for life."],["一些世界上最藍的水在火山湖。",""]],["comfortably","'kʌmfәtәbli","adv. 安乐地, 舒服地, 宽裕地",["No matter how cold it is outside, the rooms are comfortably heated.","Her higher salary will allow her to live comfortably."],["無論外面多麼寒冷，房間始終既舒適又溫暖。",""]],["exploitation",".eksplɒi'teiʃәn","n. 开发, 开采, 剥削\\n[经] 开发, 剥削, 宜传",["Capitalism is the exploitation of man by man. Communism is the exact opposite.","The information contained in this guide is meant to help people find work under fair conditions and avoid exploitation."],["",""]],["jersey","'dʒә:zi","n. 运动衫",["Contador won the yellow jersey in the Tour de France.","The trouble is, miss, that I found that Jersey cow of your aunt's in my oats again, not half an hour ago."],["",""]],["clown","klaun","n. 小丑, 乡下人",["His dress is that of a gentleman, but his speech and behavior are those of a clown.","When the little boy saw the clown, the cat got his tongue."],["他衣着像个绅士，言行举止却像个小丑。",""]],["ditch","ditʃ","n. 沟渠\\nvt. 在...开沟\\nvi. 开沟",["Tom was driving too fast on the bend and ended up in the ditch.","Tom took the bend too fast and landed in the ditch."],["湯姆拐彎兒拐得太快了，把車开到了水溝裏。","湯姆拐彎兒拐得太快了，把車开到了水溝裏。"]],["secondly","'sekәndli","adv. 第二, 其次",["Secondly, is there any project scheduled to be released today?","Secondly, some of the Creoles may become independent \"national languages\" in their own right."],["其次，按照日程今天有将要发布的项目吗？",""]],["loaf","lәuf","n. 一条面包, 块, 游荡\\nv. 游手好闲, 虚度光阴",["A loaf of bread is better than the songs of birds.","I just remembered that I was supposed to buy a loaf of bread."],["麵包比鳥的鳴唱好。","我才想起来我之前该买个面包。"]],["cushion","'kuʃәn","n. 垫子, 橡皮软垫\\nvt. 加垫褥, 缓冲, 掩盖",["The prince said that she should always be near him, and she was allowed to sleep outside his door on a velvet cushion.","Using a doubled-up cushion in place of a pillow I lie down on the hard wooden floor with nothing but a carpet spread over it."],["",""]],["wrestling","'resliŋ","n. 摔跤",["As I entered the coffeehouse, I found two young men watching a wrestling match on television.","As I entered a tearoom, I found two young men watching a wrestling match on television."],["",""]],["vaguely","'veigli","adv. 含糊地, 暧昧地",["The British have only vaguely understood why they voted.","I wondered vaguely what foul villainy it might be that the Morlocks did under the new moon."],["",""]],["twilight","'twailait","n. 暮光, 曙光, 黎明, 黄昏, 微光, 朦胧状态\\na. 微明的",["We find ourselves in the twilight of our civilization.","Anne came out of the fragrant twilight of the orchard with a sheaf of white narcissi in her hands."],["",""]],["adolescence",".ædәu'lesәns","n. 青春期\\n[医] 青年期, 青春期",["In adolescence, I hated life and was continually on the verge of suicide, from which, however, I was restrained by the desire to know more mathematics.","Adolescence is a period of transition between childhood and adulthood."],["在青春期，我厌倦生活，并持续陷入自杀的边缘。然而，在那期间，对数学知识的渴望，使我抑制住了那些负面情绪。",""]],["comprehend",".kɒmpri'hend","vt. 理解, 包括",["The professor was unable to comprehend what I meant.","This theory is too difficult for me to comprehend."],["教授不明白我說了甚麼。","这个理论对我来说太难了，理解不了。"]],["dispose","dis'pәuz","vt. 处理, 排列, 布置\\nvi. 处置",["Fadil forced Layla to help dispose of Rami's body.","Sami forced Layla to help dispose of Farid's body."],["",""]],["unlock",".ʌn'lɒk","vt. 开...的锁, 开启, 表露, 放出\\nvi. 被开启, 揭开, 解放\\n[计] 解出锁定",["Mary couldn't unlock the door because she had the wrong key.","Tom couldn't unlock the door because he had the wrong key."],["",""]],["imaging","i'mædʒiŋ","[计] 成象\\n[化] 成像",["A number of imaging techniques are employed in radiology, such as X-ray, MRI, and ultrasound.","MRI stands for Magnetic Resonance Imaging, whereas CT stands for Computed Tomography."],["放射學中採用了數種影像技術，比如 X 光、MRI 和超音波。",""]],["squirrel","'skwә:rәl","n. 松鼠, 松鼠毛皮\\nvt. 贮藏",["I was going to take a picture of a squirrel I found in the park, but it was too nimble, and all my shots were no good.","The squirrel advanced against the strong wind."],["我本来想给我在公园发现的松鼠拍照，但它太敏捷了，因此我拍的照片都不好。","松鼠在前面頂著強風。"]],["destine","'destin","vt. 注定, 预定",["We were destined to get married from the time we were born - Not!"],[""]],["bleeding","'bli:diŋ","n. 出血, 流血\\n[化] 渗色",["You're bleeding everywhere; I'll help you up.","Tom was bleeding heavily from a gunshot wound."],["你看都出血了，我扶你起来吧。","汤姆的枪伤伤口导致了大出血。"]],["royalty","'rɒiәlti","n. 皇室, 王族成员, 王权, 特权阶层, 庄严\\n[经] 特许权, 使用费, 使用税",["Intel gets a huge royalty from the invention.","In this day and age, there aren't nearly as many advantages to being \"royalty\" as there were a century or so ago."],["英特尔公司由那个发明取得着巨大的专利权收入",""]],["superb","sju'pә:b","a. 极度的, 华丽的, 极好的",["This is a superb illustration of how Emmet modified the traditional architectural designs.","Her technique is superb, but she needs to play with more expression."],["",""]],["responsive","ri'spɒnsiv","a. 回答的, 应答的, 易感应的",["It is not the strongest of the species that survives, not the most intelligent, but the one most responsive to change.","It is not the strongest of the species that survive, nor the most intelligent, but the one most responsive to change."],["",""]],["understandable",".ʌndә'stændәbl","a. 可以理解的",["They spoke of their high exam grades with understandable pride.","It is completely understandable to wipe your nose on the bedclothes if you cannot find your handkerchief with the lights out."],["他們很驕傲地談到考試中的好成績，這種驕傲是可以理解的。",""]],["salon","'sælɔ:ŋ","n. 大会客室, 大厅, 客厅, 交谊室, 沙龙, 美术展览馆, 画廊, 美容院, 发廊",["She goes to the beauty salon at least once a week.","I have to go to the salon and get my roots touched up."],["",""]],["loosely","'lu:sli","adv. 松弛地, 宽松地, 不紧",["Mary removed the band from her ponytail and allowed her hair to fall loosely about her neck.","Some of the seams of the dress were held together only loosely by basting stitches, pending the final fitting."],["",""]],["evacuate","i'vækjueit","v. 疏散, 撤出, 排泄",["We have less than five minutes to evacuate the whole building.","The threatening floods made it necessary to evacuate the town."],["我们有不到五分钟来疏散整栋楼的人。",""]],["descriptive","di'skriptiv","a. 描述的, 叙述的",["In Korean, adjectives often function as descriptive verbs, meaning they can be conjugated like verbs to express different tenses and moods.","We can thank the intrepid sailors of yore for these wildly descriptive terms."],["在韓語中，形容詞通常充當描述性動詞，這意味著它們可以像動詞一樣變位以表達不同的時態和語氣。",""]],["modified","'mɔdifaid","a. 改良的；改进的, 修改的",["You probably eat genetically modified fruits and vegetables all the time without knowing it.","If we take this additional evidence into consideration, the second law must be modified."],["",""]],["hardship","'hɑ:dʃip","n. 艰难, 辛苦, 苦难\\n[法] 受苦, 吃苦, 苦难",["He overcame all sorts of hardship and setbacks to succeed in a solo crossing of Antarctica.","Years of hardship had not caused him to lose his faith."],["他克服了種種困難和挫折，終於成功一個人越過了南極洲。",""]],["squash","skwɒʃ","n. 挤压, 压碎的东西, 南瓜属植物, 拥挤的人群\\nvt. 压扁, 镇压, 压制\\nvi. 被压扁, 发溅泼声, 挤入",["Despite their popularity, cricket and squash are not Olympic sports.","Parsnips, squash, carrots, peas and sweet potatoes are considered starchy vegetables."],["",""]],["postcard","'pәustkɑ:d","n. 明信片",["Put this stamp on the postcard and drop it in the mailbox.","I don't have a stamp collection, but I have a Japanese postcard collection that I could use as an excuse to invite him."],["把这张邮票贴在明信片上，然后投到邮箱里。","我沒有集郵，但是卻收藏了一堆日本的明信片，我想我可以用這來做藉口，邀請他來我家。"]],["instability",".instә'biliti","n. 不安定, 不稳定\\n[医] 不稳定性",["Gold prices are skyrocketing in the wake of financial instability.","In physics, the Jeans instability causes the collapse of interstellar gas clouds and subsequent star formation."],["",""]],["pity","'piti","n. 遗憾, 同情, 怜悯, 憾事, 可惜\\nvt. 同情, 怜悯\\nvi. 觉得可怜, 有同情心",["It's a pity that you can't buy miracles like you would buy potatoes.","What a pity that there are more foolish people than smart ones."],["可惜我们不能像买土豆一样买奇迹。","可惜，世界上的愚人总比聪明人要多。"]],["relocate","ri:'lәukeit","vt. 重新安置, 再配置, 放在新地方\\n[计] 再定位; 浮动",["Algeria is planning to relocate its capital to the town of Boughezoul.","The construction of the dam will undoubtedly have the resulting effect of forcing thousands of families to relocate elsewhere."],["",""]],["gulf","gʌlf","n. 海湾, 深渊, 漩涡, 隔阂\\nvt. 吞没",["Gambling site lets users bet on which species will go extinct because of the oil spill in the Gulf of Mexico.","The Mississippi River flows into the Gulf of Mexico."],["賭博網站讓用戶投注於哪些物種將因為墨西哥灣漏油而滅絕。",""]],["affiliate","ә'filieit","vt. 使紧密联系, 使附属, 接纳, 收养\\nvi. 发生联系, 参加",["Check with your local affiliate of our network to find out when the program will be broadcast.","When you buy a product using one of my affiliate links, the company pays me."],["",""]],["elusive","i'lu:siv","a. 难懂的, 易忘的, 难以捉摸的",["This species of deer is so elusive that only two have ever been photographed in the wild.","And the truth is elusive because it knows where to hide."],["",""]],["dodge","dɒdʒ","v. 避开, 躲避\\nn. 诡计, 躲藏",["Don't dodge the issue, I want you to answer my question.","On his bicycle he can dodge through traffic with amazing speed."],["不要逃避，我要你回答我的問題。",""]],["unwanted",".ʌn'wɒntid","a. 没人要的, 不需要的, 多余的",["In India many girls are named \"Nakusa\" or \"Nakushi\", which in Hindi means \"unwanted\".","There are always so many unwanted gifts in the house after Christmas."],["",""]],["bureaucrat","'bjuәrәukræt","n. 官僚作风的人, 官僚, 官僚主义者\\n[法] 官僚, 官僚作风的人",["He's a bureaucrat."],[""]],["claw","klɒ:","n. 爪, 螯, 抓伤\\nv. 用爪抓, 挖, 搜刮",["\"I cannot claw my owner\", said the cat.","Ziri saw a large claw mark on the oak tree."],["“我不能抓我的主人。”猫说。","齊裡看到橡樹上有一個很大的爪痕。"]],["marvelous","'mɑ:vәlәs","a. 令人惊异的, 了不起的, 不平常的",["It is really marvelous of you to remember my birthday.","It's marvelous how quickly the medicine relieved my pain."],["你還記得我的生日，那真是太好了。",""]],["projected","","a. 投影的, 投射",["Increases in the frequency and intensity of extreme precipitation events are projected for all U.S. regions.","With continued warming, cold-related deaths are projected to decrease and heat-related deaths are projected to increase."],["",""]],["mercury","'mә:kjuri","n. 水银, 汞, 使者\\n[化] 汞Hg",["Mercury is the smallest planet in our solar system.","Tom got mercury poisoning from eating canned tuna every day."],["水星是我們的太陽系中最小的行星。","Tom汞中毒了，因為他每天都吃罐裝金槍魚。"]],["skepticism","'skeptisizm","n. 怀疑论\\n[医] 多疑癖",["A healthy dose of skepticism is vital when listening to a politician speak.","I've asked myself whether skepticism is the key to greatness. But even petty people doubt."],["",""]],["incomplete",".inkәm'pli:t","a. 不完全的, 未完成的, 不完善的\\n[机] 不完全的",["I noticed that I got a more lasting satisfaction from works of a more incomplete character.","Sami gave cops incomplete and inaccurate information."],["",""]],["laborer","'leibәrә","n. 体力劳动者, 辅助工\\n[机] 劳动者",["The word \"laborer\" is a noun derived from the word \"labor\".","He rose from day laborer to governor."],["",""]],["continuously","kәn'tinjuәsli","adv. 不断地, 连续地\\n[电] 连续地",["Two women wielding giant spatulas continuously stir a brimming wok of shredded beef simmering in curry sauce.","When he's in class, he continuously sits next to me."],["兩名女子揮舞著巨大的鍋鏟，不停地翻炒著盛滿咖哩醬汁的牛肉絲。","他上课的时候一直坐在我的旁边。"]],["immunity","i'mju:niti","n. 免疫, 免疫性, 免除\\n[化] 免疫性",["Members of parliament deserve immunity and a paid salary to guarantee their independence.","Scientists don't know yet if herd immunity is possible with this virus."],["",""]],["reliance","ri'laiәns","n. 信任, 信赖, 受信赖的人(或事)\\n[法] 信任, 信赖, 信心",["Excessive reliance on monetary policy in an attempt to curb inflation could unnecessarily constrain credit and hence business.","Many of the text formulations arouse suspicion that the author failed to mention a reliance on some English source."],["",""]],["planetary","'plænitri","a. 行星的, 流浪的, 迁移不定的, 地球上的, 现世的",["This relation between the Sun and planetary motion is not an odd and inexplicable coincidence.","Many envision that Mars will be humanity's second planetary home."],["",""]],["nucleus","'nju:kliәs","n. 核心, 核子, 原子核, 起点\\n[计] 核心程序",["You two are the nucleus of the team.","A great deal of energy is locked up in the nucleus."],["你們倆是團隊的核心。",""]],["cater","'keitә","v. 提供饮食及服务, 投合, 迎合",["The net-cafes here cater to students; fees start at around a pound an hour.","One of the great things about the Internet is the vast array of websites that cater to every conceivable interest."],["",""]],["taliban","","塔利班",["The US was defeated by the retrograde group of the Taliban.","The Taliban inherited a state that relied on foreign aid."],["",""]],["chess","tʃes","n. 国际象棋\\n[建] 雀麦",["I don't like going out to have fun. Usually, I make my own coffee at home, and have a game of chess with a friend.","He carried off the first prize at the chess tournament."],["我不喜欢出去玩，常常在家泡壶咖啡，跟朋友下围棋象棋。","他在國際象棋比賽中取得了冠軍。"]],["blonde","blɔnd","a. (头发)亚麻色的, 淡色的, 白肤金发碧眼的, 白里透红的, 白皙的, 淡黄色的\\nn. 肤色白皙的金发女人",["I want to find a blonde, blue-eyed European woman.","She is a beautiful girl with blonde hair and blue eyes."],["他想找一位金发碧眼的欧洲女人。","她是個美麗的女孩，有著金色頭髮和藍色眼睛。"]],["brightly","'braitli","adv. 生辉地, 明亮地, 鲜明地",["The stars are shining very brightly in the sky tonight.","He saw brightly-colored birds, flowers and leaves."],["今晚的夜空星光非常明亮。","他看见色彩鲜艳的鸟、花朵和树叶。"]],["tornado","tɒ:'neidәu","n. 旋风, 龙卷风, 大雷雨",["The tornado passed through the city and headed to the sea.","With his camera, Tom captured a tornado in action."],["",""]],["filing","'failiŋ","n. 锉, 琢磨, 锉屑\\n[计] 编档; 文件编排",["I have had it with you, Yanni. I'm filing for a divorce.","Apart from a filing tray full of papers on the desk, everything else in the room was on the floor."],["",""]],["camel","'kæml","n. 骆驼, 打捞浮筒",["A camel is to the desert what a ship is to the sea.","The camel can go a long time without water and food."],["駱駝是沙漠之舟。","駱駝可以撐很久不吃不喝。"]],["heck","hek","int. 真见鬼（hell的委婉说法）",["It was the sort of weird car that made me want to blurt out, \"what the heck is that?\"","Rather - who the heck are you?! Iori enquired of the girl, ignoring my form rolling around on the floor."],["這輛有點怪的車讓我脫口而出\"那是什麼鬼東西啊?\"",""]],["declining","di'klainiŋ","a. 倾斜的, 衰退中的",["An increase in customer complaints may indicate that business is declining.","The activity of foreign trade has been declining of late."],["顧客投訴量增加，可能代表生意正在走下坡。","最近对外贸易活动减少了。"]],["conform","kәn'fɒ:m","vt. 使一致, 使遵守, 使符合\\nvi. 一致, 符合, 适应",["I hate those bands that just conform to some punk-like mentality without thought.","Since you're a member of this sports club, you'll have to conform to its rules."],["",""]],["worthwhile","'wә:θ'hwail","a. 值得花时间的, 值得做的, 有真实价值的",["The hard work was worthwhile because I passed the exam.","I think it is worthwhile to see this film twice."],["努力是值得的，因为我考过关了。","我覺得這部電影值得一看再看。"]],["cuff","kʌf","n. 袖口, 一巴掌\\nvt. 用巴掌打\\nvi. 殴斗",["He lifted the cuff of his shirt and looked at his watch.","He gave a short speech, completely off the cuff, and won the hearts of his listeners."],["",""]],["bud","bʌd","n. 芽, 花蕾\\nvi. 发芽, 萌芽\\nvt. 使发芽",["A rose is fresher as a bud than as a flower in bloom.","The orchardist grafted an apple bud onto the rootstock."],["",""]],["shipment","'ʃipmәnt","n. 装船, 出货\\n[经] 运送, 运送(寄出)货物, 装载",["In case the shipment is delayed, we have special delay insurance.","Please disregard this notice if your shipment has already been made."],["万一船运迟了，我们有特别的迟到保险。",""]],["admiration",".ædmә'reiʃәn","n. 赞赏, 钦佩, 引人赞赏的对象",["A lady's imagination is very rapid; it jumps from admiration to love, from love to matrimony, in a moment.","Ignorance is the mother of fear as well as of admiration."],["女人的思维很有跳跃性：从仰慕到爱慕，从爱慕到结婚都是一眨眼间的事。","无知是恐惧之母，也是崇拜之母。"]],["certified","'sә:tifaid","a. 证明合格的\\n[化] 检定的; 证明的; 书面证明的",["This building is LEED Platinum certified.","Yanni is an Algerian certified neurologist."],["該建築已獲 LEED 白金認證。","雅尼是阿爾及利亞認證神經病學家。"]],["sperm","spә:m","n. 精液, 精虫, 鲸油, 抹香鲸\\n[化] 鲸蜡油",["I had an artificial insemination with sperm from my husband.","Moss have motile sperm, unlike most plants, who take advantage of their surroundings to transport their gametes."],["",""]],["sedan","si'dæn","n. 轿车, 轿子",["He noticed a dark blue sedan pull up behind the truck.","For long drives, a sedan is more comfortable than a pickup truck."],["",""]],["accompanying","","a. 随同的, 附见的",["It may be problematic to dissuade your parents from accompanying you to the event.","Marie won't be accompanying him, even though she has nothing to do."],["",""]],["apartheid","ә'pɑ:theit","n. 种族隔离",["Poverty is not an accident. Like slavery and apartheid, it is man-made and can be removed by the actions of human beings.","This racist and colonialist ideology is in no way superior to the despicable system of apartheid."],["",""]],["overview","'әuvәvju:","n. 概述, 概观, 总的看法\\n[计] 概述",["Up to this point I have presented an overview of the growth of political unrest in the period.","It is important to overview the economic status of these groups before examining the proposed solutions."],["",""]],["withstand","wið'stænd","vt. 抵住, 顶住, 经得起",["She is unable to withstand the pressure.","At what age will I be able to withstand what now hurts me so easily, makes me disheartened and anxious?"],["她無法應付壓力。","到了多少岁之后 ，我才能变得不会轻易地被某些东西伤害， 沮丧 ，旁徨失措呢。"]],["earring","'iәriŋ","n. 耳环, 耳饰",["Ziri got down on his knees to help Rima search for her earring.","I dropped an earring on the floor and had to get down on all fours to find it."],["",""]],["irrigation",".iri'geiʃәn","n. 灌溉, 冲洗\\n[医] 冲洗法, 灌溉",["Algeria needs to use proper irrigation techniques.","Algeria needs to encourage the use of proper irrigation techniques."],["",""]],["expel","ik'spel","vt. 驱逐, 逐出, 排出, 开除\\n[医] 排除, 迫出",["No one has the right to expel Dan from this country.","The SARS-CoV-2 virus, which causes COVID-19, spreads mostly through droplets that infected people expel from their mouths."],["",""]],["extinction","ik'stiŋkʃәn","n. 消失, 消灭, 废止\\n[化] 消光; 熄灭",["Many conservationists fear the continuing slaughter of whales is pushing these animals towards extinction.","The Ordovician-Silurian Extinction Event wiped out nearly 85% of marine species."],["许多自然环境保护主义者担心持续屠杀鲸鱼正推动这些动物走向灭绝。","奧陶紀—志留紀滅絕事件消滅了近 85% 的海洋物種。"]],["apparatus",".æpә'reitәs","n. 装置, 器具, 器官\\n[化] 仪器; 器械",["That school is equipped with the latest gymnastics apparatus.","Something is wrong with the experimental apparatus."],["",""]],["reluctance","ri'lʌktәns","n. 不情愿, 勉强\\n[电] 磁阻",["Japanese students seem not merely to be extremely reserved, but to have at times almost a complete reluctance to speak.","Tom doesn't understand Mary's reluctance to go out with his brother."],["",""]],["forgiveness","fә'givnis","n. 宽恕, 宽仁之心",["Tom begged for Maria's forgiveness.","The princess begged forgiveness from the emperor."],["Tom祈求María的原諒。","公主向皇帝请求饶恕。"]],["scarcely","'skɑ:sli","adv. 简直不, 一定不, 仅仅",["She had scarcely finished speaking when he cut in.","Scarcely an hour goes by that I don't I think of you with love."],["她几乎没有说完话，就被他打断了。","我幾乎沒有一個小時不滿懷愛意地想著你。"]],["cabbage","'kæbidʒ","n. 卷心菜\\n[医] 卷心菜, 甘兰",["The cabbage that was this big becomes this small after being cooked.","The price of cabbage fell because of overproduction."],["這麼大的白菜煮熟了就變這麼小了。","由于产量过剩，卷心菜的价格下降了。"]],["slack","slæk","n. 松弛, 松懈, 淡季, 闲散, 家常裤\\na. 松弛的, 不流畅的, 疏忽的, 无力的, 呆滞的, 软弱的, 漏水的\\nadv. 马…",["We tend to slack off after many hours of hard work.","It is important that no one is allowed to slack off on their assigned work."],["",""]],["lumber","'lʌmbә","n. 木材, 破旧家俱, 废物, 隆隆声\\nvt. 砍伐木材, 乱堆\\nvi. 笨拙地移动, 喧闹地向前走, 隆隆地移动",["We are currently lacking good quality building lumber.","You are like someone who builds a house from scrap lumber."],["现在正缺良好的建筑木材。",""]],["extensively","","adv. 广大, 广延, 外延, 大面积(耕种), 粗放, 广博, 广泛, 广阔",["The news covers celebrity rehab stories extensively enough to avoid talking about war or corruption.","She was burned so extensively that her children no longer recognized her."],["",""]],["societal","sә'saiәtl","a. 社会的",["The point of hipster subculture is to avoid conforming to societal norms.","I only went to the party to fulfill my societal obligations."],["",""]],["prevalent","'prevәlәnt","a. 普遍的, 流行的",["It is a prevalent belief, according to a nationwide poll in the United States, that Muslims are linked with terrorism.","Avian flu is not particularly prevalent in well-developed countries like the U.K."],["根据美国国民的一个投票，人们普遍认为穆斯林人和恐怖主义有关。",""]],["benign","bi'nain","a. 善良的, 良性的\\n[医] 良性的",["The toxin that causes diphtheria is produced by a normally benign bacterium when infected with a certain virus.","The results of Tom's biopsy show that the tumor is benign."],["",""]],["calmly","'kɑ:mli","adv. 平静地, 安静地, 冷静地",["In this foreign country, people at the bus stop were calmly waiting for the bus, sitting on their haunches.","You need to take a step back and think calmly about the situation."],["",""]],["dedication",".dedi'keiʃәn","n. 奉献, 献身, 献辞\\n[计] 专用",["Hard work and dedication will bring you success.","Office managers expect accuracy, efficiency, and dedication."],["努力和敬業會讓你成功。",""]],["inequality",".ini'kwɒliti","n. 不平等, 不同, 不平坦, 不平均\\nn. 不平等, 不等式\\n[计] 不等式",["No inequality should be allowed to exist between men and women.","During the presentation the speaker talked mainly about gender inequality."],["",""]],["eve","i:v","n. 前夕, 前夜",["Dumplings are essential at the New Year's Eve dinner table.","This means that eating dumplings on New Year's eve is a symbol of family reunion."],["饺子是年夜饭桌上必不可少的。","说明年夜饭的饺子是亲人团聚的象征。"]],["archaeological",".ɑ:kiә'lɒdʒikl","a. 考古学的, 考古学上的",["It is an ancient midden, presently an archaeological treasury.","This archaeological site was damaged during the war."],["",""]],["kidnap","'kidnæp","vt. 绑架, 诱拐, 拐骗\\n[法] 拐带, 诱拐, 绑架",["However men, seeking the contents of that safe, kidnap Hana. And those men were really detectives.","The adoption-industrial complex is lobbying for the right to kidnap, abuse, and exploit trans kids."],["",""]],["windshield","'windʃi:ld","n. 挡风玻璃\\n[电] 风遮蔽",["The front windshield of a car was smashed to pieces.","The chip in Yanni's windshield became a huge crack."],["車頭的擋風玻璃被砸至粉碎。","雅尼的擋風玻璃上的碎片變成了一條巨大的裂縫。"]],["rugged","'rʌgid","a. 高低不平的, 崎岖的, 粗糙的",["The rugged terrain made the troops' advance difficult.","The scenery of Basutoland is rugged and grand, with a beauty quite its own, and unlike any other part of South Africa I have seen."],["地面高低不平，給部隊前進帶來了困難。","巴蘇陀蘭的景色崎嶇壯麗，別具一格，與我見過的南非其他地方都截然不同。"]],["preschool","'pri:'sku:l","a. 就学前的\\nn. 育幼院, 幼稚园",["Teaching foreign languages at preschool level does not make much sense.","I started school at the age of seven. My great-grandson started preschool when he was less than two years old."],["",""]],["apt","æpt","a. 有...倾向的, 易于的, 恰当的, 聪明的\\n[计] 自动数控语言, 自动图象传输, 自动程序控制, 自动程序设计工具",["Practice is as important as theory, but we are apt to value the latter and despise the former.","Thanks to television, boys and girls are apt to neglect reading books."],["实践和理论同样重要，但我们倾向于重视后者而忽略前者。","拜電視所賜，現在的小孩都不喜歡看書了。"]],["earnest","'ә:nist","n. 定金, 诚挚, 认真\\na. 认真的, 热心的, 重要的",["They refused to talk to me in spite of my earnest request.","Mingle your joys sometimes with your earnest occupation."],["尽管我恳切地要求，他们还是拒绝跟我说话。",""]],["optimal","'ɒptimәl","a. 最佳的, 最理想的\\n[化] 最优的",["The question of how to establish the optimal formula is still open.","The optimal formula which would encompass all these factors has not been proposed."],["",""]],["coherent","kәu'hiәrәnt","a. 互相耦合的, 清晰的, 明了的，凝聚性的, 连贯的",["The two sentences are both coherent.","Our tax system is still without coherent philosophy."],["兩個句子是一致的。",""]],["canned","kænd","a. 罐装的, 录音的, 一稿数用的, 刻板的, 被囚的\\n[机] 洋铁罐的, 罐头的",["Tom got mercury poisoning because he ate canned tuna every day.","Cottage cheese and canned peaches are a delicious combination."],["Tom汞中毒，因為他每天吃罐裝鮪魚。","乾酪加桃子罐頭是美味的搭配。"]],["simplicity","sim'plisiti","n. 单纯, 简朴, 朴素, 坦率, 天真\\n[计] 简明性",["The truth and simplicity of nature is always the most important foundation of noteworthy art.","There is a widespread opinion that all study of the mode of oratory is unmanly, and leads to the substitution of artifice and adornment for simplicity and power."],["大自然的真实和质朴往往是值得注意的艺术中最重要的基石。","有一種普遍的看法認為，一切對演說方式的研究都是有損男子氣概的，都會以雕飾與浮華取代質樸與力量。"]],["staple","'steipl","n. 主要产物, 常用品, 主要要素, 原料, 订书钉, 钩环\\na. 主要的, 重要的\\nvt. 分级, 钉住",["In China, southern people eat rice as staple food; northern people eat wheaten food as staple food.","Fish is one of the local staple foods in this Algerian village."],["在中国，南方人以米饭为主食，北方人以面食为主食。",""]],["plaque","plɑ:k","n. 匾, 饰板, 名牌, 勋章, 胸襟饰物, 血小板",["Tom scratched at his teeth and peered at the lumps of plaque between his nails.","At the inauguration ceremony a plaque was unveiled in honor of the founder."],["",""]],["confidential",".kɒnfi'denʃәl","a. 机密的, 获他人信赖的, 易于信任他人的\\n[经] 秘密件",["Layla's job gave her access to lots of confidential information.","His secretary flatly denied leaking any confidential information."],["",""]],["autobiography",".ɒ:tәubai'ɒgrәfi","n. 自传",["He devoted the last years of his life to writing his autobiography.","In his autobiography, he repeatedly refers to his unhappy school days."],["他晚年致力於寫自傳。",""]],["superstar","'sju:pәstɑ:","n. 超级明星",["Rajinikanth is a superstar in India.","Dr. Sadiq was a superstar in the community."],["",""]],["sleek","sli:k","a. 光滑的, 油嘴滑舌的, 线条明快的, 圆滑的, 时髦的\\nvt. 使光滑, 掩盖\\nvi. 打扮漂亮, 滑动",["The kitchen island is topped with sleek black granite.","The stainless steel case gives the watch a sleek and durable finish."],["",""]],["compatible","kәm'pætәbl","a. 能共处的, 可并立的, 适合的\\n[计] 相容的; 兼容的",["It is that Emmet's theory is compatible with previous theories in physics that is of most significance.","Tom and Mary realized that they weren't really compatible."],["",""]],["intensely","ɪn'tenslɪ","adv. 强烈地; 极度; 剧烈地",["He has no enemies, but is intensely disliked by his friends.","Nothing fixes a thing so intensely in the memory as the wish to forget it."],["",""]],["indirectly","","adv. 间接, 曲折, 迂回, 不直截了当, 不诚实, 不坦率\\n[计] 间接地",["We are indirectly dependent upon the labour of others for all the necessities and comforts of our lives.","It's clear that his comments were intended to offend me indirectly."],["",""]],["deduction","di'dʌkʃәn","n. 减除, 扣除, 减除额, 推论\\n[医] 演绎, 推论",["That was a brilliant deduction. I did not expect you to solve the mystery so quickly.","The program allows pre-tax deduction of the cost of a monthly transit pass."],["",""]],["whiskey","'hwiski","n. 威士忌酒\\na. 威士忌酒的",["There's a little whiskey in this bottle.","The video shows him chugging an entire bottle of whiskey (God rest his soul)."],["這瓶內有一點威士忌。",""]],["dune","dju:n","n. 沙丘",["From the tall dune I could see over the whole island.","He instinctively started running towards the dune."],["",""]],["grilled","grild","a. 烤的, 炙过的, 有格子的",["I like eating grilled lamb skewers.","That was one of the best grilled cheese sandwiches I've ever eaten."],["我喜欢吃烤羊肉串。",""]],["rinse","rins","n. 清洗, 染发, 染发剂\\nvt. 以清水冲洗, 漱, 漂清\\nvi. 被漂净",["In case of contact with eyes, rinse with a large amount of water.","You have to rinse your mouth after brushing your teeth."],["",""]],["vigorously","","adv. 朝气蓬勃, 精力充沛, 壮健, 茁壮, 健壮, 强有力",["The woodpecker is pecking the tree trunk vigorously.","Add the sugar and vanilla to the cream and beat vigorously until the cream thickens."],["啄木鸟正在使劲地啄树干。",""]],["interpersonal",".intә'pә:sәnәl","a. 人与人之间的, 人际(关系)的\\n[法] 人与人之间的, 需要与他人接触的",["Changing the system is difficult, not to mention the interpersonal relationships.","Systemic violence kills just as surely as interpersonal violence does."],["",""]],["staircase","'stєәkeis","n. 楼梯, 梯子, 楼梯部分\\n[医] 阶梯现象",["The staircase leading to the rooftop is narrow, steep, and dark.","Faith is taking the first step, even when you don't see the whole staircase."],["",""]],["shipping","'ʃipiŋ","n. 装运, 航行, 船舶, 船舶吨数\\n[经] 装运, 运送, 海运",["Employees involved in shipping and receiving are considered semi-skilled workers.","The low water levels have made shipping more difficult, with a complete ban imposed on boats on the Oder river in eastern Germany."],["",""]],["susceptible","sә'septәbl","a. 易受影响的, 易感动的, 容许...的\\n[法] 易感的, 易受影响的, 容许",["Thinking you're not susceptible to mind control actually makes you susceptible to mind control.","Yanni and Rima's relationship is susceptible to infidelity."],["",""]],["inconsistent",".inkәn'sistәnt","a. 不一致的, 易变的, 前后矛盾的\\n[法] 矛盾的, 不一致的, 不协调的",["When it comes to my supervisor, he's very inconsistent, so we never get any work done.","What he said yesterday is inconsistent with what he said last week."],["",""]],["sunglasses","","n. 太阳镜, 墨镜, 太阳眼镜",["Tom left his sunglasses on the dashboard of my car.","I want to buy a few pairs of sunglasses."],["汤姆把他的太阳镜留在我的车的仪表板上了。","我想買幾副墨鏡。"]],["appealing","ә'pi:liŋ","a. 有感染力的, 动人的, 恳求的",["Nothing is so appealing as the innocent face of a sleeping baby.","It is possible to launder language to make it more appealing and uplifting."],["",""]],["ambiguity",".æmbi'gju:iti","n. 不明确, 含糊\\n[计] 二义性; 多义性",["The translation doesn't have the ambiguity of the original sentence.","In the face of ambiguity, refuse the temptation to guess."],["",""]],["relentless","ri'lentlis","a. 无情的, 冷酷的, 残酷的",["The bronze armor was useless against the Saxons' relentless attack.","Rodrigo felt isolated and anxious due to the relentless online bullying he encountered."],["",""]],["fixture","'fikstʃә","n. 固定(状态), 固定物, 设备\\n[计] 夹具",["Instead of being here to work, you get the sense that he's simply a permanent fixture here.","What was originally a temporary measure became a permanent fixture."],["",""]],["tester","'testә","n. 考试人, 做试验者, 试验装置, 天盖, 华盖\\n[化] 检验器; 试验仪器",["For this test, I bought a voltage tester.","The electrical tester is not beeping. This means there is no power to the wire and it's safe to work on it."],["為了這次的測試，我特地買了電壓測試儀。",""]],["crumble","'krʌmbl","v. (使)粉碎, (使)成为碎屑, 瓦解, 崩溃, 败落",["The church's steeple is beginning to crumble with age.","Without warning, the lighthouse began to crumble under their feet."],["",""]],["vampire","'væmpaiә","n. 吸血鬼\\n[医] 吸血蝙蝠",["Ziri was a vampire who was on the run from vampire hunters.","Living as a vampire, and getting used to it, isn't such a big deal."],["齊里是一隻正在逃避獵人追殺的吸血鬼。",""]],["canopy","'kænәpi","n. 天篷, 遮篷, 苍穹\\nvt. 用天蓬遮盖",["They stood under the canopy in front of the store, so as to avoid the rain.","The jaguar hunts sloths on the ground, when they come down from the canopy to poop."],["",""]],["certify","'sә:tifai","v. 证明, 保证",["Records certify that Bob passed his driving test.","He tried to certify the matter as correct."],["",""]],["vase","veis","n. 花瓶, 瓶",["The vase on my desk overturned when I jumped up in surprise.","A vase of frost-bleached ferns and ruby-red maple leaves adorned the table."],["我突然跳起来的时候把花瓶桌子上的打翻了。","桌上擺放著一瓶被霜凍漂白的蕨類植物和紅寶石色的楓葉。"]],["merchandise","'mә:tʃәndaiz","n. 商品, 货物\\nv. 交易, 买卖",["The more people buy a certain merchandise, the higher its price.","The more people buy a given item of merchandise, the higher its price."],["",""]],["periodically",",piәri'ɔdikəli","adv. 定期, 循环, 间歇, 周期, 定期刊行, 期刊",["Everyone should periodically receive a physical examination.","Clean the VCR's head periodically for optimal playback quality."],["",""]],["negotiator","ni'gәuʃieitә","n. 磋商者, 交涉者, 议定者\\n[经] 谈判者, 交易者, 协商者",["A good negotiator plays his cards close to his chest.","He seems like a softy on the surface, but at the core he's got an iron will that makes him an extremely tough negotiator."],["",""]],["maternal","mә'tә:nl","a. 母亲的, 母系的, 母方的\\n[医] 属母的, 母的, 母性的",["My mother's father is my maternal grandfather.","Maternal love is greater than anything else."],["我妈妈的爸爸是我的外公。","母爱比任何别的东西都伟大。"]],["gardening","'gɑ:dniŋ","n. 园艺(学)",["Ziri put up hooks for gardening tools in the garage.","Gardening has been popular for some years."],["齊里在車庫裡裝上了用來掛園藝工具的掛鉤。","園藝在這幾年很流行。"]],["massage","'mæsɑ:ʒ","n. 按摩, 揉\\nvt. 按摩, 揉",["She went for a deep tissue massage because her back was hurting.","Tom asked Mary to give him a massage, but she didn't want to."],["",""]],["loneliness","'lәunlinis","n. 寂寞, 孤独, 清静",["Lonely people perpetuate their own loneliness through their fear of others.","Loneliness and being alone are not the same thing."],["孤獨的人會孤獨，是因為他畏懼他人。","一個人並不等於孤獨。"]],["cynical","'sinikәl","a. 愤世嫉俗的, 讽刺的, 冷嘲的",["In my soul there are many places that are cynical and arrogant, but at its core, it fears the darkness and is as weak as a sheep.","Tom didn't seem to be as cynical as Mary seemed to be."],["我的灵魂里有很多地方玩世不恭，对人傲慢无礼，但是它有一个核心，这个核心害怕黑暗，柔弱得像绵羊一样。",""]],["blunt","blʌnt","a. 钝的, 坦率的, 麻痹的",["My sword may be blunt, but that's more than enough for someone like you.","The knife was so blunt that I could not cut the meat with it and I resorted to my pocket knife."],["我的剑虽然是钝的，但应付你的话是绰绰有余的。","那把刀太鈍了，根本切不動肉，我只好拿出我的小刀。"]],["excel","ik'sel","vt. 胜过, 优于, 擅长\\nvi. 胜过其他",["Australians excel at sports and entertainment.","Victorian ladies were expected to excel at needlework, and everybody read a lot."],["澳大利亚人擅长体育和娱乐。",""]],["fungus","'fʌŋgәs","n. 真菌, 真菌类植物\\n[医] 真菌, 霉菌, , 蕈, 海绵肿",["That fungus is deadly, but many others are actually edible.","Aflatoxin is a natural poison produced by a fungus that grows on maize, cassava, ground nuts, and other crops."],["",""]],["gdp","","[化] 鸟苷二磷酸",["Agriculture accounts for about one-third of GDP and 80% of export revenues.","The GDP of China still pales in comparison with that of the US."],["",""]],["accidentally",".æksi'dentli","adv. 偶然地, 意外地",["Maybe at the time she accidentally left her car key in her room.","He hurried out the door, and accidentally forgot the key at home."],["也許當時她將車鑰匙忘在自己的房間裡了。","他匆匆忙忙地出門，不小心把鑰匙落在家裡。"]],["gratitude","'grætitju:d","n. 感激之情",["You have helped me so much, I'd like to express my sincere gratitude.","We express our gratitude for Mr Smith's outstanding, challenging speech."],["大家帮我这么大的忙，真心向大家道谢。","我们对史密斯先生杰出的，给人启发的讲话表示感激。"]],["astronomical",".æstrә'nɒmikl","a. 天文学的, 庞大的",["On making his discovery, the astronomer had presented it to the International Astronomical Congress, in a great demonstration.","The demotion of Pluto from the status of a planet was a very hotly debated issue within the astronomical community."],["",""]],["emperor","'empәrә","n. 皇帝, 君主",["It is said that Peng Zu was the grandson of a celestial emperor.","There has never been a savior nor an immortal emperor to rely on."],["传说彭祖是天帝的孙子。","从来就没有什么救世主， 也不靠神仙皇帝！"]],["authoritarian","ɒ:.θɒri'tєәriәn","a. 独裁的, 独裁主义的",["Human rights groups are putting pressure on authoritarian governments.","In my analysis I rely considerably on the types of authoritarian behaviour first analyzed by Kurz."],["",""]],["hue","hju:","n. 样子, 色度, 色彩, 叫声, 色调\\n[计] 色调",["As it oxidizes, the color turns blue and finally becomes a brilliant reddish-purple hue.","Black tea undergoes full oxidation, resulting in a rich, bold flavor and dark amber hue."],["隨氧化變成藍色，最終呈現出鮮豔的紅紫色。",""]],["triple","'tripl","n. 三倍数, 三个一组\\na. 三倍的\\nvt. 使增至三倍\\nvi. 增至三倍",["He is sure to set a new record in the triple jump.","A triple-drug therapy has been found to be highly effective in treating the life-threatening disorder."],["",""]],["enzyme","'enzaim","n. 酶\\n[化] 酶",["Pineapples contain an enzyme denominated bromelain that decomposes some proteins.","A kinase is an enzyme which phosphorylates other proteins."],["",""]],["outraged","","a. 义愤填膺的；愤慨的, 气愤的",["I don't just want to be outraged; I want to be liberated.","If you are not outraged, you are not paying attention."],["",""]],["disparity","dis'pæriti","n. 不一致\\n[医] 差异, 不等",["There is in all barbarian communities a profound sense of the disparity between man's and woman's work.","Binocular disparity is difference in images between the two eyes."],["",""]],["deepest","dipɪst","a. 深的（ deep的最高级 ）; 严重的; 深奥的; 有…深的",["To the best of my knowledge, the lake is the deepest here.","Lake Baikal in Russia is the deepest lake in the world."],["據我所知，這裏是整個湖最深的地方。","俄羅斯的貝加爾湖是世界上最深的湖泊。"]],["intercept",".intә'sept","n. 截取, 妨碍, 截距\\nvt. 拦截, 阻止, 截取",["Fighter jets were scrambled to intercept an airliner that deviated from its flight path.","The ship moved into position to intercept the space probe."],["",""]],["postal","'pәustl","a. 邮政的, 邮局的\\n[经] 邮政的",["A postal order is a way to send money through the mail.","International postal rates differ according to destination."],["",""]],["ambiguous","æm'bigjuәs","a. 不明确的, 模棱两可的\\n[法] 意思含糊的, 模棱两可的, 暧昧的",["Bill Clinton spoke in ambiguous language when asked to describe his relationship with Monica Lewinsky.","Ambiguous phrases in general lead to amusing interpretations."],["",""]],["surviving","sә'vaiviŋ","[法] 继续存在的, 未死的, 依然健在的",["The giant panda is a surviving ancient animal species.","It was quite fascinating to see how these men were surviving."],["大熊猫是一种残存的古动物。",""]],["cylinder","'silindә","n. 圆筒, 圆筒状物, 汽缸, 柱面\\n[计] 柱面",["The piston does not come into contact with the cylinder cover.","Actual objects can conform rigidly to the four basic form cube, cylinder, cone and sphere."],["这个活塞不接触汽缸盖。",""]],["cafeteria",".kæfi'tiәriә","n. 自助餐厅\\n[经] 自助餐厅",["The food in the cafeteria is cheap, and it's delicious.","A cafeteria is a self-service style restaurant."],["餐廳的飯很便宜，而且很好吃。","自助餐廳是一種自助式的餐廳。"]],["dire","daiә","a. 可怕的, 悲惨的, 阴沉的, 极端的",["You're always there for me, so if you're ever in dire straits, just let me know and I'll come running.","Not without sorrow shalt thou twice speak words so dire."],["",""]],["membrane","'membrein","n. 薄膜, 膜, 羊皮纸\\n[化] 膜; 隔膜",["Endometritis is a disease where bacteria enter the uterus and cause inflammation of the inner membrane.","The following is thought to be one of the reasons stress damages the stomach's mucous membrane."],["",""]],["preceding",".pri:'si:diŋ","a. 在前的, 前面的\\n[法] 在前的, 在先的, 前面的",["The third quarter GNP growth was 1% over the preceding quarter.","The essential points of my argument have been expressed in the preceding pages."],["第三季國民生產總值較上一季成長了1％。",""]],["selling","'seliŋ","a. 卖的, 销路好的, 出售的\\n[经] 卖盘, 出售, 销路好",["A bar in Shanghai started selling my favorite beer, so I'll take the opportunity to taste some.","Peter was an altruistic video game player; he would give items to people who needed them, rather than selling them for personal profit."],["在上海一家酒吧开始售我最喜欢的啤酒，所以我趁这个机会好好品尝。","彼得是一个利他主义的游戏玩家，他会把东西给需要的人，而不是为一己之私利出售。"]],["allocation",".ælәu'keiʃәn","n. 配置, 分配, 拨给\\n[经] 分配, 拨款, 分摊",["Allocation of resources can be a difficult task when you have no resources at all.","It's all about intelligent allocation of resources."],["",""]],["dismantle","dis'mæntl","vt. 拆除...的设备, 分解, 去除覆盖物",["Inside the court, prosecutors tried to dismantle the defense's arguments one by one.","The question is not merely how to stop a potential genocidal leader, but how to dismantle the system that brought him to power."],["",""]],["honorable","'ɒnәrәbl","a. 值得尊敬的, 荣耀的, 高贵的",["He enthusiastically engaged himself in this honorable undertaking.","You should do the honorable thing and resign."],["她热忱地投身于这份光荣的事业。","你應該光榮地辭職。"]],["communism","'kɒmjunizm","n. 共产主义",["Communism is the system practiced in the Soviet Union.","The American mission is to eliminate communism from the world."],["共產主義是在蘇聯被實行的制度。","美国的任务是将共产主义从世界上消除。"]],["pave","peiv","vt. 铺设, 安排, 铺满, 为...铺路\\n[化] 铺设",["The project was a failure, but it did pave the way for the success of later efforts.","Recent test drilling for oil may pave the way for development of the energy sector."],["",""]],["heap","hi:p","n. 堆, 许多, 累积\\nvt. 堆积, 装满\\n[计] 堆",["It's important to get the carbon-to-nitrogen ratio right in a compost heap.","A delicatessen caught fire and burned down, leaving a heap of ashes."],["",""]],["precaution","pri'kɒ:ʃәn","n. 预防, 留心, 警戒\\nvt. 预先警告",["As a last precaution, I put a flashlight into my pack.","As a precaution against infection, please put on the face mask provided to you."],["",""]],["fry","frai","n. 油炸食物, 鱼苗\\nv. 油炸, 煎",["Tom doesn't even know how to fry an egg.","I cannot fry these eggs. They are rotten."],["汤姆甚至连怎么煎鸡蛋都不知道。","这些鸡蛋坏掉了，不能拿来煎。"]],["glide","glaid","n. 滑动, 滑过, 流水\\nvi. 滑动, 滑翔, 溜走, 流逝\\nvt. 使滑动",["A bird can glide through the air without moving its wings.","Anna observed the dragonfly gracefully glide through the air."],["",""]],["infectious","in'fekʃәs","a. 有传染性的, 易传染的\\n[医] 传染性的",["The infectious case was isolated from other patients.","I like this song. It has an infectious rhythm and it's good to dance to."],["",""]],["nervously","","adv. 焦急地；神经质地；提心吊胆地",["The fans went silent as they nervously watched the penalty shootout between the two teams.","The dog nervously looks at the master."],["球迷们安静下来，绷紧神经，观看两支球队的点球大战。","狗不安地看着他的主人。"]],["onset","'ɒnset","n. 开始, 攻击, 进攻\\n[医] 起始, 开始",["Due to the early onset of winter this year, authorities are forecasting shortages of heating oil.","The onset of a crisis is usually triggered by a spectacular failure which shakes confidence in fictitious forms of capital."],["",""]],["plaza","'plɑ:zә","n. 广场, 市场, 购物区",["There's a movie theatre on the east side of the plaza, about ten minutes walk from here.","The rioters were forcibly removed from the plaza."],["广场东边有一家电影院，从这儿到大概要走十分钟。","广场的暴徒被强制驱离。"]],["infrared",".infrә'red","a. 红外线的\\nn. 红外线",["People show up bright on an infrared camera because of their body heat.","Conservationists in Australia are hoping infrared drones might help save the remaining koala population in New South Wales."],["人會因為體溫而在紅外線攝影機上顯現。",""]],["activism","'æktivizm","n. 激进主义, 行动主义, 能动论\\n[法] 激进主义, 行动主义",["Slacktivism is a portmanteau formed out of the words slacker and activism.","Tom was asked to speak at a college event, which ignited in him a passion for activism."],["",""]],["unstable",".ʌn'steibl","a. 不稳定的",["People's emotional lives are becoming more and more unstable.","In consequence of some badly coded functions, the system is unstable most of the time."],["人們的感情生活越來越不穩定。","由于一些写得糟糕的函数，系统大多数情况下不稳定。"]],["heated","'hi:tid","a. 热的, 激昂的, 兴奋的",["Potassium, heated with a Bunsen burner, gives the flame a lilac color.","No matter how cold it is outside, the rooms are comfortably heated."],["用本生燈加熱鉀，火焰就會呈現淡紫色。","無論外面多麼寒冷，房間始終既舒適又溫暖。"]],["invariably","in'vєәriәbli","adv. 不变化地, 恒定地, 始终如一地",["Mary invariably brought more food than she could eat.","Whenever I get ready to go shopping, he invariably starts getting on my back."],["",""]],["pottery","'pɒtәri","n. 陶器, 陶器厂\\n[化] 陶器",["I'm interested in oriental pottery.","Clay is the essential ingredient in making pottery."],["我对東方陶瓷有兴趣。",""]],["qualitative","'kwɒlitәtiv","a. 性质的, 质的, 定性的",["While a quantitative approach may be useful in certain situations, I think this case necessitates a qualitative analysis.","The qualitative advantage of the second solution was eyecatching. Because of this, the client chose this variation of the project."],["",""]],["saucepan","'sɒ:spәn","n. (长柄有盖)深平底锅, 炖锅",["Tom asked Mary if he could borrow a saucepan and a measuring cup.","Tom opened a can of soup and emptied it into a saucepan."],["",""]],["awe","ɒ:","n. 敬畏\\nvt. 使敬畏",["They watched the solemn ceremony in the church with awe.","Benjamin called the sense of awe and reverence experienced before a great work of art \"aura\"."],["",""]],["internationally",".intә'næʃәnәli","adv. 国际性地, 在国际间",["Kyoto is internationally famous for its scenic beauty.","We are internationally competitive in production technology."],["",""]],["informant","in'fɒ:mәnt","n. 提供消息者, 密告者, 被调查者\\n[经] 填报人, 被征询人",["I cannot disclose any information about the informant.","I can't disclose any information about the informant."],["",""]],["myriad","'miriәd","n. 无数, 无数的人(或物)\\na. 无数的, 种种的",["Fans of the original comic had a field day with the myriad continuity issues of the movie adaptation.","The Way produces one, one produces two, two produces three, and three produces the myriad things."],["",""]],["reluctantly","rɪ'lʌktəntlɪ","adv. 不情愿地, 勉强地",["He reluctantly agreed to my proposal.","Reluctantly, he started the engine and drove off."],["他不情愿地同意了我的提案。","他不情愿地启动引擎开车走了。"]],["scout","skaut","n. 守候, 侦察, 搜索, 侦察员, 侦察机\\nvi. 守候, 侦察, 巡视, 嘲笑\\nvt. 侦察, 跟踪, 发现, 监视, 嘲弄",["Tom and Mary spent the weekend scrambling up and down Kinder Scout in the Peak District.","Adriano's star potential caught the attention of a talent scout."],["",""]],["metro","'metrәu","n. 地铁",["I thought that the metro was free, so I went without a ticket.","Almost stepped on a gecko while going to the metro."],["我以為地鐵是免費的，所以我沒買票就去了。","去地铁的路上差点踩到一只壁虎。"]],["insufficient",".insә'fiʃәnt","a. 不够的, 不能胜任的, 不充足的\\n[法] 不足的, 不充分的, 不能胜任的",["Don't read under insufficient light, for it is bad for your eyes.","There is insufficient light to take pictures."],["不要在太暗的光線下看書，那對你的眼睛不好的。","拍照片光线不够亮。"]],["folder","'fәuldә","n. 文件夹, 折纸机, 折叠式书本, 卷宗\\n[计] 文件夹",["In which folder did you save the file?","Uninstall method: Chuck the whole folder into the recycle bin."],["你把文件存到哪个文件夹了?",""]],["exposed","ik'spәuzd","a. 暴露的, 无掩蔽的, 易受攻击的",["Skin shouldn't be exposed to sunlight for too long.","Tom was exposed to a wide variety of music as a child through his mother's vast record collection."],["不要把皮肤长时间暴露在阳光里。","由於母親收藏了一整屋的唱片，湯姆小時候便有機會接觸各種類型的音樂。"]],["exemption","ig'zempʃәn","n. 解除, 免除, 免税\\n[化] 免检",["We give foreign tourists the privilege of tax exemption.","Is death the only possible exemption?"],["","死是唯一的解脫方式嗎？"]],["saut","sәj","<法>n.(芭蕾舞用语)跳[字面意义：leap]",["My child cannot say \"Kinpira style sauteed Gobo\", he always says \"Pinkira style sauteed Bogo\" instead."],[""]],["crap","kræp","n. 废物, 废话\\nvi. 掷骰子",["You've got to be some special kind of crazy to like this crap.","Is that a car accident? Crap, now I'll never make it to work on time!"],["你一定是疯了才会喜欢上这破烂。","那是出車禍了嗎？可惡，我現在絕對來不及準時上班了！"]],["stew","stju:","n. 炖, 烦恼, 热浴, 妓院, 鱼塘\\nvi. 炖, 焖, 忧虑\\nvt. 炖, 焖, 使焦虑",["How about staying for dinner? I'm making a big pot of stew.","Today's stew has been carefully and slowly boiled to perfect deliciousness."],["",""]],["governing","'^ʌvәniŋ","[计] 调节, 控制",["Governing Algeria's mountainous territory is not easy.","Although he had fewer supporters among the governing class, he was able to get the popular vote."],["",""]],["antenna","æn'tenә","n. 天线, 触须, 触角\\n[化] 天线",["The man tried to install his own antenna.","The antenna on the roof needs to be fixed, but Tom is afraid of heights, so Mary will climb onto the roof."],["这男人试着安装他自己的天线。",""]],["printed","'printid","a. 印刷的, 印好的, 印花样的\\n[电] 印刷的",["Both of these are Song Dynasty block-printed editions.","This book will be printed next year."],["這兩本都是宋本。","这本书明年要出版。"]],["subcommittee","'sʌbkә.miti","n. 小组委员会",["The Atlantis shuttle crew carried out one last task Thursday before wrapping up their mission to repair the Hubble Space Telescope. They beamed in via satellite to a Senate subcommittee considering the budget of the U.S. space agency, NASA."],[""]],["trousers","'trauzәz","pl. 裤子, 长裤",["I want to buy a few pairs of trousers.","Why don't you try this jacket on? It looks nice with your trousers."],["我想买几条裤子。",""]],["plausible","'plɒ:zibl","a. 貌似真实的, 貌似合理的, 说得煞有其事的\\n[法] 花言巧语的, 似乎有理的",["Your explanation sounds plausible, but it just doesn't hold water.","A more plausible proposal is the one Leech presented in conjunction with Emmet's theory."],["",""]],["sneakers","","n. 胶底运动鞋（sneaker的复数形式）",["Your sneakers are dirty; take them off before you come in.","That boy put on his sneakers and ran outside."],["你的运动鞋太脏了，进来前脱掉。","那个男孩穿上了他的运动鞋，跑向外面。"]],["someplace","'sʌmpleis","adv. 在某处\\nn. 某处",["If you goof it up twice, I suggest hightailing it to Moscow or someplace.","Let me take you to someplace where you'll be safe."],["",""]],["energetic",".enә'dʒetik","a. 精力充沛的, 积极的",["The young man is both capable and energetic, needless to say.","This soccer match is full of energetic and splendid competition."],["这小伙子既能干又积极，真是没说的。","这场足球赛充满着激情和精彩的竞争。"]],["secrecy","'si:krisi","n. 秘密, 保密\\n[法] 秘密, 秘密状态, 保密",["I can't tell you any particulars. I am bound to secrecy.","Eve swore Minnie to secrecy in hopes that she wouldn't tattle about what they'd done."],["",""]],["abusive","ә'bju:siv","a. 恶言谩骂的, 被滥用的, 腐败的, 虐待的",["The purpose of antitrust law is to stop the abusive influence of the market by big companies.","I had never received such an abusive letter before."],["反垄断法律的目的是遏制大公司滥用市场影响力。",""]],["airborne","'єәbɒ:n","a. 升空的, 空运的, 空中传播的, 空降的",["Once we are airborne, you make unbuckle your seatbelts.","They published the first study linking airborne plastic fragments and fibers to climate change Wednesday."],["",""]],["harass","'hærәs","vt. 使困扰, 使烦恼, 折磨",["Tom made a list of left-leaning professors for his followers to harass and send death threats to.","Skura wasn't the only girl that Yanni would harass."],["",""]],["ethic","'eθik","n. 道德规范, 伦理",["This attitude, the Protestant work ethic, still influences Americans today.","Carlos's work ethic is an inspiration to his colleagues."],["",""]],["embarrass","im'bærәs","vt. 使困窘, 使局促不安, 阻碍",["But showing off the presents could embarrass the guests who did not bring one.","I wanted to hug you, but I knew it would embarrass you if I did."],["",""]],["substantive","'sʌbstәntiv","a. 表示实在的, 有实质的, 独立存在的, 大量的, 重大的, 坚实的, 名词的\\nn. 名词性实词, 名词",["Some can talk on and on, about nothing substantive, ad infinitum."],[""]],["endanger","in'deindʒә","vt. 危及\\n[法] 使危险, 危及",["I would never do anything that could endanger Tom.","You shouldn't endanger your children just because some fruit loop claims vaccines cause autism."],["",""]],["grader","'^reidә","n. 把东西分类别的人/机器, 平路机, 推土机",["Today, our teacher told us that those who smoke will never grow up. In order to prove it, she shot a seventh-grader named Petya.","Sami was going to fight a sixth grader."],["",""]],["billboard","'bilbɒ:d","n. 广告牌, 布告板\\nvt. 宣传",["Selena Gomez's second album hit Billboard Magazine's top two hundred albums chart at number four.","The actress is featured on a large billboard advertising makeup."],["",""]],["confer","kәn'fә:","vt. 授予, 带来\\nvi. 协商",["If you have some troubles, I recommend you confer with him.","If purchase does not confer ownership, then piracy isn't theft."],["",""]],["daytime","'deitaim","n. 白天, 日间",["The thieves knocked off another bank today in a daytime robbery.","The Summer Solstice is the day with the longest daytime hours of the year."],["今天强盗大白天的就抢了另一家银行。","夏至是一年中，日昼时间最长的一天。"]],["paralyze","'pærәlaiz","vt. 使瘫痪, 使麻痹\\n[医] 使麻痹, 使瘫痪",["A vampire can paralyze people just by looking at them.","Aggregating anemones use their tentacles to sting and paralyze prey."],["",""]],["designated","'deziɡ.neitid","a. 特指的；指定的",["More recently, some hutongs have been designated as protected areas in an attempt to preserve this aspect of Chinese cultural history.","Tickets are $30 per person and $13 for designated drivers."],["最近，有些胡同被指定为保护区，以试图保存这方面的中国文化历史。",""]],["thermal","'θә:ml","a. 热的, 热量的, 温泉的\\nn. 上升温暖气流",["The atomic reactor generates enormous amounts of thermal energy.","Yellowstone Park has many thermal areas of geysers and mud pots."],["原子反应堆发出大量的热能。",""]],["precinct","'pri:siŋkt","n. 区域, 管理区, 管辖区域\\n[法] 管辖区, 选区, 分界",["During a sprint through the pedestrian precinct, I collided with a man eating a currywurst.","Ziri was brought to the precinct for interrogation."],["",""]],["arouse","ә'rauz","vt. 唤醒, 鼓励, 引起\\nvi. 醒来",["Coffee does not arouse my interest.","The most valuable quality she possesses is the ability to arouse enthusiasm in people."],["咖啡不能引起我的兴趣。",""]],["shrub","ʃrʌb","n. 矮树, 灌木, 果汁甜酒",["I have a large shrub in my front lawn that needs to be trimmed.","The latest treatment, artemisinin, comes from a Chinese shrub."],["",""]],["underway","'ʌndә'wei","a. 航行中的；进行中的；起步的",["A campaign is underway throughout the company to achieve economy in the use of copying paper.","A national campaign for energy saving is underway."],["",""]],["grove","grәuv","n. 小树林",["In spring, the bamboo grove outside Hsinchu City is especially green.","Australian firefighters saved the world's only grove of Wollemi pines."],["春天的時候，新竹城外的竹林特別翠綠。",""]],["napkin","'næpkin","n. 餐巾, 餐巾纸, 尿布",["This project grew out of a sketch I made on a napkin at a party last year.","Mary wrote her phone number on a napkin and handed it to Tom."],["",""]],["pressing","'presiŋ","a. 紧迫的, 迫切的, 热切的\\nn. 压, 压榨, 冲压件, 唱片",["I wonder if I can add a sentence simply by pressing the 'enter' key.","Tom told Mary that he didn't have anything pressing to do."],["",""]],["consolidate","kәn'sɒlideit","vt. 巩固, 使联合, 统一\\nvi. 巩固\\n[计] 合并计算",["Let's consolidate our research and present our results at the meeting tomorrow.","They continued to consolidate their leadership position in that space."],["",""]],["stressful","","a. 着重, 强调, 重读, 使受应力",["Men and women between the ages of 25 and 54 have the most stressful lives.","Cities are exciting places, but also stressful."],["25 歲至 54 歲的男女生活壓力最大。","城市是令人興奮的地方，但也會讓人產生壓力。"]],["tribunal","trai'bju:nl","n. 法庭, 法官席, 裁决\\n[法] 法庭, 裁判所, 裁判",["The next day, the tribunal sentenced him to death.","He is undermining and dishonoring genuine victims and their causes at this tribunal."],["",""]],["unload",".ʌn'lәud","vi. 卸货\\nvt. 从...卸下, 摆脱...之负担, 倾销, 卸(货)\\n[计] 卸载",["I will not unload the car because other workers have to do that.","I won't unload the car because that's somebody else's job."],["",""]],["dental","'dentl","a. 牙齿的\\n[医] 牙的, 齿的, 齿音, 齿音字母",["I usually use dental floss as part of my dental hygiene.","Brushing the teeth helps protect against dental caries."],["",""]],["cockpit","'kɒkpit","n. 驾驶员座舱, 战场",["The future pilot is trained in a mock cockpit.","The most experienced pilots have logged many thousands of hours in the cockpit."],["未来飞行员会在虚拟驾驶舱里训练。",""]],["nationalist","'næʃәnәlist","n. 国家主义者, 民族主义者",["I'm not a nationalist, I'm a patriot.","The Nationalist movements in both countries have been exacerbating the problem."],["我不是个民族主义者，我是爱国者。",""]],["pornography","pɔ:'nɔ^rәfi","n. 色情描写, 黄色书刊, 色情画, 色情照片, 色情文学\\n[法] 色情画, 色情文学, 黄色读物",["Japanese anime these days is becoming more and more like pornography.","Child pornography is illegal in most countries, but Saeb wants me to make up sentences about it."],["现在的日本动画片越来越色情了！",""]],["urine","'juәrin","n. 小便, 尿\\n[医] 尿",["I don't like dirty animals. Especially those animals that smear urine on their bodies.","What color is your urine: clear, dark yellow, reddish, or brown like beer?"],["我不喜欢肮脏的动物。尤其是那些涂尿在身上的动物。","你的尿液是什么颜色的：浅色的、深黄色的、浅红色的还是像啤酒一样的咖啡色？"]],["obesity","әu'bi:siti","n. 肥胖\\n[医] 肥胖, 多脂",["Daily exercise is effective in overcoming obesity.","The only remaining region in the world where obesity is uncommon is sub-Saharan Africa."],["",""]],["affluent","'æfluәnt","a. 丰富的, 富裕的\\nn. 支流, 富人",["Humanity is now affluent due to progression in science and technology.","The increase in amateur stealing on the part of middle-class youth indicates a break-down in the morality of the affluent."],["由于科学技术的进步，人类现在很富裕。",""]],["cozy","'kәuzi","a. 舒适的, 安逸的, 惬意的\\nn. (茶壶等的)保暖罩, 舒适的座位\\nvt. 以假话使安心",["His home is furnished in a very cozy way.","Sami and Layla were taking their lunches at a cozy hotel."],["他家的布局非常温馨。",""]],["takeover","","n. 接管, 接收\\n[经] 接收",["We, ACME Ltd., hereby announce that we will resist with all our strength this hostile takeover.","Predictably, after Elon Musk's takeover, Twitter was flooded with Nazi spam."],["我們ACME有限公司，特此宣布，我們將盡我們的力量抵制這種惡意收購。",""]],["exacerbate","ek'sæsәbeit","vt. 使恶化, 使增剧, 激怒, 使加剧",["Hot and blustery conditions will exacerbate the risk of fire tomorrow.","Climate change threatens to exacerbate existing social and economic inequalities."],["",""]],["milky","'milki","a. 乳状的, 乳白色的, 柔和的",["The Milky Way consists of about a hundred billion stars.","The solar system is a small celestial system in the Milky Way."],["银河系大约由一千亿颗恒星组成。","太陽系是銀河系中一個小的天體系统。"]],["innings","","n. 局, 回合, 盘, 一局, 当权期间",["After the second innings, the opposing pitcher recovered too, and it turned into a pitching duel."],[""]],["realism","'riәlizm","n. 写实主义, 现实, 实在论\\n[法] 现实主义",["What terrible tragedies realism inflicts on people.","He stood agape for a moment in front of the painting, surprised at its realism."],["",""]],["tangible","'tændʒәbl","n. 可触知的东西, 有形资产\\na. 可触摸的, 有实体的, 非相像的, 有形的, 明确的",["Service economy is a useful labor that does not produce a tangible commodity.","For all those things which are qualities of the tangible object, qua tangible, we perceive by touch."],["",""]],["feat","fi:t","n. 壮举, 功绩, 技艺表演\\na. 灵巧的, 合适的, 整洁的",["The candles were placed at least a feat from each other.","To read books in a scholarly manner is a feat that requires more than just liking to read."],["",""]],["groan","grәun","n. 呻吟, 叹息\\nvi. 呻吟, 抱怨, 受压迫\\nvt. 呻吟地说",["He let out an exaggerated groan and put his hand on the doorknob.","I am tired of hearing you moan and groan."],["",""]],["militant","'militәnt","a. 好战的",["The man was said to be part of a rogue militant group.","He was the head of the League of Militant Atheists."],["",""]],["dwell","dwel","vi. 居住, 居住(于), 存在(于)",["For they were exceeding rich, and could not dwell together: neither was the land in which they sojourned able to bear them, for the multitude of their flocks.","They must protect all the people who dwell in this country."],["因為他們的財物過多，不能同居共處：他們寄居的地方也容不下他們，因為他們的牲畜甚多。",""]],["torch","tɒ:tʃ","n. 火把, 启发之物\\n[化] 火炬",["You won't see a thing without a torch.","You won't see anything without a torch."],["沒有手電筒的話你什麼都看不到。","沒有手電筒的話你什麼都看不到。"]],["lurk","lә:k","n. 潜伏, 潜行\\nvi. 暗藏, 潜伏, 埋伏\\n[计] 隐匿阅读",["In the depths of the human soul, dark feelings lurk.","Cyber espionage and identity theft abound while organized criminals and national spies lurk."],["",""]],["hay","hei","n. 干草\\nvt. 制干草, 供给干草\\nvi. 晒干草",["If the hay caught fire, it would be a real disaster.","Since I had suffered from hay fever for many years, this medicine was truly like a salvation."],["",""]],["spinach","'spinitʃ","n. 菠菜, 货币, 胡说八道",["Chocolate has more iron than spinach.","Tom didn't like spinach when he was a child."],["巧克力含有比菠菜更多的鐵質。","汤姆小时候不喜欢菠菜。"]],["mistress","'mistris","n. 主妇, 女主人, 情妇",["With Linda out of the way, Dan could marry Rita, his mistress.","I'm afraid of discord arising with my husband so I'm turning a blind eye to his mistress."],["",""]],["swiftly","'swiftli","adv. 很快地, 即刻",["With a glance of her, he left swiftly.","Spirits of Heaven and Earth, heed my call; manifest swiftly by divine decree!"],["他看了她一眼就马上离开了。","天靈靈，地靈靈；急急如律令！"]],["terminate","'tә:mineit","a. 有结尾的, (可)结束的\\nvi. 结束, 终止, 满期\\nvt. 使停止, 使结束, 使终止\\n[计] 终止",["Participation in a strike does not entitle the employer to terminate the employee's contract of employment.","Owing to a problem with one of the carriages, this train will terminate at this station."],["",""]],["huddle","'hʌdl","n. 杂乱一团, 混乱, 拥挤\\nvt. 把...挤在一起, 乱堆, 草率了事, 蜷曲\\nvi. 挤作一团, 蜷缩",["On a windswept barren mountainside, several kilometers east of Gardez, a few hundred men huddle against the cold.","Penguins often huddle together to keep warm."],["",""]],["tactical","'tæktikl","a. 战术的, 用兵上的, 策略的",["In a game of chess, many tactical moves are based on the ability of the knights to simultaneously attack two opponent's pieces.","A tactical retreat is sometimes interpreted as cowardice."],["",""]],["attic","'ætik","n. 阁楼, 顶楼\\n[医] 鼓室上隐窝",["The attic was a long, low-ceilinged room, dark and fragrant with the odor of the cedar.","They cleaned everything, from the basement to the attic."],["閣樓是一個狹長的低矮房間，光線昏暗，瀰漫著雪松的香氣。","他们从地下室到阁楼都打扫了。"]],["constellation",".kɒnstә'leiʃәn","n. 星座, 荟萃\\n[化] 构象",["The Serpent Bearer is an outspread but not very prominent constellation.","One constellation that most people know is the Big Dipper."],["",""]],["beetle","'bi:tl","n. 甲虫, 大槌\\nvi. 快速移动\\nvt. 捶",["June beetle grubs feed on plant roots.","Yanni saw his son playing with a June beetle."],["六月金龜子的幼蟲以植物根部為食。","雅尼看到兒子在玩一隻金龜子。"]],["populate","'pɔpjuleit","vt. 使人口聚居在...中, 殖民于, 移民于, 居住于, 定居于",["If we humans want to survive for hundreds of thousands of millions of years, we must ultimately populate other planets.","If humans eventually populate outer space, and it is very iffy, what kind of society will they want?"],["",""]],["maneuver","mә'nu:vә","n. 演习, 调遣, 策略\\nv. 调遣, 演习, 用计",["The tunnel was very narrow, but Ziri could maneuver through it.","Birds change the shape of their wings to turn and maneuver."],["",""]],["probation","prәu'beiʃәn","n. 鉴定, 查验, 证明, 试用, 察看, 缓刑\\n[医] 审辨, 试验, 鉴定, 试用, 见习",["Tom was sentenced to five days in jail and a year on probation for drunken driving.","Sami was sentenced to 16 months in prison and 3 years probation."],["",""]],["wreck","rek","n. 失事, 残骸, 破坏\\nvt. 使失事, 拆毁, 破坏\\nvi. (船)失事, 营救失事船只",["You're going to wreck your eyesight if you play games all the time.","Driving on a slippery road can lead to a car wreck."],["要是你老打游戏的话，你的视力会下降的。","在光滑的路上开车会导致车祸。"]],["smack","smæk","n. 风味, 滋味, 少量, 拍击声, 咂嘴声, 小渔船, 海洛因\\nvi. 有味道, 咂嘴, 发出拍击声\\nvt. 拍, 打, 掴, 咂…",["Kansas is smack dab in the middle of the US.","Yesterday I was on my way home from work when I ran smack into my old girlfriend."],["堪薩斯州剛好位於美國的中央。",""]],["turk","tә:k","n. 土耳其人, 土耳其马",["No turbaned Turk, no hired Venetian or Malay, could have smote him with more seeming malice.","It was a Turk who observed it for the first time. He talked about it at an astronomy congress."],["",""]],["civilized","'sivilaizd","a. 文明的, 有礼的",["All civilized countries are against war.","If it were not for electricity, our civilized life would be impossible."],["所有文明的國家都反對戰爭。",""]],["subscriber","sʌbs'kraibә","n. 签署者, 捐献者, 订户\\n[经] 定户",["The subscriber you are calling is currently not available, please try your call again later.","Ziri was a subscriber on a Berber-language Facebook page."],["",""]],["pirate","'paiәrәt","n. 海盗, 盗印者, 侵犯专利权者\\nvt. 盗印, 掠夺, 翻印\\nvi. 做海盗, 从事劫掠",["We could see what we thought was a pirate ship in the distance.","Christopher Columbus enjoyed the torrents of Pirate Bay and would often go surfing there."],["",""]],["sewage","'sju:idʒ","n. 脏水, 污水\\n[医] 污水, 污物",["This water needs to go to a sewage treatment plant.","Algeria has recently built many sewage treatment plants."],["",""]],["renowned","ri'naund","a. 有名的, 有声誉的",["The country is renowned for the beauty of its mountain scenery.","Sami is the director of a renowned translation office."],["",""]],["gee","'dʒi:","n. 马, 家伙\\ninterj. 向右, 前进, 哎呀(惊讶时所发声音)\\nv. (使)向右转",["I've just lost on the gee-gees, so I'm brassic.","\"Gee, it sure is boring around here!\" \"Yeah, you're so boring I could die.\""],["",""]],["baptist","'bæptist","n. 施洗礼者, 浸礼会教友",["Many Pharisees and Sadducees came to the baptism of John the Baptist.","Christians identify John the Baptist with the prophet Elijah."],["",""]],["dusk","dʌsk","n. 薄暮, 傍晚, 黄昏\\na. 微暗的\\nv. (使)微暗",["At dusk, the sky glows with a purple light.","At dusk, the sky was dyed with purple light."],["傍晚時分，天空泛著紫色的光。","黃昏時分，天空染上了紫色的光。"]],["sweetheart","'swi:thɑ:t","n. 心上人, 爱人\\nvi. 爱慕\\nvt. 向...求爱",["Tom's suffering from the absence of his sweetheart Mary.","Sweetheart, we need to go to the supermarket. We ran out of milk."],["",""]],["platter","'plætә","n. 大浅盘, 主菜盘\\n[计] 底板",["Ziri was handing Rima her dreams on a silver platter.","Benedito's restaurant has a dessert tasting platter."],["",""]],["masculine","'mæskjulin","n. 阳性, 男性\\na. 男性的, 阳性的, 有丈夫气的",["Confidence and courage are not just masculine traits; they are values anyone can strive for.","There is no \"masculine\" way of learning."],["自信與勇氣不僅是男性特質，也可以是所有人都能追求的價值。","所谓的＂男性特色教育学＂根本就不存在。"]],["lingering","'liŋɡәriŋ","a. 拖延的",["What are you lingering for? Hurry up and go.","The smell of last night's dinner was still lingering in the kitchen."],["你磨蹭什么呀，快点去吧。",""]],["printing","'printiŋ","n. 印刷, 印刷术, 印花\\n[计] 打印; 印刷",["My printer is very low on all four ink cartridges, and the quality of the printing is poor.","Mistakes in the printing should be pointed out at once."],["",""]],["crumb","krʌm","n. 碎屑, 面包屑, 少许\\nvt. 捏碎, 弄碎",["Wherever a loving hand had strewn bread crumbs for the birds, the little bird only ate one crumb and gave the rest away.","Clean out the toaster's crumb tray regularly to prevent a fire hazard."],["",""]],["disposition",".dispә'ziʃәn","n. 性情, 处置, 处理, 布置\\n[医] 素因, 性情",["He is so mild in disposition that I have never heard him speak in a loud voice.","The human mind has a natural disposition to scientific knowledge, and to the things connected with it."],["",""]],["allergy","'ælәdʒi","n. 变应性, 反感, 厌恶\\n[化] 变态反应; 变应性",["Peanut allergy is the most common of food allergies.","Constantly blowing his nose in allergy season."],["花生過敏是最常見的食物過敏。","在过敏的季节不断地擤他的鼻子."]],["provocative","prә'vɒkәtiv","a. 激发感情的, 挑拨的, 刺激的\\nn. 刺激物, 挑拨物, 兴奋剂",["After seeing her provocative body, he became obsessed with her.","Engaging in the provocative act of burning the Quran perpetuates stereotypes and promotes discrimination against Muslims."],["",""]],["stolen","'stәulәn","steal的过去分词\\n[经] 被偷窃的",["The police have been searching for the stolen goods for almost a month.","Tom went swimming in the river, but when he got out, his clothes had been stolen."],["警察大概从一个月前就开始找被偷物品了。","汤姆去河里游泳，但当他出来时，他的衣服被偷了。"]],["batter","'bætә","v. 连续猛打（尤其指妇女），猛击\\nn. 面糊（食物），击球员，打击手",["To be a good batter, you've got to hang loose and follow your instincts.","If our last batter had not hit a home run, team would have lost the game."],["想成為一個好的擊球手的話，你要在球場上時刻保持鎮定，還要學會相信自己的直覺。",""]],["dart","dɑ:t","n. 飞镖, 投射\\nvt. 投射\\nvi. 疾走, 突进",["Arn Chorn-Pond sits with his eyes closed, exhaling as his fingers dart along his bamboo flute.","The scorpion struck with its venomous dart, leaving a burning sting."],["",""]],["reversal","ri'vә:sl","n. 翻转, 颠倒, 反转\\n[医] 逆转, 颠倒",["The recent data has caused a reversal of expectations.","Her new statement is a reversal of her previous position."],["",""]],["wax","wæks","n. 蜡, 蜡状物, 一阵发怒, 增加, (月亮)渐盈\\nvi. 变大, 增大, 月亮渐满\\nvt. 上蜡于",["Burning the candle at both ends reduces the candle to wax in a hurry - just like a playboy having a pretty girl on each arm.","This car wax gives permanent protection against heavy rain."],["",""]],["disappointing",".disә'pɒintiŋ","a. 使失望的, 期待落空的, 令人沮丧的",["The speaker didn't know his subject, nor did he speak well; in short, he was disappointing.","A blanket of silence fell over everyone when they heard the disappointing announcement."],["演讲者不熟悉他的主题，说得又不好，总之，他很糟糕。",""]],["sob","sɒb","vi. 啜泣, 呜咽\\nvt. 哭诉, 哭得使\\nn. 啜泣, 呜咽",["No one over the age of thirty doesn't have a broken heart, and everyone has a sob story.","\"But I don't want to be digested,\" shouted Pinocchio, starting to sob."],["",""]],["allegiance","ә'li:dʒәns","n. 忠贞, 效忠",["The knight swore an oath of allegiance to the king.","The knight swears an oath of allegiance to the King."],["騎士宣誓效忠於國王。","騎士宣誓效忠於國王。"]],["felony","'felәni","n. 重罪\\n[法] 重罪, 重刑罪",["It's illegal to aid and abet another person in committing a felony.","Petty larceny is a misdemeanor; grand larceny is a felony."],["",""]],["retiree","ri.taiә'ri:","n. 退休人员, 退休者\\n[法] 退休者, 退职者",["Our city's pension system is being strained by a growing retiree population.","There will be two workers for every retiree in the next 20 years."],["",""]],["graceful","'greisful","a. 优美的",["The spectators were moved by her graceful performance.","Graceful degradation is a close second to robustness."],["",""]],["socialism","'sәuʃәlizm","n. 社会主义, 社会主义运动",["Modern Algeria has embarked on a process of Arabization, Islamization and socialism and this threefold policy has been a failure.","Socialism is the same as Communism, only better English."],["",""]],["freezer","fri:zә","n. 冰库, 冰箱, 冷冻库",["There are several good reasons why I have a freezer.","Her friends had to padlock the freezer to prevent her from eating ice cream."],["",""]],["wholesale","'hәulseil","n. 批发\\na. 批发的, 大规模的\\nadv. 大规模, 照批发方式\\nvi. 经营批发业, 批发\\nvt. 批发",["Organic kale is hand picked, washed and packed on site at Sprouting Farms, West Virginia, for retail and wholesale.","What was supposed to be a targeted military operation deteriorated into wholesale slaughter of civilians."],["有機羽衣甘藍在西維吉尼亞州的 Sprouting Farms 現場手工採摘、清洗和包裝，提供零售和批發。",""]],["disastrous","di'zɑ:strәs","a. 损失惨重的, 悲伤的",["Pollution has a disastrous effect on the ecology of a region.","Solar storms next year could prove disastrous for the electrical grid."],["環境污染可以對一個區域的生態造成極大的影響。",""]],["fusion","'fju:ʒәn","n. 熔合物, 结合, 熔合\\n[化] 熔融; 熔化; 聚变",["Jazz fusion is a combination of rock and jazz.","The physicist was aware of the potential danger of nuclear fusion."],["融合爵士是搖滾樂與爵士樂的融合。",""]],["adversary","'ædvәsәri","n. 敌手, 对手\\na. 敌手的, 敌对的",["Even in these supposedly modern times, the Russian army is still relying on so-called meat waves to overwhelm the adversary.","Fear is an adversary that one must face to move forward."],["",""]],["voucher","'vautʃә","n. 证人, 保证人, 证明者, 凭证, 凭单\\nvt. 证实...的可靠性",["Mary was cross because Tom had given her a gift voucher as a present.","With the travel voucher, trips are cheaper and I can make free transfers."],["",""]],["subsidize","'sʌbsidaiz","vt. 补助, 资助, 贿赂\\n[经] 资助, 津贴, 给...补助金",["The city should subsidize small businesses in industries with large overhead costs.","It is not uncommon for the government to subsidize agriculture."],["市府應補貼經常性開支龐大的產業中的小型企業。",""]],["fingertip","'fiŋgәtip","n. 指尖, 指套",["We want to take some blood from your fingertip for examinination.","A bright red ladybug landed on my fingertip."],["",""]],["shovel","'ʃʌvl","n. 铲, 铁铲\\nv. 铲",["Tom is going to shovel the snow off the roof for us.","I dug a huge pit with my shovel in just one day."],["汤姆正要为我们铲掉屋顶上的雪。","我只用一天就用鏟子挖了一個大坑。"]],["puppet","'pʌpit","n. 傀儡, 木偶\\n[法] 木偶, 傀儡, 受他人操纵的人",["During the 20th century, Manchukuo was a puppet state.","I always find puppet shows a bit creepy."],["在20世紀期間，滿洲國是一個傀儡國家。","我总觉得木偶戏有点吓人。"]],["chapel","'tʃæpәl","n. 小教堂, 礼拜式",["Tessa shared her experience in a chapel assembly this April.","With heads respectfully bowed, they carried the coffin up the steps and into the small chapel."],["今年四月，苔絲在教會集會上分享了她的經驗。",""]],["throne","'θrәun","n. 王座, 君主",["With the heirless king going crazy and royal family poisoned, the general of the army finally had his chance to usurp the throne.","Prince William is second in line to the English throne."],["随着无继承人的国王的发疯和王室家族的中毒，将军终于有机会篡夺王位。","威廉王子是英国王位第二顺位继承人。"]],["filling","'filiŋ","n. 充填物, 填料\\n[化] 加填; 填充",["Tom is filling his sentence counter on Tatoeba by adding translations from an English-Russian phrasebook.","I don't feel like filling out this questionnaire. There are too many items."],["湯姆在 Tatoeba 上添加英俄短語手冊中的翻譯，來增加他的句子數。",""]],["intricate","'intrikit","a. 复杂的, 错综的, 缠结的, 难懂的",["Great thoughts are created through intricate details.","The statesman barely coped with the intricate issue."],["细节成就伟大的想法。",""]],["gunman","'gʌnmәn","n. 枪手, 持枪的歹徒, 制造枪械者\\n[法] 持枪歹徒, 持枪抢劫或杀人者, 枪炮工人",["Last year, a fake news story about a Washington pizza restaurant went viral, causing a gunman to open fire at the business.","The crazy gunman threatened to kill me."],["",""]],["pastoral","'pæstәrәl","n. 牧歌, 田园诗\\na. 牧人的, 田园生活的, 牧师的, 田园式的",["No trace of Napoleon's waltz across Europe appears in the pastoral novels of Jane Austen."],[""]],["scheduled","'skedʒuәld","a. 预定的",["The server reboot is scheduled at 9 o'clock this evening.","The meeting between the school and the business is scheduled to be held on the 26th of December."],["服务器重启预定在今晚9点。","学校与企业见面会于12月26日按期举行。"]],["orchard","'ɒ:tʃәd","n. 果园, 果树林",["I delight in going to the apple orchard each fall.","Finally the children saw a little orchard in the middle of the mountain with apple trees growing inside it."],["我樂意每年秋季去蘋果園。",""]],["floating","'flәutiŋ","a. 漂浮的, 浮动的, 移动的\\n[医] 浮动的",["The Sargasso Sea is a vast patch of ocean named for a genus of free-floating seaweed called Sargassum.","The sea looked quite green, and large icebergs were floating about."],["馬尾藻海是一片廣闊的海域，因一種名為「馬尾藻」的自由漂浮海藻而得名。","海水看起來一片碧綠，巨大的冰山漂浮在周圍。"]],["explosives","","n. 爆炸物, 炸药；爆炸品（explosive的复数）",["For detecting drugs or hidden explosives, there's no technology that can match a dog's nose.","Tom planted some explosives near the middle of the bridge."],["",""]],["fingerprint","'fiŋgәprint","n. 指纹\\nvt. 采指纹",["The first thing that caught his eye was a fingerprint on the glass.","Ziri needed his mom's fingerprint to complete the payment process."],["",""]],["auditor","'ɒ:ditә","n. 审计员, 听者, 旁听生\\n[经] 审计(查帐)员, 审计师, 会计检查员",["The auditor picked up some anomalies in the company's accounts."],[""]],["renovation",".renәu'veiʃәn","n. 革新, 刷新, 修理\\n[化] 改建",["The social welfare system is in bad need of renovation.","We had to look for a place to stay while our house is under renovation."],["",""]],["mural","'mjuәrәl","a. 壁的, 壁上的, 壁似的\\nn. 壁画",["Don't forget to check if there are any new messages on the school mural.","A mural in the tomb depicts 12 monkeys with talismans, to help the soul find its way to eternity."],["",""]],["burger","'bә:ɡә","n. 汉堡包（等于hamburger）",["Stefan offered Rima a veggie burger.","I enjoy a veggie burger with avocado."],["史蒂芬給了麗瑪一個素食漢堡。","我喜歡吃加酪梨的素食漢堡。"]],["glue","glu:","n. 胶, 粘性物\\nvt. 粘合, 胶合",["Bees pollinate flowers and trees, and collect nectar to make honey, bee glue and bee venom.","Some furniture is put together with glue."],["蜜蜂為花卉和樹木授粉，並採集花蜜來製造蜂蜜、蜂膠和蜂毒。","一些家具是用膠水黏在一起。"]],["chick","tʃik","n. 小鸡, 小鸟, 竹帘",["A chicken hatches an egg and a chick emerges.","She hovers over that child like a hen with one chick."],["母雞孵蛋，孵出小雞。",""]],["chord","kɒ:d","n. 弦, 和音\\n[医] 索, 带",["The piano is a chord instrument, while the flute is a monophonic instrument.","I can't quite figure out what that chord around 1:58 is. Can somebody help me out?"],["钢琴是和弦乐器，笛子是单音乐器。","我聽來聽去也聽不到一分五十八秒左右的那個和弦是甚麼和弦，有人可以幫幫我嗎？"]],["sideline","'saidlain","n. 副业, 旁线, 界线, 兼职, 旁观者看法\\nvt. 使退出比赛场地",["Mr. Federer is challenging the call on the right sideline. The ball was called out."],[""]],["visibility",".vizi'biliti","n. 可见性, 能见度, 能见距离\\n[计] 可见性",["Due to limited visibility, navigation may be difficult.","Visibility was severely restricted in the heavy fog."],["",""]],["diaper","'daiәpә","n. 尿布\\n[医] 尿布, 兜布",["Skura stopped at the gas station to change her baby's diaper.","He wore a diaper on long flights because of his incontinence."],["",""]],["restructuring","","[计] 重构的",["If it's going to require a total restructuring, I'm sure they will be satisfied with the old system.","Thanks to a fundamental restructuring, our surplus has swelled three-fold."],["",""]],["unified","'ju:nifaid","a. 统一的；一致标准的",["We want you to take command of this unified force.","We need to form a unified front against the enemies of Algeria."],["",""]],["theatrical","θi'ætrikl","a. 剧场的, 夸张的, 戏剧性的\\nn. 戏剧演出",["Tom and Mary's story is very theatrical.","He spoke with great enthusiasm of the theatrical performance."],["汤姆和玛丽的故事富有戏剧性。",""]],["turbine","'tә:bain","n. 涡轮机\\n[化] 涡轮机",["The vegetation and the murmuring water calm my ardent mind. A wind turbine rotates behind the trees.","Most modern passenger and military aircraft are powered by gas turbine engines, which are also called jet engines."],["",""]],["frenzy","'frenzi","n. 疯狂, 狂暴, 狂怒\\n[医] 暴怒, 狂乱",["There was a problem with the architecture of that company's new computer. They're going through a recall frenzy right now.","The manufacturing sector is a frenzy over the new monetary policy."],["",""]],["incorrect",".inkә'rekt","a. 不正确的\\n[法] 不正确, 错误的, 不适当的",["Strictly speaking, this sentence is grammatically incorrect.","I'm afraid this is an incorrect formulation of the question."],["严格地讲,这句话语法上有错误。","恐怕这里提法不妥当。"]],["shining","'ʃainiŋ","a. 光亮的, 华丽的",["Tonight in the night sky, the stars are shining very brightly.","The stars are shining very brightly in the sky tonight."],["今晚的夜空星光非常明亮。","今晚的夜空星光非常明亮。"]],["mankind","mæn'kaind","n. 人类, 男性",["If mankind doesn't take care of the environment, the environment may eliminate mankind.","The only thing that will redeem mankind is co-operation."],["如果人類不好好保護大自然，大自然說不定會反過來把人類毀滅。","合作是人類唯一的救贖。"]],["serbian","'sә:bjәn","a. 塞尔维亚人（语）的；塞尔维亚的",["She is a native speaker of Serbian.","Do you want to learn Serbian, Mary?"],["塞尔维亚语是她的母语。","玛丽，你想学塞尔维亚语吗？"]],["betrayal","bi'treiәl","n. 背叛, 辜负\\n[法] 背叛, 通敌, 背信",["Sami had experienced the feeling of betrayal before.","Humans commit acts of cruelty, treachery, betrayal and violence that are unbecoming, considering how civilized they are."],["",""]],["baggage","'bægidʒ","n. 行李\\n[经] 行李",["I attached my name-tag to my baggage, but it soon came off.","Don't carry too much baggage when you travel."],["我在我的行李上附上了有我名字的標籤, 但是它很快就剝落了。","旅行时不要带太多行李。"]],["condo","kәn'dәu","n. 共同统治, 共管下的政府, 共管, 多层公寓大楼, 由个人占用的一套公寓房间",["The room in the condo, that the real estate agent was calling a den, was little more than a closet with a built-in desk.","Yanni will be spending the day in Algiers fixing up a condo for a new tenant."],["",""]],["veto","'vi:tәu","n. 否决权\\nvt. 否决, 禁止",["The President of the United States has the power to veto and send back legislation.","The President vetoed the bill, but Congress overrode his veto."],["美國總統有權否決與退回法案。",""]],["shack","ʃæk","n. 陋屋, 棚屋\\nvi. 居住, 暂住",["Why aren't you going to the sugar shack? Because we're all busy.","The last thing she should do is shack up with him."],["",""]],["showcase","'ʃәukeis","n. 陈列橱\\n[经] 商品陈列所, 货物陈列架",["Until now the city of Bilbao has been characterized as a showcase for arts and culture.","Donning the Kabyle dress allows Rima to proudly showcase her cultural heritage to the world."],["",""]],["eventual","i'ventʃuәl","a. 最后的, 终于的",["His mistakes led to his eventual dismissal.","The committee that selects the eventual Nobel Peace laureate does not disclose the names of the nominees to the news media or to the candidates."],["",""]],["focal","'fәukl","a. 焦点的, 在焦点上的\\n[医] 病灶的, 灶的",["The focal point of the magnifying glass was only two inches from the object.","Pomegranates are increasingly popular in cooking and baking, whether as juice, garnish, or focal ingredient."],["",""]],["insurgent","in'sә:dʒәnt","a. 谋叛的, 起义的, 澎湃的\\nn. 起义者, 叛乱者",["Several insurgent flautists attacked our armored column with Jethro Tull covers and rocket propelled grenades.","A mass unsettling of the mindless followers of the cult leader required the arrival of a charismatic insurgent."],["",""]],["bleak","bli:k","a. 萧瑟的, 荒凉的, 阴冷的",["I guess my view on friendship is pretty bleak because I've never really had to rely on anyone for anything.","As I looked across the bleak landscape, I realized I would never find what I was looking for."],["",""]],["setback","'setbæk","n. 挫折, 退步, 逆流",["Automobile sales suffered a setback at the end of the financial year.","Our negotiations to lower export taxes suffered a big setback."],["",""]],["veil","veil","n. 面纱, 面罩, 借口, 幕, 帐, 遮蔽物\\nvt. 戴面纱, 隐藏, 遮蔽, 掩饰\\nvi. 蒙上面纱",["I am on the edge of mysteries and the veil is getting thinner and thinner.","It was night, and a veil of darkness covered the streets."],["",""]],["traumatic","trɒ:'mætik","a. 外伤的, 创伤的\\n[医] 创伤的, 外伤的",["Because of my post-traumatic stress disorder, I tend to dissociate when faced with a stressful situation.","Tom suffers from post-traumatic stress disorder and is plagued by nightmares."],["",""]],["renewable","ri'nju(:)әbl","a. 可更新的, 可恢复的, 可继续的, 可换新的, 可重复的, 可重说的\\n[计] 可更新, 可再生的",["There is a long way from oil dependence to a renewable energy society.","Hydropower is a renewable resource, but oil, coal and natural gas are not."],["",""]],["restless","'restlis","a. 不安静的, 慌张的, 休息不充分的\\n[医] 不安静的, 不宁的",["I feel restless when I have to wait too long for my friend to show up.","His behaviour made me feel restless."],["等朋友等太久时,会感到烦躁.","他的行为让我坐立不安。"]],["insistence","in'sistәns","n. 坚持, 坚决主张",["Her insistence was right. She did not need to feel ashamed.","An insistence on ideological purity and an unwillingness to compromise lead to an inability to get things done."],["",""]],["severity","si'veriti","n. 严格, 朴素, 激烈",["The severity of such marks can reveal whether or not any of these people were habitually engaged in hard labor.","His running away from home is due to his father's severity."],["",""]],["pounding","'pәundiŋ","n. 重击；重击声",["The manager reprimanded the man who was pounding on the table.","The manager reprimanded the man by pounding on the table."],["經理斥責了那個正重擊桌子的男子。","經理以重擊桌子來斥責那名男子。"]],["cheerful","'tʃiәful","a. 快活的, 高兴的, 兴高采烈的",["When you are cheerful, books can increase your happiness; when you are sad, books can lessen your sorrow.","She's always been a very cheerful person."],["开心时，书可以给你增加快乐；忧伤时，书可以给你减少哀愁。","她是一直是个很欢快的人"]],["crusade","kru:'seid","n. 改革运动, 十字军东侵\\nvi. 从事改革运动, 加入十字军",["The American government has recently been on a crusade to wipe out drug trafficking.","It is politicians, not doctors, who are leading the crusade against trans people."],["",""]],["pakistani",".pɑ:ki'stɑ:ni","a. 巴基斯坦的\\nn. 巴基斯坦人",["The majority of Kashmiri speakers live in Indian-administered Kashmir, while a minority live in Pakistani-administered Kashmir.","You don't need to be Pakistani to look Muslim. In fact, there are even Muslims with blue eyes and red curly hair."],["",""]],["deposition",".depә'ziʃәn","n. 免职, 作证, 沉淀\\n[化] 沉积",["This is a deposition. You answer the questions truthfully but never volunteer anything.","Sputter deposition is widely employed in the semiconductor industry."],["",""]],["lily","'lili","n. 百合, 百合花\\na. 洁白的, 纯白色的, 纯洁的",["I bought a sprig of lily of the valley.","Her sister Joanna was bright and slender as a lily."],["我買了一小枝鈴蘭。",""]],["sunrise","'sʌnraiz","n. 日出, 黎明, 拂晓",["The Tequila Sunrise is made with orange juice, tequila, and grenadine.","We woke up very early in order to see the sunrise."],["龍舌蘭日出由柳橙汁、龍舌蘭酒和石榴糖漿調製而成。","我们起得很早为了看到日出。"]],["extraordinarily","ik'strɔ:dθnәrili","adv. 非凡, 破例, 特别, 非常, 离奇, 使人惊奇, 惊人, 特命, 特派",["A clear conscience is an extraordinarily soft pillow.","The free-range eggs from this farm are darker in color, and the yolks are extraordinarily delicious."],["問心無愧是一個非常柔軟的枕頭。","這家農場的草雞蛋顏色偏深，蛋黃特別鮮美。"]],["published","","a. 已发布的",["He has just published an interesting series of articles.","This is by far the best novel that has been published this year."],["他刚发表一系列有趣的文章。","这显然是今年出版的最好的小说。"]],["competency","'kɔmpit(ә)nsi","n. 足以使人过舒适生活的富裕收入, 充裕的生活条件\\n[法] 权能, 资格, 资产",["I'm casting aspersions on his competency as a statistician.","The board of directors lacked competency."],["",""]],["torso","'tɔ:sәu","n. 躯干, 裸体躯干雕像\\n[医] 躯干",["If you wind up the doll with the key on the side of its torso it will swing its arms round and go forward doing somersaults.","A mermaid is a living being with the head and torso of a woman and the tail of a fish."],["如果你在洋娃娃腹部的側面上鏈的話，它就會扭動手臂，翻著筋斗向前前進。",""]],["entitlement","","n. 权利\\n[法] 权利",["There is nothing more out-of-date than youthful entitlement.","Sociopaths have a profound sense of entitlement that makes them think that everyone is obligated to them."],["",""]],["puzzled","","a. 困惑的, 迷惑的",["Tom was a bit puzzled by Mary's answer.","I was puzzled about what to do next."],["湯姆對瑪麗的回答有困惑。","我对以后做什么很迷茫。"]],["stump","stʌmp","n. 残株, 树桩, 烟蒂, 讲演台\\nvt. 砍断, 挑战, 难住\\nvi. 蹒跚而走",["Even the rotten stump stood straight and healthy on the green hill-side.","Tom was sitting on a tree stump with Mary on his lap."],["",""]],["openness","'әupәnnis","n. 公开；宽阔；率真",["His openness is a very positive quality, although not without its drawbacks.","Open source is a philosophy that encourages openness, sharing, and modification."],["",""]],["formulation",".fɒ:mju'leiʃәn","n. 系统陈述, 公式化, 配制\\n[化] 表述; 数学表述; 数式化; 数学表述",["I'm afraid this is an incorrect formulation of the question.","Oleg disagreed with that formulation."],["恐怕这里提法不妥当。",""]],["diagram","'daiәɡræm","n. 图表；图解",["From the diagram, we can infer a continual increase in revenue over the past several months.","The diagram above commutes if and only if f is an isomorphism."],["",""]],["um","әm","int. 嗯（表示迟疑）",["I'm very good at keeping secrets. My sister told me she's keeping a diary, and I haven't told anybody! Um... Oops.","All politicians are populist since that is their interest. Honest politicians, um, I don't think there is one."],["",""]],["fuzzy","'fʌzi","a. 有微毛的, 模糊的\\n[电] 微毛",["Some suspected that fuzzy patches of light known as nebulas were actually distant \"islands of stars\" far beyond our galaxy.","There is nothing worse than a sharp image of a fuzzy concept."],["",""]],["reconstruct",".ri:kәns'trʌkt","vt. 重建, 改造\\n[化] 按原样修复",["The creation of most schools was not to transform society, but to reconstruct society.","The government is compelled to reconstruct national finance."],["大部分学校的创建不是用来转变社会，而是用来重建社会的。",""]],["ginger","'dʒindʒә","n. 姜, 精力, 姜黄色\\na. 姜黄色的\\nvt. 用姜调味, 使活泼, 使有生气",["Graters are good for cheese, potatoes, ginger, and other things you might need little shreds of.","Don't forget to bring coriander, chili peppers, and ginger."],["",""]],["comb","kәum","n. 头梳, 鸡冠\\nvt. 梳头发, 梳毛\\nvi. (浪)涌起",["The cat thanked them for the ham, and gave them a pocket-handkerchief and a comb.","You can use a fine-toothed comb to check for nits."],["",""]],["elimination","i.limi'neiʃәn","n. 除去, 消除, 消灭\\n[化] 消去; 脱去",["Edmundo ordered the immediate elimination of Rima.","The UN Committee on the Elimination of Racial Discrimination calls collective expulsions a violation under international law."],["",""]],["pancake","'pænkeik","n. 薄烤饼, 薄煎饼, 烙饼",["When chickens pancake-shape maintain, the tractor must have won again.","Two new species of pancake batfishes have been found in the area affected by the BP oil spill."],["當雞像煎餅一樣平的時候, 那麼一定是拖拉機跑得比它們快。",""]],["hurl","hә:l","n. 用力的投掷\\nvt. 用力投掷, 发射, 愤慨地说出, 丢下\\nvi. 猛投, 猛掷",["I hoped you could hurl some lumens into the gloom.","If you hurl a handful of stones, at least one will hit."],["",""]],["luggage","'lʌgidʒ","n. 行李, 皮箱",["Bob, help me carry his luggage to the living room.","He left his luggage at the station."],["Bob，帮我把他的行李搬到客厅。","他把他的行李留在車站。"]],["whoa","wәu","int. 惊叹声, 停止",["Whoa, you have to take that thing to the dry cleaners.","Whoa, if we keep chatting, despite actually arriving early, we'll end up late!"],["",""]],["furnish","'fә:niʃ","vt. 供给, 提供, 装设\\n[化] 供应; 供给; 配料",["It's going to cost you a lot to furnish your apartment.","It will cost me a lot to furnish my new apartment."],["",""]],["friction","'frikʃәn","n. 摩擦, 摩擦治疗, 不和\\n[医] 摩擦",["Tires wear down because of friction between the rubber and the road surface.","So-called trade friction could be avoided some day."],["",""]],["segregation",".segri'geiʃәn","n. 隔离, 偏析, 被隔离的部分, 种族隔离\\n[化] 分离; 分凝; 离析; 偏析; 分聚",["Segregation of employees on the grounds of race is also unlawful.","The first point to be discussed is whether segregation existed in this district."],["",""]],["analytical",".ænә'litikl","a. 分析的, 善于分析的, 解析的\\n[机] 分析的",["Carl Gustav Jung, the founder of analytical psychology, always respected the religious convictions of his patients very much.","Worden once described flying to the moon as like driving a car, only with some analytical ability."],["",""]],["aerial","'єәriәl","a. 空中的, 航空的, 空气的, 空想的\\nn. 天线",["In this next slide we see an aerial shot of the company headquarters.","Mary's new passion was performing on aerial silks."],["",""]],["kin","kin","n. 亲戚, 同族, 血缘关系, 家族\\na. 有亲属关系的, 性质类似的, 同类的",["Neither do I deny myself to be near of kin, but there is another nearer than I.","The police will release the victim's name after they have notified his next of kin."],["",""]],["voluntarily",".vɒlәn'terili","adv. 自愿地, 以自由意志",["Some students found out Monday that they were ordered home; others were voluntarily leaving Italy.","I would voluntarily help you, but I'm occupied at the moment."],["",""]],["knowledgeable","'nɒlidʒәbl","a. 聪明的, 有知识的",["Dr. Smith is the most knowledgeable expert in that subject.","Being knowledgeable about Japanese culture is a good thing."],["",""]],["prosperous","'prɒspәrәs","a. 成功的, 繁盛的, 幸运的\\n[经] 繁荣的, 昌盛的",["Shanghai is so prosperous; notably it was after the port was opened for trade one hundred and sixty years ago that things started to change.","The city is becoming more and more prosperous."],["上海那么繁荣，主要是一百六十年前开埠以后发生的变化。","这个城市越来越繁盛了。"]],["forensic","fә'rensik","a. 辩论的, 法院的, 关于法庭的\\nn. 辩论练习",["At first, the forensic team thought they had found human blood, but later in the laboratory, they discovered it was actually cow blood.","Smelling your own or other's farts is a type of forensic investigation that I don't want to be involved in."],["一开始法医团队以为他们发现了人血，但后来才在实验室里发现这原来是牛血。",""]],["foliage","'fәuliidʒ","n. 树叶, 植物",["In the country, the colors of the sky and of the foliage are entirely different from those seen in the city.","A tapir is a mammal with prehensile lips for eating tree foliage."],["",""]],["mid","mid","a. 中间的, 中央的, 中部的\\nprep. 在...之中",["In Japan, it rains quite a bit during our rainy season which is from mid-June until mid-July.","On Mid-Autumn Day, families gather, eat moon cake together, and watch the moon."],["在日本，在我们的雨季常常下雨，雨季一般在六月中旬至七月中旬。","在中秋节，家人团聚，一起吃月饼、赏月。"]],["unleash",".ʌn'li:ʃ","vt. 解开...的皮带, 发出, 发动",["If a piece of knotted string can unleash the wind, and if a drowned man can awaken, then I believe a broken man can heal.","Henceforth shalt the mighty leader Gru unleash his spectacular grace through this cursed world."],["如果一段打结的绳子能换来风，如果淹死的人能再醒来，那么我相信伤了心的人会痊愈。",""]],["controlled","kәn'trәuld","a. 受约束的, 克制的\\n[法] 受管制的, 受控制的, 受管辖的",["China is perhaps the only country in the world where the temperature is controlled by the government.","The Chinese government controlled the internet to prevent the people from knowing the truth of the Tiananmen Square Massacre."],["中国也许是世界上唯一一个由政府控制温度的国家。","中国政府控制了网络，以免让人民知道六四事件的真相。"]],["pollutant","pә'lu:tәnt","n. 污染物质\\n[法] 污染物",["We can conclude that this phenomenon is not related to either pollutant.","Lead is a common environmental pollutant."],["",""]],["giggle","'gigl","v. 吃吃地笑, 咯咯地笑\\nn. 咯咯笑, 傻笑",["Sitting behind people at the movies who constantly chat and giggle doesn't make for an enjoyable evening.","Gabor was standing across the street, just smiling at Martha and giggle."],["",""]],["respectable","ri'spektәbl","a. 值得尊重的, 人格高尚的, 相当数量的\\nn. 品格高尚的人",["He is said to have been a man of respectable position.","That was a respectable performance, but it definitely wasn't sensational."],["",""]],["tariff","'tærif","n. 关税, 关税表, 价格表, 收费表\\nvt. 课以关税\\n[计] 价目表",["The higher tariff on imports from China is effectively the biggest tax increase on the middle class in U.S. history.","The four pacts include simplification of visa and customs rules to boost trade and reduce tariff barriers."],["",""]],["examiner","ig'zæminә","n. 检查人, 审查人, 主考者\\n[化] 检验人; 验收员",["The medical examiner reported that the cause of death was a homicide.","Cross out any words that you do not wish the examiner to read."],["",""]],["domination",".dɒmi'neiʃәn","n. 支配, 控制, 管辖",["I guess she's into bondage and domination.","Femdom is short for Female Domination."],["我想她想要的是束縛與支配。","“女控”是“女性控制”的縮寫。"]],["ignorant","'ignәrәnt","a. 无知识的, 不知道的, 由无知产生的\\n[法] 无知的, 愚昧的, 不知情的",["I never know what to say to people who have absolutely no grasp of the basic facts and are too ignorant to realise it.","Many economists are ignorant of that fact."],["对于那些连基本事实都搞不清楚而且又盲目得无法了解到这一点的人，我从来都不知道对他们说些什么。","很多經濟學家都不知道這點。"]],["tick","tik","n. 滴答声, 一瞬间, 壁虱, 褥套, 信用, 赊欠\\nvi. 滴答响, 活动\\nvt. 滴答地记录, 标记号于",["I like to take things apart to see what makes them tick.","Tick-tock, tick-tock. There are so many stars in the sky, I can't count them all."],["我喜歡把東西拆開，看看裏面的結構。",""]],["cohort","'kәuhɒ:t","n. 一群；步兵大队；支持者；共同特点的一群人",["The clarity of the tax code was good enough to become the archetype of perspicuous writing in the lawyer's cohort.","Surprise, surprise: it's Tom and his cohort."],["",""]],["dine","dain","vi. 用正餐, 进餐\\nvt. 宴请",["Even if they have a good wine menu, I will not want to dine here.","It's impossible to dine at this restaurant without reservations."],["即使他们有很好的酒单，我也不想在这里用餐。",""]],["climbing","'klaimiŋ","a. 攀缘而登的, 上升的\\nn. 攀登",["The rope broke when we were climbing the mountain.","Playing baseball is a sport, and climbing mountains is a sport, too."],["我們爬山的時候繩子斷了。","打棒球是一种运动，登山也是一种运动。"]],["multimedia",".mʌlti'mi:diә","n. 多媒体\\n[计] 多媒体",["A lot of software is available for making multimedia presentations.","Computer games are examples of software multimedia because they combine text, images, animation, video, and sound."],["",""]],["dispatch","dis'pætʃ","vt. 派遣\\nn. 派遣, 急件\\n[计] 调度",["I've already paid. Please dispatch the merchandise as soon as possible.","Dispatch a royal rider with this sealed letter from the king."],["",""]],["disguise","dis'gaiz","n. 假面目, 假装\\nvt. 假装, 隐瞒",["You can't seriously expect that they won't recognize you in that disguise. That lopsided, dime store moustache is a dead giveaway!","Although Bob was in disguise, I recognized him at a glance."],["你不能指望他们认不出你的伪装。那个歪半边的一角店胡子是致命漏洞！",""]],["hatch","hætʃ","n. 孵化, 舱口\\nvt. 孵, 孵出, 策划\\nvi. 孵化",["This hen is sitting on an egg, but the egg won't hatch because it has not been fertilized.","It takes only a few days for the moth's eggs to hatch."],["",""]],["raised","reizd","a. 凸起的, 浮雕的, 发酵的\\n[医] 隆起的",["The criminal came out of the house with arms raised.","He raised his hand in order that the taxi might stop."],["犯人手举在空中走出了房子。","他舉高了手來截的士。"]],["prostate","'prɒsteit","a. 前列腺的\\nn. 前列腺",["Men whose mothers had breast cancer run a higher risk of developing prostate cancer.","He has difficulty ejaculating due to an enlarged prostate."],["",""]],["prolonged","prә'lɔŋd","a. 延续的, 长时间的",["She notes thousands of women, men and children languish in prolonged arbitrary detention.","Obstetric fistula is a pregnancy-related disability caused by prolonged, obstructed labor."],["",""]],["mediate","'mi:dieit","a. 居间的, 间接的\\nvt. 斡旋, 调停\\nvi. 处于中间, 调解",["He always tends to mediate in arguments between friends.","An independent advisor has been brought in to mediate between the unions and the employers."],["",""]],["amend","ә'mend","vt. 修改, 改善, 改良\\nvi. 改过自新",["Together, the developers may amend this constitution, provided a 3:1 majority is in agreement.","We'll need to amend the contract so that we can pay you more."],["",""]],["lipstick","'lipstik","n. 口红, 唇膏\\n[机] 口红",["Brian bought some lipstick for Kate.","I'm looking for a lipstick to go with this nail polish."],["布萊恩買了一些口紅給凱特。",""]],["seizure","'si:ʒә","n. 捕获, 夺取, 占领, 捕获物, 没收, 充公\\n[医] 发作; 癫痫发作",["Tom knows what to do when Mary has an epileptic seizure.","Layla was the last person to see Sami before he had a seizure."],["",""]],["signing","","[法] 签署, 签字",["I'm not signing anything until I speak with my agent.","You'd better examine the contract carefully before signing."],["在跟我的經紀人談過之前，我不會簽任何東西。",""]],["imitation",".imi'teiʃәn","n. 模仿, 效法, 冒充, 赝品\\n[医] 模仿, 仿制, 仿制品",["What is the difference between imitation and real diamonds?","Opposite the door was a showy fireplace, surmounted by a mantelpiece of imitation white marble."],["假的鑽石和真的鑽石有甚麼分別？",""]],["raft","ræft","n. 筏, 救生筏, 大量\\nvi. 乘筏\\nvt. 筏运, 制成筏",["I fainted from the heat, and when I came to, I was in a life raft.","Bleeding from her little finger, the nymphomaniac started a hot pursuit with the cops on a stolen raft."],["",""]],["arthritis","ɑ:'θraitis","n. 关节炎\\n[医] 关节炎",["Arthritis is a painful condition that affects the joints.","People with rheumatoid arthritis symptoms should be careful about what they eat."],["",""]],["shifting","'ʃiftiŋ","[计] 移位, 移位操作",["The shifting pattern of world trade is made clear in the following table.","He kept shifting his weight from one foot to the other."],["",""]],["genome","'dʒi:nәum","[化] 基因组\\n[医] 染色体组",["The genome is the complete set of genes found in the chromosomes of every cell in a living being.","The double helix that encodes our genome is an elegant structure."],["",""]],["cram","kræm","vt. 塞满, 填满, 猛吃\\nvi. 贪吃\\nn. 极度拥挤, 死记硬背",["I suppose I'll be in trouble if I don't stay up all night to cram for the examination.","I'm against us forcing the child to go to cram school."],["",""]],["nutritional","nju: 'triʃәnәl","a. 营养的, 滋养的\\n[医] 营养的",["In addition, progress has been made in reducing deaths from communicable diseases and maternal, newborn and nutritional disorders.","Even though meat is more expensive than fish, the nutritional quality of the two is more or less the same."],["",""]],["cathedral","kә'θi:drәl","n. 大教堂",["I met her at 8:30p.m at the cathedral.","The cathedral had a religious painting on its ceiling."],["我和她約了今晚八點半在大教堂見。",""]],["spike","spaik","n. 长钉, 鞋钉, 钉状物, 尖峰状物, 穗\\nvt. 以大钉钉牢, 用尖物刺穿, 阻止, 弃置不用\\n[计] 尖峰信号",["He makes a good volleyball player because he can jump high and spike the ball.","Yanni was decapitated and his head placed on a spike."],["",""]],["sideways","'saidweiz","adv. 向旁边, 向侧面地\\na. 旁边的, 向侧面的",["As the road was wet, the car must have slipped sideways.","Anatomical breast implants, however, can also deform the shape of the breast if they rotate sideways."],["",""]],["palette","'pælit","n. 调色板, 颜料\\n[计] 调色板",["I've bought a new palette and a few paint brushes.","With the colour key program system, all colours are divided into two palettes, the \"cool palette\" and the \"warm palette\"."],["我買了一個新的調色盤和幾支水彩筆。",""]],["selfish","'selfiʃ","a. 自私的, 利己主义的, 自我中心的",["It is true that she is pretty, but she is selfish.","She doesn't pay attention to others; in other words, she is selfish."],["她确实很漂亮，但她很自私。","她不關心別人；也就是說，她很自私。"]],["lament","lә'ment","n. 悲叹, 悔恨, 恸哭, 挽歌, 悼词\\nvt. 哀悼\\nvi. 悔恨, 悲叹",["One should not lament over past mistakes too long.","I call on the living, lament the dead, shatter the lightning."],["",""]],["keeper","'ki:pә","n. 监护人, 管理人, 看守人\\n[机] 保管人, 看守人, 保持片",["He told the bookstore keeper that he would come there again to buy the book that afternoon.","A furious elephant kicks out the fencing of his enclosure and sends the keeper flying."],["",""]],["negatively","'ne^әtivli","adv. 否定地, 消极地",["In Germany and Austria, the names Chantal and Kevin are viewed very negatively.","Yanni's behavior is negatively affecting his life."],["",""]],["worrying","'wʌriiŋ","a. 使人烦恼的, 忧虑重重的",["Worrying doesn't take away tomorrow's concerns, but it does take away today's power.","Her parents can't help worrying about her injuries."],["煩惱帶不走明天的憂慮, 但卻拿走了今天的力量。","她的父母不能不担心她的伤势。"]],["basil","'bæzil","n. 罗勒属植物\\n[医] 罗勒, 矮糠",["Matthew used fresh basil leaves to garnish his chicken parmesan for a pop of color.","Basil, sage, rosemary, thyme and oregano are popular herbs."],["",""]],["hmm","","abbr. 隐马尔可夫模型（Hidden Markov Model）；Hardware Maintenance Manual；Hyunda…",["Hmm. I have a feeling I'm going to get lost whichever road I take.","Hmm, I think something happened. Wait a second, I will try to figure it out."],["唔。我有預感我走哪邊都會迷路。","喔，好像是有這麼回事，你稍等，我查一查。"]],["ignite","ig'nait","vt. 点燃, 使灼热, 使兴奋",["Sometimes, I think the president is just trying to ignite a controversy when he gives a speech.","What you wish to ignite in another must burn inside you."],["",""]],["revolve","ri'vɒlv","v. (使)旋转, 反复考虑, 循环出现",["The world doesn't revolve around you.","The planets revolve around the sun."],["世界不是围着你转的。","行星繞著太陽轉。"]],["alternate","'ɒ:ltәnәt","a. 交替的, 轮流的, 间隔的\\nv. 轮流, (使)交替",["There's construction on the main drive of the hotel. Guest are advised to take the alternate entrance.","There are pictures on alternate pages of the book."],["",""]],["spa","spɑ:","n. 矿泉, 温泉浴场, 矿泉治疗地\\n[计] 软件出版者协会",["Benedito's spa has a skincare consultation service.","I make it a rule to go to a spa at intervals for a change."],["",""]],["bully","'buli","n. 欺凌弱小者, 土霸\\nvt. 威胁, 恐吓, 欺负\\nvi. 欺负\\na. 特好的, 第一流的\\nadv. 十分",["I still have these little groupings of scabs from when the school bully tossed live leeches at me.","Sami is the only bully I have ever had in my life."],["",""]],["arsenal","'ɑ:snәl","n. 兵工厂, 军械库\\n[机] 兵工厂",["Arsenal is my favourite football team.","The army surrendered its arsenal to the enemy."],["我最喜欢的球队是阿森纳。",""]],["bracelet","'breislit","n. 手镯\\n[医] 手镯, 腕带, 腕纹(掌侧横列腕部的线纹)",["\"Bracelet\" means the same thing in English that it does in French.","This watch is as expensive a gift as that bracelet."],["英文\"Bracelet\"在法文的意思是相同的。",""]],["contaminate","kәn'tæmineit","vt. 弄污, 弄脏, 污染, 毒害\\n[化] 污染",["If you don't wash your hand before working, you'll contaminate the samples.","I don't want to contaminate the clean glasses by taking them out of the dishwasher."],["",""]],["inhibit","in'hibit","vt. 禁止, 抑制\\nvi. 起抑制作用",["Yet education is the only factor that can inhibit prejudice, be it between ethnicities or genders.","He noticed that this drug seemed to inhibit bacterial growth."],["",""]],["startling","'stɑ:tliŋ","a. 令人吃惊的",["Doctors have discovered some startling facts.","Ziri's balloon popped suddenly, startling everyone."],["医生发现了一些令人吃惊的事实。",""]],["czech","tʃek","n. 捷克人, 捷克语\\na. 捷克的, 捷克语的, 捷克人的",["I'm a foreigner and I don't know Czech very well. Please, speak slowly.","Excuse me, I'm a foreigner and I don't understand Czech all that well."],["我是外国人，我捷克语不好，请说慢一点。",""]],["disbelief",".disbi'li:f","n. 不信, 怀疑",["Tom, listening to Mary, shook his head, laughing and frowning, in belief and disbelief.","Benedito shook his head in disbelief as his billy goat scaled a rocky outcropping with ease."],["",""]],["alumnus","ә'lʌmnәs","n. 男毕业生, 男校友",["I'm not sure if you remember me, but I'm an alumnus who took a couple of your classes during my senior year."],["不知道您是否還記得我，我是曾在大四修過您幾門課的校友。"]],["plight","plait","n. 困境, 窘境\\nvt. 宣誓, 保证",["The documentary is meant to raise consciousness about the plight of the poor.","The king was unsympathetic to the plight of the peasants, so he was unpopular."],["",""]],["chaotic","kei'ɒtik","a. 混乱的, 无秩序的\\n[法] 混乱的, 混沌的",["Foam fights are chaotic. He uses his sword and shield to protect comrades carrying pikes, spears and bows.","My mornings became more tranquil without the chaotic news cycle starting my day."],["",""]],["enormously","i'nɒ:mәsli","adv. 非常地, 巨大地",["Sami's YouTube channel helped me enormously to understand Islam.","Men do not differ much about what things they will call evils; they differ enormously about what evils they will call excusable."],["",""]],["hollow","'hɒlәu","n. 洞, 窟窿, 山谷\\na. 空的, 虚伪的, 空腹的, 凹的\\nvi. 形成空洞\\nvt. 挖空",["I saw an old and hollow pecan tree that had some bees flying around it.","Rain formed pools in the hollow spaces on the rocks."],["我看到一棵老舊的空心山核桃樹，周圍有一些蜜蜂在飛。",""]],["default","di'fɒ:lt","n. 违约, 不履行责任, 缺席, 默认值\\nv. 疏怠职责, 缺席, 拖欠, 默认\\n[计] 默认; 默认值; 缺省值",["I've heard that if you default on the water rates your water supply will be suspended, is that true?","The user interface of all apps should be black by default."],["聽說不交水費就會被停水，是真的嗎？",""]],["listening","'lisniŋ","n. 听, 监听\\na. 助听用的",["George, if you are not listening to the radio, turn it off.","I often spend my leisure time listening to the radio."],["乔治，如果你不听广播，就把它关掉。","我常常在我的闲暇时候听广播。"]],["sickness","'siknis","n. 疾病, 不健康, 呕吐\\n[医] 病",["There has been a lot of sickness in my family this winter.","His sickness made it impossible for him to continue his study."],["",""]],["vibration","vai'breiʃәn","n. 振动, 颤动\\n[化] 振动",["Do not place the console or accessories on surfaces that are unstable, tilted or subject to vibration.","It is vital that the collective consciousness is on a vibration that radiates Love, Joy, Kindness, Peace and Light."],["",""]],["merry","'meri","a. 快乐的, 愉快的, 嬉戏作乐的",["Money won't make you merry, but it eases your misery.","The little girl laughed a merry laugh."],["鈔能力不等於幸福，但可以暫時解決很多麻煩。","小女孩高兴地笑了。"]],["disperse","dis'pә:s","vt. 分散, 传播, 散开\\nvi. 分散\\na. 分散的\\n[计] 分散",["The children blow dandelions to see the seeds disperse on the wind.","The police used a drone with a loudspeaker to disperse the crowd."],["",""]],["awhile","ә'hwail","adv. 片刻, 一会儿",["John, you've been working too hard. Have a seat and rest awhile.","My mother stood for awhile, then sighed as she returned to her room."],["約翰，你工作太辛苦了。坐下來休息一會兒。","母亲又站了一会，然后叹着气回到了自己的房间。"]],["sober","'sәubә","a. 未醉的, 稳重的, 节制的, 严肃的, 不夸大的, 合理的, 朴素的\\nvt. 使醒酒, 使严肃\\nvi. 从醉里醒来, 变严肃",["When Tom gets drunk, he'll eat a lot of things that he wouldn't eat when he's sober.","The words of a drunk man are the thoughts of a sober man."],["",""]],["madame","'mædәm","n. 夫人, 小姐, 太太, 女士, 主妇, (非正式)喜欢差使/指使别人的女子, 鸨母",["Madame de Pompadour was one of the only people whom the King trusted to tell him the truth.","Her strongest oath was merely \"By Saint Loy!\", and she was called Madame Eglentine."],["",""]],["comrade","'kɒmreid","n. 同志, 伙伴",["I guess Ichiko is a fellow rule-breaker, she's sending me a smile filled with affection for a comrade.","Brilliant papers by Comrade Stalin allowed Soviet linguistics to take the leading position in the world."],["",""]],["corresponding",".kɒri'spɒndiŋ","a. 相当的, 一致的, 通信的\\n[计] 对应",["You have certain privileges and therefore corresponding responsibilities.","For every action, there is a corresponding reaction."],["",""]],["rainbow","'reinbәu","n. 彩虹\\na. 五彩缤纷的",["A rainbow is one of the most beautiful phenomena of nature.","Vanessa loves to knit hats, scarves, and mittens in rainbow colors."],["彩虹是自然界最美的现象之一。","Vanessa喜欢针织彩虹色的帽子、围巾和连指手套。"]],["sleepy","'sli:pi","a. 困乏的, 欲睡的",["Tom is very sleepy, because he didn't sleep well last night.","You went to bed at 2 o'clock in the morning? No wonder you look sleepy today."],["Tom很困因爲昨天晚上沒睡好。","你凌晨兩點才去睡覺嗎？難怪你今天看起來這麼沒精神了。"]],["pub","pʌb","n. 酒馆, 客栈",["I suspect that they water down the beer in that pub.","When you were at the cinema, we were down the pub."],["我怀疑那家酒馆的啤酒兑水了。","你在電影院的時候我們在酒吧呢。"]],["peek","pi:k","vi. 偷看, 窥视\\nn. 偷看, 看一眼",["I quietly take out my camera, so as not to be noticed by my photographic subject, and peek through the finder.","Gunter had to take a peek through one of the windows."],["",""]],["camping","'kæmpiŋ","n. 野营, 露营",["Tom and Mary said they've only gone camping three times.","While camping, Tom gave Mary dysentery by not thoroughly cleaning the pots and pans."],["汤姆和玛丽说他们只去过三次露营。","露營時，湯姆沒有徹底清洗鍋碗瓢盆，導致瑪莉得了痢疾。"]],["saw","sɒ:","n. 锯子, 谚语\\nvt. 锯, 锯开, 来回移动\\nvi. 拉锯, 移动\\nsee的过去式",["Outside the school, she saw people with no homes living in cardboard boxes.","When she saw that they had no schools, she started one."],["她在校外見到沒家的人住紙板箱。","当她发现他们还没有学校，她就办了一个。"]],["youthful","'ju:θful","a. 年轻的, 青年的\\n[法] 青年的, 年轻的",["Despite his age, he always has a youthful appearance.","There is nothing more out-of-date than youthful entitlement."],["",""]],["contradictory",".kɒntrә'diktәri","a. 反驳的, 反对的, 抗辩的\\nn. 矛盾因素, 对立物",["For example, if a chain-smoking teacher cautions a pupil for smoking, that warning is self-contradictory.","Doublethink means the power of holding two contradictory beliefs in one's mind simultaneously, and accepting both of them."],["舉例說，如果一個老師警告學生不要吸煙，但自己卻每天吸個不停，那麼這個警告就是自相矛盾的了。",""]],["flatten","'flætn","vi. 使...不活跃, 变平\\nvt. 弄平, 打倒, 使失去光泽",["Jupiter's rapid rotation causes the planet to flatten at the poles and bulge at the equator.","This is not meant to flatten very real power dynamics and injustices."],["",""]],["glowing","'glәuiŋ","a. 白热的, 灼热的, 通红的, 鲜艳的\\n[化] 辉光",["Tom has two looks: glowing but fat and regular fat.","Sami could see Layla's makeup glowing in the dark."],["",""]],["nap","næp","n. 小睡, 稍睡, 细毛, 孤注一掷\\nvi. 小睡, 疏忽\\nvt. 使拉毛, 打盹度过, 预测...为获胜马",["As soon as she finished, she lay down and had a nap.","The moment she'd finished, she lay down for a nap."],["她刚结束，就躺下打了个盹儿。","她刚结束，就躺下打了个盹儿。"]],["roadside","'rәudsaid","n. 路旁, 路边\\na. 路边的",["After the apocalypse, Tom and Mary sold zombie jerky from a roadside stand.","We bedded down at the roadside park for the night."],["",""]],["impair","im'pєә","vt. 损害, 减少, 削弱\\n[法] 损害, 伤害, 减少",["The heavy metal can harm the lungs and kidneys and impair hearing, balance, vision, thinking and breathing.","Social media could greatly impair the intelligence of our kids."],["",""]],["unexpectedly","","adv. 想不到的, 突然的, 意外的, 出乎意料的",["We unexpectedly found a cat in the box.","The army was unexpectedly attacked."],["我们意外地在箱子里找到了一只猫。","军队意外地被攻击了。"]],["presently","'prezntli","adv. 目前, 不久",["It is presently very difficult to calm down and treat oneself with a book.","The president is presently in Miami."],["现在很难静下心来好好看一本书。","總統目前在邁阿密。"]],["distributor","dis'tribjutә","n. 分发者, 分布者, 散布者, 分配者, 销售者, 分配器, 配电盘, 自动拆版机\\n[计] 分配器",["The company is a producer and distributor of television programming.","We are the only authorized distributor for this product."],["",""]],["razor","'reizә","n. 剃刀\\nvt. 剃",["I should try this electric razor before buying it.","I should have tried out this electric razor before buying it."],["",""]],["frantic","'fræntik","a. 狂乱的, 疯狂的",["Tom doesn't seem to be as frantic as Mary seems to be.","Tom made a frantic attempt to finish painting the fence before dark."],["",""]],["constructive","kәn'strʌktiv","a. 建设性的, 构造上的\\n[医] 构成的",["All you ever do is nitpick. I wish you could say something more constructive.","You should find a more constructive way of venting your anger."],["",""]],["planting","'plæntiŋ","n. 种植, 栽培, 播种, 人工林, 花圃, 苗圃",["Spring is the season for planting trees.","She's in the garden planting roses."],["春天是适合种树的季节。","她在花园里种玫瑰。"]],["charcoal","'tʃɑ:kәul","n. 木炭\\n[化] 木炭",["Tom does not know the difference between charcoal and carbon.","Regina Anyango, owner of small food kiosk in Nairobi, uses ethanol fuel to prepare meals for customers. Her kitchen is free of fumes and smoke from charcoal use."],["Tom不知道碳和煤的差別。","雷吉娜安揚戈是奈洛比一家小吃攤的老闆，她用乙醇燃料為顧客準備餐點。她的廚房沒有木炭產生的煙霧與廢氣。"]],["intrinsic","in'trinsik","a. 本质的, 原有的, 真正的\\n[医] 内部的, 内在的",["This celebration is an intrinsic part of the culture of our country.","There's also a lot of people who call toads \"frogs\". But that's not the intrinsic meaning."],["",""]],["starve","stɑ:v","v. (使)饿死, (使)挨饿",["Do you know how many people in the world starve to death every year?","Millions of people starve to death every year."],["你知不知道全世界每年有多少人饿死呀？","每年有几百万人死于饥饿。"]],["impatient","im'peiʃәnt","a. 不耐烦的, 着急的, 急切的",["I'm very impatient to see the new version of Tatoeba.","The longer we waited, the more impatient we became."],["我迫不及待地想要看到Tatoeba的新版本。","我们越等越不耐烦。"]],["reclaim","ri'kleim","vt. 开垦, 改造, 感化, 纠正, 回收\\nvi. 喊叫, 抗议",["Some day man will reclaim the desert for agriculture.","After weeks of planning, he was ready to reclaim his mobility once again."],["",""]],["sewer","'su:ә","n. 下水道, 阴沟, 裁缝师\\nvt. 用下水道排, 铺设下水道于",["Can you see an owl eating a delicious sewer rat over there? That's me.","Rainwater flows from the gutter, down the downpipe and into the sewer."],["",""]],["catcher","'kætʃә","n. 捕手, 捕捉器\\n[化] 受器; 接受器",["It happens that we have two copies of Catcher in the Rye.","The other day, we chose Yoshida to be the catcher on our school's baseball team."],["",""]],["prevalence","'prevәlәns","n. 普遍, 流行, 广泛\\n[医] 流行, 盛行",["In Brazil the prevalence of Asperger's Syndrome may reach 0.5%.","The prevalence of sentences with the names \"Tom\" and \"Mary\" makes both a political statement and a religious one."],["",""]],["cautiously","'kɒ:ʃәsli","adv. 慎重地",["Officers entered the house and cautiously moved from room to room.","Life is as a box of matches. Treating it cautiously is foolish, not treating it cautiously is dangerous."],["",""]],["fertile","'fә:tail","a. 可繁殖的, 肥沃的, 生产多的\\n[医] 能生育的",["It's fertile land inhabited by diverse nations.","The land on his farm is very fertile."],["這是一片肥沃的土地，居住著不同的民族。","他的農場的土地十分肥沃。"]],["wield","wi:ld","vt. 挥舞, 运用",["It is dangerous to wield an edged tool in such a way.","Hindu nationalists still wield considerable influence in India."],["",""]],["slab","slæb","n. 平板, 厚片\\nvt. 切成厚板, 以平板盖上",["The amount of concrete needed to make this slab is immense.","I had an old wire bird feeder that I used to fill often with a square slab of suet."],["",""]],["timely","'taili","a. 及时的, 适时的\\nadv. 及时地",["A timely snow promises a good harvest.","You must perform all assignments in a timely manner."],["瑞雪兆丰年。",""]],["daunting","'dɒ:ntiŋ","a. 使人畏缩的",["The challenges are daunting, but we can overcome them.","Tebboune is working for the democratization of Algeria but he's facing daunting challenges."],["",""]],["disgust","dis'gʌst","n. 厌恶, 嫌恶\\nvi. 令人厌恶\\nvt. 使作呕",["Tom's face lost its passive visage and revealed his horror and disgust.","The judge made no bones about his disgust with the accused's actions and handed down the severest sentence possible."],["",""]],["southwestern","sauθ'westәn","a. 西南的, 向西南的, 来自西南的, 西南部的",["I can speak Standard Chinese (Putonghua), Southwestern Mandarin, Wu Chinese, and Spanish.","Some Southwestern Native Americans lived in adobe houses called pueblos."],["我會普通話、西南官話、吳語和西班牙語。",""]],["yogurt","'jɔ^әt","n. 酸乳酪\\n[医] 酸乳",["This bottle of yogurt does not contain lactose.","This bottle of yogurt is lactose-free."],["這瓶酸奶不含乳糖。","這瓶酸奶不含乳糖。"]],["prose","prәuz","n. 散文\\nv. 写散文\\na. 散文的, 平凡的",["Our beloved father would read us some prose every week to better our understanding of the world's beauty.","He isn't a poet; he's a prose writer."],["我們親愛的父親每週都會給我們閱讀散文，好讓我們認識到世界的美好之處。","他不是诗人；他写的是散文。"]],["doom","du:m","n. 厄运, 不幸, 法律, 宣告, 判决, 死亡\\nvt. 命中注定, 判决",["Those gloom and doom economists aren't worth their salt.","Just because humans are stupid doesn't mean they shouldn't be able to send themselves to their own doom."],["",""]],["eagerly","","adv. 渴望, 热衷于, 热切",["People eagerly sought a more modernised style of dress and transformed the old qipao to suit their tastes.","The pupils listened eagerly during his speech."],["人们热切地寻求更有现代风格的衣服，所以把以前的旗袍改成了适合他们品位的东西。","他演講的時候，學生們都聽得十分入神。"]],["crest","krest","n. 冠, 饰毛, 头盔的顶部\\nvi. 到达绝顶\\nvt. 加以顶饰",["Time was, it is said, when the Hoopoe had no crest, and he only got one granted by royal favour.","The permutations ever increase in value, for the crest of that hill lies far ahead indeed."],["",""]],["rancher","'ræntʃә","n. 大农场经营者, 牧场工人",["Then, the Hornbacks met a stranger, a cattle rancher who invited them to stay on her property.","\"She came to our aid whenever we needed help the most,\" said Hornback, who now considers the rancher a part of the family."],["",""]],["northeastern",".nɒ:θ'i:stәn","a. 东北方的, 在东北的, 来自东北的",["I come from Kabylie, a region in northeastern Algeria.","Kabylie is a Berber-speaking area in northeastern Algeria."],["",""]],["niece","ni:s","n. 侄女, 甥女",["I have a niece. She goes to the same school as Mary.","Maria's niece was surprised to find out that Esperanto is only a hundred years older than she is."],["",""]],["gi","dʒi: 'ai","a. 军用的；美国军人的",["She married an American GI after the war.","Causes of GI bleeding include gastric ulcers, artery or vein (arteriovenous) malformations, diverticulosis, cancer or inflammatory bowel disease."],["",""]],["rainy","'reini","a. 下雨的, 多雨的",["According to the weather forecast, the rainy season will set in next week.","He goes to work on foot every day except on rainy days."],["根据天气预报，雨季下周会开始。","除了下雨天以外，他每天都會走路上班。"]],["layout","'leiaut","n. 布局, 陈列, 规划图, 页面布局, 版面编排\\n[计] 页面布局, 版面",["Please tell me how I can keep the layout unchanged even with a smaller window.","In Brussels, we discovered a beautiful bookstore where the shelves were arranged in an octagonal layout."],["",""]],["mumble","'mʌmbl","n. 喃喃而语, 咕哝\\nv. 喃喃而语, 咕哝",["Don't mumble your words. You are too old for that.","I could understand him better if he didn't mumble so much."],["",""]],["capsule","'kæpsju:l","n. 胶囊, 蒴果, 瓶帽, 航天舱\\n[化] 胶囊剂",["This building is a capsule hotel lodging men and women.","Take this capsule within thirty minutes of each meal."],["那个建筑物是男女都可以住宿的胶囊酒店。",""]],["respiratory","ri'spaiәrәtәri","a. 呼吸的\\n[医] 呼吸的",["Infected persons should wear masks to keep from releasing the virus into the air in respiratory droplets.","Concerning the characteristics of respiratory function in swimmers."],["",""]],["hamburger","'hæmbә:gә","n. 汉堡(德国港口), 肉饼, 汉堡包, 纯精牛肉, 汉堡牛排",["A hamburger and a cold drink cost 7 liras.","I was as sick as a dog after eating a hamburger from a fast food restaurant yesterday."],["汉堡和冷饮要七里拉。",""]],["accidental",".æksi'dentl","a. 意外的, 偶然的, 非主要的, 附属的\\nn. 临时记号, 次要方面",["That discovery was quite accidental.","Such things are often accidental rather than malicious."],["那个发现纯属偶然。",""]],["eighty","'eiti","num. 八十, 八十个",["Her grandmother lived to be eighty-eight years old.","Ten, twenty, thirty, forty, fifty, sixty, seventy, eighty, ninety, hundred."],["她的祖母活到了八十八歲。","十、二十、三十、四十、五十、六十、七十、八十、九十、一百。"]],["lever","'levә","n. 杠杆, 似杠杆之工具\\nvt. 撬开\\nvi. 使用杠杆",["The screw, the lever, the wedge, the pulley, etc. are called simple machines.","The handbrake lever was just behind the gearstick."],["",""]],["upright","'ʌprait","a. 正直的, 诚实的, 公正的, 垂直的, 竖式的\\n[化] 立杆",["He sits upright, not crouched over his plate like an animal at a feeding trough.","Even after it was hit, the pole was still upright."],["",""]],["readiness","'redinis","n. 预备, 准备, 敏捷",["It is correct to say that psychological readiness is important in this therapy.","A number of students announced their readiness to engage in the contest."],["",""]],["abolish","ә'bɒliʃ","vt. 废止, 革除, 消灭\\n[经] 废除, 取消, 裁撤",["We should abolish the death penalty.","We have to abolish all nuclear weapons, because they are deadly to mankind."],["我们应该废除死刑。",""]],["persistence","pә'sistәns","n. 固执, 坚持不懈, 持续(性), 存留(状态)\\n[电] 持久",["Things that seem impossible can be overcome with persistence.","Things that seem impossible can't always be overcome, even with persistence."],["",""]],["liberate","'libәreit","vt. 解放, 释放, 使自由\\n[机] 释出, 放出",["Actually I wanted to be a damsel in a tower guarded by seven dragons, and then a prince on a white horse would chop off the dragons' heads and liberate me.","The Polisario Front is fighting to liberate Western Sahara from Moroccan occupation."],["其實我想做一個被關在高塔裏的少女，然後有一天，就會有一個白馬王子出現，把守衛著高塔的七條龍通通殺掉，救我出來。",""]],["rhetorical","ri'tɒ:rikl","a. 修辞学的, 符合修辞学的, 修辞的",["To win his audience, the speaker resorted to using rhetorical techniques he learned from his communication courses.","When someone speaks with such rhetorical flourish, it starts to sound like they're lying."],["演说家为了征服他的听众，不惜使用他在交流课上学到的修辞技巧。",""]],["yacht","jɒt","n. 快艇, 游艇\\nvi. 驾游艇, 乘游艇",["It's just throwing money away to have a yacht you rarely use.","They usually use an anchor to hold a yacht in place."],["",""]],["desperation",".despә'reiʃәn","n. 绝望",["We arrived at that plan out of pure desperation, but the book sold well.","To tell the truth, she gave away all her money to others in desperation."],["",""]],["fort","fɒ:t","n. 堡垒, 要塞, 易货站\\nvt. 设要塞保卫\\nvi. 设要塞",["They seized him and took him to Fort Monroe, Virginia.","It's a fort built to defend the town from invasion."],["",""]],["feminism","'feminizm","n. 女权主义, 男女平等主义\\n[医] 男子女性",["From this you can conclude that feminism is still necessary.","Misogynists really are quite dangerous. The more I think about this, the more I'm able to understand the reasoning behind feminism."],["從這來看，你能因此論定女权主義還是必要的。","厭女的人真的挺危險的。我越想這個問題，我就越覺得女權主義有道理。"]],["anonymity",".ænә'nimiti","n. 匿名, 姓氏不明\\n[计] 匿名信件",["When using this information, I will follow any conditions you specify, whether that's anonymity or giving detailed reference.","Anonymity or detailed reference are both fine."],["在使用这份问卷的信息时，我会遵照您提出的条件，不留您的姓名或者关于您的任何详细信息。","不留名或详细的参考什么都可以。"]],["autonomous","ɒ:'tɒnәmәs","a. 自治的\\n[医] 自主的",["The private colleges and universities of the United States are autonomous.","Terrorism is the most important factor in the division of a country and the creation of autonomous regions."],["",""]],["interstate",".intә'steit","a. 州际的\\n[法] 国与国之间的, 州际的, 州与州之间的",["The other day I ran out of gas in the middle of a busy Interstate.","State police spokeswoman Janet Welp says the truck wound up crashing into a bridge railing along Interstate 30."],["",""]],["liner","'lainә","n. 班机, 划线者, 定期船, 衬里\\n[化] 衬垫; 垫带; 套管",["From the airport, the Keisei Line Sky-Liner will take you to Ueno Station in 75 minutes.","According to the ABC news, another jet-liner was hi-jacked in the Middle East."],["",""]],["librarian","lai'brєәriәn","n. 图书馆员, 图书管理员\\n[计] 程序库管理程序; 程序库生成程序",["The librarian classified the books according to subject.","I told the librarian that I needed the book for a report due on Friday; so she said she would call it in."],["",""]],["topple","'tɒpl","vt. 推翻, 颠覆\\nvi. 倒塌, 摇摇欲坠",["Those books look as if they're going to topple over any minute.","The giraffe cannot swim because its centre of gravity is so high that it would topple over."],["",""]],["inferior","in'fiәriә","a. 次等的, 较差的, 下方的, 下级的\\nn. 部下, 次品, 下标(符号)",["You cannot compare the strength of a man to that of a tiger, but nevertheless, the tiger is still the inferior creature.","Everyone who has had to deal with AI customer service knows how inferior it is to actual humans."],["虎与人是无法比拼力量的，但是，老虎还是比人类低等。","每個曾經與 AI 客服打交道的人都知道，AI 與真人相比有多麼遜色。"]],["reinforcement",".ri:in'fɒ:smәnt","n. 加强, 增援, 补充, 援军, 加固物\\n[化] 补强; 加强件",["If you want to form a new habit, positive reinforcement works best.","The steel columns tend to be covered by concrete for reinforcement."],["",""]],["morale","mɒ'rɑ:l","n. 士气, 道德",["If the spectators made fun of the other team, then it would weaken their morale.","But, and yes there is always a but, the company's profits soared while employee morale plummeted."],["",""]],["diversion","dai'vә:ʒәn","n. 转移\\n[医] 转向",["A diversion is in effect around roadworks in the city centre.","The EU is also calling for an investigation into the incident and is planning to sanction Belarusian officials responsible for the aircraft's diversion."],["",""]],["vastly","'vɑ:stli","adv. 广大地, 许多, 巨大",["Yanni said that his marriage is vastly different from what he had hoped for.","I think this suit is vastly superior to that one in quality."],["",""]],["almond","'ɑ:mәnd","n. 杏仁\\n[化] 杏仁",["Anna's striking almond-shaped eyes, inherited from her Asian lineage, exude a captivating depth and a hint of mystery.","Without bee pollination, California's almond crop, for example, would be non-existent."],["安娜引人注目的杏仁狀眼睛繼承了她的亞洲血統，散發著迷人的深度和一絲神秘感。","例如，如果沒有蜜蜂授粉，加州的杏仁作物就不會存在。"]],["distortion","dis'tɒ:ʃәn","n. 扭曲, 变形, 曲解\\n[计] 畸变; 失真",["\"I think perfection is ugly\", he said. \"Somewhere in the things that humans make, I want to see scars, failure, disorder, distortion.\"","Suppression and distortion of historical facts are unacceptable."],["“我认为完美是丑陋的”，他说道。“人们做的事情，我希望看到的是创伤，失败，混乱，扭曲。”",""]],["sitting","'sitiŋ","n. 入席, 就坐, 开庭, 孵卵\\na. 坐着的, 就座的, 在职的, 在孵卵中的, 易被击中的",["I know the boy who is sitting closest to the door.","At that time, Tom was sitting between Mary and John."],["我认识那个坐得最靠近门的男孩。","在那个时候，汤姆正坐在玛丽和约翰中间。"]],["announcer","ә'naunsә","n. 节目报告员, 宣告者",["Her ideal type seems to be someone like the announcer Shinichiro Azumi.","Even the stadium announcer couldn't whip up the atmosphere."],["",""]],["subsidiary","sәb'sidiәri","n. 子公司, 附件, 辅助者\\na. 辅助的, 次要的, 津贴的",["It's a wholly-owned subsidiary, but it maintains some independence from its parent company.","YouTube is a subsidiary of Google, which controls most of the Internet through its own services."],["",""]],["prophet","'prɒfit","n. 预言者, 先知, 提倡者",["There is no God but Allah, and Mohammed is his prophet.","I saw the great prophet with my own eyes. He had eyes like sparkling stars, and a beard like foaming water."],["",""]],["reminiscent",".remi'nisnt","a. 回忆的, 怀旧的\\nn. 往事叙述者, 回忆录作者",["Soon, the expanse of the galaxy became reminiscent of ancient Polynesian migrational waves throughout the Pacific Ocean.","What's complicated about their language is the writing, not the grammar, which is reminiscent of a creole."],["",""]],["validate","'vælideit","vt. 使有效, 使生效, 确认, 证实, 验证\\n[计] 验证",["His right-wing media bubble served to validate even his most outlandish ideas.","The newest version uses facial-recognition software to validate a login."],["",""]],["cooked","kukt","a. 精疲力竭的, 被揍得昏厥的, 未达到目的就完蛋的, 喝醉了的",["Why didn't the half-cooked steak say hello to the nearly-cooked steak when the two saw each other? They both weren't ready.","The only thing that would have made it better is if it was cooked."],["五成熟牛排见了七成熟牛排为什么不打招呼？两个都不熟。","唯一美中不足的是如果它要是熟食就好了。"]],["dime","daim","n. 10分硬币(美、加)",["He who is born for a dime, will never be worth a quarter.","You can't seriously expect that they won't recognize you in that disguise. That lopsided, dime store moustache is a dead giveaway!"],["出生是一分錢，永遠不會變成一角錢。","你不能指望他们认不出你的伪装。那个歪半边的一角店胡子是致命漏洞！"]],["pragmatic","præ^'mætik","a. 忙碌的, 爱管闲事的, 自负的, 固执己见的, 实际的, 务实的, 国事的, 国务的\\n[法] 闲断的, 固执己见的, 实用主义的",["I agree on an emotional level, but on the pragmatic level I disagree.","She called for a pragmatic approach to the problem."],["我感情上支持，但是理性上反对。",""]],["undercover",".ʌndә'kʌvә","a. 秘密从事的, 秘密的, 从事间谍活动的\\n[法] 暗中从事的, 秘密的",["I believe you already possess all the qualities needed to go undercover.","The thieves tried to sell the painting to an art collector who turned out to be an undercover agent for the FBI."],["我认为，你已经完全具备了潜伏的资质。",""]],["orphan","'ɒ:fәn","n. 孤儿\\na. 无双亲的, 孤儿的\\nvt. 使成孤儿\\n[计] 弧体",["He became an orphan when he was ten.","A child whose parents are dead is called an orphan."],["他十歲時成了孤兒。",""]],["graze","greiz","n. 吃草, 放牧, 擦伤, 轻擦\\nv. (使)吃草, 放牧, 轻擦, 擦伤",["Large numbers of cows graze on the mountain pastures.","The herds are turned out into the pasture to graze."],["",""]],["founding","'faundiŋ","[计] 铸造",["The twelve stars on the flag of the European Union do not symbolize the twelve founding members of the union. They symbolize the Twelve Apostles.","Founding your life on illusions is like building a house on a swamp."],["歐盟盟旗的十二顆星代表的不是創立聯盟的十二個會員國，而是十二門徒。",""]],["persona","pә:'sәunә","n. 人, 人物, 角色, 外表印象, 人格面具\\n[医] 伪装人格",["He patterned his stage persona after anime characters.","Tom rarely reveals his private persona to the outside world."],["",""]],["reel","ri:l","n. 卷轴, 一卷, 纺车, 旋转, 蹒跚\\nvt. 卷...于轴上, 绕, 使旋转\\nvi. 蹒跚地走, 旋转, 眩晕, 摇晃, 退缩\\…",["The films shown in this modest cinema had an intermission during which the projectionist changed the reel.","The jig, reel and hornpipe are the most popular Irish dances."],["這座規模不大的電影院在放映影片時會有一段中場休息，期間放映師負責換片。",""]],["preview","'pri:vju:","n. 事先查看, 预览\\nvt. 事先查看, 预演\\n[计] 预览",["Tebboune gave us a preview of what Algeria will be like.","Baby Boomers were blamed for the society they failed to adequately change, a preview of what's coming for Millennials and Gen Z."],["",""]],["enlarge","in'lɑ:dʒ","vt. 扩大, 增大\\nvi. 扩大, 详述",["He tried to enlarge his sphere of influence.","Study! Not to enlarge what you already know, but to know it better."],["他试图扩大自己的势力范围。",""]],["alleviate","ә'li:vieit","vt. 减轻, 使缓和",["In order to alleviate employment pressures, the nation has established a series of relevant policies.","This kind of medicine can temporarily alleviate pain. If you need it, just take it."],["为了缓解就业压力，国家已经制定了一系列相关政策。","这种药可以暂时缓解身体的疼痛，你需要的话就拿去吧。"]],["protagonist","prәu'tægәnist","n. 主人公, 主角, 领导者",["However the protagonist is aware of his own mistakes.","A protagonist as plain and ordinary as him is rare indeed."],["",""]],["collectively","","adv. 集合, 聚合性, 共同, 集体主义, 集团, 集体",["Snowflakes are individually weak but collectively dangerous.","Blinds, curtains, and drapes are collectively referred to as window treatments."],["",""]],["comedian","kә'mi:djәn","n. 喜剧演员",["For a comedian, remembering the words is the easy part.","The jokes that Tom makes about the land of kangaroos don't make us think that he will be a very successful comedian."],["",""]],["systematically",".sisti'mætikli","adv. 有系统地, 有组织地, 有条理地",["Her sewing basket, dresser drawers and pantry shelves are all systematically arranged in apple-pie order.","Environmentally damaging projects should be abandoned systematically."],["",""]],["sprawling","","a. 蔓生的, 不规则地伸展的",["Something hit her and sent her sprawling to the ground.","Yanni grew up on his father's sprawling estate in northern Algeria."],["",""]],["crunch","krʌntʃ","v. 嘎吱嘎吱的咬嚼, 压碎, 嘎吱嘎吱地踏过\\nn. 咬碎, 咬碎声",["The recession has put the crunch on wage laborers.","She could always call her parents when she was in a crunch."],["",""]],["mock","mɒk","n. 嘲笑, 戏弄, 模仿\\na. 假的, 伪造的, 模拟的\\nadv. 虚伪地\\nvt. 嘲弄, 模仿, 使失望, 欺骗, 挫败\\nvi…",["The future pilot is trained in a mock cockpit.","My parents keep making fun of my deep voice, especially when they mock me, and it annoys me."],["未来飞行员会在虚拟驾驶舱里训练。",""]],["fig","fig","n. 无花果, 无价值的东西, 少许, 服装\\nvt. 打扮, 使马跑快",["It's too bad the college dining hall doesn't have fig cookies.","Fruits are picked from fruit-bearing trees. The apple is round. The pear and the fig are somewhat long."],["可惜大学食堂没有无花果饼干。",""]],["escalate","'eskәleit","vi. 逐步扩大, 逐步升高, 逐步增强\\nvt. 使逐步上升",["The White House worries that the crisis could escalate.","Santiago asked Rima not to escalate the situation."],["",""]],["cruiser","'kru:zә","n. 巡洋舰, 巡航飞机, 警察巡逻车",["The police cruiser pulled to a stop near the spot where the accident happened.","Yanni was placed in the back of the police cruiser."],["",""]],["discretion","dis'kreʃәn","n. 慎重, 辨别力, 考虑, 处理权\\n[法] 有决定权的",["The reader focuses everything at his discretion; he only picks what he likes and understands well from a book.","They should be held to standards of privacy and discretion."],["",""]],["arbitrary","'ɑ:bitrәri","a. 任意的, 武断的, 专治的, 霸道的",["My mother prefers the arbitrary selection of the lottery machines over my lucky numbers.","Godwin's law teaches us that any infinite discussion about an arbitrary subject converges to a Nazi comparison."],["我母亲宁愿选彩票机上的任意数字，也不选我的幸运数字。","高德温法则告诉我们对任何主题的所有无休止的讨论会趋于和纳粹主义的类比。"]],["scrub","skrʌb","n. 用力擦洗, 矮树, 矮人, 渺小之物\\nvt. 用力擦洗, 擦掉, 摩擦\\nvi. 擦洗干净, 进行手臂消毒\\na. 次等的, 矮小…",["As a punishment, the disgraced Greenpeace volunteer had to scrub oil from an otter's fur with his own toothbrush.","The air quality gets noticeably worse as winter approaches and farmers clear their fields by burning scrub."],["",""]],["foe","fou","n. 仇敌, 反对者, 敌人, 对手",["Man is a more dangerous foe to man than the elements of nature or animals in the wild.","Lend your friend money. Borrow money from your foe."],["",""]],["stubborn","'stʌbәn","a. 顽固的, 不听话的, 执拗的, 棘手的",["Clean up spills inside the oven as soon as they happen to avoid stubborn stains.","Now is the critical moment. Please stop being so stubborn and inflexible, completely unable to adapt flexibility."],["烤箱內如有液體灑出，應立即清理，以免留下頑固污漬。","現在正是關鍵的時候了，請不要還那麼死腦筋，絲毫不知權變。"]],["rubble","'rʌbl","n. 粗石, 碎砖, 粗石堆",["There is a large pile of rubble where the school building used to be.","There is a pile of rubble where the building used to be."],["",""]],["bathe","beið","vt. 沐浴, 用水洗\\nvi. 洗澡",["It is dangerous to bathe in this river.","This river is dangerous to bathe in."],["在这条河里游泳很危险。","在这河里游泳危险。"]],["polished","'pɒliʃt","a. 擦亮的, 优雅的, 精良的",["Jane could not believe it when her date polished off an entire chocolate cake.","Tom polished off his martini and put the glass on the waiter's tray."],["珍的男朋友一口氣把整個巧克力蛋糕吃得一乾二淨，把珍看得目瞪口呆。",""]],["resemblance","ri'zemblәns","n. 相似处, 类似, 肖像",["No matter how close the resemblance, there's always a difference.","I was surprised at his strong resemblance to his father."],["事物无论多相似还是会有点差异的。","他像极了他父亲，这让我震惊。"]],["avert","ә'vә:t","vt. 转开, 避免, 防止",["Everything possible will be done to avert similar incidents occurring in future.","Embarrassed, Mary tried to avert her eyes when she accidentally walked in on her brother and saw his willy."],["",""]],["cavity","'kæviti","n. 洞, 空穴, 腔\\n[化] 空穴",["Since I developed this cavity, my tooth has been really sensitive to heat and cold.","My tooth ached when I had ice cream, so I might have a cavity."],["",""]],["conjunction","kәn'dʒʌŋkʃәn","n. 连接词, 联合, 结合\\n[计] 合取",["A more plausible proposal is the one Leech presented in conjunction with Emmet's theory.","A conjunction is an invariable word that links two ideas."],["",""]],["detain","di'tein","vt. 扣留, 扣押, 耽搁\\n[法] 拘留, 扣押, 留住",["To my surprise, the young lady held up her gloved hand to detain me.","\"Shall I leave, Percy?\" she asked. He clutched her hand to detain her."],["",""]],["outdoors","'aut'dɒ:z","n. 户外, 野外活动\\nadv. 在户外, 在野外",["The party will be held outdoors, weather permitting.","North China is cold in spring, so flowers don't bloom outdoors."],["若天氣許可的話，派對將會在戶外舉行。","春季的时候，中国北边很冷，所以在外边的花不开花。"]],["genocide","'dʒenәu,said","n. 种族灭绝, 灭绝整个种族的大屠杀\\n[医] 种族灭绝(侵略军队加害居民的罪行)",["The victims of the genocide were buried in mass graves spread over 25 square kilometers.","The Armenian Genocide left a total of one million and five hundred thousand deaths, including men, women and children."],["",""]],["troubling","","n. 浊度；浑浊度",["This problem was troubling us until last night when we found the cause and fixed it.","Everyone has something that's troubling him."],["这个问题一直困扰着我们，直到昨晚我们找到了原因并修复了它。","每人心里都有牢骚。"]],["crave","kreiv","v. 渴望, 热望, 恳求",["As the trees crave tranquility in the ever-persistent wind, the child craves the care of its ever-absent parents.","The heat is making me crave for an ice cream."],["树欲静而风不息，子欲养而亲不在！","热得想吃冰淇淋。"]],["redefine",".ri:di'fain","vt. 重新定义\\n[计] 重新定义",["This film attempts to break stereotypes and redefine what true masculinity is.","Our mission is to redefine what it means to write mission statements."],["這部電影試圖打破刻板印象，重新詮釋何謂真正的男性特質。",""]],["novice","'nɒvis","n. 新手, 初学者",["At first, the missile designers would not talk to him because they thought of him as an inexperienced novice.","The boys served as novice monks to give thanks for their survival and to show their gratitude to all those who helped them."],["",""]],["tenth","tenθ","num. 第十, 十分之一",["He left for Europe a week ago, that is, on the tenth of May.","She will return home next Sunday, that is, the tenth."],["他在一周前离开去往欧洲，就是说，是在五月十号。","她下周日回家，也就是10号。"]],["catastrophic",".kætә'strɒfik","a. 悲惨的, 灾难的",["The consequence of a wrong translation can sometimes be catastrophic.","You need to look at things from a different angle, it's not as catastrophic as you think."],["",""]],["compliment","'kɒmplimәnt","n. 称赞, 恭维, 敬意\\nvt. 称赞, 褒扬, 恭维",["I do not know whether to take it as a compliment or an insult.","You should compliment it with a white camisole."],["我真是哭笑不得。","你裏面要搭一件白色的吊帶。"]],["unrelated","","[法] 无关的",["In order to complete the development on schedule, we request that other unrelated tasks be delayed for the moment.","You've got to have a strong will to study something unrelated to your job after you've finished working."],["为了按期完成开发，我们请求暂时推迟其他不相关的任务。",""]],["blueprint","'blu:'print","n. 蓝图, 设计图, (周详的)计划\\nvt. 制成蓝图, 计划",["The spokesman explained the blueprint of the scheme to the press.","There's no doubt that Tom's childhood laid down the blueprint for the rest of his life."],["",""]],["progression","prә'greʃәn","n. 前进, 连续, 级数\\n[医] 进行, 前进, 步态",["Humanity is now affluent due to progression in science and technology.","You are not the owner of this save data. You will not be able to save your progression. Trophies will be disabled."],["由于科学技术的进步，人类现在很富裕。",""]],["animation",".æni'meiʃәn","n. 活泼, 生气, 激励, 卡通制作\\n[计] 动画",["The animation is on the air even in other countries.","He liked Japanese-style animation, otherwise known as anime."],["",""]],["pedestrian","pә'destriәn","n. 行人, 步行者\\na. 人行的, 徒步的, 呆板的, 通俗的, 平淡无奇的",["The ambulance went out of control and came close to running over a pedestrian.","This cross street is busy with pedestrian traffic."],["",""]],["nude","nju:d","a. 裸的, 肉色的, 无装饰的\\nn. 裸体画, 裸体",["Do you know how much love it takes for a woman to be undressed by a man, becoming nude in front of him?","Tom likes to sleep in the nude, but I prefer to wear pajamas."],["你可知道,當女人被男人脫去自己的衣服,一絲不掛的在他面前,需要多少的愛?",""]],["residue","'rezidju:","n. 残渣, 剩余, 余数\\n[化] 残基; 残渣; 残液; 釜液",["Don't leave any sticky or greasy residue in the car.","Rinse each dish with clean water to remove soap residue."],["",""]],["agony","'ægәni","n. 极大的痛苦, 挣扎\\n[医] 濒死苦闷; 剧痛",["My jaws have returned to their usual English expression of subdued agony and intense gloom.","In some countries, an advice columnist is known as an agony aunt."],["",""]],["shorten","'ʃɒ:tn","vt. 弄短, 缩短, 减少\\nvi. 缩小, 变短",["Don't smoke. Smoking can shorten your penis.","High operating temperatures shorten lubricant life."],["别吸烟。吸烟可能缩短你的阴茎。",""]],["hiring","'haiәriŋ","[法] 租用, 雇用",["Zailaiba Bar is hiring waiters; are you interested?","There's no point in hiring a babysitter for the evening."],["“再来吧”酒吧要招一个服务员，你有兴趣吗？",""]],["runoff","'rʌnɒf","n. 径流(量), 决赛, 决定性竞选",["Runoff from upstream development had almost destroyed all aquatic life in the stream.","These runoff elections will decide who will gain control of the Senate."],["",""]],["applicable","'æplikәbl","a. 合适的, 可应用的\\n[法] 适用的, 适应的",["This law is applicable to all cases.","This luxury product is taxed according to the applicable regulation."],["此法適用於所有情況。",""]],["professionally","","adv. 专业地；内行地",["I used to sing professionally, but I don't anymore.","Tom decided to give up playing guitar professionally."],["",""]],["accustom","ә'kʌstәm","vt. 使习惯于",["You have to accustom yourself to the crowded trains in Tokyo.","It took a long time to accustom myself to the noise."],["你要习惯东京拥挤的火车。",""]],["empathy","'empæθik","n. 移情作用, 共鸣\\n[医] 移情, 神入",["Sami has no empathy for people's feelings whatsoever.","Social empathy can lead us to confront the racism in our country."],["",""]],["deteriorate","di'tiәriәreit","v. (使)恶化",["If Tom doesn't take the prescribed medicine, his state of health might deteriorate.","Tom's health started to deteriorate after the death of his beloved wife, Mary."],["如果汤姆不吃处方药，他的健康状况可能会恶化。",""]],["collide","kә'laid","vi. 碰撞, 互撞, 抵触",["The views of the two politicians collide violently.","Egoists do not meet, they collide with each other."],["",""]],["ranger","'reinʒә","n. 王室守林人, 骑警, 漫游者",["The floor was strewn with party favors: torn noisemakers, crumpled party hats, and dirty Power Ranger plates.","Tom always thought he'd like to become a forest ranger."],["",""]],["reap","ri:p","vt. 收割, 收获, 获得\\nvi. 收割, 得到报应",["You know the phrase, we reap what we sow. I have sown the wind and this is my storm.","As the saying goes, \"You reap what you sow\", and yet another says that luck plays an important role in success too!"],["你也知道那句話，「善有善報，惡有惡報」。我搧的風，現在火就來了。","俗話說：一分耕耘、一分收穫；可俗話又說：人無橫財不富、馬無夜草不肥！"]],["feasible","'fi:zәbl","a. 能实行的, 可行的, 适宜的\\n[法] 可行的, 可执行的, 可完成的",["We have come to the conclusion that this plan is not feasible currently.","His plan seemed to be too difficult, but before long it proved to be feasible."],["我们得出结论，这个计划目前是不可行的。",""]],["bargaining","'bɑ:giniŋ","n. 讨价还价, 谈判, 交涉\\n[经] 议价, 讨价还价, 交易",["She's good at bargaining the price down.","Admittedly, models of hegemonic order cannot provide an explanation for all observed successful bargaining strategies."],["她很善于砍价。",""]],["mastery","'mɑ:stәri","n. 征服, 统治权, 优势, 精通, 掌握\\n[法] 统治权, 控制权, 征服",["The key to the so-called mastery of any language is bringing the words and grammar to life through context.","This piece is a virtuosic display of the composer's mastery of counterpoint and orchestration."],["",""]],["directive","di'rektiv","a. 指导的, 指挥的, 方向的\\nn. 指令\\n[计] 指令; 命令",["We received a new directive from the board yesterday. They want us to focus on our most visible projects.","I expect the board to issue a new directive that cancels the old one."],["",""]],["preventive","pri'ventiv","a. 预防的, 防止的\\nn. 防止物, 预防方法, 预防药",["Preventive measures are much more effective than the actual treatment.","That's the most realistic preventive measure, I think."],["预防措施比真正的治疗更有效。",""]],["arrogant","'ærәɡәnt","a. 自大的, 傲慢的",["In my soul there are many places that are cynical and arrogant, but at its core, it fears the darkness and is as weak as a sheep.","That girl is arrogant because of her beauty."],["我的灵魂里有很多地方玩世不恭，对人傲慢无礼，但是它有一个核心，这个核心害怕黑暗，柔弱得像绵羊一样。","那个女孩因为长得漂亮所以很自大。"]],["oneself","wʌn'self","pron. 自己, 亲自",["To have doubts about oneself is the first sign of intelligence.","It is presently very difficult to calm down and treat oneself with a book."],["自我怀疑是聪明的第一标志。","现在很难静下心来好好看一本书。"]],["dubious","'dju:biәs","a. 可疑的, 不确定的",["Tom got a computer virus while he was watching videos on dubious Internet sites.","Students are expected to stay away from dubious places."],["汤姆在可疑的网站上看视频的时候中了电脑病毒。",""]],["facade","fә'sɑ:d","n. 建筑物的正面, 外观, 表面",["That building's facade is bizarre. No idea what the architect was thinking.","The facade of the building was completely renovated. I didn't recognize it when I drove by."],["這座大樓的外觀很奇怪，不知道設計師是怎麼想的。",""]],["bypass","'baipɑ:s","n. 旁路\\nvt. 省略, 绕过, 忽视, 回避",["There was a pile-up on the town bypass involving about twenty cars.","AI is best used to enhance learning rather than bypass it."],["",""]],["creamy","'kri:mi","a. 含乳脂的, 乳脂状的, 奶油色的\\n[建] 含乳油的, 似乳油的",["The creamy mashed potatoes were enhanced with garlic powder.","The cannoli at Benedito's restaurant is crispy and creamy."],["",""]],["underlie",".ʌndә'lai","vt. 位于...之下, 成为...的基础",["What reasoning could underlie their latest decision?","Who knows what disagreements underlie this agreement?"],["",""]],["playwright","'pleirait","n. 剧作家",["A student visited the house of the great playwright.","I am determined to make a living as a playwright at all costs."],["",""]],["binoculars","bi'nɒkjulәs","n. 双目镜, 双筒镜\\n[机] 双目镜",["He watched the horse racing through his binoculars.","It's still impossible with the naked eye. With binoculars you might be able to glimpse it...."],["",""]],["phd","","abbr. 哲学博士学位（Doctor of Philosophy）",["Manan Arya's PhD thesis looked at the use of origami in space superstructures.","Sami received his PhD when he was only 26 years old."],["",""]],["vent","vent","n. 排气口, 出口, 通风孔, 发泄\\nvt. 发泄, 排出, 给...开孔",["I am really extremely angry, so I plan to smash things to vent my anger.","To have someone you can vent to nonstop, saying absolutely anything on your mind, this is rarer than anything else."],["我實在氣得不得了，所以打算砸東西發洩。","能向别人自顾自地单向倾诉、想说什么就说什么，这比什么都难得。"]],["eclipse","i'klips","n. 日食, 月食, (地位名誉等的)消失\\nvt. 引起日食, 引起月食, 使黯然失色",["The total solar eclipse can be observed next year on June 22nd.","An eclipse of the moon is a rare phenomenon."],["明年 6 月 22 日可以觀測到日全食。","月食是一種罕見的現象。"]],["enhanced","in'hɑ:nst. -'hænst","a. 增大的；加强的",["\"Enhanced interrogation\" is the term used to describe the torture techniques used in Guantanamo.","I recommend the public transport should be enhanced."],["",""]],["loading","'lәudiŋ","n. 装载, 装填\\n[化] 填充剂; 填料; 装载; 装料; 填充; 载液; 填充量; 装模; 装载",["All these new blocks will undoubtedly impact the loading speed of the home page.","The man is loading the moving truck on his own."],["这些新模块毫无疑问会影响主页的加载速度。","這個男人獨自把東西搬上搬家卡車上。"]],["foresee","fɒ:'si:","vt. 预见, 预知",["Nobody can foresee when the war will end.","The aim of science is, as has often been said, to foresee, not to understand."],["沒有人知道戰爭何時會完結。",""]],["harmless","'hɑ:mlis","a. 无害处的, 未受损害的, 无辜的, 无恶意的\\n[法] 无害的, 无恶意的, 无损害的",["Liberty consists of being able to make everything as harmless as possible.","There's no need to be frightened of the dog; he is quite harmless."],["自由旨在能够做所有不伤害其他人的事。",""]],["premier","'pri:mjә","n. 总理, 首相\\na. 首位的, 最初的",["All the top teams of the UK are in the premier division.","All the top teams in England are in the Premier League."],["英国所有的顶尖球队都在超级联赛中。","英格蘭所有頂級球隊都在英超聯賽。"]],["peril","'peril","n. 危险, 冒...之险, 险境, 险因\\nvt. 置...于险境, 冒险, 危及",["Many wild animals are in peril of losing their lives.","No peril daunts her, no prospect of fatigue or discomfort disheartens or repels her."],["",""]],["bracket","'brækit","n. 支架, 括弧, 托架\\nvt. 装托架, 括入括弧\\n[计] 方括号; 括号",["Use the apparatus only with the cart, tripod, bracket or table specified by the manufacturer, or sold with the apparatus.","In my age bracket, there are no job offers available."],["",""]],["paste","peist","n. 面团, 面食, 浆糊, 糊状物, 粘贴, 用拳重击\\nvt. 用浆糊粘, 张贴, 狠狠地打\\n[计] 粘贴",["I could eat some beef noodle soup, or some reheated rice with soybean paste like that, no problem.","Country girls like to cut red paper into peach and plum blossoms and paste them onto doors and windows."],["我可以不慌不忙吃牛奶面包鸡蛋，或者泡饭酱菜。","农村的女孩喜欢把红色的纸裁减成桃和李的花及贴在门窗上。"]],["bra","brɑ:","n. 奶罩\\n[化] 左矢; 刁",["Please take off all your clothes except your underpants and bra.","A sports bra should only be worn for working out, and not in any non-sports situations."],["請脫去除內褲和內衣外的所有衣物。","运动内衣最好只在运动时穿着，在其他非运动场合不穿。"]],["bruise","bru:z","n. 青肿, 挫伤, 擦伤\\nvi. 受伤, 擦伤\\nvt. 使受伤, 研碎",["My whole body was one big bruise after the rugby game.","I fell down really hard and got a black bruise on my knee."],["",""]],["wade","weid","vi. 跋涉\\nvt. 涉水\\nn. 跋涉, 浅滩",["Adopting a child is a tough decision with plenty of bureaucracy to wade through.","I'm surprised Wade isn't carrying her in his purse."],["",""]],["mediterranean",".meditә'reiniәn","n. 地中海, 地中海民族\\na. 地中海的, 地中海民族的",["Algeria should become China's main investment hot spot in the Mediterranean region.","A cargo vessel, bound for Athens, sank in the Mediterranean without a trace."],["阿爾及利亞應該成為中國在地中海地區的主要投資熱點。",""]],["chile","'tʃili","n. 智利\\n[化] 番椒; 辣椒",["According to today's paper, there was a big earthquake in Chile yesterday.","A tsunami warning has been issued in Chile after a magnitude 8.0 earthquake struck 49 miles off the coast."],["",""]],["poultry","'pәultri","n. 家禽",["He sent me a letter to the effect that his poultry farm would go bankrupt sooner or later.","I do not eat meat, fish, shellfish, poultry or broth."],["",""]],["reign","rein","v. 为王，为君；当政；统治\\nn. 为王，为君；当政；统治",["It is generally believed that Buddhism first came to China in 67 A.D. during the reign of Emperor Mingdi of the Eastern Han Dynasty.","The English sovereign is generally said to reign but not rule."],["普遍认为佛教公元六七年在东汉明帝的统治时先来中国。",""]],["rewrite","ri:'rait","vt. 重写, 改写, 改写新闻, 书面答复\\nvi. 修改旧作\\nn. 改写的作品\\n[计] 重写",["Use interrogative pronouns to rewrite the sentences below; if you need to, you can add or remove a few words.","You should rewrite this sentence. It doesn't make sense."],["用疑问代词表任指格式改写下面的句子，根据需要可以增加或者减少一些词语。",""]],["enjoyment","in'dʒɒimәnt","n. 享乐, 快乐, 享受\\n[经] 使用权",["No hobby is as cheap as reading, nor provides such long lasting enjoyment.","Music and art can greatly contribute to the enjoyment of life."],["没有任何娱乐像阅读这般廉价，也没有任何愉悦像阅读这般持久。",""]],["automaker","'ɔ:tәu,meikә","n. <美>汽车制造商",["The automaker will unveil its new line of sports cars tomorrow."],[""]],["rightly","'raitli","adv. 合适地, 正当地, 正确地",["And now here is my secret, a very simple secret: It is only with the heart that one can see rightly; what is essential is invisible to the eye.","In our country psychotherapists can rightly prescribe drugs while psychologists can't."],["喏，这是我的秘密。很简单。只有用心才能看到本质的东西。精髓是眼睛看不见的。",""]],["sitcom","'sitkɔm","abbr. 情景喜剧（situation comedy）",["I will always have a certain fondness for this sitcom because my grandmother and I used to watch it together.","Friends is a popular sitcom that first aired in the '90s."],["",""]],["patriotic",".peitri'ɒtik","a. 爱国的, 有爱国心的\\n[法] 爱国的, 有爱国心的",["Chinese people have the most patriotic stomachs.","National Foundation Day (February 11): day for commemorating the founding of the nation and for fostering patriotic feelings."],["中国人的胃最爱国了。",""]],["cracker","'krækә","n. 饼干, 爆竹\\n[计] 破袭者",["A cracker is much like a piece of bread, but bread is better than crackers for making sandwiches.","He is likely to have a book and a cracker at his meals--and then forget to eat the cracker!"],["",""]],["convicted","kən'vɪktɪd","v. 宣判有罪( convict的过去式 )",["The convicted drug dealer was willing to comply with the authorities to have his death sentence reduced to a life sentence.","The murderer was convicted and sentenced to life in prison."],["",""]],["impeachment","im'pi:tʃmәnt","[法] 控告, 检举, 弹劾",["We must start the impeachment process as soon as possible, if there's any hope of it succeeding.","I call for the impeachment of the President of the United States of America."],["",""]],["advertiser","'ædvәtaizә","n. 做广告者, 广告客户\\n[经] 广告商, 广告者",["The annoying advertiser called my house.","She works as an advertiser at a New Jersey firm."],["",""]],["procession","prә'seʃәn","n. 队伍, 连续, 列队行进, 涌出",["In Disneyland, popular characters in various stories march in procession at one o'clock.","At the rear of the procession was a strange-looking man in a straw hat."],["",""]],["genetics","dʒi'netiks","n. 遗传学\\n[化] 遗传学",["You won't see protein purification in a genetics course.","Their work reveals a lot about songbird genetics, and opens a new door to understanding the basis of human speech."],["",""]],["perpetuate","pә'petjueit","vt. 使永存, 使不朽, 保持",["Lonely people perpetuate their own loneliness through their fear of others.","The cruel remarks of some English native speakers perpetuate a sense of linguistic and even cultural superiority."],["孤獨的人會孤獨，是因為他畏懼他人。",""]],["dictatorship","dik'teitәʃip","n. 独裁者之职位, 独裁, 独裁政权\\n[法] 专攻, 独裁权",["Dictatorship can be summed up by \"shut up!\", democracy by \"keep talking\".","Democracy is the dictatorship of the majority."],["就算独裁国家是“闭上你的嘴”，民主国家才是“当你放屁”。","民主主义是多数选举的独裁。"]],["gosh","gɒʃ","interj. 唉, 天啊, 天哪",["Oh my gosh! You're the last person I expected to meet in a situation like this.","Oh my gosh! It's like his body was carved by ancient Greek sculptors."],["",""]],["payoff","'peiɒf","n. 发工资, 分赃, 贿赂, 盈利, 报酬, 报应, 结果, 高潮, 决定因素\\na. 决定性的, 产生结果的, 支付的",["You have time for payoff until the end of the month.","Tom said that he would not invest in stocks unless there was a definite payoff."],["",""]],["heterosexual",".hetәrә'sekʃuәl","a. 异性的, 异性爱的\\nn. 异性恋的人",["Bonobos often use sexual behavior, sometimes homosexual, sometimes heterosexual, for social negotiation.","I haven't seen a heterosexual person in over a week."],["",""]],["moan","mәun","n. 呻吟, 悲叹\\nvi. 呻吟, 抱怨, 悲叹\\nvt. 呻吟着说",["We lament, complain, moan and start crying out in pain.","I know that you will hear my bitter song, this moan of a plaintive heart."],["",""]],["lessen","'lesn","vt. 减少, 缩小, 减轻\\nvi. 变小",["When you are cheerful, books can increase your happiness; when you are sad, books can lessen your sorrow.","Even your faults do not lessen my respect for you, and in friendship this is what counts."],["开心时，书可以给你增加快乐；忧伤时，书可以给你减少哀愁。",""]],["fashionable","'fæʃәnәbl","a. 时髦的, 上流社会的, 流行的",["Libertarianism is fashionable in tech bro circles.","It's sort of fashionable, but the price is too high!"],["自由意志主義在科技男的圈子裡很受追捧。","虽然时髦一点，但是价钱太大！"]],["conquest","'kɒŋkwest","n. 战胜, 征服, 战利品\\n[法] 征服, 赢得, 获得",["The Normans' conquest of England had a great effect on the English language.","Before the Spanish conquest, the Aztecs got up to eighty percent of their nourishment from amaranth grains."],["",""]],["railing","'reiliŋ","n. 扶手, 栏杆, 抱怨\\n[电] 高重回率的雷达脉冲排挤",["A lot of people climb the railing, and even litter.","Ziri placed flowers on the balcony railing."],["很多人跳過欄杆，還丟垃圾。","齊莉將花兒放在了陽台的欄桿上。"]],["packaging","'pækidʒiŋ","n. 包装, 包装业, 包装术\\n[计] 组装; 封装",["We must make the utmost effort to reduce the use of plastic packaging, and also to recycle all waste plastic.","Packaging can actually prevent certain kinds of waste."],["我们应该尽我们最大的努力减少塑料包装的使用，并回收所有的塑料废物。",""]],["expectancy","ik'spektәnsi","n. 期待, 期望的事物, 嘱望, 希望, 期望, 预期\\n[医] 预期",["Life expectancy has been improving, most notably among the young and the poor.","We are in expectancy of which event could happen yet."],["",""]],["lebanese",",lebә'ni:z","a. 黎巴嫩的",["Putin is plucking Palestinian refugees from Lebanese camps to go fight for him in Ukraine; apparently his own soldiers aren't tough enough.","His aunt married a Lebanese man and went with him to Senegal."],["普丁正在從黎巴嫩難民營中招募巴勒斯坦難民前往烏克蘭為他作戰；顯然他自己的士兵不夠強悍。",""]],["parliamentary",".pɑ:lә'mentәri","a. 国会的, 议会的, 议会制度的",["Israel is a multi-party parliamentary republic and a liberal democracy that adopts universal suffrage.","Parliamentary activity has become a political tug of war between the ruling and opposition parties over the issue."],["",""]],["inheritance","in'heritәns","n. 遗传, 遗产\\n[医] 遗传",["He pissed away his inheritance on booze and loose women.","Her inheritance gave her a purse adequate to satisfy all her needs and wants."],["",""]],["methodist","'meθәdist","n. 墨守成规者",["George Lucas describes himself as a Buddhist Methodist.","Tom is Methodist, but Mary is Catholic."],["",""]],["briefcase","'bri:fkeis","n. 公事包",["Please pack the disks and hard copies into the briefcase.","Then he got dressed, stuffed his lecture notes into his briefcase, and ran down the stairs."],["",""]],["infamous","'infәmәs","a. 无耻的, 不名誉的, 声名狼藉的",["Sharks are infamous for their bloodthirsty natures.","After that night they became infamous in the entire city."],["",""]],["quantitative","'kwɒntitәtiv","a. 数量的, 定量的\\n[医] 定量的, 数量的",["To be considered as a scale, the construct under consideration should be a continuum, with quantitative units.","Quantitative clinical data follow a wide range of distributions."],["",""]],["brink","briŋk","n. 边缘, 陡岸",["Due to total Russification in Belarus, the Belarusian language is on the brink of extinction.","First Contact became humanity's salvation as it was at the brink of self-destruction."],["由于白俄罗斯完全地俄罗斯化，白俄罗斯语在绝灭的边缘。","在人類自我毀滅的邊緣，第一次接觸成了福音。"]],["symphony","'simfәni","n. 交响乐, 交响曲",["Do you know the concert schedule of London Symphony Orchestra?","I wrote an arrangement of this piece for a symphony orchestra."],["你知道伦敦交响乐团的演奏会行程吗？",""]],["paycheck","'pei'tʃek","n. 付薪水的支票, 薪水",["The President reiterated his call for Congress to pass the Paycheck Fairness Act that would strengthen the Equal Pay Act and give women more tools to fight pay discrimination.","Recently, they have not been giving her her paycheck on time."],["總統再次呼籲國會通過《薪酬公平法案》，該法案將加強《同工同酬法案》，並為女性提供更多對抗薪資歧視的工具。",""]],["plum","plʌm","n. 李子",["Country girls like to cut red paper into peach and plum blossoms and paste them onto doors and windows.","My mum helps me remove the core of the plum."],["农村的女孩喜欢把红色的纸裁减成桃和李的花及贴在门窗上。","妈妈帮我把李子去了核。"]],["catholicism","kә'θɒlisizm","n. 天主教的信仰",["He is a recent convert to Catholicism.","About 1.2 billion people worldwide profess Catholicism - the world's largest Christian faith."],["他新近皈依的天主教徒。",""]],["elevated","'eliveitid","a. 提高的",["Two persons were killed when an elevated bike path collapsed in Rio.","An elevated seaside bike path collapsed in Rio."],["当里约热内卢的一条高架自行车道倒塌时，有2人被砸死了。","里约热内卢的一条海边的高架自行车道倒塌了。"]],["kidnapping","","n. 绑架；诱拐",["To my surprise, the noted psychologist was accused of a kidnapping.","The prosecution condemned the defendant for kidnapping a child."],["",""]],["inherently","in'hiәrәntli","adv. 内在地, 生来地, 固有地\\n[计] 固有的",["Christians view human nature as inherently sinful.","He is a massive dimwit, inherently apathetic and incapable of rational thought."],["",""]],["cellar","'selә","n. 地窖, 地下室, 藏酒",["I realized then that this awful cellar was the only place that could save our lives.","Reception in the cellar is very poor."],["我意识到这个可怕的地下室是唯一可以救我们命的地方。","地下室裏的信號很差。"]],["breakup","'breikʌp","n. 分裂, 崩溃, 解散, 解体\\n[电] 停止",["Patterns of freeze-up and breakup influence the distribution and number of seals, the polar bear's main prey.","Tom couldn't think of Mary without remembering how painful their breakup had been."],["",""]],["boiling","'bɒiliŋ","a. 沸腾的, 激昂的\\nadv. 沸腾",["When the pressure is lower, the boiling point is lower.","Cook the peeled and chopped potatoes for 20 minutes in boiling water."],["压力低了，沸点就低。","把去皮切成小块的土豆放在滚水里煮20分钟。"]],["recede","ri'si:d","vi. 向后退, 退却, 收回, 降低, 减弱\\n[医] 退缩",["My memory of her has begun to recede.","She had begun to recede in my memory."],["我對於她的記憶開始消散。","她開始在我的記憶中消散。"]],["abound","ә'baund","vi. 大量存在, 富于, 充满",["There are not many countries in the world that abound in natural resources.","Fraud and deceit abound in these days more than in former times."],["",""]],["allowance","ә'lauәns","n. 津贴, 零用钱, 限额, 折扣, 允许\\nvt. 定量供应",["My dad gives me a weekly allowance that I use to buy comics and ice cream.","My dad gives me an allowance of $10 a week."],["我爸爸每周给我零用钱，我会用来买漫画书和冰激凌。","我爸一週給我10塊零用錢。"]],["linkage","'liŋkidʒ","n. 联合, 连锁, 结合, 联动\\n[计] 连接",["The linkage between the RV and the car was weak, allowing for the car to be left behind at the first pothole.","The 15-member Security Council heard repeated references to the linkage between poverty and conflict throughout the world."],["",""]],["roast","rәust","n. 烤肉, 烘烤, 嘲笑\\na. 烘烤的, 烤过的\\nvt. 烤, 炙, 烘焙, 嘲笑\\nvi. 烤, 炙, 烘焙",["At Christmas, one eats roast goose, red cabbage, and wheat buns.","Roast beef is usually accompanied by Yorkshire pudding."],["聖誕節時，人們會吃烤鵝、紅甘藍和小麥麵包。",""]],["depiction","di'pikʃәn","n. 描写, 叙述",["The movie is a harrowing depiction of life in an urban slum.","The depiction violated a company's registered trademark."],["",""]],["plummet","'plʌmit","n. 测深锤, 铅坠\\nvi. 垂直落下",["We heard that the company's stock is about to plummet, so we're getting out while the getting is good.","Sales will surely plummet without this change."],["",""]],["kindness","'kaindnis","n. 仁慈, 亲切, 和蔼",["Kindness is the language which the deaf can hear and the blind can see.","I will never forget your kindness so long as I live."],["善良是聾子能聽盲人能看的語言。","只要还活着，我永远忘不了你的好意。"]],["repression","ri'preʃәn","n. 抑制, 压抑, 制止\\n[医] 压抑, 抑制",["From this point we go on to an even more detailed examination of the concept of repression.","She thinks that sexual repression is really part of her religion. She misunderstands her religion, likely."],["",""]],["lust","lʌst","n. 贪欲, 欲望, 色欲\\nvi. 贪求, 渴望, 动淫念",["Love is merely a lyrical way of referring to lust.","The National Liberation Front party is know for its lust for power."],["",""]],["masterpiece","'mɑ:stәpi:s","n. 杰作, 名著",["I think that Liszt's \"Forgotten Waltz No.3\" is a hidden masterpiece.","He was surprised to find the great artist's masterpiece hung on the wall upside down."],["我觉得李斯特的《被遗忘的圆舞曲第三首》是个被埋没的名曲。","他實在有點不能相信，堂堂一個大畫家的傑作，居然會被上下倒轉地掛在牆上。"]],["culminate","'kʌlmineit","vi. 到绝顶, 达于极点, 达到高潮\\nvt. 使到绝顶, 使达到高潮",["I find striptease frustrating, as it doesn't often culminate in actual sex.","I hope this year will culminate in something good."],["",""]],["maze","meiz","n. 迷宫, 迷惘\\nvt. 使迷惘, 使混乱, 迷失",["Mary's house was situated in a maze of one-way streets almost unnavigable for drivers unfamiliar with the area.","No matter how hard he tried, he could not get out of the maze."],["",""]],["watershed","'wɒtәʃed","n. 流域, 分水岭\\n[医] 分水界, 分水岭",["This is a watershed moment for the whole industry.","Boston is in the Neponset River watershed."],["",""]],["humiliation","hju:.mili'eiʃәn","n. 耻辱, 丢脸, 谦卑",["Sami suffered a decade of abuse and humiliation from Layla.","There's a difference between humility and humiliation."],["",""]],["pronounced","prә'naunst","a. 发出音的, 读出来的, 显著的, 断然的, 明显的\\n[法] 显著的, 明显的, 明确的",["In the English language many words contain letters which are not pronounced.","\"Pecan\" is one of those tricky words that gets pronounced in several different ways."],["英文裡面很多字的字母是不發音的。","「pecan」是一個發音比較刁鑽的詞，有好幾種不同的發音方式。"]],["drainage","'dreinidʒ","n. 排水\\n[医] 引流[法], 导液[法], 排水[设备]",["The drainage systems are not able to handle the water pressure.","Inadequate drainage can lead to flooding."],["",""]],["implicate","'implikeit","vt. 涉及, 含意, 暗示, 牵连\\nn. 包含的东西",["If you implicate me, I'm warning you, I won't go down alone.","He refused to say anything that might implicate his friends."],["",""]],["wartime","'wɒ:taim","n. 战时",["Happening in wartime, this would amount to disaster.","After seven years of wartime captivity, Tom was a broken man."],["",""]],["multinational",".mʌlti'næʃәnl","a. 多国的, 跨国公司的\\nn. 跨国公司",["Multinational corporations outperform traditional corporations operating in just one country.","The multinational corporation has forecast the implementation of economies of scale."],["跨國企業遠勝於傳統的單一國家企業。","跨国公司预料到了规模经济的实行。"]],["refined","ri'faind","a. 精炼的, 优雅的, 精细的\\n[医] 精制过的, 精练过的",["The cat glided along, very refined, but ended up falling, which was very embarrassing.","I'm looking for a coat. I'm short so the length should be on the short side, and as refined a design as possible."],["這隻貓咪氣場全開，走著貓步，相當優雅，然後摔倒了，真是糗大了。",""]],["ordeal","ɒ:'di:l","n. 严酷考验, 痛苦经历, 煎熬\\n[法] 神裁判法, 严酷的考验, 痛苦的经验",["He cried thinking about his ordeal and its unending aftermath.","This whole ordeal has been stressful for Ziri and Rima."],["",""]],["navajo","'nævәhәj","n. 纳瓦霍人（美国最大的印第安部落）",["This is the ancestral territory of the Navajo people.","The capital of Arizona, Phoenix, is called Hoozdoh in Navajo."],["",""]],["periodic",".piәri'ɒdik","a. 周期的, 定期的, 间歇(性)的, 循环的, 用完整句的, 高碘的\\n[医] 周期性的",["He learnt the periodic table by heart just for fun.","Everyone has the right to rest and leisure, including reasonable limitation of working hours and periodic holidays with pay."],["他背週期表只是為了好玩。",""]],["inning","'iniŋ","n. 一局, 挨次轮换, 执政期, 围垦",["The score stood four to two, with but one inning more to play.","It would've been a close game if Tom hadn't hit a home run with bases loaded in the ninth inning."],["",""]],["snapshot","'snæpʃɒt","n. 快照, 抽点打印\\n[计] 瞬象; 抽点打印",["Fadil immediately picked up Layla's snapshot from the line-up.","It would be good to take a backup snapshot immediately."],["",""]],["adore","ә'dɒ:","vt. 崇拜, 爱慕, 喜爱\\nvi. 崇拜, 爱慕",["The students adore the new English teacher.","It is important, in any age, to adore God and to respect one's parents."],["学生们崇拜新的英语老师。",""]],["literal","'litәrәl","a. 逐字的, 字面上的, 文字的, 字母的\\nn. 印刷错误\\n[计] 文字; 直接量; 字面量; 句节",["He explained the literal meaning of the sentences.","Your interpretation is a bit too literal."],["他解释了句子的字面意思。","你的理解有点望文生义了。"]],["slippery","'slipәri","a. 滑的, 光滑的, 靠不住的, 圆滑的, 不稳固的\\n[法] 狡猾的, 不可靠的, 不安定的",["The roads are slippery on a rainy day. Be careful not to fall.","Driving on a slippery road can lead to a car wreck."],["雨天路滑，小心摔跤。","在光滑的路上开车会导致车祸。"]],["splendid","'spendid","a. 光亮的, 了不起的, 灿烂的, 壮丽的, 显著的, 杰出的",["\"Literary composition is a great achievement that concerns the ruling of a state, a splendid affair of eternal standing\".","This soccer match is full of energetic and splendid competition."],["\"文學作品是關係到一個國家統治的偉大成就，以及永恆地位的輝煌事跡\"。","这场足球赛充满着激情和精彩的竞争。"]],["mesh","meʃ","n. 网孔, 网丝, 网眼, 网状物, 圈套, 陷阱, 啮合\\nvt. 以网捕捉, 啮合, 使缠住\\nvi. 落网, 相啮合",["The guard's truncheon hit air. Off balance, he regained his posture to see a metal-mesh rubbish bin flying towards him.","The metal mesh is assembled on huge automated machines that weld many joints at once."],["",""]],["discern","di'zә:n","v. 辨别, 看清楚, 了解",["With adequate lighting, one can easily discern Nosferatu, with his pointed incisors and extremely long-limbed fingers, known as arachnodactyly, from common vampires.","It is hard to discern between the true and the false."],["在光線充足的情況下，諾斯費拉圖與普通吸血鬼很容易區分。諾斯費拉圖有著尖銳的門牙，以及極為修長的手指，即所謂的蜘蛛指。",""]],["foul","faul","a. 污秽的, 邪恶的, 恶臭的, 肮脏的, 恶劣的, 淤塞的\\nvt. 弄脏, 妨害, 污蔑, 犯规, 淤塞\\nvi. 腐烂, 犯规, …",["I just opened the lid, and a foul smell filled my nose.","The room hasn't been cleaned recently, so it now has a foul aroma."],["我刚打开锅盖，一股恶臭就扑鼻而来。","这个房间最近都没打扫过，有一股臭味。"]],["proven","'pru:vn","prove的过去分词",["The news article painted the defendant as a guilty man, even though he had been proven innocent.","A relationship between blood group and personality has not been scientifically proven."],["该报文章中将被告人描述成一个罪魁祸首，尽管他已经被证明是无辜的了。","科学上，血型和性格的关联性没有被证明。"]],["politely","pә'laitli","adv. 有礼貌地, 文雅地, 客气地",["Christopher Columbus once discovered an entire ship of deceased sailors... and politely ignored it.","When Chris suggested going out, she managed to politely say no."],["",""]],["dove","dʌv","n. 鸽子\\ndive的过去式",["Tom dove into the water and swam as fast as he could.","I saw the Spirit come down from heaven as a dove and remain on him."],["",""]],["solicit","sә'lisit","v. 请求, 乞求, 招揽, 征求",["West is in trouble not because he is a gay man, but because he is a man who was apparently willing to use the power of his public office to solicit sexual favors.","Executive departments and agencies should solicit public input on how we can increase and improve opportunities for public participation in Government."],["",""]],["ache","eik","n. 疼痛\\nvi. 痛, 哀怜, 渴望",["I have a fever and I ache all over.","The pain is here, right? That's a stomach ache."],["我发烧了，全身酸痛。","这里疼是吗？那是胃痛。"]],["alarming","ә'lɑ:miŋ","a. 使人惊恐的, 引起惊恐的",["This article is an alarming combination of gossip, superstition and nonsense.","Maybe it was an alarming situation, but in the end it was a realistic thing to say."],["",""]],["thinly","'θinli","adv. 薄, 细, 瘦",["They came from all over the world to make their homes in this new land, which was thinly populated by native Indians.","On a bright December morning long ago, two thinly clad children were kneeling upon the bank of a frozen canal in Holland."],["",""]],["nasal","'neizl","a. 鼻的, 鼻声的, 尖锐的\\nn. 鼻音, 鼻音字",["The woman used a nasal spray because she had a severe cold.","During the cold there were nasal congestion, sinus problems, and coughing."],["",""]],["tentative","'tentәtiv","n. 试验\\na. 试验性的, 暂时的",["Tom and Mary's little girl is starting to take her first tentative steps.","I've made a tentative deal with Tom."],["",""]],["outing","'autiŋ","n. 郊游, 远足\\na. 远足适用的",["The plans for the company outing don't sound too exciting.","Outing closeted, gay celebrities is a controversial practice."],["",""]],["stagger","'stægә","n. 蹒跚, 踌躇\\nvi. 蹒跚, 犹豫\\nvt. 使摇摆, 使踌躇, 交错, 错开\\na. 交错的, 错开的",["The march toward progress is really more of a haphazard stagger.","The company is attempting to stagger work hours."],["",""]],["paid","peid","a. 受雇的, 付清的\\npay的过去式和过去分词",["After the assistant returned $1 to each one, each man had actually paid only $9.","Cross off the names of the people who have paid their dues."],["然后助手还给每人1美金，每个人实际上只付了9美金。","麻煩你把付了錢的人的名字刪掉。"]],["nudge","nʌdʒ","n. 用肘轻推, 推动, 讨厌家伙",["Benedito gave the kid a playful nudge with his foot as it tried to nibble on his shoelaces.","Benedito gave the kid a playful nudge with his nose as it nibbled on his beard."],["",""]],["conjure","'kʌndʒә","vt. 念咒文召唤, 变戏法, 想象\\nvi. 变戏法, 施魔法",["When they no longer have priests, the gods become very easy to conjure.","Tom daydreams about Mary, believing he can conjure her up that way."],["",""]],["trajectory","trә'dʒektri","n. 轨道, 弹道, 轨线\\n[化] 轨道",["Mary's life trajectory has changed radically since then.","Sami was on a trajectory to do big things in life."],["",""]],["parcel","'pɑ:sl","n. 包裹, 部分, 片\\nvt. 分配, 打包\\na. 部分的\\nadv. 局部地",["The parcel arrived faster than I thought it would.","The address on this parcel is wrong."],["包裹到得比我想象中要早。","這個包裹上的地址是錯的。"]],["unsuccessful",".ʌnsәk'sesful","a. 不成功的",["If I don't come back, the venture will probably be unsuccessful.","The captain had the unsuccessful mutineers flogged."],["",""]],["wicked","'wikid","a. 坏的, 邪恶的, 缺德的, 刻毒的, 恶劣的, 淘气的",["The wicked witch cast a spell on the man and turned him into a bug.","It is wicked of you to do such things."],["惡毒的巫婆在男人身上施了咒語，把他變成了一隻蟲子。","你竟然做出那樣的事來，你還是人嗎？"]],["informed","in'fɒ:md","a. 见多识广的",["We are informed by newspapers of the major events that take place every day.","I am well-informed about this topic."],["我们从报纸中获知每天发生的重大事件。","我对这件事知情。"]],["trained","treind","a. 训练过的, 受过培训的；培训",["Musical talent can be developed if it's properly trained.","He thinks that only very well trained actors can be really successful."],["如果训练得当的话，音乐才能是可以培养出来的。","他认为只有训练有素的演员才能够获得成功。"]],["spicy","'spaisi","a. 香的, 多香料的, 辛辣的, 下流的",["Every now and then I like to have hot and spicy food.","To tell you the truth, this is a little too spicy for me."],["有时候我会想吃辣的东西。","说实话，这对我来说有点太辣了。"]],["intercourse","'intәkɒ:s","n. 交往, 交流\\n[医] 交际, 往来",["His soul was of an higher, prouder character than those with whom she had hitherto mixed in intercourse.","Syphilis is an infection that can be transmitted through sexual intercourse."],["",""]],["ornament","'ɒ:nәmәnt","n. 装饰, 点缀品, 教堂用品\\nvt. 装饰, 修饰",["Zoroastrianism uses fire for rituals and temple ornament.","Red is, indeed, the chief element of beauty in floral nature, the prime ornament of the green garb of the vegetal kingdom."],["",""]],["uprising","'ʌpraiziŋ","n. 起义, 升起\\n[法] 起义, 暴动",["The government acted boldly to deal with the outlaw uprising.","His analysis of the causes of the uprising was correct."],["",""]],["observatory","әb'zә:vәtәri","n. 天文台, 气象台, 了望台",["He built an observatory to study the stars.","Her family often took her to explore the Jodrell Bank Observatory at the University of Manchester."],["為了觀測星象，他建了一座天文台。",""]],["endurance","in'djuәrәns","n. 忍耐, 忍耐力, 耐性\\n[机] 持九性",["You need great endurance to run ten thousand meters.","Cardiovascular endurance is one of the six components of physical fitness."],["",""]],["constrain","kәn'strein","vt. 强迫, 限制, 关押",["Excessive reliance on monetary policy in an attempt to curb inflation could unnecessarily constrain credit and hence business.","Changes in water availability, both episodic and long-lasting, will constrain different forms of energy production."],["",""]],["pinch","pintʃ","n. 捏, 拧, 撮, 少量, 收缩, 挤压, 夹痛, 苦恼, 逮捕, 指控, 匮乏, 紧急关头\\nvt. 捏, 拧, 掐, 挤压, 修剪…",["Mix about four cups of white flour with a pinch of salt.","In a pinch, Tom can do without wine, but not coffee."],["",""]],["comforting","'kʌmfәtiŋ","a. 安慰的, 令人鼓舞的",["The fire burned brightly, giving forth a comforting warmth.","Nothing is more comforting than kindness offered to us while traveling."],["",""]],["orderly","'ɒ:dәli","a. 有秩序的, 整齐的, 值班的\\nn. 护理员, 清道夫, 传令兵, 勤务兵\\nadv. 依次地, 顺序地",["An orderly lifestyle and a regular diet are the keys to health.","At the bus stop, people waited in orderly lines, but as soon as the bus pulled up, the line broke up."],["",""]],["intentionally","","adv. 故意地, 有意地",["The truth is the truth, even if you defy it and intentionally cover it up, it is still no different from daydreaming.","I doubt that Tom intentionally did that."],["真理就是真理， 就算反其道而行故意掩盖它，这样的企图和白日做梦一样，不过是妄想而已。","我不太相信湯姆是故意的。"]],["dealings","","n. 来往, 交易, 买卖\\n[经] 交易",["When partners can't agree, their dealings come to naught and trouble is their labour's only fruit.","You'll gain nothing implicating us in your shady dealings."],["",""]],["recess","ri'ses","n. 休息, 休会, 放假, 凹进处, 深处\\nvt. 使凹进\\nvi. 休假, 休息",["A bight is a long, gradual bend or recess in the shoreline that forms a large, open bay.","Tom's favorite things at school are lunch and recess."],["",""]],["blog","","n. 博客；部落格；网络日志",["I wish I could figure out how to disable comments on my blog.","I started a new blog. I'll do my best not to be one of those people who blogs a lot right at the start and then quits blogging."],["但愿我能找到在我的博客上屏蔽评论的办法。","我建立了部落格。我會儘量努力，不想成為那種只在初期短暫活躍發文，然後就放棄的人。"]],["buildup","'bildʌp","n. 发展, 集结, 增强",["Loosen the bottle cap to prevent pressure buildup.","Decompression sickness, or \"the bends,\" is a buildup of nitrogen bubbles in the bloodstream and other areas of the body."],["",""]],["surf","sә:f","n. 海浪, 拍岸浪\\nvi. 作冲浪运动",["Why do you go online, surf, chat, and use QQ every time you have free time, wasting an entire night on it?","His cries for help were drowned by the roar of the surf."],["你怎么一有空就上网，冲浪灌水打QQ，一个夜晚就扔给它了？",""]],["nationality",".næʃә'nælәti","n. 国籍, 国家, 民族性\\n[法] 国家, 民族, 国民",["That company hires people without regard to race, religion, or nationality.","Everyone has the right to a nationality."],["这家公司不分种族、宗教或国籍雇用人。","所有人都有享有國籍的權利。"]],["sunshine","'sʌnʃain","n. 阳光, 光明, 晴天",["A day full of sunshine and a heart full of wishes...","We all know that blue-eyed red-heads are sensitive to sunshine, burning more readily than dark-skinned people."],["充满阳光的天和充满願望的心...","我們都知道，藍眼睛紅頭髮的人對陽光敏感，比深色皮膚的人更容易曬傷。"]],["flake","fleik","n. 小薄片, 扁薄的一层, 火星, 晒鱼架子\\nvt. 使成薄片\\nvi. 剥落",["Let's take precautions against heat fatigue, before we flake out from the heat, and have a healthy summer.","If you sift through barrels of dirt, you may eventually find a flake of gold."],["",""]],["culinary","'kʌlinәri","a. 厨房的, 烹调用的",["India is a region rich in culinary culture.","Now, the streets are silent and empty, devoid of bustling tables of customers enjoying the city's famed culinary pleasures."],["印度是一个烹饪文化丰富的地区。",""]],["alcoholic",".ælkә'hɒlik","n. 酒鬼, 酒精中毒者\\na. 酒精的",["People who drink alcoholic beverages are not allowed to enter.","His alcoholic neighbor lent him some money."],["飲酒者不准禁入。","他的一個酒鬼鄰居，借給他了一筆錢。"]],["appraisal","ә'preizәl","n. 评价, 估价\\n[经] 评价, 评估",["Tom generally makes good decisions based on a realistic appraisal of the situation he's faced with.","Our quarterly results will serve as the best appraisal of our approach."],["",""]],["reconsider",".ri:kәn'sidә","v. 再考虑, 重新考虑",["The stage charisma of drag performers compels audiences to reconsider their own stereotypes.","Conflicting reports prompted the director to reconsider her position."],["反串秀者的舞台魅力使觀眾不禁重新審視自己的刻板印象。",""]],["newborn","'nju:bɒ:n","n. 婴儿\\na. 新生的",["The newborn chicks still have not opened their eyes.","The newborn giraffe stumbled around on rickety legs."],["剛出生的小雞還沒有睜開眼睛。","新生的長頸鹿搖晃著腿跌跌撞撞地走。"]],["saga","'sɑ:gә","n. 传说, 英雄传奇, 冒险故事",["It was the third year of Meiji when their family name was changed to Saga.","The fighting is done, feasting begun, a saga well spun."],["",""]],["opener","'әupәnә","n. 开...的人, 开局人, 开创人, 开具, 开启工具, 首项\\n[经] 申请开证人",["That documentary about the environmental crisis was a real eye-opener.","The pretty girl in the bikini was an eye-opener on the beach."],["這部有關環境危機的紀錄片真是令人大開眼界。",""]],["sliced","slaist","刨切的",["This is the best thing since sliced bread! I don't know what the best thing was before sliced bread, however.","Tom sliced the tomato with the knife that he'd just sharpened."],["",""]],["explorer","ik'splɒ:rә","n. 探险家, 探测者, 勘探器\\n[医] 探察器",["Christopher Columbus wasn't an explorer because he loved the sea. He was an explorer because he hated Spanish jails.","He had been a scout too, and a trapper, a silver explorer, and a ranchman."],["克里斯托弗·哥伦布之所以成为探险家，不是因为他热爱大海，而是因为他讨厌西班牙的监狱。",""]],["degradation",".degrә'deiʃәn","n. 降格, 堕落, 退化\\n[计] 降级",["Overgrazing is leading to extreme soil degradation in Algeria.","Starch degradation is linked to a circadian clock."],["",""]],["offshore","ɒ:f'ʃɒ:","a. 海面的, 吹向海面的, 近海的\\nadv. 向海面",["Sami moved money from one of his offshore accounts into another.","He was helping his clients hide their drug money in offshore accounts."],["",""]],["superiority","sju:.piәri'ɒriti","n. 优越, 高傲\\n[化] 优越性",["I'll bet it gives her a feeling of superiority to be so beautiful.","Arab nationalism aims at building a single unified state built on Arab superiority."],["",""]],["biodiversity","","n. 生物多样性",["Algeria has a vast amount of biodiversity in the north.","We have little time to deal with the issues of climate, energy and biodiversity."],["",""]],["fingernail","'fiŋgәneil","n. 手指甲",["Ziri uses his fingernail to peel loquats.","I always keep a set of fingernail clippers in my guitar case."],["齊里用指甲剝枇杷。",""]],["questioning","'kwestʃәniŋ","[法] 审问, 讯问, 质问",["Such questioning is routine police business.","I was pressed by their questioning and slipped into telling an obvious lie."],["这样讯问只是警察例行公事。",""]],["cubic","'kju:bik","a. 立方体的, 立方的\\n[机] 立方的, 立方体的",["When in the barn the heating fails, cubic shape the milk yield takes.","Barn's heating is in bad shape, comes the milk in cubic shape."],["",""]],["bum","bʌm","n. 游荡者, 懒鬼, 闹饮\\na. 没有价值的\\nvi. 过游民生活, 乞讨, 流浪\\nvt. 乞讨",["Of course Tom makes himself scarce when there's work to do, that lazy bum.","That car dealer gave me a bum steer when he told me this used Toyota was in good condition."],["",""]],["asylum","ә'sailәm","n. 庇护, 收容所\\n[医] 养育院",["This world is just an insane asylum.","The embassy denied political asylum to foreign refugees."],["世界就是一个疯子的囚笼。",""]],["exemplify","ig'zemplifai","vt. 例证, 例示\\n[法] 制作经公章证明的誊本, 例证",["I heard your idea on how to solve the problem, but I would have to ask you to exemplify what you mean."],[""]],["pedal","'pedl","n. 踏板, 脚蹬子\\na. 脚的, 脚踏的\\nvt. 用脚踏动\\nvi. 踩踏板, 骑车",["Each time you step on the pedal, the wheel turns once.","Press the brake pedal to turn on your brake lights."],["",""]],["hiss","his","n. 嘘声, 嘶嘶声\\nvi. 发出嘘声, 发嘶嘶声\\nvt. 发嘶嘶声表示",["Mary's cat needs to hiss only once, to scare away the neighbours' dogs.","Their journey was silent but for the hum of the engine, the hiss of the rain and the rhythmic squeaking of the windshield wipers."],["",""]],["incapable","in'keipәbl","a. 无能力的, 不能的\\n[机] 不能行的, 耐不住的",["I am entirely incapable of accepting this minister's arguments.","He is a massive dimwit, inherently apathetic and incapable of rational thought."],["我完全無法接受這位公使的言論。",""]],["adulthood","ә'dʌlthud","n. 成年\\n[医] 成人期",["The graduation from elementary school to middle school is regarded by some as the first step towards adulthood.","They will be accepted by their peers in adulthood."],["有些人認為從小學升到中學是踏入成年的第一步。",""]],["slower","","[计] 减慢",["Stop inhaling your food. You should eat a little slower.","I'm sorry, I do not understand. Can you repeat it a little slower?"],["别狼吞虎咽的。你最好细嚼慢咽地吃。","对不起，我听不懂。你能慢点儿再说一遍吗？"]],["autopsy","'ɒ:tәpsi","n. 验尸\\n[医] 尸体解剖, 尸体剖检",["Most of his posthumous fame came from his autopsy results.","The autopsy confirmed that Tom died from a gunshot wound."],["",""]],["gigantic","dʒai'gæntik","a. 巨人般的, 巨大的",["The heart and mystery of his philosophy was, to look upon the world as a gigantic practical joke.","The bureaucrats maintain solid ties with the gigantic corporations."],["",""]],["repertoire","'repәtwɑ:","n. 全部剧目, 全部技能, 全部节目, 全部作品",["Her repertoire on the piano is not very large, but she has learned every piece by heart.","It's important for every musician to ensure there is variety in their repertoire."],["虽然在钢琴上她的造诣不是很深，但是她勤而好学。",""]],["scrutinize","'skrutinaiz","vt.vi. 细看, 仔细检查, 审查, 细阅\\n[法] 细看, 细阅, 仔细检查",["I will scrutinize you closely."],[""]],["rehearse","ri'hә:s","vt. 预演, 排演, 使熟练掌握, 练习, 复述\\nvi. 排练, 练习, 演习",["Tomorrow morning we will rehearse \"The Nutcracker\", and in the evening we will dance \"Swan Lake\".","The phenomenon of esprit de l'escalier is why I rehearse conversations in my head beforehand."],["",""]],["imported","","vt. 输入, 进口（import的过去式与过去分词形式）",["The suits in this row are all made of imported European fabric.","The \"anti-woke\" propaganda being imported into your country's media comes straight from actual fascists."],["这里一排都是进口面料欧版的西装。","你們國家媒體中輸入的「反覺醒」宣傳，是直接來自真正的法西斯的。"]],["iq","","智商, 智力商数",["Far from refuting the thesis that race is to blame for lower IQ score, Lynn's data actually supports it.","Anybody with at least a two-digit IQ knows this was a politically biased choice."],["",""]],["shuffle","'ʃʌfl","n. 拖着脚走, 曳步, 混乱, 蒙混, 洗纸牌\\nv. 拖曳, 马虎地做, 笨手笨脚地穿(脱)衣, 推诿, 洗牌\\n[计] 混洗",["Please shuffle the cards carefully.","You have to shuffle your classes round whatever happens because you're the lady of the house and you often have lots of guests."],["请仔细洗牌。",""]],["rethink","ri:'θiŋk","v. 再想, 重想",["The President has called for a comprehensive effort to rethink the high school experience.","Police are running an advertising campaign advising people who intend to drive home after drinking, to rethink their third drink."],["",""]],["psyche","'psaiki","n. 灵魂, 精神, 普赛克(希腊神话中人类灵魂的化身)\\n[医] 精神, 心灵",["Reality and irreality are both important for one's psyche.","Taking both alcohol and drugs simultaneously can lead to big changes in one's psyche."],["",""]],["residual","'rezidju:l","a. 残渣的, 剩余的\\nn. 残渣, 剩余, 余数",["They were left with residual feelings of guilt even though they knew they had done nothing wrong.","Large residual stomach contents may lead to loss of appetite, nausea and vomiting."],["",""]],["loft","lɒft","n. 阁楼, 鸽房, 楼上\\nvt. 储存于阁楼上\\nvi. 将球高击",["When I look for something in our loft, I never come back empty-handed, but not with the thing I had hoped to find.","She said there's an amp gathering dust in her loft which you can have, if you want it."],["",""]],["kurdish","'kә:diʃ","a. 库尔德人的\\nn. 库尔德语",["Most of them identify as being ethnically Kurdish and speak both the Sorani and Gorani dialects of the Kurdish language.","The Kabyle people and the Kurdish people are fighting the same fight against Arab-Muslim imperialism."],["",""]],["crate","kreit","n. 板条箱, 装货箱\\n[建] 篓, 筐",["Tom used a crowbar to pry open the lid of the crate.","Tom opened up the crate with a crowbar and took out a stick of dynamite."],["",""]],["uranium","ju'reiniәm","n. 铀\\n[化] 铀U",["Uranium is used in the production of nuclear power.","Uranium has to be enriched before it can be used in nuclear weapons."],["",""]],["scottish","'skɒtiʃ","a. 苏格兰的, 苏格兰人的",["Scottish libraries are open to all members of the public who can show appropriate proof of their identity.","From his accent, I would guess that man is Scottish."],["",""]],["fiercely","'fiәsli","adv. 猛烈地, 厉害地",["To make matters worse, it began to thunder fiercely.","The two sides fought fiercely in the Battle of Iwo Jima."],["",""]],["layoff","'leiɒf","n. 临时解雇, 操作停止, 活动停止期间",["Research in Motion announced the layoff of 2000 employees and a restructuring of the company."],[""]],["lizard","'lizәd","n. 蜥蜴\\n[医] 蜥蜴",["The lizard climbed along the wall and went into a hole.","If you cut the tail off of a lizard, it will grow back."],["",""]],["penis","'pi:nis","n. 阳物, 阴茎\\n[医] 阴茎",["Don't smoke. Smoking can shorten your penis.","She received an ad for penis enlargement in her inbox."],["别吸烟。吸烟可能缩短你的阴茎。",""]],["marvel","'mɑ:vl","n. 奇异事物, 罕见例子\\nvt. 惊异于\\nvi. 惊异",["Extracts from the sample we took earlier have revealed a great marvel.","I can't help but marvel at the extent of human stupidity."],["",""]],["tailor","'teilә","n. 裁缝, 成衣匠\\nvt. 缝制, 制作, 使适应\\nvi. 做裁缝",["The tailor is going to redo the hem of my pants.","Father always has the tailor make his suits."],["裁縫師要幫我重新修褲腳。","父親總是讓這位裁縫師為他做西裝。"]],["ceramic","si'ræmik","a. 陶瓷的\\nn. 陶瓷制品",["Jack has a ceramic piggy bank in which he saves coins.","An electric heater warms up the ceramic tiles of the bathroom floor."],["",""]],["gem","dʒem","n. 珠宝, 宝石, 珍贵之物\\nvt. 饰以宝石",["\"Pretty gem, isn't it?\" Not knowing if it was a suitable subject or not, but anyway I tried to get her interest that way.","It's not as if just anybody can write a literary gem."],["",""]],["violently","'vaiәlәntli","adv. 猛烈地, 激烈地, 极端地",["I had a little fever, I felt my heart beat violently.","I tried to give him some advice, but he just abused me violently."],["",""]],["scattered","'skætәd","a. 分散的, 散乱的\\n[计] 分散的",["There are beautiful flowers scattered throughout the garden.","The shards of thought were scattered on the ground."],["花園裡散落著美麗的花朵。","思想的碎片散落一地。"]],["compassionate","kәm'pæʃәnit","a. 慈悲的, 富于同情心的, 照顾性的\\nvt. 怜悯, 同情",["Thank you for your thoughtful and compassionate response.","The more you suffer in life, the more compassionate you become."],["",""]],["brighten","'braitn","vi. 变亮, 活跃\\nvt. 使生辉, 使快活",["Orchids offer an easy, low-cost way to brighten up a room.","Your smile lights up my world, and without it, everything feels dull and lifeless. I need you to brighten my days."],["",""]],["champ","tʃæmp","v. 大声地嚼, 格格地咬\\nn. 格格地嚼, 咀嚼声",["The crowd may be on the side of Luciano, but the champ has got the skill to win and that's what matters.","Luciano, the underdog in the match, will be trying to make the champ eat humble pie."],["",""]],["convene","kәn'vi:n","vt. 集合, 召集, 召唤\\nvi. 聚集, 集合",["The assembly will convene tomorrow.","They convene every evening at the library."],["",""]],["roasted","","a. 烤的",["Mary put some roasted pecans into her salad.","On a busy Friday night, in Diak's restaurant, some customers are enjoying slow-roasted pork loin with quince and mashed potatoes, baked apple, and brandy butter sauce."],["瑪莉在沙拉裡放了一些烤山核桃。","在一個繁忙的星期五晚上，迪亞克的餐廳裡，一些顧客正在享用慢烤豬里肌配榅桲、馬鈴薯泥；烤蘋果；以及白蘭地黃油醬。"]],["nineteen",".nain'ti:n","num. 十九, 十九个",["It's valid until March thirty-first, nineteen-ninety-seven.","I was born in the year nineteen hundred and seventy-two."],["有效期到1997年3月31日为止。",""]],["wrinkle","'riŋkl","n. 皱纹, 妙计, 方法, 技巧\\nvi. 起皱\\nvt. 使起皱纹",["There's a pesky wrinkle on my shirt that I just can't get the iron to remove.","From within her wrinkle furrowed face two alert and inquisitive eyes looked at me."],["",""]],["psychic","'saikik","a. 灵魂的, 精神的, 心灵的\\nn. 巫师, 灵物, 心灵现象",["Layla truly believed that Sami had psychic abilities.","Maybe in a different universe, the emotional and psychic environment is even different from ours."],["",""]],["amongst","ә'mʌŋst","prep. 在...当中, 在...之间, 在...之中",["True art of life is to see the extraordinary amongst the ordinary.","These young people are talking loudly amongst themselves and have absolutely no regard for those around them."],["生活真正的艺术是在平凡中看到不平凡。","這些年輕人彼此之間大聲說話, 絲毫不在意周圍的人。"]],["fireworks","'faiәwә:ks","n. 烟火, 激烈争论\\n[化] 焰火",["Yesterday, an explosion occurred at the fireworks factory.","As soon as it gets dark, the fireworks will start."],["昨晚，烟花厂发生了爆炸。","天一黑，就会开始放焰火了。"]],["compute","kәm'pju:t","v. 计算, 估算\\nn. 计算, 估算",["Scientists can easily compute the distance between planets.","Can you compute the distance of the moon from the earth?"],["科學家們可以很容易地計算出行星之間的距離。","你可以把地球和月亮之間的距離計算出來嗎？"]],["comprehension",".kɒmpri'henʃәn","n. 理解, 包含",["Good day, lords. In what way can I refine upon my adroitness in aural comprehension?","Each chapter in the textbook is followed by about a dozen comprehension questions."],["早安，师傅。我应该怎么样提高听力能力？",""]],["interviewer","'intәvju:ә","n. 会见者, 面谈者, 进行面试者",["The interviewer introduces the topic of the interview.","The interviewer identifies his interviewees."],["採訪者介紹了採訪的主題。","這名採訪者確認了他的採訪對象。"]],["painfully","'peinfuli","adv. 痛苦地, 苦恼地, 费力地",["It has become painfully obvious that the US is no longer the policeman of the world.","Capricorns being the best is painfully obvious and shouldn't even be doubted."],["",""]],["aspire","ә'spaiә","vi. 渴望, 立志于",["You can't aspire to a political career! Your father will disinherit you.","Sometimes little kids aspire to be strange things."],["",""]],["landowner","'lændәunә","n. 地主\\n[法] 土地所有人, 地主",["In 1880, the Irish boycotted a landowner, Captain C.C. Boycott, for failing to lower rents."],[""]],["pardon","'pɑ:dn","n. 原谅, 赦免\\nvt. 宽恕, 原谅",["I beg your pardon; I didn't quite catch your name.","Tom asked his girlfriend to pardon him for forgetting her birthday."],["能再說一次嗎？我沒聽清楚你的名字。",""]],["hawaiian","hә'waiiәn","n. 夏威夷人, 夏威夷语\\na. 夏威夷的, 夏威夷语的",["He's a pretty unique guy, wearing bell bottoms and Hawaiian shirts to the office.","This marine conservation area is home to many rare and endangered species such as the green sea turtle and the Hawaiian monk seal."],["",""]],["fiery","'faiәri","a. 炽热的, 热烈的, 暴躁的",["The fairy started off at once, and arrived, about an hour later, in a fiery chariot drawn by dragons.","The pastor gave a fiery sermon that left the sinners among them shaking in their boots."],["",""]],["specification",".spesifi'keiʃәn","n. 规格, 详述, 详细说明书\\n[计] 规范; 形式说明; 说明; 说明书; 规格",["Any industrial property rights relating to the Product Specification shall belong to ABC Inc.","In mathematics and computer science, an algorithm is an unambiguous specification of how to solve a class of problems."],["",""]],["aspirin","'æspәrin","n. 阿斯匹林\\n[化] 乙酰水杨酸; 阿司匹灵; 邻乙酸基苯甲酸",["My head hurts. Maybe I should take an aspirin.","I'm allergic to aspirin, penicillin, and sulfamides."],["我头痛。可能我该吃阿司匹林。",""]],["dependency","di'pendәnsi","n. 属国, 保护地, 从属物\\n[医] 从属, 从属部",["Careful! Emotional dependency is not synonymous with love!","Algeria needs to get rid of its dependency on oil."],["小心，精神依赖不是爱的同义词！",""]],["walnut","'wɒ:lnәt","n. 胡桃\\n[机] 胡桃木",["This wood wallet is crafted from a single piece of walnut.","Since it's my day off today, I'm going to treat myself to a family-sized tub of walnut ice cream."],["這款木質皮夾由一整塊胡桃木製成。","今天是我的休息日，我要買一整桶家庭裝的核桃冰淇淋犒勞自己。"]],["pier","piә","n. 码头, 桥墩, 支框, 防波堤\\n[医] 桥基, 基牙",["Police say he got the boys from the South Pattaya pier area where there are a lot of vagrant children.","He crosses the river under cover of darkness, to pace along the pier."],["",""]],["bluff","blʌf","n. 断崖, 绝壁, 吓唬\\na. 直率的\\nv. 吓唬, 欺骗",["She was tempted to call his bluff, hardly believing that he would carry out his threat.","I ended up tripping and skinning my knee while I was it in our game of blind man's bluff."],["",""]],["tracking","'trækiŋ","[计] 跟踪, 追踪",["But I haven't looked up this tracking number on the DHL website.","At only 17, Avi Schiffmann has built one of the most popular coronavirus-tracking websites in the world."],["但是我在DHL的网站上没有查到这个运单号。",""]],["computing","kәm'pju:tiŋ","[计] 计算",["It's possible to branch out from computing to jobs in banking, accountancy and so on.","Some of my classmates are pure noobs; they know nothing about computing sciences."],["有可能將電腦工作擴展到銀行業務, 會計業務等等。","我的一些同学真是菜鸟，他们一点都不懂计算机。"]],["slick","slik","a. 光滑的, 熟练的, 聪明的, 华而不实的, 老套的, 陈腐的\\nadv. 灵活地, 聪明地\\nvt. 使光滑, 使漂亮\\nvi. 打…",["If I don't wash my hair for a day, it becomes slick with oil and flat.","The statues in the museum courtyard were slick with rain."],["",""]],["nickel","'nikl","n. 镍, 镍币, 五分镍币\\nvt. 镀镍于",["If I got a nickel for everytime I saw someone as beautiful as you, I'd have five cents.","The islands are rich in undeveloped mineral resources such as lead, zinc, nickel, and gold."],["",""]],["onstage","'ɔn'steidʒ","adv. 在前台\\na. 在前台的",["Onstage, Tom once again proved how adaptable he is.","Tom rose from his seat and, amid applause, made his way to the onstage lectern."],["",""]],["enhancement","in'hɑ:nsmәnt","n. 提高, 美化, 增进, 增强, 增加\\n[计] 增强, 加强, 提高, 充实",["This isn't a bug, it's an undocumented enhancement.","At the moment, we are only fixing problems in the software. We are not accepting enhancement requests."],["",""]],["geometry","dʒi'ɒmәtri","n. 几何学\\n[机] 几何学",["The Greeks invented a theoretical model of geometry.","If geometry is the science of space, what is the science of time?"],["希臘人建立了幾何學的理論模型。","如果说几何学是空间的科学，那时间的科学是什么？"]],["hog","hɒg","n. 猪, 贪婪者, 象猪般的人\\nv. (使)拱起",["With the money Mr Johnson had saved, he would be able to live high on the hog when he retired.","If I win the lottery, I'll be able to live high on the hog."],["用這些傑森先生存下來的錢, 在他退休後他可以生活的很寬裕。","如果我中了彩劵，就一輩子衣食無憂了。"]],["broccoli","'brɒkәli","n. 花椰菜",["The broccoli today isn't very fresh.","Broccoli is one of the healthiest vegetables."],["今天的西藍花不是很新鮮。","西蘭花是最健康的蔬菜之一。"]],["resonate","'rezәneit","v. (使)共鸣, (使)共振",["I understand what you're saying intellectually, but it doesn't resonate with me emotionally.","At nightfall, when the last rays of the sun color the prairie sky red, the howls of coyotes resonate through the hills."],["",""]],["capitalist","'kæpitәlist","n. 资本家, 资本主义者\\na. 资本主义的",["Edward, the venture capitalist, hit the jackpot in the oil business.","Individual capitalists behave in such a way as to threaten the conditions that permit the reproduction of the capitalist class."],["",""]],["ideally","ai'diәli","adv. 完美地, 理想地",["Ideally, a candidate for this job should have four years' work experience.","Ideally, food should be tasty, cheap, healthy, and morally inoffensive."],["我们希望应聘者能有4年工作经验。",""]],["chemotherapy",".kemәu'θerәpi","n. 化学疗法\\n[化] 化学疗法",["Many cancer patients lose their hair because of the chemotherapy.","Many cancer patients lose their hair because of chemotherapy."],["很多癌症患者都因为化疗而脱发。",""]],["breach","bri:tʃ","n. 裂口, 违背, 破坏, 违反, 突破, 破裂\\nvt. 攻破, 突破\\nvi. 跳出水面",["Tom fired Vladimir for serious breach of working discipline.","The former president of a certain association has been arrested on suspicion of breach of trust."],["",""]],["knob","nɒb","n. 把手, 瘤, 旋钮, 球形突出物\\nvt. 使有球形突出物\\nvi. 鼓起",["Twist that knob to the right and the box will open.","Move the knob at the side of the seat forwards, collapse the seat."],["",""]],["tablet","'tæblit","n. 平板, 门牌, 笔记簿, 碑, 匾, 药片\\n[化] 片剂",["Take one tablet a day until all of the medicine is gone.","You have to take a tablet with a glass of water two or three times a day."],["",""]],["helping","'helpiŋ","n. 帮助, 协助, 一份",["He takes the initiative in helping his mother do the housework.","Thank you for helping me. Please turn off the light, I want to go to sleep."],["他主动帮他妈妈做家务。","我谢谢你帮帮忙，给我把灯关了，我想睡觉了。"]],["attribution","әtri'bju:ʃәn","n. 归因\\n[法] 归因, 归属, 属性",["We're releasing all the sentences we collect under the Creative Commons Attribution license.","Tatoeba's sentences are published under a Creative Commons Attribution License 2.0 (CC-BY)."],["",""]],["ineffective",".ini'fektiv","a. 无效的\\n[法] 失效的, 无效的, 效率低的",["The 5% topical solution was ineffective at reducing eczema outbreaks.","A plethora of ineffective education programs made the president unpopular amongst fiscal conservatives."],["",""]],["squat","skwɒt","n. 蹲, 窝\\na. 蹲着的, 矮胖的\\nvi. 蹲下, 蹲坐, 蹲伏\\nvt. 使蹲下, 擅自占有",["Tom started doing squat thrusts in the waiting room.","The authorities evicted Rochel's queer feminist squat."],["",""]],["fumble","'fʌmbl","n. 摸索, 笨拙的行动, 漏球\\nvt. 摸索, 乱摸, 笨拙的处理, 漏接(球)\\nvi. 摸索, 笨手笨脚, 漏球",["Indianapolis got one last chance with the ball, but a fumble by a player ended any hopes for the team.","Don't fumble with anything during an interview."],["",""]],["judaism","'dʒu:diizm","n. 犹太教, 犹太文明, 犹太教信仰",["Outside the mainstream of orthodox Judaism, the apocalyptic books were more successful with certain movements.","Judaism is more like Christianity than it is like Buddhism."],["",""]],["cardboard","'kɑ:dbɒ:d","n. 薄纸板\\n[化] 咭纸; 特等纸板; 卡纸板; 卡片纸板",["Outside the school, she saw people with no homes living in cardboard boxes.","These cardboard boxes are a hundred per cent recyclable."],["她在校外見到沒家的人住紙板箱。","這些紙板盒是百分之百可回收的。"]],["erotic","i'rɒtik","a. 性爱的, 性欲的, 色情的\\nn. 好色之徒, 色情诗",["Taobao suggested sexy and cute erotic underwear for me.","\"What's the difference between erotic and kinky?\" \"Erotic is when you use a feather and kinky is when you use a whole chicken.\""],["淘宝给我推荐了性感又可爱的情趣内衣。","「情色和變態之間有什麼不同之處？」「情色是當你使用一根羽毛，變態是當你使用整隻雞。」"]],["glacier","'gleiʃә","n. 冰川",["The glacier descends from the summit into the White River Valley.","Additional ice joins the main glacier from the south, avalanching down from the Jeannette Heights area."],["",""]],["polling","","n. 选举投票\\n[计] 轮询; 探询",["He is seriously competing with her in the polling score.","Most polling stations are in schools and other public buildings."],["",""]],["yoga","'jәugә","n. 瑜珈",["A good yoga session can limber you up like nothing else.","Yoga is becoming more and more popular every year."],["",""]],["sediment","'sedimәnt","n. 沉淀物, 沉积\\n[化] 沉降物; 沉积物",["By means of a super high-pressure water spray practically all the sediment is removed.","Continental shelves are often covered by young land-derived sediment."],["",""]],["recollection",".rekә'lekʃәn","n. 记忆, 回想, 回忆",["I have no recollection of seeing the man.","It is just my recollection that there remained no more than 20 people in the village."],["我沒有見過那男人的印象。",""]],["lobbying","","vi. 为了支持或抵制某项特定目标游说（lobby的现在分词形式）",["AIPAC is an unaccountable lobbying group with extreme opinions on Israel that do not represent those of American Jews.","Morocco is lobbying nations against Western Sahara."],["",""]],["fallen","'fɒ:lәn","a. 堕落的, 落下来的, 陷落的\\nfall的过去分词",["Many local traditions have fallen into decay in recent years.","What with fatigue and lack of sleep, he has fallen ill at last."],["近几年，很多当地的传统都衰败了。","他疲勞過度，又睡眠不足，最後便病倒了。"]],["akin","ә'kin","a. 同类的, 同族的, 同源的",["His expression grew very grave as he spoke, and a look of something akin to fear sprang up in his eyes.","Freedom is akin to the rarified air of a mountain top. Weak men cannot bear one or the other."],["",""]],["estrogen","'estrәdʒәn","n. 雌激素\\n[化] 雌激素",["Declining estrogen levels can lead to thinning of the vaginal walls.","Estrogen deficiency in men causes erectile dysfunction."],["",""]],["bartender","'bɑ:.tendә","n. 酒保, 酒吧侍者",["Either as a waiter at a restaurant or a bartender, both are OK.","When the bartender totals the bill for a customer who is drunk and angry, he must be very careful to mind his P's and Q's."],["做餐馆服务员啊、酒吧招待员啊，都可以。",""]],["evaporate","i'væpәreit","vi. 蒸发, 失去水分, 消失\\nvt. 使蒸发, 使脱水, 使消失",["When the stock market crashes, retirement accounts evaporate.","These solvents, due to their volatility, evaporate into the atmosphere when used."],["",""]],["succumb","sә'kʌm","vi. 屈从, 屈服, 死",["Endeavor to reach your objectives and do not succumb to failures.","To decide means to succumb to the preponderance of one set of influences over another set."],["",""]],["seventy","'sevnti","num. 七十, 七十个",["Ten, twenty, thirty, forty, fifty, sixty, seventy, eighty, ninety, hundred.","Ten, twenty, thirty, forty, fifty, sixty, seventy, eighty, ninety, one hundred."],["十、二十、三十、四十、五十、六十、七十、八十、九十、一百。","十、二十、三十、四十、五十、六十、七十、八十、九十、一百。"]],["radioactive",".reidiәu'æktiv","a. 放射性的, 有放射能的\\n[医] 放射性的, 放射的",["Another interesting source of energy is the heat that can be recovered from radioactive waste material.","TEPCO is unable to stop the flow of dirty water contaminated with highly radioactive material."],["",""]],["seasoned","'si:znd","a. 经验丰富的, 老练的",["I seasoned the fish with salt and pepper.","I think the Thai food at this place is seasoned so Japanese will like it."],["我在魚上灑鹽和胡椒作調味。",""]],["simulate","'simjuleit","vt. 模拟, 假装, 模仿\\n[法] 伪装的, 模拟的; 假装的, 伪装的, 冒充",["An aviary is a large enclosure for birds, often containing shrubbery and other plants to simulate their natural habitat.","He and his colleagues used an artificial material in the lab to simulate a surface like the tissue inside an infected person."],["",""]],["stature","'stætʃә","n. 身材, 身高, 高度\\n[医] 身材, 身高",["The boy did not reach his father's stature of six feet.","Young people have shown a lot of improvement in physical stature."],["",""]],["recruiting","riˈkru:tɪŋ","v. 招聘( recruit的现在分词 ); 吸收某人为新成员; 动员…（提供帮助）; 雇用",["Our basketball team is recruiting tall boys.","The police department was recruiting."],["",""]],["forearm","'fɒ:rɑ:m","n. 前臂\\nvt. 预先武装, 准备",["A blood-pressure band, or tourniquet, is placed about the arm, and the pressure increased until the forearm becomes cyanosed and the radial pulse is almost obliterated.","The elbow is the joint between the arm and forearm."],["將血壓帶 (或止血帶) 套在手臂上，逐漸增加壓力，直到前臂發紺，橈動脈搏動幾乎消失。",""]],["volleyball","'vɒlibɒ:l","n. 排球",["Some of my classmates like volleyball and others enjoy tennis.","Some people like volleyball, others enjoy tennis."],["我有些同學喜歡排球，也有些喜歡網球。","有些人喜欢排球，其他人喜欢网球。"]],["intrigue","in'tri:g","n. 阴谋, 复杂的事\\nvi. 密谋, 私通\\nvt. 激起...的兴趣, 用诡计取得",["He watches for an opportunity to intrigue against his rival.","This is a story full of intrigue, love, betrayal and secrets."],["",""]],["alignment","ә'lainmәnt","n. 队列, 结盟, 校正\\n[计] 校准; 对齐; 对准",["The engineer measured the axial alignment of the rotating shaft.","Your wheels are out of alignment. You need to take the car in for service."],["",""]],["grenade","gri'neid","n. 手榴弹",["That soldier knows how to use flamethrowers and grenade launchers perfectly.","The flashbang grenade got its name from the bright flash and loud bang it generates upon explosion."],["",""]],["shudder","'ʃʌdә","n. 战栗, 发抖\\nvi. 战栗, 发抖",["The terrible scene made him shudder.","I confess at these words a shudder passed through me."],["恐怖的场面让了他颤抖。",""]],["wink","wiŋk","n. 眨眼, 使眼色, 瞬间\\nvi. 眨眼, 使眼色, 闪烁\\nvt. 眨",["She disappeared leaving only a conspiratorial wink.","The tension on the day of the match made me greet the morning without even sleeping a wink."],["",""]],["stellar","'stelә","a. 星的, 似星的, 星球的, 主要的",["The solar system is a stellar system around which 8 planets, several moons and celestial bodies orbit.","Trying to do stellar observations from Earth is like trying to do birdwatching from the bottom of a lake."],["",""]],["coarse","kɒ:s","a. 粗糙的, 下等的, 粗俗的\\n[计] 粗略的",["Soft wool is more expensive than coarse wool and both are superior to synthetics made of nylon.","Her skin is coarse from years of working outdoors."],["",""]],["incumbent","in'kʌmbәnt","a. 现任的, 依靠的, 负有义务的\\nn. 领圣俸者, 在职者",["His speeches resemble the straight-to-the-point style of his incumbent.","The incumbent broker has 10 days to obtain a countermand letter in order to maintain the account."],["",""]],["celebrated","'selibreitid","a. 驰名的, 有名的",["Three days ago, many Chinese people celebrated the national day in Beijing.","India's Independence Day is celebrated on the fifteenth of August."],["三天前，許多中國人在北京慶祝國慶日。",""]],["outreach","aut'ri:tʃ","vt. 超出...的范围, 作超出能力所及的事而害及自己, 占...的上风, 胜过\\nvi. 走得太远, 伸出, 展开",["Tom volunteers in a community outreach program designed to help homeless people.","Outreach programs are the main source of support for at-risk teens in this community."],["",""]],["spelling","'speliŋ","n. 拼, 拼字, 拼法\\n[计] 拼写检查",["Your composition was good except for the spelling.","Many words are pronounced according to the spelling, but some are not."],["你的文章寫得很好，但卻有很多字拼錯了。","许多词是根据拼写来发音的，不过有些不是。"]],["baked","'beikid","a. 烘焙的；烤的",["The best cakes that I have ever eaten are those that my mother baked.","Egg tarts, when freshly baked, are a real delicacy."],["母亲做了的蛋糕是我吃了的最好的。","新鮮出爐的蛋撻味道一流。"]],["regimen","'redʒimen","n. 养生法, 常规强化训练课, 体制, 情态\\n[医] 制度, 生活制度",["Taoism scriptures have many Chinese medicine regimen.","He's encouraged to maintain a strict eating regimen."],["",""]],["goddamn","'^ɔddæm","a. 该死的, 完全的, 十足的, 讨厌的",["I'm not saying a goddamn thing until I get to talk to my lawyer.","I'm sick of playing these goddamn guessing games with you."],["在見到我的律師之前，我他媽的什麼都不會說。",""]],["proceeds","'prәusi:dz","pl. 收益\\n[经] 收入, 收款, 所得",["A portion of the proceeds will go to benefit children with disabilities.","The proceeds from the bond issue will be used to finance the budget deficit."],["我們會把一部分籌得的款項用來幫助殘疾兒童。",""]],["perpetrator","","n. 作恶者, 犯罪者, 行凶者\\n[法] 作恶者, 行凶者, 犯罪者",["The perpetrator could almost completely remove all traces.","Someone who sees something wrong being done and does nothing about it, is as culpable as the perpetrator of the act."],["",""]],["whine","hwain","n. 哀叫声, 嘎嘎声, 哀鸣\\nvi. 哭诉, 嘎嘎响, 发呜呜声\\nvt. 哀诉",["Coil whine may sometimes be annoying, but it's usually harmless.","Twitter is a website where people go to see celebrities whine."],["",""]],["fetus","'fi:tәs","n. 胎儿\\n[医] 胎, 胎儿",["A fetus is merely a part of the pregnant person's body until it is viable.","The point at which an embryo becomes a fetus has apparently been chosen arbitrarily."],["",""]],["catalyst","'kætәlist","n. 触媒, 接触剂, 催化剂, 刺激因素, 促进因素\\n[计] 催化剂",["It would be difficult to improve the device without an effective catalyst.","First, I'd like to examine the catalyst used in this experiment."],["",""]],["extremist","iks'tri:mist","[经] 偏激份子",["The civil disobedience of the dead was heroic; the civil disobedience of the living is extremist and criminal.","Everything can and should be translated, including what far-right, racist or Islamist extremist groups don't like."],["",""]],["contour","'kɒntuә","n. 轮廓\\nvt. 画轮廓\\na. 显示轮廓的\\n[计] 轮廓",["The fossil proved to be the first one of its kind that revealed the tail fin contour in its entirety.","I'm learning how to contour my face with make-up."],["",""]],["wardrobe","'wɒ:drәub","n. 衣橱, 衣室, 全部衣服",["I was thinking of going out and buying a whole new wardrobe.","It'll soon be winter, so I'm taking warm things from the top compartments of the wardrobe and putting them somewhere further down."],["",""]],["ordinance","'ɒ:dinәns","n. 法令, 条例, 圣餐礼\\n[经] 法令, 条款, 条例",["From today on this ordinance is history.","The attempts to overturn the ordinance still need to be passed by Congress."],["從今天開始，這項規定成為了歷史。",""]],["doctoral","'dɒktәrәl","a. 博士的",["Even if she wasn't sick, she couldn't complete her doctoral thesis by the deadline because the thesis problem contains a vast amount of detail.","His doctoral thesis must be submitted to the professor by the end of the month."],["即使她没生病，到了规定的日期她也完成不了她的博士论文， 因为论文题目涉及的内容太广泛。",""]],["grease","gri:s","n. 脂肪, 兽脂, 油脂, 贿赂\\nvt. 涂脂于, 贿赂",["The mechanic had grease all over his coveralls by the end of the day.","That politician won't meet you unless you grease his palm."],["",""]],["episcopal","i'piskәpәl","a. 主教的, 主教制度的, 英国国教的",["Nietzsche, belatedly discovered by a world beset by terrors too great for it and mysteries too profound, becomes almost respectable, nay, almost Episcopalian!"],[""]],["aviation",".eivi'eiʃәn","n. 航空, 航空学, 飞行术\\n[法] 航空, 飞行, 飞行术",["The aviation expert analyzed the statistics in detail.","Compared to fifty years ago, today's aviation technology has made great progress."],["航空专家详细分析了统计数据。",""]],["hawk","hɒ:k","n. 鹰, 掠夺者, 鹰派成员\\nvi. 放鹰行猎, 像鹰一般地袭击, 清嗓, 咳嗽\\nvt. 捕捉, 咳出, 兜售, 叫卖, 散播",["The bird was half the size of a hawk.","Betty may be pretty, but she shoots a gun with the precision of a hawk."],["那只鸟的体积有半只老鹰那么大。",""]],["imaginative","i'mædʒinәtiv","a. 想像的, 虚构的",["Our public leaders are imaginative and often come up with new ideas.","Tom doesn't seem to be as imaginative as Mary seems to be."],["",""]],["hopeless","'hәuplis","a. 无希望的, 绝望的, 不可救药的",["By the way, my English is absolutely hopeless.","I'm hopeless at ironing so I buy permanent press clothes."],["順道一提，我的英語是絕對沒有希望了。",""]],["pathetic","pә'θetik","a. 悲哀的, 可怜的, 感伤的, 差劲的\\n[医] 感情的",["We could not bear to listen to the sick child's pathetic cries.","The Japanese people, thinking only of running away in such times, are pathetic."],["",""]],["confide","kәn'faid","vt. 吐露, 委托\\nvi. 信赖",["He didn't trust his brother enough to confide in him.","Compared to my own brother, I confide in my friend more."],["",""]],["struggling","'strʌgliŋ","a. 努力的, 奋斗的, 苦斗的",["They are struggling with the goal of wiping out smallpox.","A struggling actor I know finally hit pay dirt when he was cast in the new Quentin Tarantino film."],["他们奋斗的目标是消灭天花。",""]],["fasten","'fɑ:sәn","vt. 拴紧, 使固定, 系, 集中于, 强加于\\nvi. 扣紧",["Fasten your seat belt at all times.","As the plane was approaching turbulence, the pilot asked the passengers aboard the plane to fasten their seat belts."],["無論何時都要扣好安全帶。",""]],["decay","di'kei","n. 衰退, 腐败\\nv. (使)衰退, (使)腐败",["Many local traditions have fallen into decay in recent years.","The decay of the shrine is due, in part, to acid rain."],["近几年，很多当地的传统都衰败了。","廟宇的毀壞有一部分要歸因於酸雨。"]],["silhouette",".silu:'et","n. 黑色半身侧面影, 影子, 轮廓, 剪影\\nvt. 描绘...成侧面影, 使照出影子来, 使仅仅显出轮廓",["The only pictures there are of Tom are backlit, meaning you can only see his silhouette.","To Ziri's horror, there was a dog silhouette standing in the hallway."],["",""]],["revisit","ri:'vizit","vt. 再访, 重游, 重临\\nn. 再访问",["Those old memories of junk food are nice to revisit.","Ziri is coming back to revisit the ivy in a couple of weeks."],["",""]],["hen","hen","n. 母鸡, 雌禽",["Anglo-Saxon was to Norman as hen-pecked to uxorious.","He likes me! - The cook's hen said."],["盎格鲁-撒克逊人对诺曼人来说就像妻管严对溺爱妻子的人一样。","他喜欢我！—厨师的母鸡说。"]],["resonance","'rezәnәns","n. 共鸣, 回声, 反响, 谐振, 共振\\n[化] 共振; 共鸣",["By using four types of metal, specific frequency resonance is suppressed.","MRI stands for Magnetic Resonance Imaging, whereas CT stands for Computed Tomography."],["",""]],["node","nәud","n. 节, 结节, 瘤\\n[计] 节点; 结点",["Scientists created a natural pacemaker in experiments with pigs with a malfunctioning sinoatrial node, which regulates heartbeat.","Our team captured the forward node."],["",""]],["conserve","kәn'sә:v","n. 蜜饯, 果酱\\nvt. 保存, 使(能量等)守恒",["When bears sleep or lie down, their postures depend on whether they want to get rid of heat or conserve it.","During the dry season, the giraffe cow needs to conserve its milk and energy."],["",""]],["noodle","'nu:dl","n. 面条, 笨蛋",["You're right. The noodle broth here is a bit expensive.","I could eat some beef noodle soup, or some reheated rice with soybean paste like that, no problem."],["您说得对。这里的面汤比较贵。","我可以不慌不忙吃牛奶面包鸡蛋，或者泡饭酱菜。"]],["casting","'kɑ:stiŋ","n. 投掷, 铸成品, 角色分配\\n[化] 浇铸; 铸品",["This development is casting a larger and larger shadow over the chemical industry as well.","In the cottage lay the secret which was casting a shadow over my life."],["",""]],["moonlight","'mu:nlait","n. 月光\\na. 有月光的, 月夜的",["She turned off the lights so she could enjoy the moonlight.","It was a pitch-black night without moonlight."],["她關了燈，好享受月光。","那是个漆黑的没有月光的夜晚。"]],["revised","","a. 改进的",["In order to move the project along smoothly, we have revised the plan several times.","A revised edition of the encyclopedia was published."],["为了顺利推进项目，我们已经修订了几次计划。",""]],["bowling","'bәuliŋ","n. 保龄球戏",["Although I enjoy bowling, I haven't gone bowling recently.","Even though I enjoy bowling, I haven't gone bowling recently."],["虽然我享受打保龄球，但是我最近没有去打保龄球。","虽然我享受打保龄球，但是我最近没有去打保龄球。"]],["portrayal","pɔ:'treiәl","n. 描绘, 描写, 画像, 肖像\\n[计] 描绘",["That film was an extremely inaccurate portrayal of key historical events."],[""]],["china","'tʃainә","n. 中国, 瓷器\\na. 中国的",["In China, they celebrate New Year by the lunar calendar.","Stories like Cinderella can be found in China, Japan and in every land of the world."],["中国按阴历过新年。","像灰姑娘这样的故事可以在中国、日本及世界任何国家都可以找到。"]],["specially","'speʃәli","adv. 特别地, 专门地",["This is a store that caters specially to students.","The conference will be held in a specially selected church."],["这是一家专门为学生提供服务的商店。","会议将会在特意安排的礼堂里举行。"]],["shaky","'ʃeiki","a. 震动的, 摇晃的, 动摇的",["Liverpool have got off to a shaky start this season. I wonder if Mane leaving might've spelt the end of our run of good form.","Your plan is standing on a very shaky base support."],["",""]],["villain","'vilәn","n. 坏人, 恶棍\\n[法] 歹徒, 恶棍, 恶徒",["Afterwards, he set off for Villain Valley.","Reasoning with a villain is pointless."],["然后他出发去了恶人谷。","跟小人說理，就如同對牛彈琴。"]],["durable","'djurәbl","a. 持久的, 耐用的",["This seems expensive, but it's so durable it will pay off in the long run.","Linen thread is durable and has a beautiful silver color."],["",""]],["industrialized","in'dʌstriәlaizd","a. 工业化的",["It seems a tendency that more industrialized societies create science fiction.","The average number of pregnancies per woman is two in industrialized countries."],["",""]],["generosity",".dʒenә'rɒsiti","n. 慷慨, 宽大",["I had great admiration for his generosity.","After his change of heart, the former miser became unstinting in his generosity to the poor."],["我很钦佩他的慷慨大方。",""]],["capitalize","kә'pitәlaiz","vt. 以大写字母写, 使资本化, 估计...的价值\\n[经] 资本化, 收益的现值化",["Whoever doesn't capitalize when the opportunity presents itself will later regret not having used the chance.","Be careful: We capitalize nationalities, days of the week, and languages in English."],["",""]],["sift","sift","vt. 筛, 过滤, 撒, 详查\\nvi. 筛, 被筛下, 精选",["If you sift through barrels of dirt, you may eventually find a flake of gold.","Tom wanted to sift the flour, salt, and baking soda together, but he didn't have a sieve."],["",""]],["walker","'wɒ:kә","n. 徒步者, 轻便鞋\\n[法] 山林巡视官",["Losing his balance from a sudden gust of wind, the tightrope walker fell to his death.","He must be a good walker to have walked such a long distance."],["突然刮起一陣風，走鋼索的人失去了平衡便摔死了。",""]],["bail","beil","n. 保释, 拎环, 杓, 栅栏\\nvt. 保释, 舀水",["It's so typical of him to bail out at the last minute.","Dan served only two weeks in jail before his family came up with bail money."],["",""]],["deliberation","di.libә'reiʃәn","n. 熟虑, 熟思, 审议\\n[法] 慎重考虑, 商讨, 审议",["Actions are successfully achieved with deliberation but ruined by carelessness.","After careful deliberation, the developers decided to use CryENGINE for their upcoming game."],["行成于思，毁于隨。",""]],["compass","'kʌmpәs","n. 指南针, 范围, 音域\\nvt. 包围, 达到, 图谋, 理解",["Tom doesn't know how to use a compass.","Compass needles point to the north."],["汤姆不会使用指南针。","指南针的指针指向北边。"]],["podium","'pәudiәm","n. 墩座, 矮隔墙, 指挥台\\n[医] 足, 吸足",["I knew I could get a podium, and that's all I wanted.","When cleaning the classroom, a few students carry the podium."],["",""]],["novelty","'nɒvәlti","n. 新奇, 新鲜, 新奇的事物",["Some people prefer conformity, while others seek novelty.","Back when it was first introduced, the telephone was quite the novelty."],["有些人喜欢循规蹈矩，而有些人总喜欢寻求刺激。",""]],["hoop","hu:p","n. 箍, 铁环, 呼呼声\\nvt. 加箍于, 包围\\nvi. 发呼呼声",["Kids these days have no imagination whatsoever. Only a nationwide revolution and sweeping economic reform will bring the hoop and stick back into vogue.","You ride a bike and climb a ladder. But what do you do with a hula hoop?"],["",""]],["brightness","'braitnis","n. 光亮, 明亮, 聪明\\n[计] 亮度",["The brightness of the sky showed that the storm had passed.","The brightness of her smile always makes me feel better."],["",""]],["outset","'autset","n. 着手, 开头, 最初",["The new teacher hit it off with the pupils from the outset.","Mary's brash manner didn't put Tom off, but rather impressed him from the outset."],["",""]],["martial","'mɑ:ʃәl","a. 战争的, 军事的, 尚武的, 威武的\\n[医] 含铁的",["His martial arts prowess has already reached a level of sublime perfection.","Kendo is an ancient Japanese martial art that dates back to the time of the samurai warriors."],["他的武功已经达到了出神入化的境界。",""]],["pastel","pæ'stel","n. 粉蜡笔, 粉蜡笔画, 随笔\\na. 彩色蜡笔的, 蜡笔画的, 柔和的, 纤弱的",["Madame de Pompadour liked pastel colors and floral patterns.","Pastel-colored items have a softer and more faded look compared to other types of colors."],["",""]],["cardiovascular","kɑ:diәu'væskjulә","a. 心血管的\\n[医] 心血管的",["Sometimes the first symptom of cardiovascular disease is death.","Lungs, heart, veins, arteries and capillaries form the cardiovascular system."],["",""]],["schooling","'sku:liŋ","n. 学校教育, 学费",["The mandatory character of schooling is rarely analyzed in the multitude of works dedicated to the study of the various ways to develop within children the desire to learn.","I will have to wait till I finish schooling and start earning money."],["許多著作都致力於研究開發小孩學習慾望的方式，但其中很少會有作品分析學校教育的強制性角色。",""]],["dropout","'drɒpaut","n. 退学学生, 中途退学\\n[电] 离去",["Even though he was a school dropout, Tom was later very successful in life.","I knew that Tom was a high school dropout, but I hired him anyway."],["",""]],["flooding","'flʌdiŋ","n. 充溢, 泛滥, 血崩\\n[计] 满屏幕; 扩散式路由选择",["The hillside had torrential flooding from the west.","In the city, the information is flooding."],["山坡让滔滔的洪水往西流。","消息在城里传遍了。"]],["repay","ri'pei","v. 偿还, 报答, 报复",["Lend money only to such as will repay it.","I've got to get some money somehow to repay the bank loan."],["只借錢給會還錢的人。",""]],["irresponsible",".iri'spɔnsәbl","a. 不负责任的；不可靠的",["I am alarmed by your irresponsible attitude.","They were polar opposites: one was honest and reliable, whilst the other was unpredictable and irresponsible."],["我对你不负责任的态度感到惊讶。",""]],["stimulation",".stimju'leiʃәn","n. 刺激, 激励, 鼓舞\\n[医] 兴奋, 刺激",["Just as the body needs exercise, so the mind needs stimulation to stay healthy.","There's a big difference between reading for pleasure and stimulation and reading for knowledge and education."],["正如身體需要鍛煉，所以心靈需要刺激才能保持健康。","为享受和生命激活而读书，和为知识和教化而读书，是两码事。"]],["grouping","'gru:piŋ","n. 分组\\n[计] 组",["This little grouping of chairs looks like a horse.","Mandeep found that grouping the kids into fours or fives yielded the best results."],["",""]],["jeopardize","'dʒepәdaiz","vt. 危害, 使受危困, 使陷危地",["If you ignore the past, you jeopardize the future.","Will this stuff jeopardize my health?"],["","这些东西对健康有害吗？"]],["neon","'ni:ɒn","n. 氖\\n[化] 氖Ne",["There are blue neon lights on the pretty teahouse.","Helium, neon, argon, krypton, xenon and radon are noble gases."],["",""]],["chili","'tʃili","n. 干辣椒, 辣椒粉",["Add seasoning, seasoned oil, and chili, to the boiling water.","It's the first time I've mixed chili with mayonnaise."],["",""]],["subscribe","sәb'skraib","vt. 捐献, 签署\\nvi. 赞成, 同意, 捐款, 预订, 认购\\n[计] 订阅",["The profane language used on network television makes many parents with young children not want to subscribe to cable.","Sami asked Layla to click on the \"subscribe\" button."],["",""]],["institute","'institju:t","n. 学会, 学院, 协会\\nvt. 创立, 开始, 制定, 任命",["At The Happiness Institute in Australia, a couple of hundred dollars may do the trick.","A new classroom building was built in our institute last year."],["在澳大利亚的快乐协会，两百块钱可能达到效果。","去年我们学院建了一个新教学楼。"]],["sprout","spraut","n. 芽, 萌芽\\nvt. 使发芽, 摘去芽\\nvi. 长芽, 抽条",["Professor Sprout acclimated the plant to a new environment.","Some of the seeds we're spreading will sprout later."],["",""]],["spinal","'spainl","a. 针的, 尖刺的, 尖刺状突起的, 脊骨的\\n[医] 棘折; 脊柱的",["Central nervous system consists of brain, cerebellum, medulla oblongata and spinal cord.","My body became paralyzed as the needle penetrated my spinal cord."],["",""]],["categorize","'kæti^әraiz","vt. 分类, 归类",["It is time consuming to categorize your flash cards.","You shouldn't categorize all Muslims as murderers."],["",""]],["pigeon","'pidʒin","n. 鸽子, 易上当受骗的人, 年轻女子",["The pigeon and the ostrich are both birds; one can fly and the other cannot.","So the pigeon can feel the magnetic field on its head, but it can't feel the Earth's magnetic field."],["",""]],["mutually","'mju:tʃuәli","adv. 互相地, 互助",["Instead of just the marketing department completing all their work objectives is not as effective as all the departments working together and mutually realising all the objectives.","Marriage should be mutually and infinitely educational."],["与其仅仅营销部成功地完成自己的工作目标，不如所有部门一起合作，共同实现所有目标。",""]],["functioning","'fʌŋkʃәniŋ","n. 运行, 运作；功能；机能；起酌（function的动名词）",["Now Ghouate's village is connected to the world's largest functioning fog collection project, alleviating the need to collect water that fell mainly on women.","Tom has a sex dungeon, complete with a functioning sex machine."],["现在，Ghouate 的村庄与世界上最大的功能雾收集项目相连，减轻了主要落在妇女身上的收集水的需要。",""]],["heighten","'haitn","vt. 增高, 提高, 加强\\nvi. 升高, 变大",["Humanitarian organizations fear the ongoing impasse and the hostile rhetoric could heighten local xenophobia.","The lessons learned from the annals of history on peak wood should heighten our awareness of the consequences of the limits of natural resources."],["",""]],["gland","glænd","n. 腺, 密封套\\n[化] 衬片; 密封垫",["Descartes thought that the mind and body were joined in the pineal gland.","This son of Jewish immigrants had a tumor on his pituitary gland that caused his unusual growth."],["",""]],["latitude","'lætitju:d","n. 纬度, 范围\\n[化] 宽容度; 伟度",["A nautical mile is based on the circumference of the earth, and is equal to one minute of latitude.","Tasmania is on the 40 degrees South latitude."],["",""]],["gig","gig","n. 旋转物, 轻便双轮马车, 赛艇, 鱼叉, 记过, 爵士乐演奏会\\nvi. 乘轻便双轮马车, 乘快艇, (用鱼叉)叉鱼\\nvt. (用…",["Teaching ESL is usually a gig for losers and boozers.","I'd love to go to the gig with you, but I'm brassic."],["教英語通常是失敗者和酒鬼的工作。",""]],["expressive","ik'spresiv","a. 表达的, 富于表情的",["She has an extremely expressive singing voice.","Many people use emojis because faces have a stronger expressive power than words."],["她的歌声有很强的表现力。",""]],["meaningless","'mi:niŋlis","a. 无意义的",["Technology is in itself meaningless unless it serves mankind.","Something you should know about me is that I half of what I say is meaningless."],["",""]],["moose","mu:s","n. 麋, 驼鹿",["In many parts of the world it is illegal to shoot wild game such as deer, moose or pheasant.","Tom had never seen a moose until he moved to Alaska."],["",""]],["equate","i'kweit","vt. 使相等, 视为平等\\nvi. 等同",["You can't equate nationalism with fascism.","Luxury and convenience do not equate to happiness."],["你不能將民族主義與法西斯混為一談。",""]],["yearn","jә:n","vi. 渴望, 想念, 怀念, 同情",["People everywhere yearn for public leaders dedicated to world peace.","For a pillow like this all men do yearn but that - quite frankly - is not my concern."],["",""]],["unsure",".ʌn'ʃuә","a. 不肯定的, 不确定的, 没有自信的",["She seemed somewhat unsure of herself.","He was unsure how he would get there, and when."],["她似乎对自己有点不确定。","他不知道怎么到那里去、什么时候到。"]],["unseen",".ʌn'si:n","a. 未被看见的, 看不见的",["Millions of spiritual creatures walk the earth unseen, both when we wake, and when we sleep.","A vast bedlam of sound flies up to my window, and above all is the immense whistling of unseen and unfelt winds."],["",""]],["sociology",".sәusi'ɒlәdʒi","n. 社会学\\n[医] 社会学",["He not only graduated from studying sociology, but also philosophy.","Frank majored in sociology at university."],["他不仅社会学毕业，还有哲学。","弗蘭克在大學主修社會學。"]],["theoretically",".θi:ә'retikli","adv. 理论上, 理论地",["Everything is theoretically impossible until it's done.","Being LGBT theoretically does not imply a political affiliation, but when a party is promising to destroy your life, believe them."],["",""]],["bound","baund","n. 跃, 回跳, 范围, 边界\\na. 受约束的, 装有封面的, 有义务的, 关联的, 被束缚的, 准备去...的, 便秘的\\nvi. …",["The plane bound for Beijing is going to take off soon.","We are bound to each other by a close friendship."],["飞往北京的飞机就要起飞了。","友谊紧紧联系着我们。"]],["prostitution",",prɔsti'tju:ʃәn","n. 卖淫, 糟蹋, 滥用\\n[法] 卖淫, 滥用",["Prostitution, gambling, the use of narcotic substances, drunkenness, disorder, and all other illegal activities are STRICTLY FORBIDDEN.","A high school girl posting on a web forum hinting at underaged prostitution has been arrested."],["严禁卖淫嫖娼，赌博，吸毒，酗酒滋事等违法犯罪活动！",""]],["ceramics","si'ræmiks","n. 制陶术\\n[化] 陶瓷学",["I have an interest in oriental ceramics.","It's a mixture of ceramics, porcelain, stoneware, and earthenware."],["我对東方陶瓷有兴趣。",""]],["adorn","ә'dɒ:n","vt. 装饰, 使生色",["Man adorns the place, the place doesn't adorn the man.","You have dragged from the altar a virgin whom Cupid had reserved to adorn a tale of love."],["",""]],["unify","'ju:nifai","v. 统一, 使成一体",["He tried to unify the various groups.","Today, Thanksgiving continues to unify millions of Americans who gather to celebrate the holiday with family and friends."],["他試著統一不同的團體。",""]],["clearing","'kliәriŋ","n. 清扫, 空地, 票据清算\\n[经] 票据交换, 结算, 结帐",["Fortunately, my wound is clearing up quickly.","If you have any reasons for not clearing this payment, please let us know."],["幸運的是我的傷口消失得很快。",""]],["famed","feimd","a. 著名的, 闻名的",["He who has skill and art, becomes famed in the world.","Yosemite National Park is famed for its waterfalls and giant sequoia trees."],["",""]],["turnout","'tә:naut","n. 聚集的人群, 出席者, 产量\\n[化] 输出; 产额",["Observers predict low turnout among a disaffected electorate squeezed by a deep economic crisis.","Algeria's elections didn't have a high voter turnout."],["",""]],["rabbi","'ræbai","n. 拉比(犹太教圣职人员), 大师(对犹太学者的尊称)\\n[法] 犹太教的法学博士, 老师, 犹太教教士",["Rabbi, you are the Son of God; you are the King of Israel.","The first female rabbi was an Aramaic-speaking Kurdish Jew."],["",""]],["twisted","'twistid","a. 扭曲的",["She twisted her ankle while she was doing exercise.","Streets are often twisted and narrow in the suburbs."],["她锻炼时扭伤了脚踝。",""]],["pharmacy","'fɑ:mәsi","n. 药房, 配药学, 制药业\\n[医] 药学, 药剂学, 调剂学, 药房",["The young chemist decided to open a pharmacy.","This afternoon I went to a pharmacy."],["年輕的藥劑師決定要開一家藥房。","今天下午我去了一趟藥妝店。"]],["inaugural","i'nɒ:gjurәl","a. 就任的, 开幕的\\nn. 就职演讲",["It was the coldest inaugural day in the nation's history.","He was invited by the President to the White House inaugural ball."],["",""]],["detainee",".di:tei'ni:","n. 被拘留者, 被扣押者\\n[法] 被扣扣者, 被拘留者",["The detainee struggled in the tight handcuffs, but the police paid him no attention."],[""]],["acceleration","әk.selә'reiʃәn","n. 加速, 促进, 加速度\\n[化] 加速度",["The modern era is a time of total acceleration. Our life is becoming more and more dynamic.","Electric motors deliver strong acceleration because they offer more torque than equivalent gasoline engines."],["",""]],["hindu","'hindu:","a. 印度教教徒的\\nn. 印度教教徒",["The concept of zero sprang from the Hindu culture.","He accepted Islam but never trashed his Hindu heritage."],["",""]],["indifference","in'difәrәns","n. 不重视, 无兴趣, 漠不关心\\n[法] 中立, 不偏袒, 不重视",["He doesn't have the indifference typical of people from big cities.","She assumed an air of indifference."],["在他身上没有大城市人的那种冷漠。","她假装不在意。"]],["shiite","'ʃi:ait","n. 什叶派教徒",["Sami is a Shiite Muslim."],[""]],["wavelength","'weivleŋθ","n. 波长\\n[化] 波长",["What Jansky had observed was the 14.6m wavelength radio wave from the Milky Way's core.","In that word is included the meaning of matching up to somebody's particular wavelength."],["",""]],["guru","'guru:","n. 古鲁(印度教导师)\\n[医] 柯拉子",["In a town near Tokyo, he spent time with a guru of origami, the traditional Japanese art of paper folding.","According to Tom, Mary is just a predatory guru who promises gain."],["",""]],["cardiac","'kɑ:diæk","n. 心脏病患者, 强心剂, 健胃药\\na. 心脏的, (胃的)贲门的",["We used emergency measures to revive the cardiac arrest patient.","A man on the treadmill suddenly collapsed and went into full cardiac arrest."],["",""]],["bill","bil","n. 帐单, 清单, 钞票, 鸟嘴, 广告, 法案, 票据\\nvt. 开帐单, (用招贴)宣布",["The bill was passed after a hard fight in the House.","Lobbyists for the bill funneled bribes into a campaign fund."],["該法案在眾議院爭議後獲得通過。","該法案的說客把遊說賄款匯入了競選基金。"]],["contingency","kәn'tindʒәnsi","n. 偶然性, 可能性, 意外事故\\n[经] 意外事故, 意外开支, 偶然事故",["The president's lack of a defined contingency plan is maladroit at best.","Contingency plans in some countries include quarantining families when any family member contracts the disease."],["",""]],["spiral","'spairәl","n. 螺旋形之物, 螺线\\na. 螺旋形的, 盘旋的\\nvi. 螺旋形下降, 螺旋形上升, 螺旋形行进\\nvt. 使螺旋形行进",["The Fibonacci spiral is found everywhere in nature.","The situation in Algeria could spiral out of control."],["",""]],["punk","pʌnk","n. 废物, 小阿飞\\na. 无用的, 腐朽的",["You're probably going to think this is a joke, but I was a punk rocker when I was a kid.","I used to be a planner, but now I'm a wreckless punk."],["",""]],["distinctly","dis'tiŋktli","adv. 显然地, 明显地, 清楚地",["Jefferson's Bible gives us a preaching Jesus of distinctly human dimensions, without miracles or resurrection.","My husband is broad-shouldered, with distinctly short arms."],["",""]],["attempted","","a. 企图的；未遂的",["Many companies have attempted to manufacture this complex component at scale, but so far only ours has succeeded.","The third point to make is that Emmet attempted to harmonize his theory with the reality of designing."],["許多公司都嘗試過大規模生產這種複雜的零件，但目前只有我們成功了。","他的第三点说明的是，埃米特试图协调现实与他的理论设计。"]],["paw","pɒ:","n. 爪\\nv. 以蹄扒地, 用爪子抓, 拼命抓, 向...乱抓, 笨拙地使用, 费力地前进",["Ziri took out of the box a kitten with a bandaged paw.","Mary was surprised to see a cat's wet paw prints in her living room."],["",""]],["whirl","hwә:l","n. 回旋, 旋转, 急走, 眩晕\\nvt. 使旋转, 使回旋, 卷走\\nvi. 回旋, 旋转, 急走, 发晕",["The whirl uprooted trees and tore roofs from homes, Dykema said.","As the flames raged, a fire whirl spun rapidly, pulling in everything close by."],["",""]],["flirt","flә:t","n. 卖弄风骚的人, 急动, 急扔\\nvt. 忽然弹出, 轻快摆动, 挥动\\nvi. 调情, 玩弄, 摆动, 轻率地对待",["What should I do if a customer tries to flirt with me?","I think Tom just likes to flirt. I'm sure he isn't serious if he says that I'm the only one for him or that he loves me."],["要是有顧客嘗試和我調情我該怎麼辦呀？",""]],["computerized","kәm'pju:tәraizd","a. 电脑的；用电脑处理的；电脑化的",["Algerian factories should be run by computerized system.","But computerized axial tomography, better known as a helical CT scan, provided doctors with far greater detail."],["",""]],["sovereign","'sɒvrin","n. 元首, 独立国\\na. 具有主权的, 至高无上的, 国王的, 完全的",["I hope for Taiwan to be a sovereign democratic country.","Zelenskyy is an elected president of a sovereign country."],["我希望台灣是主權獨立的民主國家。","澤倫斯基是一位主權國家的民選總統。"]],["plow","plau","n. 犁\\nv. 犁, 耕",["In order to get the soil ready for planting you must plow it.","At that time the snow plow was certainly our hero."],["",""]],["atrocity","ә'trɒsiti","n. 残暴, 凶恶, 暴行\\n[法] 暴行, 残酷, 残忍",["Atrocity crimes are imminent unless there is a cessation of hostilities.","It is hard to believe that humans are capable of such atrocity."],["",""]],["flutter","'flʌtә","n. 摆动, 鼓翼, 烦扰\\nvi. 摆动, 鼓翼, 烦扰\\nvt. 拍(翅), 使焦急\\n[计] 颤动",["I like it when the window is open and the curtains flutter in the breeze.","I see a tattered flag which continues to flutter in the wind."],["",""]],["incur","in'kә:","vt. 招致, 蒙受, 遭遇\\n[经] 招致, 蒙受, 担负",["He recently had the bad luck to incur his boss' wrath and got sent out to work in the boondocks.","If you are not careful, you will incur prohibitive expenses."],["",""]],["flicker","'flikә","n. 闪烁, 闪光, 颤动\\nvi. 闪动, 闪烁, 摇动, 扑动翅膀\\nvt. 使摇曳, 使闪烁",["This fluorescent lamp is starting to flicker. We'll have to replace it.","Fires for luring fish at night flicker on the silhouette of an island."],["",""]],["cooler","'ku:lә","n. 冷却器\\n[化] 冷却器",["Year by year, summer becomes warmer and winter becomes cooler.","The climate of England is not so mild as that of Japan, but in summer it is much cooler."],["夏天一年比一年熱，冬天一年比一年冷。",""]],["finn","fin","n. 芬兰人",["Many Japanese like Sweden and Finland because of Tove Jansson, the Swede-Finn writer of the Moomintroll fantasy books.","I come from Finland. I'm Finn, and I speak Finnish."],["",""]],["brag","bræg","n. 吹牛\\nv. 吹牛",["Not to brag, but I just made my first million dollars yesterday.","The urge to brag on his recent successes was irresistible."],["",""]],["hypothetical",",haipәu'θetikәl","a. 假设的, 有待证实的, 假定的, 有前提的\\n[计] 理想的",["When will the most probable hypothetical accident occur?","There is no point in theorizing about hypothetical situations that will never happen."],["最大可能假想事故什么时候会发生？",""]],["blessed","'blesid","a. 神圣的, 受祝福的\\nbless的过去式和过去分词",["It is more blessed to give than to receive.","May his life be blessed with health and happiness all through."],["赠与比接受更让人觉得幸福。",""]],["delete","di'li:t","vt. 删除\\n[计] 删除",["I wish I could figure out how to delete my Facebook account.","Delete his name from the list of the applicants."],["我希望我能知道如何刪除我的Facebook帳號。","从申请单中删除他的名字。"]],["tortilla","tɔ:'tilә","n. 玉米饼",["If I were to make a potato tortilla, I would buy two dozen eggs.","She uncovers the little plastic tortilla holder so gracefully. It's little things like that that are so cute about people."],["",""]],["plank","plæŋk","n. 厚木板, 支架, 木板制品, 冲浪板, 救急物, 政纲条目\\nvt. 在...上铺板, 撂下, 立即付款",["A heavy load is causing the plank to sag in the middle.","Sami put the plank back exactly where he found it."],["",""]],["exhausted","iɡ'zɔ:stid","a. 耗尽的；疲惫的",["Although he was exhausted, he had to keep working.","I am so exhausted because I have padded the hoof for 4 hours."],["儘管他累極了，他還得繼續工作。","走了四个小时，我觉得非常累了。"]],["postmodern","pәust'mɔdәn","a. 后现代的",["The Asian Library of my university, UBC, has a really nice postmodern architecture.","The AT&T building in New York is an example of postmodern architecture."],["",""]],["blaze","bleiz","n. 火焰, 烈火, 光辉\\nvi. 燃烧, 发光\\nvt. 使燃烧, 宣布, 在树皮上刻痕",["The firemen quickly extinguished the blaze.","She appeared to be dazzled by the sudden blaze of light."],["消防隊很快就把大火撲熄。",""]],["familiarity","fә.mili'æriti","n. 熟悉, 精通, 亲密",["On the one hand he is kind to everyone, but on the other hand he never behaves with too much familiarity.","Intelligence is our ability to begin understanding (or adapting to) new information, regardless of past familiarity."],["",""]],["physiological",".fiziә'lɒdʒikl","a. 生理学的, 生理学上的, 生理机能的\\n[医] 生理学的, 生理的",["My attitude to the comma is physiological; the more breath I have, the fewer commas I use.","Adaptogens are used in herbal medicine for the purported stabilization of physiological processes and promotion of homeostasis."],["",""]],["carpenter","'kɑ:pintә","n. 木匠",["The carpenter brought his tools along.","Abraham Lincoln's father was a carpenter by trade."],["木匠帶了工具。",""]],["glamorous","'glæmәrәs","a. 富有魅力的, 迷人的",["Mary earns a lot of money and has a glamorous lifestyle.","Any girl can look glamorous. All you have to do is stand still and look stupid."],["",""]],["slate","sleit","n. 板岩, 页岩, 提名名单, 人选, 记录, 石板\\na. 石板色的\\nvt. 铺石板, 责骂, 痛打",["After getting downsized he started off on a clean slate and started a business working out of a home office.","Let's scrap everything and start again with a clean slate."],["",""]],["relaxation",".ri:læk'seiʃәn","n. 松弛, 放松, 减轻, 缓和, 休息, 休养\\n[化] 松弛; 驰豫",["It's only very recently that our family farm has become a place of rest and relaxation. Just a few short years ago, it was our full-time job.","All in all, I think my hobbies are balanced; they bring some relaxation to my life, and at the same time bring focus to my studies."],["我們的家族農場成為休閒放鬆的地方，其實是近期的事。就在短短幾年前，這裡還是我們全職工作的地方。","大体上，我认为我的爱好很均衡，它们给我的生活带来轻松，并同时为我学习带来更集中的精力。"]],["souvenir",".su:vә'niә","n. 纪念品",["This will be a good souvenir of my trip around the United States.","Is there a souvenir shop in the hotel?"],["这将是我环绕美国旅行中一个很好的纪念品。","旅館裡面有紀念品商店嗎?"]],["narrowly","'nærәuli","adv. 狭窄地, 严密地, 仔细地, 几乎不, 勉强地, 仅仅",["That was so dangerous! Fortunately, I narrowly escaped a disaster.","The old man narrowly escaped being run over by a car."],["好险啊，还好侥幸逃过一劫。",""]],["successive","sәk'sesiv","a. 继承的, 连续的\\n[经] 接续承运人; 连续的",["I went there by myself, often on successive evenings.","Today's land problems are the product of years of neglect by successive governments."],["",""]],["conversely","'kɔnv\\\\\\\\:sli","adv. 相反, 逆, 颠倒, 反题, 反",["If you think it's a good idea, you should participate. Conversely, if you think it's a bad idea, you should let him know.","Conversely, hard-pressed refugees talk of discrimination, exploitation by landlords and even greater abuses flowing from local resentment."],["",""]],["disciple","di'saipl","n. 弟子, 门徒",["It goes without saying that at that time a kind of friendship beyond master and disciple grew between the two of them.","You are his disciple, but we are disciples of Moses."],["",""]],["biscuit","'biskit","n. 饼干\\n[化] 素坯; 饼干",["\"Mum, can I have a biscuit?\" \"No, you shouldn't eat between meals.\"","Someone has eaten all the biscuits from the biscuit barrel."],["\"妈妈，我能吃一块饼干吗？\" \"不行，不该在3餐间吃。\"",""]],["angrily","'æŋgrili","adv. 愤怒地",["Angrily, he stomped on the puddle, splashing mud everywhere.","Due to differing opinions between the two, they argued angrily, before leaving unhappily."],["他憤怒地踐踏水坑，弄得泥水四濺。","这两个人因意见不合，而争得面红耳赤不欢而散。"]],["benchmark","","[计] 基准程序; 基准",["The Federal Reserve cut its benchmark discount rate to an 18-year low.","Without a good benchmark, it's hard to tell which software is faster."],["",""]],["lousy","'lauzi","a. 污秽的, 恶心的, 生虱的",["That's the thing about people who think they hate computers. What they really hate is lousy programmers.","I expect it's his lousy personality that drives off the ladies."],["那些自认为讨厌电脑的人就是这么回事。他们真正讨厌的是差劲的程序员。",""]],["monastery","'mɒnәstәri","n. 修道院, 僧侣",["I'd rather live in a monastery with Internet access.","Saint Catherine's Monastery is the repository of some of the world's oldest icons and illuminated manuscripts."],["",""]],["sniper","'snaipә","n. 狙击兵",["Ziri began looking around to try and find where the sniper was.","I tracked down the enemy through the sniper scope."],["",""]],["headlight","'hedlait","n. 前灯, 桅灯\\n[电] 车前灯",["Tom pointed to the broken headlight.","Yanni's car has only one headlight working."],["",""]],["backlash","'bæklæʃ","n. 后冲, 强烈反对\\n[电] 反撞, 逆栅流",["Mennad was afraid of the backlash he was going to get.","The banning of trans women from women's chess, of all sports, exemplifies the insanity of the current transphobic backlash."],["",""]],["bakery","'beikәri","n. 面包店",["I'm going to the bakery now. Do you want anything?","The girl who works at the bakery is cute."],["我现在要去面包店了。你想要什么吗？","在面包房工作的姑娘很可爱。"]],["vet","vet","n. 兽医\\nvi. 当兽医\\nvt. 诊断, 检审",["This beef is so rare that a good vet could save it.","While Tom waited outside, the vet performed a four hour surgery on Mary's cat."],["",""]],["intern","in'tә:n","n. 实习生, 被拘留者\\nvi. 作实习医师(教师、实习生)\\nvt. 拘留, 扣留",["Tomorrow we will welcome the first intern.","The intern died after working for 72 hours without sleep."],["明天我們將迎來第一個實習生。",""]],["divorced","","a. 离婚的",["Tom is divorced and has a daughter.","Tom didn't tell me he'd gotten divorced."],["Tom離婚了，他有個女兒。","湯姆沒跟我說他離婚了。"]],["consortium","kәn'sɒ:tjәm","n. 协会, 合伙, (国际性)财团\\n[经] 合作, 联合, 财团",["This consortium has thirteen members."],[""]],["hesitation",".hezi'teiʃәn","n. 犹豫, 踌躇, 含糊, 口吃, 暂停\\n[计] 暂停",["Without the slightest hesitation, he sold his own car.","In real combat, you must not forget that hesitation is a very dangerous thing."],["他毫不犹豫地把自己的车卖了。","在实战中，你要知道三心二意是很危险的。"]],["apron","'eiprәn","n. 围裙\\n[医] 围裙",["Mary tied an apron around her waist and then took the turkey out of the oven.","Mother is in the kitchen wearing an apron."],["玛丽把围裙系在她的腰上，然后把火鸡从烤箱里拿出来了。","妈妈在厨房里围着围裙。"]],["nostalgia","nɒs'tældʒiә","n. 乡愁, 向往过去, 怀旧之情\\n[医] 怀乡病",["Tom loves the nostalgia of listening to hit songs from his youth.","Tom was overwhelmed with nostalgia when he went back to visit his old school fifty years after he had graduated from it."],["",""]],["accordance","ә'kɒ:dәns","n. 一致, 和谐",["If someone wants the ceremony to be held in accordance with Japanese Shinto ritual, then that is possible at this church.","I will sell the boat in accordance with your orders."],["",""]],["coyote","'kɒiәut","n. 丛林狼, 讨厌的家伙",["The coyote lived off of coffee shop scones and neighbor cats.","Native American Indians considered the coyote to be the Creator's Messenger on Earth, teaching people how to live."],["",""]],["uneven",".ʌn'i:vәn","a. 不平坦的, 不均等的, 奇数的",["The tamborim lends a very slightly uneven and highly distinctive 16th note groove to samba music.","Grass is growing unchecked between the uneven paving slabs."],["",""]],["thunder","'θʌndә","n. 雷, 雷声\\nvi. 打雷, 轰隆地响, 怒喝\\nvt. 大声喊出, 轰隆地发出",["It is because light travels faster than sound that we see lightning before we hear thunder.","Are you afraid of nights with thunder and lightning?"],["光傳播得比聲音快，所以我們先看到閃電，然後才會聽見雷聲。","妳怕不怕雷電交加的夜晚？"]],["waterfall","'wɒtәfɒ:l","n. 瀑布",["Zimbabwe is home to the largest waterfall in the world.","If you exercise during the height of summer, you'll be dripping sweat like a waterfall."],["",""]],["preclude","pri'klu:d","vt. 预先排除, 预防, 阻止, 妨碍\\n[法] 预防, 排除, 消除",["The fact that she's old enough to be your mother does not preclude her from being your friend.","You can be both kind and firm. One does not preclude the other."],["",""]],["litter","'litә","n. 垃圾, 杂乱, 轿, 担架\\nvt. 乱丢, 铺草, 弄乱\\nvi. 产仔, 乱丢垃圾",["A lot of people climb the railing, and even litter.","These days you can't walk down the street without seeing people dropping litter."],["很多人跳過欄杆，還丟垃圾。",""]],["automated","","a. 自动化的；机械化的",["This is an automated payphone; you use it by inserting a coin.","Each day our life becomes more comfortable and more automated."],["这是自动投币电话，用一元硬币来打的。","我们的生活日益变得更舒适更自动化。"]],["exquisite","'ekskwizit","a. 精致的, 细腻的, 敏锐的",["The tourists were fascinated with the exquisite scenery.","Everyone loves an exquisite turn of phrase. And he seems to have the knack of finding exactly the right words for any occasion."],["觀光客被獨特的景致所吸引。",""]],["immerse","i'mә:s","vt. 沉浸, 使陷入\\n[医] 浸[入]",["You need to immerse yourself into their culture to master their language.","You have to immerse yourself in the culture to learn the language."],["",""]],["petroleum","pә'trәuliәm","n. 石油\\n[化] 石油",["The present world owes its convenient life to petroleum.","The ecologist warned us that petroleum was not merely a blessing but also a curse."],["",""]],["infected","in'fektid","a. 被感染的\\n[计] 被感染的",["My computer has already been infected with the BraveSentry virus.","In short, it is because the 'plan.doc' file I attached in the previous email was infected with a virus."],["我的電腦已經中了BraveSentry病毒。","簡單來說，就是因為我附在上一封電郵的「plan.doc」檔案被電腦病毒感染了。"]],["bodyguard","'bɒdigɑ:d","n. 保镖, 护卫",["The bodyguard was wearing an earpiece.","Sami was fortunate to have the protection of a dedicated bodyguard."],["保镖戴着耳机。",""]],["thug","θʌg","n. 恶棍, 刺客, 凶手\\n[法] 凶手, 刺客, 暴徒",["The small thug beat up the convenience store employee.","Tom didn't choose the thug life, the thug life chose him."],["",""]],["initiation","i.niʃi'eiʃәn","n. 开始, 指引, 入会\\n[化] 引发",["Many sects have initiation rituals for new members.","Tom hoped the initiation ceremony would be over soon."],["",""]],["preheat","pri:'hi:t","vt. 预热\\n[机] 预热",["With some dishes, if you don't preheat the oven, your dish won't turn out right.","Be sure to preheat the water before adding the pasta."],["",""]],["misunderstanding",".misʌndә'stændiŋ","n. 误会, 误解\\n[法] 误解, 误会, 不和",["Their quarrel sprang from misunderstanding.","It's all just a big misunderstanding."],["他們的爭吵因誤解而起。","这只不过全是个大误会而已。"]],["mustache","'mʌstæʃ","n. 髭, 胡子",["Kissing a man without a mustache is like eating eggs without salt.","A kiss without a mustache is like a bowl of soup with no salt."],["",""]],["swap","swɒp","n. 以货易货\\nv. 交换, 替换, 交易\\n[计] 交换",["COVID-19 has caused a bike boom in the city as thousands of Big Apple residents swap their cars and subways for two wheels.","We have no other alternative but to swap horses midstream and inject a fresh atmosphere and new ideas into our organization."],["",""]],["consciously","","adv. 自觉地；有意识地",["Translators often tend, consciously or not, to \"explain\" a text by making it more logical than the original.","I consciously say \"Russia's\" and not \"Russian\" when I'm talking about the state of Russia and not about the Russian people."],["",""]],["aura","'ɒ:rә","n. 气氛, 气味\\n[医] 先兆",["She was an intelligent woman with an erotic aura.","E-eh? I somehow seem to feel a very threatening aura..."],["她是一個有著性愛光環的聰明女人。",""]],["sic","sik","adv. 原文如此",["If you don't leave, I'll sic my dogs on you.","If you trespass on his property, he'll sic his dogs on you."],["如果你不离开，我就放狗出来咬你。",""]],["competitiveness","","[经] 竞争",["Japan's competitiveness in camera making is unchallenged.","Japan's competitiveness is very strong in industrial products, but weak in agricultural products."],["",""]],["honeymoon","'hʌnimu:n","n. 蜜月, 蜜月假期\\nvi. 渡蜜月",["More and more couples go on honeymoon trips abroad.","Tom and Mary went on a two week honeymoon to Hawaii."],["越来越多的情侣出国度蜜月。","湯姆和瑪麗去夏威夷度蜜月，度了兩個星期。"]],["jealousy","'dʒelәsi","n. 妒忌, 猜忌, 羡慕\\n[法] 妒忌, 嫉妒, 猜忌",["Love is blind, but jealousy can see things which don't even exist.","Love is blind, but jealousy can see things which aren't even there."],["爱是盲目的，但是嫉妒却可以看到即使并不存在的东西。","爱是盲目的，但是嫉妒却可以看到即使并不存在的东西。"]],["flap","flæp","n. 飘, 摆动, 拍打, 拍打声, 片状垂悬物\\nv. 拍打, 鼓翼而飞, 飘动",["Whales flap their tails up and down and sharks from side to side.","The voiced retroflex flap appears as a phoneme in Bengali."],["",""]],["submission","sәb'miʃәn","n. 屈服, 服从, 谦恭, 呈递, 提交, 意见\\n[经] 提交, 提出, 提交公断",["We have the alternative of death and submission.","Please include a self-addressed, stamped envelope with your submission."],["我們要選擇是死亡還是臣服。",""]],["cadet","kә'det","n. 军官学校学生\\n[法] 军校学生",["When I was a cadet, I had no idea what I was getting myself into joining the army.","The officer told the cadet to get back to work."],["",""]],["drastic","'dræstik","a. 激烈的\\n[医] 峻泻药, 剧烈的",["The invention of TV caused a drastic change in our daily life.","Without a moment's hesitation, they took drastic action against the conspiracy."],["電視的發明為我們的生活模式帶來了巨大的變化。",""]],["chilling","'tʃiliŋ","[计] 冷却, 致冷",["Sami recounted the details of his crimes with a chilling lack of emotion.","Sami and Layla were just chilling at the bus stop."],["",""]],["farewell","'fєә'wel","n. 辞别, 再见, 再会\\ninterj. 再会",["I got a farewell present from everyone.","A farewell party was held for Mr. Jones."],["每個人都送了我一份歡送禮物。","舉行了一場歡送會以紀念瓊斯先生。"]],["woe","wәu","n. 悲哀, 悲痛, 苦痛",["Woe betide the child who speaks correct English; he will be the laughing-stock of his classmates.","Woe to who be alone, my friends. It seems that social isolation quickly destroys one's reason."],["",""]],["ripple","'ripl","n. 涟波, 涟漪, 波纹, 粗钢梳\\nvt. 使起涟漪\\nvi. 起微波, 起潺潺声",["Adriano watched the wind make the grass ripple like waves.","A single act of kindness can ripple through countless lives."],["",""]],["cookbook","'kukbuk","n. 食谱",["The girl reading a cookbook is Kate.","The cookbook was filled with delicious recipes that Matthew couldn't wait to try out."],["正在读烹饪书的女孩是凯特。",""]],["striped","straipt","a. 有斑纹的",["I would like to try the blue striped skirt.","Off the coast of New England, fishermen have caught too many striped bass and blue crabs."],["我想试一下那条蓝色条纹裙。",""]],["patriotism","'peitriәtizm","n. 爱国心, 爱国精神, 爱国主义",["Whether by a Hitler salute or a hand on your heart, I consider the expression of patriotism to be the symptoms of a disease, whose cause and cure should be more closely studied.","Does any other country fan the flames of patriotism as much as America?"],["無論通過行納粹禮還是將手放在胸前，我認為這種愛國主義的表現是一種病的症狀，而病因和治療方法有待進一步研究。","有没有一个国家比美国更提倡爱国主义？"]],["eighteenth","ei'ti:nθ","num. 第十八, 十八分之一",["My home is on the eighteenth floor, and both the master bedroom and the living room face south.","In the late eighteenth century, a passport for an American was usually signed by the President of the United States."],["我家在十八层，主卧和客厅都面朝南方。",""]],["disciplinary","'disiplinәri","a. 训练的, 纪律的, 训诫的\\n[法] 纪律的, 惩戒性的",["Acts of violence will not be tolerated and will be responded to with appropriate disciplinary action.","As is to be expected as part of the disciplinary action Tanaka received, his bonus was decreased."],["",""]],["advent","'ædvәnt","n. 来到, 来临",["Carriages gradually disappeared with the advent of the motorcar.","The advent of indoor tanning salons now allows Canadians to sport a sun-kissed look all year round."],["",""]],["softball","'sɒftbɒ:l","n. 垒球运动, 垒球",["In softball, the ball is pitched underhand.","In softball, the ball is pitched underhanded."],["",""]],["imbalance","im'bælәns","n. 不平衡, 不均衡\\n[医] 不平衡, 失调",["The trade imbalance between two nations should be improved.","Belize faces continued pressure from rising sovereign debt and a growing trade imbalance."],["",""]],["moderately","'mɒdәrәtli","adv. 适当地, 适度地, 中庸地",["The most dangerous untruths are truths moderately distorted.","This is moderately spicy, but it does get your juices flowing."],["",""]],["broadcaster","'brɒ:dkæstә","n. 播送者, 广播装置, 播种机",["I saw it in a documentary produced by NHK, Japan's public broadcaster.","The broadcaster made edits to the television schedule."],["",""]],["poker","'pәukә","n. 戳的人, 拨火棍, 纸牌戏\\nvt. 烙制",["Don't, under any circumstances, play poker with Tom.","Don't sit here if you're not going to play poker with us."],["无论怎样都不要和汤姆玩扑克。","不跟我们玩扑克就不要坐在这里。"]],["seam","si:m","n. 缝合线, 衔接口, 接缝, 线缝, 伤疤\\nvt. 缝合, 接合, 焊合, 使留下伤痕\\nvi. 裂开, 发生裂痕",["In order to fix this mistake we'll have to tear out this seam.","The mid-ocean range stretches around the globe like the seam of a baseball."],["",""]],["alienate","'eiljәneit","vt. 使疏远, 离间, 转让\\n[法] 转让, 让与, 疏远",["In order to conquer the centre, we'll have to alienate the left wing of the party.","With that attitude, you will alienate all of your potential allies."],["",""]],["dolphin","'dɒlfin","n. 海豚",["The dolphin and trainer communicated much better than we expected.","The dolphin is a very intelligent animal."],["海豚和驯养员交流得比我们所期望的好得多。","海豚是十分聰明的動物。"]],["restructure","ri:'strʌktʃә","vt. 更改结构, 重建, 调整",["If we don't restructure our business, we're going to go under.","Algeria needs to restructure its economy."],["",""]],["sting","stiŋ","n. 叮, 刺痛, 刺激, 讽刺\\nvt. 叮, 刺痛, 刺激, 使苦恼\\nvi. 叮, 刺痛",["The bar was so smoky that my eyes started to sting.","It could mean that this experience was so raw that even tenderness would sting like hell."],["",""]],["shortcoming","'ʃɒ:t'kʌmiŋ","n. 缺点, 短处",["It is difficult to overcome this shortcoming without drastically changing the whole system.","The greatest shortcoming of the human race is our inability to understand the exponential function."],["",""]],["sandal","'sændl","n. 凉鞋, 拖鞋, 檀香木\\nvt. 穿以便鞋",["Her dainty feet were sandal-clad, while her head remained bare of covering other than her silken tresses.","The boy lost his sandal in the field."],["",""]],["exhaustion","ig'zɒ:stʃәn","n. 抽空, 耗尽, 疲惫, 筋疲力尽\\n[化] 抽空",["A sailor saw his fellow sailor sink from exhaustion.","Triathlete Julie Moss is a portrait of the power of human spirit and true dedication, even in the face of pain and exhaustion."],["",""]],["longing","'lɒŋiŋ","n. 渴望, 热望, 憧憬\\na. 渴望的, 热望的",["All of the longing and wishes for good fortune are wrapped up in the fragile skin of the dumplings.","In literary works, night-blooming jasmine is often used to symbolize longing and tenderness."],["所有的思念与祝福都包进了那薄薄的饺子皮里。","文學作品中常用夜來香來象徵思念與柔情。"]],["booster","'bu:stә","n. 向前推的人, 支持者, 后援者, 升压器\\n[化] 爆管; 扩爆药; 传爆药; 升压机; 增压装置; 升压器; 助促进剂",["You should get a tetanus booster shot once every ten years.","The immunity from vaccines can wear off, which means booster vaccines might be needed."],["",""]],["indoors","'in'dɒ:z","adv. 在户内",["Since my boyfriend is more of an indoors person, I didn't go to the beach, nor to the mountains this summer.","When I was a child, I spent most of my time indoors reading."],["由於男友不喜歡出門，所以今年夏天我既沒去海邊，也沒去山區。","当我是个孩子的时候，我会把大部分时间都用于室内阅读。"]],["idle","'aidl","a. 懒惰的, 闲散的, 停顿的, 空闲的, 无用的\\nvi. 无所事事, 闲散, 浪费, 空转\\nvt. 虚度, 使闲散, 使空转\\nn…",["No matter how rich a man may be, he ought not to be idle.","I spent idle days during the vacation."],["無論一個男人多有錢，都不應無所事事。","假期里，我度过了悠闲的日子。"]],["kurd","kuәd","n. 库尔德人",["The \"Grey Wolves\" are a Turkish ultranationalist, neofascist, anti-Kurd movement that denies the genocide of the Armenian people.","Though Tom isn't a Kurd, he speaks fluent Kurdish."],["",""]],["ubiquitous","ju:'bikwitәs","a. 无所不在的, 到处存在的, 普遍存在的",["The fridge was covered in the kid's artwork, an entire gallery of crayons, kraft paper and ubiquitous glitter.","In the shantytowns of Africa and India, many people have smartphones. Advanced technology is ubiquitous."],["",""]],["carved","","a. 有雕刻的",["The statue was carved from a block of cherry wood.","He carved a Buddha statue from wood."],["这座雕像是由樱木雕刻而成。","他用一块木头刻出一尊佛像。"]],["pinpoint","'pinpɒint","n. 极小之物, 针尖, 立锥之地, 精确位置\\nvt. 精确地找到, 准确地轰炸, 刺穿, 准确描述, 使突出, 强调\\na. 针尖的,…",["A GPS device can pinpoint your location anywhere in the world.","She knew he was sad, but she couldn't pinpoint the reason why."],["無論你在世界的哪一個角落，你都可以使用全球定位儀來找出你的所在。",""]],["swimmer","'swimә","n. 游泳者",["It is true Wendy grew up at the seaside, but she isn't a good swimmer.","According to the coach, Bob is a good swimmer."],["溫迪的確是在海邊長大的，但是她卻不太會游泳。","教練說，鮑伯游泳游得很好。"]],["scenery","'si:nәri","n. 风景, 景色, 舞台布景",["The tourists were fascinated with the exquisite scenery.","Tom and Mary admired the scenery as they held hands."],["觀光客被獨特的景致所吸引。","汤姆和玛丽手牵着手，一起欣赏风景。"]],["mince","mins","n. 切碎物\\nvt. 切碎, 矫揉做作地说\\nvi. 碎步走, 装腔作势",["Not to mince matters, I don't want you to come to our party.","In Britain, mince pies are traditionally eaten at Christmas time."],["",""]],["glamour","'glæmә","n. 魅力, 迷人的美, 魔法\\nvt. 迷惑",["Being a movie star, she was used to a life of glitz and glamour.","If someone talks about the \"glitz and glamour\" of a party, the guests clothes were probably pretty flashy."],["",""]],["pivotal","'pivәtәl","a. 枢轴的, 关键的, 起中心作用的",["Tom played a pivotal role in the company's growth.","Tom played a pivotal role in the company's success."],["",""]],["cosmos","'kɔzmɔs","n. 宇宙, 秩序, 和谐, 大波斯菊\\n[医] 大波斯菊",["The telescope has opened a new eye onto the cosmos that has been transformative for our civilization.","To date nobody knows the actual size of the cosmos."],["望远镜为我们的文明开启了一种全新的视角来观察宇宙。","宇宙的實際大小至今無人知道。"]],["haze","heiz","n. 薄雾, 阴霾, 疑惑\\nvt. 使变朦胧, 使变糊涂\\nvi. 变朦胧, 变糊涂",["The heat haze made the road shimmer in the distance.","Because of the dense haze, the road was hard to see."],["",""]],["anatomy","ә'nætәmi","n. 剖析, 解剖学, 骨骼, 结构\\n[医] 解剖学, 解剖",["She studied the bat's anatomy for her biology project.","Dan didn't even take basic anatomy classes."],["她為了完成生物學作業，研究了蝙蝠的解剖構造。","丹甚至没有上过基础解剖课。"]],["liberalism","'libәrәlizm","n. 自由主义",["Liberalism has a different approach to international relations.","Secular liberalism is the final religion, though its church is not of the other world but of this."],["自由主义对国际关系有不同的处理方式。",""]],["dissent","di'sent","n. 异议\\nvi. 持异议, 不同意",["Within the rape crisis movement, Greensite's dissent is significant.","My government continues to treat dissent as defection."],["",""]],["scenic","'si:nik","a. 风景好的, 戏剧性的, 舞台的, 布景的\\nn. 风光影片, 风景照片",["This place is famous for its scenic beauty.","Switzerland is famous for its scenic beauty."],["这个地方以风景优美闻名。","瑞士以它的風景優美而聞名。"]],["solitude","'sɒlitju:d","n. 孤独, 单独, 孤寂",["He likes to spend some time in solitude every day.","We shouldn't confuse solitude with isolation. They are two separate things."],["他喜歡每天都享受一下一個人的時間。",""]],["cinema","'sinәmә","n. 电影院, 电影",["To prevent them from being pirated, some of his films were never shown at the cinema.","The concert ticket costs more than the cinema ticket."],["为了防止盗版，他有些电影从未在影院上映。","演唱会门票比电影票贵。"]],["ragged","'rægid","a. 衣衫褴褛的, 参差不齐的, 不协调的, 粗糙的, 刺耳的",["It was a boy dressed in ragged velveteen breeches, and thin discoloured shirt.","I should have been a pair of ragged claws, scuttling across the floors of silent seas."],["",""]],["drunken","'drʌŋkәn","a. 酒醉的",["A drunken man was sleeping on the bench.","The policeman arrested him for drunken driving."],["一個醉了的男人在長椅上睡觉。","警察因酒後駕駛逮捕了他。"]],["celery","'selәri","n. 芹菜\\n[医] 芹菜, 糖蒿",["Tableland vegetables are grown here, such as lettuce, cabbage, and celery.","In this soup there are carrots, onions, parsley, celery and potatoes."],["這裡種植有生菜、高麗菜和芹菜等高原蔬菜。","這個湯裏有胡蘿蔔、洋蔥、歐芹、芹菜和土豆。"]],["courageous","kә'reidʒәs","a. 勇敢的, 大胆的, 有胆量的",["I felt profound reverence for the courageous mother.","The strikers hectored the few scabs courageous enough to cross the picket line."],["",""]],["sculptor","'skʌlptә","n. 雕刻家",["Google commemorated the African Turkish sculptor Kuzgun Acar with a Doodle.","A sculptor made a sculpture that looks like a person."],["",""]],["lavender","'lævindә","n. 熏衣草, 淡紫色\\na. 淡紫色的\\nvt. 用熏衣草熏",["All sorts of toilet luxuries were at hand, pretty coloured soaps, loofahs, lavender-water, ammonia, violet powder, violet scent.","Bloom is a light pink pony with lavender eyes and a lavender mane and tail that are styled in a similar manner to aurora hair."],["",""]],["disconnect",".diskә'nekt","vt. 使分离, 使不相连, 拆开\\nvi. 断开\\n[计] 断开",["Disconnect the power cable from the modem, wait for approximately one minute, then reconnect the cable.","Son, let's disconnect from screens and connect with nature on a camping trip."],["",""]],["fragrance","'freigrәns","n. 芬芳, 香味",["I like to add a couple pods of star anise when cooking rice. It has a slightly sweet flavor and a licorice-like fragrance.","This flower gives off a strong fragrance."],["我喜歡煮飯時加幾粒八角。它帶有淡淡的甜味和類似甘草的香氣。","这朵花散发出强烈的香味。"]],["luckily","'lʌkili","adv. 幸运地, 幸亏, 侥幸",["I got to the bank and luckily didn't have to get in line.","Luckily he had enough money to pay the bill."],["我到銀行去，很幸運地不必排隊。","幸运的是他有足够的钱来付账。"]],["gleaming","ˈgli:mɪŋ","a. 闪闪发光的\\nv. （使）闪烁, （使）闪亮( gleam的现在分词 )",["The lake was gleaming in the bright sunshine.","Holmes sat in a great, old-fashioned chair, his inexorable eyes gleaming out of his haggard face."],["湖水在耀眼的陽光下閃閃發亮。",""]],["authenticity",".ɒ:θen'tisiti","n. 可靠性, 真实性\\n[经] 确实性, 真实性",["Tom has never ever questioned the authenticity of television.","Western attitudes towards \"authenticity\" often reproduce stereotypes."],["",""]],["inch","intʃ","n. 英寸, 身高, 小岛\\nvi. 慢慢前进, 慢慢移动\\nvt. 使缓慢地移动",["Give him an inch and he'll take a yard.","We waded into the cold water inch by inch."],["得寸进尺。","我們一步一步地踏進了冰冷的水裏。"]],["converge","kәn'vә:dʒ","vi. 聚合, 集中于一点\\nvt. 使集合",["Why do physicists converge? Because they're monotonous and narrow.","One must wait for the residuals to converge before being able to use the simulation's results."],["",""]],["trivial","'tiviәl","a. 琐碎的, 不重要的, 轻微的, 平常的",["Forget it, those are just trivial details.","What's amazing about sports fans is the intensity of the rage they can feel toward something trivial."],["別想了，那不過是些無關緊要的細節。",""]],["porcelain","'pɒ:slin","n. 瓷器, 瓷\\na. 瓷制的",["Nowadays, almost everyone has a modern bean-to-cup coffee maker, but we are still using a porcelain coffee filter.","The flawless porcelain-like complexion that graces Caifeng's face is a testament to the beauty of Asian skin."],["",""]],["designation",".dezig'neiʃәn","n. 指示, 指定, 命名\\n[电] 指定",["The leader will be whoever decides to accept the designation.","They do not preach by name or designation."],["",""]],["syrian","'siriәn","n. 叙利亚人, 叙利亚语\\na. 叙利亚语的, 叙利亚人的",["Chancellor Merkel said that all Syrian migrants would be allowed to come to Germany and apply for asylum.","There appears to be no end in sight for the Syrian conflict."],["",""]],["scanner","'skænә","n. 扫描仪, 扫描盘, 审视者\\n[计] 扫描器; 词法分析程序; 扫描程序; 扫视程序",["A scanner allowed one to determine if one's leg was really broken.","With a 3D scanner it is possible to scan three-dimensional objects."],["",""]],["pricing","'praisiŋ","[经] 定价, 标价",["I'd like to discuss pricing with you.","The service is also part of a comprehensive subscription plan, allowing users to choose the pricing and features that best fit individual and family needs."],["我想和你谈谈价钱。","此服務亦包含於綜合訂閱方案中，使用者可依個人或家庭方案選擇適合的價格與內容。"]],["deception","di'sepʃәn","n. 欺骗, 诡计\\n[法] 瞒骗, 诈欺, 欺骗",["Jugurtha was betrayed with a crude act of deception.","Conscience is sorrow. Intelligence is deception. Only on the outskirts of life can one plant a little illusion."],["",""]],["expanse","ik'spæns","n. 宽阔区域, 宽阔, 天空",["Soon, the expanse of the galaxy became reminiscent of ancient Polynesian migrational waves throughout the Pacific Ocean.","The night was calm, the sea a vast expanse of black."],["",""]],["inventor","in'ventә","n. 发明家\\n[法] 发明人, 发明家, 创造者",["Yes, he is an inventor, if I understood correctly.","B. Franklin was an American statesman and inventor."],["",""]],["reinvent",".ri:in'vent","vt. 重新使用；彻底改造；重复发明（在不知他人已发明的情况下）",["The encounter ignited a flame that propelled her to reinvent herself.","The party must reinvent itself after this election defeat."],["",""]],["fines","fainz","n. 细骨料；粉末；罚款（fine的复数）",["I've paid parking fines a number of times myself.","The city is cracking down on drunk drivers and giving them fines."],["我自己也因違例泊車而被罰了許多次款。",""]],["buzz","bʌz","n. 嗡嗡声, 流言\\nvi. 发出嗡嗡声, 说闲话\\nvt. 使嗡嗡叫, 散布",["I'm getting a bit of a nicotine buzz.","I would appreciate it if you could give me some alone time and just buzz off."],["我有點醉菸。",""]],["boxer","'bɒksә","n. 拳师",["She likes wearing boxer briefs, she doesn't like briefs, and also doesn't like thongs.","The boxer was hit on the chin and went down for the count."],["她喜歡穿平角內褲，不喜歡穿三角的，也不喜歡穿丁字褲。",""]],["famine","'fæmin","n. 饥荒, 缺乏, 饥饿",["The prospect of famine hangs over many areas of the world.","Because of the famine, the cattle starved to death."],["",""]],["systemic","si'stemik","a. 系统的, 体系的, 全身的\\n[医] 系统的, 全身的",["Systemic diseases are those that affect the entire organism.","The European crisis is a systemic problem, which can only be solved through common action of all EU states."],["",""]],["socket","'sɒkit","n. 窝, 穴, 插座, 眼窝\\nvt. 插进插座\\n[计] 套接字",["The eye socket is the bone receptacle in which the eye fits.","Sami threw the ball so hard he almost pulled his shoulder out of its socket."],["",""]],["gourmet","'guәmei","n. 美食家",["Tom's partner thought that they should also sell gourmet popcorn seasonings.","I plan wedding receptions in a historic mansion with gourmet cuisine."],["",""]],["clump","klʌmp","n. 丛, 块, 笨重的脚步声\\n[计] 丛",["Particles in the disk clump together, forming planetesimals, which then collide with each other, building up to form the planets.","Benedito raised an eyebrow as his billy goat sniffed curiously at a clump of rocks."],["",""]],["subdivision",".sʌbdi'viʒәn","n. 细分, 分部\\n[医] 再分; 亚门",["The subdivision allowed Tom to build a second house on his property.","The houses in that subdivision are all alike."],["",""]],["eerie","'iәri","a. 怪诞的, 可怕的, 奇异的, 令人迷惑不解的",["The eerie silence struck terror into their hearts.","The snow on Lulu Island seems eerie and unearthly."],["",""]],["cycling","'saikliŋ","n. 骑脚踏车兜风, 骑脚踏车消遣\\n[机] 循环操作",["You may go cycling if it doesn't rain.","That young man is very keen on cycling."],["如果不下雨的話，你可以去踏單車。","那年轻人很喜欢骑自行车。"]],["nebula","'nebjulә","n. 星云, 角膜云翳\\n[医] 薄翳; 角膜翳, 角膜云翳; 喷雾剂",["A nebula is an interstellar cloud of dust, hydrogen, helium and other ionized gases.","We don't yet know which stars were formed in the same nebula as our sun."],["",""]],["arrogance","'ærәgәns","n. 傲慢态度, 自大",["I lost my temper with him because of his arrogance.","Arrogance leads to a person's downfall."],["我为他傲慢自大对他发火。","骄傲使人落后。"]],["aquatic","ә'kwætik","n. 水生动物, 水生植物\\na. 水生的, 水中的, 水上的",["The freshwater ecosystem includes rivers, lakes, and streams, and is home to many aquatic organisms.","The otter has the long body of many mustelids, but is specialized for aquatic life."],["",""]],["disappoint",".disә'pɒint","vt. 使失望",["Tom didn't want to disappoint Mary.","Don't disappoint me the way you did the other day."],["汤姆不想让玛丽失望。",""]],["lighter","'laitә","n. 点火者, 点灯工人, 打火机, 驳船\\nvt. 以驳船搬运",["Women eat lighter meals when they're eating with a guy.","Sir, you have left your lighter on the table."],["當女性跟一個男人吃飯時，女性會吃得比較少。","先生，您把您的打火机留在桌子上了。"]],["harden","hɑ:dn","vt. 使变硬, 使坚强, 使冷酷\\nvi. 变硬, 变冷酷",["And so the method that works is treading down the snow to harden it, making blocks and piling them up.","The Kabyle people are resilient; when they want, they harden more than granite."],["",""]],["liaison","li:'eizɒn","n. 联络",["Mary is a Foreign Affairs Liaison who works for the State Department.","Administrators need to establish a close liaison with employees."],["",""]],["colon","'kәulәn","n. 冒号, 结肠\\n[医] 结肠",["The French are a really strange people: every other person who reads this sentence will check if the space before the colon is really thin and non-breaking.","In my language, the \",\" is called comma, the \";\" is called semicolon, \":\" is called colon, \"...\" are called ellipsis, and this sentence ends with a period."],["",""]],["cassette","kæ'set","n. 盒式磁带, 珠宝箱, 暗盒\\n[计] 字盒",["I got a video cassette recorder cheap at that shop.","My cassette tape recorder needs fixing."],["我在那商店花低價買了臺錄像機。","我的磁带录音机需要维修。"]],["directory","di'rektәri","n. 目录, 工商名录, 指南\\n[计] 目录",["I looked up his telephone number in a telephone directory.","No, I don't. You had better look it up in a telephone directory."],["",""]],["vapor","'veipә","n. 汽, 蒸气\\nvi. 蒸发\\nvt. 使蒸发",["A cloud is a mass of vapor in the sky.","Clouds are clusters of water droplets condensed from water vapor."],["云是天空中的水汽团。",""]],["dwelling","'dweliŋ","n. 住处\\n[医] 住房",["He is always dwelling on the pleasures of the past.","A wilder or more disconsolate dwelling it was perhaps difficult to conceive."],["",""]],["sage","seidʒ","n. 圣人, 哲人, 鼠尾草属植物\\na. 贤明的, 明智的",["Would you like a cough sweet? I've got some that are sage or lemon-flavour.","When a Sage shall again arise, he will certainly follow my words."],["",""]],["burner","'bә:nә","n. 火炉, 烧火的人\\n[化] 灯; 灯头; 烧嘴炉; 燃烧器; 燃烧炉",["Potassium, heated with a Bunsen burner, gives the flame a lilac color.","I think we're going to need to put this project on the back burner for a little while."],["用本生燈加熱鉀，火焰就會呈現淡紫色。",""]],["trooper","'tru:pә","n. 骑兵, 骑警, 伞兵",["It's better to be a good person who swears like a trooper than a quiet well mannered piece of shit.","Sami was pulled over by a state trooper."],["",""]],["dominican","dә'minikәn","a. 多明尼加共和国的",["Santo Domingo is the capital of the Dominican Republic.","She manages a lovely community garden in the Bronx, near the Dominican coffee shop."],["",""]],["evacuation","i.vækju'eiʃәn","n. 撤退, 疏散\\n[化] 抽空; 排空",["As the hurricane grew closer, the governor issued a statewide evacuation notice.","Be on alert. The evacuation order may occur at any moment."],["",""]],["decidedly","di'saididli","adv. 决定了, 坚决, 明显, 显而易见, 显然, 明确, 果断, 毫无疑问",["Christi's mysteries are most decidedly interesting.","The world's greatest singers and most of its famous musicians have been fat or at least decidedly plump."],["",""]],["carving","'kɑ:viŋ","n. 雕刻品, 雕刻, 雕刻术",["This carving knife ... it's one made by a famous swordsmith.","When you mentioned \"snow carving\", you reminded me of the \"Sapporo snow festival\". I'd love to go there one day."],["",""]],["frank","fræŋk","a. 坦白的, 率直的, 老实的\\nvt. 免费邮寄\\nn. 免费邮寄特权",["Frank was waiting with pleasure for the date in the evening.","At nine in the evening, we visited the Anne Frank House."],["法兰克高兴地等待着他晚上的约会。","晚上九点的时候，我们参观了安娜·弗兰克的家。"]],["hack","hæk","n. 劈, 砍, 砍痕, 出租车, 干咳, 晒架, 鹤嘴锄\\nvt. 劈, 砍, 出租, 用旧\\nvi. 劈, 砍, 干咳, 驾驶出租车\\…",["I never thought it'd be this easy to hack into your website.","The so-called expert turned out to be a total hack."],["",""]],["clamp","klæmp","n. 夹钳\\nvt. 夹紧, 强加",["A wise businessman knows how to clamp down on costs.","Ziri asked Yazid if he could borrow his quick grip clamp."],["",""]],["hinder","'hindә","a. 后面的\\nv. 阻碍, 打扰",["Nothing will hinder my malicious plan.","Nothing could hinder Kate from using all her energy to polish her performances."],["没有什么能阻碍我邪恶的计划。",""]],["algorithm","'ælgәriðm","n. 算法\\n[计] 算法",["No algorithm that can solve this problem in polynomial time has been found yet.","It's not a fucking algorithm developed by a narcissistic asshole that will determine whether my language exists or not."],["",""]],["irrational","i'ræʃәnәl","n. 无理数\\na. 无理性的, 不合理的",["Tom forgot how to prove that the square root of 2 is irrational.","Clava loves all things irrational, and works at the kindergarten for precisely that reason."],["",""]],["pristine","'pristi:n","a. 太古的, 原来的, 古时的, 原始的",["The governor's recent scandal was a blight on her otherwise pristine track record.","Arrokoth is the most distant, most primitive and most pristine object ever explored by spacecraft."],["州長最近的醜聞玷污了她原本完美無瑕的政績。",""]],["armored","'ɑ:mәd","a. 装甲的",["The armored glass is made of a super-resistant material, distributed in layers.","Armored though it was, the window did not resist the bullet, which hit the driver's head."],["",""]],["patiently","'peiʃәntli","adv. 耐心地；有毅力地",["I am patiently listening, but I don't feel interested.","After patiently listening to the audience's complaints, the judges changed the results."],["我很耐心地听着，但不感兴趣。",""]],["paperback","'peipәbæk","n. 平装本, 纸面本",["Is there a paperback edition of this book?","Unsold paperback books often have their covers torn off."],["这本书有平装书版本的吗？",""]],["boutique","bu:'ti:k","n. 专卖流行衣服的小商店",["The clothes at this boutique are particularly expensive.","They stayed at a small, but luxurious boutique hotel in the heart of Berlin."],["这家精品店的服装卖得很贵.",""]],["navigation",".nævi'geiʃәn","n. 航行, 航海, 导航\\n[经] 航空, 航海, 航船",["Early explorers used the stars for navigation.","It seems the navy jets had a major screw-up in navigation and they bombed their own troops by mistake."],["古代的探險家用星星來辨別方向。",""]],["diver","'daivә","n. 潜水者",["The diver wanted to test the limits of his equipment.","Chinese diver Chen Aisen earned a perfect score on his last dive."],["",""]],["alpine","'ælpain","a. 高山的, 高山生长的",["He lives in a small Alpine village in Austria.","Examples of animals common to alpine tundra environments include mountain goats, pikas, chinchillas, yaks, and marmots."],["他住在奧地利阿爾卑斯山上的一箇村子裡。",""]],["plaster","'plæstә","n. 石膏, 灰泥, 安慰(缓解)用品, 膏药\\nvt. 涂以灰泥, 敷以膏药, 掩饰, 使平服, 彻底击败, 减轻, 粘贴",["On Christmas Day, Tom still had his right leg in plaster.","I can't use my left hand because of the plaster cast."],["",""]],["abnormal","æb'nɒ:mәl","a. 反常的, 不规则的, 变态的, 畸形的\\nn. 畸形的人",["Environmental pollution is causing abnormal weather conditions.","He had part of his atrium ablated because he had an abnormal heartbeat."],["環境污染正造成異常的天氣情況。",""]],["redemption","ri'dempʃәn","n. 赎回, 赎身, 偿还, 拯救\\n[经] 偿还, 买回, 赎回",["No external evidence can, at this long distance of time, be produced to prove whether the church fabricated the doctrine called redemption or not.","He deserves the opportunity for rehabilitation and redemption."],["經過如此漫長的時間，已不可能提出任何外部證據，來證明教會是否捏造了所謂的「救贖」教義。",""]],["improper","im'prɒpә","a. 不合适的, 错误的, 不成体统的, 不道德的\\n[法] 不适当的, 不合适的, 不正确的",["This unexpected malfunctioning of the system was caused by improper wiring.","It is improper to impose sanctions upon the union."],["",""]],["creditor","'kreditә","n. 债权人\\n[法] 债权人, 债主, 贷方",["The world's main creditor nations, known as the Paris Club, will meet next week in the French capital to consider a moratorium on debt repayments by the countries most affected by the December 26 disaster."],[""]],["bamboo","bæm'bu:","n. 竹子\\n[医] 竹类",["In spring, the bamboo grove outside Hsinchu City is especially green.","There's bamboo growing in the garden."],["春天的時候，新竹城外的竹林特別翠綠。","花園裡有竹子在生長。"]],["prosper","'prɒspә","vi. 繁荣, 兴隆, 成功\\nvt. 使成功, 使昌盛",["May Algeria continue to prosper and thrive in the years ahead.","Our economy doesn't work as well or grow as fast when a few prosper at the expense of a growing middle class."],["",""]],["pianist","'piәnist","n. 钢琴家, 钢琴演奏者",["I have a friend whose father is a famous pianist.","She has a daughter who is a pianist."],["我有一個朋友，他的父親是位名鋼琴家。","她有一个钢琴家女儿。"]],["heartbeat","'hɑ:tbi:t","n. 心跳",["The doctor monitored the patient's heartbeat and blood pressure.","She laid her head on my chest so she could listen to my heartbeat."],["",""]],["interception",",intә(:)'sepʃәn","n. 拦截, 截断, 截住, 截取, 截击, 窃听, 侦听, 雷达侦察\\n[计] 截取, 窃听",["Tom made an important interception as his team defended their one-nil lead."],[""]],["downward","'daunwәd","a. 向下的",["The slump in oil prices could send Algeria in an economic downward spiral.","Yanni's letter sent Rima into a downward spiral of self-hatred."],["",""]],["adaptive","ә'dæptiv","a. 适应的, 能适应的",["Spiders are very adaptive, especially when spinning a web.","The authors looked at two different adaptive radiations in the fossil record."],["",""]],["plasma","'plæzmә","n. 血浆, 淋巴液, 原生质, 等离子体\\n[化] 等离体; 等离子体",["Before I got this new OLED TV, I used to have a plasma screen.","Plasma TVs used to be very expensive, but now they're much cheaper."],["",""]],["danish","'deiniʃ","n. 丹麦文\\na. 丹麦的, 丹麦人的, 丹麦文的",["My Danish pronunciation is not very accurate.","The Danish person tries to speak Italian at the beginning of the conversation."],["我的丹麦语发音不是很标准。",""]],["stainless","'steinlis","a. 无瑕疵的, 不锈的\\n[机] 不绣的, 污染的",["My mind is as bright and clean as a stainless mirror.","Tom filled his stainless steel coffee mug with coffee."],["",""]],["tread","tred","n. 踏, 步态, 梯级, 交尾, 鞋底\\nvi. 踏, 行走, 交尾\\nvt. 踩, 踏, 践踏, 跳(舞)",["Fools rush in where angels fear to tread.","I have spread my dreams beneath your feet; Tread softly because you tread on my dreams."],["初生之犢不畏虎。",""]],["divided","dә'vaidid","a. 分开的",["He divided one million dollars among his five sons.","This is because you approach everything as a total person, with no loose ends hanging out to signify divided intentions."],["他把一百万美元分给他五个儿子。","这是因为你总是全身心处理每一件事情，没有让鸡毛蒜皮的问题分散了你的目标。"]],["stifle","'staifl","vt. 使窒息, 抑止, 扼杀\\nvi. 窒息, 被扼杀",["She tried to stifle a sneeze during the concert but she couldn't hold it back.","Sami stuffed a bag inside Layla's mouth to stifle her."],["",""]],["sentimental",".senti'mentl","a. 感伤的, 感情用事的",["Sami things that were very sentimental for him in that box.","I don't think that Ziri was that sentimental about animals."],["",""]],["insecurity",".insi'kjuәrәti","n. 不安全, 不安全感\\n[医] 不安全感, 无保障",["Layla couldn't rid of the feelings of insecurity and unworthiness.","Often, the difference between what you are and what you want to be causes bad mood and insecurity."],["",""]],["synthesis","'sinθisis","n. 综合, 组织, 综合体\\n[化] 合成",["The smooth endoplasmic reticulum is the organelle responsible for lipid synthesis.","Additive synthesis involves manually controlling harmonics, and uses only sine waves."],["",""]],["recognizable","'rekәgnaizәbl","a. 可认识的, 可承认的, 可识别的\\n[法] 可被认出的, 可辩认的, 可被承认的",["The peacock (Inachis io) is a beautiful and easily recognizable butterfly.","Tom's car is easily recognizable since there is a big dent in the front bumper."],["",""]],["inclination",".inkli'neiʃәn","n. 倾向, 趋向, 倾斜度, 点头\\n[化] 倾角",["He showed his agreement by a sight inclination of his head.","A man ought to read just as inclination leads him; for what he reads as a task will do him little good."],["",""]],["boarding","'bɒ:diŋ","n. 木板\\n[机] 起纹",["In the London underground there is a warning to \"mind the gap\" when boarding the train.","I phoned my son before boarding the plane, telling him to come to the airport to pick me up."],["在倫敦地鐵，上車時會有「注意間隙」提醒。","我上機之前打了電話給兒子，叫他去機場接我。"]],["inclusive","in'klu:siv","a. 包含的, 包括的",["This list is inclusive of the past members of the group.","The functions sine and cosine have a range of values between -1 and 1, inclusive."],["",""]],["pilgrimage","'pilgrimidʒ","n. 朝圣, 漫游, 人生的一段经历\\nvi. 朝拜, 朝圣, 漫游",["The temple on that mountain is an important pilgrimage site.","You are not really prepared to go on a pilgrimage."],["",""]],["monumental",".mɒnju'mentәl","a. 纪念碑的, 做为纪念的, 不朽的",["The moon landing was a monumental achievement.","In Algeria, building the East-West Freeway was a monumental undertaking."],["登月是一項里程碑式的成就。",""]],["memorize","'memәraiz","vt. 记住, 熟记, 背熟",["If you study new words, then use them more so that you will be able to more quickly memorize them.","You should memorize a piece of classical literature every day."],["如果你学习了新的单词，就多多去用它们，这样能够更快地帮你记住它们。","你必须每天背一篇古典文献。"]],["upscale","'ʌpskeil","a. 迎合高层次消费者的；质优价高的",["Shall we go to a little more upscale restaurant?","They went out for dinner at an upscale restaurant."],["我们去一家档次再高点儿的餐厅怎么样？",""]],["thyme","taim","n. 百里香\\n[医] 百里香, 麝香草",["Basil, sage, rosemary, thyme and oregano are popular herbs.","Simmer five carefully peeled and chopped tomatoes with the garlic, thyme and bay leaf for five minutes."],["",""]],["ninety","'nainti","num. 九十, 九十个",["It's valid until March thirty-first, nineteen-ninety-seven.","Ten, twenty, thirty, forty, fifty, sixty, seventy, eighty, ninety, hundred."],["有效期到1997年3月31日为止。","十、二十、三十、四十、五十、六十、七十、八十、九十、一百。"]],["superficial",".sju:pә'fiʃәl","n. 表面, 外表\\na. 表面的, 肤浅的, 面积的",["One must have conviction in law, or its existence will be superficial only.","You have to acquire real skills, not just superficial knowledge."],["法律必须被信仰，否则形同虚设。","你要學的是實實在在的技能，而不單是表面的知識。"]],["reviewer","ri'vju:ә(r)","n. 评论者, 书评作者, 评论家, 剧评家, 报刊评论家",["The gentleman with his pipe in his mouth is a famous reviewer.","The book reviewer who detects a missing comma, immediately feels elevated to the level of the writer."],["",""]],["puff","pʌf","n. 一阵喷烟, 肿块, 喘息\\nv. 喷出, 张开, 吹捧, (使)充气, 喘气, (使)骄傲, (使)膨胀",["Hedgehogs curl into a ball and puff out their spines when threatened.","The chef prepared a delicious puff pastry pizza filled with cheese, tomato sauce, and fresh basil."],["",""]],["snort","snɒ:t","vi. 喷着气弄响鼻子, 轻蔑地哼, 嘶嘶响着排气\\nvt. 哼着鼻子说, 喷出, 吸入(毒品)\\nn. 喷鼻息, (潜艇的)水下通气管",["I don't like the sound the pigs make when they snort.","Cats snort when they are angry or frightened."],["",""]],["rig","rig","n. 装备, 帆装\\nvt. 装配, 装扮, 给船装帆, 垄断, 操纵",["A big rig jackknifed on Park Street this morning; commuters are urged to use Main Street as an alternate route.","I would be very concerned about Tom trying to rig the German election."],["",""]],["pecan","pi'kæn","n. 美洲山核桃(树)",["I saw an old and hollow pecan tree that had some bees flying around it.","\"Pecan\" is one of those tricky words that gets pronounced in several different ways."],["我看到一棵老舊的空心山核桃樹，周圍有一些蜜蜂在飛。","「pecan」是一個發音比較刁鑽的詞，有好幾種不同的發音方式。"]],["misunderstand",".misʌndә'stænd","vt. 误解, 误会",["Don't misunderstand me, but my mind is really occupied.","Don't misunderstand me; we are not making any promises."],["",""]],["excursion","ik'skә:ʒәn","n. 远足, 游览圆, 短程旅行\\n[医] 移动, 离轨, 逸出",["A travel agent will arrange an excursion to Andalusia for you.","Six of us are going on an excursion to the beach this weekend."],["旅行社會爲你安排去安達盧西亞的旅行。",""]],["superpower",".sju:pә'pauә","n. 超级强权, 超级大国\\n[经] 超级大国",["Though it is poor in natural resources, Japan has become an economic superpower thanks to international trade.","Algeria is quickly transforming into a regional superpower."],["日本即便是自然资源匮乏，却仍得益于国际贸易，成为了一个强大的经济体。",""]],["annoying","ә'nɒiiŋ","a. 恼人的, 讨厌的",["My friends always say I'm too calm, but my family always says I'm too annoying.","You simply cannot reason with her, which is quite annoying."],["我的朋友们总是说我太安静了，而我的家人总是说我太让人烦了。","她就是不讲道理。讨厌死了。"]],["modernity","mɒ'dә:nәti","n. 现代性, 现代状态, 现代东西",["It has hints of modernity but is well-rooted in tradition.","It took over a hundred thousand years for anatomically modern humans to develop behavioral modernity."],["",""]],["hallmark","'hɑ:lmɑ:k","n. 纯度检验证明, 品质证明\\nvt. 加盖纯度检验证明",["A certain hallmark of wisdom is the cheerful benevolence it confers.","A hallmark of fascism is the consolidation of state, media, and corporate power."],["",""]],["vocational","vәu'keiʃәnl","a. 职业的\\n[法] 职业上的, 天职的",["Builders can build low-energy houses only when they have received the appropriate vocational training.","He would have been able to enter a good university easily if he had tried, but he entered a vocational school instead."],["",""]],["cucumber","'kju:kәmbә","n. 黄瓜\\n[医] 黄瓜, 胡瓜",["A horse doesn't eat cucumber salad.","There is a good reason why the cucumber is used as the epitome of cool."],["馬不吃黃瓜沙拉。",""]],["backing","'bækiŋ","n. 后退, 衬背, 后援, 支持者\\n[化] 衬垫",["Look in the rear-view mirror before backing up.","You are backing yourself into a bad emotional corner."],["倒車前先看後視鏡。",""]],["playing","","n. 游戏, 玩耍, 竞技, 比赛, 扮演, 演奏, 赌博",["Computers are certainly playing an important role in our life, whether we like it or not.","When I came home, my sister was playing the guitar."],["无论我们是否喜欢电脑，它在我们的生活中始终起着重要的作用。","当我回到家的时候，我妹妹正在弹吉他。"]],["nightclub","'naitklʌb","n. 夜总会",["Tom was able to hear the music from nightclub down the street.","Since Tom couldn't make a decent living as a nightclub musician, he had to get a day job."],["",""]],["sharpen","'ʃɑ:pn","vt. 使尖锐, 使敏捷, 加重, 削尖\\nvi. 尖锐化, 变锋利",["The witch told the servants to sharpen the knives, make a great fire ready, and hang a large kettle full of water over it.","I didn't sharpen Tom's pencils even though he'd asked me to."],["",""]],["turnaround","'tә:nә.raund","n. 转向, 回车道, 转变\\n[化] 小修; 预防(性)修理",["Any turnaround of the economy is not expected this year.","He has made a turnaround of a hundred and eighty degrees."],["",""]],["crooked","'krukid","a. 弯曲的, 歪的, 邪恶的",["That used car salesman is as crooked as a dog's hind leg.","He was egging an innocent young man on to join him in his crooked deal."],["",""]],["satisfactory",".sætis'fæktәri","a. 满意的, 赎罪的\\n[法] 令人满意的, 令当事人满意的, 充分的",["The results of the research were quite satisfactory.","The explanation is by no means satisfactory."],["調查的結果十分令人滿意。","這個解釋不是很令人滿意。"]],["asphalt","'æsfælt","n. 柏油\\na. 用柏油铺成的\\nvt. 以柏油铺",["Where there is asphalt, there is nothing interesting, but where it's interesting, there is no asphalt.","If I ever kill myself, I hope my splattered brains turn the asphalt into a beautiful mural."],["",""]],["mortar","'mɒ:tә","n. 臼, 研钵, 灰泥\\nvt. 用灰泥涂抹, 用灰泥结合",["For a more authentic texture, use a mortar and pestle instead of a blender.","I need to buy a mortar and pestle to grind garbanzo beans for authentic hummus."],["",""]],["subscription","sәb'skripʃәn","n. 捐献, 订金, 订阅, 签署, 同意\\n[化] 订购",["The subscription service is available for a fixed monthly fee with a one-month free trial.","The monthly fee for this subscription service is fixed, and it offers a one-month free trial."],["此訂閱服務的月費為固定金額，並提供免費試用一個月。","此訂閱服務的月費為固定金額，並提供免費試用一個月。"]],["liable","'laiәbl","a. 有义务的, 应负责的, 有...倾向的\\n[法] 有责任的, 可受处理的, 应受罚的",["We are all liable to make mistakes.","A newborn baby is liable to fall ill."],["我們都會犯錯。","新生嬰兒很容易生病。"]],["savor","'seivә","n. 滋味, 气味, 食欲\\nvi. 有...的滋味\\nvt. 加调味品于, 使有风味, 尝到",["We only get healed from a passion when we savor it till the end.","O time, suspend your flight! and you, happy hours, suspend your race: let us savor the fleeting delights of our fairest days!"],["",""]],["demonstrator","'demәnstreitә","n. 论证者, 证明者, 指示者, 示威者\\n[医] 示教者",["The demonstrator convinced him to buy the expensive appliance.","The demonstrator was told by police to move back but she refused and was arrested."],["",""]],["impending","im'pendiŋ","a. 即将发生的, 迫切的, 悬空的\\n[法] 就要来的, 逼在眼前的, 紧急的",["Agitated activity by certain animals may be a sign of an impending earthquake.","The big promotion of that company's stock was just a cover-up to hide their impending bankruptcy."],["某些动物烦躁不安, 可能是地震临震前的预兆。",""]],["microscope","'maikrәuskәup","n. 显微镜\\n[化] 显微镜",["Do you know the difference between a microscope and a telescope?","Most of them are invisible without the help of a microscope."],["你知道显微镜和望远镜的差别吗？",""]],["spear","spiә","n. 矛, 枪, 持矛者, 嫩枝\\nvt. 用矛刺\\nvi. 刺, 戳\\na. 父系的",["The tip of the spear was dipped in a deadly poison.","Leaning on his bone-tipped spear for support, Tom rises to his feet."],["矛尖浸在一種致命的毒藥裡。",""]],["characterization",",kæriktәrai'zeiʃәn","n. 特性描述, 人物之塑造\\n[建] 特性因数",["The theater company's characterization of Anne Frank was very emotional, but tasteful.","I don't think that's a very accurate characterization of his point of view."],["",""]],["weekday","'wi:kdei","n. 周日, 平日\\n[计] 工作日",["On a recent brisk weekday morning, the market was vibrant.","As most big-city dwellers know, parking in public garages during a busy weekday can be very frustrating."],["",""]],["bloc","blɒk","n. 集团",["I would like to stress that it is more convenient to control tariffs as a bloc rather than country by country.","Those agenda items were taken up en bloc for discussion."],["",""]],["dorm","dɒ:m","n. 宿舍",["She was really upset at the time. She cried in the dorm the entire day.","He went back to the dorm as soon as he finished class."],["她当时很伤心，在宿舍哭了整整一天。","他一放学就回宿舍了。"]],["broadcasting","'brɒ:dkæstiŋ","n. 广播\\n[电] 广播",["You're just broadcasting cultural propaganda your education had filled you with.","The rebels have captured the broadcasting station."],["",""]],["ledge","ledʒ","n. 突出部分, 暗礁, 矿层",["At this very second, you are on a narrow ledge between life and death.","It's impossible to get onto that ledge without rocket jumping."],["",""]],["overtime","'әuvәtaim","n. 超时, 加班, 延长时间\\na. 超时的, 加班的\\nadv. 加班地\\nvt. 使超过时间",["In order to cut down on costs, the company refuses to allow employees to work overtime.","Today I haven't dealt with the things I wanted to deal with; I'll have to work overtime again."],["公司为了削减成本，拒绝让员工自行加班。","今天我要处理的事还没处理完，又要加班了。"]],["mediation",".mi:di'eiʃәn","n. 调停, 调解, 中介\\n[医] 间介[作用], 居间[作用]",["The union has asked for the mediation of the government in the dispute.","There was a linguistic mediation between aborigines and immigrants."],["",""]],["occupant","'ɒkjupәnt","n. 占有者, 居住者, 占用者",["One bamboo chair had already been vacated by its occupant; in the other, sat a young English lady.","I assure you this house with no other occupant but that sniveling woman is a miserable place."],["",""]],["bitterness","'bitәnis","n. 苦味, 悲痛, 怨恨",["She said good-bye with a smile, but there was a good deal of bitterness in her heart.","Even now, many years after the Cold War, there is still much bitterness between Germans and Russians, especially in areas which were occupied by the Soviet Union."],["她說再見的時候，臉上掛著笑容，但其實心中是十分難受的。","就是冷战几十年后的今天，德国人和俄罗斯人之间还有很多伤痛，尤其是在那些被苏联占领的地区。"]],["chimney","'tʃimni","n. 烟囱, 灯罩\\n[电] 烟囱",["Tom is clambering about on the roof, repairing the chimney stack.","The smoke went upward through the chimney."],["汤姆在屋顶一边爬一边修理烟囱。","烟从烟囱里冒了出来。"]],["lateral","'lætәrәl","n. 侧部, 支线, 边音\\na. 侧面的, 旁边的",["His job title change was considered a lateral move, possibly a demotion, and certainly not a promotion.","Dr. Hawking was diagnosed with amyotrophic lateral sclerosis while at Oxford."],["",""]],["aroma","ә'rәumә","n. 浓香, 香气\\n[医] 香气, 芳香气",["The room hasn't been cleaned recently, so it now has a foul aroma.","This wine has a fruitier aroma than the one we tasted earlier."],["这个房间最近都没打扫过，有一股臭味。",""]],["packed","","a. 充满...的, 满座的, 挤得满满的, 压坚实的, 塞满了...的, 挤满了人的, 拥挤的\\n[计] 压缩的, 装配的",["Tom seems to have packed everything but the kitchen sink.","Organic kale is hand picked, washed and packed on site at Sprouting Farms, West Virginia, for retail and wholesale."],["Tom把除了厨房水槽之外的所有东西都打包了。","有機羽衣甘藍在西維吉尼亞州的 Sprouting Farms 現場手工採摘、清洗和包裝，提供零售和批發。"]],["groove","gru:v","n. 凹槽, 惯例, 理想境况\\nvt. 开槽于",["The articles of incorporation have finally been completed for our Digital Groove Club.","The tamborim lends a very slightly uneven and highly distinctive 16th note groove to samba music."],["",""]],["relay","'ri:lei","n. 驿马, 替班, 中继, 接力\\nvt. 分程传递, 转播, 使接替\\nvi. 接力传送, 转播",["A relay church service has been taking place in The Hague for more than a month.","He wanted to relay the message as quickly as possible."],["",""]],["thwart","θwɒ:t","a. 横放的\\nvt. 反对, 阻挠, 横过\\nprep. 横过\\nadv. 横过",["The town managed to thwart plans to build a nuclear power plant nearby.","A moat was dug around the castle to thwart attackers."],["",""]],["curved","","a. 弯曲的；弄弯的",["In General Relativity the observed global effect of gravity arises from strictly local interaction with curved space-time.","The squamosal bears an indistinct, gently curved ridge."],["",""]],["buffet","'bʌfit","n. 自助餐, 小卖部, 碗橱, 殴打, 冲击\\nvt. 连续打, 冲击, 搏斗\\nvi. 奋斗",["There are a lot of people so today we've gone for buffet style.","China's the only country where three people can eat at a mid-range hotpot buffet for only 5 RMB, but a hamburger costs five times as much. Figure that one out!"],["因为人很多，今天我们会采取自助餐的形式。","中国是三人在中等餐馆吃火锅自助餐一共值五块人民币而汉堡包比它贵五倍唯一的国家。您去搞明白吧......"]],["stint","stint","vt. 节省, 限制, 停止\\nvi. 节约\\nn. 吝惜, 节约, 限额",["Tom turned his life around after a stint in rehab.","In some larger cities, people must stint on food and clothing in order to make rent or mortgage payments."],["",""]],["ye","ji:","abbr. 亚萨卡, 乒乓底板（Yasaka Extra）；酵母抽提物（Yeast Extracts）",["We speak that we do know, and testify that we have seen; and ye receive not our witness.","And whatsoever ye do, do it heartily, as to the Lord, and not unto men."],["我們說我們所知道的，為我們所看到的作證；你們卻不接受我們的見證。",""]],["fin","fin","n. 鳍, 鱼翅, 鳍状物, 五元纸币\\nvi. 猛挥鳍\\nvt. 装上翅, 切除鳍",["He thought he perceived the black fin of a shark swimming near the surface of the water.","Shark fin soup is commonly served at Chinese weddings and banquets."],["",""]],["dispense","dis'pens","vt. 分发, 分配\\nvi. 特许, 豁免",["It seems unlikely that any society could completely dispense with myths.","I guess I've reached the age where I have to dispense advice to my underlings."],["",""]],["jog","dʒɒg","n. 轻推, 轻撞, 慢跑\\nv. 轻推, (使)蹒跚行进, (使)慢跑",["The man next door said he goes for a jog every morning.","I love to jog more than anything else in the world."],["隔壁帅哥说他每天都去慢跑。",""]],["awfully","'ɒ:fuli","adv. 恶劣地, 非常地, 极端地",["He was tired out by an awfully tough job.","I was awfully confused by his question."],["他被一件辛苦的工作累坏了。","我對他的問題感到非常困惑。"]],["cruelty","'kru:әlti","n. 残酷, 野蛮, 残酷行为\\n[法] 残酷, 残忍, 虐待",["Cruelty in young people is fostered by violent movies and PC games.","I cannot abide to see such cruelty."],["暴力電影和電腦遊戲助長了年輕人的殘暴行為。","我不忍目睹这种残酷的行径。"]],["lantern","'læntәn","n. 灯笼, 提灯, 航标灯\\nvt. 装上提灯",["It is a must to guess lantern riddles during the Lantern Festival.","In Brazil, when a team takes last place in the league, they're called the \"lantern\", which roughly equates to \"tail-enders\"."],["元宵節要猜燈謎。",""]],["plateau","plæ'tәu","n. 高地, 高原, (上升后的)稳定水平\\n[医] 高原, 平顶, 坪",["The wind encounters no natural obstacles on the plateau.","The rugged rover on Neptune's Triton travelled on a plateau of nitrogen ice."],["",""]],["slaughter","'slɒ:tә","n. 残杀, 屠杀, 杀戮\\nvt. 残杀, 屠杀, 亏本出售",["Many conservationists fear the continuing slaughter of whales is pushing these animals towards extinction.","The slaughter of the prisoners was a barbarous act."],["许多自然环境保护主义者担心持续屠杀鲸鱼正推动这些动物走向灭绝。",""]],["cosmetic","kɒz'metik","n. 化妆品\\na. 化妆用的",["Cosmetic surgery is not covered by most insurance plans.","We should spend our time creating content for our website rather than wasting time worrying about minor cosmetic details."],["大部份的保險計劃不包含整容手術。",""]],["heroine","'herәuin","n. 巾帼英雄, 烈妇, 女主角\\n[化] 海洛因; 二醋吗啡; 二乙酰吗啡",["The heroine of this story is a little girl.","Lydia is the swashbuckling heroine of this adventure novel."],["這個故事的女主角是一個小女孩。",""]],["retrospect","'retrәspekt","n. 回顾, 追忆, 回溯\\nv. 回顾, 追忆",["In retrospect, I probably shouldn't have gone there with her.","In retrospect, I should have known that it was a scam."],["",""]],["recommended","","a. 被推荐的",["The QA team has discovered a serious bug. As a consequence, it is recommended that all work be reviewed from the beginning.","I will note down the recommended bibliography on the list and look for them next time I come to the library."],["QA团队发现了一个重大bug，因此，建议重新审查所有工作。","我會將推薦的書目記在清單上，下次來圖書館時看。"]],["trot","trɒt","n. 快步\\nvi. 快步走, 小跑\\nvt. 使小跑, 策马小跑",["The old man set off at a quick trot.","Horses have three modes of locomotion: Walk, trot and gallop."],["老人快步走开了。",""]],["socialize","'sәuʃәlaiz","vt. 使社会化, 使社会主义化, 使适合社会需要\\nvi. (美)(非正式)参加社交活动, 发生社交往来",["Sami wanted to go out, socialize and meet other people.","Do yourself a favor. Learn the language and socialize."],["",""]],["damaging","'dæmidʒiŋ","a. 破坏性的, 损害的",["Tom tried to crack a walnut without damaging its kernel.","Urban sprawl is environmentally damaging."],["湯姆試圖敲碎一顆核桃而不損壞果仁。","城市擴張會對環境造成破壞。"]],["mingle","'miŋgl","v. (使)混合",["Mingle your joys sometimes with your earnest occupation.","On the old marketplace, smells of fish, fruit and vegetables mingle with the hubbub of conversations spoken in many languages."],["",""]],["clubhouse","'klʌbhaus","n. 俱乐部会所",["During this period, there was a way to get into the French clubhouse without standing in line: you had to eat the products inside, but it was really expensive.","Hats aren't allowed to be worn inside the clubhouse."],["当时进法国馆，有一种不用排队的办法，就是去吃法国馆里的食品，但是实在太贵了。",""]],["pony","'pәuni","n. 矮种马\\nv. 借助逐字直译文翻译\\na. 小型的, 每日摘要的",["You know what else? My daughter wants a pony and my husband wants a yacht.","I'll buy Tom that pony he's always bugging me for."],["",""]],["peripheral","pә'rifәrәl","a. 周边的, 周围的, 圆周的, 无关紧要的, 肤浅的\\n[医] 外周的, 周围的, 末梢的",["Doing exercises to strengthen one's peripheral vision is recommended for those interested in learning how to speed read.","Yanni saw something moving in his peripheral vision."],["",""]],["grapple","græpl","v. 抓住, 掌握\\nn. 抓住, 系紧, 掌握, 与...扭打",["The Esperanto movement has always had to grapple with the problem of 'eternal beginners'.","New Yorkers woke up to a wet and gray Tuesday, as they continued to grapple with their new reality."],["",""]],["stocking","'stɒkiŋ","n. 长袜\\n[医] 马足水肿; 长袜",["He yawned and stretched, put on one stocking, rubbed his eyes, yawned, put on another stocking and yawned again.","I was late for the bus, late for work, and got a run in my stocking."],["",""]],["hospitality",".hɒspi'tæliti","n. 款待, 亲切, 殷勤",["All the guests were touched by her hospitality.","I gave a bunch of roses to her in return for her hospitality."],["所有的客人都被她的好客感动了。",""]],["floral","'flɒ:rәl","a. 花似的, 花的, 植物的",["Red is, indeed, the chief element of beauty in floral nature, the prime ornament of the green garb of the vegetal kingdom.","Madame de Pompadour liked pastel colors and floral patterns."],["",""]],["centerpiece","'sentәpi:s","n. 中心装饰品；放在餐桌中央的摆饰",["A Roman coin from the third century CE is the centerpiece of his collection.","Mark was in charge of creating the centerpiece for the party."],["",""]],["reed","ri:d","n. 芦苇, 芦笛, 簧舌, 纤弱的人\\nvt. 用芦苇盖, 用小凸嵌线装饰",["Man is but a reed, the weakest in nature, but he is a thinking reed.","Heck, with oboe players there are those who, rather than search for a reed that suits them, find it faster to make their own."],["",""]],["imperative","im'perәtiv","n. 命令, 必要的事, 规则, 祈使语气\\na. 命令式的, 急需的, 势在必行的, 强制的",["It is imperative for you to act at once.","It is imperative for you to finish by Sunday."],["您必须马上行动。","你必須在星期日前完成。"]],["congratulate","kәn'grætʃәleit","vt. 祝贺, 庆贺",["I congratulate him, I congratulate Governor Palin for all that they've achieved. And I look forward to working with them to renew this nation's promise in the months ahead.","I congratulate you on your engagement."],["我向他道賀；也向裴林州長道賀，為他們所成就的一切。我迫不及待想和他們攜手合作，在未來數月更新這個國家的許諾。","我为你的订婚祝贺。"]],["compression","kәm'preʃәn","n. 压缩, 压紧\\n[计] 压缩",["Data compression algorithms can be classified in two categories: those with data loss and those without data loss.","Carnot machines work according to cycles of compression and expansion."],["压缩数据的算法能分为两种：一种会造成数据损失，另一种则不会。",""]],["heightened","ˈhaitənd","v. （使）变高, （使）增大( heighten的过去式和过去分词 ); （使）提高; （使）加强[重]",["A society is only as free as its apperception of diversity is heightened.","The risk of fire is heightened in low-energy houses."],["",""]],["seriousness","'siәriәsnis","n. 严肃, 认真, 严重性",["He wrote a letter dealing with the matter in all seriousness.","Despite the seriousness of his illness, Mr Robinson is in good spirits."],["他写了一封信函认真地讨论了那个事情。",""]],["grammar","'græmә","n. 语法学, 入门书\\n[计] 语法检查",["One learns grammar from language, not language from grammar.","According to my experience, it takes one year to master French grammar."],["人类从语言中学语法，而不是从语法里学语言。","根據我的經驗，掌握法語語法需要一年的時間。"]],["indifferent","in'difәrәnt","a. 漠不关心的, 无重要性的, 中立的\\n[医] 中性的, 无作用的, 无亲和力的, 淡漠的",["Lots of people in Japan are indifferent to politics.","It is said that the Japanese are very friendly to those that they know, and very indifferent to those they don't."],["很多日本人對政治冷淡。","据说日本人对他们认识的人非常友好，对不认识的人非常冷淡。"]],["railway","'reilwei","n. 铁路, 轨道\\n[经] 铁路",["London is such a large city that visitors must use buses and the underground railway to get about.","The train slowed and blared its horn as it approached the railway crossing."],["伦敦是个大城市，游客必须乘公交或地铁才能出行。","火车在快到交叉路口的时候减速、按喇叭。"]],["citation","sai'teiʃәn","n. 引用, 引证, 引用文\\n[建] 引证, 指引",["Academic writing should contain facts supported by citation.","In assessing scientific work, citation counts provide a more reliable indicator, than the impact factor of the journal in which it was published."],["",""]],["impoverished","im'pɔvәriʃt","a. 穷困的, 无力的,用尽了的",["Haiti is a nation that seems hopelessly impoverished.","The war lasting for years impoverished the country."],["",""]],["dude","dju:d","n.<美国、加拿大>纨绔子弟，花花公子； <俚>男人，家伙；\\nvt.<俚>打扮得讲究或花哨",["\"Thanks a lot for letting me play with your Xbox.\" \"No problem dude, knock yourself out.\"","You suck dude! I have to tell you everything!"],["\" 非常感謝你讓我玩你的Xbox。\" \" 沒問題，老兄，別客氣盡情地玩吧。\"","你好烂哦！ 我什么事都需要跟你讲！"]],["respectful","ri'spektful","a. 表示尊敬的, 有礼貌的, 谦恭的",["One must be respectful when speaking, and not say obscene things.","He is always very respectful of his wife's opinions."],["开口要有礼貌，不讲下流话。","他总是很尊重妻子的意见。"]],["humidity","hju:'miditi","n. 湿气, 潮湿, 湿度\\n[计] 湿度",["The relative humidity is the difference between the maximum humidity and the actual humidity expressed in percentages.","It is not so much the heat as the humidity that makes me tired."],["",""]],["eternity","i'tә:niti","n. 永远, 来世, 不朽",["The two lovers swore to love each other for eternity.","Never knew before what eternity was made for. It is to give some of us a chance to learn German."],["两个恋人发誓永远相爱。","以前從來不知道永恆是為了什麼。它是為了給我們一些機會學習德語。"]],["martyr","'mɑ:tә","n. 烈士, 受苦者, 受难者\\nvt. 使成为烈士, 使受苦",["In a few moments you'll become either a holy martyr or a dead witch.","A holy martyr was depicted on the icon."],["",""]],["synagogue","'sinәgɒg","n. 犹太人集会, 犹太教会堂, 犹太教",["There's a synagogue on the other side of the street.","The medieval Jewish house of prayer in Buda now functions both as a museum and a synagogue."],["",""]],["ominous","'ɒminәs","a. 恶兆的, 不吉利的, 预兆的",["Somehow the silent snow, the waning traffic, the oncoming twilight, combined into a sense of ominous portent.","At the ominous word \"liberality\", Scrooge frowned, and shook his head, and handed the credentials back."],["",""]],["howl","haul","n. 嗥叫, 吠声, 号叫\\nvi. 狂吠, 咆哮, 呼啸\\nvt. 对...吼叫, 狂喊着说",["The north wind did howl relentlessly outside our window.","His voice was drowned out by the wraith's sudden howl."],["",""]],["pod","pɒd","n. 豆荚, (豆荚状的)保护性外壳, 扁豆形矿体\\nvt. 从豆荚中剥出\\nvi. 结豆荚",["These twin brothers are as alike as two peas in a pod.","He and his brother are like two peas in a pod."],["这两个双胞胎兄弟长得一模一样。","他跟哥哥一模一样。"]],["cricket","'krikit","n. 蟋蟀, 板球",["A caged cricket eats just as much as a free cricket.","That's not a cricket, that's a grasshopper."],["籠子裡的蟋蟀吃得跟野生的蟋蟀一樣多。","那不是蟋蟀。是蚂蚱！"]],["modernization",".mɒdәnai'zeiʃәn","n. 现代化",["Its modernization was far beyond my expectations.","In most cases, modernization is identified with Westernization."],["它現代化的程度遠遠超乎我的預料。",""]],["structured","","a. 有结构的\\n[计] 结构的",["Businesses are structured in different ways to meet different needs.","The corpus is not structured as a table but as a graph."],["",""]],["rotten","'rɒtn","a. 腐烂的, 恶臭的, 堕落的, 风化的, 虚弱的\\n[经] 腐烂的, 堕落的",["The trouble is not with impure politics, but that the whole game of politics is rotten.","Don't bother Mary; she's in a rotten mood at the moment."],["問題不是政治不純潔，而是整個政治博弈已經腐朽。","别打扰玛丽，她现在脾气不好。"]],["eligibility",".elidʒә'biliti","n. 适任, 合格\\n[法] 合格, 合格性",["The contest has very strict eligibility requirements.","The Defense Enrollment Eligibility Reporting System is also called DEERS."],["參賽條件非常嚴格。",""]],["acting","'æktiŋ","n. 演戏, 装腔作势\\na. 代理的, 演出用的, 起作用的",["The USA is acting like a terrorist force in the Middle East.","His acting is far from being perfect."],["美國在中東的行為如同恐怖主義勢力。","他的演技绝对有瑕疵。"]],["deceive","di'si:v","v. 欺骗, 行骗",["Nature never deceives us; it is always we who deceive ourselves.","It's wrong to deceive people, but worse to deceive yourself."],["自然从不会欺骗我们，骗我们的永远是我们自己。","欺騙別人是錯的, 但更糟的欺騙自己。"]],["coating","'kәutiŋ","n. 涂层, 上衣衣料\\n[计] 涂复, 涂层, 镀层, 敷层",["If you keep rubbing that, the coating will wear away.","The windshield wiper washed away the pollen coating the car's windows."],["",""]],["crane","krein","n. 鹤, 起重机\\nvt. 伸颈, 起重机起吊\\nvi. 伸颈看, 迟疑",["The crane, unlike the dog, has never dreamed of flying.","Teach me how to fold a paper crane. I forgot how to fold it."],["不像狗, 這隻鶴從來沒有夢想過飛翔。","教我怎么折纸鹤吧。我忘记怎么折了。"]],["ethanol","'eθәnәul","n. 乙醇, 酒精\\n[化] 乙醇",["Regina Anyango, owner of small food kiosk in Nairobi, uses ethanol fuel to prepare meals for customers. Her kitchen is free of fumes and smoke from charcoal use.","This volume of ethanol cannot completely dissolve 0.5 g of the white solid."],["雷吉娜安揚戈是奈洛比一家小吃攤的老闆，她用乙醇燃料為顧客準備餐點。她的廚房沒有木炭產生的煙霧與廢氣。",""]],["vodka","'vɒdkә","n. 伏特加酒\\n[化] 伏特加酒",["Tom is in the other room drinking vodka.","They gave him a glass of orange juice laced with vodka."],["Tom在別的房間喝伏特加。",""]],["farmhouse","'fɑ:mhaus","n. 农舍",["Tony ate his meals in the kitchen and he slept in a little room at the top of the farmhouse.","Tony and his mother arrived at the farmhouse and walked through the farmyard."],["",""]],["relic","'relik","n. 遗物, 遗迹, 纪念物, 遗风, 残留物",["The faithful believe that this relic is imbued with healing properties.","War is a disgusting relic of humanity's bestial past."],["",""]],["hype","haip","n. 大肆宣传；皮下注射",["Few fields have been more filled with hype than artificial intelligence.","Hype and fanfare greeted the U.S. launch of Microsoft's newest game."],["",""]],["lightweight","'laitweit","n. 不到平均重量的人/物, 轻量级, 无足轻重的人, 性格不够强的人\\na. 平均重量以下的, 重量轻的\\n[计] 轻便的, 轻量的",["Ms Sato is no lightweight. I just saw her neck three bottles of beer.","This titanium bicycle made in Italy is incredibly lightweight."],["",""]],["jeopardy","'dʒepәdi","n. 危难, 危险\\n[法] 危险, 危难, 危险处境",["I'm afraid going into their yard will put me in jeopardy.","Without fuel, the lives of countless patients are put in jeopardy."],["",""]],["offseason","ɔ:f'si:zn","n. 淡季",["Players train hard even during the offseason."],["球員在休賽季也努力訓練。"]],["vie","vai","vi. 争, 竞争, 争胜\\nvt. 提出...来竞争, 以...作较量",["I prefer your eau de vie to your conversation.","\"Around, from far and near, / the Trojans throng, and vie the captive youth to jeer.\""],["",""]],["programmer","'prәugræmә","n. 程序员\\n[计] 程序设计员; 程序员",["A good programmer will influence everyone around him.","I want to be a computer programmer."],["一个好的程序员会影响他身边的每一个人。","我想做一个程序员。"]],["faded","'feidid","a. 已褪色的, 已凋谢的",["Most of the words are faded, but it's still possible to extrapolate the meaning from these sentences.","He faded into the fog like the memory of a ghost long forgotten."],["大部分的字跡已經褪色，但仍可從這些句子中推敲出含意。",""]],["crow","krәu","n. 啼叫, 乌鸦, 鸡鸣, 撬棍\\nvi. 啼叫, 报晓",["The politician had to take back his words and eat crow.","The movie star ate crow many times because of all the thoughtless things she said."],["",""]],["variability",".vєәriә'biliti","n. 易变, 变化性, 变异性\\n[化] 可变性; 变异性",["Herbal supplements sold in drugstores have poor quality control and high content variability.","Farmers have to get used to dealing with the variability of the weather."],["",""]],["empowerment","ɪm'paʊəmənt","n. 授权; 许可",["Empowerment of girls is a major theme in movies today.","Stereotypical beliefs about femininity hinder women's empowerment and limit their opportunities for growth."],["",""]],["footprint","'futprint","n. 足迹\\n[计] 印迹",["The ecological footprint of a country is closely related to its level of economic development.","Judging by the size of this footprint, I'd say the perp is about six feet tall."],["生態印跡與一國的經濟發展程度密切相關。",""]],["churn","tʃә:n","n. 搅乳器\\nv. 搅拌, 搅动",["If you churn goat milk, you'll get sour milk and butter.","I know the farmer is trying to churn milk for everyone."],["",""]],["materialize","mә'tiәriәlaiz","vt. 赋予实质, 使体现, 物质化\\nvi. 成有形, 体现, 实现",["If you worked hard, great things would materialize.","It's not like I can materialize there. I will just have to be late."],["",""]],["unfinished",".ʌn'finiʃt","a. 未完成的",["Grandma Ling died with unfinished business. It is said that to this day no one has dared to live in that house.","Leaving something unfinished is the worst thing you can do."],["玲奶奶死的不瞑目。流传说那栋房子至今未人敢入住。","半途而废是你所能做的最糟糕的事情。"]],["irregular","i'regjulә","n. 不规则物, 不合规格之物\\na. 不规则的, 不整齐的, 不合法的",["I don't like learning irregular verbs.","An irregular galaxy has an undefined shape and is full of young stars, dust, and gas."],["我不喜欢学习不规则动词。",""]],["anguish","'æŋgwiʃ","n. 剧痛, 痛苦\\nvt. 使极痛苦\\nvi. 感到痛苦",["The newspaper told of the mother's anguish at the death of her son.","Gazing up into the darkness I saw myself as a creature driven and derided by vanity; and my eyes burned with anguish and anger."],["",""]],["decree","di'kri:","n. 法令, 判决, 天意\\nvt. 颁布, 判决\\nvi. 发布命令",["Spirits of Heaven and Earth, heed my call; manifest swiftly by divine decree!","The decree of a president of the republic expires with an end to the state of emergency."],["天靈靈，地靈靈；急急如律令！",""]],["abstraction","æb'strækʃәn","n. 抽象化, 心不在焉, 空想, 提炼, 抽象派作品\\n[化] 提取; 抽取; 夺取; 夺取反应; 除去",["The use of abstraction in computer programming allows us to create and understand the behavior of very complex software.","It has been said that the principal utility of abstraction is as an instrument in ratiocination."],["",""]],["transitional","træn'siʒәnl","a. 变迁的, 过渡期的\\n[医] 转变的, 过渡的; 过渡型单核白细胞",["A Transitional Council official told the press that he expects oil production to reach 1.6 million barrels per day within a year.","The term \"Sattelzeit\" denotes the transitional period between the early modern age and the late modern age."],["",""]],["collaborator","kә'læbәreitә","n. 合干者, 合作者, 通敌者\\n[法] 合作者, 协助者, 勾结者",["Despite rumors to the contrary, George Soros was not a Nazi collaborator.","Berkofsky's focus now is a posthumous tribute to his friend and frequent collaborator, Alan Hovhaness."],["",""]],["downturn","'dauntә:n","n. (尤指经济方面的)衰退, 下降趋势\\n[电] 低迷时期",["The best companies are usually investing during an economic downturn.","Today, my mood has taken a downturn and I feel worse than I did yesterday."],["",""]],["indefinitely","","adv. 无期限地",["Our manager agreed to let us work from home indefinitely with the proviso that we attend monthly meetings in person.","The Ko rule was introduced to prevent a game from being halted by repetitive moves which can go on indefinitely."],["",""]],["prominence","'prɒminәns","n. 突起, 突出, 显著, 突出物, 凸出\\n[医] 隆凸, 凸",["With the appearance of a promising new writer, the aging novelist fell from prominence.","His chin had the prominence and squareness which mark the man of determination."],["",""]],["commanding","kә'mɑ:ndiŋ","a. 指挥的, 威风凛凛的, 居高临下的",["The commanding officer led his army into enemy territory.","The commanding officer marched, with soldiers following behind."],["",""]],["butcher","'butʃә","n. 屠夫, 肉商, 小贩\\nvt. 屠宰, 屠杀",["But the butcher is observing the holiday today, there's nothing we can do about it.","The butcher knife is in the drawer."],["可是肉店今天公休沒辦法。","屠夫的刀子在抽屉里。"]],["lesion","'li:ʒәn","n. 损害, 身体上的伤害\\n[医] 损害",["After the accident, he suffered a lesion of the spinal cord causing partial paralysis.","Tom suffers from a skin lesion on his back."],["",""]],["temperament","'temprәmәnt","n. 气质, 性格, 性情\\n[医] 气质, 禀赋",["What a temperament! If I didn't know he was Norwegian, I would think he was Italian.","Solvency is entirely a matter of temperament and not of income."],["",""]],["thankful","'θæŋkfәl","a. 感谢的, 感激的, 欣慰的",["I am thankful to have been given the experience of life.","When a native speaker tries to help me sound more like a native speaker, I'm thankful."],["我很感激我能夠領受到這樣的人生體驗。",""]],["muster","'mʌstә","n. 召集, 集合, 检阅, 清单, 花名册, 样品\\nvt. 召集, 集合, 应召\\nvi. 集合, 集中",["That's me - the coward unable to muster his courage and find out the truth.","I did that with as much enthusiasm as I could muster."],["",""]],["democratization","","n. 民主化\\n[法] 民主化",["Tebboune is working for the democratization of Algeria but he's facing daunting challenges.","Even with the democratization of the whole of Algeria, Kabyle people will always be a hated minority."],["",""]],["promoter","prә'mәutә","n. 促进者, 助长者\\n[化] 助催化剂",["Tom fired his promoter, as attendance at his concerts had dropped sharply.","Cheerfulness is the best promoter of health and is as friendly to the mind as to the body."],["",""]],["cannon","'kænәn","n. 大炮, 加农炮\\nv. 炮轰",["The sound of a kiss is not so loud as that of a cannon, but its echo lasts a deal longer.","We began to pound the enemy positions with cannon fire."],["",""]],["oblivious","ә'bliviәs","a. 遗忘的, 健忘的, 不知不觉的\\n[法] 忘却的, 健忘的, 不在意的",["She was so preoccupied that she was oblivious of her surroundings.","My father is oblivious to the emotional pain his abuse caused me."],["",""]],["narcotic","nɑ:'kɒtik","n. 麻醉药, 镇静剂\\na. 麻醉的, 催眠的",["Prostitution, gambling, the use of narcotic substances, drunkenness, disorder, and all other illegal activities are STRICTLY FORBIDDEN.","She lay as if under the influence of a narcotic, so still that her breathing could scarcely be distinguished."],["严禁卖淫嫖娼，赌博，吸毒，酗酒滋事等违法犯罪活动！",""]],["bodily","'bɒdili","a. 身体的\\nadv. 亲自",["Ebola spreads from person to person through bodily fluids.","While you are asleep, the bodily functions slow down and body temperature falls."],["埃博拉通過體液在人與人之間傳播。",""]],["multitude","'mʌltitju:d","n. 多数, 群众",["It is a great joy to see your own sentences translated into a multitude of other languages.","The mandatory character of schooling is rarely analyzed in the multitude of works dedicated to the study of the various ways to develop within children the desire to learn."],["看到你自己的句子被翻译成多种语言是一件很开心的事情。","許多著作都致力於研究開發小孩學習慾望的方式，但其中很少會有作品分析學校教育的強制性角色。"]],["knit","nit","v. 编织, 结合",["Vanessa loves to knit hats, scarves, and mittens in rainbow colors.","Tom tried to convince Mary to knit him a scarf."],["Vanessa喜欢针织彩虹色的帽子、围巾和连指手套。","湯姆想說服瑪麗給他織一條圍巾。"]],["vault","vɒ:lt","n. 拱顶, 窖, 地下室, 撑竿跳, 穹窿\\nvt. 做成圆拱形, 撑竿跳过\\nvi. 成穹状弯曲, 跳跃",["If you look up, you'll see ornate decorations all over the vault of the church.","He was allegedly seduced by her into giving the key to the vault."],["",""]],["chilly","'tʃili","a. 寒冷的, 冷淡的, 不友好的\\n[建] 番椒, 冷",["My room is really good, though a little bit chilly.","The homeless sought shelter from the chilly shower."],["",""]],["performing","pә'fɒ:miŋ","a. 表演的, 履行的",["Jimmy is to some extent capable of performing this operation.","The subject of a sentence is usually a person or a thing performing the action shown by the verb."],["",""]],["degrade","di'greid","v. (使)降级, (使)退化",["The technical infrastructure had started to degrade quite a bit.","After years of disrepair, the building had begun to degrade."],["",""]],["cloak","klәuk","n. 斗蓬, 大氅, 掩护\\nvt. 遮掩, 隐匿, 使披斗蓬",["The Master saw no hardship in passing the night by the hall fire, wrapt in his campaign-cloak.","Under the cloak of anonymity, cowards are acting like bigmouths."],["",""]],["drummer","'drʌmә","n. 鼓手, 旅行推销员\\n[经] 跑街, 旅行商人, 旅行销货人",["Tom said he wanted to replace the drummer in his band.","The drummer grabbed the drumsticks and made the music start."],["",""]],["vitality","vai'tæliti","n. 活力, 生命力\\n[医] 生机, 活力, 生活",["My brother had a great deal of vitality for his age.","Russian folk dances, like the energetic Lezginka, embody the vitality of the nation's culture."],["",""]],["playful","'pleiful","a. 爱打趣的, 多趣的, 开玩笑的, 嬉戏的",["Be mindful of your actions when in a relationship.What may seem playful to you could really be harmful to your partner.","The dolphin is an intelligent and playful creature."],["请小心地呵护两人之间的感情。也许当你认为只是一个玩笑时，却真真切切地伤了对方的心。",""]],["mildly","'maildli","adv. 柔和地, 和善地, 适度地",["Famed for its strong, yet delicate, aroma, Kampot pepper can range from intensely spicy to mildly sweet.","He laid down into the grass in this mildly warm and clear day."],["",""]],["convoy","'kɒnvɒi. kәn'vɒi","n. 护送, 护卫\\nvt. 护航, 护送",["We need to arrange an ambush and destroy the convoy.","The convoy of army trucks was blocking the road."],["",""]],["cumulative","'kju:mjulәtiv","a. 累积的\\n[医] 蓄积的, 累积的",["The graph shows the cumulative interest as a function of time.","Lost sleep has a cumulative effect, I've been told."],["",""]],["lag","læg","n. 落后, 囚犯, 迟延, 桶板, 防护套\\na. 最后的\\nvi. 落后, 蹒跚, 缓缓而行, 滞后\\nvt. 落后于, 押往监狱, …",["We should read the newspaper so as not to lag behind the times.","I feel exhausted because of jet lag."],["我們應該讀报紙，不落後於時代。","我因為時差而感到疲憊。"]],["nylon","'nailɒn","n. 尼龙\\n[化] 尼龙; 聚酰胺纤维",["Soft wool is more expensive than coarse wool and both are superior to synthetics made of nylon.","In heavy rain a light nylon tent is drier with a fly."],["",""]],["disruptive","dis'rʌptiv","a. 分裂的, 破坏(性)的\\n[计] 击穿的, 中断的",["Working shifts can be extremely disruptive to family life.","Lately that student has been disruptive in class. Honestly it's beginning to worry me."],["",""]],["mixing","'miksiŋ","n. 混合, 混频\\n[计] 混合",["We have ninety minutes to carry the concrete from the mixing plant to the worksite.","He made the soup by mixing a little meat with some rice."],["",""]],["flank","flæŋk","n. 侧面, 侧腹, 胁, 腰窝肉\\nvt. 攻击侧面, 守侧面\\nvi. 侧面与...相接",["The palace has two wings, which flank a court of honor. Rows of columns join them with the main building.","We'll attack their southern flank here, here, and here."],["",""]],["diploma","di'plәumә","n. 文凭, 毕业证书\\n[医] 文凭",["The principal presented each of the graduates with diploma.","Tom said that he didn't have a high school diploma."],["校长向每个毕业生颁发了毕业证书。",""]],["unconstitutional","'ʌnkɔnsti'tju:ʃәnәl","a. 违反宪法的, 不符合宪法的\\n[法] 违反宪法的, 违宪的, 不合宪法规定的",["The opposition has decried the law as unconstitutional.","The state court effected unconstitutional legislation without the federal government noticing."],["",""]],["lash","læʃ","n. 鞭子, 鞭打, 睫毛, 责骂, 讽刺\\nvt. 鞭打, 摆动, 扎捆, 冲击, 讽刺, 煽动\\nvi. 冲洗, 鞭打, 责骂",["Don't lash out at me just because my brother treated you badly.","The sea waves lash incessantly against the cliffs."],["",""]],["outskirts","'autskә:ts","n. 近郊, 市郊",["Yanni lives on the outskirts of Algiers.","My house is on the outskirts of town."],["亞妮住在阿爾及爾的郊區","我的家在那座城市的郊外."]],["abide","ә'baid","vi. 停留, 遵守, 居留, 继续下去\\nvt. 忍受, 经受, 屈从于",["My parents teach me to abide by my promises.","I cannot abide to see such cruelty."],["父母教育我要遵守承诺。","我不忍目睹这种残酷的行径。"]],["thai","tai","n. 泰国人, 泰语",["Thai is the official language of Thailand.","Thai Air celebrates its 50th anniversary this year."],["泰语是泰国的官方语言。",""]],["enclose","in'klәuz","vt. 围绕, 圈起, 放入封套, 附上",["In accordance with your request, I enclose a picture of myself.","With regard to your letter of July 22nd, I enclose our most recent catalogue."],["",""]],["accumulation","ә.kju:mju'leiʃәn","n. 积聚, 累积, 积聚物\\n[医] 蓄积, 累积",["A cloud is an accumulation of water vapour in the sky.","Freckles are caused by the accumulation of melanocytes in a small area."],["",""]],["insulation",".insju'leiʃәn. 'insә-","n. 绝缘；隔离, 孤立",["They developed a biodegradable product that could replace man-made insulation.","The disadvantage of excellent insulation is that it quickly leads to overheating."],["",""]],["fluctuation",".flʌktʃu'eiʃәn","n. 变动, 波动, 动摇\\n[化] 涨落; 起伏; 波动; 脉动",["This time of year we experience a high fluctuation of insects in the house.","The fluctuation in prices caused a financial crisis."],["",""]],["darken","'dɑ:kn","vt. 弄暗, 使模糊\\nvi. 暗下来, 颜色变深",["You should darken the colours a little.","The jealousy is starting to darken Tom's mind."],["",""]],["imprison","im'prizn","vt. 使下狱, 关闭, 拘禁, 限制\\n[法] 关押, 监禁, 限制",["Tyrannical governments frequently imprison their political opponents.","It is an absurd cruelty to imprison birds and wild animals. They have souls and the right to be free."],["",""]],["irritate","'iriteit","vt. 激怒, 使发怒, 使兴奋, 使发炎\\nvi. 引起不快",["Tom's negative attitude is beginning to irritate me.","People who say \"That's how it's always been\" irritate me the most."],["",""]],["flare","'flєә","n. 闪光, 闪耀\\nvi. 闪光, 闪耀\\nvt. 用发光信号发出, 使闪耀, 使张开",["There was a flare-up between local residents and state regulators.","We thought Mary and Tom were lost at sea but then we saw the distress flare."],["",""]],["momentarily","'mәumәntәrili","adv. 暂时地, 立刻, 随时地",["I must have stolen it when I lost control of myself momentarily.","Lorenzo momentarily left the party to check his apartment."],["",""]],["retaliation","ri.tæli'eiʃәn","n. 报复\\n[法] 报仇, 报复, 回敬",["Threats of retaliation are blocking negotiations.","He carried out an act of retaliation."],["",""]],["tasty","'teisti","a. 好吃的, 可口的",["Slice the kale, and add it to a pan, with olive oil, garlic, salt and pepper, and wait until it is soft and tasty.","Even if that restaurant did very tasty food, I wouldn't like to eat there."],["將羽衣甘藍切片，放入鍋中，加入橄欖油、大蒜、鹽和胡椒，煮至軟嫩可口。","即使那家饭馆做的菜好吃极了，我也不想在那里吃饭。"]],["crushed","","a. 压碎的, 倒碎的",["It's better for me to sit on the train than to be crushed.","Tom's foot was once crushed by a woman wearing high heels in the train."],["我坐在火車上總還是比掉到火車底下要好。",""]],["cape","keip","n. 岬, 海角, 披肩, 斗蓬",["Cape Dezhnev is 30 miles south of the Arctic Circle.","Cape Horn, located at the southern tip of South America, is one of the most treacherous sailing passages in the world."],["",""]],["unpopular","'ʌn'pɔpjulә","a. 不得人心的, 不受欢迎的, 不流行的",["The unpopular politician was frequently given the razz by the crowd during his speech.","From the moment Mary became the boss, she made herself very unpopular with her subordinates."],["",""]],["worsen","'wә:sn","vt. 使更坏, 使恶化\\nvi. 变得更坏, 恶化",["They were apprehensive that the situation would worsen.","Thank goodness it didn't worsen. But please don't push yourself yet."],["",""]],["haircut","'hєәkʌt","n. 理发, (男子的)发式",["Tom has gone to get a haircut, but he should be back soon.","Tom went to get a haircut, but he will be back soon."],["湯姆去理髮了，但是他很快就會回來。","湯姆去理髮了，但是他很快就會回來。"]],["archaeology",".ɑ:ki'ɒlәdʒi","n. 考古学",["In archaeology, it is important to keep findings intact and undamaged.","Archaeology studies human culture by examining the ancient objects found buried such as pottery and tools."],["",""]],["devour","di'vauә","vt. 吞食, 挥霍, 吞没",["However, I can't help noticing, at this moment, that at first glance it seems inevitable that the shark will devour the man.","I enjoy reading so much that I devour a book a week."],["",""]],["aged","'eidʒid","a. 老的, 陈的, 有...岁的\\n[化] 老化的; 老化了的; 陈化的; 陈化了的",["My father aged a lot since last year.","The two boys, aged respectively fourteen and sixteen, were dressed in the army uniform, and wore gold-lace sergeant's chevrons upon their sleeves."],["我爸和去年比老了不少。","这两个男孩，一个14岁、一个16岁，都穿着军队制服，衣袖上佩戴着镶金色蕾丝边的中士袖章。"]],["hefty","'hefti","a. 重的, 肌肉发达的",["After receiving a hefty blow to the head, the man spoke only gibberish.","Ziri was offered a hefty scholarship to any college in the country."],["",""]],["parasite","'pærәsait","n. 寄生生物, 寄生虫, 食客\\n[医] 寄生物; 寄生胎",["The brain may be regarded as a kind of parasite of the organism, a pensioner, as it were, who dwells with the body.","In lab experiments, when researchers blocked that pore the parasite stopped growing and eventually died."],["",""]],["chosen","'tʃouzn","choose的过去分词",["My beloved is white and ruddy, chosen out of thousands.","I had the good fortune to be chosen."],["我所爱的是白皙红润，千里挑一的。","我很幸運，被選中了。"]],["simplify","'simplifai","vt. 单一化, 简单化",["Simplify your life. Take advice from native speakers.","Algeria needs to simplify its investment regulations."],["",""]],["cock","kɒk","n. 公鸡, 雄禽, 龙头, 头目, 锥形小干草堆\\nvt. 使耸立, 使竖起, 堆成锥形小干草堆\\nvi. 大摇大摆地走, 翘起",["The landlord told me a cock and bull story about why we didn't have heat for three days.","If you go drinking with Tom, be prepared to listen to some pretty outlandish cock and bull stories."],["",""]],["thicken","'θikәn","vi. 变浓, 变厚, 变得模糊, 变为复杂\\nvt. 使变厚, 加强, 使模糊",["This braised pork is still too watery. Cook it for another ten minutes to thicken the sauce, so the flavor sticks to the meat.","Let the sauce thicken first, but keep an eye on it and keep stirring."],["這滷肉還是太稀了，再煮十分鐘，讓湯汁濃稠一些，這樣味道才能更好地留在肉上。",""]],["yep","jep","adv. 是（美国俚语=yes）",["Ahhh! Feel that beer seep into every fiber of my being. Yep, nothing beats a cold one after work.","Sideburns mismanaged. Forgetting to wash hair. Mind wandering. Yep, you're a total nerd."],["",""]],["handkerchief","'hæŋkәtʃif","n. 手帕, 头巾, 围巾",["He wiped his hands on a handkerchief.","She folded her handkerchief neatly."],["他用手帕把手抹乾淨。","她整齊地把她的手帕折好。"]],["noticeable","'nәutisәbl","a. 显而易见的, 显著的, 值得注意的",["There are noticeable differences between the two.","This is what is left of the windshield chip. It's barely noticeable."],["两者之间有显著的差别。",""]],["sensory","'sensәri","a. 知觉的, 感觉的, 传递感觉的\\n[医] 感觉的",["This means that our perception of any situation depends only partly on sensory signals being received at that time.","It is hard, perhaps even impossible, to define normal sensory perception."],["",""]],["complementary",".kɒmpli'mentәri","a. 补充的, 补足的\\n[经] 补足的, 补充的",["It is likely that these two consonants are in complementary distribution.","The important point concerning the complementary distribution is to specify the environment where the individual sounds occur."],["",""]],["envy","'envi","n. 羡慕, 嫉妒\\nvt. 羡慕, 嫉妒",["Is it true that your family will travel in Hokkaido? I envy you.","I don't envy your life. Not even a little bit."],["你们家去北海道旅游是真的么？我羡慕你。","我一点也不羡慕你的生活。"]],["dictionary","'dikʃәnәri","n. 字典, 词典\\n[计] 词典",["In a dictionary like this one there should be at least two sentences with \"fridge\".","All students of English should have a good English-English dictionary at hand."],["這樣的字典最少也應該有兩句「冰箱」的例句吧。","所有學英語的學生應該隨手有一本好的英英詞典。"]],["rove","rәuv","n. 徘徊, 粗纺, 流浪\\nvt. 漂泊于, 漫游于\\nvi. 流浪, 飘忽不定\\nreeve的过去式和过去分词",["Sojourner, the size of a microwave oven, demonstrated in 1997 that a robot could rove on the Red Planet."],[""]],["curiously","'kjuәriәsli","adv. 好奇地",["Curiously, a flower bloomed on the withered up tree.","Benedito raised an eyebrow as his billy goat sniffed curiously at a clump of rocks."],["",""]],["radiate","'reidieit","vt. 放射, 散发, 辐射, 传播, 广播\\nvi. 发光, 辐射, 流露\\na. 有射线的, 辐射状的",["Ripples continue to radiate outward long after the stone that produced them has sunk to the bottom of the pond.","The animals radiate calm, making them popular with therapy groups."],["",""]],["whereby","(h)weә'bai","adv. 靠什么, 如何, 为何, 靠那个, 因此, 由此\\n[法] 因此, 由是",["Act only according to that maxim whereby you can at the same time will that it should become a universal law.","Scientists say a new geologic epoch has begun whereby humans are causing major damage to global water systems."],["",""]],["pry","prai","n. 杠杆, 窥探, 好奇者\\nvi. 打听, 窥探\\nvt. 撬动, 撬开, 费力得到",["They tried to use an iron bar to pry open the lock.","Don't pry into the affairs of others."],["他们试图用一根铁棒撬开锁。","不要探听别人的事。"]],["dresser","'dresә","n. 化妆台, (剧团)服装师, 碗柜\\n[医] 敷裹员",["The hair dresser is cutting the hair with scissors.","The teacher is counted the best dresser in our school."],["理发师正在用剪刀剪头发。",""]],["denomination","di.nɒmi'neiʃәn","n. 名称, 教派, 面额\\n[经] 票面金额, 名称, (度量衡)",["Our denomination practices exclusive psalmody in worship.","When developing an ecumenical service, take care not to offend members of any denomination."],["",""]],["consolidation","kәn.sɒli'deiʃәn","n. 巩固, 团结, 合并, 加强\\n[医] 实变",["The consolidation of the industry continues with today's acquisition.","Certain drugs, like alcohol, can prevent or hinder memory consolidation."],["",""]],["customary","'kʌstәmәri","a. 习惯的, 惯常的\\n[经] 通常的, 习惯的",["In Asian culture it's customary to take one's shoes off before entering a house or temple.","When you go abroad, you'd better keep in mind that tipping is customary."],["在亚洲文化里，习惯在进一个房子或一座寺庙前先脱鞋子。",""]],["stigma","'stigmә","n. 耻辱, 污名, 烙印\\n[医] 柱头; 小孔, 眼点; 气孔; 小斑; 特征",["We have to try to do away with the stigma behind many of society's ills. Shaming will only make things worse.","The persisting stigma of leprosy often presents a barrier to otherwise highly effective medical treatment."],["",""]],["bitterly","'bitәli","adv. 怨恨地, 悲痛地, 残酷地",["Nakamatsu smiled bitterly at his own stupid question.","Japanese and American forces were still fighting bitterly."],["中松为自己的愚蠢问题苦笑。",""]],["mystical","'mistikl","a. 神秘的, 奥秘的",["I have often admired the mystical way of Pythagoras, and the secret Magic of numbers.","The sway of alcohol over mankind is unquestionably due to its power to stimulate the mystical faculties of human nature."],["",""]],["humane","hju:'mein","a. 有人情的, 人道的, 仁慈的",["Solidarity is the driving motor of an intact and humane community.","Knowledge in itself is not an end, but a means to an end: to live a full and humane life."],["",""]],["grate","^reit","n. 炉格, 炉篦, 炉栅, 火炉, 壁炉, 格栅\\nvt. 装格栅于, 磨擦, 轧碎, 磨碎, 使焦急, 触怒, 使人烦躁, 刺激, 激…",["Dan entered the facility through a damaged metal grate.","Tom's wide-eyed optimism is beginning to grate on my nerves."],["",""]],["metallic","mi'tælik","a. 金属的, 含金属的, 产生金属的\\n[经] 金属的",["Those huge metallic boxes you see in the ship are called by the name of containers.","Tea, drunk from a new thermos, tastes a little metallic."],["",""]],["boycott","'bɒikɒt","n. 联合抵制\\nvt. 联合抵制",["We have the right to boycott the products coming from the occupied territories.","Kabyle people boycott Algerian elections every time."],["",""]],["skim","skim","vt. 撇取浮沫, 略读, 掠过\\nvi. 擦过, 浏览\\nn. 脱脂乳, 擦过, 表层物\\na. 撇去浮沫的",["Skim through this pamphlet before you take the examination for our company.","I'll try giving the book \"Reiko's Recommended\" a quick skim read on the spot."],["",""]],["referee",".refә'ri:","n. 仲裁人, 调解人, 裁判员\\nv. 仲裁, 裁判",["The referee blew the whistle and called a hand ball on him.","Messi was very close to scoring a goal, but the referee blew his whistle to say that he was offside."],["裁判吹响了口哨，判定他手球。","梅西差一点就进球了，但裁判吹哨说他越位。"]],["pudding","'pudiŋ","n. 布丁",["Roast beef is usually accompanied by Yorkshire pudding.","Spotted dick is a British pudding made with suet and dried fruit."],["",""]],["digit","'didʒit","n. 数字, 位数, 指头\\n[计] 数位; 位",["Anybody with at least a two-digit IQ knows this was a politically biased choice.","Many people who are not good in mathematics associate any two-digit number with a person's age."],["",""]],["alas","ә'læs","interj. 唉",["Many of our pioneers are still alive... but, alas, many of them aren't alive any more.","I have fond memories of whipped cream. Alas, my new diet won't allow it."],["我們的先驅者中許多還活著...但是，唉，其中有許多已經死了。",""]],["intuition",".intju:'iʃәn","n. 直觉, 直觉的知识",["By intuition he knew she was lying.","My intuition tells me that Tom is not responsible for this mess."],["他凭直觉发现她在撒谎。",""]],["deceased","di'si:st","a. 已故的\\nn. 死者",["A monument has been erected to the memory of the deceased.","I'm not a ghost-writer, I'm the ghost of a deceased writer."],["",""]],["accustomed","ә'kʌstәmd","a. 惯常的, 习惯了的",["He quickly accustomed himself to his new surroundings.","It took a long time for me to get accustomed to the Venezuelan accent."],["他很快就适应了新环境。","我花了好长时间才适应了委内瑞拉的口音。"]],["reckon","'rekәn","vt. 计算, 总计, 估计, 认为, 猜想\\nvi. 数, 计算, 估计, 依赖, 料想",["The rescue flight had to reckon with strong winds and freezing temperatures.","Reckon the cost before you decide to purchase the car."],["",""]],["canon","'kænәn","n. 教会法规, 圣典, 准则, 标准, 教士\\n[医] 规范, [加农]炮",["The energy of his lines and the rawness of his strokes place him firmly in the modern art canon.","Nicolaus Copernicus studied canon law at the university of Bologna."],["",""]],["restrictive","ri'striktiv","a. 限制的, 约束的, 限定的\\nn. 限制词",["This kind of restrictive legislation is bound to hobble the economy.","I find the concept of Globish restrictive and unreal."],["",""]],["granddaughter","'^rændɔ:tә(r)","n. 孙女, 外孙女",["My granddaughter has a lot of skill at taking pictures.","Along comes the grandmother and sees her granddaughter."],["",""]],["sociologist",".sәusi'ɒlәdʒist","n. 社会学家\\n[法] 社会学家",["The sociologist has a habit of scratching his back.","Liquid love is a concept created by sociologist Zygmunt Bauman concerning the fragility of human bonds in postmodernity."],["",""]],["dissatisfaction","'dis.sætis'fækʃәn","n. 不满, 不平",["The residents expressed their dissatisfaction at the noise.","Her remarks caused dissatisfaction in the public."],["居民們對噪音表示了不滿。","她的言論引起了輿論的不滿。"]],["eccentric","ik'sentrik","n. 怪人, 偏心圆\\na. 古怪的, 反常的, 不同圆心的",["Prof. Smith is famous for his eccentric life style.","Many scientists have the reputation of being eccentric."],["",""]],["silicon","'silikәn","n. 硅\\n[化] 硅Si",["Powders of aluminium, magnesium, silicon, etc. explode.","Silicon Roundabout is home to a large number of IT start-ups."],["",""]],["transparency","træns'pærәnsi","n. 透明, 透明度, 透过性, 透明物, 清晰\\n[计] 透明性; 透明",["Candidness and transparency, information and communication are the basis of mutual trust.","Transparency promotes accountability and provides information for citizens about what their Government is doing."],["",""]],["refrigerate","ri'fridʒәreit","vt. 使冷却, 使清凉, 冷藏\\n[机] 冷冻",["I had failed to refrigerate the milk. It went so sour that it's inedible.","This product contains no preservatives. After opening, refrigerate and consume quickly."],["",""]],["charismatic",",kæriz'mætik","a. 魅力, 能吸引大众的非凡能力, 神授的能力, 领袖人物感人的超凡魅力",["You don't seem to be as charismatic as Tom seems to be.","She has finally been regarded by the nation as the most charismatic actress."],["",""]],["overhear",".әuvә'hiә","vt. 无意中听到, 偷听",["I didn't mean to eavesdrop, but I did overhear you.","Tom put his ear to the door in an effort to overhear what Mary was saying on the phone."],["",""]],["gracious","'greiʃәs","a. 亲切的, 慈善的",["It may not be natural for you, but at least try to be a little more gracious.","I was taken in by his good looks and gracious manners."],["",""]],["enthusiast","in'θju:ziæst","n. 热心家, 狂热者, 爱好者",["By installing two carburetors that racing-car enthusiast souped up his motor considerably.","A Senegalese drone enthusiast has been working with drones both in the photography and health sectors for years."],["",""]],["volcanic","vɒl'kænik","a. 火山的, 猛烈的\\nn. 火山岩",["The surface of the earth rose due to the volcanic activity.","Volcanic eruptions in Tonga have created a new island."],["",""]],["continuum","kәn'tinjuәm","n. 连续统一体, 连续统, 闭联集\\n[化] 连续区; 连续谱; 连续介质",["To be considered as a scale, the construct under consideration should be a continuum, with quantitative units.","Northern Berber is a continuum of dialects spoken in the northern part of North Africa."],["",""]],["damaged","'dæmidʒid","a. 被损坏的\\n[建] 损伤了的, 损坏了的",["The last three coaches of the train were badly damaged.","Some people only buy organic food; they think that in this way their body will not be damaged by pollutants."],["火車的尾三節車廂損壞得很嚴重。","一些人只买有机的食物，他们认为这样可以使他们的健康不受污染的损害。"]],["insurgency","in'sә:dʒәnsi","n. 叛乱状态, 发生暴动\\n[法] 暴动, 起义, 叛乱",["The mayor was killed in an ambush during the height of the insurgency.","Tom headed a guerrilla insurgency against French colonial rule."],["",""]],["entertainer",".entә'teinә","n. 表演娱乐节目的人, 演艺人员",["The man whose work it is to amuse people who attend a show is an entertainer.","Instead of making the difficult seem easy, as a professional entertainer should do, he actually makes the easy look difficult."],["",""]],["zoning","'zәuniŋ","n. 分区制\\n[医] 带现象(补体结合)",["I think I'm zoning out because I'm tired, so I'm going to take a break.","After water fasting, Tulugaq was zoning out and ready to eat a meal."],["",""]],["guided","'ɡaidid","a. 有指导的；有向导的",["According to the Bible, the Three Kings were guided to Jesus by a shining star.","The boy succeeded in his quest, guided by the spirit of a squirrel."],["",""]],["stink","stiŋk","n. 臭味, 臭气\\nvi. 发臭味, 名声臭\\nvt. 用臭味赶",["She is in a band called \"Durian Durian\", and they stink.","Guests are like fish - after three days they stink."],["",""]],["diversify","dai'vә:sifai","vt. 使多样化, 使变化",["Algeria needs to diversify its economy and attract foreign investments.","The government is attempting to diversify its industry and trade."],["",""]],["thickness","'θiknis","n. 厚度, 密度, 愚钝, 含混不清\\n[医] 厚度",["The thickness of a piece of meat is important for determining how long to cook it.","The steel sheet passes through the rolling train to achieve the desired thickness."],["",""]],["demeanor","di'mi:nә","行为, 品行, 举止",["I found his pretentious demeanor quite disconcerting.","I particularly noticed one young woman of humble dress, but interesting demeanor."],["",""]],["overthrow",".әuvә'θrәu","n. 推翻, 瓦解, 倾覆\\nvt. 打倒, 推翻, 倾覆",["They conspire to overthrow the oppressive government.","The Libyans seek to overthrow the current government in search of a better quality of life."],["",""]],["doctorate","'dɒktәrit","n. 博士头衔",["Entering the doctorate is going to be a great challenge.","Being admitted to the doctorate is going to be a great challenge."],["",""]],["tempting","'temptiŋ","a. 诱惑人的, 吸引人的",["Test pilots are constantly tempting fate.","I'm addicted to translating sentences from French into English on Tatoeba, and Spanish is tempting me sorely."],["试飞员总是在碰运气。",""]],["grumble","'grʌmbl","n. 怨言, 满腹牢骚\\nvi. 抱怨, 发牢骚, 发隆隆声\\nvt. 抱怨",["I wish you wouldn't grumble about doing the laundry.","I'm saying that if the real thing comes to her, Sekka won't have anything to grumble about."],["",""]],["quake","kweik","vi. 颤抖, 地震\\nn. 颤抖, 地震",["No major damage or injuries are known to have resulted from the quake measuring 3.0 on the Richter scale.","The Indonesia Meteorology and Geophysics Agency issued a tsunami warning following the quake, but lifted it two hours later."],["",""]],["reckless","'reklis","a. 不介意的, 大意的, 鲁莽的, 不顾后果的\\n[法] 不注意的, 粗心大意的, 鲁莽的",["If you swear reckless oaths, lightning will strike you.","It was reckless of her to trust him."],["乱发誓会遭雷劈的。","她比较鲁莽的相信了他。"]],["drawback","'drɒ:bæk","n. 缺点, 退税\\n[法] 退款, 退税",["Brilliant people have one major drawback - they don't know how to lose.","The only drawback of a high-frequency movement is extra wear and tear on the components."],["天才们有一个重要的缺点：他们不会输。",""]],["foreground","'fɒ:graund","n. 前景, 最显著的位置\\n[计] 前景, 前台",["The man in the background is my grandfather, and my father is in the foreground.","I usually keep the foreground color in my graphic design software set to white."],["",""]],["toxin","'tɒksin","n. 毒素\\n[化] 毒素",["The toxin that causes diphtheria is produced by a normally benign bacterium when infected with a certain virus.","Japanese scientists are trying to develop a new toxin-free solder that will not damage the groundwater."],["",""]],["freight","'freit","n. 船货, 运费, 货运\\nvt. 装货, 使充满, 以货运运送, 租(或出租)(船等)",["The locomotive was pulling a long line of freight cars.","The freight train was held up about half an hour because of a dense fog."],["",""]],["muffin","'mʌfin","n. 松饼",["Tom grabbed a coffee and muffin on his way to work.","She carefully scoops the batter into the muffin cups."],["",""]],["dazzling","'dæzliŋ","a. 眼花缭乱的, 耀眼的",["The noonday sun beat down with dazzling brightness on the tennis court.","It was as gloomy inside the mansion as the sunlight was dazzling outside."],["",""]],["vengeance","'vendʒәns","n. 复仇, 报仇\\n[法] 报仇, 复仇",["You killed my father, and today I'll have my vengeance.","If we don't take care of the environment, it'll take vengeance against us."],["你殺了我父親，我今天要為他報仇。",""]],["clout","klaut","n. 敲击, 破布\\nvt. 打补钉",["Unless you've done time in prison, you won't carry any clout in this crowd.","Tom doesn't have as much clout as he used to have."],["",""]],["glossy","'glɒ:si","a. 平滑的, 有光泽的",["This is the kind of gossip you usually find in a glossy magazine.","She sat in the shade, languishing in the heat and fanning herself with a glossy magazine."],["",""]],["mar","mɑ:","vt. 损毁, 损伤, 糟蹋\\nn. 三月",["That sum of money won't make or mar us.","\"Him on Idalia, lulled into a dream, / will I secrete, or on the sacred height / of lone Cythera, lest he learn the scheme, / or by his sudden presence mar the sleight.\""],["",""]],["athletics","æθ'letiks","n. 体育运动",["The Summer Olympics feature events such as athletics, swimming, and gymnastics.","Adil is very good at studying, but when it comes to athletics, he's a bit lousy."],["",""]],["heavyweight","'heviweit","n. 重量级拳击运动员, (非正式)有影响的要人\\na. 最重量级的",["With one glorious right hook, Punkin' Pie uncrowned the reigning heavyweight champion.","He will fight the heavyweight champion tomorrow."],["",""]],["ape","eip","n. 无尾猿\\n[计] 应用程序评价",["Ziri told Walid to stop walking around like an ape.","When a big ape emerged from the cave, they got frightened and ran away."],["",""]],["drastically","'dræstikәli","adv. 激烈地, 彻底地",["They monopolized the supply market and drastically raised prices.","Meanwhile, the circumstances have changed drastically."],["他們壟斷了原物料供應，並開天價。","在这期间，情况发生了巨大变化。"]],["salsa","'sɑ:lsә","n. 洋葱做的辣调味汁；萨尔萨舞曲",["The show's theme song sounded like a cross between J-pop and salsa, with a little bit of a 70's vibe thrown in for good measure.","Benedito and his date went to a salsa dancing class."],["",""]],["moth","mɒθ","n. 蛾害, 蛾, 乌头叶菜豆\\n[医] 蠹, 蛾",["This species of moth has evolved an ingenious camouflage for blending into its surroundings.","Maybe we can reuse the wool from this jacket that moth chewed up."],["",""]],["lighten","'laitn","vt. 照亮, 点亮, 减轻, 使轻松, 闪出\\nvi. 发亮, 打闪, 变轻",["Year in and year out in this place we have naught but these little haps to lighten our thoughts.","After their quarrel, my wife tried to make some jokes to lighten up the mood."],["",""]],["sprint","sprint","n. 短距离赛跑\\nvi. 全速跑, 冲刺\\nvt. 全速跑过",["During a sprint through the pedestrian precinct, I collided with a man eating a currywurst.","Ole Einar Bjoerndalen from Norway won the biathlon 10km sprint."],["",""]],["influx","'inflʌks","n. 流入, 河口, 汇集\\n[医] 注入, 流入",["The influx of foreign workers has caused a serious housing problem in this area.","The determining factor in question is whether this social welfare plan can facilitate the influx of immigrants."],["",""]],["ghetto","'getәu","n. 犹太人区",["The orcs live in a ghetto on the northeast side of the city.","The university is located a few blocks from the edge of the ghetto."],["",""]],["terrifying","'tәrifaiiŋ","a. 令人恐惧的；骇人的；极大的",["This kind of odour is really terrifying.","The laser cow in WHAT THE CAR? is both hilarious and terrifying!"],["这种气味真可怕。","《WHAT THE CAR?》中的雷射奶牛又好笑又嚇人！"]],["bacterial","bæk'tiәriәl","a. 细菌的\\n[医] 细菌的, [无芽胞]杆菌的",["She contracted a bacterial infection called Clostridium difficile which turned into sepsis.","Bacterial colonization of the intestine occurs after birth."],["",""]],["rooftop","'ru:ftɒp","n. 屋顶",["The swimming pool of this hotel is on the rooftop.","There's a great view from the rooftop of that building. Want to go see?"],["這個酒店的游泳池在樓頂。","那座大厦天台的景色很美的，想去看看嗎？"]],["sizable","'saizәbl","a. 相当大的, 大小相当的",["I remember that one time Erik, after finding out I had crashed into his car with my bike and left a sizable dent, kicked my ass.","He received a sizable advance for his book."],["",""]],["handicap","'hændikæp","n. 障碍, 困难, 不利条件\\nvt. 加障碍于, 妨碍",["Having no will is the worst handicap.","Layla didn't want her hijab to be a handicap for her."],["没有愿望是最大的障碍。",""]],["phony","'fәuni","n. 假货, 假冒者, 赝品\\na. 伪造的, 假的, 不可信的, 华而不实的",["That idiom is as phony as a coin with my face on it.","My mother says that the child's illnesses are phony."],["",""]],["hemisphere","'hemisfiә","n. 半球, 地球的半面, 大脑半球\\n[医] 半球",["Japan is located in the Northern Hemisphere.","Those animals can be seen in the northern hemisphere."],["日本位於北半球。",""]],["housewife","'hauswaif","n. 主妇, 家庭妇女",["The illusion of Layla as a normal housewife vanished.","This is a great time-saving gadget for the housewife."],["",""]],["apprentice","ә'prentis","n. 学徒, 生手\\nvt. 使做学徒",["He's your senior fellow apprentice.","There are currently more open apprentice positions than applicants."],["他是你的师兄。",""]],["cavalry","'kævәlri","n. 骑兵",["\"We have carried the day, Sir!\" exclaimed the adjutant to the general as the heavy cavalry smashed through the opposing lines.","The firefighters quickly realized they had to call in the cavalry to control the flames and start making them die down."],["",""]],["absorption","әb'sɒ:pʃәn","n. 吸收, 专心, 全神贯注\\n[化] 吸收; 吸收作用",["Light absorption is when the light hits a surface and is converted into energy.","In fact, the absorption enhancement that we see is in the range of 20 to 50 times the single-pass absorbance."],["",""]],["catfish","'kætfiʃ","n. 鲶鱼",["You apparently haven't known the pain of a catfish sting.","Mary refuses to eat catfish because she's allergic to cats."],["",""]],["piss","pis","vi. 小便, 下大雨, 抱怨\\nvt. 撒尿弄脏, 尿在...上\\nn. 小便",["She wouldn't even piss on me if I were on fire.","I've got work to do, so piss off and leave me alone."],["如果我有麻煩了, 她甚至不會理我。",""]],["outward","'autwәd","a. 向外的, 表面的, 外服的\\nadv. 向外, 在外, 表面",["No matter how we try, it is impossible to distinguish good people from bad people by outward appearances.","One cannot judge people only by their outward appearances."],["",""]],["supernatural",".sju:pә'nætʃәrәl","a. 超自然的, 神奇的\\n[医] 超自然的",["Totem poles consist of a group of figures that represent animals, birds, fish, mythological beings and supernatural beasts.","I don't know whether she believed me or not but in any case it seems she doesn't automatically dismiss talk of the supernatural."],["",""]],["allude","ә'lu:d","vi. 暗指, 提及",["In the early part of my study, I allude to work that had already been done on the psychology of crowd-control.","Statements from the summit will probably allude to avoidance of future health crises, measures to ease climate change and steps toward a \"green\" economy, Menon said."],["",""]],["epic","'epik","n. 史诗, 叙事诗\\na. 史诗的, 叙事诗的",["The Epic of Gilgamesh is considered the most ancient written narrative in history.","When he started dating, he experienced many epic failures."],["",""]],["furnishings","'fә:niʃiŋz","n. 家具；供应；穿戴用品（furnishing的复数）",["Yanni was admiring those beautiful antique furnishings.","The curtains don't go with the other furnishings."],["",""]],["rogue","rәug","n. 恶棍, 流氓, 小淘气\\nvt. 欺骗\\nvi. 游手好闲",["In the late 20th century, Yugoslavia was considered a rogue state by the United States.","A rogue asteroid from the Kuiper Belt is on a collision course with the Earth."],["在二十世紀末期，南斯拉夫被美國認為是一個流氓國家。",""]],["starving","","a. 挨饿的；饥饿的",["We should all help provide starving people with food.","Tom, would you please give these starving people something to eat?"],["我们应该尽量的提供一些食物给那些饥肠辘辘的人们.","汤姆你能给那些饥肠辘辘的人们一些吃的吗?"]],["seduce","si'dju:s","vt. 唆使, 怂恿, 引诱, 诱奸\\n[法] 勾引, 诱惑, 诱奸",["His vain efforts to seduce her showed he was barking up the wrong tree; she was a mother of two tots.","It took her eight frustrating hours to seduce the bookkeeper."],["",""]],["amaze","ә'meiz","vt. 使吃惊",["These kids never cease to amaze me. So much talent and such good music.","Your creativity never ceases to amaze me."],["",""]],["zoom","zu:m","n. 急速上升, 变焦摄影, 嗡嗡声\\nvi. 猛增, 急速上升, 摄象机移动\\nvt. 使摄象机移动\\n[计] 缩放",["I can't wait to play Dungeons and Dragons over Zoom this weekend.","Hold down the Ctrl-key and click + to zoom in or - to zoom out."],["",""]],["coax","kәuks","vt. 哄, 诱骗, 耐心地摆弄\\nvi. 哄骗\\n[计] 同轴电缆",["It still amazes me what she could coax out of table scraps.","The cork is jammed into the neck pretty bad. If you have a knife with a really thin blade, I might be able to coax it out."],["",""]],["seating","'si:tiŋ","n. 使就座, 就座, 座位",["I thought that if we lined up benches in the garden as well, we could achieve quite a seating capacity.","In the garden, you know. I'd like to put out benches and increase the customer seating. Like this ..."],["",""]],["entrepreneurial","ˌɒntrəprə'nɜ:rɪəl","a. 创业的, 具有企业精神的; 企业性质的",["Dependability is part of our entrepreneurial culture.","Where's your entrepreneurial spirit?"],["",""]],["cleric","'klerik","a. 牧师的, 教士的",["The eccentric Vatican cleric specializes in demonic possessions.","Together, a bard, a wizard, a cleric, a barbarian and a monk comprise the party."],["",""]],["affective","ә'fektiv","a. 情感的, 表达感情的\\n[医] 感情的, 情感的",["Around two to four per cent of Canadians suffer from Seasonal Affective Disorder.","Be careful! Affective dependency is not synonym for love!"],["",""]],["eh","ei","interj. 啊!嗯!是吗?好吗?\\n[医] 氧化还原电位",["Eh? We said we'd go to the park? I didn't realise.","\"Hey! It's dangerous to run here.\" \"Eh? ... A-a-Aaah!!\" \"Oh dear, what did I tell you?\""],["啊？我们说过要去公园吗？我没有印象。","「喂！這裏跑步很危險的。」「嗯？……啊、啊、啊！！」「唉，我剛才不是和你說了嗎？」"]],["wig","wig","n. 假发, 斥责\\nvt. 给...戴假发, 激怒, 使发狂\\nvi. 激动, 发狂",["With his colored clothes, his long wig and his white gloves, one could guess he has run away from some kind of Disneyland.","A tricorn trimmed with gold lace was set at a rakish angle over a wig of white curls that dropped down to his waist."],["",""]],["amenities","","n. 令人愉快之事物（amenity的复数）",["The Algerian government should prioritize the preservation of green spaces and public amenities.","Gustavo renovated the cabin to add modern amenities."],["",""]],["climber","'klaimә","n. 登山者\\n[电] 登杆器",["This famous mountain climber is a critic of mass tourism.","It turned out that the man who rescued Ziri was a professional climber."],["這位著名的登山家批評大眾旅遊。",""]],["normative","'nɒ:mәtiv","a. 合乎规范的, 标准的, 规范的\\n[法] 标准的, 规范的, 合乎规范的",["We present here our suggestions, which are not meant to be normative, but to serve as a starting point for future dialog.","This collection contains our personal stories, which are not meant to be normative."],["",""]],["renovate","'renәuveit","vt. 更新, 革新, 刷新, 修复, 使恢复活力",["We're of the same mind about how to renovate the house.","I don't know how much it cost him to renovate his house."],["",""]],["mutation","mju:'teiʃәn","n. 变化, 突变, 元音变化\\n[化] 突变",["There are no reports on this mutation because such a mutant wouldn't even be born.","Without the random mutation of genes there would be no evolution."],["",""]],["brutality","bru:'tæliti","n. 残忍, 无慈悲, 野蛮的行为",["The police brutality incidents nearly set off a riot.","If a man kills a tiger, they say it's sport. If a tiger kills a man, they say it's brutality."],["",""]],["electorate","i'lektәrit","n. 选民, 有选举权者, 选区\\n[法] 选民, 选举团, 选区",["The electorate is largely uninterested in the lackluster candidates.","The electorate will decide who becomes the next president."],["",""]],["grievance","'gri:vәns","n. 委屈, 冤情, 苦况\\n[经] 不满(对雇用条件的)",["Unfortunately if you have a problem with it, you'll have to follow the grievance procedure as outlined in the employee handbook.","I have a grievance about that. I believe it was unfair."],["",""]],["meteor","'mi:tiә","n. 流星, 大气现象",["If you have ever seen a \"falling star\", you were actually seeing a meteor.","It's only a matter of time before the meteor strikes."],["",""]],["minus","'mainәs","n. 负号, 不足\\na. 减的, 负的, 阴性的\\nprep. 减, 缺\\n[计] 负差",["The temperature outside was minus fifteen degrees, but the air conditioning was working perfectly.","The temperature went down to minus ten degrees centigrade last night."],["",""]],["rein","rein","n. 缰绳, 统治, 支配\\nvt. 驾驭, 以缰绳控制, 控制\\nvi. 勒住马",["Being a teacher, you must learn to keep a tight rein on your emotions.","We all have free rein on how each one of us want their life to be like."],["",""]],["attest","ә'test","vi. 证明, 表明, 作证\\nvt. 为...作证",["The fingerprints on the knife attest to her guilt.","Western Sahara is a region of Morocco, the majority of its inhabitants attest to this."],["",""]],["pneumonia","nju:'mәunjә","n. 肺炎\\n[医] 肺炎",["He's got pneumonia. No wonder he is coughing nonstop.","An operation on his throat helped him recover from the pneumonia, but it left him without his voice."],["他得了肺炎，难怪他在不停的咳嗽。",""]],["eyewitness","ai'witnis","n. 目击者, 见证人",["An eyewitness is worth more than ten auditory witnesses.","One eyewitness is worth more than ten people who have heard it told."],["",""]],["commercially","","adv. 商业上；通商上",["It's forbidden to use this information commercially.","Transceivers are used primarily, but not exclusively, commercially."],["",""]],["stuffed","","已经喂饱了的；塞满了的",["You can't get the suitcase closed because you've stuffed too much into it.","The secretary stuffed the letter into an envelope."],["你無法把這個手提箱關上，因為你已經塞了太多東西進去了。","秘書把信塞到了信封裡。"]],["duct","dʌkt","n. 管, 输送管\\nvt. 通过管道输送",["Yanni said he bought scissors, duct tape, screwdrivers, nails, screws, bolts, nuts, and the list went on and on and on.","If it moves and it shouldn't, use duct tape. If it doesn't move and it should, use WD-40."],["",""]],["pathogen","'pæθәdʒ(ә)n","n. 病原体\\n[医] 病原体",["Have I been exposed to the pathogen?"],[""]],["uniquely","","adv. 独特地；珍奇地",["As tectonic plates shifted, uniquely adapted species of dinosaur emerged on each continent through vicariance.","Boston is a city that uniquely combines history, culture, and modernity."],["隨著板塊的移動，各大洲因地理隔離而出現了適應不同環境的獨特恐龍物種。",""]],["cradle","'kreidl","n. 摇篮, 发祥地, 孩提时代\\nvt. 放在摇篮内, 抚育\\nvi. 刈割",["What is learned in the cradle is carried to the tomb.","The baby is sleeping in the cradle."],["幼年時學的東西，一輩子不會忘記。","嬰兒正在搖籃裡睡覺。"]],["monarch","'mɒnәk","n. 帝王, 统治者, 元首\\n[医] 单原型(植)",["Monarch butterflies, instantly recognizable by their gold and black markings, are found in many places around the world.","She was the only female monarch in the country's history."],["",""]],["helm","helm","n. 舵, 驾驶盘, 枢机, 头盔\\nvt. 给...掌舵, 指挥, 给...戴头盔",["This helm does not have very high protection, but it does have cool stat bonuses.","The captain stood abaft the helm, keeping a watchful eye on the horizon."],["",""]],["thriller","'θrilә","n. 使人激动的东西, 使人毛骨悚然的东西, 使人毛骨悚然的小说",["Our new serial thriller begins at 7.30 this evening.","This film was praised as a completely engaging thriller that works on almost every level."],["",""]],["pulp","pʌlp","n. 果肉, 纸浆\\nvt. 使化成纸浆, 除去...果肉\\nvi. 变成纸浆",["My wife used to be a pro-wrestler, so if she ever catches me two-timing her, I'd be beaten to a pulp.","The hornet chewed the bark to make wood pulp and build its nest."],["",""]],["woo","wu:","vt. 追求, 向...求爱, 恳求\\nvi. 求爱, 央求",["France joins a growing European effort to woo Chinese investment and trade.","I tried to woo his sister, but she didn't want me."],["",""]],["stomp","stɒmp","n. 跺脚\\nvt. 跺, 践踏\\nvi. 跺脚, 践踏",["The farmer warned the children not to stomp on the freshly planted crops.","The protesters threatened to stomp on the banners left by their opposition."],["農夫警告孩子們不要踐踏新栽種的作物。","抗議者威脅要踐踏反對者留下的橫幅。"]],["lending","'lendiŋ","n. 出借, 出借物\\na. 出借",["I don't mind lending you the money provided you pay it back within a month.","Would you mind lending me your car?"],["假如能一个月之内还上的话，我可以把钱借给你。","你介意把你的車借給我嗎?"]],["nostril","'nɒstril","n. 鼻孔\\n[医] 鼻孔",["I have a facial boil. There's a painful lump at the back of one nostril.","When my left nostril is blocked, I breathe through my right nostril."],["",""]],["crank","kræŋk","a. 不稳的, 脾气暴燥的, 易怒的\\nn. 曲柄, 奇想\\nvt. 装曲柄\\nvi. 转动曲柄",["Hey! I don't want any crank calls - not at this hour.","It will take you a whole lifetime to understand a crank like him."],["",""]],["crook","kruk","n. 钩, 弯曲部分, 坏蛋\\nvt. 使弯曲, 诈骗\\nvi. 弯曲",["Sorry I didn't catch up after, but James was right crook so we left early.","When you cough or sneeze, cover your mouth with the crook of your elbow or a handkerchief."],["",""]],["paranoid","'pærәnɔid","a. (似)患妄想狂的, (似)患偏执狂的\\nn. 患妄想狂的人",["Refusing linguistic injustice doesn't make you a paranoid schizophrenic.","Sami became paranoid so much so that he accused Layla of having an affair."],["",""]],["spacious","'speiʃәs","a. 广大的, 宽广的",["The living room in my new house is very spacious.","I know that the path of virtue is very narrow and that the path of vice is very wide and spacious."],["我新家的客厅很宽敞。",""]],["annoyed","","a. 恼怒的；烦闷的",["He was always annoyed in the city by noises of one sort or another.","I'm getting endlessly annoyed by this foolishness."],["他在城市里一直受到噪音或者其他的干扰。","我对这种愚蠢的行为表示非常的气愤。"]],["scalp","skælp","v. 剥头皮\\nn. 头皮, 战利品",["She scratched her itch through the scalp to the brain.","Her hair is very thin and you could see her scalp."],["",""]],["seep","si:p","vi. 渗出, 渗流, 漏\\nn. 小泉, 水陆两用吉普车",["If your windows are not airtight, moisture will seep in.","Ahhh! Feel that beer seep into every fiber of my being. Yep, nothing beats a cold one after work."],["",""]],["curry","'kʌri. 'kә:ri","n. 咖哩粉, 咖哩饭菜\\nvt. 用咖哩粉调味, 用马梳梳, 制革",["Two women wielding giant spatulas continuously stir a brimming wok of shredded beef simmering in curry sauce.","The curry at this restaurant is good."],["兩名女子揮舞著巨大的鍋鏟，不停地翻炒著盛滿咖哩醬汁的牛肉絲。","这家饭馆的咖哩挺好。"]],["vista","'vistә","n. 远景, 展望, 回想",["The street, lined with trees, provided a vista of the sea.","Researchers announce method of circumventing Windows Vista security features."],["",""]],["relish","'reliʃ","n. 滋味, 风味, 美味, 爱好, 食欲, 调味品\\nvt. 调味, 喜欢, 玩味\\nvi. 有味道",["I resumed my place at the table; but the dinner was finished, and the wine had no further relish.","Thousand island dressing can be made of mayonnaise, ketchup, and sweet pickle relish."],["",""]],["cherish","'tʃeriʃ","vt. 珍爱, 怀有, 爱护",["The teacher of the kindergarten told the pupils to respect, and cherish each other.","One must understand and cherish fortune before creating it."],["幼儿园的老师告诉小朋友们要互敬互爱。","人要知福、惜福、再造福。"]],["unravel",".ʌn'rævl","vt. 阐明, 解决, 解开\\nvi. 散开",["Today, we are going to unravel the mystery of the English subjunctive.","Who shall ever unravel the mysteries of the sea?"],["今天我们来揭开英文虚拟式的神秘面纱。","谁能揭开海洋的奥秘？"]],["eruption","i'rʌpʃәn","n. 爆发, 喷出物, 出疹\\n[化] 喷发",["The eruption blackened the skies over Sumatra Island.","Because of the volcanic eruption, many people were forced to evacuate."],["",""]],["thou","θau","pron. 汝, 你, 尔",["What beast dost thou think thou art? Art thou a hound or a rat?","Yea, though I walk through the valley of the shadow of death, I will fear no evil: for thou art with me; thy rod and thy staff they comfort me."],["你認為你是什麼野獸？獵犬還是老鼠？","我雖然行過死蔭的幽谷，也不怕遭害，因為你與我同在；你的杖，你的竿，都讓我安心。"]],["censorship","'sensәʃip","n. 检查制度\\n[医] 督察, 监察",["The stench of censorship will spell the end of the oligarchy.","Censorship feeds the dirty mind more than the four-letter word itself."],["",""]],["eyelid","'ailid","n. 眼皮, 眼睑\\n[医] 睑",["In the twinkling of an eyelid, the Cat leaped on the blackbird, and ate him, feathers and all.","Tim's mother did not bat an eyelid when he came out as gay."],["",""]],["smuggle","'smʌgl","vt. 偷运, 走私, 私运\\nvi. 走私",["Mary tried to smuggle a hacksaw blade into the prison inside a cake.","He was sent to solitary confinement after he tried to smuggle cocaine into his cell."],["",""]],["commonplace","'kɒmәnpleis","n. 寻常事, 老生常谈, 普通的东西\\na. 平凡的, 普通的",["Space travel will be commonplace some time in the future.","Rice and noodles are commonplace in Chinese cuisine."],["太空旅行終有一天會成為平常事。","中餐常有米饭或面条。"]],["mislead","mis'li:d","vt. 误导",["The speaker believes that cosmetic industries mislead women with impossible claims.","Long after you've become inactive, your mistakes, if not corrected, will live on to mislead future users."],["",""]],["boredom","'bɒ:dәm","n. 厌烦, 厌倦, 令人厌烦的事物",["Boredom is the feeling that everything is a waste of time; serenity, that nothing is.","It was boredom that Aldous Huxley considered one of the most dangerous human conditions."],["",""]],["persuasive","pә'sweisiv","a. 有说服力的, 劝诱的, 劝导性的",["The weak point of this book is that it's less than persuasive when the married author recommends not being married.","Tom and Mary can be persuasive when they want to be."],["這本書有一個弱點 ﹣ 作者自己結了婚，但卻建議別人不要結婚，沒有甚麼說服力。",""]],["visualize","'viʒuәlaiz","vt. 使看得见, 使具体化, 想象, 设想\\nvi. 想象, 显形",["Positron Emission Tomography uses a radioactive tracer to visualize metabolic activity within the human body.","Recently, to practice my \"mind's eye,\" I visualize what a Kzin, a \"cat-like\" alien in Larry Niven's books, looks like."],["",""]],["mint","mint","n. 薄荷, 造币厂, 巨额\\nvt. 铸造, 铸币, 制造",["Excuse me, I'd like two regular size cones - one with chocolate mint, and the other with orange sherbet, please.","It costs more to mint a penny than the penny itself is worth."],["",""]],["avid","'ævid","a. 渴望的, 急切的, 劲头十足的",["Nerria, the Filipino wife of my white ex-neighbour Bruce, was an avid Roman Catholic.","Igor and his cousin were avid hikers. That's how they bonded."],["",""]],["incidentally",".insi'dentәli","adv. 伴随地, 偶然, 顺便",["Incidentally, I have to tell you something.","Incidentally a motorway ramp is being constructed in the neighbourhood, a few hundred metres away, of my clinic."],["我得順便給你講件事。",""]],["soothing","'su:ðiŋ","a. 抚慰的, 使人宽心的\\n[医] 缓解的, 安抚的",["The plush fur of the toy felt so soft and somehow soothing.","In order to relax, I need to listen to soothing music."],["那個玩具絨毛摸起來很柔軟，讓人感到舒適。",""]],["emanate","'emәneit","vi. 散发, 发出, 发源",["In a democratic regime, power must emanate from the people.","Stars emanate gamma rays when they explode."],["",""]],["farmland","'fɑ:mlænd","n. 农田",["Such projects have turned arid plains into fertile farmland, which has quadrupled agricultural production.","The farmland was open and flat, except for the solitary house in a cluster of trees."],["",""]],["deregulation","di:.regju'leiʃәn","n. 撤消(价格等的)管制规定, 解除控制",["It is difficult to peg the direction of interest deregulation.","Gas is a little cheaper with self-service, now that deregulation is kicking in."],["",""]],["unrealistic",".ʌnriә'listik","a. 不切实际的, 幻想的",["The feelings of \"love at first sight\" and \"faithful unto death\" are unrealistic; this sort of unrealistic and illusory feeling is not what we need.","The budget appears to be inaccurate and unrealistic."],["「一見鍾情」以及「從一而終」的感情是不切實際的，我們需要的不是這種不切實際而虛幻的感情。",""]],["classified","'klæsifaid","a. 分类的, 被归入某类的, 被指定为机密的\\n[建] 分了类的, 分了级的",["The classified ad wanted female singers to form an a cappella group.","Data compression algorithms can be classified in two categories: those with data loss and those without data loss."],["這則分類廣告招募女歌手組成無伴奏合唱團。","压缩数据的算法能分为两种：一种会造成数据损失，另一种则不会。"]],["contraction","kәn'trækʃәn","n. 收缩, 缩写式, 害病\\n[医] 收缩; 挛缩; 牙弓内缩",["An obstetrician estimates the progress of childbirth by measuring the time between each contraction.","Hiccups are involuntary contraction of the diaphragm."],["",""]],["nanny","'næni","n. 保姆；母山羊",["Sometimes the nanny goat wants to go into the forest to get food. She calls all seven kids and warns them about the vicious wolf.","Tom couldn't take care of the kids, so he hired a nanny."],["",""]],["municipality",".mju:nisi'pæliti","n. 自治区, 市当局, 市民\\n[法] 市, 自治市, 自治地区",["La Chingada is a small community in the municipality of San Gabriel located two hours from Guadalajara.","The municipality has recently imposed an overtaking ban for this road."],["",""]],["inaccurate","in'ækjurit","a. 错误的, 不准确的\\n[化] 不精确",["Our experiment has revealed that his report was inaccurate.","The budget appears to be inaccurate and unrealistic."],["",""]],["commemorate","kә'memәreit","vt. 纪念",["They were erected to commemorate a certain event or to tell an ancestral legend.","This speech by Ronald Reagan was made to commemorate the death of the astronauts in a space shuttle accident."],["",""]],["mythology","mi'θɒlәdʒi","n. 神话",["In Greek mythology, Ares was the god of war.","For some reason economic booms have names taken from Japanese mythology given to them."],["在希腊神话中，阿瑞斯是战争之神。",""]],["groom","gru:m","n. 马夫, 新郎, 男仆\\nvt. 喂马, 使...整洁, 推荐\\nvi. 打扮, 穿戴",["The groom works for a company now, and the bride is our teacher.","There's a photo of the bride and groom together on the invitation sent to friends."],["新郎现在在一家公司工作，新娘是我们的老师。","发给好朋友的请帖上有新郎新娘合影的照片。"]],["simultaneous",".simәl'teinjәs","a. 同时的, 同时发生的\\n[计] 同时的",["The boy solved the simultaneous equation with ease.","He really wants to work as a simultaneous interpreter."],["",""]],["filthy","'filθi","a. 污秽的, 丑恶的",["This man is like a filthy electronic without a battery.","He was always filthy and looked like he wasn't given enough food."],["这个男人简直像一台被扯掉了电源的肮脏电器。",""]],["exceptionally","","adv. 特殊地；异常地；例外地",["The eggs from this farm have darker shells, and the yolks are exceptionally rich.","The Chinese people are exceptionally hardworking."],["這家農場的草雞蛋顏色偏深，蛋黃特別鮮美。","中国人民非常勤劳。"]],["defer","di'fә:","vi. 推迟, 延期, 听从\\nvt. 使推迟, 使延期",["Suppose then that we defer the marriage till the autumn.","Alternatively, they say, OPEC could defer a decision altogether and review policy again at a special meeting in January."],["",""]],["attacker","ә'tækә","n. 攻击者",["Sami couldn't give police a good description of the attacker.","She managed to scare off her attacker by screaming loudly."],["",""]],["outweigh",".aut'wei","vt. 比...重, 比...重要, 比...有价值",["The immense costs outweigh the benefits of the project.","The needs of the many outweigh the needs of the few."],["",""]],["abrupt","ә'brʌpt","a. 突然的, 唐突的, 陡峭的, 不连贯的",["There is a fine line between speech that is terse and to the point and speech that is too abrupt.","Bill's abrupt manner causes him to be misunderstood."],["",""]],["rampant","'ræmpәnt","a. 猖獗的, 蔓生的, 猛烈的, 跃立作扑击状的",["Fiscal austerity is considered to be an answer to the rampant inflation.","There are many latent gays among rampant homophobes."],["",""]],["demographics",".demә'ɡræfiks","n. 人口统计资料",["Demographics is the measure of a society's prosperity and a state's efficiency.","Now is the time to embrace our nation's multiculturalism and seize the opportunity to appeal to new and growing demographics."],["",""]],["antiquity","æn'tikwәti","n. 古老, 古代, 古代人, 古物",["The cicada has represented insouciance since antiquity.","Many peoples of antiquity have been gone for thousands of years, and nobody sheds a tear for them."],["",""]],["moss","mɒs","n. 苔藓, 泥沼\\nvt. 使长满苔藓",["\"A rolling stone gathers no moss\" is a proverb.","\"A rolling stone gathers no moss\" is a saying."],["“滚石不生苔”是一句谚语。","“滚石不生苔”是一句谚语。"]],["generalization",",dʒenәrәlai'zeiʃәn","n. 一般化, 普遍化, 概括\\n[化] 推广; 普适化",["Note that we work with a slight generalization of the original definition.","Every generalization is dangerous, especially this one."],["",""]],["downside","'daunsaid","n. 底侧；下降趋势",["The downside, well, it's how thoroughly work gets mixed up with my private life.","The downside of being curious and always having an open mind is that you spend your whole life confused."],["",""]],["nestle","'nesl","vi. 舒适地坐定, 挨靠, 偎依\\nvt. 抱, 安置",["Pauline's baby Selina would just nestle in her arms as if they were the most comfortable place on earth.","A whole colony of wild birds nestle in the reedy thatch, and find out quiet corners in the cool shadow of that wide veranda."],["",""]],["nonexistent",".nɒnig'zistәnt","a. 不存在的",["Love is blind, but jealousy can see even nonexistent things.","Unemployment in this part of the country is virtually nonexistent."],["爱是盲目的，但是嫉妒却可以看到即使并不存在的东西。",""]],["stylish","'stailiʃ","a. 现代风格的, 流行的, 潇洒的",["It was a nice company that manufactured stylish lamps and other home accessories and sold them to many countries around the world.","Some people are really careful about what they wear because they want to be seen as stylish."],["",""]],["shred","ʃred","n. 碎布条, 细片, 少量\\nv. 撕碎",["Let's shred your wings into small pieces and throw them away.","The last shred of hope had vanished from her heart."],["",""]],["automotive",".ɒ:tәu'mәutiv","a. 汽车的",["The Chinese automotive import market shows signs of slight growth.","Let's talk about the automotive industry in Algeria."],["",""]],["veer","viә","vi. 转向\\nvt. 使转向\\nn. 转向",["This done, the sailyards to the wind we veer, / and leave the Grecians and the land of fear.","You shouldn't veer off from the focus."],["",""]],["tabloid","'tæblɒid","n. 小报, 小型画报, 药片, 文摘\\na. 轰动性的, 扼要的, 缩略的, 小报式的",["People were shocked when he cited a supermarket tabloid as a reputable newspaper.","Recently, not only tabloid journalists have to put up with the accusation of mob journalism."],["",""]],["fulfillment","ful'filmәnt","n. 履行, 结束, 完成, 实现, 满意, 称心",["Working in a society gives women both hardship and achievement, but the daily chores at home don't seem to give them fulfillment.","They promise us the moon, but I suspect we can wait for the fulfillment of those promises till hell freezes over."],["",""]],["heater","'hi:tә","n. 加热器, 灯丝, 加热工\\n[化] 加热器",["The heater is aglow with a beautiful orange color.","When the heater in the barn fails, you get milk-flavoured ice cubes."],["加熱器發出美麗的橙色光芒。","當牛舍的暖氣壞了, 你就會有牛奶味的冰塊。"]],["caucus","'kɒ:kәs","n. 领导人会议, 核心会议\\nvi. 开核心会议",["Some states select primary candidates by caucus, while others hold an election.","Tom won the Iowa caucus but did not become president."],["",""]],["refreshing","ri'freʃiŋ","a. 使清爽的, 有精神的, 爽快的",["A glass of cold water is very refreshing in hot weather.","It is refreshing to take a shower after exercising."],["一杯冷水在暑热的天气里十分提神。",""]],["ailment","'eilmәnt","n. 病痛, 疾病\\n[医] 疾病",["Johnny Depp's daughter is reportedly recovering from an unspecified serious ailment.","The doctor immediately began to look for the cause of Boldi's ailment."],["",""]],["gunfire","'gʌnfaiә","n. 炮火, 号炮报时, 炮击",["The police came as soon as they heard the gunfire.","The street fight was interrupted with a hail of gunfire."],["",""]],["whore","hɒ:","n. 娼妓\\nvi. 卖淫",["I'd rather be his whore than your wife.","For, as blushing will sometimes make a whore pass for a virtuous woman, so modesty may make a fool seem a man of sense."],["我寧願當他的情婦也不要當你的老婆。",""]],["tier","tiә","n. 排, 层, 等级",["John is obsessed about getting into a top tier university.","You're paying for a top-tier medication with a bottom-tier health insurance plan."],["",""]],["amazingly","","adv. 令人惊讶地；惊奇地",["Fadil was amazingly calm and collected after he had shot Rami.","Sami was amazingly calm and collected after he had shot Farid."],["",""]],["reunite",".ri:ju:'nait","v. (使)再联合",["They had waited a long time to reunite with their family.","Sami was trying to reunite that dog with its owner."],["",""]],["fugitive","'fju:dʒitiv","a. 逃亡的, 短暂的, 难捉摸的\\nn. 逃亡者, 亡命者, 难捕捉之物",["The fugitive surfaced in a small town fifty miles from here but then disappeared again.","Police cordoned off the area and carried out a thorough search for the fugitive."],["那个逃犯在离这里五十英里的小镇上现身过后又消失了。",""]],["intrusion","in'tru:ʒәn","n. 闯入, 侵扰\\n[医] [向内]突入",["Pardon the intrusion. My apologies for being late for our meeting.","Sami immediately reported the intrusion to the police."],["",""]],["recorded","","a. 记录的",["Famous vibraphonist Stefon Harris has recorded at least one balafon solo.","Over the last hundred years, there have been twenty-seven recorded deaths from spider bites in Australia."],["著名的鐵琴演奏家Stefon Harris已經錄製了至少一個巴拉風獨奏。","过去一百多年，澳大利亚共有二十七例蜘蛛咬人致死的记录。"]],["hired","","v. 租用；雇用（hire的过去式及过去分词形式）",["Private detectives were hired to look into the strange case.","I knew Tom would be a good basketball coach. That's why I hired him."],["私家侦探们受雇调查这桩奇怪的案件。","我知道汤姆会成为一位优秀的篮球教练。这就是为什么我聘用了他。"]],["versatile","'vә:sәtail","a. 多才多艺的, 万用的, 万向的",["The programming language Java is highly versatile.","Avoiding one-use kitchen utensils, Elton forgoes apple corers, preferring the more versatile paring knife."],["编程语言JAVA非常多用途的。",""]],["battalion","bә'tæljәn","n. 营, 军队, 集团",["He rose in rank to become commander of the battalion.","That battalion over there? It's just cannon fodder."],["",""]],["semiconductor",".semikәn'dʌktә","n. 半导体\\n[化] 半导体",["Automakers are grappling with semiconductor shortages.","Despite having a business degree, Lee worked as an office assistant at a semiconductor manufacturer."],["",""]],["unchanged",".ʌn'tʃeindʒd","a. 无变化的\\n[经] 持稳的",["Net profit for the period is estimated at 5 billion yen, largely unchanged from the previous one.","Please tell me how I can keep the layout unchanged even with a smaller window."],["",""]],["nuisance","'nju:sns","n. 讨厌的东西, 讨厌的人, 损害\\n[医] 损害, 讨厌",["Those kids are a nuisance in the neighborhood. The worst among them is Tom, Mary's son.","The noise was so loud that it was a nuisance to the neighbors."],["",""]],["lutheran","'lu:θәrәn","a. 路德教会的\\nn. 路德教会",["The pastor of the local Lutheran Church is considered a pillar of the community.","Lutheran doctrine abolished celibacy and the worship of images."],["",""]],["dizzy","'dizi","a. 晕眩的, 眼花缭乱的\\nvt. 使晕眩",["I get dizzy spells when I stand up.","This is the first time I've ever felt dizzy in a car."],["我一站起来就觉得头晕。",""]],["rumble","'rʌmbl","n. 隆隆声, 辘辘声\\nvi. 发隆隆声, 辘辘响\\nvt. 使隆隆响, 低沉地说",["About noon the sky darkened, a breeze sprang up, and a low rumble announced the approaching storm.","From somewhere in the distance came an ominous rumble."],["",""]],["juicy","'dʒusi","a. 多汁液的, 生动的, 多水分的",["The figs of Atush are sweet and juicy.","The crispy fried chicken was a perfect balance of golden brown exterior and juicy interior."],["阿图什的无花果是甜蜜多汁的。",""]],["contestant","kәn'testәnt","n. 竞争者\\n[法] 争辩者, 竞争者",["My father was a contestant in a cooking contest and won first prize.","The contestant delivered her extemporaneous speech with such gusto."],["",""]],["intentional","in'tenʃәnәl","a. 故意的, 与目的有关的\\n[法] 故意的, 有意的",["Mary accused Tom of making intentional mistakes to attract her attention.","Of course, it wasn't intentional or done with any sort of awareness."],["",""]],["growl","graul","n. 吠声, 咆哮声\\nv. 怒吠, 咆哮, 吼",["The growl scared the living daylights out of Igor.","You can growl \"Auuu!\" for all you want, but you won't turn into a wolf."],["",""]],["gel","dʒel","n. 胶化体, 凝胶\\nvi. 胶化, 成凝胶状\\n[计] 通用仿真语言",["Ziri used a antimicrobial gel to treat the car scratch.","The thick leaves of an Aloe vera plant contain a clear gel, which is used to store water."],["",""]],["purity","'pjuәrәti","n. 纯净, 纯正, 纯粹\\n[化] 纯度",["An insistence on ideological purity and an unwillingness to compromise lead to an inability to get things done.","In the name of Purity what lies are told! What queer morality it has engendered."],["",""]],["brokerage","'brәukәridʒ","n. 经纪人, 回扣, 佣金, 中间人业务\\n[经] 经纪业, 佣金, 手续费",["The brokerage charged significant commissions on both buy and sell orders, ensuring it made money hand over fist.","When you see the sign for the stock brokerage, take the next right."],["",""]],["putt","pʌt","vt. 击球入洞\\nvi. 轻击高尔夫球\\nn. 轻轻一击(入洞)",["That was an excellent putt."],["那是一個很棒的推桿。"]],["vomit","'vɒmit","vt. 吐出, 呕吐\\nvi. 呕吐\\nn. 呕吐, 呕吐物, 催吐剂",["I can only describe the terrible smell as vomit mixed with rotting flesh.","I'm not feeling well, I want to vomit."],["我只能描述这可怕的味道像呕吐物混合着烂肉。","我不舒服了，我想吐啊"]],["mike","maik","vi. 偷懒, 游手好闲\\nn. 休息, 游手好闲, 扩音器, 话筒",["Mike and his sister can speak French, but they can't speak Japanese.","As is often the case, Mike was late for the meeting this afternoon."],["麦克和他妹妹会说法语，但不会说日语。","麥克今天下午的會議遲到了，這是常有的事。"]],["reiterate","ri:'itәreit","vt. 反复地说, 重申, 反复地做\\n[法] 重述, 重申, 反覆地做",["Ziri had to reiterate his original terms."],[""]],["rhythmic","'riðmik","a. 有韵律的, 有节奏的",["Rhythmic gymnastics is a beautiful sport for girls.","Their journey was silent but for the hum of the engine, the hiss of the rain and the rhythmic squeaking of the windshield wipers."],["",""]],["sag","sæg","vi. 下垂, 倾斜, 萎靡, 萧条, 变得乏味\\nvt. 使下垂\\nn. 下垂, 倾斜, 萧条\\n[计] 系统分析组, 语法分析生成程序…",["A heavy load is causing the plank to sag in the middle.","In older buildings, a wooden lintel can sometimes sag or rot, requiring replacement."],["",""]],["frantically","'fræntikli","adv. 狂暴地, 疯狂似地",["In the darkness, I frantically reach out towards the receding figure.","Walking back from his house, I frantically searched through my memory."],["",""]],["buffer","'bʌfә","n. 缓冲器, 缓冲区\\nvt. 缓冲\\n[计] 缓冲区, 缓冲器",["During the Great Game, Afghanistan was a buffer state.","We should not use foreign workers as a buffer against Japan's economic slowdown."],["在大博弈期間，阿富汗是一個緩衝國。",""]],["endlessly","'endlisli","adv. 不断地, 无穷尽地",["If you keep on endlessly complaining, I will get angry.","I'm getting endlessly annoyed by this foolishness."],["如果你继续没完没了的抱怨，我就生气了。","我对这种愚蠢的行为表示非常的气愤。"]],["exterior","ik'stiәriә","n. 外部, 表面, 外貌\\na. 外部的, 外在的, 表面的",["Despite her hard exterior, she had a certain vulnerability that made her quite endearing.","Yanni is a very nice person despite his tough guy exterior."],["",""]],["delightful","di'laitful","a. 令人愉快的, 可爱的",["When a friend comes from afar, is that not delightful?","It is delightful to be praised by an expert in the field."],["有朋自远方来，不亦乐乎？",""]],["conditioner","kәn'diʃәnә","n. 调节器, 土壤团粒结构促进剂\\n[计] 调节器, 整形器",["Without an air conditioner, people nowadays cannot live.","On a hot summer day, the air conditioner works all day to keep us cool."],["现今人们没有空调无法生活。","炎炎夏日，空调全天开放让我们保持凉爽。"]],["illicit","i'lisit","a. 不法的, 不正当的, 禁止的\\n[法] 违法的, 违禁的, 被禁止的",["Over the last decade, Estonia has reported that heroin has largely been replaced by fentanyl on the illicit market.","No circumstance, no purpose, no law whatsoever can ever make licit an act which is intrinsically illicit."],["",""]],["perpetual","pә'petʃuәl","a. 永久的, 不断的, 无期限的, 没完没了的, 四季开花的\\n[经] 永远的, 终身的, 持续的",["The idea of perpetual motion is an absurd hypothesis.","You can see that mountain's perpetual snow from here."],["永动机这个概念是个荒唐的假说。",""]],["makeshift","'meikʃift","n. 权宜之计, 临时代用品\\na. 权宜的, 临时代用的",["Actually that I bring a huge volume of reference material with me is a makeshift way of preventing people from disputing my case.","Ziri made himself a makeshift shelter in the middle of the woods."],["",""]],["goodwill","^jd'wil","n. 友好, 好意, 善意, 亲善, (企业享有的)信誉, 声誉\\n[经] (企业的)商誉, 信誉",["If you always ignore people's goodwill, someday you're going to end up in a difficult situation.","The airline provided free accommodation to stranded passengers as a goodwill gesture."],["",""]],["wrongdoing","'rɒŋ'du:iŋ","n. 干坏事, 坏事",["It didn't escape Mary's notice, that Tom hadn't denied any wrongdoing.","Those guys are ruthless, covering up their tracks like that after all their wrongdoing."],["",""]],["aerobic","єә'rәubik","a. 需氧的, 需氧菌产生的, 增氧健身法的\\n[医] 需氧的",["Mary went to an aerobic dance class.","\"The current recommendations are for 30 minutes or more of moderate aerobic activity, such as brisk walking on most, preferably all days of the week,\" said Mihaela Tanasescu."],["",""]],["skeptic","'skeptik","n. 怀疑者, 怀疑论者, 不可知论者",["In order to be a skeptic, maybe you should not be an expert.","Even though Tom was a skeptic, he ended up hypnotized all the same."],["",""]],["covert","'kʌvәt. 'kәuvәt","a. 隐蔽的, 偷偷摸摸的, 隐密的\\nn. 树丛, 隐藏处",["Subjugation of the lower classes is important to our covert centralization of resources.","The CIA fought a covert war against the Soviets in Afghanistan."],["",""]],["anticipated","","a. 预期的；期望的",["You often need to spend more time doing something than you anticipated.","It is important that we make plans in relation to anticipated changes."],["",""]],["facet","'fæsit","n. (多面体的)面, 方面, 琢面\\n[医] 小平面, 小面",["A facet of genius is the ability to provoke scandals.","Lion dances are a facet of traditional Chinese culture."],["",""]],["disarm","dis'ɑ:m","vt. 解除武装, 裁军, 缓和\\nvi. 放下武器",["\"Your humility, Mr. Bingley,\" said Elizabeth, \"must disarm reproof.\"","The police managed to disarm the perp."],["",""]],["beckon","'bekәn","v. 招手示意, 召唤, 吸引\\nn. 表召唤的点头(或手势)",["It was surprising to see the stranger beckon me over.","The protected waters of Florida Keys National Marine Sanctuary are home to the third-largest barrier coral reef in the world and beckon millions of visitors each year."],["",""]],["improvise","'imprәvaiz","vt. 即席创作, 临时做",["To survive in a hostile environment, one must be able to improvise and be tenacious.","We have provisions for six days. If the mission is extended, we'll have to improvise or turn around."],["",""]],["slipper","'slipә","n. 拖鞋, 制轮器\\nvt. 用拖鞋打",["Tom looked under the bed to see if the other slipper was there.","Remember: Spider-Man is not afraid of anyone. Well, maybe just of Slipper-Man."],["",""]],["freelance","","n. 自由作家, 自由投稿, 自由职业者\\na. 自由投稿的",["I know that Tom used to be a freelance journalist.","Gerard contracted a freelance translator to localize his software."],["",""]],["challenger","'tʃælindʒә","n. 挑战者\\n[经] 申请回避的人",["The flyweight champion contended with a strong challenger.","He's reigning champion, and no young challenger is going to take it away from him."],["",""]],["candidacy","'kændidәsi","n. 候选人的地位, 候选资格\\n[法] 候选人的身份, 资格",["French finance minister Christine Lagarde headed to Brazil as part of a tour to garner support for her candidacy.","We took the liberty of putting your candidacy on hold."],["",""]],["preoccupation","pri:.ɒkju'peiʃәn","n. 抢先占据, 先人之见, 入神\\n[医] 成见, 注意散漫, 心不在焉",["It is preoccupation with possession, more than anything else, that prevents men from living freely and nobly.","Preoccupation with sex is the basis of all mental activity."],["",""]],["quiz","kwiz","n. 考查, 课堂测验, 恶作剧, 智力测验\\nvt. 戏弄, 考查, 恶作剧",["We had a history quiz this morning.","Tom told his students that there would be a quiz on Monday."],["我們今天早上有歷史小考。",""]],["handgun","'hændɡʌn","n. 手枪",["Layla's only defense against the dingos was a handgun.","I wouldn't sell you a slingshot, let alone a handgun."],["",""]],["chuck","tʃʌk","n. 抚弄, 赶走, 抛掷, 咯咯声, 颈肉, 卡盘\\nvt. 轻拍, 抛掷, 驱逐, 丢弃, 用卡盘夹住\\nvi. 咯咯叫",["Uninstall method: Chuck the whole folder into the recycle bin.","Chuck your watch out the window to see how time flies."],["",""]],["buddhist","'budist","n. 佛教徒\\na. 佛教的",["Vesak is a Buddhist holiday which celebrates the birth, enlightenment and death of the Buddha.","In front of the Buddhist Hall, a sign says: \"Beware of all the life under your steps.\""],["卫塞节是佛教的一个节日，纪念佛陀的诞生、成道和涅槃。","佛堂前面的一个牌子上写着：“注意脚下众生。”"]],["suicidal","sjui'saidәl","a. 自杀的, 自杀性的, 自我毁灭的\\n[法] 自杀的",["Tom told me that he thought that Mary was suicidal.","Tom never told me he was having suicidal thoughts."],["",""]],["mole","mәul","n. 痣, 鼹鼠, 防波堤, 摩尔, 克分子\\n[化] 摩尔",["The dead body was identified by a mole on the cheek.","A mole farted through grass, having swallowed a handful of grains."],["",""]],["assortment","ә'sɒ:tmәnt","n. 分类, 各种各样\\n[医] [遗传]配列",["A clocktower is full of an assortment of doodads and doohickies.","She had an assortment of plants on each windowsill so they could get enough light."],["",""]],["impede","im'pi:d","vt. 妨碍, 阻碍, 阻止",["Obstructions near doors can impede people in an emergency.","All wars that are progressive are just, and all wars that impede progress are unjust."],["",""]],["wince","wins","n. 畏缩, 退避\\nvi. 畏缩, 退缩, 退避",["You don't have to wince like that. I'll fix it so it doesn't hurt.","Meanwhile, house parties and bar nights in college towns across the country are sparking outbreaks that make public health officials wince."],["",""]],["subside","sәb'said","vi. 沉淀, 沉降, 平息",["Suffering on Earth will subside if we stop fostering it.","We need to ratchet up the pressure. We can't let it simply subside."],["",""]],["collegiate","kә'li:dʒiәt","a. 学院的\\n[法] 集体组织的, 合议的, 大学的",["Mary finished collegiate applications today.","The Maryland Terrapins have defeated the Siena Saints, 85-70, to reach the second round of the men's collegiate basketball tournament here in Washington."],["",""]],["needy","'ni:di","a. 贫穷的, 贫困的, 生活艰苦的",["Tom doesn't seem to be as needy as Mary seems to be.","Aniq turned slowly at the sound of the needy, narcissistic gurgle that sounded from behind him."],["",""]],["baseman","'beismәn","n. 守垒员",["The first baseman is the Achilles heel of our team.","The shortstop then throws the ball to the first baseman."],["",""]],["aerospace","'єәrәuspeis","n. 航天空间, 航天技术",["His dream is to become an aerospace engineer.","They study aerospace engineering at the university."],["他的梦想是成为航天航空工程师。",""]],["hypothesize","hai'pɔθisaiz","vt. 假设, 假定",["I can only hypothesize that he came here for the necklace.","Please read the manual and hypothesize 3 possible outcomes."],["",""]],["internally","in'tәnәli","[计] 内部的",["I know internally that it stabbed my thumb. Something evil was coming close.","I know internally that it is a children's song that express that life is only a dream."],["",""]],["outspoken",".aut'spәukәn","a. 直言无讳的, 坦率的, 坦白无隐的",["Though very outspoken, purists do not comprise the majority on Tatoeba.","Hector's uncommonly brash and outspoken today. He's usually deathly quiet."],["",""]],["differential","difә'renʃәl","a. 差别的, 特异的, 微分的\\nn. 差别, 两路线运费差额, 工资差额",["In general, little is known about nonlinear second order differential equations.","Resolving a differential equation means finding the functions that satisfy it."],["",""]],["petal","'petәl","n. 花瓣\\n[医] 花瓣",["Oil on canvas can never paint a petal so delicate.","Life is a rose that shows us in each petal an illusion and in each thorn a reality."],["",""]],["geological",".dʒiәu'lɒdʒikәl","a. 地质学的, 地质的",["That decision, in turn, was affected by the geological structure of the hill itself.","Mercury has three main geological layers: a core, a mantle, and a crust."],["",""]],["antibody","'æntibɒdi","n. 抗体\\n[化] 抗体",["Each antibody targets a specific bacteria or virus.","Doctors want to extract antibody-rich plasma from the blood of recovered patients to save lives."],["",""]],["graffiti","","n. 墙上乱写乱画的东西",["A new art trend in New York City takes the age-old craft of crocheting to the streets, where traditionally walls and fences have been serving as canvases for graffiti artists.","Sami lined the walls of his cell with graffiti of Michael Jackson."],["紐約市出現了一種新的藝術潮流，將古老的鉤編工藝帶到了街頭。在那裡，傳統上，牆壁和柵欄一直是塗鴉藝術家的畫布。",""]],["cliche","'kli:ʃei","n. 陈腔滥调, 凸印版\\na. 陈腐的",["With her green eye shadow and rabbit fur coat, Mary was cliche.","The cream exploded into a cliche in the author's coffee mug."],["",""]],["barren","'bærәn","a. 不育的, 贫瘠的\\nn. 荒地",["Barren trees are the fir, elder, birch, cypress, beech, ivy, sallow, linden and so on, but most of them afford shade.","I am not a rhinoceros, I am not a tiger, but I am led into this barren wild..."],["",""]],["hinge","hindʒ","n. 铰链, 关键, 枢纽\\nvt. 装铰链\\nvi. 靠铰链移动, 依...而转移",["One hinge snapped, then the other, and down came the door with a crash.","It will hinge on whether or not she gets the promotion."],["",""]],["billing","'biliŋ","n. 节目次序, 广告\\n[经] 开票(发票,帐单)",["He gave us an explanation about the new billing system.","It wouldn't take a U.S. billing address."],["",""]],["hierarchical",",haiә'rɑ:kikәl","[计] 分级的, 分层的, 层次的",["A tangled hierarchy is a hierarchical consciousness system in which a strange loop appears.","In hierarchical organizations like the military, many techniques are used to integrate new members into the team."],["",""]],["celestial","si'lestjәl","a. 天的, 天国的, 天空的\\n[法] 天的, 天空的, 天国的",["The solar system is a small celestial system in the Milky Way.","It is said that Peng Zu was the grandson of a celestial emperor."],["太陽系是銀河系中一個小的天體系统。","传说彭祖是天帝的孙子。"]],["forefront","'fɒ:frʌnt","n. 最前部, 最前线",["The company, despite being at the forefront of its field, ended up being dismembered and sold to the highest bidder.","At the forefront of our agenda has to be what is best for the citizens."],["",""]],["clench","klentʃ","n. 牢牢抓住, 钉紧, 敲弯钉尖\\nvt. 紧握, 牢牢地抓住, 确定, 敲弯\\nvi. 握紧, 钉牢",["Clench your teeth together, please.","Said the dentist: \"Now open your mouth and clench your teeth.\""],["",""]],["bob","bɒb","vt. 剪短, 敲击\\nvi. 振动, 上下跳动\\nn. 短发, 悬挂的饰品, 浮子, 摆动, 轻敲, 5便士",["Bob worked as a clerk in the grocery store on Saturday.","Bob is the only student that can speak Spanish in our class."],["每周六鲍勃在杂货店做店员。","鮑勃是我們班上唯一會講西班牙語的學生。"]],["restricted","ri'striktid","a. 受限制的, 有限的",["While video platforms do not explicitly ban such content, works of this type will have their traffic restricted.","But today smoking in public places is forbidden or strictly restricted."],["虽然视频平台没有明确禁止此类内容，但这种类型的作品的流量会被限制。",""]],["timetable","'taimteibl","n. 时间表",["If there is any change in the timetable, please let me know.","According to the timetable we're supposed to arrive at Brindisi at 9:30."],["",""]],["mundane","'mʌndein","a. 现世的, 世俗的, 宇宙的",["Sadako realized that, near death, even what was once mundane glows with an everlasting beauty.","I'm sure there's a more mundane explanation that doesn't involve ghosts."],["貞子意識到，在生命將盡之際，曾經平凡無奇的事物，也會散發永恆的美。",""]],["raspberry","'ræzbәri","n. 悬钩子, 呸声\\n[化] 覆盆子; 悬钩子",["I want to show you the raspberry bushes, put a berry on your soft lips and open them with a gentle kiss.","The tayberry is a cultivated cross between a blackberry and a raspberry."],["",""]],["presbyterian",".prezbi'tiәriәn","a. 长老派的, 长老宗的\\nn. 长老教教友, 长老制支持者",["The marriage ceremony was performed according to the rites of the Presbyterian persuasion."],[""]],["prudent","'pru:dnt","a. 审慎的, 三思而后行的, 精明的, 节俭的",["A miser hoards money not because he is prudent but because he is greedy.","A prudent bird chooses its tree. A wise servant chooses his master."],["守财奴积聚钱财不是因为他谨慎，而是因为他贪婪。","良禽择木而栖，贤臣择主而事。"]],["spokesperson","'spәukspә:sn","n. 发言人, 代言人",["She seems oddly shy and retiring for a media spokesperson.","The Cenobites' most iconic member is Pinhead, also known as the Hell Priest, who serves as their leader and spokesperson."],["",""]],["wreckage","'rekidʒ","n. 残骸, 失事, 破坏\\n[经] (船双等的)失事遭难",["The wreckage of the ship was salvaged after it had gone to Davy Jones's locker.","A flight attendant was rescued from the wreckage of the passenger plane."],["船的残骸从海底被打捞上来。",""]],["unanimous","ju:'nænimәs","a. 意见一致的, 无异议的",["They were unanimous that the war should be brought to a halt.","It was by no means unanimous, but your proposal was selected."],["",""]],["lest","lest","conj. 以免, 唯恐, 免得",["We came in through the back door lest someone should see us.","You must do all you can lest you should regret later."],["我們不想給人看見，所以就從後門走了進去。","你必須盡一切可能盡力而為, 免得你以後後悔。"]],["tavern","'tævәn","n. 酒馆, 客栈",["I was given a hard time by a strange guy at the tavern.","In the tavern we do not think how we will be dust, but rush to gamble at dice, which always makes us sweat."],["",""]],["assassin","ә'sæsin","n. 暗杀者, 刺客\\n[法] 暗杀者, 行刺者",["Algerian Arab gendarmes live from Baksheesh, they are nevertheless very well paid by the Algerian assassin power.","The assassin disguised himself as a janitor in order to access the minister's hotel room."],["",""]],["cedar","'si:dә","n. 雪松, 香椿\\n[医] 香柏, 杉, 雪松",["They made huge, grotesque, yet beautiful poles of red cedar.","The cedar count today is really high, so I might have to call work and tell them I'm too sick to go in."],["他們用紅雪松製作了巨大、怪誕卻又美麗的木桿。","今天的雪松數量非常高，所以我可能得打電話給單位，說我病得太厲害不能去上班了。"]],["etch","etʃ","vt. 蚀刻, 蚀镂\\nvi. 施行蚀刻法\\nn. 腐蚀剂\\n[计] 刻蚀; 侵蚀",["If you don't wash away the acid quickly, it will etch its way into the metal."],[""]],["flute","flu:t","n. 笛, 横笛, 凹槽\\nvi. 吹笛子\\nvt. 用长笛奏, 刻凹槽于",["I'd like to learn to play the piano, the guitar or the flute.","The piano is a chord instrument, while the flute is a monophonic instrument."],["我想学钢琴，吉它或长笛。","钢琴是和弦乐器，笛子是单音乐器。"]],["nightly","'naitli","a. 每夜的, 夜间的\\nadv. 每夜",["The town's reprobate element gathered nightly in the dim corner of the tavern.","The orchestra plays nightly the whole night through."],["",""]],["continuation","kәn.tinju'eiʃәn","n. 继续, 续集, 补编\\n[医] 连续",["Maria was tasked with the continuation of the work.","Children are our successors, our future, the continuation of the people's life."],["",""]],["beginner","bi'ginә","n. 初学者",["Tom's a beginner, but he catches on fast.","I'm sorry for my terrible French. I'm still a beginner."],["湯姆是個初學者，但他趕上得很快。",""]],["dangerously","","adv. 危险, 不安全",["The rationale behind certain New Age treatments can be dangerously wrong.","Our plane was dangerously approaching the Turkish Airlines airliner."],["",""]],["popcorn","'pɒpkɒ:n","n. 爆米花",["Pour melted butter over the popcorn.","Tom and Mary ate popcorn while watching the movie."],["將融化了的奶油倒入爆米花中。",""]],["barracks","","n. 兵营, 营房；简陋的房子；警察所（barrack的复数）",["My roommate from the barracks, who can't hold his liquor, came home after the party and puked all over my new shoes.","In this game, if you want to train military units, you first need to build a barracks."],["",""]],["smear","smiә","vt. 涂, 擦上, 玷污, 把...擦模糊\\nvi. 被弄脏\\nn. 污点, 污迹, 污蔑",["Put them on the baking pan and smear them with egg whites.","I don't like dirty animals. Especially those animals that smear urine on their bodies."],["將它們放在烤盤上並且塗抹蛋白。","我不喜欢肮脏的动物。尤其是那些涂尿在身上的动物。"]],["assassinate","ә'sæsineit","vt. 暗杀, 行刺\\n[法] 暗杀, 行刺, 中伤",["They attempted to assassinate the president.","An area man has been implicated in a plot to assassinate Tom Jackson."],["他们企图暗杀总统。",""]],["liberalization",".libәrәlai'zeiʃәn","n. 自由主义化, 宽大\\n[法] 自由化",["It will be four years before the definite result of beef liberalization emerges.","Algeria needs to intensify its liberalization process."],["",""]],["preoccupied","pri:'ɒkjupaid","a. 被先占的, 入神的, 一心一意的",["All day, I have been strangely preoccupied with thoughts of my hometown.","The values of a society totally preoccupied with making money are not altogether reassuring."],["",""]],["inspired","in'spaiәd","a. 得到灵感的, 有灵感的, 官方授意的",["I inspired my students to work harder.","Sometimes the most inspired ideas seem to just come from out of the blue."],["我鼓励学生们更努力地学习。",""]],["worthless","'wә:θlis","a. 无价值的, 无益的, 无足轻重的\\n[法] 无价值的, 无用的",["The antiques my father left when he died turned out to be nothing but worthless junk.","An eight-year-old car is almost worthless."],["父親生前留下來的老古董，原來只是一堆不值錢的垃圾。","一輛車齡八年的車子幾乎是毫無價值的。"]],["intellect","'intәlekt","n. 智力, 出众的才华, 知识分子\\n[医] 智力, 才智",["Opinion is ultimately determined by feelings, and not by the intellect.","Men of broader intellect know that there is no sharp distinction betwixt the real and the unreal."],["",""]],["nipple","'nipl","n. 乳头, 奶头, 奶嘴\\n[化] 螺纹接口; 螺纹接套",["The circular area around the nipple is called areola.","Skura got her right nipple pierced."],["",""]],["persecution",".pә:si'kju:ʃәn","n. 虐待, 迫害运动, 迫害, 烦扰\\n[法] 迫害, 虐待, 困扰",["Persecution is a bad and indirect way to plant Religion.","Everyone has the right to seek and to enjoy in other countries asylum from persecution."],["",""]],["outright","'autrait","a. 率直的, 完全的, 总共的, 直率的\\nadv. 完全地, 率直地, 立刻地, 一直向前",["I had expected an outright refusal, but to my surprise she agreed.","One day the stepmother had given the girl a frightful beating, and then threatened to kill her outright."],["",""]],["plumbing","'plʌmiŋ","n. 测深, 管子工行业, 管道设备",["In Algeria, almost every home has access to plumbing.","Hiring a non-native French speaker to write the report in French is like hiring a carpenter to fix your plumbing."],["",""]],["tremendously","trə'mendəslɪ","adv. 极大地; 极端地; 极其; 非常",["It was tremendously exciting to be in Boston at that time.","The public has been tremendously impressed by Tom."],["",""]],["flex","'fleks","vt. 弯曲, 伸缩, 折曲\\nvi. 弯曲\\nn. 屈曲, 折曲",["Militarily speaking, Gaza is utterly defenseless. That's why the IDF chooses this area to flex its muscles.","China is beginning to flex its technological muscles."],["",""]],["stunned","","a. 受惊的",["Everybody in the room was stunned by what happened.","Everyone in the room was stunned by what happened."],["屋裡人都被發生的事驚住了。","屋裡人都被發生的事驚住了。"]],["quotation","kwәu'teiʃәn","n. 引用语, 语录, 牌价, 报价\\n[化] 报价",["The following passage is a quotation from a well-known fable.","\"Love your neighbour as yourself\" is a quotation from the Bible."],["",""]],["infuse","in'fju:z","vt. 注入, 使充满, 泡制, 鼓舞\\nvi. 泡",["This soap is infused with natural fragrances."],[""]],["rake","reik","n. 耙子, 钱耙, 斜度, 浪子\\nv. 搜索, 掠过, (用耙子)耙, (使)倾斜",["Tom wanted to help Mary rake the leaves, but she was using the only rake.","Tom no longer has trees in his garden, since he hated to rake the leaves."],["",""]],["coping","'kәupiŋ","n. 墙压顶, 顶部, 顶盖, 墙的顶部\\n[医] 盖",["The statesmen are barely coping with the intricate foreign affairs.","Tom is having trouble coping with the fact that his son committed suicide."],["",""]],["trickle","'trikl","n. 滴, 细流\\nvi. 滴, 细细地流\\nvt. 使滴, 使小量流动\\n[计] 信息透露",["A trickle of blood ran from her temple down her cheek.","Encouraged by the continuing trickle of hits and the rarely arriving email I've somehow kept going till now."],["",""]],["inflate","in'fleit","vt. 使膨胀, 使得意, 使通货膨胀, 使充气\\nvi. 充气, 膨胀",["I cannot inflate all these balloons.","Ziri struggled to inflate the balloon."],["",""]],["chestnut","'tʃesnʌt","n. 栗子, 栗树, 栗色\\na. 栗色的",["The prancing chestnut mare neighed as she tried to get rid of the rider.","The prancing chestnut mare whinnied as she tried to get rid of the rider."],["",""]],["windy","'windi","a. 多风的, 风强的, 腹胀的, 吹牛的",["I'm grateful to him for catching my hat that I lost on the windy street.","It's very windy outside, but we'll still go out for a walk."],["我的帽子被風吹到大街上，我很感謝他幫我接住了。","虽然外面风很大，但是我们还是会出去散步。"]],["differing","ˈdifərɪŋ","v. 不同, 有异( differ的现在分词 ); 持异议",["By reading books and discussing concepts, a person can gain wisdom and tolerance of differing ideas.","Due to differing opinions between the two, they argued angrily, before leaving unhappily."],["藉由讀書和討論概念, 一個人能獲得智慧並包容不同的想法。","这两个人因意见不合，而争得面红耳赤不欢而散。"]],["perennial","pә'reniәl","a. 常年的, 长期的, 反复的\\n[医] 多年生的",["Neither be cynical about love; for in the face of all aridity and disenchantment it is as perennial as the grass.","A perennial plant is a plant that lives more than two years."],["",""]],["overlap",".әuvә'læp","n. 重叠, 重复, 部分的同时发生\\nvt. 重叠, 重复, 与...同时发生\\nvi. 迭盖, 部分的同时发生\\n[计] 重叠",["When inserting the budwood into the root stock, make the cambium layers overlap.","The directors' style is far more different than similar, but there is certainly some overlap."],["",""]],["longevity","lɒn'dʒeviti","n. 长命, 长寿, 寿命\\n[医] 长寿",["The carp's longevity is unmolested by the turmoil of the millipede.","There have been many revolutions over the last century, but perhaps none as significant as the longevity revolution."],["",""]],["cilantro","si'lɑ:ntrәj","n. 芫荽叶",["Koreans don't like eating cilantro.","\"Many people say it's like a cilantro flavor,\" said Walton."],["韓國人不喜歡吃香菜。",""]],["handler","'hændlә","n. 处理者, 操作者, 拳击教练\\n[经] 管理者",["Sami's service dog shouldn't be distracted from its handler.","Her owner said a good show dog is only half of the two-member team of animal and handler."],["",""]],["muse","mju:z","n. 沉思, 冥想\\nv. 沉思, 冥想, 若有所思地凝望或说",["\"Novels? I hate novels.\" Oh muse, forgive her blasphemy.","The author was known for his emotional and exaggerated panegyrics dedicated to his literary muse."],["「小说啊？我就讨厌看小说。」缪斯，请原谅她的亵渎行为。",""]],["obsolete","'ɒbsәli:t","a. 荒废的, 成废物的, 陈旧的, 老式的\\nn. 废词, 废物",["Transport with horse-drawn carriages became obsolete.","Floppy disks became obsolete long ago, but I still have some, and I still use them."],["",""]],["culprit","'kʌlprit","n. 犯人, 罪犯, 刑事被告\\n[法] 犯罪者, 犯人, 罪犯",["It's totally without precedent for the suspect's attorney to be the true culprit.","None of them would admit to being the culprit."],["這前所未聞, 犯罪嫌疑人的律師竟然是真正的罪魁禍首。","他们没有一个人承认自己是犯人。"]],["bankrupt","'bæŋkrʌpt","n. 破产者\\na. 破产的\\nvt. 使破产",["The company went bankrupt. We laid off all of the employees.","The company's going to go bankrupt really soon."],["公司倒閉了。我們遣散了所有員工。","公司很快就要倒闭了。"]],["greatness","'greitnis","n. 大, 巨大, 广大",["He's completely convinced of his own greatness but to the people around him he's just a selfish jerk.","The greatness of a nation and its moral progress can be judged by the way its animals are treated."],["",""]],["recycled","ˌri:ˈsaikld","v. 回收利用( recycle的过去式和过去分词 ); 再利用; 再次应用; 重新使用（概念、方法、玩笑等）",["Just about everything can be recycled.","Disposable coffee cups, greasy pizza boxes and plastic bags cannot be recycled."],["几乎都可以回收。",""]],["anomaly","ә'nɒmәli","n. 不规则, 反常事物, 畸形\\n[医] 异常, 反常",["I think that it was just an anomaly.","We have found an anomaly in the earth's crust."],["",""]],["variant","'vєәriәnt","n. 变体, 异体\\na. 不同的, 有差别的\\n[计] 变体型",["Justine made short work of her opponents in her own personal variant of chess.","Kabyle is the variant of the Berber language that I use."],["",""]],["intellectually","","adv. 智力上；知性上；理智地",["I understand what you're saying intellectually, but it doesn't resonate with me emotionally.","My goal is to advance personally and intellectually every day."],["",""]],["insignificant",".insig'nifikәnt","a. 无关紧要的, 无意义的, 琐碎的",["An existence without positive affirmations and resolutions will turn out to be secure but insignificant.","It's funny how the most insignificant things sometimes have a way of, you know, having their way with you."],["",""]],["mogul","mәu'^ʌl, 'mәu^ʌl","n. 大人物, 有权势的人",["Members of both parties lambasted the real estate mogul for remarks that they assert were racist.","American gambling mogul Steve Wynn has finalized a deal with authorities in Macao to build a lavish resort and casino on the Chinese territory."],["",""]],["wail","weil","n. 恸哭, 哀号, 嚎啕, 呼啸(声)\\nvi. 恸哭, 呼啸, 悲叹, 哀号, 嚎啕",["Please don't wail like that, you'll make the neighbours think there's been a death in the family.","You can cry and wail all you like, no one is going to hear you."],["",""]],["watcher","'wɒtʃә","n. 看守人, 守望者, 哨兵",["Tom's a keen hiker and bird watcher.","An avid watcher of nature documentaries, Bell said that she and her young daughters Lincoln and Delta particularly love David Attenborough and the \"Planet Earth\" series."],["",""]],["overtake",".әuvә'teik","vt. 赶上, 突然降临于, 压倒, 代替",["With China's population becoming larger, and richer, China is on track to overtake Japan as the world's largest corn importer.","The pinnacle of stupidity is to accelerate when people want to overtake, be it on foot, on horseback or in a car."],["",""]],["kinship","'kinʃip","n. 亲属关系\\n[法] 亲属关系, 家族关系, 关系",["A diametrically opposed kinship pattern is to be observed among certain South Sea Island communities.","I don't even fully understand the kinship system of English, especially when it gets beyond first cousins."],["",""]],["wonderfully","","adv. 惊人地；极好地；精彩地",["He handled things wonderfully, playing it by ear the whole way. I have to say he did an excellent job.","While she sat on the cliff and combed her hair, she sang a wonderfully beautiful song."],["",""]],["sequel","'si:kwәl","n. 继续, 续集, 后果\\n[计] 结构的英语查询语言",["By the way, I plan to do that for this story's sequel.","Tom Jackson reprised his role in the sequel to his breakthrough movie."],["",""]],["cache","kæʃ","n. 隐藏所, 隐藏的粮食或物资, 贮藏物, 高速缓冲存储器\\nvt. 隐藏, 窖藏\\n[计] 高速缓冲存储器, 高速缓冲",["My neighbor found a cache of ancient Roman coins using his metal detector.","I found a cache of my grandmother's recipes stuffed away in the back of a drawer."],["",""]],["blender","'blendә","n. 混合者, 混合器, 搅拌器\\n[化] 掺合机; 捏和机; 混合机; 搅拌机; 搅切器; 捣碎器",["Instead of eating the vegetable, he put it in a blender and then drank it.","Instead of eating vegetables, he puts them in a blender and drinks them."],["",""]],["zip","zip","n. 尖啸声, 拉链, 活力\\nvt. 给...以速度, 使增加活力, 拉(拉链)\\nvi. 有力而迅速地行动, 嘘嘘地响, 拉拉链",["In reality, it is only held together by duct-tape and zip-ties.","Go to the post office and ask what's our new ZIP code."],["",""]],["arbitration",".ɑ:bi'treiʃәn","n. 仲裁, 公断\\n[计] 仲裁",["With arbitration, judgement is usually passed in six months' time.","Counselling or arbitration is often the best way to solve disputes among members of the public."],["",""]],["excavation",".ekskә'veiʃәn","n. 挖掘, 发掘, 挖掘的洞\\n[医] 陷凹, 挖除",["The anthropologist is piecing together pottery shards she unearthed at the excavation site.","I used to own an excavation business, and run backhoes."],["",""]],["bunk","bʌŋk","n. 铺位, 废话, 逃走\\nvi. 逃跑, 睡在铺上\\nvt. 提供铺位",["Ziri was hopping up and down on one of the bunk beds.","It took Tom several hours to assemble a bunk bed that the instructions said would take less than an hour to assemble."],["",""]],["sweaty","'sweti","a. 出汗的, 吃力的",["You smell sweaty. Go and have a shower.","When he gets up on stage to sing one of his out-of-tune solos, I get so nervous for him that I get sweaty palms."],["你身上有股汗味兒，洗澡去。",""]],["surrogate","'sʌrәgit","n. 替代者, 代用品\\nvt. 代理, 替代",["Tom was offered a surrogate home, but he refused it.","The new home works as a surrogate home."],["",""]],["jointly","'dʒɒintli","adv. 共同地, 连带地",["They worked jointly on this project.","Logic and common sense suggest that Russia, the European Union, and the United States must act jointly."],["他们一起为这个项目工作过。",""]],["causal","'kɒ:zәl","a. 原因的, 因果关系的, 表示原因或理由的\\nn. 表示原因的连词",["Indeed, some writers do not think the relation of brain to consciousness is a causal relation in the first place.","It is unknown whether smoking causes depression or whether the causal direction goes the other way."],["",""]],["scissors","'sizәz","pl. 剪刀\\n[医] 剪",["The hair dresser is cutting the hair with scissors.","These scissors are suitable for left and right-handed people."],["理发师正在用剪刀剪头发。","這把剪刀左右撇子都適用。"]],["greedy","'gri:di","a. 贪婪的, 贪得的, 贪吃的",["A miser hoards money not because he is prudent but because he is greedy.","Don't be so greedy or you'll wind up with nothing."],["守财奴积聚钱财不是因为他谨慎，而是因为他贪婪。",""]],["salvage","'sælvidʒ","n. 海上救助, 抢救, 打捞, 抢救出来的财物\\nvt. 海上救助, 抢救, 打捞, 营救\\n[计] 文件恢复程序",["Derrick dropped his drawing in the tub and is now trying to salvage it with a hair dryer.","Maybe you can find the replacement parts you need in a salvage yard."],["",""]],["bedside","'bedsaid","n. 床边\\na. 床边的, 临床的",["She was at his bedside for the whole time he was ill.","I've got a photo of my girlfriend on my bedside table."],["他生病時她一直都守在他的床邊。","我床头柜上有一张我女朋友的照片。"]],["shepherd","'ʃepәd","n. 牧羊人, 牧羊犬, 牧师, 保护者\\nvt. 看守, 领导, 指导, 牧羊",["A shepherd drove his snow-covered goat into an abandoned cave to take shelter from the blizzard.","The shepherd, even when he become a gentleman, smells of the lamb."],["一个牧羊人把他一身白雪的山羊赶进被遗弃的山洞躲避暴风雪。",""]],["introductory",".intrә'dʌktәri","a. 介绍的, 引导的, 开端的",["I'm on the lookout for a good introductory book about the Internet.","Saying \"I'm not a racist, but...\" in an introductory manner can sometimes be passed off as racist."],["",""]],["yearly","'jiәli","a. 每年的, 一年一度的\\nadv. 一年一次, 每年",["The issue gained attention when student protests interrupted the yearly Harvard and Yale football game.","If rain fails, neither yearly festivals nor daily worship will be offered in this world to the celestials."],["",""]],["disadvantaged","disәd'vɑ:ntidʒ","a. 社会地位低下的, 生活条件差的, 被剥夺了基本权利的\\n[法] 被剥夺了基本权力的, 生活条件差的",["Many disabled people of all stripes are further disadvantaged by a culture that fails to understand, let alone meet, their needs.","This high school wants to favour students from disadvantaged backgrounds."],["",""]],["punitive","'pju:nitiv","a. 刑罚的, 惩罚性的\\n[法] 刑罚的, 惩罚性的, 结予惩处的",["We award punitive damages in the amount of two million dollars.","The US didn't take any punitive actions towards Algeria."],["",""]],["disparate","'dispәrәt","a. 根本不同的, 全异的, 不相干的\\nn. 无法相比的东西(或人)",["When learning a foreign language, students benefit from reading disparate example sentences."],[""]],["storytelling","'stɒ:riteliŋ","n. 说故事, 说谎话",["I embraced the power of storytelling through books.","David Attenborough brings the wonders of the natural world into our homes with unparalleled storytelling."],["",""]],["sophistication","sә.fisti'keiʃәn","n. 诡辩, 老于世故, 复杂(性)\\n[医] 掺假",["Automobile transmissions have grown in sophistication over the years.","The tall, dark and classically handsome actor was the epitome of urbane sophistication."],["",""]],["negotiating","","n. 谈判",["There was some monkey business going on when they were negotiating that last contract; money passed under the table.","They are negotiating to reach a satisfactory compromise."],["",""]],["entree","'ɒntrei","n. 入场许可, 主菜",["Tom mistakenly ate his entree with his salad fork.","In many restaurants in Turkey, kebab is the main entree."],["",""]],["token","'tәukәn","n. 表征, 记号, 代币\\na. 象征的, 表意的\\n[计] 记号",["On leaving school, we presented him with a table clock as a token of our thanks.","We'd like to give this to you as a token of our appreciation."],["我們畢業的時候送了一個桌上時鐘給他作為謝禮。",""]],["anecdote","'ænikdәut","n. 轶事, 奇闻",["Then he told an anecdote which wasn't quite picked up by the microphones.","She is more influenced by personal anecdote than I."],["",""]],["misconduct",".mis'kɒndʌkt","vt. 办错, 使行为不端\\nn. 办错, 渎职, 通奸",["According to the evidence, there's no indication of any misconduct on his part.","Judaism and Buddhism both forbid murder, theft, sexual misconduct, and malicious speech."],["",""]],["admittedly","әd'mitidli","adv. 公认地, 诚然",["Admittedly, it wasn't the best meal I've ever eaten.","Admittedly your plan makes sense, but I still think it will be very hard to carry out."],["不可否认，那并不是我吃过最好的一顿饭。",""]],["soybean","'sɒibi:n","n. 大豆\\n[化] 大豆",["I could eat some beef noodle soup, or some reheated rice with soybean paste like that, no problem.","Genetically modified soybean oil may not be as healthy as you think, research suggests."],["我可以不慌不忙吃牛奶面包鸡蛋，或者泡饭酱菜。",""]],["frail","freil","a. 脆弱的, 虚弱的, 意志薄弱的\\nn. 少女, 少妇, 灯心草篓",["Mary had become so frail and gaunt that it seemed she already had one foot in the grave.","My grandmother was gradually becoming forgetful and frail."],["玛丽早已变得太虚弱憔悴，似乎已经半截入土。",""]],["dismissal","dis'misәl","n. 免职, 解雇\\n[经] 解雇",["Bankruptcy is to the employer what dismissal is to the employee.","Membership of an allotment association is not grounds for dismissal."],["",""]],["contentious","kәn'tenʃәs","a. 好争吵的, 爱争论的, 有异议的\\n[法] 诉讼的, 争执的, 引起争论的",["Discussions about religion are very often contentious.","The debate was very contentious and didn't result in any fruitful conclusions."],["",""]],["helper","'helpә","n. 帮忙者, 有益的东西\\n[机] 助手",["Vaccines against swine and avian flu can be made more effective by the addition of a helper serum known as an adjuvant.","Now that they have a baby, the Tanakas had to hire a part-time helper."],["",""]],["plywood","'plaiwud","n. 夹板, 合板\\n[机] 层板, 木夹板, 三夹板",["Having been informed that plywood is sufficient, I will make it with plywood, as instructed.","But construction companies in other regions use bamboo mostly in engineered form, as plywood and other laminated byproducts."],["",""]],["trumpet","'trʌmpit","n. 喇叭, 小号, 喇叭声\\nvi. 吹喇叭\\nvt. 用喇叭吹出, 吹嘘",["I often heard him playing the melody on the trumpet.","Tom is trying to earn enough money to buy a new trumpet."],["",""]],["rash","ræʃ","a. 轻率的, 匆忙的, 鲁莽的\\nn. 皮疹",["Tom came out in a rash after changing to a new medication.","We should not be rash now; we should wait for a good chance."],["",""]],["disgusting","dis'gʌstiŋ","a. 令人厌恶的",["What a disgusting and stupid vice smoking is! Lighting a cigarette and sucking in the smoke. Breathing a dangerous threat to your health into your lungs. Exhaling a foul odor.","Death is a disgusting thing that nature has to hide, and it does it well."],["吸烟真是又恶心又低俗！点根烟然后吸，把这些危害健康的气体吸进肺里，然后呼出肮脏的气味。",""]],["universally","ju:ni'v\\\\\\\\:sәli","adv. 宇宙, 全世界, 普遍, 一般, 普通, 全体, 一致, 通用, 万能, 广用, 广泛",["I shall have to controvert one or two ideas that are almost universally accepted.","It is a truth universally acknowledged, that a single man in possession of a good fortune, must be in want of a wife."],["",""]],["autograph","'ɒ:tәugrɑ:f","n. 亲笔, 亲笔签名, 手稿\\nvt. 亲笔签名于, 亲笔写",["If I had noticed her, I would have got her autograph.","On encountering the celebrity, the fans asked for his autograph."],["",""]],["accomplished","ә'kʌmpliʃt","a. 完成的, 实现的, 有造诣的, 熟练的, 善社交的",["What we've accomplished is amazing.","If you had helped me, I could have accomplished the work."],["我們所取得的成就令人驚嘆。",""]],["apparel","ә'pærәl","n. 衣服, 外表\\nvt. 使穿衣, 装饰",["We went up by two floors to reach the apparel stalls.","We went up two floors to reach the apparel stalls."],["",""]],["orchestrate","'ɒ:kistreit","v. 编管弦乐曲",["The gut flora not only play a role in helping to orchestrate the neural responses that regulate digestion, scientists say, but evidence is emerging that gut bacteria can also affect a person's mood."],[""]],["continental",".kɒnti'nentl","a. 大陆的, 洲的\\nn. 欧洲大陆人",["And because Deal is very near continental Europe, it's always been one of the first areas of Britain to be invaded.","Esther didn't have time to eat the continental breakfast."],["",""]],["intently","in'tentli","adv. 一心一意地, 心无旁物地, 专心地",["I rubbed my eyes and stared. And I saw the most extraordinary little fellow studying me intently.","He looked at her face intently, trying to spot any signs of emotion."],["",""]],["hone","hәun","n. 磨刀石, 抱怨, 想念\\nvt. 用磨刀石磨, 磨练",["To be a good translator, I think Tom needs to hone his skills a bit more.","Despite the challenges and an uncertain future, the student journalists continue to hone their craft, one story at a time."],["",""]],["gunshot","'gʌnʃɒt","n. 枪弹, (枪炮)射击, 炮击, 射程\\na. 射击的",["Two people say they heard a gunshot.","Tom was bleeding heavily from a gunshot wound."],["有兩人說他們聽到了一聲槍響。","汤姆的枪伤伤口导致了大出血。"]],["verb","vә:b","n. 动词\\n[计] 动词",["A complete intransitive verb takes neither complement nor object.","This verb is normally used only in the third person."],["一个完完全全的不及物动词既没有补语，又没有宾语。","這個動詞通常只用在第三人稱。"]],["babe","beib","n. 小孩, 天真幼稚的人",["The cradle is as brand new as the born babe lying in it.","I can't believe you're so clueless. You're like a babe in the woods."],["",""]],["indispensable",".indis'pensәbl","n. 不可缺少之物\\na. 不可缺少的, 责无旁贷的, 绝对必要的",["In places where it snows a lot, kerosene is an indispensable item.","If someone is indispensable to a company, then that company is not well-organized."],["在下雪很多的地方，煤油是不可或缺的东西。","若是有人對公司來說是不可或缺的，那麼這家公司組織得不好。"]],["congestion","kәn'dʒestʃәn","n. 拥挤, 充血\\n[计] 拥挤, 拥塞",["We were delayed by traffic congestion, so we had to hurry.","In spite of the terrible congestion, I was in time for the appointment."],["",""]],["revolt","ri'vәult","n. 叛乱, 反抗, 反感\\nvi. 叛乱, 反抗, 起义, 厌恶, 反感\\nvt. 使反感, 使恶心",["The military quashed the revolt within a matter of hours.","What man is that with blood all over him? From the looks of him, he can tell us the latest news of the revolt."],["",""]],["dye","dai","n. 颜料, 染料\\nvt. 染, 染色\\nvi. 被着色",["India ink produces an interesting pattern when used as a dye.","Mary prefers to dye her hair blonde."],["墨汁用作染料时会产生有趣的图案。","玛丽更想把头发染成金色。"]],["sever","'sevә","vt. 切断, 脱离, 分开, 使分离, 断绝, 中断\\nvi. 断, 裂开",["If you're not careful, the dog will sever the head of your doll.","Fadil's blindness was caused by sever emotional stress."],["",""]],["washing","'wɒʃiŋ","n. 洗涤, 浸, 洗涤物\\n[机] 涂浆, 洗涤",["The washing-up machine at home was regarded as a rival to the worker at the kitchen sink.","After washing, the cat's fur is soft and fluffy, and has a faint scent."],["在厨房，家用洗碗机可以算得上是手洗刷碗工的大敌。","洗过澡后，猫咪的毛柔软又蓬松，还有淡淡的香味。"]],["pamphlet","'pæmflit","n. 小册子, 活页文选",["Skim through this pamphlet before you take the examination for our company.","It took slightly more than five minutes for Tom to read the pamphlet."],["",""]],["buckle","'bʌkl","n. 皮带扣, 扣子\\nvt. 扣住, 使弯曲\\nvi. 扣住, 变弯曲, 屈服",["It's the law: always buckle your safety belt in cars and airplanes.","I've really got to buckle down and study for our final exams."],["法律規定，在車輛和飛機上，一定要扣上安全帶。",""]],["clearance","'kliәrәns","n. 清除, 间隙\\n[化] 间隙; 空隙",["Tom bought that pair of shoes at a clearance sale.","It says \"clearance sale\", but these prices don't seem like a bargain at all."],["",""]],["cocoa","'kәukәu","n. 可可粉, 可可茶, 可可色\\n[医] 可可, 可可豆",["This chocolate factory consumes twenty metric tons of raw cocoa per day.","Chocolate is made from cocoa beans."],["這座巧克力工廠每一天消耗二十公噸可可原料。","巧克力是用可可豆做的。"]],["participating","","a. 由多人一起参加的, 由多方一起参加的, 股票使持有人有权参与分享的",["Participating in the general meeting raised my awareness of the new technologies in data transportation.","His leg will prevent him from participating in a tennis tournament."],["",""]],["discredit","dis'kredit","n. 无信用, 丢脸, 不名誉\\nvt. 不信, 怀疑, 使丢脸",["I am the victim of a widespread conspiracy meant to discredit me.","We are the victims of a widespread conspiracy meant to discredit us."],["",""]],["ancestral","æn'sestrәl","a. 祖先的, 祖传的\\n[法] 祖先的, 祖传的",["They were erected to commemorate a certain event or to tell an ancestral legend.","Many of the ancestral rites of this tribe have been lost over time."],["",""]],["bun","bʌn","n. 小面包\\n[医] 血液尿素氮",["During my university days, it was cheap then to buy a snack. I would munch on a curried beef bun or a big cinnamon roll and drink a cup of tea.","Is this supposed to be a currant bun? You almost need to cycle from one currant to another, so few are there."],["大學時期，買零食很便宜。我常常會吃個咖哩牛肉包子或一個大肉桂捲，再喝杯茶。",""]],["ooh","u:","int. （表示惊异、热心、高兴或不悦的叫声）哦！",["Ooh! It took a weight off my shoulders.","Just when she said \"Ooh, what a beautiful star,\" a star fell across the sky and a blue light quickly fainted in a diagonal trajectory, dragging behind a faint tail."],["",""]],["procedural","prә'si:dʒәrәl","a. 程序上的\\n[经] 程序上的",["Ziri watched some rare episodes of his favorite police procedural.","The cases were dismissed on procedural grounds before trial."],["",""]],["groundwater","'graundwɒ:tә","n. 地下水",["Over 68 percent of Earth's freshwater is locked up in ice and glaciers; and another 30 percent is in groundwater.","The experts say swelling cities are adding to the pressure by weighing down the deltas and sucking up groundwater."],["",""]],["freak","fri:k","n. 畸形人, 畸形物, 不正常的事物, 反复无常\\na. 奇异的, 反常的",["I hate those spiders. They're always there to freak me out when I'm cleaning.","When you're born into this world, you're given a ticket to the freak show. If you're born in America you get a front row seat."],["",""]],["factual","'fæktʃuәl","a. 事实的, 实际的\\n[法] 事实的, 与事实有关的, 实际的",["His remark was not intended to be a factual statement.","Tom can give factual statements in French, but he can't discuss abstract concepts."],["",""]],["salute","sә'lu:t","vi. 行礼, 致意, 问候, 放礼炮\\nvt. 向...致意, 迎接, 赞扬\\nn. 招呼, 敬礼, 礼炮",["Whether by a Hitler salute or a hand on your heart, I consider the expression of patriotism to be the symptoms of a disease, whose cause and cure should be more closely studied.","I have come to salute the United Nations and to show the support of the American people for your daily deliberations."],["無論通過行納粹禮還是將手放在胸前，我認為這種愛國主義的表現是一種病的症狀，而病因和治療方法有待進一步研究。",""]],["fern","fә:n","n. 蕨类植物\\n[医] 蕨类植物",["Pareiasaurs crashed through vast conifer and fern forests.","Account for each tree and fern or find yourself beneath the forest floor in slumber. The Goddess keeps score, too."],["",""]],["inscription","in'skripʃәn","n. 题字, 碑铭\\n[医] 划, 药量记载",["The inscription INRI in Latin signifies \"Jesus of Nazareth, King of the Jews\".","The facsimile proved that the inscription was genuine."],["",""]],["hardwood","'hɑ:dwud","n. 硬木, 硬木材, 阔叶材, 落叶树\\n[机] 硬木",["I prefer hardwood floors to carpet.","In woodworking, we classify wood as hardwood, softwood or exotic wood."],["我喜歡硬木地板勝過地毯。",""]],["citrus","'sitrәs","n. 柑橘属果树",["On the winter solstice we have a hot bath with yuzu citrus fruits in it.","Regular use of citrus fruit will shrink pores and make the skin feel fresh."],["冬至時，我們泡熱水澡，池中會加柚子。",""]],["oriental",".ɒ:ri'entl","n. 东方人, 亚洲人\\na. 东方诸国的, 亚洲的, 东方的",["The article on Buddhism revived my interest in oriental religions.","I have an interest in oriental ceramics."],["那篇關於佛教的文章再次勾起了我對東方宗教的興趣。","我对東方陶瓷有兴趣。"]],["swarm","swɒ:m","n. 群, 大群, 蜂群, 分蜂群\\nvi. 分群, 群集, 聚集一块, 云集, 攀\\nvt. 挤满, 爬, 攀",["A swarm of hornets attacked the children.","A swarm of flies want to eat your bread and fruit."],["一窩黃蜂襲擊了孩子們。",""]],["pajamas","pә'dʒɑ:mәs","n. 睡衣, 宽松裤, 喇叭裤",["Brian, in his pajamas, is engaged in reading in the house in the morning.","Tom was wearing his pajamas when he opened the door."],["",""]],["stepfather","'step,fɑ:ðә","n. 继父\\n[法] 继父",["I hope my new stepfather sticks around longer than the last one.","You must confine yourself to your room, on pretence of a headache, when your stepfather comes back."],["",""]],["blockbuster","'blɒkbʌstә","n. 巨型炸弹",["Govind's company creates computer-generated imagery for blockbuster films.","Sony Pictures has shared a new video clip from its upcoming blockbuster."],["",""]],["mixer","'miksә","n. 混合者, 混合器, 搅拌机, 搅拌器, 混频器, (非正式)交际家, 与人相处的人\\n[计] 混频器, 音装置",["Remove the beaters from the mixer before you lick them.","She bought a toaster, a coffeemaker, an egg cooker and a hand mixer."],["",""]],["tidal","'taidl","a. 潮汐的, 受潮汐影响的",["Mangroves are trees that live in marshes or tidal shores and grow in salty water.","The tidal barrier and flood walls need to be reinforced."],["",""]],["raisin","'reizn","n. 葡萄干",["Good day! I would like two baguettes and two raisin rolls.","Although similar in appearance, the sultana and the raisin are not quite interchangeable."],["",""]],["deterioration","di.tiәriә'reiʃәn","n. 恶化, 衰退, 退化\\n[医] 变坏, 变质, 颓废, 衰退",["The deterioration of corporate earnings has yet to bottom out.","Let's stop the deterioration of the natural environment."],["",""]],["mitigate","'mitigeit","vt. 温和, 缓和, 减轻\\n[医] 缓和, 减轻",["Reducing deforestation is one way to mitigate the impacts of climate change.","Wetlands are an important carbon sink, helping to mitigate the effects of climate change."],["",""]],["chronicle","'krɒnikl","n. 年代记, 记录, 编年史\\nvt. 把...载入编年史",["The Sacramento Chronicle writes frequently about that old trapper.","Resumes are a simple way to chronicle our vocational training."],["",""]],["intended","in'tendid","a. 有意的, 故意的\\nn. 未婚夫(妻)",["He intended to reexamine the case from the beginning.","This book is intended for students who do not speak Japanese as a native language."],["他打算從頭開始重新審查這個案件。","這本書是給母語不是日語的學生的。"]],["interruption",".intә'rʌpʃәn","n. 打扰, 中断, 障碍物\\n[医] 间断, 阻断, 中止",["The company faced a major interruption in business when a fire destroyed their archive of computer hard drives and optical discs.","After this interruption, they didn't continue the conversation."],["",""]],["unrest",".ʌn'rest","n. 不安的状态, 动荡的局面\\n[医] 不安",["Social unrest may come about as a result of the endless rising of prices.","Some scholars ascribe the settlement of America to social unrest in Western Europe."],["",""]],["soothe","su:ð","vt. 缓和, 使安静, 安慰, 奉承\\nvi. 起安慰作用",["For an hour he droned away upon his violin, endeavouring to soothe his own ruffled spirits.","A gift of cheesecake is apparently good to soothe discord."],["",""]],["experimentation","eks,perimen'teiʃәn","n. 实验, 试验, 实验法\\n[化] 实验; 实验过程",["Observation is a passive science, experimentation an active science.","Though animal experimentation is often argued to be necessary for life-saving medical research, this is often not the case."],["",""]],["clasp","klɑ:sp","n. 扣子, 钩, 紧握\\nv. 扣紧, 紧握",["She fastened the clasp of her necklace.","The clasp on this necklace is broken."],["",""]],["obstruction","әb'strʌʃәn","n. 障碍, 妨碍, 闭塞物\\n[医] 梗阻, 不通",["The accusations are shocking: money laundering, tax evasion and obstruction of justice.","Thankfully, the autonomous car detected the obstruction and avoided a collision."],["这些指控令人震惊:洗钱、逃税和妨碍司法公正。",""]],["tow","tәu","n. 拖, 拖绳, 拖轮\\nvt. 拖, 拉, 牵引",["The policeman didn't tow your car away.","Aunt Mary's coming to visit us next week, no doubt with a fair few other relatives in tow."],["警察沒有拖走你的車。",""]],["calling","'kɒ:liŋ","n. 职业, 行业, 呼唤, 召集\\n[计] 呼叫",["Most Americans do not object to my calling them by their first names.","I've tried calling him all day, but the line is busy."],["大多数美国人似乎不反对我直呼其名。","我整天都在打電話給他，但是卻打不通。"]],["blush","blʌʃ","vi. 脸红, 羞愧\\nvt. 弄成红色\\nn. 脸红",["Stop looking at me like that, you'll make me blush.","Some of the college students who are caught cheating on the exams do not even blush."],["",""]],["spaniard","'spænjәd","n. 西班牙人",["The first Spaniard to go to space was with the first Latin American to do the same.","I come from Spain. I'm a Spaniard, and I speak Spanish."],["",""]],["mailbox","'meilbɒks","n. 邮筒, 邮箱\\n[计] 邮箱, 电子邮箱",["Put this stamp on the postcard and drop it in the mailbox.","The neighbours see that the mailbox hasn't been emptied."],["把这张邮票贴在明信片上，然后投到邮箱里。","邻居看见信箱不是空的。"]],["vantage","'væntidʒ","n. 优势, 有利情况",["While the Earth appears to be round when viewed from the vantage point of space, it is actually closer to an ellipsoid.","From these vantage points, you can easily see the town below."],["",""]],["asbestos","æs'bestɒs","n. 石棉\\n[化] 石棉",["Asbestos are linked to a number of deadly lung diseases.","Asbestos is nasty stuff, and it can cause lung cancer if you breathe in the dust."],["",""]],["alteration",".ɒ:ltә'reiʃәn","n. 变更, 改动\\n[医] 变更",["Any alteration to this certificate renders it invalid, and use of an altered certificate could constitute a criminal offence.","The plan is incapable of alteration."],["",""]],["grit","grit","n. 砂砾, 粗砂石\\nvt. 覆以砂砾, 咬牙切齿地说\\nvi. 摩擦作声",["Tom regularly feeds his chooks grit to enhance egg production.","Grit your teeth and keep working on the wretched painting."],["",""]],["peninsula","pi'ninsjulә","n. 半岛, 突出的地方, 伊比利亚半岛",["A humid climate is characteristic of the peninsula.","Have you ever been to the Korean Peninsula?"],["","你去过朝鲜半岛吗？"]],["puddle","'pʌdl","n. 小池, 水坑, 胶土\\nvt. 搅浊, 搅炼\\nvi. 在泥污中打滚, (把黏土等)捣制成胶土",["Angrily, he stomped on the puddle, splashing mud everywhere.","A passing car hit a puddle and splashed water all over me."],["他憤怒地踐踏水坑，弄得泥水四濺。",""]],["fend","fend","vt. 击退, 保护, 供养",["In the past, the boys were taught to fend for themselves while still very young.","In French, I manage to fend myself; in Kabyle, on the other hand, the road will be longer."],["",""]],["shutter","'ʃʌtә","n. 百叶窗, 关闭物, 照相机快门, 关闭者\\nvt. 为...装百叶窗, 以百叶窗遮闭",["Hold the button down until you hear the shutter make a clicking sound.","I forgot to shutter the windows before the storm hit."],["",""]],["ivy","'aivi","n. 常春藤\\na. 学院的, 抽象的",["The wall is partly covered with ivy.","Lovely ivy cascaded down and partially obscured the cave entrance."],["墙被常青藤覆盖了一部分。",""]],["visionary","'viʒәnәri","a. 幻像的, 幻想的, 梦想的\\nn. 有眼力的人, 空想家, 梦想者",["My father is a visionary. He always thinks big, and he thinks people can do a lot more than they actually do.","William was a visionary leader who revolutionized the textile industry."],["",""]],["symbolism","'simbәlizm","n. 象征主义, 符号论\\n[医] 象征主义",["The symbolism behind this Cistercian chapel's sculptural motifs is still not completely understood.","I'm almost certain that people have gotten PhDs from dissertations on phallic symbolism in the Bible."],["",""]],["doubtful","'dautful","a. 可疑的, 疑心的, 不明确的\\n[法] 怀疑的, 有疑问的, 未确的",["Mrs. Harris is very doubtful about her son's future.","The family was highly doubtful of the statement from the military."],["夏里斯太太對她兒子的前途沒有甚麼信心。","家屬對軍方的說法高度置疑。"]],["despise","di'spaiz","vt. 轻视",["The most enlightened way of living is to despise social conventions while at the same time living your life in conformity to them.","Practice is as important as theory, but we are apt to value the latter and despise the former."],["最光明的处世方法是既蔑视社会的因袭，又过着与社会的因袭不相矛盾的生活。","实践和理论同样重要，但我们倾向于重视后者而忽略前者。"]],["affected","ә'fektid","a. 假装的, 做作的, 受影响的",["Generally speaking, nobles were only very slightly affected by taxes.","The schedule is only slightly affected by this delay."],["总体来说，贵族受到税收的影响微乎其微。","日程表只受到了这次延误的轻微影响。"]],["dismay","dis'mei","n. 沮丧\\nvt. 使惊愕, 使气馁",["Much to the dismay of her parents, she went to Canada to study medicine.","To my dismay, he was caught cheating in the examination."],["",""]],["enjoyable","in'dʒɒiәbl","a. 可从中得到乐趣的, 令人愉快的",["Compare it to other enjoyable activities: going to the cinema, reading books, going for walks, chatting to friends etc.","I feel like somehow I've stopped thinking of translation as something enjoyable."],["把它相较于其他有意思的活动：去电影院，看书，散步，跟朋友聊天等等。","不知怎麼的，我覺得翻譯好像已經不再是一件樂事了。"]],["outgoing","'autgәuiŋ","n. 外出, 开支, 流出\\na. 喜欢外出的, 即将离职的, 乐于助人的",["Layla was very outgoing, loving, and caring.","Sami remembers Layla being very outgoing and intelligent."],["萊拉很外向、有愛心、會照顧人。",""]],["intruder","in'tru:dә","n. 侵入者, 干扰者, 妨碍者\\n[计] 入侵者",["Yanni asked Skura to describe what the intruder had been wearing.","A would-be thief got a big surprise when a group of women chanting \"Jesus\" scared the intruder away from their commune."],["",""]],["duo","'dju:әu","n. 二重唱",["Duo, the owl, teaches many languages.","Ziri and Rima started performing as a duo."],["",""]],["clone","klәun","n. 无性系\\n[计] 代用件",["Tom's clone broke out of the facility they were holding him in.","The army decided to clone hundreds of copies of the handsome, athletic man."],["",""]],["jelly","'dʒeli","n. 果冻, 果冻甜食, 胶状物\\nv. (使)结冻, (使)成胶状",["Tom made himself a peanut butter and jelly sandwich.","I'm told that eating jelly helps grow strong nails."],["",""]],["emulate","'emjuleit","vt. 效法, 尽力赶上, 同...竞争\\n[计] 仿真",["At this point in time, you need a powerful computer to emulate this game.","Algeria should emulate what successful economies like Vietnam and South Korea achieved."],["",""]],["ceremonial",".seri'mәunjәl","n. 仪式\\na. 正式的",["England proper is divided into 48 ceremonial counties.","Archeologists have found a Roman ceremonial chariot near Pompeii."],["",""]],["logging","'lɒgiŋ","n. (木材)采运作业, (事物状况的)记录\\n[经] 测井",["You need a password to log in again after logging out.","By logging on, you acknowledge you have no expectation of privacy."],["登出後重新登入需要密碼。",""]],["bladder","'blædә","n. 膀胱, 囊\\n[医] 囊, 膀胱",["Phew, we made it in time. My bladder was about to explode.","For gall bladder surgery, go down this hall and take a right."],["",""]],["refrain","ri'frein","n. 重复的话, 叠句, 副歌\\nvi. 节制, 避免, 克制",["Please refrain from smoking in the elevator.","Please refrain from smoking in public places."],["電梯內不准吸煙。","在公共场所请控制自己不要吸烟。"]],["untouched",".ʌn'tʌtʃt","a. 未触摸过的, 未改变的, 未受影响的",["The stairs are completely clean and untouched from what I can tell.","In this part of Algeria, you can find thick forests and untouched landscapes."],["",""]],["lavish","'læviʃ","a. 大方的, 丰富的, 浪费的\\nvt. 浪费, 滥用, 慷慨给予",["The real estate broker was lavish in his spending in Ginza.","Tom and Mary had a lavish wedding with no expense spared."],["",""]],["ballroom","'bɒ:lrum","n. 舞厅, 跳舞场",["The king held a masquerade ball in the grand ballroom.","As the orchestra in the space hotel's ballroom played on, dancers from various worlds swayed gaily about."],["",""]],["knuckle","'nʌkl","n. 指节, 蹄爪, 膝关节\\nv. 以指节打, 以手指射",["As incredible as it may seem, she ordered a knuckle of ham with sauerkraut.","As funny as the whole concept of a knuckle sandwich is, I wouldn't ever want to be on the receiving end."],["",""]],["confidentiality","","[计] 机密性\\n[经] 保密",["Doctor-patient confidentiality should be respected at all times.","We had to agree to total confidentiality and sign a non-disclosure agreement."],["",""]],["pointed","'pɒintid","a. 尖的, 有尖顶的, 锐利的, 率直的, 显然的",["The teacher pointed her finger at me and asked me to come with her.","He pointed out how important it is to observe the law."],["教师用手指指着我，要我跟她走。","他指出了遵守法律的重要性。"]],["retrospective",".retrә'spektiv","a. 回顾的, 怀旧的, 在后面的\\nn. 回顾展",["We'll start the meeting with a retrospective look at the past year.","Kirsty went to the art gallery to see the Matisse retrospective."],["",""]],["pilgrim","'pilgrim","n. 旅行者, 朝圣者, 香客\\nvi. 朝圣",["The well-spoken man claimed to be a pilgrim, but he was actually a spy for the bandits.","I took 4 shots of cranberry sauce last night and started busting it open for a pilgrim."],["",""]],["midwestern","'mid'westәn","a. 美国中西部的",["In the Midwestern U.S., you are expected to say \"good morning,\" but this is not the case in the Eastern U.S.","Forecasters said the storm was bringing snow, sleet and freezing rain to Midwestern and Southern states, where temperatures were expected to be 20 to 40 degrees below average."],["",""]],["checklist","","n. 清单, (美)选举人名单, 名册, 目录册",["The first checklist was published in 1961."],[""]],["milestone","'mailstәun","n. 里程碑, 里程石, 里程标",["That day was an important milestone in our project.","She sees the service award as a milestone in her career."],["",""]],["curtail","kә:'teil","vt. 缩减, 剥夺, 简略\\n[法] 剥夺特权",["We can say that there's not a clear winner in terms of a policy to curtail medical expenses and benefits.","Their efforts to curtail spending didn't quite succeed."],["",""]],["amusing","ә'mju:ziŋ","a. 有趣的, 引人发笑的",["She read an amusing story to the children.","In the same way, a Russian might fail to see anything amusing in a joke which would make an Englishman laugh to tears."],["她给孩子们读了个有趣的故事。",""]],["federation","fedә'reiʃәn","n. 联邦, 联合, 联盟\\n[法] 联邦, 联盟, 联邦政府",["Carlos Queiroz was fired by the Portuguese Football Federation.","Lieutenant Worf is a Klingon who serves as an officer aboard the Federation starship Enterprise."],["",""]],["hamper","'hæpә","n. 食篮, 阻碍物, 食盒\\nvt. 阻碍, 使困累, 妨碍, 牵制",["A well-used creel might better not be picked as a picnic hamper.","Keep dirty clothes in the laundry hamper, not on the floor."],["",""]],["reappear",".ri:ә'piә","vi. 再出现",["Metal birds come and go, deliver and take people and goods, disappear and reappear behind the symmetrical artificial mountains.","Halley is the comet that proved correct Edmund Halley's prediction that it would reappear."],["",""]],["lineage","'liniidʒ","n. 血统, 直系\\n[法] 血统, 世系",["Anna's striking almond-shaped eyes, inherited from her Asian lineage, exude a captivating depth and a hint of mystery.","An aristocratic title is only inherited via the male lineage."],["安娜引人注目的杏仁狀眼睛繼承了她的亞洲血統，散發著迷人的深度和一絲神秘感。",""]],["booming","'bu:miŋ","a. 急速发展的\\n[经] 暴涨的, 大受欢迎的",["\"Speak, father!\" once again he cried, \"If I may yet be gone!\" And but the booming shots replied, And fast the flames rolled on.","Algeria should have a booming economy with wealthy citizens."],["",""]],["beta","'beitә","n. 希腊字母表的第二个字母\\n[医] β(希腊文的第二个字母), 乙种",["Alpha, beta and gamma are Greek letters.","What Microsoft is launching is a beta version of its \"NetShow streaming server\"; it supplies video and audio on demand."],["阿尔法、贝塔和咖玛是希腊文字。",""]],["motto","'mɒtәu","n. 箴言, 座右铭, 警句",["\"Freedom, Equality, Brotherhood\" is also Haiti's motto.","\"Liberty, equality, fraternity\" is also the national motto of Haiti."],["",""]],["damned","dæmd","a. 可恶的, 该死的\\nadv. 非常",["I knew Mary could do it, but I'd be damned if I'd ask for help.","Ever since you arrived, this house has been cursed and damned."],["",""]],["herbal","'hә:bәl","a. 草药的\\n[医] 本草书",["I returned to bed with herbal tea and a piece of cake.","Sami told Layla that the herbal tea would make her better."],["我回到床上，喝了杯花草茶，吃了一塊蛋糕。",""]],["said","sed","a. 上述的\\nsay的过去式和过去分词",["Tom said that he had been cleaning the house all day.","Had I known that, I wouldn't have said such a thing to her."],["汤姆说他打扫屋子打扫了一天。","如果我早知道，我不会跟她说这种话。"]],["vegetarian",".vedʒi'tєәriәn","n. 素食者, 食草动物\\na. 素食的",["The pilaf with meat is eight yuan. The vegetarian pilaf is only four yuan.","Even though my friend was a vegetarian, I didn't tell him that the soup had some meat in it."],["抓饭肉是八块钱。素抓饭只是四块钱。","我的朋友是吃素的，可是我沒有告訴他湯裏有肉。"]],["fragrant","'freigrәnt","a. 芬香的, 馥郁的, 愉快的",["The attic was a long, low-ceilinged room, dark and fragrant with the odor of the cedar.","She planted fragrant olives in the garden."],["閣樓是一個狹長的低矮房間，光線昏暗，瀰漫著雪松的香氣。","她在花园里种了桂花。"]],["banquet","'bæŋkwit","n. 宴会",["He loves a banquet, provided he is not expected to make a speech.","And the banquet sponsor tasted the water, which had turned into wine."],["",""]],["phenomenal","fi'nɒminәl","a. 现象的, 能知觉的, 异常的, 显著的, 惊人的",["I will be phenomenal to the women. I mean, I want to help women.","The series finale was good, but the show itself was phenomenal."],["",""]],["gravy","'greivi","n. 肉汁, 外快",["I'm sure that you know that I love biscuits and gravy.","It probably comes as no surprise that I like biscuits and gravy."],["",""]],["equilibrium",".i:kwi'libriәm","n. 平衡, 平静, 均衡\\n[化] 平衡",["We could apply the theory of punctuated equilibrium to languages.","Body equilibrium is one of the cerebellum's functions."],["我们可以把间断平衡理论应用到语言上。",""]],["luxurious","lʌg'zjuәriәs","a. 豪华的, 奢侈的, 放纵的",["The new theatre looks very luxurious.","Norwegian prisons are the most luxurious in the world."],["新劇院看上去很豪華。",""]],["ratify","'rætifai","vt. 批准, 认可\\n[经] 证实, 肯定, 确认",["A majority of two thirds is required to ratify an overture.","Now, we just need to ratify the voting results. Please sign here and here."],["",""]],["irresistible",".iri'zistәbl","a. 不可抵抗的, 不能压制的\\n[经] 不可抗力",["The Dodgers went on winning with irresistible force.","The urge to brag on his recent successes was irresistible."],["",""]],["peacefully","","adv. 平静地",["International disputes must be settled peacefully.","He had gone there to help garbage workers strike peacefully for better pay and working conditions."],["國際間的紛爭一定要用和平的方法來解決。","他去了那裏幫助清潔工人和平地爭取更高的薪金和更好的工作環境。"]],["fireman","'faiәmәn","n. 救火队员, 消防队员\\n[机] 司炉",["The brave fireman rescued a boy from the burning house.","I don't recall ever wanting to be a fireman or a baseball player as a youth."],["",""]],["imposing","im'pәuziŋ","a. 令人难忘的, 壮丽的, 威风的",["We should try to avoid imposing our own beliefs on others.","Austria is considering stopping all rail traffic from Italy and imposing other controls on its border with its southern neighbor."],["我們應該盡量避免把我們自己的信念強加在別人身上。",""]],["bourgeois","buә'ʒwɑ:","n. 中产阶级分子, 商人, 资产阶级\\na. 中产阶级的, 平庸的\\nn. 九点活字",["Marriage is the true fortress of bourgeois morality.","The term \"bourgeois\" can be used as an insult by both the lower and the upper classes."],["",""]],["ballpark","'bɔl.pɑ:k","n. （美）棒球场；活动领域；可变通范围",["You can go to the ballpark on this bus.","When we all estimated the price of the house, York's answer of $20 wasn't even in the same ballpark as the rest of our estimates."],["坐這個公車可以到球場。",""]],["murky","'mә:ki","a. 黝暗的, 阴沉的, 朦胧的",["The water was so murky that the police divers had to search for the body by feel.","Stefan dived and disappeared into the murky water."],["",""]],["glamor","'glæmә","n. 魅力, 迷人的美, 魔法\\nvt. 迷惑",["The model was featured on the cover of the glamor magazine.","They all moved to Algiers to start a new life of blitz and glamor."],["",""]],["guaranteed","","a. 有保证的, ；有人担保的",["Playing WHAT THE CAR? with friends is a guaranteed laugh-out-loud experience.","Freedom of thought is guaranteed by the constitution."],["與朋友玩《WHAT THE CAR?》，保證能得到讓你開懷大笑的遊戲體驗。","思想自由為憲法所保障。"]],["rosemary","'rәuzmәri","n. 迷迭香\\n[化] 迷迭香",["Basil, sage, rosemary, thyme and oregano are popular herbs.","Bundles are made up of caperspurge, rosemary, and twigs."],["",""]],["sighting","saitiŋ","n. 照准；瞄准；视线",["The earliest known record of a comet sighting was made by an astrologer of the Chinese court in 1059 B.C."],[""]],["upheaval","ʌp'hi:vl","n. 举起, 隆起, 大变动, 剧变",["The Industrial Revolution caused a great upheaval in society.","That upheaval greatly accelerated Mary's brother's baldness."],["",""]],["inadvertently","ˌɪnədˈvɜ:təntli","adv. 漫不经心地, 疏忽地; 非故意地",["They claimed that my name had been inadvertently eliminated from the voter registration list.","The steak was inadvertently burnt, but nonetheless it tasted spectacular."],["",""]],["seasoning","'si:zniŋ","n. 调味品, 作料, 佐料, 锻练\\n[化] 天然时效",["Making love to an expressionless woman is like sipping soup without any seasoning.","Add seasoning, seasoned oil, and chili, to the boiling water."],["",""]],["sparkling","'spɑ:liŋ","a. 闪闪发光的, 闪烁的, 闪烁着才华的",["Her diamond is sparkling under the light.","The water between the moss-covered stones was sparkling in the sun."],["她的钻石在亮光下闪闪发光。",""]],["psychologically",",psaikә'lɔdʒikәli","adv. 心理上, 从心理学角度",["It is psychologically difficult for her to say no.","This accident has psychologically traumatized him."],["",""]],["tuberculosis","tju,bә:kju'lәusis","n. 肺结核\\n[医] 顿挫性结核",["The most commonly counterfeited medicines in poor countries are used to treat life-threatening conditions such as malaria, tuberculosis and HIV/AIDS.","Some years ago, learning that one had tuberculosis amounted to hearing a sentence of death."],["在貧窮國家，最常見的仿冒藥品是用來治療瘧疾、結核病和愛滋病等危及生命的疾病的藥品。",""]],["fluorescent",".fluә'resәnt","n. 荧光\\na. 荧光的",["Yanni uses fluorescent tubes in the kitchen and the bathroom.","This fluorescent lamp is starting to flicker. We'll have to replace it."],["",""]],["demanding","di'mɑ:ndiŋ","a. 要求高的, 费力的",["The scores are low because the task is cognitively demanding.","Kate broke his heart by rudely demanding he go away."],["",""]],["lava","'lɑ:vә","n. 熔岩, 火山岩\\n[医] 火山石(一种顺势疗法药)",["Thanks to genetic engineering, there are now penguins that swim in lava.","Basalt is a type of rock that forms when lava solidifies."],["",""]],["pineapple","'pain.æpl","n. 凤梨, 菠萝, 失业救济金\\n[医] 凤梨, 波萝",["You can decorate the cocktail with a cherry or a pineapple.","This fruit is shaped like an orange and tastes like a pineapple."],["你可以用一个樱桃或菠萝来装饰这杯鸡尾酒。","这种水果形状像橙子，味道像菠萝。"]],["mediator","'mi:dieitә","n. 调停者, 传递者, 基督\\n[医] 间介器, 传递器, 介质, 传递质介体",["The mediator between the head and the hands must be the heart.","Mookie acts as a mediator between the black community and the Italian community."],["",""]],["bouquet","bu'kei","n. 花束\\n[医] 丛, 酒香, 末梢分极",["She held a large bouquet of artificial flowers in her hands.","Sami put Layla's bouquet in his room."],["她手裡拿著一大束假花。","薩米將萊拉的花束放在了他的房間裡。"]],["anthrax","'ænθræks","n. 炭疽\\n[医] 炭疽(脾脱疽)",["Many countries take measures in order to protect themselves against anthrax or smallpox better.","Upon learning that Bill had contacted anthrax, the doctor immediately administered him Levofloxacin."],["",""]],["womb","wu:m","n. 子宫, 发源地\\n[医] 子宫",["Surely he can not enter a second time into his mother's womb to be born!","When I was inside my mother's womb, I looked through my mother's navel at the house where I would be born and I thought: \"No way I'm going there\"."],["他当然不可能回到娘胎里再出生一次了！","當我在我母親的子宮裡, 我從我母親的肚臍看到我將要出生的房子, 我心想: 我不要到那裡。\""]],["sustainability","sə,stenə'bɪlɪti","n. 持续性, 能维持性, 永续性",["Benedito's research focuses on environmental sustainability.","Carlos's company had received numerous awards for its contributions to environmental sustainability."],["",""]],["tutor","'tju:tә","n. 家庭教师, 导师, 助教, 监护人\\nvt. 当...的教师, 教, 指导, 约束, 克制\\nvi. 当家庭教师, 受家庭教师的指导",["He is a tutor for the math department.","I'm looking for a private tutor to communicate in Japanese."],["他是数学系的导师。",""]],["depressing","di'presiŋ","a. 抑压的, 沉闷的, 阴沉的",["It was all the more depressing because it was raining.","For some reason it looks to be turning out to be a depressing week."],["",""]],["chalk","tʃɒ:k","n. 粉笔, 白垩\\nvt. 用粉笔写, 记录",["Take this piece of chalk and write on the blackboard.","Please bring me two pieces of chalk."],["拿起這支粉筆，在黑板上寫字。","给我拿两根粉笔来，谢谢。"]],["crossroads","","n. 十字路口, 交叉路口, 聚会的中心地点, (喻)需作抉择的重要关头, 紧要关头",["There's been an accident at the crossroads.","When we came to the crossroads our cab slowed down."],["十字路口出了车祸。",""]],["enclave","en'cleiv","n. 被包围的领土\\n[医] 被包围物",["The death of thousands of people in Gaza is inevitable and that's what turns any massive attack on that enclave into a genocide.","Israel could have flooded the Gaza-Egypt tunnels without annihilating the Palestinian enclave."],["",""]],["lifting","'liftiŋ","[化] 吊装; 提升",["When you're about to have exams, lifting weights really does relieve stress, and it's also good for your mind and body.","Always bend your knees when you're lifting something off the ground."],["快要考试的时候，举重真的消愁解闷，再说对身体和精神都很好。",""]],["displacement","dis'pleismәnt","n. 换置, 移位, 移动, 取代\\n[化] 顶替展开法",["The workers of the northern countries have paid a high price for the displacement of production in the southern regions.","Many adults missed out on schooling because of warfare and displacement."],["",""]],["trek","trek","vi. 牛拉货车, 艰苦跋涉\\nn. 牛车旅行, 艰苦跋涉",["The daily trek to midtown Manhattan takes about an hour and a half.","We're taking a crash course in first aid before our two-week trek through the mountains."],["",""]],["leftist","'leftist","n. 左翼的人, 左派\\na. 左派的",["You're not a leftist; you're a contrarian edgelord who typically sides with the far right.","I'm leftist. This means that my left hand is dominant."],["",""]],["furnace","'fә:nis","n. 火炉, 熔炉, 考验\\nvt. 在炉中烧",["Tom went down to the basement to see what was wrong with the furnace.","It is not as a child that I believe and confess Jesus Christ. My hosanna is born of a furnace of doubt."],["",""]],["pigment","'pigmәnt","n. 色素, 色质, 颜料\\n[化] 颜料",["It is said that Lycopene, a pigment found in tomatoes, makes your skin beautiful and helps you lose weight.","Scientists have discovered that an ancient pigment, called Egyptian blue, can be used as dusting powder to detect fingerprints."],["",""]],["nuance","nju:'ɑ:ns","n. 细微差别",["In Japanese, even if it's the same word, if the notation is different, slight differences in meaning and nuance can be expressed.","Some things should be simplified; others need more nuance."],["",""]],["gadget","'gædʒit","n. 小配件, 小玩意, 诡计",["This is a great time-saving gadget for the housewife.","Every gadget is just imaginary before one makes it for the first time."],["",""]],["stunt","stʌnt","n. 特技, 绝技, 花招, 噱头, 手腕, 发育不良\\nvt. 阻碍成长\\nvi. 表演特技",["Just know that another stunt like this will cost you dearly.","She revved up the motorcycle's engine in preparation for the stunt."],["",""]],["alcoholism","'ælkәhɒlizәm","n. 酗酒, 酒精中毒\\n[化] 酒中毒",["Tom's alcoholism not only wrecked his own life but also those of the people around him.","She suffers from a debilitating case of alcoholism."],["",""]],["wisely","'waizli","adv. 聪明地, 精明地",["Whatever you do, do it wisely, and don't forget about the end.","It is human nature to think wisely and to act in an absurd fashion."],["",""]],["intuitive","in'tju:itiv","a. 直觉的",["There is a second way to define the Gabriel-Roiter measure which may be more intuitive.","If you make your design more intuitive, your app will get better app store ratings."],["",""]],["eradicate","i'rædikeit","vt. 根除, 扑灭, 根绝, 消灭",["We shall continue our efforts to eradicate racial discrimination.","We must eradicate the drug traffic, root and branch."],["",""]],["underwater","'ʌndә'wɒ:tә","a. 在水中的\\nadv. 在水下",["Let's see who can hold their breath underwater the longest.","If you go underwater, hold your nose and blow to clear your ears."],["",""]],["undercut","'ʌndәkʌt","n. 底切, 牛腰部下侧嫩肉, 下口, 下旋削球\\nvt. 廉价出售, 底切, 雕出, 下旋削球\\nvi. 切除底部",["These challenges could undercut efforts by many African countries to increase agricultural production.","I got my pronouns shaved into my undercut and dyed my hair blue."],["",""]],["augment","ɒ:g'ment","v. 增加, 增长\\n[计] 增加; 增量; 添加",["Peasants often have a secondary activity to augment their income.","It is astonishing to what lengths they will go to augment their already enormous amounts of wealth."],["",""]],["shun","ʃʌn","vt. 避开, 规避, 避免",["The community is quite closed off and is known to shun outsiders.","Shun will take over my job while I'm away."],["",""]],["fortress","'fɒ:tris","n. 城堡, 要塞\\nvt. 筑要塞, 以要塞防守",["The author of Fortress Besieged is Qian Zhongshu.","The fortress was secure from every kind of attack."],["《围城》的作者是钱钟书。",""]],["touching","'tʌtʃiŋ","a. 动人的, 令人同情的",["Living away from family, receiving, now and then, friends' concern can be particularly touching.","Let go of my arm! I can't stand people touching me."],["在異鄉生活，偶爾收到朋友的關懷讓人倍感溫暖。","放開我的手臂！我不能忍受有人碰我。"]],["caption","'kæpʃәn","n. 说明, 字幕, 标题\\nvt. 加上标题, 加上说明\\n[计] 标题",["Generate a concise and descriptive caption for this image.","Imogen of the Internet cannot look at a cat, even a dead one, without coming up with a blood-curdlingly saccharine, egregiously misspelled caption in 60-point white Impact."],["",""]],["binding","'baindiŋ","n. 装订\\n[计] 联编; 汇集; 绑定, 捆绑",["If you agree to binding arbitration, you may forfeit some of your rights.","Tom read the book so many times that the binding started coming apart."],["",""]],["devastation",".devә'steiʃәn","n. 毁坏",["The devastation in Kobe was as terrible as I had imagined.","Misfortune and devastation always go hand in hand."],["",""]],["racer","'reisә","n. 比赛者, 游蛇属黑蛇",["Cycling through slush on a racer isn't wise, but this year there's no alternative.","The racer looked as though he might eat the wall after trying to juke his opponent."],["",""]],["safeguard","'seifgɑ:d","n. 保卫, 保护措施, 防护设施\\nvt. 保卫, 保护",["The safeguard of the state shall be the supreme law.","Free flow of information is the only safeguard against tyranny."],["",""]],["raising","'reiziŋ","[机] 起油",["He sows discord by raising controversial subjects.","The raising of children is something that concerns the entire community. There will be an education reform."],["他挑起爭議性高的話題，製造紛爭。","子女培养全社会都很关心，教育要进行改革。"]],["larva","'lɑ:vә","n. 幼虫\\n[医] 幼虫(昆虫), 蚴(蠕虫)",["The life cycle of an amphibian consists of three stages: egg, larva and adult.","Every butterfly has been a larva, but not all larvae will become butterflies."],["",""]],["rapper","'ræpә","n. 敲门人, (美)(非正式)控告人, 证人, 检举人\\n[机] 敲杆",["A rapper without bling is like a pope without a crucifix.","The rapper Tamer Nafar wrote a beautiful lament for him."],["",""]],["insulin","'insjulin","n. 胰岛素\\n[化] 胰岛素",["Have you been keeping up a normal diet since the last shot of insulin?","The syringe is the instrument most commonly used to administer insulin."],["你最後一次注射胰島素之後有正常飲食嗎？",""]],["midday","'middei","n. 正午, 中午\\na. 正午的",["They will contact us before midday today.","I got sunburnt after riding my motorcycle at midday."],["他们会在今天中午之前联系我们。",""]],["interdisciplinary",",intә(:)'disiplinәri","[计] 学科间的",["It should be clear that the curriculum reform is mandatory in order to enhance interdisciplinary research.","Cognitive scientists study the mind from an interdisciplinary perspective."],["",""]],["barber","'bɑ:bә","n. 理发师",["It doesn't matter whether your beard has grown for four years or seven. When the barber shaves it he'll use that same blade.","I had my hair cut at the barber shop yesterday."],["不論你的鬍子長了四年還是七年, 理髮師用刀子剔的時間都是一樣的。","我昨天去了理髮店理髮。"]],["cartridge","'kɑ:tridʒ","n. 弹药筒, 弹药, 一卷软片, 墨粉鼓\\n[计] 盒式磁带机",["Please replace the empty ink cartridge in the printer.","Please replace the empty ink jet cartridge in the printer."],["请把打印机里面的空的墨粉鼓换掉。",""]],["fallout","'fɒ:laut","n. 原子尘的降下, 辐射性微尘, 原子尘, 附带结果\\n[医] [放射尘]回降",["Strontium 90: One of the radioisotopes of strontium; part of radioactive fallout, harmful to human health.","He made a farcical attempt to save face during the fallout of his sex scandal."],["",""]],["heed","hi:d","n. 注意, 留心\\nv. 注意, 留心",["Spirits of Heaven and Earth, heed my call; manifest swiftly by divine decree!","And he saw in a dream God, saying to him: Take heed thou speak not any thing harshly against Jacob."],["天靈靈，地靈靈；急急如律令！",""]],["scam","skæm","n. 骗局, 诡计；故事",["In retrospect, I should have known that it was a scam.","It never occurred to me that the whole thing might be a scam."],["",""]],["malaria","mә'lєәriә","n. 疟疾, 瘴气\\n[医] 疟[疾]",["The most commonly counterfeited medicines in poor countries are used to treat life-threatening conditions such as malaria, tuberculosis and HIV/AIDS.","Scientists warn the most effective drug used to treat malaria is becoming ineffective in parts of Southeast Asia."],["在貧窮國家，最常見的仿冒藥品是用來治療瘧疾、結核病和愛滋病等危及生命的疾病的藥品。",""]],["horrific","hɒ'rifik","a. 令人毛骨悚然的, 感到恐惧的",["Their savage cruelty against God's people was beyond horrific, resulting in the Maccabean uprising.","If he had been careful back then, the horrific accident would not have happened."],["",""]],["indonesian",".indәu'ni:ʒәn","a. 印尼的\\nn. 印尼人, 印尼语群",["I've done rock climbing and deep-sea diving and slept in an Indonesian jungle.","I didn't know you knew how to cook Indonesian food."],["",""]],["unsafe",".ʌn'seif","a. 不安全的, 不安稳的, 危险的\\n[经] 不安全",["It probably would be unsafe to do that by yourself.","Mary kept tailgating the car in front of us even though I told her it was unsafe to do so."],["",""]],["avoidance","ә'vɒidәns","n. 避免, 避开, 逃避\\n[经] 回避, 废止, 宣告无效",["Trust is risk, and risk avoidance is the name of the game in business.","The government is cracking down on tax avoidance schemes."],["",""]],["liken","'laikәn","vt. 比喻, 比拟",["On the Web, I have met Japanese who would liken their country to cozy Guatemala. I call the phenomenon \"The Guatemala Model.\""],[""]],["scant","skænt","a. 不充分的, 不足的\\nvt. 减少, 吝啬, 限制, 藐视, 忽略",["Scant, low, scraggy cedars gave place to more numerous, darker, greener, bushier ones, and these to high, full-foliaged, green-berried trees.","The volunteer firefighters fought the blaze bravely, with scant regard for their own safety."],["稀疏、低矮、枝葉稀疏的雪松被數量更多、顏色更深、更綠、更茂密的雪松所取代，這些雪松又被高大、枝繁葉茂、結滿綠色漿果的樹木所取代。",""]],["allergic","ә'lә:dʒik","a. 对...过敏的, 极反感的\\n[医] 变应性的",["Many people are allergic to peanuts.","Don't forget that Tom is allergic to peanuts."],["有很多人對花生過敏。","不要忘记汤姆对花生过敏。"]],["licensed","'laisnst","a. 得到许可的\\n[经] 领有执照的, 领到许可证的",["Driving alone or without a licensed adult is grounds for having your learner's permit revoked.","This work is licensed under a Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International license."],["",""]],["lurch","lә:tʃ","n. 惨败, 倾斜, 挫折, 举步蹒跚, 徘徊\\nvi. 惨败, 倾斜, 徘徊\\nvt. 击败",["Sami managed to lurch forward another six feet towards the door before he was tased by a security guard.","If Tom had taught Mary how to do that we wouldn't be in a lurch now he's galavanting around Miami."],["",""]],["gamble","'gæmbl","n. 赌博, 冒险\\nv. 赌博, 孤注一掷",["After Tom lost his job, he started to gamble to cope with his depression.","If you gamble on the stock market, you are an investor... If you gamble on the derivatives market, you are a trader... If you gamble at the casino, you are a loser... Morality?"],["湯姆失業後，為了排遣鬱悶的心情而開始了賭博。","如果你在股票市場上賭博，你是個投資者...如果你在衍生性金融商品市場上賭博，你是個商人...如果你在賭場上賭博，你是個失敗者...道德？"]],["brisk","brisk","a. 强烈的, 寒冷而干燥的, 活泼的\\nvt. 使活泼\\nvi. 活跃起来",["Sales were brisk during the holiday season but have dropped off since.","Business is brisk now and we are up to the elbows in orders."],["假期期間銷售業績暢旺，但之後就下滑了。",""]],["bounty","'baunti","n. 慷慨, 宽大, 礼物\\n[经] 奖励金, 补贴",["Beauty without bounty avails naught.","Tom thought that Mary would make a good bounty hunter."],["沒有仁愛的美麗毫無用處",""]],["cramped","'kræmpt","a. 狭窄的, 难懂的, 难辨的",["I want to move out of this cramped room as soon as I can.","My leg cramped up as I ran down the stairs to catch a train, and I had to sit down right there in the middle of the stairway."],["我想尽快从这个不透气的屋子里出去。",""]],["authoritative","ɒ:'θɒritәtiv","a. 权威性的, 官方的, 命令式的\\n[法] 官方的, 当局的, 权威的",["These days Mary is never sure to whom grammar questions should be addressed to ensure an authoritative answer.","Every piece of knowledge must have a single, unambiguous, authoritative representation within a system."],["",""]],["rocker","'rɒkә","n. 摇的人, 摇杆\\n[电] 摇杆",["You're probably going to think this is a joke, but I was a punk rocker when I was a kid.","She's gone completely off her rocker."],["",""]],["irritation",".iri'teiʃәn","n. 刺激, 烦恼, 刺激物\\n[医] 刺激[作用], 兴奋",["Mary smiled, but her voice had some irritation in it.","After she removed the bandage, the irritation subsided."],["瑪麗微笑，但是聲音帶著些許氣惱。",""]],["ostensibly","","adv. 可公开, 显然, 表面, 外表, 诡称, 假装",["The rise in ticket prices was ostensibly to pay for improvements to the service.","He invited her up to his room, ostensibly to look at his stamp collection."],["",""]],["blindness","'blaindnis","n. 盲目, 失明, 愚昧\\n[医] 盲, 视觉缺失",["Eating carrots can help cure night blindness.","He made up his mind to jog in spite of his blindness."],["吃胡蘿蔔可以治夜盲症。",""]],["arabic","'ærәbik","n. 阿拉伯语\\na. 阿拉伯语的, 阿拉伯人的, 阿拉伯式的",["Tom wanted to be able to read the original Quran and solely for that reason he started learning Arabic.","Sami has to go to his chemistry class and he will see you in Arabic."],["汤姆是为了能够看懂古兰经的原文才去开始学习阿拉伯语的。","萨米得去上他的化学课，他会用阿拉伯语和你会面。"]],["flea","fli:","n. 跳蚤\\n[医] 蚤",["Karen bought a lot of things at the flea market.","Let's go to the flea market tomorrow."],["凱倫在跳蚤市場買了很多東西。","我們明天去跳蚤市場吧。"]],["console","kәn'sәul","vt. 安慰, 藉慰\\nn. 控制台\\n[计] 控制台",["The model and serial numbers are located on the bottom of the console.","Avoid prolonged use of the console. To help prevent eye strain, take a break of about 15 minutes during every hour of play."],["",""]],["fatty","'fæti","a. 肥胖的, 脂肪的, 含脂肪的\\n[医] 脂肪的",["Fish is considered a good source of omega threes, fatty acids thought to be beneficial to health.","He always feels cold because he does not have enough fatty layering on his body."],["",""]],["reaffirm",".ri:ә'fә:m","vt. 重申, 再确认",["Next Sunday, we'll have an opportunity to once again reaffirm our historic commitment to democracy, freedom, and the rule of law.","He says the incident is lamentable but the government wants to reaffirm that it will not affect in anyway the organization and security of the soccer tournament."],["",""]],["coma","'kәumә","n. 昏迷, 麻木, 彗发\\n[化] 彗差; 彗形像差",["Unfortunately, my neighbor was involved in a traffic accident, and is currently in a coma.","Tom couldn't catch up with the other students after he came out of his coma."],["很不幸地，我的鄰居被捲入交通事故，呈現昏迷狀態。",""]],["hymn","him","n. 赞美诗, 圣歌\\nv. 唱赞美歌",["Besides the thirty operas Verdi wrote a string quartet, the Manzoni Requiem, and a national hymn.","The hymn Abide with Me is sung before kick-off at every FA Cup Final."],["",""]],["gala","'geilә","n. 节日, 祝贺",["The actor's illustrious career was honored at a gala event attended by a bevy of A-list celebrities.","A fine layer of dust covered the finery in the wardrobe, evidence of how long it had been since she last attended a gala."],["",""]],["jumper","'dʒʌmpә","n. 跳跃者, 工作服\\n[计] 跳线连接器, 跳接器",["The child has picked a hole in his new jumper.","Tom always keeps a set of jumper cables in the trunk of his car."],["孩子的新毛衣上勾了一个洞。",""]],["tolerant","'tɒlәrәnt","a. 宽容的, 容忍的, (对冷、热)能耐的\\n[医] 能耐受的",["It is said that Dutch are tolerant.","Cassava is a drought-tolerant crop and consequently a major staple food for millions of people."],["人們常說荷蘭人很寬容。",""]],["solemn","'sɒlәm","a. 严肃的, 郑重的, 庄严的",["I am that Ravenswood to whom you granted the solemn engagement which you now desire to retract and cancel.","A solemn wisp of smoke rose from the shattered city."],["",""]],["rainfall","'reinfɒ:l","n. 降雨, 降雨量\\n[经] 降雨量",["We had a heavy rainfall last night.","Extensive rainfall is expected throughout the region."],["昨晚雨勢很大。",""]],["heave","hi:v","n. 举, 抛, 起伏, 鼓起\\nvt. 用力举起, 使举起, 使鼓起\\nvi. 抛出, 起伏, 喘息, 凸起",["This ship is outfitted with a windlass to heave up the anchor.","Here plying levers, where the flooring shows / weak joists, we heave it over."],["",""]],["concur","kәn'kә:","vi. 同意, 一致, 同时发生\\n[法] 同时发生, 并发, 同意",["He made a very strong argument, to which I had no choice but to concur.","The decision is not optimal, but I concur."],["",""]],["cranberry","'krænbәri","n. 越橘",["I took 4 shots of cranberry sauce last night and started busting it open for a pilgrim.","My stepsister finished the last of the cranberry juice."],["",""]],["disregard",".disri'gɑ:d","n. 忽视, 漠视\\nvt. 忽视, 不顾",["I have no business making demands and you have every right to simply disregard all this rubbish I've written and send me whatever you bloody well please.","Please disregard this notice if your shipment has already been made."],["我无权提出要求，而且你有权无视我写的这些垃圾，怎么样都随你的便。",""]],["glaze","'gleiz","n. 釉, 上光, 光滑面\\nvt. 装以玻璃, 上釉于\\nvi. 变得光滑, (目光)变呆滞",["Place them on the baking sheet, then glaze them with egg yolk.","You can glaze carrots with honey when cooking them."],["",""]],["hound","haund","n. 猎犬\\nvt. 带猎犬狩猎, 追捕, 激励, 使追逐",["What beast dost thou think thou art? Art thou a hound or a rat?","Yogi Bear drove the Jeep and Huckleberry Hound sat beside him."],["你認為你是什麼野獸？獵犬還是老鼠？",""]],["proxy","'prɒksi","n. 代理, 代理人, 委托书\\n[经] 代理人, 代表权, 授权书",["Saudi Arabia and Iran are already fighting a proxy war in Yemen.","Once you have a Psiphon account, you can log in through a network of proxy servers to connect to the main Psiphon server."],["",""]],["crib","krib","n. 婴儿小床, 食槽, 蓄栏\\nvi. 抄袭\\nvt. 拘禁, 关入栅栏",["The baby is on the way and my husband hasn't put the crib together yet.","The baby sleeps in a crib next to his parents' bed."],["",""]],["dread","dred","n. 恐惧, 可怕的人(或事)\\na. 可怕的, 可怖的\\nv. 恐惧, 害怕",["My writing desk, a place of dread: an incredible number of incredibly useful drawers - combined with incredibly little legspace.","Why do you think animals dread fire?"],["我的書桌很嚇人：那麼多那麼有用抽屜，放在那麼小、剛夠伸腿的地方。","你為什麼覺得動物怕火呢？"]],["camper","'kæmpә","n. 露营者",["Tom bought an old ambulance and converted it into a camper.","We're taking the camper van to Portugal this year."],["湯姆買了一輛舊救護車，並把它改裝成露營車。",""]],["livelihood","'laivlihud","n. 生计, 营生, 生活",["I'm not living for the sake of work; I'm working for the sake of a livelihood.","The two felt the pressing necessity of earning a livelihood."],["",""]],["chemist","'kemist","n. 化学家, 药剂师\\n[化] 化学家; 化学师; 化学工作者; 药剂师; 药房",["Johnny was a chemist; now Johnny is no more. For what he thought was water, was H2SO4.","The young chemist decided to open a pharmacy."],["Johny以前是個化學家，但現在Johny不再是了。他以前所想的是水，是硫酸。","年輕的藥劑師決定要開一家藥房。"]],["outnumber",".aut'nʌmbә","vt. 数目超过, 比...多",["Female students outnumber male students on campus.","In fact, in both San Francisco and New York, wealthy renters outnumber well-to-do buyers."],["",""]],["paddle","'pædl","n. 桨, 划桨, 明轮翼\\nvi. 划桨, 戏水, 涉水\\nvt. 用桨划, 划船运送, 搅, 拌",["His wife caught him out with that blonde and then he was really up shit creek without a paddle.","A son who could not learn to paddle his own canoe does not deserve to inherit his father's fortune."],["",""]],["stringent","'strindʒәnt","a. 迫切的, 严厉的, 银根紧的\\n[医] 约束的, 紧迫的",["The most stringent protection of free speech would not protect a man in falsely shouting fire in a theatre and causing a panic.","The products are subject to stringent traceability rules."],["",""]],["spaghetti","spә'geti","n. 意大利面条",["Some spaghetti fell on the badge of the uniform, dirtying it.","You mustn't eat too much ice cream and spaghetti."],["有一些意面掉到了制服上的徽章那儿，把那边弄脏了。","你不该吃太多冰激淋和太多意大利面。"]],["alphabet","'ælfәbit","n. 字母\\n[计] 字母表",["In this secret code, each number stands for a letter of the alphabet.","Nicolas means that romanization of the Cyrillic alphabet is as beautiful as the sun, which burns your eyes when you look at it."],["在这个密码里，每个数字取代了一个字母。","尼古拉斯的用意是羅馬化西里爾字母就猶如太陽般美麗，若是直視會灼燒人的眼睛。"]],["revealing","ri'vi:liŋ","a. 暴露的, 显露的, 揭露的",["The original qipao covered most of a woman's body, revealing only the head, the hands and the tips of the toes, in order to conceal the figure of the wearer regardless of her age.","The public servant leaked the secret and he was prosecuted for revealing a state secret."],["最初的旗袍遮住了女性身体的大部分，只露出头部、手和脚趾头，为的是无论穿戴者的年龄如何,都能隐藏她的身材。",""]],["pentagon","'pentәgәn","n. 五角形, 五边形\\n[经] 五角平台",["Pentagon officials won't say when the problem turned up and refused to discuss details about the flight.","I wear this tinfoil hat to keep the Pentagon from spying on me."],["",""]],["syllable","'silәbl","n. 音节\\nvt. 分成音节\\n[计] 字节",["The accent in \"guitar\" falls on the second syllable.","In Esperanto, the penultimate syllable is stressed."],["「Guitar」一字的重音在第二音節。",""]],["deprivation",".depri'veiʃәn","n. 剥夺, 剥夺官职, 免职\\n[医] 丧失, 剥夺, 缺乏",["Sleep deprivation increases risk of heart attacks.","The war ushered in a period of shortages and deprivation."],["睡眠不足增加心臟病發作的危險。",""]],["amused","ә'mju:zd","a. 愉快的, 被逗乐的",["We were all greatly amused by his jokes.","We were all amused with the comedy."],["我們都被他的笑話逗得很開心。","我们都被这出喜剧逗乐了。"]],["inflammation",".inflә'meiʃәn","n. 怒火, 发火, 燃烧, 发炎\\n[医] 炎[症]",["Last year I suffered from an inflammation of my middle ear.","Gluten intolerance can cause inflammation and joint pain."],["我去年得了中耳炎。",""]],["limestone","'laimstәun","n. 石灰石\\n[化] 石灰石; 石灰岩",["They're going to need to quarry a lot of limestone in order to build the new church.","The bristlecones grow well in limestone soil. Most trees do not grow well in such soil."],["",""]],["expansive","ik'spænsiv","a. 扩张性的, 使扩大的, 广阔的\\n[化] 膨胀的; 可以膨胀的",["When you travel abroad, you start to feel very expansive, and it's easy to overspend in a mood like that.","At sunset, she can see an expansive sky that is brilliant pink and orange."],["",""]],["punctuate","'pʌŋktjueit","vt.vi. 给文章加标点, 加标点符号\\nvt. 强调, 加强, (常用被动)不时打断\\nn. 标点, 标点法, 标点符号",["Please don't punctuate your sentences with loud farts.","If you don't punctuate your chat messages, George will straight-up block you."],["",""]],["autism","'ɒ:tizm","n. 孤独症\\n[医] 孤独癖, 自我中心主义",["April 2nd is World Autism Awareness Day.","Children that live in homes with vinyl floors are more likely to have autism."],["4月2日是世界提高自闭症意识日。",""]],["motherhood","'mʌðәhud","n. 母道, 母性, 母亲们",["The Prime Minister's press release was full of motherhood statements.","Yoko's works often tend to gravitate towards themes of motherhood and family."],["",""]],["inscribe","in'skraib","vt. 登记, 铭记于, 题写, 雕刻\\n[电] 书写",["I asked the jeweler to inscribe my initials on the back my watch.","Instead of the conservative motto, \"A fair day's wages for a fair day's work,\" we must inscribe on our banner the revolutionary watchword, \"Abolition of the wage system.\""],["",""]],["sliding","'slaidiŋ","a. 滑行的, 变化的\\n[机] 滑动",["Carlos Gavidia wears two wedding rings. The smaller one keeps the larger one from sliding off his finger.","Tom was killing time by sliding down the banister."],["",""]],["federally","'fedәrәli","adv. 同盟地, 联邦地, 联邦政府地",["Most state and federally managed public lands are open for recreational use.","The federally sponsored National Horticulture Mission also offers assistance to the farmers with money, organic production facilities and improved seeds."],["",""]],["handwriting","'hændraitiŋ","n. 笔迹",["He can't have written this; it's not his handwriting.","There was a note on my desk in Tom's handwriting."],["這不是他寫的，他的字跡不是這樣的。","我的桌上有一张便条，上面的字是汤姆的。"]],["energize","'enәdʒaiz","vt. 使活跃, 激励, 供给...能量\\n[电] 激励",["We need a campaign slogan that'll really energize the base."],[""]],["prod","prɒd","n. 刺针, 刺棒, 激励话, 提醒物\\nvt. 戳, 刺, 刺激\\nvi. 戳, 刺",["No matter how much I prod her, she refuses to start working on the assignment.","Tom's so lazy that you have to prod him repeatedly to get him to do his share of the work."],["",""]],["backer","'bækә","n. 援助者, 支持者\\n[经] 背书人, 支持人",["The backer is waiting to see how the deal pans out.","Algeria is the main backer of the Polisario Front that seeks independence in Western Sahara."],["",""]],["pollute","pә'lu:t","vt. 污染, 弄脏, 玷污\\n[化] 污染",["We ought to do our best not to pollute our environment.","We've managed to pollute our atmosphere pretty badly."],["我們應該盡力不要污染環境。",""]],["clumsy","'klʌmzi","a. 笨拙的, 不雅观的, 粗陋的",["Tom was a gangly, uncoordinated child who grew into a clumsy adult.","All your sentences sound clumsy even if rewritten into grammatically correct ones."],["",""]],["martian","'mɑ:ʃiәn","n. 火星人\\na. 火星的",["During the Martian winter, ice caps can be seen at the poles.","Someday someone will stand on the Martian landscape and take a picture of Earth in the night sky."],["",""]],["singular","'siŋgjulә","n. 单数\\na. 异常的, 单一的",["Money is a singular thing. It ranks with love as man's greatest source of joy. And with death as his greatest source of anxiety.","The narration is written in the first person singular because it is fictionally taken from the man's everyday journal."],["",""]],["hypocrisy","hi'pɒkrәsi","n. 伪善\\n[法] 伪善, 虚伪",["In the scientific world, there is a lot of intellectual hypocrisy.","Yitzhak wants true peace and justice, not political hypocrisy, racism, and massacres."],["",""]],["outpost","'autpәust","n. 前哨, 前哨部队, 前哨基地",["In a lawless outpost deep within the desert, everybody wore football shoulder pads and mohawks.","A barrage of rockets and mortars rained down on the Moroccan outpost."],["",""]],["belongings","bi'lɒŋiŋz","n. 财产, 所有物, 相关事物\\n[经] 财产, 所有物, 附属物",["Please do not forget your belongings.","She asked him to leave and take all his belongings."],["请勿望您的物品。",""]],["coil","kɒil","n. 线圈, 盘绕, 骚动, 卷\\nvt. 盘绕, 卷",["When a coil is moved near to a wire with current flowing in it current flows in the coil as well.","A Renault 6 doesn't use coil springs or leaf springs. It uses torsion bars in the suspension."],["",""]],["covered","'kʌvәd","a. 隐蔽着的, 掩藏着的, 有屋顶的\\n[建] 涂抹了的, 覆盖了的, 掩盖了的",["She covered the mouthpiece of the phone with her hand.","Cosmetic surgery is not covered by most insurance plans."],["她用手捂住了电话的话筒。","大部份的保險計劃不包含整容手術。"]],["infer","in'fә:","vt. 推论出, 推断\\nvi. 作推论",["Since the Earth and the Moon formed together, we can use our findings from the Moon to infer what happened on the early Earth.","Telescopes are not yet powerful enough to see planets orbiting distant stars, so astronomers must infer their presence."],["",""]],["motivational",".mәuti'veiʃәnәl","a. 激发性的\\n[法] 动机说明, 引起动机, 动机的形成",["The carrot and the stick are well known motivational tools.","Tom listens to inspirational CDs, and has a list of motivational quotes on the back of his bedroom door."],["",""]],["portal","'pɒ:tl","n. 入口, 大门\\na. 肝门的",["This portal leads to another world.","The researchers use the portal to enter into a different part of the universe."],["这个传送门通向另一个世界。",""]],["mourning","'mɔ:niŋ","n. 哀痛, 居丧, 举哀, 哀悼, 丧服, 戴孝",["Tom was still mourning his daughter Mary who had died in a car accident.","The government has declared three days of national mourning. Flags across the country have been lowered to half mast."],["",""]],["bedtime","'bedtaim","n. 就寝时间",["My father used to read me bedtime stories when I was a kid.","Nobody knows as many bedtime stories as the god of the dream."],["",""]],["instinctively","","adv. 本能地, 直觉地",["People could not see any hopes of obtaining happiness in this life, thus they instinctively sought comfort in the afterlife.","At the moment she saw a tall man with a gun standing in the doorway, she instinctively backed away."],["人们在此世中看不到任何获得幸福的希望，便很本能地想在彼世中寻求慰藉。",""]],["scripture","'skriptʃә","n. 圣经, 圣经的一节, 圣经的一句, 铭文",["I cannot forbid a person to marry several wives, for it does not contradict Scripture.","Then they believed the scripture and the words that Jesus had spoken."],["我不能禁止一个人娶好几个妻子，因为这与圣经不矛盾。",""]],["haitian","'heitiәn","a. 海地的\\nn. 海地人, 海地语",["Haiti is called \"Ayiti\" in Haitian Creole.","Haitian officials quarantined bus passengers Wednesday in the neighborhood of Tabarre, after one bus passenger died before crossing the border into Haiti."],["",""]],["captive","'kæptiv","n. 俘虏, 迷恋者\\na. 被俘的, 被迷住的",["Greece, conquered, took captive her savage conqueror.","Yanni and Skura were both held captive for fourteen days."],["",""]],["conservatism","kәn'sә:vәtizәm","n. 保守, 守旧性, 保守主义, [the]保守党的主张和政策, 保守党\\n[医] 保守性",["In the battle of ideas, science defeated conservatism.","There is a growing trend in religious conservatism in Algeria."],["",""]],["overt","'әuvә:t","a. 明显的, 公然的, 蓄意的\\n[法] 明显的, 公开的",["The speaker believes that overt expression of feeling for others helps people tap into their own repressed emotions.","There was absolutely nothing that proved any intention on the part of Ferdinand to commit himself to overt treason."],["",""]],["textual","'tekstʃuәl","a. 文本的, 原文的\\n[法] 原文的, 本文的, 文字上的",["Each picture in the blog includes textual descriptions for blind readers.","I think orthography should be etymological. Etymological letters or diacritics help promote textual comprehension with related or lexically similar languages."],["",""]],["cartel","kɑ:'tel","n. 卡特尔, 企业联合, 俘虏交换条约, 决斗挑战书\\n[经] 同业联合, 联合贩卖, 卡特尔",["Ziri was too busy worrying about some cartel ambush.","When a drug cartel came calling at a store selling vapes in northern Mexico, the owners knew they were powerless."],["",""]],["curly","'kә:li","a. 拳曲的, 卷毛的, 弯曲的",["He was a tall boy, with curly brown hair, roguish hazel eyes, and a mouth twisted into a teasing smile.","Mrs Tanaka's characteristic curly hair was sticking up behind her ear."],["",""]],["gin","dʒin","n. 杜松子酒, 轧棉机, 陷阱\\nvt. 轧棉, 用陷阱捕",["Tom had what looked like a gin and tonic in his hand.","I offered him whisky or gin, but he said he didn't need either."],["",""]],["duplicate","'dju:plikeit","n. 副本, 复本, 复制品\\na. 复制的, 二重的\\nvt. 复制, 使加倍\\n[计] 复制",["This contract is made in duplicate.","Algeria should duplicate what successful economies like Vietnam and South Korea achieved."],["本合同一式两份。",""]],["fundamentalist",".fʌndә'mentәlist","n. 基要主义者",["On the political level the response was the nationalist and fundamentalist revolt of the Maccabees.","Once more, fundamentalist ideologies are opposed to great historical advances."],["",""]],["unreasonable",".ʌn'ri:znәbl","a. 不合理的, 过度的, 不切实际的\\n[法] 不讲道理的, 非理智的, 不合理的",["There are always some people who are unreasonable.","No man has the imagination required to grasp female reason, which is why it is called unreasonable."],["总有一些人不讲理。","没有男人有能把控住女性理性的想象力，这就是为什么它被说无理。"]],["germ","dʒә:m","n. 细菌, 种子, 生殖细胞, 根源\\n[医] 芽胞, 胚, 胚芽, 病菌",["Ambition is the germ from which all growth of nobleness proceeds.","The patient gets a weakened version of the germ, which triggers the body's immune system to produce antibodies."],["",""]],["rename",".ri:'neim","vt. 重新命名, 再命名, 给...改名\\n[计] 重命名; DOS内部命令:更改文件名",["Tom bought Chuck's Bar and Grill, but he didn't rename it.","Has Donald Trump the right to rename the Gulf of Mexico the Gulf of America?"],["",""]],["reprint","'ri:print","n. 再版, 翻版, 重印\\nvt. 再版, 翻版",["This Second Edition of our Interlingua Grammar is a carefully corrected reprint of the first.","The new German publication of Hitler's political manifesto for the first time after 70 years has sparked a debate about whether it is right to reprint the anti-Semitic work."],["",""]],["hysterical","his'terikәl","a. 歇斯底里的, 异常兴奋的\\n[医] 癔病的, 歇斯底里的",["Right, I said, shivering at this recital as a man would who gets hysterical while taking a shower if a bit of soap stings his eye.","Stefan was hysterical in reaction to what Isabella told him."],["",""]],["drugstore","'drʌgstɒ:","n. 药房, 杂货店",["I need to go to the drugstore to buy some medicine for Tom.","Tom went to the drugstore to buy some cough syrup."],["",""]],["affinity","ә'finiti","n. 吸引, 姻亲关系, 类同\\n[化] 亲合力; 亲合能; 亲合势; 近似; 类似",["Magnanimity is a great treasure; harmonious affinity with others is wonderful, Detachment from name and gain averts trouble; happiness makes older people feel young.","Iron has an affinity for sulphur, and so does hydrogen for oxygen."],["寬宏大量是個寶; 與人無爭結緣好 放下名利不煩惱; 心生歡喜不覺老.",""]],["fraternity","frә'tә:niti","n. 友爱, 互助会, 大学生联谊会",["\"Liberty, equality, fraternity\" is also the national motto of Haiti.","\"Liberty, Equality, Fraternity\" is an example of a tripartite motto."],["",""]],["redeem","ri'di:m","vt. 赎回, 挽回, 恢复, 偿还, 补偿\\n[经] 履行(契约), 买回, 赎回",["The only thing that will redeem mankind is co-operation.","Michael took that as an opportunity to redeem himself."],["合作是人類唯一的救贖。",""]],["gaming","'geimiŋ","n. 赌博, 赌胜负\\n[法] 赌博, 赌赛",["With this add-on, your computer has been converted into a gaming PC.","In the nineties, every computer started coming with a sound card, which really kicked off PC gaming."],["有了這個附加元件，您的電腦就變成了遊戲電腦。","在九十年代，每台電腦都開始配備音效卡，真正開啟了 PC 遊戲的時代。"]],["richness","'ritʃnis","n. 富裕, 丰富, 肥沃",["The incredible biodiversity found in India's national parks and wildlife sanctuaries is a testament to its ecological richness.","Brazil is very rich; its richness is immense; coffee is one of its greatest riches."],["",""]],["folly","'fɒli","n. 愚蠢, 荒唐事, 讽刺剧",["You should be ashamed of your folly.","Men only think that you are wise when you share or approve of their folly."],["你應該為你的愚蠢感到羞恥。",""]],["strangle","'stræŋgl","vt. 勒死, 扼死, 压制, 使窒息, 抑制\\nvi. 被扼死, 被绞死, 窒息而死",["Sami was simply not capable physically or emotionally to strangle Layla.","Tom couldn't quite bring himself to strangle Mary."],["",""]],["unofficial",".ʌnә'fiʃәl","a. 非正式的, 非官方的\\n[化] 非法定的; 未入药典的",["The song \"I Am Woman\" by Helen Reddy became the unofficial anthem of the Women's Liberation Movement.","I follow my own methods, and tell as much or as little as I choose. That is the advantage of being unofficial."],["",""]],["pup","pʌp","n. 小狗, 幼畜, 令人讨厌的年轻人\\nv. 生小狗",["My pup took a marrow-bone and sat mousy-quiet in a corner.","Nuzzles is an orange and gold fox pup with violet eyes and a pink tail and wears gold and pink jewelry."],["",""]],["stray","strei","n. 走失的家畜, 浪子\\na. 迷途的, 偶然的\\nvi. 迷路, 彷徨, 流浪",["A stray dog followed Tom home and he decided to keep it.","Tom grew to love the stray dog that followed him home."],["",""]],["appetizer","'æpitaizә","n. 开胃食品, 吊胃口的东西\\n[医] 开胃剂",["During the picnic, we brought cold polenta cut into cubes as an appetizer.","Sami came out of the kitchen, holding an appetizer."],["",""]],["hunch","hʌntʃ","n. 肉峰, 预感, 大块\\nvt. 弯腰驼背, 预感到, 耸肩\\nvi. 向前移动, 隆起",["Tom had a hunch that Mary was seeing someone else.","I had a hunch something pleasant was going to happen."],["汤姆预感到玛丽在见别人。",""]],["chic","ʃi:k","n. 漂亮, 别致的款式\\na. 漂亮的, 别致的",["He was affable and smiling, and he told staff he was visiting friends in a seaside resort popular with day-trippers and, in recent years, associated with gay chic.","It's said to be a girls' high school characterised by its quiet and traditional feel and a chic, high-class uniform."],["他和藹可親，面帶微笑。他告訴工作人員，他正在拜訪朋友，他們住在一個受一日遊遊客歡迎的海濱度假勝地。近年來，這裡與同性戀時尚聯繫在一起。",""]],["lineman","'lainmәn","n. 线务员, 线路工人, 护路工, 养路工",["Tom is a defensive lineman."],[""]],["replica","'replikә","n. 复制品\\n[计] 目录分区复制",["He built an exact replica of Notre Dame Cathedral.","I can't tell if it's a real horse or just a wooden replica."],["",""]],["elude","i'lu:d","vt. 逃避, 规避, 把...难倒",["In order to elude the eager public, the movie star checked into the hotel under a false name.","She managed to elude the embarrassing situation that she found herself in."],["",""]],["contingent","kәn'tindʒәnt","a. 或许发生的, 附随的, 偶然发生的\\nn. 偶然事件, 分遣队",["Our departure tomorrow is contingent on fair weather.","His success is contingent upon his efforts."],["",""]],["sprawl","sprɒ:l","vi. 伸开手足躺, 爬行, 蔓生, 蔓延\\nvt. 懒散地伸开, 使蔓生, 使不规则地伸展\\nn. 伸开手足躺卧姿势",["Urban sprawl is environmentally damaging.","We must stop urban sprawl and fight against physical segregation while still guaranteeing the right to housing."],["城市擴張會對環境造成破壞。",""]],["sponsorship","'spɔnsәʃip","n. 发起, 倡议, 主办, 保证人的地位, 教父的地位, 教母的地位",["Tom's sponsorship was withdrawn. He had to stop his research.","After researching the company's treatment of their workers, I declined their sponsorship offer."],["",""]],["advancing","æd'vɑ:nsiŋ","[计] 导前\\n[医] 进行的",["He began advancing his pawns only when his pieces had occupied their strongest possible positions.","I am afraid we are advancing in the wrong direction."],["",""]],["daring","'dєәriŋ","a. 大胆的",["It was a daring adventure, full of thrill and excitement.","Flight across the continent was still a daring venture."],["",""]],["firsthand","'fә:st'hænd","a. 直接的, 直接得来的, 直接采购的\\nadv. 直接地",["Tom gave police a firsthand account of what had happened.","I wanted to visit the factory to see the working conditions firsthand."],["",""]],["tanker","'tæŋkә","n. 坦克手, 油船, 空中加油飞机, 运油飞机, 油槽/水槽汽车\\n[化] 槽车; 油槽船",["The huge tanker has just left the dock.","A huge tanker just pulled out from the dock."],["一艘巨大的液货船刚刚启航。","一艘巨大的液货船刚刚启航。"]],["fellowship","'felәuʃip","n. 伙伴关系, 共同参与, 团体, 奖学金, 友谊\\n[经] 合伙关系, 研究员薪金, 研究员基金",["I bid you greetings and may there be peace through fellowship between us.","In times like these, we must all act in fellowship."],["我向你們致以問候，願我們之間的友誼帶來和平。",""]],["overflow",".әuvә'flәu","n. 溢值, 超值, 泛滥\\nv. (使)泛滥, (使)溢出, (使)充溢\\n[计] 上溢; 溢出",["To cope with the overflow, humanitarian workers are helping to erect tents at the hospitals in Limbe and Buea.","Out of the overflow of the heart, the mouth speaks."],["",""]],["shoreline","'ʃɒ:lain","n. 海岸线",["The fierce pounding of the waves during the storm washed tonnes of shoreline into the ocean.","The shoreline and coastal wetlands provide critical feeding and resting habitat for shorebirds and waders."],["",""]],["dreadful","'dredful","a. 可怕的",["The consequences of Sendai's earthquake were dreadful!","I had a feeling that something dreadful was happening."],["仙台地震的结果很恐怖。",""]],["twitch","twitʃ","vi. 急拉, 抽搐, 阵痛\\nvt. 急拉, 攫取, 抽动\\nn. 急拉, 抽搐, 阵痛",["We're going to be streaming live all night, only on Twitch.","Do you ever feel your legs twitch whilst you are sleeping? It wakes me up frequently."],["",""]],["brigade","bri'geid","n. 旅, 队\\n[法] 团体, 队, 组",["The fire brigade was on the scene within five minutes of receiving the call.","We tried to put out the fire but we were unsuccessful. We had to call the fire brigade."],["",""]],["elegance","'eligәns","n. 高雅, 典雅, 优雅",["Everybody at the party was charmed by her elegance.","I like this job, but I'd prefer not to call my boss over in a loud voice whenever something bad happens. I'm partial to elegance."],["",""]],["aesthetics","i:s'θetiks","n. 美学",["These costs include potential health hazards, poor aesthetics, or reduction in home values.","Dorottya's stunning features reflect the rich diversity of Hungarian aesthetics."],["",""]],["paramount","'pærәmaunt","n. 首长, 最高当局\\na. 最重要的, 最高的, 至上的",["I'll be there seeing Dream Theater at the Paramount.","The regular upkeep of our servers is paramount to ensuring high uptime."],["",""]],["sponge","spʌndʒ","n. 海绵, 海绵状的东西\\nvt. 用海绵擦拭, 吸收掉, 抹掉\\nvi. 采集海绵, 海绵般吸收",["We need to know how much water this sponge can absorb.","The boxing match was completely one-sided, one pug was so badly mauled that his manager had to throw in the sponge."],["",""]],["carton","'kɑ:tn","n. 硬纸盒, 纸板箱\\n[化] 卡纸",["Robert dropped an entire carton of milk all over Linda's head.","Tom bought a bottle of water for himself and a carton of milk for Mary."],["羅伯將一整盒牛奶灑在琳達頭上。",""]],["suffice","sә'fais","vi. 足够, 有能力\\nvt. 满足",["It will suffice for the present that you should not appear absolutely poor; the time will come when you will be very rich.","This is a question to which a simple answer of \"yes\" or \"no\" will not suffice."],["",""]],["engender","in'dʒendә","vt. 产生, 引起\\nvi. 发生, 形成",["It is not white hair that engenders wisdom."],[""]],["artisan",".ɑ:ti'zæn","n. 工匠, 技工\\n[经] 熟练技术工, 匠人",["\"You're an artisan,\" I said with the intent to learn more.","His artisan bread is of a higher echelon than that found in the grocery stores."],["",""]],["needless","'ni:dlis","a. 不需要的, 不必要的",["Needless to say, fundamental human rights should be respected.","The young man is both capable and energetic, needless to say."],["無須多言，基本人權應當被尊重。","这小伙子既能干又积极，真是没说的。"]],["inconsistency",".inkәn'sistәnsi","n. 不一致, 易变, 前后矛盾的事物\\n[法] 前后矛盾, 不一致",["Many languages have a lot of inconsistency."],[""]],["limo","'limәu","[医] 柠檬",["A black limo rounded the corner with a squeal of tires.","We saw Tom getting in a limo with two escort girls."],["",""]],["towering","'tauәriŋ","a. 高耸的, 激烈的",["New York bristles with towering buildings.","Among our employees he's recognized as a towering figure."],["紐約充滿著高樓大廈。",""]],["burgeoning","","[计] 急速增长的",["The empire expanded eastward, in search of resources for its burgeoning textile industry.","Algeria needs raw materials for its burgeoning industry."],["",""]],["dissertation",".disә'teiʃәn","n. 论文",["I've been really busy with my graduation dissertation recently.","When writing a dissertation, it is important to heavily scrutinise your secondary sources."],["我最近非常忙于我的毕业论文。",""]],["asparagus","ә'spærәgәs","n. 芦笋\\n[化] 天冬; 天门冬",["Tom eats asparagus, but his brother doesn't.","Tom likes asparagus, but his brother doesn't."],["湯姆吃蘆筍，但是他弟弟不吃。","湯姆愛吃蘆筍，但是他的弟弟不愛吃。"]],["powerless","'pauәlis","a. 无力的, 无权的, 无效能的",["He feels powerless about his own life.","The powerless must be protected against the powerful."],["他对生活感到很无奈。",""]],["terminology",".tә:mi'nɒlәdʒi","n. 术语, 术语学\\n[医] 名词学, 命名法",["Legal terminology is not comprehensible to most laypeople.","Legal terminology is usually incomprehensible to non-specialists."],["法律術語是大多數普通人無法理解的。","法律術語是大多數普通人無法理解的。"]],["preferably","'prefәrәbli","adv. 更可取地, 更好地, 更合意地",["Currently, I'm looking for a job in customer service, preferably retail.","We want an assistant, preferably someone with experience."],["目前，我正在尋找客服工作，最好是零售業。",""]],["cracked","krækt","a. 破碎的, 破裂的, 声音嘶哑的\\n[建] 有裂缝的, 裂化的",["Mary took an egg and cracked it open on the rim of the bowl.","He cracked the walnut with his teeth."],["瑪麗婭拿了一個雞蛋，並將它在碗沿上敲開。","他用牙齒咬碎了核桃。"]],["shriek","ʃri:k","n. 尖锐的响声\\nvi. 尖叫, 发尖声\\nvt. 尖声发出",["The woman let out such a loud shriek that the house shook.","If you go to the cemetery at midnight, they say you can still hear the ghoul's shriek."],["",""]],["opaque","әu'peik","n. 不透明物\\na. 不透明的, 不传热的, 不传导的, 阴暗的\\n[计] 白底",["Some businesses complain of opaque regulations and unequal enforcement of the law.","Opaque? Not at all. Intuitively obvious to the most casual observer."],["",""]],["nausea","'nɒ:ʃjә","n. 反胃, 晕船, 恶心, 厌恶\\n[医] 恶心",["It should be borne in mind that dizziness, headache, nausea, or fatigue may occasionally occur.","Common side effects include nausea, abdominal pain, and constipation."],["",""]],["optics","'ɒptiks","n. 光学\\n[化] 光学",["His study of optics led him to the invention of the magnifying glass.","Music is the arithmetic of sounds as optics is the geometry of light."],["",""]],["menace","'menis","n. 威胁, 胁迫\\nv. 威吓, 胁迫",["This kind of bomb is a serious menace to mankind.","Fadil was no longer a menace to society."],["",""]],["cactus","'kæktәs","n. 仙人掌\\n[医] 仙人掌属",["Your lips are soft like the surface of a cactus.","Life is like licking honey off a cactus."],["你的嘴唇軟綿綿的，就像仙人掌的表皮一樣。","生活就像是舔仙人掌上的蜂蜜。"]],["horseback","'hɒ:sbæk","n. 马背\\nadv. 在马背上, 骑在马上",["Football originally meant \"a game played with a ball on foot\" - unlike a game played on horseback, such as polo.","The place is only accessible on foot or on horseback."],["",""]],["numb","nʌm","a. 麻木的, 失去知觉的\\nvt. 使麻木, 使昏迷, 使失去知觉",["My fingers are so numb with cold that I can't play the piano.","If you stand still for too long, your leg becomes numb with a tingling sensation."],["我的手指冻僵了，以至于无法弹钢琴了。",""]],["fridge","fridʒ","n. 电冰箱",["In a dictionary like this one there should be at least two sentences with \"fridge\".","The chocolate is going to melt if you keep it out of the fridge."],["這樣的字典最少也應該有兩句「冰箱」的例句吧。","巧克力不放在冰箱里的话会融化的。"]],["rewarding","ri'wɒ:diŋ","a. 有益的, 有报酬的, 报答的",["I like this work because you see the result immediately; it's very rewarding.","Directing students into rewarding business careers is the goal of vocational schools across the state."],["我喜欢这个工作因为它立竿见影，让人很有成就感。",""]],["hastily","'heistili","adv. 匆忙地, 急速地, 急躁地",["Before understanding the situation clearly, he hastily gave his opinion.","Hastily acquired knowledge was not enough to solve the problem."],["他还没有把情况了解清楚就急忙发表意见。",""]],["editing","'editiŋ","a. 编辑的",["He is very thorough and slow when he does his editing.","I dream of becoming a YouTube star, but I'm too lazy to do video editing."],["",""]],["academically",".ækә'demikәli","adv. 学术上；学业上",["The academically talented students helped others in the classroom.","Not only did she excel academically, but she also demonstrated exceptional leadership skills throughout her school years."],["",""]],["socialization",".sәuʃәlai'zeiʃәn","n. 社会化, 社会主义化",["In every society, we discern a series of socialization mechanisms to make our coexistence with the others possible.","Every type of socialization requires a lie."],["",""]],["falter","'fɒ:ltә","vt. 支吾地说\\nvi. 支吾, 蹒跚地走\\nn. 颤抖, 支吾, 踌躇",["Hold the weight above your head until your arms begin to falter.","We can't allow ourselves to falter."],["",""]],["fuss","fʌs","n. 大惊小怪, 小题大作, 忙乱\\nvi. 无事自扰, 焦急, 焦燥, 忙乱\\nvt. 使激动, 使烦燥",["It doesn't become a gentleman to fuss over trifles.","I don't know why you're making such a fuss over this."],["",""]],["warden","'wɒ:dn","n. 典狱官, 渔猎法监督官, 看守人\\n[法] 看守人, 监护人, 管理员",["There was only one warden on duty when the riot started.","That action convinced the prison warden that Tom was a threat to the rest of the prisoners."],["暴動開始時只有一位監獄長值班。",""]],["amazement","ә'meizmәnt","n. 惊愕, 惊异",["I'll never forget the amazement I felt when I heard the Beatles for the first time.","I blinked in amazement at the unexpected development."],["",""]],["famously","'feimәsli","adv. 极好地, 非常令人满意地",["Capricorns are famously known for their strong work ethic.","As F. Scott Fitzgerald famously noted, the rich are different from you and me."],["",""]],["orchid","'ɒ:kid","n. 兰花, 淡紫色\\n[医] 兰科植物",["Vanilla is a spice extracted from the fruit of an orchid.","If your orchid has yellowish leaves, it means that it was placed in inappropriate location."],["",""]],["pluralism","'pluәrәlizm","n. 多数状态, 多重性, 多元论, 兼任\\n[法] 多元论",["Above all, India's democratic values and commitment to pluralism make it a beacon of hope and inspiration for the world.","Burning the Quran stands as a direct attack on religious pluralism and the values of a diverse society."],["",""]],["pouch","pautʃ","n. 小袋, 小包, 眼袋, 邮袋, 育儿袋\\nvt. 装...入袋中, 使成袋状\\nvi. 成袋状",["He arose and, going to a table, secured a tobacco pouch and a book of cigaret papers.","The joey snuggled down into the warm kangaroo pouch of his mother."],["",""]],["miraculous","mi'rækjulәs","a. 奇迹的, 不可思议的",["This, the first of the miraculous signs, Jesus performed in Cana in Galilee.","The healer always has some miraculous products to sell."],["",""]],["crackdown","'krækdaun","n. 制裁, 镇压, 痛击",["The government is expelling illegal aliens as part of a crackdown.","The police began a crackdown on illegal parking."],["",""]],["humiliate","hju:'milieit","vt. 使丢脸, 使蒙羞, 屈辱",["Online bullies sought to humiliate Rodrigo by sharing edited and manipulated images of him on social media.","My teacher picked on me and never misses an opportunity to humiliate me in front of the other classmates."],["",""]],["willingly","'wiliŋli","adv. 自动地, 欣然地",["A true German can't stand the French, yet willingly he drinks their wines.","She would willingly come but she was on vacation."],["一个真正的德国人无法忍受法国人，但他很愿意喝他们的酒。","她很樂意前來，但是她在休假。"]],["gravitational",".grævi'teiʃәnәl","a. 重力的",["The observation of gravitational waves will start a new phase in the study of the universe.","The strength of the gravitational force reduces quickly with distance."],["",""]],["unnoticed","'ʌn'nәutist","a. 不被注意的, 被忽视的\\n[法] 未被注意的, 未被顾及的:不瞩目的",["Her absence went unnoticed until the end of the meeting.","In a town you may pass unnoticed, whereas in a village it's impossible."],["直到会议结束之前都没人注意到她不在。",""]],["hebrew","'hi:bru:","n. 希伯来人, 希伯来语, 犹太人\\na. 希伯来人的, 希伯来语的",["I was born into the Hebrew persuasion, but when I got older I converted to narcissism.","I do not believe that she can speak Hebrew."],["我天生是猶太人，但當我年紀大了的時候，我把它轉換成了自戀。","我不相信她會說希伯來語。"]],["racially","'reiʃәli","adv. 按人种, 人种上",["An aboriginal footballer was racially vilified by a member of the opposing team.","Trump must face charges of crimes against humanity for his racially-motivated neglect of Puerto Rico."],["",""]],["cherokee",",tʃerә'ki:","n. 彻罗基族人（北美印第安人之一族）",["Cherokee is a language written with a syllabary.","The Cherokee syllabary, just like the Greek, Cyrillic, Armenian and Latin alphabets, has a distinction between lowercase and uppercase letters."],["",""]],["tyranny","'tirәni","n. 专制, 暴政\\n[法] 苛政, 暴政, 专横",["People in the country were living under a tyranny.","I will be reminded of tyranny and cruelty, if Nero is said."],["",""]],["breadth","bredθ","n. 宽度\\n[法] 违背, 违犯, 未遵守",["Adversity and prosperity reveal one's breadth of mind; joy and anger test one's self-restraint.","I missed the train by a hair's breadth."],["逆境顺境看襟度，临喜临怒看涵养。","我以一分之差错过了那趟火车。"]],["vividly","","adv. 鲜艳, 强烈, 明亮, 鲜明, 活泼, 有生气, 生动, 清晰, 逼真",["I remember the event as vividly as if it were just yesterday.","More vividly than all the written histories, the Coliseum tells the story of Rome's grandeur and Rome's decay."],["",""]],["heavenly","'hevnli","a. 天上的, 神圣的, 天国似的",["The Heavenly Timber Immolation is a kind of ancient ritual.","The word came to be used for all small heavenly bodies revolving about larger ones."],["燔柴祭天是一種古老的儀式。","这个词后来被用来指代围绕大天体的小天体。"]],["scurry","'skʌri","vi. 急赶, 急跑, 急转\\nn. 急赶, 急跑, 急转, 阵雪, 阵雨",["Rodents scurry on the floor in fear.","Shadowy figures scurry across the street."],["",""]],["gangster","'gæŋstә","n. 流氓, 歹徒\\n[法] 暴徒, 恶棍, 打手",["The bold man glanced at the gangster with hatred and contempt.","\"Hey, you shut up! You talk too much,\" the gangster said."],["",""]],["sterile","'sterail","a. 不毛的, 不孕的, 无菌的, 贫瘠的, 无效的, 枯燥的\\n[医] 无菌的, 消毒的; 不育的",["The quarantine will last as long as it takes so that Argentinians stay alive and well, the rest are sterile debates.","This is pure and sterile mania of protagonism for its own sake."],["",""]],["orphanage","'ɒ:fәnidʒ","n. 孤儿院, 孤儿身份\\n[法] 孤儿身份, 孤儿, 孤儿院",["The orphans were taken to the orphanage.","It's confirmed they're donating rice to the orphanage next week."],["孤兒們被帶到這間育幼院。",""]],["multilateral",".mʌlti'lætәrәl","a. 多边的, 多国的\\n[经] 多边的, 涉及多方的",["Multilateral trade negotiations ran aground over import quotas."],[""]],["extinct","ik'stiŋkt","a. 熄灭的, 灭绝的, 耗尽的\\n[法] 消灭了的, 过时的, 无效的",["If we don't make the utmost effort to protect the rainforests, many of the rare species in them will become extinct.","This species of butterfly has already gone extinct."],["如果我们不做更多的努力去保护雨林，很多其中的稀有物种将会灭绝。","這種種類的蝴蝶已經絕種了。"]],["cupboard","'kʌpbɒ:d","n. 食橱, 碗柜, 餐具柜",["Open the cupboard to the left, the bottles are in there.","Tom opened the shoe cupboard and took the shoes out."],["打开左边的橱，瓶子在那儿。","汤姆打开鞋柜拿出鞋。"]],["impetus","'impitәs","n. 动力, 推动力, 动量\\n[医] 冲动, 动能, 起始(病)",["Note that the impetus for change has undergone a series of transformations in this community.","The scientific and technological revolution gave a powerful impetus to the development of avant-garde art."],["",""]],["networking","","[计] 连网, 建网",["The school-enterprise networking event was held as scheduled on December 26th.","The school-enterprise networking event will be held as scheduled on December 26th."],["学校与企业见面会于12月26日按期举行。","学校与企业见面会于12月26日按期举行。"]],["muted","","a. 变弱了的, 变柔和了的",["From the tunnel came the muted sound of a train whistle.","Jonas muted his laptop and heard that strange noise again."],["",""]],["plump","plʌmp","a. 圆胖的, 丰满的, 直接下落的, 直率的\\nvt. 突然放下, 支持, 使丰满, 使鼓起\\nvi. 扑通落下, 投票赞成, 变丰满,…",["When my grandmother was young, her body was very slim. Now in her old age she's grown plump.","Every day grandfather and grandmother gave the kitten plenty of milk, and soon the kitten grew nice and plump."],["我奶奶年轻的时候身材很苗条，现在年纪大了就发福了。",""]],["lad","læd","n. 青年, 家伙, 少年, 情人",["My name, dear lad, is not Trevor. I was James Armitage in my younger days.","Science, my lad, is made out of errors, but of good ones, for they bring you step by step closer to the truth."],["",""]],["unilateral",".ju:ni'lætәrәl","a. 单方面的, 单边的, 片面的\\n[医] 单侧的, 一侧的",["Tom's boss made a unilateral decision to close several small branches of the company.","The Coronavirus is a global crisis, not limited to any continent and it requires cooperation rather than unilateral action."],["",""]],["gorilla","gә'rilә","n. 大猩猩, 残暴的男人, 歹徒",["A reporter is interviewing Dr. Patterson about Koko, a talking gorilla.","Hundreds of people called or wrote to the Gorilla Foundation."],["",""]],["satin","'sætin","n. 缎子\\na. 绸缎做的, 缎子一般的, 光滑的",["The black satin ribbon adorned her hair beautifully.","I've been looking for a nice satin scarf like that for aeons."],["",""]],["assimilation","ә.simi'leiʃәn","n. 同化, 同化作用, 吸收\\n[化] 同化; 同化作用",["Mountain and desert Berbers resisted assimilation.","Algerians don't want cultural assimilation with Western nations."],["",""]],["residency","'rezidәnsi","n. 住处\\n[法] 住处, 管辖区",["In the United States, Fadil was denied residency twice.","The building kept its status of residency of the supreme power even after Azerbaijan restored its state independence."],["",""]],["asshole","'æshәul","n. 屁眼儿, 肛门；令人讨厌的人",["This teacher is a careless asshole and a cold-hearted monster.","Some people are so anal about everything that they'll one day completely disappear up their own asshole."],["",""]],["cloning","'klɔniŋ","[计] 研制兼容产品\\n[化] 克隆",["There is an idea that outer space should be the abode of only men and boys and cloning would be the means of reproduction.","Cloning of humans is prohibited, but is being done."],["",""]],["caring","'kεәriŋ","a. 有同情心的；表示或感到关怀或关心的",["She's what you call a \"delinquent mom,\" but she's good at cooking, and most importantly, she's a really caring parent.","After retirement, Teresa devoted herself to caring for orphans."],["她就是你所謂的「年輕媽媽」，但是她的廚藝不錯，最重要的是，她非常關心孩子。","退休後，德蕾莎投身照顧孤兒的工作。"]],["futile","'fju:tail","a. 无用的, 琐细的, 不重要的",["There is nothing which exacts a higher price than revenge, yet is so futile.","She said she stopped using her car Monday after a futile attempt to buy fuel at a pumping station."],["没有什么东西比复仇更昂贵，更无益。",""]],["hanging","'hæŋiŋ","n. 绞死, 绞杀, 悬挂\\n[法] 绞刑, 绞死",["This is because you approach everything as a total person, with no loose ends hanging out to signify divided intentions.","I have a pretty good idea who Tom will be hanging out with tonight."],["这是因为你总是全身心处理每一件事情，没有让鸡毛蒜皮的问题分散了你的目标。","我大概知道湯姆今晚會和誰一起玩。"]],["cultivation",".kʌlti'veiʃәn","n. 教化, 培养, 耕作\\n[医] 培养[法]",["Agriculture is defined as the cultivation of soil for growing crops.","Plants are formed with cultivation, humans with education."],["",""]],["salty","'sɒ:lti","a. 有盐分的, 咸味浓的, 海洋的, 辛辣的, 有经验的",["You can't drink seawater because it is too salty.","You can't drink seawater because it's too salty."],["你不能喝海水，因为它太咸了。","你不能喝海水，因为它太咸了。"]],["posit","'pɒzit","vt. 假设, 安置, 布置",["I will posit a guess: the person who ate my sandwich was once again Bob.","The well-preserved bones led its early 20th-century excavators to posit that the site marked a burial ground created by a predecessor to early modern humans."],["",""]],["cutter","'kʌtә","n. 裁剪者, 切割者, 切割器\\n[化] 刀具; 剪切机; 切刀; 切胶机",["Mary made some star-shaped gingerbread cookies using a star-shaped cookie cutter.","I don't want to go to a school that calls me broken for not fitting their cookie cutter model."],["",""]],["bowel","'bauәl","n. 肠, 内脏, 内部\\nvt. 挖...的内脏",["The doctor concluded that her stomach pains were due to irritable bowel syndrome.","Frequent bowel movements are a common occurrence for me."],["",""]],["idol","'aidәl","n. 偶像, 崇拜物, 宠儿, 幻象, 谬论",["There's always somebody in an idol group that uses too many filters in their selfies.","The idol of fear will survive in this accursed realm a thousand years."],["",""]],["reshape","ri:'ʃeip","vt. 改造, 使成新的形状, 打开新局面\\nvt. 整形\\nvi. 整形\\n[计] 整形",["A good writer can reshape and improve his text many times.","We do not want to discard the article but reshape it."],["",""]],["refinery","ri'fainәri","n. 精炼厂\\n[化] 精炼厂炼糖厂",["Relax, the refinery isn't going to blow up because of some small earthquake.","Tom works long hours at the oil refinery."],["",""]],["conspicuous","kәn'spikjuәs","a. 显著的, 显眼的, 出众的",["The scar on his forehead is conspicuous.","Conspicuous consumption of valuable goods is a means of reputability to the gentleman of leisure."],["他額頭上的疤痕很醒目。",""]],["accused","ә'kju:zd","n. 被告",["The accused is to appear before the court on Friday.","He accused me of having stolen his watch."],["被告周五将会出现在法庭上。","他指控我偷了他的手表。"]],["tenor","'tenә","n. 稳定的进程, 思路, 要旨, 大意, 誊本, 票据的限期, 男高音\\na. 男高音的",["Tom has both an alto saxophone and a tenor saxophone.","His speaking voice, a gruff husky tenor, added to the impression of fractiousness he conveyed."],["",""]],["ordinarily","'ɒ:dinәrili","adv. 通常, 普通, 一般地",["It seems probable that the licentiousness ordinarily imputed to Sappho may be a calumny.","Ordinarily, this was not a problem, but in the circumstances it could not have been worse."],["",""]],["stud","stʌd","n. 装饰钮扣, 大头钉, 领扣, 种马\\nvt. 镶嵌, 点缀, 散布",["The stranger who sails for the first time up the Firth of Forth must be struck with the numerous villages that stud its picturesque shores.","If you hammer a nail into the stud, you can hang the picture from it."],["眾多村莊點綴著福斯灣的岸邊，優美如畫。初次於此航行的陌生人，必定會留下深刻印象。",""]],["emptiness","'emptinis","n. 空虚, 无知",["Life is all about filling up the emptiness inside. Work, alcohol, music, we all have our substitutes for love.","There is some comfort in the emptiness of the sea, no past, no future."],["",""]],["testament","'testәmәnt","n. 遗嘱, <<圣约书>>\\n[法] 遗言, 遗嘱, 确实的证明",["He and a colleague who went to China later translated The New Testament into Chinese.","The Old Testament forbids eating shellfish."],["他跟一个去中国的同事后来把圣经中的新约翻译成中文。","旧约书中禁止食用贝类等有壳的水生动物。"]],["platoon","plә'tu:n","n. 排, 一组, 一群人",["The bedraggled houses were finally destroyed by the platoon.","A platoon has about thirty soldiers."],["",""]],["hustle","'hʌsl","n. 心碌, 挤, 推, 拥挤喧嚷\\nvt. 催促, 乱挤活动, 硬逼, 强夺\\nvi. 赶紧, 硬挤过去",["She spent hours alone, absorbed in contemplating the incessant hustle and bustle of the ants in the ant mound behind the house.","Even though Tom was brought up in the country, he loves the hustle and bustle of the city."],["",""]],["barefoot","'bєәfut","a. 赤脚的",["When was the last time you walked barefoot on a meadow?","Look, the boys are walking barefoot in the water."],["你最后一次赤脚在草地上走是什么时候？","看啊，年輕人赤腳走在水裡。"]],["invasive","in'veisiv","a. 侵入的, 侵略性的, 攻击性的",["Off the shores of Newfoundland, Canada, an ecosystem is unraveling at the hands (or pincers) of an invasive crab.","An invasive species is an organism that causes ecological or economic harm in a new environment where it is not native."],["",""]],["upbeat","'ʌpbi:t","n. 弱拍, 上升, 兴旺\\na. 上升的, 乐观的",["When upbeat music starts playing, I just start dancing.","You should take a more upbeat approach when it comes to how you view the world that surrounds you."],["",""]],["ruthless","'ru:θlis","a. 无情的, 残忍的, 毫不留情的, 彻底的\\n[法] 无情的, 残忍的",["Those guys are ruthless, covering up their tracks like that after all their wrongdoing.","Among the manufacturers of so-called consumer electronics, there's ruthless, cut-throat competition."],["",""]],["placebo","plә'si:bәu","n. (为死者所诵的)晚祷歌, 安慰剂, 安慰的话, 使人宽慰的事\\n[医] 安慰剂, 无效[对照]剂",["Both nocebo and placebo effects are presumably psychogenic.","The patients participating in the drug trial don't know if they're receiving the drug or the placebo."],["",""]],["outlaw","'autlɒ:","n. 被剥夺法律保护的人, 罪犯\\nvt. 使...失去法律保护, 将...逐出社会, 宣告非法, 取缔",["The government acted boldly to deal with the outlaw uprising.","That tricky outlaw is so sneaky that he's lower than a snake's belly."],["",""]],["cripple","'kripl","n. 跛者, 残废\\nvt. 使跛, 使成残废, 削弱\\na. 跛的, 残废的",["It can be pretty offensive to call someone a \"cripple\", so it's best not to.","Little Mary was only seven years old when the sad event happened which made her a suffering cripple for life."],["",""]],["ballad","'bælәd","n. 歌谣",["Having found a suitable human host, an ambitious Cuba Libre sang a beautiful ballad at the karaoke bar.","Evidently, no one can resist reading the ballad \"Chavayn\" by Olyk Ipay."],["",""]],["braid","breid","n. 辫子, 穗带\\nvt. 编成辫, 镶边",["My sister taught me how to braid hair.","From between the pleats of her black skirt, the nun brought out scissors and deftly cut coloured paper into long, narrow strips, which we could then braid into a paper rug."],["姐姐教我編辮子。","修女從黑色裙子的褶皺間掏出剪刀，熟練地將彩色紙剪成長而窄的紙條，讓我們可以把這些紙條編成紙地毯。"]],["shady","'ʃeidi","a. 荫凉的, 成荫的, 阴暗的, 隐蔽的\\n[法] 成问题的, 令人怀疑的",["My uncle's brother's son got involved in a shady business and disgraced the family.","On the earth are high mountains, deep valleys, rising hills, hollow caves and shady woods."],["",""]],["losing","'lu:ziŋ","a. 损失的, 输的\\nn. 失败, 损失",["There's nothing more painful than losing one's child.","She got hepatitis no wonder she is losing so much weight."],["沒有比失去孩子更傷心的事。","她得了肝炎，难怪越來越瘦了。"]],["footing","'futiŋ","n. 站稳, 立足点, 立场, 关系\\n[化] 脚子(糖浆下脚的结晶)",["If you were footing the bill, you wouldn't say that.","Tom was taking a selfie on the edge of the volcano when he lost his footing and fell into the crater."],["",""]],["waver","'weivә","n. 动摇, 踌躇, 挥动者\\nvi. 摇摆, 颤抖, 摆动, 摇曳, 犹豫",["We will also not waver in our values and our principles as a nation.","As the hours passed in the windowless interrogation room, the suspect's resolve began to waver, and he finally confessed to his involvement in the crime."],["",""]],["salient","'seiliәnt","a. 显著的, 突出的, 跳跃的\\nn. 凸角, 突出部分",["Unfortunately, munificence is not one of the salient features of my husband.","Yes, it is heavy, but I would not consider its weight one of its salient features."],["",""]],["carcass","'kɑ:kәs","n. 尸体\\n[医] 屠体(宰后除脏的畜体)",["The veterinarian examined the carcass of the giraffe.","The marabouts were feasting on the giraffe carcass."],["",""]],["motorist","'mәutәrist","n. 开汽车者, 驾车旅行的人",["The motorist drove across the country to Washington state.","Tom wore dark clothing and was killed by a motorist last evening."],["",""]],["screenplay","'skri:nplei","n. 电影剧本",["She became famous after having written the screenplay for that movie.","It was originally written as a screenplay."],["",""]],["radius","'reidiәs","n. 半径, 范围, 辐射光线\\n[电] 半径",["Find the radius of the incircle of the triangle.","We deliver your order free of charge within a 20-mile radius."],["求三角形內切圓的半徑。",""]],["solving","","v. 解决",["Science is still not capable of solving all of life's problems.","He is good at solving complicated mathematical problems."],["科學還無法解決所有生活上的問題。","他擅长解答数学难题。"]],["banish","'bæniʃ","vt. 驱逐, 消除\\n[法] 驱逐, 流放",["Tom was so rude that they had to banish him from the room.","I've tried to banish the memory of him crying."],["",""]],["magician","mә'dʒiʃәn","n. 魔术家, 幻术家, 术士",["The magician had the children's attention.","Sami is not good at being a magician."],["魔术师吸引了孩子们的注意。","萨米不是个好的魔术师。"]],["prophecy","'prɒfәsi","n. 预言, 预言能力",["Like all water-spirits, Nereus possessed the gift of prophecy, though he did not always choose to make use of it.","His mother's prophecy that he would be a great musician was later fulfilled."],["",""]],["broom","bru:m","n. 扫帚, 金雀花\\nvt. 扫除",["The angry wife was on the warpath; she hit her husband with a broom for coming home late and drunk.","For my birthday he gave me a broom and told me to get to work."],["",""]],["candid","'kændid","a. 坦白的, 率直的, 公正的",["What do I think, you say ... well then, I'll give you my candid opinion.","You have been candid with me, so I will be candid with you."],["你問我怎麼想？……好吧，那我就把我的心底話說出來吧。",""]],["trendy","'trendi","a. 随潮流的, 时髦的, 赶潮流的",["Tall and striking, with a black and gold embroidered shirt and a glittering brown bonnet, she blends in easily with the trendy, after-work crowd.","We don't fight for trendy clothes, we fight for justice."],["她身材高挑，外形出眾，身穿黑金刺繡襯衫，頭戴閃亮的棕色軟帽，輕鬆地融入了時髦的下班人潮之中。",""]],["ecstasy","'ekstәsi","n. 狂喜, 心醉神迷, 忘形\\n[医] 入迷",["Stop using emoticons everywhere. It makes it look like you're on ecstasy...","To burn always with this hard, gem-like flame, to maintain this ecstasy, is success in life."],["",""]],["unison","'ju:nisn","n. 调和, 和谐, 一致, 齐唱, 齐奏\\na. 共同做的, 同声的",["We said in unison that we didn't agree to the suggestion.","The full moon caused the werewolves to howl in unison."],["",""]],["unthinkable",".ʌn'θiŋkәbl","a. 不能考虑的, 不能想像的, 想像不到的, 不合理的",["It was next to unthinkable that the boy would steal.","It is practically unthinkable that a scientist of his stature would have made such an elementary mistake."],["",""]],["bestow","bi'stәu","vt. 授予, 使用, 贮藏, 留宿",["Such care did he bestow on his goats that he even oiled their horns and combed their hair.","Nobita is someone who can bestow happiness upon others and shoulder their misfortunes. That is, for a human, an extremely valuable trait. He'll probably make you happy, too."],["",""]],["assimilate","ә'simileit","vt. 使同化, 吸收, 使相拟, 把...比作\\nvi. 被吸收, 被同化",["The US government attempted to assimilate Native American children.","The weak easily assimilate the opinions of the strong."],["",""]],["beet","bi:t","n. 甜菜(根)\\n[化] 甜菜",["They say that beet juice can lower blood pressure.","We need a carrot, a beet, and broccoli. They need to be raw, not cooked."],["",""]],["bandage","'bændidʒ","n. 绷带\\n[化] 帘布筒; 实心轮胎; 紧带; 绷带",["He cleansed the wound before putting on a bandage.","The nurse gently put a bandage around my head."],["他先清洗了伤口，再绑上绷带。","护士轻柔地给我的头缠上绷带。"]],["intimidating","ɪnˈtɪmɪdeɪtɪŋ","vt. 恐吓, 威胁( intimidate的现在分词)",["Don't worry. He may look intimidating at first glance, but he's actually a very friendly person.","Tom felt demoralised by his boss's intimidating behaviour."],["",""]],["fairway","'fєәwei","n. 航路",["Please take a bag of soil and seed to repair divots on the fairways."],[""]],["gloom","glu:m","n. 忧郁, 暗处, 幽暗\\nvi. 变忧沉, 变黑暗\\nvt. 使忧郁, 使黑暗",["Those gloom and doom economists aren't worth their salt.","The recent sudden death of Sir Charles Baskerville has cast a gloom over the county."],["",""]],["framed","","a. 遭到陷害的；有构架的",["He framed the picture he had bought on the street.","There were framed pictures of a child and a wedding on top of the desk."],["",""]],["misconception",".miskәn'sepʃәn","n. 误解",["Unfortunately, this misconception is very persistent.","Believing nectarines to be a crossbreed of plums and peaches is a widespread misconception."],["",""]],["lining","'lainiŋ","n. 衬里, 内层, 衬垫\\n[化] 衬里; 衬垫; 衬套; 衬层",["So it seems that cloud of odorless deadly gas had a silver lining after all.","The defenders are lining up to defend against this set piece."],["只能说，那团无味的致命气体，也不是没有好处。",""]],["hoist","hɒist","n. 升高, 起重机, 推动\\nv. 升起, 升高, 举起",["Riyad Mahrez and \"The Desert Foxes\" of Algeria are hoping to hoist the Nations Cup trophy once again.","Hoist your sail when the wind is fair."],["",""]],["waiver","'weivә","n. 放弃, 弃权, 弃权声明书\\n[经] 弃权, 放弃权利",["Sami made a decision and no one can get him to waiver.","We'll give you a waiver that exempts you from paying the fee."],["",""]],["tangle","'tæŋgl","n. 缠结, 纠结的一团, 困惑, 纠纷, 混乱\\nvt. 使缠结, 缠住\\nvi. 缠结, 乱作一团",["I wish I could tangle your hair into beautiful braids.","Don't pull, or you'll tangle the threads."],["",""]],["rearrange",".ri:ә'reindʒ","vt. 再排列, 重新整理\\n[计] 重新排列; 重新整理",["If I could rearrange the alphabet, I would put U and I together.","Could you rearrange this list so it's in alphabetical order?"],["如果我可以把英文字母重新排序，我會把「U」和「I」放在一起。","你能把這清單按字母順序排列嗎？"]],["undertaking",".ʌndә'teikiŋ","n. 事业, 企业, 保证\\n[经] 企业, 事业, 承担",["He enthusiastically engaged himself in this honorable undertaking.","The undertaking entailed great expense upon the government."],["她热忱地投身于这份光荣的事业。",""]],["flier","'flaiә","n. 飞行者, 快船, 快车\\n[经] 投机买卖, 孤注一掷, 传单",["I have to design a new flier for the film.","I have to design a new flier for the movie."],["",""]],["hasten","'heisn","vt. 催促, 加紧\\nvi. 赶快, 急忙",["I must hasten to add that I do not mean to blame him.","Hasten slowly, and without losing heart, put your work twenty times upon the anvil."],["",""]],["digest","di'dʒest","n. 文摘\\nvi. 消化\\nvt. 消化, 理解\\n[计] 摘要",["If you can digest them, raw vegetables are good for your health.","Foods you eat which you don't like will not digest well."],["",""]],["jagged","'dʒægd","a. 锯齿状的\\n[电] 锯齿形的",["Anti-aliasing smooths the jagged edges in digital images.","Her coloring book lay limp, jagged with angular pink scribbles."],["",""]],["counting","'kauntiŋ","n. 计算\\n[医] 计数",["I'm counting how many people there are.","I am counting on you to deliver the opening address."],["我正在算有多少人在那裡。",""]],["prolong","prәu'lɒŋ","vt. 延长, 拖延, 拖长\\n[化] 冷凝管",["Regular services are essential to ensure trouble-free motoring, and to prolong the life of your car.","If we don't make it we need to prolong the period of time."],["",""]],["doughnut","'dәunʌt","n. 油炸圈饼, 环状物\\n[计] 圆环图",["Many of Europe's metropolises are plagued by the doughnut phenomenon.","Pour me another cup of coffee and I'll eat another doughnut."],["许多欧洲的大都市饱受“甜甜圈现象”困扰。",""]],["dysfunction","dis'fʌŋkʃәn","n. 机能不良, 机能障碍\\n[医] 机能障碍, 机能不良",["It has been claimed that there is serious exasperation and dysfunction between the Biden and Harris teams.","Studies have shown that frequent pornography use can contribute to erectile dysfunction and other sexual dysfunctions."],["",""]],["relinquish","ri'liŋkwiʃ","vt. 放弃, 撤回, 停止, 松开, 让与\\n[法] 让与, 把...交给, 放弃",["I would rather die than relinquish my virginity before marriage.","Power is a drug which few ever manage to relinquish."],["",""]],["commence","kә'mens","v. (使)开始, 得学位",["The conference will commence in due course.","The drilling operation is about to commence."],["",""]],["hesitant","'hezitәnt","a. 迟疑的, 踌躇的, 犹豫不定的",["Tom is hesitant to visit Mary in the hospital.","Fadil wanted to meet Layla's family but she was hesitant."],["对于是否要去医院探望Mary,Tom有点犹豫不决。",""]],["flurry","'flә:ri","n. 疾风, 飓风, 慌张\\nvt. 使恐慌, 使激动\\nvi. 慌张",["Experts are reacting to a flurry of cyberattacks against major industrial targets in Ukraine, Germany, Iran and South Korea.","Everyone hoped for a snow flurry for Christmas."],["",""]],["apprehension",".æpri'henʃәn","n. 理解, 忧惧, 逮捕\\n[医] 领会",["The excitement of starting a new job is sometimes mingled with a certain apprehension.","He wrung his hands in an agony of apprehension, and swayed backwards and forwards in his chair."],["",""]],["clog","klɒg","n. 障碍, 脚坠\\nv. 障碍, 阻塞",["I pulled a huge hair clog out of the bathroom sink drain.","I don't want my bathtub to clog, so I need to buy a strainer."],["",""]],["dismal","'dizmәl","a. 阴沉的, 凄凉的, 令人忧郁的\\nn. 低落的情绪, 沼泽",["The rain made the autumn day dismal.","City put in another dismal performance, losing two-nil to fellow strugglers Town."],["雨让秋天的日子阴沉沉的。",""]],["noteworthy","'nәutwә:ði","a. 值得注目的, 显著的",["The truth and simplicity of nature is always the most important foundation of noteworthy art.","There was nothing noteworthy about the candidate's speech."],["大自然的真实和质朴往往是值得注意的艺术中最重要的基石。",""]],["plume","plu:m","n. 羽毛, 羽毛装饰, 羽状的\\nvt. 用羽毛装饰, 整理羽毛, 使成羽毛状",["The southern Italian island of Sicily has been covered with a vast plume of smoke and ash.","On the wester horizon we saw a plume of smoke. Our scout thought it came from a wildfire, not a chimney."],["",""]],["sweetness","'swi:tnis","n. 甜蜜, 芳香, 美妙",["Crafting a perfect Mojito can be a challenge. Achieving the right balance of sweetness, mintiness, and lime is an art.","But he cried to the Lord, and he shewed him a tree, which when he had cast into the waters, they were turned into sweetness."],["調製一杯完美的 Mojito 並非易事。要達到甜味、薄荷味和青檸味之間的完美平衡，是一門藝術。",""]],["emmy","'emi","n. 埃米奖(美国电视艺术奖)",["That scene better win him an Emmy."],[""]],["algae","'ælgi:","pl. 藻类, 海藻\\n[化] 藻类",["Phosphorus provides nourishment for cyanobacteria (blue algae) which multiply and release toxins.","Algae and plankton are at the bottom of the food chain."],["",""]],["infantry","'infәntri","n. 步兵, 步兵团",["The infantry soldier is only a pawn in the game of war.","Dan studied psychological warfare techniques at infantry academy."],["",""]],["unmarried",".ʌn'mærid","a. 未婚的, 单身的\\n[法] 未婚的, 独身的",["She remained unmarried all her life.","My brother, being yet unmarried, did not keep house, but boarded with his apprentices at the home of another family."],["她一生未嫁。",""]],["sloppy","'slɒpi","a. 泥泞的, 潮湿的, 粗心的",["Edit your work better before you submit it, it's sloppy.","He said he dashed this proposal off in one sitting. It's pretty sloppy."],["提交工作内容之前请仔细检查，这里有疏忽的地方。",""]],["transcribe","træn'skraib","vt. 抄写, 译, 意译, 录制, 改编\\n[计] 转录",["First, in order to get a feel for your favourite author's work, transcribe and copy in full.","For next class, I want you guys to transcribe the lyrics from any singer as long as it's in English."],["",""]],["predicament","pri'dikәmәnt","n. 处境, 穷境, 困局",["If you'd been a bit more careful, we wouldn't be in this predicament.","So Jerry kept getting deeper and deeper into his predicament, like a man in quicksand."],["",""]],["sinus","'sainәs","n. 窦, 静脉窦, 凹陷处",["During the cold there were nasal congestion, sinus problems, and coughing.","I think I have a congested sinus because I feel fullness on one side of my face."],["",""]],["garnish","'gɑ:niʃ","n. 装饰, 装饰品\\nvt. 装饰",["Pomegranates are increasingly popular in cooking and baking, whether as juice, garnish, or focal ingredient.","Repurposing fruit skins for garnish or syrup is sustainable and creative."],["",""]],["override",".әuvә'raid","vt. 推翻, 无视, 对...有最后发言权, 制服, 践踏, 奔越过\\n[经] 代理佣金, 代销佣金",["Under the Constitution, the lower chamber's resolutions override those of the upper chamber.","We view compliance with existing standards as important, but this does not override our own requirements."],["",""]],["notch","nɒtʃ","n. 刻痕, 等级, 峡谷\\nvt. 刻凹痕, 用刻痕计算, 赢得",["Adobe and Apple both have top-notch video editing programs.","He decided to take it a notch up and do a prank that would inevitably hurt him."],["",""]],["attentive","ә'tentiv","a. 注意的, 留心的",["You don't seem to be as attentive in class as the other students.","Tom doesn't seem to be as attentive in class as the other students."],["",""]],["perish","'periʃ","vi. 毁灭, 丧生, 凋谢, 颓丧, 死亡, 腐烂\\nvt. 毁坏, 使麻木, 使丧生, 耗尽",["We must learn to live together as brothers, or we will perish together as fools.","That whoever believes in him shall not perish but have eternal life."],["我们必须学会像兄弟一样共同生活，要么就像傻子一样同归于尽。",""]],["tangled","","a. 纠缠的, 紊乱的\\n[法] 复杂的, 缠结的, 繁乱的",["It confuses me how combs can become so tangled up in my hair.","The thread tangled again and again, until I rewound the bobbin and re-threaded the sewing machine."],["",""]],["donkey","'dɒŋki","n. 驴子, 笨蛋, 顽固者, 辅助发动机, 辅助泵",["Jessie urged the little donkey forward.","The newest staff members get all the donkey work when they're at the bottom of the ladder."],["傑西鞭策小毛驢前進。",""]],["healer","'hi:lә","n. 医治者, 治疗物\\n[医] 治病者, 医生, 治病术土, 江湖医",["An experienced healer can lift curses and dispel evil eyes.","The healer says that he can bring the dead back to life."],["",""]],["dealership","'di:lәʃip","n. 代理权, 经销权\\n[法] 商品经销特许权, 代理商",["Don't buy your car from that dealership. They'll rob you blind.","That car dealership has a reputation for selling lemons."],["",""]],["blueberry","'blu:bәri","n. 乌饭树",["The blueberry cake he made was delicious.","Please hide the blueberry jam where Takako can't see it."],["他做的藍莓蛋糕很好吃。",""]],["vicinity","vi'siniti","n. 附近, 邻近, 附近地区, 近处\\n[法] 附近, 邻近, 附近地区",["We live in the vicinity of the school.","There are no hospitals in the vicinity of his house."],["我們住在學校附近。",""]],["humility","hju:'militi","n. 谦逊, 谦虚, 谦卑",["Then let me to the valley go, This pretty flower to see; That I may also learn to grow In sweet humility.","Only with wisdom can one distinguish between good and evil; only with humility can one build a happy life."],["然後讓我去山谷，看看這朵美麗的花；這樣我也可以在甜蜜的謙卑中，學會成長。","有智慧才能分辨善惡邪正；有謙虛才能建立美滿人生。"]],["pleasing","'pli:ziŋ","a. 令人喜爱的, 愉快的, 舒适的",["There's no pleasing Tom, he always grumbles about everything even when we've done our best.","Rather, let us raise our voices in more pleasing and joyful sounds."],["",""]],["televised","ˈteləˌvaɪzd","v. 由电视播送( televise的过去式和过去分词 ); 电视拍摄",["Let's go to the stadium, because today's match will not be televised.","Sometimes, one of the politicians can be seen trying to keep the audience's opinions under control during televised debates."],["一起去體育館吧，因爲今天的比賽沒有電視轉播。",""]],["caffeine","'kæfi:n","n. 咖啡因, 咖啡碱\\n[化] 咖啡因; 咖啡碱",["Will you be able to sleep with all that caffeine you've just had?","Caffeine is a purinergic antagonist that competitively inhibits adenosine at the sites of P1 receptors."],["你剛進食了那麼多咖啡因還睡得了覺嗎？",""]],["locus","'lәukәs","n. 轨迹；地点, 所在地",["If you think you are at the mercy of forces beyond your control, you have an external locus of control.","If you think you have control over your own life, you have an internal locus of control."],["",""]],["anthem","'ænθәm","n. 圣歌, 赞美诗",["The text of the national anthem of Canada was first written in French.","Estonia has its own national anthem."],["加拿大國歌的歌詞最初是用法文寫的。","爱沙尼亚有它自己的国歌。"]],["stuck","stʌk","stick的过去式和过去分词",["There was some chewing gum stuck to the sole of Tom's shoe.","Some chewing gum was stuck to the sole of Tom's shoe."],["汤姆的鞋底粘了口香糖。","汤姆的鞋底粘了口香糖。"]],["vanity","'væniti","n. 虚荣心, 虚无, 自负, 空虚, 时髦的小摆饰",["There is, perhaps, not one of our natural passions so hard to subdue as vanity.","The vanity of others is only counter to our taste when it is counter to our vanity."],["",""]],["mango","'mæŋgәu","n. 芒果\\n[化] 芒果Mangifera indica",["At the restaurant, I had a delicious mango dessert.","I know that people also speak Interlingua in the Blue Mango Country."],["",""]],["bulky","'bʌlki","a. 庞大的\\n[机] 庞大, 笨重",["I'm beginning to stop seeing people wearing bulky glasses like that of the bottom of a milk bottle.","Don't throw large or bulky items down the garbage chute."],["鏡片像牛奶瓶底一樣厚的那種眼鏡，我不太看到有人戴了。",""]],["limp","limp","n. 跛行\\na. 柔软的, 无力的, 软弱的\\nvi. 跛行",["Her coloring book lay limp, jagged with angular pink scribbles.","Some people caricature gay men as limp-wristed and speaking with a lisp."],["",""]],["motionless","'mәuʃәnlis","a. 不动的, 静止的\\n[机] 不动的, 静止的",["Tom sat motionless on a chair in the corner of the room.","A dog jumped onto the chair and lay motionless for five minutes."],["",""]],["tickle","'tikl","n. 胳肢, 痒\\nvt. 胳肢, 使发痒, 使快乐, 逗乐\\nvi. 觉得痒, 使人痒",["Tickle her nose with a feather while she's sleeping and see if she wakes up.","Indian cuisine is a tantalizing mix of flavors and spices that tickle the taste buds."],["",""]],["biotechnology",".baiәutek'nɔlәdʒi","n. 生物工艺学；生物技术",["It's very easy to drink potato shochu now that the potato-like smell has been reduced to a low level through use of the latest biotechnology.","Biotechnology will bring about a revolution in agriculture."],["透過現今的生物科技，蕃薯燒酒已經變得十分容易入口了，因為那種難聞的蕃薯味道大部分已經被去除了。",""]],["bony","'bәuni","a. 如骨的, 多骨的, 瘦骨嶙峋的",["As its name suggests, the leatherback is the only sea turtle that doesn't have a hard bony shell.","Look at him! He's bony, he can barely pick up a bottle of water."],["",""]],["scour","'skauә","vt. 擦亮, 洗涤, 清洗, 冲刷成, 急速穿过\\nvi. 擦, 洗, 冲刷, 腹泻, 急速穿行\\nn. 擦, 洗, 腹泻, 洗涤剂",["A cost-effective way to explore the Solar System was to send thousands of robotic probes to scour celestial bodies for data.","To solve the mystery she will have to scour his personal belongings for clues."],["",""]],["wizard","'wizәd","n. 男巫, 术士, 奇才\\na. 男巫的, 巫术的\\n[计] 向导",["\"What craft do you know?\" the wizard asked the youth.","The wizard waved his magic wand and disappeared into thin air."],["巫師問年輕人：「你懂什麼技藝？」",""]],["freshwater","'freʃwɔ:tә(r)","a. 江河湖泊的, 淡水的",["Using this device it's possible to turn ocean water into freshwater.","I believe this fish is a freshwater fish."],["通过这个装置有可能把海水变成淡水。","我相信這條魚是淡水魚。"]],["traveling","'trævliŋ","a. 旅行的, 旅行用的, 移动的",["If I have time and enough money, I'd want to go traveling in Europe.","Philip hates traveling for away games. He always gets really tired and never plays well."],["如果我有时间有钱，我要到欧洲去旅游。","菲利普不喜欢客场比赛，他总是容易感到很疲惫。"]],["dilute","dai'lju:t","vt. 冲淡, 稀释\\na. 淡的, 稀释的",["How many liters of water did you use to dilute the acid in the test tube?","Silver nitrate solution added to an aqueous solution of salvarsan acidified with dilute nitric acid yields a dark-yellow precipitate which rapidly becomes black."],["",""]],["billionaire",".biljә'nєә","n. 亿万富翁",["I always dreamed of being a billionaire.","Were it not for the fact that he is a billionaire, she would never marry him."],["我總是梦想著成為億萬富翁。",""]],["kite","kait","n. 风筝, 筝帆, 空头支票, 骗子\\nvi. 象风筝一样飞, 轻快地移动, 使用空头支票\\nvt. 使上升, 骗钱",["Tom attached the string to the kite.","There is a kite flying above the tree."],["汤姆把线拴在了风筝上。","有一只风筝在树上。"]],["compress","kәm'pres","vt. 压缩, 压紧\\nvi. 受压缩小\\n[计] 压缩程序",["Apply a compress to the affected part every two hours.","He can compress the most words into the smallest ideas of any man I ever met."],["",""]],["waterway","'wɒtәwei","n. 航道, 水路\\n[法] 水道, 水路航道",["A river and a canal are both types of waterway."],[""]],["jockey","'dʒɒki","n. 赛马骑师, 驾驶员, 操作工\\nvt. 骗, 瞒, 驾驶, 移动\\nvi. 当赛马的骑师",["He is out and away the best jockey.","I know that Tom used to be a disc jockey."],["",""]],["skyline","'skailain","n. 天涯, 地平线, 空中轮廓线",["One of the perks of my promotion is a chic, corner office with a great view of the skyline.","The New York skyline with all its skyscrapers is probably the most famous in the world."],["",""]],["lunge","lʌndʒ","n. 刺, 刺进, 跃进, 套马索\\nv. 突进, 刺",["At length, in a desperate lunge, which he followed with an attempt to close, Bucklaw's foot slipped, and he fell on the short grassy turf on which they were fighting.","The sound station's initiate recordings will be dogs barking excitedly, then falling silent as they lunge into their harnesses. Then it will be sled runners soughing in deep snow."],["",""]],["limiting","'limitiŋ","a. 限制的\\n[电] 极限",["Limiting the quantity of example sentences non-native English speakers can offer undermines their intelligence.","Renewable energy is essential for limiting the increase of the global temperature."],["",""]],["mortal","'mɒ:tәl","n. 生物, 人类\\na. 不免一死的, 人类的, 临终的",["Mortal enemies are immortal friends.","All men are mortal, all Greeks are men, therefore all Greeks are mortal."],["不共戴天的敵人是不朽的朋友。",""]],["ascend","ә'send","vi. 上升, 追溯, 登高\\nvt. 攀登",["The skyscraper's elevators ascend at an astonishing rate of speed.","I start from sleep, the parapet ascend, / and from the sloping roof with eager ears attend."],["",""]],["exempt","ig'zempt","n. 免税者, 被免除义务者\\na. 免除的\\nvt. 使免除, 豁免",["Nothing is exempt from Murphy's Law.","Israel is not exempt from abiding by international law."],["沒有任何事物能逃脫墨菲定律。",""]],["ultraviolet",".ʌltrә'vaiәlit","a. 紫外线的\\n[化] 紫外线的; 紫外线",["The ozone in the stratosphere absorbs ultraviolet radiation.","Ultraviolet rays can cause skin cancer."],["平流層的臭氧會吸收紫外線。","紫外線可導致皮膚癌。"]],["twig","twig","n. 小枝, 细枝\\nv. 懂得, 了解",["A twig snapped beneath the foot of the boy running home.","The bird picked up the twig with its beak and flew to its nest."],["",""]],["downhill","'daun'hil","a. 下坡的\\nadv. 下坡, 向下",["An increase in customer complaints might mean business is going downhill.","He is such a contrarian that when I said how steep a climb it was, he insisted we were going downhill."],["顧客投訴量增加，可能代表生意正在走下坡。",""]],["pageant","'pædʒәnt","n. 盛会, 游行, 虚饰, 露天表演",["Linda is one of the contestants in the pageant.","Crowning toddler beauty pageant queens is Mr. Fredericksen's passion."],["琳达是大会的参赛者之一。",""]],["ashore","ә'ʃɒ:","adv. 向岸, 在岸上",["He would always take drink when he was ashore, and a little drink would send him stark, staring mad.","When he left the navy, he found it hard to adjust to life ashore."],["",""]],["rectangular","rek'tæŋgjulә","a. 成直角的\\n[化] 矩形的",["In Quezon City when I was child, my family visited a mushroom farm. The mushrooms grew on rectangular hay bales.","A square is a rhombic rectangle or, if you prefer, a rectangular rhombus."],["",""]],["eldest","'eldist","a. 最年长的, 排行中第一的\\nn. 最年长者, 排行中第一者",["His elder sister is older than my eldest brother.","Mary has a difficult relationship with her eldest daughter, who is now 17."],["他姐姐比我哥哥大。",""]],["rum","rʌm","n. 朗姆酒\\na. 古怪的, 奇特的",["Even if you don't like rum, try a glass of this.","During prohibition days, racketeers used to rub each other out to get control of the rum-running racket."],["即使你不喜欢喝朗姆酒，请你尝一杯这个吧。",""]],["alligator","'æligeitә","n. 短吻鳄\\n[机] 两栖装甲车",["Did you know avocados used to be called alligator pears? Just thought you should know.","An American alligator chomps a snowy egret at the St. Augustine Alligator Farm Zoological Park in Florida."],["",""]],["overshadow",".әuvә'ʃædәu","vt. 遮阴, 使阴暗, 使失色, 使相形见绌, 使蒙上阴影",["I never intended to overshadow her accomplishments.","The English teacher's insensitive comments overshadow the progress and achievements of foreign learners."],["",""]],["persuasion","pә'sweiʒәn","n. 说服, 信念, 派别, 说服力",["I was born into the Hebrew persuasion, but when I got older I converted to narcissism.","The marriage ceremony was performed according to the rites of the Presbyterian persuasion."],["我天生是猶太人，但當我年紀大了的時候，我把它轉換成了自戀。",""]],["unhealthy",".ʌn'helθi","a. 不健康的",["This person's worldview is officially unhealthy.","She is quite pretty, but looks unhealthy."],["经鉴定，此人三观不正。","她佷美， 可是看起來不健康。"]],["repeal","ri'pi:l","n. 废止, 撤消\\nvt. 废止, 撤消, 放弃",["The Republicans want to repeal Obamacare.","I think they should repeal that law."],["",""]],["halo","'heilәu","n. 晕轮, 光圈, 晕状物, 荣光\\nvt. 使有晕轮, 围以光环\\nvi. 成晕轮",["Now, all heads turn toward the dean, who sits surrounded by a faint halo of light.","Saints are always depicted with a halo over their heads."],["",""]],["ensue","en'su:","vi. 跟着发生, 继起\\nvt. 追求",["Tears ensue, / and wailing, shrill as though her heart would bleed.","The president's argument is that chaos would ensue if he were forced from office."],["",""]],["intimately","'intimitli","adv. 亲切地, 亲密地, 个人性地",["I have known intimately a great many persons who were absorbed in the arts.","The Tesla brand is intimately connected with Elon Musk."],["",""]],["havoc","'hævәk","n. 大破坏, 蹂躏\\nvt. 严重破坏",["I'm in difficulties because of the demented old woman next door wreaking havoc in my fields.","Some non-native species are harmless, but others wreak havoc on other species, human health and the economy."],["",""]],["bilingual","bai'liŋgwәl","a. 双语的",["Being at least bilingual is a must in today's world.","Nowadays, some kindergartens are carrying out bilingual teaching, and so all the children can speak a little English."],["在当今的世界，拥有双语种是必要的","现在有些幼儿园推行的是双语教学，小朋友们都能滴里嘟噜地说上几句英语。"]],["borrower","'bɒrәuә","n. 借用人, 剽窃者\\n[经] 借款人, 借用人",["Neither a borrower nor a lender be; / For loan oft loses both itself and friend, / And borrowing dulls the edge of husbandry.","Neither a borrower nor a lender be: For loan oft loses both itself and friend; And borrowing dulls the edge of husbandry."],["",""]],["wed","wed","vt. 与...结婚, 使结合\\nvi. 结婚",["She didn't want to wed her cousin from her uncle's side.","Better be half hanged than ill wed."],["",""]],["evade","i'veid","v. (巧妙地)逃脱, 规避, 逃避",["The dense vegetation of the mangrove swamp provided excellent cover for small animals trying to evade predators.","They falsified the account balances to evade the tax."],["",""]],["terrified","'terifaid","a. 受惊吓的；感到恐惧的",["At first she was terrified, then she pulled herself together.","Tom told me he thought that Mary was terrified."],["一开头她吓坏了, 后来才定下神来。","汤姆告诉我他以为玛丽感到害怕。"]],["promotional","prәu'mәuʃәnl","a. 增进的",["Customers who purchase a new device can enjoy additional trial period as a promotional offer.","Local industry flourished throughout the land in the Edo period thanks to the promotional efforts by each clan."],["購買新裝置的用戶可享有額外試用優惠。",""]],["generating","'dʒenә,reitiŋ","a. 产生的, 生成的\\n[计] 生成",["I want my life to amount to more than just consuming products and generating garbage.","State intervention should be conducted by generating positive and intense incentives."],["",""]],["chlorine","'klɒ:ri:n","n. 氯\\n[化] 氯Cl",["There's a chance that tap water may contain harmful substances like chlorine and lead.","It's possible that the drinking water has chlorine, lead, or similar contaminants in it."],["自來水有可能含有氯、鉛等有害物質。",""]],["sulfur","'sʌlfә","n. 硫, 硫磺\\nvt. 用硫磺处理",["Hydrogen, carbon, nitrogen, phosphorus, oxygen, sulfur and selenium are nonmetals.","Methanethiol is an organic sulfur compound containing an alkyl or aryl group and a thiol group."],["",""]],["riches","'ritʃiz","pl. 财富, 财产, 富有\\n[经] 财富, 财宝, 房地产",["Despite his riches, he's not contented.","But nothing is so hard for those who abound in riches, as to conceive how others can be in want."],["尽管他很富有，他还是不满足。",""]],["inference","'infәrәns","n. 推论\\n[法] 推论, 推理, 推断",["Type inference has three outputs whereas checking only has two.","Logic, in the Middle Ages, and down to the present day in teaching, meant no more than a scholastic collection of technical terms and rules of syllogistic inference."],["",""]],["sane","sein","a. 神智健全的, 稳健的, 没病的, 合理的\\n[医] 精神健全的",["Rousseau was mad but influential; Hume was sane but had no followers.","Every sane man is accountable to his conscience for his behavior."],["盧梭是瘋狂的, 但有影響力; 休謨是理智的, 但沒有追隨者。",""]],["robber","'rɒbә","n. 强盗, 盗贼",["While the rest of us toil, the robber barons eat from gilt tableware.","While the rest of us work hard, the robber barons eat with gilded utensils."],["當我們其他人辛苦工作時，強盜貴族卻用鍍金餐具吃飯。","當我們其他人辛苦工作時，強盜貴族卻用鍍金餐具吃飯。"]],["monarchy","'mɒnәki","n. 君主政体, 君主国, 君主政治\\n[法] 君主政体, 君主制度, 君主国",["Many in England want to see the public subsidy of the monarchy done away with.","Aristotle was toadying up to the Macedonian monarchy."],["",""]],["deity","'di:iti","n. 神, 神性",["Do you know which deity this temple is dedicated to?","It is the preservation of the species, not of individuals, which appears to be the design of Deity throughout the whole of nature."],["您知道这座庙宇供奉的是哪个神吗？",""]],["metabolism","mi'tæbәlizm","n. 新陈代谢, 变态\\n[化] 新陈代谢; 代谢",["\"My metabolism is such that no matter how much I eat I don't put on weight.\" \"Just now, this second, you've made enemies of people throughout the world.\"","Scientists study adipose tissue to better understand obesity and metabolism."],["“我就算吃得再多也不会发胖。” “你在那一瞬间成了世界众人的敌人。“",""]],["somber","'sɒmbә","a. 昏暗的, 阴天的, 严峻的, 忧郁的",["From the doctor's grim expression, it was clear he had somber news for the patient.","Even in Tom's funniest sketches, there is a somber note."],["",""]],["engulf","in'gʌlf","vt. 卷入, 吸进, 吞没, 使全神贯注",["The flood waters are predicted to engulf the town.","Learning their religion will just engulf you in poverty."],["",""]],["unsettle",".ʌn'setl","vt. 使移动, 搅乱, 使动摇, 使不安宁\\nvi. 动荡不定, 离开固定位置",["The debate was full of gamesmanship, with each candidate trying to unsettle the other.","The building, rather than the exhibition as a whole, is intended to disturb and unsettle - a reminder of what Jews went through during the Holocaust or in exile."],["",""]],["mailing","'meiliŋ","n. 邮寄, 投递, 邮件, 农场租金",["Please don't forget to put a stamp on the letter before mailing it.","I don't remember mailing the letter."],["请不要忘记寄信前要在上面贴邮票。","我不記得寄過信了。"]],["subtly","'sʌtli","adv. 敏锐地, 巧妙地, 精细地",["The president tried to make his case for war by subtly appealing to the electorate's deep-seated suspicion of Arabs.","Mary believes Tom is subtly using her gender to discredit her."],["",""]],["containment","kәn'teinmәnt","n. 抑制, 牵制, 遏制\\n[法] 抑制, 牵制, 遏制",["The end of containment will be a relief for the whole world.","The doctors reviewed their containment procedures."],["",""]],["magnify","'mægnifai","vt. 放大, 扩大, 赞美, 夸大\\nvi. 有放大能力",["You can use a magnifying glass to magnify small text.","People often seek to magnify others' faults while minimizing their own."],["",""]],["jeep","dʒi:p","n. 吉普车\\nvi. 乘吉普车\\nvt. 用吉普车运",["He recently traded in his jeep for a new Mercedes.","Ziri found Rima's Jeep still parked near the hiking trail."],["",""]],["colonist","'kɒlәnist","n. 殖民地居民, 移民",["This outfit was typical of a colonist at that time."],[""]],["admirer","әd'maiәrә","n. 钦佩者, 仰慕者, 求爱者",["He's an admirer of everything relating to Korean culture.","I've been long meaning to tell you that I am your big admirer."],["",""]],["ascertain",".æsә'tein","vt. 确定, 查明\\n[法] 查明, 弄清, 确定",["We will first ascertain the cause of the disaster.","As I heard the story secondhand, I can't ascertain the truth of it."],["",""]],["malpractice","mæl'præktis","n. 不当治疗, 不端行为, 渎职\\n[医] 疗法失当, 医疗差错",["Malpractice insurance is a contributing factor to the high cost of medical care.","The doctor who treated Tom should be sued for malpractice."],["",""]],["misguided","mis'gaidid","a. 被误导的",["Our scientific power has outrun our spiritual power. We have guided missiles and misguided men.","I think most of them are benevolent but misguided."],["",""]],["sinister","'sinistә","a. 不吉利的, 凶恶的, 左边的\\n[医] 左的",["The most famous painting in the exposition depicted a starry sky with bats flying over it. It was a little sinister.","There is sorcery behind this, said a sinister voice coming from the crowd."],["",""]],["outburst","'autbә:st","n. 爆发, 突发, 破裂, 暴乱",["She walked up to him and kissed him on the cheek, then she retreated almost afraid of her outburst.","She always has an emotional outburst when arguing."],["",""]],["incarnation",".inkɑ:'neiʃәn","n. 典型, 特殊阶段, 化身, 体现",["In the Hindu religion, an \"avatar\" is an incarnation, in tangible human or animal form, of an ethereal deity.","Budai statues depict a fat and happy incarnation of Buddha."],["",""]],["mower","'mәuә","n. 刈草的人, 刈草机",["Tom's mower broke down when he was half way through mowing his lawn.","Three men jumped out, rolled an old mower down the ramp."],["",""]],["auditorium",".ɒ:di'tɒ:riәm","n. 听众席, 礼堂\\n[医] 大讲堂, 大会堂",["I knew it would be hot in the auditorium.","The auditorium is terribly stained. It is, in part, due to acid rain."],["我就知道禮堂裡會很熱。",""]],["microscopic","maikrә'skɔpik","a. 显微镜的, 用显微镜可见的, 微观的, (非正式)极微小的, 细微的\\n[计] 微观的",["The author's verbiage produced a document of mammoth size and microscopic import.","We just looked at a microscopic piece of sponge through a microscope."],["",""]],["poisoning","'pɒizәniŋ","n. 中毒\\n[医] 中毒",["Tom got mercury poisoning from eating canned tuna every day.","Tom got mercury poisoning because he ate canned tuna every day."],["Tom汞中毒了，因為他每天都吃罐裝金槍魚。","Tom汞中毒，因為他每天吃罐裝鮪魚。"]],["caretaker","'kєәteikә","n. 照顾者, 看管者, 看守人\\n[法] 看守员, 管理员, 看管人",["The accident was due to the negligence of the caretaker.","I hear some guy, presumably a caretaker, going \"Rawr, I'm going to eat you!\" from the nursery school across the street."],["",""]],["juggle","dʒʌgl","vi. 玩戏法, 行骗, 篡改\\nvt. 耍弄, 歪曲, 篡改\\nn. 玩戏法, 魔术, 欺骗",["There's no way that Tom will ever be able to juggle.","Tom could hardly keep from laughing when he saw Mary trying to juggle some balls."],["",""]],["plainly","'pleinli","adv. 清楚地, 明白地, 简单地, 朴素地, 直率地, 坦白地",["So that it may be seen plainly that what he has done has been done through God.","She plainly interpreted Picasso's paintings to me."],["",""]],["limousine","'limәzi:n","n. 轿车",["Car? Ah, if you mean that limousine, - I chartered it.","There was a limousine waiting for Tom outside the hotel."],["",""]],["plentiful","'plentiful","a. 许多的, 丰富的, 丰饶的",["She shed plentiful tears when her beloved dog was killed in an accident.","A buyers' market is a market in which goods are plentiful, buyers have a wide range of choices, and prices are low."],["她目睹愛犬在意外中離世，不禁淚如泉湧。",""]],["guitarist","gi'tɑ:rist","n. 吉他弹奏者",["Tom's the best guitarist I've ever heard in person.","Tom is a talented guitarist, but he's a horrible singer."],["",""]],["defining","","[计] 定义的",["It's been a long time coming; but tonight, because of what we did on this day, in this election, at this defining moment, change has come to America.","It's been a long time coming; but tonight, because of what we did on this day, in this election, at this defining moment, change has come to the United States."],["已经过去了很长时间，但是今晚，由于我们今天在这场选举所采取的行动，在这个决定性的时候，变革来到了美国。","已经过去了很长时间，但是今晚，由于我们今天在这场选举所采取的行动，在这个决定性的时候，变革来到了美国。"]],["starvation","stɑ:'veiʃәn","n. 饥饿, 饿死\\n[医] 绝食, 饥锇(指长时期的)",["The survivors were found on an island, dying of starvation.","The poor child was on the verge of starvation."],["倖存者在一箇島上被找到了，已經餓得要死了。","那可憐的孩子快餓死了。"]],["deflect","di'flekt","vt. 转移, 使偏斜\\nvi. 偏斜",["A barrier, designed to deflect noise away from nearby houses, was erected along the edge of the freeway.","A lot of people deflect praise that comes their way, because they don't know how to handle it."],["",""]],["defiance","di'faiәns","n. 蔑视, 挑战\\n[法] 挑战, 藐视, 违抗",["She got married in defiance of her father.","He kept on drinking in defiance of his doctor's warning."],["她違背了她父親的意願結了婚。",""]],["luminous","'lu:minәs","a. 发光的, 明亮的\\n[医] 发光的",["They all agreed that it was a huge creature, luminous, ghastly, and spectral.","An American artist is using a unique glass thread technique to create beautiful luminous glass vessels."],["",""]],["shear","ʃiә","n. 修剪, 剪下的东西, 大剪刀, 切变, 剪切机, 切\\nvt. 修剪, 割, 剥夺, 横越, 削剪\\nvi. 剪, 修剪, 剪羊毛,…",["These are the instruments you need to shear a sheep.","If the torque is too high, the shaft might break. That's why we are using a shear splint as a torque limiter."],["",""]],["amplify","'æmplifai","vt. 增强, 放大, 扩大, 详述\\nvi. 引伸",["It was a mistake to amplify this debate with thoughtless responses.","Nobody cares what you're bad at, and neither should you. Amplify your strengths. Nobody will see the rest."],["",""]],["lofty","'lɒfti","a. 高的, 傲慢的, 崇高的, 高级的, 玄虚的",["No matter what grand and lofty reason you have, it's not right to do this.","Yanni lives a segregated life in a lofty villa in Algiers."],["不管你有什么冠冕堂皇的理由，这样做是不对的。",""]],["foyer","'fɔiei","n. 门厅, 入门大堂",["In the hotel foyer, a few guests who have just arrived are waiting to receive a room key.","There's a vending machine in the foyer selling chocolate bars."],["",""]],["staggering","'stægәriŋ","a. 蹒跚的, 巨大的, 惊人的\\n[电] 参差",["They decided to abandon their plans to visit the popular museum when they saw the staggering length of the line outside.","You stand the axis on the base and then proceed to stack up each part, staggering their position."],["",""]],["modernist","'mɒdәnist","n. 现代主义者, 现代人, 现代主义作家",["Intelligence services in Algeria instead of spying on dangerous people they spy on modernist opponents and the oppressed."],[""]],["snowy","'snәui","a. 多雪的, 雪的, 被雪所覆盖着的, 下雪的",["According to the weather forecast, tomorrow will be snowy.","The children rode a toboggan down the hill in the snowy weather."],["天气预报说明天会下雪。",""]],["casket","'kɑ:skit","n. 首饰盒, 小箱, 匣子, 棺材",["The priest made the sign of the cross as the casket was lowered into the ground.","A pallbearer carries the casket of the deceased at their funeral."],["",""]],["inauguration","i,nɔ:^ju'reiʃәn","n. (美)总统就职, 开幕仪式, 就职典礼, 开始, 开辟, 开创, 为...举行开幕式\\n[法] 就职, 就职典礼, 创造",["At the inauguration ceremony a plaque was unveiled in honor of the founder.","His inauguration speech will be effectively a valediction to our hopes."],["",""]],["rot","rɒt","n. 腐烂, 腐蚀, 败坏\\nvi. 腐烂, 烂, 堕落, 憔悴\\nvt. 使腐烂, 使腐朽, 使堕落",["Wood left outdoors should be dried off and properly finished with sealant before the rot sets in.","Germany is also facing disrupted harvests and fears crops will rot in the fields."],["",""]],["horrify","'hɒrifai","vt. 使恐惧, 使震惊",["The announcement was intended to horrify the audience."],[""]],["dryer","'draiә","n. 干衣机, 干燥剂\\n[化] 干燥剂; 催干剂; 干燥器; 干燥设备; 烘箱",["Mary dried her hair with a hair dryer.","It's important never to go out while you have the clothes dryer on."],["瑪莉用吹風機吹乾頭髮。",""]],["fume","fju:m","n. 臭气, 烟, 激怒\\nvt. 熏\\nvi. 冒烟",["Don't just sit there and fume. Tell me what's wrong.","The queue for the water park slide was shorter than for the new log fume ride."],["",""]],["meager","'mi:gә","a. 质量差的, 贫乏的, 不毛的, 瘦的",["The beggar rattled a few meager coins in his tin can.","He fleeced three old ladies of their meager pensions."],["",""]],["warranty","'wɒ:rәnti","n. 正当理由, 授权, 担保, 保证, 根据\\n[经] 保单, 担保书, 保证书",["A good warranty would make me feel better.","Unfortunately, Apple doesn't provide a warranty for accidental damages."],["優質的保固能讓我安心。",""]],["seeker","'si:kә","n. 搜索者, 探求者\\n[法] 搜索人, 搜查人",["The asylum seeker was finally able to speak to a lawyer.","Claudio was the seeker and Isabella was the hider."],["",""]],["dent","dent","n. 凹痕\\nvt. 使凹下, 削弱\\nvi. 塌陷",["Stopgap measures won't make a dent in drug addiction.","Tom's car is easily recognizable since there is a big dent in the front bumper."],["",""]],["pollen","'pɒlәn","n. 花粉\\nvt. 传授花粉给",["Probably you are allergic to pollen or dust.","Just how well can masks block the, even smaller than pollen, yellow sand dust? I think it much more of a nuisance than pollen."],["你可能对花粉或灰尘过敏。",""]],["remotely","","adv. 极小地, 极细微地",["I often use SSH to remotely connect to my computer.","I often use SSH to access my computers remotely."],["我经常使用SSH来远程连接到我的电脑。","我经常使用SSH来远程连接到我的电脑。"]],["rusty","'rʌsti","a. 生锈的, 腐蚀的, 生疏的, 顽固的, 腐烂的\\n[医] 锈色的",["The water coming out of this faucet is rusty.","Sami put the rusty fork in the dishwasher."],["這個龍頭出來的水都是鐵銹。","薩米將生鏽的叉子放進了洗碗機。"]],["terrestrial","tә'restriәl","n. 地球上的人\\na. 地球的, 陆生的, 陆地的, 人间的",["The Solar System has four terrestrial or telluric planets: Mercury, Venus, Earth, and Mars.","Pigeons can use the terrestrial magnetic field to find their way home."],["",""]],["breaking","'breikiŋ","[计] 断开, 停止, 设断点\\n[化] 打开; 分割; 打碎; 轧碎; 破碎",["Love is the process of breaking and mending the heart of another.","I think a change of ruling party in Hungary will result in WWIII breaking out."],["爱，就是一个人把另一个人的心揉碎的过程。","我認為匈牙利的執政黨輪換將導致三戰爆發。"]],["jug","dʒʌg","n. 水壶, 监牢, 模仿夜莺的叫声\\nvt. 放入壶中, 炖, 关押\\nvi. 模仿夜莺叫",["This little jug is historic; it's more than eighty years old.","If I learn to play the washboard and you learn to play the kazoo, maybe we can join a jug band."],["",""]],["alienation",".eiljә'neiʃәn","n. 疏远, 离间, 转让\\n[医] 精神错乱",["Alienation is a common theme of twentieth-century literature.","Alienation is the only thing I understand about Marxism."],["",""]],["perk","pә:k","vi. 昂首, 振作, 举止高傲, 神气活现, 滤煮\\nvt. 竖起, 打扮, 使振作, 滤煮\\nn. 小费",["There's the perk of letting you join communities for paying members.","The box you designed has the perk of being a good home for the lambkin."],["",""]],["permeate","'pә:mieit","vt. 弥漫, 渗透, 充满, 影响, 感染\\nvi. 透入, 散布",["The world of dreams is a set of stages where virtual realities permeate one another.","Corruption and red tape continue to permeate the business environment."],["",""]],["defiant","di'faiәnt","a. 挑衅的, 目中无人的",["He often takes a defiant attitude toward us.","The defiant manner is characteristic of teenagers."],["他常以反抗的態度對我們。",""]],["swollen","'swәulәn","a. 肿大的, 涨水的, 夸张的, 骄傲的\\nswell的过去分词",["Your feet are swollen because your shoes are too small.","Swollen lymph nodes are usually found near the site of an infection, tumour, or inflammation."],["",""]],["maritime","'mæritaim","a. 海的, 海上的, 海事的, 沿海的, 海员的\\n[经] 海事的, 海上的, 海员的",["Boeing developed a flying boat for the Maritime Self-Defense Force.","The Portuguese man Vasco da Gama discovered the maritime route which leads from Portugal around the continent of Africa to India."],["",""]],["grunt","grʌnt","vi. 作呼噜声\\nvt. 咕哝\\nn. 呼噜声, 咕哝",["What do you expect from a pig but a grunt.","\"How'd your project go?\" \"I did all the grunt work, yet my group still managed to get a 'C'.\""],["",""]],["taxation","tæk'seiʃәn","n. 课税, 征税, 抽税, 税款, 估定的税额\\n[经] 征税, 纳税, 税制",["The people groaned under the burden of heavy taxation.","I prefer market-based solutions, such as carbon taxation, to a micromanaging regulatory approach."],["",""]],["loophole","'lu:phәul","n. 枪眼, 小窗, 换气孔",["A loophole in the law allowed him to escape prosecution.","Tom took advantage of a tax loophole."],["",""]],["bash","bæʃ","v. 猛击, 打坏\\nn. 猛撞, 猛击",["I'm having a bash myself at the ballet.","Tom is having a birthday bash this weekend."],["",""]],["acquaint","ә'kweint","vt. 使认识, 介绍",["You should acquaint yourself with the local customs.","You should acquaint yourself with the facts before you make a decision."],["",""]],["statistic","stә'tistik","n. 统计量\\na. 统计的, 统计学的",["A single death is a tragedy, a million deaths is a statistic.","The death of one man is a tragedy. The death of millions is a statistic."],["死一个人是悲剧；死上万人是数据。",""]],["afflict","ә'flikt","vt. 使苦恼, 折磨",["My motto is: Comfort the afflicted and afflict the comfortable.","These diseases afflict the poorest and most marginalized communities in the country."],["",""]],["tan","tæn","n. 黄褐色, 鞣料, 马戏团\\na. 黄褐色的, 鞣皮的\\nvi. 晒成棕褐色\\nvt. 把...晒黑, 鞣(革), 狠狠鞭打",["The plane is landing in Tan Son Nhat airport.","Judging by that great tan, it looks like you spent most of your vacation on the beach."],["飞机降落在新山一机场。",""]],["pollster","'pәulstә","n. 民意调查人, 民意测验经办人",["The pollster had nothing to eat."],[""]],["browse","brauz","v. 浏览, 吃草\\nn. 浏览, 吃草\\n[计] 浏览",["I'd like you to quickly browse through these documents.","This program protects our online privacy by uncovering trackers while we browse the Web."],["",""]],["apiece","ә'pi:s","adv. 就每个而论, 各",["Our babysitter gave us a chocolate bar apiece.","Shovels and spades sold for ten dollars apiece."],["",""]],["amass","ә'mæs","vt. 积聚, 堆积",["Her ability to amass a fortune is due to luck and hard work.","The captain ordered the crew to immediately amass."],["",""]],["skater","'skeitә","n. 溜冰者",["She is recognized as the best figure-skater in the country.","Tom is studying figure skating with a world famous figure skater."],["",""]],["implicitly","","adv. 含蓄, 不言明, 暗示, 暗指, 内含, 固有, 无疑, 绝对, 无保留\\n[计] 隐含地",["Advocating the status quo, explicitly or implicitly, is advocating a political agenda.","Fact-checking organisations are not implicitly trustworthy."],["",""]],["slum","slʌm","n. 贫民窟\\nvi. 访问贫民区",["If you ever saw the slums in the poor countries, you would feel that you're really not so poor. Those slum dwellers are human, too.","The movie is a harrowing depiction of life in an urban slum."],["你如果看過貧窮國家的貧民窟，就會覺得自己其實沒那麼窮。那些貧民窟的居民也是人。",""]],["licensing","","v. 许可；批准（license的ing形式）",["The government said it would open two downtown streets to informal vendors on weekends and also start licensing ambulatory vendors."],[""]],["inefficient",".ini'fiʃәnt","a. 无效率的, 无能的\\n[医] 无效的, 无效力的",["Yanni developed some very inefficient coping strategies.","Trying to beat some kid's high score is an inefficient use of your time."],["",""]],["soaring","'sɔ:riŋ 'sɔәr-","a. 高飞的, 翱翔的, 高耸入云的, 崇高的, 高涨的\\n[经] 飞涨的, 高涨的",["The price of land in the center of the city is soaring.","Horus is a bird soaring around the site, looking for duplicated sentences."],["",""]],["cyclist","'saiklist","n. 骑脚踏车的人",["The cyclists are wearing cyclist shorts made of spandex.","A cyclist was hit by a lorry turning right and seriously injured."],["",""]],["managed","","a. 与中央化计划及管制有关的；托管的",["Although the accident has delayed progress by one month, we have managed to catch up with the schedule.","By frugality she managed to get along on her small salary."],["尽管事故使进度延迟了一个月，我们还是设法赶上了日程表。","凭着节俭，她设法以自己微薄的薪水生活。"]],["sidebar","'saidbɑ:(r)","n. 其他选项,工具条",["If you need more room on the screen, you can toggle the sidebar off.","The sidebar is displayed on the edge of the page below the site logo."],["如需更多螢幕空間，可以關閉側邊欄。","側邊欄顯示在網站標誌下方的頁面邊緣。"]],["unto","'ʌntu, 'ʌntә, 'ʌntu:","prep. 到, 对, 直到",["The feelings of \"love at first sight\" and \"faithful unto death\" are unrealistic; this sort of unrealistic and illusory feeling is not what we need.","Do not do unto others what you do not want others do unto you."],["「一見鍾情」以及「從一而終」的感情是不切實際的，我們需要的不是這種不切實際而虛幻的感情。",""]],["traverse","'trævә:s","n. 越过, 横贯, 横断物, 屏障, 否认, 反驳\\nvt. 横过, 穿过, 经过, 详细研究, 反对, 在...来回移动\\nvi. 横…",["That's an area that's impossible to traverse on foot.","She says trucks are unable to traverse the treacherously narrow roads."],["",""]],["protector","prә'tektә","n. 保护者, 保护物, 保护装置\\n[医] [催化]保护质, 保护器",["Oh! I know very well that he is dead! cried out the trembling girl while lifting her tear-flooded face towards her protector.","When Linda was little, her big brother was her protector."],["",""]],["thermometer","θә'mɒmitә","n. 温度计, 体温计\\n[化] 温度计",["The nurse took his temperature with a thermometer.","The climate of this town is so mild that the thermometer seldom rises to thirty degrees, even in midsummer."],["護士用溫度計量了量他的體溫。","這小鎮的天氣十分暖和，即使是在盛夏，溫度計也很少會升到三十度。"]],["hippie","'hipi:","n. 嬉皮士",["I've heard that he turned a hippie, because he chewed some mushroom and discovered a new colourful world.","Your hippie crisp contained so much fiber! I lost five pounds the next day."],["",""]],["disdain","dis'dein","n. 蔑视\\nvt. 蔑视, 鄙弃",["Max really liked Catherine, but not enough for him to overcome his disdain for her mainstream taste in music and ask her out.","Tom didn't notice the look of disdain on Mary's face."],["",""]],["prominently","'prɔminәntli","adv. 显著地",["The theme of isolation features prominently in his work.","His name was prominently featured on the book's cover."],["",""]],["vigor","'vigә","n. 精力, 活力",["Mary's energetic vigor mixed surprisingly well with Tom's submissive eagerness.","The once-mighty empire had grown effete, bloated with luxury and devoid of vigor."],["",""]],["comer","'kʌmә","n. 来的人, 新来者, 有成功希望的人",["The great swans swam round the new-comer, and stroked his neck with their beaks, as a welcome."],[""]],["savvy","'sævi","v. 理解, 领悟\\nn. 理解能力, 机智, 悟性",["We're looking for some computer-savvy people to work for us.","Tom is very tech-savvy and often helps members of his family with their computing problems."],["",""]],["treasury","'treʒәri","n. 国库, 宝库, 财政部, 国库券\\n[经] 库存, 国库, 金库",["It is an ancient midden, presently an archaeological treasury.","TATOEBA could be an acronym in various languages: The All-inclusive Treasury Of Examples Beautifully Arranged."],["",""]],["oppressive","ә'presiv","a. 压制性的, 压迫的, 沉重的",["The whole thing is utterly oppressive.","Six million Palestinians continue to live under an oppressive regime in various forms."],["真是令人窒息。",""]],["mow","mau. mәu","n. 草堆, 皱眉, 怪脸\\nvt. 割草\\nvi. 割草, 做怪脸",["I'm going to mow the lawn tomorrow, weather permitting.","I didn't charge Tom anything to mow his lawn."],["如果天氣情況允許的話，我明天就去割草坪。","我修剪湯姆的草坪，沒有向他收取任何費用。"]],["unnatural",".ʌn'næʃәrәl","a. 不自然的, 反常的, 不近人情的\\n[法] 不自然的, 违背人道, 邪恶的",["It's very easy to sound natural in your own native language, and very easy to sound unnatural in your non-native language.","This sentence sounds unnatural to me as an American."],["你很容易把母语说得通顺流畅，却很容易把非母语说得不自然。",""]],["precursor",".pri:'kә:sә","n. 先驱者, 前导, 前兆\\n[化] 前体; 前身; 产物母体",["The Kingdom of Urartu (9th to 6th century BC) is considered a precursor to the Armenian nation.","Domestic corn's wild precursor was teosinte."],["",""]],["poignant","'pɒinәnt","a. 辛酸的, 尖锐的, 剧烈的",["The eating of delicious food is one of the most intense and poignant pleasures of life.","The poignant ending of the movie made all of us cry."],["",""]],["vibrate","'vaibreit","vi. 振动, 颤动, 激动, 摇摆, 踌躇\\nvt. 使颤动, 使振动, 使摆动",["Passengers became nervous when the plane began to vibrate.","Mary's cellphone started to vibrate in her pocket."],["飛機開始震動的時候，乘客們都緊張了起來。",""]],["swoop","swu:p","n. 俯冲, 攫取\\nvt. 抓取\\nvi. 猛扑, 突然袭击",["This is a golden opportunity we'd be stupid to pass up. Let's get to work and finish it all in one fell swoop.","The samurai decapitated his opponent in one fell swoop."],["",""]],["statutory","'stætjutәri","a. 法令的, 法定的, 可依法惩处的\\n[经] 法定的",["Statutory law is written and passed by a legislature.","There are no statutory minimum paid vacations or paid public holidays in the United States."],["",""]],["marketer","'mɑ:kitә","n. 赶集者, 市场商人\\n[经] 在市场买卖的人, 市场商人",["I'm a marketer, and as a marketer, I know that I've never really been in control. Your brand is what other people say about you when you're not in the room, the saying goes.","He made his fortune as a Cohiba marketer."],["",""]],["finite","'fainait","a. 有限的, 有穷的, 限定的\\nn. 有限物",["Anyone who believes exponential growth can go on forever in a finite world is either a madman or an economist.","Languages can form an infinite number of sentences with a finite set of elements."],["",""]],["minivan","'minivæn","n. 小型货车",["Fadil was found dead in the front seat of his minivan.","Tom saw a black minivan parked in front of his house."],["",""]],["cleansing","'klenziŋ","[医] 洗净, 清洗法",["Activists accuse Morocco of carrying out ethnic cleansing in Western Sahara.","Iran is ultimately responsible for the ethnic cleansing of Yemen's Jews by the Houthis. They were non-Zionists."],["",""]],["impart","im'pɑ:t","vt. 给予, 传授, 告知",["One of the things we should learn from Americans is their ability to gather, accumulate, and impart knowledge.","The teachers didn't just impart knowledge to us; they also taught us how to think."],["",""]],["parachute","'pærәʃu:t","n. 降落伞\\nvi. 跳伞",["After a minute of free fall he pulled the rip cord and out came the parachute.","Culture is like a parachute: if you don't have it, you crash."],["",""]],["centralized","'sentrәlaizd","a. 集中的；中央集权的",["Your money is like a ghost, living in a centralized computer.","Algeria needs to move from a centralized economy controlled by the state to a true market economy."],["",""]],["trafficking","ˈtræfikɪŋ","n. 非法交易",["That politician has been trafficking in drugs for years.","Mexican drug cartels are vying over lucrative drug-trafficking routes to the U.S."],["",""]],["treadmill","'tredmil","n. 踏车, 令人厌倦的工作\\n[法] 踏车",["With half an hour on this treadmill you'll work up a pretty good sweat.","Tom was sweating profusely after a half an hour on the treadmill."],["",""]],["discontent",".diskәn'tent","n. 不满",["Better to give up possessions than to live in discontent with others.","The mayor manifested his discontent with the new plan."],["",""]],["coaster","'kәustә","n. 沿海航行者/贸易者, 沿海航船, 带轮银盘, 杯托, (酒瓶)垫子\\n[经] 沿海贸易船",["On the mahogany desk, there is a metal cup and a blue coaster.","I got sick riding the roller coaster with the loop-the-loop."],["紅木書桌上有一個金屬杯子和一個藍色杯墊。",""]],["dissident","'disidәnt","a. 意见不同的, 持不同政见的\\nn. 意见不同的人, 持不同政见者",["The political dissident has spent nearly a decade under house arrest.","In the 21st century virtually every American considers themselves a dissident, even those who defend tradition and powerful institutions."],["",""]],["faintly","'feintli","adv. 微弱地, 模糊地, 朦胧地",["The boy faintly resembled his father in appearance.","It seems as if my daughter is faintly aware that I'm not her real mother."],["",""]],["amuse","ә'mju:z","vt. 消遣, 娱乐, 使发笑",["I will do my best to amuse you, and I hope I shall succeed, for you have inspired me with the liveliest interest.","The man whose work it is to amuse people who attend a show is an entertainer."],["",""]],["vinyl","'vainil","n. 乙烯基\\n[化] 乙烯基",["The weakness of vinyl is that it is easily affected by heat.","Children that live in homes with vinyl floors are more likely to have autism."],["",""]],["arousal","ә'rauzl","n. 奋发, 激励",["All pleasurable activities cause arousal of the pleasure centers of the brain.","Exhibitionism is characterized by achieving sexual arousal through the display of genitalia, usually to an unsuspecting stranger."],["",""]],["hiker","'haikә","n. 徒步旅行者",["The man was later identified as the missing hiker.","The cleft in the rock provided shelter for the hiker."],["",""]],["mileage","'mailidʒ","n. 英里数\\n[经] 运费(按英里计算的)",["Generally, a 4WD vehicle gets much worse gas mileage than a compact car.","My new car gets much better mileage than the old one."],["",""]],["browser","'brauzә","n. 吃嫩叶的动物, 浏览书本的人\\n[计] 浏览程序",["On the client side, very time-consuming operations should run asynchronously so as to avoid freezing the browser. The best example is the operation of Ajax.","The browser is running really slowly."],["在浏览器端，耗时很长的操作都应该异步执行，避免浏览器失去响应，最好的例子就是 Ajax 操作。","瀏覽器跑得超級慢。"]],["speedy","'spi:di","a. 快的, 迅速的\\n[经] 快的, 迅速的",["The doctor's careful examination of the patient brought about his speedy recovery.","The doctor's quick arrival brought about her very speedy recovery."],["",""]],["mommy","'mɒmi","n. 妈咪",["If you break the clock again, you'll catch it from Mommy.","Remember, never talk to strangers without mommy or daddy around."],["",""]],["underline","'ʌndәlain","vt. 在...下面划线, 作...的衬里, 强调\\nn. 下划线, 图下说明文字\\n[计] 加下划线; 下划线",["Underline all the verbs in the future tense in this text.","I put an underline under the word \"Alice\" to put an emphasis on it."],["",""]],["eclectic","ek'lektik","n. 折衷主义者\\na. 选择的, 折衷的",["Her eclectic taste was evident from the unusual decor of the room.","Her house is a reflection of her eclectic sensibilities."],["",""]],["intimidation","in,timi'deiʃәn","n. 恐吓, 威胁\\n[法] 恐吓, 威胁",["That time, Fadil departed from his usual pattern of intimidation.","The reign of terror and intimidation should end in the occupied territories."],["",""]],["newfound","'nju:fajnd","a. 新发现的",["When he grew older, he had a newfound interest in Islam.","Meeting you has imbued my life with a newfound sense of meaning."],["",""]],["stained","steind","a. 沾污的, 褪色的, 着色的, 染色的\\n[化] 染污",["A drop of mustard fell and stained my tie during lunch.","The auditorium is terribly stained. It is, in part, due to acid rain."],["吃午饭的时候，一坨芥末酱滴下来弄脏了我的领带。",""]],["snag","snæg","n. (尖利的)突出物, (衣服等的)戳破处, 断牙, 意外障碍\\nvt. 造成阻碍, 抓住机会, 抢到, 清除障碍物",["You stole my bike, and now I'm going to snag your face.","According to local media, the \"technical snag\" that prompted the postponement of the launch was a fuel leak in the rocket."],["",""]],["prescribed","","a. 规定的",["The physician prescribed his patient some medicine.","If Tom doesn't take the prescribed medicine, his state of health might deteriorate."],["医生给他的病人开了一些药。","如果汤姆不吃处方药，他的健康状况可能会恶化。"]],["sly","slai","a. 狡猾的, 诡密的, 俏皮的, 偷偷摸摸的",["It seemed that she didn't understand anything, but on the sly, she got the best grade in the class.","He has come to look like a sly-as-a-fox Premier who uses his position's powers to the fullest extent, to his own advantage."],["",""]],["relegate","'religeit","vt. 驱逐, 使降低地位, 把...归类, 把...委托给\\n[法] 流放, 判流放刑, 驱逐",["Don't relegate me to the back office. I want to talk to the customers.","The same people trying to ban trans people are also trying to relegate women back into subservient positions as uncompensated homemakers."],["",""]],["prom","prɔm","n. (英)音乐会, (美)舞会, 散步道\\n[计] 可编程序只读存储器",["It was a surprise to see all the students behaving with decorum on prom night.","According to functionalist theory, acne outbreaks provide a necessary limit on the number of prom attendees."],["",""]],["quantify","'kwɒntifai","vt. 定量, 用数量表示, 测量",["It's difficult to quantify how bright her personality is.","The scarcity of data makes it difficult to quantify pastoralism's contribution to ecosystem and wildlife services."],["",""]],["conspire","kәn'spaiә","vi. 阴谋, 协力, 共谋\\nvt. 图谋",["They conspire to overthrow the oppressive government.","Sami and Layla were trying to conspire against Farid."],["",""]],["motivated","'mәutiveitid","a. 有动机的, 目的明确的",["It's useless, I'm not motivated today for some reason.","He's looking for someone motivated to replace his secretary."],["不行，今天不知為何沒有幹勁。",""]],["geologist","dʒi'ɔlәdʒist","n. 地质学家, 地质学者",["The geologist noted a tabular layer of anthracite running between two bands of shale.","The geologist climbed into the limo."],["",""]],["pundit","'pʌndit","n. 学者, 梵文学者, 博学的印度人, 权威",["The pundit on TV says we're all doomed. Me, I'm skeptical.","Tom's political prospects dried up after the scandal, so he became a pundit for a conservative news station."],["",""]],["hairy","'hєәri","a. 多毛的, 毛状的, 长毛的",["You don't have to go getting so hairy about such a small thing.","Dan never handles his big hairy spider without a thick glove."],["不要這麼吹毛求疵。",""]],["bearded","'biәdid","a. 有须的, 有胡子的",["The bearded god had promised to return someday in the same way he had left.","We combed police records of the incident but found no mention of witnesses seeing a tall, bearded man."],["",""]],["oust","aust","vt. 逐出, 罢黜, 剥夺, 驱逐\\n[法] 驱逐, 剥夺, 免职",["They wanted to oust the communist government of Fidel Castro."],[""]],["shadowy","'ʃædәui","a. 有影的, 暗黑的, 朦胧的, 虚幻的",["It's getting more and more shadowy, soon it will be twilight.","I woke up and saw a shadowy figure approaching the bed."],["",""]],["abdomen","'æbdәmen","n. 腹部\\n[医] 腹[部]",["Most of an insect's organs are inside its abdomen.","The body of an insect is divided into head, thorax and abdomen."],["",""]],["entice","in'tais","vt. 诱骗, 引诱, 怂恿",["He is hoping to entice her into doing what he wants.","The bait is called beauty, it does entice - one can never foretell."],["",""]],["speculative","'spekjuleitiv","a. 思索性的, 投机的, 推测的\\n[经] 投机的, 冒险的",["Commodity futures markets have become highly speculative.","Some good inexpensive escapes would be to read speculative fiction or learn an extraordinary language to describe one's reality."],["",""]],["interpretive","in'tә:pritiv","[计] 解释的, 翻译的",["The museum offers interpretive guides for visitors."],["博物館為訪客提供解說指南。"]],["reserved","ri'zә:vd","a. 保留的, 预备的, 预定的, 腼腆的, 不露感情的, 含蓄的, 缄默的, 冷淡的\\n[法] 用作储备的, 保留的, 预定的",["Japanese people are generally very reserved.","Number 26 is already reserved, sorry."],["日本人普遍很内敛。","26号已经有预约了。很抱歉。"]],["partition","pɑ:'tiʃәn","n. 分割, 隔离物, 隔墙, 财产分割\\nvt. 区分, 瓜分, 隔开, 分割\\n[计] 分区; 划分",["There were Jews in Arab countries before the partition of Palestine.","To install Linux, you must format a primary partition in a compatible format, such as EXT2 or EXT4."],["",""]],["recurring","","[计] 循环的\\n[医] 复发的, 再发的",["We must prevent this type of incident from recurring.","A business cycle is a recurring succession of periods of prosperity and periods of depression."],["",""]],["uniformed","'ju:nifɔ:md","a. 使成一样, 使一律化, 使一致",["There were three uniformed police officers at the crime scene."],["犯罪现场有三名穿制服的警察。"]],["communion","kә'mju:njәn","n. 共享, 交流, 恳谈, 宗教教派",["The First Communion is an important ceremony in the Catholic Church.","The parson gave the communion wafer to the dying person."],["",""]],["deterrent","di'tә:rәnt","a. 制止的, 威慑的, 遏制的\\nn. 威慑力量(或因素), 制止物",["The law's harsh sentence is a deterrent against drinking and driving.","Judge Salvador was of the school that thought stiff sentences were a deterrent."],["",""]],["swelling","'sweliŋ","n. 肿胀, 肿大, 隆起部, 身上的肿胀处, 膨胀, 增大\\na. 肿大的, 突起的",["Apply some ice to the injured area to reduce swelling.","The experts say swelling cities are adding to the pressure by weighing down the deltas and sucking up groundwater."],["",""]],["squarely","'skwєәli","adv. 干脆地, 正好, 直角地",["That does not mean we should ignore sources of tension. Indeed, it suggests the opposite: we must face these tensions squarely.","A book fell from the shelf and landed squarely on its face."],["",""]],["storyteller","'stɒ:ritelә","n. 说故事的人, 故事作者",["In the shadow of the Leaning Tower of Pisa sits the town storyteller, eating a bowl of pea soup. After that he tells some children the fairy tale \"The Princess and the Pea\".","Each single-author book is immensely particular, a story told as only one storyteller could recount it."],["在比萨斜塔的塔阴下，坐着这城市的童话讲述家，他正在吃一碟豌豆汤。 之后他将给小孩子们讲述童话“豌豆上的公主”。",""]],["timeless","'taimlis","a. 无时间限制的, 不受时间影响的, 永恒的",["Jamin's perfectly symmetrical features give her an ethereal and timeless beauty.","Black and white photography captures timeless moments."],["",""]],["occupied","","a. 已占用的；使用中的；无空闲的",["When the sign on the door of a rest room says OCCUPIED, it means someone is using it.","Even now, many years after the Cold War, there is still much rancor between the Russians and the Germans, especially in areas once occupied by the Soviet Union."],["廁所門上的標示顯示「使用中」的時候，代表有人正在使用。","雖然冷戰已經過了這麼多年，俄羅斯人和德國人之間的仇恨還是沒有消除，在蘇聯曾經侵佔過的地區，這種仇恨就更深了。"]],["pioneering","","a. 首创的；先驱的",["He did pioneering work in the field of physical geography.","On their journey, the pioneering team of electric motorcycle riders hope to meet the wealthy owner of a major battery manufacturing plant in Las Vegas."],["他在自然地理科學界取得了突破性的成果。",""]],["demolish","di'mɒliʃ","vt. 毁坏, 破坏, 粉碎",["They will demolish the building and replace it with a park.","Zionist extremists want to demolish the al-Aqsa Mosque."],["",""]],["berth","bә:θ","n. 船岸之间的水区, 锚地, 卧铺\\nvi. 停泊\\nvt. 使停泊",["The dogs on the housing estate all give Mary's cat a wide berth.","All the dogs on the housing estate give Mary's cat a wide berth."],["",""]],["abs","","[计] 绝对, 美国标准局",["Tom took a picture of himself flexing his abs in front of the mirror.","\"Washboard abs\" sounds better than \"clearly-defined rectus abdominis muscles\"."],["",""]],["radiant","'reidiәnt","a. 发光的, 明亮的, 辐射的, 容光焕发的\\n[医] 放射的, 辐射的, 辐射物[质]",["The Doppler effect is also observed with light and with radiant energy in general.","The sun rose from the water in radiant brilliance and his rosy beams seemed to cast a glow of life into the prince's cheeks."],["",""]],["orbital","'ɒ:bitәl","a. 轨道的, 眼眶的\\n[化] 轨道",["One of the moons, Naiad has a tilted orbital plane and circles Neptune in a zig zag, up and down pattern.","A sauroid soldier in powered armor guarded the entrance to the orbital colony."],["",""]],["backbone","'bækbәun","n. 脊椎, 志气, 骨干, 支柱\\n[计] 主干网, 主干网点",["The Nigerian government has a strong Muslim backbone.","Kelp is the backbone of Monterey Bay coastal ecology."],["",""]],["nope","nәup","adv. 不, 不是",["So I'm telling Caroline: \"Gooseberry jam is better than raspberry.\" But she's just like \"Nope.\"","\"Tom, it's said you've lost your hearing aid.\" \"Nope! I don't like Mexican food.\""],["",""]],["marrow","'mærәu","n. 髓, 骨髓, 精华, 活力, 配偶\\n[医] 髓(尤指骨髓)",["My pup took a marrow-bone and sat mousy-quiet in a corner.","She needs a bone marrow transplant, but she has not found a donor yet."],["",""]],["furiously","","adv. 狂暴地；猛烈地",["Colorless green ideas sleep furiously.","\"Something is rotten in my Danish beard,\" said Tom, itching his mutton chops furiously."],["無色的綠色意念憤怒地沉睡著。",""]],["transnational","træns'næʃәnl","a. 超越国界的, 跨国的\\n[法] 超越国界的, 超国家的, 跨国的",["If a transnational corporation had invented Esperanto, it would be English.","Mary studies psychosociology and is currently researching the development of the European transnational blogosphere."],["",""]],["greasy","'gri:zi","a. 油腻的, 含脂肪多的",["I bought a handmade dried persimmon in Hsinchu. It tastes sweet but not greasy.","Consisting of bacon and cheese, the sandwich was quite greasy."],["我在新竹買了一塊手工柿餅，味道甜而不膩。",""]],["iris","'airis","n. 虹膜, 鸢尾属植物, 虹, 虹彩\\n[化] 可变光阑",["Iris, what do you usually eat for breakfast?","The iris deeply associated with the Boys' Festival does not have a beautiful flower."],["Iris，你一般早饭都吃什么？",""]],["checkpoint","'tʃekpɒint","n. 检查站\\n[计] 检查点",["There's a checkpoint at the border where they look in your trunk.","The coalition force fired at her car at the checkpoint in Baghdad."],["",""]],["platinum","'plætinәm","n. 白金, 铂, 银灰色\\n[化] 铂Pt",["This building is LEED Platinum certified.","Mademoiselle, would you like a platinum necklace to accompany your ring?"],["該建築已獲 LEED 白金認證。","小姐已经有一个戒指，要不要配一条铂金项链？"]],["stitch","stitʃ","n. 一针, 疼痛, 针法, 碎布条, 针脚\\nv. 缝, 缝合, 装订",["You'll learn in time that a stitch in time saves nine.","She thought cross stitch was a good substitute for oil paintings."],["",""]],["supernova",".sju:pә'nәuvә","n. 超新星",["When a massive star dies, it runs out of fuel, collapses under its own weight and explodes as a supernova.","The supernova shone so brightly that it cast a shadow on Earth."],["",""]],["bonding","'bɔndiŋ","n. 结合, 屏蔽接地, 搭接\\n[计] 压焊",["The camping trip was a wonderful bonding experience for the whole family.","The road trip across the country with his family was a bonding experience for William."],["",""]],["loaded","'lәudid","a. 有负载的, 有含蓄的, 加重的, 不公正的, 偏袒的, 喝醉了的, 富有的\\n[计] 有负载的",["The old man loaded his mule with bags full of sand.","We loaded a lot of luggage into the car."],["老人在骡子的背上放上了一个个装满了沙的袋子。","我們往車裡装了很多行李。"]],["postseason","pəʊst'si:zn","n. 赛季后",["The team advanced to the postseason tournament."],["球隊晉級季後賽。"]],["denote","di'nәut","vt. 指示, 表示",["One of the functions of the genitive case in Russian is to denote possession.","The tilde is used in math to denote equivalence."],["",""]],["devoid","di'vɒid","a. 全无的, 缺乏的",["The world which I saw in my dream was a peaceful world devoid of war.","I admit that if it weren't for him, the next ten years of my life would have been empty and devoid of purpose."],["我夢見的是一個沒有戰爭的、和平的世界。","我承认，没有他，我未来十年的生活将会是空虚的、没有目标的。"]],["authorization",".ɒ:θәrai'zeiʃәn","n. 授权, 许可\\n[经] 授权, 许可, 批准",["I went to the military camp with Kordobas's authorization.","In one month, you'll have to give me your guardian's authorization, otherwise, we'll not keep you."],["",""]],["immoral","i'mɒrәl","a. 不道德的, 邪恶的, 放荡的\\n[法] 不道德的, 道德败坏的, 邪恶的",["It's not immoral for a novelist to tell lies. In fact, the bigger the lies, the better lies, and the more the common folks and critics will praise you.","According to Islamic principles, homosexuality is an immoral thing."],["小說家說謊並不是不道德的事。其實，謊話說得愈離譜、愈有技巧，就愈會受到公眾和批評家的表揚。",""]],["receptor","ri'septә","n. 受体, 感觉器官\\n[化] 接受器; 受体",["The antibodies, however, block the receptor on the T cells that HIV uses to enter and destroy them."],[""]],["assorted","ә'sɒ:tid","a. 各种各样的, 分类的",["The oddly assorted creatures, some humanoid in form, some frighteningly animalistic, formed a rough guard about Rocky and Bud.","The butcher shop sells assorted cuts of meat."],["",""]],["armchair",".ɑ:m'tʃєә","n. 扶手椅",["We bought a comfortable new armchair.","Also, \"armchair shopping\" gets rid of the frustrations of crowds and traffic."],["我們買了張舒適的扶手椅。",""]],["nafta","'næftə","abbr. 北美自由贸易协定（North American Free Trade Agreement）",["But if intellectual property is to be addressed within NAFTA, it is critical that user rights are balanced alongside the extensive protections already granted to rights holders."],[""]],["stiffen","'stifn","vt. 使变硬, 使僵硬, 使顽强, 使严厉\\nvi. 变粘, 变硬, 变强烈",["She felt him stiffen in surprise when he heard the news.","Dad used spray starch to stiffen his dress shirts."],["",""]],["voltage","'vәultidʒ","n. 电压, 伏特数\\n[化] 电压",["For this test, I bought a voltage tester.","The resistance of varistors changes with the voltage applied to them."],["為了這次的測試，我特地買了電壓測試儀。",""]],["grieve","gri:v","vt. 使悲伤\\nvi. 悲痛, 伤心",["I never said a word to Mary, for I knew it would grieve her.","Dominic Grieve has tabled a motion for a second referendum."],["",""]],["receptive","ri'septiv","a. 能接纳的\\n[医] 接受的, 感受的",["The Japanese are highly receptive to new ideas.","Tom wasn't real receptive to the plan."],["",""]],["seminary","'seminәri","n. 神学院, 发源地",["Sami graduated from the seminary, the top of his class.","The Jewish Theological Seminary in New York City ordains Conservative rabbis."],["",""]],["populist","'pɔpjulist","n. 民粹派的成员",["Algerians are tired of the populist tone of the Islamists.","The columnist used Trumpenproletariat as a mocking label for a certain populist political base."],["",""]],["heading","'hediŋ","n. 标题, 起始字, 方向\\n[计] 上标题",["We're heading back. We'll make sure to take care of what you asked us to do.","Most of the traffic coming into this seaside town is heading for the beachside holiday camp."],["我们要回去啦，你托我们的事情一定留心着。","進入這座海濱小鎮的車輛大多是前往海邊度假營地的。"]],["bathtub","'bɑ:θtʌb","n. 浴缸",["The bathtub was filled with hot water and flower petals.","Just as I was about to get into the bathtub, Tom dropped by for a visit."],["浴缸裡滿是熱水和花瓣。","正當我準備進浴缸的時候，湯姆來拜訪我。"]],["darkened","'da:kənd","v. 变暗, 转黑",["At the end of April, the water of the Yellow River had darkened.","Suddenly, the clouds darkened the sky."],["四月底，黄河的水发黑了。","天空突然變得烏雲密佈。"]],["harness","'hɑ:nis","n. 马具, 挽具状带子, 甲胄\\nvt. 给...上挽具, 驾驭, 披上甲胄, 利用...以产生动力",["There's new energy to harness, new jobs to be created, new schools to build, and threats to meet, alliances to repair.","The bits of costume and harness that Flaubert mentions have vanished, but the reasons he calls them out are eternal."],["我们需要开发新的能源、创造新的工作岗位，我们需要修建新学校，应对众多威胁、修复与许多国家的盟友关系。",""]],["leftover","'leftәuvә","n. 剩货, 残留物, 剩饭\\na. 残余的",["With this you can make a clean sweep of leftover breakfast smells and such to make the air clean.","Tom didn't know what to do with the leftover food."],["",""]],["coercion","kәu'ә:ʃәn","n. 强迫, 威压, 高压统治\\n[法] 强迫, 强制, 高压统治",["If you don't listen to us, we will have to resort to coercion.","Leadership by coercion would not produce the results we see."],["",""]],["fatality","fә'tæliti","n. 不幸, 厄运, 致命性, 死亡者, 厄运, 天命",["Widespread testing is being credited for helping Germany to keep its coronavirus case fatality rate at a low 0.9 percent.","In Japan, officials say an 80-year woman who died in a hospital on the outskirts of Tokyo has become the nation's first coronavirus fatality."],["",""]],["drizzle","'drizl","n. 细雨\\nv. 下毛毛雨",["A quarrel between husband and wife is like a spring day's drizzle.","There was a slight drizzle and occasional lightning that night."],["",""]],["walkway","'wɒ:kwei","n. 走道, 人行道",["He went slowly and deliberately to his car, being careful not to step on the cracks in the cement walkway."],[""]],["dissipate","'disipeit","vt. 散失, 驱散, 浪费\\nvi. 消散, 放荡",["On Earth, the forces of gravity and friction dissipate the kinetic energy of a moving body, causing it to stop.","Let's not dissipate our efforts on pointless and time-wasting schemes."],["",""]],["publicize","'pʌblisaiz","vt. 宣传",["You don't have to publicize your whole life on Facebook.","My job is to publicize the decisions made during the meeting."],["",""]],["incompetent","in'kɒmpitәnt","a. 无能力的, 无资格的, 机能不全的, 不胜任的\\nn. 无能力者",["The world is full of incompetent doctors.","Tom told Mary that he didn't think John was incompetent."],["社会上满是不称职的医生。",""]],["chaplain","'tʃæplin","n. 牧师",["The chaplain listened sympathetically to his parishioner.","He's a Muslim chaplain in the US Army."],["",""]],["subordinate","sә'bɒ:dnit","n. 属下, 附属物\\na. 下级的, 次要的, 附属的\\nvt. 使居下位, 使服从",["Algeria is independent and it's not subordinate to any country in the world.","A conjunction is a word that connects a subordinate clause to a main clause."],["",""]],["visibly","'vizәbli","adv. 看得见地, 明显地, 明白地",["The more visibly Jewish someone is, the more likely they are to experience poverty and violence.","Chancing upon an unusually beautiful woman one table away, Julian began to visibly shake."],["",""]],["semifinal",".semi'fainl","n. 半决赛",["Tennis player Andrey Rublev was disqualified in the semifinal of Dubai for insulting a linesperson to their face.","The first semifinal was boring, but the second one blew me away."],["",""]],["pediatrician",",pi:diә'triʃәn","n. 儿科医生, 儿科专家\\n[医] 儿科医师, 儿科学家",["He's a pediatrician with an upcoming private practice.","Dr. Adelfo was a great doctor (pediatrician) whom we considered a dear brother."],["",""]],["uninsured","'ʌnin'ʃuәd","a. 未保过险的\\n[法] 未保险的, 未经保险的",["Tom told me that he thought that Mary was uninsured.","Tom told me that he thought Mary was uninsured."],["",""]],["finale","fi'nɑ:li","n. 结局, 最后乐章, 终曲",["The finale was so good, that I rewatched it many times.","I wanna be at home at four o'clock for the series finale."],["",""]],["mahogany","mә'hɑ:gәni","n. 桃花心木, 红褐色\\n[机] 桃花心木",["On the mahogany desk, there is a metal cup and a blue coaster.","I bought the mahogany table because it was the most elegant."],["紅木書桌上有一個金屬杯子和一個藍色杯墊。",""]],["bulge","bʌldʒ","n. 胀, 膨胀\\nvi. 凸出\\nvt. 使膨胀",["I've been on a diet for four months, but my midriff bulge hasn't budged.","Jupiter's rapid rotation causes the planet to flatten at the poles and bulge at the equator."],["",""]],["oxide","'ɒksaid","n. 氧化物\\n[医] 氧化物",["What made the comedian's audience laugh so uncontrollably that night was a convenient nitrous oxide leak.","Nitrous oxide stopped being used as an anaesthetic a long time ago."],["",""]],["reimbursement",".ri:im'bә:smәnt","n. 付还, 退还\\n[经] 偿付, 赔还",["I was excited by the promise of reimbursement from my purchase.","Students say the policy on reimbursement for room and board is still unclear."],["",""]],["ensuing","","a. 接著发生的",["One of my Japanese teachers said \"honya honya\" instead of \"blah blah.\" My ensuing laughter nearly gave me a hernia.","This sentence was born from indecisiveness and ensuing boredom."],["",""]],["diocese","'daiәsis","n. 主教教区",["The abusive priest was moved to a different diocese.","In the Late Roman Empire, a new grouping of provinces called a diocese was introduced."],["",""]],["pessimistic",".pesi'mistik","a. 悲观的, 厌世的, 悲观主义的",["The optimist looks into a mirror and becomes more optimistic, the pessimist more pessimistic.","The conclusion I have reached is, unfortunately, a pessimistic one."],["",""]],["quarry","'kwɒri","n. 采石场, 方形石, 猎物, 被追求物, 来源\\nvt. 挖出, 努力挖掘\\nvi. 费力地找",["There was a swimming hole in the abandoned quarry where marble had been found years ago.","They're going to need to quarry a lot of limestone in order to build the new church."],["",""]],["dane","dein","n. 丹麦人",["The Great Dane is a breed of domestic dog known for its giant size.","The fables written by Hans Christian Andersen, the most famous Dane in the world, made him an icon of world literature."],["",""]],["savior","'seivjә","n. 救助者, 救世主, 救星",["There has never been a savior nor an immortal emperor to rely on.","Jessica immediately introduced Mark as her savior."],["从来就没有什么救世主， 也不靠神仙皇帝！",""]],["bidding","'bidiŋ","n. 命令, 邀请, 出价\\n[经] 投标, 招标",["A lot of people ask me whether bidding goodbye to youth means old age is near.","The host city of the Olympic Games is chosen through a bidding process by the International Olympic Committee."],["很多人问我，青春的诀别是否意味着年迈的将近。",""]],["wallpaper","'wɒ:lpeipә","n. 壁纸, 墙纸\\nv. 贴墙纸\\n[计] 壁纸",["I used a photo of my dog for my desktop wallpaper.","Left to explore on her own, Coraline is delighted to discover a tiny secret door hidden by wallpaper."],["",""]],["obscene","ɒb'si:n","a. 淫秽的, 猥亵的, 讨人厌的, 可憎的\\n[法] 猥亵的, 海洋的, 污秽的",["One must be respectful when speaking, and not say obscene things.","His obscene remarks will be expunged from the record."],["开口要有礼貌，不讲下流话。",""]],["scarcity","'skɑ:siti","n. 缺乏, 不足, 缺少\\n[经] 缺乏, 不足",["Gorelick said that the outcomes of his work in Jordan may be used to evaluate water scarcity in other Middle Eastern countries, such as Syria.","A \"Post-scarcity Economy\" requires higher intelligence from its populace."],["戈雷利克表示，他在約旦的研究成果可用於評估敘利亞等其他中東國家的水資源短缺。",""]],["locale","lәu'kɑ:l","n. 现场, 场所\\n[计] 场所",["Typically, a space station serviced a locale at least several light-years radially."],[""]],["cynicism","'sinisizm","n. 犬儒主义",["The power of accurate observation is commonly called cynicism by those who have not got it.","The wording of the refusal was striking in its cynicism."],["",""]],["combustion","kәm'bʌstʃәn","n. 燃烧, 骚动\\n[化] 燃烧",["Pollutants like this derive mainly from the combustion of fuel in car engines.","Carbon monoxide is a poisonous substance formed by the incomplete combustion of carbon compounds."],["",""]],["grandma","'grændmɑ:","n. 奶奶, 外婆",["Sometimes, Grandma is more dangerous than the KGB.","Grandma Ling died with unfinished business. It is said that to this day no one has dared to live in that house."],["有时候外婆比克格勃还危险。","玲奶奶死的不瞑目。流传说那栋房子至今未人敢入住。"]],["invader","in'veidә","n. 侵略者\\n[化] 侵入物",["Food allergy sufferers can experience fatigue and brain fog as the immune system attacks a nonexistent invader.","The invader keeps blaming the victim for the invasion."],["",""]],["ventilation",".venti'leiʃәn","n. 通风, 空气流通, 公开讨论\\n[医] 通风, 换气",["The ventilation here is really bad.","Maintain good ventilation while cooking to minimize greasy residue."],["這裡的通風很差呢。",""]],["turbulent","'tә:bjulәnt","a. 狂暴的, 骚乱的, 紊乱的",["The turbulent sands above our heads, the flinging of our swords... they're naught but falling stars in the night sky.","The resulting ethnocultural divide has persisted and has led to turbulent politics."],["在我們頭頂飛舞著的沙粒，在我們手中揮動著的刀劍……它們不是甚麼，只不過是在夜空中擦過的一朵朵流星。",""]],["holistic","hәj'listik","[计] 完整的, 整体的\\n[医] 机能整体性的",["It is a stunning exhibition on wellness and holistic healing from awe-inspiring India.","The medical team takes a holistic approach when treating patients."],["",""]],["inviting","in'vaitiŋ","a. 引人动心的, 有魅力的\\n[法] 诱惑人的, 动人心的",["I am grateful to you for inviting me to the party.","I'm grateful to you for inviting me to the party."],["謝謝你邀我參加派對。","謝謝你邀我參加派對。"]],["manure","mә'njuә","n. 肥料, 粪肥\\nvt. 施肥于",["Knowledge is like manure, it's only good when spread.","His clothes were impregnated with the stench of manure."],["",""]],["tenet","'tenit","n. 信条, 教义, 宗旨, 原则",["It is necessary for every person who stands for progress to criticise every tenet of old beliefs.","The oneness of God is the most central tenet in Islam."],["",""]],["straddle","'strædl","n. 跨坐, 观望\\nv. 跨坐, 两腿叉开坐, 观望",["Mr. Straddle called me aside."],[""]],["norwegian","nɒ:'wi:dʒәn","n. 挪威人, 挪威语\\na. 挪威的, 挪威人的, 挪威语的",["The Norwegian diplomat mediated the secret negotiations that produced the historic document.","Norwegian, Swedish and Danish are mutually intelligible to a high degree."],["",""]],["longitudinal",".lɒndʒi'tju:dinәl","a. 经度的, 经线的, 纵的\\n[医] 纵的",["A longitudinal wave is one that vibrates in the direction of propagation.","Sound propagates via longitudinal waves."],["",""]],["affirmation",".æfә'meiʃәn","n. 肯定, 断言, 证实\\n[医] 肯定, 确认",["This sort of structure is called a double negative, but in effect it shows affirmation.","Every sentence I utter must be understood not as an affirmation, but as a question."],["",""]],["ethnographic","ˌeθnə'ɡræfɪk","a. 人种志的",["Students conducted ethnographic research in the village."],["學生在村莊進行民族誌研究。"]],["luncheon","'lʌntʃәn","n. 午宴, 午餐会",["I'm afraid I won't be able to make it for our luncheon appointment.","Jones says this annual luncheon offers a chance to relax after months of promoting the movie."],["",""]],["aggravate","'ægrәveit","vt. 使恶化, 使更严重, 加重",["The taunts at the end of the match failed to aggravate Tom.","The constant ticking of the clock was starting to seriously aggravate him at night."],["",""]],["insanity","in'sæniti","n. 疯狂, 愚顽, 精神错乱\\n[医] 精神病",["Insanity means doing the same thing over and over again and expecting different results.","Never flee from injustice, intolerance, or insanity. Reason must prevail."],["",""]],["cornerstone","'kɔ:nәstәjn","n. 奠基石, 基础",["Make solidarity and equal rights the cornerstone of public policy.","It also forms a vital cornerstone of the strategy for sustainable development."],["",""]],["called","","a. 被呼叫的",["While getting off the bus, she heard her name called.","The track meet was called off on account of the heavy rain."],["她一下車，就聽到有人叫她的名字。","田徑運動會因天雨關係取消了。"]],["exaggerated","ig'zædʒәreitid","a. 夸大的, 夸张的, 言过其实的",["The fisherman exaggerated the size of the fish he had caught.","You may depend upon it that the story is exaggerated."],["",""]],["rustic","'rʌstik","n. 乡下人, 乡巴佬\\na. 乡村的, 纯朴的, 手工粗糙的",["The rock gardens, waterfalls, gazebos, amphitheater and rustic cement bridges have survived virtually intact.","They live in a little, rustic house out in the woods."],["",""]],["seductive","si'dʌktiv","a. 诱惑的, 引人注意的, 有魅力的",["A brilliant, seductive chef turns to espionage in Napoleon-era France.","That's a very seductive idea but you should be careful."],["拿破崙時代的法國，魅力誘人的天才廚師搖身一變成為間諜。",""]],["mantle","'mæntl","n. 斗篷, 罩子, 披风\\nvt. 罩住, 覆盖\\nvi. 覆盖, 脸红",["Astronomers think that Mercury lost most of its mantle after a collision with another planet.","Scientists believe that Ceres has a rocky core and an icy mantle."],["",""]],["rigor","'rigә","n. 严格, 严厉, 苛刻, 严酷, 严密, 精确\\n[医] 寒战, 强直, 僵硬",["We learn to die with a constant rigor throughout a lifetime.","When translating, one must have all the rigor and no respect for the original."],["",""]],["flux","flʌks","n. 流出, 涨潮, 变迁\\nvi. 熔化, 流出\\nvt. 使熔融\\n[计] 助焊剂",["The Angara-V pulsed power facility used polystyrene to homogenize x-ray flux.","Economic conditions are in a state of flux."],["",""]],["query","'kwiәri","n. 疑问, 疑问号, 质问, 查询\\nv. 询问, 质问\\n[计] 查询",["In the opening paragraphs I query the validity of so-called supply-side economic strategies.","Please type your query in the search box and press enter."],["",""]],["gloomy","'glu:mi","a. 抑沉的, 忧闷的, 黑暗的, 悲观的",["Sunshine is a warm burst of joy after a gloomy, rainy week.","The smoggy air of Beijing makes me feel gloomy."],["陰雨連綿的一週後，陽光讓人感到一陣溫暖喜悅。","北京的雾霾天气让我心情不太好。"]],["disposable","dis'pәuzәbl","a. 可任意处理的\\n[法] 可任意处理或处置的, 可自由使用的",["In this society where everything is disposable, it is a virtue to use something until it wears out.","Disposable income is what counts for the level of personal consumption."],["在這個社會裡一切都是用完即丟, 用東西直到它磨損是一種美德。",""]],["sling","sliŋ","n. 投石器, 抛掷, 吊索, 吊钩\\nvt. 用投石器投掷, 用吊钩吊上, 吊起",["A sling psychrometer is used to measure relative humidity.","It'll be difficult to do that with your arm in a sling."],["",""]],["proprietary","prә'praiәtәri","a. 所有者的, 所有权的, 私有的\\nn. 所有者, 业主, 所有权",["The only functional drivers for this hardware are proprietary.","The only drivers for this hardware are proprietary."],["",""]],["warhead","'wɒ:hed","n. 弹头",["The scientist participated in developing high-voltage switches, a key component crucial for setting off explosions needed to trigger nuclear warhead."],[""]],["para","'pɑ:rә","[经] 帕拉",["I hope you will join us in the parade and march along the street."],[""]],["troublesome","'trʌblsәm","a. 麻烦的, 令人讨厌的",["It is the first step which is troublesome.","We have to somehow come through this troublesome situation."],["第一步是最麻煩的。",""]],["kinda","'kaindә","adv. 有几分；有一点",["Going out with those clothes? They look kinda bad.","Listening to the personal analysis about global economy made by people who watch only CCAV has always been kinda funny."],["你要穿那種衣服出門？不太好看耶。","听那些只看CCAV的老百姓进行全球经济的个人分析一直是很有趣的。"]],["wreath","ri:θ","n. 花圈, 花环, 圈状物\\n[医] 花冠, 花冠体(细胞核分裂的一时期)",["The girl in the picture has a flower wreath on her head, and not a golden crown.","We hung a Christmas wreath on the front door."],["畫中的女孩頭上戴著的是花冠，不是金皇冠。","我們在前門上掛了一個聖誕花圈。"]],["torn","tɒ:n","tear的过去分词",["Nobody's going to shed any tears if that old building gets torn down.","He's taken off his mask, torn off his costume. There's no doubt now about what the far-right candidate intends."],["没有人会为这个旧建筑物的拆除而落泪。","他摘下了面具，卸下了偽裝。極右翼候選人的意圖已昭然若揭。"]],["annoy","ә'nɒi","vt. 使恼怒, 骚扰",["He made mistakes on purpose to annoy me.","I've come to the unfortunate conclusion that musicals simply annoy the crap out of me."],["他为了惹恼我故意犯错。",""]],["amidst","ә'midst","prep. 在...当中",["One should not be scared of poverty, and instead, be determined amidst it.","If you walk amidst an aspen forest on a clear day, you will be treated to a fantastic light display."],["人不要怕穷，要穷中立志.",""]],["managerial",".mænә'dʒiәriәl","a. 管理的\\n[经] 管理上的, 经营上的",["My classmate, Xiao Ming, has strong managerial capability.","Liza was uncommonly good at remembering customers' orders, which, sadly, kept her out of any managerial positions."],["小明同学管理能力很强。",""]],["discrete","dis'kri:t","a. 不连续的, 离散的\\n[计] 离散的",["Every march is composed of discrete steps.","Let's try to be discrete about this."],["",""]],["geometric",".dʒiәu'metrik","a. 几何学的, 几何学上的, 几何学图形的",["By architectural symmetry, Emmet means geometric symmetry combined with aesthetic uniformity.","Any geometric programming problem can be transformed into a convex one."],["",""]],["wooded","'wudid","a. 树木繁茂的",["The day being fine, I felt amply repaid for my walk through the extensive and finely-wooded grounds, numerously stocked with deer.","We were assigned to a densely wooded area and we had to carry out a search of that area almost every week."],["",""]],["condemnation","kɒndem'neiʃәn","n. 非难, 宣告有罪, 非难的理由",["His remarks added up to a condemnation of my plan.","Crimes of war and crimes against humanity demand global condemnation."],["",""]],["nighttime","","n. 夜间",["At nighttime, buy some vegetables, watch TV, and have a drink.","Nighttime is my favourite time of day."],["一到晚上，买几样蔬菜，看看电视，喝喝酒。","夜晚是我一天中最喜欢的时候。"]],["scribble","'skribl","n. 潦草的写法, 潦草写成的东西, 拙劣的作品\\nv. 潦草地书写, 乱写, 滥写",["I remember that I used to scribble things on my eraser during class.","Rip your scribble into a thousand shreds!"],["",""]],["scorer","'skɒ:rә","n. 记录员, 刻痕者",["Messi can't keep pace with the League's top goal scorer.","None of us knew why the top scorer had been left out of the team."],["",""]],["enclosure","in'klәuʒә","n. 附件, 围墙, 围绕\\n[化] 机壳; 外壳",["The point about enclosure is that the configuration of ethnic groups must be clearly described.","There are many kinds of animals inside this enclosure."],["",""]],["molest","mә'lest","vt. 妨碍, 干扰, 调戏\\n[法] 调戏, 作弄, 恶意干涉",["Tom attempted to molest the eight-year-old child.","The bee makes honey, which the drone devours. The wasp and the hornet molest with a sting: and especially cattle, so do the gadfly (breeze), the fly and the gnat."],["",""]],["contaminant","kәn'tæminәnt","n. 污染物, 沾染物\\n[计] 污染物",["It's possible that the drinking water has chlorine, lead, or similar contaminants in it."],[""]],["gothic","'gɒθik","n. 哥特风格\\na. 哥特式的, 野蛮的",["This house is a fabulous example of Victorian Gothic architecture.","Many Gothic cathedrals, such as the Notre Dame Cathedral in Paris, have flying buttresses."],["",""]],["umpire","'ʌmpaiә","n. 裁判员, 仲裁人\\nvt. 对...进行仲裁, 当...的裁判\\nvi. 当裁判",["The umpire was partial to the team from his country.","The umpire sits in a high chair at the side of the court."],["",""]],["imprisonment","im'priznmәnt","n. 监禁, 下狱, 坐牢\\n[法] 监禁, 徒刑, 拘禁",["The judge sentenced him to one year's imprisonment.","Such an offence is punished by a fine and/or imprisonment."],["法官判了他一年有期徒刑。",""]],["flop","flɒp","n. 砰然落下, 拍击声, 失败\\nvi. 笨重地摔, 猛落\\nvt. 笨拙地抛下\\nadv. 噗通",["Don't flip-flop the addresses of the sender and recipient!","If you don't do anything about it, the party will be a flop."],["不要把寄件人、收件人地址的姓名填反了！",""]],["revel","'revl","n. 作乐, 狂欢\\nvi. 狂欢作乐, 陶醉, 着迷\\nvt. 耗费",["I am too sick at heart to revel, carouse, and make merry through the night.","As long as the Forest stands it will be a home, a refuge and a playground to these sweet immortals, who revel undisturbed in its depths."],["",""]],["indicative","in'dikәtiv","a. 指示的, 象征的, 表示...的\\n[经] 指标的",["A high forehead is indicative of great mental power.","In the second-person singular, the perfect active indicative of \"laudare\" is \"laudavisti\"."],["",""]],["tidy","'taidi","n. 椅子的背罩, 装杂物的容器\\na. 整齐的, 有条理的\\nvt. 弄整齐, 收拾, 整理\\nvi. 整理, 收拾",["We will tidy up our room so that Mom is satisfied.","Tom and Mary aren't as tidy as they used to be."],["我们将要整理房间，这样妈妈就会满意了。","湯姆和瑪麗不像以前那樣整潔了。"]],["blackness","'blæknis","n. 黑, 黑色, 邪恶\\n[化] 黑度",["Frankie blamed his own blackness for his school problems. His real issue was that so did his teachers.","Tom stared into the impenetrable blackness of the night sky."],["",""]],["dysfunctional","dɪsˈfʌŋkʃənl","a. 功能失调的",["It took Tom years to work through all the issues caused by his growing up in a dysfunctional family.","All families are, to a greater or lesser extent, dysfunctional."],["",""]],["typewriter","'taip.raitә","n. 打字机",["At the age of six he had learned to use the typewriter and told the teacher that he did not need to learn to write by hand.","Something is wrong with my typewriter."],["他六歲的時候學會了用打字機，便和老師說他不用學執筆寫字了。","我的打字机故障了。"]],["lagoon","lә'^u:n","n. 环礁湖, 近海岸的浅水区, 泻湖, 咸水湖",["We found a beautiful, blue lagoon on the far side of the island.","To swim to the other island, Sami had to cross a shark-infested lagoon."],["",""]],["ambivalence","æm'bivәlәns","n. 矛盾情绪\\n[医] 矛盾情绪(两种情感互相冲突)",["Spenser's sarcastic and joking remarks are often misinterpreted as signs of ambivalence and often taken too seriously."],[""]],["impaired","im'pεәd","a. 受损的",["It was proposed that the term \"blind person\" be replaced with the term \"visually impaired person\".","Your insight is poor and your judgment is impaired."],["",""]],["blizzard","'blizәd","n. 大风雪, 暴风雪",["During the blizzard, I have to ride my bicycle back to the apartment.","We found it very hard going back to our base camp in the blizzard."],["暴风雪的时候，我要骑自行车回公寓。","暴风雪使得我们难以返回营地。"]],["unavailable",".ʌnә'veilәbl","a. 得不到的, 不能利用的, 无用的\\n[化] 不可得的; 无效的; 不能利用的",["We're sorry. The number you have dialed is currently unavailable.","Sorry. The number you have dialled is currently unavailable."],["对不起，您拨打的用户暂时无法接通。","对不起，您拨打的用户暂时无法接通。"]],["humorous","'hju:mәrәs","a. 富幽默感的, 滑稽的, 诙谐的",["\"She's not only beautiful but also humorous.\" \"Can she cook?\" \"Who cares?\"","A meme is a humorous image, video or words that spread rapidly on the internet."],["“她又有魅力又风趣！” “那她会做饭吗？” “谁在乎？”",""]],["insofar",".insәu'fɑ:","adv. 在...的范围",["His career is only important to him insofar as it helps him make money, and money is necessary for many other important and enjoyable things in life.","Insofar as possible, our examples will be drawn from English."],["他重視事業，不過是為了賺錢，有錢才能做重要的事，才能享受人生。",""]],["utilization",".ju:tilai'zeiʃәn","n. 利用\\n[医] 利用",["To improve profits, we need to increase the utilization of our factory.","They are thinking about the utilization of plastic bags in the country."],["",""]],["decor","'deikɔ:(r); (?@) dei'kɔ:r","n. 装饰, 布置",["Her eclectic taste was evident from the unusual decor of the room.","She decided to japan her old dresser to match the new decor in her room."],["",""]],["divisive","di'vaisiv","a. 区分的, 制造分裂的, 造成不和的",["Use of such divisive language tends to polarize the public.","Race remains a potent and often divisive force in our society."],["",""]],["worn","wɒ:n","a. 用旧的, 穿旧的\\nwear的过去分词",["There is a pair of worn red stockings in the drawer.","A sports bra should only be worn for working out, and not in any non-sports situations."],["抽屜裏有一雙穿過的紅色絲襪。","运动内衣最好只在运动时穿着，在其他非运动场合不穿。"]],["buyout","ˈbaɪaʊt","n. 全部买下; 买下（公司或产业）",["Auctions are annoying, so I bought it instantly with a buyout.","He never intended for the startup to become a large, successful company. From the start, he was only ever hoping for a buyout."],["",""]],["unmistakable","'ʌnmis'teikәbl","a. 不会弄错的, 不会被误解的, 不会搞错的, 明白无误的, 清楚明白的",["He bore an unmistakable reference to his father. It made his mother cry.","The chemistry between Layla and Sami was unmistakable."],["",""]],["beware","bi'wєә","v. 小心, 谨防",["Beware of anybody who claims objectivity.","You should beware of overconfidence."],["要小心那些说自己客观的人。","你要注意不要太自信。"]],["melon","'melәn","n. 瓜, 甜瓜, 红利, 赃物\\n[化] 三聚二氰亚胺",["All that time the things granddad had said, like the sound of flies flying round a melon, buzzed in my head.","Cut the melon into six equal pieces."],["一直以來爺爺曾經說過的事，像蒼蠅繞著瓜飛的聲音，在我的腦海裡嗡嗡地響著。","把瓜切成六等分。"]],["smoky","'smәuki","a. 冒烟的, 满是烟的, 熏脏的, 烟灰色的",["Let this smoky air out of the room and let some fresh air in.","Ziri saw a white smoky figure move down the dark trail."],["",""]],["sensational","sen'seiʃәnl","a. 使人感动的, 非常好的",["William found something sensational to get the reporter.","I never travel without my diary. One should always have something sensational to read in the train."],["",""]],["forgotten","fә'gɒtn","forget的过去分词",["Remember what should be remembered, forget what should be forgotten, change what can be changed, and accept what can't be changed.","Don't think I've forgotten you already, you've been on my mind, but I haven't been able to take the time to write to you."],["記住該記住的，忘記該忘記的。改變能改變的，接受不能改變的。","不要以为我已经忘了你，你在我的脑海中，但我抽不出时间给你写信。"]],["usefulness","'ju:sfjlnis","n. 有用, 有益\\n[经] 有用, 有用性",["Rodrigo started arguing with Rima over her lack of usefulness.","Friendship is sometimes just a synonym of usefulness."],["",""]],["wrath","rɒ:θ","n. 愤怒, 激怒, 愤怒的举动, (自然现象等)严酷",["All the king's subjects, fearing his wrath, often acted quite servile.","Because of fierce Juno's ever-remembering wrath, he was tossed about much by the power of the gods, both on land and the deep sea."],["",""]],["videotape","","n. 录相磁带\\nvt. 把电视节目录在录像磁带上",["I promise to return this videotape within a week.","I recorded a rugby game on videotape."],["我保證在一個星期內把這盤錄影帶還給你。",""]],["pertinent","'pә:tinәnt","a. 相关的, 中肯的, 切题的\\n[法] 恰当的, 有关的",["Computer technology is indispensable to access many pertinent items of data.","As for the theoretical side, Peterson's claim is pertinent to our discussion."],["",""]],["vineyard","'vinjәd","n. 葡萄园",["In the coming years, that vineyard will produce many grapes.","These days, many vineyard owners use a machine for harvesting, but when it comes to champagne, the harvest must be done by hand."],["",""]],["soundtrack","","n. 声迹, 声槽, 声带",["I like the soundtrack on this version better than on the last version.","Tom was the only artist at the event who actually sang rather than merely lip-synced to a pre-recorded soundtrack."],["",""]],["condominium",".kɒndә'miniәm","n. 共同统治\\n[经] 财产共有权",["The site of the condominium is enclosed with stakes.","This suite is three times larger than my condominium."],["",""]],["nontraditional",".nɔntrә'diʃәnәl","a. 不符合传统的, 非传统的",["She chose a nontraditional career path."],["她選擇了非傳統的職業道路。"]],["unanswered",".ʌn'ɑ:nsәd","a. 未答复的, 无反应的",["Fadil sent Layla letters but they were unanswered.","Tom sent Mary a lot of letters, but they went unanswered."],["",""]],["wiring","'waiәriŋ","n. 线路, 接线\\n[计] 布线",["This unexpected malfunctioning of the system was caused by improper wiring.","I built the kit taking care not to make mistakes in the wiring."],["",""]],["shimmering","'ʃɪmərɪŋ","v. 闪闪发光, 发微光( shimmer的现在分词 )",["Beyond lay the sea, shimmering and blue, and over it soared the gulls, their pinions flashing silvery in the sunlight.","The continent is shimmering in a blistering heat wave that is worrying farmers and power companies."],["",""]],["flinch","flintʃ","vi. 畏缩, 退缩, 畏首畏尾\\nn. 退缩, 弗林奇戏",["He is not such a man as to flinch from danger.","Stefan shot the monster, but it didn't flinch."],["",""]],["pulpit","'pulpit","n. 讲道坛",["Tom and Mary once jumped together from Pulpit Rock with a parachute. It was a short but magical experience.","Theodore Roosevelt coined the term \"bully pulpit\" to refer to the U.S. presidency as a place from which to advocate one's views."],["",""]],["presumption","pri'zʌmpʃәn","n. 专横, 放肆, 假定, 推测\\n[法] 假定, 推测, 设想",["The result of this experiment leads to our presumption that element T determines the entire structure.","I went to the party on the presumption that she would be there."],["",""]],["endow","in'dau","vt. 捐赠, 捐助, 赋予\\n[法] 赠送财产给, 分给寡妇一份遗产, 授与",["The lawmakers had put aside 40,000 acres of land the previous year, and planned to earn enough money from it to endow the university."],[""]],["downplay","'daunplei","vt. 不予重视",["If you try to downplay this, I'm going to walk away.","Laura may be a prodigy, but she is known to downplay her failures."],["",""]],["anyhow","'enihau","adv. 无论如何, 至少",["Do whatever you want, there will be gossiping anyhow.","Anyhow, it's the truth that on this snowy night a lone old woman was sitting on the side of the road."],["",""]],["vice","vais","n. 恶习, 恶行, 罪恶, 堕落, 缺陷, 恶癖, 老虎钳\\nvt. 钳住\\nprep. 代替",["They nominated Calvin Coolidge for vice president.","To change the units from metric to imperial and vice versa, the 'menu' button must be clicked."],["他们提名卡尔文•柯立芝为副总统。","要把公制單位換算成英制或反過來操作，鬚點擊“菜單”按鈕。"]],["bullshit","'bulʃit","n. 胡说",["Oh, he was just talking about how children are the builders of tomorrow or some other bullshit.","Apocryphal stories are the most fun variety of bullshit."],["",""]],["acknowledgment","әk'nɔlidʒmәnt","n. 承认, 答谢, 认可, 谢礼, 收到的通知, 收到的回音, 谢意\\n[计] 肯定, 确认认可",["Gabriel waved his hand in acknowledgment of the compliment he received.","I sent an email with an acknowledgment of receipt."],["",""]],["racket","'rækit","n. 球拍, 喧闹, 杂乱无章\\nvi. 喧闹\\nvt. 用球拍打",["This racket of Jane's is a little heavier than the one which I bought yesterday.","There was a crack in my tennis racket, so I sent it out to be repaired."],["珍的這個球拍比我昨天買的那個重了一點點。","我的网球拍裂了，所以我把它拿去修了。"]],["vocation","vәu'keiʃәn","n. 职业, 天命, 天职, 才能, 行业\\n[法] 行业, 职业, 职业上的才能",["The \"family manager\" is a profession, occupation, vocation.","Don't push your child into any vocation he dislikes."],["“一家之主”是一份专业工作、事业和使命。",""]],["connected","kә'nektid","a. 连接的, 连贯的, 有联系的, 关联的, 连结的, 有关系的\\n[计] 连接的",["Our ancestors used animals to name the years of people's births as their lives were closely connected to these animals.","The organization is not connected with any political parties."],["以動物命名人的屬相，是因為我們的先民與這些動物有密切關係。","这个组织跟任何政党没有联系。"]],["waterfront","'wɔ:tәfrʌnt","n. 水边, 滨水区, 滩, 海滨, 江边",["The Edinburgh Waterfront project could be about to change all that.","The Waterfront project will help to keep Edinburgh up-to-date and bring more people to Scotland's capital city."],["爱丁堡的水边地工程可能会把诸如此类的事情改变。","水边地工程会帮助爱丁堡城市紧随形势并使更多人来苏格兰的首都。"]],["rounded","'raundid","a. 圆形的, 滚圆的, 完整的, 圆润的",["They rounded up a lot of Muslims in that neighborhood.","He's attracted to intelligent beefcakes, you know, well-rounded individuals."],["",""]],["levee","'levi","n. 早朝, 大堤\\nvt. 为...筑堤",["There's danger that the levee will break. We have to evacuate immediately.","The levee kept the floodwater back."],["",""]],["abandonment","ә'bændәmәnt","n. 放弃, 抛弃, 放纵\\n[经] 委付, 废弃, 放弃(采矿权)",["Yanni wanted to learn how to get over his fear of abandonment.","Yanni has serious issues with the fear of abandonment."],["",""]],["logistics","lәu'dʒistiks","n. 后勤学, 后勤\\n[医] 后勤学",["Amateurs talk strategy, professionals talk logistics.","He is in charge of the logistics of the military operation."],["外行谈策略，内行谈后勤。",""]],["tart","tɑ:t","a. 酸的, 辛辣的, 尖酸的\\nvt. 妖艳打扮\\nn. 果馅饼, 妓女",["Pare, core and quarter tart apples, stew until soft and beat smooth.","Pare and slice two quarts of tart apples. Add one cup of water and cook slowly until soft."],["",""]],["favored","'feivәd","a. 有利的, 受惠的, 幸运的",["In politics Mr. Seward favored a system which he compared to the ripe pear that detaches itself and falls into your hand.","Gin and tonic was the favored drink of British colonials due to its antimalarial quinine content."],["",""]],["witty","'witi","a. 富于机智的, 诙谐的",["She's quick on her feet, so no matter what you say to her, she'll have a witty comeback.","A witty man is only worth something if he has character."],["她的腦筋轉得很快，無論你對她說些什麼，她總能巧妙地作出反駁。",""]],["stale","steil","n. 尿\\na. 不新鲜的, 陈腐的, 疲惫的, 陈旧的\\nvt. 使变旧, 走味\\nvi. 变陈旧, 走味, 失时效, 撒尿",["The beggar is collecting stale bread.","While on a mountain trip, I was chewing on some hard, stale bread when I happened upon a huge snake."],["这名乞丐在收集干面包。",""]],["obedience","ә'bi:djәns","n. 服从, 顺从, 忠实\\n[法] 服从, 顺从, 遵从",["Then I'll work on the principle that deference is no substitute for obedience.","We should always act in obedience to the law."],["那我就恭敬不如从命啦。","我們無論如何也應該遵守法律。"]],["equitable","'ekwitәbl","a. 公平的, 公正的\\n[法] 公平的, 公正的, 平衡法的",["They argue that the distribution of wealth should be equitable.","The excessive presence of the English language does not contribute to an equitable and fair debate."],["",""]],["careless","'kєәlis","a. 粗心的, 不关心的, 无忧无虑的",["The beginning of the trouble was his careless remark.","You must take responsibility for your own careless actions."],["麻煩的開頭是他草率的評論。","您必須為您自己不小心的行為負責。"]],["fret","fret","n. 烦躁, 磨损, 焦急, 网状饰物\\nvi. 烦恼, 不满, 磨损\\nvt. 使烦恼, 腐蚀, 使磨损, 使起波纹",["Jigsaw refers to a fret saw - that's how the name's origin was derived.","U.S. stocks opened sharply lower Thursday as global investors fret over the coronavirus outbreak and its economic fallout."],["",""]],["disseminate","di'semineit","vt. 散播, 传播, 宣传\\nvi. 广为传播",["If you're going to disseminate ideas, make sure they're worthwhile.","Daniel Sila is the town crier in this Abuja village. His job is to disseminate vital information from the village chief to people who live in the community."],["",""]],["altered","ˈɔ:ltəd","a. [医]改变的\\nv. 改变, 更改( alter的过去式和过去分词 )",["Meanwhile, conditions have drastically altered.","So altered was the battle-ground, where thousands upon thousands had been killed in the great fight."],["在这期间，情况发生了巨大变化。",""]],["fetal","'fi:tәl","a. 胎儿的, 胎的\\n[医] 胎的, 胎儿的",["The woman was lying dead in an almost fetal position.","Sami was lying on his side in a semi-fetal position."],["",""]],["flatter","'flætә","vt. 奉承, 阿谀, 使高兴\\n[机] 平面锤",["He doesn't stop being arrogant, especially when you flatter him.","I flatter myself that I'm the best golfer in the club."],["",""]],["worldview","'wɜ:ldvju:","n. 看; 视力; 观点; 目的",["This person's worldview is officially unhealthy.","Lydia can't be happy unless everyone conforms to her worldview."],["经鉴定，此人三观不正。",""]],["injunction","in'dʒʌŋkʃәn","n. 命令, 禁令, 劝告\\n[经] 指令, 禁令",["Sami filed an injunction against the school board."],[""]],["errand","'erәnd","n. 任务, 差使, 使命",["What are you, just an errand boy? Start thinking for yourself and give me something serious to work with.","Today I'm shopping in town as well as running an errand for my grandmother."],["",""]],["marking","'mɑ:kiŋ","n. 印记, 印, 分\\n[计] 标志",["There is a fence marking the boundary between our yard and the neighbor's.","The red circle on the calendar marking the deadline causes me to fall into anxiety."],["我家院子和邻居家院子之间有一道篱笆做为分界线。.","日历上画着红圈的截稿日期使我陷入了焦虑。"]],["lapse","læps","n. 过失, 流逝, 失效\\nvi. 犯错, 堕落, 减退, 消失, 流逝\\nvt. 使失效",["Time crumbles things; everything grows old under the power of Time and is forgotten through the lapse of Time.","Schwartzberg is known for his dazzling time-lapse nature photography."],["",""]],["rapist","'reipist","n. 强奸犯\\n[法] 强奸犯",["Brett Kavanaugh is a rapist and should be removed from office.","Well, obviously, we have a rapist in Lincoln Park."],["布雷特卡瓦諾是個強姦犯，應該予以撤職。",""]],["suspended","","a. 悬浮的；暂停的, 缓期的（宣判）",["I've heard that if you default on the water rates your water supply will be suspended, is that true?","The lamp was suspended from the branch of a tree."],["聽說不交水費就會被停水，是真的嗎？","灯笼在树枝上吊着。"]],["kitten","'kitn","n. 小猫, 淘气姑娘\\nvt. 产仔, 卖弄风情",["Honeycake is a white kitten with purple eyes and a pink nose.","Is there anyone who wants to keep the cute kitten?"],["蜂蜜蛋糕是一隻白色的小貓，有著紫色的眼睛和粉紅色的鼻子。","有沒有人要養可愛的小貓？"]],["realist","'riәlist","n. 现实主义者, 写实主义者, 实在论者",["He's a realist, and doesn't believe that miracles are possible.","Joel Simon says that while he feels guardedly optimistic about the future of journalism, he is also a realist."],["",""]],["finishing","'finiʃiŋ","a. 最后的, 终点的\\n[化] 涂饰",["This is the book I read after finishing my homework.","After finishing his meal at the restaurant in a great mood, he left a generous tip, much to the waiter's delighted surprise."],["我做完我的功课后，就读这本书。","他在餐廳吃完飯後，心情大好，便留下了一筆大大的小費，讓服務生驚喜不已。"]],["hamlet","'hæmlit","n. 小村, 部落",["It is said that \"Hamlet\" is the most interesting play ever written.","I will have read Hamlet three times if I read it again."],["据说《哈姆雷特》是写出来的最有意思的剧本。","我再看一次《王子復仇記》，加起來一共就看過三次了。"]],["photon","'fәutɒn","n. 光子, 光量子, 光度\\n[化] 光量子; 光子",["A photon is its own antiparticle."],[""]],["frying","'fraɪɪŋ","v. 油炸, 油煎( fry的现在分词 ); 皮肤晒黑; 煎炸; 油发",["I use a frying pan at least once a day.","I candy the vegetables in the frying pan."],["我每天至少用一次煎鍋。","我把蔬菜在煎鍋裡糖漬。"]],["showing","'ʃәuiŋ","n. 显示, 陈列, 展览, 成绩, 表现, 表演, 夸耀, 陈述, 叙述, 外表, 迹象",["Showing your real feelings is not considered a virtue in Japan.","My data-burning software is showing an error message."],["直率在日本人的眼中並不是一種美德。","我的刻录软件显示了一个错误信息。"]],["ballistic","bә'listik","a. 弹道的\\n[医] 射击的, 冲击的",["They unveiled new ballistic missiles.","The Internet has expanded the range of my sex life; it's a bit like I upgraded to ballistic missiles."],["他們推出了新型彈道飛彈。",""]],["psychiatry","sai'kaiәtri","n. 精神病学, 精神病治疗\\n[医] 精神病学",["Bruno is board certified in psychiatry.","Dr. Jackson has been practicing psychiatry for years."],["布魯諾是委員會認證的精神科專家。",""]],["improvisation",".imprәvai'zeiʃәn","n. 即兴而作, 即席演奏, 即席作品",["Improvisation is an essential part of jazz. It also used to be important in classical music, but this is not true nowadays.","It is an art form that weds classical poetry and musical improvisation in specific local modes."],["",""]],["observed","","a. 观测的；观察的",["He observed that we should probably have rain coming.","Politeness is less observed today than it used to be."],["他說很可能會下雨。","现今，人们不再像过去那样遵守礼节。"]],["barge","bɑ:dʒ","n. 驳船\\nvt. 用船运输\\nvi. 蹒跚, 闯入",["Even though our house was on TV, I'd prefer it if you wouldn't just barge in our garden and take pictures.","You can't just barge in here whenever you feel like it."],["",""]],["runaway","'rʌnә.wei","n. 逃跑, 逃走的人, 逃亡, 压倒性的优胜\\na. 逃亡的, 逃走的",["The officer said that runaway kids weren't his problem and walked away.","She is like a runaway waterfall leaping over boulders, like the topmost bamboo twig rustling in the restless wind."],["",""]],["envoy","'envɒi","n. 外交使节, 特使\\n[法] 使者, 代表, 使节",["The envoy was recalled when diplomatic relations were broken.","There's an envoy from Australia here to see you."],["",""]],["coexist",".kәuig'zist","vi. 共存",["I know the human being and fish can coexist peacefully.","Despite their many cultural differences, humans and cats are able to coexist relatively peacefully."],["",""]],["sucker","'sʌkә","n. 乳儿, 吸管\\n[医] 吸盘",["I suppose that means that, after all, people taken for a sucker give off a 'sucker aura'.","As you might already know, I am a sucker for old books."],["",""]],["judiciary","dʒu:'diʃiәri","a. 司法的, 法院的, 法官的\\nn. 司法部, 司法系统, 法官",["The judiciary should not become merely an extension of the legislative branch.","An independent judiciary is one of the key pillars of a functional democracy."],["",""]],["chromosome","'krәumәsәum","n. 染色体\\n[化] 染色体",["I know I'm a man because I've got a penis and I have a male chromosome pair.","Every single chromosome in your body cries out that you're a man."],["",""]],["traitor","'treitә","n. 叛逆者, 叛国者\\n[法] 叛徒, 叛逆, 背信者",["We had thought that he was a hero, but he turned out to be a traitor.","Israeli historian Ilan Pappe is considered as a traitor."],["我们以为他是一个英雄，原来是一个叛徒。",""]],["unconventional",".ʌnkәn'venʃәnl","a. 不依惯例的, 非传统的, 非常规的",["We need an attorney with experience in unconventional means.","The art teacher's unconventional attire is the first hint that she's a nonconformist."],["",""]],["markedly","'mɑ:kidli","adv. 显著地, 醒目地, 明显地",["After being away for a long time, Osyp changed markedly.","Tom's fitness has improved markedly under his new coach."],["",""]],["espouse","i'spauz","vt. 支持, 赞成, 嫁, 娶\\n[法] 娶, 出嫁, 信奉",["Libertarians espouse free markets and limited government.","Right-wing libertarians espouse free markets and limited government."],["",""]],["powdered","'paudәd","a. 弄成粉末的, 粉状的\\n[医] 粉状的",["Powdered snow is hard to melt and piles up easily.","After the gym, I drink a glass of milk mixed with powdered protein."],["",""]],["driven","'drivn","a. 有紧迫感的\\ndrive的过去分词",["The number of cars driven in the city has increased.","You'd better not have driven my car."],["在城市里行驶的车辆数量增加了。","你最好不要開了我的車。"]],["chopper","'tʃɒpә","n. 切物之人, 斧头, 切肉大刀\\n[化] 切碎机; 切...机; 断裂剂(热原子化学); 断路器; 斩波器; 断续器",["Some sicko chopper fucked up a lot of his friends.","The chopper rushed Tom to the hospital."],["",""]],["adherence","әd'hiәrәns","n. 依附, 固执, 坚持\\n[化] 粘合",["Only strict adherence to the rules will prevent chaos.","The W-H-O report says improving adherence to existing treatments may have better results than providing new medical technologies."],["",""]],["showdown","'ʃәudaun","n. 摊牌, 暴露, 紧要关头",["When two powerful forces with opposite ideals come face to face, it's time for a showdown.","Determined not to let the cockroach escape, Anna grabbed a shoe and prepared herself for a showdown."],["",""]],["serum","'siәrәm","n. 浆液, 血清, 乳清\\n[医] 血清; 浆液",["Lukas injected himself with the invisibility serum.","After years of research, Tom made a serum that could cure cancer."],["",""]],["ascii","'æski","美国信息交换标准码\\n[计] 美国标准信息交换码",["Please ensure you always include a link-back in your replies. \">>\" in plain ASCII + number (e.g. >>1).","Inverted exclamation and question marks were invented by the Royal Spanish Academy to make ASCII look racist."],["",""]],["rehab","'ri:hæb","n. 修复（等于rehabilitation）",["The news covers celebrity rehab stories extensively enough to avoid talking about war or corruption.","This famous actress checked into rehab for the second time to treat her addiction."],["",""]],["traction","'trækʃәn","n. 曳, 牵引, 牵引力\\n[医] 牵引",["Sami started gaining a little bit of traction on social media.","The idea of leaving the Algerian state isn't getting any traction in Kabylie."],["",""]],["sunscreen","'sʌnskri:n","n. (防晒油中的)遮光剂",["If you don't want to put on sunscreen, that's your problem. Just don't come complaining to me when you get a sunburn.","Dress in layers and bring sunscreen and sunglasses."],["你不想涂防晒霜是你的问题，但是晒伤了不要来抱怨。",""]],["graveyard","'greivjɑ:d","n. 墓地",["They buried him in the graveyard by the church.","Freddy's been working the graveyard shift the past month, so he hasn't been able to see any of his friends who work normal hours."],["他們把他埋葬在教堂旁的墓園。",""]],["rodent","'rәudәnt","a. 咬的, 啮齿类的\\nn. 啮齿动物",["Without a doubt the rodent best adapted to living in rivers and marshlands is the beaver.","Bumblebees like to nest in abandoned rodent burrows or similar holes in the ground."],["",""]],["scientifically",".saiәn'tifikәli","adv. 合乎科学地, 学问上, 系统地",["A relationship between blood group and personality has not been scientifically proven.","A connection between personality and blood type has not been scientifically proven."],["科学上，血型和性格的关联性没有被证明。","科学上，血型和性格的关联性没有被证明。"]],["lame","leim","a. 跛足的, 僵痛的, 不完全的, 金属薄板, 不知内情的人\\nvi. 变跛\\nvt. 使成残废, 使无用",["The new Harry Potter movie is pretty lame.","Science without religion is lame, religion without science is blind."],["哈利波特的新片十分差。",""]],["journalistic",",dʒ\\\\\\\\: nә'listik","a. 新闻业的, 新闻工作者的, 报刊特有的, 新闻工作的",["Journalistic spin heavily affects everyday discourse.","Her journalistic work was extremely time-consuming, which was unfortunately to the detriment of her literary career."],["",""]],["analog","'ænәlɔ^","[计] 模拟",["I don't even know how it is possible for people in my generation to not be able to read an analog clock.","Nowadays, many children can't tell time on analog clocks."],["",""]],["iceberg","'aisbә:g","n. 冰山, 冷冰冰的人",["\"Tom chopped up the manuscript like it was iceberg lettuce.\" \"Sounds brutal.\" \"It was, but it was also necessary.\"","The passengers were asleep in their cabins when the ship hit a huge iceberg."],["「湯姆像切捲心萵苣一樣，把手稿切碎了。」「聽起來很殘忍。」「沒錯，而且也沒有那個必要。」",""]],["parrot","'pærәt","n. 鹦鹉, 应声虫\\nvt. 学舌, 机械地模仿",["That parrot was Tobias's only connection with his late father.","A parrot can imitate the human voice."],["那隻鸚鵡是托比亞斯與他已故父親之間唯一的連結。","鸚鵡會模仿人的聲音。"]],["template","'templit","n. 样板, 模板, 垫木\\n[计] 模板",["C++0x will admit template functions that take an arbitrary number of arguments.","There is no simple pattern that can serve as a template."],["",""]],["congratulations","","n. 祝贺词, 祝贺语",["Please accept my sincere congratulations on your success today.","May I be the first to offer my congratulations."],["請接受我對您今天的成功最誠摯的祝賀。","讓我來第一箇祝賀。"]],["midtown","'midtajn","n. 商业区与住宅区之间的地区",["The daily trek to midtown Manhattan takes about an hour and a half.","Young people were in evidence all over midtown Friday night, dancing, dining, and strolling down the avenues."],["",""]],["deserted","di'zә:tid","a. 被遗弃的, 废弃的\\n[法] 被遗弃的, 无人的, 放弃的",["A goatherd drove his goats, all white with snow, into a deserted cave for shelter.","The golf course is completely deserted. There is not a single person!"],["一个牧羊人把他一身白雪的山羊赶进被遗弃的山洞躲避暴风雪。","高爾夫球場門可羅雀，一個人都沒有！"]],["faulty","'fɒ:lti","a. 有过失的, 有缺点的, 不完美的, 应受责备的\\n[经] 缺点多的",["The most perfidious way of harming a cause consists of defending it deliberately with faulty arguments.","The errors apparent in his results are due more to carelessness than faulty procedures."],["",""]],["unification",".ju:nifi'keiʃәn","n. 统一, 联合, 一致\\n[医] 连结; 统一",["This extraordinary increase is explained by the speedy economic unification which took place during the same period.","Berlin is a symbol of unification between the East and the West."],["",""]],["thump","θʌmp","n. 重打, 重击声\\nv. 重打, 撞击, 痛打",["A heard a loud thump from upstairs.","New Yorkers appear to have accepted the scream of sirens on the ground and the thump of helicopters overhead as part of daily life."],["",""]],["paralysis","pә'rælisis","n. 麻痹, 停顿, 瘫痪\\n[医] 麻痹, 瘫痪",["His paralysis is progressing, and soon he won't be able to get out of bed.","There have been several cases of infantile paralysis."],["他的瘫痪正在恶化，不久他就不能下床了。",""]],["strew","stru:","vt. 散播, 撒满",["\"Go, set the storm-winds free, / and sink their ships or scatter them astray, / and strew their corpses forth, to weltering waves a prey.\""],[""]],["tempo","'tempәu","n. 速度, 节奏, 进行速度, (棋的)一着",["The rhythm is light, and the tempo fast - that song is liked by young people.","We're going too fast! I can't play a walking bass line at this tempo."],["",""]],["acquit","ә'kwit","vt. 无罪释放, 表现, 使履行\\n[法] 开释, 释放, 免",["For lack of evidence proving him guilty, the jury had no choice but to acquit Tom.","After the prosecutor permitted the defendant to handle the murder evidence, his attorney declared: \"If the gloves don't fit, you must acquit.\""],["",""]],["wilt","wilt","v. (使)枯萎, (使)衰弱, (使)畏缩\\nn. 枯萎, 衰弱, 憔悴",["And again he said to him: But if forty be found there, what wilt thou do? He said: I will not destroy it for the sake of forty.","And they called her, and when she was come, they asked: Wilt thou go with this man? She said: I will go."],["",""]],["yeast","ji:st","n. 酵母\\n[化] 酵母",["Bread is made from flour, water, and often yeast.","The dough is made from water, flour, salt and instant yeast."],["麵包是用麵粉和水做的，有時還會加入發酵粉。",""]],["pediatric",".pi:di'ætrik","a. 小儿科的\\n[医] 儿科的",["Tom thought he might want to become a pediatric neurologist.","Tom thought that he might want to become a pediatric neurologist."],["",""]],["enrichment","in'ritʃmәnt","n. 丰富, 肥沃\\n[化] 富集",["Tom attends maths enrichment classes after school.","The enrichment of the soil with minerals allowed my corn to grow this tall."],["",""]],["thy","ðai","pron. 你的",["Let food be thy medicine and medicine be thy food.","Yea, though I walk through the valley of the shadow of death, I will fear no evil: for thou art with me; thy rod and thy staff they comfort me."],["让你的食物成为药物，药物成为食物。","我雖然行過死蔭的幽谷，也不怕遭害，因為你與我同在；你的杖，你的竿，都讓我安心。"]],["botanical","bә'tænikәl","a. 植物学的\\nn. 植物性药材",["We found many strange plants in a botanical garden.","The roses were in full bloom in the botanical garden."],["我們在一家植物園裏找到了許多稀奇古怪的植物。",""]],["divinity","di'viniti","n. 神, 神性",["My father's little library consisted chiefly of books on polemic divinity, most of which I read.","The main problem with antitheism is its negation of my divinity."],["",""]],["flowing","flәuiŋ","a. 流动的, 如流的, 平滑的",["It wasn't water flowing through the pipes, but human blood.","Tears were flowing down her cheeks."],["管道裡流的不是水，是人血。","眼泪顺着她的脸颊流下来。"]],["wane","wein","n. 减少, 衰微, 败落, 亏缺, 月亏\\nvi. 变小, 亏缺, 衰落, 消逝, 退潮",["Oh luck! Like the moon you change; steadily you wax and then wane again.","They say it's on the wane, but it's still got something, hasn't it?"],["",""]],["unfairly","","adv. 不正当地；不公平地",["George III has been unfairly maligned by historians.","Hinata criticized her teacher unfairly and the teacher became sick."],["",""]],["savage","'sævidʒ","a. 未开化的, 野蛮的, 无礼的, 残酷的, 原始的, 粗鲁的, 未开发的\\nvt. 用暴力对付, 凶猛攻击\\nn. 原始人, 粗鲁人",["The young man who has not wept is a savage, and the old man who will not laugh is a fool.","Greece, conquered, took captive her savage conqueror."],["",""]],["forceful","'fɒ:sful","a. 有力的, 强烈的, 有说服力的",["My impression of this government is that they need a more forceful economic policy, otherwise they'll encounter large problems in the future.","You are being too forceful with your points of view, try to be less vocal about expressing your views."],["我对这个政府的印象是，他们需要强一点儿的经济政策，要不然将来会遇到很大的问题。",""]],["tack","tæk","n. 平头钉, 大头钉, 粗缝针脚, 行动方针, 食物\\nvt. 以大头针钉住, 附加",["The mind always loves to tack on to something, and when it doesn't have anything good for that purpose, it turns to the evil.","If a conversation is not going too well, try changing tack."],["",""]],["emblem","'emblәm","n. 象征, 徽章, 符号\\nvt. 用象征表示",["The royal emblem was engraved upon the invitation.","As peace is of all goodness, so war is an emblem, a hieroglyphic, of all misery."],["",""]],["promised","ˈprɔmist","vt.& vi. (promise的过去式或过去分词形式); 承诺; 允诺; 答应\\nv. 允诺( promise的过去式和过去分词 );…",["I promised myself that I would never do that again.","Mary promised she'd go to Boston with Tom next Monday."],["我对自己发誓今后不会再那么做。","瑪麗答應湯姆下週一會去波士頓。"]],["willow","'wilәu","n. 柳树, 柳木制品\\na. 柳树的, 柳木制的",["The willow branches swayed gently in the breeze.","In our Mediterranean forest, there are lots of trees: oak, pine, willow, ash, elm, etc.."],["柳枝在微风中轻轻荡悠。",""]],["bland","blænd","a. 温和的, 乏味的, 冷漠的\\n[医] 温和的, 淡的",["Life would become bland without you.","I think that generally, North America is more bland than Asia or Europe."],["如果沒有你，我的人生就會變得空白一片。",""]],["styling","'stailiŋ","n. 款式, 式样",["I don't like the styling."],[""]],["gateway","'geitwei","n. 门, 通路\\n[计] 网关",["St. Louis, Missouri is famous for the Gateway Arch and the Anheuser-Busch Brewery.","Tom's latest movie just came out. It's called \"Tatoeba: Bad Gateway\"."],["",""]],["termination",".tә:mi'neiʃәn","n. 终止, 结束, 结果, 词尾\\n[化] 终止",["I was devastated when I received my termination notice.","Conditions for termination of the agreement are listed on the last page."],["",""]],["stakeholder","'steikhәuldә","n. 赌金保管者\\n[法] 赌款保存人, 保存保证金的人",["The stakeholder most deeply affected by this decision is the chief executive officer.","The company has one stakeholder, who is also its only employee."],["",""]],["hegemony","hi:'dʒemәni","n. 霸权, 领导权, 支配权, 拥有支配权的政府\\n[法] 霸权, 盟主权",["We're witnessing the fall of Washington's global hegemony.","The ruling class employs a variety of means to maintain their hegemony."],["",""]],["homage","'hɒmidʒ","n. 尊崇, 尊敬, 效忠",["His works tend to pay homage to different artists.","A discreet homage to the accident victims was carried out yesterday."],["",""]],["mashed","","a. 捣烂的；被捣成糊状的；捣碎的",["On a busy Friday night, in Diak's restaurant, some customers are enjoying slow-roasted pork loin with quince and mashed potatoes, baked apple, and brandy butter sauce.","The grainy texture of these mashed potatoes is deeply unpleasant."],["在一個繁忙的星期五晚上，迪亞克的餐廳裡，一些顧客正在享用慢烤豬里肌配榅桲、馬鈴薯泥；烤蘋果；以及白蘭地黃油醬。",""]],["sailing","'seiliŋ","n. 航行, 航海术, 启航\\na. 航行的",["Several yachts were sailing side by side far out at sea.","I saw a white cloud sailing across the sky."],["數艘游艇在遠方的海洋並列航行。","我見到一片白雲在空中飄過。"]],["fed","fed","feed的过去式和过去分词\\n[经] 联邦储备局",["It was not until the baby was fed that he stopped crying.","The Amazon is fed by a large number of tributaries."],["这个婴儿直到吃饱了才停下不哭。","亚马逊河有很多支流。"]],["displaced","dis'pleist","a. 位移的；无家可归的；被取代的",["The villagers were displaced by the construction of a dam.","The fracture is not displaced, and no surgery is required."],["",""]],["thriving","","a. 兴旺的, 旺盛的, 繁荣的",["Let us remember that if this financial crisis taught us anything, it's that we cannot have a thriving Wall Street while Main Street suffers.","Thirty years after Hurricane Hugo, Charleston is a thriving coastal city."],["让我们记住这一点，如果说这场金融危机教会了我们什么东西的话，那就是我们不可能在金融以外的领域处于困境的同时拥有繁荣兴旺的华尔街。",""]],["mobilization",".mәubilai'zeiʃәn","n. 动员, 调动, 活动法\\n[化] 活动化",["The army's leaders are preparing for a major mobilization.","Daniel has just receive his mobilization order."],["",""]],["psychosocial",",saikәu'sәuʃәl","社会心理的(指社会环境影响下的个人心理变化)",["No, you aren't in love, for what you call love is just a psychosocial construct to make people ignore their animalic heritance.","Once the children are rescued, they receive psychosocial counseling to help them overcome their trauma."],["",""]],["clipping","'klipiŋ","n. 剪断, 剪裁, 剪下物, 剪报\\na. 第一流的, 头等的, 极好的, 快速的\\n[计] 剪取; 削波",["Tom was clipping his nails as he waited for Mary to finish getting dressed.","Her wings kept clipping through my player model."],["",""]],["convergence","kәn'vә:dʒәns","n. 集中, 收敛\\n[计] 收敛, 会聚",["The convergence of US and British imperialist interests is so pronounced that London should seriously evaluate the possibility of joining the United States as a state.","If you are a First Nations fan, maybe read the article \"Bella Coola and North Wakashan: Convergence and diversity in the Northwest Coast Sprachbund.\""],["",""]],["immensely","i'mensli","adv. 无限地, 广大地, 庞大地",["It would be immensely challenging for China to take down Taiwan.","He thought of himself as a speck of dust in an immensely vast universe."],["",""]],["imagined","iˈmædʒind","v. 想( imagine的过去式和过去分词 ); 想像; 料想; 误认为",["When I was growing up, I never imagined that I would become famous.","I foolishly imagined that he was going to help me."],["我小的时候从没想过自己会出名。","我傻乎乎地以为他会帮助我。"]],["palpable","'pælpәbl","a. 可感知的, 明显的, 触摸得到的\\n[医] 可触知的",["Tom and Mary's love for each other was so strong it was almost palpable.","The excitement was palpable in William's voice as he told the story."],["",""]],["mantra","'mʌntrә, 'mæn-","颂歌, 咒语(尤指四吠陀经典内作为咒文或祷告唱念的)",["He loved to repeat a phrase, a kind of personal mantra.","He says frugality was the mantra for an older generation, but that is changing."],["",""]],["password","'pæswә:d","n. 密码, 口令, 通行手段\\n[计] 口令",["Check that your username and password are written correctly.","You can come in if and only if you know our password."],["檢查一下用戶名和密碼有沒有填錯。","当且仅当你知道我们的密码你才可以进来。"]],["aboriginal",".æbә'ridʒәnәl","a. 原始的, 土著的\\nn. 土著居民, 土生生物",["Among the wind instruments, the aboriginal didgeridoo made of eucalyptus was his favorite.","An aboriginal footballer was racially vilified by a member of the opposing team."],["",""]],["cosmetics","","n. 装饰品；化妆品（cosmetic的复数）",["There is nothing wrong with boys wearing cosmetics.","And if we have time, I'd like to take a look at their cosmetics."],["男孩化粧沒有甚麼問題。",""]],["whim","hwim","n. 一时的兴致, 冲动, 怪念头, 绞盘",["Father was generous enough to indulge my every whim.","If you write your address on a web-page, anybody can find out where you live if the whim takes them."],["",""]],["spotted","'spɒtid","a. 有斑点的, 斑纹的, 弄污了的",["Tom says he's spotted something out of the ordinary.","The young snatcher wasn't spotted by the police again."],["",""]],["watchdog","'wɒtʃdɒg","n. 看门狗, 监察人\\n[化] 监控设备; 监视器",["My watchdog is alert to the slightest sound and movement.","A dog that barks all the time isn't a good watchdog."],["",""]],["adjustable","ә'dʒʌstәbl","a. 可调节的\\n[电] 可调整的",["An adjustable wrench is a useful tool for any plumber.","The laser sight is pre-sighted from factory, but is user adjustable."],["",""]],["pickle","'pikl","n. 盐卤, 腌汁, 泡菜, 困境, 讨厌鬼\\nvt. 腌制, 酸洗, 葬送(机会等), 泡",["Did you know that if you plug a pickle into an electrical outlet, it glows and makes buzzing noises?","Tom put some hard-boiled eggs in a jar, boiled some pickle brine, and poured it over the eggs."],["你知道如果你把泡菜插入電源插座，它會發光並且發出嗡嗡的聲音嗎？",""]],["stationary","'steiʃ(ә)nәri","a. 不动的, 静止的, 不变的, 固定的, 停留的\\n[计] 定常, 定态, 固定的",["Let's have a moment of silence for all those who are stuck in traffic on their way to the gym to ride the stationary bicycle.","The albatross appeared to be stationary in the air."],["",""]],["continual","kәn'tinjuәl","a. 持续不断的, 继续的\\n[建] 连续的",["The result is a continual search for food in a changing environment.","He struggled to deal with her continual criticism of him."],["",""]],["ridicule","'ridikju:l","n. 嘲笑, 愚弄, 笑柄\\nvt. 嘲笑, 嘲弄, 愚弄",["If you do that, you're going to subject yourself to ridicule.","It's a kinda ridicule unnecessary fibonacci-syllabic-heap."],["",""]],["dj","","n. 唱片流行音乐节目播音员, 唱片骑师",["Tom is an uplifting trance producer and DJ from Boston.","I used to be a DJ for my university's radio station."],["",""]],["denim","'denim","n. 斜纹粗棉布, 牛仔布, 劳动布, (非正式)工作服, 工装裤",["Jeans manufacturers make denim bluer with indigo dye.","I've been wearing this denim jacket for 15 years now."],["",""]],["virgin","'vә:dʒin","n. 处女\\na. 处女的, 贞洁的, 纯洁的, 初始的, 纯的",["You have dragged from the altar a virgin whom Cupid had reserved to adorn a tale of love.","He was incarnate of the Holy Spirit from the Virgin Mary, and was made man."],["",""]],["pitching","'pitʃiŋ","n. 护坡(石), 铺地石, 俯仰, (船的)上下颠簸",["Pitching tents wasn't exactly one of Matthew's favorite things to do.","After the second innings, the opposing pitcher recovered too, and it turned into a pitching duel."],["",""]],["rectangle","'rektæŋgl","n. 长方形, 矩形\\n[化] 矩形",["A square is a rectangle and a rhombus at the same time.","A square is one type of rectangle, and a rectangle is one type of parallelogram."],["",""]],["op","'әjp","观测所\\n[计] 操作, 运算, 算符",["Op-eds containing factual arguments should be subject to fact-checking.","OP, I can tell that you're a daughter who cares a lot for her parents."],["",""]],["angular","'æŋgjulә","a. 有角的, 消瘦的, 有尖角的, 生硬的\\n[医] 角的, 角形的",["Her coloring book lay limp, jagged with angular pink scribbles.","I noticed a tall, thin, angular man seated in an arm-chair by the fire."],["",""]],["imperfect","im'pә:fikt","a. 不完美的, 不完整的, 减弱的, 未完成过去时的\\nn. 未完成体",["As your goods for which you are charging us were imperfect, we will not pay this account.","Partly because he could not receive enough information, Harper's description remains imperfect."],["",""]],["revert","ri'vә:t","vi. 恢复, 复归, 回复, 还原\\nvt. 使回复原状, 使回转\\nn. 恢复原信仰的人\\n[计] 还原",["The situation will soon revert to the way things were before.","In this year of the Jubilee all land, and village houses, and the houses of the Levites were to revert to their original owners."],["",""]],["periphery","pә'rifәri","n. 外围, 边缘地区, 圆周\\n[医] 外周, 周围",["Much like Nigeria, the Philippines was considered to be in the periphery of the Anglosphere.","They never penetrated beyond the periphery of the group."],["",""]],["patronage","'pætrәnidʒ","n. 赞助, 恩赐态度, 光顾, 任免权, 保护人的身分\\n[经] 光顾, 资助, 赞助",["Isamu Kobayashi received the patronage of Rohan Koda.","We really thank you for your patronage."],["",""]],["engaging","in'geidʒiŋ","a. 动人的, 迷人的, 有魅力的",["The game is becoming more engaging.","He enjoys engaging in macabre activities such as dissecting animal corpses and stalking people on the street at night."],["游戏开始变得有趣。",""]],["startled","","v. 震惊（startle的过去分词）",["When the door slammed unexpectedly, it startled me.","These animals were startled by the noise of the fireworks."],["",""]],["clinician","kli'niʃәn","[医] 临床医师, 临证医师",["Please instruct the patient to visit a clinician.","She was a much better clinician than researcher."],["",""]],["bikini","bi'ki:ni","n. 大爆炸, 比基尼泳装",["That pretty girl wearing a bikini is Tom's younger sister.","Judy decided to wear her new bikini."],["那個穿著比基尼的漂亮女孩是湯姆的妹妹。","朱迪決定穿上她的新比基尼。"]],["hospitalize","'hɒspitәlaiz","vt. 送...进医院治疗\\n[医] 入院",["We had to hospitalize the victims."],[""]],["ringing","'riŋiŋ","a. 响亮的, 明白的, 清脆的, 干脆的\\n[电] 振铃",["My wife called to me, \"Your phone is ringing. Hurry up and answer it!\"","Shades of earth are ringing through my open view inciting and inviting me."],["我老婆对我喊道：“你电话响了，快接电话。”",""]],["comparatively","kәm'pærәtivli","adv. 比较地, 相对地",["American senior citizens are comparatively well-off.","The prices of Japanese automobiles are still comparatively high."],["",""]],["poisonous","'pɒizәnәs","a. 有毒的, 恶毒的, 讨厌的\\n[医] 有毒的",["We study a species of poisonous frog that looks very similar to a stone.","I like tulips and cats, but tulips are poisonous to cats. How should I choose?"],["我們研究一種和石頭長得很像的毒青蛙。","我喜欢郁金香和猫，可是郁金香对猫咪有毒，我该如何取舍呢？"]],["statesman","'steitsmәn","n. 政治家",["The name of this statesman is known to everybody in Japan.","In addition to being a great statesman, Churchill was a great writer."],["这位政治家的名字在日本人人皆知。","邱吉爾不僅是一位偉大的政治家，還是一位偉大的作家。"]],["villa","'vilә","n. 别墅",["A few minutes later our driver pulled up at a neat little red-brick villa with overhanging eaves which stood by the road.","The villa was abandoned and the garden became overgrown."],["",""]],["marxist","'mɑ:ksist","a. 马克思主义的\\nn. 马克思主义者",["The Marxist-Leninist method does not bring society closer to communism, but nor is it to be conflated with communism itself.","I had conservative, liberal, Marxist and anarchist professors."],["",""]],["stimulating","'stimjuleitiŋ","a. 刺激的, 有刺激性的",["This policy is sure to go a long way towards stimulating business.","A rich and stimulating environment is important for a child's cognitive development."],["",""]],["zest","zest","n. 兴趣, 热情, 风味, 热心\\nvt. 给...调味",["The garlic powder complemented the lemon zest in Matthew's chicken dish.","When practicing at home, the aspiring bartender had to use a potato peeler to zest lemons."],["",""]],["appointee","ә.pɒin'ti:","n. 被任命者\\n[法] 被指定的人, 被任命者",["The unpopular, unelected dictator's appointee rolled back protections for vulnerable populations in the name of the majority.","The President selects an appointee to be on the High Court when a member retires or dies."],["",""]],["invaluable","in'væljuәbl","a. 无价的, 价值无法衡量的",["The Internet is an invaluable source of information.","If it weren't for your invaluable help, everything would be ruined."],["互联网是一种无法估量的信息资源。",""]],["infusion","in'fju:ʒәn","n. 注入, 泡制, 注入物\\n[化] 浸渍; 浸泡",["The infusion is stored in a cool place for no more than three days.","It is essential that patients ensure there are no leaks of insulin where the infusion set is connected to the syringe."],["",""]],["ulcer","'ʌlsә","n. 溃疡, 腐烂物\\n[医] 溃疡",["A woman in your situation could easily develop an ulcer.","In the hospital, Boldi was diagnosed with an ulcer."],["",""]],["proactive",",prәu'æktiv","a. 〈心理〉前摄的",["School busing and taking a proactive stance against discrimination were hotly debated topics.","The government is being urged to take a proactive approach to reducing carbon emissions."],["",""]],["shampoo","ʃæm'pu:","n. 洗头, 洗发剂\\nvt. 洗头, 洗发",["Tom picked up the bottle of shampoo and squirted some in his hand.","I wanted to wash my hair this morning, but we've run out of shampoo."],["",""]],["translucent","træns'lu:snt","a. 半透明的, 透明的",["Add the rice and cook gently until the grains begin to turn translucent.","I ran toward the translucent sphere, and the next thing I knew, I was mysteriously suspended in mid-air."],["",""]],["brutally","","adv. 残忍地, 蛮横地",["She is brutally honest; it hurts me from time to time.","Tom brutally killed a hostage who tried to sound the alarm system."],["",""]],["triumphant","trai'ʌmfәnt","a. 得胜的, 得意洋洋的",["There's no sense acting all triumphant like a conquering hero over such a minor thing.","It must have been something really big for him to strike a triumphant pose like that."],["",""]],["sensual","'senʃuәl","a. 肉欲的, 感觉的, 感觉论的",["They gave themselves up to the enjoyment of sensual pleasures.","His sensual expertise is unmatched, making him a sought-after partner for indulging in passionate encounters."],["",""]],["fitting","'fitiŋ","a. 适宜的\\nn. 试穿, 试衣, 装配, 装置",["That piece of furniture is not fitting for the living room.","Slender and form-fitting with a high cut, the new qipao contrasted sharply with the traditional one."],["那件家具不适合摆在客厅。","新的旗袍又修长又紧身，也有短裙摆，与传统式样构成了鲜明的对比。"]],["hoof","hu:f","n. 蹄, (人的)脚\\nvt. 以蹄踢, 行走, 步行\\nvi. 走, 踢, 踏",["I am so exhausted because I have padded the hoof for 4 hours.","The farrier fitted the shoe to the horse's hoof while the shoe was hot."],["走了四个小时，我觉得非常累了。",""]],["chandelier",",ʃændi'liә","n. 枝形吊灯",["Maybe people have multiple souls or spirits, structured like differently coloured and sized jewels in a chandelier.","There was a beautiful chandelier hanging from the ceiling."],["",""]],["contaminated","kәn'tæmineitid","a. 受污染的；弄脏的",["A cell phone is as contaminated with bacteria as a toilet is.","Twenty-five years after Chernobyl, milk, mushrooms and berries are still contaminated in some parts of Ukraine."],["手机如同马桶一样被细菌污染。","在切爾諾貝利核電廠事故二十五年後，在烏克蘭的某些地區，牛奶，蘑菇和漿果仍然受到了污染。"]],["halve","hɑ:v","vt. 二等分, 对半分享, 把...减半",["He did not want to halve it."],[""]],["coordinated","","vt. 调节；调整；整理；使调和（coordinate的过去分词）",["Yesterday we coordinated with the department head to organize an office party.","Two devices are coordinated with each other if they work together."],["",""]],["approved","ә'pru:vd","a. 被认可的；经过检验的",["That four-year plan has to be approved.","The boss has already approved of our plans."],["那个四年计划必须获得批准。","老闆已經批准了我們的計劃。"]],["concentrated","'kɒnsәntreitid","a. 集中的, 浓缩的\\n[建] 浓的",["He concentrated his energies on helping his friend.","Cream is a white and light yellow liquid composed of concentrated proteins and fat."],["",""]],["unpaid",".ʌn'peid","a. 未付款的, 不支薪水的\\n[经] 未付的, 未缴纳的",["Youths who are caught violating the new rules on behaviour will lose their right to free travel, and will have to complete unpaid community work to earn it back.","My telephone service was cut off because of unpaid bills."],["被判严重违反新的行为准则的青少年将失去免费乘坐公交车的权利，如果想重新取得必须做无报酬的社区工作。",""]],["enthusiastically","in.θju:zi'æstikli","adv. 热心地, 狂热地",["He enthusiastically engaged himself in this honorable undertaking.","She hopes that everyone will work enthusiastically on this unique project."],["她热忱地投身于这份光荣的事业。",""]],["precarious","pri'kєәriәs","a. 不稳定的, 不安的, 危险的",["The first-time precarious fisherman lazily fished dangerous poisonous fish, but soon stopped to shell peas.","There's no place except here. There's no moment except now. Time and space are mere illusions of precarious human senses."],["",""]],["grassy","'græsi","a. 草绿色的, 象草的, 长满草的",["Miroslav found a nice grassy spot where he set up his tent.","Leonid was walking across a grassy field in the middle of the woods."],["",""]],["mosaic","mәu'zeiik","n. 马赛克, 镶嵌细工, 镶嵌工艺\\na. 马赛克的, 镶嵌细工的, 拼花的\\nvt. 用镶嵌细工装饰\\n[计] Mosaic浏览程序",["Please ensure the genitals are obscured by a mosaic effect.","A woman in movement clothed in what resembles a bikini is drawn on a Sicilian mosaic from 5th century Rome."],["",""]],["winding","'waindiŋ","n. 绕, 卷, 弯曲, 线圈\\na. 蜿蜒的, 卷绕的, 弯曲的",["Chongqing is a hilly city with winding streets.","I love my sister, but I do like winding her up a bit."],["重庆是一座丘陵的城市，道路弯弯曲曲的。",""]],["rosy","'rәuzi","a. 蔷薇色的, 玫瑰红色的",["Then they played \"ring-a-ring-a-rosy\" until they were tired and thirsty.","And yet it was a lovely flower, No colours bright and fair; It might have graced a rosy bower, Instead of hiding there."],["",""]],["lcd","","液晶显示器\\n[计] 液晶显示器; 改变目录",["This monitor is an LCD, that is to say, it has a liquid crystal display.","This 16:9 LCD screen seems to make success look so easy, as if I even know what that means."],["",""]],["downstream","'daun'stri:m","adv. 下游地\\na. 下游的",["The construction of a hydroelectric dam can damage the life of populations downstream and upstream.","Tom is fishing for trout about a hundred meters downstream from here."],["",""]],["shredded","","shred的过去式和过去分词",["Two women wielding giant spatulas continuously stir a brimming wok of shredded beef simmering in curry sauce.","All the documents in these folders need to be shredded."],["兩名女子揮舞著巨大的鍋鏟，不停地翻炒著盛滿咖哩醬汁的牛肉絲。",""]],["clam","klæm","n. 蛤, 沉默寡言的人\\nvi. 捞蛤",["I had a strong desire for a plate of clam linguine right now.","Giant clam harvesting, added to use of cyanide and dynamite bombing for fish, damaged coral reefs last year, the analysts said."],["",""]],["breathtaking","'breθ.teikiŋ","a. 惊人的, 惊险的",["Thousands of workers and artisans toiled for 22 years to create this breathtaking white marble structure.","The mountains could be seen from afar, and it was a breathtaking sight."],["數千名工人和工匠辛勤工作了 22 年，才打造出這座令人驚嘆的白色大理石建築。",""]],["passionately","'pæʃənətlɪ","adv. 热情地, 激昂地",["Even if you go away, I'll still passionately love you.","Miki fell passionately in love with someone she just met."],["",""]],["avalanche","'ævәlɑ:ntʃ","n. 雪崩, 山崩, 大量\\nvi. 崩塌\\nvt. 大量涌至",["As soon as you contact your friends, tell them that an avalanche is coming.","A small snowball is capable of starting an avalanche."],["",""]],["numerical","nju:'merikl","a. 数字的, 数值的, 以数字表示的, 擅长于计数的\\n[经] 数字的, 用数字表示的",["The numerical values shown above derive from Hobson's simulation.","Pantone classifies thousands of colors with unique numerical identifiers."],["",""]],["robotic","rәu'bɔtik","a. 自动的；机器人的, 像机器人的",["The UAE is the first Arab country to reach Mars with its robotic spacecraft.","A cost-effective way to explore the Solar System was to send thousands of robotic probes to scour celestial bodies for data."],["",""]],["squadron","'skwɒdrәn","n. 骑兵营, 分遣队, 小舰队",["Nate has the fiercest attitude of his whole squadron.","The squadron encountered an ambush and scrambled for coverage."],["",""]],["festive","'festiv","a. 庆祝的, 喜庆的, 欢乐的",["The festive mood was slightly spoiled by terrorist bombs.","Esperanto gives little festive hats to some of its Cs, Gs, Hs, Js, Ss, and U's."],["",""]],["coupon","'ku:pɒn","n. 息票, 赠券\\n[经] 息票, 利息单, 联票",["Nir has a discount coupon for the museum's exhibition.","If you spend less than the amount of money written on the coupon, we will return your points."],["",""]],["biker","'baikә(r)","n. 骑自行车/摩托车的人",["The biker was bombarded by clouds of gnats along every mile of the bike trail.","An innocent biker was shot by an arrogant soldier on that street."],["",""]],["ramification",".ræmifi'keiʃәn","n. 分枝, 分叉, 枝状物, 支脉, 支流, 衍生物\\n[医] 分支, 支状分布",["That's a very important ramification, but I think few people even realize its existence.","What would be the ramification of the decision?"],["",""]],["sluggish","'slʌgiʃ","a. 偷懒的, 懒惰的, 迟钝的\\n[经] 萧条的, 呆滞的",["Mr. Smith ran his sluggish horse along the country roads.","The president wants to jump-start the sluggish economy by lowering taxes."],["",""]],["grope","grәup","v. 摸索\\nn. 摸索",["It's a great folly to grope for a thing in the dark when you have a candle standing by you.","If you get into any form of public transport and there are men around, they feel free to grope you, rub against you."],["",""]],["venerable","'venәrәbl","a. 庄严的, 值得尊敬的",["The Venerable Bede is regarded as one of the most important chroniclers of the early Middle Ages.","Hero is a venerable title, because of the price paid."],["",""]],["seventeenth","sevn'ti:nθ","num. 第十七, 十七分之一",["Much of London was destroyed in the seventeenth century.","And the ark rested in the seventh month, on the seventeenth day of the month, upon the mountains of Armenia."],["倫敦許多部份在十七世紀時被摧毀。","七月十七日，方舟停在亞美尼亞的山上。"]],["microbe","'maikrәub","n. 微生物, 细菌\\n[医] 微生物",["It can infect a person if they drink water or put something in their mouth that contains the microbe.","David Paige says it is important not to contaminate Mars with a microbe that could spread."],["",""]],["repetitive","ri'petitiv","a. 重复的, 反复性的",["I like to use frameworks when I program because they save me time on repetitive tasks.","I do not write sentences about Tom or Mary as I find them to be too repetitive."],["",""]],["engaged","in'geidʒd","a. 忙碌的, 使用中的",["My father has been engaged in foreign trade for many years.","He has been engaged in the study of biology for nearly ten years."],["我父亲经营外贸多年。","他研究生物學已經有差不多十年的時間了。"]],["baker","'beikә","n. 面包师\\n[医] 烤箱(骨科用)",["The head of the college, Miss Baker, had a special place in the car park for her small car.","Wolfgang is a baker in a small village in Germany."],["",""]],["footnote","'futnәut","n. 脚注\\n[计] 脚注",["The footnote was too small that it went unnoticed by the readers.","She didn't want to be a footnote in her husband's life."],["",""]],["serene","si'ri:n","a. 宁静的, 沉着的, 安详的, 晴朗的\\nn. 晴朗, 平静",["The Beyrouth Garden is one of Algiers' most beautiful and serene gardens.","The view of Mars through earthly telescopes suggested that all was serene."],["",""]],["notation","nәu'teiʃәn","n. 记号, 符号表示法, 注释\\n[计] 记数法",["Voiceless screaming was interestingly represented through music notation by Alfred Schnittke: \"silence fortissimo\".","There are two distinct systems of shape-note notation: the four-note \"fasola\" system, and the seven-note \"doremi\" system."],["",""]],["hungarian","hʌŋ'gєәriәn","a. 匈牙利的, 匈牙利人的, 匈牙利语的\\nn. 匈牙利人, 匈牙利语",["I'm translating the messages of the bot from English to Hungarian.","In Hungary, everyone speaks Hungarian."],["我正在把这个机器人的消息从英语翻译成匈牙利语。","在匈牙利說匈牙利文。"]],["sanitation","sæni'teiʃәn","n. (环境)卫生, 环境卫生的提倡/维持, 卫生设备, 下水道设施, 卫生设施\\n[医] 环境卫生",["Sanitation is a very important part of public health.","The term sanitation worker is a euphemism for a garbage man."],["",""]],["vector","'vektә","n. 矢量, 传病媒介\\nvt. (用无线电)导引, 给...导航\\n[计] 矢量; 向量",["A vector is a unit vector if its norm is 1.","A vector quantity has two characteristics, a magnitude and a direction."],["模为1的向量是单位向量。",""]],["gust","gʌst","n. 突然一阵, 趣味, 爱好",["Losing his balance from a sudden gust of wind, the tightrope walker fell to his death.","Sometimes I will lose the context of my speech in an instant, as if a sudden gust of wind blows away the music score being played without leaving a trace."],["突然刮起一陣風，走鋼索的人失去了平衡便摔死了。","有时我会在一瞬间忽然迷失说话的脉络，像是忽然刮来一阵狂风，将正在演奏的乐谱吹得无影无踪。"]],["folding","'fәuldiŋ","a. 可折叠的\\n[化] 折叠; 折叠效应",["This is a folding fan, and this is how you open it. It's for hot summer days.","Take this folding umbrella with you. It might come in handy."],["",""]],["fluffy","'flʌfi","a. 毛绒绒的, 蓬松的, 空洞的, 无内容的, 不明确的\\n[医] 绒毛状的",["After washing, the cat's fur is soft and fluffy, and has a faint scent.","Fluffy white clouds drift across the sky one by one."],["洗过澡后，猫咪的毛柔软又蓬松，还有淡淡的香味。","一片一片的白雲在上空飄過。"]],["stern","stә:n","n. 尾部, 船尾, 臀\\na. 严厉的, 严格的, 坚定的, 坚决的",["The teacher gave his pupils a stern telling-off.","The teacher gave her pupils a stern telling-off."],["老師把學生狠狠地罵了一頓。","老師把學生狠狠地罵了一頓。"]],["pathology","pæ'θɒlәdʒi","n. 病理学, 病理, 病状, 病变\\n[医] 闰理学",["Fascism is a social pathology to be eradicated at all costs.","Nurse, take this sample to Pathology immediately, please."],["",""]],["incompatible",".inkәm'pætәbl","a. 不相容的, 不能并存的, 矛盾的\\n[化] 不协调",["Our managing director is incompatible with the president.","Many rabbis think that Judaism is incompatible with Zionism."],["",""]],["blurt","blә:t","vt. 冲口说出, 脱口说出",["It was the sort of weird car that made me want to blurt out, \"what the heck is that?\"","This guy waits in line at movie theatres just so he can blurt out spoilers."],["這輛有點怪的車讓我脫口而出\"那是什麼鬼東西啊?\"",""]],["vain","vein","a. 无价值的, 徒然的, 空虚的, 自负的, 愚蠢的",["He tried to give up smoking last year, but it was in vain.","All the doctor's efforts were in vain and the man soon died."],["他去年試過戒煙，但卻以失敗告終。","醫生雖然已經竭盡全力，但不久病人還是死了。"]],["vigil","'vidʒil","n. 警戒, 监视, 守夜\\n[医] 不眠, 警醒",["She kept an all-night vigil over her sick child."],[""]],["suppression","sә'preʃәn","n. 抑压, 镇压, 抑制\\n[计] 抑制",["Up till now America has called itself the world's police and continued suppression relying on military force.","Up till now the United States has called itself the world's police and continues suppression relying on military force."],["",""]],["orthodoxy","'ɒ:θәdɒksi","n. 正统说法, 正教, 信奉正教",["Saint Augustine's \"Confessions\" tells a timeless tale of intellectual search ending in orthodoxy.","New Age ideas are a refreshing alternative to the staid orthodoxy of traditional Christianity."],["",""]],["nonviolent","nɒn'vaiәlәnt","a. 非暴力的",["The nonviolent actions of Martin Luther King inspired many people.","Nonviolence only works when there are violent activists there to make the nonviolent ones seem like a reasonable compromise."],["",""]],["stressor","'stresә","[医] 紧张性刺激; 应激物",["And while future bride Ahmadieh never had grandiose expectations for her own wedding, one of her biggest stressors is what her guests will think of her big day."],[""]],["purchasing","","[计] 采购的",["She will be an asset to the Purchasing Department.","I think you should probably see someone from Purchasing."],["",""]],["broke","brәuk","a. 一文不名的\\nbreak的过去式",["My mother happened to be there when the fire broke out.","My car broke down this morning and won't be repaired until Friday."],["着火的时候我妈妈恰好在那。","我的车今天早上坏了，星期五才能修好。"]],["neutron","'nju:trɒn","n. 中子\\n[化] 中子",["Pulsars are compact and rapidly rotating neutron stars which are the remains of stars that have exploded.","Cobalt, which forms the core of Vitamin B12, is only created in supernovae and neutron star mergers."],["",""]],["minced","mɪnst","v. 切碎( mince的过去式和过去分词 ); 剁碎; 绞碎; 用绞肉机绞（食物, 尤指肉）",["The minced meat was so greasy that they just didn't manage to eat it.","When the minced meat is well cooked, then I add the vegetables."],["",""]],["stairway","'stєәwei","n. 楼梯, 阶梯",["In an emergency, use the stairway, not the elevator.","Mary couldn't believe that Tom had never listened to Stairway to Heaven."],["事故發生時，敬勿使用電梯，請使用樓梯。","瑪麗難以相信湯姆從來没有聽過《通往天堂的階梯》。"]],["taking","'teikiŋ","n. 取得, 捕获, 进款\\na. 迷人的, 可爱的, 会传染的",["A man who asks his wife's permission before taking any action except breathing is a henpecked husband.","Taking the group of children to the library was no problem."],["一個除了呼吸之外做任何事之前都要經過老婆同意的男人是一個怕老婆的男人。","带孩子团体去图书馆一点问题都没有。"]],["fir","fә:","n. 枞树, 杉木\\n[机] 枞木",["Every family decorates a fir tree for the new year.","The fir, the spruce and the pine are all conifers."],["",""]],["excavate","'ekskәveit","v. 挖空, 挖出, 凿通",["We should excavate. Who knows, maybe we'll find something important and become famous."],[""]],["intrude","in'tru:d","vi. 闯入, 侵入\\nvt. 强加于",["Reporters do not hesitate to intrude into people's privacy.","Take care not to intrude upon her privacy."],["记者没有犹豫地去干涉了人们的私生活。","注意不要侵犯她的隱私。"]],["metric","'metrik","a. 公尺的, 公制的, 计量的\\n[医] 测量的, 米制的, 公制的",["To change the units from metric to imperial and vice versa, the 'menu' button must be clicked.","This chocolate factory consumes twenty metric tons of raw cocoa per day."],["要把公制單位換算成英制或反過來操作，鬚點擊“菜單”按鈕。","這座巧克力工廠每一天消耗二十公噸可可原料。"]],["mapping","'mæpiŋ","[计] 映射; 变换; 映象\\n[化] 测绘; 绘图",["Does bump mapping generate more graphics load than parallax?","By mapping Jupiter's gravitational and magnetic fields, Juno will reveal the planet's interior structure and measure the mass of the core."],["",""]],["holler","'hɒlә","vi. 叫喊, 发牢骚, 抱怨\\nvt. 大声叫喊\\nn. 叫喊",["If you need anything, just give me a holler."],[""]],["hearty","'hɑ:ti","a. 诚恳的, 健壮的, 热烈的, 丰盛的",["On behalf of the company, I would like to express our hearty thanks to you all.","The whole town accorded a hearty welcome to the visitor."],["在此僅代表本公司向各位致上衷心的謝意。",""]],["cerebral","'seribrәl","a. 脑的, 大脑的\\n[医] 小脑的",["Excess fluid in the cerebral ventricles can lead to hydrocephalus, a dangerous buildup of pressure.","Sativa strains are also known as headies because their high is mostly cerebral."],["",""]],["cornerback","'kɔ:nәbæk","n. (美式橄榄球)侧卫",["The cornerback intercepted the pass near the goal line."],["角衛在達陣線附近抄截了傳球。"]],["retarded","ri'tɑ:did","a. 智力上迟钝的",["Most people are retarded and don't know how old civilization is.","Some retarded teenager is assailing the statistics again."],["",""]],["modernism","'mɒdәnizm","n. 现代作风, 现代主义, 现代思想",["Postmodernism is the period after modernism and that period's collective output.","Postmodernism is different from modernism."],["",""]],["crocodile","'krɒkәdail","n. 鳄鱼",["Wood may remain ten years in the water, but it will never become a crocodile.","The crocodile, which produces only male young in hotter weather, might die out too because there will be no females to breed."],["木头或许能在水里呆上十年，但它终究不可能变成一条鳄鱼。",""]],["cider","'saidә","n. 苹果汁, 苹果酒\\n[建] 苹果汁",["Carys makes apple cider with her family every fall.","There was a bar inside the marquee at the village fete selling lukewarm beer and cider."],["",""]],["symmetry","'simitri","n. 对称, 匀称\\n[化] 对称; 对称性; 对称现象",["The new elements also provide a certain symmetry to the periodic table, filling out the seventh row of the chart.","By architectural symmetry, Emmet means geometric symmetry combined with aesthetic uniformity."],["",""]],["fidelity","fi'deliti","n. 忠实, 诚实, 忠诚, 保真度\\n[电] 逼真度",["Histories are more full of Examples of the Fidelity of dogs than of Friends.","Take this ring as a token of my love and fidelity."],["",""]],["earthly","'ә:θli","a. 地球的, 俗世的, 可能的",["Life never ends but earthly life does.","Aristotle believed that the moon marked the boundary between the sublunary earthly region and the supralunary heavenly region."],["生活从不会停止，但世俗生活却会。",""]],["finalist","'fainәlist","n. 决赛选手, 决赛队",["Chau was a finalist in a recent competition in which students prepared plans for actual businesses.","Former Delray Beach finalist Donald Young is now a French Open doubles finalist."],["",""]],["innate","i'neit","a. 先天的, 天生的\\n[医] 先天的, 生来的",["He has an innate love of adventure.","Seen close-up, things have a way of showing their defects, their innate ugliness."],["他天生热爱冒险。",""]],["dearly","'diәli","adv. 深深地, 昂贵地",["When I'm away from home, I miss it dearly, but when I am at home, I want to travel.","Experience, when it is dearly bought, is never discarded."],["不在祖国的时候我很想家，但是在家的时候我又想旅游。",""]],["dope","dәup","n. 吸毒者, 笨蛋, 麻醉药物, 粘稠物\\nvt. 麻痹, 上涂料, 预测出\\nvi. 吸毒",["You have to give me your contact, the one who gives you the dope.","I think your master thesis is, as the cool kids say, \"hella dope\"."],["",""]],["parishioner","pә'riʃәnә","n. 教民",["The chaplain listened sympathetically to his parishioner.","In the evening an old woman, a former parishioner, came up to Mr. Lowder, and asked after his rheumatism, and said she hoped he got the bottle."],["",""]],["snail","sneil","n. 蜗牛, 行动迟缓的人, 脑筋迟钝的人, 蜗形凸轮\\nvt. (蜗牛般)缓慢地打发(时间)\\nvi. 缓慢移动",["The snail retreated into its shell.","Today, Tatoeba is slower than a tired snail facing headwind."],["蜗牛缩进壳里去了。",""]],["zeal","zi:l","n. 热心, 热衷, 热诚",["Zeal for your house will consume me.","Obviously we will help but please remember that what decides it in the end is your zeal."],["我為你的殿，心裡焦急，如同火燒。",""]],["rejoin","ri'dʒɒin","vt. 使再结合, 再加入, 回答\\nvi. 重新聚合, 回答, 第二次答辩",["Eagle was on the Moon's surface for 22 hours before it lifted off to rejoin the command module.","I rejoined my friends. When did you rejoin them?"],["","我和朋友們重聚了。你什麼時候跟他們重聚的？"]],["braille","breil","n. 布莱叶点字法(盲人用点字法)\\nvt. 用布莱叶点字法印刷",["Louis Braille, who was blind from the age of three, invented a way for the blind to read.","Blind people read by touching, using a system of raised dots called Braille."],["",""]],["decipher","di'saifә","vt. 译解, 解释\\nn. 密电译文",["Mary, illiterate as she was, was trying to decipher the half-erased hieroglyphics on that sign.","Investigators are trying to decipher what happened."],["",""]],["exemplary","ig'zemplәri","a. 可仿效的, 可做模范的, 惩戒性的, 示范的\\n[法] 惩罚性的, 警戒性的, 示范的",["I must say, his behaviour is exemplary.","He is an exemplary person with an excellent reputation."],["我该说，他的行为是典范。",""]],["electronically","","adv. 电子地",["Therefore, we try to persuade people not to have cash, to have money electronically transferred.","Tom has requested that you electronically sign documents while witnessed by a notary public."],["",""]],["osteoporosis",".ɒstiәupә'rәusis","n. 骨质疏松症\\n[化] 骨质疏松; 骨质疏松症",["My grandmother suffers from osteoporosis.","It appears that older men who eat fruits and vegetables can delay the onset of brittle bone disease known as osteoporosis."],["我外婆患有骨質疏鬆症。",""]],["shattered","","a. 极度疲劳的；破碎的",["The frustrated artist stomped on his failed painting, leaving a trail of shattered colors.","When I tried to set the glass down in the sink my hand slipped and it shattered to pieces."],["畫家失望地踐踏失敗之作，留下一片混亂的色彩。","当我试着把玻璃杯放进水槽时，我的手打了滑，玻璃杯打碎了。"]],["deplete","di'pli:t","vt. 耗尽, 使衰竭\\n[医] 排除, 减少",["Thirty years ago, the international community signed the Montreal Protocol on Substances that Deplete the Ozone Layer and began regulating ozone-depleting compounds."],[""]],["martini","mɑ:'ti:ni","n. 马提尼（一种鸡尾酒, 等于Martini）",["Tom polished off his martini and put the glass on the waiter's tray.","I can't remember the last time I had a martini."],["",""]],["perverse","pә'vә:s","a. 乖张的, 故意作对的, 有悖常情的, 执迷不悟的, 歪曲的, 错误的, 不正当的\\n[法] 邪恶的, 罪恶的:堕落的, 不合法的",["I just bet you were thinking something perverse just now.","Don't think I'm perverse, but I've seen several condoms in her purse."],["",""]],["acoustic","ә'ku:stik","a. 听觉的, 声学的, 音响的\\n[医] 听的; 声学的",["An electric guitar doesn't sound the same as an acoustic one.","It seemed as if the outside world would disappear every time Tom strummed his acoustic guitar."],["電結他的聲音和木結他不同。",""]],["proficiency","prә'fiʃәns","n. 精通, 熟练, 精练",["I've heard it said that there is no way for you to ever reach native proficiency in a language if you haven't started studying it before the age of twelve.","The letters STEP stand for the Society for Testing English Proficiency."],["我聽說，如果沒在十二歲前開始學一個語言，是無法達到母語等級的。",""]],["favorably","'feivәrәbli","adv. 顺利地, 亲切地, 好意地",["Every successful repetition spoke favorably for the quality of the first test.","Heike was pleasantly surprised when Dieter responded favorably to her advances."],["",""]],["standoff","'stændɒf","a. 冷淡的, 有支架的\\nn. 冷淡, 平衡, 和局",["The political landscape of the region turned into a Mexican standoff.","The army imposed martial law in the country Tuesday and insisted the action is not a coup but is instead aimed at resolving the political standoff through dialogue."],["",""]],["coronary","'kɒrәnәri","a. 冠的, 花冠的, 冠状的\\n[医] 冠状的",["Years back, I had a coronary vasospasm that could have led to a heart attack.","The doctor explained that angina is a common symptom of underlying coronary artery disease."],["",""]],["obsessive","әb'sesiv,ɔb-","a. 着迷的",["This problem is the clash of the idol's and obsessive fan's egos.","The conditions that lead to my parents' divorce were engendered by their obsessive attitude toward work."],["",""]],["rhyme","raim","n. 韵, 押韵, 韵文\\nvi. 押韵\\nvt. 使押韵, 用韵诗表达",["It's hard to resist the wish to make the sentence rhyme.","Old English poetry was based on alliteration rather than end rhyme."],["难以抵抗给句子押韵的愿望。",""]],["sincerely","sin'siәli","adv. 真诚地",["I sincerely hope that you will soon recover from your illness.","I sincerely hope you'll give me this second chance."],["",""]],["analogous","ә'nælәgәs","a. 类似的, 相似的\\n[医] 类似的, 类同的",["Specific Impulse can be thought of as a kind of fuel efficiency for rocket engines, analogous to the miles-per-gallon for cars.","In the economic sphere communism is analogous to democracy in the political sphere."],["",""]],["colombian","kә'læmbiәn","n. 哥伦比亚人\\na. 哥伦比亚的",["The Colombian government demanded more money.","Sami Bakir was ambushed, shot, and possibly killed in the Colombian jungle."],["哥伦比亚政府要了更多的钱。",""]],["legion","'li:dʒәn","n. 军团, 军队, 众多的人",["The Foreign Legion committed horrible crimes in Algeria.","Tom has joined The International Legion for the Defense of Ukraine."],["",""]],["patriarchal",".peitri'ɑ:kәl","a. 家长的, 族长的, 由族长统治的\\n[法] 家长的, 家长制的, 主教的",["The patriarchal system has always been more prevalent.","Society's patriarchal norms perpetuate the notion that femininity is inherently weaker or less valuable."],["",""]],["gait","geit","n. 步法, 步态\\nvt. 训练...的步法",["He walks with an awkward gait because of an injury.","From a distance, his gait reminded me of my grandfather."],["",""]],["euro","'juәrәu","n. 欧元（欧盟的统一货币单位）",["Before, when we still had guilders, everything was much cheaper than now with the euro.","At the market such cheese costs only five euro something per kilo."],["",""]],["gleam","gli:m","n. 光束, 微光, 反光\\nvi. 闪烁, 隐约地闪现\\nvt. 使发微光, 使闪烁",["A gleam of real pride quickened most ingenuously in the Older Man's pale blue eyes.","We saw the gleam of a distant lighthouse."],["老人淡藍色的眼睛閃過一絲真誠的驕傲。","我們看到了遠方燈塔的微光。"]],["penguin","'pengwin","n. 企鹅, 空军地勤人员",["The yellow-eyed penguin is the sole extant species in the genus Megadyptes.","Satellite data can help scientists find penguin populations."],["",""]],["accreditation","ә.kredi'teiʃәn","n. 委派, 信托, 鉴定合格\\n[法] 立案, 备案, 任命",["To attain accreditation, the college had to meet 16 standards.","As in other countries, accreditation in the U.S. is a stamp that a college or university meets basic standards."],["",""]],["kosher","'kәuʃә","a. 合犹太人戒律的, 清净的, 合适的",["I wouldn't trust that website, it doesn't seem very kosher.","For kosher meat, I go to a butcher I trust."],["",""]],["caravan","'kærәvæn","n. 旅行队, 有篷顶的大车\\n[经] 商队, 结队商贩",["The Tuareg caravan came loaded with dates and left loaded with salt.","The dogs bark, but the caravan of the Berber language goes on."],["",""]],["highland","'hailәnd","n. 高地, 苏格兰高地",["The city lies on the border between the coastal area and the neighboring highland.","Benedito led his billy goat up the rocky path to graze on the highland grass."],["",""]],["unresolved","'ʌnri'zɔlvd","a. 无决断力的, 不果断的, 无决心的, 未解决的, 未澄清的, 未议决的, 未分解的\\n[计] 非分辩的",["The problem of radioactive waste remains unresolved.","I am an expert when it comes to extracting the truth from any unsaid and unresolved life situations."],["",""]],["depot","'depәu","n. 停车场, 车站, 贮藏所, 仓库\\n[医] 仓库, 贮存, 积存",["The shell fell into the ammunition depot, which provoked a series of explosions.","Claudio stopped at a Home Depot and bought a Christmas tree from there."],["",""]],["locked","lɔkt","a. 上锁的；不灵活的；下定决心的",["Because the entrance was locked, we couldn't enter the house.","Tom always worried about getting locked out of his own apartment."],["由于大门锁着，我们无法入屋。","湯姆總是擔心自己會被鎖在自己公寓外。"]],["gambler","'gæmblә","n. 赌博者, 赌徒\\n[法] 赌徒, 投机商人",["After a streak of bad luck, a persistent gambler will be forced to play for high stakes.","If I had known that he was a gambler, I wouldn't have lent him the money."],["",""]],["sect","sekt","n. 宗派, 教派",["Some Latinos are not Roman Catholic, but Jewish or of some other Christian sect like Mormonism or Jehovah's Witnesses.","I didn't know that depending on which sect they belong to, priests don't necessarily have to shave their head."],["",""]],["sectarian","sek'tєәriәn","a. 宗派的, 党派的, 偏狭的\\nn. 宗派成员, 闹宗派的人",["Sectarian violence is an unwelcome reality for the city's population.","People who talk to you all the time about mosques, Islam and the prophet urge you to normalize sectarian thinking."],["",""]],["resurrection",".rezә'rekʃәn","n. 复活, 复兴, 恢复, 掘墓盗尸\\n[法] 复活, 恢复, 修复",["Easter is a Christian festival that celebrates Jesus' resurrection.","The Christian festival of Easter is the celebration of the resurrection of Jesus Christ."],["",""]],["brittle","'britl","a. 易碎的, 脆弱的, 易坏的\\n[机] 脆的, 脆性的, 易碎的",["After being out in the wind and rain for years and years the walls of this apartment building are weather-beaten and brittle.","It appears that older men who eat fruits and vegetables can delay the onset of brittle bone disease known as osteoporosis."],["",""]],["adept","ә'dept","a. 熟练的, 老练的, 巧妙的\\nn. 能手, 内行",["Hackers are adept at getting around computer security measures.","He seems very interested in musical theatre and the like, and he also seems quite adept."],["黑客很會利用電腦安全措拖的漏洞。","他好像对音乐剧什么的很感兴趣，而且还非常内行。"]],["handmade","'hændmeid","a. 手工的, 手制的",["I bought a handmade dried persimmon in Hsinchu. It tastes sweet but not greasy.","Carlos received a handmade birthday gift from his little sister."],["我在新竹買了一塊手工柿餅，味道甜而不膩。",""]],["handicapped","'hændikæpt","a. 残疾的\\n[法] 有生理缺陷的, 残废的",["\"Especially challenged people\" sounds better than \"handicapped persons\".","Volunteers collected donations for the benefit of the handicapped."],["",""]],["foray","'fɒrei","vi. 侵略, 劫掠, 袭击\\nn. 侵掠, 侵略, 攻击",["Her brief foray into painting produced only one completed work.","Is this your first foray into magic?"],["",""]],["torque","tɒ:k","n. 扭转力, 转矩, 项圈\\n[化] 转矩",["If the torque is too high, the shaft might break. That's why we are using a shear splint as a torque limiter.","You need a longer handle if you want to get more torque."],["",""]],["outdated",".aut'deitid","a. 旧式的, 落伍的, 过时的",["As technology changes, the skills a person possesses upon graduating often become outdated.","The legislators of that state did away with outdated laws."],["",""]],["fragmented","'fræɡmentid","a. 成碎片的；片断的",["The American invasion of Iraq left the country devastated, fragmented and broke.","The fruit must be finely fragmented, before it can go into the press."],["",""]],["coastline","'kәustlain","n. 海岸线",["The long coastline of the city contains sand and gravel.","Somalia has the longest coastline in mainland Africa."],["",""]],["cloudy","'klaudi","a. 多云的, 有愁容的, 云的, 浑浊的\\n[建] (混)浊的",["Tomorrow's weather won't be so good, with cloudy skies, heavy snow, and very cold temperatures.","It's getting cloudy. It may rain soon."],["明天天氣不好，不是晴天，要下雪，很冷。","雲愈來愈多，可能快下雨了。"]],["thrift","θrift","n. 节约, 茂盛, 海石竹",["Tom made a catty joke about Mary's dress being from a thrift shop.","I'd hoped the zine would connect all sort of people who understood how much cooler it was to thrift than to buy new junk."],["",""]],["necessitate","ni'sesiteit","vt. 迫使, 使成为必需, 需要",["School closures due to inclement weather will necessitate extending the school year by three days.","I'm not sure that this will necessitate that."],["",""]],["installment","in'stɒ:lmәnt","n. 就职, 装设, 分期付款\\n[经] 分期付款",["The last installment of this story will come out in the next issue.","The Electoral College's vote formalized the undemocratic installment of the forty-fifth President of the United States."],["",""]],["daycare","'deikεә","n. 日托；日间照管儿童",["Children were recruited from urban daycare centers.","Sami didn't find an affordable daycare for his children."],["",""]],["precipitate","pri'sipiteit","n. 沉淀物, 凝结物, 结果\\nvt. 猛抛, 使陷入, 促成, 使沉淀\\nvi. 猛地落下\\na. 突然的, 猛地落下的, 轻率的",["The clouds thickened and it started to precipitate.","A sudden decline in stock prices could precipitate a financial crisis."],["",""]],["subsistence","sәb'sistәns","n. 生存, 生活\\n[医] 生存",["The power of population is indefinitely greater than the power in the earth to produce subsistence for man.","The subsistence farmer grew so little that there was no room for leftovers."],["",""]],["subtract","sәb'trækt","vt. 减去, 扣掉, 减少\\nvi. 做减法\\n[计] 减",["Subtract three from eight and you get five.","Subtract two from ten and you have eight."],["八减去三就能得到五。","十减二等于八。"]],["nourish","'nә:riʃ","vt. 滋养, 使健壮, 怀有",["The role of the placenta is to nourish the foetus.","It's important to nourish your children with good food."],["胎盘的角色是滋养胎儿。",""]],["slug","slʌg","n. 鼻涕虫, 刺蛾, 懒汉, 弹丸, 金属小块, 重击\\nvi. 偷懒, 动作迟缓\\nvt. 重击",["Tom is a lazy slug! He lets Mary toil away while he himself sits there, enjoying the sunlight.","The boys couldn't agree who tougher, so they decided to slug it out."],["",""]],["ho","hәu","interj. 嗬(表示惊讶或引人注意)\\n[医] 钬(67号元素)",["I love the Dim sims from Tim Ho Wan.","I carried the heavy bags back from the store chanting yo-hee-ho all the way home."],["我爱添好运的点心。",""]],["understandably","","adv. 可懂, 可了解, 可理解",["Yuri's mom understandably lost her crap after seeing the dog in his room.","I've got nothing against waiting, but after two hours I'm feeling understandably a bit impatient."],["",""]],["likeness","'laiknis","n. 相象, 相似物, 样子",["Is there anything more beautiful than a child's smile? Behold God's likeness, the face of infinite Love.","I think the devil doesn't exist, but man has created him, he has created him in his own image and likeness."],["",""]],["strategically","strә'ti:dʒikәli","adv. 在战略上, 颇策略地",["Algeria has a strategically important position in Africa and the Mediterranean region.","Algeria is strategically located between Europe and sub-Saharan Africa."],["",""]],["scold","skәuld","n. 好骂街的人, 责骂\\nv. 责骂",["In such cases, adults should not scold them instantly, but be patient with them, considering their mental growth.","I cannot scold Taninna. She's still a little girl."],["",""]],["hysteria","his'tiәriә","n. 歇斯底里症, 不正常的兴奋, 癔病\\n[医] 癔病, 歇斯底里",["Tom doesn't know the difference between passion and hysteria.","The Goldstone Report created hysteria."],["",""]],["upbringing","'ʌp.briŋiŋ","n. 教养",["A good education doesn't imply a good upbringing.","The children had the benefit of a good upbringing."],["虽说是高学历，也未必就有教养。",""]],["sixteenth","'siks'ti:nθ","num. 第十六, 十六分之一",["If I remember correctly, I was given this amplifier as a present for my sixteenth birthday.","In Shakespeare's time, in the sixteenth century, tennis was very popular at the English court."],["",""]],["intolerance","in'tɒlәrәns","n. 不宽容, 偏狭, 不容许相反的言论\\n[医] 不耐[性]",["In the name of tolerance, we should reserve the right not to tolerate intolerance.","Beer fatigues you because it causes a food intolerance and an immune response. It's not the alcohol."],["",""]],["drinker","'driŋkә","n. 饮者, 酒徒",["He's not a big drinker, but his friends all like to drink, so he often gets drunk.","You could get into the Guinness Book of World Records as the heaviest drinker."],["他不太能喝酒，但是朋友都喜欢喝，所以他往往会喝醉。",""]],["festivity","fes'tiviti","n. 节日, 喜庆日, 欢宴, 欢庆",["Once the festivity finishes, we'll go back to work.","April 20 is not a day of festivity, it's a day of commemoration."],["",""]],["reflex","'ri:fleks","n. 反射, 反射光, 映像\\na. 反射的, 折转的\\nvt. 使折转, 使折回",["Thank you very much. Thank you for activating my gag reflex.","To me helping is a normal thing, a reflex, if you will, like breathing."],["",""]],["rebuilding","","n. 重建",["Sami spent the next years rebuilding a life nearly destroyed by the accident.","Now that the war is over, we need to start rebuilding."],["",""]],["barrage","'bærɑ:dʒ","n. 弹幕, 掩护炮火\\nvt. 以密集炮火进攻",["The minister had to face a barrage of questions from the press.","The conservationist is against the building of a tidal barrage across the Severn estuary."],["",""]],["inspiring","in'spaiәriŋ","a. 鼓舞人心的",["She's a strange, enigmatic and inspiring poet.","The vast loneliness is awe-inspiring and it makes you realize just what you have back there on Earth."],["她是一个奇怪，神秘和鼓舞人心的诗人。",""]],["slowdown","'slәudaun","n. 降低速度, 减速",["We should not use foreign workers as a buffer against Japan's economic slowdown.","Japan's foreign aid is decreasing in part because of an economic slowdown at home."],["",""]],["conglomerate","kәn'glɒmәrit","a. 聚成球形的, 砾岩性的\\nn. 集成物, 混合体, 砾岩\\nv. (使)凝聚成团",["Drop by drop, the water can conglomerate into a lake.","Jeff was very upset when an international food conglomerate introduced the \"JEFF Ready Sandwich Spread.\""],["一滴滴水能聚成湖泊。",""]],["rust","rʌst","n. 锈, 生锈, 衰退\\nvi. 生锈, 衰退\\nvt. 使生锈, 腐蚀",["A bicycle will rust if you leave it in the rain.","The body is weakened by laziness just as iron is weakened by rust."],["如果你把自行車留在雨中，它會生鏽的。",""]],["cheerleader","'tʃiәli:dә","n. 啦啦队长",["Jonathan Chait was a cheerleader for the War in Iraq, and he continues to be smugly wrong about everything.","I can't believe that you were a cheerleader."],["",""]],["township","'taunʃip","n. 小镇, 镇区\\n[法] 镇区, 乡",["Lucy was the shyest and most beautiful of all the girls in the land, and Caroll was the bravest and noblest of all the boys in the township."],[""]],["insulate","'insjuleit","vt. 使绝缘, 隔离\\n[医] 绝缘",["You'll end up getting an electric shock if you don't insulate that wire."],[""]],["honorary","'ɒnәrәri","a. 荣誉的, 无报酬的, 道义上的\\n[法] 名誉的, 荣誉的",["This is the list of decorations, awards, and honorary titles.","The rank of Marshal, now honorary, is awarded only in times of war or under exceptional circumstances."],["",""]],["disproportionate",".disprә'pɒ:ʃәnit","a. 不成比例的",["This big gate is disproportionate to the small garden.","People on lower incomes spend a disproportionate amount of their income on rent."],["",""]],["consolation",".kɒnsә'leiʃәn","n. 安慰, 令人安慰的事物\\n[法] 安慰, 慰问",["She turned to her writing of poetry, as a kind of consolation.","Victory in the competition was no consolation to her."],["",""]],["dissatisfied","","a. 不满的, 显出不满的",["If you're so dissatisfied with what I'm doing, you'd be better off doing it yourself.","The public at large are dissatisfied with the present government."],["你要是這麼不滿意我做的，自己來做好了。",""]],["operative","'ɒpәrәtiv","a. 动作的, 运转的, 有效的, 关键的, 手术的\\nn. 技工, 侦探",["An undercover operative infiltrated the organization.","Mary's post-operative abdominal pain was caused by the surgeon leaving a surgical instrument inside her."],["",""]],["englishman","'iŋgliʃmәn","n. 英国人",["An Englishman would not use such a word.","Hearing him speak English, one would take him for an Englishman."],["英國人是不會用這樣的字的。",""]],["transmitter","træns'mitә","n. 传送者, 传达人, (疾病的)传播者\\n[计] 发散机; 发送器",["The transmitter on Voyager was not reachable due to solar winds.","The scientists attached a transmitter to the giraffe's ear."],["",""]],["bailout","'beilaut","跳伞",["Why do the largest banks need the biggest bailout?","How confident are you that the bailout bill will stabilize the economy?"],["",""]],["ion","'aiәn","n. 离子\\n[化] 离子",["Suffixes, 1: \"-ion\" creates nouns that show the meaning of 'action, state, process, results,' and so on.","The computer whose keyboard was bought by Ion was locked."],["",""]],["hacker","'hækә","[计] 计算机窃贼, 计算机新技术挑战者, 黑客",["The hacker gained access to sensitive files in the company's database.","It's unlikely that a hacker could get into our website."],["",""]],["curricular","kә'rikjulә","a. 课程的",["Mrs. Tanaka, the new teacher, is offering Japanese as an extra curricular activity twice a week to interested students.","Such extra-curricular classes are available only for children who have difficulties in science."],["",""]],["anthology","æn'θɒlәdʒi","n. 选集, 诗选",["He compiled a Japanese folklore anthology for use in schools.","Tom put his book of Chuck Norris facts on the shelf next to his anthology of lolcats."],["",""]],["vacancy","'veikәnsi","n. 空, 空白, 空缺, 空虚, 空闲\\n[化] 空位",["Those interested in the employment vacancy can send their resume to the human resources e-mail.","Bring me your resume. I told you there's a vacancy at my office."],["",""]],["imprint","im'print","vt. 印, 铭刻\\nn. 印, 印记, 特征, 痕迹, 版本说明",["The military and moral-political defeat of the fascist aggressors left a deep imprint on the minds of the peoples of the world.","Ziri saw the imprint of a large animal lying in the snow."],["",""]],["supplemental",".sʌpli'mentl","a. 补足的, 追加的\\n[医] 补充的, 补足的",["Good personal investments may provide supplemental income in retirement."],[""]],["audition","ɒ:'diʃәn","n. 听, 听力, 试听\\n[计] 审计命令",["Tom is preparing for his audition at the conservatory.","You have to have an audition before you can join the choir."],["",""]],["receptionist","ri'sepʃәnist","n. 接待员",["The receptionist forced me to sign my name on the paper.","They stayed in the hotel where I am a receptionist."],["",""]],["sealed","si:ld","a. 未知的, 密封的\\n[法] 盖印的, 经盖章批准或证实的, 密封的",["Police immediately sealed off the streets around the hotel as they searched for the bomb.","The human heart has hidden treasures, in secret kept, in silence sealed."],["",""]],["addictive","ә'diktiv","a. 上瘾的",["I think that, as he's using addictive substances like thinner, the chance of rehabilitation is low.","Vaping isn't as harmful as smoking, but it's still addictive and unwise to do."],["",""]],["unbearable",".ʌn'bєәrәbl","a. 无法忍受的, 承受不住的",["Dan left Linda when life became unbearable with her.","When the wound got infected, he experienced a bout of unbearable pain."],["Dan离开了Linda，因为已经没法和她一起过日子了。","伤口发炎后，他感到难忍无比的剧痛。"]],["portuguese",".pɒ:tju'gi:z","n. 葡萄牙人, 葡萄牙语\\na. 葡萄牙的, 葡萄牙人的, 葡萄牙语的",["Nick can speak Portuguese very well. That's because he's been studying it for 5 years.","The original edition is great, but the Portuguese translation contains errors."],["Nick说葡萄牙语说得很好。那是因为他学了有5年了。","原版很好，然而葡萄牙语译文有误。"]],["notoriously","","adv. 臭名昭著的, 声名狼藉的",["Intonation is a notoriously difficult part of a foreign language to acquire.","New York is a city notoriously short on space, but also one whose residents are big on innovation."],["",""]],["packing","'pækiŋ","n. 包装, 填垫材料, 封函, 行李\\n[化] 填充物; 填料; 填充; 装柱; 装色谱柱; 垫革; 紧束; 敛集; 堆积",["I was busy packing, because I was leaving for France in two days.","She was able to be ready early this morning, because she finished packing last night."],["我当时正忙着打包，因为我两天后要去法国。","她昨晚已經收拾好行李，所以今天早上沒費多少工夫就準備好出門。"]],["projector","prә'dʒektә","n. 计划人, 发起人, 规划人, 放映机, 映画器, 幻灯机, 幻灯, 探照灯, 发射器\\n[计] 投影仪",["What's wrong with this projector? It won't display anything.","He used the projector to show his presentation to the manager."],["這個投影儀怎麼了？什麼都放不出來。",""]],["wares","","n. 货物, 商品\\n[经] 商品, 货物",["If fools did not go to market, bad wares would not be sold.","The old man wanders from town to town peddling his wares."],["",""]],["polymer","'pɒlimә","n. 聚合物, 聚合体\\n[化] 多聚体; 高分子; 大分子; 聚合物",["Every protein is a polymer composed of units called amino acids.","The elasticity of this polymer isn't the best suited to our ends."],["",""]],["prehistoric","'pri:his'tɔrik","a. 历史以前的, 史前的",["NEFU is considered the premier center for research into woolly mammoths and other prehistoric, ice age species.","Prehistoric figurines have been interpreted in many different ways."],["",""]],["eloquent","'elәkwәnt","a. 雄辩的, 有口才的, 有说服力的",["We were deeply impressed by the lecturer's eloquent speech.","Tom certainly is an eloquent speaker."],["演讲者精彩的演说给我们留下了深刻的印象。","汤姆的确是个很会讲话的人。"]],["nicotine","'nikәti:n","n. 烟碱, 尼古丁\\n[化] 烟碱; 尼古丁",["I'm getting a bit of a nicotine buzz.","He said that his previous dentist told him that he'd remove nicotine stains if he stopped smoking."],["我有點醉菸。",""]],["globally","","[计] 全局地",["The number of people with diabetes is rising globally.","Globally, around 26 million tons of plastic ends up in the ocean every year."],["",""]],["nongovernmental","nɒnɡʌvnmenlt","a. 非政府的, 非政治（上）的; 草野; 民间",["Whale Stranding Indonesia, a nongovernmental organization, says in 2020 more than 70 marine mammals were found stranded, including dugongs, which are medium-sized marine mammals that are related to manatees."],[""]],["regiment","'redʒimәnt","n. （军队）团, 大量（人或物）\\nv. 组编成团，组织，严格管制",["It was the dragoon regiment of Count O'Reilly that by a splendid charge saved the remnant of the Austrian army at Austerlitz.","The twelfth infantry regiment suffered great losses during this skirmish."],["",""]],["ascent","ә'sent","n. 上升, 提高, 攀登, 上坡路",["The Alpinists carried out the ascent, but they did not return safely.","The economic development of Algeria will be an arduous ascent."],["登山者成功登上了山頂，但回程時卻出了意外。",""]],["apricot","'eiprikɒt","n. 杏子, 杏树, 杏黄色\\na. 杏黄色的",["A pluot is a cross between a Japanese plum and an apricot.","Ziri snatched the apricot out of Rima's hand and ate it."],["",""]],["quaint","kweint","a. 古雅的, 离奇有趣的, 奇怪的",["The quaint little antique shop is full of unique trinkets, knick-knacks, and curios.","A minute later we were all seated in a comfortable landau, and were rattling through the quaint old Devonshire city."],["",""]],["seedling","'si:dliŋ","n. 秧苗, 树苗\\n[医] 籽苗, 幼苗, 实生苗",["At the foot of the palm tree there grows a palm seedling.","It's the oldest tree seedling nursery run by the U.S. Department of Agriculture's Forest Service."],["",""]],["herring","'heriŋ","n. 青鱼, 鲱",["The police followed a red herring while they let the true criminal escape.","In order to distract the others, we brought up this irrelevant issue as a red herring."],["",""]],["nigger","'nigә","n. 黑人, 社会地位低下的人, 深棕色\\n[法] 被歧视者, 有黑人血统者",["I ain't got no quarrel with them Viet Cong. No Viet Cong ever called me nigger.","The word \"nigger\" is an offensive term."],["",""]],["tofu","'tәufu:","n. 豆腐",["On the weekend, our whole family went to eat Sichuan food and ordered mapo tofu and husband-and-wife lung slices.","She's vegetarian, so she ate tofu instead of turkey."],["週末我們全家去吃四川菜，點了麻婆豆腐和夫妻肺片。","她是素食者，所以她沒吃火雞，而是吃了豆腐。"]],["thirsty","'θә:sti","a. 口渴的, 渴望的, 干燥的",["Feel free to get yourself a drink if you are thirsty.","I am so thirsty, probably because I ate pizza yesterday night."],["觉得渴了就喝点。","我渴死了，可能是因為我昨天晚上吃了比薩。"]],["anecdotal",",ænek'dәutl","a. 轶事的, 爱谈奇闻轶事的, 多轶事的",["The four books already mentioned, Matthew, Mark, Luke, and John, are altogether anecdotal.","Your examples are cherry-picked, nothing more than anecdotal evidence."],["",""]],["tapestry","'tæpistri","n. 挂毯, 绒绣\\nvt. 用挂毯装饰",["The best thing on translation was said by Cervantes: translation is the other side of a tapestry.","Halley's comet is depicted inside the Bayeux Tapestry."],["",""]],["skid","skid","vt. 刹住, 滚滑\\nvi. 打滑\\nn. 刹车, 滑动垫木",["Tom slammed on the brakes and the car began to skid.","To some extent, you can control the car in a skid."],["湯姆猛踩煞車，汽車開始打滑。",""]],["smoked","smәukt","a. 熏制的",["Lost in thought, Tom watched the sky as he smoked a cigarette.","Claudio had long hair and smoked pot."],["汤姆出神地一边看着天空一边吸着香烟。","克勞迪奧留著長髮，而且抽大麻。"]],["hospice","'hɒspis","n. 旅客住宿处, 收容所",["Cancer is the leading cause for hospice care.","A cheerful ray of sun draws shadows on the window sill of a private room prepared for the next terminally ill patient at upscale Wits Hospice in Houghton, Johannesburg."],["",""]],["adjective","'ædʒiktiv","n. 形容词\\na. 形容词的, 从属的",["Things that modify nouns (adjective, or adjectival equivalent).","This adjective is used to describe women."],["修飾名詞的東西（形容詞，或形容詞相等語）。","这个形容词是用来形容女人的。"]],["oasis","әu'eisis","n. 绿洲, 舒适的地方\\n[医] 绿洲(沙漠中), 健岛(病变区中的健康组织)",["Your gift was like discovery of an oasis in the midst of a desert.","Ziri looked across the desert and saw a distant oasis."],["",""]],["brilliance","'briljәns","n. 卓越, 光辉\\n[电] 辉度",["Every time I saw him, I was overcome with his brilliance.","The sun rose from the water in radiant brilliance and his rosy beams seemed to cast a glow of life into the prince's cheeks."],["",""]],["scarlet","'skɑ:lit","n. 猩红色, 绯红色, 红衣\\na. 绯红色的, 鲜红色的",["Afterwards his brother came out, on whose hand was the scarlet thread: and she called his name Zara.","The sun burns within scarlet clusters of mountain ash, and the earth greets the new day."],["",""]],["aquarium","ә'kwєәriәm","n. 水族馆, 养鱼池, 水草缸\\n[医] 培养缸",["I needed to add water to my aquarium.","This aquarium has a closed loop water circulation system."],["我需要往我的鱼缸里加水。",""]],["misfortune","mis'fɒ:tʃәn","n. 不幸, 灾祸, 坏运气\\n[法] 不幸事故, 不幸, 灾祸",["Years of resistance to misfortune ended when the settlers' village was overcome by the savages and their hopes and lives came to the bitter end.","What greater misfortune is there than to go blind?"],["当移居者的村庄被野蛮人征服后，他们的希望和生活到了痛苦的尽头，数年对灾祸的抵抗结束了。","有什么比失明更不幸的呢？"]],["hostess","'hәustis","n. 女主人, 女房东, 女老板",["The hostess couldn't possibly put up with his arrogance.","The hostess couldn't possibly tolerate his arrogance."],["",""]],["abuser","","n. 滥用者",["Amber Heard fought back against her abuser; this is a good thing.","Johnny Depp is best friends with fellow abuser Marilyn Manson."],["",""]],["inception","in'sepʃәn","n. 起初, 获得学位",["Tatoeba's popularity has been growing exponentially since the day of its inception.","Matrix, Inception and Interstellar are my favorite movies."],["",""]],["clad","klæd","vt. 在金属外包上另一种金属\\na. 包层金属的\\nclothe的过去式和过去分词",["A steep curve of heath-clad land, an outlying spur of the moor, lay in front of us.","Sitting in her panther hide chair, the young woman, clad in red lingerie, was reading aloud a book titled \"The Black Princess\"."],["",""]],["reverence","'revәrәns","n. 尊敬, 敬重, 敬礼, 尊严, 威望\\nvt. 崇敬, 敬畏, 尊敬",["There is a place in this world where we cannot and must not set foot. Knowing of this existence, to accept it and show it the greatest reverence is the first step to belief.","I felt profound reverence for the courageous mother."],["在这个世界上，有一个我们不能涉足、不该涉足的领域。认识到这样的存在并接受它，对它表示绝对的敬意，是一切信仰的第一步。",""]],["winery","'wainәri","n. 葡萄酒厂",["The winery offers tours with Adriano as the guide.","Benedito and Melissa's fourth date was at a winery."],["",""]],["telling","'teliŋ","a. 有效的, 显著的, 显露内心活动的",["I've no way of telling whether or not what he says is true.","Tom doesn't know whether Mary is telling the truth or not."],["我无法判断他的话是真是假。","汤姆不知道玛丽说的是真话还是假话。"]],["balk","bɒ:k","n. 障碍, 错误, 失败\\nvt. 阻止, 错过, 推诿\\nvi. 逡巡不前",["Legends of vampires flourish in the Balkans."],[""]],["monstrous","'mɒnstrәs","a. 巨大的, 畸形的, 怪异的\\n[法] 巨大的, 异形的, 畸形的:荒诞的",["Lukas shot Rima as she transformed into something more monstrous.","The prisoners were treated with monstrous cruelty."],["",""]],["obese","әu'bi:s","a. 肥胖的\\n[医] 肥胖的",["About 65% of American adults are obese, which is harmful to their health.","Sixty-nine percent of adult Americans are either overweight or obese."],["美國約 65% 成年人肥胖，這不利於對他們的健康。","69%的美国成人超重或肥胖。"]],["thoughtfully","","adv. 沉思地；体贴地, 亲切地",["Please take your rubbish with you and dispose of it thoughtfully.","After I finished my story, my neighbor looked at me silently and thoughtfully for a time."],["",""]],["lecturer","'lektʃәrә","n. 演讲者, 讲师\\n[法] 讲演人, 讲课人, 讲师",["The lecturer spoke generally about American literature and specifically about Faulkner.","The lecturer couldn't get his message across to the audience."],["",""]],["profess","prә'fes","vt. 声称, 以...为业, 伪称, 讲授\\nvi. 表白, 承认, 当教授",["About 1.2 billion people worldwide profess Catholicism - the world's largest Christian faith.","I do profess to be no less than I seem."],["",""]],["unintended","'ʌnin'tendid","a. 不是存心的, 无心的, 非故意的",["This had some unintended consequences for Algeria.","This could have unintended consequences."],["",""]],["jihad","dʒi'hɑ:d","n. 讨伐异教徒, 拥护运动",["Whatever one may say, the jihad against the \"disbelievers\" is well prescribed by the Qur'an.","ISIS terrorists are known for killing one another in the name of jihad."],["",""]],["moratorium",".mɒrә'tɒ:riәm","n. 延期偿付, 暂停\\n[法] 延期偿付, 延缓履行, 延期偿还期",["Kazakhstan declared a moratorium on capital punishment.","Scientists and environmentalists are urging an international moratorium on deep-sea mining."],["",""]],["ore","ɒ:","n. 矿石\\n[经] 矿",["Analysts warn that China could cut steel production, which would further depress iron ore prices.","Iran is rich in mineral resources, including zinc, copper, gold, and iron ore."],["",""]],["estimation",".esti'meiʃәn","n. 判断, 估计, 尊重\\n[化] 估计; 估定; 测定; 估值",["Your estimation of him is a little high, to say the least.","You must not base your estimation of a person on rumor alone."],["",""]],["headnote","'hednәut","n. 前言, 眉注, (写在判决书或报告前面的)提要",["Read the headnote before studying the case."],["研讀案例前先看判決要旨。"]],["sprig","sprig","n. 小树枝, 无头钉\\nvt. 用小树枝装饰, 用钉子钉上, 使蔓生",["I bought a sprig of lily of the valley.","I took a sprig of holly, and tucked it into my hat band."],["我買了一小枝鈴蘭。",""]],["pharmacist","'fɑ:mәsist","n. 药师, 药品商, 药商, 药剂师\\n[医] 药师, 调剂员, 药商",["Even if your friend is a doctor and your cousin is a pharmacist, you will still have to die.","You should consult with a pharmacist before buying that medicine."],["就算你朋友是醫生、堂表親是藥劑師，該死的時候還是得死。","你在买这药之前应该问一下药剂师的建议。"]],["monologue","'mɔnәlɔ^","n. 独白, 独脚戏, 独白场面, (非正式)(贬)滔滔不绝的话",["A person's silent discussion with themselves is called \"inner monologue\".","Don't heckle during the show. It's a monologue, not a dialogue."],["",""]],["feud","fju:d","n. 不和, 封地, 争执\\nvi. 长期不和, 擦亮",["Florida taxpayers are paying for Ron DeSantis's legal fees in his feud with Disney.","If you live in the water, do not feud with the fishes."],["",""]],["convertible","kәn'vә:tәbl","a. 可改变的, 可交换的\\nn. 有活动篷的汽车",["I'd like to drive across the USA in a convertible car.","Mennad gave his son a brand new convertible Mercedes."],["",""]],["embryonic",".embri'ɒnik","a. 萌芽的, 初期的, 未成熟\\n[医] 胚胎的",["The neural crest is found in embryonic structures.","The umbilical cord develops by the fifth week of embryonic development, replacing the yolk sac as the embryo's nutrient source."],["",""]],["casserole","'kæsәrәul","n. 餐桌上用有盖的焙盘, 砂锅菜\\n[化] 勺皿",["I chopped the onions and put them in a casserole with butter and oil.","There's nothing more delicious than a seafood casserole."],["",""]],["audible","'ɒ:dәbl","a. 听得见的\\n[电] 可闻的",["Tom was so shy that he didn't even look at Mary when he asked her in a thin, barely audible voice whether she might possibly consider going to the cinema with him.","Airplanes are audible long before they are visible."],["湯姆害羞到當他用細小的、幾乎聽不見的聲音問瑪麗她是否願意和他一起去影院時，看都沒看她一眼。",""]],["beaten","'bi:tn","a. 被打败了的, 筋疲力竭的, 敲平的, 踏平的\\nbeat的过去分词",["Few things are more enraging to me than the sight of an animal being beaten.","He was beaten to within an inch of his life."],["沒有甚麼比看見動物被虐打更能惹起我的怒火。","他被殴打得快死。"]],["behaviour","bi'heivjә","n. 行为, 举止\\n[计] 特性, 性能, 特点, 行为, 动作, 状态",["Youths who are caught violating the new rules on behaviour will lose their right to free travel, and will have to complete unpaid community work to earn it back.","I must say, his behaviour is exemplary."],["被判严重违反新的行为准则的青少年将失去免费乘坐公交车的权利，如果想重新取得必须做无报酬的社区工作。","我该说，他的行为是典范。"]],["disgrace","dis'greis","n. 耻辱, 不名誉\\nvt. 使受耻辱, 使失体面",["When the granaries are full, people observe rules of decorum; when food and clothing are sufficient, people understand honor and disgrace.","What you did brought disgrace on the whole class."],["粮仓充实了，百姓才会懂得礼仪规矩；衣食丰足了，人们才会知晓荣辱羞耻。","你的行为使全班的人丢脸。"]],["resurgence","ri'sә:dʒәns","n. 再起, 复活, 再现",["We see a resurgence of the wildlife.","The resurgence of the coronavirus in many countries is driven in part by younger people letting down their guard during the Northern Hemisphere summer."],["",""]],["squirm","skә:m","vi. 蠕动, 辗转不安\\nn. 蠕动",["Seeing all the worms wriggling on the corpse made me squirm all over.","Don't squirm, the doctor told patient before sticking a scary-looking needle into his arm."],["",""]],["grad","ɡræd","n. 毕业生；校友",["Yuriko, a marine biology grad student, fell asleep inside a fish tank and awoke covered in octopuses and starfish.","One professor in my grad school found a student plagiarizing and automatically gave that student a zero."],["",""]],["pixel","'piksәl","n. 像素\\n[计] 象素",["Tom's new camera can take images with much higher pixel counts than his old one could.","My phone's screen has a broken pixel."],["",""]],["fledgling","'fledʒliŋ","n. 羽毛初长的雏鸟, 刚会飞的幼鸟, 无经验的人",["It's a fledgling technology but it shows great promise.","Algeria has a fledgling tourist industry."],["",""]],["brilliantly","'brijәntli","adv. 辉煌地, 光亮地, 灿烂地",["Quasars are brilliantly shining heavenly bodies that are extremely far away.","I think Griffith conducts the orchestra brilliantly."],["",""]],["pantry","'pæntri","n. 餐具室, 食品室",["Could you please find the missing key. I can't open the pantry.","Her sewing basket, dresser drawers and pantry shelves are all systematically arranged in apple-pie order."],["你能帮忙寻找丢失的钥匙吗? 我打不开食品柜。",""]],["anew","ә'nju:","adv. 重新, 再",["We have to demolish the whole building because of the foundation and to build everything anew.","If someone can't remember his past, he's doomed to experience it anew."],["",""]],["rbi",",ɑ:bi:'ai,'ribi","abbr.[棒球] Run Batted In ,打点",["The batter drove in two runs for an RBI."],["打者打回兩分，獲得一分打點。"]],["fuse","fju:z","n. 保险丝, 导火线\\nv. 熔化, 融合",["No sooner had Tom turned on the TV than the fuse blew.","The fuse blows or the circuit breaker is often activated."],["湯姆一打開電視，保險絲就燒了。",""]],["fabricate","'fæbrikeit","vt. 制造, 建造, 装配, 伪造",["That she could fabricate writings is certain, because she could write.","Some like to fabricate distinctions between a lady and a woman."],["",""]],["sow","sau. sәu","n. 母猪, 懒胖女人\\nvt. 播种, 散布, 使密布\\nvi. 播种",["You know the phrase, we reap what we sow. I have sown the wind and this is my storm.","As the saying goes, \"You reap what you sow\", and yet another says that luck plays an important role in success too!"],["你也知道那句話，「善有善報，惡有惡報」。我搧的風，現在火就來了。","俗話說：一分耕耘、一分收穫；可俗話又說：人無橫財不富、馬無夜草不肥！"]],["modernize","'mɒdәnaiz","vi. 现代化\\nvt. 使现代化",["China is working to modernize its weapons program.","China is helping Algeria modernize its infrastructure."],["",""]],["disapproval",".disә'pru:vәl","n. 不赞成",["They communicate disapproval by shaking their heads.","I glared at him with a blatant look of disapproval on my face."],["",""]],["tendon","'tendәn","n. 腱\\n[医] 腱",["About four years ago my Achilles tendon started to hurt and I was told it was Achilles tendonitis.","The tendon is a connection between the muscle and the bone."],["",""]],["avocado",".ævәu'kɑ:dou","n. 鳄梨, 鳄梨树",["I enjoy a veggie burger with avocado.","I don't have a food processor, so I use a fork to puree my avocado for guacamole, and it works just fine."],["我喜歡吃加酪梨的素食漢堡。",""]],["gnp","dʒi:en'pi:","国民生产总值\\n[经] 国民生产毛额",["The third quarter GNP growth was 1% over the preceding quarter.","GNP is measured as the total market value of all the goods and service produced by a nation during a specified period."],["第三季國民生產總值較上一季成長了1％。",""]],["getaway","'^etә,wei","n. 逃走, 起步",["A sunny weekend is perfect for a mountain getaway.","Tom used his secluded cabin in the woods as a getaway from his hectic life as a company director."],["",""]],["plaid","plæd","n. 格子花呢披风, 格子花呢, 格子图案",["Tom was wearing an ugly plaid jacket and a polka-dot tie.","When they wear plaid, fat people often look fatter."],["",""]],["complexion","kәm'plekʃn","n. 肤色, 情况, 局面\\n[医] 体质; 面色, 面容",["She's got a fair complexion while her brother is very dark.","A stocky man with a swarthy complexion snatched Mary's handbag and disappeared into the crowd."],["",""]],["wrench","'rentʃ","n. 扳钳, 扳手, 扭伤, 歪曲, 痛苦\\nvt. 猛扭, 扭伤, 曲解, 折磨\\nvi. 猛扭, 猛绞",["Factional in-fighting threw a monkey wrench into the deliberations.","The astronaut lost his grip on the wrench and all he could do was watch in dismay as it floated serenely away."],["",""]],["sublime","sә'blaim","a. 高尚的, 壮观的, 卓越的\\nv. 提高, (使)变高尚, (使)纯化, (使)升华\\nn. 庄严, 崇高, 顶点",["His martial arts prowess has already reached a level of sublime perfection.","From the sublime to the laughable is just one step."],["他的武功已经达到了出神入化的境界。",""]],["trusted","","a. 可信的；受信任的",["Had I known more about his character, I would not have trusted him.","If she had trusted you, she wouldn't have done so."],["",""]],["collateral","kә'lætәrәl","a. 并行的, 附随的, 旁系的\\nn. 旁系亲属, 担保品",["We'll use the house as collateral so we can borrow some money.","\"Collateral damage\" is a euphemism for killing innocent people to protect capital."],["",""]],["stoop","stu:p","n. 佝偻, 屈从, 弯腰\\nvi. 弯下, 屈从, 弯腰, 堕落\\nvt. 使屈从, 使弯曲",["Ziri never thought Rima would stoop so low and take her anger out on his four-year-old son.","There is no means you won't stoop to, isn't that right."],["",""]],["unused",".ʌn'ju:zd","a. 不用的, 不在使用的, 从未用过的",["There's an old, unused flowerpot and a watering can laying on the balcony.","As the contents of our ragbag were to be sold, the rags were laid on a table in an unused room."],["",""]],["ecstatic","ik'stætik","n. 狂喜的人\\na. 狂喜的",["I was elated, ecstatic and extremely surprised that we were successful.","We individualised ourselves from the ecstatic crowd."],["",""]],["waive","weiv","vt. 不坚持要求, 放弃, 推迟考虑, 丢弃\\n[经] 放弃权利, 免除, 弃权人",["Tom does not want to waive his right to a jury trial.","Biden has been under immense pressure to waive vaccine patents, one of his campaign promises."],["",""]],["paramedic","'pærәmedik","n. 伞兵军医, 伞降急救人员",["Tom was the first paramedic on the scene of the accident.","The paramedic said there was no safe way to move Tom."],["",""]],["thaw","θɒ:","n. 融解, 融化, 解冻时期\\nvt. 使融解, 使缓和\\nvi. 融化, 解冻",["The hoarfrost hasn't yet begun to thaw.","The hoarfrost has not begun to thaw yet."],["霜還沒有開始溶化。","霜還沒有開始溶化。"]],["aye","ai","n. 赞成票, 投赞成票者\\nadv. 永远\\ninterj. (表决时说)赞成",["All in favor of this proposition will please say Aye.","Aye, what a pity! I thought it would clear up finally."],["",""]],["disintegrate","dis'intigreit","vt. (使)分解, (使)碎裂\\n[医] 分解, 分裂, 蜕变",["A plastic bag can take up to a thousand years to disintegrate.","The parish register is so old that if you touch the pages the paper will disintegrate."],["",""]],["hardy","'hɑ:di","a. 难的, 艰苦的, 坚硬的, 勇敢的\\nadv. 努力地, 辛苦地, 坚硬地",["I assure you that there is a reign of terror in the district, and that it is a hardy man who will cross the moor at night.","Stan Laurel was \"the thin one\"; Oliver Hardy was \"the fat one\"."],["",""]],["obliterate","ә'blitәreit","vt. 擦去, 冲刷(掉), 消灭, 忘掉, 盖销(邮票等)\\n[法] 灭迹, 消灭, 涂抹",["This threatens to obliterate all the progress we have made over the years.","Layla wanted to obliterate the memory of Fadil's first wife."],["",""]],["infiltrate","in'filtreit","vt. 使浸润, 使潜入, 使渗入\\nvi. 渗入\\nn. 渗透物",["They will infiltrate our network unless we do something to stop them.","Yanni was hired by an extremist Christian sect to infiltrate Muslims and mislead them."],["",""]],["decency","'di:sәnsi","n. 得体, 礼貌, 正派\\n[法] 正当, 正派, 合乎礼仪",["He didn't have the decency to admit that he was wrong.","Tom didn't even have the decency to say it was his fault."],["",""]],["brandy","'brændi","n. 白兰地酒\\n[化] 白兰地",["The Spanish make a type of brandy with the fruits of the strawberry tree.","On a busy Friday night, in Diak's restaurant, some customers are enjoying slow-roasted pork loin with quince and mashed potatoes, baked apple, and brandy butter sauce."],["西班牙人用草莓樹的果實釀造一種白蘭地。","在一個繁忙的星期五晚上，迪亞克的餐廳裡，一些顧客正在享用慢烤豬里肌配榅桲、馬鈴薯泥；烤蘋果；以及白蘭地黃油醬。"]],["notwithstanding",".nɒtwiθ'stændiŋ","adv. 虽然, 尽管\\nprep. 尽管\\nconj. 虽然",["Notwithstanding the fact that on average women are more intelligent than men, most geniuses are men.","She danced on and on, notwithstanding that every time her foot touched the ground it was like treading on sharp knives."],["",""]],["forestry","'fɒristri","n. 林学, 森林地\\n[法] 林地, 林学, 林业",["The Forestry Service limits the number of mushrooms one may pick at National Forests and also requires that a permit be obtained.","Every day, this 42-year-old forestry warden takes his 11-year-old son and his 5-year-old daughter home from school on his moped."],["",""]],["rover","'rәuvә","n. 漂泊者, 流浪者, 海盗\\n[法] 流浪者, 海盗, 海盗船",["NASA's Perseverance rover has successfully landed on Mars.","NASA's Mars rover discovered traces of a river bed."],["",""]],["internship","'intә:nʃip","n. 实习医师的职务\\n[医] 实习医师职位, 实习医师期",["An internship is a way for many students to explore different careers and gain valuable skills during their education.","Internship candidates must have five years of experience."],["",""]],["enlightened","in'laitnd","a. 有知识的, 进步的, 文明的",["The most enlightened way of living is to despise social conventions while at the same time living your life in conformity to them.","He enlightened me on how I should attack the subject."],["最光明的处世方法是既蔑视社会的因袭，又过着与社会的因袭不相矛盾的生活。",""]],["extravagant","ik'strævgәnt","a. 奢侈的, 挥霍无度的, 浪费的",["This diamond ring is too extravagant for me.","Sami wasn't ready to part ways with his extravagant lifestyle."],["我覺得這鑽石戒指太奢侈了。",""]],["testosterone","te'stɒstәrәun","n. 睾丸激素\\n[化] 睾酮",["Some of the adverse effects of testosterone treatment may be popping up now.","A high level of testosterone will drive your red blood cell count up."],["",""]],["belgian","'beldʒәn","n. 比利时人\\na. 比利时的",["At this time of the year, all Belgian students are on revision break.","The Dutch and the Belgian tricolour were streaming side by side amiably in the village on the border."],["",""]],["cub","kʌb","n. 幼兽, 年轻人",["One may only catch the tiger cub by entering the tiger's den.","The tiger cub looked like a large kitten."],["不入虎穴，焉得虎子。","小老虎看起來像隻大貓。"]],["chatter","'tʃætә","n. 饶舌, 啁啾, 喋喋不休\\nvi. 喋喋不休地谈, (鸟)啭鸣",["The online chatter about hot-button issues is reaching a fever pitch.","Some people have to stop saying words that add pain, what is called insipid chatter."],["",""]],["predictive","pri'diktiv","a. 预言性的, 成为前兆的",["Predictive texting can lead to some amusing errors when sending messages.","The predictive power of this theory has been demonstrated time and time again."],["",""]],["interrogate","in'terәgeit","vt. 质问, 讯问, 审问\\nvi. 质问, 讯问",["He knows how to interrogate people.","Their job is to interrogate suspects."],["",""]],["grieving","ɡri:vɪŋ","v. 感到悲痛, 伤心( grieve的现在分词 ); 使…伤心",["The mother was still grieving over her child's death.","Yanni's company set up a fund to help his grieving widow."],["",""]],["accessibility","әk.sesә'biliti","n. 易接近, 可进入\\n[化] 可及性; 可达性; 可接近性; 吸湿性",["Imogen of the Internet blatantly forsakes web accessibility guidelines when redesigning her Tumblr for the twelfth time today.","The kids with special needs are very lonely, especially in a world without accessibility."],["",""]],["inflammatory","in'flæmәtәri","a. 激动的, 煽动的, 炎症性的\\n[医] 炎的, 炎性的",["What the mayor is claiming is spurious and inflammatory.","I'm pouring some anti-inflammatory cream on my right knee."],["",""]],["visitation",".vizi'teiʃәn","n. 访问, 探望, 视察",["Sami was granted one hour of visitation with the children.","Unwed couples deserve visitation rights just as much as married ones do."],["",""]],["hypertension",".haipә'tenʃәn","n. 高血压, 过度紧张\\n[医] 高血压, 血压过高, 张力过强, 压力过高",["Patients with hypertension should be monitored closely when taking this medication.","Tom's eye doctor determined that he has ocular hypertension without glaucoma."],["",""]],["conceivable","kәn'si:vәbl","a. 想得到的, 可想象的, 可理解的",["We've tried every conceivable method, but absolutely nothing works.","He has lied to me, the villain, in every conceivable way."],["",""]],["zucchini","zu:'ki:ni","n. 绿皮密生西葫芦",["I like to add grilled zucchini to Benedito's salad for some extra veggies.","Do you know the difference between an eggplant and a zucchini?"],["",""]],["entrust","in'trʌst","vt. 信托, 交托, 委托\\n[经] 委托",["I wouldn't entrust Tom with such an important task.","War is too serious a thing to entrust to the military."],["",""]],["taut","tɒ:t","a. 拉紧的, 整洁的, 紧张的",["The hairs on the violin bow should not be too taut.","The walls of the tent must be taut when you set it up."],["",""]],["exploratory","iks'plɔ:rәtәri","a. 探究, 探查, 探察(伤处), 探险, 探测, 勘探, 考察, 钻研, 探索\\n[医] 探察的",["An exploratory investigation was required to collect important data regarding the health of the ecosystem.","I'm forming an exploratory committee to decide whether I should run for president."],["",""]],["incremental",".inkri'mentl","a. 增加的, 增值的\\n[经] 增长的, 增量的",["Incremental improvement is fine as long as the increments are large enough to see.","I enjoy the slow buildup of progress in incremental games."],["",""]],["cutback","'kʌtbæk","n. 情节倒叙, 减少, 短截植物\\n[经] 减少",["Tom is out of work during the holidays due to a cutback at the steel plant."],[""]],["remedial","ri'mi:diәl","a. 治疗的, 补救的, 矫正的\\n[医] 治疗的",["She has to take a remedial course in English.","She failed the math test, so she had to take a remedial class."],["她需要上英语补习班。",""]],["detach","di'tætʃ","vt. 使分离, 分遣\\n[机] 摘下, 分离, 卸下",["When you try to detach ivy from fences, it will bring them down.","You don't prepare for death. You detach from life."],["",""]],["biopsy","'bai.ɒpsi","n. 活组织检查\\n[医] 活组织检查",["The results of Tom's biopsy show that the tumor is cancerous.","The results of Tom's biopsy show that the tumor is benign."],["",""]],["brew","bru:","n. 酿造酒, 酝酿\\nv. 酿造, 酝酿",["When you travel, you've got to try the local brew.","\"Let it be done,\" said the little mermaid, and the witch put on her cauldron to brew the magic potion."],["",""]],["sacrament","'sækrәmәnt","n. 圣礼, 圣事, 誓言\\nvt. 使立誓, 使宣誓",["Love must be sanctified by marriage, and this passion becomes criminal if it's not consecrated by a sacrament.","After everyone took their places, the sacrament begins."],["",""]],["gymnastics","dʒim'næstiks","n. 体操, 体育\\n[医] 体操, 体育",["At the beginning, I was bored with radio gymnastics, but now I do not dislike it.","That school is equipped with the latest gymnastics apparatus."],["我起初覺得廣播體操很無聊，但是現在卻喜歡上了。",""]],["reorganization","'ri:,ɔ:^әnai'zeiʃәn","n. 改组, 再编制, 改造\\n[医] 再机化, 组织再生",["All hope of my promotion went up in smoke after my reorganization plan fell through.","The meeting was for a simple reorganization, but Mary went off on a tangent that led to us realizing a complete overhaul would be better and just as easy."],["",""]],["clientele",".kli:ɒn'tel","n. 诉讼委托人, 客户\\n[法] 委托人, 受保护者, 门徒",["The majority of his clientele are poor people.","We hope that this new product satisfies your clientele."],["他的客人多是窮人。",""]],["endowment","in'daumәnt","n. 捐助, 天赋, 才能\\n[经] 捐赠, 捐款, 养老金",["The university's endowment grew 10% in the last year alone.","The university's endowment has decreased steadily over the last ten years."],["",""]],["biomass","'baiәumæs","n. 生物量\\n[化] 生物质; 生物量",["Jellyfish make up up to 40% of the biomass of the ocean.","This fungus maintains its biomass under the soil."],["",""]],["zipper","'zipә","n. 拉链",["A tent with a floor and a zipper is bug tight.","Tom can't get out of his sleeping bag. The zipper is stuck."],["有垫布与拉链的帐篷可以做到防虫密闭。",""]],["adrenaline","","n. 肾上腺素\\n[化] 肾上腺素",["When he gets overtaken by another car, he gets a shot of adrenaline.","When adrenaline kicked in, I ran away as fast as I could."],["",""]],["mediocre",".mi:di'әukә","a. 不好不坏的, 通常, 平凡的",["I celebrated Bastille day with a baguette, Roquefort and a glass of mediocre French red.","Tom could've become an excellent surgeon, but instead became a mediocre psychologist."],["",""]],["stat","stæt","[电] 静",["This helm does not have very high protection, but it does have cool stat bonuses.","Upon reaching level 20, Mary improved her Strength stat and learnt two new spells."],["",""]],["heartland","'hɑ:tlænd","n. 心脏地区, 中心地带",["My mother was born in the heartland of America, but my father grew up herding goats in Kenya.","Boumerdes has become Algeria's grapes heartland."],["",""]],["sparse","'spɑ:s","a. 稀疏的, 稀稀落落的, 稀薄的",["With sparse exceptions, drug trafficking gangs tend to align politically with the right.","It makes things easier if your matrix is sparse."],["",""]],["completed","","a. 完整的；完全的",["Despite a lot of difficulties, he still completed the task.","The bridge will be completed by the end of this year."],["虽然困难重重，他还是完成了这个任务。","大橋將在年底完工。"]],["narrate","nә'reit","v. 说故事, 说明, 叙述",["People sometimes narrate their actions to themselves as a running commentary.","We need someone famous to narrate the script for our new documentary."],["",""]],["snore","snɒ:","n. 鼾声, 打鼾\\nvi. 打鼾\\nvt. 打鼾度过",["When it comes to snoring, no one can top Mr Snore.","Both Tom and Mary say they don't think they snore."],["",""]],["beacon","'bi:kn","n. 烽火, 灯塔\\nv. 照亮",["The advent of the euro is the beacon for the new millennium.","The lit skyscraper served as a beacon, welcoming those who came to the city."],["",""]],["speck","spek","n. 斑点, 有斑点的东西, 污点, 缺点, 微粒, 肥肉\\nvt. 使有斑点",["He thought of himself as a speck of dust in an immensely vast universe.","The room is empty apart from the speck of dust floating in the air."],["",""]],["zinc","ziŋk","n. 锌\\nvt. 镀锌于",["Every Monday Mrs. Evans washed all the family's clothes in the zinc bathtub.","The islands are rich in undeveloped mineral resources such as lead, zinc, nickel, and gold."],["",""]],["tattered","'tætәd","a. 破烂的, 褴褛的",["I see a tattered flag which continues to flutter in the wind.","Mary thought to herself that she ought to buy a new cover for the ironing board since the old one was getting pretty tattered."],["",""]],["cellphone","'selfәun","n. 蜂窝式便携无线电话；大哥大",["The cellphone came with several applications already pre-installed.","Is there a place where I can charge my cellphone around here?"],["这部手机和一些预装的应用一起出售。","这附近有没有可以给手机充电的地方？"]],["rendition","ren'diʃәn","n. 译文, 施舍, 表演\\n[经] 生产量",["The event opened with a stirring rendition of the national anthem.","Sami performed a beautiful rendition of a Michael Jackson song."],["",""]],["saloon","sә'lu:n","n. 大厅, 沙龙, 酒吧, 会客室",["Barsoom was the biggest Martian town. It had the fanciest saloon. It was the Wild, Wild Red.","It doesn't look like scenery for the stage. It looks more like a saloon."],["",""]],["pleasantly","","adv. 和蔼地, 亲切地；友好地；愉快地",["If your friend reminds you kindly of your faults, take what he says not only pleasantly, but thankfully.","The weather is quite pleasantly cool."],["如果有朋友對你作出善意批評，你不止應該欣然接受，還要好好的感謝他。","天气挺凉爽。"]],["delta","'deltә","n. 三角洲, 希腊字母的第四个字\\n[医] δ(希腊文的第四个字母), 丁种, 三角, 三角形区",["The Mississippi delta has changed shape drastically over the course of its history.","The river delta has flooded many times. I don't know why anyone continues to build there."],["",""]],["preseason","'pri:'si:zn","a. 活跃季节前的,旺季前的",["He was doing really well in the preseason, but that was it."],[""]],["unanimously","","adv. 全体一致, 无异议, 一致同意",["The board unanimously decided to appoint her as CEO.","His foolish proposal was approved unanimously."],["董事会一致决定任命她为执行总裁。",""]],["curfew","'kә:fju:","n. 晚钟, 打晚钟时刻, 宵禁\\n[法] 宵禁, 宵禁令",["The curfew was on and the Palestinian children were not allowed to go to school.","He was given a detention for being out after curfew."],["",""]],["gritty","'griti","a. 有砂砾的, 坚韧不拔的",["His gritty, cynical writing is very popular with men between the ages of 18 and 35.","Tom and I are working on a gritty reboot of an 80s classic."],["",""]],["extraction","ik'strækʃәn","n. 抽出, 取出, 拔出术, 抽出物\\n[化] 萃取; 提取",["They told us a story about biogas extraction today.","Many locals are blaming oil and gas extraction for the powerful tremor."],["",""]],["glisten","'glisn","vi. 闪亮, 辉耀\\nn. 闪光, 闪耀",["The morning sun makes the hoarfrost on the twigs and branches glisten.","In the night, the moon shines and stars glisten and twinkle. In the evening is twilight: in the morning the break of day and the dawn."],["",""]],["courtship","'kɒ:tʃip","n. 求爱, 求婚, 求爱时期",["Traditionally, men were expected to take the lead in courtship.","Courtship is much more formal than flirting, but the idea is similar."],["",""]],["victimization",".viktimai'zeiʃәn","n. 牺牲, 欺骗",["The program aims to reduce the victimization of elderly people."],["該計畫旨在減少老年人受害。"]],["yen","jen","n. 日元(日本货币单位), 渴望, 嗜好\\nvi. 渴望",["Mother gives my sister two thousand yen every month.","How to overcome the high value of the yen is a big problem."],["母親每個月給妹妹兩千日元。","如何克服日元升高是个大问题。"]],["rift","rift","n. 裂口, 空隙\\nvi. 裂开\\nvt. 使分开, 使割开",["My granddaughter's behaviour has caused a rift in our family.","A deep rift opened up between them."],["",""]],["orgasm","'ɒ:gæzm","n. 极度兴奋, 兴奋的高潮, (感情等的)爆发\\n[医] 性欲高潮, 性乐",["Some respondents reported they'd experienced orgasm while exercising.","You may have to work a little harder to achieve an orgasm."],["",""]],["melting","'meltiŋ","a. 熔化的, 温柔的, 令人感动的, 甜美的\\n[化] 熔化",["With global warming, the amount of ice melting in Antarctica is increasing.","Ziri was melting like ice cream in July when Rima started complimenting him."],["隨著全球氣溫變暖，南極大陸的融冰量也日益增加。","當麗瑪開始誇獎齊里時，齊里就像七月的冰淇淋一樣融化了。"]],["takeoff","'teikɒ:f","n. 起飞",["The airplane used a rocket motor to assist with takeoff.","They said they'd make the boarding announcement 20 minutes before takeoff."],["",""]],["gracefully","","adv. 优雅地；温文地",["Gabriel watched a family of swans gliding gracefully on the lake.","We must learn to meet adversity gracefully."],["加布里埃爾看著一群天鵝在湖面上優雅地游著。","我们必须学会优雅地面对逆境。"]],["admirable","'ædmәrәbl","a. 可钦佩的, 极好的, 令人惊奇的",["Your motive was admirable, but your action was not.","Nowadays, wisdom no longer appears to be an admirable virtue."],["",""]],["encyclopedia","in.saiklәu'pi:diә","n. 百科全书",["I want to leave my name on the encyclopedia.","Wikipedia is the best encyclopedia on the Internet."],["我要在百科全書上留名。",""]],["remorse","ri'mɒ:s","n. 懊悔, 良心不安, 自责, 同情\\n[法] 悔恨, 自责, 懊悔",["Sociopaths rarely display remorse or feelings of guilt for their crimes.","Remorse is impotence, impotence which sins again. Repentance alone is powerful; it ends all."],["反社会者极少为他们的罪行显露懊悔或有罪恶的感觉。",""]],["shortfall","'ʃɒ:tfɒ:l","n. 不足, 不足量\\n[经] 缺少, 不足, 亏舱运费",["A budget deficit will occur because of a revenue shortfall."],[""]],["cubicle","'kju:bikl","n. 小卧室\\n[医] 小隔间(宿舍或病室中的)",["I became a retiree after working for forty-five years in a cubicle.","Tom is a functionary working in a cubicle at the Department of Veterans' Affairs."],["",""]],["buddhism","'budizm","n. 佛教",["The major religions in China are Taoism, Buddhism, Islam and Christianity.","The article on Buddhism revived my interest in oriental religions."],["中国重要的宗教是道教、佛教、伊斯兰教和基督教。","那篇關於佛教的文章再次勾起了我對東方宗教的興趣。"]],["progressively","","adv. 进步, 先进, 向前进, 不断前进, 累进, 渐进, 逐渐, 渐次, 主张进步, 进行性",["Your questions are getting progressively more profound.","Collective rules are not set straightaway but progressively win recognition."],["",""]],["principally","'prinsәpәli","adv. 主要地, 大部分",["Jupiter is a planet principally composed of hydrogen and helium.","Individual unconventional plays are usually discussed under the province in which the play is principally located."],["",""]],["beforehand","bi'fɒ:hænd","adv. 预先",["Let me know beforehand instead of catching me on the hop at the last minute.","Let me know beforehand instead of springing it on me at the last minute."],["事先打个招呼，别叫我临时抓瞎。","事先打个招呼，别叫我临时抓瞎。"]],["undecided",".ʌndi'saidid","a. 未定的, 不明确的",["Tom told me that he thought that Mary was undecided.","He paused at the door, undecided as to whether he should enter or not."],["",""]],["margarine",".mɑ:dʒә'ri:n","n. 人造黄油\\n[化] 人造奶油; 代奶油",["She used margarine instead of butter.","She substituted margarine for butter."],["她用人造黄油代替了黄油。","她用人造黄油代替了黄油。"]],["lookout","'lukaut","n. 注意, 前途, 了望台, 景色\\n[法] 看守, 守望",["The soldier kept a sharp lookout in the darkness.","I'm on the lookout for a good introductory book about the Internet."],["這名士兵在黑暗中保持戒備。",""]],["scroll","skrәul","n. 卷轴, 画卷, 名册, 条幅, 滚动\\nv. (使)成卷形\\n[计] 滚动",["Would you look at that! After a long and exhausting quest I finally managed to find the mythical Scroll of Swordsmanship.","Scroll compressors consist of two scrolls to pressurize refrigerant."],["",""]],["objectivity",",ɔbdʒek'tivәti","n. 客观, 客观现实, 客观性\\n[经] 客观性",["Beware of anyone who claims objectivity.","Beware of anybody who claims objectivity."],["要小心那些说自己客观的人。","要小心那些说自己客观的人。"]],["affidavit",".æfi'deivit","n. 宣誓书, 书面陈述\\n[经] 宣誓, 声明",["I have to get an affidavit notarized at the consulate to prove that I'm eligible to be married and that I'm not getting married against my will.","Tom described the assault in an affidavit."],["",""]],["folded","","v. 折叠；交叉合拢；失败垮台；把牲畜关在栏中（fold的过去分词）",["She folded up the towels and put them away in the cupboard.","She folded her handkerchief neatly."],["她把毛巾折叠好再放入柜子里。","她整齊地把她的手帕折好。"]],["neural","'njuәrәl","a. 神经的, 神经系统的, 神经中枢的, 背的\\n[医] 神经的",["The term neural net was traditionally used to name a network or circuit of biological neurons.","The most advanced voice recognition techniques are based on neural networks."],["",""]],["satire","'sætaiә","n. 讽刺文学, 讽刺",["He was not aware that the praise was a satire in disguise.","I'm an epidemiologist. When I heard about Britain's \"herd immunity\" coronavirus plan, I thought it was satire."],["",""]],["dues","","n. 税, 应付款, 该缴之款\\n[经] 会费, 捐费, 手续费",["Cross off the names of the people who have paid their dues.","Many members dropped out of the club when the dues were raised."],["麻煩你把付了錢的人的名字刪掉。",""]],["cot","kɒt","n. 行军床, 小屋, (家畜等的)棚, (家畜等的)栏\\n[医] 指套; 小床",["Smoking while pregnant increases the risk of cot death.","The baby is babbling in his cot; he is talking to his teddy bear."],["",""]],["alternatively","ɒ:l'tә:nәtivli","adv. 非此即彼",["You can walk, or alternatively, I'll drive you there in my car.","Tom for Mary and Mary for Tom were alternatively the subject and the object."],["",""]],["makeover","","n. 化妆美容；大转变",["As you're starting from scratch you might as well have gone for a major makeover...","Maybe it's time to change my hair and do a makeover."],["",""]],["batting","'bætiŋ","n. 击球, 球棒的使用, 棉絮\\n[机] 棉胎",["The coach demonstrated the proper batting technique.","She can tell the most outrageous lie without batting an eye."],["",""]],["behold","bi'hәuld","vt. 看到, 注视\\nvi. 看",["I slept and dreamt that life was joy. I awoke and saw that life was service. I acted and behold, service was joy.","My heart leaps up when I behold a rainbow in the sky."],["",""]],["pew","pju:","n. 教堂长椅, 会众, 座位\\nvt. 为(教堂)安装座位, 把...围在一起",["Along the whole length of the pew hymnals are placed at regular intervals.","Pew surveyor Katerina Eva Matsa said this falls in line with years of research on political attitudes toward news media in general."],["",""]],["ethiopian",".i:θi'әupiәn","a. 埃塞俄比亚的\\nn. 埃塞俄比亚人",["I don't really feel like eating Ethiopian food tonight.","Soeder told Ethiopian media the agreement would bring Bavarian expertise in football to the sports-hungry nation of Ethiopia."],["",""]],["wring","riŋ","n. 扭绞, 拧, 挤\\nvt. 拧, 绞, 扭, 勒索, 折磨, 使痛苦\\nvi. 蠕动, 扭动, 绞, 扭, 感到痛苦",["Tobias continued to wring the guy's neck and punch him.","It was hard to resist the impulse to wring Tom's neck."],["",""]],["tedious","'ti:diәs","a. 沉闷的, 冗长乏味的",["Typing capital letters on a computer is somewhat tedious.","The journey, as I recall it, was long and tedious."],["",""]],["nostalgic","nɒs'tældʒik","a. 乡愁的, 怀旧的\\n[医] 怀乡病的",["In nostalgic moments we may tend to think of childhood as a time of almost unbroken happiness.","I suddenly feel nostalgic for my homeland."],["在懷念舊日時光的時刻，我們可能往往想起童年像是有著幾乎完整幸福的一段時期。","我突然很想念我的故乡。"]],["turbulence","'tә:bjulәns","n. 混乱, 动荡, 骚乱, 紊流\\n[化] 湍流; 紊流",["As the plane was approaching turbulence, the pilot asked the passengers aboard the plane to fasten their seat belts.","The girl next to me on the plane started to get scared from the turbulence."],["",""]],["differentiation",".difәrenʃi'eiʃәn","n. 区别, 分化, 变异\\n[医] 鉴别, 区别, 分化[作用], 微分法",["The math teacher explained the concept of partial differentiation."],[""]],["dignified","'dignifaid","a. 有尊严的, 高尚的",["At the funeral, the widow looked very dignified, with her black suit, hat and gloves.","He decided that his kielbasa was too dignified for an ordinary bun."],["",""]],["parody","'pærәdi","n. 打油诗文, 诙谐的模仿诗文, 拙劣的模仿\\nvt. 拙劣模仿, 作模仿诗文",["Evidence that Harrison did not intend this work to be a parody can be seen in his letter to Mrs. Evans.","The newspaper published a hilarious parody of the president's speech."],["",""]],["caste","kæst. kɑ:st","n. 印度的种姓制度, (排他的)社会团体",["They have all converted to Islam, a religion that doesn't have a caste system.","Even when you convert to Islam, you're not truly able to escape the discrimination from some upper caste Hindus."],["",""]],["humanities","","n. 人文学科",["The study of philosophy belongs to the humanities.","You're better suited to the humanities. It seems to me that the sciences are not for you."],["",""]],["relentlessly","","adv. 不仁慈, 严酷, 无情, 坚韧, 不懈, 不屈不挠",["The children still chased Boris and attacked him relentlessly.","That music obsessed me. It took hold of my spirit relentlessly."],["",""]],["neutralize","'nju:trәlaiz","vt. 使中立, 使成中立地带, 使中和, 抵销\\nvi. 中立化, 变无效, 中和",["Flavio can try using antibiotics to neutralize the bacteria."],[""]],["proportional","prә'pɒ:ʃәnl","a. 比例的, 相称的\\nn. 比例项",["The number of muffins that you'll receive will be inversely proportional to the number of times you talk on IRC.","The length of a marriage is inversely proportional to the cost of the wedding."],["你能得到松饼数量将和你去IRC聊天的次数成反比。","婚姻的長度與婚宴的花費負相關。"]],["rebate","ri'beit","n. 部分退款, 折扣\\nvt. 退还, 打折扣\\nvi. 退还部分付款",["Once we get our rebate, this dryer will only cost us half of what we paid.","He gave me a ten thousand yen rebate."],["",""]],["sewing","'sәuiŋ","n. 缝制品, 缝纫",["She put aside the sewing and stood up.","While you are reading to me, I can do my sewing."],["她放下手中的针线活，并站了起来。","你读给我听的时候，我就可以做缝纫了。"]],["austrian","'ɒstriәn","n. 奥地利人\\na. 奥地利的, 奥地利人的",["By three consecutive weddings the Austrian monarchy became the dominant house of Europe for a quarter of a century.","Tom is Austrian, but lives in Australia, because he loves kangaroos."],["",""]],["fleeting","","a. 疾驰的, 短暂的, 飞逝的",["Charm is deceptive, and beauty is fleeting; but a woman who fears the LORD is to be praised.","The customers gave him fleeting glances, then returned to their conversations."],["",""]],["pedestal","'pedistl","n. 支柱, 基架, 基座, 基础\\nvt. 加座, 搁在台上, 支持, 提高...的地位",["A bust of Aristotle stands on a pedestal in the entryway.","Please don't put me on a pedestal, for I will surely fall. Just love me as I am, weaknesses, flaws, and all."],["",""]],["biographer","bai'ɒgrәfә","n. 传记作者",["His biographer called him a wonderful man."],[""]],["abdominal","æb'dɒminәl","a. 腹部的, 有腹鳍的\\n[医] 腹[部]的",["The internal oblique muscle is located beneath the external oblique muscle in the abdominal region of the body.","The autoimmune disorder causes abdominal pain, bloating, malnutrition and anemia, and increases the risk of cancer."],["",""]],["diarrhea",",daiә'riә","n. 腹泻\\n[医] 腹泻",["Tom's bout with diarrhea was foreordained due to Mary's refusal to clean any cookware.","After being exposed to a large amount of radiation, vomiting and diarrhea will start quickly."],["瑪麗拒絕洗炊具，湯姆注定會鬧肚子。",""]],["delineate","di'linieit","vt. 描绘...的轮廓, 描绘, 描写",["Do you want to know who you are? Don't ask. Act! Action will delineate and define you.","There is no map that can delineate which land is ours and which is theirs."],["",""]],["spew","spju:","vi. 呕吐, 喷涌\\nvt. 呕出, 喷\\nn. 呕吐物, 喷涌物",["Our solar-system neighbors have ice mountains, frigid, liquid methane lakes, volcanoes that spew poisonous sulfur dioxide, and a colossal canyon as long as the continental U.S."],[""]],["omission","әu'miʃәn","n. 省略, 遗漏, 疏忽\\n[化] 省略",["Omission is a perfectly good example of an expression technique, and is brought up in many grammar books.","Some English speakers think that omission of the subject does not occur in their language, however, the subject of phrases like \"thank you\" or \"bless you\" is omitted."],["",""]],["annoyance","ә'nɒiәns","n. 烦恼, 打扰, 可厌之事\\n[法] 使人烦恼的事物, 麻烦事, 讨厌物",["To our great annoyance, he barged in on our party.","He showed some annoyance at the interruption of lunch."],["",""]],["paranoia",".pærә'nɒiә","n. 偏执狂, 多疑症\\n[法] 妄想狂, 偏执狂",["Saying no to unequal language rights isn't the same thing as paranoia.","The virus also drives humans insane, causing an increase in anger and paranoia worldwide."],["",""]],["kuwaiti","ku'weiti, kә'waiti","a. 科威特的, 科威特人的\\nn. 科威特人",["Khadija is a Kuwaiti citizen."],[""]],["emeritus","i'meritәs","a. 名誉退休的, 退休后保留头衔的",["\"I looked in vain for my chance, believing to find it in the trade; it closed the door in my face and put the key in its pocket\", said the emeritus artist late Taleb Rabah in his song \"The luck\"."],[""]],["reptile","'reptail","n. 爬行动物, 爬虫, 卑鄙的人\\na. 爬行的, 爬虫类的, 卑鄙的",["A scaly is like a furry whose \"fursona\" is a reptile or amphibian.","A scalie is like a furry whose \"fursona\" is a reptile or amphibian."],["",""]],["foreclosure","fɔ:'klәjʒә(r)","n. 取消抵押品赎回权\\n[经] 取消抵押品赎回权的法律手续",["When Tom lost his job, he couldn't keep up his mortgage repayments and he was threatened with foreclosure.","Anyone may bid on properties sold at a foreclosure sale."],["",""]],["insecure",".insi'kjuә","a. 不安全的, 不牢靠的, 不坚固的, 不稳定的",["She felt insecure about her future.","After the earthquake the neighbourhood felt insecure."],["她對她的未來感到沒有安全感。",""]],["majestic","mә'dʒestik","a. 宏伟的, 庄严的",["This majestic mountain range in the heart of south Asia is crowned with snowcapped peaks and draped with vast glaciers.","I want to live in a big postmodern castle amidst majestic nature."],["這座位於南亞中心的雄偉山脈，山峰白雪皚皚，覆蓋著廣闊的冰川。",""]],["confound","kәn'faund","vt. 使混淆, 使狼狈, 挫败",["When in doubt tell the truth. It will confound your enemies and astound your friends.","Come ye, therefore, let us go down and there confound their tongue, that they may not understand one another's speech."],["",""]],["mathematician",".mæθәmә'tiʃәn","n. 数学家",["Young as he is, he is as great a mathematician as ever lived.","J. Kepler, astronomer and mathematician, made a study of planets and their movements."],["",""]],["surreal","sә'riәl","a. 超现实主义的；离奇的；不真实的",["Paris butcher shops look surreal in the short hours before the sun rises.","Italians in normally bustling cities like Rome and Milan woke Tuesday to empty streets and a surreal quiet."],["",""]],["cleanse","klenz","vt. 使清洁, 净化, 使纯净\\n[建] 纯化, 净化, 精炼",["At kidney dialysis centers like this, machines do what healthy kidneys do: cleanse people's blood.","That red cloth is a \"fukusa\"; it is a vital tool used to cleanse the tea equipment."],["",""]],["relocation",".ri:lәu'keiʃәn","n. 再布置, 变换布置\\n[经] 重新安置",["The first year after the relocation from Boston was very difficult. After that, it became easier.","The relocation of the business overseas set off a wave of protest throughout the region."],["",""]],["adopted","ә'dɒptid","a. 被收养的, 被采用的",["Mr. and Mrs. Williams adopted a child whose parents were dead.","The rich merchant adopted the boy and made him his heir."],["",""]],["lotion","'lәuʃәn","n. 洗液\\n[化] 洗剂",["The marula nut kernels are pressed to extract their rich oil which is used in body lotion, soaps, and lip balm.","Applying too much suntan lotion caused him to lose his wedding ring while snorkelling on honeymoon."],["",""]],["identifiable","ai'dentifaiәbl","a. 可辨认的\\n[法] 可证明为同一的, 可以办清的",["Tom's activism didn't seem to have any identifiable effect.","Antifascists often mask their faces to make themselves less identifiable to the police."],["",""]],["cadre","'kædri.'kɑ:dә","n. 框架, 干部\\n[经] 干部",["I still haven't thought of a cadre name."],[""]],["commend","kә'mend","vt. 嘉奖, 委托给, 推荐",["They said I would never walk again, and I really have to commend them for their spot-on diagnosis.","I have to commend you for your dedication to the cause."],["",""]],["encircle","in'sә:kl","vt. 环绕, 围绕, 包围",["In the game of Go, each player tries from the beginning to encircle as many empty spaces, that is as much territory, as possible.","A territory is the set of intersections that a player has managed to encircle with his stones in such a way that it has become impregnable."],["",""]],["confiscate","'kɒnfiskeit","vt. 没收, 把...充公, 查抄\\na. 被没收的",["The US customs wanted to confiscate Australian Foreign Minister's Vegemite.","Teachers are authorized to confiscate students' smartphones if they use them in class."],["",""]],["dynasty","'dainæsti","n. 朝代, 王朝",["Both of these are Song Dynasty block-printed editions.","In the Ming Dynasty (early 15th century) the centre of Beijing was the Forbidden City."],["這兩本都是宋本。","明代十五世纪初紫禁城是北京的中心。"]],["burglary","'bә:^lәri","n. 夜盗行为, 盗窃, 盗窃行为\\n[法] 夜盗行为, 夜间入屋窃盗罪, 窃盗",["Major cities across the United States have also reported dips in burglary, assault, murder, robbery and grand larceny.","The inmate was doing time for a burglary conviction."],["",""]],["coroner","'kɒrәnә","n. 验尸官\\n[医] 检验员",["The coroner didn't find any gunshot wounds on any of the bodies.","The coroner is performing an autopsy on Tom to find out what killed him."],["",""]],["generously","","adv. 宽大地；慷慨地；丰盛地",["Tom generously invited the whole department out for a meal.","Sami and Layla generously offered to take Farid in."],["",""]],["disco","'diskәu","n. 夜总会, 迪斯科, 的士高",["Truth is like a disco ball, and only one of the tiny little mirrors it is made up of is actually yours.","When he was a student, he went to the disco only once."],["真相就像一顆迪斯可球，組成球面的無數小鏡子中，只有一面是真正屬於你的。","当他还是个学生时，他只去过迪厅一次。"]],["paradoxically","","adv. 反论, 荒谬, 自相矛盾, 似非而可能是",["Paradoxically, the President of Turkey is the de jure head of state but has no legal role in government.","Paradoxically, drinkable water is the first thing in short supply after a flood."],["",""]],["boldly","'bәuldli","adv. 大胆地, 显眼地",["Ziri boldly walked up to the boss and started talking to him.","The government acted boldly to deal with the outlaw uprising."],["",""]],["preferable","'prefәrәbl","a. 更可取的, 更好的, 更合意的",["I think death is preferable to shame.","In this kind of the situation, it is preferable to remain calm."],["我覺得士可殺不可辱。",""]],["amnesty","'æmnisti","n. 大赦, 赦免",["Amnesty International often organizes public protests in support of political prisoners.","War criminals should not benefit from amnesty or impunity."],["",""]],["hydraulic","hai'drɒ:lik","a. 与水有关的, 水力的, 水压的\\n[电] 水力的",["Hydraulic fracturing makes use of high-pressure water to create cracks in hydrocarbon-bearing shale.","The hydraulic cylinder was the main problem and was changed to a new one."],["",""]],["rediscover",".ri:dis'kʌvә","vt. 重新发现",["Each generation would have to rediscover for itself the truths of the past.","If it were not for books, each generation would have to rediscover for itself the truths of the past."],["",""]],["disgusted","dis'ɡʌstid","a. 厌恶的；厌烦的",["Sami the picture and he was immediately disgusted.","She divorced her good-for-nothing husband because she was disgusted with him."],["薩米看到照片，立刻感到厭惡。",""]],["thee","ði:","pron. 你",["Lo, thus, by day my limbs, by night my mind, for thee, and for myself, no quiet find.","Fare thee well! and if for ever, still for ever, fare thee well."],["",""]],["forcefully","","adv. 激烈地；强有力地；有说服力地",["He flirts so forcefully that he ends up pushing women away.","No ensemble can convey a composer's intent more forcefully than an orchestra."],["",""]],["rink","riŋk","n. 溜冰场, 室内溜冰场\\nvi. 溜冰",["While skating at the ice rink she fell on her rear.","A skating rink has been forced to close following public uproar over a decision to embed dead fish into the ice."],["",""]],["rafter","'ræftә","n. 椽, 筏夫\\nvt. 装椽于",["Mary tried to smither her way out of the dark basement but hit her head on the rafter and fainted.","The curvilinear roof gives beauty to the design as well as affording more head room inside than the ordinary straight rafter."],["",""]],["resurrect",".rezә'rekt","vi. 复活\\nvt. 使复活, 复兴, 恢复, 盗掘",["If one of your party members has low HP, don't heal them. Instead, let them die and then resurrect them.","If one of your party members has low health, don't heal them. Instead, let them die and then resurrect them."],["",""]],["individualism",".indi'vidʒuәlizm","n. 个人主义, 个人特征\\n[经] 个人主义",["In a country where individualism is more common, personal objections to smoking in public are usually respected.","Art is the most intense mode of individualism that the world has known."],["",""]],["neuron","'njuәrɔn","n. 神经原, 轴索, 神经细胞\\n[计] 神经元",["In the laboratory there is a piece of abstract art that is composed of images of neuron networks, showing their vast complexity.","Why was it so hard to establish that the neuron is the most basic unit of nervous tissue?"],["",""]],["deli","'deli","n. 熟食店；熟食品（等于delicatessen）",["I don't like the food at that deli.","There are a myriad of meats at the deli on the corner of Fifth and Harvey Street."],["我不喜欢那家熟食店里的食物。",""]],["backfire",".bæk'faiә","n. 逆火, 回火, 放火\\nvi. 放逆火, 预先放火, 发生意外",["Tom thought he heard a car backfire.","Tom thought that he heard a car backfire."],["",""]],["resilience","ri'ziliәns","n. 弹回, 有弹力, 恢复力\\n[化] 回弹; 弹性; 弹回性; 回能; 弹能",["The resilience and determination of the Indian people in the face of challenges are inspiring.","One sees the resilience of a person in a crisis situation."],["",""]],["downright","'daunrait","a. 明白的, 率直的, 十足的\\nadv. 全然, 彻底, 完全",["There are few, very few, that will own themselves in a mistake, though all the World sees them to be in downright nonsense.","The food industry in China is so downright criminal that city slickers become part-time farmers."],["",""]],["measured","'meʒәd","a. 整齐的, 慎重的, 基于标准的",["The distance between stars is measured in light years.","We measured the depth of the river."],["星體和星體之間的距離是用光年來量度的。","我们测量了这条河的深度。"]],["buttocks","","n. 臀部",["The young woman slapped the man who pinched her buttocks.","She has got the prettiest buttocks I've ever seen."],["",""]],["delicately","","adv. 优美地；微妙地；精致地",["This issue is quite painful for Tom, so try to bring it up to him delicately.","Ziri questioned Rima and tried to delicately find out the truth."],["",""]],["menopause","'menәupɒ:z","n. 绝经期\\n[医] 绝经",["Menopause can mean different things for different people.","Menopause is when a woman's menstrual cycle stops."],["",""]],["yugoslav","'ju:ɡәuslɑ:v","a. 南斯拉夫的；南斯拉夫人的",["Mother Teresa was born in Yugoslavia in 1910."],[""]],["halftime","","n. 中场休息",["The referee blows his whistle for halftime.","\"So, who's going to be playing the alternative halftime show?\" \"Kid Rock.\" \"Oh, it figures. They don't have anyone else.\""],["",""]],["derail","di'reil","vt. 使出轨\\nn. 脱轨器\\n[计] 转移指令",["After some freight cars were derailed, services were suspended on the Chuo Line."],[""]],["bewildered","bɪ'wɪldəd","a. 困惑的; 晕眩的; 混乱的; 不知所措的\\nv. 使困惑",["I had never seen him so completely bewildered as he was on that day.","I was bewildered at the sight of his strange behavior."],["",""]],["individuality","'indi.vidʒu'æliti","n. 个性, 个人, 特征",["Individuality is very important in the West.","Within his marriage, he must keep his individuality and freedom of action."],["西方文化很看重個人。",""]],["revitalize",".ri:'vaitәlaiz","vt. 使恢复生气, 使复活, 使复兴",["As president, Mr. Jackson plans to revitalize the economy.","City planners hope that new businesses will revitalize the downtown area."],["",""]],["reassurance",".ri:ә'ʃurәns","n. 安心, 放心, 再保证",["Narcissists are often snobbish, disdainful and patronising of others' opinions, while, at the same time, having an overwhelming need for admiration and reassurance.","Tom is very insecure and needs constant reassurance and approval."],["自恋的人往往自命不凡，轻蔑和屈尊俯就于他人的意见，与此同时，对赞美和肯定有着迫切的需求。",""]],["downsize","daun'saiz","vt. 以较小尺寸设计；缩小尺寸；裁减人数",["Tom did his darndest to try and convince his mother to downsize into a smaller house after his father died.","You may downsize to a smaller house."],["",""]],["impediment","im'pedimәnt","n. 妨碍, 障碍, 阻止, 口吃\\n[经] 对履行义务的阻碍",["He overcame his speech impediment by reciting the Quran.","Tom has a speech impediment, which gets worse if he has to speak in public."],["",""]],["captivity","kæp'tiviti","n. 囚禁, 被关\\n[法] 囚禁, 被俘, 俘虏",["I think that dolphins should not be kept in captivity.","In captivity, a giraffe may live up to 40 years old."],["",""]],["steward","'stju:wәd","n. 管理人, 招待员, 管家, 乘务员\\n[经] 轮船, 飞机的服务员, (财务)管理员",["\"You're very welcome,\" replied the steward.","And Abram said: Lord God, what wilt thou give me? I shall go without children: and the son of the steward of my house is this Damascus Eliezer."],["",""]],["watery","'wɒ:tәri","a. 水的, 湿的, 平淡的, 稀薄的, 水淋淋的",["This braised pork is still too watery. Cook it for another ten minutes to thicken the sauce, so the flavor sticks to the meat.","Explosive diarrhea is caused by a buildup of gas and watery stool."],["這滷肉還是太稀了，再煮十分鐘，讓湯汁濃稠一些，這樣味道才能更好地留在肉上。",""]],["electromagnetic","ilektrәj'mæ^nitik","a. 电磁的, 由电磁石产生的\\n[电] 电磁的",["The amount of electromagnetic radiation an object emits depends primarily on its temperature.","Sound needs matter to propagate through. However, cosmic noise and electromagnetic waves don't."],["",""]],["kayak","'kaiæk","n. 爱斯基摩人划子",["Rolling a kayak in white water is an advanced skill.","Ziri placed the gazelle skull on the front of the kayak."],["",""]],["tentatively","'tentətɪvlɪ","adv. 试验性地, 暂时地; 权; 聊且",["We've set the meeting tentatively for Monday. It's subject to change.","If your schedule permits, let's tentatively plan on meeting tomorrow at 2:00 pm."],["",""]],["teddy","'tedi","n. 连衫衬裤；泰迪玩具熊",["Tom almost always falls to sleep at night hugging his teddy bear.","My cousin Teddy majored in French in college and studied in Paris for one year."],["",""]],["awkwardly","","adv. 笨拙地；无技巧地",["Ziri awkwardly apologized to Rima for what happened the other day.","David awkwardly excused himself from the situation."],["",""]],["storefront","'stɒ:frʌnt","n. 店面",["The angry mob overturned cars and smashed storefront windows.","It was the time of year when the tastes of autumn were lined up in the storefront."],["",""]],["sparkle","'spɑ:kl","n. 闪耀, 火花, 活力, 发泡\\nvi. 闪耀, 冒火花\\nvt. 使闪耀",["I count the sparkle of constellations to foretell the future of my love.","Your eyes sparkle whenever her name comes up in conversation, giving away your secret."],["我數著星宿的星光來預測我愛情的未來。",""]],["defeated","diˈfi:tid","v. 击败( defeat的过去式和过去分词 ); 战胜; 挫败; 使困惑",["But a man is not made for defeat. A man can be destroyed but not defeated.","Those who are defeated are always wrong. History only remembers their failure."],["人不是为失败而生的, 一个人可以被毁灭, 但不能给打败。","被征服的人永遠是錯的。歷史只記得他們的失敗。"]],["bipolar","bai'pәulә","a. 有两极的, 双极的\\n[计] 双极性",["Tom told me that he thought that Mary was bipolar.","Sami was diagnosed as a teenager with bipolar disorder."],["",""]],["manageable","'mænidʒәbl","a. 易办的, 易管理的, 易控制的",["Memorising the cards in a deck in order is certainly a difficult task, but manageable.","Mr. George told British radio that the crisis is troublesome, but manageable."],["把一疊撲克牌的排列次序背熟，雖然絕不是一件易事，卻也不是沒有可能的。",""]],["guise","gaiz","n. 相似, 外观, 伪装\\nv. 穿戴, 伪装",["Fadil befriended Dania under the guise of wanting to be closer to God.","Sami Bakir pulled Layla over under the guise of a traffic violation."],["",""]],["electrode","i'lektrәud","n. 电极\\n[化] 电极; 焊条; 电焊条",["The electrode melted and mixed with the steel.","The negative electrode is usually made of carbon."],["",""]],["remake","ri'meik","vt. 再作, 再制, 重作\\nn. 再制, 改作, 重制物",["Sami told the kitchen to remake that customer's order.","The German government offered to send German craftsmen to remake Notre-Dame cathedral's clerestory windows."],["",""]],["ornate","ɒ:'neit","a. 装饰的, 华丽的",["The ornate cornice adorned the top of the building.","The loaf of bread was adorned with ornate tiny squirrels."],["",""]],["edible","'edibl","n. 食品, 食物\\na. 可食用的",["I recommend learning about edible plants that are native to your area.","I ate a banana wrapped in edible rice paper and caramel."],["",""]],["colonization",",kɔlәnai'zeiʃәn","[医] 移生, 移地发育; 集中护理(精神病人)",["The 19th-century European colonization of Africa has left a lasting legacy all over the continent.","Some forensics researchers study the rate of insect colonization of carcasses."],["",""]],["funky","'fʌŋki","a. 畏缩的, 怯懦的, 恶臭的",["If you notice a funky smell in the fridge, investigate and clean it out.","When you notice a funky smell in the refrigerator, investigate and clean it."],["",""]],["viral","'vairәl","a. 病毒的, 病毒引起的\\n[医] 病毒的",["Male circumcision decreases the risk of viral infections that cause herpes and cancer.","Linguistic resources are far more valuable if they are unencumbered by share-alike or viral licences."],["",""]],["disciplined","'disiplind","a. 遵守纪律的；受过训练的",["The university disciplined Mark Zuckerberg for hacking its database.","The teacher told me to be disciplined, because I did not pay attention."],["",""]],["eggplant","'egplɑ:nt","n. 茄子",["Eggplant is the main ingredient of some vegetarian dishes with tomato sauce.","In the outdoor kitchen, they cook eggplant parmigiana, which instantly becomes a favorite."],["",""]],["booklet","'buklit","n. 小册子",["The complete booklet is available for free online.","The new hoover came with a thick booklet of instructions in twenty-one languages."],["",""]],["thunderstorm","'θʌndәstɒ:m","n. 雷暴雨",["Communications have been cut off for two hours because of a thunderstorm.","The fireworks show was suspended after 30 minutes due to the thunderstorm."],["",""]],["bumper","'bʌmpә","n. 缓冲器, 满杯\\na. 大胜利的",["You'll get used to the bumper-to-bumper traffic of this city.","The traffic was very heavy. The cars were lined up bumper to bumper."],["",""]],["patriot","'peitriәt","n. 爱国者, 爱国主义者",["It is the duty of every patriot to protect his country from its government.","I'm not a nationalist, I'm a patriot."],["爱国者的责任就是保护国家不受政府侵犯。","我不是个民族主义者，我是爱国者。"]],["stronghold","'strɒŋhәuld","n. 要塞, 堡垒, 大本营",["The thief has to be in here. I'm sure somewhere around is his stronghold so if we can just find that we've got him.","Although Iran is nowadays known for being a stronghold of Shia Islam, most Persian Muslims were Sunni until the XVth century."],["",""]],["thrilling","'θriliŋ","a. 毛骨悚然的, 令人兴奋的, 令人发抖的",["Riding a horse is really thrilling.","The soccer match was a thrilling experience for Gustavo."],["騎馬真的很令人興奮。",""]],["schoolteacher","'sku:lti:tʃә","n. 教师",["A schoolteacher from the American state of Alabama will spend the next year as an international ambassador for education.","Dmitri was a Catholic schoolteacher."],["",""]],["focused","'fәukәst","a. 聚焦的；专心的",["The discussion focused on unemployment.","However, controls and paperwork should be focused on where they are really needed."],["討論的重點是失業問題。",""]],["skyscraper","'skaiskreipә","n. 摩天楼, 三角形天帆",["Currently Burj Khalifa is the tallest skyscraper in the world.","Burj Khalifa is currently the tallest skyscraper in the world."],["目前哈里發塔是世界上最高的摩天大樓。","目前哈里發塔是世界上最高的摩天大樓。"]],["anxiously","'æŋʃәsli","adv. 忧虑地, 不安地",["The blackbird calls anxiously to her mate from the top of an apple-tree.","\"But what will happen to Mary while I'm gone?\", said Georgina anxiously."],["",""]],["pronouncement","prә'naunsmәnt","n. 声明, 公告, 宣言, 宣告, 发表, 意见, 决定\\n[法] 宣判, 宣布, 宣告",["The team owner and the coach are not happy with his pronouncement.","Health advocacy groups that have been warning of possible cell phone-cancer links are praising the WHO pronouncement."],["",""]],["expend","ik'spend","vt. 花费, 消耗, 用光",["I knew since middle school that only because I was so lonely was I able to expend so much energy on studying.","According to the budget, she could expend no more on supplies."],["从中学的时候我就知道，我能够花很多功夫去学习仅仅是因为我过得很寂寞。",""]],["inexperienced",".inik'spiәriәnst","a. 无经验的, 不熟练的",["She's young, naive and inexperienced.","Con artists take advantage of the credulity of inexperienced investors and swindle them out of their money."],["她年轻，天真而又缺乏阅历。",""]],["airy","'єәri","a. 空气的, 空中的, 通风的, 幻想的, 轻快的",["The mountains, too, at a distance appear airy masses and smooth, but seen near at hand, they are rough.","The portrait was shot in a high key style, using bright lighting and minimal shadows to create a cheerful and airy mood."],["",""]],["outpatient","'autpeiʃәnt","n. 门诊病人\\n[医] 门诊病人",["An outpatient clinic is the part of a hospital designated for the treatment of outpatients.","Larry is participating in an outpatient treatment program."],["",""]],["resilient","ri'ziliәnt","a. 弹回的, 有弹力的\\n[医] 回弹的, 回能的",["Researchers in New Zealand have developed new technology that could make bridges more resilient to earthquakes.","Tom's very resilient and can always manage to smile, no matter what's going on in his life."],["",""]],["erratic","i'rætik","n. 古怪的人, 漂泊无定的人\\na. 不稳定的, 奇怪的",["We had to lessen the impact of the erratic supplies.","Police are searching for an erratic driver believed to be involved in a fatal hit and run."],["",""]],["redesign",",ri:di'zain","[化] 重新设计",["Algerian urban planners should work hard to redesign Algiers.","I wonder if we can redesign the comment system so as to put a damper on all the negativity."],["",""]],["refinement","ri'fainmәnt","n. 精致, 高尚, 精巧\\n[医] 精制, 精练",["Simplicity of life, even the barest, is not a misery, but the very foundation of refinement.","What atrocities do we not perpetrate in the name of culture and refinement!"],["",""]],["chute","ʃu:t","n. 瀑布, 斜槽\\n[化] 斜槽; 滑槽; 滑运道",["I dropped it into the garbage chute and forgot about it.","Remember to throw your clothes down the clothes chute."],["",""]],["reciprocal","ri'siprәkl","a. 互惠的, 相互的, 相等的, 倒数的, 彼此相反的\\nn. 倒数, 互相起作用的事物",["The ministers will pay reciprocal visits early next year.","Corresponding squares are squares of reciprocal zugzwang."],["",""]],["neurological",".njurә'lɒdʒikl","a. 神经病学上的",["She contracted a serious neurological disease, so it was urgent to transfer her to another hospital.","Synesthesia is a fascinating neurological condition."],["",""]],["hilarious","hi'lєәriәs","a. 喜不自禁的, 欢闹的, 引人发笑的",["I try not to laugh at my own jokes, but we all know I'm hilarious.","The laser cow in WHAT THE CAR? is both hilarious and terrifying!"],["我尽量不对我自己的笑话发笑，但是我们都知道我很搞笑。","《WHAT THE CAR?》中的雷射奶牛又好笑又嚇人！"]],["dispel","dis'pel","vt. 驱散, 驱逐",["Her smooth entry into the ranks of the royal family will help to dispel these fears.","The authorities are trying to dispel the doubts about his death."],["证实她顺利地过渡入皇室组织，有帮于消除这些焦虑。",""]],["syringe","'sirindʒ","n. 注射器, 洗涤器\\nvt. 注射, 洗涤",["I was calm until I saw the syringe.","Yanni used a syringe to push resin into the windshield bullseye."],["我很平静，直到我看到了注射器。",""]],["taunt","tɒ:nt","n. 辱骂, 嘲弄\\nvt. 嘲弄, 奚落\\na. 很高的",["Don't taunt him. He's liable to fight back eventually.","The boy continued to taunt his younger brother."],["",""]],["stylistic","stai'listik","a. 格式上的, 体裁上的",["In my opinion, whether to use a comma before la, after la, or to not use a comma at all is a personal stylistic choice.","Take care to avoid stylistic errors while speaking."],["",""]],["pointer","'pɒintә","n. 指示物, 教鞭, 暗示, 指针\\n[计] 指针",["Tom was using a laser pointer to play with his cat.","The Russian goalkeeper was struck by a laser pointer."],["",""]],["yawn","jɒ:n","n. 哈欠\\nvi. 打哈欠, 裂开\\nvt. 打着哈欠说",["Cover your mouth when you cough, sneeze, or yawn.","We yawn when we are short of oxygen."],["你咳嗽、打喷嚏或打哈欠的时候要捂住你的嘴。","我们缺氧时就会打哈欠。"]],["envelop","in'velәp","vt. 包封, 遮盖, 包围\\nn. 信封",["The world has not escaped from the darkness. The long shadows of conflict and crisis envelop us still. But we meet today in an atmosphere of rising hope, and at a moment of comparative calm."],[""]],["handshake","'hændʃeik","n. 握手",["I was told that the Freemasons have a secret handshake.","When my father was offered a golden handshake, he took it."],["",""]],["theorize","'θiәraiz","vi. 建立理论, 讲理论, 推理",["It is a capital mistake to theorize before you have all the evidence. It biases the judgment.","I theorize a terrorist breeding ground and terrorize a rigorist network."],["",""]],["kindly","'kaindli","a. 和蔼的, 温和的, 爽快的\\nadv. 温和地, 亲切地",["If your friend reminds you kindly of your faults, take what he says not only pleasantly, but thankfully.","He responded kindly to the question."],["如果有朋友對你作出善意批評，你不止應該欣然接受，還要好好的感謝他。","他亲切地回答了问题。"]],["revere","ri'viә","vt. 崇敬, 敬畏, 尊敬",["There is even a hint of Smith's spirit in a lot of the music Americans revere today.","The finest achievement for a man of thought is to have fathomed what may be fathomed, and quietly to revere the unfathomable."],["",""]],["renounce","ri'nauns","vt. 拒绝, 放弃, 否认, 垫牌\\nvi. 垫牌, 声明放弃权利\\nn. 垫牌",["Joan of Arc refused to renounce her belief that the voice she heard was from God and none other.","Between the 15th and the 17th century, thousands of Spanish Muslims and Jews were forced to renounce their religions."],["",""]],["mormon","'mɒ:mәn","n. 摩门教徒",["Brigham Young continued to lead the Mormon church.","That doesn't give you the right to belittle those who follow the Mormon faith."],["",""]],["distrust","dis'trʌst","n. 不信任\\nvt. 不信任",["Distrust of people, not to mention hate, is the root of human suffering.","Distrust of the Social Insurance Agency and the Ministry of Health, Labour and Welfare just keeps getting stronger."],["",""]],["emigrate","'emigreit","v. (使)移居, (使)移民",["These days, when people emigrate, it is not so much in search of sunshine, or food, or even servants.","The majority of Algerians are schizophrenic, they vote for Islamists but emigrate to the West."],["",""]],["swath","swɔ:θ","n. 刈幅, 刈下的一行草, 刈下的一行麦, 行, 一条, 条, 一行",["The tornado ripped through the small town, leaving a swath of destruction in its wake."],[""]],["bribe","braib","n. 贿赂\\nvt. 贿赂, 收买\\nvi. 行贿",["The mayor denied having taken a bribe.","The American Republic will endure until the day Congress discovers that it can bribe the public with the public's money."],["市长否认收受了贿赂。",""]],["wiggle","'wigl","v. 扭动着行进, 摆动\\nn. 扭动, 摆动",["Tom's shoes were so tight he couldn't wiggle his toes.","Anne, you sit here on the ottoman and don't wiggle."],["",""]],["overstate",".әuvә'steit","vt. 夸大的叙述, 夸张, 过分强调\\n[经] 多计, 高估",["He's a minor player, but tends to overstate his own importance.","The importance of this topic is hard to overstate."],["",""]],["breeder","'bri:dә","n. 饲养员, 养育员, 起因, 起源者",["I know that Tom is a dog breeder, so maybe we can get a dog from him.","I know Tom is a dog breeder, so maybe we can get a dog from him."],["",""]],["cringe","krindʒ","n. 畏缩, 奉承\\nvi. 畏缩, 抖缩, 阿谀",["Why don't you calm down? You're really making me cringe.","When he runs his fingernails down the blackboard, it makes me cringe."],["",""]],["disapprove",".disә'pru:v","v. 不赞成",["I disapprove of what you say, but I will defend to the death your right to say it.","Some people disapprove of the education system in the Netherlands."],["",""]],["whichever","hwitʃ'evә","pron. 无论那一个, 任何一个",["Hmm. I have a feeling I'm going to get lost whichever road I take.","Whichever route you take, you will get there in time."],["唔。我有預感我走哪邊都會迷路。","不管你选哪条路，你都能按时到那里。"]],["lore","lɒ:","n. 知识, 眼光",["And here I stand, with all my lore, poor fool, no wiser than before.","In a popular sci-fi show, there are two android brothers funnily named Data and Lore."],["",""]],["choral","'kɒ:rәl","a. 合唱队的",["Korea fans may like the dissertation \"A Study of Korean Diction for Choral Conductors Using the Principles of the Korean Writing System.\""],[""]],["memorabilia",".memәrә'biliә","n. 值得纪念的事物, 大事记",["I put that in the category about memorabilia.","He's a collector of sports memorabilia."],["",""]],["gag","gæg","n. 箝口物, 箝制言论, 讨论终结\\nvt. 阻塞, 压制言论自由, 使窒息, 使呕吐, 插科打浑, 欺骗\\nvi. 窒息, 作呕, 欺…",["Every time I opened my mouth, it felt like an invitation to gag.","They gag the dead so they won't spill the beans about what went down here."],["",""]],["simplistic","sim'plistik","a. 过分简单化的",["Dismissing non-Western opinions as simplistic due to cultural differences is unjust.","She ends up making decisions based on superficial information because of her simplistic thinking."],["",""]],["czar","zɑ:","n. 沙皇",["Peter the Great, Czar of Russia, used to take out people's teeth for fun.","The Russian Orthodox Church sanctified the czar and is now a mouthpiece for Vladimir Putin's imperialist baby-killing wars."],["",""]],["emphatically","im'fætikәli","adv. 强调地, 着重地",["But this claim is emphatically not the one that Dennett is making.","They clamored emphatically against the nuclear tests."],["",""]],["investing","","[医] 包埋, 围模",["Investing money in your home has some merit; when it is time to sell it you can get more money.","Managing your stocks with Big Wisdom shows that you are serious about investing!"],["多花點錢在房子上，也有一些好處 ﹣ 例如，賣的時候可以賣個比較好的價錢。","用大智慧做股票，说明您对投资是认真的！"]],["proclamation",".prɒklә'meiʃәn","n. 宣言, 公布, 布告, 公告\\n[法] 宣告, 宣布, 布告",["Critics had two main concerns with the idea of a presidential proclamation to declare a national Thanksgiving.","After Madison, no U.S. president issued a Thanksgiving proclamation until Abraham Lincoln."],["",""]],["climax","'klaimæks","n. 高潮, 极点, 层进法\\nv. (使)达到顶点, (使)达到高潮",["The audience sobbed throughout the climax of the movie.","Mary did not climax when she and Tom had their first sexual intercourse."],["",""]],["improbable","im'prɒbәbl","a. 不大可能的, 不象发生的, 荒谬可笑的\\n[法] 未必会的, 不大可能发生的, 未必确实的",["Your explanation won't wash; it's too improbable to be true.","If this were played upon a stage now, I could condemn it as an improbable fiction."],["",""]],["roadway","'rәudwei","n. 车道, 道路, 轨道\\n[法] 道路, 路面, 快车道",["The left turn signal will only activate if a vehicle in the left turn lane triggers the sensor embedded in the roadway.","Environmental and roadway factors can also contribute to single-vehicle crashes."],["",""]],["wrapper","'ræpә","n. 包装者, 包裹者, 包装物, 覆盖物, 外包烟叶, 包纸, 书的封皮, 妇女晨衣\\n[医] 包裹料",["Give me the wrapper, so that I can throw it in the wastebasket already.","Don't drop that wrapper, find a trash can instead."],["",""]],["ukrainian","ju(:)'kreinjәn","a. 乌克兰的；乌克兰人的",["When in Ukraine, I always speak Ukrainian.","Ukrainian girls are the prettiest in the world."],["当我在乌克兰时，我总是讲乌克兰语。","乌克兰姑娘是全世界最漂亮的姑娘。"]],["closeness","'klәusnis","[建] 密闭, 紧密",["The closeness of their relationship was too much for him and his busy schedule.","Sometimes this closeness is distracting and they might start \"goofing off\" towards the end of their study sessions."],["",""]],["contributing","","a. 贡献的, 起一份作用的",["Stop contributing to Tatoeba. You're addicted.","Ladies and gentlemen, please notify the people to stop contributing to global warming and use nature-friendly equipment."],["别再给Tatoeba做贡献了。 你上瘾了。",""]],["victimize","'viktimaiz","vt. 使牺牲, 使受害\\n[法] 使受害, 使作牺牲, 欺骗",["The police are known to victimize anyone who isn't local to that town.","Hitler rose to power not by promising to victimize Jews but by convincing the German people that Jews were victimizing them."],["",""]],["unearth",".ʌn'ә:θ","vt. 发掘, 掘出, 从洞中赶出, 揭露, 发现",["We unearth potatoes."],[""]],["ambivalent","æm'bivәlәnt","a. 矛盾的, 模棱两可的\\n[医] 矛盾情绪的",["I'm ambivalent about the itinerary for our overseas trip which my brother has drawn up.","He is genuinely ambivalent about running for president again."],["",""]],["caliber","'kælibә","n. 口径, 才干, 水准\\n[医] 管径, 口径",["However, this prohibition does not apply if you use an air rifle, air pistol, or .22-caliber rimfire firearm for the control of listed birds.","She is our teacher, our friend, our sister. Her work is of the highest caliber. She deserves every possible tribute this community can bestow upon her."],["",""]],["subgroup","'sʌbgru:p","n. 小群, 隶属的小组织, 子群\\n[化] 族; 族周期表; 副族(指周期表中B族); 子群; 亚群(生物分类); 族(数)",["The subgroup of people who had loss of smell developed more severe illness.","But when the test results are broken down by subgroup, the differences are dramatic."],["",""]],["confinement","kәn'fainmәnt","n. 限制, 被禁闭, 分娩\\n[医] 分娩, 生产",["I was stuck in confinement for thirty days until I decided to pay a bribe.","Dan was released from solitary confinement after spending a month in the dark."],["",""]],["hearth","hɑ:θ","n. 炉床, 灶台, 炉边\\n[化] 锻造炉; 敞炉; 炉缸; 炉床; 火床; 炉膛",["In Victorian age, women were considered \"Angels of the hearth\".","A cat was tearing at the door, and there was a sound of gnawing rats beneath the hearth-stone."],["",""]],["humid","'hju:mid","a. 潮湿的, 湿润的, 多湿气的",["It is extremely hot and humid in Bali in December.","It gets very humid here in the summer. In the winter, on the other hand, it gets very dry."],["12月份巴厘岛极其炎热和潮湿。","这里的夏天很潮湿，另外，冬天很干燥。"]],["updated","ʌp'deitid","a. 更新的；现代化的",["You haven't even updated the firmware?","On Jul 18th Mark/Space released an updated version of Missing Sync for Windows Mobile for the Mac OS X."],["你连刷机都没有刷过？",""]],["obstruct","әb'strʌkt","vt. 阻隔, 妨碍, 阻塞, 遮没\\nvi. 设障碍",["One of the visitors cried out to obstruct the proceedings.","It's a natural process of ageing that can obstruct or block the flow of urine."],["",""]],["shortstop","'ʃɒ:tstɒp","n. 游击手, 停显液",["The shortstop then throws the ball to the first baseman.","An injury put the shortstop out of action."],["",""]],["trudge","trʌdʒ","n. 沉重的步伐, 长途跋涉\\nvi. 步履艰难地走, 蹒跚地走\\nvt. 跋涉",["After every big snowfall, the students trudge through deep snow to school."],[""]],["glean","gli:n","v. 拾落穗, 收集",["The willow has leaned towards the basin to glean a drop of water but found nothing there.","The connection is very slow. That's why I rarely find anything to glean from you."],["",""]],["generalize","'dʒenәrәlaiz","vt. 一般化, 概括, 推广\\nvi. 形成概念, 笼统讲",["Don't generalize individual behavior to an entire group.","Don't generalize about an entire group of people just because you had some bad experiences."],["不要把个人行为上升到集体。",""]],["smuggler","'smʌglә","n. 走私者, 走私船\\n[经] 走私者, 走私船",["The drug smuggler was arrested at the airport.","Martino is actually an illegal smuggler."],["",""]],["induction","in'dʌkʃәn","n. 归纳法, 感应, 就职, 入门\\n[计] 归纳法",["St James Palace represents her, William and his brother Harry, and now regards her \"induction\" as complete.","The rock star's induction into the Hall of Fame was predicted by all."],["代表她、威廉还有他的弟弟哈利的聖詹姆斯宮现在认为，凱薩琳的“入会时期”已经结束了。",""]],["bungalow","'bʌŋgәlәu","n. 平房",["Tom's holiday bungalow has panoramic views of the ocean.","Upon returning to the bungalow, Alberto showered and got ready for dinner."],["",""]],["suggestive","sә'dʒestiv","a. 提示性的, 影射的, 暗示的\\n[医] 暗示的",["Sami had a book which showed photos of children in suggestive poses.","Children can and do see straight performers do much more sexually suggestive things than read books to them."],["",""]],["feeding","'fi:diŋ","n. 饲养, 进料, 加料\\na. 供给饲料的, 摄取食物的",["During the holiday season, the center's volunteers serve up meals-on-wheels, feeding homebound seniors and the homeless.","Tom is the one who usually ends up feeding our dog."],["假期期間，中心的志工提供「送餐到府」服務，為行動不便的長者和無家可歸者提供餐食。",""]],["faucet","'fɒ:sit","n. 龙头, 开关, 旋塞",["The faucet in the kitchen is dripping.","The water coming out of this faucet is rusty."],["廚房裡的水龍頭在漏水。","這個龍頭出來的水都是鐵銹。"]],["worldly","'wә:ldli","a. 世间的, 世俗的, 世上的",["There are five ways to emancipate themselves from the bond of worldly passions.","It was wrong to try to judge happiness in terms of worldly success."],["",""]],["stash","stæʃ","vt. 藏起来\\nn. 隐藏处, 隐藏物",["A pre-dawn raid has netted a large stash of illegal steroids and several bags of cash.","They're going to find your stash of cigarettes, and then you'll be in trouble."],["",""]],["positioning","pә'ziʃәniŋ","n. 定位；配置, 布置",["Your trust and dedication have been instrumental in positioning Brac Bank where it stands today.","GPS means \"Global Positioning System\"."],["",""]],["humiliating","hju:'milieitiŋ","a. 丢脸的, 耻辱的, 羞愧的",["It was probably the most humiliating thing I'd ever done.","They're constantly humiliating Tom. I'm surprised that he tolerates it."],["",""]],["centimeter","'sentimi:tә","n. 厘米\\n[医] 厘米",["You get drunk on just one centimeter? And Kensuke was such a heavy drinker.","The White Cliffs of Dover retreat by about one centimeter every year."],["",""]],["shard","ʃɑ:d","n. 陶瓷碎片, 鞘翅, 薄硬壳",["You can get injured from a shard of stained glass.","Ziri had a small shard of glass underneath his skin."],["",""]],["fillet","'filit","n. 头带, 带子\\nvt. 用带缚",["Having indigestion after eating some fillet while working isn't one of the best things to do.","The table was served with baked potatoes and seasoned chicken fillet."],["",""]],["dialect","'daiәlekt","n. 方言, 同源语",["Sadly, most young people speak dialect only rarely.","Speakers of the dialect are in the majority in this region."],["不幸的是，大多数年轻人都不常说方言了。","这一带的方言使用者数量居多。"]],["varsity","'vɑ:sәti","n. 大学运动代表队；大学",["He is on the varsity in tennis and in debating.","Sami was on the varsity football team."],["",""]],["pretest","'pri:test","n. 预测\\nv. 进行预测",["Students took a pretest before the course began."],["課程開始前學生先做了前測。"]],["arid","'ærid","a. 干燥的, 不毛的",["It is an arid region, almost a desert.","Exporting water from an arid country to the rainy Europe is pure folly."],["这是片干燥地区，几乎是一片荒漠。",""]],["kettle","'ketl","n. 茶壶, 罐\\n[化] 釜体釜; 锅",["The fire isn't very hot, so it won't heat the kettle.","The witch told the servants to sharpen the knives, and to make a great fire ready, and hang a large kettle full of water over it."],["",""]],["biased","'baiәst","a. 有偏见的\\n[计] 边缘的",["Concerning this issue, I feel that the trash media only report biased information.","Anybody with at least a two-digit IQ knows this was a politically biased choice."],["关于这个问题，我觉得垃圾媒体只报道了很片面的信息。",""]],["sharing","'ʃeәriŋ","[计] 共享, 公用",["Thanks for sharing your story with me.","Christmas is a time for giving and sharing."],["谢谢你跟我分享你的故事。","聖誕節是給予和分享的時節。"]],["recruiter","ri'kru:tә","n. 招聘人员, 征兵人员",["Tom thought about enlisting after being approached by an army recruiter."],[""]],["unreliable",".ʌnri'laiәbl","a. 不可靠的\\n[法] 不可靠的, 靠不住的",["Our experiment has revealed that his report was unreliable.","The unreliable colleague suffered from a veiled inferiority complex."],["",""]],["dwindle","'dwindl","vi. 减少, 缩小, 衰落\\nvt. 使缩小",["We've made great inroads into solving the problem, but our resources dwindle and the end is not in sight.","The prospects of Zimbabwe facing hunger in the coming months are high, as stocks dwindle and donors ignore calls for more aid."],["",""]],["flyer","'flaiә","n. 飞鸟, 飞行物, 飞行员, 快车, 传单, 飞跳\\n[经] 投机买卖, 孤注一掷, (广告)传单",["Dmitri spotted a flyer at a market, picked it up and read it.","Brad had been a high-flyer since his middle school years, excelling in every subject area."],["",""]],["transient","'trænziәnt","n. 瞬, 短期居留者, 过境鸟, 瞬变现象\\na. 短暂的, 易变的, 瞬变的, 路过的\\n[计] 瞬变过程; 过渡过程; 过渡的; 瞬…",["Mary knows that her main weapons, a beautiful face and a young body, are of transient value.","Art is long, life short; judgment difficult, opportunity transient."],["",""]],["rejoice","ri'dʒɒis","vt. 使欢喜\\nvi. 欣喜, 高兴, 庆祝",["A greater joy than I had dared to hope for has come to pass. You will rejoice at my joy, for you love me better than any one.","Someday, the USA will elect its first woman president, and it will rejoice in the long overdue occasion."],["",""]],["doorstep","'dɒ:step","n. 门阶",["Looking out of the window, I saw a stranger at the doorstep.","She watched the traveling salesman approach her doorstep."],["",""]],["attributable","ә'tribju:tәbl","a. 可归于...的",["Tom's headaches are attributable to stress.","That quote is attributable to Winston Churchill."],["",""]],["patriarch","'peitriɑ:k","n. 创办人, 家长, 元老, 教长, (天主教)教皇\\n[法] 家长, 族长, 创始人",["This refers specifically to the Biblical patriarch, the son of Abraham and father of Jacob.","In Istanbul, more than a dozen Orthodox men jumped into the frigid waters of the Golden Horn amid heavy rains in a ceremony led by Patriarch Bartholomew I."],["",""]],["substitution",".sʌbsti'tju:ʃәn","n. 代替, 替换, 代替物\\n[计] 置换",["There is a widespread opinion that all study of the mode of oratory is unmanly, and leads to the substitution of artifice and adornment for simplicity and power.","Algeria needs to follow an import-substitution regime."],["有一種普遍的看法認為，一切對演說方式的研究都是有損男子氣概的，都會以雕飾與浮華取代質樸與力量。",""]],["unspoken","'ʌn'spәukәn","unspeak的过去分词",["The weight of our unspoken words is heavy.","Their marriage simmered with discontentment and unspoken anger."],["我們未曾說出口的話，份量沉重。",""]],["anthropological",".ænθrәpә'lɒdʒikl","a. 人类学的, 人类学上的",["There is an anthropological theory that early Australoids arrived in the Americas before the Mongoloids, many thousands of years ago."],[""]],["welcoming","ˈwelkəmɪŋ","v. 欢迎( welcome的现在分词 ); 迎接; 乐于接受; 希望有",["It seems that everyone likes to be generous in welcoming guests to their home.","Before welcoming a beautiful tomorrow, every rich man will ensure that he gets sufficient rest!"],["好像所有的人喜欢大方地欢迎客人来他们家。","在迎接美好的明天前，每個富有的人一定會確保自己有充分地休息！"]],["unequal",".ʌn'i:kwәl","a. 不相等的, 不规则的, 不能胜任的\\n[经] 不平均的, 不等的",["I must excuse myself from the task, because I am unequal to it.","I think that Japan's marriage system is an unequal and discriminatory contract disadvantageous to men."],["我必须推掉这任务，因为我不能胜任。",""]],["mare","mєә","n. 母马, 母驴, 月球表面阴暗部\\n[法] 海",["The prancing chestnut mare neighed as she tried to get rid of the rider.","The prancing chestnut mare whinnied as she tried to get rid of the rider."],["",""]],["gal","^æl","[化] 伽(重力加速度单位,等于1厘米/秒,2)",["Gal Costa passed away yesterday, 11.09.22, at the age of 77."],[""]],["tutoring","ˈtju:tərɪŋ","v. 当家庭教师( tutor的现在分词 ); 任大学导师; 任课",["Thanks to Robert's tutoring, Sandra looks like a dutiful student now.","Ziri invited Rima over to his house for private tutoring."],["",""]],["misdemeanor",",misdi'mi:nә","n. 行为不检, 品行不良, 轻罪, 不端行为",["Tom pleaded guilty to misdemeanor drunken driving charges in New York.","Petty larceny is a misdemeanor; grand larceny is a felony."],["",""]],["info","'infәu","n. 信息\\n[计] 信息",["I'm sorry I haven't been able to give you my cousin's contact info.","Claudio was able to get the basic info off Isabella's computer."],["",""]],["loot","lu:t","n. 赃物, 洗劫, 抢夺\\nv. 洗劫, 抢夺",["The thief outwitted the police and got away with his loot.","The thieves divvied up the stolen loot among themselves."],["",""]],["inconvenience",".inkәn'vi:njәns","n. 不便, 困难\\nvt. 使感不便, 使感困难",["Tatoeba is currently unavailable. We are sorry for the inconvenience. You can check our blog or Twitter for more information.","We apologize for the delay and regret any inconvenience it may have caused."],["Tatoeba目前无法访问。为您带来了不便，对此我们深表歉意。您可以查看我们的博客帖子或者推特发文来了解详情。","我们对这次的延迟表示抱歉，并对可能造成的不便表示遗憾。"]],["sleeper","'sli:pә","n. 睡眠者, 枕木, 卧铺\\n[法] 睡眠者, 懒人, 死人",["I knew that Tom was a very sound sleeper, so I didn't even try to be quiet.","I knew Tom was a very sound sleeper, so I didn't even try to be quiet."],["",""]],["caricature","'kærikәtʃә","n. 讽刺画, 漫画, 漫画手法\\nvt. 画成漫画讽刺",["According to him, the president must not be turned into a caricature, the loss of authority and public order cannot be borne.","Some people caricature gay men as limp-wristed and speaking with a lisp."],["",""]],["legalize","'li:gәlaiz","vt. 法律上认为正当, 使合法化\\n[法] 使合法化, 法律上认可, 使符法律",["Certain things are easier to legalize than legitimize.","President Bolsonaro's administration supports legislation that environmental groups say would legalize land grabs."],["",""]],["peruvian","pә'ru:viәn","a. 秘鲁的, 秘鲁人的, 秘鲁文化的\\nn. 秘鲁人",["Tourists struggle for breath as they climb for two hours to reach the top of a mountain in the Peruvian Andes.","The theft of Peruvian resources perpetrated by the Spanish was huge."],["遊客攀登秘魯安地斯山脈的一座山峰，歷經兩個小時才到達山頂，他們氣喘吁吁。",""]],["racing","'reisiŋ","n. 赛马, 赛车\\n[机] 空转, 急转",["In WHAT THE CAR?, you play as a car with legs, racing through absurdly creative levels.","I like how WHAT THE CAR? combines racing with fun puzzle gameplay and exploration."],["在《WHAT THE CAR?》中，您將操縱長著腿的汽車，在離譜又富有創意的關卡中賽跑。","我喜歡《WHAT THE CAR?》將賽車與有趣的益智遊戲和探索相結合。"]],["foothill","'futhil","n. 山麓小丘",["He's got a house in the foothills of the Alps."],[""]],["propulsion","prә'pʌlʃәn","n. 推进, 推进力\\n[医] 前冲, 慌张步态",["To overcome drag, airplanes use a propulsion system to generate a force called thrust.","The nautilus is a mollusk that uses jet propulsion to roam the ocean deep."],["",""]],["evergreen","'evәgri:n","n. 常绿树, 常绿植物\\na. 常绿的",["A deciduous tree is one that loses its leaves in the autumn, unlike evergreen trees, which keep their leaves all year round.","This tree is evergreen all year round."],["落叶树是指会在秋季脱去树叶的树木，与终年保持叶片的常绿树不同。","这树全年常绿。"]],["attire","ә'taiә","n. 服装, 盛装\\nvt. 使穿衣, 打扮",["To be appropriately dressed in business attire, a man would wear a dark suit with a conservative tie.","The natural instinct of travellers at their journey's end is to seek for rest and change of attire."],["",""]],["backcountry","'bækkʌntri","n. 偏僻地区；边远地区；穷乡僻壤\\na. 偏僻地区的",["John is writing an assignment about the Brazilian backcountry.","Treat your trip as a remote backcountry trip: there is limited water infrastructure, variable weather, and no repair services or materials."],["",""]],["dick","dik","n. 家伙, 词典, 誓言(书)\\n[医] 二氯乙胂(毒气)",["Bill got mad and called Dick names.","Spotted dick is a British pudding made with suet and dried fruit."],["比爾生氣了並用難聽的話罵迪克。",""]],["outfielder","'ajtfi:ldә(r)","n. 外野手",["The outfielder caught the ball near the fence."],["外野手在全壘打牆附近接殺了球。"]],["sub","sʌb","n. 补充人员, 部下, 潜水艇, 胶层, 订户, 傻子\\na. 附属的, 次级的\\nvt. 替代, 转包\\nvi. 替代\\n[计] 子程…",["I'd defeated the four sub-bosses and got through the damn long underground labyrinth.","The only remaining region in the world where obesity is uncommon is sub-Saharan Africa."],["",""]],["recurrence","ri'kʌrәns","n. 再现, 再发生, 反复, 循环\\n[医] 复发, 再发",["The chances of recurrence vary from patient to patient.","There's a slight possibility of a recurrence."],["",""]],["saucer","'sɒ:sә","n. 茶碟, 茶托\\n[医] 碟",["A cheetah is just a big cat, and yet a saucer of milk does not go very far in satisfying its wants.","The kitten lapped up the milk I poured into the saucer."],["",""]],["stated","'steitid","a. 决定了的, 一定的, 阐明的, 规定的\\n[经] 固定的, 规定的, 定期的",["She once proudly stated that she was going to lose 5 kilos of fat in a single month.","The government clearly stated its intention to lower taxes."],["她曾经夸口说一个月之内要减掉5公斤赘肉。","政府明确宣布了降税的意图。"]],["synonymous","si'nɒnimәs","a. 同义词的, 同义的",["England is synonymous with football, fish & chips, and the Queen.","Careful! Emotional dependency is not synonymous with love!"],["英格兰是足球、鱼和薯片，还有女王的同义词。","小心，精神依赖不是爱的同义词！"]],["macho","'mɑ:tʃәu","[医] 结节型皮肤利什曼病",["Going out drinking with the guys makes him feel macho.","He just wants to impress us with his macho attitude and show us what a great guy he is."],["",""]],["strained","'streind","a. 紧张的, 滤过的, 矫饰的\\n[法] 牵强附会的, 勉强的, 紧张的",["Though passion may have strained, it must not break our bonds of affection.","As Lincoln said to a nation far more divided than ours, we are not enemies but friends. Though passion may have strained, it must not break our bonds of affection."],["雖然激情可能會褪去，但我們不能切斷感情上的聯繫。","林肯在向远比我们眼下分歧更大的国家发表讲话时说，我们不是敌人，而是朋友……虽然激情可能会褪去，但这不会割断我们感情上的联系。"]],["picket","'pikit","n. 桩, 尖桩, 警戒哨, 巡逻艇, 纠察队\\nvt. 围住, 警戒, 派...担任纠察\\nvi. 担任纠察",["I doubt that Tom has the courage to cross the picket line.","The strikers hectored the few scabs courageous enough to cross the picket line."],["",""]],["clothe","klәuð","vt. 给...穿衣, 盖上, 赋予",["It's preferable that I clothe you instead of feeding you.","Better to clothe you than to feed you."],["",""]],["combatant","'kɒmbәtәnt","n. 争斗者, 格斗者\\n[法] 战斗者, 参战者",["Before he settled down and started a family, Sanjay was a revolutionary combatant.","Ma'am, we've captured an enemy combatant."],["",""]],["colonialism","kә'lәunjәlizm","n. 殖民主义",["Many have suffered oppression and misery for a long period of time under the rule of colonialism.","Many have long suffered oppression and hardship under colonialism."],["",""]],["derivative","di'rivәtiv","a. 引出的, 派生的\\nn. 引出之物, 派生物, 衍生字",["This was a translation of copyrighted material, so I deleted it since copyright owners have the right to control derivative works.","The two main operations in calculus are the integral and the derivative."],["",""]],["adoptive","ә'dɒptiv","a. 有收养关系的, 采用的\\n[法] 收养的, 采用的",["Her adoptive parents are much kinder to her than her birth parents ever were.","Tom's adoptive parents are much kinder to him than his birth parents ever were."],["",""]],["informative","in'fɒ:mәtiv","a. 提供消息的, 见闻广博的",["This is a very informative article.","Yanni watched a very informative video about COVID-19."],["这是篇信息量很大的文章。",""]],["twirl","twә:l","vt. (使)快速转动, 捻弄\\nn. 转动, 万能钥匙, 旋转的东西",["The soft twirl of a leaf, the trill of a bird in the silent forest, were all pixie-whispers."],[""]],["nominal","'nɒminl","a. 名义上的, 名字的, 有名无实的, 稍许的\\nn. 名词性词",["Price increases explain the difference between the real and nominal growth rates.","The GDP, nominal or adjusted by PPP, cannot really tell the \"wealth\" of a nation. There are things in life that numbers cannot describe."],["",""]],["recapture",".ri:'kæptʃә","n. 取回, 夺回\\nvt. 再捕获, 夺回, 重温",["You can't relive the old days but you can visit some places to try and recapture some memories.","All Jews were expelled from Buda after its recapture by Hungary."],["",""]],["frontal","'frʌntәl","a. 前面的, 正面的, 额的\\nn. 额骨, 祭坛(前面的)帏帘, (建筑物的)正面",["I'd rather have a bottle in front of me than a frontal lobotomy.","I'd rather have a full bottle in front of me than a pre-frontal lobotomy."],["",""]],["splendor","'splendә","n. 光辉, 壮丽, 显赫",["The reason the Northern and Southern Dynasties had failed in their rule was that they allowed literary splendor to surpass real substance.","By morning the clouds had lifted and the whole length of the Himalayas lay before us in all its splendor."],["南北朝在他們的統治之下失敗了的原因是他們讓文學的光輝超越了實質內容。",""]],["blatant","'bleitәnt","a. 喧嚣的, 吵闹的, 俗丽的, 炫耀的",["A favorite tool in dealing with blatant racism is blatant ableism.","I am offended by your blatant disregard for my feelings."],["",""]],["viability",".vaiә'biliti","n. 生存能力, 发育能力\\n[医] [生]活[能]力, 生机",["Etsy is responsible for Imogen of the Internet's entire economic viability.","The viability of this approach is a matter of some debate."],["",""]],["spreading","'sprediŋ","[医] 摊开, 涂布\\n[经] 套期图利",["These measures can prevent the disease from spreading.","Maori culture is now spreading more and more among us and their language has become an official language."],["这些措施可以预防疾病蔓延。",""]],["overboard","'әuvәbɒ:d","adv. 自船上落下, 在船外",["Today may be April Fool's Day, but your prank went overboard. Seriously, I'm pretty angry!","He's given to going overboard every time he gets a new idea."],["今天雖然是愚人節，但你的惡作劇太過分了。說真的，我挺生氣的！",""]],["cohesion","kәu'hi:ʒәn","n. 结合, 黏聚, 内聚\\n[计] 内聚性",["The obedience of everyone to rules, even absurd ones, promotes a greater cohesion within society.","Academic writing needs to show cohesion and coherence."],["",""]],["going","'gәuiŋ","n. 去, 离去, 工作情况, 地面状况, 行为\\na. 进行中的, 流行的, 成功的, 现存的",["I was wondering if you were going to show up today.","It would take me too much time to explain to you why it's not going to work."],["我在想你今天会不会来。","给你解释这为什么行不通要花很多时间。"]],["funnel","'fʌnl","n. 漏斗, 漏斗状的东西, 烟囱\\n[化] 漏斗",["Imogen of the Internet can connect to dial-up BBSes by whistling into a funnel attached to a phone line.","Ziri uses this wide-mouth funnel to put medlar jam into jars."],["",""]],["abstinence","'æbstinәns","n. 节制, 禁欲, 戒酒\\n[医] 节制, 禁戒(如禁酒,节欲)",["After a week of abstinence, I really needed to drain my balls.","Religious fundamentalists prefer to advocate the teaching of abstinence instead of the teaching of safe sex."],["",""]],["distorted","dis'tɔ:tid","a. 歪曲的；受到曲解的",["Ziri's representation of the world is distorted by unreasonable fears.","The senator charged that I had distorted the data."],["",""]],["pictorial","pik'tɒ:riәl","a. 绘画的, 插图的, 用图画表示的, 形象化的, 有象形文字特征的\\nn. 画报, 画刊, 有图邮票, 插图杂志, 插图报纸",["A metaphor is a pictorial expression."],[""]],["fanatic","fә'nætik","n. 狂热者, 盲信\\na. 狂热的, 盲信的",["Daniel was a deluded religious fanatic who thought everything was sinful.","Then the fanatic Gallic forces of the Revolution entered the Rhineland, and laid the magnificent castle in ruins."],["",""]],["airway","'єәwei","n. 空中航线, 风道\\n[医] 导气管",["If you sleep on your back it's easier for your upper airway to be obstructed because your tongue, uvula, etc. slip towards the back of your throat."],[""]],["rendering","'rendәriŋ","n. 翻译, 表现, 描写, 表演, 打底, 透视图",["The prime purpose of the profession is the rendering of a public service.","She came completely naked into the room, rendering him speechless."],["",""]],["hopelessly","","adv. 绝望地, 无可奈何地",["Tzu-hsiang's way too honest. He's hopelessly passive in relationships.","Haiti is a nation that seems hopelessly impoverished."],["子翔那個人太老實了，談戀愛都被動得要命。",""]],["ancestry","'ænsestri","n. 祖先, 世系, 名门出身",["However, the singer does not deny her ancestry.","Algerians may or may not self-identify as Berber, but they all have a high percentage of Berber ancestry."],["但是歌手并不否认她的出身。",""]],["upstate","'ʌp'steit","a. 偏僻的, 州的北部的\\nn. 州的北部\\nadv. 在州的北部",["Audrey Louise Reynolds is an artisan living in Upstate New York.","Ziri's story takes place upstate New York."],["",""]],["remembrance","ri'membrәns","n. 回想, 记忆, 纪念品, 记忆力, 问候, 致意",["If I met a dozen individuals during that month who were not going to Europe shortly, I have no distinct remembrance of it now.","Today is a day of remembrance for those who gave the ultimate sacrifice for the good of the United States."],["",""]],["detachment","di'tætʃmәnt","n. 分离, 分遣, 分遣队\\n[医] 脱离, 分离, 支队",["I had retinal detachment five years ago.","Magnanimity is a great treasure; harmonious affinity with others is wonderful, Detachment from name and gain averts trouble; happiness makes older people feel young."],["我五年前做了网膜剥离。","寬宏大量是個寶; 與人無爭結緣好 放下名利不煩惱; 心生歡喜不覺老."]],["repercussion",".ri:pә'kʌʃәn","n. 弹回, 反响, 反射\\n[医] 消退[法], 消肿[法], 浮动诊胎法",["Everything that is said at Tatoeba can have repercussion.","Medical experts say the only possible negative repercussion of using laboratory-produced elastin to repair tissue, is that it could cause inflammation or calcification."],["",""]],["frivolous","'frivәlәs","a. 轻佻的, 妄动的, 琐碎的\\n[法] 轻薄的, 轻浮的, 无意义的",["It is so easy to be solemn; it is so hard to be frivolous.","That manchild is threatening another frivolous lawsuit against someone who made fun of him."],["",""]],["exceedingly","ik'si:diŋli","adv. 极端地, 极度地, 非常",["And again he said: I will multiply thy seed exceedingly, and it shall not be numbered for multitude.","And I will make my covenant between me and thee: and I will multiply thee exceedingly."],["",""]],["accelerated","әk'selәreitid","a. 加快的\\n[医] 加速的",["The yen's appreciation accelerated the decline of that company.","The sled accelerated as it went down the icy slope."],["",""]],["familial","fә'miljәl","a. 家族的, 家庭的\\n[医] 家族的, 全家的",["We celebrated Christmas with a familial lunch.","Like other studies, it indicated that women are much better than men at empathizing with others, regardless of any familial or cultural influences."],["",""]],["decoy","di'kɒi","n. 圈套, 诱骗\\nvt. 诱骗",["Trappers used decoy birds and a sticky substance.","This harmless protein, acting like a decoy, attaches itself to the GAS6 protein within the bloodstream and keeps the harmful AXL protein from being activated."],["",""]],["baton","'bætәn","n. 指挥棒, 接力棒, 警棍",["The band played marvellously under the baton of a new conductor.","The juggler tossed a flaming baton to his partner."],["",""]],["vial","'vaiәl","n. 小瓶\\nvt. 装入小瓶",["The year is 2038. The global government has declared gluten illegal. The last seeds of wheat sit in a freezer next to a vial of smallpox."],[""]],["wrinkled","'riŋkld","a. 具皱的, 有皱纹的",["If you don't fold your clothes or hang them, they will be wrinkled.","Your shirt is very wrinkled. Take it off and I'll iron it for you."],["若沒有將衣服摺起來或是掛在衣架上，會起皺紋。",""]],["thirst","θә:st","n. 口渴, 渴望\\nvi. 口渴, 渴望",["Our people thirst for independence.","Appetite comes with eating, the thirst goes away with drinking."],["我们的人民渴望独立。",""]],["admiral","'ædmәrәl","n. 舰队司令, 海军上将, 旗舰",["Japanese Admiral Isoroku Yamamoto launched the battle.","Shepard became an admiral in the United States Navy, the first astronaut to ever achieve such a rank."],["",""]],["flashy","'flæʃi","a. 闪光的, 一瞬间的, 浮华的",["This fantasy book is a succession of really flashy magical spells and that makes it boring instead.","Tom came to the coming-of-age ceremony in super flashy haori and hakama."],["",""]],["dweller","'dwelә","n. 居民",["Here is the mountain dweller, who will never govern, even though he is educated and competent.","Someone who lives in the city is called a city dweller."],["",""]],["tame","teim","a. 驯服的, 柔顺的, 被开垦的, 顺从的, 乏味的, 平淡的\\nvt. 驯养, 驯服, 制服, 失去锋芒\\nvi. 变得驯服",["The birds are so tame they will eat from your hand.","Ten tame goats pull ten hundredweights of sugar to Zurich main station."],["",""]],["hygiene","'haidʒi:n","n. 卫生保健, 卫生学, 保健法\\n[医] 卫生, 卫生学",["She studies hygiene as part of her domestic science course.","Apart from that, I always pay attention to my hand hygiene."],["",""]],["mindful","'maidful","a. 深切注意的, 留神的, 留心的",["Be mindful of your actions when in a relationship.What may seem playful to you could really be harmful to your partner.","You must be mindful of your family responsibilities."],["请小心地呵护两人之间的感情。也许当你认为只是一个玩笑时，却真真切切地伤了对方的心。",""]],["nonfiction","nɒn'fikʃәn","n. (非小说的)写实文学",["That book isn't nonfiction; it's historical fiction.","The nonfiction writer has published a new work."],["",""]],["porn","pɔ:n","n. 色情描写, 黄色书刊, 色情画, 色情照片, 色情文学",["My brother hides his porn magazines under his mattress.","The author of the Slovio language has even made a porn site in it."],["我的兄弟把色情雜誌藏在床墊下面。",""]],["bison","'baisәn","n. 野牛",["When Columbus discovered America, bison (American buffalo) inhabited a wide-ranging area.","Buffalo Bill didn't kill any bison. It was climate change that did it."],["",""]],["physiology",".fizi'ɒlәdʒi","n. 生理学, 生理机能\\n[医] 生理学",["Individual genes specify individual functions, but the relationship between genes enables physiology.","In essence, a medicinal chemical is nothing more than a molecule that enables a therapeutic change in human physiology."],["",""]],["mussels","","n. 淡菜；贻贝（mussel的复数）；双壳类",["I still can't believe how I could eat forty mussels in one sitting.","The mussels at Benedito's restaurant are steamed to perfection."],["",""]],["relive","ri:'liv","vi. 再生, 复活\\nvt. 再体验",["Sami didn't want to relive all the stuff that had happened.","You can't relive the old days but you can visit some places to try and recapture some memories."],["",""]],["deport","di'pɒ:t","vt. 举止, 驱逐出境\\n[法] 放逐, 驱逐, 递解",["If I don't take care of all the bureaucratic issues, they'll simply deport me.","You can't deport people or keep them from crossing the border without employing authoritarianism."],["",""]],["debacle","dei'bɑ:kl","n. 崩溃, 大失败",["What was at first a natural disaster rapidly became a man-made debacle.","Had I but known what she intended, I might have forestalled this debacle."],["起初的天灾迅速演变为了人祸。",""]],["detrimental",".detri'mentәl","a. 有害的",["Exercise caution, as your choices may result in detrimental effects that cannot be easily undone.","If you eat a spoonful of sugar or a small piece of whole wheat bread, it seems that the bread would be less detrimental."],["",""]],["amen",".ɑ:'men","interj. 阿门",["If not for \"if\" and \"however\", I would say amen to everything.","The girl was pregnant before the priest could say Amen."],["",""]],["genus","'dʒi:nәs","n. 种, 类\\n[医] 属(分类)",["The Sargasso Sea is a vast patch of ocean named for a genus of free-floating seaweed called Sargassum.","Kingdom Phylum Class Order Family Genus Species."],["馬尾藻海是一片廣闊的海域，因一種名為「馬尾藻」的自由漂浮海藻而得名。","界门纲目科属种。"]],["blare","blєә","n. 巨响, 吼叫声, 光泽\\nvi. 高声鸣叫, 大叫\\nvt. 大声喊出",["The blare of the radio burst upon our ears.","Then come the clamour and the trumpet's blare."],["",""]],["funded","","a. 成为有固定利息的长期借款的\\n[法] 提供资金的, 有固定利息的, 长期借款的",["Yanni's life is funded illegally. In fact, Yanni steals cars for a living.","In Algeria, everything is funded with public money."],["",""]],["oversized","'әuvә'saizd","a. 过大的, 极大的",["Elasmosaurs generally have the look of oversized, shellless turtles with long necks.","Your cock is so small, it looks like an oversized clit."],["",""]],["valuation",".vælju'eiʃәn","n. 评价, 估价, 价值判断\\n[经] 估价, 计价, 评价",["The real estate agent did a completely different valuation of the house.","Experts put a high valuation on the painting."],["",""]],["gobble","'gɒbl","n. 火鸡叫声\\nvt. 狼吞虎咽\\nvi. 贪食, 咯咯叫",["\"Just gobble. Become big pigs\", said Joe and watched the unprepossessing animals with admiration.","Don't gobble all the food up before I get back."],["",""]],["attainment","ә'teinmәnt","n. 达到",["He taught contemplation as a means of spiritual purification and the attainment of the Dao, a principle that signifies the highest spiritual ideals of mankind.","The attainment of a goal is a very delightful experience."],["他为精神的洁净和获得道的方法教深思，道是表示人类最高的精神理想的一个原则。",""]],["jolt","dʒәult","n. 震摇, 摇动, 颠簸\\nvi. 颠簸而行, 震摇\\nvt. 使颠簸, 使慌张, 猛击",["Suddenly I felt something like a jolt.","Yanni's car started to jolt slightly."],["",""]],["ardent","'ɑ:dnt","a. 热心的, 激动的, 燃烧般的\\n[医] 灼热的; 热心的",["Only an ardent fan could create such a faithful pastiche of the artist's works.","This pair of lovers were carrying on an ardent correspondence."],["",""]],["naturalist","'nætʃәrәlist","n. 自然主义者",["John Muir was a famous naturalist who founded the Sierra Club.","Contrary to stereotype, not every whale is big. That's according to our onboard naturalist."],["",""]],["centennial","sen'tenjәl","n. 百年纪念\\na. 一百年的",["My university is celebrating its centennial this year, so you can see banners with its colors, logo, and mascot all over the place.","The US releases centennial coins to celebrate different milestones."],["我的大学今年正在庆祝建校一百周年，因此你到处都可以看到带有它颜色，标志和吉祥物的横幅。",""]],["learned","'lә:nid","a. 有学问的, 学术上的\\nlearn的过去式和过去分词",["At the age of six he had learned to use the typewriter and told the teacher that he did not need to learn to write by hand.","It was an advantage having learned Chinese while I was in school."],["他六歲的時候學會了用打字機，便和老師說他不用學執筆寫字了。","在学校时我学了中文是个优势。"]],["unprepared",".ʌnpri'pєәd","a. 无准备的, 即席的, 不期而遇的",["Tom was unprepared for the scathing criticism meted out to him by his boss.","Israeli troops were completely unprepared for the brutality of war in southern Lebanon."],["",""]],["appalling","ә'pɒ:liŋ","a. 骇人的, 令人震惊的",["The lack of care some people put into their subtitles is appalling.","It's perfectly appalling to think of being twenty, Marilla. It sounds so fearfully old and grown up."],["",""]],["righteous","'raitʃәs","a. 公正的, 正义的, 正直的\\n[法] 正直的, 正当的, 正义的",["Surely the most honorable of you with Allah is the most righteous of you.","The labour of the righteous tendeth to life: the fruit of the wicked to sin."],["",""]],["subpoena","sәb'pi:nә","n. 传票\\nvt. 传审, 传唤",["Why doesn't he subpoena them?"],[""]],["provisional","prә'viʒәnl","a. 暂时的, 暂定的, 临时的\\n[医] 临时的",["We'll have our firm's attorneys look through the provisional agreement.","Discussions were held debating the merits of appointing a provisional government to serve until formal elections could take place."],["",""]],["mend","mend","n. 改进, 修补, 好转\\nvt. 修改, 改进, 加快, 修理\\nvi. 好转, 改善",["How much will it cost to mend this skirt?","My old house giving me trouble. I have to mend a part of it every day."],["补一下这条裙子要多少钱？",""]],["cheerfully","'tʃiәfuli","adv. 高高兴兴地",["The blue bird is perched on a branch, singing cheerfully.","He tried to act cheerfully, but we all knew how sad he felt."],["蓝色的鸟栖息在树枝上，兴致昂扬地唱着歌。","他试图表现得很愉快，但我们都知道他有多悲伤。"]],["metaphysical",".metә'fizikl","a. 形而上学的, 纯粹哲学的, 抽象的",["Mathematics has not a foot to stand upon which is not purely metaphysical.","\"Metaphysical Meditations\" is a work by Descartes."],["",""]],["teller","'telә","n. 叙述者, 讲故事者, 出纳员\\n[经] 出纳员",["I recognized the bank teller as the man I had seen in the movie theater.","According to the fortune teller, I was supposedly a prince in another life."],["",""]],["internalize","in'tә:nәlaiz","vt. 使内在化",["It's no good to internalize such self-degrading thoughts.","The root of the problem lies in our employees' incapacity to internalize the sentiments of the company."],["",""]],["demolition",".demә'liʃәn","n. 破坏, 毁坏, 撤销\\n[经] 拆毁(除,破坏)",["If the demolition of buildings is uncontrolled, a fine city is in danger of becoming nothing more than a concrete jungle.","Well over three thousand people signed to prevent the demolition of this historic building."],["",""]],["tweak","twi:k","n. 拧, 扭, 焦急\\nvt. 扭, 开足马力",["You only need to tweak the wording. You don't need to rewrite the whole thing.","Could you tweak the audio settings a little? The bass is too loud."],["",""]],["spiritually","","adv. 在精神上地",["You don't grow spiritually just because you go to parties named after Hindu gods and do drugs.","Sami said that he was spiritually possessed by a demon."],["",""]],["leafy","'li:fi","a. 叶茂盛的, 多叶的, 叶状的",["Foods rich in vitamin E include dark-green, leafy vegetables, beans, nuts and whole-grain cereals.","I've heard that you don't eat green leafy vegetables. You say that it is food for animals."],["",""]],["devout","di'vaut","a. 虔诚的, 虔敬的, 诚恳的",["Sami was a very devout Catholic and he didn't believe in divorce.","Nevertheless, devout conversation on spiritual things helps no little with spiritual progress."],["",""]],["proprietor","prә'praiәtә","n. 所有者\\n[经] 所有人, 资本主, 业主",["The proprietor of the store worked at the head of his employees.","I am the proprietor of an apartment in Bejaia, Algeria."],["",""]],["noted","'nәutid","a. 著名的, 显著的, 扬名的",["Noted literary personalities gathered together last evening.","The modernized version of the qipao is noted for accentuating the female figure."],["知名文学界人士昨晚齐聚一堂。","现代版旗袍因能突显女人的身材而闻名。"]],["boiler","'bɒilә","n. 煮器, 汽锅, 锅炉\\n[化] 锅炉",["You have to melt chocolate in a double-boiler so it doesn't burn.","The boiler room contains the heating equipment used to distribute heat throughout the mall."],["",""]],["fielder","'fi:ldә(r)","n. 外场员, 守队队员",["The left fielder ran hard and caught the long fly.","The center fielder shifted his position for the slugger."],["",""]],["reorganize",".ri:'ɒ:gәnaiz","v. 改组, 再编制, 改造",["We need to reorganize it in order to strengthen our business activities.","As the date didn't work for the section chief, it was necessary to completely reorganize the drinking party."],["",""]],["penetration",".peni'treiʃәn","n. 穿透, 渗透, 侵入, 识穿, 洞察(力)\\n[化] 渗入",["The idea that sex must involve penetration is phallocentric and heterosexist.","The meeting of man and God must always mean a penetration and entry of the divine into the human and a self-immergence of man in the Divinity."],["",""]],["grimace","gri'meis","n. 鬼脸, 怪相\\nvi. 扮鬼脸, 作怪相",["Four-year-old Sam begrudgingly ate his broccoli with a grimace on his face.","Tom leant in to kiss Mary, but she recoiled with a grimace."],["",""]],["unjust",".ʌn'dʒʌst","a. 不公平的\\n[法] 不公正的人; 不公正的, 不公平的, 不合理的",["Women have been resigned to unjust treatment for too long.","Not all violence is equally reprehensible; not all wars are equally unjust."],["",""]],["exporter","ik'spɒ:tә","n. 出口商, 输出者, 出口公司\\n[经] 出口商, 输出者",["Algeria could become an even larger energy exporter.","The United States is the world's leading cotton exporter."],["",""]],["narration","nә'reiʃәn","n. 叙述, 故事, 叙述文\\n[法] 陈诉, 原告陈述者事实",["The narration is written in the first person singular because it is fictionally taken from the man's everyday journal.","There are different points of view in the narration."],["",""]],["powerfully","","adv. 强有力, 强大, 效力大, 有权威, 权力大, 有影响, 很多, 相当, 非常",["Gabor was powerfully built."],[""]],["baggy","'bægi","a. 袋状的, 松垂的",["My husband has lost three stone since he fell ill, and his trousers are now all baggy.","Since my husband became sick he's lost 20 kilograms and his pants are now baggy."],["",""]],["rearview","'riәvju:","mirror(车辆上的)后视镜",["Tom checked his rearview mirror before pulling out into traffic.","Tom sat in the driver's seat and adjusted the rearview mirror."],["",""]],["ailing","'eiliŋ","a. 生病的\\n[医] 患病的, 病痛的",["Yanni left to Algiers to take care of his ailing mother.","The teenage girl disguised herself as a boy to look for work to feed her ailing father and small brother."],["",""]],["strife","straif","n. 争吵, 竞争, 冲突",["Marriage, in peace, is this world's paradise; in strife, this life's purgatory.","Finances are traditionally the biggest cause of strife in a relationship."],["",""]],["exaggeration","ig.zædʒә'reiʃәn","n. 夸张, 夸大的事物, 夸大之词",["It is no exaggeration to say that he is a first-rate writer.","It's not an exaggeration to say that Mrs. Smith is addicted to TV."],["",""]],["jordanian","dʒɒ:'deiniәn","a. 约旦的\\nn. 约旦人",["My mom is part Kabyle and my dad is part Jordanian.","My country is Jordan. I am Jordanian. I speak Arabic."],["",""]],["accentuate","æk'sentjueit","vt. 以重音念, 强调, 重读",["Carmela's high cheekbones accentuate her facial structure, enhancing her natural beauty.","Make-up can accentuate your cheekbones."],["",""]],["primer","'praimә","n. 入门书, 初级读本, 雷管, 导火线, 底漆\\n[化] 底漆; 引物; 雷管; 导火线",["Let's have a little bit of a primer on weight and mass, especially if we start talking about atomic weight and atomic mass.","This book's a good primer on the subject, but it doesn't go into much depth."],["",""]],["leash","li:ʃ","n. (拴狗颈的)皮带\\nvt. 以皮带束缚, 束缚",["As soon as I let go of the leash, the dog ran away.","Tom's dog slipped its leash again and almost attacked one of those tiny, yappy dogs."],["",""]],["validation",".væli'deiʃәn","n. 批准, 确认\\n[计] 证实, 检验",["The validation methodology was based also on Bowling's reports.","Today I'm less dependent on external sources of validation than I was ten years ago, although I still have a long way to go."],["",""]],["gutter","'gʌtә","n. 排水沟, 槽, 贫民区\\nvt. 开沟于\\nvi. 流\\n[计] 装订线",["On May 18, a young Japanese couple was arrested after their one-year-old baby was found wrapped in a plastic bag and dumped in a gutter.","This company has become a gutter for broken dreams."],["一對年輕日本夫婦，把一歲大的親生嬰兒放進膠袋，棄置於排水溝中，於五月十八日被捕。",""]],["auditory","'ɒ:ditәri","a. 听觉的, 听觉器官的\\n[医] 听[音]的, 听觉的",["Those voices are known as auditory hallucinations.","An eyewitness is worth more than ten auditory witnesses."],["",""]],["propensity","prә'pensәti","n. 倾向, 爱好, 习性",["Tom had a propensity for looking the other way when spoken to.","Those who are against sex have a strange propensity to talk a lot about it."],["",""]],["ponytail","'pәuniteil","n. 马尾辫",["In family photos, Ciham appears carefree. She poses casually for the camera, her hair pulled into a braided ponytail.","I used a ribbon to tie my hair into a ponytail."],["在家庭照片中，西哈姆看起來無憂無慮。她對著鏡頭擺出一副隨興的姿勢，頭髮綁成馬尾。","我用絲帶在頭上紮了一個馬尾辮。"]],["adventurous","әd'ventʃәrәs","a. 喜欢冒险的, 有进取心的, 危险的",["In private, Kobayashi-san told me he liked his women \"adventurous.\" What he calls an adventure I hope to never know.","Tom doesn't seem to be as adventurous as Mary seems to be."],["",""]],["bottled","'bɒtld","a. 瓶装的",["Having said 'domestic wine', anything bottled domestically is deemed to be domestic wine.","Titanium dioxide is frequently added to bottled salad dressing."],["",""]],["reinstate",".ri:in'steit","vt. 使复原, 使恢复, 使复立",["\"Doctor Bergman, what's the news?\" \"The good news, Tim, is that your father underwent mind uploading before he died. We can clone him and reinstate his mind.\"","Should we reinstate the death penalty?"],["",""]],["islamist","iz'lɑ:mist","n. 伊斯兰教主义者；回教教徒",["Everything can and should be translated, including what far-right, racist or Islamist extremist groups don't like.","The minority of Kabyle who support the criminal and corrupt Algerian state are Islamist Kabyle."],["",""]],["delusion","di'lu:ʒәn","n. 迷惑, 欺瞒, 错觉\\n[医] 妄想",["That girl is under the delusion that she is a princess.","Denying the existence of the Berber language is a delusion."],["",""]],["breathless","'breθlis","a. 喘不过气来的, 屏气的, 气喘吁吁的, 无风的, 死的",["He was watching the scene with breathless interest.","There are some performances that leave one breathless."],["",""]],["daisy","'deizi","n. 雏菊, 一流人物\\na. 第一流的",["A little nap and, just like that, I'm as fresh as a daisy.","If you keep early hours, you may always be fresh as a daisy in the morning."],["我小睡后就感到精力充沛。",""]],["privatize","","vt.vi. 私有化",["The government has now abandoned its plans to privatize parts of the health service.","Effective public policy is not a simple matter of centralize or decentralize, subsidize or privatize, regulate or deregulate."],["",""]],["refund","'ri:fʌnd","n. 偿还\\nvt. 付还, 偿还借款\\nvi. 归还, 偿还",["I had words with the manager of that store, because he refused to refund my money for the TV set that wasn't operating properly.","The clerk refused to give me a refund at which point I demanded to see the manager."],["我找商店经理谈了话，因为他拒绝为那不能用的电视退钱。",""]],["plutonium","plu:'tәuniәm","n. 钚\\n[化] 钚Pu",["The nuclear plant uses steam produced by plutonium fuel rods to power turbines to create electricity.","Uranium and plutonium are radioactive."],["",""]],["synthesize","'sinθisaiz","v. 综合, 合成",["The lab is trying to synthesize an antidote to treat the poisoning victims.","Russel E. Marker was able to synthesize progesterone from the fruits of a wild Mexican tree, the yams."],["",""]],["solidify","sә'lidifai","v. (使)凝固, (使)团结, 巩固",["Quickly stop the flow of milk, leave to stand for approximately 30 minutes for the milk to solidify.","The dictator reorganised the country's leadership line-up in order to solidify his power base."],["",""]],["ascribe","ә'skraib","vt. 归因于, 归咎于\\n[法] 归咎于",["Some scholars ascribe the settlement of America to social unrest in Western Europe.","Most stereotypes ascribe negative characteristics to a group."],["",""]],["stabilization",".steibilai'zeiʃәn","n. 安定, 稳定, 平抑, 安定化, 稳定化\\n[医] 稳定, 安定",["Algeria needs a strong plan of economic stabilization.","Adaptogens are used in herbal medicine for the purported stabilization of physiological processes and promotion of homeostasis."],["",""]],["trafficker","'træfikә","n. 商人, 贩子\\n[法] 贩卖者, 买卖者, 商人",["Of course he's a trafficker; he openly admits to viewing women as property.","The billionaire accusing the prime minister of ignoring sex trafficking supports replacing him with an actual sex trafficker."],["",""]],["uncanny",".ʌn'kæni","a. 怪诞的, 可怕的, 离奇的, 神秘的",["She bears an uncanny resemblance to Marilyn Monroe.","Chigurh has an uncanny ability to disappear without a trace."],["",""]],["aspiring","ә'spaiәriŋ","a. 有抱负的, 有志气的",["This coffee shop is frequented by aspiring artists.","When practicing at home, the aspiring bartender had to use a potato peeler to zest lemons."],["",""]],["pane","pein","n. 窗玻璃, 方框, 方格, 窗格\\nvt. 嵌窗玻璃于\\n[计] 窗格",["The rain beats against the window pane.","I suddenly saw myself reflected in a window pane and it startled me."],["雨滴敲打窗户玻璃。",""]],["atm","","[计] 自动出纳机; 异步传输方式",["It doesn't matter if you have no money left in your pocket. Go to the ATM.","After Tom had entered four wrong PIN numbers, the ATM swallowed his card."],["口袋里的钱摸空了没关系，去找自动取款机吧。",""]],["feeder","'fi:dә","n. 饲养者, 供给者, 奶瓶\\n[化] 给料器",["Jed works as a cattle feeder, but he has designs on the whole ranch.","The hummingbird was too timid to come to the feeder when squirrels were around."],["",""]],["specified","","a. 规定的；详细说明的",["He arrived five minutes after the specified time.","GNP is measured as the total market value of all the goods and service produced by a nation during a specified period."],["他在指定时间的五分钟后到了。",""]],["dampen","'dæmpәn","vt. 弄湿, 使沮丧\\nvi. 变湿, 丧气",["Benedito used water to dampen the cloth for cleaning.","The defeat didn't dampen his spirits."],["",""]],["rouse","rauz","n. 觉醒, 奋起, 干杯\\nvt. 唤醒, 鼓舞, 激动, 使振奋, 惊起\\nvi. 醒来, 奋起",["The slogan was designed to rouse the people.","Come on, old dozer, rouse yourself from your dreams!"],["",""]],["childbirth","'tʃaildbә:θ","n. 分娩\\n[医] 分娩, 生产",["The risk associated with advanced age childbirth has been considerably reduced compared to long time ago.","Many women pursue higher education and careers, thus delaying marriage and childbirth."],["",""]],["smother","'smʌðә","vt. 使喘不过气, 使窒息, 闷熄, 忍住, 抑制, 覆盖\\nvi. 窒息, 被抑制\\nn. 浓烟, 窒息状态, 杂乱无章",["Where women love each other, men learn to smother their mutual dislike.","They planned to smother the flames quickly to prevent further damage."],["",""]],["eject","i'dʒekt","vt. 逐放, 放逐, 喷射\\n[化] 排出",["Press the small button to eject the CD from the computer.","Always press the eject button before removing a CD."],["",""]],["backstage","'bæksteidʒ","adv. 在后台, 向后台",["Tom went backstage to see if he could meet some of the band members.","Puppeteers control the huge beasts from backstage, sending directional instructions by remote control."],["",""]],["flatly","'flætli","adv. 枯燥无味地, 完全地, 直截了当地, 毅然地, 断然地",["You should have refused his request flatly.","When I invited her to Islam, she flatly rejected it."],["你应该直接拒绝他的要求。",""]],["unauthorized",".ʌn'ɒ:θәraizd","a. 未经许可的\\n[法] 无权的, 未经授权的, 未经许可的",["Use a password to protect your laptop from unauthorized access.","I don't want unauthorized pictures of me on people's social media."],["",""]],["sincerity","sin'serәti","n. 诚实, 真实, 诚心诚意",["Sami was able to convince people of his sincerity.","I think we're slowly becoming more comfortable with sincerity again."],["",""]],["marshal","'mɑ:ʃәl","n. 元帅, 陆空军高级将官, 典礼官, 执法官\\nvt. 整理, 引领, 统率\\nvi. 排列, 各就各位",["I will marshal a fair amount of scientific data to support my argument.","US Marshal Tom Jackson is determined to recover the fugitive."],["",""]],["forgiving","fә'giviŋ","a. 宽大的, 容许有错误的",["Forgiving others is a kind deed to yourself.","If there is such a thing as an unforgivable act, it is the act of not forgiving."],["原諒別人就是善待自己。",""]],["trainee","trei'ni:","n. 实习生, 新兵, 受培训者\\n[经] 学徒工, 培训人员",["The trainee could hardly bear the burden of the task.","Because the new trainee did things sluggishly, he was told that he'd be fired if he didn't start taking his job seriously."],["",""]],["undesirable",".ʌndi'zaiәrәbl","a. 不受欢迎的, 不合乎社会道德标准的\\n[法] 不受欢迎的人, 不良份子, 不法份子",["This movie may have an undesirable influence on children.","All the vibraslap does is remind everyone of the band Cake, which may be undesirable in some situations."],["",""]],["horde","hɒ:d","n. (一)群, 游牧部落, 移动群\\nvi. 成群结队",["Tom was surrounded by a horde of screaming fangirls.","The Golden Horde wreaked havoc and death all around Eurasia."],["",""]],["hideous","'hidiәs","a. 丑恶的, 可憎的, 令人沮丧的",["You can come back again but not in this hideous Kabyle dress.","Some things get more hideous, when you clean them."],["",""]],["infancy","'infәnsi","n. 幼年, 初期, 幼儿期\\n[医] 婴儿期(一足岁以内)",["Space science is still in its infancy.","Character building begins in our infancy and continues until death."],["空間科學還在起步階段。",""]],["tsunami","tsu'nɑ:mi","n. 海啸",["An earthquake, 8.9 on the Richter scale, hits Japan and causes a massive tsunami.","A tsunami is coming, so please be on the alert."],["日本發生規模8.9的強烈地震，引發強大海嘯。","海啸来了，密切注意啊。"]],["mute","mju:t","n. 哑子, 哑音字母, 弱音器\\na. 哑的, 无声的, 沉默的\\nvt. 减弱...的声音\\nvi. 排泄",["Deaf-mute people talk using sign language.","Helen Keller was blind, deaf and mute."],["聾啞的人用手語說話。","海伦·凯勒眼盲、耳聋并且不能说话。"]],["craftsman","'kræftsmәn","n. 工匠, 技工, 手艺人",["A good craftsman takes pride in his work.","A craftsman manually adds the finishing touches to each curve of a bullet train's lead car."],["好的工匠為自己的作品感到驕傲。",""]],["alternately","'ɒ:ltәnәtli","adv. 交替地, 间隔地",["The black and white squares on a checker board are arranged alternately.","Arrange the apples and oranges alternately in a row."],["",""]],["escalating","ˈeskəleitɪŋ","v. （使）逐步升级( escalate的现在分词 ); （使）逐步扩大; （使）更高; （使）更大",["\"Given the escalating house prices, it seems like a verifiably better decision to go with renting for longer,\" Ciuntu said.","Direct confrontation can help prevent misunderstandings from escalating into bigger conflicts."],["",""]],["intersect",".intә'sekt","vt. 贯穿, 横穿\\nvi. 交错, 相交",["Jerusalem is a place where Islam, Christianity and Judaism all intersect.","The two streets intersect at right angles."],["",""]],["eyeball","'aibɒ:l","n. 眼球\\n[医] 眼球",["There's no need to worry about accuracy this time; just eyeball it.","I like to eyeball my ingredients, mostly because I don't feel like washing my measuring cups over and over."],["现在精确度已经不重要了，你目测一下就好。",""]],["professionalism","prә'feʃәnә,lizәm","n. 职业特性, 专业技巧, 职业行为, 职业作风, (褒)专业人员的特质, 职业化\\n[经] 职业特性, 职业作风, 职业化",["The main advantage of our company is professionalism.","Carlos is an employee who always conducts himself with professionalism."],["",""]],["chi","kai, ki:","n. 希腊语的第22个字母\\n[医] 卡, χ(希腊文的第二十二个字母)",["He is thinking whether to stay in Hanoi or go to Ho Chi Minh City to work.","By the time we are in Ho Chi Minh City, he will be there too."],["",""]],["watermelon","'wɒtә.melәn","n. 西瓜",["In the hotel room there was a watermelon on the table.","There is a watermelon on the table in the hotel room."],["旅館房間裡的桌上有個西瓜。","旅館房間裡的桌上有個西瓜。"]],["oatmeal","'әutmi:l","n. 燕麦片, 燕麦粥\\n[医] 燕麦片",["Tom usually only eats oatmeal for breakfast.","Every morning I eat a bowl of oatmeal."],["汤姆通常早饭只吃燕麦。","我每天早晨吃一碗麦片粥。"]],["treacherous","'tretʃәrәs","a. 不可信任的, 危险的, 背叛的, 不可靠的\\n[法] 奸诈的, 背叛的, 背信弃义的",["The large number of islands in the Caribbean Sea creates many areas of shallow water that can be treacherous to ship navigation.","Cape Horn, located at the southern tip of South America, is one of the most treacherous sailing passages in the world."],["",""]],["dormitory","'dɒ:mitәri","n. 宿舍",["I left the notes in the dormitory. I'll go back and get them now.","We will all be playing in the dormitory tomorrow night, can you come?"],["我把筆記落在宿舍了，我現在就回去拿。","明天晚上我们都去宿舍玩儿，你能不能去？"]],["quirky","'kw\\\\\\\\:ki","a. 诡诈的, 突兀的, 古怪的, 离奇的\\n[法] 诡诈的, 颇为曲折的",["Tom has quite a quirky personality.","I'm shy at first, but once I trust you I become a quirky goofball."],["湯姆具有詼諧的性格。",""]],["outstretched",".aut'stretʃt","a. 伸开的, 扩张的, 延伸的",["Never hesitate to accept the outstretched hand of another.","Here I would lie outstretched on the mossy ground, thinking strange thoughts and dreaming of strange dreams."],["",""]],["staffing","'stɑ:fiŋ","[计] 人员指挥\\n[经] 配备职工",["Paul's knowledge of creative bookkeeping has been the secret of his ability to get all the staffing he needs.","Federal departments have been hit with an official hiring freeze in an attempt to bring down government staffing costs."],["",""]],["stairwell","","n. 楼梯井",["They think that the fire started in the stairwell.","The lift is out of order, and the lights in the stairwell don't work."],["",""]],["hassle","'hæsl","n. 激烈而持久的争论\\nvi. 争论\\nvt. 与...争辩, 使烦恼",["It's become a hassle to keep on dyeing my hair.","It's a hassle trying to decide what to wear to the party."],["一直染发太麻烦了。",""]],["moderation",".mɒdә'reiʃәn","n. 缓和, 适度, 温和\\n[化] 慢化",["Even after sunset there was little moderation in the temperature.","Good health is inseparable from exercise and moderation."],["甚至在日落之后，气温也不见降低。","健康与运动及节制密不可分。"]],["stricken","'strikәn","a. 受打击的, 负了伤的, 衰老的, 受灾的\\nstrike的过去分词",["Italy's spike in mortalities exceeded worst-case forecasts, as well as the overall rate in other stricken countries.","On the faces of the grief-stricken refugees appeared a faint smile."],["",""]],["stipulate","'stipjuleit","v. 规定, 保证",["If you stipulate that these things are true, I will sign the contract.","Did you stipulate that it was to be delivered by August first?"],["",""]],["adultery","ә'dʌltәri","n. 通奸\\n[法] 通奸",["My grandfather believes he would be killed by a thunderbolt if he committed adultery.","Adolescence is the stage between puberty and adultery."],["",""]],["remarry",".ri:'mæri","v. (使)再婚",["Sami didn't want to share his mom with any other mom. In fact, never wanted her to remarry.","It would be unseemly to remarry the day after the divorce becomes final."],["",""]],["changed","","a. 变化的；改变的",["The past can only be known, not changed. The future can only be changed, not known.","The room looks different after I've changed the curtains."],["我們可以回顧過去，但不能改變過去；我們可以改變未來，但不能預知未來。","我換了窗簾後，房間看起來不同了。"]],["foreman","'fɒ:mәn","n. 领班, 工头, 陪审长\\n[经] 领班, 工头",["Mum, a mere woman surrounded by men, works in a construction company as a site foreman.","The foreman docked me an hour's pay for getting to work late."],["",""]],["corpus","'kɒ:pәs","n. (事物的)主体, 文集, 本金, 语料库\\n[医] 体",["We created a freely available English-Japanese bilingual corpus.","I would prefer to have a list of Italian words which aren't in the corpus."],["",""]],["determining","","v. 决定（determine的ing形式）",["This is an interesting case where there is no principal determining element.","The problem is one of determining the dominant factors in this phenomenon."],["",""]],["intrusive","in'tru:siv","a. 打扰的, 插入的\\n[法] 闯入的, 侵入的, 干涉的",["He is very intrusive; he keeps interfering in people's affairs.","Miroslav apologized for being intrusive at the beginning."],["",""]],["confidently","","adv. 自信地；安心地",["If you can't do it confidently, at least do it hopefully.","When you are with an indecisive group, confidently propose something that no one would agree to."],["",""]],["metabolic",".metә'bɒlik","a. 变化的, 变形的, 新陈代谢的\\n[医] [新陈]代谢的",["Positron Emission Tomography uses a radioactive tracer to visualize metabolic activity within the human body.","To assess metabolic health, doctors measure blood sugar, cholesterol, blood pressure and other indicators."],["",""]],["memorandum",".memә'rændәm","n. 备忘录, 外交备忘录, 交易备忘录\\n[经] 备忘录, 便笺, 便函",["I haven't yet read the new memorandum on internal security.","This memorandum shall be published in the Federal Register."],["",""]],["dwindling","ˈdwindlɪŋ","a. 逐渐减少的\\nv. 逐渐变少或变小( dwindle的现在分词 )",["The central bank said Tuesday the currency depreciation was a deliberate policy in the face of dwindling oil revenues.","Dwindling resources have hampered the efforts of police to stem the rise of violent crime in the city."],["",""]],["infinitely","'infinitli","adv. 无限地, 无数地, 庞大地",["Many astronomers assume that the universe expands infinitely.","Life would be infinitely happier if we could only be born at the age of eighty and gradually approach eighteen."],["",""]],["methodological",".meθәdә'lɒdʒikl","a. 方法的",["There are a number of methodological problems here, not to mention the inaccuracy of some of the results.","Here the authors touch on the central methodological issue."],["",""]],["embodiment","im'bɒdimәnt","n. 具体化, 化身",["You've become the embodiment of everything I despise.","They view the Devil as a symbol of temptation, evil, and the embodiment of sin."],["",""]],["overdue","'әuvә'dju:","a. 过期的, 未兑的, 迟到的, 早就成熟的\\n[经] 过期未付的",["They are going to cut the service off because of our overdue payment.","This is a friendly reminder about an overdue invoice."],["",""]],["mover","'mu:vә","n. 移动的人, 原动力, 鼓动者",["A steam turbine is a prime mover in which steam at high velocity impinges upon the blades of a rotating element, thus transforming energy of the steam into mechanical energy."],[""]],["fragmentation",".frægmәn'teiʃәn","n. 分裂, 破碎\\n[计] 在IP层将打包文件切成适当大小的程序",["There are many theories as to what caused the fall and fragmentation of the Roman Empire.","One way animals asexually reproduce is via fragmentation."],["",""]],["cameraman","'kæmәrәmæn","n. 照相师, 摄影师",["What's the nationality of that cameraman over there?","After his university studies, he became a cameraman."],["那个摄影师是哪国人？",""]],["cognition","kɒg'niʃәn","n. 认识, 认识力, 认识的结果\\n[医] 认识, 识别",["Child development includes the growth of cognition."],["兒童發展包含認知能力的成長。"]],["sweatshirt","","n. 园领长袖运动衫",["Tom is wearing a purple sweatshirt.","Grandpa put on a sweatshirt and went out to take care of the cattle."],["湯姆穿著一件紫色的運動衫。",""]],["prolific","prәu'lifik","a. 有生殖力的, 多产的, 丰富的\\n[医] 多育的, 多产的, 繁殖的",["My friends say I'm a prolific writer, but I haven't written anything for months.","It appears as though I am the most prolific contributor to the English language's category on this website."],["",""]],["gladly","'glædli","adv. 高兴地, 乐意地, 欢喜地",["I'd gladly pay more for something if it's of high quality.","I have my limits. If you cross them, I'll gladly walk away."],["如果它是高品質的東西我會很樂意多付一點錢。",""]],["mythical","'miθikә l","a. 神话的, 存在于神话中的, 神话式的, 不真实的, 虚构的, 幻想出来的",["The \"Newton Project\" collection contains maps that Newton drafted about mythical events of the end of days.","Would you look at that! After a long and exhausting quest I finally managed to find the mythical Scroll of Swordsmanship."],["",""]],["leukemia","lju:'ki:miә","n. 白血病, 白血球过多症\\n[化] 白血病",["Neither Tom nor Mary has been diagnosed with leukemia.","Bone marrow transplants have become routine in the West for blood cancers, such as leukemia, and similar diseases."],["",""]],["marginalize","'mɑ:dʒinəlaiz","vt.使处于社会边缘,使脱离社会发展进程, 忽视,排斥",["I began to marginalize the pepperoni on the pizza by devouring it selectively based on its protein index.","And more fundamentally, these laws wrongly stigmatize and marginalize those living with HIV and AIDS."],["",""]],["mulch","mʌltʃ","n. 覆盖物, 护根, 根篱\\nvt. 铺护盖物, 做护根",["I've been lopping trees all afternoon and shredding them into mulch for the garden.","Despite the bark mulch, borage is sprouting up around the original plant."],["",""]],["upwards","'ʌpwәdz","adv. 以上, 向上",["The kite soared upwards with the swiftness of a bird.","Boris heard the tent's zipper slowly sliding upwards."],["",""]],["unnamed","'ʌn'neimd","a. 未命名的, 没有名字的, 未提及的\\n[计] 无名的",["An unnamed assailant fired a shot at the mayor before disappearing into the crowd.","There are so many brave people who will forever go unnamed."],["",""]],["syndicated","","a. 成为企业组合的",["Her column is syndicated in forty newspapers."],["她的專欄在四十家報紙同步刊登。"]],["powerhouse","'pauәhaus","n. 发电所, 动力室, 精力旺盛的人, 办事效率高的机构",["The highway system will make Algeria an economic powerhouse.","Algeria will become North Africa's economic powerhouse."],["",""]],["defective","di'fektiv","a. 有缺陷的, 欠缺的\\nn. 有缺陷的人, 不完全变化词",["Some diseases are caused by a defective gene.","Many clients are complaining about how all the store's merchandise is defective."],["一些疾病的产生原因是基因缺陷。",""]],["shabby","'ʃæbi","a. 衣衫褴褛的, 低劣的, 破旧的, 吝啬的, 卑鄙的",["In the end, we ended up eating at that shabby restaurant.","The room was empty except for a shabby bed."],["结果，我们在那破破烂烂的餐馆里吃了饭。","房間除了一張破舊的床以外，就甚麼也沒有了。"]],["censor","'sensә","n. 检查员\\nvt. 检查, 审查, 删改",["I wonder which country will be the first to censor Tatoeba.","It'd be very convenient if we could censor this kind of comment."],["我想知道哪个国家会第一个和谐Tatoeba？",""]],["schoolchild","'sku:ltʃaild","n. 学童",["As it is now, many schoolchildren own a dictionary but don't really know what to do with it."],[""]],["construe","kәn'stru:","vt. 解释, 分析, 对...逐字直译\\nvi. 作句法分析\\nn. 直译",["They usefully managed to construe an efficient work ethic.","She could construe irregular Latin verbs without a moment's hesitation."],["",""]],["overhaul",".әuvә'hɒ:l","vt. 分解检查, 翻修, 精细检查, 彻底革新\\nn. 分解检查, 精细检查, 大检修",["The Prime Minister tried to convince his coalition partners to overhaul pensions.","Kenya is embarking on a pilot program to overhaul its education system."],["",""]],["conducive","kәn'dju:siv","a. 有益于...的, 有助于...的, 助长的",["Your behavior is not conducive to the desired environment.","When cowardice is conducive to self-preservation, it is called intelligence."],["",""]],["conceptualize","kәn'septjuәlaiz","vt. 使概念化\\n[计] 概念表达",["The best way to conceptualize looting is as similar to pollution, a byproduct of the economics of the antiquities trade."],[""]],["disable","dis'eibl","vt. 使失去能力, 使残废, (律)使无资格\\n[计] 使无效, 禁止, 关闭",["I wish I could figure out how to disable comments on my blog.","The publisher agreed to make the dictionary available online without cost, but wanted to disable robots from copying its contents."],["但愿我能找到在我的博客上屏蔽评论的办法。",""]],["trough","trɒ:f","n. 槽, 水槽, 饲料槽\\n[化] 料槽",["He sits upright, not crouched over his plate like an animal at a feeding trough.","He slipped from the roof directly into the trough and drowned."],["",""]],["warmly","'wɒ:mli","adv. 亲切地, 温暖地, 热心地",["The family received me very warmly.","They welcomed me warmly, so I felt at home."],["这个家庭热情地接待了我。","他们这么热情的欢迎我，让我感觉家人一样。"]],["ludicrous","'lu:dikrәs","a. 可笑的, 滑稽的, 荒唐的",["It's ludicrous to continue business operations while selling off bit by bit the land on which your business depends.","Please keep your ludicrous accusations to yourself in future."],["",""]],["trappings","'træpiŋz","n. 马饰, 服饰, 礼服, 装饰品, 外部标志",["Her life has all the trappings of privilege.","He had all the trappings of a great life."],["",""]],["tenderness","'tendәnis","n. 柔软, 亲切, 柔和, 敏感, 易触痛\\n[医] 触痛",["In literary works, night-blooming jasmine is often used to symbolize longing and tenderness.","Tenderness is an important element in a person's character."],["文學作品中常用夜來香來象徵思念與柔情。",""]],["beige","beiʒ","a. 淡棕色的\\nn. 薄斜纹呢, 米色",["He tricked me into thinking that his favorite color is beige.","My beige bra is now brown and my red one black. That's just how much I've worn them."],["",""]],["throng","θrɒ:ŋ","n. 群, 人群, 群集, 众多\\na. 拥挤的\\nvi. 群集, 蜂拥\\nvt. 在...群集, 使拥塞",["He was surrounded by a throng of reporters.","When we stepped off the bus we were immediately surrounded by a throng of children from the village."],["他被一大群記者包圍著。",""]],["scoff","skɒf","n. 嘲笑, 愚弄, 笑柄, 食品\\nv. 嘲笑, 嘲弄, 贪吃, 狼吞虎咽地吃",["Outsiders tend to scoff at Esperanto as an idealistic waste of time.","I'm not going to change my opinion no matter how much you scoff."],["",""]],["veggie","'vedʒi","n. 素食者",["I ordered a sesame seed buns for the veggie burgers.","Did you really order sweet potato fries to go with your veggie burger?"],["我點了一份芝麻麵包，用來製作素食漢堡。","您真的點了地瓜片來搭配素食漢堡嗎？"]],["generalized","'dʒenәrәlaizd","a. 广义的, 普遍的；无显著特点的",["Lemma 5 cannot be generalized to arbitrary artinian rings.","Dr. Thatcher diagnosed her patient with generalized anxiety disorder because his symptoms didn't point to other diagnoses."],["",""]],["treasurer","'treʒәrә","n. 会计, 出纳员, 司库\\n[经] 司库, 财务主任, 财政大臣",["I resigned from my position as club treasurer.","With regard to the membership fee, you must ask the treasurer of the club."],["我辭去了俱樂部司庫的職位。",""]],["optimum","'ɒptimәm","n. 最适条件, 最佳效果\\na. 最优的, 最适宜的",["The data suggest that the optimum length of a lecture may be 30 instead of 60 minutes.","Finding the optimum for a numerical function can be an important challenge."],["",""]],["sanity","'sæniti","n. 神智健全, 头脑清楚, 通情达理\\n[医] 精神健全",["The thin line between sanity and madness has gotten finer.","This book presents to you 10 original ways to retain your sanity."],["",""]],["pitfall","'pitfɒ:l","n. 陷阱, 诱惑, 阴谋, 易犯的错误, 意想不到的困难",["The specimen was caught in a pitfall trap sunk in the ground.","I managed to sidestep every pitfall."],["",""]],["articulation","ɑ:.tikju'leiʃәn","n. 关节, 接合, 连贯, 发音, 表达\\n[计] 清晰度",["I can't articulate myself very well. I even find it hard to get my tongue around the word \"articulation\".","The speech therapist at Tom's school helped him overcome his articulation problems."],["",""]],["revolutionize",".revә'lu:ʃәnaiz","vt. 向...鼓吹革命, 使发生革命性剧变",["This new and improved coffee maker will revolutionize the way you start your morning.","The invention will revolutionize our transportation."],["",""]],["mammoth","'mæmәθ","n. 猛犸, 庞然大物\\na. 猛犸似的, 巨大的",["The author's verbiage produced a document of mammoth size and microscopic import.","Trying to spot bodies in the middle of a vast ocean is a mammoth task."],["",""]],["fervor","'fә:vә","n. 热情, 热心, 炽热",["When he went to Russia, his revolutionary fervor emerged.","Their religious fervor was unparalleled."],["",""]],["dagger","'dægә","n. 匕首\\nvt. 用剑刺",["That person who you least expect is the one that puts the dagger in your heart.","My poor uncle was there, lying on his bloody bed, with a dagger lodged deeply in his heart."],["",""]],["hem","hem","n. 边缘, 折边, 哼声\\nvt. 缝边, 包围, 关闭\\nvi. 做折边, 发哼声\\ninterj. 哼",["The tailor is going to redo the hem of my pants.","I was just finishing sewing the hem of the skirt yesterday."],["裁縫師要幫我重新修褲腳。",""]],["revolver","ri'vɒlvә","n. 左轮手枪\\n[化] 旋转炉",["Tom fired his revolver at the man who had just killed Mary.","Tom drew a revolver and shot John's hat off his head."],["",""]],["renaissance","ri'neisәns","n. 复活, 复兴, 文艺复兴\\na. 文艺复兴的",["With Renaissance, scholastic ideas gave place to positive ideas.","During the Renaissance, Florence was one of the greatest cities in the world."],["隨著文藝復興，學院派的想法被積極的想法取而代之了。",""]],["abduction","æb'dʌkʃәn","n. 诱拐, 绑架, 外展\\n[医] 外展, 展",["Tom, an experienced reporter, was investigating the recent abduction of three children in the city.","Yanni was smuggled into North Korea after his abduction."],["",""]],["determinant","di'tә:minәnt","n. 决定物, 决定因素\\na. 决定性的\\n[计] 判定",["International trade is a key determinant of prosperity."],[""]],["chiefly","'tʃi:fli","adv. 主要地",["Dogri is chiefly spoken in Jammu, whereas Kashmiri is chiefly spoken in Kashmir.","The accident was caused chiefly by the unpredictable weather."],["",""]],["shrewd","ʃru:d","a. 精明的, 锐利的, 剧烈的, 机灵的, 厉害的",["He may be a poor talker and far from shrewd, but I like him all the better for that.","I have a pretty shrewd idea that this room contains the answer to the whole mystery."],["",""]],["predatory","'predәtәri","a. 掠夺成性的, 捕食生物的, 掠夺的\\n[医] 捕食的",["According to Tom, Mary is just a predatory guru who promises gain.","The websites of some predatory publishers look credible."],["",""]],["subtlety","'sʌtlti","n. 微妙, 精明",["If you want to talk about Chinese, it is better that you talk to me directly. You find metaphors and subtlety difficult.","The subtlety of Caifeng's facial expressions adds depth and mystery to her already enchanting Asian features."],["",""]],["cavern","'kævәn","n. 巨穴, 洞窟, 深处\\nvt. 放于山洞中, 挖空",["Here in a vast cavern king Aeolus rules over the struggling winds and howling tempests, and restrains them in prison with fetters.","Israeli researchers say a massive cavern on the shores of the Dead Sea is the world's largest salt cave."],["",""]],["laden","'leidn","a. 装满的, 负载的, 苦恼的\\nlade的过去分词",["Summer came and the pear tree was laden with pears.","After a week in Bir town, he went to a homestay in Pulga village where his workstation was often a bench under a fruit-laden tree."],["",""]],["involuntary","in'vɒlәntәri","a. 自然而然的, 无意识的, 不知不觉的, 偶然的, 不随意的\\n[医] 不随意的",["Any emotion, if it is sincere, is involuntary.","Tom's involuntary celibacy came to an end when he let go of his sense of entitlement."],["任何情绪，只要它是真诚的，就说明它是发自内心的自然流露。",""]],["thicket","'θikit","n. 丛林, 草丛",["The path stretching from that house to the bamboo thicket was laid with stone paving.","By chance, they heard some suspicious activity in the thicket which indicated that a bear also smelled their food."],["",""]],["nigerian","nai'dʒiriәn","n. 尼日利亚人",["The Nigerian government has a strong Muslim backbone.","The Nigerian ambassador only speaks botched Spanish."],["",""]],["idealism","ai'diәlizm","n. 唯心主义, 观念论, 唯心论, 理想主义",["There is also one type of idealism that says even without strength or intelligence you can do anything if you can merely persist.","Idealism fights furiously against the assertion of Marxist philosophy about the knowability of the world."],["",""]],["suggested","","a. 建议的；暗示的",["The doctor suggested that she drink more water to keep from being dehydrated.","I suggested that we should stay there another day."],["醫生建議她多喝水，以免缺水。","我提議我們在那裏再待一天。"]],["prowess","'prauis","n. 英勇, 勇敢, 超凡技术",["His martial arts prowess has already reached a level of sublime perfection.","The Yautja are renowned for their hunting prowess and consider themselves the apex predators of the universe."],["他的武功已经达到了出神入化的境界。",""]],["booze","bu:z","vi. 豪饮\\nn. 酒, 酒宴",["He pissed away his inheritance on booze and loose women.","Thomas spent close to half his salary on cigarettes and booze."],["",""]],["magistrate","'mædʒistreit","n. 长官, 法官, 推事\\n[法] 司法行政官, 治安法官, 地方法官",["Obscenity is whatever happens to shock some elderly and ignorant magistrate.","The magistrate disqualified himself from hearing the case because of a conflict of interest."],["",""]],["burglar","'bә:glә","n. 窃贼\\n[法] 夜盗, 窃贼, 盗窃者",["The burglar was traced by one of the things she had left on the scene.","A burglar broke into my house while I was away on a trip."],["警方根據現場遺下的證物把賊子找了出來。","一个入室盗窃者趁我去旅游的时候闯入了我家。"]],["diffusion","di'fju:ʒәn","n. 散播, 传播, 蔓延\\n[医] 扩散, 弥散, 漫射(光)",["Diffusion is passive because it doesn't require an external source of energy."],[""]],["campfire","'kæmpfaiә","n. 营火, 营火会",["Tom is used to cooking on a campfire.","The smoke rose from the campfire and wafted silently through the pine trees."],["湯姆習慣用營火做菜。",""]],["specificity",",spesi'fisiti","n. 特异性, 专一性, 特殊性, 特性, 特征\\n[化] 专一性",["Specificity is a virtue when you write a technical document.","In Chemistry, the characteristic of enzymes (and catalysts) to participate in certain chemical reactions is called specificity."],["",""]],["clerical","'klerikәl","n. 牧师\\na. 文书的, 事务上的, 抄写员的, 牧师的",["The church's publication of a rant against same-sex marriage was clearly a clerical error.","A collar may come in many varieties, from button-down to clerical, and Mandarin to Masonic, but it is never a lapel."],["",""]],["overlapping","'әuvә'læpiŋ","[计] 重叠, 覆盖\\n[医] 重迭",["It's not always that our postures dovetail exactly. And yet, the overlapping and mutual interests abound."],[""]],["ooze","u:z","n. 渗流, 分泌物\\nv. 渗出, 泄漏",["He is paralyzed from the waist down and gaping bedsores on the back of his legs and buttocks ooze infected pus.","I lost my balance and pitched head foremost into the ooze."],["",""]],["hamstring","'hæmstriŋ","n. 后腿腱\\nvt. 切断腿腱使成跛腿, 使瘫痪",["The hamstring muscles include the biceps femoris, the semitendinosus and the semimembranosus.","Tom slipped and tore his hamstring."],["",""]],["spearhead","'spiәhed","n. 矛尖, 先锋队, 先头部队\\nvt. 做先锋, 带头",["Christopher Columbus was the spearhead of the biggest invasion and genocide ever seen in the history of humanity."],[""]],["argentine","'ɑ:dʒәntain","n. 银, 银白色金属, 银白色鱼鳞, 阿根廷人\\na. 银的, 银色的, 阿根廷的",["Miguel Najdorf and Oscar Panno are two famous Argentine chess players. Najdorf was born in Poland.","The Argentine president said that diabetes is a disease of people with high purchasing power."],["",""]],["taiwanese",",taiwɑ:'ni:z, -'ni:s","a. 台湾人的；台湾的",["The Taiwanese dollar appreciated, causing Taiwanese exports to slump.","Although I grew up in the United States, my parents are Taiwanese."],["台幣上漲，造成台灣的出口貿易不振。","雖然我在美國長大了，但是我爸媽是台灣人。"]],["shallot","ʃә'lɒt","n. 葱",["The shallot tasted so much better than the onion in that recipe."],[""]],["steaming","'sti:miŋ","[化] 通入蒸汽",["I'd like a steaming hot cup of tea.","She waited without saying a word until I, likewise silent, set down a steaming hot cup of tea in front of her."],["我想要杯熱騰騰的茶。",""]],["goggle","'gɒgl","n. 眼睛瞪视, 护目镜\\na. 突出的, 瞪眼的\\nvi. 瞪眼看, 眼珠转动\\nvt. 使瞪眼, 使眼珠转动",["The goggles protect your eyes from dust."],[""]],["medicaid","'medikeid","n. 医疗补助方案, 医疗补助项目\\n[法] 公费医疗补助制, 医疗保健业, 医疗补助方案",["Decision to disallow Medicaid for second cochlea implant withdrawn.","I'm worried that taking on so many hours would cause me to lose Medicaid."],["",""]],["bristle","'brisl","n. 刚毛, 猪鬃\\nvi. 直立, 发怒, 充满\\nvt. 使直立",["Many New Yorkers bristle at the notion that the site where the Twin Towers once stood has become a major tourist attraction.","Soft bristle paintbrushes are best for watercolour painting."],["",""]],["enlightenment","in'laitmәnt","n. 启迪, 教化",["Vesak is a Buddhist holiday which celebrates the birth, enlightenment and death of the Buddha.","Enlightenment is man's leaving his self-imposed immaturity."],["卫塞节是佛教的一个节日，纪念佛陀的诞生、成道和涅槃。",""]],["sweetie","'swi:ti","n. 情人, 爱人, 甜食",["If you sprinkle when you tinkle, be a sweetie and wipe the seatie.","Come on, sweetie, come upstairs and take a shower with me."],["",""]],["locality","lәu'kæliti","n. 地方, 所在, 位置\\n[法] 位置, 场所, 地区",["A demonym is the name or term for the residents of a particular locality.","My locality is a nexus for occidental and oriental interplay, which is abundant in emotional undulations."],["",""]],["verification",".verifi'keiʃәn","n. 证实, 查证, 证明属实\\n[计] 验证",["Verification is the process of establishing that information is truthful and accurate.","Claudio activated the two-factor verification feature on his Facebook."],["",""]],["truce","tru:s","n. 停战, 休战\\nvi. 停战, 休止\\nvt. 以休战结束",["The dancers danced on sandy beaches, under rose-hued skies, next to aqua waves and until midnight's truce.","The Olympic Truce is an ancient tradition revived to encourage peace during the Olympic Games."],["",""]],["dugout","'dʌgaut","n. 防空壕, 独木舟",["His loneliness was as deep as the blue of the ocean around his dugout canoe.","But unlike Venice, the village houses are built on sticks and dugout canoes are the main form of transportation."],["",""]],["timer","'taimә","n. 计时员, 计时器\\n[计] 计时器",["The button battery in the PC's internal timer has gone flat.","I only figured on staying with this company a little while when I started, but before I knew it I'd become an old timer here."],["電腦內部計時器內的紐扣電池沒電了。",""]],["astonished","","a. 吃惊的",["When I saw my sister's photo, I was astonished at how old she'd become.","We were astonished to hear what had happened."],["看到我姐姐的照片时，我惊讶地发现她变老了许多。","我们听到所发生的事，感到很惊讶。"]],["threatening","'θretniŋ","a. 胁迫的, 危险的\\n[法] 威胁的, 恐吓的, 危险的",["The mayor's family was harassed with threatening phone calls all day.","Now that I think about it, I must look threatening."],["市長一家人一整天不斷遭到了恐嚇電話的騷擾。","現在想想，我肯定看起來很凶神惡煞。"]],["prerequisite","pri:'rekwizit","a. 先决条件的, 必要的\\nn. 先决条件, 必备条件",["By that time, astral projection became a prerequisite course in his university.","Please stand at the stairs. This is a prerequisite for me to defend you."],["",""]],["mistakenly","mɪ'steɪkənlɪ","adv. 错误地, 被误解地",["I think I mistakenly deleted that file.","I've mistakenly deleted the party information and registration you sent to me."],["我觉得我是误删了这个文件。",""]],["quad","kwɔd","n. 铅块, 监狱, 四方院子, 四胞胎, 四胞胎中的一个孩子, 成套的四件东西\\n[计] 四芯导线",["That computer has a quad-core processor.","This phone has a quad-core processor."],["",""]],["preschooler","","n. 学龄前儿童",["A preschooler learns many skills to prepare them for kindergarten.","It used to be that you wouldn't think of a preschooler on a computer, but now you're seeing 3-year-olds on computers."],["",""]],["multiculturalism","ˌmʌltiˈkʌltʃərəlɪzəm","n. 多元文化",["I believe that multiculturalism is beneficial for a nation.","\"Peaceful\" coexistence and multiculturalism: racism's best hiding place in Eleusis."],["",""]],["padded","","a. 有装填垫料的；脚底有厚肉的",["I am so exhausted because I have padded the hoof for 4 hours.","They just padded the report to make it look more impressive."],["走了四个小时，我觉得非常累了。",""]],["shortcut","'ʃɒ:tkʌt","n. 捷径, 最短路线\\n[计] 快捷方式",["This is the shortcut that I usually take to school.","I created a shortcut on the desktop."],["这通常是我去学校的捷径。","我在桌面上建了一个快捷方式。"]],["antisocial",".ænti'sәuʃәl","不爱社交的, 反社会的, 有害于公众利益的\\n[医] 不喜社交的",["I may be antisocial, but it doesn't mean I don't talk to people.","His antisocial behavior didn't do him any favors, either."],["我或许不善于社交,但这并不意味我不和别人交谈。",""]],["underside","'ʌndәsaid","n. 下面, 下侧, 底面",["A spider can produce a silky substance from tiny openings on its underside.","There was gum stuck to the underside of the chair."],["",""]],["baron","'bærәn","n. 男爵\\n[法] 男爵, 贵族, 大王",["Father Zachary urged these perils to the Baron with all the force of monkish rhetoric.","A viscount ranks below an earl or count but above a baron."],["",""]],["beak","bi:k","n. 鸟嘴, 喙\\n[医] 嘴, 喙",["The bird picked up the twig with its beak and flew to its nest.","With one wing it skims the water, with the other it caresses the sky; its talons plow the sea, its beak strikes the rocks."],["",""]],["tenuous","'tenjuәs","a. 稀薄的, 微细的, 纤细的, 脆弱的\\n[医] 细薄的, 纤细的",["Relations are tenuous as peace talks resume between warring factions.","You were trying to draw an extremely tenuous connection between cultures of two cities known for their animosity."],["",""]],["simulated","","a. 模仿的\\n[计] 模拟的",["The proposed methodology is applied to three simulated case studies.","The proposed method is applied to three simulated case studies."],["",""]],["misty","'misti","a. 有雾的, 模糊的, 笼罩着雾的",["I think that Misty has different feelings towards insects.","Beyond lay the sea, misty and purple, with its haunting, unceasing murmur."],["",""]],["hanger","'hæŋә","n. 挂钩, 吊架, 衣架, 挂衣钩\\n[经] (挂在店内的)广告牌",["I hung the shirt on the coat hanger.","He hung his blazer on a hanger because it was really hot."],["我把襯衣掛在了衣架上。",""]],["scowl","skaul","n. 愁容, 阴沉脸色\\nvi. 皱眉, 绷着脸\\nvt. 怒视",["He had a thatch of white hair and a red, wrinkled face with blue eyes and a scowl.","Make your voice a little deeper and add a scowl."],["",""]],["pedagogical","pedә'^ɔdʒikәl","a. 教师的, 教学法的, 适宜于教师的",["Paulo Freire was one of the most influential pedagogical theorists of the 20th century.","Through initiative of the Esperantic Studies Foundation, Edukado.net was created. This is a source of pedagogical material aimed at teachers and students of Esperanto."],["",""]],["falling","'fɒ:liŋ","a. 落下的, 坠落的, 下降的\\n[化] 消胀",["A water drop hollows a stone not by force but by falling often.","All of a sudden, large drops of rain began falling from the dark sky."],["滴水穿石，不是靠力量，而是靠時間。","灰暗的天空突然下起了一大滴一大滴的雨來。"]],["strikingly","","adv. 显著地, 惊人地, 引人注目地",["The digital revolution is paving the way towards strikingly new forms of social relationships.","Parts of Tom's speech were strikingly similar to the speech that Mary had given at the same event a year before."],["",""]],["repository","ri'pɔzitәri","n. 贮藏所, 贮物器, 仓库, 博物馆, 店铺, 陈列室, 资源丰富地区, 墓地, 亲信, 知己\\n[经] 仓库, 栈房, 贮藏所",["An encyclopedia is a repository of knowledge and wisdom.","A website for learning different languages, tatoeba.org has a rich repository of sentence examples."],["",""]],["refute","ri'fju:t. ri:-","vt. 反驳, 驳斥；驳倒",["Tom was unable to refute Mary's arguments.","Do you have an objection to the source, or a relevant piece of evidence to refute the claim?"],["湯姆無法反駁瑪麗的論點。","你是對來源有異議，還是有相關的證據可以反駁這個說法呢？"]],["spontaneously","","adv. 自发, 一时冲动, 出自自然, 不依赖人工, 自然产生, 本能, 自动, 自然而优雅",["Spontaneously kissing guys has become a habit of Rima's.","Tom's compost heap got so hot that it spontaneously combusted."],["",""]],["reassuring",".ri:ә'ʃuriŋ","a. 安心的, 可靠的, 鼓励的",["It's reassuring to know that my feelings are normal.","He kept talking to her, reassuring her she was safe."],["",""]],["mba","","abbr. 工商管理学硕士（Master of Business Administration）；海洋生物协会（Marine Biolog…",["I'm working on finishing my MBA."],[""]],["pee","pi:","n. (英)便士, 小便\\nvi. 小便",["I have to pee, but your friends are completely crowding the hallway.","Never make a decision when you feel like taking a pee."],["",""]],["meticulous","mә'tikjulәs","a. 一丝不苟的, 精确的, 过细的",["Augusto is the most meticulous person I've ever met in my life.","Carlos is a meticulous worker who pays attention to the intricacies of every task."],["",""]],["eminent","'eminәnt","a. 显赫的, 杰出的, 有名的",["The monument was erected in honor of the eminent philosopher.","An immense monument was erected in honor of the eminent philosopher."],["",""]],["knowingly","'nәjiŋli","adv. 会意地, 心照不宣地, 故意地, 有意地, 老练地\\n[法] 心照不宣地, 故意地, 有意地",["\"I was so scared,\" said Elias, and Sandra nodded knowingly.","Tom and Mary nod at each other knowingly."],["",""]],["vaccination",".væksi'neiʃәn","n. 接种疫苗, 种痘\\n[医] 接种; 种痘",["The vaccination left a funny little mark on my arm.","First love is a kind of vaccination which saves a man from catching the complaint the second time."],["",""]],["housekeeper","'hauski:pә","n. 主妇, 女管家",["Every Tuesday morning the housekeeper vacuums.","There is something that has not come out, and that housekeeper knows it."],["每周二早上主妇用吸尘器清扫。",""]],["garner","'gɑ:nә","n. 谷仓, 积蓄\\nvt. 储存, 贮藏",["French finance minister Christine Lagarde headed to Brazil as part of a tour to garner support for her candidacy.","She is certain that this piece of legislation will garner the whole-hearted support of her colleagues."],["",""]],["shingle","'ʃiŋgl","n. 墙面板, 小招牌",["The town had three lumber mills, four shingle mills, and a gristmill.","Today the lighthouse is open as a visitor attraction, and it is popular for its good view of the shingle beach."],["",""]],["sinner","'sinә","n. 罪人, 不知礼仪的人, 无赖\\n[法] 罪人, 无赖",["No sinner is ever saved after the first twenty minutes of a sermon.","Every saint has a past and every sinner has a future."],["",""]],["decorated","'dekәreitid","a. 装饰的, 修饰的",["The temples on Mars are decorated with lotus flowers.","She decorated the wall with pictures."],["火星上的神殿饰有莲花。","她用绘画来装饰墙。"]],["collage","kɒ'lɑ:ʒ","n. 拼贴画",["He had the gratification of seeing his son graduate from collage.","I glued the last piece of my collage with success."],["",""]],["sympathize","'simpәθaiz","vi. 同情, 怜悯, 同意, 体谅",["It is easier to sympathize with sorrow than to sympathize with joy.","I couldn't but sympathize with the girl who had lost her parents in the accident."],["",""]],["neglected","ni'^lektid","a. 被忽视的, 未被好好照管的\\n[法] 未被好好照管的, 被忽视的",["He regrets having neglected his studies in his school days.","The boy neglected to water the plants, and he was scolded."],["",""]],["militarily","'militərili; ,mili'teәrili","adv. 在军事上",["Militarily speaking, Gaza is utterly defenseless. That's why the IDF chooses this area to flex its muscles.","Western Europe is too divided to challenge Russia militarily."],["",""]],["biotech","'baɪəʊtek","n. 生物技术",["Biotech and Moderna have a lead in the Corona or Covid vaccination.","Sami was a business manager at a biotech company."],["",""]],["richly","'ritʃli","adv. 富裕地, 丰富地, 充分地",["The walls, pillars and ceiling are of cedar richly carven with images of serpents, pomegranates and cherubim in gold.","The binding is white buckram, with dark green cloth sides richly gilt."],["",""]],["imperialism","im'piәriәlizm","n. 帝国主义, 帝制\\n[法] 帝国主义",["This is one of the signs of weakness and the impending doom of imperialism.","America, China, and Russia are competitors in imperialism."],["",""]],["backseat","'bæksi:t","n. 后座, 次要位置",["Her dreams sometimes take a backseat to her parents'.","Tom slept in the backseat of the car as Mary drove."],["",""]],["stillness","'stilnis","n. 静止, 沉静",["As the sun set, the night's blackness gradually enveloped the countryside, bringing a peaceful stillness.","She sat in a room that was flooded with light, permeated with a deep stillness."],["",""]],["canister","'kænistә","n. 罐, 筒, 霰弹\\n[机] 罐, 滤毒罐",["Sami found a canister leaking gas in the kitchen.","Ziri handed Rima an oxygen canister."],["",""]],["fraudulent","'frɒ:djulәnt","a. 欺诈的, 不正的, 不诚实的\\n[法] 欺诈的, 欺骗的, 骗取的",["Please do not answer this fraudulent e-mail and certainly do not click on the links in the e-mail.","Kolkata has an unfortunate reputation for being home to fraudulent call centres."],["請不要回覆這封詐騙電郵，當然也不要點擊電郵裏的超連結。",""]],["onslaught","'ɒnslɒ:t","n. 突击, 猛击, 猛攻",["The defenders checked the onslaught by the attackers.","Spain is reeling under the onslaught of the coronavirus."],["",""]],["relational","ri'leiʃәnәl","a. 有关系的, 有联系的, 亲属的, 有亲属关系的\\n[计] 相关的, 关系的",["The way our relational memory works is very interesting.","I find the relational database works better than the NoSQL one."],["",""]],["bedding","'bediŋ","n. 被褥, 寝具, 床上用品, 基床\\n[机] 褥草, 被褥",["He grew accustomed to bedding down outside."],[""]],["realistically","riә'listikli","adv. 写实地, 逼真地, 现实地",["Though realistically the stock market is risky, it can still be worth investing in.","Call it a Catch-22, but sometimes, you just can't realistically come out on top."],["",""]],["pastime","'pæstaim","n. 消遣, 娱乐, 游戏",["Mary's favourite pastime was reading philosophy books, while Tom, he preferred masturbating.","Playing cards is a popular pastime."],["瑪麗最喜歡的消遣是讀哲學書；至於湯姆，他比較喜歡自慰。","打牌是一種流行的消遣方式。"]],["victor","'viktә","n. 胜利者\\na. 胜利的",["Twelve boxers chase Victor across the big Sylter dike.","One morning, when Victor woke from troubled dreams, he found himself transformed in his bed into a big mess of spaghetti."],["",""]],["budge","bʌdʒ","vi. 微微移动\\nvt. 推动\\nn. 羔羊皮",["She will not budge an inch no matter what anyone says.","Tom said, \"budge over,\" forced his way in and sat down."],["",""]],["submerge","sәb'mә:dʒ","vt. 使浸水, 使陷入, 淹没\\nvi. 潜入水中",["I want to submerge myself in the ocean depths, and to disappear there so as to never be seen again.","The dark oily substance slowly seeps into a row of bathtubs as patients undress and prepare to submerge up to their shoulders."],["我想沉到海裏去，在這個世界上消失，這樣就不會再有人看見我了。",""]],["usable","'ju:zәbl","a. 可用的, 方便使用的, 能用的",["From the research results published to date, it can be concluded that the new method will soon be usable in practice.","\"Incompetent\" is the softest word usable to describe them."],["",""]],["antioxidant",".ænti'ɒksidәnt","n. 抗氧化剂, 防老化剂\\n[化] 抗氧剂; 抗氧化剂; 防老剂; 防老化剂",["Figs contain components that have antioxidant properties.","Figs improve the antioxidant activity of your body."],["",""]],["homecoming","'hәumkʌmiŋ","n. 归国, 省亲回家, 同学会",["Tom told me he asked Mary to the homecoming dance.","Tom told me that he asked Mary to the homecoming dance."],["",""]],["peacekeeper","'pi:s,ki:pә(r)","n. (交战国间的)停火执行者(或小组)",["Peacekeeper is the basic rank of active officers in the French National Police."],[""]],["incorrectly","","adv. 错误地；不适当地",["Sometimes Tom uses the preterite (past) incorrectly.","In informal, everyday speech, the word \"literally\" is often used incorrectly as an intensifier."],["",""]],["forage","'fɒridʒ","n. 粮草, 饲料, 搜寻粮草\\nvt. 喂, 掠夺, 搜寻粮秣\\nvi. 搜寻粮草, 掠夺",["Forage crops like clover and alfalfa could be planted.","These birds forage by probing in shallow water or on wet mud."],["",""]],["blah","blɑ:","n. 废话",["One of my Japanese teachers said \"honya honya\" instead of \"blah blah.\" My ensuing laughter nearly gave me a hernia.","We drank some booze and started to blah, blah, blah."],["",""]],["institutionalize",",insti'tju:ʃәnәlaiz","vt. 使制度化, 使成为惯常的行为, 使一成不变, 把...送进疯人院",["We need to institutionalize the testing of organic products."],[""]],["illumination","i.lju:mi'neiʃәn","n. 照明, 阐明, 启发\\n[医] 照明, 映光",["Insufficient illumination is deleterious to ocular health.","They provide wide-beam illumination, lighting a small room or an area in a clinic."],["",""]],["showroom","'ʃәuru:m","n. 陈列室\\n[经] 样品间, 陈列室",["Our showroom made a hit with young ladies.","This is the fastest car in our showroom."],["",""]],["dated","'deitid","a. 有日期的, 陈旧的",["Dan dated Linda when she was a teenager.","Here is our answer to your fax message dated April 1st."],["丹在琳達十幾歲的時候就與她交往過。",""]],["blister","'blistә","n. 水疱\\n[化] 砂眼",["Miroslav developed a small blister at the site of the centipede's bite.","I've got many a blister from my ill-prepared hike yesterday."],["",""]],["hindsight","'haindsait","n. 枪的表尺, 事后聪明",["But, of course, hindsight is 20-20.","With 20/20 hindsight, he could tell why they lost the game."],["但是，当然啦，事后诸葛亮总是好当。",""]],["butler","'bʌtlә","n. 男管家, 司膳总管",["The butler announced Mr. and Mrs. Smith.","I would never have thought that the murderer was the butler."],["男管家宣佈史密斯先生和夫人駕到。",""]],["imposition",".impә'ziʃәn","n. 征收, 课税, 强加, 欺骗\\n[经] 征税, 税, 税款",["I wouldn't want to be an imposition.","Obligation means to be unable not to do something because of material necessity, practical need, moral law, or the imposition of someone else's desires."],["",""]],["sliver","'slivә","n. 裂片, 薄片, 梳毛\\nvt. 切成长片\\nvi. 剖开, 分裂",["Our evidence is no more than a tiny sliver of solid knowledge amidst the vast bog of doubts and speculations.","There's a sliver of hope in this week's news, at least."],["",""]],["saturate","'sætʃәreit","vt. 使渗透, 浸透, 使充满, 使饱和\\na. 浸透的, 饱和度高的, 深颜色的\\nn. 饱和化合物, 饱和脂肪酸",["Kaleidoscopic prints saturate my blank mind, creating vital memories and burning thoughts."],[""]],["thorn","θɒ:n","n. 刺, 棘, 荆棘",["She pulled a thorn out of the tyre.","There's a thorn in my finger and I can't get it out."],["她拔出了一根兒扎在輪胎裡的刺。",""]],["uniformly","'ju:nifɔ:mli","adv. 一样, 一致, 相同, 一直不变, 一贯, 始终如一, 均质, 一律, 均匀\\n[计] 均匀地",["Continue stirring until the chocolate chips are mixed uniformly through the cookie dough.","Colonel Barclay's family life appears to have been a uniformly happy one."],["",""]],["discreet","dis'kri:t","a. 小心的, 慎重的",["Mary told me that she thought Tom would be discreet.","It might be discreet of you to bend a little to the prevailing wind."],["瑪麗跟我說他覺得湯姆很謹慎。",""]],["pebble","'pebl","n. 小圆石, 小鹅卵石, 水晶透镜, 碎石花纹\\n[医] 小石",["The pebble I threw skipped along the surface of the water.","A person without a sense of humor is like a wagon without springs, jolted by every pebble in the road."],["",""]],["whereabouts","'hwєәrә.bauts","n. 下落, 所在之处\\nadv. 在何处",["Tom can't account for his whereabouts on the day that Mary was murdered.","Parents should monitor their children's whereabouts."],["汤姆不能说明玛丽遇害那天自己在哪里。",""]],["shrinking","","[医] 皱缩",["The shrinking of the domestic market has been blamed on inflation.","Her emergency fund is shrinking while the salon remains closed."],["",""]],["raging","'reidʒiŋ","a. 愤怒的, 狂暴的, 猛烈的, 使极痛的",["From the look of the sky, the typhoon will probably be raging in all its fury about this time tomorrow.","Miraculously, he guided the full team of oxen through the raging river, unscathed."],["",""]],["rebellious","ri'beljәs","a. 造反的, 反抗的\\n[法] 造反的, 反抗的, 反判的",["Among the people, rebellious sentiments are growing.","It seems that my son is now at a rebellious age and recklessly opposes us."],["",""]],["swivel","'swivl","n. 转环, 旋转轴承, 转椅座架\\nv. (使)旋转",["A desk stood in the centre, with a red leather swivel chair.","Tom bought a new swivel chair to go with his new computer desk."],["",""]],["bookshelf","'bukʃelf","n. 书架",["Put the book on the bottom of the bookshelf.","I have numerous books on my bookshelf."],["把书放在书柜底下。","我有大量的书在我的书架上。"]],["divergent","dai'vә:dʒәnt","a. 有分歧的\\n[医] 散开的, 偏斜的",["The harmonic series is divergent."],[""]],["arabian","ә'reibiәn","a. 阿拉伯的, 阿拉伯人的",["Islam emerged in the Arabian Peninsula in the seventh century.","Quarter-tone intervals, which are used in Persian and Arabian music, are sometimes notated with slashed flats and sharps."],["",""]],["ignition","ig'niʃәn","n. 点火, 点燃\\n[化] 点火; 着火",["As Ziri reached for the ignition, Rima stopped him.","Tom got in the truck and turned the key in the ignition."],["",""]],["jut","dʒʌt","n. 尖端, 突出部分\\nv. (使)突出, 伸出",["Carve it so that the tip will jut out from the wall.","Triangular shapes jut from the building, and a prow dangles over a busy downtown street."],["",""]],["sputter","'spʌtә","n. 喷溅声, 劈啪声, 语无伦次\\nvi. 唾沫飞溅, 结结巴巴地讲, 发劈啪声\\nvt. 喷出, 飞溅出, 气急败坏地说",["They can't help but sputter excuses for their sorry behavior.","Sputter deposition is widely employed in the semiconductor industry."],["",""]],["inward","'inwәd","a. 内心的, 向内的, 本来的\\n[医] 向内的",["The Japanese are often criticized for being inward looking and insufficiently international in their outlook.","Those who look outward dream, but those who look inward awaken."],["",""]],["quarrel","'kwɒrәl","n. 吵架, 反目, 怨言, 方头凿\\nvi. 吵架, 争论, 挑剔",["Our conversation always ends in a quarrel.","I want to put an end to the quarrel."],["我们的对话总是以争吵收场。","我想結束這場爭執。"]],["throttle","'θrɒtl","n. 节流阀, 节气阀, 喉咙\\nvt. 扼喉咙, 使窒息, 压制, 使节流\\nvi. 窒息, 节流, 减速",["When she saw the marks all over the wall, she wanted to throttle the toddler.","I need to drop these useless perceptions to take full throttle over my life."],["",""]],["methane","'meθein","n. 甲烷, 沼气\\n[化] 甲烷; 沼气",["Titan is so cold that water exists as rock-hard ice, and oily methane falls from the sky and trickles into the seas.","The two main forms in which carbon appears on the earth are carbon dioxide and methane."],["",""]],["dementia","di'menʃiә","n. 痴呆\\n[医] 痴呆",["Experts already know that years of loneliness or feelings of isolation can lead to anxiety, depression and dementia in adults.","It is very unpleasant to watch how my aunt's dementia keeps getting worse every month."],["",""]],["newsroom","'nju:zru:m","n. 新闻编辑部, 报刊阅览室, 售报处",["An all-women's newsroom in India staffed by members of the country's marginalized communities including Dalits, has been attracting international attention this year.","An all-female newsroom in India has attracted international attention this year. Its staff is made up of marginalized groups from the country, including Dalits."],["印度一家全女性新聞編輯室今年引起了國際社會的關注，該編輯室的員工由本國邊緣群體構成，其中包括達利特人。","印度一家全女性新聞編輯室今年引起了國際社會的關注，該編輯室的員工由本國邊緣群體構成，其中包括達利特人。"]],["woodland","'wudlænd","n. 林区, 林地",["From the ridge where we stood, we had a good view over the extensive woodland.","Right, while we're taking a walk anyway, we could like go along the woodland path and enjoy a little stroll through the forest..."],["",""]],["hitch","hitʃ","n. 猛拉, 急推, 蹒跚, 故障\\nvt. 猛拉, 系住\\nvi. 蹒跚, 被钩住",["As soon as our manager got off our backs, everything started to go off without a hitch.","The meeting was going off without a hitch until he threw a wet blanket on it by making silly remarks."],["",""]],["binary","'bainәri","a. 由两部分组成的, 二进位的, 二元的\\n[计] 二进制的; 二态的; 二进制, 二进制文件传输类型设置命令",["There are 10 types of people in the world: those who understand binary, and those who don't.","To claim sex is binary requires ignoring intersex people, which is unscientific and purely ideological."],["世界上有10种人：懂二进制的人和不懂二进制的人。","若要聲稱性別是二元的，就需要忽視陰陽人，這是不科學的，且純粹屬於意識形態問題。"]],["gaping","'^æpiŋ","a. 多洞穴的",["Sami was found with a gaping gunshot wound to the back of his head.","Sami turned Layla's body over and found a huge gaping wound in her chest."],["",""]],["topping","'tɒpiŋ","a. 极好的, 主要的, 一流的\\nn. 除顶部, 修剪树稍, 剪落之小树枝",["This product is both a floor polish and a dessert topping.","Her favorite topping for frozen yogurt was mini chocolate chips."],["",""]],["restored","","a. 精力充沛的；精力恢复的",["A historical landmark has been restored and will reopen.","After decades of civil war, order was restored."],["一座歷史地標已經修復並將重新開放。","经过几十年的内战，秩序恢复了。"]],["allusion","ә'lu:ʒәn","n. 提及, 暗指",["She makes no allusion in the book to her profession.","Holmes made no further allusion to the matter that day, though he sat lost in thought for a long time after our belated dinner."],["",""]],["bulldozer","'buldәuzә","n. 推土机\\n[化] 推土机",["A bulldozer lifts part of a statue of king Ramses II found in northern Cairo, Egypt.","The bulldozer smashed into the concrete, obliterating everything in its path."],["",""]],["fad","fæd","n. 时尚\\n[化] 黄素腺嘌呤二核苷酸",["They don't want to admit that it's really a passing fad.","Basically, she's created a fad diet collider. And sometimes the particles that spin off are gluon-free neutrino burgers."],["",""]],["homogeneous",".hәumә'dʒi:niәs","a. 同种的, 同质的, 齐性的\\n[医] 同种的, 纯一的, 同质的, 均匀的",["Conformity is an essential element of our homogeneous community.","Any homogeneous cycle has a period and a frequency."],["",""]],["perjury","'pә:dʒәri","n. 伪誓, 伪证, 背信弃义\\n[经] 伪证, 假的证据",["It was the court's finding that the witness committed perjury.","In a court of justice women are more often found guilty of perjury than men."],["",""]],["heady","'hedi","a. 顽固的, 任性的, 性急的, 猛烈的",["The wine had a heady aroma."],[""]],["repel","ri'pel","vt. 逐退, 抵制, 使厌恶, 抗御\\nvi. 使厌恶, 相互排斥",["I call the living, I mourn the dead, I repel lightning.","Marigolds repel nematodes, as well as some humans who don't like the way they smell."],["",""]],["murderous","'mә:dәrәs","a. 凶狠的, 杀人的, 致命的\\n[法] 谋杀的, 杀人的, 残酷的",["This only increased his desire to be revenged on the murderous duke.","Curious gazes, gazes carrying a bit of murderous intent...it goes without saying that I couldn't be more uncomfortable."],["",""]],["condone","kәn'dәun","vt. 赦, 宽恕\\n[法] 宽恕, 不咎, 抵销",["The Catholic Church doesn't condone the use of condoms.","The citizens of this small community don't condone public displays of affection."],["天主教廷不同意避孕套的使用。",""]],["blackout","'blækaut","n. 灯火管制, 暂时的意识丧失, 灯火熄灭, 删除\\n[计] 电网掉电",["The problem with the electrical grid caused a temporary blackout in the area.","Every hospital has a back-up electric generator in case of blackout."],["",""]],["iced","aist","a. 冰冷的；装冰的；冰冻的",["I like drinking hot tea when it's cold outside, but when it's hot I like drinking iced tea.","There's no ice, and in any case it's too cold today for iced tea."],["",""]],["ferocious","fә'rәuʃәs","a. 残忍的, 凶猛的, 可怕的",["A tiger is a very ferocious kind of animal.","Zipang The Power Polack, a ferocious Polish berserker, flailed around wildly, charging into enemy ranks crazily without armor."],["老虎是一种非常凶猛的动物。",""]],["rehabilitate",".ri:hә'biliteit","vt. 恢复原状, 修复, 使康复\\n[法] 恢复, 使恢复心理健康, 修复",["Either we are forcibly bound up in the present, or we lose ourselves in the long gone-by, and seek back for what is utterly lost, as if it were possible to summon it up again, and rehabilitate it."],[""]],["profitability",".prɒfitә'biliti","n. 收益性, 利益率\\n[经] 可获利润率",["The company's investors were impressed by its growth and profitability.","The company's profitability improved."],["",""]],["subdued","sәb'dju:d","a. 屈服的, 被抑制的, 减弱的, 柔和的",["Subdued girls are generally the prettiest I reckon. The loud, bustling ones are awful.","There are some indications that the reception, which is known for its luxurious dishes, will be a bit more subdued this year."],["",""]],["gulp","gʌlp","vt. 吞, 大口大口地吸气, 吸收, 抑制\\nvi. 吞咽\\nn. 吞咽\\n[计] 字节组",["He raised the glass to his lips and drained it at one gulp.","Gulp! The food is delicious, but I'm afraid of how expensive it's going to be."],["他把杯子举到嘴边，一饮而尽。","咕噜！这食物太好吃了，但我担心它会很贵。"]],["sociological",".sәusiә'lɒdʒikl","a. 社会的, 社会学的",["This is a sociological study on abortion.","Gender and sex didn't become conflated in English until after the sociological definition of gender arose. Before that, gender typically meant a linguistic category."],["",""]],["cashier","kæ'ʃiә","n. 出纳员\\n[经] 司库, 出纳员, 收支员",["Currently, my sister works as a cashier at a supermarket.","I know that Tom used to be a cashier at a grocery store."],["目前，我妹妹在一家超市当收银员。",""]],["flair","fleә","n. 鉴别力, 才能, 天资, 资质, 眼光",["In addition, she has an artistic flair.","Don't think about leaving money for your kids, use it all up and enjoy yourself with flair."],["此外，她有艺术家天赋。",""]],["handcuff","'hændkʌf","vt. 给...戴上手铐\\nn. 手铐",["The man was so agitated that the police could not handcuff him.","If you make me angry, I'll handcuff you."],["",""]],["bloated","'blәutid","a. 发胀的, 浮肿的, 傲慢的",["The bloated profits of farmers at the time were something again.","Let's put all data into silos and make every book into a bloated gaslighting saga."],["",""]],["pertaining","pә:'teiniŋ","a. 附属的；与…有关的",["A reward has been offered for information pertaining to the incident.","I kindly request that you refrain from interfering in matters pertaining to my children's education."],["",""]],["pricey","'praisi","a. 昂贵的, 价格高的",["This fold-up umbrella is really small and light, so it's easy to carry around. It's a little pricey, but I think I'll get it.","I think that hotel is going to be a little pricey for you."],["",""]],["gloss","glɒs","n. 光彩, 假象, 注释\\nvt. 使光彩, 掩盖, 上光于, 注释, 曲解\\nvi. 发光, 作注释",["The girl bought some lip gloss at the convenience store.","Rima was wearing lip gloss because she was in love with someone."],["",""]],["espionage",".espiә'nɑ:ʒ","n. 间谍活动\\n[法] 间谍活动, 刺探, 间谍",["A brilliant, seductive chef turns to espionage in Napoleon-era France.","If you engage in espionage for a foreign power, you are selling your country down the river."],["拿破崙時代的法國，魅力誘人的天才廚師搖身一變成為間諜。",""]],["headset","'hedset","n. (一副)耳机\\n[电] 头载机组",["Sony's PlayStation VR headset is not natively supported on Windows.","A knocking sensation may indicate a loose headset."],["",""]],["seismic","'saizmik","a. 地震的",["Due to constant seismic activity, Japanese engineers have come up with novel construction techniques.","The geologists conducted seismic tests to analyze the stability of the bedrock beneath the surface."],["",""]],["spree","spri:","n. 戏耍, 喧闹, 宴会, 狂饮\\nvi. 狂欢, 狂饮",["Rumors of a Wall Street crash sparked a dollar selling spree.","Mary went on a shopping spree after coming into some money."],["",""]],["speaking","'spi:kiŋ","n. 谈话, 演说\\na. 讲话的, 适于说的, 讲某种语言的",["Don't be afraid to make mistakes when speaking English.","Don't be afraid of making mistakes when speaking English."],["當你說英語的時候不要怕犯錯。","當你說英語的時候不要怕犯錯。"]],["infinity","in'finiti","n. 无限大, 无限\\n[计] 无穷",["The ocean stretches beyond sight, a reminder of infinity.","The two mirrors facing each other created a repeating image that went on to infinity."],["",""]],["wildflower","'waild,flajә(r)","n. 野花",["There's a beautiful wildflower meadow behind the house.","Wildflower honey is harvested from various nectar sources, resulting in a unique blend of flavors."],["",""]],["giddy","'gidi","a. 眼花的, 头晕的\\nv. (使)眼花, (使)眩晕",["Deserting his family must have made the old bastard giddy with joy.","She was young handsome vain and giddy and completely the slave of fashion."],["",""]],["delicacy","'delikәsi","n. 细软, 精致, 精美的食品, 娇气, 微妙, 棘手, 娇弱, 灵敏, 灵巧",["Egg tarts, when freshly baked, are a real delicacy.","Fried spiders are a regional delicacy in Cambodia."],["新鮮出爐的蛋撻味道一流。",""]],["bogus","'bәugәs","a. 假的, 伪造的\\n[经] 伪的, 伪造的",["Sami opened a bank account with a bogus Egyptian ID.","The bonus material was actually bogus."],["",""]],["inland","'inlәnd","a. 内陆的, 国内的\\nn. 内地",["Chinese coastal cities are generally more developed than the inland ones.","Three soldiers who came back from the war are renting a house at the edge of a small town on the shore of the Inland Sea and live together."],["中国大陆的沿海城市普遍比内陆城市发达。","三个退伍军人在内海一个小镇边上租了一套房子，并生活在一起。"]],["prenatal",".pri:'neitl","a. 出生以前的, 孕期的\\n[医] 产前的, 出生前的",["The next discussion concerns the transplantation of prenatal tissues.","The old way of life is in stagnation; the new one is experiencing prenatal pains."],["",""]],["titanium","tai'teiniәm","n. 钛\\n[化] 钛Ti",["This handmade Italian-made titanium bicycle is terribly light.","Titanium is a chemical element with the symbol Ti."],["",""]],["contemplation",".kɒntem'pleiʃәn","n. 注视, 沉思, 盘算\\n[法] 默察, 意图, 期待",["He taught contemplation as a means of spiritual purification and the attainment of the Dao, a principle that signifies the highest spiritual ideals of mankind.","The usual gaggle of tourists and fans are sitting on park benches, some in contemplation, others in song."],["他为精神的洁净和获得道的方法教深思，道是表示人类最高的精神理想的一个原则。",""]],["delve","delv","v. 探究, 查考\\nn. 坑, 穴",["You prefer practical solutions, while I delve into abstract possibilities.","You're going to have to delve deeper if you want to get to the truth."],["",""]],["frigid","'frigid","a. 寒冷的, 严寒的, 冷淡的\\n[医] 寒冷的, 冷淡的, 性感缺失的",["The weather is exceptionally frigid.","A man lost consciousness and had to be pulled out of the frigid water and taken to an ambulance."],["天气非常寒冷。",""]],["further","'fә:ðә","a. 更远的, 此外的, 更多的\\nvt. 促进, 增进, 助长\\nadv. 更进一步地, 更远地, 此外",["Lawyers will urge the parents to take further legal action.","The TV shouldn't be so close. Put it a little further back."],["律师们会力劝家长们采取进一步的法律行动。","电视机不应该摆太接近，摆更远一点。"]],["marina","mә'rinә","n. 码头",["Before Tom could say anything, angry Marina slapped him on the cheek.","Marina Giles left England with her husband in just this frame of mind."],["",""]],["itinerary","ai'tinәrәri","n. 旅程, 旅行指南, 游记\\na. 巡回的, 旅程的",["Everyone agrees to stay here for the night and make long-term itinerary decisions tomorrow.","According to the trip's itinerary, we will go to the British Museum on Monday."],["大家同意先在这里住一晚，行程的事情明天再从长计议。",""]],["ethos","'i:θɔs","n. 气质；民族精神；社会思潮",["Settling down and raising a family was against the ethos of the times.","With the deteriorating ethos, even seemingly trivial matters have caused a further degeneration of the situation."],["",""]],["flipping","'flipiŋ","adj .讨厌之极的",["He sat quietly at his desk, flipping through the yellowed photo album.","Tom stood at the door, flipping the light switch on and off."],["他靜靜地坐在書桌前，翻閱著那本泛黃的相簿。",""]],["puree","'pjjәrei","n. 菜泥, 果泥, 酱, 浓汤\\nvt. 把...制成浓汤/酱",["Hummus can be chunky, or a total puree, or anywhere in between.","Usually I put a bit of juice in the blender with the banana to get a puree easier."],["",""]],["nibble","'nibl","n. 少量食物, 细咬, 轻咬, 啃\\nv. 一点一点地咬, 细咬, 吹毛求疵\\n[计] 半字节",["You say you had a nibble, it looked to me like you'd polished it off.","Benedito gave the kid a playful nudge with his foot as it tried to nibble on his shoelaces."],["",""]],["ghostly","'gәustli","a. 幽灵的, 影子似的, 精神的",["At the ruined altar ghostly priests officiated, passing quietly from side to side, with bows and genuflections.","Vladimir lowered the sheet to see a dark ghostly face staring him in the eye."],["",""]],["insistent","in'sistәnt","a. 坚持的, 迫切的",["The children were insistent about our taking them to the movies.","In the Netherlands, if a child is too insistent on asking for a cookie, he might be punished and get no cookie."],["",""]],["stylist","'stailist","n. 文体学家, 时装设计师",["Tom thanked his hair stylist and stunt double when accepting his Academy Award.","Rima asked Skura to be her stylist for her wedding day."],["",""]],["cypress","'saiprәs","n. 柏, 落羽杉, 柏树\\n[机] 桧木",["The main type of tree in this part of the forest is the cypress.","Barren trees are the fir, elder, birch, cypress, beech, ivy, sallow, linden and so on, but most of them afford shade."],["这片森林的树主要是柏树。",""]],["afloat","ә'flәut","a. 飘浮着的, 在海上的, 浸满水的, 在进行中的\\nadv. 飘浮着, 在海上, 浸满水, 在进行中",["At present, firms everywhere are struggling to stay afloat in difficult economic conditions.","We only just manage to keep afloat on my husband's small salary."],["",""]],["economical",".i:kә'nɒmikәl","a. 节俭的, 经济的, 合算的\\n[经] 经济的, 节约的",["London was very important for economical and cultural reasons.","This car is very economical on gas."],["倫敦過去因為經濟和文化的緣故，十分重要。","这辆车很省油。"]],["adamant","'ædәmәnt","n. 坚硬的东西\\na. 非常坚硬的, 坚强的, 固执的",["Bill was adamant that she should obey him.","Sami was adamant that he had never had sex with Layla."],["比尔坚持她必须听从他的话。",""]],["gush","gʌʃ","n. 涌出, 滔滔不绝地讲话\\nv. 涌出, 迸出, 滔滔不绝的讲话",["Community leaders say current efforts have been unsuccessful and oil continues to gush from the damaged well.","That prompted a cross-section of officials in the southeast Asian country to gush about the promise in store for one of the world's fastest-growing economies."],["",""]],["overrun",".әuvә'rʌn","n. 蔓延, 风行一时, 超过限度\\nvt. 蔓延, 蹂躏, 超过, 泛滥\\nvi. 泛滥, 超载限度\\n[计] 超限",["Even tough it's such a big garden, it would be wasted if we let it get overrun with weeds.","Behind the house there was an old orchard, now overrun with noxious weeds and rough shrubs."],["",""]],["fella","felә","n. 小伙子；[俚]伙伴, 伙计",["He's no longer the happy-go-lucky fella he once was.","You should know: Tom's a talkative fella."],["",""]],["mini","'mini","n. 同类中的极小者, 微型汽车, 超短裙\\na. 微型的",["For general amusement, I'm wearing a mini-skirt today.","Girls wearing mini-skirts, walking or sitting, are very effective eye-openers."],["",""]],["convent","'kɒnvәnt","n. 女修道会\\n[法] 召集, 召开, 开会",["Rima visited a convent in the middle of the island.","One cannot find peace in work or in pleasure, in the world or in a convent, but only in one's soul."],["",""]],["rationality",".ræʃә'næliti","n. 合理性, 纯理性",["At the same time, he didn't hide his fears and doubts, but tried hard to keep his calm and rationality in facing every difficulty.","It's not that suicide is always insane, but generally, nobody kills themselves in a fit of rationality."],["",""]],["riding","'raidiŋ","n. 骑, 乘车, 乘, 骑术, 骑马",["Life is like riding a bicycle. To keep your balance you must keep moving.","Stupidity is riding a bike that doesn't have brakes."],["人生就像騎單車一樣，要保持平衡就得不停地前進。","愚蠢骑着没有闸的单车。"]],["graphite","'græfait","n. 石墨\\n[化] 石墨",["The \"lead\" of the pencil is actually a mixture of graphite, clay and wax with a binder that seals the lead in the wooden shaft.","Two kinds of lubricant are used on a bicycle--oil and graphite."],["",""]],["disturbed","di'stә:bd","a. 混乱的",["Mike asked that he not be disturbed.","My sleep was disturbed by the sound."],["邁克要求不要被打擾。","那声音搅了我的美梦。"]],["jig","dʒig","n. 吉格快步舞, 快步舞曲, 带锤子的钓钩, 夹具\\nv. 乱跳, 加工用钩钓鱼, 选筛\\n[计] 装架; 钻模; 夹具",["The jig, reel and hornpipe are the most popular Irish dances.","The Irish jig and the French gigue differ in speed, microrhythmics, and German gender."],["",""]],["imaginable","i'mædʒinәbl","a. 可想像的, 可能的",["She loudly said every slander imaginable about me.","This cookbook has recipes for every imaginable occasion."],["",""]],["unpublished",".ʌn'pʌbliʃt","a. 未公开出版的；未发表过的",["An unpublished work is like an undelivered present.","The author held the hostages at gunpoint in a barn for three days, forcing them to read his unpublished novel."],["",""]],["galley","'gæli","n. 战舰, 军舰",["This apartment has a galley kitchen.","It will be recalled that Archimedes amazed the Syracusan general by constructing an apparatus that enabled him, sitting on shore, to drag a ponderous galley from the water."],["",""]],["covenant","'kʌvәnәnt","n. 契约, 盟约\\nv. 立契约, 缔结盟约",["And God said to Noah: This shall be the sign of the covenant, which I have established, between me and all flesh upon the earth.","Brothers, let me put this in human terms. Even a human covenant, once it is ratified, cannot be canceled or amended."],["",""]],["expulsion","ik'spʌlʃәn","n. 逐出, 开除, 驱逐, 排气\\n[医] 逼出",["His expulsion from university was occasioned by his academic misconduct.","I can see how kicking a teacher could lead to detention, or even expulsion, but not juvenile detention."],["",""]],["hepatitis",".hepә'taitis","n. 肝炎\\n[医] 肝炎",["She got hepatitis no wonder she is losing so much weight.","He's been battling hepatitis for 6 months now, but it looks like he's just starting to recover."],["她得了肝炎，难怪越來越瘦了。",""]],["esteem","i'sti:m","n. 尊敬, 尊重\\nvt. 尊敬, 尊重, 认为",["Just recently, I've become very lazy. I need to work to restore my self-esteem.","Because of his achievements, he is held in high esteem."],["",""]],["dichotomy","dai'kɒtәmi","n. 两分, 分裂, 二分法\\n[医] 二分(二分之一); 二叉, 二歧",["The work-play dichotomy has something to do with the left-right brain dichotomy."],[""]],["barricade",".bæri'keid","n. 路障, 障碍\\nvt. 设路障于, 阻碍",["The barricade has to be perpendicular to the road.","The barricade stood firm, a testament to their teamwork."],["",""]],["masculinity",".mæskju'liniti","n. 男子气, 刚毅, 大丈夫气概\\n[医] 男子本性, 男性",["This film attempts to break stereotypes and redefine what true masculinity is.","I think hairiness is a symbol of masculinity, so I really like it."],["這部電影試圖打破刻板印象，重新詮釋何謂真正的男性特質。",""]],["ecologist","i:'kɒlәdʒist","n. 生态学者",["Ziri is an ecologist."],[""]],["madden","'mædn","vt. 使发狂, 激怒\\nvi. 发狂, 发怒",["These brain teasers are maddening. I can't figure out any of them!"],[""]],["academia",".ækә'di:miә","n. 学术界, 学术生涯",["The invention of the Internet has revolutionized the world of academia for the better.","Latin was the language of European academia."],["",""]],["bog","bɒg","n. 沼泽\\nvt. 使陷于泥沼\\nvi. 陷于泥沼",["Grounding and other bog-standard punishments didn't get through to his son at all.","Our evidence is no more than a tiny sliver of solid knowledge amidst the vast bog of doubts and speculations."],["",""]],["subversive","sәb'vә:siv","a. 从事颠覆的, 破坏性的\\nn. 破坏分子, 颠覆分子",["The lyrics seem innocent enough, but if you listen to them closely, you'll realize how subversive they really are.","The subversive group was dragging Algeria to the brink of utter destruction."],["",""]],["deduct","di'dʌkt","vt. 扣除, 减去\\n[经] 扣除, 减去, 折扣",["He could deduct the furnishing of his work room from his taxes.","From our monthly revenue, we should deduct the costs of food, rent, clothing, transportation etc."],["",""]],["croatian","krej'әiʃ(ә)n","a. 克罗地亚的, 克罗地亚语的, 克罗地亚人的\\nn. 克罗地亚人, 克罗地亚语",["Mary has three language lessons every day: Czech, Hungarian and Croatian.","I'm learning four languages at the same time: Croatian, Serbian, Bosnian, and Montenegrin."],["",""]],["tinker","'tiŋkә","n. 补锅匠, 会做各种修补活计的人\\nvi. 做焊锅匠, 笨拙的修补\\nvt. 修补",["Tom likes to tinker with things because he believes there's always a better way.","It is an important match for the hosts, while the Americans will have a chance to tinker with their line-up."],["",""]],["troll","trɒl","vi. 滚动, 参加轮唱, 曳绳钓鱼\\nvt. 使转动, 轮唱, 高唱, 用曳绳钓(鱼)\\nn. 转动, 轮唱, 钓绳",["\"You, Sir, are an imperialist!\" \"And you, Sir, are a troll.\"","Just one slip and you'll be mistaken for a troll and flamed."],["\"先生, 你是一個帝國主義者!\" \"而你, 先生, 是一個巨魔。\"",""]],["concerted","kәn'sә:tid","a. 商定的, 协定的, 一致的\\n[法] 一致的, 协力的, 共同的",["All the neighbours made a concerted effort to clean up the park.","A concerted effort is required to eradicate malaria in the country."],["",""]],["quartet","kwɒ:'tet","n. 四重奏\\n[计] 四位字节",["A nibble is a data aggregation that comprises 4 bits, also called a half-byte, tetrade or quartet.","Tom often thinks of Mary when he hears a string quartet."],["",""]],["dummy","'dʌmi","n. 傀儡, 假人, 仿制品\\na. 虚设的, 假的, 名义上的",["The corporation set up a dummy company.","He made a crash test dummy of himself."],["",""]],["truthful","'tru:θful","a. 说真话的, 诚实的, 真实的, 如实的\\n[法] 真实的, 说实话的, 诚实的",["Tom isn't being entirely truthful about his job history.","A man is never more truthful than when he acknowledges himself a liar."],["",""]],["landslide","'lændslaid","n. 山崩\\n[化] 滑坡",["Traffic was blocked by a landslide.","Eight structures were swept into the sea by a landslide near the Norwegian Arctic town of Alta."],["交通被山崩所阻斷。",""]],["wrestler","'reslә","n. 摔跤选手",["My sister is cheering for a young Sumo wrestler.","The newly-elected mayor used to be a pro wrestler."],["我的姊姊為一個年輕的相撲力士加油。",""]],["fieldwork","'fi:ldwә:k","n. 野战工事, 野外工作\\n[经] 农田工作",["She fell in love with fieldwork studying lizards in the Chiricahua Mountains of Arizona.","Benedito's research involves fieldwork and laboratory experiments."],["",""]],["taint","teint","n. 污点, 耻辱, 感染\\nvt. 污染, 使腐败, 沾染, 腐蚀",["The stink bug can hide in wine grape clusters and then taint the juice when the grapes are crushed.","Back, from another quarter of the sky, / dark-ambushed, round the clamorous Harpies fly / with taloned claws, and taste and taint the prey."],["",""]],["sled","sled","n. 雪撬\\nvt. 用雪撬搬运\\nvi. 乘雪撬\\n[计] 单一大型贵重磁盘",["Out of other avenues for escape, the desperate fugitive decided to hijack a dog sled.","In the winter, I like to sled down the small hill close to our home."],["",""]],["contextual","kɒn'tekstjuәl","a. 上下文的, 前后关系的",["Language is contextual."],[""]],["tandem","'tændәm","adv. 一前一后地, 纵排地\\na. 纵排的, 串联的\\nn. 纵列两匹马拉的马车, 前后纵列的两匹马, 串座双人自行车",["I read both of those books in tandem several years ago and I can't remember which one the scene you're describing was in.","Benedito and his girlfriend will ride the tandem bike."],["",""]],["astonishment","ә'stɒniʃmәnt","n. 惊异, 惊愕, 使人惊异的事物",["To my astonishment, my money was gone.","Between astonishment and sorrow, she could not speak a word."],["令我惊讶的是，我的钱没了。",""]],["trample","'træmpl","n. 践踏(声), 蹂躏\\nv. 践踏, 无视",["In all of the gardens in my city it is illegal to trample the flower beds.","You can relax on the grass, but don't trample it."],["在我的城市的所有花園裡，踐踏花壇是違法的。","你可以休息在草地上，但是别踩它。"]],["incorporation","in.kɒ:pә'reiʃәn","n. 包含, 结合, 编入, 团体组织\\n[医] 惨合, 混合, 合并",["The articles of incorporation have finally been completed for our Digital Groove Club.","I feel that the incorporation of sex education in schools is a great step forward."],["",""]],["improperly","","[计] 不适当地",["They vote in secret, may seek public office, and may demand the removal of public officials who behave improperly.","Any electrical device, if used improperly, has the potential for causing fire, electrical shock or personal injury."],["",""]],["timid","'timid","a. 胆小的, 羞怯的",["She seems timid, but she's actually a strong-willed person.","Bob is very timid and blushes when chatting with girls."],["她看起來可能有點畏首畏尾的，但她的意志其實十分堅強。","鮑伯非常膽小，和女生聊天時會臉紅。"]],["destabilize","di:'steibilaiz","vt. 使动摇",["It's clear that Mary is a puppet of foreign powers that aim to destabilize the government.","The goal of Christianity was to destabilize Judea and make it ripe for direct Roman rule."],["",""]],["ambush","'æmbuʃ","n. 埋伏, 伏兵, 伏击\\nvt. 埋伏, 伏击\\nvi. 埋伏",["We've just received intelligence that the enemy is waiting in ambush two miles down the road.","The mayor was killed in an ambush during the height of the insurgency."],["我們剛剛收到情報，敵方正在前方兩英里處埋伏。",""]],["borrowing","'bɔrәuiŋ","[经] 借款, 贷款",["Borrow and return, then you can borrow again. Borrow and don't return, and then the borrowing gets difficult.","My pride prevented me from borrowing money from him."],["有借有还，再借不难。有借不还，再借就难。","骄傲使我无法向他借钱。"]],["taboo","tә'bu:","n. 禁忌, 禁止接近, 禁止使用\\na. 禁忌的, 忌讳的\\nvt. 禁忌, 忌讳, 禁止",["It exists, but seeing as it is taboo and that nobody talks about it, there's no need to have words for it.","The most taboo topics of discussion are: money, politics, religion, and sex."],["它的確存在, 但是因為人們將它視為禁忌而不去談論它, 也就不需要多說什麼了。",""]],["edgy","'edʒi","a. 刀口锐利的, 尖利的, 急躁的",["I can't tell if you're trying to be cute or edgy, but if you're trying to be both, it's not working well.","Her black leather jacket exuded an edgy sense of style."],["",""]],["undocumented",",ʌn'dɔkjjmentid","a. 无正式文件的, 无事实证明的",["It's not a bug, it's an undocumented feature.","It isn't a bug. It's an undocumented feature."],["这不是一个漏洞，而是一个没有写进文档的特性。","这不是一个漏洞，而是一个没有写进文档的特性。"]],["penalize","'pi:nәlaiz","vt. 处刑, 对...处罚(刑), 使不利\\n[法] 处罚, 对...处以刑事惩罚",["I will penalize you if you do not observe these regulations.","Algeria shouldn't penalize its poorest categories."],["",""]],["rut","rʌt","n. 辙迹, 凹槽, 常规, 惯例, 发情期\\nvi. 交尾, 发情\\nvt. 挖槽于",["I'm stuck in a rut in my boring job and need to do something new.","After more than three decades together, Kay and Arnold are in a rut with the same routine day after day."],["",""]],["symposium","sim'pәuziәm","n. 讨论会, 座谈会, 专题报告会, 专题论文集",["The symposium was a little rougher than usual: \"Never again,\" said Socrates the morning after.","Tom is attending a writers' symposium in Boston."],["",""]],["upstream","'ʌp'stri:m","adv. 向上游, 逆流地\\na. 向上游的, 逆流而上的",["It's a lot easier to paddle a canoe downstream than to paddle upstream.","It's a lot easier paddling a canoe downstream than upstream."],["",""]],["urgently","","adv. 急切地；迫切地；紧急地",["Algeria should urgently implement social distancing measures.","Algeria urgently needs to develop its manufacturing sector."],["",""]],["felon","'felәn","n. 重罪犯, 恶棍, 瘭疽\\n[医] 瘭疽, 指头脓炎",["I know that Tom is a felon, but I still think he's a nice guy.","I know Tom is a felon, but I still think he's a nice guy."],["",""]],["clarification",".klærifi'keiʃәn","n. 澄清, 净化\\n[计] 澄清报告; 澄清",["The first point that requires clarification is that the design was purely experimental.","We are at your disposal for any further clarification."],["",""]],["vulgar","'vʌlgә","a. 粗俗的, 庸俗的, 普通的, 通俗的, 方言的\\n[法] 庸俗的, 卑下的, 粗俗的",["She is extremely vulgar in her speech.","You could say it that way, but it's quite vulgar."],["她讲话非常俗气。","可以这样说，但是太不文明了。"]],["censored","ˈsensəd","a. 受审查的, 被删剪的\\nv. 删剪（书籍、电影等中被认为犯忌、违反道德或政治上危险的内容）( censor的过去式和过去分词 )",["The book \"Sexuality and Homosexual Condition in Christian Morality\" was censored in Argentina.","Many topics were discussed during the interview, but some of them were censored."],["",""]],["homelessness","","n. 无家可归",["The government cannot avoid the issue of homelessness any longer.","I tried lying down for a nap, dreamt about homelessness, and woke up."],["",""]],["accompaniment","ә'kʌmpәnimәnt","n. 伴随物, 附加物, 伴奏",["High fever is a frequent accompaniment of influenza.","You're not playing the accompaniment softly enough."],["",""]],["wrongly","","adv. 错误地, 不恰当地, 不正确地, 不正直地, 不公正地",["Having been wrongly addressed, the letter never reached him.","If it is wrongly used, the medicine will be a poison."],["",""]],["ax","æks","n. 斧头\\nvt. 用斧削或砍, 削减",["The tree was felled with one hard blow of his ax.","Many workers are facing the ax in the assembly department."],["他用斧頭重重的斬了一下，那棵樹就倒了下來。",""]],["creepy","'kri:pi","a. 爬行的, 令人毛骨悚然的",["I always find puppet shows a bit creepy.","What are you hiding? Come on, tell me. You can't keep it from me. That's creepy."],["我总觉得木偶戏有点吓人。",""]],["entourage",",ɔntu'rɑ:ʒ","n. 全体随行人员, 陪同人员",["She found it difficult to adapt herself to her new entourage.","Bouteflika and his entourage had unchecked access to Algeria's oil revenues."],["",""]],["slit","slit","n. 裂缝, 投币口, 狭长裂口\\nvt. 切开, 扯裂, 使有狭缝\\nvi. 纵切, 纵裂",["The police think that Tom was stabbed before his throat was slit.","Tom and his buddies slit the throats of eleven men and women."],["",""]],["rummage","'rʌmidʒ","v. 仔细翻寻, 仔细搜查, 检查出\\nn. 仔细翻找, 查出的物件",["Tom opened the drawer and began to rummage through it.","Ziri started to rummage greedily in his mom's purse."],["",""]],["neutrino","nju:'tri:nәu","n. 中微子\\n[化] 中微子; 微中子",["Basically, she's created a fad diet collider. And sometimes the particles that spin off are gluon-free neutrino burgers."],[""]],["deference","'defәrәns","n. 顺从, 尊重",["Then I'll work on the principle that deference is no substitute for obedience.","Although you are able to win, sometimes yield to a friend, since through deference, sweet friends are preserved."],["那我就恭敬不如从命啦。",""]],["doze","dәuz","vi. 打瞌睡, 假寐\\nvt. 打瞌睡度过\\nn. 瞌睡",["I was so sleepy that I unintentionally fell into a doze right where I was sitting.","Yet I get no repose and I can't even doze without dreaming I'm back on the Beagle."],["",""]],["flora","'flɒ:rә","n. 植物群\\n[医] 植物区系, 植物丛, 植物群, 菌丛",["The botanist studied the flora of the remote island.","The island's unique flora and fauna must be protected."],["",""]],["obligate","'ɒbligeit","vt. 使负义务, 强使, 使感激, 施恩惠于\\na. 有责任的, 必须的",["Not even a state can obligate you to take others' lives.","Many methanogenic Archaea are obligate anaerobes."],["",""]],["eyepiece","'aipi:s","n. (接)目镜\\n[化] 目镜",["Look through the eyepiece to see the specimen."],["透過目鏡觀察標本。"]],["discriminatory","di'skriminәtәri; (?@) -tɔ:ri","a. 有辨识力的, 有差别的",["I think that Japan's marriage system is an unequal and discriminatory contract disadvantageous to men.","Though effective in theory, this practice is likely to be discriminatory in practice."],["",""]],["janitor","'dʒænitә","n. 守卫, 门警, 管理人\\n[医] 幽门",["Tom started as a janitor, but he's now the president of the company.","Tom accepted the job as janitor at the local high school."],["汤姆最初是看门人，但现在他是公司的总裁了。",""]],["chancellor","'tʃɑ:nsәlә","n. 大臣, 总理, 首相, 大使馆/领事馆的一等秘书, 司法官, 大学校长",["The German Chancellor is plagued by immigration problems.","Gerhard Schroeder is the first German chancellor not to have lived through World War II."],["",""]],["recourse","ri'kɒ:s","n. 求援, 求助, 追索权\\n[经] 追索权",["His last recourse will be to go to his father for help.","He was the only recourse for his family after his father's death."],["",""]],["kernel","'kә:nl","n. 核心, 中心, 精髓, 内核\\n[计] 内核",["Tom tried to crack a walnut without damaging its kernel.","The kernel of a group homomorphism always contains the neutral element."],["湯姆試圖敲碎一顆核桃而不損壞果仁。",""]],["purport","'pә:pɒ:t","n. 意义, 要旨, 目的\\nvt. 意味着, 声称, 打算",["You purport to know what you're talking about; why don't you know about this?","The text did not purport to be comprehensive."],["",""]],["medically","","adv. 医学, 医疗, 医术, 内科, 医药",["Gender-affirming care is controversial politically, not medically.","At present it is medically impossible to cure this disease."],["",""]],["birdie","'bә:di","n. 小鸟",["A little birdie told me you were there."],[""]],["corroborate","kә'rɒbәreit","vt. 巩固, 确证\\n[法] 确证, 确定, 证实",["Ray was willing to corroborate Gary's story, but the police were still unconvinced that either of them were telling the truth.","Your story doesn't corroborate what I've heard before."],["Ray乐于证实Gary的故事，但警察仍然不相信他们其中一个说的是事实。",""]],["adversity","әd'vә:sәti","n. 逆境, 不幸, 灾祸, 灾难",["Adversity and prosperity reveal one's breadth of mind; joy and anger test one's self-restraint.","Despite adversity, the architect achieved worldwide fame."],["逆境顺境看襟度，临喜临怒看涵养。","尽管有逆境，建筑师还是获得了享誉全球的荣誉。"]],["impatience","im'peiʃәns","n. 性急, 难耐, 焦急, 急躁",["The audience showed their impatience by stamping of feet.","Infinite patience and infinite impatience: one of these two expressions makes sense and the other doesn't."],["",""]],["semantic","si'mæntik","a. 语义的\\n[计] 语义",["Here's an example of a semantic gamut: non-existent, unique, rare, uncommon, common, trite, worn-out, universal.","Semantic equivalence is protean as well as fuzzy: what hoi polloi find equivalent may to cognoscenti be quite distinct."],["",""]],["grace","greis","n. 优雅, 风度, 慈悲, 恩惠, 体面, 赦免, 恩典, 谢恩祷告\\nvt. 使优美",["Grace goes upstairs to the extension telephone.","If Grace had not studied so hard, she would surely have failed the test."],["格雷斯去樓上的分機電話。",""]],["anglo","'æŋ^lәj","n. 英国人",["Anglo-Saxon was to Norman as hen-pecked to uxorious.","In the 6th century, the Anglo-Saxons adopted Roman characters."],["盎格鲁-撒克逊人对诺曼人来说就像妻管严对溺爱妻子的人一样。",""]],["yolk","jәuk","n. 蛋黄, 卵黄\\n[医] 卵黄, 羊毛脂",["Place them on the baking sheet, then glaze them with egg yolk.","Even if I use both hands, I can't crack an egg without breaking the yolk."],["",""]],["deserving","di'zә:viŋ","a. 该受的, 有功的, 值得...的\\nn. 功过, 赏罚",["This hotel is far from deserving the four stars the guidebook gives it.","They call Paris the City of Lights, but Las Vegas may be more deserving of that title."],["這家酒店在旅行指南上有四星級的評分，但是卻完全沒有四星級的水準。",""]],["connotation",".kɒnәu'teiʃәn","n. 含蓄, 内涵",["In the first paragraph, she describes the labels she was tagged with, which have a negative connotation.","A positive term for gentiles in Yiddish is \"layt\" or \"laytn\", which has the connotation of respectable, civilized adults."],["",""]],["remodel","ri:'mɒdl","vt. 改造, 改型, 改变",["Tom hired a local contractor to remodel his kitchen.","The bathroom remodel is usually a scam. Sorry, I just made that up."],["",""]],["incite","in'sait","vt. 刺激, 激励, 引诱\\n[法] 鼓动, 煽动",["The speaker tried to incite the people to rebellion.","He however says the government will not condone pronouncements that incite violence and chaos."],["",""]],["campsite","kæmp'sait","n. 营地",["Tom drove the medicine to the campsite.","Campers scampered to higher ground when their campsite was engulfed in water."],["汤姆把药物运到了营地。",""]],["primate","'praimit","n. 大主教, 灵长目动物\\n[医] 灵长类",["Madame Berthe's mouse lemur is the smallest primate in the world.","The zoo's primate exhibit was interesting to Adriano."],["",""]],["parchment","'pɑ:tʃmәnt","n. 羊皮纸, 毕业文凭, 学位证书",["Swallows fill the parchment of the sky with signatures in honor of the good weather.","His face was lean and haggard, and his brown parchment-like skin was drawn tightly over the projecting bones."],["",""]],["anarchy","'ænәki","n. 无政府状态, 政治混乱\\n[法] 混乱, 无秩序, 无政府状态",["The country was in a state of anarchy at that time.","While the civil war went on, the country was in a state of anarchy."],["",""]],["cumin","'kʌmin","n. 莳萝, 土茴香子\\n[化] 枯茗; 欧莳萝; 异丙苯",["If you just put a little bit of cumin on the kebab, it'll be really delicious.","Cumin is very good for after a large meal."],["",""]],["artificially",".ɑ:ti'fiʃәli","adv. 人工地, 人为地, 不自然地",["If a natural language can be compared to a tree, which has developed during the course of time, Esperanto can be compared to a plastic tree, which was created artificially.","Tom comes from a culture where women artificially color their lips and put holes in their earlobes."],["如果把自然语言比作一棵随着时间推移而生长的大树，那么世界语就可以比作一棵人工制造出来的塑料树。",""]],["roadblock","'rәudblɒk","n. 障碍, 障碍物",["The roadblock is only temporary. It will be removed when the construction is finished.","Bruno complained to Rima about the roadblock."],["",""]],["coerce","kәu'ә:s","vt. 强制, 强迫",["I can try to persuade her to go, but I can't coerce her.","He said laws should not coerce but protect public health while protecting human rights."],["",""]],["oily","'ɒili","a. 油的, 油滑的, 油嘴的\\n[化] 油的; 含油的; 油性的; 油质的; 多油的; 油腻的; 油滑的",["My clothes have an oily smell because I ate at an okonomiyaki place.","I didn't eat all the fries because they were too oily."],["我去了一家什錦燒店吃東西，所以身上的衣服都沾上了一股油味。",""]],["immortal","i'mɒ:tәl","n. 不朽人物, 神仙\\na. 永远的, 不死的, 长久的",["There has never been a savior nor an immortal emperor to rely on.","Mortal enemies are immortal friends."],["从来就没有什么救世主， 也不靠神仙皇帝！","不共戴天的敵人是不朽的朋友。"]],["guinea","'gini","n. 几内亚",["The northern half of what is today Papua New Guinea was a German colony.","I, Stallone, am not such as to be scared simply of being the guinea pig for some test."],["",""]],["oats","","n. 燕麦, 燕麦属植物, 燕麦粥, 麦片粥",["Our breakfast has oats and corn in it.","The sun rose bright and shone upon the sheaf of oats, and the twittering birds surrounded the pole."],["我們早餐有燕麥和玉米。",""]],["quicker","","a. 快些（quick的形容词比较级）",["Eating smaller portions from smaller plates can help you eat less while not feeling hungry any quicker.","If you do it a bit slower, it goes quicker."],["用小餐盘打饭可以帮助你减少食量而不至于那么快感到饥饿。","如果你做慢一點, 它就會進行的快一點。"]],["assertive","ә'sә:tiv","a. 武断的, 过分自信的\\n[法] 断言的",["Tom doesn't seem to be as assertive as Mary seems to be.","You don't seem to be as assertive as Tom seems to be."],["",""]],["spore","spɒ:","n. 孢子\\nvi. 长孢子",["The biologist looked at a spore under the microscope.","A mushroom is a spore distribution device."],["",""]],["flagship","'flægʃip","n. 旗舰",["A famous brand has opened a flagship store in my neighbourhood.","Dragon Quest was the flagship RPG franchise of Enix, while Final Fantasy was Square's."],["",""]],["customize","kʌstәmaiz","vt. 定制, 按规格改制, 定做\\n[计] 定制",["You can format and customize a worksheet, and insert and use tables, charts, formulas and functions.","This game lets you customize your own mech for battle."],["",""]],["picturesque",".piktʃә'resk","a. 生动的, 如画的, 独特的, 别致的, 栩栩如生的",["The stranger who sails for the first time up the Firth of Forth must be struck with the numerous villages that stud its picturesque shores.","That little fishing village by the sea is very picturesque."],["眾多村莊點綴著福斯灣的岸邊，優美如畫。初次於此航行的陌生人，必定會留下深刻印象。",""]],["whack","hwæk","vt. 猛击, 重打, 削减\\nvi. 重击\\nn. 重击, 重打",["I'm just about to whack you on the ears with a spoon, you monkey.","She's diabetic, so her blood sugar was already out of whack."],["",""]],["noticeably","","adv. 显而易见, 值得注意, 重要, 显著",["The temperature in the winter is noticeably colder than in the fall.","The days are getting noticeably shorter now that autumn has arrived."],["",""]],["arithmetic","ә'riθmәtik","n. 算术, 算术知识\\n[机] 算术; 算术的",["Accuracy is important in arithmetic.","How many arithmetic books are left?"],["准确性在计算中很重要。","有多少本算数书留着？"]],["washer","'wɒʃә","n. 洗衣人, 垫圈, 洗衣机\\n[化] 洗涤器; 垫圈",["The window washer lost his grip and fell to his death.","Move the clothes from the washer to the dryer before they start to mildew."],["",""]],["relieved","ri'li:vd","a. 宽慰的, 解除的, 减轻的",["We felt relieved when we saw a light in the distance.","After you take the medicine, your stomachache will be much relieved."],["我們看見遠處傳來了一點光，不禁都鬆了一口氣。","你吃了这药，胃痛就会缓解很多。"]],["terrorize","'terәraiz","vt. 使惊恐, 恐吓\\nvi. 实施恐怖统治",["It cannot be allowed to terrorize the populace any longer.","Fireball, an orange tabby cat, loves to terrorize all the cats in the neighborhood."],["",""]],["maternity","mә'tә:niti","n. 母性, 怀孕, 妇产科医院\\na. 产妇的",["Little Wang is on maternity leave. She won't be back to work for six months.","I'm taking maternity leave from September 30th to October 14th."],["小王休产假了，半年内都不会来上班。",""]],["rainforest","'rein'fɔrist","[生态]雨林",["Most accidents, after all, happen around the corner, not in the rainforest.","The sun and a damp climate made the tropical rainforest."],["",""]],["palate","'pælit","n. 腭, 味觉, 趣味, 爱好\\n[医] 腭",["The tongue and the palate are the taste organs.","Foreign rice is hard and tasteless, and doesn't appeal to the Japanese palate."],["舌头和上颚都是味觉器官。",""]],["wreak","ri:k","vt. 发泄(怒火), 报仇\\n[法] 报仇, 报复, 施",["A hurricane can wreak destruction everywhere it goes.","Some non-native species are harmless, but others wreak havoc on other species, human health and the economy."],["",""]],["recurrent","ri'kʌrәnt","a. 再发生的, 定期重复的, 循环的\\n[医] 复发的, 再发的, 回归的",["Recurrent miscarriage is distinct from infertility, and is defined as two or more failed pregnancies.","Recurrent wintertime outbreaks of SARS-CoV-2 could occur after the initial pandemic wave."],["",""]],["seminal","'seminl","a. 精液的, 种子的, 生殖的\\n[医] 种子的; 精液的",["Imogen of the Internet has created a seminal classification of thirty distinct varieties of chatspeak, some now facing linguistic extinction."],[""]],["axe","","n. 斧, 斧头\\nvt. 削减(人员、经费、计划、机构等)",["I get the feeling you still have an axe to grind. If you've got something to say come on out and say it.","He has had absolutely no part in the conspiracy; it was not he, but his brother, who had an axe to grind against the government."],["",""]],["aw","ɔ:","int. 哦！噢！（表示抗议, 厌恶, 讨厌等）",["Aw, all gone..., I wonder if I open the bag again there'll be more.","\"Aw, come on, son!\" the farmer insisted."],["",""]],["wad","wɒd","n. 小软团, 小软块, 一卷, 填料, 大量\\nvt. 揉成一团, 填塞",["My tight wad husband took me to McDonald's for our anniversary.","Daniel took a thick wad of money out of the closet and threw it at Amanda."],["",""]],["depressive","di'presiv","a. 压抑的, 压下的, 沉闷的\\n[医] 抑郁的, 阻抑的, 压低的",["This site is one of the most depressive sites I've ever been.","Mennad suffered a major depressive disorder."],["",""]],["gruesome","'gru:sәm","a. 可怕的, 令人毛骨悚然的, 阴森的",["When he claims to desire eternal life, in reality man merely wishes to avoid a premature, violent or gruesome death.","Any murder is gruesome but this one was especially heinous."],["",""]],["bidder","'bidә","n. 出价人, 投标人\\n[经] 投标人, 出价人, 投标商",["During the dictatorship, many midwives would sell the babies of impoverished people to the highest bidder.","These websites are tracking everything you do, then selling information about it to the highest bidder."],["",""]],["skeletal","'skelәtәl","a. 骨骼的, 框架的\\n[医] 骨胳的",["His abstemious habits gave him a skeletal appearance.","The mesenchymal tissue between the mesothelium and the ectoderm forms the mass of the skeletal, muscular and vascular systems."],["",""]],["targeted","'tɑːɡɪtɪd","[医]定向的",["America's radioactive waste may be targeted in terrorist attacks.","After all, even salesmen are desperate to avoid being targeted for downsizing."],["",""]],["acutely","ә'kju:tli","adv. 尖锐地, 剧烈地",["I was acutely aware of how very important mathematical education was.","The U.N. Children's Fund says thousands of children in the Central African Republic are acutely malnourished."],["",""]],["unsuccessfully","","adv. 无用；失败地",["He tried unsuccessfully to domineer over his office workers.","She waited unsuccessfully for any signs of life in her friend."],["",""]],["rented","","a. 租用的",["Helen and Kathy rented an apartment in a suburb of Tokyo.","The reporter rented an expensive room."],["海伦和凯蒂在东京郊区租了个套间。","记者租了间很贵的房。"]],["hive","haiv","n. 蜂房, 闹区, 蜜蜂群\\nvi. 进入蜂房, 储藏蜜于蜂房, 如蜂般群居\\nvt. 使进蜂房, 储备\\n[计] 蜂巢",["Bees communicate the location of food by carrying odor samples back to the hive.","You will never find a more wretched hive of scum and villainy."],["",""]],["rodeo","rәu'deiәu","n. 竞技表演\\n[经] 牛市场",["Benedito will ride the mechanical bull at the rodeo.","Sadly, Maskwa's rodeo was not impressive to the crowd and so he went home without the money."],["",""]],["measurable","'meʒәrәbl","a. 可测量的, 不久的, 重要的",["The results should be measurable and the process repeatable.","The scientific method accounts for measurable uncertainties."],["",""]],["subvert","sәb'vә:t","vt. 推翻, 颠覆, 毁灭\\n[法] 颠覆, 推翻, 减亡",["Alana, stop trying to subvert the company goals.","Her poems subvert the dominant narrative of \"Western civilization.\""],["",""]],["publicist","'pʌblisist","n. 国际法学家, 政治评论家, 政治作家, 广告员\\n[法] 国际法学家, 公法学家, 政治学",["Many well renowned influencers have their own publicist.","The publicist boasted of her multifarious contacts across film, fashion, and politics."],["",""]],["liter","'li:tә","n. 公升\\n[化] 升",["This car can go thirteen kilometers for every liter of gasoline.","A liter of milk contains about thirty grams of protein."],["這輛車每升油能跑十三公里。",""]],["menacing","'menәsiŋ","a. 恐吓的, 威胁的\\n[法] 威胁的, 恐吓的, 险恶的",["I can't even describe how malicious and menacing Igor's voice was when he said those words.","The 80m-high cliffs, steep from every angle, appear uninviting, even menacing."],["",""]],["debilitating","dɪ'bɪlɪteɪtɪŋ","v. 使（人或人的身体）非常虚弱( debilitate的现在分词 )",["Cancer patients often have to deal with debilitating bouts of nausea.","Mild to moderate cases of eye floaters can be frustrating and debilitating - but only if you let them."],["",""]],["geopolitical",",dʒi(:)әupә'litikәl","[计] 地理的",["This wasn't the first geopolitical battle between the United States and China, and it would not be the last.","Algeria is a formidable geopolitical rival in the North Africa and the Sahel region."],["",""]],["caveat","'keiviæt","n. 中止诉讼程序的申请, 警告\\n[经] 停止支付的广告, 货物出门概不退换",["The major caveat that is preventing me from travelling more is increased travel expenses.","His proposal was very well received, but it had one big caveat."],["",""]],["patterned","","a. 被组成图案的",["He patterned his stage persona after anime characters.","These are cafes, patterned after Middle East lounges, where people gather to smoke fruit-flavored tobacco from water pipes."],["",""]],["ravine","rә'vi:n","n. 峡谷, 冲沟, 溪谷",["It is likely that nobody can accurately estimate the depth and breadth of this ravine.","When this bridge was built, two workmen were killed when they fell into the ravine."],["",""]],["bustling","'bʌsliŋ","a. 熙熙攘攘的, 忙乱的",["Algiers is a bustling city of over three million people.","The railway station was bustling with travellers saddled with Christmas presents."],["阿尔及尔是一座有着超过三百多万人口的繁华都市。",""]],["abnormality",".æbnɒ:'mæliti","n. 反常, 畸形, 变态\\n[化] 反常; 非正态性",["We have detected an abnormality on your x-ray.","Boldi is the embodiment of abnormality."],["",""]],["quarterly","'kwɔ:tәli","a. 季度的, 按季度的, 每季的\\nadv. 按季, 每三个月, 每季一次\\nn. 季刊",["Surely the most curious of sources consulted is Mankind Quarterly.","The quarterly growth of 1.2% means an annual growth rate of 4.8%."],["",""]],["porter","'pɒ:tә","n. 大楼管理员, 门房, 搬运工人, 侍者, 服务员\\n[化] 搬运车; 搬运工人",["Don't forget to tip the porter for carrying your luggage.","Please have the porter take the baggage to our room."],["",""]],["folklore","'fәuklɒ:","n. 民俗学, 民间风俗, 民间传说",["Island folklore still recounts the story of the raft.","He compiled a Japanese folklore anthology for use in schools."],["",""]],["depress","di'pres","vt. 使沮丧, 压低, 降低, 使萧条\\n[化] 推下",["Analysts warn that China could cut steel production, which would further depress iron ore prices.","Rain doesn't depress people who like reading."],["",""]],["repressive","ri'presiv","a. 压抑的, 抑制的, 镇压的",["Every dictatorship needs a strong repressive intelligence service.","Afghanistan has become a terrible repressive theocracy."],["",""]],["quicken","'kwikәn","vt. 加快, 激发, 使有生气, 鼓舞, 使复活\\nvi. 加快, 变活跃, 进入胎动期",["I felt my heart quicken."],[""]],["redirect",".ri:di'rekt","vt. 重新寄送, 使改道, 使改方向\\n[计] 重定向, 重新引导",["I want you to redirect the output of this command into that file.","Please redirect your energy to something more productive instead of persistently making passive-aggressive remarks towards me."],["",""]],["joyful","'dʒɒiful","a. 欢喜的, 高兴的, 令人高兴的",["Loving and being loved are the most joyful things in the world.","A joyful soul is like healthy soil in which life can thrive and produce good fruit."],["爱和被爱是世上最幸运的事。",""]],["crackle","'krækl","n. 劈啪响, 裂纹\\nvi. (使)发劈啪声",["He spake, and nearer through the city came / the roar, the crackle and the fiery glow / of conflagration, rolling floods of flame."],[""]],["tributary","'tribjutәri","a. 支流的, 纳贡的, 从属的, 辅助的\\nn. 支流, 纳贡者, 属国",["During the 15th century, the Ryukyu Kingdom was a tributary state of Imperial China.","The Oste is a tributary of the River Elbe."],["在15世紀，琉球王國是中國帝國的附庸國。",""]],["songwriter","","n. 流行歌曲的作者",["Tom told me he thought that Mary was a talented songwriter.","Tom told me that he thought that Mary was a talented songwriter."],["",""]],["unpack",".ʌn'pæk","vt. 从包裹中取出, 卸下, 打开\\nvi. 打开包裹\\n[计] 拆开",["You have to unpack your luggage for customs inspection.","Tom wanted to unpack, but couldn't get his suitcase open."],["",""]],["tablecloth","'teiblklɒθ","n. 台布",["As Tom sat down, he bumped the table and his coffee spilled onto the tablecloth.","I'm afraid that I spilled coffee on the tablecloth."],["",""]],["stately","'steitli","a. 庄严的, 宏伟的",["A government official's stately mansion was looted.","He was a tall, heavy-looking young man of five-and-twenty. His air was grave and stately, and his manners were very formal."],["",""]],["secretive","si'kri:tiv","a. 秘密的, 偷偷摸摸的, 分泌的, 促进分泌的",["Apple is still very secretive with regard to the release date and the price.","Tom doesn't seem to be as secretive as Mary seems to be."],["苹果在发售日期和价格上口风仍然很紧。",""]],["horrifying","","a. 令人恐惧的；使人惊骇的",["In a horrifying chain of events, Christopher Columbus once bit his own lip.","The debate has been interesting, confusing, and sometimes horrifying."],["在一連串可怕的事件中, 哥倫布曾經咬緊牙關撐過去。",""]],["penchant","'pә:ŋʃә:ŋ","n. 爱好, 嗜好",["He has a penchant for whistling at pretty ladies he sees on the street.","He plays a wily detective with a penchant for disguises."],["",""]],["abduct","æb'dʌkt","vt. 诱拐, 绑架, 使外展\\n[医] 外展, 展",["Nobody knows how or why, but aliens abduct hundreds of people every year.","I've always guessed that aliens saw something special in me for wanting to abduct me so forcefully."],["",""]],["drone","drәun","n. 雄蜂, 懒惰者, 嗡嗡的声音, 无人驾驶飞机(或船)\\nvi. 嗡嗡作声, 混日子\\nvt. 低沉地说",["While you drone on about preserving the standard of living for the middle class, our parents are dying of hypothermia.","The police used a drone with a loudspeaker to disperse the crowd."],["當您滔滔不絕地談論著維護中產階級的生活水準時，我們的父母正死於體溫過低。",""]],["commando","kә'mɑ:ndәu","n. 突击队, 突击队员, (南非)布尔人部队",["It's called commando when you don't wear underwear beneath your pants."],[""]],["separated","'sepәreitid","a. 分居；分开的；不在一起生活的",["Out of sight out of mind. When you're separated you lose touch.","This classroom is separated from that one by a wall."],["久了不見，便會逐漸淡忘。分開以後，也就自然不會再聯絡了。","这间教室与那间隔着一堵墙。"]],["sitter","'sitә","n. 坐着的人, 坐着被画像的人",["Every portrait that is painted with feeling is a portrait of the artist, not of the sitter.","The previous pet-sitter taught our parrot the phrase \"level 10 gyatt\" and now he won't stop saying it, so we're hiring a new one."],["",""]],["modestly","","adv. 适当地；谨慎地",["She listened to him with her eyes modestly cast down.","Vladimir told Martha to dress a little more modestly."],["",""]],["crumbling","","v. 破碎；崩溃（crumble的ing形式）",["His friends had told him a lot about that small hut, built roughly with metal parts and crumbling bricks.","Recently, I've been suffering from lack of sleep, so my skin is crumbling."],["",""]],["thrash","θræʃ","vt. 打, 使逆行, 胜过, 推敲, 鞭打\\nvi. 打谷, 痛打, 剧烈扭动, 逆行\\nn. 打谷, (划水)鞭状动作",["Tom went out into the yard of his Australian home to thrash about the mice with a broom.","I fancied that it would not be very difficult to thrash him, but found that I had made a great mistake."],["",""]],["geology","dʒi'ɒlәdʒi","n. 地质学, 地质情况",["Geology is divided into various branches such as mineralogy, petrology, and physical geology.","Tom isn't studying geology. He's studying geography."],["",""]],["hospitalization",",hɔspitәlai'zeiʃәn","n. 医院收容, 住院治疗\\n[医] 住院, 入院",["Tom was beaten by his father to the point of needing hospitalization.","Eighty percent of people who get the coronavirus don't need hospitalization and can recover at home with no problem."],["",""]],["boon","bu:n","n. 恩惠",["Some Central Asian residents remain skeptical of the project, while others anticipate it will be an economic boon for the region.","This dictionary is great boon up to us."],["",""]],["pointless","'pɒintlis","a. 不尖的, 钝的, 不得要领的",["Don't bother your parents with such a pointless thing.","Life without love is just totally pointless."],["別為了這樣的小事麻煩你父母。","没有爱情的生活毫无意义。"]],["lengthen","'leŋθәn","vt. 加长, 使延长\\nvi. 变长",["Being optimistic could lengthen your life, a new study suggests.","The coat is a bit too short. Can you lengthen it?"],["",""]],["accelerator","әk'selәreitә","n. 加速剂, 加速器, 油门\\n[化] 加速器; 早强剂; 促进剂; 硫化促进剂",["You need to press the accelerator to go more quickly.","Paul was ready to put the particle accelerator to the test."],["",""]],["waking","","a. 醒着的",["Going to sleep and waking up early is good for the body.","He crept out of the room very carefully to avoid waking her up."],["早睡早起身体好。","他很小心地溜出房间，以免惊醒她。"]],["yarn","jɑ:n","n. 纱, 纱线, 故事\\n[化] 纱",["He presses just the right part of the snail's foot to encourage it to secrete a neurotoxin directly onto a skein of cotton yarn.","The milky liquid stains the yarn in a greenish color."],["",""]],["ploy","plɒi","n. 手段, 活动, 玩乐",["The opposition party claimed that approving the bill by a vote late at night was a political ploy."],[""]],["pretense","pri'tens","n. 借口, 虚假, 伪装",["He made a pretense of knowing my father.","He says the accusation was just a pretense to grab his land, and he thinks the communal violence has everything to do with his ethnicity."],["",""]],["seated","","a. 就座的；固定的；根深蒂固的",["A beautiful woman was seated one row in front of me.","They were seated side by side under an oak, and, having once tasted of the pleasure of kissing, were unable to cease their endearments."],["一個美麗的女人坐在我前面一排。","他們並排坐在橡樹下，嚐到了接吻的滋味後，便無法停止彼此的愛意。"]],["liturgy","'litәdʒi","n. 礼拜仪式, 祷告文, 圣餐仪式",["Every priest who serves liturgy is required to receive communion.","On and around holidays, there are additions to the daily Jewish liturgy."],["",""]],["teeter","'ti:tә","vi. 步履不稳地走动, 踉跄, 摇晃, 摇摆不定, 摇摇欲坠, 玩跷跷板\\nn. 踉跄, 摇摆, 跷跷板",["I wish I were a kid again so I could play on a teeter-totter.","Tom and Mary were playing on the teeter-totter."],["",""]],["stirring","'stә:riŋ","a. 活跃的, 忙碌的, 激动人心的\\n[化] 调和; 搅拌",["Cooks are dicing onions, stirring sausage, slicing tuna in slender chunks, their work spare and clean.","The event opened with a stirring rendition of the national anthem."],["",""]],["logically","'lɔdʒikәli","adv. 逻辑, 合乎逻辑, 符合逻辑, 逻辑上, 有逻辑, 有逻辑头脑, 合理, 明智",["An argument may be logically sound without being true.","It's probably a person. However, not logically entailing Peter's expression..."],["不正确的命题听起来可能符合逻辑。",""]],["bale","beil","n. 包, 捆, 货物, 灾难\\nvt. 打包, 捆包",["Bale was fouled, and his team was awarded a free kick.","Jonah and Leah live in a beautiful, straw-bale, timber-framed home that they built from hand."],["贝尔被犯规了，球队获得了任意球。",""]],["converse","kәn'vә:s","n. 相反的事物, 倒, 逆向\\na. 相反的, 逆向的, 颠倒的\\nvi. 交谈, 谈话",["Passengers shall not converse with the driver while the bus is in motion.","My father is still reluctant to convert to Islam but we converse about this religion now."],["",""]],["unborn",".ʌn'bɒ:n","a. 未诞生的, 未来的, 在胎内的\\n[法] 未诞生的, 未来的, 原来存在的",["Mary had an ultrasound to find out the sex of her and Tom's unborn baby.","Sami isn't sure who Layla's unborn baby's father was."],["瑪莉為了知道她和湯姆未出生的孩子的性別，做了超音波檢查。",""]],["led","led","lead的过去式和过去分词\\n[计] 发光二极管",["Susan, I'm sorry if I led you on but the truth is that I'm just not interested.","Some people consider Led Zeppelin to be the greatest band there has ever been."],["苏珊，我很抱歉让你抱有希望，但事实是我就是不感兴趣。","有些人將齊柏林飛船視為有史以來最偉大的樂團。"]],["stroller","'strәulә","n. 散步者, 流浪者",["I saw Tom pushing a stroller down the sidewalk.","Why would you push a dog around in a stroller? That doesn't give them any exercise at all."],["我看到湯姆推著嬰兒車走在人行道上。",""]],["barley","'bɑ:li","n. 大麦\\n[医] 大麦",["Having run the race, Jane had two glasses of barley tea.","He who is frightened of a sparrow will never sow barley."],["",""]],["slay","slei","v. 杀害, 残杀",["The hero ventured into the cave to slay the fearsome firedrake.","All to the strange encounter, sword in hand, / rush forth, these miscreants of the deep to slay."],["",""]],["conformity","kәn'fɒ:miti","n. 遵照, 适合, 一致, 相似\\n[计] 符合度",["Some people prefer conformity, while others seek novelty.","The most enlightened way of living is to despise social conventions while at the same time living your life in conformity to them."],["有些人喜欢循规蹈矩，而有些人总喜欢寻求刺激。","最光明的处世方法是既蔑视社会的因袭，又过着与社会的因袭不相矛盾的生活。"]],["benevolent","bi'nevәlәnt","a. 善意的, 慈善的",["He was a benevolent old man who volunteered to mow his neighbors' lawns for free.","Utterly different from Tom was his friend John, who was kind and benevolent."],["",""]],["coward","'kauәd","n. 懦弱的人, 胆小的人",["He doesn't even dare to reply to a harsh word. He's such a coward.","John is brave in appearance, but is in reality a coward."],["他連一句重話都不敢回，真是個窩囊廢。","約翰看起來很勇敢，但其實是個膽小鬼。"]],["briskly","'briskli","adv. 活泼地, 精神勃勃地",["Rub briskly with soap, and the stain will soon wash off.","Of those on the loud side, some people say they look like they're briskly working, while others say that they're just noisy."],["",""]],["shaped","ʃeipt","a. 成某种形状的, 制成一定形状的, 有某种形状的, 合适的, 计划好的, 有目标的\\n[医] 具形的, 形似的",["This fruit is shaped like an orange and tastes like a pineapple.","Her dark, almond-shaped eyes were remarkably beautiful."],["这种水果形状像橙子，味道像菠萝。","她那雙深色的杏仁眼非常美麗。"]],["fabrication",".fæbri'keiʃәn","n. 制造, 建造, 虚构的谎言\\n[医] 虚谈症",["I heard that a gay priest had been promoted to the rank of bishop, but it turned out to be a fabrication.","Even if it's not true, it's a brilliant fabrication."],["",""]],["fearless","'fiәlis","a. 大胆的, 勇敢的, 无畏的",["Tom doesn't seem to be as fearless as Mary seems to be.","Tom didn't seem to be as fearless as Mary seemed to be."],["",""]],["clockwise","'klɒkwaiz","a. 顺时针方向的\\nadv. 顺时针方向地",["Normal screws when turned clockwise will tighten and when turned anti-clockwise will loosen.","Rotating it clockwise will tighten it, while rotating it counterclockwise will loosen it."],["",""]],["croat","'krәuәt","n. 克罗地亚人；克罗地亚语",["We're a mixed group and I never knew who was a Serb, a Croat or a Muslim."],[""]],["microorganism",".maikrәu'ɒ:gәnizm","n. 微生物, 微小动植物\\n[化] 微生物",["Tom succeeded in culturing the new microorganism.","The alien microorganism grew faster."],["",""]],["georgian","'dʒɒ:dʒjәn","n. 乔治亚州人, 乔治亚人\\na. 乔治王时代的, 乔治王时代艺术风格的, 乔治亚的",["The languages that have been transliterated within the Tatoeba Project are Japanese, Chinese, Shanghainese, Georgian and Uzbek.","Georgian is probably one of the most difficult languages in the world."],["Tatoeba 计划获得了音译的语言为日语、汉语、上海话、格鲁吉亚语及乌兹别克语。",""]],["deceptive","di'septiv","a. 迷惑的, 虚伪的, 欺诈的",["Charm is deceptive, and beauty is fleeting; but a woman who fears the LORD is to be praised.","People place more trust in a deceptive image than in an article full of facts."],["",""]],["strut","strʌt","n. 高视阔步, 支柱, 压杆\\nvi. 趾高气扬地走, 肿胀\\nvt. 用支柱支撑, 炫耀",["You can't play chess with a pigeon. It'll just knock over the pieces, crap on the board, and strut around acting like it won.","\"What?\" asked Al-Sayib. \"You think that being on international TV means that you need to strut around in an Armani now?\""],["",""]],["dormant","'dɒ:mәnt","a. 睡眠状态的, 静止的\\n[医] 休眠的, 不活动的, 休止的",["The cobbles lie dormant beneath a layer of asphalt.","The scientists say the insects lay dormant, feeding on tree roots and slowly growing underground."],["",""]],["californian",".kæli'fɒ:njәn","n. 加利福尼亚州人\\na. 加利福尼亚的",["A Californian policeman pulled a car over and spoke to the driver.","A Californian police officer stopped a car at the side of the road and spoke to the driver."],["",""]],["destroyer","di'strɒiә","n. 破坏者, 消灭者, 起破坏作用的东西, 驱逐舰",["Shepard served on a destroyer during World War II.","Brahma is the creator, Vishnu the sustainer, and Shiva the destroyer."],["",""]],["vertically","'vetikli","adv. 垂直地",["Referring to short people as \"the vertically challenged\" is political correctness running wild.","Fold this sheet in half vertically and horizontally."],["",""]],["balancing","'bælәnsiŋ","[计] 平衡, 均衡, 结算\\n[经] 平衡, 结出余额",["The government will have much trouble balancing the needs of its younger population with the requirements of the old people.","Balancing work and family life requires careful time management."],["",""]],["glittering","","a. 闪闪发光的, 光辉灿烂的, 华丽的, 极好的, 光彩夺目的, 炫耀的",["Tall and striking, with a black and gold embroidered shirt and a glittering brown bonnet, she blends in easily with the trendy, after-work crowd.","The water between the moss-covered stones was glittering in the sun."],["她身材高挑，外形出眾，身穿黑金刺繡襯衫，頭戴閃亮的棕色軟帽，輕鬆地融入了時髦的下班人潮之中。",""]],["acclaimed","ə'kleɪmd","v. 欢呼（acclaim的过去式及过去分词）\\na. 受到赞扬的",["The audience acclaimed the actors for their performance.","Zynsky's widely acclaimed glass vessels are displayed in museums and at exhibitions around the world."],["",""]],["manpower","'mænpauә","n. 人力\\n[经] 人力",["Due to lack of manpower, we need more time than expected to handle this task.","If you use this modern equipment, it will save a lot of manpower."],["由于人力不足，我们需要比预期更多的时间来承担这项任务。","如果人們使用這些現代化的機器, 那將節省很多人力。"]],["toasted","təustid","v. 向…祝酒, 为…干杯( toast的过去式和过去分词 ); 烤火, 取暖, 使暖和",["The toaster-oven's timer rings. The fragrant smell of well toasted bread.","They raised their glasses and toasted to their success."],["",""]],["carnage","'kɑ:nidʒ","n. 大屠杀, 残杀",["Police encountered a scene of unspeakable carnage.","In his address, Macron spoke of the sacrifices of lives made a century ago in the four years of carnage in Europe."],["",""]],["relativity",".relә'tiviti","n. 有关系, 相关性, 相对性\\n[化] 相对性",["We associate the name of Einstein with the theory of relativity.","Einstein's theory of relativity is Greek to me."],["一提到愛因斯坦，我們就會想起相對論。","我完全看不懂爱因斯坦的相对性理论。"]],["juncture","'dʒʌŋktʃә","n. 接合, 连接, 接缝",["At this juncture, we're looking into every possibility.","I don't want to jump into any conclusions at this juncture."],["",""]],["coherence","kәu'hiәrәns","n. 黏合(性), 连贯性, 一致性\\n[化] 相干性",["Academic writing needs to show cohesion and coherence."],[""]],["rebirth",".ri:'bә:θ","n. 再生, 复活, 新生",["The egg is a universal symbol of life and rebirth.","Bennu is the ancient Egyptian deity linked with the Sun, creation and rebirth."],["",""]],["ration","'ræʃәn","n. 定额, 定量, 配给\\nvt. 配给, 定量供应",["Supplies of food were low and we had to ration out the little that was left.","In an address Sunday on state television, the president announced a 30-day plan to ration electricity."],["",""]],["birch","bә:tʃ","n. 桦树, 桦木, 桦条\\n[医] 桦",["Tom sawed two pieces off the trunk of a fallen birch, splitting them twice lengthwise with his axe.","This birch grove is a very romantic spot for a clandestine rendezvous."],["",""]],["antidote","'æntidәut","n. 解毒剂, 解毒药\\n[化] 解毒药",["The lab is trying to synthesize an antidote to treat the poisoning victims.","Nothing acts as a better antidote for romance than young men and women doing geometry together at eight o'clock every morning."],["",""]],["barbed","bɑ:bd","a. 有倒刺的",["The building is surrounded by a barbed wire fence.","What do you get if you cross a hedgehog and a snake? Five feet of barbed wire."],["",""]],["treatise","'tri:tis","n. 论文, 专著",["The military treatise authored by Sun Tzu is, to this day, required reading in military academies all across the world.","The definitive treatise was written by someone with no formal education in the subject."],["孫子所著的兵法，至今仍是各國軍事學院的必讀經典。",""]],["manufactured",",mænju'fæktʃәd","a. 制造的, 已制成的",["These cameras are manufactured in Japan.","These automobiles, for the most part, are manufactured in Japan."],["這些相機是在日本生產。",""]],["purge","pә:dʒ","n. 净化, 清除, 泻药\\nv. (使)净化, 清除, (使)通便\\n[计] 服务器文件删除实用程序",["One student says the purge is still going on in China and terror is widespread.","Sami wanted to purge the evil spirit our of Layla's body."],["",""]],["reactive","ri'æktiv","a. 反动的, 反应的\\n[医] 反应的",["Mary's realisation that she was gay plunged her into a reactive depression.","Retroactive jealousy is more toxic than reactive jealousy."],["",""]],["lunchtime","'lʌntʃtaim","n. 午餐时间",["At lunchtime today, our usual restaurant was closed because of a funeral in the family.","Tom looks forward to his lunchtime run, to break up the monotony of his working day."],["今天午餐時間，我們常去的飯館關門了，因為他們家在辦喪事。",""]],["quiver","'kwivә","n. 震动, 颤抖, 箭袋\\nvi. 颤抖, 振动\\nvt. 使颤动\\na. 敏捷的",["When he was about to shoot the thirtieth arrow, the archer realised that his quiver was empty.","In mathematics, a quiver is a directed graph."],["",""]],["duke","dju:k","n. 公爵",["Did the Duke of Zhou dream of the butterfly, or did the butterfly dream of the Duke of Zhou?","With his mother out of the way, Duke was able to proceed with his plan to embezzle the money from the company."],["究竟是周公夢到了蝴蝶，還是蝴蝶夢到了周公？",""]],["legitimize","li'dʒitimaiz","vt. 使…合法；立为嫡嗣",["Certain things are easier to legalize than legitimize.","Everything is fomented in the Algerian black laboratories to drive Kabylia into the chaos that would legitimize a state of siege."],["",""]],["lobe","lәub","n. 叶, 耳垂, 裂片\\n[医] 叶",["No student has ever complained of pains in the front lobe of the left side of the brain.","Our memories are stored in the temporal-lobe of the brain."],["",""]],["deteriorating","diˈtiəriəreitɪŋ","v. 恶化, 变坏( deteriorate的现在分词 )",["Tom's health has been deteriorating for some time.","In the deteriorating atmosphere, even seemingly trivial matters have caused a further degeneration of the situation."],["汤姆的病情这段时间一直在恶化。",""]],["ingenious","in'dʒi:njәs","a. 灵敏的, 精巧的, 聪明的",["Everyone's tricks are different; each differs in ingenious ways.","The ingenious man received the prestigious award for the first time."],["戲法人人會變，各有巧妙不同。",""]],["labyrinth","'læbәrinθ","n. 迷宫, 难解事物, 迷路\\n[化] 迷宫; 曲径",["I'd defeated the four sub-bosses and got through the damn long underground labyrinth.","Walking meditatively through the labyrinth was soothing."],["",""]],["intertwine",".intә'twain","v. (使)纠缠, (使)缠绕",["We live in harmony, like two trees whose roots intertwine.","Traditional Islamic beliefs shouldn't intertwine themselves with modern politics in Algeria."],["",""]],["vigilant","'vidʒilәnt","a. 警觉的, 警戒的, 警惕的\\n[法] 警醒的, 警戒的, 注意的",["Their faith teaches them to be vigilant against the Devil's influence and to resist his temptations.","Benedito knew that he needed to be vigilant and protect his herd from predators."],["",""]],["antelope","'æntilәup","n. 羚羊",["Despite its name, the wildebeest is an antelope, forms huge herds and can run at a speed of up to 70 km/h.","The creature had the head of an antelope and the body of a person."],["",""]],["calculator","'kælkjuleitә","n. 计算者, 计算器\\n[计] 计算器",["The calculator on the table is mine.","The batteries in my calculator are dead."],["桌上的计算器是我的。","我計算機的電池沒電了。"]],["birthplace","'bә:θpleis","n. 诞生地",["Every student was asked his or her name and birthplace.","He told me his age, his birthplace, his family, and so on."],["",""]],["appal","ә'pɒ:l","vt. 使惊骇, 使吓坏",["It constantly appalls me how stupid he can be."],[""]],["contagious","kәn'teidʒәs","a. 触染性的, 会蔓延的\\n[医] (接)触(传)染的",["The doctor told us that what Tom has isn't contagious.","The doctor said that what Tom has isn't contagious."],["",""]],["inspirational",".inspә'reiʃәnәl","a. 凭灵感的, 鼓舞人心的, 神感的",["Tom listens to inspirational CDs, and has a list of motivational quotes on the back of his bedroom door.","Tom wrote an inspirational quote on the chalkboard."],["",""]],["replay",".ri:'plei","vt. 重新比赛, 重演\\nn. 重赛",["I find myself being enthralled by her reaction each time I replay it.","After the goal was scored, the crowd turned to the giant TV to watch the action replay."],["",""]],["counterproductive",".kauntәprә'dʌktiv","a. 反生产的；使达不到预期目标的",["Vigilante violence against those of a different political persuasion is counterproductive.","Punching those who hold beliefs you oppose is counterproductive."],["",""]],["saliva","sә'laivә","n. 唾液, 唾沫, 涎\\n[医] 涎, 唾液",["I hate the taste of my saliva after eating chocolate.","The highly contagious virus was spread through blood and saliva."],["",""]],["disarmament","dis'ɑ:mәmәnt","n. 裁军\\n[法] 裁军, 解除军备",["The superpowers made significant progress in disarmament.","The Malian government will organize a disarmament of the MNLA."],["",""]],["utopian","ju:'tәupiәn","a. 乌托邦的, 空想社会主义的\\nn. 理想社会主义者",["To live in a perfect world is just a utopian dream.","Fadil had utopian ideas as to how an ideal family life should be."],["",""]],["autobiographical","ɔ:tәjbaiә'^ræfik(ә)l","a. 自传的, 自传体的",["\"Tom and Mary - A Tragedy in Five Acts\" is the title of Mary's latest autobiographical work.","The novel has many autobiographical elements from the author's own life."],["",""]],["enlighten","in'laitn","vt. 教育, 启发, 启蒙, 开导, 教导",["There is only one way to enlighten the world: to enlighten oneself.","I'm sure you'll soon be able to enlighten us all as to the real state of affairs."],["",""]],["sushi","'su:ʃi","n. 寿司（生鱼片冷饭团）",["Hanako and Taro went to eat some sushi.","I've just eaten some sushi and drunk a beer."],["花子和太郎去吃了寿司。","我剛才吃了壽司喝了啤酒。"]],["headphone","'hedfәun","n. 戴在头上的收话器, 耳机\\n[电] 头载数话器",["Tom has headphone hair from playing videogames all the time.","Stefan wore a wireless headphone when he goes to the gym."],["",""]],["sporadic","spәu'rædik","a. 偶尔发生的, 零星发生的, 分散的\\n[医] 散在的, 散发的",["As a stranger in a strange land, the sporadic solicitude from friends can be especially heart-warming.","Apart from hearing sporadic gunfire, the day was pretty quiet."],["在異鄉生活，偶爾收到朋友的關懷讓人倍感溫暖。",""]],["sufferer","'sʌfәrә","n. 受难者, 被害者, 患者\\n[法] 受害者, 受难者",["The sufferer of a cold may have spread the virus even before they noticed any symptoms.","Treatment in those days consisted of easing pain and making the sufferer as comfortable as possible."],["",""]],["totalitarian",".tәutæli'tєәriәn","a. 极权主义的\\nn. 极权主义者",["The totalitarian era is passing, its old ideas blown away like leaves from an ancient, lifeless tree.","Parents must be totalitarian dictators for part of their child's life."],["",""]],["troupe","tru:p","n. 团, 班, 一伙\\nvi. 巡回演出",["The troupe is enthralling audiences around the country with their energetic performances.","He's working in a troupe right now."],["",""]],["veterinarian",".vetәri'nєәriәn","n. 兽医\\n[医] 兽医",["Tom wanted to become a veterinarian.","Tom's youngest son wants to be a veterinarian."],["那时汤姆相当一个兽医。","汤姆的小儿子要当兽医。"]],["contrasting","kənˈtrɑ:stɪŋ","v. （靠近或作比较时）显出明显的差异, 形成对比( contrast的现在分词 ); 对比, 对照",["The explanation below was achieved by comparing and contrasting a variety of different theories.","It's possible for us to have contrasting opinions."],["下面的解釋是通過比較和對比各種不同的理論。",""]],["stiffness","'stifnis","n. 坚硬, 呆板, 刻板\\n[医] 强直, 僵硬",["Tom felt the stiffness in his joints as he stood up after sitting in the same position for a long time.","She stretched to relieve the stiffness in her back."],["",""]],["blockade","blɒ'keid","n. 阻塞\\nvt. 封锁",["The blockade by Britain and the other allies was very successful.","Israel's blockade on Gaza has cut off Palestinians from the rest of the world."],["",""]],["outcry","'autkrai","n. 尖叫, 倒彩, 强烈抗议, 喊价\\nvi. 喊叫\\nvt. 叫得比...响",["The sinking of the RMS Lusitania caused an international outcry.","Absent sustained and vociferous public outcry, President Barack Obama's call for a bipartisan budget deal may fall on deaf ears."],["",""]],["conveniently","","a. 方便, 合宜",["This hotel is conveniently located in terms of public transportation.","This house is conveniently situated but the trouble is that it is too small for my large family."],["這間酒店的交通位置很方便。",""]],["oregano","ɔ:'re^әnәu, ә-","n. 〈植〉牛至",["Basil, sage, rosemary, thyme and oregano are popular herbs.","This pizza recipe includes hard-boiled eggs, tomatoes and oregano."],["",""]],["stewardship","'stju:wәdʃip","n. steward的职务, 管理工作",["The organization promotes responsible stewardship of natural resources.","The board thanked him for his years of faithful stewardship over the charity's finances."],["",""]],["shin","ʃin","n. 胫骨\\nv. 攀, 爬",["The Hikari runs between Tokyo and Shin-Osaka in three hours and ten minutes.","OK. I'll go to Shin-Osaka station's shinkansen exit."],["",""]],["unavoidable",".ʌnә'vɒidәbl","a. 不可避免的, 不得已的, 不能作废的\\n[医] 难免的",["What happened here was unavoidable.","He had to part from her owing to unavoidable circumstances many years ago."],["發生這事是免不了的。",""]],["prosthesis","'prɔsθi:sis","n. 弥补, 添字首音",["A cochlear implant consists of a prosthesis in the internal ear which allows a deaf person to hear.","I want to say: \"Thanks for the trip to Afghanistan and for my prosthesis!\""],["",""]],["pore","pɒ:","n. 毛孔, 小孔, 气孔\\nvi. 专心阅读, 细想, 钻研, 沉思, 注视\\nvt. 使注视得",["A possible explanation would be the formation of pore-like structures.","Experts will now pore over the fine print of the contract."],["",""]],["surfer","'sә:fә","n. 冲浪运动员",["A surfer was eaten by a shark in Australia.","The surfer tried to ride the crest of the wave."],["",""]],["reunification",",ri:ju:nifi'keiʃәn,ri:,ju:-","n. 使重新统一, 使重新团结",["A peaceful reunification of Taiwan with China has become virtually impossible.","Israel strongly argued against the idea of German reunification."],["",""]],["lemonade",".lemә'neid","n. 柠檬水\\n[医] 柠檬水",["Sami was drinking all the lemonade at the restaurant.","Dad used to always make this kind of lemonade for you."],["",""]],["milieu","'mi:ljә:","n. 周围, 社会环境, 环境, 表达的手法\\n[医] 环境",["Maybe in another universe, beings are like clouds or shadows in a cloudy or shadowy milieu...","The quiet suburban neighborhood provides the perfect milieu for raising a family."],["",""]],["rooster","'ru:stә","n. 公鸡, 栖息的鸟\\n[机] 炉篦",["There are about seventy hens in the henhouse, but only one rooster.","Yesterday I went to Denizli and I saw a rooster near the coop."],["",""]],["procurement","prә'kjuәmәnt","n. 获得\\n[经] 采购",["We are trying to clarify your future procurement requirements.","The military's procurement process was found to favor the vice-president's company."],["",""]],["topical","'tɒpikl","a. 论题的, 题目的, 时事问题的, 局部的\\n[医] 局部的",["This is a topical cream, not a toothpaste, so I hope your gums are free of hemorrhoids.","The 5% topical solution was ineffective at reducing eczema outbreaks."],["",""]],["encode","in'kәud","vt. 把(电文、情报等)译成密码\\n[计] 编码",["Make sure you encode that file in the right format.","Missions encode their scientific data onto the electromagnetic signals to send back to Earth."],["",""]],["ligament","'ligәmәnt","n. 结带, 纽带, 韧带\\n[医] 韧带",["If she's not careful she'll tear a ligament doing that.","Have you ever had a pulled ligament? It hurts like hell."],["",""]],["unconditional",".ʌnkәn'diʃәnl","a. 无条件的, 无限制的, 绝对的\\n[经] 无条件的, 无保留的",["Yanni and Rima's marriage is based on unconditional love.","Loving you has taught me the true meaning of unconditional love and selflessness."],["",""]],["plop","plɒp","n. 扑通声, 掉下\\nadv. 扑通一声地\\nvt. 把...沉重地放下\\nvi. 扑通落下",["We hear the plop of a frog jumping into the canal.","Our best pictures of the human mind suggest that we don't plop our mental activities into single, ordered boxes."],["",""]],["superstition",".sju:pә'stiʃәn","n. 迷信\\n[法] 迷信",["Religion is just organised superstition with a bestseller.","Such a ridiculous superstition no longer exists."],["宗教不過是有組織的迷信加上一本暢銷書。","這種荒謬的迷信已不復存在了。"]],["supremacy","sju'premәsi","n. 至高无上, 霸权地位, 优势, 至上\\n[法] 至高权力, 无上权力, 霸权",["The Mongol supremacy over Japanese sumo is totally due to the presence of two of its representatives at the highest rank.","Banning religious symbols in a government that gets days off for several Christian holidays is just Christian supremacy."],["",""]],["victorious","vik'tɔ:riәs","a. 胜利的, 得胜的, 战胜的",["Mary emerged victorious from countless tournaments.","The victorious country dictated the terms of peace to the defeated country."],["",""]],["doc","","[计] 通信部, 数字输出控制, 文档\\n[医] 脱氧皮质酮",["It's a great pleasure for Snow White to have a talk with Doc at morning coffee.","My uncle's prosthetic leg is causing him trouble lately, so he's going to talk to his doc about replacing it with a newer model."],["",""]],["rave","reiv","n. 狂吼, 狂暴\\nv. 愤怒地说, 叫嚷, 咆哮",["This restaurant lives up to all the rave reviews it got.","Surprisingly, Gustavo's action movie received rave reviews from critics."],["",""]],["hugely","'hju:dʒli","adv. 巨大地, 非常地",["The austerity measures that many city governments have implemented are hugely unpopular.","His warm way with people had made him hugely popular."],["",""]],["spaceship","'speisʃip","n. 宇宙飞船",["It is rumoured that a spaceship has been seen near Shanghai.","Tom claims he saw some aliens getting out of a spaceship."],["谣传一架宇宙飞船在上海附近被见到了。",""]],["hazy","'heizi","a. 朦胧的, 模糊的, 烟雾弥漫的",["A hazy cloud called a coma surrounds the comet's nucleus.","The mountains, like giants sleeping under blankets of rock, rested on the hazy horizon."],["",""]],["swan","swɒn","n. 天鹅, 天鹅星座, 有才华的诗人\\nvi. 闲荡, 蜿蜒而行",["Henrietta Swan Leavitt discovered the relation between the luminosity and the period of Cepheid variable stars.","One way of committing suicide is by taking a swan dive off a tall building."],["",""]],["boulevard","'bu:lәvɑ:d","n. 林荫大道",["I was in hot pursuit of the scooter when I cycled down the boulevard.","We are at the boulevard St. Michel."],["",""]],["smallpox","'smɒ:lpɒks","n. 天花\\n[医] 天花, 痘疮",["They are struggling with the goal of wiping out smallpox.","Everybody is immune to smallpox nowadays."],["他们奋斗的目标是消灭天花。","現今每個人都對天花免疫了。"]],["squid","skwid","n. 枪乌贼, 鱿鱼, 反潜水雷发射装置\\n[电] 超导量子干涉元件",["At the restaurant, do not order fried squid.","Arroz negro tastes inky because it's made with squid ink."],["当在餐馆里时，不能点炒鱿鱼。",""]],["groin","^rɔin","n. 腹股沟, 交叉拱\\n[医] 腹股沟",["Getting kicked in the groin is painful.","At least two Americans have shot themselves in the groin this year."],["被踢襠是很痛的。",""]],["stench","stentʃ","n. 恶臭, 臭气\\nv. (使)发恶臭",["The stench of rotting flesh overwhelmed us as we entered the room.","The stench of censorship will spell the end of the oligarchy."],["",""]],["sabotage","'sæbәtɑ:ʒ","n. 怠工, 破坏活动, 破坏\\nvi. 从事破坏活动\\nvt. 妨害, 破坏",["Ziri couldn't believe that Rima teamed up with his sister, Skura, to sabotage his project.","Damiano revealed that that was an act of sabotage."],["",""]],["solvent","'sɒlvәnt","n. 溶剂\\na. 有偿付能力的, 有溶解力的",["Vaporise the solvent from the liquid. What's left is the perfume component and a lump of vegetable wax.","The states that keep the government solvent are the ones where taxpayers contribute more than they get back."],["",""]],["thematic","θi:'mætik","a. 题目的, 主题的, 主旋律的",["The thematic and motivic works of Mozart and Schubert are basically quite similar."],[""]],["crutch","krʌtʃ","n. 拐杖, 支撑, 依靠\\nvt. 支撑",["You're using that dictionary as a crutch. You don't really need it.","Mennad was using Baya as a crutch. She supported him through everything."],["",""]],["dashboard","'dæʃbɒ:d","n. 仪表板, 挡泥板",["Tom left his sunglasses on the dashboard of my car.","You'll find the 'Ban User' setting in your admin dashboard."],["汤姆把他的太阳镜留在我的车的仪表板上了。",""]],["insensitive","in'sensitiv","a. 对...没有感觉的, 感觉迟钝的\\n[医] 感觉迟钝的",["I dislike Chris because he is very rude and insensitive.","Soles of the feet are insensitive to heat and cold."],["",""]],["correctness","","[计] 正确性\\n[经] 正确性",["Discuss whether the idea of political correctness is beneficial or harmful.","Referring to short people as \"the vertically challenged\" is political correctness running wild."],["",""]],["puffy","'pʌfi","a. 胀大的, 肥胖的, 喘气的, 一阵阵吹的\\n[医] 虚肿的, 浮肿的",["Have you been crying all night? Your eyes are all puffy.","Not sleeping for three days straight had left her puffy-eyed and wan."],["",""]],["ingenuity",".indʒi'nju:iti","n. 心灵手巧, 精巧, 精巧设计",["The talented finance minister's ingenuity has helped his bankrupt nation to get out of the red.","It is nothing that a little persistence and ingenuity can't overcome."],["",""]],["tally","'tæli","n. 符木, 记账, 得分, 比分, 计数器, 标签, 符合, 对应物\\nvt. 记录, 点数, 计算, 加标签于, 使符合\\nvi. 记…",["It's the end of the quiz! Time to tally up the scores.","What you're now saying doesn't tally with what you said before."],["",""]],["cascade","kæ'skeid","n. 小瀑布, 瀑布状物\\nvi. 成瀑布落下\\n[计] 层叠, 级联",["As this is a cascade with multiple layers, it shouldn't be surprising that it's slow.","A trophic cascade led to an increase in livestock attacks as predators sought out alternative sources of food."],["因为这是一个有好几层的瀑布，所以速度慢也不会让人惊讶。",""]],["rescuer","'reskjuә","n. 救助者",["Rodrigo needs to perform his duty as a rescuer.","Rodrigo explained to Rima his duty as a rescuer."],["",""]],["geographically","","[计] 自通地",["Algeria and Morocco are geographically and culturally like fraternal twins.","Geographically and economically, Algeria is an African giant."],["",""]],["baltic","'bɒ:ltik","a. 波罗的海的",["The Baltic Sea is one of the most popular national travel destinations for Germans.","The whole Baltic coast of Poland is made up of sandy beaches."],["",""]],["foreseeable","'fɒ:'si:әbl","a. 可预知的, 能预测的\\n[法] 可预见的, 可预料的",["I have read your letter closely, and your situation seems very typical and foreseeable in a relationship.","This development was not foreseeable; it simply surprised us."],["",""]],["conscientious",".kɒnʃi'enʃәs","a. 有责任心的, 负责的, 本着良心的\\n[法] 凭良心做的, 有道德感的",["Though Alfred is scrupulous in fulfilling his duties at work, he is less conscientious about his obligations at home.","At the end, the conscientious girl gave up with her English homework, and started to revise her list of Ainu words."],["",""]],["charisma","kә'rizmә","n. 非凡的领导力, 神秘的个人魅力, 神授的能力",["The stage charisma of drag performers compels audiences to reconsider their own stereotypes.","The attractiveness of his charisma made other people listen."],["反串秀者的舞台魅力使觀眾不禁重新審視自己的刻板印象。",""]],["diaspora","dai'æspәrә","n. 犹太人的离散, 离散的犹太人",["There is a very large Gujarati diaspora in Canada.","The Kabyle diaspora is doing everything to help Kabylia."],["",""]],["baptism","'bæptizm","n. 浸礼, 洗礼",["The deluge was a notable first experiment in baptism which washed away the sins (and sinners) of the world.","Many Pharisees and Sadducees came to the baptism of John the Baptist."],["",""]],["subtitle","'sʌb.taitl","n. 副标题",["This week I've watched foreign car-action movies with subtitles for three days in a row."],[""]],["composting","'kɔmpɔstiŋ","堆制肥料",["Teach the importance of recycling and composting to reduce waste.","Tom put in his will that he wanted human composting as his burial method."],["",""]],["threatened","'θretənd","a. 受到威胁的\\nv. 威胁(threaten的过去分词)",["The man with the gun threatened to kill Tom's dog.","The protesters threatened to stomp on the banners left by their opposition."],["持槍男子揚言要殺死湯姆的狗。","抗議者威脅要踐踏反對者留下的橫幅。"]],["optimize","'ɒptimaiz","vt. 使完美, 使完善, 充分利用, 乐观地对待, 优化\\nvi. 持乐观态度\\n[计] 优化",["If human life is convex, we can optimize it.","Basically, he's using algorithms to optimize data."],["如果人生是凸的，那我们可以优化它。",""]],["retribution",".retri'bju:ʃәn","n. 报应, 惩罚, 报酬\\n[法] 惩罚, 报应, 报答",["You can make your choice freely without fear of retribution.","But retribution was at hand, and the wicked city met with sudden destruction."],["",""]],["budding","'bʌdiŋ","a. 萌芽的, 发育期的, 初露头角的\\nn. 发芽",["The budding of the peach tree is very beautiful.","The cold weather may keep the plants from budding."],["正在開花桃樹很美。",""]],["parochial","pә'rәukiәl","a. 教区的, 地方性的, 目光偏狭的",["He is a member of the parochial board.","His parents wanted him to have a Catholic education so they sent him to parochial school."],["他是教區委員會的成員。",""]],["stony","'stәuni","a. 多石的, 无情的",["When he was asked why he had done that, he maintained a stony silence.","He had a stony face, etched by time."],["",""]],["caucasian","kɒ:'keiziәn","n. 高加索人, 白种人\\na. 高加索的, 白种人的",["Thousands of Native American children were placed in Caucasian foster homes.","You think that she is strange because she is not just Caucasian."],["",""]],["totality","'tәutæliti","n. 全体, 总数, 全食",["The task of philosophy is to recover the totality obscured by the selection.","The magnitude of a solar eclipse depends on how close you are to the path of totality."],["",""]],["bloodshed","'blʌdʃed","n. 流血",["The parties to the conflict must agree upon measures to end the bloodshed.","Cold War is a misnomer cause the bloodshed in the third world was horrendous."],["",""]],["decry","di'krai","vt. 反对, 责难, 诽谤, 诋毁",["Environmentalists decry what they say are Bolsonaro's anti-environment stance in favor of oil, mineral, logging and ranching interests."],[""]],["apprehend",".æpri'hend","vt. 理解, 忧虑, 逮捕\\nvi. 担心, 理解",["The police expect to apprehend the robber before nightfall.","I sometimes apprehend that there will be some difficulty."],["",""]],["fennel","'fenәl","n. 茴香\\n[化] 茴香",["Chewing on fennel seeds can keep your breath fresh.","That vegan restaurant is famous for its creative use of fennel."],["",""]],["touring","'tuәriŋ","n. 游览\\na. 游览的",["I'm looking forward to touring bookstores in the US.","To me, he seems too young to be touring the world on his own."],["",""]],["shaman","'ʃæmәn","n. 萨满教巫医\\n[法] 巫师",["The chieftain is their leader, but the shaman is the one who actually calls the shots.","The shaman performed the ritual rain dance."],["",""]],["coupling","'kʌpliŋ","n. 联结, 结合, 耦合\\n[计] 耦合",["The coupling connects the two machines."],["聯結器連接兩台機器。"]],["shawl","ʃɒ:l","n. 披肩, 围巾\\nvt. 用披肩裹",["Currently, two thirds of Turkish women cover their head with a shawl.","I was sent a video showing a sweet looking baby being unravelled from it's shawl."],["",""]],["predominant","pri'dɒminәnt","a. 占主导地位的, 卓越的\\n[法] 占优势的, 支配其他的, 主要的",["The predominant belief since the dissolution of the Soviet Union has been that another world is not possible.","You could say that France is the predominant cultural power in Europe."],["",""]],["tyrant","'taiәrәnt","n. 暴君\\n[法] 专制君主, 暴君, 压制他人者",["The depravity of the king's deeds led the people to believe he was nothing more than a tyrant that needed to be overthrown.","Today a child acting like a king, tomorrow a tyrant."],["国王的卑劣行为致使人们相信他只是个该被推翻的暴君。",""]],["reliably","ri'laiәbli","adv. 可靠地, 可信赖地",["In order to bring about order in this chaos, we need a reliably functioning control mechanism.","As of yet, there is no method that can reliably cure all tumors."],["",""]],["receiving","ri'si:viŋ","[计] 接收",["Living away from family, receiving, now and then, friends' concern can be particularly touching.","Intersex children are the only children receiving gender reassignment surgery, and the right supports it in their case, unlike the left."],["在異鄉生活，偶爾收到朋友的關懷讓人倍感溫暖。","陰陽人兒童是唯一接受變性手術的兒童。與左派不同，右派支持他們接受手術。"]],["peddle","'pedl","vi. 挑卖, 沿街叫卖, 游荡, 闲混\\nvt. 叫卖, 兜售, 散播",["Newspapers peddle disaster scenarios."],[""]],["depletion","di'pli:ʃәn","n. 消耗, 耗尽, 放血\\n[医] 排除, 缺失(液体), 衰竭[状态](由于缺液)",["The best refutation of the imaginary Malthusian laws of \"land depletion\" is the practice of Soviet collective farming.","Unsustainable fishing on coral reef areas can lead to the depletion of key reef species in many locations."],["對馬爾薩斯虛構的「土地耗盡」定律最有力的反駁，是蘇聯集體農場的時間。",""]],["transcendent","træn'sendәnt","a. 卓越的, 出类拔萃的, 超常的\\nn. 卓越的人, 超绝物",["Often in the darkest of times, artists can be at their most transcendent.","You believe that love is transcendent and eternal."],["",""]],["tremor","'tremә","n. 震动, 颤动\\n[医] 震颤",["I felt a small tremor, but rather than an earthquake, it was just a truck driving by.","There was a violent tremor during the night, so I was scared and couldn't sleep very well."],["",""]],["sinking","'siŋkiŋ","n. 沉没, 降低, 衰颓感\\n[法] 偿还债务",["The evening sun is sinking in the west.","They fled the doomed company like rats deserting a sinking ship."],["夕阳西下。",""]],["worrisome","'wʌrisәm","a. 令人烦恼的, 麻烦的, 劳碌命的",["Lorenzo became a very worrisome man in his old age.","The greatest danger in life is becoming too worrisome."],["",""]],["solidly","","adv. 坚硬地；坚固地；团结一致地",["You can see that the house is solidly built.","Islam is solidly established in Kabylie."],["",""]],["spoken","'spәukәn","a. 口头讲的, 口语的\\nspeak的过去分词",["The position requires applicants to be skilled in spoken English.","When Mary was spoken to by a stranger, she was at a loss for words."],["这份职位要求应征者有一定的英语口语表达能力。","当一个陌生人来和玛丽说话时，她不知道该说什么了。"]],["unheard",".ʌn'hә:d","a. 没有被听到的, 未予倾听的, 未予考虑的",["Declaring war after a surprise attack is to be expected, but killing over ten thousand non-combatants with a bomb is something unheard of.","Heard melodies are sweet, but those unheard are sweeter."],["被突襲後宣告戰爭是可以預想的，但用炸彈屠殺萬人以上的平民卻是前所未聞的。",""]],["occupancy","'ɒkjupәnsi","n. 占有, 居住, 占用\\n[法] 占据, 据有, 占用",["Hotel guests may be charged a \"room occupancy tax\".","The occupancy rate in hotels is almost fifty percent."],["",""]],["planter","'plæntә","n. 种植者, 耕作者, 种植机, 花盆",["Sami was sitting on a planter, waiting for Layla to come pick him up.","Jelle Van Loon, of the International Maize and Wheat Improvement Center, demonstrates a prototype hand planter."],["",""]],["stormy","'stɒ:mi","a. 暴风雨的, 粗暴的, 激烈的",["I think it's dangerous to climb a mountain on a day when it's stormy.","It was a stormy day, and the snow was falling fast."],["我認為在有風暴的時候裡登山很危險。","这天刮着暴风雪，雪下得很大。"]],["subjectivity",",sʌbdʒek'tivәti","n. 主观, 主观性\\n[医] 主观性",["Philosophy is the self-correction by consciousness of its own initial excess of subjectivity.","There is nothing objective that can explain subjectivity."],["",""]],["fastball","'fɑ:stbɔ:l","n. [棒](投手投出的)快球",["I'll throw a fastball."],[""]],["knack","næk","n. 熟练技术, 巧妙手法, 诀窍\\n[化] 窍门",["She has a real knack for getting people to do what she wants.","I am not an artist. I never had the knack for it."],["她真的有本事让别人做她想做的事。","我不是藝術家，我一點那方面的天賦都沒有。"]],["instructive","in'strʌktiv","a. 有益的, 增进知识的",["This book is not only more instructive but more interesting than that book.","In my opinion, Tatoeba is a pleasant and instructive pastime."],["",""]],["languish","'læŋgwiʃ","vi. 憔悴, 凋萎, 苦思",["She notes thousands of women, men and children languish in prolonged arbitrary detention.","He left his brother to languish behind bars."],["",""]],["serpent","'sә:pәnt","n. 巨蛇座, 蛇, 蛇形管, 狡猾的人",["It had the head of a woman, the body of a lion, the wings of a bird, and the tail of a serpent.","From above the river looks like a serpent slithering through the jungle."],["它长着女人的头、狮子的身体、一双羽翅以及蛇尾巴。",""]],["fiddle","'fidl","n. 小提琴, 提琴类乐器\\nvt. 虚度时光, 拉小提琴\\nvi. 拉小提琴, (无目的地)拨弄, 瞎搞",["Tom wants to be able to play the fiddle as well as Mary.","He's definitely the right guy for the job. Let him fiddle with a computer and he perks right up."],["",""]],["commotion","kә'mәuʃәn","n. 骚动, 暴乱\\n[医] 震荡",["Tom could hear a commotion in front of his house, so he went outside to see what was happening.","I really don't understand what all the commotion is about."],["",""]],["petite","pә'tit","a. 小的, 次要的, 小个子的, 娇小玲珑的, 娇小的",["Akane Oda got her start in a petite miss beauty contest.","The French call orgasms \"la petite mort\" (the little death)."],["",""]],["frenchman","'frentʃmәn","n. 法国人",["He is not an American but a Frenchman.","I could tell from his accent that he was a Frenchman."],["他不是美國人，是法國人。",""]],["stretcher","'stretʃә","n. 担架, 延伸器\\n[医] 担架",["Sir, we need to stabilize your fracture before transferring you to the stretcher.","The stretcher was ready, and he helped lift her on."],["",""]],["bask","bɑ:sk","vi. 晒太阳, 感到舒适",["The red-eared slider turtles bask in the sun at the University of California Los Angeles Mildred E. Mathias Botanical Garden.","William loves to bask in the warm sunshine during his afternoon walks."],["",""]],["animosity",".æni'mɒsiti","n. 仇恨, 憎恶, 敌意",["There is no natural animosity between Arab and Jewish children.","You were trying to draw an extremely tenuous connection between cultures of two cities known for their animosity."],["",""]],["predictably","","adv. 可预言地",["The man noticed the enthusiastic shill as he passed by on the street, and decided to avoid the predictably rigged shell game.","Predictably, when she is too hungry to think and her mind has run out of glucose, she makes me pick the restaurant."],["",""]],["airwaves","'eәweivz","电视广播",["Then, as the newsreader began a live interview, the channel was pulled from the airwaves."],[""]],["incomprehensible","in.kɒmpri'hensәbl","a. 不能理解的, 费解的, 无限的",["It is incomprehensible to us that a country with that level of technology would even think of making an automobile.","It's absolutely incomprehensible how this hotel has four stars."],["只有那样技术的国家，还想要做汽车，我们十分无法理解。","这家酒店怎么会是四星酒店，真是令人无法理解。"]],["easel","'i:zәl","n. 画架, 黑板架",["No artist's studio is complete without an unfinished painting resting on an easel.","The same half-finished painting sat on the artist's easel for years."],["",""]],["flawless","'flɒ:lis","a. 无瑕疵的, 无缺点的\\n[化] 无裂纹的; 无裂缝的",["The melody's execution was flawless.","Nothing in the world is flawless and perfect."],["这段旋律的演绎真是完美无瑕。","世界上没有十全十美的东西。"]],["staunch","stɒ:ntʃ","vt. 止住, 止血\\na. 坚固的, 坚强的, 忠实的, 忠诚的, 不透水的",["As a staunch pacifist, she abhors all forms of violence.","In order to staunch the flow of blood, apply direct pressure to the wound."],["",""]],["glucose","'glu:kәus","n. 葡萄糖\\n[化] 葡萄糖; 右旋糖; 葡糖(用于复合词中)",["The nurse gave me a glucose injection.","Whoever lost a bag with a glucose meter inside, contact this address."],["护士给我打了葡萄糖。",""]],["spasm","'spæzm","n. 痉挛, 抽搐, 发作\\n[医] 痉挛",["A spasm, violent and uncontrollable, stiffened every muscle in his body.","I feel a sort of spasm in my left leg."],["",""]],["streamline","'stri:mlain","n. 流线, 流线型\\nvt. 使成流线型, 使合理化",["The mayor of New York made an effort to streamline municipal government.","The uniform of a swimmer has to be streamline so it helps them cut through the water. It makes them faster."],["",""]],["staging","'steidʒiŋ","n. 脚手架, 上演, 公共马车业\\n[计] 登台",["Public opinion surveys suggest most Japanese residents are opposed to staging the Games.","Mexico's Zapatista rebels are staging a three-day public party in the southern Chiapas state to revive the cause of indigenous rights."],["",""]],["squander","'skwɒndә","vt. 浪费, 使分散\\nvi. 浪费, 漂泊, 四散",["First you squander your health to acquire money; then your money to get your health back.","Do not squander time. That's the stuff life is made of."],["",""]],["discontinue",".diskәn'tinju:","vi. 中断, 终止, 停止\\nvt. 使中止",["McDonald's will discontinue the use of boneless lean beef trimmings in their hamburgers.","It's important not to change or discontinue medication without seeking medical advice."],["",""]],["beggar","'begә","n. 乞丐\\nvt. 使贫穷, 使成乞丐",["He is rich yet he lives like a beggar.","The beggar on the street asks: \"Do you have any extra euros?\""],["他很富有，但活得像个乞丐。","街上的乞丐问：“你还有多余的钱吗？”"]],["ipod","","n. 苹果公司音乐播放器",["Sami doesn't even know what color Layla's iPod is.","Sami reported Layla to the principal for stealing his iPod."],["",""]],["medic","'medik","n. 苜蓿属植物, 医师, 医科学生",["The medic knew that it was a carcinogenic substance but didn't inform the authorities.","The medic ripped open Tom's shirt and took a look at the wound."],["",""]],["intestine","in'testin","a. 内部的, 国内的\\nn. 肠",["Bacterial colonization of the intestine occurs after birth.","The walls of the small intestine are like a sieve."],["",""]],["etiquette","eti'ket","n. 礼仪, 礼节, 成规\\n[法] 规则, 成规, 礼节",["Nearly lost Chinese etiquette terms.","Keep your Japanese etiquette for yourself. I'm just a visitor in Japan."],["几近失传的中华礼仪用语。",""]],["segregated","","a. 被分离的, 被隔离的, 实行种族隔离政策的, 偏析的",["The magicians were segregated from the prison population and shot promptly at dawn.","Yanni lives a segregated life in a lofty villa in Algiers."],["",""]],["tripod","'traipɒd","n. 三脚桌, 三脚架\\n[医] 三脚架, 三脚台",["Use the apparatus only with the cart, tripod, bracket or table specified by the manufacturer, or sold with the apparatus.","Luis had to pay back the expensive tripod with interest."],["",""]],["prematurely","'premətʃə(r)lɪ","adv. 过早地, 贸然地",["Mary was born prematurely during a 16 hour transcontinental flight.","He sometimes became impatient of the extreme fear which she expressed of their attachment being prematurely discovered."],["玛丽是在16小时跨大陆飞行中早产出生的。",""]],["caress","kә'res","n. 爱抚, 拥抱\\nvt. 爱抚, 抱, 宠爱",["In Russian, the words for \"caress, endearment\" and \"least weasel\" are homonymous and possibly related etymologically.","A caress, a word, an image, each life experience leaves a mark on the brain."],["",""]],["shutdown","'ʃʌtdaun","n. 关门, 停工, 停机\\n[经] 停工",["Her husband has been able to work on his farm despite the shutdown.","Zoos are experiencing declined revenues during the coronavirus shutdown."],["",""]],["miraculously","","adv. 超自然, 非凡, 不可思议, 令人惊叹, 象奇迹一样, 奇迹般, 能创造奇迹",["Missing for years, the document miraculously came to light the other day.","Miraculously, all the passengers managed to leave the blazing plane in less than three minutes."],["",""]],["fruitful","'fru:tful","a. 结果实的, 多实的, 产量多的",["Their stay in Germany for a year was very fruitful.","Their year-long stay in Germany was very fruitful."],["",""]],["medicinal","me'disinәl","a. 药用的, 药的, 有益的\\n[医] 药用的, 医药的, 医治的",["Ancient Germanic tribes used medicinal herbs in their attempts to cure diseases.","In the botanical garden, there are many aromatic and medicinal herbs."],["",""]],["wicker","'wikә","n. 柳条\\na. 柳条编的",["Arjun passed by the shop that sold wicker baskets.","We mostly see wicker in small items like baskets, but larger furniture like chairs or tables can also be made using the same weaving techniques."],["",""]],["ketchup","'ketʃәp","n. 蕃茄酱",["A kilo of ketchup is equivalent to two kilos of tomatoes.","Tom asked me if I wanted some ketchup on my hamburger."],["一公斤的番茄酱等于两公斤的西红柿。",""]],["impatiently","","adv. 不耐烦, 忍受不了, 急躁, [表]急欲, 急切",["Her eyes blazed at me, and she tapped the ground impatiently with her foot.","All day long today I have been waiting impatiently for you."],["",""]],["matchup","'mætʃ,ʌp","n. 火柴, 比赛, 竞赛, 匹配, (足球, 捧球, 蓝球)比赛\\nv. 相配, 相称, 比赛, 相比, 匹配",["Who would win in this hypothetical matchup?"],[""]],["restroom","'restru:m","n. 洗手间；休息室；更衣室；厕所",["He couldn't find the restroom, so he had to ask the shopkeeper for directions.","She just came back from the restroom."],["他找不到洗手間，只好向店員詢問方向。","她剛從洗手間回來。"]],["crushing","'krʌʃiŋ","a. 碾碎的, 压倒的\\n[化] 粗碎; 压碎; 破碎",["Woe to the braggart parasite. The crushing stone is falling overhead.","Ziri yelled out that Walid was crushing the bones of his hand."],["",""]],["immature",".imә'tjuә","a. 不成熟的, 未完全发育的, 粗糙的\\n[医] 未成熟的",["He was so immature, he couldn't resist the temptation.","Recalling his own youth, he says teenagers are often immature hooligans."],["",""]],["thirds","","n. [法]归寡妇所得的亡夫遗产的三分之一；[商]（商品的）三等品",["Two thirds of the employees of this company are engineers.","I have spent more than two-thirds, if not all, of the money for a new car."],["这个公司三分之二的雇员是工程师。",""]],["dishwasher","'diʃwɒʃә","n. 洗碗机, 洗碗工",["Sami put the rusty fork in the dishwasher.","I got a rash on my hands from dishwasher detergent."],["薩米將生鏽的叉子放進了洗碗機。",""]],["harshly","'hɑ:ʃli","adv. 粗糙地, 粗暴地, 刺耳地",["The study found that African-American students were disciplined more often and more harshly than other students.","The waiting-maid commanded her harshly to take off her royal robes, and to put on her common ones."],["",""]],["junkie","'dʒʌŋki","n. 有毒瘾者, 废旧品商人",["No one's going to want to have anything to do with a junkie like you, including me.","Benedito's date was an adrenaline junkie, so they went bungee jumping."],["",""]],["hobble","'hɒbl","vi. 蹒跚\\nvt. 使跛行, 阻碍\\nn. 跛行",["I can't walk, but I can definitely hobble.","Tom took heart and, sure enough, on New Year's Eve he was able to hobble along to a party."],["我走不动，但是肯定能跛行。",""]],["prognosis","prɒg'nәusis","n. 预测, 预后\\n[医] 预后",["We will have a discussion concerning the prognosis.","Marcus was spot on in his prognosis, as the results before us now show."],["",""]],["intermediary",".intә'mi:diәri","n. 仲裁者, 调解者, 媒介物, 中间人\\na. 中间的, 媒介的",["I am an intermediary who introduces business.","Poetry is emotion expressed in rhythm through thought, just as music is that same expression, but direct, without the intermediary of the idea."],["",""]],["bourbon","'buәbәn","[机] 波旁",["Tom took the flask of bourbon out of his pocket and took a sip.","One of his steadiest jobs was playing five nights a week at the Old Absinthe House on Bourbon Street."],["",""]],["bruised","","a. [医]青肿的；瘀紫的",["But words are words; I never yet did hear. That the bruised heart was pierced through the ear.","The people were bruised and the cities were on their knees."],["",""]],["queer","kwiә","n. 怪人, 同性恋者\\na. 奇怪的, 不舒服的, 可疑的\\nvt. 搞糟",["You're both queer enough, if that's what you mean by kindred spirits.","I was wishing you could have stayed a little girl, even with all your queer ways."],["",""]],["deportation",".di:pɒ:'teiʃәn","n. 驱逐出境, 放逐\\n[法] 递解出境, 放逐, 驱逐",["It is unlikely that this indictment will lead to his deportation.","Deportation and genocide are two different things."],["",""]],["fraught","frɒ:t","a. 含有...的, 伴着...的, 充满...的",["The bath which Chloe had taken was apparently more fraught with peril than the sea from which he had escaped.","Landing on the lunar surface is a complex maneuver fraught with challenges."],["",""]],["pathologist","pæ'θɒlәdʒist","n. 病理学家\\n[医] 病理学家",["The team included forensic pathologist Fadil Sadiq.","Mennad isn't scared of dead bodies. He's a forensic pathologist."],["",""]],["riddle","'ridl","n. 谜, 谜语, 粗筛\\nvt. 解谜, 给...出谜, 筛, 寻根究底地检验, 充满于\\nvi. 出谜",["If he could not answer the riddle, he would be eaten.","Russia is a riddle wrapped in a mystery inside an enigma."],["",""]],["squeal","skwi:l","n. 尖叫, 抱怨\\nvi. 发出尖叫声, 高声埋怨\\nvt. 用尖声说",["A black limo rounded the corner with a squeal of tires.","Vladimir ran up to Mom with an ear-piercing squeal."],["",""]],["appellate","ә'pelit","a. 上诉的, 有权受理上诉的\\n[法] 受理上诉的, 上诉的, 控诉的",["He filed an appeal with the appellate court."],["他向抗訴法院提起上訴。"]],["galactic","gә'læktik","a. 乳汁的, 银河的, 极大的\\n[医] 乳液的, 催乳液的",["The galactic military used wormholes to hop around the universe.","The centre of the Galactic Empire was a palatial garden planet."],["",""]],["inadequacy","in'ædikwәsi","n. 不适当, 不足之处, 不充分\\n[医] 机能不全, 闭锁不全, 关闭不全",["It's at times like this I'm reminded of the woeful inadequacy of human justice.","The inadequacy of my salary makes it difficult to save for emergencies or future goals."],["",""]],["dribble","'dribl","vi. 流口水, 滴下\\nvt. 使滴下, 运球\\nn. 点滴, 口水, 少量",["Ziri picked up a ball and started to dribble it around the court.","Tom can't dribble a basketball very well."],["",""]],["perceptual","pә'septʃuәl","a. 知觉的, 有知觉的",["My friend is writing a doctoral thesis on developing visual perceptual skills in children with learning disabilities.","The brain has multiple perceptual systems."],["",""]],["negligence","'neglidʒәns","n. 疏忽, 粗心大意, 忽视\\n[经] 疏忽, 过失",["God loves those who can control their anger and forgive unintentional negligence.","If it weren't for his negligence, it would have never happened."],["",""]],["volatility",".vɒlә'tiliti","n. 挥发性, 挥发度, 轻快, 易变, 短暂\\n[计] 变更率",["These solvents, due to their volatility, evaporate into the atmosphere when used.","Continuing volatility is a safe bet in today's market."],["",""]],["cheekbone","'tʃi:kbәun","n. 颧骨",["In the 1980's women put blush under their cheekbones, but the trend now is to apply it on the cheekbone."],[""]],["silky","'silki","a. 丝的, 柔滑的",["A spider can produce a silky substance from tiny openings on its underside.","Then it draws more silky lines across these spokes, leaving a smooth, non-sticky patch in the middle of the web."],["",""]],["beaver","'bi:vә","n. 海狸(毛皮)\\n[机] 轻型及中型飞机加油",["An oil leak was contained by a beaver dam in Alberta.","Without a doubt the rodent best adapted to living in rivers and marshlands is the beaver."],["",""]],["torrent","'tɒ:rәnt","n. 奔流, 倾盆大雨, 倾注, 迸发",["Another section of the hillside collapsed into a torrent of mud in the nearby Phuoc Loc district, killing three people.","No matter the situation, Miroslav's default response seems to be a torrent of colorful expletives."],["",""]],["tort","tɒ:t","n. 民事侵权行为\\n[经] 侵犯行为(不包括违约), 非法行为",["The cruelty of the torture in the police station is beyond description."],[""]],["locomotive",".lәukә'mәutiv","n. 火车头, 机车\\na. 运转的, 火车头的, 移动的",["The locomotive was pulling a long line of freight cars.","We were wakened by the whistle of the steam locomotive at dawn."],["",""]],["unconsciously",".ʌn'kɒnʃәsli","adv. 无意识地, 无意中, 不知不觉地",["Unconsciously my mom took hold of the chair.","I end up unconsciously trying to get fit as summer draws near."],["母親無意中握住了椅子。",""]],["weakly","'wi:kli","a. 弱的, 虚弱的\\nadv. 微弱地, 虚弱地",["She protested weakly, but ended up joining in with everyone else.","Miroslav asked Anna if she could eat and she nodded very weakly."],["",""]],["primal","'praiml","a. 主要的, 最初的, 原始的",["Like the colour blue, stoats are one of the things that appeal to me on a primal level.","Appetite is one of humankind's three primal needs, alongside sleep and sexual desire."],["",""]],["durability",",djuәrә'biliti","[计] 耐久性, 耐用性, 持久性",["This machine is inferior to that one in durability.","He checked the durability of the house before buying it."],["",""]],["dimly","'dimli","adv. 微暗, 朦胧",["In the distance, there stood a dimly white lighthouse.","The antechamber was dimly lit, filled with portraits of long-dead ancestors."],["",""]],["humankind","'hju:mәnkaind","n. 人类",["The discovery of a new type of meal contributes more to humankind than the discovery of a new star.","Those who are governed by reason desire nothing for themselves which they do not also desire for the rest of humankind."],["",""]],["mayonnaise","meiә'neiz","n. 蛋黄酱",["The oil in mayonnaise sometimes separates from the other ingredients.","You can do anything with mayonnaise, except sit on it."],["",""]],["notification",".nәutifi'keiʃәn","n. 通知, 通告, 告示\\n[经] 通知, 通知书",["I received notification that we must move out in one month.","My Thunderbird sorts notification e-mails from Tatoeba into three different folders without my having asked it to do so."],["",""]],["unmarked",".ʌn'mɑ:kt","a. 未被注意的, 无记号的, 无标志的",["Tom put together one million dollars in unmarked, used bills as the kidnappers had told him to do.","Tom had his licence suspended on the spot after crashing his car into an unmarked police car."],["",""]],["nitrate","'naitreit","n. 硝酸盐\\n[化] 硝酸盐(或酯)",["Natural mineral water contains calcium, magnesium, sodium, potassium as well as nitrate.","The stain on the lab coat is due to silver nitrate."],["",""]],["mast","mɑ:st","n. 桅, 桅杆, 杆\\nvt. 装桅杆于",["Odysseus had himself bound to the mast, asking not to be untied until the Sirens were out of earshot.","The government has declared three days of national mourning. Flags across the country have been lowered to half mast."],["",""]],["fiance","fi'ɒnsei","n. 未婚夫",["Kate always shows off the big diamond ring she got from her fiance.","Sami thinks his daughter's fiance is responsible for her death."],["",""]],["dreamer","'dri:mә","n. 做梦的人, 梦想者",["A dreamer is one who can only find his way by moonlight, and his punishment is that he sees the dawn before the rest of the world.","The real dreamer is he who dreams of the impossible."],["",""]],["grandeur","'grændʒә","n. 庄严, 伟大, 壮丽",["Grandeur and gallantry never appeared with more lustre in France, than in the last years of Henry the Second's reign.","More vividly than all the written histories, the Coliseum tells the story of Rome's grandeur and Rome's decay."],["",""]],["candlelight","'kændllait","n. 烛光, 黄昏",["Instead of preparing a dinner by candlelight, she put her boyfriend up for auction on eBay.","During the power cut, Tom read the children a story by candlelight. Everyone was quite sad when the lights came back on."],["她没有准备烛光晚餐，而是把她的男友放到Ebay上拍卖。",""]],["coarsely","'kɒ:sli","adv. 粗糙地, 粗俗地, 鄙俗地",["The salt was coarsely ground."],["鹽是粗磨的。"]],["interracial",".intә'reiʃjәl","a. 人种间的, 人种混合的",["More than 50 years after the U.S. Supreme Court struck down laws banning interracial marriage, a growing number of ads feature interracial couples with biracial children.","The thugs targetted interracial couples."],["",""]],["shameful","'ʃeimful","a. 可耻的, 丢脸的, 不道德的, 淫猥的, 猥亵的, 不体面的",["Your conduct is absolutely shameful.","And I did not shoot. I couldn't... At the last moment, it's shameful to say... I didn't have the courage to shoot."],["你的行為是絕對可恥的。",""]],["utmost","'ʌtmәust","n. 极限, 最大限度, 极度\\na. 极度的, 最远的",["If we don't make the utmost effort to protect the rainforests, many of the rare species in them will become extinct.","We must make the utmost effort to reduce the use of plastic packaging, and also to recycle all waste plastic."],["如果我们不做更多的努力去保护雨林，很多其中的稀有物种将会灭绝。","我们应该尽我们最大的努力减少塑料包装的使用，并回收所有的塑料废物。"]],["aptly","'æptli","adv. 适当地, 适宜地",["It is aptly said that necessity is the mother of invention.","It is aptly said that illness starts from the mind."],["",""]],["groundwork","'graundwә:k","n. 地基, 基础, 根据",["I've been meaning to read Kant's Groundwork of the Metaphysics of Morals.","We're laying the groundwork of a better future for ourselves and our progeny."],["",""]],["dogma","'dɒgmә","n. 教条",["Loving, of enemies is another dogma of feigned morality, and has besides no meaning.","His dogma forbids that he eats fish during Passover."],["",""]],["cyberspace","","[计] 空间, 网控空间",["Tom is glad he gets to escape the real world by going to cyberspace, where he can be anyone.","Is the information superhighway in cyberspace, or does it merely take you there?"],["",""]],["interstellar","'intә'stelә","a. 星际的",["A civilization advanced enough to have developed interstellar travel must be communist.","In physics, the Jeans instability causes the collapse of interstellar gas clouds and subsequent star formation."],["",""]],["mesmerize","'mezmәraiz","vt. 施催眠术, 迷住, 迷惑\\n[医] 催眠",["Snakes are said to mesmerize small animals and birds."],[""]],["midwife","'midwaif","n. 助产士, 接生婆\\n[医] 助产士",["In the hospital room, the nurse wearing white clothes and the midwife were preparing for the delivery.","The next day, Feb. 5, he filed a complaint with district police alleging negligence by the midwife."],["",""]],["jack","dʒæk","n. 插座, 千斤顶, 男人\\nvt. 抬起, 提醒, 扛举, 增加, 提高, 放弃\\na. 雄的\\n[计] 插座",["No other boy in our class is more studious than Jack.","Jack stopped talking all of a sudden when Mary went into the room."],["我们班级里没有比杰克更勤奋的男孩了。","瑪麗進入了房間，傑克就突然不講話了。"]],["chilean","'tʃiliәn","n. 智利人, 智利讲的西班牙语\\na. 智利文化的, 智利人的, 智利的",["Tom can't tell the difference between Spanish wine and Chilean wine.","It was disappointing to hear about the privatization of Chilean copper."],["",""]],["populace","'pɒpjulәs","n. 平民, 大众, 人口",["The populace was in thrall to the dictator's whims.","The gazing populace receive greedily, without examination, whatever soothes superstition and promotes wonder."],["",""]],["protracted","prәu'træktid","a. 拖延的",["Because of the protracted depression, many workers are unemployed.","Their interview was protracted beyond that at which they usually parted."],["",""]],["fundamentalism",".fʌndә'mentәlizm","n. 基要主义",["There are occasional outbreaks of religious fundamentalism in Algeria.","It raises the question of fundamentalism."],["",""]],["lug","lʌg","v. 拖, 拉\\nn. 一拖, 一拉, 耳朵, 耳状物, 装腔作势, 勒索",["The engine was seized and the lug nuts were frozen on all four wheels.","Tom never leaves the pub before 2 a.m., and by then he's usually so drunk that his friends have to lug him up to bed."],["",""]],["elastic","i'læstik","n. 松紧带, 橡皮筋\\na. 有弹性的, 能伸缩的, 可通融的",["Filo pastry is very elastic and has a low fat content.","It struck me that many pickup trucks use elastic metals in their rear shock absorbers."],["",""]],["peacekeeping","'pi:s,ki:piŋ","[法] 维护和平的, 执行停火协定的",["The UN needs to send a peacekeeping force to Western Sahara.","Bangladesh has consistently made large contributions to United Nations peacekeeping operations."],["",""]],["ruined","'ruind","a. 毁灭的, 没落的, 荒废的",["Actions are successfully achieved with deliberation but ruined by carelessness.","The two of you have ruined my life."],["行成于思，毁于隨。","你们两个误了我一生。"]],["baffle","'bæfl","vt. 困惑, 为难, 使挫折\\nvi. 徒作挣扎\\nn. 迷惑, 挡板",["Ziri's disappearance continues to baffle everybody.","The thick walls baffle outside noises."],["",""]],["bandit","'bændit","n. 强盗",["In an attempt to escape, the bandit took the lives of four hostages.","A bandit will be the best underling."],["",""]],["protrude","prәu'tru:d","vi. 伸出, 突出\\nvt. 使伸出, 使突出",["In this type of break, the bone will actually protrude from the skin."],[""]],["clinically","","adv. 临床, 临诊, 冷静, 不偏不倚, 分析",["We put the cat on a vegan diet. She became clinically depressed and died."],[""]],["pavilion","pә'viljәn","n. 楼阁, 亭子, 大帐篷, 观众席\\nvt. 置...于亭中, 搭帐篷, 笼罩",["When I was young, my father often talked to me about the Golden Pavilion.","The beauty of the Golden Pavilion covered in snow was unmatched."],["",""]],["cod","kɒd","n. 鳕, 欺骗, 愚弄\\nv. 欺骗, 愚弄",["Haddock are gadids, meaning they are in the same family as cod.","Gadiformes are an order that cod, haddock and other sea species belong to."],["",""]],["acculturation","ә.kʌltʃә'reiʃәn","n. 文化互渗, 文化适应",["Since then, Kabylia has been obstinately confronting the process of Arabization and acculturation that is undermining its language and identity."],[""]],["breaker","'breikә","n. 断路器\\n[化] 破碎机",["It never occurred to me that he was a prison-breaker.","Yanni turned off the breaker that controls the light switch to this light above."],["",""]],["wanted","'wɔntid. 'wɔ:n-","a. 被通缉的",["It was Sir Anthony's eightieth birthday concert and everybody wanted a ticket.","I felt quite relieved after I had said all I wanted to say."],["这是安东尼爵士的八十岁生日音乐会，大家都想要一张入场券。","说了所有我要说的话后，我感觉很轻松。"]],["precipitation","pri.sipi'teiʃәn","n. 坠落, 沉淀, 降水, 轻率, 急速, 猛冲, 突如其来\\n[化] 析出",["Compared to last summer, we haven't had that much precipitation this year.","The areas with lowest precipitation are on the leeward side of the mountains."],["",""]],["horrendous","hɒ'rendәs","a. 可怕的, 骇人的, 不得了的",["A horrendous situation developed. We hope the government can find a satisfactory solution.","It is horrendous that the phenomenon of child soldiers still exists."],["",""]],["densely","'densli","adv. 浓密地, 浓厚地",["The Silesian Voivodeship is the most densely populated region of Poland.","Kabylie, Algeria, is one of the most densely populated areas in the world."],["西里西亚省是波兰人口稠密度最大的地区。",""]],["gingerly","'dʒindʒәli","adv. 小心翼翼地, 慎重地\\na. 慎重的, 谨慎的",["The opera singer tested her voice gingerly after recovering from throat surgery.","I have gingerly opened the post box each night waiting for the letter."],["",""]],["childish","'tʃaildiʃ","a. 天真的, 孩子气的",["It is time you left off your childish ways.","His way of thinking is very childish."],["是你该放弃你幼稚手段的时候了。","他的思維方式很幼稚。"]],["obscenity","ɒb'si:niti","n. 淫秽, 淫秽的语言(或行为、动作), 可憎的事\\n[法] 猥亵, 淫诲, 猥亵的言语或行动",["Obscenity is whatever happens to shock some elderly and ignorant magistrate.","\"I know it when I see it\" is an American judicial standard for identifying obscenity established by its Supreme Court."],["",""]],["handbag","'hændbæg","n. 手提包",["Mary claimed that the handbag had been a present from her husband.","She was robbed of the handbag she bought last week."],["",""]],["befriend","bi'frend","vt. 待人如友, 扶助",["Apparently, having too few foes, the Americans like to provoke the enemies of their enemies rather than befriend them.","You must befriend the bacteria that live in your gut."],["",""]],["heroism","'herәuizm","n. 英勇, 勇敢事迹, 豪侠行为",["But let not this blind you to what virtue there is; many persons strive for high ideals, and everywhere life is full of heroism.","People are rewarded for heroism in putting out fires, not for preventing them."],["",""]],["elf","elf","n. 小精灵, 矮人, 淘气鬼\\n[电] 超低频的简写",["Tom is a woodland elf and John is a dwarf from the mountains.","The Marsh Woman is related to the elf maidens, who are well-known, for songs are sung and pictures painted about them."],["",""]],["medalist","'mædәlist","n. 奖章获得者, 奖章设计者, 奖章制作者, 勋章制作者, 奖章搜集者, 勋章搜集者",["World-record sprinter and eight-time Olympic gold medalist Usain Bolt is self-quarantining at home in Jamaica, after testing positive for the coronavirus.","World champion and Olympic gold medalist Simone Biles has 19 medals to her name, but there's one accolade that's been out of her reach."],["",""]],["wretched","'retʃid","a. 可怜的, 不幸的, 卑鄙的",["Grit your teeth and keep working on the wretched painting.","When it's warm the sickness saps my energy, and it's no better in this wretched cold either."],["",""]],["interplay","'intәplei","n. 互相作用, 互相影响\\nvi. 互相作用",["The colorful hues of icebergs result from the interplay of light with dense ice, ice crystals, and algal growth.","My locality is a nexus for occidental and oriental interplay, which is abundant in emotional undulations."],["",""]],["exhale","eks'heil","v. 呼气, 发出, 散发",["If you can see your breath when you exhale, you know it's cold.","The doctor told me to inhale and exhale slowly and deeply."],["如果呼气的时候能看到自己的气，你就知道天气很冷。",""]],["teamwork","'ti:mwә:k","n. 协同作业, 协力\\n[法] 联合工作, 联合行动, 协调工作",["Foster a positive work environment through teamwork.","The most wonderful thing about baseball is teamwork."],["",""]],["waft","wɑ:ft","vt. 随风传送, 使飘荡\\nvi. 飘荡\\nn. 吹拂, 飘荡",["The smoke rose from the campfire and wafted silently through the pine trees."],[""]],["doorbell","'dɒ:bel","n. 门铃",["Sorry, I was taking a nap and didn't hear you ring the doorbell.","I was about to leave when the doorbell rang."],["对不起，我在睡午觉，没听到你按门铃。","门铃响的时候，我正准备出门。"]],["moody","'mu:di","a. 心情不稳的, 郁郁寡欢的, 喜怒无常的",["He is moody and difficult to get along with.","Helen Moody was noted as a tennis player for not showing any expression on the court."],["他喜怒无常，极难相处。",""]],["situational","sitju'eiʃәnәl. -tʃu-","a. 环境形成的；情形的",["The interview includes situational questions."],["面試包含情境題。"]],["guidebook","'gaidbuk","n. 指南, 手册, 要览",["This hotel is far from deserving the four stars the guidebook gives it.","While in England, I often referred to the guidebook for details of my journey."],["這家酒店在旅行指南上有四星級的評分，但是卻完全沒有四星級的水準。","我在英國的時候，經常翻閱旅遊指南，查詢旅途中的相關細節。"]],["wasp","wɒsp","n. 黄蜂, 胡蜂, 易怒的人, 刻毒的人\\n[医] 胡蜂, 黄蜂",["Last summer, a wasp stung me and I had to go to the emergency room.","This wasp paralyzes other insects, cakes them in dirt, and lays its eggs inside so its larvae will feast on them."],["",""]],["existential",".egzis'tenʃәl","a. 有关存在的",["Stephen was able to surpress the existential terror he was feeling in the traditional manner: drinking excessively.","Thinking about the universe always gives me an existential crisis."],["",""]],["alloy","'ælɒi. ә'lɒi","n. 合金\\nvt. 将...铸成合金, 减低成色\\nvi. 合铸",["ODS super alloy is produced by the mechanical alloy method following powder metallurgy.","I've never seen a metal of that color before; it's probably an alloy."],["",""]],["discretionary","dis'kreʃәnәri","[计] 选择的",["Each member of the city council received an annual allocation of discretionary funds which could be used to support special projects in their respective council districts."],[""]],["mischief","'mistʃif","n. 损害, 伤害, 灾祸, 恶作剧, 淘气\\n[法] 损害, 伤害, 危害",["The little boy got into mischief when he was left alone.","It is impossible to calculate the moral mischief, if I may so express it, that mental lying has produced in society."],["",""]],["optimist","'ɔptimist","n. 乐观者, 乐观主义者",["I am by turns an optimist and a pessimist.","The optimist looks into a mirror and becomes more optimistic, the pessimist more pessimistic."],["我时而乐观，时而悲观。",""]],["manhood","'mænhud","n. 成年, 勇气, 男儿\\n[法] 成年身分, 成年, 男子",["Most athletes are at their best during their early manhood.","Having reached manhood, he is now ready to establish a home of his own."],["",""]],["disputed","","a. 有争议的",["We disputed for hours about what to write.","The scientificity of this research has been often disputed."],["我們為該寫些甚麼而爭論了好幾個小時。",""]],["aristocratic","æristә'krætik","a. 贵族的, 主张贵族统绐的, 有贵族气派的",["His dress somehow gives an aristocratic impression.","Her very long, black eyelashes set off the aristocratic pallor of her cheeks."],["",""]],["adjunct","'ædʒʌŋkt","n. 附属物, 附件, 助手, 修饰语\\na. 附属的",["Before his work as an adjunct instructor, he had worked in a lab which, until it ran out of funding, sponsored his work visa."],[""]],["formative","'fɒ:mәtiv","a. 有助于形成的, 造型的, 形成的\\nn. 构词要素",["It was in Algiers that he spent the formative years of his life.","WHO officials said this is of particular concern as it is during this formative age that healthy relationships are made."],["",""]],["helium","'hi:liәm","n. 氦\\n[化] 氦",["It is, moreover, very difficult to explain in any other way why there should be so much helium in the universe.","Jupiter is a planet principally composed of hydrogen and helium."],["",""]],["crumple","'krʌmpl","vt. 弄皱, 压皱\\nvi. 崩溃, 变皱",["You're not a serious mathematician unless you crumple up a piece of paper in frustration every twenty minutes, look off into space, and appear to be questioning your very existence."],[""]],["generational","","a. 生殖的, 世代的, 代与代之间的, 一代的, 生育的",["Some religious groups set up gigantic generational ships that travelled many years away from the Solar System to distant stars.","You are always thinking about gender. It shows your generational and educational background."],["",""]],["sludge","slʌdʒ","n. 软泥, 泥泞\\n[化] 沉淀物; 泥状沉淀",["I can't imagine anything would grow in that toxic sludge.","Thick sludge bubbled out of a factory pipe into the nearby creek."],["",""]],["archbishop","'ɑ:tʃ'biʃәp","n. 大主教",["The archbishop caused an uproar with his dismissive comments about the nuns' concerns.","Laurent Weber is the archbishop of Portland."],["",""]],["nutmeg","'nʌtmeg","n. 肉豆蔻\\n[医] 肉豆蔻",["Salt and pepper completely and add a dash of nutmeg.","It's uncommon to come across ten-pound boxes of nutmeg, so be sure to grab as many as you can when you do."],["",""]],["feasibility",".fi:zә'biliti","n. 可行性, 可能性\\n[化] 可行性",["Although much research has been carried out into the applications of Emmet's theory, little is known about their feasibility.","We're currently studying the project's feasibility."],["",""]],["fray","frei","n. 磨损, 打架, 争论\\nvt. 使磨损\\nvi. 被磨损",["So when their screams descending fill the strand, / Misenus from his outlook sounds the fray.","The way he returned into the fray to rescue his comrade is, for lack of a better word, praiseworthy."],["",""]],["giftedness","ɡɪf'tɪdnəs","假资优, 天才, 资赋优异",["The school supports the giftedness of its students."],["學校培養學生的天賦。"]],["termite","'tә:mait","n. 白蚁",["Flavio created a hybrid between a termite and a bee.","We have a termite problem that we need to do something about."],["",""]],["pellet","'pelit","n. 颗粒状物, 小子弹, 小药丸\\nvt. 使成颗粒, 使成团, 用子弹打",["Indian forces have been known to use pellet guns against protestors in Kashmir.","Did you see how the fish grabbed a pellet of food just before it reached the bottom of the tank?"],["",""]],["taker","'teikә","n. 取者, 捕者, 接受者, 收取者\\n[法] 受者, 收票人, 接受打赌的人",["The thief-taker arrested many thieves at the same time.","The hostage-taker activated the timer of the bomb."],["",""]],["tether","'teðә","n. 系绳, 系链, 界限, 范围\\nvt. 栓, 束缚, 限制",["Astronauts use tethers to keep tools from floating away. They tether their tools to their spacesuits.","Yanni and Skura reached the end of their tether and took it out on each other."],["",""]],["connecting","kә'nektiŋ","[计] 接线的",["Connecting a PC to the internet is not rocket science.","Connecting a PC to the internet isn't rocket science."],["將電腦連線到網際網路並不是什麼難事。","將電腦連線到網際網路並不是什麼難事。"]],["fencing","'fensiŋ","n. 围墙, 剑术\\n[法] 围栏, 买卖赃物, 辩论",["A furious elephant kicks out the fencing of his enclosure and sends the keeper flying.","The fencing competition is taking place in Algiers."],["",""]],["approximate","ә'prɒksimәt","a. 大约的, 接近的, 近似的\\nvt. 接近, 使接近, 粗略估计\\nvi. 接近于",["This will give you an approximate idea of the situation.","The finite element method enables us to find approximate solutions of partial differential equations."],["",""]],["unprotected","'ʌnprә'tektid","a. 没有防卫的, 无掩护的, 未设防的, 没有保护人的, 不受关税保护的\\n[计] 无保护的, 非保护的",["Although medicine has come a long way in the last few years, having unprotected sex is still a huge risk.","The female warrior's armor seemed to leave many parts of her body unprotected."],["",""]],["workload","'wә:klәud","n. 工作量\\n[化] 工作量",["High blood pressure increases the workload of the heart and the arteries.","Tom was advised, for medical reasons, to cut back on his workload."],["",""]],["verbally","'v\\\\\\\\:bәli","adv. 口头地, 非书面地",["Yanni's father was alcoholic and used to verbally and physically abuse his family.","Daniel accused the teacher of verbally abusing him."],["",""]],["prelude","'prelju:d","n. 前奏, 序幕, 序诗, 前奏曲\\nvi. 作为前奏\\nvt. 作为...的开头",["They came early so they wouldn't miss the prelude.","Sami's yelling was just a prelude to what was going to happen later."],["",""]],["glitter","'glitә","n. 灿烂, 闪烁, 辉耀\\nvi. 灿烂, 闪烁, 辉耀",["The drag queens applied glitter to their eyes to complete their makeup.","Matthew likes to decorate his cupcakes with edible flowers and glitter."],["",""]],["forbidden","fә'bidn","a. 被禁止的, 严禁的\\nforbid的过去分词",["Students are forbidden to smoke on the school grounds.","In the Ming Dynasty (early 15th century) the centre of Beijing was the Forbidden City."],["學生不得在校園範圍內吸煙。","明代十五世纪初紫禁城是北京的中心。"]],["redwood","'redwud","n. (美国)红杉, 红树",["Redwood trees are some of the tallest and oldest trees in the world.","Are you superior to a thousand-year-old olive tree or redwood tree?"],["",""]],["dissect","di'sekt","v. 解剖, 切开",["Teachers dissect frogs to teach students their anatomy.","If you want to know a person you like better, you have to confine them and dissect them."],["",""]],["modesty","'mɒdisti","n. 谦逊, 质朴, 羞怯",["Even when one is being praised, modesty is important.","With a high, closed collar, figure-hugging cut, and large slits at either side of a straight skirt, the qipao is unique in its ability to communicate both modesty and sensuousness."],["即使在受到表扬的时候，谦虚也是很重要的。","因为有高而闭合的领子、紧身的剪裁和在直身裙两边的大开口，旗袍有着独一无二传达端庄和性感的能力。"]],["abyss","ә'bis","n. 深渊, 深邃, 地狱",["One step further, and you will fall into an abyss.","It was only when the fog lifted that we noticed that we had slept on the edge of an abyss."],["",""]],["attrition","ә'triʃәn","n. 摩擦, 磨损\\n[医] 擦除术; 磨耗",["At this point, it's just a war of attrition. Only those who are patient can survive.","Rapid attrition in the number of employees led to an increased workload for those who remained."],["",""]],["rout","raut","n. 溃败, 大败, 乌合之众, 盛大晚会\\nvt. 使溃败, 使败逃, 打垮, 用鼻拱, 挖起, 搜, 唤起\\nvi. 用鼻拱地, 搜",["The enemy's rout gave us a decisive victory.","The team's defense couldn't prevent the rout."],["",""]],["enclosed","in'klәuzd","a. 被附上的\\n[经] 附上, 内附",["The site of the condominium is enclosed with stakes.","I would like to order one coffee machine (Model 25-A) and have enclosed your order form."],["",""]],["anterior","æn'tiәriә","a. 前面的, 先前的\\n[医] 前的",["The sounds babies make when they babble seem to contain a lot of anterior consonants.","The head, expanding from the neck, contracts to a bluntly pointed anterior end."],["",""]],["stuffing","'stʌfiŋ","n. 填塞物, 填料",["Gyoza stuffing? I made some gyoza at home but, possibly because I didn't have enough dough, I had some of the filling left over.","That isn't the way that my grandmother made stuffing."],["",""]],["estranged","i'streindʒd","a. 疏远的, 分离的, 隔离的",["Yanni tried to limit his kids' contact with his estranged wife.","William is struggling to repair his relationship with his estranged brother."],["",""]],["coding","'kәudiŋ","n. 译码\\n[计] 编码",["Believe it or not, my favourite part of coding is when I have to debug my program.","Microsoft has partnered with Code.org, a non-profit group, to offer free in-store classes and online training on coding."],["",""]],["cosmology","kɒz'mɒlәdʒi","n. 宇宙哲学, 宇宙论\\n[电] 宇宙论",["Cosmology is a branch of science which studies the evolution of our universe.","The article \"The singularity problem in brane cosmology\" may interest you."],["",""]],["fantasize","'fæntәsaiz","vt.vi. 想象, 出现幻想, 产生幻想, 使幻想化, 幻想",["I fantasize about a life that doesn't so closely resemble hell.","Some people fantasize about living in a society with a lower technological level. The horse and buggy are still technology."],["",""]],["grassland","'græslænd","n. 牧草地, 草原",["The Grassland theme in Heroes of Might and Magic II is my favourite terrain theme in all of HoMM.","The steppe ecosystem is a grassland biome that is found in temperate regions around the world."],["",""]],["idealistic","ai'diәlistik","a. 理想主义的, 唯心论的, 唯心主义的, 唯心主义者的",["Outsiders tend to scoff at Esperanto as an idealistic waste of time.","The Americans are a sentimental people who, under all its realism, is very prone to idealistic ideas."],["",""]],["alaskan","ә'læskәn","a. 阿拉斯加的；阿拉斯加州的",["An Alaskan town recently elected an entire team of sled dogs as its city councilors.","An Alaskan man awoke to find a lynx family on his deck."],["",""]],["clandestine","klæn'destin","a. 偷偷摸摸的\\n[法] 秘密的, 暗中的",["He was suspected of being active in a clandestine movement.","Money laundering is, by definition, a clandestine enterprise."],["",""]],["propagate","'prɒpәgeit","vt. 繁殖, 传播, 传送\\nvi. 繁殖, 蔓延",["Humans are the vehicles that genes use to propagate themselves.","Sound needs matter to propagate through. However, cosmic noise and electromagnetic waves don't."],["",""]],["weaponry","'wepәnri","n. 武器, 军备, 武器设计研制学",["The West isn't using diplomacy. It prefers to use weaponry.","Yautja weaponry is highly advanced, including plasma-based weapons, shoulder-mounted cannons, and retractable wrist blades."],["",""]],["hind","haind","n. 雌鹿\\na. 后部的, 在后的",["Jerboas look like kangaroos due to having many similarities such as long hind legs, very short forelegs, and long tails.","The front legs of a giraffe are longer than its hind legs."],["",""]],["silvery","'silvәri","a. 像银的, 银色的, 银铃一般的",["Beyond lay the sea, shimmering and blue, and over it soared the gulls, their pinions flashing silvery in the sunlight.","I found myself walking under the silvery lights of Regent Street, full of thoughts of Gladys and of wonder as to my future."],["",""]],["mysteriously","mɪ'stɪərɪəslɪ","adv. 神秘地; 不可思议地; 诡秘地; 故弄玄虚地",["The sense of humor is mysteriously bound up with national characteristics.","There must have been a unique combination of circumstances that mysteriously caused a vast improvement in his health."],["",""]],["borough","'bә:rәu","n. 自治的市镇, 区",["The borough continued to grow as other factories and supporting businesses were established.","If you move from one borough to another within the city, please submit a notification of the change."],["",""]],["enigmatic",".enig'mætik","a. 费解的, 谜一般的, 高深莫测的",["The Mona Lisa has an enigmatic smile.","She's a strange, enigmatic and inspiring poet."],["蒙娜丽莎有着神秘的微笑。","她是一个奇怪，神秘和鼓舞人心的诗人。"]],["tibetan","ti'betn","a. 西藏的\\nn. 藏语, 西藏人",["The two scholars wrangled over the meaning of an obscure Tibetan phrase.","Han, Manchu, Mongol, Hui and Tibetan people (as well as other minority groups in China) are kins in one family."],["兩位學者為一句意思含糊的藏文句子爭論了一番。","漢滿蒙回藏（以及中國的其他少數族裔們）一家親。"]],["resting","'restiŋ","a. 静止的；休眠的",["He was listening with his chin resting on his hand.","An old man was resting in the shade of the tree."],["他用手撑着下巴，听着。","一個老人在樹蔭下休息。"]],["allure","ә'luә","vt. 引诱, 吸引\\nn. 魅力, 诱惑力",["Layla wasn't conventionally beautiful, but she possessed a certain kind of intense sexual allure.","There is an allure and excitement to the power of an old-fashioned steam train."],["",""]],["distraught","dis'trɒ:t","a. 烦恼的, 心烦意乱的, 发狂的",["Yanni was distraught and that's why he didn't cooperate with the police right away.","I don't know how to talk to emotionally distraught people."],["",""]],["tnt","","[化] 梯恩梯\\n[医] 三硝基甲苯",["The crew used TNT to bring down the old building."],["工程隊用 TNT 炸毀舊大樓。"]],["unruly",".ʌn'ru:li","a. 难控制的, 无法无天的, 任性的",["He teaches a class with a conspicuous number of rebellious and unruly pupils.","His enjoyment of the game was marred by the unruly behaviour of some of the other spectators."],["",""]],["wag","wæg","vt. 摇摆, 摇动, 饶舌\\nvi. 摆动, 喋喋不休\\nn. 摇摆, 爱说笑打趣的人",["Dogs wag their tail not so much to you as to your bread.","A friend in the wag is better than a penny in the purse."],["",""]],["eschew","is'tʃu:","vt. 避开, 远避",["I do not eschew an elevated style of speech, especially when my interlocutors are themselves well read.","Eschew obfuscation, espouse elucidation."],["",""]],["schizophrenia",".skizәu'fri:niә","n. 精神分裂症\\n[医] 精神分裂症",["One of the symptoms of schizophrenia is pathological attention to detail, so I feel comforted when I forget a few commas.","\"Dementia praecox\" was the original name of what is today called schizophrenia."],["",""]],["thankfully","'θæŋkfulli","adv. 感激地；感谢地",["If your friend reminds you kindly of your faults, take what he says not only pleasantly, but thankfully.","Thankfully, there was an Armani store just outside the alley where Dima had slept."],["如果有朋友對你作出善意批評，你不止應該欣然接受，還要好好的感謝他。","幸好，在狄馬睡覺的小巷外面，剛好有一家阿瑪尼。"]],["bullying","ˈbuliŋ","v. 恐吓, 威逼( bully的现在分词 ); 豪; 跋扈",["I happened to witness the bullying in the corridor.","Mary was subjected to persistent bullying and harassment at work."],["",""]],["piety","'paiәti","n. 虔诚, 孝敬, 虔诚的行为",["There are two things in the world that cannot wait: 1. Filial piety, 2. Doing good.","To raise one's name in later generations and thereby glorify one's parents, this is the greatest expression of filial piety."],["世上有兩件事不能等：一、孝順 二、行善。",""]],["opium","'әupjәm","n. 鸦片\\n[化] 阿片; 鸦片",["Religion is the opium of the people.","The \"Red Dragon\" is a well-known gambling and opium den."],["宗教是人民的鸦片。",""]],["negotiated","niˈɡəuʃieitid","v. 谈判, 协商, 议定( negotiate的过去式和过去分词 ); 兑现（支票等）; 通过, 越过（险要路段）",["We negotiated with the President about our working hours.","They negotiated for months on end without reaching an outcome."],["",""]],["uniqueness","ju:'ni:knis","[计] 唯一性",["We want to capture all the uniqueness of each language. And we as well want to capture their evolution through time.","Creativity and uniqueness certainly go a long way."],["",""]],["otter","'ɒtә","n. 水獭, 水獭皮",["The otter features in mythology and folklore across the world.","Even if a hedgehog, a mole, an otter, a rabbit or an opossum looks like a rodent, it isn't."],["",""]],["looming","'lu:miŋ","n. 上现蜃景；庞视；幽影",["She stood looming down at him, attacking him for indolence and irreverence, blasphemy and ignorance, while waving her umbrella.","A shortage of animal feed is also looming after damage to maize crops and grass."],["",""]],["wither","'wiðә","vt. 使凋谢, 使消亡, 使畏缩\\nvi. 枯萎, 衰退",["Oh luck! Like the moon, you steadily change, you always grow and then wither again.","Countries may rot and wither away due to a lack of a secular state."],["",""]],["liberating","ˈlibəreitɪŋ","v. 解放, 释放( liberate的现在分词 )",["Watching or reading sci-fi is a liberating and expanding experience for the mind.","I wish I could go to school naked. It'd be so liberating."],["",""]],["reimburse",".ri:im'bә:s","vt. 付还, 偿还, 赔偿\\n[经] 偿付, 赔还, 付还; 偿还",["Your school is so kind to reimburse you for the return airfare.","I'll reimburse you for the damage I did to your car."],["你们学校真好，还帮你们报销来回的机票。",""]],["almighty","ɒ:l'maiti","a. 万能的, 全能的",["So vast, without any question, is the divine handiwork of the most excellent Almighty.","And God almighty bless thee, and make thee to increase and multiply thee: that thou mayst be a multitude of people."],["",""]],["bagel","'beiɡәl","n. 百吉饼（先蒸后烤的发面圈）；[俚]（体育比赛中）零蛋",["A Massachusetts man sued Dunkin' Donuts because his buttered bagel didn't have butter.","Donald gave the bagel to a homeless girl on the sidewalk."],["",""]],["solace","'sɒlis","n. 安慰, 安慰之物\\nvt. 安慰, 抚慰, 给与安慰, 使轻松",["He often needs to seek solace in places near water.","The Internet is no solace at all for most people. It feels unnatural for them..."],["",""]],["carnival","'kɑ:nivәl","n. 嘉年华会, 狂欢节, 饮宴狂欢",["If we had been in Venice a month prior, we could have taken part in the carnival.","It's a century-old tradition involving carnival rides, live local music, and plenty of food."],["",""]],["cancellation","kænsә'leiʃәn","n. 取消, 作废, 注销戳\\n[经] 注销, 取消, 保险单的注销",["Apparently there's a cancellation charge of 30 percent.","Only if there's a cancellation, and that would be a bolt out of the blue."],["",""]],["airliner","'єәlainә","n. 班机, 大型客机",["A jet airliner does not admit of careless handling.","The pilot of an airliner is responsible for the safety of passengers."],["",""]],["bullpen","'bjlpen","n. <美>牛栏,<口>大房间(尤指候审犯人用的),[棒球]候补队员区",["The manager warmed up the pitcher in the bullpen."],["總教練在牛棚讓投手熱身。"]],["grossly","'grәusli","adv. 非常, 很, 粗",["Mary was bullied at school because her mother was grossly overweight.","Innovations will be grossly overestimated at first, but grossly underestimated in the long run."],["",""]],["stratum","'streitәm","n. 层, 地层, 阶层\\n[医] 层",["The color of this stratum stands out from the rest of the cliff face.","The members of each stratum accept as their ideal of decency the scheme of life in vogue in the next higher stratum, and bend their energies to live up to that ideal."],["",""]],["tar","tɑ:","n. 焦油, 柏油, 水手\\nvt. 涂以焦油, 玷污, 怂恿\\na. 焦油的",["The tar won't come off. I'm going to have to take this skirt to the dry cleaner.","The components obtained by distillation of coal tar are as shown below."],["",""]],["jab","dʒæb","v. 刺, 戳, 猛击\\nn. 刺, 戳, 猛击",["Village chiefs are trying to change that by urging people to take the jab from mobile vaccination clinics.","In the trade this is generally regarded as a nasty underhand jab at the British cigar industry."],["",""]],["brute","bru:t","n. 畜生, 残忍或好色之人\\na. 残忍的, 无理性的, 畜生的",["He had much more than brute force: he was a skilled and terrific basher.","Any brute can destroy a stable, but it takes a carpenter to build one."],["",""]],["extinguish","ik'stiŋgwiʃ","vt. 熄灭, 使消亡, 压制, 使减色\\n[医] 消灭",["The rain wasn't heavy enough to extinguish the fire.","Don't forget to extinguish your cigarette."],["雨沒大到能把火澆滅。","别忘記熄掉你的香烟。"]],["ransom","'rænsәm","n. 赎金, 赎身, 赎回\\nvt. 赎, 赎身, 赎回, 勒索赎金",["The hijacker demanded a ransom of two million dollars.","Tom immediately agreed to pay the ransom for his beloved wife Mary."],["",""]],["inaugurate","i'nɒ:gjureit","vt. 开始, 举行...就职典礼",["A local politician was called in to inaugurate the new restaurant down the street."],[""]],["reconnaissance","ri'kɒnisәns","n. 侦察, 勘察队\\n[电] 勘查",["These paratroopers are specialized in reconnaissance.","The aircraft was conducting aerial reconnaissance."],["",""]],["fluent","'flu:әnt","a. 流利的, 流畅的",["Even though she grew up in Japan, she speaks fluent English.","You will be able to speak fluent English in another few months."],["即使她在日本长大，她也会说一口流利的英语。","再過兩、三個月，你就能說得一口流利的英語了。"]],["meticulously","","adv. 过细地, 细致地",["I meticulously pieced the torn photograph back together, ensuring that the edges were perfectly matched.","He organized the university's butterfly collection so meticulously that it is now fully machine-searchable."],["",""]],["perpetrate","'pә:pitreit","vt. 做(恶), 犯(罪), 胡说, 恶劣地做\\n[法] 犯, 作, 行",["The government will not fold its arms and allow miscreants and criminals to continue to perpetrate these acts of hooliganism.","What atrocities do we not perpetrate in the name of culture and refinement!"],["",""]],["nonstick","","a. 锅底不粘的",["This is a nonstick pan."],[""]],["leopard","'lepәd","n. 豹, 美洲豹",["I still can't believe they had a snow leopard in that zoo. I thought they were an endangered species.","Have you ever seen a snow leopard hunt in the mountains?"],["我还不敢想象他们在那个动物园里有一个雪豹，我以为它们是一种濒危物种。","你見過雪豹在山上狩獵嗎？"]],["shuffling","","[法] 支唔的, 含混的, 可疑的:躲躲闪闪的",["Alberto heard a shuffling noise coming from the closet.","The purpose of shuffling is to randomize a deck of cards."],["",""]],["screech","skri:tʃ","n. 尖声喊叫, 尖叫声, 煞车声\\nvt. 尖声讲\\nvi. 发出尖声",["With a rattle and a screech, a tractor rolled through the field, knocking the grass flat with a giant red rolling pin.","A screech rang out through the air."],["",""]],["elective","i'lektiv","a. 选举的, 根据选举的, 选修的\\nn. 选修课程",["In high school, my language elective was French, as I waited to learn Japanese and Spanish from a big university.","In schools in Hispanic countries, English is just an elective subject that few take."],["",""]],["weaver","'wi:vә","n. 织布者, 织工",["So fine was the thread that no frame could be found to weave it upon, nor would any weaver undertake to make one.","The spring season is normally very busy for Iowa real estate broker Georgia Weaver."],["",""]],["attendee","æten'di:","[计] 出席人, 参加者, 被照顾者, 被服务者",["You can only take advantage of our offer if you are an attendee."],[""]],["bittersweet","'bitәswi:t","a. 又苦又甜的, 苦乐参半的\\n[医] 白英, 蜀羊泉",["If I could, I would love to experience once again a bittersweet love like in middle school.","Mary describes her first love as \"a bittersweet memory\"."],["",""]],["rationalize","'ræʃәnәlaiz","vt. 使合理, 合理地处理, 使有理化\\nvi. 合理地思考",["Sociopaths rationalize the pain they inflict on others.","Sociopaths never feel remorse and they rationalize the pain they inflict on others."],["",""]],["infertility",".infә'tiliti","n. 不肥沃, 不毛\\n[医] 不育症, 不孕症",["Female hormone imbalance is a major cause of infertility.","He feels proud to support those struggling with infertility."],["",""]],["circumvent",".sә:kәm'vent","vt. 绕行, 陷害, 包围, 智取",["You'll have to find a trick to circumvent that issue.","For every law, there's always someone trying to circumvent it."],["",""]],["digestive","di'dʒestiv","a. 消化的, 助消化的\\nn. 助消化药",["Millions of beneficial organisms live in the human digestive tract.","The stomach and the large and small intestines form the digestive system."],["",""]],["uphill","'ʌp'hil","a. 上坡的, 向上的\\nadv. 往上坡, 向上地",["After an uphill struggle against great odds they finally got the company on its feet again.","Greenpeace is fighting an uphill battle to save the environment."],["",""]],["infidelity",".infi'deliti","n. 不信神, 无信仰, 背信",["She never forgave him the infidelity and held it over him every chance that she got.","Day after day the tabloids titillated the public with lurid details about the president's marital infidelity."],["",""]],["bystander","'baistændә(r)","n. 旁观者, 目击者\\n[法] 候补陪审员, 旁观者",["A bystander videotaped the police beating using their cell phone.","The incident happened to be captured on video by a bystander."],["",""]],["chilled","tʃild","a. 已冷的, 冷硬了的, 冷冻了的\\n[建] 冷却了的, 冷凝了的, 淬火迟的",["An icy blast of wind chilled me to the bone.","Tom likes to drink chilled water in hot weather, while Mary prefers hers at room temperature."],["冰冷的疾風吹到我骨子裡去了。",""]],["hourly","'auәli","a. 每小时的, 以小时计的, 频繁的\\nadv. 每小时地, 频繁地, 不绝地",["I want an hourly update about what's happening.","Sami doesn't know what his hourly pay is."],["",""]],["flannel","'flænl","n. 法兰绒, 法兰绒衣服",["Tom wears the same red flannel shirt every time he goes camping.","Do you sell any trousers lined with plaid flannel?"],["",""]],["tamper","'tæmpә","vi. 干预, 拨弄, 贿赂, 损害, 篡改\\nvt. 篡改\\nn. 捣棒, 打夯机, 填塞者",["Can you ensure your server log files are tamper-proof?","We can't tamper with the building's power."],["",""]],["subset","'sʌbset","n. 子集\\n[计] 子集; 子设备",["In American English, stoats are a subset of weasels, while in British English, they aren't.","Any simple graph can be treated as a subset of the set of all two-element subsets of the set of its vertices."],["",""]],["taped","","n. 录播, 压胶",["All the papers were taped up and kept in the safe.","Captain Akagi sprained his ankle during practice, so, before the game, he taped it up until it was stiff as a board."],["",""]],["scorn","skɒ:n","n. 轻蔑, 藐视, 嘲笑, 被嘲弄的人\\nvt. 轻蔑, 不屑做",["Lucy sighed. She perceived too plainly that her lover held in scorn the manners and habits of her father.","Football supporters have poured scorn on the suggestions."],["",""]],["venetian","vә'ni:ʃәn","a. 威尼斯的\\nn. 威尼斯人",["Tom closed the venetian blinds, so the neighbors couldn't look in.","Tom opened the venetian blinds and looked out at the view."],["",""]],["blinding","'blaindiŋ","a. 使人眩目的, 使人失去判断力的\\nn. 碎石子",["He rushed up through the blinding smoke and hissing flames, till he reached the children.","Three days, made doubtful by the blinding gloom, / as many nights, when not a star is seen, / we wander on, uncertain of our doom."],["",""]],["mash","mæʃ","n. 碎麦芽, 饲料, 糊状物\\nvt. 调情, 捣碎",["Mash this sprout with a little salt and rub it on the swollen part.","Peel the bananas and mash them with a fork."],["",""]],["temp","temp","n. [口]临时雇员",["The workers are hired not by the company itself, but by a temp agency, so they have no rights and get lower pay.","This is just a temp job. I'm out as soon as I'm done with college."],["",""]],["contracting","'kɔntræktiŋ","[法] 缔约的, 承包的",["Divers who surface too quickly run the risk of contracting the bends.","The populations most at risk of contracting the virus are the elderly, the very young and those with compromised immune systems."],["",""]],["conservationist",",kәnsә'veiʃәnist","n. 自然资源保护论者",["The conservationist is against the building of a tidal barrage across the Severn estuary.","Kristen is a bat conservationist who studies how bats relate to their environment, like the plants nectarivorous bats pollinate."],["",""]],["scholastic","skә'læstik","a. 学校的, 学校教育的, 学者的, 学究的\\nn. 经院哲学家, 学究, 墨守成规者, 学生",["With Renaissance, scholastic ideas gave place to positive ideas.","He exceeds all his brothers in scholastic ability."],["隨著文藝復興，學院派的想法被積極的想法取而代之了。",""]],["bunny","'bʌni","n. 兔子",["The first time I was exposed to drag as a child was when I watched Bugs Bunny.","Alberto was walking around in a big Easter bunny costume."],["",""]],["rushing","'rʌʃiŋ","a. 急流的；旺盛的",["Be more careful. Rushing through things is going to ruin your work.","More and more people are rushing to make use of the interactive nature of the medium."],["",""]],["latch","lætʃ","n. 门闩\\nvi. 上闩, 抓住, 占有\\nvt. 闩上\\n[计] 门闩线路; 锁存器",["It took me a while to latch on to what he was talking about.","Karl used the fingerprint scanner to open the latch."],["",""]],["mitigation",".miti'geiʃәn","n. 缓和, 减轻\\n[法] 减, 减轻, 缓和",["As mitigation, it could have been you.","There's a mitigation in the translation."],["",""]],["probing","'prәubiŋ","[电] 探求",["We need to ask some probing questions if we want to get some real information.","These birds forage by probing in shallow water or on wet mud."],["",""]],["recital","ri'saitl","n. 背诵, 吟诵, 详述\\n[法] 叙述, 评述, 列举",["There was a large audience at the piano recital last night.","The girl took the cake for her wonderful dancing at the recital."],["",""]],["vinaigrette",",vinei'^ret","n. 一种油、醋、盐、香料等合成的浓烈调味品",["Endives, walnuts and roquefort are the ingredients of a good salad that can be enjoyed with a walnut or sunflower oil vinaigrette.","Benedito tossed the salad with a light vinaigrette."],["",""]],["munch","mʌntʃ","v. 用力咀嚼, 大声咀嚼",["During my university days, it was cheap then to buy a snack. I would munch on a curried beef bun or a big cinnamon roll and drink a cup of tea.","I would like to have something to munch on with my beer."],["大學時期，買零食很便宜。我常常會吃個咖哩牛肉包子或一個大肉桂捲，再喝杯茶。",""]],["exodus","'eksәdәs","n. 大批的离去\\n[法] 退出, 大批离去, 成一外出",["The rural exodus depopulated entire villages in this region of Germany.","I understand that this sounds far-fetched, but in order to understand Exodus you have to see the bigger picture."],["",""]],["counterterrorism","'kaʊntəˌterərɪzəm","n. 以恐怖反恐怖主义, 报复性恐怖主义",["We favor the continued cooperation in counterterrorism and maintaining cybersecurity."],[""]],["paramilitary",".pærә'militәri","a. 辅助军事的",["Sami organized his gang in a paramilitary structure with him in command.","The Ukrainian army uses paramilitary groups like the Azov Battalion."],["",""]],["midway","'mid'wei","n. 中途, 中间, 娱乐场\\na. 中途的, 中间的\\nadv. 中途",["Midway through our trip we realized that we hadn't brought enough money.","My son had to use the bathroom midway through the movie."],["",""]],["untrue",".ʌn'tru:","a. 不真实的, 不正确的, 不忠实的\\n[法] 虚伪的, 不真实的, 不正确的",["If it doesn't make sense, it's either untrue or poorly argued.","This supposition, that the Earth is immobile, was completely untrue."],["",""]],["woven","'wәuvәn","weave的过去分词",["Microfibre cloth is cloth woven from fibres as narrow as a hundredth of the width of a hair.","The most distinctive element of the men's clothing is the hand-woven poncho."],["",""]],["warship","'wɒ:ʃip","n. 军舰, 战船",["That warship armed with eight cannons is a \"Queen Elizabeth\" class.","It was a big black American warship."],["",""]],["tunic","'tju:nik","n. 束腰外衣\\n[医] 膜, 被膜",["Yanni accidentally spilled some jam on his white tunic.","He wore a tunic over a silk shirt and high patent leather boots."],["",""]],["swerve","swә:v","n. 转向, 弯曲, 背离\\nvi. 突然转向, 转弯, 背离\\nvt. 使突然转向, 使转弯, 使背离",["Narrow roads have also been an issue, causing some motorists to swerve and get into accidents.","Boldi managed to swerve around Martha at the last moment."],["",""]],["compulsive","kәm'pʌlsiv","a. 强制的, 强迫的\\n[医] 强迫性的",["Once a habit has been acquired, it almost has compulsive power over us.","Mary could not avoid the cause of her obsessive-compulsive disorder."],["",""]],["postoperative","pәust'ɒpәrәtiv","a. 手术后的\\n[医] 手术后的",["Staph infections in hospitals pose a significant threat to the health of postoperative surgical patients."],[""]],["bliss","blis","n. 福佑, 天赐的福\\n[计] 实现系统软件的基本语言",["If ignorance is bliss, there should be more happy people.","Bliss is it on such a day to be alive; but to smell dying fir is very heaven."],["",""]],["assemblage","ә'semblidʒ","n. 集合, 装配, 一群人\\n[法] 配合, 集合, 集合物",["The art gallery displayed a stunning assemblage of sculptures.","The assemblage of musicians created a beautiful symphony."],["",""]],["snug","snʌg","a. 舒适的, 温暖的, 整洁的, 紧身的, 隐藏的\\nvt. 使整洁干净, 使紧身, 隐藏",["Below was a little valley and beyond a long, gently-rising slope with snug farmsteads scattered along it.","The children were nestled all snug in their beds, While visions of sugar-plums danced in their heads."],["",""]],["undeniable",".ʌndi'naiәbl","a. 不可否认的",["Love undeniably has wings to fly away from love, but it's also undeniable that it also has wings to fly back.","To make such a denial would be to rave like the deranged, refusing to acknowledge the undeniable truth staring them in the face."],["",""]],["incense","'inseins","n. 香, 香气, 奉承\\nvi. 焚香\\nvt. 用香焚, 使发怒",["In the Nigerian city of Maiduguri, the popular incense kaaji is a cherished, local tradition.","Ziri rubbed the doors and the windows with holy incense."],["",""]],["scheduling","'skedʒuәliŋ","n. 行程安排, 时间表制定\\n[计] 调度",["We had to nix tomorrow's meeting because of a scheduling problem.","The coffee shop wasn't open Sunday morning. There was a scheduling error amongst the staff."],["因为日程安排的问题，我们必须取消明天的会议。",""]],["adjoining","ә'dʒɒiniŋ","a. 邻接的, 毗连的\\n[机] 联接",["Tom could hear someone moving in the adjoining room.","We could hear people talking in the adjoining room."],["",""]],["burnt","bә:nt","burn的过去式和过去分词",["The fire burnt down four houses in the east of the city.","Before the fire engine arrived, the whole house had burnt down."],["火灾把位于市区东部的四栋房屋全烧光了。","消防车到达之前，房子就全烧了。"]],["ravage","'rævidʒ","n. 破坏, 蹂躏\\nv. 毁坏, 破坏, 掠夺",["War, disease, and famine continue to ravage the poverty-stricken country, despite the decades-long international effort to ameliorate the situation."],[""]],["incompetence","in'kɔmpitәns","n. 不胜任, 不够格, 不合格, 不适合, 无能力, 不熟练, 无资格\\n[医] 机能不全, 闭锁不全, 关闭不全",["Sooner or later, they'll end up paying for their incompetence.","Miroslav called Rima out on her incompetence and laziness."],["",""]],["serviceman","'s\\\\\\\\:vismәn","n. 军人, 维修人员\\n[化] 机械师; 维修人员",["I saw an injured serviceman being interviewed on TV.","The winner of the race was a retired US serviceman."],["",""]],["bearer","'bєәrә","n. 带信人, 票据持有人, 搬运者\\n[经] 持票人, 持有人, 不(无)记名",["This ticket entitles the bearer to one chocolate sundae.","This ticket entitles the bearer to one chocolate ice cream."],["",""]],["specialization",".speʃәlai'zeiʃәn","n. 专业化, 特殊化, 专门化\\n[经] 特殊化, 专门化",["A high degree of specialization is required in that company.","Other areas of specialization include toxicology, pharmacology, and physical therapy."],["",""]],["spreadsheet","'spredʃi:t","n. 空白表格程序, 电子制表软件, 电子数据表\\n[计] 电子表格",["Once you get the hang of it, spreadsheet software is really useful.","For a display where the data items increase and decrease I think you are best making use of a spreadsheet program, not Access."],["",""]],["aha","ɑ:'hɑ:","interj. 啊哈",["Aha, Bancus, I thought that the boat for carrying you were in fact sail-powered.","Aha. Today is Sunday. I've lost track of the days."],["",""]],["harp","hɑ:p","n. 竖琴\\nvi. 弹奏竖琴, 不停地说",["They could hear the elegant, flowing sound of a harp coming from somewhere.","Not to harp on the same string, I still insist that those who drink should never drive."],["",""]],["plush","plʌʃ","n. 长毛绒, 长毛绒裤\\na. 长毛绒制的, 豪华的",["The plush fur of the toy felt so soft and somehow soothing.","After the calves are weaned they are moved to the plush river-flats for fattening."],["那個玩具絨毛摸起來很柔軟，讓人感到舒適。",""]],["trimming","'trimiŋ","n. 整理, 修剪, 装饰, 点缀物, 装饰物, 修剪下来的东西, 诈骗, 击败, 殴打\\n[化] 微调",["Tom decided to try trimming his beard with a knife, but he wasn't very successful.","One of the things I love most about Christmas is trimming the tree."],["",""]],["koran","kɒ'rɑ:n","n. <<可兰经>>",["The Koran does not permit Mohammedans to drink. Their natural instincts do not permit them to be moral.","In Algeria we cure cancer and AIDS by reciting the Koran."],["",""]],["illegitimate",".ili'dʒitimәt","a. 不法的, 私生的, 不合规则的, 不合理的, 不符合习惯的\\nn. 无合法身份的人\\nvt. 宣告...为非法, 证明...为私生",["For a start, he was the illegitimate son of an unmarried mother.","The king had numerous illegitimate children with her."],["",""]],["plumber","'plʌmә","n. 水管工人\\n[法] 堵漏防漏人员",["Not only is there no God, but try getting a plumber on weekends.","The plumber pumped out the water in order to drain the pipe."],["",""]],["conceivably","kәn'si:vәbli","adv. 想得到地, 想象上, 以为",["Scientists say the so-called Super Earth is an ideal distance from its sun to conceivably harbor life."],[""]],["disqualify","dis'kwɒlifai","vt. 使不适合, 取消...资格",["If you swim incorrectly the judges will disqualify you."],[""]],["chrome","krәum","n. 铬, 铬合金\\n[医] 铬(24号元素)",["According to the latest data, the most popular internet browser in the world is Google Chrome.","You think Google Chrome takes all your RAM, wait until you see Safari."],["",""]],["itch","itʃ","n. 痒, 渴望, 疥疮\\nvi. 发痒, 渴望",["It's normal for the wound to itch. That means it's healing.","It's normal for a wound to itch. That means it's healing."],["",""]],["welsh","welʃ","a. 威尔士的\\nn. 威尔士人\\nvi. 赖赌帐, 逃避责任",["Celtic is still present in Irish, Welsh and Scottish Gaelic.","The United Kingdom is called \"Y Deyrnas Unedig\" in Welsh."],["",""]],["latent","'leitnt","a. 潜伏性的, 隐藏的\\nn. 隐约指纹",["There are many latent gays among rampant homophobes.","You have a latent problem here that will cause trouble in the future."],["",""]],["defending","diˈfendɪŋ","v. 辩护( defend的现在分词 ); 保卫; （足球、曲棍球等）防守; 进行辩护",["The most perfidious way of harming a cause consists of defending it deliberately with faulty arguments.","Robson's proposal is tantamount to defending terrorists because they have a cause."],["",""]],["formality","fɒ:'mæliti","n. 礼节, 拘谨, 正式手续\\n[化] 克式浓度",["Please, don't be concerned about it. It's just a formality.","You'll have to make a toast but it's just a formality."],["",""]],["facilitator","fә'siliteitә","n. 服务商；促进者",["The facilitator guided the group discussion."],["引導員主持小組討論。"]],["preferential",".prefә'renʃәl","a. 优先的, (关税等)优惠的\\n[经] 特惠的; 特惠关税率, 优先权",["He asked her to give him preferential treatment.","There is a preferential price for unemployed people and the elderly."],["他请求她给予优待。",""]],["wherein","hwєәr'in","adv. 在哪方面, 在那方面",["Opinion is something wherein I go about to give reason why all the world should think as I think.","Delilah said to Samson, Tell me, I pray thee, wherein thy great strength."],["",""]],["processed","","a. 处理的, 加工过的",["Any orders you place with us will be processed promptly.","Bacon is an overly processed food. It is healthier to eat a pork chop."],["",""]],["ethnically","'eθnikli","adv. 人种上, 民族上",["The Christians of Nazareth ethnically cleansed their Jewish population in the 7th century.","I have an Arabic name but I'm not ethnically Arab."],["",""]],["figurative","'figjurәtiv","a. 比喻的, 象征的, 修饰丰富的",["The figurative meaning is no longer in current use.","In both the literal and figurative sense a donkey is hardier than a horse."],["",""]],["spectral","'spektrәl","a. 光谱的, 鬼怪的, 幻觉的\\n[医] 光谱的",["They all agreed that it was a huge creature, luminous, ghastly, and spectral.","Alpha Centauri A is the same spectral type as, and similar in size to the Sun."],["",""]],["clamor","'klæmә","n. 喧闹, 叫嚷, 大声的要求\\nv. 喧嚷, 大声地要求",["The cliff collapsed, the rocks split, and the empty sky filled with a noisy clamor.","Dozens of injured protesters were taken to hospitals amid the heat and clamor."],["",""]],["logistical","lə'dʒɪstɪkl","a. 逻辑的; 后勤方面的",["Algeria should become an important logistical center.","Algeria is trying to become an important logistical hub in Africa."],["",""]],["waterproof","'wɒtәpru:f","n. 防水材料\\na. 不透水的, 防水的\\nvt. 使防水",["Waterproof features would be a plus.","The young campers were kitted out with new waterproof jackets."],["防水功能可以加分。",""]],["workstation","'wә:k.steiʃәn","n. 工作站\\n[计] 工作站",["After a week in Bir town, he went to a homestay in Pulga village where his workstation was often a bench under a fruit-laden tree.","Tom's workstation is usually tidier than Mary's."],["",""]],["unwelcome","ʌn'welkәm","a. 不受欢迎的, 讨厌的\\nn. 冷淡\\nvt. 冷淡地对待, 冷淡地接受",["The English teacher ridiculed the foreign students' cultural differences, making them feel unwelcome.","Billy's negative comments make non-native speakers feel unwelcome and discouraged."],["",""]],["instill","in'stil","vt. 滴注, 慢慢地灌输",["We must instill patriotism into the young people of today.","The best way to instill an idea in other people is to make them believe that it comes from themselves."],["",""]],["sequential","si'kwenʃәl","a. 继续的, 后果的\\n[计] 顺序的",["The team of researchers recorded the springtime soundscape of northern Alaska for five sequential years.","Will there be a sequential translation into other languages?"],["",""]],["pumping","'pʌmpiŋ","n. 抽水, 泵送\\n[化] 抽运",["The candidates are out kissing babies and pumping hands.","She said she stopped using her car Monday after a futile attempt to buy fuel at a pumping station."],["",""]],["desolate","'desәlәt","a. 荒凉的",["Yanni's restaurant was oddly desolate for lunch time.","If one does not have a hobby, his life may be desolate."],["",""]],["shrill","ʃril","n. 尖声\\na. 尖锐的, 刺耳的\\nvt. 尖声说出\\nvi. 发出刺耳声",["I was walking along the crowded street when all at once I heard a shrill cry.","All at once she began to shout in a shrill voice."],["我在人來人往的街道上走著，突然聽見一下尖銳的叫聲。","突然間她開始用尖銳的聲音大喊。"]],["skew","skju:","a. 斜的, 歪的\\nn. 歪斜, 偏态家庭关系\\nvi. 歪斜, 侧转\\nvt. 使歪斜, 曲解\\n[计] 扭斜; 歪斜; 偏斜",["Despite Republican propaganda to the contrary, people making under $50,000 per year still skew overwhelmingly Democratic."],[""]],["disarray",".disә'rei","vt. 弄乱, 使混乱, 使脱去衣服\\nn. 无秩序, 杂乱, 不整齐的衣着",["After all the merrymaking, the apartment was in great disarray.","We have far more to fear from a functional dictatorship than from one in disarray."],["",""]],["torment","'tɒ:ment","n. 使人痛苦的东西, 折磨者, 苦痛\\nvt. 使苦恼, 纠缠, 歪曲, 拷问",["Bad children love to torment animals.","Poetry is not just torment; poetry is love. It is warm and sensual passion; it is revolution, romance and tenderness."],["坏孩子们喜欢虐待动物。",""]],["jesuit","'dʒezjuit","n. 耶稣会信徒, 阴险的人, 阴谋家",["Gabriel was a Jesuit leader."],[""]],["dissolution",".disә'lu:ʃәn","n. 分解, 溶解, 解散, 结束\\n[化] 溶解; 溶解作用",["Justice without mercy is cruelty; mercy without justice is the mother of dissolution.","Tom and Mary announced the dissolution of their marriage."],["",""]],["retaliate","ri'tælieit","vt. 报复, 回敬\\nvi. 报复, 以牙还牙",["If you're going to say it, you have to say it with force, and take away your opponent's ability to retaliate.","How can you be so passive? Why don't you retaliate?"],["要说，就要说得有力量，使对方失去反驳的能力。",""]],["meteorite","'mi:tiәrait","n. 陨星\\n[化] 陨石; 陨铁",["A meteorite is what a meteor is called once it lands on Earth.","When I was in high school, I wished every day that a meteorite would fall."],["",""]],["muffled","","a. 听不清的；蒙住的",["It was the sob of a woman, the muffled, strangling gasp of one who is torn by an uncontrollable sorrow.","The voice on the loudspeaker was too muffled to understand."],["",""]],["wee","wi:","a. 很小的, 微小的\\nn. 一点点",["I'm bursting for a wee and I can't find a washroom.","She liked men, if truth were told, a tiny wee bit more than women."],["",""]],["impersonal","im'pә:sәnәl","a. 客观的, 和个人无关的, 没有人情味的, 非人称的\\nn. 非人称动词(或代词)",["It's so impersonal."],[""]],["whiff","hwif","n. 一吹, 一吸, 一阵, 一点点, 一口烟\\nvi. 轻轻地吹, 喷气, 三击不中出局, 垂钓\\nvt. 吹送, 喷出, 吸, 使三击…",["He had a whiff at my fart and fanned it back to me.","Scratching his armpit and giving his finger a whiff, Tom jolted away from his hand."],["",""]],["summertime","'sʌmәtaim","n. 全盛时期, 夏季",["Yanni usually left the door open in the summertime.","A parasol is used during the summertime to shade the face."],["",""]],["ashtray","'æʃtrei","n. 烟灰缸",["Kissing a person who smokes is like licking an ashtray.","Kissing a smoker is like licking an ashtray."],["亲吻一个抽烟的人就像在舔烟灰缸。","亲吻一个抽烟的人就像在舔烟灰缸。"]],["prophetic","prә'fetik","a. 预言的, 先知的, 预示的",["However, it would be nice if it doesn't become a prophetic dream.","That's a book of incredible prophetic power."],["",""]],["momentary","'mәumәntәri","a. 瞬间的, 刹那间的",["Victory attained by violence is tantamount to a defeat, for it is momentary.","There was a momentary lull in the violence as the leaders of the two sides parleyed."],["靠武力取勝，猶如落敗，因為這樣的勝利不會長久。",""]],["sculpt","skʌlpt","v. 雕刻, 造型",["Some come to paint or sculpt; others want to examine the art of poetry and storytelling, while those with cinematic interests aspire to find a niche in New Mexico's thriving film business."],[""]],["creed","kri:d","n. 宗教信条, 教义, 纲领",["The laws apply to everyone irrespective of race, creed or color.","His creed was one of works rather than of words, and whatever he was doing he did it with his whole heart."],["",""]],["misuse",".mis'ju:z","n. 误用, 滥用\\nvt. 误用, 滥用, 虐待",["Antimicrobial resistance is growing because of the widespread abuse and misuse of antibiotics.","Misuse of prepositions can make a situation hilarious."],["",""]],["hangar","'hæŋә","n. 棚厂, 飞机库",["Two airplanes, one large and one small, were at rest in the hangar.","Two aeroplanes, one large and one small, were parked in the hangar."],["",""]],["suspiciously","","adv. 猜疑地；怀疑地",["Tom looked at the tall man suspiciously.","A man was seen acting suspiciously shortly before the explosion."],["汤姆用怀疑的目光盯着那个高个子男人。",""]],["pervade","pә'veid","vt. 弥漫于, 遍及于, 流行于, 蔓延, 渗透于, 充满",["Science and technology have come to pervade every aspect of our lives and, as a result, society is changing at a speed which is quite unprecedented."],[""]],["relaxing","","a. 令人轻松的",["There is nothing as relaxing as lying in a hot bath.","I'd love to be able to find more time that I could spend relaxing."],["世上沒有甚麼東西比泡熱水浴更舒服的了。",""]],["amino","'æminәu","a. 氨基的\\n[医] 氨基",["Proteins are chains of amino acids that are folded like origami paper.","Every protein is a polymer composed of units called amino acids."],["",""]],["seamless","'si:mlis","a. 无缝的, 无缝合线的\\n[医] 无缝的",["The married couple was able to run this store with their seamless teamwork."],[""]],["unimaginable",".ʌni'mædʒinәbl","a. 不能想象的, 不可思议的",["This situation is truly unimaginable.","The pain she suffered while being tortured was unimaginable."],["这件事情真是太不可思议了。",""]],["polity","'pɒliti","n. 政体, 国体, 政治组织\\n[法] 政府, 政治制度, 政治形态",["Maratha polity consisted of a decentralised confederacy of various states.","Has there been a polity which has instituted a democratic form of communism, rather than authoritarian?"],["",""]],["negligible","'neglidʒәbl","a. 可以忽略的, 不足取的, 无用的\\n[医] 可不计的, 可忽视的",["Mineral deposits are negligible; the country has no known petroleum deposits.","There's a debate about social disparity throughout Japan, but if you look at the world, this level of disparity is negligible."],["",""]],["poppy","'pɒpi","n. 罂粟\\n[医] 罂粟",["Poppy seed muffins are her favorites, but there are days when she must settle for blueberry.","Although the poppy flower has a beautiful color, it has an unpleasant smell."],["",""]],["arcade","ɑ:'keid","n. 拱廊, 拱形建筑物, 有拱廊的街道\\n[医] 弓形组织, 连拱",["Real-time strategy games usually include arcade elements.","The shopping arcade was covered with lots of paper decorations."],["即時策略遊戲通常會融入街機元素。",""]],["mythic","'miθik","a. 神话的, 存在于神话中的, 神话式的, 不真实的, 虚构的, 幻想出来的",["Most of these who are thrust into combat soon find it impossible to maintain the mythic perception of war."],[""]],["conduit","'kɒndit","n. 导管, 水管, 沟渠\\n[电] 导管",["The screams are harmonic tremors, and researchers at the University of Washington believe they are caused when magma is forced through a narrow conduit at greater and greater pressure into the heart of the volcano."],[""]],["seeming","'si:miŋ","a. 表面上的\\nn. 外观",["They're failing to give off the impression of seeming scary but actually being a good person.","He knew how to gladhand executives without seeming too obvious."],["",""]],["suspense","sә'spens","n. 悬疑, 焦虑, 悬念, 悬而不决\\n[经] 未定, 暂记",["Readers had been waiting in suspense for at least three months before they got an answer.","The two part episode's cliffhanger had me in suspense."],["",""]],["grapefruit","'greipfru:t","n. 葡萄轴",["Some people think that eating grapefruit with every meal will help you lose weight.","I usually drink grapefruit juice with my breakfast."],["有些人認為吃飯的時候吃葡萄柚會有助於減肥。",""]],["anesthesia",".ænis'θi:ziә","n. 麻醉, 麻木\\n[化] 麻醉; 失去知觉",["The hospital patient dropped off shortly after the doctor injected him with anesthesia.","Now you're going to receive some local anesthesia."],["",""]],["strait","streit","n. 海峡, 困境\\na. 困难的, 窘迫的, 狭窄的",["The secret police forced Ron into a musty, white strait-jacket and carted him off to the nearest asylum.","At its narrowest, the Strait of Gibraltar is 14.3 kilometres wide."],["",""]],["handout","'hændaut","n. 施舍物, 救济品, 分发的印刷品资料, 广告物品",["We take pride in being self-sufficient. We don't want a permanent handout.","The poor man was looking for a handout."],["",""]],["tuxedo","tʌk'si:dәu","n. 无尾礼服, 男小礼服",["Tom said that he was planning to wear a black tuxedo.","Then he bought a black tuxedo suit for the theater, a warm winter coat, a red bathrobe, and the finest silk underclothes."],["",""]],["analytic",".ænә'litik","a. 分析的, 善于分析的, 解析的\\n[医] 分析的",["Filtered back projection is an analytic reconstruction algorithm designed to overcome the limitations of conventional back projection."],[""]],["sexism","'seksizm","n. 性别歧视, 歧视女性",["The tide of public opinion is turning against sexism.","It's a period drama about sexism and greed in the workplace."],["",""]],["ram","ræm","n. 公羊, 撞锤\\nvi. 猛击, 撞\\nvt. 猛击, 填塞, 反复灌输\\nn. 只读内存, 随机存取内存, 随机存取存储器\\n[计]…",["My PC with 16 gigs of RAM can't handle my next-level multitasking.","The police used a battering ram to break down the door."],["我的電腦有 16GB 的 RAM，無法滿足我的高階多工需求。",""]],["artichoke","'ɑ:titʃәuk","n. 朝鲜蓟\\n[医] 朝鲜蓟",["Tom says that he has never eaten an artichoke.","This style of pizza uses tomato sauce and is usually topped with traditional Greek favorites like kalamata olives, artichoke hearts and feta cheese."],["",""]],["lapel","lә'pel","n. 翻领",["A collar may come in many varieties, from button-down to clerical, and Mandarin to Masonic, but it is never a lapel.","She fastened the medal on the lapel with a pin."],["",""]],["literate","'litәrit","n. 学者\\na. 有读写能力的, 精通文学的, 受过教育的",["We're in the Boreal forest of Canada, and we've uncovered a civilization of literate caterpillars.","An illiterate man was fair game for the literate exploiters who contributed to his domination."],["",""]],["papal","'peipl","a. 罗马教皇的, 教皇制度的",["Papal Audiences are held on Wednesdays if the Pope is in Rome.","Everyone on the papal plane has been vaccinated against COVID-19."],["",""]],["endemic","en'demik","n. 地方病\\na. 某地(或某些人中)流行的, 地方的",["It was discovered that less than one child in a hundred had been inoculated against endemic disease.","Experts say many people in Zanzibar and other parasite-endemic regions are usually infected with more than one type of worm."],["",""]],["rapport","ræ'pɒ:","n. 关系, 融洽, 一致\\n[医] 关系, 协调(病人与医师间), 感通(唯心的灵交术时)",["Professor Jefferson has a good rapport with his students.","I would like to get a feel for your rapport with the customer."],["",""]],["awakening","ә'weikәniŋ","n. 唤醒, 觉醒, 被唤起\\na. 觉醒中的",["The night eye caught all, whilst the king slept. Upon awakening he was informed of the treachery afoot.","What's essential in education is not the doctrine that is taught, it's the awakening."],["",""]],["resin","'rezin","n. 树脂\\nvt. 涂树脂于",["I'm always wondering what the difference is between resin and sap.","Bird lime accumulates on the boughs, which also seep gum, resin, pitch etcetera."],["",""]],["masked","mæskt","a. 戴假面具的, 隐现的, 伪装的\\n[医] 掩蔽的, 隐蔽的",["Two masked men held up the jewelry store last night.","Masked men held up the passengers and robbed them of their money."],["",""]],["spirited","'spiritid","a. 有精神的, 活泼的, 生气勃勃的",["He was spirited away by four police officers in the middle of the night.","I must admit that his hateful act towards you was pretty mean-spirited."],["",""]],["fresco","'freskәu","n. 湿壁画, 湿壁画技法\\nvt. 作湿壁画于",["A fresco was found under a layer of plaster.","Even if Smither can safely determine the mural is there, would da Vinci's \"Battle of Anghiari\" ever see light of day without damaging the Vasari fresco standing in front of it?"],["",""]],["parity","'pærәti","n. 同等, 同位, 平价, 奇偶性\\n[计] 奇偶性",["I hope that there will be parity amongst people someday.","Women will never gain parity with men in a field that few women wish to enter."],["",""]],["stupidity","stju:'piditi","n. 愚蠢, 糊涂事\\n[医] 迟钝",["Only two things are infinite, the universe and human stupidity, and I'm not sure about the former.","Never attribute to malice that which is adequately explained by stupidity."],["世界上只有两个东西是无限的，一为宇宙，一为人类的愚蠢，我所不能肯定的乃是前者。","能解釋為愚蠢的，就不要解釋為惡意。"]],["compulsion","kәm'pʌlʃәn","n. 强迫, 强制\\n[医] 强迫",["The hardness of God is kinder than the softness of men, and His compulsion is our liberation.","He was not sure he could fight the compulsion to run."],["",""]],["fender","'fendә","n. 防卫物, 挡泥板",["There were no damages to the cars involved in the fender bender.","I had a fender bender on my way to work."],["",""]],["gilded","'gildid","a. 镀金的, 有钱的, 装饰的\\ngild的过去式和过去分词",["While the rest of us work hard, the robber barons eat with gilded utensils.","The noble lady drove by towards the baron's mansion with her three daughters, in a gilded carriage drawn by six horses."],["當我們其他人辛苦工作時，強盜貴族卻用鍍金餐具吃飯。",""]],["windfall","'windfɒ:l","n. 被风吹落的果子, 横财\\n[经] 意外损失",["The unexpected windfall has put my brother and his wife on easy street.","They received a windfall as recompense for false imprisonment, but it doesn't even begin to make up for lost time."],["",""]],["feeble","fi:bl","a. 微弱的, 衰弱的, 无效的\\n[医] 无力的, 衰弱的",["The old lady has been rather feeble since her illness.","The feeble patient is suffering from stomach cancer."],["",""]],["devotee",".devә'ti:","n. 爱好者, 献身者, 虔诚的宗教信徒",["He was a staunch devotee who had unflinching faith.","The syncretist, the mystic, the devotee, the puritan, would find a congenial climate in these regions of Asia Minor."],["",""]],["stinging","'stiŋiŋ","a. 刺人的, 刺一般的, 激烈的",["Don't fear the stinging of the thorns if you want to break the rose.","The little mermaid drank the burning, stinging draught, and it was like a sharp two-edged sword running through her tender frame."],["",""]],["disintegration","dis.inti'greiʃәn","n. 瓦解\\n[化] 破碎; 崩解; 蜕变",["Some think that disintegration is unavoidable in Algeria.","I have no respect for a person who calls for the disintegration of our beloved Algeria."],["",""]],["religiously","","adv. 虔诚而经常地, 笃诚地",["Ordener religiously pressed this gift from his beloved against his lips.","He said he was Muslim culturally but not religiously."],["",""]],["instrumentation",".instrumen'teiʃәn","n. 乐器法, 仪器制造学, 仪表化\\n[医] 器械用法, 器械操作法",["Astral projection augmented by sophisticated instrumentation became utilized for exploration of distant parts of the universe."],[""]],["supplant","sә'plɑ:nt","vt. 排挤掉, 代替",["Christianity's main connection to Judaism throughout history has been its attempt to eradicate and supplant it.","The computer has already surpassed man in the ability to play chess. And it won't take long to supplant them in the domain of languages as well."],["",""]],["deterrence","di'tә:rәns","n. 威慑, 威慑力量\\n[法] 威慑力量, 制止物",["Strategic nuclear arms are only there for deterrence.","They're desperately trying to reestablish deterrence."],["",""]],["gallop","'gælәp","n. 疾驰, 飞奔\\nvi. 飞驰, 急速进行, 急急忙忙地说\\nvt. 使飞跑, 迅速运输",["As usual I run down the steps and gallop to class.","Horses have three modes of locomotion: Walk, trot and gallop."],["",""]],["obituary","ә'bitjuәri","a. 关于死亡的, 讣告的\\nn. 讣告",["Tom Jackson's obituary said that he was born in Boston.","I never wanted to see anybody die, but there are a few obituary notices I have read with pleasure."],["",""]],["diagonal","dai'ægәnl","a. 对角线的, 斜的, 斜纹的\\nn. 对角线, 斜线, 斜列",["Oleg walked in a diagonal manner across the field to try and cut us off.","A diagonal matrix is positive semidefinite if and only if all of its elements are nonnegative."],["",""]],["tonic","'tɒnik","n. 补药, (音乐)主调音或基音\\na. 滋补的, 声调的, 使精神振作的",["She said that a good gin and tonic is like summertime in a glass, and it struck me as being too true.","Tom ordered a beer for himself and a gin tonic for Mary."],["",""]],["oppressed","","a. 受压制的, 受压迫的",["Women across time periods and geographical locations have been oppressed in many aspects of life.","But the more they oppressed them, the more they were multiplied and increased."],["",""]],["mammogram","'mæmә,^ræm","[医] 乳房X线照片",["It's recommended that you get a mammogram every year."],[""]],["rarity","'rєәrәti","n. 稀罕, 罕有, 珍奇, 稀薄",["Because of their rarity, pandas have become a world treasure.","Pictures and prints which even my unpractised eyes could recognize as being of great price and rarity hung thick upon the walls."],["熊猫因为它们的稀有而成为了世界的宝藏。",""]],["antler","'æntlә","n. 鹿角",["I found a deer antler walking in the forest."],[""]],["nobility","nәu'biliti","n. 贵族, 高尚, 贵族阶级",["The service nobility was a pillar of the Prussian state.","It is sometimes said that nobility have blue blood."],["",""]],["sexist","'seksist","n. 性别歧视者",["That's not what I meant. I'm not being sexist. Men and women are just different.","His sexist slur was broadcasted across the country."],["",""]],["metropolis","mi'trɒpәlis","n. 大都市, 重要中心, 首府\\n[医] 产地, 生地",["A recent survey reveals that the population density in the metropolis is decreasing.","A recent survey revealed that the population density in the metropolis was decreasing."],["",""]],["rudimentary","ru:di'mentәri","a. 基本的, 起码的, 初步的, 发展不完全的, 残留的, 退化的\\n[医] 原基的, 未成熟的; 残遗的, 已退化的",["Digital cameras aren't as good as rudimentary cameras.","She has a rudimentary grasp of the Berber language."],["",""]],["onward","'ɒnwәd","a. 向前的, 前进的\\nadv. 向前, 前进, 在先",["Onward it came, smooth-sliding on the ground, / an, beetling, o'er the midmost city frowned.","From that day onward, Saul considered David his enemy."],["",""]],["battleground","'bætlgraund","n. 战场, 战地",["Fadil and Layla's married life was a battleground.","Mail-in ballots are still being counted in key battleground states."],["",""]],["inequity","in'ekwiti","n. 不公平, 不公正",["The report highlights the inequity in school funding."],["報告凸顯教育經費的不公平。"]],["affectionate","ә'fekʃәnәt","a. 深情的, 充满情爱的",["My father was no less affectionate and tender to me than my mother was.","He's always been very affectionate with his in-laws."],["我爸爸对我的爱和照顾不比我妈妈少。",""]],["mite","mait","n. 尽绵薄之力的捐献, 细微, 微少, 螨\\n[医] 螨",["Now, plans are in the works to create a new service that breeders can use to check their bees' mettle against this parasitic mite.","Ziri has a spider mite infestation."],["",""]],["counteract",".kauntә'rækt","vt. 抵消, 阻碍, 中和\\n[法] 抵抗, 阻碍, 抵销",["To counteract calcification, do mental gymnastics at Tatoeba.","Reality and dreams counteract each other."],["",""]],["vignette","vi'njet","n. 装饰图案；小插图",["Each vignette adds something distinct to the film.","A vignette is a short written description or a brief scene in a movie or play."],["",""]],["morgue","mɔ:^","n. 陈尸所\\n[医] 停尸室",["The doctor sent the live patient to the morgue.","Tom's body is probably already resting in the morgue."],["医生在患者还活着的时候就把他送入了太平间。",""]],["detached","di'tætʃt","a. 超然的, 分离的, 冷淡的\\n[法] 分遣的, 派遣的, 分离的",["The beautiful red leaves of the maple become detached from the branches and are dancing in the wind.","Mennad was emotionally detached from his siblings."],["楓樹美麗的紅葉從枝頭飄落，在風中翩翩起舞。",""]],["sesame","'sesәmi","n. 芝麻\\n[医] 芝麻, 脂麻, 胡麻",["I ordered a sesame seed buns for the veggie burgers.","Matthew's stir-fry sauce recipe included garlic powder, sesame oil, and soy sauce."],["我點了一份芝麻麵包，用來製作素食漢堡。",""]],["clutter","'klʌtә","n. 杂乱\\nvt. 弄乱, 使凌乱",["Organize your desk and keep it clutter-free for a productive study space.","There's too much clutter in the house now that we have two kids."],["",""]],["sill","sil","n. 基石, 槛, 窗台, 岩床, 海底山脊, 梁",["One day, Tom put a bowl of grain on the window sill to feed the birds, but instead, squirrels came.","Yuri was sitting on his window sill with a cup of coffee in his hand."],["",""]],["burrow","'bʌrәu","n. 洞穴, 藏身处\\nvi. 掘洞穴, 躲藏\\nvt. 掘, 打洞",["The aardvark has powerful limbs and sharp claws so it can burrow into earth at high speed.","Disturbed away from its burrow, the aardvark can escape its enemies by digging at incredible speed."],["",""]],["delinquency","di'liŋkwәnsi","n. 行为不良, 失职\\n[经] 毁约, 怠工, 旷职",["Recently juvenile delinquency has been on the rise.","Juvenile delinquency has been on the rise recently."],["",""]],["vascular","'væskjulә","a. 血管的, 维管的\\n[医] 血管的, 脉管的",["Coated vascular stents didn't prove their superiority over bare metal vascular stents.","Many types of vascular diseases are identified by their affects on blood flow in the hands and legs."],["",""]],["duet","dju:'et","n. 二重奏",["The sisters played a duet on the violin and piano.","The musicians performed passionately, exchanging melodies fluidly as they went through their duet."],["",""]],["airtight","'єәtait","a. 气密的, 不透气的, 无懈可击的\\n[机] 气密, 不透气",["Tom doesn't have an airtight alibi.","If your windows are not airtight, moisture will seep in."],["湯姆沒有無懈可擊的不在場證明。",""]],["cove","kәuv","n. 山凹, 小湾\\nv. (使)内凹, (使)成拱形",["Down the coast from the shingle beach was a secluded cove.","Mrs. Spencer lived in a big yellow house at White Sands Cove."],["",""]],["camouflage","'kæmuflɑ:ʒ","vt. 伪装, 掩饰\\nn. 伪装, 伪装物, 幌子",["This species of moth has evolved an ingenious camouflage for blending into its surroundings.","Giraffes spend most of their day in the safety of cover, relying on camouflage to escape their predators."],["",""]],["replenish","ri'pleniʃ","vt. 把...重新补足, 把...再装满\\nvi. 被再装满, 充满",["He wanted to replenish the stock as soon as possible.","Dead tongues, Greek and Latin, have been revived to replenish our verbal population with the terms needed for the sciences."],["",""]],["tango","'tæŋgәu","n. 探戈舞, 探戈舞曲\\nvi. 跳探戈舞",["Tango is the vertical expression of a horizontal desire.","Tango is the vertical expression of horizontal desire."],["",""]],["dynamite","'dainәmait","n. 炸药\\nvt. 炸毁, 破坏",["Giant clam harvesting, added to use of cyanide and dynamite bombing for fish, damaged coral reefs last year, the analysts said.","Dynamite fishing is extremely destructive to reef ecosystems."],["",""]],["agitate","'ædʒiteit","vt. 使摇动, 搅动, 使激动, 使不安\\nvi. 鼓动, 煽动",["They sent agents to agitate the local people.","Now is not the time to agitate the hornet's nest."],["",""]],["utterance","'ʌtәrәns","n. 发声, 言辞, 表达, 说话的方式, 死\\n[医] 发言, 言语, 语调",["Don't overanalyze it, it's just a ready-made utterance.","Tom has naturally a very agreeable voice and utterance."],["",""]],["biomedical",",baiәu'medikәl","a. 生物医学",["I'm going to give a paper at this year's conference on biomedical ethics.","I specialize in research on video games and mental health, but I'm trained in a wide variety of biomedical research methods."],["",""]],["proficient","prә'fiʃәnt","n. 高手, 专家\\na. 精通的, 熟练的",["Proficient in English, he is looked on as a good teacher.","The international situation had become so tense, it would require proficient diplomats to handle it with kid gloves."],["",""]],["bluntly","'blʌntli","adv. 坦率地, 率直地",["Mary bluntly rejected Tom's request.","There are too many demonstrative pronouns. To put it bluntly, it couldn't be harder to understand."],["玛丽直截了当地拒绝了汤姆的请求。",""]],["trolley","'trɒli","n. 电车, 手推车, 台车\\nvt. 用手推车运\\nvi. 乘电车",["Tom filled the shopping trolley with sweets while his mother stood at the meat counter.","Tom queued behind an old biddy with a full trolley."],["",""]],["hardened","'hɑ:dәnd","a. 变硬的；坚定的",["And Pharaoh's heart was hardened, and he did not hearken to them, as the Lord had commanded.","And the Lord said to Moses: Pharaoh's heart is hardened, he will not let the people go."],["",""]],["requisite","'rekwizit","n. 必需品, 要素, 必要物品\\na. 必要的, 需要的",["I won't be able to go travelling until the requisite visa fees are paid.","The car had the requisite tail fins that you would expect from that era."],["",""]],["incarceration","in.kɑ:sә'reiʃәn","n. 下狱, 监禁, 禁闭\\n[医] 箝闭",["The U.S. incarceration rate is the highest in the world.","Yanni was trapped in a circle of addiction and incarceration."],["",""]],["biceps","'baiseps","n. 二头肌, 臂部肌肉\\n[医] 二头的, 二头肌",["The hamstring muscles include the biceps femoris, the semitendinosus and the semimembranosus.","When men go to the gym it seems they really work their biceps."],["",""]],["prized","","a. 被看作最有价值的",["The wood of trees in the pine family is much prized for construction and furniture making.","So-called regional specialities are things prized by out-of-towners but spurned by locals."],["松科樹木的木材因其優良的品質，在建築和家具製造領域備受推崇。","所谓特产，就是外地人奉之为宝，本地人嗤之以鼻的东西。"]],["bent","bent","a. 弯曲的, 决心的\\nn. 爱好\\nbend的过去式和过去分词",["I bent over to pick up my pen which had fallen on the floor.","He bent over backward to please his wife."],["我俯身撿起了掉在地上的筆。","他竭尽全力地讨好他老婆。"]],["hectic","'hektik","a. 脸上发红, 发热的, 潮热的, 肺病的\\nn. 脸红, 潮热病人",["Tom tried intermittent fasting, but his job was too hectic to allow it.","She has used TikTok to document her experience in quarantine, which she has described as more boring than hectic."],["",""]],["nonstop","nɒn'stɒp","a. 直达的, 不着陆的, 不休息的\\nadv. 不休息地\\nn. 直达车, 直达行驶",["To have someone you can vent to nonstop, saying absolutely anything on your mind, this is rarer than anything else.","He's got pneumonia. No wonder he is coughing nonstop."],["能向别人自顾自地单向倾诉、想说什么就说什么，这比什么都难得。","他得了肺炎，难怪他在不停的咳嗽。"]],["polarize","'pәulәraiz","v. (使)偏振, (使)极化, (使)两极分化",["Use of such divisive language tends to polarize the public.","The strong sentiments the candidate voiced only served to polarize his constituency."],["",""]],["quirk","kwә:k","n. 古怪举动, 俏皮话, 急转",["A quirk of the software was that it had to be restarted after every new entry.","The fact that the money came just then was a quirk of fate."],["",""]],["undress",".ʌn'dres","vt. 使脱衣服, 暴露, 使卸去装饰\\nvi. 脱衣服",["Tom began to undress, but then noticed that the curtain was open, so he went over to close it.","Why are you so reluctant to undress in front of other people?. We're at the beach."],["",""]],["lovingly","'lʌviŋli","adv. 钟爱地, 亲切地",["Then she, while he was bathing, took his dress and donned it after kissing it lovingly.","The kids asked Ziri for sweets and he reacted lovingly."],["",""]],["stagnant","'stægnәnt","a. 不流动的, 停滞的, 不景气的, 萧条的, 污浊的, 迟钝的\\n[经] 萧条的",["I always have to check my yard for stagnant pools of water so mosquitoes don't breed there.","Stagnant water is a breeding ground for mosquitoes."],["",""]],["gorge","gɒ:dʒ","n. 峡谷, 凹槽, 塞饱, 咽喉\\nvi. 狼吞虎咽\\nvt. 塞饱, 狼吞虎咽地吃",["Ironbridge Gorge is a Unesco world heritage site.","An old, rickety footbridge is the only way to get to the other side of the gorge."],["鐵橋峽谷是聯合國教科文組織世界遺產。",""]],["earned","ә:nd","a. 挣得的",["You've worked hard for months and have certainly earned a holiday.","Tom worked very hard and earned a lot of money."],["你已經辛苦地工作好幾個月了, 當然可以休假。","汤姆努力工作挣了好多钱。"]],["exude","ig'zju:d","v. (使)流出, (使)渗出",["During mating season many animals exude strong fragrances.","Anna's striking almond-shaped eyes, inherited from her Asian lineage, exude a captivating depth and a hint of mystery."],["很多動物會在交配季節釋放出很強的氣味。","安娜引人注目的杏仁狀眼睛繼承了她的亞洲血統，散發著迷人的深度和一絲神秘感。"]],["litany","'litәni","n. 连祷, 连续",["A litany of taste tests enabled Hugo to distinguish between a variety of pastes.","The defendant is being accused of a litany of criminal and civil offenses."],["",""]],["detour","'di:tuә","n. 绕路, 迂回\\nv. (使)绕道",["If a high hill stood between A and B, it was important to decide whether the line should climb over it, pierce it with a tunnel, or make a detour to avoid it.","We had to make a detour across a bridge down the river from here."],["假設 A 和 B 之間有一座高山，那就要考慮一下，路線應該越過高山、穿過高山，還是直接從山旁繞過呢？",""]],["regal","'ri:gl","a. 帝王的, 适于帝王的",["The crowd parted as William walked through, his regal demeanor commanding respect.","Meanwhile with regal splendour they arrayed / the palace-hall, where feast and banquet high / all in the centre of the space is laid."],["",""]],["concussion","kәn'kʌʃәn","n. 剧烈摇动, 震荡\\n[医] 震荡",["A new blood test can tell doctors whether a person has suffered a concussion up to a week after he or she was injured.","Ziri is still suffering from long-term concussion symptoms."],["",""]],["solemnly","","adv. 庄严地；严肃地",["All graduates solemnly received their graduation certificates.","Grab me a Bible and watch me solemnly swear not to hit you over the head with it."],["",""]],["campground","'kæmpɡrәund","n. 露营场所；野营地",["It was still early in the day when Tom arrived at the campground.","There's a small campground on the south shore of the lake."],["",""]],["interdependence",".intәdi'pendәns.-dәnsi","n. 互相依赖",["Human interdependence is our only way to survive."],[""]],["accrue","ә'kru:","vi. 自然增加, 产生\\n[经] 应计, 产生, 出现",["Many advantages accrue to society from the freedom of speech.","Benefits accrue to the community from reconstruction."],["",""]],["magnesium","mæg'ni:ziәm","n. 镁\\n[化] 镁Mg",["Powders of aluminium, magnesium, silicon, etc. explode.","Beryllium, magnesium, calcium, strontium, barium and radium are alkaline earth metals."],["",""]],["aforementioned","ә'fɒ:.menʃәnd","a. 上述的, 前述的\\n[法] 前面提到过的, 前述的",["This sentence exemplifies the way in which the aforementioned expression has come to be completely divorced from its root.","Tom proposed to Mary on the aforementioned afternoon, but she rejected him."],["",""]],["evangelist","i'vændʒilist","n. 福音传道者, 圣经新约福音书的作者",["The tele-evangelist has a large, if deluded, following.","Many of Tom's friends think he'll likely become an evangelist."],["",""]],["proton","'prәutɒn","n. 质子\\n[化] 质子",["An hydrogen atom only has one proton and one electron.","The nucleus of a hydrogen atom consists of a single proton. Around this proton orbits a single electron."],["",""]],["crimson","'krimzәn","n. 深红色\\na. 深红色的\\nv. (使)变为深红色, 脸红",["Thoreau coveted the plant's strong purple stalk for a cane, and the robins eat its dark crimson-juiced berries.","In the evening, the crimson sphere of the sun descends beyond the haze of the horizon."],["梭羅垂涎於這種植物強壯的紫色莖稈，將其製成藤條，而知更鳥則以深紅色汁液的漿果為食。",""]],["fable","'feibl","n. 寓言, 神话, 谎言\\nvi. 虚构, 作寓言",["\"Drawing dragons and dotting in the eyes\" is a fable.","The following passage is a quotation from a well-known fable."],["画龙点睛是一则寓言故事。",""]],["fourteenth","'fɒ:'ti:nθ","num. 第十四, 十四分之一",["The killer has just taken his fourteenth victim, and we still have no lead on his identity.","Skimmed milk is the fourteenth item on my shopping list."],["",""]],["illustrator","'ilәstreitә","n. 插画家, 图解者, 说明者",["My older sister says it's her dream to become a pro illustrator.","I have the draft ready, but I still need an illustrator."],["",""]],["tubing","'tju:biŋ","n. 管料, 管道系统, 管状组织\\n[化] 管工; 管材; 管线; 管道; 管道系统; 铺设管道",["You can soften dialysis tubing by soaking it in water.","Today, the river is popular for canoeing and salmon fishing, and tubing."],["",""]],["gull","gʌl","n. 鸥, 易受骗之人, 呆子\\nvt. 欺诈, 骗",["A beautiful gull flies over the sea.","One great grey bird, a gull or curlew, soared aloft in the blue heaven. He and I seemed to be the only living things between the huge arch of the sky and the desert beneath it."],["",""]],["migratory","'maigrәtәri","a. 迁移的, 流浪的",["Most migratory birds don't get why, once they've flown south, they don't just stay there.","The swallows are migratory birds which arrive in autumn."],["",""]],["earmark","'iәmɑ:k","n. 耳上记号, 特征, 记号, 标记\\nvt. 在耳朵上做记号, 标记, 指定...作特定用途",["The highway construction project received a $500,000 earmark from the federal government."],[""]],["finnish","'finiʃ","n. 芬兰语\\na. 芬兰的, 芬兰人的, 芬兰语的",["I got pregnant from the Finnish harpist that I told you about last night.","Most of the Finnish people are very friendly to Chinese people."],["我跟那個芬蘭豎琴手懷孕了，他就是我昨晚告訴你的那個人。","绝大多数芬兰人对中国人非常友好。"]],["grimly","'grimli","adv. 严格地, 冷酷地, 可怕地",["\"She'll stay in her room until she confesses,\" said Marilla grimly.","The man smiled grimly, and brought a hatchet and a club."],["",""]],["potassium","pә'tæsiәm","n. 钾\\n[化] 钾K",["Potassium, heated with a Bunsen burner, gives the flame a lilac color.","Potassium, heated with a Bunsen burner, turns the flame purple."],["用本生燈加熱鉀，火焰就會呈現淡紫色。",""]],["proliferate","prәәu'lifәreit","vi. 增殖, 激增, 扩散\\nvt. 使激增",["The sentences proliferate like rabbits. But it's good.","As these groups proliferate, the U.S. Food and Drug Administration is warning against feeding babies with breast milk obtained from donors not screened for infectious diseases."],["",""]],["citizenry","'sitizәnri","n. 市民\\n[法] 市民",["Accountability is in the interest of the Government and the citizenry alike.","The revolt was led by the southern citizenry."],["",""]],["assured","ә'ʃuәd","a. 确定的, 自信的\\n[经] 被保险人, 被保证者, 投保人",["You may rest assured; I have no ulterior motive in making this donation.","I know you're nervous, but rest assured, you won't feel a thing."],["",""]],["impossibly","im'pɒsәbli","adv. 不可能地, 难以置信地",["Her standards for men are impossibly high, thanks to a girlhood rich in Disney, Cosmopolitan, and private school.","Like him, she was tall, blonde and impossibly good-looking."],["",""]],["untreated","'ʌn'tri:tid","[化] 未经处理的",["Tom's bladder burst due to untreated venereal disease.","The threats range from diesel exhaust and unchecked forest fires fouling the air to untreated waste poisoning the water."],["",""]],["decisively","","adv. 果断地；决然地",["We shall have the ability to respond rapidly and decisively to terrorism directed against us wherever it occurs.","We suggest that the ruling party act more decisively in order not to be voted out of office in the next election."],["",""]],["meltdown","'meltdaun","[经] 销毁(货币等), 变卖(财产)",["The findings are a warning to conservationists that keeping a small pool of endangered animals could result in inbreeding and genomic meltdown.","If you \"didn't have neurodiversity before the internet\" then explain why Grandpa had a meltdown if the cutlery wasn't sorted by length?"],["",""]],["cadence","'keidns","n. 韵律, 抑扬, 调子, 节奏\\n[电] 步调",["It's hard for me to get the cadence right when I speak Spanish.","Idly I touch the strings, till, without my knowing, the music borrows the mad cadence of that storm."],["",""]],["rind","raind","n. 树皮, 壳, 外表\\nvt. 削皮, 剥壳",["The freshest watermelon is discovered by knocking on its rind.","The trunk is attached to the root. A log is the body of the tree cut down, without boughs: having bark and rind, pith and heart."],["",""]],["civility","si'viliti","n. 礼貌, 礼仪",["One step forward is a step towards civility.","The way a country treats its intellectuals is a sign of its civility. The way a country treats its farmers is a sign of its conscience."],["向前一步，走向文明。","一个国家对待知识分子的态度标志着一个国家的文明程度，而一个国家对待农民工的态度则代表着一个国家的良心！"]],["albanian","æl'beinjәn","n. 阿尔巴尼亚人",["My dream is to study Albanian in Tirana.","The speed at which he keeps churning out sentences in Albanian makes me wonder if 'he' is a machine."],["我的夢想是在地拉那學習阿爾巴尼亞語。",""]],["lifeless","'laiflis","a. 无生命的, 无趣味的, 死气沉沉的",["He seems really depressed and lifeless today. I wonder what took the wind out of his sails.","The lifeless rocks nod their heads again and again."],["",""]],["overrule",".әuvә'ru:l","vt. 统治, 威压, 打败, 驳回\\n[法] 否决, 驳回, 批驳",["Tom's stomach seems to overrule him at every turn."],[""]],["crisscross","'kriskrɒs","n. 十字形\\na. 十字形的\\nadv. 十字形地\\nvt. 画十字形于\\nvi. 交叉往来",["Lightning was crisscrossing all around the sky."],[""]],["drilling","'driliŋ","n. 演练\\n[医] 钻",["Martino urged the workers to stop the drilling operation.","The burglars brazenly gained entry through the front door in the early evening by drilling out the cylinder lock."],["",""]],["warlord","'wɒ:lɒ:d","n. 军阀, 军阀式领袖",["The high court decided to try the fugitive warlord in abstentia.","Tom looked out the window while fantasizing about being a warlord in an exotic land."],["",""]],["regularity",".regju'læriti","n. 规则性, 匀整, 正规, 经常\\n[医] 规律性",["Odysseus and Morpheus are pronounced, with perfect regularity, like Zeus.","The silent man seemed even more clumsy than usual, and drank champagne with regularity and determination out of sheer nervousness."],["",""]],["unfavorable",".ʌn'feivәrәbl","a. 不宜的, 不顺利的, 反对的\\n[法] 不利的, 有害的, 不吉祥的",["The weather is unfavorable for our athletic meet today.","Unfavorable circumstances prevented me from traveling."],["",""]],["neutrality","nju:'træliti","n. 中立, 不偏不倚, 中间状态\\n[医] 中性; 无作用[性]",["The alternative possibilities are neutrality or war.","An important principle of the Internet is the network neutrality."],["",""]],["pertain","pә'tein","vi. 从属于, 关于, 涉及, 附属, 适合, 相称\\n[法] 属于, 从属, 附属",["He shall speak in thy stead to the people, and shall be thy mouth: but thou shalt be to him in those things that pertain to God.","Technically, you're right. However, you must also consider the unusual circumstances that pertain here."],["",""]],["incest","'insest","n. 近亲相奸, 乱伦\\n[医] 近亲通婚",["Imagine, for the sake of argument, a tribal group in which mother-son incest was countenanced.","It is thought that it was at this time that he engaged in incest with his sister."],["",""]],["polio","","n. 脊髓灰质炎, 小儿麻痹症\\n[医] 脊髓灰质炎",["Tom's grandmother and daughter both were paralyzed by polio.","The polio vaccine was first produced by an American scientist."],["",""]],["eater","'i:tә","n. 吃...的人, 生吃的水果, 美味的水果",["This is just between you and me, he is a big eater.","Tom is a picky eater and seldom tries anything new."],["我就只告诉你，他是个大胃王。",""]],["disgruntled","dis'^rʌnt(ә)ld","a. 不满意的, 满腹牢骚的, 不高兴的",["\"I'd rather get the sack than not join the labour union,\" said the disgruntled worker.","We think a disgruntled employee was the one who planted the bomb."],["",""]],["quintessential",".kwinti'senʃәl","a. 精萃的, 精髓的, 典范的",["Summer festivals and firework shows are a quintessential part of summer in that town.","Light is quintessential. Light is life."],["",""]],["joyous","'dʒɒiәs","a. 快乐的, 高兴的",["May happiness and joy come to you as you celebrate this joyous day.","It was a joyous morning for the cat, but a great tragedy for the now-orphaned chicks."],["",""]],["hijacker","'haidʒækә","n. 强盗, 劫盗, 劫持犯\\n[法] 劫持者, 绑架者, 抢劫者",["The hijacker demanded a ransom of two million dollars.","The identity of the hijacker has been revealed."],["",""]],["ultrasound","'ʌltrә,saund","n. 超声\\n[计] 超声",["If you have problems with rats or mice, you can scare them away with ultrasound.","Mary had an ultrasound to find out the sex of her and Tom's unborn baby."],["你如果遭受老鼠困擾，可以使用超音波來嚇跑牠們。","瑪莉為了知道她和湯姆未出生的孩子的性別，做了超音波檢查。"]],["toughness","'tʌfnis","n. 有粘性, 强硬, 强健\\n[化] 韧性",["I still remember staring with fear at his face marked with candor and toughness.","Openness and toughness characterize Korean diplomacy."],["",""]],["incidental",".insi'dentәl","a. 附带的, 偶然的, 容易发生的\\nn. 附带事件",["His criticism only referred to incidental matters.","It is of the highest importance in the art of detection to be able to recognize, out of a number of facts, which are incidental and which vital."],["",""]],["burnout","'bә:naut","n. 烧尽, 烧坏, 熄火\\n[化] 燃尽",["Bastida said she has experienced eco-anxiety and burnout from climate activism.","As a result of burnout, my submissions to the magazine became increasingly labored and vacuous."],["",""]],["utilitarian",".ju:tili'tєәriәn","a. 有效用的, 实利主义的, 功利主义的\\nn. 功利主义者",["The study of history offers to individuals major utilitarian learning outcomes.","His callously utilitarian outlook doesn't earn him many friends."],["",""]],["wasted","'weistid","a. 浪费的",["When I ask people what they regret most about high school, they nearly all say the same thing: that they wasted so much time.","Tom regretted having wasted a great deal of his life."],["当我问人家高中时代他们最后悔的是什么时，他们几乎所有人都回答一致：他们浪费了那么多时间。","汤姆为自己浪费了大好的青春年华感到非常后悔。"]],["cede","si:d","vt. 割让\\n[法] 割让, 让与, 放弃",["There isn't a Monday that would not cede its place to Tuesday.","If you believe Palestine can't cede any land to its invaders, why would you believe Ukraine can and must?"],["",""]],["doubtless","'dautlis","a. 无疑的, 确定的\\nadv. 无疑地, 确定地",["You doubtless mean well; but your ideas are unhappily mistaken.","He was evidently unconscious, doubtless in an anaesthetised sleep."],["",""]],["aerobics",".eiә'rәubiks","n. 有氧运动法；增氧健身法",["He plays at aerobics just to please his girlfriend.","She worked as an aerobics instructor in her twenties."],["",""]],["telegram","'teli^ræm","n. 电报, 一封电报\\n[计] 电报",["When you send a telegram, brevity is essential because you will be charged for every word.","Your telegram arrived just as I was about to telephone you."],["当我们发电报的时候，简明扼要是关键，因为是以字计费的。","我正想打電話給你，你的電報就送來了。"]],["enamel","i'næml","n. 珐琅, 瓷釉\\nvt. 涂以瓷釉, 彩饰",["Tooth enamel is the hardest substance in your body.","Tooth enamel is mostly composed of hydroxyapatite."],["",""]],["reliever","ri'li:vә","n. 解除痛苦的人, 接替者, 救济者",["Take the pain reliever only when you need it.","Benedito's plant is a stress-reliever."],["",""]],["cumbersome","'kʌmbәsәm","a. 笨重的, 麻烦的, 累赘的",["English is like a gated community; access is possible but cumbersome.","Government red tape has made the process very cumbersome and hard to understand."],["",""]],["kickoff","'kikɒf","n. 开球, 开始, 肇始",["In the kickoff article of this series, I defined some fundamental concepts we can use when talking about plugins.","Do you have any idea what time is kickoff?"],["","你知道什么时候要中线开球吗？"]],["engraving","in'greiviŋ","n. 雕刻, 镌版术, 雕版",["You can even add a custom engraving inside the locket, for $10 extra, of course.","The engraving process for music sheets takes a considerable amount of time."],["",""]],["agrarian","ә'grєәriәn","a. 土地的, 耕地的\\n[法] 土地的, 土地所有制的",["Many novels and shows romanticize the agrarian lifestyle.","But the fact is that the U.S. automobile industry got its start in agrarian Indiana."],["",""]],["particulars","","n. 细节, 详细情况, 详情\\n[经] 细节, 摘要",["You don't have to give me the particulars of the contract right now; just show me what I need to do and I'll do it.","Care over the particulars only has meaning once it gets across to customers."],["",""]],["concurrent","kәn'kʌrәnt","n. 同时发生的事件\\na. 同时发生的, 一致的\\n[计] 并行的; 并发的; 同时发生的; 共行的",["Sami is also serving a concurrent sentence of 60 years for attempting to kill Layla's infant daughter.","Are increases in life expectancy accompanied by a concurrent postponement of disability and functional limitations?"],["",""]],["intermittent",".intә'mitәnt","a. 间歇的, 断断续续的\\n[化] 间歇的; 间断的",["Intermittent flashes of lightning illuminated the dark gloom of the forest.","Tom tried intermittent fasting, but died of complications soon after."],["",""]],["decreased","di:ˈkri:st","v. （使）缩短, 减小, 减少( decrease的过去式和过去分词 )",["My income has decreased ten percent.","The university's endowment has decreased steadily over the last ten years."],["我的收入減少了百分之十。",""]],["seaside","'si:said","a. 海边的, 海滨的\\nn. 海滨",["If the weather's nice, I'll go to the seaside tomorrow.","It is true Wendy grew up at the seaside, but she isn't a good swimmer."],["如果天氣好的話，我明天就去海邊。","溫迪的確是在海邊長大的，但是她卻不太會游泳。"]],["stow","stәu","vt. 收藏, 装填, 贮藏, 装满, 使暂留, 堆垛\\n[经] 堆装, 装载",["Between meals, he usually manages to stow away a generous supply of candy, ice cream, popcorn and fruit.","Stow your carry-on luggage in the overhead compartments."],["",""]],["illiterate","i'litәrәt","n. 文盲\\na. 目不识丁的, 没受教育的",["The illiterate man was eager to increase his vocabulary.","They are not illiterate in the sense that they can not read or write at all."],["",""]],["faithfully","'feiθfuli","adv. 忠实地, 诚心诚意地, 深信着地",["He carried out the scheme faithfully.","Take this medicine faithfully, and you will feel better."],["他忠实地实行了该计划。",""]],["dumbbell","'dʌmbel","n. 哑铃\\n[医] 哑铃",["A dumbbell should not be dropped on the floor.","Tom struggled to lift the heavy dumbbell."],["",""]],["squeak","skwi:k","n. 吱吱声, 侥幸\\nvi. 吱吱叫, 告密, 侥幸成功\\nvt. 以短促尖声发出",["Some people follow their kids around with a camcorder as though every squeak is a star-studded performance.","I just bought a bed, but every time I turned over it would squeak and it was uncomfortable to sleep in."],["",""]],["inventive","in'ventiv","a. 善于创造的, 发明的",["Edison was an inventive genius of the United States.","Butterflies are just flowers that took flight on a feast day when nature was particularly inventive and fruitful."],["",""]],["sunken","'sʌŋkәn","a. 沉没的, 下凹的\\nsink的过去分词",["The museum displayed historic bullion recovered from a sunken Spanish galleon.","A jeweled naga guarded the entrance to the sunken temple."],["",""]],["maverick","'mævәrik","n. 未烙饲主印记的小牛, 持不同意见的人\\nvi. 迷路",["Senator Jackson carefully cultivates the image of a maverick, but he toes the party line more often than not.","His maverick attitude toward generally-accepted best practices didn't endear him to his superiors."],["",""]],["appendix","ә'pendiks","n. 附录, 附加物, 阑尾\\n[化] 增补",["He wrote an appendix comprising more than half the length of the total document.","The surgeon took out his patient's appendix."],["",""]],["buff","bʌf","n. 暗黄色, 暗黄色皮革, 人的皮肤\\nvt. 擦亮, 使柔软\\na. 暗黄色的",["Let's play a game of blind man's buff.","Skura and Mira didn't know that Yanni was a film buff."],["咱们玩儿捉迷藏吧。",""]],["weaving","","[机] 织动",["She learned the craft of basket weaving from her grandmother.","This invention marked the dawn of a new era in weaving."],["",""]],["unsalted","ʌn'sɔ:ltid","a. 新鲜的",["In order to make this cake you need baking powder and unsalted butter.","To make this cake, you'll need baking powder and unsalted butter."],["",""]],["grotesque","grәu'tesk","n. 奇异风格, 怪异图案\\na. 奇怪的, 可笑的",["They made huge, grotesque, yet beautiful poles of red cedar.","When seen in the perspective of half-a-dozen years or more, the best of our fashions strike us as grotesque, if not unsightly."],["他們用紅雪松製作了巨大、怪誕卻又美麗的木桿。",""]],["flowering","'flauәriŋ","a. 开花的\\nn. 开花, 饰以花",["It's unusual for the heath to be flowering at this time of year.","Many Japanese irises were flowering prettily on the lake's edge."],["",""]],["camaraderie",".kæmә'rɑ:dәri:","n. 友情；同志之爱",["Reading this book, I felt a renewing sense of the importance of camaraderie.","The abrupt cancellation of performances and loss of the daily ritual and camaraderie has been challenging."],["",""]],["horribly","'hɒrәbli","adv. 可怕地, 非常地",["Everything is going horribly wrong for Tom.","Last night I was horribly lonesome all alone in my room and wished so much you were with me."],["對湯姆來說一切都開始錯得離譜。",""]],["sandstone","'sændstәun","n. 沙岩\\n[化] 砂岩",["The name of the Algerian town Tipaza comes from tafza, red sandstone.","We have sandstone in the bathroom, and parquetry in the bedroom."],["",""]],["prerogative","pri'rɒgәtiv","n. 特权, 君权, 职权\\na. 特权的, 行使特权的",["It's your prerogative to decide whether to go on the trip.","If you want to throw your money away, that's your prerogative."],["",""]],["casing","'keisiŋ","n. 箱, 盒, 包装, 框, 套管\\n[化] 汽车外胎",["For safety purposes, remove the plastic casing before use.","If a door doesn't fit the casing, we must plane it carefully until it does."],["",""]],["tulip","'tju:lip","n. 郁金香",["Asia's largest tulip garden in Srinagar has witnessed 3 million visitors this year.","The acronym TULIP expresses the five points of Calvinist theology."],["",""]],["triangular","trai'æŋgjulә","a. 三角形的, 三人间的\\n[医] 三角的, 三角形的",["This god is cruel, nervous, and diabolic, with yellow wrinkly skin, small squinty eyes, a triangular nose, and bright teeth.","Some people find it difficult to write with pens that have a triangular grip."],["",""]],["sentencing","","[法] 判决, 宣判",["Sami apologized to Layla's family during the sentencing.","The Supreme Court approved the primary sentencing."],["",""]],["coercive","kәu'ә:siv","a. 强制的, 强压的, 强迫的\\n[法] 强制的, 强迫的, 强行的",["The police used coercive techniques when questioning suspects.","Shanghaiing is a practice from the mid-19th Northwest United States that consisted of conscripting men as sailors by coercive techniques."],["",""]],["heartfelt","'hɑ:tfelt","a. 衷心的, 真心真意的",["We all share the heartfelt wish that he and all the others will pass the admission examination.","Please accept my heartfelt apology for what happened today."],["",""]],["disproportionately","","adv. 不匀称, 不相称",["The new bill favoured the rich disproportionately to the number of lower class.","Crimes are disproportionately committed by minorities."],["",""]],["owing","'әuiŋ","a. 未付的, 亏欠的, 受惠的, 归因于...的\\n[经] 应付的, 欠着的, 未付的",["Owing to the rain, the athletic meeting was put off.","I regret that I will be unable to meet you on February 27 owing to an unexpected matter."],["運動會因為下雨延後了。","因为临时有事，我很抱歉在2月27日那天不能跟你们碰面了。"]],["wand","wɒnd","n. 棒, 棍, 杖",["The wizard waved his magic wand and disappeared into thin air.","The witch cast a spell and a beam of light shot out of her wand."],["",""]],["freestyle","'fri:stail","n. 自由式",["Taneda Santoka spent the twilight years of his life writing freestyle haiku as an impoverished, wandering drunkard.","Mary reluctantly agreed to listen to another one of Tom's freestyle raps."],["",""]],["reread",".ri:'ri:d","vt. 重读, 再读",["The mother occasionally reread her son's letter.","I read and reread the sentence; I just couldn't believe it."],["这位母亲偶尔会重温她的儿子的信件。",""]],["paved","peivd","v. 铺( pave的过去式和过去分词 ); 为…铺平道路",["The road to hell is paved with good intentions.","The road to Hell is paved with good intentions."],["通往地狱的路，都是由善意铺成的。","通往地狱的路，都是由善意铺成的。"]],["coke","kәuk","n. 可口可乐, 焦炭\\nv. (使)成焦炭",["Can I have two hamburgers and a coke, please?","Coke has always been the top dog when it comes to soft drinks."],["可以给我来两个汉堡和一杯可乐吗？谢谢。",""]],["alright","ɔ:l'rait","a. 没问题的",["If it isn't a bad, dirty, or wrong thing, then it's alright.","It's alright. This injection won't hurt. It will just prick a little."],["不是坏事，不是丑事，不是错事，确认了这三点就没事。","没关系的，这个针不痛的，就只有一点点刺痛感。"]],["ufo","'ju:fәu, ,ju:ef'әu","不明飞行物, 飞碟",["UFO stands for unidentified flying object.","Christopher Columbus once saw a UFO, and ordered his men to fire his ship's cannons at it."],["UFO代表不明飛行物體。",""]],["heyday","'heidei","n. 全盛期\\ninterj. 嘿",["It's not an upmarket resort, but rather a down-at-heel one whose heyday has long since past.","Known for his temper as much as his talent, Tom was capable of both brilliance and rubbish in his heyday."],["",""]],["coveted","ˈkʌvɪtid","a. 令人垂涎的; 垂涎的, 梦寐以求的\\nv. 贪求, 觊觎(covet的过去分词); 垂涎; 贪图",["Thoreau coveted the plant's strong purple stalk for a cane, and the robins eat its dark crimson-juiced berries.","An Olympic gold medal is probably the most coveted sporting prize."],["梭羅垂涎於這種植物強壯的紫色莖稈，將其製成藤條，而知更鳥則以深紅色汁液的漿果為食。",""]],["wry","rai","a. 扭歪的, 歪曲的, 歪斜的\\nv. 扭曲, 扭歪",["With a wry face I went out into the hall and opened the door. To my astonishment it was Sherlock Holmes who stood upon my step.","There he was, standing at the side of the car, with his arms crossed over his chest and a wry smile on his face."],["",""]],["engrave","in'greiv","vt. 刻上, 雕刻, 铭记",["Pisoni says since they don't know who wins, they have to engrave a bronze plate with all the nominees' names.","But if you look close enough into the grooves and onto the lip of the Cup, you will see that players started to scratch and engrave their names into it."],["",""]],["bellow","'belәu","v. 怒吼",["Some bellow out insults so loudly that even radio and television audiences can hear every word.","Even the ersatz of the flies imposed their menu on us, the content of which I will not have to bellow."],["",""]],["indignation",".indig'neiʃәn","n. 愤怒, 愤慨, 义愤",["Many Greeks feel great indignation when Germans give them advice.","All the strikers came out of the building in indignation."],["",""]],["soaked","","a. 湿透的",["I got soaked by the rain on the way home.","I got soaked with rain on the way home."],["我回家路上被雨淋得濕透了。","我回家路上被雨淋得濕透了。"]],["crescent","'kresәnt","n. 新月, 新月形(物)\\na. 新月形的, 逐渐增加的",["May 8 is World Red Cross Red Crescent Day.","Croissants are called crescent rolls when they come from a can of refrigerated dough."],["5 月 8 日是世界紅十字會與紅新月日。",""]],["overpower",".әuvә'pauә","vt. 击败, 打胜, 克服",["Layla knew that she couldn't physically overpower Sami.","It was easy for the large dog to overpower the small one."],["",""]],["haunted","'hɔ:ntid","a. 常出现鬼的, 闹鬼的",["The mansion was so cheap because it was known to be haunted.","That house is haunted by Tom's ghost."],["那別墅因為聽說鬧鬼所以很便宜。","那棟房子有湯姆的鬼魂作祟。"]],["malignant","mә'lignәnt","a. 有恶意的, 恶性的, 有害的\\n[化] 恶性的",["Various types of tumors exist, both benign and malignant.","A certain amount of ambitiousness, before it reaches the malignant stage, can also be an engine for progress."],["",""]],["snarl","snɑ:l","vi. 吼叫, 怒骂, 缠结\\nvt. 咆哮着说, 搞乱, 使缠结\\nn. 咆哮, 吼叫, 怒骂, 缠结, 混乱",["A colorful bike share revolution is taking over on the streets, helping ease traffic snarl and keeping the air cleaner.","The creature continued to snarl as it got closer to Boris."],["",""]],["skillful","'skilful","a. 熟练的, 巧妙的\\n[机] 熟练的",["Bill is skillful in arguing and debating.","Lisa is so skillful that she can even make screws and similar small objects for herself."],["比尔擅长辩论。",""]],["panelist","'pænәlist","n. 专门小组成员, 演出小组成员, 参加电视公开讨论会的成员, 答问小组的成员",["The panelist talked about their experience as a researcher."],[""]],["faraway","'fɑ:rәwei","a. 遥远的, 恍惚的, 出神的",["A good neighbour is better than a faraway friend.","We have a saying to the effect that a good neighbor is better than a faraway relative."],["一個好鄰居勝於一個遙遠的朋友。",""]],["pouring","'pɔ:riŋ","[机] 浇铸, 浇注",["For you to come out and say that kind of thing now would just be pouring oil on the fire.","It's been pouring here for the last few days."],["你現在說這種話，只會火上加油。","這裏近幾天都在下大雨。"]],["crayon","'kreiәn","n. 蜡笔, 蜡笔画\\nvt. 以蜡笔作画",["Ziri asked Rima if he could borrow her red crayon.","The child was rushed to the hospital after swallowing a crayon."],["",""]],["countryman","'kʌntrimәn","n. 同胞, 乡下人, 国民",["After the activities of the second day she stayed the night with a countryman."],[""]],["cervical","'sә:vikәl","a. 颈的, 子宫颈的\\n[医] 颈的",["The patient injured his upper cervical posterior spinal artery by sneezing.","Cervical cancer has nothing to do with cervical vertebrae. It's a cancer of the cervix."],["",""]],["darn","dɑ:n","n. 织补\\nv. 织补",["I had no idea you guys were getting married. You should've told me earlier, darn it.","Darn, my train is going back to Central Station 'cause the train in front has technical problems."],["",""]],["raccoon","ræ'ku:n","n. 浣熊, 浣熊毛皮",["I'm just a raccoon with a PC and a MIDI keyboard.","Tom backed his car up to check, but the raccoon that he'd run over was as dead as a doornail."],["我只是一隻擁有電腦和 MIDI 鍵盤的浣熊。",""]],["mayhem","'meihem","n. 蓄意的破坏, 故意的伤害罪\\n[医] 伤残, 残废",["Tom was arrested for aggravated assault and mayhem.","There is no reason for such mayhem."],["",""]],["yearning","'jә:niŋ","n. 渴望, 热望, 怀念\\na. 热望的, 渴望的, 怀念的, 向往的",["I feel a yearning for the university.","Nothing can keep me from yearning for freedom."],["我对于上大学有一种渴望。","没有什么可以阻挡，我对自由的向往。"]],["bravery","'breivәri","n. 勇敢",["Four brave military dogs were awarded the K-9 Medal of Courage for their bravery and service.","Today I finally worked up the bravery to say to her \"I love you!\""],["四隻英勇的軍犬因其勇氣與貢獻獲頒 K-9 勇氣勳章。","今天我终于鼓起勇气对她说：“我爱你！”。"]],["prickly","'prikli","a. 多刺的, 满是针刺的, 针刺般痛的",["Both peoples lived off deer, small game, rodents, and even insects, but their main food sources were probably plants such as prickly pear cactus, mesquite beans, and pecan.","The question of free will is a prickly conundrum to religion."],["這兩個民族都以鹿、小型獵物、囓齒動物甚至昆蟲為生，但他們的主要食物來源可能是仙人掌、牧豆和山核桃等植物。",""]],["panties","'pænti","n. 女式短裤",["Pregnant women usually buy bigger size panties.","She was wearing pink panties under the skirt."],["孕婦一般會買大一號的內褲。","裙子下她穿著一條粉紅色的內褲。"]],["correctional","kә'rekʃәnәl","a. 改正的, 修正的, 矫正的",["The editors of this magazine run a correctional facility.","Sami is serving his time in a correctional institution."],["",""]],["brim","brim","n. 边, 边缘, (河)边\\nvt. 注满, 使满溢\\nvi. 满溢",["The brim of his soft felt hat hid every inch of his face but the shiny tip of his nose.","The brim of the fedora measures approximately 2 1/4 inches with a slight upturn."],["",""]],["guild","gild","n. 团体, 协会, 行业协会\\n[经] 同业公会",["The guild leader relegated Vince to a lesser officer because he was abusing his power.","Tom's ancestor was a member of a blacksmiths' guild."],["",""]],["gratification",".grætifi'keiʃәn","n. 令人满足的事(或物), 满足, 喜悦\\n[医] 愿望满足, 满意",["Many in this generation favor instant gratification over hard work.","He had the gratification of seeing his son graduate from collage."],["",""]],["clinch","klintʃ","n. 钉牢\\nv. 敲弯, 用臂钳住",["Did you clinch the deal?"],[""]],["mop","mɒp","n. 拖把, 鬼脸\\nvt. 用拖把洗擦, 擦, 拭\\nvi. 做鬼脸\\n[计] 维护操作协议",["When you've finished sweeping, I'll mop.","When you're done sweeping, I'll mop."],["你掃完地後，我來拖地。","你掃完地後，我來拖地。"]],["originality","ә.ridʒә'næliti","n. 创意, 新奇, 独创能力, 原始",["It is better to fail in originality than to succeed in imitation.","Authenticity is invaluable, but originality is non-existent."],["",""]],["timeline","ˈtaɪmlaɪn","n. 时间轴, 时间表",["Let's write up a timeline so that we can figure out when things went wrong.","Here is a historical timeline of events that sparked protests similar to those we are now witnessing."],["",""]],["oblivion","ә'bliviәn","n. 遗忘, (头脑的)一片空白状, 湮没, 大赦, 赦免\\n[法] 忘却, 被忘却的事, 大赦",["Finishing second in the Olympics gets you silver. Finishing second in politics gets you oblivion.","Sometimes silence is not oblivion. Sometimes silence is only patience."],["",""]],["patty","'pæti","n. 小馅饼",["Patty has gender identity disorder because she's a woman who feels like a man.","Patty was so short that she couldn't get at the branch."],["",""]],["impartial","im'pɑ:ʃәl","a. 公平的, 不偏不倚的\\n[法] 公正无私的, 不偏袒的, 公平的",["He puts on a show of being impartial and unbiased, but I think he's just a guy with no opinion of his own.","Tom and Mary told me that they thought John would be impartial."],["他總在別人面前裝出大公無私的樣子，但依我看，他只不過是個沒有主見的傢伙。",""]],["boyhood","'bɒihud","n. 少年时代",["In his boyhood, Yasunari Kawabata took care of his grandfather.","His boyhood experiences taught him what it was like to be poor."],["",""]],["dishonest","dis'ɒnist","a. 不诚实的\\n[法] 不忠实的, 不诚实的, 欺诈的",["There's no disguising the fact that she is dishonest.","He was angry at the suggestion that he was dishonest."],["不需掩飾她不誠實的事實。",""]],["evict","i'vikt","vt. 逐出, 赶出, 驱逐\\n[法] 逐出, 驱逐, 没收",["If you don't pay rent, the landlord will evict you.","Jewish settlers attempted to violently evict Wafi and his family from their house."],["",""]],["toxicity","tɒk'sisiti","n. 毒性\\n[医] 毒力, 毒性",["All the toxicity in this office has left me feeling demotivated.","The toxicity of our cheap foods makes us more prone to give birth to handicapped offspring."],["",""]],["wording","'wә:diŋ","n. 用词, 措词",["I admit, my wording is a bit direct.","I'm not quite happy with the wording of this sentence."],["我承认，我的用词有点直接。",""]],["antarctic","ænt'ɑ:ktik","a. 南极的, 南极地带的\\nn. 南极地区",["Owing to its landmass, the Antarctic has an air temperature lower than that of the Arctic.","They went on an expedition to the Antarctic."],["南極因為有大陸，所以氣溫低於北極。","他们出发去南极探险。"]],["arson","'ɑ:sәn","n. 纵火, 纵火罪\\n[法] 纵火, 放火",["The fire that broke out last night was judged to be caused by arson.","In Germany today, anti-violence rallies took place in several cities, including one near Hamburg where three Turks were killed in an arson attack on Monday."],["昨晚的火災被斷定為由縱火引起的。","今日在德国，反暴力集会着落到了德国的很多城市，包括周一在汉堡附近一场纵火袭击中3名突厥人被杀害的地方。"]],["concealed","","a. 隐蔽的, 隐匿的",["She concealed the fact that she used to be a salesgirl.","The rebel concealed his ambition to destroy the regime."],["",""]],["horseman","'hɒ:smәn","n. 骑马者, 马术师, 养马者",["In the leaden backdrop of the dawn, the horseman stands in silence, the long mane of his horse, disheveled by the wind.","The horse of the fourth horseman of the Apocalypse was actually green."],["",""]],["iconic","ai'kɔnik","[计] 图标的",["The view of the Earth from the Moon is one of the iconic images of the 20th century.","After years of hard work, we finally have reason to believe that these iconic dolphins can be protected against extinction."],["",""]],["tasting","'teistiŋ","n. 品尝, 尝味",["He complained of the dish tasting bad.","After making and tasting authentic macaroons, I still don't understand why some people love them."],["他抱怨菜的味道不好。",""]],["insidious","in'sidiәs","a. 隐伏的, 阴险的, 狡猾的\\n[医] 隐袭的",["In junior high and high schools, they say insidious forms of bullying are on the rise.","We are working against an enemy who is very insidious in his methods."],["",""]],["demo","'demәu","n. 演示, 样本唱片\\n[计] 演示",["Any sufficiently advanced technology is indistinguishable from a rigged demo.","The demo sounds better than the original."],["",""]],["dosage","'dәusidʒ","n. 剂量, 用量, 配药\\n[医] 剂量",["If the medicine isn't working, maybe we should up the dosage.","The package insert for this medicine contains important information about dosage and side effects."],["",""]],["exertion","ig'zә:ʃәn","n. 努力, 发挥, 运用\\n[医] 劳力, 用力",["After much exertion, he was exhausted."],[""]],["contraception",".kɒntrә'sepʃәn","n. 避孕, 避孕法\\n[医] 节(制生)育, 避孕",["As in the previously mentioned case with the farmer, the mentality of contraception and family planning seems unnatural.","What methods of contraception are you using?"],["","你們採取什麼措施避孕？"]],["hijack","'haidʒæk","vt. 抢劫, 劫持, 敲诈\\n[法] 挡路抢劫, 抢劫, 绑架",["Investigators foiled a plot to hijack an airplane.","If someone doesn't hijack something, it's not a good movie."],["",""]],["ambient","'æmbiәnt","a. 周围的\\nn. 周围环境",["My brother listens to a music genre called ambient.","Now, a recent safety upgrade has accidentally turned the bridge into a giant ambient music generator."],["",""]],["swinging","'swiŋiŋ","a. 极大的, 大幅度的, 大量的, 极好的, 大力的, 极有力的, 活跃的, 时髦的\\nadv. 极大地, 非常地",["A fierce-looking elderly man strode out from the gate with a hunting-crop swinging in his hand.","France seems to be swinging left - Britain to the right."],["",""]],["mountainous","'mauntinәs","a. 多山的, 如山的, 巨大的",["Languages in the Hmong-Mien language family, also referred to as the Miao-Yao language family, are spoken across Southeast Asia and mountainous areas of southern China.","Kabyle, a dialect of the Berber language, is spoken in the mountainous area of Kabylie, in northeastern Algeria."],["苗瑤語系的語言分佈於東南亞和中國南方山區。",""]],["inhibition",".inhi'biʃәn","n. 禁止, 抑制, 压抑\\n[计] 禁止",["She's prepared to argue without inhibition.","Tom was beside himself with rage, failing to find a single example sentence on Tatoeba containing the expression \"complete inhibition\"."],["",""]],["unarmed","'ʌn'ɑ:md","a. 没有武装的, 非武装的, 徒手的, 手无寸铁的, 无突的, 无刺的",["The Israeli army shoots and kills unarmed Palestinian people.","Larger pirates often preyed on unarmed merchant ships."],["",""]],["accumulated","","a. 累计的；累积的；达到",["The merchant accumulated tremendous fortune during the postwar era.","Americans accumulated their trade deficits by living far beyond their means."],["",""]],["predicted","priˈdiktid","v. 预言, 预测, 预示( predict的过去式和过去分词 )",["Einstein predicted that the Sun's gravity would bend light.","Everything Tom predicted came true."],["爱因斯坦预测太阳的引力会弯曲光线。","汤姆说的预言全部都应验了。"]],["craving","'kreiviŋ","n. 渴望, 热望\\n[医] 瘾, 癖, 嗜欲",["I suddenly got a craving to eat some crisp roast chicken skin.","If you find yourself craving junk food, then pick a healthy alternative."],["",""]],["versatility",".vә:sә'tiliti","n. 多用途, 多才多艺, 易变",["The advantage of our method lies in its simplicity and versatility.","Once renowned in Asia for its durability and versatility, traditional Korean paper is now produced only in a handful of rural paper mills."],["",""]],["negate","ni'geit","vt. 否定, 否认, 取消\\n[计] 非",["The secret of Hegel's dialectic lies ultimately in this alone, that it negates theology through philosophy in order then to negate philosophy through theology.","Technically, drugs that cause miosis can relieve the PNS effects of those causing mydriasis since sympathetic and parasympathetic stimulation tend to negate each others' effects."],["",""]],["indistinguishable",".indis'tiŋgwiʃәbl","a. 不能辨别的, 不能区别的",["The twins are indistinguishable from each other.","Any sufficiently advanced technology is indistinguishable from magic."],["這對雙胞胎沒法區分。",""]],["contested","kənˈtestid","v. 争夺, 竞争( contest的过去式和过去分词 ); 争辩, 提出异议",["Adoption for gay and lesbian parents remains a hotly contested issue in the United States.","It's been heavily contested for decades, and people don't want to believe it."],["",""]],["purposely","'pә:pәsli","adv. 故意地",["He would often make mistakes purposely just so the teacher would notice him.","Tom would often make mistakes purposely just so the teacher would notice him."],["",""]],["mounted","'mauntid","a. 安在马上的, 裱好的",["The jeweler mounted a big pearl in the brooch.","Bob mounted the portrait in a fancy frame, but it was upside down."],["寶石師傅在胸針上鑲了一枚大珍珠。",""]],["pairing","'peәriŋ","[计] 配对, 成对",["I'm never going to take your advice on pairing cheese.","The wine pairing at the restaurant impressed Adriano."],["",""]],["refresh","ri'freʃ","vt. 使清新, 使恢复, 使生气蓬勃\\nvi. 提起精神, 恢复精神, 吃点心, 喝饮料\\nvt. 刷新, 重新整理\\nvi. 刷新, …",["Moderate exercise will refresh both mind and body.","Refresh yourself with a cup of coffee when sleepy."],["适度的运动让身心焕然一新。",""]],["handlebar","'hændlbɑ:","n. 手把, 八字胡",["You'll recognise Nitesh by his handlebar mustache.","If I could grow a mustache, it would definitely be a handlebar mustache."],["",""]],["rotor","'rәutә","n. 转子, 旋筒, 转动体\\n[化] 转鼓; 转轴",["In helicopters, the cyclic controls the tilt of the main rotor, producing pitch and roll.","In helicopters, yaw is controlled through the pedals, which alter the angle of attack of the tail rotor blades."],["",""]],["sherry","'ʃeri","n. 雪利酒, 葡萄酒",["Gabriel took nothing but the hot soup and a little sherry.","Serve with soy sauce, rice vinegar, or sherry."],["",""]],["seduction","si'dʌkʃәn","n. 教唆, 怂恿, 诱惑, 诱惑物, 诱饵\\n[法] 诱奸, 勾引, 引诱",["There were grace, seduction, mystery, and coquetry in her face and in all her movements.","Sami entered a new world of seduction and sex."],["",""]],["taco","'tɑ:kәu","n. 墨西哥煎玉米卷；[美俚]墨西哥人",["I ate a bunch of Taco Bell and now I have a serious case of the shits.","I'm at the Pizza Hut. I'm at the Taco Bell. I'm at the combination Pizza Hut and Taco Bell."],["我吃了一堆塔可鐘，現在肚子拉得很慘。",""]],["reddish","'rediʃ","a. 微红的, 略带红色的",["As it oxidizes, the color turns blue and finally becomes a brilliant reddish-purple hue.","What color is your urine: clear, dark yellow, reddish, or brown like beer?"],["隨氧化變成藍色，最終呈現出鮮豔的紅紫色。","你的尿液是什么颜色的：浅色的、深黄色的、浅红色的还是像啤酒一样的咖啡色？"]],["scallop","'skɒlәp","n. 扇贝\\nvt. 用扇贝状碟烘烤\\nvi. 拾扇贝",["Double scallop curtains are commonly seen in old theaters.","The ray population exploded, and the scallop fisheries were decimated."],["",""]],["juxtaposition",".dʒʌkstәpә'ziʃәn","n. 并排, 并置, 并列\\n[医] 并列, 并置, 对合",["The author's juxtaposition of the two characters highlights their flaws.","The author's juxtaposition of the two characters highlights their differences, but also their similarities."],["",""]],["engineered","","a. 设计的, 工程",["Opponents say genetically engineered crops can cross-pollinate and damage other crops.","But construction companies in other regions use bamboo mostly in engineered form, as plywood and other laminated byproducts."],["",""]],["diffuse","di'fju:z","v. 散播, 传播\\na. 散开的, 弥漫的",["There were no galaxies or even stars, only diffuse gas.","Layla tried to diffuse the situation."],["",""]],["transpire","træn'spaiә","vt. 使蒸发, 使排出\\nvi. 蒸发, 散发, 泄露",["They are women, they are minorities, and we are very worried about what might transpire.","Do you think a fight will transpire after school today?"],["",""]],["exuberant","ig'zju:bәrәnt","a. 繁茂的, 丰富的, 生气勃勃的\\n[医] 生成过多的, 高度增生的",["He's always been so exuberant, he doesn't really seem like a lone wolf.","The sunrise stained the sky with an exuberant mixture of colors."],["",""]],["watchful","'wɒtʃful","a. 注意的, 警戒的, 警醒的, (时间)醒着换过的",["Ivan keeps a watchful eye on his goats, ensuring they stay together and graze well.","Do not try to run away, please, because the eyes of your enemies are watchful."],["",""]],["segregate","'segrigeit","a. 分离的, 被隔离的\\nvi. 分离, 隔离, 分凝\\nvt. 使分离, 使隔离",["People often segregate the two approaches, but they can often work together.","Racist politicians want to segregate schools again."],["",""]],["delayed","di'leid","a. 定时的；延时的",["A couple of flights were delayed on account of a minor accident.","In order to complete the development on schedule, we request that other unrelated tasks be delayed for the moment."],["因為一些小事故，兩、三班機被延遲了。","为了按期完成开发，我们请求暂时推迟其他不相关的任务。"]],["absurdity","әb'sә:diti","n. 荒谬, 悖理, 荒谬的言行",["Twitter is a good example of absurdity.","In the sphere of thought, absurdity and perversity remain the masters of the world, and their dominion is suspended only for brief periods."],["推特就是荒谬的绝佳例子。","在思想的領域中, 荒誕和墮落仍然主宰著世界, 它們的操控只是短時間地被暫停。"]],["sunflower","'sʌnflauә","n. 向日葵",["I like cracking sunflower seeds with my teeth.","They eat sunflower seeds while playing cards."],["我喜欢嗑葵花籽。","他們一邊嗑香瓜子，一邊打牌。"]],["immersion","i'mә:ʃәn","n. 沉浸, 专心, 陷入\\n[医] 浸, 浸渍",["He needed a Berber language immersion course.","The language students participated in an immersion program."],["他需要參加柏柏爾語沉浸式課程。",""]],["horsepower","'hɒ:spauә","n. 马力\\n[电] 马力",["The horsepower of a car matters not, with a donkey in control.","Mary brought her truck to the dynamometer, hoping to show off its horsepower."],["",""]],["pagan","'peigәn","n. 异教徒, 无宗教信仰者\\na. 异教的, 异教徒的",["Her mother was a Christian and her father a pagan, but this wasn't a problem for them at all.","Several nights a year, they meet to observe important dates on the Pagan calendar, such as the seasonal equinoxes."],["",""]],["appalachian",",æpə'leitʃjən","n. 阿巴拉契亚山脉\\na. 阿帕拉契山脉的",["You get a feeling of euphoria upon completing a hike of the Appalachian Trail.","Earth has plenty of mountain ranges. The Rocky Mountains and the Appalachian Mountains in the U.S. are just two of them."],["",""]],["thyroid","'θairɒid","a. 甲状腺的, 甲状的, 甲状软骨的\\nn. 甲状腺, 甲状软骨, 甲状腺剂",["In hyperthyroidism, or high thyroid gland activity, the gland removes iodide ions from the blood stream more rapidly than normal.","I receive hormone therapy for a thyroid condition."],["",""]],["paradoxical",".pærә'dɒksikl","a. 似非而是的, 矛盾的, 诡论的\\n[医] 奇异的, 矛盾的, 逆理的, 反常的",["Many paradoxes are paradoxical only because they sound strange.","As paradoxical as it may seem, defending tolerance requires to not tolerate the intolerant."],["",""]],["meditate","'mediteit","vt. 想, 考虑, 计划\\nvi. 沉思, 反省",["He used to meditate in the morning.","Do not meditate over war criminals. War is the crime."],["他過去時常在早上的時候冥想。",""]],["uterus","'ju:tәrәs","n. 子宫\\n[医] 子宫",["Endometritis is a disease where bacteria enter the uterus and cause inflammation of the inner membrane.","Uterine prolapse is when the uterus drops towards or through the vaginal opening as a consequence of weak supporting ligaments."],["",""]],["emerald","'emәrәld","n. 翡翠, 绿宝石, 翠绿色\\na. 翡翠的, 翠绿色的",["Rare gems include aquamarine, amethyst, emerald, quartz and ruby.","Tom does not know the difference between a diamond and an emerald."],["",""]],["falsely","'fɒ:lsli","adv. 虚伪地, 错误地, 不实地",["The title wise is, for the most part, falsely applied.","The most stringent protection of free speech would not protect a man in falsely shouting fire in a theatre and causing a panic."],["",""]],["sadden","sædn","vt. 使忧愁, 使悲哀\\nvi. 忧愁, 悲哀",["It will sadden Tony so much to hear that Donna is dead."],[""]],["underdog",".ʌndә'dɒg","n. 斗败了的狗, 失败者, 受害者\\n[法] 受压迫者, 在不健全的社会的受害者",["Luciano, the underdog in the match, will be trying to make the champ eat humble pie.","Some people say that it is human nature to root for the underdog."],["",""]],["blitz","blits","n. 闪电战\\nvt. 以闪电战攻击",["The police are having a blitz on drink driving, hooliganism and hoon driving this weekend.","They all moved to Algiers to start a new life of blitz and glamor."],["",""]],["virtuous","'vә:tʃuәs","a. 品德高尚的, 公正的, 贞洁的, 有效力的",["At first I thought it impossible that a virtuous man would show up.","No nation was ever so virtuous as each believes itself, and none was ever so wicked as each believes the other."],["",""]],["marginally","","adv. 记在页边, 有旁注, 边缘, 边沿地区, 边际, 限界, 勉强够格, 无关紧要, 少量",["The food at this restaurant was only marginally better despite the price."],[""]],["sham","ʃæm","n. 假, 赝品, 骗子, 哄骗\\na. 假的, 伪造的\\nvt. 假装, 冒充\\nvi. 装假",["With all its sham, drudgery and broken dreams; it is still a beautiful world.","Because so many people want a European passport, sham marriages are on the rise."],["虽然虚伪、苦痛还有破碎的梦伴随着我，但这仍然是一个美丽的世界。",""]],["missed","","v. 投偏；未抓住；错过（miss的过去分词）",["The mother missed her daughter who was away at college.","Tom may have missed the train. He hasn't come yet."],["妈妈想念她在读大学的女儿。","湯姆到了現在還沒來，說不定是沒趕上火車。"]],["ledger","'ledʒә","n. 分类帐, 分户总帐, 盖墓石板, 横木\\n[经] 分户帐, 分类帐",["There are many questionable points in this ledger.","The auditors will have a hard time deciphering this ledger."],["",""]],["snowflake","'snәufleik","n. 雪片, 雪花, 雪片莲",["No snowflake in an avalanche ever feels responsible.","The Sochi official mascots are The Polar Bear, The Hare, The Leopard and two aliens called The Snowflake and The Ray of Light."],["",""]],["billow","'bilәu","n. 巨浪\\nvi. 象巨浪般汹涌, 象巨浪般波动\\nvt. 使翻腾",["One, that bore / the brave Orontes and his Lycian crew, / full in AEneas' sight a toppling wave o'erthrew. / Dashed from the tiller, down the pilot rolled. / Thrice round the billow whirled her, as she lay, / then whelmed below."],[""]],["abort","ә'bɒ:t","vi. 流产, 中途失败\\nvt. 使流产, 使失败, 使中止",["I don't want to abort the mission now.","\"Yanni is coming.\" \"Abort mission! Abort mission!\""],["",""]],["concoct","kәn'kɒkt","vt. 调合, 捏造, 编造\\n[建] 调制, 混合",["The herbalist will concoct a potion for that."],[""]],["respectfully","ri'spektfuli","adv. 尊敬地",["No one respectfully bowed towards him.","I have heard that nothing gives an author so great pleasure, as to find his works respectfully quoted by others."],["没有人向他恭敬地鞠躬。",""]],["fateful","'feitful","a. 宿命的, 重大的, 决定性的",["Parents try not to think about it, hoping that if they blot the children out, the fateful call or cable will never come.","Under Bouteflika, Algeria made many fateful economic errors."],["",""]],["excitedly","ik'saitidli","adv. 兴奋地",["The moment Pip saw its owner come home, it excitedly wagged its tail.","Mary excitedly entered the room, she gave Tom a big hug and a huge slap."],["皮皮一看到主人回家，就興奮地搖尾巴。",""]],["agonizing","'ægәnaiziŋ","a. 折磨人的, 痛苦难忍的",["It is agonizing for America to lose our young men and women.","It is agonizing for the United States to lose its young men and women."],["",""]],["cramp","kræmp","n. 痉挛, 腹部绞痛, 铁夹钳\\na. 狭窄的, 难认的\\nvt. 使抽筋, 以铁箍扣紧, 束缚",["I just got another leg cramp and it hurts like hell.","Tom suddenly got a cramp in the middle of the lake."],["我刚刚腿又抽筋了，痛死我了。",""]],["marinade",".mæri'neid","n. 腌泡汁\\nvt. 腌泡",["They discovered how to marinade meat with pomegranate molasses.","Jimmy had devised the perfect marinade for flank steak."],["",""]],["animate","'ænimeit","vt. 使有生气, 赋予生命\\na. 有生命的, 有生气的",["Whereas the junction is more stiff or rigid, the nexus is more pliable; it is, as it were, animate or articulated.","We have to animate this scene by Friday!"],["",""]],["toad","tәud","n. 蟾蜍, 癞蛤蟆, 讨厌的家伙",["I can't distinguish a frog from a toad.","I cannot distinguish a frog from a toad."],["我无法区分青蛙和蟾蜍。","我无法区分青蛙和蟾蜍。"]],["polo","'pәulәu","n. 马球, 水球",["I would kill for a plate of polo right now.","Football originally meant \"a game played with a ball on foot\" - unlike a game played on horseback, such as polo."],["我现在很想吃一盘抓饭。",""]],["mania","'meiniә","n. 狂躁, 热衷, 狂热\\n[医] 躁狂, 狂",["I get hypomanic, but rarely does this become full-blown mania.","This is pure and sterile mania of protagonism for its own sake."],["",""]],["overriding","","[医] [骨折端]重迭, 架迭",["He spoke in little, sharp, jerky outbursts, and it seemed to me that to speak at all was very painful to him, and that his will all through was overriding his inclinations."],[""]],["dazzle","'dæzl","v. (使)眼花, 炫耀\\nn. 耀眼",["It is the light of darkness that will dazzle us, we who look at blindness as white as a black lamb.","Manufacturers are trying to dazzle prospective buyers with electric propulsion, better performance, comfort, style and better mileage."],["",""]],["admonish","әd'mɒniʃ","vt. 警告, 劝告, 训诫, 告诫",["I therefore admonish you to give the defendant the benefit of every reasonable doubt.","No words were able to admonish him."],["",""]],["exec","i^'zek","n. 主任参谋, 副舰长\\n[计] 执行, 执行程序",["I want to execute the plan by all means."],[""]],["skyrocket","'skai.rɒkit","vi. 飞涨, 突升\\nn. 焰火",["The price of carrots is going to skyrocket this winter because of the drought.","Algeria's defense budget could skyrocket with its economy."],["",""]],["acclaim","ә'kleim","n. 喝彩, 欢呼, 赞同\\nv. 欢呼, 喝彩, 称赞",["The mayor's speech was received with much acclaim.","Nelson Mandela was one of those rare people who manage to win universal acclaim throughout the world."],["",""]],["unwillingness","","n. 不情愿；不愿意",["The greatest difficulty of all is the unwillingness.","The problem is Tom's complete unwillingness to negotiate."],["",""]],["multivariate",",mʌlti'veәriit, -eit","[计] 多元",["The study used multivariate analysis to compare the groups."],["該研究用多變量分析比較各組。"]],["jargon","'dʒɑ:gәn","n. 专门术语, 行话, 梦话, 土语\\n[计] 行话",["The talk was peppered with scientific jargon that no one understood.","You can tell from the jargon alone that these instructions were written for experienced builders and not the average consumer."],["",""]],["appease","ә'pi:z","vt. 抚慰, 缓解, 平息, 姑息\\n[法] 使和缓, 使满足, 姑息",["Management tried to appease labor by offering them a bonus.","Tom likes to complain in order to appease his envious neighbors."],["",""]],["senseless","'senslis","a. 无感觉的, 无意识的, 不省人事的",["Even if your sentences were actually senseless, you at least have the luck to be able to form beautiful sentences.","War results only in senseless and violent destruction."],["即使你的句子实际上是毫无意义的，至少你有幸能造出好句子。",""]],["looting","lu:tɪŋ","v. 抢劫, 掠夺( loot的现在分词 )",["The best way to conceptualize looting is as similar to pollution, a byproduct of the economics of the antiquities trade.","Looting, raping, and plundering are common during wartime."],["",""]],["tentacle","'tentәkl","n. 触须, 触手, 触角\\n[医] 触角, 触须",["They say that tentacle porn is very popular in certain countries.","It has a slight resemblance to an octopus's tentacle."],["",""]],["trance","træns","n. 昏睡状态, 恍惚, 着迷\\nvt. 使恍惚, 使发呆",["Our record label is dedicated to trance and drum and bass musicians.","The hypnotist was able to put his subject into a trance."],["",""]],["cinematic",",sini'mætik","a. 电影的, 影片的",["The American Film Institute has again rated Orson Welles' 1941 feature film debut atop its list of cinematic masterpieces."],[""]],["obscurity","әb'skjuәriti","n. 阴暗, 朦胧, 晦涩, 费解, 身份低微",["I'm afraid of losing my obscurity. Genuineness only thrives in the dark. Like celery.","The heavy and gloomy appearance of the thunder-sky added still farther to the obscurity."],["",""]],["blindly","'blaindli","adv. 轻率地, 盲目地",["Tom doesn't believe in blindly obeying every rule.","I was blindly following some other idiot then. In hindsight, it's pretty dumb."],["",""]],["moderator","'mɒdәreitә","n. 主席, 会议主持人, 仲裁人\\n[计] 筛选人",["Don't delete items that are unnatural-sounding or archaic without a second opinion by an experienced moderator.","James became a moderator at Amanda's event which was going to be held in college."],["",""]],["industrialization","in,dʌstriәlai'zeiʃn","n. 工业化, 产业化\\n[经] 工业化",["Industrialization often goes hand in hand with pollution.","Industrialization of the region must be carried out very carefully to avoid environmental destruction."],["工業化常會導致環境污染。",""]],["objectively","әb'dʒektivli,ɔb-","adv. 客观地",["It's hard to judge objectively a person you're close to.","Beauty cannot be determined objectively but depends on personal aesthetic criteria."],["",""]],["unforgettable",".ʌnfә'getәbl","a. 忘不了的, 令人难忘的",["This is the unforgettable place where we met each other for the first time.","One receives unforgettable impressions of scenery and local life."],["",""]],["gill","gil","n. 鳃, 菌褶, 沟壑, 少女\\nvt. 用刺网捕, 去除内脏\\nvi. 被刺网捕住",["Gill usually acts most efficiently.","Conservation groups agree that, instead of being beneficial, gill plates may be harmful to human health because they contain arsenic, cadmium, and other lethal metals."],["",""]],["passageway","'pæsidʒwei","n. 通道, 走廊",["We discovered a secret passageway leading to the catacombs.","There is a secret passageway in my mind leading to my childhood."],["",""]],["arduous","'ɑ:djuәs","a. 费力的, 努力的, 险峻的",["She went through a long and arduous vocational course.","Running the Inca Trail near Machu Picchu can be arduous."],["",""]],["securely","si'kjuәli","adv. 安全地；安心地；牢固地；有把握地",["Please make sure that your seat belt is securely fastened.","Holmes edged his way round the wall and flinging the shutters together, he bolted them securely."],["",""]],["detractor","di'træktә(r)","n. 毁损者, 贬低者",["The president's detractors conveniently omit from their criticism all the positive things he's done."],[""]],["firewood","'faiәwud","n. 木柴",["He broke up the chair for firewood.","I am going to take you to the market once more and sell you as dry firewood."],["他摔斷了椅子當柴火。",""]],["pedagogy","'pedәgәudʒi","n. 教育学, 教授法, 教学工作",["Leo Tolstoy built a school and founded a libertarian pedagogy among whose principles was respect for oneself and one's own kind.","Leo Tolstoy built a school and founded a libertarian pedagogy whose principles included respect for oneself and one's own kind."],["",""]],["temperate","'tempәrәt","a. 温和的, 适度的, 有节制的, 温带的",["Our country's climate is temperate.","There aren't so many places in the world that are as temperate and so often sunny as where I live."],["我國是溫帶氣候。",""]],["aptitude","'æptitju:d","n. 资质, 才能, 自然倾向\\n[医] 资质, 才能",["He has a remarkable aptitude for music.","Genius is nothing but a great aptitude for patience."],["他有非凡的音樂天份。",""]],["tarp","tɑ:p","n. (=tarpaulin)防水布, 油布",["My father, in his infinite wisdom, has forgotten to bring the tarp again.","\"Where are the bags?\" \"They're under the tarp over there.\""],["",""]],["defuse",".di:'fju:z","vt. 去掉...的引信, 平息",["Tom was killed instantly when the bomb he was trying to defuse exploded.","The bomb exploded while Tom was trying to defuse it."],["",""]],["healthful","'helθful","a. 有益健康的, 使人健康的, 卫生的\\n[法] 有益健康的, 健康的, 卫生的",["My goats are more healthful than this man's oxen will ever be.","More Vietnamese citizens are looking for food products that are healthful."],["",""]],["muzzle","'mʌzl","n. 动物之鼻口, 口套, 枪口\\nvt. 戴口套于, 使缄默",["Others may find your dog a puzzle. Please be nice and make her wear a muzzle.","Do not muzzle an ox while it is treading out the grain."],["",""]],["incarcerate","in'kɑ:sәreit","vt. 下狱, 监禁, 禁闭\\n[法] 监禁, 使下狱, 禁闭",["If we incarcerate these old men, we can take control.","It is immoral, unethical and unacceptable to incarcerate people for the purpose of generating profit."],["",""]],["calculated","'kælkjuleitid","a. 有计划的, 适当的, 适合的, 计算出的\\n[机] 算清了的",["We calculated that we could reach the place within two weeks.","It was calculated that hundreds of workers would have to work a hundred hours to make a mistake as enormous as that which a computer can make in a millionth of a second."],["我们估计能在两周内到那个地方。","据统计，数百名员工不得不工作上百个小时出现的失误与计算机在百万分之一秒的时间内才会犯的错同样巨大。"]],["stealth","stelθ","n. 秘密行动, 秘密, 鬼祟\\n[法] 秘密行动, 鬼祟",["The greatest pleasure I know is to do a good action by stealth and have it found out by accident.","The cheetah uses a combination of stealth and explosive acceleration to catch its prey."],["",""]],["incision","in'siʒәn","n. 切口, 切割, 雕刻, 切入\\n[医] 切口, 切开, 缺口(叶)",["Ziri had a small incision in the back of his neck.","The surgeon carefully used the medical scissors to make a precise incision during the surgical procedure."],["",""]],["whirlwind","'hwә:lwind","n. 旋风",["It was clear that Fadil and Layla were involved in a whirlwind romance.","Their whirlwind courtship quickly led to marriage."],["",""]],["psychotherapy",".saikәu'θerәpi","n. 精神疗法, 心理疗法\\n[医] 精神疗法, 心理疗法",["The show's about a New Jersey mob boss who's in psychotherapy.","Sami got lots of effective psychotherapy in prison."],["",""]],["decreasing","di'kri:siŋ","[计] 下降的",["As is evident from the data, smoking is not decreasing among the young.","A recent survey shows that the number of smokers is decreasing."],["数据表明年轻人抽烟的现象没有减少。","最近的一项调查显示吸烟的人数减少了。"]],["aberration","æbә'reiʃәn","n. 离开正路, 偏离, 畸变, 光行差, 心理失常, 色差\\n[化] 光行差; 像差",["Owing to a strange mental aberration, Tom forgot his own name.","Such a sanction is an inconceivable aberration in the application of international law."],["",""]],["technologically","teknә'lɔdʒikәli","adv. 技术上地；科技地",["Japan is becoming the most advanced country technologically.","The Romans were one of the most technologically advanced civilizations of antiquity."],["",""]],["hunk","hʌŋk","n. 大块\\na. 行的, 好的",["We won't get very far with this hunk of junk."],[""]],["emigration",".emi'greiʃәn","n. 移民, 移居外国(或外地)\\n[医] 血细胞渗出",["Algeria is losing its youngest and brightest people to emigration.","Algeria is losing many skilled workers to emigration."],["",""]],["ornamental",".ɒ:nә'mentl","n. 装饰物, 观赏植物\\na. 装饰性的, 装饰的, 观赏用的",["Tom has several ornamental birds in his backyard as well as a garden gnome.","There is a tendency to utilize underground space for the less ornamental purposes of civilization."],["",""]],["finalize","'fainәlaiz","vt. 使结束, 定稿\\nvi. 定局",["My credit card application at the bank was approved. Now I need to wait for a representative to call me to finalize the process.","After landing, he headed straight to the car rental office to finalize the reservation."],["",""]],["bisexual",".bai'seksjuәl","a. 两性的, 雌雄同体的\\n[医] 两性的",["Sami is bisexual and doesn't consider himself part of the gay community.","It's more ridiculous to speak constructed languages than to be gay, bisexual or transsexual."],["",""]],["priceless","'praislis","a. 无价的, 极贵重的",["The saying goes: to turn a new leaf is priceless. The saying also goes: a dog can't change their habits of eating shit!","After he bumped into the shelf, the priceless china fell and shattered into fragments."],["俗話說：浪子回頭金不換；可俗話又說：狗改不了吃屎！",""]],["spruce","spru:s","n. 云杉\\na. 颇为干净的, 俏的, 整洁的\\nv. (使)显干净, 打扮整齐",["Tom told me that he often drinks root beer, but he'd not only never drunk spruce beer, he'd never even heard of it.","In Appalachia, no ecosystem is better at capturing carbon dioxide than red spruce forests."],["",""]],["cartilage","'kɑ:tilidʒ","n. 软骨\\n[医] 软骨",["Disk herniation is when cartilage, called 'intervertebral disk' and found between each vertebra, slips out.","The meniscus is not a bone. It is a cartilage, a flexible, elastic tissue."],["",""]],["crossover","'krɒsәuvә","n. 转到另一方, 天桥, 交叉\\n[电] 交越",["If it exists, a crossover with it will eventually happen.","Tom and Sami reunited for another crossover sentence."],["",""]],["dreamy","'dri:mi","a. 空幻的, 梦想的",["She was so dreamy that no one dared to approach her.","Her large, deep, blue eyes had a dreamy look, but a childlike smile still played round her mouth."],["",""]],["goodies","","n. 特别吸引人的东西, 糖果, 好吃的东西, 美味的食品, 令人愉快的东西",["In Quezon City, at the end of a road lined with coconut trees was Merced Bakehouse that was full of Filipino baked goodies.","\"How do you manage to keep your slim figure in spite of eating all these goodies?\" \"Ah, well, that's my secret!\""],["",""]],["transmitted","","v. 传输；传送（transmit的过去分词）",["Condoms offer protection against sexually transmitted diseases.","\"El Chavo del 8\" is a Mexican series transmitted in Brazil by the Brazilian Television System (BTS)."],["避孕套可以預防性傳播疾病。","《查沃德爾奧喬》是一部墨西哥電視劇，由巴西電視系統 (BTS) 在巴西播出。"]],["helplessly","","adv. 无能为力地；无助地",["Layla watched helplessly as Sami turned the knife on her little brother.","It may seem silly, but I'm helplessly in love with you."],["",""]],["connector","kә'nektә","n. 连结者, 联系者, 连结物\\n[计] 连接口",["The connector road was backed up because of an accident and it took an hour to get home.","You must plug in the connector first."],["",""]],["epitomize","i'pitәmaiz","vt. 摘要, 概括",["Anna's radiant smile and graceful demeanor epitomize the elegance and poise commonly associated with Russian women.","They epitomize the romance of the Australian Outback but sheep shearers are deserting the job in droves, sending the country's wool industry into crisis."],["",""]],["crotch","krɒtʃ","n. 分叉处, 丫叉, 胯部",["Driving into Dublin airport, I always think the main building looks like a crotch.","If you just crouch a little, her crotch can just be seen flicking in and out of sight."],["",""]],["fiasco","fi'æskәu","n. 惨败, 大失败",["Whatever the reason, forfeiting the trade that we finally got on track is a fiasco.","Up to that point, every attempt had resulted in a fiasco."],["",""]],["fungal","'fʌŋ^әl","a. 真菌, 突然发生而迅速生长的东西, 真菌类植物, 海绵肿, 真菌类病害\\n[医] 真菌的, 霉菌的",["Tom and Mary tested the wheat for fungal infestation. It ought to be harvested in six to eight weeks.","Tom and Mary were testing the wheat for fungal infestation. It ought to be harvested in six to eight weeks."],["",""]],["creak","kri:k","n. 辗轧声, 嘎吱嘎吱声\\nvi. 作辗轧声, 发出辗轧声",["When it's windy, the leaves of the old oak rustle and its branches creak.","When the wind blows, the leaves of the old oak rustle, and the branches creak."],["刮風的時候，老橡樹的葉子會沙沙作響，樹枝會發出嘎吱聲。","刮風的時候，老橡樹的葉子會沙沙作響，樹枝會發出嘎吱聲。"]],["punt","pʌnt","n. 方头平底船, 踢悬空球, 赌博者\\nv. 踢悬空球, 用篙撑船, 赌博",["A punt play is less common in American football than a pass or running play.","We traveled down the river in a punt."],["",""]],["bedrock","bed'rɒk","n. 基岩, 基本原理, 基础",["Without bedrock, Manhattan's skyscrapers would be unstable.","The bedrock of a healthy diet is a variety of fruits and vegetables."],["",""]],["flickering","'flikәriŋ","a. 闪烁的, 摇曳的, 微弱的\\n[计] 闪烁",["All I could see was the flickering lights.","The candle's flame is flickering in the soft breeze."],["我只能看到閃爍的燈光。",""]],["ammonia","ә'mәunjә","n. 氨水, 阿摩尼亚\\n[化] 氨",["Don't mix ammonia and bleach together.","Ammonia is a colorless liquid or gas with a very strong smell."],["别把氨水和漂白剂混在一起。",""]],["indulgence","in'dʌldʒәns","n. 沉溺, 放纵, 嗜好\\n[法] 宽容, 纵容, 赎罪券",["Excessive indulgence spoiled the child.","Find a mean between harshness and indulgence."],["",""]],["tundra","'tʌndrә","n. 苔原, 冻原",["Examples of animals common to alpine tundra environments include mountain goats, pikas, chinchillas, yaks, and marmots.","Alpine tundra is a biome or natural region at high elevation which does not contain trees."],["",""]],["bombardment","bɒm'bɑ:dmәnt","n. 炮击\\n[化] 轰击",["Nothing would escape a Chinese bombardment in Taiwan.","I would miss food stalls, the lilt of the Thai language, the constant bombardment of cheesy advertisements."],["",""]],["irritating","'iriteitiŋ","a. 刺激的, 使愤怒的, 气人的",["Tom is one of the most irritating people I've ever met.","Far from irritating my skin it was better than before I used it."],["",""]],["legislate","'ledʒisleit","vi. 制定法律\\nvt. 用立法规定",["It's not possible to legislate against stupidity."],[""]],["pounce","pauns","n. 猛扑, 爪\\nvi. 猛扑, 突袭\\nvt. 扑住",["He knows that his critics are waiting to pounce on any slip that he makes.","The tiger lies in wait in the head-high grass, ready to pounce."],["",""]],["workable","'wә:kәbl","a. 可经营的, 可使用的\\n[机] 能工作的, 机械等能使用的, 材料等可加工的",["After considering your idea for a few days, I don't think it's a workable one.","Well, if you want my tuppence worth, I don't think this plan is really workable."],["",""]],["transgression","træns'greʃәn","n. 违反, 犯罪\\n[医] 亲和转移",["Plagiarism is a serious transgression of academic ethics."],[""]],["glimmer","'glimә","n. 一丝光线, 微光, 少许\\nvi. 发微光",["There was a glimmer of light from the dark window.","There was still a glimmer of hope that everything would be alright."],["",""]],["duel","'dju:әl","n. 决斗, 斗争\\nvi. 决斗",["Kyouichi Saionji, who he supposed would win the duel, has lost.","\"Dad, this a real sword?\" \"Of course, it is a duel after all.\""],["大家都以為西園寺會勝出那場決鬥的，但他卻輸了。","“爸爸，这是真的剑吗？”“当然，毕竟这是一场对决。”"]],["philippine","'filipi:n","a. 菲律宾(群岛)的, 菲律宾人的",["Carioca is a Philippine, often ball-shaped doughnut made of sugared deep-fried ground glutinous rice with grated coconut.","The flag of the town of Vila Velha looks like an inverted Philippine flag."],["",""]],["conclusive","kәn'klu:siv","a. 决定性的, 确定性的, 最后的\\n[法] 决定性的, 不容置疑的, 确实的",["Today, their efforts have paid off and they are in possession of conclusive evidence, an achievement which is indeed commendable.","There has been no conclusive proof regarding extra-sensory perception."],["",""]],["calamity","kә'læmiti","n. 灾难, 不幸事件",["He prophesied that a dreadful calamity would happen.","The anticipation is always worse than the calamity."],["",""]],["tragically","'trædʒɪklɪ","adv. 悲剧地, 悲惨地",["Roger Waters was found this morning in his hotel room, tragically alive.","Love should be taken seriously, but not tragically."],["",""]],["steroid","'stiәrɒid","n. 类固醇\\n[化] 甾族化合物",["She was born with underdeveloped lungs, but eventually a few steroid shots set her straight.","Tom was prescribed a type of anabolic steroid by his doctor."],["",""]],["floppy","'flɒpi","a. 叭嗒叭嗒响的, 松软的",["Floppy disks are the predecessor of hard disks.","He deleted his floppy disks' content with a magnet."],["软盘是硬盘的前身。",""]],["revolving","ri'vɒlviŋ","a. 回转的, 旋转的, 旋转式的\\n[经] 循环, 周转",["The word came to be used for all small heavenly bodies revolving about larger ones.","Today our artificial satellites are revolving around the earth."],["这个词后来被用来指代围绕大天体的小天体。","今天我们的人造卫星正在环绕地球运转。"]],["exhaustive","ig'zɒ:stiv","a. 消耗的, 枯竭的, 彻底的, 详尽的",["The police undertook exhaustive searches but failed to find the body.","I quickly realized that my text needed an exhaustive revision."],["",""]],["heartbreaking","'hɑ:tbreikiŋ","a. 令人悲伤的, 极其累人的, 令人动情的",["It is heartbreaking for our family to accept the likelihood of spending a third Christmas without Mary.","My youngest is already saying she misses school and she misses her friends, and that's heartbreaking to hear."],["",""]],["byzantine","bi'zæntain","a. 拜占庭帝国的, 拜占庭式的",["The Byzantine Empire dominated Albania until the Ottoman Turks began their conquest in the late 14th century.","The ancient Roman and Byzantine empires had well-developed associations known as demes."],["",""]],["symbolically","sɪm'bɒlɪklɪ","adv. 象征性地",["The couple symbolically planted a tree at the ceremony."],["夫妻倆在典禮上象徵性地種了一棵樹。"]],["drained","dreɪnd","v. （使）流干, （使）逐渐流走( drain的过去式和过去分词 ); 喝光, 喝干; 使（精力、金钱等）耗尽",["He raised the glass to his lips and drained it at one gulp.","He raised the glass to his mouth and drained it all in one shot."],["他把杯子举到嘴边，一饮而尽。","他把杯子举到嘴边，一饮而尽。"]],["lighthouse","'laithaus","n. 灯塔",["We saw the gleam of a distant lighthouse.","In the distance, there stood a dimly white lighthouse."],["我們看到了遠方燈塔的微光。",""]],["diving","'daiviŋ","n. 潜水, 跳水",["I've done rock climbing and deep-sea diving and slept in an Indonesian jungle.","Tom was the owner of the only swimming pool in the city that had a diving board."],["",""]],["stepmother","'step.mʌðә","n. 继母",["Because Vasilissa was the greatest beauty in the whole village, the stepmother and her two daughters envied and hated her.","One day the stepmother had given the girl a frightful beating, and then threatened to kill her outright."],["",""]],["majesty","'mædʒәsti","n. 最高权威, 威严, 王权, 雄伟, 庄严",["Please your Majesty, it was my daughter who is the cleverest girl in all the world.","In all her pompous majesty, carried on the shoulders of the entire football team, stood the de facto queen of the school."],["",""]],["intolerable","in'tɒlәrәbl","a. 无法忍受的, 难耐的",["The pain from the compound fracture was almost intolerable.","For to him it was intolerable to think in a hurry, to jump to slapdash decisions, to act on instincts that could not be explained."],["",""]],["captor","'kæptә","n. 捕捉者, 逮捕他人者\\n[法] 捕获者, 夺得者, 攻夺者",["After it had been unhooked and was being exultantly inspected by the younger and exhibited for the admiration of the older boy, the fish gave a sudden wriggle, slipped through the hands of its captor, and fell back into the river."],[""]],["cyclical","'siklik(e)l","a. 周期的, 轮转的, 循环的, 轮列的, 轮卷的, 环状的, 环的, 组诗的, 始末的\\n[计] 循环的",["Everybody in Algeria knows that oil prices are cyclical.","If time truly is cyclical, then you have read this sentence an infinite number of times already."],["",""]],["wildfire","'waildfaiә","n. (古时战争时所用的)燃料剂, 磷火, 鬼火, 野火",["So many lives were lost due to the wildfire.","Vacationers were evacuated after a wildfire tore through a pine wood near the coastal city of Pescara."],["野火奪走了好多人的生命。",""]],["hurtle","'hә:tl","vi. 猛冲, 碰撞, 突进\\nvt. 猛撞, 猛投\\nn. 投掷, 碰撞, 碰撞声",["The chimp's eyes narrowed, ready to hurtle the stone at the slightest provocation."],[""]],["nonproliferation","'nɔnprәu,lifә'reiʃәn","n. 防扩散\\n[法] 不扩散, 防扩散",["It is crucial that we fine-tune the dialogue on strategic stability and global security and nonproliferation of weapons of mass destruction."],[""]],["thereof",".ðєәr'ɒv","adv. 在其中, 关于..., 由此\\n[法] 由是, 由此, 属于它的",["Whereof one cannot speak, thereof one must be silent.","Europe is not really a continent; it juts westward out of Eurasia, the continent, as India juts southward out thereof."],["",""]],["harmonious","hɑ:'mәuniәs","a. 和睦的, 调和的, 和谐的, 协调的",["Our sex life is not completely harmonious.","Magnanimity is a great treasure; harmonious affinity with others is wonderful, Detachment from name and gain averts trouble; happiness makes older people feel young."],["我們的性生活不是十分和諧。","寬宏大量是個寶; 與人無爭結緣好 放下名利不煩惱; 心生歡喜不覺老."]],["propeller","prә'pelә","n. 螺旋桨, 推进器\\n[化] 搅拌叶片; 螺旋桨",["The propeller acts like a rotating wing creating a lift force by moving through the air.","Propeller-powered aircraft are very efficient for low speed flight."],["",""]],["authorized","'ɒ:θәraizd","a. 经认可的, 经授权的\\n[法] 委任的, 核准的, 许可的",["Is it true that you authorized the driver to take the car home?","You are not authorized to enter there."],["你批准司机把车开回家的事是真的吗？","你无权进入那里。"]],["suffocate","'sʌfәkeit","vt. 使窒息, 噎住, 闷熄\\nvi. 闷死, 窒息, 受阻",["I thought I was going to suffocate on the crowded train.","If I slap you, the whole city will suffocate from face powder."],["",""]],["bookcase","'bukkeis","n. 书架, 书柜",["Tom can't move this bookcase without a little help.","There are a lot of dictionaries in the bookcase."],["如果沒人幫點忙的話，湯姆是沒辦法移動書櫃的。","书架上放着很多字典。"]],["suitor","'sju:tә","n. 起诉者, 请愿者, 求婚者\\n[法] 起诉人, 原告, 求婚者",["Unsure of which suitor she wanted to marry, the princess vacillated, saying now one, now the other.","He began courting her in earnest when he found out that she had another suitor."],["",""]],["dumplings","'dʌmplɪŋz","n. 汤团( dumpling的名词复数 ); 饺子; 水果布丁; 矮胖的人",["Dumplings are essential at the New Year's Eve dinner table.","This means that eating dumplings on New Year's eve is a symbol of family reunion."],["饺子是年夜饭桌上必不可少的。","说明年夜饭的饺子是亲人团聚的象征。"]],["insulting","in'sʌltiŋ","a. 侮辱的, 损害人体的",["There is nothing more awful, insulting, and depressing than banality.","She could no longer put up with his insulting words."],["",""]],["bleachers","'bli:tʃәz","n. 漂白剂（bleacher的复数形式）；（美）露天看台",["Three students ran out onto the football field and mooned everyone sitting in the bleachers.","Ziri found Rima and Walid making out under the bleachers."],["",""]],["excessively","ik'sesivli","adv. 过多, 极度, 过度, 过分",["Don't exercise excessively; do it within your limits, otherwise it may have negative effects on your body.","He worries excessively on the eve of exams."],["不能过度运动，要量力而行，否则反而对身体造成负面影响。","考试前夕，他特别焦虑。"]],["tantrum","'tæntrәm","n. 发脾气, 发怒\\n[医] 暴怒, 发脾气",["The child threw a tantrum because he wanted me to buy him a toy.","The child threw a tantrum because he wanted the toy."],["",""]],["hallucination","hә.lu:si'neiʃәn","n. 幻觉, 幻想\\n[医] 幻觉",["It might have been real. Or maybe it was just a hallucination. I really hope it was the latter.","Ziri began to question whether that was a dream or some sort of hallucination."],["",""]],["congregate","'kɒŋgrigeit","v. (使)集合, (使)聚集\\na. 集合在一起的, 集体的",["In the winter the elk congregate on the golf course.","A pub is a place where people congregate to drink beer."],["",""]],["silicone","'silikәun","n. 硅树脂\\n[化] 硅氧烷; 聚硅氧烷",["Tsuji says he uses resin, platinum and silicone as well as other materials to construct three-dimensional portraits of people such as Andy Warhol and Salvador Dali.","Mary has no silicone, no tattoos and no penis."],["",""]],["manifesto",".mæni'festәu","n. 宣言, 声明",["I'm going to allow my words to be the manifesto of my life.","Our electoral manifesto has been translated into Berber."],["",""]],["aloft","ә'lɒft","adv. 在高处, 在上",["Until now, opinions differed over the question of whether birds could sleep while aloft.","I saw a flock of birds flying aloft."],["",""]],["astonish","ә'stɒniʃ","vt. 使惊讶",["Always do right. This will gratify some people and astonish the rest.","His memory never ceases to astonish me."],["坚持做对的事情。这会满足一部分人同时使另一部分人感到惊讶。","他的记忆力总让我吃惊。"]],["escalation",".eskә'leiʃәn","n. 扩大, 增加\\n[经] 调查, 价格调整",["Thus money in circulation drops, and price escalation quietens down.","This is a serious escalation between Algeria and Morocco."],["",""]],["horizontally","","[计] 水平置中",["In chess, rooks can move vertically and horizontally, bishops move diagonally, and knights jump in the shape of an L.","The missile was carried horizontally, erected by the truck itself, and launched immediately."],["",""]],["irreversible",",iri'vә:sәbl,-sib-","a. 不可逆的, 不可改变的, 不能倒置的, 不能翻转的, 不能倒转的, 不可撤销的\\n[计] 不可逆的",["Deforestation and poor irrigation practices can lead to irreversible desertification.","But few people ponder over the fact that copying English words, terms and phrases causes irreversible mental changes."],["",""]],["herald","'herәld","n. 使者, 传令官, 先驱\\nvt. 预报, 宣布, 传达, 欢呼",["Having scattered the enemy before me and triumphantly returned, this is how they would herald me.","It was the lark, the herald of the morn, no nightingale."],["",""]],["splinter","'splintә","n. 碎片, 尖片, 分裂出来的小派别, 微小的东西\\nv. 使分裂, (使)破裂",["Mary had a splinter in her finger, so she asked Tom to help her get it out.","Tom tried to get the splinter out of Mary's finger."],["",""]],["placid","'plæsid","a. 平静的, 温和的, 沉着的, 平稳的",["Now that he's retired, Yves can look forward to a contented and placid life.","His placid face and regular breathing showed that he was fast asleep."],["",""]],["irregularity","i.regju'læriti","n. 不规则, 例外, 违反规则的行为\\n[化] 不匀度",["We will no longer turn a blind eye, but will publicly denounce every irregularity, no matter how small.","He is the last man to commit an irregularity."],["",""]],["taxable","'tæksәbl","a. 可征税的, 应征税的\\n[经] 可征税的, 应纳税的",["All economic problems would be solved, if they made complacency taxable.","Income from this source is non-taxable."],["",""]],["goofy","'gu:fi","a. 愚笨的, 傻瓜的",["Donald Duck, Mickey Mouse, and Goofy went camping in the mountains.","The cat was pretty goofy and its energy never let up for a moment."],["",""]],["unreal","'ʌn'ri(:)әl","a. 假的, 虚构的, 不真实的, 幻想的",["I find the concept of Globish restrictive and unreal.","Men of broader intellect know that there is no sharp distinction betwixt the real and the unreal."],["",""]],["watering","'wɔ:tәriŋ","n. 洒水, 冲淡, 搀水, 供水, 浇水, 灌溉, 排水渠\\n[经] 虚报, 冲淡, 掺水",["I've finished watering the flowers.","The flowers in the garden need watering."],["我已經澆完花了。","花園裏的花要澆水了。"]],["westward","'westwәd","n. 朝西的方向\\na. 向西的\\nadv. 向西的",["Europe is not really a continent; it juts westward out of Eurasia, the continent, as India juts southward out thereof.","William watched the sunset from the airplane window as he flew westward."],["",""]],["sailboat","'seilbәut","n. 帆船",["The sun glittered on the water in front of the old sailboat.","He started his voyage around the world in his sailboat."],["",""]],["appreciative","ә'pri:ʃiәtiv","a. 有欣赏力的, 感激的",["Lena can become quite a clown when she has an appreciative audience.","John felt more appreciative of the things he had taken for granted."],["",""]],["smug","smʌg","a. 自以为是的, 自鸣得意的, 整洁的\\nn. 书呆子, 自命不凡的家伙",["I think that things like animal rights are really just humanity being smug.","If you were less smug, you might have more friends."],["",""]],["gravitate","'græviteit","vi. 被重力吸引, 沉下, 下降\\nvt. 使受重力吸引",["The wishes and ideas of a composer gravitate around a common point.","Yoko's works often tend to gravitate towards themes of motherhood and family."],["",""]],["metaphorical","metә'fɒ:rikl","a. 隐喻性的, 比喻性的",["This expression has really caught my fancy, as a type of English metaphorical expression not in Japanese.","\"Literally\" can literally mean \"metaphorically\". \"Literal\" meaning \"metaphorical\" is also a literal irony."],["",""]],["ta","tɑ:","interj. 谢谢\\n[计] 终端适配器",["Ta-dah! Well then, Haruta, it's OK to look now! It's everybody's yukata debut.","The student offered to be a teacher's assistant, or a TA."],["",""]],["explanatory","ik'splænәtәri","a. 说明的, 解释的, 辩明的\\n[法] 解释的, 说明的",["When I looked at the explanatory notes under the posts list I realized what was causing it.","Convulsion followed convulsion, till they closed in death, without her being able to utter a word explanatory of the fatal scene."],["",""]],["transatlantic",".trænsәt'læntik","a. 横渡大西洋的, 大西洋彼岸的, 美国的",["Lindbergh's solo nonstop transatlantic flight was a remarkable accomplishment.","Transatlantic flights are among the most profitable parts of Air France-KLM's business."],["",""]],["compilation",".kɒmpi'leiʃәn","n. 编辑, 编纂, 编辑(编纂)物\\n[计] 编译",["He devoted his whole life to compilation of the dictionary.","This corpus is just a giant compilation of independent clauses."],["",""]],["aperture","'æpә.tjuә","n. 孔, 缝隙, 孔径\\n[计] 窗孔; 小孔",["You need a wider aperture, or you won't get enough light reaching the film.","Glancing upward, I saw the aperture, a small blue disc, in which a star was visible."],["",""]],["forgo","fɒ:'gәu","vt. 摒绝, 放弃",["The middle-class woman placed value on her necklace because she didn't want to forgo the privileges of her class.","Tom had to forgo his morning swim, on account of it being too cold."],["",""]],["adversely","","adv. 不利, 有害, 相反, 逆, 敌对, 逆向",["If long-term beds are reduced, then it won't be possible to do that and normal sickbeds will also be adversely affected.","Bending the cable too tightly can also adversely affect signal quality."],["",""]],["influenza",".influ'enzә","n. 流行性感冒\\n[医] 流行性感冒, 流感",["Researchers have found that human influenza is common in tropical and sub-tropical countries, but is often mis-diagnosed.","High fever is a frequent accompaniment of influenza."],["",""]],["ecumenical",",i:kju(:)'menikәl","a. 一般的, 普遍的, 全基督教的, 泛基督教主义的",["When developing an ecumenical service, take care not to offend members of any denomination.","Her experiences of playing with insects as a child led to an ecumenical curiosity in entomology as an adult."],["",""]],["revoke","ri'vәuk","vt. 撤回, 废除\\nvi. 藏牌\\nn. 藏牌\\n[计] 取消权限程序",["We don't think they have the ability to revoke your privileges.","They should revoke the driving license of motorcyclists who drive on the sidewalk."],["",""]],["sweetly","'swi:tli","adv. 甜美地, 惬意地, 讨人喜欢地",["While the bureaucracy comes up with sweetly technical terms like \"less advantaged,\" the slums brim with malcontent.","Sandra smiled at the guard sweetly and let her in."],["",""]],["pinnacle","'pinәkl","n. 小尖塔, 尖峰, 高峰, 极点\\nvt. 造小尖塔, 置于尖顶上",["He's unstoppable right now but the question is how long he can remain at the pinnacle of his career.","In an instant Holmes raced up on to the ridge, and, standing upon a lofty pinnacle, craned his neck in every direction."],["",""]],["femininity",".femi'niniti","n. 妇女特质, 温柔, 柔弱性\\n[医] 女子本性, 女性, 女子气",["The devaluation of femininity perpetuates harmful gender stereotypes and restricts individual expression.","Femininity is a construct influenced by a variety of social and cultural factors."],["",""]],["puberty","'pju:bәti","n. 青春期, 春情发动期\\n[医] 青春期(12-17岁)",["Girls begin puberty around the ages of ten to eleven, and boys around the ages of eleven to twelve.","I've always wanted a younger brother just so I could make fun of him when he's going through puberty."],["",""]],["subdue","sәb'dju:","vt. 使服从, 压制, 减弱, 抑制, 克制",["There is, perhaps, not one of our natural passions so hard to subdue as vanity.","The supreme art of war is to subdue the enemy without fighting."],["",""]],["dizzying","'dizi:iŋ","a. 令人昏乱的；极快的；灿烂的",["Tom looked down upon the city from the dizzying height of the skyscraper.","These cars can reach dizzying speeds on the straights."],["",""]],["rotary","'rәutәri","a. 旋转的, 轮流的\\nn. 旋转式机器",["Do you remember that we had a phone with a rotary dial?"],[""]],["tumultuous","tju:'mʌltʃuәs","a. 吵闹的, 纷乱的, 骚乱的\\n[法] 喧嚣的, 骚乱的, 凶猛的",["Myriad cliffs host dozens of tumultuous brown waterfalls, eerily silent in the distance.","Sami and Layla had a very tumultuous relationship."],["",""]],["pendulum","'pendʒәlәm","n. 钟摆, 摇锤, 摇摆不定的事态(或局面)\\n[化] 摆",["In her latest works she lets the uncanny swing like a grotesque pendulum from the humorous into homelike cosiness and back again.","Not a great deal of energy is required for keeping a free moving pendulum in a state of oscillation."],["",""]],["shank","ʃæŋk","n. 胫, 腿骨, 杆, 柄\\nvt. 用铁球棒末端击球\\nvi. 花从病梗上枯萎脱落",["Even the best tennis players shank their shots occasionally."],[""]],["accuser","ә'kju:zә","n. 控诉者, 指责者\\n[法] 原告, 指控人, 控告者",["A guilty conscience needs no accuser.","Information sometimes varies dramatically according to format: my news feed truncated the last word of the headline \"Ex-boyfriend backs Cain accuser\"."],["",""]],["reverberate","ri'vә:bәreit","vi. 回响, 反响, 被反射\\nvt. 使反响, 使回响, 反射\\na. 回响的, 反射的",["The loud sounds of sawing, drilling and scraping reverberate around the room.","Yanni heard the voice reverberate through the woods."],["",""]],["handwritten","'hænd.ritәn","a. 手写的",["I'm in the habit of taking handwritten notes, yet I still often draw a blank when picking up a pen.","Even small gestures, like a handwritten note, can touch my heart deeply."],["我有手写笔记的习惯，但依然经常提笔忘字。",""]],["erroneous","i'rәuniәs","a. 错误的, 不正确的\\n[法] 错误的, 不正确的",["He does not like to add funny comments about an erroneous translation at all.","The fundamental problem in arguing with a person who denies global warming is that they use erroneous logic."],["",""]],["bumpy","'bʌmpi","a. 颠簸的, 崎岖不平的",["We have a bumpy road in leaving the city, followed by a fine stretch of smooth, beautiful cement highway.","It's really hard to drive on the bumpy roads around here."],["",""]],["knowing","'nәuiŋ","a. 博学的, 聪颖的, 精明的",["The Chinese government controlled the internet to prevent the people from knowing the truth of the Tiananmen Square Massacre.","Knowing that you're doing fine over there, I'm really pleased for you."],["中国政府控制了网络，以免让人民知道六四事件的真相。","知道你在那裡過得不錯，我替你感到高興。"]],["downfall","'daunfɒ:l","n. 衰败, 大雨",["Looking back at the former wise rulers and nations, their success was achieved through diligence and frugality, while their downfall was caused by extravagance and luxury.","Arrogance leads to a person's downfall."],["历览前贤国与家，成由勤俭破由奢。","骄傲使人落后。"]],["embellish","im'beliʃ","vt. 修饰, 装饰, 润色",["Men may embellish their look with gloves or a top hat if they desire.","You're just seeking to embellish all this!"],["",""]],["twelfth","twelfθ","num. 第十二, 十二分之一",["The old church on the hill dates back to the twelfth century.","Imogen of the Internet blatantly forsakes web accessibility guidelines when redesigning her Tumblr for the twelfth time today."],["山上的老教堂的歷史可以追溯到12世紀。",""]],["mesa","'meisә","n. 台面, 岩滩, 平顶山",["The mesa rose above the desert floor."],["平頂山聳立在沙漠之上。"]],["detergent","di'tә:dʒәnt","n. 清洁剂\\n[化] 洗涤剂",["I don't like to use liquid laundry detergent.","This towel needs to be washed with high-quality detergent."],["我不喜歡用洗衣液。",""]],["steamy","'sti:mi","a. 蒸汽的, 充满蒸汽的",["Sami and Layla's relationship evolved into a hot and steamy affair.","Yanni was having a steamy affair with Ziri's wife."],["",""]],["unnerve",".ʌn'nә:v","vt. 使失去勇气, 使胆怯, 使不能自制\\n[医] 除神经",["Tom was confident that his submission was going to win but as soon as he saw Mary's model, it unnerved him."],[""]],["euphoria","ju:'fɒ:riә","n. 兴奋, 陶醉, 陶醉感\\n[医] 精神愉快, 欣快",["You get a feeling of euphoria upon completing a hike of the Appalachian Trail.","The euphoria of victory does not blind us to the realities of the moment."],["",""]],["reintroduce","ri:intrә'dju:s","vt. 再引进, 再介绍",["They applied for a license to reintroduce wildcats in this area of Algeria.","Scientists are trying to reintroduce the sturgeon to rivers where it once freely migrated."],["",""]],["exhilarating","ig'zilәreitiŋ","a. 令人喜欢的, 使人愉快的, 爽快的",["He took the young men on an exclusive and exhilarating ride through the famous southern Florida wetlands on an airboat.","Beethoven's music portrays the whole spectrum of human emotions, from exhilarating joy to deep despair."],["",""]],["melted","","melt的过去式和过去分词",["Pour melted butter over the popcorn.","Last night there was still snow on the ground, but this morning it's all melted."],["將融化了的奶油倒入爆米花中。",""]],["gnaw","nɒ:","v. 咬, 啃, 侵蚀, 消耗, 折磨",["Sometimes wolves gnaw at each other's throats, but the lives of sheep don't get easier from this.","Beavers sometimes get crushed by the trees they gnaw down."],["",""]],["soggy","'sɒgi","a. 浸水的, 沉闷的\\n[化] 欠硫; 硫化不足",["After a while, corn flakes in milk will become soggy.","Tom dunked the Oreo in milk for too long and it became soggy."],["",""]],["undue",".ʌn'dju:","a. 不适当的, 过度的, 未到期的\\n[经] 未到(支付)期的",["Jealousy is the undue concern about the preservation of that which can only be lost if not worth keeping.","Do nothing that will bring undue attention to yourself."],["",""]],["atheist","'eiθiist","n. 无神论者",["It's about as easy to start a union in a Walmart as it is to start an atheist club in the Vatican.","An open discussion with an atheist took place recently in a mosque in Cairo."],["在沃尔玛建立工会和在梵蒂冈建立无神论俱乐部一样容易。",""]],["refinance",".ri:fai'næns","vt. 再为...筹钱, 再供...资金",["With the theft of their life savings, they were forced to refinance their mortgage-free home to pay for their prescription drugs. The couple has given up driving their car and instead ride the bus to save money."],[""]],["vacate","vә'keit","vt.vi. 使空出, 搬出, 腾出, 不再使用/居住, 解除(职位), 撤离(阵地), 辞职, 退位\\nvt. 取消, 使作废",["We need to vacate the house by the end of the month at the latest.","We must vacate the house before next month."],["",""]],["fright","frait","n. 惊骇, 吃惊\\n[医] 惊吓",["The boy fell of fright when he saw a ghost.","Tom couldn't understand Mary's nervousness before the act before he himself got stage fright."],["那个男孩子见到鬼的时候吓了一跳。",""]],["loathe","lәuð","vt. 厌恶, 憎恶",["As for physical exercise, although I loathe most sports (I think they're really boring), I do like going to the gym to lift weights.","I loathe people who think they can just buy whatever they want."],["要说锻炼身体，虽然我痛恨大部分的运动，觉得它们真的无聊，但是我喜欢去健身房举重。",""]],["provocation",".prɒvә'keiʃәn","n. 激怒, 刺激, 挑拨\\n[医] 激发[作用]",["The band of Indians were ready to go on the warpath at the slightest provocation.","Until such difficulties are ironed out completely, there is always a chance of fighting breaking out at the slightest provocation."],["",""]],["fauna","'fɒ:nә","n. 动物群\\n[医] 动物区系",["The island's unique flora and fauna must be protected.","Madagascar is famous for its flora and fauna, as well as its inclement weather."],["",""]],["glaring","'glєәriŋ","a. 闪耀的, 炫目的, 瞪视的",["Tom kept talking to Mary, even though the teacher was glaring at him.","Ziri kissed his teeth as he was glaring at the teacher."],["",""]],["covet","'kʌvit","v. 妄想, 垂涎",["People from all over the world covet a table at this very restaurant.","As soon as one of my eyes catches sight of you, the other begins to covet you."],["",""]],["gridlock","ˈgrɪdlɒk","n. 交通全面大堵塞; 僵局\\nv. （交通等）堵塞",["That really would cause some serious gridlock.","Gridlock occurs when cars block intersections."],["",""]],["sheath","ʃi:θ","n. 鞘, 叶鞘, 翅鞘\\n[化] 护套",["He laughed, and his laughter was like the purr of a sword sliding from a silken sheath.","Eventually, he returned the sword to its sheath."],["",""]],["underwrite","'ʌndәrait","vt. 签名于下, 给...保险\\nvi. 经营保险业",["Not every company can afford to underwrite such an expensive event."],[""]],["trump","trʌmp","n. 王牌, 法宝, 喇叭\\nvt. 打出王牌赢, 胜过\\nvi. 出王牌, 吹喇叭",["On March 1, President Donald Trump has signed an executive order making English the official language of the United States.","Boris Johnson is the British Donald Trump."],["3 月 1 日，唐纳德・特朗普总统签署了一项行政命令，将英语定为美国的官方语言。","鲍里斯·约翰逊是英国的唐纳·川普。"]],["veal","vi:l","n. 小牛肉\\nvt. 宰小牛",["If we gave priority to the veal and take very little colostrum, it passes. The man forgets himself, alas!","Tomorrow we will buy turkey and veal."],["",""]],["logger","'lɒgә","n. 樵夫, 圆木装车机\\n[计] 记录器; 注册器; 登记器",["The thousand-year-old tree was cut down by the logger."],[""]],["wobble","'wɒbl","n. 摆动, 摇晃, 不稳定, 抖动\\nvi. 摇晃, 摇摆, 游移不定\\nvt. 使摇摆, 使颤动",["I always use the steps, but...it's scary how they wobble...so I'd like you to hold them steady.","Basically, when too many people walked over the bridge at one time, each footstep exerted a slight sideways force, which, in turn, caused a very noticeable wobble."],["",""]],["posttest","'pəʊstɪst","n. 课程结束考核",["A posttest will be given at the end of the term."],["學期末會進行後測。"]],["pocketbook","'pɒkitbuk","n. 笔记本, 钱袋, 皮夹, 经济来源",["I get caught in the rain, I'm late for my date, and I lose my pocketbook. It's just one thing after another today.","When I felt for my pocketbook I found it was gone."],["",""]],["clamber","'klæmbә","n. 攀登, 爬上\\nv. 爬上, 攀登",["She watched the tiny puppy clamber up the big stairs.","The children clamber over the fence."],["",""]],["peg","peg","n. 钉, 桩, 栓, 藉口, 销子, 借口\\nvt. 钉木钉, 固定, 限制, 使受约束\\nvi. 坚持不懈地奋力于, 疾行",["It is difficult to peg the direction of interest deregulation.","Tom tried to fit the square peg into the round hole."],["",""]],["countertop","'kajntәtɔp","n. (厨房的)工作台面",["Luis bought a new product to clean the countertop.","The sink was full, so I left the plate on the countertop."],["",""]],["ipo","","abbr. 首次公开募股（Initial Public Offerings）；初次公开发行（Initial Public Offering）",["The Alibaba Group reported a jump in second quarter earnings ahead of the IPO, with total revenue climbing 46 percent from year-ago levels to $2.54 billion."],[""]],["anova","","[化] 方差分析",["The researcher ran an ANOVA to compare the means."],["研究者用變異數分析比較平均值。"]],["honk","hɒŋk","n. 雁鸣, 汽车的喇叭声\\nvi. 雁鸣叫, 按汽车喇叭\\nvt. 揿(喇叭)",["When I approach an intersection, I always honk my horn just in case."],[""]],["bosom","'buzәm","n. 胸部, 胸, 胸怀, 内部, 中间\\nvt. 怀抱",["For a long time, no village girl would dress her hair or bosom with the sweetest flower from that field of death.","Fashion in the eighteenth century emphasized the bosom."],["",""]],["simmering","'sɪmərɪŋ","v. 炖, 慢煮( simmer的现在分词 ); 充满势将爆发的（怒气等）",["Two women wielding giant spatulas continuously stir a brimming wok of shredded beef simmering in curry sauce.","The soup is simmering on the stove and the bread is cooking in the oven."],["兩名女子揮舞著巨大的鍋鏟，不停地翻炒著盛滿咖哩醬汁的牛肉絲。",""]],["pawn","pɒ:n","n. 典当, 抵押物, 人质, (象棋)兵, 马前卒, 工具\\nvt. 当掉, 以...担保",["A person who is only a pawn in the game often talks big in company.","A clerk in the office is only a pawn in the game of big business."],["",""]],["forfeit","'fɒ:fit","n. 没收物, 罚金, 丧失\\nvt. 没收, 丧失\\na. 丧失了的",["You refuse a toast, only to be forced to drink a forfeit.","The team had to forfeit the match due to lack of players."],["敬酒不吃吃罰酒。",""]],["momentous","mәu'mentәs","a. 重大的, 重要的",["The discovery will have a momentous effect on the treatment of cancer.","The falling of the Berlin Wall was truly a momentous occasion."],["",""]],["millimeter","'milimi:tә","n. 毫米\\n[医] 毫米",["If the bullet had been a millimeter to the left, he would have died.","This windshield chip is about four millimeter wide."],["",""]],["unilaterally","","[计] 单侧地",["You can't just decide things unilaterally like that. We have to come to a consensus.","Tom unilaterally decided that he and Mary were in a relationship."],["",""]],["detonate","'detәneit","vt. 引爆, 使爆炸, 使爆裂\\nvi. 爆炸, 发爆炸声",["We're going to detonate the bomb in a few moments.","The police caught the suicide bomber before he could detonate his bomb."],["",""]],["amputation",".æmpju'teiʃәn","n. 切断, 截肢术\\n[医] 切断术",["Amputation is needed."],[""]],["naughty","'nɒ:ti","a. 顽皮的, 没规矩的, 不适当的, 下流的",["That little naughty one is running around the living room again!","It is very naughty of you to pull the kitten's tail."],["這個小皮蛋，又在客廳亂跑！",""]],["inseparable","in'sepәrәbl","a. 不能分的\\n[化] 不可分的",["Good health is inseparable from exercise and moderation.","He and I were inseparable friends during our time together in school."],["健康与运动及节制密不可分。","我和他在學生時代是分不開的朋友。"]],["captivate","'kæptiveit","vt. 迷住, 迷惑",["He knows how to captivate his audience.","I saw the stars; they captivate the eye, and their beauty is beyond comparison."],["他知道如何去吸引他的聽眾。",""]],["chimpanzee",".tʃimpәn'zi:","n. 黑猩猩\\n[医] 黑猩猩",["I observe a chimpanzee peel a banana and eat it.","The chimpanzee is an intelligent creature, capable of solving simple problems."],["我观察到一只黑猩猩剥了一根香蕉并吃了它。",""]],["nook","nuk","n. 角落, 躲蔽处, 隐匿处, 凹处",["He found solace in retreating to his favorite reading nook.","Tom searched every nook and cranny of the house looking for his wallet."],["",""]],["strenuous","'strenjuәs","a. 奋发的, 费劲的, 艰苦的",["He just naturally avoids everything that is intense, difficult or strenuous.","The journey to China was strenuous, so I'm rather tired."],["",""]],["appall","ә'pɒ:l","vt. 使丧胆, 使惊骇",["The destruction of the environment is appalling."],[""]],["pointedly","","adv. 指向地；尖锐地",["But then the dogs were howling pointedly, insistently toward the south.","He pointedly ignored her as she walked into the room."],["",""]],["substantiate","sәb'stænʃieit","vt. 使实体化, 证实\\n[经] 确证",["Prosecutors in court have to substantiate their claims in order to prove a suspect is guilty.","I am going to substantiate this theory."],["",""]],["vibe","vaɪb","n. 感应",["This place gives me a really bad vibe.","Jonas wasn't someone John was going to vibe with easily."],["这地方给我一个很差的印象。",""]],["parmesan","'pɑ:mizæn","n. 帕尔马干酪(意大利产)",["\"I'm going to try to make chicken parmesan for my family tonight,\" said Matthew's sister after trying his recipe.","\"This chicken parmesan tastes amazing, Matthew. You should open a restaurant,\" said his friend."],["馬修的姊姊在試過他的食譜後說道：「我今晚要試著為家人做帕瑪森雞排。」",""]],["entrenched","","a. 牢固的, 根深蒂固的",["We had to run the gauntlet of entrenched defenders.","On the 19th, we were ordered to assault formidably entrenched German trenches."],["",""]],["utensil","ju:'tensl","n. 器皿, 用具",["The pressure cooker is a cooking utensil that closes hermetically.","The ballpoint pen replaced the fountain pen as the universal writing utensil."],["",""]],["antics","'æntiks","n. 滑稽动作, 古怪姿态",["A good Tatoeba contributor adopts orphaned sentences so the rest of us can focus on Christopher Columbus and his zany antics.","Benedito played with the kids, making them laugh with his silly antics."],["",""]],["flaming","'fleimiŋ","a. 燃烧的, 热烈的, 色彩鲜明的",["The juggler tossed a flaming baton to his partner.","Janos started throwing flaming marshmallows at the tent."],["",""]],["cosmopolitan",",kɔzmә'pɔlitәn","a. 世界主义的, 世界性的, 全世界的, 遍生的, 不偏狭的, 卓有见识的\\nn. 世界主义者, 世界性",["The bourgeoisie turned the production and consumption of every country cosmopolitan by exploiting the world economy.","Her standards for men are impossibly high, thanks to a girlhood rich in Disney, Cosmopolitan, and private school."],["",""]],["intervening","","[计] 中间的, 插入的",["He felt convinced that Jonas was again the Jonas he had known a week ago, and not the Jonas of the intervening time.","France is intervening in battles between government troops and rebels in Mali."],["",""]],["overtly","'әuvә:tly. әu'vә:tly","adv. 明显地；公开地, 公然地",["Those spikes under the bridge are overtly hostile architecture.","Ziri was overtly lying and spreading false information about Islam and Muslims."],["",""]],["hasty","'heisti","a. 匆匆的, 轻率的, 性怠的",["Maria is always making hasty decisions, forgetting about the consequences.","Being a hasty person, he is likely to jump to conclusions."],["",""]],["immaculate","i'mækjulit","a. 无污点的, 纯洁的, 无缺点的, 无辜的\\n[医] 无斑点, 无瑕疵的, 洁净的",["That poodle has an immaculate pedigree, with illustrious ancestors on both sides stretching back generations.","She cleans the house endlessly, thus keeping it immaculate."],["",""]],["glitch","^litʃ","[计] 假信号",["We found a glitch in the program that will have to be dealt with before we move on.","The Tokyo Stock Exchange had to shutdown because of a hardware glitch."],["",""]],["unnecessarily","ʌn'nesisәrili","adv. 不必要地, 多余地",["There is no need to be unnecessarily anxious about the outbreak.","Excessive reliance on monetary policy in an attempt to curb inflation could unnecessarily constrain credit and hence business."],["",""]],["pessimism","'pesimizm","n. 悲观, 悲观情绪, 悲观主义\\n[医] 悲观主义",["Optimism is like the lamp of hope. Pessimism [or negativity] is like a drug of sorrow.","Your pessimism won't produce any positive results."],["樂觀如明燈,照亮希望的前程. 消極如毒品,腐蝕健康的心靈.",""]],["impasse","'impɑ:s","n. 难局, 僵局, 死路, 死胡同",["We had our priorities, they had their preferences, and we came to an impasse.","Humanitarian organizations fear the ongoing impasse and the hostile rhetoric could heighten local xenophobia."],["",""]],["doe","dәu","n. 母鹿, 雌兔",["\"Vasya Pupkin\" sounds much worse than \"John Doe\", and it does not mean quite the same thing, either.","A roe is a kind of deer. The male is called a roebuck, the female a doe, and their young are called fawns."],["",""]],["enactment","i'næktm(ә)nt","n. 制定, 条例, 法规, 法令, 颁布, 规定\\n[法] 制定, 规定, 颁布",["Common law is derived from judicial decisions, constitutional law from the constitution of the state or country, and statutory law from the enactments passed by a legislature."],[""]],["homestead","'hәumsted","n. 家园, 田产\\n[法] 宅基地, 住宅",["Mary was the matriarch of the family who lived on the homestead for five generations.","Tom bought a remote homestead in the Scottish Highlands."],["",""]],["selectively","","adv. 有选择地",["I selectively don't like kids at school by their choice of death metal bands.","I began to marginalize the pepperoni on the pizza by devouring it selectively based on its protein index."],["",""]],["fluctuate","'flʌktʃueit","vi. 变动, 起伏, 动摇\\nvt. 使波动, 使动摇",["The budget is bound to fluctuate due to the economy.","Vegetable prices fluctuate according to the season."],["",""]],["insightful","'in.saitful","a. 有深刻见解的, 富有洞察力的",["The professor provided an insightful analysis of the current economic climate.","Differences in values can lead to insightful discussions."],["",""]],["pimp","pimp","n. 皮条客, 男妓, 恶棍, 窥探情人者, 告密者\\nvi. 拉皮条, 告密",["Sami, a pimp, gave Layla a false sense of feeling secure.","Give some time to pimp up a little before we leave."],["",""]],["bathing","'beiðiŋ","n. 游泳, 洗海水澡",["Otherwise, it is considered impolite to pass food with the left hand, because the left hand is used for bathing.","The first time he met his friend was when he was bathing in the sea."],["否则，用左手传递食物会被认为是不礼貌的，因为左手是用来洗澡的。",""]],["adherent","әd'hiәrәnt","n. 信徒, 追随者\\na. 附着的, 发生联系的",["To an adherent of the Paleo diet, a bean salad is considered a menace to the universe to the likes of Nomad, an indestructible planet-destroying space probe from the original Star Trek series."],[""]],["oftentimes","'ɒ:fntaimz","adv. 时常地",["Oftentimes things don't happen as we'd imagined them.","Social attitudes oftentimes take generations to change."],["",""]],["checkup","'tʃekʌp","n. 审查, 鉴定, 健康检查",["The doctor was giving a patient a checkup.","Tom underwent a general medical checkup. The results showed that he is a healthy person."],["医生在给病人看病。",""]],["binge","bindʒ","n. 狂闹, 狂欢",["Julie gains 20 pounds every month from her eating binge.","I need to binge watch that series before they take it off of streaming."],["",""]],["overcoat","'әuvәkәut","n. 外套大衣",["The child had no overcoat on although it was very cold.","It's so cold here that we can't do without an overcoat."],["尽管天气很冷，孩子却没有大衣穿。",""]],["epiphany","i'pifәni","n. 主显节, 出现",["The Epiphany marks the baptism of Jesus in the River Jordan.","In his Epiphany homily Monday in St. Peter's Basilica, Francis encouraged people to focus on serving others, not themselves."],["",""]],["foggy","'fɒgi","a. 雾深的, 模糊的",["She slowly disappeared into the foggy forest.","It was so foggy I couldn't tell who it was."],["她緩緩消失在霧氣瀰漫的森林中。","霧太大了，我看不清楚是誰。"]],["roasting","'rәustiŋ","a. 非常热的\\nadv. 非常热地",["Matthew enjoys roasting marshmallows over the campfire.","The old man sat cosily by his warm stove. The fire was blazing brightly and some apples were roasting in front of it."],["",""]],["stucco","'stʌkәu","n. 粉饰灰泥\\nvt. 涂以灰泥, 粉刷",["The house was clad in brightly colored stucco."],[""]],["apprenticeship","ә'prentisʃip","n. 学徒身分, 见习(期)\\n[经] 学徒制, 学徒期",["Tom completed his apprenticeship as an electrician.","Catherine is doing an apprenticeship abroad as a cook."],["",""]],["sobering","ˈsəʊbərɪŋ","a. 有节制的; 清醒的, 冷静的; 朴素的, 柔和的; 持重的\\nv. 使清醒(sober的ing形式); 使冷静",["The results of the study were sobering, to say the least.","The prose of everyday life can be very sobering."],["",""]],["beleaguered","bɪ'liɡɚd","v. 围攻（beleaguer的过去式和过去分词）\\na. 围困的；包围的",["After all of these years of war, the populace is tired and beleaguered.","The beleaguered city held out against the enemy's attacks for weeks."],["",""]],["flashback","'flæʃbæk","n. 倒叙, 火舌回闪\\n[机] 回闪",["To the naked eye, the view of this little Pennsylvania town looks like a flashback to the past.","This movie has way too many flashback scenes."],["",""]],["paternal","pә'tә:nl","a. 父亲的, 父系的, 似父亲的, 得自父亲的, 家长式统治的\\n[法] 父系的, 父亲的",["He's my father's father. He's my paternal grandpa.","She is my father's mother. She is my paternal grandmother."],["",""]],["spam","","n. 罐头猪肉, 垃圾邮件\\nv. 发送垃圾邮件",["One look at the subject line and I could tell it was a spam email.","He sent about 2.2 billion spam emails over a period of around one and a half years."],["",""]],["launcher","'lɒ:ntʃә","n. 发射者, 发射台",["Tom downloaded a new app launcher to organize his smartphone's home screen.","The satellite launcher successfully placed three small probes into low Earth orbit."],["",""]],["registry","'redʒistri","n. 登记处, 登记名册\\n[计] 登录库",["In Germany, people can only get married at the registry office.","The wedding is taking place at the registry office."],["",""]],["polarization",",pәjlәrai'zeiʃәn; -ri'z-","n. 极化, 极化强度, 偏振, 两极分化\\n[计] 定位; 对位",["The film was alarmingly prescient about political polarization."],[""]],["inflated","in'fleitid","a. 膨胀的, 充了气的, 夸张的, 通货膨胀的",["The frog inflated himself more and more, until finally he burst.","The severe housing shortage is partly to blame for the inflated rents."],["",""]],["aversion","ә'vә:ʃәn","n. 厌恶, 讨厌的事, 讨厌的人\\n[医] 厌恶, 移转, 移位",["Squashing the centipede crossed Rodrigo's mind, but he hesitated due to his aversion to killing living creatures.","To those who meditate the feet of God,who neither has desire nor aversion, evil shall never come."],["",""]],["nurturing","ˈnə:tʃərɪŋ","v. 养育( nurture的现在分词 ); 培育; 滋长; 助长",["The macho society discourages men from engaging in nurturing and caregiving roles.","The acer seedlings required careful nurturing to grow properly."],["",""]],["chronology","krә'nɔlәdʒi","n. 年代学, 资料按年月次序的排列, 按时间顺序编制的表格, 年表",["I took the most important events from the chronology of information science and wrote a few words about each one.","I here aver that his chronology is correct."],["",""]],["idiom","'idiәm","n. 习语, 成语, 惯用语法, 方言",["\"Having a clear conscience\" is an idiom.","I foolishly interpreted the idiom according to its literal sense."],["问心无愧是一个成语。",""]],["binder","'baindә","n. 捆缚者, 用以绑缚之物, 活页夹\\n[化] 粘结剂",["I use a three-ring binder for all my subjects instead of a notebook for each one.","The \"lead\" of the pencil is actually a mixture of graphite, clay and wax with a binder that seals the lead in the wooden shaft."],["",""]],["individualized","ˌɪndɪˈvɪdʒuəlaɪzd","v. 赋予个性, 个别地加以考虑( individualize的过去式和过去分词 )",["The teacher provided individualized instruction."],["老師提供個別化教學。"]],["incline","in'klain","n. 倾斜, 斜坡, 斜面\\nvt. 使倾向于, 使倾斜\\nvi. 倾向, 倾斜, 爱好, 易于",["The more powerful and original a mind, the more it will incline towards the religion of solitude.","So saying, my neck and shoulders I incline, / and round them fling a lion's tawny hide, / then lift the load."],["",""]],["coalesce",".kәuә'les","vi. 合并, 联合, 合生\\n[计] 结合",["Now a few thoughts are starting to coalesce in my mind."],[""]],["conceptualization","kәn,septjjәlai'zeiʃәn; -li'z-","[计] 概念表达",["The paper discusses the conceptualization of justice."],["論文討論正義的概念化。"]],["accomplice","ә'kʌmplis","n. 共犯, 同谋\\n[医] 协同菌",["The police say they know that you had an accomplice.","The robber who shot the cashier was arrested, but his accomplice managed to get away with the takings."],["",""]],["experimenter","","n. 实验者, 试验者",["The brothers built upon data from German experimenter Otto Lillienthal to improve the shape of wings for most efficient lift."],[""]],["insomnia","in'sɒmniә","n. 失眠症\\n[医] 失眠[症]",["As a result, he was diagnosed with insomnia and anxiety neurosis near the end of May.","Ziri has suffered from insomnia since he was a teenager."],["",""]],["serenity","si'reniti","n. 宁静, 沉着, 晴朗",["Boredom is the feeling that everything is a waste of time; serenity, that nothing is.","He sought serenity, closeted in study, remote from the wear and tear of the world."],["",""]],["uncomfortably","ʌnˈkʌmftəbli","adv. 不舒适地, 不自在地, 令人不快地",["While not experiencing high fevers, she said, her body gets uncomfortably warm.","Parts of the movie were uncomfortably relatable, while the rest made me feel sad for the protagonist and supporting characters."],["她说，虽然没发高烧，但身体暖得难受。",""]],["combo","'kɒmbәu","n. 小型爵士乐团",["You should try the triangle-triangle-square combo, it can break the enemy's guard.","People say chocolate and chips go really well together, but I don't really like that combo."],["",""]],["mistaken","mis'teikәn","a. 犯错的, 错误的\\nmistake的过去分词",["I was mistaken in thinking that he was a trustworthy man.","A stranger tapped me on the shoulder from behind. He must have mistaken me for someone else."],["我還以為他是個信得過的人。","有個陌生人從後面拍了拍我的肩。我肯定他是認錯人了。"]],["colossal","kә'lɒsәl","a. 巨大的, 巨像似的",["Algeria is a colossal behemoth to be reckoned with in the Mediterranean region.","Forgetting to say the graduating student's name at the graduation ceremony was a colossal miss."],["",""]],["scuttle","'skʌtl","n. 箩, 筐, 急速逃走, 天窗, 小舱口\\nvi. 急速逃走, 急忙撤退\\nvt. 凿沉, 毁坏",["They are now drawing lessons to make sure that rumors and misinformation will never again scuttle a vital health campaign.","With care, Rodrigo opened the jar, allowing the centipede to scuttle away into the undergrowth."],["",""]],["boo","bu:","v. 嘘(某人), 喝倒彩\\ninterj. 嘘",["I've seen Tom play peek-a-boo with his baby.","Studying cows, pigs and chickens can help an actor develop his character. There are a lot of things I learned from animals. One was that they couldn't hiss or boo me."],["",""]],["egalitarian","i.gæli'tєәriәn","a. 平等主义的\\nn. 平等主义",["The lack of gender in English is not due to the English having a more egalitarian culture.","Bonobos are also different in that they have a more egalitarian and cooperative society than chimpanzees."],["英文中沒有陰陽性並不是因為英國人的文化偏向平等。",""]],["vaginal","vә'dʒainl","a. 鞘的, 似叶鞘的, 阴道的\\n[医] 鞘的; 阴道的; 睾丸鞘膜的",["The use of a condom during vaginal, anal, and oral intercourse is the best preventive measure.","Declining estrogen levels can lead to thinning of the vaginal walls."],["",""]],["sneer","sniә","n. 冷笑, 嘲笑\\nvi. 嘲笑, 冷笑\\nvt. 嘲笑着说, 嘲笑得使",["He never spoke of the softer passions, save with a gibe and a sneer.","There was a laughing devil in his sneer."],["",""]],["microprocessor",".maikrәu'prәusesә","n. 微处理器\\n[计] 微处理器; 微处理机",["The computer age led to tide gauges that use microprocessor-based technologies.","This computer has a Pentium microprocessor."],["",""]],["crease","kri:s","n. 皱痕, 折痕\\nv. (使)起皱痕",["The deep crease in the centre of my forehead was dramatically reduced.","Fold and unfold along each of the lines to make a crease."],["",""]],["midsummer","'midsʌmә","n. 仲夏, 夏至期\\na. 仲夏的",["The climate of this town is so mild that the thermometer seldom rises to thirty degrees, even in midsummer.","In spring brightly green, and spangled with wild flowers, by midsummer this prairie had grown sere and yellow."],["這小鎮的天氣十分暖和，即使是在盛夏，溫度計也很少會升到三十度。",""]],["skewer","skju:ә","n. 串肉棒, 烤肉叉子, 针状物\\nvt. 刺穿, 串住, 讽刺",["You know, the ones where you skewer some marshmallows and roast them. I don't know what they're called but they're really good. Let's try roasting some at my place sometime, too.","Could you cook a skewer for me, please?"],["",""]],["compressed","kәm'prest","a. 被压缩的, 扁平的",["Fourteen billion years ago, the universe was a compressed ball of fire.","Under this type of geo-sequestration, carbon dioxide from power plants is compressed into liquid and pumped underground."],["",""]],["airfield","'єәfi:ld","n. 飞机场",["The airfield on the island is now covered with weeds.","China built a military installation on Woody Island with an airfield and artificial harbor."],["",""]],["unethical","","a. 不道德的",["It would be unethical for me to tell you about Tom's medical problems.","Tom told me that he thought that what Mary had done was unethical."],["",""]],["espresso","e'spresәu","n. （用汽加压煮出的）浓咖啡",["I drank a very hot double espresso at the coffee shop this morning.","Today I read that espresso is more digestible than normal coffee."],["",""]],["mourner","'mɒ:nә","n. 悲伤者, 哀悼者, 送葬者",["Mourners in Iceland gathered Sunday to bid a final farewell to 700-year-old Okjokull, the first Icelandic glacier lost to climate change."],[""]],["unimportant",".ʌnim'pɒ:tnt","a. 不重要的",["You're thinking of unimportant things.","We need to decide what's important and what's unimportant."],["你在思考無關緊要的事情。",""]],["whipped","hwipt","a. 受到鞭打的",["Whenever I see the clouds, I think of whipped cream.","The thief whipped out into the crowd."],["无论我什么时候看到云，我都会想到奶油。","小偷迅速地窜入了人群。"]],["shopkeeper","'ʃɒp.ki:pә","n. 零售商, 店主, 老板",["He couldn't find the restroom, so he had to ask the shopkeeper for directions.","Worried, the shopkeeper ran over and kneeled beside Dima, who was breathing heavily - his forehead covered in sweat."],["他找不到洗手間，只好向店員詢問方向。","店主擔心地跑過去跪在迪馬身旁, 迪馬沉重地喘著氣, 他的額頭覆著一層汗。"]],["assailant","ә'seilәnt","n. 攻击者\\n[法] 攻击者, 行凶者",["Witnesses provided detailed descriptions of the assailant.","Sami summoned every ounce of strength to try to overcome his assailant."],["",""]],["deftly","","adv. 灵巧地；熟练地；敏捷地",["Keiko deftly piles up the dishes and takes them to the sink.","From between the pleats of her black skirt, the nun brought out scissors and deftly cut coloured paper into long, narrow strips, which we could then braid into a paper rug."],["惠子巧妙地把碗碟迭起再拿到水槽。","修女從黑色裙子的褶皺間掏出剪刀，熟練地將彩色紙剪成長而窄的紙條，讓我們可以把這些紙條編成紙地毯。"]],["outperform",".autpә'fɔ:m","vt. 胜过；做得比……好",["Multinational corporations outperform traditional corporations operating in just one country.","Algeria can outperform its neighbors economically."],["跨國企業遠勝於傳統的單一國家企業。",""]],["appalled","ə'pɔ:ld","a. 惊骇的；丧胆的",["Mary was appalled to see Tom stirring his coffee with his finger in spite of having a spoon beside him.","I am shocked and appalled at what I have just seen."],["",""]],["compulsory","kәm'pʌlsәri","a. 被强制的, 强迫的, 义务的\\n[经] 强迫的, 强制的",["Attendance is compulsory for all members.","The scholar regards so-called compulsory education as useless."],["全員均須出席。",""]],["whiteness","'hwaitnis","n. 白, 苍白, 洁白\\n[化] 白度",["His teeth were of the most pearly whiteness, and he made a constant display of them, grinning and chattering continually.","The whiteness of the lily is a symbol of purity."],["",""]],["calculus","'kælkjulәs","n. 结石；微积分学",["The integral and the antiderivative are defined in two different ways, and the Fundamental Theorem of Calculus states the relationship between them.","Calculus was developed by Newton and Leibniz independently."],["積分與反導函數是以兩種不同的方式定義的，而微積分基本定理闡述了兩者之間的關係。",""]],["workman","'wә:kmәn","n. 工人, 工匠, 男工",["I'm waiting for a workman who's coming to lay some carpets in my house.","A bad workman complains about his tools."],["",""]],["thud","θʌd","n. 砰的一声, 重击\\nvi. 砰的一声掉下, 嘭的一声",["The demon lord finally lost consciousness and fell to the floor with a thud.","The snow that had piled up on the roof at night came down with a thud."],["大魔王終於失去知覺，砰的一聲倒在了地上。",""]],["geographer","dʒi'ɒgrәfә","n. 地理学者",["Tom is a geographer."],[""]],["apparition",".æpә'riʃәn","n. 鬼, 幽灵, 幻影",["With her perfect figure and elegant dress she was, indeed, a strange apparition upon a lonely moorland path.","All evening, though I tried to think of other things, my mind would turn to the apparition at the window."],["",""]],["sheen","ʃi:n","n. 光辉, 光彩, 光泽\\na. 光辉的, 发光的, 有光泽的\\nvi. 发出光泽",["The thin layer of oil at the top of the soup produced a mesmerizing sheen.","Asked if he was bipolar, Charlie Sheen replied that he was \"bi-winning.\""],["",""]],["piercing","'piәsiŋ","a. 尖厉的, 刺耳的, 刺骨的, 刺穿的, 敏锐的, 彻骨的, 辛辣的, 讽刺的\\n[化] 冲孔",["The xylophone's piercing high notes have bloodied ears around the world.","With a piercing whistle, the ship sailed from the port."],["",""]],["diminishing","di'miniʃiŋ","v. 减少；衰减；递减；削弱…的权势（diminish的现在分词）",["The population of this country is gradually diminishing.","The deficit has been diminishing little by little."],["这个国家的人口正在逐渐减少。",""]],["helplessness","'helpləsnəs","n. 无可奈何状态, 无能为力; 无助的状态",["We will have to get over the feeling of helplessness.","Some speculators take advantage of the ignorance and helplessness of old people."],["我們必需克服我們所感到的無助。",""]],["whopping","'hwɒpiŋ","a. 巨大的, 天大的\\nadv. 非常地",["A whopping twenty-five goals were scored in yesterday's football highlights show.","Donald beat Jessica by a whopping five marks."],["",""]],["leek","li:k","n. 韭",["Why did you put leek in the soup? You know I don't like it.","Rows of cabbages wind beneath passion fruit vines, and tiny red eggplants rub shoulders with the spikes of a rare type of leek."],["",""]],["bonfire","'bɒnfaiә","n. 大篝火, 营火",["As the sun sets, hundreds of people from nearby villages gather around a crackling bonfire to celebrate a unique event.","We stayed around the bonfire telling jokes and horror stories."],["",""]],["sneeze","sni:z","n. 喷嚏\\nvi. 打喷嚏",["When you sneeze, it means someone is thinking of you.","I think I'm gonna sneeze. Give me a tissue."],["打噴嚏是因為有人在想你。","我想我要打喷嚏了。。。给我张纸巾。"]],["fortify","'fɒ:tifai","vt. 设要塞于, 加强, 使坚强, 增加\\nvi. 筑防御工事",["Fadil and Dania were ready to do anything to fortify their relationship.","We must fortify the settlement before someone tries to attack it."],["",""]],["patchwork","'pætʃwә:k","n. 拼缝物, 拼凑物",["From the plane, the landscape was just a patchwork of fields.","Now, get out your patchwork and have your square done before teatime."],["",""]],["acreage","'eikәridʒ","n. 英亩数, 土地面积\\n[经] 英亩数, 土地面积, 矿区租赁面积",["A significant number of those pumpkins will come from the state of Illinois, which harvests the largest share of pumpkin acreage of all the states.","It's a property with a lot of acreage."],["",""]],["priesthood","'pri:sthud","n. 神职人员, 祭司职",["Torah is greater than the priesthood or the monarchy.","Damiano refused to take the priesthood."],["",""]],["cavernous","'kævәnәs","a. 似巨穴的\\n[医] 空洞的",["And so the veil falls, revealing the walls, of cavernous halls, Valhalla calls."],[""]],["arsenic","'ɑ:sәnik","n. 砷, 砒霜\\n[化] 砷As",["Sami gave Layla enough arsenic to kill an elephant.","The amount of arsenic in the water is minuscule but significant."],["",""]],["composure","kәm'pәuʒә","n. 镇静, 沉着",["She showed more composure than others.","She showed greater composure than others did."],["她显出不同于他人的平静。","她显出不同于他人的平静。"]],["coupe","'ku:pei","n. 双座四轮轿式马车, 小轿车, 双门轿式小汽车, (英)铁路客车尾部的分隔车厢",["Honda's first hybrid was the Insight, a streamlined, small coupe with room for two people and not much more.","\"A castle indeed!\" he continued, looking around him; \"why, this is worse than a coupe-gorge house, where they receive travellers to plunder them of their property.\""],["",""]],["keenly","'ki:nli","adv. 锐利地, 敏捷地, 激烈地",["The lack of a public sphere in Europe is being felt increasingly keenly.","The lack of a public sphere in Europe is being felt more and more keenly."],["",""]],["equator","i'kweitә","n. 赤道\\n[医] 赤道, 中纬线",["The equator divides the earth into two hemispheres.","I crossed the equator for the first time on my trip to Australia."],["赤道把地球分为两个半球。","我去澳大利亚旅游的时候第一次穿越了赤道。"]],["modality","mәu'dæliti","n. 样式, 形式, 形态\\n[医] 药征, 用药程式(顺势疗法派所用的名词)",["Raumschach (in German, \"space chess\") is a modality of chess invented in 1907 by Ferdinand Maack. It adds a third dimension to the board."],[""]],["primacy","'praimәsi","n. 第一, 首位, 卓越",["The diplomat's assertion of the primacy of his nation's interests was seen as an invidious act by his nation's rivals.","Tensions grew when the laity questioned the primacy of the clergy in moral decision-making."],["",""]],["spec","spek","n. 投机, 投机事业, 规格, 说明书, 专业人员\\n[化] 加工单",["Everything was white. Nothing had a single spec of color.","I'm not sure that design meets the spec."],["",""]],["lastly","'lɑ:stli","adv. 最后, 终于",["Lastly, is there anything else to share with the group?","Lastly, cook on low heat for thirty minutes and it's done."],["最后，还有其他要和大家分享的吗？",""]],["culmination",".kʌlmi'neiʃәn","n. 顶点, 高潮, 最高点",["Science is simply the culmination of our best educated guesses, and changes as we learn more about the world around us.","This project is the culmination of a lifetime of work."],["",""]],["purposeful","'pә:pәsful","a. 有目的的\\n[法] 有意图的, 有目的的, 故意的",["Reagan's purposeful inaction during the AIDS crisis was a crime against humanity.","I've always felt that I had a more purposeful and a more meaningful lifepath to achieve and to go down than most people around me."],["",""]],["twinkle","'twiŋkl","n. 闪烁, 闪耀, 瞬息\\nvi. 闪烁\\nvt. 使闪耀",["In the night the moon shines and the stars glitter and twinkle.","Planets are easy to identify because they don't twinkle like stars do."],["",""]],["classy","'klɑ:si","a. 上等的, 优等的, 漂亮的",["Miss, that dress is splendid, it has a sheer silhouette and is very classy.","Tom walks through a very classy neighborhood on his way home from school."],["",""]],["dramatize","'dræmәtaiz","vt. 改编成戏剧, 编写剧本\\nvi. 戏剧化",["Don't dramatize. Everything's fine."],[""]],["subculture","'sʌb,kʌltʃә","n. 再次培养, 亚文化群\\n[医] 次代培养物, 次培养物",["The point of hipster subculture is to avoid conforming to societal norms.","Gadesh is a subculture in Azerbaijan."],["",""]],["perilous","'perilәs","a. 危险的, 濒临毁灭的",["Learning without thought is labor lost; thought without learning is perilous.","A coward is someone who, in a perilous emergency, thinks with his legs."],["",""]],["permissible","pә'misәbl","a. 可允许的, 可容许程度的\\n[机] 容许, 允许",["Music is an agreeable harmony for the honor of God and the permissible delights of the soul.","I asked him if it was ever permissible for a parent to punish their child."],["",""]],["acrylic","ә'krilik","a. 丙烯酸的\\n[医] 丙烯酸的",["When attaching a polarizing plate, set it first and then attach a protective plate (a clear acrylic plate).","The museum curator wanted the Egyptian painting to be sandwiched between two pieces of thick acrylic glass."],["",""]],["pious","'paiәs","a. 虔诚的, 敬神的, 尽责的, 可嘉的, 不可能实现的",["So characteristic of what a pious Christian would say, this courteous phrase.","Although I am a pious man, I am not the less a man."],["",""]],["mating","'meitiŋ","n. 交配\\n[化] 配套; 交配",["During mating season many animals exude strong fragrances.","You weave a mating net when you surround the opponent king, cutting off all its means of escape before moving in for the kill."],["很多動物會在交配季節釋放出很強的氣味。",""]],["rustle","'rʌsl","n. 沙沙声, 瑟瑟声, 飒飒声, 急忙\\nvi. 发出沙沙声\\nvt. 使飒飒作响",["The leaves on the trees rustle gently in the wind.","When it's windy, the leaves of the old oak rustle and its branches creak."],["树叶在风中簌簌作响。","刮風的時候，老橡樹的葉子會沙沙作響，樹枝會發出嘎吱聲。"]],["waxed","'wæksid","a. 上过蜡的；防水的",["I was just wondering how much it would cost to have my car washed and waxed.","My legs are full of hair; I'm going to have to get waxed."],["",""]],["mutant","'mju:tәnt","n. 突变体\\n[化] 突变型",["There are no reports on this mutation because such a mutant wouldn't even be born.","The entire colony will inherit the mutant DNA."],["",""]],["fondly","'fɒndli","adv. 溺爱地, 怜爱地, 情柔地",["Once again, Mrs. Lee speaks fondly of the past, and it is impossible to stop her.","I have loved the stars too fondly to be fearful of the night."],["",""]],["earthy","'ә:θi","a. 土的, 土质的, 土味的",["Yanni's breath smelt earthy like he had eaten soil.","Diana Krall takes a mellow turn on a collection of earthy love songs titled Quiet Nights."],["",""]],["unwittingly","","adv. 不知情地；不知不觉地；不经意地",["Unwittingly, he told her exactly what she wanted to know.","Unwittingly he told her all that she wanted to know."],["",""]],["aback","ә'bæk","adv. 向后, 朝后, 突然, 船顶风地",["I am taken aback by those who are not repelled by those who rant behind the backs of people they don't know.","While some find it amusing or endearing, others are taken aback by Miroslav's incessant use of explicit language."],["",""]],["twisting","'twistiŋ","[医] 扭转, 捩转",["River Suzhou is Shanghai's \"mother river\"; twisting and turning, it stretches across and flows through the city center.","Us people are very good at twisting the facts to match our conclusions as soon as we come to them."],["苏州河是上海的母亲河，弯弯曲曲横跨流过市中心。",""]],["analyse","'ænәlaiz","vt. 分析, 细察, 分解\\n[经] 分析",["The council held a meeting to analyse the rescheduling.","You cannot analyse the data efficiently unless you draw a plot."],["",""]],["upside","'ʌpsaid","n. 上侧, 上段, 上部\\n[机] 上侧, 上部",["The map on page 11 looks very strange. Turn it upside down. Then it becomes a familiar map to you.","You're holding the book upside-down. This is upside-down and this is right-side up."],["第十一頁的地圖看起來十分奇怪。可是，把它上下倒轉來看的話，就會變回你所熟悉的地圖了。","你把书拿反了，这是反面，这才是正面。"]],["algebra","'ældʒibrә","n. 代数学",["In mathematics, a module is one of the fundamental algebraic structures used in abstract algebra.","In algebra a monomorphism is an injective homomorphism."],["",""]],["materialism","mә'tiәriәlizm","n. 唯物主义",["You grew up with too much materialism, and now you envy your neighbours.","The American dream was not, at least at the beginning, a rags-to-riches type of narrow materialism."],["",""]],["fixation","fik'seiʃәn","n. 定置, 固定, 定色\\n[医] 固定; 固定法, 固定术; 定影",["Tom has a strange fixation to potato salad.","In short, \"kink\" covers diverse unconventional sexual interests, while a \"fetish\" is a specific fixation on something for sexual arousal."],["",""]],["epoch","'i:pɒk","n. 新纪元, 时代, 时期",["There have always been fashionable faces and expressions which marked an epoch.","The Middle Ages is the most interesting epoch in my opinion."],["",""]],["reset",".ri:'set","n. 重新设定, 重新组合, 重排版\\nvt. 重新设定, 重置, 重新组合\\nvi. 重置, 清零\\n[计] 重置, 清零",["With this upgrade, one obvious impact is that users will be obliged to reset their passwords.","Bruno figured out that the reactor needed to be reset."],["这次升级的一个明显影响是用户会被强制重置密码。",""]],["gimmick","'gimik","n. 暗机关\\nvt. 耍花招改变, 使暗机关",["As far as we are concerned we see this as a political gimmick made to hoodwink people.","The latest gimmick they introduced actually made the application worse."],["",""]],["limbo","'limbәu","n. 地狱边缘, 监狱, 忘却\\n[法] 监狱, 拘禁, 忘却",["It's not explicitly prohibited, but in fact it is not allowed either. It is a legal limbo.","The Senate is expected to adjourn later this week, leaving weighty issues unaddressed and major legislation in limbo."],["",""]],["adorable","ә'dɒ:rәbl","a. 可崇拜的, 值得敬慕的, 可爱的",["How can there exist a creature as adorable as a cat?","He loves his puppy. His puppy is really adorable."],["怎么会有猫咪这么可爱的生物？","他愛他的狗，那隻小狗真的很可愛。"]],["cork","kɒ:k","n. 软木塞, 软木树, 软木\\n[化] 木栓",["Tom wasn't able to get the cork out of the bottle.","Tom had trouble getting the cork out of the bottle."],["",""]],["astound","ә'staund","vt. 使惊骇, 使大惊",["When in doubt tell the truth. It will confound your enemies and astound your friends.","If we did all the things we are capable of, we would literally astound ourselves."],["",""]],["tabletop","'teibltɒp","n. 桌面",["The tabletop is very sticky."],[""]],["deficient","di'fiʃәnt","a. 不足的, 不充分的, 有缺陷的",["English is a very deficient language in this area.","Chronic problems include a shortage of skilled labor and a deficient infrastructure."],["",""]],["imbue","im'bju:","vt. 使感染, 灌输, 使浸透",["The article \"Wabi-Sabi Mathematics\" concerns how wabi-sabi can imbue mathematics.","We made an escapist political thriller that we wanted to imbue with humanity and realism."],["",""]],["meander","mi'ændә","n. (河流的)蜿蜒, 漫步, 迂回旅行\\nvi. 蜿蜒流动, 漫步\\nvt. 使蜿蜒曲折",["Explorers looked for shortcuts in space-time to meander serendipitously through the universe.","Through those two days the train seemed to meander in a leisurely fashion through varied and attractive country."],["",""]],["chronically","'krɒnikli","adv. 慢性地, 长期地, 习惯性地",["He suffers from a chronically exaggerated opinion of himself. Wherever he goes, he thinks no one can hold a candle to him.","If you have symptoms of the cold, don't have any contact with the elderly and the chronically ill and don't go out without wearing a mask."],["",""]],["wondrous","'wʌndrәs","a. 令人惊奇的",["Occasionally, wondrous texts were included.","The human brain is a wondrous thing. It works until the moment you stand up to make a speech."],["偶爾也會收錄一些精彩的文字。",""]],["windmill","'windmil","n. 风车",["I had never seen a windmill until I visited the Netherlands.","Napoleon's headquarters were in an unused windmill."],["在我去荷兰之前，我从没见过风车。",""]],["pitiful","'pitiful","a. 慈悲的, 可怜的, 令人同情的, 可鄙的",["The pitiful sight moved us to tears.","The little girl, deeply moved by the old man's pitiful story, burst into tears."],["看著眼前淒涼的景象，我們不禁流下了淚來。",""]],["knead","ni:d","vt. 揉, 按摩, 捏\\n[机] 揉合",["Knead the dough with both hands until it becomes elastic.","Unblended gold in its pure form is so soft, that one can knead it by hand."],["",""]],["intravenous",".intrә'vi:nәs","a. 静脉内的\\n[医] 静脉内的",["The intravenous morphine made the trip to the hospital worth it.","I saw a sci-fi movie wherein children learn their lessons by intravenous therapy."],["",""]],["cunning","'kʌniŋ","a. 狡猾的, 巧妙的, 可爱的\\n[法] 狡猾的的, 狡诈的, 熟练的",["People say that the fox is more cunning than other animals.","All knowledge, when separated from justice and virtue, is seen to be cunning and not wisdom."],["人们说，狐狸比其他动物要狡猾。",""]],["chap","tʃæp","n. 小伙子, 颌, 龟裂\\nv. 皲裂",["Tom's a polite, kind, and self-effacing chap who you wouldn't hesitate to introduce to your parents.","He was a dashing, swaggering chap, smart and curled, who had seen half the world and could talk of what he had seen."],["",""]],["schema","'ski:mә","n. 概要, 图解, 略图\\n[计] 模式",["Make sure your submission is consistent with the project schema.","The actantial schema shows the rules of the event."],["",""]],["companionship","kәm'pænjәnʃip","n. 交往, 友谊, 一群同伴",["Gustavo set up a campfire in the woods, its warm glow providing comfort and companionship.","Gustavo often brought his German Shepherd along for walks in the woods, enjoying the companionship and shared love for nature."],["",""]],["sullen","'sʌlәn","a. 愠怒的, 沉闷的, 阴沉的",["No longer mourn for me when I am dead / Than you shall hear the surly sullen bell / Give warning to the world that I am fled.","Mary's sullen husband Tom was kidnapped and hugged every morning by Teletubbies."],["",""]],["appointed","ә'pɔintid","[法] 派任的, 任命的, 指定的",["He was appointed ambassador to Britain.","He came five minutes behind the appointed time."],["他被任命為駐英國大使。","他在指定时间的五分钟后到了。"]],["lowland","'lәulәnd","n. 低地, 苏格兰低地\\na. 低地的",["A child fell into the enclosure of 17-year-old Harambe, an endangered western lowland gorilla, on Saturday.","Kabyle people before, call a mountain in the middle of lowland, aqbu."],["",""]],["egregious","i'gri:dʒiәs","a. 异乎寻常的, 过分的, 惊人的",["The group's infractions were so egregious that we were forced to arrest them.","He would never make a mistake this egregious."],["",""]],["stamina","'stæminә","n. 精力, 活力, 耐力, 雄蕊\\n[医] 耐力, 精力; 雄蕊",["Sam doesn't have the stamina to finish a marathon.","You have to have a lot of stamina to be an Olympic athlete."],["",""]],["grizzly","'grizli","a. 略为灰色的, 呈灰色的\\nn. 灰熊",["Tom was attacked by a grizzly bear.","This grizzly bear weighs half a ton."],["汤姆被一只灰熊揍了。","这只灰熊有0.5吨重。"]],["poach","pәutʃ","vt. 水煮(蛋), 偷猎, 侵入, 窃取\\nvi. 偷猎, 陷入泥中",["Tom asked Mary to teach him how to poach an egg in a microwave oven.","Tom wanted poached eggs, so he first had to poach a chicken."],["",""]],["booty","'bu:ti","n. 战利品, 获得之物\\n[法] 赃物, 掳获物, 战利品",["The eyepatch is annoying; I have no rum, ship, or parrot; and I have not found any hidden treasure or booty yet.","The pirates are hiding the booty they got from the attack."],["",""]],["comp","kɔmp","[计] 电脑及相关知识; DOS内部命令:比较两个文件的内容",["We learned about arrays in Comp Sci today."],[""]],["lander","'lændә","n. 出铁槽；着陆器；把钩工人",["Lander assumes that rioting and gang behavior are a result of poverty and poor economic conditions.","It is worth noting that Lander made the necessary modifications."],["",""]],["dreary","'driәri","a. 沉闷的",["I've got to go to another dreary meeting tomorrow.","In the whole world there can be no more dreary view than that from the northern slope of the Sierra Blanco."],["",""]],["macaroni",".mækә'rәuni","n. 通心面, 纨绔子弟",["The smell of macaroni and cheese makes me nauseous.","Yankee Doodle came to town // Riding on a pony // He stuck a feather in his cap // and called it macaroni."],["",""]],["ale","eil","n. 麦芽酒\\n[医] 麦芽酒",["He began his meal by drinking half a glass of ale.","This cheddar cheese is made from Welsh brown ale, horseradish, and mustard seeds."],["",""]],["weathered","","a. 风化的, 倾斜的",["The rocks are weathered into fantastic forms.","The old shack seems to have weathered the storm pretty well."],["岩石經過風化後，形成了各種奇特的形狀。",""]],["baptize","bæp'taiz","vt. 施洗礼, 使经受考验, 命名",["The man on whom you see the Spirit come down and remain is he who will baptize with the Holy Spirit.","Except that the one who sent me to baptize with water told me..."],["你如果看見聖靈降下，落在誰身上，誰就是用聖靈替人施洗的了。",""]],["rocking","'rɒkiŋ","a. 摇摆的, 摇动的\\n[电] 摇移",["Worrying is like a rocking chair; it gives you something to do but doesn't get you anywhere.","Nan likes to sit knitting away in her rocking chair."],["",""]],["reflector","ri'flektә","n. 反射镜, 反射物\\n[医] 反光镜, 反射器",["Apollo 11 astronauts set up the first reflector when they made the first manned flight to the moon nearly 40 years ago.","The shit he smeared on the reflector ruined it with its smell."],["",""]],["gunner","'gʌnә","n. 炮手, 炮长, 机关枪手, 带枪猎人",["Tim's uncle was a machine gunner on a helicopter in Vietnam.","Sami was known around the town as Gunner."],["",""]],["scoot","sku:t","vi. 快跑, 奔跑",["Excuse me, but could you scoot over a little bit, please?","Can you scoot over and make room for one more person?"],["",""]],["cherished","ˈtʃeriʃt","v. 珍爱( cherish的过去式和过去分词 ); 怀有; 爱护; 抚育",["The Imari porcelain plate that my father cherished was quite heavy.","They knew what friendship is worth and cherished it like the apples of their eyes."],["",""]],["biologically","","adv. 生物学, 生态学",["The human brain is biologically programmed to learn languages.","Eukaryotes are biologically superior to prokaryotes."],["",""]],["aggregate","'ægrigәt","n. 合计, 总计, 聚集体\\na. 合计的, 聚集的\\nv. 聚集, 集合, 合计达\\n[计] 聚合体; 聚集",["Simply put, a human being is an aggregate of many cells.","Strawberries and raspberries are both examples of an aggregate fruit."],["",""]],["jumping","'dʒʌmpiŋ","a. 跳跃的",["He could not help jumping for joy at the good news.","I'm jumping to the worst-case scenario."],["他聽到那個好消息，高興得跳了起來。","现在是我一直往最坏的方面想。"]],["promulgate","prә'mʌlgeit","vt. 发布, 公布, 发表, 传播\\n[法] 颁布, 公告, 散播",["They are simply trying to promulgate an accurate version of the facts.","The President shall promulgate a regulation providing for the mandatory allocation of crude oil."],["",""]],["gale","geil","n. 狂风, 大风, 定期租金\\n[经] 地租, 年金",["The next morning it was blowing a gale, and we had to delay the ascent.","Although it's blowing a gale outside, we're going to leave the house and go for a walk."],["",""]],["paraphrase","'pærәfreiz","n. 释义, 解述, 改写\\nvt. 改写, 解述\\nvi. 释义, 意译",["Paraphrasing is all well and good as long as you don't have the original sentence in sight when you seek to paraphrase.","Don't repeat or paraphrase the question you're being asked because it sounds patronizing."],["",""]],["cayenne","kei'en","n. 辣椒",["This is cayenne pepper."],[""]],["trucker","'trʌkә(r)","n. 卡车驾驶员, 从事货车运输业者, 以物易物者, 小贩",["Lorenzo grabbed his radio and contacted a fellow trucker.","He's wearing a sleeveless shirt and a trucker hat."],["",""]],["venom","'venәm","n. 毒液, 恶意\\nvt. 放毒, 使有毒",["Bees pollinate flowers and trees, and collect nectar to make honey, bee glue and bee venom.","The spikes on a stonefish's fins contain glands that inject neurotoxic and cytotoxic venom."],["蜜蜂為花卉和樹木授粉，並採集花蜜來製造蜂蜜、蜂膠和蜂毒。",""]],["annuity","ә'nju:iti","n. 年金, 年金保险, 年金领受权\\n[医] 年金, 年俸",["If it weren't for her annuity, she'd never be able to pay the bills.","There are a lot of companies that will offer to buy part or all of an annuity in exchange for a lump sum payment."],["",""]],["teapot","'ti:pɒt","n. 茶壶",["Please fill the teapot with boiling water.","Put the teapot on the burner, otherwise the tea will be cold."],["請用開水把茶壺灌滿。",""]],["localized","","a. 小范围的；局部的；地区的",["I'm glad we didn't go there because there were some localized heavy rain showers.","A certain movie was novelized - rather it was a scenario written for a movie that was expanded as a novel and localized to Japanese."],["我很庆幸我们没有去那儿，因为当时那儿有局部大暴雨。",""]],["preparedness","pri'pєәdnis","n. 准备状态, 战备状态",["We're taking a class on disaster preparedness uptown.","These two events sent the countries of the region into overdrive to review and improve disaster preparedness."],["",""]],["shroud","ʃraud","n. 尸衣, 寿衣, 覆盖物, (船的)横桅索\\nvt. 包以尸衣, 遮蔽, 隐藏, 覆盖",["Some say the Shroud of Turin is a photo made by Leonardo da Vinci using a camera obscura.","She bought a shroud for herself long before she died."],["",""]],["eagerness","'i:gәnis","n. 热心",["Pierre ate and drank a lot, with his usual eagerness.","Mary's energetic vigor mixed surprisingly well with Tom's submissive eagerness."],["",""]],["gamma","'^æmә","n. 希腊语的第三个字母(Γ,γ)\\n[医] γ(希腊文第三个字母), 丙种, 微克(千分之一毫克)",["Alpha, beta and gamma are Greek letters.","There are several current theories about the possible causes of gamma-ray bursts."],["阿尔法、贝塔和咖玛是希腊文字。",""]],["immortality",".imɒ:'tæliti","n. 不朽, 不灭的声望",["Millions long for immortality who do not know what to do with themselves on a rainy Sunday afternoon.","Reading about Hinduism, I encountered a discussion describing an alternative beyond immortality and mortality."],["世界上有數之不盡的人渴望自己能長生不老，但這些人卻連一個下雨的星期天下午也不懂得該怎麼打發。",""]],["elegantly","","adv. 优美地",["She smoothly and elegantly poured the water into the glass.","Mayan pyramids and large temples were built elegantly using stone tools."],["",""]],["impossibility","im.pɒsә'biliti","n. 不可能之事, 不可能\\n[法] 不可能性, 不可能的事",["Every man would like to be God, if it were possible; some few find it difficult to admit the impossibility.","Death is the possibility of the absolute impossibility of Dasein."],["",""]],["apocalyptic","ә.pɒkә'liptik","a. 天启的, <<启示录>>的",["Outside the mainstream of orthodox Judaism, the apocalyptic books were more successful with certain movements.","An interesting Japanese anime is No. 6, about surviving post-apocalyptic ultramodern city-states in this world in the future."],["",""]],["named","neimd","a. 被指名的, 指定的\\n[计] 命名的, 指定的, 有名的",["Sami was having an affair with a girl named Layla.","The Sargasso Sea is a vast patch of ocean named for a genus of free-floating seaweed called Sargassum."],["萨米和一个叫莱拉的女生有染。","馬尾藻海是一片廣闊的海域，因一種名為「馬尾藻」的自由漂浮海藻而得名。"]],["publicized","","v. 公布；广告；宣传（publicize的过去分词）",["That politician has come down in the world since the so-called \"Recruit scandal\" was publicized.","Television news stories publicized Earth Day."],["",""]],["microbial","mai'krәubiәl","a. 微生物的, 由细菌引起的\\n[医] 微生物的",["Perseverance is tasked with searching for telltale signs that microbial life may have lived on Mars billions of years ago.","The Perseverance science team believes this ancient river delta could have collected and preserved organic molecules and other potential signs of microbial life."],["",""]],["flail","fleil","n. 连枷\\nv. 用连枷打, 打",["Don't just flail around aimlessly. You need a plan.","Our eyes may bulge, our arms may flail but that does not necessarily mean that there is any greater lack of freedom here than there is anywhere else."],["",""]],["magnification",".mægnifi'keiʃәn","n. 扩大, 放大率, 放大的复制品\\n[计] 缩放比例",["At this level of magnification, I can't even tell what I'm looking at.","What magnification should I look for in binoculars for birdwatching?"],["",""]],["spook","spu:k","n. 幽灵, 鬼\\nvt. 惊吓, 鬼怪般地出没\\nvi. 惊吓而逃窜, 受惊",["I didn't mean to spook you."],["我沒想要嚇唬您。"]],["impeccable","im'pekәbl","a. 无懈可击的, 勿容置疑的, 无瑕疵的, 不会做坏事的",["He has impeccable manners, which means you can never be sure what he actually thinks!","He is generally an impeccable student."],["他是一個極有禮貌的人 ﹣ 也就是說，他內心的想法永遠沒有人能看得穿！","他总体上是个无可非议的学生。"]],["dependable","di'pendәbl","a. 可信任的, 可靠的, 可信赖的",["I wonder if Tom and Mary are dependable.","I wonder whether Tom and Mary are dependable."],["我想知道汤姆和玛丽可不可靠。","我想知道汤姆和玛丽可不可靠。"]],["childlike","'tʃaillaik","a. 孩子似的, 天真烂漫的",["I couldn't help smiling at her childlike frankness.","Her large, deep, blue eyes had a dreamy look, but a childlike smile still played round her mouth."],["",""]],["loudspeaker","'laud'spi:kә","n. 扩音器, 喇叭\\n[电] 扬声器",["The voice on the loudspeaker was too muffled to understand.","The police used a drone with a loudspeaker to disperse the crowd."],["",""]],["inhibitor","in'hibitә(r)","n. 禁止者, 抑制人, 抑制物, 抑制因素, 抑制剂, 阻化剂\\n[计] 禁止器, 抑制剂",["Having these STD pamphlets strewn here on the coffee table sure is an inhibitor.","There's an inhibitor in your brains that makes you think that I'm a normal human being, so I can walk amongst people."],["",""]],["inescapable",".ini'skeipәbl","a. 逃不掉的, 不可避免的",["The inescapable conclusion is that Senator Jackson has abandoned his constituents for corporate lobbyists.","Tom ended up in an inescapable situation."],["",""]],["fodder","'fɒdә","n. 饲料, 草料, 素材, 弹药\\nvt. 喂",["Ziri was frantically throwing more and more fodder on the fire.","Besides working at home, women in the village fetch fodder for buffaloes and work in fields."],["",""]],["manually","'mænjuәli","adv. 用手",["Additive synthesis involves manually controlling harmonics, and uses only sine waves.","Ziri paid Yazid to manually remove the ivy from the tree."],["",""]],["stranded","","a. 处于困境的, 进退两难的",["Because of the blizzard, Tom and Mary were stranded in Boston.","If you were stranded on a desert island, what books would you want to have with you to read?"],["因为暴风雪，汤姆和玛丽被困在波士顿了。","如果你被困在一個荒島上, 你會想要隨身帶著哪些書來看?"]],["nonverbal","nɔn'vә:bәl","a. 不用语言的；不用动词的",["Up to 60% of Imogen of the Internet's nonverbal social cues are snarky hashtags."],[""]],["onlooker","'ɔnljkә(r)","n. 旁观者, 袖手旁观者",["This onlooker almost got in the way of the fire truck.","\"Were you at Mary's wedding?\" \"Yeah, as an onlooker.\""],["這個看熱鬧的人差點把消防車的路擋住了。",""]],["cornmeal","'kɒ:nmi:l","n. 玉蜀黍粉, 玉米片, 麦片",["Dredge the fish in cornmeal before frying."],[""]],["layered","'leiәd","a. 层状的；分层的",["She layered the cake with whipped cream and berries.","A jawbreaker is a round candy, multi-layered like a pearl."],["",""]],["pun","pʌn","n. 双关语, 俏皮话\\nvi. 说双关语, 说俏皮话\\nvt. 用双关语说服, 捣实",["His style (if you were to call it that) was excessively (though I run the risk of hypocrisy) parenthetical (pardon the pun).","Whoever is able to translate a pun may consider themselves to be among the best translators."],["",""]],["elongated","ˈi:lɒŋgeɪtɪd","v. 延长, 加长( elongate的过去式和过去分词 )",["He stood from the wall, his slender figure casting an elongated shadow across the hallway.","The model's elongated form was a great beauty and envy to all."],["",""]],["blazer","'bleizә","n. 燃烧体, 颜色鲜明的上装, 宣布者",["I would like to get a blouse to go with this blazer.","He hung his blazer on a hanger because it was really hot."],["",""]],["wellness","'welnis","n. 健康",["It is a stunning exhibition on wellness and holistic healing from awe-inspiring India.","Many people spend much of their waking hours staring at screens and that has spawned a growing health sector, called \"digital wellness\"."],["",""]],["midlife","'midlaif","n. 中年",["She's going through a midlife crisis.","Maybe I'm going through a midlife crisis."],["",""]],["grazing","'greiziŋ","n. 放牧, 牧草, 草场, 放牧法",["Tom took a picture of the cattle grazing on the hillside.","I have taught my cows to follow the sound of this pipe, and to obey its call, even if they be grazing at the greatest distance."],["",""]],["wholesome","'hәulsәm","a. 有益健康的, 合乎卫生的, 健全的, 有益的, 有生气的, 审慎的",["She prepares wholesome meals for her family.","Tom is the most wholesome person you'll ever meet."],["她为她的家人准备健康餐。",""]],["camcorder","kæm'kɔ:dә","n. 摄录像机；便携式摄像机",["Some people follow their kids around with a camcorder as though every squeak is a star-studded performance.","Ziri submitted the camcorder to the principal."],["",""]],["entirety","in'taiәti","n. 全部, 整体\\n[法] 共有制, 整体, 全部",["Yanni lived in Algiers for the entirety of his childhood.","Tom read the Bible in its entirety, from the beginning to the end."],["",""]],["coloring","'kʌlәriŋ","n. 着色, 色彩, 色调, 面色, 气色, 外貌, 伪装, 色素, 颜料, 染料, 着色剂, 特质\\n[建] 着色, 染色",["Her coloring book lay limp, jagged with angular pink scribbles.","Nowadays, ten year old girls are having abortions; when I was fifteen years old I was still coloring."],["",""]],["replication",".repli'keiʃәn","n. 回答, 反响, 复制, 第二次答辩, 折转, 弯回\\n[化] 复制",["The strength of the correlation was severely weakened in future replication studies.","Better supervision is required. This place is nothing but confusion. For example, there is too much replication which only wastes time and energy."],["",""]],["persecute","'pә:sikju:t","vt. 迫害, 虐待, 困扰, 同...捣乱\\n[法] 迫害, 虐待, 烦扰",["In France, we leave alone those who start fires, but we persecute those who sound the alarm.","Sedition laws are usually used to persecute peaceful left-wing activists."],["",""]],["steamed","","a. 蒸熟的, 蒸的",["Yesterday I bought two steamed buns.","Is there a difference between steamed buns and steamed bread?"],["昨天我买了两个馒头。","馒头和馍馍有区别吗？"]],["deluxe","dә'luks","a. 高级的, 豪华的\\nadv. 豪华地",["A deluxe edition of Beyonce's Grammy-winning album B'Day will be released on April 3.","I'll have a kebab pizza deluxe, with mixed sauce."],["",""]],["wasteful","'weistful","a. 浪费的, 不经济的",["It's wasteful to leave the land lying idle.","Taxpayers are angry about wasteful government spending."],["讓土地閒置著很浪費。",""]],["salted","'sɒ:ltid","a. 盐腌的, 盐味的, 有经验的, 虚报的",["Salted fried dough was the children's favorite afternoon snack.","The food at the canteen isn't very good, and the menu contains mostly unhealthy foods, too salted or sweetened."],["",""]],["agitation",".ædʒi'teiʃәn","n. 激动, 焦虑, 煽动, 搅动, 摇动\\n[化] 搅拌; 搅拌作用",["Fred's agitation has now subsided, and he's sleeping peacefully.","Sami was hopeful that Layla's agitation might be subsiding."],["",""]],["idiosyncratic",".idiәsiŋ'krætik","a. 特质的, 异质的, 特殊的\\n[医] 特[异反]应性的, 特异体质的",["The idiosyncratic watch smith watched me from behind the window.","He had an idiosyncratic response to the medication."],["",""]],["refill","ri:'fil","n. 再注满, 替换物\\nvt. 再将...注满\\nvi. 被再注满",["Remove the cap from the ink refill bottle, fill the dropper with ink, and drip an appropriate amount onto the marker's core.","I think it's time for me to refill this prescription."],["",""]],["empirically","","adv. 以经验为主地",["\"A child can't be transgender.\" \"Medically and empirically speaking, that statement is false.\"","\"You don't have PTSD unless you were in a warzone.\" \"Medically and empirically speaking, that statement is false.\""],["",""]],["borderline","'bɒ:dәlain","n. 边界, 界线\\na. 边界的",["You really ought to wash your hands of this borderline illegal work.","Layla suffered from borderline personality disorder."],["",""]],["domestically","dәu'mestikli","adv. 家庭式地, 国内地",["Having said 'domestic wine', anything bottled domestically is deemed to be domestic wine.","The government is promoting the use of domestically made products."],["",""]],["drench","drentʃ","vt. 使湿透, 使充满\\nn. 滂沱大雨, 弄湿",["After a while, dressing in the recommended long pants and long sleeved-shirt during a summer hike can really drench your clothes."],[""]],["nightgown","","n. 女式睡衣, 孩子穿的睡衣, 妇女穿的睡衣",["She has this pretty lace nightgown with straps.","Mary was still wearing a nightgown when Tom got to her house at noon."],["她的這件吊帶蕾絲睡衣很漂亮。",""]],["raucous","'rɒ:kәs","a. 沙哑的, 粗声的, 喧闹的",["Parliament members had a raucous argument over the Wiretapping Law.","Could I really afford to accommodate such a raucous comrade?"],["",""]],["postsecondary","","高等教育",["She plans to attend a postsecondary institution."],["她打算就讀大專院校。"]],["slew","slu:","n. 沼地, 回转, 旋转, 扭转, 大量\\nvt. 使旋转, 使猛拐, 使侧滑\\nvi. 回转, 扭转, 侧滑, 猛拐\\nslay的过去式",["A slew of corporate logos adorned the entrance to the soccer match.","Laocoon, Neptune's priest, by lot ordained, / a stately bull before the altar slew."],["",""]],["cohesive","kәu'hi:siv","a. 黏合在一起的\\n[医] 内聚的",["The departmental heads, lost in petty argument, could not reach a cohesive decision.","A text could be coherent but not cohesive, and vice versa."],["",""]],["fascist","'fæʃist","n. 法西斯主义者, 法西斯党员",["For all intents and purposes, Donald Trump is a fascist.","Lakhdar Benkoula, the fascist, turned out to be a really nice guy."],["",""]],["bandwidth","'bændwidθ","n. 频带宽度, 通带宽度\\n[计] 带宽, 频宽",["We don't have enough bandwidth to use that service.","We don't have enough bandwidth for more than six people to be online at one time."],["",""]],["listed","'listid","a. 列出的\\n[经] 上市的, 已登录的, 表列的",["No person by that name is listed in the register of the school.","This company is listed on the Paris stock exchange."],["学校的名册里没有这个名字的人。","这家公司在巴黎证券交易所上市了。"]],["creatively","","adv. 创造性地；有创造力地",["I was born to think more creatively than most other people and to have a more unique mindset that sets me apart from other people.","The goddess Natural Selection blindly and unconsciously, but amazingly creatively, chooses random mutations produced at long intervals by the god Chance."],["",""]],["simulator","'simjuleitә","n. 模拟器, 假装者\\n[计] 模拟器",["Before he could fly a real plane, Ben was made to demonstrate his skills in a simulator.","This video game can be described as a walking simulator."],["",""]],["chime","tʃaim","n. 钟声, 钟, 和谐\\nvi. 鸣, 奏出谐和的乐声, 和谐\\nvt. 敲出和谐的声音, 打钟报时, 重复说",["About the same time as he entered the classroom and arrived at his seat, the chime to announce class rings across the school.","I love to hear a grandfather clock chime."],["",""]],["treason","'tri:zn","n. 叛逆, 不忠, 叛国罪\\n[法] 叛逆, 通敌, 叛国罪",["In some countries, the punishment for treason can be life in prison.","The dictator accused Tom of treason for not applauding him."],["在一些國家，叛國罪的懲罰可以是終身監禁。",""]],["scallions","ˈskæljənz","n. 青葱( scallion的名词复数 ); 冬葱; 大葱; 韭菜",["A diet rich in garlic, onions, shallots, leeks and scallions may cut the risk of prostate cancer. That is according to a new study by researchers at the U.S. National Cancer Institute."],[""]],["therein",".ðєәr'in","adv. 在其中, 在那里, 在那一点上",["In the end, one always ends up wishing to annihilate one's fellow man. Therein lies the sad fate of humanity.","Aviaries are sometimes called flight cages because the birds confined therein have room to fly around."],["",""]],["cartoonist","kɑ:'tu:nist","n. 漫画家",["Cartoonist Walt Kelly created a special Earth Day poster.","He was a famous graphic artist and cartoonist."],["",""]],["recognized","","a. 经过验证的；公认的",["I hadn't recognized the importance of this document until you told me about it.","She recognized the brooch as the one she had lost a few months before."],["你告訴了我以後，我才知道這份文件有多重要。","她认出那枚胸针是她几个月前丢失的。"]],["mystique","mis'ti:k","n. 神秘的气氛, 奥秘, 秘诀",["The location of the remaining Wollemi Pines is shrouded in mystique.","The show has lost a lot of its mystique over seven seasons."],["",""]],["parable","'pærәbl","n. 寓言, 隐晦的比较",["The parable of the talents is one of my favorites.","Let me explain by way of a parable."],["",""]],["marching","","[计] 步进式的",["A brass band is marching along the street.","The soldiers were marching with their swords shining."],["一个铜管乐队沿着路前进。",""]],["approaching","","v. 进场；侵入；接近（approach的ing形式）",["I was dazzled by the headlights of an approaching car.","If you see a man approaching you with the obvious intention of doing you good, you should run for your life."],["我被前方驶来的车的车头灯晃得眼花。",""]],["droplet","'drɒplit","n. 小滴\\n[医] 小滴",["Each droplet can travel about 1.5 meters.","Does the medicine come in droplet form?"],["",""]],["hooded","'hudid","a. 有罩盖的, 戴头巾的",["The hooded clouds, like friars, tell their beads in drops of rain.","Poor Luis. Last night, when he was going home very late, some hooded men turned up and beat him up. He is in the hospital."],["",""]],["proverb","'prɒvә:b","n. 谚语, 格言, 箴言\\nvt. 使众所周知, 用谚语表达",["There is a proverb that goes \"time is money\", but there is another one that goes \"money can't buy you time\".","\"A rolling stone gathers no moss\" is a proverb."],["俗話說：一寸光陰一寸金；可俗話又說：寸金難買寸光陰！","“滚石不生苔”是一句谚语。"]],["vagina","vә'dʒainә","n. 阴道, 鞘, 叶鞘\\n[医] 阴道; 鞘",["To avoid injury or discomfort, be sure that the vagina is lubricated before intercourse.","Sami shoved the bottle of beer into Layla's vagina."],["",""]],["kicker","'kikә","n. 踢者, 善踢的人, 爱踢的马\\n[化] 抖动器",["Yanni's goat is a kicker."],[""]],["imperfection",".impә'fekʃәn","n. 不完美, 缺点\\n[化] 缺陷; 疵点; 毛病",["She is fixated on one perceived imperfection when she is perfect in every way.","He wasted his youth on an imperfection no one cared about and some women actually found it attractive."],["",""]],["overestimate",".әuvәr'estimeit","vt. 评价过高, 过高估价\\nn. 估计过高, 评价过高",["We cannot overestimate the value of health.","One cannot overestimate the importance of getting up early."],["我们不能高估健康的价值。",""]],["activation","ækti'veiʃәn","n. 活化, 激活\\n[化] 活化; 活化作用; 激活; 激活作用",["Sami gave Layla the activation code for that software.","We sent you an email with an activation link."],["",""]],["reuse","ri:'ju:z","vt. 再使用\\nn. 重新使用",["Maybe we can reuse the wool from this jacket that moth chewed up.","If the napkin is dirty or soiled, please don't reuse it."],["",""]],["smog","smәug","n. 烟雾\\n[化] 烟雾",["The very air we breathe is polluted with smog from the factory chimneys.","In large cities, in London for instance, there is heavy smog."],["",""]],["precedence","pri'si:dns","n. 优先, 居先\\n[计] 先后次序; 优先规定",["It is very natural for a human being that one always give himself precedence over the interests of others.","Whenever there is a conflict between my work and my family, my family always takes precedence."],["",""]],["participatory","pɑ:'tisipeitәri","a. 吸引参与的, 供人分享的",["It is imperative that we should encourage participatory forms of decision-making.","Let us support participatory practices."],["",""]],["respite","'respait","n. 暂缓, 缓期执行\\nvt. 使暂缓",["But when Pharaoh saw that there was respite, he hardened his heart, and hearkened not unto them; as the LORD had said.","Although temperatures eased on Monday, the respite is likely to be brief."],["",""]],["compatibility","kәm.pætә'biliti","n. 兼容性\\n[计] 兼容性",["Availability may vary by region and device compatibility.","The actual content provided may vary depending on the region and device compatibility."],["實際提供內容可能因地區與裝置相容性而異。","實際提供內容可能因地區與裝置相容性而異。"]],["innumerable","i'nju:mәrәbl","a. 无数的, 数不清的",["I have tried innumerable times to contact him.","The number of permutations, in human terms, is innumerable."],["我找過他很多次。",""]],["computation",".kɒmpju'teiʃәn","n. 计算, 计数, 计算结果\\n[经] 计算, 估计, 计算法",["The notion of algorithm forms the core of all of the computation theory.","Machine learning demands a lot of computation."],["",""]],["quell","kwel","vt. 压制, 平息, 减轻",["He ought to go to anger management classes to quell his explosive anger.","Top health officials have been trying to quell these fears."],["",""]],["inaccessible",".inæk'sesәbl","a. 难得到的, 难接近的, 难达成的",["The cave is inaccessible during a flash flood because the arroyo turns into a raging river.","The southern shore of the lake is marshy and inaccessible."],["",""]],["enrage","in'reidʒ","vt. 激怒, 使暴怒",["The word that Mary had, just before the comma, to enrage Tom, was the word \"erased\".","The renomination could enrage anti-government protestors who demand he resign."],["",""]],["lodging","'lɒdʒiŋ","n. 寄宿处, 寄宿\\n[法] 提起, 住所",["This building is a capsule hotel lodging men and women.","The people whose houses were demolished received lodging in the square."],["那个建筑物是男女都可以住宿的胶囊酒店。",""]],["inertia","i'nә:ʃә","n. 惯性, 惰性, 迟钝\\n[化] 惯性",["Inertia is an important governing law.","Never underestimate the power of inertia."],["",""]],["herein",".hiәr'in","adv. 在此处, 如此",["Use of controls or adjustments or performance of procedures other than those specified herein may result in hazardous radiation exposure.","All legislative Powers herein granted shall be vested in a Congress of the United States, which shall consist of a Senate and House of Representatives."],["",""]],["redevelopment","","n. 再开发；重点恢复",["Due to the redevelopment of the town center, most of the surrounding area looks like a building site.","Redevelopment in front of the station has continued, and new shops have opened up."],["",""]],["notoriety",".nәutә'raiәti","n. 恶名, 臭名, 声名狼藉",["Layla wasn't receiving the attention and notoriety that she wanted.","I recalled her as an energetic, autocratic personality, somewhat inclined to charitable and social notoriety."],["",""]],["brothel","'brɒθәl","n. 妓院\\n[法] 妓院",["As I left the brothel, I was embarrassed to be seen by my friends.","You were at the brothel. I can smell it all over you."],["",""]],["reindeer","'rein.diә","n. 驯鹿",["Tom wore a Christmas sweater with embroidered reindeer.","Tom fell off the truck while he was feeding the reindeer."],["",""]],["flimsy","'flimzi","a. 易坏的, 脆弱的, 浅薄的\\nn. 易损坏的东西(或材料), 薄纸, 描图用薄纸, 薄纸稿纸",["The flimsy stalls in this restroom offer very little privacy.","For some inexplicable reason, the flimsy shack survived the storm."],["",""]],["redundant","ri'dʌndәnt","a. 多余的, 过多的, 冗长的\\n[医] 过多的, 多余的",["I'm sorry to have to tell you that you've been made redundant.","The bottles of beer that I brought to the party were redundant; the host's family owned a brewery."],["非常不幸地通知您，您被辞退了。",""]],["underworld","'ʌndәwә:ld","n. 下层社会, 地狱, 下流社会",["Christopher Columbus once fought Cerberus, the three-headed guardian of the underworld, with nothing but his hat.","O deities of the underworld, to whom all we who live must come, hear my words, for they are true."],["",""]],["cello","'tʃelәu","n. 大提琴",["Tom plays the cello with one of the local orchestras.","Olga has been playing the cello since she was 8 years old."],["",""]],["rendezvous","'rɒndivu:","n. 约会, 约会地点\\nv. 集合, 集结, 在约定场所会面\\n[计] 会合",["Tom bought, for his rendezvous, a flower and some gifts.","This birch grove is a very romantic spot for a clandestine rendezvous."],["湯姆為約會買了一束花和一些禮物。",""]],["holster","'hәulstә","n. 手枪皮套",["He was quick on the draw and shot him before he even got his hand on his holster.","Tom took his finger off the trigger and put his pistol back in its holster."],["",""]],["agitated","'ædʒiteitid","a. (表现出)不安/焦虑的, (被)激烈辩论的, (被)热烈讨论的, 颤抖的\\n[医] 激越的",["Agitated activity by certain animals may be a sign of an impending earthquake.","The leaders of the Union agitated for higher wages."],["某些动物烦躁不安, 可能是地震临震前的预兆。",""]],["unhappiness","","n. 苦恼；忧愁",["She doesn't know how to face the unhappiness in her marriage.","Unhappiness comes without being called."],["她不知道怎麼面對婚姻中的不幸。","不快樂不請自來。"]],["assigned","","a. 已分配的；指定的",["When the counter value reaches the assigned 'lucky-number' it displays a congratulatory message.","The teacher assigned us ten problems for homework."],["當計數器的數值達到預設的「幸運號碼」時，就會顯示一則恭喜訊息。","老師給我們佈置了十道題為作業。"]],["centrality","sen'træliti","n. 中心, 中央, 向心性\\n[医] 中央性, 归中性",["He became convinced of his own indispensability and centrality to the process.","Their mistake was thinking of themselves as centrality. Humanity is not the centre of the universe. The Earth is not the centre of the universe."],["",""]],["amish","'ɑ:miʃ","n. 孟诺教派；孟诺教派之教徒",["Mary didn't want to wear a sexy costume for Halloween so she decided to dress like an Amish woman.","Amish people don't pay National Insurance contributions."],["",""]],["understate",".ʌndә'steit","v. 不完全地陈述, 保守地说, 有意轻描淡写",["Brits tend to understate things."],[""]],["vulture","'vʌltʃә","n. 秃鹫, 贪婪的人\\n[法] 贪婪而残酷者, 劫掠成性者",["We men can silence the vulture within us, but not the jackass.","The eagle is a raptor, like the falcon and vulture."],["",""]],["torpedo","tɒ:'pi:dәu","n. 鱼雷, 水雷, 地雷\\nvt. 用鱼雷袭击, 破坏",["It took many torpedo hits to send the battleship Bismarck to Davy Jones's locker.","The first air striking unit consisted of 50 Zero fighters, 40 torpedo bombers and 81 dive bombers."],["",""]],["contraceptive",".kɒntrә'septiv","a. 避孕的\\nn. 避孕剂, 避孕用具",["In Japan the ring shaped ones came into use first so they're also often called \"contraceptive rings\".","Today, I saw a woman in pink crocs and I believe that that is the best contraceptive I have ever seen."],["",""]],["periodical",".piәri'ɒdikl","n. 期刊\\na. 定期出版的, (有关)期刊的, 间歇(性的), 周期的, 定期的",["Even the periodical pay raise could not keep abreast of higher living costs.","A magazine is a periodical publication containing articles and illustrations about a subject or specific field."],["",""]],["postcolonial",",pәjstkә'lәjnjәl,-ni-","a. 殖民地时期之后的",["The class read postcolonial novels this semester."],["這學期班上讀了後殖民小說。"]],["mane","mein","n. 鬃毛",["In the leaden backdrop of the dawn, the horseman stands in silence, the long mane of his horse, disheveled by the wind.","His long and untidy hair was similar to a lion's mane."],["",""]],["pulitzer","'pulitsә","n. 普利策（美国新闻业经营者）",["Many people have won more than one Pulitzer Prize.","The Pulitzer Prize for Fiction, the United States' pre-eminent prize for literature, is awarded only to Americans."],["",""]],["stockholder","'stɒkhәuldә","n. 股东\\n[法] 股东, 股票持有者, 股票所有人",["I'm a stockholder in this company."],[""]],["dutifully","","adv. 忠实地；忠贞地",["Benedito whistled a tune as he set off for a long day of herding, his billy goat following dutifully behind.","The altar boy dutifully followed the priest."],["",""]],["bigotry","'bigәtri","n. 盲从, 偏见, 偏执的行为(或态度)",["Bigotry is often invisible to those who are not on the receiving end of it.","The burning of the Quran exemplifies the worst form of religious bigotry and ignorance."],["",""]],["digging","'digiŋ","n. 挖掘",["You are always digging at me about my clothes.","There's nothing like digging up money, it's good fun."],["你总是挖苦我的着装。",""]],["nagging","'nægiŋ","a. 唠叨的, 责备挑剔的",["Mike is always nagging his father to buy him a car.","I've had more than enough of his constant nagging."],["米克整天都在求爸爸買車給他。",""]],["fractured","","a. 断裂的；挫伤的；折裂的",["As the employee came down from looking at the top shelf, he misstepped, fell, and fractured his left ankle.","The boy fell off the bicycle and fractured his skull."],["",""]],["auspice","'ɒ:spis","n. 吉兆, 占卜, 赞助",["That party was held under the auspices of the Foreign Ministry."],[""]],["speechless","'spi:tʃlis","a. 不会说话的, 哑的, 说不出话的, 无言的, 非言语所能表达的, (非正式)烂醉的",["The surprise rendered her speechless.","Maria cheerfully giggled when she saw Tom looked as if he were speechless."],["她驚訝得說不出話來。",""]],["recur","ri'kә:","vi. 复发, 回到, 重现, 再来, 诉诸, 采用, 循环",["These are symptoms that may recur after some time.","Next year we'll recur to this issue."],["",""]],["furry","'fә:ri","a. 毛皮的, 盖着毛皮的, 似毛皮的",["In the furry fandom, many are artists of some sort.","The furry fandom, like many other fandoms, has its own slang."],["在福瑞圈子里，不少人都会进行一些创作。",""]],["painkiller","'pein,kilә(r)","n. 解痛药, 止痛片, 止痛药",["If you have pain, take a painkiller.","I took a painkiller for my headache."],["",""]],["predispose",".pri:di'spәuz","vt. 预先处置, 使预先有倾向",["His good manners predispose people to like him."],[""]],["warring","'wɔ:riŋ","a. 交战的, 敌对的, 冲突的\\n[法] 战争, 敌对行为",["Relations are tenuous as peace talks resume between warring factions.","A neutral country is a country that doesn't sell weapons to a warring country, unless you pay cash."],["",""]],["inexplicable","in'eksplikәbl","a. 不能说明的, 不能解释的, 费解的",["The more I thought, the more extraordinary and inexplicable did it appear.","When anyone tries to explain the inexplicable, he is getting ready to excuse the inexcusable."],["",""]],["restart",".ri:'stɑ:t","v. 重新开始, 重新启动\\n[计] 重新启动",["The saved game appears to be damaged and cannot be used. Please quit the game and then restart after removing the save data.","Your computer will restart several times during installation."],["",""]],["lax","læks","a. 松的, 不严格的, 腹泻的, 松弛的\\nn. 腹泻, 松元音",["Some member countries have been lax in abiding by G-7 agreements.","Parents who are lax in raising their children do them a disservice."],["",""]],["toil","tɒil","n. 辛苦, 苦工, 网, 罗网, 圈套\\nvi. 苦干, 跋涉",["While the rest of us toil, the robber barons eat from gilt tableware.","God created man to enjoy, not destroy, the fruits of the earth and of their own toil."],["當我們其他人辛苦工作時，強盜貴族卻用鍍金餐具吃飯。",""]],["sync","siŋk","[计] 同步的",["Subscribers can play across phones, tablets, and computers, with certain games supporting multiplayer access and cloud sync.","This app will let you sync your photos and music between all your devices."],["訂閱用戶可以在手機、平板與電腦上遊玩，部分遊戲支援多人連線及雲端同步。",""]],["dissemination","di.semi'neiʃә","n. 散播, 传播, 普及\\n[医] 散布, 播散",["The over presence and domination of English in the European blogosphere works against interaction and dissemination of debate.","The dissemination of scientific knowledge is essential."],["",""]],["caribou","'kæribu:","n. 北美驯鹿",["Caribou can see ultraviolet light. This ability is crucial to their survival in a harsh Arctic environment.","Caribou can spot wolves using their ultraviolet vision."],["",""]],["oppress","ә'pres","vt. 压迫, 压抑, 使烦恼",["Wealth could not muddle his thoughts, poverty could not change his integrity, force could not oppress his will, this is what it means to be a man.","If you oppress those below you, don't feel safe from the punishment of the one above you."],["富贵不能迷乱他的思想，贫贱不能改变他的操守，威武不能压服他的意志，这就是大丈夫的本分。",""]],["policing","pəˈli:sɪŋ","v. （警察、军队等）巡查( police的现在分词 ); 维护治安; （委员会等）监督; 管制",["Lemoine said local authorities restored a more thoughtful form of neighborhood policing, which included training officers on cultural sensitivities.","The US wants to continue policing the world."],["",""]],["boiled","bɔild","a. 煮沸的, (非正式)喝醉的, 烧滚的",["Chestnuts have to be boiled for at least fifteen minutes.","No need to trouble yourself, Auntie. A glass of boiled water will be plenty."],["栗子至少要煮15分钟。","阿姨，您别客气，喝杯开水就行。"]],["pulmonary","'pʌlmәnәri","a. 肺的, 与肺有关的, 有肺的\\n[医] 肺的",["At least 10% of individuals with pulmonary embolism die within the first hour.","Breathing in volcanic ash can cause pulmonary problems."],["",""]],["handbook","'hænd,buk","n. 手册\\n[计] 手册",["We need a description of the club so that it can be added to the school handbook.","Unfortunately if you have a problem with it, you'll have to follow the grievance procedure as outlined in the employee handbook."],["",""]],["inundate","'inʌndeit","vt. 浸水, 泛滥, 淹没, 使充满",["The basement of his house is constantly inundated with inexplicable water leaks."],[""]],["cobalt","'kәubɒ:lt","n. 钴, 钴类颜料\\n[化] 钴Co",["Some of the cobalt used in phone and laptop batteries is dug out by hand in Congo.","Cobalt, which forms the core of Vitamin B12, is only created in supernovae and neutron star mergers."],["",""]],["hangover","'hæŋәuvә","n. 宿醉, 残留物, 遗物\\n[电] 残存物",["I ended up going over the top, drinking too much and having a terrible hangover the next day.","Robots are great in the workplace, because they don't need toilet or meal breaks, don't get sick or come to work with a hangover."],["",""]],["absentee",".æbsәn'ti:","n. 缺席者, 不在者\\n[经] 缺勤者, 缺席者, 未到工者",["The absentee landlord requires a state to enforce his claims to the property.","The traveler sent in an absentee vote by mail."],["",""]],["plurality",".pluә'rælәti","n. 复数, 较大的数, 多数状态, 兼职\\n[法] 大多数, 较多数, 复数",["While there is a plurality of Tatoeba sentences in English, it is encouraging that Esperanto, Italian, German, Turkish, Russian, French and Spanish already have respectable numbers of sentences as well."],[""]],["repress","ri'pres","vt. 镇压, 抑制, 压制\\nvi. 压制",["We repress the fact that we eat animals rather than barcoded containers from the supermarket.","The report also discusses actions by governments and other groups to repress the news media."],["",""]],["tableau","'tæblәu","n. 生动场面, 戏剧性局面",["Ferries, freighters and fishing and tour boats are part of the tableau that often makes living by the sea postcard-pretty and desirable."],[""]],["reparation",".repә'reiʃәn","n. 补偿, 赔偿, 弥补, 修复, 修理\\n[经] 赔偿, 补偿, 修理",["Victims of crimes of war and crimes against humanity deserve recognition and reparation.","To cheat oneself out of love is the most terrible deception; it is an eternal loss for which there is no reparation, either in time or in eternity."],["",""]],["bloodstream","","n. 血流",["Decompression sickness, or \"the bends,\" is a buildup of nitrogen bubbles in the bloodstream and other areas of the body.","The vaccine is not injected into the bloodstream, but into the muscle."],["",""]],["pungent","'pʌndʒәnt","a. 刺激性的, 尖刻的, 苦痛的\\n[医] 冲味的, 刺激味的",["Wasabi is a pungent plant that is difficult to cultivate.","Stepping through the front door, Tom recognised instantly the pungent smell of Mary's perfume."],["",""]],["postulate","'pɒstjuleit","n. 假定, 基本条件\\nvt. 要求, 假定",["We need to postulate a completely different paradigm to explain all these phenomena.","Seriously, I postulate that I am, right after my ex-girlfriend leaves my house, going to talk to myself in Lojban."],["",""]],["sarcastic","sɑ:'kæstik","a. 讽刺的, 讥讽的",["Don't you think the name \"The Sacred War\" sounds a bit sarcastic?","Spenser's sarcastic and joking remarks are often misinterpreted as signs of ambivalence and often taken too seriously."],["你不覺得這個名字很諷刺嗎，「神聖的戰爭」？",""]],["transistor","træn'zistә","n. 晶体管\\n[化] 晶体管",["The invention of the transistor marked a new era.","The invention of the transistor introduced a new era."],["晶體管的發明標誌著一個新時代的開始。",""]],["trilogy","'trilәdʒi","n. 三部剧, 三部曲\\n[医] 三联, 三联症",["Pachacuti was the ninth ruler of the Inca trilogy of Mexico.","The Cornetto trilogy was named after the ice cream brand."],["",""]],["panorama",".pænә'rɑ:mә","n. 全景, 全貌, 概论, 范围",["The city always glows, lamps replace the sun. Its panorama ornaments the profound horizon.","The weather was favorable, and the view, in Richter's opinion, far surpassed the much-vaunted panorama from the Krimmler Tauern."],["",""]],["untold","'ʌn'tәuld","a. 未说过的, 未透露的, 未加叙述的, 数不清的, 无限的, 不可计量的, 无数的\\n[法] 未说明的, 未方露的, 未说出的",["There is no greater agony than bearing an untold story.","They caused an untold amount of death and destruction."],["",""]],["burly","'bә:li","a. 结实的, 粗壮的, 率直的",["Those burly books were really expensive.","He was a thick-set, burly man with a shock of grizzled hair, a brown, weather-beaten face, and blue eyes which were keen to the verge of fierceness."],["",""]],["stardom","'stɑ:dәm","n. 明星身分, 明星们",["Sills' stardom stretched from the highbrow world of the Metropolitan Opera to the playful world of the Muppets on television.","She rose to stardom when she was just twelve."],["",""]],["tranquil","'træŋkwil","a. 安静的",["Hunting game is forbidden in these tranquil woods.","Hunting game is forbidden in this tranquil wilderness."],["",""]],["miscarriage","mis'kæridʒ","n. 失败, 误送, 流产\\n[医] 流产",["Layla's husband left her because she had a miscarriage.","My friend had a miscarriage and I don't know how to comfort her."],["",""]],["bombard","bɒm'bɑ:d","vt. 炮击, 攻击, 轰击\\nn. 射石炮",["Brave men and women crossed thousands of miles to bombard innocent villagers in these remote mountains.","Cyber experts say hundreds of thousands of viruses and malware bombard personal computers every day."],["",""]],["somali","sәu'mɑ:li","n. 索马里人",["The official languages of Ethiopia are Afar, Amharic, Oromo, Somali, and Tigrinya.","The Somali government has declared a national emergency over a locust upsurge which is spreading in the East Africa region."],["",""]],["fifteenth","'fif'ti:nθ","num. 第十五, 十五分之一",["The mosque, which was built in the fifteenth century, is the most beautiful building in the town.","This note is better construed as a sharp fifteenth rather than a flat ninth."],["",""]],["defensively","di'fɛnsivli","adv. 防御地；守势地",["Buddhists are not so anti-science as some Christians defensively are.","Stingrays only use their stingers defensively, so injuries to humans are rare."],["",""]],["preparatory","pri'pærәtәri","a. 预备性的, 准备性的\\nn. 预科",["These tests are also standardized, so they can only give you questions from the syllabus you can find in preparatory books.","Nowadays, the preparatory value of Esperanto for other languages is much emphasized."],["",""]],["telltale","'telteil","n. 搬弄是非者, 迹象, 指示器\\na. 搬弄是非的, 泄露秘密的, 报警的",["The school telltale reported Tom to the principal for smoking behind the gym.","The red, itchy rash on Mary's skin was a telltale sign that she had chicken pox."],["",""]],["zombie","'zɔmbi","n. 蛇神, 起死回生的魔力, 僵尸, 回魂尸, (美)鸡尾酒, 木鸡, 讨厌的家伙\\n[计] 僵尸",["What would you do in the event of a zombie apocalypse?","After my husband's death I walked around like a zombie."],["在殭屍啟示錄的事件中你會怎麼做？",""]],["assembled","ә'sembәld","v. 集合；装配（assemble的过去分词）",["The police assembled a lot of evidence against him.","The teacher assembled the students in the hall."],["警察收集了很多对他不利的证据。","老師在禮堂把學生們集合起來。"]],["drying","'draiiŋ","[计] 干燥的\\n[化] 干燥",["This is perfect weather for drying clothes.","This is an appliance for drying clothes."],["這是最適合晾衣服的天氣。","這是一個晾衣服的器具。"]],["grinder","'graindә","n. 推磨的人, 研磨者\\n[化] 磨床; 磨木机; 研磨机",["After I tried out my new loom, I made my bed and repaired the coffee grinder.","The Beetle was blind, and the Bat was blinder, and they went to take tea with the Scissors-grinder."],["",""]],["variously","'veәriәsli","adv. 各种各样, 种种, 不同, 多方面, 多才多艺, 许多, 各个, 个别, 杂色, 彩色",["The policy was variously criticized and praised."],["該政策受到各方不同的批評與讚美。"]],["scapegoat","'skeipgәut","n. 替罪羔羊, 替人顶罪者, 替身\\n[法] 替罪羊, 代人受过者",["Why am I the only one they complain about? They're just making an example out of me and using me as a scapegoat.","Why am I the only one they complain about? They just latched onto me and made me a scapegoat."],["為什麼我是他們唯一抱怨的人? 他們就這樣拿我作例子, 利用我當代罪羔羊。",""]],["topography","tә'pɒgrәfi","n. 地志, 地形学, 地势, 局部解剖学\\n[医] 局部解剖, 局部记载",["It's easy to see the area's majestic topography from the cockpit of a helicopter.","The topography of the state and low population levels are among the reasons why affordable broadband is lacking, he says."],["",""]],["rightful","'raitful","a. 合法的, 正直的, 恰当的\\n[法] 正当的, 合法的, 依法有求权的",["These items must be returned to their rightful owner.","I have returned the diamond to its rightful owner."],["",""]],["prism","'prizm","n. 棱镜, 棱柱\\n[化] 棱镜",["A beam of white light is split by a prism into rays of various colors.","Inside the prism, violet light slows down more than red light."],["",""]],["gymnasium","dʒim'neiziәm","n. 健身房, 体育馆\\n[医] 体育馆, 健身室, 运动场",["The money was appropriated for building the gymnasium.","I got a quick glimpse of Takanohana as he hurriedly left the gymnasium."],["",""]],["mindless","'maindlis","a. 没头脑的, 不小心的, 不留神的",["A mass unsettling of the mindless followers of the cult leader required the arrival of a charismatic insurgent.","The internet is a wonderful source of mindless entertainment."],["",""]],["diva","'di:vә","n. 歌剧女主角/首席女主角, 主要女歌手",["Gossip that the diva had gotten married was spreading.","She was a real diva from head to toe."],["",""]],["mire","maiә","n. 泥沼, 泥泞\\nvt. 使陷于泥泞, 使陷入困境\\nvi. 掉进泥坑",["Heavenly ire / ne'er sent a pest more loathsome; ne'er were seen / worse plagues to issue from the Stygian mire.","This is what the vox populi reports: he who stirs up the mire brings the mud to the surface."],["",""]],["linked","liŋkt","a. 连接的；显示连环遗传的；联合的",["It is a prevalent belief, according to a nationwide poll in the United States, that Muslims are linked with terrorism.","The defendant was romantically linked with the judge."],["根据美国国民的一个投票，人们普遍认为穆斯林人和恐怖主义有关。",""]],["roomy","'ru:mi","a. 广阔的, 宽敞的, 宽大的",["I like this house. It's quite roomy.","Tom's two-door sedan is surprisingly roomy."],["",""]],["shellfish","'ʃelfiʃ","n. 贝, 甲壳类水生物\\n[医] 牡蛎",["The Old Testament forbids eating shellfish.","I do not eat meat, fish, shellfish, poultry or broth."],["旧约书中禁止食用贝类等有壳的水生动物。",""]],["scooter","'sku:tә","n. 小型摩托车, 踏板车\\n[机] 机车",["I was in hot pursuit of the scooter when I cycled down the boulevard.","I crossed the whole city of Algiers on my scooter."],["",""]],["marquee","mɑ:'ki:","n. 大帐篷, 遮篷, 选取框\\n[计] 选取框",["Many theaters still have marquee signs over their entrances, advertising the current films being shown to passersby.","The marquee collapsed halfway through the band's set."],["",""]],["buried","","a. 埋葬的；[地]埋藏的",["Tom couldn't remember where he'd buried the money.","It is said that treasure is buried in this area."],["汤姆把他钱埋的地方给忘掉了。","据说这个区域埋着财宝。"]],["kissing","'kisiŋ","a. 接吻的",["Kissing a person who smokes is like licking an ashtray.","Kissing a smoker is like licking an ashtray."],["亲吻一个抽烟的人就像在舔烟灰缸。","亲吻一个抽烟的人就像在舔烟灰缸。"]],["capitol","'kæpitl","n. 国会大厦, 州议会大厦, 朱比特神庙",["A banking scandal is sweeping across Capitol Hill.","The heads of 16 city councils met at the state capitol."],["",""]],["miniseries","ˈmɪnisɪəri:z","n. 电视连续短剧",["The true-crime miniseries lasted six episodes."],["這部犯罪紀實影集共六集。"]],["trustworthy","'trʌst.wә:ði","a. 可信赖的\\n[法] 可信任的, 可靠的, 可信赖的",["People are not willing to lend money to people who aren't trustworthy.","I was mistaken in thinking that he was a trustworthy man."],["人们不愿意把钱借给那些不值得信任的人。","我還以為他是個信得過的人。"]],["sidestep","'saidstep","n. 横跨的一步, 台阶\\nvt. 横跨一步躲避, 回避\\nvi. 回避问题, 躲避打击",["He attempted to sidestep a conflict with his chief.","I managed to sidestep every pitfall."],["",""]],["gravely","'greivli","adv. 重大地, 严肃地, 庄重地",["Yanni has been gravely injured for more than four hours.","The girl was standing on the other side of the fire, gravely whistling a most extraordinary song."],["",""]],["whimsical","'hwimzikl","a. 怪念头多的, 反复无常的, 古怪的, 异想天开的",["I prefer my stories to be on the more whimsical side.","He never lost his whimsical longing for adventure."],["",""]],["immunization",".imju:nai'zeiʃәn","n. 免疫\\n[医] 免疫法",["If you have a certificate of immunization, please bring it when you come.","The vaccine will be administered free to all 10-year-old girls as part of the country's routine immunization schedule."],["",""]],["effortlessly","'efətləslɪ","adv. 不作努力地, 不费力地",["I would love to be able to read French effortlessly.","The teacher got Tom to recite the times tables, which he did effortlessly and flawlessly."],["要是我能流畅地读法语就好了。",""]],["lighted","","light的过去式和过去分词",["He gets out of the car and climbs the slope of the garden to the lighted window.","This is the first time I've ever lighted a candle with a lighter."],["",""]],["mounting","'mauntiŋ","n. 装备, 衬托纸, 舞台效果, 上马\\n[化] 装配",["The fumes of the wine were mounting steadily to addle his indifferent brains.","Tensions are mounting on the al-Aqsa Mosque compound."],["",""]],["courier","'kuriә","n. 送快信的人, 伴游服务员\\n[法] 信使, 送急件者",["In Premium Rush, a routine delivery for a New York bicycle courier turns into a race against the clock when a mysterious stranger tries to hijack the package.","Yesterday a courier delivered my order."],["",""]],["recoil","ri'kɒil","n. 畏缩, 后退, 弹回, 反作用, 后坐力\\nvi. 退却, 畏缩, 弹回, 撤退, 反冲, 报应",["This is a great rifle to snipe with, if you can handle the recoil.","He told the lawmakers that the thought of war made him \"recoil in horror\"."],["",""]],["lyrical","'lirikәl","a. 抒情诗调的, 有抒情味的, 感情丰富的",["Love is merely a lyrical way of referring to lust.","He always waxes lyrical about his wonderful new job."],["",""]],["disoriented","dis'ɔ:rientid","a. 无判断力的；分不清方向或目标的",["This one time, I dreamt I was a squirrel, and then I woke up in bed completely disoriented.","Igor got disoriented and ended up on another trail."],["",""]],["armpit","'ɑ:mpit","n. 腋窝\\n[医] 腋, 腋窝",["Scratching his armpit and giving his finger a whiff, Tom jolted away from his hand.","When I lost my electric razor, I tried plucking my armpit hair with tweezers, but that was too painful."],["",""]],["evasion","i'veiʒәn","n. 逃避, 藉口\\n[法] 回避, 规避, 逃避",["The accusations are shocking: money laundering, tax evasion and obstruction of justice.","Tax officials are zeroing in on income tax evasion."],["这些指控令人震惊:洗钱、逃税和妨碍司法公正。",""]],["hormonal","hɒ:'mәunәl","a. 荷尔蒙的\\n[医] 激素的",["Some flame retardants can cause cancer and hormonal disruptions.","Biological sex is generally subdivided into genotypic sex, phenotypic sex, and hormonal sex."],["",""]],["perpetually","","adv. 永恒地, 持久地",["Our Tawes is perpetually smiling, she never feels down.","You perpetually leave the door of your dwelling open for them."],["",""]],["fondness","'fɔndnis","n. 溺爱；爱好",["Tom has always had a special personal fondness for reading thriller books.","Love is a feeling of great fondness or enthusiasm for a person or a thing."],["",""]],["mmm","","[医] 毫微米",["Sorry Link, I can't give credit. Come back when you're a little... mmm... richer!","Mmm, this is one yummy pie! Om nom nom."],["",""]],["vip","","n. 要人, 大人物\\n[化] 血管活性肠肽",["The star of the film festival gave Adriano a VIP pass.","He is a VIP and we must treat him as such."],["",""]],["consensual","kәn'sensjuәl","a. 在两方愿意下成立的, 交感的\\n[医] 同感的, 交感的",["The important thing is that kinks are consensual and explored with open communication and respect.","Role play allows you to step into different roles and explore fantasies in a safe, consensual environment."],["",""]],["pike","paik","n. 长矛, 尖头, (体操)屈体, 流浪者, 狗鱼, 通行费\\nvi. 用矛刺杀, 刺, 离开, 谨慎办事, 采用屈体姿势",["Speaking of fall flavors in Japan, what comes to everyone's mind? For me, after all is said and done, it would be pike.","Another innovation could come down the pike and transform industries."],["",""]],["extremism","ik'stri:mizm","n. 极端倾向, 极端论, 过激主义",["The first issue that we have to confront is violent extremism in all of its forms.","The slogan for the day against extremism was, \"multicolored instead of brown\"."],["",""]],["ovation","әu'veiʃәn","n. 热烈欢迎, 大喝采, 小凯旋式",["Adriano's star performance earned him a standing ovation.","The audience paid a standing ovation at the end of the play."],["",""]],["undisturbed",".ʌndi'stә:bd","a. 未被扰乱的, 安静的, 镇定的",["Very few places on our earth remain undisturbed by civilization.","Older people say they do understand, but that they need undisturbed sleep."],["",""]],["khaki","'kɑ:ki","a. 卡其色的, 土黄色的\\nn. 卡其色, 卡其色军服",["Khaki shorts with cargo pockets do not make you an adventurer.","Business casual means you can wear khaki trousers with a button-down shirt, but not shorts with a T-shirt."],["單有卡其褲，還成不了冒險家。",""]],["hiking","'haikiŋ","n. 徒步旅行",["Tom wanted to stay home and relax instead of hiking with his children.","The man is hiking on a narrow path."],["汤姆想待在家休息而不是和他的孩子们出去远足。","他在一条狭窄的道路上走。"]],["jamaican","dʒә'meikәn","a. 牙买加的；牙买加人的",["My Jamaican high school friend Graeme was one-quarter black and had a very rich Jewish uncle.","Jamaican people use a creole version of English."],["",""]],["finder","'faindә","a. 发现者, 寻星镜\\n[医] 寻觅器, 探示器",["I quietly take out my camera, so as not to be noticed by my photographic subject, and peek through the finder.","Could you lend me your stud finder? I need to install a towel rack."],["",""]],["precondition",".pri:kәn'diʃәn","vt. 事先准备, 事先处理\\nn. 先决条件, 前提\\n[计] 前置条件",["High moral character is not a precondition for great moral accomplishments.","According to Ms. Morillon, the report disproves the theory that economic prosperity is a precondition for democracy."],["",""]],["embedded","im'bedid","a. 植入的, 内含的, 深入的",["A metallic lid flew around three kilometers and embedded itself in a building.","It's dazzling how a couple of million cells embedded in an electrochemical mush give rise to the gestalt of human consciousness."],["",""]],["pep","pep","n. 活力, 气力, 劲头, 锐气\\nvt. 鼓起精神, 激励, 使充满活力",["The players sat and listened to their coach give them a pep talk in the changing rooms.","The coach gave his team a pep talk before the game started."],["球员们坐在更衣室，听教练给他们打气。",""]],["attracting","","n. 吸引",["Hsinchu's meatballs and rice noodles are very famous, attracting many tourists to taste them.","An all-women's newsroom in India staffed by members of the country's marginalized communities including Dalits, has been attracting international attention this year."],["新竹的貢丸和米粉非常有名，吸引不少遊客品嚐。","印度一家全女性新聞編輯室今年引起了國際社會的關注，該編輯室的員工由本國邊緣群體構成，其中包括達利特人。"]],["complimentary",".kɒmpli'mentәri","a. 问候的, 称赞的, 夸奖的",["Yes. I'm pretty sure there are complimentary tickets that haven't been used somewhere.","First class plane flights come with complimentary alcohol."],["",""]],["weakest","wi:kɪst","a. 弱的( weak的最高级 ); 微弱的; 无说服力的; 淡的",["The weakest link in the chain is also the strongest. It can break the chain.","Man is but a reed, the weakest in nature, but he is a thinking reed."],["",""]],["ordain","ɒ:'dein","vt. 注定, 规定, 任命\\nvi. 颁布命令",["The bishop's role includes the power to select, ordain, and supervise ministers.","\"Naught happens here but as the Gods ordain. / It may not be, nor doth the Lord divine / of high Olympus nor the Fates design / that thou should'st take Creusa.\""],["",""]],["standout","'stændaut","n. 杰出的人\\na. 杰出的, 出色的",["Though not one of the top contenders, Yang is the first Asian American to run for president and is a standout within that community.","He was the standout in that tournament."],["",""]],["malicious","mә'liʃәs","a. 怀恶意的, 恶毒的",["Nothing will hinder my malicious plan.","Malicious gossip spreads like wildfire. I guess that's why they say bad news travels fast."],["没有什么能阻碍我邪恶的计划。",""]],["checkbook","'tʃekbuk","n. 支票簿",["I balanced my checkbook while you were washing clothes.","Mary reached in her purse and pulled out her checkbook."],["",""]],["astute","ә'stju:t","a. 敏锐的, 狡猾的",["An astute reader should be willing to weigh everything they read, including anonymous sources.","Tom was an astute businessman who made a lot of money."],["",""]],["unaffected",".ʌnә'fektid","a. 不矫揉造作的, 自然的, 未受影响的, 未被感动的\\n[经] 不受影响的",["She was quite unaffected by the death of her husband.","Mr. Bingley was good-looking and gentlemanlike; he had a pleasant countenance, and easy, unaffected manners."],["",""]],["archaic","ɑ:'keiik","a. 古体的, 过时的, 古老的, 古代的\\n[医] 原始的, 古代的",["The written form looks like an archaic form of English.","Jonas's house is more archaic-looking than the rest."],["",""]],["prowl","praul","n. 潜行, 徘徊, 悄悄踱步\\nvi. 潜行以觅食, 徘徊\\nvt. 徘徊",["Grave robbers prowl cemeteries at night, selling stolen treasures to black market collectors.","Graverobbers prowl cemeteries at night, selling stolen treasures to black market collectors."],["",""]],["vestige","'vestidʒ","n. 遗迹, 痕迹, 残余, 丝毫, 退化的器官\\n[医] 遗迹, 剩件, 剩余",["One only vestige of his fate appeared. A large sable feather had been detached from his hat, and the rippling waves of the rising tide wafted it to Caleb's feet.","This mousepad is a vestige of a bygone era."],["",""]],["figurine","'figjuri:n","n. 小雕像",["Tom accidentally knocked Mary's favourite figurine off the shelf and broke it.","Dan got a lucky cat figurine from a co-worker for his birthday."],["",""]],["fertilization",".fә:tilai'zeiʃәn","n. 使肥沃, 土地肥沃法, 施肥\\n[医] 受精, 授精",["We will study the underlying molecular occurrences of fertilization.","For women who are unable to conceive naturally, in vitro fertilization gives them a chance to have a child."],["",""]],["quail","kweil","n. 鹌鹑\\nvi. 胆怯, 畏缩",["Chicken eggs are richer in vitamin A than quail eggs.","California has an official animal, the grizzly bear, and a state bird, the California quail."],["",""]],["appraise","ә'preiz","vt. 评价, 估价\\n[经] 评价, 鉴定",["I went to the pawn shop and asked them to please appraise my 1980s style car."],[""]],["discernible","di's\\\\\\\\:nәbl,-'z\\\\\\\\:-","a. 看得清的, 可看出的, 可辨别的, 辨别得出的\\n[计] 可识别的",["If Mary had been discernible as a spy, she wouldn't have done her job very well. Even her husband had no idea."],[""]],["erection","i'rekʃәn","n. 直立, 竖起, 建筑物\\n[化] 装配",["Nothing is more repulsive at a wedding than a priest with an erection.","Don't lend money to someone who can't have a morning erection."],["",""]],["financier","fai'nænsiә","n. 财政家, 金融家\\nvi. 从事欺骗性金融活动, 欺骗",["The industrialist found a wealthy financier to help him weather the storm which was inevitable.","Steal a penny, you're a thief. Steal thousands, you're a financier."],["",""]],["entrench","in'trentʃ","vt. 围以壕沟, 防护, 保卫, 使处于牢固地位\\nvi. 掘壕, 侵犯",["The money of all the world's billionaires is used to sell you on capitalism and to ensure that the laws are crafted in such a way as to entrench it."],[""]],["nonpartisan","","a. 超党派的, 不支持任何党派的, 不受任何党派影响的, 不受任何党派控制的",["The committee is nonpartisan and independent."],["該委員會是無黨派且獨立的。"]],["afar","ә'fɑ:","adv. 由远处, 遥远地",["The sea is deep blue, and from afar it looks like a vast sheet of silk spread out.","When a friend comes from afar, is that not delightful?"],["海水藍藍的，遠遠看去像一大片絲綢鋪開。","有朋自远方来，不亦乐乎？"]],["assisted","əˈsistid","a. [计]辅助的\\nv. 帮助, 促进( assist的过去式和过去分词 ); 为…的助手; 为…当帮手; 辅助",["The students assisted the professor in the investigation.","Rulers who posses the Way are raised by heaven, supported by the earth and assisted by the spirits."],["",""]],["revamp","ri:'væmp","vt. 换新鞋面, 修理, 修补, 修改\\n[经] 整修, 补, 修改",["Keep the estate, but revamp the house!"],[""]],["intrinsically","","[计] 本质的",["No circumstance, no purpose, no law whatsoever can ever make licit an act which is intrinsically illicit.","At the time, astronomy was still intrinsically linked to astrology."],["",""]],["manic","'meinik","a. 躁狂的\\nn. 躁狂者",["Tom has periods of debilitating depression followed by bursts of manic activity.","She stopped taking Prozac because it gave her a manic episode."],["",""]],["glee","gli:","n. 欢乐, 高兴",["She noticed with glee that his eyes widened, as he saw her in a bikini for the first time.","Ziri rubbed his hands together with villainous glee."],["",""]],["extracurricular",".ekstrәkә'rikjulә","a. 课外的, 业余的",["Sami started doing some extracurricular activities.","Tom participates in many extracurricular activities."],["",""]],["transfusion","træns'fju:ʃәn","n. 倾注, 输血, 输液\\n[医] 输血, 输液",["Check the suitability of the blood for transfusion.","The business needed a quick transfusion of cash or it was going to go under."],["",""]],["understatement","ʌndә'steitmәnt","n. 软弱无力的陈述, 克制的说法\\n[经] 少报",["To call Yanni's father a monster would be an understatement.","To call that fabrication a fib would be a criminal understatement."],["",""]],["stoke","stәuk","v. 司炉, (使)大吃",["There are buses in place of trains between Stoke-on-Trent and Crewe today because of maintenance work on the line.","Buses are running instead of trains today between Stoke-on-Trent and Crewe because of maintenance work."],["",""]],["overcrowded","ˌəʊvəˈkraʊdɪd","a. 挤满的; 过度拥挤的\\nv. 拥挤(overcrowd的过去式和过去分词)",["In the U.S., there are more prisoners than there is jail space for them. So the prisons are overcrowded.","He organized his overcrowded schedule and managed to come to see my performance."],["",""]],["stiffly","'stifli","adv. 呆板地, 顽固地, 僵硬地",["He moved stiffly after doing too much in the gym the day before.","The poplars stood in two endless rows with their leafless branches pointing stiffly heavenwards."],["",""]],["heirloom","'єәlum","n. 传家宝, 动产继承物\\n[法] 祖传动产, 传家宝",["I found some interesting heirloom tomatoes at the farmer's market.","It's an heirloom. Been in my family for generations."],["",""]],["failing","'feiliŋ","n. 失败, 缺点\\nprep. 如果没有...\\na. 失败的",["Failing the examination means waiting for another year.","Regardless how many times I try to solve this nasty problem, I always end up failing."],["考试不及格意味着再等待一年。","对于这个棘手的问题，无论我尝试多少次，结果都会以失败告终。"]],["excruciating","iks'kru:ʃieitiŋ","a. 极痛苦的, 折磨人的, 精心制作的",["Listening to the orator's incoherent ramblings was excruciating.","You discovered my biggest weakness: excruciating pain."],["",""]],["vindicate","'vindikeit","vt. 辩护, 证明...无辜, 维护\\n[法] 辩护, 辩解, 辩明",["Sami wanted to vindicate himself."],[""]],["impractical","im'præktikәl","a. 不切实际的, 不能实行的, 不现实的, 不合情理的",["She thought the plan was fine but impractical.","We all consider your idea to be impractical."],["她认为计划很好，但不可行。","我们都认为您的想法是行不通的。"]],["overdose","'әuvәdәus","n. 配药量过多\\nvt. 配药过量, 使过分沉溺",["Tom's autopsy revealed that he died from an overdose.","About 77 Americans die each day from an opioid overdose."],["",""]],["uproar","'ʌprɒ:","n. 骚动, 喧嚣",["On the day of my birthday, my friends made me drink and I caused quite an uproar.","The archbishop caused an uproar with his dismissive comments about the nuns' concerns."],["在我生日那天，朋友讓我喝酒，我大鬧一番。",""]],["din","din","n. 喧嚣\\nv. 絮絮不休地说, 喧闹",["Babur's full name was Zahir-ud-din Muhammad Babur.","There's a video of Tom dancing to \"Dragostea Din Tei\" by O-Zone."],["",""]],["migraine","'mi:^rein, 'mai-","n. 严重的周期性偏头痛\\n[医] 偏头痛",["His wife pushed him away, saying that her migraine had taken hold again.","His wife rebuffed him, saying that her migraine had returned."],["",""]],["observational",",ɔbzә'veiʃәnәl","a. 观察的, 观测的\\n[计] 观察的",["The documentary is purely observational and critics say it avoids being didactic, helping to broaden its appeal.","Brahe invented many instruments such as the Tyconian Quadrant which were widely copied and led to the invention of improved observational equipment."],["",""]],["jolly","'dʒɒli","a. 愉快的, 高兴的, 宜人的\\nvt. 恭维, 使高兴, 取笑\\nvi. 开玩笑\\nadv. 非常, 极为",["He was chubby and plump, a right jolly old elf, And I laughed when I saw him, in spite of myself.","Don't apologise for doing what you love to do. Saying no is a jolly for you."],["",""]],["burned","","burn的过去式和过去分词\\n[机] 焦化",["Before the firemen were able to arrive, both buildings burned down.","After he received the letter, he burned it without even reading it."],["消防員還沒有趕到，那兩幢大廈就已經燒成灰燼了。","他收到這封信後，讀也沒讀就把它燒了。"]],["manslaughter","'mænslɒ:tә","n. 杀人, 过失杀人罪",["Sami is not guilty of murder. He's instead guilty of manslaughter.","After a lengthy trial, the woman was sentenced to 5 years in prison for involuntary manslaughter."],["",""]],["candor","'kændә","n. 坦白, 直率",["He does not, in short, write with the candor of a man who is completely confident of his thesis.","I'm going to speak to you with utmost candor so I want you to take everything I'm about to say at face value."],["簡單來說，他的文筆並沒有流露出那種對自己的論文充滿信心的人應有的直率和坦誠。",""]],["cadmium","'kædmiәm","n. 镉\\n[化] 镉Cd",["Cadmium poisoning is a very common cause of death in the south.","Contaminants included arsenic, copper, cadmium, lead and other metals."],["",""]],["eel","i:l","n. 鳗鱼, 鳝鱼",["Holding an eel too fast is the way to let her escape.","The American eel, the European eel and the Japanese eel are endangered species."],["",""]],["uncontrollable",".ʌnkәn'trәulәbl","a. 无法控制的\\n[经] 不能控制的",["At last, as midnight approached and the street gradually cleared, he paced up and down the room in uncontrollable agitation.","If that's how matters stand, the next parliament will be uncontrollable."],["",""]],["caterpillar","'kætәpilә","n. 毛虫\\n[机] 履带车",["This caterpillar will become a beautiful butterfly.","The silk moth is a large moth whose caterpillar spins a cocoon used for silk production."],["",""]],["ply","plai","n. 厚度, 板层\\nvt. 使用, 使劲挥舞, 从事, 折, 弯\\nvi. 辛勤工作, 定期航行",["It made the world smaller, creating a shortcut for cargo ships that ply their trade from east and west.","He spake, 'twas done; and Palinurus first / turns the prow leftward: to the left we ply / with oars and sail, and shun the rocks accurst."],["",""]],["err","ә:","vi. 犯错, 做错, 犯罪\\n[法] 弄错, 犯错误, 陈述",["To err is human. To blame someone else for your mistakes is even more human.","To err is human, to forgive divine."],["是人都會犯錯。為你自己的錯誤指責別人，更是人類會做的事。","人皆有錯，唯聖者能恕。"]],["winged","wiŋd","a. 有翼的, 高速的, 迅速的, 飞行的, 翼受伤的",["I didn't prepare a presentation, so I just winged it.","Cicadas are 3-centimeter, winged insects that buzz loudly while seeking a mate."],["",""]],["arcane","ɑ:'kein","a. 神秘的, 晦涩难解的",["Nowadays, the fourteenth century's debate about the Eucharist sounds completely arcane.","The warm punch fuming in the icy air called to mind caldrons, witches, and arcane incantations."],["",""]],["covering","'kʌvәriŋ","n. 覆盖物, 掩蔽物\\na. 掩护的, 掩盖的\\n[计] 覆盖",["Women really are quite dangerous. The more I think about this, the more I'm able to understand the reasoning behind face covering.","My bonus doesn't come close to covering all the loan payments I have to make."],["女人真是太危险了。越想这一点越能理解蒙脸的道理。",""]],["renegade","'renigeid","n. 背教者, 变节者, 脱党者\\na. 背弃的, 脱离的, 叛徒的\\nvi. 背叛, 背弃, 脱离",["Any politician who does not toe the main party line would be branded a renegade.","Taiwan is a renegade province of China."],["",""]],["hoax","hәuks","vt. 欺骗, 哄骗, 愚弄\\nn. 愚弄人, 恶作剧",["My grandpa believes that the moon landing was a hoax.","Claiming that the COVID-19 pandemic is a hoax, Tom refuses to wear a mask."],["我的祖父相信登月是一個騙局。",""]],["prosthetic","prɔs'θetik","a. 修复术的, 弥补性的, 非朊基的\\n[医] 修复的, 假体的",["The young man has only one leg, and even that is prosthetic. He must use crutches or a wheelchair to get around.","There's nothing worse than a soulless person. After all, there's no such thing as a prosthetic soul."],["",""]],["gathered","'gaðəd","v. （使）聚集（ gather的过去式和过去分词 ）; 集合; 推断; 了解",["The boy gathered a handful of peanuts and put them in a small box.","Noted literary personalities gathered together last evening."],["男孩收集了一把花生，然後把它們放到了一個小箱子裏。","知名文学界人士昨晚齐聚一堂。"]],["aspen","'æspәn","n. 山杨\\na. 山杨的, 颤抖的",["If you walk amidst an aspen forest on a clear day, you will be treated to a fantastic light display.","Aspen also produce chlorophyll in their bark, allowing the tree to begin photosynthesizing before leaves have emerged."],["",""]],["newscast","'nju:zkɑ:st","n. 新闻广播",["The TV newscast informs us of daily news."],[""]],["personalized","","a. 个人化的；个性化的",["I bought a personalized toy for my friend's new baby.","We'll prepare a personalized insurance contract for you."],["",""]],["mouthful","'mauθful","n. 一口, 满口",["She gulped down half her tea in one mouthful.","A handful of soldiers is always better than a mouthful of arguments."],["她一口气喝下半杯多凉茶。",""]],["writhe","raið","n. 扭动, 盘绕, 苦恼\\nvt. 扭曲, 缠绕\\nvi. 蠕动, 扭动身体, 盘绕, 遭受苦难",["Alexandra was left to writhe on the floor.","Jessica made her girlfriend writhe and moan."],["",""]],["dredge","dredʒ","n. 挖泥机, 拖网\\nvt. 用挖泥机疏浚, (用船)采捞",["Dredging is a fishing method in which a dredge is dragged across the sea floor, either scraping or penetrating the bottom.","I don't want to dredge up the past."],["",""]],["axle","'æksl","n. 轴, 车轴\\n[电] 轴",["When I started to fix the language, I got wrapped around the axle.","The axle of the car wobbled and would soon cause further damage."],["",""]],["skirmish","'skә:miʃ","n. 前哨战, 小争论, 小冲突\\nvi. 发生小争论, 侦察",["He was involved in a skirmish with a violent gang.","There was a border skirmish. The road to the airport is blocked."],["",""]],["fluency","'flu:әnsi","n. 流畅, 雄辩, 善辩",["Fluency in English is a very marketable skill today.","I was amazed at the fluency with which the boy spoke French."],["流利的英語在今天是一種十分搶手的技能。","那個男孩的一口法語流利得有點兒不可置信。"]],["standardize","'stændәdaiz","vt. 使标准化, 使合于标准, 用标准检验\\n[计] 标准化; 规格化",["It's difficult to standardize language for a multi-ethnic nation."],[""]],["semblance","'semblәns","n. 外表, 伪装, 假象, 少量",["The figures at Madame Tussauds are very lifelike, and appear to have no semblance of waxiness to them.","There is not even a semblance of proof."],["",""]],["replete","ri'pli:t","a. 装满的, 充满的, 充实的, 吃饱的",["History is replete with the stories of unappreciated genius.","O Lord, who lends me life, lend me a heart replete with thankfulness."],["",""]],["junction","'dʒʌŋkʃәn","n. 连接, 会合处, 交叉点\\n[医] 接[合]处, 接点.[接]界",["The junction box allows you to store the camera's pigtail inside of it.","This junction is notorious for accidents."],["接線盒可以用來存放攝影機的尾線。","這個路口因頻繁的事故而臭名昭著。"]],["pesto","'pestәj","n. <美>[食](浇在面条或通心粉等上的)香蒜沙司,香蒜酱",["The diced courgette will be added to the pesto just before serving.","Remember to use the pesto sauce for the pasta today."],["",""]],["instil","in'stil","vt. 滴注, 逐渐灌输, 不断灌输\\n[医] 滴注",["Parents try to instil a sense of responsibility in their children."],[""]],["jostle","'dʒɒsl","n. 推挤, 冲撞\\nvi. 推挤, 冲撞\\nvt. 推, 挤, 煽动",["I'm watching Sami and Tom jostle for recognition as King of Tatoeba.","My friend and I were separated in the jostle of the surging crowd."],["",""]],["vanguard","'vængɑ:d","n. 前锋, 先锋, 先驱",["The Communist Party is the vanguard of the working class.","An army was divided into the vanguard, the rearguard and the main body."],["",""]],["primordial","prai'mɒ:diәl","a. 原始的, 自原始时代的\\n[医] 原始的",["We lay together and enjoyed the primordial delight.","Bennu is a primordial artifact preserved in the vacuum of space."],["",""]],["blunder","'blʌndә","n. 大错, 大失策\\nvi. 失策, 跌跌撞撞地走, 犯错\\nvt. 做错",["Don't worry about your blunder: it wasn't serious.","As a result of his carelessness, he made a serious blunder."],["",""]],["glint","glint","n. 闪光, 一闪\\nvi. 闪耀, 闪闪发光, 反射, 迅速移动\\nvt. 使发光, 使闪光",["She was a fine tall woman, black and quick and fierce, with a proud way of carrying her head, and a glint from her eye like a spark from a flint."],[""]],["allot","ә'lɒt","vt. 分配, 分摊指定\\n[经] (按股或按规定)分配, 配(拨)给, 规(派)定",["Let's see how much time they allot you."],[""]],["posh","pɒʃ","a. 豪华的, 漂亮的, 优雅的, 极好的\\ninterj. 呸",["I just can't stand him using his disgusting accent with all those bombastic words. He just sounds like some old posh guy to me.","She had a posh accent, a private education, and a wardrobe of preppy clothes."],["",""]],["eyelash","'ailæʃ","n. 睫毛\\n[医] 睫[毛]",["He sank the deal without batting an eyelash.","I hate it when I get an eyelash in my eye."],["",""]],["custard","'kʌstәd","n. 蛋奶糕\\n[化] 乳蛋糕",["The custard buns are sold out today.","I had some custard pudding for an afternoon snack."],["今天的奶黃包賣完了。",""]],["multidimensional",".mʌltidi'menʃәnl","a. 多面的, 多维的",["Entertainment on his planet meant doing multidimensional higher mathematics.","The alien is a small intelligent multidimensional parasite that attaches to the host's nervous system."],["",""]],["seaweed","'si:wi:d","n. 海草, 海藻\\n[医] 海藻",["The Sargasso Sea is a vast patch of ocean named for a genus of free-floating seaweed called Sargassum.","Some types of seaweed are edible and are low in fat and high in protein."],["馬尾藻海是一片廣闊的海域，因一種名為「馬尾藻」的自由漂浮海藻而得名。",""]],["thorny","'θɒ:ni","a. 多刺的, 令人苦恼的",["For giraffes, the thorny acacia leaves are a feast.","Tom brought up a very thorny subject during the barbecue."],["",""]],["memento","mi'mentәu","n. 纪念物, 令人回忆的东西",["This ring is a memento from grandma.","Tom gave me this necklace as a memento."],["",""]],["wisp","wisp","n. 小把, 小物体, 纤细的东西\\nvt. 把...卷成小把",["A solemn wisp of smoke rose from the shattered city.","Will-o'-the-wisp is the light phenomenon traditionally ascribed to ghosts."],["",""]],["blocking","'blɔkiŋ","[计] 组成块; 粘连\\n[化] 封闭",["I did not see much of her as there were too many people in front of me blocking the view.","Please move your car. You're blocking my driveway."],["",""]],["urn","ә:n","n. 瓮, 缸, 坟墓",["Grandmother's ashes are in an urn at the temple.","The children broke the ancient urn."],["祖母的骨灰在寺院的骨灰瓮里。",""]],["encase","in'keis","vt. 把...装入箱内, 包住",["Indeed, in hot weather it is important not to encase the ankles in heavy boots or leggings, as these would ensure overheating."],[""]],["computational",".kɒmpju'teiʃәnәl","a. 计算的",["He studies computational linguistics.","In order to study computational linguistics it's necessary to know various languages, however, one also has to be familiar with the use of computers."],["",""]],["configure","kәn'figә","vt. 装配, 使成形",["I need to configure this server with an appropriate firewall system."],["我该在这个服务器上设置一个防火墙。"]],["budgetary","'bʌdʒitәri","a. 预算的\\n[法] 预算的",["Algeria needs budgetary stability."],[""]],["cull","kʌl","vt. 采, 摘, 拣\\nn. 拣出的等外品, 被剔出的动物",["I breed betta fish and cull my unwanted stock by feeding them to my oscar.","There is no reason to cull pigs right now."],["",""]],["nutritionist","nju:'triʃәnist","n. 营养学家\\n[医] 营养学家",["Yet a leading researcher and nutritionist says the fad diets are doing more harm than good.","How can I find a registered dietitian or nutritionist?"],["",""]],["corrective","kә'rektiv","a. 纠正的, 改正的, 矫正的\\nn. 改善法, 矫正物",["You'd be surprised what strengthening your core and doing postural corrective exercises can do for your body.","Almost all patients require corrective eyewear after cataract surgery."],["",""]],["pornographic",".pɒ:nә'græfik","a. 淫秽作品的, 色情的\\n[法] 色情画的, 色情文字的",["Some insist that the Spanish hostel is a pornographic film.","Algerian Arabs veil their sisters and their wives but spend their time watching pornographic films."],["",""]],["elitist","ei'litist","n. 优秀人材, 杰出人材\\na. 优秀人材的, 杰出人材的",["The words \"elitist\" and \"elitism\" are often used by anti-intellectuals.","Criticizing something as being \"elitist\" is often a disguised form of anti-intellectualism."],["",""]],["pare","pєә","vt. 剥, 削, 消减",["Choose large apples of uniform size; pare, core and cook until tender in syrup.","Pare, core and quarter tart apples, stew until soft and beat smooth."],["",""]],["wacky","'wæki","a. 古怪的",["Tom's wacky hobby became a multimillion dollar empire.","Leave it to Tom to come up with these wacky ideas."],["",""]],["stripper","'stripә","n. 剥...的人, 刮毛器, 折卸器, 剥皮器, 露天矿矿工, 低产井, 枯竭井\\n[化] 汽提塔; 去漆药水",["Martha is a stripper. She dances around a pole and undresses for money.","I don't know if I should hire a stripper or a whore for my boyfriend."],["",""]],["linoleum","li'nәuliәm","n. 油地毡, 漆布\\n[化] 油毡; 亚麻油毡",["The parquetry linoleum is not only less costly than wood, but it is more sanitary and much easier to take care of.","A linoleum floor was very popular in postwar America."],["",""]],["clot","klɒt","n. 凝块, 一团\\nv. (使)凝结, (使)聚集",["A blood clot is good when it occurs on the skin and bad when it occurs within the body.","The surgeon removed the clot responsible for the vessel's occlusion."],["",""]],["muck","mʌk","n. 垃圾, 肥料\\nvt. 施肥, 弄脏, 弄糟\\nvi. 搬运矸石",["We're down in the pit, cleaning out the muck, and Tom goes traipsing by and waves.","Those heavy shoes will bring all the muck and dirt into the house."],["",""]],["nutritious","nju:'triʃәs","a. 滋养的, 营养的\\n[医] 有营养的",["Make the most nutritious thing the least expensive. That'll confuse them and then they'll buy the most profitable item.","Persimmons are highly nutritious and a great delicacy, but sometimes you get a sour one."],["",""]],["mismanagement","","n. 管理不善；处置失当",["It was mismanagement of the company's affairs by the acting director.","In Algeria, economic mismanagement led to rising prices."],["",""]],["choosing","","v. 选择；决定（choose的ing形式）",["It is a difficult task, choosing what is \"right\" or \"wrong\", but you have to do it.","Teaching is a profession of my own choosing."],["选择什么是“对”或“错”是一项艰难的任务，我们却必须要完成它。","教书是我自己选择的职业。"]],["filipino",".fili'pi:nәu","n. 菲律宾人",["Nerria, the Filipino wife of my white ex-neighbour Bruce, was an avid Roman Catholic.","The Filipino woman wanted to learn English so that one day she could emigrate to the Anglosphere."],["",""]],["marinate","'mærineit","vt. 用腌泡汁腌/泡(肉/鱼)",["Our shrimp is a traditional South Indian style shrimp, and we marinate it with turmeric, ginger, shallots and green chilies.","With what did you marinate the rollmops?"],["",""]],["kiosk","ki'ɒsk","n. 亭, 凉亭, 报摊",["Regina Anyango, owner of small food kiosk in Nairobi, uses ethanol fuel to prepare meals for customers. Her kitchen is free of fumes and smoke from charcoal use.","Before catching the bus, I always stop by the kiosk to buy some licorice."],["雷吉娜安揚戈是奈洛比一家小吃攤的老闆，她用乙醇燃料為顧客準備餐點。她的廚房沒有木炭產生的煙霧與廢氣。",""]],["magically","","adv. 用魔法地；如魔法般地",["He wished that a bowl of peanut soup would magically appear before him.","The rich make money magically and are therefore worthless parasites."],["",""]],["increment","'inkrimәnt","n. 增加, 增值, 盈余\\n[计] 增量",["Every time you go through the cycle, you increment the counter by one.","The small increment made no impact on the projection."],["",""]],["angst","æŋst","n. 焦虑, 疑惧\\n[医] 恐怖",["Angst is the fear of our own incapacity for peace.","Tom and Mary went to see \"Environmental Noise\" live in concert. It was just a jackhammer and some angst-ridden crows."],["",""]],["heterogeneous",".hetәrәu'dʒi:njәs","a. 异种的, 异质的, 由不同成分形成的\\n[医] 不均匀的, 多相的, 异质的",["Tatoeba's corpus is heterogeneous in many dimensions.","Without an emulsifier to keep them from separating, oil and water always return to a heterogeneous mixture."],["",""]],["wiry","'waiәri","a. 金属线制的, 瘦长结实的\\n[医] 弦样的(指脉搏)",["Being a wiry person, he is thin but still looks strong.","Holmes had sent on a wire, so that Lestrade, as wiry, as dapper, and as ferret-like as ever, was waiting for us at the station."],["",""]],["geneticist","dʒi'netisist","n. 遗传学家\\n[医] 遗传学家",["Neil Gemmell, a geneticist from the University of Otago in New Zealand, led the study that tried to catalog all living species in the lake by extracting DNA from water samples.","I wanted to be a geneticist for a while after Jurassic Park was made into a movie."],["紐西蘭奧塔哥大學的遺傳學家尼爾杰梅爾領導了這項研究，試圖透過從水樣本中提取 DNA 來對湖泊中所有生物物種進行編目。",""]],["behemoth","bi'hi:mɔθ","n. 庞然大物",["Algeria is a colossal behemoth to be reckoned with in the Mediterranean region.","China transformed from a poor country into an industrial behemoth."],["",""]],["mull","mʌl","n. 软薄布, 混乱\\nvt. 研磨, 细想\\nvi. 深思熟虑",["I need time to mull things over before I decide what to do.","This gives the subconscious mind a chance to mull over the original problem."],["",""]],["abate","ә'beit","vt. 减少, 减轻, 减弱, 废除, 打折扣\\nvi. 减轻, 减弱, 减少, 失效, 被废除",["The storm didn't abate for several hours.","This action would not have been sufficient to abate the odor nuisance."],["风暴几个小时没有减弱了。",""]],["nah","nɑ:","a. 没有；很少, 很小",["\"You should write a novel or something.\" \"Nah, I don't think so. I can't see myself coming up with anything good, anyways.\"","\"Have you been here before?\" \"Nah, this is my first time.\""],["",""]],["secluded","si'klu:did","a. 隐退的, 隐蔽的",["Tom told me he wanted to live on a secluded beach.","Tom used his secluded cabin in the woods as a getaway from his hectic life as a company director."],["",""]],["veritable","'veritәbl","a. 名副其实的, 真实的, 确实的, 真的",["Paganini dazzled his audience with (among other things) a veritable hailstorm of left-handed pizzicatos.","Paper is, therefore, a veritable miracle created by man."],["",""]],["inconceivable",".inkәn'si:vәbl","a. 不能想象的, 想不到的, 难信的",["It is inconceivable to me that he would do such a thing.","A few years ago it would have been inconceivable for Japan to send troops overseas."],["我不能想象他会做这种事。",""]],["dole","dәul","n. 救济品, 失业救济金\\nvt. 发放救济",["Tom has been on the dole since the 6th of August when he lost his job.","It should be noted that Dole did not intend to change the configuration of the communication protocol."],["Tom從八月六號他失業那天，開始領失業救濟金。",""]],["expatriate","eks'peitrieit","n. 移居国外者, 侨民, 被流放者, 背井离乡者\\nvt. 逐出国外, 脱离国籍, 放逐\\nvi. 移居国外",["Tom is an expatriate."],[""]],["nascent","'næsnt","a. 发生中的, 开始存在的, 初期的\\n[医] 初发的, 初生的",["Critics were right to point out that the politician led a nascent fascist movement.","The nascent VR industry is still having trouble breaking into the mainstream."],["",""]],["infuriate","in'fjuәrieit","a. 狂怒的\\nvt. 激怒",["In a packed bus, it would infuriate me to miss my stop on account of other passengers.","Sami's behavior started to infuriate Layla."],["",""]],["electrician",".ilek'triʃәn","n. 电学家, 电气技师, 电工\\n[化] 电工; 电气工人",["Next week the electrician is coming to fix the wires.","You don't need an electrician to change a light bulb."],["",""]],["sheltered","","a. 受庇护的, 受保护的",["These flowers should be sheltered from the rain.","They were, in fact, sheltered, but they had ceased to remember it."],["應該為這些花遮擋風雨。",""]],["mecca","'mekә","n. 麦加",["Istanbul, Turkey, has become the new Mecca of medical tourism.","Jerusalem is the third holy city in Islam, following Mecca and Medina."],["",""]],["minuscule","'minәskju:l","n. 小书写体, 小写字\\na. 用小书写体的, 小写字的",["The amount of arsenic in the water is minuscule but significant.","The tree is much too large for Ziri's minuscule axe."],["",""]],["alibi","'ælibai","n. 不在犯罪现场, 托辞\\nv. 为...辩解",["Tom doesn't have an airtight alibi.","The police are suspicious of my alibi."],["湯姆沒有無懈可擊的不在場證明。","警察覺得我的不在場證明可疑。"]],["crazed","kreizd","a. 癫狂的；疯狂的",["The man, as the story goes, was so crazed with fear that he could scarce speak, but at last he said that he had indeed seen the unhappy maiden, with the hounds upon her track.","Gunter heard a crazed howling outside."],["",""]],["fanfare","'fænfєә","n. 喇叭边(或号角)嘹亮吹奏声, 吹牛",["He came on board this company with a lot of fanfare and he turns out to have the skill and talent to live up to it.","In Mexico, most small towns have a patron saint whose feast day is celebrated with great fanfare."],["",""]],["sprinkler","'spriŋklә","n. 洒水车, 洒水器",["The sprinkler is shooting out a stream of water onto the grass.","I thought that this building had a sprinkler system."],["",""]],["cardiologist","","n. 心脏病学家\\n[医] 心[脏]病学家",["I'll refer you to a cardiologist for further evaluation.","Tom's doctor referred him to a cardiologist."],["",""]],["chemically","'kemikli","adv. 用化学, 以化学方法",["Acids react chemically with metals.","When matter is changed chemically, chemical energy is given off."],["酸会和金属物质起化学反应。",""]],["hooker","'hukә","n. 用钩子的人, 渔船",["You can't find a job if you're dressed like a hooker.","We've reached the point where a street hooker is explaining how to make something of yourself!"],["",""]],["mainstay","'meinstei","n. 主桅支索, 支柱, 中流砥柱",["Food production is a mainstay of the country's economy.","Tourism is the mainstay of the economy and depends on conditions in the euro-zone countries."],["",""]],["psychotic","sai'kɒtik","a. 精神病的\\nn. 精神病患者",["After experiencing several acute psychotic episodes, Mary was admitted to a mental institution.","I think we need to challenge the stigma around schizophrenia and other psychotic disorders."],["",""]],["tropics","","n. 热带地区",["The open doors of the greenhouse let in the smells of the greenery and the scents of the tropics.","There are only two seasons in the tropics."],["",""]],["caper","'keipә","n. 跳跃\\nvi. 雀跃, 蹦跳",["The book brings back hardboiled detective Tom Jackson for another caper involving drugs, murder, and intrigue."],[""]],["polyester",".pɒli'estә","n. 聚酯\\n[化] 聚酯",["Blood splatter was found on Tom's polyester leisure suit, convicting him of the crime.","This lovely blouse is made of polyester and cotton."],["",""]],["observance","әb'zә:vәns","n. 观察, 遵守, 仪式, 风俗习惯\\n[法] 遵守, 奉行, 惯例",["It is a custom more honored in the breach than the observance.","Thou shalt keep this observance at the set time from days to days."],["",""]],["rotting","'rɔtiŋ","vt. 深蚀刻；腐败, 腐坏之（rot的现在分词形式）",["I can only describe the terrible smell as vomit mixed with rotting flesh.","The stench of rotting flesh overwhelmed us as we entered the room."],["我只能描述这可怕的味道像呕吐物混合着烂肉。",""]],["deafening","'defәniŋ","a. 震耳欲聋的",["The dinosaur continued to roar at a deafening volume.","With a deafening roar, the rocket was hurled into space."],["",""]],["molten","'mәultәn","a. 熔化的, 炽热的, 铸造的\\nmelt的过去分词",["Tom is a solid and determined man, but sometimes he's as impetuous as a river of molten lava.","The crane accidentally dropped the pot of molten metal."],["",""]],["scuba","'skju:bә","n. 自携式水中呼吸器",["I didn't know William was into scuba diving. He's explored some amazing underwater worlds.","This year, Carlos wants to learn how to scuba dive."],["",""]],["evolving","","a. 展开的；进化的",["If human nature is evolving, it's not much faster than the geological profile of the Earth.","New Berber words appear every single day and the language is rapidly evolving."],["",""]],["prick","prik","vt. 刺, 戳, 刺痛, 使竖起\\nvi. 刺, 竖起\\nn. 扎, 一刺, 刺痛\\na. 竖起的",["It's alright. This injection won't hurt. It will just prick a little.","As the boat sailed on westwards, the captain looked back at how far they had come, and felt a tear prick the corner of his eye."],["没关系的，这个针不痛的，就只有一点点刺痛感。",""]],["preface","'prefis","n. 序, 绪言, 前言\\nvi. 作序, 写前言\\nvt. 给...作序, 以...开始",["The text of the Preface to the First Edition follows unchanged in substance.","People will accept your idea much more readily if you preface it by telling them that Benjamin Franklin said it first."],["",""]],["asking","'ɑ:skiŋ","n. 请求",["Tom has no intention of asking Mary to the upcoming dance.","After searching and asking around, they still couldn't find a suitable place."],["Tom没有意图去邀请Mary去即将来临的舞会。","他們四處找來找去，但就是找不到合適的地方。"]],["colonize","'kɒlәnaiz","vi. 开拓殖民地\\nvt. 殖民于, 移植于",["When the French came in to colonize Algeria, they came in hard.","Maybe, humanity's machine children will explore and colonize outer space. The future may be postbiological."],["",""]],["impromptu","im'prɒmptju:","n. 即席演出, 即兴曲\\na. 即席的\\nadv. 即席",["A musician friend of mine gave an impromptu performance of a piece he had just finished composing.","It usually takes me more than three weeks to prepare a good impromptu speech."],["",""]],["repertory","'repәtәri","n. 仓库, 库存, 储备, 保留剧目轮演",["But his command of the concert repertory and the required technique is astonishing.","The lawyer drew upon a repertory of juridical precedents to strengthen her argument."],["",""]],["beep","bi:p","n. 短而尖的声音, 嘟\\nv. 嘟嘟响",["Please leave a message after the beep or drop some candies in our mailbox.","A terribly loud beep resounded - the microphone produced feedback."],["",""]],["unquestionably","","adv. 毫无疑问, 不成问题, 无可非议, 确实",["He is unquestionably the oldest man in the village.","The sway of alcohol over mankind is unquestionably due to its power to stimulate the mystical faculties of human nature."],["",""]],["biographical","baiәu'græfikәl","a. 传记的",["He wrote a biographical sketch of George Washington.","Oleg watched a Japanese biographical film."],["",""]],["borrowed","'bɒrәud","a. 借来的, 伪造的, 虚构的",["I returned the books I borrowed from the library, and I borrowed some new ones.","I just want you to give me back that book you borrowed a few days ago."],["我还了从图书馆借的书，又借了些新的。","我只是想要你把我前些日子借给你的书还回来。"]],["deduce","di'dju:s","vt. 推论, 演绎出\\n[法] 推断, 推出, 演绎",["Sherlock Holmes could deduce much out of the smallest details.","We began to see what we can deduce from it."],["",""]],["retardation",".ri:tɑ:'deiʃәn","n. 迟延, 妨碍, 阻止\\n[化] 缓聚作用",["The study found evidence that iron deficiency can lower intelligence test scores by five to seven points, and a lack of iodine in pregnancy causes as many as 20 million babies a year to be born with mental retardation."],[""]],["bribery","'braibәri","n. 贿赂行为, 行贿, 受贿\\n[经] 行贿, 受贿",["My name is not on any bribery lists, nor am I a suspect of any crime against the common good.","The bribery scandal cast doubts on the government."],["",""]],["postage","'pәustidʒ","n. 邮资\\n[经] 邮费, 邮资",["You have bought more postage stamps than are necessary.","You're the one taking the time and buying the postage."],["",""]],["constitutionally",",kɔnsti'tju:ʃәnәli","adv. 本质地, 天生, 体质上",["I am constitutionally averse to getting carried away with feelings."],[""]],["shipyard","'ʃipjɑ:d","n. 造船厂\\n[经] 船坞, 造船厂, 修船厂",["That ship was towed into the shipyard for refitting.","That ship was towed into the shipyard for refurbishment."],["",""]],["implied","'implaid","a. 暗指的, 含蓄的\\n[经] 暗指的, 含蓄的",["His reply implied a criticism of our work.","\"Once is like never,\" implied the young lady. Yet the gynecologist implied: \"twins.\""],["他的回答暗含着对我们工作的批评。","\"一次就像是從未有，\" 年輕的姑娘暗示。然而，婦科醫生暗示：\"雙胞胎。\""]],["pamper","'pæmpә","vt. 放纵, 使吃饱, 使过量",["I'm no longer the little child that you need to pamper all the time.","The reason they're so selfish is that you pamper them so much."],["",""]],["tortoise","'tɒ:tәs","n. 龟, 行动迟缓的人",["The hare was outdistanced by the tortoise.","The hare was overtaken by the tortoise."],["野兔被烏龜拋了在後頭。","野兔被烏龜拋了在後頭。"]],["stereotypical",",steriə'tipikl","a. 典型的; 带有成见的",["Ugh, it's so stereotypical of you to assume I'd be the one to do this kind of work.","Stereotypical beliefs about femininity hinder women's empowerment and limit their opportunities for growth."],["",""]],["unrestricted",".ʌnri'striktid","a. 无限制的",["It's not healthy for children to have unrestricted access to the Internet.","Congress wants to vote for broad, general and unrestricted impunity for its members."],["",""]],["politicize","pә'litisaiz","vi. 搞政治\\nvt. 使具有政治性",["Changing the Senate rules now will only further politicize the Supreme Court.","Republicans are dropping like flies because they've decided to politicize a pandemic."],["",""]],["levy","'levi","n. 税款, 所征的人数, 征收\\nvi. 征税, 课税\\nvt. 征收, 强求, 召集",["The airport improvement levy seems higher than last year.","The king believed it would be more fitting to levy a tax that was lower than usual."],["",""]],["piston","'pistәn","n. 活塞, 活塞阀键\\n[医] 活塞(如注射器的)",["The piston does not come into contact with the cylinder cover.","The settling of piston rings into a cylinder's wall is the goal of modern engine break-ins."],["这个活塞不接触汽缸盖。",""]],["battleship","'bætlʃip","n. 战列舰, 主力舰",["It took many torpedo hits to send the battleship Bismarck to Davy Jones's locker.","The battleship did not dare come within range of the coastal batteries."],["",""]],["sonic","'sɒnik","a. 音波的, 音速的, 声音的\\n[电] 音波",["Sonic toothbrushes may clean teeth better, but they use electricity.","When aircraft break the sound barrier, this causes the so-called sonic boom."],["",""]],["reformed","ri'fɒ:md","a. 改革过的, 改革派的",["It is the educational system that needs to be reformed in this area.","While Islam remains not reformed, we neither can nor want to accept it in Europe."],["",""]],["forcibly","'fɒ:sәbli","adv. 强制地, 用力地",["The rioters were forcibly removed from the plaza.","The efforts to forcibly introduce the values of the so-called civilized world are excessive."],["广场的暴徒被强制驱离。",""]],["procure","prәu'kjuә","vt. 获得, 取得, 导致\\nvi. 拉皮条",["This decision was a self-serving measure designed to procure immunity from prosecution.","\"How can I procure an endless supply of nachos?\" thought Tom out loud on the bus ride to Paris."],["",""]],["muffle","'mʌfl","n. 低沉的声音, 拳击手套, 唇鼻部, 围巾, 头巾\\nvt. 围裹, 抑制, 发低沉的声音",["Sami used a pillow to muffle the sound of his gun.","Yanni tried to muffle Skura's scream."],["",""]],["inefficiency",".ini'fiʃәnsi","n. 无效率, 无能\\n[化] 效率低; 效率差",["Algeria is known for its bureaucracy and inefficiency.","Algerians are tired of bureaucracy and inefficiency."],["",""]],["brooding","'bru:diŋ","a. 沉思的；徘徊不去的",["I was in my room, brooding over the missed opportunity.","You are not brooding and existing in your own head."],["",""]],["nocturnal","nɒk'tә:nәl","a. 夜的, 夜曲的\\n[医] 夜间的",["Ziri is addicted to nocturnal hikes in the nearby woods.","Kiwi are mostly nocturnal and have a refined sense of smell uncommon in birds."],["",""]],["inherited","in'heritid","a. 遗传的；继承权的；通过继承得到的",["Anna's striking almond-shaped eyes, inherited from her Asian lineage, exude a captivating depth and a hint of mystery.","Dan didn't want to be taxed on the land he inherited from his mother."],["安娜引人注目的杏仁狀眼睛繼承了她的亞洲血統，散發著迷人的深度和一絲神秘感。",""]],["lull","lʌl","n. 暂停, 间歇, 稍息, 使人安静的东西\\nvt. 使平静, 哄骗, 使安静\\nvi. 变平静",["There was a lull in the festivities as Fred was carted off to the infirmary by the emergency medical technicians.","Because of the lull in the wind, we couldn't fly the kite."],["",""]],["misgiving","mis'^iviŋ","n. 疑虑, 不安, 害怕, 担扰, 疑惧",["Happy days of childish credulity, when fact and fiction were swallowed alike without a misgiving!"],[""]],["stubbornly","","adv. 倔强地；顽固地",["The man held on to his job stubbornly and would not retire.","Millions of people in the world still stubbornly believe that the Earth is flat."],["",""]],["geek","gi:k","n. 做低级滑稽表演的人",["Tatoeba: As if the geek invasion wasn't enough."],["Tatoeba:好像怪客入侵還不夠似的。"]],["waffle","'wɒfl","vi. 胡扯, 闲聊\\nn. 华夫饼干, 胡扯\\n[计] Waffle程序",["I recommend giving it to them straight, don't waffle your way around the subject.","He doled out the waffle batter with a large soup spoon."],["",""]],["estuary","'estjuәri","n. 河口, 港湾",["The conservationist is against the building of a tidal barrage across the Severn estuary.","Because of tides, the water levels in an estuary are going up and down several times a day."],["",""]],["blackboard","'blækbɒ:d","n. 黑板",["Hey, sir, the function on the blackboard is not exponential, but trigonometric.","Compare your sentence with the one on the blackboard."],["老師，黑板上的函數不是指數函數，是三角函數。","比較一下你寫的句子和黑板上的句子。"]],["cultivated","'kʌltiveitid","a. 耕耘的, 栽植的, 有教养的",["Good habits should be cultivated in childhood.","Because of the difference in climate, the same crop is not cultivated in both the northern and the eastern parts of the country."],["好习惯是从小养成的。",""]],["tote","tәut","vt. 提, 负, 携带, 加, 合计\\nn. 负担, 携带",["I hate going shopping because you always make me tote around everything you buy.","Do you want a reconditioned or a remanufactured tote ?"],["",""]],["stout","staut","a. 结实的；矮胖的；勇敢的；激烈的\\nn. 矮胖子；烈性啤酒",["Far better is it to have a stout heart always, and suffer one's share of evils, than to be ever fearing what may happen.","The other was about fifteen years younger, short, stout, ruddy-faced, and red-haired, with an open, resolute, and cheerful eye."],["",""]],["archival","ɑ: 'kaivәl","a. 档案的, 档案中的",["In an archival interview, he was careful not to overrate his success or appear arrogant."],[""]],["dermatologist",".dә:mә'tɒlәdʒist","n. 皮肤学者, 皮肤科医生\\n[医] 皮肤病学家, 皮肤科医师",["She married a successful dermatologist.","I didn't know that Tom was a dermatologist."],["",""]],["gouge","gaudʒ","n. 圆凿, 用圆凿凿成的槽, 挖, 掘\\nvt. 用圆凿削, 挖出, 欺骗",["I will cut off his tongue and gouge out his eyes!"],[""]],["funk","fʌŋk","n. 怯懦, 恐惧, 臭味\\nvt. 畏缩, 害怕, 使闻到臭味\\nvi. 惊恐, 发出臭味",["This song samples a bunch of old American funk records from the 70s using equipment from the 90s.","This is the gladdest I've seen him since his mother died. He'd been in a funk for so long and, God, I was so worried about him."],["",""]],["steamer","'sti:mә","n. 汽船, 蒸汽机\\n[化] 蒸汽发生器; 蒸汽机",["As luck would have it, a steamer passed by and they were saved.","Tell me how you will take the steamer from Mwanza to Bukoba."],["",""]],["doubly","'dʌbli","adv. 加倍地, 双重地\\n[计] 双地",["I'm doubly disappointed on the lack of improvement from my team.","My Greek-Cypriot neighbour Nikki has a double K in her name. I try not to pronounce it doubly as in Italian."],["",""]],["dripping","'dripiŋ","n. 滴, 滴下物, 水滴",["The sweat was dripping off my brow.","The faucet in the kitchen is dripping."],["汗水從我的額頭上落下。","廚房裡的水龍頭在漏水。"]],["monoxide","mɒ'nɒksaid","n. 一氧化物\\n[医] 一氧化物",["Carbon monoxide is a poisonous substance formed by the incomplete combustion of carbon compounds.","Dihydrogen monoxide is the overly technical term for water."],["",""]],["pendant","'pendәnt","n. 垂饰, 下垂物, 补充的东西, 补编\\n[电] 垂环",["Ziri put a picture of the family inside the pendant.","We installed pendant lights above the kitchen island."],["",""]],["crumpled","","a. 弄皱了的, 被扭弯的, 弯曲的\\n[建] 皱的, 起皱纹的, 盘曲的",["The floor was strewn with party favors: torn noisemakers, crumpled party hats, and dirty Power Ranger plates.","Tom took the letter, crumpled it and put it in his pocket."],["",""]],["vehemently","'vi:əməntlɪ","adv. 激烈地; 暴烈地; 强烈地; 热烈地",["I am vehemently opposed to all dictatorships, whether of the proletariat or otherwise.","He is an extremely liberal politician who vehemently attacks everybody who thinks differently."],["",""]],["climatic","klai'mætik","a. 气候的",["Global climatic changes may have been responsible for the extinction of the dinosaurs.","Environmental pollution triggered climatic changes all over Earth."],["",""]],["cashmere","'kæʃmiә","n. 开士米, 山羊绒\\n[化] 山羊绒; 开斯米绒",["Most westerner's cultural horizons end with Led Zepplin's Cashmere song.","If a neck-muffler is worn, it should be of cashmere, not of silk."],["",""]],["circumstantial",".sә:kәm'stænʃәl","a. 依照情况的",["Circumstantial evidence backed by a confession that checks on all the angles is about all any jury needs to be convinced of guilt.","For circumstantial evidence, that's plenty."],["",""]],["radiator","'reidieitә","n. 暖气装置, 散热器, 辐射体\\n[化] 散热器",["Install properly the fans and radiator in your computer case.","It was Tom who put his socks on the radiator to dry."],["",""]],["ace","eis","n. 幺点, 好手, 少许, 发球得分\\na. 一流的, 杰出的\\n[计] 应答允许, 自适应计算机试验, 自动呼叫设备, 自动执行控制",["She was within an ace of saying \"I don't know\".","According to my headcanon, Luke Skywalker is a gay ace."],["她差點要說「我不知道」了。",""]],["skylight","'skailait","n. 天窗",["Light penetrated the room only through a skylight.","Skylight glazing and automobile windshields typically use laminated glass."],["",""]],["flaunt","flaunt","n. 炫耀, 飘扬\\nv. 炫耀, 飘扬",["Dennis Hall, an American Greco Roman wrestler understands why this is not the time to flaunt victories."],[""]],["dislodge","dis'lɒdʒ","vt. 逐出, 使移动, 驱逐\\nvi. 离开原位",["The blow of the hammer was enough to dislodge the loose brick.","Storms and large weather events, like the El Nino, can tear and dislodge the kelp, leaving a tattered winter forest to begin its growth again each spring."],["",""]],["haste","heist","n. 匆忙, 急忙",["Being written in great haste, this letter has quite a few mistakes.","Having been written in haste, the book has a lot of errors."],["這封信是十分匆匆忙忙地寫的，所以有不少筆誤。","這本書是匆匆忙忙地寫的，所以有很多謬誤。"]],["consolidated","kәn'sɔlideitid","a. 整理过的；巩固的；统一的",["The two banks consolidated and formed a single large bank.","The following table shows our consolidated statements of operations for the years indicated."],["",""]],["impulsive","im'pʌlsiv","a. 冲动的, 受感情驱使的, 任性的\\n[医] 冲动的",["Impulsive people are more prone to procrastination.","Tom doesn't seem to be as impulsive as Mary seems to be."],["",""]],["broadband","'brɔ:dbænd","[计] 宽带",["There are big differences in broadband speed and quality from country to country.","\"It's very difficult to operate a business without reliable broadband,\" Allman says."],["",""]],["darkly","'dɑ:kli","adv. 暗, 黑, 呈黑",["The choroid is a highly vascularised, darkly pigmented layer found in between the retina and the sclera of the eye.","The choroid is darkly pigmented to fully absorb the light passing through the retina, so as to avoid internal reflection which would lead to blurry vision."],["",""]],["subsidized","ˈsʌbsidaizd","v. 给…津贴或补贴, 资助或补助…( subsidize的过去式和过去分词 )",["Corn is the most highly subsidized crop in America.","Corn is the most highly subsidized crop in the United States."],["",""]],["payout","'pei'aut","n. 支出, 付出款项\\n[经] 付出款项, 花费, 支出",["Layla used what was left of her husband's insurance payout to buy a house in Cairo.","Sami received an insurance payout of sixteen thousand dollars."],["",""]],["beset","bi'set","vt. 围绕, 使苦恼, 镶嵌",["Although the catastrophe which beset us was foreseeable, no one did anything to prevent it before it occurred.","But before they went to bed, the men of the city beset the house, both young and old, all the people together."],["",""]],["philharmonic",".filɑ:'mɒnik","a. 爱好音乐的, 交响乐团的, 爱乐团体的\\nn. 音乐爱好者, 音乐协会, 音乐会, 交响乐团",["The Elbe Philharmonic Hall is a symbol of HafenCity, a new quarter of the German city Hamburg.","The Berliner Philharmonie is a concert hall in Berlin home to the Berlin Philharmonic."],["",""]],["smuggling","","n. 走私\\n[经] 走私",["The police arrested him for smuggling.","I heard that Tom had been smuggling drugs into America for years before he got caught."],["警察以走私爲由逮捕了他。",""]],["overture","'әuvә.tʃuә","n. 主动表示, 事件的开端, 序言, 提议, 提案, 初步交涉\\nvt. 提议, 为...奏前奏曲",["A majority of two thirds is required to ratify an overture.","The overture contains all of the main themes."],["",""]],["fascism","'fæʃizm","n. 法西斯主义, 极端国家主义",["You can't equate nationalism with fascism.","The Americans don't accept Fascism any more than they do Communism."],["你不能將民族主義與法西斯混為一談。",""]],["unregulated","","a. 未经调节的；未校准的",["Holistic medicine is largely unregulated so has a greater share of quacks.","But he believes N-REL's efforts can make wind power competitive in America's more unregulated energy marketplace."],["",""]],["spade","speid","n. 铲子, 锄, 铲刀, 黑桃\\nvt. 以锄掘, 把...弄实抹平\\nvi. 铲",["He is the type of a person who calls a spade a spade.","Tom is the kind of person who calls a spade a spade and a lot of people don't like that."],["",""]],["guarded","'gɑ:did","a. 被防护着的, 被监视着的, 警戒着的",["Actually I wanted to be a damsel in a tower guarded by seven dragons, and then a prince on a white horse would chop off the dragons' heads and liberate me.","This is one of Boston's most closely guarded secrets."],["其實我想做一個被關在高塔裏的少女，然後有一天，就會有一個白馬王子出現，把守衛著高塔的七條龍通通殺掉，救我出來。",""]],["intercom","'intәkɔm","n. 内部通信联络系统, 内部通话系统\\n[计] 内部通信",["Tom leaned out the window of his car and pressed the button on the intercom at the gate.","We asked him over the intercom if he could come downstairs quickly."],["",""]],["minimally","","adv. 最低限度地；最低程度地",["Thanks to modern medical methods, today someone can be operated on with minimally invasive processes.","Newly developed, IT-based, minimally invasive surgery techniques are currently gaining momentum, thereby revolutionizing healthcare in its entirety."],["",""]],["nozzle","'nɒzl","n. 管口, 喷嘴\\n[化] 喷口",["No spray is coming out because the nozzle is clogged.","Laura turned the spray-nozzle of the hosepipe upon the tin roof and against the side of the house."],["",""]],["slant","slænt","n. 倾斜, 斜面, 观点, 偏见, 歪曲\\na. 倾斜的\\nv. (使)倾斜",["The paper's editorial staff traditionally has had a conservative slant.","This newspaper has no political slant."],["",""]],["dislocation","dislou'keiʃәn","n. 脱臼, 转位, 混乱\\n[化] 位错; 转位",["Tom has a posterior hip dislocation."],[""]],["armenian","ɑ:'mi:njәn","a. 亚美尼亚的, 亚美尼亚人的\\nn. 亚美尼亚人, 亚美尼亚语",["Armenian is an Indo-European language.","Armenia is called \"Hayastan\" in Armenian."],["亚美尼亚语是一门印欧语言。","亚美尼亚在亚美尼亚语中是”哈亚斯坦“。"]],["chide","tʃaid","v. 斥责, 责骂",["Birds in their little nests agree; And 'tis a shameful sight, When children of one family Fall out and chide and fight.","Soon as our ships can trust the deep once more, / and South-winds chide, and Ocean smiles serene, / we crowd the beach, and launch, and town and shore / fade from our view."],["",""]],["jock","dʒɔk","n. 苏格兰高原地方的士兵；[美俚]（大学）运动员；乔克（男子名）",["Many people mindlessly agree with whatever a shock jock says.","I played sports to fit in, and because of this, a lot of people saw me as a jock."],["",""]],["musically","'mju:zikli","adv. 音乐上",["He is very talented musically, able to play at least 5 instruments.","He is just musically gifted. He mastered the guitar in one year at the age of 15."],["",""]],["acknowledgement","әk'nɒlidʒmәnt","n. 承认, 确认, 感谢, 收到的通知\\n[计] 确认; 肯定",["The company gave him a gold watch in acknowledgement of his services.","The only honest form of acknowledgement in Germany is envy."],["",""]],["adventurer","әd'ventʃәrә","n. 冒险家, 投机者\\n[法] 冒险者, 投机者",["Khaki shorts with cargo pockets do not make you an adventurer.","The adventurer grabbed his Uzi and set out to find the man responsible for stealing 12 million Mexican euros."],["單有卡其褲，還成不了冒險家。",""]],["debtor","'detә","n. 债务人, 借主, 借方\\n[法] 负债者, 债务人, 借方",["A debtor of my debtor is not a debtor of mine."],[""]],["banned","","a. 被禁的",["Then they displayed all the book titles publicly and banned their sale forever.","He was banned from practising medicine."],["然後又把各書名揭示通衢，永遠禁止販賣。","他被禁止行医。"]],["leisurely","'li:ʒәli","a. 悠闲的, 从容的\\nadv. 从容地, 悠闲地",["I have come to realize that China is developing quickly but the Chinese people live a relatively leisurely life.","No matter how fierce the winds blow or the waves crash, it feels as effortless as strolling leisurely in a quiet courtyard."],["我意識到了中國正在快速地發展，但是相對而言中國人卻過著悠閒的生活。","不管风吹浪打，胜似闲庭信步。"]],["honored","","a. 已承兑或付款的；受尊敬的",["Throughout Heaven and Earth, I alone am the honored one.","It is a custom more honored in the breach than the observance."],["天上天下，唯我獨尊。",""]],["fore","fɒ:","a. 在前的, 以前的\\nadv. 在前面, 在船头\\nprep. 在...前",["Mike entered the fore of the plane, but his seat was located in the final row at the aft of the plane.","Starboard is the right-hand side of a ship as seen from aft to fore. The left-hand side is port."],["",""]],["mater","'meitә","n. 母亲\\n[医] 脑[脊]膜",["A class reunion was organized to raise funds for our alma mater.","Tom works in the registrar's office of his alma mater."],["",""]],["uncontrolled",".ʌnkәn'trәuld","a. 不受抑制的, 不受控制的, 自由的",["If the demolition of buildings is uncontrolled, a fine city is in danger of becoming nothing more than a concrete jungle.","Uncontrolled, these forces may be dangerous and destructive, but once mastered they can be bent to man's will and desire."],["",""]],["mummy","'mʌmi","n. 木乃伊, 瘦而干瘪之人, 妈咪\\n[医] 干尸, 木乃伊; 普鲁士红",["Mummy has to do the washing this afternoon.","Mummy, who's terrified of mice, had two fears to cope with."],["妈妈下午要洗衣服。",""]],["pathological",",pæθә'lɔdʒikәl","a. 病理学的, 由疾病引起的, (非正式)不合理的, 仅由想象引起的, 不理智的\\n[计] 错误的",["One of the symptoms of schizophrenia is pathological attention to detail, so I feel comforted when I forget a few commas.","Ziri's abandonment issues have reached a pathological level."],["",""]],["apex","'eipeks","n. 顶, 尖端, 最高潮\\n[医] 尖, 尖端",["The polar bear is the apex predator of the Arctic.","In Tasmania, thylacines were the only marsupial apex predators."],["",""]],["liturgical","li'tә:dʒikl","a. 礼拜仪式的",["Easter is the most important day in the Christian liturgical calendar and celebrates the resurrection of Jesus."],[""]],["juniper","'dʒu:nipә","n. 杜松属\\n[医] 杜松[实]",["My favorite dish is wild boar with juniper berries.","But the juniper and bay tree yield berries; the pine, pine cones, the oak acorns and Galls."],["",""]],["dispatcher","dis'pætʃә","n. 发送者, 配车员, 调度员\\n[计] 调度程序; 调度器",["Jane radioed the dispatcher for backup.","Tom has been working as a dispatcher."],["",""]],["wastewater","'weistwɔ:tә","n. 废水",["The ultraviolet light disinfects wastewater so completely that bacteria and other harmful microorganisms cannot grow.","Benedito's work has implications for the future of wastewater treatment."],["",""]],["aggressor","ә'gresә","n. 侵略者, 挑畔者\\n[法] 侵略者, 攻击者",["You can safely assume that anything the aggressor says is a lie.","Sami said it was Layla that was the aggressor, not him."],["",""]],["fiberglass","'faibә^lɑ:s","n. 玻璃纤维, 玻璃丝\\n[化] 玻璃纤维",["Chivell has decided to step in. He is installing small fiberglass igloos for the penguins to use as nests.","As carousels began to be made of metals and fiberglass, workmen qualified to maintain hand-carved and painted carousels became hard to find."],["",""]],["repressed","ri'prest","a. 被镇压的, 受约束的, 被抑制的",["The speaker believes that overt expression of feeling for others helps people tap into their own repressed emotions.","Yanni vented his repressed frustration regarding the government."],["",""]],["responsibly","","adv. 认真负责地, 可信赖地, 可靠地",["Cell phones are convenient, but I want them to be used responsibly.","Algeria needs to use its public funds responsibly."],["",""]],["cheaply","'tʃipli","adv. 便宜地",["I found out where to buy fruit cheaply.","Desktop publishing lets you produce books quickly and cheaply. It's like killing two birds with one stone."],["我找到一个买水果很便宜的地方。",""]],["eerily","","a. 怪诞的；奇异的；可怕的",["Tom was able to get eerily beautiful tunes out of a saw which he played using a violin bow.","I think that the architecture in the Greek Islands is eerily non-European."],["",""]],["chronological",", krɔnә'lɔdʒikәl","a. 年代学的, 按时间顺序的, 按照年月顺序的\\n[计] 编年的, 按年月日顺序的",["Please arrange the books on the shelves in chronological order.","Here are the languages I want to learn, in roughly chronological order."],["",""]],["garb","gɑ:b","n. 打扮, 装束\\nvt. 打扮, 穿衣",["Red is, indeed, the chief element of beauty in floral nature, the prime ornament of the green garb of the vegetal kingdom.","Dressed in ceremonial garb, he began the ritual."],["",""]],["scot","skɒt","n. 摊派的款项, 税赋\\n[化] 涂载体空心柱",["He pleaded self-defense at the trial and went scot-free.","Stefan stole Isabella's phone, laptop, and valuables and got away with it scot free."],["",""]],["juxtapose",".dʒʌkstә'pәuz","vt. 并置, 并列\\n[法] 使连接, 毗连, 并列",["I intend to juxtapose Senator Jackson's words and his actions in this supercut.","Good essays juxtapose two different arguments."],["",""]],["chassis","'ʃæsi","n. 底盘\\n[化] 底盘",["The pocket-sized chassis makes the camera versatile.","This server chassis is meant to be slotted into a rack to save space."],["",""]],["inconvenient",".nkәn'vi:njәnt","a. 不便的, 有困难的",["If it were not for the computer, how inconvenient our lives would be!","The opposite of \"inconvenient\" is \"convenient\"."],["如果沒有電腦的話，我們的生活會是多麼的不方便呢！","「不方便」的相反詞是「方便」。"]],["stalemate","'steilmeit","n. 僵持状态, 僵局, 陷于困境, 胶着状况\\nvt. 将...逼和, 使僵持, 使陷入困境",["The stalemate in the negotiations was broken when one of the parties made an unexpected compromise.","After a two-year political stalemate, Lebanon has a new president."],["",""]],["naming","'neimiŋ","n. 命名\\n[计] 命名",["Not complying with the naming conventions will result in parse errors.","Among the Uighurs, a \"Naming Celebration\" is held after a child is given a name."],["不遵守命名规则会导致解析错误。",""]],["popularize","'pɒpjulәraiz","vt. 使成通俗性, 使平易, 使普及\\nvi. 通俗化",["Dr. Sagan helped to popularize science through the writing of hundreds of articles and over two dozen books.","That book's done a lot to popularize chemistry."],["",""]],["siding","'saidiŋ","n. 侧线, 旁轨, 边宽",["Since Comet Siding Spring's discovery, astronomers have observed it with many telescopes, including the Hubble Space Telescope.","Once Comet Siding Spring leaves the inner solar system, it will not come back for a couple million years."],["",""]],["ya","'jә","abbr. 年轻人（young adult）；偏航轴（yaw axis）",["Ya-wen nailed her proposal yesterday. The boss kept nodding.","\"Please move aside.\" \"Ya wanna make something of it, sonny?\""],["雅雯昨天提案超穩，主管一直點頭。",""]],["veneer","vә'niә","n. 饰面薄板, 饰面, 外表\\nvt. 镶饰, 胶合, 虚饰",["The veneer we call civilisation is only skin deep.","Augustus kept only the veneer of the Republic while effectively making himself into a king."],["",""]],["buggy","'bʌgi","a. 多虫的\\nn. 双轮单座轻马车, 四轮单座马车",["The horse and buggy is now definitely out of date.","Some people fantasize about living in a society with a lower technological level. The horse and buggy are still technology."],["",""]],["discreetly","dɪ'skri:tlɪ","adv. 谨慎地, 小心地",["\"Meow, meow,\" said the cat, \"Woof, woof\" replied the puppy and the little mouse squeaked discreetly.","We would prefer for your search to be carried out discreetly."],["",""]],["apprehensive",".æpri'hensiv","a. 惴惴不安的, 敏悟的, 知晓的",["Tom certainly seems to be apprehensive about something.","They are apprehensive that some further disaster might occur."],["",""]],["spatula","'spætʃәlә","n. 刮刀, 压舌片, 匙突\\n[医] 药刀, 软膏刀; 铲; 压舌板",["He uses a spatula to scrape off advertisements that were stuck on the ground.","Tom has come to know that a large, thin spatula works best for turning over pancakes or latkes."],["他用鏟子刮掉黏在地上的廣告單。","湯姆逐漸了解到，用又大又薄的鏟子翻煎餅或馬鈴薯餅效果最好。"]],["pennant","'penәnt","n. 尖旗, 三角旗, 三角锦旗, 三角信号旗",["The Yankees are running away with the pennant race.","The players were terribly excited over winning the pennant."],["",""]],["ordering","'ɔ:dәriŋ","n. 有序化\\n[计] 定序; 排序",["After I got all worked up about ordering in English, I walked in the store and they greeted me with \"Irasshaimase!\" I felt, like, \"What the ...?\"","You can't just come in here and start ordering people around."],["在我準備好用英語來訂購東西之後，我走進商店，他們對我打招呼時卻說\"Irasshaimase!\" 我感覺像是，\"搞什麼東西啊...?\"",""]],["reconnect",".ri:kә'nekt","vt. 使再接合",["Disconnect the power cable from the modem, wait for approximately one minute, then reconnect the cable.","Google has launched an online person finder to help people reconnect with those in the disaster areas."],["",""]],["eleventh","i'levnθ","num. 第十一, 十一分之一",["A stay of execution was ordered at the eleventh hour.","We'd better finish up this project before the eleventh hour."],["缓期执行在最后关头决定了下来。",""]],["hotline","'hɔtlain","n. 热线电话, 咨询电话；热线",["Sami called the suicide prevention hotline."],[""]],["crepe","kreip","n. 绉丝, 绉呢, 绉绸, 绉布, 绉线, 绉橡胶, 皱胶, 绉纸, 黑绉纱, 小而极薄的烤饼\\n[化] 皱片",["Can you reveal your successful raisin crepe recipe to us?","Do you have any ivory crepe blouses in medium?"],["",""]],["celtic","'keltik; 'seltik","a. 凯尔特族的, 凯尔特语的\\nn. 凯尔特语",["The museum has a fascinating collection of Celtic artifacts.","That museum has a superb collection of Celtic era cultural artifacts."],["",""]],["parisian","pә'rizjәn","n. 巴黎人\\na. 巴黎的, 巴黎人的",["Two percent of tourists admitted to Parisian emergency rooms have been injured by sitting on Eiffel Tower souvenirs.","None of the clerks at the cheese counter in the Parisian gourmet grocery could speak English."],["",""]],["unfit",".ʌn'fit","a. 不适当的, 不胜任的, 不健康的\\nvt. 使不相宜, 使不合格",["Not that I dislike the job, but that I am unfit for it.","Tom's so unfit he couldn't run out of sight on a dark night."],["",""]],["personalize","'pә:sәnәlaiz","vt. (贬)使个人化, 体现, 使人格化, 在(物品)上标明姓名/标出地址/标出记号",["The students like to personalize their name tags by drawing pictures on them and using vibrant markers.","I think it would be difficult to personalize every wedding invitation."],["",""]],["valet","'vælit","n. 贴身男仆\\nvt. 伺候",["If a restaurant has valet parking it's probably pretty expensive.","Sami parked his car and gave his keys to the valet."],["",""]],["diversification","daivә:sifi'keiʃәn","n. 变化, 多样化\\n[经] 分散",["Animal diversification is a process through which one species diverges into two or more species.","The company is working on diversification of its products."],["",""]],["chasm","'kæzәm","n. 陷窟, 裂口",["The fridge was a yawning chasm of emptiness: inside were only three bottles of beer.","The pupils of her eyes had the blackness of a deep chasm."],["",""]],["landscaping","'lænd.skeipiŋ","n. 景观美化",["The Arbutus unedo is a popular plant for landscaping.","Landscaping is my profession and my hobby."],["",""]],["gubernatorial",".gju:bәnә'tɒ:riәl","a. 州长的, 统治者的",["Local music groups in northern Nigeria are being paid to canvass votes for candidates in the gubernatorial race that opens Saturday, two weeks after the presidential polls."],[""]],["purify","'pjuәrifai","vi. 变纯净\\nvt. 使纯净, 净化, 提纯, 精炼",["Sami wanted to know how to purify himself as a Muslim.","The scientist conducted experiments to purify contaminated water and make it safe for consumption."],["",""]],["pretext","'pri:tekst","n. 借口, 托词\\nv. 以...为借口",["Jonas left under the pretext of going to the bathroom.","He came to my house on the pretext of seeing me."],["喬納斯以去洗手間為藉口離開了。","他打着见我的幌子来了我家。"]],["centrist","'sentrist","n. 中间党派的成员, 温和主义者\\n[法] 中间派议员, 中立派议员",["Growing centrist sentiment threatens to upset America's traditional two-party system.","His wide-ranging stances on various issues cement him as a centrist."],["",""]],["believable","bi'li:vәbl","a. 可信的",["People are often quite skeptical about things unless given believable proof.","The easily believable hope stimulates life, always promising that tomorrow will be better."],["",""]],["fathom","'fæðәm","n. 英寻(长度单位,合6英尺)\\nvt. 测量深度, 看穿, 彻底了解\\nvi. 测深",["I can't begin to fathom how someone could believe that one race is superior to another.","I can't fathom why somebody would make something like that up."],["",""]],["prioritize","'praiәritaiz","vt. 按优先次序列出, 优先考虑",["When your resources are limited, you have to prioritize.","The Algerian government should prioritize the preservation of green spaces and public amenities."],["",""]],["bustle","'bʌsl","n. 喧闹, 裙撑\\nvi. 奔忙, 喧闹\\nvt. 使忙碌, 催促",["Living in the noise and bustle of a large city, we sometimes feel like going into the country.","At first glance Lviv seems like a normal Central European city with some bustle in the streets."],["",""]],["aquifer","'ækwifә","[化] 含水层",["The aquifer is Florida's main source of drinking water.","We had to make a deep well, otherwise we wouldn't reach the aquifer."],["",""]],["rna","","[医] 核糖核酸",["There are many sentences about DNA, but none about RNA.","In contrast to DNA, which only occurs in the nucleus, RNA is also found in the cytoplasm."],["",""]],["attune","ә'tju:n","vt. 为乐器调音, 使协调, 使合拍",["The bright colors and flashing lights were more attune to that of a rave than a child's playroom.","How differently would I attune the story of our student days, were I to write it to-day in loving memory of my friend!"],["",""]],["habitual","hә'hitʃuәl","a. 习惯的, 惯常的, 平常的\\n[法] 习惯的, 以习惯为常业的, 惯常的",["Grandfather sat in his habitual place near the fire.","The simple present is mainly used for habitual actions, or occasionally when telling a story."],["",""]],["lithuanian",".liθju:'einiәn","n. 立陶宛人\\na. 立陶宛的, 立陶宛人的, 立陶宛语的",["I can understand Lithuanian, but I can't speak it.","I'd like to learn Lithuanian, Latvian, and Estonian."],["",""]],["lowered","","v. 降低；削弱（lower的过去分词）",["Sami lowered Layla down the mountain slowly.","The bugler played taps as the tricolour was lowered at sunset."],["萨米缓缓地把蕾拉放下了山。",""]],["mantel","'mæntәl","n. 壁炉架",["Tom's mother kept his graduation picture on the mantel.","Matthew decorated the mantel above the fireplace with Christmas stockings."],["",""]],["sarcasm","'sɑ:kæzm","n. 挖苦, 讽刺, 讽刺话, 讽刺性",["He spoke with a suggestion of sarcasm in his voice.","She spoke with a suggestion of sarcasm in her voice."],["",""]],["snowstorm","'snәustɒ:m","n. 暴风雪\\n[化] 雪暴",["The train was held up for two hours on account of the snowstorm.","She was looking miserable sitting in the middle of this snowstorm, so I threw a small coin at her."],["",""]],["preposterous","pri:'pɒstәrәs","a. 反常的, 乖戾的, 荒谬的, 首末倒置的",["Nothing could disabuse them of that preposterous notion.","His story is too preposterous to be a lie."],["",""]],["fertilize","'fә:tilaiz","vt. 施肥, 使丰饶, 使受精",["You can also fertilize orchids -- but not too much. Too much fertilizer can also kill the roots.","The best thing for the field is to fertilize it with organic products."],["",""]],["sioux","su:","a. 苏人的；苏语的",["The Sioux tribe asked the government to enforce the treaty.","A Sioux gave that old trapper a golden nugget."],["",""]],["residuals","rɪ'zɪdʒʊəlz","剩余误差",["One must wait for the residuals to converge before being able to use the simulation's results."],[""]],["murdered","ˈmə:dəd","v. 糟蹋( murder的过去式和过去分词 ); （尤指在团队运动中）彻底打败; 打垮",["The police arrested the man who had murdered the girl.","Tom can't account for his whereabouts on the day that Mary was murdered."],["警察逮捕了謀殺這位小姐的兇手。","汤姆不能说明玛丽遇害那天自己在哪里。"]],["idly","'aidli","adv. 懒惰地, 空闲地",["She was looking idly out of the window.","She was idly looking out of the window."],["她无所事事地看向窗外","她无所事事地看向窗外"]],["carrying","'kæriiŋ","[法] 运载",["This airplane is capable of carrying 40 passengers at a time.","This elevator is capable of carrying 10 persons at a time."],["这架飞机一次可以携带40名乘客。","这部电梯一次能运送10个人。"]],["dreaded","","a. 令人畏惧的, 可怕的",["Cleaning up the house is truly my most dreaded task.","Tom dreaded the amount of tutorials required to master the new technology."],["打扫屋子真的是我最害怕的工作。",""]],["communicator","kә'mju:nikeitә","n. 传播者, 通信装置, 列车内通话装置",["My colleague Carlos is a strong communicator who ensures that everyone is on the same page.","My colleague Carlos is a clear communicator who avoids misunderstandings."],["",""]],["ruffle","'rʌfl","n. 皱褶, 波纹, 生气, 混乱\\nvt. 弄皱, 触怒, 洗(牌), 连续轻擂(鼓)\\nvi. 起皱, 发脾气, 连续轻擂",["Buckle up. We're going to ruffle some feathers today.","Tom is not afraid to ruffle some feathers."],["",""]],["exhibitor","i^'zibitә(r)","n. (展览会的)参加者, 电影院经理, 电影院老板, 电影放映者, 展出者\\n[法] 出示证物人, 展览者, 提供者",["The exhibitor isn't involved in the conversation.","The exhibitor is cut off from the conversation."],["",""]],["visceral","'visәrәl","a. 内脏的\\n[医] 内脏的",["Jim had a visceral hatred for Muslims.","Tom felt a visceral feeling of disgust."],["",""]],["veranda","vә'rændә","n. 阳台, 走廊",["I left some scallions out on the veranda for too long and they dried out.","Get the hell off my veranda and take your ugly furniture with you."],["",""]],["clipboard","'klipbɒ:d","n. 有纸夹的写字板, 剪贴板\\n[计] 剪贴板",["Tom entered the conference room, carrying a clipboard.","If you're disappointed by your elected officials, grab a clipboard, get some signatures, and run for office yourself."],["",""]],["eucharist","'ju:kәrist","n. 圣餐",["He was excommunicated for serving the Eucharist in highball glasses.","Nowadays, the fourteenth century's debate about the Eucharist sounds completely arcane."],["",""]],["backside",".bæk'said","n. 背部, 背后, 后方",["If you tumble here, your backside will be squashed.","I ate too many beans and now my backside cannot stop singing."],["",""]],["upland","'ʌplәnd","n. 山地, 高地, 高原\\na. 高地的, 山地的",["The agency says its biggest challenge so far has been providing enough shelter from the rain and cold in this upland area.","Mead and Bateson chose the upland village of Bajoeng Gede for their research, because a lack of iodine in the villagers' diet made them slow of speech."],["",""]],["evocative","i'vɒkәtiv","a. 唤出...的, 唤起...的",["The careful use of evocative imagery is an important part of building a successful advertising campaign.","The gentle purr of the turtle dove is an evocative sound of summer."],["",""]],["legitimately","","adv. 正当地；合理地",["Sami is legitimately my biggest supporter."],[""]],["potency","'pәutәnsi","n. 力量, 权力, 效力\\n[化] 能力",["Expired medicine may lose its potency.","Would regulating the potency of marijuana create new opportunities for the black market?"],["",""]],["confrontational","ˌkɒnfrʌnˈteɪʃnl","a. 挑衅的; 对抗的",["Her ex-boyfriend was very possessive and confrontational.","Sami doesn't have to be confrontational all the time."],["",""]],["rework","ri:'wә:k","vt. 重做, 修订, 修改\\n[经] 再加工, 再制, 返工",["This logo needs to be reworked."],[""]],["coincidentally","","adv. 巧合地；一致地",["Completely coincidentally, these two are still being repaired.","Coincidentally, all of us had a crush on the same girl."],["真的湊巧，這兩樣現在還在維修。",""]],["romanian","ru:'meiniәn","n. 罗马尼亚人, 罗马尼亚语\\na. 罗马尼亚的",["The Romanian language is part of the Romance language family.","The first time I saw the Romanian soccer players was in Madrid."],["羅馬尼亞語屬於羅曼語族。",""]],["chimp","tʃimp","n. 黑猩猩",["The angry chimp went up the sidewalk and ripped everybody's face off."],[""]],["workday","","n. 工作日, (一天的)工作时数\\n[机] 工作天",["The fire and power outage resulted in a shortened workday at some exchanges in Manhattan's financial district.","Auto mechanics finish up the workday with grime all over their hands."],["",""]],["decentralized","","a. 分散化, 分散式；分散管理的；分散的；去中心化",["Decentralized energy may make the widespread use of renewable energy a real possibility.","A blockchain is a decentralized digital ledger where transactions are recorded, verified and become permanent and immutable."],["",""]],["ultra","'ʌltrә","a. 过分的, 极端的\\nn. 极端主义者, 过激论者, 急进论者",["He hopes this will help pave the way to accessible ultra-sophisticated personalized medicine.","Infrared and ultra-violet rays are types of light invisible to the human eye."],["",""]],["finesse","fi'nes","n. 策略, 手段, (桥牌中的)飞牌\\nv. 用计谋处理, 出小牌",["He did it with the finesse we've come to expect from Tom.","A lot of people can do that, but Tom does it with a rare finesse."],["",""]],["surmise","'sә:maiz","n. 推测, 猜测\\nv. 推测, 臆测",["Those are the main facts of the case, stripped of all surmise, and stated as baldly as possible.","The tragedy has been so uncommon, so complete and of such personal importance to so many people, that we are suffering from a plethora of surmise, conjecture, and hypothesis."],["",""]],["acronym","'ækrәunim","n. 首字母缩拼词, 首字母组合词\\n[计] 字首组合词",["Who can tell me what the acronym Tatoeba stands for?","SOPA is an acronym for the Stop Online Piracy Act."],["谁能告诉我TATOEBA首字母缩合词的意思？",""]],["vigilance","'vidʒilәns","n. 警戒, 警觉, 失眠症\\n[医] 不眠症, 警醒症",["For the sake of vigilance, the prophets did not sleep.","I believe that stricter vigilance is necessary here."],["",""]],["trivia","'triviә","n. 琐事",["Sometimes I find that I basically have no time to pay attention to irrelevant trivia.","Today's trivia corner! Today it's about the origin of Calpis."],["有时候发现自己基本上没有时间顾及一些无关紧要的琐事。",""]],["charging","'tʃɑ:dʒiŋ","[计] 计费的\\n[化] 充电; 装料",["I'd like a phone that supports fast charging.","We're charging you with the murder of Tom Jackson."],["我想要支持快充的手機。",""]],["feign","fein","vt. 假装, 装作\\nvi. 作假",["It is difficult for those who are sad to feign joy.","To seem sympathetic to Germans, you just need to feign modesty."],["",""]],["intestinal","in'testinәl","a. 肠的, 肠内的\\n[医] 肠的",["\"Intestinal fat\" is a kind of sacrifice.","Fadil started complaining of stomach and intestinal pains."],["“膟”是一種用牲法。",""]],["innovator","'inәuveitә","n. 改革者, 创新者",["Though Shepard spent only 5 minutes in actual space aboard Freedom 7, he laid the groundwork for the United States to become the great innovator in space exploration we know today.","Tom is the best innovator at our company."],["",""]],["gypsy","'dʒipsi","n. 吉卜赛人, 吉卜赛语\\na. 象吉卜赛人的\\nvi. 流浪",["The old gypsy moved her hand over the crystal ball and, peering inside, beheld my future.","This novel presents a very romantic account of Gypsy vagabonds."],["",""]],["crusty","'krʌsti","a. 有硬皮的, 易怒的\\n[建] 硬的, 有壳的, 似外皮的",["Please, apply more strength upon cleaning the insides of the armoires. They're rather crusty.","I don't like crusty bread enough that your suggestion appeals to me."],["",""]],["kerosene","'kerәsi:n","n. 煤油, 火油, 灯油\\n[化] 煤油",["In places where it snows a lot, kerosene is an indispensable item.","I warned little Mary to leave the kerosene heater alone."],["在下雪很多的地方，煤油是不可或缺的东西。",""]],["observable","әb'zә:vәbl","a. 可遵守的, 可庆祝的, 看得见的, 可辨别的, 观测得到的, 值得注意的, 显著的\\nn. 感觉到的事物, 现象",["It's an easily observable fact that trans athletes do not outperform their cis competitors.","Isolated material particles are abstractions, their properties being definable and observable only through their interaction with other systems."],["",""]],["unbelievably","ˌʌnbɪˈli:vəblɪ","adv. 难以置信地, 不可信地",["The queue for buying tickets was unbelievably long.","It was unbelievably quiet there; perhaps that's why he liked the place so much."],["买票的人龙竟然那么长！",""]],["hilltop","'hiltɒp","n. 小山顶",["The caves are situated on a hilltop and provide an excellent vantage point.","We looked down on the plain from the hilltop."],["",""]],["confluence","'kɒnfluәns","n. 合流, 合流点, 集合, 人群\\n[医] 融合, 汇合",["The Danube begins at the confluence of the Brigach and the Breg rivers.","Koblenz lies on the confluence of the Rhine and Moselle rivers."],["",""]],["organizing","","[经] 组织",["They are organizing politically and working to ensure that they are respected and valued.","Tom let Mary take the credit for organizing the party."],["",""]],["fluke","flu:k","v. 侥幸成功\\nn. 锚爪, 侥幸, 偶然事故",["For all his success, Tom was regarded by all as a fluke.","By a total fluke the ball sailed under the bar, and the crowd exploded."],["",""]],["discursive","dis'kә:siv","a. 离题的, 东拉西扯的",["There has been a discursive shift on this topic in recent years.","Tom Jackson's latest book is discursive and self-indulgent."],["",""]],["rubric","'ru:brik","n. 红字标题, 红色印刷, 题目\\n[医] 红的, 红核的, 标准",["The teacher handed a rubric for the assignment to the students.","It depends on your rubric for judging quality."],["",""]],["hotly","'hɒtli","adv. 暑热地, 激烈地, 热心地",["Identity is a hotly debated topic in Egypt and the countries of the Maghreb.","Identity and ethnic identification are hotly debated topics in Algeria."],["",""]],["unbroken","'ʌn'brәukәn","a. 未破损的, 未被征服的, 未打垮的, 不屈服的, 不涣散的, 整齐的, 未中断的\\n[法] 未被阻断的, 未破损的, 完好的",["In nostalgic moments we may tend to think of childhood as a time of almost unbroken happiness.","Our country has enjoyed many years of unbroken peace."],["在懷念舊日時光的時刻，我們可能往往想起童年像是有著幾乎完整幸福的一段時期。",""]],["conversational",".kɒnvә'seiʃәnl","a. 会话的, 对话的, 健谈的\\n[计] 会话式的; 对话式的",["Discuss the basic procedures involved in the analysis of conversational interaction.","I took 2 semesters of conversational Arabic at the community college."],["",""]],["limitless","'limitlis","a. 无限的, 无界限的",["We have used earth's energy resources as if they were limitless.","Don't look down on yourself, because people have limitless possibilities."],["我们如同无限般的使用地球的能源资源。","不要小看自己，因為人有無限的可能。"]],["creme","","n. 奶油调味液, 乳剂, 香甜的酒",["I put on creme in the evenings to nourrish my face skin.","I think I already tried creme brulee before."],["",""]],["jeweler","'dʒu:әlә(r)","n. 宝石商, 宝石匠, 珠宝商",["The jeweler mounted a big pearl in the brooch.","I asked the jeweler to inscribe my initials on the back my watch."],["寶石師傅在胸針上鑲了一枚大珍珠。",""]],["postmodernism","ˌpəʊstˈmɒdənɪzəm","n. 后现代主义",["Yona Wallach had been a postmodernist two decades before the term \"Postmodernism\" was even conceived.","Postmodernism and critical theory are distinct concepts."],["",""]],["laurel","'lɒ:rәl","n. 月桂树, 荣誉\\nvt. 使戴桂冠, 授予荣誉",["The leaves dropped from his imaginary crown of laurel; he turned to a gate, leant against it, and cried bitterly.","Stan Laurel was \"the thin one\"; Oliver Hardy was \"the fat one\"."],["",""]],["mellow","'melәu","a. 成熟的, 醇的, 熟练的",["You two are really harshing my mellow.","The mellow sounds of the Rhodes piano are partly responsible for thousands of accidental conceptions."],["你们俩真扫我的雅兴。",""]],["swimsuit","'swimsju:t","n. 游泳衣",["Tom tried to return the swimsuit for a larger size, but the clerk told him that wasn't allowed.","They stared at her swimsuit in surprise."],["汤姆试过还回泳衣来换成更大一号的，但是员工告诉他那是不被允许的。","他們驚訝地盯著她的泳裝看。"]],["complicity","kәm'plisiti","n. 同谋, 串通, 复杂\\n[法] 共谋, 共犯关系",["Natalia and Veronica looked at each other in complicity.","It is but a short step from negligence to complicity."],["",""]],["futility","fju:'tiliti","n. 无用, 无益, 无价值",["This is the worst snowstorm to hit England in 18 years. And for some the journey into work became an exercise in futility.","Tom was overcome with a sense of futility."],["",""]],["normalize","'nɒ:mәlaiz","vt. 使常态化, 使合标准, 使合规格\\n[计] 规格化",["It's really important for Algeria to normalize its relations with the West.","Algeria should normalize its relations with the West as soon as possible."],["",""]],["swipe","swaip","n. 强打, 用力挥击, 尖刻的话, 碰擦, 起重杆\\nvt. 强打, 用力挥击, 偷",["Enter your ticket number in the box, tap \"Confirm\", and swipe left to return to the home screen.","As soon as you swipe on your cell phone, you'll see this group of stuff."],["",""]],["starch","stɑ:tʃ","n. 淀粉, 浆糊, 刻板\\nvt. 浆硬",["Please tell me how to use laundry starch to starch things.","Starch degradation is linked to a circadian clock."],["",""]],["veterinary","'vetәrinәri","a. 兽医的\\nn. 兽医",["I took my cat to the veterinary hospital yesterday.","Mary has been studying veterinary medicine for three years."],["",""]],["apr","","[计] 替换通路再试器",["Apr. is an abbreviation for April."],[""]],["fiancee","fi'ɒnsei","n. 未婚妻",["I owe you much more than you owe me, I said to him. I owe you the life of my fiancee, Mary.","My fiancee arrived without notifying me beforehand, and I felt embarrassed."],["",""]],["philanthropy","fi'lænθrәpi","n. 慈善, 仁慈, 博爱, 慈善事业, 慈善机构(团体)",["If you donate money to a charity or volunteer to help people in need, you can call your good deeds philanthropy.","But director Lowery Stokes Sims said the Studio Museum is benefiting from a new recognition and a surge in Black philanthropy."],["",""]],["vile","vail","a. 恶劣的, 肮脏的, 低廉的, 卑鄙的\\n[法] 极坏的, 恶劣的, 卑鄙的",["I think that this sick sociopath is the most disgusting and vile individual on earth.","This bunch of sociopaths are the most vile people on earth."],["",""]],["brash","bræʃ","a. 性急的, 仓促的, 无礼的, 傲慢的\\nn. 胃灼热, 骤雨, 碎石堆",["Hector's uncommonly brash and outspoken today. He's usually deathly quiet.","Mary's brash manner didn't put Tom off, but rather impressed him from the outset."],["",""]],["informational","","a. 信息的, 情报的, 提供消息的, 介绍情况的, 提供情报的\\n[计] 信息性的",["The statements provided in this article are for informational purposes only.","This content is for informational purposes only, and does not constitute legal advice."],["",""]],["kidnapper","","n. 拐子, 绑架者\\n[法] 诱拐者, 拐骗犯, 绑架者",["The kidnapper told me he'd kill Tom if I didn't show up alone.","Sami received a telephone call from Layla's kidnapper."],["绑匪告诉我我如果不独自出现他就会把汤姆杀了。",""]],["tiptoe","'tiptәu","n. 脚尖\\nvi. 用脚尖走\\nadv. 踮着脚\\na. 踮着脚走的, 偷偷摸摸的",["He walked on tiptoe so that nobody would hear him.","The trees, like the yearnings of the earth, stand on tiptoe to peer at the sky."],["",""]],["puzzling","'pʌzliŋ","a. 使迷惑的, 把人难住的",["Get back at me when you think you've answered life's puzzling mystery.","I can see how that would be puzzling."],["",""]],["oceanic",".әuʃi'ænik","a. 海洋的, 产于海洋的, 在海洋中生活的, 广阔的",["Even now, commercial ships use \"the trades\" and the currents the winds produce to hasten their oceanic voyages.","Tsunamis are giant oceanic waves triggered primarily by earthquakes that can roll ashore, causing loss of life and disaster."],["",""]],["epistemological",",episti(:)mә'lɔdʒikәl","a. 认识论的",["The article raises epistemological questions about knowledge."],["文章提出關於知識的認識論問題。"]],["cautionary","'kɒ:ʃәnәri","a. 警告的",["This drama is missing something. All it is is a simple cautionary tale with no real depth.","The company's journey to bankruptcy presented a cautionary tale on the pitfalls of corporate greed."],["",""]],["garland","'gɑ:lәnd","n. 花环, 荣誉\\nvt. 戴花环",["Ziri stretched his ivy out like a garland in the kitchen.","Merrick Garland has a slam dunk case against Trump."],["",""]],["doctrinal","'dɒktrinәl","a. 教义的, 教诲的, 学说的",["The ruling was based on doctrinal principles."],["該裁決基於學說原則。"]],["ideologically","","adv. 思想上, 思想体系, 意识形态, 观念形态",["Tom's sentences are often biased and ideologically charged.","It's not true, but it's ideologically pure, and that's what matters."],["",""]],["bathrobe","'bɑ:θrәub","n. 浴衣",["Yuri barely had the time to throw on his bathrobe.","Mary came into the living room wearing a bathrobe."],["",""]],["plethora","'pleθәrә","n. 过多, 过剩, 多血症\\n[医] 多血[症]",["A plethora of ineffective education programs made the president unpopular amongst fiscal conservatives.","Mennad had a plethora of excuses not to live life."],["",""]],["condolence","kәn'dәulәns","n. 哀悼, 吊唁",["Use a brief expression of condolence, such as: \"On this sad occasion we grieve with you\".","When his wife died, he received dozens of condolence cards."],["",""]],["forbidding","fә'bidiŋ","a. 严峻的, 可怕的, 令人难亲近的",["There is a very strict rule forbidding smoking in bed.","I approached and knocked at the door, which was instantly opened by a tall, gaunt woman with a harsh, forbidding face."],["",""]],["briton","'britәn","n. 大不列颠人, 英国人",["Tom is a Briton."],["湯姆是英國人。"]],["cleavage","'kli:vidʒ","n. 劈开, 裂片, 分裂\\n[化] 解理",["There's really no need for Mary's outfit to have a cleavage window.","She leaned forward, offering a breathtaking view of her cleavage."],["",""]],["fanciful","'fænsiful","a. 奇怪的, 稀奇的, 想像的",["We are our memory, we are that fanciful museum of capricious forms, that mountain of broken mirrors.","His ideas are often fanciful, but they're always original."],["",""]],["smirk","smә:k","vi. 傻笑, 假笑, 得意地笑\\nn. 傻笑, 假笑, 得意的笑",["With a smirk on his face, Donald Trump waved at the crowd before starting his speech.","He left with a smirk on his face, leaving the two lovebirds alone."],["",""]],["extremity","ik'stremiti","n. 极端, 极点, 困境, 绝境\\n[医] 肢, 端",["In an instant he had reached the extremity of the niche, and finding his progress arrested by the rock, stood stupidly bewildered.","He was driven to the last extremity."],["",""]],["porous","'pɒ:rәs","a. 多孔的, 有气孔的, 多孔性的, 能渗透的\\n[医] 多孔的",["The countries have competing claims to villages and towns along the porous, undefined border.","The Colorado silver lodes are porous at the surface and colored more or less red or green."],["",""]],["rowing","'rәuiŋ","n. 划船",["She sat listening to the water lapping rhythmically against the moored rowing boats.","She clambered aboard the rowing boat, steadied herself as it bobbed, and cast off."],["",""]],["audubon","'ɔ:dәbɔn","奥特朋(1785-1851, 美国鸟类学家, 画家及博物学家)",["The Audubon Society protects birds and their habitats."],["奧杜邦學會保護鳥類及其棲地。"]],["vested","'vestid","a. 穿衣服的, 既得的, 既定的\\n[经] 既得的, 法定的",["All legislative Powers herein granted shall be vested in a Congress of the United States, which shall consist of a Senate and House of Representatives.","Executive power is vested in the Prime Minister."],["",""]],["stockpile","'stɒkpail","n. 储蓄, 积蓄, 库存\\nvt. 储蓄, 贮存",["You should stockpile necessary supplies in case of a big earthquake.","Tom says that it is wise to stockpile some food in case of emergency."],["",""]],["malice","'mælis","n. 恶意, 蓄意害人, 怨恨\\n[法] 预谋, 蓄意, 恶意",["Never attribute to malice that which is adequately explained by stupidity.","There was no malice intended in what she said."],["能解釋為愚蠢的，就不要解釋為惡意。","她的话没有恶意。"]],["saxophone","'sæksәfәun","n. 萨克斯管\\n[电] 俱有余割平方辐射图案的线性排列天线",["I didn't tell Tom who told me that he'd stolen my saxophone.","Because the saxophone wasn't invented until the mid-nineteenth century, it was unknown to Mozart or to Beethoven."],["",""]],["attractiveness","","[经] 吸引性, 有利可图",["The attractiveness of his charisma made other people listen.","The thought of rating people by attractiveness does not seem fair to me."],["",""]],["striker","'straikә","n. 打击者, 罢工者\\n[经] 罢工者",["The team's best striker scored twenty-three goals last season.","When the striker completed a hat-trick, the crowd cheered so loudly they could be heard half a mile away."],["",""]],["melodic","mә'lɒdik","a. 有旋律的, 旋律美妙的",["Esperanto is one of the most melodic languages in the world.","For me, of the symphony's three movements, the second is the most melodic and beautiful."],["",""]],["screenwriter","'skri:nraitә","n. 电影剧本作家, 编剧家",["I think that Tom used to be a screenwriter.","I think Tom used to be a screenwriter."],["",""]],["commencement","kә'mensmәnt","n. 开始, 毕业典礼\\n[法] 开始, 毕业典礼",["Commencement is typically the first or second Saturday in April.","This event, also called commencement, is where schools recognize the students who successfully completed their degree programs."],["",""]],["delinquent","di'liŋkwәnt","n. 行为不良的人, 违法者\\na. 怠忽的, 有过失的",["She's what you call a \"delinquent mom,\" but she's good at cooking, and most importantly, she's a really caring parent.","The delinquent boy was arraigned for stealing a bicycle."],["她就是你所謂的「年輕媽媽」，但是她的廚藝不錯，最重要的是，她非常關心孩子。",""]],["creole","'kri:әul","n. 克里奥耳人, 克里奥耳语, 克里奥耳人所讲的法语\\na. 克里奥耳人的, 克里奥耳式法语的",["The man addressed the St. Lucian people in Creole.","Seychelles is called \"Sesel\" in Seychellois Creole."],["",""]],["populous","'pɒpjulәs","a. 人口多的, 人口稠密的",["Gaza is one of the world's most populous enclaves.","San Francisco is only one-tenth as populous as New York."],["",""]],["icu","","[计] 工业控制器, 指令控制器, 综合控制器, 接口控制器, 中断控制器",["Nikhil has made it out of the ICU at last.","The patient is being treated in ICU."],["",""]],["inactive","in'æktiv","a. 不活动的, 停止的, 怠惰的, 闲置的\\n[计] 非活动的",["As long as a bear is relatively inactive, and is not exposed to wind, it does not burn excessive energy in cold weather.","The inactive child is far more inclined to live in a world of fantasy."],["",""]],["perseverance","pә:si'viәrәns","n. 毅力, 忍耐, 锲而不舍, 不屈不挠",["I was surprised by his perseverance.","There's no success without perseverance."],["我对他的坚持感到很惊讶。","沒有堅持，就沒有成功。"]],["forecaster","'fɔ:kɑ:stә","n. 预报员",["The weather forecaster predicts sunny weather tomorrow."],[""]],["distressed","di'strest","a. 痛苦的, 哀伤的",["They look like monsters there with their facelifts, their distressed clothing, and their Prozac eyes.","Stefan heard moaning and distressed breathing of someone in pain."],["",""]],["wean","wi:n","vt. 使断奶, 使丢弃, 使断念\\nn. 小儿",["Ziri set up a fence in the yard to wean the lambs from their mother.","Nuclear fusion could wean the global economy off fossil fuels."],["",""]],["quip","kwip","n. 妙语, 遁辞, 讽刺\\nv. 说讽刺话, 嘲弄",["That quip was just not funny enough."],[""]],["crony","'krәuni","n. 密友, 亲密伙伴, 好朋友",["Barry and Prue would have given him almost anything they had, for he was a great friend and crony of theirs."],[""]],["automation",".ɒ:tә'meiʃәn","n. 自动化, 自动操作\\n[计] 自动学; 自动化",["Automation is bound to have important social consequences.","Automation sometimes deskills workers by removing complex decisions from their jobs."],["",""]],["saturation",".sætʃә'reiʃәn","n. 饱和, 渗透, 浸透, 色饱和度\\n[计] 饱和度",["The pulse ox sensor couldn't get a good oxygen saturation reading because Tom's hands were so cold.","You can manually adjust the saturation of your image in this program."],["",""]],["glorify","'glɒ:rifai","vt. 赞美, 美化, 赞扬, 使辉煌",["To raise one's name in later generations and thereby glorify one's parents, this is the greatest expression of filial piety.","There are economic systems that don't glorify money."],["",""]],["wafer","'weifә","n. 薄酥饼, 圣饼, 晶片, 圆片, 干胶片\\nvt. 用干胶片封\\n[计] 圆片",["The parson gave the communion wafer to the dying person.","The biscuit was coated with a wafer-thin layer of chocolate."],["",""]],["defined","di'faind","a. 清晰的, 轮廓分明的；有定义的, 确定的",["America is a nation that can be defined in a single word. I was in the foothills of the Himalayas with Xi Jinping.","The integral and the antiderivative are defined in two different ways, and the Fundamental Theorem of Calculus states the relationship between them."],["美國是一個可以用一個字來概括的國家。我曾與習近平主席一起在喜馬拉雅山麓。","積分與反導函數是以兩種不同的方式定義的，而微積分基本定理闡述了兩者之間的關係。"]],["fullness","'fulnis","n. 满, 充满, 丰富\\n[医] 发胀",["From the fullness of his grace we have all received one blessing after another.","We have all received one blessing after another from the fullness of his grace."],["",""]],["sinful","'sinful","a. 有罪的, 罪孽深重的\\n[法] 有罪, 充满罪恶的",["Christians view human nature as inherently sinful.","Harnessing electricity, said the man with the bongos, is a sinful perversion of the earth's resources."],["",""]],["fisher","'fiʃә","n. 渔夫, 食鱼动物, 渔船",["What happens today in Europe also concerns the fisher in Senegal and the programmer in India.","This is the boy whose name is Tom Fisher."],["",""]],["swede","swi:d","n. 瑞典人",["For Norwegians, it is normally not difficult to understand what a Swede is saying.","Many Japanese like Sweden and Finland because of Tove Jansson, the Swede-Finn writer of the Moomintroll fantasy books."],["",""]],["grated","'^reitid","a. 有格栅的, 有炉格的",["The sharpness of the parmesan grated over my pasta dish added a depth of flavor that was unparalleled.","Tom put a bag of grated cheese into his shopping trolley."],["",""]],["vowel","'vauәl","n. 元音\\na. 元音的",["This vowel change has much to do with the overall accent pattern assigned to each word.","The rime consists of the vowel and any final consonants of a syllable."],["",""]],["tombstone","'tu:mstәun","n. 墓石, 墓碑\\n[经] 墓碑, 墓志铭",["They set up a tombstone over the grave overlooking the harbor.","The letters on the ancient tombstone can barely be distinguished."],["",""]],["anatomical",".ænә'tɒmikl","a. 解剖的, 解剖学的, 构造上的\\n[医] 解剖学的",["Most important of all, the brain needs global reentry pathways connecting these anatomical structures.","Good doctors explain things to patients in easily understandable ways, using anatomical models and such."],["",""]],["lite","lait","a. 低盐的；清淡的；简化的",["You were the one who ignited this fire that just needed to be let out and to be lite up.","When the choice is between shit and shit lite, shit usually wins."],["",""]],["melancholy","'melәnkɒli","n. 忧郁, 悲哀, 愁思\\na. 忧郁的, 使人悲伤的, 愁思的",["From early morning I had been oppressed by a strange melancholy.","Tom can't tell the difference between melancholy and depression."],["",""]],["cornfield","'kɒ:nfi:ld","n. 玉米田",["For the astronomers it was like finding a skyscraper in the middle of a cornfield.","She made a scarecrow and stood it in a cornfield, where it's to stay all summer."],["",""]],["balsamic","bɒ:l'sæmik","a. 香膏质的, 如香油的, 镇静的\\n[医] 香脂性的, 香脂的",["Tom bought a bottle of balsamic vinegar in Modena.","The tanginess of the balsamic vinegar in Benedito's salad is a great touch."],["",""]],["leaflet","'li:flit","n. 小叶, 传单\\n[医] 小叶",["Tom briefly glanced at the leaflet before throwing it in the trash.","There is a plan of treatment at the end of the included leaflet."],["",""]],["chunky","'tʃʌŋki","a. 矮矮胖胖的",["Hummus can be chunky, or a total puree, or anywhere in between.","If the applesauce is too chunky, your baby will have a hard time swallowing it."],["",""]],["methodically","mi'θɒdikәli","adv. 有系统地, 有方法地",["We're methodically trying out every type of bread from the bakery and ranking them from best to worst.","I excavated the fossil carefully and methodically so it would arrive elsewhere intact."],["",""]],["cooling","'ku:liŋ","n. 冷却\\na. 冷却的\\n[计] 冷却",["Autumn is just around the corner. It's about time the weather started cooling off.","The counselor suggested a cooling-off period before making a final decision about the relationship."],["",""]],["partisanship","'pɑ:tәznʃip","n. 党派性, 党派偏见, 对党派的忠诚",["No. It is not a matter of partisanship, it is a matter of America.","Let's resist the temptation to fall back on the same partisanship and pettiness and immaturity that has poisoned our politics for so long."],["",""]],["choreographer",".kɒri'ɒgrәfә","n. 舞蹈指导",["The choreographer instructed Tom on the proper motions for Tom's performance.","The choreographer created a stunning dance routine."],["",""]],["posting","'pәustiŋ","[计] 记入, 记录, 稿件, 邮件\\n[经] 过帐, 誊入总帐",["You need to stop posting private photos on Facebook.","Tom thought up several sentences and ran them past Mary before posting them on Tatoeba."],["别再往Facebook上发私人照片了。",""]],["hegemonic",".hedʒi'mɒnik","a. 支配的, 霸权的",["Admittedly, models of hegemonic order cannot provide an explanation for all observed successful bargaining strategies."],[""]],["aching","'eikiŋ","a. 疼痛的, 使人痛苦的",["Let's just rest here for a little while, my feet are aching so much I can't walk.","There's no elevator in the building and I can hardly walk up the stairs because of my aching knees."],["我们要不在这里一下吧。我的脚好痛走不动了。",""]],["padding","'pædiŋ","n. 垫充, 垫塞, 填料, 废话, 虚报的费用\\n[计] 填充; 装填",["Tom was caught padding his expense account.","Her jacket had padding in the shoulders."],["",""]],["forested","","a. 草木丛生的",["Growing up, I lived in a forested area of Algiers.","Our artificial island isn't very well forested yet."],["小的时候，我住在阿尔及尔的一个森林地区。",""]],["spire","spaiә","n. 尖塔, 尖顶, 锥形体, 螺旋\\nvi. 突出, 耸立, 螺旋形上升\\nvt. 给...加塔尖",["To the west a dark church spire rose up against a marigold sky.","In the distance could be seen the mirrorlike river and the spire of the village church."],["",""]],["lowly","'lәuli","a. 地位低的, 卑下的, 谦卑的\\nadv. 位置低下的, 低声地, 谦逊地",["The affection of the lowly is like a wall of sand.","\"Nor yet proud Ilion nor her towers had stood; / in lowly vales sequestered they abode.\""],["",""]],["snowball","'snәubɒ:l","n. 雪球, 果味冰霜卷, 滚雪球式的募捐法\\nvt. 向...丢雪球, 使滚雪球般增长\\nvi. 打雪仗, 滚雪球般增长",["Back when it still used to snow in winter, children would ride sledges, have snowball fights or build snowmen.","A small snowball is capable of starting an avalanche."],["",""]],["newlywed","'nju:liwed","n. 新(婚的)人, 新婚夫妇",["Tanaka only just recently became a newlywed."],[""]],["unease",".ʌn'i:z","n. 不安",["What you're saying is perfectly viable, but I can't shake off my unease.","Ziri began to feel his sense of unease increasing."],["",""]],["polluted","pә'lu:tid","a. 被污染的, 被玷污的, (美)(非正式)喝得烂醉的",["The air was polluted by exhaust gas.","The very air we breathe is polluted with smog from the factory chimneys."],["空氣被廢氣污染了。",""]],["deforestation","di:.fɒ:ri'steiʃәn","n. 采伐森林, 森林开伐\\n[法] 砍伐森森",["Palm oil production is the leading cause of deforestation in Indonesia.","A biodiversity sanctuary in Brazil called The Pantanal is threatened by deforestation."],["棕榈油制造是导致印度尼西亚森林砍伐的主要原因。",""]],["piracy","'paiәrәsi","n. 海盗行为, 海上劫掠, 剽窃, 著作权侵害, 非法翻印\\n[法] 海盗行为, 海上掠夺, 海盗罪",["In China, software piracy is a serious issue.","Movie theaters are losing more and more revenue due to internet piracy."],["在中国，软件盗版是一个很严重的问题。",""]],["discarded","dɪs'kɑ:rdɪd","v. 丢弃, 抛弃( discard的过去式和过去分词 ); 不再使用",["No women like to wear a dress that another discarded. With men, they're not so choosy.","Experience, when it is dearly bought, is never discarded."],["沒有女人會喜歡穿二手裙子；可是二手男人呢，她們卻照要不誤。",""]],["adapter","ә'dæptә","n. 适应者, 改编者, 接合器\\n[计] 衔接器; 适配器, 适配卡",["I had to buy a separate adapter to use the headset with my newest phone.","This adapter lets you plug in up to four USB devices."],["",""]],["deflate","di'fleit","vt. 放气, 抽出空气, 使缩小\\nvi. 缩小",["Your incisive criticism will deflate a lot of egos.","We'd like to invite you to apply to our world-class university so we can artificially deflate our acceptance rate."],["",""]],["blackberry","'brækbәri","n. 刺, 黑莓\\n[医] 黑果莓",["Still to come... buttermilk-fried bullfrog legs, braised wild boar with Himalayan blackberry glaze and Asian carp boulettes.","Ziri left Rima some blackberry juice in the fridge."],["",""]],["repudiate","ri'pju:dieit","vt. 声明离婚, 拒绝, 拒付, 拒绝履行\\n[经] 拒付(公债,国债等)",["My parents would repudiate my brother if they ever found out he was gay."],[""]],["crevice","'krevis","n. 裂缝\\n[医] 缝",["The crevice in the boulder on the ocean floor conceals an octopus.","My phone fell into the crevice between the two seats."],["海底的岩石缝里藏着一只章鱼。",""]],["flamboyant","flæm'bɒiәnt","a. 火焰似的, 辉耀的, 华丽的",["Kabuki dancers wear spectacular and flamboyant kimonos.","Jennifer was flamboyant that night, and Jack fell in love with her immediately."],["",""]],["brandish","'brændiŋ","vt. 挥, 挥舞\\nn. 挥舞",["You dare brandish your weapons in front of your king?"],[""]],["cheesecake","'tʃi:zkeik","n. 干酪饼, 半裸体的女人照片",["If cheese is good, but the cake is a lie, what is a cheesecake? A good lie.","I didn't try the cheesecake, but it looked delicious."],["如果乳酪是好的, 但是蛋糕是個謊言, 什麼是乳酪蛋糕? 一個好的謊言。",""]],["hydrocarbon",".haidrәu'kɑ:bәn","n. 碳氢化合物\\n[化] 烃; 碳氢化合物",["Hydraulic fracturing makes use of high-pressure water to create cracks in hydrocarbon-bearing shale.","Hydrocarbon exploration has ceased with declining oil prices."],["",""]],["clatter","'klætә","n. 咔嗒声, 哗啦声, 嘈杂的谈笑声\\nvi. 发出哗啦声, 喧闹的谈笑\\nvt. 使咔嗒咔嗒地响",["When out on the lawn there arose such a clatter, I sprang from the bed to see what was the matter.","The clatter of the horse's hooves soothed him."],["",""]],["pelvis","'pelvis","n. 骨盆\\n[医] 骨盆; 盂, 肾盂",["In women, the pelvis is broader and lower, and all of its dimensions are larger, than in men.","The doctor will examine the pelvis and rectum to feel for any blockages."],["",""]],["tarnish","'tɑ:niʃ","n. 失泽, 失泽膜, 污点\\nvt. 使失去光泽, 玷污\\nvi. 失去光泽, 被玷污",["He is afraid that he will tarnish his reputation if he disagrees.","Sami was trying to tarnish Layla's reputation."],["",""]],["brownie","'brauni","n. 界仁巧克力饼",["Tom tried to score brownie points with the teacher.","You might just chalk up some brownie points."],["",""]],["parka","'pɑ:kә","n. 皮制连帽大衣, 派克大衣",["Put on your long johns, wool socks, parka, and gloves if you travel to Antarctica, the coldest spot on Earth.","What do you think about this parka?"],["",""]],["madly","'mædli","adv. 发狂地, 精神失常地, 愚蠢地",["I was madly in love with Tom when I was in junior high school.","Yanni and Skura were madly in love with each other."],["",""]],["gully","'gʌli","n. 小峡谷, 排水沟",["The gully had more plants than the rest of the desert because it occasionally filled with rain.","It's near what looks like a little gully."],["",""]],["tacit","'tæsit","a. 沉默寡言的, 不苟言笑的, 缄默的",["There must have been a tacit understanding between them.","There must've been a tacit understanding between them."],["",""]]];
